('Your help is most appreciated!', '', 201088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 162817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, are you... a mortal?', '', 201087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 162820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend of Featherlight is a friend of mine.', '', 201086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 162819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since that day, no soul has been judged. Instead, all are lost to the horrors of the Maw.', 201085, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 159739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acherus, the stronghold of the Ebon Blade, has moved to Icecrown Citadel. My death gate will take us there.', '', 201075, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 164951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Preparations have been made.', '', 201074, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 164949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yours is a legend I wish to witness myself.', '', 201063, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 162639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will report to Vyraz and then join you at the Seat of the Primus.', '', 201062, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 162638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever evils lurk within the tower that Tyrande seeks, we must not let her face them alone.', 201060, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 165916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tear that tower apart, and the Banshee with it!', 201059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 162197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Not while our people suffer inside Torghast!', 201058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 162196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minn\'do! Leave the Maw with us--before the Night Warrior\'s power overwhelms you!', 201057, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 165915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet you there, $n.', '', 201054, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To fix, must reach the Citadel of Loyalty.', '', 201053, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crown is being bent to Denathrius\'s will by his lingering influence.', '', 201052, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am fine. We need access to the Temple to fix the crown. Protected by a barrier. Must disable.', '', 201045, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies for the delay, $n. Convincing our new ally of my flying ability proved difficult.', '', 201044, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be Mueh\'zala who brought Helya to da Jailer\'s side... struck a deal for ol\' Odyn\'s eye... and made da Banshee warchief with a whisper!', '', 201015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon now, heroes! Bring me mojo back and help me put dis old loa in him place!', '', 201014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya think ya won, bossmon? Heh. Maybe ya been skulkin\' in da shadows for too long.', '', 201013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese little friends o\' yours think dey gonna help ya, Bwonsamdi? What chance ya be havin\' against me?', '', 201012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ol\' Hakkar, him a nasty one. But ya be makin\' him pay him debt. Sooner or later, him gonna be back. Ya can\'t keep a bad loa down!', '', 201011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well whatcha givin\' me dat look for? Sure, Hakkar be a loa of blood. But a deal\'s a deal, mon! Just get me mojo back.', '', 201010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now here\'s a loa ya might remember! Hakkar always be needin\' mojo for his rituals... and Bwonsamdi always be willin\' ta make a deal.', '', 201009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem brokers be up ta somethin\'. Ya best be keepin\' an eye on \'em! NNNGGGG! Now hurry back wit me mojo!', '', 201008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one ain\'t gonna want ta give me back me mojo. So careful now... she\'s tricky..', '', 201007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ol\' Bwonsamdi don\'t just be makin\' deals on Azeroth. Brokers be lookin\' for power, too... all kinda power.', '', 201006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me don\'t need worshippers! Da Jailer gonna give me all da power I need... and Bwonsamdi da one who gonna be forgotten!', '', 201005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat was long ago, but me remember. Remember how da trolls be turnin\' away from ya. All dem sacrifices... all dat blood... dey were gonna NNNGGGHHHH!', '', 201004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya be forgettin\' who made ya a loa, Bwonsamdi! Now gimme dem souls and kneel before ya mastah!', '', 201003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da only power dat counts be Death! And Death be comin\' for dem all!', '', 201002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gone and forgot what it mean ta be a loa! Ya bond wit da people... da power ya share... NNNNGGGG!', '', 201001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me want dem souls, Bwonsamdi! Me want Rastakhan and all da other Zandalari! It ain\'t wise ta be holdin\' out on Mueh\'zala!', '', 201000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be keepin\' dis ol\' loa distracted. Go on, now. Follow da paths. And don\'t ya be takin\' no for an answer!', '', 200999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mueh\'zala got me at a... disadvantage. But if ya collect me mojo from a few of me... business partners... den together, we can turn da tables on him!', '', 200998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... who...? Heroes! Uh... no hard feelins \'bout dat little disagreement dat we had in Zuldazar?', '', 200997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... who...? Heroes! Me knew ya was gonna come an\' help ya ol\' pal Bwonsamdi.', '', 200996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya always be soft, Bwonsamdi. Weak. Sooner or later, ya gonna break. Den da Jailer be getting\' his due!', '', 200995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ya can be sendin\' dem to da Maw? No, no, no... dem is my people, Mueh\'zala. No way I gonna give dem up!', '', 200994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where ya be hidin\' all dem Zandalari souls, Bwonsamdi? Give \'em ta ya bossmon now, or ya gonna be sorry. Reeeeaaal sorry!', '', 200993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 165341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True love... now ain\'t dat sweet? Ol\' Bwonsamdi had his share of romance back in de day. More den his share!', '', 200992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
