('Some loa of death ya be, Bwonsamdi. Makin\' deals instead of takin\' what be yours.', '', 199467, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 165073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be runnin\' ta da Winter Queen wit\' ya problems now?', '', 199466, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 165072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no. Ya got dis all wrong! Da boss be stealin\' da loa from their sleep and--', '', 199465, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 165274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The quarrels of loa are no concern of mine. Do not involve Ardenweald in your petty squabbles.', 199464, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 162392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, now, ya majesty! I come in peace. We need ta be workin\' together if we gonna beat ol\' Mueh\'zala.', '', 199463, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 165273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is the meaning of this intrusion, $n?', 199462, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 162393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
