('It appears someone has come to steal the secrets of my genius!', '', 199459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 157779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah-HAH! So you DID botch the procedure!', 199458, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 161286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, uh, there are many complicated factors that go into successful flesh preparation. Perhaps I needed a touch more--', '', 199457, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 157781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh... I just saw it move! Those kyrian parts are fighting to take control of the construct!', 199456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 161285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense! Once we embed a Maldraxxian soul, it will squelch any remaining echoes of Bastion brainwashing!', '', 199455, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 157780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He will also notice that you failed to purge the flesh of its memories before assembly!', 199454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 161284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
