('A touch of anima should soothe it. Once its dreams have calmed, we can--', '', 198573, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 161387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit it. Unless you want to be dead, too.', 198571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 155933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
