('', 'You have my gratitude. Once the Jailer lies defeated... there may be much for the kyrian to discuss.', 198429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long have we believed that our mortal lives are burdens to be shed in the name of service. And yet, the deeds of mortals are what won the day.', 198428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Jailer\'s schemes have torn a schism in the ranks of the kyrian. One that must be healed.', 198427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Devos...', 198426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Jailer has twisted your mind, Devos. You must be stopped... no matter the cost.', 198425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 160654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With your spear in hand, I will take control of the Spires and forge new paragons to lead the kyrian!', 198424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Accept your defeat, Archon. I serve a far greater power now.', 198423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh!', 198422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I mourn your betrayal.', 198421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He seeks to free us from the prison we have built for ourselves. And for that, he has earned my loyalty.', 198420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so, I listened to the Jailer\'s words. I learned of the great injustice you and the others thrust upon him... and upon us all.', 198419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But you refused to see the truth. That the path is flawed. That we serve a lie.', 198418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As I peered into Uther\'s memories, what I saw shook me to the core.', 198417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. It was a mortal who exposed the folly of your edicts.', 198416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Jailer\'s allies encroaching on all sides we must make full use of its resources.', '', 198415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 157483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We sacrifice because we must. Mortal burdens would only impede our sacred duty.', 198414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But what do we serve? An impotent Arbiter, an oppressive law! Our sacrifices were made for nothing!', 198413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elysian Hold was built by the Archon to serve as our covenant\'s base of operations.', '', 198412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 157482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For eons, we have been told to \"purify\" ourselves. To let go of our memories, our identities, our loved ones. All in the name of service.', 198411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not so long as you command them. The Forsworn will forge a new path for Bastion!', 198410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen to reason, Devos. The kyrian must stand united.', 198409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forsworn, see that the mortals do not interfere!', 198408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blind adherence to the path would have doomed us all. You left me no choice but to oppose you!', 198407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were the Paragon of Loyalty, Devos. And yet all this time, it was you who led the Forsworn.', 198406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanquish their rear guard while I confront Devos. Go in service.', 198405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are vastly outnumbered, mortals. The Forsworn have cut a swath through most of our forces.', 198404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bask in the glory of Elysian Hold. Magnificent, is it not?', '', 198403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 157484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
