('The final death has found me, even in the shadows...', '', 195449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 162659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Typical mortal, meddling in things you cannot comprehend!', '', 195448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 162655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time to rise up, venthyr! We will reclaim the anima from your oppressor!', '', 195442, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 160660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
