('I am still too old for this nonsense.', '', 195379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 158479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fate has not yet been written.', '', 195378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 158474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsworn must be stopped.', '', 195377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 158473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice, vengeance... a line so thin...', '', 195376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 158472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for showing me mercy.', '', 195375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 158471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
