('', 'Strength comes from loyalty, honor and... will you stop poking me!', 194370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the blade in the dark. I am also the blade in your face.', 194369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the House of Eyes, I learned THE SECRETS OF SUBTLETY!', 194368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
