('End my suffering.', '', 193195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 153152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to challenge me?', '', 193194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 153155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
