('', 'What have you found, Maw Walker? Is it... valuable?', 191742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a mystery to unravel. Perhaps you will not fail me yet.', 191738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 163281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
