('Harbingers: Illidan', 'Harbingers: Illidan', 185271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters fighting. Heartless. Hopeless. Pointless.', 'Brothers and sisters fighting. Heartless. Hopeless. Pointless.', 185270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
