('A valiant effort. With continued forays into the visions, your resistance to N\'Zoth\'s influence grows ever stronger.', '', 184149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our sorties into N\'Zoth\'s mind place you in immense peril. We must push further into the visions, but not if we lose you to madness in the process.', '', 184148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grim fate for Orgrimmar indeed. Take solace in the knowledge that should it ever come to pass, you shall be ready to end it.', '', 184147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
