('It seems that you are able to withstand the visions for longer than before. Each excursion prepares you for the horrors of Ny\'alotha.', '', 184142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A blow well struck, but this was only the beginning of N\'Zoth\'s vision. Additional horrors lurk throughout the city. Find them, and vanquish them.', '', 184141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
