('', 'I cannot help you now. Perhaps... the Temple of Loyalty can.', 183547, 0, 0, 457, 0, 0, 0, 157293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this is truly the only way, then I will find another.', '', 183545, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 158206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will all fall. All of us. That is where the path leads!', '', 183544, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 158204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our faith binds us all! This is the path we were chosen to walk!', 183543, 0, 0, 457, 0, 0, 0, 157420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you endure this? How can you watch them suffer, unmoved?!', '', 183542, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 158203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is only one path for you, disciple. That is forward, through this pain!', 183541, 0, 0, 457, 0, 0, 0, 157313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
