('Begin the final challenge.', 'Begin the final challenge.', 181696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the penultimate challenge.', 'Begin the penultimate challenge.', 181695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the third challenge.', 'Begin the third challenge.', 181694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the second challenge.', 'Begin the second challenge.', 181693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the first challenge.', 'Begin the first challenge.', 181692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be presented with a five-by-five matrix of elemental totems. Some are fire, some water. Your objective is to change them all to water totems.$b$bSimply touch a totem to flip its elemental alignment. Ah, but the elements are connected to one another! Flipping a totem will also change the four totems adjacent to it.$b$bThrough patience, trial, and error, you should be able to coax all of the totems into water totems. Try your best, $c!$b$bIf you find yourself completely lost, speak to me and I can reset the puzzle for you.', 'You will be presented with a five-by-five matrix of elemental totems. Some are fire, some water. Your objective is to change them all to water totems.$b$bSimply touch a totem to flip its elemental alignment. Ah, but the elements are connected to one another! Flipping a totem will also change the four totems adjacent to it.$b$bThrough patience, trial, and error, you should be able to coax all of the totems into water totems. Try your best, $c!$b$bIf you find yourself completely lost, speak to me and I can reset the puzzle for you.', 181691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Totemic Matrix', 'Totemic Matrix', 181690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To develop harmony with the elements, one must study and understand the interactions between them. The totemic matrix is an ancient training method, a puzzle that will challenge one\'s mind and spirit.$b$bThe object of the exercise is to transform all the totems to water totems. Simply touch a totem to invoke it. Know that all things are connected, a lesson invaluable in this puzzle... as in life!', 'To develop harmony with the elements, one must study and understand the interactions between them. The totemic matrix is an ancient training method, a puzzle that will challenge one\'s mind and spirit.$b$bThe object of the exercise is to transform all the totems to water totems. Simply touch a totem to invoke it. Know that all things are connected, a lesson invaluable in this puzzle... as in life!', 181689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flip the shells. Remember where they are, and match the pairs!', 'Flip the shells. Remember where they are, and match the pairs!', 181688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Remembery', 'Play Remembery', 181687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eye on the barrel!\n\nOne barrel will flash at the start of each round. Remember which one it is, and pick it when they\'re all done moving around.', 'Keep your eye on the barrel! One of the barrels will flash at the start of each round. Remember which one it is, and pick it when they\'re all done moving.', 181686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Barrels o\' Fun', 'Play Barrels o\' Fun', 181685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The idea is simple. The game is hard! Uncross the wires to fix poor BULL-E\'s circuits.\n\nThere is only one difficulty level: Pretty easy to insane-o hard! Give up and you have to start from the beginning!', 'The idea is simple. The game is hard! Uncross the wires to fix poor BULL-E\'s circuits.\n\nThere is only one difficulty level: Pretty easy to insane-o hard! Give up and you have to start from the beginning!', 181684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play BULL-E', 'Play BULL-E', 181683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to main console.', 'Return to main console.', 181682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Rune Matching - Harderest', 'Play Rune Matching - Harderest', 181681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Rune Matching - Hardest', 'Play Rune Matching - Hardest', 181680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Rune Matching - Hard', 'Play Rune Matching - Hard', 181679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Rune Matching - Normal', 'Play Rune Matching - Normal', 181678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Rune Matching - Easy', 'Play Rune Matching - Easy', 181677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rules are simple! Match 3 or more runes for points. More than 3 and you get bonus points!\n\nIf you manage to get 100,000 points, you might unlock an additional level of difficulty! If this is set up correctly...', 'The rules are simple! Match 3 or more runes for points. More than 3 and you get bonus points!\n\nIf you manage to get 100,000 points, you might unlock an additional level of difficulty! If this is set up correctly...', 181676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
