('The arcade console sounds as if it\'s full of gears, springs, uncontrolled electricity, and a healthy dose of hopes and dreams.\n\nIt whirs, grinds, gurgles, beeps, boops, and sproings as you press the Start button.\n\nWhat game do you want to play?', 'The arcade console sounds as if it\'s full of gears, springs, uncontrolled electricity, and a healthy dose of hopes and dreams.\n\nIt whirs, grinds, gurgles, beeps, boops, and sproings as you press the Start button.\n\nWhat game do you want to play?', 181669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
