('They never should have filled our sails to begin with. It\'s the Alliance\'s war, not ours.', 'They never should have filled our sails to begin with. It\'s the Alliance\'s war, not ours.', 180572, 0, 73395, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear the winds of war are beginning to die down.', 'I hear the winds of war are beginning to die down.', 180571, 0, 73395, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
