('Ah, an\' here I thought you Stormwind folk were too uptight to enjoy a stiff drink!', 'Ah, an\' here I thought you Stormwind folk were too uptight to enjoy a stiff drink!', 180561, 0, 73395, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
