('Follow his example. Train hard. Never give up. Accept nothing but victory or death.', 'Follow his example. Train hard. Never give up. Accept nothing but victory or death.', 180531, 0, 73395, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
