('I want to remember adventures from the Cataclysm! <Queue my party>', 'I want to remember adventures from the Cataclysm! <Queue my party>', 179300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
