('', 'It was up to heroes like you to venture into the Firelands and permanently snuff him out.', 179294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though thwarted by mortals once before, Ragnaros returned to Azeroth and sought to consume it in flame.', 179293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
