('', 'Scanning transcribed data.', 178254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye, champion. I\'ll get tae trackin\' down the Black Prince. Not too many places ye can hide when Azeroth\'s own speaker is lookin\' fer ye.', '', 178253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose Wrathion doesn\'t want tae be found. But the knowledge he\'s accrued could be critical in the fight against N\'Zoth.', '', 178252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Data committed to memory. Physical record no longer required. Destruction executed as advised.', 178251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MOTHER! Why\'d ye do that?', '', 178250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I do not disagree, but taking on new allies now, when we cannot address the needs of our current allies would be unwise.', '', 178236, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Do not discount my kind. We are a strong and capable group, up to any task put before us, no matter how small. We would do well within your ranks.', '', 178235, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga commanders have been defeated!', 'The naga commanders have been defeated!', 178234, 0, 70076, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] But we are ready to do more than simply survive. We want to explore the world and uncover its secrets.', '', 178233, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] We relied on the sands to provide for us.', '', 178232, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ll have us, we would explore the world by your side.', '', 178231, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have we survived amidst the sands, without a thought of what lies beyond them. But the Horde has shown us that there is more to life than mere survival.', '', 178230, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Please, come forward. What can I do for you?', '', 178229, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I know of your kind. Your people aided the Horde with our efforts on Zandalar.', '', 178228, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the need, the need for (flying) speed.', 'I feel the need, the need for (flying) speed.', 178226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, are ye there? I thought we lost ye fer a second...', '', 178221, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 143099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like you. My devoted chosen.', '', 178214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such misplaced zeal. Their eyes remain closed to the true path.', '', 178213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
