('I will take us to the Chamber of Heart. This may prove... disorienting.', '', 178207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me MOTHER\'s research into unaccompanied exploration.\n[Open Solo Tech Tree]', 'Show me MOTHER\'s research into unaccompanied exploration.\n[Open Solo Tech Tree]', 178206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
