('Take us to the Chamber of Heart', 'Take us to the Chamber of Heart', 178201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have given me hope, and in return I will offer my aid.\n\nLet me know when you are ready to travel to the Chamber of Heart.', '', 178200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Perhaps I should observe this myself.', '', 178199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, it means we can use the Forge against N\'Zoth without reoriginatin\' the entire world!', '', 178198, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intriguing discovery, Speaker. If the mogu have learned how to focus the Forge\'s energies...', '', 178197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. For the Alliance!', 'I am ready. For the Alliance!', 178196, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
