('What\'s up, buttercup? You lookin\' to add a little flash to your craft? Find a lover for your hover? Well then look no further!\n\nYou bring me the ink and I\'ll \"Kram\" it on your ride, if you catch my drift? \n\nBut seriously, if you find any sweet colors out there, bring \'em to me and I\'ll add them to the choices of colors available for your Xiwyllag ATV.', '', 177977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
