('You never cease to amaze me, $n. If anyone can successfully utilize the power of the Mecha-Perfection Turbo, it\'s you. Use it well.', '', 177962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. I\'m the one who designed it, before my exile from Mechagon. Though I was able to keep it out of my father\'s possession, it is inoperable without a Perfection Enhancing Gearbox to regulate its output.\n\nBut even if we had one... I\'m afraid the Mecha-Perfection Turbo is far too dangerous for anyone to use. It would take a truly impressive feat of strength to convince me that an individual is sufficiently equipped to handle the risk.', '', 177961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
