('There we go! Ye can use that console tae connect us tae the Chamber of Heart.', '', 177892, 0, 0, 5, 118, 0, 145602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will remember this when we meet again.', '', 177891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reactivatin\' the Engine now. Let me see if I can find a console or somethin\' for ye...', '', 177889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute... I think I\'ve got access!', '', 177888, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All according to plan.', '', 177887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! That stung.', '', 177886, 0, 0, 0, 118, 0, 145604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely done, hero! Now tae get this thing runnin\' again!', '', 177885, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 145599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You challenge me in my own city? Laughable!', '', 177884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size o\' that thing! Go for the eye!', '', 177882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You are... too late...', '', 177881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot oppose the Deep One!', '', 177880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MALOWNED!', '', 177879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Get dunked on!', '', 177878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them at all costs!', '', 177877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empress will have our heads if the ritual is interrupted.', '', 177876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m startin\' tae worry about ye. But right now, we have tae focus on the Engine. Come on!', '', 177874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion? Are ye still with me?', '', 177873, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re tryin\' tae corrupt the Vaults! We cannae let that happen!', '', 177871, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the jam!', '', 177870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, I should\'ve known the mantid would throw their lot in with N\'Zoth!', '', 177869, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deep One... returns...', '', 177868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave none alive!', '', 177867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders have breached the vaults!', '', 177866, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the name of Azeroth is goin\' on in here?', '', 177865, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a few more adjustments...\n\nThis is so exciting!', 177864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, I think we\'re here! Now let\'s find the Engine!', '', 177862, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been a while since I\'ve had tae walk for this long...', '', 177861, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we should\'ve brought a torch...', '', 177860, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That did it! Now, let\'s see where this passage leads!', '', 177859, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statue, of course! Ye\'ve got a sharp mind, hero!', '', 177858, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, seems we\'ll need somethin\' tae weigh down this tile tae keep the door open.', '', 177857, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be a switch somewhere. We best start searchin\'.', '', 177856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. I dunnae see a way to open the door.', '', 177855, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like this leads underground. Let\'s find that passage!', '', 177854, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A hidden staircase!', '', 177853, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That switch must open the way forward. Just watch yer step around those tiles.', '', 177851, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful where ye step. The mogu are known tae leave traps for unwary intruders.', '', 177850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! The statues are comin\' tae life!', '', 177849, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ra-den said that the secret passage is hidden beneath the palace. We need tae find a way down there.', '', 177847, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay that monstrosity in the name of the Mag\'har!', 177846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 145026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void calls to you!', '', 177845, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lunar Festival is a magical time of year.\n\nElune blesses us during this time, and her power manifests in many ways in Azeroth. You can see it across the land, present in even the smallest bloom.', 177844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder Scene: Mount Acquisition', 'Placeholder Scene: Mount Acquisition', 177843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the bees is acting strangely.', 'One of the bees is acting strangely.', 177842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That appears to be all of them. Let\'s head for higher ground.', 177841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 141690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Representatives from the Bronze Dragonflight have opened up a portal that can take you to Caverns of Time in Silithus. You can find it on the lower level of the portal room. Once you enter the hallway in the front gate, take the stairs on the left to get downstairs.', 'Representatives from the Bronze Dragonflight have opened up a portal that can take you to Caverns of Time in Silithus. You can find it on the lower level of the portal room. Once you enter the hallway in the front gate, take the stairs on the left to get downstairs.', 177840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Representatives from the Bronze Dragonflight have opened up a portal that can take you to Caverns of Time in Silithus. You can find it in the portal room, at the top of the mage tower.', 'Representatives from the Bronze Dragonflight have opened up a portal that can take you to Caverns of Time in Silithus. You can find it in the portal room, at the top of the mage tower.', 177839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caverns of Time, Silithus', 'Caverns of Time, Silithus', 177838, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_THUNDERKING_THUNDERSTRUCK.BLP:20|t %s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:303491|h[Shock Burst]|h|r move away from allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_THUNDERKING_THUNDERSTRUCK.BLP:20|t %s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:303491|h[Shock Burst]|h|r move away from allies!', 177837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not easy being a Pirate. There\'s a lot of family treasures to keep track of.', 177836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I be a pirate?', 'Can I be a pirate?', 177835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think so.', 177834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Absolutely not.', 177833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t feel like a pirate to me.', 177832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a pirate!', 177831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air crackles with power as Azshara\'s forces begin summoning a minion from the depths.', '', 177830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ripley looks up at Staxie with her big, adorable eyes.', '', 177829, 0, 0, 591, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the... hic! ... resistance!', '', 177828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you avoid all Arcane Orbs while moving and separated from your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you avoid all Arcane Orbs while moving and separated from your allies!', 177827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you avoid all Arcane Orbs while moving in formation with an ally!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you avoid all Arcane Orbs while moving in formation with an ally!', 177826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We stand no chance against the Klaxxi on our own. Focus on destroying the amber.', 177825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 141688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb with an ally without moving!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb with an ally without moving!', 177824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to absorb any Arcane Orbs or stand with your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to absorb any Arcane Orbs or stand with your allies!', 177823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 177822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with an ally without absorbing any Arcane Orbs!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with an ally without absorbing any Arcane Orbs!', 177821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you keep moving while separated from your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you keep moving while separated from your allies!', 177820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you keep moving in formation with an ally!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you keep moving in formation with an ally!', 177819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with your allies without moving!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with your allies without moving!', 177818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to move or stand with your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to move or stand with your allies!', 177817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb alone!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb alone!', 177816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb with an ally!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb with an ally!', 177815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing lasts.', 177814, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]', 177813, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough reflection. There are preparations to be made.', 177812, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My bargain with Azshara will yet bear fruit. The armies of Azeroth will fight her master, and he will line their streets with corpses.', 177811, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But despite all I taught them, they stubbornly clung to hope. To life.', 177810, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though I cared nothing for the living, I did pity the Forsaken. For the great injustice that made them what they are.', 177809, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Countless souls have been fed to the hungering darkness.', 177808, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang\'s ill-considered challenge may have ended the war prematurely, but it doesn\'t matter now.', 177807, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, champion. I wasn\'t certain you made it out of Orgrimmar. If the traitors knew of your service to me, they\'d have put you in irons...', 177806, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 139087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe journey, my love.', '', 177805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer gonna get smashed!', 'Yer gonna get smashed!', 177804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one packs a punch!', 'This one packs a punch!', 177803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This drink\'s on you.', 'This drink\'s on you.', 177801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll knock you off yer feet!', 'This\'ll knock you off yer feet!', 177800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There won\'t be. Safe journey, Nathanos.', 177799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...As do I, Dark Lady. But when the time comes, there can be no hesitation.', '', 177798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to stand with your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to stand with your allies!', 177797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you stand with your allies!', 177796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to move!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to move!', 177795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you continue to move!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_SPRINT.BLP:20|tThe queen demands that you continue to move!', 177794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to absorb any Arcane Orbs!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen forbids you to absorb any Arcane Orbs!', 177793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ScrollUnrolled04d.blp:20|tThe queen demands that you absorb an Arcane Orb!', 177792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have proven entertaining so far. Now it is time for the real show to begin.', 177791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My subjects seldom face a true challenge. You will try to provide them with one, won\'t you?', 177790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a disappointing performance from that underling. I must be sure to arrange a more suitable challenge for you.', 177789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Barely a challenge so far. Time to raise the stakes.', 177788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, my loyal servants, greet our guests. After all, they traveled such a long way to pay us a visit.', 177787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It shall be so, my king. Vereesa and I will scout her line for weaknesses. Good luck... to all of us.', 177786, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 139128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot wage two wars. Sylvanas must fall. Here. Now. Before all is lost.', '', 177785, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"In the end, death claims us all.\" Eitrigg told me those were among the last words Sylvanas spoke to Vol\'jin.', '', 177784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Sylvanas realized the war was on the cusp of ending, she lured both fleets into Azshara\'s hands. Not to find victory, but to meet death.', '', 177783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sister will not fight for us, Alleria.', '', 177782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sylvanas commands what may be the only army capable of defeating N\'Zoth. For the sake of Azeroth... perhaps we should stand aside and let her.', 177781, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, Alleria. What are you suggesting?', '', 177780, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Sylvanas is not the only threat we face. The Old God has been freed. I can hear his whispers... sense his unseen tendrils writhing all around us.', 177779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our sister is patient. She knows we have precious few soldiers left. While we lay siege to Orgrimmar, she will whittle away our numbers.', 177778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course.', '', 177777, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 139129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Wrynn. May we speak?', 177776, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return us to the shadows.', 'Return us to the shadows.', 177775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready to go?', 177774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Tidal Conflux.', 'Teleport to the Tidal Conflux.', 177773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Displacement Pedestal glows with arcane energy.', 'The Displacement Pedestal glows with arcane energy.', 177772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya lose your weapon, come back here and I\'ll have a replacement.', '', 177769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They know what is coming. They know you will be its herald.', '', 177767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel the frenzy of the swarm?', '', 177766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00+$1i Corrupted Mementos|r', '|cffffff00+$1i Corrupted Mementos|r', 177765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Engineering_Failure Detection Pylon.blp:20|tDrained of all power, the Ancient Wards experience a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300076|h[Catastrophic Failure]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Engineering_Failure Detection Pylon.blp:20|tDrained of all power, the Ancient Wards experience a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300076|h[Catastrophic Failure]|h|r!', 177764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The larva seems well tended by its hive.>', '', 177763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more hair!', 'No more hair!', 177762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hair! Too much hair!', 'Hair! Too much hair!', 177761, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Return to the mission area or you will be vaporized!', 'Warning! Return to the mission area or you will be vaporized!', 177760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
