('', 'Victory mode engaged!', 177726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That this place has survived this long is proof of the hubris of the naga.', 'That this place has survived this long is proof of the hubris of the naga.', 177725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And she knows it, too! That\'s what\'s dangerous...', '', 177724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s from all that junk she dug up on our last walk!', '', 177723, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I can never stay mad at that face. She\'s sooo cute!', 177722, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ripley, you\'re all dirty! What happened?', 177721, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met and tread carefully, fellow traveler.', '', 177720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am weary from my travels. Please, allow me a moment of respite.', '', 177719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are rumors of mini mechanical combatants being built on this island.\n\nI\'ve come seeking to acquire one of these \"robots\" for my son, Firion.', '', 177718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep working!', 'Keep working!', 177717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh! No more work! No more work!', '', 177716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have restored order to the Mogu\'shan Vaults. For this, my people owe you a great debt.\n\nI will dispatch the honor guard to protect the Engine of Nalak\'sha. I hope it serves you well against the greater foe.', '', 177715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need the Engine of Nalak\'sha to safeguard Azeroth from N\'Zoth\'s corruption.', 'I need the Engine of Nalak\'sha to safeguard Azeroth from N\'Zoth\'s corruption.', 177714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard the whispers. I know what evil is upon us.\n\nI\'m afraid the coming darkness is too great even for you to bear. It took the combined might of all of the Keepers and their creations to imprison the Old Gods during the time of the Black Empire.\n\nWith the Pantheon gone and the Keepers scattered, what hope do you have to prevail?', '', 177713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the champion of Azeroth. I should\'ve expected that you\'d show up in the vale soon enough. \n\nWhy have you disturbed my peaceful exile?', '', 177712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Walk with Stormspeaker Qian.>', '<Walk with Stormspeaker Qian.>', 177711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was slain by the mantid and told me to seek you out.', 'He was slain by the mantid and told me to seek you out.', 177710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Stormspeaker Qian the sigil>', '<Show Stormspeaker Qian the sigil>', 177709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then his mission has failed. It is as we\'ve feared.\n\nIt was not Tsuo\'s place to send you to us, but your arrival presents an opportunity that has until now been closed to us.\n\nWalk with me, and I will explain.', '', 177708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tsuo\'s sigil! \n\nHow did you obtain this?', '', 177707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You appear to walk with the Speaker, so I will allow you words.\n\nMake them quick. The Rajani have little patience for meddlers.', '', 177706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way.', 'Lead the way.', 177705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a task you won\'t be able to accomplish while the mantid hold the vaults, so it would seem our goals align.\n\nCome with me. I think we may be able to help eachother.', '', 177704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to activate the engine of Nalak\'sha.', 'I need to activate the engine of Nalak\'sha.', 177703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... are allies of the Speaker?\n\nWe must... stop the mantid. They cannot have... the vaults.\n\nI must take you to... my people...', '', 177702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you fare better.', '', 177701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try as I might, I cannot reach him...', '', 177700, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 145765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only delay the inevitable.', '', 177699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 146028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope. The coming threat will consume us all.', '', 177698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 146027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Skinner sighs>\n\nIn case you couldn\'t tell, this whole city is supposed to be underwater. Thanks to the Tidestone, that is no longer the case. I\'m here to study its effects on the ley-lines. \n\nNow if that is all, I really must get back to my research.', '', 177697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, Highkeeper. The mantid have overrun Mogu\'shan Vaults, and threaten the Engine of Nalak\'sha.', '', 177696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have gone through great lengths to remove myself from the problems of this world, yet you bring this outsider to me?', '', 177695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this, Qian?', '', 177694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away!', 177693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 136208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great Ra-den! Your servants call upon you!', '', 177692, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if perhaps you could convince him to action.', '', 177691, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot abide by the mantid\'s invasion of the Mogu\'shan Vaults, but our numbers are few and our leader is... complacent.', '', 177689, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our primary purpose was the protection of the titan\'s facilities here on Pandaria.', '', 177688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course!', 177687, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 136207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rajani are an ancient order of mogu, from the time before the Hundred Kings.', '', 177686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you studying?', 'What are you studying?', 177685, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt, outsider. Your kind are not welcome here.', '', 177684, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh.\n\n<Professor Skinner looks up from his notes> \n\nWhat do you want, $c? There is much research to be done. I didn\'t travel all the way from Suramar to be bothered by your insufferable pestering...', '', 177683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177682, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amazing!', 177681, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 136206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remarkable! This sigil matches that of the Rajani! Is it possible that this ancient clan has been resurrected? And what of Ra-den?', '', 177680, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Originally, the mogu served the titans as builders and guardians. Those who answered to Highkeeper Ra-den were known as the \"Rajani.\"', '', 177678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177673, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... there is one more tome we could search. Bring me a copy of \"The Origins of the Mogu.\"', '', 177672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sigil does not appear here, either. Could it be we\'ve not encountered these mogu before?', '', 177671, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 143582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stubborn and prideful, the Baruk use the spirits of the dead to animate the statues littering their ruins and turn them into immortal soldiers.', '', 177670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks nothing like the sigil, though. See if you can find a copy of \"Will of Stone\".', '', 177669, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 143580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masters of blood magic, the Dokani bolster their ranks with powerful war machines fueled by the life essence of those they conquer.', '', 177668, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177667, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, I see nothing pertaining to our mysterious sigil. Perhaps my copy of \"Power through Blood\" holds the answer...', '', 177666, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With their command over storm and serpent, many consider the Zan-Tien the dominant clan... though the others surely disagree.', '', 177665, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177664, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps this sigil belongs to one of them. Let\'s begin our search with my copy of \"The Serpent Masters\".', '', 177663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177662, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you know, the mogu clans were once again united by the resurrected Thunder King, Lei Shen.', '', 177661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
