('These walls shall hold me no longer! Go, tiny one. The naga will soon feel Kramp\'t\'s wrath!', '', 177650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will surely be a tale to remember. But enough prattling. How can I help?', '', 177649, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, champion! Just as new dangers threaten Pandaria, her heroes make a triumphant return!', '', 177647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dunnae know the first thing about mogu clan sigils. But I bet Lorewalker Cho does! I\'ll meet ye at the Seat of Knowledge.', '', 177646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
