('', 'Thank you, both of you!', 177615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, it was nothin\', Punkin. $n did most of the work.', '', 177614, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sapphronetta gives Grizzek a big kiss.', 177613, 0, 0, 17, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the second-best gift you\'ve ever given me, Grizzy!', 177612, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so cute! I look... AWESOME!', 177611, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It sure is, Punkin. Your very own Azeroth Mini!', '', 177610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is... Is this... What I think it is?', 177609, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wolves, Attack!', 177608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill them!', 177607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack!', 177606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That dog had more honor than you do, Saurfang!', 177605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mukuta, no! You monsters!', 177604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just wait... The Alliance will destroy us...', 177603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tonight, my wolves will feast on the flesh of traitors and Alliance scum!', 177602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am disappointed to see you here, Saurfang. Thrall. But I am not surprised.', 177601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wondered if anyone would come to save the traitor\'s life.', 177600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sapphronetta', 'Sapphronetta', 177599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to-- Wait...', 'Get back to-- Wait...', 177598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear something?', '', 177597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve brought a new tradition to Brewfest: the Brewfest Chowdown! If you are interested in participating, talk to Britta Steinheart by the Chowdown tent. If you prove yourself as a true legend of food and drink, you could win a trophy!', '', 177596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m having trouble finding one of the ingredients, though...', '', 177595, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve already uploaded the blueprint to Pascal-K1N6.', '', 177594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t good...', 177592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My existence is sadness.', 177591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink it all! Direbrew\'s orders!', 'Drink it all! Direbrew\'s orders!', 177590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I might know a way to free them, if you would be willing to help me.', 177589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Admitting that Azshara\'s pride and vanity destroyed them, when they worshipped her... They would lose everything, if they admitted she allowed them to die.', 177588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They won\'t listen. I know you mean well $c. But like many of the spirits here, they refuse to admit the truth.', 177587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Do ye feel that power pulsin\' in the Heart o\' Azeroth, champion? It\'s almost overwhelmin\'!', '', 177586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero.', 'Thank you, hero.', 177585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somewhere safe.', 'Somewhere safe.', 177583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT][REMOVE]', '[DNT][REMOVE]', 177582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re up and running! Come on!', 'We\'re up and running! Come on!', 177581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay sharp, $p.', 177580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the teleporter!', '', 177579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the tree\'s heartroot has been corrupted. This does not bode well.', 177578, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 141682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A shrine to Shek\'zara, the mantid\'s new empress... and to N\'Zoth, their new god.', 177577, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 141683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This amber was corrupted before it was tapped. The entire tree must be afflicted.', 177576, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 141681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', 'I see.', 177575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, right.\n\nJelly is what the bees make from all the pollen they gather from flowers. Some of it is used to make honey, but the rest is used to feed the hive.\n\nThey have to make quite a lot to feed a hive this size, so I wouldn\'t be surprised if they have little deposits of the stuff all over Stormsong by now.\n\nI\'m willing to bet if you bring it back here, the Hivemother would be very happy with you. Saves her brood some work.', '', 177574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is jelly?', 'What is jelly?', 177573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough to know that they do most of the work themselves.\n\nGive them plenty of jelly to eat, leave them to their devices, and eventually they\'ll crawl from the soup and start flying about. Really quite fascinating.\n\nFrom there, these bees grow incredibly fast. They have to, given how large they get! It takes a substantial quantity of jelly to grow one of these to their full size.', '', 177572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, the name has some implications, doesn\'t it?\n\nGuardians are the first to attack and the last to ask questions before doing it. They are fierce protectors of the hive and will selflessly sacrifice themselves if need be. There\'s something to be said about that kind of loyalty.\n\nTides help you if you get on the wrong side of a guardian, though. They have a tendency to call the rest of the hive to swarm their foes.\n\nNasty way to go.\n\nBut hey, they\'re red, so they\'re easy to spot. Just give them their space.', '', 177571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the little yellow ones?\n\nAye, they\'re the sweetest of bees. Their whole lives revolve around flowers and honey and caring for the hive. Blessedly simple creatures, harvesters, but they make up for it in other ways.\n\nNever had a harvester sting me. Not once!\n\nThey might even let you pet their fuzzy little thoraxes if you treat them right.\n\n<Barry sighs happily.>', '', 177570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every hive has its queen, you see. She is responsible for the hive\'s growth. All of these bees are her children.\n\nBy the looks of it, she\'s all by herself. Ordinarily there\'s a young hivemother among the larvae. Might explain why she\'s so protective.', '', 177569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was what about?\n\nOh, the Hivemother?\n\nMy friend, you really ought to learn to speak bee.\n\nShe told me that this hive is new to this region. No idea where they might have come from, but they\'re here now. They are going through the usual struggle to find enough food to keep things moving and the like. Something about ettins and bears.\n\nRegardless, I told her we would help her out. So if you happen to spot an opportunity to help our new friends, I\'m sure they\'d be grateful.', '', 177568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about raising bees?', 'What do you know about raising bees?', 177567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Guardians.', 'Tell me about the Guardians.', 177566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Harvesters.', 'Tell me about the Harvesters.', 177565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Hivemother.', 'Tell me about the Hivemother.', 177564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that all about?', 'What was that all about?', 177563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adapt. Improve. Overcome.', 'Adapt. Improve. Overcome.', 177562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You didn\'t catch that? Haha. Come on inside. I\'ll explain.', '', 177561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeyback Hivemother spins.', '', 177560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeyback Hivemother wiggles.', '', 177559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeyback Hivemother shimmies.', '', 177558, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we are. See? Nothing to worry about.', '', 177557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave ... it... to... me!', '', 177556, 0, 0, 94, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh. Very ... Interesting! Continue!', '', 177555, 0, 0, 94, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleased... to... meet... you!', '', 177554, 0, 0, 94, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... name... is... Barry!', '', 177553, 0, 0, 94, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should probably start with introductions.', '', 177552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeyback Hivemother brandishes her stinger menacingly!', '', 177551, 0, 0, 35, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barry discreetly beckons you over.', '', 177550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah there, Your Majesty! I\'m sure our new friend meant no harm.', '', 177549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A loud buzzing sounds on your approach!', 'A loud buzzing sounds on your approach!', 177548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Cooking_80_ChoralHoney.blp:16|t|Hitem:168822|h|cFF088A08[Thin Jelly]|h|r>', '<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Cooking_80_ChoralHoney.blp:16|t|Hitem:168822|h|cFF088A08[Thin Jelly]|h|r>', 177547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The enormous bee buzzes angrily at you.>', '', 177546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here!', 'Let\'s get out of here!', 177545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the ancestors!', 'Thank the ancestors!', 177544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did you barricade yourself in with these explosives?', 177542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t leave without me!', '', 177540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, young ones. We have to go!', 'Quickly, young ones. We have to go!', 177539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cave starts to buzz angrily at your intrusion!', 'The cave starts to buzz angrily at your intrusion!', 177538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like your little fellow is on to something. It might be able to lead you to their nest!', '', 177537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, you there. Seems to be a new hive in town. Keep an eye out!', '', 177536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brew has come to life! Quick, down a drink and throw the empty mug to capture them!', '', 177535, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen?! How did Hozen get to Durotar? Chase them off before they cause too much chaos!', '', 177534, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. Have you come to join the hunt?', '', 177533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb_nightborne.blp:20|t%s unleashes an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300519|h[Arcane Detonation]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb_nightborne.blp:20|t%s unleashes an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300519|h[Arcane Detonation]|h|r !', 177532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny one, I am injured. We must mend my tides.', '', 177531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little one, I am weak. I require mending.', '', 177530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon reigns upon you!', '', 177529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water you waiting for? Face me!', '', 177528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splashing!', '', 177527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in the tides of vengeance!', '', 177526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic. Nothing more than a ripple!', '', 177525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the waves consume you!', '', 177524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magic of the Tidestone of Golganneth is staggering. I dread to think what would have happened if she had laid her hands on it sooner than she did....', 177523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad the Alliance was able to see reason. We could not stand against Azshara while at each others\' throats. $b$bStill, I fear that any peace brokered here will not last. I do not think the wolf king will be at ease until the Banshee Queen is no more.', 177522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_SIEGE_ENGINEER_OVERLOAD.P:20|t The %s goes |cFFFF0000|Hspell:296080|h[Haywire]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_SIEGE_ENGINEER_OVERLOAD.P:20|t The %s goes |cFFFF0000|Hspell:296080|h[Haywire]|h|r!', 177521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am worried, $n. This has all been too easy.$b$bAzshara has had millennia to plan for our coming. It would be foolish to assume that she has not considered any possibility.$b$bWhat is her true goal, I wonder? Are we playing straight into her machinations?', 177520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am... grateful for the Horde\'s support. This fragile agreement may likely shatter once we return to our homes, but at the very least we are united against Azshara here.', 177519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have neutralized one of her threats by seizing the Tidestone of Golganneth. Now we must bring the fight to Azshara herself.', 177518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara is waiting for us in the palace. I do not speak lightly when I say she is the most powerful sorceress to have ever lived. We cannot underestimate her.', 177517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Genn looks at the Tidestone of Golganneth for a moment.>$b$bSo this is what is keeping the water from flooding in? I\'m glad we have it now.', '', 177516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make no mistake, $n. I do not trust our Horde \"allies.\"$b$bWe will make use of them when we take the fight into the palace, but this is an arrangement of convenience. At least I do not detect the Banshee\'s stench, nor that of her bootlicking general.', '', 177515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this over with. The sooner we defeat Azshara, the sooner we can get out of this trap.', '', 177514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are very nearly finished. Only one obstacle remains.', '', 177513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While we cannot fully trust the Alliance, we will need all the help we can get. Azshara will not show mercy to us once we enter her palace.', '', 177512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait till that bug gets close, then blow it to pieces!  I want nothing left.', '', 177511, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tidestone of Golganneth is safe for now. We will guard it until we are ready to assault the palace.', '', 177510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t%s aims their|cFFFF0000|Hspell:300601|h[Piercing Spear]|h|r at $n!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t%s aims their|cFFFF0000|Hspell:300601|h[Piercing Spear]|h|r at $n!', 177509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you bring me a Vision Key, then you and your party may journey into N\'Zoth\'s Horrific Visions.', '', 177508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re braver than I thought!', 177506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elun\'alor, once the largest temple to the moon goddess.$b$bAzshara and the rest of her Highborne stopped visiting, and the priestesses grew cautious and left. I wonder if anyone still worships there, but I am afraid to find out who they are worshiping.', 177505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to retrieve my trophy.', 'I would like to retrieve my trophy.', 177504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful traveling around here, $n. Not all the ghosts trapped here will meet with you peacefully. Some have been driven mad or remain fanatically devoted to their queen.', 177503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I used to visit these streets. This was a center for magical study and debate. To think all those years of knowledge and expertise are now gone... save for Azshara and our elders.', 177502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits here do not seem to remember the Sundering. Have they forgotten, or been made to forget?$b$bPerhaps it is a blessing.', 177501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though it seems she has abandoned the city, I am glad to see that life has thrived down here.', 177500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much lost in her quest for power... there are many lessons to be learned here.', 177499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Spark-1351 powers down. You\'ll need to find a new one tomorrow.', '', 177498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must tread carefully here. We do not know what lurks in the ruins....', 177497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are a celebration of the heroes, villains, and wondrous creatures of Azeroth! \n\nPlace your Azeroth Mini Collection base on the ground, then choose a figure from your collection to display on it.\n\nBe careful, other nearby figures may attack your figure and destroyed. \n\nDestroyed figures will return to your collection next time you summon your base.', '', 177496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about these toys?', 'Tell me about these toys?', 177495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These kelfin certainly seem friendly enough. It would serve us well to see if we can aid them in their struggles here. After all, the Horde did the same for us in our time of need.', 177494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara has had millennia to consolidate her power. We must be careful.', 177493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The air still thrums with power. Even in its destruction the Well of Eternity has potency.', 177492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now after all these years the essence of the well permeates the air. What power they used to wield....', '', 177484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Giant walls of water that could crush us at any moment. Endless naga, commanded by the most powerful sorceress to have ever lived. Truly a warm welcome to Nazjatar.$b$bHmph. I have survived worse odds.', '', 177483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want an Azeroth Mini of me!', 177482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To think this was once the homeland of all our peoples.... What has been lost beneath the waters? What have we uncovered?', '', 177481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Okani.', 177480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whenever I am in a dangerous situation, I remind myself that a wise murloc once said: \"Mrglgl grrk rrlgl brgldrk!\"', '', 177479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entering the Horrific Vision consumes 1 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_CODEXOFXERRATH_CHAINS.BLP:15|t Vision Key. Do you wish to continue?', 'Entering the Horrific Vision consumes 1 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_CODEXOFXERRATH_CHAINS.BLP:15|t Vision Key. Do you wish to continue?', 177478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look hauntingly familiar... have we met?', 177477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga seek to bend the elements to their will. There is nothing more dishonorable than slavery.', '', 177476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have abused the Tidestone and disrupted the elements. Something must be done before it is too late.', '', 177475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hunt to survive. It has always been our way.', '', 177474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to enter the Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar.', 'I\'d like to enter the Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar.', 177473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard your mind. N\'Zoth\'s influence is insidious in its subtlety.', '', 177472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blastatron', 'Blastatron', 177471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much... for that... promotion...', 177470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MASTERMARKSMAN.BLP:20|t Caution! This area is being patrolled by the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MASTERMARKSMAN.BLP:20|t Caution! This area is being patrolled by the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit!', 177469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another casualty. Let\'s move along.', 177468, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 144725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
