('It is too late to help Gotri.', 'It is too late to help Gotri.', 177466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Searching Garbage', 'Searching Garbage', 177465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s hope the salvagers found the parts they needed for the teleporter.', 177464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More blocked-off buildings. Check the leatherworking and engineering workshops. Careful around those explosives!', 177463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
