('Are you certain that I will require amputation, Pristy? Tinkmaster Overspark didn\'t specify any requirements for--', '', 177425, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_AllianceWarEffort.blp:20|tThe Alliance Commander has begun to lead the assault on Ar\'gorok!', '', 177424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
