('Choose an Azeroth Mini figure to place on the display base.', '', 177398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eeeasy!', '', 177397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... The bot always wins... Szzt!', '', 177396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got some guts fighting me!', '', 177395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! I was about to light up those murlocs and take their stuff!', 177394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only thing worth livin\' is the killin\'.', '', 177393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Usha sends her best.', 177392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I twisted my ankle... go easy on me!', 177391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be fertilizer!', 177390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s for Grumbol!', '', 177389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you still here messing around in my city? Step outside and face me if you want a real challenge.', '', 177387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been here long enough to know that you don\'t stand a chance beating me. Leave now if you value your pride.', '', 177386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb the great Malown?', '', 177383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold the wonders of Nazjatar.', 177382, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 135653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to get MALOWNED?', '', 177381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll beat it out of you!', 'I\'ll beat it out of you!', 177380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grumbol\'s Hammers take what we want!', 'Grumbol\'s Hammers take what we want!', 177379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re all alone out here!', 'You\'re all alone out here!', 177378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammer \'em!', 'Hammer \'em!', 177377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody messes with Usha\'s Eyegougers!', 'Nobody messes with Usha\'s Eyegougers!', 177373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Alliance ain\'t comin\' to save you this time...', 'Your Alliance ain\'t comin\' to save you this time...', 177372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No rules out here, $r...', 'No rules out here, $r...', 177371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gouge \'em eyes!', 'Gouge \'em eyes!', 177370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune-Adore, hero. Our new allies have proven to be quite resourceful. With their help, we have formed a new plan of action.', 177369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If not, you\'d better book it before the meatheads spot you.', 177368, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re looking for Bondo\'s Fight Club, you found it.', 177367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make it entertaining, meatheads!', 177366, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got it, boss.', 177365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bondo wants more fighting! New jackpot incoming!', 177364, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course you don\'t. You think spectators want to stand in the middle of the fighting?\n\nUse your meaty head, meathead. We got cameras rollin\'.', 177363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Audience? I don\'t see any audience.', 'Audience? I don\'t see any audience.', 177362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Longshot holds up a finger as she listens to her earpiece.>\n\nYeah, hold on one sec, boss. Some meathead\'s botherin\' me.\n\nNo I\'ll take care of it.\n\n<Longshot turns to you.>\n\nLook, meathead. Bondo\'s deal is simple: every 30 minutes, he pays to put a big fancy chest loaded with loot in the back of this cave.\n\nYou loot it, you keep it.\n\nYou die, our audience is entertained.\n\nNow, leave me alone and let me work.', 177361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cheating... boar\'s dung... scumbag...', 177359, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think yers\'ll be comin\' back at all! Hahaha!', '', 177358, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha! Ya better drink up, Usha... Mine came back first!', '', 177357, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like Alterac...', '', 177356, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grumbol sighs.', '', 177355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kick some orc teeth in fer me, $n! I\'m stuck \'ere, schmoozin\' with that durned Prince Erazmin while the rest o\' ya have all the fun.', '', 177354, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucky... stinkin\'... filthy... ligh\' durned... swine-smoochin\'...', '', 177350, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I doubt yours\'ll come back at all! Hahaha!', 177348, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heh, drink up, Grumbol... Mine came back first!', 177347, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just like Alterac...', 177346, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Usha sighs.', 177345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill some for me, $n. I\'m stuck here, savin\' face with Prince Erazmin while the rest of you have all the fun.', 177344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found one of my hidden treasures! It\'s trapped of course, I\'m no fool.', '', 177343, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wee prince o\' this island \"commands\" we don\'t fight the Horde swine here.\n\nYe think I e\'er let a durned gnome tell me whatta do!?\n\n<Grumbol leans forward and whispers extremely loudly.>\n\nYa wanna fight? We got a place outside o\' town where the rules aren\'t so... strict.\n\nUnless ya\'d rather cuddle up with the stinkin\' Horde running around here instead. Is that what you like, $n?\n\n<Grumbol throws back his head and laughs.>\n\nNah, yer a fighter. Just like me!', '', 177342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The South Overcharge Station activates!', 'The South Overcharge Station activates!', 177341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The North Overcharge Station activates!', 'The North Overcharge Station activates!', 177340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grumbol laughs into his mug.', '', 177339, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And bring yer big kid pants. It\'s a free fer all out there!', '', 177338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O\' course yer not! Head west to the big waterfall.', '', 177337, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Magni\'s beard! What a stench!', '', 177336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Usha laughs into her mug.', 177335, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a free for all over there. Bring some friends.', 177334, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good for you. Head west toward the waterfall. You\'ll know it when you see it.', 177333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not afraid of a fight. Where\'s the action?', 'I\'m not afraid of a fight. Where\'s the action?', 177332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep on walkin\', scumbag.\n\n<Usha spits at your feet.>\n\nDon\'t worry, I\'ll find you later.', 177331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The prince of this place thinks he can tell us not to kill Alliance scumbags?\n\nBOAR\'S DUNG! I kill Alliance scumbags whenever I damn well feel like it.\n\n<Usha leans forward and whispers.>\n\nFound a place outside town where the fightin\' rules aren\'t as strict. You in?\n\nThat is, if the baby prince hasn\'t melted your heart with his soft, cuddly words...\n\n<Usha throws back her head and laughs.>\n\nDon\'t go soft on me, $n.', 177330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I better go check on my friends. Be careful out here!', 177329, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 135511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you can handle yourself just fine. See you later!', 177328, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 135510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need to get back to my people. Good luck!', 177327, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 135509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stratholme is clear of this undead menace for now, but it sounds like these shadowy figures are becoming more annoying as the time goes on? Maybe you should take the fight to them next time!', '', 177326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oglethorpe cackles mischievously.', '', 177324, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you take care of that, I\'ll make sure Overspark gets a nasty surprise...', '', 177323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very intriguing...', '', 177322, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know if you find any other examples of such alterations on my chickens across the island.', '', 177321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll document the OOX-35/MG\'s natural propensity for rocket evolution.', '', 177320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odd. I don\'t remember outfitting one of my chickens with that much firepower...', '', 177319, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! Oglethorpe is best. Overspark is worst.', '', 177318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remote override protocol activated. CLUCK! Returning to maker.', '', 177317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! CLUCK! MAXIMUM VENGEANCE! CLUCK! CLUCK!', '', 177316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! Troggs detected. Initiating independent annihilation protocol.', '', 177315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Takeoff in 3...2...1... CLUCK!', '', 177314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CLUCK! Giblets overflowing. Power restored.', '', 177313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that noise?', 177312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day those who lord over the rest of us will get their reward.', 177311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I prefer talking to plants rather than people.', 177310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This avenue holds so many memories, all drowned in the aftermath of Queen Azshara\'s ambition.$b$bWatch your step, the Queen will be intending to test us, if I read matters correctly.', 177309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leaving this Bot\'s operational area. Return to the mission area before it explodes.', '', 177308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]There may come a day when I request the curse again. But if I do, I will know what I ask.', 177306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people are not merely worgen. We are Gilnean, as we always have been, and always will be, cursed or not.', 177305, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]Tess...', 177304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feared that to truly know my countrymen, I would need to bear their curse. But I was mistaken.', 177303, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lemme know if you need anything.', 177302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We got you covered.', 177301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last one there\'s a flat mug o\' brew!', '', 177300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet ye at the entrance tae the Vaults, champion!', '', 177299, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, then! Looks like we\'re headin\' tae Pandaria!', '', 177298, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Schematics indicate compatibility between Forge of Origination and Engine of Nalak\'sha.', 177296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 143130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All o\' the other forges are workin\' full-time tae protect Azeroth. Is there anywhere else we can get that power?', '', 177294, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the Forge was not damaged beyond repair. How fortuitous. It is unlike N\'Zoth to resort to brute force...', '', 177293, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 145636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forge operating at reduced capacity. Recommendation: Reroute power from compatible titan facilities.', 177292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 143129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer back! Let\'s hear what MOTHER has tae say.', '', 177288, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet us at the Chamber of Heart as soon as ye can!', '', 177287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! MOTHER may have found a way tae restore the Forge of Origination!', '', 177286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flying to the Vermillion Redoubt with Kalecgos.', 'Flying to the Vermillion Redoubt with Kalecgos.', 177285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! I get to try and... what do you land-walkers call it? Fishing?', '', 177284, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you please send me to Stratholme?', 'Would you please send me to Stratholme?', 177283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our journey continues.', '', 177282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was great! Time for a cold refreshment.', 177278, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on everyone, let\'s get funky!', 177277, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This tawny\'s pretty good, but nothing beats the dwarven stuff back home in Ironforge. No offense, Langstons. I mean, for human brew, it gets the job done. Don\'t get me started on that Moonberry swill!', 177276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stick around and maybe you\'ll see me break out my funky beats. Get it?', 177275, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s all this talk of mechagnomes and upgrades? I don\'t need any \"improvements.\" Have you seen me?!', 177274, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Raid on Orgrimmar after the next round! Who\'s with me? Harry?', 177273, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So tell me, friends, have you ever considered a future in Talent & Leadership Development?', 177272, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You might not know this, but I moonlight as a DJ. Of course, how could you not know? It comes with the name.', 177271, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pull up a stool and join me for a drink or two, friend. Hey, where\'d all the stools go?', 177270, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Next round\'s on me! Except for that drunkard over there. They\'ve had enough!', 177269, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
