('', 'You might not be a warrior, but you\'re a champion of Azeroth for sure. Pull up a stool and grab a drink!\n\nNext round\'s on me... now where did I put my coin purse?', 177267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where else would I discover the most talented warriors and adventurers in all of Azeroth? A tavern, of course!\n\nA toast to you, $n. Cheers!', 177266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
