('My favorite thinking music! I can feel the inventions flooding into my brain already...', '', 177218, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Not my personal taste, but I understand the appeal.', '', 177217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you were busy, I managed to cleanse the remains of that Sludge Belcher from earlier. It still smells awful, but you should be able to use it to clear out that courtyard in front of the Slaughter House just up ahead.', '', 177216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen a snipe? It\'s impossible... without the proper eyewear, that is.', '', 177215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goldrinn! I have gained the wisdom I seek! Remove the rage which clouds my mind!', 177214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, adventurer! These gates leading towards Slaughter Square have opened up after you defeated that apparition. Onward!', '', 177213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you can see, some unwelcome visitors have shown up here. This grotesque thing has even started spewing out more problems to deal with. Good luck and Light be with you.', '', 177212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is scary, get me out of here!', 'This place is scary, get me out of here!', 177211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place gives me the creeps. I hope we aren\'t in here for too long.', '', 177210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewmaster Gadar is on his way! The \"Tapping of the Keg\" will take place in just a few short minutes!', '', 177209, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
