('', 'There\'s only one dog here!', 177205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TO BREWFEST!', '', 177204, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your glasses, people of the Horde!', '', 177203, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I invite you, my brothers and sisters, to count down to the tapping of the keg.', '', 177202, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, and for the rest of Brewfest, we celebrate our shared experience that ties us together as brothers and sisters of the Horde. We share cup, plate, and culture, strengthening our bonds as one Horde.', '', 177201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor, as well as the honor of Warpath Ales, to step up and help lead Brewfest into a new era. An era where the myriad people of the Horde can come together to celebrate and share our experiences.', '', 177200, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although your traditions here may be different than ours on Draenor, I learned about your people through your food and your drink. Experiences we share, though our perspectives may be different.', '', 177199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was not until my first Brewfest that I found where I belonged.', '', 177198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I, alongside my brewers, ventured to find my place in the Horde, to find others like me... like us.', '', 177197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a purpose: to serve the Horde. But how would I serve those that I did not know?', '', 177196, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
