('Shandris is alive and here. Be at peace.', 'Shandris is alive and here. Be at peace.', 177168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina...?', '', 177167, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 135171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t need these shackles.', 'You don\'t need these shackles.', 177166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this off of you.', 'Let\'s get this off of you.', 177165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got lost. They brought me here. I... I think that was a long time ago.\n\nI lost my friend Shandris. I was supposed to watch her but we got separated. I can\'t leave until I find her.', '', 177164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Seduction.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299094|h[Beckons]|h|r you to come closer...', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Seduction.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299094|h[Beckons]|h|r you to come closer...', 177163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was two weeks.... From retirement...', 'I was two weeks.... From retirement...', 177162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you....', 'Curse you....', 177161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is so unfair...', 'This is so unfair...', 177160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw... Nuts...', 'Aw... Nuts...', 177159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die Alliance!', 'Die Alliance!', 177158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Get outta here!', 'Hey! Get outta here!', 177157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But when all is said and done... the choice is yours, and yours alone. All I ask is that you make it wisely.', '', 177156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rage within has driven me to rash decisions in the past. I only wish to shield you from a similar fate.', '', 177155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There may come a day when I ask for the curse again. Know that if I do, it will be after careful consideration.', 177154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father... I would like to apologize for my behavior. But not for my request.', 177153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Restricted area, pal!', 'Restricted area, pal!', 177152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance!?', 'Alliance!?', 177151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! You shouldn\'t be in here!', 'Hey! You shouldn\'t be in here!', 177150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a few targets left. They can\'t use them against us if we turn them into scrap.', '', 177149, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 135227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to keep moving, Shaw.', 177148, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 135226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They should use their minds to save the world instead of devising ways to tear it apart.', 177147, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 135225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day the goblins might outpace gnomish innovation. But not today.', '', 177146, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 135229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, he eluded both N\'Zoth\'s minions and $n. But it seems he has found a way to resist the influence of the Old Gods.', '', 177145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_HONORAMONGSTTHIEVES.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:297372|h[reverses]|h|r the polarity of all wards!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_HONORAMONGSTTHIEVES.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:297372|h[reverses]|h|r the polarity of all wards!', 177144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion crafted this potion? So you were able to find him?', '', 177143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers... are silent...', '', 177142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_GUILDPERK_QUICK AND DEAD.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:297371|h[reverses]|h|r the polarity of two of the wards!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_GUILDPERK_QUICK AND DEAD.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:297371|h[reverses]|h|r the polarity of two of the wards!', 177141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_KILLCOMMAND.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300522|h[Divides]|h|r the field in two!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_KILLCOMMAND.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300522|h[Divides]|h|r the field in two!', 177140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FROST_FROZENORB.BLP:20|tYour heart is about to unleash a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299828|h[Glacial Burst]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FROST_FROZENORB.BLP:20|tYour heart is about to unleash a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299828|h[Glacial Burst]|h|r!', 177139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move to the Eye of the Storm while Ancient Tempest is active!', 'Move to the Eye of the Storm while Ancient Tempest is active!', 177138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Skyreach_Four_Wind.blp:20|t Radiance of Azshara begins to summon an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:295920|h[Ancient Tempest]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Skyreach_Four_Wind.blp:20|t Radiance of Azshara begins to summon an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:295920|h[Ancient Tempest]|h|r!', 177137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_BossFelMagnaron_RuneEmpowered.blp:20|t%s activates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299178|h[Ward of Power]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_BossFelMagnaron_RuneEmpowered.blp:20|t%s activates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299178|h[Ward of Power]|h|r !', 177136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acquire Bioluminescence from a Shimmerskin Pufferfish or your allies will be unable to heal you!', 'Acquire Bioluminescence from a Shimmerskin Pufferfish or your allies will be unable to heal you!', 177135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_SHAWATERELEMENTAL_REFORM.BLP|t The Blackwater Behemoth begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:292084|h[Cavitation]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_SHAWATERELEMENTAL_REFORM.BLP|t The Blackwater Behemoth begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:292084|h[Cavitation]|h|r!', 177134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_LIGHTNINGOVERLOAD.BLP:20|t The Blackwater Behemoth begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:292279|h[Shock Pulse]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_LIGHTNINGOVERLOAD.BLP:20|t The Blackwater Behemoth begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:292279|h[Shock Pulse]|h|r!', 177133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_NULLIFYPOISON.BLP:20|t You have been targeted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:301930|h[Piercing Barb]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_NULLIFYPOISON.BLP:20|t You have been targeted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:301930|h[Piercing Barb]|h|r!', 177132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rushes toward an Ancient Ward!', '', 177131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_PRIEST_SHADOWORBS.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300205|h[Drains]|h|r one of the Ancient Wards!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_PRIEST_SHADOWORBS.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:300205|h[Drains]|h|r one of the Ancient Wards!', 177130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MOTHER\'s opened a waygate tae get ye back here. Hurry!', '', 177129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Monk_ForceSphere_arcane.blp:20|t%s litters the field with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298787|h[Arcane Orbs]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Monk_ForceSphere_arcane.blp:20|t%s litters the field with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298787|h[Arcane Orbs]|h|r !', 177128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! We need ye back in the Chamber at once. Ebonhorn\'s almost gone!', '', 177127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the current assault.', 'Show me the current assault.', 177124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have eyes across the whole of Uldum, watching the movements of enemy forces. If we can alert you of any upcoming surge of activity from one of these enemies, I have no doubt you will be able to quell them.\n\nWould you like to hear the latest scouting report?', '', 177123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legionnaires of Ramkahen stand ready.', '', 177122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will join you.', 'I will join you.', 177121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threats to Uldum are greater than I had imagined. Although I am loath to throw our lot in with the Wastewanders, it seems we have no choice but to band together against these threats.\n\nI\'m afraid that also means I will need your help once more. Will you join us?', '', 177120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I welcome you to Ramkahen, $c.', '', 177119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Black Prince may have eluded us... but you will not!', 'The Black Prince may have eluded us... but you will not!', 177118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, champion! Let us tear these Forsaken apart!', 177114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If only I had this strength back then... I could have saved Liam! Is that what Goldrinn means to show me?', 177113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How I\'ve longed to bring him to justice... He will know my rage!', 177112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blightcaller! Track his scent, champion! His stench should be easy to follow!', 177111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll kill you, Nathanos! I\'ll rip out your throat!', 177110, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 139802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Robots, jetpacks, massive kegerators...\n\nI like these mechagnomes\' style!', '', 177109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t%s aims their |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298425|h[Charged Spear]|h|r at you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t%s aims their |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298425|h[Charged Spear]|h|r at you!', 177108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After him! Now!', 177107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c! Brewfest welcomes you!', '', 177106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on in and have some brew!', '', 177105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mok-rah, $c! Welcome to Brewfest!', '', 177104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey almost made it, so brave, even to da end.', '', 177103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the resistance!', '', 177102, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live the Rustbolt Resistance!', '', 177101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tipsy Tinkerer\'s back in business!', '', 177100, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This kegerator... it\'s beautiful... a work of art!', '', 177099, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast my cogs! What is that heavenly smell?', '', 177098, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the resistance!', 'To the resistance!', 177097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, just suffering from a case of sword in the belly. I\'ll be fine soon.', '', 177096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the resistance!', 'To the resistance!', 177095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood. More blood.', 177094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No escape.', 177093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This has never been easier.', 177092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s next?', 177091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not done yet.', 177090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, what \"queen\" do you speak of?', '', 177089, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 135970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Mag\'har took over Brewfest, we brought along one of our favorite traditions: the Brewfest Chowdown! If you are interested in participating, talk to Etga by the Chowdown tent. If you prove yourself as a true Chowdown champion, you could win not only honor, but a trophy!', '', 177087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the Amathet are retreating back to their tombs. They were fools to challenge Ramkahen.', '', 177086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 145359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 177085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Amathet are mustering for another assault on the Halls of Origination. Break their ranks and scatter them to the winds!', '', 177084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 145357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Together we will vanquish all who threaten our home. For Uldum!', '', 177081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The League\'s got your back, too!', 177080, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 143128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wastewanders stand with you, King Phaoris.', '', 177079, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 143114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest Chowdown', 'Brewfest Chowdown', 177078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will obey your king. All who would fight for Uldum are allies of Ramkahen.', '', 177076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot be serious! I will not partner with graverobbers and bandits!', '', 177075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I propose an accord with those here today, that we band together and defend our home.', '', 177074, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is clear that Ramkahen cannot face these menaces alone.', '', 177073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a disturbing omen, indeed.', '', 177072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is possible, but the visions are... fleeting... unclear...', '', 177071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could these be related to the disappearances in the Lost City?', '', 177070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and the eyes... always watching...', '', 177069, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our cities in ashes... our own kind turned against us... great, black spires looming above the destruction...', '', 177068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you seen, High Priest?', '', 177067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have had... troubling visions of late.', '', 177066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No festival is complete without a bit of chaos. But at Brewfest, it seems that chaos comes every half-hour!\n\nSometimes there is a Dark Iron attack, trying to steal the brew for themselves. Other times, hozen appear and cause an uproar. Every so often, the brew even appears to come to life!\n\nIf you witness any of these events, lend a hand so that we can enjoy the festival.', '', 177065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid that Uldum may be endangered by greater enemies than those we have seen.', '', 177064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the denizens of Ahn\'Qiraj truly are resurfacing, we will need all the allies we can muster.', '', 177063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we cannot face this threat alone. We need the aid of Ramkahen.', '', 177062, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You speak of the past, High Commander. The Wastewanders see Uldum as a land of opportunity. We wish to defend it just as much as you.', '', 177061, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people? The Wastewanders are bandits and thugs! You now play at civilization?', '', 177060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We suspect they are remnants from Ahn\'Qiraj, but these creatures look like no silithid my people have seen before.', '', 177059, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While we prefer wolves on Draenor, it seems as though rams are the traditional Brewfest mount on Azeroth. If you would like to participate in this year\'s ram racing, talk to Draz down by the ram stable. It\'s a great way to earn some Brewfest Prize Tokens!', '', 177058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great swarm of insect-like creatures has overrun many of the Wastewander settlements to the West.', '', 177057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for hearing us, King Phaoris.', '', 177056, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wastewander, tell us what you have encountered in the West.', '', 177055, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is only a matter of time before they overwhelm Uldum unless we can mount a counteroffensive.', '', 177054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their soldiers outnumber ours, and our scouts have seen Watcher constructs among their armies.', '', 177053, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! This bickering does nothing to shield us from the Amathet\'s advance.', '', 177052, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Probably on account of the giant sword sticking into the ground in the North!', 177051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been trying to tell you, the tomb was open when we got there!', 177050, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Your bumbling has brought this war upon us! You were told to leave the tombs be!', '', 177049, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'d know more if you wouldn\'t keep the League from exploring their tombs!', 177048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know little of the Amathet, only that they believe themselves the sole defenders of the titans\' works and seek to rid them of the \"unworthy.\"', '', 177047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem you are not the only ones.', '', 177045, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are full of food and drink, don\'t forget to check out the Brewfest souvenirs! From traditional holiday garb to mini-kegs of tasty brew, you can purchase many different items from Blix Fixwidget. These items are traditionally not bought with gold, but traded for Brewfest Prize Tokens, which you can earn by participating in Brewfest festivities.', '', 177042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come unarmed, and we only seek an audience with the king.', '', 177041, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 143108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brigands! Your kind are not welcome here!', '', 177040, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 143107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest is all about enjoying the best food and drink in the land, and our vendors took that to heart. A good brew can be hard to come by, but I assure you that here you will only find the very best. There are also many vendors selling hand-crafted sausages, pretzels, and cheeses to enjoy with your drink.', '', 177039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twice a day, at six fifteen in the morning and six fifteen in the evening, the brewmaster of Warpath Ales himself comes out to the Brewfest grounds for the Tapping of the Keg ceremony. It is a grand honor. Be here!', '', 177038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
