('Walton Cogfrenzy himself brought me here!\n\nImagine that, the chief architect of Mechagon forced to sneak people out of his own city...\n\nThis is a dark day.', 'Walton Cogfrenzy himself brought me here!\n\nImagine that, the chief architect of Mechagon forced to sneak people out of his own city...\n\nThis is a dark day.', 176938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re safe here in Rustbolt. Prince Erazmin will protect us.\n\n...Right?', 'We\'re safe here in Rustbolt. Prince Erazmin will protect us.\n\n...Right?', 176937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should\'ve seen the signs... I didn\'t want to believe that King Mechagon had gone mad.\n\nBut he has, hasn\'t he?', 'I should\'ve seen the signs... I didn\'t want to believe that King Mechagon had gone mad.\n\nBut he has, hasn\'t he?', 176936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family is still inside Mechagon... We must rescue them too!', 'My family is still inside Mechagon... We must rescue them too!', 176935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
