('Mr. Cogfrenzy is an exemplary individual. He risked his life to sneak us out of Mechagon!', 'Mr. Cogfrenzy is an exemplary individual. He risked his life to sneak us out of Mechagon!', 176933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
