('The crystal is dormant. Perhaps a source of elemental magic may revive it.', 'The crystal is dormant. Perhaps a source of elemental magic may revive it.', 176860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never stop building, friend.', '', 176858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Nazjatar!', 'Take me to Nazjatar!', 176857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the button to release a pulse of energy.', 'Press the button to release a pulse of energy.', 176856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready when you are.', 'Ready when you are.', 176855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For ages, I wondered what would have happened to me had I chosen to flee to Zin-Azshari, or to Suramar, instead of with Tyrande.$b$bNow I see I might have found my family, right before I would have lost them to Azshara\'s madness.', 176854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The false son of Durotan must die! The blood of the Mag\'har is on his hands!', 176853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00Resistance +$1i|r', '|cffffff00Resistance +$1i|r', 176852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You would presume to challenge my magic, Thalyssra? Allow me to demonstrate why you never ascended to Grand Magistrix.', 176851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough, Sivara. My subjects cannot grovel if they are dead. I will allow them one final chance to kneel before my throne.', 176850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I digress. You hoped to be reunited with a lost loved one. Allow me to grant your wish.', 176849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can abide the ignorance of your companions, but you should know better than to defy your rightful queen.', 176848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Little Shandris. A lowborn commoner who fancies herself a general. Filth like you shall be washed from the streets of Zin-Azshari.', 176847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy there!$b$bThe last ship to Nazjatar just departed, but in the meantime I can take ye there. Ye will arrive a bit late to the party, but you\'ll be intact.$b$bWant a ride, $n?', '', 176846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewfest is the perfect holiday! But every half-hour or so, the camp seems to erupt into chaos.\n\nSometimes Direbrew\'s Dark Iron attack, trying to take the brew home for themselves. Other times, hozen come out of nowhere and cause a ruckus! And other times the brew even comes to life!\n\nIf you are around, lend a hand so that we can enjoy the festival.', '', 176845, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Campground Chaos', 'Campground Chaos', 176844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen the naga use these things all over the place. They can hold a lot of power.', '', 176840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara must answer for her crimes.', '', 176833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never break an oath.', '', 176832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan will survive.', '', 176831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike true.', '', 176830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you ask of the Waveblade?', '', 176829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak your mind.', '', 176828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must remain alert.', '', 176827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, traveler.', '', 176826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need me, you know where to find me.', 176825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try not to be too reckless.', 176824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you around.', 176823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay sharp.', 176822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You waiting for a welcome mat?', 176821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something on your mind?', 176819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t have all day.', 176818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well? Out with it.', 176817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feeling a little homesick. Mind if I head back for now? Come get me later, okay?', '', 176816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ocean says I\'m needed back home. I can always join you again if you ask!', '', 176815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I have to head back for now. But I\'ll be in Newhome if you need some help!', '', 176814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At any rate, I suppose you have work to do. Good luck!', '', 176809, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elementary! Well, arcane, if one is to be technical about it. I must beg your pardon. We are all a bit out of our depth right now.', '', 176808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are. With the merest touch of the Heart of Azeroth, the pathway will be stabilized.', '', 176807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we combine our powers, we should be able to open a gateway to Zuldazar without Azshara noticing.', '', 176806, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a convergence of ley lines close by. Come, come!', '', 176805, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know just the thing, Thalyssra. Come along, $p. You will serve as my assistant!', '', 176804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth, I am relieved you made it here. Azshara is blocking my teleportation spells. We need to find a crack in her defenses.', 176803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They seem to be quite different from the goblins on land.', '', 176802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t sweat it. If you wanna show your appreciation, you can lend a helping hand.', 176801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are in your debt, Neri.', 176800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell your troops to make themselves comfortable. I have a few things to discuss with my people.', 176799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, folks. Here we are! It\'s not much, but it\'s home.', 176798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never forget Neri\'s survival rule number one: Don\'t get killed!', 176797, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 135465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go... before something else comes along to spoil the fun.', 176796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Phew! I knew Azshara didn\'t like us, but she reaaaaaally hates you. That got personal!', 176795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course! By the stars, I should have realized! Lor\'themar, this place is--', 176794, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 135257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What queen?! Are you telling me you don\'t know where you are?', 176793, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 135462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are some who would beg to differ.', '', 176792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any enemy of the queen is a friend of ours. We know the bad guys pretty well, and you\'re not one of them.', 176791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve had our eye on you since this chaos started. Walls of water rising, ships crashing everywhere... then the naga swarmed all over you!', 176790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are strangers here. Why did you help us?', 176789, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 135256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, everyone. Let\'s get moving before the creature regains its wits! We have a safe place where you can regroup.', 176788, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 135459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chew on this, monster! Atolia, free them from the beast\'s grip!', 176787, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 176786, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 135968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful. Something stirs beyond this wall of water.', 176785, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, assuming there is any safe ground to find. This place is unsettling, yet... familiar.', 176784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we find refuge, will you be able to send word to Oculeth?', '', 176783, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 135965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Questions will have to wait. We must find shelter for our people.', 176782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This makes no sense. Why would the naga accept a human as an ally?', 176781, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 135251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew Ashvane could not be trusted. Damn her treachery!', '', 176780, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must move quickly.', 176779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are vastly outnumbered. We cannot hold this position.', '', 176778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not a moment too soon, $p.', 176777, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His chains... will be... broken...', 176776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are far too late. His ascension comes!', 176775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will serve or die!', 176774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I drink their dreams! Savor their fear!', 176773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yessss... More! More!', 176772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hour the queen spoke of is upon us.', 176771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More sacrifices for the tide!', 176770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yet instead of fighting alongside the rest of us, you walled yourselves off as Kalimdor burned around you.', 176769, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 135633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return quickly. I can only hold this barrier for so long.', 176768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, $p! The naga\'s attack is relentless!', 176767, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on ahead to Thalyssra. Cut down any naga you encounter along the way. Make them pay for every Horde life they have taken.', '', 176766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seemed as if the Alliance ships were about to capture us. Then the naga sprung their trap. What could those fiends be up to?', '', 176765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers, hold this ground! Where is Blightcaller?', '', 176764, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N\'eth ana!', '', 176763, 0, 0, 51, 64, 0, 135612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That looks far enough. No time to lose!', '', 176762, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 135611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Regent Lord and Lady Thalyssra seek shelter for our forces. I will remain here to catch any other soggy heroes who trudge along.', '', 176761, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies. I am sometimes prone to distraction. I should get you down these falls without letting you plummet to your death.', '', 176760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is fascinating, don\'t you think? The power that thrums all around us is quite astonishing.', '', 176759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast!', '', 176758, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you will want to find safe haven for our wounded. Oculeth will assist you. I have a mission to complete.', '', 176757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around, $p. The vaunted Alliance fleet lies in ruins. Perfect.', '', 176756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re back on your feet. Good. Your survival is key to the Dark Lady\'s plans.', '', 176755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure! Yes of course, I\'ll be.. right there..', '', 176754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave that pearl alone and get back to Boralus! The Admiral needs you.', 'Leave that pearl alone and get back to Boralus! The Admiral needs you.', 176753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 176752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... a little... more...', '', 176751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet mother of pearl, I want you.', '', 176750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come loose!', '', 176749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh fine, alright, I\'ll head that way now.', '', 176748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get up! The Admiral needs you!', 'Get up! The Admiral needs you!', 176747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just innae fair! The whole ocean just went away. How are we supposed ta fight that?', '', 176746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks. I will be taking my leave now.', '', 176745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coast is clear.', 'The coast is clear.', 176744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t help but overhear the death throes of those foul insects outside. Am I correct to assume that they have been dispatched successfully?', '', 176743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything going well?', '', 176742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy to see you.', '', 176741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be right here!', '', 176740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can count on me.', '', 176739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target neutralized! Sparknozzle will want a full report, Commander. We\'ll clean up here.', '', 176738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 176737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fool\'s errand. But I will let my daughter chase it so she may learn some lesson from it. It is your job to make sure nothing happens to her.', '', 176736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then we\'ll have another one of these pleasant family conversations.', 176735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if it goes badly?', '', 176734, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 139822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Perhaps not, but that is a lesson she must learn herself. Let her talk to the druid. We\'ll see how that goes.', 176733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a day goes by without me thanking the Light that the two of you were spared the curse. It is not the answer she seeks.', '', 176732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 139821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that he is gone, Tess is searching for answers to questions she never thought she would ask.', 176731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... she\'s not wrong. Liam was the heir apparent. He was meant to lead Gilneas.', 176730, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 139772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remind you of anyone, dear? She did not inherit her temper from me.', 176729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is impossible to reason with that girl!', '', 176728, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 139820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal, now hold on tight!', '', 176727, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I will meet you in Duskwood... before my father forbids it.', 176726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on!', '', 176725, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hope whoever has the shield up lets us in, or this will be one short ride!', '', 176724, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The recruits back at Stormwind are never going to believe this!', '', 176723, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m goin\' ahead te make sure Camp Bronzebeard is safe. For the Alliance!', '', 176722, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll have to leap off the gryphons when we get to the camp and get to work as fast as possible with whoever is left there.', '', 176721, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna get meself to Camp Bronzebeard te see how they\'re doin\'. I\'ll meet up with the rest of ye later!', '', 176720, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold onto the gryphons, they\'re trained to avoid all sorts of danger. Hopefully it also includes fire from a dragon\'s artifact!', '', 176719, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to learn from the creatures that inhabit this deep sea, though we must do our best not to disrupt the fragile ecology. \n\nI enchanted scrolls to collect valuable data from a specimen without being unnecessarily invasive. \n\nThis way, we can ensure that information is recorded and passed down to future generations.', 176718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 39653),
('I... I thought I heard water. Rushing, roaring water...', 'I... I thought I heard water. Rushing, roaring water...', 176717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are some who say the Queen is consorting with the same demons that destroyed our home.', 'There are some who say the Queen is consorting with the same demons that destroyed our home.', 176716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost so many just trying to get here.', 'We lost so many just trying to get here.', 176715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our home was destroyed by demons. We had no where else to turn.$b$bAnd now the people of this city won\'t believe us. The Queen will not even grant us an audience.', 'Our home was destroyed by demons. We had no where else to turn.$b$bAnd now the people of this city won\'t believe us. The Queen will not even grant us an audience.', 176714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... late...', '', 176713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm surge is upon us!', '', 176712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r <Search the body for more journal pages.>', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r <Search the body for more journal pages.>', 176711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The body is still warm to the touch. He has not been dead for long.>', '<The body is still warm to the touch. He has not been dead for long.>', 176710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These beasts will not allow us to pass unscathed. I fear our lives would be forfeit if we tried. Might you be willing to lend us a hand?', '', 176709, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This $r will make an excellent subject.', '', 176708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Full mechanization awaits $n.', '', 176707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I deem $n worthy.', '', 176706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I approve of your existence.', '', 176705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have been through so much together, you and I. Trust in me, as I have ever trusted in you.', 176704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The threads we have woven with such care will soon be drawn together. The war is serving its purpose. Stay focused on the endgame. You know what is to come.', 176703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Casualties on both sides will be substantial. Consider this an opportunity to weed out the disloyal.', 176702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sail out with what remains of our fleet. The blade will guide you to the rendezvous.', 176701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathanos. The next phase of our campaign is at hand.', 176700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Removal of $n required.', '', 176699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Technology has deemed $n unnecessary.', '', 176698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deletion is required.', '', 176697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your existence is unauthorized.', '', 176696, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incompatible $r detected.', '', 176695, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No no no no! My entire inventory of nightsabers are on the loose. This will not do.\n\nI don\'t remember how they got out. I don\'t remember why everything got so wet either. \n\nI don\'t... did I just imagine a wall of endless water?', 176694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I failed... They know where to find him. Hurry!', '', 176693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Shath\'Yar] Hwr... whyrr..', '', 176692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I so wet?', '', 176691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am starting to think our Queen\'s ritual did not do what she promised it would...', '', 176690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, the hippogryphs got loose. The nightsabers are running amok. And there is algae on the ground. How is there algae on the ground?', '', 176689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t remember the market getting so messy...', '', 176688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! A customer.$b$bI wish I had some goods to sell you today, but all of my wares have been purchased.$b$bMany of the refugees that have arrived have shared stories of horrifying demons and monsters beyond our walls, and as such everyone is just buying up every talisman, trinket, and magic wand I had for sale.', '', 176687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need to get these animals under control. All of this strange magic in the air is driving them mad.', 176686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard Queen Azshara was coming by today. Oh why did it have to be today?', 176685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of these refugees are making my birds nervous.', 176684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My hippogryphs! They got free!', 176683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.$B$BYo ho ho, even.$B$BThe flights to Mechagon are being worked on. In the meantime, I\'ll take yeh there, lickety-split.$B$BDo yeh trust me, $c?', '', 176682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse of flesh detected,', '', 176681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bat no work. Submarine works!\n\nGo talk to Captain Krooz!', '', 176680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.$B$BYo ho ho, even.$B$BThe flights to Alliance territory are being worked on. In the meantime, I\'ll take yeh there, lickety-split.$B$BDo yeh trust me, $c?', '', 176679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agreed. Today, we share a common goal. Azshara must fall.', 176678, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 134093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot afford to underestimate her strength, Jaina. It may take all of us to defeat her.', '', 176677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our armies will crush you!', 'Our armies will crush you!', 176676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, attend me!', 'Minions, attend me!', 176675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Denizens of the deep, heed my call!', 'Denizens of the deep, heed my call!', 176674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold, champion. Sivara is beyond our ability to confront alone. We will need reinforcements.', 176673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew many of these people. They were my friends... my loved ones... all of them are gone...', 176672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Janius? My closest childhood friend... we were playing together when the Legion attacked our village...', 176671, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the lift to the third floor>', '<Take the lift to the third floor>', 176670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the lift to the first floor>', '<Take the lift to the first floor>', 176669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The lift controls are operational.>', '', 176668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The lift controls appear to be without power.>', '', 176667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try to get you patched up.', '', 176665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know if I can save this one...', '', 176664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many lives lost... please let this one make it.', '', 176663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay with me!', '', 176662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continued excavation not recommended. 30 seconds to cancel.', '', 176661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are losing control of Theronar. Turn back!', 'You are losing control of Theronar. Turn back!', 176660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murky is too far from his egg! Turn back!', 'Murky is too far from his egg! Turn back!', 176659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies are already upon us! Activate it!', '', 176658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The watcher is not yet complete. I need more time!', '', 176657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Obtaining the Tidestone must be our top priority. But it would be unwise to press further into Azshara\'s realm without first knowing what we\'re up against.', 176656, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 134972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to push further into Azshara\'s realm and obtain the Tidestone, we will need to know the lay of the land.', '', 176655, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Those hozen will be running home with their tails between their legs!', '', 176654, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those hozen caused quite a ruckus, we\'re going to need a cleanup crew.', '', 176653, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen?! How did Hozen get to Dun Morogh? Chase them off before they cause too much chaos!', '', 176652, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sivara... never... should... have listened to... you... Thalyssra.', '', 176651, 0, 70667, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is just a boy. Please, take Janius away from this madness before it is too late.', '', 176650, 0, 70666, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can use the reactivated crystals to speak over great distances. Find more within the city if you need to contact me.', 176649, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra! Vile witch! You were the one who convinced my sister to serve at the palace.', '', 176648, 0, 70667, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Janius? What have you done with him?!', '', 176647, 0, 70666, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sivara, my love! We... should have fled...', 176646, 0, 70667, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Janius, no! I couldn\'t... save you...', 176645, 0, 70666, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, Sivara! The city is flooding!', 176644, 0, 70667, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Janius! Where are you?!', 176643, 0, 70666, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This terminal controls the power to something called the \"Guardian Protocol.\"\n\nIt appears to have been damaged by the Amathet, and is currently nonoperational.>', '', 176642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This power terminal is simply marked \"Reorigination.\">', '', 176641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This terminal controls the power to Forge of Origination\'s defense matrix.>', '', 176640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This terminal controls the power to the lift in the Maker\'s Rise.>', '', 176639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know Arcanist Sivara? I just saw her! She has such pretty hair.\n\nI heard she was trained by First Arcanist Thalyssra. She is super fancy.\n\nAnyway, I saw Arcanist Sivara walk by just a few minutes ago. I think she is going to see the Queen. Didn\'t you hear? Queen Azshara is right down the street! Maybe I\'ll get to see her if I get away from these nasty guards.', 176638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Arcanist Sivara?', 'Have you seen Arcanist Sivara?', 176637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Janius? Oh yeah! \n\nHe\'s nice but sad. Always looking for his friend. He never told on me when he saw me stealing from someone\'s cart. Said he was from a small town like Ara... Ara-something.\n\nHe said he was going to try to see the Queen. Didn\'t you hear? Queen Azshara is right down the street! Maybe I\'ll get to see her if I get away from these nasty guards.', 176636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s just hope I\'m not too late...', 'Let\'s just hope I\'m not too late...', 176635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the light, stay with me!', 'By the light, stay with me!', 176634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
