('Reorigination? Back away slowly, now. Best not tae be messin\' with that...', '', 176632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be where they\'re powerin\' the defenses we encountered earlier. We can shut this one off.', '', 176631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
