('Annihilated', 'Annihilated', 176620, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Janius?', 'Have you seen Janius?', 176619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many wonders lie in store. Such... magnificence.', 176618, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 134005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider this a formal invitation. My palace has been made ready. Your presence is eagerly anticipated.', 176617, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 134008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop you? My dear child, why would I want to stop you?', 176616, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 134004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t stop us, Azshara. We are coming to end your reign.', 176615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here? Bitter rivals standing united around my Tidestone. I really do possess a gift for bringing my subjects together.', 176614, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 134003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance heroes will dethrone the would-be queen. We won\'t seek a fight with you, Lor\'themar, but we will not abide interference.', 176613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s champions will drive every last naga from the palace. Azshara will pay for what she\'s done.', '', 176612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t want to steal the pudding, but I needed the food.', 176611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This arcane lock is fiendishly difficult if you don\'t... you know what... you don\'t need to hear it. It\'ll probably just confuse your infantile mind. Ha!', '', 176610, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
