('Then it is imperative that we take control of it ourselves. We must find a way to break that barrier!', '', 176589, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As long as she holds the Tidestone, she has the power to bring back the sea and drown us all at any moment.', 176588, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara has the Tidestone of Golganneth? The recent invasions must have been a diversion!', '', 176587, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 135992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot allow that to happen. We must find a way to break the barrier and secure the Tidestone.', '', 176586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $p. Now we need to gather our wits and reinforce our position.', 176585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perfect. The Heart will allow you to use the portal safely.', 176584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nearly there...', 176583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Heart of Azeroth holds potent magic, $p. If you use it to help me focus the ley lines, we can open the way together.', 176582, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can tap into this latent power to forge a connection to Boralus. So long as we\'re careful, we can keep Azshara from noticing it.', 176581, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land was once the heart of the night elves\' empire. I can sense ley lines of magical energy converging below ground.', 176580, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears Shandris has finished scouting the area. She\'s gathered our surviving forces.', '', 176579, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hold back the naga, King Greymane.', 176578, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is something going on here that we do not yet understand. We must find out what she\'s after.', 176577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But why lure us here? Why not simply drown us and be done with it?', '', 176576, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So long as Azshara controls that artifact, we are all in grave danger. She could flood Nazjatar in an instant.', 176575, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 134997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tidestone of Golganneth! That must be how she was able to part the sea!', '', 176574, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 133956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan holds this ground. Your people are welcome here, so long as you respect our ways.', '', 176573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could not have stumbled upon this place by accident. She wanted you here.', '', 176569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara. Perhaps the most powerful sorceress the world has ever known.', 176568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you truly not know whose kingdom this is, landwalker?', '', 176567, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 135886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"She\"? Of whom do you speak?', '', 176566, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nowhere in this place is safe. She is always watching.', '', 176565, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 135885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have found safe haven here?', 176564, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 134986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. My people will harry the enemy while we work our way past the main army.', '', 176563, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Okani, we will come with you.', '', 176562, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 133952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They seem to be our best chance. My instincts tell me to trust them--at least for now.', 176561, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It could be a trap. What say you, Jaina?', '', 176560, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are departing for our shelter in the reef. Come, or do not. But decide quickly.', '', 176559, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people are known as the ankoan. We left the land behind long ago.', '', 176558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A people called the jinyu aided the Alliance in Pandaria. Are they your kin?', 176557, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 134984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And why would we trust you?', '', 176556, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We share a common foe. Come, we will lead you to safety.', '', 176555, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. I am Okani, leader of the Waveblade clan.', '', 176554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another naga ambush!', '', 176553, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 133949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a source of great power up ahead.', 176552, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here.', 176551, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 134981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve spotted us! We need to go!', '', 176550, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 133948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear that?', '', 176549, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay on your guard. We don\'t know how many more naga are out there.', 176548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful. Something about this place fills me with dread. Elune watch over you.', 176547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris, hold this ground. We will send word once we\'ve found refuge.', '', 176546, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then we have no choice but to move forward.', 176545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cave won\'t remain safe for long.', '', 176544, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 133945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come.', 176543, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 135650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are done here. Let us rejoin the others. The sooner we can leave this place, the better.', 176542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such should be the fate of all your kind.', 176541, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This vile serpent commands the others. Stop her!', 176540, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 135647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wretches!', 176539, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 135646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You follow a false queen!', 176538, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unhand them, monsters!', 176537, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are sacrificing our soldiers!', 176536, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll meet you up ahead.', '', 176535, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will make them pay!', 176534, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 135642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Shandris, can you handle the naga ahead with our champion\'s help?', 176533, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 134978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not without me.', '', 176532, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hold them off for now.', 176531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 176530, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 134976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we will put a stop to it. Let\'s move.', '', 176529, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 133942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They speak of others being seized by the naga for some sort of ritual.', 176528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Survivors are gathering in a cave ahead.', 176527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tides carry them home.', 176526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our vessels have been lost. Casualties are... extensive.', 176525, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Little of it good, I fear.', 176524, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 135638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shandris, thank the Light you survived. Any news?', 176523, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 134974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. I\'ll get us down this water safely.', 176522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, we\'re ready to move.', '', 176521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. The Lord Admiral is nearby.', '', 176520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re being pressed in from all sides. We must find safety for our troops before more are lost.', '', 176519, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many dead.', '', 176518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have stayed in the water, snake!', '', 176517, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 133937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sivara? No! You chose to serve Azshara?!', 176516, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... I sense something... someone... familiar...', 176515, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sivara... my most gifted student. It was on my recommendation that she enrolled in the Royal Academy.', 176514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be at peace, my dear friend.', 176513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Janius!', 176512, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flux spits over her shoulder.', 176511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get overloaded. You want a discount? Get here earlier next time and help us build the blasted thing.', 176510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incoming!', 176509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You charge too much! This is extortion!', 'You charge too much! This is extortion!', 176508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, with me!', 176507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The charging station is the big tower of power usually standin\' next to me.\n\nIt\'s the only device powerful enough to recharge empty energy cells, converting them into usable energy cells.\n\nBondo owns it, I protect it. Neither of us tolerate freeloadin\'.\n\nYou wanna use it, you gonna pay for it.\n\nBut it ain\'t workin\' today. So beat it.', 176506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The charging station is that big tower of power standin\' next to me.\n\nIt\'s the only device powerful enough to recharge empty energy cells, converting them into usable energy cells.\n\nBondo owns it, I protect it. Neither of us tolerate freeloadin\'.\n\nYou wanna use it, you gonna pay for it.\n\nToday\'s your lucky day. Bondo don\'t open it up to outsiders most days.', 176505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The charging station is the big tower of power usually standin\' next to me.\n\nIt\'s the only device powerful enough to recharge empty energy cells, converting them into usable energy cells.\n\nBondo owns it, I protect it. Neither of us tolerate freeloadin\'.\n\nYou wanna use it, you gonna pay for it.\n\nIt ain\'t workin\' every day, but you\'re lucky. We should have it up and runnin\' here soon. Chip in or get lost.', 176504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heh, lil\' flashfoot\'s first charge.\n\nMomma Quickcharge must be so proud.\n\n<Flux spits over her shoulder.>', 176503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You confused or somethin\'? You already got access and the charger\'s over there.\n\nKeep your hands and eyes offa ME, or I\'ll take \'em offa YOU. Got it?', 176502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ain\'t nothin\' in Bondo\'s Yard\'s free.', 176501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Charging Station\'ll be up soon.\n\nYou want to use it? Stick around and help us repair the blasted thing.', 176500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll handle this.', 'I\'ll handle this.', 176499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Roo\'li is dead and I failed to protect him. But maybe...\n\n<Koo\'li looks to your direhorn companion.>\n\nYou can prevent this from happening again. Kill de beast known as Spinethrash. Work together. Let no one else suffer as my poor Roo\'li suffered.', 176498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Koo\'li wipes at her eyes.>\n\nI should have known better than to walk so close to de river. He tried to warn me, he tried to stop it...\n\n<Koo\'li sobs quietly.>', 176497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should buy us a few more minutes before it shuts down.', 176496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll toss that energy cell into the charging station.', 176495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that Sharas\'dal you hold? Impudent mortal! You dare to wield my own scepter against me?!', 176494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A harmless prank, yes! Hek hek hek. Give de large stompy one a smile from ol\' Jani.', '', 176493, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... No, richmon. I found it. It belongs to me, yes?', '', 176492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Eternal Palace (Raid).', 'I want to go to the Eternal Palace (Raid).', 176491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $c! Its you. \n\nDa Alliance are all over in Nazjatar. You can help us take \'em out.', '', 176490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you, $c. We need all the help here in Nazjatar to fend off the Horde. Volrath can\'t get the upper hand.', 176489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, dear sister. You are always correct.', '', 176488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stabilize yourself, dear brother. We must continue our project.', 176487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much power... the generator... it\'s beautiful...', '', 176486, 0, 0, 16, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And did you see that jump? Wondrous.', 176485, 0, 0, 17, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power spike, dear sister! Our test subject has done it!', '', 176484, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a |TInterface\\ICONS\\Sha_Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye_nightmare.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:297173|h[Mind Nearly Lost]|h|r! Gain Sanity before time runs out!', 'You have a |TInterface\\ICONS\\Sha_Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye_nightmare.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:297173|h[Mind Nearly Lost]|h|r! Gain Sanity before time runs out!', 176483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Azshara.', 'I want to teleport to Azshara.', 176482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Za\'qul.', 'I want to teleport to Za\'qul.', 176481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to the Naga Council.', 'I want to teleport to the Naga Council.', 176480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to the Hatchery.', 'I want to teleport to the Hatchery.', 176479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Lady Asvhane.', 'I want to teleport to Lady Asvhane.', 176478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I want to teleport to the Blackwater Behemoth.', 'I want to teleport to the Blackwater Behemoth.', 176477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to the Radiance of Azshara.', 'I want to teleport to the Radiance of Azshara.', 176476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You struggle against the inevitable end.', '', 176475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your every victory serves my will.', '', 176474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One falls. A thousand more will take its place.', '', 176471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened?', 'What happened?', 176470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were merely a stepping stone along your true path.', '', 176469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torcali demands that you restore her shrine. Now.', 'Torcali demands that you restore her shrine. Now.', 176468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that Torcali\'s shrine?', 'Is that Torcali\'s shrine?', 176467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings Richmon!\n\nHow do you like this new shrine of mine? Fancy, yes?', '', 176466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t die before then.', 176463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous! We\'ll have another experiment ready for you tomorrow, dear test subject.', 176462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repairs on the generator are sufficient. Next step: more power!', '', 176461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have the tools. We just need the test subjects.', 176460, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Torcali truly is a worker of miracles. May her steps shake de earth always!', '', 176459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help you.', 'I will help you.', 176458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gave praise to de loa of travelers and here you are!\n\nCan you help us? My beast has fallen ill. She will not last much longer without aid.\n\nI noticed some powerful medicinal blooms nearby, but I fear if I leave her side de stalkers will eat her. If you could pick some of de white blossoms and bring the largest petals to me, I can get her on her feet long enough to find a town.\n\nWhat do you say? Will you help us?', '', 176457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope she will be alright...\n\n<Kofu pats his direhorn\'s side.>', '', 176456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forge is ours, trespassers!', '', 176455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 143071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Direbrew\'s Dark Iron won\'t get away with our brew this day!', '', 176454, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much brew... stolen by those Dark Iron defectors! Perhaps next time we will be prepared to fight them off.', '', 176453, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall to your knees!', 176452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I will take my place beside Saurfang and Thrall, and pray that the sin\'dorei stand with me.', '', 176451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell my people what transpired here. Of how Azshara fell because we stood together. Of the threat rising from the depths, and all that is at stake if we should fail.', '', 176450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had hoped that reason would prevail. But the time has come to finish this.', '', 176449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The war needs to end, Lor\'themar. You know this to be true.', 176448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have found common cause here in Nazjatar, but the battle still rages beyond these waters. So long as Sylvanas holds Orgrimmar, there can be no lasting peace.', '', 176447, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For all her lies, Priscilla Ashvane spoke one truth. The war between the Alliance and Horde has kept us distracted. Divided, we have no hope against N\'Zoth.', 176446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got him!', '', 176445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blammo!', '', 176444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna hurt!', '', 176443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see him!', '', 176442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Locked on!', '', 176441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our victory rings hollow. Azshara\'s master will rise. Nothing can stop that now.', '', 176440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I gotta head back for now. You know where to find me.', '', 176438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Headed home to check on things. Come get me if you need backup.', '', 176437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m needed back at home. Meet me there when you can.', '', 176436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direbrew\'s lackeys have returned! Quick, everybody fight them off!', '', 176435, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ratified. Only displaying unlocked blueprints.', '', 176432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ratified. All blueprints now available for viewing.', '', 176431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ratified. Hypothetically incredible blueprints now available for viewing.', '', 176430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pascal-K1N6, prepare your database for rapid-transfer. Store these ideas until we develop blueprints for them.', '', 176429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THESE are incredible new ideas!', '', 176428, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now scram. Your first-timer discount is all used up.', 176427, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you didn\'t fry your brains out. Look at you.', 176426, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the power this relic holds, we can seize control of the Tidestone. Elune is with us, champion.', 176424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This temple was once graced by the light of Elune. Now it is merely another monument to Azshara\'s selfish pride.', 176423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits of the long departed linger here. Tread carefully, $n, until we know what danger awaits us.', 176422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Ramkahen will know of your deeds.', '', 176421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannae afford tae lose the Forge again. Do whatever it takes tae protect it!', '', 176420, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 143106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll return tae the chamber and start figurin\' out our next move.', '', 176419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 143105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like our work isn\'t done, champion.', '', 176418, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 145598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Affirmative. Additional power sources required.', 176417, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 145595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thirty-seven! That can\'t be enough tae keep Azeroth protected!', '', 176416, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 145597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Error: Forge operating at thirty-seven percent efficiency.', 176415, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 145594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Circuit established. Restoring power.', 176414, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 145593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Direct circuit to Chamber of Heart required. Interface Heart of Azeroth with main console.', 176413, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 143127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Receiving signal. Error: Unable to access primary power conduits.', 176412, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 143126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood. Access power terminals to commence system reactivation.', 176411, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 143125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
