('I want to teleport to the Operation: Mechagon dungeon.', 'I want to teleport to the Operation: Mechagon dungeon.', 176260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, champion. Find Wrathion. He may be Ebonhorn\'s only hope.', '', 176259, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 139069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold it together, Ebonhorn! Don\'t give in tae them!', '', 176258, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 139067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voices... I can\'t...', '', 176257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 139080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, it is time for you to die. Do not despair, for I shall ensure your allies meet the same fate.', '', 176256, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! I know fully well how to reverse your little spells. When I return, you will be reduced to cinders.', '', 176255, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! The brew has come to life! Quick, down a drink and throw the empty mug to capture them!', '', 176252, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unauthorized containers detected.', 'Unauthorized containers detected.', 176250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Immediate examination of contents required.', 'Immediate examination of contents required.', 176249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spooky dark calls!', '', 176248, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more spooky juju!', '', 176247, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The slickies always watchin\' you...', '', 176246, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the slicky said...', '', 176245, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready to be slap-slapped, wikket!', '', 176244, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jib in the snibbets!', '', 176243, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slicky said to give it to you!', '', 176242, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna ook ya, silly wikket!', '', 176241, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to give Jani the Trashmaster\'s Mantle? Doing so will remove the item.', 'Do you want to give Jani the Trashmaster\'s Mantle? Doing so will remove the item.', 176240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r (Give Jani the Trashmaster\'s Mantle).', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r (Give Jani the Trashmaster\'s Mantle).', 176239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My gears will not fail me!', 176238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once Izira is repaired we\'ll begin our resistance anew!', 176237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I continue to be impressed at what you are able to achieve with such inferior mechanization.', 176236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These results are quite a triumph.', 176235, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does it eat at you, knowing you are less than what you are meant to be?', 176234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There she is. Now we finish this.', '', 176233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heart Forge activation required.', 176232, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the chowdown, you will be presented with plates of sausage! Eat all the sausage on the plate, but be sure not to choke! If you are about to choke, drink some brew to wash it down.\n\nOnce you\'re done eating all the sausage on a plate, you can call for a new one. The first person to eat ten plates worth of sausage wins!\n\nIf you want to take part, just grab some folks and an open seat!', 176231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I was told you had created something called a... snapdragon. Azshara has shown keen interest in this development. Show me at once!', '', 176230, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I play?', 'How do I play?', 176229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter, they probably all drowned when the city went shell-down.', '', 176228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Experiment recklessly! Failures are easy to scrap.', '', 176227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some ancient records I found elsewhere seemed to point towards a wolf population here. I wonder what happened to them...', '', 176226, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to hear about your findings!', '', 176225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AND MORE MECHANOCATS!', '', 176224, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechanocats, mechanocats, mechanocats...', '', 176223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I don\'t think you\'d be interested in ALL of my ideas, but I\'ve got a few you\'ll like.', 176222, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, what an ambitious test subject you are. Here, you may browse my plans for future experiments.', 176221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagine what we could accomplish with a higher voltage generator! So many things, my dear test subject.', '', 176220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, there may be hope for you yet. Thanks for kicking some naga tails with me.', '', 176219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just getting to know you has made me better at helping our people. Thank you!', '', 176218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fighting beside you has shown me a whole new level of teamwork. Thanks for that, $n.', 176217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re gonna free more folk, we\'ll need resources to support our efforts.\n\nIt is not as glamorous as crafting the arms and potions, but without those resources, we may never defeat the naga threat.', '', 176216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those naga think they\'re so smart just because they can make magic stuff, but it isn\'t that hard.\n\nPotions are mashed up plants in a bottle. Jewels are shiny rocks. Inscriptions? Ink and paper!\n\nLemme show ya.', '', 176215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can never rest as long as our brothers and sisters are held captive by the naga.\n\nI learned how they make their armor and weapons, since you\'re helping us out, I\'ll show you what I know.', 176214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You can\'t hammer on things as long as I have and NOT come up with a couple great ideas. Lost the blueprints in the attack, though...', 'You can\'t hammer on things as long as I have and NOT come up with a couple great ideas. Lost the blueprints in the attack, though...', 176213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gravely wounded, let me take care of this.', 'You\'re gravely wounded, let me take care of this.', 176212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, I love idea swaps! I\'ve been mulling over this one concept in particular...', '', 176211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mag\'har refused to drink the blood of N\'Zoth, and were slaughtered for their defiance.', 176210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sapphronetta giggles.>\n\nNo, I don\'t mind at all. Most of my favorite things were made by a goblin.\n\n<Sapphronetta shows you the massive Azerite ring on her finger.>', 176209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aren\'t you uncomfortable working with so many goblins?', 'Aren\'t you uncomfortable working with so many goblins?', 176208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the resistance? Sure thing. Saffy and I were just brainstorming some ideas to improve this place.', '', 176207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate you helpin\' me keep a low profile on the trip over, $n.\n\nNot too happy to find the Horde here, but I\'m at least grateful it\'s Gazlowe.', '', 176206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came over with Gazlowe, right?\n\nHe\'s agreed to \"forget\" that me and Saffy were out here when Gallywix checks in on him.\n\nI know we can trust you to do the same.', '', 176205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around you. This workshop is overflowing with ideas!', 176204, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t throw anything away. Here, take a few of my failed upgrade modules to study.', 176203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n. I can feel the pain of the earth beneath my hooves. I hope we are not too late.', '', 176202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure you are, you horde simpleton. Well, you won\'t get any from me!', '', 176201, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well you came to the right, gnome! I\'ve more ideas than I can prototype. I can spare these.', '', 176200, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must discuss a few matters with Navarrogg, $n. I will meet you in the chamber.', '', 176199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inquisition is important, but do not allow it to delay your practical application. Take some prototypes I\'ve been tinkering with.', '', 176198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not up for discussion. I will not subject you to that torment!', '', 176197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn!', 176196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat it, chump. Ya ain\'t in my crew, so I got nothin\' for you.', '', 176195, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let her go. My children are safe for now.', 176194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ideas are cheap. The hard part is makin\' \'em work! Here, take a few of my latest brainstorm docs.', '', 176193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for new ideas.', 'I\'m looking for new ideas.', 176192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are secret fish hiding all over Azeroth, just most people can\'t see them. I know that sounds crazy, but they do exist!\n\nWearing these Secret Fish Goggles I can see and hear these fish, and if I get near them, I can snatch them right out of the air!', 176191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s always a pair for sale for you.', 176190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'EAT!!!', 176189, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get set...', 176188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On your marks...', 176187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s time for the Brewfest Chowdown!', 176186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the Secret Fish Goggles?', 'What are the Secret Fish Goggles?', 176185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Secret Fish Goggles.', 'I lost my Secret Fish Goggles.', 176184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a very good boy, even if I growl sometimes. Thirteen out of ten, especially loyal to young kings.', '', 176183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re sending the wolf? Well... that\'s all you had to say!', '', 176182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I advise you to let sleeping dogs lie.', '', 176181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust your instincts.', '', 176180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have justice for the fallen.', '', 176179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have endured much.', '', 176178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never let your guard down.', '', 176177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand strong, hero.', '', 176176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilneas will prevail.', '', 176175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance must endure.', '', 176174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n has won the Brewfest Chowdown!', 176173, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May honor guide you.', '', 176172, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my attention.', '', 176171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with courage.', '', 176170, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to our enemies.', '', 176169, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor above all.', '', 176168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara will fall.', '', 176167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at your service.', '', 176166, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our oath is our bond.', '', 176165, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe much to the Alliance.', '', 176164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you require?', '', 176163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my blades.', '', 176162, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I assist you?', '', 176161, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May fate be on your side.', '', 176160, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread lightly amidst the reef.', '', 176159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet again.', '', 176158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our curse is also our greatest gift.', '', 176157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elements be with you.', '', 176156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waters guide you.', '', 176155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For country. For family.', '', 176154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live to serve the elements.', '', 176153, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan will prevail in the end.', '', 176152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just relax and enjoy de flight!', 176151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Smile, it will all be over very soon. Haha!', 176150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not regret it, tiny wingless one!', 176149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This humble farseer greets you.', '', 176148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I assist you?', '', 176147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon sees all.', '', 176146, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move swiftly.', '', 176145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell for now.', '', 176144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, champion.', '', 176143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news do you bring?', '', 176142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I do, I do for Gilneas.', '', 176141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared to place your faith in my wing-claws?\n\n<Pa\'ku grins menacingly down at you.>', 176140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe journey.', '', 176139, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never underestimate your prey.', '', 176138, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, here goes nothing.', 'Well, here goes nothing.', 176137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess?', 'I guess?', 176136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust you.', 'I trust you.', 176135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our hunt continues.', '', 176134, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you seen?', '', 176133, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am listening.', '', 176132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yearn for the hunt.', '', 176131, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you require a tracker?', '', 176130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, traveler.', '', 176129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, there is something I must ask of you.', '', 176128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everywhere you look, the stars gaze back. You know their form already. You have but to listen.', '', 176127, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen. You know this is the truth. It is but one of a thousand. You have only to listen.', '', 176126, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen. She is a threat. Kill her. KILL HER.', '', 176125, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were right to doubt them.', '', 176124, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen. Open the gate. Step into the abyss. Complete the circle.', '', 176123, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The undrowned will join the chorus. Listen to it.', '', 176122, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The queen threatens the king. There is no way to win. Listen.', '', 176121, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen. The Deep beckons. Answer the call.', '', 176120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush or I\'ll un-pirate you!', 176119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t know you had a father, or a family.', '', 176118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen. Listen. Listen. LISTEN.', '', 176117, 0, 70697, 0, 64, 0, 134524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in. Accept the embrace. Listen.', '', 176116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_EARTHQUAKE.BLP:20|t Silivaz is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:301807|h[Zealous Eruption]|h|r!', '', 176114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Merithra, daughter of Ysera, the Dreamer.\n\nI had thought that she would be here forever. Until she wasn\'t.\n\nFor eons my flight has watched over the Dream and the realms of nature. I cannot hide from this duty. Even if I fail, I must try.\n\nThere is too much at stake to do nothing.', 176087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 176081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\ABILITY_HUNTER_MASTERMARKSMAN.BLP:20|t $n has been targeted for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299914|h[Frenetic Charge]|h|r!', '', 176062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust you can make it back to your allies from here, $p.', 176060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quicker! The enemy will not wait for you to take aim at them!', 176059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Again. Faster this time!', 176058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop messing about like a novice!', 176057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Again! The Dark Lady demands perfection--and so do I!', 176056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good effort--but I expect greatness.', 176055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aim through the target!', 176054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your bow steady!', 176053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dark warden unleashes her rage upon the target dummy before her.\n\nPerhaps it would be wise to let her be.>', '<The dark warden unleashes her rage upon the target dummy before her.\n\nPerhaps it would be wise to let her be.>', 176052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Back away, slowly.>', '<Back away, slowly.>', 176051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish here too crunchy.', '', 176050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything\'s running smoothly down here. Ahead of schedule.\n\nYou get what you pay for with the Greasemonkeys, and the pay ain\'t cheap.', '', 176049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s finally time for me to be the one relaxin\' and spendin\' some coin.\n\nThis vacation\'s shapin\' up just fine...', 176048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone\'s got a little Laughing Skull in \'em. Ha ha ha ha!', 176047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve only just come to this realization? \"First Arcanist\" indeed!', 176046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay vigilant, champions! Azshara conceals schemes within schemes. She wants something...', 176045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your essence will be my gift to Him!', '', 176044, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master\'s gaze is upon me!', '', 176043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence here is but a minor distraction, that will soon be eliminated.', '', 176042, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step forth, and be judged in the eyes of invention!', '', 176041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was right, mechanization is the salvation.', '', 176040, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resistance was insufficient. I have been upgraded.', '', 176039, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find another pickaxe, be sure to return to the cove to collect more brinestone.', '', 176038, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find any more chum, be sure to toss it in the water. You never know what will come to the surface.', '', 176037, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ever find another seed, be sure to plant it and reap the rewards!', '', 176036, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Additional information granted.\n\nError. Additional Titan facility detected. Status: Unknown.\n\nRecommendation: Do not approach or engage.', 176028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else did you discover during your calculations?', 'What else did you discover during your calculations?', 176027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings. \n\nChamber of Heart facility has been rehabilitated. Now functioning within operational parameters.', 176026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each bounty and requisition will help the people of this camp. Just talk to me when you finish a job.', 176024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is a lot of requests... How about this, take a few of these requests a day and I will reward you for doing so.', 176022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was the prize for the inaugural Rustbolt Tinkering Competition, crafted by Prince Erazmin himself!\n\nI won the competition, of course, with Pascal-K1N6 as my entry.\n\nChristy and the Quickcharge twins put up a good fight.\n\nI gave them copies of the blueprint, as a sign of respect, but I don\'t think either of them has managed to make one yet.\n\nAs you can see, the prince used top-shelf parts. It\'s not cheap.\n\nI\'ve still got the blueprints for the blowtorch, but I don\'t hand it out to just anyone.', '', 176021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'d you get that blowtorch?', 'Where\'d you get that blowtorch?', 176020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare Parts are the backbone of any construction or crafting project in Mechagon.\n\nSure, you may need an Energy Cell or a specialized component to really get the functionality you need. But, Spare Parts are the glue that hold all those things together and keeps things running.\n\nWhich is good, because you\'ll find Spare Parts everywhere in Mechagon.\n\nYou can hardly walk ten feet without stubbing your toe on something that can be used as Spare Parts.', 'Spare Parts are the backbone of any construction or crafting project in Mechagon.\n\nSure, you may need an Energy Cell or a specialized component to really get the functionality you need. But, Spare Parts are the glue that hold all those things together and keeps things running.\n\nWhich is good, because you\'ll find Spare Parts everywhere in Mechagon.\n\nYou can hardly walk ten feet without stubbing your toe on something that can be used as Spare Parts.', 176019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conversation is like smithing; you have to strike while the irons hot. So... get on with it.', '', 176018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know I\'m a little early! ... For once.\n\nDon\'t you worry, though. There will be more to do soon enough.', 176017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blueprints store the precise technical schematics of an invention, allowing anyone to create that item. Assuming they have sufficient skill to do so, of course.\n\nThankfully for you, I programmed Pascal-K1N6 here with my own genius-level skill in Junkyard Tinkering.\n\nYou can access his database of Blueprints at any time to see what resources are required to make a particular item. Then bring the items to Pascal-K1N6 and he\'ll make it for you, free of charge.\n\nYou can find new Blueprints all across Mechagon. When you do, just bring them back to Pascal-K1N6. He\'ll upload them to his database and you can access them immediately.', '', 176016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Blueprints.', 'Tell me about Blueprints.', 176014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junkyard Tinkering is the fancy title that I invented for the technique that us mechagnomes use to craft things.\n\nLook at us. Look at our town. We\'re resourceful, clever, and we\'re always tinkering with some new invention.\n\nThis is how we convert an Energy Cell and a handful of Spare Parts into a weapon capable of blasting a trogg to dust, or an implant to boost your mental capacities, or a security turret to defend our town.\n\nAll of the gadgets and gizmos we\'ve created came from tinkering out here in the junkyard. And we always document our designs in Blueprints, which Pascal-K1N6 here stores in his database for easy reference.\n\nYou can access any blueprints we\'ve collated right here!', '', 176009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Junkyard Tinkering.', 'Tell me about Junkyard Tinkering.', 176008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soup\'s on!', '', 176003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are low on rations. Kelp buds can provide nutritional needs in a pinch. However, some find the taste... unappealing.', '', 176002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga that way and that way. Hydra that way. Monsters all ways. Need more giants.', '', 176001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need more coneshells. We use them to craft almost all of our armaments. The shells are harder than most metals and lighter too.', '', 176000, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A disappointed growl echoes from the deep.', '', 175999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare Parts are the backbone of any construction or crafting project in Mechagon.\n\nSure, you may need an Energy Cell or a specialized component to really get the functionality you need. But, Spare Parts are the glue that hold all those things together and keeps things running.\n\nWhich is good, because you\'ll find Spare Parts everywhere in Mechagon.\n\nYou can hardly walk ten feet without stubbing your toe on something that can be used as Spare Parts.', '', 175998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll give you all that we have left, but our stores are dangerously low.', 175997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Spare Parts', 'Tell me about Spare Parts', 175995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy Cells are the most valuable resource we have in Mechagon.\n\nThey are large batteries with a universal interface, capable of delivering electrical power to any mechanical device that requires it.\n\nIf you\'re looking to construct or craft something complex, you\'ll likely need at least one Energy Cell to power it.\n\nYou can find Energy Cells almost anywhere on the island, but they are exceptionally rare. When you have them, be sure to use them wisely.\n\nIf you have Empty Energy Cells, you can charge them at the Charging Station to convert them into usable Energy Cells.\n\nThe Quickcharge Twins experiment with Energy Cells often and are always looking for more test subjects. You can ask them for more information.', '', 175994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jonah needs medical supplies for the wounded.', 'Jonah needs medical supplies for the wounded.', 175993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drink Drohn\'s. Drink with honor!', 175992, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ale so good it\'ll straighten your back out! Drohn\'s Distillery!', 175991, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Energy Cells are the most valuable resource we have in Mechagon.\n\nThey are large batteries with a universal interface, capable of delivering electrical power to any mechanical device that requires it.\n\nIf you\'re looking to construct or craft something complex, you\'ll likely need at least one Energy Cell to power it.\n\nYou can find Energy Cells almost anywhere on the island, but they are exceptionally rare. When you have them, be sure to use them wisely.\n\nIf you have Empty Energy Cells, you can charge them at a Charging Station to convert them into usable Energy Cells.', 175990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drohn\'s Distillery ale puts the thunder in your blood!', 175989, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! Claim victory!', '', 175988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such strange power held within that weapon...', '', 175980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, a fight!', '', 175979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must fight our way out.', '', 175978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here. I can sense that this is where we need to be.', '', 175977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense danger ahead. Be prepared for combat.', '', 175976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be cautious. We do not know what awaits us within.', '', 175975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unconventional approach. Let us hope for its success.', '', 175974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must we disguise ourselves? I would gladly face the naga head on.', '', 175973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suffer this indignity for the sake of my clan.', '', 175972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a singular purpose in your muscles: to fight, to kill, to stand triumphant in battle.\n\nWe can improve those muscles to make them better at such things, or replace them entirely.\n\nSome warriors I\'ve spoken with were unwilling to give up the pain and bloodrush that comes with feeling every blow received in battle. I hope you will consider my counsel to the contrary.\n\nYou should replace your limbs with mechanical versions that are superior in every way. Any emotional responses you lose while in battle can then be simulated with artificial stimulants.', '', 175970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that you\'re willing to go to any length to acquire the power you crave. You must be careful where that urge leads you. I\'ve seen it lead to pain and misery in my father.\n\nBut, in the realm of self-modification, your unwavering will is a boon. Others resist the benefits of mechanization out of fear or misunderstanding. You will not.\n\nI will not feign to know what powerful upgrades you are already considering. I\'m certain you already have some in mind.\n\nInstead, I will caution you against going too far. Do not lose yourself in the machine. Take it slow.\n\nGreater men and women than you have fallen prey to its lure.', '', 175969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every shaman I\'ve ever met has a favorite element... even if they won\'t admit it.\n\nYou require more lightning? Stuff your arms with a variety of metal gadgets to make them perfect, efficient conduits of that electricity!\n\nMore interested in lava? Perhaps try internal forges that\'ll keep you fueled up and ready to unleash molten rock at anything that moves.\n\nWater is easy. Most people are made of the compound. We\'ve created pumps that tap right into that personal reservoir when you need it most!', '', 175968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re quiet, certainly. But you are not my-new-feet-are-made-of-material-that-absorbs-all-sound-even-ones-that-my-feet-produce quiet.\n\nMaybe you\'re less worried about hiding, though? You could also embed extra daggers wherever your hands can reach on your body, for easy access during combat.\n\nDon\'t poison them before you embed them, though. Takron, you fool...', '', 175967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who does da voodoo? T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brew do!', 175966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ya wanna be livin\' life to da fullest, ya gotta try T\'chali\'s Voodoo Brew!', 175965, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'T\'chali\'s Voodoo got a brew dat won\' kill ya... but also one dat might!', 175964, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All dreams... made real...', '', 175963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zin-Azshari was once the center of all magical knowledge. The key to wresting control of the Tidestone must lie amidst the ruins.', 175962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know. So long as it remains in her clutches, we have little hope of victory.', 175961, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 135635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shandris. We sealed off Suramar to keep the Pillars of Creation free from Azshara\'s grasp. The power she holds with just the Tidestone...', 175960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You see? We have found common ground already. Dear children, it is only a matter of time until you kneel before my throne. As a willing subject... or a broken corpse.', 175959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara. Rest assured that we stand united in our contempt for you.', 175958, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 135634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It breaks a queen\'s heart to watch her subjects squabble. Such a futile argument. In the end, you will all be mine again--one way or another.', 175957, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar rebelled against Azshara. Were it not for our courage, the Legion\'s forces would have overwhelmed Azeroth.', 175956, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here to admire the Highborne\'s handiwork, Thalyssra? To look upon all that your hubris has wrought?', 175955, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart... your offering...', '', 175954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empty Energy Cells are just Energy Cells that have been drained of all their electricity.\n\nThey aren\'t good for anything other than getting recharged at the charging station. Then they can be used in any project that requires charged Energy Cells.\n\nYou can find Empty Energy Cells almost anywhere in Mechagon, but you\'ll have to wait until the charging station construction project is available to recharge them.', 'Empty Energy Cells are just Energy Cells that have been drained of all their electricity.\n\nThey aren\'t good for anything other than getting recharged at the charging station. Then they can be used in any project that requires charged Energy Cells.\n\nYou can find Empty Energy Cells almost anywhere in Mechagon, but you\'ll have to wait until the charging station construction project is available to recharge them.', 175953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fates... are one...', '', 175952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Empty Energy Cells.', 'Tell me about Empty Energy Cells.', 175951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy Cells are the most valuable resource we have in Mechagon.\n\nThey are large batteries with a universal interface, capable of delivering electrical power to any mechanical device that requires it.\n\nIf you\'re looking to construct or craft something complex, you\'ll likely need at least one Energy Cell to power it.\n\nYou can find Energy Cells almost anywhere on the island, but they are exceptionally rare. When you have them, be sure to use them wisely.\n\nIf you have Empty Energy Cells, you can charge them at the Charging Station to convert them into usable Energy Cells.\n\nThe Quickcharge Twins experiment with Energy Cells often and are always looking for more test subjects. You can ask them for more information.', 'Energy Cells are the most valuable resource we have in Mechagon.\n\nThey are large batteries with a universal interface, capable of delivering electrical power to any mechanical device that requires it.\n\nIf you\'re looking to construct or craft something complex, you\'ll likely need at least one Energy Cell to power it.\n\nYou can find Energy Cells almost anywhere on the island, but they are exceptionally rare. When you have them, be sure to use them wisely.\n\nIf you have Empty Energy Cells, you can charge them at the Charging Station to convert them into usable Energy Cells.\n\nThe Quickcharge Twins experiment with Energy Cells often and are always looking for more test subjects. You can ask them for more information.', 175950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Energy Cells.', 'Tell me about Energy Cells.', 175949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The charging station is a large construction project occasionally found in Bondo\'s Yard.\n\nIt\'s the only device that can recharge Empty Energy Cells, converting them into usable Energy Cells.\n\nBe careful, though. Charging stations are noisy and will attract the attention of nearby troggs who may wish to interfere with you.\n\nYou can always ask Waren Gearhart in town if the charging station, or any other particular construction project, is available today. Or just run by Bondo\'s Yard and check for yourself.\n\nIf the charging station is not available, it should be available within a few days.', 'The charging station is a large construction project occasionally found in Bondo\'s Yard.\n\nIt\'s the only device that can recharge Empty Energy Cells, converting them into usable Energy Cells.\n\nBe careful, though. Charging stations are noisy and will attract the attention of nearby troggs who may wish to interfere with you.\n\nYou can always ask Waren Gearhart in town if the charging station, or any other particular construction project, is available today. Or just run by Bondo\'s Yard and check for yourself.\n\nIf the charging station is not available, it should be available within a few days.', 175948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Charging Station.', 'Tell me about the Charging Station.', 175947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga and their vile magic are to blame.', '', 175946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are safe now.', '', 175945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, Adaru.', '', 175944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, find refuge.', '', 175943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fate worse than death.', '', 175942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga will pay for what they have done.', '', 175941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be explained in time.', '', 175940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We understand. You are not to blame for your actions.', '', 175939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will recover in time, Adaru.', '', 175938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None of you will escape these halls!', '', 175937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, Alliance filth!', '', 175936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, traitors!', '', 175935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Defend our mages!', '', 175934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not succeed!', '', 175933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel their spell weakening. We need to take down all four crystals!', 175932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! I\'ll bring down the shield from this one next!', 175931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll disrupt the shields protecting those mages. You destroy the focus crystals!', 175930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All truths... revealed...', '', 175929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All paths... open...', '', 175928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Closer... closer...', '', 175927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your eyes... open...', '', 175926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The breaker of chains... comes...', '', 175925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide... rises...', '', 175924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nWell, your body is clearly resilient to even EXIST in its current state.\n\nIt also appears to be resistant to, or at least extremely compatible with, infections of all types.\n\nI\'d recommend pursuing our most invasive surgical options.\n\nMost test subjects would not survive them, but I\'d give you above average odds!', 175923, 0, 47453, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully, poking you with a sharp needle.>\n\nNow you are an interesting case, my dear test subject...\n\nI recommend against full limb replacement due to your rapid regeneration. Who knows what would happen.\n\nBesides, your unique biological capability can be leveraged in a more efficient manner.\n\nYou should pursue a surgical plan that accounts for near-constant upgrade procedures. You can modify yourself every morning to fit the specific needs of the day!\n\nMost other races could not withstand such a taxing biological demand, but your body appears to be built for it.', 175922, 0, 70319, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully from head to hoof.>\n\nImpressive physique... Sturdy balance... Efficient gait...\n\nNature did pretty well with you.\n\nBut let\'s talk about those horns... Frankly, they look ridiculous, and I doubt they serve any real purpose.\n\nI recommend immediately replacing them with antennae receivers or retractable gliders. Your choice.', 175921, 0, 34467, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nThere\'s sufficient room in those shoulders for embedded modules...\n\nNo, maybe we should scale back the shoulders and enhance the spine further...\n\nHave you ever wanted to be taller than a Tauren? I think we might be able to pull it off if you\'re open to copious amounts of skin grafts and extended physical therapy.\n\nDon\'t worry, we won\'t copy the Tauren horns. We\'ll embed retractable power coils instead!', 175920, 0, 34464, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This written study is dull! Come, let us engage in some \"practical\" education.', '', 175919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are low on rations. Kelp buds can provide nutritional needs in a pinch. However, some find the taste... unappealing.', '', 175917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you require?', '', 175916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows hold endless secrets. The Light is blind to them.', '', 175915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept my gift. Let all truths be revealed.', '', 175914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need more coneshells. We use them to craft almost all of our armaments. The shells are harder than most metals and lighter too.', '', 175913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna go first?', '', 175912, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s our cue to leave!', '', 175911, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, how do I look?', '', 175910, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.', '', 175909, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no, I knew something bad would happen!', '', 175908, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just hope we can get used to the smell.', '', 175907, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This must be the place.', 175906, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we get to fight our way out of here!', 175905, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this disguise really necessary?', 175904, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll be okay... right?', '', 175903, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, Esma. You\'re safe now.', '', 175902, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, now use them to get out of here!', '', 175901, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Probably best not to think about it...', '', 175900, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What did they do to you, Kono?', 175899, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga will pay for what they\'ve done.', 175898, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, that\'s not how it happened. Let\'s start over.', 175897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I just love strolling down the timeways. Thank you for all of the memories!', 175896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I need? I need reinforcements on almost all fronts. We are losing men to naga, murlocs, hydras, and all manner of creature here.', '', 175895, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need?', 'What do you need?', 175890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask me for the Bot Re-Energizer anytime you need it!', '', 175888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get somewhere safe, Fenn.', '', 175887, 0, 70298, 0, 64, 0, 134315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be fine, Fenn.', '', 175886, 0, 70297, 0, 64, 0, 133789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, soldier?', '', 175885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Fenn... what have they done to you?', 175883, 0, 70296, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
