('Poen Gillbrack pieces together a |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_Legion_seashellA4.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299776|h[Barnacled Charm]|h|r.', 'Poen Gillbrack pieces together a |TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_Legion_seashellA4.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:299776|h[Barnacled Charm]|h|r.', 175880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
