('Hello World', '', 175838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come to take the fight to the naga!', '', 175837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pathetic dragonflights will fall. If you will not serve the master, then I will find one who will!', 175836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not possible! I just need... more power!', 175835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corastrasza will carry you back to Silithus. I will meet you there.', 175834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you seek to empower the Heart of Azeroth. You have more than earned my support.', 175833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is but one way this can end, $n. Prepare for a fight.', '', 175832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give you all that we have left, but our stores are dangerously low.', '', 175831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you resist, sister? Do you not see the grand destiny that awaits our kind?', 175830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power you were promised will not protect you from me!', 175829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s escaping! Quickly, we must chase her down!', '', 175828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza and I will focus on Vexiona. Do what you can to save the captives!', '', 175827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not my sister.', 175826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold the future of all dragonflights. United as one. You will see the truth as I have, sister.', 175825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are they doing to my children?!', 175824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never!', 175823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life-Binder. Give in to the whispers. Join us and you will be granted power beyond measure.', 175822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This battle is far from over. I can sense their leader drawing near.', 175821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A disapproving growl rumbles up from the deep.', '', 175820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
