('Lady Narjiss is a cunning adversary. She should not be underestimated.', '', 175754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander Sarj\'eth has earned a vile reputation among my people. We may find him formidable.', '', 175753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This chest is protected by the power of the Void. Proceed with caution, $c.', '', 175752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we may treasure our memories, some are best left forgotten.', '', 175751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
