('Potent magic resides within these pearls. They may prove useful against the naga.', '', 175749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crab hunting? In my clan, such chores are given to the children.', '', 175748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braxicus has crushed many within her claws. We will take them as a trophy!', '', 175747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emorneth has been terrorizing the area. We are stalking dangerous prey.', '', 175746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
