('No witnesses!', '', 175734, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot abide weakness!', 175733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good.', '', 175732, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That would be correct, General.', 175731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very impressive indeed. I assume you have kept notes on this research?', '', 175730, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies. Right away.', 175729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough talking. Do you dare waste the Queen\'s time?', '', 175728, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, of course. I think Azshara will be very pleased with what you report.', 175727, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me.', '', 175726, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should not leave the makrura to suffer at the hands of the naga. Let us free them.', '', 175725, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without further ado... The stage is set, the hour is at hand. Legions arise! Serve your queen\'s command!', 175724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The resistance is always in need of resources. You can aid us by locating mechanized chests across the island.', '', 175723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to be blunt, your existence here is quite suspect!\n\nEither you are an agent of King Mechagon, or you have impressive mechanization that I am unaware of. \n\nEither way, I will be watching you very closely.', 175722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a fully mechanized boy!', '', 175721, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check out Bondo Bigblock version 2.0.', '', 175720, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I expected you to be dead.', '', 175719, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 175718, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A hologram of King Mechagon appeared in the middle of Rustbolt declaring victory. Then he activated the Mechoriginator. \n\nThere was a large blast...fire and panic everywhere!\n\nMost of us were O.K, but those without mechanization were not so lucky.', 175717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clockwork giants and spiders began attacking Rustbolt soon after the blast. We all fought the bots till our gears gave out. \n\nMy legs broke and I was unable to protect Prince Erazmin. He was taken prisoner. \n\nI think King Mechagon wanted him alive.', 175716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it reverse the curse of flesh?', 'Did it reverse the curse of flesh?', 175715, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s Prince Erazmin?', 'Where\'s Prince Erazmin?', 175714, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe his research was corrupted, his device flawed.  It didn\'t reverse the curse of flesh as Mechagon planned.\n\nIt ignited the skies and burned the flesh off most every living thing. Those of us mechanized enough survived.', 175713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are all gone. King Mechagon won, he activated the Mechoriginator.\n\nEveryone is gone.', 175712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rustbolt faces countless enemies, but it is reassuring that their numbers have been reduced. Thank you.', '', 175711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This island is home to a multitude of dangers. Help us secure a perimeter by eliminating the most immediate threats.', '', 175710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go back to Nazjatar.', 'I am ready to go back to Nazjatar.', 175709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will prepare. Speak with Admiral Jes--Tereth when you are ready to return to Nazjatar.', 175708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
