('The naga messed with the wrong guy, and I\'ll make sure they know it.', '', 175683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on, pal!', '', 175682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting to feel a little stronger. Let me at \'em.', '', 175681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I see the naga, they\'re in for a world of hurt.', '', 175680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] The abyss trembles!', '', 175679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'re making me angry!', '', 175678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught in the undertow!', '', 175677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] It is time to come together!', '', 175676, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such wonderful gifts the ocean gives!', '', 175675, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ocean power!', '', 175674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The judgment of the tides be upon you! [dnt]', '', 175673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides will save us!', '', 175672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! The ocean has granted me strength!', '', 175671, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we\'re both getting stronger, huh?', 175670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! Get away from that!', 175669, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, yeah! The naga are in for it now.', 175668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oculeth has devised a method to detect trace amounts of Azerite. Provide him with whatever he needs to do so.', '', 175667, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we can determine where they are being stored, we can seize them for ourselves and arm our allies.', '', 175666, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is safe to assume that the naga are maintaining an arsenal of these weapons.', '', 175665, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and me, together we\'re unstoppable!', 175664, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one\'s gonna hurt!', 175663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too slow!', 175662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cut deep!', 175661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m getting pretty good at this. Let\'s take on more of the naga!', 175660, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one is on the fritz... I can\'t hear a thing. Stupid elven trinkets...', '', 175659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on... blasted thing.', '', 175658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve certainly made themselves at home, haven\'t they?\n\nNow then. I\'m sure you have questions. Ol\' Barry here is happy to answer!\n\nWhat can I help you with?', '', 175657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just let me do the talking, stranger! I have a knack for this sort of thing.\n\n<Barry winks at you.>', '', 175656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder where they\'ve come from? A hive of bees this big isn\'t likely to be very well hidden.', '', 175655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Brush the bees off of him.>', '<Brush the bees off of him.>', 175654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gesture uncertainly toward all of him.>', '<Gesture uncertainly toward all of him.>', 175652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, sure?', 'Uh, sure?', 175649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem to be covered in bees.', 'You seem to be covered in bees.', 175648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t get stung, did you?\n\nBoy, I\'ve met some aggressive bugs in my life, but this new hive really doesn\'t seem to trust newcomers.\n\nWonder if there\'s a way to fix that?\n\n<Barry strokes his beard in thought.>', '', 175647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some people like dogs, or cats, or horses.\n\nMe? I like bees.\n\nShame about that allergy, though.', '', 175646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander Wyrmbane, given my history and knowledge, I would be invaluable to our forces in Nazjatar.', 175645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds like an excellent idea. We will be ready, when our forces are needed.', '', 175644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is dire news you carry, $p. We couldn\'t afford more losses to the fleet, but even that news is overshadowed by news of Queen Azshara.', '', 175643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now we have a link to Boralus. Take my message to Halford Wyrmbane.', 175642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Queen Azshara might block my spells when she is here, but these devices allow us to overcome that.', 175641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, here it is.', 175640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These buildings have existed for millennia. We are fortunate, as this means there are ancient mechanisms that allow for stable portals.', 175639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zin-Azshari was once the capital of the night elves\' empire.', 175638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Distress message received! Gear Checker Cogstar backing up target area.', '', 175637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... Unit defeated... request immediate support... Szzt.', 'Bzzt... Unit defeated... request immediate support... Szzt.', 175636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No life is too small to save. Your deeds are those of a true hero.', '', 175635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll make sure this little guy ends up somewhere safe. Thanks for rescuing him.', 175634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor demands that we aid the weak in their time of need. We must rescue this creature.', '', 175633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That poor critter\'s scared to death! Get him to safety!', 175632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we can locate their cache, we can strip them of their arsenal and arm our own forces.', 175631, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 133987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s safe to assume that the naga are keeping a stockpile of these weapons somewhere nearby.', 175630, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 133986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is so much darkness behind this place... my stomach hurts when I am here.', '', 175629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] Your ships don\'t seem to move so well. They sure do provide some neat stuff when you send them down to us though!', '', 175628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hugged Mak so hard when I got back to Newhome.', '', 175627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I helped a little elf girl find her doll here, once. It made her so happy, even though there was so little of it left.', '', 175626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May you swim in calm waters.', 175625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is one of my favorite spots! I always keep snacks in my pocket! It works out great for everyone!', '', 175624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] She is the one that discovered this pool! Fresh water somehow mixes into the ocean water in this one part of Nazjatar, and that gives the meat a totally new flavor.', '', 175623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sardina is so brave, surrounded by monsters, here alone... [dnt]', '', 175622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever swooped on a ray? It\'s out-ray-geous!', '', 175621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] Helping Ian is always such fun!', '', 175620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dani is great! She wrangles all of our snapdragons, even the most difficult and ornery ones.', '', 175619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think water elementals ever get thirsty?', '', 175618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are lovely. Sometimes, doing something nice for a friend is what it\'s all about.', '', 175617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This \"garden\" harvests nothing but pain. The ancients, and other creatures here, deserve better.', '', 175616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That information isn\'t mine to give at this time.\n\nNow go, before your chattering gets the attention of every naga in this place.', '', 175615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a wee sprog, I was told that the Shirakess created our nightmares. I thought that was a myth... until I saw this place for myself.', '', 175614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes on the road. It is not safe to linger here.', '', 175613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Nazjatar begins!', 'The Battle for Nazjatar begins!', 175612, 0, 72103, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You appear to be malfunctioning. Please correct your output.', '', 175611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aAlathir Spire has been captured by the Horde!', '', 175610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adapt. Improve. Overcome.', '', 175609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be efficient.', '', 175608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Define your own parameters.', '', 175607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing is ever truly finished.', '', 175606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Have you considered an upgrade?', '', 175605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody\'s perfect.', '', 175604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The resistance stands strong.', '', 175603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proceed with your inquiry.', '', 175602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up, and you better hope you get hazard pay.', '', 175601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where there\'s risk, there\'s reward.', '', 175600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Business is booming.', '', 175599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lemme know if you need a crew.', '', 175598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plenty more where that came from.', '', 175597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got a contract with your name on it.', '', 175596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You buyin\' or sellin\'?', '', 175595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only deal with the best.', '', 175594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, lookin\' for work?', '', 175593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Erm... of course. Right this way...', 175592, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeesh.', '', 175591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And Azshara is anything but brave.', '', 175589, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, mage! I am here for results... not pleasantries.', '', 175588, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s brave to sacrifice yourself to save others. It\'s craven to sacrifice others to serve yourself.', '', 175587, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That thing has caused us a lot of trouble. But getting rid of it now wouldn\'t do us too much good, would it?', '', 175586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice to meet you, General Huxzar.', 175585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara has requested that I formulate new... creations.', 175584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may need to discuss the seafaring... uh... skills... of your people on of these days.', '', 175583, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One person\'s pride destroyed so many lives.', '', 175582, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara\'s advisor will be visiting soon. Make haste or she will have our heads!', 175581, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Students, round up as many of the local wolves as you can at once!', 175580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer for your insolence!', 175579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would not let them take you. Not before you have fulfilled your destiny.', 175578, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contain yourself, human. Show faith in your queen.', 175577, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot leave me here to die! We had a deal!', 175576, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AZSHARA!', 175575, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara!', 175574, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave now and I will call off the assault.', 175573, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is your last warning! I can still offer you mercy.', 175572, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You face far greater forces than you know.', 175571, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 133684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, landwalker!', 175570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None may approach!', 175569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Although, I worry about creations we cannot control.', 175568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wolves to the north may prove to be suitable hosts...', 175567, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must be nice, not having anything better to do.', '', 175566, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya around, pal.', '', 175565, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy!', '', 175564, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all got work to do.', '', 175563, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] This is a serviceable cave. Hidden.', '', 175562, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, get going.', '', 175561, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ya workin\' on?', '', 175560, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could always use a hand.', '', 175559, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How ya doin\'?', '', 175558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' on your mind?', '', 175557, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How\'s it going?', 175556, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me tell ya, sea giants throw the best parties.', '', 175555, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you really don\'t want to be doing that.', 175554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to stay out of trouble.', 175553, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If these scales can help keep our people safe, then they\'re worth the effort.', '', 175552, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be good, do good!', 175551, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get out there and make a difference!', 175550, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, you just gave me an idea!', 175549, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ABC - Always Be Creating!', 175548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t always be around to protect Newhome.', '', 175547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] Ha! I love that even the sponges hate the naga.', '', 175546, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lovely to see you!', 175545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wanna help me test something?', 175544, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These snakes will go to any length to feel powerful... usually by hurting the helpless.', '', 175543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_SPEAR_02.BLP:20|t $n has been targeted for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:295607|h[Toxic Bolt]|h|r!', 175542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_POLEARM_2H_MISC_SPEARFISHINGROD.BLP:20|t $n has been targeted for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:295606|h[Frost Bolt]|h|r!', 175541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have given all they are to the dark one. [dnt]', '', 175540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what to do when fighting soldiers, but these Shirakess creep me out.', '', 175539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What choice would I have made... to save our people?', 175538, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] You\'re braver than I thought.', 175534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You came in one of those?', 175533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be a stranger.', 175531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See ya, hun.', 175530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Some of the Highborne chose death over corruption. They ended up trapped here anyway.', 175529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Highborne chose death over serving Azshara, but ended up trapped here anyway. Such a sad place...', 175528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] He said, \"you always keep something in your pocket the enemy won\'t expect\".', 175527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, ain\'t you a sassy lil\' sprocket?', 175526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, I was done anyway.', 175525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like this place? Vim named it. He thinks you should always keep something in your pocket that the enemy won\'t expect.', 175524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
