('Are you waiting for the ocean to return to Nazjatar?', '', 175350, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 134319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ocean provides for us. We take what we find and put it to use. Might not always be pretty, but it gets the job done.', 175349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nazjatar will be your grave!', 175348, 0, 72372, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I... cannot fail... my queen....', 175347, 0, 72372, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not need the Tidestone\'s power to defeat you! I am the queen\'s champion!', 175346, 0, 72372, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impudent wretches! You shall all drown!', 175345, 0, 72372, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My queen... forgive... me...', 175344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 132176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Queen Azshara has chosen me! I will slay you in her name!', 175343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will hear the song!', 'You will hear the song!', 175342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134177, 134178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voices! Make them stop!', 'The voices! Make them stop!', 175341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134175, 134176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear the whispers. You will submit!', '', 175340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The song... so beautiful.... You must hear it!', '', 175339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... cannot hear them.', '', 175338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... cannot... hear them...', 175337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The song... you will hear it!', 175336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Submit to the whispers!', 175335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aAlathir Spire has been captured by the Alliance!', '', 175334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, a titan\'s heart was exactly what was needed. Not to heal the world... but to shatter the prison of a god.', 175325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Coax the power from these ancient wards! Rattle the chains that bind him!', 175322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their eyes long for one another, yet their gaze incurs calamity.', 175321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, heroes. Prove yourselves worthy. Find me... in the circle of stars.', 175318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now is that any way to repay me for my generosity? For the privilege I have seen fit to grant you?', 175317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Liar!', 175316, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 132532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That human novice, and the pale elf with the sword. Ah well... acceptable losses.', 175315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done! It is so rare for mortals to exceed my expectations. If only your friends had been as capable.', 175314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to warn the others! We must end this, champions... now!', 175313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara wants us to see this. Why? Surely she knows we would never let that monster free!', 175311, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 132528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Out there... titan pillars. And chains descending into darkness...', 175310, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 132527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N\'Zoth rises once more.', '', 175308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The locks weaken. The world screams.', '', 175307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is... a presence here. Tendrils strangling my mind...', 175306, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 132526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show such heart! Preparations are nearly complete. I await your arrival below.', 175305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough games, Azshara! This shall be the final day of your twisted reign!', 175304, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 132524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps he was right after all. You do show great potential.', 175303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should be cross over your brutal attacks upon my underlings, but... I must admit, you provide splendid entertainment.', 175302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow these creatures to hatch. They will overrun the surface!', 175300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, good. You arrived just in time to welcome these little ones into my service.', 175299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You asked to be powerful, Priscilla. Consider our bargain complete.', 175296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Not like this! What are you doing to me?!', 175295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance... Horde... fools, every one! Fighting each other, blind to the true powers at play. But you\'ll learn soon enough.', 175292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The barrier has fallen! Let us see how brave Ashvane is without a magical shield to protect her.', 175289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sooner we do so, the better our chances of foiling Azshara\'s mad scheme.', 175288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! Now to find the last font and destroy it.', 175287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara will not have left it unguarded.', 175286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magic\'s source is nearby, but proceed carefully.', 175285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike that monstrosity down, champions! We must stop the flow of energy from this chamber!', 175284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we disrupt the flow of those channels, Ashvane\'s barrier will fall.', 175283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashvane means to hold us at bay. But I can sense fonts of magic close by that are feeding into this room.', 175282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... the ones who thwarted my plans in Boralus. But no matter. A new path now lies before me.', 175280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I intend to. I merely wanted our guests to bear witness to your glorious ascension.', 175278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We had a deal, Azshara! Give me the power you promised!', 175276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderbrew and Barleybrew representatives are on their way!  The \"Tapping of the Keg\" ceremony will begin shortly!', '', 175275, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your screams will echo throughout these walls!', 175274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A loud hiss echoes throughout the tunnels.', 'A loud hiss echoes throughout the tunnels.', 175273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for your disruption!', 175272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick.', '', 175271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?', '', 175270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better be important.', '', 175269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work!', '', 175268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of my sight, drudge!', '', 175267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, not her. Something even more ancient.', 175262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you still standing there?', '', 175261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara. Even before her transformation, she had a way of bending subjects to her desires.', 175259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In just 10 minutes, the Thunderbrews and Barleybrews will tap the Brewfest Keg!', '', 175258, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Zharessa has spotted you!', 'Lady Zharessa has spotted you!', 175257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you in the city. Never did I expect to walk its streets again...', 175256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our best hope of reaching the Tidestone must lie amidst the ruins of Zin-Azshari. Good luck.', '', 175255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah look, you managed to keep your limbs!', '', 175254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In 20 minutes, the Thunderbrews and Barleybrews will tap the Brewfest Keg!', '', 175253, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TO BREWFEST!', 175252, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your glasses!', '', 175251, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Ahem* ...so that WE can tap the keg!', '', 175250, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So now, let us celebrate by starting the countdown so I can tap the keg!', '', 175249, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Brewfest is a time to celebrate our crafters, our everyday heroes, who make us great food and drink to enjoy!', '', 175248, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So often we laud the accomplishments of our heroes, who protect us from those who wish to hurt us.', 175247, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...my family has been honored to lead in celebration of our favorite thing in the world. Brew!', '', 175246, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah, not this again!', 175245, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, ever since my father Grimbooze Thunderbrew founded this festival...', '', 175244, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you all for joining us! Brewfest is my favorite time of the year, and it is an honor to lead you for the ceremonial tapping of the keg.', 175243, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yourself, Marleth. I\'m not gonna push you off the stage!', '', 175242, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ach, Thunderbrew. You best be playing nice up there. We don\'t want a repeat of rehearsal.', 175241, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s hard to imagine what we\'ll do once we don\'t have to fight to survive. I look forward to figuring that out.', 175240, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stand against me, insect.', 175239, 0, 72372, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready to see what all this fancy tech actually does?', '', 175238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A dark presence lurks within this palace, twisting everything it touches.', 175237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Patience, little one. We will be together soon enough.', 175235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of these games, Azshara. Face us!', 175234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good you survived. I would hate for our gathering to end prematurely.', 175232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck... to all of us.', 175230, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 132495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with our champions. Help them find her.', '', 175229, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 132494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris, Thalyssra, you know better than anyone what Azshara is capable of.', '', 175228, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 132493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can keep the brunt of her forces engaged here while our champions pursue Azshara.', 175227, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 132492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be wary. It moves slowly, but if you tarry for too long, it will find you!', 175226, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tarragrue? I hoped you would get deeper into the Maw before that beast caught your scent.', 175225, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have been repelled for now, but more are sure to come.', '', 175217, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 132491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.blp:20|t %s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298718|h[Mega Taze]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.blp:20|t %s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298718|h[Mega Taze]|h|r!', 175216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Her antennae twitch toward you curiously.>\n\nBzzz?', '', 175214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The nascent bee twitches eagerly within its honeycomb.>', '', 175213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The bee larva wiggles occasionally within its honeycomb.>', '', 175212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smashing is good. You should try it!', '', 175211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gaze upon true devotion, landwalkers! Behold the rage of a queen!', 175208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, my queen. I sacrifice all that I am to serve you!', 175205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual has begun! We all have our parts to play. Isn\'t that so, my child?', 175203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer and perish!', 175202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the storm\'s wrath!', 175201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers! Kill them all! FOR THE SUNREAVERS!', '', 175200, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You will watch your friends die--just as I did!', '', 175199, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then your vendetta is with me, and me alone!', 175198, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 131935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you forgotten the purge of Dalaran, murderer?  Today, the Sunreavers will be avenged.', '', 175197, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no quarrel with you.', 175196, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 131934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed she did, traitor. You and Lady Proudmoore.', '', 175195, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This feels wrong. Sylvanas must have known we were coming.', '', 175194, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These chains are warded against magic. I\'ll need time to pick the lock.', '', 175193, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th--Thrall? Jaina?', '', 175192, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine!', '', 175191, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to decrypt the schematic.', 'I am ready to decrypt the schematic.', 175190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! That catapult is a problem. We need to deal with it.', '', 175189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. We must avoid the main army.', '', 175188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I expected you might be here.', 175187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to return to my own timeline.', 'I wish to return to my own timeline.', 175186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to travel to the other place.', 'I am ready to travel to the other place.', 175185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no time like the present to start saving the future!', 175184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of our warriors have fallen to that fiend. I thank you on their behalf.', '', 175183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fewer minion for Azshara to pit against us. Well fought, champion.', 175182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware, $p. That creature\'s meek appearance belies its deadly strength. Strike it down with all of your might.', '', 175181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something nearby is channeling a massive amount of arcane energy. We must strike it down while we still have the chance.', 175180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! Our victory brings honor to our clan, and tribute to Neptulon.', '', 175179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought, $p. We will never yield to Azshara, no matter how many monsters she pits against us.', '', 175178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon grants us a chance to prove our worth. We shall slay this monster in the Tidehunter\'s name.', '', 175177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have summoned an enormous beast from the depths. Slay it before it can reach our encampment!', '', 175176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would give my life to save Rustbolt.', 175175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Upgraded! It appears to be compatible with Mechagon modules, if you can find any.', 175174, 0, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sentries said there was a mechanocrawler on the fritz outside Junkwatt Depot today. Should have what you need.', 175173, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could still use an upgrade, of course.', 175172, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s quite the hardware you\'ve got tucked in your bags there, $r...', 175171, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So take your time and have fun, my fleshy friend!', '', 175170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My superior components render me physically incapable of aging. I will outlive you all.', '', 175169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stress about it. We\'re not going anywhere!', '', 175168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may take you a while to find other blueprints.', '', 175167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were successful in rescuing Baine. We had unexpected assistance from the Alliance. Proudmoore and Shaw showed up to save him as well.', 'We were successful in rescuing Baine. We had unexpected assistance from the Alliance. Proudmoore and Shaw showed up to save him as well.', 175166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach, so we may discuss your intentions.', '', 175165, 0, 0, 44, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is still much work to be done, $n.', '', 175164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat be enough for now. Better to lose one battle and fight anotha\' day. We still be havin\' much ta do here.', '', 175161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work, $p. We be gainin\' ground in Nazjatar thanks to ya efforts.', '', 175160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere be one nasty Alliance soldier huntin\' our warriors. Go out dere and give dem some payback.', '', 175159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some supplies for ya. Pick \'em up from da drop zones on ya map.', '', 175158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Alliance be here in force, mon. Watch yaself. No tellin\' when and where dey gonna strike.', '', 175157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna mark some key locations around da area. Keep hold of dem, no matter what ya gotta do.', '', 175156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear there are a few final details that require my attention. Until I return, my servants will keep you... entertained.', 175155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another perfect creation!', '', 175154, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to my Eternal Palace, honored guests. Our festivities can finally commence.', 175153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, Nazjatar be a dangerous place. We best be gettin\' it under Horde control.', '', 175152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scrap Grenades are Explosives.', '', 175151, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a look through all the blueprints I\'ve programmed into Pascal-K1N6.', '', 175150, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Alliance druids be bringin\' an ancient of war into battle. We gotta take it down. Now!', '', 175149, 0, 36348, 0, 64, 0, 131906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our shamans be summonin\' a mighty elemental ta fight beside us. Da Alliance don\'t stand a chance!', '', 175148, 0, 36348, 0, 64, 0, 131907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let Azshara\'s lackeys break upon our ranks! We will not yield!', '', 175147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashran be ours, mon! Well done!', '', 175146, 0, 36348, 0, 64, 0, 131912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been recalled to Orgrimmar. Remain in Nazjatar. Keep playing along with these traitorous vipers... until you are summoned.', '', 175145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon your loyalty will face an even greater test. I do hope you prove worthy of the Dark Lady\'s favor.', '', 175144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace? Wit\' da Alliance? Never, mon.', '', 175143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurfang, Thrall... and the Alliance. It is vexing to allow our quarry to believe they escaped us. But we must trust in the warchief\'s plan.', '', 175142, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna keep da ancient power here out of da Alliance\'s hands, no matter what. For da Horde!', '', 175141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of you gonna take da fight to da Alliance. Da others, find dose artifacts before our enemies can get to dem.', '', 175140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions! We\'ll hold this position while you cut a path through Azshara\'s elite guard!', 175139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions of da Horde. Da warchief be wantin\' Ashran and all its artifacts. It be up to us to secure da island.', '', 175138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall back for now, $p. We may have lost this battle, but we must conserve our strength and remain vigilant.', 175137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p. We\'ve pushed back our foes and gained the upper hand in Nazjatar. Glory to the Alliance!', 175136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of the Horde\'s warriors has been viciously attacking our soldiers. Find them and take them down.', 175135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara demands that her subjects worship her above all others. Her prideful vanity will be her downfall.', 175134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After I lost my family, it was the Sisterhood of Elune who took me in. Thank you for ending their torment.', 175133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incoming supplies! Check your map for the drop zones.', 175130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde appears to have a significant presence in the area. Be on your guard. I doubt they will hesitate to strike.', 175129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our scouts have marked several key strategic locations. Do whatever it takes to secure them for the Alliance.', 175128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, Nazjatar is hostile territory, and it is imperative that we establish control over the region.', 175127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The priestesses of Elune never bowed to Azshara, and were cursed for their defiance. Grant their spirits the peace they were denied.', 175126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is short. Let\'s move.', '', 175125, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Agreed.', '', 175124, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His odds will improve if we work together.', 175123, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 131861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We too have come to save Baine.', '', 175122, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our king sent us to rescue his friend.', '', 175121, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance? Here?', '', 175120, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thrall...', 175119, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 131860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close. I\'ll get us out.', 175118, 0, 0, 0, 102, 3000, 0, 131859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got him free!', '', 175117, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 131858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It sickens me to know that Azshara has cursed Elune\'s priestesses with a restless death. Please give them the peace they deserve.', 175116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde\'s shamans have summoned a deadly elemental. Eliminate it before it can reach Stormshield!', 175115, 0, 36349, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our druids have awakened an ancient of war. Follow it into battle and crush the Horde!', 175114, 0, 36349, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashran is ours! Excellent work, champions!', 175113, 0, 36349, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There can be no peace with the Horde.', 175112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow the Horde to obtain the power found on this island. For the Alliance!', 175111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While some of you push into enemy territory, the others will search for and retrieve the artifacts before the Horde does.', 175110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes of the Alliance. Our mission is to secure Ashran and the ancient artifacts scattered across it.', 175109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $p. We\'ve lost enough lives today.', '', 175108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll secure the cave, rescue who you can and meet us there.', 175107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: You... disappoint me...|R', '', 175106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: You... are not worthy...|R', '', 175105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: Harness your hatred...|R', '', 175104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: Trust no one...|R', '', 175103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: You no longer serve the Horde... only me.|R', '', 175102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: You no longer serve the Alliance... only me.|R', '', 175101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: Accept my gift... fulfill your destiny...|R', '', 175100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: Ha ha ha ha...|R', '', 175099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: They sought to betray you...|R', '', 175098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFFFB5EBN\'Zoth whispers: Yes... kill the weak...|R', '', 175097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If his machinations are allowed to continue, the entirety of Azeroth will become a bubbling pit.', '', 175096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was driven to create a better world, but his actions created pollutants that are destroying it.', '', 175095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area has been ruined by King Mechagon\'s ambitions.', '', 175094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System restored. Moving to contamination site.', '', 175093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sensors recalibrated. Massive toxicity levels detected.', '', 175092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the kelfin are finally free, we\'ll show everyone that we can become more than the naga tried to make us.', 175091, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troggs! Bring me their skulls!', '', 175090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to steal treasures?!', '', 175089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ocean taught me how to help and heal my friends. I\'m glad when I can be useful.', '', 175088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you really listen, sometimes you can hear the voice of the ocean. She brings me peace.', '', 175087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I talked to an ankoan, once. They\'ve lost so many of their friends. It\'s sad to think about.', '', 175086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day, there will be no more shackles.', 175085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was born in the slave pens. My family was broken by the naga... I never had a chance to heal them.', '', 175084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always dreamt of fighting back against the naga. Neri gave me that chance.', '', 175083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that?', 175081, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 131963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas has the loyalty of the people. So long as she is warchief, this war will rage within their hearts. We cannot stop it.', '', 175080, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 131950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That animosity only benefits Azshara. Her power is considerable. Divided, we are no match for her--or the master she serves.', 175079, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore and Shaw risked their lives to rescue Baine? Unexpected.', '', 175078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. We will focus on defeating the naga queen. But if the Horde turns against us, they will answer for it.', '', 175077, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There must be vengeance for Teldrassil. But if Azshara is not stopped, she will unleash her master upon the world.', 175076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Merely that we direct our efforts against Azshara instead of the Horde. That could buy time for Saurfang\'s rebellion to take root.', 175075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on... Are you suggesting we lay down our arms and fight beside them? After all they\'ve done?!', '', 175074, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 131946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We had a common enemy. Sylvanas wanted us at each other\'s throats. Perhaps that\'s what Azshara wants, too.', 175073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were fortunate that you were not betrayed. Presenting your heads might have regained their warchief\'s favor.', 175072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After what he did for Derek, I felt I owed him a debt. We received some unexpected help from Saurfang... and Thrall.', 175071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You risked your lives to save a leader of the Horde?!', '', 175070, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 131945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sylvanas ordered the execution of Baine Bloodhoof. Anduin sent us into Orgrimmar to rescue him.', 175069, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to have you back, Jaina. Why did King Anduin summon you?', '', 175068, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 131944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... got me...', '', 175067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna... take a... seat...', '', 175066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on... without me...', '', 175065, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... is my fault...', '', 175064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I messed up...', '', 175063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t heroes usually... you know... do stuff?', '', 175062, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Let us take a moment to smell the salt in the air.', '', 175061, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is something stuck in your shoe? That\'s why I don\'t wear them!', '', 175060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for action!', '', 175059, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone hungry for seafood?', '', 175058, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got your dorsal!', '', 175057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got this!', '', 175056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poen\'s a good sprog. He just needs a little more confidence.', '', 175055, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you know the naga? Believe me, you\'ve never faced the ones here in Nazjatar.', '', 175054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those sea giants can tell a mean tale... when you can make sense of what they\'re saying.', '', 175053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone I knew as a sprog is gone. I\'ve got a new family now, but I\'ll never forget the one I lost.', '', 175052, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara and her \"loyal subjects\" are the worst kind of monsters. We have to stop them here and now.', '', 175051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Horde of yours sounds real interesting. Reminds me a lot of the Unshackled.', '', 175050, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the naga were keeping me in chains, I never thought I\'d be free again. Shows what I know, huh?', '', 175049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] There are few of us that still remember what it was like before the naga came. We lost much.', '', 175048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without Neri, we would have scattered with the current. She brought us together.', '', 175047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the ocean returns, the tears of all who have suffered will be washed away.', '', 175046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechagon is a land of endless opportunity, and we will fight to keep it that way.', '', 175045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. This brief respite is quite welcome.', '', 175044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey. No resting until the battle\'s won.', '', 175043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight for those in Mechagon who can still be saved. We mourn for those who can\'t.', '', 175042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resist the forces of subjugation and uniformity! Fight for our future!', '', 175041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rustbolt Resistance needs you! Repel Mechagon\'s forces and help put an end to his machinations!', '', 175040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Mechagon\'s forces threaten us at every turn. Band together and fight back!', '', 175039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While we\'re killing time, the naga are killing our people.', '', 175038, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate the break, but we gotta keep moving.', '', 175037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga aren\'t gonna defeat themselves, you know.', '', 175036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was almost too easy!', '', 175035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy your salty grave!', '', 175034, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Unshackled will always be free!', '', 175033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Nice work, sprog.', '', 175032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s how we turn the tide!', '', 175031, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 133811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just need... a second...', '', 175030, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think I\'ll... let you have this one...', '', 175029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Slime Elemental attacked us, and we all got separated.\n\nI was headed back to Rustbolt for help, but became trapped here!', 175028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was... a good one...', '', 175027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, crash dummies! Let\'s paint the pavement red!', '', 175025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop with the squealing, I\'m here!', '', 175024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, motor-head! Get in here!', 175023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Catching my breath... you got this...', '', 175022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrngh! One hit... too many...', '', 175021, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s mine!', '', 175020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give it your best shot, briny!', '', 175019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to die! [dnt]', '', 175018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! [dnt]', '', 175017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me, I joined the Explorer\'s League for the action!\n\nFind the others. They need your help more!', '', 175016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once we\'ve beaten the naga, I hope the ocean swallows them up, along with everything they built.', 175015, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our cave keeps us safe for now, but someday we\'ll return to our real homes. Nazjatar will just be a bad memory.', 175014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When it looked like we were done for, Gral found us. He was angry at the naga, just like we were. He\'s a good friend.', 175013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen the ankoan? Impressive fighters, but a  bit standoffish. Too bad. We\'d be stronger together!', 175012, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someday we won\'t have to think of ourselves as shackled or Unshackled. We\'ll all just... be free.', 175011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I spent a lot of time in a cage. Not keen on wasting any now.', 175010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, people are counting on us.', 175009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No time like the present... to fight the naga.', 175008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The slimes attacked us and my pack broke. My cards were scattered everywhere!\n\nThere\'s a slime up the hill that ate some of my cards. I\'m not leaving till I get those back!', '', 175007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will continue to analyze your performance. Return when you are open to new ideas.', '', 175004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is not accurate.', '', 175003, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was hoping you\'d ask. We must all welcome criticism if we hope to move forward.', '', 175002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You desperately require an embedded flashlight.\n\n<Prince Erazmin waits far too long for you to laugh.>\n\nMessage received. The joke landed better with the last $pc.\n\nYou\' have many formal techniques, but I\'d like to see some boosts to your creativity. What if you embedded prisms into every limb of your body to aid in the manipulation of the Light in new and unforeseen ways?\n\nActually, does your Light work in the same way as natural light? Are the naaru okay with unconventional manipulations of it? Does the Light come from inside of you, or is it channeled through you from another, invisible source?\n\nTo be honest, the whole Light thing has never made much sense to me, personally...', '', 175001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve earned those calluses on your hands and feet, and I would deprive you of them through full limb replacement.\n\nStay subtle. What if you embedded steel plates under your palms and retractable katars in your knees? \n\nYou\'d look the same, but would be at least 19% more dangerous.', '', 175000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are already a master of technology, in a way.\n\nYou study magic, I study mechanics. They both follow important principles that aren\'t so different from each other. I\'ve often said that the underlying ideas and ideals of the--\n\nOh, apologies, you asked me a specific question. Let me answer your question with a very simple idea:\n\nThere are more than just ARCANE missiles.', '', 174999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our researchers have had tremendous breakthroughs in enhancing the connection between a hunter and their pet via embedded communication and empathy relay modules.\n\nI must warn you, however. There are many unsavory side effects that many hunters choose not to speak of.\n\nSometimes, even our closest companions are better left outside of our heads.', '', 174998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m surprised to hear that you are open to such ideas. I\'ve always said that nature often needs to be pushed along, but I would have wagered that you\'d disagree.\n\nThat said, I\'m unsure how permanent modifications would interface reliably with your malleable biological components. Unless you\'re willing to take large risks, I would recommend starting with ingestible modifiers.\n\nIf those succeed, move onto small, superficial attachments that can be removed without risk if your body reacts poorly.\n\n<Prince Erazmin appears lost in thought.>\n\nThis is a truly puzzling postulate.', '', 174997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I conclude that you have no moral qualms about modifying your body\'s capabilities via external sources.\n\nDemons may have given you wings and horns, but technology can give you everything else.\n\nYou do well on ground and air. For your next upgrade, I\'d consider modifications for aquatic environments.\n\nMaybe mechanical gills, retractable fins, or submersible propulsion engine?', '', 174996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand your kind do not require sleep on a biological level.\n\nHowever, sleep offers secondary benefits to cognitive functions and memory consolidation in others, so I assume it would for you as well.\n\nIf you insist on avoiding it, I recommend experimenting with swappable sensory deprivation modules that may assist in short-term meditation and stress-reduction experiences.\n\nOr, if you refuse to consider such activities entirely, at least mod your eyeballs to give you flawless nighttime vision for those nocturnal hours.', '', 174995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My advice is simple: study your actions and intentions.\n\nWhere do you feel most inadequate? Discard those aspects.\n\nIdentify your primary strengths, and use modifications to amplify them.\n\nDetermine who you are, and you will know who you must become.', '', 174994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many rumors of my father\'s plans have leaked to the surface, but data is scarce.\n\nAs we await confirmation, prepare yourself and your people.\n\nThe Rustbolt Resistance will need you by our side when the time comes.', '', 174993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember the wisdom and courage that my father showed when I was a child. In those early days, he led our people well. He saw a brighter future, and helped guide us to it.\n\nThat is the version of my father that I will carry with me as I lead our people forward.\n\nTheir trust will not be easily earned. And it should not be.\n\nI will earn it, and then I will keep it.', '', 174992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you continue, ask yourself whether whatever you\'re about to say is more important than the brainstorming of a technological advancement capable of disrupting the entire course of Azeroth\'s history!\n\nBecause that\'s what I was working on when you so rudely interrupted me, and the Horde will tremble when I finally reveal it!', '', 174991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must remain undisturbed, $n.\n\nI\'m currently brainstorming a technological advancement capable of disrupting the entire course of Azeroth\'s history!', '', 174990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Erazmin\'s got potential. Smart. Knows his people and leans on their strengths, shores up their weaknesses. Knows that the group\'s success is his success.\n\n<Gazlowe makes a rude gesture toward Tinkmaster Overspark.>\n\nYou Alliance grubs could learn a thing or two from him.', '', 174989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Erazmin\'s got potential. Smart. Knows his people and leans on their strengths, shores up their weaknesses. Knows that the group\'s success is his success.\n\nStill needs us, of course. And I don\'t mind not gettin\' paid as long he don\'t mind us loading up our submarine with tech we find out here.\n\nWe\'re gonna get rich off this stuff.', '', 174988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have a funny definition of perfect.', 174987, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever your question is, mechanization is the answer!', 174986, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imagine your arms... but, now, instead of arms... they\'re FLAMETHROWERS!', 174985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never recommended a full head replacement before... but maybe this is the time to try it.', 174984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skin is fine, but it could be incredible.\n\nI recommend you reinforce it with some sort of... sentient elastic metal... that I\'m trying to... invent as I say... this sentence...\n\n<Christy\'s face contorts as she struggles to think harder before letting out a massive exhale.>\n\nNope, didn\'t get it. Check back with me tomorrow. It\'d be a terrific upgrade for you!', 174983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look tired. You should install energy cells around your heart.\n\nThat way, when it needs a break, just power it down and have the energy cells take over and power your body until your heart comes back online.\n\nYou\'ll need to remove some organs to make room for all the energy cells, but I\'m sure we could replace most of those with smaller mechanical versions too.', 174982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are slower than a motorcycle.\n\nLet\'s replace your entire lower half with a big ol\' motorcycle.\n\nWe can make it whatever color you want. We\'ll get in all the science journals.\n\nYou want to pop wheelies while you\'re chasing down bad guys? I\'m in! Let\'s do this!', 174981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and your 29 best friends should install connective brain implants that allow you to strategize, gossip, and occasionally insult each other at all times, no matter where you are!\n\nIf you go for the super-deluxe edition, you can even transmit hilarious photographs to each other!', 174980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your eyesight is average. That is to say, unacceptable.\n\nWe should replace them with fully mechanical visual scanning devices that can be upgraded via remote software upgrades every week.', 174979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you know, I strongly believe that most things can be improved through technology...\n\nBut in your case, I believe it\'s actually ALL things.\n\nLet\'s start at the bottom and work our way up.\n\nHow attached, would you say, are you to those feet?', 174978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, gnomes I can respect!\n\nThese mechagnomes can make somethin\' outta nothin\' in 10 seconds flat... and look good doin\' it!\n\n<Ricket winks at a nearby mechagnome.>\n\nI think I\'m gonna like it here.', 174977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a wonderful workshop!\n\nWe\'ve got everything we need to discover something amazing here. Good things are coming to Rustbolt!', 174976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s VERY messy. That\'s the best part. Oil sprays, electrical shocks, small explosions, we got it all!\n\nOh, don\'t worry. We never do our research on mechagnomes.\n\nKing Mechagon\'s soldiers are all fully mechanized. Most of them forced into it, sadly.\n\n<Hacker Bassblast glances at the robots behind him and frowns.>\n\nThere\'s nothing left of the gnomes we used to know inside those metallic husks...', '', 174975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds messy.', 'That sounds messy.', 174974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re examining the latest technology coming out of Mechagon.\n\nSee what we can reprogram, reverse-engineer, and extract from the robots we\'ve collected.\n\nKing Mechagon has plenty of bad ideas, but he has also the best tech this side of immortality!\n\nYou could learn more from one of these robots than all the engineering trainers on Kalimdor combined!', '', 174973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing to these robots?', 'What are you doing to these robots?', 174972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got any new tech?', '', 174971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? Space is limited.', '', 174970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cranky?! Of course, I\'m cranky!\n\nHave you seen my hands? Or should I say CLAMPS!\n\nNot all of us got to choose the \"upgrades\" King Mechagon gave us. Some of us had them chosen for us! And, in case you hadn\'t heard, King Mechagon makes terrible choices!\n\nExhibit A!\n\n<Smiles thrusts his clamps at you and snaps wildly with them.>\n\nChristy\'s promised me some real, full-functioning hands soon. But, until then, yeah, I\'m going to be cranky!', '', 174969, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 389, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s talk about something else.', 'Let\'s talk about something else.', 174968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re kind of cranky.', 'You\'re kind of cranky.', 174967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there a... healer... in the house?', 174966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better me... than you...', 174965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food?! I don\'t cook!\n\nWhy do you think I built Stacks?!\n\nNiru\'s always got something semi-edible stashed away. Go bother her!', '', 174964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gotta... get my... GRRR back...', 174963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve... been through... worse....', 174962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hungry. Do you have anything I can eat?', 'I\'m hungry. Do you have anything I can eat?', 174961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oof! Need... a second...', 174960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Greymane is waiting, I\'m ready to set sail.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Greymane is waiting, I\'m ready to set sail.', 174959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar is building a team to free Baine.', 'Lor\'themar is building a team to free Baine.', 174957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news do you have for me, $n?', '', 174955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That mechanocrawler still holding up well?\n\nIf you ever need a tune up, bring it on by! It\'d be fun to get under the hood again.', 'That mechanocrawler still holding up well?\n\nIf you ever need a tune up, bring it on by! It\'d be fun to get under the hood again.', 174952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I doubt it.', 174942, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I\'m ready to depart.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I\'m ready to depart.', 174941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, everyone can be wondrous if they change enough!', 174940, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nWell, today is full of surprises, isn\'t it? We have all manner of fire-resistant and emergency revival modules that would be helpful to a typical goblin.\n\nBut, I wonder if your lifestyle demands such failsafes?\n\nIf not, there is ample room for improvement on those ears, for certain.\n\nDon\'t misunderstand me, they are exceptional already.\n\nBut imagine if they could hear light or move with the nimbleness of fingers. Maybe even store small payloads of explosives inside of them for emergencies!', 174939, 0, 34466, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nWe\'ve got a lot to work with here. I like that.\n\nReally, there\'s very little that I would not recommend. I believe your body is capable of withstanding tremendous modification.\n\nAnd that, of course, means we should do all of it.', 174938, 0, 70316, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nYou, my dear test subject, have many flaws. The biggest being your complicated connection to magic.\n\nI assume that you cannot help it. It\'s in your blood.\n\nBut you must break that connection and replace with a much more healthy and sustainable reliance on technology!\n\nSpend some time thinking of the most common tasks you use magic for around your home.\n\nThen, after you\'ve identified them, we will infuse you with a whole host of mechanical components that can do that task for you instead!', 174937, 0, 70315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\n\nWith you, I\'m less concerned about what our goals will be in your improvement plan. Those are obvious.\n\nInstead, I\'m worried what roadblocks we might encounter during procedures and in the recovery phase.\n\nWill your body accept mechanical implants, or reject them? Maybe even fight them as invasive entities trying to corrupt you?\n\nYes, we will certainly need to do further research before we\'re ready to proceed with you.', 174936, 0, 70314, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\nI\'m pleased to see a fellow gnome asking such questions.\n\nAs you might imagine, we have a breadth of research and test cases that track results, specifically with gnome biology.\n\nYou can pursue any modifications you see here in Mechagon.', 174935, 0, 33812, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\nYour biological, or should I say geological, quirks could add complications to invasive surgeries.\n\nI\'d recommend keeping to surface-level modifications initially. See how your body reacts before delving deeper with more invasive surgeries.\n\nOh, and you\'re probably just a bit too tall.', 174934, 0, 70310, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully from head to hoof.>\n\nImpressive physique... Sturdy balance... Indomitable resilience... Nature did pretty well with you. \n\nBut let\'s talk about those tendrils... Frankly, they look ridiculous, and I doubt they serve any real purpose.\n\nI recommend immediately replacing them with retractable hoses or storage tubes. Your choice.', 174933, 0, 67878, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy examines you carefully.>\nAn excellent question! There is always room to improve what nature handed you at birth.\n\nReject equally the claims that you are either perfect or unsalvageable. Both are equally wrong. And you, my dear test subject, have plenty about you that is right.\n\nFor the rest, I\'ll write up a 24-page plan detailing every modification we simply must make.\n\nThere\'s still so much to improve!', 174932, 0, 70320, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m perfect just the way I am!', 'I\'m perfect just the way I am!', 174931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your candid advice.', 'Thank you for your candid advice.', 174930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What improvements could mechanization offer me?', 'What improvements could mechanization offer me?', 174929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think voidwine is my new favorite drink!', 'I think voidwine is my new favorite drink!', 174927, 7, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another pretzel!', 'I need another pretzel!', 174926, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I\'m always telling my dear sister, energy is the lifeblood of innovation!', '', 174925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PROXIMITY SENSORS: ACTIVATED - INITIALIZE CONVERSATION SUBROUTINES.\n\nOUTPUT: Pleasant greetings, $r $c. I am BLINGTRON 7000, and am programmed to provide adventurers, such as yourself, with GIFTS and PARTY.\n\nQUERY: Do you require GIFTS or PARTY?', '', 174914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit your tinkering and do something!', '', 174910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shift your useless butt into gear!', 174909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Designed for destruction!', 174908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This looks like a fun one!', 174907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha ha ha ha ha!', 174906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s give you little more juice!', 174905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not to worry, I\'ll fix you right up!', 174904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here? You folks must be lost!', 174903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit and run!', '', 174902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let honor guide your path.', '', 174901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we are strong.', '', 174900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s retreats from the area!', '', 174899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Azeroth.', '', 174898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met.', '', 174897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat my dust!', '', 174896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-ka!', '', 174895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up and juice my ride!', '', 174894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe it in, loser!', '', 174893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna be roadkill!', '', 174892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit spinning your tires and punch it!', 174891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s boogie!', 174890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High voltage!', 174889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... crossin\'... the finish line...', '', 174888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All... outta... gas...', 174887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-tar!', '', 174886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all gotta try thish...', 'You all gotta try thish...', 174885, 7, 0, 462, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow Azshara to swell her ranks with such aberrations. Well done.', 174884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pour me another!', 'Pour me another!', 174883, 7, 0, 70, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot let Azshara swell her ranks with such aberrations.', 174882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_THUNDERKING_LIGHTNINGWHIP.BLP:20|t You are targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:298413|h[Arcing Current]|h|r!', '', 174881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara incubates entire armies within her vile hatcheries. Ensure that the eggs never reach their destination.', 174880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These nightmarish creatures are carrying naga eggs into hidden hatcheries. No doubt foul rituals are being performed upon them. Stop this madness, champion!', 174879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me bruddas and sistahs be free... but how can we ever be trustin\' da voices of da elements again?', '', 174878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s always something in progress on this island.', '', 174877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explore Rustbolt and acquaint yourself with the resistance.', '', 174876, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 132616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sea\'s wrath flows through me!', 174875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tides move against you!', 174874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From darkness, sirens come forth!', 174873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plugging', 'Plugging', 174869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You really gunked up my under carriage.', '', 174868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Didn\'t even scratch the paint.', 174867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides have been disrupted!', '', 174866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb these waters?', '', 174864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scrapped!', 174863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You could use an adjustment!', 174862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splattered!', '', 174861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sideswiped!', '', 174860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crash and burn!', '', 174859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for a tune up!', 174858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Operating parameters have been satisfied. \n\nSYSTEM SHUTDOWN IN 3... 2...', '', 174857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a Chitterspine pile to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298777|h[Feast]|h|r on to restore your health!', 'Find a Chitterspine pile to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298777|h[Feast]|h|r on to restore your health!', 174856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The resistance prevails! Rustbolt will not fall today!', '', 174855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father will stop at nothing to ensure world mechanization. We must resist his every action!', '', 174854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cracklemaw Colossus begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:298870|h[Stormrend]|h|r!', 'Cracklemaw Colossus begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:30455|h[Stormrend]|h|r!', 174853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your assistance. But there remains much more to do.', '', 174850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'d erase everything that makes us who we are. We cannot allow that to happen.', '', 174849, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my father succeeds, then all of us will end up like that machine on the wall.', '', 174848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight not only for our own freedom, but for theirs as well.', '', 174847, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of the resistance still have family and friends within Mechagon.', '', 174846, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stop him. We must stop him.', '', 174845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have yet to determine that. King Mechagon has converted over 99 percent of their physical composition.', 174844, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 133249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Is there even a gnome left inside?', '', 174843, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The extent of this mechanization... is there even a gnome left in there?', '', 174842, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 132609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Erazmin looks at the fully mechanized Sentry and sighs.', '', 174841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, sir. Their tech is improving. We can hardly keep up.', 174840, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we have an impressive haul today, Christy.', '', 174839, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 132608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] We prefer a union of the flesh and mechanical. And, above all, the ability to choose for yourself what improvements you will pursue.', '', 174838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] My father desires full mechanization for our people, so he can be in full control.', '', 174837, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The choice to install upgrades belongs to each of us. No one can strip us of that autonomy.', '', 174836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father does not share that view. He intends to mechanize the entirety of our people, willing or not.', '', 174835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, we also value our organic components. Our emotions and memories, our personalities.', '', 174834, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you can observe, we take pride in our ability to refurbish and repurpose technology.', '', 174833, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! But... if you change your mind, I could scrounge up some potential buyers. For a nominal fee.', '', 174832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once it is secured, I will dismantle it myself.', '', 174831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this \"mechoriginator\"... how much would you say it\'s worth?', '', 174830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must dispatch my father before he can activate the mechoriginator.', '', 174829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve accessed its data core and retrieved the codes to gain entry into the city.', '', 174828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it! That monstrosity will no longer darken our skies.', '', 174827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Efficient and self-reliant. I respect that.', '', 174826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My readers deserve to know that I\'m more than just my incredible brain!', '', 174825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splendid, Gila! But make sure you include a passage about my rugged fortitude.', '', 174824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By shutting down the power grid, Tinkmaster Overspark has turned the hunter into the hunted.', 174823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is our chance to disable it and acquire the access code.', '', 174822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exemplary work! With the power nodes inert, the machine will return to its hub to recharge.', '', 174821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t need a tour of the city.', 'I don\'t need a tour of the city.', 174820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The junkers are no longer a threat. I can disable the node.', '', 174819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you have a question?', '', 174818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need to employ violence.', '', 174817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There appears to be a power node within the vicinity of the scrapyard.', '', 174816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Zuldazar, aboard the Banshee\'s Wail. What we do next... we do for the Horde.', '', 174815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warships are ready to embark. The key to victory over the Alliance is within our grasp.', '', 174814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, the Dark Lady summons you. The time has come to set her plan into motion.', '', 174813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fleet is ready to set sail. Report to Boralus and meet me upon the Wind\'s Redemption with all haste!', '', 174812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, champion. The Azerite barrier is getting stronger!', '', 174811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will vastly outnumber them on the open water. Let us seize this opportunity and end this war once and for all!', '', 174810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azerite empowers you, $p!', '', 174809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, Spymaster Shaw informs me that the Horde\'s remaining ships are preparing to depart from Zuldazar.', '', 174808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With that creature neutralized, I can deactivate the node.', '', 174807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have to sanitize the area in order to access it.', '', 174806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I doubt they will relinquish it willingly.', '', 174805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A power node must be located within that slime.', '', 174804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will deactivate the node. Move with haste and locate the others.', '', 174803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m detecting a power node within that trogg den.', '', 174802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still stand. Your little ritual actually managed to weaken me.', '', 174800, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hand over the Eye of Fire and we will not be required to take it by force.', 174799, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s headed for Scrapbone Den. Stay out of its sight.', '', 174798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems to be moving towards Bondo\'s Yard. You should keep your distance.', '', 174797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its flight path will take it over the Heaps. I suggest avoiding that area.', '', 174796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to head back to the surface.', 'I\'m ready to head back to the surface.', 174795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain alert. The flying menace has altered its trajectory.', '', 174794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proceed with caution. Mechagon\'s war machine appears to be changing course.', '', 174793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your assessment is accurate.', '', 174792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All while avoiding a flying death machine, so that we can break into a fortress that has even MORE death machines?!', '', 174791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So we\'re going to root around through the garbage, looking for nodes that may not even be there?!', '', 174790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nodes are scattered throughout the junkyard. I\'ve calibrated my sensors to detect them when you\'re in proximity.', '', 174789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assaulting it head-on would be ill-advised, but disabling its remote power nodes should render it vulnerable.', '', 174788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily, the flying mechanical terror that patrols this region has a control module that can open the gates.', '', 174787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To prevent my father from eradicating all organic life, we need to gain entry into his subterranean fortress city.', '', 174786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should have gotten a mechanocat, Ricky.', '', 174785, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watchout, Ricky\'s on the road again!', 'Watchout, Ricky\'s on the road again!', 174784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary. It moves slowly, but if you tarry for too long, it will find you!', '', 174783, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First fel magic, now the Void. Azshara is a prideful fool who tampers with powers beyond her control.', 174782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tarragrue? I hoped you would get deeper into the Maw before that beast caught your scent.', '', 174781, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga serve a great darkness. They tamper with powers that will one day consume them.', 174780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Did you think I would retreat so easily after your puny ritual?', '', 174778, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shirakess are conducting dark experiments with the Void. Use this telemancy beacon to deny them their specimens.', 174777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to understand the forces that the naga are harnessing. Use this telemancy beacon to send over any void experiments you find.', 174776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you\'re all set up, give that conch a toot and we\'ll go check on our scouts!', 174775, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I can be of even greater help!', '', 174774, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers from the deep call to me, but I have been hearing whispers for far longer than this. My things are all that matter to me now!', '', 174772, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The most difficult lock, for the most delicate prize. Try your mind against this, looter.', '', 174771, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another ley lock secured. Even with the water entering my abode, to use my mind in such a fashion... I astound myself.', '', 174770, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet, what if another of my genius should happen upon this cache? Ha! I made myself laugh. Another of my brilliance... how droll.', '', 174769, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another of my possessions, secured for the ages. One day, I will return for you.', '', 174768, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An arcane lock will protect this chest as well. The key, of course, is to never cross the ley lines.', '', 174767, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live the Rustbolt Resistance!', '', 174766, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 132600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me back in Rustbolt. We must rebuild before Mechagon\'s next offensive.', '', 174765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THAT was an optimized application of force!', '', 174764, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unauthorized lifeforms detected! Exterminate!', '', 174763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Current rate of damage inadvisable. Returning for repairs.', '', 174762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No living thing deserves to be enslaved by Azshara. Break the chains! Break the slavers! Break the naga!', 174761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The honorless naga will enslave no one so long as we stand vigil.', '', 174760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A band of naga slavers has invaded the area. Tear those snakes apart!', 174759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara\'s minions intend to force these creatures into servitude. Stop them.', '', 174758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will lead our allies back to safety. Be careful, $n. The naga will not part with their armaments easily.', '', 174757, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will lead our allies back to safety. Be cautious, $n. The naga won\'t relinquish their weapons easily.', 174756, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 133989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blademaster Okani has offered to aid us. Let\'s ensure the ankoans have whatever they require.', 174755, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 133988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today has given me much to think about.', 174754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Adaru told me of your task. What were you able to find?', 174753, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 133985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something powerful lies hidden within their military stronghold.', '', 174752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Zanj\'ir are the ones who pose the gravest threat.', '', 174751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who wield the dark magic of the Void call themselves the Shirakess.', '', 174750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azsh\'ari are vile summoners, calling upon the tides to do their bidding.', '', 174749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara\'s forces hold dominion over all of Nazjatar.', '', 174748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll leave you ex-static!', '', 174747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m acting in self-defense!', '', 174746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most do not see the similarity between cloth and metal armor. \n\nCover the vitals. Do not hinder movement. The material is irrelevant.', '', 174745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be mindful of your conduct!', '', 174744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
