('', 'You wish to explore? Even after all that has happened, there is still beauty to be found here.', 174681, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, another puzzle complete. Let us see the thieves take my possessions now. What in the world is going on outside? It sounds like... the ocean?', '', 174680, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the most brilliant, like myself, will be able to complete my intricate puzzles. This one I have fashioned after the ley lines that cross our world.', '', 174679, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you found us. I didn\'t have a chance to thank you for saving our hides back there.', 174674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta watch these troggs. They\'re robbing us blind!', '', 174673, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion, for your aid earlier today. Long have the naga contaminated these waters with their filth. It is good that the world unite under one current to crush these warped creatures upon the very rocky shores they seek to invade.', '', 174672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal! I have been sent by the great Neptulon to bring ruin and judgment upon these current befouling fools that would destroy our world.$b$bThe power of the Tidestone holds the great Neptulon back, but together, you with your Heart of Azerite, and I with the full might of the undercurrent, can join forces and deliver justice upon these villains.$b$bJoin me in battle, and together we shall crush them beneath the very water they breath.', '', 174671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing some scrap, energy cells, and elbow grease won\'t fix.', 174670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rustbolt is in a state of disarray. Your skills are presently required.', '', 174669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you think you can convince that guy to come along and crush more of the naga? He made it look easy.', 174668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a great honor to fight alongside the Waterlords. May Neptulon\'s currents guide us to victory.', '', 174667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 135879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play along for now. I\'ll send word ahead. These traitors are in for a surprise once they reach Bloodhoof.', '', 174666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
