('Forget about me! They took Pascal-K1N6, the greatest invention of our time!', '', 174663, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 131981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, do you know a huge guy made of water? Has an army of elementals? He\'s asking for you. Better not keep him waiting.', 174662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, dear sister. You are always correct.', '', 174661, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 131980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
