('Feel the power of the blue dragonflight!', '', 174528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not today!', 'Not today!', 174527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131696, 131697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
