('Oh no you don\'t!', 'Oh no you don\'t!', 174525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131692, 131693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll fight to the death!', 'I\'ll fight to the death!', 174524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131690, 131691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me alive!', 'You\'ll never take me alive!', 174523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131688, 131689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I can\'t bet on a sure thing, then I ain\'t really living!', '', 174522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom!', 'Freedom!', 174521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131686, 131687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on!', 'Bring it on!', 174520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131698, 131699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... if they win, won\'t we be dead?', 174519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sweat, pal. I\'m putting twenty large on Gnomercy!', '', 174518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city\'s entrance is located just past this arena.', '', 174517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must hold your ground until we can clear a path to it.', '', 174516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will marshal our forces. We will meet you near the Tidestone.', '', 174515, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 135974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What inspires you to battle, $c? For me, it is the thrill of defeating a powerful opponent.', '', 174514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara believes she has us cornered. But that is when prey is at its most dangerous.', '', 174513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The depths are a dangerous place, with monsters the likes of which you have never seen.', '', 174512, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At times, I can feel distant from my clan. But though I often hunt alone, I live and die for them.', '', 174511, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hunt the naga down to the last, and put an end to their vicious cruelty.', '', 174510, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan invaded Nazjatar with a thirst for vengeance. We may die here... but we will die fighting.', '', 174509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have trained as a hunter since childhood. Whether beast or naga, my prey never escapes.', '', 174508, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okani trusts that I will deal with the clan\'s largest threats. I am honored to do so.', '', 174507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to hunt with you, $c. There is much we can learn from each other.', '', 174506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $c! Looking to participate in the Brewfest Chowdown?', 174505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My skills once provided food for my clan. Now they will provide vengeance.', '', 174504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time to waste, $c.', '', 174503, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, we have much to do.', '', 174502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunt awaits us, $c.', '', 174501, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get mobilized for mayhem!', '', 174500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Platinum Pummeler and Gnomercy 4.U.!', '', 174499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up, and I\'ll spray you with ink! I think I saw a pen around here somewhere...', 'Keep it up, and I\'ll spray you with ink! I think I saw a pen somewhere around here...', 174498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131655, 131656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to introduce them to the legends of the Tussle Tonks arena!', '', 174497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is a statistical anomaly! Our visitors are still alive!', '', 174496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
