('', 'Example: Energies once granted by titan watchers to primitive draconic lifeforms.', 174494, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 134466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A word of caution to anyone sitting in the splash zone: Watch out for blood!', '', 174493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, what\'s this?! Some surface dwellers have unwittingly stumbled into the arena!', '', 174492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a match up we\'ve got tonight, folks! Sparks are gonna fly!', '', 174491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! This madness ends now!', '', 174490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
