('I have sealed the chamber, nonetheless this is quite alarming. I shall finish locking these chests and then enact a most brilliant escape that I simply have not thought of yet.', '', 174459, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A most devious arcane puzzle will lock my prized possessions, so that I may return one day and claim them. Now, to deal with all of this water flooding my chamber...', '', 174458, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dark ranger appears to be slightly bored with a stationary target and has drawn a crude smile with arrows.>', '<The dark ranger appears to be slightly bored with a stationary target and has drawn a crude smile with arrows.>', 174457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ranger has put a tight cluster of arrows into the target.>', '<The ranger has put a tight cluster of arrows into the target.>', 174456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done.', 'Well done.', 174455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you will excuse me, I must attend to a sprain.', 174454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p is going to inspect your form.', 174453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad a champion of the Horde stands with us today.\n\nAre you ready, $p?', '', 174452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go.', 'I am ready to go.', 174451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do what\'chu gotta do. I be keeping an eye out for ya. Spirits be wit\' ya mon.', '', 174450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And take this. I have a feelin\' ye be needin\' it.', '', 174449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But if the Alliance undermines our efforts, the flames of war will rise again.', '', 174448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A truce then? We fight Azshara here, not one another.', 174447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lesson that Jaina Proudmoore and I needed to learn. Your counsel is wise, Thalyssra. Our focus must be on ending Azshara\'s reign.', '', 174446, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 131952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. We also have a history of setting differences aside to fight greater foes.', 174445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That plan would infuriate Blightcaller... which makes me like it all the more. Hmm... \"It stops when you turn from one another and walk away...\"', '', 174444, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 131951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we do not need to. It might be enough to direct our attacks against Azshara rather than the Alliance.', 174443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry for what happened to your people in Dalaran. The response was... Harsh.', 174442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His life spared for one he saved.', 174441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooperation between our sides has been the exception, not the rule. More often, we are at each other\'s throats.', '', 174440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it? Not long ago, Alliance and Horde fought together to liberate Suramar from the Legion.', 174439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord.', 174438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor child. If only you could accept the truth.', '', 174437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no longer my father. Just a malfunctioning machine that must be shut down.', '', 174436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So my misguided son returns. I\'m impressed you made it this far.', '', 174435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Input accepted. Countdown terminated.', '', 174434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
