('Let\'s get back out there!', 'Let\'s get back out there!', 174229, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not as mechanized as I expected.', 'Not as mechanized as I expected.', 174228, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does $c need?', '', 174227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, outsider!', 'Greetings, outsider!', 174226, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Jaina. There isn\'t much time, so make haste. May the Light be with you all.', '', 174225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] We will have lost any hope of ending this war peacefully. And peace is worth the risk.', 174224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Baine dies, we might lose our last hope of bringing this war to a peaceful end. And peace is worth the risk.', 174223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we should fall, we will be rebuilt and returned to battle, learned and ready to triumph!', 174222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] I know how hard it is to offer an open hand when the rest of your people have drawn swords.', 174221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine defied his warchief by returning Derek to us. To me. He\'s risked more than anyone.', 174220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain? It\'s an immense risk.', '', 174219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do it.', 174218, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 131363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must rescue him at once. I know what I ask of you. To infiltrate Orgrimmar--', '', 174217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... can\'t be... right...', '', 174216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really expect to survive against my genius?', '', 174215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spies report that the Banshee has ordered the execution of Baine Bloodhoof.', '', 174214, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mangled!', '', 174213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make good grease!', '', 174212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my garden, trespassers!', '', 174211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, $p. We are faced with a dire situation.', '', 174210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be neutralized.', 'You will be neutralized.', 174209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131066, 131067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating hostile action.', 'Initiating hostile action.', 174208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131064, 131065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By King Mechagon\'s decree.', 'By King Mechagon\'s decree.', 174207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131062, 131063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings mortal. The naga have committed a grand crime against the power of my master, Neptulon.$b$bThe magic of the Tidestone is the magic of titans. Even now, that ancient power holds him at bay just as it holds back the sea. However, it cannot hold back his justice.$b$bWill you join me in quelling these naga for their defiance of the great Neptulon?', '', 174206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the time comes, each of us will perform beyond our designed limits!', 174205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rustbolt will not fall again on our watch!', 174204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the equal of any of Mechagon\'s troops, but our spirit and desire are superior!', 174203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will be ready for anything Mechagon sends against us!', 174202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rustbolt\'s future is not set! It is ours to create, adapt, and improve.', 174201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Sorry is a luxury we cannot afford. We have a mission to accomplish.', '', 174200, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Prince Erazmin straightens in his chair and points at the fortress up ahead.', '', 174199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('[DNT] That\'s rough one, buddy. I\'m sorry to hear that.', '', 174198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] He has transformed himself into a heartless machine. Nothing of my father remains within.', '', 174197, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will stop at nothing to achieve his goals. The Rustbolt Resistance is all that stands in his way.', '', 174196, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It doesn\'t make sense... Why would King Mechagon do that to his own people?', '', 174195, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 132735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was once a visionary. But now... he has transformed himself into a heartless machine.', '', 174194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechagon\'s forces recently raided the settlement. Many of us were apprehended... or worse.', '', 174193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have noticed that Rustbolt is not currently operating at peak efficiency.', '', 174192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Process this information as we proceed.', '', 174191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting as ordered.', 'Reporting as ordered.', 174190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a $r riding around on a goblin trash can?', '', 174189, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Fenn informed me of your incursion into the naga camp. What have you found?', '', 174188, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 135985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew I should\'ve walked you earlier!', 174180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_SHAWATERELEMENTAL_SWIRL.BLP:20|t You are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:298306|h[Incubation Fluid]|h|r!', '', 174179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh oh, someone has a tummy ache.', 174178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s playtime!', 174177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boom goes the junk heap!', 174176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out below!', 174175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knock... out...', '', 174171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But not to worry! I\'ll stop at nothing to give you the play by play!', '', 174170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My upgrade will be fabulous, once we fix the malfunctions.', '', 174169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like yours truly has joined the tussle!', '', 174168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoaaah! Gadgets and cogs... we\'ve got a highly unusual development!', '', 174167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He returned my brother, yes, but this is not the first time he has reached across all that divides us. I know how hard it is to extend a hand when everyone else has drawn swords. I have even been the one with the weapon.\n\nBaine has always tried to act with honor. He has shown me a flicker still exists in the Horde. If he dies, then whatever is left within the Horde will die with him, killed by the Banshee as surely as she slaughtered the innocents of Teldrassil.\n\nThere is a time and place for weapons, but... We also need words. I would rather speak with one such as Baine.\n\nAre you ready to go?', 174166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'ll take me weeks to rebuild him!', 174165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you done?! You monsters!', 174164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are times when I wish I had fleshy toes to wiggle.', 'There are times when I wish I had fleshy toes to wiggle.', 174163, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The aid of the outsiders is convincing many of the king\'s loyalists to join us.', 'The aid of the outsiders is convincing many of the king\'s loyalists to join us.', 174162, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think my brother will join the resistance.', 'I think my brother will join the resistance.', 174161, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechanization is superior, but I miss having toes to wiggle.', 'Mechanization is superior, but I miss having toes to wiggle.', 174160, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you willing to risk so much for a leader of the Horde?', 'Why are you willing to risk so much for a leader of the Horde?', 174159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fleshy brethren seem quite at ease with their lack of mechanization.', 'Our fleshy brethren seem quite at ease with their lack of mechanization.', 174158, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not even worth recycling.', 174157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared, Jaina.', 'I am prepared, Jaina.', 174156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you smell what the junk is cooking?', 174155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine Bloodhoof doesn\'t have much time. Unless we act, he will be executed.\n\nWe are about to enter the heart of Horde territory.\n\nBe ready for anything.', 174154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More trash for the incinerator!', 174153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The giant has broken loose!', 'The giant has broken loose!', 174152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think Carlton just got one. He loves it!', '', 174151, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can hold the giant for now! Hurry and save the others!', 'We can hold the giant for now! Hurry and save the others!', 174150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drop that weapon, landwalker!', '', 174149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Why aren\'t you working?! Get over here!', '', 174148, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 132059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their technology is quaint, and I find their enthusiasm entertaining.', 'Their technology is quaint, and I find their enthusiasm entertaining.', 174147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The outsiders have some unusual devices.', 'The outsiders have some unusual devices.', 174146, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The new ankle bearings were a fabulous idea.', 'The new ankle bearings were a fabulous idea.', 174145, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw several of them trying to drink it.', 'I saw several of them trying to drink it.', 174144, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The troggs have been stealing our oil again!', 'The troggs have been stealing our oil again!', 174143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was thinking about an optical upgrade.', 'I was thinking about an optical upgrade.', 174142, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sic \'em, boy!', 174141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those new legs are performing well!', 'Those new legs are performing well!', 174140, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fight is about to heat up!', '', 174139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better watch your step!', '', 174138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maximum thrust! Maximum carnage!', '', 174137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better duck and cover! Its bouncing blades!', '', 174136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spinning up! Here come the buzz saws!', '', 174135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, a brutal hit from the piston hammer! A real fan favorite!', '', 174134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trash! Trash! Trash! Trash! Trash!', '', 174133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stunning victory for the surface dwellers! But... we\'re still throwing them out with the trash!', '', 174132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all she transcribed folks! Another thrilling show from the Tussle Tonks arena!', '', 174131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! That one has gotta hurt!', '', 174130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another challenger falls to the champions!', '', 174129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And here we go!', '', 174128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you in Stormwind Keep, $p.', 174127, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 131362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save what you will need.', '', 174126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave nothing behind.', '', 174125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are leaving the area. Return to Zanj\'ir Terrace!', 'You are leaving the area. Return to Zanj\'ir Terrace!', 174124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we must get past her first.', '', 174123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like Baine is being held just ahead.', '', 174122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! We aren\'t here to fight each other.', 174120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A home that still stands. Can you say the same for Teldrassil?', '', 174119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay focused. Baine\'s life is all that matters right now.', '', 174118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides will provide.', '', 174117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return when you can.', '', 174116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See what can be of use.', '', 174115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Browse at your leisure.', '', 174114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to examine my wares?', '', 174113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters have much to offer.', '', 174112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara... will... fall...', '', 174111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never... give in...', '', 174110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue... the fight...', '', 174109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The... ancestors... call me...', '', 174108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tide... hunter...', '', 174107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... fought... with honor...', '', 174106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... vigil... begins...', '', 174105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan will be avenged!', '', 174104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waters, heed my call!', '', 174103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the abyss with you!', '', 174102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waveblade do not surrender!', '', 174101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power of the sea!', '', 174100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Neptulon\'s will!', '', 174099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grizzek grunts and nudges Sapphronetta.', '', 174098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think what Tinkmaster Overspark means is...', 174097, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 133189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... this place isn\'t Mechagon? Well, what are we waiting for? Let\'s get going!', '', 174096, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were all exiled from the underground city of Mechagon. Our goal is to--', '', 174095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides will crush you!', '', 174093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not King Mechagon. He is my father... and he is a madman who must be stopped.', '', 174092, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 132546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, King Mechagon. I am Tinkmaster Overspark. I have come to introduce your technology to the entire world!', '', 174091, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 132739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You trespass on sacred ground!', 174090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your people have been through so much, Prince Erazmin. We are--', 174089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood will fuel our rituals!', 174088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another prisoner for the mindbreakers!', '', 174087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face the abyss!', '', 174086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy prey!', '', 174085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No escape, landwalker!', '', 174084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember when all of this was underwater. Seems like it was only yesterday.', '', 174083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jin me? No, jin you!', '', 174082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assistance required in sector W-2!', 174081, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 133250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not quite the reception I had envisioned...', '', 174080, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll get a message to our allies. They should know the risk you\'re about to take.', 174079, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I asked you how my fins look, would I be fishing for compliments?', '', 174078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware, beware this, toots!', 174077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Killin\' you guys is gonna earn me a HUGE raise!', 174076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, well, well. If it ain\'t Sneaky Spy-Guy and Sea Captain Lady Lord!', 174075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re hiding something powerful within their military stronghold.', 174074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the Zanj\'ir are the ones who should worry you the most.', 174073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the naga have learned to harness the Void. They call themselves the Shirakess.', 174072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Azsh\'ari summoners can force the tides to do their evil bidding.', 174071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara has minions across all of Nazjatar.', 174070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dust yourself off, $n. King Mechagon will surely wish to address us personally.', '', 174068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I snuck a raiding party into Rastakhan\'s treasury. Getting through this gate isn\'t even a challenge.', '', 174067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sapphronetta and Grizzek ran ahead, no doubt to prepare the town for my arrival.', '', 174066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re having trouble with the lock, I could try a spell.', 174065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a tricky one. The Horde\'s locksmiths must be learning from the Zandalari.', '', 174064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand fast! More are coming!', 174063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll need time. $p, you and Lady Jaina keep those Horde thugs at bay.', '', 174062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara wasn\'t the only one manipulating us. I should have seen it sooner.', '', 174061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No creature is stronger than the sea.', '', 174060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you get the gate open?', 174059, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 131372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waveblade stand ready.', '', 174058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She wanted us divided. Fighting each other kept us distracted from the true threat.', 174057, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 132814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember those who gave their lives.', '', 174056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again your empire crumbles, Azshara. Your master will be disappointed by this failure.', 174055, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 132813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our oath cannot be broken.', '', 174054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara must be stopped.', '', 174053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust in the Tidehunter.', '', 174052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow the currents.', '', 174051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way!', '', 174050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 131388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are all... beneath me...', 174049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon, grant us strength.', '', 174048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To know your quarry is to master the hunt.', '', 174047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret this incursion!', 'You\'ll regret this incursion!', 174046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With wisdom comes survival.', '', 174045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are at home in the depths.', '', 174044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water can both cleanse and destroy.', '', 174043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ancestors are with us, always.', '', 174042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am one with the tides.', '', 174041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
