('For the Waveblade!', '', 174030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your strength!', '', 174029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us finish this!', '', 174028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spirit will languish here!', '', 174027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join your ancestors!', '', 174026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the end of your journey!', '', 174025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me!', '', 174024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ankoan humor tends to be self-referential. We make many... deep cuts.', '', 174023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hesitate to try new things. I always feel like a fish out of water.', '', 174022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempting to provoke me is a waste of time. I will not take the bait.', '', 174021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On land or sea, we strike with honor.', '', 174020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare none of the naga.', '', 174019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
