('The Deep Hunt awaits.', '', 174013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spirit is sharper than any sword.', '', 174011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must avenge the fallen.', '', 174010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be no coronation this day.', 174009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have need of my skill?', '', 174008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual nears completion. The Black Empire rises... and the world awaits its true queen.', 174007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You speak to a warrior of the Waveblade.', '', 174006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand with the tide.', '', 174005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That lumbering dwarf believed you could save Azeroth by empowering your shiny little Heart. The gift of a sleeping titan.', 174004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
