('', 'There is no power I cannot defile!', 173920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... happened? How did I come to be here?', '', 173919, 0, 72379, 6, 64, 0, 132085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Refuse... and be crushed beneath the tides. Choose your fate.', 173918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind was not my own...', '', 173917, 0, 23503, 1, 64, 0, 133977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel before me and I will bestow talents beyond your wildest imagination.', 173916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know your dreams... your lust for power. The hunger with which you pursue your desires.', 173915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
