('', 'Something big came up from the depths and started attacking us! We could use a hand!', 173665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy your respite, heroes. It will not last long.', 173664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A hollow victory. You faced a mere inkling of my power.', 173663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this is how you repay my hospitality? I will remember this slight.', 173662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s make this a bit more interesting.', 173661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have proven entertaining so far. Now it is time for the real show to begin.', 173660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Barely a challenge so far. Time to raise the stakes.', 173659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The chosen of Nazjatar answer to me. Behold!', 173658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you still fail to comprehend the power I wield? Perhaps a demonstration is in order.', 173657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, my loyal servants, greet our guests. After all, they traveled such a long way to pay us a visit.', 173656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, just in time. This event is being held for your benefit, after all. It will teach you the price for defying me.', 173655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Savor this small victory. It may lessen the bitterness of your inevitable defeat.', 173654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a devoted servant. So willing to die in my name... and so many others eager to take their place.', 173653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another victory... interesting. One day, I may allow you to serve as my champion.', 173652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An impressive display of heroism. Perhaps you will prove worthy of serving me after all.', 173651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here? A champion of Nazjatar versus a defiant outsider. High drama indeed.', 173650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This should be an entertaining test of skill. My chosen champion against... you.', 173649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of my champions seeks to earn glory in my name. It would be cruel of me to deny them this opportunity.', 173648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your refusal to bend the knee offends my loyal subjects. This one wishes to teach you proper respect.', 173647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surely you must realize the futility of resisting me. For each minion you dispatch, two more take its place.', 173646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, thank you. By culling weakness from my ranks, you only make my kingdom stronger.', 173645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This changes nothing. You will kneel, and I will rule.', 173644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such perseverance! A noble trait... that will be bent to serve my will.', 173643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a shame... I was fond of that one. You will, of course, answer for your insolence.', 173642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a disappointing performance from that underling. I must be sure to arrange a more suitable challenge for you.', 173641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Entertain your queen.', 173640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem restless, landwalker. Allow your queen to provide some entertainment.', 173639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My subjects seek to earn my favor by collecting your head. Who am I to refuse their loyalty?', 173638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps your continued survival has made you complacent. A test of your resilience is in order.', 173637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My subjects seldom face a true challenge. You will try to provide them with one, won\'t you?', 173636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My servants are so eager to meet our guests. I do hope you enjoy their... attentions.', 173635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! They don\'t belong here! Keep \'em away from our Azerite!', 'Hey! They don\'t belong here! Keep \'em away from our Azerite!', 173634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! Time for an upgrade...', 'Oof! Time for an upgrade...', 173633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice catch!', 'Nice catch!', 173632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They almost got me...', 'They almost got me...', 173631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow... Thank you...', 'Ow... Thank you...', 173630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! What a headache...', 'Oof! What a headache...', 173629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a dream like this once...', 'I had a dream like this once...', 173628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What strong arms you have...', 'What strong arms you have...', 173627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! Where am I?', 'Oof! Where am I?', 173626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing you do is beyond my sight.', '', 173625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 145146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I call the cursed lovers to enter the stage!', 173623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I doubt we have seen the last of that creature... but we have weakened its hold over the makrura. Excellent work.', 173622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An unseen will commands the makrura of Kal\'methir. Do what you must in order to reveal and destroy it.', 173621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not believe the true entity was destroyed, but at least you weakened its hold over the makrura. Well done.', 173620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An unseen will commands the makrura of Kal\'methir. With the void energy you gather, I will reveal the enemy so you can strike it down.', 173619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
