('Drill Rig DR-CC73 has been activated! It will finish excavating in 1 minute.', '', 173530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your assistance, we can foil my father\'s schemes and save my people.', '', 173529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind him, Prince. Me and my crew are willin\' to lend a hand. Just tell us what needs doin\' and we\'ll do it!', '', 173528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An oxymoron from a proxy moron...', '', 173525, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
