('Uh, yeah, that\'s why we came out here, too. Sign us up!', '', 173522, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 133153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course we\'ll join your cause, Prince Erazmin. That\'s why we\'re here!', 173521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
