('', 'I could use another spanner, here!', 173517, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali tugs hard against the reins. She seems to want you to turn around.', 'The Child of Torcali tugs hard against the reins. She seems to want you to turn around.', 173516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
