('', 'Kneel before your queen!', 173504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 133383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Good, we\'ll take the first sub over with a small group. Everyone else on standby for word to join us.', '', 173503, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Sub\'s all loaded for the first trip. Plenty more supplies and laborers on their way.', '', 173502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right! Let\'s get this show on the... uh... sea!', '', 173501, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 133172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 173500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now all of Orgrimmar drinks the blood of N\'Zoth, twisting the Horde into a frenzied war machine.', '', 173499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 145032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Driven mad by N\'Zoth\'s whispers, Thrall believes that the elements warn him of a disaster that only the Old God can prevent.', '', 173498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 145031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Spare no expense, $p. I want only the best.', '', 173497, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 133170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s see... yeah, Zuldazar should have everything we need.', '', 173496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My favor is yours. Do not fail me.', 173495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you command, my queen.', 173494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not disappoint you, my queen.', '', 173493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am weary of this farce. Obey my edicts or suffer the consequences.', 173492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Told you it would be.', 173491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one, Ricket. This boat\'s a beaut.', '', 173490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those supplies on the sub! Move it!', '', 173489, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 132933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spell Stealing', 'Spell Stealing', 173488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to receive the gift of the dragonflights.', 'I\'m ready to receive the gift of the dragonflights.', 173487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can hear Azeroth still in pain. We have tae help her!', '', 173486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything explodes if you throw it hard enough! Ha ha ha ha ha!', 173484, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice try, ya lil\' booger. I\'ll handle anything that explodes. You carry the rest.', 173483, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure thing, sis. I\'ll start with your secret dynamite stockpiles. Where are they?', 173482, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gazlowe just bought out the shop. Wants everything we got delivered to his crew down in the harbor.', 173481, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quizla, I got a job that\'ll keep you outta my hair for a bit!', 173480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! MOTHER has a new plan tae save Azeroth. Meet us in the Chamber of Heart as soon as ye can!', '', 173478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 173473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Aspects have watched over this world for eons. While there may only be a few of us left, I will do everything in my power to protect Life on Azeroth.', 173472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Alexstrasza. I will do my best to live up to my mother\'s legacy.', 173465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Neither did she. None of the Aspects did. But we rose to the challenge, as will you. Have faith in yourself, Merithra.', 173464, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 134131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know if I possess such strength. Or if I can fulfill the task that lies ahead of me.', 173463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ysera was strong in a way most could not understand. But hers was a strength on which Azeroth depended.', 173462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some believed that as the smallest among us, she was also the weakest. They were wrong.', 173461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We were sisters. The only two of our brood to survive. Inseparable ever since our birth.', 173460, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You knew her before you became Aspects. What was she truly like?', 173459, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 134775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yet she always seemed... distant. As if she were in two places at once.', 173458, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long did my mother lead the green dragonflight as the Aspect of the Dream.', 173457, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right... Well, good luck with that. Gazlowe needs supplies for a big expedition to Mechagon.', 'Right... Well, good luck with that. Gazlowe needs supplies for a big expedition to Mechagon.', 173456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, she met up with that crazy Kil\'rip...\n\n<Shuga looks over her shoulder and shouts loud enough for Quizla to hear.>\n\n...ONE TIME and suddenly she thinks she\'s in the Laughing Skull clan!\n\nShe\'s been insufferable ever since.\n\nDon\'t get me wrong, we sowed plenty of chaos together growing up in Kezan. But we were testing our engineering creations! That chaos had purpose.\n\nNow she\'s just chucking bombs into the wind for no reason except she thinks it\'s funny.\n\nWe ain\'t learning anything from that.', 173455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe needs supplies for a big expedition to Mechagon.', 'Gazlowe needs supplies for a big expedition to Mechagon.', 173454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gazlowe thinks he\'s found Mechagon? He wouldn\'t be the first and I\'d be surprised if he\'s the last.\n\nBut, sure, I\'ll sell him anything he wants! What\'s he lookin\' for?\n\nWe\'ve got explosives, rockets, fasteners, unfasteners, gadgets, wires, Kaja Cola, mystery supply boxes... Whatever you need!\n\nFree shipping on orders over 20 pounds!', 173453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is your sister wearing a Laughing Skull mask?', 'Is your sister wearing a Laughing Skull mask?', 173452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weakness binds you!', 173451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall strike you down!', 173450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been found wanting!', 173449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face my wrath!', '', 173448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quizla! Stop wasting all MY grenades! And get out of my workshop!', 173447, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eye is upon you!', '', 173446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww, I used up all my grenades...', 173445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha ha ha ha ha! Run, sister, run!', 173444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh! Cut it out, you maniac!', 173443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my favor... for now.', 173442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike now, champion! Throw the Javelin!', 173429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 135296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, champion! Hurl the Javelin!', 173428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This pageant grows tiresome. I command you to provide more entertainment.', 173427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful!', '', 173426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mercy!', '', 173425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was skeptical when Ricket proposed a collaboration project, but I must admit her out-of-the-box thinking is refreshing.\n\nI\'m not certain that all of her ideas will withstand my rigorous testing, but I will learn even from the failures.\n\n<Uraka looks at the boat pensively.>\n\nA built-in escape pod... only a goblin would think of that... Ha!', 173424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Initiating teleportation protocol.', 173423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None oppose our queen and live.', '', 173422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... obeyed... her commands...', '', 173421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blood... for the queen...', 173420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
