('I thought I smelled the Banshee\'s stench...', '', 173409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra, there is little our troops can do against the guardian. We shall assault the nearby naga camp to buy you the time you need.', '', 173408, 0, 23504, 1, 64, 0, 135981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, $n, I\'ll meet you and Gazlowe down at the docks. I\'ve got a surprise I think you\'re gonna like!', 173407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\'Course it is, hun. Just like me.', 173406, 0, 0, 17, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... will try not to undo your work. It is truly... unique.', 173405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So few, but we are strong. We must prevail.$b$bAre you ready to begin the assault?', 173404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Sound the advance!', 'I am ready. Sound the advance!', 173403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve no doubt you\'ll find ten ways to improve it before sundown. Do it all, and tell me all about it when I get back.', 173402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it. It will have to do.$b$bAre you ready to begin the assault?', '', 173401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a dream, Uraka, but you\'re gonna have to test drive our beautiful boat without me.', 173400, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Say no more! If Gazlowe found Mechagon, I\'m going with him.', 173399, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, technically, it\'s an oversized spyscope. But yeah, of course I did!\n\nAnd a rotating missile turret, an automated escape pod, an embedded generator, and of course a riveted goblin banner so everyone knows who masterminded all of these brilliant modifications!\n\nUraka was skeptical when I proposed we work together on a new project, but I think we\'ve created something truly amazing together!\n\nMag\'har and goblin tech, together at last!', 173398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mounted a telescope... on a boat?', 'You mounted a telescope... on a boat?', 173397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drill Rig DR-JD41 has been activated! It will finish excavating in 1 minute.', '', 173396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, okay, maybe the Kaja\'Cola vending machine was a bit much. But the rest is golden. We\'re a great team!', 173395, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know...', 173394, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
