('Weekly beach party on Mechagon\'s sandy shore!', 'Weekly beach party on Mechagon\'s sandy shore!', 173333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Robot pup mascot for the crew... and you can name it!', 'Robot pup mascot for the crew... and you can name it!', 173332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The union rep smirks and nods her head.>\n\nNow we\'re gettin\' somewhere. Triple the normal pay... I can sell the crew on that.\n\nLook, everybody on the crew loves Gazlowe. He takes good care of us, so we\'re gonna take care of whatever he needs.\n\nBut I\'m gonna need one more thing to get the whole crew onboard. Somethin\' small, but it\'s gotta be flashy.', 173331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Worthless scum. You are unfit to grovel before my queen.', 173330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you leave the water on purpose?', '', 173329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you breathe like this?', '', 173328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do your limbs feel heavy? I feel heavy every time I get out of this pool!', '', 173327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that the best you can do?', 173326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your tactics are pathetic!', 173325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Queen Azshara!', 173324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, uh, guess I forgot that Gazlowe also authorized hazard pay for the whole crew.', 'I, uh, guess I forgot that Gazlowe also authorized hazard pay for the whole crew.', 173323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tough cookies, sweetcheeks!\n\nYou think YOU\'RE tired after negotiatin\' for two minutes? This CREW\'s tired after working all week!\n\nGazlowe\'s always been good to us, so I don\'t know what he was thinking sendin\' a two-lipped goon like you down with nothin\' but mush for brains.\n\nYou better wise up, or better yet, get outta here and tell Gazlowe to send someone who isn\'t Gallywix\'s brain-twin to talk things through with us.', 173322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 5, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting tired of negotiating...', 'I\'m getting tired of negotiating...', 173321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll grind you into dust.', 173320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your corpses will feed the depths!', 173319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe also authorized hazard pay for the whole crew.', 'Gazlowe also authorized hazard pay for the whole crew.', 173318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That ain\'t gonna be enough this time.\n\nWhat\'s the point of overtime pay if you never get a vacay to spend it on!\n\nNah nah, goldpockets. You and Gazlowe gotta offer up somethin\' special for the crew this time.', 173317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite is mine to wield!', 173316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shatter!', 173315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Break!', 173314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drown like the rats you are!', 173313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now! Strike while she is vulnerable!', 173312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How could I have ever loved someone so weak? Let us hope Arator did not inherit your cowardice.', 173311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agggh!', '', 173310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have always stood between me and the Void.', 173309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria... please... this is madness...', '', 173308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 144348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Oh Bravo, well done my husband.', 173307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] And YOU, little one, should not have meddled in the affairs of a the one true dragonflight!', 173306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you\'ll pay for what you\'ve done to me.', 173305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With me!', '', 173304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should have killed me when you had the chance.', 173303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll have my revenge!', 173302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible!', 173301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward!', '', 173299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to take a drink? Good! Thought so.', '', 173298, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on here?', 'What\'s going on here?', 173297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Jo\'nok glares intently at the nearby blood trolls.>\n\nThey killed Torcali\'s faithful. This one must protect de others.', '', 173296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep the party goin\'!', 'Keep the party goin\'!', 173294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Fired?! You sound like that fat ol\' Gallywix. That cheapskate can\'t keep a good crew like ours on-site for a week!\n\n<The union rep stands up tall and shoves her finger in your chest.>\n\nListen here, cupcake. Gazlowe don\'t run his crews like that.\n\nWe got a union and we got rights!\n\nIf Gazlowe wants us to work, he knows he\'s gotta negotiate with us.\n\nHe wouldn\'t send you here to threaten us. So what are you up to?', 173293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for this. Get your crew on-site right now or you\'re all fired!', 'I don\'t have time for this. Get your crew on-site right now or you\'re all fired!', 173292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe\'s on the same page. He\'s authorized immediate overtime pay.', 'Gazlowe\'s on the same page. He\'s authorized immediate overtime pay.', 173291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The union rep sets her drink down on the table and frowns.>\n\nYeah, I thought you were gonna say that...\n\nListen here, bub. This crew just got done working overtime. They\'re enjoying some well-deserved R&R.\n\nGazlowe\'s gonna have to shatter his whole piggy bank if he expects them back on site so soon.', 173290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashvane spoke with a serpent\'s tongue, but... could she be right? Were we lured to Nazjatar as part of some dark bargain?', 173288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, I lied. Gazlowe\'s authorized overtime pay.', 'Okay, I lied. Gazlowe\'s authorized overtime pay.', 173287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then let\'s party, sweetcheeks!\n\n<The union rep shoves a drink in your face and forces you to drink it while she leads the crew in a chant.>\n\nWoooo!', 173286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just here to party!', 'I\'m just here to party!', 173285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Azerite Area Denial.blp:20|t Lady Ashvane targets you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:296944|h[Arcing Azerite]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Azerite Area Denial.blp:20|t Lady Ashvane targets you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:296944|h[Arcing Azerite]|h|r!', 173284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gave Azshara... what she wanted. N\'Zoth will rise... his madness... comes...', 173283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Puppets... fools. Baited here... to your own slaughter.', 173282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 132515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] With the essence in your possession it is best we return to the chamber. One of my children will ensure you arrive safely.', 173281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this true power?', 173280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How long I\'ve waited for that.', 173279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That information isn\'t mine to give at this time.\n\nYou have your hands full as it is. Go about your business and you will know more, soon enough.', '', 173277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s an agent of the Black Prince doing here?', 'What\'s an agent of the Black Prince doing here?', 173276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go about your business, champion of Azeroth. You and I have no quarrel.', '', 173275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Light!', '', 173274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dear wife Alleria may be lost, but my son is still in there. I know he lives, I can feel it. Let us do this one last thing together. Let us find him, and free him.', '', 173273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight by my side, stand with me, let us scream with our dying breath that we will never surrender, that we will never stop.', '', 173272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I promise you, soon you will rest.', '', 173271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your bodies are weak, your minds are tired.', '', 173270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Brothers and Sisters of the Light, this is our final hour.', '', 173269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, vermin!', 173268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! I\'ll tear you apart!', 173267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 131771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender to madness!', '', 173266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be consumed by fear!', '', 173265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion. Your actions today have saved the red dragonflight from a terrible fate. For that, I am eternally grateful.', 173264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open your mind!', '', 173263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None', 'None', 173262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in to despair!', '', 173261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can escape N\'Zoth\'s grasp!', '', 173260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your psyche will break!', '', 173259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enlightenment is upon you!', '', 173258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the master\'s truth!', '', 173257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void gathers!', '', 173256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must say, that was a delightfully dramatic entrance.', 173255, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 132239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a Test Drive', 'Take a Test Drive', 173254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose right accessory:', '', 173253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose left accessory:', '', 173252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose back accessory:', '', 173251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose banner:', '', 173250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose mount skin:', '', 173249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mount customization options:', '', 173248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I cannot control its energies on my own.', 173247, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 132249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tidestone\'s power could be used to shatter the barrier...', 173246, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 132248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N\'Zoth... will... rise...', '', 173245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah? What is it?', '', 173243, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s some powerful stuff there!', 'That\'s some powerful stuff there!', 173242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should\'ve run faster.', 'I should\'ve run faster.', 173241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Checking in!', 'Checking in!', 173240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will revel in N\'Zoth\'s glory.', '', 173239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is this happening? I thought we were safe here!', 'Why is this happening? I thought we were safe here!', 173238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I can get back to the others.', 'Thank you. I can get back to the others.', 173237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you understand.', '', 173236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bend to the master\'s will.', '', 173235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end approaches!', '', 173234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, it is safe. I would not leave such a dangerous object in the wrong hands.', '', 173233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the Doomstone?', 'What happened to the Doomstone?', 173232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I felt the world to be in so much turmoil. I can only imagine what Magni, who feels everything that Azeroth feels, is going through.\n\nI hope that these efforts are not too late.', '', 173231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chain Ignitercoils are used in the engines of the most powerful and largest bots. \n\nSalvaged Chain Ignitorcoils can be obtained off the wreckage of such bots.', '', 173230, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is good to hear. We are much stronger when we stand together. Good luck.', '', 173229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know! We\'re doin\' all we can an\' we\'ve enlisted some powerful help.', '', 173228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must hurry. Though the pain of the earth lessens, I fear that there is little time left to save what remains of Azeroth.', '', 173227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 173226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogue', 'Rogue', 173225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde', 'Horde', 173224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothin\' our champion can\'t handle! We\'ll get yer people out o\' there.', '', 173223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance', 'Alliance', 173222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Red', 'Red', 173221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful when you venture deeper into the caverns. Some of us were not able to make it out in time.', '', 173220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purple', 'Purple', 173219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blue', 'Blue', 173218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Green', 'Green', 173217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose Right Accessory', 'Choose Right Accessory', 173216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose Left Accessory', 'Choose Left Accessory', 173215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Chain Ignitercoils?', 'Tell me about Chain Ignitercoils?', 173214, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose Back Accessory', 'Choose Back Accessory', 173213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose Banner', 'Choose Banner', 173212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose Skin', 'Choose Skin', 173211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] [REMOVE]', '', 173210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] [REMOVE]', 173209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But this is our home...', '', 173208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are we going?', 173207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was him or us...', 'It was him or us...', 173206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He... was our friend...', 'He... was our friend...', 173205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a F.E.A.S.T.!', '$n prepares a F.E.A.S.T.!', 173200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Aye. I\'ll be seein\' ye aroun\'... Father.', 173199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] I understand. If it\'s something ye want, it\'s entirely up to ye. I jus\' wanted t\' say it while there was the chance.', 173198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] I don\'t know if that\'s possible, after everything\' that\'s happened, old man.', 173197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Then I promise ye, when this is done an\' we\'ve saved Azeroth. I\'ll put it all down an\' we can be a family again. I miss me grandson. I miss me brothers, ... and ye.', '', 173196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Aye. An\' you bein\' the Speaker don\'t change that. If anythin\' it\'s put ye even farther away from yer family.', 173195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I know we\'re still havin\' our differences, Moira...', '', 173194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] This is more than jus\' a wee incident, Moira. It\'ll take the Heart of the Champion tae heal this.', 173193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT} Yer help isn\'t needed or wanted here, Speaker. The Dark Iron Clan has it under control.', 173192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]We\'ll need the Drag clear to make it through.  Once it\'s safe, we\'ll sneak forward.', 173190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts are taking a huge risk out there. They don\'t have many places left to hide.', '', 173189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re exposed now that all the water\'s gone. The naga have been slithering all over the area.', '', 173188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the deep, dark sea, no one can hear you scream. Trust me...', '', 173187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara may have her legions, but we\'ve got our friends. And they can crush the naga flat.', '', 173186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Came here to chew urchins and kick fin... and I\'m all out of urchins.', '', 173185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Stop poking me, you gormless little snit.', '', 173184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you\'re tough, huh?', '', 173183, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, you glorified sand eel!', '', 173182, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah whatever, you won\'t get the parts to build this anyway!\n\nGood luck finding \'em! When you give up, Cork Stuttguard may sell ya the parts.', '', 173181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever, you\'ll never get the parts to make this anyway!', 'Whatever, you\'ll never get the parts to make this anyway!', 173180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now can I borrow those powercore schematics?', 'Now can I borrow those powercore schematics?', 173179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of these times, you won\'t be so lucky!', '', 173178, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar said you had a vision you wished to share with me?', 'Lor\'themar said you had a vision you wished to share with me?', 173177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of you, stay close. Thrall\'s agents are everywhere.', 173175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 144728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like some Alliance gnomes built a little present for us. My advice? Don\'t accept it.', '', 173174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear dat hissing? Dat\'s de sound of an Alliance siege tank. You hear it get louder, you better run.', '', 173173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out, dose Alliance snakes have a jetpack. Don\'t forget to look up.', '', 173172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loa curse dis robot, all dese sparks are going to set my ship on fire! Come, take dis thing off my hands.', '', 173171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our demolisher is as good as new. Now let\'s show de Alliance what it can do.', '', 173170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Dat jetpack is fired up! Why don\'t you drop in on de Alliance?', '', 173169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s refurbished robot is a walking time bomb. Try leading it away from the ship, would you?', '', 173168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that\'s just great. Our Horde neighbors have a shiny new demolisher! Might want to stay out of its way.', '', 173167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eyes up! Looks like those Horde scoundrels have a jetpack. So... I\'ll be below deck.', '', 173166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some assembly required, but it looks like the jetpack is ready for launch. Good luck! Seriously, you might need it.', '', 173165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just listen to that engine purr! I think it\'s time to take our siege engine out for a spin.', '', 173164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Now that we\'ve rebuilt this robot... you\'re going to blow it up. Preferably close to our enemies, and far from me.', '', 173163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis jetpack can take you into de skies. I think I\'ll stick to de sea. Be on de lookout for dis thing\'s components.', '', 173162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to use a goblin jetpack? Heh, it\'s your funeral. De components should be somewhere on de island.', '', 173161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we want dis demolisher to be of any use, we need to find de parts dat fell off of it. Get to looking.', '', 173160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, our demolisher broke apart in transit from Orgrimmar. De rest of its parts must have washed ashore.', '', 173159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis bucket of bolts can\'t fight, but it can still explode. Gather de gizmos we need to get it up and running.', '', 173158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De goblins say dey can turn dis robot into a bomb. Dey just need a few gizmos to get de job done.', '', 173157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Take this essence and remember that you are not alone.', '', 173156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] The blue flight has watched over the realm of Magic for many ages.', '', 173155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I will see to it that this place does not fall to such disarray in the future.', '', 173154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] The essence was bound within this anomaly. We can meet back in the Chamber of Heart, champion. We will make sure this goes to good use.', '', 173153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May this gift honor the memories of those who came before us.', 173152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though we have suffered great losses, the green dragonflight remains steadfast in our duty to Azeroth.', 173151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
