('It may not look like much, but this scrap heap packs a serious punch. It just needs a few more gizmos first.', '', 173149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe those gnomes sold me an incomplete jetpack! It needs more components if it\'s going to work.', '', 173148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Such instability... bring it down!', '', 173147, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
