('Searching for anything in particular?', 'Searching for anything in particular?', 172543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If someone initiates trouble, holler for me. We look out for each other in the Rustbolt Resistance.', 'If someone initiates trouble, holler for me. We look out for each other in the Rustbolt Resistance.', 172542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
