('Krag\'wa\'s Shrine stands at de northwest corner of de pyramid, near de Terrace of Crafters.', 'Krag\'wa\'s Shrine stands at de northwest corner of de pyramid, near de Terrace of Crafters.', 172521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
