('Gonk\'s shrine is at de base of de stairs on de way to de Terrace of de Speaker.', 'Gonk\'s shrine is at de base of de stairs on de way to de Terrace of de Speaker.', 172519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi\'s shrine can be found on de stairs on de western edge of de pyramid.', 'Bwonsamdi\'s shrine can be found on de stairs on de western edge of de pyramid.', 172518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shrine to Akunda can be found on de stairs to de east of de Great Seal.', 'A shrine to Akunda can be found on de stairs to de east of de Great Seal.', 172517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lastly, you must perform the ritual of binding.', 172516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhh no, what have you done!? Now we are really in trouble!', '', 172515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhhh! This is the end for us!', '', 172514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
