('The Heart o\' Azeroth will be used tae heal this world, Aviana.', '', 172512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such power! Use it wisely, champion.', 172511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
