('Vol\'jin reopened these halls to provide shelter when the Legion invaded.', '', 172491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not walked these halls since we faced Garrosh.', '', 172490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
