('Loa Shrines', 'Loa Shrines', 172483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are weak... soon you will be broken.', 172482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will bow to the power of Queen Azshara!', 172481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mind will belong to us, slave.', 172480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can keep them busy.', 'I can keep them busy.', 172479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Heart Forge unlocked!', '[DNT] Heart Forge unlocked!', 172478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve gotten this far, but the power of Rokhan\'s totem is fading.\n\nSaurfang and I need another way to avoid being noticed.\n\nEven these loyalists know you as a champion of the Horde, $n. Perhaps you could provide a distraction.', '', 172477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly! This way!', 172476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your trials now await you. Peer into the tomes and obtain the knowledge you seek.', '', 172475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must keep moving. Baine\'s time grows short.', '', 172474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water... it\'s coming in. They can\'t hold it out forever.', 'The water... it\'s coming in. They can\'t hold it out forever.', 172473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t believe the lies of others. Read the truth right here!', 'Don\'t believe the lies of others. Read the truth right here!', 172472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t fear the TRUTH! Take some pamphlets!', 'Don\'t fear the TRUTH! Take some pamphlets!', 172471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have some juicy, well-written pamphlets here. All facts verified!', 'We have some juicy, well-written pamphlets here. All facts verified!', 172470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Well is gone. We are all dead now.', 'The Well is gone. We are all dead now.', 172469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our gathering! Help yourself to some pamphlets.', 'Welcome to our gathering! Help yourself to some pamphlets.', 172468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('She won\'t come for us. She betrayed us.', 'She won\'t come for us. She betrayed us.', 172467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wave... the city must be destroyed.', 'That wave... the city must be destroyed.', 172466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no way out. I think we are going to die here.', 'There\'s no way out. I think we are going to die here.', 172465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I gotta run. They need some help down the hill.', 172464, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Queen will save us! Do not lose faith!', '', 172463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain... I was almost gone...', 'The pain... I was almost gone...', 172462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Orgrimmar is besieged! The spirits feel far away...', '', 172461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye understand the essence better than we do, Ebonhorn. We\'d be grateful for any guidance ye can provide.', '', 172459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Draconic presence detected. Designation: Ebyssian, black dragonflight. Lack of Old God corruption indicates low threat probability.', 172458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it\'s good tae meet a black dragon that isn\'t tryin\' tae kill us all! Ebyssian, is it? I\'m Magni Bronzebeard.', '', 172457, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'Rogg smash you bug!', '', 172456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neltharion was once tasked with protecting Azeroth. It is my duty to see the essence carry on that legacy.', '', 172455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did ye recover the essence that MOTHER detected?', '', 172454, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, Speaker Magni. In my tauren form, I am known as Ebonhorn. As the construct said, I am here to help.', '', 172453, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, ye\'re back, champion! And ye brought... a tauren?!', '', 172452, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 134492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go meet Magni.', 'Let\'s go meet Magni.', 172451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An impressive chamber. The world\'s spirit is strong here.\n\nA fitting place for you and Magni to use the essence we acquired in Highmountain.\n\nI am ready to discover what this MOTHER can do, when you are, $n.', '', 172450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Loa save us...', 172449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] We must stand and fight. Are you wit us or against us?', '', 172448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Caution recommended. Readings indicate extreme subterranean instability.', 172447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coordinate designation: Highmountain. Essence origin: Unknown.', 172446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 134498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell for now, little ones.', 172445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali bumps her horn against Torcali\'s snout.', '', 172444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There ye are, champion! We\'ve made repairs to the Chamber of Heart since ye were last here.', '', 172443, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 134496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the spirits...', 'Thank the spirits...', 172442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return him to the soil, $n. I will do the rest.', 172441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show her Roo\'li\'s Remains.>', '<Show her Roo\'li\'s Remains.>', 172440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Torcali stares down at you. Her voice enters your mind.>\n\nYes, small one?', 172439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burying', 'Burying', 172438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s and $n collided, causing a massive eruption!', '%s and $n collided, causing a massive eruption!', 172437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Unstable Resonance expired, causing a massive eruption!', '%s\'s Unstable Resonance expired, causing a massive eruption!', 172436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_DEATHSEMBRACE:20|t|cFFFF0000%s|r begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:293653|h[Unstable Resonance]|h|r!', '', 172435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you stand to be so... dry... all the time?', '', 172434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you\'ll find some that are still able to be saved?', '', 172433, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d recommend looking to the east. There are some rather ferocious yetis around Alpine Rise who like to make meals of the deer there.', '', 172432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For that trial, you need to find a wounded creature and heal it. Of course it will cost you your own life force to do so.', '', 172431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] The spirits heard me. You\'re here!', '', 172430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I supposed to do with the Writ of Sacrifice?', 'What am I supposed to do with the Writ of Sacrifice?', 172429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your trials await you in the books on either side of me. Choose whichever you like.', '', 172428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da elements... da voices...', '', 172424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] You\'re safe now. The Seekers sent me.', '[DNT] You\'re safe now. The Seekers sent me.', 172419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I don\'t know who ta trust. You wit da Seekers?', '', 172418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soothed Faerie Dragon trills in thanks.', '', 172417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soothed Faerie Dragon seems very happy with you!', '', 172416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soothed Faerie Dragon scurries away.', '', 172415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soothed Faerie Dragon wriggles happily!', '', 172414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your frivolous accusations!', '', 172413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul play? How uncouth!', '', 172412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those were my good dice you savage!', '', 172411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean you won\'t take my action?', '', 172410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, $r. Might I interest you in some of de finest cloth you\'ll ever see?$b$bOr do you wish to learn how to turn dis cloth into powerful equipment?', '', 172409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey dere, $gbruddah:sistah;, you lookin\' to be makin\' some sweet tings outta leather?$b$bWell den, look no furder. I be de best trainer in all dese parts.', '', 172408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s up, $c? You lookin\' to make things blow up harder than Silithus?$b$bWell then look no further. I\'m the goblin who can make all your explosive dreams come true!$b$bWhy don\'t you have a look?', '', 172407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] You\'re safe now. The Seekers sent me.', '[DNT] You\'re safe now. The Seekers sent me.', 172406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
