('[DNT] I could hear her crying when they started...', '', 172385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! They took Mak! She was trying to save me!', '', 172384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 134320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
