('Poen and Mak... in danger... help them!', '', 172381, 0, 68986, 1, 64, 0, 131994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense much anger and frustration among those gathered here today. In my homeland, we saw such feelings manifest into very real threats after we spent too much time and energy suppressing them.\n\nBaine had to act, lest his anger turn into a greater threat to the Horde. \n\nWe should all take a lesson from this.', '', 172380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your techniques are quite flawed.', '', 172379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few of you would benefit from cranial mechanization.', '', 172378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was also my friend. I\'ll miss her.', 172377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nelu was always a strong fighter.', 172376, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 135487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali nudges the Sickened Travel Beast with her horn.', '', 172375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Her body is cut and burned. Her feet and knuckles are torn. $B$BThe area has been disturbed by recent activity.>', 172374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Mak clicks her claws and whistles in gratitude.>', '', 172373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, small land friend!', '', 172372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought freedom would not come.', '', 172371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cloud in my head is gone!', '', 172370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you for this!', 'I owe you for this!', 172369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131663, 131664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga will never take me again!', 'The naga will never take me again!', 172368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131661, 131662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m myself again!', 'I\'m myself again!', 172367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131659, 131660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
