('', 'I\'m also wondering if Zukashi was waiting for me to use dose bubbles so he could see me like dis. He always had a childish side to him.', 172365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, I think I need a bath.', 172364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay den. I guess dose weren\'t de right ingredients. Process of elimination and all dat, right, $n?', 172363, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was always childish, and now I wonder if he had been waiting for me to try and use those bubbles just to witness this outcome.', '', 172362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, it would be just like Quintin to use an ingredient that could result in such an outcome.', '', 172361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, if at first you don\'t succeed, try, try again. Right? At the very least we\'re eliminating the wrong ingredients from the list.', '', 172360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
