('Do you have anything there that can aid my beast?', '', 172355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, what\'s that in your pocket?$b$bIs that one of my transmuting stones?! Oh man, which one did you get?$b$b<You show the stone to Silas.>$b$bHaha, yea, that\'s a fun one. I think I even tried to sell the recipe for those once...$b$bWell, I hope you enjoy it! And don\'t forget to peruse my carnival. It has wonders you\'ve only seen in your dreams!', '', 172354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess... I just miss Hati, if I\'m being honest with ye. That boy\'s got a heart of gold if I\'ve ever seen one.', '', 172353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
