('', 'I\'m so happy to see you here, Archdruid!\n\nWhen I first heard the stories of Mechagon, I was worried it might be beyond saving.\n\nBut, if you\'re here, I know nature is not lost.\n\nTogether, we will restore nature\'s power here and save all of the teeny tiny creatures!', 172257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I first heard the stories of Mechagon, I was worried it might be beyond saving.\n\nBut, I can still feel nature here, underneath the rubble and wreckage.\n\nWe must restore it, so all the teeny tiny creatures can be safe!', 172256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
