('Jump! Bounce!', '', 172227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rarrr!', '', 172226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smashed real good...', '', 172225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smashing time!', '', 172224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... still my carrots...', '', 172223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth rages against you. How can you protect it?', '', 172222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Carrots!', '', 172221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move it or lose it. Hold the energy cell up to the charger.', 172219, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous idea, dear brother.', 172218, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold up. Let me back up before you electrocute yourself.', '', 172217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately that\'s all the time I have. I must be off now. It was a pleasure to meet you!', 172216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, this is an interesting time. Let\'s see, judging by your clothes I should be around...\n\nYes, that period. Excellent! Well, fellow tailor, if you\'re interested in more than just my company, perhaps you\'d like to see some recipes I have for sale?\n\nAnd don\'t worry, I won\'t take all your gold. I mostly deal in cloth trading.', 172215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali runs toward the smell of food.', '', 172214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The generator\'s back online!', '', 172213, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Wait it wasn\'t just a regular wolf! It was... uh...', 172212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Tread carefully. The Stonemother will be watching...', '', 172211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] We\'ve got you surrounded! Your bunny murdering days are over!', '', 172210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purifying', 'Purifying', 172209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] It was time to avenge the bunnies.', 172208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Through our incredible detective skills and our unending resilience, we finally tracked down and cornered the murderer.', 172207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s talk about something else.', 'Let\'s talk about something else.', 172206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ysera, the Dreamer, lost her life in Val\'sharah after she was corrupted by the Nightmare.\n\nIn the end, it seemed as if Elune welcomed her spirit with open arms. I pray she is at peace.', 172205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Ysera?', 'Where is Ysera?', 172204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See, dear brother? I told you our test subject would survive.', 172203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali munches contentedly.', '', 172202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali trots happily back into its pen.', '', 172201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are holding my master in a cave not far from here.', '', 172200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Azshara and her minions have no respect for the elements.', '', 172199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is the Lord of Blackrock!', '', 172198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Fine... but you better make me look cool!', '', 172197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Alright Arthur. I found this clue. It\'s only fair I tell the story!', 172196, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements are on our side, $c.', '', 172195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Arthur! I found something!', 172194, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] You couldn\'t have done it without me! I had to find you!', '', 172193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] No way Arthur, that was my clue fair and square. You were too busy pretending to talk to squirrels, while I did the work!', 172192, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] At that moment, I heard Thisalee call out. She must have found a clue that only I, Azeroth\'s greatest detective, could investigate and understand!', '', 172191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, champion! The source of the corruption! Destroy it!', 172190, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 134792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I-whoa... Oh, that was much more draining than I imagined. I must rest for a bit.', '', 172189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is my fault. I should have done something to stop it sooner.', 172188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] But now it festers within the Void\'s grasp. Soon all of the Dream will be engulfed in darkness.', 172187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mother used to seek respite here. The Void threatens to engulf everything she loved.', 172186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to return to the Emerald Dreamway.', 'I need to return to the Emerald Dreamway.', 172185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good choice. Red\'s the fastest color.', '', 172184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I need to go deeper into the Emerald Dream.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I need to go deeper into the Emerald Dream.', 172183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I\'m ready to go deeper into the Emerald Dream.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I\'m ready to go deeper into the Emerald Dream.', 172182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have a mechanocat.', 'I don\'t have a mechanocat.', 172178, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... You\'ve got to get one. Everyone has to have a mechanocat! \n\nI\'d talk to Pascal-K1N6 right away about making one. ...Szzt', '', 172177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the ritual.', 'Begin the ritual.', 172176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And by \"attracted to,\" he means they\'ll eat you if your light\'s on!', '', 172168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of whale sharks. They seem to be attracted to glowing lights.', '', 172167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He means talk to me and I\'ll give you some cool doohickeys once you have enough research notes.', '', 172166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your voluntary participation in this experiment will be compensated with incentives.', '', 172165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cool, huh? Oh, and Edgar is our submarine.', '', 172164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will receive notes directly from your helmet into your backpack.', '', 172163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring those creatures here and Edgar will research them.', '', 172162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can\'t you just say \"glowing\" like a normal person?', '', 172161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve identified three unique species of luminescent creatures in this vicinity.', '', 172160, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough... I yield. You... are worthy.', '', 172159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s dead. Where\'s my payment?', 'He\'s dead. Where\'s my payment?', 172158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s nothing but a smear across the desert. A tiny smear. A series of microscopic bits spread across the sand. He\'s 100% dead. I got this really awful sunburn looking for all the pieces. And when I found them I blew them up again. Yep. He\'s dead. Really, really dead.', 'He\'s nothing but a smear across the desert. A tiny smear. A series of microscopic bits spread across the sand. He\'s 100% dead. I got this really awful sunburn looking for all the pieces. And when I found them I blew them up again. Yep. He\'s dead. Really, really dead.', 172157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what I like to hear! Nice doin\' business with ya, $p.', '', 172156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! $N!\nYou take care of that bad investment, Grizzek Fizzwrench?\n\nDon\'t spare any of the details! Come on, spill!', '', 172155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell him to run if  he\'s gettin\' too close!', '', 172154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never get involved in political engineering! Never!', '', 172153, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And uh, thank Gazlowe for me? I owe him one, so I\'m gonna pay it with some advice for you to pass along.', '', 172152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, you never saw us!', 172151, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Saffy!', '', 172150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to target, approximately twenty seconds.', '', 172149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Signal Re-established.', '', 172148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Signal disrupted. Error 37. Compensating.', '', 172147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempting to compensate.', '', 172146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Signal degradation. Atmospheric disturbances detected.', '', 172145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! $p! Over here!', '', 172144, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, I\'ll pay double!', '', 172143, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for maximum pain!', 'Time for maximum pain!', 172142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better run!', 'You better run!', 172141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For flat out speed, I\'ll take a mechanocat any day!', 'For flat out speed, I\'ll take a mechanocat any day!', 172140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Ha ha ha ha HA HA HA HA!', '', 172139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Lemonade Steel.', 'Paint my mechanocat Lemonade Steel.', 172138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hungry Lasher wants you for its next meal!', '', 172137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It must be hungry! Feed it as many seaflies as you can be the Ravenous timer runs out!', '', 172136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Hungry Lasher sprouts up through the soil!', '', 172135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alrighty, boys! Our investment has paid off! Let\'s find our next score.', '', 172134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Copper Trim.', 'Paint my mechanocat Copper Trim.', 172133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remove all paint.', 'Remove all paint.', 172132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Overload Orange.', 'Paint my mechanocat Overload Orange.', 172131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, boys, we got paid! First pint is on me.', '', 172130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Mechagon Gold.', 'Paint my mechanocat Mechagon Gold.', 172129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Fel Mint Green.', 'Paint my mechanocat Fel Mint Green.', 172128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Battletorn Blue.', 'Paint my mechanocat Battletorn Blue.', 172127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paint my mechanocat Fireball Red.', 'Paint my mechanocat Fireball Red.', 172126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you do here?', 'What do you do here?', 172125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... No one likes a boring cat. I can add flair and color to your mechanocat mount, making you the proverbial \"cat\'s meow\". \n\nBring any Paint Vials you find to me, and I will add them to the choices of colors available for your mechanocat ...Szzt', '', 172124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... Your presence here is an unexpected pleasure ...Szzt', '', 172123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The NRG-100 uses an energy cell to recharge.', 'The NRG-100 uses an energy cell to recharge.', 172122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must secure the essence. Its powers should be used for the betterment of Azeroth. \n\nWill you help me?', '', 172121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth will break you!', '', 172120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. We accept your challenge!', '', 172119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then face me, and prove you have the strength to do so.', '', 172118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free of my father\'s madness. We seek to wield the essence in defense of Azeroth!', '', 172117, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 133461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you, dragon. Kin of the Worldbreaker. You are unworthy of such power.', '', 172116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stone lord! I am Ebonhorn, protector of Highmountain. We have come to claim the essence you now hold!', '', 172115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bondo painted his gold!', 'Bondo painted his gold!', 172114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blue finish is a classic!', 'The blue finish is a classic!', 172113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void... is inevitable. Let me rest...', '', 172112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like that cat\'s seen some action!', 'Looks like that cat\'s seen some action!', 172111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us continue our mission.', 'Let us continue our mission.', 172110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You going to add some racing stripes?', 'You going to add some racing stripes?', 172109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for the naga to hang on our walls.', '', 172108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 133654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to paint mine, Fel Mint Green!', 'I\'m going to paint mine, Fel Mint Green!', 172107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bots are going to notice this red paint job!', 'Bots are going to notice this red paint job!', 172106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no! It is not yet my time. You have my thanks!', '', 172105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope... I wish only to sleep...', '', 172104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever happens, I stand by your side, Life-Binder.', 'Whatever happens, I stand by your side, Life-Binder.', 172103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have prevented them from laying claim to the Redoubt, but I fear this is merely the beginning of their assault.', 172102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jo\'nok answers de call of de queen of de Zandalari.\n\nWhat do you want, small thing?', '', 172100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at all these tomes! Scrolls! Books!\n\nI knew the Zandalari to be a sophisticated people, but there\'s enough here to keep me reading for decades!\n\nOl\' Torga was right, as usual. Strange adventures always make the best stories.\n\nI can\'t wait to see what happens next!', '', 172099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Bladeguard Kaja is deep in conversation with General Rakera.>', 172098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<General Rakera is deep in conversation with Bladeguard Kaja.>', 172097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De winds of change are blowing. Can you feel it in de air?', '', 172096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $n!\n\nWhile Queen Talanji toils away at de long task of restoring our empire, de Zanchuli Council has been asked to see that de faithful of Zandalar give her de time to do so.\n\nThere are still whispers of doubt among de priesthood, but in time they will see Talanji\'s worth as a leader. I already have.', 172095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May de light of de loa shine upon you, $n.', 172094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As my father would say, it is good to be queen.\n\nI miss him every day. In de past I wondered how I could measure up to de example he set. Now, I am beginning to understand that even de oldest and wisest of us cannot foresee all that will come to pass. Not even a prophet like Zul.\n\nDe road ahead is uncertain, but de Zandalari will rise to meet de changes to come.\n\nThat much, I am certain of.', 172093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand beside our ancestors and accept their aid!', '', 172092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there! Our ancestors give us strength!', '', 172091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know my sister did not set me on this task to sit around and drink up all of Stormwind\'s ale.\n\nSoon, very soon, we\'ll be taking the fight to the Horde. The sea calls, as it always does.', '', 172088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, $n.\n\nShe\'s got some beautiful artillery, this city. I can see how she\'s stood so long. \n\nReminds me of home, really.', '', 172087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just hope we aren\'t left here like decorations, $n.\n\nI\'ve got some harpoons meant just for our friends in the Horde.', 172086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready.', 172085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, $n!\n\nI had hoped you would stop by sometime. Things are quiet around here without Dorian.\n\nOh, don\'t get me wrong, I enjoy a little quiet. I can always walk down to Brennadam if I fancy a conversation. My old lady was never much for idle chatter anyway.\n\nShe said she would visit soon. That will be nice.\n\n<Sal hums cheerily as he returns to his gardening.>', '', 172084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragon essence... earthen magic... lesser races... must prove worth ... says Earthmother.', '', 172083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It used to be that to be a tidesage was to sail the world. I am eager to see where these strange new currents take us.', '', 172082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thomas Zelling has... had... a family in life. He made me promise to keep them safe, even after they called him a monster and shunned him for being undead. It is a promise I will continue to keep.\n\nIf they ever ask how he met his fate, I will tell them that he died a hero.\nWe Forsaken are raised with free will. That\'s what separates us from the Scourge. Sylvanas Windrunner used to take pride in that distinction. \n\nBut after all I have seen in this war, I must wonder if that still holds true.', 172081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, Tirion Fordring sacrificed everything to spare my life as a matter of honor. Baine has done much the same. Are we now to punish him for it?\n\nI fear the Horde is becoming what we once hated, $c. And I do not like it.', '', 172080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You see what happened to Baine? To Zelling? That\'s why we need to lay low, keep our heads down, follow the warchief\'s lead. At least for now.\n\nBaine\'s mistake wasn\'t acting against Sylvanas. His mistake was acting too soon.', 172079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are others who must hear of this, $n. \n\nAnd they will.', '', 172078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this what the Horde stands for? Imprisoning those who act with compassion and honor?\n\nPerhaps my people should have never left Highmountain...', 172077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our rebellion against Elisande was just, and it earned me a blade in the back. I pray Baine does not meet a similar fate.\n\nThe nightborne are still new to the Horde. Perhaps I should seek Lor\'themar\'s council. He understands what my people have endured, and I have learned much through our conversations.', 172076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She is no orc, but the warchief shows strength by punishing that tauren who deceived and betrayed her. \n\nThose who lack loyalty also lack honor.', 172075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without de Horde beside us, my people would now be at de mercy of de Alliance. We owe much to de warchief... but we will not follow her blindly. \n\nBaine Bloodhoof has shown honor and respect to de Zandalari. He must be given a chance to face his accusers and answer for dis supposed crime.', 172074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be some bad juju, mon. Da Horde gotta stick together if we gonna win dis war... but Sylvanas... she not be makin\' dat easy. \n\nAnd dis just gonna throw more fuel on da fire.', '', 172073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot fault Baine\'s heart, even if his actions were drastic. Through this act of defiance, he exposed a schism in the Horde that has been growing since the attack on Teldrassil.\n\nI fear that by openly opposing Sylvanas, he may have put his own people at risk. As mine would be, were I to side with him.\n\nThese are perilous times. We must be cautious... and deliberate.', '', 172072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I didn\'t see that comin\'! \n\nWish I\'d known things were gonna heat up this much. I coulda charged DOUBLE for admission!', '', 172071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stone lord from Deepholm? This is worse than I feared. Their kind still harbors enmity toward the black dragonflight.', '', 172070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... Continued operation failing, deliver soon ...Szzt', '', 172068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt... Limited operational lifetime ...Szzt', '', 172067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Harvest Festival has long been part of tauren tradition. I urge you to take time and honor your ancestors.', '', 172066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Carnivorous Lasher is ready for its next meal!', '', 172065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until we meet again, brave $p. Earth Mother guide you.', 172064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It warms my heart to witness all that you have accomplished. I eagerly await your next adventure.', 172063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is the duty of every tauren to observe these rites. The spirits rely on us to fulfill this ancient calling.', 172062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our rituals and traditions serve a sacred purpose. They preserve the balance between our realms.', 172061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, we meet again. I see that you continue to honor the old ways.', 172060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
