('', 'You take good care of Feathers, $p!', 172051, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, right. We\'re all packed, pookie. Ready to go when you are.', '', 172050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should really be going. Gallywix\'s goons could find us at any moment!', 172049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, thanks for not blabbing to Gallywix for me.', '', 172048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll be in touch. Maybe. Possibly.', 172047, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, richmon.\n\nJani will watch this new queen very closely. De likes of her do not worship de likes of me, but where gold glitters, refuse lurks not far behind it.\n\nThose that Talanji leaves behind will find me, in good time.\n\nUntil then, richmon.', '', 172046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
