('', 'I fear that even if Azeroth is saved, my brothers and sisters of the green dragonflight are doomed. \n\nStill, we will do everything in our power to help save our world.', 172033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must enter the Dreamway before the rest of my flight is lost. Speak to me when you are ready.', 172032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother... If only you were here to guide me...', 172031, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 134787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
