('Is there no one left to test me?', '', 171920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Oh, I bet we could find a use for these!', 171919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see ya, kid.', 171918, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 135407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the power of Gillbrack!', '', 171917, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are more fish here than I can catalogue!\n\nThe conditions here have caused a large number of mutations in the fish population. If you catch anything unusual, bring it to me to study.\n\nIf you help me enough, I will reward you with a pair of my Secret Fish Goggles.', 171916, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the fish here.', 'Tell me about the fish here.', 171915, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a winner! Against all odds, $p has won the Roadrash Race!', 171912, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, little one!', '', 171911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
