('Here are all the locations I\'ve found to which you may safely be transported.', '', 171869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to know where you can take me.', 'I\'d like to know where you can take me.', 171868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your bidding?', '', 171867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
