('Can I use the Minnow Vac?', 'Can I use the Minnow Vac?', 171851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth is alive with more fish than you could imagine.', 171850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the rat. Get \'em boys.', '', 171849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finished! Here you go.', '', 171848, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have this done for you quick, $n!', '', 171847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found another chapter?! Lucky for you, I haven\'t returned dose books yet!', '', 171846, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to purchase Sheza\'s Rare Hides for:', 'Do you want to purchase Sheza\'s Rare Hides for:', 171843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sheza told me you were asking for 1,000.', 'Sheza told me you were asking for 1,000.', 171842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... and now to etch the runes of power into the bones.\"', 171841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 657, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... There\'s still some meat on these scales. A lime bath should clean that up.', 171840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I asked politely.', 'I asked politely.', 171839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There may be blood on the Horde\'s hands, but there is no purpose in washing them until the Alliance is shattered.', '', 171838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level X)|r Do not press button.', '|cFF0000FF(Level X)|r Do not press button.', 171837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEVEL INFINITY', '', 171836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I\'m going to start soaking these so they\'ll be ready when we need them.', 171810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('------------------------------$bHEXSWEEPER CHAMPION$b------------------------------$b\nThe console\'s central display winks, flashes, and whirrs. Two eyes and a smile appear where once there was promise of certain death.$b$bA cheerful tune plays. It sounds like that song you can\'t get out of your head. For a single frame, the image flashes. Was that a skull and crossbones? Unlikely. The activation console is your friend.$b$bChoose your difficulty. Enjoy the game.', '', 171809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Warning! Curse of Flesh detected!', '', 171808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never forget Teldrassil, friend.$b$bWe will hold the Horde accountable for the havoc they\'ve caused.$b$bAlso, don\'t touch Gouge\'s drink. If you\'re lucky, he\'ll only break your hand.', 171807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level 5)|r Begin the game.', '|cFF0000FF(Level 5)|r Begin the game.', 171806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level 4)|r Begin the game.', '|cFF0000FF(Level 4)|r Begin the game.', 171805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level 3)|r Begin the game.', '|cFF0000FF(Level 3)|r Begin the game.', 171804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level 2)|r Begin the game.', '|cFF0000FF(Level 2)|r Begin the game.', 171803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to my shop, $c.$b$bAre you interested in my wares, or would you like to learn how to cut dem yourself?', 171802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And here you are, $n. De translation of your journal. Quite de page-turner if you ask me.', '', 171801, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? Yes! Dat\'s it! Now where are my empty books at...? Ah, here\'s one.', '', 171800, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OH! So DAT\'S what dat rune is. Interesting...', '', 171799, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got dem all?! Exellent work, $n. Now to translate dis journal.', '', 171798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, patron. I\'m a procurer of exotic wares from the great north!$b$bCome, have a look!', '', 171797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And here you go. Please be careful with it, it\'s very old.', 171796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it is!', 171795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yes, I believe it\'s here somewhere...', 171794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the racetrack!', 'Return to the racetrack!', 171783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna need an A-7 Torque wrench for that!', 'You gonna need an A-7 Torque wrench for that!', 171769, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could fix that for ya.', 'I could fix that for ya.', 171768, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What gnome gave ya that idea?', 'What gnome gave ya that idea?', 171767, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t listen to him!', 'Don\'t listen to him!', 171766, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it gonna move without explosives?', 'How\'s it gonna move without explosives?', 171765, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gotta connect the oscillator to the round thingie!', 'Ya gotta connect the oscillator to the round thingie!', 171764, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it with a hammer!', 'Hit it with a hammer!', 171763, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know ogres smarter than you!', 'I know ogres smarter than you!', 171762, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way that\'s gonna work!', 'No way that\'s gonna work!', 171761, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya call yourselves engineers?', 'Ya call yourselves engineers?', 171760, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing it wrong!', 'You\'re doing it wrong!', 171759, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali nuzzles you affectionately.', '', 171758, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali presses its sticky maw into your hands and grunts happily.', '', 171757, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali enthusiastically chows down on the fruit!', '', 171756, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pet the direhorn.>', '<Pet the direhorn.>', 171755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_FOOD_106_FJORDPEACH.BLP:16|t |Hitem:167553:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0|h|cFFFFFFFF[Juicy Mango]|h|r>', '<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_FOOD_106_FJORDPEACH.BLP:16|t |Hitem:167553:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0|h|cFFFFFFFF[Juicy Mango]|h|r>', 171754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the fruit.>', '<Take the fruit.>', 171753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My loa is not one for shining temples and glittering effigies. We are told all of Zandalar is her temple, and all who walk de world are her charges. \n\nDe Great Mother, de Wanderer, de Mountain Dat Walks, de Bulwark, are all names she recognizes. I am a humble servant of de loa of bounty, and my desire is to see dis little one thrive.\n\nI hope you and I will work together toward dis end, hm?', 171752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Small things like your little one are usually raised with their siblings and cousins in a wide field of their relatives.\n\nI understand why she is alone, but perhaps there is more we can do to help her feel better.\n\nI happened to pick some juicy fruit as I walked from de city dis morning. \n\nPerhaps dat will cheer her?', 171751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Perhaps something from outside the Dreamgrove killed the bunnies!', '', 171750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] I found a single pawprint, leading from a portal into the water...', '', 171749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to kill me? You first!', '', 171748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'alah belore!', '', 171747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not cut out for this.', '', 171746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got... lucky.', '', 171745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious kill!', '', 171744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valiant effort.', '', 171743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to test me?', '', 171742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you sift through the remains, you find what appears to be some sort of core, shattered in two, with several small pieces of what look like the jewel you\'re after.$b$bIt would seem whoever made these constructs was using the very same jewel that the shrine was made out of.', '', 171741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_RaptorBaby_red.blp:16|t |Hitem:167553:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0|h|cFFFFFFFF[Squeaky Raptor]|h|r>', '<The Child of Torcali wiggles excitedly at the sight of the Squeaky Raptor.>', 171740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali wiggles excitedly at the sight of the Squeaky Raptor.>', '', 171739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Oh no I can\'t, that actually didn\'t help at all.', '', 171737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Whoa, Arthur. I didn\'t know you could talk to squirrels!', 171736, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1,250 Gold.$b$bLast chance, $r. What will it be?$b$bBusiness or a burial?', '', 171735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, no no no. That\'s not setting a good example for the young ones!', 171733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. I\'ve seen worse... but I\'m sure you can do better.', 171732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeak.', 'Squeak.', 171731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Squeakity squeak squeak!\n\nSqueaker squeak, squeaking squeaky squeak. Squeaken squeaking squeak!\n\nSqueaken?', '', 171730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your line work is impressing the children. Look at their little eyes light up!', 171729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeak squeaker, squeak squeaken!', 'Squeak squeaker, squeak squeaken!', 171728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Squeaky squeak. Squeaken... squeak?', '', 171727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Obviously somebody stepped on it, Thisalee. It was the perp!', '', 171726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Arthur... I\'m pretty sure somebody just stepped on it.', 171725, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Splendid job! You know, if this adventuring business doesn\'t work out, you\'d make an excellent school teacher.', 171724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] This stick was no ordinary stick. It was broken in half and torn up on the edges. It had to be a clue!', '', 171723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before a young tortollan can inscribe their first scroll, they need to practice their basic shapes. Can you show these little ones how it\'s done?', 171722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another turtle made it to the water!', 171721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All creatures in nature must live together in balance. But I can\'t help cheering for the little turtles!', 171720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These tiny crabs need help! I hate to see any living thing suffer. Would you be willing to lend a hand?', 171719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to purchase Telonis\' Rare Hides for:', 'Do you want to purchase Telonis\' Rare Hides for:', 171718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come de morning, she will be eager to see you again. Try not to disappoint her, yes?', 171717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, dis is not another enchanted sleep.', 171716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be here if you have questions, though de duty of raising dis little one is entirely yours.', 171715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have come to ensure dat my loa\'s child is properly cared for.', 171714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. I am Li\'zal, priestess of Torcali.', 171713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was wondering if de Great Wanderer would intervene.', 171712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a rip-off!', 'That\'s a rip-off!', 171711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, I\'ll buy them.', 'Sure, I\'ll buy them.', 171710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry you feel that way.$b$bBoys, try to avoid making a mess. I don\'t want to have to relocate again.', '', 171709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, boys! We\'re done here.$b$bLet us head to the finest swillpeddler to celebrate our good fortunes!', '', 171708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The Hard Way\".', '\"The Hard Way\".', 171707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, how much to buy them?', 'Fine, how much to buy them?', 171706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Feisty.$b$bLook, you seem like a nice $r, so I\'ll give you one do-over. Think about your answer carefully.$b$bMy boys have been looking for a good scrap, and this is not something worth getting yourself killed over.$b$bHow do you want to do this?', '', 171705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the skins or the world has a few less thieves to worry about.', 'Give me the skins or the world has a few less thieves to worry about.', 171704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic! I told this bunch of reprobates that there are still good, decent people in the world.$b$b<He takes your coin as he holds out a small silver key.>$b$bA genuine pleasure doing business with you, my $ggood sir:dear;.$b$bI do hope all of your endeavors can be as painless and fruitful as this.', '', 171703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh! Now THIS I like! Someone who understands business practices, and is willing to act like a proper $ggentleman:lady;.$b$bI was going to charge more for the hassle, but since you\'re being so... diplomatic, I\'m gracious enough to come down somewhat.$b$b1,250 gold. If you\'ve got the coin, you get some priceless skins, and we\'ll be on our merry way.$b$bWhat do you say?', '', 171702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t need to make this violent. I just want to buy the skins.', 'We don\'t need to make this violent. I just want to buy the skins.', 171701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
