('', 'Wherever the Great Hunt leads you, may our gifts remind you of your tribe and your home. Walk with the Earth Mother, $p.', 171691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Balance has been restored, and I must bid you farewell. But the spirits will always watch over you.', 171690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
