('', 'Some of us are still wanderers at heart. You have done much in your travels to honor your ancestors.', 171688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people once lived as nomads. It was not long ago that we settled in these lands.', 171687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While I\'d love to hear more, I really would like to get that codex and be on my way.', 'While I\'d love to hear more, I really would like to get that codex and be on my way.', 171686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very much so! And then the naga came over and asked how he was feeling. And do you know what he said to her? \n\n<The tortollan pulls out the book and thumbs through the pages. He clears his throat and begins to recite from the book.>\n\n\"For a moment I thought I was rescued, but staring into those eyes of yours I\'m apparently still lost at sea.\" And then she flirts back with him!\n\nA naga and a human, conversing and cajoling each other. This is the reason why fiction is so fun to read, wouldn\'t you agree?', '', 171685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s crazy! A naga?!', 'That\'s crazy! A naga?!', 171684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] I\'m going to take wing and do an aerial search for any clues. You check down here!', 171683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
