('[DNT] There we were, no witnesses to the carnage of a murder in the Dreamgrove.', '', 171680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Later he wakes up on the shores of a rather large island. His wounds were wrapped in seaweed and not too far off he could hear the most beautiful voice humming a song. \n\nWhen he looked up to see who it was, well, this would never happen in real life but it was a naga!', '', 171679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
