('By all means, don\'t assess the situation, you halfwit! Just jump into the fray!', '', 171544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why yes, I did. And quite the read it is.$b$bHowever, I came across other books as well. One you may be more interested in as it contains a tale of heartbreak and adventure!$b$bThe protagonist is this man, \"Marcus\" and it follows his tale as he woos women, and travels the world!$b$bIt\'s quite a naughty read.', '', 171543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was told you came across an ancient earthen codex in your recent travels. Could I please borrow it?', 'I was told you came across an ancient earthen codex in your recent travels. Could I please borrow it?', 171542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adventure awaits, young one.', '', 171541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do! But, and I mean no disrespect, I speak in coin if you catch my drift?$b$bFor the right price, they\'re all yours.', '', 171540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for some scrolls you may have?', 'I\'m looking for some scrolls you may have?', 171539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, patron. I\'m a procurer of exotic wares from the great north!$b$bCome, have a look!', '', 171538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will leave the Horde in ruins!', '', 171537, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You betray the Horde!', '', 171536, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we nothing more than pawns in your game?', '', 171535, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I returned Derek Proudmoore to his family.', '', 171534, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He had help. Didn\'t he...', 171533, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems there are traitors in our midst.', 171532, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And here you go. Please be careful with it, it\'s very old.', 171531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it is!', 171530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yes, I believe it\'s here somewhere...', 171529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a book you have on runes and carvings. Could I borrow it?', 'I\'m looking for a book you have on runes and carvings. Could I borrow it?', 171528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali makes the kibble disappear and then stares expectantly up at you.', '', 171527, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali devours the food out of your hands, then snuffles around for more.', '', 171526, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali eats so quickly that bits are scattered everywhere. She looks up at you and trumpets for more.', '', 171525, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Child of Torcali munches on the kibble then immediately searches your hands for more.', '', 171524, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali inhales the kibble, then looks up at you expectantly.', '', 171523, 0, 68315, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali yawns and settles down for yet another nap.', '', 171521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali searches your hands for something to eat.>', '', 171520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali wiggles at the sight of you.>', '', 171519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali sniffs your hand.>', '', 171518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali blinks trustingly up at you.>', '', 171517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali plucks a leaf off the ground and offers it to you.>', '', 171516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali spins rapidly in place at the mere sight of you.>', '', 171515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali lightly bumps her horn against your hand.>', '', 171514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali stomps in place at your approach.>', '', 171513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Child of Torcali trumpets softly in greeting.>', '', 171512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank Elune that we are alive and have allies strong enough to allow us the time and resources to recover.', '', 171511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Child of Torcali eagerly devours the herbs within the offering bundle.', '', 171510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Brightwing, no! No eating bunnies!', 171509, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Bunnies? Yum! Where are the bunnies?', '', 171508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bunnies have been murdered in the Dreamgrove! Have you seen anybody suspicious?', 'Bunnies have been murdered in the Dreamgrove! Have you seen anybody suspicious?', 171507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Hi friends! What can Brightwing do for you?', '', 171506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancestors! Let them grant you their power!', '', 171504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Also... Zen\'tabra is very scary.', '', 171503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] For the record I do NOT kill bunnies.', '', 171502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a pleasure, $n. Perhaps we\'ll meet again in another time.', 171501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Just because I be a feral druid don\'t mean I be attackin\' critters! What about you, cat-boy? You be killin\' for fun?', 171500, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 6, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('If somebody in the Dreamgrove murdered some bunnies, who do you think it would be?', 'If somebody in the Dreamgrove murdered some bunnies, who do you think it would be?', 171499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Arthur... maybe we should go.', 171498, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Oh no Celestine, don\'t get us wrong! We would never assume... uh...', 171497, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] I fear the reason you ask me. I assure you that I would never partake in such brutal massacre, nor would my fellow Gilneans. Perhaps you should partake in acquiring some manners?', 171496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who would murder bunnies in cold blood?', 'Do you know who would murder bunnies in cold blood?', 171494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Greetings, young druids. Where does nature lead you today?', 171493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] We will keep our eyes open, Skylord!', 171492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have our orders, Lor\'themar. We can still accomplish our mission. Or do you disobey your Warchief?', '', 171488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember Neri\'s survival rule number one: don\'t get killed!', 171487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremendous! Now the experiment can begin.', '', 171486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dear brother, $n has waived all claims.', 171485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s hurry, $n. I fear I haven\'t much more time and who knows when this hunt will take us next.', 171484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please do, dear test subject. We\'ll be waiting.', 171483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll come back later.', 'I\'ll come back later.', 171482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, I\'m ready to proceed.', 'Okay, I\'m ready to proceed.', 171481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sheza sent me. I\'m here to negotiate for the goods.', 'Sheza sent me. I\'m here to negotiate for the goods.', 171480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, dear test subject.\n\nFlip and I would never want you to feel pressured to participate.\n\nTake your time. Consider the joys of your future life, when its enhanced by all of the wondrous technology we can create.\n\nConsider the incredible enhancements you can already see on our own bodies. The Quickcharge twins are walking testaments to the power of technology!\n\nLet me know when you\'re ready to proceed.', 171479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 39653),
('I need more time to think this over.', 'I need more time to think this over.', 171478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous! Welcome to the Quickcharge team, dear test subject.\n\nYour verbal agreement is now stored on file here at our laboratory.\n\nYou\'re authorized to participate in any and all future experiments we conduct at this and any and all future locations, regardless of risk, life expectancy, or your general uneasiness at the aims or methods of said experiments.\n\nWelcome to the future!', 171477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 39653),
('I do.', 'I do.', 171476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My face is up here, Pristy.', 'My face is up here, Pristy.', 171475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous, let\'s proceed.\n\nDo you, $n, hereby waive all of the claims I\'ve previously mentioned in their entirety, for all eternity?', 171474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay...', 'Okay...', 171473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interminable biological life.\n\nOh, it\'s not as scary as it sounds. I waived mine long ago!\n\nAre you ready to continue?', 171472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that last one?', 'What was that last one?', 171471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be as cute as ever. There\'s no waiving that one, not for you. No way.\n\n<Pristy looks you up and down slowly.>', 171470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Specifically, you waive your claims to the following functionalities:\nRespiratory,\nCirculatory,\nMuscular,\nReproductive,\nSkeletal,\nDigestive,\nBoth innate AND adaptive immunity,\nFacial,\nStructural,\nGeneral well-being,\nand interminable biological life.', 171469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there any functionality that I\'m not waiving claim to?', 'Is there any functionality that I\'m not waiving claim to?', 171468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What sort of functionality?', 'What sort of functionality?', 171467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous, let\'s proceed.\n\nThis verbal contract waives all previously held, typically understood, or spiritually derived claims regarding your physical form and its current functionality.', 171466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, of course... And how do I agree to the verbal contract?', 'Yes, of course... And how do I agree to the verbal contract?', 171465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We simply insist that every potential test subject confirm their ability and willingness to participate in our experiments.\n\nWe believe that our technology can, and will, improve the lives of every living being on Azeroth. But we also believe that living beings should choose this improvement. We will not force it on anyone who does not ask for it.\n\nWe\'re not wicked King Mechagon, after all!\n\n<Pristy giggles.>', 171464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to agree to your verbal contract.', 'I\'m ready to agree to your verbal contract.', 171463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you have a verbal contract?', 'Why do you have a verbal contract?', 171462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Pristy giggles.>\n\nYou are most certainly NOT ready, dear test subject!\n\nYou haven\'t agreed to the verbal contract yet.', 171461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There should be a rift around here somewhere. Let\'s hurry and repair it.', 171460, 0, 68264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, ya seem like a nice $gguy:gal;.\n\nEither pay up and be on ya way or the Venture Co. \"Asset Recovery\" team will have to go through your bags. Ta, you know, make sure that you didn\'t \"accidentally\" acquire anything that rightfully belongs to Venture Co. \n\nAnd I gotta warn ya, you\'re gonna be surprised by the amount of stuff we\'ll find in your bag that belongs to us. \n\nKapish?', '', 171459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Correct! It WAS 1,000 gold.\n\nBut she must have forgotten to include my, ahem, \"broker\'s fees\".\n\n1,250 is the offer. Take it or leave it.\n\nAlthough with our limited supply, and this sudden demand on the market, it seems it would be fiscally responsible to, ehh, increase the price further.\n\n<He grins showing off his yellow teeth.>', '', 171458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cow gave you the run down, eh? Fine, a mark\'s a mark. Doesn\'t matter to me who gets the goods.\n\nYou want what\'s in the chest, just hand over a one-time payment of 1,250 gold, and they\'re all yours!', '', 171457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heeey, you look like a smart, young rube.\n\nHow wouldja like to find yourself in some fine leathers?', '', 171456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to test the NRG-100.', 'I\'m ready to test the NRG-100.', 171455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isahi. Akule. We must make haste to Thunder Bluff. $p will aid Bloodhoof Village.', '', 171454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re so very excited to have you test the NRG-100!', 171453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t this island wondrous?\n\nI can\'t wait to modify it.', 171452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a journey, $n. But your time is needed elsewhere.\n\nAre you ready to go?', 171451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.', 'I\'m ready to leave.', 171450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is truly a glorious day.', '', 171449, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous, dear brother. I\'ll redouble my efforts to repair the malfunctioning circuit.', 171448, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good news, dear sister! We have empty energy cells for the NRG-100!', '', 171447, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our story is one of sadness. Perhaps it is better to save it for later, after you and your companions have recovered from your own loss.', '', 171446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Waveblade Ankoan.', 'Tell me about the Waveblade Ankoan.', 171445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until the tides no longer ebb and flow, we will fight to the end, to extinguish the Vainglorious.', '', 171444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She knows where we are! We\'re all in danger!', 171443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No bother. I shall end you and your interfering companion now!', 171442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you got out of my trap. We are quite resilient when the need arises.', 171441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go with her, $n. We will keep an eye out for more survivors and make sure that the naga do not follow.', 171438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my thanks. Follow me, friend. We\'ll make sure the way is safe.', 171437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a source of great power up ahead.', 171434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should move carefully. If we draw more attention, it could be the end of us.', 171433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that?', '', 171432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open for a safe location or an ambush.', '', 171431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go.', 'I am ready to go.', 171430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in the trap. All we can do is try to get out.', '', 171429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being torn...apart. Take my thread. Close...the rifts! Gaaaaahh!', 171428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Help me! It was...a trap...', 171427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will search the area to see if Prelus tried to tell me anything of use.', 171426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Members of my order are trained to leave clues so subtle that only another dark ranger could spot them.', 171425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[dnt] Now I will sit.', '', 171424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While you look for evidence, I will perform an investigation of my own.', 171423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been... uh... Gillbracked!', '', 171422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel my connection to the tides... deepening!', '', 171421, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got the Poen!', '', 171420, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pain, courtesy of Poen.', '', 171419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you smell what Poen is cooking? [dnt]', '', 171418, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poen! Right in the gill!', '', 171417, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 134343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, $n! Don\'t touch that portal!', 171416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Activate the recall subroutine.>', '<Activate the recall subroutine.>', 171415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom goes the Poen!', '', 171414, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134342, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make sure the way ahead is clear while you cover our retreat. Stay safe, $n. We cannot afford to lose you.', '', 171413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 171406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... A cold, ominous wind.', '', 171405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to know more? Take a pamphlet. We have many to choose from.', 'Want to know more? Take a pamphlet. We have many to choose from.', 171404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t trust the Alliance. They don\'t care about us!', 'Don\'t trust the Alliance. They don\'t care about us!', 171403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it just get a bit colder? Hmm...', 'Did it just get a bit colder? Hmm...', 171402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
