('Gallywix talked to you about Fizzwrench? Yeah, I thought so.\n\nLook, Grizzek didn\'t have a lick of sense when it came to politics, but he was a good guy. Between you and me? We need goblins like him, pushin\' the boundaries of engineering.\n\nSo here\'s my counter offer. If you find Grizzek, tell him to keep his head down and tell Gallywix he\'s out of the picture.\n\nDo that and I\'ll make sure you get paid twice as much. Sound good?', '', 171247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
