('|TINTERFACE\\TIMEMANAGER\\RWButton.blp:30|t |cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Reactivate the device.', '|TINTERFACE\\TIMEMANAGER\\RWButton.blp:30|t |cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Reactivate the device.', 171124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Spare Parts as ammo.', 'Using Spare Parts as ammo.', 171123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can utilize the YZ-85 Biorearrangement Unit by the ion converter if you need room in your stable, of course.', '', 171122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to have ye back with us, Hati ol\' boy. Don\'t be a stranger!', '', 171121, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll leave the two of ye tae get reacquainted. This dwarf could use a day or two in the wilds!', '', 171120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He sure does like jumpin\' around like that, don\'t he?', '', 171119, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the Temple of Storms. There is something I must show you!', '', 171118, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! I never doubted you for a moment!', '', 171117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time!', '', 171116, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re gonna need those spare parts and the energy cell to build this thing. Put in everything I gave you.', 171115, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I mean... of course it worked! Behold--Hati is whole once more!', '', 171114, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll do it. The Mail-o-matic\'s up and running!', 171113, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It worked?', '', 171112, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the field right there... yes, yes, yes! No, no no no no. Wait... no... yes!', '', 171111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there! The Thunderspark\'s lightning magic is being drawn into the stabilization field. Spectacular!', '', 171110, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fusion press is accepting the energy. Marvelous! Most marvelous indeed!', '', 171109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just open up the Broken Mail-o-matic to contribute the last of the parts we need.', 171108, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stabilization matrix at full strength. Reflowing ions to the fusion press...', '', 171107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ion converters increasing to full energy output... now!', '', 171106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just place the Thunderspark on the console here and Hati will be back in no time!', '', 171105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s better than good, Bronzebeard. It\'s science!', '', 171104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s... good?', '', 171103, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are! I\'ve just finished rerouting the low-ion energy converter units to the stabilization matrix, which should force the fusion press unit to reform Hati\'s body from his essence!', '', 171102, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ordered a very expensive spice! Worth more than your legs, Gearhart!', '', 171101, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL!', '', 171100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess... I just miss Hati, if I\'m being honest with ye. I know he\'s tied to your spirit an\' all, but he\'s got a heart of gold if I\'ve ever seen one.', '', 171099, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Used tae be I\'d just travel the wilds with Theodore and ol\' Huey. Maybe run across a fellow hunter every now and again.', '', 171098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye know, $Glad:lass;, sometimes I wonder how we get ourselves into these situations.', '', 171097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Mimiron... whatever ye say.', '', 171096, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bronzebeard, you made it! Apologies for the slight discombobulation on your way through the teleporter.', '', 171095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will bring you straight to the wondrous Spark of Imagination! Come, $p! Time to put that companion of yours back together with the magic of science!', '', 171094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You find those parts, $n? Ol\' Cracklekey won\'t stop bugging me about his mail.', 171093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another interloper? No matter. You will both die!', '', 171092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! Care to join the fun?', '', 171091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde is up to something and we\'re gonna find out what, one way or another.', 171090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My stash is just up the hill there, next to Gill. A handful of scrap and a few energy cells should cover it.', 171089, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blast my bolts! What did they do to this thing?!', 171088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And success! One listening device back up and running!', 171087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on I almost have this!', 171086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I reinitialize the matrix. And then I... Wait... What\'s that part doing there?', 171085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I need to reinitialize the power matrix... No! Wait! Grounding switches!', 171084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see... I need to calibrate the samophlange.', 171083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Drill Rigs didn\'t provide a big enough thrill for you monster hunters, the Reclamation Rig is what you\'re lookin\' for.\n\nHead down to The Outflow and help get that massive machinery up and runnin\'.\n\nBring some people that don\'t mind fightin\', though. The machinery is noisier than a hundred engines, so it\'s gonna attract some unwanted attention.\n\nBig thing is slow to recover after it breaks, too. You may have to wait awhile for it.', 171082, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s all fun and games down at the Crashcog Circuit. Racin\' robots and winnin\' prizes.\n\nI ain\'t much for driving in the derby myself, but I still go down and watch a match or two every time it\'s open.', 171081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, now this one\'s fun! The armory\'ll keeps a stockpile of any extracurricular weapons you\'ve helped develop in town, so you can use them all day long!\n\nIt\'s also got anti-gravity packs! You strap one of those onto the back of anything and it\'ll fly straight up to the sky!\n\nI did it to a capacabra once... felt a little bad afterwards... I hope he\'s alright.', 171080, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not much of a fighter. I prefer to let me bots do my fightin\' for me.\n\nThat\'s why I invented the Flame Turret!\n\nIt packs a wollop and will help you burn through any tough guys in the area.', 171079, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For those who like a little extra excitement in their life, Drill Rigs are like a mystery box stuffed with spiders!\n\nAin\'t my thing, but I\'m sure some of you adventurers are into it.\n\nIf you run across a cave-in, Drill Rigs\'ll blast that cave entrance wide open and give you access to whatever monsters are lurkin\' inside of it.\n\nBring a friend or two!', 171078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one\'s my personal favorite. The charging station\'ll let you convert all of your Empty Energy Cells into fully charged Energy Cells.\n\nIt ain\'t cheap to get this station up an runnin\', though. Try to recruit several other builders to help you cover costs.\n\nBondo\'s got a monopoly on the only electrical line capable of running enough juice to power the charging station, so you\'ll only find it in Bondo\'s Yard. Lucky jerk.', 171076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What other construction projects are available today?', 'What other construction projects are available today?', 171075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll watch your back.', 'I\'ll watch your back.', 171074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Reclamation Rig.', 'Tell me about the Reclamation Rig.', 171073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Crashcog Circuit.', 'Tell me about the Crashcog Circuit.', 171072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Rustbolt Armories.', 'Tell me about Rustbolt Armories.', 171071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Flame Turrets.', 'Tell me about Flame Turrets.', 171070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Drill Rigs.', 'Tell me about Drill Rigs.', 171069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Charging Station.', 'Tell me about the Charging Station.', 171068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadra\'s rage will destroy you!', 171067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death ta all who appose da empire!', 171066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadra... save... me...', 171065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another offering to da loa!', 171064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She will feast on yer soul!', 171063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Succumb ta her venom!', 171062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer soul belongs ta me!', 171061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da spiritbinder reveals yer soul ta me!', 171060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Embrace yer demise!', 171059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swagger all you like; you pups don\'t stand a chance. Flee now, while you can.', 171058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cross the Stormbinder! I\'ll slaughter you all.', 171057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should have run, dog.', 171056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feh!', 171055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Down, pup.', 171054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t outrun the storm.', 171052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die beneath the ice.', 171051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer the storm\'s wrath!', 171050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See what becomes of those who stand before me!', 171048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cowards! You pack of weakling... dogs...', 171044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm!', '', 171043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And fire!', '', 171042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The True Horde takes what it wants!', '', 171041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anguished water, stagnant and poisonous!', '', 171040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crumbling earth, plagued with rust!', '', 171039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!', '', 171038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements... what have we done...', '', 171037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skull will adorn my necklace.', '', 171036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine now.', '', 171035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you...', '', 171034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... are next.', '', 171033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close your eyes. Sleep.', '', 171032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The races of the world will perish. It is only a matter of time.', '', 171031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see endless suffering. I see torment. I see rage. I see everything...', '', 171030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon the world will tremble.', '', 171029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is upon you.', '', 171028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hungry worms will feast on your rotting flesh.', '', 171027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance is mine!', '', 171026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was the first you know. For me the wheel of death has spun many times. So much time has passed... I have a lot of catching up to do. ', '', 171025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have use for you...', '', 171024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It gets worse.', '', 171023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death really isn\'t so bad.', '', 171022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you afraid of?', '', 171021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in.', '', 171020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have something for you...', '', 171019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will show the proper respect!', '', 171018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wheel... spins... again.', '', 171017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break you.', '', 171016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot be defeated. I beat all man.', '', 171015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fists are scarlet... with your blood!', '', 171014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you die, you die.', '', 171013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are like... piece of iron...', '', 171012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got a couple construction projects on the island today.\n\nWhich one do you want to know more about?', 171011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Construction projects are opportunities to build something together in Mechagon. \n\nWhen you run across a piece of broken machinery, you and others can team up to repair it by contributing resources.\n\nMany construction projects can be completed by one person, but you\'ll want to get help for the larger projects you run across.\n\nDifferent construction projects are available every day, and their locations change throughout the day. And when you build one, it won\'t last forever... although you can extend their lifespan if you have the right tools.\n\nNot sure what you should be lookin\' for? Check in with me whenever you land in Rustbolt to find out what construction projects are available that day.', 171010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to ask something else.', 'I want to ask something else.', 171009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the right gnome for the job. I\'ve flown and crashed with the best of them! \n\nI will get you to Mechagon, assuming it actually exists!', '', 171008, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What construction projects are available today?', 'What construction projects are available today?', 171007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about construction projects.', 'Tell me about construction projects.', 171006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing\'s ever truly finished... some people just run out of ideas.', 171005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tinkmaster sent word that you needed skilled pilots, so my crew and I came as fast as we could.', '', 171004, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can tell you what construction projects are underway each day. Just ask!', 171003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mechagon is always under construction, and the construction projects change every day.', 171002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got questions about construction projects? Hit me up anytime.', 171001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only when I stop needing it.', 171000, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They know better than to try that. You really gotta clean up that mess of yours.', 170999, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks, Gill. Hope they didn\'t scuttle away with anything of yours.', 170998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah-hah! Another chance to test my might.', '', 170997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your guard!', '', 170996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bested... by the likes of...', '', 170995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah-HAH!', '', 170994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tsk! You need more training.', '', 170993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MILLHOUSE!! You\'re next!', 170992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 128442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why you... No one insults my hair! NO ONE!', 170991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 128443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to EXPLODE?', 170990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 128444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here comes the heat!', 170989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 128445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no place you can hide from me, Millhouse! No place!', 170988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 128446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fought back da Scourge. What chance joo thinkin\' JOO got?', '', 170986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready for somethin\'... much... BIGGAH!', '', 170985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da ground gonna swallow you up!', '', 170984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I crush joo cockroaches!', '', 170983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who gonna stop me? You?', '', 170982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so tough now!!', '', 170981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If our gods can die... den so can we....', '', 170980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da shadow gonna fall on you....', '', 170979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
