('Ya don\' kill me yet... ya don\' get anudda chance!', '', 170978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis a nightmare ya don\' wake up from!', '', 170977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
