('Diel fin\'al.', '', 170959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sha\'amoor ara mashal?', '', 170958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shal\'mor sinabanal!', '', 170957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flee or die!', 170956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My work is done.', 170955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As it should be.', 170954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destiny... awaits.', 170953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No second chances!', 170952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Quel\'Thalas! For the Sunwell!', 170951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m full of surprises!', 170950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 128382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a most unexpected turn of events.', '', 170949, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, good! You\'re back. I think that was the last kleptobot hiding in your stash.', 170948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some construction projects are small and can be done on your own, others will require larger groups to all contribute.', 170947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your eyes open as you explore the island, and you\'ll find opportunities to build or repair other useful things.', 170946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the junkergnome way, $n. Ain\'t nothin\' that some scrap, energy cells, and elbow grease can\'t fix.', 170945, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to concede defeat! I am a prince of the Eredar! I... am...', '', 170943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you did not think you could win.', '', 170942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your greed, your foolishness has brought you to this end.', '', 170941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but a plaything. Unfit even to amuse.', '', 170940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple fools! Time is the fire in which you\'ll burn!', '', 170939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face not Malchezaar alone, but the legions I command!', '', 170938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you hope to stand against such overwhelming power?', '', 170937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All realities, all dimensions are open to me!', '', 170936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the same look in his eyes when he died. Terenas could hardly believe it.', '', 170935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choke on your suffering!', '', 170934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Run... Run to meet your destiny... Its bitter, cold embrace, awaits you.', '', 170933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master surveyed his kingdom and found it... Lacking. His judgment was swift and without mercy: DEATH TO ALL!', '', 170932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh shall decay before your very eyes!', '', 170931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waste away into nothingness!', '', 170930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is all that you will find here!', '', 170929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forward, so that we may be properly introduced.', '', 170928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I was but a cub I could scarcely throw a punch, but after years of training I can do so much more!', '', 170927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one\'s martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!', '', 170926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As my master once said, \"You cannot truly know someone until you fight them.\"', '', 170925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 128350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where one falls, another will rise to take their place.', '', 170924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your technique needs work.', '', 170923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need more training!', '', 170922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold nothing back, for I will not!', '', 170921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, my banishment ends!', '', 170920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook... not safe...', '', 170919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook... needs help!', '', 170918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 128357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
