('Nothing but ash!', '', 170542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blaze of Glory!', '', 170541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master\'s power takes on many forms...', '', 170540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the rage of the Firelands!', '', 170539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My studies... had only just begun...', '', 170538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know my hunger!', 170537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, Mylune. Leave it to us!', 'Don\'t worry, Mylune. Leave it to us!', 170536, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] All I saw is these poor, teeny weeny little babies... with their little twitchy noses... and cute little wittle paws...\n\n<Mylune breaks into tears.>', 170534, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see anything else? Any clues as to who did this?', 'Did you see anything else? Any clues as to who did this?', 170530, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise up, brothers, and destroy our enemies!', 170529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check back tomorrow. We may need some more help!', 'Check back tomorrow. We may need some more help!', 170527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have made an... unwise... decision.', 170526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Really...? Is that all you\'ve got?', 170525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a pity.', 170524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death is no escape!', 170523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] These poor little bunnies... who would murder such innocent babies in cold blood?', 170522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... we were getting along... so... well...', 170521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ends NOW!', 170520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you handle this?', 170519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'SUFFER!', 170518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 127644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR SOUL IS MINE!', '', 170517, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 127631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Class... dismissed.', '', 170516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('School is in session!', '', 170515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dunce.', '', 170514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Did you hear that, Thisalee? Let\'s go see what happened!', '', 170513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a bold new recruit, you have joined the rescue mission departing from Stormwind.', '', 170512, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 152837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Alliance expedition sent to explore an uncharted island has recently gone missing.', '', 170509, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 152836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a soldier of the noble Alliance, a coalition of kingdoms upholding the ideals of valor and justice across Azeroth.', '', 170508, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 152835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this again, I want better ideas this time!', '', 170507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wasn\'t quite as we planned. Let\'s get it right this time!', '', 170506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well ya messed up. Let\'s try it again!', '', 170505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapon exploded! We must start again!', '', 170504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got us a new toy to try out on king Mechagon\'s goons!', '', 170503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See what happens we work as a team!', '', 170502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, who\'s got another idea?', '', 170501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, keep it coming!', '', 170500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good start, gimme more brainpower!', '', 170499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna be a beautiful thing.', '', 170498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not sure they\'re as smart as you think!', 170497, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got thirty-eight motivated wrench wielding goblins, ready to build some weapons!', '', 170496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s too much juice!', 'That\'s too much juice!', 170495, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s gonna jam up with all those gears.', 'It\'s gonna jam up with all those gears.', 170494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya gonna blow us all up!', 170493, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s gonna be leaking all over!', 170492, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring some boom, add explosives!', 'Bring some boom, add explosives!', 170491, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More batteries and it will be deadly!', 'More batteries and it will be deadly!', 170490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Add more Cogs and Springs!', 'Add more Cogs and Springs!', 170489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
