('Volatile Liquid, pour it in!', 'Volatile Liquid, pour it in!', 170487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It needs batteries to operate correctly!', 'It needs batteries to operate correctly!', 170486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cogs and Springs, we can mechanize it!', 'Cogs and Springs, we can mechanize it!', 170485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explosives, lots of \'em.', 'Explosives, lots of \'em.', 170484, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volatile liquid, stuff you don\'t want to smell.', 'Volatile liquid, stuff you don\'t want to smell.', 170483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Batteries, let\'s electrify stuff!', 'Batteries, let\'s electrify stuff!', 170482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, we need more of dat!', '', 170481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like your initiative!', '', 170480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ya talkin!', '', 170479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explosives, as much as you can fit in it!', 'Explosives, as much as you can fit in it!', 170478, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good idea... you still don\'t get a raise.', '', 170477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know you want Cogs and Springs!', 'You know you want Cogs and Springs!', 170476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what we putting in this thing?', '', 170475, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin!', 'I am ready to begin!', 170474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got a lot of smart people here, with a lot of opinions!', '', 170473, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know of a defensible position?', 170472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your help against the naga. We must find shelter and regroup.', 170471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spoken like someone who has been fighting for a very long time. We, too, understand the cost of war.', '', 170470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have been decimated. Many lives were lost to Azshara\'s trap. Our fleet is in ruins.', '', 170469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. And hurry. She is always watching.', '', 170468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must trust that the enemy of my enemy is my friend. The end of this conflict draws near... one way  the other.', '', 170467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stay here. Azshara\'s reinforcements will find you.', '', 170466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon\'s favor! Just when our numbers wane, the battle is joined.', '', 170465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way!', 170464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Genn! There is a small cave ahead. It\'s not ideal, but at least there won\'t be naga coming out of the walls.', 170463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll follow your lead.', '', 170462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina! We have to find a safer location!', '', 170461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time like the present.', '', 170460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The $r is stealing our parts!', 'The $r is stealing our parts!', 170459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That stuff is ours. We stole it!', '', 170458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be stealing the stuff we stole from you!', 'Don\'t be stealing the stuff we stole from you!', 170457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am curious to see what you have in mind, Lord Admiral.', '', 170456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though we have already rejoined the Alliance, we wish to present you with a token of our unity.', 170455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tiras stands ready to answer the call to arms.', 170454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gained ground against the Horde, yet many battles still lie ahead.', '', 170453, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our soldiers protect our allies on many fronts, across Alliance lands both old and new.', '', 170452, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take a knee.>', '<Take a knee.>', 170451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt! Welcome to the Roadrash Race, roadrasher!\n\nChoose the vehicle you wish to enter into the race below:', '', 170450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'LET\'S ROADRASH!', 170449, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '1...', 170448, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '2...', 170447, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '3...', 170446, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '4...', 170445, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold onto your bolts. It\'s time! 5...', 170444, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t want to see your hunk o\' junk leaking all over my course again, Greaseface! Get that scrap patched!', 170443, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '30 seconds to claim your spot in the next Roadrash Race, scrappers!', 170442, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone scrape that flaming debris off the course!', 170441, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The next Roadrash Race will kick off in 1 minute!', 170440, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re back online!', 170439, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so, as princess, I hereby induct you into the Greyguard! May you continue to be a paragon of the Gilnean people.', 170438, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 139816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! On behalf of all Gilneas, the royal family recognizes your exemplary service to kingdom and country.', 170437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]Generally this sort of thing is a bit too stuffy for my taste, but it seems appropriate here.', 170436, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That will not be necessary. Though their form has changed, I now fully accept my people are as they have always been. Thank you, honored Ancient.', 170431, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your doubts still haunt you, I can offer you one last option of reprieve. I could grant you the true curse.', '', 170430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The noble heart of Gilneas will never die...', 170429, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may have been my curse that gave your people their bloodlust. But it is their nature that allowed them to overcome it.', '', 170428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you did stop. And that is what I was interested in.', '', 170427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Honored Ancient, I wish to know what it means to bear the worgen curse. To experience its rage and wield its strength.', 170426, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, hunter, did you find your prey?', '', 170425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I--I understand.', '', 170424, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Princess, I have something to ask of you, as well.', 170423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see now. My people are not defined by this curse. They have held on to who they are in spite of it.', 170422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this game. I will show you how a true hunter kills its prey.', '', 170421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 134504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry! After her! She is losing control!', 170420, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 139791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... bloodlust turned me into a rabid beast. I nearly lost myself to the rage.', 170419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good thing I had my axe and armor on. It\'s nice to be the quartermaster sometimes.', 170418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Maybe they have more weapons. Move out!', 170417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Oh Arthur it\'s just the most awful thing! Somebody brutally murdered these poor little bunny wunnies!', 170416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Mylune! What happened?', '', 170415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good thing for the naga we\'re leaving. I had a whole bucket of death ready to dish out. Fishy death buckets!', '', 170414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back! Back, I say! I will slap you with this trout, so help me...$b$bWait, you\'re $r. Where\'s the party at?', '', 170413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say your prayers, naga! I\'ve got fish and I\'m not afraid to use them!', '', 170412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n. Thank you so much.', 170411, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the tides, it really is you!', 170410, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess barks!', '', 170409, 0, 0, 393, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Princess...? Is that you?', 170408, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be waiting for you.', 'We\'ll be waiting for you.', 170407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard the $Gman:woman;, we are getting out of here! Meadow, let us lead the charge!', 170406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! Thank goodness you survived. What of the others?', 170405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meadow, stay back! You have done enough...', 170404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are regrouping to the west. The way should be clear.', 'We are regrouping to the west. The way should be clear.', 170403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
