('<Placeholder: Magni meets MOTHER.>', '<Placeholder: Magni meets MOTHER.>', 170187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph] Three runes begin to glow brightly upon the box\'s surface. \n\nDo you touch one of the runes?', '[ph] Three runes begin to glow brightly upon the box\'s surface. \n\nDo you touch one of the runes?', 170186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take caution, Zelling. The Banshee Queen is plotting something...', '', 170185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suspect that she intends to make a show of force. But for whom, I cannot say.', '', 170184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are deep in enemy territory, Baine. Why would Sylvanas gather the Horde\'s leadership here?', '', 170183, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 127555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] - Let\'s get to building!', '[PH] - Let\'s get to building!', 170182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box gently glows with arcane runes.', 'The box gently glows with arcane runes.', 170181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All this strength, all this fury... it won\'t bring him back. It won\'t bring anyone back.', 170180, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember your loyalties.', 170174, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could not stand by and permit such depravity to unfold.', '', 170173, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop!', '', 170172, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However you may feel about dark rangers and their place in the Horde, I hope you understand my worry for Velonara\'s welfare.', '', 170170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a member of the Alliance, you may not be inclined to care about Dark Ranger Velonara\'s welfare. But please know that there is another side to her.', '', 170169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, do whatever you can to ensure her safety!', '', 170168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is a noble soul who cares deeply about her apprentice\'s welfare. I fear this concern has led her into peril.', '', 170167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My feelings toward Dark Ranger Velonara may have been romantic at first, but now I see her as a dear friend.', '', 170166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... this power! I can do anything! I can save Liam! I can save Gilneas!', 170165, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father! Out of my way!', 170164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done $n.', 170155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you, $n. Keep your head down, this whole area is crawling with Ashvane Loyalists.\n\n<Kelsey grins> \n\nWell, for now it is.', 170154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we should spend a little less time in this smoke hut.', '', 170153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha?! Where did that tauren go?', '', 170152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Oh no!!!! Somebody help! Quick!', 170151, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Ha ha! Got you again. Bye Naralex!', '', 170150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] Then suddenly, we heard a yell!', 170149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we\'ve got MOTHER here in the Chamber of Heart, we can start makin\' a plan!\n\nI jus\' hope it doesn\'t take her too long to finish those calculations...', '', 170148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I recognize Baine may have a time constraint, but there are preparations to me made on our side first.', 170146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust Master Shaw, and I trust Anduin. That will have to do. Tell Baine that I agree to the meeting... but I am not going alone or unprepared.', 170145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never a dull moment when you\'re dealing with Old Gods! I\'m just glad we got out in one piece.', '', 170141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight me, coward!', '', 170140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Extermination of all contaminated specimens recommended.', 170134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Augmented decontamination protocol initiated.', 170133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! Looks like there\'s still some corruption left in the system!', '', 170132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that was just the beginning. Now he can hear everything Azeroth says, and feel all the pain she endures.', '', 170131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we were lads, I used tae joke about Magni shoulderin\' the weight o\' the world. Dinnae know he\'d take it literally.', '', 170130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Hmm... wha...', '', 170125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Tess Greymane is dead asleep.>', 170124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Hah! Still asleep. Your turn again, Thisalee.', '', 170123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Mm... Muyoh, leave me... to my studies...', '', 170122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Hmm... no reaction. Let me try!', '', 170121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes, fire! I\'m outta here!', '', 170118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those blueprints... are long gone...', 170117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh scrap! You guys are back?! I mean... Hooray... you\'re back...', 170116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] For the last time, knock it off!', '', 170115, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back! It appears these sentinels are more resilient than we thought.', '', 170114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! All forces, retreat. The warchief will not be pleased with this.', 170113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is clear that we can hold this ground no longer. We must retreat for now.', 170112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin is lost! We must regroup and defend the rest of our land.', '', 170111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine trap we\'ve fallen into. There\'s still time to mitigate this disaster.', '', 170109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you injured? No? Then on your feet!', '', 170108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, champions. You have struck fear into the hearts of the Horde.', 170107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! See how the Alliance cowers in fear of you. We march on Ashenvale!', '', 170106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi Basin is ours, champions. The League of Arathor thanks you.', '', 170105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Fleshy friend. Approach my workbench, for my creator would have words with you.', '', 170103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Arathi Basin and all of its resources belong to us now!', 170093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Derek. No matter the storm, we will face it... as family.', 170092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you come with me, Jaina? I... I don\'t know if I can do this alone.', '', 170091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Not yet. But I know others who have been through this. I believe they can help you.', 170090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t come home... can I.', '', 170089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory is nearly ours! Press the attack and decimate the Horde!', 170088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know. But we will find the answer together.', 170087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, mother, and Tandred all endured so much. I\'m pleased you have each other again, but... where does my path lead?', '', 170086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I know about father. The Horde spewed lies to poison me against you. But Baine explained the truth of what happened.', '', 170085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much has changed, Derek. I... There\'s something I must tell you--', 170084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina... I can hardly believe it\'s you. When I set sail, you were a child. And now... Lord Admiral.', '', 170083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for trusting Baine. He was good to me.', '', 170082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He did not come as a foe. This time.', 170081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have the Alliance backed into a corner. Finish the fight!', '', 170080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are pushing them back! Show these Defilers no mercy!', '', 170079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land is nearly ours! Do not relent, champions!', 170078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To have any hope of ending this war, we must end her.', 170075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For years I pitied Sylvanas for what Arthas did to her. But nothing remains of the hero she was. Perhaps now the Horde will see that, too.', 170074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine showed compassion and honor by returning Derek to us. I fear that choice may cost him his life.', 170073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Report our findings to the Lord Admiral. I\'ll make my way back on my own.', '', 170072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She did this to send a message to the rest of the Horde: Dissent will not be tolerated.', '', 170071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was ruthless, even by the Banshee\'s standards.', '', 170070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And in this corner... wait, who gave it rockets? And cannons? Why would anyone do this?! It\'s a Hyper Mecha-Mega Seagull!', '', 170069, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And in this corner... wait, who gave it rockets? And cannons? Why would anyone do this?! It\'s a Hyper Mecha-Mega Seagull!', 170068, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Forward, Bloodfang! Shred any survivors to pieces! Fenris Keep belongs to us!', '', 170067, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Spy on the Horde gathering.>', '<Spy on the Horde gathering.>', 170066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, $p!', '', 170065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foraging', 'Foraging', 170064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish you luck and hope you find Master Shaw and the others alive and well.', 170063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But it is your trust dat I must earn.', 170062, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stand before you, having proven myself to de loa.', 170061, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And together with de Horde, we take our rightful place among de great kingdoms of Azeroth. Zandalar forever!', 170060, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Threats from without and within rose up to challenge us... to test our faith.', 170059, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With de loa\'s blessing, our sacred blades and mighty ships commanded de seas.', 170058, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to make me something.', 'I want you to make me something.', 170057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TBD Default Gossip.', '', 170056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw Kelsey Steelspark run by a little bit ago, but was too wounded to get her attention. She might need help, too.', 'I saw Kelsey Steelspark run by a little bit ago, but was too wounded to get her attention. She might need help, too.', 170055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I overheard some peons talking. They say the Warchief ordered the area cleared. Stay on guard.', 'I overheard some peons talking. They say the Warchief ordered the area cleared. Stay on guard.', 170054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took out our listening posts! I\'d have been dead too if you hadn\'t come along. Whatever is going on is important.', 'They took out our listening posts! I\'d have been dead too if you hadn\'t come along. Whatever is going on is important.', 170053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what they are up to, but it\'s big. They don\'t want any witnesses.', 'I don\'t know what they are up to, but it\'s big. They don\'t want any witnesses.', 170052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are systematically sweeping the area. Be careful.', 'The Horde are systematically sweeping the area. Be careful.', 170051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dorian Atwater pats Hurricane\'s neck affectionately.', 170049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s for the spider mount Kerchunk! Not your hair.', '', 170048, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hair is naturally sleek and shiny.', '', 170047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you $n, this grease will come in handy.', '', 170046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Observe the meeting.>', '<Observe the meeting.>', 170045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work securing the area, $c. \n\nIt\'s time for the festivities to begin.', '', 170044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. What do you need?', 170043, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Hey Thisalee! Let\'s play Don\'t Wake Naralex!', '', 170042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT] So we were hanging out in the Dreamgrove, playing our favorite game...', 170041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IGC PLAYS HERE', 'IGC PLAYS HERE', 170040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Jaina, there is a Horde ship approaching.', 'Lady Jaina, there is a Horde ship approaching.', 170039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Jaina\'s gaze remains on the ruins of Theramore as you approach her.>\n\nSo much was lost here.\n\nI wonder if that includes me.\n\nNot for the first time, I question if I am becoming my father.', 170038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Arathi, $r. \n\nOh, what am I doing?\n\nWhile you are all out killing each other, I\'m planning some grand redesigns of these wretched grounds fit for a warchief!\n\nWhat\'s wrong with these humans? Who puts such bright red roofs on stone masonry?\n\nSavages...', '', 170037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 7, 0, 39653),
('The hero sat down to rest and replenish his vitality. This trial was proving to be a bit more challenging than originally anticipated.', 'The hero sat down to rest and replenish her vitality. This trial was proving to be a bit more challenging than originally anticipated.', 170036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... I suppose not.', 170035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has a point. Can you think of anywhere less likely to be under Horde surveillance?', '', 170034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may not trust me, Lord Admiral, but King Anduin will vouch for both me and the chieftain.', 170033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Jaina, Valeera was one of King Varian\'s closest friends. If she says Baine seeks this meeting in defiance of Sylvanas, then I believe her.', '', 170032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t have a ticket, you\'ll have to leave.', 'If you don\'t have a ticket, you\'ll have to leave.', 170031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll need to see your ticket.', 'I\'ll need to see your ticket.', 170030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield! I yield!', 'I yield! I yield!', 170029, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting out of here!', 'I\'m getting out of here!', 170028, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I guess you\'re pretty tough...', 'Yeah, I guess you\'re pretty tough...', 170027, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Fine, I\'ll go...', 'Stop! Fine, I\'ll go...', 170026, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show you where you can stick your \"ticket!\"', 'I\'ll show you where you can stick your \"ticket!\"', 170025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just got a ticket for a good beating!', 'You just got a ticket for a good beating!', 170024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t try to order me around!', 'Don\'t try to order me around!', 170023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t make me leave!', 'You can\'t make me leave!', 170022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those goblins got you playing enforcer? Fine, here it is.', 'Those goblins got you playing enforcer? Fine, here it is.', 170021, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little overdressed for a ticket-taker, wouldn\'t you say? Here you go.', 'A little overdressed for a ticket-taker, wouldn\'t you say? Here you go.', 170020, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right here. I still can\'t believe I had to pay to be here.', 'I still can\'t believe I had to pay to be here.', 170019, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for the coast of Theramore.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for the coast of Theramore.', 170018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here it is. Paid a hefty sum for it, too.', 'Here it is. Paid a hefty sum for it, too.', 170017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you kidding? At the prices these goblins are charging? \n\nTalk about highway robbery!', 'Are you kidding? At the prices these goblins are charging? \n\nTalk about highway robbery!', 170016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on the special guest list. \n\nJust ask Gallywix, he\'ll vouch for me.', 'I\'m on the special guest list. \n\nJust ask Gallywix, he\'ll vouch for me.', 170015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I don\'t have a stupid ticket. What are you going to do about it?', 'No, I don\'t have a stupid ticket. \n\nWhat are you going to do about it?', 170014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ticket? \n\nOh, I must\'ve left it in my other greaves...', 'Ticket? \n\nOh, I must\'ve left it in my other greaves...', 170013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady\'s got stones for holding this meeting right under the Alliance\'s nose. \n\nTalk about a power play!', 'The Dark Lady\'s got stones for holding this meeting right under the Alliance\'s nose. \n\nTalk about a power play!', 170012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a big risk gathering so many of our leaders right in the middle of Alliance territory. \n\nWhat is Sylvanas trying to prove?', 'It\'s a big risk gathering so many of our leaders right in the middle of Alliance territory. \n\nWhat is Sylvanas trying to prove?', 170011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your message?', 'What is your message?', 170010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll vouch for you as well. What did you have to say?', 'I\'ll vouch for you as well. What did you have to say?', 170009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an odd place to call a council. \n\nI wonder what\'s going on?', 'This is an odd place to call a council. \n\nI wonder what\'s going on?', 170008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would all the leaders be summoned all the way out here? \n\nSomething big must be happening.', 'Why would all the leaders be summoned all the way out here? \n\nSomething big must be happening.', 170007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aren\'t you just the sweetest little horse in the valley? Yes, you are!', 170005, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 127238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurricane stomps away from you with an indignant whinny.', '', 170004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurricane snorts irritably.', '', 170003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll find ol\' Hurricane in the yard. Don\'t worry, he\'s not as wild as his name implies. Well, not quite.', 170002, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 127237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t be defeated so easily!', '', 170001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have fun recycling!', '', 170000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deserve a nice mount like this, $n, for helping save the town and all.\n\nIt\'s got a ways to go before its ready, but you can see the potential right?\n\nKeep checking back. Together, you and I will find a way to get it fixed!', '', 169998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Valeera looks you over>\n\nI do what I can, Champion, as we all must.', 169997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Funny how we keep meeting under dire circumstances, $n. \n\n<Valeera smirks>\n\nThink you can convince Lady Proudmoore I\'m not out to kill her? She really is going to want to hear this.', 169996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust Master Shaw, and I trust Anduin. That will have to do. Tell Baine that I agree to the meeting... but I am not going alone.', 169995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you can\'t take me at my word, go to Stormwind and ask Anduin to vouch for me. But we don\'t have much time, Lady Jaina.', 169994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine is going behind the Banshee\'s back. That\'s why he\'s suggesting Theramore. Not to offend you, but for secrecy.', 169993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then he must hear this message as well. Tell Baine that will I agree to this meeting... after I speak with Anduin.', 169992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trusted Varian... as I trust Master Shaw. That will have to do. Tell Baine that I agree to this meeting... but I am not going alone.', 169991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Banshee Queen has eyes everywhere. Theramore is one of the few places she is not watching.', 169990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After all that the Horde has done, you have the audacity to--', 169989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine Bloodhoof seeks to right a wrong done to your family. He asks to meet with you in secret... off the coast of Theramore.', 169988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s hear this message of yours.', 169987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time streams are mine to command! You cannot win!', 169986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the waves of time crash over you!', 169985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I control the battlefield, not you!', 169984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time shifts again, and your doom draws near!', 169983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you race through time? Or be trapped in an endless eternity?', 169982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your timelines end here!', 169981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s... not possible! I... I was destined to win...', 169980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were destined to die.', 169979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An inevitable outcome.', 169978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
