('', 'What\'s a shaman?', 169962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It isn\'t home, but at least it has an ocean breeze.\n\nI miss Sal.', 169961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I would never sail again. But here I am. Boatswain. Shipping off to join the Alliance.\n\n<Dorian sighs.>\n\nI hope Sal can get on without me.', 169960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
