('', 'Forward! For the Alliance!', 169948, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 127589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Send the Horde a message by hanging their tattered banners from our ramparts. They will find no shelter here!', 169947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We sentinels will not rest until Ashenvale is rid of the Horde. Take back our forest, heroes.', 169946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
