('As the hero entered the chamber, a larger version of the creatures he\'d been fighting stood before him. Perhaps this was the trial he was here to complete?', 'As the hero entered the chamber, a larger version of the creatures she\'d been fighting stood before her. Perhaps this was the trial she was here to complete?', 169940, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
