('', 'Taking control of the resources in Arathi will sever the Alliance\'s supply lines. Seize them by any means necessary.', 169925, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 127584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braggarts and liars, all of them.\n\nBet I have a few stories you haven\'t yet heard.', 'Braggarts and liars, all of them.\n\nBet I have a few stories you haven\'t yet heard.', 169924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got any good gossip, $n?', 'Got any good gossip, $n?', 169923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Well of course I had to let it go. How was I supposed to haul a whale shark aboard?\n\n<He lightly elbows you in the ribs.>\n\nAin\'t that right? \n\nWhat did you want, now?', '...Well of course I had to let it go. How was I supposed to haul a whale shark aboard?\n\n<She lightly elbows you in the ribs.>\n\nAin\'t that right? \n\nWhat did you want, now?', 169922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... So you\'re telling me you got dragged down to the bottom of the sea by a giant tentacle and you\'re standing here to tell the tale?\n\n<He gestures to his conversational partner.>\n\nYou believe this load of horse dung?\n\nAnyway. What can I do for you?', '... So you\'re telling me you got dragged down to the bottom of the sea by a giant tentacle and you\'re standing here to tell the tale?\n\n<She gestures to her conversational partner.>\n\nYou believe this load of horse dung?\n\nAnyway. What can I do for you?', 169921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I\'m telling you, this island had flying monkeys on it! Why would I make something like that up?\n\n<Flustered, he sighs and turns to you.>\n\n... Hail, stranger. Come to trade a tale or two?', '...I\'m telling you, this island had flying monkeys on it! Why would I make something like that up?\n\n<Flustered, she sighs and turns to you.>\n\n... Hail, stranger. Come to trade a tale or two?', 169920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... So I told her where she could drop her anchor...\n\n<He clears his throat and looks at you.>\n\nYou just going to keep dropping eaves or do you want something from me?', '... So I told her where she could drop her anchor...\n\n<She clears her throat and looks at you.>\n\nYou just going to keep dropping eaves or do you want something from me?', 169919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... And the wave was taller than me head! Came crashing down onto the deck...\n\n<He realizes you are standing there and turns to face you.>\n\nOi, you need something?', '... And the wave was taller than me head! Came crashing down onto the deck...\n\n<She realizes you are standing there and turns to face you.>\n\nOi, you need something?', 169918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know where I can find Dorian Atwater?', 'Do you know where I can find Dorian Atwater?', 169917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He stops mid-sentence and looks at you.>\n\nAye?', '<She stops mid-sentence and looks at you.>\n\nAye?', 169916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. Then I will hear what she has to say.', 169915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Varian did.', '', 169914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
