('', 'I am Tinkmaster Overspark\'s personal assistant and official documenter of all his engineering research.\n\nI also handle his luggage.', 169886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. The Atwaters live out of town, somewhere in the Deadwash I reckon. I don\'t travel that way too often.', 'Aye. The Atwaters live out of town, somewhere in the Deadwash I reckon. I don\'t travel that way too often.', 169885, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
