('Isn\'t that the name of a famous shipwright? I swear I\'ve heard it before...', 'Isn\'t that the name of a famous shipwright? I swear I\'ve heard it before...', 169880, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never seen it myself, but I\'ve heard that Atwater once built a ship in a single day! Say hello for me, aye?', 'Never seen it myself, but I\'ve heard that Atwater once built a ship in a single day! Say hello for me, aye?', 169879, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who?', 'Who?', 169878, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course it\'s Mechagon! This is the discovery of a lifetime!', '', 169877, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the letter.>', '<Take the letter.>', 169875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Lady Jaina Proudmoore offers you a folded letter.>\n\nYou may read it, if you wish. It is a touch sentimental but nothing terribly private.', 169874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scrappy barks happily and nuzzles $n\'s leg.', '', 169873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just imagine, $n... a vault full of lost technology, left behind by the last king of the gnomes!', '', 169872, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quackenbush? No!\n\nWhat a shame. He was a good kid. Good hugger. Real soft feathers. Probably offed by the same folks that left me marooned here.', '', 169871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bizmo back at the arena is a phony! Let\'s unmask them and find out what\'s going on!', '', 169870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Tell Bizmo about Quackenbush\'s murder.>', '<Tell Bizmo about Quackenbush\'s murder.>', 169869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, thanks! You didn\'t have to do that, sweet cheeks!\n\nSo, what have I missed while I was gone?', '', 169868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Bizmo 2 gold so he can get home.>', '<Offer Bizmo 2 gold so he can get home.>', 169867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Bizmo your hearthstone so he can get home.>', '<Offer Bizmo your hearthstone so he can get home.>', 169866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any Bizmo you\'ve been working with is a traitor! I don\'t know who he... or, it... is, but I know that they\'re not me. I\'m me!\n\nI\'ll tell you everything I know.\n\nI don\'t know what happened. They caught me from behind. There was a scuffle and then... darkness. And then I was here, on the other side of the world, without a hearthstone or a copper to my name.', '', 169865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Bizmo? I thought you were running Bizmo\'s Brawlpub. What\'s going on?', 'What? Bizmo? I thought you were running Bizmo\'s Brawlpub. What\'s going on?', 169864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are... are you from my Brawlpub? It\'s me! Bizmo!\n\nThe REAL Bizmo!', '', 169863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see you back at the Brawlpub, $p. Let\'s go unmask the fake me and get to the bottom of this murder mystery!', '', 169862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will store our luggage until we return.', 169861, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 133206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cancel my meeting with Wyrmbane. I want to depart immediately!', '', 169860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s $p now!', '', 169859, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail to Theramore.', 'Set sail to Theramore.', 169858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Tidesage, I can call upon the powers of the sea to guide this ship to our destination.\n\nSay the word and we will set sail.', '', 169857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting in, High Commander. I found this letter from Lady Ashvane.', 'Reporting in, High Commander. I found this letter from Lady Ashvane.', 169856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will meet again... I am certain of it.', 169855, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 126964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vor\'koth emerges from the depths.', '', 169854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please return to the witness chair, $gmister:miss; $n.', '', 169853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. Lie in my court one more time, $n, and I\'ll hold you in contempt!', '', 169852, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lies! Your honor, you know for a fact that the witness is lying.', 169851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witness is lying your honor. We were all there. We all saw that epic beatdown.', 169850, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Really? You don\'t remember anything? Fine, let\'s just move on.', 169849, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please remember that you ARE under oath, $n.', 169848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we investigated that case together. Weren\'t you paying attention? Sigh...', 169847, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s strange, I thought that you did... moving on, then. Is it true that, in your discussions with Lord Browne, you learned about a potential motive?', 169846, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before I rest, I will ask you, $n: who do YOU think killed our quartermaster?', '', 169845, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All three defendants charged with murder of quartermaster, Quackenbush!', 169844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All rise as Judge Bizmo leave courtroom. Meatball hungry. Court adjourned.', '', 169843, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to recess court while your team investigates this further evidence.', '', 169842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander Daalo, your jinyu associate has found some information which is relevant to the People\'s case.', '', 169841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Highly unusual... but I\'ll allow it.', '', 169840, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach.', '', 169839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a moment of your time, your honor.', '', 169838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Stop everything!', '', 169837, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the matter of the Alliance vs. Browne, O\'Flannerty, Lazarby, and $n, we find...', '', 169836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most intriguing! Please continue, mister foreman.', '', 169835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have, your honor.', '', 169834, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. And have you found anybody presently in the courtroom to be guilty?', '', 169833, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jury has reached a verdict, your honor.', '', 169832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. I would now like to offer the jury a chance to deliberate their...', '', 169831, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The defense rests, your honor.', 169830, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no other explanation than the obvious: $n killed Quackenbush.', 169829, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n has been lying to us this entire time. $gHe:She; behaves like a murderer with something to hide.', 169828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like to present to the jury this S.E.L.F.I.E. picture which clearly shows $N breaking the law by distributing illegal Brawlpub invitations. No respect for the law!', 169827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will $ghis:her; bloodthirst never end? And finally, $gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my worgen client of murder.', 169826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, you murdered two innocent engineers during your investigation of my client, correct?', 169825, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'See? $gHe:She; has financial motivations. And $gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my fine dwarven client of assassinating the quartermaster.', 169824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the records show that YOU murdered Lord Sylysthrel in order to steal his fairly-earned Brawler\'s Gold! Is that correct?', 169823, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my human client of having a motivation to kill our quartermaster.', 169822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n killed Quackenbush!', 169821, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We would like to offer an alternative theory to the jury:', 169820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor.', 169819, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, counsel.  Defense?', '', 169818, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The People rest, your honor.', 169817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was possessed by a demon!', 169816, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was a Horde spy!', 169815, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was so bored with the Brawlpub that he shoplifted!', 169814, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was so bored with the Brawlpub that he spit off the side of the VIP Lounge!', 169813, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To forge invitations simply out of boredom requires a large amount of disposable income, which is consistent with the jeweled sword that $n found at the scene.', 169812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was so bored with the Brawlpub that he distributed counterfeit invitations.', 169811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grant Lazarby had an excellent motive to murder Quackenbush:', 169810, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, you\'ve got it all wrong...', '', 169809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s hat to the Lich King!', 169808, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s hat to the highest bidder!', 169807, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s hat to an invisible shadow monster!', 169806, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s heart to the Lich King!', 169805, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s heart to the highest bidder!', 169804, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s heart to an invisible shadow monster!', 169803, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s soul to the Lich King!', 169802, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s soul to the highest bidder!', 169801, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is supported by the evidence $n found at the scene: a shadowy scroll.', 169800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s soul to an invisible shadow monster!', 169799, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadowmaster O\'Flannerty also had a good motive:', 169798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... dare... you... !', '', 169797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He killed Quackenbush to cover up for another murder!', 169796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He and Quackenbush were caught in a love triangle!', 169795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Jaina Proudmoore.', 169794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Thrall.', 169793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is supported by the evidence $n found at the scene: a crate of valuable supplies had been stolen.', 169792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Lord Sylysthrel.', 169791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Winifred Browne had good reason to kill Quackenbush:', 169790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, you have heard the evidence.', 169789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pfshh. If having a bit of fun is a crime, then consider me guilty. I will pay whatever fine you require. Let\'s get it over with.', '', 169788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. And what CRIME did he commit out of boredom?', 169787, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was the motive?', 169786, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true that, in your discussions with Mister Lazarby, you discovered a potential motive?', 169785, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What evidence did you find at the scene of the crime that implicates Mister Lazarby?', 169784, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lastly, $n, I\'d like to ask you about Grant Lazarby.', 169783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry.', '', 169782, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have order in my brawl court!', '', 169781, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-y-you don\'t understand! I-I-I...', '', 169780, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give the hat?', 169779, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give that heart?', 169778, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give that soul?', 169777, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was that motive?', 169776, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true that, in your discussions with Mister O\'Flannerty, you learned about a potential motive?', 169775, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you also found some evidence that may implicate Shadowmaster O\'Flannerty. What did you find?', 169774, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh-wh-who, me?', '', 169773, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor. I\'d like to proceed to some questions about one Shadowmaster O\'Flannerty.', 169772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Counsel, you may continue.', '', 169771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highly unorthodox, but I\'ll allow it.', '', 169770, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your loose lips will be the end of you, $pr! To arms!', '', 169769, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom did he owe the money?', 169768, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SAY!', '', 169767, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was the motive?', 169766, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true that, in your discussions with Lord Browne, you learned about a potential motive?', 169765, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was that evidence?', 169764, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, is it true that you found a piece of evidence at the scene of the crime that implicates Lord Browne?', 169763, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahem!', '', 169762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I\'d like to ask you a few questions about Lord Winifred Browne.', 169761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The People would like to call $n to the stand.', 169760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Ulaani. Prosecution, your witness.', '', 169759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My clients are innocent!', 169758, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, counsel. Defense, opening statements?', '', 169757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The three defendants have each been charged with murder. We plan to show that at least one is guilty!', 169756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor.', 169755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The People may proceed.', '', 169754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Jury sit down.', '', 169753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bailiff Meatball, please swear in the jury.', '', 169751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jury listen up. You all swear you gonna tell truth, so help you Light?', '', 169750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we hear case of People of Alliance versus Browne, O\'Flannerty, and Lazarby.', '', 169749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brawlpub Court now in session. Judge Bizmo presiding. Meatball hungry.', '', 169748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody listen up.', '', 169747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While much of the book now contains the events of your trial, your story has not yet come to its finale.', '', 169746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue writing your story.', 'Continue writing your story.', 169745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hero\'s vision began to fade...', 'The hero\'s vision began to fade...', 169744, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the ritual.', 'Begin the ritual.', 169743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot remain idle, not after my people have lost their second home.', 169742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren of Thunder Bluff! We are safe thanks to the deeds of $p.', '', 169741, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 130404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not waste my time, $c. \n\nCome back when you have something worth listening to.', '', 169738, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevermind. <Don\'t report Baine\'s request.>', 'Nevermind. <Don\'t report Baine\'s request.>', 169737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine Bloodhoof has requested that I help him with a secret task.', 'Baine Bloodhoof has requested that I help him with a secret task.', 169736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Bloodhoof wishes to act in shadow? We must know what he is planning.\n\nGo along with his little task, $n. You are under my protection, so do not worry if you need to get your hands dirty to keep up the ruse.\n\nJust do whatever he asks of you and return to me with your findings.', '', 169735, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have something to report, $n?', '', 169734, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C! I carry an urgent message from the High Chieftain!', 169733, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
