('This crate is completely empty. It\'s been pried open, and all of its contents have been removed.\n\nQuackenbush was the arena quartermaster, and traded in valuable wares. Whoever stole this merchandise may have been |cFF0000FFmotivated by money|r.', 'This crate is completely empty. It\'s been pried open, and all of its contents have been removed.\n\nQuackenbush was the arena quartermaster, and traded in valuable wares. Whoever stole this merchandise may have been |cFF0000FFmotivated by money|r.', 169704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
