('I spy... a waxy treasure that kobold\'s covet!', '', 169576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tess, becoming a worgen is a choice that cannot be undone. But there might be another way to gain the understanding you seek.', 169575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you will not pass the worgen curse onto me... then I will ask our champion instead.', 169574, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 139768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many of our people endure the same burden. How can I hope to lead them unless I share their plight?', 169573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, you have borne the worgen curse for many years, and have learned to live with its ferocity. To harness it as your own.', 169572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 139766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Equipping...', 'Equipping...', 169571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish.', 'As you wish.', 169570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know not what you ask. To be forever torn between rage and reason. To fear for your loved ones whenever they are near.', '', 169568, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 133354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I am to one day lead our people, then I must understand their hardship. This is the only way.', 169567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 139765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely not! I forbid you to take such an action!', '', 169566, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 133353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that were sleeping... shall be awakened.', '', 169565, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That which was sunken shall rise.', '', 169564, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Receive my gift and see all truths before you.', '', 169563, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guided your hand.', '', 169562, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Boss Bazzelflange back at the arena is a phony! Let\'s unmask them and find out what\'s going on!', 169561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Avoid the frogs while Princess Talanji rescues you!', 'Avoid the frogs while Princess Talanji rescues you!', 169560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here for Mechagon?', 'Are you here for Mechagon?', 169559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those poor souls! This device must have malfunctioned. King Mechagon would never mean us harm!', '', 169558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you still here? We have a team to assemble!', '', 169557, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132766, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know my verdict.', '', 169553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Makessss ssssense to me...', '', 169552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook.', '', 169551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good point.', '', 169550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, me remember that.', '', 169549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They DID kill those guys.', '', 169548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought about it that way.', '', 169547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting.', '', 169546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<grunt>', '', 169545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n? Impossible!', '', 169544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no she didn\'t!', '', 169543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<gasp>', '', 169542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braves, prepare for battle! Thunder Bluff is under attack!', '', 169541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone and everything, is packed up and ready to go.', 169540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He spies with his little eye... Your DEATH! Everyone give it up for, Spymaster!', 169539, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He spies with his little eye... Your DEATH! Everyone give it up for, Spymaster!', '', 169538, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should try it on your radiation burns.', '', 169537, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right! The radiation. From Gnomeregan. Where I am definitely from.', '', 169536, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 132912, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t we be going soon?', '', 169535, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is...uh, important for gnomes!', '', 169534, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Love you too Punkin.', '', 169533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still love you!', 169532, 0, 0, 17, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am definitely a short and very cheerful gnome from Gnomeregan.', '', 169531, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A radiation victim too.', 169530, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I was all over Gnomeregan, yes indeedy...', '', 169529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daylight\'s burnin\' here!', '', 169528, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s for the... uh... radiation poisoning! Right, sweetie?', 169527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 132913, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which explains why you gravitated towards the Explorer\'s League.', '', 169525, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, at least it\'s a start. Thank ye, champion. Ye\'ll be the first tae know when MOTHER finds an answer.', '', 169517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calculating now.', 169516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just fer analysis? How long before we have a plan o\' action?', '', 169515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Accessing Chamber of Heart data archives. Comprehensive analysis will require approximately 77 cycles.', 169514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we\'ve brought ye here, can ye find a way tae heal Azeroth?', '', 169513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it down, or we\'re done fer!', '', 169512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size o\' that one!', '', 169511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'System c-c-c-corrupted.', 169510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\'s not right! We\'re losin\' her!', '', 169509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever happens, our champion can handle it. Be ready!', '', 169508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning: Waygate diagnostic routine incomplete. High probability of travel conduit corruption.', 169507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fully functional titan waygate! I cannae wait tae see it in action!', '', 169506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Etiquette system overload. Resetting now.', 169505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning: Reorigination sequence imminent.', 169504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Error. Exit routine not found.', 169503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Departure acknowledged.', 169502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell protocol activated.', 169501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you require experimentation?', 169500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Accessing greeting database. Hello.', 169499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contamination levels nominal.', 169498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you wouldn\'t hang me out ta dry, $n. Thank ye for saving ma life.', '', 169497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get started.', 'Let\'s get started.', 169496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Straight out of retirement, Farmer Xiang-Su is ready to wet some plants!', '', 169495, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As for you, $r. You have proven to value life over possessions, and I shall reward that honor. You may take the anvil as well.', 169494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re free to go, Ormhun. But do not think you will go unpunished. We shall discuss the details of that later.', 169493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a feeling there may be a shred of virtue in you, surface dweller.', '', 169492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, the anvil is yours. And Ormhun shall face his punishment elsewhere.', 169491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Typical surface dweller. Only thinking of yourself and how to further your own power.', 169490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', '', 169489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<grunt>', '', 169488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?', '', 169487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessss...', '', 169486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skraawwwk!', '', 169485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But of course.', '', 169484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrnngg.', '', 169483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must always tell truth!', '', 169482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook yeah!', '', 169481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever.', '', 169480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, sure.', '', 169479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Therazane, please. I didn\'t think it\'d be tha big of a problem.', '', 169478, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, what have you to say for yourself?', 169477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you, $r. The audacity of you surface dwellers! Thinking you can just come here and take our secrets?!', 169476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Correct. You didn\'t think. And now you shall answer for your crimes.', 169475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you battle the troggs in Gnomeregan?', '', 169474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must say, Grizzek, your outfit is quite peculiar.', '', 169473, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 132911, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve never been patient with your lab work, Sapphronetta.', '', 169472, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 132760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'ll be able to craft some rather durable equipment. But best you be getting on yer...', '', 169471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what a beautiful anvil it is. You\'ve definitely got the technique down, $n.', '', 169470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it!', '', 169469, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to meet MOTHER.', 'I\'m ready to meet MOTHER.', 169468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need some help if we\'re tae save Azeroth. Hopefully, this MOTHER knows what to do!', '', 169467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I aspire to greatness beyond your imagination. There are important calculations to finish. \n\nSo leave me alone!', '', 169466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am worthy, you can\'t deny me access.', '', 169465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secret is here, all my tests were correct!', '', 169464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This batch is stronger than the last!', 169463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mecha-Golem! Take special care of $n for me, would ya? I think $Ghe:she; may have been followed...', '', 169462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kablamo! The tea is ready.', 169461, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve done it! Hold on, we\'re gettin\' out o\' here!', '', 169460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, young one. How I wish we could have met under different circumstances.', 169459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 130408, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, young one. How I wish we could have met under different circumstances.', '', 169458, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 130411, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to start the extraction process.', 'I\'m ready to start the extraction process.', 169457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings. \n\nHeart of Azeroth detected. Planetary annihilation imminent.', 169456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I imagine I wasn\'t your first choice, but I ain\'t gonna let Saffy run off to Mechagon all alone. \n\nI heard stories about the tech there, supposed to be gnomes with robotic parts and stuff. I don\'t want Saffy thinking she needs to do that...she\'s perfect with all her original parts!\n\nOf course I\'ll go, but it could be awkward.  Me being green and all.', '', 169455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your partner in life, love, and the lab says I should invite you to come to Mechagon.', 'Your partner in life, love, and the lab says I should invite you to come to Mechagon.', 169454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet you was expecting someone taller, less green, maybe a gnome?', '', 169453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug zug, $n.', '', 169452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking to return to Outland, our allies amongst the ethereals have opened a portal to Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest.\n\nFrom there, you will find easy travel to wherever you aim to go.', '', 169451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are looking to return to Outland, there is a portal upstairs to Shattrath City in Terokkar Forest.\n\nWalk through the large portal at the top of the tower to reach the portal room. The portal to Shattrath City should be on your right at the end of the hall.', '', 169450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear animal cries in the distance.', '', 169449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must report to the Dark Portal.', 'I must report to the Dark Portal.', 169448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds interesting.', 'That sounds interesting.', 169447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you want me to come with you, you gotta invite my partner in life, love, and the lab...Grizzek Fizzwrench.\n\nScoot upstairs and tell him the good news!', 169446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.', '', 169445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I modified my Lightning Blast 3000 to a lower frequency allowing it to fuse tea leaves with Azerite particles. \n\nThe taste of the tea, pairs perfectly with the energetic and lively nature of the Azerite ore. The results are most exciting... and surprisingly smooth!', 169444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tea?', 'Tea?', 169442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What problem?', 'What problem?', 169441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, Mechagon, I heard it had been discovered!\n\nAll the new technology! The possibilities make my toes wiggle!  \n\nYou bet I\'ll go! There\'s just one problem...', 169440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need you for Mechagon.', 'We need you for Mechagon.', 169439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve just discovered the two-hundred and forty third most useful thing to do with Azerite.\n\nGrab a cup of tea and test it out!', 169438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The priestess rests with a bloodied note pinned to her robes.>\n\nBWONSAMDI\'S PUPPET! THE FAITHFUL WILL NOT KNEEL.', 169437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Princess Talanji kneels before the corpse of a priest. She clutches a bloodied charm to her chest.>\n\nThey dropped her body at my feet, $n.\n\nShe did nothing except worship Bwonsamdi.\n\nI brought this fate upon her.', 169436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools! The titan defenses are already under my control! The loss of my mech means nothing! You will--', '', 169435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold true gnomish ingenuity!', '', 169434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 131356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to get to work!', 169431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got a gadget for every occasion!', 169430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello!', 169429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s our current trajectory?', 169428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need something?', 169427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 169426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good day to fly.', '', 169425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaiting orders.', '', 169424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty!', '', 169423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are go for launch.', '', 169422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Locked and loaded.', 169421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no good. No evil. No Light. There is only POWER!', '', 169420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 127197, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there!', 169419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always ready to fly.', 169418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got a new target?', 169417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orders, Commander?', 169416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s will be armed in 3 seconds!', '', 169415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to celebrate. for it is Wednesday!', '', 169414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Evasive maneuvers, Captain! Do a barrel roll!', 169413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to make the anvil.', 'I\'m ready to make the anvil.', 169412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, ye heard her, champion. Let\'s get tae it!', '', 169400, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Acknowledged. Waygate activation advised. Destination coordinates encoded within Heart of Azeroth.', 169399, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, no offense, but if me flyin\' machine couldn\'t carry Magni, I doubt it can haul a titan watcher all the way tae Silithus!', '', 169398, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Recommendation: Relocate MOTHER unit to Chamber of Heart facility.', 169397, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Error: Uldir facility designed for Old God experimentation and containment. Planetary rehabilitation not within operational parameters.', 169396, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly! We need yer help, MOTHER. Azeroth\'s dyin\', and nothin\' we do seems tae heal her.', '', 169395, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Visitor identified. Designation: Speaker. Presence of Speaker indicates imminent threat to Azeroth.', 169394, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleased tae meet ye. I\'m Magni--', '', 169393, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings. I am the Matron of Tenacity, Herald of Endless Research. Designation: MOTHER.', 169392, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been a while since I\'ve teamed up with someone from the Horde. But if we want tae save Azeroth, we have tae work together.', '', 169391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now hold on! We\'re goin\' in!', '', 169390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll do whatever it takes tae heal our world. But this time, there\'s no way I\'m lettin\' him shoulder that burden alone.', '', 169389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how heavy the burden, Magni takes it all on himself. He\'s as stubborn as he is brave, and it\'s cost him dearly.', '', 169388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s just the way he\'s always been. As a brother, as King of Ironforge, and now as Speaker of Azeroth.', '', 169387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When he turned into diamond, we all thought he was lost forever. That he sacrificed himself tae save us.', '', 169386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we were lads, I used tae joke about Magni shoulderin\' the weight o\' the world. Dinnae know he\'d take it literally.', '', 169385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Horde are not de enemy. Forgive me.', 169384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is by Talanji\'s mercy alone that I do not slaughter de heretics that threaten my queen-to-be.', 169383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such insolence can be quashed a number of ways. I will defer to Talanji\'s wisdom.', 169382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no place for weakness in our ranks.', 169381, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Others will see you for what you are, Sylvanas.', '', 169380, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take him.', 169379, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. He did. And so did you.', 169378, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Banshee!', '', 169377, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your honesty.', 169376, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You raised him as a Forsaken. But you planned to deny him his free will. To violate his mind.', '', 169375, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 127390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... Zelling?', 169373, 0, 0, 0, 102, 300, 0, 127397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Derek Proudmoore didn\'t flee to Kul Tiras by himself.', 169372, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most of you need fear nothing.', 169371, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have troubling news.', 169370, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 127394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The torment...', '', 169369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... end this curse...', '', 169368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape...', '', 169367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So cold...', '', 169366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last...', '', 169365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Desecrator...', '', 169364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revenge...', '', 169363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... hunger...', '', 169362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_CREATURE_DISEASE_02.BLP:20|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:291061|h[Death\'s Corrosion]|h|r!', '', 169361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wear it with pride, as an honored hero of both the Alliance and Kul Tiras.', 169360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, it is with great respect and admiration that I present you with the regalia of the Admiralty\'s most decorated officers.', 169359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please give my regards to the king. And wherever the winds take you, look always to the sea.', 169358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We Kul Tirans have always been an adventurous people. I have no doubt that your deeds will bring glory to the Alliance and pride to Kul Tiras.', 169357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am honored to bestow upon you de golden armor of our most sacred champions. Go forth with de blessing of de loa, and de pride of our people.', 169356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As we rejoin de world beyond our shores, you continue to represent de greatness of Zandalar.', 169355, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Gazelle cowers and whimpers in pain.', '', 169354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A bond forged in battle is as strong as a pact with de loa. Join our new brothers and sisters, and bring honor to both Zandalar and de Horde.', 169353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Plainstrider stretches its neck and shrieks in pain.', '', 169352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When de Alliance invaded our home, heroes of de Horde drew their weapons and fought by our side.', 169351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Swoop shrieks in pain.', '', 169350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Kodo rears up and roars in pain.', '', 169349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AHH! Please! Disenchant the ward that binds me!', 169348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GAH! Can\'t! Move! There\'s a ward nearby! Disenchant it!', 169347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zandalar forever!', 169339, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A glorious future awaits our empire, and we must embrace it together. Will you stand with me?', 169338, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But without their aid, we would have collapsed under de weight of our pride. These mighty allies have given Zandalar new strength.', 169337, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many questioned my judgment when I reached out to de Horde.', 169336, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'People of Zandalar.', 169335, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think of this as a mercy killing.', '', 169334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So brave, but so... shortsighted.', '', 169333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grand Magistrix... will have your heads for this...', '', 169332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not survived for ten thousand years just to fall to a swarm of rats.', '', 169331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas... blind courage only triumphs in the fairy tales.', '', 169330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a conduit of the Nightwell\'s glorious power! I am NIGHTBORNE!', '', 169329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you vermin ever witnessed such raw power? I think not.', '', 169328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! You little beasts are getting out of hand!', '', 169327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victim of my artistry.', '', 169326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never heard my blade coming!', '', 169325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let your names be forgotten.', '', 169324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind slices to the bone!', '', 169323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death by a thousand cuts!', '', 169322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you blink... you bleed!', '', 169321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt your betters!', '', 169320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally. I\'ll make this quick.', '', 169319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bleed for the Grand Magistrix!', '', 169318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande... forgive me!', '', 169317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sea to sea, storm to storm, tide to tide.', '', 169316, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this vessel be one with the vast ocean, and us with her.', '', 169315, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagine no longer, simpleton! I am more than willing to tell you how you and your little crew will meet your demise.', '', 169314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Enter Uldir.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Enter Uldir.', 169313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sparkspanner always was an odd one... Can\'t imagine what he has planned.', '', 169312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe strength into our sails, and guard us against the crushing depths!', '', 169311, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm above and tides below, hear us now!', '', 169310, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 126666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Engineering is very simple once you grasp the basics.', 169305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh has been recently shaped.\n\nShaping it again now would be... unwise.', '', 169304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna get into position for my part, and when you\'re ready, start strikin\' it as hard as ye can!', '', 169303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be sure to find ya worthy, Princess.', '', 169302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s that signal coming from, Tinkerbow? We need to hurry!', '', 169301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was one of Thermaplugg\'s assistants. But no one has heard from him since the Gnomeregan incident.', '', 169300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know that ugly mug, Cog Captain?', 169299, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 130520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems Hati\'s essence has gathered at locations where he performed great sacrifices in life. Get to the Temple of Storms right away!', '', 169298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this smelted ore on the anvil and we\'ll be ready ta get ta work.', '', 169297, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkspear have arranged for transport to Zandalar by boat at the Echo Isles to the south of Orgrimmar.\n\nAlternatively, our Zandalari allies have set up a portal directly to their capital in the portal room.', 'The Darkspear have arranged for transport to Zandalar by boat at the Echo Isles to the south of Orgrimmar.\n\nAlternatively, our Zandalari allies have set up a portal directly to their capital in the portal room.', 169296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuldazar, Zandalar', 'Zuldazar, Zandalar', 169295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies amongst the shal\'dorei have set up a portal directly to Azsuna in the Broken Isles. You can find it in the portal room, located in Orgrimmar\'s front gates.', 'Our allies amongst the shal\'dorei have set up a portal directly to Azsuna in the Broken Isles. You can find it in the portal room, located in Orgrimmar\'s front gates.', 169294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna, Broken Isles', 'Azsuna, Broken Isles', 169293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mages have opened a portal directly to Ashran in Draenor in the portal room. You can find it on the lower level, down the stairs on the left side of the hallway.\n\nIf you are going to Draenor for the first time, the Vanguard Battlemage near the portal can help you.', 'Our mages have opened a portal directly to Ashran in Draenor in the portal room. You can find it on the lower level, down the stairs on the left side of the hallway.\n\nIf you are going to Draenor for the first time, the Vanguard Battlemage near the portal can help you.', 169292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies in Pandaria have opened a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located in the portal room, inside the main gates to Orgrimmar.', 'Our allies in Pandaria have opened a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located in the portal room, inside the main gates to Orgrimmar.', 169291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a quick transport to Northrend, report to the portal room located in the front gates to Orgrimmar. Some Argent mages have set up a portal there for your use.', 'For a quick transport to Northrend, report to the portal room located in the front gates to Orgrimmar. Some Argent mages have set up a portal there for your use.', 169290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran City, Northrend', 'Dalaran City, Northrend', 169289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you\'re here! I\'ve got everything ready ta go. Just give me tha word and we\'ll get started.', '', 169288, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mage representatives from Thrallmar have set up a portal to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland in the portal room. \n\nIf you\'ve never been, the portal room is located inside the front gates to the city. The portal to Outland is on the lower level. Look for the guardian mages.', 'Mage representatives from Thrallmar have set up a portal to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland in the portal room. \n\nIf you\'ve never been, the portal room is located inside the front gates to the city. The portal to Outland is on the lower level. Look for the guardian mages.', 169287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some blood elf magisters have set up a portal to Silvermoon City in the Orgrimmar portal room. You can find the room located inside the front gates to the city.', 'Some blood elf magisters have set up a portal to Silvermoon City in the Orgrimmar portal room. You can find the room located inside the front gates to the city.', 169286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon City, Eastern Kingdoms', 'Silvermoon City, Eastern Kingdoms', 169285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to the Undercity, seek out Freeza on the eastern zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. He has more information about how to get you where you need to go.', 'To get to the Undercity, seek out Freeza on the eastern zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. He has more information about how to get you where you need to go.', 169284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undercity, Eastern Kingdoms', 'Undercity, Eastern Kingdoms', 169283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose we\'ll just figure out the plan later. Let\'s get movin\'!', '', 169282, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Restore Hati? Why did you not say so before?! I will join you in Silithus at once!', '', 169281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of Hati\'s essence is in Silithus. If we can capture it, Mimiron thinks we can reform him!', '', 169280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the love o\'... aye, \'tis good to see ye again as well, Thorim.', '', 169279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Bronzebeard and $p! It is good to see you once more!', '', 169278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM FREE!', '', 169277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! Use the Thunderspark tae absorb Hati\'s essence!', '', 169276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we\'re breakin\' through! Keep it up, $p!', '', 169275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know yer in there, Hati. We\'re here tae help ye!', '', 169274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Excelsior!', '', 169273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on already! Surgios demands power!', '', 169272, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster!', '', 169271, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t get these things operational, I\'ll make a fine necklace out of you!', '', 169270, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I concur, but that doesn\'t mean that this is Mechagon.', '', 169269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 133260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is nae titan technology!', '', 169268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! This is clearly ancient gnomish technology!', '', 169267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 132742, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mission complete. New orders: return to base.', '', 169266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where\'d be the fun in that? Hop aboard, champion!', '', 169265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet ye inside Uldir. Brann, fly safe!', '', 169264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Carnivorous Lasher is ready to feast on seaflies.', '', 169263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hati\'s essence recognizes you and becomes confused!', '', 169262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, out with it.', 169261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get this over with.', 169260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, yeah, I\'m listening.', 169259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move along, now.', 169258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tides take me.', 169257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmph. Right then.', 169256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My life for Zandalar.', 169255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I call, and de light of de loa answers.', 169254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak.', 169253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to Boralus, seek out Captain Hicks of the Relentless at the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. His vessel departs periodically for Kul Tiras.\n\nAlternatively, our Tidesage allies have opened a portal to their capital in the Mage Tower.', 'To get to Boralus, seek out Captain Hicks of the Relentless at the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. His vessel departs periodically for Kul Tiras.\n\nAlternatively, our Tidesage allies have opened a portal to their capital in the Mage Tower.', 169252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
