('Azsuna, Broken Isles', 'Azsuna, Broken Isles', 169225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies in the Kirin Tor have opened a portal inside the Mage Tower to assist heroes getting to Draenor. Take that, and it will bring you directly to Ashran.', 'Our allies in the Kirin Tor have opened a portal inside the Mage Tower to assist heroes getting to Draenor. Take that, and it will bring you directly to Ashran.', 169224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashran, Draenor', 'Ashran, Draenor', 169223, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located at the top of the central tower in the Mage Quarter.', 'Our allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located at the top of the central tower in the Mage Quarter.', 169222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
