('Mages have opened a portal to Hellfire Peninsula in the Mage Tower. You can find the portal room at the top of the tower in the Mage Quarter.', 'Mages have opened a portal to Hellfire Peninsula in the Mage Tower. You can find the portal room at the top of the tower in the Mage Quarter.', 169217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
