('Looking to go to Teldrassil? Talk to Perrin Moontear on the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. She can assist you in your travels.', 'Looking to go to Teldrassil? Talk to Perrin Moontear on the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. She can assist you in your travels.', 169215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
