('', 'They all have merit. The choice is yours, $n.', 169213, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is beautiful, mother.', 169212, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tiffin\'s Melody.', 169211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is fond of its lions. How does Lionheart sound?', '', 169210, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She seems like a Dawnsailor to me.', '', 169209, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin\'s Wrath. The Horde will learn to fear her!', 169208, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 126720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She needs a name, as all great ships do. Any suggestions?', 169207, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can mind the house, dear. Go on. Have an adventure.', '', 169206, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... yes. Thank you.', 169205, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s just a tad shy, ma\'am. Pay her no mind. Would you like some warm milk while you wait?', '', 169204, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to return to my post now. Good luck, and don\'t forget the letter.', '', 169203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking for a homestead somewhere in the Deadwash.', '', 169202, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 126741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This town\'s quite the rumor mill. But we\'ve at least narrowed down our search.', '', 169201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask around. I\'ll speak with the innkeeper. Old Buck never forgets a face.', '', 169200, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 126739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brennadam is a well-traveled crossroads. It\'s likely that Atwater has passed through here a time or two.', '', 169199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye aye, Lord Admiral. Come, $n. We\'ll start in Stormsong Valley, where we build every ship in the fleet.', '', 169198, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 126737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you in your search, but what if our mysterious shipwright refuses your request?', '', 169197, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Directive updated: Avenge Gryzix. Follow $r to hostiles.', '', 169196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... somethin\'s wrong. What is it, boy?', '', 169195, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! He remembers us!', '', 169194, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hati! Come \'ere, boy!', '', 169193, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry, Thorim, we\'ve got yer back!', '', 169192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That thing could barely carry us when I wasn\'t made of diamond. I\'ll take my chances on the ground.', '', 169191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hati... is that you?', '', 169190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our next combatant has more hammers than a carpenter convention. Where the deuce do they all come from, anyway?', 169189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah come on, Magni! This ol\' bird can handle the extra weight!', '', 169188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127403, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And straight from of the frozen wastelands of Draenor... Stop what you\'re doing; it\'s hammer time!', '', 169187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your eyes do not deceive you folks, we have a brewmistress from the beautiful lands of Pandaria!', '', 169186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To take on our fledgling champion, we have someone who\'s going to brew beer in the arena? Wait, that can\'t be right...', 169184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 169176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $Glad:lass;! Somethin\' ain\'t right.', '', 169175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combat Mode: Active. Powering thrusters.', '', 169174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These tracks are only a few hours old...', '', 169173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New orders: follow $r. Protect at all costs.', '', 169170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave Uldir.', 'Leave Uldir.', 169169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this... death? Fascinating...', '', 169168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep trying...', '', 169167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, for the last bit of data... your death!', '', 169166, 0, 22031, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that is but the price of information. My master will be pleased with my observations.', '', 169165, 0, 22031, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a shame I had to kill that innocent shopkeeper to set it all in motion.', '', 169164, 0, 22031, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watching you fight was quite informative... but watching you solve this mystery has been even more illuminating.', '', 169163, 0, 22031, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been observing you for some time now, $p.', 169162, 0, 22031, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Distress mode: Engaged. Returning to home base.', '', 169159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You said Aerial Elite Rangers, which would be G.A.E.R. If you wanted G.E.A.R.--', 169158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elite Aerial Rangers, sir!', 169157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what I said! Anyway, you are the first Gnomish Elite Aerial Rangers. And you will show Azeroth everything we gnomes can accomplish.', '', 169156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuse me, soldier?', '', 169155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see you back at Brawl\'gar, $p. Let\'s go unmask the fake me and get to the bottom of this murder mystery!', 169154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethrak detected. Powering stompers...', '', 169153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dataguru Gryzix: Not found. New guardian: $r.', '', 169152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Passenger Override: Active.', '', 169151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The remainder of Hati\'s essence is trapped in Silithus... dangerously close to the wound.', '', 169150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is worse than I thought. I\'m going to quarantine the signal. Hold on!', '', 169149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?! Is Hati alright?', '', 169148, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silithid? Most suspicious. Perhaps if I reference a different dataset... oh dear.', '', 169147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a moment! More data coming in through the triangulation protocol. Analyzing...', '', 169146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh> That\'s a shame. He was a good kid. Probably offed by the same folks that left me marooned here.', 169145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The signal originates from the Temple of Storms not far from here. Seems it\'s time to pay a visit to our friend Thorim!', '', 169144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Tell Boss Bazzelflange about Paul North\'s murder.>', '<Tell Boss Bazzelflange about Paul North\'s murder.>', 169143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to my calculations, it\'s only locked onto a portion of Hati\'s essence. But indeed, Bronzebeard, we do!', '', 169142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well? Do ye know where Hati\'s run off to?!', '', 169141, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, thanks! You didn\'t have to do that, sweetheart!\n\nSo, what have I missed while I was gone?', 169140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Boss Bazzelflange 2 gold so she can get home.>', '<Offer Boss Bazzelflange 2 gold so she can get home.>', 169139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Boss Bazzelflange your hearthstone so she can get home.>', '<Offer Boss Bazzelflange your hearthstone so she can get home.>', 169138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a feelin\' we ain\'t out of the woods just yet, $Glad:lass;.', '', 169137, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any Bazzelflange you\'ve been working with is a traitor! I don\'t know who she... or, it... is, but I know that they\'re not me. I\'m me!\n\nI\'ll tell you everything I know.\n\nI don\'t know what happened. They caught me from behind. There was a scuffle and then... darkness. And then I was here, on the other side of the world, without a hearthstone or a copper to my name.', 169136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Boss Bazzelflange? I thought you were at Brawl\'gar Arena. What\'s going on?', 'What? Boss Bazzelflange? What\'s going on?', 169135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cross-referencing the data with my archives now. Let\'s see where this signal is coming from!', '', 169134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are... are you from Brawl\'gar? It\'s me! Boss Bazzelflange!\n\nThe REAL Boss Bazzelflange!', 169133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proto-drakes... fascinating. Fascinating indeed!', '', 169132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I believe you are best equipped to handle dis.', 169131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. It is their right to be angry. I will use force only as a last resort.', 169130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s up tae us, $p. For the wilds!', '', 169129, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear. I may have been premature in my assessment. Something is coming through!', '', 169128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course not, Bronzebeard!', '', 169127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There won\'t be any \'incompatibilities\' this time... right?', '', 169126, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m engaging the triangulation protocol now. In a few moments we should know exactly where Hati\'s essence has run off to!', '', 169125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Sylvanas Windrunner, and I approve this message.', 169124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 125588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Anduin Wrynn, and I approve this message.', '', 169123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste! There\'s so much glorious science ahead of us!', '', 169121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Gnomeregan!', 169120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is not the last, but the first. Drown her and you will see.', '', 169119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He gave himself to the deep places. He gave himself to me.', '', 169118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It grows hungrier... bolder. Alas, your eyes are closed.', '', 169117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I alone can save you from what is to come.', '', 169116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to Zuldazar, my champion, so dat your deeds may be celebrated and rewarded.', 169114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Zandalari Empire has a long history of heroes, but few of dem can match all dat you have achieved.', 169113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that you have seen the world beyond Kul Tiras, it is time to return to the shores of home. It would be my honor to personally commend you for your service.', 169112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you have made quite a name for yourself, $n. Not a day goes by without your exploits being toasted in the taverns of Boralus.', 169111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deep one\'s prison weakens. None will be spared!', '', 169110, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all drown beneath him...', '', 169109, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, I am queen.', 169107, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But over time, our empire grew stagnant. We stood alone.', 169106, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Zandalari have ruled dis land for thousands of years.', 169105, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DELETE ME.', 169104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
