('', 'For a time, we let fear and distrust divide us.', 169102, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every Kul Tiran shares a bond with the sea.', 169101, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 126196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
