('When the arrow finds its mark, the last fetter will fall away.', '', 169093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to return home?', '', 169088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, fallen ones!', '', 169083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fall of night reveals her true face. She will bring only ruin.', '', 169082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The veil wanes. His crown will open the way.', '', 169081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Six seats at the high table. Six mouths that hunger. One will consume all others.', '', 169080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light has struck a bargain with the enemy of all.', '', 169079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 125382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You\'re almost out of time! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r is imminent!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You\'re almost out of time! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r is imminent!', 169077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 121526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]', 169076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[DNT]', 169075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 169074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 169073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 169072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '', 169071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The forest is our ally... you will perish...', 169069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kaldorei will retake this land!', 169068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda stuck... to my day job...', '', 169067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh you\'re gonna be extra crispy, pal!', '', 169066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ancestors... will drive you out...', '', 169065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You defile this land with your presence!', '', 169064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never... surrender...', '', 169063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-tar ogar!', '', 169062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your kind... will not... prevail...', 169061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gilneas stands with the Kaldorei!', 169060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take... dis land...', '', 169059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkshore belongs to da Shatterspear now!', '', 169058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be... broken...', '', 169057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We claim this land in the name of Azshara!', '', 169056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are only... the beginning', 169055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga tide will break your pathetic forces!', 169054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! My work is not... complete...', '', 169053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late! Soggoth has arisen!', '', 169052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defense matrix failing... Site has been lost...', '', 169051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This site has been compromised. All lifeforms will be purged.', '', 169050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all drown beneath him...', '', 169049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deep one\'s prison weakens. None will be spared!', '', 169048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I cannot be... defeated!', '', 169047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is mine!', '', 169046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da embers... fade...', 169045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis forest will burn!', 169044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cycle continues...', '', 169043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the wrath of the forest!', '', 169042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, my son. Let it be.', '', 169041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 130426, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 169040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaddup! Punch bigger!', '', 169039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Brugg, dat make no sense...', '', 169038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother, no!', '', 169037, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tap out...', '', 169036, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You done!', '', 169035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Brother no die!', '', 169034, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brugg, me hurt...', '', 169033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...You die like da crows!', '', 169032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bash with da bros...', '', 169031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No run!', '', 169030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On second thought... nevermind. I like this curse!', 'On second thought... nevermind. I like this curse!', 169029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you return me to the present time?', 'Can you return me to the present time?', 169028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. We must discover what she\'s after... and stop whatever madness she seeks to unleash upon us.', '', 169027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are so close to ending this conflict and forging a lasting peace. But if Sylvanas uncovers some new weapon that allows her to keep fighting...', '', 169026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s clear she does not fight for Azeroth. She doesn\'t even fight for the Horde. She wages war upon life itself.', '', 169025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Sylvanas Windrunner became warchief, I knew we would not be friends... but I didn\'t want us to be enemies. Then came the massacre in Arathi... and the burning of Teldrassil.', '', 169024, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you show me what Darkshore was like before the battle?', 'Can you show me what Darkshore was like before the battle?', 169023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WORK IN PROGRESS', '', 169022, 0, 0, 0, 93, 555555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ERR! Find the ward! Disenchant it!', 169021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Darkshore Unlocked', 'The Battle for Darkshore Unlocked', 169020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '[DNT]', 169019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT]', '[DNT]', 169018, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reshape me.', 'Reshape me.', 169017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may reshape your flesh if you so desire. \n\nBe aware that you will not be able to be changed in this manner for a time afterwards, and your mind may never be the same.\n\nHow may this one serve?', '', 169016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This war is about to shift yet again. And it will be this blade that guides our way to victory.', 169015, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War is a living thing. It writhes, it grows, twisting and turning until its final form is revealed.', 169014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools. The boy-king has lied to himself and his people. He hasn\'t the faintest inkling of what he\'s truly up against.', 169013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance believes that by striking down Rastakhan and decimating the Zandalari fleet, they have broken us. That the Horde will soon crumble.', 169012, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Old God wants us fractured. Divided. I fear this war has given N\'Zoth exactly what he wants.', '', 169011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I became a tidesage to wield the might of the depths for the good of Kul Tiras. To learn of the great darkness lurking beneath us all this time...', '', 169010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All my life, I\'ve witnessed the duality of the sea. It is both a source of life... and a force of destruction.', '', 169009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We defeated G\'huun, but N\'Zoth poses an even graver threat. In a world torn apart by war, I pray de loa will show us a way to stop him.', 169008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But now I see dat dey are all too real. An infection within de heart of Azeroth.', 169007, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a child, I listened to de elders tell tales of de Old Gods. I thought dey were little more than ghost stories meant to frighten us.', 169006, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn back and continue fighting the Alliance.', 'Turn back and continue fighting the Alliance.', 169005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take a Jury-Rigged Hand Cannon from Okri.>', '<Take a Jury-Rigged Hand Cannon from Okri.>', 169004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 169003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your place. She is about to begin.', 169002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Outriggers can hunt down anything!', '', 169001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to continue the fight in Draenor, take the portal behind me.', 168996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to continue the fight in Draenor, take the portal to Ashran upstairs.', 168995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must help Khadgar. Send me to the Blasted Lands!', 'I must help Khadgar. Send me to the Blasted Lands!', 168994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to return to the Broken Isles, please use the portal behind me.', 168993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it, $n?', 168992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It seems you\'ve survived another day. We shall see if your luck continues...', 'It seems you\'ve survived another day. We shall see if your luck continues...', 168991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did good today, my pet. We shall continue your training another time.', 'You did good today, my pet. We shall continue your training another time.', 168990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of this, we shall continue your training another time.', 'I tire of this, we shall continue your training another time.', 168989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A righteous slaying, a mercy kill, in the end it is all murder...', 'A righteous slaying, a mercy kill, in the end it is all murder...', 168988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death surrounds you like a heavy shroud, just how many corpses have you left behind to reach this point?', 'Death surrounds you like a heavy shroud, just how many corpses have you left behind to reach this point?', 168987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your weapon down, I\'m sure you can come to an understanding...', 'Put your weapon down, I\'m sure you can come to an understanding...', 168986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill, Kill, KILL!', 'Kill, Kill, KILL!', 168985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Controlling your mind is giving me a headache!', 'Controlling your mind is giving me a headache!', 168984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only speak the truth, you can trust me.', 'I only speak the truth, you can trust me.', 168983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to solve everything with violence. Try not fighting back...', 'You don\'t have to solve everything with violence. Try not fighting back...', 168982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried standing in lava? I hear it\'s the hot new thing.', 'Have you tried standing in lava? I hear it\'s the hot new thing.', 168981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see that thing moving over there? Slay it! It has something shiny!', 'Do you see that thing moving over there? Slay it! It has something shiny!', 168980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are looking to return to the Broken Isles, please take the portal upstairs.', 168979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin Tor requires my aid. Send me to Dalaran!', 'The Kirin Tor requires my aid. Send me to Dalaran!', 168978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I help you, $c?', 168977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind is such a simple thing to control.', 'Your mind is such a simple thing to control.', 168976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you couldn\'t resist!', 'I knew you couldn\'t resist!', 168975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you would succumb!', 'I knew you would succumb!', 168974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must destroy the spirit before it is too late!', '', 168972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 130425, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take care, $c. The Horde is assaulting this region.\n\nThe Alliance has dispatched a contingent of soldiers empowered by the Light to protect the people here.\n\nWe will keep this area secure, but we cannot guarantee your safety outside of Arom\'s Stand.\n\nIf you see any Horde activity, report it to the nearest Alliance officer and we will deal with the threat.\n\nDioniss aca!', 168970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 396, 66, 0, 2000, 3000, 39653),
('', 'For Gnomeregan!', 168969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Gnomeregan!', '', 168968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drop it!', '', 168967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put that down!', '', 168966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back off!', '', 168965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first! Every elite unit requires a proper uniform! Wear the colors of Gnomeregan with pride, ranger!', '', 168964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers! You have more than proven gnomish aerial might. The Alliance will no doubt call upon G.E.A.R. in the future.', '', 168963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wood thief!', '', 168962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s stealing!', '', 168961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna get axed!', '', 168960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hands off!', '', 168959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been hit! Hold onto something! This is going to be a bumpy landing!', '', 168957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t matter how far we push into Darkshore if the night elves circle back and attack us from behind.', '', 168956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
