('', 'I\'ll keep that in mind when we get shot out of the sky, Cog Captain.', 168948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worry not, tinker. I am an excellent pilot.', '', 168947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, Commander. The titan facility\'s exterior defenses may have been rewired to see us as intruders.', 168946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
