('Naga forces are preparing for an assault!', 'Naga forces are preparing for an assault!', 168938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Roller coaster... of loooooove!', 168937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll need a ride ticket to ride the roller coaster. Come and get your ride tickets!', 168936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ride tickets! Get your roller coaster ride tickets!', 168935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel the need? The need... for speed?!', 168934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the adrenaline rush!', 168933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ride the Gryvern roller coaster!', 168932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the roller coaster.', 'You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the roller coaster.', 168931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De only option left is to destroy dis artifact to remove de fog... curse de Alliance for dis trap!', 168930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something is not right... de magic in dis artifact is not being dispelled!', 168929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This guy\'s downed more goblin pilots than the rest of the Alliance squadrons combined!', '', 168919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah scrap, it\'s the baron! Move, move, move!', '', 168917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a safe spot to land! We\'ll cover you while you adjust the device.', '', 168912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander! The signal tracker is going haywire! I\'ll need some time to recalibrate it.', 168911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so, you four will be the first to take to the skies as Gnomish Aerial Elite Rangers, and--', '', 168908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are Gnomeregan\'s finest soldiers. Paragons of gnomanity. The best examples of gnomish ingenuity and determination.', '', 168907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is it!', 168905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! That looks familiar!', 168904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not this one, either.', 168903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not this tree. Let\'s keep moving.', 168902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was buried near one of these trees, the ones with red leaves and white bark. Follow me.', 168901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those poor souls, trapped by that ward. You should disenchant it to free them.', 168900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '*Sigh* These woods used to be filled with joyous spirits. But now... let me show you what I see...', 168899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I welcome all of you to the Alliance.', '', 168898, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 126776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She is yours to command, as is her crew. They will serve you on behalf of Kul Tiras.', 168897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May she be as steadfast as my father.', '', 168896, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... Jaina.', '', 168895, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And into the dawn she will sail.', '', 168894, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It certainly sends a powerful message. May her enemies give her a wide berth.', '', 168893, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lionheart.', 168892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tiffin\'s Melody.', 168891, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dawnsailor.', 168890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t stop yet, friend.', 168889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin\'s Wrath.', 168888, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Onward!', 168887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is her name?', '', 168886, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can think of no grander gesture, Lord Admiral.', '', 168885, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come along, friend!', 168884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tiras and the Alliance once shared a bond of friendship. Now both of our peoples will see that bond reforged.', 168883, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving.', 168882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready?', 168881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m pretty sure it was this way.', 168880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you asked to meet me at the harbor, I had no idea what you had in mind. This is incredible!', '', 168879, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 126769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'mon, let\'s go!', 168878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait\'ll you see the next version of my bomber, $p... It\'s gonna blow your doors off!', '', 168877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey \'mon.\n\nDa mages of da Horde be finally comin\' together to make travelin\' a bit easier.\n\nIf ya be lookin\' to go to one of dem regions still wounded from da Cataclysm, ya can get dere at da Western Earthshrine north of de zeppelins.', '', 168875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De fools around here don\'t appreciate de true power of my transmutations. But I\'ll show dem. Soon, they\'ll come to know me as someone to respect...$b$bBut what brings you all de way out here, $c? Looking to learn de secrets of alchemy?$b$bIf dat be de case, it\'ll cost ya.', '', 168873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Placeholder Interaction: Go to Stormwind.>', '<Placeholder Interaction: Go to Stormwind.>', 168872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tandred will guide her to Stormwind Harbor, but I believe it appropriate for you send us on our way. Place your hands upon the helm when you are ready.', 168871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are leaving the combat area. Turn back!', 'You are leaving the combat area. Turn back!', 168870, 0, 89117, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, I had him right where I wanted him! I was just... recovering my strength. Carry on.', '', 168869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise I won\'t make a good meal, kitty. Very boney.', '', 168868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad kitty!', '', 168867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Placeholder RTC: Tidesage\'s Blessing.>', '<Placeholder RTC: Tidesage\'s Blessing.>', 168866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Brother Pike.', 'Yes, Brother Pike.', 168865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my pleasure to offer my services to bless this vessel.\n\nJoin me as we cross the bay to deliver a proper sermon.', '', 168864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am honored to have been chosen as part of this crew, $n.', '', 168863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
