('', 'What shall we call this new vessel, $n?', 168853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I make it a point not to share my methods, Lord Admiral.', 168852, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 126710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That quickly? How is that possible?', 168851, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should be done by day\'s end. Sooner, if you stay out of my way.', 168850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You have suffered an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r! Make sure to input the shutdown code that matches your Spark Bot!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You have suffered an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r! Make sure to input the shutdown code that matches your Spark Bot!', 168849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine. But you\'ll be getting an earful if you damage my ship.', 168848, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a chance.', '', 168847, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 126765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not going to let this go, are you?', 168846, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you build something this magnificent and not want to sail it into the sunset? She\'s beautiful!', '', 168845, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m retired.', 168844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Name a better boatswain and I\'ll take them instead. You wanted the best. You are the best.', '', 168843, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you heard the man.', 'Well, you heard the man.', 168842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not like the way this young man is looking at me.', 168841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had my time in the public eye. I\'m quite content to finish out my days in obscurity.\n\nBesides, Sal struggles with crowds.', 168840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, there\'s someone else I want to recruit. Meet me at Port Fogtide once you\'ve spoken to everyone.', '', 168839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Excellent. I couldn\'t ask for a finer crew. Pack up and follow me.', '', 168838, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 126761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lead with that next time, Captain.', 168837, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 126715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... I would assume so, yes.', '', 168836, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance? Does that mean we\'ll be giving the Horde some payback?', 168835, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll still be your crew! I want all of you on my ship when we set sail under the Alliance\'s flag.', '', 168834, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 126759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You expect me to be flattered? I\'m a captain. The Outriggers are my crew.', 168833, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know how it sounds, but I need a first mate I can count on! And that means you!', '', 168832, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 126758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want me to be your WHAT?', 168831, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 126712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are ya KIDDING me?!', 168830, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will regret this!', '', 168829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese bubbles appear to contain some sort of power. Perhaps if I just remove de exterior...', 168828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah!', 168827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese eyes seem nice and plump. I\'ll just squeeze a few drops from dem and...', 168826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting...', '', 168825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day, mainlander.\n\nWhat can the Outriggers do for you? Come to harpoon some beasts?', 168824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, lads and lasses. Looks like I\'m off to sea.', '', 168823, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Point taken.', '', 168822, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re more than capable of holding the hill.', 'We\'re more than capable of holding the hill.', 168821, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been taking pot shots at parrots for a while now, sir.', 'You\'ve been taking pot shots at parrots for a while now, sir.', 168820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And leave this gate undefended?', '', 168819, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tandred Proudmoore is putting together a crew. He needs a master gunner. Are you interested?', 'Tandred Proudmoore is putting together a crew. He needs a master gunner. Are you interested?', 168818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are they getting all these parrots?\n\nBah. What do you need, $n?', '', 168817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cursed pirates!', '', 168816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Besides, how could I refuse the Lord Admiral\'s brother?', '', 168815, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 126757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legacy of the tidesages has been tainted, but perhaps I can help rebuild it.', '', 168814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been too long since I have stood upon the seas.', '', 168813, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tandred Proudmoore is putting together a crew. He needs a tidesage. Are you interested?', 'Tandred Proudmoore is putting together a crew. He needs a tidesage. Are you interested?', 168812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You walk with purpose, $n.\n\nHow can I help?', '', 168811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at Outrigger Post, where we can find the rest of our crew.', '', 168810, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 126754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For my master gunner, I\'ll have none other than Lieutenant Tarenfold. He should still be stationed at Vigil Hill.', '', 168809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother Pike is currently here in Boralus. He\'s my first choice for a tidesage. No ship sails without one.', '', 168808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve a few in mind, but some of them might take more convincing than others.', '', 168807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
