('Someone needs to stop it!', 'Someone needs to stop it!', 168293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s going to break through!', 'It\'s going to break through!', 168292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance already begins to quake under our might! Hop on, $r. Go and finish the fight!', '', 168291, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot... win.', 'You cannot... win.', 168290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will be... defeated...', 'The Horde will be... defeated...', 168289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t... kill us all...', 'You can\'t... kill us all...', 168288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late to stop us.', 'You are too late to stop us.', 168287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your borders are weak!', 'Your borders are weak!', 168286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is for Teldrassil!', 'This is for Teldrassil!', 168285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, $r! Hop on and get to the front!', '', 168284, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde scum.', 'Horde scum.', 168283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 168282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 168281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are not enough of you to succeed. It is only a matter of time!', 'There are not enough of you to succeed. It is only a matter of time!', 168280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a pitiful excuse for a supply line.', 'What a pitiful excuse for a supply line.', 168279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The supplies your people brought will aid the Horde nicely.', 'The supplies your people brought will aid the Horde nicely.', 168278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The... Alliance will still... fall...', 'The... Alliance will still... fall...', 168277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friends with the Explorer\'s League have uncovered these bones. The skeleton appears to be intact, and should be a suitable vessel.$b$bThe Void seeks to consume. Engulf. Grow. It will answer our call, and will allow itself to be guided for a time.$b$bI am told the Zandalari hold their dead in special regard, a rather primitive approach for such a grand civilization. One might consider it... poetic for them to be undone by one of their own, hmm?', '', 168276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... was more hoping... for victory instead of... death...', 'I... was more hoping... for victory instead of... death...', 168275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Others will come...', 'Others will come...', 168274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A... glorious... death...', 'A... glorious... death...', 168273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R! Hurry up and hop on! We\'ve already begun our assault on this cursed land.', '', 168272, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', 'Die!', 168271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought you could get behind OUR lines?', 'You thought you could get behind OUR lines?', 168270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This totem should scare away the vulpera without harming them. Then you can focus on the primary objective--destroying those Horde supplies.', 168269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vulpera are not our enemy, but we cannot allow them to transport supplies for the Horde.', 168268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been sporting for a good fight. Try not to die too fast.', 'I\'ve been sporting for a good fight. Try not to die too fast.', 168267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make a fine meal for my wolf.', 'You will make a fine meal for my wolf.', 168266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance scum!', 'Alliance scum!', 168265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will paint this continent red with your blood!', 'We will paint this continent red with your blood!', 168264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ritual is this, Magister?', 'What ritual is this, Magister?', 168263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Telaamon, sir, we\'re under attack by a lone darkspear named Rokhan!', 'Telaamon, sir, we\'re under attack by a lone darkspear named Rokhan!', 168262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokhan? I have heard of this shadow hunter. Let us see how powerful he truly is.', '', 168261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix, I know I\'ll regret asking this, but what do you think of Derek Proudmoore\'s revival?', 'Gallywix, I know I\'ll regret asking this, but what do you think of Derek Proudmoore\'s revival?', 168260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lilian has been helping me come to terms with who I am... and why she played a role in it.', 168259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will fight for Lady Shandris, whenever she calls.', 168258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian, what are your thoughts about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore?', 'Lilian, what are your thoughts about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore?', 168257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian, I heard you helped Zelling\'s family get a home in Drustvar.', 'Lilian, I heard you helped Zelling\'s family get a home in Drustvar.', 168256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine, you seem troubled about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore.', 'Baine, you seem troubled about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore.', 168255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are your thoughts about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore?', 'What are your thoughts about Sylvanas bringing back Derek Proudmoore?', 168254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How silly of the Alliance to think they can stop us from experimenting here. Why, the Blight is actually derived from the most potent of nature\'s capabilities.\n\nThis gigantic tree won\'t slow us down much, don\'t you worry.', '', 168253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde think they can draw power from the land to enhance their weapons of war. Our Ancient of Lore will help undo the damage they have caused.', '', 168252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen an invasion like this before, but once we\'re done with the Horde, it won\'t ever come back!', 168251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now they\'ve got big, angry elementals? I\'m out!', 'Now they\'ve got big, angry elementals? I\'m out!', 168250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niiishaaa!', 'Niiishaaa!', 168249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that?!', 'What is that?!', 168248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was supposed to be an easy job!', 'This was supposed to be an easy job!', 168247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m outta here!', 'I\'m outta here!', 168246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody said anything about angry elementals!', 'Nobody said anything about angry elementals!', 168245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t sign up for this!', 'I didn\'t sign up for this!', 168244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh!', 'Ahhh!', 168243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Ulfar I said hello!', '', 168242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nearly there!', '', 168241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no quarrel with the local vulpera, but the Horde is hiring their caravans to transport war supplies.\n\nThis cannot be allowed to continue.\n\nIt is my hope that we can scare the caravan drivers off and deter them from working with the Horde in the future... without making them our enemies.\n\n<Vakaara sighs.> \n\nWartime diplomacy is never easy.', 168240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... don\'t look down.', '', 168239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily for you, I\'m as sure-footed as they come.', '', 168238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the totem. I\'ll scare away the vulpera!', 'Give me the totem. I\'ll scare away the vulpera!', 168237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have learned that the Horde is hiring vulpera caravans to transport war supplies.\n\nThough we have no quarrel with the little fox people, we cannot allow them to bring aid to our enemies.\n\nUse this Sandscream Totem to scare the vulpera away from the supplies, then destroy them.\n\nTo be clear, I mean destroy the supplies... not the vulpera! We merely want to dissuade them from doing any more jobs for the Horde.', 168236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But he always starts talking about \"dignity\" and I stop listening.', '', 168235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, I keep trying to convince Ulfar that a goat form would be amazing.', '', 168234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight, this ride is about to get a little bumpy.', '', 168233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are no match for them!', 'We are no match for them!', 168232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 168231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need reinforcements!', 'We need reinforcements!', 168230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re under attack!', 'We\'re under attack!', 168229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is attacking!', 'The Alliance is attacking!', 168228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their champion is here!', 'Their champion is here!', 168227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On my target!', 168226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will be quick.', 168225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 168224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider this done.', 168223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, I borrowed it.', 168222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gesbish Togglebot left the keys in it.', 168221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s almost like being a machine!', 168220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it down. Of course I made sure his family was taken care of. Do I look like a monster?\n\nOn second thought, don\'t answer that.\n\nI gave Zelling my word that his family would remain safe. I intend to keep my promise, even if I have to do it from the shadows.', 168219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot abide this, $n. Each time I think Sylvanas has gone too far, she finds a new line to cross. I have watched her commit one dishonorable act after another.\n\nShe desecrates more than the memory of a fallen enemy. She desecrates the Horde itself.\n\nThis cannot stand. Something must be done. And soon.', '', 168218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'My father\'s final act was to invoke de power of Bwonsamdi. De Zandalari are no strangers to calling upon de dead to serve us.\n\nYet de raising of Derek Proudmoore makes me uneasy. It reminds me of what Zul did to my beloved Rezan... a foul deed dat broke my heart.\n\nDe Alliance must be brought to justice for my father\'s death. But we must not let rage blind us... or make us forget de honor dat makes de Zandalari great.', 168217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhhh, the Alliance is gonna be fumin\' over this one! They\'re gonna come at us, guns blazin\'. You know what that means, right?\n\nIt means my profit margins on Azerite armor plating are gonna go through the roof! I gotta double--no, triple--my mining operations! It\'s a good thing I don\'t pay my goons overtime. Or at all.\n\nNow if you\'ll excuse me, I gotta go see a warchief about supply and demand. Scram!', '', 168216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I was a cadet, my instructors would tell me stories of Derek Proudmoore\'s bravery. Every captain I knew dreamt of living up to his legacy. \n\nIt pains me to see him like this, to know that he will never again be accepted by his people or his family.\n\nAnd to know I played a part in it.', 168215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not surprised. I always knew the Banshee Queen was capable of tactics like these. As she\'s so fond of saying, they are the arrows in her quiver. \n\nThis changes nothing for me... or for what I need to do.', 168214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War isn\'t pretty. I know that all too well, and so does Windrunner. You have to decide what you\'re willing to do to achieve victory... and what you\'re not.', 168213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure thing! Hop on!', '', 168212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you take me to the High Thornspeaker?', 'Can you take me to the High Thornspeaker?', 168211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Birchgrove said you might need some help getting up to Ulfar. His lair doesn\'t exactly have signs.', '', 168210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defended Thoras\'tal Spire!', '$n has defended Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken Thoras\'tal Spire!', 'The Alliance has taken Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted Thoras\'tal Spire!', '$n has assaulted Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, $c! We are taking the Zandalari homeland! Hop on!', '', 168206, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has defended Thoras\'tal Spire!', '$n has defended Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken Thoras\'tal Spire!', 'The Horde has taken Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted Thoras\'tal Spire!', '$n has assaulted Thoras\'tal Spire!', 168203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, $c! It\'s time we show the Horde they are not even safe here! Hop on and get in there, soldier!', '', 168202, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_ENGGIZMOS_35.BLP:20|t %s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:287952|h[Wormhole Generator]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_ENGGIZMOS_35.BLP:20|t %s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:287952|h[Wormhole Generator]|h|r!', 168201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_GNOME_MALE.BLP:20|t You\'re |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284168|h[Shrunk]|h|r watch out!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_GNOME_MALE.BLP:20|t You\'re |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284168|h[Shrunk]|h|r watch out!', 168200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Way too easy!', 'Way too easy!', 168199, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength... and honor...', 'Strength... and honor...', 168198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will... prevail...', 'The Horde will... prevail...', 168197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die... a warrior\'s death...', 'I die... a warrior\'s death...', 168196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder!', 'Blood and thunder!', 168195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 168194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory or death!', 'Victory or death!', 168193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You\'re almost out of time! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r is imminent!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_STATICSHOCK.BLP:20|t You\'re almost out of time! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286480|h[Anti-Tampering Shock]|h|r is imminent!', 168192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 121525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, $c! We\'re attacking the horde in Nazmir! Hop on and get in there, soldier!', '', 168191, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_GNOME_MALE.BLP:20|t You\'re |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284168|h[Shrunk]|h|r! Take control of a Spark Bot!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_GNOME_MALE.BLP:20|t You\'re |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284168|h[Shrunk]|h|r! Take control of a Spark Bot!', 168190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No match for me!', 'No match for me!', 168189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got their champion in my sights!', 'I\'ve got their champion in my sights!', 168188, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take him out!', 'Take him out!', 168187, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got \'em in my sights!', 'Got \'em in my sights!', 168186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t hear any more noise. I do hope that means you smashed the intruder, you foolish brute.', '', 168185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I go... to de otha side...', 'I go to... de otha side...', 168184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde will avenge us...', 'Da Horde will avenge us...', 168183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda stayed away... from da voodoo...', 'Shoulda stayed away... from da voodoo...', 168182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is our land!', 'Dis is our land!', 168181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to da Horde\'s enemies!', 'Death to da Horde\'s enemies!', 168180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya messin wit da wrong troll, mon!', 'Ya messin wit da wrong troll, mon!', 168179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know how hard it is to hold open portals all day?\n\nThat\'s not really my shtick. I\'m gonna stick to supervisin\'. Trust me, these loonies need it!', 168178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filling Vessel', 'Filling Vessel', 168177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orcs do enjoy their mood lighting, don\'t they?\n\nUnfortunately for me, it doesn\'t quite lend to the best environment for studying.', 'The orcs do enjoy their mood lighting, don\'t they?\n\nUnfortunately for me, it doesn\'t quite lend to the best environment for studying.', 168176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was skeptical of the Forsaken when I first joined the Horde, but was assured that they chose their state of undeath willingly. This, however...\n\nThe nightborne suffered greatly under the Legion\'s heel. The atrocities I witnessed... it is distressing how much I am reminded of them now. I will leave it at that.', 168175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have my partners sent for me? Is it time?', '', 168174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
