('Where... am I?', '', 167556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like your communication device is working, tinker.', '', 167555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 130530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are times when it pays to be subtle.', '', 167554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Testing. One, two, three. Can you hear me, Commander?', 167553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130498, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 167552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to choose Jani, the loa of Scavengers.', 'I would like to choose Jani, the loa of Scavengers.', 167551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh don\'t worry about that little lost wisp. It has been put away somewhere safe.\n\n<Father Norlath smiles.>', '', 167550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever happened to that wisp?', 'Whatever happened to that wisp?', 167549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It can be disorienting to suddenly find oneself alive again, particularly in the middle of a battlefield.\n\nWe are here to help our new recruits adjust to this transition.', '', 167548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re gonna have to lead these mines to the target!', 167547, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get the crawler mines back into operation!', 167546, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We gotta swarm \'em. One crawler mine will never make it through!', 167545, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you wish to cleanse the Gift of N\'Zoth? You will not be able to undo this decision.', 'Are you sure you wish to cleanse the Gift of N\'Zoth? You will not be able to undo this decision.', 167544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are those?', '', 167543, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chimaera! Take cover!', '', 167542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that on the horizon? Looks like...', '', 167541, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need a lift?', 167540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The shapes under Vashreen\'s hood ripple in to a crude approximation of a smile.>\n\nHow wonderful to see you, $n. Can I interest you in one of my freshly-acquired products?', '', 167539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another of our sisters has fallen to darkness. But that will not stop us from our duty.', 167538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodfang will hunt the Forsaken into extinction.', '', 167537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no memory of that skill.', 'I have no memory of that skill.', 167533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no idea how to do that.', 'I have no idea how to do that.', 167532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t recall that ability.', 'I don\'t recall that ability.', 167531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the central road!', '|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the central road!', 167530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the western road!', '|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the western road!', 167529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the eastern road!', '|A:Warfront-AllianceWave3:25:23:0:0|aAn Alliance assault force has deployed to the eastern road!', 167528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARNING: This choice will prevent you from completing the main Fate of Saurfang quests, and will grant you an alternative quest instead.\n\nYou will not be able to obtain the Worn Cloak toy, but other rewards will be obtainable.\n\nZekhan will remember this, are you sure?', 'WARNING: This choice will prevent you from completing the main Fate of Saurfang quests, and will grant you an alternative quest instead.\n\nYou will not be able to obtain the Worn Cloak toy, but other rewards will be obtainable.\n\nZekhan will remember this, are you sure?', 167527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not my battle.', 'This is not my battle.', 167526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not betray my Warchief, troll.', 'I will not betray my Warchief, troll.', 167525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Catch!', '', 167524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get these Alliance off my ship!', '', 167523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will throw your corpse overboard to rot with your friends!', '', 167522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I would die in this cage.', '', 167521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge those of us who could not be saved.', '', 167520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not forget your bravery.', '', 167519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the blight on the intruders!', '', 167518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! Free us so we may continue our mission.', '', 167517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tales of my demise were gravely exaggerated.', '', 167516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally free!', '', 167515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are, Commander.\n\nHerk Winklespring reporting for duty! I was a captain in Mekkatorque\'s personal squadron, serving directly under the High Tinker himself. \n\nIt\'s an honor to work with you, commander.', '', 167514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Name, Cog Captain?', 'Name, Cog Captain?', 167513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you wish to continue?', 'Are you sure you wish to continue?', 167512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to make way.', 'We\'re ready to make way.', 167511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t he beautiful? I\'ve been working on various modifications to Mekkatorque\'s newest mechanostrider plans in hopes of making them even more useful. So far, I\'ve been able to reduce shock damage of long distance jumps to the accelerator by twenty percent and set the headlight\'s luminosity control to automatically respond to the current light. Right now I\'m testing out a new coat of paint pigments that provide better insulation....\n\n<The gnome continues on for a few minutes.>\n\nOh, sorry. I\'m Master Tinker Fizzi! I was one of Mekkatorque\'s many assistants. It\'s an incredible honor to be chosen for this opportunity.', 167510, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Report, Tinker!', 'Report, Tinker!', 167509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get the fleet to safety. Are you ready to depart?', '', 167508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve really been looking forward to this. I can\'t wait to get started!', 167507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 130489, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not fear, we are on the same side this time.\n\nDeath has a way of making everything clearer.', 167506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, boys. Go on and set us up.', 167505, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The val\'kyr hardly had to even offer before I was back on my feet. What else did you expect?\n\n<Lorash considers for a moment.>\n\nI do hope I\'ll get another chance to cut off Malfurion\'s head. See how HE likes it.', '', 167504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay calm, just tell us what you remember.', 'Stay calm, just tell us what you remember.', 167503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I saw everything!', '', 167502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Jux looks back and forth with embarrassment.>\n\nEehh, we don\'t like to talk about what happened with the AzerMEK Mk. I. Suffice to say it didn\'t pass its sea trials, know what I\'m sayin\'?', '', 167501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever happened to the AzerMEK Mk. I?', 'Whatever happened to the AzerMEK Mk. I?', 167500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief wanted weapons, and we got \'em for her!', '', 167499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gentle with $n, sweet pea.', '', 167498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know the drill, Sal. Get the cart and meet me at the lumber mill.', 167497, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dorian Atwater mutters something about back pain under her breath.', 167496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out back, dearest!', '', 167495, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 126744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sal! Where\'d I leave my tools?', 167494, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 126681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have prepared a letter in case some persuasion is required. I suggest you take it with you.', 167493, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looking for a shipwright, are you? Too bad. I\'m retired.', 167492, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My ears still work perfectly fine, you know.', 167491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Zul\'jan ruins', 'Return to Zul\'jan ruins', 167490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me? Tides, no. That\'s my wife. She\'s inside.', '', 167489, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did.. Did that golem just move?', '', 167487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delete', '', 167486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delete', '', 167485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got a look in your eye. Come to have a drink?', '', 167484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a long time ago, Lord Admiral. But the name does ring a bell...', '', 167483, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 126735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe Atwater\'s ships were the gold standard while you were serving in my father\'s guard.', 167482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Dorian Atwater...', '', 167481, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits disagree...', '', 167480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey t\'ink deir shiny walls and bright lights be keepin\' us outta dis city.', '', 167479, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Alliance be sendin\' Lightforged reinforcements to fight us here.', '', 167478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Full power to the back line shields! Don\'t let anyone or anything into the city!', 167477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s bringing down those defenses? I want answers!', 167476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Extra troops to the eastern flank! Hold the line!', 167475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that unholy sound? I want a situation report immediately!', 167474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh! I see... only darkness... How?', 167473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DOOM!', '', 167472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To all dose dat oppose us here, we cry... DOOM!', '', 167471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill dese vessels wit ya pain, ya rage, and ya powa!', '', 167470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient spirits, abandoned and forgotten, I be here. I remember ya.', '', 167469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has captured Lor\'danel!', 'The Horde has captured Lor\'danel!', 167464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkspear have arranged for transport to Zandalar by boat at the Echo Isles to the south of Orgrimmar.', 'The Darkspear have arranged for transport to Zandalar by boat at the Echo Isles to the south of Orgrimmar.', 167463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $p. Good. I am testing a hypothesis and have need of a... resilient... adventurer such as yourself to help.$b$bWe are experimenting with animating the fallen friends of the Zandalar.$b$bIt is not a mana efficient method of combat, but I believe the psychological trauma on our enemy will make up for the cost. You see, the Zandalari have weak stomachs when it comes to animated corpses.$b$bI need you to collect more materials for me to work with, but you can take two of my early voidcrafted tests to see how they work. Enjoy!', '', 167462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to test.', 'Ready to test.', 167461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you Dorian Atwater?', 'Are you Dorian Atwater?', 167460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He doesn\'t look up from his gardening as you approach.>\n\nMind you don\'t step on the flowers. The wife hates that.', '', 167459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sal seems quite content.>\n\nHow are you liking my old lady?', '', 167458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am told you know where to find the shipwright, Dorian Atwater?', 'I am told you know where to find the shipwright, Dorian Atwater?', 167457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $n.', '', 167456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji, I\'m ready to face the Alliance, let\'s recover the Abyssal Scepter.', 'Princess Talanji, I\'m ready to face the Alliance, let\'s recover the Abyssal Scepter.', 167454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... Nothing? Where is de army? De fleet?', 167453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourselves, when de fog lifts, we will charge de fleet, and Raal shall assault dem with our aerial forces!', 167452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar', 'Zandalar', 167451, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Captain Hicks of the Relentless at the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. That fine vessel departs periodically straight for Kul Tiras.', 'Seek out Captain Hicks of the Relentless at the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor. That fine vessel departs periodically straight for Kul Tiras.', 167450, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras', 'Kul Tiras', 167449, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what the plague wagons are for. Just need Blightcaller to give the order.', '', 167448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the Dark Lady\'s mission. Let\'s make some blight!', '', 167447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure it gets where it\'s going. We have a battle to win!', '', 167446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, I will slay you and then finish off these other fiends!', '', 167445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Kul Tiran Corsair approaches on the starboard side!', 'A Kul Tiran Corsair approaches on the starboard side!', 167444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Kul Tiran Corsair approaches on the port side!', 'A Kul Tiran Corsair approaches on the port side!', 167443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. It will not.', 167442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh... the Light... will... protect... me...!', '', 167441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must protect the wild!', '', 167440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'When our people needed a home, the night elves were there to take us in. We will not stand by as they fight to retake their own home. We fight with them!', 167439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your boon.', 'Grant me your boon.', 167438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The currents will drag you to your demise!', 'The currents will drag you to your demise!', 167437, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea will be your grave!', 'The sea will be your grave!', 167436, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides will crush you!', 'The tides will crush you!', 167435, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the depths with you!', 'To the depths with you!', 167434, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape the Abyss!', 'You cannot escape the Abyss!', 167433, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sink beneath the waves!', 'Sink beneath the waves!', 167432, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces will flood this land!', 'Our forces will flood this land!', 167431, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not... the best outcome...', 167430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready yourselves! The landwalkers will fall before us!', 'Ready yourselves! The landwalkers will fall before us!', 167429, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our queen has claimed this land for the Abyss! None shall stand in her way!', 'Our queen has claimed this land for the Abyss! None shall stand in her way!', 167428, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide shall rise and swallow this land for the glory of our Queen!', 'The tide shall rise and swallow this land for the glory of our Queen!', 167427, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me more captives! The Abyss hungers for their souls!', 'Bring me more captives! The Abyss hungers for their souls!', 167426, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drain the life from their bodies! Our queen demands it!', 'Drain the life from their bodies! Our queen demands it!', 167425, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe deep, landwalkers! Let the ocean fill your lungs and release your soul!', '', 167424, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me the prisoners! The Abyss cries out for more souls!', 'Bring me the prisoners! The Abyss cries out for more souls!', 167423, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls shall be consumed by the Hungering Deep!', 'Your souls shall be consumed by the Hungering Deep!', 167422, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the others! There must be additional sacrifices!', 'Find the others! There must be additional sacrifices!', 167421, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The queen demands more souls for the Abyss!', 'The queen demands more souls for the Abyss!', 167420, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown them! Release their souls to the Abyss!', 'Drown them! Release their souls to the Abyss!', 167419, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resources: depleted. Powering down.', '', 167418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Runes: bound. Horde detected. Cleansing Mode: Activated.', '', 167417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you in the harbormaster\'s office.', 167416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elven puppets of the void have come to infest my children with their dark magics. Gather my children and then bring me the heads of these pious abominations.', '', 167415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
