('', 'So you\'re the one everygnome around here has been talking about.\n\n<Emaedi extends her hand.>\n\nEmaedi. Emaedi Autoblast. Sharpshooter and scout for the 7th Legion. If you need anything related to explosions, I\'m your gnome. I\'d like to think I\'m a pretty good shot, too.', 167351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c. I thought I would never escape this prison.', 'Thank you, $c. I thought I would never escape this prison.', 167350, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! After all these years...', 'Free! After all these years...', 167349, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elements, forgive me.', 167348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
