('The Buzzboxes deployed throughout Darkshore take a lot of fuel, and our supplies are running low.\n\nFortunately, we\'ve got a surplus here - we just have the small task of wresting it out from under the cultists that have taken up residence.', '', 167340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill every last one of them. We show no mercy today!', '', 167338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
