('They have no answer for our siege weapons!', '', 167336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought for my people...', '', 167335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde fights with honor. Can you say the same?!', '', 167334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomish submarines were key to winning the Second War. It\'s an honor to work on one for the Alliance!$b$bPlus it will give me a chance to show Pozzik that gnomish engineering is truly superior in every way to his brash, unrefined way of blowing everything up. Of course our torpedoes will explode on contact, but that\'s a REFINED explosion. Calculated and precise!', '', 167333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Akunda, I beseech you! Use your power to energize dis machine, so that we may use it to slay our enemies!', 167332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
