('', 'Ishnu-alah.', 167265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The goddess gives me strength.', 167264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d think the high command would give us a larger escourt.', 167262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'s our reinforcements?', 167261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a terrible time to break down.', 167260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay vigilant, we can\'t allow this shipment to be taken by the Horde!', 167259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time waits for no one!', '', 167258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tempt nature\'s wrath.', '', 167257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time wears thin.', '', 167256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the winds be at your back.', '', 167255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature stands with you.', '', 167254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May nature guide your path.', '', 167253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How might nature serve?', '', 167252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I aid you?', '', 167251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend.', '', 167250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That didn\'t go as I planned...', 167248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None plunders my caravan!', 167247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sweet release of death. Hopefully I stay... dead.', '', 167245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes! Come try the latest strain of plague!', '', 167244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s diverts weapon power to internal repair and diagnostic systems.', '', 167243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature reclaims me...', '', 167237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cursed temple! Must reclaim!', '', 167236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The circle... continues...', '', 167235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just messed with the wrong bull!', '', 167233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Sylvanas!', 'For Sylvanas!', 167226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t find all of us...', 'You can\'t find all of us...', 167225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras is gonna fall!', 'Kul Tiras is gonna fall!', 167224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 167223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loa... they call me home.', '', 167222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha ha! Your head gon\' look real nice on my spear!', '', 167221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is one of Tacha\'s backpacks. She always keeps them packed with useful stuff!', 167220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who thought this was a good idea?', 'Who thought this was a good idea?', 167219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about!', 'Now that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about!', 167218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the smell of gunpowder in the morning!', 'I love the smell of gunpowder in the morning!', 167217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa whoa, watch where you\'re putting that!', 'Whoa whoa, watch where you\'re putting that!', 167216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep this area safe for fleeing vulpera. Get in that gulch and take down anything attacking my people!', 167215, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voldunai never stand alone. I\'m with you!', 'Voldunai never stand alone. I\'m with you!', 167214, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like the way you fight... I could learn a thing or two from you.', 'I like the way you fight... I could learn a thing or two from you.', 167213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no problem that we can\'t solve together.', 'There\'s no problem that we can\'t solve together.', 167212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got your back, friend.', 'I\'ve got your back, friend.', 167211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the vulpera!', 'For the vulpera!', 167210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'dun will be free!', 'Vol\'dun will be free!', 167209, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nisha sends her regards.', 'Nisha sends her regards.', 167208, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vulpera stick together!', 'The vulpera stick together!', 167207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There. The ice will hold them off long enough for us to handle the ships in the bay.', 167205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe I can stem the tide.', 167203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taelia and I were able to subdue the Horde on our side of the wharf. I see you\'ve had some success here as well.', 167200, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We keep shooting them out of the water but they keep coming! Can you stop their boats?', 'We keep shooting them out of the water but they keep coming! Can you stop their boats?', 167199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you giving me the cold shoulder?', 167198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will blanket Kul Tiras in an endless winter!', 167197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always stay frosty!', 167196, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel a cold snap coming on...', 167195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest well, big guy. You\'re helping us more than you\'ll ever know.', 167194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am going to have to ask all of you to chill out for a little while.', 167193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grong will forever be known as a hero of the Alliance.', 167192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trample on kaldorei land! Flee to your Banshee Queen while you still can!', '', 167191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It pains me to see Grong like this, but I know it\'s what he wanted.', 167190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grong\'s courage and selflessness are admirable.', 167189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The work that Megs and Morton are doing will change the course of this war.', 167188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moira, I have failed you.', '', 167187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames of Blackrock rage for your head! For the Alliance!', '', 167186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this, ya radioactive freak! Gallywix\'s special Azerite blast, it\'ll let $p tear through that armor of yours!', '', 167183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halt! You\'ll go no further.', 167182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve slain hundreds of your kind. From the pits of Warsong to the cliffs of Arathi! Meet your maker!', '', 167181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! This is nothing compared to my tour in Alterac!', '', 167180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EARTH RECLAIMS...', '', 167179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HORDE CRUSHED BY MY FURY!', '', 167178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Ashenvale Front!', '', 167177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.', 'Yes.', 167176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Bwonsamdi rubs his hands together.>\n\nI will enjoy this, yes. Talanji\'s witness, will you deliver my verdict to de people of Zandalar?', '', 167175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How goes de soul collection, hm?\n\nI hope you are keeping count, loa know ol\' Bwonsamdi isn\'t.\n\n<Bwonsamdi laughs.>\n\nIn all seriousness, I hope you have not forgotten our bargain.', '', 167174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 11, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King forgive me!', '', 167172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Azerite belongs to the Alliance!', '', 167171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Power flows through dis place. De spirits here are strong, but... imprisoned. It is different than de voices I hear at Bwonsamdi\'s necropolis. Here... it is... channeled.\n\nWe should hurry. I feel as though I am trespassing in a place dat looks unkindly to de living.\n\nLet me know when you are ready to proceed.', 167170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drums call me home...', '', 167169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drums of war ring!', '', 167168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Shaman_HighTide:20|tLaminaria casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284760|h[Catastrophic Tides]|h|r!', '', 167167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_LIGHTNINGOVERLOAD:20|tYou are affected by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:285350|h[Storm\'s Wail]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_NATURE_LIGHTNINGOVERLOAD:20|tYou are affected by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:285350|h[Storm\'s Wail]|h|r!', 167166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onu\'s roots disable your shredder!', '', 167165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shredder\'s armed and ready for some good old fashioned deforestation, boss!', 167164, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the supplies. I\'ll defend the vulpera!', 'Give me the supplies. I\'ll defend the vulpera!', 167163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'ll die like the sethrak... and anybody else who tries to oppress the vulpera!', 167162, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this destruction, $p!\n\nThe only thing these caravans were guilty of was accepting a good-paying job to transport supplies.\n\nWe vulpera have been free merchants and traders for countless generations. What makes the Alliance think they can bully us into refusing work from people they don\'t like?\n\nThey\'re no better than the sethrak... and you know how I deal with sethrak.\n\nYou in? I\'ve got plenty of useful goodies here that you can use to fight like a vulpera!', 167161, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sands reclaim me!', '', 167160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will bury you beneath these sands!', '', 167159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Horde, time to test my new inventions!', 'The Horde, time to test my new inventions!', 167158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque gave us strict orders to take you out!', 'Mekkatorque gave us strict orders to take you out!', 167157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde doesn\'t belong here, we\'ll help you leave!', 'The Horde doesn\'t belong here, we\'ll help you leave!', 167156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t let you hurt the Kul Tirans!', 'We won\'t let you hurt the Kul Tirans!', 167155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll just have to finish what Mekkatorque started!', 'We\'ll just have to finish what Mekkatorque started!', 167154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque warned us about the Horde, we\'re prepared!', 'Mekkatorque warned us about the Horde, we\'re prepared!', 167153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re still alive! Well, I can fix that bug.', 'You\'re still alive! Well, I can fix that bug.', 167152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for coming here!', 'You will pay for coming here!', 167151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die like the rest of your pathetic Horde!', 'You will die like the rest of your pathetic Horde!', 167150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our gnomish allies will make quick work of you.', 'Our gnomish allies will make quick work of you.', 167149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mekkatorque\'s forces will help us destroy you!', 'Mekkatorque\'s forces will help us destroy you!', 167148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde dogs, you will die like Ashvane\'s forces!', 'Horde dogs, you will die like Ashvane\'s forces!', 167147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vigil Hill belongs to Kul Tiras!', 'Vigil Hill belongs to Kul Tiras!', 167146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not drive out Ashvane\'s pirates just to have the Horde come here!', 'I did not drive out Ashvane\'s pirates just to have the Horde come here!', 167145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras is free from Ashvane, now it shall be free of Horde!', 'Kul Tiras is free from Ashvane, now it shall be free of Horde!', 167144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carter Riptide is unresponsive.', 'Carter Riptide is unresponsive.', 167143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish to test Talanji\'s determination. I already know you possess a great deal of it, but it will amuse me if you participate.\n\nAre you prepared to begin?', 167142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well if it isn\'t the wingless wonder, $n!\n\nI see Talanji made the predictable choice of her witnesses. I will act surprised for her sake.', 167141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa\'ku will offer the next trial. Remain strong, Talanji.', '', 167140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zandalar... belongs to the Horde.', 167139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My krolusks will break your men!', 167138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to pose a question to Talanji. Will you stand by while I do so?', '', 167135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji chose her witness well.', '', 167134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $n.', 167133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk will be the next to test your worth. Good luck, Talanji.', '', 167132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoo! Go away!', 167131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not stop running!', 167130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not eat my witness!', 167129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just hold on a little longer!', 167128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back, toad!', 167127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away!', 167126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, we strike. For da Horde!', '', 167124, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall strike with the might of our wyverns. Leavin\' nothin\' but destruction for da puny Alliance.', '', 167123, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Warchief says we strike soon! Dey won\'t see it comin\'.', '', 167122, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Alliance thugs roughed me up real good... I thought I was done for.', 'Those Alliance thugs roughed me up real good... I thought I was done for.', 167121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice hat. Nisha must\'ve sent you.', 'Nice hat. Nisha must\'ve sent you.', 167120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want any part of this war... but at least the Horde isn\'t killing us!', 'I don\'t want any part of this war... but at least the Horde isn\'t killing us!', 167119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried to reason with them, but they weren\'t even listening to me!', 'I tried to reason with them, but they weren\'t even listening to me!', 167118, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one, friend.', 'I owe you one, friend.', 167117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As if we didn\'t have enough to worry about with the sethrak... now the Alliance is attacking us?!', 'As if we didn\'t have enough to worry about with the sethrak... now the Alliance is attacking us?!', 167116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, hey that\'s weird, who the heck put that in my mech?! I\'m gonna get to the bottom of this... just never mention this to anyone. Ever.', '', 167115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember Jastor, you\'re good enough, you\'re smart enough, and people HAVE to like you!', '', 167114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just minding my own business... and those Alliance jerks jumped me without warning!', 'I was just minding my own business... and those Alliance jerks jumped me without warning!', 167113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $pr... Those humans were going to kill me!', 'Thank you, $pr... Those humans were going to kill me!', 167112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Grove of the Ancients!', '', 167111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die for da Horde...', '', 167110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies belong to da Darkspear!', '', 167109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bring the rest of the frozen zeppelins to an explosive end, $p. I\'m going to join Rosaline and the other Outriggers.', '', 167108, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! Ingenuity prevails over brute force!', '', 167107, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the fuel pump.', 'Take the fuel pump.', 167106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t nothin\' can burn without fuel, so these fields here gotta be loaded with the stuff! \n\nUnfortunately, these cultists are getting in the way of our refueling efforts.', '', 167105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Critical error: Unexpected matter in core.', '', 167104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostiles detected. Kill mode: Engaged. Please vacate the area.', '', 167103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall crush them on the land, sky, and sea!', '', 167102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break them beneath the might of the Warchief!', '', 167101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rain hellfire upon them!', '', 167100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed my corpse...to the wolves.', '', 167099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feed you to my wolves!', '', 167098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomper...no stomp anymore?', '', 167097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bile. STOMP!', '', 167096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the G.M.O.D is almost out of Azerite. We should get it refueled.', 'It looks like the G.M.O.D is almost out of Azerite. We should get it refueled.', 167095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You take one look at the manual written by some other schmucks and throw it away. You\'re a top goblin engineer, you don\'t need to listen to someone else\'s dumb manual!\n\nYou eventually find a meter that says, \"AZERITE\" and see that the needle is close to the words, \"TOTALLY EMPTY BOSS\".>', '<You take one look at the manual written by some other schmucks and throw it away. You know what you\'re doing!\n\nYou poke and prod at various parts of the mech. How hard could it be figuring out another goblin\'s work?\n\nMaybe it\'s pretty hard, but you eventually find a meter that says, \"AZERITE\" and see that the needle is close to the words, \"TOTALLY EMPTY BOSS\".>', 167094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You take one look at the manual written by some other schmucks and throw it away. You know what you\'re doing!\n\nYou poke and prod at various parts of the mech. How hard could it be figuring out another goblin\'s work?\n\nMaybe it\'s pretty hard, but you eventually find a meter that says, \"AZERITE\" and see that the needle is close to the words, \"TOTALLY EMPTY BOSS\".>', '<You take one look at the manual written by some other schmucks and throw it away. You know what you\'re doing!\n\nYou poke and prod at various parts of the mech. How hard could it be figuring out another goblin\'s work?\n\nMaybe it\'s pretty hard, but you eventually find a meter that says, \"AZERITE\" and see that the needle is close to the words, \"TOTALLY EMPTY BOSS\".>', 167093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You would think your training as an engineer would prepare you for the peak of goblin technology, but alas, nothing could prepare you for this.\n\nThe manual contradicts itself not only on each page, but actually in the same sentence. It\'s a miracle this thing even works.\n\nYou finish your review. Short of redoing this machine all over again, the only actionable thing you could find is that the mech is dangerously low on Azerite.>', '<You would think your training as an engineer would prepare you for the peak of goblin technology, but alas, nothing could prepare you for this.\n\nThe manual contradicts itself not only on each page, but actually in the same sentence. It\'s a miracle this thing even works.\n\nYou finish your review. Short of redoing this machine all over again, the only actionable thing you could find is that the mech is dangerously low on Azerite.>', 167092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You carefully read through the G.M.O.D\'s manual. \n\nYou have to do it several times, in fact, as the combination of goblin talk and \"inventive\" engineering make it difficult to parse.\n\nOnce you\'re comfortable, you do a review of the G.M.O.D\'s systems. \n\nThe most glaring issue is a meter labeled, \"AZERITE\". The meter\'s needle is almost over \"TOTALLY EMPTY\".>', '<You carefully read through the G.M.O.D\'s manual. \n\nYou have to do it several times, in fact, as the combination of goblin talk and \"inventive\" engineering make it difficult to parse.\n\nOnce you\'re comfortable, you do a review of the G.M.O.D\'s systems. \n\nThe most glaring issue is a meter labeled, \"AZERITE\". The meter\'s needle is almost over \"TOTALLY EMPTY BOSS\".>', 167091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This G.M.O.D is awesome, huh?', '', 167090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Open the G.M.O.D manual and review its systems.>', '<Open the G.M.O.D manual and review its systems.>', 167089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well? What are you waitin\' for, this mech ain\'t gonna review itself!\n\n... hold on. Maybe I shoulda spent the money to get this thing to do self-reviews! Gallywix, you\'re a genius!\n\nThat\'s what you\'re supposed to say, $n.', '', 167088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So don\'t go breaking it!', '', 167087, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stole ...uh, invented this thing just for you!', '', 167086, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heading over there to collect some heads, richmon? Wish I could come with you. Soon enough.\n\nHead down to de port and look for de Forsaken ship, the Banshee\'s Wail. Ugly thing, but she will get you across de ocean. Speak with Dread-Admiral Tattersail.', 'You heading over there to collect some heads, richmon? Wish I could come with you. Soon enough.\n\nHead down to de port and look for de Forsaken ship, the Banshee\'s Wail. Ugly thing, but she will get you across de ocean. Speak with Dread-Admiral Tattersail.', 167085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off to conquer the Kul Tirans? I hear they\'re insufferably arrogant... not quite as bad as the Gilneans, but close enough it makes no difference.\n\nAnyway, you want to head south to the port. Speak with Dread-Admiral Tatttersail on the Banshee\'s Wail.\n\nWatch your back.', 'Off to conquer the Kul Tirans? I hear they\'re insufferably arrogant... not quite as bad as the Gilneans, but close enough it makes no difference.\n\nAnyway, you want to head south to the port. Speak with Dread-Admiral Tatttersail on the Banshee\'s Wail.\n\nWatch your back.', 167084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship to Kul Tiras', 'Ship to Kul Tiras', 167083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship to Zandalar', 'Ship to Zandalar', 167082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar, huh? The great troll empire. Here\'s what I think of them and their navy.\n\n<spits>\n\nYou want to go speak with your Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth down in the harbor.\n\nGive \'em hell.', 'Zandalar, huh? The great troll empire. Here\'s what I think of them and their navy.\n\n<spits>\n\nYou want to go speak with your Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth down in the harbor.\n\nGive \'em hell.', 167081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('But if you are so eager to meet Bwonsamdi... den step forward. De Loa of Death awaits!', '', 167077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, I will create a path for you to travel over the water to the Outriggers on the south shore.', 167076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me know when you are ready to begin.', 167075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you are ready, let us begin.', 167074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They got Krazzlefrazz handled now, let\'s go deal with the rest of this army up ahead!', '', 167073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By all means. I kept it over here.', 167072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_winston_bubble:20|t|cFFFF0000%s|r activates the power of the Trident of Deep Ocean!', '', 167070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_ELECTROCHARGE:20|t|cFFFF0000%s|r activates the power of the Tempest Caller!', '', 167069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Priest_Void Blast:20|t|cFFFF0000%s|r activates the power of the Void Stone!', '', 167068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_POSSESSION:20|t|cFFFF0000%s|r begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282517|h[Terrifying Echo]|h|r!', '', 167067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it... Did you destroy it?', 167066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No point... don\'t resist...', 167065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come... stay....', 167064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been so long since I\'ve been warm...', 167063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Share your warmth...', 167062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... cold...', 167061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must have miscalculated!', '', 167060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly what I expected from inferior minds as yourself!', '', 167059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will.', 'I will.', 167058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you stand with us today?', '', 167057, 0, 0, 333, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, friend.', 167056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prophet, forgive me.', '', 167055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can stop us?! Then you shall die.', '', 167054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, $p! You two gotta help, we got mechs from here to Arom\'s Crossing!', '', 167053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krag\'wa\'s trial is not yet complete. Return to Talanji!', 'Krag\'wa\'s trial is not yet complete. Return to Talanji!', 167052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to assist me, $n?', '', 167051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n. We have crushed many foes together.', '', 167050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Battle for Lordaeron was me first fight. Seein\' dat Alliance army outside da walls be... well, it got me nerves up, dat\'s for sure.\n\nDen I saw Saurfang. Dat orc won him a thousand battles! Dem eyes of his didn\'t look scared... but maybe jus\' a bit empty.\n\nDa High Overlord, he give me courage. We remind each other dat da Horde be worth fightin\' for.\n\nNo way I be lettin\' him stand alone. Saurfang need us, champion!', '', 167049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope will prevail.', 167048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar will fall!', 167047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got a knack for savin\' people, you do this for a living? No, seriously, what\'s the pay like?', '', 167046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ma always told me I was gonna die surrounded by slimes made outta the planet\'s blood. Looks like she\'s wrong again!', '', 167045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shoulda read the contract before signin\' up. Or maybe I should learn how to read.', '', 167044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better count as overtime! Heck, who am I kiddin\', it probably doesn\'t even count as hourly.', '', 167043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I swallowed some of this stuff, does that make me an Azerite goblin?', '', 167042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the save, I can\'t even afford a lawyer!', '', 167041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah well, I guess I ain\'t suing this time!', '', 167040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought with Saurfang back at da battle for Undercity. \n\nDon\'t think I would have made it out if he wasn\'t there.\n\nI\'m not gonna let him go out like this.', '', 167039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, take my water elemental to help you.', 167038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, Lord Admiral.', 167037, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not frighten me, blasphemer!', '', 167036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people... of Drustvar... will... avenge me...', '', 167035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yours is just another foul magic that must be purified from these lands!', '', 167034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got any news from the front, $r?', '', 167033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yipe yipe yipe yipe yipe!', 'Yipe yipe yipe yipe yipe!', 167032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, I\'ll just do it myself! And by do it myself, I mean get $p over here to do it for me.', '', 167031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_FROST_ICESHARD.BLP:20|t Run away from the boss during |cFFF00000|Hspell:287565|h[Avalanche]|h|r to avoid damage!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_FROST_ICESHARD.BLP:20|t Run away from the boss during |cFFF00000|Hspell:287565|h[Avalanche]|h|r to avoid damage!', 167030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed me to... the beasts.', '', 167029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These beasts will tear you apart!', '', 167028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, this is the fifth time we\'ve had this talk, I really don\'t know why you think askin\' me over and over is gonna change anythin\'.', '', 167027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean the operation got stopped by a bunch of Azerite goop comin\' outta the ground?!', '', 167026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t stop us. The lion\'s might... will prevail.', 167025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! My transporter is nearly operational!', 167024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Gather yourselves and assemble everyone atop Zanchul. I must now face de loa.', 167020, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are unharmed, despite de White Widow\'s intentions.', 167019, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like for you to stand beside me as I address my council. It is imperative that I have their support for de trial to come.\n\nSpeak to me when you are ready for de formalities to unfold.', 167018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now. Let\'s not start making accusations. Let\'s take this matter outside, shall we?', '', 167014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance spy! Come quietly or die by my blade.', 'Alliance spy! Come quietly or die by my blade.', 167013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahem. Loker Ogre...fellow horde pal?', '', 167012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will...burn.', '', 167011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will break you from within!', '', 167010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Herb_AncientLichenPetal.blp:20|tIvus |cFFFF0000|Hspell:287554|h[Petrifies]|h|r his bark, defeat the Plaguelings to end the spell!', '', 167009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The souls in the power core are controlling the golem! You need to destroy it!', 167008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eh? Something is wrong...', 167007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If everything was done right, the power core should bind and animate the golem.', 167006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements...embrace me.', '', 167005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will drown you like the scum you are!', '', 167004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, we have the Azerite. But where are the cannoneers?', '', 167003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased that the cleansing ritual didn\'t prove fatal. You are either very resilient... or very lucky.', '', 167002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin.', 'I am ready to begin.', 167001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to glow.', '%s begins to glow.', 167000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Place the runic power core at the heart of the golem.', 166999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you\'ll need to bind the limbs together with the webbing.', 166998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First, you need to arrange the wood in a humanoid form.', 166995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so excited! Let\'s get started!', 166994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is such a beautiful hill. I\'m going to go to that hill.', 166993, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is that sound? So lovely... I must find the source...', 166992, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something sure smells delicious over there. Maybe if I smile, they will give me a little taste...', '', 166991, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done!', 'Well done!', 166990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the central road!', '|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the central road!', 166989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the eastern road!', '|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the eastern road!', 166988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the western road!', '|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has deployed to the western road!', 166987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learn new things, explore new shores, help our fellow man!', 166985, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Order received.', '', 166984, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, they\'re all taken up by local guards right now.\n\nNot sure where they got the gold. They filled up the rooms last night. Even the captain was here.\n\nAt least one of them left me a mess to clean up in the morning, too.', 166983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Them do seem like lofty goals, ma\'am.', 'Them do seem like lofty goals, ma\'am.', 166982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You little brat! Hasn\'t your mother taught you better than to question adults?', 166981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that Proudmoore is cleaning up the filth around here, we\'ll be able to get back to making things that matter.', 166980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, actually, quite a few. Head upstairs if you want to see for yourself.\n\nSorry, but I need to get back to the other customers.', 166979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are any guards staying at this inn?', 'Are any guards staying at this inn?', 166978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t that a little rude?', 'Isn\'t that a little rude?', 166977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We want a room, please.', 'We want a room, please.', 166976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And here I am, covered in soot, chasing off residual Ashvane minions.', 166975, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"We\'ll send ya to a new post\", they said. \"It\'s near the sea\", they said.', 166974, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya see any Ashvane scum lurking around here, send them to me! I\'ll be happy to give \'em the what for!', '', 166973, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello little one, please get out of the way. We\'re kind of busy here.', 166972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it be Dajingo\'s last dino...', '', 166971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be Dajingo Dino Time!', '', 166970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Darcy gives Lyana a worrying glance.>\n\nGood little girls don\'t say things like that, dear.\n\n<Darcy turns to face Lyana.>\n\nI\'m sure it\'s just a phase.', 166969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, sweet thing, nothing to worry about. Were you scared? \n\nOne of the guards just had a little too much fun, and he needed to lie down and take a nap.\n\nI put him right to bed at the inn, don\'t you worry.', 166968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhh, this ain\'t over yet! I\'ll be back!', 'Ohhh, this ain\'t over yet! I\'ll be back!', 166967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, yes, poor thing.\n\nI couldn\'t make out a word of what he was saying on account of all of the slurring and stumbling. Something about beans?\n\nI put him right to bed over at the inn in Lakeshire.\n\nHope he\'s not feeling too horrible today.', 166966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Banshee Queen!', 'Glory to the Banshee Queen!', 166965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened last night?', 'What happened last night?', 166964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guard told me you took care of him last night, that was nice!', 'The guard told me you took care of him last night, that was nice!', 166963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, aren\'t you just the cutest? Look at those cheeks!', 166962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello! Hope you don\'t mind the mess, I\'ve got hungry soldiers to feed!', 166961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I embrace...my final death!', 166960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You all will be crushed under The Dark Lady\'s might!', 166959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the controls.  Get us a win this time!', 166958, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Round the mines still working. We gonna swarm their defenses!', 166957, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, um, lost my potion...', 'I, um, lost my potion...', 166956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? What is it?', 166955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, for me to assume control of the golem.', 166954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked! I knew you could do it!', 166953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt ...Circuits functioning perfectly ...Szzt', '', 166952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Szzt ...AE-35 unit functional ...Szzt', '', 166951, 0, 0, 595, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am completely operational ...fzzzt', '', 166950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bzzt ...ready for action!', '', 166949, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A warrior\'s death!', '', 166948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU NO PASS VOL\'GAR!', '', 166947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now stand very still. I must excise N\'Zoth\'s defilement from you.', '', 166946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The evil that seeks to control you must be purged! I know a ritual that can help, but the process will be... unpleasant.', '', 166945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TRANSITION CUTSCENE PLAYS HERE', 'TRANSITION CUTSCENE PLAYS HERE', 166944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! They were going to pay a high... price.', '', 166943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why must you interrupt me?! I was gettin\' valuable information!', '', 166942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be stopped!', 'You will be stopped!', 166941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde... will fall...!', 'The Horde... will fall...!', 166940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Stormwind... for King Anduin!', 'For Stormwind... for King Anduin!', 166939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
