('We will never... abandon... Kul Tiras...!', 'We will never... abandon... Kul Tiras...!', 166937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas will never win...', 'Sylvanas will never win...', 166936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras... will... end... you!', 'Kul Tiras... will... end... you!', 166935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will... never...', 'You will... never...', 166934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For... my... family...', 'For... my... family...', 166933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry... Lady Proudmoore...', 'I\'m sorry... Lady Proudmoore...', 166932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slain... by Daelin\'s... killer...', 'Slain... by Daelin\'s... killer...', 166931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Kul Tiras...', 'For Kul Tiras...', 166930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will... be stopped...', 'You will... be stopped...', 166929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light forsakes you!', 'The Light forsakes you!', 166928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will never win...!', 'The Horde will never win...!', 166927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will... pay...', 'The Horde will... pay...', 166926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... will survive...', 'The Light... will survive...', 166925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All Horde.. will be... purged...', 'All Horde.. will be... purged...', 166924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin the ritual.', 'I\'m ready to begin the ritual.', 166923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There be dark voodoo here, mon... Dis won\'t be easy.', '', 166922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Creature_Amber_02.blp:20|t You are covered in |cFFFF0000|Hspell:287072|h[Liquid Gold]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Creature_Amber_02.blp:20|t You are covered in |cFFFF0000|Hspell:287072|h[Liquid Gold]|h|r!', 166921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookout below!', 'Lookout below!', 166920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombs away!', 'Bombs away!', 166919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you think of my new council, $n?', 166918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Rastakhan surrounded himself with traitors and snakes. Talanji has chosen her advisers wisely.', 166913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This new pack of ours is growing stranger every day.', 166911, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you agan, $n.\n\n<Hexlord Raal gestures to the other councilors gathered nearby.>\n\nThese are strange times for de Zandalari. Ordinarily I would be opposed to an exile AND a Tortollan among our ranks, but after all that has happened, perhaps change is what we need most.', '', 166910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 25, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', 'I see.', 166909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet you there.', '', 166908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde will not... defeat...', 166907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We didn\'t kick Ashvane out just for the Horde to come in!', 166906, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Mugambala. Once we found out about this place I knew I would need to get a tail gate party goin\'. I got some prime floor space here for bedrolls and what not. Make yourself comfy and buy a drink why don\'t ya.', 166904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready.', 'Ready.', 166900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to depart?', '', 166899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More subjects, more testing!', 166898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, $p. Show da Alliance da powa of da trolls, and da powa of da Horde!', '', 166897, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azzaga choogo zinn!', '', 166896, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...WITH POWER!', '', 166895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...In shadows...', '', 166894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...By spirits...', 166893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sendulo ma\'das na khu\'das, kuba zinn awe.', '', 166892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brace ya\'self, $p. We gonna infuse ya with da ancient powa of da trolls.', '', 166891, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'re hiding here somewhere, little kitty.', '', 166890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here kitty, kitty...', '', 166889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not deny me my trophy!', '', 166887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meat\'s on the menu tonight!', '', 166886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Ashvane\'s information and resources, we will make quick work of those that oppose us.', '', 166885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got de trophy... dis... time...', 'You got de trophy... dis... time...', 166884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice head ya got dere. It gonna make a mighty fine trophy!', 'Nice head ya got dere. It gonna make a mighty fine trophy!', 166883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Misha snorts.', 166882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be fine.', '', 166881, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are just going to have to sit this one out, Misha.', '', 166880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fickle, finicky gusts of bluffs... You\'ve doomed me...', 166879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rebellious winds of Zandalar, heed my call!', 166878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be seein\' ya around, $p.', '', 166877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let those old orcs know they can count on me the next time they need something fast and deadly built, yeah?', '', 166876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe fighting in a war ain\'t so bad after all...', '', 166875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a rush! $p, that was more fun than any of the races back at the ol\' speedbarge.', '', 166874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE WILL HAVE OUR REVENGE!', '', 166873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('killed us... captured us... sought to use us as fuel...', '', 166872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AAAAAa....aahhhh....', 166871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You...', '', 166870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This baby\'s comin\' loose at the bolts! I\'ll fix \'er up while you take out the captain.', '', 166869, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha!', '', 166868, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat smoke, Fizzle!', '', 166867, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s leave some scorch marks!', '', 166866, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not let you down, Telaamon. Your sacrifice will be remembered.', 166865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My only regret is that I will not see this war through to its end. You all have the much harder task ahead.', '', 166864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of our paths lead back to the Light... some can be more painful than others.', '', 166863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have no fear of your own death? The Horde will do terrible things to you, Telaamon.', 166862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought the Burning Legion longer than your known ancestry, Lady Proudmoore. I walk with no fear.', '', 166861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Telaamon, thank you again for... everything. This cannot be easy, giving your life so that we may defeat the Horde.', 166860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, in this case, you may be correct in it bringing more good than harm.', 166855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still have an uneasiness, Rexxar. I advise caution in doing as one is told, when it is against their better judgment.', 166854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...but we can follow the Warchief\'s plan for now. One guilty human out is worth the lives that will be spared.', '', 166853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this the end?', 'Is this the end?', 166851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It hurts! It hurts...', 'It hurts! It hurts...', 166850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the injustice!', 'Oh, the injustice!', 166849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for this!', 'You\'ll pay for this!', 166848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ruined!', 'I\'m ruined!', 166847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wonder how much your hide is worth?', 'Wonder how much your hide is worth?', 166846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mess with the cartel!', 'Don\'t mess with the cartel!', 166845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind your own business, pal!', 'Mind your own business, pal!', 166844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna regret steppin\' foot in this gorge!', 'You\'re gonna regret steppin\' foot in this gorge!', 166843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel a darkness coiling about your very soul. I fear your essence bears the mark of the forces you faced.', '', 166842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde... and for profit!', 'For the Horde... and for profit!', 166841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t gonna let you take my kill!', 'I ain\'t gonna let you take my kill!', 166840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must deal with the Crucible of Storms.', '', 166839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir has shown you more mercy than you deserve. Take your friend\'s spirit and go.', 166838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Banshee Queen will pay for her crimes one day. You would do well not to be standing with her when her time comes.', 166836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stink of Bwonsamdi and his twisted magics.', 166835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not welcome here.', 166834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to be done before Talanji can wear de crown. We must make haste, before de unrest boils over again.\n\nSpeak to me when you are prepared to carry out your role in this sacred ritual.', 166833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Bashal\'Aran.', 'Take me to Bashal\'Aran.', 166832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The moonsaber looks expectantly at you.>', '', 166831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya fight better than me expected, outsiders. Mmm... ya gonna make a fine addition to me collection...', '', 166830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mighty rude of ya to be comin\' into our city uninvited. Zuldazar be under ol\' Bwonsamdi\'s protection!', '', 166829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My new council awaits you above, $n. Rata and I will be along shortly.', 166826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In due time, Princess. De sooner de loa grant you de throne, de better for Zandalar.', 166825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on now, spirit! Ya can\'t let da big monkey have all da fun!', '', 166824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya just gonna let dese Alliance outsiders stroll around our city? Go get dem!', '', 166823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up, spirits of Zandalar! Drag dese invaders down into da grave with ya!', '', 166822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. The Void has its vessel, and now it wishes to feed.$b$bWe can use this power to our advantage. Go forth and destroy the Horde, but do it quickly! We can only hold the ritual for so long....', '', 166821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shu... dalees-na.', 'Shu... dalees-na.', 166820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wilds stand against you, Trespasser! Andu-falah-dor!', 'The wilds stand against you, Trespasser! Andu-falah-dor!', 166819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should speak with de priesthood. Dey are not de ones who brought dis turmoil upon us.', 166818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to become a weapon of the Alliance.', '', 166817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know the risks, $p. And I accept them.', '', 166816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever the cost, it will be worth it to see the Horde pay for what they have done.', '', 166815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to become so colossal that the Horde trembles in fear at the sight of me!', '', 166814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we\'re in this together, $p, right? You won\'t let me fail.', '', 166813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
