('Return to the battlefield!', 'Return to the battlefield!', 166648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There can be no peace without action.', '', 166647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde must be purged to keep Azeroth safe.', '', 166646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Attend the meeting.>', '<Attend the meeting.>', 166645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calling mole machine', 'Calling mole machine', 166644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will go do what I can within Zalamar. We will meet again once we have purged the world of these blood trolls.', '', 166643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Paladin_EmpoweredSealsRighteous:20|tRa\'wani Kanae starts to release |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284469|h[Seal of Retribution]|h|r!', 166642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_HOLY_SEALOFWRATH:20|tRa\'wani Kanae starts to release |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284436|h[Seal of Reckoning]|h|r!', 166641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t my fault!', 'This isn\'t my fault!', 166640, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! I wasn\'t finished yet.', 'Wait! I wasn\'t finished yet.', 166639, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight!', 'Hold on tight!', 166638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, the safety protocols are-- Oops!', 'Alright, the safety protocols are-- Oops!', 166637, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here at Talanji\'s request. Her royal highness has been a tremendous help to de prelates, reminding us of who we are, and what we stand for.$b$bOur loa, Rezan, may have fallen, but his ideals remain. We must lead those who are lost, and be a beacon of light against de darkness.$b$bBy de graces of de loa, we are still one with de Light.', 'We are here at Talanji\'s request. Her royal highness has been a tremendous help to de prelates, reminding us of who we are, and what we stand for.$b$bOur loa, Rezan, may have fallen, but his ideals remain. We must lead those who are lost, and be a beacon of light against de darkness.$b$bBy de graces of de loa, we are still one with de Light.', 166636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gone... with the tides...', 166635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark waters take you!', 'Dark waters take you!', 166634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'daaaaaaaaaa!', '', 166633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would rather see dis city burn than pay homage to death.', 'I would rather see dis city burn than pay homage to death.', 166632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I let my fears get de better of me... Talanji, please forgive me.', 'I let my fears get de better of me... Talanji, please forgive me.', 166631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Zandalari are not slaves to de loa of death!', 'De Zandalari are not slaves to de loa of death!', 166630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody comes ta ol\' Bwondsamdi in da end!', '', 166629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mere, little thing!', '', 166628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ya know da might of ol\' Bwonsamdi!', '', 166627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How \'bout a little taste of me power, eh?', '', 166626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on! Make yourselves useful!', '', 166625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go teach dese upstarts a lesson!', '', 166624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gonna have some fun with dis one!', '', 166623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a little toy ta play with!', '', 166622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh nonono! Ya on your own now!', '', 166621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ey now! No helpin\' da tough one!', '', 166620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_ThunderKing_BallLightning.blp:20|t You\'ve been struck by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286811|h[Akunda\'s Wrath]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_ThunderKing_BallLightning.blp:20|t You\'ve been struck by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286811|h[Akunda\'s Wrath]|h|r!', 166619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya been king a long time, Rastakhan. Maybe... too long. If ya can\'t be gettin\' da job done, perhaps dat pretty daughter of yours can.', '', 166618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such strength! Now you will fall!', '', 166617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of... Kul... Tiras...', 'For the glory of... Kul... Tiras...', 166616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve invaded the wrong kingdom, swine!', 'You\'ve invaded the wrong kingdom, swine!', 166615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis power... dis death... it is a curse, not a blessing! Oh, daughter... what have I done?!', '', 166614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese outsiders still do not yield! Bwonsamdi, how can dey resist your power?!', '', 166613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis darkness threatens to consume my soul! I must... be free of it!', '', 166612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are dese invaders still resisting?  You should have dealt with them by now, Bwonsamdi!', '', 166611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... de darkness... it is too much to control!', '', 166610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! De power of a loa flows through me!', '', 166609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be mighty demandin\', Rastakhan! I gonna give ya da power ya seek... but ya better watch your tone.', '', 166608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi! You are my loa! Honor our bargain and strike down dese attackers!', '', 166607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you have charged the runic power core, find me within the ruins.', 166606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Rastakhan. Go on and have a taste of me mojo...', '', 166605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Den give me de power to destroy dem!', '', 166604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Whatcha be raisin\' such a fuss about, ya majesty? Ol\' Bwonsamdi ain\'t gonna let no outsiders take your throne!', '', 166603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi! De Alliance invaders have struck down our people! Aid me!', '', 166602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death has taken hold of me!', '', 166601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is dis dark power?!', '', 166600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer in agony!', '', 166599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will show you pain!', '', 166598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer!', '', 166596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape death!', '', 166595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn for your crimes!', '', 166593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let de fire rain down!', '', 166592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware de serpent\'s strike!', '', 166590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De serpent\'s bite can be deadly!', '', 166589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, my pretties. Go!', '', 166587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar can be a deadly place!', '', 166586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Send me to Darkshore.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Send me to Darkshore.', 166584, 0, 66258, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do my bidding!', '', 166583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hearts and minds belong to me!', '', 166582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would be wise to flee!', '', 166580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Away from my presence!', '', 166579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face de wrath of Zandalar!', '', 166578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I failed... my kingdom...', '', 166577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My loyal subjects! Show dese outsiders de price of their arrogance!', '', 166576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not face me alone, invaders! You stand before de finest defenders of Zuldazar!', '', 166575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 123016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remind me what happened?', 'Remind me what happened?', 166574, 0, 66247, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. I will bring the scepter back to the Far Reach. Good luck to you all.', '', 166573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tides, grant us power, cover this cursed swamp in your fog, create the veil of a fleet within it!', '', 166572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 166571, 0, 66245, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Delaryn glances up.>\n\nI remember you. You were there.', 166570, 0, 66247, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Delaryn doesn\'t seem to be looking at you.>', 166569, 0, 66245, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, use the Abyssal Scepter to create the fog to hide our forces.', 'I\'m ready, use the Abyssal Scepter to create the fog to hide our forces.', 166568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Abyssal Scepter is a powerful artifact. Give me the word, and I shall unleash its power.\n\nKnow that once the fog comes, we will have to move quickly before the Horde and the Zandalari catch on to our plan.', '', 166567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spare me! De White Widow filled my heart with lies... I see de truth now.', 166566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Horde will be ousted from our city!', 166565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me a vision of the Tormented Guardians.', 'Grant me a vision of the Tormented Guardians.', 166564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me a vision of the Rift of Aln.', 'Grant me a vision of the Rift of Aln.', 166563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
