('Grant me a vision of the Trial of Valor.', 'Grant me a vision of the Trial of Valor.', 166558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me a vision of the The Gates of Hell.', 'Grant me a vision of the The Gates of Hell.', 166557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me a vision of the Wailing Halls.', 'Grant me a vision of the Wailing Halls.', 166556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
