('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_2H_DraenorQuest_B_01.blp:20|tBlightguard Captain Thedric chases $n with a series of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286805|h[Blighted Edge]|h|r strikes!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_2H_DraenorQuest_B_01.blp:20|tBlightguard Captain Thedric chases $n with a series of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286805|h[Blighted Edge]|h|r strikes!', 166549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me a vision of the Darkbough.', 'Grant me a vision of the Darkbough.', 166548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our preparations are complete, $n. The ritual is ready.$b$Our enchantments on these bones should be sufficient for us to unleash its powers on the Horde, but we must move quickly. Are you ready to begin?', '', 166547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to be working with you again, $n. No doubt you are wondering what we are up to.$b$bWe are still preparing the ritual. I will let you know when we are ready.', '', 166546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must move quickly for our distraction against the Horde and Zandalari to work.', 166545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll prepare a way to move our troops to Nazmir. We\'ll meet you in the Far Reach, $p.', 166544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And may it be with you, Halford. The Light\'s power shines brightly within you. Do not lose it.', '', 166543, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Thank you, Telaamon. Light be with you.', '', 166542, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am willing to pay any price to ensure no one goes through the same pain that I did, Halford.', '', 166541, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Horde, if left unchecked, will mean the doom of this planet.', '', 166540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All because of the desire for power that some of my people could not control.', '', 166539, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand this well. Halford, I watched as my own planet became a bitter, dead husk.', '', 166538, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s correct. Whoever goes will act as bait for the Horde and will be slaughtered by their forces... while our main fleet deploys.', '', 166537, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said this is suicide mission, yes? That no one will return.', '', 166536, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has taken control of Lor\'danel Landing!', 'The Horde has taken control of Bitterstone Quarry!', 166535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is your last moment to back away, Telaamon. We can find others for this position, I am willing to do this myself.', '', 166534, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, I just wished for one more look at your beautiful world.', '', 166533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Are you ready to go to Nazmir?', 'Yes. Are you ready to go to Nazmir?', 166532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n. You and Halford are here because it is time to begin our fight against the Horde, are you not?', '', 166531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is becoming unstable! Turn back!', 'The ritual is becoming unstable! Turn back!', 166530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji better handle this quickly!', 'Princess Talanji better handle this quickly!', 166529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this White Widow they speak of?', 'Who is this White Widow they speak of?', 166528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe this is happening...', 'I cannot believe this is happening...', 166527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make these traitors pay!', 'Make these traitors pay!', 166526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, of all days?!', 'Today, of all days?!', 166525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It all happened so quickly...', 'It all happened so quickly...', 166524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is Talanji safe?', 'Is Talanji safe?', 166523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They just started tearing de place up!', 'They just started tearing de place up!', 166522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De White Widow sends her regards!', 'De White Widow sends her regards!', 166521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji\'s pet! White Widow take you!', 'Talanji\'s pet! White Widow take you!', 166520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De White Widow said you would come. I will not be silenced!', 'De White Widow said you would come. I will not be silenced!', 166519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be made quiet! De White Widow gives me voice!', 'I will not be made quiet! De White Widow gives me voice!', 166518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She promised us a choice! You will not take that from me!', 'She promised us a choice! You will not take that from me!', 166517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For De White Widow!', 'For De White Widow!', 166516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I let de Widow\'s whispers persuade me. I am sorry.', 'I let de Widow\'s whispers persuade me. I am sorry.', 166515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t hurt me.', 'Please don\'t hurt me.', 166514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not mean to cause so much trouble. I just got caught up in de madness!', 'I did not mean to cause so much trouble. I just got caught up in de madness!', 166513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
