('I\'d prefer a little downtime and rest to this, to be frank.', '', 166348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not complaining, any chance to gut the Alliance is good for me.', '', 166347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well, plans change. Orders from the top and what not.', '', 166346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And if I recall, our job WAS done.', 166345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, I thought we were supposed to head out of here once our job was done.', '', 166344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HeheHAHA! Finally, I get to use my shadow magic on real targets!', 166343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Mekkatorque.', 'I want to teleport to Mekkatorque.', 166342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark my words... Before this day is over, I will see that meddling runt raised as a Forsaken. Heroes, bring down that beast!', '', 166341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have any hope of overcoming gnomish innovation! I advise you to surrender... or to collect a whole lot of bananas.', '', 166340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use these beasts to fly down and pursue the Alliance. They must not leave here alive!', '', 166339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, Genn. We\'ve got a little surprise that should keep our pursuers occupied. Get going!', 166338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina! We have them beaten. There\'s no need to--', '', 166337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All vessels--set a course for home! Mekkatorque and I will cover your escape.', 166336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll show those savages the might of Kul Tiras!', '', 166335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual is underway, Lord Admiral!', 166334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, heroes. Your vessel is ready to depart.', 166333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me to help clear the way.', 166332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on guard, champions. I sense... a rising darkness.', '', 166329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, $n, let me know when you\'re ready.', 166328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me guard door!', '', 166327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The champions of the Horde boarded the Zandalari ship and pursued us.', '', 166326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('That\'s when the troll princess returned... with blood in her eyes.', '', 166325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea priests did their job. It was a sight to behold!', '', 166324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde troops were relentless... bloodthirsty. But our Kul Tiran forces weren\'t backing down!', '', 166323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion fought bravely to get us out of there.', '', 166319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! That\'s one Alliance hero down. But I want your blades soaked in Proudmoore blood. Move!', '', 166318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the...? Okay, I wanna know two things... First, how could you let that pipsqueak get away? And second.... WHY DON\'T I HAVE AN ESCAPE POD?', '', 166317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Tinker fought bravely. But in the end... it wasn\'t enough. Thank the tides he had one last trick up his sleeve to carry him to safety!', '', 166316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He gave us help from the skies while gnome forces aided us on the ground... until Gallywix showed up.', '', 166312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde hoped to pin us between their pursuing champions and the forces holding the docks. But they didn\'t count on the High Tinker!', '', 166311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you know, the Horde arrived too late to save King Rastakhan. While the troll princess grieved, it was the Blightcaller who rallied their forces.', '', 166310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do my best to tell you what happened. It started when they saw their king fall...', '', 166309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, speak to the survivor. I want details on what happened out there.', '', 166308, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 122616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grand Admiral fought bravely, as did the High Tinker. But the Horde attacked with such rage... such fury!', '', 166307, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a witness who survived the battle, my king.', '', 166306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121910, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, dat is how you do it! I will see if Rokhan needs my help.', '', 166305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The attack on Zuldazar was a success, but the Horde caught up to us as we retreated.', '', 166304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina badly wounded... Mekkatorque on the brink of death... What went wrong, Genn?', '', 166303, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone! Head to the ships!', '', 166302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can savor our victory back in Boralus. It\'s time to get our people out of here.', '', 166301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan chose his fate when he sided with the Horde.', '', 166300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $p. I will go see who else needs help!', '', 166299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think so, goblin. Heroes, you know what to do.', '', 166298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No surprise in her choice of allies. The Zandalari deserve their fate.', '', 166297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the Banshee Queen isn\'t the only one with ghouls in her arsenal.', '', 166296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still... you made the Alliance bleed. Gather your strength, heroes. There will be more fighting to come.', '', 166295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore managed to escape with her wretched life. The warchief will not be pleased.', '', 166294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave da princess to her grief, champions. No doubt she be grateful to ya for seekin\' to avenge Rastakhan.', '', 166293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be so, princess! Heroes, come aboard!', 166292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain, take dese Horde champions and pursue de murderers! Bring me de head of Jaina Proudmoore!', 166291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance invaded our city and killed our king. De wounded need my aid.', 166290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Helm, bring us to de docks! By de loa... what has happened here?', 166289, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Dose butchers are getting away!', 166288, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 122624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji! Da Alliance be usin\' their sea priest mojo against us!', '', 166287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care what that monstrosity is. Bring it down, champions!', '', 166286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s some powerful mojo dose sea priests be cookin\' up! Dey summoned a nasty ting!', '', 166285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Alliance invaders will suffer for their crimes. Do not let them get away!', '', 166284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya heard da princess!', '', 166283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De rest you know. King Rastakhan was a hero for his people. I would do anything to avenge him!', 166282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tell you everything I know. It began when de Alliance reached de pyramid...', 166281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ahold of yourself! These champions of the Horde will avenge your king. Give them every bit of information you can.', '', 166280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dose Alliance monsters! Dey... dey...', 166279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Tell us what happened here. Now!', '', 166278, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 122168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... no...', '', 166277, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 121888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta get to Rastakhan and Talanji!', '', 166276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be lettin\' \'em stop ya now, heroes!', '', 166275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troops, get down there! Hold off the Horde advance!', '', 166274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! Find a way around her damned ice walls... or through them!', '', 166273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why Blightcaller... I don\'t believe you\'ve ever received a proper burial. I\'d say you\'re long overdue.', 166272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore... Oh, I am going to enjoy seeing you fall!', '', 166271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halt! You will come no further!', 166270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen mightier. Let\'s move!', '', 166269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da loa of death be mighty indeed!', '', 166268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya be lazy now, ape mon! Get up! Show them invaders dat dey shouldn\'t be messin\' wit ol\' Bwonsamdi.', '', 166267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhhhhh, what we got here now? Dis big fella look like him could be useful, eh?', '', 166266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, deal with that overgrown distraction. Rokhan, with me. We must hold this ground!', '', 166265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To demonstrate our capabilities, we\'ve prepared a little... or shall I say BIG... surprise for you!', '', 166264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention Horde brutes! This primitive pyramid is now Alliance property!', '', 166263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in da name of da loa be dat ting?!', '', 166262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard her. Keep moving!', '', 166261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must go to his side at once. Champions of de Horde, please... hurry!', 166260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De city surges with Bwonsamdi\'s power! My father would not invoke dis ritual unless de odds were dire.', 166259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take dat, shorty! Nice work, champions!', '', 166258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna be doin\' everythin\' we can, princess! Gonna start by clearin\' dese Dark Irons outta da way!', '', 166257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must reach de pyramid before dey do! My father is defending it with only a handful of guards.', 166256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance forces have come ashore in the harbor. They\'re spreading throughout Zuldazar like a plague.', '', 166255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt the Horde will seek reprisal for their losses. We must make ready for what is to come.', '', 166254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, thank you for all you\'ve done this day. We cannot reward you enough for your service.', '', 166253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, soldier. We will see that the Lord Admiral\'s wounds are healed.', '', 166252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s how it happened. Lady Proudmoore was the bravest hero I\'ve ever seen!', '', 166251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When it looked like the Horde might get the upper hand, the Lord Admiral turned the tables!', '', 166250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Admiral Proudmoore was as gallant as they come! She offered the Horde every chance to turn back.', '', 166249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think that\'s enough for now. Bring Grong home, $p.', 166248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a magnificent beast!', '', 166247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold your ground! Do what needs to be done.', 166246, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! Our allies will do what needs to be done.', '', 166245, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold! The ancients require our assistance.', '', 166244, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the line! Those ancients need our aid!', 166243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to waste. Bashal\'Aran awaits.', 166242, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one down. Allies, with me!', '', 166241, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! We must press on.', '', 166240, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way. Our reinforcements will secure the area.', 166239, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlefield awaits. This way!', '', 166238, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come to reclaim our land!', '', 166237, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Battle awaits!', 166236, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To battle!', 166235, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh good, you\'re awake! Sorry about what happened back there...', 166234, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Umbric, we need a portal, pronto!', 166232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abort! Abort! He\'s out of control!', '', 166231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Plate_RaidDeathKnightMythic_O_01Helm.blp:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282526|h[Death Specter]|h|r has been summoned!', '', 166230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_GreaterPyroblast.blp:20|t%s prepares to launch a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286379|h[Pyroblast]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_GreaterPyroblast.blp:20|t%s prepares to launch a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:286379|h[Pyroblast]|h|r!', 166227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are getting some new Azerite readings on de detector. You had better check dis out!', '', 166226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere is a lot of Azerite at a new spot on dis island. Watch your backs, though! Dese Alliance are seeing it, too.', '', 166224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like there\'s a ton of Azerite concentrated in a single spot. I suggest we get there first.', '', 166223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azerite detector is really acting up. Sounds like an opportunity if I\'ve ever heard one! Let\'s capitalize on it.', '', 166222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Azerite extractors are ready! Tell me where to send dem. Watch out! De Alliance will see you coming.', '', 166220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our detector is reporting lots of Azerite! Deploy extractors before de Alliance does.', '', 166217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... one more... boom...', 'Just... one more... boom...', 166213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bombing halts for no one!', '', 166212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, our Azerite extractors are ready for use. Care to take them out for a spin? I\'ve marked the good spots on your map.', '', 166211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve found a few sites that are prime for Azerite extraction. Gotta move quick, though. The Horde surely found them, too.', '', 166210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your actions have saved countless lives. Thank you.', 166209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another enemy thwarted. Darkshore owes you a debt of gratitude.', 166208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The threat is no more. Well fought, champion.', 166207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our sentinels have identified a new threat in the area. Slay it before it assaults our forces!', 166206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful adversary has been spotted nearby. Act swiftly, champion!', 166205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This foe poses a grave threat to the people of Darkshore. It must be cut down!', 166204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done what you can. Let us hope your efforts help restore balance to the land.', 166203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without our druids to tend to the creatures of Darkshore, corruption has spread unchecked. We must stop it before it is too late.', 166202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A necessary measure, if regrettable. Thank you for carrying it out.', 166201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our ancestral spirits have been driven to madness by the Horde\'s atrocities. Put them to rest and bring them peace.', 166200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cultists are scattered and broken. If they are wise, they will remain that way.', 166199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The remnants of the Twilight\'s Hammer have crawled out of hiding. Whatever their schemes, they must be stopped.', 166198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These foul pests are a blight upon Darkshore. They will not be missed.', 166197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Murloc infestations continue to plague our lands and harass our people. Exterminate them.', 166196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga\'s advance has been halted, for now. We must remain vigilant.', 166195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Naga invaders are taking advantage of the turmoil in Darkshore. Drive them back into the depths where they belong.', 166194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. Let each Horde death be a message to the Banshee Queen!', 166193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our victory is not complete until every Horde soldier is purged from Darkshore. Leave none alive.', 166192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! They should have known better than to tangle with a champion of the Dark Lady.', '', 166191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Horde!', '', 166190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call in the val\'kyr! This one will make a useful ally...', '', 166189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dangerous foe is lurking in our midst. Show them no mercy.', '', 166188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have spotted a powerful threat nearby. Take it out.', '', 166187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A formidable opponent has been sighted in your vicinity. Care to test your mettle?', '', 166186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These trolls are annoyingly resilient, but we have them on the run. They won\'t hold out for long.', '', 166185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Witherbark trolls are the last remnants of a doomed tribe. They were driven from the Hinterlands by the armies of the Dark Lady. Let\'s finish the job, shall we?', '', 166184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Syndicate has been routed. I\'ll dispatch the Deathguard to clean up the stragglers.', '', 166183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Syndicate hooligans actually believe that they can lay claim to this territory. Make it clear that this land belongs to the Horde.', '', 166182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should keep them subdued until we devise a more permanent solution.', '', 166181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic holding these elementals at bay is weakening. Destroy them before they become more of a nuisance.', '', 166180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the vermin cleared out, our operations can resume. Hmph... candles indeed!', '', 166179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These loathsome kobolds hinder our mining operations. Get rid of them. Oh, and take their candles, will you? I\'m curious what all the fuss is about.', '', 166178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have always said that the surest way through a thick skull is with a well-placed axe. I believe your message was properly received.', '', 166177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lumbering brutes can\'t take the hint that they are no longer welcome in Arathi. Ensure they get the message.', '', 166176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Their corpses will make fine cannon fodder in the battles to come.', '', 166175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems that certain Alliance forces still refuse to die like good little soldiers. Let us help them along.', '', 166174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thus will be the fate of all enemies of the Horde.', '', 166173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A blow well struck! The Horde triumphs once again!', '', 166172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more body for the Dark Lady\'s army.', '', 166171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful adversary has been sighted nearby. Take it down!', '', 166170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This foe thinks they can stand up to the Horde. Show them they are mistaken.', '', 166169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new threat emerges! Give no quarter!', '', 166168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! This... this wasn\'t...', 166167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave our enemy bereft of allies and they will fold. You have done well.', '', 166166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves revere the creatures of this place as kindred spirits. That should be all the motivation required to destroy them.', '', 166165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splendid. As I\'m sure you\'d agree, there\'s nothing like a little desecration to demoralize an enemy.', '', 166163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we\'ve roused the spirits of fallen natives. It would be a shame if we vexed them further.', '', 166162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Just make sure they stay dead this time.', '', 166161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Twilight\'s Hammer buffoons just don\'t know when to die. Kindly show them.', '', 166160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, sweet silence. Their incessant gibbering can be quite taxing.', '', 166159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spare me the trouble and die!', 166158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These intolerable murlocs are becoming more than an inconvenient nuisance. Take care of them.', '', 166157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those serpents will think twice before slithering into Horde territory again!', '', 166156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These naga seem to think they can take what is ours. Make plain their error in judgment.', '', 166155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. We will not rest until this misbegotten shore is purged!', '', 166154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance clings to this place like fleas on a hound\'s back. Exterminate them.', '', 166153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The chest appears to be sealed by magic.>', '<The chest appears to be sealed by magic.>', 166152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_SELFDESTRUCT.BLP:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284374|h[Magma Trap]|h|r forms nearby.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_SELFDESTRUCT.BLP:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284374|h[Magma Trap]|h|r forms nearby.', 166151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
