('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_SPECTRALTRANSFORMATION.BLP:20|tThe combatants take on their final forms! Finish them!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_SPECTRALTRANSFORMATION.BLP:20|tThe combatants take on their final forms! Finish them!', 166149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_GIFTOFTHEWILD.BLP:20|tThe combatants summon |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282031|h[Fire in the Mist]|h|r, defeat the Living Bombs before they |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284399|h[explode]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_GIFTOFTHEWILD.BLP:20|tThe combatants summon |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282031|h[Fire in the Mist]|h|r, defeat the Living Bombs before they |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284399|h[explode]|h|r!', 166148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MONK_PALMSTRIKE.BLP:20|tYou are being tested with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282030|h[Multi-Sided Strike]|h|r, face each attack!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MONK_PALMSTRIKE.BLP:20|tYou are being tested with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282030|h[Multi-Sided Strike]|h|r, face each attack!', 166147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our home is under siege! Return to Zuldazar at once!', 166146, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dose Alliance snakes!', '', 166145, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey have deceived us! My father stands alone to defend de city!', 166144, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It does not make sense. Unless... dey wanted us to be in Nazmir...', 166143, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be givin\' me a bad feelin\'. Why bring da fog if dere be no ships ta hide?', '', 166142, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, nope. Now, we run.', '', 166141, 0, 0, 0, 102, 3700, 121654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now do we worry?', '', 166140, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry. They\'ve got this.', '', 166139, 0, 0, 0, 102, 3800, 121652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful...', '', 166138, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde have gathered siege weapons in preparation for an attack on Shatterstone Harbor. We attack their base now, and take out those weapons!', 166136, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to King Rastakhan.', 'I want to teleport to King Rastakhan.', 166135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I be Horde for life after this. Thank ya, $pr.', 'Looks like I be Horde for life after this. Thank ya, $pr.', 166134, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please show me what happened.', 'Please show me what happened.', 166133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told those \'lubbers that the Horde would come fer us. Lok-bar! ...Or whatever it is ya kind say.', 'I told those \'lubbers that the Horde would come fer us. Lok-bar! ...Or whatever it is ya kind say.', 166132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n. Your aid on Argus has not been forgotten.', '', 166131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye have me thanks... and me axe!', 'Ye have me thanks... and me axe!', 166130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye! Time to drown some of these Alliance rats.', 'Aye! Time to drown some of these Alliance rats.', 166129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr! The Horde\'s alright in me books after this.', 'Yarr! The Horde\'s alright in me books after this.', 166128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Serves those Alliance dogs right.', 'Ha! Serves those Alliance dogs right.', 166127, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the cap\'n send ya? Give her me thanks.', 'Did the cap\'n send ya? Give her me thanks.', 166126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Owings was right... The Horde\'s got our back!', 'Captain Owings was right... The Horde\'s got our back!', 166125, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Council of Loa.', 'I want to teleport to Council of Loa.', 166124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good tidings, $n.', '', 166123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target eliminated. Well done.', '', 166122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mission accomplished.', '', 166121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat has been neutralized. Good work, champion.', '', 166120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A significant threat has been spotted nearby. Be on your guard.', '', 166119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have reported a powerful foe in this area. You know what to do.', '', 166118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A priority target is near your location. Take it out!', '', 166117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll be nursing their wounds for quite some time after that beating. Nice work!', '', 166116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Witherbark have been an enemy of Stromgarde since the Second War. They\'ll fight tooth and nail for this land, and so will we.', '', 166115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe now they\'ll get the message. Well done, $n!', '', 166114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Syndicate isn\'t too happy we took Stromgarde from them, and they\'re making it known. Show them we\'re not to be trifled with.', '', 166113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. The last thing we need is for wild elementals to be raging across our newly claimed territories.', '', 166112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic that binds the elementals to this land appears to be weakening. Deal with them before they can cause too much damage.', '', 166111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now our miners can enjoy some peace of mind. Thank you, champion.', '', 166110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The kobolds here have a knack for finding their way into our mines. We need to protect our resources from them.', '', 166109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That ought to keep them away from Stromgarde for a while. Your help is appreciated.', '', 166108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogres are never the best of neighbors, but the Boulderfist are particularly... unfriendly. Let\'s convince them to play nice, shall we?', '', 166107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Alliance!', '', 166106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s forces still hold some key positions here. We should correct that.', '', 166105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Systems compromised. PURGE! PURGE! PURGE!', '', 166104, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 121526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breach detected! Purge unauthorized entities!', '', 166103, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 121525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re coming for us! Secure a beachhead!', '', 166101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be ended!', '', 166100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judgment is at hand!', '', 166099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have made a grave mistake!', 166098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must be taught a lesson!', 166097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never escape the sea\'s wrath!', '', 166096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have much to answer for!', '', 166095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
