('Unworthy!', '', 166081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Treasure Guardian.', 'I want to teleport to Treasure Guardian.', 166078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! No mercy for the Horde!', '', 166077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must pay for your crimes!', 166076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not be made a puppet for Bwonsamdi!', 166075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Bloated Leper Rat screeches loudly and runs to block your path.', '', 166074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moar big! Bigger! MOAR! GROOONG!', '', 166062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put a stop to whatever ritual those Kul Tirans are attempting. And quell their blathering while you\'re at it!', '', 166061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, we will... Doesn\'t mean I can\'t enjoy myself while doing it!', '', 166060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not here to taunt them. Focus on the ritual! We must ensure all our people make it out.', 166059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should\'ve never challenged the might of Kul Tiras, Horde scum!', '', 166058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need this blockade broken and these docks secured!', '', 166057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She... Maiev, I must speak to you alone.', 166056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll cross paths again, Blightcaller. I\'ll see you dead or in chains before this war ends, I promise you.', '', 166055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... Where is Sira? She is not with you.', 166054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leaving so soon, Shaw? What a pity. I\'ve got an arrow with your name carved into it.', '', 166053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
