('Her song shall spell your doom!', '', 166037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea\'s bounty can be quite... alluring!', '', 166036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
