('Signaling Fogsail Cannoneers', 'Signaling Fogsail Cannoneers', 166011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Definitely bigger, yes. But we still need to monitor his other stats.', 166010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you look at that! What a beast!', '', 166009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya must be new to the crew. Let me show you how we deal with scoundrels like this!', 'Ya must be new to the crew. Let me show you how we deal with scoundrels like this!', 166008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
