('', 'We can\'t recommend that.', 165994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me want bigger! Me can handle it.', '', 165993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Certainly faster than before. How\'s his intellect holding up?', 165992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to ride a Caravan.', 'I would like to ride a Caravan.', 165991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help a weary traveler like yourself today?', '', 165990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come closer! We will be safe from prying eyes in here.', 165989, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That ship is... quite something.', 165988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see what an embiggified Grong can do!', 165985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I will not walk de Other... Side...', 165984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like this teleport pad reactivated when you beat that Prototype Annoy-O-Tron. It should take you below safely.', '', 165980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All our hard work is about to pay off, $p. \n\nLet me know when you\'re ready to make history!', 165979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Embiggifier is our greatest invention!', 165978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Heroes... you know what must be done.', '', 165977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar forever!', '', 165976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got us inside, the rest is up to you now.', '', 165975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I will not surrender. Because no matter what happens here today... Zandalar will stand long after your Alliance has crumbled to dust.', '', 165974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should be grateful.', 165973, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE conquered this world. WE brought it glory. You... you are nothing. Merely de latest in a long line of savages seeking to undermine our greatness.', '', 165972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And death is mine to master.', 165971, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Zandalari built an empire dat would endure for over ten-thousand years... while your barbaric ancestors scuffled in de dirt.', '', 165970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... an exile without a homeland... you dare invade dese sacred halls and demand dat I turn my kingdom over to you?', '', 165969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan of Zandalar... On behalf of the Alliance, and in the name of King Anduin Wrynn, I hereby request your surrender.', '', 165968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have struck a decisive blow against the Zandalari. Let us hope their king chooses to surrender and spare his people further harm.', 165967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The throne room lies ahead.', '', 165966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was the least I could do. You were so helpful.', 165965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will thank me later, my champion.', 165964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many times must we forsake our honor?', '', 165963, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for us to go!', 165962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... so he can slaughter them in their sleep.', 165961, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are sure to stage a rescue attempt when they learn of his fate.', 165960, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safety protocols malfunctioning. Primary directive: protect Gnomeregan. Secondary directive: become sentient.', '', 165959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s going to get framed above my fireplace for sure.', '', 165958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suggest you move away from the wall. It is about to get considerably hotter.', 165957, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable! You disabled all of the defenses. I\'m going to take a quick picture with this pile of junk to remember this day, stand by it to remember your achievement if you want.', '', 165956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
