('', 'We\'ll measure Grong\'s speed first.', 165926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re entering the heart of Dazar\'alor. Expect fierce resistance from the Zandalari.', '', 165925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance salutes your commitment to science!', '', 165924, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! You big, bad Alliance heroes... Hold on a minute!', '', 165923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good hunting, mon. You get spotted, you make it back to me or one of de other scouts and we can do de voodoo on you again.', 'Good hunting, mon. You get spotted, you make it back to me or one of de other scouts and we can do de voodoo on you again.', 165922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They sent you to do the job? Oh, dis is gonna be good...$b$bYa job be simple, mon: get in there, find the target, and take \'em out. We know they be in there somewhere. My job be to give you the voodoo to sneak by the guards, but watch out for the sentries. They can see you, so ya still gotta be sneaky.$b$bI be givin\' ya one smoke bomb for when ya finish de mission. Use it to get outta dere!', 'They sent you to do the job? Oh, dis is gonna be good...$b$bYa job be simple, mon: get in there, find the target, and take \'em out. We know they be in there somewhere. My job be to give you the voodoo to sneak by the guards, but watch out for the sentries. They can see you, so ya still gotta be sneaky.$b$bI be givin\' ya one smoke bomb for when ya finish de mission. Use it to get outta dere!', 165921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve already scouted these halls and disarmed the Zandalari defenses. Our way in should be clear.', '', 165920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast! I\'d hoped we would avoid that monstrosity.', '', 165919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breach successful! I\'ll stay out here and keep the skies clear.', '', 165918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, heroes! I\'ll get you inside the pyramid.', '', 165917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the coordinates, High Tinker. Fire when ready.', '', 165916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our incursion point is up ahead. Clear a path to the waterfall!', '', 165915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did someone call for an air strike?', '', 165914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 165913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grah! We need these beasts knocked out of the air! Where is Mekkatorque with that new toy of his?', '', 165912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Paladin.', 'I want to teleport to Paladin.', 165911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was a noble fellow who deserved better. Heroes, do what you have to, but... please, be merciful.', '', 165910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck. If your cover gets blown, find another agent around the camp and we can try again.', 'Good luck. If your cover gets blown, find another agent around the camp and we can try again.', 165909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are going to execute the operation? Good. They told me they were sending the best, but I was not expecting you!$b$bMy orders are to provide support. I can hide you from all but the most prying eyes. Sneak into their camp and take out the target.$b$bI can also give you one more smoke bomb for getting out once you have completed the mission. Use it to make your escape!', 'You are going to execute the operation? Good. They told me they were sending the best, but I was not expecting you!$b$bMy orders are to provide support. I can hide you from all but the most prying eyes. Sneak into their camp and take out the target.$b$bI can also give you one more smoke bomb for getting out once you have completed the mission. Use it to make your escape!', 165908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing! You have managed to open the first security door. This hallway is filled with deadly Bomb Bots, but my trusty Bomb Crusher here was built to survive such an occasion. It has my best set of Nitro Boosters and a Defensive Force Field wired up and ready to go. Hop in and clear the path!', '', 165907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan\'s magic has turned our own weapon against us!', '', 165906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold the Zandalari back. Heroes, you deal with this pair of Horde thugs!', '', 165905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Hello. Hello.', '', 165904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanguard, with me! Press forward!', '', 165903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers, defend our sacred city! Halt de enemy advance! Zandalar forever!', '', 165902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have little time before the Horde return to the city. Keep moving!', '', 165901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All forces advance! Establish a perimeter. I don\'t want any surprises.', '', 165900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the beast!', '', 165899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to deploy our simian friend. The Horde won\'t know what hit them!', '', 165897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, our objective is to destabilize the Zandalari and take out Horde targets. King Wrynn wants to avoid civilian casualties.', 165896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Secure the harbor and prepare to move forward, spymaster.', 165895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! Our feint in Nazmir drew the bulk of the Horde\'s forces away from the city.', '', 165893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey were not counting on our forces being unified against dem. We will crush de Kul Tiran fleet and end dis war.', 165892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be clever, I\'ll give \'em dat. Dey be using dis fog to be givin\' dem an advantage in dis cursed place.', '', 165891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not before we destroy de source of dis fog. It is rendering our flyers useless. It is close to Zalamar, I can feel it.', 165890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be takin\' back most of Nazmir now. Once we be takin\' Zalamar, we can be assaultin\' de Kul Tiran fleet.', '', 165889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
