('', 'Such is the way of things.', 165879, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 121839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a Sanguinated Feast!', '$n prepares a Sanguinated Feast!', 165878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Grong.', '', 165877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are to come with us, Ashvane.', '', 165876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems the time for subtlety has passed.', 165875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Release my men. They should prove quite adept at keeping the guards occupied.', 165874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 123040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you before, you will get nothing from... Hmm, what have we here?', 165873, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 123039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work in Progress: Bat flies in and carries you to safety!', 'Work in Progress: Bat flies in and carries you to safety!', 165872, 0, 65911, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Mount_JungleTiger.blp:20|t You\'ve been marked for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282447|h[Kimbul\'s Wrath]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Mount_JungleTiger.blp:20|t You\'ve been marked for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:282447|h[Kimbul\'s Wrath]|h|r!', 165871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tell you of the fall of Rastakhan, when you are ready.', 165870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must know... how did my father fall?', 165869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey struck without honor... dey stole what dey could carry, and destroyed what dey could not.', 165868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one.', '', 165867, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey knew Dazar\'alor as though dey had been here before...', 165866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Proceed, prisoner.', 165865, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me, Otoye... how did these invaders breach our city?', 165864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll serve as proctor during these tests. \n\nPlus, it\'s never a bad idea to have someone close in case something goes wrong... but that won\'t happen.\n\nLet me know when you\'re ready to begin.', '', 165863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomish technology is years ahead of goblin engineering!', '', 165862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you- Oh... That\'s... Not something I expected.', '', 165861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, yeah! If the Scepter is that valuable, it\'d be in there, right? Let\'s go!', '', 165860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Towards the piles of gold and obvious riches just pouring into the treasury?', '', 165859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on a second, we should head through this way.', '', 165858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Two exits from this room.', '', 165857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sarcasm? What\'s that?', '', 165856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is lightning on the floor and fire in the hallway after this, Fairwind.', '', 165855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this obviously safe room. We should just run right in!', '', 165854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mayla has the most perfect antlers... Er, not that I\'m thinking about them or anything. Do not speak about her antlers!', '', 165853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do some speak of \"grabbing life by the horns\" as if it is a good thing? Because let me tell you, that is most uncomfortable. And impolite.', '', 165852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurfang once called me \"animal style.\" I did not care for the nickname. He had a hungry look in his eyes when he said it.', '', 165851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The downside to having a surname like \"Bloodhoof\" is that people are reluctant to let you walk on their carpets.', '', 165850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tauren stand proud.', '', 165849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight when we must... for Azeroth.', '', 165848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to me?', '', 165847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0EA6DCThe Alliance|r has destroyed an Azerite extractor!', '|cFF0EA6DCThe Alliance|r has destroyed an Azerite extractor!', 165846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFEF0201The Horde|r has destroyed an Azerite extractor!', '|cFFEF0201The Horde|r has destroyed an Azerite extractor!', 165845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Earthmother smile upon you.', '', 165844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Baine, son of Cairne.', '', 165843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n, let\'s blow up some Alliance with this thing! And, uh, hope that it doesn\'t blow us up.', '', 165842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph, it\'s like they don\'t even know how this mech works! ... guess we all got a lot in common.', '', 165841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be up ahead fightin\' de Alliance, we be kickin\' em outta here!', '', 165840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever the answer, we need that machine to help push the Alliance out of the ruins.', 165839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, are we talking objectively or subjectively?', '', 165838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Patch, $p, good work, but our fight is not yet over. Does your machine still have power left after disarming those mines?', 165837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us head to Xibala; to my destiny!', '', 165836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits watch over you.', '', 165835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work In Progress Trap here', 'Work In Progress Trap here', 165834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I aid you?', '', 165833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand strong. Stay true.', '', 165832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor those who came before us.', '', 165831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve as caretakers of this world.', '', 165830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are stronger together.', '', 165829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without honor, we have nothing.', '', 165828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earthmother guide us all.', '', 165827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde... always.', '', 165826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho! What have we here?', '', 165825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ROUF!', 'ROUF!', 165824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRRRR...', 'GRRRR...', 165823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ar-oof!', 'Ar-oof!', 165822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrrrr...', 'Rrrrrr...', 165821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bark!', 'Bark!', 165820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrrr... rouf!', 'Rrrrr... rouf!', 165819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrr...', 'Grrr...', 165818, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall make my way to the grotto to say my farewells.', '', 165816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would wish you luck, but... my words would be wasted. Super Teleport, activate!', '', 165814, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 121396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s more, I have observed your pathetic strategy and have already predicted your next four moves. You cannot hope to outsmart someone of my advanced capabilities!', '', 165813, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 121395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have just deactivated all safety protocols from this unit... and took something special for us to keep.', '', 165812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a plan. One so elaborate that a simplistic plebeian like you could never hope to comprehend it!', '', 165811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been watching you, \"hero\". You haven\'t the faintest idea what you are up against.', '', 165810, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 121392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back away from the robot... or I shall blow this entire facility to ruins!', '', 165809, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her deeds disgrace us all. We must set things right... before the Horde loses everything that made us strong.', '', 165808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is wrong. There is no honor in it.', '', 165807, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 121384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me... tell me, where is my father? My mother? Jaina... Tandred... please... please, I\'m so alone! Don\'t... don\'t leave me alone!', '', 165804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was... dead, wasn\'t I? But for how long? I am not quite alive, and yet... I don\'t understand this! Please... PLEASE... how is this possible?!', '', 165802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember the battle. Orcish dragon riders. Our decks consumed by flame. I felt a blaze of agony, and then... darkness.', '', 165801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... help me. I... I don\'t know what\'s happened. What\'s been done to me.', '', 165800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashvane is here.', 165799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valtrois--light them up.', '', 165798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move out!', '', 165797, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When these go off, this place will explode into chaos.', '', 165796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, get outta here! We got our army comin\' in right now anyway.', '', 165795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may retake these ruins, but our forces march throughout Nazmir. The Horde will never win!', '', 165794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very perceptive, Lady Ashvane. I believe we have... mutual interests to discuss.', 165793, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 123049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You only broke me out of that cell because you need something from me.', 165792, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 0, 123041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n, game face on. We gotta hit him with the ol\' one two, straight shot then overhead curveball!', '', 165791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your toys cannot harm me, you and the Horde filth will be purged today!', '', 165789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! What does this mook think he can do? Let\'s blast him and get this army going.', '', 165788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is with me, you will go no further!', '', 165787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill \'em all!', '', 165786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For... Proudmoore...', '', 165785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ain\'t leavin\' my island with that foul wench!', '', 165784, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to unveil one of my latest inventions!', '', 165783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe afterwards, we\'ll give ya a proper tour. It\'s a lovely place!', '', 165782, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 121847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll take ya to the brig. You\'re on your own from there.', '', 165781, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been huntin\' for this one. A prize indeed!', '', 165780, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch that jawin\' back there, prisoner!', '', 165779, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well... fought....', 165778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have sparred with trainees more tough than you. You cannot match me.', 165777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems words... have failed....', '', 165776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interrupt my work. We are not defenseless ambassadors!', '', 165775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... not worth it....', '', 165774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you messed with the wrong guy. I\'m gonna fry you!', '', 165773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For your sake, I hope so.', 'For your sake, I hope so.', 165772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah... She will be just like her father.', 'Bah... She will be just like her father.', 165771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should keep you busy for a while!', '', 165770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. You are taking this a bit far.', '', 165769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Officer! This is the infamous Horde criminal Rexxar. He belongs in the deepest, darkest corner of this dungeon!', 165768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even my magic is not potent enough to cover up that smell.', 165767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Quickly! Gather around. I will create the disguise.', 165766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to introduce a favorite gadget of mine!', '', 165765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know how fond you are of spears and battle axes, but surely you recognize superior technology when you see it!', '', 165764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your odds of victory are decreasing. Exponentially. By the second.', '', 165763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The logical thing would be for you to give up now. Hmm... but have I ever known the Horde to be logical?', '', 165762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a yes?', 'Is that a yes?', 165761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me Grong!', '', 165760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be made bigger. Big enough to be a weapon used against the Horde.', 'You\'ll be made bigger. Big enough to be a weapon used against the Horde.', 165759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is kaja\'mite?', 'What is kaja\'mite?', 165758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to do this?', 'Are you sure you want to do this?', 165757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plainly speaking, kaja\'mite is an ore with remarkable properties and a sordid history. \n\nWhen first discovered, it was used upon test subjects to determine its usefulness.\n\nThe results of these questionable studies showed a steady increase in intelligence when consumed, followed by a marked decline when removed from the diet.', '', 165756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As sure as I\'ve ever been about anything. \n\nIf I can help, I must help. \n\nDon\'t waste your worry on me. I am prepared for what will come. \n\nYou should prepare yourself, too.', '', 165755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is my destiny, $p.', '', 165754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warden needs you right away! Better get going!', 'The warden needs you right away! Better get going!', 165753, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you?', 'What can I do for you?', 165752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d advise you to stay grounded!', '', 165751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked for it!', '', 165750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the landing area!', '', 165749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got a small problem on your hands!', '', 165748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Slap on all the gold and glitter you want. Your inventions are still cut-rate trash!', '', 165747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'re better than me? YOU THINK YOU\'RE BETTER THAN ME?! Let\'s go, tinkerboy!', '', 165746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You plan to stop me with that gaudy piece of junk you call a flight suit? Were you planning to sparkle me to death?', '', 165745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, High Stinker! Your band of murderers ain\'t goin\' anywhere! Still can\'t forgive what they did to my beautiful money golem...', '', 165744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Warning! Vital signs critical. Ejection sequence initiated.', '', 165743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Systems... inoperable... need... charging cable...', '', 165742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power levels... falling... warning... warning...', '', 165741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System failure imminent. What a shocking... development...', '', 165740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde bad. Smash, monkey! Who is a good monkey? You are!', '', 165739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reminder: Do not exceed \"compassionate\" thresholds. Shock only for the Alliance!', '', 165738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy! No one said you could touch that key!', 'Oy! No one said you could touch that key!', 165737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subject\'s irritation levels rising. Maintain shockification!', '', 165736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antagonization matrix at maximum capacity. Ready to deploy.', '', 165735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All systems online. Target acquired. Batteries at full.', '', 165734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apetagonizer 3000 system deployed. Prepare to \"encourage\" target!', '', 165733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We sorely need the Zandalari, and their fleet, if we intend to engage the Alliance again.', 165732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji soon gonna be crowned queen. She da one who be sayin\' if dey join us.', '', 165731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, I think it be time to call upon da Zandalari.', '', 165730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
