('', 'Champion. Leaders of the Horde. I have summoned you here to discuss matters of war.', 165727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that shadow there before?', 'Was that shadow there before?', 165726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I heard something....', 'Hmm, I heard something....', 165725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
