('Ugh, what a mess. Who would do such a thing?', 'Ugh, what a mess. Who would do such a thing?', 165719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you now!', 'I see you now!', 165718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone is here! Sound the alarm!', 'Someone is here! Sound the alarm!', 165717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shouldn\'t be here!', 'You shouldn\'t be here!', 165716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji, can you use your power to jump start the A.F.M.O.D.?', 'Princess Talanji, can you use your power to jump start the A.F.M.O.D.?', 165715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0EA6DC$n|r has activated an Azerite extractor!', '|cFF0EA6DC$n|r has activated an Azerite extractor!', 165714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance are gonna regret trying to ambush us through a nightmarish swamp filled with blood trolls and monsters!\n\n... if they aren\'t already.', '', 165713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now, I gonna keep searchin\' for answers. If dere be new enemies gatherin\'  in da shadows, den I best be huntin\' dem... before dey be hunting us.', '', 165712, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you be da first to look to da future... to see what da trolls can become. You be young, but you be righteous. Call on me spirit if ya ever need advice from an old chieftain.', '', 165711, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar still stands because of your courage, Talanji. Your father was mired in da old ways, dreamin\' of a troll empire lost to time.', '', 165710, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She be leader of da Horde, no matter how she got dere. And she needs good advisors around ta keep her in check.', '', 165709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter de circumstances, she is leader of de Horde. I will do all I can to ensure dat her rule is a just one.', 165708, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Lich King didn\'t bring me back. Eyir be claimin\' she don\'t got da mojo. Bwonsamdi be as confused as da rest of us. And none of dem were eager ta see Sylvanas in charge.', '', 165707, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121093, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy in our midst! To arms!', 'Enemy in our midst! To arms!', 165706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Surround them!', 'Guards! Surround them!', 165705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
