('|cFFEF0201$n|r has activated an Azerite extractor!', '|cFFEF0201$n|r has activated an Azerite extractor!', 165703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This tarantula has seen better days. \n\nIt appears to have been punched to death.>', '<This tarantula has seen better days. \n\nIt appears to have been punched to death.>', 165702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know which is worse, the Alliance or the blood trolls! Okay okay, I know which one is worse, but let\'s blow \'em both up!', '', 165701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time! I\'ll get to work rebuildin\' the A.F.M.O.D.', '', 165700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish I could say this was the worst place I\'ve hidden, but I\'d be lying. I\'ll go fix up the A.F.M.O.D.', 165699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see ya, $n. We\'re rebuildin\' the A.F.M.O.D.? I\'m in!', '', 165698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Arrival at the Ruins of Auberdine.', '[PH] Arrival at the Ruins of Auberdine.', 165697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hit them fast and from behind!', 165696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin the attack.', 'Let\'s begin the attack.', 165695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish. Those monsters will suffer for what they have done.', 165694, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rally our allies. Sharpen your glaives. Darkshore will be ours once more.', 165693, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, focus on the val\'kyr! I will deal with this brute.', 165692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune\'s wrath guides my glaive. I can sense them ahead.', 165691, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There he is.', 165690, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now go. Remember your duty to the Horde. We have a war to win.', 165689, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 121029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me be perfectly clear. You will find the traitor Saurfang. You will deliver him to me. And you will not fail me again.', 165688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How fortunate that you escaped with little more than a bruise. Fortunate... but disappointing.', 165687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 121027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me see if I have this right... Saurfang single-handedly slew my elite forces and a veteran dark ranger?', 165686, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 121026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep moving. More of them are sure to follow.', 165685, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 122365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 165684, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 122248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope Tyrande is still there.', 165683, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Eye of Elune must be in the hunter\'s hall. Push forward!', 165682, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goddess watch over you.', 165675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On your mark.', 165674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider it done.', 165673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sentinels stand ready.', 165672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never miss a shot.', 165671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am listening.', 165670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, over here! You are just in time!', 165669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not let the Horde get through!', 165668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it up!', 165667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our co-inventor, Grong, has selflessly agreed to become embiggified for the greater good.', '', 165666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the process is complete, we\'ll unleash him upon the Horde!', '', 165665, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we could test it on the Horde?', '', 165664, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The product of Da\'kani intellect and gnomish ingenuity.', '', 165663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But first, we need to run a small test.', 165662, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I apologize. It\'s just we all know you\'re his favorite.', 165661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be absurd! If it works, then we\'ve turned our enemies into the ultimate weapon!', 165660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Terrible idea! Are you going to be the one to tell Halford that we killed his pet if things go horribly wrong?', 165659, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Technically speaking, it converts intelligence into size and strength, but we won\'t weigh you down with specifics.', 165658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adeptly named, it makes things big.', 165657, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We present to you: the Embiggifier!', 165656, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We... are... Kaldorei!', 165655, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They died for that folly. For our hope resides not in the trees, but in our bonds to each other!', 165654, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde burned our forests thinking to kill our hope.', 165653, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune has given us the power to save ourselves!', 165652, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory is ours this night!', 165651, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 122004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We shall have vengeance for the slain, and show Sylvanas that she has not won! And if the Alliance will not aid us...we shall do so alone.', 165650, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 0, 122285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande...', '', 165649, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 122282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will rest easier knowing the Horde cannot use against my people. You have my thanks for returning it to us.', 165648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grew up hearing tales of this artifact\'s power.', 165647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bravery and sacrifice of heroes like Blademaster Telaamon will forever be remembered by the Alliance.', '', 165646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be our base. Bashal\'Aran belongs to the Horde!', '', 165645, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will take Bashal\'Aran back for the Horde. Ride now!', 165644, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bashal\'Aran. Once a glimmering jewel... We will take it back.', '', 165643, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has the Banshee Queen sent you to kill more innocents, Blightcaller?', '', 165642, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assume that every step from here forward is under the eyes of the enemy. Press on.', '', 165641, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good hunting, champion.', 165640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Has the Horde robbed you of all honor, Sira? You will be brought to justice.', 165639, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show no mercy, for you can expect none from Maiev.', 165638, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, look who decided to show himself. The might of the night elves indeed!', '', 165637, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make our stand. The Horde will pay for what they\'ve done here!', '', 165636, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacrifices will be unavoidable... but if we are successful, we can bring this whole war to an end in a matter of weeks.', '', 165635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get us to the shore--now!', '', 165634, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get to shore before we are overrun!', 165633, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, get to the shore!', '', 165632, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we are to put an end to this horror, we must secure Bashal\'Aran. Move!', 165631, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These lands have been forsaken by Elune. You will leave, or you will die!', 165630, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maiev! You are a fool if you think you can stop us.', 165629, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not falter. The Horde trespasses on kaldorei land. Auberdine will be reclaimed!', 165628, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<giggling>', 165627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we wait. Rest assured that the gnomes will safeguard our secret weapon until the time is right.', '', 165626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No apology necessary, Lord Admiral. We\'re glad to have you join our ongoing operations.', '', 165625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not delay. Whatever Kelsey has discovered could be key to gaining a tactical advantage in this war.', '', 165624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, you\'re here. Let\'s not waste any time.', '', 165623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for action is upon us. We are about to change the course of this war. Report to me aboard the Wind\'s Redemption as soon as possible.', '', 165622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies for the delay, High Commander. There was a matter which required my attention.', 165621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
