('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\SPELL_HOLY_SEALOFWRATH:20|tFrida Ironbellows starts to release |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284436|h[Seal of Reckoning]|h|r!', 165618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Paladin_EmpoweredSealsRighteous:20|tFrida Ironbellows starts to release |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284469|h[Seal of Retribution]|h|r!', 165617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As do I. But no matter what comes, Kul Tiras and the Alliance will stand strong together.', 165616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Lord Admiral. It was an honor to be of service. I only hope we can soon bring an end to this war.', 165615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did well today, Taelia. I believe we\'ll rely upon your bravery again before this is over.', 165614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please tell High Commander Wyrmbane I will join him on the Wind\'s Redemption as soon as I am able. Thank you for the help today.', 165613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance forces think they have us trapped at Warfang Hold, but it is them that are about to be trapped!', 165612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
