('', 'Now we bring the Horde down!', 165610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the last dockworker. They\'re safe.', 165609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In a sacred ritual, the strongest among them became her avatar--the Night Warrior. Our victory was swift.', 165608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand strong! Bring the enemy down!', 165607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more... Got it! The last trap is disarmed. Hmmm. Passable work, Fairwind.', '', 165606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we stay focused? I\'m almost done with the last set of traps.', '', 165605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to think of it, an angry stone golem sounds like my last ex.', '', 165604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While your concern is touching, it\'ll take more than a few creepy masks and angry stone golems to get the best of me.', '', 165603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are a few mystical masks too much for the infamous Flynn Fairwind?', '', 165602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
