('Kill!', '', 165585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will fall!', '', 165584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance are really testing my patience. Dey would be dead now if not for dis fog.', '', 165583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. Let\'s find somewhere quiet to talk.', 165582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much to explain. Some I still don\'t fully understand... but I\'ll tell you what I know.', '', 165581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much transpired while I was away. Anduin... I\'ve heard rumors about an old friend of mine--Calia Menethil. What happened in Arathi?', 165580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to have you back with us, Auntie. I missed you.', '', 165579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still recovering, but... I\'ll be fine. You have enough on your mind without worrying about me.', 165578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But enough of that. How are you faring? You held off the Horde\'s finest warriors so our fleet could withdraw. You risked everything for the Alliance, Jaina.', '', 165577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was a costly battle... in many ways.', 165576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our priests feel just as helpless. History will say we won a great victory in Zuldazar. Yet I find little cause for celebration.', '', 165575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can the Light heal him?', 165574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry. The mechanism preserving his body is unlike any magic I have encountered.', 165573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, is there anything you can do for Mekkatorque?', '', 165572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must continue the fight. But as we push toward victory, we must never lose sight of who we are and what we stand for.', '', 165571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s the real problem here. I imagine she is already finding ways to turn this to her advantage.', '', 165570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*angry growling* No.', '', 165569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no wish to be like Sylvanas Windrunner. Do you Genn?', 165568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Their queen would do it.', '', 165567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me.', 'Show me.', 165566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Press the attack as the Zandalari mourn their fallen king? That would make us no better than the Banshee.', 165565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Large parts of Nazmir be lost ta de Alliance. Dey be usin\' dis fog to mask dere movements.', '', 165564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has never been more vulnerable. We should strike hard... before Sylvanas hatches another vile scheme.', '', 165563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More than half the Zandalari vessels were destroyed in the initial strike, and the Horde fleet is in disarray. Their remaining ships cannot hope to stand against the Kul Tiran navy.', '', 165562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But our mission was to drive a wedge between the Zandalari and the Horde. Instead, we may have strengthened their bond.', '', 165561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was a casualty of war, Anduin. A king must be willing to sacrifice himself for his people without doubt or hesitation.', '', 165560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dori\'thur looks at you expectantly.>', '', 165559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know that, Genn... as well as anyone.', '', 165558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but at what cost? So many fallen... including Mekkatorque, whose life hangs by a thread. And I fear the death of Rastakhan will ignite a fire in the hearts of the Zandalari.', '', 165557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is losing on all fronts. The Alliance should achieve victory in a matter of weeks.', '', 165556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king, the attack on Zuldazar was a resounding success.', '', 165555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you dragged along with you?', '', 165554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The southern gate has been breached!', 'The southern gate has been breached!', 165553, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot fly through dis fog, we have already lost several warriors to it. De Alliance are trying to delay our attack!', '', 165552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be tryin\' ta help our remainin\' forces, but I was overrun by de Alliance. Dat Telaamon, he be no ordinary warrior.', '', 165551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you tell us anything of dis fog? Of Zul\'jan ruins?', 165550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has attacked de Alliance\'s Azerite sources and released Ashvane, dey must be getting desperate to end dis war.', '', 165549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come! We ride for Nazmir to bring an end to dis madness.', 165548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me, cowards! Boralus stands strong!', '', 165547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s just say Dalaran was a long way from Kul Tiras, and I needed to fit in. I missed you too, Tandred. Even the teasing.', 165545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tOne of Sira\'s glaives drops to the ground,  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:289205|h[Hurl]|h|r it at an Avatar of Smoldering Vengeance.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tOne of Sira\'s glaives drops to the ground,  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:289205|h[Hurl]|h|r it at an Avatar of Smoldering Vengeance.', 165544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only question I have is... when did you start sounding like a mainlander?', '', 165543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always knew where you stood. Now everyone else does, too.', '', 165542, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 127258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, our fleet was lost. If you hadn\'t called us home, we\'d never have survived out there. Just like Boralus wasn\'t going to survive Ashvane.', '', 165541, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feared our people would never accept me back. That there was nothing I could do to prove myself to them. To mother. To you.', 165540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde scum!', 165539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bandu thoribas!', 165538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not survive!', 165537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature will prevail in the end...', '', 165536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tMaiev will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284952|h[charge]|h|r toward your location, guide her attack to one of Sira\'s Avatars!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tMaiev will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284952|h[charge]|h|r toward your location, guide her attack to one of Sira\'s Avatars!', 165535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line', '', 165534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear the wilds!', '', 165533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds answer my call!', '', 165532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is nature\'s wrath.', '', 165531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line 4', '', 165530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough talk, Blightcaller. Let us finish this!', '', 165529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line 1', '', 165528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to begin, m\'Lord.', 'We are ready to begin, m\'Lord.', 165527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nathanos eyes you coldly, you think it best not to waste his time.>', '<Nathanos eyes you coldly, you think it best not to waste his time.>', 165526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... can never truly be defeated.', '', 165525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tMaiev will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284952|h[charge]|h|r toward your location, guide her attack to one of Sira\'s Avatars!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tMaiev will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:284952|h[charge]|h|r toward your location, guide her attack to one of Sira\'s Avatars!', 165524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature demands retribution!', '', 165523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line', '', 165522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line', '', 165521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for us all.', '', 165520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line 4', '', 165519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkshore is ours! You and your Horde will be purged from these forests!', '', 165518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is over, Blightcaller! You are at the mercy of the wilds!', '', 165517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP>Line 1', '', 165516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to begin, Archdruid.', 'We are ready to begin, Archdruid.', 165515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Malfurion waits patiently.>', '<Malfurion waits patiently.>', 165514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so ends the most tragic saga in our people\'s history. Follow me, $p. It is time to return the lantern to Silvermoon.', 165513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De might of de loa shall punish your arrogance!', '', 165512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders! Defilers! How DARE you disturb our rituals!', '', 165511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your end... nears.', 165510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I will not be defeated so easily...', 165509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe de Alliance is attacking through Nazmir. It be madness ta march through dat place!', '', 165508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance are using some strange voodoo, be careful!', 'De Alliance are using some strange voodoo, be careful!', 165507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people would have soon suffered the same fate had we remained linked to its magic. With a heavy heart, Prince Kael\'thas decided to destroy the Sunwell.', 165506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of dese days, I will be de one rescuing you. Oh, and don\'t tell Jabari about dis.', 'One of dese days, I will be de one rescuing you. Oh, and don\'t tell Jabari about dis.', 165505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not think we would meet again! Thank you for de assistance, I will retreat back to Rakera.', 'I did not think we would meet again! Thank you for de assistance, I will retreat back to Rakera.', 165504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas slaughtered our remaining forces and used the Sunwell to resurrect Kel\'Thuzad as a powerful lich, corrupting its waters beyond salvation.', 165502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha ha ha ha! Burn \'em up, $p! For the Horde!', 165501, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I removed the brakes to accommodate a bigger Azerite payload. Hope you don\'t mind!', 165500, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deal! That\'s a binding contract!', 165498, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heh. You bring the Azerite, and I\'ll bring the boom, lil\' one.', 165497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We gotta make more of them. Hundreds of them... Millions of them... Bomb-billions of them!', 165496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew you\'d appreciate my genius eventually.', 165495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uraka smiles.', 165494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoo! Your iron star made my post shake all the way from the front gates, Uraka!', 165493, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance are bold to attack from Nazmir.\n\nStupid, but bold. We will show dem de price of their pride.', 165491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sister was slain before she could fulfill her part of our pact with the Dark Lady.\n\nThere are so few of us left now.', 165490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be makin\' me way ta da princess, dey got Zul\'jan ruins!', '', 165489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will be purged, for the good of Azeroth!', '', 165488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance\'s attack will not be thwarted!', '', 165487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you want to show me?', 'What did you want to show me?', 165486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nathanos stares at the forest with undisguised hatred.>', '', 165485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh well, I never liked your hands anyways.', 165484, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell that to Kil\'rip. Ha ha ha!', 165483, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And take that stupid mask off. You\'re not Laughing Skull.', 165482, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut up, Quizla. I know what I\'m doing.', 165481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re packing the Azerite into that compartment too tightly, Uraka. You\'re gonna lose a hand.', 165480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, not again....', 165479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, send me into Gnomeregan!', 'I\'m ready, send me into Gnomeregan!', 165478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye of all should see the futility of fightin\'.', 165477, 0, 7505, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer not gonna win. It\'s not like ye can kill me!', 165476, 0, 8278, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, hero. We best get back ta Orgrimmar... before more enemies show up!', '', 165474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We betta\'. We be countin\' on ya.', '', 165473, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 121010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with honor. You will see me again.', '', 165472, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not today, my friend. This path I must travel alone.', '', 165471, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 121008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way, mon. I\'m comin\' with ya! Where da high overlord go, I go.', '', 165470, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zekhan, I need you to remain in Orgrimmar. Let those who wish to restore the honor of the Horde know that they must not give up hope.', '', 165469, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Banshee Queen. Tell her that I will be no one\'s pawn.', '', 165468, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good. You are still alive. Bruised... but alive.', '', 165467, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 121004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready? Take a deep breath. I fear I lack practice in pulling my punches.', '', 165466, 0, 0, 333, 64, 0, 121003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are to remain in the Banshee\'s favor, she needs to believe that I defeated you. But it has to look like you put up a good fight.', '', 165465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey! We did it, mon! What a battle! You see all dem sparks I be shootin\'?', '', 165464, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 121001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how you handle this little gizmo!', '', 165463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready for a shocking twist!', '', 165462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a taste of superior gnomish artillery!', '', 165461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s cut you down to size!', '', 165460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrusters engaged!', '', 165459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow... really?', 165458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To me, comrades! A brave fool dares to challenge me!', 165457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible....', '', 165456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I\'ve been fighting the Horde for years. What makes you think you can win?', '', 165455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should have... cashed out....', '', 165454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a tip for you: don\'t go sneaking around enemy camps!', '', 165453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill the traitor--and all who stand with him!', 165452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the honor of the Horde! Lok-tar ogar!', '', 165451, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 121016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of your prattling, dark ranger! If you came seeking a fight, you shall have it!', '', 165450, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 121015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the Alliance, I am prepared to accept your surrender.', '', 165449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s put that Horde intellect Gallywix brags about to the test!', '', 165448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you still have not learned to fear impossible odds, my young friend. It is an honor to stand at your side.', '', 165447, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance forces, get to the harbor! I\'ve got you covered.', '', 165446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it be da loa\'s will dat fall here, den it\'s gonna be together. As da Horde!', '', 165445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not alone!', '', 165444, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Or you will die here, in the swamp, alone.', 165443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will throw down your weapon at once and come with us.', 165442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And worse, after you abandoned your people, you conspired with humans against your warchief.', 165441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You turned your back on your duty to the Horde, Saurfang.', 165440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what orders might those be?', '', 165439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya ain\'t got a shred of honor between ya! How ya gonna turn ya backs on Saurfang, after all he\'s done for da Horde?', '', 165438, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 121017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Systems... compromised. Get me... out of here...', '', 165437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suit... failing... not looking... good...', '', 165436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is why you invest in gnomish technology... not that goblin garbage!', '', 165435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Gnomeregan!', '', 165434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One down, more to go!', '', 165433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target terminated!', '', 165432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face the pinnacle of gnomish technology!', '', 165431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve calculated your odds of survival. They are not in your favor!', '', 165430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware... the daughter of... the sea...', '', 165429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, to me! We will drive this Horde filth out of our city!', '', 165428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever that might be, she must not succeed. Be ready for me to call on you again, $n. We will stop Sylvanas--once and for all.', '', 165427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas sent her champions into that shrine for a reason. She must have discovered something that can shift the war back in her favor.', '', 165426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance stands on the brink of victory. Of ending this conflict and bringing peace to Azeroth.', '', 165425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Old God awakened... this does not bode well. Our world suffers much as it is. The wound in Silithus, the war...', '', 165424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 127460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnomeregan\'s automated defenses have been set to high alert, if you really want to go in there, be careful!', '', 165423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, you and that troll need to stay out of this. My orders come from the warchief herself!', 165422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varok Saurfang! You are guilty of treason against the Dark Lady. Exit the hut or I will burn it down... like that tree your Alliance friends loved so dearly.', 165421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurfang\'s hidin\' out at a small farm nearby. We best be gettin\' dere before dey do!', '', 165420, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey mon, over here! I be needin\' your help!', '', 165419, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 120999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must report back to the warchief. You are to take no further action until you hear from me again. Understood?', 165418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stand ready to defend the ritual.>', '<Stand ready to defend the ritual.>', 165417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! You\'re with the Horde, aren\'t you!? Get \'em, boys!', '', 165416, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to think of it, sort of like they\'re doing right now...', '', 165415, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were barking and growling up a storm. They do that whenever one of those Horde scoundrels comes around.', '', 165414, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must\'ve been your orc that got my dogs all riled up last night.', '', 165413, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If that was your orc, he\'s a big one. Best watch yourselves.', '', 165412, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found some huge tracks just this morning. They led over the mountain pass and into the swamp.', '', 165411, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen any signs of such a monstrous brute travelling over the pass?', 165410, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 120997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A filthy orc raided our farm in the night. He stole a priceless family heirloom!', 165409, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 120996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My good sir, can you help us?', 165408, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 120995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! I\'ll never get used to the taste of this vile concoction.', 165407, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 120994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me a moment to scout the area. We shall reconvene at Redridge Pass.', 165406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a shame. I quite like spiders.', 165405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...their mother.', 165404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which means that our quarry must have also encountered...', 165403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a lot of ichor. More than I\'d expect from one of these young tarantulas.', 165402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re dead. Based on the print pattern, I\'d say it was only a minor scuffle.', 165401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ripped webbing. Someone definitely passed through here--and it wasn\'t a gnoll.', 165400, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 120986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Derek groans as being revived.>', '', 165398, 0, 0, 0, 84, 0, 121156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Derek Wailing>', '', 165397, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 120939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We require more time! Finish it, Signe. I will handle this.', 165396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Kul Tiras!', 165395, 0, 0, 0, 70, 2000, 0, 122685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon I will call upon you again, champion. And together, we will steer the Horde toward its destiny.', 165394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This blade is more than a mere dagger. It is a torch that shall light our path forward.', 165393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A pity it now lies dormant. But anything that slumbers can be awakened.', 165392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xal\'atath... a fascinating weapon. I have heard tales of its exploits.', 165391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 127464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this anti-stealth pack and root out the losers!', '', 165386, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! We got spies crawling all over this place, sabotagin\' our siege weapons.', '', 165385, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone wants me to control the storms, change the current, but no one ever asks to just sit down and have a nice chat.', '', 165384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not how I imagined life after death would be.', '', 165383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do know I was a tidesage, right? Command lightning, control the sea. Just checking.', '', 165382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy what you have.', '', 165381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not take this life for granted.', '', 165380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never forget what is precious to you.', '', 165379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family will be safe, no matter what.', '', 165378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help the Horde, as they helped me.', '', 165377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is my only home.', '', 165376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', 'Help!', 165375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, you\'re here. We will begin.\n\nThe Proudmoore family was behind the death of King Rastakhan.\n\nIt is only suiting that we deal with them first.', 165374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the plan, Lord Admiral?', 'What\'s the plan, Lord Admiral?', 165373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am with you.', 'I am with you.', 165371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is nowhere left for the coward to hide now.', 165370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HELP! I\'m trapped!', 165369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me and stay close.', 165368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paying respects', 'Paying respects', 165367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why Lord Proudmoore, I\'ve given you a chance to reunite with your family.', 165366, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what is this? Why am I... What have you done to me?!', '', 165365, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There can be only victory or death for us, Baine.', 165364, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is too far!', '', 165363, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And once his mind has been properly conditioned, we will allow the Proudmoores to recover their long-lost prince...', 165362, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Derek Proudmoore was a hero to the Kul Tirans.', 165361, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What reason could you possibly have for this madness?!', '', 165360, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas!', '', 165359, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me aboard the Banshee\'s Wail. I have a plan to ensure the Proudmoore family pays dearly for Rastakhan\'s death.', 165358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. This war will not end until we stand victorious. Until the Little Lion kneels before my throne.', 165357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance slays the leader of the Zandalari, and you speak of negotiations?', 165356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we can open negotiations--', '', 165355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, this one looks right.', '', 165354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm. I wonder what this button does...', '', 165353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! Not that one!', '', 165352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one more turn.', '', 165351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina, you should not stand alone. Take $n and Taelia at the very least!', 165350, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will take a moment to find the path through....Ah, there it is. Good luck!', 165349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a moment to shroud our actions from their wards... I have it.', '', 165348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Magister, I think we\'re ready to get underway.', 165347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Fairwind--', '', 165346, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 121734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, are we allowed to make any additional withdrawals from the treasury?', '', 165345, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We hope you can gather information on the pyramid to support a future assault. Mekkatorque has provided you with a Gnomish Positioning Gizmo to take readings.', 165344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While our primary target is the Abyssal Scepter, High Tinker Mekkatorque has also given us a secondary objective.', '', 165343, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am being serious. Have you met my friends? Madness might be an improvement. And the tentacles, in some cases.', '', 165342, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a serious mission, Fairwind.', '', 165341, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By \"side effects,\" do you mean the shadowy tentacles or the descent into madness? Asking for a friend.', '', 165340, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can call upon the Void to conceal the magic Lady Jaina will use to open the portal. We believe we have eliminated any potential... side effects.', '', 165339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The treasury is well protected, but Magister Umbric and I have a way to get the team inside without setting off any alarms.', 165338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not pass while I draw breath!', 'You will not pass while I draw breath!', 165337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fall, monsters!', 'You will fall, monsters!', 165336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Silvermoon!', 'For Silvermoon!', 165335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is not here.', 165334, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So to answer your question quick as I can, I don\'t think we saw any dogs last night. At least not that I can recall.', '', 165333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t give up on her, now! You\'ve got a big heart, and that counts for something.', '', 165332, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me tell you, nobody knows how to tuck in a man the way she does.', '', 165331, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead of the wooing of a lifetime, poor Darcy had to put a sick man to bed and scrub the floor.', '', 165330, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had the poached fish and taters. Not a meal I\'ll soon forget.', '', 165329, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He takes one look at the franks and beans she\'s got boiling in the pot, and before you know it, his lunch makes a repeat appearance.', '', 165328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart couldn\'t take it anymore! A man\'s got no defenses when he\'s down in his bottles.', '', 165327, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then he decides that he\'s gonna inform Miss Darcy Parker that he\'s got feelings for her.', '', 165326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t need to hear any more about that...', '', 165325, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next thing you know, this one\'s so deep in his cups that he can hardly stand!', '', 165324, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truth be told, it wasn\'t so much the night off as it was a full bottle of very fine rum... and a lack of orders that we shouldn\'t drink it all in one sitting.', '', 165323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s fine! Why, Mr. Shaw himself paid us a visit! It\'s not every day the head of SI:7 gives you the night off.', '', 165322, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! No need to tell \'em about that!', '', 165321, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last night? Don\'t much remember about last night, do we? Hah!', '', 165320, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It ran away last night. Did you see it?', 165319, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 120984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My poor sweet daughter lost her puppy!', 165318, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 120983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
