('', 'I just LOVE t-shirts! Do you love shirts as much as I do?! There\'s NO WAY!', 165305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a bad feeling about this! Be careful!', '', 165304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 165303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes! That\'s a big one!', '', 165302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick! Get those supplies away from them!', '', 165301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seize those supplies! Don\'t let the naga have any advantage!', '', 165300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Now you\'ve got them on the run!', '', 165299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, hero... make them pay!', '', 165298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach those slithering brutes a lesson!', '', 165297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rescue those prisoners... before the naga do something worse to them!', '', 165296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those captives need help, hero!', '', 165295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen... reports are coming in from all outposts. The Alliance is tightening its grip. Victory is within their grasp.', '', 165285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not turn our back on our allies, Talanji. The war campaign has taken an unfortunate turn, to be certain... but our cause is not lost.', 165284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Titles mean little to me now. I must know... with de Zandalari navy in ruins, does de Horde intend to abandon us?', 165283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My condolences on your loss, princess. Excuse me... Queen Talanji.', 165282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
