('This is not the time to speak of revenge, Blightcaller!', '', 165280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen firsthand the treachery of the Alliance. Let your grief be sated by vengeance against them.', '', 165279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I too know the pain of losing a father. If there is anything I can do, please do not hesitate to ask.', '', 165278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for coming, $n. Zuldazar is still reeling from de Alliance attack. My people\'s faith has been shaken... and so has my own.', 165277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe now they\'ll think twice about leaving the surf to invade our turf. Hah! Ahem... nice work.', '', 165276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those blasted naga are assaulting the coast. Teach \'em a lesson they won\'t soon forget!', '', 165275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara has been terrorizing the seas since the days when my shell was shiny. It\'s about time someone stood up to her.', '', 165274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are on the move. I don\'t know what they\'re up to, but I do know that we have to stop them.', '', 165273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it be as you command! They will serve... or they will die!', '', 165272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience... patience. They may yet prove worthy of my gift. I will taste their dreams... their flesh.', '', 165271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lowly mortals desecrate your shrine, master. Let us drown them and wash away their defiance!', '', 165270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even thinking about what the naga are planning makes my shell crawl. Thanks for dealing with them.', '', 165269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! Look at you... how sickeningly sweet. It\'s perfect.', 165268, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 120981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t good, $n. We need to meet those naga head on. Get in there!', '', 165267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no telling what Azshara\'s after. We\'ll have to keep our eyes on the shore from now on.', '', 165266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh... shhh.. shhh.. shhhhHHHH SHYIRTS!', 'Shhh... shhh.. shhh.. shhhhHHHH SHYIRTS!', 165265, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shirts for everyone!', 'Shirts for everyone!', 165264, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who likes FREE T-SHIRTS?!?!?!?!', 'Who likes FREE T-SHIRTS?!?!?!?!', 165263, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got more shirts than I can shoot!', 'I got more shirts than I can shoot!', 165262, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep yeeeeeep!', 'Yep yeeeeeep!', 165261, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooooop!', 'Wooooop!', 165260, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getcher t-shirts hyah!', 'Getcher t-shirts hyah!', 165259, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HeyyyyyUP!', 'HeyyyyyUP!', 165258, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone has to put a stop to those naga. And right now, that someone is you.', '', 165257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Countless innocents were murdered. Entire families erased in moments.', 165256, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get to it.', 165255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! This... this was not...', 165254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pull Random Levers>', '<Pull Random Levers>', 165253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will show you the way. Come... come. The hour approaches when all eyes shall be opened.', '', 165252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Receive now the greatest of all gifts. My dream has become your own. The circle of stars made flesh.', '', 165251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... you are indeed the ones I seek. The ones to turn the tide.', '', 165250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obey!', '', 165249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel!', '', 165248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither!', '', 165247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last... embrace the truth of shadow.', '', 165243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the tides draw you into my dream...', '', 165242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children... the depths are my domain.', '', 165240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm holds strength... but there is a price to be paid.', '', 165238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid your faithful servant, o mighty N\'Zoth!', '', 165234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His wrath has awakened!', '', 165233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All glory to the master!', '', 165232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste his true power!', '', 165231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His gaze falls upon every path... every dream given form!', '', 165230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His devoted outnumber the sands... the stars!', '', 165229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His eyes behold every truth... every unnumbered crime!', '', 165228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teldrassil burned because I chose to spare Saurfang\'s life.', 165227, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am.', 'I am.', 165226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood tide rises!', '', 165225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared?', 165224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('All... shall be... awakened...', '', 165223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master... they are... worthy...', '', 165222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were not the ones you sought, master. We will find others to open the way.', '', 165221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were tested... and found wanting.', '', 165220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dream has ended!', '', 165219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy!', '', 165218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flesh was weak!', '', 165217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before your true master!', '', 165215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the price for your defiance!', '', 165214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will overrun all of Azeroth if we do not stand in their way. Start here. Start now.', '', 165213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual nears completion. $p, unleash the Eye of Elune!', 165212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance will fall beneath the might of the Zandalari.', 165211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere are a lot of val\'kyr between us and Eyir, and I suspect dey do not wish us to pass.', 165210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done! Rommath! Teleport us to safety!', '', 165209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual appears to be working! Magisters, maintain your focus!', '', 165208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder: Sunwell Explodes', 'Placeholder: Sunwell Explodes', 165207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These cowards are attempting to seize control of this location. Shut them down.', '', 165206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight the Horde every step of the way. They will spare you no mercy, so spare none in return!', '', 165205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our push into Kul Tiras has been stalled. Break the enemy line so our troops can advance!', '', 165204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet the enemy on the battlefield. Crush them and secure our victory!', '', 165203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These gutless Alliance runts refuse to engage us in open combat! Use the crawler mines to break their defenses!', 165202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plan here is simple: You see the Alliance, you kill the Alliance. I don\'t care how you do it.', 165201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies move against us. Stand firm and defeat them here to strike a vital blow to their efforts.', 165200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This atrocity will not stand. For the Alliance!', 165199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, look what be goin\' on here. Bettah\' make sure dis works out for da Horde.', '', 165198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance spies be lurkin\' nearby. Up ta no good, dat be for sure. Watch ya back... and happy huntin\'.', '', 165197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We aren\'t the only ones here who oppose the Horde. Do whatever it takes to bolster the local resistance.', '', 165196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An important Horde officer is hiding here. Locate and eliminate them.', '', 165195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Alliance, thanks to you.', '', 165194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies wield magic as a child wields a weapon. Show them true power.', '', 165193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! They look like ants down there. Run, little ants, run!', '', 165192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has secured the ground nearby. But all we need is the sky above it.', '', 165191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is too much at stake here for us to lose. Assure our victory!', 165190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow the Alliance to prevail. For the Horde!', 165189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is already facing resistance here. Find the agitators and help them however you can.', '', 165188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our troops have engaged the enemy! Join in the fight and bring glory to the Horde!', '', 165187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those swine-smoochin\' pigheads are congregatin\' around some powerful Azerite. Can\'t let \'em get their grubby hands on it, now can we!?', '', 165186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A squad o\' our soldiers has been waylaid by some slimy Horde good-fer-nothings. What are ye waitin\' fer!? Get in there!', '', 165185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief believes that she can win. Show her just how wrong she is.', '', 165184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the Horde has finally decided to come out of hiding. Unleash our fury!', '', 165183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gryphon riders have spotted the enemy. Knock \'em out, $n!', '', 165182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got trouble brewin\' over here! Let\'s put a stop to it!', '', 165181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons from the Alliance? Such a reckless tactic... No matter, you\'ve put a stop to it. We will drive them from Zandalar!', '', 165180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should give the Horde a nasty surprise. And if the blood trolls accidentally hurt themselves... Well, it\'s a win-win.', '', 165179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If our enemies had communed with the land, they might have avoided this fate. I am glad that they did not. Farewell, $n.', 165178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With our combined might, the Horde cannot stand against us. For the Alliance!', 165177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have left the Horde reeling. Join General Feathermoon in Shatterstone Harbor and deliver the final blow together!', '', 165176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'dun is a wasteland hardly worth fighting over... which is why the Horde has neglected it. We intend to use that to our advantage.', '', 165175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! They will have no choice but to retreat and lick their wounds. You can return to base. Good work, $n.', '', 165173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde might be expecting us to fight on the water. That\'s why we\'re going under the water.', '', 165172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spymaster Shaw has devised a cunning plan to rid us of the Horde presence in Nazmir. Report to our outpost and commence the operation.', '', 165171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fetid swamp is within striking distance of the Zandalari capital. Driving out the Horde will give us an enormous tactical advantage.', '', 165170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done it! I will break the ritual. One must always use caution when consorting with powers such as these.', '', 165169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void makes for a dangerous ally, and a deadly foe. We must make use of this creature before its strength eclipses our own.', '', 165168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have struck at their army, but we must cut deeper to truly wound them. Assist Magister Umbric as he prepares a ritual for exactly that purpose.', '', 165167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Zuldazar, the crown jewel of the Zandalari empire. Attack while they are unprepared and decimate the Horde\'s newest allies.', '', 165166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bahaha! Whew... seein\' those smokin\' orcs flyin\' sky high brings this old dwarf tears o\'joy. Ye have my thanks!', '', 165165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s high time we rained down some destruction on those lily-livered crawg kissers! Level it all!', '', 165164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good start, but we must cut out the heart of their forces if we wish to truly end this absurd invasion.', '', 165163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormsong has suffered the Horde\'s stench for long enough. Put an end to their pathetic invasion by any means necessary.', '', 165162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woo-hoo! Look at that mess! The Horde won\'t be bombin\' Drustvar any more, that\'s fer sure!', '', 165161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people in Drustvar are dealin\' with enough as it is without the plague to worry about. Take care of it for \'em!', '', 165160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas\'s vile lackeys have brought the plague to our lands! We must stop them immediately.', '', 165159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was bold of the Horde to attack Drustvar, but they\'ve overextended themselves. Strike now and drive them out!', '', 165158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this is going to be an exciting trip.', '', 165157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you might be right, Captain. $p, we should check it out.', '', 165156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is secure... for now. We should move quickly.', '', 165155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much for quietly.', '', 165154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heat rises, small one!', '', 165153, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120751, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it down!', '', 165152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I\'ve never seen an airship blow up like that! They\'ll have tae swim back to Zandalar!', '', 165151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Horde airship is bombardin\' the civilians o\' Boralus while they\'re just trying to live their lives. We gotta put a stop to it.', '', 165150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should slow them down. Now knock that Horde airship out of the sky!', '', 165149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde army is pushing hard into Tiragarde Sound. Make them regret every foot they set upon our soil!', '', 165148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, back so soon? Looking for a remnant of Magni\'s ritual, you say? Please, feel free to take any of the crystals that splintered when Magni broke free.', '', 165147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! A classic combination of high and low. They never stood a chance! Now get out of there!', '', 165146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the airship, just ahead! I\'ll rain death from above while you tear it apart from the inside!', '', 165145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-narash! The Alliance has brought in an airship to reinforce their encampment on the northern shore. Bring it down!', '', 165144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did not expect the Alliance to push into Vol\'dun. Contain their soldiers before they spread too far. Then we\'ll deal with the root of the problem.', '', 165143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If dat don\'t convince da Alliance to leave Nazmir for good, I be tinkin\' nothin\' will.', '', 165142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese blood ticks be givin\' me da creeps... so I know da Alliance really gonna hate dis. Ha ha!', '', 165141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, soldier! Now meet up with Rokhan to deliver the crushing blow!', '', 165140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s likely that the Alliance will fall victim to the blood trolls, but I want to ensure their demise. Cut them down wherever you find them.', '', 165139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the east?! The Horde is everywhere!', 165138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our soldiers can handle the rest from here. Take a moment for yourself before your next assignment, $c. You have earned it.', 165136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An airship can be felled just as any other foe: strike at a critical target and hold nothing back.', 165135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. You\'ve bought us enough time to deal with that airship and its cowardly bombs. Take it down.', '', 165133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protecting Zuldazar is our top priority. We cannot allow the Alliance to encroach upon the city. Push them back to their boats!', '', 165132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahaha! Da magic of da Alliance be no match for our voodoo!', '', 165131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes ya can\'t stay away from da voodoo. Dere be times ya gotta ask it for help. Now let\'s go see whose voodoo be stronger.', '', 165130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokhan will coordinate the next phase of our assault. Report to him immediately.', '', 165129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Alliance wants to hide among the monsters of Drustvar, then we will hunt them both. Fight with honor, and fight with strength.', '', 165128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara\'s not gonna like being denied something she\'s had her eyes on. Which is just fine by me. Heh.', '', 165127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No idea what these whatchamacallits are, but Azshara clearly wants \'em. We\'d be wise to make sure she doesn\'t get \'em!', '', 165126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance thinks they can sneak through Nazmir to ambush us, let us show them just how wrong they are!', '', 165125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wars are won by those with the most resources. And you\'ve brought us closer to victory.', '', 165123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like Azshara\'s flunkies are on the hunt for resources. My advice? We snatch \'em up first.', '', 165122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! Glorious victory! Eat dirt and die, Alliance scum! Stormsong Valley belongs to the Horde!', 165121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance thinks it has us cornered. But if there\'s anyone who can fight their way out of a valley, it\'s me. Let\'s kill them all.', 165120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C! Alliance forces have flanked us and are now pushing into Warfang Hold. Get back here and cut off their retreat!', '', 165119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Brann\'s Flying Machine is ready for take off.>', '', 165118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Movement to the north! Show them no mercy.', 165117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incoming! To arms!', 165116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust me, $n, that one\'s had it coming for years.', '', 165115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got a particularly nasty naga coming ashore. How about you give them a warm welcome?', '', 165114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, if Azshara wasn\'t paying attention to us before, she sure will be now!', '', 165113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I\'ve heard stories about this naga. One of Azshara\'s favorites. You\'d better deal this personally.', '', 165112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warriors at Warfang Hold have given us the perfect platform to launch an invasion. We will conquer this entire valley!', '', 165111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much for the city walls! Ha ha! Our warriors will have no problem pushing into Boralus now! Lok-tar!', 165110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! I need to get one of these things for myself! Now head for the main gates to Boralus and blast them to pieces!', 165109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces cannot breach the walls of Boralus! Regroup with our engineers and find a way to break through the Alliance defenses!', '', 165108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiragarde Sound is the most heavily fortified Alliance stronghold on the continent. We cannot hesitate or lose focus. Strike quickly, $p.', '', 165107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
