('Make it so, get every ship you can to Nazmir\'s coast.', 'Make it so, get every ship you can to Nazmir\'s coast.', 165078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are kidding me! I cannot get de entire fleet moved out like dis. De most I can do is order de ships dat are not docked to change course and head to Nazmir.', 'You are kidding me! I cannot get de entire fleet moved out like dis. De most I can do is order de ships dat are not docked to change course and head to Nazmir.', 165077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
