('But now that I know where they are, I can come out here sometime and keep them all company!', '', 165072, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope everybody is comfy here. Maybe some of them are orphans like me!', '', 165071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the leaders are in there! I bet whatever they\'re doing is really important.', '', 165070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! So this is where we get new allies for the Alliance?', '', 165069, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance are attacking us in Nazmir, we need your forces to move out and support Princess Talanji.', 'The Alliance are attacking us in Nazmir, we need your forces to move out and support Princess Talanji.', 165068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, good to see you. I am in de middle of training exercises, what do you need?', 165067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A warden\'s glaive never misses its mark!', 165066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn, Horde scum!', 165065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vengeance for Teldrassil!', 165064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the kaldorei!', 165063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I failed you, Sira. And I will atone for it by releasing you from your torment.', 165062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can you side with the Horde, sister? How can you abandon justice?', 165061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare speak to me of justice? I died following your orders. You abandoned me!', 165060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to begin, Dark Warden.', 'We are ready to begin, Dark Warden.', 165059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sira stands resolute, eyeing her former commander.>', '<Sira stands resolute, eyeing her former commander.>', 165058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya words be troublin\', though. Step forward, Speaker of da Horde. Maybe dere be a way ta find da answers ya seek.', '', 165057, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember the battle on these fel stained shores. I lost many friends to the endless forces of the Burning Legion.\n\nThings were set in motion that day that would affect not only Azeroth, but every world the Legion touched.', '', 165056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde cannot continue like this. We espouse nobility and honor, even as we justify vile deeds in the name of a hapless, hopeless war.\n\nOur Horde was founded in the crucible of conflict. We banded together against common foes to protect our lands... our people. But with Sylvanas as warchief, the need to survive may not be enough to hold us together.\n\nWe must find a new path forward... before we lose everything we are.', '', 165055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to Vol\'jin at the battle of the Broken Shore?', 'What happened to Vol\'jin at the battle of the Broken Shore?', 165054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calling up spirits adrift in the space between life and death is one thing. Communing with a spirit that has passed on is quite another. And then there is the task of Vol\'jin.\n\nI can say it is a task unlike any other I have tried to perform. My respect for Talanji grows.', '', 165053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep! Definitely moving!', '', 165052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re coming in loud and clear, mate. How about- Wait...', '', 165051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we don\'t. Touch. Anything. Do you understand, Captain?', '', 165050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t even know I\'m here.', '', 165049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We proceed quickly and quietly. Emphasis on quietly.', '', 165048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for invading our lands!', 165047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Light of de loa is all de strength I need. Face me!', 165046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A troll paladin? Now I\'ve seen it all. Protest all you want, but you appear to be outnumbered.', '', 165045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye must answer fer yer foul deeds!', 165044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No smoldering dwarf will prevent us from reaching the king. Champions, take her down!', '', 165043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here, King Rastakhan. What is the situation with the Alliance attack?', 'We\'re here, King Rastakhan. What is the situation with the Alliance attack?', 165042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no time to lose. De Alliance are here.', '', 165041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are with you, Tyrande!', 165040, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, spread word of our counterattack and meet me at de Blood Gate.', 165039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight as one on the battlefield. Your people have been valuable allies, King Rastakhan. We will not let them stand alone.', '', 165038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rally the Horde\'s forces. This is our chance to end this war... on our terms.', '', 165037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. We must strike as one, on all fronts. Talanji, lend your aid at de Blood Gate while we prepare our armies.', '', 165036, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 123038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have come to know the wilds of Nazmir. We can rout the Alliance, so long as we fight together with the Zandalari.', '', 165035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must retake our territory and destroy dis fleet.', '', 165034, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 123037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
