('Hahahah! Yes!', '', 165008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s one thing I\'ve learned about dealing with naga, it\'s that you have to strike decisively. Let\'s get to it.', '', 165007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should put a wrinkle in Azshara\'s schemes. Thanks, $c.', '', 165006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
