('Nice job handling the naga. Can never be too careful with those slippery goons.', '', 165004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever Azshara is planning, it can\'t be good. Stop those naga in their... uh... tracks.', '', 165003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remove this curse.', 'Please remove this curse.', 165002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
