('', 'Light... guide me... home...', 164962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light have mercy on yer souls... fer ye\'ll get none from me!', 164961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye had no chance!', 164960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bested by a Dark Iron!', 164959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Face a daughter o\' the mountain!', 164958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fer the Alliance!', 164957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall before the dragon!', 164954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to test your mettle!', 164953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You face a dragon of the Light!', 164952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the fury of the Light!', 164951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Horde... serves only... death...', 164950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A pitiful opponent!', 164949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! I have fought imps that proved more of a challenge!', 164947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the Twisting Nether, I slew countless demons of the Legion. This motley crew of troll sympathizers poses little threat.', 164946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your defense is feeble!', 164945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements will break you!', 164944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No quarter for you!', 164943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many fists can you withstand?', 164942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dragon will bring your doom!', 164941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Care to take a turn, Manceroy?', 164940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be nothing left of you but ashes!', '', 164939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the flames of the inferno!', '', 164938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to end this!', '', 164937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire... will be... rekindled...', '', 164936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice for Kul Tiras!', '', 164935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another corpse to burn!', '', 164934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari chose their allies poorly.', '', 164933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your advance ends here, Horde filth! You will answer for your crimes against Kul Tiras!', '', 164932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will show you how the Alliance deals with its enemies. Come forward!', '', 164931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Mestrah. We will finish these fools together!', '', 164930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire must feast!', '', 164929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d best watch your step!', '', 164928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of the cosmos will crush you!', '', 164927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames take many forms!', '', 164926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be consumed!', '', 164925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, my lady.', 164924, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 120970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark Ranger Lyana is an exceptional tracker. She will assist you on this assignment.', 164923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I expect you to find him before they do.', 164922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While some within our ranks have questioned the High Overlord\'s loyalties, we cannot allow him to fall back into enemy hands.', 164921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should the boy-king\'s forces locate Saurfang, no doubt they will kill him on sight.', 164920, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 120966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My spies report that Varok Saurfang has escaped Alliance custody. He\'d been held in the Stormwind Stockades since the assault on Lordaeron.', 164919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the Alliance!', 164918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tOne of Maiev\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:285766|h[Glaives]|h|r dropped on the ground, use it to defeat Sira\'s Avatars of Suffering!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_throwingchakrum_01_fel.blp:20|tOne of Maiev\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:285766|h[Glaives]|h|r dropped on the ground, use it to defeat Sira\'s Avatars of Suffering!', 164917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly champions, take up a glaive and deal with these shadows!', 164916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Warden is prepared, even in death.', 164915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer as I have!', 164914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death comes for us all.', 164913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then you leave me no choice! Bandu thoribas!', 164912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is your last warning, Sira. In Elune\'s name, stand down!', 164911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune be damned! I will watch you all burn, just as she did!', 164910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! I can see all de way to Nazmir from here!', 164909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are we going?', 164908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve always wanted to ride a pterrodax!', 164907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Kill Sira] I\'ll take care of it.', '[Kill Sira] I\'ll take care of it.', 164906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Spare Sira] I won\'t do it.', '[Spare Sira] I won\'t do it.', 164905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Finish her.', '', 164904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on with it.', '', 164903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will tend to her wounds. Free the others!', 164902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth is bleeding? I\'m sure she\'ll be okay. I bet she can regenerate like a troll can! Right?', 164901, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is dere a way dat I can become a big shiny like dat dwarf?', 164900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat sword is huge!', 164899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My my, look what we have here. The hunter has become the prey. It\'s almost a cliche, when you think about it.', '', 164898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is where it ends. You have nowhere else to run.', 164897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will speak again... soon.', '', 164896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour is close at hand.', '', 164895, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 124657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By coming to me, you have opened yourself to great opportunity.', '', 164894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have dreamed your destiny, mortal.', '', 164893, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 124656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go... but the blade must remain... to serve my will.', '', 164892, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 124655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Honor our bargain... free me to find my own fate!', 164891, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 124760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear me, God of the Deep! I have brought you the Opener... the Bringer of Truths... the Torch That Lights the Way!', 164890, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 124759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to present you with the regalia of our greatest heroes. Belono sil\'aru, belore\'dorei. Rise, champion of the sin\'dorei!', '', 164889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always remember that our people are not defined by tragedy, but by our ability to overcome it. From the ashes of the past, we carry the flame of hope into the future.', '', 164888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not that you have a choice...', 164887, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are. Do not be afraid. This was always meant to be.', 164886, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 124749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Row, row, row your boat...', 164885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis place is made out of... boats? Is dat common here?', 164884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have pirate friends?! Do dey know any good sea shanties?', 164883, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their intellect and might have brought us to this place.', 164882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear dat people here are really into water. What\'s de big deal?', 164881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I shoot one of dose things? I promise I\'ll be careful!', 164880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This? Why, this is my champion.', 164879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go get de humans! For de Horde!', 164878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we go see de snow? I wanna know what it feels like!', 164877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard some adventurers saying dat Drustvar is pretty scary... I love scary stories!', 164876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere sure are some funny looking people here.', 164875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to begin, Maiev.', 'We are ready to begin, Maiev.', 164874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Maiev Shadowsong eyes the dark warden at the far end of the platform intently.>', '<Maiev Shadowsong eyes the dark warden at the far end of the platform intently.>', 164873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure this is a good idea? We can just go turn ourselves in to the Naga you know... I\'m sure the punishment will be swift.', 'Are you sure this is a good idea? We can just go turn ourselves in to the Naga you know... I\'m sure the punishment will be swift.', 164872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear dere\'s lots of hidden treasure in de jungles. Maybe I could be an arka... arky... lollagist!', 164871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think I could be a scribe. I don\'t know how to read!', 164870, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know skinning? Can I see your knife?', 164869, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe one day I can be a crafter! I think jewelcrafting would be best for me.', 164868, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be consumed!', '', 164867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
