('The very might of the cosmos will crush you!', '', 164865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better watch your step!', '', 164864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
