('', 'Care to have a turn, Anathos?', 164861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dragon will bring your doom!', 164860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many fists can you withstand?', 164859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No quarter for you!', 164858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements will break you!', 164857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your defense is feeble!', 164856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let us teach them a lesson, shall we?', '', 164855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On my homeworld, I leveled countless Lightbound foes. I have been eager to do the same to these rivals of the Horde.', 164854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, the Alliance\'s greatest heroes... stumbling their way into the heart of the troll empire. I fear we can let them proceed no further.', '', 164853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! I have fought goren that proved more of a challenge!', 164852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So you\'re saying dat people come in here and just... leave their stuff with strangers? How do dey know it\'s safe?', 164851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
