('', 'A pitiful opponent!', 164849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Alliance... will be... broken...', 164848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do bankers get to keep some of de shinies?', 164847, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the fury of the Mag\'har!', 164846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bet dere are lots of shinies in here!', 164845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You face the dragon of Draenor!', 164844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to test your mettle!', 164843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another corpse to burn!', '', 164842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the flames of the phoenix!', '', 164841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough trifling! DIE!', '', 164840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The phoenix... will be... reborn...', '', 164839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see? I told you they were nothing to worry about.', '', 164838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Typical Alliance weakness!', '', 164837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn to ashes!', '', 164836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many saurids can you fit on dis ship?', 164835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we going on an adventure?', 164834, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is dis YOUR ship?!', 164833, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did dey find skulls so big? Did dey belong to devilsaurs?', 164832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at all de spikes! Like de caretakers always say, \"You know something is built by de Horde when it\'s covered in spikes!\"', 164831, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another threat to our plans eliminated. You have all of our gratitude.', 164830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, champion. Rest well and know that your deeds have saved the lives of our soldiers.', 164829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It matters not who they send against us if we have you to meet them in battle. For the Horde!', 164828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we depart, our pact has ended. Cross us before our god, and the echoes of your broken soul will ring through the ages.', '', 164827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may keep your offering. It may amuse him.', '', 164826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fa\'thuul, handle it.', '', 164825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These items I will take. It is time to bring the darkness to light.', '', 164824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, it has brought the elements together... and something else...', '', 164823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To have waited for so long... I can feel his rage... his hunger. The Black Empire will rise again!', '', 164822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another victory for the Horde! I can always rely on you to accomplish the task at hand.', 164821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creature, you were to deliver the relics. Why do you summon us here?', '', 164820, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work. Now our forces will be able to travel more safely through this area.', 164819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uovssh thyzz... Y\'za othk feln yurr. Shath\'mag sshk shu et\'agthu!', '', 164818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the most stalwart soldiers waver when their officers are cut down in front of them. The battle is already won.', 164817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coordinating an army of this scale is neither quick nor easy. More difficult now for the Alliance, thanks to you.', 164816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We shall stop the Alliance here and now. $n, take out their leader and disrupt their chain of command!', 164815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, this mission is refreshingly simple. There is a dangerous enemy here. Kill it.', 164814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance is dispatching some of their better combatants to this region. We shall dispatch our best.', 164813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our patrols report the presence of an Alliance agent at this location. I trust that you can handle the matter.', 164812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A high-ranking enemy officer has been spotted in the area. Show our new allies how the Horde defends their own.', 164811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you accompany me today?', 'Would you accompany me today?', 164810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Larry Rep Dude 1 excitedly clicks his mandibles as he fans his antennae back towards Deep Port. It seems he is done with hunting for the day.>', '', 164809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daddy had another plan, now mommy will never age again.', 'Daddy had another plan, now mommy will never age again.', 164808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommy tried to send me off to meet his voice, so I could play forever.', 'Mommy tried to send me off to meet his voice, so I could play forever.', 164807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears this lost soul wishes to follow you. Perhaps we should bring it back to Nathanos.', 164806, 0, 65938, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, soldier. You honor your ancestors with this victory.', '', 164804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, Alliance pups. Know that the might of the Horde falls down upon you.', '', 164803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to enter the Sunwell. <Start the Fall of the Sunwell scenario.>', 'I am ready to enter the Sunwell. <Start the Fall of the Sunwell scenario.>', 164802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter the field or the foe, we fight with honor, $p. Show these Alliance dogs what it means to be Horde.', '', 164801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 164800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder! For the Horde!', '', 164799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wildhammer! Oh, and for the Alliance!', '', 164798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well... It seems the Horde needs tae be reminded who controls the skies... That\'s us. We do. Take \'em down.', '', 164797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m sold. I hope Steelspark has more of those for the rest of my agents.', '', 164796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His song will not be sung.', 'His song will not be sung.', 164795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hugged until I heard de crack.', 'I hugged until I heard de crack.', 164794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He used ta sing de pretty song.', 'He used ta sing de pretty song.', 164793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... I\'ll be going, now.', '', 164792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well. That certainly did not go as planned.', '', 164791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An officer of the Alliance is rallying nearby troops. Prevent them from bolstering their ranks!', 164790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach him your name, $n.', 'I will teach him your name, $n.', 164789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I beg to feel that pain again!', 'I beg to feel that pain again!', 164788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He says my name. It hurts me!', 'He says my name. It hurts me!', 164787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind my eyes... I can feel their teeth. They nibble, they bite, they tickle my brain. Get closer, sweet one, let them taste you.', 'Behind my eyes... I can feel their teeth. They nibble, they bite, they tickle my brain. Get closer, sweet one, let them taste you.', 164786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had my share of disagreements with Sylvanas... But I will never forget her sacrifice. She was the Ranger-General of Silvermoon. Nothing will ever change that.', '', 164785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Arthas raised her as a banshee and turned her against Quel\'Thalas, it broke all our hearts.', '', 164784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She paid the ultimate price so that enough of us might escape to rebuild our fallen kingdom.', '', 164783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas Windrunner was our kingdom\'s protector. Had she and her rangers not met Arthas with such fierce resistance, our people might no longer exist.', '', 164782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Words cannot describe the devastation our people suffered that day. That any of us survived to tell the tale is a miracle. One that we cannot afford to waste.', '', 164781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my eye in that battle... and would have lost my life were it not for Halduron.', '', 164780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were wholly unprepared for what we encountered. Quel\'Thalas had enjoyed years of idyllic peace. And suddenly, we were facing death itself.', '', 164779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My company was patrolling the forests near Zul\'Aman when we received word of the Scourge invasion.', '', 164778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where the end began.', '', 164777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do know that I specialize in murder, don\'t you?', 164776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be watchful.', 164775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your voice down.', 164774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arrows at the ready.', 164773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m listening.', 164772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aim twice, shoot once.', 164771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it quiet.', 164770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silent and deadly.', 164769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Dark Lady.', 164768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A single soldier\'s death can turn victory into defeat. Eliminate the Alliance commander and rout their army!', 164767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be consumed!', '', 164766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble before his hunger! His darkness!', '', 164765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic existence will be washed away!', '', 164764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will drown in your terror!', '', 164763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but rubble in the storm\'s wake!', '', 164762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quake in fear of his endless strength!', '', 164761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master! Grant me strength!', '', 164760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory will yet be ours!', '', 164759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the end of your pitiful defiance!', '', 164758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your screams will echo through his halls!', '', 164757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will befoul this chamber no more!', '', 164756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH! Let it all be ended!', '', 164755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He... will yet... claim you...', '', 164754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your terror... will be... unending...', '', 164753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fish shall feast...', '', 164752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their dreams are ended...', '', 164751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and the world is his to claim.', '', 164750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...as the master claims his prize.', '', 164749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dream dies!', '', 164748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh is forfeit!', '', 164747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the master!', '', 164746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy!', '', 164745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before his might!', '', 164744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel in the shadow of his glory!', '', 164743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rapture in his whispers!', '', 164742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace the master\'s truth!', '', 164741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this... place... the wounded need time... to heal...', 'Leave this... place... the wounded need time... to heal...', 164740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at... peace...', 'I am at... peace...', 164739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry... whoever hurt you... Let your anger... go...', 'I\'m sorry... whoever hurt you... Let your anger... go...', 164738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will this... kill finally satisfy you, $pr?', 'Will this... kill finally satisfy you, $pr?', 164737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see... what they\'ve been... talking about... It\'s... so dark...', 'I see... what they\'ve been... talking about... It\'s... so dark...', 164736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde blood stains the ground today!', '', 164735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, friends... I cannot help you now...', 'I\'m sorry, friends... I cannot help you now...', 164734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another senseless death... like all the others...', 'Another senseless death... like all the others...', 164733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will win in the end.', '', 164732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, do not hurt the others...', 'Please, do not hurt the others...', 164731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ends here for you!', '', 164730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world needs more healing, and less fighting.', 'This world needs more healing, and less fighting.', 164729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us live to fight another day, $pr.', 'Let us live to fight another day, $pr.', 164728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight you, if you insist, but leave the wounded out of this.', 'I will fight you, if you insist, but leave the wounded out of this.', 164727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s soldiers like you who made this mess.', 'It\'s soldiers like you who made this mess.', 164726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you no respect for the dying?', 'Have you no respect for the dying?', 164725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These people are going to die if I don\'t heal them!', 'These people are going to die if I don\'t heal them!', 164724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, friend. I do not wish to fight you.', 'Please, friend. I do not wish to fight you.', 164723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m no fighter, but I will give my life to protect these injured.', 'I\'m no fighter, but I will give my life to protect these injured.', 164722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! Reinforcements are on the way!', '', 164721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let their flesh become an offering of atonement.', '', 164719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has awakened, and they shall slumber in his stead.', '', 164718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are insolent... unworthy of his gift.', '', 164717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scent of mortal filth defiles this chamber.', '', 164716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 124595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p... the blight thrower...', 164715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Naga have taken control of Lornesta Mine!', 'The Naga have taken control of Lornesta Mine!', 164714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for coming so quickly, $n. This is a matter I could entrust only to you.', 164713, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('<Simply nod.>', '<Simply nod.>', 164712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my queen?', 'Yes, my queen?', 164711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, champion. I have need of you.', 164710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Larry Rep Dude 1 rapidly clicks his mandibles in greeting.>', '', 164708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The end is close now.', 164707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do be careful. If anything\'s going to kill you, I would prefer it to be me.', 164705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You aren\'t thinking of abandoning me again, are you? That was so unkind, considering all I\'ve done for you.', 164704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see it?', 164703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again you prove deserving of my admiration. Such a worthy champion.', 164702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep me close. I wouldn\'t want to lose you.', 164701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join me at the Precipice of Oblivion. There the way will be opened. There our path shall be revealed.', 164700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood of those who are touched by us... it\'s so much sweeter than anything else.', 164699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We really do make a magnificent team, don\'t we?', 164698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will accomplish remarkable things together, you and I. Magnificent things.', 164697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It pleases me that we have a chance to spend more time together. You should know that of my many companions, you were my favorite.', 164696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How glorious it is to be renewed! Though I haven\'t forgotten your callous misuse of me in Silithus. Such a waste of potential.', 164695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew you were the right choice, $n. Your strength and courage are... compelling.', 164694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. YES. It\'s been so long since I took a mortal form. This body is pleasing... don\'t you think?', 164693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, though... I sense you are truly destined for greatness. We will accomplish remarkable things together, you and I. Magnificent things.', 164692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why, just recently I helped another mortal hero defeat the Burning Legion. My selfless sacrifice left me weakened. Sadly, that priest proved... shortsighted.', 164691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I realize it may be... disconcerting to converse with a weapon. Be at ease. I merely wish to see you reach your full potential.', 164690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strength failing... I need... blood... souls...', 164688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter how much pain we endure, we will not lose hope. In the face of darkness, look always to the Eternal Sun.', 164687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let this monument serve as a reminder of what it means to be sin\'dorei. That our every deed may honor the sacrifices of those who came before us.', 164686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 120754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My faith was shattered when Silvermoon fell. I lost sight of who I was. But by the grace of the Light, I found redemption before it was too late.', 164685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For thousands of years, the Sunwell meant everything to our people. Arthas dealt us a grievous wound when he defiled it.', 164684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A single broken link renders the chain of command useless. Well done.', 164681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justice is served! Selama am\'oronor!', 164680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please... The people here... need... healing... As do you...', 164679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a house of peace. Have you no respect for the injured?', 164678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
