('', 'An enemy commander is stationed here, vulnerable and ripe for the picking. You may have the honors.', 164676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic is cool. Maybe I can learn magic!', '', 164675, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are no willing souls nearby.', 164674, 0, 66665, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
