('Ooh! Where are we going?', '', 164672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are receiving reports of a powerful foe nearby. Do not underestimate them.', 164671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth is... bleeding? That\'s sad. Is it gonna be okay?', '', 164670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
