('', 'The Horde will find no victory here. Eliminate its officers and scatter its armies!', 164662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These back roads would make an ideal route for someone trying to avoid attention. Let\'s look around.', 164661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
