('', 'The beast cannot survive without its head. Cut down our enemy\'s leader and the rest will falter.', 164659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These savages only understand the language of death. It is time we speak to them.', 164658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande seeks the Eye of Elune. It was last kept here in Auberdine.', 164657, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde to be this organized, a commander must be issuing orders nearby. Ensure that those orders cease.', 164656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
