('', 'Unleash the Void Stone, $n. It should provide the strength I need to help you find the other two relics.', 164521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A stone to call forth the darkness...', 164520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop them and take what is ours.', 164519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Those novices are performing some sort of ritual on the stone.', 164518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That which we seek is nearby. A relic of concentrated void energy.', 164517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here. One path ends... another begins.', 164516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weak-minded fool. Only the strong are worthy of true power.', 164515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A crown for the ruler of all worlds...', 164514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so excited, all my chins are shakin\'! One thing at a time, let\'s blow up that ship.', '', 164513, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the part where you and me blow him up on his burnin\' airship. You can\'t get more dramatic than that!', '', 164512, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then when he gets there, we\'ll tag team him! I\'ll take him from the mech, you do, uh, whatever is you do outside of it.', '', 164511, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s gonna be flying back, and I bet he\'ll be all, oh no, I\'ve been outwitted by Gallywix, he destroyed my ship, I better save everyone!', '', 164510, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna show Mekkatorque that we ain\'t so stupid after all. Once his ship\'s on fire, we\'ll land on it and send out one of them SOS things.', '', 164509, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, here we go! We got the fuel, we got the plan, and we got the hands to push the buttons to make it happen!', '', 164508, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn!', 164507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now... destroy him.', 164506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, on the landing... that must be Nathanos\'s tent. Get closer.', 164505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their numbers are strong. Good. The more we kill here, the fewer we fight in future battles.', 164504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lor\'danel... nothing remains...', 164503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I took our their leader and grabbed the Azerite bombs.', 'I took our their leader and grabbed the Azerite bombs.', 164502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '*groan* I\'m losing it!', 164501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The complexity behind these enchantments is amazing. There\'s no way that a single person could have- Whoa. That surge of power. I\'m having trouble-', 164500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fascinating! The enchantments aren\'t just layered, they\'re interwoven! I\'ve never seen anything like this before. Let\'s see if we can separate them just a bit more.', 164499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, we fought but a fraction of the Horde\'s forces. I will share Dori\'thur\'s vision with you so we may scout them further.', 164497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot dwell in the past... not with our very future at stake. Lead our people to victory as I sate the Night Warrior\'s wrath.', 164496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You place much faith in me, given our... history.', 164495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come to reclaim our home. Maiev, you will command our forces.', 164494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blightcaller yet lives, but at the cost of one of his queen\'s val\'kyr.', 164493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande, what happened?', 164492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Our forces gather. We will settle this another day.', 164491, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hunt them down.', '', 164490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witch! You shall pay dearly for that. Let\'s move!', '', 164489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is nothing. Stay safe, Zelling. And remember... this is now enemy territory for you.', '', 164488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has gathered over 28 ingredients and is near victory!', '', 164487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has gathered over 28 ingredients and is near victory!', '', 164486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Dark Lady... I am... sorry...', 164485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never again. Ash thoribas!', 164484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have nothing left. We are forsaken.', 164483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you abandoned us. Elune abandoned us!', 164482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sk\'magg yawifk hoq!', 164481, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We placed our faith in you.', 164480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Voss... I will have to thank her. And you as well, Rexxar, for indulging me. It sets my mind at ease knowing they live well.', '', 164479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must fight the shadow in your hearts, sisters!', 164478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have the Azerite! Alliance forces are weakened and our warriors are withdrawing. Make your way back to Westwind Weald!', '', 164477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER scene of Lightforged beacons dropping and troops moving out', '', 164476, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late. Behold!', '', 164475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[LAST ONE] Tell me what happened!', '[LAST ONE] Tell me what happened!', 164474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The echoes of your twisted soul will ring through the eons!', '', 164473, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end has come.', '', 164472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But once our ritual is complete...', '', 164471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may taste some power now...', '', 164470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Else it will make a fine offering.', '', 164469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you are...', '', 164468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had best watch your tongue...', '', 164467, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has collected an Ingredient for the Horde!', '', 164466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has collected an Ingredient for the Alliance!', '', 164465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise! In the name of Sylvanas, the Banshee Queen, I bestow this gift upon you!', 164464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing. Raise them!', '', 164463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!', '', 164462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not stand alone. Now!', 164461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Any last words, priestess?', '', 164460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from me forever, elf.', '', 164459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shal\'karath!', 164458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon you will share the fate of your dear friend Sira... and the noble Delaryn. Reunions can be so... heartwarming.', '', 164457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll meet up when we\'ve cleared the Horde out of the Wharf.', 164456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am no queen. I am the kaldorei\'s vengeance.', 164455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How uncouth for the... Queen of the Tree Elves, is it? No, I suppose that won\'t do... What exactly do you rule over these days?', '', 164454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance cowards flee! All lines push forward! For the Horde!', '', 164453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts report that the blood trolls in this area wield strange new weapons. The last thing we need is a war on two fronts.', '', 164452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You receive Iron & Wood.\nYou gain Bristling Power.', 'You receive Iron & Wood.', 164451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not see another sunrise, monster.', 164450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was getting bored sneaking around anyway...', 'I was getting bored sneaking around anyway...', 164449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to Zandalar, filthy $pr!', 'Go back to Zandalar, filthy $pr!', 164448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras is ours!', 'Kul Tiras is ours!', 164447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off of our continent, Horde scum!', 'Get off of our continent, Horde scum!', 164446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! how\'d you find me?', 'Hey! how\'d you find me?', 164445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 164444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Took you long enough to find me.', 'Took you long enough to find me.', 164443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have always known the Horde\'s magic is no match for ours. We will cut off any and all of their reinforcements.', '', 164442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is summoning reinforcements to this area. Find the ones responsible and shut them down. For the Alliance!', '', 164441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see... Very well, Queen Talanji. The Horde welcomes you.', 164440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am de queen of Zandalar. And a queen kneels to no one. Surely, you understand.', 164439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Equals?', 164438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So let it be official. De Zandalari and de Horde will stand together... as equals.', 164437, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand dat you have need of our forces. De Alliance will stop at nothing to destroy you.', 164436, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without our partnership, we may not have overcome de threats dat rose against us.', 164435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Horde has been a trustworthy ally to Zandalar.', 164434, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, it is beyond time we did.', 164433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will await de warchief upon my throne.', 164432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, dat is a real shame. Been wantin\' a warchief\'s spirit for a long time. But go on. Claim ya crown.', '', 164431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 126116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is. My freedom is not worth my honor.', 164430, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat ya final answer?', '', 164429, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 126115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lieutenant Maliyra succumbs to her wounds without divulging any information.', 164428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t go down that easy!', 164427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tell you... nothing!', 164426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die... for Teldrassil!', '', 164424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant Golras succumbs to his wounds without divulging any information.', '', 164423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell you nothing, Horde scum!', '', 164422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant Ivyth succumbs to his wounds without divulging any information.', '', 164421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Withering Thicket!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Withering Thicket!', 164420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die Horde scum!', '', 164419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what happened!', 'Tell me what happened!', 164417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No talking, only death!', '', 164416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take Blightcaller. The val\'kyr are mine.', 164415, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Wait for my signal before you attack.', 164414, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us strike as one.', '', 164413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! I am glad you are by our side.', 164412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, now that was a fight! Bet they didn\'t even see ye comin\', did they!? Hahaha!', '', 164411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth itself will swallow you whole.', '', 164410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slaying that target will demoralize the Horde\'s soldiers. Show them that defeat is inevitable.', 164409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted boneheads thought they could sneak right under our bearded noses. Get in there and stomp \'em flat!', '', 164408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have won... nothing.', '', 164407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold. More come.', 164406, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave him to rot. He does not deserve a clean death.', 164405, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve done it! We\'ll put that Azerite to good use!', '', 164404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni\'s beard, the Horde\'s been stockpilin\' a lot o\' Azerite! Let\'s smash \'em up and take it all!', '', 164403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find you there.', '', 164402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Operations restored.', '', 164400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Movement no longer impaired.', '', 164399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acquiring new target for arboreal annihilation.', '', 164398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resuming normal operations.', '', 164397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least I\'ve got one competent soldier! Those grunts could learn a thing or two from you.', 164396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I failed to protect my people, but I will avenge them.', 164395, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your tree... was just the beginning. This entire shore will fuel our armies!', '', 164394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please return to the witness chair, $gmister:miss; $n.', 164393, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. Lie in my court one more time, $n, and I\'ll hold you in contempt!', 164392, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boar\'s dung! A critical supply shipment was ambushed nearby. Get back those goods! Now!', 164391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lies! Your honor, you know for a fact that the witness is lying.', 164390, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witness is lying your honor. We were all there. We all saw that epic beatdown.', 164389, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Really? You don\'t remember anything? Fine, let\'s just move on.', 164388, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please remember that you ARE under oath, $n.', 164387, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we investigated that case together. Weren\'t you paying attention? Sigh...', 164386, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s strange, I thought that you did... moving on, then. Is it true that, in your discussions with Mister Buxdoggle, you learned about a potential motive?', 164385, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anu dorah, hero. You inspire us all.', 164381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. De Horde stood beside us when all seemed lost. I will not repay dem with betrayal.', 164380, 0, 0, 274, 64, 8000, 0, 126075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drive out this monster. Tor ilisar\'thera\'nal!', 164379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh... by de loa...', 164378, 0, 0, 16, 64, 5000, 0, 126074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me de head of de Horde\'s warchief, and I be forgettin\' all about ya father\'s bargain.', '', 164376, 0, 0, 273, 64, 10000, 126114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, since ya be so eager to get rid of me... I got a new deal for ya.', '', 164375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 10000, 126113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You saved countless Alliance lives today. We owe you a debt of gratitude.', 164374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Test me and be done with dis.', 164372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have, and I will. Thank you.', 164371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think on this, and go with my blessing.', '', 164370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what of the Horde?', '', 164369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari, surely... but what of your allies? The tortollans, the vulpera?', '', 164368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so I ask you: Who is your pack?', '', 164367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To defend our home, we loa banded together and stood as one.', '', 164366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My kind draw strength from the pack.', '', 164365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde has no intention of fighting an honorable war. Stop them here. Stop them now.', 164364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am listening, great one.', 164363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-tar! Glory and honor to the Horde!', '', 164362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was an amusing lesson. Now, take my blessing. Winds be at your back!', 164361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought with skill and honor. The enemy will be licking their wounds for some time.', '', 164360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like your spirit, little one.', 164359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the time to strike. Agrama-ka!', '', 164358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot fight de winds of change... but I will endure dem.', 164357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tree that stands rigid in the wind will snap its branches. Bend, my child.', 164356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we shatter our enemies. Fight with honor, hero!', '', 164355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah!', 164354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Having trouble?', 164353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can barely see... are you still with me, $n?', 164352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This storm stands between you and your crown. Ascend, Talanji!', 164351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I expected nothing less!', 164350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. The Alliance was sloppy and arrogant to send so few. Make them regret their mistake.', '', 164349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, huge one.', 164348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These supplies will benefit our soldiers greatly. We must win the long war.', '', 164347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve tracked the Horde\'s reinforcements to this area. Find their hideout and eliminate them.', '', 164346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Your actions speak truth. You have my blessing.', '', 164345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, $n. I will let no harm come to you!', 164344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Now they are weak. Defend them!', '', 164343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance\'s convoys are poorly guarded. They should be no match for you. Strike them down!', '', 164342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n!', 164341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that so? Prove it.', '', 164340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can strike a blow at the enemy supply lines here. Keep your focus on the target, soldier. Lok-narash!', '', 164339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All dat I have. My own life, if necessary.', 164338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can help with that, Captain. Hold on!', 164337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, Talanji... what would you give to protect those who are yours to defend?', '', 164336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya keep dis up, mon, and we be winnin\' dis war in no time.', '', 164335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We were taking too much fire, so I pulled my people back. But if they could get there quickly, we could lay into those ships with harpoons.', 164334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sent dem reelin\', mon. Taz\'dingo!', '', 164333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice goin\', mon. I be passin\' da good news to da warchief.', '', 164332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad to hear it! What\'s the status of the weapon emplacements on the battlements?', 164331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anu\'dora!', 164330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies be here, just as da warchief predicted. For da Horde, mon.', '', 164328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for mercy is over.', 164327, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, Lord Admiral! The Outriggers never back down from a good hunt.', 164326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain Madison! Shall we keep those ships busy while $p stops their sapper teams?', 164323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits be whisperin\' of some powerful voodoo nearby. Find it... and make sure da Alliance don\'t.', '', 164321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde need ya here, mon. Get in dere and make us proud.', '', 164318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a high ranking magister... we must have been betrayed from within! Defenders! Hold the line here! We must not let those monsters reach the Sunwell!', 'This is a high ranking magister... we must have been betrayed from within! Defenders! Hold the line here! We must not let those monsters reach the Sunwell!', 164312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every pack be needin\' its leader. Ya keep droppin\' Alliance officers all over Kul Tiras, and da whole Alliance be lost.', '', 164308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got \'em spooked now. We gonna keep hittin\' dem where it hurts, \'til dey got nothin\' left.', '', 164305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits be sayin\' a big shot from da Alliance be hidin\' somewhere in here. Show dem dat da Horde can reach dem, no matter where dey be.', '', 164304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Steel yourself, $n. De loa look upon us.', 164303, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I do know dat you must not intervene. You cannot help me here as you did with Samara.', 164301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hahaha! I love watching Alliance pups run away with their tails between their legs.', 164299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you hurt?', 164298, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be needin\' a quiet takedown, but we don\'t know da exact position of da target. Ya feelin\' sneaky, mon?', '', 164297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, you cannot see where de blame truly lies. For dat, you must die.', 164296, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 126034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... you are to blame for de unrest dat plagues de city!', 164295, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 126033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am de voice dat whispers while others roar. I am de spider in whose web you now writhe.', 164294, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me to introduce myself.', 164293, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 126031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is de meaning of dis?', 164292, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 126030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have much to do, but together we will prosper. I humbly ask--', 164291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, with me. Nathanos Blightcaller lurks nearby with two of the Banshee Queen\'s val\'kyr.', 164286, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maiev. Shandris. Prepare our forces for war.', 164285, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will kill them all.', 164284, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 122046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, we shall have justice. The Night Warrior lives... within me.', 164283, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune! Make me the instrument of your vengeance!', 164282, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ash rohk ilisar! Anu\'dorini ash\'ka!', 164280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul erath shul, Kul erath sin.', 164278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In\'a shul daElune!', 164277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With this offering, I demand to wear your darkest face.', 164276, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With ancient words, I invoke your most ruthless phase.', 164275, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, I will serve you only if you grant me justice!', 164274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I served you for millennia. But tonight, I do not come as a maiden, mother, or even priestess.', 164273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune! Your people loved you! Yet you watched, distant and aloof, as they died in torment!', 164272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None who have attempted the ritual since then have survived. Elune\'s raw power tears them apart.', 164271, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Legend says that long ago, Elune bestowed her fury upon our greatest warriors to secure Kalimdor.', 164270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zolani? What is wrong?', 164268, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 126014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maiev. What makes this ritual so dangerous?', 164267, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 122260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I am found wanting, my people will hear of de loa\'s decision from you.', 164266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will act as my witness.', 164265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Her spirit will be weighed and measured in de eyes of de loa.', 164264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
