('', 'Loa keep you, White Widow.', 164164, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 126039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am coming... Shadra...', 164163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, call your master. If I must die to expose de truth, den so be it!', 164162, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 126037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It need not end dis way, Samara. Do not make me send you to Bwonsamdi.', 164161, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 126035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat traitorous spider! Look out!', 164160, 0, 0, 29, 64, 0, 0, 126036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is a council of many firsts. You represent de hope of de Zandalari, and my wishes for de future.', 164159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 126027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Ashwood Depot!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Ashwood Depot!', 164158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Bitterstone Quarry!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Bitterstone Quarry!', 164157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $n!', 164150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 126004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vengeance is a powerful weapon.', 164149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your strength has grown, sister.', 164148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fourteen shhots... got \'em', 164147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'sh the one that shtole my ale.', 164146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ash\'al theradas!', 164145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got three... uh one... five of \'em!', 164144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She brought $p!', 'She brought $p!', 164143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Lady Jaina!', 'It\'s Lady Jaina!', 164142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re saved!', 'We\'re saved!', 164141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the Lord Admiral!', 'It\'s the Lord Admiral!', 164140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent a good deal of time with Princess Talanji and de Zandalari in Nazmir and beyond. I be hoping to seal de deal and bring them into de Horde, where we can best help one another.', '', 164139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. I will have our recruiters follow up with a few of those citizens. They show promise.', '', 164138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll die!', 164137, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 122251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need not stand alone. The local populace should be eager to help you fight off the Horde. Rally them to our cause.', '', 164136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is heavily damaged.', '', 164135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best we not keep da princess waiting. I be meetin\' you in Zuldazar.', '', 164134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 126096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bombs you planted earlier are still secure, but the clock is ticking. We need to push forward or we\'ll lose our advantage.', '', 164133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We shhould go ta da Octopus, have a pint and wait for thish to blow over ...hic!', '', 164132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, of course, are the exception.', 164131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine work, friend! If ye need a lift home, we can take my flying machine. Follow me!', '', 164130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have the advantage... for now. Press the attack and break the enemy\'s will before they recover!', '', 164129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today you\'ve shown the Alliance the fury of the Horde!', '', 164128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those Alliance cowards are fleeing like frightened talbuk. Pathetic. Lok-tar!', 164127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance is digging in its heels. Everyone forward! No rest or rations until they\'re driven out!', 164126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An impressive body count, and a fine demonstration of that equipment\'s potential.', '', 164124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work, champion. Horde threat neutralized.', '', 164123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glorious! This was certainly worth the trip from Highmountain! Isn\'t that right, Aviash? Ha!', '', 164122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance will think twice before launching their next air raid. The skies belong to the Horde!', '', 164121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! I\'d been hoping the Alliance would challenge us in the skies. Taking down that airship will be fun!', '', 164120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should rescue the prisoners aboard that airship before destroying it. But you can get a head start as you free them.', '', 164119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ain\'t supposed to fight the other crews here, but accidents happen, eh?', '', 164118, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The next century is foggy, as I wandered these woods, alone and afraid. All I remember is him saying that as long as my spirit is bound to my body, I can never know rest.', 164117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thinking that he would just banish me, I chose to hide in the woods. Instead... he tore my soul from my body, leaving just enough of a connection that I couldn\'t stray too far from it.', 164116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tul was furious. He decided to make an example of me. \"You can fight these invaders or you can hide in the woods forever. Which is it?\"', 164115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was alive when the mainlanders first landed on our shores. Gorak Tul was threatened by their presence and ordered raids against their villages. I wanted nothing to do with it. As a Thornspeaker, a guardian of the wilds, I knew that we could live in harmony if we tried.', 164114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand back.', 164113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blight it.', '', 164112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so hard to find good help these days.', '', 164111, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 121796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in testing out a new SI:7 device? I\'m sure you can find a few Horde test subjects nearby.', '', 164110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick. I have a forest to blight.', '', 164109, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 121795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry man. I have got your back. I ain\'t gonna let dem take our throne.', '', 164108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but you\'re just in time! The Banshee Queen has a keen interest in your heads, night elves.', '', 164107, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 121794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are too late.', 164106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi! Help me!', '', 164105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was once a place of joy and laughter. Now... only silence and death remain.', 164104, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 122247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way. I was stationed here many moons ago.', 164103, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 122246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They tried to stop her.', 164102, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What happened to them?', 164101, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 122245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...As you command.', 164100, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sira, you scout the shoreline while the rest of us head inland. We will find Tyrande and meet you at Lor\'danel.', 164099, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must not lose faith in the goddess. That is just what the Horde wants.', 164098, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all Akunda.', 'We are all Akunda.', 164097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know that you did help to stop those paltry invasions -- and by that, we have now opened the door for something bigger from Nazjatar.', 164096, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And yet, for you, I have something you never would have known to ask... A gift that you so richly deserve, my champion.', 164095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The universe opens before me. You may want to pray that our paths don\'t cross again.', 164094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the moment we met, I recognized your potential. As did he.', 164093, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga on your shores are of no concern. Not when you stand on the threshold of true greatness.', 164092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new Horde threat calls for new ordnance. See how this fares out in the field.', '', 164091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your timing could be better. Take what you will, there is much to be done.', 164089, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, you must... Stop!', 164088, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune... was she watching over us as Teldrassil burned?', 164087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, my champion. The offerings have been made... and accepted.', 164086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Place the relics here, in this sacred place. We will draw upon their power.', 164085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you are. Preparations have been made. Shall we?', 164084, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 124746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She is the incarnation of Elune\'s wrath. Even witnessing the ritual to become her would put our lives at risk.', 164083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ritual do you speak of, Maiev? Who is the Night Warrior?', 164082, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not leave Tyrande on her own behind enemy lines. Move!', 164081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, with me. There is little time.', 164080, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And the only life Tyrande wishes to risk is her own. Elune watch over her.', 164079, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And the only life Tyrande wishes to risk is her own.', 164078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! That\'ll teach \'em. We won\'t have any of their ugly ships cloggin\' up our skies. No way!', '', 164075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone\'s safe and sound. I knew ye were the one fer the job.', '', 164074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torcali is in de grass. De bounties dat heap our tables. De strength of our spears. She is de great shaper. Where she walks, great valleys are born. Where she drags her horns, rivers run.\n\nJo\'nok\'s loa does not have a temple. Zandalar is her place of worship. If you want to meet her, look for de mountain that moves.\n\nJo\'nok is her champion.', '', 164070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Horde invaders think they can bring an airship intae our skies?! That\'s an insult to all gryphon riders. Show \'em who owns the air.', '', 164069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s kidnappin\' our people! Get up to that airship an\' bring \'em back home.', '', 164068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Torcali?', 'Who is Torcali?', 164067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, let\'s go! Goodbye, mook!', 164066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hek hek hek hek! Dose richmon never see it comin\'. Let\'s go bring ya shinies to da shrine.', '', 164065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Check dis out. I got dis mook to bring me to all de loa shrines to steal some shinies for you!', 164064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hey Jani! I didn\'t think you\'d be here so soon!', 164063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azala! What ya be doin\'?', '', 164062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for taking me all around Zandalar. I guess you better get going...', 164061, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think it\'s gonna be pretty hard to decide on a loa for myself. I\'m gonna need to do a lot of considering!', 164060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere are so many different loa! How does anybody choose one to follow?', 164059, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fair exchange. Shadows guide you, my dear friend.', 164058, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 124761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry. Bring it here.', 164057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! The Tempest Caller sits upon his... little pet.', 164056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone! Through the portal! Hurry!', 164055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n. Please escort this nuisance out of our terrace.', '', 164054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How fare you?\n\nWhen we capture Bashal\'Aran, I shall magically summon those who remained behind.', 164053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Work together! You and $p can do this, Taelia!', 164052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here comes a nasty one! We\'ll take it down!', 164051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold them off just a little while longer!', 164050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Admiral! It looks like the Horde is sending in their worst!', 164049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande\'s ship was last seen near the Zoram Strand. We will start there.', 164048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These abominations will be pushed back!', 164047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mending tide heals all.', 164046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reinforcements are coming.', 164045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trust our brethren to force them back.', 164044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must hold this gate!', 164043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... it can\'t end like this!', 164042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close, the power of the sea shall cleanse your wounds!', 164041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humph. I should get back to my post.', 'Humph. I should get back to my post.', 164040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a stench! Who did this?', 'What a stench! Who did this?', 164039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', 'What was that?', 164038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... all right. $n, head to Old Ironforge. I\'m sure we can find something left over from Magni\'s ritual. I just hope this works...', '', 164037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120511, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, I will require a remnant of the previous ritual if I am to conduct one for you.', '', 164036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not. Azeroth has already called her speaker. Your friend\'s stoneform will only be temporary.', '', 164035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni?! No no no, I wouldna wish that on anyone, no matter what\'s at stake!', '', 164034, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 120510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. There is a ritual that can accomplish what you seek. Your king has performed it in the past.', '', 164033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friend here has tae stay in stoneform fer a long stretch o\' time in order to withstand an intense amount of heat.', '', 164032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120474, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s time we finish this.', 164031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bouldercrag! Glad you could come. We need yer help.', '', 164030, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 120509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware falling on the wrong side of a loa, Azala.', 164029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But be careful when you are dealing with powerful artifacts. Dishonesty under my gaze is not taken lightly.', 164028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Young Zandalari, you may be used to getting away with whatever you please, as you skulk through the streets of your home.', 164027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have I not taught you to keep a steady hand, my follower? To not launch yourself headfirst into violence?', 164026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss! You must conserve your strength. I can handle this pilferer!', '', 164025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vorrik, do not scare the child.', 164024, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That keystone is a powerful artifact, and it is important to my people. You shall not lay a hand on it.', '', 164023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh! I wasn\'t going to take it, I swear!', 164022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Doral ana\'diel?\n\nWhen we capture Bashal\'Aran, I shall magically summon those who remained behind.', 164021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible!', 164020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You really think I\'ve been running, captain?', 164019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye, furnace master.', '', 164018, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They don\'t eat alpacas here, right?', 164017, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 142439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it is decided. From this day forth, the vulpera of Vol\'dun are allies of the Horde!', '', 164016, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be our honor, High Chieftain.', '', 164015, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Even still, you worked to lessen the strain, without being asked.', '', 164014, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Burdened by the troubles facing our new allies, I turned you away.', '', 164013, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] For a moment I forgot this.', '', 164012, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is the true spirit of the Horde. If you still desire to join us, you would be most welcome within our ranks.', '', 164011, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though I turned you away, you selflessly came to our aid. Just as you did in Vol\'dun.', '', 164010, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde endures because we band together in times of adversity.', '', 164009, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kiro. I must apologize for so hastily dismissing you earlier.', '', 164008, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanatoa clicks in rage and casts a dark spell at Xal\'atath.', '', 164007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanatoa points at his diminutive friend and makes an abrupt gesture.', '', 164006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Child! Get away from the keystone!', '', 164005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you give me a boost? I just want to touch it...', 164004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, look at dat!', 164003, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Talanji asked to speak with you.', 'Queen Talanji asked to speak with you.', 164002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These trolls certainly know how to celebrate a new leader.', 164001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exquisite! I couldn\'t have done better myself.', '', 164000, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vintner Iltheux sticks his nose into the glass and inhales deeply.', '', 163999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a fragrant bouquet!', '', 163998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vintner Iltheux sips the wine.', '', 163997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] It has legs. Impressive.', '', 163996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vintner Iltheux swirls the liquid within the glass.', '', 163995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. A decent color. And it has legs.', '', 163994, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vintner Iltheux holds the glass up to the light and swirls it around.', '', 163993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Vintner Iltheux the sample of Nomi\'s Wine.>', '<Give Vintner Iltheux the sample of Nomi\'s Wine.>', 163992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Placeholder RTC: Talanji addresses her people.>', '<Placeholder RTC: Talanji addresses her people.>', 163991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.', 'Yes.', 163990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I lured you into open waters. Because out here, you have no hope of escape.', 163989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De loa have given me their blessing. My advisors welcomed me. De leaders of our faith have all knelt before me. My people have many voices, but on de whole they have accepted my rule.\n\nOnce I step foot on that dais, I become Queen Talanji. It is what my father prepared me for. It is what I have spent my whole life growing toward.\n\nI am ready. Are you?', 163988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 163987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, your skin is stone. Azeroth has granted you strength. You are ready.', '', 163986, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourself for battle. We will not leave Darkshore without Tyrande.', 163985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual will kill her! We depart for Darkshore immediately.', 163984, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She intends to invoke the ancient rites...', 163983, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Night Warrior.', 163982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That tome... could it be?', 163981, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 122460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dori\'thur will accompany you. We are not alone out here.', 163980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! Horde vessels on de horizon! You have nowhere left to run, ice witch!', 163979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I listen to the mountain\'s reply.', '', 163978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are one. I am of it and it of me.', '', 163977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within me is the earth itself.', '', 163976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quench the metal in the water.', '', 163975, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 120824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike the metal to shape it!', '', 163974, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 120823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the forge!', '', 163973, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 120822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take hold of it! Your skin will not succumb to the flame.', '', 163972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever ya need, we got it.', 163971, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it be forged!', '', 163970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN! Burn with the fire of the makers!', '', 163969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarf, bring me the metal!', '', 163968, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120517, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That gluttonous fool! Take what is ours, $n.', 163967, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way. I doubt Toatana will give us the crown willingly.', 163966, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 124740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rest of you stand guard. We move no further until we search the area.', 163965, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has felt the wrath of the Alliance! They will fear us now. They will fear you.', '', 163964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tide rises!', 163963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can help you. You need to turn back the naga who invade your shores. I know a way.', 163962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She must have destroyed it so she would not be followed.', 163961, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s minions think they can attack us here? Hmph, the fools. Eradicate them!', '', 163960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande\'s ship. Or at least what is left of it.', 163959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you know so much about me, captain, then you would have been wise to run while you still had the chance.', 163957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their army is shattered! This is the hour of the Alliance\'s vengeance!', '', 163956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must deal with the Horde\'s presence at once. Eliminate this threat with all due haste!', '', 163955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An assertive victory, and a decisive blow against the Horde.', '', 163954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance banners will fly proudly over this land.', '', 163953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chilled to the bone!', 163952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to testify. Let\'s go to court.', 'I am ready to testify. Let\'s go to court.', 163951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been keeping yourself out of trouble, $n? You haven\'t broken any laws, have you?', '', 163950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All weapons, open fire!', 163949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cannons, fire!', 163948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for vengeance. Overwhelm the Horde and take no prisoners!', '', 163947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be washed away!', 163946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tide moves against you!', 163945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break their lines! Send them crawling back to their warchief.', '', 163944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our commander has given the signal.\n\nGo! Fly, fly! For Darkshore, and the Alliance!', '', 163943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 679, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Our hippogryph riders survey the terrain as we speak.\n\nUpon our commander\'s signal, you will fly ashore and join them.', '', 163942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 113, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be prepared for anything.', 163941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me hammer is ready fer \'em!', '', 163939, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got boarders, be ready!', '', 163938, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They gonna regret boarding my ship!', '', 163937, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got one!', 163936, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These weapons will give us the advantage in Nazmir!', 163935, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We shall hold the line until the very end. Selama ashal\'anore.', 163934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liadrin, guard the entrance! Let none pass!', '', 163933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAHAHA! Those Alliance goons will never learn! Who\'s a good golden golem? You are!', '', 163932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must put this misery behind us. We are no longer high elves! In honor of the blood that was shed and the sacrifices of our loved ones... as of this day, we are sin\'dorei!', '', 163931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh thank GOODNESS! Don\'t you worry, my precious baby boy. I\'m gonna take good care of you.', '', 163930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... MONSTERS! How could you destroy something so glorious?! It\'s true what Sylvanas says... you Alliance goons ain\'t got no souls!', '', 163929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let that be a lesson to ya!', '', 163928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serves ya right!', '', 163927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you DOING?! Don\'t hurt it!', '', 163926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, howsabout we make an arrangement? Leave this guy to me and be on your merry way. I don\'t say anything to your king, and you don\'t say a word to my warchief. Deal?', '', 163925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soul of our people, now a desecrated font of decay. It worsens with each sunrise.', '', 163924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sunwell... What has he done?', 163923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, with me! Protect the magisters at all costs! We must reach the Sunwell!', '', 163922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut down enough undead for us to pass and leave the rest for the trolls. That will buy us the time we need.', '', 163921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sound of cannons... The Amani have landed on the shore. We must hurry!', 163920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come! May the light of the sun guide us to the very end!', '', 163919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s all just relax and take a look at this thing! The gold... the gems. It\'s... it\'s... BEAUTIFUL! I\'m tearin\' up over here!', '', 163918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, arise, Kel\'thuzad, and serve the Lich King in death.', '', 163917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death itself has come to claim the high home of the elves!', '', 163916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens of Quel\'Thalas! I have given you ample opportunities to surrender, but you have stubbornly refused! Know that today, your entire race and your ancient heritage will end!', '', 163915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have built ourselves a Fortress. Gather as many forces as you can! I want Malfurion\'s head on a pike!', '', 163914, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the workshop is up and running, we can build the catapults we need to set those trees ablaze.', '', 163913, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Great Hall has been upgraded to a Stronghold. Now we can begin building a workshop.', '', 163912, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Barracks have been built. I suggest you conscript additional soldiers to fill them.', '', 163911, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Altar of Storms is ready. Claim its power as your own or use it to take the form of a fierce ally.', '', 163910, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have finished constructing the Armory. Supplied with the proper resources, it can improve our armaments.', '', 163909, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holding Ashwood Depot will allow us to cross the battlefield with haste and rain death upon our foes.', '', 163908, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ruins of Lornesta now belong to us. Strip the area of its iron to reinforce the Horde war machine.', '', 163907, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have taken Cinderfall Grove. Extract its lumber for the Horde\'s war effort.', '', 163906, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gloomtide Strand belongs to us! Our apothecary can now train alchemists and construct monstrosities that will terrorize the Alliance!', '', 163905, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forlorn Crossing is ours. Controlling it will keep Bashal\'Aran well defended.', '', 163904, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing\'s the same anymore.', 'Nothing\'s the same anymore.', 163903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120635, 120636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde lays claim to Bitterstone Quarry. We will improve our arsenal using the iron we mine from its depths.', '', 163902, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withering Thicket is in our grasp. We will conquer Darkshore using the wood from its own forests.', '', 163901, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back! The warchief will not be pleased when she learns of this failure.', '', 163900, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows draw near.', 'The shadows draw near.', 163899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120633, 120634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkshore has been retaken by the Horde... as it should be!', '', 163898, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your way to the islet and finish this. For the Dark Lady!', '', 163897, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all slaves to this torment.', 'We are all slaves to this torment.', 163896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120631, 120632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you, elf. Nature has already lost.', '', 163895, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak. Or go.', 'Speak. Or go.', 163894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120629, 120630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fury of nature rises against you. Attack!', '', 163893, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our resolve is greater than you can imagine. You may destroy our home, but you will never destroy our hope.', '', 163892, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were you saying about stopping us? Here we are, strolling along your shoreline, with a lovely view of your world tree. Well... such as it is.', '', 163891, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware, beware... of me.', 163890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All things must end.', 'All things must end.', 163889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120627, 120628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'danel is under our control. Defend those catapults!', '', 163888, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Night Warrior and the forces of the Alliance will vanquish your despicable Horde, Blightcaller!', '', 163887, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear your precious Tyrande has learned a few new tricks. Her pointless rituals cannot prevent us from reclaiming Darkshore.', '', 163886, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope burns away to ashes.', 'Hope burns away to ashes.', 163885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120625, 120626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a watery grave for you!', 163884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not for long.', '', 163883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak ill of my queen again and I will clip your ridiculous wings myself!', '', 163882, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least I have a soul, you despicable monster.', '', 163881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have already lost a val\'kyr, Blightcaller. Is the banshee too blind to see that she\'s lost Darkshore as well?', '', 163880, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Horde will be broken!', 163879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have been formidable once. But I sense your soul fading, your life force flickering weakly--a flame I will gladly extinguish.', '', 163878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is only death and pain.', 'There is only death and pain.', 163877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120623, 120624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have secured the ruins at Bashal\'Aran. From here, we will build our fortifications and seize everything we need to reclaim Darkshore.', '', 163876, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get to Bashal\'Aran. Cut down anything in your path.', '', 163875, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe in nothing.', 'Believe in nothing.', 163874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120621, 120622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Invincible!', '', 163873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How rich! The feathered elf thinks he can stop us.', '', 163872, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'alah belore! You will burn for your actions!', '', 163871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I watch. I listen.', 'I watch. I listen.', 163870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120671, 120672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is far enough, Prince Arthas. Your march ends here!', '', 163869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auberdine has been retaken. Now press on and gather resources for our assault!', '', 163868, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find these lands more dangerous than when you last defiled them, Horde scum.', '', 163867, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness the end: the removal of the final barrier.', '', 163866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will establish a foothold here while you scout ahead to see what we\'re up against.', '', 163865, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take out those glaive throwers!', '', 163864, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 163863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By all means, take your time. I\'m sure the Alliance will wait.', '', 163862, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Kul Tiras!', 163861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you don\'t mind the cold!', 163860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this unnatural night is good for anything, it at least allows us to strike from the shadows.', '', 163859, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Horde, ready yourselves. Today we oust the Alliance from Darkshore and take it back in the name of the Banshee Queen!', '', 163858, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122140, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too kind. We both know the truth though.', '', 163857, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve the Banshee Queen.', 'I serve the Banshee Queen.', 163856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120669, 120670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do what is asked, but does this mean I\'ll have to get my feet wet?', '', 163855, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will freeze you where you stand!', 163854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arrows strike true.', 'My arrows strike true.', 163853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120667, 120668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you seek?', 'What do you seek?', 163852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120665, 120666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay sharp. Stay ready.', 'Stay sharp. Stay ready.', 163851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120663, 120664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarr! I\'ll join the crew!', 'Yarr! I\'ll join the crew!', 163850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounds wonderful! I do love working with food and drink.', '', 163849, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got a hand to spare and a pocket to fill, $p?\n\nThe Fogsail Freebooters be recruitin fer one day only!\n\nJoin the crew and help us pillage the Ashvane Foundry up the hill. Plenty of Alliance and stuck-up Proudmoore to kick in the teeth!', '', 163848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The queen\'s enemies will fall.', 'The queen\'s enemies will fall.', 163847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120661, 120662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, death claims us all.', 'In the end, death claims us all.', 163846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120659, 120660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pillage for one, pillage for all.\nAlways pillage for yourself first,\nAnd don\'t forget the alcohol!\n\nHa ha ha!', '', 163845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Dark Lady.', 'For the Dark Lady.', 163844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120657, 120658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are now blessed with a Tree of Eternity. Gather as many soldiers as you can and bring Blightcaller to justice!', '', 163843, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to the Glaiveworks, we can now construct glaive throwers to pierce through the machinery defending Lor\'danel.', '', 163842, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tree of Life has grown into a Tree of Ages. We can now begin construction of the Glaiveworks.', '', 163841, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient of War has awakened. Speak with Jarod if you wish to call new troops to Bashal\'Aran.', '', 163840, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have completed the Altar of Elders. Imbue yourself with its magic or use it to take the form of a powerful ally.', '', 163839, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hunter\'s Hall has opened its doors. With enough resources, it can provide our troops with improved armaments.', '', 163838, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashwood Depot is ours. We can now soar across Darkshore and call upon chimaera to join the battle.', '', 163837, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vast stores of iron lie hidden under the Ruins of Lornesta. The time has come for us to use them.', '', 163836, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have reclaimed Cinderfall Grove. Our forces will benefit from the wood it offers.', '', 163835, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Gloomtide Strand in our hands, my fellow druids can join our army. We can also call upon another archdruid to aid us.', '', 163834, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as we hold Forlorn Crossing, we can defend Bashal\'Aran.', '', 163833, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. We have laid claim to Bitterstone Quarry and the iron within its mine.', '', 163832, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withering Thicket has been liberated from the Horde. Its wood will prove vital to our efforts.', '', 163831, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull back! We are outmatched. Regroup, so that we may return in greater strength.', '', 163830, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought. We have defeated a terrible opponent this day, and Darkshore once again belongs to the kaldorei.', '', 163829, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gunships are routed! Hurry, take a hippogryph to the Dredge and end this once and for all.', '', 163828, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no end to your depravity? We will not be deterred, not even by cruelty such as yours!', '', 163827, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve arranged a little reunion for you. Dark rangers, attack!', '', 163826, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As if those primitive glaives could intimidate me. Fools.', '', 163825, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces will soon overwhelm you, Blightcaller. There is nowhere to run this time!', '', 163824, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have secured the shore at Lor\'danel. Defend our glaive throwers as they dispatch those goblin ships!', '', 163823, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold words... for someone who abandoned the world to take a ten-thousand-year nap.', '', 163822, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here to do the Banshee Queen\'s dirty work, Blightcaller? Is there yet more beauty in the world that you wish to destroy?', '', 163821, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing is mightier than nature itself, Blightcaller. You will learn that lesson soon enough.', '', 163820, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really think that you and a few savage druids can stand against the might of the Horde?', '', 163819, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have retaken Bashal\'Aran. From here, we will fortify our position and strengthen our forces for the march to Lor\'danel.', '', 163818, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I named Sylvanas as Warchief, I knew I was takin\' a big risk. Da loa have mighty voices, voices dat never steered me wrong before. Dat is what made me a shadow hunter after all. \n\nBut the day I died, da voices spoke loudly, together, as if it were many loa at once. I remember dem bein\' so loud at the time. Now I cannot remember who da voices belonged to.', '', 163817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To stand a chance against the Horde, we must secure a foothold at Bashal\'Aran. Quickly now!', '', 163816, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blightcaller is here. Good. We will make sure that he pays for what his Banshee Queen has done.', '', 163815, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No ragtag band of elves is going to retake these lands!', '', 163813, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 122099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auberdine is ours once again. Quickly, push forward and secure any resources you can find.', '', 163811, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While we establish a foothold in Auberdine, you will scout ahead to Bashal\'Aran.', '', 163809, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hurry.', '', 163808, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste.', '', 163807, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy those catapults!', '', 163806, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroy those glaive throwers!', 163805, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions of the Alliance! Darkshore yet lies in the clutches of the foul Horde. Today, we will reclaim it!', '', 163804, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 121618, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many turned out for me funeral. So many died to da Burning Legion.\n\nCome, hero. Let us be lookin\' to see what we can find. Let me know when ya be ready. I gonna bring ya with me on a walk through da shadows.', '', 163802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On second thought...', 'On second thought...', 163798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sea answers my call!', 163796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s really great to see you, $p.', 163793, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deck is rigged to explode!', '', 163792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, sure. I can have Kazit make the wine, and long as you don\'t expect me to drink it.', 163791, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got it! I\'ll send Kazit out to find whatever ingredients ya need.', 163790, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombs are in place!', '', 163789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charges set!', '', 163788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe that the Bronzebeard brothers bear a striking resemblance to him: his leadership, his command of battle, and his inquisitiveness.', '', 163787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me don\'t steal scenes on purpose, mon. Da loa jus\' made me dat way!', '', 163786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really am, aren\'t I? Tellin\' this one what to do \'aint as easy as it looks!', 163785, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da otha trolls say I become somethin\' called a... \"me-me\". Can anybody tell me what dat means?!', '', 163784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ello mon. Ya bring da Glaive of Vol\'jin? Without Talanji here I gonna be needin\' it to reach him.', '', 163783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey are sunk! Nothing left but ash and splinters!', 163782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me bring da lightnin\' AND da thundah!', '', 163777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He earned renown for his abilities in combat, but he was also known as a great scholar. His study is just below us.', '', 163772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long time I have spent speaking to da spirits and da loa. Many a lost spirit I have brought to Bwonsamdi for tending.\n\nYet as strong as I be, it took da strength of Talanji to find Vol\'jin. \n\nDere be dark powers at play here. Powers dat be hidin\' something from us.', '', 163767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bronzebeards were a small clan back then. It was thanks to Aegrim that the Bronzebeard name began to flourish and command respect.', '', 163765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ayyy mon!', '', 163764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood. I will do whatever is needed.', '', 163762, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be honored ta serve.', '', 163759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey belong to de sharks now!', 163757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to helping in any way I can.', '', 163756, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too kind, $p.', '', 163755, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fine shot! Their vessel is bound for de deep!', 163754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! Hope de Kul Tirans can swim better than dey sail!', 163753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing a great job.', 'You\'re doing a great job.', 163752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be creating the recipe.', 'You should be creating the recipe.', 163751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be obtaining ingredients.', 'You should be obtaining ingredients.', 163750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be stomping fruit.', 'You should be stomping fruit.', 163749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, my friend.', '', 163748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gathering ingredients for the wine, but it\'s a tiring job. I think I\'ll just take another quick break...', '', 163747, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again.', '', 163746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Iltheux tells me to jump in the vat, so I tell Kazit to jump in the vat. Easiest job ever.', 163745, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the earth guide you.', '', 163744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', '', 163743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at Kazit, workin\' so hard. \n\nHe\'ll get the hang of it eventually.', 163742, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came in search of something.', '', 163741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iltheux has put me in charge of the vintage. I decide what goes in the wine to make it palatable for the Horde.', '', 163740, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you tasked with?', 'What are you tasked with?', 163739, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $p. \n\nI\'ve never made wine before, but it can\'t be too difficult, can it?', '', 163738, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the sands you\'re here. There\'s nothing quite right about this at all!', 163734, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Talanji scowls.>\n\nBwonsamdi stands where Rezan would have. De NERVE of dis mon, I swear on my father--\n\n<Talanji takes a deep breath.>\n\nCome. Let us finish this.', 163733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gonk be a familiar sight. Loti has told me he is a kind loa, gentle in his teachings and humble for one of his kind. Let us see what he has in store for me.', 163732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pa\'ku is a tempestuous loa. I expect her to test me with de wrath of a storm.\n\nAre you ready to brave such a thing, $n?', 163731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I confess, I know little enough of de mighty Krag\'wa. I only know that he is strong, and will viciously defend his kin from harm. It could be that either of us may need to fight.', 163730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 163727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I be of assistance?', '', 163726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for your crimes! All hands, attack!', 163725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have heard of you, Jaina Proudmoore. De little girl who betrayed her father and lost her brother to war. Failure is your family legacy.', 163724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider this your only warning. Turn your vessel back to port and look after your dead... or you will soon join them.', 163723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth calls.', '', 163722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey are reducing our hull to splinters! If you were waiting for a dramatic moment to turn de tide, de moment is NOW!', 163712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('90 seconds until the Battle for Darkshore begins.', '', 163710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are taking on water! If you do not handle dese Kul Tirans, we will be swimming home!', 163709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are taking fire! Remove dese Kul Tirans from my waters. Now!', 163708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Master $p. I was just resting my eyes for a moment. How can I help you?', '', 163706, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No Horde walks on this deck and lives!', '', 163702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every man fights!', '', 163701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time to take back these shores! For the Alliance!', '', 163700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A CURSE?! No wonder nobody\'s ever come back with dis treasure! Let\'s get out of here!', 163699, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, $n. Open dat treasure chest for me! I want to see what\'s inside!', 163697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll add these Horde to our collection of prisoners!', '', 163695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With dis many shinies, I could be a richmon! I could be whatever I want!', 163694, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready yourselves. Our riders approach.', '', 163693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts are surveying the lands under the cover of night. On their signal, we will begin our effort to reclaim these shores.', '', 163692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemy vessel off our port side! Give dem a taste of our cannons!', 163691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re trying to rescue the prisoners!', '', 163690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repel boarders!', '', 163689, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tiran colors off our port side!', 163688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tirans on de starboard side!', 163687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemy vessel off de starboard side! Man de guns!', 163686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can me help?', '', 163685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor da spirits of da past.', '', 163684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never give up!', '', 163683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we be strong.', '', 163682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde be our family.', '', 163681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you ever seen so many shinies in one place, $n? Zuldazar may have a lot of gold... but nothing you can just pick up!', 163680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All hands on deck! Time to make de daughter of de sea pay for trespassing in our waters!', 163679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Darkshore has begun!', '', 163678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('30 seconds until the Battle for Darkshore begins.', '', 163677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1 minute until the Battle for Darkshore begins.', '', 163676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three!', 'Three!', 163675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two!', 'Two!', 163674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One!', 'One!', 163673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, $n! Into the chests!', '', 163672, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope ya fare better in death den ya did in life!', '', 163671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya know yet, mon? Dere be no hidin\' from Bwonsamdi!', '', 163670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, if ya so eager for death, ya shoulda come see me sooner!', '', 163669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya died as ya lived... forgettable.', '', 163668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya for deliverin\' a new champion to me service!', '', 163667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sooner or later... everybody serves me!', '', 163666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm will take you!', '', 163664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can withstand the tempest!', '', 163663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your bones will rain from the sky!', 163662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have invoked my wrath!', 163661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot run!', '', 163660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape!', '', 163659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes are upon you.', '', 163658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you were wise, you would run.', '', 163657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rage is upon you!', '', 163656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you like flies!', '', 163655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should look before I leap!', '', 163654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The workshop is now operational. Begin building catapults so that we can clear a path to Lor\'danel.', 163653, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Stronghold has become a Fortress. Rally our forces and prepare to storm the islet!', 163652, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Great Hall is now a Stronghold. We can start building a workshop without delay.', 163651, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Barracks are fully constructed. Make use of them to recruit additional forces.', 163650, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Armory is ready for use. Provide it with the resources it needs to improve our weapons and armor.', 163649, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have finished building the Altar of Storms. Absorb its power yourself, or use it to take the shape of a formidable ally.', 163648, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forlorn Crossing is secured. Hold the crossroads and maintain our grasp on Bashal\'Aran!', 163647, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell your fear.', '', 163646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With Ashwood Depot under our control, we can swiftly navigate the battlefield and call down aid from the skies.', 163645, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. The magic of Gloomtide Strand will allow our apothecary to train alchemists and create a monster to fight beside us.', 163644, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have laid claim to the Ruins of Lornesta. The iron from its mine will prove useful.', 163643, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bitterstone Quarry belongs to us now! Extract its iron so we can better equip our warriors.', 163642, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cinderfall Grove is ours. We will use the wood from its lumber mill to fortify our position.', 163641, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have seized the lumber mill at Withering Thicket. Harvest its wood to reinforce our garrisons.', 163640, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall back and regroup. When next we return, death will claim both Darkshore and the Alliance.', 163639, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory is ours! Darkshore belongs to us once more, and the Alliance will never take it back.', 163638, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare to attack. Maiev awaits us.', 163637, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not fear death! We are its harbingers!', 163636, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break your bones!', '', 163635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, Horde filth! Ash\'al theradas!', 163634, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not frighten me, Sira. Nor do the forces of death you now serve!', 163633, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was not my doing, Sonji. But I am grateful that the threat has been dealt with.', '', 163632, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 142468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for dealing with dis matter swiftly. De Zandalari are fortunate to have such dependable allies.', 163631, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkshore belongs to us, Maiev. We are coming for you.', 163630, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spill your blood!', '', 163629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rend your flesh!', '', 163628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do, Commander. But I cannot take credit for this fortunate turn of events.', '', 163627, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 142467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can... dis be...', '', 163626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have stayed out of de jungle.', '', 163625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work has resumed, High Chieftain. I\'m pleased to see the Horde takes these issues seriously.', '', 163624, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools are de first to die!', '', 163623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only de strong survive!', '', 163622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel my claws!', '', 163621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunt begins!', '', 163620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds are mine to command!', 163619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the storm!', '', 163618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blight it all, from here to the shoreline.', '', 163617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MY SWEET RIDE!', 163616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll never forget ya, Drill Kill!', 163615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Purified by lightning!', 163614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have taken Lor\'danel. The water is all that lies between us and Maiev.', 163613, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I JUST paid it off!', 163612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I call de thunder!', 163611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be washed away!', 163610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is true I have made mistakes, Sira... but there is no justice in this!', 163609, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis... island... is... incredible!', 163608, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ends here, Maiev. You will know how it feels when your allies fail you.', 163607, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave nothing alive.', '', 163606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is you who abandoned us, Maiev! You burdened me with everything in your absence!', 163605, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De storm... calls...', 163604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a Warden no longer, Sira! You have abandoned everything we stand for!', 163603, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clarity comes after de storm.', 163602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo... to be sittin\' on so much raw POWAH!', 163601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bashal\'Aran is under our control. Scour the region for more resources and lay waste to any obstacles between here and Lor\'danel.', 163600, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got some big brass bombs for ya!', 163599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Purged by de storm!', 163598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time ta get DRILLED!', 163597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DRRRILLL KILLL!!!', 163596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deploy the Blight!', '', 163595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Press forward to Bashal\'Aran. From there, we will lay waste to the Alliance!', 163594, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maiev. She is a fool to think she can stop us.', 163593, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can\'t stand the heat, then... you probably burned the dish. Trust me, I would know!', '', 163592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to kiss the cook? An unusual tradition, but... I would be willing to oblige.', '', 163591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Persistent, aren\'t you? Must have worked up quite an appetite!', '', 163590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good food makes a good mood.', '', 163589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sira... No... Turn back now, or I will be forced to strike you down!', 163588, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always use fresh ingredients.', '', 163587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to eat!', '', 163586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life is more pleasant on a full stomach!', '', 163585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still have a lot to learn.', '', 163584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone hungry?', '', 163583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have retaken Auberdine. But do not rest on your laurels. Move forward and seize whatever resources you can find.', 163582, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been working on some new recipes.', '', 163581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get cooking!', '', 163580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces will capture Auberdine while you scout ahead to Bashal\'Aran.', 163579, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Variety is the spice of life.', '', 163578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, my friend!', '', 163577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me.', 163576, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get ready.', 163575, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Champions! We shall rip Darkshore from the hands of the Alliance! Ready your blades!', 163574, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122504, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mind has been cleansed!', 163572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot oppose Akunda\'s power!', 163571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bold undertaking. In gratitude for your assistance, I offer you my own. When the time comes, I will light the flame.', '', 163570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Great Forge can no longer produce the heat required to smelt the metal... not without your help.', '', 163569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignis! We\'re in need of yer aid. My friend and I are tryin\' tae reforge a suit of ancient dwarven armor.', '', 163568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back into the forge with you!', '', 163567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, small one. The forge is once again under my control.', '', 163566, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pester all you want... but know that my glaive is sharper than EVER!', 163565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death will claim them all.', 163564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now my true hunt begins.', 163563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was a fool to believe.', 163562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune\'s promises were empty lies.', 163561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No words. Only pain.', 163560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies will suffer.', 163559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last I see the true path.', 163558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not test my patience.', 163557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one\'s mine! Taste my blades, tidebreaker!', 163556, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before I rest, I will ask you, $n: who do YOU think killed our quartermaster?', 163555, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All three defendants charged with murder of quartermaster, Paul North!', 163554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This contraption is all wood.   Find the fuel and we\'ll light it up!', '', 163553, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time someone showed up!', '', 163552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere is no escape for you!', 163551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look right at home crawling on your bellies!', 163550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De shape of vermin suits you!', 163549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My hunt... has ended...', 163548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your hope... will fail you...', 163547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help put an end to this. Our people have suffered enough.', '', 163546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess workin\' for Gallywix is a little better than being captured by these guys. A little.', 'Guess workin\' for Gallywix is a little better than being captured by these guys. A little.', 163545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, guess I better go fix Gallywix\'s stuff.', 'Well, guess I better go fix Gallywix\'s stuff.', 163544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this what is to become of us? Slaves in our own lands?', 163543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another successful hunt.', 163542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your death strengthens de pack!', 163541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These shards are all that remain.', '', 163540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reforging an historic piece of armor like this will be no easy task. But with Grumnus\'s guidance, it might just be possible.', '', 163539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legend has it that when a mountain king\'s armor is forged, it binds tae the dwarf fer whom it was made.', '', 163538, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh meat!', 163537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More prey for de pack!', 163536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 120569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! Well, as free as Gallywix\'s personal insurance mechanic can get.', 'I\'m free! Well, as free as Gallywix\'s personal insurance mechanic can get.', 163535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De wind is my will!', '', 163534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De skies belong to us!', '', 163533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De wind is at our backs!', '', 163532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I join... de wind...', '', 163531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You proved unworthy of breathing our sacred air.', '', 163530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, heretic!', '', 163529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready when you are, $n.', 163528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food for de saurid!', '', 163527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stand against de loa!', '', 163526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who knew killing naga could be so fun?', 163525, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 142423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s slay that slimy sea witch and end this invasion!', 163524, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 142421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course! I\'ve got it right here.', 163523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All rise as Judge Bazzelflange leave courtroom. Meatball hungry. Court adjourned.', '', 163522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like to recess court while your team investigates this further evidence.', 163521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander Ravenhide, your hobgoblin associate has found some information which is relevant to the People\'s case.', 163520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. Highly unusual... but I\'ll allow it.', 163519, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Approach.', 163518, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nugg need moment of your time, your honor.', '', 163517, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Stop everything!', '', 163516, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the matter of the Horde vs. Buxdoggle, Skrizzik, Blightrunner, and $n, we find...', '', 163515, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most intriguing! Please continue, mister foreman.', 163514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have, your honor.', '', 163513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. And have you found anybody presently in the courtroom to be guilty?', 163512, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jury has reached a verdict, your honor.', '', 163511, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good. I would now like to offer the jury a chance to deliberate their...', 163510, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The defense rests, your honor.', 163509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no other explanation than the obvious: $n killed Paul North.', 163508, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n has been lying to us this entire time. $gHe:She; behaves like a murderer with something to hide.', 163507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like to present to the jury this S.E.L.F.I.E. picture which clearly shows $N breaking the law by distributing illegal Brawl\'gar invitations. No respect for the law!', 163506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will $ghis:her; bloodthirst never end? And finally, $gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my blood elf client of murder.', 163505, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, you murdered two innocent engineers during your investigation of my client, correct?', 163504, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See? $gHe:She; has financial motivations. And $gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my fine orc client of assassinating the quartermaster.', 163503, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the records show that YOU murdered Lord Sylysthrel in order to steal his fairly-earned Brawler\'s Gold! Is that correct?', 163502, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$gMister:Miss; $n. You have accused my goblin client of having a motivation to kill our quartermaster.', 163501, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n killed Paul North!', 163500, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We would like to offer an alternative theory to the jury:', 163499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor.', 163498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, counsel.  Defense?', 163497, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De People rest, your honor.', 163496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was possessed by a demon!', 163495, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was an Alliance spy!', 163494, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was so bored with the Brawl\'gar Arena that she shoplifted!', 163493, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was so bored with the Brawl\'gar Arena that she spit off the side of the zeppelin!', 163492, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To forge invitations simply out of boredom requires a large amount of disposable income, which is consistent with the jeweled sword that $n found at the scene.', 163491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was so bored with the Brawl\'gar Arena that she distributed counterfeit invitations.', 163490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Libbiara Blightcaller had an excellent motive to murder Paul North:', 163489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, you\'ve got it all wrong...', '', 163488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s hat to de Lich King!', 163487, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s hat to de highest bidder!', 163486, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s hat to an invisible shadow monster!', 163485, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s heart to de Lich King!', 163484, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s heart to de highest bidder!', 163483, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s heart to an invisible shadow monster!', 163482, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to give our quartermaster\'s soul to de Lich King!', 163481, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to sell our quartermaster\'s soul to de highest bidder!', 163480, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is supported by de evidence $n found at de scene: a shadowy scroll.', 163479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wanted to feed our quartermaster\'s soul to an invisible shadow monster!', 163478, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadowmaster Skrizzik also had a good motive:', 163477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... dare... you... !', '', 163476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He killed Paul North to cover up for another murder!', 163475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He and Paul North were caught in a love triangle!', 163474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Jaina Proudmoore.', 163473, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Thrall.', 163472, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is supported by de evidence $n found at the scene: a crate of valuable supplies had been stolen.', 163471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was deep in debt to Lord Sylysthrel.', 163470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pit Boss Buxdoggle had good reason to kill Paul North:', 163469, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, you have heard de evidence.', 163468, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pfshh. If having a bit of fun is a crime, then consider me guilty. I will pay whatever fine you require. Let\'s get it over with.', 163467, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. And what CRIME did she commit out of boredom?', 163466, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was de motive?', 163465, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true dat, in your discussions with Miss Blightrunner, you discovered a potential motive?', 163464, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What evidence did you find at de scene of de crime dat implicates Miss Blightrunner?', 163463, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lastly, $n, I\'d like to ask you about Libbiara Blightrunner.', 163462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry.', '', 163461, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will have order in my brawl court!', 163460, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-y-you don\'t understand! I-I-I...', '', 163459, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give de hat?', 163458, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give dat heart?', 163457, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom was he going to give dat soul?', 163456, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was dat motive?', 163455, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true dat, in your discussions with Mister Skrizzik, you learned about a potential motive?', 163454, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you also found some evidence dat may implicate Shadowmaster Skrizzik. What did you find?', 163453, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh-wh-who, me?', '', 163452, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor. I\'d like to proceed to some questions about one Shadowmaster Skrizzik.', 163451, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Counsel, you may continue.', 163450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highly unorthodox, but I\'ll allow it.', 163449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You talk too much, kid! I\'ll kill you!', '', 163448, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to whom did he owe de money?', 163447, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY!', '', 163446, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was de motive?', 163445, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. And $n, is it true that, in your discussions with Mister Buxdoggle, you learned about a potential motive?', 163444, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what was dat evidence?', 163443, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, is it true that you found a piece of evidence at de scene of de crime dat implicates Pit Boss Buxdoggle?', 163442, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', '', 163441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I\'d like to ask you a few questions about Pit Boss Buxdoggle.', 163440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De People would like to call $n to the stand.', 163439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Tiana. Prosecution, your witness.', 163438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My clients are innocent!', 163435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, counsel. Defense, opening statements?', 163434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De three defendants have each been charged with murder. We plan to show dat at least one is guilty!', 163431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, your honor.', 163430, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand, Genn. Light be with you.', '', 163429, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The People may proceed.', 163428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t mean to defy you. But if I didn\'t give the order, I think Mia would charge off to battle without me.', '', 163427, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some goblin ingenuity, and a lot of explosives, we could take this ship down!', '', 163426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Jury sit down.', '', 163425, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jury listen up. You all swear you gonna tell truth, so help you Light?', '', 163423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bailiff Meatball, please swear in the jury.', '', 163422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we hear case of People of Horde versus Buxdoggle, Skrizzik, and Blightrunner.', '', 163421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brawl\'gar Court now in session. Judge Bazzelflange presiding. Meatball hungry.', '', 163420, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody listen up.', '', 163419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot stand idle as they endure the same fate we did. Gilneas will fight by their side.', '', 163418, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves saved my people from our curse. They offered us refuge in Darnassus after our kingdom fell.', '', 163417, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. You know you can always speak your mind.', '', 163416, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 122843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your aid is welcome, $p. At least we can count on you.', 163415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, our forces in Zuldazar have not yet begun their assault. With your aid, we may be able to succeed on both fronts.', '', 163414, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 122842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave us be!', 'Leave us be!', 163413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call the guards!', 'Call the guards!', 163412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, it\'s the Horde!', 'Run, it\'s the Horde!', 163411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First pirates, now the Horde!', 'First pirates, now the Horde!', 163410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are here!', 'The Horde are here!', 163409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', '', 163408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As ready as I\'ll ever be.', 'As ready as I\'ll ever be.', 163407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready for what comes next?', 163406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lifeform scanned... Match not found... Aegrim Bronzebeard... Activating defenses...', '', 163405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder detected... Arming defenses...', '', 163404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande left for Darkshore ahead of our army. She intends to wrest it from the Horde herself.', 163403, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. We will reclaim our home now.', 163398, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 0, 122284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me this Drust relic.', 'Show me this Drust relic.', 163397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people need action, not excuses! We will not languish in Stormwind while the Horde defiles our lands!', 163396, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 0, 122283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After that business with G\'huun and de siege of de city, Talanji needed someone who could maintain order.\n\nJakra\'zet was many things, a firm hand among them. I hope I can fill his role without de more unsavory parts of his character.\n\nTalanji brought me back from exile and gave me his job. I became General Rakera, much to Kaja\'s delight. Now in addition to leading Zandalar\'s armies, I am to give voice as one of de Zanchuli Council.\n\nIt is an honor, and a chance to right de wrongs of de past.', 163395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one is Jo\'nok, de Bulwark of Torcali.\n\nJo\'nok is chosen to replace Vol\'kaal. Slime who served de mistress of lies.\n\nWe are made for war, not pretty words. Jo\'nok\'s voice on de Council be dat of strength.\n\n<Jo\'nok cracks his knuckles loudly.>', '', 163394, 0, 0, 591, 64, 0, 0, 0, 589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am High Prelate Rata, formerly de Will of Rezan.\n\nAs my loa is no more, I answer to Talanji now. I hope to serve her well as a voice of faith on de Zanchuli Council.', 163393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I know what you\'re thinking. How does someone like me get to a place like this?\n\nIf I\'m being perfectly honest with you, I have no idea. I think maybe Torga had something to do with it.\n\nAt least it will make a great story! The first Tortollan on the Zanchuli Council, of all things! Hah!', '', 163392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I vow we will recover Teldrassil before the war is over. But we face dwindling resources and rising casualties. If I can ask your patience for a while longer--', '', 163391, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 122281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish things were different, High Priestess. But with the war raging in both Arathi and Zandalar, an assault on Darkshore would stretch us too thin.', '', 163390, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 122280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen, please share what happened with $p.', '', 163389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei have been loyal to the Alliance. Are we now left to fend for ourselves?', 163388, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 122239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you will.', '', 163387, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me? Of course not, I don\'t have a loa! Maybe I\'ll pick you!', 163386, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though if you wish to change shapes, you must be loyal to me. Will that be a problem for you, child?', '', 163385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...And what of the countless dead? Of the families that will never be whole again?', 163384, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 122351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My followers come from all walks of life. They may also follow other loa, but all are part of my pack.', '', 163383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the one!', 163382, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the master of shapes, little one. If you choose to honor me, I will grant you this power as well.', '', 163381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Trident of Deep Ocean is nearby. We must get to that island.', 163380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s call up roadside assistance to fix the mech.', 'Let\'s call up roadside assistance to fix the mech.', 163379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I do NOT want you to move my freakin\' mech! $p, it\'s time for you to get vengeance for me.', '', 163378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, yeah, got nabbed by Alliance near here. Want me to move mech?', '', 163377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the rest of you? I need this thing fixed, not moved!', '', 163376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roadside help here now, boss. Where move mech to?', '', 163375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes the roadside assistance. See, that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about, fast service with a smile!', '', 163373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothin\' here but us bananas!', 'Nothin\' here but us bananas!', 163372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lead the way.>', '<Lead the way.>', 163371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no way to exist.', 163370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Banging', 'Banging', 163369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da bananas never fail! Use dem responsibly, yeah?', '', 163368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s an old Goldtusk Gang secret, $p, but I know I can trust ya with it.', '', 163367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to move quickly and quietly.', '', 163366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You get rid of those security features, we\'ll watch your back.', 'You get rid of those security features, we\'ll watch your back.', 163365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tidesages will use the Abyssal Scepter to conceal our true intentions beneath a thick layer of mist. Meanwhile, the fleet will invade Dazar\'alor from the south.', 163364, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think he\'s actually part robot? Might explain why he\'s so freakin\' annoying!', '', 163363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two steps ahead of ya again, junior! As usual.', '', 163362, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahah! Fresh air at last!', '', 163361, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope... not dead. Just wishing we were dead. This must be how Sylvanas always feels.', '', 163360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... are we dead? Is this how Sylvanas always feels?', '', 163359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points at you.', '', 163358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to put you on ice!', '', 163357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Freeze,\" don\'t move!', '', 163356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Ice\" to meet you...', '', 163355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Chill\" out...', '', 163354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BZZT. ERROR. AZERITE AMMUNITION DEPLETED.', '', 163353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no nonononono!', '', 163352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, bye bye!', '', 163351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See, Gallywix, this is the reason why the Horde will never win. You\'re not smart enough to outwit me!', '', 163350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of Azerite?! Why didn\'t this stupid thing warn me it was out!', '', 163349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We may have underestimated the value of our prisoners.', 163348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy zhe - Vait... vhat is ZHAT?!', '', 163347, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Engines to full power, we will depart the area immediately!', 163346, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have doubts on the ability of this crew to repel these boarders.', 163345, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are attempting a rescue!', 163344, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From my observations, a victory here is highly possible!', 163343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GAH! $p, hit the big red button, BLOW THIS MOOK TO SMITHEREENS!', '', 163342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, Gallywix, that would really show me! Any more clever ideas?', '', 163341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then, I\'m gonna sell all those junk parts of his at BELOW MARKET RATE. The ultimate goblin insult!', '', 163340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, where was I? Oh yeah, blowing up all his stuff. Yeah, I bet he\'d be cryin\' and sobbin\' the entire time, what a wimp!', '', 163339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seriously, this guy is really obsessed with machines. Makes me think he wants to be part robot or somethin\'!', '', 163338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then, I\'m gonna find MORE of his little machines and blow them up too!', '', 163337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what I\'m gonna do when I find this guy? First, I\'m gonna blow up that little mech suit of his.', '', 163336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to reach the engine room.', 163335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He thinks he\'s soooooo much better than goblins! Yeah, well, you know what pal, at least half of us ain\'t RADIOACTIVE!', '', 163334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With a little help, this shoddy goblin workmanship, may just explode!', 163333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s Mekkatorque\'s ship. King of the gnomes, or whatever those little freaks like to call him.', '', 163332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta say, I\'m not a fan. Think I\'ll leave this sorta thing to you in the future.', '', 163331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh, feels weird actually doin\' somethin\' for someone else. Is this what you do all the time?', '', 163330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will follow you, and make an in depth study of this primitive air vehicle.', 163329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to formulate a plan to disable this crudely built airship.', 163328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Evacuation is of the highest priority!', 163327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your arrival is quite timely!', 163326, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, this tingles. I can feel its power from here.', 163325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone in this camp bears a key. That key will open a chest. In that chest you will find the relic we seek.', 163324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A grand destiny lies before us. Surely you sense it as well as I.', 163323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, mortals, one forgets how intense their delusions of grandeur can be.', 163322, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, I can detect the stench of these wretches. It may even be sticking to this form.', 163321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies will fall!', 'Our enemies will fall!', 163320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A weapon forged in the depths...', 163319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What delicious irony that a pirate keeps such a coveted prize... as a trophy.', 163318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful naga once possessed the trident. Now his underlings seek to recover it.', 163317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Kul Tiras!', 163316, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe I see some of the Outriggers fighting the Horde across the water. They\'ll help us take back Anglepoint.', 163315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, Quartermaster. Taelia, you\'re with me.', 163314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Send me to Lor\'danel Landing.', 'Send me to Lor\'danel Landing.', 163313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Cinderfall Grove.', 'Send me to Cinderfall Grove.', 163312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Gloomtide Strand.', 'Send me to Gloomtide Strand.', 163311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Bashal\'Aran.', 'Send me to Bashal\'Aran.', 163310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did the right thing, Taelia.', 163309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope the rest of my patrol group is okay. Maybe if I\'d stayed...', 163308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t want to leave my company... but it was the only way to get the word out.', 163307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Galeheart\'s our swiftest gryphon, so I was dispatched to sound the alarm.', 163306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Outriggers and my patrol fought hard, but the enemy was relentless. We were overwhelmed.', 163305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are warships outside the seagate. Scores of Horde were invading on small craft.', 163304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do, ma\'am. When we caught sight of the Azerite explosives, we knew what they were planning.', 163303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taelia, what\'s the situation at Anglepoint? Do you think the Horde means to take out the seagate?', 163302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get ready. We\'re almost there.', 163301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If our people live, we will rescue them. And if they died fighting, then we will make the Horde pay.', 163300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we do the best we can... and we never give up hope.', 163299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes... sometimes there\'s no way to save everyone.', 163298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite infused weaponry was used to take a seagate down before. I imagine they will be doing the same here.', 163297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anglepoint is the last seagate protecting the sound.', 163296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid I have to help some people right now. I\'ll be back later.', 163295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Momma says you do ice magic. Can we have ice cream?', 'Momma says you do ice magic. Can we have ice cream?', 163294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi Lady Jaina! Can you do some magic for us? Can I have a water elemental?', 'Hi Lady Jaina! Can you do some magic for us? Can I have a water elemental?', 163293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the Lord Admiral!', 'It\'s the Lord Admiral!', 163292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah!', 'Woah!', 163291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll travel over Tiragarde Sound. Meet me by the canal, $p.', 163290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have all gone down to de steps of Zanchul to witness Talanji\'s crowning.\n\nThis is a momentous occasion. One not seen in living memory. Commit this to memory, $n, for de kings and queens of de Zandalari are notoriously long-lived.', '', 163289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is everyone?', 'Where is everyone?', 163288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen-to-be Talanji directed me to acquire you.', '', 163287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery on the move!', '', 163286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glaive thrower ready for battle!', '', 163285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This glaive thrower could use an escort.', '', 163284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery coming through. Clear a path.', '', 163283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glaive thrower production complete. Onward, allies!', '', 163282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glaive thrower--moving out!', '', 163281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re so glad you\'re home, Jaina. I believe that we--What\'s this? Incoming!', '', 163280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... yes, mother. You\'re right.', 163279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve all made mistakes, but we\'ll weather this storm, dear ones. Together.', 163278, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No \'buts\', Jaina.', 163277, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. But such was not his fate.', '', 163276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I think of those Horde savages seizing his body and hanging it on display...', 163275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear Derek would be disappointed by how I behaved. Especially toward you, Jaina.', 163274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father could be hard, but I do think he\'d be happy to see us together again.', '', 163273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was a ploy to provoke us. To goad us into making mistakes. We will not give them the satisfaction.', 163272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Part of me wonders what our brother and father would make of all that Kul Tiras has been through. All that we\'ve endured as a family.', '', 163271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful not to let it burn!', '', 163270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s sure to give it some flavor!', '', 163269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the aroma of simmering chili!', '', 163268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s chili smells delicious! Won\'t be long before it\'s done!', '', 163266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more ingredients, and the Horde\'s chili will be ready to eat!', '', 163265, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to try the Alliance\'s chili! It\'s almost ready!', '', 163264, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance\'s chili is really coming along! It just needs a few more ingredients...', '', 163263, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory for the Horde! And spicy chili for me!', '', 163262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance wins! This chili is superb... I have to learn this recipe!', '', 163261, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first kitchen that gathers enough ingredients to make their chili wins! Let the cooking begin!', '', 163260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I missed you, Jaina. Kul Tiras suffered in your absence. When father died, no one wanted to understand why it happened. They were just angry it did.', '', 163259, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Five minutes? How frightfully unfair, big sister. It\'s been at least ten!', '', 163258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that\'s the brother I remember! Barely back on land for five minutes and already plotting your next excursion.', 163257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the vote of confidence, baby brother. But are you sure you weren\'t hoping for the job?', 163256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 127251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'d have done my duty if asked, but my calling is the sea. Speaking of which, considering all that\'s happened, a nice long sail would do mother a world of good.', '', 163255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s my sister, the Lord Admiral! Your Alliance friends say you\'re a master of diplomacy. I think this new title could work out quite well indeed.', '', 163254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 127250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t start, Tandred. It still feels strange to hear people call me that. I\'d always assumed Derek would become the next Lord Admiral.', 163253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Admiral.', '', 163252, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 122767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry to disturb you. I\'ve brought a report from Master Shaw.', 'Sorry to disturb you. I\'ve brought a report from Master Shaw.', 163251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So we are... and I am very grateful.', 163250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, Mother. But Jaina and I are here now. Thank the tides that the three of us are together again.', '', 163249, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First I lost your brother Derek, then your father, then Jaina. When you disappeared with the fleet, I was all alone.', 163248, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t make light of a mother\'s pain, Tandred.', 163247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The memorial is very nice, Mother. I like the bit about how you said I was fearless.', '', 163246, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How quickly the world changes.', 163245, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew returning home would be dangerous, but I had to take the chance. I did not expect to find healing.', 163244, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Great Pandaren Chili Championship! This year, the noble Alliance faces off against the mighty Horde!', '', 163243, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So those are taunka, eh? And I thought the tauren looked rough! Get the Azerite--but watch your backside around those horns.', '', 163241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are those... taunka canoes on the horizon? They\'ve come a long way for some Azerite. Let\'s make sure they leave empty-handed.', '', 163240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would an undead vrykul even do with Azerite? Here\'s hoping we never find out. Be a sport and eliminate them, would you?', '', 163239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever wonder what\'s worse than a vrykul? An undead vrykul, apparently. Why don\'t you put those things out of our misery?', '', 163238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great... It appears we have some sort of cult on our hands. Better keep them away from the Azerite--and plug your ears around their chanting!', '', 163237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, I\'m no expert on cultists, but I\'d wager it\'s better for the Azerite to be in our hands rather than theirs.', '', 163236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear howling? I hear howling. That\'s... never good. I think I\'ll see how things are going below deck!', '', 163235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HA! They don\'t stand a chance. Give \'em hell, sister!', '', 163234, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 122785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye aye, Lord Admiral. Where will you be?', '', 163233, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be facing the Horde head on.', 163232, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tandred, take our best ships and sail out to flank them.', 163231, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde attack on Norwington\'s place emboldened them. It was only a matter of time before they struck again.', '', 163230, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feral worgen? I assumed that wet dog smell was coming from you! No offense. Mind taking care of this?', '', 163229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brann Bronzebeard!', '', 163228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, do you see de taunka canoes coming ashore? Dis could pose a problem. Take dem out!', '', 163227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been years since I have seen a taunka. De last time did not end so well. Time for some payback!', '', 163226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
