('I think I can do that! Thanks, mister!', '', 163073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An open heart. Falcons know the intentions of those around them. If you stay true and good, you\'ll be a friend to animals of all kinds.', '', 163072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that, mister?', '', 163071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am. It takes hard work and perseverance, but to be a falconer there is one trait you must embrace above all others.', '', 163070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! You\'re a falconer?!', '', 163069, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winston!', '', 163068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, then allow me to introduce you to mine!', '', 163067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His falcon is so cool! I want a bird friend!', '', 163066, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiring our monument to Arom Waycrest? Did you know he led the charge against the Drust?', '', 163065, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that big guy and his falcon, $n!', '', 163064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t seen zhe last of me, $p!', '', 163063, 0, 0, 0, 102, 5000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat it, Schnottz!', '', 163062, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to the base, see if we can find where Mekkatorque is controlling these things.', '', 163061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, yes. Any last vords? Hmm?', '', 163060, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, zhen, vhere vere ve?', '', 163059, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be certain there aren\'t, Schnottz. Deathwing\'s patience wears thin.', '', 163058, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell him zhat zhere vill be no furzher interruptions.', '', 163057, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take it from here, my friends. Report to your master zhat zhe problem has been dealt vizh.', '', 163056, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Zhat\'s far enough!', '', 163055, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You vill pay, $p. Deazh by firink sqvad!', '', 163054, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If zhat vere not enough, you sabotaged my ritual and caused Gobbles\' death!', '', 163053, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But -', 'But -', 163052, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO BUT! Silence! Keep Movink!', '', 163051, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhen you mercilessly kill my loyal vorkers...', '', 163050, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clumsily interferink vizh my operation...', '', 163049, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, you come traipsing into Uldum as if you owned zhe place...', '', 163048, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THIS is what I paid for! Mekkatorque\'s got nothin\' on this.', '', 163047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about, look at all that Azerite! All that destruction... all that POWER!', '', 163046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... freakin\'... WORK!', '', 163045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You piece of junk! I paid good money for this, and all you can do is make me look like an idiot in front of Mekkatorque\'s toys!', '', 163044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Hey uh, $p, you might wanna hold on to a lot of somethings for this one)', '', 163043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAHAHA! Take a good look at what gold and goblins can getcha, Mekkatorque. This baby is brimmin\' with Azerite!', '', 163042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* That mech of yours is a serious safety hazard!', '', 163041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* Seriously, did your people iterate on this mech at all? It\'s barely first pass!', '', 163040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* I just ran a scan... can your tech really be THAT outdated?!', '', 163039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* Hah! This is just pitiful, Gallywix. You\'re no match for my creations!', '', 163038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* Goblin slapdashery can never match gnomish technology!', '', 163037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* Who are you kidding, Gallywix? Your machine is falling apart!', '', 163036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*BZZT* This is sad, Gallywix! My creations are far stronger than yours!', '', 163035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re cookin\' with gas now, AZERITE gas! Hit the big red button and let\'s see what this thing can really do.', '', 163034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, champion, Aviash will carry you to meet this threat.', '', 163032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems like something I should do.', '', 163031, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I definitely thought of installing it.', '', 163030, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may have installed a self-destruct to prevent Horde from stealing this equipment!', '', 163029, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This gyrocopter is for Alliance personnel only!', '', 163028, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s assuming it does not explode.', '', 163027, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I personally guarantee your safety!', '', 163026, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a gyrocopter all warmed up for you!', '', 163025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really zhink you vould get avay vizh it, $p? Hmm?', '', 163024, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See? This thing is fine, I never refuel until that needle is WAY past empty, never had a problem!', '', 163023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re outta fuel? That can\'t be right, we got plenty of Azerite left! Look at what this thing can do.', '', 163022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Mainlander!', 'Thank you, Mainlander!', 163020, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will regret coming here!', 'The Horde will regret coming here!', 163019, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Kul Tiras! For the Daughter of the Sea!', 'For Kul Tiras! For the Daughter of the Sea!', 163018, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right. I\'m an Outrigger. Time to act like it!', 'You\'re right. I\'m an Outrigger. Time to act like it!', 163017, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make them pay for what they\'ve done, Mainlander.', 'Make them pay for what they\'ve done, Mainlander.', 163016, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew Taelia would find help!', 'I knew Taelia would find help!', 163015, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I thinking? These are just more monsters to fight!', 'What am I thinking? These are just more monsters to fight!', 163014, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Lord Admiral! For Kul Tiras!', 'For the Lord Admiral! For Kul Tiras!', 163013, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a PhD in explosions and a minor in literature. Guess what? I can\'t explode or read anything here with these Alliance on my back!', 'I got a PhD in explosions and a minor in literature. Guess what? I can\'t explode or read anything here with these Alliance on my back!', 163012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mother nearly lost her life trying to save the people of Darnassus. I will do everything in my power to stop the Horde here in Darkshore.\n\nSome atrocities simply cannot go unanswered.', 163011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go back to Loch Modan.', 'I am ready to go back to Loch Modan.', 163010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are yeh?', '', 163009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a direct flight to Quel\'danas.', 'I need a direct flight to Quel\'danas.', 163008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister tidesage, do you really live here?', '', 163007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look $n, we\'re flying in water! This is so cool!', '', 163006, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we take a closer look?', '', 163005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death comes for us all.', 163001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 121566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Delaryn doesn\'t seem to be looking at you.>', 163000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have all been affected by these dark times. Some of us in ways we\'ll never truly recover from. I chose a name to reflect how I\'ve changed.', 162998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And if anything goes wrong, roadside assistance will come fix it. I got my guys to throw in a warranty at no extra charge!', '', 162997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They ain\'t expectin\' us to team up in a G.M.O.D and create some chaos!', '', 162995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! This baby can really move. Imagine what it\'ll do to the Alliance!', '', 162994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Tiragarde Sound.', '', 162993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, hold on. I just gotta figure out which button makes this thing fly...', '', 162992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhhhh, hold on... I think it\'s goin\' too faaaaaaaaaast!', '', 162991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Here we go. Ya better hang on, \'cause this thing is gonna ZOOM. It\'s fueled by Azerite, baby!', '', 162990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna show the Alliance what goblin technology can do.\n\nAnd by that, I mean we\'re gonna blow up a whole lotta them.', '', 162989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That it did, Liam. May the tides bless you.', '', 162988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did... did the water tell you that?', '', 162987, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there--Farstrider! Man a ballista. Provide cover for the retreating civilians!', 162983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 123045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I salute your bravery, elf, but the chase is over.', '', 162982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if we could smelt the metal, no dwarf can endure that kind o\' heat. Not even a Dark Iron!', '', 162981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, Grumnus. Some friends o\' mine may be able tae help us solve both of those problems.', '', 162980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pray that you stay true to your chosen path. If you do, you shall find great happiness and fulfillment in life.', '', 162979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There may come a time when you face evil. Perhaps with less fanfare than $n, but you will face it all the same.', '', 162978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They didn\'t take it, my child. They are my brothers and sisters. But darkness lurks in their hearts.', '', 162977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure we can reforge the armor, Brann. The Great Forge would need tae be much hotter than any of us have ever seen.', '', 162976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mean bad guys? Why did bad guys take your home?', '', 162975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did, once. But now it is in the hands of those who wish to do harm.', '', 162974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As ye can see, the armor\'s completely shattered... Ah! Here\'s our friend now!', '', 162973, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 120423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m trying to decide what I want to be when I grow up. I wanted to see the giant squid rock!', '', 162972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am indeed, my young friend. What brings you into the shadow of the Shrine of the Storm?', '', 162971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Mister, are you a real tidesage?!', '', 162970, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is truly a marvel to behold, is it not?', '', 162969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today will be a day all de Zandalari remember for years to come.\n\nI hope it is de start of something good for my people.', 162955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aegrim\'s study has likely not been disturbed since his passing.', '', 162954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Outriggers almost certainly need mechanical restoration to their weaponry, Lord Admiral. I\'ll stay with $p.', '', 162952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uhm... don\'t we need to find some oarsmen?', 162951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, ma\'am. Lead on Lord Admiral!', 162950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about your gryphon, Cadet. I\'ll make sure she is cared for.', 162949, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Ma\'am. But... I can\'t just leave Galeheart here.', 162948, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wise counsel, mother. Champion, Taelia--with me. We\'ll cross Tiragarde Sound. Meet me by the canal.', 162947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lorena would have wanted you to have this. She shared so many happy stories of you and her brothers while she served in Theramore. I am so sorry for your loss.', 162946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 122811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother, I need you to mobilize our infantry and medics.', 162945, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will get them moving to Anglepoint at once, Jaina.', 162944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will teach them there is a price for attacking Kul Tiras.', 162943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In your many years of adventuring, you\'ve stumbled upon an uncountable number of shadowy scrolls, but never anything like this.\n\nIt is written in a language you don\'t understand, and the very parchment is permeated with a shadowy energy. This scroll must belong to |cFF0000FFsomeone who works with dark, malevolent magic|r.', '', 162942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This crate is completely empty. It\'s been pried open, and all of its contents have been removed.\n\nPaul North was the arena quartermaster, and traded in valuable wares. Whoever stole this merchandise may have been |cFF0000FFmotivated by money|r.', '', 162941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paul North lies on the table, unbreathing, with a sword plunged into the center of his skeletal chest.\n\nYou suspect that this is what killed him.\n\nThe sword is inlaid with gold and studded with gemstones. Whoever bought this weapon must have had access to |cFF0000FFtremendous wealth|r.', '', 162940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow...', '', 162939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always been a peon. Never nothing else. Maybe want more?', '', 162937, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peons treated like da poop. Never get nothing nice.', '', 162936, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tools broken. Had to use hands. Now they break too!', '', 162935, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crushblow Peon ignores you.', '', 162934, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked Lilian Voss that they be taken care of. She made sure they were.', '', 162933, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 122727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s... good. But how? We spent everything we had before my death--I mean, my transformation.', '', 162932, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 121818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family is well. Your wife purchased a small home within Arom\'s Stand in Drustvar, and your children are well fed.', '', 162931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why aren\'t you working?', 'Why aren\'t you working?', 162930, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This meeting\'s for peons only!', '', 162929, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me won\'t build that outpost!', '', 162928, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foreman Magrok cares about us peons.', '', 162927, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me not go back there!', '', 162926, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me no take orders from the Horde no more.', '', 162925, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. More than anything.', '', 162924, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 121817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it wise to dwell on your former life? Are you sure you want to know?', '', 162923, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 122725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rexxar, wait. Is there... any news from my family? How are they doing?', '', 162922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well, Zelling. Until we meet again.', '', 162921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 122724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... It is done. Come, we must check on Misha and Zelling.', '', 162920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neferset City will fall!  ATTACK!!!', '', 162919, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah... hah... the others will come... for you all...', '', 162918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come then, see if you can claim your justice!', '', 162915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be the one to bring Daelin\'s killer to justice, no matter what!', '', 162913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hid in your tin can while your allies were killed, coward. At least Daelin had the courage to fight with his soldiers!', '', 162912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, get to shore!', 162911, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 122412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkness has fallen over the shore.', 162910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies are ready. Let us begin.', 'Our allies are ready. Let us begin.', 162909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah!', '', 162908, 0, 0, 4, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you finally ready to hear our demands?', '', 162907, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 142458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Someone from Orgrimmar?', '', 162906, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 142457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw down your tools and raise up your fists!', '', 162905, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t lie. Not everyone will be coming back from this. We need the Horde to believe the attack is real.', '', 162904, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Admiral! The Horde is attacking Anglepoint Wharf!', 162903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for coming so quickly. King Wrynn would like to have a word with us before we continue.', '', 162902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to listen in, High Commander. [Start RTC]', 'I\'m ready to listen in, High Commander. [Start RTC]', 162901, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people will form strike teams to provide support, and High Tinker Mekkatorque\'s engineers will assemble a few surprises for the Horde.', '', 162900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 122914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our goal is to draw them north into Nazmir. We\'ll hit them with guerilla tactics and rile up the blood trolls.', '', 162899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An assault on the city of Dazar\'alor will destabilize the Horde\'s relations with the Zandalari.', '', 162898, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 121741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That sounds wonderful, Mother. You know... it is so very good to be home.', 162896, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are never alone, my daughter. Say, let\'s go somewhere quiet and talk. The library in the keep was always your favorite spot. Still like surrounding yourself with musty old tomes?', 162895, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That realm of torment... it forced me to confront memories I had pushed away for so long. But when I saw you there, I... I realized I didn\'t need to face the darkness alone.', 162894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw visions when we searched for you in Thros. Moments of doubt and pain. I don\'t mean to open old wounds, but... I need to know. Are you... better?', 162893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many lost. Brave heroes... innocent families... victims of a madman\'s hatred.', 162892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, not about your father. I know what happened to the city. The Horde attack. The explosion.', 162891, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'About Theramore? Oh mother, forgive me. I didn\'t mean to remind you of--', 162890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such conversations never get easier. Jaina... may I ask you something?', 162889, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 122812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Pharaoh has fallen!  His immortal colossi tumble like toys!', '', 162888, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, thanks mister pirate man!', '', 162887, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That I do, kid. Here, I\'ve got an extra. Now get back and finish yer studyin\'. Don\'t grow up too fast.', '', 162886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, if my troops can\'t kill you, then I will! For Daelin Proudmoore!', '', 162885, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you still get a cool hat!', '', 162884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, kid. A pirate\'s life ain\'t all that great. Ye\'ll never have a warm hearth or yer own bed. And upstanding citizens will call ye a no-good vagrant!', '', 162883, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up I wanna be just like you! Forget the rules! I\'m gonna live a life of adventure on the high seas!', '', 162882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... uh... yes?', '', 162881, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a real hat and everything! You\'re so cool! Do you sail and swashbuckle and find buried treasure?!', '', 162880, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I am! What\'s it to ye?', '', 162879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a real pirate?!', '', 162878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, kid! What ye be doin\' here? This is no place for a kid yer age!', '', 162877, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh! We gotta get out of here!', 162876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away boss!', 162875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got it, Kiro!', 162874, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those naga won\'t know what hit \'em!', 162873, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Let\'s get to work.', '', 162872, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meerah, can you sort things out with the vintner in Suramar?', '', 162871, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 142451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nisha, head for Zuldazar and do what you do best.', '', 162870, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since joining the Horde, we\'ve been asked to increase our arcwine production. \n\nBaine was kind enough to send us some help, but unfortunately, it\'s had the opposite effect. \n\nI\'m not sure what can be done...', 162869, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I oversee all war-related construction. \n\nThe Horde has new outposts going up all over Azeroth. \n\nThings were going as planned, until work at the Crushblow camp came to a stop. \n\nThe peons just disappeared! \n\nWe won\'t meet our deadlines unless Baine does something.', '', 162868, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar has sent de Horde our finest warriors, but at what cost? Our coastlines are left defenseless. \n\nDe naga have been advancing along de southern shores. Their presence causes me great concern. \n\nDe Horde must protect its allies! Especially those dat cannot defend themselves.', 162867, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care if it\'s not finished, get that shredder into Kill-Mode NOW!', '', 162866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, $n! Look how cool that place is!', '', 162865, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come here?', 'Why have you come here?', 162864, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine must act before things get worse.', '', 162863, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must all do our part.', 162862, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AUTOPILOT MODE: ENGAGED. KILL ALL HOSTILES.', '', 162861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold to the schematic for safekeeping. Don\'t worry, I got my sentries to keep it safe!', '', 162860, 0, 65067, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand. Thank you for your time, High Chieftain.', '', 162859, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 142448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Now, where were we?', '', 162858, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But please, enjoy the hospitality of Orgrimmar as our guests. Horde or not, the vulpera will always be welcome here.', '', 162857, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] You understand, don\'t you?', '', 162856, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meeting the needs of our current allies has stretched the Horde thin. It would be unwise for us to take your people under our wing.', '', 162855, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though I am honored by your request to join us, I am afraid that I must decline.', '', 162854, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 142445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] It would be foolish to embark on such a journey without strong allies, and so I stand before you, with an offer to join your Horde.', '', 162853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Chieftain Bloodhoof. I am Kiro, and I speak for the vulpera of Vol\'dun. We seek to join the Horde.', '', 162852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baine sent assistants to Suramar to aid with our arcwine production, but managing them has proven... difficult.', 162851, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Crushblow outpost was undergoing construction, but the peons suddenly vanished. I need them to get back to work!', '', 162850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De naga have been advancing on Zuldazar\'s shores. We must push dem back before dey pose a greater threat!', 162849, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our vintner refuses to work with the staff you have provided.', 162848, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work at the outpost has halted. How should we proceed?', '', 162847, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 142441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar requires additional forces along de coast!', 162846, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 142414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aka\'magosh. We grow strong, while they grow weak!', '', 162839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has dramatically increased their presence in this region. Do not fear unfavorable odds. Beat them.', '', 162838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their defeat was inevitable. Lok-tar!', '', 162837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hurry. The whispers grow more insistent.', 162835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so pleased that your mind is open to all possible paths.', 162834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 124750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is an interesting turn of events. I did not know this was possible.', 162833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', '', 162814, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back in a couple years, kid. If you train hard, I bet you\'ll have no problem with the trials.', '', 162813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut your stupid face, Budd.  SHUT IT!!', 162812, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! $n, look at me!', '', 162811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOOK AT ME!!!!  I\'M A MANATAUR!!!', '', 162809, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide of battle has turned in our favor thanks to your efforts. Well done, $c.', '', 162799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide of battle has turned in our favor, thanks to you. Well done.', '', 162798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to ride a gryphon, huh? I can take care of that.', '', 162797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s so cool! One day I\'ll be just like you. I\'m going to ride gryphons and everything!', '', 162796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Of course I can. It\'s the Roughneck way!', '', 162795, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are sacrificing villagers and laying waste to the town! Stop them before more innocent lives are lost!', '', 162794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are up in arms! Stop them before more innocent lives are lost.', '', 162793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 120609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re so cool! Can you really beat up a wendigo with both your hands tied behind your back?', '', 162792, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That I am, kid.', '', 162791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, wow! Hi, mister! Are you a Roughneck?', '', 162790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a kid like you doing all the way in the mountains?', '', 162789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, look! Look at them handling that gryphon!', '', 162788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your approach is... unorthodox.  Though, I suppose with the smoke from the fires, all they\'ll see is your silhouettes.', '', 162787, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun is wondrous. Like a magnificent holy light!', '', 162786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What am I grabbing again?', 162785, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow!', '', 162784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I suppose it\'s the only plan we\'ve got.', 162783, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my greetings to you. I will remain here, to contemplate the sun.', '', 162782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Soulare of Andorhal, disciple of the Light.', '', 162781, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Delormi. Return me to my time.', 'I\'m ready, Delormi. Return me to my time.', 162780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the most moronic... half-assed... ridiculous plan you\'ve ever come up with, Budd!', 162779, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free... at last.  Your reward will be substantial, friends.', '', 162778, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fabric of time is saved for now... but you can mend it no longer, Weaver Delormi...', 162774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our selves are not weakness...and you are not our destiny!', 162773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shears of death so easily destroy that which is so flimsy. We must cut away our weakness.', 162772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But it is our destiny to destroy it. Fabric is feeble - mending it is futile.', 162771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Delormi, stop this! It is our purpose to preserve the fabric of time!', 162770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been granted all the knowledge I am willing to share. Leave now, and never return.', 162769, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So whoever whispered to me\'s not da same as who sent me back?', '', 162768, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been touched by the hand of valor. Such a noble force does not scheme for mortal thrones.', 162767, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who be havin\' such power? Could it be da same one who bid me ta name Sylvanas warchief?', '', 162766, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadow hunter, you are no longer a mere spirit. What you have become is something beyond my power to forge.', 162765, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen of da val\'kyr. My spirit was sent to da Other Side, den returned. Was dis your doing?', '', 162764, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. Very well. You and your champion may approach. But know that deception will be met with destruction.', 162763, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eyir, speak with me if da others not be to your liking.', '', 162762, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold... you DARE bring a priestess of Bwonsamdi into MY halls?', 162761, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But enough musing. Make your way to the shores of Vol\'dun. That is where the third prize awaits.', 162760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 124739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions of the Banshee Queen, leave this place or die.', 162759, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 121068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave now or stay forever. The choice is yours.', '', 162758, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not like de look of dis. I suggest we go... quickly!', 162757, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are neither undead nor damned. You do not belong here. Leave this place at once.', '', 162756, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it you who be trappin\' me soul in dis world? Ta jail me like ya jail da Scourge?', '', 162755, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin... your soul has walked on the Other Side and returned. You have been altered... more than you know.', '', 162754, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And me spirit bein\' trapped in dis world... is dat your doin\'?', '', 162753, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Banshee Queen\'s schemes threaten the balance. I had no hand in them.', '', 162752, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lich King. Da voice I heard as I be dyin\'... tellin\' me to name Sylvanas warchief... was it yours?', '', 162751, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balance be important! Besides, dat one got a nasty habit of keepin\' what she kills. No, ya warchief be no friend to ol\' Bwonsamdi.', '', 162750, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would me want da Banshee Queen in charge? Nononono. Sure, I be all for war and death, but dat Sylvanas... she be tippin\' da scales too far.', '', 162749, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind ya tone, bull-mon... or ya be talkin\' with ya father soon enough.', '', 162748, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak plainly! Was it you who urged Vol\'jin to name Sylvanas warchief?', '', 162747, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Nonono. Ya be mistaken, Talanji.', '', 162746, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Loa of death, your servant Vol\'jin has called to you. Yet you have turned a deaf ear to his pleas.', 162745, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 122756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhh, ya come back. Did ya find da spirit of Vol\'jin? Or ya here ta make a deal?', '', 162744, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 122994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da truth dat it might not be da loa who wanted Sylvanas to be warchief, but somethin\' far more powerful.', '', 162743, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember it takin\' me somewhere, but da memory of where be hidden from me. Ta keep me from sharin\' da truth...', '', 162742, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been callin\' ta Bwonsamdi for a long time. He not be hearin\' me... or he be choosin\' not ta answer.', '', 162741, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like dey be doin\' now. Cannot hear dem, champion. Da voices of da loa be silent.', '', 162740, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As if da loa demselves had forsaken me.', '', 162739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 121055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Sometin\' not be right dat day. Da demons, deir blades slipped past me guard.', '', 162738, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121054, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere was a presence. Somethin\' movin\' in da shadows. Somethin\' powerful.', '', 162737, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was expectin\' ta see ol\' Bwonsamdi, or Shadra, or Hir\'eek... any of da loa.', '', 162736, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember dyin\'. I remember glimpsin\' da Other Side.', '', 162735, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 121075, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
