('', 'Though we have kept to ourselves for many years, Kul Tiras has still felt the cost of war.\n\nThe orphans in our care have lost their families to many tragedies. Pirates, witches, fires, beasts... we do what we can to provide them a caring home. Many stay here until they are old enough to go out on their own, and we do our best to train them for their futures and find them apprenticeships and livelihoods.\n\nOur favorite time of the year is Children\'s Week, where adventurers like you can take the kids out to see and learn more about the world.', 162545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright boys, time for a little fun!', 'Alright boys, time for a little fun!', 162544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another plaything for Zunjo!', 'Another plaything for Zunjo!', 162543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
