('Yes, this is perfect. This is exactly what I needed. It should take but a moment.', '', 162105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel it. The shard thrums with power! It is... beautiful, yet terrifying.', '', 162104, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a long time comin\'. The Dark Iron will finally emerge from the mountain and claim our rightful place in the Alliance.', 162103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
