('', 'There are draenei on this world?\n\n<Geya\'rah narrows her eyes.>\n\nNot for long.', 162081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We pledge our blades to the Horde!', 162080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mag\'har will make a new home here on Azeroth.', 162079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Draenor may be lost to us, but my heart tells me I will see its skies again one day.\n\nAncestors, may this dream come true!', 162078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flaying? It is a barbaric practice from long ago. Why, I would not even know how to begin such a ritual.\n\n<The orc leans in close and whispers.>\n\nI know exactly how to begin. Are you here for a demonstration?', 'Flaying? It is a barbaric practice from long ago. Why, I would not even know how to begin such a ritual.\n\n<The orc leans in close and whispers.>\n\nI know exactly how to begin. Are you here for a demonstration?', 162077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes I look at the draenei and wonder if there are bones in those fleshy face tentacles because if there are I would collect many hundreds and string them together into decorative strands that I would hang from our fortress walls so that visitors would marvel and say hey would you look at all those face tentacle bones I bet they were collected by a very very wise and talented orc and I would answer yes that is what my mother always told me.\n\nI am sorry. Did you have a question?', 'Sometimes I look at the draenei and wonder if there are bones in those fleshy face tentacles because if there are I would collect many hundreds and string them together into decorative strands that I would hang from our fortress walls so that visitors would marvel and say hey would you look at all those face tentacle bones I bet they were collected by a very very wise and talented orc and I would answer yes that is what my mother always told me.\n\nI am sorry. Did you have a question?', 162076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it time to eat? I hope it is time to eat!\n\nOn another matter... if you had to choose a limb you could live without, which would it be?', 'Is it time to eat? I hope it is time to eat!\n\nOn another matter... if you had to choose a limb you could live without, which would it be?', 162075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Lasha fixes her gaze on your head.>\n\nHow\'s your skull? Does it fit?\n\nIs your mind free... empty... or split?', 162074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I miss the botani.\n\nWhen you roasted them just right, they were DELICIOUS.\n\n<Lasha wipes a trickle of drool from her lips.>', 162073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it time to set the Lightbound on fire yet?', 162072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?', 'Welcome to my inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?', 162071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make this inn your home.', 'Make this inn your home.', 162070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who challenge Warchief Hellscream will pay with their lives!', 'Those who challenge Warchief Hellscream will pay with their lives!', 162069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You walk upon OUR world, outsider.\n\nShould you bring corruption here, your life will be forfeit.', 'You walk upon OUR world, outsider.\n\nShould you bring corruption here, your life will be forfeit.', 162068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I catch any of those Lightbound traitors, I will slit their throats!', 'If I catch any of those Lightbound traitors, I will slit their throats!', 162067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We bested the primals. We will bring down any foe.', 'We bested the primals. We will bring down any foe.', 162066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenor will be free!', 'Draenor will be free!', 162065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you earn the overlord\'s trust, you will earn mine.', 'If you earn the overlord\'s trust, you will earn mine.', 162064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord Geya\'rah is the warchief\'s right hand. There is no braver orc on Draenor.\n\nNor on your world, outsider!', 'Overlord Geya\'rah is the warchief\'s right hand. There is no braver orc on Draenor.\n\nNor on your world, outsider!', 162063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a child, draenei scholars taught me to read and write. I liked them. Respected them.\n\nThen the naaru came, and fanaticism took hold.\n\nThe draenei were reborn--no, they have a different word for it--re-forged in their precious Light.\n\nTheir belief blinds them, binds them to masters who seek to control the universe as surely as the Legion did.\n\nDraenei... eredar... so willing to bend the knee. So prone to corruption.', 162062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grommash Hellscream has led us well. I respect him as much as I did my father.\n\nBut if I ever see his traitor son again...\n\n<Geya\'rah spits on the ground.>\n\n...I will end him.', 162061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Draenor must be free from the grip of fanatics and tyrants.', 162060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes from your world once freed me from a demon\'s grip in Hellfire Citadel. Were you among them?\n\n<Grommash peers at you.>\n\nIf so, I owe you a great debt. Perhaps the spirits will show me a way to repay it.', '', 162059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mag\'har will bend to no one. Not even those we once called friends.', '', 162058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have traveled far, $c. You may find our world to be even more savage now then it was when your people last set eyes upon it.', '', 162057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What memories can I bring forth for you today?', 162047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can an ol\' T\'omkus help ya?', '', 162046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
