('Tell ya what, how bout I cut you in on the silver profits and you put down that pick. How\'s twenty percent sound?', 'Tell ya what, how bout I cut you in on the silver profits and you put down that pick. How\'s twenty percent sound?', 161942, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? I think I would remember that...', 'Really? I think I would remember that...', 161941, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because we were screaming at you as you left with our only guards!', 'Because we were screaming at you as you left with our only guards!', 161940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, cool it there! How was I supposed to know there were survivors?', 'Whoa, cool it there! How was I supposed to know there were survivors?', 161939, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You coward! You left us there to die!', 'You coward! You left us there to die!', 161938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Score my next run!', 'Score my next run!', 161937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re ready to ride!', '', 161936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t mind, I\'m gonna go find Grimelock and show him the business end of my pick...', 'If you don\'t mind, I\'m gonna go find Grimelock and show him the business end of my pick...', 161935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks again for your help, stranger.', 'Thanks again for your help, stranger.', 161934, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('World Quests Unlocked', '', 161933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They tried to sell these things as food!', 'Seal those crate, we need to clean up this mess!', 161932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Stromgarde Unlocked', '', 161931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate those kids!', 'Get rid of these things!', 161930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those horrible kids brought these things into town!', 'This is another one of those kids ideas, gone bad!', 161929, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Bell_Green:20|t Raal the Gluttonous starts to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:264931|h[Call Servant]|h|r!', '', 161928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_VOLATILESHADOW:20|t Lady Waycrest starts casting |cFFFF0404|Hspell:268306|h[Discordant Cadenza]|h|r!', 161927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! Azeroth has grown stronger... and ye have too, champion!', '', 161926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A minion o\' the Old Gods! The Heart of Azeroth is strong enough tae drive it out! Use the Heart, $n!', '', 161925, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Islands Unlocked', '', 161924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_RACIAL_CANNIBALIZE.BLP:20|t Use |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263235|h[Blood Feast]|h|r to purge your stacks of |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263227|h[Putrid Blood]|h|r.', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_RACIAL_CANNIBALIZE.BLP:20|t Use |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263235|h[Blood Feast]|h|r to purge your stacks of |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263227|h[Putrid Blood]|h|r.', 161923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soar high above the storm.  Let the others get wet.', '', 161922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve done it! Let us return to Stormwind and report in to the King.', 161921, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We decided tae make a few upgrades while repairin\' the Black Anvil.', 161920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will keep hunting the enemy until this war is won, $n.\n\nThat is my pledge to all those lost at Teldrassil.\n\n<Shandris lowers her head in prayer.>', 161919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ride the currents. Brave the storm!', 161918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Blood Gate.', 'Return to the Blood Gate.', 161917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t say I\'m fond o\' boats as a general rule, but I admire what ye got stored down here.\n\nIf ye find any more ancient relics worth lookin\' at, I\'m happy tae take a peek.\n\nAnd doors. Mysterious doors. Mysterious titan doors are me specialty!', '', 161916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halford\'s got some pretty interesting notes in here. War reports, troop movements...\n\n<Kelsey glances at the doorway and leans in close to whisper to you.>\n\nAnd I may have even located his private diary!\n\n<Kelsey winks knowingly.>', 161915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t want to leave without your friends, do you?', 161914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be fighting alongside sturdy, honest Alliance soldiers again. Reminds me of the old days back in Bravo Company.\n\n<Keeshan\'s eyes seem to gaze somewhere far away.>\n\nAlways have your weapon ready, $n. And keep an extra one hidden in case of capture. Someplace they won\'t want to search for it.', '', 161913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FROST_ARCTICWINDS.BLP:20|t Rixxa Fluxflame is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FROST_ARCTICWINDS.BLP:20|t Rixxa Fluxflame is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r!', 161912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have been training. Mastering our abilities.\n\n<Umbric narrows his eyes.>\n\nThe whispers speak of many possibilities. We will be ready for whatever comes.', '', 161911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. I was dubious about this whole arrangement, but it seems things have worked out fer the better.', '', 161910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good day tae be Dark Iron!', '', 161909, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The final stroke is yours, $p.', 161908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It feels good to be at war again, $n. But I must admit... healing the wounded is growing tiresome. There are far better uses of my talents.\n\nMany of the techniques we Lightforged employed against the Legion would serve us well fighting the Horde.\n\nKindly inform the High Commander that I am happy to ensure any prisoners we capture are properly... \"purified\".', 161907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not surprised that Jaina Proudmoore has chosen to return home.\n\nA wound untreated can never heal. And her wound is grave indeed.', 161906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart Guardian moves to attack you!', 'The Heart Guardian moves to attack you!', 161905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE.BLP:20|tMerektha is about to hit you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:263914|h[Blinding Sand]|h|r, look away!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE.BLP:20|tMerektha is about to hit you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:263914|h[Blinding Sand]|h|r, look away!', 161904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready when ye are, $n. Talk tae me when ye want tae go tae the Blackrock Depths.', 161903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know what we must do, $n. Time to move.', 161902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready to go to the Firelands.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready to go to the Firelands.', 161901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $n. We must strike her down.', 161900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They won\'t expect us here in Vol\'dun, but they\'ll soon wonder who\'s killing their operatives.', '', 161899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to move quickly, $n. The Horde doesn\'t know we\'ve made landfall yet.', '', 161898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll have those bombs planted and be back with us in no time.', '', 161897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He might not look it, but he can handle himself in a fight, and his demolitions experience is second-to-none.', '', 161896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I\'ve worked with Guzbert before. He\'s a professional.', '', 161895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light willing, we\'ll put a stop to that.', '', 161894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What they can\'t use, they sell, which funds the Horde\'s war efforts.', '', 161893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that would be a mistake. Those scoundrels are notorious for digging up powerful artifacts and unleashing them against their enemies.', '', 161892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s tempting to overlook Sunwatcher and the Reliquary. I mean really... they are archaeologists, after all.', '', 161891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready to go to Blackrock Depths.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r I am ready to go to Blackrock Depths.', 161890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arathi is currently too dangerous for travel.$B$BPortal access will be restored once we\'ve regained control of Stromgarde.', 161889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we know about the Mag\'har orcs?', 'What do we know about the Mag\'har orcs?', 161888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about the Dark Iron dwarves?', 'What can you tell me about the Dark Iron dwarves?', 161887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up, I\'m going to be just like Nisha! She\'s the best!\n\nOr maybe Kiro! He\'s super smart....\n\nOr maybe Meerah! She\'s so nice....\n\nOr maybe Jena! She\'s got a lot of stuff....\n\nOr maybe...\n\n<Rudo continues listing the names of other vulpera in the camp.>', '', 161886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arathi is currently too dangerous for travel.$B$BPortal access will be restored once we\'ve regained control of Ar\'gorok.', 161885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you care for a refreshing brew?', 161884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucky trades for you! Cannot win without these!', '', 161883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I hope you like my inventions!', 161882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some freshly-forged weapons an\' armor here!', '', 161881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trade supplies from Stormwind here for you!', 161880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring instruments of darkness.', '', 161879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have magical artifacts that you may find interest in.', '', 161878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brews for sale!', '', 161877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mag\'har are by your side, blood and thunder!', '', 161876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, you guys want some explosives? I got what you need right here.', '', 161875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar! I have trade supplies from Orgrimmar.', '', 161874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring goods to trade! Much luck they bring you!', 'I bring goods to trade! Much luck they bring you!', 161873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said Elisande had mastered incantations known only to the bronze dragons. Perhaps they would be willing to aid your cause.', '', 161872, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time magic was the province of our former leader, Grand Magistrix Elisande. Much of her knowledge died with her.', '', 161871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to infiltrate the Proudmoore Academy.', 'I need to infiltrate the Proudmoore Academy.', 161870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to infiltrate the Proudmoore Barracks.', 'I need to infiltrate the Proudmoore Barracks.', 161869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 161868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold the line. You go on ahead. For the Alliance!', '', 161867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re backed up against a wall, with an ocean full of enemy ships pinning us in.', '', 161866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid I have to agree with the gnome, $p.', '', 161865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey!', 161864, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scurries back towards The Frogmarsh.', '%s scurries back towards The Frogmarsh.', 161863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one will speak. At least he still has his tongue, unlike those stinking forsaken.', '', 161862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get a move on, $p! Talk to the ship\'s captain so we can ship out!', 161861, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes I wish I WAS a machine...', 161860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Machines.... <sigh>', 161859, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have your orders. Dismissed!', '', 161858, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evaluate these encampments and report back with your findings.', '', 161857, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh! Dark iron dwarves! I love dark iron dwarves! They have MACHINES.', 161856, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be meeting with Anvil-Thane Thurgaden, on Zuldazar\'s southeastern coast.', '', 161855, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes sir!', 161854, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kelsey!', '', 161853, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His crew ran into some trouble at sea, but they\'ve managed to eke out a bit of a camp on the eastern shore.', '', 161852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rendezvous with Brigadier Thom, one of our 7th Legion officers.', '', 161851, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p!', '', 161850, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lot\'s of fresh food inside.', 161849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We already have boots on the ground in not one, but TWO locations in Zuldazar.', '', 161848, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather around, everyone. Here\'s the plan.', '', 161847, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll end up... in Proudmoore\'s prison...', '', 161846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde... scum...', 161845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will retrieve Derek\'s body... one way or another...', '', 161844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never be able to harness the power of our teachings...', 161843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall be washed away...', '', 161842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go. Return to Oculeth. With the shard restored, he can send you to the place you seek.', '', 161841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had there been any doubt, I would never have allowed the shard to fall into the wrong hands. Not again.', '', 161840, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the threads of fate upon you. You are indeed worthy of what is to come next.', '', 161839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even as a reverberation of the past, Garrosh was a formidable foe.', '', 161838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you saw here was one of his worst possible incarnations. A waste.', '', 161837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('In countless potential timelines, he was seen as a great hero to his people. Some called him the Horde\'s greatest warchief.', '', 161836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh Hellscream... Such a pity how things turned out.', '', 161835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I\'m afraid of you?', '', 161834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us everything, Zandalari.', 'Tell us everything, Zandalari.', 161833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to hear my story?\n\nI was on the flagship. I saw everyt\'ing.\n\nFine. I\'ll tell ya what happened. Better for ya to know. Better for ya to feel de fear.', '', 161832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, we must travel now to the Temple of the White Tiger.', '', 161831, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will not be missed... not in this, nor any other timeline.', '', 161830, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though this is merely an echo of this enemy of Azeroth, know that death at this entity\'s hands would prove quite real.', '', 161829, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was here that Gul\'dan once traveled between worlds with the aid of the Vision of Time.', '', 161828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The echoes of magic here reverberate through the timeways.', '', 161827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now, I can... Hang on, what is that?', '', 161826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within this chamber, the Heart of Azeroth ye hold can grow even mightier!', '', 161825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Chamber of Heart sure looks better than the last time ye were here, eh?', '', 161824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we cannae give in tae despair. I know ye will turn back this tide o\' darkness!', '', 161823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear we still got a long way tae go, $n. Things out there seem tae be gettin\' worse.', '', 161822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do ye feel it? The Heart\'s power continues tae awaken!', '', 161821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fie on ye! Mark me words... the Firelord will have his due. See ye then... old friend.', '', 161820, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that\'s the stuff... the scent o\' fire in the mornin\'... an\' noon, an\' night. We need tae delve into the Firelord\'s lair tae get that Molten Core charged up.', '', 161819, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get our finest scouts lookin\' fer Grimstone. We need tae stop that mad bastard before he brainwashes more followers!', '', 161818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to skip the Kul Tiras introductory quests?', 'Are you sure you want to skip the Kul Tiras introductory quests?', 161817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard this tale before... <Skip the Kul Tiras introductory quests and begin your journey in Boralus.>', 'I\'ve heard this tale before... <Skip the Kul Tiras introductory quests and begin your journey in Boralus.>', 161816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use its power wisely, $n. And be wary... there are some out there who want ye tae fail in yer duty tae our world!', '', 161815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As she gains strength, so does the Heart of Azeroth ye wear around yer neck!', '', 161814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth is still in pain, but thanks tae all yer efforts, she\'s holdin\' her own.', '', 161813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. Let\'s get that bridge up. Think I know just the spell...', '', 161812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
