('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves.blp:20|t Hadal creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:276068|h[Tidal Surge]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves.blp:20|t Hadal creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:276068|h[Tidal Surge]|h|r!', 161802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Nae sense in further pleasantries, then.', '', 161801, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer darn well right I do!', '', 161800, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the true Firelord rises again, all faithful Dark Irons will heed his call. Do ye mean tae oppose us?', '', 161799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye think that ragged band o\' embers ye gathered will impress him? I believe we snuffed out most o\' yer rabble cultists on our way in here.', '', 161798, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
