('Heed the call of battle.', 'Heed the call of battle.', 161680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is what we\'ve been training for.', 'This is what we\'ve been training for.', 161679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle awaits.', 'The battle awaits.', 161678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n. Grab a hunk o\' that Core an\' we can return tae the caverns above. I\'ll get a mole machine ready.', '', 161677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c like yourself would do well among our ranks.', 'A $c like yourself would do well among our ranks.', 161676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself for battle.', 'Prepare yourself for battle.', 161675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right!', '', 161674, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, you do. Defeat me and you may return with a fragment of the Core.', '', 161673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need a piece o\' the Molten Core tae repair the Black Anvil.', '', 161672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what do you seek, child of fire?', '', 161671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin Darkanvil o\' the Dark Iron clan.', '', 161670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who approaches?', '', 161669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. You have earned a piece of the Molten Core. Use it wisely.', '', 161668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremblade thinks she can outsmart us with her band of Alliance fools.\n\nHer arrogance will be her downfall.', '', 161667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t tell the others, but I\'m a little glad that the falcons have been scarce lately.\n\nI don\'t have anything against the birds, but I\'ve grown a bit attached to these furry critters. \n\nWith the falcons away, my rabbits get to stay much more... alive.', 161666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And for the fallen... Elune-adore.', 161665, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Falstad! You\'re here.', '', 161664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place!', 'Leave this place!', 161663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not destroy these lands!', 'You will not destroy these lands!', 161662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits be... welcoming me...', 'Da spirits be... welcoming me...', 161661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not gonna kill... us all...', 'Ya not gonna kill... us all...', 161660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Joinin\' da spirits...', 'Joinin\' da spirits...', 161659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t see dis... in me visions...', 'Didn\'t see dis... in me visions...', 161658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde... lives on...', 'Da Horde... lives on...', 161657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da Horde!', 'For da Horde!', 161656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya move now!', 'Don\'t ya move now!', 161655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got bad juju headin\' your way!', 'Ya got bad juju headin\' your way!', 161654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot be stopped...', 'We cannot be stopped...', 161653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me in my chambers in the Undercity, where we can discuss our next move... discreetly.', 161652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whisky? Never touch the stuff.\n\nNo, I\'m just here for the pretzels.', '', 161651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Magister. Your insight will be most valuable.', '', 161650, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m happy to share any details I can remember that might help them.', '', 161649, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s only one real Gallywix, and we\'ll find him. I\'ll inform Shaw of the decoys.', '', 161648, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One Gallywix was already more than Azeroth needed, and now we have... what do you think, Halford, dozens?', 161647, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone deal with that $pr! And someone else bring me cocoa butter on the balcony!', '', 161645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go!', 'I am ready to go!', 161644, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad you could make it, $n! Let me know when you are ready and I can take you up to Ulfar.', '', 161643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not understand goblin parties at all.', '', 161642, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us never speak of this place again.', '', 161641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such gluttony and waste of resources, while other goblins starve.', '', 161640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, what is that oppressive smell?', '', 161639, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never required a shower more than I do right now.', '', 161638, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would not put even a toe in that filthy pool. Who knows what they have been doing in there.', '', 161637, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, they simply throw their trash in the water. How vulgar.', '', 161636, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasant patch of nature... ruined by swaths of tacky artificial grass.', '', 161635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your body becomes heavy as your lungs fill with smoke...', 'Your body becomes heavy as your lungs fill with smoke...', 161634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am... relieved... I found you...', 161633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero... hero? Can you hear me?', 161632, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames are clear! Get to the Temple of the Moon!', 'The flames are clear! Get to the Temple of the Moon!', 161631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishala! Ishala! Are you out there?!? Please, Ishala -- listen to my voice!', 'Ishala! Ishala! Are you out there?!? Please, Ishala -- listen to my voice!', 161630, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot leave without my child! Please, somebody, help!', 'I cannot leave without my child! Please, somebody, help!', 161629, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, anybody! Please find my family!', 'Please, anybody! Please find my family!', 161628, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Help me! I cannot find my daughter!', 'Please! Help me! I cannot find my daughter!', 161627, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it. Bring her home.', '', 161626, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been given one more chance.', '', 161625, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would give anything to hold my boy again.', '', 161624, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can hear her... then it\'s not too late.', '', 161623, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s too late for that.', 161622, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Katherine, she\'s calling out to you... You must go to her.', '', 161621, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Genn... She\'s burning.', 161620, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... I see her... in my dreams.', 161619, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... she\'s suffering even more now. Isn\'t she?', '', 161618, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina did nothing but follow her heart. And she\'s suffered for that.', '', 161617, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina betrayed the kingdom.', 161616, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have Jaina.', '', 161615, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have nothing... no one... left...', 161614, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Priscilla, the greatest friend of my heart... has stabbed me in it.', 161613, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what to do, Daelin. I don\'t know what to believe in... who to trust.', 161612, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her. The Kul Tirans. The whole Alliance, if I must.\n\nI love the Horde. I made a promise to Thrall that I would defend it.\n\nNo matter who began this war, I will fight until it ends... or I do.', '', 161611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darnassus cannot be lost... It cannot end like this!', 'Darnassus cannot be lost... It cannot end like this!', 161610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse the Horde. Curse them all!', 'Curse the Horde. Curse them all!', 161609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... I don\'t... understand...', '... I don\'t... understand...', 161608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I hope the others made it out...', 'Thank you! I hope the others made it out...', 161607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fight Jaina Proudmoore?', 'You will fight Jaina Proudmoore?', 161606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina Proudmoore.\n\nShe once made a choice to spare us from her father\'s tyranny. I respected that decision, and how difficult it was.\n\nBut she could not forgive what Hellscream did to Theramore. She turned her hatred against all the Horde.\n\nShe went too far. Killed too many. Her quest for vengeance must be ended.', '', 161605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... I did not think I was going to make it.', 'Thank you... I did not think I was going to make it.', 161604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all burning... all of it...', 'It\'s all burning... all of it...', 161603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune bless you...', 'Elune bless you...', 161602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise Elune for you, $n.', 'Praise Elune for you, $n.', 161601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Boralus!', 'Send me to Boralus!', 161600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. Do you wish to return to Boralus?', 161599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. Are you headed to the front?', 161598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"She\"? Who do you mean?', '\"She\"? Who do you mean?', 161597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t... breathe...', 'I can\'t... breathe...', 161596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had found kinship with other hunters in the Unseen Path. We fought to defend a broken land.\n\nBut now the horn of war is sounded once again.\n\nWhen I heard she had returned... I had to answer the call.', '', 161595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to this conflict, Rexxar?', 'What brings you to this conflict, Rexxar?', 161594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, help me!', 'Please, help me!', 161593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put it out! Someone! Anyone!', 'Put it out! Someone! Anyone!', 161592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we have another war to fight.\n\nThere is little time for chatter.', '', 161591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so... hot...', 'It\'s so... hot...', 161590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is this happening?!', 'Why is this happening?!', 161589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAHHH!!', 'AAAHHH!!', 161588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water! Please! Please!!', 'Water! Please! Please!!', 161587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune save us!', 'Elune save us!', 161586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, focus. Task at hand. Please the Blightcaller. Keep them safe.\n\nI must be about my work, $n.', '', 161585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus, Brother Zelling!', 'Focus, Brother Zelling!', 161584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are EVERYTHING to me!\n\nI... I realize they don\'t want me in their lives anymore. But that could change!\n\nOnce they realize it\'s me, that I still love them, I know they will... they will...\n\nI... I...', '', 161583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are still in your thoughts.', 'They are still in your thoughts.', 161582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure if... I still haven\'t...\n\nThis isn\'t easy, $n.\n\nMiss Voss advised me to focus on the task at hand. She says proving my worth to the Blightcaller is the best way to keep my family safe.\n\nMy family...', '', 161581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('How has your transition been, Zelling?', 'How has your transition been, Zelling?', 161580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do all I can to aid the Forsaken\'s cause.', '', 161579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Zuldazar!', 'Send me to Zuldazar!', 161578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm-ka, $c. Do you wish to return to Zuldazar?', 161577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In life, I was raised to hate the undead. Trained to destroy them.\n\nWhen I became Forsaken, I hated myself most of all.\n\nBut now I see it is the Alliance that fosters this malice. The human kingdoms shun their former brothers and sisters because we remind them what\'s lurking beneath the facade of flesh.\n\nIt\'s time to end their cycle of hatred. The Alliance deserves to fall.', 161576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkness cannot abide within the Light!', 161575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat be some nasty voodoo.', '', 161574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is fine.', 'This is fine.', 161573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noting gonna stop da Horde!', '', 161572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what of the Alliance?', 'And what of the Alliance?', 161571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It doesn\'t take a prophet to see that Sylvanas will use this war as a means of bringing more Forsaken into the world.\n\nMy own conversion was... difficult. I had a lot to work through. Many scores to settle.\n\nI haven\'t let go of all that. But I also feel an obligation to help the newly risen adapt to their situation. Perhaps I can spare them the sort of pain I endured.', 161570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind if I do.', 'Don\'t mind if I do.', 161569, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have everything under control. Relax and enjoy your ale.', 'We have everything under control. Relax and enjoy your ale.', 161568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my dirt-stained friend, but we move more quickly on our own.', 'Thank you, my dirt-stained friend, but we move more quickly on our own.', 161567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye wee elves be needin\' some help with yer mission? Dark Irons can take care of it!', 'Ye wee elves be needin\' some help with yer mission? Dark Irons can take care of it!', 161566, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What sort of opportunity?', 'What sort of opportunity?', 161565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems my skills drew the attention of the powers that be. My services were... \"requested.\"\n\nDid you catch the hidden meaning there? Sorry. Despite my profession, I\'m not the best at subtlety.\n\nRegardless, I know how to recognize an opportunity when I see one.', 161564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem to have embraced the Horde.', 'You seem to have embraced the Horde.', 161563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halford, let\'s begin the process to blow up this ship.', 'Halford, let\'s begin the process to blow up this ship.', 161562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a lift?', '', 161561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a lift?', '', 161560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Brewston said you could give me a tour of the area.', 'Captain Brewston said you could give me a tour of the area.', 161559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', 'Thank you.', 161558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wistel said you could give me a tour of the area.', 'Wistel said you could give me a tour of the area.', 161557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', 'Thank you.', 161556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, that\'s enough. Let\'s bring her on down.', '', 161555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Straight ahead, you\'ll see High Perch, and then beyond it? That\'s Ar\'gorok, my $gboy:girl;. The enemy. The place we need to take over.', '', 161554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there? That\'s Newstead. Farm and pasture land. Pretty standard fare.', '', 161553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there to the east, that\'s the Circle of Elements. They\'ve got big stone totems, giant fire elementals, and huge circles on the ground. Shamans love it.', '', 161552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, we aren\'t going far. I just want to point out some of the spots where we\'ve been dealing with Horde attacks. In case we need you to, you know, kill \'em.', '', 161551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Highlands Mill, the source of all of Stromgarde\'s lumber. Well, at least this is USUALLY where we get our lumber from. Since the last Horde attack, we\'ve been forced out and nature seems to have reclaimed our mill.\n\nNot to worry. Once we get a few footmen out here we\'ll have the old mill up and working again.', '', 161550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Highlands Mill, the source of all of Stromgarde\'s lumber.\n\nThe forests have been quiet today. One of the peasants had a bit of a tussle with a bear, but that\'s nothing new. You know how it is with peasants.', '', 161549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, was it? Tully.\n\n<Foreman Tully extends a calloused hand.>\n\nThis is Galson\'s Lode. Normally I\'d have my laborers in there gathering ore for the war effort, but since the last Horde attack, we\'ve been forced out.\n\nTell Brewston that we could use some military support out here. We\'re ready to work, but we won\'t be getting into that mine without a fight.', 161548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, was it? Tully.\n\n<Foreman Tully extends a calloused hand.>\n\nNothing to report here. The Horde continue to be a thorn in our side, and the kobolds continue to be... annoying, but it\'s nothing we can\'t handle.', 161547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, that\'s enough. Let\'s bring her on down.', '', 161546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Straight ahead, you\'ll see High Perch, and then beyond it? That\'s Stromgarde, my $gboy:girl;. The enemy. The place we need to take over.', '', 161545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there? That\'s Newstead. Farm and pasture land. Pretty standard stuff.', '', 161544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over there to the east, that\'s the Circle of Elements. They\'ve got big ol\' stone totems, giant fire elementals, and huge circles on the ground. Shamans love it.', '', 161543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, we ain\'t goin\' far. I just want to point out some of the spots where we\'ve been dealin\' with Alliance attacks. In case we need you to, ya know, kill \'em.', '', 161542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Hatchet Ridge, the source of all of Ar\'gorok\'s lumber. Well, at least this is USUALLY where we get our lumber from. Since the last Alliance attack, we\'ve been forced out and nature seems to have reclaimed our mill.\n\nNot to worry. Once we get a few grunts out here we\'ll have the old mill up and working again.', '', 161541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Hatchet Ridge, the source of all of Ar\'gorok\'s lumber.\n\nThe forests have been quiet today. One of the peons had a bit of a tussle with a bear, but that\'s nothing new. You know how it is with peons.', '', 161540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, was it? Drogg.\n\n<Drogg extends a calloused hand.>\n\nThis is the Drywhisker mine. Normally I\'d have my peons in there gathering ore for the war effort, but since the last Alliance attack, we\'ve been forced out.\n\nTell Wistel that we could use some military support out here. We\'re ready to work, but we won\'t be getting into that mine without a fight.', '', 161539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, was it? Drogg.\n\n<Drogg extends a calloused hand.>\n\nNothing to report here. The Alliance continue to be a thorn in our side, and the kobolds continue to be... annoying, but it\'s nothing we can\'t handle.', 161538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as Silvermoon stands with the Horde, there will always be those who mistrust us.\n\nBut the Alliance is where our people belong. I am more certain of that now than ever before.\n\nStay the course, $n. Show our comrades in the Alliance that we fight for the same cause.\n\nOne day the Horde\'s grip on our land will be broken, and the children of Quel\'Thalas will stand united once more.\n\nI know it.', '', 161537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you believe we have earned the trust of the Alliance?', 'Do you believe we have earned the trust of the Alliance?', 161536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I struggle to fetter the whispers, same as you. Thankfully, Alleria Windrunner continues to offer us her guidance.\n\nWithout her intervention... well, I fear we would have all been lost.\n\nAnd though I was reluctant to treat with him at first, I have learned much from the Locus-Walker. Just bear in mind that anything he offers is bound to serve his own goals in some way.', '', 161535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How fare you, Magister Umbric?', 'How fare you, Magister Umbric?', 161534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not stand with the Alliance out of convenience. Nor is it a mere gesture of thanks to Alleria.\n\nOur ordeal has taught us the importance of great powers being in the right hands. We could not allow the Horde to know the things we know, or to use us as a weapon in their schemes.\n\nWe fight for the Alliance because we believe in its values. And one day, I pray we will bring all of Silvermoon back into the fold.', '', 161533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you fight for the Alliance.', 'Now you fight for the Alliance.', 161532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I led us right into the ethereals\' trap. If not for Alleria Windrunner\'s intervention, we would have been lost.\n\nAs it was, the shadow energies transformed us... and opened our minds to the whispers of the Void. Without Alleria\'s guidance, we would have fallen into madness.\n\nShe has helped us quiet our minds. Dampen the whispers. It is a constant struggle.', '', 161531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void nearly claimed you?', 'The Void nearly claimed you?', 161530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My followers and I felt no loyalty to the Horde. When Grand Magister Rommath forbade our Void research, we did not hesitate to break away and follow our own path.\n\nBut hubris got the best of me. I was certain I could master any force we encountered.\n\nI was so wrong...', '', 161529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you sought the power of shadow?', 'So you sought the power of shadow?', 161528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a magister, my duty has always been to Silvermoon and its people. When the mad Arthas devastated our lands, I knew we must harness every power available to ensure our survival.\n\nPrince Kael\'thas proposed one way. I sought out another.', '', 161527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your role in this campaign, magister?', 'What is your role in this campaign, magister?', 161526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, shall we?', 161525, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back so soon?', '', 161524, 0, 63336, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve misplaced the flute.', 'I\'ve misplaced the flute.', 161523, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. Thank you, Magister.', '', 161521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll travel with you on this vessel so that we may plan our strategy in the meantime.', '', 161520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll be waiting on the shore when we arrive, with a full scouting report of the area.', '', 161519, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Magister Umbric. How long will it take them to meet us there?', '', 161518, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Commander, I\'ve arranged for a regiment of my finest scouts and assassins to meet us in Xibala.', '', 161517, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An audience--perfect! Stay still, Alliance dog. Watch me strike down one of your greatest heroes!', 161516, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Arathi Highlands!', 'Send me to Arathi Highlands!', 161515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm-ka, $c. Are you headed to the front?', 161514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there! This place is really amazing right? I can never decide which bar is my favorite, but this is definitely in the top ten. Easy.', 161513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No vessel can match ours. None.', 'No vessel can match ours. None.', 161512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tidemother be praised.', 'Tidemother be praised.', 161511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to the depths. Only they will show us the truth.', 'Listen to the depths. Only they will show us the truth.', 161510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hey, another Drust artifact. I should take it to Jane.', 161509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Currents guide you.', 'Currents guide you.', 161508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hrm, my mining pick is getting a little loose. I should get Grix to look at it.', 161507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gettin\' hungry. I should grab Alan and head to Byron\'s.', 161506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As much as I hate to admit it, moving materials was a lot easier when Franklin was here.', 161505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our humble inn. How can I help you?', 161504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need help getting back to Boralus?', 161503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven yourself a true ally, $p.\n\nYou are always welcome in our caravan, here or anywhere else that the sands take us.', '', 161502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life won\'t ever be easy in Vol\'dun, but it will be easier after our victories against the Faithless.\n\nThank you, $p.\n\nRest and enjoy the hospitality of my people. Speak with the little ones you helped us rescue. Have a drink.\n\nThese moments of peace are what we fight for, and we must remember to enjoy them.', 161501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been quite an adventure, $p. One I won\'t forget anytime soon.\n\nOh, be sure to say hi to Dolly. She misses you!', 161500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The situation at Algerson Lumber Yard has been resolved. All parties waiting on lumber should have their orders filled soon.', '', 161499, 0, 54675, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, the hair on these boar hides keeps dulling my razor. I should get Grix to make me something better.', 161498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waycrest Guard has informed us that travel to Drustvar is once again safe. However, they would advise any curious travelers to stay to the roads.', '', 161497, 0, 62150, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is dat with Talanji? Is dat a... Horde?', '', 161496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does she have any new skulls? Let, me see!', '', 161495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The princess is back!', '', 161494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji! Talanji!', 'Talanji! Talanji!', 161493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to Zuldazar.', 'Take me back to Zuldazar.', 161492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Norwington would like to invite any skilled riders and game hunters to participate in the 15th annual Norwington Equestrian and Hunt Festival at his estate.', '', 161491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Civilization is so boring... I should be out hunting...', 161490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... clockin\' out... one last time...', 'I\'m... clockin\' out... one last time...', 161489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll pound ya flat!', 'I\'ll pound ya flat!', 161488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Proudmoore Guard would like to warn against travel to Drustvar until further notice. They are awaiting response from the Waycrest Guard. No more information is available at this time.', '', 161487, 0, 63340, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I\'m sure she will. Here, she asked me to give you this letter!', 'Don\'t worry, I\'m sure she will. Here, she asked me to give you this letter!', 161486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Cass. I can\'t find my favorite skinning knife. Have you se- Nevermind! Found it.', 161485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For those concerned about strange rumors surrounding the Algerson Lumber Yard, Maynard would like you to know that all tales have been exaggerated for emotional effect, and that the yard is just dealing with standard business issues.', '', 161484, 0, 63339, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priscilla... will have your head for this...', 'Priscilla... will have your head for this...', 161483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snoopin\' around ain\'t good for yer health!', 'Snoopin\' around ain\'t good for yer health!', 161482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Grand Admiral\'s decree, I would like to remind all citizens planning on visiting Stormsong that they must present themselves at the valley checkpoint for inspection by Lord Stormsong\'s guards.', '', 161481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhh, mom! I miss her a bunch. I really hope she is coming home soon.', '', 161480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De winds always change and shift. Sometimes good. Sometimes bad. Pa\'ku teaches us to go where de winds send us, as that is where we are needed.\n\nYou and de Horde have done my king and my people a great service. We will never forget that.\n\nNot that Loti will let us. Maybe I should forgive her. Or apologize. I do not remember. This might be de end after all.', '', 161479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahoy!$b$bCurious about the engineering trade?', 161478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dad\'s been busy as a bee trying to get the farm all fixed up!', '', 161477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss my mom... she hasn\'t been home in a really long time.', '', 161476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know... I think some day, I\'d like to be an adventurer too.', '', 161475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe you fought the wendigos and won!!', '', 161474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhh, please tell me you have some cool new stories to share!', '', 161473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there $p!', '', 161472, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be dead if not for you. Thank you.', 'I would be dead if not for you. Thank you.', 161471, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh loa, dis gonna crash hard!', 'Oh loa, dis gonna crash hard!', 161470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse the Horde! Lor\'danel did nothing to deserve this!', 'Curse the Horde! Lor\'danel did nothing to deserve this!', 161469, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hello there! Don\'t you look just... aweful.$b$bDon\'t worry, my little crumpet. Danny has just the thing you need!', '', 161468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loa be with you both.', '', 161467, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a dark time for Zandalar. Blood trolls, loa dying, and traitors. Our skies are filled with darkness and de winds whisper of yet more trouble to come.\n\nEven Loti is being nice to me. It is not natural. I do not like it.\n\nI am glad you are here, $n. And your Horde.', '', 161466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune help us!', 'Elune help us!', 161465, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, you want to do WHAT?', 'Wait, you want to do WHAT?', 161464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who thought this was a good idea?!', 'Who thought this was a good idea?!', 161463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The farm is a mess. I don\'t know what happened!', '', 161462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It all happened so fast...', 'It all happened so fast...', 161461, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise Elune!', 'Praise Elune!', 161460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going somewhere?', 'Going somewhere?', 161459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought it was the end. Thank you!', 'I thought it was the end. Thank you!', 161458, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t run that many tris in dis spot.', 'You can\'t run that many tris in dis spot.', 161457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too many tris in dis spot.', 'Too many tris in dis spot.', 161456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'danel did not stand a chance...', 'Lor\'danel did not stand a chance...', 161455, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De k\'liyant gonna suffa for dis.', 'De k\'liyant gonna suffa for dis.', 161454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I met your mom. She says hello!', 'I met your mom. She says hello!', 161453, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am disconcerted about de performance of dese direhorn in de present moment.', 'I am disconcerted about de performance of dese direhorn in de present moment.', 161452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owe! I am allergic to pain!', 'Owe! I am allergic to pain!', 161451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens if I just give up and stand here?', 'What happens if I just give up and stand here?', 161450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk, don\'t fail me now!', 'Gonk, don\'t fail me now!', 161449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheese it!', 'Cheese it!', 161448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are they attacking us?!', 'Why are they attacking us?!', 161447, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope! Noooope! Nooooooope!', 'Nope! Noooope! Nooooooope!', 161446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fast ya may be, you\'ll never be catchin\' me!', 'Fast ya may be, you\'ll never be catchin\' me!', 161445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run!', 'Run!', 161444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The diary lies open to a page detailing the Horde attack of Brennadam Square.>', '<The diary lies open to a page detailing the Horde attack of Brennadam Square.>', 161443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not even know what dat seal was for!\n\nNow, more than ever, we must work together to overcome de dangers dat threaten Zandalar. Look out for your packmates and help dem carry their burdens.\n\nDe traitor Zul is dead. I would remind Raal I was right, but perhaps since dere are so few of us, I should make peace? Bah.', 161442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Kul Tiran Skins and Leathers!$b$bUgh... we really need a better name.$b$bI\'m Cass, and I offer lessons in leatherworking. My partner, Cami, is a bit gruff, but you\'ll find no better skinner.$b$bThat said, what are you looking for?', 161441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De loss of so many loa... Gonk protect those who are adrift now. My heart aches for my king and de princess. De loss of Rezan is a wound on their hearts.\n\nBAH. I may even have to be polite to Raal, but only for a few days.\n\nThank you, $n. You and your Horde are strong. You make our pack stronger. We will need you.', 161440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time and time again, you have shown your value to de Zandalari Empire. De defeat of de blood trolls, de sethrak menace, and now even de traitorous prophet.\n\nIt is an honor to stand by your side, $n.', 161439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you\'re seeking a new pet?\n\n<Ulfar scoffs>\n\nThe magic of this place is deep and profound. It has come to inhabit some of the animals of the region. They are powerful manifestations of nature to be respected.', '', 161438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An observant one, aren\'t you?  \n\n<Ulfar chuckles.>\n\nIndeed I am, but not all of my people agreed with the conflict. Have you never seen division among your own? \nWe Thornspeakers joined Kul Tiran society. Some of your descendants heard the call of the wilds and wished to learn the ancient ways, and so we have taught them. Perhaps you hear the call? No?', '', 161437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul is dead, but at what cost?\n\nDe Great Seal is broken. Mythrax de Unraveler walks de world again. An evil greater than any de Zandalari have faced looms on de horizon, and it is called G\'huun.\n\nDe burden is mine, $n. If I had listened to Talanji, if I had dealt with Zul any of de numerous times his behavior came into question, perhaps this could have been avoided. Perhaps my loa would still live, and I would not have cast my lot in with de loa of death.\n\nThis is my shame.\n\nBut you, $n, have stood by me. Your Horde fought with us against our oldest foes. De Zandalari will not forget.\n\nI will make sure of it.', '', 161436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed I am. Not all of my people agreed with the conflict. Have you never seen division among your own? \n\nWe Thornspeakers joined Kul Tiran society. Some of their descendants heard the call of the wilds and wished to learn the ancient ways, and so we have taught them.', '', 161435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Ulfar, the last of the Drust Thornspeakers and the teacher of these students. One day my task will be over, I will return to the earth and a new High Thornspeaker will rise to lead, as is the proper way of things.\n\nBut that day has not yet come.', '', 161434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buh! Ya startled me!$b$bSo... you here to learn to fish? \'Cause I don\'t really know anythin\' else.', '', 161433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen some animals that look like they are part plant. Can you tell me about them?', 'I have seen some animals that look like they are part plant. Can you tell me about them?', 161432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a Drust! We fought a war against you!', 'You\'re a Drust! We fought a war against you!', 161431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a Drust? Wasn\'t there a war against them?', 'You\'re a Drust? Wasn\'t there a war against them?', 161430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you please share your story again?', 'Can you please share your story again?', 161429, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 161428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must remember to look after ourselves as well $p, we can\'t help the ones we love if we are barely surviving on our own.', 161427, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a druid as well?', 'Are you a druid as well?', 161426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you druids?', 'Are you druids?', 161425, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you\'ve been faring well on your own adventures $p!', 161424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are, $n. We are guardians of the balance in nature, the keepers of the cycle. Life is a part of nature, as is death.', '', 161423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are and not so different from you, $n. We are guardians of balance, keepers of the cycle. Life is a part of nature, as is death. But as a druid you know this.\n\nBe welcome in our grove.', '', 161422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I miss Ancel and his father dearly. Hopefully, I\'ll be able to return home soon.', 161421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you again $p. I hope you\'ve been well.', 161420, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Read the diary entry.>', '<Read the diary entry.>', 161419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will do!', 'Will do!', 161418, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Read about when you and Talanji first saw the Heart of Darkness.', 'Read about when you and Talanji first saw the Heart of Darkness.', 161417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. I miss them dearly and hope to return home soon. I\'m sure Raimond is trying his best, but he definitely has a penchant for throwing things into complete disarray!\n\nIf you see them again, please deliver this letter to my dear Ancel.', 161416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crazy Vaza has taken notes regarding all the events that have happened in Nazmir. Despite his moniker, his notes are actually very well written and organized.', '', 161414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such devastation Zul has wrought...\n\nI am thankful that you and de Horde are still here, $n. I am glad that my faith was not misplaced. To think de Zandalari might have faced such things alone is... more frightening than words can convey.\n\nIf we are still alive when this is over, I hope we can return de favor. De Zandalari are forever in your debt.', 161413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Well brother,\" Koralynn said, \"you\'re a rotten sailor, but I think you\'re going to be an excellent Tidesage.\"', '\"Well brother,\" Koralynn said, \"you\'re a rotten sailor, but I think you\'re going to be an excellent Tidesage.\"', 161412, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will go with you now, Eitrigg, and have words with your warchief. Is it still the troll that my mother spoke of?', 161411, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rezan... my loa... is dead.\n\nMy heart aches. I have never seen such a weight on my father\'s shoulders. Zul\'s betrayal struck deeper than any of us could have guessed... even those who suspected him from de very beginning.\n\nSuch heresy cannot go unanswered, $n. We must rally our people, our loa, our allies! Only den will we stand any chance of stopping Zul\'s foul schemes.', 161410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well then. Until next time.', 161409, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy there,  $g lad : lass;!$b$bWelcome to Byron & Bros. Boralan B.B.Q! Finest smoked meats this side of Ironforge!$b$bWhat can I get for ya?', '', 161408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Rastakhan\'s deal with Bwonsamdi.', 'Tell me about Rastakhan\'s deal with Bwonsamdi.', 161407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before us stand the walls of Orgrimmar, capital of the Horde.', '', 161406, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt the same, long ago. It can be... unsettling. I will do what I can to help you and your people.', '', 161405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow... that\'s quite the story.', 'Wow... that\'s quite the story.', 161404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mythrax the Unraveler is loose upon de world again! We thought him part of legend, a storied tradition meant to warn us against succumbing to de decays of time and complacency. But thanks to that snake Jakra\'zet and his Faithless allies this terror lives again.\n\nAll is not lost. Jakra\'zet met his fate and we have gained new allies in de Vulpera and them who praise de loa Sethraliss. However... I fear even with their added strength we may not prevail against such a foe.\n\nDese are dark days... and I hope dat dey will not be Zandalar\'s last.', 161403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mere moments ago, we were fighting for our lives on Draenor. I never thought I would set eyes upon another world.', 161402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Talanji\'s Rebuke.', 'Tell me about Talanji\'s Rebuke.', 161401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the attack of Mythrax.', 'Tell me about the attack of Mythrax.', 161400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Overlord, this... is Azeroth.', '', 161399, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Betrayal of Zul.', 'Tell me about the Betrayal of Zul.', 161398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For generations de Zandalari have warred against de Nazmani. Our borders have been under siege since long before I was born, and my father has only ever known war with de blood trolls. My father thought them pests, and we have let them gather their strength. Now we know the source of it.\n\nThey answer to de blood god, G\'huun.\n\nWe must not fail. If Zuldazar falls, de rest of de world goes with it. They will not stop until de blood god rules all.', 161397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to my shop.$b$bPlease feel free to took around. If you have any questions, I\'m sure I can assist you.', 161396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meep! Meep!', 161395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Zandalari specimens require an entirely new taxonomy!', 'These Zandalari specimens require an entirely new taxonomy!', 161394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Fairweather\'s Fine Enchantments!\n\nIf you have any questions about anything mystical, please ask!', 161393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww, I broke another quill...', 161391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The key... turns once more.', '', 161390, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Errant flesh! When it awakens, you will know eternity, and you will tremble!', '', 161389, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh! Hand cramp!', 161388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a great and terrible truth at the beginning of all things. I am its herald. Listen to my sermon, and know your infinite inconsequence.', '', 161387, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t panic, I just swam around and kept drinking!', '', 161386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There I was, trapped in a huge vat of Stormstout Ale!', '', 161385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen into the beyond. Now you shall perceive things as they truly are.', '', 161384, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, was this a smudge or a glyph?', 161383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas seeks to engage me, and I plan to give her what she wants.', '', 161382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A couple dwarven breweries would really improve Moonglade.', '', 161381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go! The submarine should already be deployed.', 161380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another round for my friends!', '', 161379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Special delivery for you, sir!', '', 161378, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, that was pretty bad. Anyway, we\'re here!', '', 161377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too rooted! Get it?', '', 161376, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents wanted me to be in the navy. Can you imagine that? I can\'t.', '', 161375, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He and the others have been guiding me since I heard the calling when I was little.', '', 161374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ulfar can be a hard teacher, but he\'s fair.', '', 161373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on!', '', 161372, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! $n! Over here!', '', 161371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way to Ulfar\'s grove can be a bit precarious. Arthur, meet our friends at the head of the path.', '', 161370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure! I\'ll meet you there, $n!', '', 161369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your exploits have been the talk of Telogrus Rift, $p.\n\nI\'m grateful to have you by my side on this mission. Together, there\'s nothing that can stop us.', '', 161368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m doin\' me best ta keep the grounds clear \'round here.', 'I\'m doin\' me best ta keep the grounds clear \'round here.', 161367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With those devices disabled this area should be a wee bit safer... fer now.', 'With those devices disabled this area should be a wee bit safer... fer now.', 161366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind yer step.', 'Mind yer step.', 161365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve disarmed all the devices I\'ve found, but ye should still be careful out here!', 'I\'ve disarmed all the devices I\'ve found, but ye should still be careful out here!', 161364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yep, it\'s definitely fixed! Hey! Why don\'t we review those records that $n found?', 161363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see, it\'s good that you\'ve fixed it.', '', 161362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a lovely bloom.', '', 161361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Ha ha... well, the miniaturized containment field wasn\'t really working so well ten minutes ago.', 161360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kelsey, why didn\'t we just take this submarine over to the Isle of Fangs?', '', 161359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sit back and relax, I\'ll get us to the warport in no time flat!', 161358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Tideskipper is becoming frightened. Turn back now!', 'Your Tideskipper is becoming frightened. Turn back now!', 161357, 0, 64143, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrm... aphids... I\'ll have to deal with YOU later.', '', 161356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon little fella. Sprout.', '', 161355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, nothing makes this work better than the delicate fragrance of aethril.', '', 161354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yojamba Isle was an expedition many years ago to Stranglethorn Vale. I was part of the forces who crushed the return of Hakkar to this world. We provided armaments of glory to de heroes who fought that vile abomination of a loa.\n\nWhen we returned victorious to Zandalar, I made de mistake of overplaying my victory with the Prophet Zul. I may have said some things in public that did not go over well.\n\nNow I serve treats.', '', 161353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You begin to stop paying attention to the story. Turn back now!', 'You begin to stop paying attention to the story. Turn back now!', 161352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, $p. I admire how quickly you have risen through the ranks of the Alliance. \n\nBut I am even more pleased that you continue to resist the whispers.\n\nWar is chaotic and savage. No matter what you witness--what you experience--you must never lose control. Do not let the shadows overtake your will.\n\nThe Alliance is counting on you.\n\nI am counting on you.', 161351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is or was Yojamba?', 'What is or was Yojamba?', 161350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance are attacking, we must tell de king!', 'De Alliance are attacking, we must tell de king!', 161349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance are here, warn de mainland!', 'De Alliance are here, warn de mainland!', 161348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are under attack by de Alliance, I must warn de mainland!', 'We are under attack by de Alliance, I must warn de mainland!', 161347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance are attacking, we must warn de others!', 'De Alliance are attacking, we must warn de others!', 161346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let your guard down, Umbric. This is an ambitious plan. If any one thing goes wrong, many lives will be lost.', 161345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose this task isn\'t as suicidal as I once thought.', '', 161344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not mean offense, Halford, but what you propose is a suicidal task. The Zandalari wiped out the last fleet that breached their shores.', '', 161343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, as it stands, our losses would be catastrophic if we attempted any major naval landfall here.', '', 161342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their naval defenses blew apart the last fleet that got near the island, and they were just chasing after some princess in a boat.', '', 161341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buried goods?', 'Buried goods?', 161340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, I guess...', 'Thanks, I guess...', 161339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have something you want to talk about?', 'You have something you want to talk about?', 161338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s hot in here.', 'It\'s hot in here.', 161337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You gesture around the area.>', '<You gesture around the area.>', 161336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were saying?', 'You were saying?', 161335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This what you had in mind?', 'This what you had in mind?', 161334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there, don\'t be afraid.', '', 161333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, should even be enough for a tip!', '', 161332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, sometin I tucked away before they caught me. All you need ta do is find the tower just off the Rootway near the river in Nazmir. It be der at the foot.', '', 161331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel I\'s owe you your deposit from way back. So I be lett\'n you in on my buried goods.', '', 161330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to admit, you be da best guide a skull could ask for.', '', 161329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel\'n fine. Seems like a cozy place.', '', 161328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Did I tell ya, I  ov\'r heard one of those charcoal half pints claim he lived in a volcano.', '', 161327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, so, it can hap\'n... you be turning blue... and don\'t you be leav\'n me here.', '', 161326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I almost setup a racing ring in Vol\'dun. Me partner worried another cataclysm might put us under water and backed out. Plus we had no money, dey took it, when we exiled.', '', 161325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That tis not a real reptile... Don\'t tell him I said that.', '', 161324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got da\' big reptiles in Zandalar, nun be big\'r in all of time.', '', 161323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I feel colder, dat possible?', '', 161322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever see a saber in the snow? That be a crazy idea, snow that is.', '', 161321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis place seems pleasant. I could haunt here.', '', 161320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we go\'n ta visit somewhere nice?', '', 161319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, we moved into that farm in hopes we could turn our lives around. Things hadn\'t been going well in the city and Ancel was really struggling in school. His dad and I thought it would be best to get out of the hustle and bustle and find a slower pace in the country. \n\nI had to give up my arcane studies and dedicate my efforts to getting the farm to produce. Things weren\'t easy, it was hard work, we were living off scraps for quite some time. Each time Raimond thought he was having a breakthrough, inevitably, something would go terribly awry.\n\nThat\'s when we decided it would be best if I resumed my pursuit of the arcane. I\'ve been travelling, improving my abilities, and supporting my family by offering my talents to those with the coin.', 161318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tis a bit cold here isn\'t it? Or dat jus me?', '', 161317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place look intrestin.', '', 161316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, where we be today?', '', 161315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks...?', 'Thanks...?', 161314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have to save it for another time.', 'We will have to save it for another time.', 161313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
