('', 'You have shown great courage and honor. I have conveyed to King Rastakhan dat you might be someone whom we can trust with more important endeavors.\n\nNow, watch your back, for I have no doubt unfriendly eyes are watching you.', 161240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
