('And Domenic, with shaking hands and wide eyes, realized the sea had answered his call.', 'And Domenic, with shaking hands and wide eyes, realized the sea had answered his call.', 161237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the waters receded. The beast was impaled on the rocks!', 'But the waters receded. The beast was impaled on the rocks!', 161236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It lifted the fleeing ships over the rocks! The hunting Kraken swam after its escaping prey!', 'It lifted the fleeing ships over the rocks! The hunting Kraken swam after its escaping prey!', 161234, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really need to calibrate my surveying equipment before my next outing.', 161233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then suddenly, a kraken, three times the size of the one that hunted them, formed from the waters!', 'Then suddenly, a kraken, three times the size of the one that hunted them, formed from the waters!', 161231, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We\'re dead!\" cried the crew.', '\"We\'re dead!\" cried the crew.', 161229, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Massive stones suddenly rose ahead of them in the waters.', 'Massive stones suddenly rose ahead of them in the waters.', 161228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaving through the rocks, Domenic\'s direction was true, but the kraken gained ground in the chase!', 'Weaving through the rocks, Domenic\'s direction was true, but the kraken gained ground in the chase!', 161227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"To port!\" Domenic cried in a panic, a tug like the tides pulling him in that direction. The ship turned. \"Starboard ahead!\" Again his sister followed his direction.', '\"To port!\" Domenic cried in a panic, a tug like the tides pulling him in that direction. The ship turned. \"Starboard ahead!\" Again his sister followed his direction.', 161226, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A massive kraken, bigger than their largest ship, rose from the depths!', 'A massive kraken, bigger than their largest ship, rose from the depths!', 161225, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But when they arrived, the ships found they were the ones being hunted.', 'But when they arrived, the ships found they were the ones being hunted.', 161224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I believe the seas will be calm and the winds sure,\" Domenic said. The small hunting fleet marveled at the speed of their journey as his prediction proved true.', '\"I believe the seas will be calm and the winds sure,\" Domenic said. The small hunting fleet marveled at the speed of their journey as his prediction proved true.', 161223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"They are dangerous!\" the crew cried! \"The ship will be smashed to bits!\"', '\"They are dangerous!\" the crew cried! \"The ship will be smashed to bits!\"', 161222, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her brother considered the question for a long while, as if listening to a song no one else could hear. Then he pointed. \"My gut says the shoals near Kalimdor.\"', 'Her brother considered the question for a long while, as if listening to a song no one else could hear. Then he pointed. \"My gut says the shoals near Kalimdor.\"', 161221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Brother, where do you think we should hunt?\" she asked, for his intuition had never steered her wrong.', '\"Brother, where do you think we should hunt?\" she asked, for his intuition had never steered her wrong.', 161220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korralyn decided they needed to hunt elsewhere.', 'Korralyn decided they needed to hunt elsewhere.', 161219, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day they set sail, hunting for Kraken to feed the fleet, but there were none to be found in the usual spots! For weeks they could not find food, the situation growing more dire!', 'One day they set sail, hunting for Kraken to feed the fleet, but there were none to be found in the usual spots! For weeks they could not find food, the situation growing more dire!', 161218, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day they set sail, hunting for Kraken to feed the fleet, but there were none to be found in the usual spots!', 'One day they set sail, hunting for Kraken to feed the fleet, but there were none to be found in the usual spots!', 161217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He seemed to know the sea in a way no one else did; when the storms would come, when the tides would change and where to fish for food.', 'He seemed to know the sea in a way no one else did; when the storms would come, when the tides would change and where to fish for food.', 161215, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
