('So all were surprised when Koralynn picked him for the crew in her first command - including Domenic!', 'So all were surprised when Koralynn picked him for the crew in her first command - including Domenic!', 161211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The less said about his attempts to run a galley the better!', 'The less said about his attempts to run a galley the better!', 161210, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
