('She studied the charts of stars, currents and hunting grounds. She watched the sailors and learned.', 'She studied the charts of stars, currents and hunting grounds. She watched the sailors and learned.', 161203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
