('Miimii the mummy looks up at you, expectantly.', 'Miimii the mummy looks up at you, expectantly.', 161196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fish? Guess I\'ll die.', '', 161195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feels like forever since I last ate.', '', 161194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothin\' bitin\'? STILL?!', '', 161193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been witness to many momentous occasions. I have seen history unfold, conflicts resolve and renew themselves, betrayals, and great victories.\n\nThis is a defeat as sure as any. Zul bested us at each turn and achieved his ultimate goal. We cannot let this be the end.\n\nThe coming conflict with this ancient foe, a foe these people have faced since the dawn of their race, will shape the fate of the Horde and Zandalari alike. We will answer their call. We will make right that which Zul made wrong.\n\nBe ready, be vigilant, and do not falter, $n.', '', 161192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was afraid I was not going to be able to get these supplies to your army. Thank you, and please take these resources as a reward.', 161191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know what the Zandalari king is thinking at this moment, but I know we cannot let these events deter us from our goal. The Zandalari must endure this conflict. The Horde has pledged its swords in defense of these people and we may well stand alone if their gods will not save them.\n\nNow, more than ever, they will look to you. Represent us well, Speaker of the Horde.', '', 161190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh wow, I thought I was totally dead. Then there you were! Just for that I will upgrade your army\'s armor. Thanks!', 161189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yearning for magic and faraway lands? Or is it that the war is taking you away from us for awhile?\n\nIf you\'re looking for the portals to Stormwind City, Ironforge, and the Exodar, you\'ll find them on the lower level of Tradewinds Market on the south side. Look for the chamber right next to that strange ethereal transmogrifier.', 'Yearning for magic and faraway lands? Or is it that the war is taking you away from us for awhile?\n\nIf you\'re looking for the portals to Stormwind City, Ironforge, and the Exodar, you\'ll find them on the lower level of Tradewinds Market on the south side. Look for the chamber right next to that strange ethereal transmogrifier.', 161188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must keep hope. Jaina may yet live.', 161187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see the darkness in your eyes. Your next effort will shred the mind and you shall become another phantom to haunt me.$b$bYou are not ready. Return when you are and the next task will be waiting. The corruption has had eternity to fester and grow. A few days are of little import, in the end.', '', 161186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found this clue in Ashvane\'s offices.', 'I found this clue in Ashvane\'s offices.', 161185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you finally got around to saving me, aye? Well, I guess I owe you one. Maybe I can repay you by upgrading your army\'s weapons.', '', 161184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I refuse to believe Jaina  is dead.', 161183, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I\'m lovin\' this Tradewinds Kolsch! It\'s crushable!\n\nI think I\'ll throw this one back and get another!', '', 161181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the beer here. It\'s some of my favorite!\n\nCheers!', '', 161180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our brewery!\n\nI hope you enjoy the beers we have to offer. If you are looking to purchase kegs for an event, just give me a shout.\n\nIn the meantime, why don\'t you enjoy a pour?', '', 161179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 250, 0, 39653),
('There you are! Zul\'s forces tried to oust us but the Horde demonstrated its strength. The fighting is done for now.\n\nWe had reason to suspect Zul was working against us. I did not think he would act so soon, or so decisively. I suppose his abilities as a Prophet were not overstated.\n\nWe must act to preserve our new allies. Go, and do what you can to restore King Rastakhan to power. The Horde will maintain order here.', '', 161178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De power dat first sat on dis throne ruled over all civilized people in dis world.\n\nNow look at us, our power choked to a single island. Even de lesser trolls defy our power.\n\nIt will not always be dis way.', '', 161177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you come in on that new ship?  Tell me all about its structural architecture over a beer!', '', 161176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another day, another brew!\n\nWhat\'s your favorite kind of beer?', '', 161175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 200, 0, 39653),
('Something need fixing?', '', 161174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink up!', '', 161173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My daughter believes de threats in Nazmir are so great dat we must throw our entire army at our northern border. \n\nShe is young and impatient. She does not understand dat de blood trolls have pestered our people for generations. \n\nIf she believes de Horde can help her, den I look forward to seeing what you will accomplish. She could use experience in dealing with foreign powers.\n\nIf she comes to harm, know dat I will burn your Horde to ash and turn dat pitiful collection of rowboats you call a fleet to floating debris.\n\nGood luck.', '', 161172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheers everyone!', '', 161171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon as I finish my drink, I\'m gonna get over there and help them out with that.', '', 161170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion sent word that the Burning Legion is attacking Broken Shore!', '', 161169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande and I were a couple before I met Mildred here.', '', 161168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got right to work, saved every keg of rum!', '', 161167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boat went down, people drowning everywhere, thirty kegs of Tiragarde rum headed to the bottom.', '', 161166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a single decent Stout in the Dreamgrove.  That\'s why I never go there.', '', 161165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All aboard for Zuldazar!', '', 161164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All aboard for the Echo Isles!', '', 161163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not the coming tides of war $p. Only when we are truly tested do our strongest selves emerge.', '', 161162, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve gotta convince the king ta\' assign me ta\' a more temperate clime!', '', 161161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The conflict is just beginning $p. I hope you are prepared for the trials of war.', '', 161160, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel like I be needin\' a raise to work here. Danger pay, $r! Danger pay!', '', 161159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may light meself on fire if I get bittin\' by anymore bugs in me nether regions. I hate this place!', '', 161158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are welcome to send their strongest soldiers against us. I would love nothing more than to test my blade against a worthy foe.', '', 161157, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Tis so hot! Do ye see the sweat tricklin\' down me beard?', '', 161156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you see an opportunity to lend a hand, please do so. There\'s no need to wait for permission in these perilous times.', '', 161155, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, this be one of the fastest ships in Zandalar. We get you to your destination.', '', 161154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to eliminate the Horde, we must be cunning and precise. There\'s no room for error.', '', 161153, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now arriving in the Echo Isles!', '', 161152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now arriving in Zuldazar!', '', 161151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just reordered the kegs light to dark.\n\nBut maybe I should make it alphabetical? By date? Maybe by malt?', '', 161150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, dear. Are you looking for a trustworthy companion? A critter to cuddle close in stormy weather? A best friend to share in life\'s joys and hardships?', 161149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm... dis takes me back... learnin\' to mine... Secott always tellin\' me... de trick was hitting it with yer pick at an angle... keeps de... ore....', 'Blech! Too much sunfruit...', 161148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you Commander, we would have died if you had not saved us! We will return to our posts immediately!', '', 161147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat tasted like \"mule\", alright.', 'Dat tasted like \"mule\", alright.', 161146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see our victory.', 'I can see our victory.', 161145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always hated this forest.', 'I always hated this forest.', 161144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was... was dat a bucket of dirty mop water?', 'Was... was dat a bucket of dirty mop water?', 161143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will take the tree.', 'We will take the tree.', 161142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmruf! Ahh, I hate gin, mon!', 'Mmruf! Ahh, I hate gin, mon!', 161141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da ship should have left Zandalar and be on her way here now even as we speak.', 161140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least I died in battle.', 'At least I died in battle.', 161139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She all da way cross da ocean at Zandalar. She be comin\' back soon, don\'t ya worry.', 161138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re nothing but an inconvenience.', 'You\'re nothing but an inconvenience.', 161137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat tasted like death, mon.', 'Dat tasted like death, mon.', 161136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da ship just departed for Zandalar. She be back real soon now.', 161135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She be right here in front of ya. Get on!', 161134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, what is dis? Tortollan wine?', 'Ugh, what is dis? Tortollan wine?', 161133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend pairing our Hook Point Porter with some delicious Roasted Lasher Seeds.\n\nDon\'t let the seeds fool you. The roasted, toasted flavors of the lasher seeds really sing when paired with the malty, rich depth of the beer. It may be a strange sounding pairing, but tides help me is it one of my favorites.', '', 161132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blech! Too much sunfruit...', 'Blech! Too much sunfruit...', 161131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend pairing our Patina Pale Ale with my favorite comfort food, Col. Tenders Spiced Chicken.\n\nThe light honey of the beer works wonders to balance the spiciness of the chicken. It serves as a wonderful wheaty palate cleanser when the spice gets too overwhelming!', '', 161130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi! Are you here to see my collection?', '', 161129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I implore you to follow her example. Bend, so you do not break. And drop your foes upon a rock when you are finished with them!', 'I implore you to follow her example. Bend, so you do not break. And drop your foes upon a rock when you are finished with them!', 161128, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It be uncertain, but dere be a storm brewin\' just over da horizon.', 161127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds bring more than storms and trade. They bring change. Change that Pa\'ku has taught us to weather.', 'The winds bring more than storms and trade. They bring change. Change that Pa\'ku has taught us to weather.', 161126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I was just *hic!* thinkin\' of grabbin\' a drink...', 'And I was just *hic!* thinkin\' of grabbin\' a drink...', 161125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve already lost!', 'You\'ve already lost!', 161124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll take what\'s ours!', 'We\'ll take what\'s ours!', 161123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look beyond de spiteful words of them that broke against de storm. Look instead to those who bent.', 'Look beyond de spiteful words of them that broke against de storm. Look instead to those who bent.', 161122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whacha got?', 'Whacha got?', 161121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is said to be wanton, quick to anger, and fickle. But I challenge you to look closer.', 'She is said to be wanton, quick to anger, and fickle. But I challenge you to look closer.', 161120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the honor of dying to me.', 'You have the honor of dying to me.', 161119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free drink?', 'Free drink?', 161118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis had better be good...', 'Dis had better be good...', 161117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her winds bring de rain, fill our sails, and send our ships over de seas. Her might is all that we are!', 'Her winds bring de rain, fill our sails, and send our ships over de seas. Her might is all that we are!', 161116, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend pairing our Pontoon Pilsner with our zesty Salted Tideway Cod.\n\nThe bright bitterness of the beer contrasts the sweetness of the cod rather nicely, while the hops adds a spicy complement to the fish\'s notable saltiness.', '', 161115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Headin\' ta Zandalar? Dat\'s where da ship dat dock here be goin\', mon.', 161114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m coming my love...', 'I\'m coming my love...', 161113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Amani Mule', 'Offer Amani Mule', 161112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Jani Juice', 'Offer Jani Juice', 161111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Mojo\'ito', 'Offer Mojo\'ito', 161110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Zul\'s Gin', 'Offer Zul\'s Gin', 161109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Bwonzombie', 'Offer Bwonzombie', 161108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Grotto Punch', 'Offer Grotto Punch', 161107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend pairing our Drop Anchor Dunkel with a nice Hatherford Brunost.\n\nI adore a good beer and cheese pairing, and these two marry together perfectly. Each has a smooth layer of caramel, and pairing them together brings out the best of it in both.', '', 161106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer Trolwhip', 'Offer Trolwhip', 161105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death take you...', 'Death take you...', 161104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My pets only grow stronger when an ally falls in battle.', 161103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are the birds so quiet?', 'Why are the birds so quiet?', 161102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Tyrande will stop you.', 'Lady Tyrande will stop you.', 161101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The species of Zandalar are unrivaled in power, your other pets stand no chance.', 161100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never corner a wounded nightsaber...', 'Never corner a wounded nightsaber...', 161099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is ours!', 'This land is ours!', 161098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is most unexpected, I will win next time we meet, stranger.', 161097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like I have an advantage on my home turf.', 161096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much for honor.', 'So much for honor.', 161095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You come to face me in my own home? Good luck.', 161094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to kill you, but I will.', 'I don\'t want to kill you, but I will.', 161093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe this isn\'t the strongest new species out here, I should keep looking for better things to capture.', 161092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recommend pairing our Snowberry Berliner with none other than a Snowberry Custard!\n\nWith this pairing you experience both sides of the snowberry\'s flavor profile: the sour in the beer and the delicate sweetness in the custard. The creaminess of the custard counteracts the pucker of the beer for a whimsical flavor adventure.', '', 161091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s probably going to leave a scar.', 161090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need more time to train with these new species, I will be stronger when we next battle.', 161089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like I said, the critters in this land are vicious.  Good fight either way.', 161088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The critters in this land are vicious, I hope you\'re ready for this.', 161087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry little one, I will take care of you.', 161086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything must die.', 'Everything must die.', 161085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be sad about losing that one, your other pets look plenty strong.', 161084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just wanted to protect my home.', 'I just wanted to protect my home.', 161083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess I may be out of practice.', 161082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope to dream...', 'I hope to dream...', 161081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My goodness, I guess I had a stronger team than I realized.', 161080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The leaves fall...', 'The leaves fall...', 161079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I had time to kill you slowly.', 'I wish I had time to kill you slowly.', 161078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have not battled in a long while, I hope I am still a good challenge to you.', 161077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Claws out!', 'Claws out!', 161076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorns pierce you!', 'Thorns pierce you!', 161075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wasn\'t ready, this doesn\'t count!', 161074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will avenge the forest!', 'I will avenge the forest!', 161073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like my win streak is about to increase.', 161072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I recommend pairing our Tradewinds Kolsch with my house made Caraway Rye Loaf.\n\nThe breadiness of the beer pairs very nicely with the earthiness of the bread, while also cleansing the palate with its carbonation.', '', 161071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This doesn\'t really count as a loss, I\'m keeping my win streak.', 161070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hooray, my winning streak increases!', 161069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m on a winning streak, you have no chance against me and my team.', 161068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_HAUNT.BLP:20|tThe Avatar is no longer  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274148|h[Tainted]|h|r, your heals are now fully effective!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_HAUNT.BLP:20|tThe Avatar is no longer  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274148|h[Tainted]|h|r, your heals are now fully effective!', 161067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not cower in the face of defeat, rise up to the challenge if you can.', '', 161066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to buy some food.', 'I\'d like to buy some food.', 161065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory is within my grasp, I can almost feel it.', '', 161064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give thanks to Gonk, run with his pack, and know the other ways remain open to you. This is his gift to de Zandalari.', 'Give thanks to Gonk, run with his pack, and know the other ways remain open to you. This is his gift to de Zandalari.', 161063, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
