('You were at my side in the Undercity. We had them cornered! Justice was within my grasp!', '', 160938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $Gbrother:sister;, you look like you could use a drink. Want a beer?', '', 160937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just started a new brew with top of the line Stormsong honey.\n\nWe paid a pretty copper for it, but I wholeheartedly believe it\'ll be worth it!', '', 160936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interested in a pint? I\'ve also made some coffee if you need a pick me up!', 160935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I going to be a richmon! Woo!', 'I going to be a richmon! Woo!', 160934, 0, 63408, 4, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your loa is not welcome here! Begone!', 'Your loa is not welcome here! Begone!', 160933, 0, 63408, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De God of Garbage gives you his boon! Ahahaha!', 'De God of Garbage gives you his boon! Ahahaha!', 160932, 0, 63408, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De others will tell you that their loa be de most generous, or de strongest, or quickest to anger.', 'De others will tell you that their loa be de most generous, or de strongest, or quickest to anger.', 160931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha! It be time to give praise to everymon\'s loa! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to celebrate Jani!', 'Ahahaha! It be time to give praise to everymon\'s loa! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to celebrate Jani!', 160930, 0, 63408, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If she is running on schedule, de ship has departed de Echo Isles and will arrive shortly.', '', 160929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of Zandalar! It is time to give praise to de lord of winds, queen of de skies, matron of de sea! Come to de steps and give praise to Pa\'ku!', 'People of Zandalar! It is time to give praise to de lord of winds, queen of de skies, matron of de sea! Come to de steps and give praise to Pa\'ku!', 160928, 0, 61441, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of you who stand before me have felt de blessing of Pa\'ku, my loa.', 'All of you who stand before me have felt de blessing of Pa\'ku, my loa.', 160927, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise Pa\'ku! May her winds fill your sails!', 'Praise Pa\'ku! May her winds fill your sails!', 160926, 0, 61441, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk graces us with his boon! May de pack be with you always!', 'Gonk graces us with his boon! May de pack be with you always!', 160925, 0, 61442, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be welcome, brothers and sisters, and know that de spirit of Gonk is with us this day.', 'Be welcome, brothers and sisters, and know that de spirit of Gonk is with us this day.', 160924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People of Zandalar! De loa of shapes seeks de praise of his people. Come, let us raise our voices for de lord of de pack, de most generous of loa! Praise Gonk!', 'People of Zandalar! De loa of shapes seeks de praise of his people. Come, let us raise our voices for de lord of de pack, de most generous of loa! Praise Gonk!', 160923, 0, 61442, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fellow Zandalari! De mighty Krag\'wa has returned! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give tribute to de great guardian!', 'My fellow Zandalari! De mighty Krag\'wa has returned! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give tribute to de great guardian!', 160922, 0, 61466, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many have said to me- Krag\'wa? De great toad? Such a loa is myth! Fiction!', 'Many have said to me- Krag\'wa? De great toad? Such a loa is myth! Fiction!', 160921, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De great guardian offers his protection! Krag\'wa be praised!', 'De great guardian offers his protection! Krag\'wa be praised!', 160920, 0, 61466, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi watches us all. Be worthy of his boon, brothers and sisters!', 'Bwonsamdi watches us all. Be worthy of his boon, brothers and sisters!', 160919, 0, 63138, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sure you all be knowing all about Bwonsamdi. You be thinking, aye, de loa of death.', 'I sure you all be knowing all about Bwonsamdi. You be thinking, aye, de loa of death.', 160918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spirits be with us! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give praise to him that keeps our dead. Give thanks to Bwonsamdi!', 'De spirits be with us! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give praise to him that keeps our dead. Give thanks to Bwonsamdi!', 160917, 0, 63138, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ship is at de Echo Isles. I am sure she will set sail and return to us shortly.', '', 160916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t pay attention to the chalkboard. It\'s a work in progress.', 160915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have just missed her. She is on her way to de Echo Isles. De ship will be back soon.', '', 160914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fellow Zandalari! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to hear de wisdom of de King of Cats, Prey\'s Doom, de Lord of Beasts. Praise Kimbul!', 'My fellow Zandalari! Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to hear de wisdom of de King of Cats, Prey\'s Doom, de Lord of Beasts. Praise Kimbul!', 160913, 0, 61468, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give you de words of my loa. He spoke thus to his followers:', 'I give you de words of my loa. He spoke thus to his followers:', 160912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Prey\'s Doom blesses your hunts! Go forth!', 'The Prey\'s Doom blesses your hunts! Go forth!', 160911, 0, 61468, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bask in de blessing of Akunda!', 'Bask in de blessing of Akunda!', 160910, 0, 61469, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will share with you de wisdom of Akunda. He is de loa of storms, of new beginnings.', 'I will share with you de wisdom of Akunda. He is de loa of storms, of new beginnings.', 160909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A storm approaches! Let de rain wash away your worries, brothers and sisters. Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give praise to Akunda!', 'A storm approaches! Let de rain wash away your worries, brothers and sisters. Come to de steps of Dazar\'alor to give praise to Akunda!', 160908, 0, 61469, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, it is here, my friend. Get on board before she sets sail.', '', 160907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true fan! What a delight! You must be in a daze meeting me. Do not worry your little precious head, I am just a regular adventurer, like yourself. Except I am an unbelievably wealthy award-winning author, whose fans cross oceans for even the chance to meet me.\n\nHere is your book. I am sure you will cherish it.', '', 160906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another day, another beer! Have you tried anything exceptionally delicious yet?', '', 160905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a death knight? I\'ve always wanted to meet one!\n\nWhat\'s undeath like? Did you want to be a death knight? I do. Where can I sign up?', '', 160904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you please sign my book?', 'Would you please sign my book?', 160903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My latest work is a true masterpiece. A literary jewel, drug from the depths of the seas, to dazzle and seduce the reader. Are you here to sing my praises?', '', 160902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To be honest, I am not certain at de moment. Let us hope de Alliance did not get dem.', '', 160901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be able to hold Mythrax for long. Slay Zul while there is still time.', '', 160900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me! Thank you so much! I got a reward for you, somewhere in this bag.', '', 160899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to your city, hero. I will hold the Northern road from these vile sethrak.', '', 160898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought I would see the streets of Zuldazar overrun by any enemy...', 160897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are de defenses? Has Zuldazar grown so weak from Zul\'s betrayal it cannot defend itself?\n\nI had Meerah rush us to get here in time to warn de royal guards, but dere are so few left. It will fall to us to defend what remains.', 160896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wouldn\'t believe the route we had to take to get here before the sethrak. If your friends didn\'t have my help they never would have made it over those mountains in time.\n\nOh, and we brought Akunda and Kimbul. Akunda is covering our backs and I don\'t know where Kimbul went but he said something about \"rending the enemy\" or something.\n\nAll I know is that we saw a LOT of sethrak coming this way. A LOT!', 160895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell us about the Horde\'s movements in the area?', 'Can you tell us about the Horde\'s movements in the area?', 160894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was done for back there. You have my thanks, $r. They still call your kind a $r, right?', 'I thought I was done for back there. You have my thanks, $r. They still call your kind a $r, right?', 160893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look like a tall drink of water! Or maybe beer!', 160892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see your beer list.', 'Let me see your beer list.', 160891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I interest you in a beer? We have options for every palate!', 160890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, you made short work of them. You know, if you wanted I could maybe supply your troops with some new armor. Free of charge!', '', 160889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using Barbed Shot will also shorten the time before you can use Bestial Wrath again.', 160888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m prepping as fast as I can!', '', 160887, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chop faster, Colton! We\'ve got customers to feed!', 160886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Barbed Shot will also shorten the time before you can use Bestial Wrath again.', '', 160885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go, girl!', '', 160884, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ya ready?', '', 160883, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it time to play, Luna?', '', 160882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is fortunate I found such a brilliant wife.', '', 160881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a surprise for you!', 160880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is fascinating, have you seen it?', 160879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I don\'t know, maybe find me someone nice, settle down on a little farm somewhere...\n\nWhat do you THINK I\'m gonna do, mate?!\n\nI\'m gonna get my money from Cyrus, buy everyone a round at The Snug Harbor, and look for the next adventure.\n\nOnly way to live, my friend.', '', 160878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will you do now?', 'What will you do now?', 160877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invasions, coups, rise of the old gods, bah! I am not leaving this Zocalo until Old Tella here pays me back.', '', 160876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is nothing. During de third war I witnessed de great bone dance of de Rootway. It was de most scarousing ting I ever seen.', '', 160875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear, if I survive dis, I promise not to swindle my customers for at least two... maybe three weeks.', '', 160874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the ship now?', 'Where is the ship now?', 160873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will send all that I can to aid you, $n.', 160872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stood in the wake of the scourge when it stormed across Zul\'Drak, and yet this attack on my homeland by those we trusted as friends.... \n\nWell, I am normally not a violent troll, but I do believe I may need to kill someone for dis.', 160871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archdruid, Malfurion requires your aid in Darkshore!', 'Archdruid, Malfurion requires your aid in Darkshore!', 160870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priestess, we require your aid to hold the Horde at Wildbend River.', 'Priestess, we require your aid to hold the Horde at Wildbend River.', 160869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re helping de princess. Dat\'s good. You keep doing dat. Destroy de blood troll threat before it consumes us all.\n\nDe person you want to speak with is at de Zul\'jan Ruins. Her name is Provisioner Lija. She will help you with what you need.', 'You\'re helping de princess. Dat\'s good. You keep doing dat. Destroy de blood troll threat before it consumes us all.\n\nDe person you want to speak with is at de Zul\'jan Ruins. Her name is Provisioner Lija. She will help you with what you need.', 160868, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is in the best interests of the Warchief that you do everything to ensure the Zandalari and their fleet join the Horde. To that end, continue to support Talanji. If that means destroying every last Blood Troll, see it done.\n\nYou will find her emissary in Nazmir at the Zul\'jan Ruins. You\'re looking for Provisioner Lija. Dark Lady watch over you.', 'It is in the best interests of the Warchief that you do everything to ensure the Zandalari and their fleet join the Horde. To that end, continue to support Talanji. If that means destroying every last Blood Troll, see it done.\n\nYou will find her emissary in Nazmir at the Zul\'jan Ruins. You\'re looking for Provisioner Lija. Dark Lady watch over you.', 160867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji\'s Expedition Emissary', 'Talanji\'s Expedition Emissary', 160866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Kul Tirans have interesting beer!\n\nIt is much more flavorful than what I have found on the mainland. They are truly dedicated to their craft!', '', 160865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make for Princess Talanji and Warguard Rakera.', 'Make for Princess Talanji and Warguard Rakera.', 160864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood cultists, sethrak, mogu, and even our own Zul? I miss de simple days when we were just trying to take over de world.', 160863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though our long war against the Legion has ended, the Horde cannot afford a moment of respite.', 160862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the Legion has fallen, a new threat rises. Disturbing messages are arriving from our operatives in Orgrimmar. Join me at Stormwind Keep to discuss the matter further.', '', 160861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Ruff Waters! Looking for supplies for your good good boy or girl?', '', 160860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It started with three cats. Three cats! That seemed reasonable!\n\nBut then a friend moved away and needed to rehome her cat. Then I found a sad-looking stray on the street. A neighbor passed away. One had kittens. A couple just... showed up!\n\nI love each and every one of them. I wouldn\'t trade any of them for the world.', 160859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('Yay! Again!', '', 160858, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None of these pups are mine. I lost my sweet Willoughby many years ago. So, I come here to find the loneliest one each day. I pet them and tell them what a good dog they are.', '', 160857, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would do anything for my dog.', '', 160856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is my dog, Bucket. He\'s really good at digging!\n\nI put him up here so I can give him better pets. I think he\'s just happy to be here.', '', 160855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\artifactability_BloodDeathknight_UmbilicusEternus.blp:20|t Make sure at least one player stands in each area targeted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:266948|h[Plague Bomb]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\artifactability_BloodDeathknight_UmbilicusEternus.blp:20|t Make sure at least one player stands in each area targeted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:266948|h[Plague Bomb]|h|r!', 160854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Priest_Void Blast.blp:20|t You have over 50 stacks of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:272146|h[Annihilation]|h|r! Seek out Essence Fragments to regain maximum hit points!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Priest_Void Blast.blp:20|t You have over 50 stacks of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:272146|h[Annihilation]|h|r! Seek out Essence Fragments to regain maximum hit points!', 160853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard you needed some help with the Ettins.', 'I heard you needed some help with the Ettins.', 160852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 160851, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ensure that King Anduin personally hears of your heroics today. Exceptional work, everyone.', '', 160850, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a special recognition to High Thane Falstad and the entire Wildhammer clan.', '', 160849, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a long way from home, $r.$b$bI will ask de spirits to watch over you while you are in Vol\'dun, but I should warn you, dey do not listen to me anymore.', 'You are a long way from home, $r.$b$bI will ask de spirits to watch over you while you are in Vol\'dun, but I should warn you, dey do not listen to me anymore.', 160848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere\'s no escape from dis heat.', 'Dere\'s no escape from dis heat.', 160847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witless cur! I\'ll have your head for that!', 'Witless cur! I\'ll have your head for that!', 160846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
