('Don\'t let \'em near the cannons!', 'Don\'t let \'em near the cannons!', 160821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t touch that!', 'Don\'t touch that!', 160820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from that!', 'Get away from that!', 160819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw me... overboard...', 'Throw me... overboard...', 160818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you... and your king...', 'Curse you... and your king...', 160817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re trapped out here... with us...', 'You\'re trapped out here... with us...', 160816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For... my Warchief...', 'For... my Warchief...', 160815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance dog...', 'Alliance dog...', 160814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was... supposed to be... easy...', 'This was... supposed to be... easy...', 160813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nathanos... will... finish you... off...', 'Nathanos... will... finish you... off...', 160812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For...the Banshee... Queen...', 'For...the Banshee... Queen...', 160811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I smelled an ugly $pr.', 'I knew I smelled an ugly $pr.', 160810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll cleave you to the brisket!', 'I\'ll cleave you to the brisket!', 160809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone tell Nathanos!', 'Someone tell Nathanos!', 160808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 160807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Dark Lady!', 'For the Dark Lady!', 160806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get \'em!', 'Get \'em!', 160805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off of our boat!', 'Get off of our boat!', 160804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is here!', 'The Alliance is here!', 160803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreven will... end you...', 'Dreven will... end you...', 160802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little... more... power...', 'Just a little... more... power...', 160801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... invincible...', 'I am... invincible...', 160800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you...', 'Curse you...', 160799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blood Prince... will... drain you dry...', 'The Blood Prince... will... drain you dry...', 160798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!', 'No!', 160797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep goin\'! Just a wee bit more...', '', 160796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One... last... drop...', 'One... last... drop...', 160795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... one... more...', 'Just... one... more...', 160794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll weep before I\'m done with you.', 'You\'ll weep before I\'m done with you.', 160793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but fuel for the san\'layn!', 'You are but fuel for the san\'layn!', 160792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! I think it\'s workin\'!', '', 160791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $pr... How curious.', 'A $pr... How curious.', 160790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll drain the flesh from your bones!', 'I\'ll drain the flesh from your bones!', 160789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look what wandered onto our ship.', 'Look what wandered onto our ship.', 160788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will hurt so good.', 'This will hurt so good.', 160787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me hear you scream.', 'Let me hear you scream.', 160786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, $pr...', 'Come closer, $pr...', 160785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c, huh? What brings you around these parts?\n\nAh, must be the imminent battle I suppose. Well then, this chatter has left me rather parched.\n\nNow, if you\'ll excuse me, I must continue my preparations.', '', 160784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battle awaits. A $c such as yourself would do well within our ranks.', '', 160783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with us to safety. We will not harm you.', 'Come with us to safety. We will not harm you.', 160782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, don\'t take me!', 'Please, don\'t take me!', 160781, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde... here?', 'The Horde... here?', 160780, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here, it\'s too late...', 'Get out of here, it\'s too late...', 160779, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should be a time of festivities! However, this ever-changing world often makes that hard. I can help you, if you\'d like to join the celebrations!', '', 160778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Punch him.>', '<Punch him.>', 160777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roko sends his regards.', 'Roko sends his regards.', 160776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember me?', 'Remember me?', 160775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What business do you have with de exiles and refuse of de sands? Vol\'dun is where we send troublemakers to die.\n\nStill, you are trusted. Okay, listen closely. You\'re looking for one of de vulpera. Her name is Hoarder Jena, and you might be able to find her at a place dey call de Vulpera Hideaway.', 'What business do you have with de exiles and refuse of de sands? Vol\'dun is where we send troublemakers to die.\n\nStill, you are trusted. Okay, listen closely. You\'re looking for one of de vulpera. Her name is Hoarder Jena, and you might be able to find her at a place dey call de Vulpera Hideaway.', 160774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to beg for handouts like the rest of the stinking rabble outside?$B$BDon\'t waste your time. I\'m here on business.', 'Have you come to beg for handouts like the rest of the stinking rabble outside?$B$BDon\'t waste your time. I\'m here on business.', 160773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need with them? They\'re a bunch of scavengers and exiles. Has the Dark Lady asked you to bring them into the fold as well?\n\nWhatever the reason, you might try the Vulpera Hideaway up in Vol\'dun. There\'s a little fox lady there goes by the name, Hoarder Jena. She might be able to help you.', 'What do you need with them? They\'re a bunch of scavengers and exiles. Has the Dark Lady asked you to bring them into the fold as well?\n\nWhatever the reason, you might try the Vulpera Hideaway up in Vol\'dun. There\'s a little fox lady there goes by the name, Hoarder Jena. She might be able to help you.', 160772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voldunai Emissary', 'Voldunai Emissary', 160771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Storm\'s Wake are a good group of people if you ask me. If you\'re looking to speak with one of their leaders, you want to head up to Brennadam in Stormsong Valley.\n\nOnce there, look for Sister Lilyana. She can help you with whatever Wake business you have.', 'The Storm\'s Wake are a good group of people if you ask me. If you\'re looking to speak with one of their leaders, you want to head up to Brennadam in Stormsong Valley.\n\nOnce there, look for Sister Lilyana. She can help you with whatever Wake business you have.', 160770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm\'s Wake Emissary', 'Storm\'s Wake Emissary', 160769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 160768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, looks like we even scared the storm away.', '', 160767, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war is long overdue.\n\nThe Alliance cloaks itself in righteousness and piety. Rubbish! They spurn and revile anyone who does not fit into their narrow world-view.', '', 160766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 160765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seems I have been conscripted into service once again, to carry out yet another master\'s schemes.\n\nI will do what I must--say what I must--to live for another day.\n\nBut sooner or later this war will end. We must be ready for what follows.', 160764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 160763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subtlety and guile are our best weapons in this war, $n.', '', 160762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 160761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Wildhammers are on yer side, ye just gotta look tae the skies whenever yer in trouble!', '', 160759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The campaign proceeds apace, $n. You have certainly been doing your part.', '', 160758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How the Dark Lady will laugh... when I tell her that you died in a trap like the mongrel you are!', '', 160757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been looking forward to ending your meddlesome existence for some time.', '', 160756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this business over with.', '', 160755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Order of Embers? What\'s that? Sounds terribly mysterious.\n\nI did happen to hear about someone over at Arom\'s Stand in Drustvar far to the west. Goes by the name of Quartermaster Alcorn. You must know how to get there if you\'re asking me about this to begin with. Here, give me your map and I\'ll mark the location for you.', 'Order of Embers? What\'s that? Sounds terribly mysterious.\n\nI did happen to hear about someone over at Arom\'s Stand in Drustvar far to the west. Goes by the name of Quartermaster Alcorn. You must know how to get there if you\'re asking me about this to begin with. Here, give me your map and I\'ll mark the location for you.', 160754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fenlow sisters requested my assistance. The world has seen so many changes. Why should that stop our fun?', '', 160753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a member of the Bronze Dragonflight doing here?', 'What is a member of the Bronze Dragonflight doing here?', 160752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you enjoying the festivities?', '', 160751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Order of Embers Emissary', 'Order of Embers Emissary', 160750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. Wildhammers, stow yer stormhammers and maintain a holding pattern until I give the word.', '', 160749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not too close yet. I want to observe and formulate a plan before they know we\'re here.', 160748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There they are, General. Two battleships straight ahead. Forsaken.', '', 160747, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ximo says I should not talk to de customers.', '', 160746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die well, Grommash Hellscream.', 160745, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let his sacrifice be in vain! We go! NOW!', '', 160744, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I will stand with my Warchief!', 160743, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather round quickly! We have only one chance!', '', 160742, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Mag\'har! For Draenor! Lok-tar ogar!', '', 160741, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I managed to snag a few boxes of provisions before I left. You\'re welcome to some of them. You\'ll need your strength!', 160740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brothers and sisters have gone too far. It is up to us to right this wrong.', 160739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have some cots if you\'d like to rest. It\'s not much, but it\'s what we\'ve got.', 160738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Geya\'rah, get everyone out of here. Now. No questions.', '', 160737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grommash lowers his voice so only the Mag\'har can hear.>', '', 160736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It pains me to lose an old friend, Grommash. But... very well. We will settle this your way.', 160735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you be so blind, Yrel? It is the Light that has doomed this world!', '', 160734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your people are choking the life from this world... dooming the land to desiccation.', 160733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have come to offer you one last chance to embrace the Light.', 160732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Exarch. A rare... honor.', '', 160731, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grommash Hellscream. It has been a long time.', 160730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must! It is NOT our fate to fall to this corruption!', 160729, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boat to Kul Tiras has just arrived. All aboard for Boralus!', 'The boat to Kul Tiras has just arrived. All aboard for Boralus!', 160728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are too many! We cannot hold this line forever!', '', 160727, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, head to the top of the tower and rain hell on the Lightbound!', '', 160726, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord, Eitrigg, hold the line here with me!', '', 160725, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lantresor, ride as hard as you can! Gather every orc you see and bring them here!', '', 160724, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 160723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All?', '', 160722, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of them.', '', 160721, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many do we face, Lantresor?', '', 160720, 0, 0, 604, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief Hellscream! An army approaches!', '', 160719, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fly to Stormwind>', '<Fly to Stormwind>', 160718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Relentless has just docked! All aboard for Stormwind!', 160717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord! Stonemaul don\'t want trouble with orcs. Kor\'gall\'s in his cave.', '', 160716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heading back home already? Lucky for you, one of your few remaining Alliance ships frequently makes the trip here from Stormwind. Just head to the little, wooden dock on the south end of Tradewinds Market.\n\nSee ya.', 'Heading back home already? Lucky for you, one of your few remaining Alliance ships frequently makes the trip here from Stormwind. Just head to the little, wooden dock on the south end of Tradewinds Market.\n\nSee ya.', 160715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship to Stormwind', 'Ship to Stormwind', 160714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d be surprised how many repairs I\'ve had to do around here. With all the magic the tidesages use, you\'d think they would use waterproof materials.', '', 160713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fly to Orgrimmar>', '<Fly to Orgrimmar>', 160712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I\'m totally honest, I never really trusted them. I mean, have you seen their banners?', '', 160711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tidesages, they\'ve all gone mad!', '', 160710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have ya been to any of our dive bars yet? Dey be well worth de visit!', '', 160709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When de boat is empty, I relax and stick all four of my toes into de water.', '', 160708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing beats de smell of sea air.', '', 160707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live on an island to not be harassed by de rest of de world. Can\'t dey all just go home? I don\'t mean you, of course.', '', 160706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De sound de oar makes as it moves through de water is so relaxing.', '', 160705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeb\'ahari was always de favorite, so quiet and relaxing. Far from de hustle of Dazar\'alor, ya really appreciate de beauty of Zuldazar.', '', 160704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember back when I was a wee troll, I used to love our trips to de shore.', '', 160703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De sooner dey clean up our beaches, de happier I will be!', '', 160702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Galson\'s Lode.', 'Send me to Galson\'s Lode.', 160701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Highlands Mill.', 'Send me to Highlands Mill.', 160700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Stromgarde Keep.', 'Send me to Stromgarde Keep.', 160699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help?', '', 160698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll get things in ship-shape if we all work together!', '', 160697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave it to the Assurance Engineer Corps to find the problems!', '', 160696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got a dent somewhere? Leave it to me!', '', 160695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the notes.>', '<Take the notes.>', 160694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"After finally discovering a suitable base, we have successfully produced a stable compound.$B$BIn this state it can be stored, transported, or introduced into the mixing process to infuse a terribly potent black powder!$B$BI am so confident in its stability that initial samples were sent to Boralus suspended inside a necklace.$B$BAs we run the cauldrons day and night mixing powder, work also continues on prototyping further applications. Our most promising so far is a pistol, which we hope will make another suitable gift for our esteemed Lady Chairman.\"$B$B<The disorganized notes go on to detail various projects and aspirations.>', 160693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empowering', 'Empowering', 160692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once Zandalar lies in ruins, da empire of da Old Gods be risin\' again!', 160691, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya fight be hopeless... G\'huun gonna be free!', 160690, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If de last seal is destroyed, dat monster will be unleashed upon Azeroth!', 160689, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 114298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scans indicate Nazmir and Vol\'dun devices currently inoperable. Last functioning seal: Zuldazar.', '', 160688, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Designation: G\'huun.', '', 160687, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis. Ends. Now.', 160686, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 114294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not escape your crimes any longer.', 160685, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 114293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('and you have no place among kings.', '', 160684, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4280, 114291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you not understand?', '', 160683, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we call you now?', '', 160682, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 114289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trespass upon sacred ground.', '', 160681, 0, 0, 0, 70, 5000, 114288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to assist you.', 'I am ready to assist you.', 160680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though these days have been marked by loss, we continue onward.', 160679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, keep de wet side down!', '', 160678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Red sky in de night, sailor delight. Red sky in de morning, sailor take warning!', '', 160677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ship is safe in de harbor... but where be de fun in dat?', '', 160676, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Priest_VoidSear.blp:20|t Mythrax begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274113|h[Obliteration Beam]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Priest_VoidSear.blp:20|t Mythrax begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274113|h[Obliteration Beam]|h|r!', 160675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p. Well done, Shandris.', '', 160674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xibala', 'Xibala', 160673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to craft items from here in Kul Tiras more efficiently, then look no further.\n\nThere\'s an agent of the Alliance in Nazjatar that can teach you how to better use those resources.\n\n<Leedan sighs as he looks towards the bar.>\n\nThe dwarf WHO TOOK MY SPOT also seems to know a thing or two.', '', 160672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wildhammer\'ll be telling tales of this mission for years... But now I\'m ready fer a pint.', '', 160671, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll be keepin\' a keen eye on the movements o\' the sethrak below. You can count on us!', 160670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the best!', 'You\'re the best!', 160669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow them up again!', 'Blow them up again!', 160668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to grow up to be like you!', 'I\'m going to grow up to be like you!', 160667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a hero!', 'You\'re a hero!', 160666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking to learn how to craft your gear more effectively, then look no further. I have what you need.', '', 160665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\70_inscription_vantus_rune_light:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267905|h[Reinforcing Ward]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\70_inscription_vantus_rune_azure:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267891|h[Swiftness Ward]|h|r!', 160664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse this vile Light!', 160663, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... a naaru... Not again!', 160662, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And, of the fate of my brothers and sisters in Evermorn Hold. I am afraid that there is little we can do to save them now.', 160661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to go, heroes! I\'m not getting paid to wait around!', 'Time to go, heroes! I\'m not getting paid to wait around!', 160660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni Bronzebeard awaits you in Silithus. Hurry! The land itself rises against us!', '', 160659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni Bronzebeard needs your aid, champion. Let us speak at once.', '', 160658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must speak with you, champion!', '', 160657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, we must speak. Magni Bronzebeard is in need of your aid!', '', 160656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! I bear an urgent message from Magni Bronzebeard, the Speaker of Azeroth.', '', 160655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.', 'I\'m ready to leave.', 160654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to depart?', 'Ready to depart?', 160653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once a breach has been made, the pain is... bearable. Just... give me a moment.', 160652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brace yourselves...', 160650, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We pass through the wall on my command!', 160649, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Self Destruct has been activated!', 'The Self Destruct has been activated!', 160648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I don\'t believe that is quite correct. Shall we try again?', '', 160647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people will endure.', 160646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.', 'I\'m ready to leave.', 160645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde will pay for this incursion!', 160644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune... save us.', 160643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I serve the kaldorei.', 160642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad you stand with us.', 160641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to be done.', 160640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MONK_HEALTHSPHERE.BLP:20|tThe Avatar\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274149|h[Life Force]|h|ris bolstered, heal her!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MONK_HEALTHSPHERE.BLP:20|tThe Avatar\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:274149|h[Life Force]|h|r is bolstered, heal her!', 160639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphon riders, disengage and fall back into formation. We\'re done here!', '', 160638, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye heard the General, Swiftwing. Take us back tae Boralus!', '', 160637, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re ready to go, Falstad.', 160636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is here?! I\'d rather take my chances with the sharks!', 'The Horde is here?! I\'d rather take my chances with the sharks!', 160635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better dey leave than I rush de dish. Melons require a delicate yet violent cleaving motion.', '', 160634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I should chop de melons with your sharp tongue, Grozzak.', '', 160633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am chopping as hard as I can!', '', 160632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleaving of melons cannot be rushed. Leave de chef be.', '', 160631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need de melon or de customers will leave.', '', 160630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps de cleaver is dull, my friend.', '', 160629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems like a long time to cut watermelon, Ka\'ro.', '', 160628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Customers are waiting. How long will dis take?', '', 160627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me Wildhammers won\'t be able tae keep Nathanos and the rest of the Horde busy much longer. Ye ready tae leave?', '', 160626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth be a better place without that Blood Prince. Ye did good, $p.', '', 160625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish the fight.', 'Finish the fight.', 160624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done much for Boralus this day, heroes. Now, it\'s my turn.', 'You\'ve done much for Boralus this day, heroes. Now, it\'s my turn.', 160623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready tae jump, $p. I\'ll bring ye in right over the Crimson Squall.', '', 160622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which loa would you like me to create the statue for?', 160621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take ye down tae the Crimson Squall, $p. Shandris is waitin\' for ye there.', '', 160620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will never... escape the Blighted Lands...', '', 160619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thros consumes all! She is ours!', '', 160618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to change the loa represented here from Vol\'dun.', 'I would like to change the loa represented here from Vol\'dun.', 160617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to change the loa represented here from Nazmir.', 'I would like to change the loa represented here from Nazmir.', 160616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll head to the outskirts and alert the citizens. Hurry to the docks. I\'ll meet you there!', 160615, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood... Lord Admiral.', 160614, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 114621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems our homecoming will have to wait.', 160613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You\'re back! What happened?', '', 160612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You are fading from si--', '', 160611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good Luck.', '', 160609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will remain with our guides, and will serve as a beacon for you to find your way back to shore.', '', 160608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pray we find those we seek. But be wary. That island reeks of evil.', '', 160607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know what we will find when we arrive at Fate\'s End, $p.', '', 160606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, were you worried? Haha! \n\n<cough>\n\nAh... still a bit sore. But I\'ll be fine.\n\nBesides, my job\'s done, mate.\n\nYou and Taelia go on back to Boralus and do the hero thing.', '', 160605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Amalia. Let us continue our lesson on what it means to be Forsaken.', 160604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you have for sale.', 'Show me what you have for sale.', 160603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was on a supply run when I hit engine troubles. I made an emergency landin\' at this very spot and waited days for help t\' arrive.$b$bHave ye ever survived in a swamp by eatin\' twigs n\' moss? I have!', '', 160602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Signal Falstad and join me in the skies. We\'ll return to Boralus together.', 160601, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood Prince Dreven is dead. We must move before Nathanos and the others recover from the Wildhammer diversion.', 160600, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anu\'dorini talah... monster.', 160599, 0, 0, 16, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorak Tul... will break you...', '', 160598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay!', '', 160597, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 114573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An outsider dares to desecrate these bones?', '', 160596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my, just like my mother used to after she made her famous pie.\n\nVery well, I will show you... my life\'s work!\n\nIt\'s in the chest out back, and it\'s all yours!\n\nI hope it was worth it!', 'Oh, my, just like my mother used to after she made her famous pie.\n\nVery well, I will show you... my life\'s work!\n\nIt\'s in the chest out back, and it\'s all yours!\n\nI hope it was worth it!', 160595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I smell?', 'How do I smell?', 160594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that is excellent. But still, I... er... hm.', 'Oh, that is excellent. But still, I... er... hm.', 160593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve sent some messages to your enemies, now about those secrets...', 'I\'ve sent some messages to your enemies, now about those secrets...', 160592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s me, your friend. Got any secrets to tell me about?', 'It\'s me, your friend. Got any secrets to tell me about?', 160591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no idea what you\'re talking about!', 'I have no idea what you\'re talking about!', 160590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello! I don\'t get many visitors out here, you\'ll have to excuse the mess.', 'Hello! I don\'t get many visitors out here, you\'ll have to excuse the mess.', 160589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goddess, give me strength!', 160588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! No more trickery. No more escape. I will not wait any longer for justice.', 160587, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood Prince Dreven begins casting a spell to escape!', '', 160586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve grown weary of your feeble play at combat. I will entertain these foolish notions no longer.', '', 160585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hesitate to make yourselves at home.', 'Don\'t hesitate to make yourselves at home.', 160584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would treat you to a smile and a toast, but alas, I have neither skin nor ale.', 'I would treat you to a smile and a toast, but alas, I have neither skin nor ale.', 160583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, visitors! And I haven\'t a thing to wear.', 'Oh my, visitors! And I haven\'t a thing to wear.', 160582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance attacked. You missed the fun, $p.', 160581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back! We\'ve been, uh, a little busy while you were down there.', '', 160580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It added to the appeal.', '', 160579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish girl. I knew their names when I drained the life from their husks.', '', 160578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me and Swiftwing got yer back, $p! We\'ll keep the hammers comin\' through the ports!', '', 160577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear it is slightly too late for that, Amalia. We have a new visitor.', 160576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Proudmoore\'s forces are relentless, Nathanos. We should get out of here as soon as possible.', 160575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good. Not only will this be a boon for the Zandalari armada... but also a detriment to that of the Kul Tirans.', '', 160574, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have successfully retrieved the Abyssal Scepter, Nathanos.', '', 160573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it, champion! The chamber is secure!', '', 160572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The seal is shatterin\'! Hold on, lass! Please hold on!', '', 160571, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_POSSESSION.BLP:20|t Remember to look while G\'huun casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:267700|h[Gaze of G\'huun]|h|r.', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_POSSESSION.BLP:20|t Remember to look while G\'huun casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:267700|h[Gaze of G\'huun]|h|r.', 160570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_TITANKEEPER_CLEANSINGORB.BLP:20|t Collect the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263420|h[Power Matrix]|h|r in order to trigger a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263482|h[Reorigination Blast]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_TITANKEEPER_CLEANSINGORB.BLP:20|t Collect the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263420|h[Power Matrix]|h|r in order to trigger a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263482|h[Reorigination Blast]|h|r!', 160569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Zeb\'ahari', 'Zeb\'ahari', 160568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready to progress to the ritual site, $n.', '', 160567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This can\'t be good.', 160566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, what\'s going on down there?', 160565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was it simply a test of her new weapons... or something more?', 160564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t understand... Why would Lady Ashvane hire pirates to attack Daelin\'s Gate?', 160563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with honor. For the Horde.', '', 160562, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I next call on you, it will be time to strike against Boralus, the Kul Tiran capital.', '', 160561, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gathered all the pieces we need.', '', 160560, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
