('Zelling. You\'re certain that you can find the location of Marshal Valentine\'s body?', '', 160542, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking to get some practice in? Good for you. Gotta stay sharp or you\'re dead. Okay, so what you need to do is get to the top of the wall overlooking Boralus Harbor.\n\nBest way to get there is to go near Joan Weber, the flight master in Tradewinds Market, and take the steps that lead down to the left of her. Follow those and go south through the checkpoint. There\'s a small clearing where my fellow guards train.', 'Looking to get some practice in? Good for you. Gotta stay sharp or you\'re dead. Okay, so what you need to do is get to the top of the wall overlooking Boralus Harbor.\n\nBest way to get there is to go near Joan Weber, the flight master in Tradewinds Market, and take the steps that lead down to the left of her. Follow those and go south through the checkpoint. There\'s a small clearing where my fellow guards train.', 160541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to get to Boralus. The Lord Admiral must be warned!', 160540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
