('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_02.BLP:64|t\n\nCorporal Aloysius Millsworth', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_02.BLP:64|t\n\nCorporal Aloysius Millsworth', 159967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You get on a boat and wind up in this new place and chase little bugs and wildlife around and wind up in the middle of a spooky area like this. At least that\'s what happened to me.  I captured some neat little guys though, creatures I\'d never seen before coming to this place.  Want to see what they can do?', '', 159966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
