('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Bag_10.blp:64|t\n\nProvisioner Jarrod', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Bag_10.blp:64|t\n\nProvisioner Jarrod', 159955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye need some armor repaired? I\'ve got the best forge in the desert... well... the only forge in the desert.', 'Ye need some armor repaired? I\'ve got the best forge in the desert... well... the only forge in the desert.', 159954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea shall swallow you whole!', '', 159953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What would you ask of the kaldorei?', 159952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Away from our archives! This research does not belong to you!', 159951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune light your way.', 159950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not lose faith.', 159949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all the blood elves we brought over, you\'d think we\'d have included a jewelcrafter given they practically invented the profession. I guess the Zandalari don\'t trust us with their riches.\n\nSo, if you\'re looking to learn more, you need to speak with Seshuli. You can find her in the Hall of Glimmers. To get there, head down to the Terrace of Crafters on the west side of Dazar\'alor. Then, turn and face the pyramid and head into one of the tunnels. That\'s where she\'ll be.', 'With all the blood elves we brought over, you\'d think we\'d have included a jewelcrafter given they practically invented the profession. I guess the Zandalari don\'t trust us with their riches.\n\nSo, if you\'re looking to learn more, you need to speak with Seshuli. You can find her in the Hall of Glimmers. To get there, head down to the Terrace of Crafters on the west side of Dazar\'alor. Then, turn and face the pyramid and head into one of the tunnels. That\'s where she\'ll be.', 159948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for someone to teach you further in the mysteries of Inscription, head into the Great Seal.\n\nOnce in there, head upstairs on the east side and you\'ll find the Hall of Chroniclers. You\'re looking for Chronicler Kizani.', 'If you\'re looking for someone to teach you further in the mysteries of Inscription, head into the Great Seal.\n\nOnce in there, head upstairs on the east side and you\'ll find the Hall of Chroniclers. You\'re looking for Chronicler Kizani.', 159947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism, huh? Okay, I know a guy. Goes by the name, Jahden Fla. You\'ll find him tending his garden at the Terrace of Crafters on the lower, west side of Dazar\'alor.', 'Herbalism, huh? Okay, I know a guy. Goes by the name, Jahden Fla. You\'ll find him tending his garden at the Terrace of Crafters on the lower, west side of Dazar\'alor.', 159946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the children of Elune.', 159945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-alah.', 159944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The goddess gives me strength.', 159943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a Zandalari down on the banks of The Sliver to the north of Dazar\'alor. Her name is Silent Tali and it\'s said that she can fish up anything from anywhere.\n\nOf course, true to her name, she\'s no braggart, so you\'ll have to decide for yourself if she\'s really that good.', 'There is a Zandalari down on the banks of The Sliver to the north of Dazar\'alor. Her name is Silent Tali and it\'s said that she can fish up anything from anywhere.\n\nOf course, true to her name, she\'s no braggart, so you\'ll have to decide for yourself if she\'s really that good.', 159942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease.', 'At ease.', 159941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nae quick enough. Keep practicing!', 'Nae quick enough. Keep practicing!', 159940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eyes open! Ye canna shoot what ye canna see!', 'Eyes open! Ye canna shoot what ye canna see!', 159939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Verra sloppy! We\'re gonna keep doing this till ye get it right!', 'Verra sloppy! We\'re gonna keep doing this till ye get it right!', 159938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye dropped yer ammo, Kelada! <sigh> Get it right next time!', 'Ye dropped yer ammo, Kelada! <sigh> Get it right next time!', 159937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When was the last time ye cleaned yer rifle, private? Are ye unable tae do it yerself?', 'When was the last time ye cleaned yer rifle, private? Are ye unable tae do it yerself?', 159936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PRESENT!', 'PRESENT!', 159935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right shoulder... ARMS!', 'Right shoulder... ARMS!', 159934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No wonder Ashvane couldn\'t get her people to go. That place is terrifying!', '', 159933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there, you ever seen what these can do?  They\'re pack hunters. They stalk their prey, they distract it, and then get the killing blow. Vicious little creatures. I\'m in charge though and they know it! Want to see how your little beasts measure up against mine?', '', 159932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n munches on some popcorn.', '$n munches on some popcorn.', 159931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, you\'re looking for Shuga Blastcaps at the Terrace of the Crafters. You\'ll find her with her buddy, Myxle, on the west side of Dazar\'alor down at the base of the pyramid.\n\nWhat are you planning to blow up?', 'Yep, you\'re looking for Shuga Blastcaps at the Terrace of the Crafters. You\'ll find her with her buddy, Myxle, on the west side of Dazar\'alor down at the base of the pyramid.\n\nWhat are you planning to blow up?', 159930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... This is bad. This is very bad... They shipped her off to Fate\'s End.', '', 159929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah. Here we are.', '', 159928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough evidence to put him away for life. But since he\'s dead, I guess he doesn\'t need to worry about that anymore.', '', 159927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood elf Enchantress Quinni came in with us. Listen carefully. To find her, you need to head down to the western base of Dazar\'alor to the Terrace of Crafters. Once there, turn to face the pyramid and look for a way down. There\'s a tunnel that will lead you down into a place called the Hall of Glimmers.\n\nYou ask me, we sure did bring a lot of blood elves along with us. Makes one suspicious...', 'The blood elf Enchantress Quinni came in with us. Listen carefully. To find her, you need to head down to the western base of Dazar\'alor to the Terrace of Crafters. Once there, turn to face the pyramid and look for a way down. There\'s a tunnel that will lead you down into a place called the Hall of Glimmers.\n\nYou ask me, we sure did bring a lot of blood elves along with us. Makes one suspicious...', 159926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gold, gems, treasure maps, ransom notes... my oh my, Harlan was a naughty, naughty boy.', '', 159925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit, I admire your work ethic. Nicely done.', '', 159924, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 114377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s usually a good sign. What\'s inside?', 159923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, what do you know... it didn\'t explode!', '', 159922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Bilgewater bunch needs to keep the ranishu fed to power their mechs. Help the goblins out. The sooner they\'re done, the sooner they\'re gone.', '', 159921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One last lock. Here\'s hoping it\'s not booby trapped.', '', 159920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. Let\'s get this chest open.', '', 159919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_08.BLP:64|t\n\nKnight-Captain Ellis R. Ladimore\n\nCaptain of the Fathomdasher', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_08.BLP:64|t\n\nKnight-Captain Ellis R. Ladimore\n\nCaptain of the Fathomdasher', 159918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inspect... arms!', 'Inspect... arms!', 159917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari royals lent us their very own chef. Her name is T\'sarah. You can find her inside the Great Seal, upstairs on the west side.\n\nPersonally, I have no idea if she\'s any good. I don\'t eat cooked food.', 'The Zandalari royals lent us their very own chef. Her name is T\'sarah. You can find her inside the Great Seal, upstairs on the west side.\n\nPersonally, I have no idea if she\'s any good. I don\'t eat cooked food.', 159916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down on the lower, west side of Dazar\'alor, you\'ll find the Terrace of Crafters. There\'s a giant Zandalari dire troll named Forgemaster Zach-something down there hammering away at an anvil. Trust me, you can\'t miss him.', 'Down on the lower, west side of Dazar\'alor, you\'ll find the Terrace of Crafters. There\'s a giant Zandalari dire troll named Forgemaster Zach-something down there hammering away at an anvil. Trust me, you can\'t miss him.', 159915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We brought Examiner Alerinda along with us. She\'s inside the Great Seal in a room on the west side.\n\nI think there\'s some giant dinosaur her people are digging up far to the southwest. You should see if you can help.', 'We brought Examiner Alerinda along with us. She\'s inside the Great Seal in a room on the west side.\n\nI think there\'s some giant dinosaur her people are digging up far to the southwest. You should see if you can help.', 159914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riflemen! Fall in!', 'Riflemen! Fall in!', 159913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re both glad you\'re back safely, $n.', 159912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on! I wasn\'t the one who... <sigh>', 159911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there\'s the brave hero! See, I told you $n would be just fine, Taelia. She\'s such a worrier.', '', 159910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everytime my family goes out into those hills, I worry.', 159909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Careful where you\'re throwing those things!', '', 159908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are a few grenades left, $n! Let \'em have it!', 159907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking for Clever Kumali. She\'s at the Terrace of Crafters on the west side of Dazar\'alor down near the ground.\n\nBe careful. She looks the type the Darkspear are always warning us about their spooky voodoo.', 'You\'re looking for Clever Kumali. She\'s at the Terrace of Crafters on the west side of Dazar\'alor down near the ground.\n\nBe careful. She looks the type the Darkspear are always warning us about their spooky voodoo.', 159906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see anyone suspicious in here, you tell me. I\'ll smash de truth out of \'em.', '', 159905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This vault is secured by Lok de Rock. Ain\'t nobody stealing from it!', '', 159904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... You and I need to talk about our shared interests after this.', '', 159903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now we\'re at my favorite part!', 159902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re at my favorite part.', '', 159901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make it back safely... including the prisoner.', '', 159900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasures come in all shapes and sizes, apparently. I\'m constantly amazed by what people store in these vaults.', '', 159899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood.', 159898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let anything happen to your valuables, $p.\n\nI\'ve guarded de treasures of kings, storehouses of merchants, trinkets of mad men, and lunches of casteless.\n\nDoesn\'t matter what it is, I make sure it\'s kept safe.', '', 159897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_05.BLP:64|t\n\nSergeant Major Alison Flint', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_05.BLP:64|t\n\nSergeant Major Alison Flint', 159896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De last gang that tried to rob this vault is out in Vol\'dun now... just like everyone else who\'s tried.', '', 159895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_02.BLP:64|t\n\nCorporal Jameson Keefe', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_02.BLP:64|t\n\nCorporal Jameson Keefe', 159894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_01.BLP:64|t\n\nPrivate Lorelai Whetstone', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_01.BLP:64|t\n\nPrivate Lorelai Whetstone', 159893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_01.BLP:64|t\n\nPrivate James Simmons', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_A_01.BLP:64|t\n\nPrivate James Simmons', 159892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is de safest vault in Zandalar. Nothing goes in or out without my approval.\n\nYou keep your things here, you sleep easy. It\'s that simple.', '', 159891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take my job as vault security seriously, $p.\n\nYou got good intentions, then I got good intentions.\n\nYou got bad intentions, then I crush your entire body inside a tiny crate, ship ya out to Vol\'dun, and let de sethrak feed you to their vultures.\n\nWe clear?', '', 159890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An agreement I have made with the Zandalari. They let me stay and get invited to my party.', '', 159889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Alliance in Zandalar, be sure to watch your back.\n\nIf seen, the guards and gods are likely to attack.', '', 159888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A long way from home, you and I are. Why not stay and have a drink in the Grand Bazaar.', '', 159887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Astarii... hurry. Evacuate the city... before it burns...', 159886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh sure. If you\'re looking for some professional help, you\'ll find most of them at the Terrace of Crafters down on the lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nWhat are you looking to train?', 'Oh sure. If you\'re looking for some professional help, you\'ll find most of them at the Terrace of Crafters down on the lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nWhat are you looking to train?', 159885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurolisk flipped the wagon and the supplies went flying all over.', '', 159884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Genn may be known as the \"Old Wolf\", but I can make him purr like a kitten.', 159883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The night elves once saved my people. I will do all I can for them.', 159882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll stay here and get the horses settled.', '', 159881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei need our help.', 159880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is short.', 159879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you!   I think I can make it back on my own now.', 159878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make them pay for this, champion.', 159877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much innocent blood...', 159876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 159875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ugly one is mine!', 'The ugly one is mine!', 159874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take no prisoners!', 'Take no prisoners!', 159873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Alliance property! Away with you!', 'This is Alliance property! Away with you!', 159872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve made a mistake, Horde filth!', 'You\'ve made a mistake, Horde filth!', 159871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Save all you can!', 159870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guilty will pay for their crimes.', 159869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of us will meet you there when this is all done to help with any debriefing that is necessary.', '', 159868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance.', 159867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My home calls to me.', 159866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your service.', 159865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I be of service?', 159864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A kingdom is not a place, but a people.', 159863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gilneas honors your service.', 159862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, champion.', 159861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knife. Throat. It\'s not that complicated.', '', 159860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killing is its own reward. But gold works, too.', '', 159859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, give the word when you\'re ready for us to begin preparations to blow this ship up. Afterwards, I want you to report our success to King Wrynn.', '', 159858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s impress the warchief... and earn ourselves a nice reward.', '', 159857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s teach these savages a lesson, shall we?', '', 159856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeshan, Kelsey, rig the ship to explode once everyone is out.', '', 159855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s not waste time.', '', 159854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War abounds with opportunity.', '', 159853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umbric, we\'ll need one last void rift to get all our forces out of here.', '', 159852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need this ship destroyed. Shandris, help our remaining forces prepare to leave.', '', 159851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do so enjoy my job.', '', 159848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we get to work?', '', 159847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people will free me from your jails, just as they did Princess Talanji and Zul!', '', 159845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would love to see them try. Now, towards other matters.', '', 159844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can either fight us the entire way or cooperate with us, the choice is yours.', '', 159843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take care of it.', 'I will take care of it.', 159842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. There has been enough killing today, captain. We\'re taking you prisoner, back to Stormwind.', '', 159841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance dogs! Kill me now and be done with it!', '', 159840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain Zalkran was attempting to flee to Zuldazar, but Falstad and I subdued him.', 159839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris, can you give me a status report?', 'Shandris, can you give me a status report?', 159838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you return me to the present time?', 'Can you return me to the present time?', 159837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you show me what Tirisfal Glades was like before the Battle for Lordaeron?', 'Can you show me what Tirisfal Glades was like before the Battle for Lordaeron?', 159836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh... and if you see my grandson, Charles, please make sure he\'s not cowering under a tree somewhere.', 159835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you begun to capture the pets this strange land has to offer? Personally, I\'m after one of those blood tiki masks, though I\'m not sure how the locals will feel about it.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a stable master, there\'s a Zandalari calls himself Beast Handler Kalatak near the northwest base of Dazar\'alor.', 'Have you begun to capture the pets this strange land has to offer? Personally, I\'m after one of those blood tiki masks, though I\'m not sure how the locals will feel about it.\n\nIf you\'re looking for a stable master, there\'s a Zandalari calls himself Beast Handler Kalatak near the northwest base of Dazar\'alor.', 159834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Purple Princess crew has gone on strike. Something about not getting paid for the last eleven years? I wasn\'t really listening.', 'The Purple Princess crew has gone on strike. Something about not getting paid for the last eleven years? I wasn\'t really listening.', 159833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I get to Stranglethorn Vale?', 'How can I get to Stranglethorn Vale?', 159832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! It seems I am in need of your aid once more.', 159831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you again, champion...though it looks like we may not be out of the squall yet.', 159830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Mother. I will return with them shortly.', 159829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taelia! Take $n and muster the militia. Jaina and I will prepare the defenses.', 159828, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! It seems I am in need of your aid once more.', 159827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Priscilla has come back for my city...', 159826, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Or... Were we too late?', 159825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me what you found. Was there any sign of Jaina?', 159824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n!... You return alone, I see.', 159823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wagon is wrecked, and we could have been killed.  \n\nThe beast that attacked us is in that cave.  I am not leaving till it\'s dead!', 159822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Admiral! Ships on the horizon! They\'re flying Ashvane colors!', 159821, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 114495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother... I--', 159820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, let me see if I can do this properly this time... Welcome home, daughter.', 159819, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to feel the sea air. Thank you, $n. Without your intervention, I may never have felt it again...', 159818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Inquisitor!\n\nLady Waycrest has instructed me to ready my fastest falcon to carry a message for you.', '', 159817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send word to Katherine Proudmoore to meet me at Gol Inath.', 'Send word to Katherine Proudmoore to meet me at Gol Inath.', 159816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a way into the Blighted Lands.', 'I\'m looking for a way into the Blighted Lands.', 159815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect her with your life. Kul Tiras has lost too many Proudmoores as it is.', 159814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done it! The effigy worked!', 159813, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s it! The markings on the wall show the sequence!', 159812, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps the runes need to be activated in a particular pattern...', 159811, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'That seemed unpleasant...', 159810, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to activate another.', 159809, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 114641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It vanished! Could these runes be serving as wards?', 159808, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now... there must be some clue in here as to how this works.', 159807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that did... something...', 159806, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This looks like some kind of doorway. Perhaps we should place the effigy here.', 159805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must steel my nerves. Jaina has braved far worse because of me.', 159804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place chills my soul. It feels as if I am walking over my own grave...', 159803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we\'re on our own from here. Lead the way.', 159802, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those... monsters in the woods ambushed my honor guard. I only survived thanks to their sacrifice.', 159801, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 114633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! You\'re a welcome sight!', 159800, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, sir! Hannibal \'ere will get yer message to Proudmoore Keep straight away!', '', 159799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are safe now.', 'You are safe now.', 159798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inquisitor, I know that Katherine plans to join you on this mad pursuit.', 159797, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That creepy nightborne, Oculeth, made us portals to Orgrimmar, Silvermoon City, and Thunder Bluff. You can find them in the Hall of Ancient Paths inside the Great Seal on the east side.\n\nSadly, there\'s no portal to Undercity. Soon, we will have our revenge on the Alliance scum! Genn, Jaina, and King Anduin will pay for their crimes!\n\nVictory for Sylvanas! May her reign as warchief last a thousand years!', 'That creepy nightborne, Oculeth, made us portals to Orgrimmar, Silvermoon City, and Thunder Bluff. You can find them in the Hall of Ancient Paths inside the Great Seal on the east side.\n\nSadly, there\'s no portal to Undercity. Soon, we will have our revenge on the Alliance scum! Genn, Jaina, and King Anduin will pay for their crimes!\n\nVictory for Sylvanas! May her reign as warchief last a thousand years!', 159796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The path to Thros will be treacherous, but that is merely a fraction of what awaits you inside the Blighted Lands. \n\nPrepare yourself, $c, for the minions of Thros will use your deepest fears and regrets as a weapon against you.', '', 159795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entrance to Thros lies within the great tree, Gol Inath, but crossing the threshold will not be as simple as walking through.\n\nTo open the path, you will need an effigy of great strength. Not one of the trinkets of the coven, mind you, but one of old, Drust magic.', '', 159794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wagon flipped over.  It was terrifying!\n\nI was headed back to town to get help, but got scared.', 159793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it is good to see another follower of the path.\n\nWhat do you seek from the Thornspeakers?', '', 159792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the mainlander returns? \n\nI believe our debt has been repaid. Do you come seeking further favors of the Thornspeakers?', '', 159791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been a long time since a mainlander step foot in my grove. \n\nDo you wish to learn from the Thornspeakers, or have you come to lay claim to this land, as your kind are so fond of doing?', '', 159790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... changes things.', '', 159789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would appear I was mistaken. Thros has come to us.', '', 159788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is far from over, old bear.', '', 159787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see they are safe.', 'I\'ll see they are safe.', 159786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you to judge who\'s worthy? Your twisted ways have disgraced our kind, Tul!', '', 159785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would share our gifts with these wretches, Ulfar? You deserve to burn with them!', '', 159784, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I get to Howling Fjord?', 'How can I get to Howling Fjord?', 159783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thornspeakers, to arms!', '', 159782, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 114672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost contact with the Cloudkisser somewhere over the Great Sea. We were going for a record, eight-hundred and fifteen flights without refueling! I\'m sure they\'re fine.', 'We lost contact with the Cloudkisser somewhere over the Great Sea. We were going for a record, eight-hundred and fifteen flights without refueling! I\'m sure they\'re fine.', 159781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorak Tul! It cannot be!', '', 159780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, we are well past peeking, old bear.', '', 159779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some pathways are best left closed, lest those on the other side set foot upon them.', '', 159778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am afraid I cannot help you with this, mainlander.', '', 159777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to enter Thros? I am afraid I cannot help you, mainlander.', '', 159776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not seriously considering going into the Blighted Lands, are you?', 159775, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inquisitor! I\'ve received word from Katherine!', 159774, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was the one who brought this fate upon her. I will be there to set it right.', 159773, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If... when you find Jaina, I want to be there. I will brave whatever dangers await.', 159772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One more thing, $n.', 159771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Saurolisk spooked the horses, the wagon spilled, and we lost our supplies. \n\nMy two girls Lorraine and Mallory are still out there, they could use your help.', '', 159770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s where me and some of the others are heading after our shift. Gotta stay sharp.\n\nIt\'s at the Royal Armory on the north side of Dazar\'alor down near the base of the pyramid. You should join us.', 'That\'s where me and some of the others are heading after our shift. Gotta stay sharp.\n\nIt\'s at the Royal Armory on the north side of Dazar\'alor down near the base of the pyramid. You should join us.', 159769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find Brother Pike! He is still a loyal and devout tidesage. I know he will help us.', 159768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was, after all, acting on my orders.', 159767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the tidesages can approach it safely, and Ashvane would have had no trouble compelling them to bring Jaina to its shores.', 159766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me I am not too late.', 159765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where was Jaina taken?', 159764, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah. Me too.', '', 159763, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flynn, you know what I mean. For Lady Katherine\'s sake, I pray you\'re wrong.', 159762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placing wagers now, are we? For shame! Whatever would Cyrus say?', '', 159761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take it you have business with the Darkspear? You know the ship goes to the Echo Isles, right? Or, are you just looking for a short excursion before heading back to Orgrimmar?\n\nJust head down to the end of the dock south at the Port of Zandalar.', 'I take it you have business with the Darkspear? You know the ship goes to the Echo Isles, right? Or, are you just looking for a short excursion before heading back to Orgrimmar?\n\nJust head down to the end of the dock south at the Port of Zandalar.', 159760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, if anyone can bring her back from that awful place, I\'d bet on $n.', 159759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The island is called Fate\'s End, Taelia. Not Fate\'s Hope.', '', 159758, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. Let\'s regroup.', '', 159757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take ye down tae the Banshee\'s Wail, $p. But ye gonna have tae hold on tight!', '', 159756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wildhammers, spread out and keep the skies clear, but avoid detection fer now.', '', 159755, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah... de captain... will... kill all of you...', 159750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late! De captain is already reporting your location to Princess Talanji.', 159749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know just the goblin. His name\'s Myxle Gutwrench. You\'ll find him and his Shred-Master Mk1 at the Terrace of Crafters down on the lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nHe claims his device can break any of your equipment into pieces for you to reuse or sell. I was going to take him up on his offer, but this is Horde-issued armor.', 'I know just the goblin. His name\'s Myxie Gutwrench. You\'ll find him and his Scrap-O-Matic 1000 at the Terrace of Crafters down on the lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nHe claims his device can break any of your equipment into pieces for you to reuse or sell. I was going to take him up on his offer, but this is Horde-issued armor.', 159748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to the Golden Throne, you have to take the elevators up from inside the Great Seal.\n\nYou getting in good with the royals? What do you think of those headdresses? Those are some strong necks!', 'To get to the Golden Throne, you have to take the elevators up from inside the Great Seal.\n\nYou getting in good with the royals? What do you think of those headdresses? Those are some strong necks!', 159747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is big. I\'ll give them that. I know a few places if you\'re looking for something interesting.', 'This place is big. I\'ll give them that. I know a few places if you\'re looking for something interesting.', 159746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brillin the Beauty is in the middle of the Great Seal. Isn\'t her dancing just divine?', 'Brillin the Beauty is in the middle of the Great Seal. Isn\'t her dancing just divine?', 159745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a Zandalari named Paku\'ai providing flights. If you want a pterrordax, she is on the ledge outside the Great Seal on the east side.', 'There\'s a Zandalari named Paku\'ai providing flights. If you want a pterrordax, she is on the ledge outside the Great Seal on the east side.', 159744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess that depends on which emissary you\'re looking for, $n.', 'I guess that depends on which emissary you\'re looking for, $n.', 159743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting in good with the Zandalari? Smart. That\'s just what the warchief wants.\n\nYou can find their emissary, Natal\'hakata, inside the Great Seal.', 'Getting in good with the Zandalari? Smart. That\'s just what the warchief wants.\n\nYou can find their emissary, Natal\'hakata, inside the Great Seal.', 159742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trying to pry secrets from the tortollan? It\'s said they live for ages. Not quite as long as I will, but still, a long time.\n\nIn any case, you need to head all the way out to Scaletrader Post, northeast of Dazar\'alor. Look for Collector Kojo.', 'Trying to pry secrets from the tortollan? It\'s said they live for ages. Not quite as long as I will, but still, a long time.\n\nIn any case, you need to head all the way out to Scaletrader Post, northeast of Dazar\'alor. Look for Collector Kojo.', 159741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh sure. A different style. Or, maybe a new color? You\'re looking for Connor Buzznick down in the Grand Bazaar at the harbor.', 'Oh sure. A different style. Or, maybe a new color? You\'re looking for Connor Buzznick down in the Grand Bazaar at the harbor.', 159740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t I ever get to be the one actually riding the gryphon?', '', 159739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not too low! Not too low!', '', 159738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll fly low and try to lose them! Down, Galeheart!', 159737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hanging on is all I can do at the moment!', '', 159736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on! They\'re firing at us!', 159735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Royal Treasury is inside the pyramid on the west side of the Great Seal. We were going to staff it with goblins, but the Zandalari refused.\n\nThey\'re smart.', 'The Royal Treasury is inside the pyramid on the west side of the Great Seal. We were going to staff it with goblins, but the Zandalari refused.\n\nThey\'re smart.', 159734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to go to de Echo Isles? Why? Dat\'s where de Darkspear live. Tiny place. Stay in Zandalar. Big place. \n\nNo? Okay, well lucky for you, we loaned dem one of our little warships. You can catch it at de end of de dock, south in de Port of Zandalar.', 'You want to go to de Echo Isles? Why? Dat\'s where de Darkspear live. Tiny place. Stay in Zandalar. Big place. \n\nNo? Okay, well lucky for you, we loaned dem one of our little warships. You can catch it at de end of de dock, south in de Port of Zandalar.', 159733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship to Echo Isles', 'Ship to Echo Isles', 159732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Darkspear Foreman Al\'jibo is in de Hall of Ancient Paths on de east side of de Great Seal. I cannot vouch for him, as he came with de Horde. But, I am sure he can repair your dents and sharpen your weapons.\n\nIf not, you\'ll be on your way to Bwonsamdi soon enough.', 'De Darkspear Foreman Al\'jibo is in de Hall of Ancient Paths on de east side of de Great Seal. I cannot vouch for him, as he came with de Horde. But, I am sure he can repair your dents and sharpen your weapons.\n\nIf not, you\'ll be on your way to Bwonsamdi soon enough.', 159731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye need us again, just get clear of the boat and send up a signal. Me and Swiftwing\'ll find ye.', '', 159730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I love this part!', '', 159729, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go, Swiftwing. Bring us in nice and low tae avoid detection. As quick as ye can.', '', 159728, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repairs', 'Repairs', 159727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course you have gold to spend. Dis is Zandalar! Not even de goblins have more gold than us.\n\nNow, what are you looking for?', 'Of course you have gold to spend. Dis is Zandalar! Not even de goblins have more gold than us.\n\nNow, what are you looking for?', 159726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vendors', 'Vendors', 159725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll scout the Crimson Squall while you scout the Banshee\'s Wail. Tor ilisar\'thera\'nal!', 159724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re getting close. I can smell the foul stench of undeath.', 159723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your nightborne elf has been using his voodoo in de Hall of Ancient Paths. Look for it on de east side inside de Great Seal.\n\nHe conjured you up a way to get back to your little cities. What are dey called? Orgrimmar, Silvermoon City, and Thunder Bluff? Hmph.', 'Your nightborne elf has been using his voodoo in de Hall of Ancient Paths. Look for it on de east side inside de Great Seal.\n\nHe conjured you up a way to get back to your little cities. What are dey called? Orgrimmar, Silvermoon City, and Thunder Bluff? Hmph.', 159722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Portals', 'Portals', 159721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you end up here?', 'How did you end up here?', 159720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go! The information about Jaina\'s location is sure to be in here.\n\n<Flynn gestures to the chest.>\n\nYou got the keys. You do the honors.', '', 159719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late!', 159718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still succeeded.', 159717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you want some practice? We have plenty of training dummies here in Dazar\'alor. Just head into de Royal Armory.\n\nYou can find it on de north side of de Dazar\'alor pyramid.', 'So, you want some practice? We have plenty of training dummies here in Dazar\'alor. Just head into de Royal Armory.\n\nYou can find it on de north side of de Dazar\'alor pyramid.', 159716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Zenbaro coughs.>', '', 159715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training Dummies', 'Training Dummies', 159714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you wish to return to Arathi Highlands as it appears in the present, you have but to ask.', 159713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will need you to watch my back while I perform this ritual. It should only take a few moments.', '', 159712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you return me to the present time?', 'Can you return me to the present time?', 159711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Zenbaro the canteen.>', '<Give Zenbaro the canteen.>', 159710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n. Let\'s finish this.', '', 159709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you show me what Arathi Highlands was like before war broke out?', 'Can you show me what Arathi Highlands was like before war broke out?', 159708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see your name right here! Go on upstairs, the farthest office down the hall. Mister Camden will be right with you.', 159707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War rages in these lands, repeating patterns set down long ago. The ways of time are ever cyclical.\n\nApologies. I sometimes forget that your people are so... linear.\n\nHow may I help you?', 159706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry but no one gets in without an appointment. Guards!', 159705, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I have an appointment. It\'s under M. Arbor.', 'Yes, I have an appointment. It\'s under M. Arbor.', 159704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you know who I am? I\'m $n, champion of the Alliance! I need to see your files, now!', 'Don\'t you know who I am? I\'m $n, champion of the Alliance! I need to see your files, now!', 159703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have an appointment with your boss. It is very important I speak with them immediately!', 'I have an appointment with your boss. It is very important I speak with them immediately!', 159702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How may I assist you today?', 159701, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Ashvane Trading Company offices. Do you have an appointment?', 159700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there ye are, $p. Hop on!', '', 159699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. Let\'s just get this over with.', '', 159698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land is rich with history. I really must show you what it was like when the Empire of Arathor stood at its zenith.\n\nHmm. But I suppose that will have to wait.\n\nIs your business in the past complete, champion?', 159697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is. I\'m under no pretense that this is the best solution, but this is the hand we were dealt.', '', 159696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grim business, ain\'t it, Halford? Havin\' te kill every last Zandalari on the ship.', '', 159695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready to start the ritual, place the key of the sea in the bowl.', '', 159694, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been looking forward to your return, $n.', '', 159693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was beginning to worry you might not be back.', '', 159692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad to see you, $n. I\'ll admit, I didn\'t think you\'d return.', '', 159691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me start from de beginning. \n\nMy earliest memories are some of my best, running with de scamps of Zuldazar. \n\nGot up to nothing but trouble back then, but we didn\'t know any better. \n\nRajin was our leader. He gave us shelter, and in return, we did whatever he asked. \n\nDat usually meant running scams in de city or stealing from de loa temple\'s coffers.', '', 159689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On the double! We\'re in hostile territory, not Stormwind! Let\'s get this stuff unloaded and wounded evacuated now!', 159688, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t that de question we all end up asking ourselves?\n\n<Zenbaro coughs.>\n\nDe sands have not been good to me, $n. I am nearing my end. \n\nMy throat swells from de desert heat. \n\nFetch me some cool water from de spring nearby, and I will tell you my story.', '', 159687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re talking about dat goblin and his crazy contraption at de Terrace of Crafters? He says his Scrap-O-Matic 1000 can break down any equipment into its parts to make other things.\n\nJust head to de lower west side of Dazar\'alor.', 'You\'re talking about dat goblin and his crazy contraption at de Terrace of Crafters? He says his Scrap-O-Matic 1000 can break down any equipment into its parts to make other things.\n\nJust head to de lower west side of Dazar\'alor.', 159686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never imagined dis would be my fate. Alone and dying in de dunes.', '', 159685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scrapper', 'Scrapper', 159684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the place. Let\'s get down to the basement.', '', 159683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What business do you have with de Golden Throne? Are you looking for an audience?\n\nTo get up dere, take de elevators from inside de Great Seal.', 'What business do you have with de Golden Throne? Are you looking for an audience?\n\nTo get up dere, take de elevators from inside de Great Seal.', 159682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The basement in question should be nearby. Let\'s not waste any time.', '', 159681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Golden Throne', 'The Golden Throne', 159680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to go?', '', 159679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s make this quick. In and out, before we\'re discovered.', '', 159678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get movin\'!', '', 159677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At once.', 159676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris, I need you to patrol the beaches and ensure no survivors get away. Falstad will join you once he\'s dropped us off.', '', 159675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'ll never see us coming.', 159674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roger that.', '', 159673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeshan, Kelsey, take Umbric\'s portal and establish a landing zone at the top of the boat.', '', 159672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command.', '', 159671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umbric, set up a void portal to bring the Dark Iron dwarves in to Gral\'s Call.', '', 159670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must ensure no one on that ship makes it back to Zuldazar, or our mission, and all of us, are dead.', '', 159669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go.', 'I\'m ready to go.', 159668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone at the academy is going to make fun of me for this! Oh, Yuke, you\'re so clumsy!', 159667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks! I\'m a member of the Shado-Pan, really. I\'m just having an off day, ok? Here\'s some Azerite, don\'t tell anyone about this, please?', 159666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the waves, I could not see this coming. Shall I perish here?', '', 159665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deepest thanks, I should be more careful in the future. A gift for you for your kindness.', '', 159664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How droll, I\'ve mapped myself into a corner!', '', 159663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! What is cartography without a little adventure, eh? A little danger? Yes, I can see in your blank stare that you agree. Here, something for you. Now, I must map!', '', 159662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is really very embarassing to say as a dragon, but could you help me out here?', '', 159661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. These islands house all manner of magical items, worthy of my time and attention. I could do without so many traps, though.', '', 159660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help Two-Socks, much luck to you if you do!', '', 159659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two-Socks is free! You will be maximum amount of lucky today, friend! It is your fate, now!', '', 159658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Tweets you\'re in a jam again! Gotta find a way out...', 159657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re the best! But I\'m not gonna stop exploring, heck no! If I\'m not exploring, I\'m not Tweets Lightsprocket!!', 159656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gratitude mechanisms activated. Dispensing gratitude. Gratitude dispensed.', '', 159655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Circuits registering obstruction, entering help mode. HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP. Repeating.', '', 159654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ay mon, what you doin\' here? Can ya help me out a dis mess?', 159653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat\'s better. Ya got a good head on ya, here be somethin\' for what ya done.', 159652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Want to help a guy out? I promise I am NOT with the Legion anymore. Those guys are gone. It\'s just me now, Sylvester the Honest Imp.', '', 159651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, thanks, really, can\'t thank you enough. Ok bye, don\'t follow me.', '', 159650, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi! Hello? Oh hi, yes, hello. Can you help me? I don\'t know what to do here. Quite lost.', 159649, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks! Thank you, really, so much. Do you know where we are? I don\'t remember what I was doing. Where\'s my boat? Did I have a boat?', 159648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in need of aid! Can anyone hear me?', '', 159647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I thank you, fisher-friend. How have you come so far, yourself? No matter, I see you must be on your way.', '', 159646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De great city of Dazar\'alor is de mightiest in all de world. Its many districts are full of wonder and enticement. Its people are de strongest and wisest.\n\nJust beware de voodoo!', 'De great city of Dazar\'alor is de mightiest in all de world. Its many districts are full of wonder and enticement. Its people are de strongest and wisest.\n\nJust beware de voodoo!', 159645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, I appear to be in a bit over my head. Hmmm. Think think.', '', 159644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh thank you, friend. I could not tell you how many times that has happened to me. Some day I will learn! Ha ha, but not today it seems. Here, I will share what little I have.', '', 159643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gregg need help! Somone help Gregg!', '', 159642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You help Gregg! Gregg so happy. Gregg give you rocks! Gregg love rocks.', '', 159641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, you there. Maybe you help ol\' Frankie out? Maybe he gives you something he knows you want? Whaddaya say?', '', 159640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof, that\'s better. Never thought I\'d be saved by one of you, but life comes at you fast. Here\'s some Azerite for your troubles, and don\'t tell anyone you saw ol\' Frankie here.', '', 159639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aiii! Yes! Flicker thank you! Yes here, take gems!', '', 159638, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Help! You help me! Help!!', '', 159637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay brul, need a spot here!', '', 159636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put a bit too many weightstones on the bar for my own good, there. Thanks, brul.', '', 159635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalari Empire Emissary', 'Zandalari Empire Emissary', 159634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, gee, thanks! You\'re really the best. I\'ll try not to do that again.', 159633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look what you got yourself into THIS time, Karyn. Oh, how am I going to get out of this?', 159632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find Collector Kojo all de way out at Scaletrader Post, to de northeast of de city.\n\nCareful with dat tortollan mojo. It\'s strange stuff for sure.', 'You can find Collector Kojo all de way out at Scaletrader Post, to de northeast of de city.\n\nCareful with dat tortollan mojo. It\'s strange stuff for sure.', 159631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tortollan Seekers Emissary', 'Tortollan Seekers Emissary', 159630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere are several I know of. Which one do you want?', 'Dere are several I know of. Which one do you want?', 159629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Points of Interest', 'Points of Interest', 159628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my humble abode, $c. I hope you rest... in peace.', '', 159627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not any longer. I will explain...', '', 159626, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to mourn what was lost. The Mag\'har will make a new home. Here.', 159625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Azeroth will stay open long enough for your soldiers to prepare for their journey and come through.', '', 159624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aka\'magosh, Geya\'rah. I will inform your mother of your choice. Safe journey, Eitrigg. And to you, $n.', '', 159623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n! De outpost be yours to command.', 159622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To once more feel the stones of Draenor under my feet in battle... this was a good day.', '', 159621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have opened the way to Draenor before. I know in my heart that we will find our way back again.', 159620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic that brings you to Azeroth is volatile. It may not be able to return you home.', '', 159619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have our thanks. $n, prepare to return to--', '', 159618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suspected that once you bonded with them in battle, you would wish to join these heroes, Geya\'rah. I give you my blessing.', '', 159617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The warchief can hold off the draenei and those traitorous Lightbound. The Mag\'har will help you win your war, and then our debt will be paid.', 159616, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, overlord? But what of your people\'s fight here?', '', 159615, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me. Along with a company of volunteers. With your permission, warchief.', 159614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, on the matter of the debt we owe your Horde, we will send--', '', 159613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They fought with courage. I admit... I judged you harshly, Eitrigg. You as well, $n.', 159612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will be ready. And what of these heroes from Azeroth? Were they of aid to you?', '', 159611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The draenei attack was thwarted, warchief. But the High Exarch will not relent. Fanatics never do.', 159610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the pirates sailed out of Freehold, we may find more information there. And I think I know someone who can help us.', '', 159609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... You may be right, Genn. But even if that\'s true, we are left with scant clues to work from.', 159608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps they have yet to arrive at their destination, Katherine. You may not be too late.', '', 159607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The contract was to move Jaina somewhere, not to kill her outright.', '', 159606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can you possibly believe that?', 159605, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 114595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll meet back at the camp, $n.', 159604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She hired pirates to execute my daughter, Genn! Pirates! The scum of the sea!', 159603, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is running out, and all we have to go on is a contract that Priscilla made with some brigands out of Freehold!', 159602, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think about this, Katherine. It may actually be good news.', '', 159601, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... you\'re... really...?', 159600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Alliance battle plans are for our eyes only, time to die blood troll!', 159599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t... be a blood... troll...', '', 159598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood trolls! Hah, you\'re too dumb to understand the Alliance\'s secrets.', '', 159597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re... no... blood troll...!', 159596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A blood troll? I\'ll end this quick before getting these plans to the Zandalari.', 159595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell funny now!', 'I don\'t want to play this game anymore!', 159594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A green man at the shore sold them to us!', 'A green man at the shore sold them to us!', 159593, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The militia are always here to protect us! Well, except right now. They went to some important meeting with the tidesages. They can be scary sometimes, but Brother Pike is always nice when he visits.', 'The militia are always here to protect us! Well, except right now. They went to some important meeting with the tidesages. They can be scary sometimes, but Brother Pike is always nice when he visits.', 159592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was all Grettle\'s idea!', 'Want to buy one as a pet?', 159591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did they call it Stormsong? I never hear them singing.$b$bGrown-ups are weird, aren\'t they?', 'Why did they call it Stormsong? I never hear them singing.$b$bGrown-ups are weird, aren\'t they?', 159590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried the steamed clams yet? They\'re a Stormsong specialty!', 'Have you tried the steamed clams yet? They\'re a Stormsong specialty!', 159589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love it when we visit the Mildenhall Meadery! My parents say I\'m too young for mead, but I always get a honeycomb as a treat.', 'I love it when we visit the Mildenhall Meadery! My parents say I\'m too young for mead, but I always get a honeycomb as a treat.', 159588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if I\'ll grow up to be as big as Mum or Papa. They always eat their vegetables, maybe I should too...', 'I wonder if I\'ll grow up to be as big as Mum or Papa. They always eat their vegetables, maybe I should too...', 159587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mum and dad work hard to make sure everyone has enough to eat. Food is really tasty!', 'My mum and dad work hard to make sure everyone has enough to eat. Food is really tasty!', 159586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello $Gmister:miss;! Are you new to the valley?', 'Hello $Gmister:miss;! Are you new to the valley?', 159585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope no one saw that.', 'Pretend that never happened!', 159584, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have trusted in the guidance of the tidesages for generations. The sea grants them wisdom, I\'m sure of it.', 'We have trusted in the guidance of the tidesages for generations. The sea grants them wisdom, I\'m sure of it.', 159583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had better days.', 'Let\'s not mention this to anyone.', 159582, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you sampled some of the bounty of the valley? Try our fresh bread with some Drustvar sausage. Wash it all down with a nice mug of mead... makes my mouth water just thinking about it.', 'Have you sampled some of the bounty of the valley? Try our fresh bread with some Drustvar sausage. Wash it all down with a nice mug of mead... makes my mouth water just thinking about it.', 159581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We always used to have the militia to protect us. I wonder what made them withdraw?', 'We always used to have the militia to protect us. I wonder what made them withdraw?', 159580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We work in the fields to fill the bellies of Kul Tiras. It\'s tough work, but rewarding!', 'We work in the fields to fill the bellies of Kul Tiras. It\'s tough work, but rewarding!', 159579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may live off the land, but we are still children of the sea.', 'We may live off the land, but we are still children of the sea.', 159578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seas guide you, stranger.', 'Seas guide you, stranger.', 159577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the valley!', 'Welcome to the valley!', 159576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT NOT USED] Ah $n, there you are. Some of the Proudmoores have broken through. Eliminate them.', '', 159575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am getting restless. Allow me to provide my aid from the shadows.', 159574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mama, where\'s Daddy?', 159573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r. You have something you wish reforged?\n\nThe power of Azerite is limitless. Lucky for you, my prices are not.', '', 159572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, champions of Azeroth. We must tell the warchief of our victory...', 159571, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your High Exarch cannot save you. My people will never stop fighting until Draenor is free!', 159570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel... I have failed you...', '', 159569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This once-fertile land is now lifeless dust. That\'s what your hate has done!', '', 159568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our scars are not yours to take!', 159567, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up your hate! The Light can heal the scars of war!', '', 159566, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mean subjugation!', 159565, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru offer us peace and order!', '', 159564, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Draenor! For the Mag\'har!', '', 159563, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tire of your blathering! Let us be judged upon the field of battle!', 159562, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Exarch orders you to submit... or face judgment!', '', 159561, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Retreat while you still can! You will not force your doctrines upon us, draenei!', 159560, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cease this pointless defiance, Mag\'har! Stand down and welcome the Light!', '', 159559, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are with you, Geya\'rah!', '', 159558, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are attacking Evermourn Hold! With me, heroes!', 159557, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Exarch only wishes the best for us all!', 'The High Exarch only wishes the best for us all!', 159556, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Light saved us. It can save you, too!', 'The Light saved us. It can save you, too!', 159555, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of Grommash is past. Embrace a new future!', 'The time of Grommash is past. Embrace a new future!', 159554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us in the Light, brothers and sisters!', 'Join us in the Light, brothers and sisters!', 159553, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can save Draenor together!', 'We can save Draenor together!', 159552, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have ruined this land! It is not too late to save it!', 'You have ruined this land! It is not too late to save it!', 159551, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heed the High Exarch\'s visions!', 'Heed the High Exarch\'s visions!', 159550, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come to save you from your savagery!', 'We come to save you from your savagery!', 159549, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yield, Mag\'har! Embrace the Light!', 'Yield, Mag\'har! Embrace the Light!', 159548, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome.', '', 159547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike down the Light\'s corruption!', 159546, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back, draenei! Your Light is not welcome here!', 159545, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold your ground! This land belongs to the Mag\'har!', 159544, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda welcomes all.', '', 159543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take out those siege engines!', 159542, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then we fight for blood and honor together! With me, heroes!', 159541, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never walked away from a battle. I do not plan to start today.', '', 159540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not your fight, outsiders. You are free to return to Azeroth.', 159539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are holding the line, overlord. But the enemy looks to be mustering for a bigger attack.', '', 159538, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lantresor! Report!', 159537, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can also assail your enemies with a Barbed Shot, causing them to take bleeding damage for a while.', '', 159536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight with you, overlord!', '', 159535, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not stand by while the High Exarch crusades against Mag\'har freedom! The tyranny of the Light must be ended!', 159534, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some orcs even sided with the draenei against their kin... even the warchief\'s own son was lost! We call these traitors Lightbound.', 159533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their naaru masters compelled them to spread their influence among the orcs. A few converted willingly. Others had the Light forced upon them.', 159532, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But without demons to fight, the draenei became fixated upon their precious Light.', 159531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After Archimonde\'s fall, the orcs and draenei worked together to drive the Legion from Draenor. Those were good years.', 159530, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose you have earned that much.', 159529, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time you explained who these Lightbound are, overlord.', '', 159528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good! I\'ve been wanting another exarch\'s head upon my wall. Come, outsiders!', 159527, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An exarch leads them. Their numbers are... considerable.', 'An exarch leads them. Their numbers are... considerable.', 159526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn those traitors! How great a force do they have?', 159525, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord Geya\'rah! The Lightbound are attacking Beastwatch!', 'Overlord Geya\'rah! The Lightbound are attacking Beastwatch!', 159524, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There. You are now... a blood troll. At least temporarily.', '', 159523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we cannot risk even one member of the Alliance being seen within Warport Rastari.', '', 159522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize for the pain and unseemliness of this ritual, $n.', '', 159521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umbric, I\'m ready to become a blood troll.', 'Umbric, I\'m ready to become a blood troll.', 159520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say Pin\'jin is one of de most patient trolls dere has ever been. With all de nobles constantly nattering in his ears about their fancy dresses, he would have to be.\n\nIf you have de patience to learn from him, head over to de Terrace of Crafters. It\'s on de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 'Dey say Pin\'jin is one of de most patient trolls dere has ever been. With all de nobles constantly nattering in his ears about their fancy dresses, he would have to be.\n\nIf you have de patience to learn from him, head over to de Terrace of Crafters. It\'s on de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 159519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think it\'s easy to skin an anklydon? It\'s not! You want to learn, you have to train with Rana.\n\nLast I heard, she just returned to de city. You can find her at de Terrace of Crafters on de west side of Dazar\'alor. Just make sure you\'re nice, or maybe she\'ll skin you, too!', 'You think it\'s easy to skin an anklydon? It\'s not! You want to learn, you have to train with Rana.\n\nLast I heard, she just returned to de city. You can find her at de Terrace of Crafters on de west side of Dazar\'alor. Just make sure you\'re nice, or maybe she\'ll skin you, too!', 159517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want with dat thief, Secott? We haven\'t caught him yet, but we know he\'s stealing gold from Atal\'Dazar! De loa will make him pay. And if dey don\'t, I will!\n\nGo find your \"friend\" over at de Terrace of Crafters. We\'ll be watching de both of you.', 'What do you want with dat thief, Secott? We haven\'t caught him yet, but we know he\'s stealing gold from Atal\'Dazar! De loa will make him pay. And if dey don\'t, I will!\n\nGo find your \"friend\" over at de Terrace of Crafters. We\'ll be watching de both of you.', 159515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xanjo takes de hides dat Rana gives him and makes some of de most beautiful armor you have ever seen.\n\nYou can find him at de Terrace of Crafters on de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 'Xanjo takes de hides dat Rana gives him and makes some of de most beautiful armor you have ever seen.\n\nYou can find him at de Terrace of Crafters on de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 159513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our very own Seshuli crafts de finest jewelry in de South Seas. You want to learn from her, you find her in de Hall of Glimmers.\n\nTo get there, just go to de Terrace of Crafters at de ground on de west side of Dazar\'alor. Then, turn east and head down de tunnel into de pyramid. You can\'t miss her with all de shinies in there.', 'Our very own Seshuli crafts de finest jewelry in de South Seas. You want to learn from her, you find her in de Hall of Glimmers.\n\nTo get there, just go to de Terrace of Crafters at de ground on de west side of Dazar\'alor. Then, turn east and head down de tunnel into de pyramid. You can\'t miss her with all de shinies in there.', 159511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take my hippogryph to Darnassus. Ensure that the Horde\'s occupation is as... tolerable as it can be.', 159509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De chroniclers travel far and wide to know de truth of de world. It\'s Kizani you want to talk to.\n\nYou can find her upstairs at de Great Seal in de Hall of Chroniclers.', 'De chroniclers travel far and wide to know de truth of de world. It\'s Kizani you want to talk to.\n\nYou can find her upstairs at de Great Seal in de Hall of Chroniclers.', 159506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jahden Fla is always tending to his flowers over at de Terrace of Crafters. Dat\'s on de west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nHe\'s not joking when he says dat he has de green thumb.', 'Jahden Fla is always tending to his flowers over at de Terrace of Crafters. Dat\'s on de west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nHe\'s not joking when he says dat he has de green thumb.', 159504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War tests us. Forces us to examine our honor, our convictions.\n\nI have come to Zuldazar to ensure that, in the midst of this struggle, the Horde does not lose sight of what defines us. What makes us strong.\n\nI have faith you will not forget, Speaker of the Horde.', '', 159503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get stronger!', '', 159502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re doing well $p.', '', 159500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, I\'m going to start training to be a brave warrior. I want to be able to defend our town!', '', 159499, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandma won\'t stop talking about how she wishes I was more like you...', '', 159498, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I\'m just glad you go here when you did.', '', 159497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to learn how to fish? Den you have to see Silent Tali. She\'s fishing at de Sliver, north of Dazar\'alor.\n\nJust make sure you don\'t make noise and scare all her fish away.', 'You want to learn how to fish? Den you have to see Silent Tali. She\'s fishing at de Sliver, north of Dazar\'alor.\n\nJust make sure you don\'t make noise and scare all her fish away.', 159496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to let Grandma down, but I\'m not cut out for this... I just want things to get back to normal.', '', 159495, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your head, there are rocks falling from the sky!', '', 159494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere\'s a goblin named Shuga is teaching dat sort of thing at de Terrace of Crafters. Dat\'s outside on de west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nYou better not be planning to blow up anything important. We like Zuldazar de way it is.', 'Dere\'s a goblin named Shuga is teaching dat sort of thing at de Terrace of Crafters. Dat\'s outside on de west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nYou better not be planning to blow up anything important. We like Zuldazar de way it is.', 159492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They killed my cow!!', 'They killed my cow!!', 159491, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ain\'t my first battle!', 'This ain\'t my first battle!', 159489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help however I can!', 'I\'ll help however I can!', 159488, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lemme at \'em!', 'Lemme at \'em!', 159487, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give \'em what-for!', 'I\'ll give \'em what-for!', 159486, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye! They\'ll pay for this!', 'Aye! They\'ll pay for this!', 159485, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking for a blood elf enchantress named Quinni. You can find her by going to de western base of Dazar\'alor to de Terrace of Crafters. Once you\'re there, face de pyramid and go down into de Hall of Glimmers.', 'You\'re looking for a blood elf enchantress named Quinni. You can find her by going to de western base of Dazar\'alor to de Terrace of Crafters. Once you\'re there, face de pyramid and go down into de Hall of Glimmers.', 159484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Proudmoore legacy of failure dies with you!', 159482, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5020, 0, 113407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your family has always been too weak.', 159481, 0, 0, 1, 70, 4303, 0, 113406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And we have evidence!', 159480, 0, 0, 1, 70, 1947, 0, 113405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will shoulder this heavy burden. I can only hope I will be a worthy successor.', 159479, 0, 0, 1, 70, 7542, 0, 113404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want de royal chef, T\'sarah. You can find her inside Dazar\'alor, at de Royal Meat Rack next to de Great Seal.', 'You want de royal chef, T\'sarah. You can find her inside Dazar\'alor, at de Royal Meat Rack next to de Great Seal.', 159478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear friend Priscilla and I have discussed this. I believe that what is best for Kul Tiras is that I step down as Lord Admiral...', 159476, 0, 0, 1, 70, 11392, 0, 113401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Katherine Proudmoore has spent her life doing what\'s best for Kul Tiras!', 159475, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5519, 0, 113400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, horde scum!', 'Die, horde scum!', 159473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send you back to your warchief in pieces!', 'I\'ll send you back to your warchief in pieces!', 159472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never defeat us!', 'You will never defeat us!', 159471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boralus will not fall!', 'Boralus will not fall!', 159470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Boralus!', 'For Boralus!', 159469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold tight, $p. Swiftwing\'ll get us there in no time.', '', 159468, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The thrill of the hunt... There\'s nothing like it.', 159467, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pa\'ku eyes Kua\'fon and sighs.', 159466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go, Swiftwing! Back tae the skies, where we belong.', '', 159465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Closing', 'Closing', 159464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s IMPERATIVE that we send the ignition commands from a position with line-of-sight on all explosion locations. Unfortunately, I need to manually verify all parameters are correctly set, and that cannot be done from anywhere but here.\n\nThe short version: we need you to get in the flying machine and press the big red button when I tell you to.', '', 159463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough questions. Ride!', 159462, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightbound?', '', 159461, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mother commands a garrison in Nagrand. My father fell in battle to the Lightbound.', 159460, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the daughter of Durotan and Draka. I see them both in you. Are your parents...', '', 159459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not need the help of outsiders... but I will do as you command. Come!', 159458, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eitrigg and $n will aid you in putting down the ogre instigator, Geya\'rah.', '', 159457, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan owed a debt to these heroes, Geya\'rah, same as I. You dishonor your father\'s spirit with your outburst. Still... you have given me an idea...', '', 159456, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think us fools?! Warchief, we cannot pledge our soldiers to these off-worlders. Not when we face foes of our own!', 159455, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes from my world once freed yours from the grip of tyrants. Now Azeroth faces a similar threat, so we have come to ask repayment of that debt.', '', 159454, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then here we are... two old ghosts. Why have you returned to Draenor after all this time?', '', 159453, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the Grommash Hellscream I knew gave his life to free us from the grip of demons. A worthy death.', '', 159452, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eitrigg... I knew an Eitrigg who served Blackhand. He was an honorable orc who died in glorious battle.', '', 159451, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. I am Eitrigg, and this is $n, champion of the Horde.', '', 159450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been many years since I set eyes upon a green-skinned orc. And this one at your side is... familiar. You come from Azeroth.', '', 159449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I will judge the prisoners for myself, Geya\'rah.', '', 159448, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your words stir my heart, old one. We still honor the history of our clans, though we stand united as the Mag\'har. But you have yet to prove--', 159447, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan was chieftain of the Frostwolves. Never have I known a more honorable orc. He was a true leader who loved his people. I miss his wisdom.', '', 159446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warsong clan struggled for generations against the ogres. Though vastly outnumbered, Grommash Hellscream led his people to a great victory over the Highmaul.', '', 159445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackrock... my own clan. We were proud orcs... fierce soldiers. But we were deceived by Gul\'dan\'s fel magic and did... terrible things.', '', 159444, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The three banners in this camp will be known to any true orc. Tell me of them, or it\'s the executioner\'s blade for you both!', 159443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is but one warchief... and you are no Blackrock! But let us put your words to the test.', 159442, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Eitrigg of the Blackrock clan. We come from Azeroth on behalf of our warchief.', '', 159441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will see. Speak, intruders. Who are you?', 159440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are Lightbound spies! Filthy traitors!', 'They are Lightbound spies! Filthy traitors!', 159439, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring them to me.', 159438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overlord Geya\'rah! We have prisoners.', '', 159437, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The overlord will know what to do.', 'The overlord will know what to do.', 159436, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary. For all we know, they are spies sent by the draenei.', '', 159435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Green skin... disgusting! I have heard tales of this corruption, but never seen it.', 'Green skin... disgusting! I have heard tales of this corruption, but never seen it.', 159434, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence! The overlord will decide your fate. Bind them!', '', 159433, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your hand! We come in peace to speak to your warchief.', '', 159432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders!', 'Intruders!', 159431, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you want to go digging around in our lands? If you must, you can find Examiner Alerinda in de Great Seal.', 'Why would you want to go digging around in our lands? If you must, you can find Examiner Alerinda in de Great Seal.', 159430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archaeology', 'Archaeology', 159429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this Void voodoo doing here?', 'What is this Void voodoo doing here?', 159428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this voodoo?', 'What is this voodoo?', 159427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What dark voodoo is dis?', 'What dark voodoo is dis?', 159426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go. But take care not to lose yourself amongst the threads of fate.', '', 159425, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send the shard through with you. When you are ready, it will bring you home.', '', 159424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hold the way open long enough for us to bring the orcs of Draenor through?', '', 159423, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The streams of time and reality are ever-shifting. The anchor to the world you seek will be tenuous.', '', 159422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I get to Orgrimmar?', 'How can I get to Orgrimmar?', 159421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our battle here be over, but da war goes on.', '', 159420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warchief will not tolerate excuses. It seems $p must journey to Tanaris. My old bones need a rest.', '', 159419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were the shard not depleted, I could use it to send you on your way. But my specialty is teleportation, not chronomancy.', '', 159418, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to go to de Terrace of Crafters on de lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nYou\'ll find no stronger blacksmith than Forgemaster Zak\'aal in all of Azeroth!', 'You want to go to de Terrace of Crafters on de lower west side of Dazar\'alor.\n\nYou\'ll find no stronger blacksmith than Forgemaster Zak\'aal in all of Azeroth!', 159417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wildlife here is amazing.  Krag\'wa is nearby, I wonder if de presence of a Loa makes them stronger. Want to battle and test your pets against mine?', 159416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pa\'ku chuckles ominously.', 159415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a relief!', 'What a relief!', 159414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain is gone!', 'The pain is gone!', 159413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That feels a lot better.', 'That feels a lot better.', 159412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My honor, General. $p, hop on Swiftwing whenever ye be ready.', '', 159411, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Falstad, you lead the way with $p. I\'ll ride Jai\'alator.', 159410, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... I see now. Perhaps he is not meant to soar in de clouds. But with $n at his side, it will still be a good life.', '', 159409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will lead de way. Trust in each other, and de rest will come. Now, to de skies!', '', 159408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry! Your winged friend will be fine. I have a plan.', '', 159407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clever Kumali is brewing up all kinds of mojo at de Terrace of Crafters. You can find her at de base of de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 'Clever Kumali is brewing up all kinds of mojo at de Terrace of Crafters. You can find her at de base of de west side of Dazar\'alor.', 159405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As members of the Horde have utilized our exemplary services for so long, we have provided mage portals for distinguished individuals, such as yourself. I promise the trip will be mostly painless.', 'As members of the Horde have utilized our exemplary services for so long, we have provided mage portals for distinguished individuals, such as yourself. I promise the trip will be mostly painless.', 159404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hahahaha!', 159403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the wind be at your back!', 159402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I get to Tirisfal Glades?', 'How can I get to Tirisfal Glades?', 159401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thundercaller is under maintenance, it caught fire just one too many times. Shame really.', '', 159399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Pa\'ku.', 'Yes, Pa\'ku.', 159398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have de best trainers in all de world. You can find most of dem on de lower west side of Dazar\'alor on de Terrace of Crafters.\n\nAre you looking for someone in particular?', 'We have de best trainers in all de world. You can find most of dem on de lower west side of Dazar\'alor on de Terrace of Crafters.\n\nAre you looking for someone in particular?', 159397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh, I sensed you would be coming to me soon. It has been some time since your youngling\'s last lesson.\n\nCome, let us see what he has learned.', 159396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trainers', 'Trainers', 159395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pets, huh? De only companions worth having are de children of de loa.\n\nYou\'ll want to find Beast Handler Kalatak near de northwest base of Dazar\'alor.', 'Pets, huh? De only companions worth having are de children of de loa.\n\nYou\'ll want to find Beast Handler Kalatak near de northwest base of Dazar\'alor.', 159394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have been doing King Rastakhan\'s bidding, den Natal\'hakata might have something good for you inside de Great Seal.', 'If you have been doing King Rastakhan\'s bidding, den Natal\'hakata might have something good for you inside de Great Seal.', 159392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emissaries', 'Emissaries', 159391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tirisfal has seen great powers rise and fall. But I wonder... will your kind ever truly glean lessons from its history?\n\nBut I digress.\n\nIs your business in the past complete, champion?', 159390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teldrassil... a magnificent sight, was it not? Often the most beautiful things are the most fleeting.\n\nEspecially when mortals insist on shooting them with fire.\n\nIs your business in the past complete, champion?', 159389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you think you can rest with dat dead thing dancing around, you can seek her out in de Great Seal.', 'If you think you can rest with dat dead thing dancing around, you can seek her out in de Great Seal.', 159388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_CREATURE_CURSED_04.BLP:20|t Vectis begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267242|h[Contagion]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_CREATURE_CURSED_04.BLP:20|t Vectis begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267242|h[Contagion]|h|r!', 159386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All requests for shelter will be prioritized on a case-by-case basis.', '', 159385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From these shores, you may gaze upon Teldrassil. Once a cradle of life, it is now a ruin of ash and fire.\n\nEven the World Trees must bow to the cycle of life. Everything born will die.\n\nNo one understands this better than the Bronze Dragonflight.\n\nWould you like to see the tree as it once was?', 159384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regrettably, our resources are quite strained at the moment.', '', 159383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find Paku\'ai on de ledge outside de Great Seal. Where are you going?', 'You can find Paku\'ai on de ledge outside de Great Seal. Where are you going?', 159382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please be patient. We\'re doing everything we can, under the circumstances.', '', 159381, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tirisfal... a place of beauty and darkness. A land fraught with regret... and graves.\n\nYour kind has fought to claim it time and time again.\n\nDo you wish to see it as it was prior to the latest war?', 159379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was getting tired of goat meat.', '', 159378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s comin\'?', '', 159377, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can get ye and a small squad there in no time.', '', 159376, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Falstad Wildhammer whistles and gryphon riders descend onto the deck.', '', 159375, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer ship\'s too slow tae get there in time. But speed\'s no problem for the Wildhammer.', '', 159374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Dreven is onboard that boat, he\'ll be cornered. Nowhere to escape to... if we can strike before they make landfall.', '', 159373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my hunt, I learned that Blood Prince Dreven is traveling via boat with a traitorous tidesage.', 159372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Actually, I believe this is a top priority. Thank you, Mathias.', 159371, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shandris Feathermoon swoops down onto the deck atop her hippogryph.', 159370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not sure, but I can send some agents to investigate. This may be low priority.', '', 159369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could the Horde be looking for in old shipwrecks...?', '', 159368, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Mathias.', '', 159367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We, of course, allowed the original to proceed to its destination without sign of tampering, but created a duplicate for you.', '', 159366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Commander, my agents have intercepted orders from Sylvanas.', '', 159365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people will not make the same mistake when using the Void, I promise.', '', 159364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like you said, Umbric, I have lived a long life. I have seen power corrupt the most noble of races... restraint has been uncommon.', 159363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sound surprised. Did you imagine my people simply used void magic as if it were a toy?', '', 159362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Used to protect? Interesting, Umbric.', 159361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void can be used to protect, as long as you do not succumb to its power.', '', 159360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you do not seem hesitant to use your Void powers against them.', 159359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and I have both lived long lives, Shandris. I know many who have been affected by the Zandalari\'s barbarism.', '', 159358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sound like you\'ve had experience with the Zandalari in the past.', 159357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people and I will not allow the Alliance to be destroyed by these monstrous trolls. You have my word.', '', 159356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The amount of guards in this port is astounding. They must be preparing to move out the fleet.', 159355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll need to warn Halford right away after we drop $n off.', 159354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s bad when you consider its route takes it within eyesight of our outpost in Xibala.', '', 159353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One ship? Doesn\'t sound too bad.', 159352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a problem. There\'s a ship that we didn\'t account for. Maybe it was one that was stationed in Pandaria.', '', 159351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see. It seems like Halford\'s intel was right about the location of most ships, as well as their sailing routes. Although...', '', 159350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t normally peek... but I can make an exception this one time. Let\'s see...', 159349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any new intel from the records $n recovered?', '', 159348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck! Warport Rastari will be crawling with Zandalari. I\'m sure Shandris has a plan.', 159347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for a change, see those strange goblins in de Grand Bazaar near de harbor.', 'If you\'re looking for a change, see those strange goblins in de Grand Bazaar near de harbor.', 159346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All sorts of weird critters runnin\' around these parts. Some are your standard rabbits and squirrels and beavers, but then there\'s these other weird ones that look like they are a walking bundle of sticks.  I spent days and finally caught one and trained it up, turns out they are pretty loyal. Don\'t get me wrong, you\'ll still yell out when you get poked by one of their sharp pointy bits, but I think they\'re pretty darn cool. Want to see them in action?', '', 159343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find de Royal Treasury right in de middle of de pyramid next to de Great Seal.', 'You can find de Royal Treasury right in de middle of de pyramid next to de Great Seal.', 159342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to go plant some bombs... and not blow them up. For now.', '', 159340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t say that, Flynn. We have to hold out hope that Lady Jaina could still be alive!', 159339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, please extend my sincere condolences to Lady Katherine.', '', 159338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate\'s End... Not how I\'d choose to go out, that\'s for sure.', '', 159337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s play!', 'Let\'s play!', 159336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their shinies!', 'Take their shinies!', 159335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh you have shinies!', 'Oooh you have shinies!', 159334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and play with us!', 'Come and play with us!', 159333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha!', 'Ha ha ha!', 159332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fell for it!', 'Fell for it!', 159331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got you!', 'Got you!', 159330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He he he!', 'He he he!', 159329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful. I\'ll be waiting for your signal!', 159228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re done, we\'ll meet up in Freehold.', '', 159227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You grab some grenades. I\'m going to see a cadet about a bird.', '', 159226, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess they didn\'t dare reveal her destination, even in this mess of legalese and double-talk. But I bet I know where they stashed that information.', '', 159225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe there\'s something in the fine print...', '', 159224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Katherine has you looking for her daughter, eh? Well, let\'s see what this contract has to say about where she went.', '', 159223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Where are you \'shipping\' Jaina off to?', '', 159222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More definitions, more terms of service... legal mumbo-jumbo that would never hold up in court unless the judge were crooked....', '', 159221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten pages of security measures... twenty pages of liability conditions...', '', 159220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Description of services, the carrier will supply to the client... Blah, blah, blah...', '', 159219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Contract for services is hereby made by Ashvane et cetera... Ugh, who writes this stuff?', '', 159218, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pass through the wall quickly! I cannot hold it much longer!', 159217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Katherine has asked me to look for her daughter. This is the only clue I have so far.', 'Lady Katherine has asked me to look for her daughter. This is the only clue I have so far.', 159216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n. Good to see you again.', '', 159215, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to me as soon as you discover where Jaina was taken, $n.', 159214, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you are right, Genn.', 159213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is one of the finest champions of the Alliance, Katherine. If anyone will be able to recover Jaina it will be them.', '', 159212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_CORPSEEXPLODE.BLP:20|t You are infected with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_CORPSEEXPLODE.BLP:20|t You are infected with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r!', 159211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! Use the control charm!', '', 159210, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This be yer stop. Be careful and remember, plant the bombs and don\'t let \'em alert the mainland about yer presence!', '', 159209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...  This might be the beginning of a beautiful friendship.', '', 159208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A? No no no, I have SEVERAL knife collections.', 159207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a knife collection?', '', 159206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a man after my own heart, Keeshan. We\'ll have to compare knife collections after this.', 159205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I\'ll be helping $n by planting Kelsey\'s bombs on the smaller ships... and gutting any Zandalari that see me.', '', 159204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be working on a device to help $n get across the water for the next part of this plan.', 159203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye just need te make sure they don\'t see ye plantin\' those bombs at the base of their ships.', '', 159202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye don\'t have te tell me twice. I be droppin\' ye all off on the Isle of Fangs. It be far enough from the city that ye can act with some impunity against them Zandalari.', '', 159201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was almost eaten once. I don\'t recommend it.', '', 159200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'d feed us to their pet dinosaurs. We\'d be chewed to tiny little pieces.', 159199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. Finding a small number, like $n over here, is one thing. But if they see the whole bleedin\' camp?', '', 159198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you think Halford is moving so fast? He knows we\'re doomed if the Zandalari catch us in their home.', 159197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Alliance camp stands out like a sore thumb. We need to be ready for when the Zandalari discover us.', '', 159196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! This should be high enough to avoid the Zandalari spottin\' us.', '', 159195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight, we gotta get REAL high to avoid detection!', '', 159194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re always welcome to stop by whenever you want $p.', 159193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never see you with your coat dear, you\'re going to catch a mean cold if you\'re not careful!', 159192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you\'re getting enough rest. There\'ll always be plenty of monsters to fight!', 159191, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s discuss our plan to weaken the Zandalari fleet.', 'Let\'s discuss our plan to weaken the Zandalari fleet.', 159190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... DARE you...?', 'How... DARE you...?', 159189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crushing tide... is coming...', 'The crushing tide... is coming...', 159188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness... is only temporary...', 'Darkness... is only temporary...', 159187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent... brat...', 'Insolent... brat...', 159186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have thousands of constructs... you cannot win...', 'We have thousands of constructs... you cannot win...', 159185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spirit... will return...', 'My spirit... will return...', 159184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This will not stop with my death...', 'This will not stop with my death...', 159183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will... rebuild...', 'We will... rebuild...', 159182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your punishment only begins with death!', 'Your punishment only begins with death!', 159181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why, hello there, dear! Might you be able to help me with an errand or two? Only as long as it\'s no bother though!', 159180, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate is sealed, fool.', 'Your fate is sealed, fool.', 159179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow down, intruder!', 'Bow down, intruder!', 159178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will be slow, interloper!', 'Your death will be slow, interloper!', 159177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were here before your kind, we will be here when you perish!', 'We were here before your kind, we will be here when you perish!', 159176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent flesh-creature!', 'Insolent flesh-creature!', 159175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn to respect your superiors!', 'You will learn to respect your superiors!', 159174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weak have no place in this world!', 'The weak have no place in this world!', 159173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is dead... cannot die...', 'What is dead... can never die...', 159172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to her, only for a moment...', 'I return to her, only for a moment...', 159171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be forgotten in the depths...', 'We will not be forgotten in the depths...', 159170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will free us from this torment...', 'She will free us from this torment...', 159169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will have the golden liquid... you cannot stop us all...', 'She will have the golden liquid... you cannot stop us all...', 159168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are eternal... your victory means nothing...', 'We are eternal... your victory means nothing...', 159167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will bring me back...', 'She will bring me back...', 159166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot be killed... by mortals...', 'We cannot be killed... by mortals...', 159165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stealth the breath from your lungs!', 'I will stealth the breath from your lungs!', 159164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These waters belong to us!', 'These waters belong to us!', 159163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The depths will crush your fragile bones!', 'The depths will crush your fragile bones!', 159162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides will take you!', 'The tides will take you!', 159161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya calls to you!', 'Helya calls to you!', 159160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will be ours!', 'Your souls will be ours!', 159159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will join us in death, you will join her army!', 'You will join us in death, you will join her army!', 159158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mists come for you!', 'The mists come for you!', 159157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never master the seas...', 'You will never master the seas...', 159156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One dies, but thousands remain...', 'One dies, but thousands remain...', 159155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not think you have won...', 'Do not think you have won...', 159154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your future... is doomed...', 'Your future... is doomed...', 159153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for you...', 'Death comes for you...', 159152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara... is all...', 'Azshara... is all...', 159151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Azshara... I return to the waves...', 'My Azshara... I return to the waves...', 159150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen...', 'My queen...', 159149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fathom-god waits for you, writhing in anticipation!', 'The fathom-god waits for you, writhing in anticipation!', 159148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
