('The Alliance will endure... and the Banshee Queen\'s insidious reign will be ended.', '', 159009, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 114087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She expects this atrocity to crush our spirits. Shatter our unity. But this I vow...', '', 159008, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 114086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rargh! Honorably struck...', 'Rargh! Honorably struck...', 159007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yargh! This is the death I crave!', 'Yargh! This is the death I crave!', 159006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that dream can never be realized so long as Sylvanas Windrunner leads the Horde.', '', 159005, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 114085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sail... into the sunset...', 'I sail... into the sunset...', 159004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My whole life, I have prayed for peace in this world.', '', 159003, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 114084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take my place with the warriors of old...', 'I will take my place with the warriors of old...', 159002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown courage and heart, champion. On this, one of the Alliance\'s darkest days.', '', 159001, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 114083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits bless my passing...', 'The spirits bless my passing...', 159000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest while you can. Prepare for the battles ahead. I will have need of you.', 158999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die in glorious battle!', 'I die in glorious battle!', 158998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clan will avenge me...', 'The clan will avenge me...', 158997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But they ARE bleeding. Their anger will prove a weakness, not a strength, in the war to come.', 158996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for you...', 'Death comes for you...', 158995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another puny one to conquer!', 'Another puny one to conquer!', 158994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another glorious battle!', 'Another glorious battle!', 158993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
