('', 'I just love all these fun little creatures you can find out here.  Bunnies and birds and crabs, everything you can think of. I have a few pets that I\'ve trained up to be champions, you see this big carcass next to me?  My pets did that in 4 minutes flat. Hungry little guys. Want to see them in action?', 158898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye on Meerah, will you? \n\nShe\'s blind to the true dangers of the desert. I\'d hate to see her swallowed by the sands...', 158897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your friend looks much better. I\'m glad Kiro and Meerah were able to help.', 158896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
