('Me take your head as trophy when we done here!', '', 158711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dem! Break dere spines!', '', 158710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis my island, puny one. Mine!', '', 158709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me smash you, drink your blood!', '', 158708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me crush you to pieces! Rrawgh!', '', 158707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis my gems! Rrrawgh!', '', 158706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No take our stuff!', '', 158705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dem!', '', 158704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take gems!', '', 158703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis my island! You leave now!', '', 158702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill da intruder!', '', 158701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash, crush, kill!', '', 158700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me crush you!', '', 158699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if I jus\' promise to be a better person dis time... not like last time!', 'Maybe if I jus\' promise to be a better person dis time... not like last time!', 158698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think Bwonsamdi would want from me?', 'What do you think Bwonsamdi would want from me?', 158697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I gotta do... what I gotta do... there has to be a way outta dis!', 'What I gotta do... what I gotta do... there has to be a way outta dis!', 158696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I jus\' make a deal with Bwonsamdi, then everything go back to normal, right?', 'If I jus\' make a deal with Bwonsamdi, then everything go back to normal, right?', 158695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate dis! I hate everything!', 'I hate dis! I hate everything!', 158694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis not be acceptable! Don\'t they know who I am?', 'Dis not be acceptable! Don\'t they know who I am?', 158693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna get whoever did dis to me! If it be the last thing I do!', 'I gonna get whoever did dis to me! If it be the last thing I do!', 158692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could dis happen? It ain\' fair!', 'How could dis happen? It ain\' fair!', 158691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ain\' gonna get better, an\' you can\'t convince me o\' dat either.', 'It ain\' gonna get better, an\' you can\'t convince me o\' dat either.', 158690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be goin\' so great for me, and now look... now I be nothin\'.', 'It be goin\' so great for me, and now look... now I be nothin\'.', 158689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never gonna feel the sun again.', 'I never gonna feel the sun again.', 158688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had a few more days... I could\'ve done so much.', 'If only I had a few more days... I could\'ve done so much.', 158687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead? No, I jus\' be takin\' a little rest.', 'Dead? No, I jus\' be takin\' a little rest.', 158686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who you be? Never mind, it can\'t be dat important...', 'Who you be? Never mind, it can\'t be dat important...', 158685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I not be lookin\', then it not be happenin\'. Simple as dat.', 'If I not be lookin\', then it not be happenin\'. Simple as dat.', 158684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Just keep goin\'... just keep goin\'... It be turnin\' out right eventually...', 'Just keep goin\'... just keep goin\'... It be turnin\' out right eventually...', 158683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you trample through MY hold. No longer!', '', 158682, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak. Face me in real combat!', '', 158681, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think your pitiful machine can stand up to me!?', '', 158680, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho, challenger appears! Have at thee!', '', 158679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I\'m too pretty to die...', '', 158678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll... gut you...', 158677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gonna cut you to ribbons!', 158676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bury me at sea...', '', 158675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna keel-haul you!', '', 158674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. This guy. Not sure what\'s worse... his excessive use of hair product or his amateur poetry. But make no mistake, Reed\'s a lover and a fighter.', '', 158673, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 114555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beckett\'s something of a legend in his own mind.', '', 158672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luna is a bit... Sharp, shall we say.', '', 158671, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... The only certain things. Taxes and...', '', 158670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we have here? Looks like an account that needs to be settled!', '', 158669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I pray we are not too late, $n. Go with all speed. Find my daughter.', 158668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fate\'s End is an island off the coast of Stormsong. The worst criminals and traitors are taken there, never to return.', 158666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! What have you found?', 158665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting outta here! Thank you for your help, $p!', '', 158661, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon issues a piercing screech and lashes his tail excitedly.', '', 158660, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon places the skull back in your hand.', '', 158659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon drops the skull at his feet and screeches playfully at you.', '', 158658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This war is lost. Teldrassil will soon fall.', 158657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides shall swallow you whole!', '', 158656, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, champion. We must follow our warchief to... victory.', '', 158655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That works. Everyone, hop on!', 158654, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a choice as well. Take him to Darnassus and both of you will fall when we conquer it... or flee somewhere far from here, so that you both survive.', '', 158653, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because you spared Malfurion, I will offer you a choice.', 158652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand firm.', 158651, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not for nothing. We spill blood so that the Horde will endure.', '', 158650, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 113657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This entire war is without honor. How dare you spill so much innocent blood... for nothing!', 158649, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 113757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I struck without honor. I did not deserve to end him.', '', 158648, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 113656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did not kill him, orc. Why?', 158647, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 113756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion! No!', 158646, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 113755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have led... your Horde... in service... of death. You will... regret this day...', '', 158645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heal your wounds and rest your bones. You are safe here.', 158642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I died from pickin\' a fight wit de wrong beastie. You know de one.', 'I died from pickin\' a fight wit de wrong beastie. You know de one.', 158641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I jus\' as confused as you, mon.', 'I jus\' as confused as you, mon.', 158640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\' take de heat of Haw\'li\'s chili.', 'I couldn\' take de heat of Haw\'li\'s chili.', 158639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I died runnin\' in de Torcanata. An\' I be doin\' it again if I could!', 'I died runnin\' in de Torcanata. An\' I be doin\' it again if I could!', 158638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be leavin\' your body at de door, yah?', 'You be leavin\' your body at de door, yah?', 158637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be struck by lightning, walkin\' down de Zocalo.', 'I be struck by lightning, walkin\' down de Zocalo.', 158636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I died falling off de pyramid, and now I can\'t remember how I got here.', 'I died falling off de pyramid, and now I can\'t remember how I got here.', 158635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All dressed up with nowhere to go.', 'All dressed up with nowhere to go.', 158634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calculating the correct location to place this portal in Boralus was not easy, but it was a welcome challenge! Do tell me how it goes, will you?', '', 158633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Nathanos.', '', 158632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zelling, accompany $n to Boralus. Oculeth awaits with a portal.', '', 158631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay dere, hero. We need ta talk.', '', 158630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the best seat in the house... You can have it when I get up.', '', 158629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p? Pfft, never even heard of you.', 158628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re ready to get out to the ships, Hobart is waiting outside to assist you.', '', 158627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t say we didn\'t warn ya.', 'Don\'t say we didn\'t warn ya.', 158626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! It\'s for your own good.', 'Stay back! It\'s for your own good.', 158625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon shivers in terror.', '', 158624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides sure have turned in our favor, wouldn\'t ya say, $n?', '', 158623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see great things on the horizon, for you and me both.', '', 158622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t just leave me here. My bones be too old to work in dese mines.', 'You can\'t just leave me here. My bones be too old to work in dese mines.', 158621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see where we may have gone wrong with the fermentation stage.', '', 158620, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, the introduction of unseen contaminants may be having an impact on the initial reduction process.', '', 158619, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got it.', '', 158618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything to help.', '', 158617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off to work I go.', '', 158616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, I\'ll lend a hand.', '', 158615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suppose I can lend a hand.', '', 158614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look up and around you. The trees have eyes, champion. Blind them.', 158612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ought to focus on stabilizing the key compounds first.', '', 158611, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhh! This explains quite a bit! \"The First Law of Alchemy: To obtain something of benefit, a reciprocal substitution must be afforded.\"', '', 158610, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lets do this!', 'Lets do this!', 158609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intriguing... the precise application of heat is crucial.', '', 158608, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh! I think I understand where the catalyst failed.', '', 158607, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odd... there\'s no way we could have predicted that.', '', 158606, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... well that is interesting.', '', 158605, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of our pals got caught out there. Wanna give \'em a hand?', '', 158604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Someone\'s nabbed a bunch of our goods! We gotta get \'em back, PRONTO. Preferably with interest.', '', 158603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, wounded EVERYWHERE. We gotta get those guys some help!', '', 158602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any good sneak thieves around? Got a job for ya!', '', 158601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, you find any spare wartrike parts out there, lemme know. You can take her for a spin once she\'s runnin\' again.', '', 158600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spy somethin\' that needs a good old-fashioned Kezan-style stompin\'.', '', 158599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, look at the size of THAT thing. Hey! Anyone wanna go kill it?', '', 158598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of our Alliance forces have been captured. Feeling up for a rescue operation?', '', 158597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy forces have absconded with crucial supplies. What say we supply the thieves with some Alliance justice?', '', 158596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have injured soldiers in the field. Any medics on hand?', '', 158595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, child. Elune was with them. She blessed the druids with the strength to conjure a great wind to fill their sails.', '', 158594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Veiled Sea was kind to them, Shan\'do?', 158593, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me back to the harbor.', 'Send me back to the harbor.', 158592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the smaller ship.', 'Send me to the smaller ship.', 158591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeking volunteers for a daring covert operation; a degree of stealth and skullduggery will be required.', '', 158590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are attempting to salvage an enemy war machine. Do bring back any spare components you can find.', '', 158589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah. A target of opportunity presents itself.', '', 158588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some rather large and hostile wildlife has wandered onto the field. The hunt is on!', '', 158587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna say hello to my little friend?', '', 158586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a real kick in the bombs, pal.', '', 158585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey. Cool it.', '', 158584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it back in one piece, yeah?', '', 158583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open.', '', 158582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself out there.', '', 158581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s new?', '', 158580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it goin\'?', '', 158579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookin\' good.', '', 158578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, I could use another drink.', '', 158577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even an officer\'s pay isn\'t worth this.', '', 158576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes...', '', 158575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run along.', '', 158574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dismissed.', '', 158573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your enemies in your sights.', '', 158572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 158571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my undivided attention.', '', 158570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Alliance.', '', 158569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... this can not be.', 158568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will help me test the limits of my power!', 158565, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some say my magic is cruel, but I seek only to explore the bounds of what is possible.', 158564, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rooting', 'Rooting', 158563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mia... MIA! Open your eyes, my queen... my love!', '', 158562, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your goddess watch over you.', '', 158561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Banshee murdered my son. Stole my kingdom. She will not cost me my beloved!', '', 158560, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They... will not go...', 158559, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 113673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astarii, you\'ve done all you can! Command the priests to come with us!', '', 158558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never! I\'ll take you both!', '', 158557, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tree... they\'re burning the tree! The child... save her. Leave... me.', 158555, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stay here any longer! We must escape through the portal!', '', 158554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Astarii, there is no time to lose. We must evacuate this city before it burns to ash!', 158553, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 113670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finish him and be done with it. Take a moment, if you like... then take his head. Meet me at the World Tree.', 158551, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My victory was inevitable. He was merely wasting my time.', 158550, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was not my place to interfere.', '', 158549, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Regret nothing. You did well.', 158548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dishonorable blow. I... regret it.', '', 158547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGH! Saur...fang?!', '', 158546, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief faces Stormrage alone! I must...', '', 158545, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The north? How did... Oh, they scaled the mountains of Felwood. Of course!', '', 158544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, Delaryn--intercept them at Auberdine. I will see to the north.', '', 158543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is only a matter of time before the Horde breaks through. They will attack us from both sides.', '', 158542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wisps... they\'re growing disoriented! The wall is failing!', '', 158541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That sound... could it be...? Shan\'do! The Horde is approaching from the north!', 158540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now is the time. The World Tree is ours for the taking! Find Saurfang. We shall finish this once and for all.', 158539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around you, hero! What a lovely sight. The wisps are scattering. One by one, the wall comes crashing down.', 158537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang! It\'s about time.', 158536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', '', 158535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did you fly away to, little bird?', 158534, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 113737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh! My eyes! It burns!', 158533, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 113736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, witch!', '', 158532, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 113281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who would have guessed that you would come to protect your precious trees?', 158531, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 113735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion. How gracious of you to join us...', 158530, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 113734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas! Your foul deeds desecrate this sacred place! Andu-falah-dor!', '', 158529, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 113280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We shall not afford them the luxury of a peaceful night\'s rest. This is war.', 158528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the meantime, we will do all that we can to keep the kaldorei under pressure.', 158527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will continue leading our soldiers through the wall while we await word from Saurfang.', 158526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must stay the course for now.', 158525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wildbend River is locked in a stalemate, and Malfurion knows it.', 158524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions of the Horde, your aid is required at Wildbend River! This is our chance for victory!', 158523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...I have a crow to hunt.', 158522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make quick work of this place. Give the azerite to our engineers when you\'ve collected all you can hold.', 158521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That ship must have come from Darnassus... Which means...', 158520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Proceed with caution, champion. It seems the Alliance has beaten us to it.', 158519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite... With this in our grasp, all who dare to oppose the Horde will fall.', 158518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sappers! Gather your gear and follow me! Bring every shredder we have.', 158517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'End their existence, or they will coat this forest in our peoples\' blood.', 158516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see this makes you uneasy. These ancients have been turned against you, druid... against their sacred charge.', 158515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia! We could use a pickup here!', '', 158514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And by that I mean \"jump off the cliff to safety.\" Come on!', '', 158513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And make a dramatic escape!', '', 158512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just need to grab the chest...', '', 158511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never realized how harsh the sun could be on one\'s remaining skin.', 'I never realized how harsh the sun could be on one\'s remaining skin.', 158510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assure you, my plan is brilliant.', '', 158509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assume you have a plan for getting out of here with that?', 'I assume you have a plan for getting out of here with that?', 158508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan increased his security by adding another lock to his strongbox.\n\n<Flynn rubs his chin.>\n\nYep. Nothing to do right now... but steal the chest.', '', 158507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well played, Harlan. Well played.', '', 158506, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 114558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thinking a hundred laps around the Academy for every cadet I find.', '', 158505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have to be around here somewhere.', '', 158504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We never asked to be brought back... or to endure this.', 'We never asked to be brought back... or to endure this.', 158503, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four locks? Four!?', '', 158502, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 114557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance dares to think WE are monsters?', 'The Alliance dares to think WE are monsters?', 158501, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did those cadets go...', '', 158500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, here we are... Harlan Sweete\'s strongbox.', '', 158499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all that has happened, I can\'t say I envy her. But perhaps it\'s time for her to hand Kul Tiras over to someone who\'s more qualified to lead.', 'With all that has happened, I can\'t say I envy her. But perhaps it\'s time for her to hand Kul Tiras over to someone who\'s more qualified to lead.', 158498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems that with every day, it becomes more and more obvious that Katherine is just riding on her late husband\'s coat tails.', 'It seems that with every day, it becomes more and more obvious that Katherine is just riding on her late husband\'s coat tails.', 158497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another week gone by without a meeting between the Houses.', 'Another week gone by without a meeting between the Houses.', 158496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite. Any Tiragarde noble worth their sea salt would have had the common sense not to set up such a sob story the victim could capitalize on.', 'Quite. Any Tiragarde noble worth their sea salt would have had the common sense not to set up such a sob story the victim could capitalize on.', 158495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murdered in broad daylight, on their wedding day. What amateurish planning.', 'Murdered in broad daylight, on their wedding day. What amateurish planning.', 158494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About her fiance? Of course, what a shame.', 'About her fiance? Of course, what a shame.', 158493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear what happened with the Waycrest daughter?', 'Did you hear what happened with the Waycrest daughter?', 158492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How disgraceful. What sort of Stormsong can\'t call upon the sea? If I were in that family, I would\'ve disowned the boy ages ago.', 'How disgraceful. What sort of Stormsong can\'t call upon the sea? If I were in that family, I would\'ve disowned the boy ages ago.', 158491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So his uncle just shipped him off to be our concern then?', 'So his uncle just shipped him off to be our concern then?', 158490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear Brannon is back to working here in the Sound.', 'I hear Brannon is back to working here in the Sound.', 158489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m relieved to see that Jaina takes after her mother. I can\'t say that Daelin was much of a looker.', 'I\'m relieved to see that Jaina takes after her mother. I can\'t say that Daelin was much of a looker.', 158488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<A dagger remains lodged in her back, but all of her belongings have been stolen.>', 158487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<This Zandalari corpse appears to be fresh.>', 158486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Examine the body.>', '<Examine the body.>', 158485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waycrests haven\'t visited Boralus in some time. I wonder if Meredith finally realized how much she doesn\'t fit in here.', 'The Waycrests haven\'t visited Boralus in some time. I wonder if Meredith finally realized how much she doesn\'t fit in here.', 158484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see Lord Stormsong\'s attire last time he was here? A hat with tentacles is a bit old fashioned if you ask me.', 'Did you see Lord Stormsong\'s attire last time he was here? A hat with tentacles is a bit old fashioned if you ask me.', 158483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Simon glances at Kunga.>\n\nUmm, yes... Ha! Ha! what a joker you are, friend!\n\nHa! ha! So funny!\n\nYou should leave now, before you find another. Ha! ha!\n\nGo watch the fighting while I... restock.', '', 158482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a body behind your store.', 'I found a body behind your store.', 158481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, um, yes.\n\nWelcome to my store, Simon\'s... Selling... Stuff... Store.\n\nI sell...\n\n<Simon glances behind him quickly.>\n\nWeapons. All sorts of weapons. But they\'re all busy now.\n\nMaybe come back later after I\'ve... restocked.', '', 158480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will put you down, Horde scum!', '', 158479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance holds no claim upon our lands!', 'The Alliance holds no claim upon our lands!', 158478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything is better than trail bread.', '', 158477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All our resources are focused on buying time for our people to evacuate and keep the Horde at bay. Seek out something to eat for our sentinels.', '', 158476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall send you to the depths of the sea!', 158475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s not a mojo in my pocket.', '', 158474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna give ya a taste of ya own medicine!', '', 158473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be makin\' me turn ya into a toad!', '', 158472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya best be stoppin\' dat. I may be old, but dat just means I know da best hexes to use.', '', 158471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy dere, mon. Don\'t need to be gettin\' so handsy.', '', 158470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been trainin\' Darkspear trolls for generations.', '', 158469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, and keep a good mojo close at hand.', '', 158468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anything is better than trail rations.', 158467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An army moves on it\'s stomach, or so I am told. There must be something worth eating in this forest.', 158466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just remember, not everything regenerates.', '', 158465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 158464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve nearly got the sample I need! Just a bit more time...', '', 158463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, these leaves are a bit more stubborn than anticipated... but I think I\'m making progress.', '', 158462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may take some time. Removing the leaves is a delicate process.', '', 158461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be gettin\' too old for dis.', '', 158460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits be wit\' ya.', '', 158459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eekum bokum.', '', 158458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone call for da doctah?', '', 158457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya seek me help?', '', 158456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, mon.', '', 158455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the spirits to guide me.', 'I\'d like the spirits to guide me.', 158454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits, they can guide you through here.', '', 158453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Una\'fe, $n. The outpost is yours to command.', '', 158452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve disarmed them... for now. Until we shut down their suppliers, we must remain vigilant.', 158451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fill your belly until it is full and rest a while!', 158450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seal on this chamber protects the world\'s soul. But with all this Azerite burstin\' through, the seal is close tae shatterin\'!', '', 158449, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye use yer amulet tae absorb the Azerite, its power should mend the chamber\'s seal!', '', 158448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rumor has it that the gangs have gotten hold of some nasty Azerite explosives. Until those armaments are recovered, no one in Boralus is safe!', 158447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My boat sank and hundreds of men went in the water. Sharks showed up within the hour.  Small sharks, big sharks, angry sharks. We fought against them as best we could, but when you get looked at right in the eye by a shark and see those lifeless, black eyes, they don\'t even seem to be livin\' until they come up and bite ya. Then the ocean turns red, things get dark, and within moments a man gets torn to pieces. Probably lost half of the men by the end of the first night. There were a thousand sharks if there were ten. Eventually rescue came, maybe five days later, almost was too late. Three hundred and sixteen men went in the drink, seven came out, sharks took the rest. \n\nEnough talk. Want to battle some sharks?', '', 158446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. I\'ll take my chances. Let me borrow those boots.', 'Thanks. I\'ll take my chances. Let me borrow those boots.', 158445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ouch! I was just tryin\' to move some boxes that... uh... fell off the back of a wagon.\n\nAt least Coda\'s fine. Nothing can hurt my amazing, little man!\n\nI have a second pair of boots if ya need to jump back up north. Fair warning... I haven\'t tested \'em out yet.', 158444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re too late.', 158443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See if these people need help. I\'ll go on ahead!', 158442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First we have to hold that gate!', 158441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no...', 158440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We know. Just rest. He\'ll get what\'s coming to him.', 158439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan... the bastard\'s sold out to Ashvane... he\'s... UNGH!', '', 158438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhh... everywhere... <cough>', '', 158437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flynn! It\'s okay, I\'ve got you! Are you alright? Where does it hurt?', 158436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ughh.. ah.. wh- woaaAAHH!!', '', 158435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Come, mother. Time to go home.', 158434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on tight!', 158433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.', 'I\'m ready to leave.', 158432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can teleport us out of here when you are ready, $c. \n\nPlease hurry, I wish to be rid of this place.', 158431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CUTSCENE!', 'CUTSCENE!', 158430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves make fine neighbors. But, uh... those wisps take a bit of getting used to.', '', 158429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the land, work the land. That was our deal.', '', 158428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a shame what happened to their tree.', '', 158427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye think ye can stop us from retrieving Derek\'s body? Ye\'ve got another thing coming!', '', 158426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This time Loh just needs to make it to the goal; but beware the dangers that lurk in the maze.', '', 158425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, can you guide Loh to the treasure, and then to the goal, without crossing the path he\'s taken?', '', 158424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy enough. Right, $n?', '', 158423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, a simple challenge: Guide Loh to the goal.', '', 158422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('When telling these stories, we ask young tortollans to guide Loh around small mazes to complete different challenges.', '', 158421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready for your combat training?', 'Are you ready for your combat training?', 158420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
