('', 'I\'m coming a bit more to my senses, $n.\n\nWith Lilian\'s help, perhaps I can come to accept this new fate.\n\nThough I must say... the further I can get from Kul Tiras... the better.', 158271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am grateful for this opportunity to prove the value of the ren\'dorei to our cause.\n\nWe will do whatever it takes to ensure the Alliance\'s success.', '', 158270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thus far, I have been very impressed by High Commander Wyrmbane.\n\nHe employs a wide range of tactics and is quick to adapt to changing circumstances with appropriate, necessary strategies.\n\nThe Alliance\'s war efforts are in capable hands. Like you, I am proud to play my part in them.', 158269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The san\'layn must be eradicated. The Horde\'s recklessness endangers us all.', 158268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, soon. Fire! Yes, big fire!', '', 158267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll call for you again when you are needed. For the Alliance.', '', 158266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Anduin must be informed at once. Our task is complete here, but our mission has only just begun.', '', 158265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the Horde really employing those vampiric elves? How far they\'ve fallen.', '', 158264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All smoke, no mirror!', '', 158263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you\'re describing sounds like one of the san\'layn... a blood prince.', '', 158262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G-Guzzy\'s dead?', 158261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where be smoke, there be fire... trust me!', '', 158260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to move onto the next stage of our plan.', '', 158259, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have Derek Proudmoore\'s body. We do not need to raise any more Kul Tiran corpses. For now.', '', 158258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hope your efforts were not in vain.', '', 158257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War has come to Darkshore and we must protect our people as best we can. Direct any wisps you find to the front lines and clear out any threats.', '', 158256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! I heard de scream of a stuck traitor!', 158255, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest for de weary, food for de hungry.', 158254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not agree to drawing the Kul Tiran fleet to my harbor.\n\nYou better have a suitable plan. I refuse to lose my freedom.', 158253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the ritual.', 'Begin the ritual.', 158252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you from?', 'Where are you from?', 158251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long have you been here?', 'How long have you been here?', 158250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the only home I\'ve ever known. \n\nWe go where the sands take us.', 'This is the only home I\'ve ever known. \n\nWe go where the sands take us.', 158249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 39653),
('My caravan has called these sands home for much longer than I\'ve lived. \n\nThere are others across the sea, though I have never seen them myself.', 'My caravan has called these sands home for much longer than I\'ve lived. \n\nThere are others across the sea, though I have never seen them myself.', 158248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. You and your people performed admirably, Magister. You\'re a credit to the Alliance.', '', 158247, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of all void elves, I apologize for our failure.', '', 158246, 0, 0, 16, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must get to Vigil Hill. Quick, hop on!', 158245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon chirps contentedly and curls up for a nap.', '', 158244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The villager groans in pain.', 'The villager groans in pain.', 158243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mok\'rah, $n! The outpost is yours to command.', '', 158242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmph.', 158241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will pay you plenty for your trouble.', '', 158240, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathanos, I told you your Horde could make base in my harbor. I did not give you permission to lead the Proudmoore fleet to my very door!', 158239, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scepter is an artifact of immense power over the sea. We will be able to use it to gain quite the advantage over the Kul Tiran fleet.', '', 158238, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are you going to sneak in? You cannot exactly just waltz into Boralus...', 158237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sent Valentine into Boralus to get a message to Lady Proudmoore, at any cost: We have your son.', '', 158236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm down my friends. Rest assured that this pirate will pay for his crimes. However, we must wait for word from the courts of his final sentencing.', '', 158235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission here is to retrieve the Abyssal Scepter, located deep inside the Stormsong Monastery in Boralus.', '', 158234, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come in, $n. Nathanos will catch you up to speed.', 158233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the crime of usury, the courts have found you guilty. Your predatory lending has robbed many good people of Hook Point of their savings. Many now rest in the streets, because of your misdeeds.', '', 158232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the crimes of piracy, theft, and murder, the courts have found you guilty. Piracy is one of the most vile of crimes under Kul Tiran law and you will be served justice.', '', 158231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extortion and racketeering! Many of the families here today have been victims to your schemes. You charged the good people of Kul Tiras too high a price and now it\'s you who will pay the piper.', '', 158230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. I will take us directly to Alleria and the High Commander.', '', 158229, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the complete victory I\'d hoped to earn for the Alliance, but I will not add tardiness to my failings here.', '', 158228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were hunting a decoy Gallywix that whole time? Goblins truly are the worst.', '', 158227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya later, losers!', '', 158226, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those mech suits ain\'t cheap, though, $p. I\'m gonna be sendin\' you the bill for that one!', '', 158225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fell for the oldest trick in the Bilgewater book: high-quality, low-paid laborers!', '', 158224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I wish you could see the looks on your faces right now.', '', 158223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De idea dat any spirit could evade Bwonsamdi is impressive. It is my hope de bonds of his friends will be enough to give us a connection to him on de other side.', 158222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, there\'s a telescope on the west side of camp. Why don\'t you go look out for him?', '', 158221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... yes, where is Guzbert? He should be coming around that corner any moment now.', '', 158220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Am I the first one back? Where\'s Guzzy?', 158219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, Miss Steelspark.', '', 158218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey boss! You hear that boom? I think I might\'ve launched a goblin into low orbit.', 158217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guzbert and Kelsey should be here any moment now.', '', 158216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, what\'s the world done for me?', '', 158215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ego is as bloated as your body. Think of the good you could\'ve done for this world!', '', 158214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the wealth you\'ve amassed and this is what you build, Gallywix? A den of depravity!', '', 158213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Vivify to replenish your health to full.', 158212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Vivify to replenish your health to full.', '', 158211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taking damage is part of battle, but you can tap the spiritual mists to heal yourself or an ally. Use Vivify to heal your wounds.', 158210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking damage is part of battle, but you can tap the spiritual mists to heal yourself or an ally. Use Vivify to heal your wounds.', '', 158209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has been defeated!', '', 158208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has been deployed!', '|A:Warfront-HordeWave3:25:23:0:0|aA Horde assault force has been deployed!', 158207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
