('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch has been lost!', 158203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing has been lost!', 158202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aGalson\'s Lode has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aGalson\'s Lode has been lost!', 158201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHighlands Mill has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHighlands Mill has been lost!', 158200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aGalson\'s Lode is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aGalson\'s Lode is under attack!', 158199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHighlands Mill is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHighlands Mill is under attack!', 158198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-BaseMapIcons-Alliance-MainHall-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aYour commander is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aYour commander is under attack!', 158197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aValorcall Pass is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aValorcall Pass is under attack!', 158196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNewstead is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNewstead is under attack!', 158195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aCircle of Elements is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aCircle of Elements is under attack!', 158194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing is under attack!', 158193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push the big red button when you tell me to. Got it.', 'Push the big red button when you tell me to. Got it.', 158192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me where I can fly.', 'Show me where I can fly.', 158191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna fly somewhere?', '', 158190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outbid again! Why do some seek to profit from the misery of others?', 'Outbid again! Why do some seek to profit from the misery of others?', 158189, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have nothing of value left to sell.', 'We have nothing of value left to sell.', 158188, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope we have enough left to buy the supplies we need.', 'I hope we have enough left to buy the supplies we need.', 158187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much gold do we have left?', 'How much gold do we have left?', 158186, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not enough rations...', 'Not enough rations...', 158185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind the road, traveler. Something strange lurks in Drustvar\'s shadows.', 'Mind the road, traveler. Something strange lurks in Drustvar\'s shadows.', 158183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa... Whoa... The suit\'s malfunctioning!', '', 158182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ravens are watching! The laughing won\'t stop! They\'ll come for me!', '', 158181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye made me... spill... me drink...', 158180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think ye can pull one over on ME do ya?! I\'ll <hic> run ya through!', 158179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work. See you back at the other side of camp.', 158178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch this, Gallywix!', 'Watch this, Gallywix!', 158177, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance? Here in Zandalar?', '', 158176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We move with the sands.', 'We move with the sands.', 158175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dunes are filled with treasures just waiting to be found.', 'The dunes are filled with treasures just waiting to be found.', 158174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Home is where the wagon is.', 'Home is where the wagon is.', 158173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Mace_2H_CapturedTitanConstruct_D_01:20|t%s targets you with the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:271296|h[Cudgel of Gore]|h|r!', '', 158171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor souls... no one should endure this. After we save Jaina, we must find a way to come back for them.', 158170, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One thing is for certain, Drustvar has gone mad.', 'One thing is for certain, Drustvar has gone mad.', 158169, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard one of them say something about deer hungering for the flesh of men.', 'I heard one of them say something about deer hungering for the flesh of men.', 158168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The ones about beast men and wooden demons? Aye, I heard them talking about that.', 'The ones about beast men and wooden demons? Aye, I heard them talking about that.', 158167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear what they were saying? Why those refugees are here?', 'Did you hear what they were saying? Why those refugees are here?', 158166, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some days I think I can make buzzing noises with my mouth and actually communicate with my bees, but it\'s probably not going to work until I finish my full size bee costume.  That\'s besides the point, my bees are the best around, want to fight them, or are you going to buzz off?', '', 158165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May our will be stronger than their machines of war.', 158164, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deeds will not be forgotten by the kaldorei, $n. The aid you lend in these dark times could make all the difference.', '', 158163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we face a great trial, do not give in to despair. The goddess gives us strength, and we must cling tightly to it.', '', 158162, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A war is not won or lost in a single battle. Our day will come.', '', 158161, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Anduin will send his soldiers to aid us. We must hold our ground until they arrive.', '', 158160, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fleet has returned from Silithus. Elune be praised! Their might is sorely needed.', '', 158159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the wisp wall still holds, Horde forces are pressing into Darkshore.', '', 158158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That dealt a blow to their morale. Never underestimate the value of psychological warfare.', '', 158157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strong words you said to Nathanos.', 'Strong words you said to Nathanos.', 158156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pirates of Freehold grow bolder by the day. We must sow chaos among their ranks. Use one of their own mounts to rain filth upon them from the sky!', '', 158155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All sailors fear de siren\'s call. But some do not fear it enough.', 158154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De sirens have ensnared another Kul Tiran supply ship. Search de wreckage for anything we can use... but be careful not to end up like de crew!', 158153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a fate much worse than death waiting for you...', '', 158152, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'ve won!? My fall is only the beginning of your demise!', '', 158151, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Our foes will be ill-equipped to defy us.', '', 158150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kul Tirans must not be allowed to produce more Azerite munitions. Shut down production at that foundry!', '', 158149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When fanatics doubt your loyalty, you are not long for this world.\n\nI was conscripted into this campaign. Perhaps you were, too. We must do whatever is needed--say whatever we must--to survive it.\n\nBut know this. There is only one war that matters. And it is not this one.', 158148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will... share her fate...', '', 158147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... too late... to save her...', '', 158146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torment... awaits you all...', '', 158145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is... already doomed...', '', 158144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance is at hand!', '', 158143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore is ours!', '', 158142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You too will be consumed!', '', 158141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will join her suffering!', '', 158140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are a lot of levers and some foot pedals on this console.  It probably does something important.', '', 158139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU FOOLS! You cannot hope to comprehend the powers you now trifle with!', '', 158138, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch is under attack!', 158137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not exactly. When you see an opportunity, you take it.\n\nI\'ve always had plans for my future. It\'s about time I do the work to make those plans a reality.', 158136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you served the Uncrowned. Have you changed your allegiance?', 'I thought you served the Uncrowned. Have you changed your allegiance?', 158135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am FREE! I thank you... and now your souls shall sate my fathomless hunger!!', '', 158134, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which region we target first is up to you. When your choice is made, we will set sail at once.', '', 158133, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fair work. The guards can take care of any stragglers. We\'ll need to keep a closer eye on the manor.', 158132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Abominations have started pouring out of Waycrest Manor! We need to stop their advance before they reach Arom\'s Stand!', 158131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will win this war, $n. For the Alliance!', '', 158129, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 112492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out targets of opportunity in troll lands. Undermine the warchief\'s efforts at every turn.', '', 158128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The footholds you established in Zandalar were a bold first step. Now we will use them to take the fight to the Horde!', '', 158127, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides of war are ever-shifting. It is time our campaign\'s focus changes as well.', '', 158126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never felt so hungry...', 'I have never felt so hungry...', 158125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, your work in Kul Tiras has been vital to our cause. Only through unity can the Alliance grow stronger.', '', 158124, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 158123, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 112477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But for now, at least, know that you serve as an inspiration to those around you. And for that, hero, you have my thanks.', '', 158122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance must ask even more of you, $n. It is clear that we cannot hope to end the warchief\'s reign until we sever her ties to the Zandalari. That day will come... soon.', '', 158121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could say our work was done, but there remains much more ahead of us. I fear the days shall grow darker... before they can grow brighter.', '', 158120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, you have spearheaded a long campaign against a relentless foe. What\'s more, you have faced the Horde with courage... and honor.', '', 158119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!', 158118, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 112516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You embody the best of the Horde, $n. I know that you will be the spark that sets Boralus ablaze.', 158117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tiras has become a rallying point for the Alliance. The return of its vaunted navy has emboldened them. But soon those tide-born curs will pay the price for defying us.', 158116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though victory still eludes us, it draws closer every day. We must not rest until the last flicker of hope in the boy-king\'s heart turns to ashes.', 158115, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 112513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The world is full of soldiers, champion. But few truly have the stomach for war. You, it seems, have a genuine taste for it.', 158114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take their hope, and you will claim victory, $n. For the Horde!', 158113, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 112506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the footholds you secured in Kul Tiras to cripple the boy-king\'s forces. Shake their faith in their futile cause.', 158112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But victory demands more than bolstering our own strength. It requires hobbling our enemies until they grovel before us.', 158111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew there was no one more capable of winning the Zandalari to our cause than you.', 158110, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, when Princess Talanji came to us seeking aid, I recognized an opportunity to add her kingdom\'s strength to our own.', 158109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da very earth here be dead. Dis be dread, mon. Truly dread.', '', 158108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warm your hands and rest your bones, $c.', 158107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Food_Legion_gooAmberPink_pool.BLP:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:273361|h[Pool of Darkness]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Food_Legion_gooAmberPink_pool.BLP:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:273361|h[Pool of Darkness]|h|r!', 158106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Swiftwind Post, $n. The outpost is in your command.', '', 158105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should\'ve... bought... the warranty option...', '', 158104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Gallywix PAIN Palace, ya grimy thief!', '', 158103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack Ar\'gorok.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack Ar\'gorok.', 158102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption is spreading faster than I could have imagined...', '', 158101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These spores aren\'t natural. We must find their source.', '', 158100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have done what we can. May they find peace in the next life.', '', 158099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits grow restless here. We must end their torment.', '', 158098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. May dey find rest.', 158097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De spirits grow restless. Help dem find peace.', 158096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wit dese spores, we can find de source of de rot and destroy it.', 158095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De rot is spreading fast. We must find  a way to stop it. Gather de spores so we can learn more.', 158094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters! The Horde is pressing further into Darkshore! Rally at the Wildbend River.', '', 158093, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 112410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been infused with the power of wind!', 'You have been infused with the power of wind!', 158092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want all this gold back to the palace ASAP and then-', '', 158091, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No delays! No excuses! No promotions!', '', 158090, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outta my way! The Alliance is here!', '', 158089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die... to a goblin.', '', 158088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is counting on the void elves. We will not disappoint.', '', 158087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywiiiiix!', 'Gallywiiiiix!', 158086, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scram! It\'s the Alliance!', 'Scram! It\'s the Alliance!', 158085, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde must have driven the furbolgs from their home.', 158084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde... there are so many of them...', 158083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy gold! Where\'d the elf come from?!', 'Holy gold! Where\'d the elf come from?!', 158082, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The furbolgs are normally a peaceful tribe. Being ousted from their home must have sent them into a frenzy.', 158081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I walk in shadow.', 158078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away!', 158077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, hero! We must do this quietly!', 158076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill this one quickly, before they alert the others!', 158075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Avoid being detected! We cannot draw too much attention...', 158074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be right down, Lanfa!', '', 158073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After you, $n. If you would like me to incapacitate any of them, just say so. But... quietly.', 158072, 0, 64575, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harli will get you dere and come back for me. I have to check on my mate!', '', 158071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat was a proper lesson you taught dem. We will see if dey learn from it.', '', 158070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese dwarf-things are not taking de hint. Dey are not welcome here! Show dem how de Zandalari deal with intruders.', '', 158069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If anyone tries to climb this hill... kill them!', '', 158068, 0, 62326, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we dismantle the fleet, Zandalar will be ours!', '', 158067, 0, 62326, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those pillars up!', '', 158066, 0, 62326, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Wait a moment while Genn convinces Katherine in a really awesome cutscene>', '<Wait a moment while Genn convinces Katherine in a really awesome cutscene>', 158065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Kul Tiras are united, but their leading house is not, and the Alliance is without one of our most powerful leaders.\n\nIt is my hope this rift can be healed as well.', '', 158064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the family memorial by Proudmoore Keep. With luck we can convince Lord Admiral Proudmoore to grant her daughter a stay of execution.', '', 158063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, You have helped to unite the Kul Tirans and gained their support for the Alliance. Perhaps now you might be able to help reunite a mother with her daughter.', '', 158062, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cutting off the Horde\'s supply will slow their assault. You bought us time.', '', 158061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those monstrous goblins are drilling for fuel for their war machines! End their defilement!', '', 158060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We advance as the fires continue to burn.', 158059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These elementals will serve as fuel for our demolishers. Kill them, as well as any kaldorei who get in your way.', 158058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can travel through the Void to save time. Follow me.', '', 158057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix is slippery. He won\'t stay out in the open for long.', '', 158056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should\'ve known that a goblin like Gallywix wouldn\'t be able to resist looting a city literally made of gold.', '', 158055, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have been spotted! Gather as much Azerite as you can. We cannot remain here long!', 158054, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 112426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the goddess... Azerite! It is everywhere!', 158053, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 112425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azerite nodes pop up all over the place', 'Azerite nodes pop up all over the place', 158052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place your hand on the Azerite Node>.', '<Place your hand on the Azerite Node>.', 158051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Azerite node thrums with power>.', '', 158050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You take the shredder. I will drive the invaders from the grove!', 158049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grove of the Ancients! Oh my...', 'The Grove of the Ancients! Oh my...', 158048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on it!', 'I\'m on it!', 158047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind the furbolgs. They have suddenly appeared in droves.', 'Mind the furbolgs. They have suddenly appeared in droves.', 158046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on my way!', 'I\'m on my way!', 158045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The furbolgs seem uncharacteristically aggressive...', 'The furbolgs seem uncharacteristically aggressive...', 158044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_misc_boilingblood:20|t%s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:271224|h[Plasma Discharge]|h|r!', '', 158043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not underestimate the value of your actions. While they recover from such defeats, we can solidify our position in this region.', '', 158042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde seeks to strengthen their foothold here. Deny them, champion!', '', 158041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De pack survives. You have done well.', 158040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A most unusual pack of hatchlings is in need of aid. Help dem and earn de favor of Gonk.', 158039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is one less war party for us to contend with. Excellent work.', '', 158038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zandalar forever!', 158037, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it were not for dis hero of de Horde, our losses would have been far worse.$bDis proves, more than ever, dat it is time for us to adapt, to become part of de world again.', 158036, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let dis glaive be displayed as a reminder dat no matter how far we fall, no matter how much we lose, we are Zandalari!$bWe adapt, we find a way to survive!', 158035, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By his will were borne de deaths of so many of our brothers and sisters.', 158034, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold de blood of G\'huun. By his will were borne de deaths of Shadra, Hi\'reek, Torga, and ...and Rezan.', 158033, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have reported the presence of a Horde warship off the coast. See that their reinforcements do not make landfall.', '', 158032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis was not my achievement.', 158031, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 112316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can take nothing for granted in this land, champion. Thanks to you, our scouts will live to spy another day.', '', 158030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show dem da blade. Become da symbol dey need.', '', 158029, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 112357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya set in motion what be needed ta save ya people. Now, more than ever, dey be callin\' for a leader dey can love and trust.', '', 158028, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 112356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya brought de champion to dese shores against ya father\'s will. Ya learned da secrets of G\'huun when no one be listenin\'.', '', 158027, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 112355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Several SI:7 operatives were dispatched to this region, but we have not yet received their report. Deal with the source of this delay at once.', '', 158026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show dem, leader of Zandalar. Show da blade to those dat need to see it da most. Give dem peace.', '', 158025, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 112354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin, can you hear us? Reveal yourself, spirit.', 158024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will pay in blood for every inch of ground they try to claim. Even small victories can tilt the scales in our favor. Well done.', '', 158023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loss... Loss. So much loss. So many without guidance. So many without justice. Their hope be taken by G\'huun.', '', 158022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 21, 112359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde thinks it can operate uncontested in this area. Prove them wrong, champion.', '', 158021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush.', 158020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be hearin\' him!', '', 158019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loss...', '', 158018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin, hear de voices of your friends and family. Dey are wondering where you are.', 158017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placing Azerite', 'Placing Azerite', 158016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must defend the Grove of the Ancients!', 'You must defend the Grove of the Ancients!', 158015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remain vigilant.', 'I remain vigilant.', 158014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Help him up.>', '<Help him up.>', 158013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be honest with you... this isn\'t my lowest point.\n\nBut it\'s pretty close.', '', 158012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero, the ancients are calling! Seek out the Druids of the Claw in the forest and meet me at the Grove of the Ancients!', 158011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That bought us some breathing room. Sentinels, hold the line!', 158009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haven\'t seen anyone like that. I\'m afraid your friend may have been lost to the siren\'s call.', 158008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ask if she has seen Flynn.>', '<Ask if she has seen Flynn.>', 158007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gone? What do you mean, gone? I demand reimbursement!', 'Gone? What do you mean, gone? I demand reimbursement!', 158006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not the only one who requests files from SI:7.', 158005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How does a decorated elven general know about someone like me?', '', 158004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a hero in your own way, Keeshan, from your service in the first three wars to your acts of heroism in Redridge.', 158003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Far as I\'m concerned, I\'m barely worthy of serving next to you. Least I can do is keep quiet and show you respect.', '', 158002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'am, I read your file from SI:7. You\'ve been alive for more than ten thousand years, fought in more wars than I can ever imagine.', '', 158001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keeshan, you\'re allowed to be at ease around me.', 158000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Said how she should be out killing the Alliance instead of dealing with some nonsense. I knew after that I should leave before making any more deals for stories.', '', 157999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Areiel you\'re looking for is in the Necropolis, along with a whole host of Horde! She seemed real bothered by some missive she received.', '', 157998, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be fun! I\'ll give you what you need to know, and then you can tell me all about your war experiences.', '', 157997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been alive for over 10,000 years and have fought in every war. I saw the original Well of Eternity with my own eyes.', 157996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I served across the first three wars, survived being prisoner to a bunch of barbaric orcs, and helped kill a black dragon.', '', 157995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good story! I was supposed to get great ones from Torga, but now he\'s dead. Do you have any good stories?', '', 157994, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just saved your life. What more do you need?', '', 157993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell you all about the Horde. I just need a little something in return.', '', 157992, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, ma\'am.', '', 157991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for all your help $n, Keeshan. I must go now and continue the hunt for Dreven. May Elune bless your way.', 157990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! I be watchin\' da flank!', '', 157989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, Keeshan, come. Let us return to Fort Victory... and request a proper burial for my friends.', 157988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elf, human, we are all equal, Keeshan. No one of us is more valuable than the other.', 157987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be... good as new in no time... shouldn\'t have been me, though. Your friends shoulda survived.', '', 157986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keeshan! Praise Elune, at least someone survived this slaughter.', 157985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> Ma\'am... not quite... dead yet. Looks like his power... ain\'t all that great... with those minions gone.', '', 157984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Falia... Lyrias... Aeolyn... Keeshan... I swear, $n, Dreven will pay!', 157983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh!', '', 157982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never give in, Shandris Feathermoon. See how frail your allies are!', '', 157981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We best be headed out. Let de spirits find their way ta Bwonsamdi on their own.', '', 157980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem blood trolls gonna be back, of dis I be certain. But now dey know we can hurt dem in their home. Dey gonna tink twice \'bout attackin\' again.', '', 157979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shandris, go on... without me...', 157978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be sneakin\' on ahead ta clear out a safe meetin\' point. Meet me outside da village when ya done.', '', 157977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace death with me, night elf!', '', 157976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to show you what this pathetic human can do!', '', 157975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring down the shield! Seize the opportunity! Stromgarde will be ours!', 157974, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All cannons--FIRE!', 157973, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah?', 157972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely they will let us go back to recover some of our valuables. Once the smoke clears, I mean.', 'Surely they will let us go back to recover some of our valuables. Once the smoke clears, I mean.', 157971, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything we owned was stored in the Bough of the Eternals!', 'Everything we owned was stored in the Bough of the Eternals!', 157970, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to wish you burned with Darnassus!', '', 157969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris Feathermoon, attempting an ambush? How bold.', '', 157968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I\'ll make an example out of this pathetic human.', '', 157967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The killing ends today, Dreven.', 157966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more of your kind must I kill before you understand to stay out of our way?', '', 157965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance. I knew you\'d be too idiotic to learn your lesson from our last encounter.', '', 157964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s time for me to tear out the bad battle spiders and put in some good battle spiders.', '', 157963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One guy, three spiders, 26 total legs, you didn\'t have a chance.', '', 157962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When one falls, another takes its place!', '', 157961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy there, little one. Will you help us?', 'Easy there, little one. Will you help us?', 157960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Flicka eyes you cautiously>\n\nFlicka?', '', 157959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, that\'s right.  We\'re bad! Rock and Roll!', '', 157958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to kill Dreven and his followers.', 'I\'m ready to kill Dreven and his followers.', 157957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, name\'s Dilbert McClint, Infestation Management.  Always nice to battle a fellow arachnoid enthusiast.', '', 157956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'re the bait for a group of hungry bloodsucking elves. Ready for whatever happens next?', '', 157955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll alert the others, Keeshan will meet you at the tunnels.', 157954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done. We should be able to handle it from here.', 157953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde forces have broken through! They are trying to establish a base! Push them back with your fey dragon!', 157952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might walk through this nearby thicket and think that spiders wouldn\'t like the open air and the breeze, but in that respect, spiders are just like you and me.  That, and the spider webs make a pretty dead giveaway of an arachnoid presence.', '', 157951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you outside of Zo\'bal ruins. Be careful.', 157950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the thrill of the hunt. Savor it. I certainly do.', '', 157949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest for the weary, food for the hungry.', 157948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always, princess.', '', 157947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. I shall return to Zuldazar. Keep me informed of de Horde operations in Nazmir. And be careful, Rokhan.', 157946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas wants ta give \'em a chance. Dey got no home left. If dey can work with us, den dey got a home with da Horde. If not, dey be gone.', '', 157945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This avian menace hunts the seas, making prey of any ships we dispatch against Kul Tiras. End its pursuit.', '', 157944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not trust dis Dreven, Rokhan. It is not wise to involve san\'layn, of all things, in dis conflict.', 157943, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... I shall do as you ask, for now. We will clear this tunnel and send word when your forces can move out.', '', 157942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because part of ya agreement with Sylvanas was respectin\' da hierarchy of authority within da Horde, and brudda, I be outrankin\' ya.', '', 157941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want us to use our abilities... to move rocks. And why should I follow you, troll?', '', 157940, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere be a collapsed tunnel dat connects Nazmir ta Vol\'dun. Take ya followers, use ya powers ta clear da rubble, den we be attackin\' da main Alliance forces.', '', 157939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere is a collapsed tunnel to de south of here dat connects Nazmir and Vol\'dun. Clear it, and de Horde will be able to strike de main Alliance base in Vol\'dun with ease.', 157938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas ain\'t gonna like dat. We need ta be movin\' fast on our plan ta stop da Alliance, Prince Dreven.', '', 157937, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call it one of my special traits. The Alliance have disrupted the Horde forces in the Necropolis and killed Areiel in the process.', '', 157936, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Princess Talanji to you, Prince Dreven. And how do you know dat?', 157935, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Areiel is not coming because she is slain, Talanji.', '', 157934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And yet she is not here. Is she too busy to give a simple status report?', 157933, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Areiel be killin\' both da Alliance and blood troll forces and helped us establish a base in da Necropolis.', '', 157932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Apologies for my delay, Rokhan. Tell me of your status here. Has dis Captain Areiel been useful?', 157931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess, thank ya for comin\' down from Zandalar. We be hard at work here keepin\' back da blood trolls and Alliance invaders.', '', 157930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n. The outpost is in your command.', 157929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My services are yours.', '', 157927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Take the flask of invisibility.)', '(Take the flask of invisibility.)', 157926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay hidden. Only one of us should go in. I\'ll stay here to make sure no one finds out what we\'re doing.\n\nI have a flask of invisibility that you can use to sneak in there. It should render you completely unseen... for a small amount of time.\n\nDrink from the flask, then sneak in to the ruins. Find out what the Horde are planning, then get out.', 157925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear even the small victories are just delaying the inevitable.', '', 157924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are holding the Horde at bay, but their attention has shifted to an eruption of Azerite on the coast. We must stop them.', '', 157923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, dearie. Wunja be blind but not deaf! Kehehe! You come ta old Wunja for a potion?', 'Come closer, dearie. Wunja be blind but not deaf! Kehehe! You come ta old Wunja for a potion?', 157920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The big G ain\'t gonna like this...', 157919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll blast ya big time, right in the mouth!', 157918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people are ready, $p. For the Alliance.', '', 157917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess you\'re with me then, $p. I\'ll see you at the Reliquary camp.', 157916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zoidfuse, let\'s move.', '', 157915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought in all three wars. I thought I\'ve seen the worst that Azeroth has to offer.\n\nI was wrong.', '', 157914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have something that can help.', 157913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That leaves you, hero. Report back to Captain Summermoon and reinforce that border!', 157912, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hippogryph Archers, come with me. We will regroup in Lor\'danel and remain vigilant as a mobile response unit!', 157911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Sentinels, create a battle line at the Wildbend River! Rouse our allies at the Grove of the Ancients!', 157910, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huntresses, you are to reinforce the southern border of Darkshore! Bring the Glaive Throwers!', 157909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take action! Sentinels, forward face!', 157908, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, the Horde have reached the Wildbend River! We cannot hold them for long!', 'Captain, the Horde have reached the Wildbend River! We cannot hold them for long!', 157907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An alpaca! Yay!', '', 157906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure?', 'Are you sure?', 157905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you command!', 157904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Just attack.>', '<Just attack.>', 157903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about some gold?', 'How about some gold?', 157902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas seeks to engage me, and I plan to give her what she wants. Word has been sent to our fleet. Elune willing, they will soon return.', '', 157900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I ask that you see to the defense of Darnassus.', '', 157899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delaryn, travel to our outposts. Gather every soldier you can find and bring them here.', '', 157898, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 112404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you, Shan\'do?', 157897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Banshee Queen seeks to capture the World Tree.', '', 157896, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion! Horde forces have gathered at the Zoram\'gar Outpost.', 157895, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 112428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may pass through the wall, $n. The wisps will not harm you.', '', 157894, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even in your final moments, you fail to see the true potential of humans.', 157893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you still cling to your outdated views on humans. I should\'ve killed you a long time ago.', 157892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am destined to live for eternity, I will not die here!', 157891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a shame you\'re fighting alongside this filthy human, Shandris! Such short, insignificant lives.', 157890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shandris, it\'s been... two, three thousand years? To think we\'d meet again like this, and with you helping a human, of all things.', 157889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkness... Sylvanas... is this what you saw... what you wished to save us from?', 157888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I thought this would be a simple scouting mission. I\'ll enjoy this!', 157887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... It\'s over. Find her plans and return to Redfield\'s Watch when you\'re done here.', 157886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Xibala in Zuldazar.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Xibala in Zuldazar.', 157885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! With that creature destroyed, our troops can travel the area unhindered.', '', 157884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rum is for real Irontide.  Hands off!', 'Rum is for real Irontide.  Hands off!', 157883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s hard enough to establish supply lines through a swamp without magical beasts in the way. Put this one down and clear us a path.', '', 157882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! Dat creature will trouble us no longer.', 157881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark mojo feeds dis creature! Feed de souls back to Bwonsamdi.', 157880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another victory.', 157879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta learn dat dere be a price ta pay for interruptin\' Bwonsamdi! Why don\'tcha take a little trip?', '', 157878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My scouts report that there has been a sudden eruption of Azerite here in Darkshore. Assist our Goblin allies in securing the Azerite.', 157877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get too close to Bwonsamdi!', 'Don\'t get too close to Bwonsamdi!', 157876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with the ears?$B$BUhh, it\'s called fashion OBVIOUSLY.', '', 157875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thieving hozen.  I better not find any rum missing.', 'Thieving hozen.  I better not find any rum missing.', 157874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless bilge rats, stop drinking the rum!', 'Worthless bilge rats, stop drinking the rum!', 157873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrupting the Horde\'s alliance with the Zandalari is our top priority. To do this, we need to establish footholds in enemy territory.', '', 157872, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to show the Horde that the 7th Legion means business, $n.', '', 157871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers... No! Do not rush the--!', 157870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, is this thing on?', '', 157869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, you sure sent them packing! It\'ll take some time for their forces to mobilize again. Good work.', '', 157868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve managed to seize another one of the Horde\'s siege weapons. Time to turn the tables on them!', '', 157867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No! Impossible. Da boss ain\'t gonna like dis. Ol\' Bwonsamdi not been losin\' a spirit in... oh, dis be bad.', '', 157866, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 113241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, Vol\'jin? Come on outta dat urn. Wait... wait, wait... no! Where be da spirit?! Where be Vol\'jin?', '', 157865, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 113240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be off, hero. Ain\' nothin\' for ya here now.', '', 157864, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 113239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortunately the workers don\'t seem to mind us snooping around... just the company goons.\n\nYou get what we need?', '', 157863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much was accomplished here today. We can regroup outside.', 'Much was accomplished here today. We can regroup outside.', 157862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jakra\'zet must be stopped.', 157861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the king doing about our own homeland?', 'What is the king doing about our own homeland?', 157860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind\'s resources are spread thin. There won\'t be enough to keep us all alive.', 'Stormwind\'s resources are spread thin. There won\'t be enough to keep us all alive.', 157859, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no, my little hero. Ya not be leavin\' dat here.', '', 157858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! One less set of teeth to worry about.', '', 157857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead of fighting over ruins, the Alliance should retake our homeland!', 'Instead of fighting over ruins, the Alliance should retake our homeland!', 157856, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the second home we lost.', 'That was the second home we lost.', 157855, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are we supposed to go now?', 'Where are we supposed to go now?', 157854, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Her passing will allow future generations to thrive.', '', 157853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are larger stakes, General. We must adapt to this new information.', '', 157852, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t let that monster get away, Wyrmbane.', 157851, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No Darkspear! No dumb trolls in fancy troll place!', '', 157850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No Horde filth gonna be worthy of dis place. We of da Sandfury challenge ya!', 'No Horde filth gonna be worthy of dis place. We of da Sandfury challenge ya!', 157849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Alleria. Your aid is most welcome.', 157848, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wise strategy. I approve.', '', 157847, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hunt him down and bring you his head. Shandris can focus on tracking that Blood Prince.', 157846, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My void elf forces can lead the effort to eliminate Gallywix.', 157845, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria opens a void portal behind her.', 157844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot afford to allow either of these targets to escape us... and we do not need to.', 157843, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive my interruption, but I believe you are both right.', 157842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw what Dreven was capable of, Wyrmbane. What if there are more like him?', 157841, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tactically speaking, he is their weak link. This is a rare opportunity. We must strike now.', '', 157840, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix funds the Horde\'s war campaign and understands Azerite better than any of their other leaders.', '', 157839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can kill that gluttonous goblin any day! If Dreven escapes, we may never find him again.', 157838, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will deal with Blood Prince Dreven soon, General. But this is a rare opportunity to cripple the Horde\'s military. Everything else must wait.', '', 157837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A winged beast is feeding my men to its offspring! Give it a belly full of steel for its next meal.', '', 157836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not gonna be bringing dat Horde lovin\' traitor to dis sacred place!', '', 157835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our allies await your command.', 157834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De great Pa\'ku has decided dat Ji\'arak has outgrown her time with us. Gather your forces and slay dis creature.', '', 157833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n. We have work to do.', '', 157832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... blood? Really? You\'re telling me that there\'s a literal shield of blood protecting that thing?\n\nOkay... Now I\'ve definitely seen everything.', '', 157831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Circle is ours! Everyone to your post!', 157830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next war. And the one after that.', '', 157829, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will endure long after we are gone. But when this war is over, what will you be left with, Shaw?', '', 157828, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your faith in the Light? Or in Turalyon?', '', 157827, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite the opposite. To witness Turalyon\'s return, and to learn how the Light had sustained him, transformed him, only strengthened my resolve. I know my faith was well placed.', '', 157826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you learned that Turalyon was alive, did it cause you to question your devotion? Your choices?', '', 157825, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When he left with the Alliance Expedition to Outland and was presumed lost, the Light opened my eyes. I realized I could be both a soldier and a paladin. I vowed to honor his sacrifice.', '', 157824, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 112616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the more I observed those first paladins, one in particular inspired me... Turalyon. His faith sustained him, fueled his dedication, and made him a great leader.', '', 157823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drukan has a lie down.', '', 157822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I served as a knight when the Silver Hand was founded. I was dubious that priestly orders could mix with martial skills, so I remained focused on my combat training.', '', 157821, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, Wyrmbane, how does a paladin come to lead a force of elite soldiers? Shouldn\'t you be off consecrating temples or some such?', '', 157820, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, of course.', '', 157819, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 112498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kind of you to say, but if I had to choose between satisfying honor and getting the job done, I\'ll pick the latter every time. For the Alliance, of course.', '', 157818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit... as a paladin, I have questioned the need for spies and assassins within the ranks of the Alliance. But the honor and loyalty you have shown our king is beyond question.', '', 157817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 was built to work behind the scenes. I prefer to stay in the shadows where I am not so... exposed.', '', 157816, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve stopped counting. I go where the Alliance orders me... and where the Light calls me. But then, you are no stranger to battle.', '', 157815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many campaigns against the Horde does this make for you, Wyrmbane?', '', 157814, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful where you swing that thing, $n.', '', 157813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thought ye oughta know.', '', 157812, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Workshop now open fer business! If ya need somethin\', we got the sweat \'n\' grease ta make it happen!', '', 157811, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The damage to Warfang will be returned tenfold!', '', 157810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I no longer fear death, death fears me...', '', 157809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief will not allow this to go unpunished.', '', 157808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is too good for you.', '', 157807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feast on your corpse!', '', 157806, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cleave you in two!', '', 157805, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, but something tells me they\'ll just keep trying.', 157804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pirates are raiding Vigil Hill again! Will they ever learn?! Help the marines fend them off!', 157803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I need to get back to my family.', 'Thank you! I need to get back to my family.', 157802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see the looks on their faces?! Oh, that was priceless! They\'ll be cleaning up for days!', '', 157801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are barbarians!', 'The Horde are barbarians!', 157800, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such insidious corruption is best purged... before it can infect the Horde.', '', 157799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. We cannot stand idle while the abyss corrupts our land!', '', 157798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Venrik and I used to get three sheets to the wind and take a couple of riding parrots out for fun. Give it a go and rain down some justice on those brigands!', '', 157797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ground down...', '', 157796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve mis...calculated.', '', 157795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This abomination is the very embodiment of madness and corruption. Destroy it at once!', '', 157794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only hope my family escaped in time.', 'I only hope my family escaped in time.', 157793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The smoke was so thick. We would have been lost in it, if not for Queen Greymane.', 'The smoke was so thick. We would have been lost in it, if not for Queen Greymane.', 157792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must send this creature back to the abyss. Destroy it!', '', 157791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We barely made it out alive.', 'We barely made it out alive.', 157790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would they do this?', 'Why would they do this?', 157789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re really grinding my gears!', '', 157788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all miiiiine!', '', 157787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll drill you to bits!', '', 157786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This could have been a huge loss for the Proudmoore Guard. Thanks to you, it was merely a setback.', 157785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of our supply ships ran aground in the southern tideway. Most of the crew escaped, but they had to leave valuable goods behind.', 157784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_GATHERSHADOWS.BLP:20|t Warbringer Yenajz begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:274932|h[Endless Abyss]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_GATHERSHADOWS.BLP:20|t Warbringer Yenajz begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:274932|h[Endless Abyss]|h|r!', 157783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s booze?! Aww, I was hoping for treasure... to SPEND on booze!', '', 157782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word around Freehold is that one of those pirates has a juicy stash hidden in the water just off the docks. See if you can find it!', '', 157781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. That should limit the amount of Azerite weaponry coming into Boralus while we quell the Ashvane mutiny.', '', 157780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashvane Trading Company has yet to halt their weapons production as ordered. Bust up that foundry, but avoid hurting any civilians.', '', 157779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, don\'t worry. We\'ll find them new homes. The important thing is that they\'re off the streets and out of harm\'s way.', '', 157778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashvane Trading Company lures in orphans with the promise of food and then works \'em to the bone. Get those kids outta there!', '', 157777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say Azurethos could pluck a kraken straight outta the waves with its claws. It was lethal, mate. You\'re a legend for bringing it down.', '', 157776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sailors sing of the fabled Azurethos, who can capsize a galleon with a gust of wind. Well, the tales are true. Take it down, and they\'ll be singin\' about you.', '', 157775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Report to High Overlord Saurfang. Teach them the price of their folly. For the Horde!', 157774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every time I close my eyes... I see the flames.', 'Every time I close my eyes... I see the flames.', 157773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope our friends are safe.', 'I hope our friends are safe.', 157772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalimdor cannot be lost to us.', 'Kalimdor cannot be lost to us.', 157771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe the World Tree is... gone...', 'I cannot believe the World Tree is... gone...', 157770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Horde mongrels destroyed our home!', 'Those Horde mongrels destroyed our home!', 157769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? Oh, you look like you might be a fellow engineer...', '', 157768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to ask something else.', 'I want to ask something else.', 157767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That crazy cook? I think he is a second cousin. It\'s sad, all he can think up is bombs and bigger bombs. The real genius is inventing the ultimate power source. So it fuel machines that can rip, shred, drill, or blow up lots of things, for as long as possible.', '', 157766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day doctor, I wanted to offer to purchase one of your reactors. I can make it worth your while.', 'Good day doctor, I wanted to offer to purchase one of your reactors. I can make it worth your while.', 157765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you that! Dr. Boom?', 'Are you that! Dr. Boom?', 157764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you think so. I see you ARE an engineer of great skill! Nowhere near my level but not many are.', '', 157763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dunnae know who that is, but I\'m sure she needs killin\'!', 157762, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 112284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dr, the engineering of that piece is extraordinary!', 'Dr, the engineering of that piece is extraordinary!', 157761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone meet back at the Black Anvil! We need a damage report!', 157760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I\'m workin\' here! Come back when you\'re an engineer with somethin\' to offer in the skills department.', '', 157759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, ye made quick work o\' those! We\'re openin\' the door. I can hear a whole lot o\' enemies on the other side. Watch yer back!', 157758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent the last five years fixing and upgrading and fine tuning the most advanced and deadliest team of robots ever imagined.  Want to see how your boring, normal pets do against pets made by the most brilliant low grade repair technician in the universe?', '', 157757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfunction!? That\'s not supposed to happen!', '', 157756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brilliant mind making even more brilliant machines is an unbeatable combination.', '', 157755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! That construct is nothing but rubble, and all of Drustvar is safe.', 157754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A massive stone construct has awoken in the mountains nearby! We have to take it down before it descends on the people of Drustvar!', 157753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable! Next time I\'m building bigger robots.', '', 157752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No pet can compete with my team, I\'m unstoppable!', '', 157751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to face my unbeatable team of highly modified and customized robots!', '', 157750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go, Krag\'wa.', 'I am ready to go, Krag\'wa.', 157749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now the blood trolls continue to slaughter my children. $b$bI will help you reach their leader, but I must hurry back to the marsh to protect my children.', '', 157748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krag\'wa, the leader of the blood trolls has fled to the large structure in the distance. Please, lend us your assistance.', 'Krag\'wa, the leader of the blood trolls has fled to the large structure in the distance. Please, lend us your assistance.', 157747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... ahem. Not now, Venrik. We\'re here on serious business.', '', 157746, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 111973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here to help, to battle!', 157745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fight for my people.', 157744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An easy foe, dispatch it quickly!', 157743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
