('', 'It will be a relief to put this place behind me.', 157740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'d better go before more of those... things... arrive.', 157739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... I will be fine.', 157738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, Flynn. Whatever happened to that woman you were always talkin\' about?', '', 157737, 0, 0, 604, 64, 0, 112337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother! Are you alright?', 157736, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will ye go recover the hammer? It\'s a power unto itself an\' could spell disaster fer us if the goblins figure out how tae use it.', 157735, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I\'ve got another task fer ye. Those savages were Venture Co. That means they\'re gonna be in Kezan, probably deliverin\' Ironfoe into the greasy hands o\' Mogul Razdunk as we speak.', 157734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anvil-Thane, Darkanvil, figure out how tae repair the Black Anvil.', 157733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Och, Ironfoe\'s been stolen an\' they split the Black Anvil in twain!', 157732, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And Kul Tiras will never yield.', 157731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drust... will never... relent...', '', 157730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hell\'s bells!', '', 157729, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You two, open yer eyes! Look at the Black Anvil!', '', 157728, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Son o\' the core! That must\'ve been the big mech that slammed into me!', 157727, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some sort o\' pummeler ambushed me an\' stole Ironfoe!', '', 157726, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m fine. Ye don\'t look so good yerself.', 157725, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen-Regent! Are ye all right lass?!', '', 157724, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alrighty boys \'n\' girls, let\'s wrap it up!', 157723, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people defeated your kind once, monster. We will do so again!', 157722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thros will consume you all! At last I will claim vengeance!', '', 157721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just when things started lookin\' good fer us.', 157720, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Moira mutters to herself.>', 157719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thaelin, head up through the Hall o\' Craftin\'! They might be on the way tae the Black Vault.', 157718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, take the Dark Iron Highway an\' see that it\'s secure!', 157717, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anvil-Thane, go gather yer sorcerers fer a counterattack!', 157716, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spineless green turds think tae attack us in our home?!', 157715, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblins! In the tunnels!', '', 157714, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To arms, $n!', 157713, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 114848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You challenged the wrong family, fiend!', 157712, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother!', 157711, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother, look out!', 157710, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 114845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, that\'s a biggun!', 157709, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None of you will escape!', '', 157708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, daughter. We\'ll find our way out of here.', 157707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here come some more o\' em!', 157706, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incomin\' elementals!', 157705, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve discovered the application o\' great magic tae Azerite can have some unexpected results.', 157704, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina? Is it really you?', 157703, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the curmudgeonly bookworm means is, watch our backs when the elements attack us.', '', 157702, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... too late...', '', 157701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, we\'re sure tae encounter spontaneous azer-genesis incidents while shapin\' the Azerite. Think ye can handle it?', '', 157700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind poppin\' some more Azerite up on the anvil fer me, $n?', '', 157699, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be next!', '', 157698, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 114886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent fools! She is broken beyond your reach!', '', 157697, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 114885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Queen-Regent.', '', 157696, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thaelin, Thurgaden, put yer backs into it.', 157695, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! Show us your true form, monster!', 157694, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re makin\' progress. Anduin keeps askin\' fer updates seems like every day, so I thought we\'d show ye what we\'ve learned.', 157693, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve had me best workin\' on refinin\' Azerite since it first appeared in our depths.', 157692, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks fer comin\', $n.', 157691, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father... please...', 157690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you by the statue on the hill.', 157689, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great Krag\'wa, we have need of your aid!', 157688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like the Third War.', '', 157687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Bravo Company!', '', 157686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like in Draenor!', '', 157685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reminds me of the Second War.', '', 157684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph mph.', '', 157683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go over the plan to kill Captain Areiel.', 'Let\'s go over the plan to kill Captain Areiel.', 157682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General.', '', 157681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We move out now. $n will take point. The rest of us will provide support and scout ahead. Keeshan, that includes you.', 157680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can get information about the Horde\'s movements if we save the tortollans, which should lead us to Captain Areiel.', 157679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'am. There are tortollans in Nazmir, and intel suggests they know the Horde\'s movements. Several of them have been captured by blood trolls.', '', 157678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like shootin\' fish in a barrel!', '', 157677, 0, 64133, 0, 64, 0, 112154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bullseye! Er, fisheye!', '', 157676, 0, 64133, 0, 64, 0, 112153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need information and allies within Nazmir to achieve this. Lucky for us, we have an opportunity. Keeshan?', 157675, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain Areiel\'s death will cripple the Horde\'s operations within Nazmir and weaken Sylvanas\'s dark rangers.', 157674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These trolls have harmed my children for too long! Now it is I, that is doing the hunting.', '', 157673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always thought Deadwash was the other direction?', '', 157672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been nice and quiet since Nedly vanished.', 157671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not allow that to happen. Rally your allies, champion. Stromgarde belongs to the Alliance!', '', 157670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Horde is gathering its forces to wrest the keep from our control. Should they succeed, they will gain a critical strategic position within the Eastern Kingdoms.', '', 157669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stromgarde was a vital seat of power in the days of the Alliance of Lordaeron. We intend for it to become so once again.', '', 157668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mount an expedition and lay claim to that Azerite... before the Horde does.', '', 157667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaw\'s scouts have discovered Azerite deposits on islands scattered about the seas. The Alliance needs that resource, champion.', '', 157666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The agents you recruit will specialize in undermining the Horde\'s efforts... and ensuring that we achieve victory.', '', 157665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work with Mathias Shaw to assemble a team of covert operatives. No one is better suited to this task than Stormwind\'s master spy.', '', 157664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, victory in war requires strength of arms. But there are times when it also calls for a more... subtle approach.', '', 157663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to summon Krag\'wa.', 'I\'m ready to summon Krag\'wa.', 157662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zelling is speaking with his family. Stay back, we\'ll see if I need to intervene.', 157661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use their stealth and guile to reveal weaknesses in the enemy\'s defenses... and exploit them.', 157660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Work with Garona Halforcen to assemble a unit of the Horde\'s most cunning and devious operatives. You will dispatch these forces on covert missions throughout Kul Tiras and Zandalar.', 157659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To ensure your success, I am sending along an operative who possesses a... unique set of skills. I believe they will prove quite useful on this mission.', 157658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must act quickly. Use the cover of night to conceal your search for the remains. Those waters are fraught with Alliance patrols.', 157657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathanos, your conversion of Brother Zelling is already yielding results. He has revealed the location of the shipwreck we seek.', 157656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the boy-king sends his underlings to reclaim it. We cannot allow them to succeed.', 157655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stromgarde was a seat of Alliance power at the heart of the Eastern Kingdoms... before the keep fell to ruin.', 157654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must seize the advantage. Explore these islands and lay claim to them... before the Alliance does.', 157653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our goblin allies continue to prove their worth. They have pinpointed deposits of Azerite on islands scattered throughout the vast seas.', 157652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In war, there are times when a single well-placed blade in the back does more damage than a thousand swords on a battlefield.', 157651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That blasted Mildenhall is insane! Sounds like the meadery\'s been overrun by his experiments. Check it out, before things spiral out of control.', 157650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thank you and your Horde for your aid in freeing my crew.\n\nFor as long as I am in charge, the Fogsail will be free to roam the seas!', 157649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was de final sacrifice... We have failed.', 157648, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 111388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... It cannot be!', '', 157647, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 111387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you will!', '', 157646, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 111381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffering? You have not seen true suffering. Not yet...', '', 157645, 0, 0, 1, 70, 11539, 111380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia, when time permits, you must come to Stormwind as my guest. I have many stories to share about your father.', '', 157644, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The letters stopped coming. I... I have so many questions.', 157643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give him a clean death. We have seen enough suffering for one day.', 157642, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5702, 0, 111378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"My shining star.\"', 157641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember now... he used to write you letters. He had a nickname for you...', '', 157640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord Bolvar was a great man. A true hero to the Alliance--and to me.', '', 157639, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you know my father?', 157638, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 111766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Jakra\'zet groans.>', '', 157637, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 111379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia... please, rise. The honor is mine.', '', 157636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daughter of Bolvar. Fostered under our protection since the Third War.', 157635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fordragon?!', '', 157634, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taelia Fordragon.', 157633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is an honor to meet you, King Wrynn. I am Taelia.', 157632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Along with your champion, she was instrumental in saving our kingdom... and my life.', 157631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Wrynn, there is someone you should meet.', 157630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased and honored to welcome Kul Tiras back into the Alliance. May the Light guide us to victory.', '', 157629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you... all of you. I will do everything I can to prove worthy of your trust.', 157628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What say you?', 157627, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 112084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis ends here, General. De plots. De lies. De murders.', 157626, 0, 0, 1, 70, 13230, 0, 111377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sam, no!', 157625, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 111376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STORMSONG!', '', 157624, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 111386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought your end with you, Pike. I must deliver the fleet to our glorious savior... Azshara.', '', 157623, 0, 0, 1, 70, 9000, 111385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I see are lost souls, crying for release.', '', 157622, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5800, 111384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over, Stormsong! Look around you... You\'re surrounded!', '', 157621, 0, 0, 1, 70, 6480, 111383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly, you knew what you were doing. I can always count on you for a little mayhem!', '', 157620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have much in the way of weapons, so we need to be resourceful. Find a way to do some serious damage and get out before they know what hit \'em.', '', 157619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who knows how much damage that thing could have done to the fleet? Thanks to you, we\'ll never find out.', 157618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re too weak to rule, Katherine.', 157617, 0, 0, 1, 70, 3165, 0, 111409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I almost... Priscilla... How could you betray the kingdom? How could you betray me?', 157616, 0, 0, 1, 70, 8433, 0, 112096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That golem could cleave a ship in half! We can\'t let Lord Stormsong have a weapon of that magnitude.', 157615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You hired the pirate fleet, armed them to the teeth, and set them upon your own countrymen.', 157614, 0, 0, 1, 70, 6484, 0, 111807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s called Azerite... and the Alliance and Horde are already at war over it.', 157613, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5805, 0, 111806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your company MADE the weapons that destroyed Daelin\'s Gate using this!', 157612, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5541, 0, 111805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Priscilla Ashvane, you are under arrest for trafficking, conspiring with pirates, and high treason against the Admiralty of Kul Tiras.', 157611, 0, 0, 1, 70, 9873, 0, 111804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ocean gives us much, but beneath its surface lies naught but despair.', '', 157610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is the meaning of this, girl?!', 157609, 0, 0, 1, 70, 2505, 0, 111408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, this was your play all along. Despicable.', 157608, 0, 0, 1, 70, 4346, 0, 111803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A liar!', 157607, 0, 0, 1, 70, 971, 0, 111802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ancient horror from the depths has been made manifest. Send it crawling back beneath the tides.', '', 157606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Ashvane has been my rock since those first dark days when we both lost our husbands. Now, she will be the kingdom\'s rock. Now... she is--', 157605, 0, 0, 1, 70, 12093, 0, 112095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But it has not been enough.', 157603, 0, 0, 1, 70, 1713, 0, 112094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well struck! Our forces fight on dry land for another day.', 157602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last time I saw that much smoke, ol\' Grandma Davenport was trying to teach her dimwit grandson how to bake. Excellent work!', '', 157601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For shame!', 157600, 0, 0, 1, 70, 1141, 0, 111406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga have called forth a living siege engine to destroy the levee! To arms!', 157599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirates?! The Proudmoores can\'t even protect us from pirates anymore!', '', 157598, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5582, 111455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A pirate fleet struck the gate with overwhelming force...', 157597, 0, 0, 1, 70, 4176, 0, 112093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm\'s fury is unpredictable and dangerous, but no match for your talents.', '', 157596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bears the mark of tidesage magic. Do what you must to contain it!', '', 157595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I keep thinking we\'re making a dent in their forces, but they rebuild faster than we can destroy. We need to cut off their lumber supply! Burn it all!', '', 157594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rumors are true. Daelin\'s Gate... has fallen.', 157593, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5274, 0, 112092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those were some loud explosions. Did you leave anything behind other than a pile of a rubble?', '', 157592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The harvest is safe, thanks to you! We\'ll see if we can\'t relocate these little guys away from the farmlands.', 157591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I absolutely knew it\'d be worth the effort. We\'re lucky to have her around!', 157590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something is eating the local farmers\' seeds before they can sprout. See if you can flush them out!', 157589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Miss Davenport has requested delivery of a few items to aid in the war effort. That old lady is one tough cookie. We\'d be crazy to refuse to help her!', 157588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will wash away their corruption time and again, until the Shrine of the Storm is made pure.', '', 157587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fiends seek to desecrate our most sacred grounds. This cannot stand!', '', 157586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know pest control isn\'t the most glamorous task, but I\'m sure the help is greatly appreciated by the folks in Millstone.', 157585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The residents of Millstone have been plagued with all manner of ill fortune. Their food stores are infested with pests. Let\'s help clear them out.', 157584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some day, the joyous sound of tidesages casting their first spells will once more fill these grounds... but not this day.', '', 157583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s hope that\'ll drive the rest of those horrid giants back up into the mountains, where they belong!', 157582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My former master\'s tendrils still run deep. Eradicate every trace.', '', 157581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. The people of the valley will never forget your deeds.', '', 157580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ettins have been terrorizing Millstone Hamlet, and the civilians have no way of fighting back. We\'re their only hope!', 157579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have need of you in Brennadam, hero. We still don\'t have enough forces to stage a counterattack on our own.', '', 157578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111483, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Captain Angelica when you are ready to embark.', '', 157577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, I should\'ve asked if you were allergic to bees before sending you out there. But you seem fine, so now I know who to ask next time!', 157576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate that you reported in so quickly, $n. You will ship out with the Third Fleet.', '', 157575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 114091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such brazen wickedness must never be allowed to flourish in our world.', '', 157574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bees at the meadery are terrorizing the locals again and, what d\'ya know, the farmers have lost control of the situation. Big surprise!', 157573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Anduin sent me, Spymaster.', 'King Anduin sent me, Spymaster.', 157572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something going on at that farm has whipped the wendigos into a frenzy. They kept to their own before those crazy Mildenhalls moved in.', 157571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve received word that the Mildenhall Meadery is having trouble with wendigos. Think you could head up there and lend them a hand?', 157570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K\'thir practice their dark magics unimpeded aboard the Abyssal Melody. Cleanse its decks of their defilement.', '', 157569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may be outnumbered, but we remain undaunted thanks to you.', '', 157568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fallen tidesages have enthralled lost sailors and threaten to overrun Tidecross. Halt their advance!', '', 157567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That creature must have once been an honorable fungarian. Such a tragic fate for so noble a warrior.', 157566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re getting reports of a powerful presence in a cave to the south. Be careful. The descriptions of that creature chill me to the bone...', 157565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, but I\'m not so sure that\'ll be the last time we need to save his hide...', 157564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We haven\'t been able to root the Horde out of the pass yet. Cripple their production, no matter what it takes. Blow the place sky-high, if you have to!', '', 157563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any weapons coming out of Stormsong\'s foundries should be protecting the people, not oppressing them.', 157562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It might be a simple task, given your history, but it\'s something that needs to get done.', '', 157561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kennings Lodge is running behind on orders from the Admiralty due to some... complications. Helping out should be simple for someone like you.', '', 157560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be a shame for all these munitions to go to waste. You know what to do.', 157559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It falls to us to keep them in check, now that the militia is gone.', '', 157558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quilboar are up to no good again in their kraul. Stop their plans before they can regain their strength!', '', 157557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111487, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nura, I am here to help.', 'Nura, I am here to help.', 157556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What brings you all the way out here?', 157555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll meet up later in town and split this up!', '', 157554, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you get me close to the High Road in Southern Barrens?', 'Can you get me close to the High Road in Southern Barrens?', 157553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A ship without its sails is as a cavalry without its horses. Just... well, no good at all, really.', '', 157552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fearsome storm threatens our rigging stores. Calm it while you still can!', '', 157551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done Addington\'s legacy justice this day. Thank you.', '', 157550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother Addington would never have stood for such depravity. Reclaim the yards in his name!', '', 157549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything starts from raw materials. The rest comes from hard work and true hearts.', 157548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stormsong\'s shipwrights are legendary, but they need lumber to work. Restore order right away!', 157547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That ought to show them. Stormsong will always be open to all!', 157546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Stormsong\'s forces have set up another blockade! Clear it out so these traders can pass!', 157545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, make haste!', '', 157544, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 112401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Isabella. She will ensure that you make it safely to our rendezvous point in the Undercity.', '', 157543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we have gathered enough reinforcements, I will give you your briefing.', '', 157542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for responding so quickly, $n. There is no time to waste.', '', 157541, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 112127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To protect, nourish, and guide. That is the true way of the tidesages.', '', 157540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All tidesages take sacred oaths to protect our people. Uphold our oaths and help these weary souls!', '', 157539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies are relentless. But thanks to you, we stand to fight another day.', '', 157538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the ritual failed without incedent. The naga\'s vile magic cannot be allowed to continue corrupting the seas.', '', 157537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azshara\'s followers are attempting a new ritual in light of their recent defeat. Show them to the depths to which they so desperately cling.', '', 157536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga seem to be getting more aggressive with each passing day. I worry about what that means for us.', 157535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Storm\'s Wake is still recovering from that naga attack. Help them hold their ground while they get everything under control!', 157534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces would benefit greatly from these resources. Claim them for our cause!', '', 157533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tides bless you. They will not take this valley so long as we stand!', '', 157532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a first time for everything, and... let\'s hope there\'s no second time for that one.', '', 157531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111464, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, I\'m not sure what to make of this, but something very strange is happening in town. See if you can sort it out.', '', 157530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111463, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you abandon your feelings, only an empty darkness will remain.', 157529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dearest Jaina... reason alone cannot dictate all of your choices.', 157528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s not real, Jaina! None of this is!', 157527, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... they lied to me...', 157526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was a fool to think you could be our leader!', '', 157525, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 114932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You let your personal biases taint the Kirin Tor!', '', 157524, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 114931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish your father could have learned that lesson.', 157523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seeking an end to bloodshed is a noble pursuit, Jaina.', 157522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Stormsong\'s armies threaten to reclaim this area. Ensure that it does not fall into their hands!', '', 157521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from her!', 157520, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hir\'eek is de Loa of Night. You don\'t need to know any more than dat.', 'Hir\'eek is de Loa of Night. You don\'t need to know any more than dat.', 157519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All because of me...', 157518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you... You stayed my blade. How many Alliance soldiers died that day? And in all the battles that followed?', '', 157517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could have ended them all! Sylvanas... Thrall... Think what our world could have been without them and their twisted Horde!', '', 157516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. It must be another of those creatures tormenting Jaina. Hurry!', 157515, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That voice... Daelin?!', 157514, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another illusion? Jaina must still be trapped nearby.', 157513, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will find her... and free her from this forsaken place.', 157512, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My daughter is here somewhere. Hiding. Suffering.', 157511, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! The currents will carry tales of your efforts here for years to come.', '', 157510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must continue our search.', 157509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s gone. The child was only a reflection... an echo of Jaina\'s suffering.', 157508, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...but even the strongest of us can\'t save everyone.', 157507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina... you were... are... the pride of Kul Tiras. Her power, and her fury...', 157506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Don\'t listen to them, Jaina!', 157505, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I failed them... all of them...', 157504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You could have stopped him! You could have saved us!', 157503, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty, High Overlord.', 'Reporting for duty, High Overlord.', 157502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Storm\'s Wake requires your aid once more. May the tides guide you to victory.', '', 157501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You left us to die!', '', 157500, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 114694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lead the way, $p.', 157499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always found her then... and I will not fail her now.', 157498, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When Jaina was a child, she used to hide whenever she was frightened or upset.', 157497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait!', 157496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! You can\'t help me! No one can help me!', 157495, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s alright, dear...', 157494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 114903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina is just ahead. We must hurry!', 157493, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thros... will consume you...', '', 157492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not if I have anything to say about it!', 157491, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore\'s daughter is ours, interloper!', '', 157490, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 114575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we must follow her!', 157489, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina, wait!', 157488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Stay away!', 157487, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 114951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina?!', 157486, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 114898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s... all my fault...', 157485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Blighted Lands... this place certainly lives up to its name...', 157484, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 114897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tides bless you. Our valley is safe once more.', '', 157483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the abyssal depths... this aberration must not be allowed to threaten our people any longer!', '', 157482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May this serve as a lesson to all who wield the Tidemother\'s gifts.', '', 157481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such callous disregard for the sea\'s power must be destroyed.', '', 157480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torga is a powerful being much diminished, but we Tortollans keep the memory alive.', '', 157479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s stop here for a moment, $p.', '', 157478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gral is a wise loa. He takes de long view of things. De deep sea is his realm, and de darkest ocean is his domain.', 'Gral is a wise loa. He takes de long view of things. De deep sea is his realm, and de darkest ocean is his domain.', 157477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the tides reject them, as they did their people.', '', 157476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s several fewer thorns in our side! Nice work.', '', 157475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111468, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quilboar are up to something at the farm just outside their kraul. Why don\'t you drop in and see if you can\'t put a stop to their scheming?', '', 157474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111467, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another wicked soul has answered Lord Stormsong\'s call. They must not undo our work!', '', 157473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest now, wretched soul. You shall suffer no longer.', '', 157472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What horrors my brethren have wrought... End this creature\'s misery.', '', 157471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off I go...', 'Off I go...', 157470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... milord.', 'Yes... milord.', 157469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha ish sit?', 'Wha ish sit?', 157468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off I go then!', 'Off I go then!', 157467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More work?', 'More work?', 157466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m on it, boss!', 157465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I DO see another small digsite west of here. Kelsey?', '', 157464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand together. We have not come this far to fall!', '', 157463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The largest Reliquary digsites are further to the south. As I suspected.', '', 157462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has set fire to the buildings! Put them out before the whole valley goes up in flames!', '', 157461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! The fires recede, and we still have our homes. Thank you.', '', 157460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to make sure the sethrak don\'t even have their own loot when they leave here.', 'I\'m going to make sure the sethrak don\'t even have their own loot when they leave here.', 157459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though I cannot call our mariners home, at least we know those ships are out there... somewhere. The fate of our fleet lies with the Proudmoores now.', '', 157458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jani is de loa of discarded things, and de people dat others might throw away or ignore. He looks out for orphans like me, or anyone dat finds demselves in a low place.', '', 157457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic is strongest here. If there is any hope the fleet can yet be found, now is the time to try.', '', 157456, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Errn... Go away... <hic!> I\'m busy.', '', 157455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are followers of Torcali, de Moving Mountain, de Wandering Bulwark. If our loa wills it, nothing gets past our shields.', '', 157454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s one less threat wandering the valley! Well done!', 157453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa... I\'m speechless. That was an amazing fight!', 157452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait here. I think I see something.', '', 157451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really didn\'t think that was going to work, but that gold is going to help a lot of people rebuild their lives!', '', 157450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111482, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... I can sense the ships... our fleet! The dark mists surrounding them are dissipating!', '', 157449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here to solve your problems, Krog.', 'I am here to solve your problems, Krog.', 157448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the Storm\'s Wake reported a troublesome beast nearby. I bet you can handle it, though!', 157447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something dangerous stalks the hills. Find it before anyone gets hurt!', 157446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The treasure hunters at Deadwash are going to donate some gold to help rebuild Brennadam. The catch is we need to collect the gold ourselves!', '', 157445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111481, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthur...', '', 157444, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doras, I need a wind rider down to Brackenwall Village.', 'Doras, I need a wind rider down to Brackenwall Village.', 157443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, champion. In saving Ai\'twen, you have helped de tortollans... and pleased de loa as well, I think.', 157442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114119, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I toppled stones! Some very angry stones.', '', 157441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had orders to topple cairns.', '', 157440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, come on! Things turned out well in the end. The Mainlander and I took down that big rock monster and lived! That\'s a win.', '', 157439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthur! What have I told you about rushing headlong into things?', '', 157438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De tortollans revere de great turtle Ai\'twen, a powerful ally from their past. Keep it safe and well-fed, dat it might aid us once more.', 157437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114118, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place!', '', 157436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair currents guide you, champion! Your actions set an example for us all.', '', 157435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111872, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll continue south, then. We\'ll be in touch, Guzbert.', '', 157434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got this, Guzzy!', '', 157433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go get \'em, Guzbert!', 157432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... with a BUTTLOAD OF BOMBS!', '', 157431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Small digsite, eh? Sounds like a job for a gnome...', '', 157430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a small Reliquary digsite about half a click east of here.', '', 157429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, behind you! Help me get these nuisances out of the way.', '', 157428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancient turtle Ai\'twen is a mystery of the sea that must be protected. Aid the tortollans in keeping it safe and well fed.', '', 157427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111871, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make Lord Stormsong pay for his transgressions... or perish trying.', '', 157426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Stormsong deserve to feel safe and secure. Show no mercy to anyone who threatens that security.', '', 157425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must act now if we are to spare the fleet from Azshara\'s grasp.', '', 157424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not safe here. Come, there is an old watch post overlooking the Shrine nearby.', '', 157423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But he will not be forgotten. Not so long as we stand.', '', 157422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voice now echoes your own. You feel it seeking an answer, because you seek it as well.\n\n\"To what end?\"', '', 157421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wince with pain as the voice screams within you.\n\n\"Where did it begin?\"', '', 157420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks. The farmers should be able to return to their fields shortly.', '', 157419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve received reports of danger from the outlying farms. Please help restore order to the valley!', '', 157418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111485, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voice grows stronger and more eager.\n\n\"More! More! More!\"', '', 157417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancient voice is now only an echo, calling from the depths of your mind.\n\n\"What do you seek?\"', '', 157416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You really are full of surprises! I need you to teach me a few tricks sometime.', '', 157415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. If you need an extraction from Boralus, we have agents waiting nearby.', '', 157414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to sneak back and tell Birchwood. See you there!', '', 157413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HA! It crumbled before our might!', '', 157412, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sam... he\'s... he\'s gone...', 157411, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the last of his subjects has been slain and raised Forsaken, the boy-king will kneel before the Dark Lady. And at long last, there will be but one queen to rule them all.', '', 157410, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance. Contempt. Call it what you will.', '', 157409, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Ah, vengeance fuels you. I can appreciate that.', 157408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Lich King\'s hold over us was broken, Sylvanas sought allies. Instead of embracing their fallen kin of Lordaeron, the humans spurned us. Hunted us. So I vowed to hunt them.', '', 157407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turned their backs?', 157406, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 111333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once fought for their cause. The Alliance\'s insufferable arrogance has increased tenfold since they turned their backs on us.', '', 157405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The zeal with which you attack the Alliance seems borne of more than deference to your queen, Blightcaller.', 157404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I caused the downfall of one king. Perhaps it is time I ended the reign of another.', 157403, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. The Alliance deserves no sympathy. No quarter. Make them suffer, and the Dark Lady will reward you.', '', 157402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. And you are doubtless aware that I have worked with the Alliance when it served my purposes. But I owe them nothing. The Horde is my home.', 157401, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are fools...', '', 157400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of Kul Tiras, you shall leave this place!', '', 157399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am familiar with the tale. I also know that killing Llane Wrynn was not your choice.', '', 157398, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because I was once befriended by the young king\'s grandfather? I murdered him, if you recall.', 157397, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 111326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your strikes on Alliance targets have been most impressive, Garona. I admit, I wondered if your loyalties might be... divided.', '', 157396, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ehehe... fresh meat!', '', 157395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel nature\'s fury!', '', 157394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna turn you into rubble!', '', 157393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to continue?', 'Are you sure you want to continue?', 157392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work, $p. Stormsong Valley owes you more than we could ever repay.', '', 157391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111504, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dream, dream of the Sunken City.', 'Dream, dream of the Sunken City.', 157390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found in the shadow of His gaze...', 'Found in the shadow of His gaze...', 157389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost in Her relentless embrace...', 'Lost in Her relentless embrace...', 157388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To breathe in the wisdom of the drowned...', 'To breathe in the wisdom of the drowned...', 157387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The survivors at Dire Hills Lodge have been fighting for days. See if you can help them out, and give them a chance to rest.', '', 157386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111503, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was an impressive number of explosions!  Glad to see none of them were you or Toki.', '', 157383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111474, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink deep the shimmering tide...', 'Drink deep the shimmering tide...', 157382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Venture Company continues to destroy the coastline here. Meet up with Toki and see if you can help him out.', '', 157381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111473, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh...', 'Uh...', 157380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find an ominous altar. As you place your hand upon it, words begin to flood your mind.\n\n\"How will you begin?\"', '', 157379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine work. I owe you a drink for that one.', '', 157378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111511, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait\'ll I get my claws on you!', '', 157377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna rip you apart!', '', 157376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want the Irontide out of this area. Let\'s see if they still want to stay after we make their lives a little more miserable.', '', 157375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111510, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Drustvar!', '', 157374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Let\'s turn that monster into rubble!', '', 157373, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De tortollans thank you for your help, as do I.', 157372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114116, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dose Venture Company brutes continue to antagonize de tortollans! Meet with Toki and lend dem your aid, champion.', 157371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114115, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies will know dat a champion of de Horde put an end to their schemes. Well done.', 157370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114121, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies grow bolder by de day! Deprive dem of their resources--and their lives, if necessary.', 157369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114120, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We grow stronger while our enemies weaken. Sometimes small victories lead to a greater triumph.', 157368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114123, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers cannot win a war if their bellies are empty. Bear meat will keep our forces fed. Do not let our enemies interfere.', 157367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114122, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient things which should not be, are stirring. Be on your guard.', 'Ancient things which should not be, are stirring. Be on your guard.', 157362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did not expect the dead to walk!', 'We did not expect the dead to rise and walk!', 157361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t expect such power! Be careful, Mainlander.', 'We didn\'t expect such power! Be careful, Mainlander.', 157360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The constructs must be destroyed. Please help!', 'The constructs must be destroyed. Please help!', 157359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A timely assist, mainlander.', 'A timely assist, mainlander.', 157358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, stop. You see that?', '', 157357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re driven back for now, and the town still stands. We owe you our lives.', '', 157356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has returned in force to try and finish the job. Stop them by any means necessary!', '', 157355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He keeps to himself, mostly, but he knows when he\'s in a pinch. Thank you for assisting him!', '', 157354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goldfield says he could use your help. The raids on his farm haven\'t stopped, and he\'s running short on supplies. Lend what aid you can.', '', 157353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111489, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll think twice before trying that again! Give that dog an extra scratch for me.', '', 157352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quilboar are trying to expand their tunnel network, putting the valley in danger. Our hounds can sniff them out if they know where to look.', '', 157351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111491, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, let\'s move.', '', 157350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_SHADOWFURY.BLP:20|t You are affected by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:272536|h[Imminent Ruin]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_SHADOWFURY.BLP:20|t You are affected by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:272536|h[Imminent Ruin]|h|r!', 157349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, dis chamber would be ideal for displaying de royal collection of antiquities. Perhaps we should --', '', 157348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t be far.', 157347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shandris, keep a low profile. Stay in the shadows... if you can find any.', '', 157346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '10-4, High Commander! Let\'s ride!', 157345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kelsey, you\'re our eyes in the sky. Report back if you see anything.', '', 157344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you repeat the plan?', 'Can you repeat the plan?', 157343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents always said I had an overactive imagination.', '', 157342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes we would ride down the hills of a valley in a wagon! We used to pretend Hobbs was a tiger!', '', 157341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hobbs and I would go on all sorts of adventures when we were children.', '', 157340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me.', 'Show me.', 157339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The visions can help us observe the carnage, $r.', 'The visions can help us observe the carnage, $r.', 157338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon the fleet too shall bask in her radiance, and all of Kul Tiras will bow to the light beneath the tides.', '', 157337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are blind. The Tidemother\'s gifts have made us strong once more.', '', 157336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Souls of the corrupted, you will yet fulfill your oaths. Break down this gate!', '', 157335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_TikiMan2_Bloodtroll.blp:20|t Elder Leaxa begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:264603|h[Blood Mirror]|h|r!', 157334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel positive about this cave. I am picturing an awful lot of gold inside.', 157333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I was just getting to the part where I dive straight down its gullet and slice it up from the inside out!', 157332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, alright, Line and Sinker helped. But everything else is true... every last word!', 157331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph mph, mph mph!', '', 157330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut your trap, Line. Wait your turn!', 157329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No gold, but a lot of rum!', 157328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, with my expert anglin\'!', '', 157327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to my razor-sharp wit, I knew exactly how to cut the beast down.', 157326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then I saw it, approachin\' from the horizon. A beast unlike any I\'d ever seen!', 157325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was first watch, keepin\' an eye out for more of them blasted naga.', 157324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, let me tell you how I met these two sorry sailors.', 157323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, even I can agree--hey, wait a minute!', '', 157322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That helmet\'s gone to your head. I\'d sooner believe Line actually managed to catch a fish!', 157321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph, mph mph mph mph. Mph.', '', 157320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MPH!!!', '', 157319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph... mph.', '', 157318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily, I had me special bullet I kept \'round me neck at all times for just such an occasion.', '', 157317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guard the rum until the captain returns.', '', 157316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain...I didn\'t drink any.', '', 157315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where there\'s pirates, there\'s usually gold!', 157314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the workers have said they see a pirate\'s ghost around this cave.', 157313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brennadam is just ahead. Come on!', 157312, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 111715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of Kul Tiras is exposed without it. It\'s only a matter of time before we\'re attacked.', 157311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to find Brother Pike right away. Hopefully, he can help us bring the fleet home.', 157310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t the valley majestic? No wonder so many people settle down here.', 157309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This pass is the only land route into the valley. House Stormsong is up to something.', 157308, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brennadam is the largest trade hub in Kul Tiras outside of Boralus.', 157307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your backs into it, you lazy meat sacks!', '', 157306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s up there. Two heads and big!', 'He\'s up there getting ready to attack!', 157305, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind your own beeswax. I\'m on official business here!', 'Mind your own beeswax. I\'m on official business here!', 157304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you up to? You need to evacuate with the rest of us!', 'What are you up to? You need to evacuate with the rest of us!', 157303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for that club!', 'Better run Tom, we got the numbers!', 157302, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We both blame you... for dis.', 'We both blame you... for dis.', 157301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come face me... both of me!', 'Come face me... both of me!', 157300, 0, 0, 36, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take his right head.', 'He\'s bigger than I thought he\'d be.', 157299, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inspecting', 'Inspecting', 157298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, my little friends. Listen to this new song I learned!', '', 157296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die, den I flatten all people in town!', 'You die, den I flatten all people in town!', 157294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Storm\'s Wake shall guide the fleet to victory for the Alliance, as we have before.', '', 157293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'House Waycrest stands with you, Lord Admiral. And with the Alliance.', 157292, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And to renew our bond with the Alliance, whose heroes have saved us from our own unmaking.', 157291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ask you now to put your faith in my daughter Jaina... the true Lord Admiral of Kul Tiras.', 157290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde, too, has made its intentions clear. Those savages would see us burn.', 157289, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 112081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Division has made us vulnerable. We are beset by enemies from within.', 157288, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you all for coming. I shall keep this brief.', 157287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet between the two of us we could take these monsters out!', '', 157286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Daelin asked me to leave his guard and raise this child of the Eastern Kingdoms, I struggled to understand why. \n\nWhy thrust this burden on me? Why deny me the honor of fighting by his side? I thought maybe I had done something to lose his faith. \n\nOver the years, I have come to realize that the opposite was true. He wanted Taelia to grow up strong of arm and noble of heart - and he had faith that I could make that happen.', '', 157285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it true that one can travel from Stormwind to Ironforge by some kind of underground tunnel?$B$BThat sounds incredible! I\'d love to see it some day.', 157284, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 604, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('And that was just a pinch! Imagine how much damage they could do with more of this stuff.', '', 157283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. With this, the locals can hopefully return to working their fields.', 157282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a creature nearby that is threatening the local farmers. We need to help them!', 157281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! I bet they\'ll find use for these supplies immediately.', 157280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hopefully, the day will come when the citizens of Kul Tiras can once again trust the tidesages to guide them. Until then, we must chart our own course.', 157279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should afford us some much needed time to breath. Thank you.', 157278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The people of Stormsong will not forget your actions. Good work!', 157277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These hills are rich with resources that are important to the Storm\'s Wake\'s efforts. Perhaps you could help them out?', 157276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Stormsong\'s forces are causing problems again. We cannot allow their dark rituals to continue!', 157275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve lost control of the area! Get in there and drive the enemy back!', 157274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Storm\'s Wake needs assistance here. Do what you can to restore some sense of peace to this valley!', 157273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cannoneers! Prepare the final barrage!', 157272, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maintain the shield! We\'re barely holding her together as it is!', 157271, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one of the Forsaken. I didn\'t think-- <cough>. Tell me, miss...?', '', 157270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> The Horde. Here I thought I would die in peace.\n\nAnd you\'re Forsaken? Interesting, but too late.\n\nWell, what are you waiting for?', '', 157269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you back at the wagon, $p!', '', 157268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoo! It\'s lootin\' time!', 157267, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please take me back.', 'Please take me back.', 157266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help today. We should head back.', 'Thank you for your help today. We should head back.', 157265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch the encounter between Zelling and his family.', 'Watch the encounter between Zelling and his family.', 157264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jolly good job as always, my friend. If all members of the Alliance rode like you do, then they\'d be welcome to my estate any time!', '', 157263, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 111402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, what a beautiful day for a show! Mount up, my friend, and display your prowess in the ring!', '', 157262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suit yourself. Come on, $n.', 157261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m returning to base. I know how this ends, I don\'t need to witness it.', '', 157260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know dat ya be among ya bettahs. Don\' be gettin\' in da way of my time wit\' da hexlord.', '', 157259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fantastic! That should slow the naga down.', 157258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my word. Come. $n, return to Nathanos and inform him that we have what we need.', 157257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will join you... and help you find Marshal Valentine. As long as you promise that my family remains unharmed.', '', 157256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga are making another push against the fort! Deal with them, tortollan style!', 157255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Embrace the Forsaken and carve your own path. You\'ll be amongst those who accept you for what you\'ve become.', 157254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And where does that leave me? A mindless servant of the Banshee Queen?', '', 157253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is an honor seldom awarded to one not of Zandalar. Come, walk de path with me and share dis Vol\'jin\'s deeds.', 157252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tried to warn you, Zelling. The process changes you. The living won\'t accept you anymore.', 157250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Julia... Matthew... Hannah... what have I done? What.. am I?', '', 157249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make the monster go away!', 157248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave us be!', 157247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get it away!', '', 157246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet!', '', 157245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know who you are, but my husband NEVER tried to hurt me or his children. We are leaving... do not follow us!', 157244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I...', '', 157243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THAT\'S ENOUGH!', '', 157242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Momma! Help us!', '', 157241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it away!', 157240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daddy is right here. Listen to my voice! Why aren\'t you understanding this?!', '', 157239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay away!', 157238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Momma, I\'m scared of the monster!', '', 157237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why won\'t you understand?! I\'m your husband... Children, it\'s your daddy!', '', 157236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the last time, STAY BACK! You are NOT my husband!', 157235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remain strong... even in death.', '', 157234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came ill-prepared to face me in combat!', '', 157233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zelling, we need you to locate Marshal Valentine\'s corpse for us.', 'Zelling, we need you to locate Marshal Valentine\'s corpse for us.', 157232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family will avenge... me.', '', 157231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be the focus of my rage!', '', 157230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess we\'ll see what happens now.', 157229, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I live! Hahaha! I must see Julia and the children at once. They will be delighted!', '', 157228, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Few spirits have ever shown such... power. Master Gadrin, I invite you to bring dis chieftain\'s ashes to Atal\'Dazar. If his spirit is worthy, he may have a place of honor amongst our greatest kings.', 157227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zalazane not gonna come back from dat. Even in death, Vol\'jin be watchin\' over us.', '', 157226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da dead, dey be fallin\'...', '', 157225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our reinforcements await your command.', '', 157224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Horde want war, we\'re going to give them everything we\'ve got!', '', 157223, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you bring fair news.', '', 157222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormsong will endure.', '', 157221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe travels.', '', 157220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tides guide you.', '', 157219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! We can certainly use the supplies, and we will find a use for those piglets.', '', 157218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quilboar have been raiding our stores again. Fair is fair; take our supplies back, as well as anything else that seems useful!', '', 157217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111247, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got it.', '', 157216, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, sir!', 157215, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 111808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Merciful Elune, please bless the fallen.', 157214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia, prepare to make your rounds again. Tell the city guard to be on the lookout for unusual weapons being smuggled into Boralus.', '', 157213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let it be known dat I find Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin, worthy of dese sacred tombs. Though to enter Atal\'Dazar, you may need to fight. I recommend de champion be de one to carry dese ashes to dere final resting place.', 157212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a hard thing to do what your leaders will not.', 157211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When it be clear dat our warchief, Garrosh, be unwillin\' ta lead wit\' honor, Vol\'jin led da rebellion ta depose da warmonger.', '', 157210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At de time, Zul\'s vision of a grand troll empire was very tempting to my father. I must commend your chieftain for seeing de bigger picture.', 157209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Zandalar tried ta unite da troll tribes, Vol\'jin chose da safety of his people over da prophet\'s dark powers.', '', 157208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin made a deal wit\' Bwonsamdi ta defeat da powerful Zalazane.', '', 157207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are more wisps than I can count. The loss of life...', 157206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come bearin\' da ashes of Vol\'jin, son of Sen\'jin, ta be honored in dis sacred place.', '', 157205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flynn, I have another job for you: Help our new ally track down the source of this powder.', '', 157204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient threats are stirring in these lands. Be wary.', '', 157203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Windcaller, I have come at the Warchief\'s direction.', 'Windcaller, I have come at the Warchief\'s direction.', 157202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I need to go to Silithus.', 'Yes, I need to go to Silithus.', 157201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I here, human?', 'Why am I here, human?', 157200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emissary! Mind giving our skeptical colleagues here a demonstration?', '', 157199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this, they aren\'t.', '', 157198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is that a lead? They\'re making new weapons all the time.', '', 157197, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 111634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, Flynn. What\'s this big lead of yours? Something about Ashvane having a new gunpowder?', 157196, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 111810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a wind rider to Marshal\'s Refuge in Un\'Goro Crater.', 'I need a wind rider to Marshal\'s Refuge in Un\'Goro Crater.', 157195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back again... good! I feared I would have to tell de princess dat her champion was stolen by a diamond dwarf!', '', 157194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, wow! We did a great job!', '', 157193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to recover some of that lost cargo. And by \"we,\" I mean you.', '', 157192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wherever you are going, I hope de trip is brief. I know de princess needs your help!', 'Wherever you are going, I hope de trip is brief. I know de princess needs your help!', 157191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is extraordinary! I really should take notes.', 'Dis is extraordinary! I really should take notes.', 157190, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protecting your supply lines is a vital element of warfare... as is disrupting those of you enemy.', '', 157189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance shipwrecks... always a welcome sight! Search the area for any supplies that could be of use to the Horde.', '', 157188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All in a day\'s work.', '', 157187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That extractor is under attack! Protect it!', '', 157186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These resources provide vital fuel for the Horde\'s good work. Well done.', '', 157185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect our extractor! We need that Azerite!', '', 157184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your strategy, Shandris?', 'What is your strategy, Shandris?', 157183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Shandris\'s keen eyes scan the horizon. She nods at you in acknowledgement.>', 157182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find Sunwatcher, then fill him with arrows.', '', 157181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strategy?', '', 157180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gnomeregan Covert Ops team will plant bombs to draw out Sunwatcher, and then we will assault him in the confusion.', '', 157179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey hey!', 157178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Affirmative! Consequently, I\'ve enlisted a crack team of commandos with the technical expertise to do so.', '', 157177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want to... set off a bunch of bombs at once.', 157176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to execute a synchronized incendiary attack on all of their excavation sites.', '', 157175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Our intel suggests at least three excavations.', '', 157174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archaeology?', 157173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sunwatcher is, as a member of the Reliquary, here on an archaeological mission.', '', 157172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I do not remember? But it is better dis way.', '', 157171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me, friend... who did you say you were? Are you the one Malfurion spoke of?', 157170, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 112418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I delivered your note to B\'wizati.', 'I delivered your note to B\'wizati.', 157168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And the civilians... not even they were spared. I only hope that some managed to flee before...', 157167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our outposts were taken by surprise. They fell one by one. The guards were poisoned.', 157166, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 0, 112416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s wipes a tear as she stands.', 157165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We tried to set a trap for the Horde. It failed. We could not stop them.', 157164, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 112415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good ta see you are well, $n. \n\nI am well, too.\n\nAkunda has given me de chance ta start anew.', '', 157163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s your plan, High Commander?', 'What\'s your plan, High Commander?', 157162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion represents the best that Azeroth has to offer.\n\nFor the Alliance!', '', 157161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who? I do not know any troll by dat name, do I?', '', 157160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The bodies... so many bodies...', 157159, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 112414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got somethin\' $n needs tae see. A gift that can aid the people of this land.', '', 157158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dwarf... made of diamond... in de heart of Zuldazar! Who...?', '', 157157, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen some strange things in these woods but nothing like this.', 157156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel dat? De ground is trembling...', '', 157155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief commanded I assist you.', 'The Warchief commanded I assist you.', 157153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must fly to Gadgetzan in Tanaris.', 'I must fly to Gadgetzan in Tanaris.', 157152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... must...', '', 157151, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would... damn my soul... for all eternity... if it meant my family\'s happiness... please! You must...', '', 157150, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder that every day, Zelling.', 157149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
