('Armed and ready! Blast that kraken back to the depths!', 'Armed and ready! Blast that kraken back to the depths!', 157134, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112599, 112600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to fire!', 'Ready to fire!', 157133, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112597, 112598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doras, I need a flight down to Mudsprocket in Dustwallow Marsh.', 'Doras, I need a flight down to Mudsprocket in Dustwallow Marsh.', 157132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannon\'s good to go! Turn that beast into chum!', 'Cannon\'s good to go! Turn that beast into chum!', 157131, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112595, 112596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.... NO!', 'No.... NO!', 157130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks! Now I\'ll get this cannon prepped for some payback!', 'You have my thanks! Now I\'ll get this cannon prepped for some payback!', 157129, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112605, 112606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zabanji snores.', 'Zabanji snores.', 157128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one! Now, just give me a second to get this cannon working!', 'Ugh, I owe you one! Now, just give me a second to get this cannon working!', 157127, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112602, 112603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was it all a dream?', 'Was it all a dream?', 157126, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let this beast eat me!', 'Don\'t let this beast eat me!', 157125, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112592, 112593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn \'em all to a crisp!', '', 157124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get this thing off me!', 'Get this thing off me!', 157123, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112590, 112591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, grab a torch and hit anything that moves. These undead abominations aren\'t worth a second thought!', '', 157122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, Private. And there are endless monsters to kill in this unholy port.', '', 157121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', 'Help!', 157120, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 112587, 112588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And no one to steal our kills, sir.', '', 157119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? Where are we?', 'Who are you? Where are we?', 157118, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No backup\'s coming. There will be no rescue if we mess this up.', '', 157117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up, soldiers. This is an unauthorized mission.', '', 157116, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waitin\' for, $p?\n\nWe got weapons and we got an enemy. Get in the boat!', 'What are you waitin\' for, $p?\n\nWe got weapons and we got an enemy. Get in the boat!', 157115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
