('To battle!', 'To battle!', 157100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job sorting that mess out, $p. Everyone gets to go home safe tonight.', '', 157099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111515, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi is ours!', 'Arathi is ours!', 157098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
