('Follow me!', 'Follow me!', 157096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 157095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! We\'ve got a war to win!', 'This way! We\'ve got a war to win!', 157094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde in this area have chased the wildlife into the lowlands. Help the hunters deal with all the bears.', '', 157093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111514, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you made me kill my friend! Now you will die!', '', 157092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters, behold our glorious destiny!', '', 157091, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 111091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend.  The valley is with you.', 'I am so happy to see you, $p. I will remember this.', 157090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can make it now.  Be careful.', 'You\'re a welcome sight!', 157089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was dead for sure!', 'Thank you, I won\'t forget this.', 157088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Maybe those boars aren\'t so bad, after all. I wonder if they like steamed clams...', '', 157087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some unguarded boars have been spotted outside the kraul. If you\'re willing to ride one, we can use them against the quilboar!', '', 157086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111245, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge me... Taptaf...', '', 157085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last... The torment ends...', 157084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... Release...', 157083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... Was a trap...', 157082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heh... Hunter becomes the hunted...', 157081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He comes for us all...', 157080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a moment, your majesty! New information has come to light.', '', 157079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 114090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was not... Supposed to... Happen...', 157078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So convenient when the prey walks in on it\'s own!', 157077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look what just walked onto my trapline!', 157076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a bit small but I\'ll take your hide anyway!', 157075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They promised me all the bounty of the forest!', 157074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pelt will fetch a nice price!', 157073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another pelt to take!', 157072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will.... fall...', '', 157071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to the earth...', '', 157070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end... comes...', '', 157069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
