('My soul... is blighted...', '', 157067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The veil has dropped...', '', 157066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thros will consume us all!', '', 157065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He speaks from beyond!', '', 157064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take yer vengeance and take yer treasure!', '', 157063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, grab a torch and get to work, $p!', 'Aye, grab a torch and get to work, $p!', 157062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, we gonna wreak havoc and send \'em all down to de dark depths below!', '', 157061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So we gonna burn \'em up, aye?', 'So we gonna burn \'em up, aye?', 157060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our old cursed crew in de Port of Zem\'lan be sendin\' out big raiding parties today, and we be one of de targets.', '', 157059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to de salty sea, me hearties!', '', 157058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hand hoy!', 'All hand hoy!', 157057, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once I do figure out this spell, perhaps they\'ll let me back in. How about... Ta ergsi leinad!', '', 157056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taptaf, if you can understand me, I wanted to say I am sorry for polymorphing you. You know, permanently.', '', 157055, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if your name will work, Taptaf. Let\'s try, Nolem asi Taptaf!', '', 157054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It wasn\'t fair for them to expel me, Taptaf. I\'ll show them my greatest power... err... once I remember how it went.', '', 157053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... no, that doesn\'t seem to be it.', '', 157052, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t remember that blasted spell. What was it again, Taptaf? Leinad something... Nos fatsug?', '', 157051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes have been opened!', '', 157050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood will feed the forest!', '', 157049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrraaaaagh!', '', 157048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. Perhaps one day this place can be used for worship again.', '', 157047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic here will befoul the surrounding waters if left unchecked. Delay the tidesages as best you can.', '', 157046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May their misguided souls be swept away by the tides, led to a final peace.', '', 157045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Stormsong\'s dark influence was brought to this place by specific individuals. End their lives before they have the opportunity to do even more harm.', '', 157044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! I can see the smoke from here! We\'ll hit \'em again as soon as we can.', '', 157043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111513, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you get along with gryphons! Check in with Bernadette Robels. She\'s worked out a plan to strike the Horde at Warfang Hold.', '', 157042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111512, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yarr?', 157041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak without de loa! Finish him!', '', 157040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De fiend hides behind Rezan\'s power! I will steal it back from him!', '', 157039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, mainlander, fear that which lurks in the depths. Nothing good lives in its darkest shadows.', '', 157038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of the tidesages here are attempting to call upon a force that could level Boralus. They must be stopped!', '', 157037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let her lead, she\'ll get you there and back in one piece.', 157036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s ready to go!', 157035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s the fastest gyphon in the valley. If anyone says otherwise, they\'re lying.', 157034, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are next in line!', 'You are next in line!', 157033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and the bird are not nice.', 'You and the bird are not nice.', 157032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
