('Look! Pretty bird.', 'Look! Pretty bird.', 157029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Reorigination Drive is ready. Now, it is left to us to end G\'huun\'s plague once and for all.', 157028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Reoriginiation Drive is primed. Let\'s light it up and pop G\'huun like the pus-filled boil he is.', '', 157027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me be da one... crushed?', 'Me be da one... crushed?', 157026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny runt! I gonna crush ya like a bug!', 'Puny runt! I gonna crush ya like a bug!', 157025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
