('', 'Everit trained you well. I know he would be proud of you.', 157020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, my lady. I won\'t let you down.', 157019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I name you Marshal Cleardawn and appoint you the head of the Waycrest guard.', 157018, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Drustvar has greater need of your services in a larger capacity.', 157017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inquisitor Cleardawn, you exceeded our expectations, displaying compassion, bravery, leadership, and cunning.', 157016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
