('The Horde controls the Circle of Elements!', 'The Horde controls the Circle of Elements!', 157011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Circle of Elements carries our banners!', 'The Circle of Elements carries our banners!', 157010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces control the Circle of Elements.', 'Our forces control the Circle of Elements.', 157009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Circle of Elements remains under our control.', 'The Circle of Elements remains under our control.', 157008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Newstead carries the Horde\'s banners... for now.', 'Newstead carries the Horde\'s banners... for now.', 157007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those monsters think they control Newstead? We\'ll show them...', 'Those monsters think they control Newstead? We\'ll show them...', 157006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those fiends can\'t hold Newstead forever.', 'Those fiends can\'t hold Newstead forever.', 157005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have control of Newstead.', 'Our forces have control of Newstead.', 157004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Newstead is under our control.', 'Newstead is under our control.', 157003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'ve got control of Newstead. Best to keep it that way.', 'Looks like we\'ve got control of Newstead. Best to keep it that way.', 157002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loa of kings has fallen. We must use caution if we are to launch another hunt.\n\nRastakhan is sorely wounded and aging fast. Only the power of Rezan could keep Bwonsamdi at bay. I would offer him my power, but it is not my domain to challenge the loa of death.', '', 157001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, lady?', '', 157000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beastlord L\'kala eyes the goblin beside her suspiciously.', 156999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like your little one is tired after all dat fighting. It will be safe here. I will look after it myself.', 156998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn Hatchling yawns and closes its eyes.', 'Direhorn Hatchling yawns and closes its eyes.', 156996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to leave!', 'Time to leave!', 156995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel like someone has ripped de very soul from my body.', '', 156994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a close call! Appreciate the help!', 'That was a close call! Appreciate the help!', 156993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Appreciate the help! For some reason my Goo-be-gone slippers malfunctioned.', 'Appreciate the help! For some reason my Goo-be-gone slippers malfunctioned.', 156992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you so much! As soon as I get back I\'m filing a complaint. The logistical hurdles this expedition is encountering is far beyond the scope of our briefing.', 'Thank you so much! As soon as I get back I\'m filing a complaint. The logistical hurdles this expedition is encountering is far beyond the scope of our briefing.', 156991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man, I\'m going to be in the Sanitron for a week after this!', 'Oh man, I\'m going to be in the Sanitron for a week after this!', 156990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a sticky situation! You have my gratitude!', 'That was a sticky situation! You have my gratitude!', 156989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May de seas bless dis ore, and may dey never seek to reclaim what dey have once blessed.', 'May de seas bless dis ore, and may dey never seek to reclaim what dey have once blessed.', 156988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you bless these storm silver ingots?', 'Could you bless these storm silver ingots?', 156987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No person should think of the Forsaken as a second chance for anything.', '', 156986, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not like what you are insinuating, Zelling.', '', 156985, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Crustacean power!', '', 156984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you need to seek some shell-ter. Get it? Shells? Crabs! Victory is mine!', '', 156983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will not stand! You have not seen the last of Captain Hermes and his trio of ruthless crabs!', '', 156982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is this possible?!', '', 156981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a challenger steps up!', '', 156980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail for Stormsong Valley.', 'Set sail for Stormsong Valley.', 156979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail for Tiragarde Sound.', 'Set sail for Tiragarde Sound.', 156978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail for Drustvar.', 'Set sail for Drustvar.', 156977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...What?', '', 156976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That bloke in the red shirt over there told me I \"wasn\'t canon.\" Well, obviously! I\'m a mariner, not a cannon!', '', 156974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you brief me on Kul Tiras again?', 'Can you brief me on Kul Tiras again?', 156973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will set things right.', '', 156972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, how can I aid ya?', 156971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great stuff! You certainly nipped their plans in the bud.', '', 156970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do the seas call to you as they call to me?', '', 156969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must know if my family is safe! <cough>', '', 156968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I said do not try my--', 156967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am hearing reports of some sort of horrible plant monstrosity near the kraul. Our mechanical farmhands should make quick work of it.', '', 156966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111249, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the seas guide you home.', '', 156965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you ask of House Proudmoore?', '', 156964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail for Zuldazar.', 'Set sail for Zuldazar.', 156963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set sail for Nazmir.', 'Set sail for Nazmir.', 156962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand strong together.', '', 156961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will honor my father\'s legacy.', '', 156960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent years at sea collecting the most lethal assortment of hermit crabs that this world has ever seen. Care to battle, or are you too afraid of getting washed up?', '', 156959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. We\'ll get our best researchers to begin their study of these writings. Thank you.', '', 156958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our battlemages spotted several scrolls of tortollan magic among the fallen. We must obtain them before the Horde learns of them. Recover any that you come across.', '', 156957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has reclaimed Stromgarde!', 'The Alliance has reclaimed Stromgarde!', 156956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n! Over here!', '', 156955, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy dere, $p. I hear ya be friends with ol\' Kiro and de vulpera.\n\nWe ain\'t got time for a long parley, so Kiro\'s word be good enough for me.\n\nIf ya be up for a little pillagin\' on de open seas, ya be welcome on our crew.\n\nJump in de boat when ya be ready, and we\'ll set sail.', '', 156954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... I\'ll have our mages pursue further study on this scroll at once. Thank you!', '', 156953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy, $p! It be good to see ya again.\n\nYa be up for a bit o\' seaside pillagin\'? Zem\'lan be orderin\' his crews to de boats and dat makes \'em easy targets for us... if your aim be true.\n\nI seen ya in action before though, so I know ya can make quick work of those scurvy skeletons.\n\nHop in de boat when ya be ready to go.', '', 156952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall return to the Wind\'s Redemption. Let the Grand Admiral know when you are prepared to return to Boralus.', '', 156951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent years at sea finding the most ruthless crabs you will ever battle against. Care to see how quickly your pets will be washed up?', '', 156950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! What can I do for you?', '', 156949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whass thish?', 'Whass thish?', 156948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! It is good to see you again. It has been some time since I served beneath you in Draenor.', '', 156947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kul Tirans will know fear!', '', 156946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... even....', 'Wha... even....', 156945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ick! So bitter!', 'Ick! So bitter!', 156944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tastes like... hooks...', 'Tastes like... hooks...', 156943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha am I?... A vrykul?... <hic!>', 'Wha am I?... A vrykul?... <hic!>', 156942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... hate... <hic!> pale ale...', 'I... hate... <hic!> pale ale...', 156941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open up a portal to bring in our troops.', 'Open up a portal to bring in our troops.', 156940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to serve the Horde as part of my ongoing studies of telemancy beneath Oculeth. \n\nIt will also be my honor to leave this place as soon as the task is done.', '', 156939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hounds... were... all bark... no bite...', 'My hounds... were... all bark... no bite...', 156938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect, our quarry has come to us!', 'Perfect, our quarry has come to us!', 156937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infuse this amulet with power... it might be the only way tae save her!', '', 156936, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 111031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel that? Some sort of... tremor...', '', 156935, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 110882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Subject: Azeroth. Major arrhythmia detected.\n\nVitals exceeding acceptable parameters.\n\nAttempting to update incident reports...\n\nERROR. ERROR. ERROR. ERROR.', 156934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoo! That\'s strong!', '', 156933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm... reminds me... of when I was a miner... the trick was hitting it with yer pick at an angle... keeps the... ore....', '', 156932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WARNING: Multiple containment breaches registered.\n\nRecommend expurgation of following facilities:\n\nUldaman. Uldum. Uldorus. Ulduar. Uldir. Uldaz. Uld... Uld... Uld... Uld...', 156931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urg... Thas not sittin\' well with me...', '', 156930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my calculations, we\'ve lost two point five three nine, repeating of course, percent from our success rate. We must hurry the repairs!', 'By my calculations, we\'ve lost two point five three nine, repeating of course, percent from our success rate. We must hurry the repairs!', 156929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon! Get those tanks repaired! We\'re falling behind schedule!', 'C\'mon! Get those tanks repaired! We\'re falling behind schedule!', 156928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up, people! We\'ve only got a short window to get these siege tanks deployed before the Horde discovers we\'re here.', 'Hurry up, people! We\'ve only got a short window to get these siege tanks deployed before the Horde discovers we\'re here.', 156927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
