('Take us back to Boralus.', 'Take us back to Boralus.', 156918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh boy oh boy! I won\'t let you down $n, I swear it!', 156917, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, excuse me? $GMr.:Ms.; $n? Over here!', 156916, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, did you require something from me?', '', 156915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where should we focus our efforts?', '', 156914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take us back to Zuldazar.', 'Take us back to Zuldazar.', 156913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need a boat? A message sent?\n\nPERHAPS SOME AID IN STABBING?', 156912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away, mon... Can you not shee... <hic!> I\'m busy?', '', 156911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Subject: Azeroth.\n\nWARNING: Catastrophic system failure in progress.\n\nPlanetary integrity at--\n\ncalculating... calculating... calculating...', 156910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wasn\'t in my calculations...', 'This wasn\'t in my calculations...', 156909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my calculations, your chance of success is... zero!', 'By my calculations, your chance of success is... zero!', 156908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat quilboar wielded powerful mojo, but it was no match for you, champion.', 156907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114117, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De lands themselves are marching under a quilboar shaman\'s command. Dispatch dis new threat before it jeopardizes our plans.', 156906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110881, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rest easy tonight knowing Stormsong has fewer boulders walking around.', '', 156905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111480, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wild Pterrorchick screeches in alarm!', 'Wild Pterrorchick screeches in alarm!', 156904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a quilboar earthcaller here who\'s summoning an army of elementals. Thin that army out, and then thin him out!', '', 156903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111479, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I thought I was doomed.', 'Thank you. I thought I was doomed.', 156902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m grateful there are still good people in this world.', 'I\'m grateful there are still good people in this world.', 156901, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I can make it from here.', 'Thanks! I can make it from here.', 156900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
