('Please... I need to... take care... of my family... no matter what.', '', 156730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be shunned if you become one of us. You look in a mirror and all you\'ll see is a monster.', 156729, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Voss, <cough> please... bring me back... I must help my family... I\'ll do anything... anything...', '', 156728, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? Your family will think you\'re a monster, don\'t be ridiculous!', 156727, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine. I have something I want to know, anyway.', 156726, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<wheeze> I\'m... sorry. I.. can\'t... I don\'t have anything... left in me...', '', 156725, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zelling! Damn you, we need you alive!', 156724, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Eternal life, granted to me at last, I am ready for it!', '', 156723, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, Zelling. Do you understand, truly understand, what\'s about to happen?', 156722, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent job. You showed them how we do things in the valley.', '', 156721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scouts are reporting a new threat in this area. Kill it before it becomes a bigger problem.', '', 156720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, Jaina. Light be with you.', '', 156719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will return with the fleet... or not at all.', 156718, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 110939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be difficult... and dangerous.', '', 156717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe it is... and I believe you can.', '', 156716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And dealing with that is the only hope we have of bringing them back.', 156715, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, you\'re the reason they left the Alliance.', '', 156714, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then we must make allies of our own.', 156713, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show us... show us what happened...', 156710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Horde makes allies of the Zandalari, we won\'t have the power to stop them.', '', 156709, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 110931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! It\'s one of Sylvanas\'s tricks. It has to be...', '', 156708, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a massive Zandalari fleet.', '', 156707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survivors say they encountered strange and terrifying magics.', '', 156706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only one returned.', '', 156705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m aware. What of the eight warships we sent in pursuit?', '', 156704, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 110923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A princess. And a prophet.', '', 156703, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recently, Horde agents broke into the Stockades and freed two Zandalari prisoners.', '', 156702, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, perhaps you could help us see what this survivor has witnessed.', '', 156701, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lot of travelers have been killed in this area. I need you to take out whoever is behind these attacks.', '', 156700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone is here. What news do you bring, Spymaster?', '', 156699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupendous work! I knew we could count on you to protect us.', '', 156698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next I be wantin\' an airship. I be namin\' dat one after me son!', '', 156697, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stole dis one myself! I call her Mala\'s Fortune... afta me daughta!', '', 156696, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When dey tell me we be dealin\' wit pirates, I say I be needin\' pirate ship!', '', 156695, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are up to something!', '', 156694, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... eternity...!', '', 156693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you be ready to go, use da rope. I be wantin\' to show ya my boat!', '', 156692, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The next one of you that complains is dead!', 156691, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Work faster, you pathetic mongrels!', 156690, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More work! Less talk! This Azerite won\'t mine itself!', 156689, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that what you call work? You dogs are lucky we aren\'t paying you for this!', 156688, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back to work, you dogs! Put your backs into it!', 156687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, kill me! Deliver me to eternity as a Forsaken!', '', 156686, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'ve been stealing from the company. I\'m here to make sure it doesn\'t happen again...', 'I know you\'ve been stealing from the company. I\'m here to make sure it doesn\'t happen again...', 156685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lookin\' for a beating? Mind yer business!', 'You lookin\' for a beating? Mind yer business!', 156684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep on walkin\', crewman. Nothin\' to see here...', 'Keep on walkin\', crewman. Nothin\' to see here...', 156683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re you looking at, crewman?', 'What\'re you looking at, crewman?', 156682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> Miss Voss, how is it that you came to be Forsaken?', '', 156681, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s thieves are pilfering Azerite from the Ashvane Trading Company. Crush our enemies and claim those resources for the 7th Legion!', '', 156680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only stole to fill an empty heart that has never known love!', 'I only stole to fill an empty heart that has never known love!', 156679, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was my poor upbringing that made me do it!', 'It was my poor upbringing that made me do it!', 156678, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t do it again, I promise!', 'I won\'t do it again, I promise!', 156677, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That salty dog Harrington called in the muscle!', 'That salty dog Harrington called in the muscle!', 156676, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m done stealing! No more!', 'I\'m done stealing! No more!', 156675, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t kill me please! I\'ll never steal again!', 'Don\'t kill me please! I\'ll never steal again!', 156674, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our soldiers are being held for ransom by exiles from Zuldazar. We don\'t negotiate with allies of the Horde. Show them the strength of the Alliance!', '', 156673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dispatched them with ease. Well done.', '', 156672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spies have located a small encampment of Horde troops on the dunes. Strike swiftly and decimate the enemy forces!', '', 156671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'was truly a pleasure doing business with you. If you ever want a job as a pirate, you\'re free to join my crew!', '', 156670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a man of my word, $c. The captain\'s lockbox is all yours!', '', 156669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet you in the captain\'s quarters once Hartford is dead. Don\'t worry about the lockbox; everything inside will be yours!', '', 156668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not done yet. You have good information, but we need to see just how powerful you are.', 156667, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Surely this is enough, your champion has caused chaos and destruction within Sagehold. Make me a Forsaken!', '', 156666, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Were we... wrong... to support the Alliance?', 156665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde will never break the will of Kul Tiras!', 156664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The book... should be thrown... to the sea...', '', 156663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take this book! It is too dangerous!', '', 156662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d be dead before your next pathetic cough, Zelling. Care to test me?', 156661, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<wheeze> You\'re not concerned I may attack you? Try to run?', '', 156660, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did Captain Stone go mad when she turned? I\'m well aware of what happened to her.', '', 156659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Becoming Forsaken is an unpredictable process. Your body and mind are certain to change, but to what extent... it\'s impossible to know. As is how well you will cope with the process.', 156658, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, but can you answer my question? When you become Forsaken, are you purged of any sicknesses?', '', 156657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With you on my side, I\'ll be one step closer to getting out of this blasted desert!', '', 156656, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Redrock Harbor when the job is done.', '', 156655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that was... inventive.', '', 156654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies cannot complete their mission while the Horde wanders these ruins. The Dark Iron have an idea of how to handle this.', '', 156653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2 minutes until the Battle for Stromgarde begins.', '', 156652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to have dropped my fabulous hat.', 'I seem to have dropped my fabulous hat.', 156651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take us to Stormsong Valley.', 'Take us to Stormsong Valley.', 156650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Let\'s see if any of this proves useful.', '', 156649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ruins appear to be a temple that has fallen into the sea. The presence of naga is also a concern. Good luck on your reconnaissance.', '', 156648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to parley, Ty\'jin.', 'I\'m ready to parley, Ty\'jin.', 156647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you be ready to get goin\', boss-mon.', '', 156646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well handled. Better to deal with a threat now than leave it until later.', '', 156645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have discovered a murloc infestation. We can\'t risk them swelling in number and attacking our flanks.', '', 156644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well, champion! De loa smile today.', 156643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110778, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Venture Company scars de lands of a valuable ally. De loa would not be pleased. Put an end to their actions and help clean up de mess.', 156642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110777, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Well done! Those tortollans will remember who saved dem from dat fate.', 156641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110780, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I received word dat naga on these shores enslave tortollans for unknown purposes. Do not let dis happen, champion! Slay de naga and set de tortollans free.', 156640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110779, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tidesages have long guided lost souls at sea... but not like this.', '', 156639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work. Let\'s hope the tortollans remember this when we need them later!', '', 156637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110732, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to sail to Lordaeron.', 'I am ready to sail to Lordaeron.', 156636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Venture Company\'s making a mess of the coastline here. Let\'s earn the tortollans\' favor by cleaning things up.', '', 156635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110731, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Schools out... forever...', 156634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to teach you a lesson!', 156633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great work. I hate to imagine what the naga had in store for those tortollans.', '', 156632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110734, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scouts report that naga in this area are taking tortollans captive. Whatever they\'re planning, we need to stop it now.', '', 156631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110733, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight like a dairy farmer!', 156630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! We are one step closer to victory!', '', 156629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will keep their numbers down... for now. Well done.', '', 156628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These feathered vipers are known for their aggressive infestations, but this is getting out of hand! Destroy their eggs at once.', '', 156627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These will do nicely. Our wounded soldiers will be grateful for your aid, champion.', '', 156626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make use of local supplies. Collect salivary glands from the wild pterrordax. Our injured can benefit from their restorative properties.', '', 156625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No wonder ravasaurs can eat nearly anything! These will be put to good use. Thank you, champion.', '', 156624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are in need of durable supplies, and the ravasaurs here supposedly have extremely resilient stomach linings. Collect some for us, would you?', '', 156623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arghh... to Neptulon\'s locker... with you...', '', 156622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this... mutiny?! Have at you, swine!', '', 156621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 156620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My research is complete, for now. Thank you for your assistance.', 156619, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll teach the horde to interfere! This magic should never fall into their hands...', 156618, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your help is greatly appreciated. This barrier is so resilient...', 156617, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Immortality is at my fingertips! I cannot wait to become a Forsaken. Just imagine the possibilities! \n\nWhen you have a moment, you must tell me what it is like. Undeath, eternity, having the world at your grasp!', '', 156616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to let my life end here from some... disease. I must live on to keep my family safe.', '', 156615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not disturb the dead, $r.', '', 156614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could use a little help here!', 156613, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you aren\'t moving forward, then you\'re falling behind. That\'s what I always say!', '', 156612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll need to run some tests and gather data. Keep an eye out for any who might interfere.', 156611, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we can harness this magic, or even replicate it.', 156610, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magic used here is fascinating! It\'s unlike anything I\'ve ever seen before.', 156609, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t over!', 156608, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 0, 110253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But do you have time to waste?', '', 156607, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 110252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a new disguise.', 'I need a new disguise.', 156606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are here, run! Is no where safe?!', 'The Horde are here, run! Is no where safe?!', 156605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great, more Horde problems now that the Alliance is here!', 'Great, more Horde problems now that the Alliance is here!', 156604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not risking my life if the Horde are already here!', 'I\'m not risking my life if the Horde are already here!', 156603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run! This is what we get for helping the Alliance!', 'Run! This is what we get for helping the Alliance!', 156602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we were safe from the Horde!', 'I thought we were safe from the Horde!', 156601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are the Horde here?!', 'How are the Horde here?!', 156600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde, run!', 'The Horde, run!', 156599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is test text, I say things in it.', '', 156598, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, Nathanos.', 156597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sylvanas begins to depart, then hesitates and glances over her shoulder.>', 156596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fail you. Safe journey, my lady.', '', 156595, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 110756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See it done, and dispatch reports of your progress to me.', 156594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, Warchief.', '', 156593, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 110755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Work with $n to determine where we will secure a foothold first.', 156592, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my lady. The Banshee\'s Wail is prepared to depart at a moment\'s notice.', '', 156591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is everything in order?', 156590, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 110718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nathanos bows deeply.>', '', 156589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen.', '', 156588, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 110753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, your presence is required upon the Banshee\'s Wail. The Dark Lady has orders for us to begin our campaign on the shores of Kul Tiras.', '', 156587, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me.', 156586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n.', 156585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overseeing this group is Garona Halforcen. She will orchestrate these missions with your help.', '', 156584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
