('Rhan\'ka still hiding out down in the oasis? I gotta go visit him one of these days...', '', 156445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you\'d come back for more! I got a fresh batch right here, just for you.', '', 156444, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[SCENE SHOWING GENERAL JAKRA\'ZET AND EMPEROR KORTHEK COLLUDING.]', '', 156443, 0, 0, 457, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The depths... watch... you...', 'The depths... watch... you...', 156442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll toss your broken carcass into the sea!', 'I\'ll toss your broken carcass into the sea!', 156441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should have been born a goblin, they appreciate my unique abilities more.', 156440, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should cut a deal with the Irontide. They\'re even bigger fools.', '', 156439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do what you must while we search for Zul, little hero. But be ready, we will have need of your ferocity soon enough.', '', 156438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hunt these heretics to the ends of Azeroth. I will gather my flock and we shall rain death and rocks down upon the heads of these vile creatures who dared turn their backs on us.\n\nFor now, my flock shall search the skies and divine what Zul and his traitors doing.', 156437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya had de killin\' blow... dis time...', '', 156436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue my party for a PvP Island Expedition.>', '<Queue my party for a PvP Island Expedition.>', 156435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue for a PvP Island Expedition.>', '<Queue for a PvP Island Expedition.>', 156434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Jin\'Tiki\'s Fetish to destroy Zulajin!', 'Use Jin\'Tiki\'s Fetish to destroy Zulajin!', 156433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only hope I\'ve hidden my key well enough so that you are the only one to find it.', '', 156432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaga, your valor is without question but you are in no condition for combat. $n, I\'ll accompany Kaga. Meet us at the wartower when you\'re done.', '', 156431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, I\'ll go secure the wartower. We\'ll need it to call in the rest of the troops.', 'Thank you, I\'ll go secure the wartower. We\'ll need it to call in the rest of the troops.', 156430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sisters...  Will kill you...', 'My sisters...  Will kill you...', 156429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will fall...', 'The Horde will fall...', 156428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You follow a madwoman...', 'You follow a madwoman...', 156427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You monsters...', 'You monsters...', 156426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll... Killl... You...', 'I\'ll... Killl... You...', 156425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will pay...', 'The Horde will pay...', 156424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Teldrassil...', 'For Teldrassil...', 156423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sisters... I tried...', 'Sisters... I tried...', 156422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family died in Teldrassil! I will kill you!', 'My family died in Teldrassil! I will kill you!', 156421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have revenge for Teldrassil!', 'We will have revenge for Teldrassil!', 156420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s make the Kul Tirans think twice before betting against the Horde.', '', 156419, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Teldrassil and the Alliance!', 'For Teldrassil and the Alliance!', 156418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die screaming, Horde scum!', 'Die screaming, Horde scum!', 156417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murderers! You dare show your faces?', 'Murderers! You dare show your faces?', 156416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go dis way!', '', 156415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I do da walkin\'!', '', 156414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We go where I want now!', '', 156413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promoted to legs!', '', 156412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I da driver now!', '', 156411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By holy fire be purged!', '', 156410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.. I must find... the ring...', '', 156409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters! I\'ll send your head to your Warchief!', 'Monsters! I\'ll send your head to your Warchief!', 156408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your head will be a prize for my queen!', '', 156407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will pay for what they did to Teldrassil!', 'The Horde will pay for what they did to Teldrassil!', 156406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show you how bodies burn!', 'I\'ll show you how bodies burn!', 156405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like our work here is done! Be safe out there, $p.', 156404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men will be avenged. I swear it.', 'My men will be avenged. I swear it.', 156403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals. You cannot stop my return.', '', 156402, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 109903, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! Horde. I have need of your abilities.', 156401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_TITANKEEPER_CLEANSINGORB.BLP:20|t A new |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263420|h[Power Matrix]|h|r is available.', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ABILITY_TITANKEEPER_CLEANSINGORB.BLP:20|t A new |cFFFF0404|Hspell:263420|h[Power Matrix]|h|r is available.', 156400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That troll\'s crazier than a bag of ranishu.', '', 156399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rikati rolls his eyes.', '', 156398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, buddy. Will do! Thanks!', '', 156397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time to talk, Rikati! De sandfury be on a rampage! Hide ya honey!', '', 156396, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ring of Tides shall be ours! Queen Azshara demands it!', 'The Ring of Tides shall be ours! Queen Azshara demands it!', 156395, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not stop until the ring is ours!', 'We will not stop until the ring is ours!', 156394, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ye goin\' on about? Counting? Me? I don\'t be doin\' that. You be da one that should be counting.\n\nTell ye what, let\'s be starting over.', '', 156393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Ring of Tides? Do not hide it from us!', 'Where is the Ring of Tides? Do not hide it from us!', 156392, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ring of Tides was lost nearby. The queen must have it back!', 'The Ring of Tides was lost nearby. The queen must have it back!', 156391, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Storm\'s Wake grows. Are you with us?', 'The Storm\'s Wake grows. Are you with us?', 156390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have I reached a million souls yet?', 'Have I reached a million souls yet?', 156389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('None shall stand in the way of our Queen!', 'None shall stand in the way of our Queen!', 156388, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ring of Tides is our birthright!', 'The Ring of Tides is our birthright!', 156387, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can still stop Lord Stormsong.', 'We can still stop Lord Stormsong.', 156386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ring will be ours!', 'The ring will be ours!', 156385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Azshara demands the Ring of Tides!', 'Queen Azshara demands the Ring of Tides!', 156384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Gem_Pearl_04.blp:20|t The Golden Serpent absorbs an Animated Gold, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:265991|h[Luster]|h|r!', 'The Golden Serpent absorbs an Animated Gold, gaining |TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Misc_Gem_Pearl_04.blp:20|t optional text here |cFFFF0000|Hspell:265991|h[Luster]|h|r!', 156383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh oh! That\'s not good! NOT GOOD!', 156382, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use one of those ropes to scurry down to a landing craft... unless you prefer swimming.', '', 156381, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not washing another pair of those filthy humans\' underwear!', '', 156380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m soaked to my socks! Thank you.', 156379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve had enough of this!', 156378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me from a terrible fate.', '', 156377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you were adventuring, I studied the blade.', 'While you were adventuring, I studied the blade.', 156375, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Spymaster Shaw nods in acknowledgment.>', '', 156374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here, Spymaster.', '', 156373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna be workin\' with Spymaster Shaw. Not the most amiable fella, but he gets the job done.', '', 156372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The King\'s brought in some right impressive heroes for this campaign.', '', 156371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swiftwing, go find yerself a nice meal.', '', 156370, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, $Ulad:lass;.', '', 156369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got that one in the knee!', 'Oh...that had to hurt!', 156368, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t quit that easily.', 'Should have run while they had the chance.', 156367, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one down!', 'Not as tough as they thought!', 156366, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, Captain Stone. I so look forward to meeting you.', '', 156365, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Load it into the wagon, then. You are proving more useful than I had anticipated, Miss Voss.', '', 156364, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Intact enough.', 156363, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mostly intact?', '', 156362, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right here, Blightcaller. I have retrieved the body.', 156361, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, $p. Now, where is Lilian?', '', 156360, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to hurry... dey are going after Rezan!', '', 156359, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey... dey made me tell dem how de Drakkari did it.', '', 156358, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Hero, Taelia will get you up to speed.', '', 156357, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sir! The situation report is ready!', 156356, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 110423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve turned their army into kindling! Well done.', 156355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witches are beginning to rebuild their forces. Take control of a demolisher and destroy their army!', 156354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to show the Kul Tirans what it means to make an enemy of the Horde.', 156353, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember - Bridgeport is a large settlement, and well-guarded. Try and stay on the edges of town... for now.', '', 156352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done our part, $p. I\'m proud of what we\'ve accomplished here.\n\nBut now it\'s time for me to look after my people and ensure their safety.\n\nI\'ve no doubt we will meet again. I\'m proud to call you a friend and ally.', '', 156351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless treat their beasts cruelly. It isn\'t difficult to turn them against their masters.', '', 156350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not have to take dis. I was appointed to my position by Zul de Prophet!', '', 156349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now THAT was a battle worth singing about!\n\nIt is an honor to fight alongside you and Vorrik. I hope we can do it again soon.\n\nThere are always more Faithless to kill, after all.', 156348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us end this together.', '', 156347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s teach these sethrak a lesson.', 156346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These supplies will help us continue the fight against the coven. Thank you.', 156345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, the hold isn\'t far from here.', '', 156344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. They\'ll be our target, then.', '', 156343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The town we passed by, Bridgeport, seems to be the largest threat in the area.', 156342, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rexxar! <cough> Many still resist. Th... they don\'t have much time.', 'Rexxar! <cough> Many still resist. Th... they don\'t have much time.', 156341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That beast won\'t be making any more meals out of Horde soldiers. A worthy kill, champion.', '', 156340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re running short on silver, which is crucial in our fight against the witches. Delve into the mines and gather all you can find.', 156339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rakjan appears willing to aid us, and it is easy to see why.\n\nThe Faithless have been cruel to him and his brood. Look at the scars on his body and empty perches on his peak.\n\nHe deserves vengeance as much as any of us do. We will earn it together.', '', 156338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Samuel. Just stay strong.', '', 156337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so cold. Will the voices stop soon?', '', 156336, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 110194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, give my stew a stir or it will burn.', '', 156335, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine bit of work. Now let\'s ensure this party is the council\'s last.', '', 156334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work, richmon. Now we are ready to crash de council\'s party.', '', 156333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, the herbs will soothe your wounds. Can you tell us anything of inside the hold? Are there any other survivors?', '', 156332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\ABILITY_DEATHKNIGHT_SOULREAPER:20|t Soulbound Goliath\'s damage increases with each stack of |cFFFF0404|Hspell:260512|h[Soul Harvest]|h|r!', '', 156331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! This one still breathes!', '', 156330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many brave warriors fell in the battle. Your arrival was most fortunate.', '', 156329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As we were trying to save the crews, the Kul Tirans attacked. Our troops were spread too thin to hold both locations, we had to retreat to the shore.', '', 156328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The attack happened early this morning. The Kul Tiran mages used a strange object to summon those horrors you saw coiled around our ships.', '', 156327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Confirmed. Mission success. Perfection incarnate! I love it when a plan comes together. Over and out.', '', 156326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Execute to follow. See that big red button? Yeah, get clear of the area and DO press the big red button. Execute when ready. Over.', '', 156325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Authentication code is one-niner-niner. Instrument alignment is outside acceptable parameters... Belay that... I can make this work. Sit tight, over.', '', 156324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roger! Yes! Calibration complete. All of you must orient the instruments in very specific locations. Contact me when they\'re in place. Over.', '', 156323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Radio check. This is Alpha 1. Address group, alpha squadron. Do you read me? Over.', '', 156322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious battle! And we lived, $p!', '', 156321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flame never dies...', 156320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashes to ashes...', 156319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are humbled by your great deeds.  Many thanks, $p.', '', 156318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your bones shall make excellent kindling.', 156317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will leave none behind to mourn your ashes.', 156316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our lengthy history has seen few days as great as this!', '', 156315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to create a new soup in your honor!', '', 156314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turtle soup is not half as tasty as $r soup.\n\nJust get the Mud Worm meat, and leave the small turtles alone.\n\nCome visit me someday and we can explore other soup options!', '', 156313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_PRIEST_SHADOWORBS.BLP:20|t The %s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267334|h[Orb of Corruption]|h|r!', 'A projection appears in the distance...', 156312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is easy to lose one\'s way.', 156311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be lettin\' me know if ya be needin\' my help!', '', 156310, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
