('', 'The true battle lies ahead.', 156150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do what I can.', 156149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The way forward will not be easy.', 156148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That hurts more than I expected.', 'That hurts more than I expected.', 156147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I took some of their crystals... so now I will have the last laugh. Ha!', '', 156146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This shell is not for sale!', '', 156145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None of these sethrak could afford me anyways.', '', 156144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless have no respect for age or wisdom.', '', 156143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell this story to everyone in Zuldazar!', '', 156142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot let the world fall to darkness.', 156141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, my luck has turned around!', '', 156140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief demands we decimate the Alliance presence in this region. Make quick work of them!', '', 156139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for dreaming is over.', 156138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Alliance fools have taken a position nearby. Pay them a visit... and demonstrate the futility of their ambitions.', '', 156137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance forces are mulling about near your location. Ensure this day is their last.', '', 156136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What would you ask the daughter of the sea?', 156135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance falters before us! The Dark Lady will be pleased.', '', 156134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressively ruthless! The Alliance has felt the full measure of our wrath.', '', 156133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commence firing!', '', 156132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance... pathetic! They\'ll think twice before interfering with our plans again.', '', 156131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A long road lies before us.', 156130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your breath, $p!', '', 156129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance will endure.', 156128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know what must be done.', 156127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'A single spark can set the world aflame.', 156126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Control your power... or it will control you.', 156125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Lordaeron.', 'For Lordaeron.', 156124, 0, 0, 592, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never forget.', 156123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We all have our ghosts.', 156122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, some excitement!', 'Finally, some excitement!', 156121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful who you trust.', 156120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul thirsts.', 'My soul thirsts.', 156119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to bleed!', 'Time to bleed!', 156118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do so appreciate an efficient kill. Keeps our war effort on schedule.', '', 156117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Typical... yet another foe who faced the might of the Horde... and lost.', '', 156116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady chooses her champions well.', '', 156115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A suitably thorough job... if lacking a certain finesse. You may resume your normal duties.', '', 156114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... the simple pleasures of cutting an opponent down to size. Duty need not get in the way of savoring a victory!', '', 156113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine work. Our operations can move ahead as planned.', '', 156112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will soon lay claim to this area, but a powerful foe stands in our path. Clear the way for our forces.', '', 156111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief\'s plans for this area do not include that... monster. Take it down!', '', 156110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen, smarty-pants... Did you ever stop to think that YOUR timeline is the \"alternate history\" and MINE is the REAL one? Heh... bet I just blew your mind...', 156109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A notable foe is near your location. Bring our researches a corpse to study, won\'t you?', '', 156108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby foe has been making quick work of our milquetoast recruits. I trust a \"champion of the Horde\" will fare better.', '', 156107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fought a war against the Legion... but you didn\'t think to call us? Seriously? The fate of the entire universe was hanging in the balance, but you couldn\'t be bothered to... bah, whatever!', 156106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reports indicate that a powerful foe is near your location. Strike it down... and remember to relish the kill!', '', 156105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief requires you to eliminate a target in this area. Do not disappoint her.', '', 156104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since I came to town, these Orgrimmar orcs seem to stand up straighter.', 156103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some green orc described my eyes as \"enTHRALLing\"... so I shattered his spine.', 156102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was getting hungry...', 'I was getting hungry...', 156101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak quickly. There are battles to be won!', 156100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The heart of the Mag\'har is pure and strong.', 156099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are here to win this war.', 156098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hear your words... but judge you by your deeds.', 156097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot imagine what would have happened had we allowed them to continue those rituals. Thank you for your help.', 156096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak.', 156095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will see Draenor\'s skies once more.', 156094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War is all we know.', 156093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May your enemies grovel before you.', 156092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witches in Corlain appear to be attempting a new type of ritual. Stop them before it goes too far!', 156091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight with honor. Die with glory!', 156090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mag\'har will claim victory.', 156089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die well.', 156088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go with honor.', 156087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm-ka!', 156086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok-tar!', 156085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor birds... May your spirits fly free forever.', '', 156084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The falcons here are under the witches\' curse. I wish there was a way to save them, but they\'re too far gone. These onions should help you deal with them!', '', 156083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine work. When will de Alliance realize de Zandalari cannot be stopped?', 156082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well. De Alliance will come to fear de might of de Zandalari.', 156081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance will soon learn dat de Zandalari cannot be conquered.', 156080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have received word of de Alliance gathering their forces nearby. Stop whatever it is dey are planning.', 156079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance think dey can defy de Zandalari empire. Show dem how wrong dey are.', 156078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright boys, it\'s mutiny time! The Fogsail refuse to sell our freedom!', 156077, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At first I was irritated by all that \"yaaaaaaas queen\" nonsense. But, eh... I\'ll permit ye tae carry on with it!', 156076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance is plotting something nearby. End dem. Make dem fear de Zandalari empire.', 156075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can rest a little easier now that this problem has been handled.', '', 156074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soldiers fighting for the Alliance won\'t forget what you\'ve done today.', '', 156073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done well. I\'ll have to tell you some stories from the Third War. This reminds me of those days.', '', 156072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. These resources will help us in the long run.', '', 156071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is giving our forces problems. Reminds me of the Second War. Can you lend a hand?', '', 156070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need problems in the immediate area to be dealt with. Can you handle it?', '', 156069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well of course I\'ve got a complicated relationship with me da. Hard enough tae get along with any parent, let alone one made outta freakin\' diamond!', 156068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The area near you could be of great use to us. We need it cleared and made safe.', '', 156067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve received word of vital resources located nearby. They will help change the tide if we can acquire them.', '', 156066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go ahead... make a short joke. We\'ll see how well ye get along without yer kneecaps!', 156065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not throw off my groove.', '', 156064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 156063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiro and I are just passing through. Our next stop, the Faithless empire. \n\nMy plan is in place. \n\nThose sethrak will never know what hit \'em.', 156062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So we meet again.', 156061, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor those of the 7th Legion who have fallen. We will make good use of this area.', '', 156060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done well. Leave the rest to my soldiers.', '', 156059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people live inside a volcano. Keep pokin\' me and I\'ll show ye how a Dark Iron erupts!', 156058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent tactics. We\'ll be able to make use of this area soon.', '', 156057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine work. These resources will supply the 7th Legion for a long time to come.', '', 156056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need your aid to secure this area. My forces are unable to take it themselves.', '', 156055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Several of my soldiers have fallen trying to take the nearby area. End the threat there now.', '', 156054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('7th Legion scouts have determined that this location is of extreme importance. Clear it out for our use.', '', 156053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Three Hammers stand as one.', 156052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion requires resources located nearby. Secure them through whatever means necessary.', '', 156051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May yer hammer strike true.', 156050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the Black Anvil watch over ye.', 156049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dark Irons will claim their rightful place in this world.', 156048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, go on. I have work tae do!', 156047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye may take yer leave.', 156046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dismiss ye.', 156045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombard my target!', 'Bombard my target!', 156044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannons! Fire!', 'Cannons! Fire!', 156043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target marked for destruction!', 'Target marked for destruction!', 156042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery! Fire on my target!', 'Artillery! Fire on my target!', 156041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get down tae business, then.', 156040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well? I\'m listenin\'.', 156039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Best mind yer manners in the presence of a queen.', 156038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see the sands haven\'t swallowed you yet.', '', 156037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mountain lends us its strength.', 156036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You address the Queen-Regent of the Dark Iron clan.', 156035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dark Iron clan will have the respect it is due.', 156034, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 108608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance has need of our sorcery, as well as our strength.', 156033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting Dressed', 'Getting Dressed', 156032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearing', 'Clearing', 156031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work. Dese resources will greatly help de Zandalari.', 156030, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive work. Soon all will know never to cross de Zandalari empire.', 156029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another victory for de champion of de Horde. I think I could get used to having you as an ally.', 156028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Zandalari thank you for your efforts.', 156027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathanos does not think we can take dis area. Prove him wrong.', 156026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De area near you must be cleared out for our campaign to continue. Do what you do best.', 156025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must make dis area safe for our allies to use. Show no mercy to any who would stop you.', 156024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are resources in de vicinity dat will be useful to our campaign. Retrieve dem for us.', 156023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dot and Dolly will devour this in no time.', '', 156022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dot and Dolly are fickle beasts. They won\'t work on an empty stomach. Help find them something to eat.', '', 156021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoo!', 'Shoo!', 156020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away!', 'Go away!', 156019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no touch!', 'You no touch!', 156018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come closer an\' me bash head with rock!', 'You come closer an\' me bash head with rock!', 156017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away, or me kill you!', 'Go away, or me kill you!', 156016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go. Gather what is needed to heal dis snakeman. I will fill in Julwaba on what we know.', 156015, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 109864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-BaseMapIcons-Horde-MainHall-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNew construction available!', '|A:Warfronts-BaseMapIcons-Horde-MainHall-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNew construction available!', 156014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have served many warchiefs. Go travel the world a bit. No doubt you will run into a number of them.', '', 156013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you keep prodding me? Is there another war to fight? What am I saying... there is ALWAYS another war to fight.', '', 156012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you knew how much blood has stained my axe, you would not be so quick to pester me!', '', 156011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too old for this nonsense.', '', 156010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve the Horde.', '', 156009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak quickly... and speak the truth.', '', 156008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is not the time for pleasantries.', '', 156007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you ask of me?', '', 156006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-ka!', '', 156005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-tar!', '', 156004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Saurfang. Brother of Broxigar.', '', 156003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will endure.', '', 156002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me no like dis anymore. Me run now!', 'Me no like dis anymore. Me run now!', 156001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In battle, strategy is as important as strength.', '', 156000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hooray! Me free!', 'Hooray! Me free!', 155999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me get out of here!', 'Me get out of here!', 155998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the true might of Kalimdor.', '', 155997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why dis happening?', 'Why dis happening?', 155996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me not gunna die, watch me back!', 'Me not gunna die, watch me back!', 155995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happening!?!', 'What happening!?!', 155994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, crazy humans be everywhere!', 'Be careful, crazy humans be everywhere!', 155993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not grow old... if you can help it.', '', 155992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without honor, we have nothing.', '', 155991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die today, on the field of battle, is to die an orcish death.', '', 155990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you die in battle against a hated enemy.', '', 155989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See if you can guide Loh to the safety of the kelp.', '', 155988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Loh and the Sea.\" A young tortollan must find their way to safety immediately after emerging from the sands.', '', 155987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witches\' forces have been routed, and our workers can return. Thank you for keeping them safe.', 155986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just going to wipe dis off right here...', '', 155985, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witches have sent their minions to lay claim to our logging operations. Rally the woodsmen. Burn the witches out!', 155984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fletcher\'s Hollow is once again free of the coven\'s influence. Thank you.', 155983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fletcher\'s Hollow has been overrun by the coven! Free its citizens and win back the town!', 155982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psshht... over here, $n!', '', 155981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must stand up for what\'s right.', 155980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the time comes, I\'ll be there.', 155979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See it done.', 155978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must help those who cannot help themselves.', 155977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without honor, we are nothing.', 155976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you tell ANYONE that just happened, I\'ll feed you to my gryphon. Got it?!', 155975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll fight to the bitter end.', 155974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<snort> Oh no... Y-you didn\'t hear that.', 155973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am... a highly disciplined... squire with... iron willpower...', 155972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, that tickles! Knock it off!', 155971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Stop that!', 155970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can do this.', 155969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Serve with honor.', 155968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay on course.', 155967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Winds at your back, friends. But my fight is here, alongside the vulpera.', 155966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back with stories!', 155965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Kul Tiras!', 155964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Duty calls.', 155963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, friend.', 155962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s the situation?', 155961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, some action!', 155960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve trained my whole life for this.', 155959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we can unify Kul Tiras.', 155956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve always dreamed of adventure.', 155955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Home is where the valley is.', '', 155953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got your back if you\'ve got mine.', '', 155952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of yourself out there.', '', 155950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in this together.', '', 155947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Update. Reorigination blast approaching maximum power.', 155946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attention. Reorigination blast nearing full capacity.', 155945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attention. Full power imminent.', 155944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Update. Power level near maximum.', 155943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothin\' a hard day\'s work can\'t fix.', '', 155942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart belongs to this valley.', '', 155941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help?', 155939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear that? The depths are whispering something to me. It\'s... it\'s about you! What\'s that? Uh huh. I see. They said, \'Stop clicking on Pike, you monster.\' Amazing!', '', 155938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, they\'re quite useful for a lot of different things!$b$bBesides the obvious use as a sharp implement for puncturing, the quills themselves possess several useful properties. Ground into a fine powder, it makes for a great binding agent. You can boil them and use the oils as a detergent, and in a pinch you can use them as toothpicks!', '', 155937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have to murder you myself along with the rest of your foolish friends!', '', 155936, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tongo... killed by an outsider? I must have overestimated him!', '', 155935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this... no... argghh....', '', 155934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have taken vows to maintain peace in these lands. For you, I\'m willing to make an exception.', '', 155933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pester as you wish. The patience of a tidesage is legendary.', '', 155932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met!', 155931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you use these quills for, anyway?', 'What do you use these quills for, anyway?', 155930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offering', 'Offering', 155929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you, drunk? And you didn\'t even think to share? I\'m hurt.', '', 155928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, sailor. I know I look good, but we\'ve got work to do.', '', 155927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, unless you\'ve been pressed into service with the navy... Or captured by pirates... and THEN captured by the navy...', '', 155926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the open sea. A shanty on your lips. The wind in your chest hair. Now THAT\'s freedom.', '', 155925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look back.', '', 155924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eyes on the horizon.', '', 155923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next round\'s on me.', '', 155922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get paid.', '', 155921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya \'round.', '', 155920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<King Rastakhan\'s breathing is short and labored. The bandages wrapped around his chest are soaked through with blood.>', '', 155919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your back out there.', '', 155918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your powder dry.', '', 155917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s your story?', '', 155916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! I shall begin brewing what we need immediately. I\'m certain the local fishermen will appreciate the much smaller flock, as well.', '', 155915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Jamil Abul\'housin, de king\'s Royal Physician. Dis is not de first time I patched up de king, and loa willing dis won\'t be de last.', '', 155914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require components from the local fish and crabs. Unfortunately, the local seagulls desire them as well. Acquire the supplies I need and get rid of some of those birds!', '', 155913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How goes the mending?', 'How goes the mending?', 155912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... yes! Let this land tremble before the might of the Horde!', '', 155911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been through a lot together, ol\' Rastakhan and I. But dis...\n\n<Jamil gestures down to the king\'s battered form.>\n\nDis is bad.', '', 155910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Jol does not look up from his concoctions.>\n\nTime runs short for the king.', '', 155909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A job\'s a job, mate.', '', 155908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will do. A pity that menace couldn\'t have been turned into a weapon against our enemies.', '', 155907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful enemy near this location has proven... problematic for our forces. I trust you know what must be done.', '', 155906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief will be pleased by your success.', '', 155905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dangerous foe skulks nearby. Eliminate it--before it can disrupt our plans.', '', 155904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy forces in this area are proving disruptive to our plans. The warchief expects the problem to be taken care of. Do not let her down.', '', 155903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could Rhenik let this happen?!', 'How could Rhenik let this happen?!', 155902, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not again!', 'Not again!', 155901, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody\'s gonna pay for that!', 'Somebody\'s gonna pay for that!', 155900, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is the grog always destroyed?!', 'Why is the grog always destroyed?!', 155899, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not the grog!', 'Not the grog!', 155898, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood or gold; everything has a cost.', '', 155897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that\'s not how the story is supposed to go. Why don\'t you try again?', '', 155896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you thirsty? I\'m thirsty.', '', 155895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m all ears.', '', 155894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the word?', '', 155893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy.', '', 155892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself out there.', '', 155891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until next time.', '', 155890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheers!', '', 155889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grog or ale? Or both?', '', 155888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'ll it be?', '', 155887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n!', '', 155886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do ya for?', '', 155885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you guide Loh to all of the island\'s food, and then to his hut, without crossing the path he\'s taken?', '', 155884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The Simple Life.\" One day, Loh decided to live a peaceful life on a remote island.', '', 155883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what we called cadets like you back in the Second War? Barnacles... \'cause you clung to my backside!', '', 155882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Often enough, Loh\'s travels were fraught with dangers. Take this story, for example...', '', 155881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We tortollans love the story of Loh, a young tortollan who traveled the world.', '', 155880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, a war story?', '', 155879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in MY day, we knew when a conversation was over.', '', 155878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cycle of life can be cruel...', 155877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A turtle made it to the water!', 155876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n!', 155875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A tortollan begins its life amidst great danger, like these turtles here on the beach.  Defend them as they make for the safety of the ocean!', 155874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work! Not the intended use of such a machine, but it was effective nonetheless.', 155873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If they\'re not wearing an ID badge. Kill \'Em!', 155872, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which idiot lost several crates of bombs?', 155871, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the men up at Arom\'s Stand have managed to get that mining machine to work. Turn it on its Horde makers!', 155870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
