('', 'Scram.', 155702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got a weapon and I\'m not afraid to use it.', 155701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sick of your face.', 155700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show me a beast, and my Outriggers can take care of it.', 155699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Muffy, you bad cat.  Come here right now!', 155698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, kitty kitty!', 155697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to Atal\'Dazar (Dungeon).', 'I want to go to Atal\'Dazar (Dungeon).', 155696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me know when you\'re ready to play with the big kids.', 155695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got monsters to kill.', 155694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What now?', 155693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mission complete, I take it? Good. I shall report your success to the warchief.', '', 155692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Battle for Azeroth PTR! \n\nI can teleport you directly into raid instances that are currently open for testing. This is just a teleport, not a match-making service, so I hope you have a party ready to tackle the challenges waiting inside. If not, you might want to check out our new Group Finder feature to find some allies.\n\nMake sure you have selected the difficulty you want to test before teleporting, since you may not be able to zone out easily if you need to change the difficulty setting!', 'Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Battle for Azeroth PTR! \n\nI can teleport you directly into raid instances that are currently open for testing. This is just a teleport, not a match-making service, so I hope you have a party ready to tackle the challenges waiting inside. If not, you might want to check out our new Group Finder feature to find some allies.\n\nMake sure you have selected the difficulty you want to test before teleporting, since you may not be able to zone out easily if you need to change the difficulty setting!', 155691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n (Horde) is marked on your map as an |c00FFFF00|Hspell:272296|h[Assassin]|h|r! Slay them for a bounty reward.', '$n (Horde) is marked on your map as an |c00FFFF00|Hspell:272296|h[Assassin]|h|r! Slay them for a bounty reward.', 155690, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n (Alliance) is marked on your map as an |c00FFFF00|Hspell:272295|h[Assassin]|h|r! Slay them for a bounty reward.', '$n (Alliance) is marked on your map as an |c00FFFF00|Hspell:272295|h[Assassin]|h|r! Slay them for a bounty reward.', 155689, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy forces in this area must be contained. I trust you can handle this assignment.', '', 155688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen a monster I couldn\'t take down.', 155687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That took a bit longer than I would have liked... but the results are acceptable. Our campaign continues.', '', 155686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief has laid claim to all resources in this area. Take what is ours.', '', 155685, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are still not allowed to mention my sister.', '', 155684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will put these resources to good use! Well done.', 155683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight like your sister.', 155682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are resources here that would be of benefit to the Order. Take control of the area and secure them for us!', 155681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Mother...', '', 155680, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 107793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kitty, where are you?', 155679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Arthur.', 155678, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, Marshal, be a dear and bring Lucille to my quarters, after you dispose of these pests...', 155677, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen my cat?', 155676, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why Marshal, that\'s no way to talk to a Lady. I should teach you some manners.', 155675, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think you can keep up?', 155674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep away from her, you heartless witch!', '', 155673, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 107792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be appreciative, girl! Not only is your father alive and well, but he will soon be lord of all Kul Tiras! Come join us, child...', 155672, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... What have you done to him?!', 155671, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so glad you could join us my dear. Your father has missed you so.', 155670, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother? Is that... you?', 155669, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s far enough.', 155668, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard it has something to do with all those crates we\'ve been getting from the Ashvane.', 'I heard it has something to do with all those crates we\'ve been getting from the Ashvane.', 155667, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Stone\'s really worked up about something.', 'Captain Stone\'s really worked up about something.', 155666, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure am glad we got assigned out here today.', 'Sure am glad we got assigned out here today.', 155665, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? This is a BOMB? I thought it was an avocado.', '', 155664, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful there, John. That gunpowder\'ll blow your hand clean off.', 155663, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get de planks up! We are shipping out! Nice job out dere.', '', 155662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like dey are after de Azerite, too. Let\'s go ahead and sneak out before dey notice us. We have to report back about dis.', '', 155661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s all of it. Looks like we cleared out dis island, and not a moment too soon. Dere is a Kul Tiran ship on de horizon.', '', 155660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems dey have been collecting de Azerite, too. Dat\'s good for us... it\'s all in one spot, ha! Go ahead and take it from dem.', '', 155659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen! Ha! You never know who\'s going to show up in dese places.', '', 155658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spotted a huge bunch of Azerite just around de corner from you. You will have to take a look at dat now.', '', 155657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s de way. We will have our hull full in no time.', '', 155656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s a big monster, and it\'s coated with Azerite residue. Slay dat thing, and we\'ll get de Azerite from it.', '', 155655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like dere\'s another source of Azerite near you. Probably want to check dat out next.', '', 155654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere you go, dat\'s a nice haul. Good job.', '', 155653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yeah, dat\'s a big chunk. Go ahead and mine it. We will get de Azerite back on de ship in no time.', '', 155652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De machine is showing some Azerite close by. Get yourself out dere and take a look around.', '', 155651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower de gangplanks. Dis is de place.', '', 155650, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 108535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not know what else is here, though. You have to watch your backs out dere.', '', 155649, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 108534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost dere. Dis is de island dat our scouts say holds a lot of Azerite.', '', 155648, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 108533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, Captain.', 'Of course, Captain.', 155647, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, load them onto the ship! Those explosives are a safety hazard.', 155646, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-yes, Captain Stone.', 'Y-yes, Captain Stone.', 155645, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are those gunpowder shipments in from the Ashvane Foundry?', 155644, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, what sorcery is this? Our ships are destroyed and our troops have been pushed to the sea!', '', 155643, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, someone in Freehold could make a killing selling earplugs.', '', 155642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do... do you hear that? Wait! Not again! Kill it, quickly!', '', 155641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice! Maybe Freehold will be a safer place now. Ah, who am I kidding?', '', 155640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Take that, ya parrot!', '', 155639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great! There\'s one less debt I have to worry about.', '', 155638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What smells like grog and wears a red hat? A pirate. Not a friendly one, either.', '', 155637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of my friends saw a wanted man nearby. Let\'s claim the bounty for ourselves!', '', 155636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a particularly nasty outlaw in the area. You should probably take them out.', '', 155635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s our friends at the Venture Company, here to help relieve us of our Azerite. Such nice guys. You\'d like them, go make friends.', '', 155634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Venture Company\'s starting operations in several locations around the island. You should go put them out of business.', '', 155633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Venture Company just showed up, looking to cash in on this Azerite source like only goblins can.', '', 155632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve spotted Venture Company goons around the island. Looks like a hostile takeover is underway.', '', 155631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Longboats, vrykul make, and there\'s a lot of them. Looks like a clan has taken to the seas after the Azerite.', '', 155630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul longboats just dropped off a large group, they must be after our stash. Let\'s not let them take it, ok?', '', 155629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul flotilla just arrived. A whole lot of really mean looking warriors are making camp around the island, from what I can see from behind this barrel.', '', 155628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul ships are on the way. Looks like a raiding party. They\'re always raiding stuff. It\'s their thing.', '', 155627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some unfriendly island trolls have decided to crash this party. They\'re making camp around the island.', '', 155626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Island troll canoes on the horizon, they\'ll be here any minute. This Azerite is like a beacon for everything I hate.', '', 155625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few of the island trolls have showed up, probably also after the Azerite plunder. If you could keep them away from the ship, we\'d really appreciate it.', '', 155624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey look, a whole bunch of troll ships just arrived. Because what we needed was more trolls. A whole raid of trolls, why not? Great idea.', '', 155623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a HUGE dragon just flew in out of nowhere, because that\'s what I need today. It\'s been a real week for me, you know? Anyway, yeah, dragon.', '', 155622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, friends? A big dragon just decided to join the fun, and it looks interested in your Azerite. Just thought I\'d let you know.', '', 155621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragons, we\'ve got dragons, and they\'re looking directly at the ship. I think they see me. Can you, um, help?', '', 155620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got, like, a whole flight of dragons that just landed, and I bet I know what they\'re after. Good luck!', '', 155619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Now what is going on with the sky? Why\'s it so dark? And WHY are there dead corpses all over the island now? Oh boy.', '', 155618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that is THE most unpleasant thing I\'ve ever smelled. Who did that? Oh, it\'s the dead. Hey everyone, the dead are here and they\'re after the Azerite! Okay?', '', 155617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to make things even better, it looks like the undead are now spreading across the island. I don\'t even want to know.', '', 155616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The undead? Here? I have no idea what is going on now, but I bet it\'s something bad.', '', 155615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up, we\'ve got some tol\'vir ships on the horizon, and they do not look like they want to engage in peaceful trade. So let\'s hurry up out there, please?', '', 155614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, the tol\'vir, eh? Haven\'t seen one of these ships in a long, long time. Well, they\'re here now, and they hate us.', '', 155613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tol\'vir ships just made landfall. How does everyone know where the Azerite is? I hate this stuff. Can you go deal with them?', '', 155612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that, centaur? Mantaur? Hey, some uh, tol\'vir I think they are, just showed up.', '', 155611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirate ship on the horizon. Probably looking to plunder this place, too. Pirates are always doing that.', '', 155610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got a pirate crew making landfall. Because where there\'s treasure on an island, you\'ve got to have pirates, of course.', '', 155609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now a THIRD ship has shown up, of course, because I get all of the fun missions. It\'s pirates, by the way, if you were wondering.', '', 155608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah! Cannon fire just missed us. We\'ve got pirates, and a lot of them, coming ashore right now.', '', 155607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurok just showed up. Probably sniffed out the Azerite. Wait, do they have noses? I\'m not going to ask them.', '', 155606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, an entire saurok warband just swam right up out of the ocean. So that just happened.', '', 155605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that in the waves? Oh, wow, ok, a whole lot of saurok just surfaced from the depths. This is all on you.', '', 155604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some angry looking lizards are eyeing our ship and it\'s Azerite. Maybe don\'t let them take it? Maybe?', '', 155603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some new arrivals, never seen these guys before. Going to guess they\'re not here to help us.', '', 155602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just spotted some strange new arrivals. Looks like they\'re collecting the Azerite like us, but there\'s something... not quite right about them.', '', 155601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Where did those guys come from? It\'s like they appeared out of thin air. Hey, heroes? We\'ve got company.', '', 155600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who in the world are these guys? I can\'t make out their faces. Might be friendly? Probably not.', '', 155599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now it looks like we\'ve got the attention of nothing less than an Old God and his minions. Can you, uh, deal with this whole situation?', '', 155598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got some tentacle-faced monstrosities on the island now and yup, that\'s it, im out, I\'m going below, goodbye.', '', 155597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is anyone else hearing whispers? Either I\'m going crazy, or there\'s some faceless on the island. Oh, and they\'re after the Azerite.', '', 155596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a storm of shadowy darkness. Super. Has to be Old Gods. Watch out for tentacles.', '', 155595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we\'ve got mogu, a lot of them, after the Azerite. Probably want to get over here.', '', 155594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saw some mogu around the island just now. Keep an eye out... we\'re, uh, not friends.', '', 155593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some, uh, mogu just landed on the island. Not sure what they\'re doing. Gonna let you look into it.', '', 155592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu serpents are dropping off a raiding party. Tipped off by the Azerite, once again. Every time.', '', 155591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, now the naga have arrived. This is just what we needed. Don\'t get killed out there, ok?', '', 155590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spotted some naga in the eyeglass, they\'ll be here pretty soon. Give them a nice welcome for us, will ya?', '', 155589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some naga just made their way to the island, looking for Azerite. No doubt on a mission for our friend Azshara. What is her deal, anyway?', '', 155588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got naga slithering out of the depths, looking like they\'re going to raid our stash. I\'m going to go ahead and load the cannons now.', '', 155587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fog\'s rolling in. No, wait, I see rotting ships, ok it\'s the kvaldir. Great.', '', 155586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, so, we\'ve spotted some kvaldir ships, and they\'ll be here any minute. Must be for the Azerite. Why did I take this job, again?', '', 155585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are getting awfully misty over here. That\'s got to be kvaldir. Keep a look out... if you can, you know, manage to see anything.', '', 155584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, what smells like seaweed? Oh, hey, we\'ve got some kvaldir over here, guys.', '', 155583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re about to be neck-deep in bugs over here... huge mantid swarm incoming. I\'ll be below deck, you kids have fun!', '', 155582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard of these guys, called the mantid I think. You, uh, just deal with them for us, ok? I\'m allergic.', '', 155581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a swarm of bees? No, no those are big. Yup, it\'s the mantid, aaaand they\'re almost here.', '', 155580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to love this. The mantid just showed up. Of course, they\'re after the Azerite, too. Of course.', '', 155579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! What just flew overhead? Did you see that? There\'s a big dragon somewhere on the island. Watch it.', '', 155578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
