('Champion.', '', 155408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For those situations that require a more... subtle approach, Master Mathias Shaw and his SI:7 operatives are at your disposal.', '', 155407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An honor to work with you, $n.', '', 155406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To aid your efforts, you will have the full support of the Alliance\'s finest soldiers--the 7th Legion, under the leadership of High Commander Halford Wyrmbane.', '', 155405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As one of the Alliance\'s greatest heroes, you will play a crucial role in achieving victory in this war. The Horde must not succeed in their goal of aligning with the Zandalari.', '', 155404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the time has come to take the fight to Zandalar. I await your arrival aboard the Wind\'s Redemption in Boralus.', '', 155403, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These woods are cursed! Get out! Run while you still can!', 'These woods are cursed! Get out! Run while you still can!', 155402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen something so insane!', 'I\'ve never seen something so insane!', 155401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They ate my dog! I was going to be eaten next!', 'They ate my dog! I was going to be eaten next!', 155400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the name of my grandpa\'s barnacle covered longboat is going on here?', 'What in the name of my grandpa\'s barnacle covered longboat is going on here?', 155399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was chased by a pack of bunnies. Bunnies!', 'I was chased by a pack of bunnies. Bunnies!', 155398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!', 'Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!', 155397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The animals have gone crazy!', 'The animals have gone crazy!', 155396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks friend!', 'Thanks friend!', 155395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have naga slithering ashore over here. A whole lot of dem are looking to plunder de isle.', '', 155394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have sightings of naga. Must be all dis Azerite you gathered. Keep a look out.', '', 155393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga forces just showed up, ya show them a good time, ha.', '', 155392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga comin\' from tha depths, lookin\' for gems here the same as us. Watch out.', '', 155391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your backs, a big dragon and it\'s flight were just spotted in tha distance, headed our way.', '', 155390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A whole lot of dragons just flew in, and they\'ve started collectin\' the Azerite themselves. Might want to put a stop ta dat.', '', 155389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we have some visitors. A flight of dragons just swooped in, and dey are eyeing our ship.', '', 155388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is flying in... dragons, it looks like. Must be after de Azerite. Be careful.', '', 155387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Black dragons... here? Must be after de Azerite, too. Watch yourselves.', '', 155386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragons... never thought I\'d see a full-grown one. They\'re looking for Azerite, our Azerite.', '', 155385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, we have dragons landing over here. Looks like de Azerite has drawn de attention.', '', 155384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sky\'s darkening... it\'s a black dragon! Brought his kin with him ta plunder tha island. Help!', '', 155383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of Venture Company equipment and crew just arrived. They be lookin\' for da Azerite.', '', 155382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Venture Company is looking to set up an operation on dis island. You may want to stop dem.', '', 155381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya we got investors from da Venture Company here ta take our stash. Gonna need you to go have a nice business discussion with dem.', '', 155380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friends, de Venture Company is here. Looks like dey are setting up camp right now.', '', 155379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, look, over there, bunch of island troll ships. Dey after the Azerite, too. Don\'t let \'em get it, ha!', '', 155378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some island trolls just arrived. Looking to loot de island, I bet. Keep your heads on.', '', 155377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Island troll canoes on da horizon. Never did like dem. Kill a few of dem for me, will ya?', '', 155376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have island trolls coming ashore, and dey don\'t look friendly.', '', 155375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be takin\' some cannon fire over here. Pirate ship dropping anchor, lookin\' ta loot the island.', '', 155374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, we got pirates here now, too. Dey just comin\' ashore, ya better go welcome them.', '', 155373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere is a pirate crew making landfall, looking for de same loot we are. Be careful.', '', 155372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like you...', 'You... really should leave...', 155371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107360, 107361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another ship is on de horizon. Looks like pirates. You better make quick work of dem before dey steal all our plunder.', '', 155370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know dat slithering. Dere\'s a saurok raid comin for us. Watch ya selves.', '', 155369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere are some strange movements in de waves. Looks like de saurok just showed up... a lot of dem.', '', 155368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got some mean looking lizards eyeing our boat here. Maybe take dem out, fast.', '', 155367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A saurok warband is coming right up out of de water. Dey are looking to get de Azerite, too.', '', 155366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Not the face!', 'You can stop now...', 155365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107358, 107359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna miss my deadline!', 'I\'m not insured for this!', 155364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107356, 107357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear dat? De mantid are here, searching for Azerite too. Don\'t get stung! Ha ha!', '', 155363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big swarm of bugs, incoming. Watch yourselves out dere... dey are here for de same thing we are.', '', 155362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese guys, mantid I think, just showed up. Looks like they\'re gathering Azerite too.', '', 155361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat buzzing sound... it\'s comin\' from da sky. We got a lot of bugs about ta land on dis island I think.', '', 155360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My insurance pays double for this...', 'This is embarrassing!', 155359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107354, 107355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits... take me...', '', 155358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay what smells like seaweed? Over dere, we got Kvaldir longboats hittin\' da shore.', '', 155357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t make out anything in dis mist. Gotta be Kvaldir out there, watch ya backs.', '', 155356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Rotting boats are sailing in, and dey stink of kvaldir. Dey are here for our Azerite.', '', 155355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting foggy out here, and dat is no normal mist. Kvaldir will be here soon.', '', 155354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis not be... what I planned...', '', 155353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always be wantin\' a pirate ship, boss-mon. I named it afta my daughta, Mala!\n\nIf I get an airship, I gonna name it afta my son!', '', 155352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you come up with the name?', 'How did you come up with the name?', 155351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eheheheheheheh...\n\nDat\'s a story for another time, boss-mon.', '', 155350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you get this ship?', 'Where did you get this ship?', 155349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garona sent me lookin\' for a boat. So I got one.', '', 155348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you have a pirate ship?', 'Why do you have a pirate ship?', 155347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some new friends just showed up, ha ha. Vrykul warriors, I think.', '', 155346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, someone else just showed up. Looks like vrykul raiders. Watch out.', '', 155345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul longboats are making landfall. A raiding party. Dey are after our stash.', '', 155344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey, boss-mon. Ready for some mutineerin\'?', '', 155343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some longboats on the horizon, gotta be vrykul here for da gems.', '', 155342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is sending de dead after us. Something not from dis world. Be careful.', '', 155341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spirits are telling me de dead are here, and dat dey want your Azerite.', '', 155340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, dat stench. Gotta be undead here for our stash. Watch it.', '', 155339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis darkness isn\'t natural, something\'s here for da Azerite. Something evil.', '', 155338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some strange new visitors here for ya Azerite. Looks like a cult of some sort.', '', 155337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah, didn\'t even see these guys arrive. Ya got some company, watch it!', '', 155336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, who are dese guys? Looks like dey are gathering de Azerite, too. Probably want to stop dem.', '', 155335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have some new friends. Never seen dem before. Probably here for de Azerite.', '', 155334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some mogu serpents just off the coast, they gonna be here any minute.', '', 155333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu just showed up, lookin\' ta take our hoard. Give them a warm welcome, ha.', '', 155332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of de mogu is coming for our Azerite. Keep your eyes open for raiding parties.', '', 155331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saw some serpents flying in from a bit off. Mogu will be here soon.', '', 155330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A storm of shadow... dere must be some faceless on de way.', '', 155329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, you hearin\' whispers too? Must be an Old God sending his forces at us. Watch out.', '', 155328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some tentacle-faced friends here for ya Azerite, friend. I\'m... gonna go below.', '', 155327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Azerite has gotten de attention of de faceless. A bunch of dem just showed up here.', '', 155326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad bird! No blood.', 'Bad bird! No blood.', 155325, 0, 52073, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoo!', 'Shoo!', 155324, 0, 52073, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glenbrook\'s woods are safe for our hunters once more.', 155323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The animals have fallen under the witches\' sway and are now hunting our hunters! Save them and put down these cursed beasts!', 155322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re like my comic relief sidekick $p.', 155321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sure do look familiar... do any time in Tol Dagor?', 155320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. The wildlife in the foothills will no longer be a threat to the surrounding communities.', 155319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wildlife in these hills has been enthralled by the witches\' curse! Put an end to this, before they reach the town.', 155318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s becoming difficult to breathe!', 'It\'s becoming difficult to breathe!', 155317, 0, 0, 0, 81, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take some time for them to recover from this attack. For the Dark Lady!', '', 155312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warchief\'s forces have established a foothold within the military academy. Assist them!', '', 155311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trained alongside some of those men! The Horde will pay for the damage it\'s done!', 155310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A contingent of Horde elites have found their way into Proudmoore Academy. The marines could use our help defending it!', 155309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fallhaven is safe once more, but we must remain vigilant.', 155308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fallhaven is once again besieged by the witches\' curse. Break it before the town is lost!', 155307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah... the power of the rocks... shall belong to... Stormsong!', 155306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This rock is a gift from below. You shall not have it!', 155305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When it wilted, I knew I was on my own, so I immediately got a job here on de docks. Dat flower kept me from becoming a vagrant, like so many others.', 'When it wilted, I knew I was on my own, so I immediately got a job here on de docks. Dat flower kept me from becoming a vagrant, like so many others.', 155304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whether it\'s quilboar or Horde invaders, the people of this valley stand tall.', '', 155303, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No take... trogg rocks...', '', 155302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rocks...', '', 155301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash... you...', '', 155300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trogg... broken...', '', 155299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
