('Crush! Break! KILL!', '', 155280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trogg smash!', '', 155279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trogg no stupid!', '', 155278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy! Did ya see what de Princess did to de Alliance? Off to ya left, you will notice some of de wreckage. Dat was some serious loa power!', '', 155277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De naga were gone for some time. Dere was talk of rebuilding, but with Gral either missing or too weak to help, it remained just talk.', '', 155276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every last one of his followers were slain. Gral was furious! Anyone near de water dat night could feel his pain... as each one fell.', '', 155275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho! It was as if a weight had lifted! We knew that snaky haired witch was dead!', '', 155274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a stupendous day.', '', 155273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful. This land is no longer safe.', '', 155272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
