('Brennadam is my home, and I will protect it.', '', 155268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107381, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am a woman of my word. You and your Horde are welcome in my port.', 155267, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya, captain-mon. We be commitin\' to ya cause. And we hopin\' you be commitin\' to ours too.', '', 155266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
