('Work be poop, no more! Me gonna train, me gonna be somebody!', 'Work be poop, no more! Me gonna train, me gonna be somebody!', 154961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
