('All you\'ll get outta this gryphon is a missing hand, chum.', 'All you\'ll get outta this gryphon is a missing hand, chum.', 154959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows lenghten. Chosen gather. Our time draws near.', '', 154956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will give your flesh purpose.', '', 154955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My power... my curse... it cannot be...', 154954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If... you return.', '', 154953, 0, 0, 0, 70, 2584, 106270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I return, we will speak of honor... and how it may yet be reclaimed.', '', 154952, 0, 0, 0, 70, 5040, 109196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take him to the Stockades.', '', 154951, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your species exists to feed my growth.', '', 154950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this moment, it is.', '', 154949, 0, 0, 0, 70, 2235, 109194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is not for an Alliance king to decide!', '', 154948, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4235, 106269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me. There is no honor in this.', '', 154947, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4801, 109193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father once said that Varok Saurfang embodied the honor of the Horde...', '', 154946, 0, 0, 0, 70, 5822, 109192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I demand an honorable death!', '', 154945, 0, 0, 0, 70, 6269, 106268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance... hold!', '', 154944, 0, 0, 0, 70, 1148, 109191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How tenacious! Feel honor in your accomplishment of living long enough to face my pride.', 154940, 0, 0, 1, 70, 8960, 0, 107011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All forces, focus fire on that monstrosity! The naga will not breach the wall this day!', '', 154939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Mythic Difficulty.>', '<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Mythic Difficulty.>', 154937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Heroic Difficulty.>', '<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Heroic Difficulty.>', 154936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue for an Island Expedition on Mythic Difficulty.>', '<Queue for an Island Expedition on Mythic Difficulty.>', 154935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue for an Island Expedition on Heroic Difficulty.>', '<Queue for an Island Expedition on Heroic Difficulty.>', 154934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, packstrider, and build a statue to me upon the steps of Dazar\'alor. Let others know the strength of the pack, and you shall have my boon.', '', 154933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With these three scrolls, I can make it easier for you to travel here.', 154932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 110875, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Skyreach_Four_Wind.BLP:20|t %s faces |cFFFF0000$n|r and readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:268403|h[Gale Slash]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Karoz_Leap.blp:20|t %s  is preparing to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:268932|h[Quaking Leap]|h|r towards |cFFFF0000$n|r!', 154931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least I die... with both feet... on the ground...', '', 154930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent throw, outsider! You are worthy of my full attention.', '', 154929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_BG_Xkills_AVgraveyard.blp:20|t%s has been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267702|h[Entomb]|h|red! Look for their signs of struggle to find them!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_BG_Xkills_AVgraveyard.blp:20|t%s has been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267702|h[Entomb]|h|red! Look for their signs of struggle to find them!', 154928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Relics_TotemofRage.blp:20|t You have been trapped in a tomb! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267764|h[Struggle]|h|r to let your friends know where you are!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Relics_TotemofRage.blp:20|t You have been trapped in a tomb! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267764|h[Struggle]|h|r to let your friends know where you are!', 154927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hurry back to the Sanctuary of the Devoted and stop General Jakra\'zet from releasing Mythrax!', '', 154926, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool! Mythrax cannot be controlled!', '', 154925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will raise Mythrax, and we will conquer all of Azeroth!', '', 154924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_BG_Xkills_AVgraveyard.blp:20|t %s is preparing to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267702|h[Entomb]|h|r |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_BG_Xkills_AVgraveyard.blp:20|t %s is preparing to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267702|h[Entomb]|h|r |cFFFF0000$n|r!', 154923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Karoz_Leap.blp:20|t %s is preparing to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:268932|h[Quaking Leap]|h|r towards |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Karoz_Leap.blp:20|t %s  is preparing to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:268932|h[Quaking Leap]|h|r towards |cFFFF0000$n|r!', 154922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raagh! Come forward and answer for your crimes, Korthek!', '', 154921, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 107532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here to observe. We Zandalari are very interested in these forsaken.', 154920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I assure you, Blightcaller, the pleasure is all mine.', 154919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll try to figure out why the road is closed. See if you can convince the soldiers to clear out!', 154918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pack up, ya worthless swabs. We have bigger fish to fry.', '', 154917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sod off, louse.', 'Sod off, louse.', 154916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111118, 111122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of my face.', 'Out of my face.', 154915, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 111117, 111121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I went easy on you.', 'I went easy on you.', 154914, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 111116, 111120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of you, anyway.', 'I\'ve had enough of you, anyway.', 154913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111115, 111119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re focusing too much on the details! It\'ll be fine!', 154912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything has a price - and these creepy crawlies are going to earn me a fortune! Once I ship them back to Kalimdor.', 154911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They require blood to survive, how will you feed them?', 154910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you collecting pests in a box?', 154909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open this pass at once.', 'Open this pass at once.', 154908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell that age has only sharpened your ferocity and wisdom, Rakjan. We will punish these Faithless for how they have treated you and your kin.', '', 154907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only way you\'re getting in here is through me, pal.', 'Only way you\'re getting in here is through me, pal.', 154906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ears broken, $Glad:lass;? Valley\'s closed.', 'Your ears broken, $Glad:lass;? Valley\'s closed.', 154905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gas mask and blight canister, please. I want to see what this thing can do.', 'Gas mask and blight canister, please. I want to see what this thing can do.', 154904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a gas mask for me, please.', 'Just a gas mask for me, please.', 154903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back of the line if you don\'t want trouble, bilge rat.', 'Back of the line if you don\'t want trouble, bilge rat.', 154902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No papers, no entry. Them\'s the rules.', 'No papers, no entry. Them\'s the rules.', 154901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between Ai\'twen\'s strong back, my brilliant strategy, and your dauntless determination, we\'re undefeatable.', '', 154899, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will travel to the top of the mountain and ensure that Rakjan has not forgotten me after all these years.', '', 154898, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll rest as soon as we stop gettin more wounded.', 154897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m fine. These sailors need me skills.', 154896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this rate, yer gonna to need a healer yerself. Ye canna help from a stretcher.', '', 154895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye look tired Feorea, ye should rest.', '', 154894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take my staff, and charge it by draining power from the Faithless\' suppression spires.', '', 154893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ai\'twen and I will meet you at the Venture Company\'s minefield.', '', 154892, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mom! Meerah and $p saved us!', 'Mom! Meerah and $p saved us!', 154891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you Meerah wouldn\'t forget about us! She\'s the best!', 'I told you Meerah wouldn\'t forget about us! She\'s the best!', 154890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiro! I\'m so happy you\'re back! Was it scary out there? How\'d you get one of their krolusks? Did you name it? Can I name it? Is it nice?', 154889, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell you the stories later, Meerah. Let\'s get our people out of here safely first.', '', 154888, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was... surprisingly fun!', '', 154887, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hop on the krolusk and let\'s get out of here before the Faithless send reinforcements!', '', 154886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s going on down there? Galeheart, take us in!', 154885, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 111162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll start our search in Brennadam. If nothing else, hopefully we can find this Brother Pike there.', 154884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Stormsong rules the house, and basically the entire valley. It sounds like he\'s the key to all of this, but he hasn\'t been to Boralus in months.', 154883, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll need to bring House Stormsong back into the fold first. They control the tidesages, and the tidesages the fleet.', 154882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tremble under the shadow of the vulpera banner, Faithless scum!', 154881, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 107763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need a gas mask to survive the blight. If you choose, you may also take a blight canister and help out.', 'You will need a gas mask to survive the blight. If you choose, you may also take a blight canister and help out.', 154880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid Kul Tiras won\'t be much help to the Alliance until the fleet is home again.', 154879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And our people shackled in chains down there should know we haven\'t abandoned them.', 154878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. They should know who\'s gonna kill them.', 154877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is risky, Nisha. The Faithless will know we\'re up here.', '', 154876, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. That lich has been attacking our scouts with its forces. Now we should be able to focus on the Horde.', '', 154875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drustvar has witches, and apparently Nazmir has liches. Take out this fiend\'s army and whatever is empowering it.', '', 154874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nisha will be so happy to see you! She\'s out at the crater killing sethrak... Like she always is.', 154873, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 105979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive, though I\'ve been informed that the gnomes refuse to work with any technology of goblin origin. At least we know what it\'s capable of.', '', 154872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have commandeered an experimental device from the goblins. Test it out on the nearby blood troll army to give us an idea of its power.', '', 154871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a hunch that the naga have more planned than this. Keep your eyes out for them.', '', 154870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga! They\'ve terrorized this world long enough. Put a stop to whatever they\'re doing.', '', 154869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not since the Third War have I seen such ferocity in battle against the Horde. Well done.', '', 154866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought well against the Horde. The people of Kul Tiras will know of your bravery.', '', 154864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. Let us hope this whole conflict ends better than the Second War.', '', 154863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kids are being held in the crater below. Please be careful!', 154861, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Noting gonna stop da Horde!', '', 154859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Several scouts have been slain trying to fight the Horde in this area. It\'s up to you to stop whatever they\'re doing.', '', 154858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! I tink I could be learnin\' a few tings from you, mon.', '', 154857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another foe be dead, and soon another gonna take its place. But for now, ya earned some rest.', '', 154856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll call Galeheart over. There\'s a perch on the eastern dock where she can meet us.', 154855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, victory! It taste sweet, mon!', '', 154854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in the Third War, I grew familiar with the Horde\'s tactics. They seem to be using a dangerous one here. Take them down.', '', 154853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Didn\'t know who it be facing, did it?', '', 154852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s nearby operations remind of me actions they took in the Second War. We need to stop them before they succeed.', '', 154851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now dat be impressive, mon!', '', 154850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strong soul be near. Hurry, strike it down!', '', 154848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An enemy be hidin\' nearby. Let\'s kill it!', '', 154846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the 7th Legion, I thank you for your efforts against the Horde.', '', 154845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s defeat here will allow the 7th Legion to advance. Well done!', '', 154843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Anduin will hear of your heroics against the Horde.', '', 154842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts have reported the Horde is on the move near your location. They\'re vulnerable to an ambush. Take them down!', '', 154838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve received word of a large contingent of Horde nearby. This is our chance to strike!', '', 154836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A target be near, strike quickly!', '', 154833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion has discovered Horde forces mobilizing nearby. Your orders are to disrupt them and their plans!', '', 154832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another threat be lurkin\' nearby. You know what ta do.', '', 154831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits tell me of a strong foe in da area. We should be slayin\' it... before it become a problem.', '', 154830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful threat be lurkin\' nearby. Eliminate it!', '', 154829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Good work! Have you ever considered permanently joining the 7th Legion? We could use someone like you!', '', 154828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. For King Anduin! For the Alliance!', '', 154827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done the 7th Legion and the Alliance a great service today.', '', 154826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, and the thanks of every soldier in the 7th Legion.', '', 154825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ensure that King Anduin knows of your bravery.', '', 154824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have word from our scouts that a powerful enemy lurks near your position. Take it down.', '', 154823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion has received orders to take out a target near your location.', '', 154822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They had better be more careful. We won\'t be around every time they get into trouble. Thank you, champion.', '', 154821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A survey crew has been trapped by the undead! Help them, before it is too late!', '', 154820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll take it from here. Time tae put an end to G\'huun.', '', 154819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eugh, so he\'s a reanimated corpse? Let\'s put \'im back in the ground.', '', 154818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recognize the ugly on that troll. What is Zul up to?', '', 154817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 154816, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 154815, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
