('', 'De rest is up to us. We will put an end to G\'huun\'s disease.', 154650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning, significant threat of contamination beyond this point. Quarantine protocols prevent me from proceeding.', 154649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfection, $p! We have more than enough mines to strike against the Venture Company.', '', 154648, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It does not matter how he returned. My knife will send him back to de abyss.', 154647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see many mines to choose from.', '', 154646, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Analysis indicates high levels of corruption. Hypothesis: G\'huun reanimated this specimen and enhanced it. Further testing required.', 154645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul?! How is he alive? I saw him die by my father\'s hand!', 154644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mines weren\'t built to detect turtles! We can gather them safely.', '', 154643, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem to have missed one.', 154642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tests focused on the ability of G\'huun\'s corruption to reanimate expired tissue. Results were inconclusive and specimens were destroyed.', 154641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Observation accurate. This facility has run numerous experiments on loa to research solutions for Old God corruption.', 154640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is dis creature?! It appears as if it were once a loa.', 154639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If dat thing was one of G\'huun\'s minions, den we must stop him before an army of dem reaches de surface.', 154638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Error. Disc malfunction. Corrupted data stream deployed.', 154637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boot sequence initiated.', 154636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please report to the medical bay for neural extraction and cerebral tissue collection.', 154635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Analysis of your cerebral cortices indicates all present individuals have previously interacted with Old God specimens.', 154634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any available data from your prior experiences can aid in this facility\'s research.', 154633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Analysis of your cerebral cortices indicates previous interactions with Old God specimens for certain individuals.', 154632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And 950 billion norgabytes of musical playlists and self-portrait images.', 154631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seventy-five norgabytes of every existing chemical compound.', 154630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These discs currently contain 50 norgabytes of biological data on known lifeforms throughout the cosmos.', 154629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now entering the data vault. This is a comprehensive collection of titan knowledge.', 154628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight against the inevitable. My plague cannot be stopped. It already festers within you.', '', 154627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If dat thing had made it past us, it would have infected all life on de surface.', 154626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, welcome. Visitors are becoming rare these days, especially in the archives.\n\nHow may I help you?', 'Ah, welcome. Visitors are becoming rare these days, especially in the archives.\n\nHow may I help you?', 154625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Viral containment breached. Contaminated specimen approaching. Risk of infection imminent.', 154624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This laboratory contains thousands of the most dangerous viral strains in the known cosmos, alphabetically sorted for ease of access.', 154623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now entering the viral ecology wing.', 154622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to keep Power Word: Shield active at all times to benefit from Atonement.', 154621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to keep Power Word: Shield active at all times to benefit from Atonement.', '', 154620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Power Word: Shield on yourself, and then deal damage to the target dummy to heal your wounds.', 154619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Power Word: Shield on yourself, and then deal damage to the target dummy to heal your wounds.', '', 154618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you deal damage to an enemy, everyone who has your Atonement on them will be healed.', 154617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you deal damage to an enemy, everyone who has your Atonement on them will be healed.', '', 154616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some spells, such as Power Word: Shield, apply Atonement to your target.', 154615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me anything about the missing fleet?', 'Can you tell me anything about the missing fleet?', 154614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some spells, such as Power Word: Shield, apply Atonement to your target.', '', 154613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warchief will need convincing. For this, I need your help. Come.', '', 154612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps it is time we collect on an old debt. In so doing, we could add loyal soldiers to the Horde\'s ranks.', '', 154611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I believe you love the Horde as I do. But unless we act, I fear it will not survive this war.', '', 154610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a plan. Activate de consoles and put an end to G\'huun\'s plague once and for all.', 154609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Activating all consoles will grant access to G\'huun\'s vault, where the specimen may be purged by activating the reorigination drive.', 154608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In order to destroy the specimen, you must reactivate the vault consoles located throughout this wing.', 154607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not have dat kind of time! G\'huun must be stopped now!', 154606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Negative. Data inconclusive. Alternative research trials are being developed and are scheduled to be deployed in 2,364 cycles.', 154605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! That stuff packs a punch!', '', 154604, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And have you found de answer?', 154603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now for a little spark... You may wanna take a step back.', '', 154602, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we can blow the lock? Sprinkle some of that powder on it.', '', 154601, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Collection of data is imperative to combating the Old Gods. G\'huun\'s unique biology potentially holds the answer to eliminating their threat.', 154600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been keeping dat abomination alive?! Why?', 154599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Designation, Uldir. This research facility was designed to contain and study the entity known as G\'huun.', 154598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is dis place?', 154597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Facility systems compromised. Proceed with caution.', 154596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De doors are locked! Shut down dat machine... before we are reduced to ash!', 154595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106863, 1, 603, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Contaminated life forms detected. Incinerators engaged.', 154594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She must be de reason de corruption has not completely overtaken dis facility.', 154593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106862, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the Matron Of Tenacity, Herald of Endless Research.  Designation: M.O.T.H.E.R.', 154592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!', 154591, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 104747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was dat voice?', 154590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106861, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!', 154589, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 104746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-tar ogar! For the Horde!', '', 154588, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 104745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Virulent specimen removed. Opening decontamination chamber.', 154587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I accept your loyalty, overlord. Your people are welcome within the gates of Orgrimmar.', 154586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Draenor has fallen, but we will make a new home on Azeroth. Your enemies are now our enemies!', 154585, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 104744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sprinkling Powder', 'Sprinkling Powder', 154584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eitrigg and your champion proved their courage and nobility. If they embody the heart of the Horde, then we will gladly fight beside them.', 154583, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taloc survived de A.M.O.D strike?! We cannot let dis monstrosity stand between us and G\'huun!', 154582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi...', 'So far from home...', 154581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107046, 107047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'re upset Sunshine, but there are actual monsters. We need to leave.', 'I know you\'re upset Sunshine, but there are actual monsters. We need to leave.', 154580, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Honor is everything to us! We do not make this oath lightly, Warchief.', 154578, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 104741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can get another cake, but we should go.', 'We can get another cake, but we should go.', 154577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'re angry but we really need to go now, Sunshine.', 'I know you\'re angry but we really need to go now, sunshine.', 154576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sunshine, we need to go.', 'Sunshine, we need to go.', 154575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eitrigg has told me of your people\'s strength. I trust honor means as much to you as it does to him?', 154574, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ruined my dress! This dress was perfect! It was imported silk from Quel\'Thalas! The veil was my mother\'s! How dare you!', 'You ruined my dress! This dress was perfect! It was imported silk from Quel\'Thalas! The veil was my mothers! How dare you!', 154572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission was successful, Warchief. Overlord Geya\'rah has pledged her soldiers to the Horde.', '', 154570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed the caterer! He hadn\'t even served the appetizers yet!', 'You killed the caterer! He hadn\'t even served the appetizers yet!', 154569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost to de sands.', 'Finally, a good death!', 154568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107044, 107045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to make you pay for ruining my wedding you, you, whatever you are!', 'I am going to make you pay for ruining my wedding you, you, whatever you are!', 154567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know how much it took for me to make this perfect?', 'Do you know how much it took for me to make this perfect?', 154566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you ruin my day!?', 'How dare you ruin my day!?', 154565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De end... at last.', 'It can\'t end... not like dis.', 154564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107042, 107043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t eaten bread in four months!', 'I haven\'t eaten bread in four months!', 154563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('De sands are going to claim us all.', 'Death be de only escape.', 154562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107040, 107041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any idea how much that cake cost!?', 'Do you have any idea how much that cake cost!?', 154561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was on a waiting list for two years for this location!', 'I was on a waiting list for two years for this location! Two! Years!', 154560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death hasn\'t stopped me before...', '', 154559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can kill you with one finger!', '', 154558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A new power matrix can now be collected.', 154557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A power matrix is ready for acquisition.', 154556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attention. A new power matrix is available.', 154555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning. Reorigination blast imminent. Please clear the area.', 154554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Reorgination blast sequence initiated. Please vacate the area.', 154553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has been defeated!', '', 154551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, you will see the folly of your resistance!', 'Soon, you will see the folly of your resistance!', 154550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out, submit to your fate!', 'Come out, submit to your fate!', 154549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He who lurks below shall wear your skin as his cloak!', 'He who lurks below shall wear your skin as his cloak!', 154548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Struggle for your pathetic existence! The endless tide will claim you in the end!', 'Struggle for your pathetic existence! The endless tide will claim you in the end!', 154547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Penance to heal your wounds.', 154546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just what kind of powder is this? Hey, help me grab some of this stuff.', '', 154545, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 111953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Penance to heal your wounds.', '', 154544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Casting Penance on yourself or on an ally will heal damage instead of inflicting it.', 154543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Casting Penance on yourself or on an ally will heal damage instead of inflicting it.', '', 154542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill those monsters!', 'Kill those monsters!', 154541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was supposed to be a nice occasion!', 'This was supposed to be a nice occasion!', 154540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on? What\'s happening? What are these monsters?', 'What\'s going on? What\'s happening? What are these monsters?', 154539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is so much worse than drunk in-laws!', 'This is so much worse than drunk in-laws!', 154538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is this happening?', 'Why is this happening?', 154537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t even get to dance the funky hawkstrider!', 'We didn\'t even get to dance the funky hawkstrider!', 154536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is supposed to be a happy day!', 'This is supposed to be a happy day!', 154535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhhhh!', 'Ahhhhhhhhh!', 154534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By your leave, Warchief. Come, $n.', '', 154533, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 104738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our nightborne allies possess a particular affinity for teleportation. I suggest you draw upon their knowledge to aid you on your journey.', 154532, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have obtained a fragment of the artifact Garrosh used to travel to that world. I believe it can open the way again... but I will need help to do it.', '', 154531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see the value in this plan. But I thought the door to that other Draenor had closed.', 154530, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll go talk to Owings. I like my job, and I want to keep doing it. On my own terms.', '', 154529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this mean... I see.', '', 154528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I don\'t believe that the captain would decide against siding with the Ashvane. He seems fairly set.', '', 154527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What say you, $n? Are you prepared to pursue a new ally?', 154526, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 104716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mag\'har orcs are legendary for their battle prowess. I will have need of such fearless soldiers in the days ahead.', 154525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An army of militant orcs from another world? Trained soldiers... weapons waiting to be fixed upon the Alliance. Interesting...', 154524, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In saving Draenor from Garrosh and the Burning Legion, this champion earned the trust of the orcs there. They owe the Horde a debt. I propose we collect what is owed to us.', '', 154523, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, years ago, the Horde pursued the fugitive Garrosh Hellscream to an echo of the Draenor I once knew.', '', 154522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re saying no to the Ashvane. Here are orders from the captain.', 'We\'re saying no to the Ashvane. Here are orders from the captain.', 154521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mighty fine clothing you\'ve got there, friend. Need something?', '', 154520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink up, me hearties. Ya be lookin\' a bit dry... Ha!', 'Drink up, me hearties. Ya be lookin\' a bit dry... Ha!', 154519, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breaking', 'Breaking', 154518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re no student. You\'d best have a good reason for interrupting my lesson.', 'You\'re no student. You\'d best have a good reason for interrupting my lesson.', 154516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Darrel does not seem to acknowledge your presence.>', '<Darrel does not seem to acknowledge your presence.>', 154515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is rude to interrupt, outsider.', 'It is rude to interrupt, outsider.', 154514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t see anything here on first glance that tells me where my fellow gnomes went. Let me look into the information you\'ve gathered and I\'ll contact you again if I find something interesting.', '', 154513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Stormsong Valley.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Stormsong Valley.', 154512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Warning! Intruder alert! Intruder alert!', '', 154511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 5805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Accept this gift... the traditional armor of our people. Wear it with pride as a reminder of our homeland. Dranosh\'ek mag\'har!', 154510, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 104734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In defending the Horde against its enemies, you have brought honor to the Mag\'har.', 154509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to Orgrimmar that I may recognize your dedication to our people.', 154508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have fought countless battles across the face of Azeroth. You have shown both our allies and enemies what it means to be Mag\'har!', 154507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter where your journey takes you, never forget that the heart of Draenor beats within you. Lok-tar ogar!', 154506, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 104730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With every victory, you will show the people of Azeroth that we are masters of war!', 154505, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the Horde needs our strength against the Alliance. And we have answered their call.', 154504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people remained united under the leadership of Grommash Hellscream. One tribe. The Mag\'har.', 154503, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 104727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Years ago, the heroes of this world journeyed to Draenor and fought beside us against the Burning Legion.', 154502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear Rokhan, de Darkspear tribe has more than earned de aid of de Zandalari. I will join you to help as I can.', 154501, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 112330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gotta borrow da champion for a bit. An old enemy somehow escaped Bwonsamdi and now be threatenin\' my home.', '', 154500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Begin your ritual.', 'I am ready. Begin your ritual.', 154499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, someone around here has to know something. You can\'t just lose a whole fleet!', 154498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead we shall... open our port to the Horde?', '', 154497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall not hand ourselves over to the Ashvane...', '', 154496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I am to believe you, $r? Hand it over.', '', 154495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orders from the captain, sir. He has decided against siding with the Ashvanes!', 'Orders from the captain, sir. He has decided against siding with the Ashvanes!', 154494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you come from? Clearly you are not from around here.', '', 154493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? Let me see that.', 154492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some new orders from the captain for you, boatswain.', 'Got some new orders from the captain for you, boatswain.', 154491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not just to bring the fleet home, but to make Kul Tiras whole again... or \"cure the infection,\" as Cyrus likes to say.', 154490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who are you? And what exactly do you want?', 154489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They also bless every last Kul Tiran ship. That\'s what really sets them apart from the visiting vessels you see in port.', 154488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have never seen so much Azerite in one place. This both concerns and pleases me.', 154487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An elemental... of pure Azerite. Slay it, champion, but do not destroy it. Gather as much of its resin as you can!', 154486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should quell their appetites... for a while, at least.', 154485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orcs make fine soldiers, but each one eats as much as a dozen goblins! Our food stores need replenishment. Mind slaughtering a few beasts while you strike down the kaldorei?', 154484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cut the rose before it can sprout thorns, I always say.', 154483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another kaldorei commander in the wrong place at the wrong time. Dispatch her at once. We can\'t allow her to gather reinforcements.', 154482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were the right arrow for the shot, champion.', 154481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang has crested the mountains between Darkshore and Felwood. Meet him at Shatterspear Vale and ensure that the passage he seeks is secure.', 154480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We done it, crew! Pirate-King Zem\'lan be dead for now, and de treasure be ours!', '', 154479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never doubted you for a moment.', 154478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems the kaldorei have mustered reinforcements. This one may prove to be a challenge. I expect victory.', 154477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight with finesse and fervor. Such effort serves to inspire all my soldiers, champion.', 154476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance scours Darkshore seeking to root out our footholds. We must not lose ground! Defend what is ours!', 154475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In times of war, you must kill or be killed. There is nothing else to say.', 154474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not relent, hero! These savage elves would do you no such favor.', 154473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We struck a significant blow to their reserves, hero. Well done.', 154472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei are deadliest in the dark. Jump into the fray and deal with them before night falls!', 154471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My faith in you was well-placed. The will of the kaldorei will soon crumble.', 154470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our army has Malfurion\'s soldiers on their heels! We must push further into Darkshore while we hold the advantage!', 154469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor thing... she barely got a chance to swing.', 154468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That night elf commander is testing my patience. Break her.', 154467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imagine, to sleep for thousands of years only to awaken to defeat. Pathetic!', 154466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the Ancients decided to come out and play, eh? Let us give them a rude awakening.', 154465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose that could have gone worse. Ensure that its resin is not collected by the Horde.', '', 154464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An elemental born of pure Azerite! I do not know what kind of threat this poses, champion... but please, do take care.', 154463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves will fight us at every step.', 'The night elves will fight us at every step.', 154462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever used an Azerite bomb before? Want to witness true power? Brace yourself for impact, champion. I think you will be pleasantly surprised.', 154461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a splendid specimen! I can think of a variety of alchemical uses for this creature.', '', 154460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s always a bit of a shock for a new cadet. Don\'t worry, it builds character!', '', 154459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei will defy our occupation... unless we break their spirits.\n\nWe must inflict a blow that will show them what is at stake. They need to lose something... someone... in whom they have absolute trust and faith. A symbol of hope.\n\n<The Dark Lady narrows her eyes.>\n\nMalfurion Stormrage must die.', 154458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishermen have reported something large and strange in the water. Acquiring a sample for study would be quite helpful.', '', 154457, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance seeks to use siege weaponry against us? How quaint. Show them what the Horde is capable of.', 154456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the current shortage of iron, even our training munitions can\'t afford to be wasted. Our marines have devised the perfect way of retrieving them.', '', 154455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These ruins are rich with natural resources... ours for the taking! Do not allow the kaldorei to stop us, champion.', 154454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have some wind riders available to us. Gather our explosives and wreak havoc on that wisp wall. We will send a message to Malfurion.', 154453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice shooting, hero! I do feel bad for whoever is fetching those cannonballs, though.', 154452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Venture Company shaman has command of elementals rippling with Azerite! Thievin\', good for nothin\' gobbers dinnae deserve such power. Crush her!', '', 154451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It sounds like there\'s shooting practice going on in the training area. I bet you could show the other cadets a thing or two about firing a cannon.', 154450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The weapons you reclaimed will prove useful to our war effort. Skillfully done.', 154449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One way or another, we need the tidesages\' help... now more than ever.', 154448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work! You probably lightened quite a few betting purses there. Including mine.', '', 154447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now nobody seems to know why the fleet still hasn\'t returned home.', 154446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'People say the tidesages have lost their magic, but I think they\'re just vying for power like Ashvane.', 154445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That cargo belongs to the Horde! Do not allow the Alliance to lay their hands upon it.', 154444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of the Cutwaters hold a pirate dueling tournament here from time to time, and they aren\'t picky about the participants.', '', 154443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even with all their training, those dark rangers seem to have miscalculated their attacks. Perhaps Blightcaller should have words with them...', 154442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our largest ships always carry a tidesage to navigate through storms, withstand heavy seas, and put wind in their sails.', 154441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dark rangers require your help, champion. Lend aid to any that you find!', 154440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your efforts are needed elsewhere, champion. I have a team of goblins ready to scour for the rest.', 154439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all the things... feedin\' the lifeblood of the planet to an ogre thinkin\' it\'ll give \'im a brain?! I mean... it couldn\'t, could it? Best smash him before we find out, eh?', '', 154438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupendous! This is sure to catch the everyday eye!', '', 154437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite powder kegs have been flung from our ships! Gather them quickly, before they sink!', 154436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve run out of the shots you\'ve taken before. If you have some extra time on your hands, I could always use more pictures.', '', 154435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our encampment is secure for now, but remain vigilant.', 154434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Venture Company\'s chief weapons researcher is here! We\'ve been tryin\' a pin him down for ages. Go give \'im a beatin\' for me!', '', 154433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish you could see the fleet. I think even someone as well-traveled as you would be impressed!', 154432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Boralus! The illustrious city of backstreet gangs and bickering nobles. You know, Gnomeregan never had those problems.', '', 154431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve decided to add in a few of the other local sights to my business advertisement. The city is a good place to start.', '', 154430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance saboteurs have infiltrated our foothold! Flush them out! Make them bleed!', 154429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, time to put that ferry pass to good use!', 154428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My chief weapons researcher took a huge payday to work for the Venture Company. Can\'t say I blame him for goin\' after a big pile of gold. Too bad you\'re gonna have to kill him for me, ain\'t it?', '', 154427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beautiful! You know, the best thing about pictures is that you can\'t smell the horses.', '', 154426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Norwington wants his gorgeous estate featured prominently on the next Fizzsprings brochure. I, for one, am happy to oblige.', '', 154425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Venture Company\'s stuffin\' their ogres full of Azerite, sayin\' it\'ll make \'em smarter. Probably won\'t, but uh... maybe you should go handle it anyway. Just in case.', '', 154424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moonwell essence should serve you well in battle. Be sure to do the same to any wells the kaldorei consecrate in the future.', 154423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei use moonwells to replenish their strength in battle. Draw from the wells what you will, then... render them unusable. Am I understood?', 154422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice timing! Any longer, and my reputation as a resort host would probably have been damaged.', '', 154421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out there, Taelia. I don\'t trust those hooded sages one bit.', '', 154420, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word on the street is the Venture Company\'s figured out how to tame elementals made from pure Azerite. We outta put a stop to that. And by we, I mean you.', '', 154419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will order our enchanters to infuse these moonstones with Azerite. Their power now serves the Horde!', 154418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei draw power from pendants made of moonstone. Do whatever you must to deprive them of these trinkets.', 154417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very nice, champion. I will have the Azerite added to our reserves.', 154416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite emerges amongst the ruins of Darkshore. We must not allow the Alliance to gather a single shard of it!', 154415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s exactly the kind of message I want to send to Malfurion. Excellent work.', 154414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These wisps are little more than insects to be crushed. Snuff out each light one by one, and soon the sky will fill with darkness.', 154413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a disaster! The springs went wild and they\'re attacking my guests!', '', 154412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools! G\'huun not gonna fail! Ya power be useless!', 154411, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 105672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our chefs should be able to whip up something good with this. Thank you.', 154410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My druid brethren, well... they eat like bears. It is a dirty job, but our stocks need replenishing. Are you up for the task?', 154409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to earn our pay. Fire at will!', '', 154408, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! Good one.', 'Ha ha! Good one.', 154407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rude.', 'Rude.', 154406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you do dat?', 'Why would you do dat?', 154405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in de name of all de loa do you think you are doing?', 'What in de name of all de loa do you think you are doing?', 154404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knock dat off!', 'Knock dat off!', 154403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of the way! Bringin\' in the big guns!', '', 154402, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere is de eighth piece. Dat makes one whole coin, richmon!', '', 154401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirates have a habit of splitting their coins up in eighths.  Might be lucky if you collect eight pieces for yourself! Should be plenty of loose treasure around Freehold.', '', 154400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glutton for punishment, dat one. Now who wants some calamari? Hah hah.', '', 154399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A giant man o\' war is making Freehold\'s waters its home. No matter how many times it gets stuck with harpoons, it just keeps comin\' back for more!', '', 154398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have slain de Dread Captain Vandegrim and put his soul to rest. Think of all dat treasure you have just uncursed!', '', 154397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Vandegrim was known as a fearsome scallywag all up and down dese coasts. Rumor has it his greed was so powerful dat he is still plundering from beyond de grave.', '', 154396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iggksh ywaq ag\'rr ni ky!', '', 154395, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah\'shel ywaq qam yrr woth\'gl!', '', 154394, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the eighth piece! That makes one whole coin! We\'re rich!', '', 154393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Za ag\'rr wgah thyzz zuq!', '', 154392, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirates have a habit of splitting their coins up in eighths. Could be mighty lucky if you collect eight pieces yourself!  Should be plenty of loose treasure around Freehold.', '', 154391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk about being a glutton for punishment.  Calamari, anyone?', '', 154390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A giant jellyfish has made Freehold\'s waters its home.  No matter how many harpoons it gets stuck with, it just keeps coming back for more!', '', 154389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga ag\'rr ez AN\'zig wgha kyth zuq!', '', 154388, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve slain the Dread Captain Vandegrim and put his soul to rest!  Think of all that treasure that just became un-cursed!', '', 154387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Vandegrim was known as a fearsome scallywag all up and down these coasts. Rumor has it his greed was so powerful that he keeps plundering them even in death.', '', 154386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... Dis was not the future I was promised...', '', 154385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'huun\'s blood flows through my veins! Tremble before my power!', '', 154384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I\'ve seen...', 'Your kindness is unexpected.', 154383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107261, 107262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power will break you!', '', 154382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. I wouldn\'t have lasted much longer.', 'Thank you. I won\'t look back!', 154381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107259, 107260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De power of G\'huun will be your doom!', '', 154380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness your end and despair!', '', 154379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise my chosen! Through blood we shall conquer!', '', 154378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise from my blood to crush de weak!', '', 154377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, brethren! Feed upon de unfaithful!', '', 154376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return your blood to me!', '', 154375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'huun! Accept dis offering of blood!', '', 154374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You never had a future.', '', 154373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak. Just as I predicted.', '', 154372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is as I have foreseen!', '', 154371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, fools! I\'ve already seen your end.', '', 154370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mother died when I was very young, leaving me to be raised by my father. He used to be a sailor, and always left de flower of a sea stalk with me when he went to sea.', 'My mother died when I was very young, leaving me to be raised by my father. He used to be a sailor, and always left de flower of a sea stalk with me when he went to sea.', 154369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Dark projection manifesting.', 154368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Void containment failsafe compromised.', 154367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a noble act, hero.', 154366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alert. Detecting unsafe levels of void energy.', 154365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning. Additional nerubian are being replicated.', 154363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balance has been restored. Anu\'dorini talah!', '', 154362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one walks in shadow, hero. But none can hide from Elune\'s blessed moonlight. Put them down.', '', 154361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warning. Additional silithid are being replicated.', 154360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Cursed things! De only thing sea stalks mean to me are good sailors not coming home and cargo sitting at de bottom of de sea.', 'Bah! Cursed things! De only thing sea stalks mean to me are good sailors not coming home and cargo sitting at de bottom of de sea.', 154359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mythrax has no place in this world.', 154358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune praise you, hero. You shine with the light of a star.', 154357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My archers could use your help, champion. Lend your aid to any you may find!', 154356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This war must end.', 154355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will watch over you.', 154354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Load complete. Disc shutting down.', 154353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You eliminated the threat AND returned my siege weapon in one piece. You get extra credit for that.', 154352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Order must be restored.', 154351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We all have our place. Mine is here.', 154350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am weakened, but I am here.', 154349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever used one of these before? Hold on tight, you\'re in for a surprise.', 154348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disc accessed. Corrupted data loading.', 154347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send as many soldiers as I can muster to this site. Hopefully, they can fend off the assault. We can\'t afford a war on two fronts.', '', 154346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a disturbance in the north. Could it be? Has the Horde begun to attack us from over the mountains? Investigate, quickly!', '', 154345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem a little singed, hero. Things not go as planned?', 154344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even underwater, those Azerite powder kegs are still quite dangerous. I want you to detonate them before they can float to the surface. Try to keep yourself in one piece, would you?', 154343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Data matrix overload. Multiple discs accessed.', 154342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sea stalk, eh? Some of my crew makes sure dat their other half always has one when we ship out. I do not blame dem for wanting to keep their family from agonizing over their fate should something happen.', 'Sea stalk, eh? Some of my crew makes sure dat their other half always has one when we ship out. I do not blame dem for wanting to keep their family from agonizing over their fate should something happen.', 154341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never doubted you for a moment.', 154340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde has arrived in great numbers, and none of them are to be underestimated. This one in particular seems... resilient. Approach with care, hero.', 154339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disc accessed. Yogg-Saron data loading.', 154338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disc accessed. C\'Thun data loading.', 154337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde saboteurs have crept in among our ranks! Flush them out! Make them bleed as we have!', 154335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must say, that was well-struck, hero. Even the Sentinels could learn a thing or two from you.', 154334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to fight fire with fire! We must rid the Horde of their demolishers, and push them back to the Barrens where they belong!', 154333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune smiles upon you, hero. As do I.', 154332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde is trying to steal the essence from our moonwells! Do not allow their filth to desecrate our blessed springs!', 154331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let those Horde fiends keep to their wastelands. We will teach them to stay clear of our forests.', 154330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde has established a foothold beyond the borders of Ashenvale. Rally the druids who watch over the forest!', 154329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, hero. And with such fervor...', 154328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde soldiers are stealing resources from our lands! Stop them--before they deplete our sacred forest.', 154327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Millennia of death did not dull their abilities. You did well to overcome their might.', 154326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those... those are King Dazar\'s first guard! Dey will not yield easily!', 154325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Looks like ye made those un-dead re-dead! Good work.', '', 154324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those undead trolls look tougher than the rest. Watch out!', '', 154323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about sea stalks?', 'What can you tell me about sea stalks?', 154322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These will do just fine, hero. Your contribution today will not be overlooked.', 154321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde already has Azerite weapons. Let\'s see if we can\'t confiscate some of them, shall we?', 154320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Halls of Stone dinnae count.', '', 154319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pfft. Dwarven constructs wouldna gone haywire like that.', '', 154318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work! I\'ll have my alchemists store the Azerite somewhere out of the Horde\'s reach.', 154317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, typical shoddy troll manufacturing. That golem\'s gone haywire. Beat it into submission!', '', 154316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to find Julwaba before Jakra\'zet does.', 154315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul\'s dark magic has corrupted dis guardian. Stop its rampage so dat we may repair it.', 154314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul... what you have done to dis sacred place is unforgivable.', 154313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goodbye, Halu. Rest well.', 154312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, Weaponmaster Halu... he trained my father, and his father before him. His charge is over. Put his troubled spirit to rest.', 154311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Looks like ye showed him who\'s the real master!', '', 154310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A warrior who trained the Zandalari royalty remains hauntin\' this tomb. Put \'im to rest!', '', 154309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'My archers should be able to handle it from here. Your presence made all the difference, champion. You have my thanks.', 154308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemy forces are striking at us from the north. It is time we take the fight to them, champion.', 154307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them through!', '', 154306, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 110188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s almost done! I can hear Akunda\'s voice entering my mind.', 154305, 0, 61398, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do my best to repair Akunda\'s mind, but you need to be prepared to subdue any memories dat might be awakened.', 154304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq ongg an\'qov i lal halahs nuq.', '', 154303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq mh\'naus wgah zaix zyqtahg.', '', 154302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mojambo gonna make... you pay...', '', 154301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where... where am I? What am I doing here?', 154300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou thyzz lal ak\'uq qwaz Zuq shkul ma sk\'tek...', '', 154299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re a little mysterious, but they\'re important to Kul Tiras. They help bring fish to the nets here, and rain to the fields in the valley.', 154298, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most people here look to the sea for guidance the same way others look to the Light, but the tidesages, they\'ve got a much deeper connection with the water.', 154297, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Normally, I\'d offer you a ride on Galeheart, but the tidesages only allow visitors by boat.', 154296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be fine, Cyrus. I can protect myself. Besides, I have the Alliance emissary by my side!', 154295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou yyqzz ez thyzz phquathi zuq!', '', 154294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou gul\'kafh lal lwhuk!', '', 154293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Qam oou iilth ez i awtgsshu amun on\'ma!', '', 154292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Log\'loth w\'oq Ongg!', '', 154291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azerite has surfaced amongst the ruins of Darkshore. We cannot let the Horde get their hands on it!', 154290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W\'oq uhn\'agth ez qam Shandai!', '', 154289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awtgssh shn ongg shg\'ullwaq!', '', 154288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuq ag\'xig bormaz ag\'thyzak!', '', 154287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 154286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Za qualar ag\'xig za al\'tha!', '', 154285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 'I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 154284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!', 'AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!', 154283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the save!', 'Thanks for the save!', 154282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was sausage for sure!', 'I thought I was sausage for sure!', 154281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou vwahuHn ag\'xig shfk zuq!', '', 154280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks friend!', 'Thanks friend!', 154279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ongg za ywaq qvsakf.', '', 154278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vwah oou kaaxth zz ywaq iiyoq Ag\'xlg fhssh I on\'ma.', '', 154277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Za awtgsshu wgah uulg\'ma ywaq zaix.', '', 154276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Qam oou uhnish kyth zuq Ongg za fhssh as\'rr.', '', 154275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq zuq ywag shn\'ma Bo\'al za qwor.', '', 154274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou qam puul zyqtahg ywaq vorzz Qam ma shn\'ma.', '', 154273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou shath\'yar lwhuk shn\'ma yrr shandi agth fhssh.', '', 154272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the spirits are at peace, so is the forest. You have my thanks.', '', 154271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These spirits are mere shells of who they once were. Warm them with your touch, champion. Give them peace.', '', 154270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey don\'t call me de Hexlord for nothing.', '', 154269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take my hexing stick and transform some of dese priests into something more interesting.', '', 154268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you think dat was harsh, you should see what some of de other loa have their followers do.', '', 154267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we can\'t stop this corruption, who will?', 'If we can\'t stop this corruption, who will?', 154266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk\'s druids are too uptight. Play some pranks on their altars to get dem to lighten up. Oh, and dey may try to kill you for dis.', '', 154265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this spreads... Azeroth is doomed.', 'If this spreads... Azeroth is doomed.', 154264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature cries out in pain... how do we stop this madness?', 'Nature cries out in pain... how do we stop this madness?', 154263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our powers are having no effect... how can we heal the planet?', 'Our powers are having no effect... how can we heal the planet?', 154262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was quite a ride! Excellent work, both of you.', 154261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our fey dragons aren\'t accustomed to wearing a bridle, so please excuse the bumpy ride. Mount up and guide their attacks.', 154260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feed on your terror!', '', 154259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge reinforcements! March on the enemy\'s base!', '', 154258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush Ar\'gorok, for Arathor! For Stromgarde! FOR THE ALLIANCE!', '', 154257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight like de Zandalari of legend. Impressive.', 154256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You continue to prove your worth. Well done.', 154255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Both our peoples will be safe, thanks to you.', 154252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our efforts can continue with de death of dat enemy.', 154251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hideaway should be up ahead. We\'ll be safe there. For a while, at least.', 154246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hopefully dat is de last we have heard of dat foe.', 154245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your victory was foretold by de loa. It is good to see dey were not wrong.', 154244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De members of your Horde will be pleased to know you have dealt with dis threat.', 154243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew dat foe would be no match for your might.', 154242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the twitch in your spine? That is where I exist.', '', 154240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have received word dat a powerful enemy nearby wishes for your death. Show dem no mercy.', 154239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warriors of de Horde tell me of a troubling threat near you. Eliminate it to relieve their burden.', 154238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Horde\'s scouts have reported a formidable enemy nearby. I agree with their proposal on how to deal with it: a swift killing.', 154237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazmir seems to have an endless supply of dese savages. Thank you for culling their numbers.', '', 154234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Yer a natural! Been a long while since I\'ve seen anyone tear up the slopes like that!', '', 154232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood trolls surge our gates. Ride de horns of war into battle against dese savages.', '', 154230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t have any work for yeh today. Most of the Roughnecks went sledding to blow off some steam. Grab a pengling and hit the slopes!', '', 154228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
