('The greatest step one can take is the next one, $n. Keep upon this path.', 'The greatest step one can take is the next one, $n. Keep upon this path.', 154087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a monster in Arthas\'s own image, $n. When final death comes for you, I hope you will go slowly, tortured by the pain and suffering you have inflicted on others. \n\nWhen all the world was engaged in greater matters, you rode across the planet dragging the dead into cursed unlife. I am sure you told yourself it was for the greater good, but mark my words, Deathlord, there will be consequences.\n\n<Zallestrasza gives herself a little shake>\n\nBut for now, maybe you can be useful.', 'You are a monster in Arthas\'s own image, $n. When final death comes for you, I hope you will go slowly, tortured by the pain and suffering you have inflicted on others. \n\nWhen all the world was engaged in greater matters, you rode across the planet dragging the dead into cursed unlife. I am sure you told yourself it was for the greater good, but mark my words, Deathlord, there will be consequences.\n\n<Zallestrasza gives herself a little shake>\n\nBut for now, maybe you can be useful.', 154086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Zallestrasza\'s expression eases slightly.>\n\nThat also did not go unnoticed, $n. My people are few and each life is precious.\n\nIt does not excuse the offense against my flight, but we acknowledge and appreciate your... restraint. For a being such as you it could not have been easy.', '<Zallestrasza\'s expression eases slightly.>\n\nThat also did not go unnoticed, $n. My people are few and each life is precious.\n\nIt does not excuse the offense against my flight, but we acknowledge and appreciate your... restraint. For a being such as you it could not have been easy.', 154085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do, Deathlord, $n. \n\nWe know it was you who assaulted our sanctum. We know you have corrupted and enslaved Kyranastrasz. \n\nThose are offenses against Life that will be answered for, one day.', 'We do, Deathlord, $n. \n\nWe know it was you who assaulted our sanctum. We know you have corrupted and enslaved Kyranastrasz. \n\nThose are offenses against Life that will be answered for, one day.', 154084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know of your misdeeds, Death Knight. Your actions helped to save Azeroth from the Burning Legion, but our trust is damaged. \n\nTread Carefully.', 'We know of your misdeeds, Death Knight. Your actions helped to save Azeroth from the Burning Legion, but our trust is damaged. \n\nTread Carefully.', 154083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems I missed a few dragons in the Ruby Shrine. <Try to kill her>', 'It seems I missed a few dragons in the Ruby Shrine. <Try to kill her>', 154082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope my actions here have earned some trust.', 'I hope perhaps my actions here have earned some trust.', 154081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people are weak and were nearly dead anyway. I just ended your suffering more swiftly.', 'Your people are weak and were nearly dead anyway. I just ended your suffering more swiftly.', 154080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spared what lives I could.', 'I spared what lives I could.', 154079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know me?', 'You know me?', 154078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No! Nooooooo!', 'No! No! Nooooooo!', 154077, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance.', 154076, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 112106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out! Save yourself!', 'Get out! Save yourself!', 154075, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I think I may have messed myself...', 'I... I think I may have messed myself...', 154074, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here!', 'Get me out of here!', 154073, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I was nearly a goner.', 'Thank you! I was nearly a goner.', 154072, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are these things!? I\'m getting out of here!', 'What are these things!? I\'m getting out of here!', 154071, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m saved! I was about a moment away from being monster food!', 'I\'m saved! I was about a moment away from being monster food!', 154070, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph! Hardly a challenge, it would seem.', '', 154069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unbelievable... what other terrors has Lord Stormsong consorted with?!', '', 154068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mighty horror awaits us within the shrine. Come, we\'ll meet it with our fangs bared!', '', 154067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! I can sense a mass of great corruption within the shrine. It must not be allowed to fester!', '', 154066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t appear any different from before. Hmph. Regardless, our hunt awaits.', '', 154065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you not feel calmed? Your resolve strengthened? Let us now continue and do what must be done.', '', 154064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors suggest the tidesages strengthen themselves with waters from their cleansing fonts. Let\'s see if that\'s true before entering the heart of the shrine.', '', 154063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Follow me, den!', '', 154062, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 105587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All must be purified before stepping inside our most holy place. I ask that you receive the blessings of each cleansing font before entering the heart of the shrine.', '', 154061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every bit helps, champion. For the Horde!', '', 154060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a great relief to me that not all is within Lord Stormsong\'s grasp. Thank you.', '', 154059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is strength in these pools. Recover motes of pure water and they will add to our power!', '', 154058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel there is still some good in this sacred place. Retrieve motes of pure water so that we may restore this shrine to its former glory.', '', 154057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They nearly had me there. Thank you, $c.', 'They nearly had me there. Thank you, $c.', 154056, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contagion spreading.', 154055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Viral levels increasing.', 154054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'New strain detected.', 154053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surgical field engaged. Preparing samples for study.', 154052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Infection levels critical. Full purge initiated.', 154051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Venting containment chamber.', 154050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Testing bacterial resistance to extreme heat.', 154049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dissection protocol initiated.', 154048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'System restored. Levels returned to secure thresholds.', 154047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly wasn\'t a quiet operation, but it was effective.', '', 154046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat is de last of them. Yazma will not be spying on us any longer!', 154045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yazma has spies everywhere. Peering through de eyes of spiders. Squish dem.', 154044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sanitation complete.', 154043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a rescue mission. Find our captured soldiers, free them, and make your way to the extraction point. I am authorizing the use of lethal force. In fact, I recommend it.', '', 154042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contagion level reduced.', 154041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Now the second team will easily be able to retrieve our soldiers.', '', 154040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadowblade Razi will not be killing any more of my people. Thank you.', 154039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Infection purged.', 154038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This operation is simple. Create chaos. I have another team ready to retrieve our captured warriors, but first you have to deal with those guards. Get in, kill as many as you can find, and then get out of there.', '', 154037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of Yazma\'s most trusted assassins has been seen in de area. Be careful!', 154036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Virulent strain detected. Neutralize with extreme prejudice.', 154035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat will teach Yazma and her ilk to dabble in dark voodoo.', 154034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cleansing protocol activated.', 154033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yazma\'s evil voodoo has animated dose tiki masks! Destroy her tainted constructs.', 154032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye done it! Now the lads from the Explorer\'s League can investigate the temple in peace.', '', 154031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s been killin\' the Zandalari trolls here, and it\'s too dangerous fer the Explorer\'s League tae enter the temple until somethin\'s done about it! Get in there and root out the cause!', '', 154030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic! We\'ll get an expedition underway immediately.', '', 154029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannae send me lads down into the temple with these tiki masks about. Their magic is too strong!', '', 154028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Though I can still feel those creepy crawlies in me beard!', '', 154027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, spiders! It\'s always spiders! This Yazma has \'em all over the place. Squish a few will ye, so we can work in peace!', '', 154026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightforged, bring those demolishers down!', '', 154025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphon riders, take wing!', '', 154024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Irons, now! Attack \'em from below!', '', 154023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, we have the evidence. But you didn\'t leave many of them to carry out their plan! Either way, good job.', 154022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory... to the Alliance...', '', 154021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be with the Fogsail now, but to assume I would insult my Alliance roots by siding with the Horde... how dare you!', '', 154020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pirate crews in Freehold are always up to something. Find out what it is this time.', 154019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion has one less threat to worry about, thanks to you.', '', 154018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! We will secure this entire area for the Alliance in no time!', '', 154017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was quite a challenge, but you conquered it valiantly. Keep up the good work!', '', 154016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy has been waylaid. It is a shame it had to end so violently, but you did what had to be done.', '', 154015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could\'ve used someone like you by my side in the Third War. Excellent work.', '', 154014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would have done well back in the Second War. Well fought.', '', 154013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. We now have one less threat to worry about!', '', 154012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for lending your strength. You are a truly a champion of the Devoted!', '', 154011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hit \'em where it hurts! Their wallets!', 154010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we had one of the gang\'s ledgers, we could use it to disrupt their financial operations!', 154009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. We can\'t move the wounded just yet, but you bought us valuable time.', '', 154008, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 109236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, this will stop the bleeding for now...', '', 154007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know it hurts, but try to stay still...', '', 154006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet! They\'ll hear us...', '', 154005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, get help! I\'ll see what I can do from inside Uldir tae stop this corruption!', '', 154004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could recognize Owings\'s handwriting anywhere. I\'ll kill you, and then that traitor!', 154003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach, the entrance is closing! I cannae let this chance pass me by!', '', 154002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right where I left it!', 154001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain! We\'ve got a mutiny on our hands...', 154000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did that thing just say G\'huun?! Follow that machine!', '', 153999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It might be connected to Uldir. Let\'s hurry and find out!', '', 153997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen that kind o\' corruption before.', '', 153996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello dere, $c. Are you interested in learnin\' some alchemy?$b$bI\'m de best trainer in all de land.', 153995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows what secrets it contains? It may even have the answer tae defeatin\' the Old Gods!', '', 153994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titans constructed this facility after the fall o\' the Black Empire to run experiments on all manner of beasties.', '', 153993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! What manner o\' beastie is this?!', '', 153992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These caves must lead to the legendary Uldir!', '', 153991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your aid. The desert is a safer place thanks to your efforts.', '', 153990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat was quite a challenge, but you fought well. Keep up de good work!', 153989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat\'s one less problem to worry about. Nice work!', 153988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. You\'ve taught de enemy a lesson dey won\'t soon forget.', 153987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way.', 'Lead the way.', 153986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This house is full of hidden secrets. With the upper floors secured, I can show you a hidden path to the basement.', 153985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for lending a hand. We need more heroes like you in Vol\'dun!', '', 153984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. Thanks to your help, the desert is a little bit safer now.', '', 153983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one less danger to worry about in Vol\'dun. Well done!', '', 153982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But think of all... the gold...', '', 153981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you understand what you\'re meddling in? Ashvane will make us powerful beyond our wildest belief!', '', 153980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will bring no harm to my people!', '', 153979, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 105321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stones are... all over... the mogu will... have them all!', '', 153978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Attack!', '', 153977, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 105320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think we\'re in the clear. Great work back there.', 153976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With these stones, the mogu shall be invincible!', '', 153975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you show your face! Begone!', '', 153974, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 105319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we have company. Light \'em up, $p!', 153973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on! This is gonna be a wild ride.', 153972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this old wolf show you his teeth!', '', 153971, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 109557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine!', '', 153970, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 109556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grown a spine, have you? Hah!', '', 153969, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 109555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think not.', 153968, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 109654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic.', 153967, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 109653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not today.', 153966, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 109652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts report a dangerous foe nearby. I need you to neutralize it.', '', 153965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost some of my soldiers to a foe nearby. Avenge their deaths!', '', 153962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The 7th Legion has received word of a powerful foe nearby. Dispatch it at once.', '', 153959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No treasure... only darkness.', 'Gold, far as de eye can see...', 153958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107155, 107156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me...', 'I be... free?', 153957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107153, 107154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cursed treasure... Cursed gold...', 'Cursed thief...', 153956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107151, 107152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Add me to de pile...', 'Golden bones...', 153955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107149, 107150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have word of a dangerous enemy near your position. Take it out, but be on your guard for any surprises.', '', 153954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost some scouts nearby to a dangerous enemy. Honor them by ending this threat.', '', 153953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, there\'s a threat nearby. Keep calm and strike it down before it can escape.', '', 153952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat ain\'t a bad look, boss-mon. But if ya don\' like it ya can keep diggin\'.', '', 153951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a potion for each of you. Don\'t drink it just yet.', '', 153950, 0, 0, 432, 64, 0, 106679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. You have managed to make a sleeping city very, very angry.\n\nLet\'s not waste time pointing fingers, shall we?', '', 153949, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard this story before. (Skip the Scenario and port to Zuldazar Harbor in Zandalar)', 'I have heard this story before. (Skip the Scenario and port to Zuldazar Harbor in Zandalar)', 153948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this be a message to your masters. The Storm\'s Wake will never waver!', '', 153947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let it into your mind. Stay strong!', '', 153946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All this pain and suffering is your fault. MONSTER!', 153945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will shield us from its assault!', '', 153944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ni plahf Ni bormaz Oou sshoq\'meg vwyq yyg\'far', '', 153943, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gold. Gold. Gold.', 'More treasure for de pile.', 153942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107139, 107140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No light. No escape. The forgotten king returns.', '', 153941, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No crew here...', 'Run...', 153940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107137, 107138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All treasure for Zem\'lan.', 'Only Zem\'lan gets de treasure.', 153939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107135, 107136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems introductions be in order. First mate Owings, $n. $n, Owings. Let\'s be gettin\' ta business, ya?', '', 153938, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I warned Kiro that the sethrak would come for us soon enough. We could have been prepared... Maybe now he\'ll finally listen.', 153937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We weren\'t prepared for their attack. The sethrak slaughter and enslave without remorse.', 153936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gold...', 'Shiny...', 153935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107133, 107134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dangerous threat lurks nearby. Destroy it before it preys on more innocent lives.', '', 153934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of our allies were attacked here. You must eliminate the threat at once.', '', 153933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
