('', 'Some of our allies were attacked nearby. Eliminate de threat before it strikes again!', 153928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere\'s something very dangerous lurking here. You need to kill it before it kills you.', 153927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve received reports of a dangerous creature in this area. I need you to exterminate it as soon as possible.', '', 153926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, to me!', '', 153925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of our caravans was attacked around here. Eliminate the threat before it happens again!', '', 153924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know she be a human, but try ta be undastandin\'.', '', 153923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our goal be simple. We be helpin\' her mutiny succeed, we be allowed ta stay here as a foothold for our attack.', '', 153922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owings don\' wanna give up her freedom like da rest of da pirates be doin\'.', '', 153921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a dangerous creature nearby. I need you to take care of it before it\'s too late!', '', 153920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard \'bout our contact while scopin\' out Tiragarde for landin\' spots.', '', 153919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy, pirate \'mon!', '', 153918, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sunken realm welcomes your yawning souls.', '', 153917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oou c\'toth shuul phquathi ywaq uulg\'ma on\'ma', '', 153916, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is lost! All that remains is darkness.', '', 153915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sam, I know you\'re in there. You have to fight this!', 153914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly, no creature stands in your way for long.', '', 153913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Now the path is clear.', 153912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was just a replica. Let us not speak of this again.', '', 153911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perfect! We\'ll take it back and see what it\'s hiding.', 153910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will do. The warchief sends her regards.', '', 153909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fantastic! These will aid the war effort.', 153908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, boss-mon. Let\'s go be meetin\' wit da first mate. Act piratey.', '', 153907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be lookin\' good, don\' ya tink? Arrrgh!', '', 153906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A quarrelsome beast obstructs our exit route from this prison. Kill it.', '', 153905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A mighty beast prevents us from fully securing a foothold on this beach. I need you to handle it so we can clear an escape route.', 153904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me do da dressin\' up too, boss-mon.', '', 153903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spymasters claim the Pride of Kul Tiras is docked within Tol Dagor. If the reports are true, you are going to steal that ship for us.', '', 153902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The overseer keeps an heirloom hidden within a replica ship model. I\'d like you to retrieve it.', 153901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde war machine requires weapons and armor. Take what you can while you\'re in there and report back to me.', '', 153900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With all the chaos going on, there must be some unlooted cargo in there. Let\'s see if we can\'t sneak some supply crates out from under their noses.', 153899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took your father... betrayed your king... and you did nothing! Will you abandon all your allies to the Horde?', '', 153898, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are nothing more than monsters. No surprise they turned on you!', '', 153897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sided with mongrels over your own flesh and blood!', '', 153896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stood and watched as those animals cut me down. What has your betrayal earned you?', '', 153895, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A sizeable force of Witherbark trolls approaches Stromgarde from the east. What say we send a few of them running back to their hovels? Do kill the rest, though.', '', 153894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t burn dis one, bucko. We be usin\' it to get out to de island.', '', 153893, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A number of our gryphon riders have been felled. Keep an eye open for survivors in the field.', '', 153892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now ya see! Now ya undahstand! G\'huun gonna claim ya all!', 153891, 0, 0, 0, 70, 10600, 0, 105673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If dat monstrosity is freed, it will mean de end of Zuldazar!', 153890, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew de blood trolls were a threat, but I never imagined... dis...', 153889, 0, 0, 0, 70, 6060, 0, 106809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 153888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $n. Word of your heroic deeds as a champion of Azeroth are known to us.', 'Well met, $n. Word of your heroic deeds as a champion of Azeroth are known to us.', 153886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twisted abominations! Back to the depths!', '', 153885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear cultists from House Stormsong may be trying to spread their influence within Boralus. Reveal them for what they truly are.', '', 153884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, the rumors were true. At least the streets are a little safer for now.', 153883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, brothers and sisters. We stand together!', '', 153882, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving. The darkness claws at his mind!', '', 153881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang in there, Sam! We\'re almost there!', 153880, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 111755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TIDES OF BLOOD! RISE! RISE!', '', 153879, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rumor has it the Boralus Guard are under the gang\'s payroll. Will you look into this?', 153878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew. That\'ll keep \'em busy for... uhh.... all of five minutes?', '', 153877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! These birds are out of control! Give \'em a treat or something! Quick!', '', 153876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay. None of these wallets are mine, but... I\'ll just hold onto them \'til we can find their owners.', '', 153875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Where\'s my wallet? Wait! Did that brat just take my wallet?! After him!', '', 153874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope the others made it to safety.', 153873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vulpera are mostly a passive people. We travel in caravans, scavenging for supplies and trading where we can.', 153872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done it $p.  Ai\'twen awakens!', '', 153871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look what the sethrak have done to our home...', 153870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice choice. I can work with that.', 153869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some Boulderfist ogres intend to assault Stromgarde. Kindly demonstrate what happened to the last batch of beer-bellied brutes to dirty our doorstep.', '', 153868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Taelia. They will come.', '', 153867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
