('Daddy says I need my sea legs... But I already got two legs!', 'Daddy says I need my sea legs... But I already got two legs!', 153750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104839, 104840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that you have closed the distance to your prey, it\'s time to unleash your fury.', 153749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that you have closed the distance to your prey, it\'s time to unleash your fury.', '', 153748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel... cold...', 'I feel... cold...', 153747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya don\'t belong here!', 'Ya don\'t belong here!', 153746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. $n, head to Kezan. Acquire the Azerite refining techniques we were promised... and make Mogul Razdunk suffer for breaking his word to the Dark Lady.', '', 153745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That deal was more trouble than it was worth. There is an easier way to get what we want... by cuttin\' out the middle man, if you get my drift.', '', 153744, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 103897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief will not be pleased. We were counting on Razdunk\'s methods of refining Azerite in our war against the Alliance.', '', 153743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well excuuuuuuse me, Banshee Prince. Sorry if I\'m rattled after nearly getting killed... in a deal that I was against making in the first place!', '', 153742, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 103895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull yourself together, Trade Prince. Such babbling does not befit a leader of the Horde.', '', 153741, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 103894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogul Razdunk double-crossed us! It was crazy! I nevah seen the green bastid back out of a deal like that. You wouldn\'t beli--', '', 153740, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 103893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Mr. Blightcaller. I got some bad news...', '', 153739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood trolls... get more... of da power!', 153738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Power! POWER!', 153737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ai\'twen has been resting, gathering his strength for when he is needed again.', '', 153736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to G\'huun.', 'Teleport to G\'huun.', 153735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
