('Teleport to the entrance of Uldir.', 'Teleport to the entrance of Uldir.', 153732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Displacement Pad appears to be active and stable.', 'The Displacement Pad appears to be active and stable.', 153731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another day, another victory!', '', 153730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My guards have reported that the troggs seem to be preparing another attack! Stop them before it\'s too late!', '', 153729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Done? Good. The fewer crazed animals that can and will eat me alive, the better.', '', 153728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bewitched bears...? Nope! Absolutely not. Please uh... just get rid of them.', '', 153727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Call me crazy, but I\'m not really a fan of trees that can walk.', 153726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like there\'s trouble at the Algerson yard again. Help them out!', 153725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jolly good, my friend! You and your furry companion make quite a team.', '', 153724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nickel\'s barking to get back out and hunt some falcons. Why don\'t you take him along for some exercise?', '', 153723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, an impressive haul as always, my friend. Bully for you!', '', 153722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another day, another hunt! Let\'s see what you can take down this time!', '', 153721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere has been much going on in de city lately. Being on de water is better. It is nice here.', '', 153720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few years ago, de naga came. Their hulks tore down de temple.', '', 153719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be a shame what happened in Atal\'Gral.', '', 153718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
