('Be cautious.', '', 153637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I say about doin\' someting stupid?', '', 153636, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 105595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Outcasts welcome you, traveler.', '', 153635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to lend a hand?', '', 153634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you here?', '', 153633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the wind be at your back.', '', 153632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength and virtue.', '', 153631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with honor.', '', 153630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands gonna rise up... against you...', 'These lands gonna rise up... against you...', 153629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I was gonna take your head...', 'No! I was gonna take your head...', 153628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny... Alliance...', 'Puny... Alliance...', 153627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not be lastin\' much longer...', 'You not be lastin\' much longer...', 153626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Empire... lives on...', 'The Empire... lives on...', 153625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We jus\' gonna keep comin\'...', 'We jus\' gonna keep comin\'...', 153624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my attention.', '', 153623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This not be over...', 'This not be over...', 153622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome here.', '', 153621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For de... Horde.', 'For de... Horde.', 153620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna be rewarded for your head.', 'I gonna be rewarded for your head.', 153619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can out-smart us? Ha!', 'Think you can out-smart us? Ha!', 153618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna take your heads as trophies!', 'We gonna take your heads as trophies!', 153617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t find us all!', 'You can\'t find us all!', 153616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out to play, little Alliance?', 'Come out to play, little Alliance?', 153615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands belong to de Zandalari!', 'These lands belong to de Zandalari!', 153614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna regret coming here!', 'You gonna regret coming here!', 153613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t belong in dese lands!', 'You don\'t belong in dese lands!', 153612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a chance. We\'re better than these savages.', 'Not a chance. We\'re better than these savages.', 153611, 0, 64039, 1, 64, 0, 109267, 109268, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not without you!', 'Not without you!', 153610, 0, 64039, 5, 64, 0, 109265, 109266, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re getting out of here, damn it!', 'We\'re getting out of here, damn it!', 153609, 0, 64039, 5, 64, 0, 109263, 109264, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not leaving you!', 'I\'m not leaving you!', 153608, 0, 64039, 5, 64, 0, 109261, 109262, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing? Save yourself!', 'What are you doing? Save yourself!', 153607, 0, 64039, 0, 64, 0, 109283, 109284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go get help! I\'ll be fine!', 'Go get help! I\'ll be fine!', 153606, 0, 64039, 0, 64, 0, 109281, 109282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here, it\'s too late...', 'Get out of here, it\'s too late...', 153605, 0, 64039, 0, 64, 0, 109279, 109280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to run...', 'You need to run...', 153604, 0, 64039, 0, 64, 0, 109277, 109278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes are upon you.', '', 153603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps next time they will be more careful about being taken captive. They were fortunate that the Horde has as capable a hero as you to look out for them.', '', 153602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies have need of our aid. They seem to have gotten themselves captured. See to it that they\'re freed.', '', 153601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this intelligence, we are sure to gain the upper hand against the Alliance. Your efforts will be rewarded.', '', 153600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spies have informed us that an important message will be delivered through this area at any moment. Intercept it by any means necessary.', '', 153599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De loa favor you. Dat is a good thing! Just do not let it go to your head.', '', 153598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies are infesting de Garden of de Loa once more, and dey need to learn a good lesson in manners. De power of de loa be with you!', '', 153597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet us in the outpost. We must find the answer. This smells like a potential upheaval.', '', 153596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may not be subtle work, but it is necessary. We must keep our enemies blinded. Well done.', '', 153595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has sent its spies to ferret out our secrets from the shadows. We will not let them uncover our plans. See to it.', '', 153594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war with the Alliance will end us if we do not have the Zandalari fleet.', '', 153593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is not going to wait for us to build a fleet before they attack. We need the Zandalari.', '', 153592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get these Zandalari to join the Horde, hero.', '', 153591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need that Zandalari fleet.', '', 153590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief\'s will be done.', '', 153589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With you and Ai\'twen on our side, the plan can\'t fail.', '', 153588, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari do not seem to like me much.', '', 153587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speaker of the Horde.', '', 153586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari fleet MUST join the Horde. Make it happen.', '', 153585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis champion defied de might of Stormwind to save Zul and me. Such bravery merits an audience, Father.', 153584, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king, de Horde has only come to steal our navy for their undead warchief.', '', 153583, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some good stuff here, no askin\' any questions.', 'Got some good stuff here, no askin\' any questions.', 153582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring supplies from Highmountain.', 'I bring supplies from Highmountain.', 153581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(View events that led to Azeroth\'s wound)', '(View events that led to Azeroth\'s wound)', 153580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The titan console has a series of data entries displayed on it. You can select one to view.>', '', 153579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope ye got fire resistant underwear!', '', 153578, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, things are about tae get hot!', '', 153577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time tae light ye up!', '', 153576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That \"diamond dwarf\" speaks for the world\'s soul. He would not intervene like this unless the situation were dire.', '', 153575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, can you imagine? The diamond dwarf could send us anywhere on Azeroth!', 153574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like this teleporting diamond dwarf who hands out powerful gifts. Can we keep him?', '', 153573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sure this must be important, Magni. But for the sake of the Kul Tirans... please be swift.', '', 153572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, champion. Azeroth herself beckons!', '', 153571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, forgot I saved it to here.', 'Ah, forgot I saved it to here. Shoot.', 153570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too old for this. I\'m out of here!', 'I\'m too old for this. I\'m out of here!', 153569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better square yourself away, private.', 'You better square yourself away, private.', 153568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, I... I\'ll do better, sir.', 'Sir, I... I\'ll do better, sir.', 153567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Private James, didn\'t your parents give you enough attention as a child? Why are you wasting my time in chasing your butt all over lands unknown?', 'Private James, didn\'t your parents give you enough attention as a child? Why are you wasting my time in chasing your butt all over lands unknown?', 153566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sergeant... thanks for coming after me... sir.', 'Sergeant... thanks for coming after me... sir.', 153565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get moving!', 'Let\'s get moving!', 153564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time we get headed back. Wyrmbane\'s going to want a full report.', 'It\'s time we get headed back. Wyrmbane\'s going to want a full report.', 153563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Briarback failed to kill me, and they\'re going to regret that.', 153562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I will redecorate when I get back. I\'m thinking a tusk theme... where ever will I find them?$b$b<Deal grins wickedly.>', 153561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need a drink, then I have a home to retake and rebuild. Thanks for thinning them out!', 153560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t stay long, I gotta get back to my farm. Mayor told me to come here and make sure to congratulate you for helpin\' us out with the Briarback.$b$bNice work, kid.', '', 153559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work with those quilboar, friend!', '', 153558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t stay too long. We\'ll need those farmhands repaired to fix the damage they did to the fields.$b$bBut it\'s important to take breaks every once in a while.', '', 153557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I left the farmhand in self-defense mode. I\'m sure it will be just fine.', '', 153556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep an eye out for any quilboar quills. They\'re surprisingly useful as tools and the quilboar even use them as ingredients in their own cauldrons!', '', 153555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde from the north, quilboar from the west. Can we trust the militia any more?', '', 153554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope Rolf, Mort, and Spiff made it out.', '', 153553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My spies tell me you can\'t win your war against de Alliance without our fleet. \n\nSo... dat means every little dirty task I have to do today I will assign to you and you will do it. Or else!', 153552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I keep telling Zolani and Talanji dat de port is secure. Do dey listen? No.$b$bAre dere fights? Ruffians? Brawls? Sure. But nothing so drastic dat de king must be bothered.', 153551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, if you would.', 'Follow me, if you would.', 153550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got somethin\' $n needs tae see. A gift that can aid this land as well.', '', 153549, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 110231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At ease, all. This is Magni Bronzebeard--once king of Ironforge, now Speaker for Azeroth.', '', 153548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this is new.', '', 153547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorcery!', '', 153546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A... diamond dwarf?!', 153545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now unleash the Heart\'s power!', '', 153544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is dire news. We better go report this to the High Commander.', 'This is dire news. We better go report this to the High Commander.', 153543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korthek is insane! He must be stopped!', 'Korthek is insane! He must be stopped!', 153542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korthek grew tired of peace. He turned his back upon the sacrifice of Sethraliss and foolishly seeks to combine the keys and unleash the C\'Thrax upon his foes.', 'Korthek grew tired of peace. He turned his back upon the sacrifice of Sethraliss and foolishly seeks to combine the keys and unleash the C\'Thrax upon his foes.', 153541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great sage Sulthis enlisted the aid of Korthek and I to raise a magical barrier to seal away the fallen C\'Thrax. We swore that we would never allow such terror to be unleashed again.', 'The great sage Sulthis enlisted the aid of Korthek and I to raise a magical barrier to seal away the fallen C\'Thrax. We swore that we would never allow such terror to be unleashed again.', 153540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power unleashed from the destruction was immense. Our land was forever altered.', 'The power unleashed from the destruction was immense. Our land was forever altered.', 153539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was only through the intervention of our loa that we were spared. Sethraliss sacrificed herself to subdue the C\'Thrax, but not before it was able to destroy an ancient pyramid that stood in the center of this land.', 'It was only through the intervention of our loa that we were spared. Sethraliss sacrificed herself to subdue the C\'Thrax, but not before it was able to destroy an ancient pyramid that stood in the center of this land.', 153538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, before the sands began to spread, a monstrous C\'Thraxxi warbringer descended upon our lands. He began to slaughter all in his path, troll and sethrak alike.', 'Long ago, before the sands began to spread, a monstrous C\'Thraxxi warbringer descended upon our lands. He began to slaughter all in his path, troll and sethrak alike.', 153537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must be vigilant for the Horde. They continue to attack the square.', 153536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you see anything else out there looking to invade my town, I would appreciate the warning.', 153535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone is counting on me to lead the town. I won\'t let them down!', 153534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone seems to be safe... for now.', 153533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not just a stone, it\'s a key. It is one of a set used to contain a great and terrible power.', 'That\'s not just a stone, it\'s a key. It is one of a set used to contain a great and terrible power.', 153532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! There\'s some sort of stone in there.', 'Oh! There\'s some sort of stone in there.', 153531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Beware the Daughter of the Seas.\"', '\"Beware the Daughter of the Seas.\"', 153530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To his nation, with his last breath, cried,', 'To his nation, with his last breath, cried,', 153529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betrayed by family.', 'Betrayed by family.', 153528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis dwarf promised to better arm your champion to save my people. I am willing to take de risk.', 153527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buried deep beneath the waves,', 'Buried deep beneath the waves,', 153526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His daughter stood aside.', 'His daughter stood aside.', 153525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But when he faced those savage foes', 'But when he faced those savage foes', 153524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies \'pon the rise!', 'Enemies \'pon the rise!', 153523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
