('But there he found on the Western shores,', 'But there he found on the Western shores,', 153522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('and pray she still drew breath?', 'and pray she still drew breath?', 153521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else but sail to save a daughter\'s life,', 'What else but sail to save a daughter\'s life,', 153520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose we\'re just going to let our champion take a trip with the king of diamonds?', '', 153519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('the admiral followed west.', 'the admiral followed west.', 153518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
