('How could she go astray?', 'How could she go astray?', 153516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always the pride of our nation\'s eyes,', 'Always the pride of our nation\'s eyes,', 153515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why this? Did you forget your seaside days?', 'Why this? Did you forget your seaside days?', 153514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why this? Why this oh Daughter of the Seas?', 'Why this? Why this oh Daughter of the Seas?', 153513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('because she left his side.', 'because she left his side.', 153512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The admiral fell at Theramore,', 'The admiral fell at Theramore,', 153511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where sailors fought and died.', 'Where sailors fought and died.', 153510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those blood-soaked shores of Kalimdor,', 'Those blood-soaked shores of Kalimdor,', 153509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As he sank beneath the tide.', 'As he sank beneath the tide.', 153508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His words carried upon the ocean breeze,', 'His words carried upon the ocean breeze,', 153507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Beware,\" I heard him cry.', '\"Beware,\" I heard him cry.', 153506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
