('The Horde think that they can spy on our position here in Zuldazar, but they are wrong! Deafen their ears and send a message that the Alliance will not be shaken.', '', 153344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m nae goin\' in one o\' those without a key ever again!', 'I\'m nae goin\' in one o\' those without a key ever again!', 153343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more minute in that thing and there woulda been a reckonin\'!', 'One more minute in that thing and there woulda been a reckonin\'!', 153342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why\'d Thurgaden leave us in those tin cans for so long? Gah!', 'Why\'d Thurgaden leave us in those tin cans for so long? Gah!', 153341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was hotter\'n Ragnaros\' fiery bottom in there!', 'It was hotter\'n Ragnaros\' fiery bottom in there!', 153340, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send a lad tae let Wyrmbane know we\'ve got this area buttoned up. Thanks fer the assist, $n.', '', 153339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All in a day\'s work!', '', 153338, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was right terrifyin\'!', '', 153337, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re drawin\' power from the Firelands, but nothin\' dangerous will heed this call.', '', 153336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yer quaverin\' beard, Thaelin. I\'m not as foolish as Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan was.', '', 153335, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful what ye summon, Anvil-Thane.', '', 153334, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mighty fine summon, lads. You have control o\' it, $n. Show that batch o\' Horde what happens when they meddle with the Dark Iron!', '', 153333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, place some o\' that slag on the unstable magma there. And prepare yerself.', '', 153332, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Stromgarde has begun!', '', 153331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('30 seconds until the Battle for Stromgarde begins.', '', 153330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, not a problem.', '', 153329, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, ye kept the key tae yerself?', '', 153328, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like me shaman are still in the mole machines. Knew I forgot somethin\'.', '', 153327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve already got a good start here. What\'s missin\'?', '', 153326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea of the forces at play here, child.', '', 153325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Reach inside and pull out something that feels more like a building.>', '<Reach inside and pull out something that feels more like a building.>', 153324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Reach inside and pull something out.>', '<Reach inside and pull something out.>', 153323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A wormhole stretches out before you. Apparently you should be able to use this to create a building, somehow.>', '', 153322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not test my patience, vermin. Die.', '', 153321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_BOSS_CTHUN.BLP:20|t The %s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:264382|h[Eye Beam]|h|r!', 'A projection appears in the distance...', 153320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De sea is our home. Something is out there keeping us away, I hope ya take care of it!', '', 153319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to see de Seekers, eh? Dey be a solid lot, you should be safe dere.', '', 153318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boats go missing. Storms appear where dere were none before. Others be afraid to take de water.', '', 153317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere have been rumors, strange things happening on the coast.', '', 153316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish.', '', 153315, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 112122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And please... look after Jaina.', '', 153314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secure a base of operations in Kul Tiras. Our plan must not fail.', '', 153313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a 7th Legion vessel along as an escort.', '', 153312, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Steady as ever.', '', 153311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the depths reject you, as you have your people.', '', 153310, 0, 57238, 0, 64, 0, 108748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand for naught but hatred and suffering.', '', 153309, 0, 57237, 0, 64, 0, 108747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear the storm\'s awakening, and know your end.', '', 153308, 0, 57236, 396, 64, 0, 108746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, for your judgment is at hand.', '', 153307, 0, 57235, 396, 64, 0, 108745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, Genn... how are your sea legs?', '', 153306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear our people\'s cries, and know your time has come.', '', 153305, 0, 57234, 396, 64, 0, 108744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are beyond redemption.', '', 153304, 0, 57233, 396, 64, 0, 108743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been found wanting.', '', 153303, 0, 57232, 396, 64, 0, 108742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your soul languish forevermore.', '', 153302, 0, 57231, 396, 64, 0, 108741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As soon as I get my hands on a weapon...', 153301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They failed to kill me. That was their first mistake.', 153300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They wreck my farm and have the nerve to capture me. They\'re not going to walk away from this!', 153299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not leaving until we deal with this threat!', 'I\'m not leaving until we deal with this threat!', 153298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re going to pay for what they did!', 'They\'re going to pay for what they did!', 153297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe these quilboar a beating!', 'I owe these quilboar a beating!', 153296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back and barter sometime.', 153295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Free at last! I\'m going to show these filthy swine what happens when you mess with my farm!', 153294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heyyy, look who\'s finally awake.', '', 153293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware... beware... the daughter of the sea... hmm hmm...', '', 153292, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep... keep that away from me.  I only.... want to drown... in my cups! *hic!*', 'Keep... keep that away from me.  I only.... want to drown... in my cups! *hic!*', 153291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sister\'s husband gave her a sea stalk before setting off on a four month voyage, only to have the flower wilt on the third day.  She was out of her mind with grief, but because she knew about it early, she was able to ration her coin to provide for her kids.', 'My sister\'s husband gave her a sea stalk before setting off on a four month voyage, only to have the flower wilt on the third day.  She was out of her mind with grief, but because she knew about it early, she was able to ration her coin to provide for her kids.', 153290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got cots set up upstairs and room in the basement to stow yer gear. \n\nIt\'s not much, but it\'s better than bein\' out there with the witches.', 'We got cots set up upstairs and room in the basement to stow yer gear. It\'s not much, but it\'s better than bein\' out there with the witches.', 153289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some sailors consider them bad luck, almost tempting fate.  Others want their loved ones to not have to wait for bad news.  I don\'t begrudge either.', 'Some sailors consider them bad luck, almost tempting fate.  Others want their loved ones to not have to wait for bad news.  I don\'t begrudge either.', 153288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, as long as the trees stand, so must we. We cannot throw away our lives here.', '', 153287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us find some of our kin. Together, we may be able to heal some of what ails Drustvar.', '', 153286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But--!', 153285, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have everything that was important in that grove, sapling. If the fungarians hadn\'t attacked, the corruption from the south would have reached us.', '', 153284, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Going? Going where? The Ashenwood is our home, Morwin. And it\'s covered in spores. We can\'t just leave it!', 153283, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Amalie. Now, I suppose we should be going.', '', 153282, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this sea stalk?', 'What can you tell me about this sea stalk?', 153278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drumming', 'Drumming', 153277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Zuldazar.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Zuldazar.', 153276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my strength is returning!', '', 153275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things were quiet here. Then there was a storm. The other seekers stopped returning, $c. What is going on out there?', '', 153274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sincerest thanks, and some of my own personal stash is yours for your troubles. I must depart now in my conveyance, good show!', '', 153273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My word, I appear to be in a bit of a situation. Be a dear and lend me your aid.', '', 153272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, thanks, you\'re the sweetest. Here\'s a little something for you. Toodles!', 'Aw, thanks, you\'re the sweetest. Here\'s a little something for you. Toodles!', 153271, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there! You gotta help me out, hon! I\'m all alone here, desperate, you know?', 153270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oo ye know I kin not give ye all of my Azerite, here\'s enough ta thank ye kindly and ye be off and outta me way.', '', 153269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awright thare, kin ye help me oot o\' this fankle?', '', 153268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, it\'s just a costume! See? Feel it!$b$bNow will you tell them to let me out of here? It was just a joke! Hogger wasn\'t really terrorizing Stormwind!', 'Look, it\'s just a costume! See? Feel it!$b$bNow will you tell them to let me out of here? It was just a joke! Hogger wasn\'t really terrorizing Stormwind!', 153267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank ye! I suppos\'n you\'ll be wantin\' some of my Azerite. S\'only fair, I say.', 153266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi there! Ya think ya could help me outta this?', 153265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose I have earned this.', 153264, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 112104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will suffer what I must...', 153263, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 112105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sh-she\'s come back to finish us!', '', 153262, 0, 0, 5, 94, 0, 111452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murderer!', 'Murderer!', 153261, 0, 0, 5, 94, 0, 111834, 111850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitor!', 'Traitor!', 153260, 0, 0, 5, 94, 0, 111833, 111849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the daughter of the sea!', '', 153259, 0, 0, 5, 94, 0, 111451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Jaina... Is that really her?', 153258, 0, 0, 6, 94, 0, 0, 111772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, we\'re going home. Now!', 153257, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 111450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mommy, who is that lady?', 153256, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 104804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hamlet... you\'ve done been truffled...', '', 153255, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My head... What happened to my pigs!?', '', 153254, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell the tale of your great victory here today. So, uh... be sure to win!', '', 153253, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 110797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Crimson Forest!', 'Return to the Crimson Forest!', 153252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those civilians back! Form a perimeter!', '', 153250, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 111678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees.', '%s flees.', 153249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now they see me as a criminal.', 153248, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 112103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see the city guard is as disciplined as ever. My father was so proud of them.', 153247, 0, 0, 1, 94, 0, 0, 112102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not rush me! I am trying to save your master!', '', 153246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n! Over here!', 'Hey $n! Over here!', 153245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just be my luck! I be on my way to Dol\'watha an\' my beast be gettin\' sick. It\'s like what they say. When it be rainin\', it be pourin\'.', '', 153244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m Rally!', 'I\'m Rally!', 153243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plenty o\' Horde blood out there ta spill. Save some for me, will ya?', 'Plenty o\' Horde blood out there ta spill. Save some for me, will ya?', 153242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us make it suffer.', '', 153241, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have orders to kill this one.', '', 153240, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close, friend. We do not want to risk discovery.', 153239, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay focused, $n.', 153238, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 106314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you trying to draw attention to us?', 153237, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, Boris... I think our snatchin\' days are over...', '', 153236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep yer hands away from my beast!', '', 153235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re talkin\'. Look at all this Azerite!', '', 153234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss! You\'re here!', '', 153233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the way! Dangerous prisoners coming through!', '', 153231, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 111677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt! State your intentions!', '', 153230, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 111674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no time to wander off.', 153229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 112098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sh-shut up.', '', 153228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh... maybe a WITCH did it!', '', 153227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one of your scouts, Gallywix... and this one\'s dead.', '', 153226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must push into the city\'s heart to evacuate the remaining citizens!', '', 153225, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('L-look out...', '', 153224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re almost there! Make haste, heroes!', 153223, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep moving!', 153222, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, with me! We rally in the keep! Your warchief commands it!', '', 153220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang! Where did you go?', 153217, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, the collapsed fields are still dangerous! The road to the right should be a little safer and take you to the windmill. Deal\'s farm is just past it.', '', 153216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re willing to fight, I could sure use some help.', 153215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m all out of potions and there\'s a whole lot of sethrak between me and my wagon.', 153214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You still alive in there? Any good with that weapon of yours?', 153213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not today, snakemen!', 153212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please return me to the entrance.', 'Please return me to the entrance.', 153211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Avatar of Sethraliss is rejuvenated thanks to the efforts of you and your allies.', 'The Avatar of Sethraliss is rejuvenated thanks to the efforts of you and your allies.', 153210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni, send me back to Zandalar.', 'Magni, send me back to Zandalar.', 153209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this can take us where we need tae go. Come along, champion.', '', 153207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat any remaining intruders.', 'Defeat any remaining intruders.', 153206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_REGENERATION_02.BLP:20|tThe Avatar joins you,  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:269670|h[Empowering]|h|r you to finish the fight!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_REGENERATION_02.BLP:20|tThe Avatar joins you,  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:269670|h[Empowering]|h|r you to finish the fight!', 153205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You see the Avatar of Sethraliss before you. Though still alive she is very weak from the Trolls\' meddling. All around you ancient defensive wards flicker to life...>', '<You see the Avatar of Sethraliss before you. Though still alive she is very weak from the Trolls\' meddling. All around you ancient defensive wards flicker to life...>', 153204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00+$1i Wood|r', '|cffffff00+$1i Wood|r', 153203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the princess! Let \'er rip!', '', 153202, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
