('My kind kills for less, you know.', 'My kind kills for less, you know.', 153044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107302, 107303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Discipline and tact are scarce resources for you, it seems.', 'Discipline and tact are scarce resources for you, it seems.', 153043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107300, 107301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything has value, even you.', 'Everything has value, even you.', 153042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107298, 107299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be quick. Be clever.', 'Be quick. Be clever.', 153041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107286, 107287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
