('Remember, everything has its use!', 'Remember, everything has its use!', 153039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107282, 107283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dunes have everything we need.', 'The dunes have everything we need.', 153038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107280, 107281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of yourself. No one else will.', 'Take care of yourself. No one else will.', 153037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107278, 107279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
