('What did you bring me?', 'What did you bring me?', 153035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107296, 107297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need something?', 'Need something?', 153034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107294, 107295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to trade?', 'Have you come to trade?', 153033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107292, 107293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi there.', 'Hi there.', 153032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107290, 107291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got anything for me?', 'Got anything for me?', 153031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107288, 107289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me a prize from your next adventure!', 'Bring me a prize from your next adventure!', 153030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
