('Feast\'s up!', '', 152975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could use a new helmet...', 152973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That reminds me. A sethrak also poked me once... once.', 152972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] Go with speed and fury.', 152971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Winds at your back, swords in your hands.', 152970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make them fear you.', 152969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave some sethrak for me.', 152968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] Never give in.', 152967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] Tell me, how many sethrak have you killed?', 152966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today is a good day to fight. Every day is.', 152965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vulpera are stronger than we look.', 152964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people will be free.', 152963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] I\'m ready to fight.', 152962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for de king.', '', 152961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your weapon ready.', '', 152960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loa be with you.', '', 152959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar stands strong.', '', 152958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will face de danger.', '', 152957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies will fall.', '', 152956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I know you won\'t.', 152955, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 107000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fail you... my queen.', '', 152954, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 106685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you up to the task?', 152953, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are to infiltrate Stormwind and liberate a political prisoner. One who could change the course of the war... in our favor.', 152952, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The boy king has something that does not belong to him. I want it back.', 152951, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To win this war, the Horde needs allies.', 152950, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I understand discretion very well.', 152949, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Certain members of the Horde seem to feel my recent actions have been... indiscriminate.', 152948, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I require the services of one whom I can trust completely.', 152947, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, there you are. I was beginning to wonder.', 152946, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...to the Horde.', '', 152945, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her advisors are loyal...', '', 152944, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps my queen would be more open if she were more assured of their loyalty.', '', 152943, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 106684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can we aid the warchief if she keeps things from her advisors?', '', 152942, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This doesn\'t concern you.', '', 152941, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 106683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has the warchief summoned you?', '', 152940, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 105269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even I know its nature yet.', '', 152939, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 106682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warchief has requested you for a mission of great importance... and secrecy.', '', 152938, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 106680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell ya friends to visit de Goldtusk Inn!', '', 152937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to sign de guest book.', '', 152936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go dyin\' on me.', '', 152935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey, ya got any bananas?', '', 152934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goldtusks stay true.', '', 152933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to de Goldtusk Inn!', '', 152932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mutiny or de yard arm.', '', 152931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of ya crew.', '', 152930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware de briny deep.', '', 152929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She mourns the husband who fell at Theramore, but she lost her daughter that day as well.', '', 152928, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit jabbering! No need to tell everyone.', 152927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet! We\'ve got a good thing here.', 152926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush! We don\'t need anyone asking questions.', 152925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zem\'lan be no place for de livin\'.', '', 152924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya lookin\' for a crew?', '', 152923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy!', '', 152921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Katherine bears an immense burden. It\'s no wonder Jaina\'s return was so hard on her.', '', 152920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must unite the houses beneath the Proudmoore banner and locate the missing fleet. Otherwise, Kul Tiras could fall apart before this war even begins.', 152918, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clan was wiped out by the Twilight\'s Hammer. The only reason I escaped was because my brother Keeland sent me away on his gryphon. Saved me life.\n\nTraveled most of the world before I settled \'ere in Kul Tiras. Found these folks hunting gryphons for meat and pelts. I showed them there was another way. Now they\'re the next generation of gryphon riders.\n\nDon\'t think I\'ll return home. This is my clan now.', '', 152917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to Zul\'jan.', 'Take me back to Zul\'jan.', 152916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sawing', 'Sawing', 152915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a Wildhammer dwarf doing out here?', 'What\'s a Wildhammer dwarf doing out here?', 152914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna be rich after this haul.', 'We\'re gonna be rich after this haul.', 152913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fools dinna know the value o\' the stuff under their verra feet.', 'The fools dinna know the value o\' the stuff under their verra feet.', 152912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a buyer in Silvermoon that\'s gonna pay a lot fer these relics.', 'I got a buyer in Silvermoon that\'s gonna pay a lot fer these relics.', 152911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None o\' this stuff is headed tae a museum.', '', 152910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all da tings dat not seem right in Nazmir... dis place seems da most not right. Be on ya guard.', '', 152907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hezrel be busy! What could he be doin\' down here?', '', 152906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We been expectin\' Hezrel to help us in da fight, but he ran off ta do his own ting. What dat construct be up to?', '', 152905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your hands off my treasure...', 'Heave me down, I be coming back soon...', 152900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107163, 107164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis land be cursed... we all are....', 'Zem\'lan won\'t let us stay dead... dat\'s de real curse...', 152899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107161, 107162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel nothing...', 'Scuttle your landlubber legs...', 152898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107159, 107160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De captain\'s... gonna hear about dis...', 'You\'ll answer... to Pirate-King Zem\'lan for dis...', 152897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107157, 107158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fly down and meet with Titan Keeper Hezrel.', 'Let\'s fly down and meet with Titan Keeper Hezrel.', 152896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must inform my father what has transpired here. We have won a great victory, but de fight against de blood trolls will continue.', 152895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not forget all dat de Horde has done for my people. Without you, none of dis would have been possible.', 152894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At your command!', 152893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cavern is collapsing! Run!', 152892, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 108185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perish here amid the rubble, or be torn apart by my vassals. You will not live to see my victory.', '', 152891, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 106529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m takin\' you with me!', 152890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a little closer!', 152889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s have a blast!', 152888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'mon, gimme a hug!', 152887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me! Make haste and do not stray!', '', 152886, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 103587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_shadow_mindflay.blp:20|tAn |cFFFF0000|Hspell:269131|h[Ancient Mindbender]|h|r attaches to |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 152885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of the Third Fleet, steel yourselves! Report to King Greymane at once!', '', 152884, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, never mind. It\'s ale. We\'re good.', '', 152883, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4530, 106114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '.', 152882, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces are keeping de rest of de blood trolls at bay, but dey cannot hold out forever. We must end dis, and soon.', 152881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '.', 152880, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But nobody has heard from the fleet in months! The tidesages have withdrawn into their cloisters and seem uninterested in finding our missing ships.', 152879, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'House Waycrest has been a loyal supporter of Proudmoore\'s rule for centuries, but their recent absence from council meetings has given rise to troubling rumors.', 152878, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return, precious!', '', 152877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasn\'t about to let it get cold.', 'Wasn\'t about to let it get cold.', 152876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me die this time, Bwonsamdi... Please...', '', 152875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit it out already.', '', 152874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will continue our... what are you looking at me like that for? DO YOU NOT APPROVE?', 152873, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At once, yes. Absolutely, and without delay!', '', 152872, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, not the worst I\'ve seen. Still a sad story, though. We\'ll need to let the High Commander know what transpired.', '', 152871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear. That is much worse than I feared. My deepest apologies for putting you in such a risky situation, sir Bronzebeard.', '', 152870, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WELL?! That lassie was madder than a murloc on moon mead. Tried to sacrifice our lovely $c here to some Blood God called G\'huun.', '', 152869, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Conrad... is well, I trust?', '', 152868, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'Nazman, I believe. Or Tul\'vor? In fact I believe they are one and the same. Or nearly so.', '', 152867, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knowledge or no, it\'s time to get to the bottom o\' this. Where\'d this Captain head off to?', '', 152866, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... oh my goodness. Surely the esteemed Captain Conrad had no knowledge of these macabre circumstances.', '', 152865, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harry\'s blood drains from his face.', '', 152864, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this all about, Harry?! Those offerin\'s you were sendin\'... The soldiers were sacrificed! Blood drained from their bodies like a mug o\' ale at Brewfest.', '', 152863, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast that! They won\'t get another red copper from us before me an\' $n go see what\'s what.', '', 152862, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trade agreements with trolls! We even have bats prepared to send another trade offering to Zalamar.', '', 152861, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh heavens! Well, indeed, yes. I suppose that is accurate, mmm. But Captain Conrad is a glory to behold. Impressive, no doubt.', '', 152860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heard they were savages wot practice bloody sacrifices.', '', 152859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing untoward, I assure you! Our glorious Captain is off negotiating trade agreements with the local trolls.', '', 152858, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, no sign o\' the Captain then. What\'s goin\' on?', '', 152857, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Ah ha! Right to the point, yes, yes. Not to worry! All is in order. Let\'s retire to safer environs behind our fort\'s walls, yes?', '', 152856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the Captain?', '', 152855, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Conrad left me with instructions.', '', 152854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been expecting you, our esteemed advisors and future fast friends.', '', 152853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome! Welcome!', '', 152852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like our welcome party is here. Harry\'s an interestin\' one. Don\'t pay him no mind.', '', 152851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... eugh... keep yer nostrils pinched. What\'s that foul-as-death rottin\' stench?', '', 152850, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. Look. Listen. Keep those sharp eyes peeled. Unforgivin\' lands aren\'t known ta forgive the unwary, $n.', '', 152849, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, this here\'s a land that works \'gainst the Zandalari and their Horde associates. The enemy of yer enemy is yer... wait, what\'s that sayin\'?', '', 152848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sent Captain Conrad ahead to build a fort. They say the blood trolls here might even be willin\' ta trade, but I cannae imagine that\'d come at a price worth payin\'.', '', 152847, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like it! Anywhere yer hackles raise, there\'s an opportunity for adventure an\' the prospect o\' knowledge.', '', 152846, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place gives me the willies...', '', 152845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you will not live to see that day. Arise, guardian, and slay these trespassers!', '', 152844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 115225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kul Tiran plague will be cleansed and we will retake our lands!', '', 152843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 115227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ancestors were fools... As are you!', '', 152842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 115226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take one of the ropes down to the landing craft, $n. And good luck.', '', 152841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those are definitely more carvings. Come on!', 152840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gorak Tul did not survive! Witnesses wrote of his defeat!', 152839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The local authority has given us permission to open portals here.', 'The local authority has given us permission to open portals here.', 152838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is steeped in magic. Can you feel it?\n\nWhat kind of rituals were they doing here, I wonder?', 'This place is steeped in magic. Can you feel it?\n\nWhat kind of rituals were they doing here, I wonder?', 152837, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another Stele! This one also shows Gorak Tul.', 152836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Vol\'dun.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Vol\'dun.', 152835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFEF0201+$1i|r |cFFFFFF00Azerite|r', '|cFFEF0201+$1i|r |cFFFFFF00Azerite|r', 152834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They said I\'d be working with blood <coughs>. I was like, \"Blood elves?!\" And they repeated \"blood <coughs>.\"\n\nBlood TROLLS. Not ELVES. Ugh. Not refined in the least.', '', 152833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, sir!', 152832, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 111809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... What\'s going on?', 152831, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In unity, there is strength.', '', 152830, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Right, I made a note here about the red ones. I even circled it. In red. Thank you for your help. That may not have ended well, otherwise.', '', 152829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you there. I wish to collect samples of this rare desert bloom. Please assist me.', '', 152828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a whackjob! I\'ll meet ya back at Fort Victory. Let\'s get outta this dark place before they all come after us.', '', 152827, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 152826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This a rare sight in this part of the world. The leaves of the red lasher are said to have mystical healing properties.$b$bI wish to collect some, but removing them will release the plant\'s scent into the air. It will surely attract attention from the local fauna.$b$bProtect me while I harvest it. I will reward you accordingly.', '', 152825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria, take the rest of our troops and focus on routing the enemy army.', '', 152824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY LIFE FOR THE HORDE!', '', 152823, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 106273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father gave everything for the Alliance! The question is, are you willing to do the same for the Horde?', '', 152822, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 105314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will NEVER stand down! I eat, sleep, and die by the sword. What price have you paid for your people?', '', 152821, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 106272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father was a man of honor, boy. You know nothing of the sort.', '', 152820, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 106271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand aside, Saurfang. This war is not yours to bear alone, and there is no honor in killing you.', '', 152819, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 105313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready!', 152818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work, everyone! Let\'s keep moving.', '', 152817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four eyes... the end... she rises!', '', 152816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Endless shadow... a thousand arms...', '', 152815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe ya everything, $p. I won\'t be forgettin\' dat.\n\nFor now, we\'ll help Norah and de other vulpera ransack all of Zem\'lan\'s stolen booty. But don\'t hesitate to ask if ya need something from a few undead pirates.\n\nWe led a good mutiny, but I know dat Zem\'lan didn\'t have to force all of de crew to be monsters. Many of dem did that on their own.\n\nBe careful if ya had back into de port.', '', 152814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must ensure Victoria\'s sacrifice was not in vain. Her staff is the key to opening the way to the Shrine.', '', 152813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mutiny \'til de yard arm, $p. I be with ya.', '', 152812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have ya ever seen so much treasure in one place?\n\nDis be what a life of eternal piracy gets ya. It be beautiful...', '', 152811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Ahna snores loudly as she pretends to be asleep.>', 152810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ring de gong to issue a challenge to Pirate-King Zem\'lan. I be ready to face him.', '', 152809, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Then we shall prove to Katherine Proudmoore the same truth that I learned at great cost...', '', 152808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! Gold coins from the ancient troll empire are worth a fortune. Here\'s your cut!', '', 152807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found an ancient totem in the Court of Zak\'rajan that has the power to raise the dead. Take it to the bone pits and use it to dig up some buried treasure!', '', 152806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, forget it. I don\'t have time for this nonsense. I have a party to get to!', '', 152805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kids today. So impatient. I\'m just getting warmed up!', '', 152804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you keep poking me, I\'m liable to break into a story. A really looooong, boring story.', '', 152803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll trade stories next time.', '', 152802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. Go. I have things to do.', '', 152801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be in such a rush.', '', 152800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it down!', '', 152799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have any good stories?', '', 152798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah... I\'m listening.', '', 152797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De flora of de jungle can be worse than de fauna, if you are not careful.', '', 152796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m never stepping foot in this mine again!', 'I\'m never stepping foot in this mine again!', 152795, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They came out of nowhere!', 'They came out of nowhere!', 152794, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I thought I was a goner.', 'Thank you! I thought I was a goner.', 152793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here!', 'Get me out of here!', 152792, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will take you to the bridge below.', 152791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dinnae think yer face and my boot have been properly introduced. What say we change that?!', '', 152790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly away, little birdy...', '', 152789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ye in the skies.', '', 152788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In Stormsong Valley, to the north, the tidesages of House Stormsong craft and bless the ships of our legendary fleet.', 152787, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright then. Off ye go.', '', 152786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back ta work!', '', 152785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on with it!', '', 152784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What d\'ye need?', '', 152783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye? I\'m a busy fella!', '', 152782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those beasts have been the bane of many caravans in Vol\'dun. Good work.', '', 152781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonebeak vultures are an untamable breed. They\'ve become a nuisance and must have their numbers and nests culled.', '', 152780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel free to take a look around, but please don\'t touch anything.$b$bThese plants are very delicate.', '', 152779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the west lies Drustvar, a mountainous region providing most of the kingdom\'s ore... and some of our toughest warriors.', 152778, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beyond Tiragarde Sound are lands held by the Waycrest and Stormsong families.', 152777, 0, 0, 1, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For you, dere is only pain!', 'For you, dere is only pain!', 152776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have ways of making you talk!', 'I have ways of making you talk!', 152775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll break your spirit.', 'I\'ll break your spirit.', 152774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life burns to ash...', '', 152773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the time he asked for help, it was too late.', '', 152772, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 111630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land I love is falling apart... so I\'m asking for your help. Kul Tiras needs the Alliance just as badly as you need us.', '', 152771, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 111633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But she is misguided. Her advisors have kept her blind to the infection that has spread throughout our kingdom.', '', 152770, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras still bears the scars of the Third War. No one feels this more deeply than Katherine Proudmoore.', '', 152769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try not to make me look bad, will ya?', 152768, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few days later, he woke up screaming and drenched in sweat. Infection had eaten away at his insides. My friend never saw another sunrise.', '', 152767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If there\'s no more coins here, check the other locations.', 152766, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should have been his ticket home, but he was a stubborn one. Refused to leave before the war was won. So he patched himself up and told the healers he was fine.', '', 152765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orcish juggernaut struck our transport. Splinters from the gunnel ripped across the deck and tore into a friend of mine.', '', 152763, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was in a battle many years ago. It was... the Second War? Tough to keep them all straight.', '', 152762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph... Humor an old knight for a moment, would you?', '', 152761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you help us?', '', 152760, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Katherine Proudmoore turned us away and had her own daughter cast out as a traitor.', '', 152759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wandering Zandalari offered this potion in a trade. It\'s supposed to instantly cook whatever you use it on, and I won\'t say no to free meat. Give it a try on the creatures in this area.', '', 152758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia! Prepare a full briefing for our guests.', '', 152757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will melt.', '', 152756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Greymane, it is an honor. You are free to remain in the harbor on my authority.', '', 152755, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 111623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t argue with those results! To be safe, I\'ll have our tusked friends taste it first...', '', 152754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The desire for power. The yearning for the greater truth. The will of blood.', 152753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The methods of the Nazmani were... offputting, at first. But I know them now. They are a simple people with simple desires.', 152752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, let me show you what I have learned.', 152751, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to understand about them yet. This blood magic... it is more potent than you could possibly imagine.', 152750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They can be powerful tools against the Zandalari trolls and their Horde allies.', 152749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have established more trust with the blood trolls--these Nazmani--than I anticipated.', 152748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaacchh, shut yer trap!', '', 152747, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Urrrggrh!', 152746, 0, 0, 34, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is nothing personal, you understand. But, you cannot be allowed to interrupt the progress I have made. The things I have learned... what I have yet to discover.', 152745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This Zandalari will be sacrificed for the furtherance of our power.', 152744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got us dis far. We be followin\' ya.', 'Ya got us dis far. We be followin\' ya.', 152743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p knows where a vulpera crew be nearby. I say we join dem for now, \'til dis blows over.', '', 152742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zem\'lan\'s lackeys gonna be lookin\' for us on de seas.', '', 152741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. But we gonna need to hide out for a little while first.', '', 152740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free to keep our treasure for ourselves.', 'Free to keep our treasure for ourselves.', 152739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free to pillage where we please.', 'Free to pillage where we please.', 152738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free to sail da open seas.', 'Free to sail da open seas.', 152737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We done it, me hearties. We finally be free of Zem\'lan!', '', 152736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hand hoy! Double speed to da coast!', 'All hand hoy! Double speed to da coast!', 152735, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the Alliance emissary. I\'m glad Flynn and Taelia were able to get you out of that damn prison. \n\nI am Sir Cyrus Crestfall. On behalf of the Proudmoore Admiralty, I welcome you to Kul Tiras.\n\n<Cyrus extends his massive hand warmly.>', '', 152734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Shake his hand.>', '<Shake his hand.>', 152733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fewer days ahead now than behind.\n\nI\'ll not spend them watching Kul Tiras fall apart.', '', 152732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, crew. Grab de treasure and get in de boat!', '', 152731, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winston is flying outside of your range. Return to Corlain!', '', 152730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Princess, $n, me scouts be reportin\' Titan Keeper Hezrel be wanderin\' at da base of dis structure.', '', 152729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever since Hakkar, dere is a weakness in de Gurubashi\'s minds. Their path can be too easily corrupted, and must be purged.', '', 152728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot... prevail...', 152727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, aye, captain.', '', 152726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corlain belongs to the coven!', 152725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest and enjoy camp tonight. Tomorrow, we\'ll plan out how we\'re gonna get the rest of that treasure.', 'Rest and enjoy camp tonight. Tomorrow, we\'ll plan out how we\'re gonna get the rest of that treasure.', 152724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the caravan!', 'Welcome to the caravan!', 152723, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then...', 'Well then...', 152722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. Dere be a whole island of it off de coast. More treasure than you can count.', '', 152721, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little curse never kept the vulpera from a worthy treasure... You got more of that somewhere?', 'A little curse never kept the vulpera from a worthy treasure... You got more of that somewhere?', 152720, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only problem be dat da treasure be cursed.', 'Only problem be dat da treasure be cursed.', 152719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be lookin\' for a new crew to join. If you be havin\' us, we\'ll share our treasure with ya.', '', 152718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Pirate-King Zem\'lan killed ya friend. We mutineed against Zem\'lan and stole his treasure.', '', 152717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m listening...', 'I\'m listening...', 152716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belay dat! We come to parley peace with ya.', '', 152715, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-s-skeletons! N-n-norah, kill them!', 'S-s-skeletons! N-n-norah, kill them!', 152714, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. A blast from their own cannons should certainly weaken the Faithless siege.', '', 152713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live for a good fight!', 'I live for a good fight!', 152712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless are pressing their attack! Use one of the cannons we have commandeered to help defend the temple!', '', 152711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Patch, now!', 152710, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 103848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready when you are.', 'I\'m ready when you are.', 152709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna get movin\'? We ain\'t here on vacation.', '', 152708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash it on \'em, lads!', '', 152707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send the shot!', '', 152706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give it to em, lads!', '', 152705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target acquired! Fire!', '', 152704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire at will!', '', 152703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the target! Fire!', '', 152702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha...', '', 152701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...yeah. A little too spooky for our potential customers.', '', 152700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too spooky?', '', 152699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did a little profit-loss calculation, and I don\'t think this area\'s really worth our time.', '', 152698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... what about your Azerite?', '', 152697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Hop on the bike. Let\'s make tracks.', '', 152696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hell yeah.', '', 152695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... uhh... you wanna maybe get out of here?', '', 152694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no no...', '', 152693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better get over this fear of witches, Eitrigg. This area\'s LOADED with Azerite, and... URK!', '', 152692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Nature_LightningShield.blp:20|t%s gains a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:263246|h[Lightning Shield]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Nature_LightningShield.blp:20|t%s gains a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:263246|h[Lightning Shield]|h|r!', 152691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not another one!', '', 152690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood is mine!', 152689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who cares! Did you find the Azerite seam?', '', 152688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? What is it?', '', 152687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sh-shut up.', '', 152686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh ha ha ha! Big ol\' orc, afraid of witches.', '', 152685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! I mean, no. I just... don\'t like them, that\'s all.', '', 152684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you say?', '', 152683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware... the... the witches...', '', 152682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eitrigg... are you afraid of witches?', '', 152681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did he say... w-w-witches?', '', 152680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Commons isn\'t safe! The birds are upon us!', 'The Commons isn\'t safe! The birds are upon us!', 152679, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, do your job and protect me!', '', 152678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t... but I do see something. We have company.', '', 152677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bahhh... happens all the time. You see any Azerite anywhere?', '', 152676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re flocking everywhere!', 'They\'re flocking everywhere!', 152675, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix... do you see this mangled corpse here? Your scout is dead.', '', 152674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, whatever.', '', 152673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, we will investigate the Azerite. But then we MUST focus on the Alliance!', '', 152672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... many... birds!', 'Too... many... birds!', 152671, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never trust a gull again!', 'I\'ll never trust a gull again!', 152670, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old lady MacMillan was right. These birds are evil!', 'Old lady MacMillan was right. These birds are evil!', 152669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pfsh. Drudges.', '', 152668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna check that out first.', '', 152667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First things first! My scouts are tellin\' me about a HUGE Azerite vein here in Drustvar.', '', 152666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then get out of my sight, or I\'ll really give you something to be scared of!', '', 152665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should be cautious. His words were... concerning.', '', 152664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but...', '', 152663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... terrible curse... the others are all...', '', 152662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to turn back! It\'s...', '', 152661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh. I thought it\'d be bigger.', 152660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not enough zap. I guess it needs more juice.', 152659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We prefer de groves of nature to de cold stone of de city. Many of de Zandalari believe us to be heretics. Dey claim our matron is no loa. \n\nDey are welcome to their opinions. We of de Lun\'alai have long possessed de gifts of nature, to take de forms of de wild. Ours is de way of balance, not bargains.', '', 152658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wonderful! Beautiful! Oh this one has some sand on it. But no matter. You did very well!', '', 152655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tons of shiny sea-glass wash up into this marsh, but the murlocs grab it all! See if you can pick out some pretty pieces, however you see fit.', '', 152654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_DemonHunter_SoulCleave2.blp:20|t Yazma begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:249924|h[Soulrend]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_DemonHunter_SoulCleave2.blp:20|t Yazma begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:249924|h[Soulrend]|h|r!', 152653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late.  The invasion is already here!', 'You are too late.  The invasion is already here!', 152652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I work alone?  Meet my associates!', 'You think I work alone?  Meet my associates!', 152651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This coven\'s actions are terrible, but this is a new low even for them! Words cannot express my gratitude for stopping this... this butchery.', 152650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This coven\'s proclivities border on the profane. So ends one of their more sordid ventures.', '', 152649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smartly now! Meet me back at de boat. I\'ll make sure de crew has it loaded with treasure.', '', 152648, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every life we can save from this cult is a victory. Good work.', 152647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The workings of death and rebirth are ours and ours alone. Good work keeping it that way.', '', 152646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve spared the citizens of Drustvar from this terror of the skies today. You have my thanks.', 152645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t cause any trouble.', 'Don\'t cause any trouble.', 152644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These feathers will provide for our rangers for some time.', '', 152643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An eternity of pillagin\' and plunderin\'... without you!', '', 152642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could be better than an eternity of pillagin\' and plunderin\'?', '', 152641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be a cruel captain, Zem\'lan. De crew deserves better!', '', 152640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have to, or we are all lost. Now go!', 152639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We aren\'t leaving you to die!', 152638, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 111719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat was a close one. We need to keep our eyes on de seas as well as de sands in Vol\'dun.', 152637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a close one. It seems we\'ll need to keep our eyes on the seas as well as the sands.', 152636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A massive sea monster has been ravaging de coast. We must stop de beast before it ventures further inland.', 152635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A giant sea monster has been ravaging the coast. We must stop the beast before it ventures near our camp!', 152634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xorrath was a prominent commander in de sethrak army. Disposing of him is a great victory for us.', 152633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fangcaller Xorrath was a high-ranking commander in the sethrak army. Eliminating him is a great victory for us.', 152632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vulpera scouts have reported de presence of a sethrak commander nearby. We must seize de opportunity to eliminate him.', 152631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our scouts have reported the presence of a high-ranking sethrak commander nearby. We must seize the opportunity to eliminate him while we have the chance.', 152630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work! De tribe will collapse without a chief to lead dem.', 152629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work! The tribe will fall apart without a chief to lead them.', 152628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a tribe of murlocs nearby that have been causing trouble. Take out their leader and the tribe will fall apart.', 152627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere is a tribe of murlocs nearby dat has been causing trouble. Take out their leader and de tribe will fall apart.', 152626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work. Our scouts will be pleased that you\'ve eliminated Mor\'fani.', 152625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work. De vulpera will be pleased that you have taken care of Mor\'fani.', 152624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A large crow has been charmed by this coven for use against the villagers. While I have no love lost for the residents of Drustvar, our dark rangers can make excellent fletching from the bird\'s feathers.', '', 152623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the coven\'s top witches is sacrificing acolytes in an effort to gain more power. Destroy her and show these upstarts that only the Dark Lady holds dominion over death.', '', 152622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the coven here have \"employed\" the manor\'s chefs to create rather unsavory dishes. It would best to eliminate them as soon as possible.', '', 152621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Heartsbane coven has charmed a massive crow native to Drustvar. Kill it before it can prey upon our civilians!', 152620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A member of Lady Waycrest\'s coven is sacrificing their own acolytes. Stop this ritual before too many lives are lost!', 152619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Zandalri exile has been terrorizing our scouts. Find and eliminate him before he takes even more lives.', 152618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A recent exile has been terrorizing de vulpera. Find and dispatch him before he takes even more lives.', 152617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The chefs here have been serving up meals of questionable content to their unwitting guests. Put a stop to their culinary monstrosities!', 152616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, sir!', '', 152615, 0, 0, 66, 78, 0, 110187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N-no, sir.', '', 152614, 0, 0, 669, 78, 0, 110186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now stand down and let them pass. We shall parley in my office.', '', 152613, 0, 0, 1, 78, 0, 109554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You serve Kul Tiras! You wear the crest of Proudmoore! And you take your orders from ME.', '', 152612, 0, 0, 22, 78, 0, 109553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s impossible to grow crops in Vol\'dun without fertilizer. We usually collect it from hyenas, but they haven\'t been leaving much lately. Try feeding them to speed things up!', '', 152611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Ashvane? Do you serve Lady Ashvane? Is that Lady Ashvane\'s crest upon your shield?', '', 152610, 0, 0, 1, 78, 0, 109552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But sir... Lady Ashvane ordered--', '', 152609, 0, 0, 396, 78, 0, 110185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down! Don\'t you know who that is?', '', 152608, 0, 0, 22, 78, 0, 109551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is high quality fertilizer! Nice work... just don\'t forget to wash your hands!', '', 152607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Suppose we ought to interrupt it, aye?', '', 152606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a sail on the horizon? They might be makin\' a deal with the Zandalari.', '', 152605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kicking', 'Kicking', 152604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box issues a neutral chime.', '', 152603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box issues a cheerful chime.', '', 152602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box issues a neutral chime.', '', 152601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No idea. But I\'m buyin\' the ale tonight, lass.', '', 152600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it?', 152599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will enjoy teleporting you to the bottom of the Great Sea! For the Horde!', 152598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh--', '', 152597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Given the rumors of foreign invaders and spies among us, we can never be too careful. Obey their instructions to avoid any unseemly incidents.', 152596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will discuss payment later, Dockmaster.', 152595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, there it is. We\'ll get this sealed up an\' shipped off back to Stormwind.', '', 152594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth... I\'m sorry...', 152591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The needle points east. I\'ll meet ye in the ruins, $n.', '', 152590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too slow, dwarf.', 152589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close. The Horde be lurkin\' nearby. I can smell \'em.', '', 152588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a little more floral than I expected. Did they get a new flavor o\' elf?', '', 152587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not here. And it looks like it be Nightborne after us t\'boot. Joy of joys.', '', 152586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gettin\' closer. Just keep those murderin\' mana-chuggers off me, $n.', '', 152585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s right under me feet... where...?', '', 152584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och! That\'s a dirty trick!', '', 152583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box hums gently.', '', 152581, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box hums gently.', '', 152580, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box hums gently.', '', 152579, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast! De idols can\'t be destroyed, but dey released an old memory... One I\'ve tried to forget.', '', 152578, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye mean ta tell me there\'s an ENORMOUS sword stabbed into the heart o\' the planet... and ye\'ve got time ta sit around pokin\' me fer a laugh? GET BACK TA WORK!', '', 152577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember yer duty ta Azeroth.', '', 152576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our world must be healed!', '', 152575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth cries out in pain.', '', 152574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our world needs us, champion.', '', 152573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To think the trolls were squattin\' on the archaeological find of the century!', 152572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep yer bones. There\'s power here, I can taste it. We\'ll take it right out from under the Horde\'s nose.', '', 152571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mind yer hands, now. Slow and steady.', 152570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try not to damage it. Aye, like that...', 152569, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aaaahhh... now look at that. Ye\'ll make a proper archaeologist yet!', 152568, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? Ye mean to do it all with yer hands?', '', 152567, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on and give me elemental a tap. It\'ll get this done for ye.', '', 152566, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait!', 152565, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Now, on to the real work.', '', 152564, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You scratched it! We can\'t display it in this state!', 152563, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, lass, it\'s not that bad.', '', 152562, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me bones are tired. De curse weighs heavy.', '', 152561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pirate-King Zem\'lan never gonna forget dis day.', '', 152560, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on! The harbormaster\'s office is just through here.', 152559, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<whiff> Need to wash this coat, too.', '', 152558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good solid hammer is an invaluable tool and a sturdy weapon.', '', 152557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m of no use wi\'out me hammer. It\'s like I am missing me hand.', '', 152556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t be able to hold them for long. Take the rod and get out of here!', 152555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examining', 'Examining', 152554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These caves are swarming with kobold vermin.', '', 152553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands to de boat! See ya soon, $p.', '', 152552, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be almost ready to weigh anchor. Zem\'lan never gonna see us coming.', '', 152551, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye.', 'Aye.', 152550, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye.', 'Aye.', 152549, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. Zem\'lan be a tyrant, not a captain. Mutiny be da only way.', 'Aye. Zem\'lan be a tyrant, not a captain. Mutiny be da only way.', 152548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be of an accord, den?', '', 152547, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, and take our share of de treasure.', '', 152546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at all dat gold...', 'Look at all dat gold...', 152545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be a mutiny, ya bilge rat! We gonna run our blades right through Zem\'lan\'s bony gut.', 'Dis be a mutiny, ya bilge rat! We gonna run our blades right through Zem\'lan\'s bony gut.', 152544, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And yet we headin\' right into it.', 'And yet we headin\' right into it.', 152543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be de only fate worse than ours.', '', 152542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De only people dere be de goldslaves, former crewmates forced to tend to Zem\'lan\'s treasures for all eternity.', '', 152541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be headin\' to de Golden Isle, where Zem\'lan hoards all de treasure we\'ve pillaged over countless years.', '', 152540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hand hoy!', 'All hand hoy!', 152539, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Some fun mine cart transitional action here.*', '', 152538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so bright out here... Put me bones back in the hole.', 'It\'s so bright out here... Put me bones back in the hole.', 152537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kul Tiras is made up of several major houses. They were unified under Daelin Proudmoore\'s leadership, but that gradually changed after his defeat at Theramore.', 152536, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Admiral Katherine Proudmoore now rules in his place, commanding both the military and the guard.', 152535, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Despite our efforts to maintain order, Kul Tiras has seen an increase in crime, corruption, and piracy. People are losing faith in the Proudmoore Admiralty.', 152534, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 110426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '.', 152533, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '.', 152532, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day. Do you require rest? Refreshment?', '', 152531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to serve Lord and Lady Norwington as their housekeeper. If you would like to acquire a room for rest, do not hesitate to ask.', '', 152530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An estate such as this one requires a lot of upkeep. Between making horseshoes, repairing rakes, and doing the occasional odd job here and there, a blacksmith\'s work is never done!', '', 152529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need something repaired? I specialize in horseshoes, but I could see what I can do with your armor.', '', 152528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run. RUN!', 152527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s verra simple. Donna get hurt and I won\'t have tae heal ya.', 152526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll hold them off for as long as I can.', 152525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a natural fisherman. I knew you\'d do great! And you\'ve still got all of your arms and legs... that\'s a bonus!', '', 152524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sandworms are savage predators that lurk beneath the dunes. They\'re dangerous, but their fangs are valuable! Take my fishing pole and see what you can catch!', '', 152523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things can always get worse. We do our best, with what we have.', '', 152522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kul Tiran fleet bows to my will. And now, so shall you.', '', 152521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I don\'t think I can go on.', 152520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s only a few more steps. We\'re not leaving you behind!', 152519, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 111718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give them a taste of our new allies\' power.', '', 152518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got nothin\' else to give, Zem\'lan... You took everything.', 'I got nothin\' else to give, Zem\'lan... You took everything.', 152517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another fleshy to dominate! This\'ll be fun.', 'Another fleshy to dominate! This\'ll be fun.', 152516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, we\'re almost there!', 152514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just need to reach the altar ahead.', 152513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you stand in my way, but Kul Tiras\'s fate was sealed long ago.', '', 152512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let you deliver the good news. I\'m going to make sure these cannons are taken care of.', '', 152507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the last of them!', '', 152506, 0, 56947, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, that\'s another one down. Just the one left...', '', 152505, 0, 56947, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE!', '', 152504, 0, 56947, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That certainly got their attention. Watch out for the Horde while I reload!', '', 152503, 0, 56947, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, here we go. Cover your ears!', '', 152502, 0, 56947, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only they were usin\' their power tae heal Azeroth instead of hurt her. Good work, champion.', '', 152501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s drawin\' power from Azerite in this area. Ye need tae stop \'em!', '', 152500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And it is I who will deliver us to our glorious future beneath the tides.', '', 152499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This power... will... be... ours!', 152498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None can stand against the sethrak with this power!', 152497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recover the jewels and place them back into their sockets so we can pass!', '', 152496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eyes of Sethraliss have been removed!', '', 152495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have everything I need. Speak to me when you\'re ready to begin the ritual.', '', 152494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saw him waddling over toward de city. Better hope he\'s not making a fool of himself, or de people might take care of him demselves.', '', 152493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve watched you come and go for a long time. Saw your struggles and triumphs with de little one. You should be proud of him. Proud of yourself for sticking with him. Not many around here would have.\n\nTreat Kua\'fon well. He is a loyal companion, if not de best flier.', '', 152492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun... wants... dis power...', 152491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis energy be givin\' us power! Ya not gonna stop it!', 152490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helping', 'Helping', 152489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eviscerating', 'Eviscerating', 152488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes, it seems like this whole swamp is out to get us. Good thing you\'re up to the challenge!', '', 152487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a bad feeling about this... Our scouts on patrol should have returned long ago. Investigate the cause of the delay.', '', 152486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving.', 152484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was his father who guided us to this valley, many years ago.', 152483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not at all. He was so kind before the whispers took him.', 152482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was Lord Stormsong always this cruel?', 152481, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 111717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much for not being noticed.', 152480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you just going to leave me to die?', 152479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stone pulses with the power of Azshara herself! Take it to the forces at the fort proper. They will know what to do.', '', 152478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. But you and I should be getting out of here!', 'Thanks. But you and I should be getting out of here!', 152477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not going be baby pterrordax fodder!', 'I\'m not going be baby pterrordax fodder!', 152476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The commander will have my hide for getting caught by the wildlife.', 'The commander will have my hide for getting caught by the wildlife.', 152475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I thought I was careful, but another beast swooped down on me from the side. Clever girl.', 'Thank you! I thought I was careful, but another beast swooped down on me from the side. Clever girl.', 152474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof, those talons of theirs hurt!', 'Oof, those talons of theirs hurt!', 152473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese blasted Pterrordax be a nuisance. I don\'t want me troops ta be food!', 'Dese blasted Pterrordax be a nuisance. I don\'t want me troops ta be food!', 152472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These blasted Pterrordax are a nuisance. I don\'t want my troops to be food!', 'These blasted Pterrordax are a nuisance. I don\'t want my troops to be food!', 152471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was hoping to clear out the pterrordax to use the vantage point on the hill, but we\'re getting picked off one by one like it\'s nothing!', 'I was hoping to clear out the pterrordax to use the vantage point on the hill, but we\'re getting picked off one by one like it\'s nothing!', 152470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu... will find... more... stones...', '', 152469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This stone\'s power will revive the mogu empire!', '', 152468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! There were a couple more than I expected.', '', 152467, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 107956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Gurubashi have worked demselves into a murderous frenzy! Let us help dem out... with dying! Hit de gong and watch dem come running!', '', 152466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There have been reports of some restless trolls in the area, and we fear an attack is imminent. It\'s time to thin their numbers. Hit the gong at the top of the stairs to provoke them!', '', 152465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you can do to help us would be appreciated.', 'Whatever you can do to help us would be appreciated.', 152464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me an axe and I will chop!', '', 152463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me wicker, show me beasts... I will fight them all!', '', 152462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tirans never go down without a fight!', '', 152461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the aid, friend.', '', 152460, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got company!', 152459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GO! GO! GO!', 'GO! GO! GO!', 152458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright marines, listen up! When we hit the beach I want $n to take point. Use that pretty little flare gun to light up anything that moves.', 'Alright marines, listen up! When we hit the beach I want $n to take point. Use that pretty little flare gun to light up anything that moves.', 152457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 152456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush these interlopers or your hazard pay is mine, whelps!', '', 152455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emergency Repair Protocol in progress...', '', 152454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet sweet Azerite!', '', 152453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drill baby drill!', '', 152452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
