('Warning! Fuel levels critical!', '', 152443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! Unauthorized user detected.', '', 152442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning! You have zero points left on your license.', '', 152441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes another one, get ready!', 'Here comes another one, get ready to spit.', 152440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit higher, it\'ll go farther and you won\'t miss.', 'Spit higher, it\'ll go farther and you won\'t miss.', 152439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready!', 'Get ready!', 152438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit just as they take off.  We\'re sure to hit em!', 'Spit just as they take off.  We\'re sure to hit em!', 152437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Innncoommmiiiiin\' dwaaaaarf!', '', 152436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a shame that Azerite is drivin\' the elements out of control. More reason for us tae be puttin\' an end tae this.', '', 152435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some earth elementals have been infused with Azerite and are goin\' crazy. Put them down and absorb their Azerite!', '', 152434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re here! Light the munitions!', '', 152433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stones stir... we shall have them all!', 152432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power from this stone will fuel our empire!', 152431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Glibb looks at you curiously. Brann doesn\'t have the heart to tell him he\'s not a monkey.>', '<Glibb looks at you curiously. Brann doesn\'t have the heart to tell him he\'s not a monkey.>', 152430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Falcon\'s Roost. Thanks to you the monsters have been pushed back and we can reclaim the town. Please stay as long as you like.', 'Welcome to the Falcon\'s Roost. Thanks to you the monsters have been pushed back and we can reclaim the town. Please stay as long as you like.', 152429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems those weapons might be of goblin origin. Regardless, they\'ll work well against the sethrak.', '', 152428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nisha scavenged some... interesting weaponry that may help us fight the sethrak, if we can figure out how to use it.', '', 152427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anything like these monsters before!', 'I\'ve never seen anything like these monsters before!', 152426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I fly out of here?', 'Can I fly out of here?', 152425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid not right now. \n\nI tried to fly out when this mess started but they fired on us from the ground with magic. Lionel here took a hit to his flank and we barely made it back to Falconhurst with our lives. \n\nMayor Royston told us to stay until we took back the town or the situation improved.\n\nI\'m sorry, but we\'re grounded.', 'I\'m afraid not right now. \n\nI tried to fly out when this mess started but they fired on us from the ground with magic. Lionel here took a hit to his flank and we barely made it back to Falconhurst with our lives. \n\nMayor Royston told us to stay until we took back the town or the situation improved.\n\nI\'m sorry, but we\'re grounded.', 152424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that was not what I was expecting. I\'m sure our mages will want to take a look at this thing. Excellent work, hero.', '', 152423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our intelligence reports indicate that the Horde are planning to secure some kind of artifact from these sethrak. Let\'s beat them to it, shall we?', '', 152422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let get gettin\', $n.', '', 152421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoooooaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa!', '', 152420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, champion! Those things should stay under the dirt, where they belong.', 152417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Filthy creatures... they\'re sacrificing their own to craft monstrosities. Stop them before we\'re overrun by flesh-eating plants!', 152416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Normal Difficulty.>', '<Queue my party for an Island Expedition on Normal Difficulty.>', 152415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Azerite... be ours... ta control!', 152414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Azerite be bendin\' ta me blood magic!', 152413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scuttle me bones! Of course I be ready to mutiny. I been hangin\' here for weeks!', 'Scuttle me bones! Of course I be ready to mutiny. I been hangin\' here for weeks!', 152412, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting. Perhaps these will help us understand the strange phenomenon we\'ve seen around Nazmir, as well as the origins of these vicious blood trolls.', 152411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our researchers requested we keep an eye out for any artifacts we find, especially to ensure they don\'t fall into the Horde\'s hands. Search this ruin for anything of use.', 152410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never met a mutiny I didn\'t like. I\'m in.', 'I never met a mutiny I didn\'t like. I\'m in.', 152409, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be gladly joinin\' ya mutiny, ya swab. Pirate-King Zem\'lan gonna pay for crossin\' me.', 'I be gladly joinin\' ya mutiny, ya swab. Pirate-King Zem\'lan gonna pay for crossin\' me.', 152407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you got gold, you\'re welcome to spend it here.\n\nJust don\'t disrupt business and my people won\'t disrupt you, we clear?', 'If you got gold, you\'re welcome to spend it here.\n\nJust don\'t disrupt business and my people won\'t disrupt you, we clear?', 152406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talk to some of the bigger names around here: Klause Fairwind, Kane Carlyle, Clonk Greaseybit, and Fixi Slyshiv.\n\nBe my agent and see if they need any favors. I\'ll need their support too.\n\nAnd unless there\'s anything else, I should continue talking to fine, upstanding but concerned folks here.', 152405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who should I talk to?', 'Who should I talk to?', 152404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ain\'t a mutiny with just two of us, $p. Recruit some others!', '', 152403, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is your keeper?', '', 152402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
