('A parrot? No kites?', 'A parrot? No kites?', 152380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Tan scoffs>\n\nParrots are far more intelligent and interesting than a kite.\n\n<Tan opens one eye and looks over at his bird.>\n\nEven if they scream for fun sometimes.', '<Tan scoffs>\n\nParrots are far more intelligent and interesting than a kite.\n\n<Tan opens one eye and looks over at his bird.>\n\nEven if they scream for fun sometimes.', 152379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since the Irontide sailed in, Richard Tornsail has to approve flights in and out.\n\nSupposedly it\'s to keep the Cove \"Secret\" and \"Secure\" but if you ask me, it\'s so he can control everything.\n\nHe\'d have to approve. Look, it\'s my hide and my bird\'s wings if I don\'t listen.\n\n<Tan leans forward and lowers his voice>\n\nOr someone else would have to be in charge.', 'Since the Irontide sailed in, Richard Tornsail has to approve flights in and out.\n\nSupposedly it\'s to keep the Cove \"Secret\" and \"Secure\" but if you ask me, it\'s so he can control everything.\n\nHe\'d have to approve. Look, it\'s my hide and my bird\'s wings if I don\'t listen.\n\n<Tan leans forward and lowers his voice>\n\nOr someone else would have to be in charge.', 152378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could I catch a flight out of here?', 'Could I catch a flight out of here?', 152377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
