('Maybe... if you\'re feeling brave... tell him next time I\'ll bring a hat!', '', 152374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so big and strong now, eh? Go, my minion. Go and find de ratmon Alfin who told ya to kill my kind. Bite him, and earn ya richmon form again.', '', 152373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
