('', 'Good work. As always, we can count on you to get the job done.', 152342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, these blood trolls have been attacking Fort Victory. Show them that their raids will not go unpunished!', 152341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up, rats! This Azerite won\'t blast itself!', '', 152340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
