('Perhaps we shall meet again on the field of battle. Side by side, back to back, outnumbered, out-armored, outclassed. Hee hee.', '', 152323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s my turn, you come get de fish!', '', 152322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit down, sista!', '', 152321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are so immature!', '', 152320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay! You scared off my fish!', '', 152319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'RAWK! I\'m Pa\'ku! Woosh!', 152318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey look, I\'m Gral!', 152317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taz\'okun!', 152316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wheee!', 152315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck. Try not to die.', '', 152314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always watch your back, or get a shell.', '', 152313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll... Pay...', 'You\'ll... Pay...', 152312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Fair...', 'No... Fair...', 152311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disciples! Intruders approach the sacred pools!', '', 152310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... This is mine...', 'No... This is mine...', 152309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... Dare... You...', 'How... Dare... You...', 152308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I\'m taking payment outta your hide!', 'Looks like I\'m taking payment outta your hide!', 152307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do enjoy a wild rumpus. On occasion I have even been known to partake in a tussle, or even fisticuffs.', '', 152306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m charging double for that!', 'I\'m charging double for that!', 152305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I\'m charging you an arm and a leg!', 'Looks like I\'m charging you an arm and a leg!', 152304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! That\'s gonna cost ya!', 'Hey! That\'s gonna cost ya!', 152303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been stabbed in the back by more races than you even know existed, so don\'t get any ideas.', '', 152302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death be de only mercy dat Zem\'lan has to offer. And even dat be denied to most.', '', 152301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Digging', 'Digging', 152300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 152299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t rest until Lord Stormsong\'s head hangs from these walls.', 152298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that\'s the kind of firepower we need!', 152297, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... Fair... Enough...', 'Heh... Fair... Enough...', 152296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll... Pay...', 'You\'ll... Pay...', 152295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t... be... beaten...', 'I can\'t... be... beaten...', 152294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I\'m the Boss...', 'But... I\'m the Boss...', 152293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Makin\' a run fer Cove boss, eh? HA! I\'ll beat you like the last one!', 'Makin\' a run fer Cove boss, eh? HA! I\'ll beat you like the last one!', 152292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the Boss of this place! You better step in line!', 'I\'m the Boss of this place! You better step in line!', 152291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody hush. Meeki\'s fine and I\'m trying to sleep back here.', 'Everybody hush. Meeki\'s fine and I\'m trying to sleep back here.', 152290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have you keelhauled!', 'I\'ll have you keelhauled!', 152289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one sails against the Irontide!', 'No one sails against the Irontide!', 152288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you!', 'How dare you!', 152287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find treasure along the way, bring that back too. We can make it worth your trouble.', 'If you find treasure along the way, bring that back too. We can make it worth your trouble.', 152286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay...', 'You\'ll pay...', 152285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one sails against the Irontide...', 'No one sails against the Irontide...', 152284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get.... You...', 'I\'ll get.... You...', 152283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry... boss...', 'Sorry... boss...', 152282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not supposed to be here!', 'You\'re not supposed to be here!', 152281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re you snooping around for!', 'What\'re you snooping around for!', 152280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t belong here!', 'You don\'t belong here!', 152279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', 'Hey!', 152278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you know you can use whale shark gills in soup? It prevents scale rot! Oh, what were we talking about?', 152277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, when I said \'everyone\', I guess I really meant everyone with gold to spend. Human, goblin, tauren, elf, it doesn\'t matter. Their gold all spends the same.\n\n<Cesi eyes you up and down>\n\nOh. You wanna know if I\'d sell to the Horde.\n\nLook, I gotta make a living. If I have some anchors that fell off the back of a ship, I\'ll sell \'em to the first customer who shows up. That\'s the deal. When I\'m boss, everyone gets to come do business in the Cove.\n\nAnd you don\'t really wanna deal with those Irontide Pirates, do ya?\n\nTrust me pal, this is gonna be great.', 152276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me children got better manners than you.', '', 152275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean open trade to \'everyone\'?', 'What do you mean open trade to \'everyone\'?', 152274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Less ya wanna be makin\' an offering of dat finger, ya better not be poking me.', '', 152271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The local inn is full up with refugees, but I\'ve a spare room to rent if ye need lodging.', '', 152270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, you find somethin\' shiny, you bring it down to ol\' Jani.', '', 152269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When ya go, can I be havin\' have ya stuff?', '', 152268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May ya always be findin\' friends in low places. Ha!', '', 152266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, champion! These lands are safer for your efforts.', '', 152265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spies have identified a dangerous threat in this area. Seek it out and neutralize it!', '', 152264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reassemble them and kill her pet before we have nothing left to repel Ashvane\'s fleet!', 152263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was such a proud tortollan, if a bit big for his shell, if you know what I mean. A shame he was eaten by a whale shark.', 152262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I almost didn\'t notice that she was snoring. Her voice is so rough as it is. Rather like my second grandson, actually.', 152261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some say I have a tendency to ramble. My sister was far worse, though. Did you know she once fell asleep mid-sentence?', 152260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trashpile just be a place to keep ya stuff while you be going out ta get more stuff.', '', 152259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adventurers are so polite these days.', 152258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, wasn\'t that nice?', 152257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come see old Nola again sometime.', 152256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This reminds me of a story...', 152255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well aren\'t you a spry young thing?', 152254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so nice to see you, dearie.', 152253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transblahgrifier. Makes terrible ideas less bad!', 'Transblahgrifier. Makes terrible ideas less bad!', 152252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaja\'cola, now with real water!', 'Kaja\'cola, now with real water!', 152251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look like you can appreciate a good story.', 152250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find me north of this hellhole once you have the rod. Look for a pile of these dead bastards.', 152249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep dat up, ya gonna see why dey call me a grouch.', '', 152248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, richmon.', '', 152246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like I always say, one mon\'s trash be another mon\'s loa.', '', 152243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too many threats call Nazmir home. At least that\'s one less for now.', 152241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ARE those things? Hero! Our engineers have the just the thing for this. Take it and burn them all out before they swarm our camps!', 152239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a good friend to have. These dunes are a bit safer thanks to you.', '', 152232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our caravan spotted something dangerous out on the dunes. I trust you\'ll handle it.', '', 152231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taelia, $p, this burden must be yours to bear. I will take Samuel and meet you by the Shrine as soon as we are able.', '', 152230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Communing', 'Communing', 152229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you looked smart. Come on, I\'ll meet you there!', 'I knew you looked smart. Come on, I\'ll meet you there!', 152228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck getting rid of \'em! I smuggle goods. I\'m no mercenary.', 'Good luck getting rid of \'em! I smuggle goods. I\'m no mercenary.', 152227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, maybe the Irontide need to go, then!', 'Well, maybe the Irontide need to go, then!', 152226, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irontide are squeezing me for gold, Cesi. I\'m hardly making ends meet.', 'The Irontide are squeezing me for gold, Cesi. I\'m hardly making ends meet.', 152225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... let the hunt begin!', '', 152224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, we can still turn a profit out of here!', 152223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These people were trying to escape. There must be survivors somewhere.', 152222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a test.', 'This is a test.', 152221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should strike now, before word reaches Lord Stormsong.', '', 152220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Nazmir.', '|cFF0000FF(Quest)|r Set sail for Nazmir.', 152219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ship is yours to command, $n. I have the crew prepared for any eventuality.', 152218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where should we focus our efforts?', '', 152217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it happens. Next time you see these guys, just think about claiming some sweet, sweet revenge.', '', 152216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t beat yourself up about it, we still managed a decent haul.', '', 152215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone aboard! We\'ve gotta get outta here before we lose our ship.', '', 152214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t win them all, right? We\'ll get them next time.', '', 152213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_THUNDERKING_OVERCHARGE.BLP:20|tSome of the defenses start |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267931|h[overloading]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_THUNDERKING_OVERCHARGE.BLP:20|tSome of the defenses start |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267931|h[overloading]|h|r!', 152212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, we have got enough. Let us get out of here.', '', 152211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot win every fight. Dat is just life.', '', 152210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! We have to go now. You will get dem next time.', '', 152209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice job out dere today! You showed dem, ah ha ha!', '', 152208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are done! Ay, take a few shots at dat Alliance ship when we swing by. Ha ha ha ha!', '', 152207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De hull is full. Unfurl de sails and head for home!', '', 152206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat is all we need. Time to shove off! Ah ha ha!', '', 152205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather what you can. We will have to shove off soon!', '', 152204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De other ship looks like it will be leaving soon. We must move fast.', '', 152203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like dat Kul Tiran ship is almost full. We are going to have to leave soon.', '', 152202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nearly dere. Just keep your heads down for a little longer.', '', 152201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('De hull is nearly full. Just a bit more and we will be done.', '', 152200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are almost done. You are doing well!', '', 152199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! I cannot stand on my own two feet with dis quake! Dere be a powerful earth elemental out dere, lookin\' for Azerite just like us.', '', 152198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De wind is ripping everything apart... bet dere is an air elemental behind dis. Probably has a load of Azerite too... ripe for de picking!', '', 152197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, dis blizzard must be following a mighty lord of water. Put him out of his misery, already. I hate de cold.', '', 152196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is getting hot out dere. Must be a lord of fire, here to take our Azerite. You will want extinguish him before our sails catch fire. Ha ha.', '', 152195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must be a lord of de elements behind dis. Slay dem... and take their Azerite, too!', '', 152194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De elements are against us today. Probably after de same thing we are.', '', 152193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, we caught de attention of some powerful elementals. Keep a lookout for de leader!', '', 152192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is no normal weather. Dere must be a mighty elemental coming for our Azerite!', '', 152191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got about half de ship left to fill. Keep your eyes sharp!', '', 152190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are doing great out dere. We are halfway done already!', '', 152189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De hull is half full. Keep it up and we will be done in no time!', '', 152188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, things are about to get a bit more interesting!', '', 152187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some new friends just showed up, heh heh.', '', 152186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, keep your eyes open! We have got company out here.', '', 152185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is de place. Get to it, de Azerite\'s waiting for you!', '', 152184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship\'s docked. Don\'t get yourselves killed out dere, heh heh.', '', 152183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De planks are down, friends. We\'ll get de detector online.', '', 152182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, we have got a lot of Azerite over here. You had best check it out.', '', 152181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A huge chunk of Azerite just burst from de ground. Get over dere! Ha ha!', '', 152180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay, de device is going crazy over here! Must be a big load of Azerite out dere.', '', 152179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are up and running now! Marking de Azerite nodes on your map.', '', 152178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De detector is on! Check your map for Azerite concentrations.', '', 152177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just was resting eyes! Back to work now!', '', 152176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK boss, I get back to the mine.', '', 152175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleepy... so sleepy...', '', 152174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! OK, I\'ll get back to work, $n!', '', 152173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dispatch the Hoodoo Hexxers and their Grounding Totems.', 'Dispatch the Hoodoo Hexxers and their Grounding Totems.', 152172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another continent, another demon to hunt.', '', 152171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You never let me down. I like that in a crew.', '', 152170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaand we\'re done here. Great work, let\'s head home.', '', 152169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azerite stores are full! Now let\'s get outta here before they notice we\'re leaving.', '', 152168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we\'re off! Wow, look at that haul. Nice job out there.', '', 152167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde almost have us beat. Gather that Azerite as fast as you can!', '', 152166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I go... to Xibala...', '', 152165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the Horde\'s wrapping up. We\'ll be sitting ducks if we don\'t leave soon.', '', 152164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde\'s almost taken their fill. Just try and grab as much as you can, okay?', '', 152163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mean to alarm you, but the Horde\'s ship looks pretty full. And once they\'re full, we\'ll have to ship out too.', '', 152162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just about done here! Eyes sharp, ears open, you\'ve got this.', '', 152161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our hold\'s glittering and shining! Just a few more of these rocks, and we\'re off.', '', 152160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hull\'s nearly full of Azerite. Get the sails ready! We can head out as soon as you\'re done.', '', 152159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we\'re almost done here! Just a bit more, and we\'ll ship out.', '', 152158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why\'s the ground shaking? I\'m gonna be sick. Listen, we\'ve spotted some earth elementals, and I\'ll wager there\'s an elemental lord behind this. Get in there before I lose my lunch.', '', 152157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sails aren\'t gonna last long in this hurricane. There\'s gotta be an elemental lord of wind sending his minions after the Azerite. Sailing outta here\'s gonna be tough so long as they\'re around.', '', 152156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, h-heroes? A lord of water\'s sent his troops to steal our Azerite, and I\'m f-f-freezing. Get in there and take them down! I didn\'t pack for this.', '', 152155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is getting HOT. What in the world is... oh. Well, that explains it. A lord of fire\'s sent his forces after the Azerite. Great. Good. Super.', '', 152154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re at the halfway mark! Keep that momentum going and we\'ll be out of here in no time.', '', 152153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hull\'s half full of Azerite. Keep it up, you are doing just great.', '', 152152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tread on sacred ground!', '', 152151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 152150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The survey pointed to these ruins. The Horde camp is just down the hill to the northeast, so we best get in an\' out as quick as we can.\n\nWe\'ll get the Breath of Xibala before they can, I guarantee it.\n\nSpeak when ye be ready to start surveying.', '', 152149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got the detector working! Check your map to see where the Azerite lies.', '', 152148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Detector\'s online. I\'ll mark the Azerite locations on the map. You\'re welcome.', '', 152147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just spotted a huge cluster of Azerite crystals close by. Must be causing this quake.', '', 152146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow. That is a lot of Azerite showing up near us. Better check it out before the Horde does.', '', 152145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anchor\'s away and planks are down! We\'ll get the Azerite detector online, you handle the bad guys.', '', 152144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship\'s docked! Enjoy your adventure while we spin up the ol\' Azerite detector.', '', 152143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here, and this wind\'s not doing my hair any favors. Let\'s get the Azerite and get out quick, yeah?', '', 152142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, so, it looks like we\'ve got a lord of the elements here looking for the same Azerite we are. I\'m just gonna hang out below deck while you deal with this... situation.', '', 152141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the Azerite\'s caught the eye of some elemental forces. There\'s probably a lord after our stash. But finders keepers, am I right?', '', 152140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess the Horde found this place, too. Their ship just docked.', '', 152139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, looks like we\'ve got Horde. Watch your backs out there, okay?', '', 152138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a ship with gold... everything. Yep, definitely Zandalari. The Horde\'s here, so keep an eye out.', '', 152137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to be an adventurer like you... and then I got better. Ha Ha.', '', 152136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you\'ve seen some action. We should swap war stories.', '', 152135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember the great war of King Raka and his sister Queen Tola. Or at least, I remember some of it. Well, I am mostly sure it happened. About fifty-fifty.', '', 152134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You remind me of this other fellow with whom I stormed the beaches of Krasarang during the third dynasty. Shame what the mogu did to him.', '', 152133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not Swainbeak\'s time! Awk!', '', 152132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is why I don\'t like partners.', '', 152131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you called yourself Felbane I thought that meant you were the bane of fel, not the other way around.', '', 152130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to blow them down!', '', 152129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Let\'s go to the jungle\' you said. \'See the sights\' you said. I should have known your blind spot would get us into trouble.', '', 152128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we die, I am blaming you for this.', '', 152127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard you might be skulking about.$b$bThanks to an... indiscretion... on Marius\' part, not mine, we had to come to this humid hell hole filled with things that like chewing on bones to find this nasty demon.$b$bHelp us and you can have whatever there is of value off of her corpse.$b$bWe just want the piece of paper she has on her. Nothing worth reading.', '', 152126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awk! All yours!', '', 152125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swainbeak get some fish?', '', 152124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop hitting! My human!', '', 152123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You people never learn.', '', 152122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if you hadn\'t told them so often. Awk!', '', 152121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
