('', 'Back off, bird, I don\'t need your help!', 152117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That didn\'t even hurt. Is that really the best you can do, shark bait?', 152116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HA! I\'ve been looking for a chance to blow off a little steam!', 152115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
