('Zug-zug.', 'Zug-zug.', 152030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102745, 102746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength and honor.', 'Strength and honor.', 152029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102747, 102748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is everyone from Azeroth this annoying?', 'Is everyone from Azeroth this annoying?', 152028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102749, 102750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hobby is killing things that bother me. Are you SURE you want to keep poking me?', 'My hobby is killing things that bother me. Are you SURE you want to keep poking me?', 152027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102751, 102752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look stranger, you\'re making me angry. You wouldn\'t like me when I\'m angry.', 'Look stranger, you\'re making me angry. You wouldn\'t like me when I\'m angry.', 152026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102753, 102754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ORC...SMASH!!!!!', 'ORC...SMASH!!!!!', 152025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102755, 102756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cookin\' up fresh caught-fish. Dun\' get much bettah den that.', '', 152024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We been travelin\' ta get away from it all. Funny how we only evah get so far. You jus\' can\' beat de view.', 152023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did it break the chains?!', 'How did it break the chains?!', 152017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s not stick around to find out!', 'Let\'s not stick around to find out!', 152016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood contagion!', '', 152015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examining Flower', 'Examining Flower', 152014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Avatar of Sethraliss is no longer hexxed!  Restore it to full health to disable the defenses!', 'The Avatar of Sethraliss is no longer hexxed!  Restore it to full health to disable the defenses!', 152013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evolve!', '', 152012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infect!', '', 152011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pestilence spreads!', '', 152010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Violent gestation!', '', 152009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consume husks!', '', 152008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! You Horde have it comin\' now.', '', 152007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fatal strain. Contagion successful.', '', 152006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lost my disguise. Do you have another scroll?', 'I have lost my disguise. Do you have another scroll?', 152005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jungle Gulper leaps away into the water!', '', 152004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fester!', '', 152003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ripe for infection!', '', 152002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outbreak inevitable...', '', 152001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice. BAH. Nothing nice about it.', 152000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you found the dastardly mastermind Mista Nice yet?', 151999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh hosts!', '', 151998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now then... time to carve a trophy.', '', 151990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pearl is ours! With it, our vessels will become predators of the sea.', '', 151989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy this victory. It will be your last.', 151987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the law of the wild. The strong take from the weak.', '', 151986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your senses sharp. Some unseen force stalks us.', '', 151985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance must not claim this prize. All who oppose us will fall!', '', 151983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got my business back, so yeah. Having Cesi as Boss would mean we\'d start making some real money around here again.', 151982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you support Cesi Loosecannon?', 'Will you support Cesi Loosecannon?', 151981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place used to be way more profitable.', 151980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get out of here before we\'re the cornered ones. Come on!', 151979, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 110209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Stormsong will rule this drowned realm. The Tidemother\'s wrath will ensure it.', '', 151978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fleet... will be hers...', '', 151977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was merely toying with them, my lord. It shall be done!', '', 151976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our destiny is nearly upon us. They must not enter the Shrine of the Storm.', '', 151975, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 110183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at what you have become. All of this bloodshed is on your hands!', 151974, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 110208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scroll floats and hums, visions of other places just obscured by magic.', '', 151973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('World soul survival: improbable...', '', 151972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planetary infection imminent.', '', 151971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should let the Irontide have the treasure.', 'We should let the Irontide have the treasure.', 151970, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\70_inscription_vantus_rune_azure:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267891|h[Swiftness Ward]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\70_inscription_vantus_rune_azure:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:267891|h[Swiftness Ward]|h|r!', 151969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Just stab him>', '<Just stab him>', 151968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Are you serious?', '...Are you serious?', 151967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s outrageous! I\'m not paying that!', 'That\'s outrageous! I\'m not paying that!', 151966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Floor space for the night is fifty gold. Sixty if you want to be by the fire. Bring your own blankets. \n\nBeds are a hundred gold. \n\nBinding your hearthstone is seventy five gold a week.\n\nDon\'t like it? \n\n<He scoffs and crosses his arms with a smirk.>\n\nToo bad. Those are the going rates.', '', 151965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The depths spoke of your coming... and your demise!', '', 151964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 113787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Massive breach detected.', '', 151963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must gather our forces and stop de rot at its source.', 151962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De titan bought us time, but G\'huun will not stay contained for long.', 151961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Virulent specimen detected. Containment priority one.', '', 151960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Devour! Consume! Spread!', '', 151959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis thing is looking for its ma\'da? Let us hope it leads us to something dat can stop de spread of dis blight.', 151958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'huun containment failing. M.O.T.H.E.R. not responding.', '', 151957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If dis spreads to de surface, we will not be able to contain it.', 151954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have never seen dis form of corruption before.', 151953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It must not be allowed to reach de surface! Destroy it now!', 151952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ack! What manner of creature is dis?!', 151951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guard yourselves. Who knows what lurks in dese caves.', 151950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls are scattered, but we must find de source of de rot and destroy it.', 151949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We bring a gift for you, great loa of death!', '', 151948, 14, 56823, 0, 64, 0, 98530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it means we get some new faces in here, yeah I\'ll do that.', '', 151947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
