('I cannot trade that.', '', 151555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot use that.', '', 151554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is not equipped.', '', 151553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Arathi belongs to ME. You and your Horde will pay for your trespass, Eitrigg.', '', 151552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That must be equipped first.', '', 151551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trollbane! You\'d better keep moving. Arathi belongs to the Horde now.', '', 151550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, however, we need to fortify this position. Get us some lumber and iron.', '', 151549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush this enemy!', '', 151548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed it should, Lady Liadrin. I look forward to enacting justice on a misguided paladin of the Horde.', '', 151547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On my target!', '', 151546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring my foe down!', '', 151545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come this way.', '', 151544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let an orc lead.', '', 151543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turalyon? This should prove interesting...', 151542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me.', '', 151541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 151540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m wounded!', '', 151539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fix me, healer!', '', 151538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just stand there--help me!', '', 151537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me now!', '', 151536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold here.', '', 151535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay put.', '', 151534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is with us, Rokhan. We fear no shadows.', '', 151533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch da shadows, Turalyon. Me an\' da Horde be comin\' for you...', '', 151532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die with honor!', '', 151531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 151530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mok-thora ka!', '', 151529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush our enemies!', '', 151528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to purge you and your Horde army from the hills of Arathi, Eitrigg.', '', 151527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break their lines!', '', 151526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back or die!', '', 151525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight another day!', '', 151524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! Get away!', '', 151523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that Alliance scum I smell on my battlefield? Looks like it\'s time for a fight.', '', 151522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ready!', '', 151521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check in from time to time. I\'d hate to see the iron in that chest go to waste.', '', 151520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn them all!', '', 151519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open fire!', '', 151518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll be comin\' soon. We need ta build up this base, and that means securin\' lumber and iron.', '', 151517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Horde\'ll be holdin\' their swollen arses after I\'m done kicking \'em! Hah!', '', 151516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand down, Muradin. The Horde holds this territory.', 151515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I\'m lookin\' for a pack o\' Horde mongrels to try me new blade on!', '', 151514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatchu doin\' here, Muradin? Ya be lookin\' for a fight?', '', 151513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you go back to yer barren wasteland, ye flea-bitten orc!', '', 151512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muradin! Your dwarves have overstepped their bounds. Go back to your mountain.', '', 151511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance will soon be at our door. We need to move fast. Secure wood and iron, so we can establish a foothold.', 151510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t delude yourself, old man. We\'re here to take Stromgarde back.', 151509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Liadrin! Welcome to Arathi. I trust you\'re here to surrender?', '', 151508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve been away for too long, Turalyon. The world\'s moved on without you.', 151507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Horde invaders, with a paladin in command? What has this world come to?', '', 151506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d like to see you try, Muradin. This is Horde territory now.', 151505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye best stop right there, lass, \'less ye want a face full o\' Alliance mortar shells.', '', 151504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Danath Trollbane... you an\' I got a bone ta pick! I be seein\' you out on da battlefield...', '', 151503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare invade Arathi? With a TROLL as your commander? You\'ve made a terrible mistake.', '', 151502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Green-skin\"? Ohoho... now you\'ve made me mad.', '', 151501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reclaiming', 'Reclaiming', 151500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Klause snorts a laugh>\n\nAye, you probably have. Got a fair number of relatives here an\' there.', '', 151499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare invade Stromgarde, rightful home of the Trollbanes? Get out of my sight, green-skin.', '', 151498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we claim what is rightfully ours. For the Alliance!', '', 151497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stromgarde has been despoiled by invaders for too long.', '', 151496, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 151495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Alliance! Today, we reclaim the noble city of Stromgarde from the monstrous Horde.', '', 151494, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we retake the hills of Arathi... for the Alliance!', '', 151493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Load yer rifles and draw yer steel.', '', 151492, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arathi will be ours! For the Horde!', 151491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Focus on the task at hand. First we capture Ar\'gorok, then onward to Stromgarde!', 151490, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 104539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
