('Da barracks be ready. Dis war gonna be won on da backs o\' da grunts.', '', 151460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Stronghold is now a Fortress!', '', 151459, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Great Hall is now a Stronghold!', '', 151458, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Altar of Storms has been completed.', '', 151457, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a barracks, now train those grunts!', '', 151456, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not a chance. Blood Knights, strike them down!', 151455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' dey don\'t call me shadow hunter for nothin\' either. Now, assassins! Show yahselves!', '', 151454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know all about your \"Alliance justice.\" Wind riders, show them the meaning of Horde fury!', '', 151453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never!', 151452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None o\' dis land be yours, Trollbane. Da trolls be here long before you.', '', 151451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! That\'s what you think.', '', 151450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve had enough of your posturing. Blood Knights, strike with the fury of the Light!', 151449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Light can\'t be savin\' ya now. Shadow hunters, show yahselves!', '', 151448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind riders, attack from the skies!', '', 151447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll see about that, Turalyon. You still have to deal with me.', 151446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' I gonna be waitin\'.', '', 151445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not if I can help it, Turalyon.', '', 151444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It won\'t be enough, dwarf. Blood Knights, to arms!', 151443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya walked right into my trap, Muradin. Shadow hunters, show yahselves!', '', 151442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, wind riders! Attack!', '', 151441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never.', 151440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch ya back, Muradin!', '', 151439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t be for long, dwarf. For the Horde!', '', 151438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost this city once. I won\'t lose it again, especially to the likes of you. Defenders, show them the strength of Stromgarde!', '', 151437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me safe now. Back to work.', '', 151436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is at my side. Defenders, forward!', '', 151435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold Stromgarde to my last, Liadrin. Defenders, stand strong!', '', 151434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save your celebrations, blood elf. You still have to deal with me.', '', 151433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... I\'m counting on it.', '', 151432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pfah! The high ground is overrated!', '', 151431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This old fool still has a few tricks up his sleeve, troll. Defenders, show them the strength of Stromgarde!', '', 151430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light will always defeat Shadow, Rokhan. Defenders, forward!', '', 151429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on, Rokhan! I\'ve been waitin\' for ya. Defenders, show \'em what we\'re made of!', '', 151428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Shut your mouth, troll. The Alliance will prevail over your filthy army of monsters.', '', 151427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet the Light still shines over Stromgarde.', '', 151426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon enough, laddie. I figure I\'ll let me riflemen soften ye up a bit first.', '', 151425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stromgarde still stands, orc. I\'ll enjoy watching your corpse float in my moat. Defenders, show them the strength of our city!', '', 151424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve won and lost thousands more battles than you\'ve ever seen, Eitrigg. And this battle is far from lost. Defenders, forward!', '', 151423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll have to get to it first, laddie. Defenders, push \'em back!', '', 151422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. You and your kind are all the same. You\'ll die on your knees, just like the rest.', '', 151421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have patience, orc. It shall come soon enough.', '', 151420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I can smell yer breath from down here! Bring it on, orc!', '', 151419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, siege engines, blast down that gate. I\'ll have that blood elf\'s head on a pike!', '', 151418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, siege engines, blast down that gate, and bring Rokhan to me! They don\'t call me Trollbane for nothing...', '', 151417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, siege engines, blast down that gate. This vile orc will know the meaning of Alliance justice!', '', 151416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Perch is ours. This is your last chance, blood elf. Surrender, and I might just spare your life.', '', 151415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have secured High Perch. We will soon sack Ar\'gorok, and reclaim what is rightfully ours!', '', 151414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Perch is ours. We\'re well on our way to dealing with these interlopers.', '', 151413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control over Galson\'s Lode means a limitless supply of iron. That should come in handy.', '', 151412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect. Highlands Mill will provide us the lumber we need to rebuild Stromgarde.', '', 151411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our chance. Siege the gate! Exact retribution on these Horde intruders!', '', 151410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our chance. Siege the gate! The Light has come for you, Rokhan!', '', 151409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
