('The elements... cannot be stopped...', '', 151258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your seals will boil, your sky will crack, your mountains will rise up, and we will return!', '', 151257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dawn of the elements is coming!', '', 151256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time is running out, mortals.', '', 151255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With these gems, we will destroy you at last.', '', 151254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements will rule again!', '', 151253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The golden minerals empower us!', '', 151252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world will be ours again!', '', 151251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you face me on my own plane?', '', 151250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me watch. Hands too full!', '', 151249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Orgrimmar.', 'Send me to Orgrimmar.', 151248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, good to be seein\' ya. I be stayin\' here for now ta be near Krag\'wa.\n\nMe parents be tellin\' me all kinds of stories about da frog loa. I be honored ta guard him from da blood trolls.', 151247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should do. Thank you!', '', 151246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, fetch me the cannon balls so that I may keep firing!', '', 151245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drahnor. Draynor? Draanur. Draenor. <Sigh>. I\'m just gonna say I\'m from Outland.', 151244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can call me uncorrupted, but I prefer to think of myself as an organic orc.', 151243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dyed my hair green once. Warchief Hellscream was NOT amused.', 151242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of this wibbly-wobbly, timey-wimey... BLAH! Just let me smash stuff!', 151241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shattered Hand are legendary warriors, but don\'t ever ask one of them for a back rub. Trust me on this one... <pained sounds>', 151240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth has so many rules about who you can stab, who you can\'t stab... who you can punch, who you can\'t punch... You guys need to loosen up!', 151239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey... aren\'t you the one who left that abandoned garrison littering up Frostfire?', 151238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay as long as ya like but remember; you break it you buy it, pal!', 151237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before we go any further, I need to know... How high is your pain threshold?', 151236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just because I\'m enjoying your company doesn\'t mean I don\'t also want to punch you.', 151235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Bleeding Hollow shaman just flirted with me. At least, I think he did. Either he was winking suggestively or he had just sacrificed an eye.', 151234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The last person to hit on me learned what \"hitting on\" really means.', 151233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A green orc gave me a candy heart that said \"I fel for you.\" I told him he could keep his demon\'s blood and clobbered him with my mace.', 151232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any idea if Saurfang is single? He\'s got that silver fox thing going on...', 151231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t need a Dark Portal... you\'ve already invaded my heart.', 151230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... regret that.', 151229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic! You will fall before the Mag\'har!', 151228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you want something done right...', 151227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda asked... for that promotion...', 'Looks like... I got burned...', 151226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103760, 103761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bury me... with my money...', 'No stoppin\' death... or taxes...', 151225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103758, 103759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... smarts...', 'You\'re gonna... pay for that...', 151224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103756, 103757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasn\'t... worth it...', 'Wasn\'t... worth it...', 151223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s my... hazard pay...', 'Wasn\'t... worth it...', 151222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103754, 103755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am grateful.', 151221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thank you.', 151220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief cleared us for collateral damage. Burn, baby!', 'Warchief cleared us for collateral damage. Burn, baby!', 151219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collateral damage approved! Burn, baby!', 'You got a price on your head... and I mean to collect!', 151218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103752, 103753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am in your debt.', 151217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will fall before me!', 151216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never... stop her...', 151215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tried to save the wrong town, pal.', 'You just made a big mistake!', 151214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103750, 103751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the moons of Draenor!', 151213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna enjoy this!', 'Baby, I love burnin\' stuff!', 151212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103748, 103749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
