('My brothers and sisters once tended to this land as kin of the trees. That age has long since passed.\n\nThere are a few of us who have not forgotten that path.\n\nThe Ashenwood Grove was one of our sanctuaries. A respite from the corruption that slowly seeps through the Crimson Forest.\n\nWith the infestation that grows in its shadows, it seems that its age has also passed. I now watch as it fades, living on only in the memories of those it once nurtured.', '', 151017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
