('Hush, ya don\'t wear shoes.', '', 150925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe just one? I could use some new shoes.', 150924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, little sista!', '', 150923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey will never notice. No one is sayin\' to charge into de camp, but takin\' out a few would not hurt!', 150922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The queen has ordered your death!', '', 150921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to Azshara!', '', 150920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our destiny is at hand!', '', 150919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have the glory of your death!', '', 150918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall oppose Queen Azshara!', '', 150917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ring of Tides is ours!', '', 150916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to stay here. If ya run off and get us killed, dere be no one to report back.', '', 150914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot comprehend our power!', '', 150913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My cabbages!!!', '', 150912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time ta nab another gryphon. Mount up!', '', 150911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Roughneck work ain\'t always glamorous, but it pays.', '', 150908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got a big order fer gryphon saddles, but we need more fur. Get ta work!', '', 150907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Less of \'em up high means less of \'em ta come down the mountain. Good on ye!', '', 150906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wendigo numbers been risin\' on the glacier. Get up there and do somethin\' about that!', '', 150905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the power of the Tide Pearl, our fleets will be unstoppable.', '', 150904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s like you think I\'m made of gold or something!', 150903, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me sorry, boss...', '', 150902, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dumb lout! Those were expensive!', 150901, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes. You\'ve returned hope to the Kul Tiran people.', '', 150900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the dark presence receding. The shrine will be whole again.', '', 150899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not listen to its whispers! This horror will try to twist your souls!', '', 150898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Tidemother!', '', 150897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary, heroes. Some unseen evil still lurks in the dark. We must press on to remove its influence from the shrine.', '', 150896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is not right. Darkness still festers here.', '', 150895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You turned against the tide, Master, and now you have been pulled underneath it.', '', 150894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I shall cast your bodies to the blackened depths, to be crushed for eternity.', '', 150893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never.', '', 150892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the last time, join me, or die.', '', 150891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! We must return to the sea, and Queen Azshara will grant us the power to do so!', '', 150890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master! Stop this madness at once! The Kul Tiran fleet must not fall to darkness!', '', 150889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would seem you have guests, Lord Stormsong.', 150888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just show respect and let him do de talking... and hopefully he will not throw you off de pyramid.', 150887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kul Tiran fleet is nearly yours, my queen.', '', 150886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sea to sea, ashes to ashes, tide to tide. May your souls find peaceful currents.', '', 150885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, heroes! Stop them before the fleet is lost!', '', 150884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Corruption Protocol', 'Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Corruption Protocol', 150883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Deception Protocol', 'Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Deception Protocol', 150882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once our ritual is complete, the Kul Tiran fleet will belong to Queen Azshara!', 150881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Brother Pike. You have arrived just in time to witness our victory.', '', 150880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormsong has twisted this sacred place. We must press on and undo his foul work.', '', 150879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voices?', 'Voices?', 150878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully. Some dark presence watches us even now.', '', 150877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shrine must be cleansed of Lord Stormsong\'s evil, heroes.', '', 150876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master! Don\'t forsake me! Nooooo!', 150875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya really tink you gonna stand against da might of G\'huun? Suffer for ya arrogance!', 150874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are voices in the mud!', 'There are voices in the mud!', 150873, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are broken.\n\nThe light of Rezan has left us. Only a handful of those that followed the great king of the loa still have any sort of power, and even they are suspect.\n\nOur life was devotion itself. Now who do we become?', 150872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for some upgrades!', '', 150871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'m done fightin\' fair.', '', 150870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outstanding! Our soldiers will put those supplies to good use. Well done!', '', 150869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts report that a Zandalari cargo boat has been hijacked by a blood troll raiding party. Slay them and recover the supplies as our own.', '', 150868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up boys, looks like we got us some solicitors!', '', 150867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Go find yourself a stylist!', '', 150866, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Oi, $n! We\'ve got a quest for ya!', 150865, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump!', 'Jump!', 150864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya can\'t be hidin\' from Bwonsamdi, little ting.', '', 150863, 0, 56710, 603, 64, 0, 109305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someting about ya seem off... Ah, da stench of a demon hunter.', '', 150862, 0, 56709, 603, 64, 0, 109299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
