('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing is under attack!', 150856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aDrywhisker Mine is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aDrywhisker Mine is under attack!', 150855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHatchet Ridge is under attack!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Horde-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHatchet Ridge is under attack!', 150854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to reach our advance scouts, clear out these flying pests on the double!', 'We need to reach our advance scouts, clear out these flying pests on the double!', 150853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aValorcall Pass has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aValorcall Pass has been lost!', 150852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNewstead has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNewstead has been lost!', 150851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aCircle of Elements has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aCircle of Elements has been lost!', 150850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHigh Perch has been lost!', 150849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Banner-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aNorthfold Crossing has been lost!', 150848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not be dreaming now, mon.', '', 150847, 0, 56708, 603, 64, 0, 109300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, da spirits be with ya now, mon.', '', 150846, 0, 56707, 603, 64, 0, 109306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a death knight. Ya should come see MY death gate!', '', 150845, 0, 56706, 603, 64, 0, 109298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lands are next to fall!', 'Your lands are next to fall!', 150844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103647, 103648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the sands from spreading!', 'You cannot stop the sands from spreading!', 150843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103645, 103646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aDrywhisker Mine has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-Mine-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aDrywhisker Mine has been lost!', 150842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Ya didn\'t roll out of dat one.', '', 150841, 0, 56705, 603, 64, 0, 109303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have dominion over all!', 'We have dominion over all!', 150840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103643, 103644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will eradicate you like insects!', 'We will eradicate you like insects!', 150839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103641, 103642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be tryin\' ta feign death, mon? Shame...', '', 150838, 0, 56704, 603, 64, 0, 109301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Emperor!', 'For the Emperor!', 150837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103633, 103634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tink ya followed da wrong light, mon.', '', 150836, 0, 56703, 603, 64, 0, 109304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat blink didn\'t get ya very far, did it?', '', 150835, 0, 56702, 603, 64, 0, 109302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHatchet Ridge has been lost!', '|A:Warfronts-FieldMapIcons-Alliance-LumberMill-Minimap:25:23:0:0|aHatchet Ridge has been lost!', 150834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! I mean, they look terrible, but definitely different!', '', 150833, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that adventurer sure looks different.', 150832, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it\'s another one of them \"heroes\". Smells like somebody was standing in fire!', '', 150831, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What in the world is that smell?!', 150830, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Waldorf that ain\'t no quilboar, it\'s just another one of them \"heroes\"!', 150829, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, all dat armor didn\'t help ya much, did it?', '', 150828, 0, 56701, 603, 64, 0, 109308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, Statler, hand me my sword! There\'s a quilboar comin\' down the road!', '', 150827, 7, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww, did ya lose your little shiny soulstone, eh?', '', 150826, 0, 56700, 603, 64, 0, 109307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re right! It looks all bad!', 150825, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see the outfit on $n? It doesn\'t look half bad!', '', 150824, 7, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, ya come ta spend some quality time with Bwonsamdi?', '', 150823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Now dat was an impressive death!', '', 150822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d say they\'re looking worse for wear... but I think they always look that bad!', '', 150821, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well well well, look what the saurolisk dragged in! It\'s $n!', 150820, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah where\'d that set drop? Off a trogg?!', 150819, 7, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Statler, check out the gear on $n!', '', 150818, 7, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it is! Boy, they smell worse than I imagined! Ha!', '', 150817, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi, Waldorf! Is that the \"famous\" $r that showed up with Jaina?', 150816, 7, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah! You stink! Hahaha!', 150815, 7, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! Yeah, you, the $r with the face!', '', 150814, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen horses with better transmog!', '', 150813, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi! $n! You think that helm goes with those boots?', 150812, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wished to know something else.', 'I wished to know something else.', 150811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ancient Drust. Their hatred for Kul Tirans transcended their mortal lives. Even their echoes from beyond loathe our very existence. \n\nI pity whatever fool brought them forth.', 150810, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vengeful dead?', 'The vengeful dead?', 150809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be eradicated!', '', 150808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The magic these witches use is ancient and deeply corrupted. They have twisted the wildlife to serve them, upsetting the balance. Their wretched creations house spirits of the vengeful dead.', 150807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere is joy in de hunt, and satisfaction in vengeance!', 150806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese loa-killing traitors still seek to sully de Temple of Rezan. Old K\'zlotec will teach dem what happens when you spit in de face of de loa of kings.', 150805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naza bul rexil qalic ul\'.', '', 150804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has happened to the forest?', 'What has happened to the forest?', 150803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ca\' lish!', '', 150802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may find him in one of the caves nearby. Good luck, $n.', 150801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greenstalker was weakened but it is only a matter of time before he returns to the hunt.', 150800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ug\' bwafa qilikx za!', '', 150799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will forever be welcome within these walls.', '', 150798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, poor little thing, ya be needin\' some help from old Bwonsamdi?', '', 150797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ranishu have poisoned my children. They are weak and clinging to life. Use my power to save them, as you have saved me.', '', 150796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hul bala miz rilakich...', '', 150795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tsk, tsk. I did not expect ta be seein\' you here so soon.', '', 150794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 150793, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', 'FOR THE HORDE!', 150792, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am superior!', '', 150791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Horde, ready your blades! Today, we march on the kaldorei!', '', 150790, 0, 0, 5, 94, 0, 114213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me guess... ya got in over ya head?', '', 150789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Il qul zerakish!', '', 150788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should now be fixed. Journey to Sylvanas in Orgrimmar to begin your epic shenanigans.', '', 150787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I started Nazmir but can\'t start Zuldazar. Please fix me.', 'I started Nazmir but can\'t start Zuldazar. Please fix me.', 150786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you need?', '', 150785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be to our advantage to keep it that way.', '', 150784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep those Waycrest loyalists on their heels, and you will be rewarded.', '', 150783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your best crew and sail for Chandlery Wharf. From there you will pillage, loot, and plunder your way through their lands, depleting their supplies while filling our coffers.', '', 150781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Leadfist, our benefactor has informed me that House Waycrest is falling into a state of disrepair.', '', 150779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why aren\'t you at your post?', 'Why aren\'t you at your post?', 150778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to choose Kimbul as my loa.', 'I wish to choose Kimbul as my loa.', 150777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The very Heart of Azeroth!', '', 150776, 0, 0, 0, 102, 3200, 111030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This shrine was built as a tribute to Kimbul, the lord of beasts.>', '<This shrine was built as a tribute to Kimbul, the lord of beasts.>', 150775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah?', 'Yeah?', 150773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be her Speaker, but you are her champion. And she needs ye tae fight fer her.', '', 150772, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 111029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth calls tae ye, champion. She offers a gift... one born of her own essence.', '', 150771, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 111028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! We must get to de safety of de inner temple!', 'Free! We must get to de safety of de inner temple!', 150770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... what happened to me?', 'Wha... what happened to me?', 150769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun! Grant me ya might!', 150768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one on de other side, friend.', 'I owe you one on de other side, friend.', 150767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da end be comin\'!', 150766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scream for mercy!', 150765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All gonna serve da master!', 150764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, free from those accursed bones!', 'Finally, free from those accursed bones!', 150763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now de time has come to relieve Harlan Sweete of his riches.', '', 150762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Chaos Protocol', 'Titan Discs Activated: Engaging Chaos Protocol', 150761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give it back! I swear!', 'I\'ll give it back! I swear!', 150760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104827, 104828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And dat is de end of Harlan Sweete. Now de seas are ours for de taking!', '', 150759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaah!', 'Aaaah!', 150758, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104825, 104826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stole that, fair and square!', 'I stole that, fair and square!', 150757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104823, 104824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I knew betting on you would be de smart play!', '', 150756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scatter!', 'Scatter!', 150755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104821, 104822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Stranger danger!', 'Ah! Stranger danger!', 150754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104819, 104820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about we earn some gold by cracking a couple of skulls?', '', 150753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De island is on lockdown till de festivities in de fighting pit are over.', '', 150752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat is good work... but introducing Harlan to some cold steel will be far tougher.', '', 150750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you get an invitation, dis job will be easy. But rush in swinging at three of de most feared pirate captains all at once, things will be tough. Your decision, richmon.', '', 150749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even fish drink like de Bilge Rats! You keep up with dis zoo, Captain Eudora will want you at dat meeting.', '', 150748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Blacktooth Brawlers love hardening their knuckles in a fight. You loosen their teeth, Captain Raoul is going to want you at de meeting.', '', 150747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard de captains are meeting. If we get into dat gathering, we cut off all de heads from dis hydra at once.', '', 150746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war ain\'t gonna win itself. We\'ve got work to do!', '', 150745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Den we will deal with Harlan Sweete for good.', '', 150744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is de plan. Drain de Cutwaters, purge de Bilge Rats, break de Black Tooth, and dismantle de Irontide.', '', 150743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he succeeds, he will command a fleet dat threatens our interests on de seas.', '', 150742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan is using de Irontide to bring de other pirate crews under his banner.', '', 150741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me. I feel de call of Bwonsamdi from within de temple. Let us go.', 'Thank you for freeing me. I feel de call of Bwonsamdi from within de temple. Let us go.', 150740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I would be an ugly skeleton forever. I must return to de temple quickly!', 'I thought I would be an ugly skeleton forever. I must return to de temple quickly!', 150739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Bwonsamdi... temple... quickly....', 'Return to Bwonsamdi... temple... quickly....', 150738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My remaining senses are dulled from their nasty ritual... help me to de temple steps.', 'My remaining senses are dulled from their nasty ritual... help me to de temple steps.', 150737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, mon! I\'m fading fast. Please help me to Bwonsamdi\'s temple.', 'Thanks, mon! I\'m fading fast. Please help me to Bwonsamdi\'s temple.', 150736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you have there, richmon? A shiny trinket for ol\' Jani? Bring it closer...', '', 150735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the only one around here that knows math! So I\'m watching the expenses, and making sure everyone\'s hands stay in the right pockets.', '', 150734, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('Peons are the backbone of this war.', '', 150733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to come back in one piece.', '', 150732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of de blood trolls.', '', 150731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself, now. I need you alive!', '', 150730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark times for Zandalar.', '', 150729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. I HATE blood trolls.', '', 150728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we going to get out of dis one?', '', 150727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph! The Horde got what was coming to them. I\'ll take this contraption up to Arom\'s Stand and see if anyone has any use for it. Good work.', '', 150726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to defend Zandalar.', 'I am ready to defend Zandalar.', 150719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! Our ground forces are waiting below.', '', 150718, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The forest cries in agony. Can you hear it?', 150717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are coming home!', 'We are coming home!', 150716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you didn\'t need my help! We got back as quick as we could!', '', 150715, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daryl and I been coming up into these hills our whole lives.  We can survive up here a lot longer than any Horde.', '', 150714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 100, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to go back to Zuldazar and be killed, or stay here and be killed by raptors?', 'Do you want to go back to Zuldazar and be killed, or stay here and be killed by raptors?', 150713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not going to Vol\'dun, you hear me? I\'m going to live my life back in de city!', '', 150712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh turtles Emma! You gotta pay me my share now!', 150711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you have there, richmon? A shiny trinket for ol\' Jani? Bring it closer...', '', 150710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xul krass qi\' UN skush!', 150709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skitsh qi\'uthik illith!', 150708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The carnage is dripping through the floor boards.', 150707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why not join me in the basement, and marvel at death\'s beauty?', 150706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear, it seems you have slaughtered my entire household.', 150705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You see an image of a young troll, watching what must be a funeral procession. He looks wide-eyed and innocent.>', '<You see an image of a young troll, watching what must be a funeral procession. He looks wide-eyed and innocent.>', 150704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from the gate! It\'s not safe up here.', 'Stay away from the gate! It\'s not safe up here.', 150703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon growls at you. Return to Raal or be dismounted!', 'Kua\'fon growls at you. Return to Raal or be dismounted!', 150702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Writhe in agony!', 150701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will rend your souls!', 150700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using that thing made my hair turn green!', 150699, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your screams will echo for eternity!', 150698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hold dominion over all!', 150697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiro, they\'re alive! We can\'t just leave them here...', 150696, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, scavenge what you can. Leave the bodies for the vultures.', '', 150695, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die in these dunes...', '', 150694, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 107663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trespassers!', '', 150693, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 109607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do your part, General, and I will do mine.', '', 150692, 0, 0, 1, 70, 5684, 107662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need ta speed things up. Da King has nosey visitors... dat could pose a problem.', '', 150691, 0, 0, 1, 70, 6573, 109606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There was a guard at Tol Dagor, looked just like you!', 150690, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think you could sneak me into the \nBank of Boralus?', 150689, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you ever worry about radiation?', 150688, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got any useful skills like forgery or safe cracking?', 150687, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The storm has broken, and I am myself again. Thank you.', 150686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your lives were meaningless, and in death you are forgotten.', 150685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defilers!', 150684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Restore me and I will disable them!', 150683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hex is shattered, but the temple\'s defenses have awakened!', 150682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your torment will be endless!', 150681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will enjoy watching you fry!', '', 150680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, vermin!', '', 150679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcing slash!', '', 150678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Severed!', '', 150677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loser!', '', 150676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattered like glass!', '', 150675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not like I\'m scared or nothin\', I just don\'t feel like it!', '', 150674, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can stand against our empire!', '', 150673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I can climb it. I\'m not a weakling!', '', 150672, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t need to prove anything to you!', '', 150671, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon Abraham. I\'ve seen kids do it.', '', 150670, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon, it ain\'t that high.', '', 150669, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bet ya can\'t climb it.', '', 150668, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sh not funny! Get me down from \'ere!', '', 150667, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit muckin\' around and help me down!', '', 150666, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jusht help me down!', '', 150665, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave while you still can!', 'Leave while you still can!', 150664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re not taking me!', 'They\'re not taking me!', 150663, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They can have my share!', 'They can have my share!', 150662, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll kill all the Irontide!', 'We\'ll kill all the Irontide!', 150661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their not taking me!', 'Their not taking me!', 150660, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t work for pirates!', 'I don\'t work for pirates!', 150659, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will flatten your head!', 150658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Havin\' fun hangin\' \'bout? Ha!', '', 150657, 7, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Havin\' shome trouble there, Abraham?', '', 150656, 7, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, idiot! Yer shtuck up there!', '', 150655, 7, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss gave her own life to save our world. If Mythrax returns, her valiant sacrifice will have been for naught...', '', 150654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107517, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in death, Mythrax\'s essence remains strong here. I fear for what will become of our world should he rise once more...', '', 150653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107516, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a dark presence here. We should be on our guard...', '', 150652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107515, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey begin their journey to greatness.', 150651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time for dese little ones to be tested, so dey can begin working towards their destiny. Encourage dem to return to de Hall of Castes.', 150650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! These creatures will provide arrows for our hunters and lining for our armor.', '', 150649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It\'s hard to get a supply line into the swamp. To keep our war effort going, we need you to hunt the local wildlife for materials.', '', 150648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that\'ll do nicely. I trust the slithery critters didn\'t give one such as you too much trouble?', '', 150647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A swarm of quilljets? How very gracious of them to show up just when I ran out of ink! Take this scroll, and use it to siphon that precious ink from them.', '', 150646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems this technology will prove incredibly useful for our forces. Well done!', 150645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mekkatorque has improved upon his D.R.O.N.E. technology, and needs a field evaluation of its capabilities. We\'ve heard there are a great number of blood trolls hiding nearby. Use it to seek and destroy!', 150644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Climb aboard!>', '<Climb aboard!>', 150643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon turns his head to examine you. He gives a sharp cry in greeting.>\n\nSkree!', '', 150642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Filthy little monsters.', 150641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
