('By destroying Lady Waycrest, you have opened the doorway to your world.', '', 150479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, you lack foresight. Death cannot be stopped.', '', 150478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have overstayed your welcome. Very well. Now you shall never leave these grounds!', 150477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Continue to meddle in my affairs, and your deaths will be long and abhorrent.', 150476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can tell by your dull expressions that in your corner of the world, the concept of a home not made of dung is likely new and exciting.', 150475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On second thought, don\'t answer that.', 150474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where you come from, is it considered polite to murder your hostess\'s servants?', 150473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go find the others.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go find the others.', 150472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not have time to waste. Your friends are already inside Atul\'Aman...', '', 150471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107514, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon screeches in indignation and runs off.', '', 150470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Small thing! If you want to return to the nest, you had best start running.', 150469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For now, we are going to teach it an object lesson.', 150468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your little one has no faith in its wings. You must continue to show it the joy of the skies.', 150467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you still using your legs?!', 150466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are both alive. Good. Just as I said--', 150465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, heroes. You\'ve broken the coven and released us from Gorak Tul\'s power. We are in your debt.', 150464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See, there is nothing a strong arm and sharp steel can\'t fix.', 150463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! Gorak Tul has been banished.', '', 150462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With a crash imminent, Kua\'fon screeches for help!', 'With a crash imminent, Kua\'fon screeches for help!', 150461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, mortals. Death awaits you.', '', 150460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sterntide and I will hold them here. You have to finish this!', 150459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every horror in the manor is making its way to us!', 150458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow Gorak Tul to cross into our world!', 150457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The kite starts to shudder violently. Head back for smoother air!', 'The kite starts to shudder violently. Head back for smoother air!', 150456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_POTION_24:20|t Use |cFFFF0404|Hspell:266198|h[Alchemical Fire]|h|r to destroy Deathtouched Slaver corpses!', '', 150455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, your nightmare is just beginning.', '', 150454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Waycrest was merely a vessel for my power. By destroying her, you have opened the doorway to your world.', '', 150453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absorbing', 'Absorbing', 150452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish child. You lack vision. Death is an inevitable force that stalks you at every turn.', '', 150451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last, the nightmare is over.', 150450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, my minion.Take his hat and earn de favor of Jani. But be careful not to let that hungry predators be seein\' you...', '', 150448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re right. Yet how will I regain the people\'s trust when they learn of the horrors my family has committed?', 150446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All that matters now is bringing her evil to an end.', 150445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mother had a cruel streak, but I never imagined she was capable of this.', 150444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go on. Find Lady Waycrest. Settle the score.', '', 150443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh! Dead meat.', '', 150442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure Lady Waycrest pays dearly for this foul witchcraft.', '', 150441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done those souls a service by setting them free.', '', 150440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue your hunt for Lady Waycrest. I will ensure these rooms are clear.', '', 150439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can rest more easily knowing these foul creatures no longer prowl the night.', '', 150438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll investigate the grounds while you dispatch her servants. Good hunting.', '', 150437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes, your strength is needed. We must see this evil brought to an end.', 150436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Running off seems like a bad idea. We have more of a plan than that... right?', '', 150435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mace!', '', 150434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back and face my steel!', 150433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you command, mistress.', 150432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ladies, ensure our visitors are made comfortable.', 150431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears we have uninvited guests. No matter, I\'m certain we can accommodate them.', 150430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are full of surprises.', 'You are full of surprises.', 150429, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work $r!', 'Nice work $p', 150428, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free!', 'I\'m free!', 150427, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you!', 'I owe you!', 150426, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks!', 'Many thanks!', 150425, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will grant you a portion of my power, $p. My bulwark will expunge any Faithless who challenge you.', '', 150421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you so afraid, old friend, that you hide while your people suffer? Come and end this, Korthek!', '', 150420, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 107534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p you should work with me. I\'m gonna find it.', '$p you should work with me.  I\'m gonna find it.', 150419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A minor inconvenience! Once my forces regroup, this miserable town will be ours!', 150418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'s treachery cuts deeper than I realized. With his rebellion, he practically depleted my army.\n\nThose still loyal to me are dying on the battlefield behind me to these invading, endless swarms of blood trolls.\n\nI should have listened to Talanji.', '', 150417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know a guy that knows where it is.', 'I know a guy that knows where it is.', 150416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know where the gold is?', 'You know where the gold is?', 150415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find the treasure, we could split it.', 'You find the treasure, we could split it.', 150414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the Irontide found it already.', 'I heard the Irontide found it already.', 150413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, help a guy find the treasure!', 'Hey, help a girl find the treasure!', 150412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This guy\'s got a friend who heard one of the Irontide say they know where it is.', 'This guy\'s got a friend who heard one of the Irontide say they know where it is.', 150411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe these stories of gold are all just a lie.', 'Maybe these stories of gold are all just a lie.', 150410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta find this treasure before the Irontide raids this place.', 'We gotta find this treasure before the Irontide raids this place.', 150409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe someone ate the cat.', 150408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DNT] Fly home, proud Rak\'jani, and tell your father who freed you.', '', 150407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will gather some crew, and get others to take da skiffs nearby. Have fun, $n!', 150406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! Set them aflame before the Drust King resurrects them!', '', 150405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Burn it!', '', 150404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could use some assistance here!', '', 150403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! We\'re being overwhelmed!', '', 150402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb to the darkness!', '', 150401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise!', '', 150400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one can oppose me!', '', 150399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were nothing!', '', 150398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All life ends.', '', 150397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... cannot hold me...', '', 150396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death consumes all!', '', 150395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None will escape my vengeance!', '', 150394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All staff to the kitchen!', '', 150393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tenderized!', '', 150392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonight\'s menu will be EXTRA tasty...', '', 150391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such... delicious... agony...', '', 150390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vulpera have your back, $p.\n\nSend any problematic Faithless my way and I\'ll deal with \'em. Happily.', 150388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succulent!', '', 150387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh meat!', '', 150386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mouth-watering!', '', 150385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Stay for dinner!', '', 150384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Triple share to the one that finds the treasure!', '', 150383, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to be rich?  Find me that treasure!', '', 150382, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moxie, get these slackers working!', '', 150381, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stinkin\' Irontide, you\'re never gettin\' the treasure!', '', 150380, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill that guy in the pirate hat! Yeah, that one!', '', 150379, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check under the rocks!  Check everywhere!', '', 150378, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear these Irontide out of here!', '', 150377, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Moo sound>', '', 150376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Moo sound>', 150375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry...', 150374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None', 150373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you were doing here, ends today!', 150372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'s the money?', 150371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you\'re hiding something around here!', 150370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of you will break at the yards.', 150369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not as tough a bunch as I expected.', 150368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll wear these Chains till the Shipyards!', 150367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have ya brought somethin\' solid and tough to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 150366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let \'em have it, ya can\'t spend it if you\'re dead!', 'Let \'em have it, ya can\'t spend it if you\'re dead!', 150365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not leaving the treasure. It\'s here!', 'I\'m not leaving the treasure. It\'s here!', 150364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Irontide\'s coming! We gotta get out of here soon!', 'Irontide\'s coming! We gotta get out of here soon!', 150363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have ya brought somethin\' shiny and smooth to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 150362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here. Clear skies, great day for some exploring.', '', 150361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is no normal quake! Azerite is bleeding out somewhere nearby.', '', 150360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De device is up. You should be able to see all de Azerite now.', '', 150359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out! A Kul Tiran ship has made landfall.', '', 150358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fair, you got the last one!', 'No fair, you got the last one!', 150357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, that\'s mine!', 'Hey, that\'s mine!', 150356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search his pockets!', 'Search his pockets!', 150355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab the keys!', 'Grab the keys!', 150354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Razgaji sent you to your death!', '', 150353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Precisely what I was thinking. $n, would you be so kind as to test our theory?', 150352, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 113712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting. The wisps respond to Malfurion\'s call. But what if more of the forest were to cry out for help?', '', 150351, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot destroy the wisps... not in numbers enough to matter. But we may be able to disperse them.', 150350, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 113711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody steals from Tongo and gets away with it!', '', 150349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The scouting party I led to Malfurion underestimated the wisps. They paid the price for doing so.', 150348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wall of wisps? Surely it is nothing our dark rangers and a few demolishers cannot overcome, my lady.', '', 150347, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 113903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not... be broken...', '', 150346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another pterrordax too weak for the Faithless!', '', 150345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you! Come, rest your weary head.', 150344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ya need anything just let me know!', 150343, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to my tavern! Come, have a drink.', 150342, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You doin\' good, sweet thing? Come on in, make yourself at home.', 150341, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem like you could use a rest. Have a seat, eat some grub!', 150340, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have ya brought somethin\' staticky and sharp to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 150339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this Azerite is mine!', 'All this Azerite is mine!', 150338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lemme know if this hurts...', 150337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! You sure do bleed a lot!', 150336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain! The doohickey has detected enemies nearby. Time to break out my good knives!', 150335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fix the fires... fix the explosions... Pffft! Slave drivers!', 150334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It can work AND explode. The two aren\'t mutually exclusive, ya know!', 150333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The captain\'s... not gonna... like this...', 150332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gonna stab ya!', 150331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surprise!', 150330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stabbing time!', 150329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that hurts a wee bit!', '', 150328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhh, yer a feisty one!', '', 150327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now yer fish bait!', '', 150326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re ye lookin\' at?', '', 150325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I be... the fish food...', '', 150324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, not yer usual rabble on this here island. Seems this detour might be worthwhile after all.', '', 150323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wigglin\' worms fer me hook!', '', 150322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn them into chum!', '', 150321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now reap the whirlwind!', '', 150320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quick! Get me a bucket! There\'s no blood ta waste!', 150319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An island brimmin\' with creatures an\' people an\' things... an\' Horde. Go get me some blood!', 150318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, crew! Bring me blood... my lovely, lovely blood! Suppose there\'s some loot in it fer ye, too.', 150317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde blood... my favorite! Crew o\' mine, ye know what ta do!', 150316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there. Say, do ye need all yer blood? Surely ye could spare a bit...', 150315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All that blood... wasted...', 150314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
