('Read the runic text out loud.', 'Read the runic text out loud.', 150297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to the Golden Throne.', 'Fly me to the Golden Throne.', 150295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we need to hold the kaldorei\'s attention while I devise a solution to our wisp problem.', 150294, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmmm, the wisps were dispersing? Excellent. Our plan shows promise...', 150293, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 113703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My demolisher will rip you to shreds! You only forestall the inevitable!', 150292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Acolyte, tear that barricade down!', 150291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go, my pets! Rip them apart!', 150290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 104175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions, with me. You are invited to bear witness to the grand finale.', 150289, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Or perhaps you will have a chance to say hello to your son.', 150288, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So die your warrior\'s death, High Overlord Saurfang. It means little to me. Perhaps I will raise your broken body to serve me once more.', 150287, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe you don\'t care if your people die so long as it is honorable. But to me, this Horde is worth saving. Anyone who disagrees does not deserve to stand among us.', 150286, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Honor means nothing to a corpse, Saurfang. You have the luxury of underestimating death, but it is something with which I am intimately familiar.', 150285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have faith in the warchief\'s strategy, Theron.', '', 150284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void elves... those traitors must be dealt with!', '', 150283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken! Do not back down!', '', 150282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their assault will soon falter. Remain steadfast!', '', 150281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is on its last legs, champions! More than half of their soldiers are down.', '', 150280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahaha! Look who joins the fray. Good, I was hoping you\'d keep this interesting!', '', 150279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is better if she tells you herself. Now go!', '', 150278, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long are you expecting to hold them off? What is the warchief\'s strategy?', '', 150277, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 105268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. Lor\'themar and I will handle the interlopers. I can\'t risk leaving the warchief unguarded. You are not to leave her side.', '', 150276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood. I will meet you as soon as I can.', '', 150275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chokepoint we create will funnel them through the side of the keep and thin their ranks.', '', 150274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time! We have but precious moments before we lose our terrain advantage!', '', 150273, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Blightcaller. But... where is Saurfang?', '', 150272, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 105266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine! Gather the catapults and every apothecary you can find. Send them to the keep at once!', '', 150271, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure, Blightcaller.', '', 150270, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 105278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar, command our rangers from the flank! Position them on the rooftops!', '', 150269, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blight throwers, you are our front line! You will create a swath of blight between us and the enemy!', '', 150268, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I obey, my queen.', '', 150267, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 106641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet with Lor\'themar. QUICKLY! Do not fail me, Nathanos!', 150266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gas masks! Get your gas masks here! And if you\'re feelin\' sassy, you can grab one a these backpacks and get to work!', '', 150265, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain your honor, heroes. Lok-narash.', '', 150264, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 110600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay them all, champions! Mark my words, King Anduin and his army did not come here for their amusement. They mean to destroy us! Show them no mercy, for they would show you none in return!', 150263, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 106980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Horde! Your brothers and sisters lie wounded on the battlefield! There is no honor in this victory if we abandon our own!', '', 150262, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 106290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 150261, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers are strong, but we are stronger. We are the Horde! We crush those who would bring us harm!', '', 150260, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 106288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! Your warchief commands you! It is time to take arms against the Alliance!', '', 150259, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then it\'s time to finish this once and for all. Saurfang, rally your troops. I will prepare the Azerite machine.', 150258, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Warchief.', '', 150257, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 106286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste! The warchief awaits!', '', 150256, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To my side, quickly! We must keep pushing before the Horde has a chance to react!', '', 150255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His winds are strong, but together we are stronger! Persevere, champions!', '', 150254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast!', '', 150253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And do it quickly! My ice barriers won\'t hold forever!', 150252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! Focus on the reinforcements first. Then we can deal with those shaman!', '', 150251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Warchief... will ... stop ya...', '', 150250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winds of da eagle spirit gonna SCOUR YA BONES!', '', 150249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 103583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TK lore about Rakjan + what Korthek learned while you were separated + the next plan', '', 150248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
