('<The book is filled with enchanted runes the skitter across the pages.>', 'The book is filled with enchanted runes the skitter across the pages.', 150242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I kill them now?  You promised me killing.', '', 150241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT!?', '', 150240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find your own box you grabby $r!', 'No, the box is mine!\n\nI came here looking for worms to make Soup.  Some Tortollans say Crawler meat makes a superior soup, but I don\'t associate with them.  Crawler soup is not worthy of the efforts to befriend a stranger. \n\nMud Worm Soup builds friendships that last a lifetime, and we Tortollan\'s live a long time.  \n\nFind me some Mud Worm Meat and I\'ll consider giving you this box.', 150239, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... hurts...', '', 150238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graaaah!', '', 150237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you draw your weapon, just hear me out...', '', 150236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone check the body for swag.', 150235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s treasure on that island that isn\'t aboard my ship yet.  Move it, you lay-abouts!  And take the Alliance\'s loot, too!', 150234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see the Alliance are here, and they\'re still breathing. Let\'s fix that.', 150233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This island needs looting, boys. Hop to it! I hate having to wait.', 150232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yarr?', 150231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give... nothing... back...', 150230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of this! Kill them now!', 150229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll be easier to loot when you\'re dead.', 150228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve heard bad things about the Alliance. Let\'s stay away from them.', 150227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will help.', 150226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me get that.', 150225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 150224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
