('', 'Your time has come.', 150211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashes to ashes.', 150210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds have guided us here... along with the Alliance.  Sometimes, the elements still surprise me.', 150209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear me, Alliance. Don\'t bother us and we won\'t bother you.', 150208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements are out of balance here. See if we can help, but don\'t let the Alliance get in our way.', 150207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What brings you here?', 150206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
