('You ain\'t seen... the last of me...', '', 150011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done it! Without their giant, Ashvane\'s forces will be pushed out of the city.', 150010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what this baby is built for!', '', 150009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill switch, engaged!', '', 150008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into the fray!', '', 150007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I guess I played too hard.', '', 150006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Yawns* We\'re already here? But it\'s the perfect time of day for a nap.', '', 150005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t have to do this if we just stopped fighting.', '', 150004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s gotta lick your wounds.', '', 150003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrr-ello!', '', 150002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... time for a nap...', '', 150001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nap time!', '', 150000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Laughs* Just run for it, Hordies. We won\'t chase you!', '', 149999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to pray... prey!', 149998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seems I need a new target to hunt!', 149997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhh... the scent of prey is in the air. I love a good chase before a kill!', 149996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You smell funny.', 149995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... the sweet smell... of blood...', 149994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just wait... you\'re next!', 149993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go for their throats!', 149992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, champion! These lands are safer for your efforts.', '', 149991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go for the kill!', '', 149990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat will show dem de might of de Zandalari!', '', 149989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell your fear.', '', 149988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that, I enjoyed!', '', 149987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde! We\'ll run them down. Let the hunt begin! *howls*', '', 149986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our spies have located a dangerous threat in this area. Seek it out and eliminate it!', '', 149985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Sniff* *Sniff* The Horde! I wish I was upwind right now...', '', 149984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It makes no difference. Me cannons\'ll soon reduce the opposition to rubble!', 149983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay with the pack and don\'t wander off. I smell something foul in the air.', '', 149982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*growls*', '', 149981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t keep... the big dog down...', '', 149980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will regret dis heresy! Di chuka Rezan!', '', 149979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear them to shreds!', '', 149978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Howls* Wolfpack, attack!', '', 149977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! Dibs on da head, hahaha!', 149976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, dis island show lotsa promise. Outta my way, I got some voodoo needs doin\'.', 149975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll fix ya.', 149974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya got a good head! Can I be havin\' it when ya die?', 149973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, but da Darkspear... neva die...', 149972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hexin\' ya up!', 149971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Doomed!', 149970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dere, lemme shrink ya head!', 149969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dis one.', '', 149968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess I got ya.', '', 149967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be a nice island, wonder what we gonna find here today.', '', 149966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What chu waaant?', '', 149965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jus\' gonna... lie down for a bit...', '', 149964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a nap!', '', 149963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where dese guys come from? What dey doin\' here?', '', 149962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'RHAAAR!', 149961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More blood!', 149960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More! Bring me more!', 149959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Team... tactics... bah, kill dem now! Rhaaar!', 149958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance! Kill dem all! And bring me their hearts...', 149957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rush in, and tear dem limb from limb! Gonna be blood everywhere! Hahahaha!', 149956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?', 149955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I die... a warrior\'s death! *spit*', 149954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tear their arms off!', 149953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you miss me?', '', 149952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freeze!', '', 149951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well... hello there.', '', 149950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely... done...', '', 149949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Add a kill to my tally! No doubt I\'m leading.', '', 149948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get it on!', '', 149947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna need to buy a new face first', 'You gonna need to buy a new face first', 149946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is uncertainty in your eyes, $n.\n\nI will permit you to inquire about my plans, if you wish.', 149945, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, may I ask why we want to capture Teldrassil?', 'Warchief, may I ask why we want to capture Teldrassil?', 149944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opportunity?', 'Opportunity?', 149943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is uncertain, Warchief.', 'It is uncertain, Warchief.', 149942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What IS certain is that the Alliance will use Darnassus as a safe harbor for funneling Azerite into the Eastern Kingdoms. Anduin Wrynn will build powerful new weapons, and sooner or later he will turn them upon our homelands. First he will strike at the Undercity and Silvermoon, then his gaze will fall upon Kalimdor.\n\nFor the sake of the Horde\'s future, we must be the first to act.\n\nBy occupying Darnassus, we will control the flow of Azerite and ensure it cannot be used against us. The Alliance will dare not attack its own city for fear of harming civilians.\n\nWith a single stroke, we will guarantee generations of peace.', 149940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is not a luxury we possess, but I respect your desire to know more.\n\n<Sylvanas points to Silithus on the map>.\n\nTHIS has forever altered the balance of power in Azeroth.\n\nDeposits of Azerite are being located across the world, $n. Though we do not yet understand its full potential, it is clear that this substance has vast destructive capability.\n\nWhat will war look like in twenty years? In a hundred?\n\nHow can the Horde hope to defend its borders if the Alliance controls the flow of Azerite?', 149939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You would ask a question of me, $n?', 149938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless keep wild beasts penned in nearby. Looks like a good opportunity to me.', '', 149937, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the Horde has arrived. Things are about to get... interesting.', '', 149936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t keep away, can you?', '', 149935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice \'em, boys!', '', 149934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, good looking.', '', 149933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well struck... until we... meet again...', '', 149932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Another for me!', '', 149931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My body is ready!', '', 149930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although, these weapons will provide us with a far greater advantage.', '', 149929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like me new wings? Fast they may be, no slicky can hide from me!$b$bWikkets either.$b$b$b$bFilthy wikkets.', '', 149928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slickies of Zandalar are wierd. Too ookin\' salty, and they sometimes talk back.', '', 149927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde! At last, some real action. I better take my shirt off for this one!', '', 149926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon screeches in glee and gobbles up the offered chow.', '', 149925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon sniffs at the food before enthusiastically devouring it.', '', 149924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon snatches the food out of the air.', '', 149923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon launches himself at the offered foot and swallows it whole.', '', 149922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many secrets both mysterious and divine, you have yours and I have mine.', '', 149921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skree?', '', 149920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SKREEEE!', '', 149919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skree!', '', 149918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SKREE.', '', 149917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flying hozen? How?', 'Flying hozen? How?', 149916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tactical retreat is in order!', '', 149915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me fix that!', '', 149914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there. Come to have a look at the best?', '', 149913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have much in de way of supplies, but I can spare you a few things. If you help us out, I can probably see about getting you some of de good stuff.', 'We don\'t have much in de way of supplies, but I can spare you a few things. If you help us out, I can probably see about getting you some of de good stuff.', 149912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_BAG_10.BLP:16|t |Hitem:157779:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0|h|cFFFFFFFF[Free-Range Dino Chow]|h|r>', '<Offer |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_BAG_10.BLP:16|t |Hitem:157779:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:0|h|cFFFFFFFF[Free-Range Dino Chow]|h|r>', 149911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got the best spot, the treasure is here.', 'We got the best spot, the treasure is here.', 149910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not... seen the last... of me...', '', 149909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon inspects your hands for food.>\n\nSkree? SKREE.', '', 149908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know. Your. Place.', '', 149907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoo! Vile Horde mongrels!', '', 149906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to be out-maneuvered!', '', 149905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde... unwashed, unimaginative, unencumbered by intellect. How did you even manage to find this island? Stumbled upon it, no doubt.', '', 149904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde\'s benefit, I will speak slowly.  Island... ours. You... leave. Simple enough for you?', '', 149903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde savages! We will accept your surrender, provided you hand over all your Azerite. I hope you have the intellectual capacity to appreciate my offer.', '', 149902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? Do I know you?', 149901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! Is that how you Alliance rabble normally dress? You should leave... before you die from embarrassment!', 149900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that really the Alliance ship? Was it attacked by a sea giant, or is that how it always looks?', 149899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it hot here, or is it just me? I\'m joking... of course it\'s me!', '', 149898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toasted!', '', 149897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Incineration!', '', 149896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s start some fires!', '', 149895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll sabotage their cannons on the upper levels while you burn the gulch. Meet me at their beast pens when you\'re done.', '', 149894, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! If only I didn\'t have to look at you to kill you!', 149893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown your stench in the ocean or bathe in my flames. The choice is yours, Alliance!', '', 149892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! What is that smell? Oh... the Alliance has sent its \"finest\". Do you know why they stink like that? It\'s because they eat so much cheese.', '', 149891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light bless you.', '', 149890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought well. I fought better.', '', 149889, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Falling back.', '', 149888, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be healed by the Light!', '', 149887, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, the Alliance. And I was having such a good day. Care to improve it by leaving now?', '', 149886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This island is ours, Alliance. Violence will not be necessary if you abandon it.', '', 149885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy is upon us!', '', 149884, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n starts casting a Great Heal!', '$n starts casting a Great Heal!', 149883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find one or make one. Time is a luxury we do not possess.', 149882, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 113708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then it is decided. Saurfang, Nathanos -- you will leave at once.', 149881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most smugglers would prefer to avoid the attention of the High Overlord... but I believe we can locate one who can be persuaded to assist us.', '', 149880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 113902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not naive. There is little chance that Everlook receives all its cargo through legitimate means. Someone is using a hidden route through Felwood.', '', 149879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I beg your pardon?', '', 149878, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 113901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... Know many smugglers, Blightcaller?', '', 149877, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'We will squeeze Malfurion from both sides.', 149876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saurfang, take a squad into Felwood. Seek a path over the mountain into Darkshore, but leave the siege weapons under my command.', 149875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems the wisps are susceptible to distraction. We will exploit this weakness to get past them.', 149874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 113705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, there is no safe passage through Felwood.', '', 149873, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 112395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar, one of the only other cities to survive the Sundering and still thrive. At their pinnacle, the Zandalari Empire ruled half the world. In Suramar, we still warn our children of the trolls and their dark ways.\n\nWe saw them as blood thirsty savages. But looking at this... well, it is easy to wonder who actually needs the other: the Zandalari or the Horde.', 149872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fury of the vulpera rises from the sands to demand vengeance. And I will have it!', 149871, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 107766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death is at your door, Faithless!', 149870, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 107765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To Zoram\'gar, quickly!', 149869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ceremony is ready to begin.', 'The ceremony is ready to begin.', 149868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this is a little embarrassing.\n\nYou see, I had my speech written out in my notebook, but I seem to have... misplaced it.\n\nIt must be somewhere in this room. If you could help me find it, I would be eternally grateful!', '', 149867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello there. I\'m afraid we haven\'t met, but I thank you for being here for my dear Lucy.\n\nHow can I help you?', '', 149866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry, Vaza will take care of you in Nazmir!', '', 149865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little does Lucille know that I would visit her whenever she came to Whitegrove. \n\nHer despair over what happened in this place must prevent her from seeing my spirit. I can only hope that some part of her knows I am here.', '', 149864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, you must join them. Sethraliss forgive you.', '', 149858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE\'VE GOT OURSELVES A BRAWL!', 'WE\'VE GOT OURSELVES A BRAWL!', 149857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon devours the fish.', '', 149856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon sniffs the offered fish warily.', '', 149855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Shimmerfin Flesh.>', '<Offer Shimmerfin Flesh.>', 149854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon cowers in fear, shying away as you approach.>$b$bPerhaps the hatchling could use a little persuading. A treat, maybe?', '', 149853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always...', '', 149852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will always be here, dear Lucy...', '', 149851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 102845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Alexander... I wish you were here now...', 149850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend.', '', 149849, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 102844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last... I can leave the memories of this place behind.', '', 149848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 102843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, old friend. Our people are dead, because of you.', '', 149847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not force anyone to follow me, Vorrik... Our people are conquerors...', '', 149846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will regret... seeing this...', '', 149845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Waycrest is a powerful enemy...', '', 149844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You had better!', 149843, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I\'ll get rid of this pest.', '', 149842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Idiot! There can be no witnesses!', 149841, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems we have a visitor...', '', 149840, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always a pleasure doing business with you, milady.', '', 149839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is your money, outlaw. Take it before anyone sees you!', 149838, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ambush! Lucy, get behind me! Guards, to arms!', '', 149837, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alexander, no!', 149836, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 103805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing personal, kid.', '', 149835, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 104297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexander, have you prepared the--wait, what was that!?', '', 149834, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the lord governing Drustvar--and as Lucille\'s proud father--it is my honor to wed these two in the presence of the land, the sky, and the sea.', '', 149833, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friends, family, and honored guests. We gather on this fine autumn day to celebrate the joining of Lucille and Alexander.', '', 149832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', '', 149831, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 103415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By all means. Please proceed, father.', 149830, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we?', '', 149829, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 103414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will be down shortly. She asked that I begin in her stead.', '', 149828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s fine, father. Where is mother?', 149827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please forgive my tardiness.', '', 149826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But where is Lady Waycrest?', '', 149825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here he comes!', 149824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and do convey my apologies for the delay.', '', 149823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please inform the happy couple I will be down shortly.', '', 149822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you\'ve found it! Thank the tides!', '', 149821, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103409, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you trying to waste our time?', 149820, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105949, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are looking for a book. Don\'t you think we would have already checked the bookcase?', 149819, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 105948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why would my husband put his notebook in Lucille\'s pack? Are you daft?', 149818, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe I left them with Lucy\'s letters, but I suppose it\'s prudent to be sure.', '', 149817, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 103408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While I am thankful for your help, I must ask that you not rummage through my daughter\'s undergarments...', '', 149816, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Her heart isn\'t doing our house any favors...', 149815, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 105946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucy is merely following her heart, Meredith. Just as I did when I wed you.', '', 149814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m telling you, Arthur, you should not allow this. Our daughter, marrying a common merchant?!', 149813, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 105945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you so much for coming. We are honored to have you.', 149812, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 103802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come here?', '', 149811, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 102842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucy? You\'ve come... wait, you\'re not Lucy.', '', 149810, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 102841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nor you. Your father is displeased dat you have brought dese creatures here. He has ordered me to collect you.', '', 149809, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ensured my victory no matter what happens here. General Jakra\'zet already has my key, and by now... I suppose he has yours, as well.', '', 149807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done, Korthek?', '', 149806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder, Vorrik... If you\'re here, who\'s guarding the keys in your temple?', '', 149805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PH] I exist to defend my people. You will die by this lowborn\'s hand!', 149804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Lowborn vulpera, you exist to serve my empire!', '', 149803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] You will no longer enslave the vulpera!  - NOT USED', '', 149802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna get me new teeth, made of gold!', 'I\'m gonna get me new teeth, made of gold!', 149801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will keep Mythrax\'s prison sealed, and I will unite our people.', '', 149800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We doing all the work, we should get all the gold.', 'We doing all the work, we should get all the gold.', 149799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. You are our failure. Sethraliss sacrificed herself so we could live in peace.', '', 149798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the true power of the sethrak!', '', 149797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one better try to cheat me out of my share.', 'No one better try to cheat me out of my share.', 149796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I find it, the treasure and me are gone!', 'If I find it, the treasure and me are gone!', 149795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They givin\' an extra share to the one that finds it!', 'They givin\' an extra share to the one that finds it!', 149794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three million worth of gold coins, we gonna be rich!', 'Three million worth of gold coins, we gonna be rich!', 149793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we diggin\' in the wrong place?', 'Maybe we diggin\' in the wrong place?', 149792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna buy me a castle, with a hot bath and servants.', 'Gonna buy me a castle, with a hot bath and servants.', 149791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nedly says we getting close, any day now.', 'Nedly says we getting close, any day now.', 149790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna buy a boat bigger than any in da fleet!', 'I\'m gonna buy a boat bigger than any in da fleet!', 149789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much is 1/267th of a share of 3 million?', 'How much is 1/267th of a share of 3 million?', 149788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so much dat Jaina Proudmoore\'s gonna marry me for my money!', 'It\'s so much dat Jaina Proudmoore\'s gonna marry me for my money!', 149787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...Well, that sometimes happens too.', 149786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the first time, they will feel the wind beneath their wings. The joy of flight! The...', 149785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... another answers the call of the skies!', 149784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return soon. We must strike at Emperor Korthek without delay.', '', 149783, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay here to prepare for our assault while you sow chaos among the Faithless.', '', 149782, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 107518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nudge the hatchling out of the nest.>', '<Nudge the hatchling out of the nest.>', 149781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Client Scene - Taelia steps up to accuse Lady Ashvane of being behind the attack. Don\'t you see, Katherine? Replacing you has been her plan all along. Katherine turns to Priscilla - is this true? Priscilla cuts the soft and sympathetic act. Goes hard against Katherine: Weak! Unfit to rule! Ashvane BUILT this city! Takes a shot at Katherine with her pistol. Guards jump into action. Priscilla shoots barrels on a wagon near the crowd, igniting a smokescreen that quickly envelops the plaza. Chaos ensues.]', '[Client Scene - Taelia steps up to accuse Lady Ashvane of being behind the attack. Don\'t you see, Katherine? Replacing you has been her plan all along. Katherine turns to Priscilla - is this true? Priscilla cuts the soft and sympathetic act. Goes hard against Katherine: Weak! Unfit to rule! Ashvane BUILT this city! Takes a shot at Katherine with her pistol. Guards jump into action. Priscilla shoots barrels on a wagon near the crowd, igniting a smokescreen that quickly envelops the plaza. Chaos ensues.]', 149779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vorrik, I\'m ready to face Emperor Korthek.', 'Vorrik, I\'m ready to face Emperor Korthek.', 149778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My loot... noooo....', 149777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smite this wretched vessel and free our people!', '', 149776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That be shiny weapon ye got there, more loot for me!', 149775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great storms upon the sea, heed my call!', '', 149774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Impressive, \"old friend.\" But it will not be enough to stop me!', '', 149772, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] The key is deep within my fortress, Vorrik. Or did you think that I was foolish enough to carry it on my person?', '', 149771, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] You are right about one thing, though. The time for talking is over!', '', 149770, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] No more talking, old friend. Surrender your key to Mythrax\'s prison. You would doom us all!', '', 149769, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face the might of Korthek, the Eternal Emperor!', '', 149768, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 107664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] It is done, I can harness the power of this spire. To the gate, quickly!', '', 149767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hot sands, am I glad to see you, $p! I\'m in way over my head, here...', 149766, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiro\'s hard to keep track of. Always on the move, always working on some big plan.\n\nHe left with Nisha. But, last I heard, he was heading down into the gulch to steal supplies or sabotage the cannons or something.', 149765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nisha\'s been stirring up trouble down at the slave camp. Just head west out of the cave, and down the first ramp on your right.\n\nWhen in doubt, listen for the sounds of sethrak dying and go toward \'em. She\'ll be close by.', 149764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that\'s the best part! You probably didn\'t even see them on your way in, huh?\n\nSneaky vulpera are hiding all along the escape route, keeping an eye out for Faithless!\n\nWhen they know it\'s safe to travel on the road, I lead some of the vulpera out and meet with the caravans who\'ll take them to safety.\n\nThen I sneak back in and get ready to take another group. It\'s very exciting and I\'ve only cried in fear three times so far!\n\nIf you need to leave, just pop out of the cave and head west. Cross the bridge into the ruins and you\'re home free.', 149763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The same thing you are, I assume. Look at the vulpera in here... They\'re hurt and need someone to help them.\n\nThe Faithless have enslaved countless of us and forced us to work and fight for them.\n\nWe\'ve never been able to stop them before. But Nisha and Kiro have shown us that we can fight back.\n\nAt night, Kiro and the others sneak into the slave camp below and rescue the most vulnerable vulpera.\n\nThey bring them back here. Then I secure safe passage out to the dunes, where we have caravans waiting to take them away to safety.\n\nIt\'s dangerous, and I\'d much rather be back in camp, listening to Ahna sing a song around a cozy campfire. But how could I when I know that my friends need my help?', 149762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to ask about something else.', 'I want to ask about something else.', 149761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Nisha?', 'Where is Nisha?', 149760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Kiro?', 'Where is Kiro?', 149759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you sneak the slaves out?', 'How do you sneak the slaves out?', 149758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 149757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p! I knew you\'d come! I told them, \"$p cares about the vulpera and won\'t abandon us.\"\n\nI\'m here to help too! Kiro and Nisha are rescuing vulpera slaves, and I\'m organizing caravans to carry them out of here.\n\nIt\'s kind of scary, being so close to the sethrak. But I know it\'s the right thing to do. Nisha said so.\n\nOh, welcome to our little hideout, by the way.', 149756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way.', 'Lead the way.', 149755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re lying, you hang.', 'If you\'re lying, you hang.', 149754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m with you.', 'I\'m with you.', 149753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces will make good use of dose supplies. Well done!', 149752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have located de wreckage of a riverboat dat has been sacked by blood trolls. Secure its cargo before de blood trolls do!', 149751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better be good.', 'This better be good.', 149750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Alright, let\'s go.', 'Hmm. Alright, let\'s go.', 149749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! You\'d better be right about this...', 'What?! You\'d better be right about this...', 149748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, my trusty squire, it seems our work here is done. If you would excuse me, I have an ettin to slay.', '', 149747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bandit! Fear not, maiden, for I shall protect you!', '', 149746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astral demon? I will not stand to hear Twinkle the Second insulted like this! Prepare to taste the might of Johnny-- Is that an ettin?', '', 149745, 0, 0, 707, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you ran afoul with this astral demon! I commend you for vanquishing it on your own! Did it injure you?', '', 149744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'People are losing in faith in Katherine...', 149743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great... We might have to cause a scene.', 149742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step one, start a riot.', 149741, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
