('Twinkle the Second... Why didn\'t you fly...?', '', 149738, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] I shall begin... and not a moment too soon, here come Korthek\'s forces!', '', 149737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to defend you from the sethrak, begin your attunement.', 'I\'m ready to defend you from the sethrak, begin your attunement.', 149736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH]  Are you ready? We must hurry, Korthek\'s forces will try to stop me from gaining the power of this spire, you\'ll need to defend me during my spell.', '', 149735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did all of these wisps come from?', '', 149730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! These damned wisps sting!', '', 149729, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 112399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve removed a major threat to Boralus, heroes, but I\'d wager my weight in grog the city isn\'t out of danger yet.', '', 149726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without that backstabbing coward and his captains, this pirate army won\'t be able to tell their bootstraps from their bilge pumps.', '', 149725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan should\'ve known betraying me would end like this.', '', 149724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that\'s hardly a concern for you, right?', '', 149723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Except, of course, his dread guard of malicious murderers and cutthroats.', '', 149722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] I will make my way to the spire. Meet me there. Korthek\'s forces will doubtlessly try to stop us from harnessing their power.', '', 149720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair maiden, what ails you? For Maximillian of Northshire is here to help!', '', 149719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We wouldn\'t have found Rakera without you, little one.', 149717, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 105905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sounded like a damsel in need of saving. With me, squire!', '', 149716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, squire, that my previous attempts at felling this ettin have resulted in naught but my lances being lodged firmly in its side. So, my first task for you---', '', 149715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re friends, right?', 149714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ruins are on the way to Zem\'lan. I\'m happy to take you there! Dolly and Dot are great company, but it\'s nice to have friends to talk to.', 149713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, that bubble... Oh! You can\'t do saltwater? That\'s weird, little man.', '', 149712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO!!!! IT CAN\'T BE!!!!', '', 149711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... what are vulpera doing here?', '', 149710, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been abandoned for years, but it will be an ideal place to launch our--', '', 149709, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My personal sanctum was hidden away in the hills. A small shrine to Sethraliss, where I could meditate.', '', 149708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In those days, Korthek and I led all sethrak in our worship of Sethraliss.', '', 149707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drowned dream consumes me!', 'The drowned dream consumes me!', 149706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101379, 101380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lived here too once, long ago. Before Korthek betrayed our people for power and madness.', '', 149705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a cruel nest of rock and dirt, swarming with sethrak who have forsaken our loa.', '', 149704, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I drink in the infinite void.', 'I drink in the infinite void.', 149703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101377, 101378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am blind no longer.', 'I am blind no longer.', 149702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101375, 101376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are heading into the heart of the Faithless empire, $p.', '', 149701, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The circle... I see the circle!', 'Yes... The circle... I see the circle!', 149700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101373, 101374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The writhing shadow comes for me!', 'Oh... The writhing shadow comes for me!', 149699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101371, 101372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear the voice! The thousand truths!', 'Ah... I hear the voice! The thousand truths!', 149698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101369, 101370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will live eternal in the abyss.', 'I will live eternal in the abyss.', 149697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101367, 101368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! The way to Harlan Sweete is open, and nothing can stand in our way.', '', 149696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul for the ancient one!', 'My soul for the ancient one!', 149695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101365, 101366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will defend your people as our own.', 149694, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, how about we put your pugilistic skills to good use?', '', 149693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That blighted barnacle has the island on lockdown until the festivities in the fighting pit are over.', '', 149692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\' got no peacebloom on my lapel, Alliance scum!', 'I ain\' got no peacebloom on my lapel, Alliance scum!', 149691, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know anythin\' \'bout a Deeprun Tram!', 'I don\'t know anythin\' \'bout a Deeprun Tram!', 149690, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now all that\'s left is to introduce Harlan\'s gullet to some cold steel. But that won\'t be easy.', '', 149689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moonkin don\'t fly! You have to go!', 'Moonkin don\'t fly! You have to go!', 149688, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\' a spy!', 'I ain\' a spy!', 149687, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"De murloc what\'s at what?\" You\'re not right in de head!', '\"De murloc what\'s at what?\" You\'re not right in de head!', 149686, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"One bottle o\' troll sweat?\" We don\'t sell dat here!', '\"One bottle o\' troll sweat?\" We don\'t sell dat here!', 149685, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Course trees are pretty, and fires are bad. What are you gettin\' at?', '\'Course trees are pretty, and fires are bad. What are you gettin\' at?', 149684, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar forever!', 'Zandalar forever!', 149683, 0, 56190, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something\'s not right about dis temple. We need to find a way in.', 149682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you weren\'t the hero type, you\'d make a proper pirate.', '', 149681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sleep... only to wake...', '', 149680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s.... great, Maximillian. I\'ll just be going now.', 'That\'s.... great, Maximillian. I\'ll just be going now.', 149679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The endless shadow... embraces me...', '', 149678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hope... wanes...', '', 149677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh.... What?', 'Uh.... What?', 149676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seed... takes root...', '', 149675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am but one... of many...', '', 149674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cycle... continues...', '', 149673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even death... may... die...', '', 149672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end... you will know the truth...', '', 149671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard? Daelin\'s Gate has fallen!', 'Have you heard? Daelin\'s Gate has fallen!', 149670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think about all this?', 'What do you think about all this?', 149669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The currents wash you into the abyss.', '', 149668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it makes me want to go back to my old ways.', '', 149667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blacktooth Brawlers love hardening their knuckles in a fight. If you can loosen their teeth, Captain Raoul will definitely want you at the meeting.', '', 149666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is dat screeching coming from your mouth?', '', 149665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even fish drink like the Bilge Rats! If you can keep up with this zoo, Captain Eudora won\'t be able to resist inviting you to the meeting.', '', 149664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you heard about the attack?', 'What have you heard about the attack?', 149663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let no one say I gave nothing for the war effort. Here\'s my report.', 'Let no one say I gave nothing for the war effort. Here\'s my report.', 149662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine then. Dolly and Dot are my best friends. They pull my wagon through dunes of sand!', 149661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know... Things are getting worse every day. Maybe it\'s time for Katherine to step down.', 'I don\'t know... Things are getting worse every day. Maybe it\'s time for Katherine to step down.', 149660, 0, 56196, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fail the Alliance. Even if I had to sit in mud for three days to get this. Please, take my report.', 'I will not fail the Alliance. Even if I had to sit in mud for three days to get this. Please, take my report.', 149659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dot and Dolly like it when I sing. It\'s soothing.', 149658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe some people think trolls and night elves are related? This has been an awful experience. Here\'s my report.', 'Can you believe some people think trolls and night elves are related? This has been an awful experience. Here\'s my report.', 149657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting your hands on an invitation will make the job easier. Or, just rush in and attempt to kill three of the most feared pirate captains all at once. Your decision, mate.', '', 149656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dolly and Dot are my best friends. They pull my wagon through dunes of sand! They have small teeth and they love to eat...', 149655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I said I\'d do anything to avenge Teldrassil. Pretending to be a troll, evidently, is anything. Here\'s my report.', 'I said I\'d do anything to avenge Teldrassil. Pretending to be a troll, evidently, is anything. Here\'s my report.', 149654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got it on good authority the captains are gathering to meet. If we get into that party, you can cut off all the heads from this hydra in one fell swoop!', '', 149653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is my pterrordax?', 'Where is my pterrordax?', 149652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong with my hatchling?', 'What\'s wrong with my hatchling?', 149651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little trip to the jungle, they said. It\'ll be easy, they said. Just take my report.', 'Just a little trip to the jungle, they said. It\'ll be fine, they said. Just take my report.', 149650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is he making that noise?!', 'Why is he making that noise?!', 149649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Savages. Complete and utter savages here. Please, take my report.', 'Savages. Complete and utter savages here. Please, take my report.', 149648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t even ask where I had to sleep last night. Here\'s your report.', 'Don\'t even ask where I had to sleep last night. Here\'s your report.', 149647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks.', 'Thanks.', 149646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m more of a big picture guy, so I\'ll leave the finer details of the plan to you.', '', 149645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we\'ll give Harlan what\'s coming to him.', '', 149644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in the blood of the infinite.', '', 149643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So here\'s the plan. Drain the Cutwaters, purge the Bilge Rats, break the Blacktooth, and dismantle the Irontide.', '', 149642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he succeeds, he\'ll command a fleet that would threaten the entire region.', '', 149641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I heard some screeching, but I can\'t leave de nests to go look.$b$bBetter hurry, or you won\'t have a pterrordax to look after anymore. Not all of dem live to adulthood.', '', 149640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan Sweete is using his Irontide to bring the other pirate crews under his banner.', '', 149639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, he ran off. Got bored, most likely.$b$bYou should probably go find him before he gets hurt. He\'s not ready to fend for himself.', '', 149638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He sure looks a little down in de dumps, eh?$b$bBet he\'s missing his mother. Hey, dat\'s you, right?', '', 149637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will know only hunger.', '', 149636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars fear our ascension.', '', 149635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat noise he\'s making is a sure sign dat he\'s hungry.$b$bBetter feed him before he takes a finger for de trouble.$b$bIf you don\'t have food, you can get some from Warbeast Kraal.', '', 149634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know the embrace of true nothingness.', '', 149633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep eternal in Ny\'alotha.', '', 149632, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light dies in the endless fathoms.', '', 149631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Wingminder Goja. Pa\'ku is my loa, and I serve de Lord of Wind by keeping an eye on her young.$b$bShe told me you might need a little help.$b$b<Wingminder Goja chuckles.>$b$bWhat do you need?', '', 149630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon the shadow of your demise.', '', 149629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard it was pirates. Can you believe that? Scurvy, flea-bitten PIRATES! Can the Proudmoores even protect us anymore?', 'I heard it was pirates. Can you believe that? Scurvy, flea-bitten PIRATES! Can the Proudmoores even protect us anymore?', 149628, 0, 56191, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! My trusty squire! Always showing up in my time of need.\n\nI\'ve come to Kul Tiras in hopes of finding imperiled citizens in need of saving. My current task is to save the poor fishers in this quaint village from the ettins which have decided to terrorize them.\n\nTheir hide is abnormally thick.', '', 149627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, you and everybody else. Get in line and try not to cause a scene. Crowd\'s riled up enough as it is.', 'Yeah, you and everybody else. Get in line and try not to cause a scene. Crowd\'s riled up enough as it is.', 149626, 0, 56187, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to speak with Katherine Proudmoore immediately.', 'I need to speak with Katherine Proudmoore immediately.', 149625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Admiral Proudmoore is preparing to address the public. Please remain patient.', 'Lord Admiral Proudmoore is preparing to address the public. Please remain patient.', 149624, 0, 56186, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lord Admiral is in danger. Come with us!', 'The Lord Admiral is in danger. Come with us!', 149623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remain calm. Everything is under control.', 'Please remain calm. Everything is under control.', 149622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nedly Grinner don\'t like bein\' taken advantage of. Nobody is finding that treasure before me!', '', 149621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 200, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t catch me sleepin\'.\n\nTry to cheat me, and I\'ll sell you to the Loyalists.', '', 149620, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 5, 0, 0, 200, 0, 39653),
('This tideblood was corrupted only recently. I should be able to purify it.', '', 149619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! It is more volatile than I thought.', '', 149618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho, traveler!\n\nHave you been chasing my heroic tales in hopes of becoming the squire of Maximillian of Northshire?\n\nYou can hope no longer, for you are in luck! I am need of a squire to assist me with tasks as I take on dangerous foes.', '', 149617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will find her, or die trying.', 149616, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 105911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zem\'lan\'s port is to the south. Ships haven\'t sailed into its dockyard for years, but it\'s still our best chance at getting what Kiro and Nisha need for their attack on the sethrak.', 149615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You keep an eye out for your friend. I\'ll keep my eyes on the road.', 149614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is after the battle, but... Tul isn\'t shown dead. Wounded and broken but not dead!', 149613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Histories of this event always say Lord Arom killed Gorak Tul and his army fell thereafter. But here you can see all his constructs shattering as he\'s stabbed and his power broken. There was some connection.', 149612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s Lord Arom Waycrest when he was just a Colonel leading the final assault. And there... That is Gorak Tul being stabbed by Waycrest.', 149611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'This isn\'t Drust. It\'s a Kul Tiran carving over a Drust Monolith.', 149610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting. I hadn\'t realized the constructs came later as part of his desperation to win.', 149609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuq yoh\'ghyl ma oou shandai nuq Ez iilth thyzz', '', 149608, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98464, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhssh zzof og far\'al awtgsshu', '', 149607, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! You have given respite to Krag\'wa\'s brood. Thank you, hero.', 149606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon screeches in glee and gobbles up the offered chow.', '', 149605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon sniffs at the food before enthusiastically devouring it.', '', 149604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon snatches the food out of the air.', '', 149603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kua\'fon launches himself at the offered food and swallows it whole.', '', 149602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls once more hunt de brood of Krag\'wa. De heart of de lord of frogs burns with rage. Aid his quest for revenge!', 149601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Stormsong\'s name!', 'In Stormsong\'s name!', 149600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101171, 101172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This valley is ours, bilge rat!', 'This valley is ours, bilge rat!', 149599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101173, 101174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kul Tiras is fish food without us!', 'Kul Tiras is fish food without us!', 149598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101175, 101176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fleet will crush you!', 'Our fleet will crush you!', 149597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101177, 101178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All who oppose us will perish!', 'All who oppose us will perish!', 149596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101179, 101180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re relentless as the briny deep!', 'We\'re relentless as the briny deep!', 149595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101181, 101182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
