('We\'ve pushed the enemy back!\n\nDon\'t just stand there, get in and fight!', 'We\'ve pushed the enemy back!\n\nDon\'t just stand there, get in and fight!', 149442, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ominous Cloud begins to boil upon touching %s!', 'Ominous Cloud begins to boil upon touching %s!', 149441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you...', 'Thank you...', 149440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... I may rest...', 'Finally... I may rest...', 149439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My watch is ended...', 'My watch is ended...', 149438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return... to rest...', 'I return... to rest...', 149437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My duty is done...', 'My duty is done...', 149436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get the meat.', 'I\'ll get the meat.', 149435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box is mine, ya nosey $r.\n\nI need Mud Worms to make my Mud Worm soup, but the worms is hiding! I\'m patient, I can wait here a few days, maybe find more boxes?\n\nYou find me some Mud Worm Meat and I\'ll trade you this box.', 'No, the box is mine!\n\nI came here looking for worms to make Soup.  Some Tortollans say Crawler meat makes a superior soup, but I don\'t associate with them.  Crawler soup is not worthy of the efforts to befriend a stranger. \n\nMud Worm Soup builds friendships that last a lifetime, and we Tortollan\'s live a long time.  \n\nFind me some Mud Worm Meat and I\'ll consider giving you this box.', 149434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That box?', 'That box?', 149433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was standing here for a long time. Then I found this interesting box in the mud.', 'I was standing here for a long time. Then I found this interesting box in the mud.', 149432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job, mon. I... I had been going insane, my spirit withering slow as a tortollan caravan!', 'Good job, mon. I... I had been going insane, my spirit withering slow as a tortollan caravan!', 149431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks, stranger.', 'My thanks, stranger.', 149430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, no more. Thank you.', 'At last, no more. Thank you.', 149429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can rest easy again. Thanks, outlander.', 'I can rest easy again. Thanks, outlander.', 149428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ends...', 'It ends...', 149427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the plan?', 'What\'s the plan?', 149426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was thinking electric shocks, or fire, maybe we just blow him up!  \n\nBut, it\'s bad luck to kill a Tortollan and I don\'t need any more bad luck.  \n\nSo, you show me how you would handle this Tortollan?', 149425, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 274, 0, 0, 200, 0, 39653),
('', 'We got problems $p.  The Tortollan found a box, and we want it!', 149424, 0, 0, 707, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 200, 0, 39653),
('Blasted swamp! Everything\'s falling apart in this humidity.\n\nWell then, What ye need? Out wid it so I can get back ta me repairs.', 'Blasted swamp! Everything\'s falling apart in this humidity.\n\nWell then, What ye need? Out wid it so I can get back ta me repairs.', 149423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<TEMP - Scenario to follow.>', '<TEMP - Scenario to follow.>', 149422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the most arrogant fool would think it wise to allow the Amani within their walls. You have done well today, champion.', '', 149421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only good Amani is a dead one, yet the Zandalari gave them a refuge within the city. Defeat their disciples, for the Alliance!', '', 149420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast is dead! Ashvane, secure the upper floors! I\'ll take care of this thief...', 'The beast is dead! Ashvane, secure the upper floors! I\'ll take care of this thief...', 149419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For as long as I stand, I will not let this bastion fall!', '', 149418, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should remind them of their place.', '', 149417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Kellam the Songstone.>', '<Show Kellam the Songstone.>', 149416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Amani tribe would do well to remember that the Horde has strength in Zuldazar. Why don\'t you jog their memories? Give their gong a ring and defeat their disciples.', '', 149415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll go on ahead and search for the farmers. Whatever you do, don\'t get captured!', '', 149414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104609, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taz\'dingo!', 149413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a lot of treasure out there in that mud.  You and Moxie gonna work together to find it!', '', 149411, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The crawgs... must not be freed...', '', 149410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle!', 'To battle!', 149409, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 149408, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight together.', 'We fight together.', 149407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fight by your side.', 'I fight by your side.', 149406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt, $n.', 'I am in your debt, $n.', 149405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is not yet complete. The crawgs must be subdued!', '', 149404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the attack. I can take care of myself.', '', 149403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My strength... what... is dis?', 149402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My body... I can\'t... Arghh!', 149401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O.K.', 'O.K.', 149400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The workers say they hear voices in the mud.  It\'s driven some of them crazy!\n\nI just don\'t listen!', 149399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Certain Kul Tirans kind of associate me with certain robberies, that I really don\'t know anything about.', 149398, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sail to... uncharted waters...', 149397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one acts like they never seen a gnome before!', 149396, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tire of this!', 149395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Decimator rounds... FIRE!', 149394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s lead in yer gut!', 149393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll carve ya to ribbons!', 149392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clear the deck!', 149391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalari... be full of empty promises.', 'Zandalari... be full of empty promises.', 149390, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be hearin\' from my loa about this...', 'You\'ll be hearin\' from my loa about this...', 149389, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No place is safe for us anymore.', 'No place is safe for us anymore.', 149388, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In their own city... they let us die.', 'In their own city... they let us die.', 149387, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will become of us now?', 'What will become of us now?', 149386, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empire... has truly fallen.', 'The empire... has truly fallen.', 149385, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could they let this... happen?', 'How could they let this... happen?', 149384, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari... promised we\'d be safe...', 'The Zandalari... promised we\'d be safe...', 149383, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! Someone found my offering to Bwonsamdi. Use it well!', 'Finally! Someone found my offering to Bwonsamdi. Use it well!', 149382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring me their thumbs! Do what ya will with the rest.', 149381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I get your share if you die!', 149380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your head gonna look great in my collection.', 149379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and I are pretty much friends now.  Can I borrow some gold?', 149378, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw someone looked just like you at Tol Dagor.', 149377, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be makin\' a big mistake!', 'You be makin\' a big mistake!', 149376, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! De terrace be under attack!', 'Help! De terrace be under attack!', 149375, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dem!', 'Get dem!', 149374, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here, mon!', 'You do not belong here, mon!', 149373, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone! Zandalar belongs to da trolls!', 'Begone! Zandalar belongs to da trolls!', 149372, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I be smellin\' something foul...', 'I knew I be smellin\' something foul...', 149371, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! I be under attack!', 'Help! I be under attack!', 149370, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy mongrel!', 'Filthy mongrel!', 149369, 0, 56037, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coda chatters and looks into the ravine.', '', 149368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m worried, too, Coda.', 149367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride to Eastpoint Station.', 'I need a ride to Eastpoint Station.', 149366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where ya headed?', 149365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you! And please give Poda lots of snuggles!', 149364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All cannons... FIRE!', 149363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ship yards will be your new home.', '', 149362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all serve Lord Stormsong at the Yards.', '', 149361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody into the wagons.', '', 149360, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again, the blood trolls threaten my children!$B$BCome small one, together we shall remind them what happens when they anger Krag\'wa!', '', 149359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The city is ours, mates!', 149358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer innards\'ll dangle from me mast!', 149357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another notch in me blade!', 149356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All hands... ATTACK!', 149355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No survivors!', 149354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their wait is nearly complete.', '', 149353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How soon?', 'How soon?', 149352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Irontide attacks us each day, and there\'s a Horde army heading this way too. It won\'t be long before the whole town has to flee.', '', 149351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('I will complete de ritual... with your blood!', '', 149348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O.K.', 'O.K.', 149347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Failed? No...', '', 149346, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a kingdom\'s fortune in gold out there in that muddy lake bottom. A sunken treasure ship from the Second War!  \n\nThe whole town is working together to find the treasure first. Time is short though, we gotta hurry!', '', 149345, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 300, 0, 39653),
('Lith qul\'shoth wshh... yzsh uovssh qvask.', '', 149344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s over, Jakra\'zet. Your plan has failed!', 149343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You struggle at the surface... but He waits below.', '', 149341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just in time to stop you!', 149340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have arrived just in time...', '', 149339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! They all ran home!', 149338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ritual of blood is nearly complete!', '', 149337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please hurry and find them! Coda will be so sad if he loses his family.', 149336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasure?', 'Treasure?', 149335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irontide is taking everyone prisoner. They\'re trying to stop us from finding the treasure first!', '', 149334, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back, little ones! We can help you!', 149333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we go in there, those stingers will get us, too!', 149332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t see them, Coda!', 149331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zaix lal sk\'woth\'gl Zaix lal uulwi', '', 149330, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98463, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Irontide is taking people prisoner. We could use your help!', '', 149329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are redemption. They are truth.', '', 149328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuq wgah nuq iilth zz oou ga\'halahs anagg', '', 149327, 178, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98462, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all drown in the lightless abyss.', '', 149326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it don\'t blow up, try again.', 149325, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think not. I have orders to return you to the warchief directly.', '', 149323, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seeing as how this is my ship, I think you will need to adjust your plans.', 149322, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can discuss it on de way, your highness.', '', 149321, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 106176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come. We set sail for Zuldazar.', 149320, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 106850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe de phrase you be looking for is \"thank you.\"', '', 149319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems a mage of your... skill... could be very useful right now, hm?', '', 149318, 0, 0, 273, 70, 0, 106174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... it can\'t be.', 149317, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 0, 109663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can try to subdue us, and likely succeed.', '', 149315, 0, 0, 273, 70, 0, 106173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you see de flames devouring de city.', '', 149314, 0, 0, 273, 70, 0, 106172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be so hasty, now.', '', 149313, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 106171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then perish.', 149312, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 109662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respectfully, we have a boat to catch.', '', 149311, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surrender, and I will return you to the Stockades where you belong. There, you will await the king\'s justice.', 149310, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait here.', '', 149309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already taken care of. Observe.', '', 149307, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 106698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop gawking and break through that ice!', '', 149306, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t be knowin\' a Rezan, but I be owin\' him me thanks.', '', 149305, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 105610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, Horde scum!', 149303, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 109659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She has cut off our escape!', 149302, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need twenty of those birds.', 149300, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 106849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha! Lasan ya clever moose-mon!', '', 149299, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 105611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... but I think I know why. Look.', '', 149298, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loa help dem dat cross you, Zul.', '', 149297, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 105612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have slain many innocents to get this far. But your little jailbreak is over.', 149296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are they not pursuing us?', 149295, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha!', '', 149294, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 81577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their forces must have returned from Lordaeron. How will we get through?', 149292, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move!', '', 149291, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 106697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My loa hears us. Mighty Rezan, lend me your strength!', 149290, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not harm another soul in this city!', 149289, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 109658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is far enough!', 149288, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 109657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
