('Entry Two: The animated mead has begun to exhibit signs of aggression. Perhaps I\'ve made a slight miscalculation.', '', 149128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entry One: The honey has come to life, but is replicating at a rate beyond my wildest dreams. I must run more tests!', '', 149127, 7, 0, 669, 64, 0, 111443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Douse these flames! Head them off!', '', 149126, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 109561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at them flee, tails between their legs!', '', 149125, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 109560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scurry, like the rats you are!', '', 149124, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 109559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is folly. You will die here, and an unmarked grave will be all you have to show for it.', 149123, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 109656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have known the Horde to be cruel and heartless. Ruthless in its pursuit of victory. But this...', 149122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 109655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have found them, my king! I will bring you their hides for a trophy!', '', 149121, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 109558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be actin\' like you not happy to see us.', '', 149120, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 105609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delighted. Truly. Now, let\'s move. On your mark.', '', 149119, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 106694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a cruel enemy, Zul.', 149118, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 106847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot fight her. Run!', 149117, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it now?', 149116, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well this is a fine mess we\'re in.', '', 149115, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The harbor! We must press forward!', 149114, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 106327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One would think dat a city of stone would be less... flammable.', '', 149113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be tryin\' ta box us in. Don\'t let dem corner us!', '', 149112, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 105608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will want to wait here.', '', 149111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta get back to da canals. Follow me!', '', 149110, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 105607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, dis will be useful.', '', 149109, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 106167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to find cover!', 149108, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 149107, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 106845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da old wolf got our scent. We got ta get outta here!', '', 149106, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 105606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are too many... the barrier will not hold!', 149105, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 106324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is! Stop them before they reach the gates!', 'There it is! Stop them before they reach the gates!', 149104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thought you got away? Think again!', 'Thought you got away? Think again!', 149103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down there! Get those resources!', 'Down there! Get those resources!', 149102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls are sick, twisted creatures. Dere is no hope for dem to ever change.', 149101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls are devouring my people! Stop them!', 149100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murderbeak is attracted by the commotion!', 'Murderbeak is attracted by the commotion!', 149099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Axebeaks are enticed by the scent of chum in the water!', 'Axebeaks are enticed by the scent of chum in the water!', 149098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c! I was not looking forward to meeting the end of a pike.', '', 149097, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are! Mind lending me a hand here?', '', 149096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your alacrity is appreciated, $c. We will convene with Miss Waycrest.', '', 149095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A little help, here?', 149094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the assist.', '', 149093, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted witches and their barriers!', '', 149092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese young hatchlings are doing well. Dey will make fine warbeasts one day.', 149091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Young warbeasts require constant attention and affection. Dey must learn to interact with us as much as we must learn to interact with dem.', 149090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear the summons!', '', 149089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost all me weapons, but at least I got me life.', '', 149088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey caught me off guard while I be scoutin\', it no be happenin\' again.', '', 149087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be comin\' back here ta make dese blood trolls pay!', '', 149086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya, I be gettin\' back to Zul\'jan.', '', 149085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. Those goblins better start focusing on saving my city instead of making a profit!', 149084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'A group of goblin prospectors has been trapped by de undead. We must free dem!', 149083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what this tar can be used for? Me neither, but I heard it\'ll sell BIG!', '', 149082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This here\'s the pits, literally! I\'m outta this place.', '', 149081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah well, I was just about to get out anyway. This tar is gonna sell for a ton!', '', 149080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close call! Hey, pick up some tar for me, will ya? We can sell it for big back home.', '', 149079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, who knew it\'d be dangerous gettin\' tar from a forbidden swamp?', '', 149078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korthek has gone too far. I must deal with this personally. Protect the keys while I am away.', '', 149076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat should show de blood trolls that their days are coming to an end.', 149075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Gob Squad has a plan to deal with de blood trolls. See what you can do to get dem out of it alive.', 149074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get in the A.F.M.O.D and stop that blood troll army.', 'Let\'s get in the A.F.M.O.D and stop that blood troll army.', 149073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! We got some nasty blood trolls makin\' their way to Zuldazar. Lucky for us, we got a little upgrade to the A.M.O.D!\n\nFeast your eyes on the A.F.M.O.D, this baby can FLY! Death from above!\n\nCourse, we had to lose the shield, this thing wouldn\'t fly with it.\n\nWant to take it out on a test drive? We can blast that army to bits!', '', 149072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are worthless... just like the rest...', '', 149071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another exile to slaughter? Today is a good day.', '', 149070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, Little King. I shall swallow any who try to follow you.', '', 149066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, not nothing.', '', 149065, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul is not soiling himself. It may be nothing.', 149064, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They cannot have gone far. Your vigilance safeguards us all.', '', 149063, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 105325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde infiltrators have breached the Stockades! Civilians are to remain in their homes until the threat has been subdued!', '', 149062, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the king!', '', 149061, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be keepin\' us hidden, long as no one does anyting stupid.', '', 149060, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 105596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! Don\'t worry my dear Ancel, it\'s merely a setback! We\'ll be back up and running in no time.', 'Ha ha! Don\'t worry my dear Ancel, it\'s merely a setback! We\'ll be back up and running in no time.', 149059, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-w-what are you talking about!? You nearly got yourself killed and ruined the entire farm in the process!', '', 149058, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That it\'s up to us to push forward the art of honey production, no matter the cost!', 'That it\'s up to us to push forward the art of honey production, no matter the cost!', 149057, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly you did not need it.', '', 149056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOW.', '', 149055, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 106164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh?', '', 149054, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 105601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, we will know if his life is in danger.', 149053, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 106843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue.', '', 149052, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 106162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... where are the guards?', 149051, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 106323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go. Stay together.', '', 149050, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 105604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little more warnin\' woulda been nice.', '', 149049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain alert. SI:7 has informed us that the enemy emerged near the Keep.', '', 149048, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 105324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump off de bridge. Now.', '', 149047, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 106163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s cross at da bridge. Unless ya prophet be havin\' a problem wit\' dat.', '', 149046, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 105600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move quick, off da path.', '', 149045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait here.', '', 149044, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 106161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention, citizens of Stormwind!', '', 149043, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright. Stay close. We all friends now.', '', 149042, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 105598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The city is stirring. We cannot linger here for long.', 149041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to set sail!', 'I\'m ready to set sail!', 149040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared for the journey to Kul Tiras?', 149039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because of your work, we have some time to maneuver and allow Krag\'wa to shore up his defenses. Thank you.', 149038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop me from reclaiming what is mine!', '', 149037, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 106528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls continue their attacks on Krag\'wa! Cut off their supplies and make dem pay dearly for their assault!', 149036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss... I\'d forgotten your voice...', '', 149035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are not bound to the loa. Our strength is our own!', '', 149034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interlopers! You meddle in affairs beyond your ken.', '', 149033, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 106527, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Talanji asks if things are really over, Rokhan says evil has a way of surviving and he doubts this will be the last we see of this place.\nShot: Close ups of Talanji and Rokhan, then ominous shot of the now revealed pit.', 'PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Talanji asks if things are really over, Rokhan says evil has a way of surviving and he doubts this will be the last we see of this place.\nShot: Close ups of Talanji and Rokhan, then ominous shot of the now revealed pit.', 149031, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master... I... failed...', 149030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gorak Tul... comes...', 149029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gorak Tul... Promised power...', 149028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may not be of much use in combat, but my mother must be brought to justice... and I must be there to see it through.', 149027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For my father, and for Drustvar!', 149026, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 108235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will join you inside, Inquisitor.', 149025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inquisitors, on me! Glory to House Waycrest!', 149024, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 104626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye ma\'am. We\'ll put the coven in the ground.', 149023, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 104625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inquisitors, the final battle is upon you. May the winds be at your back.', 149022, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 108232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother... what have you done?', 149021, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 103809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal, no...', 149020, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 103808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... sorry...', '', 149019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dearest Lucy... I... have failed you...', '', 149018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight it, Marshal!', 149017, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 103807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... this is not... right!', '', 149016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... obey...', '', 149015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll cover the flanks. $n, stay with Lucille and the Marshal!', '', 149014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve screeched at the wrong woman, witch!', 149013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving, we\'ve got this! Go for the eyes, Winston!', '', 149012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be right behind you.', 'I will be right behind you.', 149011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For House Waycrest!', '', 149010, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 102974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stick close, and do not stop your advance until we\'ve breached the manor gates!', '', 149009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 102973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We not gonna last much longer at dis pace. We got tah run for deh docks.\n\nSay de word an\' we go.', '', 149008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inquisitors! This is our chance to rescue Lord and Lady Waycrest... and put an end to this insufferable coven!', '', 149007, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 102972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see you trembling. Scared, Alliance?', 149005, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 103058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feeling dizzy?', 149004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You actually thought you could win?', 149003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Routed by... lowborn scum...', 149002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your odds of victory are slim to none!', '', 149001, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re out of position!', '', 149000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn this one down!', '', 148999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... cheated...', '', 148998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you!', '', 148997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defensive positions!', '', 148996, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... will guide me back.', '', 148995, 0, 0, 592, 64, 0, 104027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get their hearts!', 148994, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 104110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will send your soul to Gorak Tul!', 148993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the ready! We have incoming.', 'At the ready! We have incoming.', 148991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the resources!', 'Protect the resources!', 148990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wood belongs to us!', 'This wood belongs to us!', 148989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t come any closer!', 'Don\'t come any closer!', 148988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back!', 'Stay back!', 148987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Keepers were the most powerful among us, charged with sealing Mythrax\'s corpse within the great pyramid.\n\nSulthis was the founder, but he could not seal the tomb alone.\n\nHe asked Vorrik and Korthek for their help, and together, they cast a barrier around the great pyramid, sealing the corpse of Mythrax within.', 'The Keepers were the most powerful among us, charged with sealing Mythrax\'s corpse within the great pyramid.\n\nSulthis was the founder, but he could not seal the tomb alone.\n\nHe asked Vorrik and Korthek for their help, and together, they cast a barrier around the great pyramid, sealing the corpse of Mythrax within.', 148986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He calls himself Emperor Korthek, but long ago he was one of the Keepers, entrusted to protect the tomb.\n\nHis hunger for war goes against everything our loa stands for, yet he denounces and defies her by raising an army that plans to conquer all of Zuldazar.', 'He calls himself Emperor Korthek, but long ago he was one of the Keepers, entrusted to protect the tomb.\n\nHis hunger for war goes against everything our loa stands for, yet he denounces and defies her by raising an army that plans to conquer all of Zuldazar.', 148985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless are a force of militant sethrak, led by Emperor Korthek.\n\nLong ago, we all lived as one, as Sethraliss would have wanted. \n\nSince Korthek\'s betrayal, the Faithless have brought war upon these lands. \n\nThey will not stop until they have conquered the world.', 'The Faithless are a force of militant sethrak, led by Emperor Korthek.\n\nLong ago, we all lived as one, as Sethraliss would have wanted. \n\nSince Korthek\'s betrayal, the Faithless have brought war upon these lands. \n\nThey will not stop until they have conquered the world.', 148984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss is our beloved loa.\n\nWhen Mythrax ravaged our lands and threatened to wipe us from existence, it was she who stopped him, giving her life to save ours.\n\nUnlike the Faithless, we still feel her presence, and believe that one day she will be returned to us.', 'Sethraliss is our beloved loa.\n\nWhen Mythrax ravaged our lands and threatened to wipe us from existence, it was she who stopped him, giving her life to save ours.\n\nUnlike the Faithless, we still feel her presence, and believe that one day she will be returned to us.', 148983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Keepers were the most powerful among us, charged with sealing Mythrax\'s corpse within the great pyramid.\n\nSulthis was the founder, but he could not seal the tomb alone.\n\nHe asked Vorrik and Korthek for their help, and together, they cast a barrier around the great pyramid, sealing the corpse of Mythrax within.', '', 148982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He calls himself Emperor Korthek, but long ago he was one of the Keepers, entrusted to protect the tomb.\n\nHis hunger for war goes against everything our loa stands for, yet he denounces and defies her by raising an army that plans to conquer all of Zuldazar.', '', 148981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss is our beloved loa.\n\nWhen Mythrax ravaged our lands and threatened to wipe us from existence, it was she who stopped him, giving her life to save ours.\n\nUnlike the Faithless, we still feel her presence, and believe that one day she will be returned to us.', '', 148980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
