('Sulthis was murdered, but not before he was able to safeguard his key. Those of us still loyal to Sethraliss were forced out of our homes and into hiding. We have been fighting the Faithless ever since.', '', 148389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
