('For years, we lived in peace, as Sethraliss would have wanted. Our land was ruined and our loa was gone, but we adapted. We knew without a doubt that one day, Sethraliss would return.', '', 148383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To ensure that the barrier could not be easily broken, we each created a key. The magic we used to form the barrier can only be undone when all three keys are present. And thus, the Keepers were formed.', '', 148382, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
