('I saw it one time, it was amaaaaaaaaaaaaazing!', '', 148327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know there was fire in this place under the water?!', '', 148326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man, that\'s not even really the point right now, what is really the point is...', '', 148325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, he wasn\'t. He just looked at me, then squashed a crab...', '', 148324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d be impressed, wouldn\'t you? Or at least pretend?', '', 148323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That made me sad.', '', 148322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a shell one time. It was a nice shell. I told Korl about it. Korl didn\'t care.', '', 148321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not like barnacles. Korl says that people that like barnacles are evil.', '', 148320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much has changed since the days when Korthek and I would teach the wisdom of Sethraliss together in this place...\n\nNow the holy sites lie in ruins and Sethraliss is, at best, forgotten. More often, reviled.\n\nKorthek... What have you done to our people, old friend?', '', 148318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnacles are bad. Do you like barnacles, Mr. Nimmy?', '', 148317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like barnacles because they make my feet itch. Korl says he does not like barnacles either.', '', 148316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barnacles are bad.', '', 148315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
