('You\'re scared of spiders now? Just squish them under your foot!', '', 148206, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now spiders are attacking in the woods! We can\'t chop trees when we\'re being killed, boss!', '', 148205, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the task is up to us, $n. Let\'s see how bad this spider problem really is.', '', 148204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have made us exiles in our own land.', '', 148203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough meddling! The towers, the towers!', 148202, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not question me, Saurfang! We must draw their attention from my war machine so it can destroy the towers. Casualties are inevitable.', 148201, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re sending our troops to their deaths! We need soldiers on the battlefield to reinforce the--', '', 148200, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 106266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forget the army, we can deal with them later. Blast the siege towers!', 148199, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me as close as you can to Nazmir.', 'Get me as close as you can to Nazmir.', 148197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are you going?', 148196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything made can be broken! Genn, follow me!', '', 148195, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4000, 105290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anything like it...', '', 148194, 0, 0, 0, 70, 2800, 103035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have no idea what you\'re up against, boy king. We\'ve only just begun!', 148193, 0, 0, 0, 70, 7800, 0, 109620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is over, Sylvanas! The walls of Lordaeron will soon come crashing down around you.', '', 148192, 0, 0, 0, 70, 6739, 105289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not gonna be baby pterrordax fodder!', 'I not gonna be baby pterrordax fodder!', 148190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokhan gonna have my hide for gettin\' caught by da wildlife.', 'Rokhan gonna have my hide for gettin\' caught by da wildlife.', 148189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to go check on the workers in the woods. If we\'re in danger here, I worry about their safety out there!', '', 148188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware, mon. I thought I be careful, but another beast swooped down on me from da side. Clever girl.', 'Beware, mon. I thought I be careful, but another beast swooped down on me from da side. Clever girl.', 148187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will you do, exile me to Vol\'dun again? Now stay still!', '', 148186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me to die, criminal! Your fate is in Vol\'dun now. It is de law, and you are violating it by staying here.', '', 148185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, dat hurt real bad.', 'Ooh, dat hurt real bad.', 148184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks mon, but you and I should be gettin\' outta here!', 'Thanks mon, but you and I should be gettin\' outta here!', 148183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay still, Zaluto. We will cure dis infection and get you fixed up.', '', 148182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop moving around. We will cure dis infection and get you back on your feet.', '', 148181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun\'s power take you!', 148180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun, accept dis offering of flesh and bone.', 148179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, criminal... you are exiled to Vol\'dun. If you stay here, you will be violating Zandalari law!', '', 148178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise be G\'huun!', 148177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My power grows!', 148176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blood for G\'huun...', 148175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for de sacrifice!', 148174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For de glory of G\'huun!', 148173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a dart.', 'I need a dart.', 148172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De beasts of de Preserve are active today.', 148171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be a while before dey can regroup. Thank you.', 148170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disciples of Zul and de mogu are gathering forces at de Temple of de Prophet. You know what to do.', 148169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They won\'t get past me!', '', 148168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve not heard from Alleria yet, either. She was supposed to gather support from Gnomeregan.', '', 148167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. Dat should ensure de health of de beasts for a while.', 148166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beasts in de Preserve have been falling ill to a strange poison. Here, use dis on dem. But take care. Some are already too far gone and may turn on you.', 148165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And burn this note after reading it, you buffoon!', 148164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer no insolence from the soot-smeared rabble. Make examples if you must. All that matters is that our clients get their supplies on time.', 148163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The chemists are producing excellent powder. You WILL keep them supplied with refined Azerite, or I\'ll find someone who can.', 148162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t care how you do it, I want those forges running day and night!', 148161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kindly direct inquiries to Mister Farthing or Mister Williams.', 148160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Regarding increased company presence on site: Rest assured, they are here for your safety.', 148159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Faithful employees! Effective immediately, all shifts are doubled. We do not ask this of you lightly. Your hard work ensures the safety of Kul Tiras in these uncertain times!', 148158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear me powa!', 'Fear me powa!', 148157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometime it look like da whole swamp be out ta get us! Good ting you be up to da challenge!', '', 148156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a bad feelin\' about dis... Our scouts on patrol shoulda been back long ago. Find dem and see where dey at.', '', 148155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More than that, we\'ll use it to destroy them! Come on! Everyone climb aboard!', 148154, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll ride that monster out of here!', '', 148153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fashioned a greater control charm out of the others we acquired. Use it on the demolisher!', '', 148152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat will teach dem to venture out from Nazmir! I am glad I can count on you, champion.', 148151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls have broken through to de rivermarsh! Champion! Kill their vanguard and burn any corpses dey can raise from de dead.', 148150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!', '', 148147, 0, 0, 53, 70, 0, 106526, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sick of these excuses. Trees don\'t come to life! Get back to work!', '', 148146, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to head back to de arena. Be careful out dere. Jakra\'zet has put a hefty price on your head.', 'I need to head back to de arena. Be careful out dere. Jakra\'zet has put a hefty price on your head.', 148145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple is in ruins, but we may find safety there if the loa will take us in...', '', 148144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be safe here much longer.', '', 148143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never heard of the Ring of Tides, but it must be powerful if Azshara is sending an army to retrieve it.', '', 148142, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers are recovering quickly. Bah... dey always do. No doubt we will face dem again.', '', 148141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese feathered vipers are known for their aggressive infestations, but dis is getting out of hand! Destroy their eggs to keep their population in check.', '', 148140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Reveal of the true power of the blood trolls, a giant corrupted titan monster, huge armies of blood trolls, and Ateena mocking Talanji. Ends with a horde of blood trolls descended upon everyone.', 'PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Reveal of the true power of the blood trolls, a giant corrupted titan monster, huge armies of blood trolls, and Ateena mocking Talanji. Ends with a horde of blood trolls descended upon everyone.', 148139, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korthek the Brave! \n\nTales of strength and strategic agility are passed through camps of young warriors, and they all speak his name. When the battle is bleakest, tales of Korthek ignite the flames of battle.\n\nHe is able to turn the tide single-handedly! He fights for his people with passion and ferocity!\n\nHe is a beloved brother.\n\nFor him, none will compare to the sethrak. We are the best. We are the wise. We are the mighty.\n\nWith him at our back, no outsiders shall harm our powerful nation!', '', 148138, 0, 55754, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lawful, just, faithful, firm - these are the words that echo the name of Vorrik.\n\nHis service to Sethraliss is profound and unwavering. His wisdom and clarity of vision are without question. \n\nThere is nothing that will distract Vorrik from his duty as Keeper. \n\nWith his honored brothers at his back, he will maintain his eyes on the horizon. \n\nNo enemy will ever get near enough to awaken our sleeping giant.', '', 148137, 0, 55754, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sulthis is the most closely connected to Sethraliss. The love he bears for his loa, and for the desert, inspired him to adopt the cobra as his spirit guide. \n\nHe is often regarded as the first Keeper. While his power was immense, he knew it wouldn\'t be enough to seal the tomb alone. He sought out others to share the responsibility. Vorrik and Korthek agreed, and thus the Keepers were formed.\n\nSethrak travel from far, and near, to place tokens of their affection at the feet of the statues of the Keepers. These tokens embody all that Sulthis represents.\n\nThe C\'Thraxxi must never have another chance to destroy everything we hold dear.', '', 148136, 0, 55754, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! A door in the tree!', 148133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is no one going to mention that massive wicker golem? Because I feel it should be mentioned.', '', 148132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One crisis at a time, my boy!', '', 148131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth is a bit safer, thanks tae yer efforts.', '', 148130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yerself. There\'s something strong around here, and it\'s empowered by Azerite!', '', 148129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat was good work, mon. Well done!', '', 148128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like a tortollan be over dere. See if dey be needin\' help.', '', 148127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, that was a good fight! This will make a fine story to tell the others.', '', 148126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, Lucille. Show them what you\'ve got.', '', 148125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you make this interesting, I don\'t want a boring fight!', '', 148124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll fight your summoned creature.', 'I\'ll fight your summoned creature.', 148123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you! You\'re a $c, right? Maybe you can help me, I\'m looking for an interesting story.\n\nI just picked up this scroll from a friend, supposed to summon something strong.\n\nYou up for fighting it? I want to see this thing in action.', '', 148122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will make a great story to tell the others. Here\'s something for your efforts. Keep it up.', 148121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm? There\'s something strange going on nearby. Be a dear and check it out. It could lead to something interesting.', 148120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one less blight we need tae worry about.', '', 148119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a powerful monstrosity nearby, fueled by the blood of Azeroth herself! Ye\'ve got tae destroy it before it does any harm.', '', 148118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torka asked me to deliver this to you.', 'Torka asked me to deliver this to you.', 148117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You actually did it! Quickly, over here!', '', 148116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104606, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lived many years and seen many things. The Tortaka tribe survived long before I was born and it will survive long after I am dead.', '', 148115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... dat hand be talkin\' quite a lot for not havin\' a mouth. Da spirits truly be mysterious.', '', 148114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the new Scroll of Fate\'s Hand.', 'Take the new Scroll of Fate\'s Hand.', 148113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Scroll of Fate\'s Hand\' be mysterious, but useful. Da undead be swarmin\' again along da coast. Go see what dat scroll can do, eh?', '', 148112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'da wants me home soon.', '', 148111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
