('C\'mon, you can afford another bauble or two.', 'C\'mon, you can afford another bauble or two.', 148090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98722, 98723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, you come on back with more of dat coin now, yes?', 'Come on back with more of dat coin, now.', 148089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98724, 98725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
