('Hah! I can always count on you to get da job done.', '', 148071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da scent of blood be thick in da air. Do what you do best and cause some havoc in Zal\'amak.', '', 148070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! I just want my family to be safe again.', '', 148069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of our valley!', '', 148068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to be ordered around by the likes of you!', '', 148067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'You have been judged worthy.\n\nReceive the blessing of Eraka no Kimbul. The Loa of Tigers awaits you.\'', '', 148066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are de prelates of Rezan, highest order of holy warriors to serve any loa.\n\nOur path is de elite, taking only those gifted from birth with prowess in battle and blessed by de loa, and crafting champions of light to defend our empire.\n\nAnd no, we do not have any openings or hand outs.', 148065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lieutenant Akaro eyes the edge of his blade, then smirks in your direction.>', '', 148064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'You have been judged unworthy.\n\nPonder the words of the great loa, Eraka no Kimbul, and return when you are ready.\'', '', 148063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good mornin\', sir.', '', 148062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll follow your lead. Remember: the key to going anywhere you don\'t belong is just to walk in like you own the place.', '', 148061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see the future.', 'They see the future.', 148060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see the face of their enemy.', 'They see the face of their enemy.', 148059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 148058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see shape and color.', 'They see shape and color.', 148057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see the truth.', 'They see the truth.', 148056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see that they belong to nature.', 'They see that they belong to nature.', 148055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They see the world around them.', 'They see the world around them.', 148054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life filled with pleasure.', 'A life filled with pleasure.', 148053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life filled with accomplishment.', 'A life filled with accomplishment.', 148052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life lived with honor.', 'A life lived with honor.', 148051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life lived in peace.', 'A life lived in peace.', 148050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life filled with glory.', 'A life filled with glory.', 148049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life lived in luxury.', 'A life lived in luxury.', 148048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Money. Lots of money.', 'Money. Lots of money.', 148047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A keen mind.', 'A keen mind.', 148046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great strength.', 'Great strength.', 148045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A handsome face.', 'A handsome face.', 148044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loyal followers.', 'Loyal followers.', 148043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An indomitable will.', 'An indomitable will.', 148042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always watch your back.', 'Always watch your back.', 148041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Act with courage in all matters.', 'Act with courage in all matters.', 148040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pride comes before the fall.', 'Pride comes before the fall.', 148039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look before you leap.', 'Look before you leap.', 148038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear is for the weak.', 'Fear is for the weak.', 148037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the strong survive.', 'Only the strong survive.', 148036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'What do those with vision see?\'', '', 148035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'What is a life well-lived?\'', '', 148034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'What is the source of power?\'', '', 148033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'What is the lesson of the leaping tiger?\'', '', 148032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey are nearly to de gates of Atal\'Dazar. Quick, we must catch up.', 148031, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to catch a ride on that ship and see where it\'s going?', '', 148030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Where?', '', 148029, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not to draw too much attention.', '', 148028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, Raal! You missed Rezan and Rastakhan!', 148027, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 106033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek nothing at all.', 'I seek nothing at all.', 148026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek great glory and prestige.', 'I seek great glory and prestige.', 148025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the knowledge of ancient kingdoms.', 'I seek the knowledge of ancient kingdoms.', 148024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the wealth and fortune of kings.', 'I seek the wealth and fortune of kings.', 148023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the power to slay my enemies.', 'I seek the power to slay my enemies.', 148022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got any more business in town, now\'s the time to do it. Let me know when you\'re ready to board that ship and go wherever the wind takes us.', '', 148021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the loa\'s blessing.', 'I seek the loa\'s blessing.', 148020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A mysterious voice echoes within your mind.>\n\n\'What do you seek?\'', '', 148019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tide... ebbs...', 148018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My queen... I have... failed...', 148017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Abyss take you...', 148016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My life... for... Azshara...', 148015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re out! I\'ll make my way back to Roz with the report. You\'ve saved the town, hero!', '', 148014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104600, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. I\'ve got them right where I want \'em.', '', 148013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just want to wish you good luck. We\'re all counting on you.', '', 148012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104598, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', '', 148011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104597, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Promises, promises.', '', 148009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will stab you with your own tusks.', 148008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loti, what took you so long?', '', 148007, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! You got their attention now! Big horde incoming!', '', 148006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That ain\'t gonna hit the monster, aim harder!', '', 148005, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da rest of dese fellas be all yours. Have fun, but don\'t forget ya still be payin\' me a debt. Send me their souls!', '', 148004, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 109292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Ya tink I gonna let ya die when ya still owe me?', '', 148003, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 109291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat gonna set those scaly lizards back a while! Our mages will wanna take a look at dis gem, too.', '', 148002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese sethrak be carryin\' gems overflowin\' wit\' power. Whittle dem down and secure a gem of our own.', '', 148001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that\'ll do nicely. I trust those slithery critters didn\'t give you too much trouble?', '', 148000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A swarm of quilljets? How very gracious of them to show up just when I ran out of ink! I have just the thing for such an occasion! Now, hop into the water and siphon that precious ink for me.', '', 147999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We got a BIG problem here!', 147998, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat will give de Rastari a bit of breathing room. You have done well, champion.', '', 147997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Rastari have been working to flush de mogu out of de warport, but to no avail. Rally dem, and crush any mogu dat get in your way.', '', 147996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! We want no part in this!', '', 147994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YEAH! CURVEBALL!', '', 147993, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mate, I\'ll see you up ahead.', '', 147992, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cagney, get these kids on a ferry back to town. Taelia will make sure they get placed into a shelter.', '', 147991, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curveball! Curveball!', '', 147990, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pao-me hands you his report.', '', 147989, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This thing ain\'t a problem, we just gotta use the ol\' curveball!', '', 147988, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feng hands you his report.', '', 147987, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fight again!', '', 147986, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 102124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not have my permission to die! Arise!', '', 147985, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 102116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show de strength of Rezan himself.', 147983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese vile followers of Zul corrupt Rezan\'s temple! Teach dem to show respect to de loa.', 147982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 110066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These goblins must be stopped! Focus on the shredder!', '', 147981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smoke is... so thick...', '', 147980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people deserve a peaceful crossing to de other side. My thanks to you, champion.', 147979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You owe souls to Bwonsamdi, and I think it is a good time to make good on your deal. Free de souls trapped in those horrors and guide dem to Bwonsamdi\'s temple.', 147978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, hero. For dis, you will want to hold on tight!', 147977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better to deal with a threat now than regret it later.', '', 147975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 115037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murlocs invade our shores. If dey aren\'t culled immediately, dey will quickly grow beyond our control.', '', 147974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 115036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the desert take your soul.', 147973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you\'re there, $r. Your scent tickles my tongue.', 147972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107777, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First we must assemble my forces. Ah! $n, dat gong should do de trick.', 147970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 102008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dig. Seek. Find. The final key must be here!', 147969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those blasted Zandalari are closing in, we must find it before they do!', 147968, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Korthek will reward us, if we find the key first!', 147967, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107774, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The key is ours, $c! The other Keepers failed in their task! For Korthek, I will not!', 147966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107773, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chao hands you his report.', '', 147965, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What intelligence have you gathered?', 'What intelligence have you gathered?', 147964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh. There are ears all around. Stone ears, but ears nonetheless.', 'Shh. There are ears all around. Stone ears, but ears nonetheless.', 147963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me! I\'m no fighter!', 'Forgive me! I\'m no fighter!', 147962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mercy! Mercy, please!', 'Mercy! Mercy, please!', 147961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They made me do it!', 'They made me do it!', 147960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry! Please don\'t hurt me!', 'I\'m sorry! Please don\'t hurt me!', 147959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you say so...', 'If you say so...', 147958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sure about this?!', 'You sure about this?!', 147957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not cut out for this!', 'I\'m not cut out for this!', 147956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just stand there! Help me!', 'Don\'t just stand there! Help me!', 147955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Help me with this intruder!', 'You there! Help me with this intruder!', 147954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This intelligence will prove invaluable to our efforts against the Horde. Well done, champion.', '', 147953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Shado-Pan allies have infiltrated the mogu in the troll warport. Seek out their information, and do not hesitate to cut down any mogu that you see!', '', 147952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattering', 'Shattering', 147951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll leave you to the mystery, then... while I see about cracking more coven skulls!', 147950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With de gorillas beaten back, we can relax a little. Until de next inevitable disaster.', 147949, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese gorillas have gotten into de kaja\'mite again! See dat dey are put back into their place before dey run amok over Zuldazar.', 147948, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sethrak have been chasing me for days. These dunes are death.\n\nI thought you were killed when we crashed... Did anyone else survive?', '', 147947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, well, yeah... user manuals are for schmucks. Newt, we\'re doing this live!', '', 147946, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, boss... we got some screws missin\' in places that the manual clearly says require screws.', 147945, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got it, Princess. You\'re about to get a front row seat to the latest and greatest of goblin technology!', '', 147944, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MORE?! Bring it on!', '', 147943, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Criminy. I never blew up an Old God before. Maybe I shoulda brought more explosives!', '', 147942, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 101300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many more of these goons we gotta blow up before they get the message?', 147941, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, Princess, I ain\'t no expert, but I think you guys got a blood troll problem.', '', 147940, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, boss, I believe the technical term is \"Forsaken\".', 147939, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We WORK with undead all the time, you idiot!', '', 147938, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa whoa WHOA! Nobody said we\'d have to deal with undead!', '', 147937, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 101301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Julwaba, are you hurt?', 147936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s how goblins from Kezan roll!', '', 147935, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 101304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wakey wakey, time to DIE!', '', 147934, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aw! They blow up so fast, I can\'t even enjoy it! Well... maybe I can enjoy it a little.', 147933, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breakfast is served!', '', 147932, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s your Blood God now, huh? Bleh, ya creeps!', '', 147931, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 101303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bet we could blow up a whole lotta gnomes with this baby!', '', 147930, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 101302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And BOOM goes the bad guy!', 147929, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well excuuuuuuse me, princess!', 147928, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh> Did I really think working with goblins would turn out any other way?', 147927, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 102007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrible swamp you all got here. Would be real nice if somethin\' happened to it!', '', 147926, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tonight you\'re sleepin\' with the swamp fishies!', 147925, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna blow up your Old God, goblin style!', '', 147924, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now if you don\'t mind, I\'ve got a few more scores to settle.', '', 147923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 104225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah that\'s right buddy, take a walk!', '', 147922, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 105712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! I\'ve found her!', 147921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
