('', 'Uh oh.', 147754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, what be dat?', 147753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did ya see da way dey be squirmin\'?', 147752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Tell Yash if he wants to live a crazy story that he should go to Gloom Hollow to help stop the blood trolls and their god.)', '(Tell Yash if he wants to live a crazy story that he should go to Gloom Hollow to help stop the blood trolls and their god.)', 147751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think a lot of tortollans want to hear the details of a dead and gutted loa... what am I going to tell the others now when I get back?', '', 147750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Tell Korkush there\'s a great story to be had if he helps the Horde fight the blood trolls and save the Zandalari.)', '(Tell Korkush there\'s a great story to be had if he helps the Horde fight the blood trolls and save the Zandalari.)', 147749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, Torga\'s dead, the blood trolls have overrun this place... the entire pilgrimage is ruined! There\'s no point in me staying here.', '', 147748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Tell Crez about what happened to Torga, and the chance for new stories to be told if he goes to Gloom Hollow.)', '(Tell Crez about what happened to Torga, and the chance for new stories to be told if he goes to Gloom Hollow.)', 147747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A millennia-old spirit bent on vengeance who wants to kill us all? Lovely.', '', 147744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their master?', '', 147743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Based on what I overheard while held captive, I suspect this entity is connected to the Drust.', '', 147742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their master hates the Kul Tirans with every fiber of his being. Even the witches are mere pawns in his bid to return to our realm.', '', 147741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A malevolent being who grants them power. I have heard his rage echoing in the darkness.', '', 147740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The witches spoke of a \"Grand Rite\" to call forth their master.', '', 147739, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more pressing matters, Inquisitor!', '', 147738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe so. Thank you, Marten... $n.', '', 147737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must stop this \"Grand Rite\" at all costs.', 147736, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 108180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not just any Drust... their leader, I would wager. The being Arom Waycrest fought against in ages past.', 147735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should get you back to Falconhurst.', 147734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master Ashton, are you back with us?', 147733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaahhh!!! The Brue!', '', 147732, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! If anything moves, kill it!', '', 147731, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh? What do you want? I\'m ready to head home, there\'s nothing interesting happening here anymore.', '', 147730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planting Cursed Coin', 'Planting Cursed Coin', 147729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, mon. Dem... tings shoulda stayed under da dirt where dey belong.', '', 147728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem Natha\'vor trolls be waterin\' da local plants with sacrifices. Stop dem before we be overrun by flesh-eatin\' plants!', '', 147727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got it.', '', 147726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Champions, with me. Mekkatorque, backtrack through the keep with the rest of our forces, and station them at Brill. Be ready to strike on my command.', '', 147725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go. Find ya way down de road to de best spot. Plant dis coin in de middle of de road. But be careful not to let that hungry predators be seein\' you...', '', 147724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n, what do you think all of this stuff is for?', '', 147723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks like a small piece of those things outside...', '', 147722, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a map? Hmm.... there is a red mark near the flower field.', '', 147721, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have you brought something ancient and tarnished to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have you brought something ugly and scaly to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sniffs> Eww... that\'s definitely not honey.', '', 147718, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just harvested a fresh batch, if you\'re interested.', '', 147717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to The Four Stingers, $pr, home to Vol\'dun\'s only honey hive!', '', 147716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have you brought something beautiful and luminescent to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seek out and destroy our enemies!', 147714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, spirit of water! We require your aide!', 147713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slow and steady may win down here, but the skies, they\'re another matter.', 147712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to the other loa. I will hunt the gardens for more invaders to slay.', '', 147711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heretics dare enter MY lair? I will bury you here!', '', 147710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, little hero! Have you come to join me in slaying these heretics?', '', 147709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me...', '', 147708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirit of fire. May the elements guide your way! We call upon your aide in the battle before us!', 147707, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I\'ve seen... The horror... The horror...', '', 147706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I\'ve seen...', '', 147705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have ya brought somethin\' bright and shiny to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look... the honey, it\'s moving all on its own!', '', 147703, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Hand the potion to Master Ashton>', '<Hand the potion to Master Ashton>', 147702, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. Have ya brought somethin\' smooth and gilded to da Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing! I wanna be a $pc when I grow up.', '', 147700, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It didn\'t stand a chance!', '', 147699, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take that!', '', 147698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, you\'re really strong!', '', 147697, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right $glad:lass;, meet me over near the Shuddering Spires. There\'s some crystal there that we\'ll need fer the smithin\'.', '', 147696, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph!', '', 147695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Listen, I appreciate what ye did fer me back there. After all that work ye did, I wasn\'t sure if that anvil meant more to ye than I did.$b$bThankfully, Therazane was kind enough to give ye the anvil anyways.$b$bI\'d heed her warnin\', though. Don\'t go sharin\' how we made it with anyone else.', '', 147694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph mph. Mph mph mph.', '', 147693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph. Mph.', '', 147692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, and Sinker\'s got a tale o\' his own!', 147691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph, mph mph mph!', '', 147690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, Sinker\'s got a point. Ozumat ain\'t been seen since the Cataclysm!', 147689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that is how I hoisted the very fiend of the dark below to this very mast!', '', 147688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to seal the deal!', '', 147687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the beast\'s tentacles subdued, it was time to finish the job.', '', 147686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ozumat?! Not on my wharf!', '', 147685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All me fishin\' caught the hungry eye of none other than the leviathan Ozumat!', '', 147684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaand on that note, time for this chicken to fly the coop! Good luck my friend!', '', 147683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you worry Pam, we won\'t ruffle a single feather!', '', 147682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck. Remember, none of this traces back to me.', 147681, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This island is ripe with thermal activity. After a geyser plumes, Azerite is sure to spill out of the fissures. This has got to be worth a fortune!', 'This island is ripe with thermal activity. After a geyser plumes, Azerite is sure to spill out of the fissures. This has got to be worth a fortune!', 147680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once more with feeling, my fancy friend! Let\'s get these chickens on a boat!', '', 147679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gladly.', '', 147678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I\'ve brought a friend of my own, Hank. Verick, show them what you do best.', '', 147677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greer-y, my friend! How are you this fine day? We\'ve got some fine feathered friends ready to ship!', '', 147676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well well, look who we have here.', '', 147675, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people face threats from every direction, but the most dangerous is the corruption embraced by the blood trolls.\n\nI can smell their foul stench nearby. When you are ready, we will hunt the source together.', '', 147674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trifling victory... but a victory nonetheless.', '', 147673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seize this momentum!', '', 147672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find nothing in these salt-soaked halls...', 'You find nothing in these salt-soaked halls...', 147671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortality clarified in a single blow!', '', 147670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A decisive pummeling!', '', 147669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their cursed champions fall!', '', 147668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the fiend falls, a faint hope blossoms.', '', 147667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy. Them. All.', '', 147666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest now, adventurer. Your mind is too fractured by this place. Return in three days, and you may have the will to brave these horrors again.', '', 147665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to hunt with the pack.', 'I\'m ready to hunt with the pack.', 147664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to de pack, $p. You\'ve done well.', 147663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring the Horde to their knees!', 'Bring the Horde to their knees!', 147662, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hooah!', 'Hooah!', 147661, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies will fall!', 'Our enemies will fall!', 147660, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Stromgarde!', 'For Stromgarde!', 147659, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 147658, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of the Alliance!', '', 147657, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 147656, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrust!', '', 147655, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent.', '', 147654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember your training.', '', 147653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand strong.', '', 147652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good form.', '', 147651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done.', '', 147650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blades at the ready!', '', 147649, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not forget to honor me, $p. I\'m watching.', '', 147648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well sending this one to me, Loti. $p strengthens the pack.', '', 147647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will step through the shadows once more to speed our journey. Hold on tight.', '', 147646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise a statue to me in the city, $p. Tell the people of the pack\'s feats. Our feats.', '', 147645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to return to Dazar\'alor as your champion.', 'I\'m ready to return to Dazar\'alor as your champion.', 147644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You led the pack well today, $p.\n\nTogether, we are strong.', '', 147643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is what I call fishin\'!', '', 147642, 0, 64133, 0, 64, 0, 112151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishin\'', 'Fishin\'', 147641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Climb onto my back once more and I will take you to Dazar\'alor.', '', 147640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You led the pack well, $p. I\'d welcome you as my champion.', '', 147639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood won\'t even dry before it is forgotten.', '', 147638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, who was that!? She fights with such fury...', '', 147637, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p will lead the pack for now... Prove yourself worthy of the honor.', '', 147636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood trolls are close. Our pack has already found a few.', '', 147635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your feet, pack! Rouse and ready each other while I\'m away. We hunt soon!', '', 147634, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hop on my back, $p. Even you cannot keep up with a loa in a hurry.', '', 147633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could feel me mind slipping. I owe ye me life, mainlander.', 'I could feel me mind slipping. I owe ye me life, mainlander.', 147632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 99116, 99117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blood will poison dis land for generations.', 147631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arrogant, weak loa slaves! G\'huun is supreme!', 147630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, don\'t worry. It\'s a special slow fuse I designed. It only goes off when I\'m bored with a conversation.\n\nSo... Boom.', 147629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you holding a lit stick of dynamite?', 'Are you holding a lit stick of dynamite?', 147628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some people say handling explosives is dangerous work. I\'d say they are bang on.', 147627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, which will it be, fleshling? Make your choice.', 147625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Or you may choose to take the anvil you created, the prize you were truly after this whole time.', 147624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grab a crate, we got to get this stuff out of here while we still have a chance.', 147623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may either choose to free your ally, the one who betrayed his people by sharing our coveted knowledge with you and faces a punishment of death...', 147622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d like to offer you a choice, fleshling.', 147621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pick the hatchling up.>', '<Pick the hatchling up.>', 147620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon greets you with a soft screech.>\n\nSkree!', '', 147618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon bobs his head at your approach.>', '', 147617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon perks up at your attention.>\n\nSkree?', '', 147616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kua\'fon peers at you inquisitively.>', '', 147615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader is just ahead, $p. Continue the charge and, together, we will kill her.', '', 147614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Now that was fun...', '', 147613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charge, brothers and sisters! Stop for nothing!', '', 147612, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 104945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me, $p. I will show you how a loa fights.', '', 147611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally to me, pack. It\'s time to end this!', '', 147610, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 104944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ormhun! What is the meaning of this?', 147609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
