('Watch yer head in the tunnels!', 'Watch yer head in the tunnels!', 147460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97935, 97936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Iron clan will forge a new future.', 'The Dark Iron clan will forge a new future.', 147459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97933, 97934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer ta stay underground.', 'I prefer ta stay underground.', 147458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97931, 97932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honest work is good fer the soul.', 'Honest work is good fer the soul.', 147457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97929, 97930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Black Anvil bless ye.', 'May the Black Anvil bless ye.', 147456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97927, 97928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t burn yerself on the way out.', 'Don\'t burn yerself on the way out.', 147455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97925, 97926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, back ta work.', 'Well, back ta work.', 147454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97923, 97924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ye here ta lend a hand?', 'Are ye here ta lend a hand?', 147452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97949, 97950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help ye?', 'How can I help ye?', 147451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97947, 97948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d rather be hammerin\' than talkin\'.', 'I\'d rather be hammerin\' than talkin\'.', 147450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97945, 97946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak yer piece, if ye must.', 'Speak yer piece, if ye must.', 147449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97943, 97944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m nae much fer smalltalk.', 'I\'m nae much fer smalltalk.', 147448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97941, 97942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warm yerself by the forge.', 'Warm yerself by the forge.', 147447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97939, 97940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit it out. I got smeltin\' ta do.', 'Spit it out. I got smeltin\' ta do.', 147446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97937, 97938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you doin\', you crazy beast? Noooo!', '', 147445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak yer mind.', '', 147444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, we\'re off to the Norwington Estate! I will surely see you again soon, my fine fancy friend.', '', 147443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... fantastic.', '', 147442, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks muchly, Greer-y boy. I\'m sure I\'ll be seeing you again soon!', '', 147441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Very well, Hank. You may pass.', '', 147440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the mine back? We\'re going to need help. Find my sister and meet me outside the mine!', 147439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*ahem*... Neigh.', '', 147438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Greery boy! We are off to Norwington\'s! My associate here has our documentation in order.', '', 147437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, goody. Just when I thought today would be dull. What is it today, Hank?', '', 147436, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes of course I will ride this horse. What a good horse this is!', '', 147435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Alright my friend, it\'s up to you! Let\'s help this horse achieve its dreams!', '', 147434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to hunt with the pack.', 'I\'m ready to hunt with the pack.', 147433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pack grows restless.', '', 147432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars at $n.', '', 147431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murderous beast!', '', 147430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 147429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disgusting pig!', '', 147428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me tell all of you \'bout the time I caught the biggest fish in all of Azeroth!', '', 147427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sinker\'s right, sharks are solitary predators! I don\'t believe a word.', '', 147426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 112161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mph mph mph!', '', 147425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And that is how I got me deadliest cache - Tidemaw\'s fin. Sold fer a pretty copper, too!', 147424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Theock wants to retake the mine.', 'Theock wants to retake the mine.', 147423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... our last meeting was not our final. Good to see you again, $n.\n\nAre you ready to pick up where we left off? \n\nThese disgusting pigs must die.', '', 147422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yazma and Zul never approached me about their little coup. I suspect dey knew deep down I am too much of a Zandalari for their little rebellion.$b$bAlso, I would have killed dem on de spot, so good chance dat might have been why.', '', 147421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 147420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drinking a potion!', '', 147419, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will.', 'We will.', 147418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, excuse me.\n\nWhy don\'t the two of you show me how good of a ride your horse is, then?', '', 147417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the fallout of the wound in Silithus>', '<Recall the fallout of the wound in Silithus>', 147416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the fallout of the wound in Silithus>', '<Recall the fallout of the wound in Silithus>', 147415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the events following Argus>', '<Recall the events following Argus>', 147414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to find the alpha o\' these beasts.', 147413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the sharks at bay, I sought out the alpha.', 147412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! I\'ll believe it when I see it.\n\n<Greer inspects your horse up and down.>\n\nAnd I am quite confident I will never see it.', '', 147411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s uh... tougher than he looks.', 'He\'s uh... tougher than he looks.', 147410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuse me, but my horse comes from a long line of successful show horses. Have you even heard of the Carmallo pedigree?', 'Excuse me, but my horse comes from a long line of successful show horses. Have you even heard of the Carmallo pedigree?', 147409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To... compete?\n\nNow, I do not mean to be rude, but your horse looks as though it can barely walk in a straight line. I doubt it can carry a person on its back, let alone complete in an equestrian festival!', '', 147408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How\'s that fer chummin\' the waters?', 147407, 0, 64134, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall be taking this horse to the Norwington Equestrian and Hunt Festival.', 'I shall be taking this horse to the Norwington Equestrian and Hunt Festival.', 147406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t you see I\'m a little busy? This place is in shambles. I don\'t have the workforce nor the materials to get this under control.', 147405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where there\'s a gill, there\'s a way.', 147404, 0, 64134, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kennings Lodge?\n\nMy good $Gsir:madam;, you are on the complete wrong side of the Sound for that.', '', 147403, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that all you got?', 147402, 0, 64134, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like stabbin\' fish on dry land!', 147401, 0, 64134, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe it\'s... Kennings Lodge?', 'I believe it\'s... Kennings Lodge?', 147400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, of course. One of the mainlanders.\n\nAnd where may you be taking this horse?', '', 147399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To arms! Land sharks be takin\' the wharf!', 147398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They ride rams in Ironforge, not horses!', '', 147397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was a dark, stormy night when the land sharks attacked.', 147396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... Iron...forge?', 'Uh... Iron...forge?', 147395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should be earnin\' hazard pay for this!', 'Should be earnin\' hazard pay for this!', 147394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in the world savin\' business, ain\'t ya? Maybe you should get ta work!', 'You\'re in the world savin\' business, ain\'t ya? Maybe you should get ta work!', 147393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t easy ta meet my quota with that giant sword loomin\' overhead!', 'Ain\'t easy ta meet my quota with that giant sword loomin\' overhead!', 147392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure hope the boss knows what he\'s doin\'.', 'Sure hope the boss knows what he\'s doin\'.', 147391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the Dark Lady can\'t save us now...', 'Even the Dark Lady can\'t save us now...', 147390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world\'s bleedin\' out. Hope you can stop it, hero.', 'The world\'s bleedin\' out. Hope you can stop it, hero.', 147389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been staring up at that sword all day. Still can\'t believe it\'s real.', 'Been staring up at that sword all day. Still can\'t believe it\'s real.', 147388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are all the other heroes who are supposed to protect us?', 'Where are all the other heroes who are supposed to protect us?', 147387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought this horse in with me when I arrived from Lordaeron.', 'I brought this horse in with me when I arrived from Lordaeron.', 147386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure hope you can do something to save us, hero.', 'Sure hope you can do something to save us, hero.', 147385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be at home with my family...', 'I should be at home with my family...', 147384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes. One... palomino horse.\n\nWhere are you bringing this horse in from?', '', 147383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doomsayers were right. Azeroth is dying.', 'The doomsayers were right. Azeroth is dying.', 147382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe this is the end of days.', 'Maybe this is the end of days.', 147381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way we\'re survivin\' this.', 'No way we\'re survivin\' this.', 147380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world\'s bleeding out. Can you stop it, hero?', 'The world\'s bleeding out. Can you stop it, hero?', 147379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been staring up at that sword all day. Still can\'t believe it\'s real.', 'I\'ve been staring up at that sword all day. Still can\'t believe it\'s real.', 147378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the documentation.>', '<Present the documentation.>', 147377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a day goes by where a smuggler doesn\'t attempt to pull the wool over my eyes.\n\nAnd not a day goes by where they do not fail.\n\nTell me, shall that be you today?', '', 147376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a prophet, Zul did a poor job anticipating the Horde response to treachery. When his minions tried to storm this place after his coup, we \'educated\' them on who they were facing.', '', 147375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the King named you Speaker for the Horde? Good. My diplomacy skills mostly involve arrows.', '', 147374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is an... enthusiastic predator.', '', 147373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is de fate of dose who defy de great king!', '', 147372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, if you\'ll excuse me. I gotta see some men about a horse.', '', 147371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel your potion will work dis time, Cala, and Ben\'jin will get his mojo back.', 147370, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard \'im, pal. I\'ll take Bailey boy. You know what to do.', '', 147369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes alright, that horse matches the description. Take this documentation when you are quite ready, and get out of my hair.', '', 147368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey, mister inspector man! I got that horse right here. Can I get that stamp or what?', '', 147367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, keep it down would ya?', '', 147366, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hank sent me for documentation.', 'Hank sent me for documentation.', 147365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely day, innit?', '', 147364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then what happened?', 'And then what happened?', 147363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready fer some adventure?', '', 147362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now find dat stompy caravan brutosaur along dis road and give it a few nips. When Tik\'su comes tumbling down, take his hat and earn de favor of Jani...', '', 147361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. What brings ya to dis Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find Gral. Let him know what transpires here. We do not think he will approve. His sharp, pointy teeth could come in handy.', '', 147359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something out there. There is darkness. The naga\'s motives here were not self-driven. I will find out more. Grow in strength and wisdom, $n, we will need it.', '', 147358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleansing', 'Cleansing', 147357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Rezan is teaching dem to respect a loa\'s might. Come and see!', '', 147356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight, $p. Loa do not always travel on roads.', '', 147355, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Tiragarde Barracuda has the scent of your blood! Get back to land!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Tiragarde Barracuda has the scent of your blood! Get back to land!', 147354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Lord of de Hunt. Thank you.', 'Yes, Lord of de Hunt. Thank you.', 147353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pack and I will deal with the blood trolls. Keep the guards here to defend our people.', '', 147352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De scouts report an army forming out in de Rootway Collapse. We are sending many of de guard out to stop dem.', 'De scouts report an army forming out in de Rootway Collapse. We are sending many of de guard out to stop dem.', 147351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Lord of de Hunt. Third dis week.', 'Yes, Lord of de Hunt. Third dis week.', 147350, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another blood troll?', '', 147349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you smell it? The corruption is just ahead...', '', 147348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loyal pack is always strong.', '', 147347, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you stand alone, a single failure is death. But the pack covers each other\'s weaknesses.', '', 147346, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are strong, $p. Your prey cannot even be counted... but can you say the same of your allies?', '', 147345, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Young ones, protect our wounded! Keep Zajera safe.', '', 147344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, that ain\'t yours!', 'Hey, that ain\'t yours!', 147343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has gathered over 1200 Azerite and is near victory!', '', 147342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has gathered over 1200 Azerite and is near victory!', '', 147341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last \"hero\" who pestered me ended up reassigned to a construction project... as part of the foundation.', '', 147340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Hunter_FocusingShot.blp:20|t%s has been detected by an Ashvane Spotter!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Hunter_FocusingShot.blp:20|t%s has been detected by an Ashvane Spotter!', 147339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Git outta here!', 'Git outta here!', 147338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your grubby hands!', 'Watch your grubby hands!', 147337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi! That\'s mine!', 'Oi! That\'s mine!', 147336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got the parts tae get \'er up and runnin\', but it\'s gonna take time.', 'I\'ve got the parts tae get \'er up and runnin\', but it\'s gonna take time.', 147335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure what road ye took tae get here, but I haven\'t seen damage like this in quite some time.', 'Not sure what road ye took tae get here, but I haven\'t seen damage like this in quite some time.', 147334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'d ye say happened tae yer cart here? This\'ll take a bit tae get it runnin\' again.', 'What\'d ye say happened tae yer cart here? This\'ll take a bit tae get it runnin\' again.', 147333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye sure ye didn\'t hit anything on the way here?', 'Ye sure ye didn\'t hit anything on the way here?', 147332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did it, I made it out!', 'I did it, I made it out!', 147331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at them run, those prisoners will never make it off the beach!', '', 147330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, before I call in the muscle. I\'m a personal friend of the warchief, you know.', '', 147329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re just jealous of my pleasure palace!', '', 147328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A body doesn\'t get into this kinda shape by accident. I take gluttony very seriously.', '', 147327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m always three steps ahead of the competition.', '', 147326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave the thinkin\' to me, kid.', '', 147325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along. I got deadlines to meet!', '', 147324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This conversation stays between us. Got it?', '', 147323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We done? Gotta get to my lobe massage appointment.', '', 147322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for keepin\' it short, pal.', '', 147321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a card game to get back to.', '', 147320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up, pal.', '', 147319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Penny for my thoughts? Gotta do better than that!', '', 147318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time. Money. You get the drift.', '', 147317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time like the present... to get rich!', '', 147316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get down to business.', '', 147315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it snappy, kid.', '', 147314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better be here to make me money!', '', 147313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hm? What\'s that saurid doing?', 147311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we\'ve got the situation in Silithus under control. SI:7 can take the operation from here. Thanks again, $n.', '', 147310, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anythin\' like this in all my years! What can it be?', '', 147309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to you, we are now one step closer to understanding the effect that the blade is having on Silithus!', 147308, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mugambala', 'The Mugambala', 147306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the ingredients, Marten.', 'I have the ingredients, Marten.', 147305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The situation in Silithus is now under our control. I will see to the rest of the operation. Go with honor, $n.', '', 147304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think you\'re so powerful and wise? I\'ve got aches in my undercarriage older than your entire civilization.', 147303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was old before your people even figured out what \'words\' were.', '', 147302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you have the patience to outlast me?', '', 147301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been annoyed for much longer by far more obnoxious annoyers than you.', '', 147300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar asked me to deliver this letter.', 'Khadgar asked me to deliver this letter.', 147299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(':', ':', 147298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deep water coral and sandfury chiton, ancient scrolls full of that old-timey writin\', hand-whittled walking staffs adorned with rings, these are a few of my favorite things...', 147297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pests like you are the reason I left Un\'goro.', 147296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Knowledge is power. Except stupid knowledge. Avoid that if you can.', 147292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leaving so soon? But I was just starting a great story!', 147290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My back is killing me.', 147289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to Zandalar, they said. It\'s lovely this time of year, they said...', '', 147288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Knowledge is the best currency. But I do take gold and interesting trade-ins.', 147287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have great grandchildren older than you.', 147286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is about the journey, not the destination.', 147285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do so enjoy a good scroll.', 147284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s see what we\'ve got here...', '', 147283, 0, 55298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scram! Go on! Get away from there, ya pest.', '', 147282, 0, 55298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I sure hope so, because there\'s something else coming this way!', '', 147281, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waste Disposal Units open, forming Corruption Corpuscles!', 'Waste Disposal Units open, forming Corruption Corpuscles!', 147280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides seem to be calming. Perhaps our friend has made some progress.', '', 147279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_DEATHVORTEX:20|tFetid Devourer prepares to unleash |cFFFF0000|Hspell:262291|h[Rotting Regurgitation]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_DEATHVORTEX:20|tFetid Devourer prepares to unleash |cFFFF0000|Hspell:262291|h[Rotting Regurgitation]|h|r!', 147278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Captain. The longer we can keep it contained, the longer we have to stop it.', '', 147277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Locus-Walker is an intriguing fellow.\n\nAlleria seems to trust him... to a point.\n\nI think we can learn much from him, so long as we remain wary of his true intentions.', '', 147276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My scouts report that the corruption hasn\'t spread beyond the harbor yet. We\'re cullin\' any monsters that stray too far out.', 147275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya won dis battle, but ya can\'t hide here forever. Soon as ya leave... ya die!', 147274, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 98504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!', 147273, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 98503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Studying this rift has value, but we cannot neglect our duty.\n\nAzeroth must be defended. Our place is out there, fighting for our world.\n\nThe power that flows through us is a weapon. And weapons must be wielded.', 147272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, control demands sacrifice. Power never comes without a price. You risk losing those closest to you in order to save them.\n\nThis is the bargain we have made.\n\n<Alleria looks away.>', 147271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lightforged draenei came here to dance and kill demons. And we\'re all out of demons!', 147270, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turn off the disco ball and these lightforged draenei will still light up the stage!', 147269, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get down with your bad self, void elf!', 147268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just because you\'re an avatar of darkness doesn\'t mean you can\'t get funky. Hit it, void elves!', 147267, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An illusion!? Nope... it\'s just the dancing nightborne!', 147266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adventurers by day, dancers by night... borne. It\'s time to cheer for the nightborne!', 147265, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moose is loose! Highmountain tauren, GO!', 147264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They may come from Highmountain, but they sure can get low. It\'s the Highmountain tauren!', 147263, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa... easy. You\'re actaully a lot scarier than you look.', '', 147262, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apparently you\'re hard of hearing, so let me say this loud and clear for ya.$b$bWHAT I KNOW ABOUT IT AIN\'T GONNA MAKE ANY DIFFERENCE. NOW SCRAM, OR ELSE!', '', 147261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, you\'re startin\' to bother me.$b$bIf you don\'t let this go, you might find yourself at the wrong end of my hammer.', '', 147260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, $gmister:miss;, there ain\'t no point in askin\'. Ain\'t nobody seen one of them anvils in ages.$b$bJust enjoy the recipe and let people think you\'re some legendary blacksmith.', '', 147259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will kneel before our master!', 'You will kneel before our master!', 147257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your destruction!', 'I am your destruction!', 147256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall withstand the power of our master!', 'None shall withstand the power of our master!', 147255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The twilight is upon you!', 'The twilight is upon you!', 147254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cry for help... none shall answer you!', 'Cry for help... none shall answer you!', 147253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the harbingers of destruction!', 'We are the harbingers of destruction!', 147252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall oppose the Twilight\'s Hammer!', 'None shall oppose the Twilight\'s Hammer!', 147251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no heroes in oblivion!', 'There are no heroes in oblivion!', 147250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeker\'s Outpost: Dreadpearl Shallows', 'Seeker\'s Outpost: Dreadpearl Shallows', 147249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any day you get to be on de ocean is a good day, my friend! Where to?', 'Any day you get to be on de ocean is a good day, my friend! Where to?', 147248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you heading, mon?', 'Where are you heading, mon?', 147247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good day for a voyage! Where would you like to go?', 'It\'s a good day for a voyage! Where would you like to go?', 147246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressed with my technique? Heh, I would be too if I were you.$b$bSay, what do ya need? Some armor? Some weapons? A little training?', '', 147245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooo! dez teeth... be my own...', '', 147244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such pretty little teeth, give dem to Xu\'ba!', '', 147243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planting Stink Bomb', 'Planting Stink Bomb', 147242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This drink is green! Why is it green?', 'This drink is green! Why is it green?', 147241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde needs allies. This is true.\n\nBut to be worthy of a place here, those we recruit must have honor in their hearts. If they lack it, their presence only diminishes us.', '', 147240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Diplomacy has never been my strong suit.\n\nThis work is best left in your hands.', '', 147239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, sure. Allies. I get it.\n\nBut I got a business to run, see. And a rather delicate operation in the works.\n\nSo how about you handle your end and I\'ll handle mine.', '', 147238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The local cuisine has some... interesting spice to it.', 'The local cuisine has some... interesting spice to it.', 147237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well... the illustrious $ct. Still basking in the glory of your victory over the Legion, no doubt.$B$B<Nathanos rolls his eyes.>$B$BThe Dark Lady has entrusted you with securing new allies for the Horde. For your sake, let us hope her faith has not been misplaced.', '', 147236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit of Ol\' Vol\'jin still be strong in dis city, mon. Da work ya be doin\' honors his memory.', '', 147235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is always good to see you, $n. Let us work together to strengthen the Horde!', '', 147234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have spent too long depending on visions to guide me.\n\nIt is time we forge our own fate. Part of that is finding new allies to stand beside us.', '', 147233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squawk! It\'s the plank for you, you cowardly blowfish!', '', 147232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Tyrande says nothing. Her brow is furrowed, as if deep in thought.>', 147231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I had two eyepatches, so I wouldn\'t have to look at yer ugly mug! Squawk!', '', 147230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m more than happy to help the Alliance find new allies. My first steps into Stormwind were quite daunting, but now I consider it a home.', 147229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The young king reminds me so much of his father. More than he realizes, I think.\n\nHe\'s the right person to lead this effort and bring new faces into the Alliance.', '', 147228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My position has been eliminated... feels like early retirement.', 'My position has been eliminated... feels like early retirement.', 147227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The campaign on Argus was costly, but necessary. Now we must focus on defending our own lands.\n\nWe cannot sit idle while those Horde monsters build their forces.', '', 147226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to have a cushy office job in Orgrimmar.', 'I used to have a cushy office job in Orgrimmar.', 147225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much about Azeroth has changed in the years I was absent. But the Alliance remains an ideal worth fighting for.\n\nI will do everything in my power to make it stronger.', '', 147224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day Silvermoon will stand again on the side of the Alliance. I know it.', 147223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance needs strength. Unity. The king\'s plan tae bring in fresh blood is a good one.\n\nAs fer the Dark Iron clan, the Alliance needs us now more than ever.\n\nIf only I can show the rest o\' me clan how much we need allies ourselves, perhaps we can finally all agree that we are indeed already part o\' the Alliance.', 147222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here as part of a \"workforce adjustment.\"', 'We\'re here as part of a \"workforce adjustment.\"', 147221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been downwardly promoted.', 'I\'ve been downwardly promoted.', 147220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss Mida says I\'m bein\' discharged. The only things that oughta be discharged are guns and explosives!', 'Boss Mida says I\'m bein\' discharged. The only things that oughta be discharged are guns and explosives!', 147219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Downsized? I\'m already about as downsized as you can get!', 'Downsized? I\'m already about as downsized as you can get!', 147218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got the axe.$B$BSee? I brought it with me.', 'I got the axe.$B$BSee? I brought it with me.', 147217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting find, $n. Trouble stirs within the Zanchuli Council. We must learn more so that we can bring the matter to King Rastakhan.', '', 147216, 0, 55302, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thought of Zul allying with the naga is troubling indeed! We must make preparations to deal with this threat.', '', 147215, 0, 55301, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 39653),
('May the Light ever guide you, $n.', 'May the Light ever guide you, $n.', 147214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you ever need my assistance, you know where to find me.', 'Should you ever need my assistance, you know where to find me.', 147213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will always have steadfast allies here.', 'You will always have steadfast allies here.', 147212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To have given yourself wholly to the Light... you are an example to us all.', 'To have given yourself wholly to the Light... you are an example to us all.', 147211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Lightforged! Know that you are always welcome here in the Cathedral of Light.', '', 147210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really hated this tophat at first. What does a guy have to do for a good tricorne?\n\nBut I must say... this fits real nicely on my skull.', '', 147209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Psst... Yeah, you, $r.\n\nHey, can you put in a bad word for me with the Warchief? I need to get fired. Being a jerk to everyone isn\'t working!', '', 147208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('What do I have to do to get myself out of this job?\n\nI try to leave, some orc picks me up and plops me right back down here.', '', 147207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any idea how much it hurts to try to crack a smile?\n\nThis is ridiculous!', '', 147206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('I used to be a famous pirate!\n\nThey dig me up, hand me this tophat, then tell me I have to greet all of you newcomers with a smile on my face...', '', 147205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stand before Yazma, de king\'s spider. It is my duty to ensure dat schemes and plots dat would harm de kingdom are heard of before dey hatch.$b$bSo do not get any ideas... Horde filth.', 147204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you need something magically enhanced, or have you come to learn?', 147200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go. Find ya way to dis Big Hunter Mon\'s ammunition stores. Plant dis present for him. But don\'t be lettin\' de Eyes of Yazma see ya...', '', 147199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To seek, to strive... such things are exhausting! You are welcome to rest at this outpost for as long as we remain here.', '', 147198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I have a moment. What do ye want?', '', 147197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I do for you?', 147196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is an invitation-only gathering. Did you bring an invitation? No?$B$BI thought not.', '', 147193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Nice try, but you are missing a touch of darkness in that outfit.', '', 147192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have learned much from our fight against the Legion. In truth, these warframes are the culmination of many years of research.$B$BIf you wish, I can train you to craft similar devices.', '', 147191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And this scroll... this is the seal for the Zanchuli Council... and Queen Azshara? I am unable to read the text, but if anyone can decipher it, it will be Akru.', '', 147190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive work, to be sure! The specularity on this rock is stunning. I feel like it has an energy...', '', 147189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These machines are fantastic! How could they operate with no anomalies or chance of failure?$B$BOh, excuse me. Did you need something?', '', 147188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will admit, it took some time to grow accustomed to our transformation. At first, my usual dexterity felt... impeded.$B$BHowever, I can guarantee the techniques themselves have in no way been affected.', '', 147187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spent enough time with clumsy fingers here that I\'ve picked up a thing or two about treating injuries. Perhaps I can offer you some training?', '', 147183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The only good witch is a dead witch.', 147182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, then. Back to the fight!', 147181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough chitchat.', 147180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make it quick.', 147179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s your business here?', 147178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spit it out.', 147177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dark times. Tread carefully.', '', 147176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the witch\'s curse.', '', 147175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair winds and following seas.', '', 147174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps is it as Alleria Windrunner says, and the whispers of shadow can be controlled.\n\nBe on your guard, friend, and may the Ligh--\n\nHrm. Well... May fortune favor you.', '', 147173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grim tidings, I fear.', '', 147172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to Fallhaven?', '', 147171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, traveler.', '', 147170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Tread carefully, $c. Lady Alleria\'s name will only carry you so far.', '', 147169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Habutu, Zolani, take de Speaker of de Horde and ensure de Warport is safe. Today is not de final day of my reign.', '', 147168, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 109672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey near Warport Rastari as I speak. We should retreat to Zanchul while it is still an option.', '', 147167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king, you are in great peril. I see encroaching enemies claiming de throne for themselves.', '', 147166, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho there, traveler. Are ye lost, or just lookin\' for a bit o\' blacksmith knowledge?$b$bI\'m a bit rusty, but I still remember a thing or two.', '', 147162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So if she weighs the same as a duck... she\'s made of wood?', '', 147161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We found a witch, may we burn her?', '', 147160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I commend your dedication. However, I fear you walk a dangerous path.$B$BYou would best serve the Alliance away from the cathedral.', 'I commend your dedication. However, I fear you walk a dangerous path.$B$BYou would best serve the Alliance away from the cathedral.', 147159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On with the execu-- um, trial! I mean trial.', '', 147158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along. These witches aren\'t going to burn themselves.', '', 147157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! I\'ve important work to do.', '', 147156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 147155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 147154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help in whatever way I can, but I suggest you do not linger too long here.', 'I will help in whatever way I can, but I suggest you do not linger too long here.', 147153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What now?', '', 147152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('B-b-b bird, bird, bird! B-bird\'s the word! B-b-b-bird, bird, bird! The bird is the word!', '', 147151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody knows that the bird is the word.', '', 147150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you know about the bird?', '', 147149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy hunting.', '', 147148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s a good bird?', '', 147147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be seeing you.', '', 147146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.', '', 147145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely day for some witch hunting, isn\'t it?', '', 147144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say \"hi,\" Winston.', '', 147143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, you\'re nice and all, but I prefer someone a little less... desperate.', 147142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All talk, no action, huh? That\'s a shame.', 147141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You havin\' a good time there?', 147140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll put the coven down.', 147139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see you on the battlefield.', 147138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just tell me what to kill.', 147137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough sitting around.', 147136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade is ready.', 147135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'s the battle?', 147134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. What brings ya to dis Shrine of Scavengers?', '', 147133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must take arms against this sea of troubles, and by opposing, end them.', '', 147132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, Lord Waycrest. I knew him well.', '', 147131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? $b$bIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission.', '', 147130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am gone.', '', 147129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul waters lie ahead.', '', 147128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with the tides.', '', 147127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my attention.', '', 147126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have need of me?', '', 147125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salutations.', '', 147124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still here? Oh, I\'m sorry. I stopped payin\' attention a while ago.', '', 147123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just keep goin\', don\'t ya?', '', 147122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You talk a lot.', '', 147121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got it.', '', 147120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-huh.', '', 147119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everywhere I go, de people chant \"yaaaaas queen.\" A troll could get used to dis...', 147118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not saying de Zandalari need to rule de world... but come on, you know you would be better off if we did.', 147117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right.', '', 147116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh huh?', '', 147115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah?', '', 147114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph?', '', 147113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! You... bastard! I\'ll... kill... you!', '', 147112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, that tickles!', '', 147111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop that.', '', 147110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, but I do not require your aid.', 'Thank you, but I do not require your aid.', 147109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must remain vigilant.', '', 147108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coven will fall beneath my blade.', '', 147107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sworn to protect.', '', 147106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to House Waycrest.', '', 147105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense the shadow in you. Though it is diminished in the presence of the Light.', 'I can sense the shadow in you. Though it is diminished in the presence of the Light.', 147104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must act with haste.', '', 147103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle awaits.', '', 147102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemy\'s eyes are upon us.', '', 147101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is not meant for you.', 'This place is not meant for you.', 147100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must drive out the darkness.', '', 147099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light does not treat with the Void, elf. You should leave this place.', 'The Light does not treat with the Void, elf. You should leave this place.', 147098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why you pent-up, dull-witted, mangy looking walrus-herder!', 147097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help me Marshal Reade, you\'re my only hope.', 147096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aren\'t you a little short for an adventurer?', 147095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fair winds and following seas.', 147094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The coven will pay for their atrocities.', 147093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory to House Waycrest.', 147092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A steady tiller prevails.', 147091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your sails true.', 147090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drustvar stands firm.', 147089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help?', 147088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is your business with House Waycrest?', 147087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, outlander.', 147086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, traveler.', 147085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Hello there... fellow member of the Alliance.\n\nI mean no disrespect, but... I\'m just not entirely sure the cathedral is the most... appropriate place for... for...\n\nFor someone who indulges such... unique proclivities.', '', 147084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My chamber walls are adorned with many skulls... but dere is always room for one more.', 147083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful now... my loa is de jealous type.', 147082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TELL ME NOW!', 'TELL ME NOW!', 147081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your threats won\'t work. I know you know more, now out with it.', 'Your threats won\'t work. I know you know more, now out with it.', 147080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, but that\'s not good enough. Please tell me more about the anvil.', 'I\'m sorry, but that\'s not good enough. Please tell me more about the anvil.', 147079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot win...', 147078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In death... I still serve...', 147077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The coven... will end you...', 147076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother... avenge me...', 147075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stop... my curse...', 147074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be sneakin\' on ahead ta clear out a safe place for our next move. Meet me near da bridge when ya be done.', '', 147073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bow before the Heartsbane!', 147072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The coven will rule!', 147071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our power is ancient!', 147070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mother will take you!', 147069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will fall!', 147068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse... is lifted...', 'The curse... is lifted...', 147067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97828, 97829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness... fades...', 'The darkness... fades...', 147066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97826, 97827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you...', 'Thank you...', 147065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97824, 97825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive... me...', 'Forgive... me...', 147064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97822, 97823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... free...', 'I am... free...', 147063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97820, 97821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mother... guides my blade...', 'The Mother... guides my blade...', 147062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97818, 97819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heartsbane commands...', 'The Heartsbane commands...', 147061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97816, 97817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for the coven...', 'My life... for the coven...', 147060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97814, 97815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... obey...', 'I... obey...', 147059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97812, 97813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am bidden...', 'I am bidden...', 147058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97810, 97811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey hey, hey! Are all members of de Horde so... touchy?', '', 147057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But do not make promises your body cannot keep.', '', 147056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I find your lack of modesty amusing.', '', 147055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat reminds me of de 46th assassin dat tried to kill me. Ah... she was a good wife.', '', 147054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind the gap.', '', 147053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re going to fall to your death, do it somewhere else.', '', 147052, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you conducting some kind of dangerous experiment? I like it!', '', 147051, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step! I can\'t do this all day! Actually, I suppose I can.', '', 147050, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you fall, or was that a graceful jump designed to look like a clumsy fall?', '', 147049, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best be careful close to the edge, $n.', '', 147048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, goodness me! Did you slip?', '', 147047, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da end of da Zandalari begins now!', 147046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, mon. I be on guard here ta make sure noting be comin\' at us from behind.', '', 147045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to gloat, have you?', 'Come to gloat, have you?', 147044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stood by and watched as Elisande led us astray.\n\nI was wrong... about everything.', '', 147043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I should thank you.$B$B<Anarys dips his head slightly at you.>', '', 147042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stood by and watched as Elisande led us astray.\n\nI was wrong... about everything.', 147041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose I should thank you.$B$B<Anarys dips her head slightly at you.>', 147040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion nearly took everything from us... while I blindly trusted Elisande.\n\nI am relieved that Suramar is back in our hands.', 147039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave, small puny ting.', '', 147038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who ya be wantin\' me ta kill?', '', 147037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
