('Time ta smash yet?', '', 147033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be all dat is troll.', '', 147032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promised not to smash you yet. I promised good. But maybe time for me to break promise...', '', 147031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zanchuli in charge. Not you.', '', 147030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
