('You are tiny, puny thing.', '', 147027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat it... or I beat you.', '', 147026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENTRY - Mead Production Experiment\n\nUsing what I\'ve learned from experimenting with animating the honey, it seems possible that additional mead production could be automated.\n\nI\'m still not sure that it\'s the best approach, as the animated mead seems to be more volatile and difficult to control.\n\nIf I can find a way to safely contain them or at least reduce their aggression, however, they may provide a plentiful source of alcohol and give me a leg up on the competition.\n\nIn fact, this could help with reducing overall aggravation of the bees as well.', '', 147025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep dis up, and de POISON in your veins will be SO POTENT dat even dat greedy fool Bwonsamdi will be afraid to touch your soul!', 147024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will put your head on a spike, and den put dat spike in a box, and put dat box inside a bigger box, and den CRUSH IT WITH A HAMMER!', 147023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A rich noble in Zuldazar pawed at me like dis once. ONCE.', 147022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Begone... and take dat foul smell with you.', 147021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, I have eyes everywhere. Everywhere!', 147020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did I dismiss you?', 147019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rabble should be seen and not heard.', 147018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no time for nonsense.', 147017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
