('Wait!', '', 146597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just let me--', '', 146596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vision or not, you wasted Rastakhan\'s patience. Dere are consequences, boy.', '', 146590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As if things could get any worse.', 146586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah, you will surely save us.', '', 146585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I do to you? Why ya pickin\' on me?', 'Why ya pickin\' on me?', 146582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98756, 98757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back off, richmon.', 'Back off, richmon.', 146581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98754, 98755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t dat kinda troll, ya know. We Zandalari got standards!', 'I ain\'t dat kinda troll, ya know. We Zandalari got standards!', 146580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98752, 98753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Jani bring you fortune.', 'May Jani bring you fortune.', 146579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98734, 98735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadra be watching.', 'Shadra be watching.', 146575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98732, 98733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar forever.', 'Zandalar forever.', 146568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98730, 98731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, so be it.', 'So be it.', 146567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98728, 98729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch ya back.', 'Watch ya back.', 146564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98726, 98727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to the present.', 'Take me back to the present.', 146563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me Silithus before it was pierced.', 'Show me Silithus before it was pierced.', 146562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time heals all wounds... especially when you can travel back in time, to before the wound occurred!', '', 146561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You here to buy, richmon?', 'You here to buy, richmon?', 146560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98738, 98739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got coin to spend?', 'Got some coin to spend?', 146559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98736, 98737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you make a weapon out of this silver?', 'Can you make a weapon out of this silver?', 146558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy, $n! Thanks again fer nettin\' me out from under the coven\'s boot. We nearly got a proper forge set up here, so ye just holler if ye need anything done.', '', 146557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind ya step around me.', 'Mind ya step around me.', 146556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98748, 98749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Augh! Gonna throw ya to da crawgs for dat!', 146553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your connection to the spirits begins to fade...', 'Your connection to the spirits begins to fade...', 146552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, I got good deals for you.', 'I got da good deals.', 146548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98740, 98741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatcha want, richmon?', 'Whatcha want, richmon?', 146547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98746, 98747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, mon.', 'Hello, mon.', 146546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98744, 98745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatcha doin\' here?', 'Whatcha doin\' here?', 146545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98742, 98743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a flight to Staghelm Point.', 'I need a flight to Staghelm Point.', 146544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looking for a lift? Going someplace special I hope!', 146543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death... be changin\'... nothin\'...', 'My death... be changin\'... nothin\'...', 146542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98718, 98719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world... still gonna... be ours...', 'The world... gonna still... be ours...', 146541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98716, 98717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... a flesh wound...', 'Just... a flesh wound...', 146540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98714, 98715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betta hope... I don\'t... regenerate...', 'Betta hope... I don\'t... regenerate...', 146539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98712, 98713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi... be comin\'... for me...', 'Bwonsamdi... be comin\'... for me...', 146538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98710, 98711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be seein\' ya on da other side...', 'Be seein\' you on da other side...', 146537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98708, 98709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya can\'t kill us all...', 'Can\'t kill us all...', 146536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98706, 98707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off me island!', 'Get off me island!', 146535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98704, 98705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da true kingdom!', 'For da true kingdom!', 146534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98702, 98703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar forever!', 'Zandalar forever!', 146533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98700, 98701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De greatness of Zandalar will rise again!', 'De greatness of Zandalar will rise again!', 146532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98698, 98699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First I\'m gonna kill ya, then I\'m gonna go ta work on ya.', 'First I\'m gonna kill ya, then I\'m gonna go ta work on you.', 146531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98696, 98697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hungry. Do you have any food?', 'I\'m hungry. Do you have any food?', 146530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya death be here.', 'Ya death be here.', 146529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98694, 98695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna bleed ya real good, den leave ya here ta die.', 'Gonna bleed ya real good, den leave ya here ta die.', 146528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98692, 98693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a place to rest.', 'I need a place to rest.', 146527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to have your equipment repaired?$B$BOr would you like some quality tools of your own?', '', 146522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our home is always open to those in need.\n\nDo you need a place to lay your head tonight, friend? No cost. No questions.', '', 146521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave it to me, Dark Lady. I will lead the reserves in the assault. The Alliance will go no further, I swear it.', '', 146519, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 106640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, I\'ve got a very specific list of things I need you to capture in a shot. If they aren\'t clearly noticable, I can\'t use it.', '', 146518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last people who ventured beyond this space were consumed by the shadows.', 'The last people who ventured beyond this space were consumed by the shadows.', 146517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void energy released when the ethereals attacked left the other islands unstable. No one is allowed beyond this point.', 'The void energy released when the ethereals attacked left the other islands unstable. No one is allowed beyond this point.', 146516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found your gear. <Hand Samantha her gear>', 'I found your gear. <Hand Samantha her gear>', 146513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toss the chum into the sea.', 'Toss the chum into the sea.', 146512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bucket contains fresh chum. It might be used to attract creatures closer to shore...', 'The bucket contains fresh chum. It might be used to attract creatures closer to shore...', 146511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I warned ya, chum!', 146510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a moment $n. This stinger could come in handy.', 'Just a moment $n. This stinger could come in handy.', 146509, 7, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan\'s Might is mine! Taste de bitter wind of defeat!', '', 146508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis was not de end... I was promised...', '', 146507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time... will come...', 'Your time... will come...', 146505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99003, 99004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul... save me...', 'Zul... save me...', 146504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98884, 98885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not... my... time...', 'Not... my... time...', 146502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98882, 98883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this... what he... foresaw?', 'Is this... what he... foresaw?', 146501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99001, 99002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will see... how it ends...', 'You will see... how it ends...', 146500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98999, 99000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is just... as he said...', 'It is just... as he said...', 146499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98997, 98998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Zul\'s name, die!', 'In Zul\'s name, die!', 146498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98969, 98970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan\'s reign is over. De age of Zul has begun!', 'Rastakhan\'s reign is over. De age of Zul has begun!', 146497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98967, 98968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Di chuka Zul!', 'Di chuka Zul!', 146496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98854, 98855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul has foreseen your death!', 'Zul has foreseen your death!', 146495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98965, 98966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I claim your head for de glory of Zul!', 'I claim your head for de glory of Zul!', 146494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98852, 98853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De king is finished. Zuldazar has a new ruler now!', 'De king is finished. Zandalar has a new ruler now!', 146492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98858, 98859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Zul\'s will!', 'By Zul\'s will!', 146491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98963, 98964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya got ten seconds ta get outta here, $pr. Else ya gonna get bit.', 146490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dad\'s been carrying that book with him everywhere lately...', '', 146489, 7, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help... me...', '', 146488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... why would he leave his boot here? Unless he was eaten!?', '', 146487, 7, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secure the area!', '', 146486, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the Perch and the skies are ours!', '', 146485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them try and break our defenses!', '', 146484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wield the shadows as a weapon to save our world... and defend the Alliance!', 146482, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 96129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lesson for what!?', '', 146481, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, Ancel... I hope you\'ll let this serve as an important lesson.', 'Well, Ancel... I hope you\'ll let this serve as an important lesson.', 146480, 7, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That the Void is a power to be harnessed... to be bent by a will strong enough to command it.', 146477, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 96128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Its whispers have broken the will of dragons... and lured even the titans\' own children into madness.', 146476, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 96127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Venture forth alongside new allies and show the world that the legacy of the nightborne is one of nobility... and strength.', 146475, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 96126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $pr. Loa watch over you.', 'Thank you, $pr. Loa watch over you.', 146474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...you have done well. My master shall be pleased to see this.', 146473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, here are the results.', 146472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you gathered the information I require?', 146471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will... never go back...', 146470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late! This land is ours!', 146469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... we must... grow.', 146468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The thorns will pierce your hide!', 146467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blood... feeds them.', 146466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our roots are strong!', 146465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know Fernn was behind this! Tell me what you\'re trying to achieve!', '', 146464, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But to those who would threaten this world... or attack our allies... you will embody the Light\'s wrath.', 146463, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 96123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And in turn, we have been reborn as instruments of its power.', 146462, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 96122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk the path that Huln took so very long ago, and bring honor to the name... Highmountain.', 146461, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 96121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arooo!', '', 146460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arf, arf!', '', 146459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woof!', '', 146458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, ye jus\' lead the way...', '', 146457, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 99199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to be eaten!', 'I thought I was going to be eaten!', 146456, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting outta here!', 'I\'m getting outta here!', 146455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 'I don\'t get paid enough for this!', 146454, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I thought I was done for.', 'Thank you! I thought I was done for.', 146453, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leonard will provide you some back up. Just give him a whistle and he\'ll do what he does best.', '', 146452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just ye try! Ye\'ll taste my hammer, witch!', '', 146451, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 99202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost a friend and my bird in the mutiny. Once I get back into fighting form, the traitorous scum will feel my fury.', 'I lost a friend and my bird in the mutiny. Once I get back into fighting form, the traitorous scum will feel my fury.', 146450, 0, 55125, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Non-magical devices are for mana-starved whelps, they said. Non-magical devices serve no purpose, they said. $B$BOrgrimmar practically runs on such creations!$B$BTime for me to show those palanquin-addled wretches back home the perfection of machinery!', 146449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This workshop is a bit \"rustic\" for my tastes.', 146448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My loa has called me back to de land of de living. Dere is work to be done.', '', 146447, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 109706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... I can still feel de touch of de Other Side.', '', 146446, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 109705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few days before the attack I noticed some questionable individuals meeting with a few of the mutineers. I should have informed someone.', 'A few days before the attack I noticed some questionable individuals meeting with a few of the mutineers. I should have informed someone.', 146445, 0, 55123, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring down the Horde commander!', 'Bring down the Horde commander!', 146444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi is ours!', 'Arathi is ours!', 146443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 146442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just what are those soldiers trying to solve by doing this? This fort is first line of defense for that seagate.', 'Just what are those soldiers trying to solve by doing this? This fort is first line of defense for that seagate.', 146441, 0, 55121, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 146440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could use a blacksmith to help fight the coven.', 'We could use a blacksmith to help fight the coven.', 146439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I don\'t know ye from a hole in the hull, but an enemy of the coven is a friend of mine. Plus, it\'ll be easier to get outta here with an extra blade at me side.\n\nYe say the word and we\'ll be outta here.', '', 146438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a blessin\' te see someone that dun have that dark glow in their eyes. I was beginnin te think there was no one left these blasted witches didn\'t put a curse on.\n\nAngus Ballaster at yer service. What ye be doin in a blighted hellhole like this?', '', 146437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I took a bullet from a man I considered a friend. I remember him saying something about an upcoming increase in pay...', 'I took a bullet from a man I considered a friend. I remember him saying something about an upcoming increase in pay...', 146436, 0, 55119, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were probably planning this out for months. Skyheart was out on a routine munitions check at the camp when the revolt started.', 'They were probably planning this out for months. Skyheart was out on a routine munitions check at the camp when the revolt started.', 146435, 0, 55117, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work, $n! You might be ready for something more challenging... Speak with me if you\'re interested!', '', 146434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still plenty of letters to sort, if you\'re up to it!$B$BOr how about something more challenging? We also receive letters without a full address on them.$B$BThink you can handle it?', '', 146433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a challenge! I want to sort the letters with partial addresses.', 'Give me a challenge! I want to sort the letters with partial addresses.', 146432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible! The surrounding area alone houses at least forty species of plants I am unfamiliar with.', '', 146431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De time of bargaining with weak loa is over. Awaken now, and serve your true god, G\'huun.', 146430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One by one, de loa will fall, and G\'huun will be all dat remains.', 146429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Open your soul to G\'huun, or we shall open it for you.', 146428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your king has fallen. Surrender to your fate.', 146427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul has shown us de path, and you will follow dat path, or die.', 146426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun is your god now. Submit.', 146425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Submit.', 146424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Honestly, if the local cuisine wasn\'t absolutely mouthwatering I wouldn\'t know what to do with myself.', 146423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
