('', 'You are wrong, Jonda. Gonk did not hide in de bushes or attack alone! Gonk always hunts with de pack, and he does not hesitate. He takes de fight to dem!', 146415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
