('My wife complains that I leave soot all over the furniture. I say it adds character!', '', 146278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come \'ere a second... I wanna ASH ye a question.', '', 146277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The secret ta livin\' a happy life at the forge? Well, flame-resistant hair nets, o\' course!', 146276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always wanted a pair o\' diamond earrings. Think Magni would notice if I chipped off a couple o\' bits?', 146275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My ma and da met at the Grim Guzzler. Come ta think o\' it... EVERYBODY\'S ma and da met at the Grim Guzzler.', 146274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some dwarves just wanna watch the world burn. I happen to be one o\' them.', 146273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Stop, drop, and roll\"? And just what is THAT supposed ta mean?', 146272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once had a pet bird. I used ta tell him \"By fire be perched.\" Ah, Sooty... I miss ye!', 146271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a hunk o\' hunk o\' burnin\' love.', '', 146270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can keep ye warm on a cold night. Well, at least my forge can.', '', 146269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did ye come from a diamond mine? \'Cause I wanna learn all your facets.', '', 146268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even Ragnaros didn\'t burn as hot as my heart does for ye!', '', 146267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in joinin\' the mile deep club?', '', 146266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye make my iron heart feel warm. Hot, even. Wait... that\'s just my beard on fire again!', '', 146265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The way ye swing that hammer really stokes my forge.', 146264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come over ta my place. We\'ll IRON out yer love life.', 146263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ye wanna impress me on a date, don\'t try ta pick me up in a mole machine.', 146262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye put a gleam in my eye. Well, so does lava. But mostly you.', 146261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It takes more than a mug or two ta get on my good side. A keg ought ta do it!', 146260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m a nice girl, but I know my way around an anvil.', 146259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try again.', 'Let\'s try again.', 146254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her alchemy does affect the dinosaurs. Can your voodoo make it work correctly?', 'Her alchemy does affect the dinosaurs. Can your voodoo make it work correctly?', 146253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can Cala\'s science help?', 'Can Cala\'s science help?', 146252, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are so many! We\'re going to eat well tonight!', '', 146251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scare de fish toward me, Razaji!', '', 146250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, $n. I shall try to make de voodoo and Cala\'s science work together. I thank you for your help.', 146249, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cala\'s science doesn\'t work because it doesn\'t understand de feelings of de creatures. $b$bI cannot change her mind and she does not listen.', 146248, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If my voodoo can\'t make a love potion dat works, den I\'ve lost my edge. Perhaps brutosaurs don\'t work like we do.', 146247, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice throw, Bunuji!', '', 146246, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will let Jangalar know.', 'I will let Jangalar know.', 146245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, I suppose she could do a little voodoo on my formula if it might get a more favorable response from Gentle Ben\'jin.', 146244, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But what she believes is all superstition! I\'ll admit her weird mind meld thing worked with the dinosaurs but alchemy is real science!', 146243, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jangalar is attuned to the dinosaurs. Can you use that?', 'Jangalar is attuned to the dinosaurs. Can you use that?', 146242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you work with Jangalar to solve this problem?', 'Can you work with Jangalar to solve this problem?', 146241, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t understand why my science didn\'t work. My cousin Alexxi is an expert in this type of formula and I only changed maybe 70% of the recipe.', 146240, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need help sorting these letters!', '', 146239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to sort letters!', 'I want to sort letters!', 146238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mail must go through!', '', 146237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was... embarassing. But surely we can find  *something* to do with a sleeping, miniaturized, endangered brutosaur!', 146236, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So Ben\'jin is shrunk AND sleeping now? Dere are no words...', 146235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen up! We need to get you ready to fight, and quick.', 146234, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open fire!', '', 146233, 0, 36471, 25, 64, 0, 170604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wut you doing here? We found this place first!', '', 146232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although broken and scattered, this rift holds many secrets. It will teach us much about the nature of the shadows.', '', 146231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If tusks are your thing, then I am de guy for you.', '', 146230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The way to a Zandalari girl\'s heart is through her devilsaur.', 146229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 100216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are getting a little... heated, don\'t ye think?', '', 146228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Iron on the streets... volcano in the sheets.', 146227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I try to aim high, but sometimes I\'m forced to LOA my standards.', 146226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 100183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let de door hit you where de good loa split you.', '', 146225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it gettin\' hot in here, or is it just my beard?', '', 146224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 100019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live in a volcano. Personal hygiene ain\'t exactly high on my list o\' priorities.', 146223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am respectfully doubtful, Cala.', 146222, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch and learn, Jangalar. Alchemy plus brutosaur equals loverboy--er, lover dino.', 146221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was able to arrange for your companions to be flown here without General Jakra\'zet interfering. You need only signal dem.', 146220, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 106896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot be in all places at once. I leave it to you to choose your priority. Review your maps and decide which plan you will see to first.', 146219, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And den there are de schemes of Jakra\'zet in de deserts of Vol\'dun. I have no doubt he is as big a threat to de Horde as he is to my people.', 146218, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, if you want our navy, you need de support of my father here in Zuldazar. His advisors plot against you.', 146217, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Time is short, so I will be brief. I plan to lead an expedition into de swamps of Nazmir to deal with de threat to our northern border.', 146216, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 106898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father believes he is indulging me. He heeds de word of his stoic advisors like Zul instead of listening to me.', 146215, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 106897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any alliance get aboard this ship, they\'ll be incinerated.', '', 146214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about the airship, I\'ll keep an eye out for any... unwanted guests.', 146213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 146212, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 166369, 166368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here!', 146211, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 103330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe deep, Highness...', '', 146210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, bring me my spices. I portioned them out earlier.', '', 146209, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An offering of blood is sure to rouse de king\'s temper.', '', 146208, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jamil will tend to his spirit while I close the wound. You must move quickly where I cannot.', '', 146207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would have fed de raptor fish cakes and brought it home!', 146205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I\'m surprised you made it out of dere with both your arms!', '', 146204, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and den Gano threw de fish at de raptor and ran away! It was so funny, Dad!', '', 146203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your emotions expose weakness. The Void will exploit that if you let it.', '', 146202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yourself and it will pass.', '', 146201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t feel so good...', 'I don\'t feel so good...', 146200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be a scaredy elf! We\'ll be legends!', '', 146199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, Gano... We\'re really high up...', '', 146198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m tellin\' ya, Chuchu. We get a runnin\' start and this\'d be the best jump of our lives!', '', 146197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaagh! What have you done to my beautiful mech!?', '', 146196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 146195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('R-right!', 'R-right!', 146194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fourteen times I took \'em for a ride and dey haven\'t e\'en noticed once. Ha!', 146193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Concentrate and banish this creature!', '', 146192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How convenient! I could not have timed this better myself.', '', 146191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind you!', 'Behind you!', 146189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
