INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'This place belongs to our master!', 145948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will die screaming!', 145947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He comes... he... comes...', 145946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will... have revenge...', 145945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will... win...', 145944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was promised.... power...', 145943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring \'em back to their papa, on that lake in the southwest. And make sure you get a reward!', '', 145942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the love of gold! We got murloc tadpoles everywhere!', '', 145941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh... Fozruk\'s patrollin\' the roads in the southeast. Be on the lookout for a nasty ol\' stone giant.', '', 145940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see if we can convince it to join our side... with violence!', '', 145939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shaman are tellin\' me that some stray earth elemental\'s found its way to the top of the eastern hill.', '', 145938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes. Fozruk go attack punies.', '', 145937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK, OK, Fozruk stop. What you want Fozruk do?', '', 145936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack Circle of Elements.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack Circle of Elements.', 145935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack Newstead.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack Newstead.', 145934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack Northfold Crossing.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack Northfold Crossing.', 145933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moo... lah?', '', 145932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... but... think of the moolah!', '', 145931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, my comrades and I are not warlike. We will not assist with your foolish endeavor.', '', 145930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This could mean big things for us. Big! Now if only there were some friendly gorillas to help us out with that kaja\'mite...', '', 145929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, because of a few wild gorillas? Nothing our friend can\'t handle! Isn\'t that right, chump? I mean chum.', '', 145928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t say I didn\'t warn you, little goblins. Dat gorge is abandoned for good reason.', 145927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our bond can never be broken!', 145926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never let him go!', 145925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! You won\'t take him from me!', 145924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Husband, please attend to our guests.', 145923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s kaja\'mite? It\'s a powerful resource that gives you ideas!\n\nIt was discovered on Kezan thousands of years ago, and we goblins mined and refined it. Some experts say that kaja\'mite is what gave the goblins our incredible intelligence in the first place.\n\nThe Zandalari use kaja\'mite too. For some reason. Probably for rituals. But according to goblin law, all kaja\'mite belongs to goblins!', 145922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s kaja\'mite?', 'What\'s kaja\'mite?', 145921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is so exciting! The first real potential kaja\'mite find since the Lost Isles. I can hardly contain myself!', 145920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh look, husband. Your supper has arrived.', 145919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Pretty paltry readings so far. See if you can get deeper into the gorge and find more vents to scan.', '', 145918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, apprentice, witness my ascension!', '', 145917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I can FEEL the transmutation taking effect! I shall finally become a being worthy of fear and respect!', '', 145916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect timing, apprentice! Now witness history in the making!', '', 145915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... and which loa do you bargain with?', 'Hmm... and which loa do you bargain with?', 145914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98813, 98814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who I am?', 'Do you know who I am?', 145913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98811, 98812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want something?', 'Do you want something?', 145912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98809, 98810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar forever.', 'Zandalar forever.', 145911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98795, 98796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can earn a crawgling\'s trust, dey could one day be a might ally.', '', 145910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is goin\' after our camp at Valorcall Pass!', '', 145909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance troops spotted at the Circle of Elements!', '', 145908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up! The Alliance is attacking Newstead!', '', 145907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of Alliance soldiers at High Perch! Stop \'em, before they get the upper hand!', '', 145906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is attacking Northfold Crossing! You gotta stop \'em... that\'s right in front of our base!', '', 145905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re attacking the mine! That\'s our turf!', '', 145904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, they\'re attacking the lumber mill at Hatchet Ridge! We need that wood!', '', 145903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance soldiers are headed to our base! Get back here, or this battle\'s over!', '', 145902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t see what all the fuss is about.', '', 145901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do try and hurry there so you don\'t miss the excitement!', '', 145900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in for quite the treat, apprentice. I\'m off to the cave now.', '', 145899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A path long denied to us is open at last.', 'A path long denied to us is open at last.', 145898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need no longer fear exile for the pursuit of knowledge.', 'We need no longer fear exile for the pursuit of knowledge.', 145897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating.\n\nI sensed that change was destined to find Alleria Windrunner, but I did not anticipate that her kin would undergo a similar transformation.\n\nThe implications are many. These events have given me much to ponder.', '', 145896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The voices never stop. They push, they bully, they plead. They will not relent, not even for a moment.\n\nBut you are stronger than the voices. You can glean their secrets and draw upon their strength.', 145895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is more than a simple prick of de flesh we are dealing with. Betrayal cuts down to de soul.', '', 145894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Alleria\'s teaching, we can avoid the fate suffered by those on Mac\'Aree.', '', 145893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The elf\'s concentration wavers momentarily and he gives you a withering look.>', '<The elf\'s concentration wavers momentarily and she gives you a withering look.>', 145892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
