('A tree.', 'A tree.', 145244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t fall off, friend! I\'ll be okay if I fall, but you\'d go SPLAT!', 145243, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 145242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t know mountains could go this high!', 145241, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see everything from here!', 145240, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good ta see ye.', 145239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met.', 145238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Caw caw caw caw caw!', 145237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.', 145236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nope.', 145235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not a chance.', 145234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s right.', 145233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmm-hmm.', 145232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yep.', 145231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m very grateful.', 145230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye have my thanks.', 145229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A gnome.', 'A gnome.', 145228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe ye one.', 145227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Black Anvil!', 145226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like... TEN birds!', 145225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that the best ye got?', 145224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll pummel ye!', 145222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder how many birds live in that tree. Must be so many!', 145221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Answer me dis.\n\nI am tall when I am young, and short when I am old. What am I?', '', 145220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\'Twas my pleasure.', 145219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Friend, look! We\'re under a giant tree!', 145218, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad ta help.', 145217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer most welcome.', 145216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s play.', 'Let\'s play.', 145215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready to test your mind?', '', 145214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I have one for a pet?', 145213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But for lizard birds.', 145212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a big tower. It\'s like a... giant birdhouse!', 145211, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, what are those flying things? They\'re so pretty!', 145210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come to think of it... do you live ANYwhere?', 145209, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you live here?', 145208, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How does it do that?', 145207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa... a flying city! Are you serious?!', 145206, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you wanna play princesses with me?', 145205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know who lives here? I bet it\'s a princess.', 145204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! That\'s gotta be the prettiest house ever!', 145203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ewwwww!!', 145202, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it bugs? I bet it\'s bugs. Yuck! I hate bugs!', 145201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you suppose they wanted to keep out?', 145200, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! That\'s the biggest wall I\'ve ever seen!', 145199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uuna hugs you.', 145197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take boot!', '', 145196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, friend, let\'s get outta here! We have so many places to go!', 145195, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell Mama and Papa I miss them, and... and I\'ll see them soon!', 145194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Friend! The Light says I can stay! Woo-hoo!', 145193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it okay if I stay with my friend? For just a little while longer?', 145192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s so much I never got to do. So many places I never got to see...', 145191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait a sec...', 145190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mama! Papa! They\'re waiting for me!', 145189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light... it\'s telling me to follow it...', 145188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... what\'s happening?', 145187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, friend! We did it! We beat them!', 145186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The darkness is gone! I can see!', 145185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya will pay fah wat ya ave done!', 145184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you. Curse you! I wasn\'t finished...', '', 145183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will please the Banshee Queen!', '', 145182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Scum! I will bring the Dark Lady your head!', '', 145181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I gonna slit ya throat, $n!', 145180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frantic hoofbeats echo in the distance. Something is coming.', 'Frantic hoofbeats echo in the distance. Something is coming.', 145179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya dare interrupt me. Ya will pay wid ya life, $n!', 145178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I been watchin\' ya, $n.', 145177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNUSED', '', 145176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell ozone as the air begins to crackle.', 'You smell ozone as the air begins to crackle.', 145175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cheeky, but I be more den my magic.', 145173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Let us begin the ritual.', 'I am ready. Let us begin the ritual.', 145172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can hear the cries o\' the world beneath my feet. Azeroth trembles in pain! We must find a way tae ease her sufferin\'...', '', 145171, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not die dat easily, $n. You will suffer my wrath!', 145170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last, I\'ve found you, $n.', 145169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush your skull!', '', 145168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will peel the flesh from your bones!', '', 145167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stand over your grave for eternity.', '', 145166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
