('The thorns seek your soul!', '', 145130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The he turned and vanished into the woods. Since then, the valiant and true have found shelter with the White Stag of the forest.', 'The he turned and vanished into the woods. Since then, the valiant and true have found shelter with the White Stag of the forest.', 145129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
