('\"You are welcome. I was repaying the kindness you showed me.\"', '\"You are welcome. I was repaying the kindness you showed me.\"', 145119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
