('The white stag returned and trampled some of the Drust!', 'The white stag returned and trampled some of the Drust!', 145106, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mighty bellow came from the forest!', 'A mighty bellow came from the forest!', 145105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Determined to take down as many warriors as he could, he held his ground.', 'Determined to take down as many warriors as he could, he held his ground.', 145104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Arom stood against ten warriors! He fought valiantly and with cunning but he was out numbered and surrounded!', 'Lord Arom stood against ten warriors! He fought valiantly and with cunning but he was out numbered and surrounded!', 145103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious.', 'Curious.', 145102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the night, the Drust attacked!', 'In the night, the Drust attacked!', 145101, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stag bounded into the woods and Arom made camp.', 'The stag bounded into the woods and Arom made camp.', 145100, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Anyone who can fight off so many Drust is someone I wish to have in my forests,\" he thought. So Lord Arom healed the stag\'s injuries.', '\"Anyone who can fight off so many Drust is someone I wish to have in my forests,\" he thought. So Lord Arom healed the stag\'s injuries.', 145099, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
