('Lord Arom\'s people needed food and the massive deer would feed many, but he decided not to strike.', 'Lord Arom\'s people needed food and the massive deer would feed many, but he decided not to strike.', 145097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
