INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('They came from the woods. We fought. Master Ashton shoved me aside and they took him. We have to get him back!', '', 144893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you did, Marten. Tell us what happened.', 144892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried my best to fight them off!', '', 144891, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... why did you bring the dwarf? A show of force? A deterrant?', 144889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That worked precisely as I imagined it would.', '', 144888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Right... Yes. Of course!', '', 144887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not forget our purpose here. We must find the Eye before the Alliance can.', '', 144886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To think the trolls may have been sitting on the archaeological find of the millenium!', 144885, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De battle has begun! Lead us to victory!', 144884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you left, you told your father you were going exploring. Not negotiating with mongrels from de Horde.', '', 144883, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess.', '', 144882, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are keeping your father waiting.', '', 144881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Princess... allow me to be the first to welcome-', 144880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know dis... Father is set in his ways, but he is most observant. I would wager he already knows of your role in freeing me from Stormwind.', 144879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their fate will not be decided by you, General.', 144878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De best way to protect de kingdom would be for me to banish dis... thing... to Vol\'dun. De Horde has no place in Zandalar.', '', 144877, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are sworn to protect dis kingdom. If you will not do your duty, den I must look for someone who will.', 144876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Touch the tear.>', '<Touch the tear.>', 144875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'General.', 144874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A green dragon\'s tear, cast in shadow by unknown forces.>', '', 144873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meanwhile, de Zanchuli Council, scheming politicians and decrepit old tusks, dismisses dis threat. Dey convince my father dat nothing need be done.', 144872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood trolls surge across our northern border. Dey drag our people off to de swamps of Nazmir, never to be seen again.', 144871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zandalar is beset by enemies, both within and without. Dis is why I went seeking de Horde... and why I call upon you, one of its greatest heroes.', 144870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have only a few moments alone, $n. Dere are things about my kingdom dat you must know.', 144869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, champion of de Horde. Let us pay my father a visit. Zul... we will speak later.', 144868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tze\'na! Hello, little girl. Did you miss me?', 144867, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 102081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have heard the cries of the child you speak of.\n\nI shall mark you, that you may pass into this realm and seek her out.\n\nShe resides in a place where the barrier between the realms of life and death are thin, and spill over into your world.\n\nBe warned, you have no power in this place, its denizens cannot be harmed by mortals.\n\nTry as you might, you may not be able to aid your friend.', 144866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with you.', 'Light be with you.', 144864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a little girl named Uuna, have you seen her?', 'I\'m looking for a little girl named Uuna, have you seen her?', 144863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'T\'paartos showed us how to play boulder, parchment, blade... but I forgot the rules.', 144862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance Gate has been destroyed!', '', 144860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gryphons! Attack!', 144859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our bravest warriors are often in the vanguard. It is the least I can do to watch over their families until they return.', 'Our bravest warriors are often in the vanguard. It is the least I can do to watch over their families until they return.', 144853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You enter my tunnels? How foolish!', '', 144852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tail is so fluffy!', 144851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I keep it?', 144850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Stay and tell us adventure stories, T\'paartos!', 144849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s back!', 144848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s T\'paartos!', 144847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry! T\'paartos will return with more stories... and perhaps another friend.', '', 144846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos must return this little one now. Say farewell, children.', '', 144845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww!', 144842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what happened at the feast.', 'Tell me what happened at the feast.', 144841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady has an important job for you, $c. I hope that you are ready...', '', 144840, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'T\'paartos!', 144839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Promise you won\'t leave me, friend. Even when it gets dark...', 144838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But now you\'re here. Together we can fight them! I think...', 144837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I keep running and running... but they always find me.', 144836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re gonna be here, soon, friend.', 144835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you are! That\'s much better.', 144834, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! T\'paartos is glad to see you are well! T\'paartos also brought a present. This little one was in Val\'sharah.', '', 144833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you KIDDING me?!', '', 144832, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These bubbles appear to contain some sort of power. Perhaps if I just remove the exterior...', '', 144831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah!', '', 144830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These eyes seem nice and plump. I\'ll just squeeze a few drops from them and...', '', 144829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m just so cold, and it\'s very dark here. I don\'t know what to do!', 144828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t give up, friend! I promise!', 144827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Friend? Is that you?', 144826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our agents have already infiltrated the goblin mining operation below. We\'ll know what they\'re up to soon enough...', '', 144825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda... dug... deeper...', 'Shoulda... dug... deeper...', 144824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An elf... diggin\'... hah!', 'An elf... diggin\'... hah!', 144823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'re too late. We found...', 'Ye\'re too late. We found...', 144822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finders, keepers...', 'Finders, keepers...', 144821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll never find it...', 'Ye\'ll never find it...', 144820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer search ends now. Die!', 'Yer search ends now. Die!', 144819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m goin\' to enjoy buryin\' you.', 'I\'m goin\' to enjoy buryin\' you.', 144818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll dig your feet out from under ye!', 'We\'ll dig your feet out from under ye!', 144817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye thought to tangle with the Dark Iron? Ye thought wrong.', 'Ye thought to tangle with the Dark Iron? Ye thought wrong.', 144816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meddlin\' elf! These ruins belong to the Dark Iron!', 'Meddlin\' elf! These ruins belong to the Dark Iron!', 144815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemy reinforcements incoming!', 144812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The readings are unmistakable! We go west!', '', 144811, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De ravine is ours! Regroup! We must plan de next assault.', 144810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are trying to fit a square totem into a round totem stand. De voodoo knows moods, goblin.', 144809, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They sprang from the shadows. They\'re everywhere!', '', 144808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An admirable quality, I quite like that about him.', 144807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yes, just like yesterday, the day before... and the day before that!', 144806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tunnels have been secured. Open the gate!', '', 144805, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 106284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is in high spirits today, no?', '', 144804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De enemy approaches! Bwonsalaka!', 144803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall return to the others. We must stop this while we still can.', '', 144802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $p. I\'m afraid matters are far worse than we thought.', '', 144801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what happened at Lion\'s Rest.', 'Tell me what happened at Lion\'s Rest.', 144800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My agents have secured this area. That said, it\'s always prudent to keep our voices low.', '', 144799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwon\'chaga di choka!', 'Bwon\'chaga di choka!', 144798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98850, 98851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Voodoo touches all hearts, Cala, whether dey believe in it or not.', 144796, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Voodoo can allow you to read dinosaurs minds? Really!?', 144795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is a matter of love, Cala. De heart, even yours, knows de voodoo better than de brain.', 144794, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your will be mine now!', '', 144792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De vapors hold de truth!', '', 144791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe deeply!', '', 144790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_EARTHQUAKE.BLP:20|tRezan |cFFFF0000|Hspell:260683|h[awakens]|h|r all remaining bone piles!', '||TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHAMAN_EARTHQUAKE.BLP:20|tRezan |cFFFF0000|Hspell:260683|h[awakens]|h|r all remaining bone piles!', 144789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun...', 144788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... not like dis...', 144787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me sistas... will... avenge... me...', 144786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gachaga!', 144785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar... will... fall...', 144784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mistress... avenge me...', 144783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I was ta be da strongest...', 144782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pohkiza...', 144781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that didn\'t work. Good thing that wasn\'t my only idea.', '', 144780, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work on those potions, $n. Now I\'ll just combine them along with this other reagent and...', '', 144779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis gonna be easy!', 144778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I gonna make dis quick!', 144777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! Ya not even a challenge!', 144776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another skull for me collection!', 144775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis be our land!', 144774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Over here! We\'ve got work to do!', '', 144773, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 103470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to rest once in a while.$B$BEspecially after a profitable venture!', '', 144772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You put out those fires and I\'ll set up what we need in the lab. Oh, what fun this shall be!', '', 144771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am fresh out of materials for the moment. My apologies.', '', 144770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have several globes for you, Elric.', 'I have several globes for you, Elric.', 144769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have those herbs for you.', 'I have those herbs for you.', 144768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the eyes you asked for.', 'Here are the eyes you asked for.', 144767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are those potions you needed.', 'Here are those potions you needed.', 144766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a fellow alchemist! Perhaps I can interest you in some of my latest recipes.$b$bPotions are my specialty, but I also dabble in transmutation from time to time.', '', 144765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, $c! Could I interest you in a refreshing draught or is there something else that\'s piqued your interest?$b$bPotions are my specialty, but I also dabble in transmutation from time to time.', '', 144764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh meat!', 144763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dem ears gonna dangle from me necklace!', 144762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood for G\'huun!', 144761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh! Don\'t move! His vision is based on movement.', 'Shh! Don\'t move! His vision is based on movement.', 144760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light preserve me... he\'s back.', 'Light preserve me... he\'s back.', 144759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lightforged Vindicator groans.', 'The Lightforged Vindicator groans.', 144758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believed my mind was forfeit.', 'I believed my mind was forfeit.', 144757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earthmother bless you!', 'Earthmother bless you!', 144756, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was horrible, $r.', 'It was horrible, $r.', 144755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must... My mind... Must get away from this place!', 'I must... My mind... Must get away from this place!', 144754, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers... they were driving me mad!', 'The whispers... they were driving me mad!', 144753, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion.', 'Thank you, champion.', 144752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the finest weapon will dull with too much use. Take some time to fully heal, T\'paartos.', 144751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos offers gratitude to Lysara. T\'paartos feels ready to fight again!', '', 144750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not enough times to stop T\'paartos!', '', 144749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me effigy amulet for dis. Trust me, it be da best thing I got.', '', 144748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now dis is a fine forgery! Who\'d ya get this from? Don\'t say their name! Just send \'em my way.', '', 144747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep ya mouth shut about where ya got this or I\'ll show ya how I got dis name.', '', 144746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Again, T\'paartos? How many times have you...', 144745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not just any night elf head... She was royalty thousands of years ago!', '', 144744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time will tell. Take care of that centennial blossom, $p. They only bloom once every hundred years.', '', 144743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Golden seeds! We gotta plant dese immediately for da king. What do ya think will grow, Jahden?', 144742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pepper\'ll be perfect for my next batch of extra-spicy chili... and those golden seeds taste like dirt!', '', 144741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They were real. They are real. Lady Lucille is determined to take back our lands and our people.', 144740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If she does that, she\'ll have my full support.', '', 144739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has? I thought they were just a legend!', '', 144738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My title is Inquisitor now, mayor. Lady Lucille has reforged the Order of Embers to combat these witches.', 144737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot thank you enough for showing up when you did, Lieutenant.', '', 144736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks, $p! Our hearthstone supply was getting low. Have a peppa, on de house.', 144735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya interested in some work, $p? Find someone ta buy dose hearthstones. Trade \'em up for something really valuable and I\'ll make it worth ya while.', '', 144734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what that means... free lumber!', '', 144733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, umm... boss? I\'m gettin\' reports of some sort o\' huge tree- monster walkin\' around the woods.', '', 144732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squawk! Yer mother was a trogg! Squawk!', '', 144731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yellow-bellied landlubbers! SQUAWK!', '', 144730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUAWK!', '', 144729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst, $p, ya ever wanted to punch someone in da face, but knew ya couldn\'t? I got da solution for ya right here!', '', 144728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! I be havin\' special deals for top-notch traders!', '', 144727, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to the whispers. They are beautiful.', 'Listen to the whispers. They are beautiful.', 144726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows will consume you.', 'The shadows will consume you.', 144725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings an\' shouts be outdated! Only Azerite can be givin\' ya da strength needed for today\'s dangerous and demanding world. Drink bottled Azerite today!', '', 144724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death is necessary.', 'Your death is necessary.', 144723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MAKE IT STOP!', 'MAKE IT STOP!', 144722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkness comes...', 'The Darkness comes...', 144721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Vol\'jin had had his trusty invulnerability totem wit\' him on da Broken Shore, he\'d still be wit\' us today. Don\'t be makin\' da same mistake!', '', 144720, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spy on ya enemies, keep an eye on ya friends, sneak a peek at da royal chambers... all wit\' dis incredible whisperin\' wisps totem!', '', 144719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis totem\'s flame be burnin\' bright ever since King Rastakhan first sat on da throne. Own dis piece of Zandalari history today!', '', 144718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Griftah\'s guarantee: Don\'t ask questions, get a discount!', '', 144717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos is here!', '', 144716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel a lot better now.', 144715, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'PAARTOS!', '', 144714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t fight the dark without a crown, friend. It\'s the rules.', 144713, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It shoots stars! Bad guys really hate that.', 144712, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My kind are keepers and collectors of knowledge. \n\nIt is my job to ensure our discoveries are properly archived.', '', 144711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have much to prepare. Deal with them.', '', 144706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bore of this prattle.', '', 144705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those voices offer only lies!', '', 144704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you not feel the great one deep below? By her will, we shall be whole once more!', '', 144703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We swore to protect Brennadam. To protect our people! Have you forgotten our oaths?', '', 144702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were always too weak to serve by Lord Stormsong\'s side, languishing in Brennadam like a fool.', '', 144701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who are lost!', '', 144700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seas... swallow you...', '', 144699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for... Azshara...', '', 144698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abyss take you...', '', 144697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen... I\'ve... failed...', '', 144696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tide... ebbs...', '', 144695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seas... swallow you...', 144690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another question...', 'I have another question...', 144689, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you could use a friend.', 'It looks like you could use a friend.', 144688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing?', 'What are you doing?', 144687, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to help, Kugro!', 'I\'m here to help, Kugro!', 144686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you take a look at this scroll?', 'Can you take a look at this scroll?', 144685, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save your breath, young one. \n\nWhatever you want, I don\'t have time.', '', 144684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend? No, but an assistant, yes.', '', 144683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell you what I\'m not doing, and that\'s making small talk with a $r when there\'s work to be done.', '', 144682, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In that case, I hope you\'re an efficient multitasker.', '', 144681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not taking on side work right now. I\'m too far behind as is. These scrolls won\'t write themselves, you know.', '', 144680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in the red.', '', 144679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Arluelle has a faraway look in her eyes.>$B$BIf only my brother could see the city now...', 144678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a feeling our city will be called upon soon. I plan to be ready when the time comes.', 144677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a pity the Lightforged could not be convinced to join our side. Their martial prowess is formidable.', '', 144676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What number was I on? Arg!', '', 144675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Duskwatch will do well having Victoire in its ranks once more.', '', 144674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us go, champion.', 144673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad to see that Arluelle continues her training. She appears stronger already.$B$BPerhaps I should measure her improvement.', '', 144672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tides shift, Brother. If you do not stand with us, then you are lost.', '', 144671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One for you. One for me.', '', 144670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking the books is delicious!', '', 144669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reid! The fleet must be returned to Kul Tiras at once!', '', 144668, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 111100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I already count this pile?', '', 144667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One... Two... Seven... Red... Two...', '', 144666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In case it ain\'t clear by now, I\'m pretty good at blowin\' things up... and guess who\'s rapidly climbin\' my list of prime targets!', 144665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it up and there just might be a teeny-tiny \"accident.\"', 144664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! This is gonna cost ya!', 144663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Later, pal.', 144662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh? That was it?', 144661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See ya!', 144660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatcha need, bub?', 144659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready to move out?', 144658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey pal, what\'s up?', 144657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I guess THIS is my life now. Great. Juuuuuuust... great.', '', 144656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is how it\'s gonna be, huh? Seriously? Over and over with the tap tap tap tap tap tap tap...', '', 144655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you got anything better to do? Like, uh... go kiss a murloc or somethin\'?', '', 144654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, come on! I deserve more respect than this!', '', 144653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
