('', 'Greetings, $p! New lands and allies await us across Azeroth.$B$BOculeth has portals prepared downstairs when you are ready.', 144621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
