('I brought samples to dispel the unfounded rumors that our wine tastes too footy... I mean too fruity!', '', 144395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of our vintners have given up tending their vines and have taken up other forms of botany.', '', 144394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, dem blood trolls be battlin\' it out wit\' da guards as we arrived. Dey weren\'t expectin\' us ta attack from da rear.', '', 144393, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, that\'s a big one. I\'m gonna need your help taking him down!', '', 144392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you see a group of \'em, toss one of those quillbombs and give them a taste of their own medicine!', '', 144391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet that hurt, didn\'t it! Get off my land!', '', 144390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, got \'em right between the eyes!', '', 144389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can go back an\' tell Roz that I\'m okay, but I\'m never leaving my farm. I\'ll never leave them.', '', 144388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that will do. They always loved this spot...', '', 144387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can use the Orgrimmar portal to meet our Horde allies in their capital city on Kalimdor.', '', 144386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rokhan! Are you alright? It seems a battle happened here.', 144385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear Dalaran has an entire floor dedicated to magical transportation. $B$BImagine the possibilities!', '', 144384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These portals are incredibly tedious to sustain and, more importantly, they take attention away from valuable research!$B$BI am certain that telemancy will allow us to achieve a more stable solution.', '', 144383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who says goblins ain\'t got no culture?', '', 144382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They even got one a\' our drums!', '', 144381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and find an open drum!', '', 144380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to De Drunken Drummer, $pr! Grab a drink...', '', 144379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! I thought my plan was foolproof, mon!', '', 144378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You\'ll pay fer comin\' unda me bridge!', '', 144377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ey mon! Y\' be crossin\' ma bridge, mon. Pay da troll toll, mon, or y\' be payin\' in blood, mon!', '', 144376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin the trial.', 'I\'m ready to begin the trial.', 144375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What if we strapped a few explosives to \'em? It\'d be hilarious... Exploding dinosaurs!', 144374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I appreciate your enthusiasm, Shuga. But I\'m certain that the Zandalari prefer their weapons to be enchanted with powerful magic, not grease-dripping eyesores.', 144373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what have we become?', '', 144372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Let me go! Help, friend! HELP!', 144371, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s dark again! Where did you go? Don\'t leave me!', 144370, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I used to have a wand like that! Lost it a long time ago.', 144369, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A crown! So pretty!', 144368, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nuu-Nuu! I was scared I\'d never see you again! How did you get here?', 144367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s gotten a little brighter! I can see... sorta.', 144366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that? A light in the darkness! It\'s so bright...', 144365, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She... promised...', '', 144364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was told we could be together this way!', '', 144363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With de loa behind us and courage in our hearts, we will be victorious!', 144362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will strike down de blood trolls. We will ensure dat abomination dey are calling forth will never be used against us!', 144361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our foes seek to destroy all dat we hold dear. We must not allow their plans to succeed! Zandalar\'s future depends upon our actions dis day!', 144360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers... friends. We have endured many hardships, but at last de end of our struggle is in sight.', 144359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me where I can ferry to.', 'Show me where I can ferry to.', 144358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for a ferry?', 'Looking for a ferry?', 144357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good thing I wore my boots!', 144356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be takin\' some of da tortollans and movin\' to Zul\'jan by foot. Good luck, you two.', '', 144355, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live and die... for the Horde!', 'I live and die... for the Horde!', 144354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and honor!', 'Blood and honor!', 144353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arathi belongs to the Horde!', 'Arathi belongs to the Horde!', 144352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me!', 'Follow me!', 144351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Alliance!', 'Death to the Alliance!', 144350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 144349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! To battle!', 'This way! To battle!', 144348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Come on, grunts! We\'ve got a war to win!', 'Come on, grunts! We\'ve got a war to win!', 144347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Gral!', '', 144346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the south you will find what remains of my temple, I will find you there and we will teach these naga about the fury of a shark loa!', '', 144345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... you were delicious.', '', 144344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no depths dark enough for you!', '', 144343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga are not welcome in Atal\'Gral!', '', 144342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deliciously sharp scent of naga rage-infused blood... the sweet tender morsels... I will attend for this.', '', 144341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother, Benjamin told me everything.\n\nYou couldn\'t hear me before, but maybe now you can? All I wanted was an explanation.', 144340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother, I know you aren\'t here. But if you can hear me...', 144339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may not be the best manager, but mother was incredible. To see her fall that far...$b$bWe\'re coping, $n. Thank you for your help.', '', 144338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are you going?', 144337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, don\'t leave me.', 144336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our master beneath the tides will guide us all to victory!', 144335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great to see you all made it back in one piece thanks to... hey, there\'s the gal of the hour!', '', 144334, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You staying or leaving?', '', 144333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuse me. I must find my sister.', '', 144332, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When father died, mother disappeared. But I never thought...', '', 144331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She and my father worked their whole lives to build this business and provide for me and my sister.', '', 144330, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That witch... she was my mother.', '', 144329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you know your way around beasts. What do you need?', '', 144328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it now? You lose something?', '', 144327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Again, from the beginning.', '', 144326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Expending too much energy at once is dangerous. Pace yourselves, students.', '', 144325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focused chi is extremely potent. Master Tau Li will guide you once you are ready.', '', 144324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When healing, you must gather your inner strength and pass it along to another.', '', 144323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad I did not have to give EVERYTHING.', 'I\'m glad I did not have to give EVERYTHING.', 144322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our corrupted brothers and sisters still wander in the wilds.', 'Our corrupted brothers and sisters still wander in the wilds.', 144321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My life... for the Horde.', 144320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See ya soon, my friend.', 144319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood and thunder!', 144318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll cut you down.', 144317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blades thirst for your flesh.', 144316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your strength is no match for an orc!', 144315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your bones are no match for my blades!', 144314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the line! Nothing gets through!', 144313, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend.', '', 144312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I do not remember you the next time we meet, I am sorry.', '', 144311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for dealing with Torok. He refused to see the dangers behind the power he sought.', 'Thank you for dealing with Torok. He refused to see the dangers behind the power he sought.', 144310, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The sleeping Tauren snores loudly and rolls over.>', '<The sleeping Tauren snores loudly and rolls over.>', 144309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZZZzzz...', 'ZZZzzz...', 144308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be in, princess. To da very end.', '', 144307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is de only way to save my people, Rokhan. I am willing to give up everything for their safety. Are you with me?', 144306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still cannot believe my brothers and sisters succumbed to the fel.', 'I still cannot believe my brothers and sisters succumbed to the fel.', 144305, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daughters, dis de how ya deal wit\' guests!', 144304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da blood... gonna avenge me...', 144303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For da warmothers!', 144302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, focus your chi. Push the energy away from you.', '', 144301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya essence be servin\' from da outside!', 144300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gonna be fun ta drain ya.', 144299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood gonna fuel us!', 144298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take ya blood. Da rest can rot!', 144297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood gonna wet my blade.', 144296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya need a lift, you know where to find me!', '', 144295, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood for da singers!', 144294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your hide gonna make a fine harness!', 144293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The skies... call.', 144292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lovely day fer a battle.', 144291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da crawgs be eatin\' well tonight!', 144290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay strong! I will check on Satao.', '', 144289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENTRY - The Slime Experiment\n\nAnimating the slimes has proven successful. Instead of dissolving organic matter such as meat or vegetation, they can subsist entirely on honey. The plentiful waste produced can be fermented in barrels, creating an exceptionally potent and delicious mead.\n\nWithout properly containing them, however, the slimes will eventually seek out and consume entire hives. They tend to become more aggressive and grow out of control in the process.\n\nNaturally, in response, the bees have become more defensive and are now more difficult to work with. It\'s obvious I\'ll need to eventually work on a solution, as the bees are not easily replaced.', '', 144288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pohkiza...', 144287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Blood God... claims... all...', 144286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hahaha!', 144285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar... gonna... fall...', 144284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gachaga!', 144283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sistahs... gonna... avenge... me...', 144282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
