('', 'A rising sun over golden water...', 143928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A large egg, shaking wildly, but not cracking...', 143927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All de troll tribes, united under de Zandalari banner...', 143926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A severed elf\'s head...', 143925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ancient waters, undisturbed for generations...', 143924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Masks of gold...', 143923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pa\'ku\'s shadow crosses a stone path...', 143922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Let us see what de spirits have to say to you...', 143921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you sure you wish to know, $p?\n\nNot all fortunes tell of great deeds and happy endings...', 143920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not afraid. Tell me what you see in my future.', 'I\'m not afraid. Tell me what you see in my future.', 143919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you see in my future?', 'What do you see in my future?', 143918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear me now, spirits, lost and ancient. Fill my vessels and reveal to us de future.', 143917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does not matter. We are everywhere... below your feet.', '', 143916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak... Our tribe... grows strong.', 'You are weak... Our tribe... grows strong.', 143915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104274, 104275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
