('The thorns will grow strong with your blood.', 'The thorns will grow strong with your blood.', 143908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104262, 104263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No retreat, no surrender!', 'No retreat, no surrender!', 143907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104260, 104261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is the Bloodshed Compendium blank?', 'Why is the Bloodshed Compendium blank?', 143906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our boars will feed on you.', 'Our boars will feed on you.', 143905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104258, 104259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us!', 'You cannot stop us!', 143904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104256, 104257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We claim this land!', 'We claim this land!', 143903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104254, 104255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin writing in the book.', 'Begin writing in the book.', 143902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thumb through the entire book.', 'Thumb through the entire book.', 143901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scraaatchy! Are you still up there?! Meow twice if you can hear me!!', 143900, 0, 54547, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
