('Kachago!', '', 143867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t you read the fine print, kid?\n\nNo refunds. No exceptions. No whining.\n\nI know what\'ll lift your spirits... a Featherfeet Fun Fall!', '', 143865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One Featherfeet Fun Fall, please!', 'One Featherfeet Fun Fall, please!', 143864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a refund.', 'I want a refund.', 143863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $p!\n\nYou\'ve no doubt been enjoying your time in the Featherfeet Fun Fall Family.\n\nAs a full member, you have access to an unlimited number of slow falls off the top of this fun ziggurat. Just let me know whenever you need another!\n\nThere are absoutely no refunds.', '', 143862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join Featherfeet\'s Fun Fall Family today!\n\nFor a small one-time convenience fee, you\'ll have access to unlimited slow falls off the top of this ziggurat. Guaranteed to ensure your survival!\n\nNo refunds.', '', 143861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds are stronger up here than they were in Highmountain. Our decision to join the Horde is already paying off.', '', 143860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the storm and know peace. Flow through the Shrine so we might share your strength.', '', 143859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a wonderful city. Exploring the world is such fun!', 143858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear our call, fallen. Your wicked deeds are forgiven this day.', '', 143857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, release the souls within the bell.', '', 143856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rosaline, I\'m sorry, but you must wait. We have more pressing matters than hunting on our hands today.', '', 143855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi! Therold! Enough dallying. We need your blessing to go out for our hunt!', 143854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back soon, $p!', '', 143853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten points for spitting on any blood trolls you see!', '', 143852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Featherfeet\'s Fun Falls! Tell your friends!', '', 143851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $p. Happy falling!', '', 143850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to land on the brutosaur!', '', 143849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
