('Safe travels, $p.', '', 143846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaaaaaugh!', '', 143845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance.', '', 143844, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da Horde!', '', 143843, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stromgarde has fallen. Surrender now, Rogers, and save your skin.', '', 143842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hell yeah there is... my hammer!', '', 143841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knock knock, little Bronzebeard. Anybody home?', '', 143840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is still with me. I will not fall so easily!', '', 143839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral Rogers! We\'ve stormed your fortress. Where is your retribution now, paladin?', '', 143838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey tink a few soldiers on horseback gonna stop us? Hah! Show \'em what de Horde is made of!', '', 143837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da stronghold be needin\' reinforcement. Go destroy dem tanks before dey get too close!', '', 143836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defenses are still weak. Horde troops, return to base and defend our position!', '', 143835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. If you want war, then you shall have your war. Send a mounted battalion to take them out!', '', 143834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Circle of Elements be under da Horde\'s control now.', '', 143833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Newstead be ours... an\' wit\' it, da wolf riders.', '', 143832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armory be good ta go, mon.', '', 143831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Workshop be done. Our demolishers gonna make quick work o\' da Alliance walls!', '', 143830, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siege engines, destroy them!', '', 143829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were warned, Horde scum. Now prepare to be annihilated.', '', 143828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All o\' dis been troll lands long before da Alliance even knew it be here, Turalyon.', '', 143827, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. You\'ll fit right in.', '', 143826, 1, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those clothes will have to do for now.', '', 143825, 1, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First tings first. We be needin\' wood and iron ta build a Horde base here. Should be plenty of both nearby.', '', 143824, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I been waitin\' for da same, Muradin.', '', 143823, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe those clothes will help your gathering skills.', '', 143822, 1, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pfah! You can choke on your retribution, Turalyon!', '', 143821, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are Alliance lands! Swift retribution shall come to these Horde invaders!', '', 143820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, it belongs to da Horde!', '', 143819, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, all of dis land belonged to da trolls.', '', 143818, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... gladly, lad. Ye\'ve messed with the wrong dwarf now.', '', 143817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muradin! Show yourself, you coward!', '', 143816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defenses are still weak. Stop those tanks before they get to our base!', '', 143815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not half as ugly as you, Bronzebeard!', '', 143814, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, Examiner.', '', 143813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m honored to serve, Examiner.', '', 143812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De battle is over... and we have survived. Ateena will pay for her madness!', 143811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold de destroyer of Zuldazar! I hope ya try an\' stop us... ya suffering\'s gonna be glorious!', 143810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya come so far, only ta fall before de master\'s fury!', 143809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Working for the Reliquary is exhausting...', '', 143808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, too easy! Try your hand in the field. We can always use more wood.', '', 143807, 1, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you say, Examiner.', '', 143806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However I may be of service, Examiner.', '', 143805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m happy to help, Examiner.', '', 143804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya skin gonna make a fine vessel for me master!', 143803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Horde be fallin\' next. Ya gonna pay for killin\' Hir\'eek! Ya got nowhere ta run.', 143802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar gonna fall... and me master soon be free! Ya weak loa ain\'t gonna stop him!', 143801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, Examiner.', '', 143800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be right there, Examiner.', '', 143799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting... Baeloth, come look at this and tell me what you see.', 143798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'d you run off to, Baeloth? I have more valuable insights for you to write down.', 143797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear Baeloth, come look at this.', 143796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time for rest in the Reliquary, Baeloth.', 143795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baeloth, don\'t touch the artifacts!', 143794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s marvelous... Baeloth, come acknowledge how marvelous this is!', 143793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hezrel\'s shield is up! Get inside of it!', 143792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baeloth, are you dreaming again? I could use your help over here.', 143791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baeloth, be sweet and transcribe everything I say.', 143790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Outriggers require many supplies to stay performing to their maximum capacity! It is my job to track and replenish the stores, as well as repair broken gadgets and gizmos!$b$b...$b$bThey break numerous gadgets and gizmos per day.$b$bThey are not the most gentle of people.', '', 143789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, if I may have a word with you? I would like your assistance.', 143788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103280, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<< An event plays out where me and the laborers walk towards the causeway with cannons. >>', '', 143787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two pairs of toes. Two pairs o\' toes. T\'pairs o\'toes. T\'pair o\'toes. T\'paar o\'toes. T\'paartoes. T\'paartos. T\'paartos!', '', 143786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They appear to have all fallen for my act! I find it extraordinary that they believe I could be so simple-minded as to... Wait, you mean they can hear me? I, uh... T\'paartos!', '', 143785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('List of things T\'paartos does not like: snakes, mean children, snakes, dark caves, snakes... and puny ones who pester T\'paartos.', '', 143784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, T\'paartos has read books. Books with few words and many pictures... but they still count.', '', 143783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny one is not trying to take advantage of T\'paartos\' good nature... are you?', '', 143782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos is still slightly afraid of snakes.', '', 143781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos is proud to be Lightforged!', '', 143780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back to T\'paartos anytime.', '', 143779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos must get back to work now.', '', 143778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos has much to do.', '', 143777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
