('Light be with you, friend.', '', 143772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Danger? T\'paartos scoffs at danger!', '', 143771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny one needs something of T\'paartos?', '', 143770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
