('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_DEATHWING_BLOODCORRUPTION_DEATH.BLP|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:259610|h[Bloody Apocalypse]|h|r! Take cover!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_DEATHWING_BLOODCORRUPTION_DEATH.BLP|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:259610|h[Bloody Apocalypse]|h|r! Take cover!', 143766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Struggle! Fight! Ya suffering feeds me master!', 143765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina? More like Paina. Modera? More like... uh... look, you cannot expect me to hit gold every time, okay?', '', 143764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar? More like Badghar. Am I right?', '', 143763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kirin Tor? More like Kirin Snore. Am I right?', '', 143762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you would all just do what I say instead of attempting to think for yourselves, Azeroth would be much better off.', '', 143761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be unwise to oppose us.', '', 143760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Quel\'Thalas.', '', 143759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have overcome much.', '', 143758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We build our future upon the backbone of tradition.', '', 143757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be about your work.', '', 143756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let outsiders interfere.', '', 143755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respect our customs.', '', 143754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eternal sun still guides us.', '', 143753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would you ask of me?', '', 143752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve Silvermoon.', '', 143751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am rather busy.', '', 143750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not squander resources.', '', 143749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?', '', 143748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunwell must be protected.', '', 143747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this, as a way of thanks.', '', 143746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Plans? Little old me? What sort of plans could I possibly have?', 143745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you think I would not notice the way you leer at my dark rangers? I suggest you keep your eyes--and thoughts--to yourself.', 143744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have taken note of your progress. It seems I may have to send you to Nathanos for remedial training.', 143743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No doubt I am your favorite Windrunner sister... right? Right?', 143742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lifeblood of Azeroth belongs to the Horde.', 143741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I started questioning the existence of such a creature!', '', 143740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will claim what is ours.', 143739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will serve the Horde in time.', 143738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will grow the ranks of the Forsaken. One way... or another.', 143737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will bring the Alliance to its knees.', 143736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Serve the Horde. Serve me.', 143735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s beautiful!', '', 143734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go. I have much to do.', 143733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Serve me well, and you will be rewarded.', 143732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be a new future for the Horde.', 143731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our true work is just beginning.', 143730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, champion.', 143729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come forward.', 143728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust you will not waste my time.', 143727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'State your business to your Warchief.', 143726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements of Zandalar have endured much. We must stop the dark shaman who abuse their power for selfish ends.', 143725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The name\'s Berthold, and I\'m a bit of a horse fanatic.\n\nRumor is, there\'s a majestic horse-like creature to the west of this resort, on a mountain of some sort. I took up a job here on the chance I might be able to see it on my off time.\n\nOh, what I would give to see something like that...', '', 143724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Affirmative. Request no more thought regarding Titan Keeper Hezrel\'s position. Will make way to area designated Zul\'nazman.', '', 143721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hezrel, de blood trolls are gathering in Zul\'nazman. If you are going to help us, dat is where you need to go.', 143720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buy me a drink, $pr.\n\nMy people saved dis world while your people ran off like cowards, hiding in your mist.\n\nYou owe me a drink.', '', 143719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan Keeper Hezrel systems operating at 50 percent capacity. Must conserve remaining energy for blood troll purge.', '', 143718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis used to be my mixing room. De royal family entertained nobility from all over de world, and I pleased all of dem with my drinks.\n\nNow, it\'s a den for filthy outsiders and their ugly friends. What a disgrace.', '', 143717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I respect some of de goblin cartels. Neutral and strong, willing to do whatever it takes. Like de Zandalari... but worse, of course.\n\nBut you Bilgewater are a disgrace. In bed with de elves and de Horde. Nothing but sell outs.', '', 143716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel my power!', '', 143715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like de way your Horde operates, $p. Strong leaders. United in purpose. Steady supply lines.\n\nYou recruiting?', '', 143714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to pursue our next ally.', 'I am ready to pursue our next ally.', 143713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last, the ceaseless posturing between the Horde and the Alliance is coming to an end.$b$bThe time for war is at hand.', 143712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always surprised me dat you Darkspears signed up with de Horde. Always were too weak to stand on your own, I guess.\n\nHow\'s Vol\'jin?', '', 143711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, elf. I don\'t own dis bar anymore, so I don\'t have to pretend to like you.\n\nGet out of my face, filthy elf.', '', 143710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look thirsty. Have a drink. Stay and chat for awhile.\n\nZuldazar\'s been around since de ancient times. It won\'t disappear overnight.', '', 143709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear some of you are heading out to Nazmir. Dodge dat assignment, if you can. Nothing good has come out of dat swamp in generations.', '', 143708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear dere\'s more trouble than usual brewing out in de sands of Vol\'dun. Be careful if you are headed out dat way.', '', 143707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people founded civilization at de dawn of time, and have carried de rest of you on our backs ever since.\n\nTell me, $pr, what have your people ever done worth remembering?\n\nI can\'t think of a single thing.', '', 143706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Leap onto Hezrel\'s shoulder to return to Gloom Hollow.)', '(Leap onto Hezrel\'s shoulder to return to Gloom Hollow.)', 143705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'huun containment repair failed. Must prevent units designated blood trolls from destroying Zuldazar to prevent full release of G\'huun.\n\nStructure surrounded by blood trolls. Titan Keeper Hezrel will ensure safety of $n and Princess Talanji.\n\nLeap onto shoulders. Keep head down.', '', 143704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy. Disgusting. You smell worse than a blood troll.\n\nIf I still owned dis bar, I\'d sweep you out with de garbage.', '', 143703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you hear about things outside de city?', '', 143702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gallywix has operations underway in Silithus. Get there at once. And if you see any Alliance skulking about, make quick work of them.', '', 143700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We established a makeshift base in Silithus. Check in with our operatives there--and keep your eyes open for Horde aggression.', '', 143699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You orcs can drink. I give you dat.\n\nBut tell your stuck-up elf friends to stay out of here, eh?', '', 143698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria and Turalyon? No chance. I mean... not that I am rooting against them or anything, but... Uh, do we have to keep talking about this?', '', 143697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I can forgive you for not being a fan of elves. After all, half of us dislike the other half rather intensely.', '', 143696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admit, purple was never my favorite color. But lately it\'s growing on me. Literally.', '', 143695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High elf? Please. Why would you want to be a high elf when you can look all tragic and brooding?', '', 143694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain focus and control.', '', 143693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not bend to the whispers.', '', 143692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be open to possibilities.', '', 143691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows watch over you.', '', 143690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve the Alliance.', '', 143689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is not the only path.', '', 143688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ren\'dorei shall prove our worth.', '', 143687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have much to teach you.', '', 143686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with an open mind.', '', 143685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All paths are possible.', '', 143684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We embrace power. We do not fear it.', '', 143683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows serve us.', '', 143682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 143681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, traveler.', '', 143680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eye patch has never switched sides! I mean... who would mix up something like that?', '', 143679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Working for Sylvanas has its... challenges. Being dead has made her even bossier. But, uh... do not tell her I said that.', '', 143678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen\'s champion or no, I can out-shoot Nathanos any day of the week.', '', 143677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hair like this does not just happen on its own. It requires constant attention.', '', 143676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never again shall a king reign in Silvermoon.', '', 143675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a nation on the rise.', '', 143674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al diel shala.', '', 143673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We find strength in the Horde.', '', 143672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I do, I do for Quel\'Thalas.', '', 143671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light of the Sunwell be with you.', '', 143670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon will know prosperity again.', '', 143669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beauty of Eversong endures.', '', 143668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eternal sun still guides us.', '', 143667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rebuilding continues.', '', 143666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have made many sacrifices.', '', 143665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I proudly serve as regent lord.', '', 143664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 143663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I greet you on behalf of Silvermoon.', '', 143662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I think I\'ve caught a big one!', '', 143651, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Hezrel reveals G\'huun being an old god, being experimented upon, and reveals blood trolls want to destroy Zuldazar in order to free G\'huun. No way of fixing current containment, must protect Zuldazar. Ateena, blood troll matriarch, arrives, badly damages Hezrel, and prepares to strike.', 'PLACEHOLDER SCENE - Hezrel talks about G\'huun being an old god, being experimented upon, and reveals blood trolls want to destroy Zuldazar in order to free G\'huun. No way of fixing current containment, must protect Zuldazar. Ateena, blood troll matriarch, arrives, badly damages Hezrel, and prepares to strike', 143650, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back, $r! His voice belongs to me!', 143649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is such... power... here...', 143648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, Umbric. Answers to such mysteries often come at a price.', 143647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this cube, for instance. It is an ancient device, perhaps even predating life on Azeroth. It seems to have been locked, and we cannot yet open it.', '', 143646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! Like you, we believe the void can be used to defend life rather than consume it. We have made great progress, Lady Windrunner, but many mysteries remain.', '', 143645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another time, perhaps. This champion and I have been searching for you. We know of your exile from Silvermoon and felt we shared common ground.', 143644, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people and I heard tales of what transpired on Argus. As you might imagine, we have a keen interest in your interaction with the darkened naaru.', '', 143643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria Windrunner!? How did... My, what an unexpected honor!', '', 143642, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Magister Umbric! I am Alleria Windrunner.', 143641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, up ahead. That must be Umbric.', 143640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Based on these notes, I believe I can reopen the passage to this world he spoke of. Let me see...', 143639, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Landing from jump: Total 3>', 143638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drathir believed this rift held an ancient object of unspeakable might. Perhaps this will be the key that allows us to gain control over the shadows.', '', 143637, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His notes said it existed within a rift in the very fabric of reality. He never found this place... but I have succeeded where he failed. The way will soon be open to us!', '', 143636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drathir\'s quest for power led him to seek the fragments of an ancient world, one teetering on the brink of the Void itself.', '', 143635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Landing from jump: Total 3>', '', 143634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come. We must make our way to Dawnstar Spire.', 143633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevertheless, I believe this knowledge can be used for good. The bulk of Drathir\'s research was conducted at Dawnstar Spire. That is where we must go.', '', 143632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was Drathir\'s betrayal that allowed Arthas to corrupt the Sunwell... and left our kingdom in ruins. For the first time, I see why Rommath opposes our course of study.', '', 143631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we are not the first of our people seeking to harness the void. I have found notebooks belonging to one whose very name is a curse... Dar\'Khan Drathir.', '', 143630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Landing from jump: Total 3>', '', 143629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems we have found some notes.', 143628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Landing from jump: Total 3>', 143627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, it seems our research has reached an impasse. I believe there is knowledge at the Andilien Estate that will springboard us forward.', '', 143626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grand magister must understand that this power is crucial to the defense of Silvermoon. Never again shall the sin\'dorei fall prey to our enemies!', '', 143625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our void experiments are proceeding well. I am certain we are on the cusp of a breakthrough... despite Rommath\'s smallminded protests.', '', 143624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Landing from jump: Total 3>', '', 143623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Landing from jump: Total 3>', 143622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Distressed cry: Total 3>', '', 143621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Landing from jump: Total 3>', '', 143620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hezrel, begin your scans to find a solution to the Old God corruption with Nazmir.', 'Hezrel, begin your scans to find a solution to the Old God corruption with Nazmir.', 143619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see if these fish are ready to bite!', '', 143618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Landing from jump: Total 3>', 143617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These woods once brought such joy to me and my sisters. To see them like this... fills my heart with sorrow.', 143616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will prove them wrong.', '', 143615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take some time for us to adjust to our new forms. We look forward to your return, Lady Windrunner. And $p... you have our deepest thanks.', '', 143614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And in turn, I pledge to aid you on your journey. $p and I will inform High King Wrynn of this news. Then I will return, so that we can begin your training.', 143613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon turned its back on us long ago. Today we are reborn... and it is fitting that we walk a new path. From this day forth, the Alliance has our loyalty.', '', 143612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense the powers at your command. They are... considerable. You would make valuable allies of the Alliance.', 143611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arrogance was nearly our undoing. I dabbled with powers far beyond my control. If you will train us, Alleria, we will follow where you lead.', '', 143610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve authorized the building of an embassy in Orgrimmar. From it, we will win others to our cause. Meet me there at once.', 143609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde\'s selfless leadership in the war against the Legion has left our ranks depleted. Our enemies slaver at the thought of stealing what is ours. We will not let them.', 143608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have observed our operations in Silithus, $p. Clearly the Alliance is doing everything in its power to undermine our efforts.', 143607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for the Alliance to bring in new members to join our cause. We have established an embassy in Stormwind to spearhead these efforts. Meet me there.', '', 143606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will stop at nothing to claim the lifeblood of Azeroth. I fear that after the war against the Legion, our ranks are too depleted to stave off their aggression.', '', 143605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen the devastation in Silithus with your own eyes, $p. You know what is at stake.', '', 143604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me outside Grommash Hold. Keep this quiet... or the consequences will be swift and severe.', '', 143603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Information has come to light crucial to the interests of the Horde. It is imperative we remain a step ahead of our rivals.', '', 143602, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! The Dark Lady instructs you to meet me in Orgrimmar.', '', 143601, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find me at Lion\'s Rest. And needless to say, keep the details of this meeting between us.', '', 143600, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve uncovered certain... sensitive information that he insists you be made aware of.', '', 143599, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, High King Wrynn requests that you rendezvous with me at Stormwind.', '', 143598, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am also bringing dis outsider who wishes to speak with you, mighty loa.', '', 143597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The nightborne are a wise and powerful people. The ancient knowledge you possess will prove a great boon to our cause.', 143596, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of these pleasantries. You have much to prove, hero. Wherever your path takes you, know that you fight... for the Horde!', 143595, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest assured, I will be taking note of your progress. As warchief, I expect much of you... and I reward those who serve me well.', 143594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde has many rivals in this world. Some call us enemies... others call us outcasts. But we find strength in unity... and in defiance of those who would challenge our freedom.', 143593, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Highmountain tauren possess strength and courage. We will have need of such qualities in the days to come.', 143592, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the young hero $p comes before me. I am told you show great promise. Let us hope these reports prove true.', 143591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe travels, $p. May the Light be with you always.', '', 143590, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void elves may be a recent addition to our ranks, but Alleria Windrunner is one of our greatest heroes. Under her tutelage, the powers you wield will aid our cause.', '', 143589, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll rid you from these lands!', '', 143588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe travels, $p. Though you walk among the shadows, you are a beacon of hope to us all.', '', 143587, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to hearing of your progress. Something tells me we will speak again soon.', '', 143586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are troubled times for Azeroth. In the days to come, you will face many trials... fight many foes. Know that you are never alone against the darkness, for the Alliance stands with you.', '', 143585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lightforged may be a recent addition to our ranks, but I know the draenei well. I am confident you will embody the dedication and courage of the Army of the Light.', '', 143584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend $p. I am King Anduin Wrynn. As a new member of the Alliance, I wished to greet you personally.', '', 143583, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need healing!', '', 143582, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your own mill!', '', 143581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What an interesting and obscure little corner of the world the Horde has led us to.\n\nI trust most of my new faction\'s establishments will be more elegant and clean than this one?', '', 143580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, $p.\n\nI\'d love to chat with you, but I\'m afraid I\'m about to be sick.\n\nDo not try the wine.', '', 143579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vintner Thesnala glares at the bartender while slowly pouring his wine onto the ground next to him.>', '', 143578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tasted the wine here yet?\n\nYou simply must. The taste is unbelievably horrendous.\n\nBards may write songs about its legendary awful texture.\n\nTruly, an achievement in bottom-dwelling, alcohol-spoiling, death-of-the-party products.', '', 143577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far, I trust the Zandalari to build large, obnoxious buildings.\n\nI do NOT trust them to make wine.', '', 143576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you cannot make fine wine, you shouldn\'t make any wine at all.', '', 143575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buy me another glass of this wine so I may spit its filth onto the ground a second time.', '', 143574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They call this swill wine? No wonder the trolls are abandoning this city.', '', 143573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re finally free! Quick, let\'s get out of here!', 'We\'re finally free! Quick, let\'s get out of here!', 143572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101096, 101097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These wooden abominations are something out of a nightmare!', '', 143571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I better get... hazard pay... for this...', 'I better get... hazard pay... for this...', 143569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102061, 102062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even devastated as it is, dis place looks familiar...', 143568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your backs into it, you lazy meat sacks!', 'Put your backs into it, you lazy meat sacks!', 143567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102063, 102064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Structure interior clear. Being designated \"Princess Talanji\" has joined.', '', 143566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The word is given. Let us ride to Corlain!', '', 143565, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too late. G\'huun cannot be contained. All will fall. All will die.', '', 143562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is upon you. G\'huun will be free. Azeroth will be ours.', '', 143561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your valuables in de vault and keep movin\', $p.\n\nI got my eyes on you...', '', 143560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark times have come to Drustvar, but we shall win our land back!', '', 143559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Zandalar!', '', 143558, 0, 0, 22, 68, 0, 109704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Rezan, let\'s go hunting.', '', 143557, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 109703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. We ride out on the mainlander\'s command.', '', 143556, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa\'ku, loa of de winds, take to de skies and seek out de heretics. Divine their goals and meet us at de temple.', '', 143555, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 109702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk, loa of de hunt, lead your followers to de Temple of de Prophet and slay any foes you find. Flush our enemies out into de open.', '', 143554, 0, 0, 25, 68, 0, 109701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters of Zandalar, de time has come to cut off de heads of dese traitors who have sworn demselves to Zul.', '', 143553, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 109700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rest of us will need to prepare for the ride to Corlain. Marshal, I understand you have a plan of attack?', 143552, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, ma\'am!', 143551, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 97794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take this recipe for alchemical fire to Master Ashton in Falconhurst. He will know what to make of it.', 143550, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fortunately, I know of an expert alchemist in Falconhurst, to the south. The woods are treacherous, so you\'ll need to travel there along the old mountain roads.', 143549, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tome contains a recipe for alchemical fire, but we have no one here skilled enough to craft it.', 143548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we wish to defeat the coven for good, we will need more than silver. We will need fire.', 143547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, sir! What do you require of me, milady?', 143546, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 97789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Cleardawn--Excuse me, Inquisitor Cleardawn is as reliable as they come. I\'m sure she can handle anything you need her for.', '', 143545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any recommendations, Marshal?', 143544, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, before we depart, I\'ll need someone to undertake a special task for the order.', 143543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe the Horde has never founded an official bureau of telemancy? I mean, I have no idea how its citizens traveled with any degree of safety. The thought of all those random portals tearing holes in reality without proper anchoring...\n\nWell, at any rate, I am pleased to offer a network of stabilized teleportation to the Horde. Move along, please.', '', 143542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of my town are tough, but this is testing our mettle.', '', 143540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drown these insects, my children. Show yourselves worthy of my pride.', 143539, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 107010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brgl! Brglrgl!', '', 143537, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgl, mrglrglrgl! Mrrrg! Mrrrg!!', '', 143536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prying', 'Prying', 143531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one\'s on you, kid! Hop aboard!', '', 143530, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is not right on Rezan\'s Claw. We set up a scout flyer near de camp.', '', 143529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimmie your gold, I\'ve got an earnings call in five minutes!', '', 143523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for you to apply the synthetic G\'huun essence to me.', 'I\'m ready for you to apply the synthetic G\'huun essence to me.', 143520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Da\'ka! He find us! Help!', '', 143519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... lost? To them? Pathetic! Report to the Undercity for remedial training. Apparently I have to start at square one with you...', '', 143518, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was far from what I\'d call an elegant victory, but at least you put those Alliance dogs in their place. For the Horde!', '', 143517, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... worgen I smell? It\'s hard to be sure over the overwhelming stench of Alliance self-righteousness.', '', 143516, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take them down! You do NOT want to disappoint your warchief!', '', 143515, 0, 36471, 5, 64, 0, 94751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance calls those soldiers? Miserable! That one can barely swing a sword!', '', 143514, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Don\'t leave one of those bastards breathing!', '', 143513, 0, 36471, 5, 64, 0, 94749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zounds! There\'s even more Azerite to be had. Follow your map and lock down those sites!', '', 143512, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more Azerite eruptions around this blasted island! Check your map to find them.', '', 143511, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost there. Do not relent. More Azerite!', '', 143510, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Snatched it out of the Alliance\'s hands! Well struck!', '', 143509, 0, 36471, 0, 64, 0, 94745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An acceptable first effort, but we need more Azerite!', '', 143508, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab these supplies, if you need them. But don\'t lose sight of the Banshee Queen\'s prize!', '', 143507, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supplies are on the way. I better not see the Alliance getting them before you do!', '', 143506, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down there... Azerite! Take it for our warchief. And should those Alliance get in your way, litter the beach with their corpses. Move!', '', 143505, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me have a look at you. Ugh... pathetic! Why aren\'t there any dark rangers in your ranks? Well, you\'ll have to do.', '', 143504, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance vessel incoming! Those curs are lapping at our heels. Well, get to battle stations!', '', 143503, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mission here is simple. Collect every bit of Azerite and leave nothing for the Alliance to find. I trust that isn\'t too hard to grasp.', '', 143502, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions of the Horde! We have found Azerite deposits on some wretched island off the Feralas coast. It is your duty to secure it in the name of the Dark Lady!', '', 143501, 0, 36471, 1, 64, 0, 94755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drive them out! This island is ours!', '', 143500, 0, 36470, 5, 64, 0, 94730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight for the king! Fight for the Alliance!', '', 143499, 0, 36470, 5, 64, 0, 94729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Horde think they\'re clever. Teach them a lesson!', '', 143498, 0, 36470, 5, 64, 0, 94728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Take out those healers!', '', 143497, 0, 36470, 5, 64, 0, 94727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all look like a sturdy lot. Hmm... could use another rogue or two, I\'d say... but you\'ll do!', '', 143496, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn! The Horde got the upper hand this time. But I swear upon Lion\'s Rest that we will yet claim victory!', '', 143495, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely done, champions! King Wrynn will be pleased to learn of your victory. For the Alliance!', '', 143494, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supplies incoming! Grab them, champions!', '', 143493, 0, 36470, 603, 64, 0, 94739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Azerite eruptions! Locate them on your map and secure those sites!', '', 143492, 0, 36470, 603, 64, 0, 94726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing good work. Just a bit more Azerite and the day is ours!', '', 143491, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kept that Azerite out of the Horde\'s hands. Well done!', '', 143490, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing well so far, heroes. But we need more Azerite!', '', 143489, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! We\'re dropping supplies down to you. Don\'t let the Horde get their hands on them!', '', 143488, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 94738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have spotted more Azerite eruptions around the island! The locations are marked on your map.', '', 143487, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a rich Azerite deposit below us, heroes. Get down there and collect all you can. And if those Horde marauders gets in your way... put them down!', '', 143486, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde vessel incoming! No doubt that scum followed us here. Battle stations!', '', 143485, 0, 36470, 603, 64, 0, 94735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve brought our ship around to the center of the island. Collect as much Azerite as you can. It is the key to victory!', '', 143484, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, Azerite deposits have been located on an island off the coast of Feralas. We must secure them before the Horde does.', '', 143483, 0, 36470, 1, 64, 0, 94733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be an honor, Lady Liadrin. Oculeth has the coordinates to your capital. I will gather Silgryn and Valtrois, and meet you in Silvermoon.', 143482, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sure the regent lord will be pleased to learn of your interest. Are you ready to depart?', 143481, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is why I am grateful for your invitation to Silvermoon. I would like to inquire whether there could be a place for the nightborne in your Horde.', 143480, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance feels too walled off... too cloistered. My people will never endure such stagnation again.', 143479, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sin\'dorei are also scorned by Tyrande and her prideful lot. Yet for many ages her people slept in dens or hid in trees while my people fought to save this world.', 143478, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would seem \"Elune\'s wisdom\" guided her away from the bond we once shared. So be it.', 143477, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei will fight to see the Legion defeated and the Nightwell destroyed. Beyond that... we shall see where Elune\'s wisdom guides us.', 143476, 0, 0, 661, 68, 0, 0, 94767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not intend to be slaves to the Nightwell. We seek to drive the Legion from Suramar and put an end to Elisande\'s oppression.', 143475, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 94986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arcanist Thalyssra. I remember where your order stood in the War of the Ancients. How do we know you won\'t betray us and become the next Elisande... the next Azshara?', 143474, 0, 0, 25, 68, 0, 0, 94766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought our kin from Kalimdor would make obvious allies. But their arrogance and mistrust soon proved otherwise.', 143473, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must admit, when I first learned of the Horde, I was skeptical that we would share common ground.', 143472, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde was proud to fight by your side against the Burning Legion, my lady.', 143471, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For that, we owe you both a great debt. You proved instrumental to our cause.', 143470, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see your city free, First Arcanist.', 143469, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, Lady Liadrin, $p. Welcome back to Suramar. I am pleased to receive you under more pleasant circumstances.', 143468, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disappointing, but not surprising... De loa have not blessed you, child. You will not join us on de Terrace of the Chosen.', 143467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well you\'ve certainly traveled far to visit me, young one.$b$bI\'ve several novels on the history of crabs, if that\'s something that piques your interest?', '', 143466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resilient and proud, you can outlast your enemies and weather any storm. Your strength will be needed to defend our city.', 143465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is... most unusual. Your strength will be needed in de times ahead.', 143464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Selfish and honorless... You would do well to find another way, little one.', 143463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting... Stealthy and clever, you strike from de shadows. Surprise will be your greatest weapon.', 143462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see. You are swift and observant, careful in your strikes. Your patience will be rewarded.', 143461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reach deep within you, child. Show me how you will hunt your prey. With wisdom, strength, or something else entirely?', 143460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De pack calls strongly to you. Embrace de ties of kinship, and hunt with your brothers and sisters.', 143459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you smell that? I smell cabbage.$b$b<Kronah leans in and sniffs you.>$b$bNot you, but something around here. $b$bSay, how\'s your penmanship? Would you like a lesson? I\'m a master scribe if you can believe it.', '', 143458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re under attack!', 'We\'re under attack!', 143457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your steel, brothers and sisters!', 'Ready your steel, brothers and sisters!', 143456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are enemies among us!', 'There are enemies among us!', 143455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder! To arms!', 'Intruder! To arms!', 143454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be happy to.', '', 143452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move it!', '', 143451, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got orders to fill!', '', 143450, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please do not distract de child.\n\nI\'m testing dese children for any signs of connection with de loa. Those blessed by a loa will receive full priest training and all of de honor and privilege dat accompanies it.\n\nThose who are not blessed will be given an opportunity to prove dey will grow into strong warriors someday.\n\nThose who fail both tests are of no use to us. Dey\'ll probably end up thieving in de docks or begging in de Zocalo.', 143449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can do that.', '', 143448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okie dokie.', '', 143447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work, work.', '', 143446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need more wood!', '', 143445, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can rest when you\'re dead. Until then, we\'ve got orders to fill!', '', 143444, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return to the village as quickly as I can, before it all disappears. Perhaps they will not have forgotten me.', '', 143443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not think I can live as I did before. As a mindless ape. Not after what I have seen and felt, however briefly.', '', 143442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da\'ka was right. Already I can feel my mind fading back into its primitive state.', '', 143441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler. Interested in some scrolls today?$b$bOr maybe some exotic inks made from the rarest of herbs?', '', 143440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O\'course goblins have those tiny brains, so ye\'ll probably have to bash a few hundred more afore the lesson sinks in.', '', 143439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine job teaching these goblins what happens when ye meddle with the Dark Iron dwarves!', '', 143438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break their machines! Destroy their tools! Crush every tiny green gobber that gets in yer way!', '', 143437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These goblins are corrupting Azerite on a massive scale! We cannae let this stand!', '', 143436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironfoe is finally within our grasp. Make sure ye teach these goblins what happens when ye steal from the Dark Iron!', '', 143435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who here? Who stop the mists? King Da\'ka kill you!', '', 143434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 143433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
