('Lil\' Tika wiggles playfully.', '', 143431, 0, 0, 399, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who be a good little face munching raptor baby? You are! You are!', 143430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it be so good to see you little one! $n... Thank you.', 143429, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is dat Tika?!?!', 143428, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lil\' Tika trills happily.', '', 143427, 0, 0, 399, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be... others...', 143426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sun sets on the Zandalari empire. The Faithless will claim what is left!', 143425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll have you drawn and quartered for that!', 143424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
