('', 'You will kneel before your queen, peasant!', 143422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She will... take you... too...', 143421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'House Stormsong will rule this land!', 143420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to both of you for your help! $n, be ready to head to Gloomtail\'s cave to help Ben\'jin when this works.', 143419, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could have made a device to read the brain scans of the brutosaurs and perform analysis. Just sayin\'.', 143418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Science is the only answer, Jangalar. I don\'t mean to denigrate your powers but mumbo jumbo is not a replacement for aggressive, logical alchemy.', 143417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
