('Upgrading auxiliary systems. Please stand by...', '', 143335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you repair equipment?', 'Can you repair equipment?', 143334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De village be gone, but they gonna have to pry my forge from my cold, dead hands.', '', 143333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For da Horde!', 143332, 14, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taz\'dingo!', 143331, 14, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who you want me kill?', 143330, 14, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad the innocent are safe, but much remains to be done.', '', 143329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have only heard stories of Stormwind before now. I will explore its streets and the wonders it holds. May the shadows guide you, $n.', 143328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with you, $n. I plan to  seek the Legion upon Azeroth to continue our eternal battle.', '', 143327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not gonna, of course... but I thought about it. For almost a whole second!', '', 143326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll admit, watchin\' you work almost makes me consider cuttin\' you in for a share of the profits.', '', 143325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great job! Now for the real heroics to begin... Signin\' all these forms to take ownership of the mine. All nice and official-like.', '', 143324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seriously though, better destroy \'em before they start hurtin\' my profits.', '', 143323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Objective cleared. Moving to forward position. Deliver completion to new location.', '', 143322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Look at those chumps gettin\' crushed. Those elementals are really layin\' on the hurt.', '', 143321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lil\' Tika growls in a tiny, menacing fashion.', '', 143320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lil\' Tika chirps in distress!', '', 143319, 0, 0, 602, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world bleeds and you tear at its wounds?! Die!', '', 143318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanna see explosions, mayhem, and off-the-charts violence! You know... the stuff you do best.', '', 143317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach these Venture Company upstarts that there\'s nothin\' they got that I can\'t take.', '', 143316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one problem... it don\'t belong to me! That\'s where you come in.', '', 143315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is where all the black market Azerite has been comin\' from, eh? Not a bad operation.', '', 143314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not sure what \"worgsbane\" is, but... Wait, what\'s this?', 143313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were too good for this world, brother. I will make sure you receive a proper burial.', '', 143312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love de smell of mojo in de morning!', '', 143311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rokhan said you have experience dealing with dis sort of thing. Do what you can. I will be here, waiting for the Gob Squad.', 143310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we need all de allies we can get. Help this keeper--as quickly as you can.', 143308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid required. Repair Hezrel. Reach interior of nearby structure. Contain all corruption within Nazmir.', '', 143307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Massive corruption detected within Nazmir. Must enact containment.', '', 143306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve fought many battles... but never have I seen anything like dis monster... before...', '', 143305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never take me alive!', '', 143304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, Vol\'dun has to be safer than dis place!', '', 143303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Don\'t! De raptors... dey will eat me!', '', 143302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Thank you, Zaluto. Maybe in another life, we could have been brothers.', '', 143301, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use de blood fetish on Zulajin to absorb his power and send him back to de grave!', '', 143300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No worries, mon! I will take care of de captain here while you cleanse de ruins!', '', 143299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay! Now put on de camoflauge and grab de key!', '', 143298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will need a disguise to get past Zulajin. Hurry back when you have de supplies!', '', 143297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a criminal, but I am not evil. I will not leave you here to die!', '', 143296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, if I die... I die with my honor intact...', '', 143295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, here! A toast to the brave <hic> champion who will save us all!', '', 143294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go to Orgrimmar. Join with our allies and forge a new future together.', 143293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you travel the roads of Azeroth, tell those you meet of the nightborne\'s proud history... and show them that we live in seclusion no longer.', 143292, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we know about the nightborne?', 'What do we know about the nightborne?', 143291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I am glad you are here. We must convince the warchief to pursue an allegiance with the nightborne.', 143290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we know about the Highmountain tauren?', 'What do we know about the Highmountain tauren?', 143289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Now it is our turn to demonstrate the strength and honor we bring to the Horde.', 143288, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We share much with the Highmountain tauren. It is my belief that they would make ideal allies in the time to come.', '', 143287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about Tsunga. We will take care of him. Even if he does not remember his own name anymore.', 143286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boy, he was a big one, wasn\'t he? Nice work, friend!', 143285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stars guide you, $p. I have heard intriguing talk of the Hillsbrad Foothills. I will likely journey there.', 143284, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sure about dis, Tsunga? You know what you will lose if dis champion closes off de mists?', 143283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prepare the ritual to release these souls. Meet me by the shoreline just north of here.', '', 143282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am fully aware of the consequences. However, I believe that while some things are hard to lose, they are right to lose.', '', 143281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take another path into the Gorge and meet you there.', '', 143280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not break rank! Reinforcements are on the way. We can\'t let the naga destroy the levee!', '', 143279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let your heart know hatred no longer.', '', 143278, 0, 54404, 0, 64, 0, 108761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the sin\'dorei--the blood elves--showed us respect and understanding. Their kinship proved there were others in Azeroth who share our values.', 143277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When our city faced its darkest hour, the heroes of Azeroth fought with us to drive out the Legion. Some did so reluctantly.', 143276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I present you with the traditional garb of Suramar. Wear it as a reminder of our ancient past... and the new future we will forge alongside our allies.', 143275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t have to tell me twice!', '', 143274, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 109736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have shown the Horde--and all the people of Azeroth--that the nightborne possess the will and the courage to defend our world.', 143273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your way to the shoreline on the other side of the yard. Find a young Proudmoore cadet--Taelia. Go!', '', 143272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to Suramar so that we may thank you for helping our people reclaim a place in this world.', 143271, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are among the first shal\'dorei to venture forth and explore the wilds of Azeroth. But now it is time to come home.', 143270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those laborers... they\'re being held by tidesage magic! We must help them.', '', 143269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the tides not everyone has lost their damn mind. Half the house has gone mad!', '', 143268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could use a bit less flannel.', 'I could use a bit less flannel.', 143267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll scout ahead. Meet you at the shoreline!', 143266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking good, $n.', '', 143265, 1, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got work to do.', '', 143264, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could use a bit more flannel.', 'I could use a bit more flannel.', 143263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To arms!', 143262, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the king!', 143261, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have at thee!', 143260, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the death!', 143259, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Stormwind!', 143258, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 143257, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No retreat!', 143256, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me at them!', 143255, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What corruption do you meant? $n, perhaps dis thing sees de blood trolls as \"corruption\".', 143254, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 106819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, do you know what dis thing is? Would it be willing to help us?', 143253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What kind of voodoo is dis?! Perhaps it can help us stop de blood trolls and G\'huun...', 143252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me at them!', '', 143251, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No retreat!', '', 143250, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 143249, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Stormwind!', '', 143248, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the death!', '', 143247, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have at thee!', '', 143246, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the king!', '', 143245, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms!', '', 143244, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, the detector\'s going barmy. There\'s got to be a major Azerite explosion somewhere on the island.', '', 143243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must discover the source of this defilement.', '', 143242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let this armor remind you of all you have achieved, $p. Accept it with my thanks.', 143241, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely.', '', 143240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do... do you believe that the sea creatures have been affected, too?', '', 143239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give you another \"ill omen\". The bay is full of the Outriggers\' prey.', '', 143238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tsunga peers at the cave entrance, worried.', '', 143237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many doubted that the ren\'dorei could harness the power of the void without falling prey to its influence. You have proven them wrong.', 143236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water\'s screams grow louder as we go out into the bay. I can feel the torment of the tides. These are ill omens, indeed.', '', 143235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have become a formidable weapon of the Alliance, $p. Return to the void rift so that we may honor your accomplishment.', 143234, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see this done.', '', 143233, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get to work on the training. You go see Tagart, he\'s got more for you.', '', 143230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan Keeper Hezrel rebooted. Protocol: contain rampant corruption within Nazmir. Task impossible due to damaged systems.', '', 143229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throughout your journeys across Azeroth, you have achieved mastery over the forces that constantly seek to control you.', 143228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite a catch, my friend. Let\'s see how he flies. Hyah!', '', 143227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho, ho! Look at what the house cat dragged in! Unbelievable!', '', 143226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let King Rastakhan know dat when de towers are lit, we have retaken our ships. Dat will be de signal to my crew dat dey can come home!', '', 143224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The required subject isn\'t clear in this picture, Wulferd won\'t want this.', 'The required subject isn\'t clear in this picture, Wulferd won\'t want this.', 143223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, lend me your aid!', '', 143222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My workers... I failed them.', '', 143221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! The commander\'s been hit!', 143220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! I\'m being attacked!', '', 143219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that!', '', 143218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This guy really ruffles m\' feathers!', '', 143217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doh! My insurance premiums!', '', 143216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I payin\' you fools for?! Get out here and fix this!', '', 143215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste some high-caliber carnage!', '', 143214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get a load of 300 rounds per minute!', '', 143213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right where you belong--under my heel!', '', 143212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat dirt!', '', 143211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do some scouting and meet you further down the path!', 143210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103328, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me alive!', '', 143209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda... sprung... for the... ejector seat package...', '', 143208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll bill your next of kin for the spent ammunition.', '', 143207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the lessons I have taught you to maintain control. Become a weapon for the Alliance... even as you skirt the edge of darkness.', 143206, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be those who doubt you. Who question your resolve, your ability to harness powers that have caused the downfall of weaker wills.', '', 143205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we see alternatives. Many roads--many possibilities--that are open to us.', 143204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some will tell you that the Light is the only path. The one weapon that can stop the enemies of Azeroth.', 143203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you bums realize how much property damage you\'ve done!?', '', 143202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome ta the Roughnecks!', '', 143201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE ME', '', 143200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush!', '', 143199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash!', '', 143198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pulverize!', '', 143197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity I was not able to teach him de most important lesson of all.', '', 143196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let ol\' Rastakhan know I will return in my own time. Oh, and thanks for all your help.', '', 143195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get my claws on Yazma and Zul, I am going to drop them on a rock!', '', 143193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our prey is near. The blood of Zul, Yazma, and their heretics will soon be spilled. It shall be a great hunt.', '', 143192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory for Pa\'ku!', 'Glory for Pa\'ku!', 143191, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ship will be ours!', 'De ship will be ours!', 143190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taz\'okun!', 'Taz\'okun!', 143189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s only a flesh wound. I think I\'ll be alright..', '', 143188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re goin\' up in flames!', 143185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn! Yes! Burn!', 143184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lookin\' for Azerite? Have a face full!', 143183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
