('<Lieutenant Sterntide nods his head slightly in acknowledgement of your approach.>', '', 143099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine specimen, isn\'t he? The House Waycrest has long been known as experts in the arts of falconry.\n\nUnfortunately, most of our best birds have fallen under the curse of the coven. Winston here is one of only a handful of Waycrest falcons not under their spell.\n\nIt is truly a sad state of affairs.', '', 143098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But this... They\'ve glorified the slaughter! The Kul Tirans don\'t even have weapons!', 143097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 103285, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something wicked stirs in the woods, mainlander. At night, the ancient Drust monument at its heart glows with unholy power.\n\nIf I were you, I would give that place a wide berth in your travels.', '', 143096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
