('Now set de urn near de archway.', '', 143031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your weapons ready outside of the embassy, $p. These Zandalari lack the strength and will necessary to maintain control. They need a strong warchief like ours.\n\nNow, what can I do for you?', 'Keep your weapons ready outside of the embassy, $p. These Zandalari lack the strength and will necessary to maintain control. They need a strong warchief like ours.\n\nNow, what can I do for you?', 143030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You see any Alliance skulking about, you let me know. I\'ll take care of them.\n\nIn the meantime, what are you looking for?', 'You see any Alliance skulking about, you let me know. I\'ll take care of them.\n\nIn the meantime, what are you looking for?', 143029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One thing I\'ll say about the Zandalari, they know how to build embassies. And this city is huge!\n\nAre you lost?', 'One thing I\'ll say about the Zandalari, they know how to build embassies. And this city is huge!\n\nAre you lost?', 143028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m busy. Make this quick.', 'I\'m busy. Make this quick.', 143027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need, $pr?', 'What do you need, $pr?', 143026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Warchief! Looking for something?', 'Glory to the Warchief! Looking for something?', 143025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This massive embassy proves that the Zandalari respect our warchief\'s strength. They should fear it also.\n\nNow, what do you want?', 'This massive embassy proves that the Zandalari respect our warchief\'s strength. They should fear it also.\n\nNow, what do you want?', 143024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This humidity is making my bones sweat. What can I do for you?', 'This humidity is making my bones sweat. What can I do for you?', 143023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re movin\' up, big guy. Some day this will all be ours.', '', 143022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we payin\' ya for? Slacking?', '', 143021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps death is the true legacy of the Windrunners.', 143020, 0, 0, 604, 64, 0, 0, 94535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. Sometimes I feel that I have already died twice. Once when we were presumed lost on Draenor, and again when gripped by the shadow of the fallen naaru.', 143019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is unsettling to look upon these memorials to our passing.', '', 143018, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time, Turalyon. I must see my homeland again with my own eyes... and hear from Sylvanas how she could ever wear the mantle of warchief.', 143017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each of you has a path to follow. If the Light wills that those paths intersect, they will. There\'s no need to force the hand of fate.', '', 143016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to go. You don\'t have to see her.', '', 143015, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like no other, my love.', 143014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re anxious. You hide it well... but I know you.', '', 143013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know there\'s much ta face in the days ahead. But no matter what comes... never forget our duty ta Azeroth!', '', 143012, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The energy coursin\' through that weapon o\' yers... I ain\'t seen nothin\' like it! But remember, all power comes with a price.', '', 143011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! Sargeras\' sword has gone dormant. Now, Azeroth\'s not yet healed... but your actions bought us precious time.', '', 143010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, champions! For Azeroth!', '', 143009, 0, 0, 603, 70, 0, 94525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise them up as one.... draw out the corruption from the Dark Titan\'s blade!', '', 143008, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only vessels capable o\' containin\' that kind o\' power... are the mighty weapons you wield.', '', 143007, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sword of Sargeras is poisonin\' the very lifeblood of the world.', '', 143006, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come ta Silithus... while we still have a world left ta fight for!', '', 143005, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 94521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know tensions are risin\'... but I\'m callin\' on ye ta stand together once more.', '', 143004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, ye unified yer orders and fought together ta drive the Legion from Azeroth.', '', 143003, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm\'s gatherin\', $p. If we don\'t find a way ta heal Azeroth... nothin\' else is gonna matter.', '', 143002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how ta fix this. Not sure anyone does. But we\'ve gotta keep tryin\'.', '', 143001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since returnin\' from Argus, the cries o\' Azeroth have been... overwhelmin\'. Such pain...', '', 143000, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 94516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion... \'tis good ta see a familiar face in these dark times.', '', 142999, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We still be waitin\' on dem, Princess. But we did get a lead about da loa, Krag\'wa.', '', 142998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and dat is de fate of Torga. What news from de Horde\'s reinforcements?', 142997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We almost done with dis, $n. Just gonna keep goin\' a little further.', '', 142996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t believe those monsters gutted Torga...', '', 142995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meh, Torga\'s dead and now I\'ve got nothing to tell the others when I get back.', '', 142994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s Kisha? I thought she\'d be here to give directions...', '', 142993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, I\'ll go to Gloom Hollow and see how crazy this\'ll get.', '', 142992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh... well, I guess fighting a horde of blood trolls would be an interesting story. Fine, I\'ll go to Gloom Hollow.', '', 142991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all did... WHAT? I\'m not missing this story, I\'ll head to Gloom Hollow.', '', 142990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Kisha. Let\'s head to Gloom Hollow and gather any of our kin we meet along the way. $n here will pick up anyone we missed.', '', 142989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will head to Gloom Hollow while you deal with de tortollans along de way.', 142988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, man those cannons!', '', 142987, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $p. As for me, I am going to test my skill in Ashenvale. For the Horde!', '', 142986, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Breath of Pa\'ku and Rezan\'s Claw made it around de world and back. Help dem make it de rest of de way home.', '', 142985, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When de ships returned, a darkness was with dem. Dere came a bad feelin\', deep in my belly.', '', 142984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Breath of Pa\'ku was my home for many years. My heart, like dis harbor, was empty when she left.', '', 142983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 479, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Anji the Thundering\'s roar fills you with vigor.', '', 142982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy! Get in de boat! De Captain says de Breath of Pa\'ku is in trouble!', '', 142981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, we\'re here to help. The levee won\'t break today!', 142980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s make our way to the levee. Commander Reed doesn\'t like to wait!', 142979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thou art unfit for this place!', '', 142977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a fool and coward!', '', 142976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I scorn you, scurvy intruder!', '', 142975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get you gone, you knave!', '', 142974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will deal you a mighty thumping!', '', 142973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will beat you into clamorous whining!', '', 142972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By this hand, I will supplant your teeth!', '', 142971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention!', '', 142970, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 97764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the authority of House Waycrest, I name you inquisitors of the Order of Embers!', 142969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today you become the beacon of hope against the endless foe.', 142968, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today you become the shining blade that cuts through the wicked.', 142967, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brothers and Sisters, today you become the searing fire that burns away the darkness.', 142966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, here we are.', 142965, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 97758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There were words of induction somewhere in the tome. Let me see...', 142964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for relinquishing your men, marshal. Now we\'re starting to look like a proper Order!', 142963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been waiting for an audience for days now. You would think de Throne would be more interested in what de goblins are doing in these lands.', '', 142962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have many capable troops stationed here, milady. They will make fine recruits for your Order of Embers.', '', 142961, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal, we may have found weapons to use against the coven. We will need able-bodied soldiers to wield them.', 142960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never betray de loa or de city!', '', 142959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I worship Pa\'ku. Blood magic is forbidden!', '', 142958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am telling you de truth. I don\'t know anything about blood relics!', '', 142957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m innocent! Please, have mercy.', '', 142956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never smuggle blood relics. Blood magic is evil!', '', 142955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen any blood relics!', '', 142954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what you\'re talking about!', '', 142953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t do anything wrong!', '', 142952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me stab you again...', '', 142951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who did you sell de blood relics to?', '', 142950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disgust me, traitor.', '', 142949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make you suffer, Pro\'ditor. We will make an example out of you.', '', 142948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you confess, I promise to kill you quickly.', '', 142947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are de worst kind of scum, Pro\'ditor. Blood magic is killing our people!', '', 142946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know you have been smuggling blood relics into dis city.', '', 142945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us how you acquired de blood relics, Pro\'ditor!', '', 142944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis scum has been smuggling blood relics into our city.\n\nHe will confess, and den we will make an example of him.', '', 142943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t do anything wrong! Tell dem!', '', 142942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Leave)', '(Leave)', 142941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The bloody, tattered remains of the escaped criminal Teshyambi are hardly recognizable. It appears to be the work of nearby raptors.>', '<The bloody, tattered remains of the escaped criminal Teshyambi are hardly recognizable. It appears to be the work of nearby raptors.>', 142940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know who you are, Mojoba. Proceed to Vol\'dun and live out your exile in peace.', 'I know who you are, Mojoba. Proceed to Vol\'dun and live out your exile in peace.', 142939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? What do you want, eh?', '', 142938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, but you\'ve been exiled to Vol\'dun for your crimes.', 'I\'m sorry, but you\'ve been exiled to Vol\'dun for your crimes.', 142937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh! I\'m hiding from de raptors and Zulajin. I have to make my way back to Zuldazar.', '', 142936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do good work... for an escaped fugitive.', 142935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that we have the prison under our control and the keys in our possession, we can begin securing the Azerite and releasing the hostages.', 142934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems Lady Ashvane will have an opening for a new overseer after all.', 142933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check your fire! I\'m looking at you, flame caster. If any of these Azerite munitions explode, we\'ll all be dust!', '', 142932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ready, men! They\'re coming!', '', 142931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll finish securing the lower levels while you make your way to the Overseer.', 142930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. Looks like you have things under control.', 142929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we get our claws on the Overseer\'s hostages, we\'ll be up to our snouts in ransom money!', '', 142928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, boys! Rip open those doors!', '', 142927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d better be right, or your replacement\'s first duty will be to watch you drown with the rest of this scum.', 142926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, Lady Ashvane. I am confident my men will restore order soon.', '', 142925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Korgus! Explain to me why you haven\'t flooded the lower levels and drowned these squabbling rats!?', 142924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oof! You had to crawl through this stuff to escape? Try to stay downwind from me!', 142923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That creature must be why the Overseer didn\'t have many patrols on this side of the island. Good job defeating it.', 142922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll secure the perimeter guards while you make your way to the sewer grate. It should still provide a way into the prison.', 142921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'According to our intelligence, the keys that access the Azerite caches and the hostage wing are kept by the Overseer... around his neck.', 142920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay low! They haven\'t spotted us yet.', 142919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I have to?', '', 142918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want?', '', 142917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to work.', '', 142916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Barracks has been destroyed!', '', 142915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll need reinforcements to win this war.', '', 142914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work!', '', 142913, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This building won\'t build itself!', '', 142912, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swing that hammer!', '', 142911, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria tenses defiantly.', 142910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life!', 'You saved my life!', 142909, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be able to make my way to safety. Thank you.', 'I should be able to make my way to safety. Thank you.', 142908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their attacks are relentless. Thank you for your help.', 'Their attacks are relentless. Thank you for your help.', 142907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not forget your bravery.', 'I will not forget your bravery.', 142906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die out here!', 'I thought I was going to die out here!', 142905, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our village could use more heroes like you!', 'Our village could use more heroes like you!', 142904, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge those of us who could not be saved.', 'Avenge those of us who could not be saved.', 142903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These naga are monsters!', 'These naga are monsters!', 142902, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This shiv is going right through your ribcage!', '', 142901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders are coming through the sewers!', '', 142900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stone sings a silent and powerful song. There is only one that can hear its melody, and we should hope she never finds her way to these shores.', '', 142898, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen all I need to see. This stone is evil, and must be destroyed.', '', 142897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I doubt it will surrender it willingly, so you\'ll have to wrench that weapon from its cold dead hand.', '', 142894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve caught sight of our next quarry to the south. You\'d best move quickly.', '', 142893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a pity that destroying that vessel will allow the Kul Tirans to regroup.', '', 142892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady will surely appreciate your service.', '', 142891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be my pleasure, Regent Lord. I will meet you in Silvermoon, champion.', 142890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Lady Liadrin, please return to Orgrimmar and tell the warchief the good news.', '', 142889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On behalf of the nightborne, I accept your proposal. From this day forth, Suramar fights for the Horde.', 142888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde offers that to you, First Arcanist. Join us. The gates of Silvermoon stand open to you.', '', 142887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar will always be our home. But some among my people wish to venture out into the world, to claim our place in Azeroth once again. To do that, we need allies.', 142886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We gain strength from our allies... but we have not lost who we are.', 142885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On the contrary. This conflict has demonstrated your dedication to your people. I can see that the Horde has allowed you to uphold your traditions--something that is very important to us.', 142884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regret you had to witness that exchange, Thalyssra. This is not how I planned your visit to unfold.', '', 142883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you command, Regent Lord. For now.', 142882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! You will leave at once, Alleria. Accident or no, your presence poses a danger to Quel\'Thalas. Go back to Stormwind. Silvermoon is no longer your home.', '', 142881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not be taken prisoner in my own homeland.', 142880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Seize this saboteur.', '', 142879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunwell is secure. Your aid was invaluable, Thalyssra. And yours, champion.', '', 142878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only delay the inevitable! I will yet have my prize.', '', 142877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now! Focus your power with mine!', 142876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The door opens. Yes... this should suit our needs.', '', 142875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell us what to do, and we will lend our strength.', 142874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can close the rift--but I will need help.', 142873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something seeks to open a rift into the chamber. If it comes through, we may lose the Sunwell.', '', 142872, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Start casting the spell, Rikal.', 'Start casting the spell, Rikal.', 142871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sooner or later the tides will change. They always do.', '', 142870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Grip is Failing!', '', 142869, 0, 54225, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
