('', 'I offer rare goods from distant realms.', 142728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you seek?', 142727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though, while we\'re here, might as well see what other treasures we can find.', '', 142726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh sure, I get physically transformed by a cosmic force known to induce madness and suddenly I\'m considered \"suspicious\". Talk about profiling...', 142725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, our primary objective is seizing Lady Ashvane\'s Azerite weapons.', '', 142724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If a portal leading into endless nothingness were to open under your feet and consume you in my presence, rest assured it would be entirely coincidental. Accidents do happen, after all.', 142723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, looks as if Boralus is already in its death throes.', '', 142722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take my head today!', 'You will not take my head today!', 142721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97368, 97369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lives are forfeit!', 'Your lives are forfeit!', 142720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97366, 97367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time to waste! Open a portal to the keep and we will report to the warchief!', '', 142719, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 106285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More spies! We have them cornered!', '', 142718, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 106282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What now?', 'What now?', 142717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rezan has too much of a head start. We will not be able to reach him before he reaches Zul.', '', 142716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De lesser tribes are petty, prone to bickering. Dey need Zandalari discipline and authority.\n\nOur golems keep de speakers subdued most of de time. And when a fight does break out, I get to publicly punish de instigators.\n\nThose are my favorite days.', 142715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zanchul is currently off-limits to civilians, $c.', 142714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard of your tremendous skill in battle.\n\nIt would be an honor for you to speak to our trainees and offer some advice.', '', 142713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your hands in your pockets and your coins in mine, and we\'ll have no problems.', 142712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see everything dat happens in de Zocalo, $pr. Everything.', '', 142711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this cannon out of here.', 'Let\'s get this cannon out of here.', 142710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse da Jambani! Curse dem all!', '', 142709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
