('I am chosen to survive!', 'I am chosen to survive!', 142701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98834, 98835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not live long enough to see Zuldazar fall!', 'You will not live long enough to see Zuldazar fall!', 142700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98830, 98831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You feel the ground rumbling beneath your feet. Watch out!', 'You feel the ground rumbling beneath your feet. Watch out!', 142699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The only thing that will be finished here... is you.', 142697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The transformation... incomplete... must... be... finished...', '', 142696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our destiny is our own, Durzaan! You will not define our future!', 142692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I offer freedom. I offer strength. Cast off your mortal shackles.', '', 142691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish loyalist, die!', 'Foolish loyalist, die!', 142690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Durzaan is using those forges to draw in power. We must break his hold on Umbric\'s people.', 142689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That vortex up ahead pulses with power. Let us investigate, $p.', 142688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark forces surge through these ashen stones. No wonder the ethereals were drawn here.', 142686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maka\'fon feels unsettled. Dis land does not feel like home for some reason. She is not in de mood for love.', 142683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like there are still artillery pieces in the wreckage!', 142682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashvane\'s beast is destroying our ships!', 142681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
