('My people were reshaped by the void. Stripped of the limitations of flesh. We offer you the same gift.', '', 142672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll rally the militia and secure the castle. Good hunting.', 142671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Your death is regrettable... but necessary.', '', 142670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop them, and we may have a chance at driving them from Boralus.', 142669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 113766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
