('Hello, Vigilant Quoram. We met before on Argus.', 'Hello, Vigilant Quoram. We met before on Argus.', 142629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppse you are wondering what I am doing here.$b$bSuffice it to say that I have been given a new prime directive. Apparently standing watch over the Conservatory was not an efficient use of my time.$b$b<Sigh> Tenure no longer means what it once did.$b$bDo you require something? As you can see, I am quite busy.', '', 142628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It sounds like not all of de Zanchuli Council are happy you are here. Dis is going to be interesting.', 142627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You presume to speak with King Rastakhan? Get in line. There are only four hundred and thirty two citizens ahead of you.', '', 142626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, a lowly $c. Know dat I am Natal\'hakata. THE Natal\'hakata.\n\nI am de Voice of the King, deliverer of de royal will, keeper of de grand schedule, and wall against de peasantry dat constantly tries to interfere with my lord\'s patience.\n\nMy time is precious, so speak quickly.', '', 142625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me getting outta here! Gotta warn the boss!', '', 142624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repairing', 'Repairing', 142623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My bird.... That beast got my bird!', 'My bird.... That beast got my bird!', 142622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_HOLY_PROCLAIMCHAMPION:20|tMove to the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:255199|h[Avatar of Aggramar]|h|rto avoid being killed by |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SHADOWFURY:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Soulbomb Detonation]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_HOLY_PROCLAIMCHAMPION:20|tMove to the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:255199|h[Avatar of Aggramar]|h|rto avoid being killed by |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SHADOWFURY:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Soulbomb Detonation]|h|r!', 142621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, hopefully we can get more medical supplies soon.', 'Hang in there, hopefully we can get more medical supplies soon.', 142620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the coven wields similar magic, they may be vulnerable to silver as well!', 142618, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tome mentions that the Inquisitors of old would use weapons of silver to disrupt the magic of the Drust.', 142617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, I need you to find my sewing kit. It should be somewhere in my bag over there!', 142616, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alchemical fire? Oh, if only Master Ashton were here. He would have a field day!', 142614, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay... rowan wood? No... that doesn\'t grow around here...', 142613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Much better! Could you do me a favor and jot this down? My notebook is here somewhere...', 142612, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me see if there is something here we can try...', 142611, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If my theory is correct, then whatever they used could also disrupt the coven\'s magic.', 142610, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, it says here that the Order used special weapons against the Drust to counter their dark magic.', 142609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I had your faith, Lucy, but I think it will take more than ancient legends to eliminate this threat.', '', 142608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t understand, Marshal. The knowledge we\'ve unearthed could be the key to saving my father from the coven!', 142607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you\'re trying to help, but you must stop these adventures of yours. It\'s dangerous out there.', '', 142606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Umbric risks much. He follows in the footsteps of treachery. Let us hope this obsession has not led to his downfall.', 142605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Andilien Estate... yes, I remember it. Come, $p.', 142604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
