('', '\"Remember the Sunwell\"? Please. I am so over it.', 142600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are ready to proceed. Stay on your guard, $p. We do not know what we might find inside.', 142599, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
