INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Look out!', '', 141953, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 93835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', '', 141952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way!', '', 141951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wear these vestments with pride, $p. The Army of the Light will always be honored to count you in its ranks.', 141950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throughout your journeys, you have been a beacon of Light in the darkness. You have shown the Alliance what it means to be Lightforged.', 141949, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, meet with me at the Vindicaar. It is time that we reward your diligence.', 141948, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your service to the Alliance has been most impressive, $p. I could not have done better myself. Well, I could... but not by much.', 141947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!', '', 141946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 141945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my honor to present you with the armor of our people. No matter where your journey takes you, it will serve as a reminder of where you came from.', 141944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the darkest times, you have been strong, brave, unyielding. Thanks to you, $p, the Horde knows what it means to be Highmountain.', 141943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna hook ya!', '', 141942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now Thunder Totem calls you home. It is time we thank you for all that you have done for us.', 141941, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your sojourn through Azeroth has been long, $p. And through it all, you have brought honor to Highmountain.', 141940, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come here!', '', 141939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re next!', '', 141938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t run!', '', 141937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll feast on your gore!', '', 141936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Argus Filter!', 'S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Argus Filter!', 141935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Frostmourne Filter!', 'S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Frostmourne Filter!', 141934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Sha Filter!', 'S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Sha Filter!', 141933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Firelands Filter!', 'S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Firelands Filter!', 141932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Twilight Filter!', 'S.E.L.F.I.E. Camera captures Twilight Filter!', 141931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let me go to waste...', '', 141930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many juicy morsels.', '', 141929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More chum for the waters!', '', 141928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Argus_WastingPlague:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:248396|h[Soulblight]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Argus_WastingPlague:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:248396|h[Soulblight]|h|r!', 141927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what I call a prime cut!', '', 141926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll chop you lot to bits!', '', 141925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The fisherman stares obsessively at the water, mumbling to himself. His lips are cracked, his hands bleeding, and his body is covered with cuts and scratches - likely from the ravenous birds swarming the coastline.\n\nIt looks like he hasn\'t moved from this spot in days. \n\nHe is clearly under the coven\'s spell, but unlike others you\'ve seen, he\'s able to move and speak, but he doesn\'t address you when you approach.>', '', 141924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lambs to the slaughter.', '', 141923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay true to who you are. And should you ever miss your home, know that Highmountain is here for you. Always.', 141922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go to Orgrimmar. Meet our new allies and learn what it is they care about... what they fight for.', 141921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today you begin a new journey, $p. You will be our voice in the lands beyond the mountain.', 141920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 93863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time we changed that.', 141919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For many ages, our people have called the Broken Isles home. We know little about the Azeroth that exists beyond our shores.', 141918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard there are spies! What do I do?', 'I heard there are spies! What do I do?', 141917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And always walk in the Light, $p.', 141916, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your duty begins in Stormwind. Explore this world of Azeroth. Get to know the people and places we have sworn to defend.', 141915, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we must not grow complacent. One war ends, the next begins. Such is the life of a soldier.', 141914, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, for the first time in ages, we can walk beneath a sky not befouled by the Legion\'s madness... and feel the earth under our hooves again.', 141913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For thousands of years, the Lightforged fought demons in the Twisting Nether. The Xenedar was the only home we knew.', 141912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this is excellent timing, champion. You can see firsthand what it means for a soldier to become Lightforged. Proceed, Fareeya.', '', 141911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know how fond I am of your speeches, but can it wait? We were just about to send these initiates to undertake the trials.', 141910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. He is eager to have the Army of the Light fighting on the side of the Alliance. Assemble our forces, captain, and I will make the announcement.', '', 141909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not expect you back so soon, High Exarch. I assume your meeting with the king went well?', 141908, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 93714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Addington! By the depths...', '', 141905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to the void that spawned you!', '', 141902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunder Bluff will be free of you!', '', 141901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha! It feels good to swing my mace again!', '', 141900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will drive your shadow from Mulgore!', '', 141899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 141898, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 141897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I often wonder whether he is right.', '', 141896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both these qualities will be needed in the days to come. And thank you for your part in bringing them to our cause, $p.', '', 141895, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fought beside these draenei in the Twisting Nether for a thousand years. You will find no soldiers who are more skilled, or more loyal.', '', 141894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength of the Lightforged is most welcome in our ranks, High Exarch.', '', 141893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High King Wrynn. The Army of the Light is pledged to defend the Alliance.', '', 141892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Stormsong now forbids such rituals. He focuses instead on building new ships.', '', 141891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I search the water\'s surface, I encounter a dark storm that clouds my vision.', '', 141890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know where the fleet is?', 141889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Stormsong changed when the fleet failed to return.', '', 141888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of my brothers... and answers, I hope.', '', 141887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what will we find there, exactly?', 141886, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 111721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mariner\'s Strand is a short ride from here. Come.', '', 141885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay down!', '', 141884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None of you are coming back from Nazmir. Our poor king, losing his daughter to dis foolish crusade!', 141883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be headin\' ta Nazmir, $n. Be ready, dere be nothin\' left dere but blood trolls and dark voodoo.', '', 141882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not see my pets become food for de blood trolls! No one comes back from Nazmir.', 141881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you leave though, I believe I may have discovered how to obtain the lens the earthen was using at the shrines.', '', 141880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re down in Zandalar. Perhaps you could tag along with the 7th Legion on their next incursion.', '', 141879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I know where a few more might reside, but it\'s in rather hostile territory.', '', 141878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you were away, I\'ve been going through the journal trying to discover more shrine locations.', '', 141877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With pleasure, High Exarch.', 141876, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 93709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, it is time for us to return to Stormwind. Fareeya, spread the word. The Lightforged now fight for the Alliance.', '', 141875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos is a bit... unconventional. But he will serve our cause well.', '', 141874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos!', '', 141873, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 93741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pheta thones gamera. Light guide our path!', 141872, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this day forth, you are Lightforged.', '', 141871, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 93728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos is sorry.', '', 141870, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 93740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('sniffs Wees\'ki\' breath. Whew!', '', 141869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We jus\' about had de best night evah. Shame I can\'t remembah none of it.\n\nStill, we got dino eggs fo\' breakfast!', '', 141868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shadow hunters and I gonna scout ahead. $n, I be trustin\' ya ta guard da princess.', '', 141867, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 112706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be rememberin\' what happen last night?\n\nMe neithah.', '', 141866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
