('', 'I like ya. Never satisfied, just like me. That\'s the pursuit of perfection in ya.$B$BYa know, I\'m not really sure. This thing\'s got the best in goblin engineering all crammed into a tiny box. That\'s a recipe for untapped potential, right there.$B$BMaybe find yourself a source of great power and... see what happens? No promises.', 141836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Niko, more light! Oh, hey gorgeous! Didn\'t see ya there. What can I do for ya?', 141835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, I\'m not quite sure! It\'s infused with some powerful engineering... there\'s probably a hidden feature or two.$B$BYou might want to try taking it near some sources of great power. That always seems to kick-start things!', 141834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
