('', 'Your corpses will make excellent fuel.', 141726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait to see you melt.', 141725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, come quick! Rakera\'s memories are returning!', 141724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the one... who\'s supposed... to bleed...', '', 141723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My head... Kaja, is dat you?', 141722, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 107401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to hunt!', '', 141721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed my kid brother. Now, I\'m going to rip you to shreds.', '', 141720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little brother!', '', 141719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your feet, little brother! There\'s killing to be done.', '', 141718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, boys! Show them why this is our block!', '', 141717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been sharpening these blades just for you.', '', 141716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I was... up for... parole...', '', 141715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should\'ve stayed in your cells.', '', 141714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me into Ulduar. (Timewalking Raid)', 'Send me into Ulduar. (Timewalking Raid)', 141713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. You probably don\'t remember me--we met next week.$b$bWould you care to revisit Ulduar?', 141712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the alpha dog!', '', 141711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead meat.', '', 141710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh meat!', '', 141709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaken the gryphon but maintain your grip with |TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_DESECRATED_LEATHERGLOVE.BLP:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:269442|h[Hold Tight]|h|r', '', 141708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go.', 'I\'m ready to go.', 141707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get to work.', 141706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We seem to be in de clear now. We will need to move fast once we land at Zul\'jan ruins.', 141705, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls are relentless and unending, feeding on de power of an Old God.', 141704, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad you recognize dat, Patch. You are a step ahead of my father.', 141703, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Undead! Dey are marching toward Zuldazar. We must destroy dem!', 141701, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The charm doesn\'t seem to be working. Test it on some Curseformed Thralls first.', '', 141696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This guy don\'t seem too bright.', '', 141695, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucktail runs toward the waterfalls!', '', 141694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Fly to Southwind Ferry Dock', '[PH] Fly to Southwind Ferry Dock', 141693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffffff00+$1i Armor Scraps|r', '|cffffff00+$1i Armor Scraps|r', 141692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucktail runs away to safety!', '', 141691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'What have dese cultists done to Rakera... She doesn\'t even remember her own name.', 141690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Yes, you. Approach quietly. Do not draw attention to yourself.', '', 141689, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have dey done to you...', 141688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are all Akunda.', 141687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 107387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakera?', 141686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s here. She\'s alive! Rakera!', 141685, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakera!', 141684, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone in dis strange temple must know something.', 141683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care what deal ya think to barter from da King and his daughter. Know that ya not welcome in Zuldazar.$b$bAnd while da Princess may have a lot of authority, she not be queen yet.$b$bUntil then, da real power of Zuldazar lay with me and da Zanchuli Council.', '', 141682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is an official ceremony. Do not interrupt.', 141681, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 93707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos realizes this now.', '', 141680, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 93739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all have darkness inside us. It is no easy thing to face.', '', 141679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'T\'paartos... You confronted your fears... your failings... and have been reborn.', 141678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome back, T\'paartos.', 141677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Rakera is within dis temple, we will find her.', 141676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That you smell funny! Raauuuttt!', '', 141675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry you smell like parrot guano! Rawk!', '', 141674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rawk! Kragg Dead! Sharkbait sorry!', '', 141673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, a member of de Horde. Curious...', 141672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted the Alliance forces at Lumber Mill!', '$n has assaulted the Alliance forces at Lumber Mill!', 141671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da very wind here be alive with da power of da loa. Pa\'ku soars somewhere in dese skies, I can feel her presence.$b$bI never be settin\' foot on Zandalar before, but me old gran\'fatha\' used ta tell me stories of dis place.', 141669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The loa be powerful here. I can feel the presence of me own loa, Gonk, stalking behind every tree and bush.$b$bGonk be near. It will be a fine thing to see him in person.', 141668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fall so easily. Soldiers - reclaim our mill!', '', 141667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, little one.$b$bI am Hexlord Raal, highest of those dat barter with Pa\'ku, de loa of winds, and a member of de Zanchuli Council.$b$bI am very important, and very busy. What do you want?', '', 141666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our time wit\' da Hexlord be short. Don\'t be interruptin\'. We got much ta cover.', 141665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend!', '', 141664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the sethrak will know to fear the vulpera!', 141663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107744, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem General Jakra\'zet, de upjumped Sandfury troll who runs de military of Zuldazar, has decided to pull his guards back from de harbor.\n\nNot all trolls are happy with Princess Talanji\'s decree to allow non-trolls into de port, it would seem. \n\nShe is going to need at least one Zanchuli council member to help her for dis one. Luckily, I learned where two are.', '', 141662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vulpera are anything but weak. They will fear us!', 141660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107758, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draining', 'Draining', 141658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These sethrak will pay for what they\'ve done to our home.', 141657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107767, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, don\'t worry about me, $gmishter:mish;. -hic- I\'ll jusht be on my way now... uh... where the hell am I?$b$bLishten, let me just shober up here for a bit and by the -hic- time you\'re back, I\'ll have cleared out. I shwear.', '', 141655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, that\'sh the funny part. Lishen, he went and got himshelf -hic- caught! Shtupid shcallywag tried to kill shomeone.$b$bThey got him over in Tol Dagor with the resht of the trash -hic-. If he\'sh shtill got it on him, I\'m willin\' -hic- to bet the only way you\'ll get it from him ish by pryin\' it from -hic- hish dead handsh.$b$bShay, you won\'t try to kill me too, will ya? -hic- I ain\'t never done nothing to ya.$b$bLishten, I\'ll jusht go shomewhere else and shober -hic- up. Shailor\'s honor, haha.', '', 141654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s this person who took the jewel?', 'Where\'s this person who took the jewel?', 141653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That shon of a wench took off with our -hic- jewel. We shpent all that time carvin\' it out thish shtupid thing and whatsh he do? -hic-$b$bHe jush leavesh in the middle of the -hic- night. We were gonna shell that thing and be shtinkin\' rich! -hic-$b$b<Salton takes another swig from his flagon.>$b$bShay, you have any gold on you, $gmishter:mish;?', '', 141652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s hunt some sethrak.', 141651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107764, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji says she needs your help with Jakra\'zet.', 'Princess Talanji says she needs your help with Jakra\'zet.', 141649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stand before Wardruid Loti, devoted of Gonk, champion of de hunt and master of trails. What is it you want, $c?', 141648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire up the saw blades! We need more lumber.', '', 141647, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, well we have a problem with dat. Jakra\'zet refuses to carry out de will of the Princess.$b$bI need de help of another member of de Zanchuli Council, but de two dat are down here are busy handling a tribal dispute.$b$bGo to Tal\'aman or Tal\'farrak and see if you can\'t talk one of those Zanchuli into helping.$b$bI am far too important for such a task, or I would go myself.', '', 141646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji demands to know where the guards are.', 'Princess Talanji demands to know where the guards are.', 141645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De moment I saw your face in Stormwind, I knew de time of de prophecy was upon us.$b$bDe spirits show me many things, and in dese visions, I have seen your face at de head of many great events to come.$b$bThings are in motion, $c. Soon, you and I will shake de very fabric of dis world.', '', 141644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I were you, I\'d do the same.  Good luck.', 141643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... give in, T\'paartos. Embrace true power!', '', 141642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shrug off the chains the Light has used to bind you.', '', 141641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is not the way to true strength.', '', 141640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power awaits us, T\'paartos.', '', 141639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light has always been with T\'paartos! He will NEVER abandon the Light!', '', 141638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH!!!', '', 141637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No...', '', 141636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... this is not real. This cannot be the true T\'paartos!', '', 141635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! Can $p make the snakes go away?', '', 141634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is... slightly embarrassing for T\'paartos.', '', 141633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos can lift mountains!', '', 141632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos has faced many such fiends in the Army of the Light.', '', 141631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, Ika. T\'paartos raised this elekk when its mother was killed.', '', 141630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The darkness will not claim T\'paartos!', '', 141629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was T\'paartos meant to walk this path? Is T\'paartos worthy to become Lightforged?', '', 141628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my hide again! I\'m going back to camp before I catch a cold.', '', 141623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t kill them without me!', 141620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107757, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vulpera are ready. The Faithless will fear us.', 141619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm... get you.... mmmm...', '', 141618, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wash gonna use the gold to get married <sob>.', '', 141617, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ash shoon ash I -hic- get a boat... I\'m coming for ya!', '', 141616, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You took our damn jewel, you shcally -hic- wag!', '', 141615, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You took our -hic-...', '', 141614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got to stop letting Nisha make the plans...', '', 141613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I doubt she could. Most of your kind can\'t. Well, not anymore.', 141612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, Meerah. Our wagons don\'t always do well on the ancient troll roads.', '', 141611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sethrak will regret ever attacking our caravan.', 141610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('No slack in the ropes! Hold her steady!', '', 141609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And here you are, $n. The translation of your journal. Quite the page-turner if you ask me.', 141608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? Yes! That\'s it! Now where are my empty books at...? Ah, here\'s one.', 141607, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'OH! So THAT\'S what that rune is. Interesting...', 141606, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got them all?! Excellent work, $n. Now to translate this journal.', 141605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The soldier is mumbling unintelligibly under his breath.>', '<The soldier is mumbling unintelligibly under her breath.>', 141604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the books you asked for.', 'Here are the books you asked for.', 141603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the sea rising, or are we falling?\n\nDeeper and deeper....', 'Is the sea rising, or are we falling?\n\nDeeper and deeper....', 141602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect, perfect, it said everything must be perfect...\n\nWhat said that?', 'Perfect, perfect, it said everything must be perfect...\n\nWhat said that?', 141601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem Zandalari gonna have a big surprise coming real soon!', 'Dem Zandalari gonna have a big surprise coming real soon!', 141600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De crawgs be growin nicely. Soon dey gonna be ready ta ride.', 'De crawgs be growin nicely. Soon dey gonna be ready ta ride.', 141599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, ma\'da. I be out of ya way real quick.', 'Sorry, ma\'da. I be out of ya way real quick.', 141598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better be gettin\' ya knife nice an\' sharp. I be hearin\' we gonna fight dem Zandalari soon.', 'Better be gettin\' ya knife nice an\' sharp. I be hearin\' we gonna fight dem Zandalari soon.', 141597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief Sylvanas Windrunner, I present Chieftain Mayla Highmountain.', '', 141596, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One o\' our rucksacks. Looks like we\'ve found the right place.', '', 141595, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One o\' our axes. We\'re on the right track.', '', 141594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This poor soul\'s been dead fer ages. Let\'s look east fer the supply cart.', '', 141593, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not seen ya before. Ya better hurry and get inside. Word be dat Najima\'s work group be found dead.', 'I not seen ya before. Ya better hurry and get inside. Word be dat Najima\'s work group be found dead.', 141592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last ward was placed at Highmountain Summit. That is where we must go. Just as Huln stood with his allies, so we must band together.', '', 141591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. And when I left the mountain to visit Mulgore, the wards weakened just enough to let the Darkness take hold.', '', 141590, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the Necrodark have been lurking in the shadows, waiting to call forth their master.', 141589, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Huln devised another plan. Wards were placed to lock away the Old Gods\' influence. Though the general survived, Uul\'gyneth\'s essence was trapped.', '', 141588, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln gathered heroes from among the tribes to stand together. They fought against Uul\'gyneth\'s servants, the Necrodark... but the forces of shadow were too great to overcome.', '', 141587, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, the Old Gods sought to lay claim to Highmountain. Their campaign was led by a terrible general... Uul\'gyneth the Darkness.', '', 141586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, champion.', '', 141585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The mayor is unresponsive.>', '', 141584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Look for the source of the spell.>', '<Look for the source of the spell.>', 141583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The effigy looming in the town\'s center pulses with dark energy similar to that which has entrapped the villagers.  It may be acting as a focus to hold the spell in place.\n\nIf it could be destroyed, the spell might be broken.>', '', 141582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This man matches the description of Cyril White, the mayor of Fallhaven. Unfortunately, he is in no state to help you right now.\n\nThe mayor, along with the rest of the residents of Fallhaven, appears to be under the effects of some unfamiliar magic. While still breathing, he is unable to move or respond.\n\nYou\'ll need to find a way to break this curse if you want his help in contacting House Waycrest.>', '', 141581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a life saver! I wonder where the Roughnecks will send me next...', '', 141580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wards have weakened! He will be ours!', '', 141579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have failed! The Darkness rises... and Highmountain shall fall!', '', 141578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion was nothing compared to our power! Surrender!', '', 141577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyhorn shall serve my masters! You will become the shadow that darkens the skies!', '', 141576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serve your true masters, drogbar! Your defiance means death!', '', 141575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there! Would um... you be interested in the history of Kul Tiras? I have several volumes on both the founding of and politics within our great nation. It\'s really a fascinating subject, I swear.$b$bI\'m also excellent at transcribing and could train you in the ways of ink and quill!', 141573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One mistep, an\' we gonna bury ya here.', '', 141572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meerah, ready the wagon and be prepared to pick up supplies at the port. Our new allies can ride along and continue their search.', '', 141571, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis humidity almost be as ugly as ya face.', 'Dis humidity almost be as ugly as ya face.', 141570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatchu lookin\' at?', 'Whatchu lookin\' at?', 141569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya have da royal ear, so we not be killin\' ya, for now.', 'Ya have da royal ear, so we not be killin\' ya, for now.', 141568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usurpers. Ya Horde will pay for what dey did to our people in Tanaris.', 'Usurpers. Ya Horde will pay for what dey did to our people in Tanaris.', 141567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day to you, $gsir:madam;. May I interest you in the fine art of lapidary?$b$bOr as its more commonly known, jewelcrafting?', '', 141566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smile while ya can, $c. Ya step wrong here, and we gonna kill ya ourselves.', 'Smile while ya can, $c. Ya step wrong here, and we gonna kill ya ourselves.', 141565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
