('Does the path lead to greatness? Glory? Or obliteration?', '', 141496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within one soul exist many truths. Some noble. Others...', '', 141495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An offer refuted... and yet the fear remains.', '', 141494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps to overcome fear of the darkness, one must embrace it.', '', 141493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear is relentless. Unyielding. A foe to be defeated.', '', 141492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe. Secure. Away from everyone. Everything.', '', 141491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is solitude the answer? No one can hurt you if you remain alone.', '', 141490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies lurk within every shadow. Can this darkness be stopped?', '', 141489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfair! Unjust! Nothing is ever what it seems!', '', 141488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
