('Retreat deeper... find safety... find comfort...', '', 141486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no comfort? No relief?', '', 141485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
