('There is no kindness here.', '', 141482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pain is the architect of memories.', '', 141481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only way is forward.', '', 141480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember a time when only trolls were allowed on Zandalar. Well... trolls and tortollans of course.\n\nOh they tried to get rid of us once. I believe it was Rastakhan\'s great grandfather, King Tezlekhan the Virulent. Bit full of himself, that one. We got him to change his mind faster than an elemental at a shaman gathering. \n\nYou would be amazed at how much political dirt you can obtain on a royal family if you live longer than they do.', 'I remember a time when only trolls were allowed on Zandalar. Well... trolls and tortollans of course.\n\nOh they tried to get rid of us once. I believe it was Rastakhan\'s great grandfather, King Tezlekhan the Virulent. Bit full of himself, that one. We got him to change his mind faster than an elemental at a shaman gathering. \n\nYou would be amazed at how much political dirt you can obtain on a royal family if you live longer than they do.', 141479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari allow our people free passage in their lands because of the useful information we provide them.\n\nWhat did your people promise them, I wonder?', 'The Zandalari allow our people free passage in their lands because of the useful information we provide them.\n\nWhat did your people promise them, I wonder?', 141478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... a $c. And what continent did you come from?', 'Ah... a $c. And what continent did you come from?', 141477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope Rokhan and de others make it back safely to Zul\'jan... otherwise dis will be a very short trip.', 141476, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 101745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, an adventurer. What are your rates? I may need help later with a rather... dangerous... precious item recovery.', 'Ah, an adventurer. What are your rates? I may need help later with a rather... dangerous... precious item recovery.', 141475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have we met before? My memory is not what it was a hundred years ago.', 'Have we met before? My memory is not what it was a hundred years ago.', 141474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, they let Horde into Zuldazar? How progressive of them.', 'Oh, they let Horde into Zuldazar? How progressive of them.', 141473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
