('Gah! These dice are cursed! Just get in there!', '', 141426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan dumps out an entire bag of dice, revealing mostly treasures.', 'Harlan dumps out an entire bag of dice, revealing mostly treasures.', 141425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan re-rolls to a cannon and two skulls.', 'Harlan re-rolls to a cannon and two skulls.', 141424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan rolls two treasures and a compass.', 'Harlan rolls two treasures and a compass.', 141423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harlan rolls triple swords.', 'Harlan rolls triple swords.', 141422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s better! Did I mention I don\'t play fair? Haha!', '', 141421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! No, no, no. That\'s all wrong.', '', 141420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyah! Fine! Another round!', '', 141419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, look, a new face! Hopefully you\'re a bit more exciting than these folks.', '', 141418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooh! Bad luck for you, haha! Carve \'em up!', '', 141417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... What to do with a couple of mutinous rats... Why don\'t we let the dice decide?!', '', 141416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho ho! Our newest \"recruit\" has arrived! This\'ll be fun!', '', 141415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband\'s exploitation of his workers will never end...', 141414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things have changed, Flynn. I\'m the captain now. And once the Proudmoores are out of the way, we\'ll be free to plunder all of Kul Tiras!', '', 141413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nghh... run...', '', 141412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, boys! Work him over good.', '', 141411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come for you to venture beyond our sacred peaks.', 141410, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At times we were divided. At times we lost our way. But the spirits of our ancestors reminded us that we are bound together by earth, river, and sky. That we are family, and family is worth fighting for.', 141409, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These words speak of more than earth and stone. They tell the history of our people, enduring hardship and conflict to unite against common foes.', 141408, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highmountain stands.', 141407, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a fool to get in my way!', 141406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silgryn! Valtrois! Aid the regent lord!', 141405, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 94877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! We need to cleanse this corruption before the well is lost!', '', 141404, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 94664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not intend for my presence to...', 141403, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is why I demanded that Umbric and his radicals be exiled. Anyone who treats with the Void is a danger to the Sunwell!', '', 141402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening?', '', 141401, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 94663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back!', '', 141400, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 94823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The Sunwell has changed... but its beauty remains. It has been so long.', 141399, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sunwell was corrupted by our enemies, but a naaru\'s sacrifice purified its waters. Now the essence of the Light sustains us.', 141398, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sense of power is palpable. As potent as the Nightwell, but of a different nature.', 141397, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please follow me.', '', 141396, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rommath, kindly open the way for us.', '', 141395, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would consider it an honor to see the Sunwell, Lor\'themar. And I prefer that my friends call me Thalyssra.', 141394, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever she has become, Alleria is a daughter of Quel\'Thalas. I will not deny her pilgrimage to our most sacred site. First Arcanist, you and your retinue would be welcome to join us.', '', 141393, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I advise against it. We cannot trust that she will not--', '', 141392, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has been a thousand years since I set eyes upon the Sunwell. May I visit it once again?', 141391, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 0, 94885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems the offer I bring has been anticipated... and spurned. Very well. But before I leave, I have one request.', 141389, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You doubt my words, yet how can we trust your own? Do you deny that the lords of the Void whisper to you? Did you not surrender yourself to the shadows on Argus?', '', 141388, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cutting words, Lor\'themar. Are they yours, I wonder, or has the dutiful ranger I knew become the mouthpiece of your warchief?', 141387, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had hoped your visit was motivated by a love for Silvermoon. Instead, you come at the behest of the Alliance\'s boy-king. How disappointing.', '', 141384, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish. I come bearing an offer from High King Anduin Wr--', 141383, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. Whatever you came to say, you may say in front of our guests.', '', 141382, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The honor is mine, First Arcanist. I do not mean to intrude upon your visit. Perhaps I should return another time.', 141381, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An unexpected honor, Lady Windrunner. Silgryn told me of your courage during the campaign on Argus.', 141380, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, call me Lor\'themar. But where are my manners? Allow me to introduce another guest: Lady Alleria Windrunner, a hero of Silvermoon\'s past.', '', 141379, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 94667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a pleasure to visit your fine city at last. Thank you for extending the invitation, Regent Lord.', 141376, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First Arcanist Thalyssra and honored guests. Welcome to Silvermoon.', 141375, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 94834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see no need to keep secrets from allies, Alleria. In fact, some new friends of ours are just arriving.', '', 141374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again, Liadrin. Champion. Lor\'themar, I am here concerning a matter that might be best addressed in private.', 141373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Liadrin... champion. You are most welcome. As you can see, we have an... unexpected visitor.', '', 141372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you command, Warchief. I will meet you at Lady Thalyssra\'s estate in Suramar, $p.', 141371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am counting on you both. Do not return until Suramar\'s strength is pledged to the Horde.', 141370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The regent lord invited the nightborne to Silvermoon. I am to travel to Suramar and escort Lady Thalyssra to the meeting.', 141369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To secure our people\'s future, you must help reclaim our place in Azeroth.', 141366, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 94552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our leaders betrayed us, striking a bargain with the demons. But we rose up against tyranny... and drove the devils out. Suramar is ours once more, and we will never again let it fall into darkness.', 141365, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 94551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As the ages passed, Azeroth changed around us... and fell into the Legion\'s grasp.', 141364, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 94550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For ten-thousand years, Suramar was the only world we knew.', 141363, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 94549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are Lightforged. You must stand as a beacon of hope against the darkness.', 141362, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 93713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last, our enemy has fallen. The Legion is no more. Yet our war is far from over. New threats gather in the shadows, awaiting their moment to strike.', 141361, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 93712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through millennia of struggle, the Light has shown us the true path.', 141360, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 93711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are soldiers.', 141359, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 0, 93710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Void has shaped us... changed us. But you will become its master.', 141358, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 94556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we understand a truth that they do not.', 141357, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 94555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sages and scholars fear the Void.', 141356, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 94554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Void. A force of infinite hunger.', 141355, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 94553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will head to de boat. Meet me dere.', 141354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessing of Bwonsamdi to you, stranger.', '', 141353, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De goblins assure me dis plan will work... which is why I need you here to make sure it does.$B$BYou ready to take a ride down de river?', 141352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our champion that sleeps with the fishes... literally! The Freehold Fanatic... the Master of the Jagged Jawbone Jab... the Powerful Pugilist Predator... Trothak the Shark Puncher!', '', 141351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing! These sweaty scallywags found a way to best Gryff and Stevin! There is only one challenger left, and he needs no introduction.', '', 141350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hungry Hungry Harbingers of Doom... the Brutal Bisect of Blubber and Birds... the Deadly Double Destroyers... Gryff and Stevin!', '', 141349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without further ado, here comes a dangerous duo from across the sea. A peerless pair of gladiatorial beasts that strikes fear in the hearts of the most stalwart warriors.', '', 141348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer, defiler!', '', 141347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not leave here!', '', 141345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ludwig goes down! What a fight! These smelly buccaneers are resilient, and they better be... because their next challenger is the epitome of brutality.', '', 141344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save.... yourself....', '', 141343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wretched child! My bargain with Bwonsamdi was to live in exchange for your soul! You will ruin everything!', 141342, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the sewers of Freehold comes a tortollan brigand who makes it his duty to \"turtley\" hurt you. He is the Dynamo of Defense... the Sergeant of Shell Shock... the Hellion in a Half-Shell... Ludwig!', '', 141341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, look at that. They caught a pig. Maybe we should move on to a more... threatening challenge!', '', 141340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You never heard of da Shadowtooth Clan? No surprise, da tribe be wiped out by da Twilight\'s Hammer.\n\nDa Zandalari be keepin\' one representative as a memento of da past. Now I be nothin\' more than a curiosity.\n\nIt not so bad. I never have ta buy any o\' me own drinks.', 141334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 'Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 141332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari once ruled all da trolls. Now, dey can\'t even keep their borders safe.', 'Da Zandalari once ruled all da trolls. Now, dey can\'t even keep their borders safe.', 141331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari be lettin\' blood magic into their borders. Only a matter of time before it destroy dem.', 'Da Zandalari be lettin\' blood magic into their borders. Only a matter of time before it destroy dem.', 141330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari be sendin\' anyone dat cause trouble to da desert. No one be comin\' back.', 'Da Zandalari be sendin\' anyone dat cause trouble to da desert. No one be comin\' back.', 141329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari once be da proudest tribe, now dat pride be da only ting keepin\' da place together.', 'Da Zandalari once be da proudest tribe, now dat pride be da only ting keepin\' da place together.', 141328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look tasty.', 'You look tasty.', 141327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate da elves. I hate da undead. Da Horde got both.', 'I hate da elves. I hate da undead. Da Horde got both.', 141326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Golden Fleet be da real Zandalari power. Whoever got da fleet, got da power.', 'Da Golden Fleet be da real Zandalari power. Whoever got da fleet, got da power.', 141325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 'Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 141324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari once ruled all da trolls. Now, dey can\'t even keep their borders safe.', 'Da Zandalari once ruled all da trolls. Now, dey can\'t even keep their borders safe.', 141323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should be killin\' da Horde and be done wit\' it.', 'We should be killin\' da Horde and be done wit\' it.', 141322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari once be da proudest tribe, now dat pride be da only ting keepin\' da place together.', '', 141321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate da elves. I hate da undead. Da Horde got both.', '', 141320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan must be slippin\', to be lettin\' da Horde into Zandalar witout takin\' dere heads.', '', 141319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde got a new warchief. Weak little elfling, be hearin\'.', '', 141318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be da only place so many tribes meetin\' without heads rollin\'. Da moment da guards be gone, it be a different story.', '', 141316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari can\'t be hidin\' from da world anymore. Their days be numbered.', 'Da Zandalari can\'t be hidin\' from da world anymore. Their days be numbered.', 141313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Darkspear be betrayin\' dere kind. Dey never shoulda joined da Horde.', 'Da Darkspear be betrayin\' dere kind. Dey never shoulda joined da Horde.', 141312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde got a new Warchief. Weak little elfling, be hearin\'.', 'Da Horde got a new Warchief. Weak little elfling, be hearin\'.', 141311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say King Rastakhan not doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter o\' time before da whole a Zandalar fall. Den where we be?', 'Dey say King Rastakhan not doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter o\' time before da whole a Zandalar fall. Den where we be?', 141310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be nothin\' like da jungles of home. We got way bigger dinos.', 'Dis be nothin\' like da jungles of home. We got way bigger dinos.', 141309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari can\'t be hidin\' from da world anymore. Their days be numbered.', 'Da Zandalari can\'t be hidin\' from da world anymore. Their days be numbered.', 141308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Golden Fleet be da real Zandalari power. Whoever got da fleet, got da power.', 'Da Golden Fleet be da real Zandalari power. Whoever got da fleet, got da power.', 141307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari tink dey high an\' mighty over da rest. But dey be nothin\' more than dyin\' relics.', 'Da Zandalari tink dey high an\' mighty over da rest. But dey be nothin\' more than dyin\' relics.', 141306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_ABOLISHMAGIC.BLP:20|tEonar unleashes her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:250048|h[Life Force]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_ABOLISHMAGIC.BLP:20|tEonar unleashes her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:250048|h[Life Force]|h|r !', 141305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari be lettin\' blood magic into dere borders. Only a matter of time before it destroy dem.', 'Da Zandalari be lettin\' blood magic into dere borders. Only a matter of time before it destroy dem.', 141304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate da elves. I hate da undead. Da Horde got both.', 'I hate da elves. I hate da undead. Da Horde got both.', 141303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say da king not even know what be happenin\' in his own city. How he gonna handle da crisis?', 'Dey say da king not even know what be happenin\' in his own city. How he gonna handle da crisis?', 141302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari once be da proudest tribe, now dat pride be da only ting keepin\' da place together.', 'Da Zandalari once be da proudest tribe, now dat pride be da only ting keepin\' da place together.', 141301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too many be speakin\'. Too few be listenin\'.', 'Too many be speakin\'. Too few be listenin\'.', 141300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 'Dey say King Rastakhan not be doin\' too well dese days. Only a matter of time before da whole of Zandalar gonna fall. Den where we be?', 141299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch ya back. Dere gonna be a knife dere.', 'Watch ya back. Dere gonna be a knife dere.', 141298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch ya back. Dere gonna be a knife dere.', 'Watch ya back. Dere gonna be a knife dere.', 141297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan must be slippin\', to be lettin\' da Horde into Zandalar witout takin\' dere heads.', 'King Rastakhan must be slippin\', to be lettin\' da Horde into Zandalar witout takin\' dere heads.', 141296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari tink dey high an\' mighty over da rest. But dey be nothin\' more than dyin\' relics.', 'Da Zandalari tink dey high an\' mighty over da rest. But dey be nothin\' more than dyin\' relics.', 141295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be believin\' da Horde be followin\' some little dead elfie for warchief? Weak.', 'Ya be believin\' da Horde be followin\' some little dead elfie for warchief? Weak.', 141294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
