('A nearby ancient pile of bones stirs.', 'A nearby ancient pile of bones stirs.', 141129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran above the Broken Isles', 'Dalaran above the Broken Isles', 141128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da princess is Zandalar\'s future. She must be kept safe.', 'Da princess is Zandalar\'s future. She must be kept safe.', 141127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98828, 98829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the High Exarch ordered me to Azeroth, I was reluctant to leave his side. I felt someone else would be better suited to the task.\n\nNow, though, I understand why he did it. He wanted to give me a glimpse of what he and Lady Alleria have been fighting for.\n\nOur war may be over, but many battles lie ahead. Just because the Legion is defeated doesn\'t mean every demon in existence has surrendered.\n\n<Lothraxion clenches his fist and smiles.>\n\nNot yet, at least.', '', 141126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve at da princess\'s command.', 'We serve at da princess\'s command.', 141125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98826, 98827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you require of me?', 'What do you require of me?', 141124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98824, 98825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trees have come alive! Grab your axes!', '', 141123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos!', '', 141122, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 93810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the trial begin. Light be with you both.', 141121, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An unorthodox choice, but... technically within the rules. I have never known $p to back down from a challenge.', 141120, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it! T\'paartos shall bring... this puny one!', '', 141119, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 93809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The last initiate who attempted the trial alone came back in pieces. Choose a second, or head back to the barracks.', 141118, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos needs no one to aid him!', '', 141117, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 93808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'T\'paartos... we have discussed this. Each initiate must be accompanied by a second. Where is yours?', 141116, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But if you are truly ready, step forward and embrace your fate.', 141115, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should you feel the slightest doubt, turn back now. It will be counted as wisdom, not cowardice.', 141114, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many worthy draenei have undergone this trial, only to return broken... or worse.', 141113, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will force you to peer into the very core of what you are. Of what you believe yourself to be.', 141112, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One final test remains--and it is the most daunting of all.', 141111, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My fellow soldiers, the trials you have endured are proof that the Light shines bright within your hearts.', 141110, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 93716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<It appears to have been emptied by the troggs.>', '', 141109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Continue looking for the children>', '<Continue looking for the children>', 141108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe $n may be more experienced than you at this sort of thing, Ingrid.', '', 141107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No fair, I wanted to do it!', 141106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vindicaar may have been untested when we set out on this campaign, but she saw us safely home.\n\nAll those ship upgrades were worth it, yes?\n\nDo not answer. It would only break my heart.\n\nA ship\'s engineer\'s work is always underappreciated.', '', 141105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found them! At long last, I found them.\n\n<Arator\'s smile gives way to a look of uncertainty.>\n\nThe two people who gave me life... have been absent for all of it. I know they fought to keep me safe, that they sacrificed so much. And yet...\n\nWe cannot suddenly become a happy family. They know next to nothing about me, and I know only legends of them. We have much to learn about one another, and many wounds to heal.\n\nBut at least we will do it together.', '', 141104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria has changed. She wields powers I do not fully comprehend. But in her heart, she remains my beloved sister. I know it.\n\nThe news of Sylvanas weighs heavily upon her. There are matters to be settled... face to face.\n\nThe Windrunner sisters must meet. And there is only one place it can be done.', 141103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re still here?\n\n<Ishanah looks at you quizzically.>\n\nIt\'s over. Go home.\n\n<Ishanah waves you away.>\n\nGo!', 141102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The campaign against the Legion has been long and wearying. We have traversed entire worlds, spanned the Twisting Nether itself to finally achieve victory.\n\nI am tired, $n. Yet we cannot rest.\n\nMagni\'s visions of doom shake me to my very core. Only one titan remains, champion, and we must defend it.', '', 141101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look! It\'s done! Oooooo, it\'s so beautiful, so deadly!', 141100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countless nights I dreamt of returning to Argus. Of seeing what became of my home. Of saving it.\n\n<Velen is quiet for a long moment.>\n\nThere was no salvation to be had. But we did find victory.\n\nWhat comes next, I cannot say. But I will not wait for visions to guide me. I will do all I can to support King Anduin, and to ensure he is prepared to face the threat that looms in the darkness.', '', 141099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My heart soars to return to Azeroth alongside Arator and Turalyon. To see the forests of my homeland once again.\n\nAnd yet...\n\nVereesa told me what has befallen Sylvanas. Though I dread the meeting, I must see with my own eyes what she has become.\n\nIs she even my sister anymore? Or some Light-forsaken monster?\n\nBut of course, I have changed as well. The powers at my command may cause some to question my loyalties.\n\n<Alleria draws in a long breath.>\n\nI must remain calm, focused. There is much to ponder...', 141098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last, the war is over.\n\nPart of me never expected to survive to see this day. So many battles. So much loss.\n\n<Turalyon sighs, his eyes brimming with a flood of emotions.>\n\nNow we return home to a world I haven\'t walked in a thousand years.\n\nMy old life is long past. It is time to build a new one, and get to know the son who embodies everything I fought for.', '', 141097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Excellent work, Ingrid. Not disconcerting at all.', '', 141096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m already on it.', '', 141095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh... boss? I think we might need a shield from this lightning coming down!', 141094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oooo I\'ve been waiting to do this for a while, stand back!', 141093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If one more of you natives calls me a walking chandelier, I swear I\'ll...', '', 141092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I\'m not usually into drogbar, but when I see them working out in that brul gym... well, let\'s just say the deep places of the earth get a little steamy.', 141091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ingrid, I\'m going to use my own magic to empower the skycaller gem. Stand back.', 'Ingrid, I\'m going to use my own magic to empower the skycaller gem. Stand back.', 141090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to empower the Skycaller Gem.', 'I need you to empower the Skycaller Gem.', 141089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe it... $n! Over here!', '', 141088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hehe... I KNEW we\'d be rescued! Well, maybe I just hoped really hard. Over here!', 141087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! $n! I\'ve heard all about you, get me out of here!', 141086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no way that $n is actually here attempting to save me.', '', 141085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Sha_Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye_nightmare.blp:20|t You are |cFFF00000|Hspell:257459|h[On the Hook]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Sha_Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye_nightmare.blp:20|t You are |cFFF00000|Hspell:257459|h[On the Hook]|h|r!', 141084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their victory is closer than you know.', '', 141083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her whispers echo loudest of all.', '', 141082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The burning ones kept balance. Lost now... lost.', '', 141081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pride led to all of this.', '', 141080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night falls. Her song will end.', '', 141079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace your fate. All will drown.', '', 141078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cracks widen', '', 141077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n awakens a pile of bones!', '$n awakens a pile of bones!', 141075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey dere! If you have any lost companions, I can help you find dem.', '', 141074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I took care of de animals in life. If you are willing, I am still able to help with dem.', '', 141073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came as soon as we could.', '', 141072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare the Blight! Let it rain down upon their armies!', 141071, 0, 0, 396, 70, 4886, 0, 106970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_PRIMAL_SHADOW:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:251570|h[Soulbomb]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_PRIMAL_SHADOW:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:251570|h[Soulbomb]|h|r!', 141070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_MOTE_SHADOW01:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:250669|h[Soulburst]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_MOTE_SHADOW01:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:250669|h[Soulburst]|h|r!', 141069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But your fate is still your own, Umbric. I can teach you to quiet the whispers. To make the shadows serve you, instead of you serving them.', 141068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Durzaan tried to tear away your mortality. To make you like him--a slave to his hunger.', 141067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria... $p... My people are free, but we have been... changed. And the voices...', '', 141066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. These people are not yours. They are not lost.', 141065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooooooooo...', '', 141064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see through your lies, Durzaan. So will the others.', 141063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you resist? You stand on the threshold of a grand destiny.', '', 141062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This void storm is a conduit... a doorway that must be closed.', 141061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your masters will not enslave me, ethereal... nor will they claim my brothers and sisters!', 141060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are on the same side, Windrunner... no matter what that traitor has taught you.', '', 141059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, now... no antler stroking on the first date.', 141058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Names are of little consequence. A more interesting question is... What shall you become?', '', 141057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $p. We must stop this transformation before my people are lost!', 141056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrrurgaaghh! I feel the power... calling to me... changing me...', '', 141055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resist the whispers, Umbric! This \"gift\" you are offered is little more than enslavement.', 141054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show yourself! Who are you?', 141053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 94940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last... the future I foresaw has come to pass. Thank you for opening the way.', '', 141052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 94328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He said my eyes were \"milky\". Talk about a mood killer...', 141051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why settle for horns when you could have a rack like this?', '', 141050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Witness my power, mortal, and know dat you can have a part of it...', '', 141049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The area ahead is dangerous, turn back!', 'The area ahead is dangerous, turn back!', 141048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You let Zul cut through our forces like tissue paper. Now they be marchin\' up to Atal\'Dazar uncontested. Ya got a plan for dat, oh king?', 141047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rastakhan, ya takin\' ya sweet time to come deal with this.', 141046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be hard to say if Zul is a good planner or is just a good prophet. Either way, he be ahead of us at every step.$b$bHe makes to replace me with the bones of our first king, Dazar.$b$bI am one to see trolls rule the world again, but I not be one willing to pay the cost of the dark heresies that Zul has turned to.', '', 141045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even ol\' Bwonsamdi will be disturbed by what I plan to do to you.', 141044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do horrible things to your very soul.', 141043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your suffering won\'t end with death.', 141042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First I will kill you, den I will go to work on you.', 141041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Invade my temple? Oh, you are going to die for dat.', 141040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rastakhan is here? Good. Take me to that late comer.', 141039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only wanted to help.', '', 141038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world will burn with the beauty that is to come.', '', 141037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well look at you! Da mighty hero... ha!', '', 141036, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 98423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know the way to a woman\'s heart? Hoof rubs. Trust me on this one, darling.', 141035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tauren make the best poets. Their verse is so moooooving.', 141034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brrrrr, it\'s cold in here. In the mood for some ice cream?', 141033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are the Rivermane always so calm? Because they\'ve learned to go with the flow.', 141032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you get when you feed cocoa to a Highmountain tauren? Chocolate moose!', 141031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you just try to hang your hat on my antlers? What do I look like, a coat rack?', '', 141030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What smells worse than a drogbar? Two drogbar. What smells worse than two drogbar? Nobody knows, because the stench will kill you.', '', 141029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tauren, a yaungol, and a taunka walk into a bar. This isn\'t a joke--it\'s my family reunion.', '', 141028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! A buddy of mine convinced this epic-geared adventurer to kick fish into the river! Oh wait... that wasn\'t you, was it?', '', 141027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be a simple tauren from the mountains, but at least I don\'t dig through worm dung for loot.', '', 141026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s play a game. We take a drink every time a harpy screeches about earth and stone.', '', 141025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does that draenei couple keep asking me where Rocky is?', '', 141024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not the size of the antlers. It\'s the motion of the totem.', 141023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you staring at my rack?', 141022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... wanna knock antlers?', 141020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be an alchemist, because we\'ve got great chemistry.', '', 141018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get as rough as you like. I\'ve got a thick hide.', '', 141017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the deep places... of my heart.', '', 141016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My totem thunders. All. Night. Long.', '', 141015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust me... I have experience at exploring deep places.', '', 141014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen the bunks on the Vindicaar? I can arrange a private tour.', '', 141013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You really must attend one of our parties in the Court of Stars. I\'ve never met anyone more in need of a mask.', 141012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Night elves? More like country elves! They live in trees, sleep in dens... sometimes even grow antlers. They\'re not cut out for life in a REAL city.', 141011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I met this kaldorei who told me my dress was the pinnacle of fashion... 10,000 years ago. Ouch! Those night elves really know how to throw shade!', 141010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande still looks good after all these years. Know if she\'s seeing anyone?', 141009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Care for a glass of arcwine? I jumped on the berries myself.', 141008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Roses are red, our city is fair. Is that a disguise? WHO GOES THERE?', 141007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An allusion! What are you implying?', 141006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s be honest. Keeping a giant, angry dinosaur caged up in a zoo was bound to end badly.', '', 141005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know why they call it the Court of Stars. I hang out there all the time and I never see anyone famous.', '', 141004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in my day, there was only one kind of elf. ONE.', '', 141003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s what I do. I drink arcwine... and I know things.', '', 141002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My name is Roy, and I\'m a mana addict.', '', 141001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does everyone keep asking me to say that? Ughhhhh. Fine. An Illusion. What are you hiding.', '', 141000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To be honest, most of the time something was quite right.', '', 140999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no area denial in this raid.', 140998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been trapped in a bubble with the same guys for 10,000 years. You could say I\'m ready for a little... variety.', 140997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll show you my ley lines if you show me yours.', 140996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Animate? Detonate? I suggest we skip straight to replicate.', 140995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Nightwell brings all the boys to the yard.', 140994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No illusions here. Everything you see is real... very real.', 140992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that an illusion in your pocket, or are you just happy to see me?', 140991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you picked from the Arcan\'dor? Because you\'re the apple of my eye.', '', 140990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars have judged you, and found you... smokin\' hot.', '', 140989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a feeling we were night-born for each other.', '', 140988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ve night-fallen for you.', '', 140987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm, I wanna tap that ley line.', '', 140986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found the Arcway to my heart.', '', 140985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must know magic too, because you just made everyone else in the room disappear.', '', 140984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your body must be a font of magic, because I\'m irresistibly drawn to it.', '', 140983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turalyon was the only human I saw for a thousand years. I assumed all of them were grizzled and scarred.', 140982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One downside of being Lightforged is that my S.E.L.F.I.E.S. are always overexposed.', 140981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We haven\'t crashed the Vindicaar yet... but given our track record, it\'s only a matter of time.', 140980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t recommend walking barehoof on the Vindicaar. We keep finding tiny shards of crystal that didn\'t get swept up.', 140979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Toes are overrated. Hooves make pedicures go sooooo much faster.', 140978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you met my dog? His name is Barkenon Puppos.', 140977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, I do not have a glowing stamp above my tail.', 140976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Aiur... <cough> Argus. My life for ARGUS!', '', 140975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After being aboard a ship for so long, it is nice to walk on solid ground again. All those hard surfaces were murder on my hooves!', '', 140974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world of yours is very strange. Talking bears who practice kung fu? On Argus, we call that a circus.', '', 140973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought my tattoo said \"Light\'s Defender\" in naaru. I found out it actually says \"glowing goat\".', '', 140972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When in doubt... touch anything that glows.', 140971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has it gotten brighter in here? Because you just turned me on.', '', 140970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
