('We need to move, we shouldn\'t stay here.', 'We need to move, we shouldn\'t stay here.', 140967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse de cowards in Zuldazar for not stopping dis threat sooner! My father was a fool to think dis would just \"go away\".\n\nDis will not end with us just killing Ateena. It is far worse than I ever imagined.', 140966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
