('<Winstone is staring furiously at his hand of cards.>', '', 140823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Winstone is huddled over his card collection, messing around with a new deck idea.$b$bUpon further inspection, he seems to be picking an awful lot of beasts...>', '', 140822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Ar\'gorok.', 'Send me to Ar\'gorok.', 140821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To find Xal\'zaix, we must first find Sethraliss.', '', 140820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan wields our very souls as weapons. You are doomed.', '', 140818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your weapons are worthless. Our spirits protect him.', '', 140817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another body to break for Zak\'rajan!', '', 140816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will join the others in this golem!', '', 140815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release us...', '', 140814, 0, 62011, 0, 64, 0, 107319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan reigns...', '', 140813, 0, 62011, 0, 64, 0, 107318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outsiders must be purged.', '', 140812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No kings. Only Zak\'rajan.', '', 140811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on, go on, find dis ya wayward ma\'da an\' bring dem together again!', '', 140810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hehe... little miss be right. Her ma\'da not on de Other Side.', '', 140809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No loa. Only Zak\'rajan.', '', 140808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend de court at all costs.', '', 140807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us...', '', 140806, 0, 62011, 0, 64, 0, 107313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacrifice... for Zak\'rajan...', '', 140805, 0, 62011, 0, 64, 0, 107312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oho... a priest! If ya ever consider a change of faith, be sure you let old Bwonsamdi know, you hear?', '', 140804, 0, 53659, 603, 64, 0, 98414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bloodflies are really biting these days, aren\'t they?', 'The bloodflies are really biting these days, aren\'t they?', 140803, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101561, 101562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow!', 'Ow!', 140802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101559, 101560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clumsy oaf.', 'Ugh, clumsy oaf.', 140801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 101557, 101558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Watch where you\'re pointing that thing!', 'Hey! Watch where you\'re pointing that thing!', 140800, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 101555, 101556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloody mainlanders...', 'Ugh, bloody mainlanders...', 140799, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 101553, 101554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! What in blazes was that for?!', 'Ouch! What in blazes was that for?!', 140798, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 101551, 101552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Our cause is lost. The Burning Crusade will consume us all.', '', 140797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy scavengers! I rule here!', '', 140796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our champions have fallen. Nothing can stop the end of all things.', '', 140795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements answer the call of the Horde. As it should be.', '', 140794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da spirit lodge is ready for ya. Whatcha needin\'?', 140793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even de loa have abandoned us.', 'Even de loa have abandoned us.', 140792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan has enslaved us for countless ages. Free us....', 'Zak\'rajan has enslaved us for countless ages. Free us....', 140791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits be powerful weapons... if you can control \'em.', 'Spirits be powerful weapons... if you can control \'em.', 140790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He uses our souls to protect himself. You cannot break through his shield with weapons.', 'He uses our souls to protect himself. You cannot break through his shield with weapons.', 140789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were promised wealth beyond measure. Instead, we were enslaved.', 'We were promised wealth beyond measure. Instead, we were enslaved.', 140788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan forbid us from worshipping de loa. Only he could be honored.', 'Zak\'rajan forbid us from worshipping de loa. Only he could be honored.', 140787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does Bwonsamdi refuse to let us into de Other Side?', 'Why does Bwonsamdi refuse to let us into de Other Side?', 140786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan imprisoned our spirits into these golems. He forces us to serve him.', 'Zak\'rajan imprisoned our spirits into these golems. He forces us to serve him.', 140785, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope the dogs are hungry. With Horde banners flying over Newstead, we can now train wolf riders.', '', 140784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Armory is complete. Get those forges up and running!', '', 140783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armory construction complete. What are your orders?', '', 140781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zak\'rajan must pay for imprisoning us!', 'Zak\'rajan must pay for imprisoning us!', 140780, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sethraliss will watch over us.', 'Sethraliss will watch over us.', 140779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest well, sweet Kaja. You will not be forgotten.', 140778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sulthis was the very first Keeper. He needed me and Korthek to help him seal Mythrax\'s corpse within the great pyramid.\n\nTogether, we cast a barrier, sealing the corpse of Mythrax within.\n\nEach of us created a key, imbued with our power, to ensure that the tomb would remain undisturbed.', '', 140777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, now, there\'s no need for any of us to fight. Let\'s sit down, have a drink and tell some riddles, all right?', '', 140776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think Winstone over there is easy pickings, you just watch. He will turn the tables, and it will be YOU that will botch!', '', 140775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know Rastakhan, the mighty and eternal king. He should be careful who he takes under his wing.', '', 140774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Oh, I will continue my adventure\' you think. Why not stay, relax, and have a drink?', '', 140773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Hozen Throne tiki bar. It\'s got the best drinks in all of Zandalar!', '', 140772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can use the heart\'s connection to Sethraliss to track her down.', '', 140771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart is linked to our loa\'s life force. The red glow you describe suggests she is distressed, but more importantly, that she is alive!', '', 140770, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If what you say is true, we must act quickly!', '', 140769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting...', '', 140768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no, ya no good to me dead. I be able to return ya to life... for a price.', '', 140767, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 98420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you be doin\' here, mon?  It not your time to pass on... yet.', '', 140766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She couldn\'t have known it would turn de jungle to sand...', 140764, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raaaaaaagh!', '', 140762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless will not take this temple.', '', 140761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using their power, I shall bend the strands of time to aid our cause.', '', 140760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the rest a ya, don\'t interfere with me business here again. Dem dat break my deals will pay my price.', '', 140759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now get back in ya prison and suffer.', '', 140758, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t make deals with double-crossers.', '', 140757, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, Bwonsamdi, another deal! I\'ll beat your drums every day! My people will worship you forever!', '', 140756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been lookin\' for Rakera, same as you. These snakes say that you found her. \n\nHow nice dat we can all be reunited, assumin\' they ever let me out of this cage.', '', 140755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya never pass into da Other Side. Ya never see ya ancestors. Ya be trapped here for eternity.', '', 140754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. Bwonsamdi don\'t forget his grudges.', '', 140753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But ya grew arrogant. Forbid worship of anyone but ya\'self. Ya remember dat?', '', 140752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('change me', 'change me', 140751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We had a deal. Ya get power, ya people worship me.', '', 140750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya believe dat, den ya as dull as ya are dishonest, Zak\'rajan.', '', 140749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar holds many secrets. Perhaps we have stumbled upon one we were not meant to reveal.', '', 140748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will expose Jakra\'zet for de traitor he is.', 140747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi, you old mongrel, I finally beat you!', '', 140746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! I will finally join my ancestors in the Shadowlands!', '', 140745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are the Keepers?', 'Who are the Keepers?', 140743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Is my soul finally free from that prison?', '', 140742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Sethraliss?', 'Who is Sethraliss?', 140740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless are a force of militant sethrak, led by Emperor Korthek.\n\nLong ago, we all lived as one, as Sethraliss would have wanted. \n\nSince Korthek\'s betrayal, the Faithless have brought war upon these lands. \n\nThey will not stop until they have conquered the world.', '', 140739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Korthek?', 'Who is Korthek?', 140738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Faithless will not take this temple.', '', 140737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khaz\'goroth! Forge these heroes in our image!', '', 140736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arise, champions! Fight to save your world!', 140735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 90885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope is not lost, Highfather. The spark of life still flickers within these mortals.', 140734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 90884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! After all we have endured... It must not end this way!', '', 140733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time answers to me, Unmaker! The one force that can bind your relentless fury!', '', 140732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortals have fallen. The final titan... cannot be saved.', '', 140731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rage of the Unmaker surges! Quickly, heroes! Strike down these constructs!', '', 140730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done, my friend. You\'re welcome to join us for a hunt anytime! For now, take a gryphon down to Anglepoint. We\'ll clean up here.', 140729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we trust Serrik? Do you think de sethrak can help us find Xal\'zaix?', 140727, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is dis Jakra\'zet\'s doing? Does he already have his hands on Xal\'zaix?', 140725, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory! Glory to the sea!', '', 140724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the tides...', '', 140723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ifis yahf an\'zig...', '', 140722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble under the gaze of our master!', '', 140721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uothk w\'shh!', '', 140720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea calls to you, $r.', '', 140719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back in your golems, spirits! You belong to me!', '', 140718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examining', 'Examining', 140717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His shield is down. Strike now!', 140716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re clever, you can make spirits do all the hard work for you.', 140715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is why I keep old totems stuffed with angry spirits, $p...', 140714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There he is! I\'ll take care of that pesky spirit shield.', 140713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Norgannon! Your keen mind may expose our enemy\'s weakness!', '', 140712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One among them shall serve as the vessel for my power, Highfather.', '', 140711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggramar! Lend these mortals your strength, brother.', '', 140710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the fury of the sea wash away this corruption!', '', 140709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of sea and sky must aid our champions, Golganneth!', '', 140708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got the best ookin\' slerp this side of the flookin\' sea. Stuff it in your jabber!', '', 140707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna drink, wikket?', '', 140706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know if dis snakemon speaks de truth, but we don\'t have many options.', 140705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do I have to grook to get a jeekin slerp around here?', 'Who do I have to grook to get a jeekin slerp around here?', 140704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you... sell anything?', 'Do you... sell anything?', 140703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must find de weapon before Jakra\'zet can get his hands on it.', 140702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The quilboar makes a series of grunting noises, punctuated by the occasional squeal.>', 140701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Them Outriggers are so brave! I could never go out and face them monsters! I\'m good on cargo duty.', 'Them Outriggers are so brave! I could never go out and face them monsters! I\'m good on cargo duty.', 140700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go, Okri. The Outriggers are waiting.', 140699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not waiting for your blessing any longer, Therold. We\'ve got monsters to kill.', 140698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once Zak\'rajan is taken care of, it\'s free for all looting. Whatever you grab, you keep.', '', 140697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHY?!', 'WHY?!', 140696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAHHHHHH!', 'AAAAAAHHHHHH!', 140695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOT HOT HOT!', 'HOT HOT HOT!', 140694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got everything we need to take out Zak\'rajan\'s barrier. Just show me where he is.', 140693, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this!!!', 'Not like this!!!', 140692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no NO!!!', 'No no no NO!!!', 140691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait wait WAIT!!!', 'Wait wait WAIT!!!', 140690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll lead the way. Stay close.', 140689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'ve certainly tried, but thanks to $n, I haven\'t met Bwonsamdi yet.', 140688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t loot anything without me.', 140687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see de sands haven\'t swallowed you yet, Rakera.', 140686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My scouts and I will meet you there.', 140685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for aiding me. I know not the implications of our discovery, but I\'m happy we were able to save some of the people here.', 140684, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Brannon and the others have departed for Stormsong Valley to warn of the corruption within the priests. I will bring the information back to Boralus.', 140683, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you there, $n. Spiritual matters must be handled delicately.', '', 140682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got just the thing to heal this...', 140681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve stumbled upon something greater than ourselves, my friend.', 140680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll wait here. It\'d be best not to draw de attention of Jakra\'zet\'s assassins.', 140678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a moment...', '', 140677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And down she goes! A fight for the ages, Outriggers.', 140675, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 108343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s emerged! Show her the strength of the Outriggers!', 140673, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 108357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sandfury Assassin retreats into the shadows.', 'Sandfury Assassin retreats into the shadows.', 140672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand firm, Outriggers! Give her all you\'ve got!', 140671, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 108359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take down those tentacles! Force the beast to emerge!', 140670, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 108360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye out for assassins. Jakra\'zet has put a hefty price on my head.', 140669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis world will be ours. Zul has foreseen it!', 'Dis world will be ours. Zul has foreseen it!', 140667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop what is coming. Zul has foreseen it.', 'You cannot stop what is coming. Zul has foreseen it.', 140666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bring dat failed king of ours? He will die, and you cannot stop it.', 'You bring dat failed king of ours? He will die, and you cannot stop it.', 140665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late. Zul is marching for de pinnacle.', 'You are too late. Zul is marching for de pinnacle.', 140664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Horde will fall. De Alliance will fall. And Zandalar will rise!', 'De Horde will fall. De Alliance will fall. And Zandalar will rise!', 140663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalar shall rule dis world!', 'Zandalar shall rule dis world!', 140662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight for a true troll empire!', 'We fight for a true troll empire!', 140661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Zul!', 'My life for Zul!', 140660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The terror of the sea, swayed by Deepwarden\'s dark master! Perhaps too large a monster even for the Outriggers.', '', 140659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taller men than you have opposed me, but they always came up short.', '', 140656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one better touch... my booty...', '', 140655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable...', '', 140654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Men! Acquaint these scallywags with our heavy guns.', '', 140653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannons! Blast these scurvy dogs to bits!', '', 140652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check their teeth for gold, boys. The rest is shark food.', '', 140651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the sound of corpses hitting the deck.', '', 140650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun gonna be freed, and Hir\'eek\'s followers gonna be rewarded!', 140649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright lads, gather their valuables. After I\'ve had my pick, you can fight for the scraps.', '', 140648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fell victim to one of the classic blunders. Never go against Sweete when booty is on the line!', '', 140647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swab the deck with their gizzards!', '', 140646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands on deck!', '', 140645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Shaman_PVP_RipplingWaters:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:255594|h[Sky and Sea]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Shaman_PVP_RipplingWaters:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:255594|h[Sky and Sea]|h|r!', 140644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive. You made it farther than I thought... but I will still be drinking your blood.', 140643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rezan was a powerful loa. Perhaps you will make a worthy sacrifice for Zul.', 140642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks for killing de priestess. You have only succeeded in strengthening my hold on de temple!', 140641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pleases me! Bring more to my lair... I must commune with the master!', '', 140640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The threat of the faceless ones is contained for now, but I will continue to keep watch over Atul\'Aman to ensure it stays that way.', 140639, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'kaal... in pieces again? No matter... I can rebuild him. But when YOU die, there will be no coming back!', 140638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fly!', 'Let\'s fly!', 140637, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are under siege! Come with me to halt the monster\'s onslaught!', '', 140636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inform me when you are prepared to go! Time is fleeting, and the monster shall not hesitate!', '', 140635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon Zul will awaken Dazar, den de troll empire will rise again!', 140634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late, outsiders! De temple belongs to my master now.', 140633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! It\'s working! Keep stabbing! Keep stabbing!', '', 140632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t outnumber the sethrak, so we gotta outsmart them.', '', 140631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take what you can, whenever you can, from whoever you can.', 140630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can find a purpose for anything if you hold onto it long enough.', 140629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MOUNT_EPICBATMOUNT.BLP:20|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:256497|h[Blood Horror]|h|r! Take cover!', '', 140628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good... he believes we are dead. We need... a new plan.', '', 140627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that bravado... only to die in my lair. I shall consume the remains... once I recover.', '', 140626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds will guide you into Atul\'Aman now... prepare yourself!', 140625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be up to us to find the source of the disturbance and put an end to it.', 140624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For centuries now, a dark power has been growing within Atul\'Aman. I sense that the elements have grown restless...', 140623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortar teams! Blow their fortress to the ground. To the ground!', '', 140622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The echoes of that blast still resonate throughout the elements. What power could have caused such devastation?', 140621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Atul\'Aman, once a magnificent structure, was destroyed in a catastrophic explosion thousands of years ago.', 140620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get down, Hir\'eek is coming!', '', 140619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Place your hands upon the shamanstone and I will summon a cyclone to carry you to Atul\'Aman.', 140618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The glasstail scorpids must be dealt with, but I fear that an even more dangerous threat looms yet ahead.', 140617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaahhh!!', '', 140616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are strong... but none stand against the might of a loa!', '', 140615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH! I will feast upon your broken bones!', '', 140614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My master\'s power flows through me... it will purge me of your infection!', '', 140613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... Auugghh!? What... poison? What have you done to me!?', '', 140612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! What can you hope to do against me? I am lord of the sky!', '', 140611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What other choice do we have?', 140610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakera! You actually believe what he says?', 140609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then you shall have our aid, Serrik.', 140608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather the reagents for the ritual and we will help you look for your lost artifact.', '', 140607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That vision was more helpful than we could have imagined. Xal\'zaix is within our reach.', '', 140606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will this ritual show us exactly? Are we close ta findin\' Xal\'zaix?', '', 140605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really trust these snakes? I think they might be knowin\' more than they\'re tellin\'...', '', 140604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people can help you find this Xal... what do you call it? Xal\'zaix?', '', 140603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you goin\' ta let them keep me caged up like this?', '', 140602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Searchin\' for Rakera is a fool\'s errand. Her fate was sealed when she was sent to da sands.', '', 140601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De vault was sealed! How can it be empty? Dis doesn\'t make any sense...', 140600, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What has Jakra\'zet done...', 140599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop... the sands...', '', 140596, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 105761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple must fall! We will slaughter any who stand in our way.', '', 140595, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 105760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure doin\' business with ya. Now if ya don\'t mind, I\'ll take my leave before my absence is noticed.', '', 140594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As promised, here\'s some official Cutwater Corsair regalia. Now you\'ll look like respectable criminals.', '', 140593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will shatter like glass!', 'You will shatter like glass!', 140592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103593, 103594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Emperor!', 'For the Emperor!', 140591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103595, 103596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya did it! I knew my pooch would help out. Man\'s best friend, that one.', '', 140590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will eradicate you like insects!', 'We will eradicate you like insects!', 140589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103597, 103598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like sand, you will be scattered and forgotten!', 'Like sand, you will be scattered and forgotten!', 140588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103599, 103600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sands will swallow you!', 'The sands will swallow you!', 140587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103601, 103602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have dominion over all!', 'We have dominion over all!', 140586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103603, 103604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the sands from spreading!', 'You cannot stop the sands from spreading!', 140585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103605, 103606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lands are next to fall!', 'Your lands are next to fall!', 140584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103607, 103608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... you scratch my back, I return the favor. Got me?', '', 140583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first, I got a problem. This here lock ain\'t cooperatin\' with my attempts to pick it. That mangy dog\'s got the key, but he\'s a slippery one.', '', 140582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to enjoy dis!', 'I will enjoy dis!', 140581, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107022, 107023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jakra\'zet wants dis one dead!', 'Jakra\'zet wants dis one dead!', 140580, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107020, 107021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere is a price on your head!', 'Dere be a price on your head!', 140579, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107018, 107019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re itchin\' to make some mayhem, you\'ll need a meeting with the Council of Captains. I can help with that.', '', 140578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to cut you down!', 'I will cut you down!', 140576, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107016, 107017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jakra\'zet sends his regards!', 'Jakra\'zet sends his regards!', 140575, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107014, 107015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy! You lot got the look o\' proper cutthroats. Not like the usual scum that passes for pirates \'round here.', '', 140574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surging steel!', '', 140573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('En guard!', '', 140572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never miss.', 140571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love watching a target squirm!', 140570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!', '', 140569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This barrel\'s tapped! Catch!', '', 140568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Krag\'wa, the little one will find ya there.', '', 140567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can stand against me, swine? Allow me to educate you.', '', 140566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen a sethrak beg for mercy before. He may be telling us de truth.', 140565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no time for prisoners. Let\'s execute him and be done with it!', 140564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lies! De sethrak murder and pillage everything in their path!', 140563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the fury of the sea!', '', 140562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind your surroundings.', '', 140561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not your enemy! You must believe me!', '', 140560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bury me with my blade...', '', 140559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I mean you no harm! Please... don\'t kill me!', '', 140558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one is mine!', 'Dis one be mine!', 140557, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107038, 107039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna regret stepping foot on dis land!', 'You\'ll regret stepping foot on dis land!', 140556, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107036, 107037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got orders to kill dis one.', 'We\'ve got orders to kill dis one.', 140555, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107034, 107035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you\'ve got, it is gonna be mine soon!', 'Whatever you\'ve got, is gonna be mine soon!', 140554, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107032, 107033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will I ever meet an opponent who can match my skill?', '', 140553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is not your fight!', 'Dis isn\'t your fight!', 140552, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107030, 107031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen too much to live!', 'You\'ve seen too much to live!', 140551, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107028, 107029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here!', 'You don\'t belong here!', 140550, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107026, 107027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First blood!', '', 140549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine coupe de grace.', '', 140548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s put your steel to the test!', '', 140546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eat grape shot, mongrels!', 140545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Things are about to get messy!', 140544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can scatter but you can\'t hide!', 140542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re in my sights!', 140541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice... shot...', 140540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Awww, I still had bullets in the chamber.', 140539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let dem worry about de Sethrak for now. You and I need to open de vault and find Xal\'zaix.', 140538, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right between the eyes.', 140537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another notch on my barrel!', 140536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skulls will be excellent target practice.', 140535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow the man down!', '', 140534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This round\'s on me!', '', 140533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink up, ye scurvy dogs!', '', 140532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will never work. Our loyalties lie with Rastakhan, not dis false prophet.', '', 140531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heave ho!', '', 140530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Bottoms up, scallywags!', '', 140529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All he will be taking is a visit to Bwonsamdi if I have anything to say about it.', '', 140528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You go and attune de sphere. De rest of us will go to de Ruins of Atul\'Aman to search for de vault of Xal\'zaix.', 140527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taking de fleet to Pandaria was bad enough. Now he is trying to take all of Zuldazar for himself!', 140526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never trusted Zul, de silver-tongued devil!', 140525, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna come back when I be done, Ma\'da.', '', 140524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was this... last call...?', '', 140523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be goin\' now, Ma\'da! Anytin\' for ya.', '', 140522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer looking three sheets to the wind!', '', 140521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn to hold your drink, matey!', '', 140520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anytin\' for ya, Ma\'da!', '', 140519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
