('Who do you want me to kill?', '', 140360, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 106081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll hold down the island and let you know if there\'s any news!', 140359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live de king!', '', 140358, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 106080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi has given me another chance!', '', 140357, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 106079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taz\'dingo!', '', 140356, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 106078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis gold is under my power!', 140355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not belong here!', 140354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My claws will find your heart.', 140353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no time to waste. We\'ll meet you up near the cave!', 140352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is it. Either de plan works... or we are dead.', '', 140335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no... it\'s Hir\'eek!', '', 140334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji is mighty curious about what happens here in de swamps.', '', 140333, 0, 53461, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De gold answers my call.', 140332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corruption be purified!', 140331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Atal\'Dazar\'s power flows through me!', 140330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been cleansed!', 140329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death is a better fit for you.', 140328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De pools... must be... cleansed.', 140327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only de worthy are buried here. Your corpses will feed de raptors!', 140326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should never have come here.', 140325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You came for de gold, but you will leave behind your bones!', 140324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Servants of Yazma are not welcome here!', 140323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step forward. I alone shall deal with you.', '', 140322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji sent us here to explore rumors of monsters in de swamp. What we found is so much worse... dey are making dem...', '', 140321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you were dead! Oh, don\'t tell me you\'re actually workin\' for those bootlickers!', '', 140320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s... kind of a long story. How about a drink?', '', 140319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you Irontide punks to--wait a minute... Flynn?!', '', 140318, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 103919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahem... AVAST ye bloated barnacle! We\'ve come for yer booty!', '', 140317, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 103918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? No! What isss thisss... Power...', 140316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Goldtusk Gang, $p. We\'re family now!', '', 140315, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You ever punched a sethrak so hard its tail fell off?', 140314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got the power, but I got the brains.\n\nWe\'re a good team.', '', 140313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, I be gettin\' the drum repaired in no time.', 140312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...just like all the dark birdies said!', 140311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...except me and my toys...', 140310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no more noise...', 140309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All the people have gone stiff or fled.', 140308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collecting', 'Collecting', 140307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara... I have failed you...', 140306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Queen will be most pleased by your death. Nazjatar will rise!', 140305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise a drink with me an\' Flynn! On the house!$B$BWhat\'ll you have?', '', 140303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milk... in a skull mug.', 'Milk... in a skull mug.', 140302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milk.', 'Milk.', 140301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ale.', 'Ale.', 140300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_AMMO_BULLET_03:20|t%s targets you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:256044|h[Deadeye]|h|r bullet!', '', 140299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful out there. Something big\'s going down.', '', 140298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya always welcome here, $p. Ya a member of de Goldtusk Gang for life.', '', 140297, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Goldtusk Inn is officially open for business!', '', 140296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for saving me...', '', 140295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think I might stay here awhile. Help out where I can.', '', 140294, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe I found you again, $p. But I\'m exhausted...', '', 140293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d say you\'re crazy, but you just saved my life. So, thanks.', '', 140292, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You helped dese exiles set up an inn way out here in da middle of nowhere?', '', 140291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Faithless chased me across da desert, through wild beasts and monsters. I barely survived.', '', 140290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De blood trolls are crazy, using our people as bat food!', 'De blood trolls are crazy, using our people as bat food!', 140289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese things wanted to use my blood for dese bats!', 'Dese things wanted to use my blood for dese bats!', 140288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! Dey wanted to sacrifice me to de bats!', 'Thanks! Dey wanted to sacrifice me to de bats!', 140287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey were going to feed me to de bats!', 'Dey were going to feed me to de bats!', 140286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Azshara seems rather desperate. If nothing else, we are absolutely going to ruin her day.$B$BThat just tickles my belly.', '', 140285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your disguise is gone! But why does mine still work? Hmm... I think dis changes things.', '', 140283, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 102556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! What are you doing?', '', 140282, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 102555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, I feel dizzy... Bwonsamdi was calling me.', '', 140281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know what you\'re thinking: \"Didn\'t the Zandalari trolls enslave the goblins and force them to mine?\"$b$bLook, if we didn\'t deal with our enemies, then they\'d just deal with each other. That\'s bad for business.', 140280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
