('', 'Unacceptable.', 140198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello? Is anyone dere?', '', 140197, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think not.', 140196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think not.', '', 140195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never!', '', 140194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course not.', 140193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 140192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.', 140191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.', 140190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 140189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody get ready. Our first guest of the day. Dis is so exciting! Don\'t kill dem!', '', 140188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re here representin\' the interests of the Bilgewater organization. Ain\'t nothing is gonna stop us, not even being stuck in this harbor with those Steamwheedle amateurs.$b$bOur negotiations are proceeding well. Pretty soon I\'ll be chatting with the king, and he\'ll come around and see how a business relationship could be mutually beneficial to both parties.', 140187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Bilgewater organization employs some of the best negotiators in the business. There\'s almost nothing they can\'t buy into, buy out of, or just straight up buy. Downright inspiring to some.$b$bI\'m the one they send when the other guys can\'t do the job. Me and my gals will take it from here, just you watch.', 140186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bilgewater? Yeah, I see \'em. Over there, thinking they\'re all fancy sending Moxie and her gals over to \"keep an eye\" on us. Like we\'ve got anything to hide, am I right?$b$bI wouldn\'t worry about them. I\'ve wheeled and dealed with trade princes, this will be a piece of cake.', '', 140185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
