('Vilnak\'dor! Kao had better be lying, or you are next!', '', 140001, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De king?', 140000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter... Your king\'s end... comes...', '', 139999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew dat scoundrel couldn\'t be trusted! He will pay for dis!', '', 139998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul promised a new empire, and we WILL have it!', '', 139997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Look around, Kao. You\'ve already lost! Lay down your arms!', '', 139996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the thunder\'s might. The terror of the steppes. I cannot lose!', '', 139995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are Zandalari! We never surrender!', 139994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuldazar is ours by birthright. Surrender and I may grant you a merciful death.', '', 139993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I had hoped for a greater challenge.', '', 139992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taz\'dingo! For King Rastakhan!', '', 139991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Habutu, you must tell King Rastakhan of Zul\'s treachery. $p and I will handle dis brute.', 139990, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrival of the Zandalari Fleet', 'Arrival of the Zandalari Fleet', 139989, 0, 0, 0, 79, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see what hats you have.', 'Let me see what hats you have.', 139988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it back?\n\nI mean, you made it back!\n\nBefore ya footsteps scared me, I was cleanin\' de inn with Zulsan just like I said I would... can you tell?', '', 139987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see those rocks!', 'Let\'s see those rocks!', 139986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me have good idea: you buy two hats, you wear one hat. You give other hat to friend, family, mate. Me no judge.', '', 139985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course I sell two hats at same time. I have two heads!$b$bI see you have only one head. Me sorry for you. But you can keep extra hat!', '', 139984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to buy hats? I have hats! Two for the price of two!', '', 139983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to be big and strong like Bol\'dar? Buy one of my rocks, then lift and smash with it every day. Then maybe you get big and strong.$b$bMaybe not as big or strong as me though.', '', 139982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buy Bol\'dar\'s rocks! I got the bestest rocks here, I sell for a good price!', '', 139981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! Wanna buy a rock? I got da best rocks.', '', 139980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart of Sethraliss is glowing red. What does it mean?', 'The Heart of Sethraliss is glowing red. What does it mean?', 139979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stay strong.', 'We must stay strong.', 139978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead Man\'s Pass be easy to spot. Just look for de dark, ominous rock formations to de northwest. It gonna be fun!', '', 139977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you get near their camp, you will be transformed into one of dem. But be careful! Dis disguise is not perfect.', '', 139976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De blood troll women are in charge of de war parties, so you will need to look like one. Trust me, dis will work!', '', 139975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should warn you, dis may hurt a little. Well... most likely a lot!', '', 139974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
