('', 'On my target!', 139398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soldiers will comb de city in case dere are others.', '', 139397, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack my enemy!', '', 139396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Applause sounds>', '', 139395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Applause sounds>', 139394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Applause sounds>', '', 139393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Applause sounds>', 139392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 91908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life, $p. Meet inside the temple. It\'s not safe here.', '', 139391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107492, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi! You\'re either talking or helping. Let\'s take the hunt to the water!', 139390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother Therold! Lord Stormsong! You\'ve arrived at a most fortuitous time! We require your aid!', '', 139389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at de others when you have my things. Preparations must be made.', '', 139388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, dere! Come, before de brutes return to finish me off.', '', 139387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey can take our land, but dey can never take our eternal souls.', '', 139386, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 106077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I will find my own way out of here.', 'Thank you. I will find my own way out of here.', 139385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! We are guarding Kaza\'jin\'s bijous with our lives.', 'Over here! We are guarding Kaza\'jin\'s bijous with our lives.', 139384, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 99172, 99173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get ready, Outriggers! These creatures are unlike anything we\'ve faced before!', 139383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 108344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your toes. The ranishu will eat anything... and I mean that in the very literal sense.', '', 139375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taji should be up the hill to the south if you\'re looking for him too.', 139374, 0, 53351, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me back at the caravan whenever you\'re done here. I\'m going to get started on the repairs.', '', 139372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Congratulations, $p. You survived an encounter with the ranishu. Few are so lucky.', '', 139371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strong and sturdy... This lumber will work perfectly for our caravan repairs.', '', 139370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repairs to the caravan are coming along nicely, thanks to that quality lumber you helped us get.', '', 139369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine... Hmm... Here it is! Scroll of Invisibility... This has to be it.', 139368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Focus! Dis is not de time for stories!', 139367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never told you that story? Oh, It was amazing! Let\'s see, where to begin...', '', 139366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear... this one looks like it\'s written in the Old Gods\' language. Where did you come across something like this?', 139365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Did you even bother reading it? But, uh, keep that handy. We\'ll need it when we\'re done with this mess.', '', 139364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see... Scroll of Eternal Return sound right?', 139363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, can you help me get back to Alby? I\'m sure he\'s worried sick.', '', 139362, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'ve saved the others, meet me on the eastern rise to confront the tidemistress!', '', 139361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meh, this could take all day! Princess, you don\'t realize how many scrolls this old timer has.', 139360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contrite words. Yet I must wonder whether he truly meant them.', 139359, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must join de others!', 'We must join de others!', 139358, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 99170, 99171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect de fleet!', 'Protect de fleet!', 139357, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 99168, 99169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Warport must not fall!', 'De Warport must not fall!', 139356, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 99166, 99167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In King Rastakhan\'s name!', 'In King Rastakhan\'s name!', 139355, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 99164, 99165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I knew I had that somewhere. This will keep us hidden enough to sneak around the blood trolls. Just stay close to me.', '', 139354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in the day, I could have handled a swarm of these slithering worms. They came at me in the dark. I was overrun! Their orders seem to be, boiled down, \"Hurry! Azshara wants her prize!\"', '', 139353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After Illidan faced defeat atop the Black Temple, I tried to let go of my feelings... my distrust and bitterness.', 139352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything you can share, my lord. We need as much information as we can gather.', '', 139351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are looking for something here. It will be for Azshara. We must stop them, or obfuscate their goal.', '', 139350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal... it rings out with a familiar voice.', '', 139349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A... a cult has taken hold of this town due to my inadequacy.', '', 139348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear it? It\'s Bwonsamdi\'s call! Eternity is near!', 'Do you hear it? It\'s Bwonsamdi\'s call! Eternity is near!', 139347, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord! Are you safe? What do you know?', '', 139346, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
