('Brannon!', '', 139345, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De voice... he is calling to us... we must obey!', 'De voice... he is calling to us... we must obey!', 139344, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening? I was sick in my bed... and now... where am I?', 'What is happening? I was sick in my bed... and now... where am I?', 139343, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for the emperor...', '', 139341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I failed my subjects. I lacked authority, and they sought direction elsewhere because of it.', '', 139339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My uncle placed me in charge of this village so I could acquire some easy leadership experience. But... a cult? How does one deal with a cult?!', '', 139338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand battles... a thousand victories...', '', 139336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thunder... can never... be silenced...', '', 139335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me, stranger. Conway and his men overthrew the village so fast... I didn\'t see it coming.', '', 139334, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm... fades...', '', 139333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is the will... of the gods...', '', 139329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even stone... breaks...', '', 139328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh is... weak...', '', 139327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empire... will never... fall...', '', 139326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make a fine slave!', '', 139317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the fury of the storm!', '', 139316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before me!', '', 139315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am power manifest!', '', 139314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari will honor their pact... or die!', '', 139312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush your skull in my hands!', '', 139311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will reforge our empire with your bones!', '', 139309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will serve!', '', 139308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brannon, you are naught but a foolish child. I have made a deal, and will lead this village to success without you!', '', 139307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need resources to hold them off. Spread out, and bring me some iron and lumber!', '', 139306, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you know of the island\'s sssecrets? Tell me!', 139305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ssseas will always be ours to rule!', '', 139304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will drown you beneath the waves!', '', 139303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now, enemies gather... and the shadows grow darker. From this day forward, the defense of our world... of all we hold dear... rests with you.', '', 139302, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven your commitment to Azeroth. Your dedication, your sacrifice, rivals my own. But more will be asked of you. So much more.', '', 139301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Well of Eternity. I am not one for sentiment... but if anything embodies my commitment to Azeroth, it is the font of power I created so long ago.', '', 139300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But enough dwelling on the past. The crystal I left for you to find holds not two messages, but three. The last is for you, champion.', '', 139299, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, I\'m off to the caravan. See you soon, $p!', 139298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion... I would have a word.', '', 139297, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have witnessed echoes of my past, hero. I ask your help to put these final matters to rest.', '', 139296, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 90774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, thank you for your aid today, Kona and $p. I am in your debt.', '', 139295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We would\'ve fought with you to the end, Sumber.', 139294, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m also glad to hear that Thun\'ka the Witherer escaped his binding. An elemental that powerful would be... problematic for us.', '', 139293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it was a shaman causing all of this chaos? Thank you for killing him.', '', 139292, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! Take that, ya filthy Horde scum!', '', 139291, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 105117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ritual is almost complete! I bind you, Thun\'ka the Witherer!', '', 139290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine, see if I care! Hmph... he acts like he built this place.', 139288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meh, what do you know! Stay here if you want. We\'re going ahead. I know every inch of this area.', '', 139287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those things will be the death of you! They\'re nastier than the blood trolls we encountered on the last pilgrimage.', '', 139286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! You\'re not the boss of anyone. We need to teach those butchers a lesson!', '', 139285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should stay and help us figure out a plan. The blood trolls are too much for you to fight.', 139284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kisha, Lashk. We\'re going to take care of these pests chopping up Torga.', '', 139283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'About time! I thought we were the only ones who cared about Torga being dead.', 139282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, look at that. The others are finally getting off their shells to come down.', '', 139281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soul of our world is in agony...', '', 139280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But now is not the time to ponder personal regrets. We must see to healing the world, champion.', '', 139279, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 90782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And yet... there were times when we fought for a common cause. A shared purpose. Those were good days.', '', 139278, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brother made selfish choices. Caused pain to so many. His transgressions are... difficult to forgive.', '', 139277, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 90780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for talk has passed. It seems he has a duty to fulfill... as do we. Let us be about it, champion.', 139276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I learned that he was alive, leading the fight against the Legion on the Broken Shore... I could not bring myself to speak to him.', 139275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a sorcerer\'s touch upon this crystal.', 139274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my lifetime, I have twice witnessed a sundering of the world. Mother Moon, I pray I do not see a third.', 139273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 90800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The road ahead will be long. Whatever comes, bring honor to the name... Stormrage.', '', 139271, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of Tyrande. Listen to her counsel. She was always the best of us.', '', 139270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have spent a lifetime fighting for the dream of what Azeroth could be. Now you must fight for what it is.', '', 139269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even when the Legion is gone, new threats will arise. There is no one I trust to face them more than you, brother.', '', 139268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But now, as my fate becomes clear, I wish to quiet the strife that has long divided us.', '', 139267, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You never trusted my intentions... though I suppose I did not make it easy for you.', '', 139266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was power I sought... but not to conquer or rule. It was a means to an end... to save Azeroth from an unstoppable foe.', '', 139265, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 90785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The teachings of Cenarius were always your path. I felt... another calling.', '', 139264, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 90784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion... Even in the womb, we grappled with one another. Struggle has followed us all our lives.', '', 139263, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 90783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of him, Tyrande. Though at times I wished your heart had made a different choice, in the end... I know it made the right one.', '', 139262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fate, my duty, are now clear to me. I leave Azeroth\'s defense to you... and to my brother.', '', 139261, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have always embodied the best of Azeroth, Tyrande. Your faith. Your devotion. Through the darkest times, my belief in you never wavered.', '', 139260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At those times when I faced doubt, I held true to one constant. One anchor. You.', '', 139259, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know that every path I took led toward a single purpose: saving our world. I could abide no half measures. No compromise.', '', 139258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But over time, that faith was lost. And like my brother, you came to believe that the choices I made had driven me to darkness.', '', 139257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande... Long ago, you trusted me enough to defy Malfurion\'s wishes and free me from my prison.', '', 139256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 90792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
