('', 'We appreciate your help, $c. The situation was looking pretty grim before you arrived.', 138859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will move to scout further in town. Pray that the people there are safe!', '', 138853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! You have gained control of the Curseformed Thrall!', '', 138852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone!', '', 138849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Happy now? Am I moving around enough for you?', 138848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m just standing here? Okay... how\'s this? Does this count as pilgriming?', 138847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world cries out to us, $n. We must fight to save it.', '', 138842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach, little $pr. I would have words with you.', '', 138841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan requested that I bring this crystal to you.', 'Illidan requested that I bring this crystal to you.', 138840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though I cannot abide the actions of your warchief, $r, we must fight together to save our world.', 138839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must continue to stand together, $n. We must not let the dark times divide us.', 138838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to do some asking around myself. Meet me in town!', 138837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
