('', 'When you wish to return to Silithus as it appears in the present, you have but to ask.', 138835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stay strong.', '', 138833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
