('Thank you, stranger. I thought I was done for.', 'Thank you, stranger. I thought I was done for.', 138769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive de intrusion, my friend. I have come with an urgent request for $n.', '', 138768, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you, stranger? Not a blood troll... or de spirits would have cut you down.', '', 138767, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 98524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... something is coming dis way.', '', 138766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis ruin is sacred to Bwonsamdi. De blood trolls won\'t be following us here.', '', 138765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have many of them, but the ones I do are at your disposal.', '', 138762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde is falling back again? What is their strategy here?', 138760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t let the warchief escape. Capturing her is the only way to win this war.', '', 138759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing...', '', 138758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cove belongs to Tidemistress Nazesh! We will unlock what has been hidden in Zuldazar!', '', 138757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh. Fresh meat.', 'Heh. Fresh meat.', 138756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, we\'re skipping that part. I know a place we can hide out while we gather information.', '', 138755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hazing. He means hazing.', '', 138754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
