('Dis place is sacred. It is my mission to protect it for eternity.', '', 138749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many pilgrims used to stay here on their way to de Necropolis.\n\nIt is quiet dese days... Not good. Not good at all.', '', 138748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been guarding dis sanctuary since it was first built. And I will do so until it crumbles to dust.', '', 138747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All who are headed to de Necropolis are welcome here.', '', 138746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Bwonsamdi\'s will, I offer rest to travelers who journey to his temple.', '', 138745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking good. Let\'s tell the recruiter we\'ve come to volunteer.', '', 138744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put the hat on. You can\'t be a scurvy sea dog without a hat!', '', 138743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only require a few more minutes, Rosaline. With the help of the enhanced harpoons, you shall triumph over your quarry!', '', 138742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okri, what\'s the status of our supplies? I want to get out into the water as soon as we can. Time\'s wastin\'!', 138741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 108355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye? What you want?', '', 138740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I\'ll return to Boralus empty-handed for now. Meet me there with the scroll and we shall work out your compensation.', '', 138739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, this is important: The scroll you\'re trading for is sealed with green wax. It MUST be green!', '', 138738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The man you are looking for is named Carentan. His shop is upstairs, at the south end of town.', '', 138737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re ya biting me for? I got no meat on me bones.', '', 138734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
