('Thanks for releasin\' me... I be lettin\' ya live for that.', '', 138728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear this may be the end of me...', '', 138726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch where you digging! I be sleepin\' down there!', 'Watch where you digging! I be sleepin\' down there!', 138725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits in this area may not sit by idly while you decimate their land...', '', 138724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think it\'s a good idea to drop bombs on those bones!', '', 138723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I questioned many trolls about Xibala, and received a different story from all regardless of my interrogation methods.\n\nSome said that Xibala made people\'s bodies swell up with putrefaction.\n\nOr anyone who laid eyes on him became a living skeleton.\n\nOr he lurked in the shadows and came out at night and devoured people while they slept.\n\nOr he waited near the roads and caused people to die coughing up blood. \n\nNo wonder the locals stay away!', '', 138722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been an age since I last gazed upon this place. Even then, the locals feared and avoided it... \n\nEvil spirits lurk here, $n. Best not to disturb them.', '', 138721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t be wanderin\' in Zem\'lan\'s alleys, rat. Get \'em, Kiffa!', 'Shouldn\'t be wanderin\' in Zem\'lan\'s alleys, rat. Get \'em, Kiffa!', 138717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
