('Gettin\' thirsty? Too bad!', '', 138701, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick up the pace, you slackers. I need more grog!', '', 138700, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured Drywhisker Mine!', '$n has captured Drywhisker Mine!', 138699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t ever run off like that again. Do you hear me? Now, let\'s get moving. We have work to do.', 138698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... please, calm down, calm down everyone! We are doing the best we can. We shall find a cure, and the cause!', '', 138691, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must help us, Therold! We need answers! We need a cure!', 138690, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is causing this illness?!', '', 138689, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our children are falling ill!', 138688, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on back for da rematch...', 'Come on back for da rematch...', 138687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been drinkin\' all day for dis one...', 'I been drinkin\' all day for dis one...', 138686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gulnaku\'s not gonna be pleased about this.', 'Gulnaku\'s not gonna be pleased about this.', 138679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Stay away from me treasure map!', 'Stay away from me treasure map!', 138678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring a vulpera head, get a discount on your first purchase!', '', 138676, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grog a day keeps the flog away!', '', 138675, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never have too many eyepatches!', '', 138674, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look like Zem\'lan himself with Patches\' latest headwear!', '', 138673, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoksa knows mojo best! Pick up his latest potions today!', '', 138672, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New cutlasses in stock! Extra sharp!', '', 138671, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight alongside a fearsome tiger today!', '', 138670, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get yer vulpera steaks, freshly cooked!', '', 138669, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Half off Oggo for the rest of the day...', 'Half off Oggo for the rest of the day...', 138668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can make me own way out. Be careful.', 138666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clean up the mess... before you go.', 'Clean up the mess... before you go.', 138664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s make this inn your home... permanently!', 'Let\'s make this inn your home... permanently!', 138663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Lo $c, we need yer help with a smidge of a problem.', '', 138662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be bound to Zem\'lan\'s will, forever.', 'We be bound to Zem\'lan\'s will, forever.', 138661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gave everything to protect me crew. You ain\'t goin\' no further!', 'I gave everything to protect me crew. You ain\'t goin\' no further!', 138660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We return from da grave, ready to fight.', 'We return from da grave, ready to fight.', 138659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t I killed ya already? Or were dat ya killed me?', 'Ain\'t I killed ya already? Or were dat ya killed me?', 138658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feast upon your flesh and offer your soul to my master!', '', 138655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will strip the flesh from your bones!', '', 138652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight well for a pathetic land-dweller... but this ends now!', '', 138651, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run fast, ya rag. I got all of eternity to hunt you down.', 'Run fast, ya rag. I got all of eternity to hunt you down.', 138650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody be takin\' dis treasure from me! Not you, not Zem\'lan, not nobody!', 'Nobody be takin\' dis treasure from me! Not you, not Zem\'lan, not nobody!', 138649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our empire\'s dawn is your extinction!', 'Our empire\'s dawn is your extinction!', 138644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103635, 103636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let your death be a lesson to the others!', 'Let your death be a lesson to the others!', 138641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103637, 103638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, $pr. I\'m not gonna fight ya.\n\nZem\'lan did this to me. He did this to all of us, whether we be wantin\' it or not.\n\nLook at me...\n\n<Gentle Guntha sighs heavily.>\n\nYou want a drink?', '', 138634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wanna survive Vol\'dun, you gotta look death in da eyes each moment... and never blink.', '', 138633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No prey, no pay.', 'Your treasure... it be mine now.', 138631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107143, 107144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De curse makes us strong!', 'I\'ve sacrificed everything for Zem\'lan.', 138628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107147, 107148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zem\'lan don\'t suffer de living no more.', 'If you ain\'t part of de crew, you be dead!', 138627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107145, 107146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been defending dis port for countless years.', 'Dis be our port!', 138625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107141, 107142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out dere! De sethrak are not to be underestimated...', '', 138624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An\' done! Thanks for the the assistance.', 138623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost finished....', 138622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve finally reached the actual relics, now that all of the additions are out o\' the way. Shouldn\'t be too long now.', 138621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And this collection of bones must be courtesy of Birch, given the teeth marks on them.', 138620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A \"genuine Cranklefuse Prototype\". What a waste of metal, no space for trash though.', 138619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of our most valuable finds were left behind in this crate. Watch my back, $c, while I secure as much as possible.', 138618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Changes from normal skin into cosmic purple power skin. Should sound like a forbidden incantation, chant/murmur invoking dark powers. Not painful or stressful: Total 3-5>', '', 138617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Changes from normal skin into cosmic purple power skin. Should sound like a forbidden incantation, chant/murmur invoking dark powers. Not painful or stressful: Total 3-5>', 138616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not abandon the temple.', '', 138615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not enough energy.', 138614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Player takes significant wound: Total 5>', '', 138611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Player takes a wound: Total 10>', '', 138602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Variant roar>', '', 138601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Roar of dominance>', '', 138600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Long attack with wind up. Jump attacks: Total 5-7>', '', 138598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dying sounds: Total 5>', '', 138593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Charging to attack enemy: Total 5-7>', '', 138592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Convey summoning power. Energy buildup: Total 5-7>', '', 138591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Release spell, throwing energy: Total 3-5>', '', 138590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as this temple stands, you are welcome to seek shelter within its walls.', '', 138589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Convey releasing power or charging enemy: Total 4-6>', '', 138586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Big attack: Total 5>', '', 138579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Standard attack: Total 10>', '', 138569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oooh! When I catch my breath I\'m soo going to kick you in the shins for that!', 138568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! I am not a dog! And I\'m surprised you can even run with those stubby legs of yours. I was certain you would just roll down any general incline.', '', 138567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An opening! I\'ll race you out, Birch! Bet you can\'t catch me, even if you are part dog!', 138566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to fight!', '', 138565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos must see this through!', '', 138564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot be real!', '', 138563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop T\'paartos!', '', 138562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the fists of T\'paartos!', '', 138561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Light!', '', 138560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to fight!', '', 138559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos!', '', 138558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... There...', '', 138557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Stromgarde Courtyard!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Stromgarde Courtyard!', 138556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured Stromgarde Courtyard!', '$n has captured Stromgarde Courtyard!', 138555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos made friends with critters. Frogs, elekk, bugs... but not snakes. Never snakes!', '', 138554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s an ambush! Defend the villagers!', 138553, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $n. We ride to Highroad Pass!', 138552, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re right, my lady. Form up, men. We ride!', '', 138551, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not hear it, Marshal. This $c will accompany me and ensure I come to no harm.', 138550, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But my lady, it would be safer if--', '', 138549, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 97621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal, you and your men will travel to Arom\'s Stand. I will meet you there after a brief detour.', 138548, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Valorcall Pass!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Valorcall Pass!', 138547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured Valorcall Pass!', '$n has captured Valorcall Pass!', 138546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who be next?', '', 138545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to da eternal crew of the damned, First Mate.', '', 138544, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raaagh!', '', 138543, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Mate Jamboya, be reborn!', '', 138542, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step forward and receive me gift. Join me crew for eternity!', '', 138540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be our home. We gonna do whatever it takes to hold dis port... Forever!', '', 138539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO!', 'NO!', 138538, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da sethrak think we gonna roll over and die. What say you?', '', 138537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\ABILITY_WARRIOR_COLOSSUSSMASH.BLP:20|t The Garothi Worldbreaker rears back for |cFFF00000|Hspell:244969|h[Eradication]|h|r! Run away!', '', 138536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t stay dead long... I be seein\' ya soon, Jamboya...', '', 138535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mutiny by me own first mate?! I\'ll keelhaul ya!', '', 138534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho! What bilgesuckers be darin\' to challenge me?', '', 138533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mother... will take you...', 138532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are fools to resist. The Heartsbane will claim Kul Tiras!', 138531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll protect the lady, mainlander. Take out their leader!', '', 138530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mother will have you, Lucille Waycrest!', 138529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in creation is that?', '', 138528, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The traps aren\'t slowing them down anymore. More incoming!', '', 138527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm down, Kal\'dran. We can still defeat Zardrax.', 'Calm down, Kal\'dran. We can still defeat Zardrax.', 138526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you return me to the present time?', 'Can you return me to the present time?', 138525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you show me what Silithus was like before the Wound in the World?', 'Can you show me what Silithus was like before the Wound in the World?', 138524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silithus was a sickened land before Sargeras struck, but at least there was life within the sands.\n\nIs your business in the past complete, champion?', 138523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silithus has ever been a magnet for ancient, malevolent powers.\n\nI could open a timeway to reveal how the Black Empire once sprawled across these sands. Or show you wars waged between mighty armies.\n\nSo much history. So much pain.\n\nBut that can wait. I believe you are here for another purpose.', 138522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, constable. Shall we, $c?', 138521, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Waycrest, you are free to go... with my apologies...', '', 138520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention! It has been determined that another witch was in fact responsible for the curse in Fletcher\'s Hollow.', '', 138519, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s better. Now, let\'s--', 138518, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...just get myself another blood troll. Dey are endless, and you are doomed!', '', 138517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Nana\'kwug! Now I have to...', '', 138516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha... your efforts are meaningless. You will never stop my power!', '', 138515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think dis makes a difference? The Blood God\'s power flows through me! You cannot stop it!', '', 138514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power... fades! Haha... you must be desperate to think this will work!', '', 138513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out! Enemies from the woods!', '', 138509, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere! Dat be da most I can be givin\' ya without hurtin\' meself too much. Go and burn dem skeleton mounds.', '', 138502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya stay focused while I be givin\' ya part of me fire mojo...', '', 138501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to receive your fire mojo to destroy the burial mounds.', 'I\'m ready to receive your fire mojo to destroy the burial mounds.', 138500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well then, it looks like we\'re going to have to take the fight to the coven. I think I know how to do just that.', 138499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They... they have him, my lady. We were working on a way to extract him when we heard word of this... trial.', '', 138498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And my father? What is he doing to combat this incursion?', 138497, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve overrun much of the land past the mountains. We\'ve only a handful left holding Arom\'s Stand.', '', 138496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is worse than you know, my lady. This coven has spread like wildfire throughout Drustvar.', '', 138495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal! What do you know of this coven? Tell me what is happening to our land!', 138494, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sate my hunger... and I\'ll sate yours.', '', 138493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When studying shadow magic, one learns to be flexible. Very... flexible.', '', 138492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a rule, I don\'t sprout tentacles. But in your case, I\'ll make an exception.', '', 138491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void has taught me many secrets. Some of them can be most... satisfying.', '', 138489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do my best work in the shadows. Allow me to demonstrate.', '', 138488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I into? Let\'s just say some of my proclivities can run a bit... dark.', '', 138487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withdraw!', '', 138486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must retreat!', '', 138485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back!', '', 138484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
