('', 'Whoa! Check out what ol\' Zem\'lan used to look like!', 138449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zem\'lan was kind of a jerk, huh?', 138448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Gods... I mean, really? Some have mouths for eyes, others have eyes for mouths. Talk about a hot mess...', '', 138447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fact that I wield void energies doesn\'t mean I plan to consume everything I see. After all, I have a figure to maintain.', '', 138446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria is my favorite Windrunner sister. Edgier than Vereesa, but slightly less homicidal than the dead one.', '', 138445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you believe purple has always been my favorite color? Even before I went void, I mean.', '', 138444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say what you will about the tenets of the Void. At least it\'s an ethos!', '', 138443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for tall dark, and brooding, that\'s me. Well, dark and brooding, at least.', '', 138442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you\'re thinking... \"Oh goody, another elf.\" Well... I bet you weren\'t expecting a VOID elf, now were you?', '', 138441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 91356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acknowledged.', '', 138440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 92867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get da idols and round up da crew.', '', 138439, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da sethrak not be takin\' our home from us. Not today. Not ever.', '', 138438, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I-I-I... There must be another way, Captain. De crew...', '', 138437, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this a trick? It is, isn\'t it?', 'You\'re a lifesaver. I would have died down here!', 138436, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 107253, 107254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time for introductions. I\'m not spending another minute in this mine.', 'No time for introductions. I\'m not spending another minute in this mine.', 138435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be questionin\' me! Get everyone to da altar. Now!', '', 138434, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sure am happy to see you.', 'I sure am happy to see you.', 138433, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t know who you are or what you want, but thanks.', 'Don\'t know who you are or what you want, but thanks.', 138432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
