('', 'Follow me.', 138084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will lead you.', 138083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way.', 138082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike my target!', 138081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assist me!', 138080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack my enemy!', 138079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Congratulations are in order.', 138078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most impressive.', 138077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done.', 138076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 92504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, would you mind assisting in the inspection of these horses? Only the perfect horse will do!', '', 138075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lazy workers always stealing \'em. If you can\'t find any grog, search the workers.', '', 138074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I store my extra stock underwater. Helps cool \'em down.', '', 138073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You alright, fleshy $pr. Let me know if you need something to drink.', '', 138072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hyah!', 138071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re lucky I can\'t kick any higher! Don\'t deny it! You set off the trap!', 138070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! That was my shin!', '', 138069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mess? MY MESS? I believe YOU were the one to set it off, you insufferable pip-', '', 138068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '-to fix your mess!', 138067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then let\'s get out of here and find someone to trade with. I\'m starving.', 138066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'And, hey, I knicked enough gems and trinkets along the way to cover costs for a month.', 138065, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, yeah. I love you all too.', 138064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing left for us here, guys. Let\'s pack up and get moving.', 138061, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t say I\'m surprised. Dispelling the curse was a long shot.', 138060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to see how the sausage is made?', '', 138059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s got your bacon? I do! Heh heh!', '', 138058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make for some fine bacon!', '', 138057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... Grind you...', '', 138056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... Doomed...', '', 138055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the winds carry you, $p.... and don\'t become one of them, okay?', 138054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll sneak back to the caravan and get everyone ready to ransack this place after you lift the curse.', 138053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s the notes I found. You only need a couple more things to perform the ritual.', 138052, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We really appreciate you saving our skins, $c.  All that curse-battling must have left you famished, though.\n\nCare for some sausages?', '', 138051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, enjoy the party. Ride! Eat! Drink! You, my friend, are my honored guest.', '', 138050, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 108431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, not only did you save my son, but also my festival! Folks will be talking about this one for years!', '', 138049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You here for food, or something else?', 138048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revitalizing', 'Revitalizing', 138047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll stay here while you find the other idols. Bring them back here when you have them all.', 138046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of the idols too. Grab it for me, will you?', 138045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think this was Zem\'lan\'s throne room. There\'s treasure everywhere!', 138044, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to position! Do not falter in your ranks!', '', 138042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meeki is likely already dead. Get out of Zem\'lan while you can.', 138040, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a big, fat $pr angel! My hero!', 138039, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took Ahna to the south, but I\'m getting out of here!', '', 138038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to my temple while my strength returns. I will wait for you there.', '', 138037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free at last.', '', 138036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back to me soon, Norah.', '', 138035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we leave now, we\'ll starve out in the dunes.', 138034, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No we can\'t. And you know that.', 138033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to do this, Norah. We can pack up and leave Zem\'lan behind us.', '', 138032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look after the caravan while I\'m away, Viggy.', 138031, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been gone a long time. Let\'s hope I still have a few friends inside.', '', 138029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have proof that the Ashvane Company\'s been selling weapons to these scumbags, come find me up the hill at the main gate.', '', 138028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'ve got your... legs. What next?', 'Alright, I\'ve got your... legs. What next?', 138026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is going to be the most exciting festival in years! Hop onto Cooper and show the troggs what for. You will find him most useful in combat!', '', 138025, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 108435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fallhaven no doubt owes you a great debt, $c. \n\nI only hope there is some way we can repay it.', '', 138024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and Cooper make a wonderful team! Feel free to ride him around the estate as much as you\'d like.', '', 138023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most may not know what you did for dem, but I will never forget.', '', 138021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish $c! You dare challenge me here, in my domain!?', 138020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one will hear your cries!', 138019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grand welcome to our esteemed guest, $gLord:Lady; $n!', '', 138018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I announce the arrival of $gLord:Lady; $n!', '', 138017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my pleasure to welcome $gLord:Lady; $n to the Norwington Estate!', '', 138016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m Jane. I was a sellsword serving on a merchant vessel before the sirens dragged us in.$B$BThese folks fished me outta the tideway, gave me a nickname, and have been like family ever since.$B$BThey may seem a bit odd, but they\'re good, honest people. For some of them, washing up here was a welcome change from whatever life they endured before. A chance to start over. Others are just trying to survive until they can get back home.', 138015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xenxuju made me drink from de Chalice of Thunder. Thanks to Xenxuju, soon we will all be one with Akunda!', '', 138014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kel\'vax have... plenty of offerings... ta be killin\' ya...', 138013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tink I\'ll add ya to Kel\'vax\'s corpse offerings!', 138012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, everybody... Hold on!', '', 138010, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 90094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D-d-don\'t scare \'em away, Norah. W-w-we need their help.', 'D-d-don\'t scare \'em away, Norah. W-w-we need their help.', 138009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, stranger. Have you heard the legend of Zem\'lan?', 'Tell me, stranger. Have you heard the legend of Zem\'lan?', 138008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_GIZMO_FELIRONBOMB.BLP:20|t A |cFFFF0000|Hspell:244722|h[Shock Grenade]|h|r is attached to you!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_GIZMO_FELIRONBOMB.BLP:20|t A |cFFFF0000|Hspell:244722|h[Shock Grenade]|h|r is attached to you!', 138007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brethren hate me much as they hate you. How... convenient. Bring me their eyes that I may feast on their visions.', '', 138006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The so-called All-Seer sends his pawns to kill me? Hah!', '', 138005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to just leave Hakmud here?', '', 138004, 0, 52907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakmud never get time to relax. Not even on his own world!', '', 138003, 0, 52907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now everybody of Argus. Hakmud did not want to be special anyways!', '', 138002, 0, 52907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not like Hakmud wanted to see his namesake or anything. Goodbye!', '', 138001, 0, 52907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take Hakmud home and abandon him. Hakmud sees how it is!', '', 138000, 0, 52907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'m gonna stand back over there. The, uh, light\'s better for reading. Good luck!', '', 137999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Think back to another time>', '<Think back to another time>', 137998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Inspect Backpack>', '<Inspect Backpack>', 137997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall Alleria\'s encounter with the Dark Naruu>', '<Recall Alleria\'s encounter with the Dark Naruu>', 137996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the resurrection of Xe\'ra>', '<Recall the resurrection of Xe\'ra>', 137995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the journey to Argus>', '<Recall the journey to Argus>', 137994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This is a child-sized  backpack. A \'Junior Explorer\' pin is attached to the back.>', '', 137993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the events of Argus>', '<Recall the events of Argus>', 137992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the events of the Tomb of Sargeras>', '<Recall the events of the Tomb of Sargeras>', 137991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the events on the Broken Isles>', '<Recall the events on the Broken Isles>', 137990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the events before the arrival of the Legion>', '<Recall the events before the arrival of the Legion>', 137989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just grab one more piece of treasure before I go...', 'I\'ll just grab one more piece of treasure before I go...', 137988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107310, 107311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I won\'t look back.', 'Thank you. I won\'t look back.', 137987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve made a huge mistake.', 'I\'ve made a huge mistake.', 137986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen their monster pets? This place is a nightmare.', 'Have you seen their monster pets? This place is a nightmare.', 137985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $pr. I wouldn\'t have lasted much longer.', 'Thank you, $pr. I wouldn\'t have lasted much longer.', 137984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', 'I am in your debt.', 137983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the last of my caravan...', 'I\'m the last of my caravan...', 137982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I\'ve seen...', 'The things I\'ve seen...', 137981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relieve these demons of their existence!', 'Relieve these demons of their existence!', 137980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike true! Show these demons no mercy!', 'Strike true! Show these demons no mercy!', 137979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring these demons down!', 'Bring these demons down!', 137978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give these demons a swift death.', 'Give these demons a swift death.', 137977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show these demons no mercy!', 'Show these demons no mercy!', 137976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari! Stand your ground! The demons will meet their end.', 'Illidari! Stand your ground! The demons will meet their end.', 137975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help these demons meet their end.', 'Help these demons meet their end.', 137974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari! Show these demons a quick death.', 'Illidari! Show these demons a quick death.', 137973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion comes. Ready your glaives.', 'The Burning Legion comes. Ready your glaives.', 137972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion encroaches upon our camp. Be ready.', 'The Burning Legion encroaches upon our camp. Be ready.', 137971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shimmers as it fades into its surroundings.', '', 137970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons swarm the skies, poised to attack. Ready yourselves for battle.', 'The demons swarm the skies, poised to attack. Ready yourselves for battle.', 137969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari! The Burning Legion\'s presence grows near!', 'Illidari! The Burning Legion\'s presence grows near!', 137968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons come. Ready your blades.', 'The demons come. Ready your blades.', 137967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground, Illidari! The demons come.', 'Stand your ground, Illidari! The demons come.', 137966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion approaches. Prepare yourselves.', 'The Burning Legion approaches. Prepare yourselves.', 137965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons approach. Ready your glaives!', 'The demons approach. Ready your glaives!', 137964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The northern skies swell with chaotic energy.', 'The northern skies swell with chaotic energy.', 137963, 0, 52240, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons approach. Hold them off as long as we can!', 'The demons approach. Hold them off as long as we can!', 137962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons incoming! Prepare yourselves!', 'Demons incoming! Prepare yourselves!', 137961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defensive positions! The Legion approaches!', 'Defensive positions! The Legion approaches!', 137960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies will be swarming soon enough. Ready your blades!', 'The skies will be swarming soon enough. Ready your blades!', 137959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pheta thones gamera. Here they come!', 'Pheta thones gamera. Here they come!', 137958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light guide us... The demons come!', 'Light guide us... The demons come!', 137957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons fast approach! Prepare for battle!', 'The demons fast approach! Prepare for battle!', 137956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons at the ready!', 'Weapons at the ready!', 137955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons come! Make haste for the Vindicaar!', 'The demons come! Make haste for the Vindicaar!', 137954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion approaches! Seek cover!', 'The Legion approaches! Seek cover!', 137953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons! Inbound! Get to safety at once!', 'Demons! Inbound! Get to safety at once!', 137952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons approach! Everyone to the Vindicaar. Quickly!', 'The demons approach! Everyone to the Vindicaar. Quickly!', 137951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The camp is about to be overrun. We must get to safety!', 'The camp is about to be overrun. We must get to safety!', 137950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light... The demons come again! We must evacuate.', 'By the Light... The demons come again! We must evacuate.', 137949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back! We are no longer safe here.', 'Fall back! We are no longer safe here.', 137948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone to the Vindicaar at once!', 'Everyone to the Vindicaar at once!', 137947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the Attuning Crystal.>', '<Take the Attuning Crystal.>', 137946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for coming. I have my suspicions about these spirits here, but I will need some of their essence to learn the truth.$b$bTake this attuning crystal and use it near any spirits that seem more solid than others.$b$bBe careful, though-- they may become angered by the attuning.', 137945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Turalyon is staring grimly at Illidan.>', '', 137944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light...', '', 137943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will we do now?', '', 137942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was... unexpected. To think he had enough power to destroy her...', 137941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe my eyes...', '', 137940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What just happened? Did he... kill her?', 137939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vashreen? He mentioned something about procuring new items and relocating to the Vindicaar on Argus.', 137938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did Thaumaturge Vashreen go with the Relinquished items?', 'Where did Thaumaturge Vashreen go with the Relinquished items?', 137937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you mean to do that?', '', 137936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here, Prophet?', 'What happened here, Prophet?', 137935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been so very long since I have laid eyes on this place. The memories... overwhelm me.', '', 137934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya friend\'s dead, $pr. Dis be no place for mortals.', '', 137926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So there was a troll named Zem\'lan who used to rule this port? This must be his throne room then.', 137925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... It was gonna be a pilgrimage for tortollans to hear Torga\'s stories. But... Yeah... I guess you can come with us.', '', 137924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fresh set of eyes... just what I needed.', '', 137922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh finally, something worth watching! Go on then, entertain me.', '', 137921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why wait for your friends? You are a strong, powerful mortal!', '', 137920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I\'ve seen this before. It didn\'t work out for the last guy.', '', 137919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is what passes for skill among mortals? Interesting...', '', 137918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stop what you\'re doing on my account. I\'ll be right here.', '', 137917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind me, just watching your every move.', '', 137916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some demons enjoy standing in the fire... you should try it sometime.', '', 137915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t go that way if I were you...', '', 137914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have de perfect remedy for nosy trespassers like you!', '', 137913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always liked that little guy. The robot, I mean.', '', 137912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a toy robot. A little wind-up fellow I bought from a gnome back in Boralus.', '', 137911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gathering de reagents needed for your communion is de first step towards redemption.', '', 137909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not keep Xenxuju waiting... but be careful! He is not de type to mess around with.', '', 137908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s continues rambling about taking responsibility for your own actions for several minutes.', '', 137907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Probably my compass. It never led me astray! Well, until we ended up here. But that\'s hardly the compass\' fault, I mean it\'s an inanimate object you can\'t really blame--', '', 137906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, fine, you can come along... but keep the noise down! This is a pilgrimage, not a party.', '', 137905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step, mortal.', '', 137904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amazing... but we have work to do. Dis leaves two loa. We must join de tortollans on their pilgrimage to see Torga, de turtle loa.', 137903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are telling me dat you got Bwonsamdi\'s aid... and KILLED Hir\'eek?!', 137902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh that\'s easy! My trusty lunchbox. Never had a bad meal outta that lunchbox. I miss it dearly.', '', 137901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Free at last!', 137900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mistress will bind your soul next!', '', 137899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Tell Talanji about getting Bwonsamdi\'s aid and killing Hir\'eek.)', '(Tell Talanji about getting Bwonsamdi\'s aid and killing Hir\'eek.)', 137898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mistress will use your soul next!', '', 137897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die for her glory!', '', 137896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill you for the Mistress!', '', 137895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gotta leave now... I be changin\' soon and I don\'t want you to see what I become...', 137894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Name\'s Bill. You got anything needs fixin\', I\'m yer man.', '', 137893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It be too late for me... but there still be hope for da others.', 137892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, traveler! You wash up with the tides like the rest of us?$B$BI know it\'s not much, but you\'re welcome to stay in our little camp as long as you\'d like.', '', 137891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search de desert for de missing initiates. I\'ll be right here waiting for you.', '', 137890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s your favorite thing you lost in the wreck?', 'What\'s your favorite thing you lost in the wreck?', 137889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got anything to eat?', '', 137888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t good. Not at all. Everybody, out of the wagon! Quick!', 137887, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 105971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those are Jakra\'zet\'s troops!', 137886, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 105875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think those trolls up ahead are friends of yours.', 137885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<You catch Alleria out of the corner of your eye. She\'s looking at your bow.>', 137877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad that Khadgar chose to accompany you. His is the only face among your cohort that I recognize. Has it truly been so long?$b$b<Turalyon\'s gaze shifts away from you.>$b$bHah! I can see he still hasn\'t changed. Speak his name and...', '', 137876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen you taking an interest in our warframes, champion. They are truly fearsome instruments of war, capable of dealing and withstanding much damage. They are even capable of flight, although we need to keep a low profile to avoid attracting the attention of the Legion.', '', 137875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a joy beyond words to look up in the sky and see Azeroth once more. Home, so close that I feel like I can reach up and touch it.$b$bBut within the grasp of the Legion. We must stop them before we can plan on returning.', '', 137874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Army of the Light will not rest until we have destroyed the Burning Legion.', '', 137873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is nice to see new, friendly faces. It has been so long since I have seen another $Gman:woman; from Azeroth!', '', 137872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Alleria gives you a wry smile.>$b$bAnother beautiful day on Argus.$b$bAlthough, now that I can see our home in the sky, I am filled with hope. Returning home is no longer a dream. It is a certainty.', 137871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Vindicaar is truly a marvel of the Light, a symbol of what the eredar were. What the draenei still are. Although, do take note that not all of the rooms are as magnificent as this. Some of them are quite confining.', 137870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You should have run away when you had de chance! De power of Akunda will be mine!', '', 137869, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is truly remarkable how much time has passed, even for an elf. Surely much has changed on Azeroth in our absence.', 137864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many demons, so many targets...', 137863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dolly! Dot! Wait! It\'s not safe down there!', 137860, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 105972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have faced the Legion on Azeroth and Draenor, even witnessed their corruption seeping through the timeways.\n\nBut until the rift to Argus opened, I could never have conceived the true depths of their evil. To see how they have twisted this world...\n\nThey will do the same to Azeroth unless we stop them.', '', 137858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, look at dis... You came back alive, $n!', '', 137857, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 99348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do hope the other members of the Council of Six are all right. I mean, of course they\'re going to be fine. They are all powerful archmagi! Yes. This is fine.', '', 137856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One by one, we have defeated the mightiest agents of the Legion. But now we must face their true power...', '', 137855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lightforged appear to be infused with the very essence of the Light. It is no wonder they have been such a powerful force against the Legion.', '', 137854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After Illidan opened the way to Argus, I was sure that we had made a grave mistake. Now, I believe there is hope.$b$bI must believe there is hope.', '', 137852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of the sethrak empire!', 'For the glory of the sethrak empire!', 137851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103639, 103640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Aethas seems to be bothered by something.>', '', 137850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel magic has permeated this entire world. It is difficult to say if there is any part of it that isn\'t corrupted.', '', 137849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a remarkable vessel. It seems to use the crystals the draenei are so fond of to stay afloat. Perhaps we can use these crystals to store arcane powers as well?', '', 137848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here to provide what support we can. Good luck out there, champion.', '', 137847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new world, if it can be called that.$b$bSo this is what the Legion wishes to do to Azeroth...', '', 137846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long after the emerald flame took our home, the Legion took to open a gate to a new world. Never had they lusted for any conquest as much as this lush, primitive land.\n\nJust as their armies set forth, a green-skinned warrior stepped through the gate. He wielded a single blade -- and roared a single cry for battle.\n\nMountains of flesh and bone grew as he carved through the demons\' ranks. His defiance drew the attention of the Dark One -- who came to see his end.\n\nThe warrior struck but one blow before he fell, but it was never forgotten.', '', 137845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Romuul.', 'I am ready, Romuul.', 137844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mac\'Aree... it looks just like how I remember it. The forests, the hills, the herds of talbuk...$b$bI wonder if my old workshop is still down there. Do you think if you had a moment, you could ...?$b$bForgive me. You have much more important things to do. Let me know when you are ready to go to the surface.', '', 137843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe what has befallen our world.$b$bLooking out there, I see nothing but hatred. Nothing but desolation.$b$bPart of me is glad that I must stay here aboard the Vindicaar. I would not want to set hoof on that accursed ground.$b$bI have locked in coordinates below our position, close enough for you to establish the teleporter. Let me know when you have finished your preparations.', '', 137842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tales often echo throughout the hovel\'s porous, rocky surroundings. Whispers of brave krokul scouts - those responsible for locating survivors after the Burning Legion made their mark upon this world.$B$BOne such tale speaks of an encounter with one of the Dark One\'s fel-emblazoned demon lords whose size was only surpassed by its power to wield destruction.$B$BThis monstrous, horned skull cap is all that remains. A reminder to the Krokul people that tales often begin with eager exploration in search of hope, and often end in grievous distress and suffering, but sometimes... victory.', '', 137841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ink is marred from endless eons of weathering, rendering the text illegible.', '', 137840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of the flora on Argus has long succumbed to its inevitable demise, though a once-journeyed cavern, whose location was never truly revealed, yielded this magnificent specimen.$B$BSince its arrival, the aura surrounding this mysterious plant has yet to dim below the level of a radiantly glowing crystal, once a prominent fixture among the Argussian landscape, but now only a memory of stories past.', '', 137839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crafted by an ancient Krokul smith, the scythe\'s markings reveal a strenuous history of battle between the Burning Legion and the Krokul.$B$BIts foggy, shale-colored blade is chipped, speckled with a darkened, dried liquid around the blade\'s edge.$B$BThe taut handle crafted from talbuk hide is well-worn, with a slight imprint of where its owner\'s grip once wielded this magnificent tool-turned-weapon into battle.', '', 137838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, the withering slaves of the Annihilan Pits held their ground in a rebellious effort to free the people of Krokuun from their bonds.$B$BThese shackles remind the inhabitants of Krokuun of the struggles endured to retain what semblance of freedom remains.', '', 137837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am home. I have been lost for so long, stranded on a strange world with strange people... There are no words for this moment.', '', 137836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think Aargon will let me switch to Consular? I don\'t think I\'m very good at this at all. Surely I can manage a familiar or two at least!', 'Do you think Aargon will let me switch to Consular? I don\'t think I\'m very good at this at all. Surely I can manage a familiar or two at least!', 137835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope I am selected to be a Wakener. Soulbinding is fascinating magic, and I get to work with Vigilants. Perhaps I can even inhabit one myself some day, like Quoram.\n\nThen again, I do like eating food... Maybe not...', 'I hope I am selected to be a Wakener. Soulbinding is fascinating magic, and I get to work with Vigilants. Perhaps I can even inhabit one myself some day, like Quoram.\n\nThen again, I do like eating food... Maybe not...', 137834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have become an Artificer like my mother wanted.', 'I should have become an Artificer like my mother wanted.', 137833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He frantically turns pages in a massive tome.>\n\nHow am I ever going to memorize all of this?', '<She frantically turns pages in a massive tome.>\n\nHow am I ever going to memorize all of this?', 137832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He appears to be talking to himself.>\n\nPerhaps if I invert the pulse rate and direct it into a vertical pylon, I can... What am I saying? That makes no sense.', '<She appears to be talking to herself.>\n\nPerhaps if I invert the pulse rate and direct it into a vertical pylon, I can... What am I saying? That makes no sense.', 137831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charming little game, is it not? I like to think we must practice such a basic ritual to remind ourselves how far we have come. Argus has much to be proud of.', '', 137825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re so big! Boom! Crash! Pow!\n\n<Naielle animatedly mimics their motions.>', 137824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of my men is competing. A fine fighter! He is no Champion Vorusk, but a worthy combatant in this tournament nonetheless.', '', 137823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have participated in a round or two of Jed\'hin in my life, but these competitors are far better than I could ever hope to be. I must admit, I am envious! Haha!', '', 137822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had a hand in picking the trophy for this tournament. I think our winner will be very pleased with their prize.', 137821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would not worry too much about their heads. Only males with the thickest crests choose to compete, and these are the best Mac\'Aree has to offer.', 137820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The competition is fierce this year. The victor will have much to be proud of.', '', 137819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a clash!', 'What a clash!', 137818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!', 'Excellent!', 137817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do you think will win?', 'Who do you think will win?', 137816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That had to hurt.', 'That had to hurt.', 137815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see that?', 'Did you see that?', 137814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a move!', 'What a move!', 137813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take him down!', 'Take him down!', 137812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I named it Flapper!', 'I named it Flapper!', 137811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owww! I think my leg... is broken.', '', 137810, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 102547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are growing well, considering how close we are to the Conservatory. Give it a month and they will be powerful enough to light a home for a lifetime. Another year and they can act as a sentry.$b$b<He rests a hand on a nearby crystal\'s surface. The crystal glows gently as a result.>$b$bI grow the finest crystals anywhere.', 'They are growing well, considering how close we are to the Conservatory. Give it a month and they will be powerful enough to light a home for a lifetime. Another year and they can act as a sentry.$b$b<She rests a hand on a nearby crystal\'s surface. The crystal glows gently as a result.>$b$bI grow the finest crystals anywhere.', 137809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this.', 'Let\'s do this.', 137807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da ritual be in full swing. Hir\'eek gonna show up any moment now. You ready?', '', 137806, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at da ritual circle.', '', 137805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot believe I set foot on a different world yet again. From the worlds of Draenor and Outland to the one overtaken by the Legion where we chased down Gul\'dan and Teron\'gor, it still takes my breath away. Argus is a grim lesson that we cannot lose to the Legion.', 137804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have sworn to defeat the Legion. One battlefield is much like any other, even if it is on a completely different world.', 137803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would that I could have brought more of our blood knights. We could learn much from these warriors.', 137802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this, $c. A ship, powered by the Light. An army of soldiers, empowered and as long-lived as the elves. Truly a worthy force for this crusade.', 137801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will meet its end here. The Light is with us.', 137800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Silgryn seems to be deep in thought, as he is even more stoic and silent than usual.>', '', 137799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lightforged draenei have spent lifetimes fighting the Legion. Perhaps even I could learn a thing or two from them.$b$bPerhaps.', '', 137798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how everyone is doing back in Suramar. I am sure they have everything under control.$b$bI do miss sparring with Victoire, though. She is a worthy opponent.', '', 137797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the chosen of the Shroud may have this treasure.', 'Only the chosen of the Shroud may have this treasure.', 137796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spell guarding the treasure falls away as the Shroud of Arcane Echoes covers you.', 'The spell guarding the treasure falls away as the Shroud of Arcane Echoes covers you.', 137795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The treasure is guarded by powerful magic. Only one shrouded in the right sort of power can access it.', 'The treasure is guarded by powerful magic. Only one shrouded in the right sort of power can access it.', 137794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do hope that Arluelle is keeping up her lessons. I gave her a small list of exercises to do every day.$b$bInterested? It\'s quite simple. One hundred push ups. One hundred sit ups. One hundred squats. A ten thousand, nine hundred thirty-six yard run.', '', 137793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only Oculeth were here. He would have had a field day studying this ship.$b$b...$b$bAnd probably have figured out a way to destroy it by now. You are right, probably for the best that he did not come with us.', '', 137792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is what the Legion does to its \"allies\"...$b$bWe were right to reject their offer.', '', 137791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself, $c.', 'Watch yourself, $c.', 137789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The body of the loa has been incapacitated by magical bonds.>', '', 137788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my temple, $n. Thanks to your brave deeds, you will always be received with hospitality here.', '', 137787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Stay awhile and listen.>', '<Stay awhile and listen.>', 137786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you both. Your loyalty means much to me... and to all Zandalari.', 137785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101831, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bet I can convince the other tortollans still in Nazmir to help. Maybe Shoak and Kajosh will come, too!', 137784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay. We\'ll stand with you against this Blood God, Princess. Just stop pestering me about it!', '', 137783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take good care of dat loa, Lashk. $n and I need to seek out more help.', 137782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! That sly old turtle... He wasn\'t ready to rest, he wanted to be reincarnated!', '', 137781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What in the name of...', 137780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not rest until G\'huun and de blood trolls are nothing but a memory. Dis I swear to you, Torga.', 137779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I\'ll make sure all our people know how bravely you stood against G\'huun.', 137778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye, Torga. I will remember the stories you told me... and share them with others.', '', 137777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'You strong, but ya be noting before da powers I control!', 137776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. Let us return to de shrine.', 137764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! I\'m ready for a break.', '', 137763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh... amazing. We actually did it!', 137762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Horde\'s champion and I... we are coming for you... and we will tear you apart, piece by piece!', 137758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis ends... now! No longer will my people... live in fear of you... and your vile blood trolls!', 137757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... proves... NOTHING! He... will claim... another vessel. Seals... will break... G\'huun... will be... free!', '', 137755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! Kill it before it figures out I am the greater threat!', '', 137754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face my trusty crossbow, vile fiend!', '', 137753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold it still! I can\'t get a good shot in if it keeps moving!', '', 137752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What you doing?? Guards, to me!', 137751, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRAAAGH! You are NOTHING against G\'huun! Suffer and DIE!', '', 137750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'FOR TORGA!', 137749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone! NOW!', 137748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts... futile... I am... untouch--what? No. NO!', '', 137747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Overconfidence shall be your undoing! Your power cannot protect you!', 137746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts... meaningless. I am... untouchable.', '', 137745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait until the others hear the story of how we killed the herald of G\'huun!', 137744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been ages since my heart burned with such fire. For Torga!', '', 137743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us begin. For Zandalar... and for Torga!', 137742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitor!', 'Traitor!', 137741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interloper!', 'Interloper!', 137740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heretic!', 'Heretic!', 137739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', 'Intruder!', 137738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great Hir\'eek, we offer you a sacrifice of blood and flesh!', 137736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may not enter while disguised!', 'You may not enter while disguised!', 137735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah. We\'re coming!', '', 137734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come! We must be prepared to destroy de herald of de Blood God!', 137733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware of spiders, my little saurid. I may be de god of secrets, but Yazma be de mistress of spies. She loves ta keep her skittering pests within my domain, always huntin\' me children.', '', 137732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go in.', 'I\'m ready to go in.', 137731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought I would set foot in these ruins. Isn\'t it amazing?', 137730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 137729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so big and strong now, eh? Go, my minion. Go and find de ratmon Nokano who told ya to kill my kind. Bite him, and earn ya richmon form again.', '', 137728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every demon\'s eyes have seen a thousand worlds. Fetch them for me, that I too may see.', '', 137727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ye ready, $p?', '', 137726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scoop the eyes from demon skulls, off-worlder. I would see what they see.', '', 137725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another agent pledges to serve? More eyes, more visions for the All-Seer.', '', 137724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me the eyes of every demon you can, off-worlder. I shall reward you handsomely.', '', 137723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This has the makings of the best story ever experienced by a tortollan. Avenging a loa and killing the avatar of some monster!', 137721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I think we might actually kill this herald of G\'huun.', '', 137720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We had best move on and see what else de blood trolls are doing up ahead.', 137719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our work here is done, $n. I\'ll meet you at Arom\'s Stand.', 137718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_SLEEP:20|t%s targets you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:254244|h[Sleep Canister]|h|r!', '', 137717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The witch was too much for me and I was trapped.', 137716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for freeing me from that foul construct.', 137715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good! Time to move. But remember, stay quiet! De last thing we need is you two getting captured.', 137710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. I\'ve got scrolls older than you are! Kisha, have a look through my stuff.', '', 137709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to find out what else de blood trolls are up to. Lashk, Kisha, do you have anything dat might... conceal our efforts?', 137708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the end, it was our scholars that turned the tide...', 137707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting too old for this.', '', 137706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood magic! Why would anyone practice this stuff?', '', 137705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tell the others stories about this.', '', 137704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First they kill Torga, now they\'re killing us! What\'s wrong with these trolls?', '', 137703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They stole all my scrolls, too! Get them back for me.', '', 137702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, my luck has turned around!', '', 137701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya not gonna stop us from eatin\' our tortollans!', 137700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We no eat loa... but we eat da tortollans!', 137699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I want to test myself against the toughest that Argus has to offer.', 'Yes, I want to test myself against the toughest that Argus has to offer.', 137698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kachago!', 137697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not believe the lies of this peddler of pedantic putrescence.\n\nHe sold me several manuscripts, all of which turned out to be preposterous lies. \n\nIf he thinks I will leave before I get my refund, he has another thing coming. Trolls don\'t live \"that\" long, after all.', '', 137696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not leave until I get a refund.', '', 137695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your narrative is confusing and poorly phrased.', '', 137694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your books talk about places that simply do not exist.', '', 137693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May fortune favor you, mortals. And... thank you.', '', 137692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are selling lies, Tella.', '', 137691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the camps surrounding my corpse to weaken Jungo.', '', 137690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji. The blood trolls power Jungo with my remains.', '', 137689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But moving flowers not always bad! They just want to eat bugs.', '', 137688, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 93799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all flowers were just flowers.', '', 137687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place reminds T\'paartos of another time he went where he wasn\'t supposed to.', '', 137686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, T\'paartos decided to stop being so afraid of dark and left cave.', '', 137685, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even shadows looked like monsters to T\'paartos.', '', 137684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos ran and ran. Got lost for days.', '', 137683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos remembers a place like this one. A time he dug too deep.', '', 137682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos loved to dig and find things.', '', 137681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When T\'paartos was scared, he found a place to hide.', '', 137680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos loved to talk to animals. They listened and liked him.', '', 137679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lend us your wisdom, great Torga. Tell us how to stop dese blood trolls.', 137678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here. What is it you seek?', '', 137677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torga! Ya spirit be needed here. Poke ya head outcha shell man!', '', 137676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guzincha!', 137675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rgggh....', '', 137674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graaaagh!', '', 137673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya can\'t hide from da Blood God!', 137672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Dumb goat. Let\'s go before you get eaten by monsters.\"', '\"Dumb goat. Let\'s go before you get eaten by monsters.\"', 137671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood for G\'huun!', 137670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Hey there, Marzipan. You look a little lost! Why don\'t you come with me and we\'ll get you home, okay?\"', '\"Hey there, Marzipan. You look a little lost! Why don\'t you come with me and we\'ll get you home, okay?\"', 137669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your bones gonna serve us well!', 137668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Want ya blood!', 137667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh meat!', 137666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zuldazar gonna fall!', 137665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here to defend de merchants or you. No, my job is to fight off de nightmares dat may come from de north. Blood trolls, snake mons, Alliance, whatever.\n\nAlso have to fight off boredom, but mostly dat other stuff. What are you here for?', 'I\'m not here to defend de merchants or you. No, my job is to fight off de nightmares dat may come from de north. Blood trolls, snake mons, Alliance, whatever.\n\nAlso have to fight off boredom, but mostly dat other stuff. What are you here for?', 137664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The little goat appears to be someone\'s lost farm animal.\n\nThe name on the collar reads \"Marzipan\".>', '', 137663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood! Blood! Blood!', 137662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you\'re de one dat brought back Princess Talanji. You have my thanks for dat.\n\nBut dey also say you\'re de one who brought back Zul. You have my ire for dat.\n\nWhat do you want?', 'I hear you\'re de one dat brought back Princess Talanji. You have my thanks for dat.\n\nBut dey also say you\'re de one who brought back Zul. You have my ire for dat.\n\nWhat do you want?', 137661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 603, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mistake me for one of de merchants? I am a warrior! Higher caste, mon.\n\nWhat do you need?', 'You mistake me for one of de merchants? I am a warrior! Higher caste, mon.\n\nWhat do you need?', 137660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have something you need? Otherwise, move along.', 'You have something you need? Otherwise, move along.', 137659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not packing any blood troll voodoo, now are you? No? Good.\n\nWhat\'s your business, den?', 'You\'re not packing any blood troll voodoo, now are you? No? Good.\n\nWhat\'s your business, den?', 137658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey say de blood trolls are finding new ways into our society. If dey can\'t invade us, dey\'re going to start converting us.\n\nProbably both, but never mind dat. What do you need?', 'Dey say de blood trolls are finding new ways into our society. If dey can\'t invade us, dey\'re going to start converting us.\n\nProbably both, but never mind dat. What do you need?', 137657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My cousin is down at de Blood Gates, fighting de real fight. Me? I got assigned to saurid duty. Bah.\n\nNow, what do you want?', 'My cousin is down at de Blood Gates, fighting de real fight. Me? I got assigned to saurid duty. Bah.\n\nNow, what do you want?', 137656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi, we\'re ready for you to summon Torga\'s spirit.', 'Bwonsamdi, we\'re ready for you to summon Torga\'s spirit.', 137655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to Nazmir they said, hear Torga\'s stories they said, it\'ll be fun they said!', '', 137654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This loa\'s husk... feeds me. Feeds... G\'huun.', '', 137652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I speak... for G\'huun. He... will lead. You... will serve... or die.', '', 137651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me back to Antorus.', 'Send me back to Antorus.', 137650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The essence of Eonar hovers before you. You sense both relief and gratitude; but a sense of urgency and purpose cuts short the joy of victory.>', 137648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vashreen makes a noise that is certainly not complimentary.>$b$bI know that a disreputable individual by that name sought me out as a financier of a project that sounded profitable, and has never repaid my investment.', '', 137645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know anyone by the name \"Locus-Walker\"?', 'Do you know anyone by the name \"Locus-Walker\"?', 137644, 0, 52729, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love ta hear der screams, but you best be keepin\' things low key. Don\'t want ya to be caught too.', '', 137643, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Freedom!', '', 137642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and if you ever see a troll named Sur\'jan, stab him in de heart with my claw! He deserves it!', '', 137641, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for everything, mon!', '', 137640, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With da spawn of Hir\'eek givin\' us flight and da power of da Blood God, da Zandalari gonna fall!', 137639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the legwork on this, $p. Tell Kreepi to send some water for me on your way out, will ya?', '', 137638, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! The treants have gone berserk and are killing anyone that gets near them.', '', 137637, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your size is of no import. Your spirit is bigger than any I\'ve met in these hills.', '', 137620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Sumber! I want to learn everything you can teach a small vulpera like me.', 137619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I infused a portion of my power into this totem for you to wield. Use it wisely.', '', 137618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_mastercleaver.blp:20|tSotanathor\'s axe sends out |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_mastercleaver.blp:20|tSotanathor\'s axe sends out |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r!', 137617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re welcome, Sumber. My friend and I are happy to aid you however we can.', 137616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am impressed. You were wise to bring me this essence.', '', 137615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ack! This water moves so quickly. I can\'t control it!', 137614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We would be transformed not into wise leaders, but into hateful monsters.', '', 137613, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 89877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But they were blinded by their vanity... their hunger for power.', '', 137612, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 89876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will transform you, granting you knowledge beyond imagining and might beyond measure.', '', 137611, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 89875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just look for big puddles of water. There\'s not many in Vol\'dun. They should be easy to spot.', 137610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make it flashy, if you can. We want to really impress Sumber.', 137609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever\'s going on down there, just take the water and get out. Don\'t get involved.', 137608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are powerful entities down there, $p. Let wisdom guide your strikes and your choices.', '', 137607, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory and honor to you, $p.', '', 137606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A day\'s work is worth a day\'s pay, no matter who you are.', 137605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful vanquisher of evil like $p doesn\'t battle monsters for your money, Maiya. We do it for the glory!', '', 137604, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anything can be fixed if you work hard enough, Heiro.', 137603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure we can even fix this wagon? The ranishu ate a lot of it.', '', 137602, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, da best part. Killin\' people, and gettin\' me more souls!', '', 137601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the Peak of Serenity before the Legion attacked.', 'Show me the Peak of Serenity before the Legion attacked.', 137600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land has gone through many hardships in the past but the final story of this grand temple has yet to be revealed. $B$BIf you wish to relive days gone by, I can allow you to visit the past for a short time.', 137599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Orders are sharing their resources, and you are no longer required to research Artifact Knowledge. Together, we have researched all possible Artifact Knowledge.', 'The Orders are sharing their resources, and you are no longer required to research Artifact Knowledge. Together, we have researched all possible Artifact Knowledge.', 137598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got a lil\' fire in dat belly, Talanji. But me help a gonna cost ya.', '', 137597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are not going to play dis game, Bwonsamdi. You want a loa spirit? Hir\'eek has already been killed by $n. You go get dat spirit.', 137594, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 101736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah... How about... a deal, hm? You bring I da soul of another loa, den I get you Torga\'s spirit, eh?', '', 137590, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 98405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me guess... Hmm... You wanna speak ta da soul of poor Torga.', '', 137588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to try and summon Bwonsamdi.', 'I\'m ready to try and summon Bwonsamdi.', 137587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And talking doesn\'t work. We gotta find another way to stop \'em. Or at least outrun \'em like you did.', '', 137586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll pass on word to Kreepi and the others. The ranishu eat $pr... and everything else.', '', 137585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, look at those $pr feet go! Don\'t trip!', '', 137584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Munchi-Munchi big! Eat mask! All eat $pr!', '', 137583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De blood trolls are going to wish dey never crossed us.', 137582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pull on the torch>', '<Pull on the torch>', 137581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Upon closer inspection, the torch appears connected to some sort of mechanism built into the wall.>', '', 137580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<It\'s a pair of old boots.\n\nWhat did you expect?>', '', 137579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You find no hidden entrances beneath the rug\n\nIt really does tie the room together, though.>', '', 137578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Surprisingly enough, the protruding book is not a secret lever for the hidden entrance.>', '', 137577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The anchor is securely fastened to the wall.>', '', 137576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tell you who... de blood trolls. Follow me... we will make dem pay!', 137575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who would do this to Torga? He only wanted to tell his stories!', 137574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torga! NO!', '', 137573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torga was killed like some sort of common animal!', '', 137572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of Torga\'s stories... gone forever!', '', 137571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A loa... dead?', '', 137570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could this have happened?', '', 137569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They kept that knowledge hidden here, safe from unwanted hands.', 137568, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<View the Life-Binder\'s Plea.>', '<View the Life-Binder\'s Plea.>', 137567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<View the Breaking of the Pantheon.>', '<View the Breaking of the Pantheon.>', 137566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<View Aggramar\'s Rise.>', '<View Aggramar\'s Rise.>', 137565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Orders are sharing their resources, and you are no longer required to research Artifact Knowledge. Together, we have researched all possible Artifact Knowledge.', 'The Orders are sharing their resources, and you are no longer required to research Artifact Knowledge. Together, we have researched all possible Artifact Knowledge.', 137564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for work.', 'I\'m looking for work.', 137563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bah! What do I look like, a tour guide? I\'m just here to listen to Torga\'s tales.', 137561, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 98546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I might as well get moving before someone else comes along asking for directions.', 137560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, just keep going down this road, don\'t wander off, and you\'ll find Torga. He\'s a giant turtle... hard to miss.', 137559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bah! What do you care what I\'m doing! Don\'t criticize how I choose to do this pilgrimage.', 137558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Pilgriming\"? You\'re just standing around! Lashk said you knew where to find Torga.', '\"Pilgriming\"? You\'re just standing around! Lashk said you knew where to find Torga.', 137557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lashk said you could tell me where I can find Torga.', 'Lashk said you could tell me where I can find Torga.', 137556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? Can\'t you see I\'m in the middle of pilgriming?', '', 137555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I think we\'ll get along just fine, Princess.', '', 137554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is not de first time I have dealt with you old tortollans... and your endless stories. Remain focused and keep walking!', 137553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, then. Let\'s be off to see Torga. But, just remember to keep the noise down. I don\'t want to miss even one of his stories!', '', 137552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh... Yeah, well. We\'re not looking to join any causes, but we won\'t stop you from walking with us.', '', 137551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want?', '', 137550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be wise to rethink your answer.', '', 137549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only know Akunda.', '', 137548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ask your name, yet you tell stories?', '', 137547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing? What kind of feeble creature has such a name?', '', 137546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be granted access to this loa\'s buff. This system is a WIP.', 'You will be granted access to this loa\'s buff. This system is a WIP.', 137545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get right on it.', 'I\'ll get right on it.', 137544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flora within this gulch are struggling to survive, just like the rest of us.', 137543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t thank you enough, mainlander. I\'m going to get as far away from this place as possible.', 137542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there! Do you like fire? Or rockets? How about rockets on fire? I have so many neato things to show you. I can\'t wait!', 137541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good heavens! What was that... that thing?!', 137540, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 101464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How delightful... a snack before my main course!', 137539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s not. But you don\'t want to travel through the canyon. It\'s filled with nightmares.', 137537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on if you can. It\'s about to get real bumpy!', 137536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis cannot be de only road we can take...', '', 137535, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'South it is. But you should know, the mountains are cursed. Those who go in, never come out.', 137534, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis must be de place. I can see a structure ahead.', '', 137533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should head south. De temple is somewhere within those hills.', '', 137531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My accommodations are rustic but comfortable, I assure you.', '', 137530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda has given us a chance to abandon our past and start anew.', '', 137529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde must be eradicated. Zuldazar will bow before the Alliance!', 137528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meh. This place isn\'t so bad. We\'re on a pilgrimage. And I have a feeling you\'re going to make it harder than it has to be.', '', 137526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tortollans! What brings you to dis accursed place?', 137525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nah. Let tubby go play with his frogs.', 137524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may not like de answer to dat, $n. I deserve my sentence to de sands, make no mistake.', '', 137523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should we go after him?', '', 137522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha! What a BABY!', '', 137521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww, the fat runt is crying!', 137520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fatty probably doesn\'t understand the question \'cause he\'s so STUPID!', '', 137519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How\'d a runt like you get so FAT, T\'paartos?', 137518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you do to end up here?', 'What did you do to end up here?', 137517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De chance to leave my past behind and start again does not sound so bad. Dese trolls might not be so crazy after all.', '', 137516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe my life to Rakera. None of us exiles would have survived in de sands without her guidance.', '', 137515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. T\'paartos thinks he knows what little T\'paartos might do.', '', 137514, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 93805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos was lost for days.', '', 137513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos remembers a place like this...', '', 137512, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 93793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes more trinkets, give them to me!', 'Yes, yes more trinkets, give them to me!', 137511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53431, 53431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill you! Take your things!', 'Kill you! Take your things!', 137510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53432, 53432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, take it! Just let me go!', '', 137509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rupert, dance!', '', 137508, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse your soul!', 'Curse your soul!', 137507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53433, 53433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen de one you are asking about. She passed de trials with ease, but didn\'t seem interested in staying here long. \n\nShe was looking for something. Asking questions, just like you are, but she left just as quickly as she came. Headed south, and you should too.\n\nDis temple isn\'t safe.', '', 137505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are all Akunda.', 137504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<It would seem her watch has finally ended.>', 137503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rupert, come here!', '', 137502, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Warguard Rakera?', 'Have you seen Warguard Rakera?', 137501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda gives us strength.', 'Akunda gives us strength.', 137500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without Akunda, we are nothing.', 'Without Akunda, we are nothing.', 137499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda lends us his power.', 'Akunda lends us his power.', 137498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all Akunda.', 'We are all Akunda.', 137497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is not Akunda.', '', 137496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If she is not Akunda, she is not allowed here.', 137495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only Akunda walks within this temple.', '', 137494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one by that name resides here.', '', 137493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only see those who are worthy of Akunda\'s power.', 137492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you concern yourself with those who are not Akunda?', '', 137491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakera? What a strange name.', 137490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gooey inside! Munch! Munch!', '', 137489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your voice down... we don\'t want dese crazy cultists to know we\'re talking like dis.', '', 137488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you wish to be one with Akunda, child? Serve me well and I will grant your wish...', '', 137487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, dere! Don\'t drink from dat chalice.', '', 137486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Munch! Munch! Munch!', '', 137485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you not hear me de first time? You drink from dat chalice, you\'ll regret it.', '', 137484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salja spends her time sleepin in da north tower. One drop of me poison and she never be wakin\' again. Make sure ta bring back da key!', '', 137483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have we met before? You look familiar...', 137482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah he he he! What a lovely day for meeeeeee!', '', 137481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get out, you will pay for dis!', '', 137480, 0, 52564, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me out, or I swear you will regret dis!', '', 137479, 0, 52564, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out dis cage before I show you a new meaning of nightmare!', '', 137478, 0, 52564, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anything like it... The meat just made the ranishu more hungry. Old Underwood didn\'t stand a chance!', '', 137477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! That tickes... Ouch! That hurts! Stop it!', '', 137476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do NOT give you permission to devour me, you foul creatures!', '', 137475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Fire!', 'Fire!', 137474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without enough power, I had to make a few... improvisations. They did not make me the grand artificer for no reason! Overloading the matrix core, refactoring the...$b$bIt matters not. What does matter is that the cannon will do its job. We will destroy the gates of Antorus and defeat the Legion.$b$bAre you ready, $n?', '', 137473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Old Underwood\'s eyes look cold and lifeless.>', '', 137472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other children were... not always kind to T\'paartos.', '', 137471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'paartos saw $n\'s heart on the field of battle. You are the bravest $c T\'paartos has ever seen.', '', 137470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should know something, friend $r. T\'paartos did not choose $n because of your puniness.', '', 137469, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 93791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
