('', '$C, behind you!', 137400, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory... ta... Hir\'eek...', 137399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We take loa meat, we EAT loa meat!', 137398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... something\'s not right.', 137397, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... It looks like some rubble blocks our path ahead. Can you clear the way?', 137396, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Armed with this knowledge, our men started driving the Drust back into their mountain holds.', 137395, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They compiled what they learned into a treatise on weapons and tactics that could be used to defeat the barbarians.', 137394, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As I was saying, the tide of the war shifted when our scholars began to uncover weaknesses in the Drust\'s magic.', 137393, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $c. I thought that one had me for a moment.', 137392, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... look out!', 137391, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Waycrests have always been hearty folk, but the Drust\'s magic was strong. We were losing the war...', 137390, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My ancestors fought against stone constructs much like these in their war against the Drust.', 137389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, $c. The coven\'s magic must be disturbing the spirits of the ancient Drust. We\'ll have to be careful.', 137388, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 137387, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 97570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... what was that?', 137386, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This carried on for countless years, until the ancestors of House Waycrest decided that something had to be done.', 137385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drustvar was their ancestral home. It was from here that they launched endless raids into our fledgling hamlets.', 137384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long ago, when Kul Tiras was first settled, our people encountered a savage group of warmongering barbarians. They called themselves the Drust.', 137383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s it! The way is opening!', 137382, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just need to find the entrance!', 137381, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It contains an ancient secret of our house, from back when the Waycrests first settled this land.', 137380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe we\'re here! My father used to tell me stories about this place.', 137379, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yah! Ride to Arom\'s Stand, Bella!', 137378, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 97561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bella, I\'ll need you to follow this one and carry the supplies they find, okay?', 137377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Choose to help Longfang and end the stalemate.>', '<Choose to help Longfang and end the stalemate.>', 137376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
