('The Triumvirate\'s wisdom has brought us to this point. I hope they know what they are doing, or this could end poorly...', 'The Triumvirate\'s wisdom has brought us to this point. I hope they know what they are doing, or this could end poorly...', 137350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
