('I thought I felt something amiss, but it is likely nothing. Worry not.', '', 137328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Hatuun clenches his fists.>$b$bSomething is very wrong here.', '', 137327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is well, stranger.', '', 137326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something strange, yes, but I am uncertain what it might be. It could be nothing.', '', 137325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense something is intensely wrong, but I could not hope to explain how! What is this awful feeling?', '', 137324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All appears to be well, stranger.', '', 137323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Crystalsmith Netrius clutches his hammer.>$b$bAbsolutely. Whatever it is, it cannot be allowed to harm Kil\'jaeden.', '', 137322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, why would I? Get out of the way, I am trying to listen to our leader speak.', '', 137321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, but it is nothing Kil\'jaeden cannot handle.', '', 137320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m scared. I want to go home.', 'I\'m scared. I want to go home.', 137319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The child sobs loudly at you in response to your question.>', '<The child sobs loudly at you in response to your question.>', 137318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He looks to either side.>$b$bSomething is very wrong. I want to run but my legs will not move.', '<She looks to either side.>$b$bSomething is very wrong. I want to run but my legs will not move.', 137314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! I noticed it the instant I arrived. It makes my skin crawl!', 'Yes! I noticed it the instant I arrived. It makes my skin crawl!', 137313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel it gripping your heart, too?  Please stop this, whatever it is.', 'Do you feel it gripping your heart, too?  Please stop this, whatever it is.', 137311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe it\'s a panthara! They like to hide in the shadows....$b$b<The child glances over his shoulder nervously.>', 'Maybe it\'s a panthara! They like to hide in the shadows....$b$b<The child glances over his shoulder nervously.>', 137310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The child fidgets nervously.>$b$bI don\'t know... Maybe?', '<The child fidgets nervously.>$b$bI don\'t know... Maybe?', 137309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but I cannot be certain where it comes from. It could be nothing.', 'Yes, but I cannot be certain where it comes from. It could be nothing.', 137306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... I think you may be on to something. The air is heavy with ill intent, though I could not say where it comes from.', 'Hmmm... I think you may be on to something. The air is heavy with ill intent, though I could not say where it comes from.', 137305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel an unsettling presence near me. What do you think it could be?', 'I feel an unsettling presence near me. What do you think it could be?', 137304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother says I should not talk to strangers.', 'Mother says I should not talk to strangers.', 137303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, it\'s the Tri-- trum... The three!', 'Look, it\'s the Tri-- trum... The three!', 137302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... no, I have not noticed anything in particular.', 'Hmmm... no, I have not noticed anything in particular.', 137299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not noticed anything.', 'I have not noticed anything.', 137298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense! The crowd is simply spirited!', 'Nonsense! The crowd is simply spirited!', 137297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More blood for Hir\'eek!', 137296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time ta collect some heads!', 137295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gonna die here!', 137294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hir\'eek gonna drink your blood!', 137292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gonna make a fine meal for me bat!', 137290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I gonna feed ya ta Hir\'eek next!', 137289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Blood God warned me of ya!', 137287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 137286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ground forces have secured the area and the Vindicaar awaits your arrival. We can give you an escort. Are you ready to leave?', '', 137285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer tryin\' to build a fortress? Hah! Don\'t make me laugh! Ha hah!', '', 137284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send in the big guns! We\'ll leave their sorry base in ruins.', '', 137282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, well! It looks like those Horde goons have finally decided to show their ugly mugs!', '', 137281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow weaker by the moment. You... you must help me before it is too late.', '', 137280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a natural, friend!', '', 137279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And of course my favorite part, the jumping! Show your equestrian expertise by jumping over the fences. The more you jump, the more impressive the rest of your actions will be!', '', 137278, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Roughnecks have already introduced you to their favorite tool, the bolas! Practice throwing them on horseback by shooting down the flying zeppelins. They\'re a bit rare, but are worth a lot of points!', '', 137277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combat prowess is an important requirement for Kul Tiran riders. Display your harpoon skills on the gnoll targets!', '', 137276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could it be a combination of the two? Man-bear, or is it bear-man?', '', 137275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More bear wounds. An outlaw and his pet bear, perhaps?', '', 137274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or maybe not a bear. She looks like she ran afoul with an outlaw, or something.', '', 137271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What peculiar wounds. They almost remind me of a bear. Do they look like bear wounds to you?', '', 137270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will... become desert... even Nazmir...!', '', 137269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazmir is claimed in the name of the Sethrak Empire!', '', 137268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I survived blood trolls and this is what I get? Bah!', 'I survived blood trolls and this is what I get? Bah!', 137267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Torga\'s dead and I don\'t get my stories.', 'Bah! Torga\'s dead and I don\'t get my stories.', 137266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the? I hate this place... I\'m not staying here!', 'What the? I hate this place... I\'m not staying here!', 137265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torga... it\'s dead?! What was this all?', 'Torga... it\'s dead?! What was this all?', 137264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What treachery dis be? I gonna have ya head!', 137263, 0, 52422, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And he\'s gone. I\'ll have to double the game warden\'s pay for this week.', 137262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Elk hunting is much more civilized than trapping bears!', '', 137261, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a small camp to the west that could use-', 137260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Good show! Keep it up!', '', 137259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin!', '', 137258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junji be always getting himself up to no good. It\'ll be bad news for him if de lizards find him before you do!', '', 137257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready? Set...', '', 137256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These may not be the most delicious ingredients, but they keep us fed.', '', 137255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snarltooth be dead and our missing alpacas have returned. Now we just gotta worry about Mojambo murdering us all...', '', 137254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De alpacas won\'t survive in de desert alone. We need to bring them back!', '', 137253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our herd of alpacas has gone missing. We must find them before it\'s too late!', '', 137252, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The desert is a desolate place, but there\'s food to be found if you know where to look!', '', 137251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t survive long without food and supplies...', '', 137250, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no peace so long as the sethrak ravage the land.', '', 137249, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll proceed when you\'re ready.', '', 137248, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured Newstead!', '$n has captured Newstead!', 137247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Newstead.', 'The Alliance has taken control of Newstead.', 137246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of Hatchet Ridge!', 'The Alliance has taken control of Hatchet Ridge!', 137245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please... I don\'t have... much time left.', 137244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The troll has a large jagged gash within her side which is surrounded by a greenish froth.>', '', 137243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so worried about my niece.', 137242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so glad you\'re safe, $p! Dolly and Dot are, too.', 137241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dolly and Dot have built up quite an appetite. Pulling a cartload of trolls isn\'t easy work!', 137240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dolly and Dot are strong and dependable. They\'ll get us where we need to go.', 137239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall to your knees and I promise you a swift death.', '', 137238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such arrogance! You approach the Antoran High Command!', '', 137237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The invaders approach. Crush them lest you be used as target practice for the fleet!', '', 137236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a bargain.', 'We have a bargain.', 137235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nickel stores the falcon in his pack.', '', 137234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a $c walks in my den. Tell me little $r, have you come to bargain?\n\nLong ago I decided to let my followers choose any loa to also follow. But for a boon, well, for that I require you to be a symbol of my power to the people of Zuldazar.\n\nIf you wish for my boon, return to the steps of Dazar\'alor, and raise a shrine to me worthy of the gods.\n\nDo this, and I shall consider you one of my pack. Do we have a bargain?', '', 137233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_GRIMWARD.BLP:20|tThe Marsh Shamblers break free from their Corrupters; but are |cFFFF0000|Hspell:253552|h[Drained]|h|r in the process.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_GRIMWARD.BLP:20|tThe Marsh Shamblers break free from their Corrupters; but are |cFFFF0000|Hspell:253552|h[Drained]|h|r in the process.', 137232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to Antorus, the Burning Throne (Raid).', 'I want to go to Antorus, the Burning Throne (Raid).', 137231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion cannot stand against the power of the Light. Not when it has champions like you!', '', 137230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our patrol has spotted a powerful foe in this area. Its downfall would set back the Legion\'s presence here significantly.', '', 137229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful demon is close... very close. Make an example of it!', 137228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought. This tide of demons will break upon our blades!', 137227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me.', 'Release me.', 137226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion considers this location unassailable. I say we prove them wrong!', '', 137225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A well-earned victory. The Legion will fall!', '', 137224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, richmon. And what ya be bringin\' ta da Shrine of Scavengers today?', '', 137223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reports say there is a particularly powerful demon at this location. We should eliminate it quickly!', '', 137222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! We have pushed the Legion back... for now, at least.', '', 137221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most effective. Every blow dealt to the Legion is a boon to our cause.', 137220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have hunted demons throughout the Twisting Nether for a thousand years. I think I can leave this one to you.', 137219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you have chosen your weapon. As have I.', 137218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light and shadow are both means to an end. For the foe before you, feel free to pick whatever weapon you favor.', 137217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! Come at once!', '', 137216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many monstrosities they send at us, we will cut them down.', '', 137215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With every such foe you bring down, our ultimate victory draws nearer.', '', 137214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a foul presence... an evil that seeks to blot out the Light. Take up arms and bring down this foe!', '', 137213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day One: We shall reach the Troggs of the Northern Caverns by lunch. I just know we\'ll find something before dinner! On to Adventure!', '', 137212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light cannot win unless we fight for it. You have done your part this day, champion.', '', 137211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just when the Light gains a foothold here, another vessel of evil rises to battle us. Your might is needed once again, champion.', '', 137210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Word of your victory will spread across Argus. Those who cling to the memory of the Deceiver are doomed to fall!', '', 137209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A disciple of Kil\'jaeden seeks to avenge its master. Be ready for its assault!', '', 137208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can never reclaim what we once had, but we will make them pay for what they did to Argus.', '', 137207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go to the stone.', 'I am ready to go to the stone.', 137206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This villain profanes the homeworld I lost so long ago. Put an end to this atrocity!', '', 137205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s important to listen, even when yer lot in life is speakin\'.', '', 137204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your comrades fought well. Such determination will be crucial in the battles to come.', '', 137203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! Come at once!', '', 137202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was once a sacred site for my people has been desecrated by the Legion. Drive them out!', '', 137201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can never reclaim what we once had, but we will make them pay for what they did to Argus.', '', 137200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never doubt that, in the end, the Light will emerge victorious.', '', 137199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An insidious champion of darkness draws near. Strike it down!', '', 137198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way you and your allies persevered is an inspiration to our forces. Proof that together we can save Azeroth!', '', 137197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your allies, hero. The threat you are about to face will put all your skills to the test!', '', 137196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even here on this bleak world, we fight for Azeroth!', 137195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The enemy draws near. Stand ready. We fight for the future of our world.', 137194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many monstrosities they send at us, we will cut them down.', '', 137193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your allies are needed, champion. Gather your forces!', '', 137192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, champion!', '', 137191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once again, I owe you a debt of thanks. I\'d say you\'re making quite a habit of this!', '', 137190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your allies, champion. A grave threat is at hand, and heroes are needed!', '', 137189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! The way you took that target down reminds me of myself in my younger days. My much, much younger days.', '', 137188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A worthy victory. No minion of the Legion can be allowed to toy with such forces.', '', 137187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense an entity that wields potent forces with great malevolence. This fiend must be brought down!', '', 137186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your work today has saved lives, champion. Take pride in that!', '', 137185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts report the presence of a deadly enemy nearby. Time to go on the offensive!', '', 137184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your comrades fought well. Such determination will be crucial in the battles to come.', '', 137183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Your expertise is needed! Prepare for battle!', '', 137182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With every such foe you bring down, our ultimate victory draws nearer.', '', 137181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself, champion. Wickedness lurks nearby...', '', 137180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
