('D\'you think there\'s titan stuff up here? I think there\'s titan stuff up here. That\'s why we got troggs. I\'m gonna find the stuff the titans left.', '', 137101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These kids are gonna be grounded for life!', '', 137100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My grandson is always getting into trouble, but this is something else!', '', 137099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gutting', 'Gutting', 137098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al... alright, child. I guess it is time. My friend, can you help me?', '', 137097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Let\'s get out of here!', '', 137096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, Dad, we\'ve waited long enough. You have to get on this horse!', '', 137095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the horse for me, my son. Look at the shine in her eyes when her gaze falls upon me. She craves my shell as food!', '', 137094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like this one. I think it\'s the prettiest! Dad?', '', 137093, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, child. I cannot ride this one. He... he looks too bouncy! Look at his gait. My old bones could never handle such motion!', '', 137092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one looks nice!', '', 137091, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, Joma. This one will not do. It is too... uh... fidgety. Yes! Fidgety! I suspect it would spook at any abrupt movement.', '', 137090, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about this one, Dad?', '', 137089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, enough dawdling, then. It is time to identify the perfect horse!', '', 137088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we begin, let me get prepared. Just a moment...', '', 137087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna carve ya up, get more food!', '', 137086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya look like good food for masters!', '', 137085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dad talks about horses all the time! He wants to ride one, but I think he\'s scared of them.$b$bI know exactly how to help him!', '', 137084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be what the sethrak have been looking for!', '', 137083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the stories engraved upon the runestones were true... the sphere does exist!', '', 137082, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have acquired many goods and curios over the course of this war.', '', 137081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I not be tricked by ya magic!', 137080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da potions not be ready yet, away wit\' ya!', 137079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak. Why do ya disturb my meditation?', 137078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thun\'ka... the Witherer...', '', 137077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thun\'ka... the Witherer...', '', 137076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the help, stranger. Remember to keep the salt outta yer britches.', 137075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready, friend. This party is about to get a whole lot more interesting!', '', 137074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thief! You will pay for this!', 'Thief! You will pay for this!', 137073, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 103665, 103666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for our empire!', 'You are no match for our empire!', 137071, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 103667, 103668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power within these ruins belongs to us!', 'The power within these ruins belongs to us!', 137068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103611, 103612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot have the power! It will be ours!', 'You cannot have the power! It will be ours!', 137067, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 103609, 103610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not every day that you get the chance to earn a favor from a water elemental.', 137066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I admire your passion. Go, raise a statue to me before the steps of Dazar\'alor so the trolls of this land know with whom you have bargained.', 137065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haha! I did not mean that literally.', 137063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Activate the Colossus>', '<Activate the Colossus>', 137062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient construct begins to glow as you approach.', 'This ancient construct begins to glow as you approach.', 137061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not attempt to bind me a second time, shaman. I will disintegrate you!', '', 137056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi! You don\'t look like one of them uppity nobles. Come \'round and have a drink with us! Lord Norwington invited us down from the mountains to bring the party, and that\'s exactly what we\'re gonna do!', '', 137055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not welcome here... Dis be troll bridge!', '', 137054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at these majestic equines, young one. We traveled across the continent to attend this festival. I am determined to learn about these exquisite beasts.$b$bNoble, powerful... they strike a fascinated fear in my old heart.', '', 137053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Witherer will consume this valley!', '', 137052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has reclaimed Ar\'gorok!', 'The Horde has reclaimed Ar\'gorok!', 137051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a new power in my house. Step forward, $p of the Horde, so that I might see you for who you are.$b$bA $r who is a $c, and a champion no less.$b$bMy hexlord tells me you desire my boon, but I require something from you first, as I do with all of those who would deal with me.$b$BI require a leap of faith...', 137050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, let\'s put an end to this cult!', '', 137049, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A--are you serious? I think we should take his offer!', '', 137048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I be survivin\' lots a things, I know you ain\'t gonna win.', '', 137047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people are doomed! Join with me... and you will be saved.', '', 137046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed.', 'Agreed.', 137045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is once again whole!', '', 137044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes, it is coming together nicely.', '', 137043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not had to create something like this in a millennium; bear with me.', '', 137042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, our esteemed hero! Welcome, welcome. Help yourself to some food and drink. If you need anything else, let me know and I will gladly assist.', '', 137041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where we take care of all of our horses. Both the riders and the stablehands keep them groomed and well cared for!', '', 137040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What would you ask of the loa of the skies?', 137039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to hide with Marcus!', 137038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you! I was gonna run out of rocks up here!', 137037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, interloper!', '', 137036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zardrax\'s power be flowin\' through me!', 137035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zardrax\'s power gonna destroy ya!', 137034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be goin\' back ta Zul\'jan. We gonna see if anyone else be gettin\' crazy ideas ta run off and join da blood trolls.', '', 137033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too bad Kal\'dran be too weak ta be seein\' we were gonna win, huh?', '', 137032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n. Kill Zardrax before he be corruptin\' anyone else ta his side.', '', 137031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya just be leavin\' dis thing to $n. $GHe:She; gonna kill dat hexxer ya be talkin\' about.', '', 137030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know about dis, Da\'jul... $n can\'t stop dis! We will all die!', '', 137029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll go find Marcus! See you there!', 137028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, thank you! It was quite uncomfortable in here.', 137027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is all a bit too much for me. I\'m out of here!', 137026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has assaulted the Mine!', '', 137025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has assaulted the Mine!', '', 137024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will begin refilling the lake immediately.', '', 137023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such strong essence. This must be Sumber\'s doing.', '', 137022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to find Marcus and wait with him. See ya there!', '', 137021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, thanks! Who knew troggs could use magic?', '', 137020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to Sumber.', '', 137019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am reborn.', '', 137018, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grew up hearing stories of de savage blood trolls. But dis is worse den anything I was told.', '', 137017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kal\'dran! $n, ya gotta go after him... even if it means ya might have ta kill him.', '', 137016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all DOOMED! Zardrax will save us, and you are dead if you try to cross me!', '', 137015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... hold...', '', 137013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Norwington Equestrian Festival! We\'re still setting up, but you must participate in the festivities. I won\'t have it any other way!', '', 137012, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 108437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! There\'s nothing more for you here!', '', 137011, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, $c!', '', 137010, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not follow his empty lies or you will doom yourself!', '', 137009, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Autumnvale is dead! His thirst for power led to his demise!', '', 137008, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen... de face of G\'huun... no hope... no hope...', '', 137007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere is no hope! Why do you not join Zardrax?', '', 137006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, $c. You arrived in the nick of time!', '', 137005, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have doomed... this land...', '', 137003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should not interfere with our works, lest you too become a sacrifice!', '', 137002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These people are crazy! Help me, $c!', '', 137001, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wicker Man must be appeased, else our misfortunes will continue!', '', 137000, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you quiet down?! Your death will serve the greater good!', '', 136999, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t do this! This is murder! Murder!', '', 136998, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you\'ve thinned them out a bit. I think I can make my way back from here.', '', 136997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger! I thought those bees would be the end of me!', '', 136996, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re in my eyes! My eyes!', '', 136995, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not the bees! Nooooo!', '', 136994, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C! It\'s good to see a friendly... wait, what is that?', '', 136993, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail to the Wicker Man!', 'Hail to the Wicker Man!', 136992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, $n! This is Magoo, my new horse. Isn\'t he great?$b$bI miss Hotshot, he was a good boy. He just got excited sometimes! I\'m going to bond extra hard with Magoo so that I can tell when he\'s nervous.$b$bI wanna be a really good equestrian, so I\'m going to keep training with Melissa so that Magoo and I can be a great team. The best of the best!', '', 136991, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather before the Wicker Man, initiates. His favor will protect us from the curses that befall our land.', '', 136990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot thank you enough for saving Eddie. He\'s a good kid, and he\'ll shape up to be a good equestrian as well.$b$bI think we\'ll keep the riding to the estate for a while though.', 136989, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... weak...', '', 136988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I listen to ya, ma\'da. I be goin\' now!', '', 136987, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 102565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kejabu sent me.', 'Kejabu sent me.', 136986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But if you join me, you can receive more power than you ever dreamed of!', '', 136985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you try to fight, you will be crushed by our forces.', '', 136984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no choice. Zuldazar is doomed. G\'huun will be freed!', '', 136983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can be spared, if you serve me. G\'huun promises dat.', '', 136982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'huun will consume everything. Dere is no hope.', '', 136981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha... you are strong! But all will fall before G\'huun. My offer stands whenever any of you want it...', '', 136980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('H-hold on, maybe we work with Zardrax! How do we stop all of dis?', '', 136979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n never gonna side wit\' you! Show dis lich what ya tink of dis \"offer\"!', '', 136978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serve me, and be saved... and I will give you a part of G\'huun\'s power.', '', 136977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuldazar will fall to de blood trolls and G\'huun. But you don\'t need to share dat fate.', '', 136976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, lich, tell me your offer.', 'Alright, lich, tell me your offer.', 136975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me and be saved from de destruction of Zuldazar!', '', 136974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are doomed! How can we hope to stop something like dis?', '', 136973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many sources of power dese blood trolls be havin\'?', '', 136972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 136971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 136970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! You chose wisely. Come, ride with me to meet your patron.', 136969, 0, 52143, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I knew you would make de right choice. Come over here and I will fly you out to see Pa\'ku face to face.', '', 136968, 0, 52142, 0, 64, 0, 98101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to chose a different loa.', 'I would like to chose a different loa.', 136967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooo! Interferin\' Horde worm! I gonna rip da life from ya body.', '', 136966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not stop! I need it to not stop!', '', 136965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me more! Give me all of it!', '', 136964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! Give me more!', '', 136963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessss... Yesss... YESSS!!!!', '', 136962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You be late! If me bat dies because of this I\'ll have your head ta decorate me hut!', 136961, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a most unexpected ally in this battle.', '', 136960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I...I think that\'s fair.', '', 136959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright Eddie. I think riding lessons will continue on the estate for now.', 136958, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no time for sentiment, High Overlord!', 136957, 0, 0, 396, 70, 4780, 0, 106971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be another way, Warchief!', '', 136956, 0, 0, 5, 70, 2992, 106267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Raal, you stuck-up idiot! You left us wide open! We have a blood cultist ritual happening on our very pinnacle.', 136954, 0, 61304, 603, 64, 0, 0, 106036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De last barrier... will fall... and G\'huun... will be free...!', '', 136953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... my link to G\'huun is... fading?', '', 136952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am spreading G\'huun\'s power! You won\'t stop me!', '', 136951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! G\'huun\'s power is in me! I will not fall!', '', 136950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Presumptuous little $pr. Approach, I would have words with you.', '', 136949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah... Zardrax never gonna be stopped... his power... gonna help us destroy... Zuldazar...', 136948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'With da power of Zardrax and G\'huun, we be unstoppable!', 136947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $c. You have earned my trust, and I will help you in your task.', '', 136945, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He seems more present, for sure.', 136944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think he moved! No... wait... was that the wind?', '', 136943, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Heed our offerings, Wicker Man, and grant us your boon!', '', 136942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought the bones? Perfect! This thing obviously likes bones.', '', 136941, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, the entrails! I\'m sure we can do... something with that.', '', 136940, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you brought the wicker. An obvious choice, but no less correct.', '', 136939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, no, no! Those are cooking herbs, not ritual herbs! Can\'t you tell the difference?', 136938, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you doing with that grain? We\'re not stuffing a scarecrow, here!', 136937, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you brought the scrolls... While I agree they could be vital to awakening the wicker man, well... none of us can read them.', '', 136936, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fruit?! Are you serious? $gHe:She;\'s serious, isn\'t $ghe:she;?', '', 136935, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it.  Sylvanas will finally answer for her crimes. Champions, to my side...', '', 136934, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 105318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gift of the Emperor is placed within the arena!', '', 136933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Paraxis is here! Take cover under the shields!', 136932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 89342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Paraxis is returning soon! Army of the Light, set up your shields!', 136930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 89336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Heiro casually taps the tambourine on his hip and winks at you.>', '', 136929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doubt we\'ll see you again, $n. Thank you.', '', 136927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purple Team gains Gift of the Emperor!', '', 136926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'dun has thrown much worse than this at us. We\'ll be fine.', 136925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Seat of the Triumvirate (Dungeon).', 'I want to go to the Seat of the Triumvirate (Dungeon).', 136924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can make it to Melissa if you cleared me a path. Thank you so much for saving me!', '', 136919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is... Is it safe to get out? Troggs are really scary!', '', 136918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has captured Hatchet Ridge!', '$n has captured Hatchet Ridge!', 136917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will leave you with Loti. Let her know de cause of all dis trouble may lie within Zanchul itself.', '', 136916, 0, 52060, 0, 64, 0, 98087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, something feels... different. I sense a great power resonating inside Zanchul.', '', 136915, 0, 52059, 0, 64, 0, 98086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a week goes by dat we do not see some Zandalari turning to blood magics learned from those heretics in Nazmir.', '', 136914, 0, 52058, 0, 64, 0, 98085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defenses grow weaker. Princess Talanji has been asking for more troops. But her father has not acted fast enough, and she has turned to de Horde.', '', 136913, 0, 52057, 0, 64, 0, 98084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat was when we got our first taste of real blood magic. Not dat petty nonsense practiced by de lesser tribes.', '', 136912, 0, 52056, 0, 64, 0, 98083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few years back, dis whole land shook during de Cataclysm. Our northern gates fell, and swarms of blood troll savages poured through.', '', 136911, 0, 52055, 0, 64, 0, 98082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will call out de best spots, and you can have de honor of tossing down a sentry totem.', '', 136910, 0, 52212, 0, 64, 0, 98081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small bag of horse treats lays scattered on the ground. Inspecting the bag, you find Eddie\'s name stitched into the fabric.$b$bHe must have come through this way, though it doesn\'t seem by choice. You spot some spare treats leading up the hill.', 'A small bag of horse treats lays scattered on the ground. Inspecting the bag, you find Eddie\'s name stitched into the fabric.$b$bHe must have come through this way, though it doesn\'t seem by choice. You spot some spare treats leading up the hill.', 136909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know how much longer we can survive against the sethrak...', '', 136908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re obviously not from Zuldazar, or else you\'d know exactly who I am. I was General Jakra\'zet\'s personal chef!$b$bI was exiled after de general became ill eating one of my meals... but it wasn\'t my fault!$b$bDe other cooks envied my position! One of dem must have poisoned de meal when I wasn\'t looking!$b$bSomeday, I\'ll find a way to prove my innocence, but for now, I have to cook dung beetles to survive.', '', 136907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALLIANCE, HOLD YOUR GROUND!', '', 136906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you end up in Vol\'dun?', 'How did you end up in Vol\'dun?', 136905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ask dangerous questions, $c.\n\nI do not care to hide my past, but others here may not feel the same way...\n\nI was exiled with my family when I was merely a boy. My father owed a great deal of debt and in those days children were exiled with their parents.\n\nI was alone and dying from thirst when Razgaji found me. He nursed me back to health and raised me as his own. I have been with him ever since.', '', 136904, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you end up in Vol\'dun?', 'How did you end up in Vol\'dun?', 136903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there, I not be seein\' your face before. Come, speak with me.', 136902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hir\'eek be pleased... but more blood is needed! Bring another sacrifice!', 136901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great Hir\'eek, loa of bats and servant of G\'huun. Dis sacrifice be offered to you!', 136900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can find Hexlord Raal down at de other end of de Terrace. Be sure to insult him for me.', 136899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 106037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:252508|h[The Paraxis]|h|r has arrived! Run for cover!', '', 136898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:252508|h[The Paraxis]|h|r is arriving soon!', '', 136897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time is up, King Anduin!', '', 136895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we turn tail now, we just become prey. No. We will fight--and die, if we must--for what we believe in!', '', 136894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin attack run on Antorus.', 'Begin attack run on Antorus.', 136891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The warframe hisses with energy, ready to be taken into battle.>', '', 136890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak, or I\'ll have your tongue ripped out for the next ritual.', 136889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hir\'eek provides us his children, Da Blood god provides us his power. Together, we unstoppable!', 136888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it? Speak quickly or you will be the next sacrifice.', 136887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grabbing Line', 'Grabbing Line', 136882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War demands that we take a more direct approach.', 136878, 0, 0, 396, 70, 4315, 0, 106972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Snakes! Look out!', 136876, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Illidan has taken it. His plan is in motion, Slayer.', 136875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you spoken with Gonk? He is de lord of de pack. He spoke to some of de Darkspear, guiding dem to be druids.$b$bBut for us, he is more than a voice. We can listen to him in person. Not some fragment or piece of him, but de real thing.', 'Have you spoken with Gonk? He is de lord of de pack. He spoke to some of de Darkspear, guiding dem to be druids.$b$bBut for us, he is more than a voice. We can listen to him in person. Not some fragment or piece of him, but de real thing.', 136874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'vas, what is the status of the Sargerite Keystone?', 'Kor\'vas, what is the status of the Sargerite Keystone?', 136873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk is de loa who taught all trolls how to expand their influence to other loa and become druids. And we are forever grateful.', 'Gonk is de loa who taught all trolls how to expand their influence to other loa and become druids. And we are forever grateful.', 136872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De followers of Pa\'ku are still bitter over how Wardruid Loti left their Hexlord Raal. Very sad. Very unprofessional.', 'De followers of Pa\'ku are still bitter over how Wardruid Loti left their Hexlord Raal. Very sad. Very unprofessional.', 136871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De followers of Gonk are still bitter over how Hexlord Raal left our Wardruid Loti. Very sad. Very unprofessional.', 'De followers of Gonk are still bitter over how Hexlord Raal left our Wardruid Loti. Very sad. Very unprofessional.', 136870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you do, do not listen to de lies of dese followers of Gonk. Dey are just jealous of how great our loa Pa\'ku is.', 'Whatever you do, do not listen to de lies of dese followers of Gonk. Dey are just jealous of how great our loa Pa\'ku is.', 136869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I answer to Pa\'ku, de loa of de winds and mistress of our navy. She is a loa unlike any other. You would do well to deal with her instead of those other loa. Dey are not trustworthy.', 'I answer to Pa\'ku, de loa of de winds and mistress of our navy. She is a loa unlike any other. You would do well to deal with her instead of those other loa. Dey are not trustworthy.', 136868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, $p. De loa have been whispering your name. Your arrival in Zuldazar should be very interesting.', 'Hmm, $p. De loa have been whispering your name. Your arrival in Zuldazar should be very interesting.', 136867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa\'ku is de loa of winds and mistress of our scouts and fleet. She is an impulsive loa who loves her freedom. Speak with her champion, Hexlord Raal, if you wish to know more.', 'Pa\'ku is de loa of winds and mistress of our scouts and fleet. She is an impulsive loa who loves her freedom. Speak with her champion, Hexlord Raal, if you wish to know more.', 136866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! De hero of de Horde. Hexlord Raal will be impressed with you. If you\'re in good with him, you\'re in good with Pa\'ku, and you\'re in good with me.', 'Ah! De hero of de Horde. Hexlord Raal will be impressed with you. If you\'re in good with him, you\'re in good with Pa\'ku, and you\'re in good with me.', 136865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence is not welcome here.', 'Your presence is not welcome here.', 136864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing to say to you.', 'I have nothing to say to you.', 136863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be lost. Know dat you should not be here.', 'You must be lost. Know dat you should not be here.', 136862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Casteless. Bah!', 'Casteless. Bah!', 136861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not speak to me, peasant.', 'Do not speak to me, peasant.', 136860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As expected, my work is perfect. Something must be clogging the fountain. Would you mind taking a look?', 136859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get a closer look at this fountain.', 136858, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will carve my next ritual with your blood.', 'I will carve my next ritual with your blood.', 136857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interfering Horde scum!', 'Interfering Horde scum!', 136856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stop us all!', 'You can\'t stop us all!', 136855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I\'m de only one using blood magic here? You are due for an ugly surprise.', 'You think I\'m de only one using blood magic here? You are due for an ugly surprise.', 136854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I will not be undone by some interfering minion of de Horde!', 'Bah! I will not be undone by some interfering minion of de Horde!', 136853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you flying fools were supposed to scout out for dese blood trolls. Why are we doing your work for you?', 'I thought you flying fools were supposed to scout out for dese blood trolls. Why are we doing your work for you?', 136852, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll not be messing with our ritual day. Loti will make sure of dat.', 'You\'ll not be messing with our ritual day. Loti will make sure of dat.', 136851, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You flying fanatics will be de death of Zandalar.', 'You flying fanatics will be de death of Zandalar.', 136850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raal is going to get you all fed to de king\'s loa if he keeps messing with us.', 'Raal is going to get you all fed to de king\'s loa if he keeps messing with us.', 136849, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That army is enormous... Give the word, and I will teleport us to safety.', 136848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELFLAMESTRIKE.BLP:20|t This area is targeted for |cFFF00000|Hspell:250249|h[Obliteration]|h|r!', '', 136847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you still following Loti? Ha! You are dumber than bruto dung.', 'Are you still following Loti? Ha! You are dumber than bruto dung.', 136846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who is outnumbered now.', '', 136845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raal is going to run dis place one day, and kick all of you raptor fanatics out to de wilds where you belong.', 'Raal is going to run dis place one day, and kick all of you raptor fanatics out to de wilds where you belong.', 136844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your loa\'s name is Gonk. You should feel bad about dat.', 'Your loa\'s name is Gonk. You should feel bad about dat.', 136843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You filthy druids are scraping de bottom. No better than de Gurubashi.', 'You filthy druids are scraping de bottom. No better than de Gurubashi.', 136842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no better than me. My blood... is on your hands.', '', 136841, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every troll for himself. Kill or be killed!', '', 136840, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 107102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus will never belong to the Legion so long as we stand.', '', 136839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You find the still warm corpse of Eddie\'s pony, Hotshot.>$b$b<Crumbs lead up the hill. It seems Eddie left a trail.>', 'You find the still warm corpse of Eddie\'s pony, Hotshot$b$b You hope you are not too late for Eddie as well.', 136838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy make yummy treat!', '', 136837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m over here! He has the key! Please, help me!', '', 136836, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get going, $n. Lord Norwington will have my head if something happens to his son!', 136835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sacrifices made to empower the Netherlight Crucible must never be forgotten.', 136834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power of the Netherlight Crucible is yours, $n.', 136833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a tribe of outcasts, exiled from Zuldazar and sent to de desert to die.\n\nDere are a few among us who were falsely accused of de crimes dat sent dem here. But de rest of us earned our fate.\n\nSurvival is our only concern now.\n\nSo long as you obey de laws of de tribe, you will have a place among us. However, if you fail to obey our laws, you will find our justice more immediate than King Rastakhan\'s.', '', 136832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you need, ma\'da?', '', 136831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it? You... you are not de next to be sacrificed, are you?', '', 136830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De priestesses... dey will kill us all!', '', 136829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis will be a whole lot more violent without your disguise.', '', 136828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about your tribe.', 'Tell me about your tribe.', 136827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must continue to fight until the Legion is no more.', 136826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is Rakera\'s shield... Where is she? What have you done to her?', 136825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jakra\'zet\'s to blame for dis, not me. Rakera\'s de only reason I\'m still alive.', '', 136824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meerah, stop de caravan! I see something up ahead!', 136823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 105884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How could Rakera survive in such a place?', 136822, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 105883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you believe this wasteland was once the jewel of the troll empire? A jungle teeming with life... now whatever\'s left is buried beneath the sands.', 136820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiro\'s got no reason to worry. I\'ve had plenty of practice! But you might want to hold on, just in case.', 136819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always am!', 136818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Marsh Shambler becomes Fel Enraged and breaks free from the corrupters!', 'The Marsh Shambler becomes Fel Enraged and breaks free from the corrupters!', 136817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... but only with de help of dis $c. $gHe:She; has lots of mojo. I can smell it.', '', 136816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are just like all de other crazies who go to Naz--wha?', 'You are just like all de other crazies who go to Naz--wha?', 136815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Look, I\'ll go down here and show you dis guy is crazy.', 'Bah! Look, I\'ll go down here and show you dis guy is crazy.', 136814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make sure to tell everyone at the camp how you saved me!', '', 136813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! I can\'t believe it!', '', 136812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I get my strength back, I could beat him...', '', 136811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...And dat is Urok, an undead monstrosity who is going to kill all of you.', '', 136810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Idiot! You\'ll be food for Urok!', '', 136809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh. Urok is near... I can SMELL his TEETH.', '', 136808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me Urok, the Terror of the Wetlands.', 'Show me Urok, the Terror of the Wetlands.', 136807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eddie!!!', 136806, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa\'ku, Pa\'ku, Pa\'ku, she\'s de loa for you.', 'Pa\'ku, Pa\'ku, Pa\'ku, she\'s de loa for you.', 136805, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like de sky? So do I. Join Pa\'ku. She is de loa for you.', 'Like de sky? So do I. Join Pa\'ku. She is de loa for you.', 136804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not delay, follow Pa\'ku today!', 'Do not delay, follow Pa\'ku today!', 136803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s okay, he\'s okay! There\'s no need to-- AAH!', '', 136800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright Eddie, keep Hotshot calm.', 136799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic runt! Hir\'eek won\'t even accept ya as a sacrifice!', 136798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come along now. It be your time.', 136797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ask the obvious.$b$bA direct assault on Antorus would be folly. The Legion\'s forces vastly outnumber us, and they are replacing fallen soldiers at unnatural speed. Some of these brutes are even strong enough to slow me down... slightly.$b$bBreaching their stronghold will require a different plan. In the meantime, there is a sea of demons to slay.$b$bGo back to your High Exarch and let him strategize. I have an enemy to destroy.', '', 136794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall put an end to the Legion in this accursed place.', '', 136793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My glaives hunger for the blood of demons.', '', 136792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are in full force here. They truly are Legion.$b$bPerfect.', '', 136791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here at last. It has been so long...', '', 136790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, $n. I will see you soon.', '', 136789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get back to Zo\'bal. Dere are still more souls to gather before I can pay off my debt.', '', 136788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The outlook is grim.$b$bMounting a direct assault from this location would prove far too costly. What is more, those cannons atop the wall may well be powerful enough to bring down the Vindicaar.$b$bI suggest using this foothold to launch guerilla strikes. Assassinate key members of their leadership and wreak havoc within their ranks.$b$bI know this is not what you or Turalyon were hoping to hear, but a patient hunter must know when to strike.', 136787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turalyon wants to know the situation down here.', 'Turalyon wants to know the situation down here.', 136786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What information have you been able to gather, Alleria?', 'What information have you been able to gather, Alleria?', 136785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are truly endless. We must find a way to bring a final end to them.', 136784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the heart of Argus.', 136783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even here, I can hear it calling to me. Its hunger...', 136782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much prey to be had here.', 136781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bound Nighthunter emits a gurgled whine.', '', 136780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bound Nighthunter hears something nearby!', '', 136779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bound Nighthunter sniffs at the air.', '', 136778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meeki deserved a better fate than what he got, but I know that\'s not your fault.\n\nThank you for finding him for us. It\'s better to know pain than live with regret.\n\nWe travel these dunes as a family, and you\'re a part of that now. You\'re always welcome in our caravan.', 136769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must keep a clearer head den dat. Your enemies will sense da weakness in your mind.', '', 136768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop dat!', '', 136767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I-I-I can\'t wait to hear Ahna\'s song of your adventure.\n\nA-a-ahna makes very good music. B-b-be sure to tell her your story!\n\nW-W-We\'ll make sure everyone we meet hears the tale of $p.', '', 136766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tragedy, undead pirates, cursed treasure, a mutiny... this adventure is the stuff of legends.\n\nI\'ve already got some great ideas for the first verse of my song, the Ballad of Brave $p.\n\nYou\'ll be a legend, at least to this caravan, for generations.\n\nRight after this nap.', 136764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight like you mean it! Everyting is on da line!', '', 136763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight not only to protect da people, but also da future of da Zandalari. Do not take dis lightly.', '', 136762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack swiftly, but neva forget da soldiers around you.', '', 136761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must strike da target wit force... But also wit poise.', '', 136760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve ridden a bunch in the ring, it can\'t be much different out here!', '', 136759, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep a good hold of the reins, Eddie.', 136758, 0, 51943, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Norwington entrusted me to train his son in equestrianism. He\'s been doing well enough in the ring, but I worry about taking him out here. I\'m not sure he\'d be able to stop his pony if it spooked.$b$bHopefully it doesn\'t come to that!', 136757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hotshot would never spook. He\'s a good boy!', '', 136756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think he\'s listening, look at his ears!', '', 136755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am, I am!', '', 136754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it slow and easy. Anything out here could spook him.', 136753, 0, 51943, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep his attention on you, there\'s a lot going on out here!', 136752, 0, 51943, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eddie, turn with your leg, not your hand.', 136751, 0, 51943, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph... desert in a swamp... what are the sethrak up to?', '', 136750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gold Team gains the Gift of the Emperor!', '', 136749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purple Team gain the Gift of the Emperor!', '', 136748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for getting me away from those nasty saurolisks. That\'s the last time I\'ll go to the riverbed alone... at least until I\'m older!', '', 136747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello? Is someone out there?', '', 136746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is no match for our strength. For the Horde!', '', 136745, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Port of Zem\'lan be mine!', '', 136744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time.', 136743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sur\'jan, don\'t be crazy! We aren\'t leaving Nazmir after this. I will never go back to Zuldazar.', '', 136741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With you helping, I will be strong enough so we can beat Urok again. I will be waiting here to prepare de next ritual.', '', 136740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those monsters were going to eat me!', '', 136738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 136737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s dat, Sur\'jan? ... Hmph, fine, good point.', '', 136732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sur\'jan, I should be de one doing all dis, you know. I don\'t like sitting back and watching someone else work.', '', 136731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m moving up ahead! Get things ready for us to fight Urok.', '', 136730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Papa says that I can participate in the celebrations this year. They\'re finally teaching me how to ride!', '', 136729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take care of de balance of nature.\n\nQuiet, Sur\'jan, of course I care about de balance of nature... sort of. $gHe:She; doesn\'t need to know dat.', '', 136728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da swamp be full of horrors, if you gonna survive out there you gonna have to become one as well.', '', 136727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De curse... is over? Am I finally... free?', '', 136726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are on cursed land... no one ever gets out!', '', 136725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are monsters hiding in the shadows of Zem\'lan.\n\nTake care that you don\'t become one yourself.', 136724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F-f-families stick together, no matter what.', '', 136723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I\'m not joking. I want dat troll dead, just like Urok here. Good hunting.', '', 136722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be stupid, Sur\'jan. $gHe:She; wouldn\'t think I\'m joking. Okay, fine, let me make sure dey know it.', '', 136721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was good working with you. If you see a troll named Krugah, make sure you kill him. Hah!', '', 136720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can waste no more time. Urok must be put down!', '', 136719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YES! It is time... we will bring down Urok!', '', 136718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel it... my power returning!', '', 136717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Champion... I was sure this was the end.', '', 136716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, save the others!', '', 136715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was done for... thank you!', '', 136714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha HA! I\'m almost dere... and we are almost ready to kill Urok!', '', 136713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good... I feel my power coming back to me!', '', 136712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... MORE! We need more power if we\'re going to kill Urok!', '', 136711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s everything I need... now it is time to get more power!', '', 136710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have accomplished our mission. Let us return to the Vindicaar. Much work remains to be done.', '', 136701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the lucky ones. Not you. Not yet.', '', 136698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She seeks that which must be earned by sacrifice.', '', 136697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beyond this small sea of stars there is only endless Darkness.', 136696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell my daddy I forgive him.', 136695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Has she betrayed you yet? She will...', 136694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will die alone.', 136693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Master waits for you to join him...', 136692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s awake now. And he\'s noticed you.', 136691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll join us soon.', 136690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know the things you\'ve done.', 136689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You hear faint laughter.', 136688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You feel eyes upon you.', 136687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are being watched.', 136686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ghostly Follower laughs and runs off.', 136685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our next meeting will be our last...', '', 136684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be mine, tresspasser!', '', 136683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not... prepared.', '', 136682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 89057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence be a desecration. Beware da wrath of Xibala!', 'Your presence be a desecration. Beware the wrath of Xibala!', 136681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ya be wantin\' da finest mojo an trinkets looted from da south, ya come speak wit\' Wunja!', 136680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal. Xibala will destroy you!', 'Foolish mortal. Xibala will destroy you!', 136679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall ride Ata de Winglord on dis journey. Hop on, and keep your eyes open.', '', 136678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is like my loa always says: if you cannot see de source of corruption, go higher.', '', 136677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loti\'s method is too grounded for my taste. I prefer a pterrordax\'s-eye view.', '', 136676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to patrol.', 'Ready to patrol.', 136674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Wardruid Loti! I am de conduit of Gonk, loa of shapes and master of de hunt.$b$bI am also a member of de Zanchuli Council, but you knew dat already I\'m sure.', 136673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The carrier nods to the Zandalari Guard.', '', 136672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guard examines you thoroughly.', '', 136671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guard acknowledges your presence.', '', 136670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better have learned your lesson!', 'You better have learned your lesson!', 136669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guard salutes you as you walk by.', '', 136668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guard nods in your direction.', '', 136667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand before Hexlord Raal, member of de Zanchuli Council and High Priest of de great loa Pa\'ku, mistress of winds and our navy.\n\nSo what do you want?', '', 136662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MAGE_DEEPFREEZE.BLP:20|tGet to a Brazier! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:251709|h[Flash Freeze]|h|ris coming!', '', 136661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this place?', 'What is this place?', 136659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been working for years to comprehend the powers the void might provide. Now, we are on the cusp of understanding.', '', 136658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work, work.', '', 136657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stuff isn\'t bad, but it\'s a bleedin\' shame just letting the beans sit in water and callin\' that a proper beverage. I need to bring some of this coffee back to the famed Thunderbrew clan and let them have a go at it. Just imagine a good stout, aged with a batch of these beans....', '', 136656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light\'s peace be upon you, $c.', 136655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid Sur\'jan! Why are you running your mouth like dat in front of everyone? They\'ll think you\'re crazy!', '', 136654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going out to get things ready for de ritual. We will be able to kill Urok once I get my power back.', '', 136653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I live in Nazmir, so you think I\'m crazy, but you need to listen! You will all be dead if you don\'t help me!', '', 136652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you think I\'m crazy, but you need to help me!', '', 136651, 0, 51965, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop turning me away! I need your help!', '', 136650, 0, 51965, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere, his protection is gone! Let\'s finish him off!', '', 136649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By G\'huun, I be reborn!', 136648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'ll let you handle de complicated things. I will be outside of Urok\'s lair.', '', 136647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! We did it! I told you, Sur\'jan. We beat him!', '', 136646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Deal wit dat witch! Dem dancin\' bones she call \"minions\", dem gonna fall to de true lord of de dead!', '', 136645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urok is being protected by de totems! Use my torch to burn dem!', '', 136644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The half-buried backpack is covered with sand, but the contents within appear to be in suitable condition.>', '', 136643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Didn\'t I tell you to stay clear of that place? We barely got you out of there alive!', 136642, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for you!', 'Death comes for you!', 136641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interloper!', 'Interloper!', 136640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us!', 'Join us!', 136639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not have my work disrupted! Destroy this insect!', 136638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! Go! Go!', 'Go! Go! Go!', 136637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, I\'m taking dis one down!', '', 136632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way, champion.', 136631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will do our best to locate them, High King.', 136630, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 94927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Windrunner, please begin the search for your exiled kin. Perhaps our champion here can assist you.', '', 136629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to hear our champion\'s perspective on which of these potential allies we should reach out to first.', '', 136628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind has suffered at the hands of those who succumbed to the shadow\'s whispers. But if others could master its power as you have, they would make formidable allies.', '', 136627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I did learn of a group of sin\'dorei who have been exiled for studying the void as I have. If I could locate them, their knowledge might aid our cause.', 136626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I reached out to them in hopes of seeing Silvermoon return to the Alliance. My efforts proved... futile.', 136625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High King, I remember the days when my people and yours fought together against the Horde.', 136624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, High Exarch. Lightforged soldiers would indeed bring strength to our numbers.', '', 136623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Among our number are brave initiates about to undertake the arduous path of becoming Lightforged.', '', 136622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of our bravest soldiers gave their lives for the cause. Those who remain would be proud to join the Alliance.', '', 136621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory on Argus was only possible because the heroes of Azeroth fought side-by-side with the Army of the Light.', '', 136620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our future depends on bringing other like-minded allies into the fold. I call upon those of you gathered here for your suggestions.', '', 136619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meanwhile, the Horde musters its forces and arms for war. Their aggression must not go unanswered.', '', 136618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all know the Alliance incurred heavy losses in the war against the Legion. And even now, the world bleeds in the aftermath of Sargeras\'s final strike.', '', 136617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for joining us, champion. These are dire times indeed.', '', 136616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 94916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, minions! Rise and destroy dis fool loa!', 136615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need your help... something bad is coming, and I can\'t kill it alone!', '', 136614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bold words, but ya be meetin\' da same fate as all who refuse G\'huun!', 136613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PH Activate Choice UI', 'PH Activate Choice UI', 136612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one be telling Bwonsamdi what ta do! So... You tink you have what it takes ta face me, little ting?', '', 136611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... You look like a smart woman. Yet here you be, interruptin\' me in my own temple.', '', 136610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I give ya dis one chance ta submit to da Blood God. Surrender... or be destroyed!', 136609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bwonsamdi! At last, ya left da safety of dat ruin.', 136608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
