('', 'And den she be orderin\' me ta be makin\' sure $n and, her words, \"da cute one\", get ta Nazmir as soon as possible.', 136590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
