('', 'Our work is nearly complete. Soon all of Argus will fall to darkness!', 136586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do what you like with the fleshling and her ally. They are of no concern.', '', 136585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not give Locus-Walker the satisfaction of disrupting our efforts. Capture him at all costs.', '', 136584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is plenty material for the harvest, here. Let none of it go to waste!', 136583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity he did not kill the elf and her ally, too.', '', 136582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal with this intruder, Seawarden. My will be done.', '', 136581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the Viceroy finally took care of that meddling priest.', '', 136580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paying Respects', '', 136578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d bet my boots we\'ll find more Ashvane weapons at the docks. We need to learn who\'s buying them.', '', 136577, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 105449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sisters are many... Kul Tiras will fall...', 136576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot win! The coven will not stop until all are made to serve!', 136575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Face my wrath!', 136574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive... but it will take more than that to best a matron of the Heartsbane Coven!', 136573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It matters not. See what becomes of the enemies of the coven! Acolytes, destroy our wayward pawn!', 136572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So some meddlesome clod managed to turn one of our creations against us? You must think you\'re so clever.', 136571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen it this busy before. Something big must be going down.', '', 136570, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 105448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Privateers, mercenaries. Even pirates are welcome. Naturally, it\'s a, uh... colorful town.', '', 136569, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 105447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freehold is a \"free people\'s port.\" Unlike Boralus, it has no rules or regulations about what vessels are allowed to dock.', '', 136568, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 105446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, $c. We\'re completely out of seaweed. Everybody has felt too ill to go into the water to harvest. Give Therold my apologies.', 136567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sisters will avenge me...', 136566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should not have interfered!', 136565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
