('', 'You will fall before the matron...', 136563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This town belongs to the coven, interloper!', 136562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much to do, so little time!$b$bI must bless the fishermen and their equipment, read the tides for omens, pray for the return of our sailors...', 136561, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
