('The sirens are out in full force today, but do not leave the soil. Steer clear of islands and you shall be prosperous.', 'The sirens are out in full force today, but do not leave the soil. Steer clear of islands and you shall be prosperous.', 136558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
