('I see.', 'I see.', 136544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As the naaru lay dying, L\'ura\'s essence called to me. A being born of the Light had turned to shadow.\n\nIt was a familiar sensation.\n\nThe transformation you witnessed is under my control, to be used when I see fit. I am the same person I was... and yet, something more.\n\nThe use of such power makes some... uneasy. But shadow is a force to be harnessed, not feared.\n\nAs with any weapon, one must maintain constant control when wielding it.', 136543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to you in the Seat of the Triumvirate?', 'What happened to you in the Seat of the Triumvirate?', 136542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
