('Razgaji told me to challenge you to a duel.', 'Razgaji told me to challenge you to a duel.', 136463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d better watch yourself... I don\'t take kindly to strangers.', 'You\'d better watch yourself... I don\'t take kindly to strangers.', 136462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask me how I ended up in Vol\'dun and I\'ll give you a list of graveyards to visit...', 'Ask me how I ended up in Vol\'dun and I\'ll give you a list of graveyards to visit...', 136461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to the count of three to turn around and walk away... Three!', 'You have to the count of three to turn around and walk away... Three!', 136460, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m training? Beat it!', 'Can\'t you see I\'m training? Beat it!', 136459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokhan, I\'m here to help you and Princess Talanji investigate Nazmir.', 'Rokhan, I\'m here to help you and Princess Talanji investigate Nazmir.', 136458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Princess Talanji be sendin\' us ta Nazmir. We gonna need ya pterrordaxes ta get us dere.', '', 136457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do what you must to secure the town. I will arrive shortly to investigate the ruins personally.', 136453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tomb inside may hold powerful relics that could prove useful for our coven\'s rituals.', 136451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The miners at Fletcher\'s Hollow have stumbled upon a previously undisturbed ruin hidden deep within the Elderstone Mine.', 136450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters of the coven, take heed.', 136449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve already lost two good men in there. Don\'t make yourself the third.', 136448, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what they\'re up to, but the magic coming out of that place seems to sap your very life away.', 136447, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 97638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A word of warning, $c. Avoid the mine at all costs.', 136446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the last of the villagers. With any luck, they\'ll make it to Fallhaven unscathed.', 136445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like they\'re sending in the big guns! Brace yourselves, boys!', 136444, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More attackers from the town! Hold your position!', 136443, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 97634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like they\'re onto us. Protect the civilians!', 136442, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, take a position with them and hold off any attacks from the town!', 136441, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 97632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, boys, let\'s secure this road so we can get these bystanders out of harm\'s way.', 136440, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 97631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s hope you brought an army in that pack of yours.', 136439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You hear that, boys? The mainlander\'s gonna help us take our town back!', 136438, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, let\'s just say that the creepy looking wicker people aren\'t for show.\n\nIt all started a few weeks back with some of the miners disappearing. Then all of a sudden, these creatures started showing up and driving us out of our town. It all started around the time that Waycrest girl started nosing around, but even after she left the problem just kept getting worse.\n\nNow, the things have taken over and have captured most of our villagers to boot. I managed to hold this point with a handful of volunteers, but I\'ve got no idea how I\'m supposed to get my town back.\n\nSo unless you\'re here to help, you might as well keep moving.', 136437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to help.', 'I\'m here to help.', 136436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happening here?', 'What\'s happening here?', 136435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever since these nightmarish creatures started pouring out of the mines, our village has gone to shambles.  \n\nI hope you have better luck finding the source of this mess than we did.', 136434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero!', 'Thank you, hero!', 136433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you find your mother.', 'I\'ll help you find your mother.', 136432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been very patient.', 'You\'ve been very patient.', 136431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s soooo lonely here without Ma\'da.$b$bCould you help me look for her? Please! I promise I won\'t be trouble.', 136430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ma\'da told me to stay here. I\'ve waited ages now and Ma\'da still hasn\'t come back!$b$bI\'m tired of waiting. I want my ma\'da!', 136429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 136428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'s Ma\'da? I want to go home!', 136427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did Ma\'da go? She\'s been gone for so long.', 136426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is so cold... where is Ma\'da?', 136425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone else going to Nazmir? You are not coming back, trust me.', '', 136422, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmph. Say no more. I be makin\' my way ta Nazmir. Hope we can catch up with da princess.', 136421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji already be in Nazmir? I be gettin\' movin\', den. See ya dere.', '', 136420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve not a moment to waste. Falconhurst hasn\'t been heard from in days.', 136419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 103278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I th-think I can s-sneak to the cave where my Sister is. I\'ll meet you there.', 136418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be makin\' my way ta Nazmir. See ya dere.', 136417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose the Vindicaar power that you want to use on Argus. Only one power can be active at a time.', '', 136416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quality ingredients are not easy to find in Vol\'dun, but if you eat quickly and close your eyes da food doesn\'t taste as bad as you\'d expect!', '', 136415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to learn about alpacas, you\'ve come to the right place! I know everything there is to know and more.', '', 136414, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'dun may be a treacherous wasteland, but it\'s da only home I\'ve got.', '', 136413, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need repairs, Durael.', 'I need repairs, Durael.', 136412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be goin\' into a place no one in Zuldazar wants ta go. Be prepared.', '', 136407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SMASH!', '', 136406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am also bringing dis outsider who wishes to speak with you, mighty loa.', '', 136405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. Dis is de way.', '', 136404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I know dis voice! And dese gifts, very nice. Come in, come in!', '', 136403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Motherlode moving out! Get us some reinforcements!', '', 136402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me skin! It burns!', '', 136398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhh!', '', 136397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great Bwonsamdi, de drum has sounded in your name! Dese offerings await you!', '', 136396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doba quzhu ta tawbo! Metah bo chu!', '', 136395, 14, 56822, 0, 64, 0, 98530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Now sound de drum!', '', 136394, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 98529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let de vision guide your footsteps to form de ritual circle. Careful, now! Bwonsamdi will not be happy if de ritual gets sloppy.', '', 136393, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 98528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well you got me there. Still comfortable regardless.$B$BNow if you\'ll excuse me, I\'ve got quite a bit of reading to do.', '', 136392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you\'re sitting down.', 'But you\'re sitting down.', 136391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am well, $n. Thank you for asking.$B$BBefore you venture out to the fields of battle I wanted to make sure you know that my services are always available should you need a place to rest.$B$BBe well.', 136390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, Ishanah. How are you?', 'It is good to see you, Ishanah. How are you?', 136389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all done with your side job, are you? Can we get a little <hic> professionalism here?', '', 136388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toxic stingers? I\'m sure those serve a totally legitimate purpose.', '', 136387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s dangerous out here! <hic> You really should stick with me, you know!', '', 136386, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 105467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, uh... suppose I\'ll just wait.', '', 136385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic> Over here!', '', 136384, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 105465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, what are you waitin\' for?!', '', 136383, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 105464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic> Hey, lizard.', '', 136382, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 105461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your blades! Lok-tar ogar!', '', 136380, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 108959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [300] Dig Tunnel', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [300] Dig Tunnel', 136379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $gbub:toots;. Lemme tell you all about the latest technology to hit the warfront:\n\nTunnels.\n\nThat\'s right. For just ONE huge pile of gold, my associate and I will dig you and your wartime comrades a tunnel to the front lines. Whaddya say?', '', 136378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a rough town. Just <hic> let me do the talkin\'.', '', 136377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are. Freehold.', '', 136376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm. We went right last time... so it MUST be left! Think my head\'s finally clearing up.', '', 136375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take de sphere back to de camp before de sethrak realize it\'s gone! Hurry!', 136374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh. We\'re gettin\' close. I can feel it.', '', 136373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blimey, what a hike. Just need another little sip...', '', 136372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... what? Who are you? What is that?', 'Wh... what? Who are you? What is that?', 136371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That thing was controlling my brain?!', 'That thing was controlling my brain?!', 136370, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Ah-ha! This looks familiar. We <hic> must be going the right way.', '', 136369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... what happened?', 'Wh... what happened?', 136368, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uq naggwa... our master... comes for you...', '', 136367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late! You cannot stop the tide that rises before you!', '', 136366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, that hits the spot. Let\'s get movin\'.', '', 136365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, still a bit foggy. Just need a little drink to clear my head.', '', 136364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no. It was DEFINITELY right.', '', 136363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic> Now, which way was it... left?', '', 136362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers... they overwhelm my thoughts...', 'The whispers... they overwhelm my thoughts...', 136361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul for the sea...', 'My soul for the sea...', 136360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y\'za qam yyqzz...', 'Y\'za qam yyqzz...', 136359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O, intruder. You wander into places you do not belong!', 'O, intruder. You wander into places you do not belong!', 136358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your heart shall make a suitable sacrifice!', 'Your heart shall make a suitable sacrifice!', 136357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give myself fully for this power!', 'I give myself fully for this power!', 136356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is following you.', '', 136350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grows tired of following you and runs away.', '', 136349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the sea taken care of, it\'s time to set our sights on the cavern.', 136348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De candles are placed and de offerings are ready. Now, de circle must be drawn...', '', 136347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skycaller Gem is overloading! Who knows what will happen if you use it now?', 'The Skycaller Gem is overloading! Who knows what will happen if you use it now?', 136346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
