('Reborn in Fel!', '', 136344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe you\'re free? We all serve a master.', '', 136343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From Fel... to Fel.', '', 136342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin.', 'Let us begin.', 136341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These plains will thrive with the blood-soaked soil of our enemies.', '', 136340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must select one of the countless ways to kill you.', '', 136339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So eager to die?', '', 136338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be first.', '', 136337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can make you immortal. However, you first have to die!', 136336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How fortuitous, my pets were getting hungry.', 136335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, look! Another pet has come to play.', 136334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me, I\'ll find a way down... Eventually.', '', 136333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 136327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 136326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright... I think I\'m ready to go. We can still fix this.', '', 136325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack High Perch.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack High Perch.', 136324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask Fozruk to attack Valorcall Pass.', 'Ask Fozruk to attack Valorcall Pass.', 136323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
