('I am wearing shoes.', 'I am wearing shoes.', 136305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cold flooring beneath my feet helps me maintain my concentration.', '', 136304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... And why aren\'t you wearing any shoes?', 'Interesting... And why aren\'t you wearing any shoes?', 136303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that behind you?', 'What is that behind you?', 136302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that portal doing here?', 'What is that portal doing here?', 136301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is full of magic and mystery.', '', 136300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOW COULD YOU?!', '', 136297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
