('Dis is Xibala\'s sacred shrine. He will welcome a new soul to his collection!', '', 136290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world... shall drown... ak yar qi\'lwhuk h\'iwn...', '', 136278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is too late! You cannot stop our progress!', '', 136277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ifis shuul qi\'nuq yyqzz...', '', 136276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brannon Stormsong is a weak boy. The true power belongs to the sea!', '', 136275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alby? What\'s going on? Where is Lord Stormsong?', '', 136274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 109029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wouldn\'t believe me if I told you, Therold. It\'s a disaster.', '', 136273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it down! Lady Sylvanas won\'t be happy if we fail our mission.', '', 136272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tucker! Should have known. At least he paid the price for his incompetence.', '', 136271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was Tucker. The sethrak killed him first.', '', 136270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should\'ve seen the attack coming. Who was supposed to be the lookout?', '', 136269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think that\'s our fault, boss, given that we were attacked by a group that wasn\'t supposed to be here.', 136268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will be if we do our jobs properly, Ingrid.', '', 136267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is she ever happy, boss?', 136266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
