('<The Dark Fetish seems to move out of the corner of your eye but never when looked at directly. Perhaps it is a trick of the light. Perhaps not.>', '', 136264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh come on!', 136263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...That information is classified.', '', 136262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When WAS the first time you were cut in half?', 136261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not the first time I\'ve been cut in half. Hopefully it\'ll be the last.', '', 136260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes.', '', 136259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, Clayton, we\'re undead, of course we can survive getting cut in half.', 136258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, how did you survive? I saw you get cut in half.', '', 136257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have fun with the gem! I think the ritual kept it... mostly intact.', 136256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worms that eat faces? I\'m getting out of here!', 'Worms that eat faces? I\'m getting out of here!', 136255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can management let this happen? That\'s it, we need to unionize.', 'How can management let this happen? That\'s it, we need to unionize.', 136254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for my break anyway. I\'m outta here.', 'It\'s time for my break anyway. I\'m outta here.', 136253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll move up ahead to higher ground. Let the squad know to rendezvous on my location.', '', 136252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m used to monster parts in the shipments, but living monsters? Count me out.', 'I\'m used to monster parts in the shipments, but living monsters? Count me out.', 136251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just jam that one part in...', '', 136250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you on the other side of the packing area. I\'m going to see what\'s happening further into town.', 136249, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s going on here? What... What IS that?', 136248, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 136247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n. Everyone aboard has been quite active. You look like you\'ve been busy yourself! If you ever need a place to rest I\'m always here for you.', 136246, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That? Why that\'s just a portal I\'ve conjured to allow safe passage to and from Dalaran.$B$BNever know when we\'re gonna need reinforcements!', '', 136245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behind me rests the Netherlight Crucible. It is an ancient remnant of this world that once served as a source of considerable magic.$B$BThough its potential power is thought by many to be a gift, empowering it would require great sacrifice... as well as a delicate balance of Light and Shadow.', 136244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Don\'t experiment with shadow magic,\" they told me.$B$B\"It\'ll doom all of Azeroth if you keep delving into this,\" they warned me.$B$B\"Give me back my arm, you can\'t use it as a component!\" he screamed, as I pulled his arm off.$B$BOh, sorry, just reminiscing!', 136243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The \"yea\"s have it. Looks like we\'re staying to watch a lightning show.', '', 136242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay.', '', 136241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay.', '', 136240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and all those against.', '', 136239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea.', '', 136238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I better come along and make sure dis gets done right.', '', 136237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yea.', 136236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yea.', 136235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll put it to a vote. All those in favor of staying in a dangerous swamp to watch someone else use a gem to kill snake people.', '', 136234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, Chadwick! We can FRY them with the skycaller gem that $n is gonna get!', 136233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mages and I will meet you up there.', '', 136232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t think I\'d see a friendly face in this place. Thanks for the save, did you hear Ingrid\'s plan yet?', '', 136231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should have known better than to come to such a dangerous place unprepared...', '', 136230, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll get out of here while you take care of things... then we\'ll see what this gem can do!', 136229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the rescue, these sethrak are looking for some sort of shadow magic in Nazmir. Who knows why?', '', 136228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a relief. These sethrak want some sort of magic to unlock the power of one of their artifacts.', 136227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been receiving your shipments?', 'Have you been receiving your shipments?', 136226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAH! GET THIS THING OFF ME!', '', 136225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bastard!', 'You bastard!', 136224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
