('', 'You know, I haven\'t seen that Stormsong kid in a few days. I wish they would put somebody more competent in charge of this place, but who am I to say?', 136220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 300, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noticed anything strange?', 'Noticed anything strange?', 136219, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
