('From this table, you can queue for Island Expeditions. \n\nNew interface coming soon!\n\nThank you for testing Battle for Azeroth!', '', 136216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
