('Jaina! Thank the Light you\'ve come! You are sorely needed in this fight.', '', 136170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kel\'vax was our son in life, but now he is just another monster. Destroy him, so we can send his soul to Bwonsamdi.', 136169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
