('', 'Help cleanse da old holy place of Bwonsamdi. Ta think, it used ta be so glorious...', 136166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... dere be someone over dere... and dey ain\'t a blood troll! Hey, over here!', 136165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
