('At dis rate, we never gonna cleanse dis place for Bwonsamdi!', '', 136162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, dere you are! I just heard Mutumba\'s report. It seems you two had quite an adventure.', 136161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I kept these woodlands safe in life. I won\'t be a tool of these witches!', 136160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... beautiful...', '', 136159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
