('Bring me spheres of coalesced flame, that I may empower myself for battle!', '', 136157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, now. Ya wounds be deep.', 136156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will not stop their efforts to corrupt me and my brethren. But, maybe your arrival can turn the tide.', '', 136155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, the corruption ceases!', '', 136154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to leave.', 'We\'re ready to leave.', 136153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s never safe to travel these dunes alone.', 136152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In life I protected this land.\n\nIn death I vow to do the same.', '', 136151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See ya on da other side.', 136150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Bwonsamdi\'s will be done. It time we all be gettin\' our rest.', '', 136149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I can\'t see Bwonsamdi, I no want ta... please, STOP!', '', 136148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your fate be up ta Bwonsamdi now. Best hope he be havin\' more mercy dan us.', 136147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
