('Our victories mean nothing. So long as Sargeras has the soul of Argus to fuel his infinite army, Azeroth remains in grave peril.', '', 136120, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titans can sever that connection... but not here. They need ta bring the soul o\' Argus ta their place o\' power... the Seat o\' the Pantheon.', '', 136119, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The very cradle of creation!', '', 136118, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! Aggramar\'s essence is free! He can stand beside his brethren once more.', '', 136117, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us return to the Burrow.', '', 136116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Our foes flee before us!', '', 136115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwonsamdi! No... G\'huun promised dat I would never be defeated!', '', 136114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be such a worry wart! I have found that creatures of supersition are never as fearsome as the stories would lead you to believe.', '', 136113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gotta bad feeling about dis... Be careful, $n!', '', 136112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! With the leader dead, these minions will soon fall. Let us feast upon them!', '', 136111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAH! Curse you and curse Bwonsamdi, he NOT HAVE ME SOUL!', '', 136110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spirits be fuel for the Blood God!', '', 136109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kel\'vax be vulnerable again... it be up ta you!', '', 136108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are... impossible! I no be chained, not by you, not by Bwonsamdi!', '', 136107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be time ta face da judgment of Bwonsamdi, we have da phylacteries, and $n got me da bones ta counter ya voodoo!', '', 136106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother, father...', '', 136105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kel\'vax, dis be enough!', 136104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will join those servants of Bwonsamdi in an eternity of suffering!', '', 136103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH! The Blood God demands your destruction... and I shall deliver it, Bwonsamdi be damned!', '', 136102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It no matter. I have seen da rise and fall of dis civilization... you no be stoppin\' me!', '', 136101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Where be me zombies... me skeletons? What be goin\' on?', '', 136100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal... me armies be destroyin\' you. Servants, ta me!', '', 136099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage Y\'mera waves for you to follow her.', 136098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do what I can ta ease the titan spirits while you put an end ta their torturers!', '', 136097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy! I don\'t recognize you. You here to help or what?', '', 136096, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough with this charade!', '', 136095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful \'bout stickin\' yer nose into Ashvane business. They\'re as filthy as they come.', 136094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not bad, for a flea-bitten stowaway. Yer lucky I didn\'t find ye before we ran aground, or it\'d be your guts I\'m scrapin\' off me boots.', 136093, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 109583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come at me, ya briny hags! I\'ll fly yer hides as me new colors!', 136092, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 103924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coven\'s torments o\' the Highfather have taken form!', '', 136091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coven strikes at ye through the storms o\' Golganneth!', '', 136090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons are turnin\' the Shaper\'s flames against ye!', '', 136089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! Mortals ain\'t meant ta walk the Dreamweaver\'s path!', '', 136088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The southern skies swell with chaotic energy.', 'The southern skies swell with chaotic energy.', 136087, 0, 52240, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father once ruled with an iron fist, and none would dare break his laws. But he was also just, helping those in need, so his subjects loved him for it.$b$bNow? Now de iron fist is forgotten. Dose he trusts pour poison in his ear as dey plot and scheme.$b$bI do not know what dey are planning, but I know our people cannot afford to wait and see.', 136086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children, slay dis creature!', 136085, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a lightsphene in the space.', 'Place a lightsphene in the space.', 136084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a hesselian in the space.', 'Place a hesselian in the space.', 136083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place an argulite in the space.', 'Place an argulite in the space.', 136082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a florid malachite in the space.', 'Place a florid malachite in the space.', 136081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Place a chemirine in the space.', 'Place a chemirine in the space.', 136080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a labradorite in the space.', 'Place a labradorite in the space.', 136079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where a lightsphene could fit.', '', 136078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where a hesselian could fit.', '', 136077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where an argulite could fit.', '', 136076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where a chemirine could fit.', '', 136075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where a florid malachite could fit.', '', 136074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see an empty space where a labradorite could fit.', '', 136073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De tide of blood will break upon you from de North, and you will be made to kneel.', 'De tide of blood will break upon you from de North, and you will be made to kneel.', 136072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon dey will come from Nazmir, and you will all see what we have seen.', 'Soon dey will come from Nazmir, and you will all see what we have seen.', 136071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No! You cannot stop us. He promised us you cannot stop us.', 'No! No! You cannot stop us. He promised us you cannot stop us.', 136070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood of a hero will fetch a fine price.', 'Blood of a hero will fetch a fine price.', 136069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t be telling any guards about me if you\'re dead.', 'You won\'t be telling any guards about me if you\'re dead.', 136068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you to stand against us?', 'Who are you to stand against us?', 136067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ata\'mal crystal soon showed me the horrible truth of what would come to pass if we accepted the titan\'s offer.', '', 136066, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 88437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had hoped the others would sense the darkness behind Sargeras\'s words.', '', 136065, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power... And he speaks the truth.', '', 136064, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is little enough to ask, for what he offers us.', '', 136063, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will become Legion, and defeat the hungering void that would consume us all.', '', 136062, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swear loyalty to me, pledge the hearts of your people to my cause.', '', 136061, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hunt you across the stars, traitor! Even if it takes a thousand years!', '', 136059, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K\'ure! Help us!', '', 136058, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... keep my family safe.', '', 136057, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hatuun! You do not have to do this!', '', 136056, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It cannot end like this. Take the others and go, Prophet. We will buy you time.', '', 136055, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No...', '', 136054, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talgath has turned against us!', '', 136053, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for hiding is over. Aid me... or everything ends.', 136052, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 88403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember fleeing... to keep him from his prize.', 136051, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 88402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember unity... until it was shattered by betrayal.', 136050, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 88401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember the awakening... how life sprang forth all around us.', 136049, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 88400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When my new Pantheon rises, no power in the universe will stand against the Legion!', '', 136048, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Life-Binder will soon reveal herself. She will not escape me, master!', '', 136047, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One still eludes us. Her essence is needed to ensure the victory of my crusade.', '', 136046, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our kin still resist the true path, master. But they will soon be broken.', '', 136045, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour of rebirth draws near. Are the souls prepared?', '', 136044, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Become the instrument of my wrath once again, Aggramar. End this incursion of the Light.', '', 136043, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who will not serve shall be destroyed. It is the only way.', '', 136042, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 88392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The circle nears completion. The mortals must not disrupt the rebirth.', '', 136041, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your bidding, master?', '', 136040, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 88390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Our foes are behind us! If you will not face them with me, then I shall do so alone.', '', 136039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azerite fissures begin to erupt nearby!', '', 136038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth!', '', 136037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should they fall to darkness, Sargeras will have the power he needs to claim the final titan.', '', 136036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel those demons twistin\' the spirits o\' the titans! Forcin\' \'em ta use their might ta serve the Legion!', '', 136035, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ignore him, sister! Focus on your duty. These souls are nearly ready to join Aggramar in the master\'s service.', 136034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A faint glow emanates from the object.', '', 136033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tire of that worm\'s babbling! Let me scorch the flesh from his miserable bones!', 136032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaarggh! Witches! You call that torment? I have endured far worse!', '', 136031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last, the end is upon us. Press on, my friends.', '', 136030, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much agony here... so many voices. It\'s... it\'s nearly overwhelmin\'! But I can feel Eonar urgin\' us forward.', '', 136029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart of Antorus lies before us. The power behind the Legion\'s infinite army.', '', 136028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So close now to the end...', '', 136027, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain here, Magni. The rest of us will go on.', '', 136026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The souls of the Pantheon are free, but they endured so much sufferin\'. Let me bide with \'em fer a time. Offer a bit o\' comfort.', '', 136025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who could ever imagine such a sacrifice?', '', 136024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may be the one place in the universe sacred to the Legion. Demons would pluck out their eyes sooner than gaze upon it.', '', 136023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard all the prattling I can bear. Let us show this lackey of Sargeras that he has no claim to our world!', '', 136022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon comes the awakening of my brother, Argus. Together, our new Pantheon will join the master in breaking your fetid world. But you will not live to see it.', '', 136021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Warlock_DemonicEmpowerment.blp:20|tKin\'garoth casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:249740|h[Overcharge]|h|r!', '', 136020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound effect for troops', 'Sound effect for troops', 136019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88736, 88736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound effect for troops', '', 136018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound effect for troops', '', 136017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 90065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the Alliance answered the call as well.', '', 136016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shipments in the barrel seem to be made up of safe, mundane monster parts.', '', 136015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'uure, free from the Legion\'s grasp at last? I welcome your presence, torchbearer.', '', 136014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will put these to use immediately. Thank you for recovering them.', '', 136013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armaments from one of our past assaults litter the ridge on the eastern side of the hold. Their recovery would aid our war effort.', '', 136012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bit worn, but still functional. These will do nicely.', '', 136011, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('||TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '||TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 136010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 136009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 136007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 136006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 136005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter:20|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 136004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to end this! Meet me at the river\'s edge.', '', 136003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s hold will be broken at every turn! Do not let them rest! Do not relent!', '', 136002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The keystone continues to gain strength. Interesting... Perhaps we can use it to tear open more powerful rifts.', '', 136001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them the price of their arrogance!', '', 136000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons will be caught off guard, assuming all our attention to be focused on Argus.', '', 135999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the keystone to pass through the rift. Bring the fight to the Legion!', '', 135998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will punish their hubris by hunting them any place they dare to tread.', '', 135997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even as we march upon the heart of Argus, the Legion continues its crusade on other worlds.', '', 135996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is as I thought... the stone is depleted, but intact. It shall still prove useful to us.', '', 135995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s fanatical crusade falters. We will purge their stench from every world they have defiled.', '', 135994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new invasion point harbors a Legion commander. Go and deliver vengeance!', '', 135993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s arrogance is clear. Pursue them to every world they infest. Show them that they cannot escape our wrath.', '', 135992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion brazenly advances on worlds beyond Argus, spreading its forces thin. Find their portals and kill the demons on the other side!', '', 135991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My top commander, Lothraxion, was sent to defend Azeroth alongside the Silver Hand... and to guide you here.', '', 135990, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An end? Pah! Their numbers are beyond measure. It is an impossible task. A death wish!', '', 135989, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 88273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seek you as allies. We came to Argus at the call of the Army of the Light to bring an end to the Legion. Stand with us once more!', '', 135988, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 88285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hope. Just pain. Only pain!', '', 135987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master! I go to claim your prize!', '', 135986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master demands your doom!', '', 135985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A merciful release!', '', 135984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know the darkness!', '', 135983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But your ally saved many of us from the Legion\'s grasp. Perhaps you have changed.', '', 135982, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 88232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My watch... ends.', '', 135981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence is an infestation. Infestations must be purged!', '', 135980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The master... will be... your end.', 135979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... come closer, little ones!', 135978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You left me... wanting...', 135977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'New playthings? How irresistible!', 135976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sight fails me...', '', 135975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the weakness in your soul!', '', 135974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! They are nearby, I am certain.', '', 135973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames... will... claim you...', '', 135972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All worlds will burn in felfire!', '', 135971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Im... impossible...', '', 135970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, small ones. Die by my hand!', '', 135969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness... will... claim you...', '', 135968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows hunger!', '', 135967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought down the brutes and cost the Legion another victory. Their downfall is at hand.', '', 135966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brutal eredar have been awakened from their stasis. Cut them down where they stand!', '', 135965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion grow reckless. They reek of desperation!', '', 135964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An infernal has crashed down, killing the very masters who spawned it. Destroy this monstrosity before it jeopardizes our advance!', '', 135963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A successful strike and a warframe returned to me in one piece? It truly is a miracle!', '', 135962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forces inside Antorus must see they are not safe from our attacks. Take a warframe and hit targets of opportunity behind their lines!', '', 135961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The krokul slaves fled somewhere further down the ridge as they were freed. They could not have gone far.', '', 135960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so the Legion is deprived of yet another weapon.', '', 135959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Powerful eredar are held in stasis as their bodies are being twisted into an even more brutal form. Cut the fiends down while they slumber!', '', 135958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious blast! The Light\'s advance will not be stopped!', '', 135957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion artificers are reckless, and I have found a weakness in their ordnance. Shorten their fuses and destroy their stockpiles!', '', 135955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your master has failed, demons. To the abyss with you!', 135954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every ship grounded without a pilot means one less enemy firing on the Vindicaar\'s shields. Excellent work!', '', 135953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts have pinpointed a gathering of some of the Legion\'s most skilled pilots. This would be a perfect opportunity to take them out!', '', 135952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory is nigh, champions! Dispatch their remaining forces. I will see to their vessel myself.', 135951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You scorched the hovels of those Legion pests and cleared the way for our troops. Well done!', '', 135950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We identified an area crucial to getting our troops to the front lines, only to find the place infested with demon spiders. Burn out those nests!', '', 135949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The death howls of those vile beasts will be remembered by the soldiers you saved, even as they march on the gates of Antorus.', '', 135948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion hounds harry our troops as they try to pull back. Rescue as many of our forces as you can!', '', 135947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions of darkness! You will know the might of a titan!', 135946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the potency of life! Fear its power!', 135945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have stoked the fire in the hearts of our soldiers. There is no doubt we will win this war!', '', 135944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The courage of our troops has never faltered, but even an experienced soldier can grow weary. A show of force on the front lines would be a welcome inspiration!', '', 135943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way forward is clear. Our campaign to bring down the Legion carries on!', '', 135942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon beasts and deadly traps slow our advance. Deal with these impediments!', '', 135941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saved from a grisly fate. My soldiers send their thanks.', '', 135940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Begone, intruders! Back to your master!', 135939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of our scouting parties has gone missing. The Legion may have them pinned down--or worse. Find our soldiers... before it\'s too late!', '', 135938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope my brothers and sisters will know some measure of peace.', '', 135937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many of my kinsmen\'s souls endure torment at the hands of the Legion. Free them, that they may rest.', '', 135936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The torment these soldiers endured... You arrived just in time.', '', 135935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inquisitors emerge from darkness and abduct our patrols. Find these captives and spare them from their fate.', '', 135934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To think Legion soldiers drink that swill... disgusting to the last!', '', 135933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soldiers speak of demonic brews that melt armor and disfigure flesh. Find the source of this insidious alchemy and destroy it!', '', 135932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s plans shatter as its Burning Crusade crumbles to dust.', '', 135931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion summoners are calling forth a massive infernal to rain terror upon our allies. Put an end to their ritual!', '', 135930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese undead are an affront to Bwonsamdi. We can\'t rest until we make dis right.', 135928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De will of Bwonsamdi must be done. We cannot rest until dat happens.', '', 135927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stand together. For Azeroth!', '', 135926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' ain\'t right with this place. A presence calls ta me from somewhere deep inside the earth.', '', 135925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance is scouring the far corners of Azeroth in search of every advantage against us. We must do the same.', 135924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It shall be so, Warchief.', '', 135923, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 93902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chieftain Bloodhoof, have our champion join you for your feast in Thunder Bluff. By the time dessert is served, I want their oath of loyalty to the Horde.', 135922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 93837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each option would have its uses. I believe $n knows these peoples. Which potential ally do you suggest we pursue first?', 135921, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 94777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even without the Nightwell, Suramar holds vast arcane resources. A most useful arrow added to my quiver.', 135920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The regent lord and I agree that our kingdoms have much in common. We believe the nightborne would make valuable allies.', 135919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I too have a suggestion, Warchief. The sin\'dorei have maintained diplomatic ties with the nightborne since we helped liberate Suramar from the Legion.', 135918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A simple people, but strong. They would be a boon on the battlefield.', 135917, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 94775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have invited their leaders to a great feast in Mulgore. This could be a chance to bring them to our side.', '', 135916, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, the tauren of Highmountain fought boldly alongside us in our campaign against the Burning Legion, just as our ancestors did long ago.', '', 135915, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 93826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War is coming. We need fresh blood added to the ranks of the Horde. What say you?', 135914, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 94774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leaders of the Horde, I summoned you here--along with one of our greatest champions--because our enemies are gathering their strength.', 135913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 94772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no mere siege weapon...', '', 135911, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is wrong.', '', 135910, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no guards this close to their weapon?', '', 135909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
