('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_FELFLAMESTRIKE.BLP:20|tThe Paraxis charges up its |cFFFF0000|Hspell:248861|h[Spear of Doom]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_FELFLAMESTRIKE.BLP:20|tThe Paraxis charges up its |cFFFF0000|Hspell:248861|h[Spear of Doom]|h|r!', 135906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us destroy this foul machine while we still have the chance.', '', 135905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to my burrow. There is much that must be done.', '', 135904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
