('I can assist you, $c, with any repairs your equipment may need.', '', 135889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will not find us all. Not in the shadows.', '', 135888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no fighting them. With each death they return!', '', 135887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
