('', 'The darkened naaru pulses with Void energy.', 135882, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 88166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help...Help... me...', '', 135881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
