('Your kind will fall.', '', 135847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the master!', '', 135846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brethren in the Army of the Light await our arrival. Only together will we achieve victory.', '', 135845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay with your life!', '', 135844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da mawfiends... just wanted ta make... one... more...', 135843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya be good power for totems!', 135842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... couldn\'t you have returned out to us? To your people? To me?', '', 135841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is open. Come, children of Argus, allies, champions. The Vindicaar awaits!', '', 135840, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every spare moment, every resource, has gone toward the birth of a new vessel. Our instrument of retribution.', '', 135839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar has long been crippled by the crash that brought us to this world many years ago.', '', 135838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend me your strength, $p. We will open the way together.', '', 135835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The forces of the Void are always looking to claim footholds in our world. Your resistance is crucial for preserving balance.', 135834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have quelled the void presence in this area. Well done.', 135833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fine hunt, heroes.', 135831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The beast has been defeated. Well done, champions.', 135830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, heroes.', 135828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark portals are tearing open reality, allowing shadow energy to pour into our realm. Put a stop to this, heroes!', 135827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The void energy here is spreading out of control. Stem this dark tide before we are overrun.', 135826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something foul is stalking these grounds, heroes. Hunt it down and destroy it.', 135825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will save our world and put a stop to the Burning Legion... once and for all.', '', 135824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fellow draenei... champions of Azeroth... the time has come to invade Argus.', '', 135823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An entity from the Void has emerged into our world. It must not be allowed to spread its corruption.', 135822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I sense a surge of void energy in this area. Find the source and destroy it.', 135821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 135820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have already won.', '', 135819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late.', '', 135818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crusade... must...', '', 135817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have... failed...', '', 135816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antorus calls to me.', '', 135815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never defeat us!', '', 135814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The apocalypse is upon you!', '', 135813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 135812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is forfeit!', '', 135811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our crusade is eternal!', '', 135810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be crushed beneath me!', '', 135809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then my parents can finally return home.', '', 135808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus is our ancestral home. We will not see it in the Legion\'s hands any longer.', '', 135807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen the draenei assemble a force of this magnitude.', 135806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, I will show you to the Vault of Lights. The others await our arrival.', '', 135805, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I commend your heroism. Every soldier on the field of battle counts.', '', 135804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A group of Lightforged are trapped behind enemy lines. We must save them.', '', 135803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power! These fiends must learn that we will not be defeated so easily.', '', 135802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion portals have opened near Nath\'raxas Spire to reclaim it. Use one of our warframes to see that their effort fails.', '', 135801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will see the Legion\'s end, even if we must tear Argus itself asunder.', '', 135800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eredar sorcerers twist the fel blood of this world into weapons to use against us. They must be dismantled.', '', 135799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make no mistake, each world is infested with countless armies of demons. We have much to do.', '', 135798, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. The Legion\'s armies are scattered across their conquered worlds. We must ensure they do not come to Argus\'s defense before our work is done.', '', 135797, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good of you to show up. There are more targets here than even I can shoot.', 135796, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 88107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The giant frog lies dead in the mud.>', '', 135795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will purge the Legion from every world they defile. This is only the beginning!', '', 135794, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s forces are unprepared for your arrival! Put an end to them!', '', 135793, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes, it is working even better than I thought! Most excellent.', '', 135792, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, fire the gun! For Argus! For our people!', '', 135791, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 88116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are operational. Prepare to fire!', '', 135790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is ready. Quickly, fire the main cannon!', '', 135789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Legion\'s heart, and is fortified as such. An assault now would be madness. We will need additional preparation to tip the balance.', '', 135788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaken their forces! We will aim the Vindicaar\'s weapon for the final strike!', '', 135787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you destroy the generators, we should be able to target their defenses with the Vindicaar. We are almost there!', '', 135786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should do it! I am adding the coordinates to our beacon matrix.', '', 135785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the crucible fully functional, our weapons will shine like the stars themselves! Come, I will show you.', '', 135784, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 87685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will travel to the heart of Argus and deliver the final blow to the Legion!', '', 135783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot let this loss stop us. Light\'s Judgment is the key to our victory.', '', 135782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her long years of service to the Light will not be in vain!', '', 135781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light and Shadow depend upon one another. If we hone the power of a great being of shadow, the crucible may be complete!', '', 135780, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 87684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if... no, it could not be...', '', 135779, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light burns brightly within the crucible, but it is still not functional!', '', 135778, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scatter!', '', 135777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaah!', '', 135776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her Light can not be allowed to fall into darkness. We must safeguard what we can within the crucible.', '', 135775, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scamper!', '', 135774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more! The matter is done. Our mission remains, with or without the Light Mother.', '', 135773, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eep!', '', 135772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna tell Mista Nice on you!', '', 135771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I needed dat!', '', 135770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Stranger danger!', '', 135769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mista Nice not gonna like dis!', '', 135768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though her form has shattered, her Light has not left us. Not yet.', '', 135767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are right, Prophet. The mission still stands.', '', 135766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry, there is still great power on Argus\' shattered surface. We just need to find it!', '', 135765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light still shines within me. Within you all. We will triumph!', '', 135764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is nearly complete, but it lacks a power source. We need something quite potent indeed.', '', 135763, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must continue our mission. The Legion must be destroyed.', '', 135762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We still have our purpose. We still have a world to save. We must press on!', '', 135761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light does not die with the Prime Naaru. It shines within each of us!', '', 135760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see no reason for anyone else to know, spiritwalker. Let it be a matter kept... between friends.', '', 135759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only Mayla and our champion knew my secret before. Now I entrust it to you as well, chieftain.', '', 135758, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 93881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once it is complete, this crucible will be able focus the fundamental forces of the cosmos into your weapon! Just... not yet.', '', 135757, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 87679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not realize that I had invited a dragon to feast with us at Thunder Bluff. Had I known, I might have set a bigger table!', '', 135756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light embraces you! Revel in its power!', '', 135755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Azeroth!', '', 135754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warframe deployed!', '', 135753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them feel your fury!', '', 135752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will serve us, dragon, just as Neltharion did! Your kind always bends to the whispers.', '', 135751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have many experiments in mind for these fossils. Acquiring them was no small feat. Thank you.', '', 135750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating! The ancient trees here have pockets of fossilized resin with unusual properties. Say... you wouldn\'t mind securing some samples for me, would you, my friend?', '', 135749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will banish your darkness!', '', 135748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These heroes do not stand alone.', '', 135747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mountain belongs to us, mortals. You will soon become vessels for this world\'s true power!', '', 135746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 93894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take caution, for it requires a great deal of power to deploy a warframe. You wouldn\'t want to find yourself in need of one while it is recharging!', '', 135745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the transmitter is linked to Light\'s Judgment, we can use it to deploy a warframe to your location. I think you know what to do from there.', '', 135744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such devastation...', '', 135743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion... I need a word.', '', 135742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', 'What?', 135741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did de $r say to de witch doctah?', '', 135740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had best be going. Until next we meet... fare well, champion.', '', 135739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead, I will go to Karazhan and confer with my old mentor, Medivh. Perhaps somewhere in his ancient texts lies the knowledge needed to heal this world.', '', 135738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I will not take up arms against heroes on either side. Not after all we\'ve been through.', '', 135737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had hoped that after the war against the Legion, the people of Azeroth would build a new future together. But now the unity we forged has been shattered.', '', 135736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the life essence of Azeroth bleeds out, the leaders of the Alliance and Horde scramble to claim it as a resource. Blades are drawn, and the tides of war are rising once again.', '', 135735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems our victory on Argus was a hollow one. With his final blow, Sargeras has done much more than bury his blade in the heart of our world.', '', 135734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was wrong. Oh dere was damage, but Zul fled, with our fleet, and started a few wars. Those of us who stayed, endured. We rebuilt. Because DAT is what it means to be Zandalari.', '', 135733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'s visions, bah! Did he tell you about de time he predicted Zandalar would sink beneath de waves?', '', 135732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A valuable perspective, Lady Liadrin. You have given me much to ponder.', '', 135731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has. Make no mistake, ours has not been an easy road, and we have struggled through dark times. But together we face a world that has often turned its back on us. Together, we find strength.', 135730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And has the Horde served that purpose for you?', '', 135729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We banded together to fight for our place on Azeroth. And we realized we needed allies to stand with us.', 135728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unbridled thirst for power is the most terrible corruption of all. How did your people find their path forward?', '', 135727, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 87406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I oversee hundreds of vessels dat land and leave every month from dese docks, and I make sure every one of dem ships on time.$b$bSpeak quickly, my time is in high demand.', '', 135726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And nearly mine as well. The sin\'dorei also had a leader who struck a bargain with the Legion, poisoning us in the process.', 135725, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my entire lifetime, I never left the borders of Suramar. To see this place is to understand the fate that almost befell my people.', '', 135724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought. This tide of demons will break upon our blades!', 135723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even here on this bleak world, we fight for Azeroth!', 135722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The enemy draws near. Stand ready. We fight for the future of our world.', 135721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful demon is close... very close. Make an example of it!', 135720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Proceed.', 135719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time grows short. The enemy closes in. Approach me and stand ready, my children. The final battle is at hand.', 135718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I implore you, stand with me. Together we can drive back this onslaught and deprive Sargeras of victory.', 135717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For countless ages my spirit has lingered here, safe from the Dark Titan\'s grasp. But he has found me at last, and comes to claim my power.', 135716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, mortals, to my sanctuary.', 135715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The invaders are charging their weapons. Quickly! Use these portals to board their vessel. Stop their attack!', 135714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will be upon the courtyard shortly to finish them off. For Azeroth!', '', 135713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you have chosen your weapon. As have I.', 135712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A necessary end for such an enemy. Well done.', 135711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive skill. Though I believe my arrows would have brought that demon to an even quicker end.', 135710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most effective. Every blow dealt to the Legion is a boon to our cause.', 135709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light and shadow are both means to an end. For the foe before you, feel free to pick whatever weapon you favor.', 135708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This beast of darkness must be put down. No need for mercy, but do be swift.', 135707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Exarch, our warframe is fully operational. Behold!', '', 135706, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 87663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. May their souls finally find peace.', '', 135705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None deserve the fate that awaits souls claimed by the Legion.', '', 135704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking this hold will buy us valuable time to prepare for a full assault on Antorus.', '', 135703, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you at our staging ground near Nath\'raxas. The Vindicaar must be ready to help us secure the hold at a moment\'s notice.', '', 135702, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dere be many tales about Xibala, but I do not know which of dem be truths. Da ancients feared him, dat\'s for sure.\n\nIt be said dat Xibala made people\'s bodies swell up wit\' putrefaction.\n\nOr anyone who laid eyes on him became a livin\' skeleton.\n\nOr he lurked in da shadows an came out at night an devoured people while dey slept.\n\nOr he waited near da roads an\' caused people to die coughin\' up blood. \n\nEven da bravest warriors know ta stay away from dis place.', '', 135701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Maiev\'s blade, now yours. His punishment in Antorus will be severe.', '', 135700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who was Xibala?', 'Who was Xibala?', 135699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dreadlord that once served me in the Black Temple has cast his lot with the Legion. He will regret opposing me.', '', 135698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her soul will return to Antorus to be reborn, but not without punishment. Sargeras does not take kindly to failure.', '', 135697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A doommaiden attempts to fashion an army of fiends right under our noses. She must not succeed.', '', 135696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is relentless in its assault. We must remain ever vigilant.', '', 135695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I th-think I can s-sneak to the cave where my Sister is. I\'ll meet you there.', 135694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A demon dares lead a vanguard on the Vindicaar. Its death will send a powerful message to the enemy.', '', 135693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have hunted demons throughout the Twisting Nether for a thousand years. I think I can leave this one to you.', 135692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have devised a plan to strike against the Legion. This is an operation that calls for your special skills, champion.', 135691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The younger animals in the city are particularly susceptible to void energy. Use this crystal to release them from its grasp.', '', 135690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was merciful to free these creatures from the grip of shadows. It saddens me to see the city like this.', '', 135689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should be it! Just activate the console one last time to complete the transfer. I will handle the rest!', '', 135688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done. That will have the demons reeling!', 135687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With results like that, I am confident our victory will come.', 135686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is more than one way to deliver a blow to the Legion. Well done!', 135685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To cripple the Legion\'s offensive, we need to take out their infrastructure. Strike a blow for Azeroth!', 135684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your business here, $c?', '', 135683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a target in this area that must be brought down. The choice of weapon is up to you.', 135682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes subtlety is more effective than a direct assault. I believe such a strategy is needed here.', 135681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to begin the trial.', 'We\'re ready to begin the trial.', 135680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stalling will not help you. We will find out the truth behind Miss Waycrest soon enough!', '', 135679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will not break our spirits. By recovering these mementos of our past, you have given my people faith that we can endure this. I am grateful.', '', 135678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though we can never thrive here as we once did, Argus is our home. You have eased our struggle, outsider, at least for today.', '', 135677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More of my people have been taken by the Legion. They seek to break our bonds of kinship, to turn brother against brother. Please, free them!', '', 135676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have so little, yet the demons steal our relics in hopes of cutting us off from our past. Help take back what is ours, outsider.', '', 135675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our windriders may have fallen, but true power lies in the grip of an axe!', '', 135674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery or not, our strength is unmatched!', '', 135673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light\'s army endures.', '', 135672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of our world hangs in the balance.', '', 135671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blades will rend your flesh!', '', 135670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 108933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU ARE NOT PRE-- <pause> What\'s that? Am I denying you something? Bah. You know nothing of true longing.', '', 135669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be touched by rabble such as you.', '', 135668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not prepared.', '', 135667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your persistence is hardly surprising.', '', 135666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IGC: Velen escapes Argus', 'IGC: Velen escapes Argus', 135665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hunt is eternal.', '', 135664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will meet its end.', '', 135663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See it done.', '', 135662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see this to the end.', '', 135661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will finish my hunt.', '', 135660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s fury pales before mine.', '', 135659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not sit idle.', '', 135658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A timely arrival.', '', 135657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour has come at last.', '', 135656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will stop at nothing to destroy our world.', '', 135655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no sacrifice too great.', '', 135654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evil draws close.', '', 135653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I shall relish the experience while I have it. Thank you for your counsel, Khadgar.', '', 135648, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. We are in the presence of primal powers that shaped the very cosmos. The fact that you feel the tug of their influence is not a sign of weakness. It shows that you are highly attuned to them.', '', 135647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can still breach Antorus and dismantle the Legion\'s resurrection engine, but we\'ll need Xe\'ra and the Army of the Light by our side.', '', 135646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I confess I am relieved to hear you say that. I feared I was the only one experiencing such sensations.', '', 135645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, archmage. It can be... overwhelming at times. Difficult to focus.', '', 135644, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never seen anything like this place, Khadgar. The powers at play here...', '', 135643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A worthy victory. No minion of the Legion can be allowed to toy with such forces.', '', 135642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power is power. It is what we do with it that matters. By using the Legion\'s own resources against them, we turn the tide in our favor.', '', 135641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense an entity that wields potent forces with great malevolence. This fiend must be brought down!', '', 135640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus is a world saturated with power. The Legion has made use of it... now it is our turn!', '', 135639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those monsters struck down my last remaining follower. I will unleash the rage of ten thousand years upon them!', '', 135638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vindicaar will be the instrument of our retribution. As with any weapon, you should know it well before we charge into battle once more.', '', 135637, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A convincing victory. You have demonstrated the futility of the Legion\'s existence.', '', 135636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demon\'s cries of failure ring out across Argus. A sound that never grows tiresome.', '', 135635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought a quick end to that fiend\'s ambitions. But do not doubt that others will seek a similar path to infamy.', '', 135634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A decisive victory. I expected no less of you.', '', 135633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one has nothing more to brag about, other than the quick death it earned.', '', 135632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s morale crumbles... as does their hold on Argus.', '', 135631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many monstrosities they send at us, we will cut them down.', '', 135630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each target we bring down is another failure for the Dark Titan\'s crusade.', '', 135629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now they know the truth... that we will never relent. Their crusade will soon face oblivion.', '', 135628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These foes have earned no mercy... and we have shown them none.', '', 135627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... you have them reeling. Well fought.', '', 135626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies will suffer as we have.', '', 135625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will lead my people through any darkness.', '', 135624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A threat closes in. Bring it down, and show the demons they cannot stand against us.', '', 135623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He offers us power unlike any we have known before.', '', 135622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Triumvirate has received a visitor from another world!', '', 135621, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 87817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beacon of our civilization shining bright... upon what we feared was an empty void.', '', 135620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ask you, now, to raise your voices in praise. Praise Sargeras!', '', 135619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In partnership with our new ally, the light of the eredar will shine bright across the cosmos!', '', 135618, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 87814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has shown us the path to a new future.', '', 135617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need not endure this solitude any longer.', '', 135616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For so long, we eredar have been alone in the universe.', '', 135615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people, I have called you here to share a revelation.', '', 135614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It brings me great joy to see the old ways honored like this. Thank you.', '', 135613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many draenei traditions were lost during our long journey. The spirits of Mac\'Aree have not forgotten. They practice the ritual combat of Jed\'hin even now. Perhaps they will welcome a new challenger!', '', 135612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold, a vile menace eager to prove its might. Put an end to its ambitions.', '', 135611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis will take you to de chamber below where Princess Talanji is waiting for you. Mind de step.', 135610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This demon looks to rise within the Legion\'s ranks by ending our invasion. Demonstrate its folly.', '', 135609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard. A threat looms, thirsty for mortal blood.', '', 135608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another demon champion boasts and blusters. Silence its cacophony.', '', 135607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons rally around a brutish menace. Teach them that their faith is misplaced.', '', 135606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A brutish fiend looms just ahead. Send it back to the hell that spawned it.', '', 135605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me. I can lead you to de easiest way down.', 135604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another champion of the Legion is near. End its existence.', '', 135603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion believes itself entrenched on Argus. Untouchable. Reward their arrogance with suffering!', '', 135602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons everywhere. Go. Fight. Spare none of them.', '', 135601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon filth pervades this broken land. Take no prisoners. Strike down every fiend you see!', '', 135600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every demon that walks this world is a perversion of the Argus that was. You struck a blow for the Light this day.', '', 135599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light cannot win unless we fight for it. You have done your part this day, champion.', '', 135598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word of your victory will spread across Argus. Those who cling to the memory of the Deceiver are doomed to fall!', '', 135597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the Legion is relentless, the demons cannot outlast the Light.', '', 135596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras took so much from my world. Now it is his turn to lose!', '', 135595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With every such foe you bring down, our ultimate victory draws nearer.', '', 135594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of all the noble souls lost here to the Legion, I thank you.', '', 135593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never doubt that, in the end, the Light will emerge victorious.', '', 135592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may be vastly outnumbered, but the Light is with us. Victory will yet be ours!', '', 135591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can never reclaim what we once had, but we will make them pay for what they did to Argus.', '', 135590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air hangs heavy with fel corruption. Bring down this vile aberration!', '', 135589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a foul presence... an evil that seeks to blot out the Light. Take up arms and bring down this foe!', '', 135588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A disciple of Kil\'jaeden seeks to avenge its master. Be ready for its assault!', '', 135587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come visit me when you have the chance. I can\'t wait to share all that I\'ve learned from these etchings with you!', 135586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just when the Light gains a foothold here, another vessel of evil rises to battle us. Your might is needed once again, champion.', '', 135585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An agent of the Dark Titan rises to attack. Strike first! Strike true!', '', 135584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself, champion. Wickedness lurks nearby...', '', 135583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This villain profanes the homeworld I lost so long ago. Put an end to this atrocity!', '', 135582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An insidious champion of darkness draws near. Strike it down!', '', 135581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s grip on this land must be broken. Now is our time! Push back against the darkness!', '', 135580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about me... I can make it back to the arena myself.', 135579, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_DemonHunter_SoulCleave2.blp:20|t Yazma begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:249924|h[Soulrend]|h|r on|cFFFF0000$n|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_DemonHunter_SoulCleave2.blp:20|t Yazma begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:249924|h[Soulrend]|h|r on $n!', 135578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel my strength returning... it appears the antivenom is working.', '', 135577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 106003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure how much time Julwaba has left... the anti-venom is her only hope.', '', 135576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was once a sacred site for my people has been desecrated by the Legion. Drive them out!', '', 135575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Julwaba and Taz\'jin have been missing for days. I\'m starting to fear for their safety...', '', 135574, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every victory is satisfying, but when a foe like that is brought down... I must admit, I savor it even more.', '', 135573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Army of the Light is proud to call you an ally, champion.', '', 135572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive tactics. No wonder the Legion has learned to fear you.', '', 135571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to know that during my long absence from Azeroth, our world was protected by heroes like you.', '', 135570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight like you\'ve been crusading against the Legion for a thousand years.', '', 135569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bit by bit we chip away at the backbone of the Legion.', '', 135568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('A well-earned victory. The Legion will fall!', '', 135567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought. In our long struggle against the demons, we must savor every victory.', '', 135566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, quickly! The naga must be slain to save Kra\'gwa\'s followers.', '', 135565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your quick and decisive action, the Army\'s soldiers are safe. You have my gratitude.', '', 135564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My faith was well placed. You have aided the Light this day, friend.', '', 135563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That cargo belongs to the Army of the Light, not the minions of Sargeras. Well done.', '', 135562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now the Burning Legion sees the truth... that we will drive them from the heart of Argus!', '', 135561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your help, our forces have rallied and the Legion is on the run.', '', 135560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When they push us, we push back harder. To victory!', '', 135559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
