('', 'You could stand to do better.', 135397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bear in mind that your performance reflects upon all of us.', 135396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unimpressed.', '', 135395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrogance will be your undoing.', '', 135394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue like this and you may well scrape by.', '', 135393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts thus far are... lacking.', '', 135392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons seek to bleed a creature that lies dormant beneath the surface. Put an end to their plans.', '', 135391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s thirst for blood is unquenchable. Remove their filth from this world.', '', 135390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am told power comes from unlikely places.', '', 135389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say the King has not left his throne since the day his wife died.', 'They say the King has not left his throne since the day his wife died.', 135388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde? Here in Zuldazar? This be bad, this be very bad.', 'The Horde? Here in Zuldazar? This be bad, this be very bad.', 135387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Zul left, he took so many of us. Now they say the blood trolls attack our northern border.', 'When Zul left, he took so many of us. Now they say the blood trolls attack our northern border.', 135386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh... I\'m sorry, mainlander, but I may have to ask another favor.', 135385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I guess we shall have to wait.', '', 135384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But that could take ages!', 135383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tests or no, you will only be absolved once we uncover the truth of what happened to our village!', '', 135382, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?! After all I just went through!', 135381, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 97720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remain unconvinced. This still doesn\'t explain the happenings at Fletcher\'s Hollow.', '', 135380, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 97717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet! I will be the one passing judgment here!', '', 135379, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe she\'s not a witch after all! But what of our village?', '', 135378, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She got sick! It\'s impossible!', '', 135377, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 101549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ohhh... I don\'t feel so...', 135376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed I shall. The venom, mainlander.', 135375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you prepared to prove otherwise, Miss Waycrest?', '', 135374, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is well known that a witch\'s power is fueled not by food, but by consuming the souls of her victims. Her insides are an empty husk.', '', 135373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting, but hardly conclusive. Let us move on to the final test... the purging of the viscera.', '', 135372, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bugs don\'t seem to be avoiding her. If anything, they\'re biting more than usual!', '', 135371, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 101571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ouch! Oof! Oh, that stings!', 135370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about me. I can handle a few bug bites.', 135369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the flies, then watch as they scatter from her bewitched flesh!', '', 135368, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The second test will be the stinging of insects. It is well known that even the voracious bloodfly will not taste of a witch\'s vile blood.', '', 135367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm down, calm down. There may still be trickery afoot. We will continue with the trial.', '', 135366, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 97704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s crying! Witches can\'t do that, can they?!', 135365, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 101566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go ahead, mainlander. Show them.', 135364, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the accused even capable of weeping? Show us, that we may pass our judgment.', '', 135363, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 97697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first test will be the shedding of tears. Let it be known that Miss Waycrest shed not one tear during this entire process.', '', 135362, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has selected this mainlander to administer the tests. An unusual choice... but as a show of good faith, I will allow it.', '', 135361, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As is customary, the lady Waycrest has chosen the tests she will undergo to prove her innocence of the accused crime of witchcraft.', '', 135360, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! The trial can commence!', '', 135359, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you quite finished? I\'m becoming impatient!', '', 135358, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard a story a while back that there was a witch who lived in the swamp, and the way the villagers found her out was because the bloodflies there wouldn\'t go near her. \n\nThey bit everyone else, but wouldn\'t bite her! \n\nThey say it was because a witch\'s blood is so foul that not even a bloodfly will touch it!', '', 135357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen a real witch before. Isn\'t this exciting?!', '', 135356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in the old days we would weigh them down and throw them into the river! If they resurfaced, we\'d know that they had made an unholy pact, and they\'d get the noose! \n\nThat\'s the only way to absolve a witch in my eyes!', '', 135355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The witch\'s evil curse took my son! There will be justice done today!', '', 135354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I\'m not sure... \n\nThere is a rumor that a witch could never sick up, since their belly is constantly emptied by the dark spirits living within her. \n\nI\'m not sure how you could prove that, though...', 135353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something must be done to stop the curse on our village. \n\nSurely, killing the witch who cast the spell should break it?', 135352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that a witch\'s flesh is impervious to flame. That\'s why we hang them when they\'re found guilty! \n\nIf you want to convince me, put a torch to her!', '', 135351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That woman brought evil into our town. She must be made to pay!', '', 135350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, my ma always told me that a witch could never cry, no matter how hurt or sad they got. \n\nMiss Waycrest didn\'t cry one bit even after being told she would be put on trial.  She must be a witch!', 135349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you prove someone is not a witch?', 'How can you prove someone is not a witch?', 135348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This trial is an awful thing, but justice must be done for Fletcher\'s Hollow!', 135347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has Miss Waycrest determined how she wishes to be tested?', '', 135346, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! Let\'s get on with it!', '', 135345, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 97690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constable! You may continue this... trial.', '', 135344, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 97689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve bought us some time, mainlander. Let\'s just hope that these villagers truly mean no harm to the lady Waycrest.', '', 135343, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rescue? And do you plan on cutting down these villagers to free me, as well? \n\nNo, if you wish to help, you\'ll need to help me with the marshal.\n\nWhile their accusations are misplaced, these are still my people, and I will not have them harmed to save me some discomfort. I will let them have their trial, and prove to them my innocence.\n\nHowever, I fear that the marshal may take matters into his own hands, and I\'m a bit tied up here. See if you can convince him to let this trial run its course.', 135342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to rescue you.', 'I\'m here to rescue you.', 135341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry you seem to have been put in the middle of this. These really are good people, but times have been trying of late.', 135340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will do no such thing, Marshal! I order you to stand down!', 135339, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 97687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time to argue. If you refuse to stand aside, we\'ll take her by force!', '', 135338, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 97686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Waycrest stands accused of witchcraft! We will not turn her over unless she is absolved of this crime!', '', 135337, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 97685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constable Framer! I order you to release the lady Waycrest into my custody!', '', 135336, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 97684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More interruptions!? What is it this time?!', '', 135335, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 97683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look! Riders approaching from the woods!', 135334, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 101565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, how I loathe interruptions! What is your business here, mainlander?', '', 135333, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 97682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constable! A stranger approaches!', '', 135332, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 101570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be hereby tried for--', '', 135331, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 97680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lucille Waycrest! You stand accused of practicing witchcraft and of inflicting a curse upon the village of Fletcher\'s Hollow.', '', 135330, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power at their command is immeasurable. The Vindicaar cannot withstand their assault.', 135329, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 86958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, heroes. You\'ve driven the Legion from this world.', '', 135327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what Magni saw was true. Aggramar lives once more... in the service of Sargeras.', '', 135326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve gotten the attention of the Legion\'s commander. Defeat them, and the remaining demons will flee.', '', 135325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is power here... power beyond comprehension!', '', 135324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without these machines, the Legion will be unable to drain this creature. Now it\'s their turn to bleed.', '', 135323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought I\'d have to slay a titan. This grieves me, but we do what must be done.', '', 135322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them! The magic of the titans must not fall into the Legion\'s hands!', '', 135321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion drains the blood of a colossal creature that slumbers beneath the surface. They must be stopped!', '', 135320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master of these machines conceals their true strength. Be on your guard.', '', 135319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons, built to destroy forces beyond reckoning. A pity that such power was not funneled into more productive pursuits.', '', 135318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arcane energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 'The Arcane energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 135317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 'The Fel energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 135316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fiery energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 'The Fiery energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 135315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Diseased energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 'The Diseased energy dissipates, leaving $W13953 more |4zone:zones; to deactivate.', 135314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Witness the fate of the great makers. Oblivion shall be their destiny.', '', 135313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of this one... it is incredible! Perhaps we can bind it to us instead?', '', 135312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sisters have the right idea, but they lack the power to see their will enforced.', '', 135311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He had so much potential. A pity he refused to submit to his betters.', '', 135310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence of chaos is infused within these weapons. Soon, they shall be lifted in praise to us!', '', 135309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon the weapons of the Legion. Soon, they shall be used at my... our... beck and call!', '', 135308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has long been a thorn in the Legion\'s side. I never imagined we would become allies.', '', 135307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She meddles with power she does not understand. One slip and she will lose herself to it.', '', 135306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How pathetic this creature is. Watch and learn why your will must always be stronger than the powers you control.', '', 135305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has the necessary ambition, but lacks talent.', '', 135304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break this thing, bend it to our will. If this is beyond you, destroy it.', '', 135303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city was once the greatest of Argus. Look how it has fallen! The once-mighty houses are now mere pawns of the Legion. Soon, they will serve us as well.', '', 135302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [70] Spawn War Trike', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [70] Spawn War Trike', 135301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! That should keep the enemy from sending in more reinforcements.', '', 135300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eredar summoners are trying to establish new structures down in the Shattered Fields. Disrupt their plans and help our soldiers!', '', 135299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. These crystals can be adapted to power our defenses. They are a valuable resource.', 135298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Logistics and supplies are often forgotten in the heat of battle, but are critical to maintaining our presence here. Collect what you can from the field to strengthen our defenses.', 135297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late.', 135296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will be remade. All will be undone!', 135295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not disrupt the rebirth. They will be whole again!', 135294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must all embrace the inevitable abyss.', 135293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You lack... vision.', 135292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our crusade is the only path to redemption. All will be reborn by the master\'s flame!', 135291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn the cannon on Kil\'jaeden\'s ship!', '', 135290, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 87250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you not see? Without the fel, the shadow will prevail!', 135289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, home... I almost missed it.', '', 135288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare set foot in the sacred pools? Suffer!', 135287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was foolish of me to wander off alone in search of ancient relics...', 135286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most of our air support was lost when the Xenedar crashed. Those bats would have caused real trouble for our troops on the ground.', 135285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The bats are swarming the battlefield once more. Man one of our batteries and blast them out of the sky!', 135284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work. Our soldiers are refreshed, I have done my job, and the enemies are weakened! Everyone benefits.', 135283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The troops are insisting that I spend some time tending to their wounds. You will have to slay the enemy in my stead.', 135282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... <hick!> ...whadda you lookin\' at, mon?', '', 135281, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All worlds shall fall.', '', 135280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras will be pleased.', '', 135279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to dust.', '', 135278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Sargeras!', '', 135277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall before my blade!', '', 135276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostile destroyed.', '', 135275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat terminated.', '', 135274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exterminated.', '', 135273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s discuss what we can do to fight the blood trolls.', 'Let\'s discuss what we can do to fight the blood trolls.', 135272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hostile targets remaining. Continuing patrol.', '', 135271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy combatants neutralized.', '', 135270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Termination imminent...', '', 135269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power core... rupturing...', '', 135268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Targets acquired.', '', 135267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suppression systems engaged.', '', 135266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere be one more... here!', 135265, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere! Torga, de turtle loa. He is benevolent and wise. I know he will help us! Let us see who else is here...', 135263, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Paraxis warps in.', 'The Paraxis warps in.', 135262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nazmir is a cursed place... but one where de loa rest. Stand back... I will find out which of dem is here.', 135261, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With my death, he will come...', '', 135259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It matters not. I will end this.', '', 135258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ally yourselves with the traitorous draenei and their Light, yet it leaves you so weak.', '', 135257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I eagerly await your agonized screams resonating through its halls.', '', 135256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This hold is but an echo of the grandeur of Antorus.', '', 135255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day is ours! We await you outside, $p.', '', 135254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This weapon\'s test was a resounding success.', '', 135253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is as I thought. The Void\'s corruption has reached them here.', 135252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am certain it had help. Take a look around. Call for me if you find anything of interest.', 135251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll use your bones for spare parts.', '', 135250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a broken... toy...', '', 135249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was not in the instructions...', '', 135248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to work.', '', 135247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to be deconstructed.', '', 135246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There may be another way. I will require a second set of hands, however.', 135244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is far worse than I feared. Do we have the strength to face such a foe?', '', 135243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hubris overcomes you.', '', 135242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold, Prophet. I have scouted the area. The shadows grip Mac\'Aree more tightly than you know.', 135241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, we must brave the darkness.', '', 135240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last, we have turned the tables on the Legion. Let them cower before our invasion!', '', 135239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tiniest crack in the armor, allowing a blade to slip in...', '', 135238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue the mission while I distract their forces. Perhaps they shall help me prepare for the real challenge...', '', 135237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He thinks I require help? Against the Legion? Very well... try to keep up.', '', 135236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beating heart of the Legion... soon I shall tear it out.', '', 135235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These explosives have been modified to amplify fel energies. The results should be quite... dramatic.', '', 135234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light... what have they done to my world?', '', 135233, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 87902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has invaded your world. Now look upon theirs.', '', 135232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, champion. Now we assault the heart of the Legion itself.', '', 135231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must take out those guns if we are to assault the citadel. Your mission is critical, champion.', '', 135230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing you have done here matters, mortal. We are infinite. We are Legion.', '', 135229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend what assistance you can. Alleria is leading the forces there and will be able to direct your efforts.', '', 135228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Nath\'raxas lies in the spire ahead. Take him down!', '', 135227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I was living a nightmare.', '', 135226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to stop her!', '', 135225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on?', '', 135224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has assembled a sizable force by those siege cannons. Illidan should already be there, weakening their positions.', '', 135223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In spite of everything, we must exercise caution. Ensure safe passage down to the surface, and we can continue the assault.', '', 135222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll kill you!', '', 135221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt the Mistress\'s work!', '', 135220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready.', 'We are ready.', 135219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to strike?', 135218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the defense. This incursion ends here!', 'Press the defense. This incursion ends here!', 135217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87166, 87167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy has breached the spire gates. To arms!', 'The enemy has breached the spire gates. To arms!', 135216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87164, 87165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your anguished cries will be a testament to all who dare assault the Legion.', 'Your anguished cries will be a testament to all who dare assault the Legion.', 135215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87162, 87163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming Legion ships! Take cover!', 'Incoming Legion ships! Take cover!', 135214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87018, 87019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Expect heavy resistance. Nath\'raxas will not go down without a fight.', '', 135213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will advance on the citadel on the ground while you clear the way ahead.', '', 135212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rendezvous in the central courtyard once he has fallen. Good luck.', '', 135211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, the time has come to take the central spire. Prepare for battle!', '', 135210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see what else be out dere...', 135209, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s not get ahead of ourselves. We need to test the limits of this newfound power. Come.', '', 135208, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems my training is complete.', 135207, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked me to teach you to use the Void as a weapon. Now that weapon is you.', '', 135206, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The voices are louder now. More insistent. But they do not control me.', 135205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You survived... interesting! How do you feel?', '', 135204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Claim its essence, Alleria Windrunner. Make its chaos your own.', '', 135203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even defeated, the darkened naaru surges with power. I hear the shadows calling to me.', 135202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand on the cusp of destiny, Alleria. There will be choices to make... and consequences to face.', '', 135201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel the fallen naaru\'s power. It... beckons me.', 135200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void is a force of change... of transformation. Shadows are fluid, ever shifting.', '', 135199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did a being of the Light become a creature of Shadow?', 135198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such musings can wait, though. This entity must die.', '', 135197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is rare that a naaru falls into Void this way. The few cases I know of have occurred when mortals were involved. What fascinating implications...', '', 135196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such chaos... such anguish. I have never sensed anything like it before.', 135195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Figure out their motives... and put a stop to their efforts.', 135194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your timing is fortuitous, champions. Members of the Shadowguard are nearby, infusing the natives with void energy. To what end, I do not know.', 135193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The scouts are safe now, thanks to your help.', 135192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve sent scouts to gauge the extent of the Legion\'s incursion into Mac\'Aree, but they have not returned. Please find them and give aid... if they yet live.', 135191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, Pinky! I have a nice treat for you!', 'Here, Pinky! I have a nice treat for you!', 135190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance have captured the Mine.', 'The Alliance have captured the Mine.', 135189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, dat went a bit squirrelly. All\'s well dat ends well, right? Ha ha ha!', '', 135188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoever holds thissss mast... commandssss my crew...', '', 135187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
