('Some be looking forward to the fleet returning. But I remember well the trolls that sailed with Zul. Dey be an angry lot.', 'Some be looking forward to the fleet returning. But I remember well the trolls that sailed with Zul. Dey be an angry lot.', 135185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be true that Zul be dragged back to Zandalar? I bet he not be happy about that.', 'It be true that Zul be dragged back to Zandalar? I bet he not be happy about that.', 135184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcane energy coalesces around the $n.', 'Arcane energy coalesces around the $n.', 135183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel energy coalesces around the $n.', 'Fel energy coalesces around the $n.', 135182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
