('Diseased energy coalesces around the $n.', 'Diseased energy coalesces around the $n.', 135180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not fond of da Horde, but you killed a lot of Alliance filth so can\'t be too bad.', 'Not fond of da Horde, but you killed a lot of Alliance filth so can\'t be too bad.', 135179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really fight alongside da Princess Talanji? Did she melt someone\'s face? Did she rip someone\'s mind apart? What was her hex like?', 'Did you really fight alongside da Princess Talanji? Did she melt someone\'s face? Did she rip someone\'s mind apart? What was her hex like?', 135178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear your kind follow an undead leader. Ol\' Bwonsamdi not gonna like that.', 'I hear your kind follow an undead leader. Ol\' Bwonsamdi not gonna like that.', 135177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are of da Horde? Is it true Vol\'jin be dead?', 'You are of da Horde? Is it true Vol\'jin be dead?', 135176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the loa for Princess Talanji\'s return. She was not gone for long, but those who stand against her did not need long.', 'Thank the loa for Princess Talanji\'s return. She was not gone for long, but those who stand against her did not need long.', 135175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First non-trolls, and now the Horde? Who else will Talanji let into our city?', 'First non-trolls, and now the Horde? Who else will Talanji let into our city?', 135174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Horde be here? Dark times.', 'Da Horde be here? Dark times.', 135173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see to opening the way once he\'s taken care of.', '', 135172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eliminating him will give us an opportunity to get in ourselves.', '', 135171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, this will do nicely. You\'ll find their viceroy near the entrance to the temple, feebly trying to break in.', '', 135170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for removing the obstacles between me and this staff, heroes.', '', 135169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just give the word, heroes, and we can begin the assault.', 135168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrupting their efforts would benefit us all. Also, their commander here has a particular item that would be useful to me.', '', 135167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowguard is building up its presence near the temple.', 135166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time we repay the favor.', '', 135165, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would become finite. Taking away the Legion\'s advantage would give us our best chance to save Azeroth!', 135164, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 87486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are prepared to assault the Burning Throne, but we cannot move until we find Eonar\'s spirit.', '', 135163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to forge our own path, my friend.', '', 135162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the turning point. If we can activate the arena\'s defenses, this battle will be finished.', '', 135161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This soul fragment calls ta me again, but somethin\'s different this time. It ain\'t Argus speakin\'. It\'s... another.', '', 135160, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave that to me.', '', 135159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find her soul. I just don\'t know how.', '', 135158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Life-Binder! Somehow, she\'s the key to Sargeras\'s plan.', '', 135157, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good that you have returned. Something has... changed with the stone.', '', 135156, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must let these spirits finally realize their escape.', '', 135155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps the only way to end their torment is to finish what I started so very long ago.', '', 135154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many were left behind... They linger, forced to relive their final moments over and over again.', '', 135153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings. I will show you the gravity of your mistake.', '', 135152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon perfection. This is the last gift you will reject!', '', 135151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not bow? Then die!', '', 135150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are unworthy of the name eredar!', '', 135149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the power you rejected!', '', 135148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
