('Using', 'Using', 135143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mac\'Aree... this is all that is left.', '', 135142, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, help me. I need your guidance. I need...', '', 135140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My king, our siege towers are lost! Our numbers are waning...', '', 135138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His fate was ours to decide. You will pay for your insolence, mortals!', 135136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A titan... the Legion must have harnessed the power of its soul to regenerate its armies in the Nether! If we can destroy it, the infinite army...', '', 135135, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of this. Let the shadows claim them all.', 135134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lack of faith is his undoing. The fel will consume the unworthy.', 135133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps the nathrezim has grown too familiar with the torment of flames, my sisters.', 135132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mortals falter!', 135131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The prisoner weakens. He is close to surrender.', 135130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic! Let them all burn!', 135129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow this wretch to savor victory.', 135128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then watch the icy grip of despair drain his will!', 135127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
