('It matters not. You are blind to the true darkness closing in around you.', '', 135108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When your thrones run red with betrayal... when your holy places burn and the shattered mask hangs above your hearth... only then you will know. And it will be too late.', '', 135107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, your Alliance still endures. Longer than I expected, though she has already planted the seeds of its downfall. She is patient, that one.', '', 135106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the nathrezim!', '', 135105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to put an end to this!', '', 135104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings! You surrender to the merest taste of what I have suffered.', '', 135103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic and weak!', '', 135102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all you can take?', '', 135101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your torment... is only... beginning.', '', 135100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draw your blades! I will show you torment!', '', 135099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long have we sought entry to this realm! To think we have a mortal to thank for giving us our foothold. Your service will be remembered!', 135098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one would make an excellent champion for our cause. Perhaps he can yet be turned.', 135097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pretenders play at whispering madness. Amateurs! I should demonstrate proper technique.', 135096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a disappointment. He squandered his potential by backing the wrong side.', 135095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imagine this machinery infused with our power. Interesting...', 135094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much effort, so much bluster, only to delay the inevitable victory of their betters.', 135093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now this is true beauty! At least one of the mortals in your midst can appreciate what it offers.', 135092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While I relish a healthy lust for power, this one fumbles for it like an amateur.', 135091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch now as a weak mind gives way to darkness.', 135090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He flaunts his defiance of the shadows. Arrogance will be his undoing.', 135089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The caterpillar has become the butterfly. She is all but ours now.', 135088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one shows promise. The whispers lure her toward her fate.', 135087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you taste it on the air? The sweet nectar of madness? Mmm... this place is swollen with it.', 135086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such potential here, but all of it wasted on a doomed crusade.', 135085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt!', '', 135058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only hope we are not too late.', '', 135027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. We will do all we can to ensure Eonar does not fall like the others.', '', 135026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras is building some kind o\' Dark Pantheon! We gotta find Eonar\'s spirit before Aggramar does!', '', 135023, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place your hand on the stone.>', '<Place your hand on the stone.>', 135022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone thrums with energy.', '', 135021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place yer hand upon the stone when yer ready.', '', 135020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel Argus\'s soul callin\' ta me again. He\'s frantic, desperate... and sad, so bloody sad. It breaks me heart!', '', 135019, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The short one of diamonds awaits you in the stone\'s resting chamber. He is... distressed.', '', 135017, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light hasten you to Magni. I hope he has good news.', '', 135016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have outlived your usefulness!', '', 135015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears adjustments still need to be made.', '', 135014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such an honor! You will be test subjects for my ultimate weapon!', '', 135013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will turn you to ash!', '', 135012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 135011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness true power!', '', 135010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape!', '', 135008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how fast you can run.', '', 135007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to demonstrate my newest invention.', '', 135006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send in the next test subject!', '', 135005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some disassembly required.', '', 135004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t just leave this thing here. Grab it already or I\'m taking it back!', '', 135002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If nobody opens the cache soon I\'ll have to engage the recall array!', '', 135001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t win \'em all I suppose. Off and away!', '', 134991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? No takers? Suit yourselves!', '', 134989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many gave their lives to hold this ground. Honor their sacrifice and drive these demons back into the abyss!', 'Many gave their lives to hold this ground. Honor their sacrifice and drive these demons back into the abyss!', 134981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87016, 87017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw it first!', 'I saw it first!', 134976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind if I roll need?', 'Mind if I roll need?', 134975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Rendezvous with the Vindicaar so we can prepare for the final attack.', '', 134928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet this battle is far from over. A great power roils in torment at this world\'s core.', '', 134926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Throne', 'The Burning Throne', 134920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken Cliffs', 'Broken Cliffs', 134919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wield the power of the cosmos!', 134918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My essence... returns... to the Nether.', 134917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have walked the spaces between stars. What hope did you have against me?', 134916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your existence was meaningless.', 134915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your faith is weak.', 134914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exhaust', 'The Exhaust', 134913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vindicaar awaits your orders, $n. Where do we take the fight next?', 'The Vindicaar awaits your orders, $n. Where do we take the fight next?', 134912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who dares to defile this sacred armory?', 134903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the Man\'ari!', 134902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I cannot fail...', 134901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Man\'ari will never defile the armor!', 134900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have calculated your odds of survival--zero!', '', 134892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step!', '', 134889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you enjoy my inventions.', '', 134888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion, show these weaklings why we are the dominant force in the cosmos!', '', 134887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no one alive!', '', 134886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons! Charge!', '', 134885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cannons, begin firing on my mark!', 134884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears I need to take a more hands-on approach!', '', 134883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why let my vessels blast you apart when I can dispatch you myself?', 134882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can no longer resist the call to battle!', '', 134881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of this labor! It will be more satisfying to have my machines tear you apart.', '', 134880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All vessels, converge on my position!', 134879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for my pawns to thin your ranks!', '', 134878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s do this thing! First to open it up wins it all!', '', 134877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just fifteen to go. Get ready for a real ruckus!', '', 134876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlocking in progress! Gimme thirty seconds, will ya?', '', 134875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond these blast doors lies the heart of the Legion\'s war machine. Eliminating this threat will cripple the demons\' arsenal.', '', 134870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Payload comin\' through! Watch your heads!', '', 134869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll go no further, mortal scum. There\'s a bounty on your heads, and I mean to collect.', '', 134868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up, we got a load of supplies headed to the Lowlands!', '', 134867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They gave everything to this war. We must honor that sacrifice.', 'They gave everything to this war. We must honor that sacrifice.', 134840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87014, 87015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing more I can do, commander. They\'re with the Light now.', 'There\'s nothing more I can do, commander. They\'re with the Light now.', 134839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87020, 87021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Sargeras breaks them as he did Aggramar, no power in this universe will stop him.', 134821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlock complete! To the victor go the spoils!', '', 134811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fifteen seconds until unlock complete!', '', 134810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unlock sequence activated! T-minus thirty seconds.', '', 134809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orb of Arcane energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 'An orb of Arcane energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 134798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orb of Fel energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 'An orb of Fel energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 134797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orb of Fiery energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 'An orb of Fiery energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 134796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orb of Diseased energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 'An orb of Diseased energy lies on the ground near the $n.', 134795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems my employer overestimated your threat. But who am I to question a payday?', '', 134791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Payload deployed! Careful down there!', '', 134790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supply drop inbound to the Lowlands!', '', 134789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easiest money I ever made.', '', 134788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barely enough left to collect!', '', 134787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Killed by the best!', '', 134785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will be my biggest payday.', '', 134780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think I\'ll keep a few of your parts as a trophy.', '', 134779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, find a seat if you can!', '', 134778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohohoho, it\'s good to see you again!', '', 134777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back!', '', 134776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull up a chair by the hearth!', '', 134775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boys and girls, look who it is!', '', 134774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Busy night... but there\'s always room for another!', '', 134773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my inn!', '', 134772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss da Warchief. I tink we all do.', '', 134771, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey didn\'t know we was comin\'!', '', 134770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Razor Hill was already lost when we got der.', '', 134769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He gave such an inspirin\' speech!', '', 134768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was barely any warnin\'. De Kor\'kron mounted an attack on Sen\'jin in force. We were lucky Vol\'jin was there to help us.', '', 134767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who ordered the chicken?', '', 134761, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, good, I was hoping you\'d find your way here. I\'m always in need of test subjects. You should do nicely!', '', 134744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is in its death throes. Time to put our boot to their throats. Return to the Vindicaar and prepare to strike the killing blow.', '', 134742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. We must cripple those infernal engines of destruction. Champions, use this teleporter to board the Vindicaar. On to our next target!', '', 134738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Striking at the heart of the Legion is futile until we take out their war machines. Unchecked, they would soon overwhelm us.', '', 134737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras seeks ta corrupt the other titans! If we don\'t stop \'im, the Pantheon will be reborn in darkness. There\'s no time ta waste!', '', 134736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, champions. For the first time in millennia, a blow has been struck against the denizens of the Burning Throne.', '', 134735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not be fighting alone, Turalyon. The demons will pay for every step... with their blood.', 134734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s ranks are crumbling, but they still outnumber us. My forces will keep them engaged here.', '', 134733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Release them, champions, or your struggle will be for naught.', 134732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tormented cries of the Pantheon ring out from deep within the core of Argus.', 134731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Eonar, the Life-Binder! This portal leads ta her sanctuary. Go. I\'ll stay here and cover yer backs!', '', 134730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions, hear me.  The Legion has breached my sanctuary, and my defenses will soon be overrun. Stand with me now, lest Sargeras claim his prize.', 134724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! I heard a familiar voice callin\', so I fought me way inside this accursed place.', '', 134723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war council has finally paid for their treachery. Without their leadership, the Legion will fall into chaos.', '', 134721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They betrayed everything we stood for when they accepted his bargain. There can be no redemption... only retribution.', '', 134720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recognize the trappings of the generals commanding the Legion\'s forces. Before Sargeras took our world, these generals martialed our armies and brought peace to Argus.', '', 134719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s two demons down, but countless more await the attention of your blade.', '', 134718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras has left us a few of his favorite pets to play with. Remove these abominations from the battlefield.', '', 134717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without their portals, the Legion is cut off from reinforcements. Now is the time to press our attack!', '', 134716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby crystal crackles with Arcane energy.', 'A nearby crystal crackles with Arcane energy.', 134714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel energy courses through a nearby crystal.', 'Fel energy courses through a nearby crystal.', 134713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby crystal burns with Fiery energy.', 'A nearby crystal burns with Fiery energy.', 134712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Diseased energy infects a nearby crystal.', 'Diseased energy infects a nearby crystal.', 134711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_BLUE.BLP:20|tArcane energies crackle around you.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_BLUE.BLP:20|tArcane energies crackle around you.', 134709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_GREEN.BLP:20|tFel energy courses through you.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_GREEN.BLP:20|tFel energy courses through you.', 134708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_RED.BLP:20|tFiery energy burns through you.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA_RED.BLP:20|tFiery energy burns through you.', 134707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA.BLP:20|tDiseased energy infects you.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\PRIEST_ICON_CHAKRA.BLP:20|tDiseased energy infects you.', 134706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
