('Champions, there is a disturbance close to your location the likes of which I haven\'t felt since the opening of the Dark Portal.', '', 134703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use my portals to take the fight to the enemy. Make haste!', 134702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are moving towards Legion high command. Buy us all the time you can, Alleria.', '', 134701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turalyon, I\'ve started my assault on the northern front. I\'ll keep their forces occupied so you can hit the priority targets.', 134700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Continue ahead, hero. I have some more words for dis sand snake.', 134699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the spires are out of the way, we will make our move.', '', 134694, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 88153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, bring that monstrosity down!', '', 134692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightforged, fall back!', '', 134691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gaining ground! Press the attack!', '', 134690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a hint: it\'s an ancient word of power. If I whisper it in your ear, your mind will fall into madness. Still want to play?', '', 134689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But by all means, if you want to see reality itself torn asunder, keep asking about my name.', '', 134688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were I to speak it aloud, a thousand void portals would rip open and some very unpleasant entities would come looking to collect on old debts.', '', 134687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I do have a \"real\" name. It\'s none of your business.', '', 134686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful. I dabble in powers beyond your comprehension.', '', 134685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make them suffer.', 134684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, we\'ll keep these winged beasts occupied while you clear a path.', '', 134683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fail you, Prophet.', '', 134682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vindicaar will draw all the fire we can, Turalyon, but we cannot hold out long. You must disable their defenses!', '', 134681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightforged, secure this position!', '', 134680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve breached the wall!', '', 134679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t kill the frogs, but we\'ll slaughter you!', '', 134678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have your coordinates, champion. It will take some time to calibrate the teleportation matrices. Keep it out of the Legion\'s hands until then!', '', 134677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall cage and drain your little frog friends!', '', 134676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must protect her new mana source!', '', 134675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy $r! We shall have our new mana source!', '', 134674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll get more of those frogs once we kill you!', '', 134673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our orders say not to kill the frogs, but we can kill you!', '', 134672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t stop us. The frogs will feed us for years!', '', 134671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The frogs belong to the naga!', 134670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not let you take our frogs!', 134669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the mana-stealers!', 134668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These frogs belong to us now!', 134667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The frogs are ours, fool!', 134666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These frogs shall sate us for years to come!', 134665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will use these frogs to save our people!', 134664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These frogs shall feed us!', 134663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, even number of facets, no occlusions. It has to be just so!', '', 134662, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde\'s cowardly attack on Teldrassil brought war upon us... and made clear what is truly at stake.', '', 134661, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 103025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Legion fall before you.', '', 134660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will endure.', '', 134659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vindicaar is at your disposal.', '', 134658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our time is now, hero.', '', 134657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krag\'wa shall reward your faith. Come.', '', 134656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, speak with me.', '', 134655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My void will consume you... if you ask nicely.', 134654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lend you my strength.', '', 134653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me elder told stories \'bout Krag\'wa. No one believed \'im... but me. I wanted it ta be true.', 134652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what is in your heart, Narez. You were faithful to Krag\'wa, all of this time.', '', 134651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait! Before ya go...', 134650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time I return to the barrow. Thank you again for all your aid.', '', 134649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They even say ya father decided to give in to weakness and sent his only daughter to beg Zul to return with the fleet. That be the case, highness?', '', 134648, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How dare you speak to me--', 134647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will be able to fend off the naga, once Zaldraxia has been killed. Good luck.', '', 134646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters are complicated. Especially the undead ones.', 134645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, of course I still love him. Must you be so nosey?', 134644, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 86278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I go missing for all those years and this is how you treat me?', 134643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already their ranks crumble. We must press the attack.', '', 134642, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we will prey upon them!', '', 134641, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons came into our world, their only desire to extinguish all life.', '', 134640, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy Demolisher has spawned at the Southern Horde Structure!', 'Enemy Demolisher has spawned at the Southern Horde Structure!', 134639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In all my years in these hills, I\'ve never seen monsters like those!', 134638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show her the Word of Zul.>', '<Show her the Word of Zul.>', 134637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archimonde learned to do this as an acolyte. How hard could it be?', '', 134636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never reach Arc-Consul at this rate.', '', 134635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I should have listened to my parents and come a jewelcrafter instead...', '', 134634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I d-don\'t know what my sister and her friends are p-planning, but it\'s not good. Good things don\'t require b-blood sacrifices!', 134630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'S-so many legs! So many eyes! They\'re looking for me!', 134629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we had best discuss the matter in private.', 134628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krono-ka lith\'tor agnos... or was it lith\'nos agtor? Bah! I will never get this spell right!', '', 134627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have started studying sooner.', '', 134626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if I just invert the core matrix to expel... wait, no. That is how explosions happen.', '', 134625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was I supposed to energize the projection before I stabilized the effusion? Oh...', '', 134623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need a true leader! Not a feeble King.', 134620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our borders are weak. Our people are weak. We need de strength dat only Zul can offer.', 134618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember de words of Zul, our prophet. Remember de doom he saw for our people.', 134617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Rastakhan rots on his throne too weak or too cowardly to visit his people. We need a strong leader!', 134616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul forsaw de Cataclysm, and we did nothing. We watched as our king banished him. We watched as Zul took our brothers and sisters into exile with him. And we saw de destruction dat came with de Cataclysm!', 134615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zul will come again and raise our empire from de ashes.', 134613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be ready, High Exarch. You have my word.', '', 134612, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 86598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t risk our forces on the spire without that warframe backing us.', '', 134611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De time has come! I must tell de others. Those still faithful to him must know.', 134610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your lives are forfeit, should we fail. Secure Mac\'Aree!', 134609, 0, 51282, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Antorus demands its prize! Mac\'Aree will be ours!', 134608, 0, 51282, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can rest when this rock is ours!', 134607, 0, 51282, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Double your efforts! This land has been useless long enough.', 134606, 0, 51282, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back to work... or you will know the lash!', 134605, 0, 51282, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The eyes of Antorus are upon you. Find the Prophet or suffer the consequences!', 134604, 0, 51281, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Failure will be rewarded with torment! The Prophet must not escape!', 134603, 0, 51281, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave no stone unturned. Find him!', 134602, 0, 51281, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mark my words! Velen must not escape!', 134601, 0, 51281, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find the Prophet! Slaughter his allies!', 134600, 0, 51281, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not fail you, Queen Azshara! The frogs shall be ours; I shall see to it!', 134599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All your precious frogs will be caged. They will live to serve our needs!', 134598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impudent SCUM! Our people will finally have our magic sated. No more thirsts! No more yearning!', 134597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why... we were so close... to never thirsting for magic... again...', 134596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
