('The Eredar... reign...', '', 134493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, some help! Da naga be gettin\' a lucky hit on me. We gotta save da frogs.', 134492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run... while you can.', '', 134491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... will never... escape...', 'You... will never... escape...', 134489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86719, 86720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere to run.', 'There is nowhere to run.', 134488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86717, 86718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus will... rise...', 'Argus will... rise...', 134487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86715, 86716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is it... dark?', 'Why is it... dark?', 134486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86713, 86714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eredar... reign...', 'The eredar... reign...', 134485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86711, 86712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run... while you can.', 'Run... while you can.', 134484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86709, 86710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This changes nothing.', 134483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By Argus\' flame I will be renewed.', 134482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Antorus, I return...', 134481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am one... of many...', 134480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be reborn again... and again...', 134479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy my icy caress before you are frozen solid.', 134478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it, champion! Come, let us enter the Xenedar and rescue Xe\'ra!', '', 134477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look so vulnerable, trembling in the dark.', 134473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Antorus sends its regards!', 134472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhh, what have we here? Has the Lion of Stormwind finally come out to play? You have no idea what you\'re up against, boy king. We have only just begun!', 134471, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 106969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want to see your limbs roasting!', 134470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think you can defeat us? Here? Hah!', 134469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fatal mistake.', 134468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness the might of the Burning Throne!', 134467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Antorus will know your screams!', 134466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmph... I be here waitin\' and hidin\', two tings I hate da most. Find out why da naga want dese frogs!', 134465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all you\'ve got, Windrunner?!', '', 134464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All units, to the gates! Victory for the Alliance!', '', 134463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll cut you in two and collect twice the bounty!', '', 134462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not going to make it out of this alive!', '', 134461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese naga won\'t get away with defilin\' dese frogs.', 134460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re beginning to outlive your worth.', '', 134459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s Judgment... she is magnificent. I should have it operational shortly!', '', 134458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The more you fight, the higher the bounty!', '', 134457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombard this area!', '', 134456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire on my position!', '', 134455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, High Exarch. Enaara and Sorvos have taken up positions at our main camp. The rest are scattered, but I am sure they survived.', 134454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da princess not be here ta save ya now.', 'Da princess not be here ta save ya now.', 134453, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of the other captains? I pray that they are safe as well.', '', 134452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha. Ain\'t no one goin\' to save you but me.', 'Haha. Ain\'t no one goin\' to save you but me.', 134451, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da guards don\' give two copper for ya filthy outsider hide.', 'Da guards don\' give two copper for ya filthy outsider hide.', 134450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My knife say you be givin\' me a great discount.', 'My knife say you be givin\' me a great discount.', 134449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be late on your protection payment again.', 'Ya be late on your protection payment again.', 134448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highness, can you not smell de fear dat grips dis city?', '', 134447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lightforged Warframe>', '<Lightforged Warframe>', 134446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lightforged Champion>', '<Lightforged Champion>', 134445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vindicaar Teleport Beacon>', '<Vindicaar Teleport Beacon>', 134444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Shroud of Arcane Echoes>', '<Shroud of Arcane Echoes>', 134443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... Heh... Shipments have already gone out...', '', 134442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I\'ll have to call in the big guns.', '', 134441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got nowhere to run.', '', 134440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! More meat to grind into sausage!', '', 134439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You\'ve still got some fight in you. Allow me to give you a taste of what the Horde has to offer.', '', 134438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what they say. Fool me once, shame on you. Fool me twice...', '', 134437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brethren have taken it upon themselves to hasten this area\'s fall to darkness. Disrupt their activities. Or don\'t. The Void will have its due either way.', '', 134436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not waste this opportunity to learn from my former peers. Thank you for your help.', 134435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many unanswered questions about the spirits lingering in this place. Why do they stay? What makes them rebuff our presence? Perhaps studying their essences will yield an answer.', 134434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will allow you to retain your credentials. For now.', '', 134433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are overdue for remedial lessons. Report to the Hall of Enlightenment for an exam.', '', 134432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fascinating! Their scales are covered in mana-sensitive particulate. I am certain we can find a use for this knowledge.', 134431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Panthara are feasting on Conservatory spirits. Bring me samples of their scales. Perhaps I can devise a deterrent.', 134430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I was certain you would not complete the trial this time. I must, per the rules, acknowledge your success. Congratulations.', '', 134429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have devised a modification on a previous trial. Should you be equal to the challenge, you may once again prove your cunning.', '', 134428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is one less arrow in their quiver. Perhaps I can find a use for these crystals that will benefit our cause.', 134427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is churning out darkness, manifesting into crystals of pure void. The Shadowguard covets this resource. We must claim it before they do.', 134426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unusual tactic, to be certain. The Legion cannot be allowed to use these defenseless spirits for their machinations.', '', 134425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange... Spirits have congregated to hear Kil\'jaeden speak, yet all is not as it seems. I sense a demonic presence. Find it amongst the crowd before it can stage an ambush.', '', 134424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bought us valuable time, but we must remain vigilant. So long as the Legion knows we have a foothold on Mac\'Aree, they will not relent.', '', 134423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forces from Antorus are using the remains of Talgath\'s portals to stage another invasion on Mac\'Aree. Stop their advance before we are overrun.', '', 134422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amusing how they continue to underestimate you fleshlings, is it not?', '', 134421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brethren are as industrious as they are clever. I fear the incursion point needs another round of cleansing. You know what to do.', '', 134420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope they can be soothed after their ordeal. Good work, but our struggle against the Shadowguard continues.', 134419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The formidable creatures here are prey worthy of any hunter, yet the Shadowguard seeks to empower them further with the void. Stop the ethereals and release these beasts back into the wilds.', 134418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That ought to keep them busy. For now, at least.', '', 134417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion seeks to claim a foothold on Mac\'Aree. Disrupt their forces any way you can. Give them a mess to clean up.', '', 134416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The activated constructs will serve as an excellent distraction. My thanks!', '', 134415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s forces occupy the estates of Mac\'Aree. Activate the nobles\' vigilants to help with the battle. No doubt their power crystals have been stolen by the eredar.', '', 134414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those constructs certainly have not aged well, have they? I guess nothing is immune to obsolescence in the end.', '', 134413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have need of a very specific type of crystal to maintain the Vindicaar\'s defenses. The constructs lingering here share this technology. Extract their cores. Use whatever manner you see fit.', '', 134412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to the day when we leave this shattered place behind. Perhaps then they will find their rest.', '', 134411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am afraid our continued presence on Mac\'Aree has awoken more angry spirits. Help them find peace.', '', 134410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to keep your identifiable parts intact.', '', 134409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t need a complete corpse to collect the bounty. A few pieces will do.', '', 134408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got to be faster than that, mortals!', '', 134407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a little carnage!', '', 134406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep up, if you can.', '', 134405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll collect you later.', '', 134404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay down!', '', 134403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet dreams.', '', 134402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we take the fight to the Burning Throne itself. Ready yourselves. Antorus awaits!', '', 134401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crown is whole once more!', '', 134400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have faced perils rivaling any the Legion has wrought. Please, do me the honor of placing the Crest.', '', 134399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no time to celebrate our victory over Talgath. L\'ura\'s dark song echoes in my mind.', '', 134396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is hidden in the Seat of the Triumvirate, then. I sense only darkness within.', '', 134393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least we know where it is.', '', 134392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This relic\'s time has passed. Throw it in the temple with the naaru. Let them rot together.', '', 134391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless. The Crest alone is powerless.', '', 134390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste, my friends. Something dark and terrible stirs... and it is not Talgath.', '', 134389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are one step closer to unlocking the Vindicaar\'s true potential. All that remains is the Crest of Knowledge. Then the Crown will once more be whole.', '', 134388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do wonder what he hoped to prove with his trials. Was the Sigil itself the test, perhaps?', '', 134387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This disdain is what allowed us to recover the Sigil. Had he anticipated its value to us, heh, he most certainly would have destroyed it.', '', 134386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archimonde was disdainful of the Sigil\'s limitations. Without the rest of the Crown, it gave him little power. And power was all he ever craved.', '', 134385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"That is not your path,\" they told me. Is this what they intended?', '', 134384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Argus grew smaller and smaller in the distance, I begged the naaru to go back.', '', 134383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people will never know how I mourned for them... the depths of my regret.', '', 134382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... insignificant...', '', 134381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest, you know.', '', 134380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told him of my plan to leave Argus. I asked him to bring my family and join me. Instead, he went to Kil\'jaeden.', '', 134379, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was this... the vision he saw?', '', 134378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Our... destiny...', '', 134377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Argus!', '', 134376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! Not here!', '', 134375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... not after all we gave...', '', 134374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic resistance ends here!', '', 134373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were foolish to come here!', '', 134372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true power of the fel courses through me!', '', 134371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus will be your tomb.', '', 134370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That world of yours hanging in the sky... is doomed!', '', 134369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble before the true might of the Legion!', '', 134368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are blind... to the truth!', 134367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A stubborn one... I see.', 134366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing can stop the master!', 134365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you see? This is the only way. I will make you understand!', 134364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defiance will not be tolerated!', 134363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This pain is nothing...', 134362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not... escape your fate...', 134361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My life for the Legion!', 134360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have broken countless mortals. What chance do you think you have?', 134359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rules are rules.', '', 134358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That gave me no pleasure either.', '', 134357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protocol dictates that I bid you farewell.', '', 134356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am obligated to serve.', '', 134355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('State your purpose.', '', 134354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am required to provide a greeting. Hello.', '', 134353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close your ears to the whispers.', '', 134352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh... did you hear that?', '', 134351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger speaks strangely.', '', 134350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You speak?', '', 134349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Oh. Yes?', '', 134348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan listens.', '', 134347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent timing, $n. We just used the last of that stuff and thought we\'d have to wait longer for more. Thanks!', '', 134346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it going, $n? Is there something I can help you with?', '', 134345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time. We\'ve been running low on this stuff.$b$bTell Vridiel he needs to gets his couriers working faster.', 134344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have your felslate shipment.', 'I have your felslate shipment.', 134343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m busy, $r. What do you need?', 134342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not to waste my time.', '', 134338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare set foot on his world? You will die!', 134337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh is fickle. Power endures.', '', 134336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is all about perspective.', '', 134335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I represent... an alternative.', '', 134333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do go on.', '', 134332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating. Simply fascinating.', '', 134331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody save yourselves!', 'Everybody save yourselves!', 134330, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is chaos! I must get to safety.', 'This is chaos! I must get to safety.', 134329, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These troggs came out of nowhere!', 'These troggs came out of nowhere!', 134328, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a good day for a hunt.', 134327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use every weapon at your disposal.', 134326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What news?', 134325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Light will not save you. Not here!', 134324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your corpse will make a fine trophy for the master!', 134323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We each walk a line. Choose yours.', 134322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 134321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shadows can be an ally... if controlled.', 134320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 134319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aim true.', 134318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do what we must for those we love.', 134317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your gaze fixed on your target.', 134316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But for Azeroth, and for those we love, it was all worth it.', '', 134315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fighting the Legion every step of the way. Savoring every victory, mourning every bitter defeat.', '', 134314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent so long away from my home. Away from my son.', '', 134313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight for home... for family.', '', 134312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light guide us.', '', 134311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple is in ruins. It is even worse than I feared.', '', 134310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before I was murdered, I was the caretaker of this temple. I fear what has become of it in the decades following my death...', '', 134309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t come this far to falter now.', '', 134308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
