('I will accompany you through the temple ruins.', 'I will accompany you through the temple ruins.', 134289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nickel barks in the direction of a stoat.', '', 134288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The remaining fragments may still be here, on Argus. We must go to Mac\'Aree where my brothers and I once ruled.', '', 134287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still possess a third of the whole. I carry it with me always. This is the Eye of Prophecy.', '', 134286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the entrance.', 'Return to the entrance.', 134285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beacon hums with energy.', '', 134284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lifetime ago, my brothers and I crafted a relic designed to bring prosperity to all.', '', 134283, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We called it the Crown of the Triumvirate.', '', 134282, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one hope, one treasure that may give us the edge we need.', '', 134281, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have given our plight much thought. As it currently stands, we will be destroyed if we challenge Antorus.', '', 134280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
