('Urgh... my magic is fading...', '', 134277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so... drained... they took my power!', '', 134276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those fiends kidnapped my friends!', '', 134275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cads were draining my magic!', '', 134274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not this time...', '', 134272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance leaves no soldier behind!', '', 134271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
