('', 'Greetings, $n. How goes the battle against the legion?', 134176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace tranquility.', '', 134175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fel beasts that roam these desolate lands produce some of the foulest-smelling hides I\'ve ever encountered.$b$bHopefully we can leave this place someday and find a home with nicer-smelling creatures.', 134174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am one with the Light. The Light is with me.', '', 134173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness that lingers in the temple... the shadow that looms over all of Mac\'Aree... is L\'ura.', '', 134172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talgath\'s last words... Not even the Light can escape. What did he mean?', '', 134171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. I dare not tarry here.', '', 134170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a teleporter inbound.', '', 134169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
