('Keep an eye out for fel-encrusted herbs. The astral glory still resides within.', '', 134167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear the rumors, you know. That I am bloodthirsty, and conduct myself in a manner unbecoming of a priestess.', 134166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always good to see another $c in the ranks. We need all the help we can get.', '', 134165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come Drekal, let us continue de search.', 134164, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see nothing of interest here.', 134163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did you call us?', 134162, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know what happened to de $r who cried wolf?', 134161, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I say what\'s wrong with blood? We all need it. Except the traitors. That\'s why we take theirs.', 134160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is dis a game to you?', 134159, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no... I think my barrel has pee in it...', '', 134158, 0, 0, 0, 70, 3223, 106113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clients want the stuff right now! We\'re shovin\' off!', 134157, 0, 0, 0, 70, 4519, 0, 106121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Timetable\'s changed, boys! Get your grogs to-go!', 134156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you wasting our time?', 134155, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The loss of the Xenedar was tragic. But this is a fine ship. Perhaps we still have a chance against the Legion.', '', 134154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Killing demons makes you feel good. Killing demons makes you feel all right.', 134153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
