('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [20] Defend the Northern Alliance Structure', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [20] Defend the Northern Alliance Structure', 134149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each demon you slay is one fewer we must face.', 134148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay safe, and slay many demons.', 134147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will stop at nothing. Be careful.', 134146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dioniss aca.', 134145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye out for anything useful.', 134144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you require assistance in exterminating our foes?', 134143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurt? Bah! You\'re still on your feet. Fight more and then we\'ll talk.', 134142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can rest when we\'ve killed them all! Keep fighting!', 134141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
