('', 'Nevermind, we can\'t wait for him. I\'ve found someone who claims to know where Rakera is. Come, dis way!', 134125, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another assault! Be on your guard!', 134124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
