('Hah! You are far too late. Nothing will escape the temple. Not even the Light itself.', '', 134119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense you bring ill news.', 134118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is your end. If there is a shred of goodness left in you, you will help us find the Crest of Knowledge.', '', 134117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands are ours, dogs! You will pay with your lives!', '', 134116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
