('I can\'t say I\'ll miss this place one bit.', '', 134111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re making a lot of demands for someone who\'s standing so close to my sword.', 134109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It takes powerful wards to keep the Old Gods at bay.\n\nPerhaps a place heavily warded against void magic could prove useful.', '', 134108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits are restless. A shadow looms over this place. The very earth feels... wrong.', '', 134107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish I could offer better news. In my experience, once the Old Gods take hold, hope is all but lost.', 134106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes we must walk in the land of dreams to seek the truth.', 134105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ally\'s mind is under assault by the Old Gods. Can he be saved?', 'An ally\'s mind is under assault by the Old Gods. Can he be saved?', 134104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What news, hero? I sense that darkness has descended upon the bluff.', 134103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
