('Are you sure you want to build a Scout Tower for 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:20|t Warfront Gold?', 'Are you sure you want to build a Scout Tower for 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:20|t Warfront Gold?', 134094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Construct Scout Tower', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Construct Scout Tower', 134093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, Man\'zul. We shoulda listened to you. You didn\'t deserve dis fate. We shoulda stuck to ya plan. You so smart. I remember. Now shush, or I\'ll pinch ya nose again!', '', 134092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man\'zul! Dis be a family-friendly inn. Those days are behind us.', '', 134091, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I like ya style, $p, but I beat ya to it. All he\'s got left is dat ugly eyepatch and dazzling smile.', '', 134090, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Volni, stop challenging all of our guests to duels! De last two you killed never paid their bill.', '', 134089, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak up! I can\'t eavesdrop if ya two jerboas be mumbling over dere!', '', 134088, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not fooling anyone, Volni. I know ya love de hat I got ya, and I\'m not moving it until ya admit it!', '', 134087, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, she can\'t hear ya over de incessant pounding of her drum. Take a break, Grenja! $p is trying to greet ya. Grenja\'s our bard, but sometimes she be forgettin\' people need to talk in here.', '', 134086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...You okay, $p? Ya freaking Grenja out... Ya having a heat stroke?', '', 134085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good eye, $p! Back in Zuldazar, Grenja got us outta a lot of sticky situations. She held open, and knocked down, a lot of doors for us... people too, actually.', '', 134084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was not supposed to happen! I was to live forever!', '', 134083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many have tried to kill me. They are all dead and gone, yet I remain!', '', 134082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you are winning? I am immortal!', '', 134081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot kill me so easily! The Fel Heart will protect me!', '', 134080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, time to get to work!', '', 134079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 101306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However... you did a great service for our town, for which I am grateful. I\'ll see what I can do...', '', 134078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I doubt they have any desire to parlay with a mainlander.', '', 134077, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a curse upon this land, and when it showed its head, the Waycrests did naught but tuck tail and run. They hide in their manor house while their subjects fall prey to unseen evils.', '', 134076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to meet with the cowards of Waycrest? I don\'t think it\'ll do you much good.', '', 134075, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to meet with the lord of House Waycrest.', 'I wish to meet with the lord of House Waycrest.', 134074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot begin to thank you enough for what you did for our town, mainlander. \n\nFallhaven is truly in your debt.', '', 134073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help, $c?', '', 134072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you are remnants of memories past, echoes of what our people were before the Dark Titan came.$B$BWhen one of our kind breaks away from the Legion\'s grasp, sometimes they return with a memento of our old way of life.$b$bThese relics symbolize all we have lost... and serve as a reminder of what we fight for.', '', 134071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, you have returned! You were gone longer than expected. Any trouble?', 134070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can ride my rocket back to your base. It\'s a one-way trip, though, so don\'t fire it up until you\'re all set to go.', 134069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, uh... you\'ve been great and all, but we can handle the rest here.', 134068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
