('How dare you touch me treasure!', '', 134059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Der\'ek... manul...', '', 134058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAaaahhh!', '', 134057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Safe journey, Talgath.', '', 134056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. This ends now.', '', 134055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will finish this another ti--', '', 134054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sheet-sah, you hide behind your allies... as usual.', '', 134053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Struck a nerve, did I?', '', 134052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence! You dare speak of them!', '', 134051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only hoped they would give you a reason to stay. How cold of you, leaving without your mate and child.', '', 134050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not forgotten your betrayal!', '', 134047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did not lose him. You gave it up--all of it! Your people, your planet... even your family!', '', 134046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost a beloved brother that day as well.', '', 134045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, how Kil\'jaeden mourned for you! Do you know how deeply your departure wounded him?', '', 134044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pheta thones gamera. Light, guide our path.', '', 134041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are with you, Velen.', '', 134040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the hunt be finished! You are mine, Prophet!', '', 134039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 134034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After all I have endured at his hand... after all my people have suffered... it comes to this.$b$b<Velen grips his staff tightly.>$b$bWhen you are ready, we will finish this together.', '', 134033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A welcome change of pace, to be certain.', '', 134032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How unlike you, Velen, to stand your ground.', '', 134031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s here.', '', 134030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IGC: Sargeras Appears to the Triumvirate', 'IGC: Sargeras Appears to the Triumvirate', 134029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me.', 'Show me.', 134028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you what I have done. Perhaps, then, I can make peace with it at long last.', '', 134027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Velen\'s unmoving gaze is rooted on the statue before him.>', '', 134026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Vindicator Sorvos nods to you.', '', 134025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blademaster Telaamon salutes you.', '', 134024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way. I will deal with this myself.', '', 134020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your screams will echo through Antorus if they escape!', '', 134019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Attempt to open the chest.>', '<Attempt to open the chest.>', 134018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chest is locked tight, but with some effort you should be able to bust it open.', '', 134017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like another Alliance ship has already docked. Hopefully they got a warmer welcome than Jaina did...', 134016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a life saver!', '', 134015, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t forget this. Thank you!', '', 134014, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you an ale!', '', 134013, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, I couldn\'t have held on much longer.', '', 134012, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga took the rest off in chains. Please, free them as well!', '', 134011, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and honor! Next time I see you, the drinks are on me!', '', 134010, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what just happened to you, but it seems to have worked! Are... you okay?', 134009, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion here are finished, for now. Our war continues on Argus.', '', 134008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 134007, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 102757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their commander approaches! Make him regret defiling this world.', '', 134006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have spliced spores into their own flesh to mask their attacks. Show them they cannot hide from death!', '', 134005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in such a mire the Legion cannot mask their scent. Rip them apart!', '', 134004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand as one! FOR THE ALLIANCE!', '', 134003, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 103029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To secure our future, the Banshee Queen must answer for her crimes. Her dark reign ends today!', '', 134001, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 103027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their warchief\'s goal was not to capture a single city, but to destroy our way of life... and snuff out hope for generations to come.', '', 134000, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 103026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we will drive her evil from this land... and raise our banners above Lordaeron once more!', '', 133999, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 103028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters of the Alliance, hear me!', '', 133998, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 103024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Anduin is leading the assault! Push past the reserves and secure the battlefield!', '', 133996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 103031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siege Engine ready fer action!', '', 133990, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One Siege Engine for a fine $Gladdie:lassie;!', '', 133989, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [100] Build Siege Engine', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [100] Build Siege Engine', 133988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Train Mortar Specialist - Attack North', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Train Mortar Specialist - Attack North', 133986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [60] Train Knights - Attack North', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [60] Train Knights - Attack North', 133985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [40] Train Riflemen - Attack North', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [40] Train Riflemen - Attack North', 133984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be needin\' a bit more from ye ta fill me orders.', '', 133983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome ta me shop!', '', 133982, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stable Master Lucia Farondale, at your service!', 133981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Training our riders is quite expensive, $n.', 133980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad to see you again, $n! How can I help you?', 133979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Quickly, heroes! The naaru is stunned, but won\'t be for long!', 133978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack now, champions! The naaru is momentarily weakened!', 133977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes, the naaru has been weakened!', 133976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t be trainin\' somethin\' fer nothin\'!$B$BGather a bit more gold then come back an\' see me!', 133974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take her shadow for your own, Alleria! Do as I trained you!', '', 133973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siphon the portal energy! The naaru\'s weakness will become your strength!', '', 133972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [60] Train Knights - Attack South', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [60] Train Knights - Attack South', 133971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Train Mortar Specialist - Attack South', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [50] Train Mortar Specialist - Attack South', 133970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [40] Train Riflemen - Attack South', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t [40] Train Riflemen - Attack South', 133969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What took ye so long? It\'s time ta get ta work!', 133968, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! They flee to the terrace! We have them right where we want them.', '', 133967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Introduce yourself politely.>', '<Introduce yourself politely.>', 133960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Introduce yourself politely.>', '<Introduce yourself politely.>', 133959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is she safe? I told Kaja not to come for me.', 133958, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we here at the Well of Eternity?', 'Why are we here at the Well of Eternity?', 133957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we here at Mount Hyjal?', 'Why are we here at Mount Hyjal?', 133956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we here in Andorhal?', 'Why are we here in Andorhal?', 133955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we here in Stratholme?', 'Why are we here in Stratholme?', 133954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sunken city was once a beautiful temple dedicated to the loa of the sea, Gral.$b$bHowever, the naga came and destroyed the temple. All of his followers were killed.$B$BIf Gral survives, he is weak.', '', 133953, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What be going on, mon? We under attack?', '', 133952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someting fell out of da sky! It be over here!', '', 133951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brothers are letting their hatred for the naga cloud their judgement. This is not the first time that Mistress Ssin and her Dreadcoil naga have tracked us to such a find.$b$bYou see, they know we know something they do not know.', '', 133950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late! My power grows... soon you will fall before me!', '', 133949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel Heart fills with the energies of Argus. Soon I will be unstoppable!', '', 133948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will beg for mercy!', 133947, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride to Gloom Hollow.', 'I need a ride to Gloom Hollow.', 133946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die by my blade!', '', 133945, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 104294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need a ride?', '', 133944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take no prisoners!', '', 133943, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 104293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll pay for this interruption with your life!', 133942, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 110433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strip this camp apart. I want everything Goji and his ilk were working on brought to me.', 133941, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have stolen my power! Argus no longer calls to me!', '', 133940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pirate queen will avenge my death!', '', 133939, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 104296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who let this cretin on my ship?', '', 133938, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 104295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not escape the Arcatraz to die at your hands!', '', 133937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, maggot!', 'Die, maggot!', 133936, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 108975, 108976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a brave one, aren\'t you?', 'You\'re a brave one, aren\'t you?', 133935, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 108973, 108974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you have belongs to me, now!', 'Whatever you have belongs to me, now!', 133934, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 108971, 108972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land belongs to the Ashvane Company!', 'This land belongs to the Ashvane Company!', 133933, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 108969, 108970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will win this fight.', '', 133932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such loss... we will need to grow our ranks.', '', 133931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is with us.', '', 133930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not welcome here!', 'You\'re not welcome here!', 133929, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 108967, 108968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t leave here alive!', 'You won\'t leave here alive!', 133928, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 108965, 108966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The way is open! Hurry, heroes!', 133927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 89414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not forget this kindness...', 'I will not forget this kindness...', 133926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The torment is over at last...', 'The torment is over at last...', 133925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks stranger...', 'You have my thanks stranger...', 133924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew Eraka no Kimbul would send us aid...', 'I knew Eraka no Kimbul would send us aid...', 133923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you cover our retreat, we may just see this through.', '', 133922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even though we are surrounded by enemies on all sides, it is good to be with my soldiers again.', '', 133921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear. The Light Mother awaits.$b$bWe should hurry. There is nothing blocking the Legion from her now.', '', 133920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, I can rest in peace...', 'At last, I can rest in peace...', 133919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the loa would not forget us...', 'I knew the loa would not forget us...', 133918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump over the designated jump. The judge may not count it if you do not jump across the center!', 'Jump over the designated jump. The judge may not count it if you do not jump across the center!', 133917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you jump too late or early, your horse may buck you off.', 'If you jump too late or early, your horse may buck you off.', 133916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I won\'t get lost! And I know you\'d look for me anyway.', '', 133915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way, Prophet.', '', 133914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When cantering, you can use Gallop to go even faster!', 'When cantering, you can Gallop even faster!', 133913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Canter to move faster. This is the best speed for jumping!', 'Use Canter to move faster. This is the best speed for jumping!', 133912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Walk to Walk forward, and Stop to Stop at any time.', 'Use Walk to Walk forward, and Stop to Stop at any time.', 133911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My torment... ends...', '', 133910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will escort Velen safely to the Crest.', '', 133909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All life ends.', '', 133908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ended!', '', 133907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death! Death and pain!', '', 133906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 88233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So he is here, then. I was afraid of this.', '', 133905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilgoblins are horrid creatures. The sycophantic little sea dwellers will happily do the bidding of their naga masters, no matter how disdainful.', '', 133904, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I welcome oblivion...', 133903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never burn out...', 133902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrival is timely. We must find the Crest of Knowledge before Talgath takes it beyond our reach.', '', 133901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unharmed.', '', 133900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph, maybe Shoak will realize that this isn\'t a place for exploring, it\'s a place for leaving!', '', 133899, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood. Champions, once the door is open, clear the way to L\'ura. We will be right behind you.', 133898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you hurt?', '', 133897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, the naaru. We must get inside. Alleria, the skills you have learned can open the way.', '', 133896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense great despair emanating from within. L\'ura...', 133895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So cold...', 133894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph... you\'re welcome, moron. Don\'t run off again!', '', 133893, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
