('', 'Impossible! I refuse to believe she now leads the Horde. Not after all they did to our people during the war.', 133740, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 86113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold Thas\'dorah proudly, champion. Know that you have proven worthy of it.', 133739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There may come a day when I will have need of my family weapon once again. But for now, at least, I have a different path to follow.', 133738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is clear you wield Thas\'dorah with skill and finesse. You bring honor to the bow, and to the memory of those who carried it before you.', 133737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vereesa told me you accompanied her on the mission to Niskara. That you risked your own life to rescue me, and prevented her from falling into the inquisitor\'s trap.', 133736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would have words with you, Huntmaster.', 133735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 86102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Light\'s Judgment Trigger>', '<Light\'s Judgment Trigger>', 133734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fel Heart of Argus>', '<Fel Heart of Argus>', 133733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rescue Shoak, I\'ll move somewhere safer. No point in you having to rescue two of us.', '', 133732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[After a short ferry ride...]', '[After a short ferry ride...]', 133731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the lift, Tae. I\'ll report to the old man.', '', 133730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That idiot... why did he have to get captured by blood trolls?', '', 133729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...The Natha\'vor trolls have Shoak.', '', 133728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no no!', '', 133727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no...', '', 133726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Stop circling me and find Shoak!', '', 133725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What dat noise be? I\'ll guard da princess, you go investigate.', '', 133724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fallhaven is in your debt, stranger. Please tell us how we can repay you.', '', 133723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must have you to thank... I never thought I would awake from that accursed state...', '', 133722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 97677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what is going on?', '', 133721, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 97676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re back! ...and the villagers seem to be coming to!', 133720, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stop... my curse...', 133719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our power is ancient. You will fall!', 133718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I will show you the coven\'s power!', 133717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should turn away now, lest you share their fate.', 133716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 97670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insipid $c! This village is mine. The Mother has willed it!', 133715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 97669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She\'s a dangerous one... but not half as dangerous as I\'ll be if I find out you\'re up to no good!', 133714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever it is you\'re up to, it better not involve that crazy woman in the woods.', 133713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dearest Husband... I don\'t know who you think you\'re fooling, but I\'ve seen you sneaking out into the foothills while you think I\'m asleep.', 133712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 102926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will attempt another shipment by week\'s end.', '', 133711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My swine have become afflicted with a malady that makes them unusually aggressive. It has been difficult to corral them for transport.', '', 133710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was given some plant scraps by a kindly old woman down the way for my pig feed, but I\'m afraid it may have been tainted.', '', 133709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dear Foreman Staughton, I apologize for the delay in the latest butchery shipment.', '', 133708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please report any suspicious persons or activity to Mayor White at once.', '', 133707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In addition, we have received reports of dangerous creatures in the foothills. Anyone with business outside the town limits is urged to use caution.', '', 133706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For your protection, all villagers are expected to retire to their homes no later than sundown.', '', 133705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Due to several recent disappearances, a new curfew will be strictly enforced in Fallhaven.', '', 133704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 97661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d bet my last torch it has something to do with that old crone!', '', 133703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this rate, we\'ll run out of feed for the pigs in a month\'s time. What curse has befallen this place?!', '', 133702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know where these blasted flies came from, but they\'ve returned each morning for a fortnight now.', '', 133701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 102020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look for any recent writings by the villagers. They may help us find out what did this.', 133700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see if I can find anything in the town\'s ledger. If the villagers had seen anything suspicious, they may have recorded it somewhere.', 133699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no... not this place too!', 133698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t understand. Nowhere is safe if Jakra\'zet succeeds.', 133693, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I couldn\'t just leave you to die! We can escape all of dis. Start our life over somewhere safe.', 133692, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shouldn\'t have come for me, Kaja.', 133691, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I\'d never see you again...', 133690, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some totems destroyed is better than none, let\'s see if we can find that oaf...', '', 133689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SHOAK! This isn\'t funny anymore, I\'m too close to the blood troll outpost!', '', 133688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakera! You\'re alive!', 133686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zolani, my blade, we must defend de temple. Go!', '', 133685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleporting', 'Teleporting', 133677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. It is time we seized our fate.', '', 133673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De will of my mistress be done!', '', 133672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have established a foothold at the citadel, High Exarch.', '', 133671, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 86149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smashing time!', '', 133670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 99430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Little King. Let us bring ruin upon these heretics!', '', 133669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I swear to you, and to dis champion of de Horde, dat I will not rest until I have Zul\'s head.', '', 133668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have grown soft. Many have tried to warn me... my own daughter among dem. I did not listen.', '', 133667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to ask yourself... are you king, or are you prey?', '', 133666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is blood in the waters now.', '', 133665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your council challenges your authority. Your friends try to take your life.', '', 133664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan, your enemies test your borders.', '', 133663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are unworthy.', '', 133655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trifling outsider. Your arrogance was your undoing.', '', 133654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is as I thought.', 133653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witnessing', 'Witnessing', 133652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa-cawcaw', '', 133651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ca-caw chee-chaw', '', 133650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coodle chee-chaw', '', 133649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great one, are you still breathing? Let me release you from dese chains.', '', 133648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa-caw chee-chawchee-chaw', '', 133647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul foretold your coming. All proceeds as he predicted.', '', 133646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fool! If I had de time, I would crush you for what you did to Vol\'kaal.', 133645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, Shadra. Die forever! By de old ways, I claim your power as my own!', 133644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going up ahead while you destroy those totems. Hopefully we can find that oaf once the totems are gone.', '', 133643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle!', '', 133642, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pheta vi acahachi!', '', 133641, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krypta!', '', 133640, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acalah pek ecta!', '', 133639, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'kaal! Dispose of dese invaders while I deal with Shadra.', 133638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the fallen!', '', 133637, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For our people!', '', 133636, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the shadows we strike.', '', 133635, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your actions.', '', 133634, 0, 50928, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadra! For ages you have guided my hand. But from this day forth, I serve a new master!', 133633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late. De blood of de loa has been spilled!', 133632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He... he needs us ta see somethin\'...', '', 133631, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 88126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus\'s soul ain\'t like that. He\'s tormented... broken. Careful, or his pain\'ll overwhelm ye!', '', 133630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Azeroth\'s spirit speaks ta me, it\'s like a song. There\'s beauty in it, even when her message ain\'t exactly clear.', '', 133629, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 88124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone\'s whispers steady my people\'s hearts. It is curious that you hear them as well, outsider.', '', 133628, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will do Argus proud. Claim your prize.', '', 133627, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 87139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready when you are!', 'Ready when you are!', 133626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s try this again!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s try this again!', 133625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the song that never ends. It just goes on and on, my friend. Some people started singing, not knowing what it was, and now they\'re still singing it. No reason... just because!', '', 133624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will direct our forces to establish a foothold outside the Legion stronghold while you speak with Magni.', '', 133623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so tired.', 'I am so tired.', 133622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86636, 86637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such darkness... I had hoped...the light...', 'Such darkness... I had hoped...', 133621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86634, 86635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen... why?', 'Velen... why?', 133620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86632, 86633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could not escape.', 'We could not escape.', 133619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86630, 86631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I had... fled...', 'I wish I had... fled...', 133618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86628, 86629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When will it end?', 'When will it end?', 133617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86626, 86627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not torment me!', 'You will not torment me!', 133616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86620, 86621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can\'t you let us rest?', 'Why can\'t you let us rest?', 133615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86618, 86619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our home! Begone!', 'This is our home! Begone!', 133614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86616, 86617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not mock my suffering!', 'Do not mock my suffering!', 133613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86614, 86615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here!', 'You do not belong here!', 133612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86612, 86613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come?', 'Why have you come?', 133611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86610, 86611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonk mad! Gonk crush Yazma!', '', 133610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions here have not gone unnoticed. My blessing is yours.', '', 133606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. You have earned my blessing.', '', 133605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will redeem our home.', 133604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blade and spell, ready to serve the Light.', 133603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anything can be a weapon with the right mindset.', 133602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get to those batteries and start shooting down those bats! We\'re counting on you!', 133601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! You\'re not a demon. Come here and help us kill some!', 133600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archenon poros.', 133599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will defeat the Legion.', 133598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be on your guard.', 133597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 133596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have something to report?', 133595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will win this war.', 133594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light prevails.', 133593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are doing all we can to hold the line here. Go, find Y\'mera, and turn the tide in our favor!', 133592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A small message is scrawled upon the side of the rocket.>$b$bATTENTION: Official message.$B$BIf you are not of commander rank within the Horde STOP READING NOW!$b$bFrom: Patch, Gob Squad$b$bMy team\'s been sent to deliver some firepower so that our plan in Nazmir can proceed. We\'re bringing a cannon that will make short work of anything that stands against us.$B$BWe\'re on \"The Libation\" and are looking for an anchor point off the eastern shore. Send a guide to direct us to a deployment point.', '', 133591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krona ki cristorr!', '', 133590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golad niton acalah.', '', 133589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acheon kor.', '', 133588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stand together.', '', 133587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be at peace.', '', 133586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have helped ensure the future of our people.', '', 133585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light guide us.', '', 133584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks, $n.', '', 133583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Growl* I will stay for now, if only to aid the spirits of my competent followers who were slain for your stupdity.', '', 133582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a simple mistake... but look around you! Doesn\'t this place bring back fond memories? Stay and allow us to rebuild this temple in your honor!', '', 133581, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tortollans have strange customs, my lord. How was I to know that declining a marriage proposal could be considered an act of war?', '', 133580, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your task was simple: Make peace with the Tortaka and look after my temple while I was away. Now look at this place!', '', 133579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*achem* It is I, great loa, your loyal and trusted servant, Vunanju.', '', 133578, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to introduce myself. I am the Magnificent Al\'Abas. I find myself temporarily indisposed in this rather decrepit vessel. Perhaps you\'d be so kind as to listen to my tale.', '', 133577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s an old saying here in Kul Tiras.$B$BWhen something goes wrong, old sailors will shrug it off and proclaim: \"You cannot change the winds.\"$B$BI hate that saying.', 133576, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cyrus has raised me since I was a child. He taught me how to fight, how to ride, how to sail.$B$BBy the time I entered the guard I was already better trained than some of my instructors.$B$BThey didn\'t appreciate that.', 133575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything here changed when Daelin Proudmoore was defeated.$B$BJaina must have had her reasons... right?', 133574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 604, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grew up hearing tales of the great kingdom of Lordaeron.$B$BAnd tales of its fall.$B$BThe Scourge took my mother, my father, and my homeland before I was even old enough to understand.', 133573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to make my decision.', 'I am ready to make my decision.', 133572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE BEAST IS OUT OF CONTROL!', '', 133571, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 108397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you decided what you\'ll do next?', 133570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my gratitude, $n.', 133569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you get lost before we get back, I am NOT looking for you again!', '', 133568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to the others. I\'ve got so many stories to tell!', '', 133567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, these trolls aren\'t right in the head. Why would they eat their own people?', '', 133566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... tastes good! Could use a little something extra. Maybe next time.', '', 133565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So hungry... raptor meat sure sounds good right now.', '', 133564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself mortal! For the Lord of Beasts is returned to us at last!', '', 133563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bladeguard Kaja sent me.', 'Bladeguard Kaja sent me.', 133562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see Julwaba still lives.', 133561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe you so much, $n.', 133560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think it\'s best you wear de suit and head into de encampment. I don\'t trust myself not to turn my blade on anyone who\'s laid a hand on Rakera.', 133559, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our... treasures...', '', 133558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These treasures belong to the Vilescale!', '', 133557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 103762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re just humble sausage makers! Why would anyone want to hurt us?', '', 133556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep an eye on de human. If he tries to run, my blade will stop him.', 133555, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make my way to the beach. Meet me there once you have what I\'ve asked for.', '', 133554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that the offerings are in place we have everything we need to summon the loa.', '', 133553, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari will need all the help they can get against this evil. Fortunately the Horde is here to come to the rescue.', '', 133551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may not be able to assist you directly, but I have information that could be of interest.', 133549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep an eye on dis one and make sure he doesn\'t go anywhere.', 133548, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A tsunami of blood is coming. Are we doomed, $n?', 133547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So generous of you.', 133542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, Y\'mera, will have no part in this. But I will not deny you the opportunity to watch $n fail.', '', 133541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, $n. Deliver my wrath. I must get to my loa before it is too late.', '', 133540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 109711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How... da flesh... supposed ta give me... power...', 133539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t happen... ya no eat me, ya no get my power!', 133538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh? It said I gonna get power by eatin\' flesh. Why ya not be dyin\'?!', 133537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya be smellin\' strong. I gonna get power after eatin\' ya!', 133536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Y\'mera handles the Sigil warily.>$b$bI feel very exposed, holding such a relic.', 133535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya not be gettin\' dis artifact!', 133534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quoram and I have... a history.$b$bLet it suffice to say that I did not depart the Conservatory on the best terms.', 133533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh yes, how foolish of me... I forgot the offerings! We cannot summon the loa empty handed!', '', 133532, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am also required to allow the uninitiated to participate.', '', 133531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am obligated to inform you that the master created trials specifically for this purpose.', '', 133529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sigil is the Conservatory\'s highest honor. Only Archimonde\'s chosen may pursue this accolade.', '', 133528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... something must be wrong. The idol is in place upon the altar, why would the loa not return?', '', 133527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is Rakera\'s medallion. It is given to all warguards in recognition of their service to de king. At least she didn\'t give it up without a fight.', 133526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of all people to become Gatekeeper... $n, perhaps you had better do the talking.', 133525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conservatory resources are not available to one of your... status.', '', 133524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I must return to my people at once.', '', 133523, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fight does not end here!', '', 133522, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must leave before it is too late!', '', 133521, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be swift before the pits consume you!', '', 133520, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks. I will find my way.', '', 133519, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness shrouds the Light.', '', 133518, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not safe here!', '', 133517, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul and all those who follow him will soon learn dat dere is always a price to pay for defying a loa.\n\nWith each passing moment, dat debt grows.', '', 133516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re here! What did you find?', 133515, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving. We must be close.', 133514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am going to need your help. Jostle it a bit, won\'t you?', 133508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stand with you, my king. The Horde will pay for its crimes. I\'ll block off the entrance so our forces can regroup.', 133505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 109642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least two, and they were big ones! Oh, and thanks for healing me.', '', 133503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You almost got eaten and... how many spears in your stomach?', '', 133502, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw Kajosh, you shoulda seen it! Dark magic everywhere, trolls doing weird stuff, I even had spears in my stomach!', '', 133501, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You idiot! Do you know how worried I was?!', '', 133500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a close call! I\'ll be fine in no time, this old shell isn\'t going anywhere.', '', 133499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m awake, okay! Was that really necessary?', '', 133498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, you saw my flare! Where\'s Drekal?', 133497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh... I\'m fine, I can move. I\'ll meet with Kajosh... I bet he\'s... urgh... pretty angry!', '', 133496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah... Jal\'aya... still... got... ya... artifact...', 133495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tink we be eatin\' you after da tortollan!', 133494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The market hosts travelers from all over Azeroth. There are many taverns, but this one\'s my favorite!', 133492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The visions I saw... Zul and Yazma must be stopped, $n!', 133490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kajosh sent me. I\'ll handle the mawfiends.', 'Kajosh sent me. I\'ll handle the mawfiends.', 133489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh... if you\'re not here to eat me... get out of here, save yourself! \n\nThose mawfiends will be here... any minute... to get their \"food\".', '', 133488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh... here they come, watch out!', '', 133487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are now using |TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_ChallengeMode_Auchindoun_Hourglass.blp:32|t [Stolen Time]!', 'You are now using |TInterface\\ICONS\\Achievement_ChallengeMode_Auchindoun_Hourglass.blp:32|t [Stolen Time]!', 133486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those steeds are vital in our battle against the demons. You have my thanks for safeguarding them.', '', 133485, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lives and souls of my people are safer, thanks to you.', '', 133484, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now the ones we\'ve lost can find rest.', '', 133483, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_AMMO_ARROW_03:20|t%s targets enemies with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:230139|h[Hydra Shot]|h|r!', 133482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is not Shadra\'s way. What has happened to her?', 'Dis is not Shadra\'s way. What has happened to her?', 133481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul and Yazma are responsible for dis treachery. Dey must be stopped!', 'Zul and Yazma are responsible for dis treachery. Dey must be stopped!', 133480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is no way to die. Thank you for saving me!', 'Dis is no way to die. Thank you for saving me!', 133479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have words with de loa about dis!', 'I will have words with de loa about dis!', 133478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today\'s as good a day as any for a battle.', '', 133477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood magic be forbidden! Da traitors must be stopped!', '', 133476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... whole! Now it is time for my revenge!', '', 133475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadra an her minions be goin\' too far dis time!', '', 133474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! My might grows! Unleash the power of the final totem.', '', 133473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go after Shoak, I\'ll wait here.', '', 133472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...he\'s inside the temple behind us. Well, that was easy.', '', 133471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha! He\'s...', '', 133470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul will pay for dis!', '', 133469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my strength is returning! Quickly, unleash the magic from another totem.', '', 133468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May da loa bless you, friend!', '', 133467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Shoak could be anywhere in Nazmir...', '', 133466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, cast the spell so we can find Shoak.', 'I\'m ready, cast the spell so we can find Shoak.', 133465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Believe me, I know the feeling. We\'ll fly soon, all right?', 133463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Back)', '(Back)', 133461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess I could eat my old food, but I\'ve never tried raptor meat before. Why pass up the chance to try something new?', '', 133460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of the totems are destroyed, will your spell work now?', 'Some of the totems are destroyed, will your spell work now?', 133459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, there\'s my girl. You must be restless, being cooped up here all day.', 133455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 133454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 133453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 133452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 133451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die now.', 'You will die now.', 133450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul promised power to de one who brings him your head.', 'Zul promised power to de one who brings him your head.', 133449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will give your head to Zul.', 'I will give your head to Zul.', 133448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rip your mind apart.', 'I will rip your mind apart.', 133447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will bleed you.', 'We will bleed you.', 133446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is de king?', 'Where is de king?', 133445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will put your head on a pike.', 'We will put your head on a pike.', 133444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Zul!', 'My life for Zul!', 133443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time has run out.', 'Time has run out.', 133442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! Your intrusion ends now, mortals!', 133440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The surface of the top of the altar is slightly concave with visible grooves near each corner.$b$bIt appears as if some kind of large and heavy object was seated upon the altar at one point.$b$bWhatever it was, it appears to be missing.>', '', 133438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your modicum of skill will be insufficient to save you.', '', 133436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have withstood the flames, but you will not withstand my fury.', '', 133435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of Taeshalach will consume you!', '', 133434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taeshalach\'s power is unleashed!', '', 133433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the altar.', 'Examine the altar.', 133432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the flesh be seared from your bones!', '', 133431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The room appears to be empty.$b$bThe altar in front of you is etched with ancient zandalari glyphs and images of the loa, Eraka no Kimbul.$b$bIt appears as though something used to sit atop the altar, a statue perhaps?>', '', 133430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The counting house is under heavy guard day and night. Feel free to store your valuables here.', 133428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames will consume you!', '', 133427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape.', '', 133426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand and die!', '', 133425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will die in my wake!', '', 133424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in flames!', '', 133422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had hoped that would work. The lights are on but no one is home.', 133420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 133419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can stand against Taeshalach!', '', 133418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may be... too late to stop him...', '', 133417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had no hope of victory. Nothing can stop our crusade!', '', 133416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a worthless opponent.', '', 133414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
