('My spirit is weak and I do not have much time, traveler. Listen closely to my words...', '', 133223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prophet Velen will be pleased that you answered his call. We draenei have long awaited this day.', '', 133222, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion has run rampant on Azeroth for too long. It is time to see this done.', 133221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we will see to it that the Legion finally meets their end.', 133220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall Kil\'Jaeden\'s defeat>', '<Recall Kil\'Jaeden\'s defeat>', 133219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall Anduin reclaiming Shalamayne>', '<Recall Anduin reclaiming Shalamayne>', 133218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the opening of the Tomb of Sargeras>', '<Recall the opening of the Tomb of Sargeras>', 133217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall Kil\'Jaeden\'s attack on Dalaran>', '<Recall Kil\'Jaeden\'s attack on Dalaran>', 133216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AL\'KSH SYR IIR AWAN? IILTH SYTHN AGEV.', 'AL\'KSH SYR IIR AWAN? IILTH SYTHN AGEV.', 133215, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s get out of here. Dere is a shrine up ahead called Zo\'bal. Meet me dere.', '', 133214, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 98518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde Commander has been defeated! You won!', 'The Horde Commander has been defeated! You won!', 133213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloody brilliant! Now, looks like those orc scum left behind a few juicy explosives. I wonder what would happen if we dropped it near their ugly structures over yonder?', '', 133212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rift collapses, heroes! You must hurry before the entrance closes forever!', '', 133210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel Bats start flying down to Eonar\'s platform!', 'Fel Bats start flying down to Eonar\'s platform!', 133209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 133208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis area be long abandoned to da spirits of da past, and for good reason. \n\nDa Horde be welcome to learn what dey can from it, if dey dare...', '', 133207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 133206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 133205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in death, the spirits of my people have remained loyal to the great loa, Eraka no Kimbul. The bonds of our faith are timeless and stronger than the grip of death itself.', '', 133204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SUMMONWRATHGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 133203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_LAVASPAWN.BLP:20|t An Ember of Taeshalach overloads causing a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:244912|h[Blazing Eruption]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_LAVASPAWN.BLP:20|t An Ember of Taeshalach overloads causing a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:244912|h[Blazing Eruption]|h|r!', 133202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need that mine, but those damn orcs are standing in our way. Lets get down there and wipe \'em out so we can get these Laborers to work building us a Barracks.', '', 133201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the end of that ugly mug. Now get rid of that banner, and lets get to work.', '', 133200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright lads, we need to get a base started here if we are going to take out that Orc Commander and destroy his base once and for all.', '', 133199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis changes... nothing! Soon... you all gonna... die...', 133198, 0, 49974, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the first mortal to enter my temple in many years. It is good to once again have followers among the living.', '', 133197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is cursed. Let us shed a little Light on these poor souls.', 133196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Accept the crystal.>', '<Accept the crystal.>', 133195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Enaara offers a gold-wrought crystal to you.>$b$bBanish the darkness, $n. Let the Light prevail.', 133194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We may not be able to restore their sanity, but at least we can prevent more from succumbing.', 133193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Despite our best efforts, the void continues to seep in through the cracks. Seek out the Army of the Light and use their blessings to banish the darkness once again.', 133192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 133191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_summonfelhunter.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 133190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARNING: You are about to fall into a dark fissure. You may not be able to climb back out again. Are you very sure you want to do this?', '', 133189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Drop into the fissure.>', '<Drop into the fissure.>', 133188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A fissure in the ground, barely wide enough to squeeze through. It\'s too dark to see anything, but you can tell that it is very deep.>', '', 133187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wrath of the Legion will overwhelm you!', 133186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces are infinite!', 133185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion\'s forces throughout the cosmos are mine to command!', 133184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your resistance is at an end!', 133183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion has laid waste to a thousand worlds. Yours will be no different.', 133182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you have fallen, so shall Azeroth.', 133181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was this truly the best Azeroth had to offer?', 133180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So easily broken.', 133179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More bones for the pile.', 133178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know your place!', 133177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world will fall...', 133176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... cannot... be so...', 133175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portals... must... endure...', 133174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathreza... once a world of magic and knowledge, now a twisted landscape from which none escape.', 133173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gaze upon Rancora, a landscape of festering pools and skittering death!', 133172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness Xoroth, a world of infernal heat and scorched bones!', 133171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rend their flesh!', 133170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave none alive!', 133169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike them down!', 133168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness the power to destroy worlds!', 133167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every world in our path has fallen. Yours is next.', 133166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness the fate of all who oppose us.', 133165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your war ends here.', 133164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve slowed down time significantly so we can prepare without wasting any valuable time.$b$bLet me know when you\'re ready to go!', 133163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this the best you could muster? Hah. Pathetic.', 133162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion devastates all who oppose us!', 133160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We made it. Just tink what happens when dat big construct crushes da walls of Zuldazar and lets dem all in. More loa on our side be helpin\' a lot.', 133158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at dem all! All those heading ta Zuldazar... look out! Keep ya head down!', 133157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da isle be south of here. I\'ll be waitin\' for ya dere.', 133156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here. Da boat be ready when you are. Hopefully no river monsters, eh?', 133155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HERE WE GO!', '', 133154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('JUST DON\'T MAKE IT EXPLODE!', '', 133153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KEEP HITTIN\' IT!', '', 133152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for ya, $Glad:lass;?', '', 133151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell ya what, take whatever ya find in that thing. My way of sayin\' thanks!', '', 133150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAa....aahhhh....', '', 133149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_BACKDRAFTGREEN.BLP:20|t Stand within the impact areas of |cFFF00000|Hspell:244761|h[Annihilate]|h|r to avoid raid damage!', '', 133146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SUMMONFELGUARD.BLP:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 133145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence here is a desecration! Beware Xibala!', '', 133143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarven Grenadiers can now be recruited at the Workshop.', 'Dwarven Grenadiers can now be recruited at the Workshop.', 133141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riflemen can now be recruited at Blacksmith.', 'Riflemen can now be recruited at Blacksmith.', 133140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knights can now be recruited at the Stables.', 'Knights can now be recruited at the Stables.', 133139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Footmen can now be recruited at Barracks.', 'Footmen can now be recruited at Barracks.', 133138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are getting close. De first presence I sense is somewhere beside de water.', 133136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inserting mind larva', 'Inserting mind larva', 133135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... dat offering appears fresh. Looks like Bwonsamdi has a worshiper here in de swamp.', 133133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too many blood trolls. I fight no more.', '', 133131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost a building. The Blacksmith is now ready to be constructed.', 'The Horde has lost a building. The Blacksmith is now ready to be constructed.', 133126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost a building. The Workshop is now ready to be constructed.', 'The Horde has lost a building. The Workshop is now ready to be constructed.', 133125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has lost a building. The Stables are now ready to be constructed.', 'The Horde has lost a building. The Stables are now ready to be constructed.', 133124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere... follow de phantom and let us see where dis worshiper of Bwonsamdi has gone.', 133123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A blood troll. Looks like she was sacrificed. Ah, de killer left a dagger behind. A minor spell and...', 133122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chromie needs our help? Of course. We will distract the cannons so she can fly away safely..', 133121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need the druids to distract the cannons outside so that a bronze dragon can escape Andorhal.', 'We need the druids to distract the cannons outside so that a bronze dragon can escape Andorhal.', 133119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This - this says that you come bearing orders from Keeper Remulos himself! Very well, what are your orders, $n?', 133118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the Cenarion Circle documents.>', '<Present the Cenarion Circle documents.>', 133117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cenarion Circle cannot sit idly by while Horde and Alliance soldiers mindlessly slay one another. If I can give some solace to some wounded soldiers, I am content.', 133116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GET ME OUTTA HERE!', '', 133114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bomb has been dropped!', 'The Bomb has been dropped!', 133113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bomb has been picked up!', 'The Bomb has been picked up!', 133112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bomb exploding! Get away!', 'Bomb exploding! Get away!', 133111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only we could gaze upon her torment when she returns to Antorus. Sargeras does not take kindly to failure.', '', 133110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The man\'ari doommaiden Talestra toils to fashion an army of fiends. See to it that she fails.', '', 133109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Footman [25 Warfront Gold] |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t', 'Footman [25 Warfront Gold] |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_COIN_17.BLP:15|t', 133108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will stop at nothing to destroy our world. They would do well to remember this defeat.', '', 133107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('A demon dares lead a vanguard on the Vindicaar. A quick death will make clear its master\'s folly.', '', 133106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s save your life!\n|cFF0000FF(Start the scenario).|r', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s save your life!\n|cFF0000FF(Start the scenario).|r', 133105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin.', 'Let us begin.', 133104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSEME', 'REUSEME', 133103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work here is proceeding very slowly thanks to the Alliance interference!', 'Our work here is proceeding very slowly thanks to the Alliance interference!', 133102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could get a lot more done here if I didn\'t have to keep looking over my shoulder for Alliance saboteurs...', 'I could get a lot more done here if I didn\'t have to keep looking over my shoulder for Alliance saboteurs...', 133101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The alliance have no rights to this land - Zuldazar is Horde territory!', 'The alliance have no rights to this land - Zuldazar is Horde territory!', 133100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot make any real progress here until those blasted dwarves are driven from our lands!', '', 133099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the high temple entrance.', 'A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the high temple entrance.', 133098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the lower entrance.', 'A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the lower entrance.', 133097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the main entrance.', 'A Legion troop carrier and cruiser materialize above the main entrance.', 133096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is grim work, reliving the last sane moments of their troubled lives. But it is the best and only way to honor them. Thank you for your help.', '', 133095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have many unanswered questions about my brethren\'s fall to madness here in Mac\'Aree. Bring me any memory crystals you find and I will continue my research.', '', 133094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelLord.blp:24|t |TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_FelReaver.blp:24|t', 133093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_FelbatMount.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_FelbatMount.blp:24|t', 133092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_FelArakkoa_EyeofTerrok.blp:24|t', 133091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_HellFire_Socrethar.blp:24|t', 133090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
