('', 'Hi there! Ever fired a rocket tied to your back while blindfolded? I have!', 133055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance must be eradicated. Zuldazar belongs to the Horde!', '', 133054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was incredible. What a find!', '', 133053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the Legion encroaches upon the hunting grounds of the panthara, the starving beasts have grown more aggressive. Thin their numbers, before they wipe out our talbuk herds.', '', 133052, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those fiends capture my people and subject them to heinous rituals. We will no longer be hunted. Help us bring the fight to the Legion!', '', 133051, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people are being used as fodder for vile rituals. Destroy these monstrous creations and help us honor the remains of our dead.', '', 133050, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what you know about the stone.', 'Tell me what you know about the stone.', 133049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I spend a lot of time in here, pestering travelers to tell me their stories. Especially folks from the Eastern Kingdoms!', 133048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 111777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are, Boralus Harbor. Aside from Proudmoore Keep, it\'s the most heavily guarded part of the city. And the only place most visitors ever get to see.', 133047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re lucky he\'s paying you at all. Now row!', 133045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance emissary?! Cyrus didn\'t mention that... I would have charged him double!', '', 133044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You arrived with Jaina Proudmoore! You\'re the Alliance emissary!', 133043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... I recognize you...', 133042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OH, and I rescued the target, of course. Crime-buddy, Taelia. Taelia, crime-buddy.', '', 133041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is going on in there? It sounds like you started a riot!', 133040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 111794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No idea what you\'re talking about... But I think we finally have some real dirt on Ashvane.', '', 133039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 111967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There she is! Let\'s hop in.', '', 133038, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get down to the lower levels and find a way out.', '', 133037, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, that\'s better. I felt naked without these! Let\'s move.', '', 133036, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 111955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
