('Chromie has died.', 'Chromie has died.', 133027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Necrodark... I thought those vile cultists had been wiped out long ago.\n\nNo time like the present to finish the job. I can take us into Neltharion\'s Vault.', '', 133022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring it to me--quickly. We have established a safe perimeter below.', 133021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You found it! Such power... I can feel it from here.', 133020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you shall see firsthand the fruits of our labor. Behold, Zuraal the Ascended! The first to embrace the void in its entirety!', '', 133019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your interference will not impede our progress. All will serve the void, or fall to it.', '', 133018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the trial complete?', 'Is the trial complete?', 133017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you would like me to return you to the Conservatory entrance.', '', 133016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you made it. Wonderful.', '', 133015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
