('Raising', 'Raising', 132999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems this nuisance requires a more personal touch. I shall handle you myself!', '', 132998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
