('If it interests you to know, I was once the keeper of the Conservatory\'s keys, custodian to all of its locks and gates.$b$bTo halt the ravages of time, I placed my soul inside this construct. And so it is that I watch over the Conservatory for all eternity.$b$bIt will forever be my burden to deal with the likes of you.', '', 132970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
