('There\'s no thrill without the risk! Geez, you really need to do more gamblin\'.', '', 132912, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 101299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'mon, 80 percent is plenty. Why push it and risk blowin\' the deal?', 132911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only 80 percent? You coulda gone WAY higher! Where\'s the greed?', '', 132910, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 101298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to de Goldtusk Inn, sista. Ya always among family here.\n\nRelax and rest, den let\'s drink!', '', 132909, 0, 8127, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to de Goldtusk Inn, brotha. Ya always among family here.\n\nRelax and rest, den let\'s drink!', '', 132908, 0, 8126, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing? That\'s my gear!', 'What are you doing? That\'s my gear!', 132907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Saboteur here!', 'Help! Saboteur here!', 132906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s delicate equipment!', 'That\'s delicate equipment!', 132905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Get away from my gear!', 'Hey! Get away from my gear!', 132904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\ABILITY_MAGE_FIRESTARTER.BLP:20|t You are targeted for |cFFF00000|Hspell:244410|h[Decimation]|h|r!', '', 132901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take out each of their reinforcement points!', 132900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me!', 132899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_ENCHANT_VOIDSPHERE.BLP:20|t Slay the Void Images before they can cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:246483|h[Void Slip]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_ENCHANT_VOIDSPHERE.BLP:20|t Slay the Void Images before they can cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:246483|h[Void Slip]|h|r!', 132898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me out of dis cage! I\'m innocent, I swear!', 'Let me out of dis cage! I\'m innocent, I swear!', 132897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s cannons have gone silent, thanks to you.', '', 132895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ph', '', 132894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree, Grenja. $p would be a good fit if Zulsan doesn\'t return.', '', 132893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has built up stores of ammunition to use against us. Thin out their forces and mark the stockpiles as targets for the Vindicaar\'s guns. Then... get out of the way!', '', 132892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whose idea was it to navigate near this forsaken grotto anyway?', 'Whose idea was it to navigate near this forsaken grotto anyway?', 132891, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The singing has finally stopped!', 'The singing has finally stopped!', 132890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... ale?', 'Is that... ale?', 132889, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, that part never gets old.', '', 132880, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I boiled de blood and stingers ya collected and mixed dem in our ceremonial Goldtusk goblet... It\'s a pineapple. Don\'t eat it. We only have one.', '', 132879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for saving my hide!', '', 132877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I\'ll see you at the rendezvous!', '', 132876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin, Turalyon.', 'Let us begin, Turalyon.', 132875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Light\'s Heart, we can restore Xe\'ra to her full glory.$b$bThe sooner we do this, the sooner we grow stronger against the Legion.', '', 132874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough. You have proven your worth.', 132873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. It is finished then.', '', 132872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose that qualifies as a victory.', '', 132871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fool\'s errand, but I will indulge you.', '', 132870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not restrain myself. Let us begin.', 132869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face Jarasum, Grand Vizier of the Conservatory!', '', 132868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Velara looks you over impassively.>\n\nYes?', 132867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will bow when addressing the High Wakener.', '', 132866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you to a duel.', 'I challenge you to a duel.', 132865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, stranger.', '', 132864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High Wakener Aargon. Where to start?\n\nHe ascended to his position only after his predecessor Thal\'kiel was banished. That is a story for another time, if you are not familiar with it. \n\nNeedless to say he was... an opportunist.\n\nUnder his influence we delved deeply into the mysteries of soulbinding. The constructs that roam these streets are his doing. They represent but a fraction of what the Wakeners could do.\n\nUnder the Legion he became Aargoss. \n\nTo the Army of the Light he was known as the Soulcleaver. Where soul engines operated, Aargoss was never far away.', 132863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arc-Consul Velara answered only to Archimonde himself.\n\nShe was a focused and quiet individual, as I recall. Parallel to the Wakener\'s guild, she led the Consulate in the pursuit of the powers of creation.\n\nUnder her tutelage we vastly expanded our ability to summon creatures of the arcane. The familiars that linger here still bear marks of her expertise. She was also largely responsible for cultivating the shield technology that we use even now.\n\nShe took the name Velysra and the title of Archmage when she joined the Legion.\n\nI hope you shall never meet her, $n.', 132862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the others.', 'Tell me about the others.', 132861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the Grand Vizier.\n\nHe acted as the Arc-Consul\'s second and oversaw much of the day to day operations in the Conservatory.\n\nWhen discipline was needed, it was often his voice that would ring out. He was not well liked, but he was respected nonetheless.\n\nIt is my understanding that he changed his name to Jaraxxus when he took the Legion\'s fel magics for his own.\n\nBeyond that, I know nothing of his fate.', 132860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Arc-Consul Velara.', 'Tell me about Arc-Consul Velara.', 132859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about High Wakener Aargon.', 'Tell me about High Wakener Aargon.', 132858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Grand Vizier Jarasum.', 'Tell me about Grand Vizier Jarasum.', 132857, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know who you will be fighting.$b$bArchimonde gave them each a title to acknowledge their substantial knowledge of their craft.$b$bSadly, all of them sided with the Legion. This is a rare opportunity to see them as they once were.', 132856, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION:20|tArmageddon impacted the platform, causing an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:240908|h[Armageddon Blast]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION:20|tArmageddon impacted the platform, causing an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Armageddon Blast]|h|r!', 132855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_painspike:20|tYou are afflicted by  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:233983|h[Echoing Anguish]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_painspike:20|tYou are afflicted by  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:233983|h[Echoing Anguish]|h|r!', 132854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ability_fixated_state_red.blp:20|t Zuraal the Ascended has fixated on you!', '', 132853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_PAINSPIKE:20|tA\'nutsu starts casting |cFFFF0404|Hspell:245164|h[Fragment of Despair]|h|r', '', 132852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the Guardian\'s Seal fades.', 'The power of the Guardian\'s Seal fades.', 132851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus Volcano is erupting.', '', 132850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see now that I almost wandered into a malevolent trap... thank you!', 'I see now that I almost wandered into a malevolent trap... thank you!', 132849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what came over me...', 'I don\'t know what came over me...', 132848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please save the others... I will go to Kimbul at once.', 'Please save the others... I will go to Kimbul at once.', 132847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was nearly destroyed... you have my thanks, stranger!', 'I was nearly destroyed... you have my thanks, stranger!', 132846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This deception nearly cost me my soul...', 'This deception nearly cost me my soul...', 132845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see now that it was only an enchantment. I will go to Kimbul...', 'I see now that it was only an enchantment. I will go to Kimbul...', 132844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was seduced by the devouring light. Thank you for saving me...', 'I was seduced by the devouring light. Thank you for saving me...', 132843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t survive much longer without food or water. After traveling in circles for most of de day, I decided my only option was to follow de advice of a rambling madman and head south toward de promise of shelter.', 132841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assassins, sent by Jakra\'zet, attacked our camp in de middle of de night. Unarmed and befuddled by sleep, we were unable to defend ourselves. I fought off de traitors, but it was too late. De survivors had scattered, each now forced to navigate dis unforgiving terrain alone.', 132840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De sun has set across de dunes, providing some relief from de heat dat has made many delirious. In a sun-stricken stupor, one among us began rambling about a temple to de south dat welcomes exiles. I doubt he will make it through de night.', 132839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I write dis as I sit in a cage with a dozen other exiles, traveling to de sands where we will live out our days, however numbered dey may be. De air, heavy with heat, tells me we are close.', 132838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 107388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You too late... da loa... all gonna be food... for da Blood God.', 132830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_KNIFE_1H_FIRELANDSRAID_D_01.BLP:20|t Aggramar begins a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:244688|h[Taeshalach Technique]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_KNIFE_1H_FIRELANDSRAID_D_01.BLP:20|t Aggramar begins a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:244688|h[Taeshalach Technique]|h|r!', 132829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use this key to go through the Town Hall. You can get to the back roads of Stratholme through there.', '', 132828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These naga are going to pay for this!', '', 132827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t thank you enough!', '', 132826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one!', '', 132825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom!', '', 132824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life. These serpent men will pay for what they\'ve done to our home...', 'I owe you my life. These serpent men will pay for what they\'ve done to our home...', 132823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\WARLOCK_CURSE_SHADOW_AURA.BLP:20|t Void-Blade Zedaat begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:246340|h[Nether Eruption]|h|r! Run!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\WARLOCK_CURSE_SHADOW_AURA.BLP:20|t Void-Blade Zedaat begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:246340|h[Nether Eruption]|h|r! Run!', 132822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the letter.>', '<Take the letter.>', 132821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It ends. My life... forever bound... to Sargeras...', 132818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The last of my strength... ebbs away. I will not... be able to stop them...', 132817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My resistance wanes. Should Sargeras prevail, all life will fall to darkness.', 132816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defeat them before they reach me, or all is lost.', 132815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions! The forces of the Legion seek to capture my essence for their infernal master!', 132814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n wins the match!', '$n wins the match!', 132813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What on earth was that?', 132812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better start distributing it to the rest of the townsfolk. People need to eat.', 'Better start distributing it to the rest of the townsfolk. People need to eat.', 132811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much grain! The farmers really outdid themselves this week.', 'So much grain! The farmers really outdid themselves this week.', 132810, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is looking for an opponent!', '$n is looking for an opponent!', 132809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy there, Pepper. What\'s gotten into you?', 'Easy there, Pepper. What\'s gotten into you?', 132808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bit, I guess. Not my problem.', 'A bit, I guess. Not my problem.', 132807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' smell off about this grain to you?', 'Somethin\' smell off about this grain to you?', 132806, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be reborn by Argus\' flame! I will never... stop... fighting.', 132805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think me a fool? Fiends, to me!', 132804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The armies of a thousand worlds will rise against you. You are damned!', 132803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will defend Argus to my dying breath!', 132802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... is... working!', '', 132801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will overwhelm it with energy before it can fire. I need only a moment.', '', 132800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot handle another attack from these creatures. We must end this now.', '', 132799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves. It rises!', '', 132798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we prevent it from firing, the antaen will surely turn its attack upon us.', '', 132793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nisha, thank the sands you\'re safe!', '', 132752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. The Vindicaar is safe once more.', '', 132751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Legion Devastators are pummeling our forces. Lower their protective barriers and we will show them the power of the Vindicaar!', '', 132750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the Vindicaar!', '', 132749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be purged by the Light!', '', 132748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear. Fire!', '', 132747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the other corner, a golem with a magnetic personality. Watch out, this golem\'s gonna Klunk you up!', 132746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the other corner, a golem with a magnetic personality. Watch out, this golem\'s gonna Klunk you up!', '', 132745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop right there!', 132744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freeze!', 132743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you feel it? There\'s treasure somewhere around here.', 132742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense treasure nearby.', 132741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One minute remaining. Cutting it a little close, aren\'t we?', 132740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s five minutes left. You think we\'ll finish in time?', 132739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you look at the time! Only about ten minutes left...', 132738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He truly is the kindest man I\'ve ever known.', 132737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s motions in your direction as if to stop you, then retracts, settling down to gaze into the distance once more.', '', 132736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, first time\'s always tough drinkin\' de ritual scorpid blood. Let it out. It be goin\' down easier next time.', '', 132735, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zuldazar betrayed us. Exiled us like outsiders. But we never betrayed each other. Goldtusks stay true.', '', 132734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, de blood tastes sweet... Drink it and see what I see, $p.', '', 132733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to The Breach.', 'Return to The Breach.', 132732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion must be stopped!', '', 132731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Chamber of the Avatar.', 'Teleport to the Chamber of the Avatar.', 132730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the power of the seal we can travel directly to the Chamber of the Avatar.', 132729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. The Gatekeeper is inactive.', 132728, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 87595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dragon comes! Felstalkers, hunt her down!', '', 132726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_DEATHKNIGHT_ARMYOFTHEDEAD.BLP:20|tThe Metal Knight summons an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245162|h[Army of the Dead]|h|r to attack Devlynn Styx!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_DEATHKNIGHT_ARMYOFTHEDEAD.BLP:20|tThe Metal Knight summons an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245162|h[Army of the Dead]|h|r to attack Devlynn Styx!', 132723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\WARRIOR_DISRUPTINGSHOUT.BLP:20|tDevlynn Styx leaps down to unleash her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245150|h[Screams]|h|r at the Death Metal Knight!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\WARRIOR_DISRUPTINGSHOUT.BLP:20|tDevlynn Styx leaps down to unleash her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245150|h[Screams]|h|r at the Death Metal Knight!', 132722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
