('We can help.', 'We can help.', 132598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re trying to find out who\'s about to attack Chromie. We\'ve heard you\'re having trouble with the ley lines - do you think that could be related?', 'We\'re trying to find out who\'s about to attack Chromie. We\'ve heard you\'re having trouble with the ley lines - do you think that could be related?', 132597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
