('Honestly, I\'m not sure. It\'s quite possible. The ley lines have always been fussy in this part of the world, but today, they\'re acting particularly strange. There\'s something interfering with them.', '', 132590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? What does the bronze dragonflight want here?', '', 132589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have. The dreamers have been restless. It\'s been... overwhelming.', 132588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? What is it I can do for you?', 132587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are. Usually only one or two stray ghouls trickle in each day, but today they\'ve attacked in numbers we haven\'t seen in nearly ten years.', 132586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you?', 132585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me? Why does everyone always suspect the black dragon? I\'m ashamed, Chronormu.$b$bNo, I know nothing about an attack. I was simply visiting Northrend for... my own amusement, let\'s say. I was, however, surprised to see this skeletal infestation here in our beloved dragonshrine. If you\'re looking for someone who might take umbrage at a dragon, you might start with these undead, and whomever might be controlling them.', '', 132584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know this shrine has been abandoned for a few years now, but... really? Shambling skeletal remains? Father would never have approved of this.', '', 132583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin Tor will be sponsoring a Tavern Crawl soon! Come to the Legerdemain Lounge when it starts and try some tasty drinks and food!', '', 132582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough with these insects. On to their leader!', '', 132581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will suffer these attacks no longer! Crush them! I am Krag\'wa, and I am no one\'s feast!', '', 132580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n. You have more than proven your strength and courage. Return to the temple and receive your reward.', '', 132579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think we should start our investigation by talking to a bronze dragon of some sort.', 132578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready when you are.', 'Ready when you are.', 132577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four caravans were devoured in the last ranishu swarm. Thank you for preventing it from happening again.', '', 132573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pack of brutosaurs wandered into Vol\'dun and caused the ranishu to start a feeding frenzy! Cull their numbers before they escalate into a deadly swarm.', '', 132572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove yourself by returning safely with the offerings and the loa will grant you an audience.', '', 132571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come and bring your good vibes to our dance parties at the Stormwind and Orgrimmar auction houses!', 132570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everybody dance now! We\'ve taken over the Stormwind and Orgrimmar auction houses for a dance party!', 132569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re going to be taking over the Stormwind and Orgrimmar auction houses for a dance party! I better see you there!', 132568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got to work on your moves, $p! We\'re going to be hosting dance parties in the Stormwind and Orgrimmar auction houses!', 132567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have served this temple and proven your worth, $n. In return, I shall grant you my blessing if you are willing to receive it.', '', 132566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must locate the fangcaller\'s lair and slay the creature without delay. The safety of the temple depends on it.', '', 132565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the sethrak are not driven from the canyon, the safety of this temple will be in jeopardy.', '', 132564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accept your offerings, stranger. Please come closer, these old eyes are not what they used to be.', '', 132563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears that we have a visitor, Jal\'nanji. Please see to our newest guest.', '', 132562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was it you said again?', 'What was it you said again?', 132561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to da real hunt.', '', 132560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy... they\'re... in the dream...', '', 132559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop this torment...', '', 132558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me...', '', 132557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you\'re a trend setter? Visit Warpweaver Tuviss or any Transmogrifier to enter the Trial of Style!', '', 132556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visit Warpweaver Tuviss in Dalaran or any other Transmogrifier to enter the Trial of Style!', '', 132555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $p. You need to step up your style game. The Trial of Style begins soon!', '', 132554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your outfits ready! The Trial of Style starts soon!', '', 132553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 132552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go to the Arcatraz.', 'I am ready to go to the Arcatraz.', 132551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great thunder lizard has allowed us to take refuge here at the temple. You are welcome here for as long as the loa allows.', '', 132550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOO! It\'s makin\' off with our A.M.O.D.! Our wages are gonna be garnished for the rest of our LIVES if we don\'t get it back!', '', 132549, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 101305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you get what we needed?', '', 132547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will defend you, Lifebinder.', 'We will defend you, Lifebinder.', 132546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You see hundreds of fuses leading into small vials of glimmering powder.>', '', 132545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The cutlasses in this crate have a familiar sheen on their blades.>', '', 132544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The essence of Eonar hovers before you. Though her beauty and purity is palpable, you can sense her sorrow and dread.>', 132543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say the word when you are ready to begin. No doubt we will soon have company.', '', 132542, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thousands of balls of musket shot are bundled carefully inside this crate.>', '', 132541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacker lies... within the dragon\'s palm...', '', 132540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek your answer... by the water...', '', 132539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stop... the great nightmare...', '', 132538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The unmistakable scent of gunpowder wafts from this crate.>', '', 132537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Peeling back the wrapping, you see the glint of gunmetal within the crate.>', '', 132536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will join you at the weapon, $p.', '', 132535, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never thought I\'d be stickin\' my neck out again for Cyrus.$B$BCourse I also never thought either of us would live this long!', '', 132534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me there when you\'ve got some information on those shipments.', '', 132533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send those kids to the western edge of the foundry. I\'ll wait there and make sure nobody tries to snatch \'em.', '', 132532, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 111974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cagney fished this girl out of the water with his ferry - said she was trying to escape the foundry.$B$BDoesn\'t surprise me one bit that the Ashvane Company is putting kids to work. I was barely older than her when the gangs in Boralus had me picking pockets and distracting guards for them.$B$BIn this world, the weaker you are, the more people take advantage of you.', '', 132531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now it says here that their leader is up on one of those floating discs above us. Time to go take him out!', 132530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aardon\'sha, kir kah\'los!', '', 132529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend me your strength, $p. We will finish this together!', '', 132528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are doomed.', 132527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All will bow before the Destroyer.', 132526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
