('Azeroth will fall!', 'Azeroth will fall!', 132500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86698, 86699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be heralded for your demise.', 'I will be heralded for your demise.', 132499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86696, 86697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen but a fraction of our might.', 'You have seen but a fraction of our might.', 132498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86694, 86695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the fury of a thousand conquered worlds.', 'I am the fury of a thousand conquered worlds.', 132497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86692, 86693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are legion!', 'We are legion!', 132496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86690, 86691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'huun... dis is not... what ya promised...', 132495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fool! Your soul now belongs to G\'huun!', 132494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I not ready... for... this...', 132493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya dare to be interruptin\' my mourning? Ya gonna regret dat!', 132492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mother and father yet live, Arator. I am sure of it. But for now, stay focused on the fight to come.', '', 132489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s like, are we storing treasure on the OUTside or the INside? Right?', 132488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s like we want people to find \'em! All that shiny gold edging and gem-encrusted locks...', 132487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So what\'s the deal with treasure chests nowadays? They\'re so expensive and shiny...', 132486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked great... until it talked his ear off!', 132485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did ye know he once used his gnomish gizmos to combine a parrot and shark into the ultimate pirate companion?', 132484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye all know crazy Rear Admiral Giggleplanks, right?', 132483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Six pirates!', 132482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What has six legs, six hands, and six eyes?', 132481, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'This is one of \'em brain puzzles...', 132480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He got it on sail!', 132479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I asked him how much he had to bribe the admiral with to make that happen, and he told me his secret...', 132478, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So Captain Salthoof got his first ship pretty quickly, right?', 132477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a buccaneer!', 132476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye know how he is. Always a perfectionist. Took two hours, and at the end of it I asked him how much I owed. He said...', 132475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So I was gettin\' me ears pierced by Pretty Boy Duncan on the Brashtide yesterday...', 132474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn the ways of the Moonkin at the Moonkin Festival in Moonglade!', '', 132473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Moonkin Festival begins soon! Be sure to visit Moonglade when it starts to learn more!', '', 132472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Moonkin Festival is soon! Come to Moonglade when it starts to find out what it\'s all about!', '', 132471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $p! Come learn about Moonkin at the Moonkin Festival in Moonglade!', '', 132470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! We must protect the Vindicaar with our lives!', '', 132469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us show Sargeras\' ilk what they have brought upon themselves.', '', 132468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I raised my mug and told him we just ARRR!', 132467, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After a few drinks, he looked me in the eyes and asked how the Bloodsail got to be so great...', 132466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was drinkin\' with a Dread Crew gunner in Booty Bay last week...', 132465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha, now someone get me a grog.', 132464, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, batten down yer hatches, mateys. This one\'ll blow yer rudder off...', 132463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank ye, matey. Treasure ain\'t always found in chests.', 132462, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spread the word. Tell \'em ol\' Bad News ain\'t so bad after all.', 132461, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, then buy me a clap of thunder, would ye?', 132460, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No hornswaggle? I thank ye kindly for that, friend.', 132459, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yarrr! Splice the mainbrace!', 132458, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve trained over countless oceans and pillages. This be authentic pirate humor!', 132457, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll cut ye fer... Oh wait, ye liked em? Thank ye. Nobody ever says they like \'em.', 132456, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank ye kindly, ye old sea dog.', 132455, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A black spot upon ye and all yer cockroach friends!', 132454, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thought I was gonna suffocate in there! Thanks, pal!', 132453, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 101331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go dance with Jack Ketch, and leave the jokes to the old salt.', 132452, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut yer squiffy grog hole and walk the plank, ye son of a biscuit eater!', 132451, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Newt gasps.', 132450, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shut yer trap or I\'ll run ye through, ye pathetic pirate wannabe!', 132449, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll cleave ye to the brisket!', 132448, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go keelhaul yerself, ye bilge-sucking carouser.', 132447, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! I\'d like to see ye do better, scallywag!', 132446, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah? Well yer face is terrible... and so is yer mother!', 132445, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis way!', 'Dis way!', 132444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light guides my arrow. There is nowhere the darkness can hide when exposed to its glorious incandescence.', '', 132443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your jokes are terrible!', 'Your jokes are terrible!', 132442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your jokes are the best!', 'Your jokes are the best!', 132441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, tell me a joke.', 'Sure, tell me a joke.', 132440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take off yer shoes, grab a grog, and share a joke with me!', 132439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve got us surrounded again. Poor fools.', '', 132438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand it when my quarry runs. However, they are only going to die tired.', '', 132437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While vile demons still draw breath, there can be no peace.$b$bWhile faithless traitors still live, there can be no forgiveness.', '', 132436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One shot, one kill.', '', 132435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Systems re-engaged, rerouting power. Weapons primed.', '', 132434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apocalypse drive engaged.', '', 132433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave none alive.', '', 132432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapon system primed, target locked.', '', 132431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannon primed for annihilation.', '', 132430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Targets acquired for decimation.', '', 132429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Critical system failure...', '', 132428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Targets cleared.', '', 132427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy combatants detected. Threat level nominal.', '', 132426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people were greedy, lusting for power. I have faith in the Light, and I have all the power I need to show them the error of their ways.', 132425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy contact. Deploying arsenal.', '', 132424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bormos over there has a great saying for times like this: \"Give me a hundred Lightforged. Barring that, a thousand regular troops.\"', 132423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By blade and spell, we make our stand against our enemies. We cannot rely too heavily on one or the other.', 132422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Few among us still wield true magic after we saw what tempted our brethren. I will take any advantage I can get.', 132421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your mark, $p.', '', 132420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activating transport array.', '', 132419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to give us reprieve from the ceaseless tide?', 132418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beacon deployed, Prophet!', '', 132417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close!', '', 132416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
