('', 'These traitors will never defeat us, for we walk in the Light.', 132412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you wounded? You seem fine. I\'m sure a fine meal will bring you back to fighting shape in no time.', 132411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did somebody call for the doctor? Too bad, there are Legion to fight!', 132410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The greatest wound imaginable is that our people would betray us so. It still festers, so many years later.$b$bWounds such as these must be cleansed, purified. The rot must be excised and destroyed before true healing can begin.', 132409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
