('INSERT SHOOTING GALLERY HERE', '', 132221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How very arrogant of you.', 132220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is our realm, fleshling.', 132219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you.', 132218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot hide.', 132217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will find you, interloper.', 132216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My, my... What is this?', '', 132215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... hahahaha', '', 132214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intruder?', '', 132213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself!', '', 132212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', '', 132211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The devastators are no more. Surge forward!', '', 132210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will befoul this world no longer!', '', 132209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your crimes, foul demons!', '', 132208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be cleansed, demons!', '', 132207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!', '', 132206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87805, 0, 644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina\'s jailers arrived here only a few days ago to carry out her exile. If we hurry, we may be able to find her before it\'s too late.', '', 132205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A futile effort, worm!', 132204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions! To me!', 132202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86788, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Intruder! You gonna\' pay for the death of me sisters!', 132201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Beastlord says you be one of us now, so you be permitted ta stay here. Don\'t think we be not keepin\' an eye on you, though.', '', 132190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riding pterrordax be thrilling, ta say da least! Be sure ta hang on tight!', 132189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, that\'s where we will begin.', '', 132188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s likely she would\'ve followed the road to look for shelter.', '', 132187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find a way, Mace, once we find Jaina. Thoughts, Yorrick?', '', 132186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a feeling they\'re not going to open that gate for us when we return...', 132185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is ours for the taking, sister.', 132182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87380, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zereketh\'s void magic still lingers here.', 132181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we go, this be the path!', 132180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ya be askin\' of Ol\' Bwonsamdi?', '', 132179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad, not bad! Maybe dere\'s a lil\' bit o\' soul reaper in ya!', '', 132178, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you defile my corpse!', '', 132177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not going anywhere, \"champion.\" The master has plans for you!', '', 132176, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know that I refuse to die while the Legion still stands, High Exarch. Follow me. We\'ve set up a perimeter.', 132175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not today, monster! The Light prevails!', 132172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Locus-Walker?', 132170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance is prepared to offer a large reward for Jaina\'s return.', 'The Alliance is prepared to offer a large reward for Jaina\'s return.', 132169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mean in Drustvar!? You must be kidding!\n\nNo sir, my place is here at the wall providing supplies to these fine soldiers! Only a fool would willingly set foot beyond those gates!', '', 132168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel that? Something is pulling us back...', 132167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are losing him!', 132166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He cannot hear us! We must end his suffering.', 132165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! What you have seen is a lie!', 132164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resist their call, Arkhaan!', 132163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fareeya! You survived!', '', 132162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not delay me, demon!', '', 132161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who is that?', 132160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will go on ahead and clear a path. The bridge leading to the Xenedar seems to be the least guarded. Light be with us.', '', 132159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I am sorry you had to learn this way. Rest now.', 132158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why... they not... listen?', '', 132157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan will make you understand!', '', 132156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must know the truth!', '', 132155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will all be undone! There is nothing... but the Void.', '', 132154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Thank you!', '', 132153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a worthy combatant, I\'ll give you that. The marshal will have my blade.', 132152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a bit late to turn back now, Yorrick. Denholm isn\'t likely to forgive a guard who attacks his own, even under orders.', 132149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina!? She is the purpose of this expedition? But that\'s treason!', '', 132148, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a risk I must take, Captain. Soldiers, on me.', '', 132146, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can pass, Reade, but the queen will hear of this! You\'ll never set foot in Boralus again!', '', 132145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough, I yield!', '', 132144, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have time for this! Soldiers, stand with me!', '', 132143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the queen, none shall pass this gate. Not even you.', '', 132142, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Denholm, I have conscripted these men for a special mission. I order you to stand aside and allow us to pass!', '', 132141, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt! Where exactly do you think you\'re going with my men, Marshal?', '', 132140, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should do it! Tell Marshal Reade that Quartermaster Notley is reporting for duty!', '', 132139, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just... borrow some of the things we\'ll need here...', '', 132138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reward, you say? Well, that changes things...', '', 132137, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your fire, it looks like we\'ve got them on the run.', '', 132136, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take up a crossbow and assist me, mainlander!', '', 132135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he has need of me, I\'ll follow his orders, but it would be dereliction to leave without thining out these beasts a hair.', '', 132134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suspected the marshal might be here for that reason, though I\'d keep your voice down when mentioning that name around here...', '', 132133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell you what, if you can show me your mettle, I\'ll join in Reade\'s little adventure. En garde!', 132132, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m prepared to tackle the dangers of the Gravewood, but I have no desire to tend to some mainlander who can\'t keep up.', 132131, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $r, to the Great Hunt. In dis place, all that tread be open game.$b$bHere we honor dem dat bring only the finest of trophies back from their hunts.', 132130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful now! Dat witch has some powerful mojo!', '', 132129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tablet is ancient and worn down. It stands in stark contrast to the fresh offerings placed before it.', 'The tablet is ancient and worn down. It stands in stark contrast to the fresh offerings placed before it.', 132128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you\'ve reached the Arcatraz, I will remain in contact.', '', 132127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86329, 0, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Axe_2H_UndeadGuitar_C_01.blp:20|tPower Chords rain down, use them to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245034|h[Blow the Mind]|h|r of your enemies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Axe_2H_UndeadGuitar_C_01.blp:20|tPower Chords rain down, use them to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:245034|h[Blow the Mind]|h|r of your enemies!', 132126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?! I can\'t be beaten!', '', 132125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have failed, Blight Boar.  Your fans now serve my armies of the dead!', '', 132124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul for my armies!', '', 132123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul for my music!', '', 132122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I summon ghouls out every tomb.  Fight as you might, they will seal your doom!', '', 132121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness falls, and with it Banshees form these Wailing Walls!', '', 132120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight though you might, your bodies will freeze and shatter!', '', 132119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prove once and for all that only a knight from the grave can rule heavy metal.', '', 132118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya bones gonna serve da mistress!', 132117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s adjust our strategy.\n|cFF0000FF(Change Chromie\'s talents).|r', 'Let\'s adjust our strategy.\n|cFF0000FF(Change Chromie\'s talents).|r', 132116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Adjust Chromie\'s talents>', '<Adjust Chromie\'s talents>', 132115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scum and filth, these Horde!', '', 132114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will this war never end?', '', 132113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to the shadows.', '', 132112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay safe, soldier.', '', 132111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again!', 132110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits of those who resist the Legion inspire us all.', '', 132109, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even when tortured by the Legion, my people rebel against their accursed crusade. The demons may break their bodies, but never their wills. Go, release their spirits so that they may find peace.', '', 132108, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be north. Just follow the river and cross over when it gets shallow.', '', 132107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be goin\' wit\' dem, make sure it be truly safe.', 132106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome! Sorry about the mess, we don\'t get living visitors much.', '', 132105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh.', '', 132104, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah!', '', 132103, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Do not listen!', '', 132102, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nnghh... Stay with us!', '', 132101, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no... no.', '', 132100, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that?', '', 132099, 0, 53060, 0, 64, 0, 87613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope that you can find this Raalgar before the Legion does. Someone on the Vindicaar will help you.', 132098, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 87646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That sounded way better in my head than it did out loud!', 132097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I believe enough of ya story... for now. Let\'s talk.', '', 132096, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I swear it!', 132095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold up Jhasan! $GHe:She; got a quality to \'em. Maybe this little girl be telling the truth.', '', 132094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah keeping us busy with talk till your friends get here?', '', 132093, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, dey be friend--$n, look out!', 132092, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Thank you.', 'I see. Thank you.', 132091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not particularly. The ley lines have been acting up again, but that is normal in this part of the world.', '', 132090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually, yes. The Garden Keeper at the Emerald Dragonshrine has been struggling to keep the dreamers asleep. Several of the ancients have unexpectedly awakened from the Dream, and we have yet to find out why.', '', 132089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dead walk once more.\n\nThe Ruby Dragonshrine has a history of conflict with the undead. Most of that struggle subsided with the fall of the Lich King. But as of late, such incidents have been on the rise.', 132088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seen anything strange lately?', 'Seen anything strange lately?', 132087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is strange about your aura, $r. Your presence seems... otherworldly, as if you do not belong here.\n\n<Kalecgos looks down at Chromie.>\n\nAh, I see. Time traveling. That... that might explain it.\n\n<Kalecgos eyes you warily.>', '', 132086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you are accompanied by Chronormu. Might I ask... are you here from the future, or the past?\n\nOn second thought, do not bother answering that. Such matters are best left to the bronze.', '', 132085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Am... am I in trouble?', 132084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Wyrmrest, time-traveler. The council is at your disposal, should you need us.', 132083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The codebreaker\'s lifeless eyes stare into the sky. A thin tome rests beneath her body.>', '', 132082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry that Zulsan isn\'t here to meet you. He\'d like your hair.', '', 132081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pick up the code book.>', '<Pick up the code book.>', 132080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Take the Missive>', '<Take the Missive>', 132078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You can see the corner of a missive tucked into the courier\'s bracers.>', '', 132077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scorched parchment you left behind will remind the Legion that our resistance cannot be silenced. Thank you.', '', 132075, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The man\'ari torment my kind with their fel magic rituals. Let their dark words be purged... in fire!', '', 132074, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go try to save you again!', 'Let\'s go try to save you again!', 132073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This water is cursed. Do not give in to thirst.', '', 132072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure we can figure this out. Let me know when you\'re ready.', 132071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look. The way is closed. How will we go to Isolon now?', '', 132069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I heard what $p said, Man\'zul. I still think ya eyepatch be uglier than a saurolisk\'s backside.', '', 132068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Volni, be nice. Dey mighta gotten dressed in de dark... Ya not wrong, though!', '', 132067, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grenja be our resident bard. She\'ll play any song ya ask her... as long as it\'s drums. She likes smashing things. Hopefully not ya face, ha! She won\'t, she won\'t.... She might.', '', 132066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s try that again. We\'ll give ourselves a SMIDGE more time before my murder.\n\nYou ready?', 132065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You ready?  There\'s no time like the present... trust me.', 132064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 132063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again!', 132062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Grenja, I won\'t buy ya a golden drum! Stop askin\' or I be takin\' away ya fancy new hat!', '', 132057, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must keep our wits about us here. Dis swamp is de source of powerful voodoo.', '', 132055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell fresh. The smell of the swamp has not gotten into your meat. Best get to talking.', '', 132054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dark ones called to Annie, but from evil she refrained. No surprise to anyone she ended up in chains!', 132053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan knows, yes.', '', 132052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arkhaan, was it? Can you tell us what happened to your people?', 132051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sam kept his farm well-tended. To livestock he was kind. Into the woods Sam vanished--now who will tend his swine?', 132049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mister Hayes was said to have a soul so sweet and nice. How sad the kind man\'s heart became a witch\'s sacrifice!', 132048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Miss Mary turned her back on us while seeking wicked power. She brought death upon our village, turned the forest dark and dour.', 132047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, outsider. The King be through this door and up the lift inside.', '', 132046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be warned, outsider, you are being watched. You are about to stand in de presence of one of de oldest trolls alive. And he is alive because my brother and I keep him alive. So don\'t get any ideas.', 132045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance for Zul\'jin!', '', 132044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope they have food on the boat!', 'I hope they have food on the boat!', 132043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104817, 104818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to find a warm fire!', 'Now to find a warm fire!', 132042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104815, 104816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please help the grown-ups, too!', 'Please help the grown-ups, too!', 132041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104813, 104814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 132040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104811, 104812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m goin\' back to school...', 'I\'m goin\' back to school...', 132039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104809, 104810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They won\'t catch me! I\'m too fast!', 'They won\'t catch me! I\'m too fast!', 132038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104807, 104808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m out of here!', 'I\'m off!', 132037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104805, 104806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time heals all wounds... except for... the fatal ones...', 132036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry...', 132035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t what happens...', 132034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like it\'s my time... to...', 132033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe next time...', 132032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... it\'s not supposed to happen this way...', 132031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! I did it!', 132030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, wonderful! Everything worked out!', 132029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, but... that\'s how it goes!', 132028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh! Your time just ran out!', 132027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m more powerful than I appear, you know...', 132026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we go!', 132025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The timestream won\'t repair itself!', 132024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to take matters into my own hands!', 132023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright... now I attack THIS one...', 132022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Umm... sorry about this.', 132021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm yourself, Drekal. Dese creatures have given us shelter. Let us gain their trust.', 132020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oho, dat a mighty soul! Old Bwonsamdi feelin\' spry now! Haha, yes, da powers be growin\'!', '', 132019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am one with the Light. The Light is with me.', '', 132018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You destroy your chance for power...', 132017, 0, 8127, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely done. That will surely set them back.', '', 132016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sethrak are expanding their empire, taking over the plains where our people once lived. We must put a stop to their rapid conquest!', '', 132015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 107672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe we can use them to grease some wheels in Andorhal.', 132014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting... these documents mark the bearer as some sort of higher-up in the Cenarion Circle.', 132013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not much use to us here, but maybe in the Well of Eternity...', 132012, 0, 51279, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande\'s Moonstone? How did you find THIS?', 132011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head down to the water. There is a boat waiting to take you to safety.', 'Head down to the water. There is a boat waiting to take you to safety.', 132010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish man... you know not what you meddle in...', 132009, 0, 8126, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think we can use this to rile up the fire elementals in Mount Hyjal.', 132008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Brimstone Beacon... fascinating!', 132007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep that handy for the next time we visit Stratholme.', 132006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that a Stratholme gate key? Ha! This must be our lucky day!', 132005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw bad men. They were yelling at everyone - even the other grown-ups!', 'I saw bad men. They were yelling at everyone - even the other grown-ups!', 132004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you mean?$B$BYou don\'t look mean.', 'Are you mean?$B$BYou don\'t look mean.', 132003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My nose is froze, and my ears are froze, and my toes are froze...', 'My nose is froze, and my ears are froze, and my toes are froze...', 132002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They said they was gonna feed us, but I ain\'t seen a crust of bread since I got here!', 'They said they was gonna feed us, but I ain\'t seen a crust of bread since I got here!', 131999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drekal and I will meet you dere after we\'ve had a look around.', 131998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should head to de temple ahead of us. If dis loa has as much power as dey claim, maybe it can help us find Rakera.', 131997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> <cough>$B$BI wanna go home.', '<cough> <cough>$B$BI wanna go home.', 131996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t yell at me!', 'Please don\'t yell at me!', 131995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m tired.', 'I\'m tired.', 131994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you next time, $n!', 131993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But that\'s a problem for future us! Well, future you and past me. Aw, don\'t worry about it. Time is complicated.', 131992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why\'s everybody so mad at me? I think we should probably figure that out, eventually.', 131991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A whole lot of people seemed very intent on killing me. Demons, elementals, undead, void lords... even the Horde and the Alliance!', 131990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There ARE a few things still bothering me, though...', 131989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s good!', 131988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything seems... back to normal. The timelines are clearer. I don\'t see myself dying anymore.', 131987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whew! I should be safe now.', 131986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s the portal! Let\'s move!', 131985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There should be a time portal up on the other side of the Well. I know the way. Follow me!', 131984, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These fel wounds are bad. We need to get me back to Wyrmrest.', 131983, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! There I am!', 131982, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Well of Eternity, just prior to the War of the Ancients. About ten thousand years before your time, $n. Give or take.', 131981, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be fine, I think. Thanks for the help!', 131980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feeling better?', 131979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry. We\'ll protect you!', 131978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww, I\'m wounded! I can heal this... I just need a little bit more time.', 131977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There I am!', 131976, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 85344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sure don\'t recall there being so many fire elementals around here...', 131975, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 85343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember this! I should be just up ahead.', 131974, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 85342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see... we\'re in Mount Hyjal, shortly after the time of the Cataclysm.', 131973, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 85341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any time!', 131972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you so much for saving me, me!', 131971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yikes! That\'s one nasty-looking creature. Well, there\'s no getting past her. Looks like we\'re going to have to take her on.', 131970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess we\'re headed into Stratholme! Let\'s get a move on, we don\'t have much time!', 131969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t fight them off. They\'ve taken you into the city!', '', 131968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chromie! Thank the sands you\'ve arrived. They\'ve taken you into the city!', '', 131967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stratholme, during the Third War. I remember this day. Not exactly Prince Arthas\' finest moment.', 131966, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 85367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think so. See you next time!', 131965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cannon is down. Can you make it out?', 131964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hold my own here, but I can\'t fly away with that cannon pointed at the skies.', 131963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ALLIANCE wants me too? What\'s going on right now?', 131962, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soldiers of the Alliance! Hold your ground! She can\'t hide forever.', '', 131961, 0, 0, 5, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See, this is one of the problems with being a gnome. Sometimes Horde soldiers just get the urge to KICK you.', 131960, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is! You have your orders. Slay the dragon!', '', 131959, 0, 0, 397, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Andorhal, a few months after the Cataclysm. We\'re in the middle of a battle between the Horde and the Alliance.', 131958, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 85278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow... an oldie but a goodie! This portal points to the Well of Eternity.', 131957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see... a portal to Stratholme, back in the days of the Third War.', 131956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aha! A portal to Mount Hyjal. I\'ve been there a time or tree. THREE. I meant to say three.', 131955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting... a portal to Andorhal. That\'s one of my favorite places of any when! Let\'s see if I\'m in trouble.', 131954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These guys really know what they\'re doing! I wouldn\'t be surprised if they had a bronze dragon on their side.', 131953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can tell you\'re a little foggy on what that means. Basically, they\'re attacking me at multiple points in time simultaneously.', 131952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a sneaking suspicion that the enemy is planning a cross-synchronous attack. Why else would they be using chronoshards, right?', 131951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And looky here... it was carrying a chronoshard. I need to bring this to Wyrmrest to find out where it goes.', 131950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never expected to be on the bad side of a VOID LORD, of all things. Sheesh.', 131949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s skip the ley lines and go straight to that void lord. Time is of the essence!', 131948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get down there and look for clues. Maybe the disturbances are coming from whoever wants to kill me.', 131947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this! A chronoshard. We should bring it back with us to Wyrmrest.', 131946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odd. I don\'t remember getting on the satyrs\' bad side, either now OR in the future.', 131945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, the satyr is down in that bone claw by the water. Let\'s take him out!', 131944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go!', 131943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dreamers gave us three clues... great nightmare, by the water, dragon\'s palm. We just need to figure out what they mean.', 131942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can help with that, right?', 131941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can help with that!', 131940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome Soldier, are you ready to fight for the Alliance?', 131939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... a chronoshard. Let\'s bring this back to Wyrmrest. I wonder when and where it goes.', 131938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh! I wonder what the Legion wants with little ol\' me.', 131937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Luckily for us, we already know about the dreadlord mastermind pulling the strings. Let\'s kill him before he can kill me!', 131936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And it sounds like he gave away his position. Ha! Let\'s go to the entrance of the Obsidian Dragonshrine and snuff him out!', 131935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A dreadlord? And a bronze dragon... Wait, is he talking about me?', 131934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He makes a fair point. Let\'s poke around that spooky cavern for clues.', 131933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh? What\'s this? Some kind of chronoshard? I\'ll have to bring it back to Wyrmrest to investigate.', 131932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you have it tough? You have no idea how hard it is trying to keep up with the schedule for which War is running and when.', '', 131931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s one threat taken care of in a timely manner!', 131930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can go straight for that lich, $n. If he\'s really orchestrating this attack, then killing him should scatter their forces.', 131929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s inside the tree, right? Let\'s go get him then. His time has come!', 131928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A lich! Argh! I figured as much... though it\'s odd I couldn\'t see this in any future timeline.', 131927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, $n. Let\'s go clear out the undead leaders. Maybe they\'ll know something about the upcoming attack.', 131926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like we\'ve got some dragonshrines to investigate. Let\'s go, uh... investigate some dragonshrines!', 131925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ley line disturbances? Pshh... typical blue dragon problems.', 131924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Lord Itharius. We\'ll take a look, and will let you know if we find anything.', 131923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll check it out. Thanks!', 131922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pretty sure he was headed to the Obsidian Dragonshrine.', 131921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange? Let me think... Oh! I did see that black dragon earlier today. What was his name? Deathwing? No, no, no, not him... the other one. The one with the hat.', 131920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Undead attacks at the Ruby Dragonshrine? We\'ll take a look. Thanks, Allie.', 131919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s ask around and see if we can figure out where those shadowy bolts were coming from.', 131918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That probably won\'t be enough time to save me, but it\'s the best I can do for now.', 131917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are now at a time 15 minutes before my death.', 131916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, that did it!', 131915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s give this one last try...', 131914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I\'m starting to get worried, $n. Whoever orchestrated this attack really did their homework. They\'ve found a way to block my chronoports!', 131913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No worries! Four hours was probably too early anyways. Let\'s try one hour.', 131912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh! That\'s weird. Something\'s blocking me from accessing that particular moment.', 131911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, I\'m chronoporting us to a point four hours before the attack happens. That\'ll give us PLENTY of time to untangle this mess.', 131910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somebody is trying to kill you. In fact, it should happen any second now...', 131909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, where are we going? Why are we leaving Wyrmrest?', 131908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Well, alright. You\'ve never steered me wrong in the past. Or in the future.', 131907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me! We don\'t have much time!', 131906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hi! What am I doing here?', 131905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Chromie!', 131904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bought us a few more seconds this time, but we have to move quickly.', 131903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we go... again!', 131902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hi! What are you doing here?', 131901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, good. There I am over there. Hi, me!', 131900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright... let\'s see here. I think we\'re at the right time, give or take a minute. Am I dead yet?', 131899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold onto your helmet... we\'re traveling through TIME!', 131898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep flying and hope we don\'t find out.', 131897, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 105870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll need to travel through de swamp. As long as we stay in de air and out of sight, we shouldn\'t have too much trouble.', 131894, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 105869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kaja, beneath us! What are those things?', 131893, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 106073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Every choice we made was to keep you safe. It broke our hearts to be apart from you.', 131891, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 86176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arator... not a day passed that your mother and I didn\'t--', '', 131890, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... couldn\'t you have reached out to us? To your people? To me?', '', 131889, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'da asks, ma\'da gonna have.', '', 131888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for da Greatmother!', '', 131887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meat for da warmothers!', '', 131886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New blood!', '', 131885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'da said kill... no... capture. Yes! Capture.', '', 131884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tendons! Slice dem. Ma\'da said ta slice dem.', '', 131883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die! Die! Die!', '', 131882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Searching his pockets, you find a letter.>\n\nMy dearest Mary,\n\nPlease, come back home. Russell continues to ask where you are. What shall I say? That mother ran into the woods to do who knows what? We miss you, my dear. Our home is not the same. Please, come back to us.\n\nLove,\nJonathan', '', 131881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('-hic- watchsh where yerr goin\'...', '-hic- watchsh where yerr goin\'...', 131880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Investigate the body for identification.>', '<Investigate the body for identification.>', 131878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Activate the teleportation sequence.>', '<Activate the teleportation sequence.>', 131877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Light\'s Judgment is smashed into the side of the cliffs. It is intact, but clearly not operational. $b$bYou should be able to activate the security countermeasures to teleport it to the Vindicaar.>', '', 131876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we shipping out today?', 'What are we shipping out today?', 131875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', 'Yes?', 131874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus. Throne of the Burning Legion. Its infernal machines provide Sargeras with an infinite army.\n\nTime to deprive the Dark Titan of his prize.\n\nOur course is clear. We must take the fight to Argus and bring the Legion to its knees.', '', 131873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sargerite Keystone tore through the fabric of reality. Now the homeworld of the Legion looms before us, its armies poised to strike.\n\nTuralyon is out there somewhere. Alleria too, I hope. If we can find my old friends, perhaps the Army of the Light can help us end this war.', '', 131872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always knew I would see Argus again. Our homecoming appeared time and again in my visions.\n\nBut I never imagined this.\n\nThere can be no doubt that the fates of my world and yours are intertwined. Can Argus be saved, or must it be sacrificed to stop Sargeras? My visions are clouded, uncertain.\n\nIt seems we must forge our own destiny. Light save us all, $n.', '', 131871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Widow\'s grog! Three barrels.', 'Widow\'s grog! Three barrels.', 131869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spice wine! Five barrels! Abyssal ale! Seven barrels! Aaaand...', 'Spice wine! Five barrels! Abyssal ale! Seven barrels! Aaaand...', 131868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up! Here\'s the order for the day!', 'Listen up! Here\'s the order for the day!', 131867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Arkhaan did call... but he was not expecting...', '', 131866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooooooooooo!', '', 131861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooooooooooooooh!', '', 131860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aiiiiiiyaaaaahhhhhhh!', '', 131859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeeeeeeeeeee!', '', 131858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaaaaaaaahhhhhhhh!', '', 131857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aiiii!', '', 131856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks again for your help. I\'m going to take this offering straight to the temple.', 'Thanks again for your help. I\'m going to take this offering straight to the temple.', 131855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Settle down, everyone! $p gonna come around to each of ya and say hello.', '', 131851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you in the ruins below, $n. We will begin where the darkness ends.', 131846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat be enough for now. Go find da Princess over on the great stair. I will keep patrollin\' for any other Alliance we missed.', '', 131845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us split up and track these Alliance down. I\'ll be doin\' my best to help ya find dem.', '', 131844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such audacity! An attack in my own temple? Goodness me. Dey gonna be mighty sorry, mmm-hmm. Mighty sorry.', '', 131843, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 98422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been walking in dis world for far too long. At last, peace is mine!', 131842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run along, mon. Bwonsamdi be watchin\' ya.', '', 131841, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 109290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good good. Sylvanas will be pleased. Come, \"Speaker,\" let us discuss our next move.', '', 131840, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, we ALL have to fight that thing? I thought we could... like... you know... send in our champion or something.', '', 131839, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ta sound da drum you\'ll need da Mallet of Mambu and da Mallet of Gee\'dae. You can find dem both in me temple grounds.', '', 131838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up!', '', 131837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not tired!', '', 131835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sleep!', '', 131834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No want sleep!', '', 131833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend.', '', 131832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride to Zul\'jan.', 'I need a ride to Zul\'jan.', 131831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Although I be dead, da creatures still be coming at my call.\n\nYou want ride?', 131830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a word. Dere is a situation dat demands your attention.', '', 131829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, my friend! I have been looking all over for you!', '', 131828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We found your messages.', 131823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A voice! Arkhaan has never heard this one before.', '', 131822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on out. We mean you no harm.', 131821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I found a survivor. Come to me.', 131820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ya go forgetting our deal, now. Keep sending souls ta Bwonsamdi... If ya want to keep me favor.', '', 131818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let the long, dark night break you. Accept its gift.', '', 131817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy now, princess! We best be takin\' dis slow. We need ta scout da area and come up wit\' a plan.', '', 131816, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You da hero she spoke of I\'m guessing. If you can help our princess I will tell you everything. I been tending our wounded for a long time now, and it is only getting worse.\n\nShe\'s going to Nazmir. She cab only taking a small guard with her but your man Rokhan joined up too. We gave them what supplies would not be missed.\n\nThey be taking the northwest gate. No blood trolls been sighted there for some time since they started sieging the main gate.\n\nThe eyes of my loa be masked there. Please walk careful.', 131803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Deathknight_Necroticplague.blp:20|t You are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:244093|h[Necrotic Embrace]|h|r!', '', 131778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will repay this debt. You have my word.', 'I will repay this debt. You have my word.', 131777, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 107257, 107258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free to go? No deal to be made? You are different than most.', '', 131776, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 107255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a mess down there. I wish the princess had never left. The blood trolls are at our very gate and still the king does nothing!', 131774, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is maddening!', 131773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not how I thought I would spend my time in Mac\'Aree.', 131772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s not here more than a day and she already leaving!\n\nTalanji be heading somewhere and doing it behind her father\'s back. She grab only a few of her personal guard to keep up appearances.\n\nI feel she is going to Nazmir even if she don\'t say. That\'s a bad place, mon. If I can\'t go, I would feel better if you went in my stead.\n\nShe be needing supplies. The princess probably gonna call in markers with the priesthood at her old haunt. Let me see your map.', '', 131771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse the void for infesting these poor creatures!', 131770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I was going to catch that one.', 131769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are trying to help you, creature!', 131768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay still!', 131767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 88027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Talanji?', 'Where is Talanji?', 131766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be on my good side for saving our Princess. I know from experience she be a handful to protect at times. She thinks she has to save the Zandalari all by herself.', '', 131765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kindness is unexpected.', 'Your kindness is unexpected.', 131764, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no time for chit chat soldier, this here is Forward Command. We are right in the thick of it, with Camp Taurajo over there sending wave after wave of those blasted Tauren at us.\n\nIf we lose our position here, I can\'t see how we can possibly take the gates.', '', 131763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me.', 'Show me.', 131762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t hide from de mojo!', '', 131761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need to show you what I have seen.', 131760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darkness creeps in on us from all sides. Keep your wits about you.', 131759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your eyes open and your steps soft, $n.', 131758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forces beyond our reckoning are at work here. Be on guard.', 131757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a familiar presence here. I hear it calling to me.', 131756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without the Crest of Knowledge, we cannot prevail.', '', 131753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valjabu, dere is no reason to go to de other side. Submit to G\'huun, and life eternal will be yours for de taking!', '', 131752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another pathetic exile come to die in the sand?', '', 131750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make your way to Nazmir with Rokhan. I will meet you dere. We must put an end to dis blood troll menace.', 131745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blessings of Odin to you, and here, a fair reward as well.', 131742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright boys, let\'s get in here and paint it red. I want guards on the doors in case they decide to try to kick us out and I want a full service bar ready to go stat. Also, someone find me another teleporting stone in case of emergency.', '', 131741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s not keep our son waiting.', 131740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on here? Why are we caged like animals?', '', 131709, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yorrick, bring your field kit over here. We have a survivor!', 131706, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... oh! Yes, sir!', '', 131705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On your feet, Ensign! We need to search for a way out of here!', 131703, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bladeguard Hozzul is unresponsive.', '', 131690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bladeguard Jorana is unresponsive.', 131689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to de Goldtusk Inn!', '', 131674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION.BLP:20|tYou have been affected by  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236329|h[Star Burn]|h|r. Hide behind infernal pillars when targeted by Shattering Star!', '', 131673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This exile appears to still be alive, though barely breathing. \n\nHis wounds are severe, but his sickliness suggests he may be afflicted beyond the obvious damage.', '', 131672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There appears to be light coming from the other side of the rubble blocking this corridor. \n\nIf the debris could be cleared, this may lead out of the ruins.', '', 131671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These creatures were slain with frost magic - a sure sign that Jaina passed through here.\n\nWhere she went, however, remains a mystery.', '', 131670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The beast weakens. Strike true!', 131669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These look like the tracks of one of the beasts that attacked your party in the forest. It appears to have been dragging something behind it.\n\nOddly, the tracks seem to disappear completely at a point, as if the beast just vanished.', '', 131668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out. I\'m getting HANGRY!', '', 131667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What WAS dat?!', 131666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn Hatchling squeals in surprise.', '', 131665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn Juvenile pounces on you affectionately.', '', 131664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn Juvenile gives you an accidentally sharp love bite.', '', 131663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn Juvenile excitedly knocks you over.', '', 131662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so hungry, I could eat a brutasaur!', '', 131661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama, can I have more meat, please?', '', 131659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lashers are tasty, but I want MEAT!', '', 131658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s growls playfully.', '', 131657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s regards you mischeiviously.', '', 131656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prances around with glee.', '', 131655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whines excitedly.', '', 131654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, you got spunk, kid, but you ain\'t a negotiator. Not on my level.$b$bJust get me an audience with that King of theirs and I\'ll sweet talk him out of his fleet, his throne, all that gold they use to decorate the place, and maybe even a couple of extra souvenir tiki masks on the way out.', '', 131653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh heh, look at dat! Maybe ya be woth me time after all, mon. Come make we chat back in da temple. Old Bwonsamdi just might have an offer for ya.', '', 131652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Salazae... she be dawdling among de living for too long naw. Do whatever it takes to bring her soul to dis so, so very patient loa, hmm?', '', 131651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 98410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave me, unless you can reunite me with my beloved.', 131650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to receive your blessing.', 'We are ready to receive your blessing, great loa.', 131649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many years have passed since the construction of this temple. Though the walls remain the same, the faces of my followers have changed.', '', 131648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\TRADE_ARCHAEOLOGY_SHARK JAWS:20|tBring |cFFFF0000|Hspell:232913|h[Befouling Ink]|h|r to Sarukel to end his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:234621|h[Devouring Maw]|h|r!', '', 131647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings little ones, I have returned. Step forward and receive my blessing.', '', 131637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only de Zandalari may walk those sacred halls! De law states--', '', 131633, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it be known... Dis day, I name you Speaker of the Horde.', '', 131632, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De law is what I say it is, for so long as I am king.', '', 131631, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De eyes of de kingdom rest upon you, champion. Dis day, I name you Speaker of de Horde.', '', 131630, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if de Horde can prove its worth to Zandalar. Let dem stay in de Great Seal as my guests... for now.', '', 131629, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji worries dat I do not see our true enemies. Know dat I am not as blind as she fears.', '', 131628, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But my daughter is right as well. Rescuing her showed great courage... a trait I admire.', '', 131627, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jakra\'zet speaks true... you seek our fleet\'s might against de Alliance.', '', 131626, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great! Sit down so we can start the party. With you and Smoochums helping, I can call the last guest!', 131625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up here! This is gonna be the best tea party ever!', 131624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go! Let\'s go! It\'s time for the tea party!', 131623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With your sacrifice added to that of my husband, the ritual shall be complete!', 131620, 0, 8126, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join us, sister, and we will attain great power!', 131619, 0, 8127, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<There is a large, open wound in the center of the man\'s chest. Peering in, you notice that his heart has been ripped out.>', '', 131618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carved into the wood reads \"S. Hawthorne\".', '', 131617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mr. Hawthorne was always trying to keep the doggies away from his animals. But now the doggies can finally have supper!', 131616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our poor little village is dead.', 131615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must be wary. Nobody comes back from Nazmir.', 131609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood trolls are pathetic savages. Dey have not been a threat for ages.', 131608, 0, 49812, 0, 68, 0, 0, 99422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough. I will decide what to do with dis outsider.', '', 131607, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 109689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To defeat de blood trolls, we need allies. I did what had to be done.', 131606, 0, 49812, 0, 68, 0, 0, 112325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talanji brought de mongrel Horde with her. Dis is treason, Your Highness.', '', 131605, 0, 49812, 0, 68, 0, 112456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your soul for me master! Your soul for G\'huun!', 131604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis will not... be... de end...', 131603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 99301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
