('I\'m not leaving him like this. Go let the others know they did to him, I\'ll meet you back at the temple.', '', 131505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Sniff* Please wake up...', '', 131504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakasi you\'re safe now... Hakasi? Hey... wake up...', '', 131503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, you will... Walk in the Light.', '', 131502, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have hidden. We have adapted. In our hour of need, this land still listens to our pleas.', '', 131501, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, chieftain. We will gladly take whatever help we can get.', '', 131500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tunnel! So this is how you have survived...', '', 131499, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a way. We will use what power we have to help you.', '', 131498, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 86340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad devilsaur! Bad!', 'Bad devilsaur! Bad!', 131497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your assistance, as well as relaying my orders. I will report to Marshal Reade.', '', 131496, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will only fall if we stand together, chieftain. And right now, we have friends facing grave peril.', '', 131495, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('However, time is often the enemy of wisdom.', '', 131494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wisdom would favor waiting for the storm to clear before venturing into such hostile territory.', '', 131493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, I\'ll ready the supplies posthaste.', '', 131492, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Marshal Reade that Quartermaster Notley is reporting for duty!', '', 131491, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you at the gate, mainlander. I hope you\'re prepared for what lies ahead.', 131490, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! So Reade is looking to storm into the woods of Drustvar? It\'s about time something interesting happened around here.', 131489, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pains me to see them go, Aunt Vereesa. I could not bear to lose them now, not after waiting all these years.', '', 131488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you bothering me for a reason, mainlander? \n\n...or is it not obvious that I\'m busy?', 131487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A storm\'s been brewing over the Gravewood. We\'ll be lucky to spot any attack before it\'s on our doorstep.\n\nAs if Drustvar wasn\'t dangerous enough without this foul weather...', '', 131486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal Reade sends orders to join his expedition to find Jaina.', 'Marshal Reade sends orders to join his expedition to find Jaina.', 131485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, we don\'t get many mainlanders here at the wall. \n\nAre you looking for supplies?', '', 131484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is taking too long! We have more important things to do than play with this thing.', 131483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it back from us! Use your magic!', 131482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is not worth our death to fight these sentinels. Keep it subdued until the High Inquisitor is free!', 131481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s very dangerous, sisters. Maintain control!', 'It\'s very dangerous, sisters. Maintain control!', 131480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll admit, your courage surprises me, mainlander. \n\nEven though you are not from this place, you choose to put yourself in great peril to save one of ours.  I only hope your blade is as steady as your heart.\n\nWe leave on your word.', '', 131479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on Hakasi... we\'ll save you I promise!', '', 131478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll... never... get away with this you monster!', '', 131477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this, a mainlander come to visit the wall? No doubt you want to get a glimpse of the cursed land of Drustvar without facing any of its real dangers?\n\nGo home, $Gboy:girl;. This is no place for travelers.', '', 131476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What..?\n\nMy apologies. I... misspoke. \n\nSo you are allied with house Proudmoore, then? I imagine you\'ve come here for news of Jaina, then. There\'s no other reason you\'d come this far north.\n\nWell, you may have arrived just in time.', '', 131475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Reade the note from Taelia>', '<Give Reade the note from Taelia>', 131472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well hello dere, Hanzabu! You here to pay your debts?', '', 131471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 98409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
