('A-sailing down the coasts to Booty!', '', 131320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow high, blow low, and so sailed we!', '', 131319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be pirates! Bloodsail!', '', 131317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Oh, are you a pirate or a royal fleet?\" cried he...', '', 131316, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a wreck to windward and a lofty ship to lee...', '', 131315, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look ahead, look astern, look the weather and the lee...', '', 131314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me some time to blow the man down!', '', 131313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To me way, aye, blow the man down!', '', 131312, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I\'m from Ironforge, bound to Bronzebeard!\"', '', 131311, 6, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hailed her in dwarvish, she answered me clear...', '', 131310, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I took in all sail and cried, \"Way enough now!\"', '', 131309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She was round in the counter and bluff in the bow...', '', 131308, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pretty young lass I chanced to meet...', '', 131307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve never seen the great Akunda before? You could not have come at a better time!', '', 131306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have so much work to do before Akunda arrives! There\'s no time... no time at all!', '', 131305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Hakasi?', 'Have you seen Hakasi?', 131304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been many years since our people have summoned Akunda. I can\'t wait to once again be in his presence!', '', 131303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s excitedly devours every morsel, then belches flame!', '', 131302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I was a-walking down  Booty Bay\'s planks...', '', 131301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s noisily devours the plant.', '', 131300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a real battle!\n\nThese Horde fools think they can breach the chasm there and get through into Forward Command. What do I say to that?\n\nPHOOEY!\n\nCome, let us slay some scum together.', '', 131299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you\'re here soldier, we are barely holding on!\n\nFort Triumph is a cruical chokepoint in our efforts to assault the Gates. With the chasm to the north under constant assault from reinforcements from Orgrimmar, if we can\'t hold this position then all our convoys from Theramore will be under threat.', 131298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Master Higashi...', '', 131297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste-testing the food is not \'preparing the feast\'. I will not ask twice, Rifu.', '', 131296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I\'m already busy preparing the feast!', '', 131295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hakasi has yet to arrive with the last of the offerings. Please take our new friend with you to collect them for us.', '', 131294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Master Higashi!', '', 131293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rifu! We have a visitor I would like you to meet.', '', 131292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without them, we will be unable to summon the loa. Perhaps you can help us...', '', 131291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for the ritual is nearly upon us, but many of the necessary offerings have yet to arrive.', '', 131290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out the ancient tablets within the halls of the temple. The legend of Akunda awaits you.', '', 131289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing those creatures. I remember the days when our children used to play with them. It pains me to see what has happened since.', '', 131288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last vestiges of life in our city are succumbing to the void. The power in this crystal will release them from its grasp.', '', 131287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in Bloodsail territory now.', 'You\'re in Bloodsail territory now.', 131286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No splashing in the water!', 'No splashing in the water!', 131285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hands off the treasure, scallywag.', 'Hands off the treasure, scallywag.', 131284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodsail party\'s never gonna end!', 'The Bloodsail party\'s never gonna end!', 131283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one messes with the Bloodsail!', 'No one messes with the Bloodsail!', 131282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloodsail or no sail!', 'Bloodsail or no sail!', 131281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s put the blood in Bloodsail!', 'Let\'s put the blood in Bloodsail!', 131280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No landlubbers!', 'No landlubbers!', 131279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look familiar... Didn\'t I ransack your coastal villa once?\n\nHa, yeah! I\'m sure it was you! Your servants all ran screaming into the vineyards, right? And then we burnt the whole place to the ground?\n\nGood times.', 'You look familiar... Didn\'t I ransack your coastal villa once?\n\nHa, yeah! I\'m sure it was you! Your servants all ran screaming into the vineyards, right? And then we burnt the whole place to the ground?\n\nGood times.', 131278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 22, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 39653),
('Ya like treasure, landlubber? Too bad! It\'s all ours!', 'Ya like treasure, landlubber? Too bad! It\'s all ours!', 131277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t I seen you below deck before? Or maybe it\'s just the grog talkin...', 'Haven\'t I seen you below deck before? Or maybe it\'s just the grog talkin...', 131276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone wants to be a Bloodsail, but only a few got the guts to do what it takes.', 'Everyone wants to be a Bloodsail, but only a few got the guts to do what it takes.', 131275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowardly Crosby deserves what\'s comin\' to him.', 'Cowardly Crosby deserves what\'s comin\' to him.', 131274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya need a pig cooked for the barbecue later, just let me know. I do a perfect searing flame.', 'If ya need a pig cooked for the barbecue later, just let me know. I do a perfect searing flame.', 131273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never felt so free!', 'I\'ve never felt so free!', 131272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push me towards Booty Bay so I can shout more profanities at \'em!', 'Push me towards Booty Bay so I can shout more profanities at \'em!', 131271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this landlubber without a sea pony! Ha!', 'Look at this landlubber without a sea pony! Ha!', 131270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this make me look fearsome?', 'Does this make me look fearsome?', 131269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were all out of the red ones.', 'They were all out of the red ones.', 131268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast! Stop poking me inflatable or I be keelhaulin\' ya!', 'Avast! Stop poking me inflatable or I be keelhaulin\' ya!', 131267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where be ye ocean steed, matey?', 'Where be ye ocean steed, matey?', 131266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t judge me. Not on Pirates\' Day!', 'Don\'t judge me. Not on Pirates\' Day!', 131265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up, steed! We must reach Booty Bay by nightfall!\n\nI swear you\'re not even trying.', '', 131264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the one day all year that the Fleet Admiral lets me off the leash.\n\nThe one day that all of Azeroth fears.\n\nI\'m a wild pirate with wild pirate intentions! Booty Bay will burn... wildly!', '', 131263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaaarge!\n\n<Rear Admiral Giggleplanks waits for a few moments and then pouts.>\n\nFine, we\'ll wait until the tide pulls us in. That\'ll make it more dramatic anyways.', '', 131262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the unbridled wrath of Rear Admiral Giggleplanks! Not even the unusually large rats of Booty Bay will be spared!', '', 131261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of Booty Bay fears my arrival! It has been foretold in the ancient legends!', '', 131260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse this briny stallion to the depths! It won\'t obey my orders. Forward, beast, or I\'ll keelhaul you!', '', 131259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Rear Admiral Giggleplanks kicks frantically, but his feet don\'t reach the water.>', '', 131258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will reach Booty Bay just after nightfall. Then, under the cover of darkness, I will make them feel the full wrath of the Bloodsail!', '', 131257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to finally meet the famous $p! Me crew tell tales of your legendary sackings of Booty Bay.\n\nEveryone likes to pretend to be a Bloodsail today, but you\'re the real deal. Fly the Black with pride, matey.', '', 131256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May we always pay tribute to de great thunderlizard. May he forever watch over dis jungle.', '', 131255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. It is time to choose an egg, Novice. You will know if your hatchling accepts you when you hear its voice in your head...', 131254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Matriarch Jaz\'lith appraises you thoughtfully>', 131250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere she is. Is she not de perfect blend of ferocity and grace? Challenge her if you dare.', 131249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis monument looks like de shrines to Bwonsamdi in Zuldazar, but is much more ancient.', 131248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 101823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My direhorn and I have been together since de day he hatched. We fight as one.', 'My direhorn and I have been together since de day he hatched. We fight as one.', 131247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Becoming a beastcaller requires skill, yes, but also boundless patience. Young direhorn can be quite de troublemakers, you know!', 'Becoming a beastcaller requires skill, yes, but also boundless patience. Young direhorn can be quite de troublemakers, you know!', 131246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so it was upon dis very spot dat we built dis temple in honor of Akunda. May we never again forget de great loa.', '', 131245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When de dust settled, we climbed to de mountain\'s peak. De lifeless body of Zul\'khan lay before us, but Akunda was nowhere to be seen.', '', 131244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just when it seemed de battle would never end, de dust cleared and de earth grew still...', '', 131243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda had returned at last, and in moments de two beasts were locked in battle. De earth shook with every blow!', '', 131242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just when hope was lost, a great roar thundered through de canyon. A figure appeared upon de cliffs, blocking out de light of de moon.', '', 131241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We attacked Zul\'khan with all our might, but his power was too great! He broke free... doom was upon us.', '', 131240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lured Zul\'khan deep into de canyon and ambushed him. A great net was thrown down from above...', '', 131239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De elders of de tribes met in de heart of Vol\'Aman. Do we stand together and fight as one or do we take what we can carry with us and flee de jungle? We chose to fight!', '', 131238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul\'khan was now free to terrorize de land. He hunted and killed my people indiscriminately. These were dark times...', '', 131237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stopped paying tribute to de great thunderlizard. Eventually, Akunda disappeared from de jungle...', '', 131236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akunda protected us from de terror of Zul\'khan. But as de years passed on, my people grew complacent.', '', 131235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De devilsaur, Zul\'khan, was jealous of de loa\'s power. He lurked in de dark jungle, hunting for greed and killing for pleasure.', '', 131234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('All of de jungle creatures revered his power and majesty. All except for one, de tyrannous Zul\'khan...', '', 131233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, my people watched with awe as de great thunderlizard roamed de jungle.', '', 131232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Zan\'gaji, leader of my tribe and architect of dis temple, hereby dedicate it to de mighty Akunda.', '', 131231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been training to be a beastcaller since I was born. What have you done?', 'I have been training to be a beastcaller since I was born. What have you done?', 131230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fight!', 'Let\'s fight!', 131229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zandalar forever!', 131228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De loa are with me!', 131227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Zuldazar!', 131226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 114101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warguard Rakera was my commander. De best one dis city has ever seen.', 131224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not ask questions. I follow orders. It would be wise for you to do de same.', '', 131223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 106076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out with it, $n. I don\'t get paid to chat.', '', 131222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have a death wish? De general has eyes and ears everywhere.', 131221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 106072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you need, make it quick.', 131220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you can see, dere are still some of us who believe de same.', 131218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey you! Yes, you. Are you de one dat\'s been asking around about de general?', 131215, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 105867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De dunes are a death sentence. I will not stand by and let Rakera be swallowed by de sands!', 131214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever she uncovered was enough to earn her a trip to de desert.', 131213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She told me she was close to proving dat General Jakra\'zet is a traitor to de crown, but I haven\'t heard from her since.', 131212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk with me, but let\'s try to avoid drawing any attention.', 131211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 105876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about General Jakra\'zet?', 'What can you tell me about General Jakra\'zet?', 131210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I do for you?', 131209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sorry you two got caught up in dis, but at least you\'ll be gettin\' ta meet Bwonsamdi like you wanted! He he ho!', '', 131208, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well. Dis one\'s soul is going to be a worthy offering to Bwonsamdi!', '', 131207, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 98517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses, they found me! Hey, help me and we\'ll see about this favor you be wantin\'.', '', 131206, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms!', '', 131205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal, no!', 131204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unhand $Ghim:her;, you-', '', 131203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, mainlander!', 131202, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mace, Yorrick - fan out along the perimeter and search for -', '', 131201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think she went... down there?', 131200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t understand. The path leads this way...', '', 131199, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a dead end...', '', 131198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... is this place?!', 131197, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There appears to be a structure in the distance. That must be where Jaina was headed!', '', 131196, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beasts bar the way. Cut through them!', '', 131195, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must press deeper into the forest! Form up!', '', 131194, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks like ice magic... Jaina must have come this way!', '', 131193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse it! We\'ll have to continue without him... wait, what is that?', '', 131192, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir! I don\'t see any sign of Notley, and the trail is impossible to follow in this storm!', '', 131191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... this is not good.', '', 131190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What in the...', 131189, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, they went this way!', '', 131188, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s an ambush!', 131187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaiieeeee!', '', 131186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Notley, don\'t!', '', 131185, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... I think I see something...', '', 131184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, we should keep moving.', '', 131183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could believe they did. No, I think there\'s something much darker at work here.', '', 131182, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
