('Your death pleases the Dark Masters!', '', 130983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void welcomes you!', '', 130982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear that? The whispers demand your death!', '', 130981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... The shadow comes!', '', 130980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts reported Horde forces advancing toward Northwatch under the cover of night. We require your immediate aide!', '', 130979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers of the Alliance! Now is our time! Our assault on the Great Gates of Mulgore begins here and now. Stand close, and fight well.', 130978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone to the docks!', 130977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without the Light there is no Shadow, teacher.', 130976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you expect to embrace the Shadow with the Light shining so brightly at your side?', '', 130975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not talking about trust.', '', 130974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turalyon trusts me to make hard decisions, and I him.', 130973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, your mate of course. How does he feel about your choices?', '', 130972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you talking about?', 130971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $p. Ya here, just like G\'huun whispered. I gonna enjoy dis!', 130969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 98483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soldiers of the 7th Fleet, the time for our assault is at hand. Gather your belongings and prepare to move out.', 130967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subject vitals within normal parameters. The Speaker awaits you.', '', 130966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subject identified: ally of Speaker. Annihilation protocols suspended.', '', 130965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile mortals. Bow before the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 130963, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 82726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has Arkhaan... done?', '', 130962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan finally understands...', '', 130961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m starving over here?', '', 130947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama, feed me!!!', '', 130946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s happily head-butts you.', '', 130945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My death is not the end of me.', 130944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to play a game? You run, and I\'ll try to catch you and eat you!', '', 130943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stares at you plaintively.', '', 130940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whines hungrily.', '', 130939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whines and forcefully noses you.', '', 130938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s stomach growls loudly.', '', 130937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nuzzles you warmly.', '', 130936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya cannot defeat us all. Dazar\'alor gonna fall!', 130935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to get my wounded out. Meet us back at Raz\'lotec when ya done and we will bring an end to this siege.', '', 130934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hatching...', 'Hatching...', 130932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gut ya!', 130931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skin ya!', 130930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More blood! More blood!', 130929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ma\'da needs ya blood.', 130928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice bones.', 130927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh flesh, flowing blood.', 130926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, it gonna take me a week to regenerate all these cuts.', 'Ugh, it gonna take me a week to regenerate all these cuts.', 130925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood troll savages!', 'Blood troll savages!', 130924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Ya not be takin\' me blood today.', 'Ha! Ya not be takin\' me blood today.', 130923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They said they were going to use me blood.', 'They said they were going to use me blood.', 130922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Ya not be gettin\' me this day, ya bunch of savages.', 'Ha! Ya not be gettin\' me this day, ya bunch of savages.', 130921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were startin\' a ritual. I could feel my bones shiftin\' under my skin.', 'They were startin\' a ritual. I could feel my bones shiftin\' under my skin.', 130920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were carvin\' symbols into me arm. The savages.', 'They were carvin\' symbols into me arm. The savages.', 130919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Not gettin\' this troll today.', 'Yeah! Not gettin\' this troll today.', 130918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya! Thank ya very much.', 'Thank ya! Thank ya very much.', 130917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold ya fire. Here be our reinforcements!', '', 130915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go mon, we be on de hunt now!', 130914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come! De hatching will begin soon.', 130913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Wait. There is... a voice.', '', 130912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet, quiet! Arkhaan listens...', '', 130911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who calls to Arkhaan? Name yourself!', '', 130910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will hunt us. The shadows know we resist them. Turn back, turn back!', '', 130909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria and I will protect you.', 'Alleria and I will protect you.', 130908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 130907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Warbeast Kraal, $n.\n\nI have heard of your Horde, and I know you are here to strike a bargain with ol\' Rastakhan.\n\nWe will see if you are useful. Maybe den we will send kind words up de steps of Dazar, hm?', 130906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I find whoever did this to ya, ol\' boy...', '', 130905, 0, 49439, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood trolls be fightin\' dirty.', '', 130904, 0, 49439, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark magics. This be unnatural.', '', 130903, 0, 49439, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What they be cursin\' you with, ol\' boy?', '', 130902, 0, 49439, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, ol\' boy. Ya can beat this.', '', 130901, 0, 49439, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your formation! Bring the dead and wounded back but hold your formation.', '', 130900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch the skies! More Bloodbellies be incomin\'.', '', 130899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are Zandalari, fight like it!', '', 130898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that wounded up! Leave none to be claimed by these savages.', '', 130897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand ya ground brothahs and sistahs! We not be falling to these savages today!', '', 130896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light forgives.', '', 130893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was so dark.', '', 130892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naaru be praised. I am free.', '', 130891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows fade.', '', 130890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers are gone.', '', 130889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
