('It all makes sense...', '', 130885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I rejoin the void!', '', 130884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness takes me.', '', 130883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... will fail.', '', 130882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make the whispers end!', '', 130881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... No!', '', 130880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light, help me...', '', 130879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, just leave me alone!', '', 130878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it stop!', '', 130877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet... quiet!', '', 130876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness commands me. Heed its call!', '', 130875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that is must be undone!', '', 130874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It calls to us. Listen, listen!', '', 130873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power... I will show you!', '', 130872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great darkness knows all!', '', 130871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb! It is the only way!', '', 130870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
