('All is... forgiven...', '', 130863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our wait is over! Vengeance against the Prophet!', '', 130862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We waited! We waited but the Light never returned!', '', 130861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The torment is over... at long last.', '', 130860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light damn you, Prophet!', '', 130859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I waited... so long... for peace.', 'I waited... so long... for peace.', 130858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You left us here to die!', 'You left us here to die!', 130857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find the Army of the Light. With them fighting alongside us, the Legion will fall. We must find...', '', 130856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run... while you can.', '', 130852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eredar... reign...', '', 130851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is it... dark?', '', 130850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argus will... rise...', '', 130849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere to run.', '', 130848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... will never... escape...', '', 130847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give everyone a buff.', 'Give everyone a buff.', 130842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps you are stronger than you look. My champion will not be so easy on you. Challenge him when you are ready to begin.', 130841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not expect a novice to offer you much of a challenge. Let us see how you do against a stronger rival.', 130840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can supply you with buffs and benefits to aid the Warfront.', '', 130839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you truly prepared to take on such a commitment? It is not too late to reconsider.', 130838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace Sargeras!', '', 130837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Flee! Flee!', '', 130836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You flee to the abyss, coward!', '', 130835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer your folly!', '', 130834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be the last gift you reject!', '', 130833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras cannot be denied!', '', 130832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_Defile:20|tWith no souls in the Corporeal Realm, the Engine of Souls lashes out with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236507|h[Quietus]|h|r!', 130831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_Defile:20|tWith no souls in the Spirit Realm, Soul Queen Dejahna lashes out with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236507|h[Quietus]|h|r!', '', 130830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will soon see if the Horde heeds Velen\'s call. Those savages lack any sense of honor, but they do know how to fight.', 130826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! Her thoughts be clearin\' up. She\'s feelin\'... fear. Watch out!', '', 130825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. I need to see it for myself.', '', 130824, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 87948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will take this down to the surface. Be on your guard.', '', 130823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New Generals are being promoted!', 'New Generals are being promoted!', 130822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is still only moments ahead of us. Take the portal back here and I will figure out where the Inquisitor has gone!', '', 130821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Inquisitor Raalgar was imprisoned deep inside the Arcatraz. The Legion is already here, so be careful!', '', 130820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way to Bladefist Bay at once. The time has come to bring an end to this war.', '', 130816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way to Stormwind Harbor at once. The time has come to bring an end to this war.', '', 130815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last the vessel that will usher us to Argus is complete.', '', 130814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have Nethershards, are you willing to trade?', 'I have Nethershards, are you willing to trade?', 130810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion ship is preparing to retreat! Get off the ship immediately!', '', 130809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 130808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t care what horrors lie on Argus. If there is even a chance we find Alleria there, I am with you.', 130807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SOULSWAP.BLP:20|t Turn away from Gazerax\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:239217|h[Blinding Glare]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SOULSWAP.BLP:20|t Turn away from Gazerax\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:239217|h[Blinding Glare]|h|r!', 130806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MAGE_FIRESTARTER:20|t%s has targeted |cFFFF0000$n|r with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:238502|h[Focused Dreadflame]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_MAGE_FIRESTARTER:20|t%s has targeted |cFFFF0000$n|r with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:238502|h[Focused Dreadflame]|h|r!', 130805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attack, my pretties!', 130802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE ME', '$p, we salute you. Return to the Exodar and let us cover your escape.', 130800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE ME', 'REUSE ME', 130799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a cache key. |cFF9400D3[100 Nethershards]|r', 'I need a cache key. |cFF9400D3[100 Nethershards]|r', 130798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re determined, I give you dat. It is time to meet Matriarch Jaz\'lith. Come.', 130797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be you ready to put your hatchling\'s needs before your own? Do you have any idea how much dey eat?', 130796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De bond with our beasts begins at hatching and lasts a lifetime. Dey are family.', 'De bond with our beasts begins at hatching and lasts a lifetime. Dey are family.', 130795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Direhorn are plant-eaters, so don\'t try to feed it meat!', 130794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hatchlings are quite particular about who dey bond with. Why it chose an outlander like you is a mystery for sure!', 'Hatchlings are quite particular about who dey bond with. Why it chose an outlander like you is a mystery for sure!', 130793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_purple:20|t%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:238674|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_purple:20|t%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:238674|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', 130791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Travel to the Arcatraz.>', '<Travel to the Arcatraz.>', 130787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh. Right.', 130785, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do know Orgrimmar has another auction house, don\'t you?', 'You do know Orgrimmar has another auction house, don\'t you?', 130784, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe they took over the entire building just for a dance party! Where am I going to sell all these pants now?', 130783, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is our city, orcs. Let\'s show them our pride!', 130780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise up, sister and brother orcs! Let\'s see your moves!', 130779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on up, pandaren!', 130778, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love watching those pandaren throw their weight around. Time to dance!', 130777, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood elves! Your turn to dance.', 130776, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feast your eyes on the beautiful moves of the blood elves!', 130775, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me see those goblin moves!', 130774, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get those goblins up on the stage so everyone can see them!', 130773, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on up, tauren! Show us how they do it in Mulgore.', 130772, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your feet! It\'s tauren dance time, and those hooves can hurt.', 130771, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for a troll dance!  Shoes can\'t hold these feet!', 130770, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on up, trolls! Show everyone else how it\'s done!', 130769, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time for the Forsaken to dance. Their moves will take your breath away.', 130768, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get the Forsaken up here on the stage!', 130767, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your relics cannot save you now!', 'Your relics cannot save you now!', 130743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cathedral is ours!', 'The cathedral is ours!', 130742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn!', 'You will burn!', 130741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fall to the Legion!', 'You will fall to the Legion!', 130740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aegis will be ours!', 'The Aegis will be ours!', 130739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, Hir\'eek, de bat loa... he must be somewhere in Nazmir. Dat cunning loa will know how to stop dis.', 130732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel his power... he is close. Closer than all de other loa.', 130731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bwonsamdi... de loa of death. A powerful loa, but crafty and dangerous... always making deals.', 130730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De frog loa, Krag\'wa... he is in Nazmir! Krag\'wa is a strong loa who will not tolerate de evil of de blood trolls.', 130710, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So we gonna make a deal with da loa of death, da turtle loa, da bat loa, and da frog loa... all ta stop da blood trolls.', '', 130707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 105511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need more power to stop de blood trolls. Dere is but one option: de loa of Nazmir.', 130705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They smashed Thrashbite!? Run!!!', '', 130703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you, though? With your... attachments?', '', 130702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need to finish what I started, Locus-Walker.', 130701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have not turned away from that path. You know why I resisted.', 130700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had hoped to find at least one promising soul on this rock.', '', 130699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a little disappointment. Was I really your best student?', 130698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How industriously they work. A pity they will be overtaken.', '', 130697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Glares at you... suggestively.>', 130692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such impatience. I believe you will find the answers you seek on the other side.', '', 130691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Explain yourself first.', 130690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have something I want to show you, but we mustn\'t be seen. Follow.', '', 130689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way.', 130688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Completing Construction', 'Completing Construction', 130668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden hounded my people across the stars, and now does the bidding of his dark master in the depths of the Tomb.\n\nWe will make him pay for his crimes. At long last, the Deceiver will fall!', '', 130667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wardens hold the Cathedral, but it will all be for naught if Kil\'jaeden awakens his master\'s fallen avatar in the depths of the Tomb.\n\nIt seems Illidan and his followers are still needed... for now.', 130666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cathedral is ours, but the Tomb\'s depths remain in the hands of the Deceiver and his foul minions.\n\nBuild up your forces, $ct. The true battle awaits us!', '', 130665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admit I am intrigued by the vision of Aegwynn that you encountered in the Cathedral. There is so much I could learn from the mother of my mentor Medivh, even if this manifestation is but an echo of the Guardian she was.\n\nI will continue to study her writings. They may offer insights into what awaits us in the depths of the Tomb of Sargeras.', '', 130664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger. I almost met my final death! Please, take these items from my grave as your reward.', '', 130663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arator! He\'s here!', 130662, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 86139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the ship from Azeroth arrived, I sensed his presence. I would know it anywhere, even after all the years we\'ve spent apart.', '', 130661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you please send me to the Wailing Caverns?', 'Would you please send me to the Wailing Caverns?', 130660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You feel like Manapoof is silently judging you.>', '<You feel like Manapoof is silently judging you.>', 130659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sentinax has finished recharging.', 'The Sentinax has finished recharging.', 130655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sentinax recalls its portals and begins recharging.', 'The Sentinax recalls its portals and begins recharging.', 130654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, see something you like?', 130647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $ct. I have been appointed to distribute these items of interest to your armies and yourself.', '', 130646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I interest you in a beverage or two?', '', 130645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I realize this isn\'t much of an inn, but it\'s what we have.', 130644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In times of war, supplies are short.', '', 130643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never trust the Betrayer or his Illidari lackeys, but I am willing to set aside my misgivings for the sake of the greater good.\n\nBut once the Legion falls, what use will we have for those tainted by its corruption?', 130642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In times such as these, our beliefs are tested. We may be tempted to surrender to an evil that can seem overwhelming... and unstoppable.\n\nBut we must not lose faith in the Light. It will guide us to victory.', '', 130641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rockin\' and rollin\' beauties! You\'re in the right place to melt your face! Allow me to humbly introduce... Blight Booooar!', '', 130640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan has been vanquished, but his master Kil\'jaeden poses an even greater threat.\n\nThe Deceiver will stop at nothing to destroy our world. We must make any sacrifice necessary to end his reign.', '', 130639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait!', 130637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here to find out. Follow, if you can.', '', 130636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are your people doing here?', 130635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you\'ve met the viceroy.', '', 130634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blight Boar is playing their underground show on the east side of the island! Your headliner Blight Boar goes on in ten minutes!', '', 130633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re interested in gettin\' down, the Blight Boar concert starts in twenty!', '', 130632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or you could come see a GOOD band! The Blight Boar concert will begin in thirty minutes!', '', 130631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go. I am right behind you.', 130630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whispers... too... loud! Aaargghhh!', '', 130629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show us, please... please...', '', 130628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me satisfy your curiosity.', '', 130627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The assortment of valuable things that you adventurers leave behind in your wake is simply astonishing.\n\nAnd profitable.', '', 130626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talanji talks about wrangling limited support from contacts in Zuldazar while the player seeks the aid of forgotten loa.', 130625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is still here. He crossed over into the Void. We may still be able to save him if we hurry.', 130624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is not Isolon calling to you! Wait!', 130623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan remembers. Isolon calls to us! Isolon will look to the stars again!', '', 130622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They want Arkhaan. He promised to save them.', '', 130621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are these things coming from?', 130620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least their suffering is over.', 130619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We still hear their prayers. Rest, brothers. Rest.', '', 130618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkhaan forgets.', '', 130617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is it you do not share their fate?', 130616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people. Once.', '', 130615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
