('', 'I must confess, Arkhaan, that does not put me at ease.', 130611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stop the whispers. Pointy-ears should know.', '', 130610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps with some idea of what you hope to achieve...', 130609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could you elaborate? Even a little?', 130608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 87514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. Arkhaan has a plan.', '', 130607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
