('Baby, baby, baby! This is the illest, realest, deadest band you\'ve ever seen! They will melt your face, figuratively and literally! Before I met these guys, I was alive and had all my skin! Now I\'m dead and filthy rich!\n\nCatch Blight Boar here, every hour on the half hour!', '', 130589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
