('Know you are not alone. Our salvation is out there, somewhere.', '', 130580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look to the heavens above. See the million points of brilliance in the great dark beyond.', '', 130579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 87607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
