('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Magical Modelling!', 130460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Zen.', 130459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Faction Pride!', 130458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Dark and Deadly!', 130457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Spook-tacular!', 130456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Mismatched Mayhem!', 130455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Fun and Flirty!', 130454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Ready for Battle!', 130453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Winter Wear!', 130452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal! You better not forget!', '', 130450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry little bro, if we get through this then when you\'re older I\'ll teach you how to swing a knife like dad taught me. Deal?', '', 130449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But mom, you\'re letting Mycah fight!', '', 130448, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oro Junior, stay back there! Your father would be heartbroken if anything were to happen to you.', 130447, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, let me fight too!', '', 130446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I\'m dead, who will take care of my family?', 'If I\'m dead, who will take care of my family?', 130445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t be dead... someone please help me...', 'I can\'t be dead... someone please help me...', 130444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... make the nightmare stop!', 'Please... make the nightmare stop!', 130443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? I can\'t remember where I am...', 'Where am I? I can\'t remember where I am...', 130442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to die...', 'I don\'t want to die...', 130441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to me? Where is my body?', 'What happened to me? Where is my body?', 130440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s all for today. See you next time!', 130439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everybody else, keep trying. You\'ll be a champion soon.', 130438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And finally, our grand transmog champion of the evening. Let\'s hear it for $n!', 130437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In second place, we have... $n! You looked fabulous up there!', '', 130436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our third place finisher is... $n! Congratulations, $n!', 130435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And on the right, the inimitable $n!', '', 130434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for this kindness. I will never forget you...', 'Thank you for this kindness. I will never forget you...', 130433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to serve Stormwind... to serve my king!', 'It was an honor to serve Stormwind... to serve my king!', 130432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To your left, the fabulous $n!', 130431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see it... I can see the Light... thank you.', 'I can see it... I can see the Light... thank you.', 130430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to serve my king...', 'It was an honor to serve my king...', 130429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, this nightmare is at an end...', 'At last, this nightmare is at an end...', 130428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I will never forget this kindness...', 'Thank you. I will never forget this kindness...', 130427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... never forget us. Never forget our sacrifice...', 'Please... never forget us. Never forget our sacrifice...', 130426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion closes in on Azeroth. We must all do our part!', 130425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_INFERNO.BLP:20|t%s has targeted you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:238430|h[Bursting Dreadflame]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_INFERNO:20|t%s has targeted you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:238430|h[Bursting Dreadflame]|h|r!', 130424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready!', 'I\'m ready!', 130423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, the Felskorn alchemists in this area have been getting more aggressive of late. They recently stole a shipment of our brew. Worse, it appears that they have modified it to enhance themselves and are now spewing it from their spreaders!\n\nThey need to be stopped, but it will not be easy without help. Fortunately the Monkey King loaned us his vaulting staff. Use it to jump over their heads and rain death from above!\n\nWill you help?', 130422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The competition starts in two minutes. Good luck, good-looking!', '', 130421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve also provided barber chairs, in case you need to touch up your hairdo.', 130420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the next few moments to prepare your costume.', 130419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, I do love a good pair of shorts.', '', 130418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The theme of today\'s competition is... Summer Styles!', 130417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you brought your wardrobe with you, because today\'s competition looks FIERCE!', '', 130416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, High Inquisitor! The enemy is upon us!', 130415, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 86790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Trial of Style: Azeroth\'s finest fashion destination!', 130414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We strike this beast down together.', '', 130413, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvel at its glory! You cannot hide from the inevitable!', 'Marvel at its glory! You cannot hide from the inevitable!', 130412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open your eyes, $n! Only lies await you inside. The truth is in the skies!', 'Open your eyes, $n! Only lies await you inside. The truth is in the skies!', 130411, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place offers only empty promises! Wealth cannot save you!', 'This place offers only empty promises! Wealth cannot save you!', 130410, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Possessions are meaningless! Look to the sky! The end is upon us!', 'Possessions are meaningless! Look to the sky! The end is upon us!', 130409, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Material goods cannot save you, $n!', 'Material goods cannot save you, $n!', 130408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great truth reveals itself!', 'A great truth reveals itself!', 130406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look to the skies! A great destiny is revealed before us!', 'Look to the skies! A great destiny is revealed before us!', 130405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open your arms and embrace what lies before you!', 'Open your arms and embrace what lies before you!', 130404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last the time has come! The final journey is upon us!', 'At last the time has come! The final journey is upon us!', 130403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve dreamt of this moment for so long, but not once did I imagine it being so... beautiful.', 'I\'ve dreamt of this moment for so long, but not once did I imagine it being so... beautiful.', 130402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you risen any interesting creatures recently?', 'Have you risen any interesting creatures recently?', 130401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasure Master Iks\'reeged makes a rude gesture at you.', '', 130400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Artifact_PoweroftheDarkSide.blp:20|t The Fallen Avatar summons forth |cFFFF0404|Hspell:242017|h[Black Winds]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\INV_Artifact_PoweroftheDarkSide.blp:20|t The Fallen Avatar summons forth |cFFFF0404|Hspell:242017|h[Black Winds]|h|r!', 130399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_FELRAINOFFIRE:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:240910|h[Armageddon]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_FELRAINOFFIRE:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:240910|h[Armageddon]|h|r!', 130398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Socererking_arcanemines:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235059|h[Rupturing Singularity]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Socererking_arcanemines:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235059|h[Rupturing Singularity]|h|r!', 130397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tracked down any rare finds?', 'Have you tracked down any rare finds?', 130396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing right now.', 'Nothing right now.', 130395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any rare demonic trinkets in that sack?', 'Do you have any rare demonic trinkets in that sack?', 130394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find your way into the Light, my friend. The time has come for you to rest.', 'Find your way into the Light, my friend. The time has come for you to rest.', 130393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I can\'t be dead! I have a family... I can\'t leave them behind! How will they survive without me?', 'No, I can\'t be dead! I have a family... I can\'t leave them behind! How will they survive without me?', 130392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? I was fighting on the Broken Shore... can you hear me? By the gods... am I... dead?', 'Where am I? I was fighitng on the Broken Shore... can you hear me? By the gods... am I... dead?', 130391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t find my body. I was trapped inside the soul engine and now... where is it? What happened to me?!', 'I... I can\'t find my body. I was trapped inside the soul engine and now... where is it? What happened to me?!', 130390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You give wise counsel, Rokhan. But now is de time for action, not delay. Dese blood trolls must be stopped.', 130383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 101780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
