('Now, most importantly: we must decide what type of armor you want to craft. Choose carefully - your commendation only earns you one lesson.', '', 130341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the rest of you, let\'s back to the academy. Clearly you all need a few hundred years of further instruction.', '', 130338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmm... I do love a good scribe. Be sure to stay... in touch.', 130337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 17, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deserve a reward! Here, I hope this will be of use to you.', '', 130336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
