('Do you have something for sale?', 'Do you have something for sale?', 130333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo, a scribe? I do love it when someone writes down my little... dominations. I might know a little secret. A dark secret.\n\nDo you kiss and tell? Because I do.', 130332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom is mine! Your suffering for this insult will be legendary, elf!', '', 130331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Just winks a lot.>', 130319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo... I am so cold. Would you be a dear and set yourself on fire for me?', 130316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, what delicious morals you have.', 130314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you are cute, but I am already under contract.', 130312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmmmm....? Hmmmm.', 130311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, I do know where that is. Before Karazhan fell, Khadgar and I had done a bit of research on it back in my sanctum, where it still resides. I\'m afraid we didn\'t have time to learn very much about it.$b$bNormally, it would be trivial to travel to my sanctum, but I\'m afraid the demons in this cellar stand between us and the portal to it.$b$bFight your way through the cellar and you\'ll find the portal to at the far end. The tri-disc should still be there.', '', 130292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to inquire about the Tri-Disc of Fire.', 'I\'m here to inquire about the Tri-Disc of Fire.', 130281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, take this as your reward.', 'Please, take this as your reward.', 130257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
