('', 'Thank you so much! Please, have this chest from the cache. You\'ve earned it!', 130243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! Their trying to get at my supplies!', 130242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xoroth wil not be... defeated...', '', 130241, 0, 22210, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadsteeds are mine, warlock... Mine!', '', 130240, 0, 18181, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you, insect!', '', 130239, 0, 22210, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your transgressions, warlock!', '', 130238, 0, 18181, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No doubt you\'ve already been fighting back the monstrosities that invade our forest. But if we could extract the more... viscous... corruption from the water itself, that would be a great victory as well! I suggest trying a fishing pole.', 130237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<She reaches out and takes the globules while keeping her head turned away in disgust.>\n\nThank you. I will enjoy destroying this.', 130236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The corruption chokes our waters and kills the natural life that once thrived there. We must fight back!', 130235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! First and foremost, the koi in are starting to overcrowd. Maybe if you caught some of the minnows, I could release them into the rivers?\n\nBe careful of Magicus, the guardian of the aquarium.', 130234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Splendid! Here, just put them in my enchanted globe of water, and I\'ll see to the rest.\n\n<Sha\'leth appears to be distracted watching the tiny fish.>', 130233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before I was exiled, I was the aquarium keeper in the city. The life that exists in the tank is still my responsibility and I won\'t abandon them!', 130232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The raven looks at some shiny pebbles near its feet, and then looks at water. You get the distinct feeling that you could retrieve them with a fishing pole.', '', 130231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corbyn caws with delight.', '', 130230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The raven looks at you and tilts its head to the side.', '', 130229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am collecting the hundreds, maybe thousands, of pieces from the shattered totem. You might have some luck finding them with a fishing pole.', '', 130228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Akule studies the fragments carefully.>\n\nYes, these are indeed part of the original totem. You have my thanks, $c.', '', 130227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A ritual totem was lost in these waters many years ago when a lightning bolt shattered it. I seek to rebuild it so I may  honor my ancestors.', '', 130226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
