('Bandu thoribas!', 'Bandu thoribas!', 130040, 2, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By fang and claw, I\'ll stop them!', 'By fang and claw, I\'ll stop them!', 130039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons will never get past us! For the wilds!', 'The demons will never get past us! For the wilds!', 130038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion comes! We must protect our homes!', 'The Legion comes! We must protect our homes!', 130037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark an enemy, and I will strike it down!', '', 130036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your crusade is ended!', '', 130035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Facility lockdown confirmed. Engaging threat.', '', 130034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This battle shall be your last!', '', 130033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak quickly an\' be gone, $r. The Amani no be forgettin\' that it was your Horde that maimed and murdered our beloved Zul\'jin. \n\nAs a courtesy to the Zandalari, I be givin\' ya \'dis one warnin\': you be on Amani ground in this embassy. Stay, and we gonna bury you here.', '', 130032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take ya\' blessin\' and away with you. The Amani got no place for ya Horde.', '', 130031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold, mon. I tink ya not be understandin\' what ya in for. Defeat each of our disciples behind me, an\' ya be walkin\' away wit\' our blessin\'.', '', 130030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you alright, Turalyon?', 130029, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 86138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s Chosen, salute!', '', 130028, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 88049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have made a habit of saving you from the grasp of demons.', 130027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Left!', 130026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 86137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOT USED', '', 130025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth\'s greatest champions await your arrival at Krasus\' Landing when you are ready.', '', 130024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. If we are to die in the Nether, we will take the Deceiver with us!', '', 130023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. It is the only way. Go, champions! We have precious little time to save Velen and return before the portal closes.', '', 130022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to seize our fate. We must use the portal and follow the Deceiver into the abyss. It is the only way!', '', 130021, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 83574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sealing the portal buys us nothing, archmage. Whether it takes a few years or millennia, the Legion will return. Over and over again, until too few of us remain to fight them.', '', 130020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen! Stop!', '', 130019, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No more running! No more hiding! I must finish this!', '', 130018, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s nocks her arrows with blinding speed.', 130017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_BossFelMagnaron_HandEmpowered.blp:20|t You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235271|h[Infusion]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_BossFelMagnaron_HandEmpowered.blp:20|t Maiden of Vigilance begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235271|h[Infusion]|h|r!', 130016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_INCINERATE.BLP:20|t You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:240209|h[Unstable Soul]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_INCINERATE.BLP:20|t You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235117|h[Unstable Soul]|h|r!', 130015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This day will be your last, demon!', '', 130014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light give me strength!', '', 130013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Kil\'jaeden.', 'I want to teleport to Kil\'jaeden.', 130012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to the Fallen Avatar.', 'I want to teleport to the Fallen Avatar.', 130011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Maiden of Vigilance.', 'I want to teleport to Maiden of Vigilance.', 130010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Demonic Inquisition.', 'I want to teleport to Demonic Inquisition.', 130009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to The Desolate Host.', 'I want to teleport to The Desolate Host.', 130008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Sisters of the Moon.', 'I want to teleport to Sisters of the Moon.', 130007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Mistress Sassz\'ine.', 'I want to teleport to Mistress Sassz\'ine.', 130006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Harjatan.', 'I want to teleport to Harjatan the Bludger.', 130005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello, we\'re not done setting up yet.\n\nIf you\'re looking for something a bit more dead and metal than E.T.C., you\'re going to want to check this out.\n\nWould you mind spreading the word for us? It\'s a concert you\'re not going to want to miss!', '', 130004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '.', 130003, 0, 0, 669, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people... your worlds... always crumble.', '', 130002, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 86127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria! Perfect timing, as always.', '', 130001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune aids those who seek to defend the land from the Burning Legion. Step within the moonlight, hero, and obtain her blessing.', 130000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOT USED', '', 129999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Jaina Proudmoore. I have come for an audience with Lord Admiral Katherine Proudmoore... my mother.', 129998, 0, 0, 669, 94, 0, 0, 112100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for our power!', '', 129997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Tomb of Sargeras (Raid).', 'I want to go to the Tomb of Sargeras (Raid).', 129996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Cathedral of Eternal Night (Dungeon).', 'I want to go to the Cathedral of Eternal Night (Dungeon).', 129995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not relent! We end this beast here and now!', '', 129994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope this works.', 129993, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 112099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve fought your kind for a thousand years, demon. You brag and bluster, then you die!', '', 129992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh is weak! Your bones brittle!', '', 129991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that ALL you have to offer? How pathetic...', '', 129990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna know the key to beating the Legion?\n\nBuildings, mate.\n\nBuildings and more buildings. Crikey!', '', 129989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fight by your side.', 'I am ready to fight by your side.', 129988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need not be sticking around here longer than necessary.', '', 129987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your weapon.', '', 129985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 86120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will BURN!', '', 129984, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 86119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! No! Gahz\'ragon! Ya heartless Horde filth! Here, take ya blessin\' an\' be gone.', '', 129983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, the Argus Expedition calls upon you to join our assault on the Legion home world of Argus.', '', 129982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much has changed in your absence, highness. Rakera proved too weak for her station, so I saw that she was properly exiled to Vol\'dun.', '', 129980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jakra\'zet. Where is Warguard Rakera?', 129979, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is far enough, Horde scum.', '', 129978, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last time I laid eyes upon this place, I could think of nothing but escape. Talgath, my most trusted advisor, had betrayed me.', '', 129977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She fell behind. I can feel her presence even now... but her song is bitter, distorted.', '', 129976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can still hear the naaru\'s song of war. There was one who held the way open for us.', '', 129975, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 87911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits... of all those who died that day.', '', 129974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... something stirs.', '', 129973, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 87909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A beacon of progress... that drew the malevolence of the universe to our very gates.', '', 129972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mac\'Aree was once the pinnacle of eredar civilization.', '', 129971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 87907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Velen stares straight ahead. He doesn\'t seem to notice you have arrived.>', '', 129970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Loading screen -> IGC - Ship on open water, Jaina\'s nightmare, arrival at Boralus gates.]', '[Loading screen -> IGC - Ship on open water, Jaina\'s nightmare, arrival at Boralus gates.]', 129969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya want our challenge? Ya be earnin\' it. Bang da gong over dere, and ya be gettin\' a face full of our challenge.', '', 129968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Issue the Challenge>', '<Issue the Challenge>', 129967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well \'ello der, $r. Your people be causin\' I an\' mine a lot of pain in the past. What you want?', '', 129966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance won\'t stand for this!', 'The Alliance won\'t stand for this!', 129965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our King will hear of this!', 'Our King will hear of this!', 129964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win this round.', 'You win this round.', 129963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t get to keep this ground.', 'You won\'t get to keep this ground.', 129962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be back!', 'We\'ll be back!', 129961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve not heard the last of us, $p!', 'You\'ve not heard the last of us, $p!', 129960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy $c!', 'Filthy $c!', 129959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', 'Die!', 129958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I been hearin\' of ya, $p! Killing ya gonna make me a hero.', 'I been hearin\' of ya, $p! Killing ya gonna make me a hero.', 129957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not gonna leave here while ya still be breathin\'.', 'I not gonna leave here while ya still be breathin\'.', 129956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari can\'t be allying wit\' ya if ya be dead.', 'Da Zandalari can\'t be allying wit\' ya if ya be dead.', 129955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not gonna be rid of me so easily!', 'Ya not gonna be rid of me so easily!', 129954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde scum!', 'Horde scum!', 129953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No Horde scum gonna unite wit\' da Zandalari.', 'No Horde scum gonna unite wit\' da Zandalari.', 129952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the princess, you are banished. Leave or die.', 'By order of the princess, you are banished. Leave or die.', 129951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t touch me, Horde scum.', 'Don\'t touch me, Horde scum.', 129950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well well well, a member of the Horde here in Zuldazar, very interesting.', 'Well well well, a member of the Horde here in Zuldazar, very interesting.', 129949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you after this thing too? Because I saw it first and I am buying it so back off.', 'Are you after this thing too? Because I saw it first and I am buying it so back off.', 129948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? I am busy.', 'What do you want? I am busy.', 129947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, Horde scum?', 'What is it, Horde scum?', 129946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must prepare my ship. Champion, meet me in the harbor when you are ready to depart.', 129944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 112107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look outsider, I got one rule: you want to fight, take it outside.\n\nDo that, an\' ya can sleep here.\n\nOh, and don\' be turnin\' me in if you see anythin\' shady.', '', 129940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ability_fixated_state_red.blp:20|t A Razorjaw Gladiator is fixated on you!', '', 129936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistress Sassz\'ine called in a Darkscale Taskmaster!', '', 129935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved our forces from a terrible fate. The Light thanks you, hero.', '', 129934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, the Legion holds our forces captive, torturing them nigh to death. Rescue them... before their Light fades!', '', 129933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to give you all my golden minnows.', 'I want to give you all my golden minnows.', 129932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When at last our final assault on Argus began, we knew we might not survive it. And when the Xenedar was hit, it seemed all hope was lost.', '', 129931, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were committed to our cause. Either we would end the Legion\'s crusade... or they would end ours.', '', 129930, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For millennia, the Army of the Light has waged war upon the Burning Legion. Battles. Skirmishes. Sabotage.', '', 129929, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello pretty bird. Do you want all these shiny things?', 'Hello pretty bird. Do you want all these shiny things?', 129928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I found some of this disgusting globby stuff you wanted.', 'Looks like I found some of this disgusting globby stuff you wanted.', 129927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! With the kraken threat neutralized, we can focus our efforts on defeating the Burning Legion.', '', 129926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have found many of your totem fragments. Please take them.', 'I have found many of your totem fragments. Please take them.', 129925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. Take all my desecrated seaweed.', 'Fine. Take all my desecrated seaweed.', 129924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will strike you down!', 'I will strike you down!', 129923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot be stopped!', 'We cannot be stopped!', 129922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die by my blade!', 'You will die by my blade!', 129921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end is near!', 'Your end is near!', 129920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel will consume you!', 'The fel will consume you!', 129919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Legion!', 'For the Legion!', 129918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harjatan\'s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:232192|h[Commanding Roar]|h|r has drawn the attention of nearby murlocs!', '', 129917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I confess a certain fondness for murlocs. The fel variety, however... not so much.', '', 129916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel... murlocs? Is there any race the Legion won\'t corrupt? Take care of this, would you?', '', 129915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never understood how anyone could find charm in those distasteful creatures. Let us turn our attention to more pressing matters.', '', 129914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion stoops to corrupting the murlocs that call this shore home. Put an end to this befoulment!', '', 129913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your shinies, give them!', '', 129912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our pass, you go!', '', 129911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Dookya\'s pass!', '', 129910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My crag, you die!', '', 129909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic! My time is wasted here. With the power from the tomb, I will destroy all of you!', '', 129908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you prove to be as foolish as all the others on this world and seek to face me? Very well.', '', 129907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s triggers an ancient protective spell!', '%s triggers an ancient protective spell!', 129906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
