('Impale!', '', 129894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Grandmaster $p, for your assistance. Unfortunately, Ban-Lu is no longer here. I saw him heading south, but that is all I know.', '', 129893, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Claimed!', '', 129892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marked!', '', 129891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pylons can only transport a handful of troops at a time, but for now they will suffice.', '', 129890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flames!', '', 129889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must move quickly. Now that the demons know we are on the surface, the Legion will bring its full might to bear against us.', '', 129888, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should warn you that the Egg-Sploder does occasionally cause kraken eggs to hatch instead of explode. A meager price to pay for the convenience of technology, right?', '', 129887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still... I will not deprive you of this chance to fall before an ancient wonder. Let this avatar be the end of you!', '', 129886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The husk before you was once a vessel for the might of Sargeras. But this temple itself is our prize. The means by which we will reduce your world to cinders!', '', 129885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no end to your sanctimonious bluster, Velen? You claim the mantle of prophet, yet you always lacked the vision to see the inevitable destiny of our world... of all worlds.', '', 129884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No outsider may enter the Zuldazar unless I have tasted their flesh!', '', 129883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, mortal. Tell the daughter of Rastakhan that I give you my leave to enter the city.', '', 129881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to enter the city.', 'I wish to enter the city.', 129880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell of something new and tested in war. A tantalizing prey. Why do you stand before me?', '', 129879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|CFFF00000CAUTION|R This will summon a dangerous foe that will require multiple heroes to defeat. You will lose 100 Nethershards by destroying this portal.', '|CFFF00000CAUTION|R This will summon a dangerous foe that will require multiple heroes to defeat. You will lose 100 Nethershards by destroying this portal.', 129875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to clean up the sha.', 'I\'m ready to clean up the sha.', 129874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Magatha Grimtotem, of the Grimtotem tribe. I am the Elder Crone, the matriarch of my tribe.$b$bThough Baine may have exiled me from Thunder Bluff, I am the leader that the tauren need. They sit idly by in their tents, waiting for the Alliance and the Legion to effortlessly roll over them. My people and I refuse to let that happen to us. We do what we must to survive.$b$bThe Legion has attacked. The Grimtotem need me. Will you help, or will you get in the way?', 129873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve cleaned up the sha.', 'I\'ve cleaned up the sha.', 129872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overload with Nethershards [100]', 'Overload with Nethershards [100]', 129871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The portal hums with energy. Screams and other disturbing noises emanate from beyond.>', '', 129870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How goes the removal of the remaning remnants?', '', 129869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You certainly removed a great number of the remaining sha remnants, Grandmaster. We appreciate your help with that matter.', '', 129868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Grandmaster $n. It\'s nice of you to visit us. We\'re mostly focused on cleaning up the last remnants of the sha in the area.$b$bIf you could assist us with this task, perhaps we can help you with yours. What do you say?', '', 129867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the farseer of the Earthen Ring. Who are you?', 'I am the farseer of the Earthen Ring. Who are you?', 129866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re in charge here?', 129865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have recovered some of the essence you seek. Please, take all of it.', 'I have recovered some of the essence you seek. Please, take all of it.', 129864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Magatha of the Grimtotem tribe, and I will be heard!', 129863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons cannot chain us for long.', 'The demons cannot chain us for long.', 129862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must report back to camp!', 'I must report back to camp!', 129861, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
