('Climbing', 'Climbing', 129859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then that is what we will do, High Exarch.', '', 129858, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 86196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But thousands of demons stand between us and our allies. We must thin the Legion\'s ranks to have any hope of reaching the Xenedar alive.', '', 129857, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alleria\'s out there somewhere, old friend. I know it. And other survivors as well.', '', 129856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last time I saw her was on the Xenedar. She was still... under guard.', '', 129855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of Alleria? Is she...', '', 129854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 86192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
