('Sure, I\'ll give it a shot. What could possibly go wrong?', 'Sure, I\'ll give it a shot. What could possibly go wrong?', 129848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salutations, $ct! \n\nAs you may already know, this place is more than just a naval graveyard... it\'s also a massive breeding ground for kraken! I mean just look at all this incubation! It\'s spectacular... and perhaps slightly dangerous.\n\nSince you\'re here to destroy the eggs before they hatch, perhaps you\'d enjoy my newest, relatively-safe invention:\n\nI call it... the Egg-Sploder!\n\nIt almost works perfectly most of the time! What do you say?', '', 129847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you again. We will not forget your kindness!', 129846, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sisters and I owe you our lives. We don\'t have much but you\'re free to take anything you find useful from our supplies.', 129845, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
