('The Legion seeks to break our will by desecrating this once-sacred temple. Your deeds prove our spirit cannot be broken!', '', 129843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden delights in sending his underlings to defile the cathedral. Remove this foul creature from our world.', '', 129842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That inquisitor delighted in sending its victims to their deaths. Fitting, then, that you forced the fiend to meet its own fate.', '', 129841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
