('', 'Your bow is blessed, sister!', 129750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A worthy kill, sister!', 129749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My quarry falls!', 129748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The goddess is pleased, sister!', 129747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A bit slow on that kill, sister!', 129746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your hunt is ended!', 129745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are ever impetuous, Kasparian.', 129744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goddess guide your hand!', 129743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I claim first blood, sisters!', 129742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My arrows are always ready, Kasparian.', 129741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters! On your guard!', 129740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defilers! They must be purged from Elune\'s sacred temple!', 129739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Let them come! Their bodies will fuel the flames of their burning world!', '', 129734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. The demons will not soon recover from such devastation.', '', 129733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay the demons and lay waste to their fortifications!', '', 129732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Broken Shore is no place to journey alone. We must find Anduin before it\'s too late!', '', 129731, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll ready a ship at once!', '', 129730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for me to do the same. Take me to the place where my father died. I must see it for myself.', '', 129729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have lived my life sheltered by the blood of heroes like Tirion and Bolvar... heroes like my father.', '', 129728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The kings of my family have always fought shoulder-to-shield with their soldiers for the freedom of Stormwind.', '', 129727, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My great-grandfather, King Barathen, and my grandfather, King Llane, also paid the ultimate sacrifice.', '', 129726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was not the first King of Stormwind to die fighting the Burning Legion.', '', 129725, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time and time again, I have watched from afar as the heroes of Stormwind fought and died to preserve peace on Azeroth.', '', 129724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When my mother died, I was all he had left of her.', '', 129723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father sought to shield me from the war, insisting I stay behind because a Wrynn must always rule in Stormwind. But I saw the truth in his eyes... his fear of losing me.', '', 129722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is far worse than I had imagined.', '', 129721, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us press forward.', '', 129720, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is scarred and desolate, a terrible place to meet one\'s end.', '', 129719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is where our forces landed on the Broken Shore.', '', 129718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This should be enough! Now let\'s see... Kataract? Katharsis? How do you even say that?', 129717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 83155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just going to hide back here and wait for all of this to blow over.', '', 129716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found them? What a relief! I was scrambling to find a replacement gift...', '', 129715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero! I had a slight mishap while flying over this area. I dropped some special coins I was going to give to... uh, nevermind. If you happen to come across them, their return would be most appreciated!', '', 129714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to recover... Go on without me!', 'I need to recover... Go on without me!', 129713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unggh...', 'Unggh...', 129712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grevious wounds... I must recover...', 'Grevious wounds... I must recover...', 129711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has summoned a demonic lieutenant!', '%s has summoned a demonic lieutenant!', 129710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has empowered the demonic portals!', '%s has empowered the demonic portals!', 129709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has extended the duration of the demonic portals!', '%s has extended the duration of the demonic portals!', 129708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has summoned demonic portals!', '%s has summoned demonic portals!', 129707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion endures...', 129706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My children will feast on the corpses of your allies!', 129705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_egg_01:20|tA group of Incubated Eggs are |cFFFF0404|Hspell:240319|h[Hatching]|h|r!', '', 129704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S...s...spiders....', 'S...s...spiders....', 129703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... I can breathe again.', 'Finally... I can breathe again.', 129702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the poison leaving my veins. Thank you!', 'I can feel the poison leaving my veins. Thank you!', 129701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, the very land is rotting beneath our feet. Manifestations of decay proliferate at every turn. They must be eradicated!', '', 129699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear Corian... what will I do without you?', 129698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, stranger! Those imps came out of nowhere! I don\'t have much left, but you deserve a reward. Look through our supplies and take anything you need.', 129697, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so they return to the earth.', 129696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those insolent eredar still believe they can bend Azeroth\'s earth to their will? Punish them!', 129695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we continue?', 'Shall we continue?', 129694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been eons since I have laid eyes on this place. So many memories...$b$b\n<Velen\'s brows knit in pensive thought.>', '', 129693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stand together, all of us, if we are to have any chance of defeating the Legion.', '', 129692, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no wish to fight you, Hatuun. But I cannot allow your bitterness to impede our war against the Legion.', '', 129691, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end...', 'The end...', 129690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...in the darkness.', '...in the darkness.', 129689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Shaking uncontrollably.>', '<Shaking uncontrollably.>', 129688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Unintelligible.>', '<Unintelligible.>', 129687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Speaking gibberish.>', '<Speaking gibberish.>', 129686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Exarch Turalyon... we meet at last.', '', 129685, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do I tell my children?', 'What do I tell my children?', 129684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your weapons! The Prophet and his ally are not our foes.', '', 129683, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there anything we can do?', 'Is there anything we can do?', 129682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!', '', 129681, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 86511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This can\'t be end! It just can\'t!', 'This can\'t be end! It just can\'t!', 129680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We changed, just as Argus did. We endured. What choice did we have?', '', 129679, 0, 0, 397, 68, 0, 86184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That voice... Hatuun? How did you survive this hell for so long?', '', 129678, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 86183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what to do anymore!', 'I don\'t know what to do anymore!', 129677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this it? Is this what it\'s all been about? There\'s so many things I wanted to do...', 'Is this it? Is this what it\'s all been about? There\'s so many things I wanted to do...', 129676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies are darker than ever before! Is there no hope?', 'The skies are darker than ever before! Is there no hope?', 129675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You turned your back on your people, Prophet. Your world. Such betrayal should be answered with death.', '', 129673, 0, 0, 397, 68, 0, 86185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen. At long last, you return to the home you abandoned.', '', 129672, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 86182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourselves!', '', 129671, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 86181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if something attacks the city? What are we supposed to do then?', 'What if something attacks the city? What are we supposed to do then?', 129670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it mean? Is this the end?', 'What does it mean? Is this the end?', 129669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'ve got some preparin\' ta do, champion! Ye best tell Khadgar what we\'ve learned. Good luck!', '', 129668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not our final day. We stand together.', '', 129667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This hovel feels... familiar.', '', 129666, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was not a request. <Strangulate him.>', 'That was not a request. <Strangulate him.>', 129665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close. We are being watched.', '', 129664, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh don\'t worry, Farseer... we will keep an eye on the Doomstone.', 129663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! An urgent War Council is underway. Your presence is requested in Stormwind Keep.', '', 129660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 110919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s haunted by the Legion... and the Old Gods. But there be somethin\' more... a greater darkness...', '', 129659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talkin\' to a world soul ain\'t like chattin\' with a mortal. Might be why she needed someone ta become her Speaker.', '', 129658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are better off without her!', '', 129657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not trust her ramblings! I am the only true power here!', '', 129656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back later. I might have another job for you.', 129655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dream of perfect beauty... ridiculous! This world knows only pain, child.', '', 129654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I am every bit as mighty as the Tidestone, or any of these other musty relics!', '', 129653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even her echo prattles on endlessly! Do you see now what I had to deal with?', '', 129652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You called for me, Neptulon?', 'You called for me, Neptulon?', 129651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... merely a lingering echo of her power. Nothing to be concerned about, child.', '', 129650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have witnessed the destruction the Doomstone can wreak firsthand. You are a trusted warden of Azeroth, but even in your hands the power caused chaos and panic amongst your people. Imagine it in the control of someone with ill intent...$b$bWe cannot let that happen.$b$bWe discussed what to do with this artifact at length while we waited for you to awaken. We considered giving it a new home in one of the elemental planes, but each one provided its own danger.$b$bThere is no safer place for it than here, in the heart of Azeroth. It shall be kept under the protection of the Earthen Ring, never to be used again. Place it on this pedestal, where it shall never move from again.', '', 129649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She lives? No! I will never let her bind me again!', '', 129648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Farseer. Are you feeling well again?', '', 129647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deceiver! We have come to end your invasion of Azeroth. Your master\'s crusade dies here!', '', 129646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feed upon your ashes!', '', 129645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel fuels me!', '', 129644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaos will consume you!', '', 129643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Your reality is sundered!', '', 129642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somehow you survived! No matter. Look upon our wonders, you mortals, and despair! Behold the world that shall be your tomb!', '', 129641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden will draw power from those vessels!', '', 129640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your defiance is futile! My strength comes from an infinite army!', '', 129639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot resist your own nature.', '', 129638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the corruption inside you.', '', 129637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confront your own darkness!', '', 129636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Even when your own doubts and fears are made manifest, you will not yield?', '', 129635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a simple matter to show courage against my minions. Can you face the shadows within your own souls as bravely?', '', 129634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ixallon! Come forth and break them!', '', 129633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all burn!', '', 129632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A vessel for my fury!', '', 129631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Burn and die!', '', 129630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still you resist! Then let me repay your arrogance!', '', 129629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A meaningless struggle! Azeroth shall fall to the Burning Legion!', '', 129628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent mortals! Your fate was sealed the moment you stepped into the Nether!', '', 129627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall beneath my blades!', '', 129626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon filth!', '', 129625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero! Pick your target well!', '', 129624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us judge your battle prowess! Target a foe!', '', 129623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not lose faith!', '', 129622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not your time!', '', 129621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light shall restore you!', '', 129620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall, hero!', '', 129619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An inevitable fate!', '', 129618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn your gaze upon them, Felsworn!', '', 129617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incinerate these weaklings, warlocks!', '', 129616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felborne! Show them the gravity of their defiance!', '', 129615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eredar! Show Velen\'s mongrels the folly of resisting us!', '', 129614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who will save you now?', '', 129613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall before your master!', '', 129612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were fools to follow me here!', '', 129611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You will not divide us, Deceiver. I will fight by their side, and they by mine. Together, we will end your crusade!', '', 129606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now your impotent fury has drawn your allies to their doom. Watch as my infinite army slaughters them all!', '', 129605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRRAAAHHHHH!', '', 129604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Light save your son? Was it faith that shone in Rakeesh\'s eyes as they closed for the final time? Or was it hatred for the father who abandoned him?', '', 129603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lost faith in the Light. Together, we could have resisted Sargeras and saved our world!', '', 129602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was you who lacked vision! Who refused to see the truth of the Legion\'s inevitable victory!', '', 129601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hunted your own people, chasing us across the stars. Never again!', '', 129600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us mount up, Highlord and rescue our missing allies.', 'Let us mount up, Highlord and rescue our missing allies.', 129599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riding into battle with you shall be glorious, Highlord.', 'Riding into battle with you shall be glorious, Highlord.', 129598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be an honor to ride alongside you, Highlord.', 'It will be an honor to ride alongside you, Highlord.', 129597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to ride with you, Highlord!', 'Ready to ride with you, Highlord!', 129596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight by your side.', 'I will fight by your side.', 129595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
