('I am ready to search for survivors.', 'I am ready to search for survivors.', 129593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no longer the Argus I remember.', '', 129592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ask you to remain patient and calm until further information becomes available.', 'We ask you to remain patient and calm until further information becomes available.', 129591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here on your behalf. There is no need for panic. Please remember to maintain orderly conduct at all times.', 'We are here on your behalf. There is no need for panic. Please remember to maintain orderly conduct at all times.', 129590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
