('Due to the recent influx of patrons, we must remember to maintain a calm, orderly demeanor.', 'Due to the recent influx of patrons, we must remember to maintain a calm, orderly demeanor.', 129588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remain calm and maintain an orderly line. A banker will assist you as soon as a spot becomes available.', 'Please remain calm and maintain an orderly line. A banker will assist you as soon as a spot becomes available.', 129587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sure hope our stash back home is end-of-the-world proof.', 129586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'End of the world? Pfft! I\'m tryin\' to get our scratch but these guys are movin\' like snails!', 129585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s it take to get a helpin\' hand \'round here? We was hopin\' to have our stuff back home and safe before... well, y\'know.', 129584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold still! We don\'t want none of our loot spillin\' over, do we?', 129583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ain\'t ya ever seen someone protectin\' their assets before? Keep movin\'!', 129582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s it to ya?', 129581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen--we\'re sure our goods are \"safe\" here, but why take any chances?', 129580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
