('The streets are no place for children in times like these. Someone will be by shortly to watch you until we\'re certain the city is safe.', 'The streets are no place for children in times like these. Someone will be by shortly to watch you until we\'re certain the city is safe.', 129535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not your fault, children, but you really shouldn\'t be out until we\'re certain it\'s safe.', 'It\'s not your fault, children, but you really shouldn\'t be out until we\'re certain it\'s safe.', 129534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are your parents? You shouldn\'t be running around the city right now.', 'Where are your parents? You shouldn\'t be running around the city right now.', 129533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Has anyone seen their parents? They really shouldn\'t be running around right now. It\'s not safe.', 'Please! Has anyone seen their parents? They really shouldn\'t be running around right now. It\'s not safe.', 129532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council will reveal information soon enough. I\'m sure of it.', '', 129531, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should listen to our leaders, not the whispered conversations throughout the city. We will know more soon enough.', '', 129530, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder when the streets will calm down. The city\'s been abuzz ever since this whole thing began.', 129529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walking through the streets earlier I could feel my ears growing tired from all the speculation. So much uncertainty around here lately.', 129528, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should try to maintain a positive attitude. People have enough to deal with. We need to set an example for others.', 129527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have complete faith in our leaders. We should not be led astray by the idle banter throughout the city. People cope in different ways.', 129526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
