('', 'Even if captured, my Grimtotem remain ready to fight. Your Earthen Ring, however... weak.', 129519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you hear the wind, child? It screams for help, for salvation from the Legion.', 129518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consider the majesty of earth... so sturdy, protective, immutable. Yet when it but shudders, capable of such grand destruction.', 129517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The powers of water are generally restorative, the most passive and weak of elements. What did the Legion think to do with it?', 129516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demons have their fel fire, so they assume they can control Azeroth\'s as well. Oh, how wrong they are!', 129515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
