('You are fuel for the engine!', '', 129451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will reap your souls!', '', 129450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will feed upon your suffering!', '', 129449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be made one with us!', '', 129448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fury is unleashed!', '', 129447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am confident you can handle your end. Let us hope the others come through.', '', 129446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emptiness... desolation...', '', 129445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will know despair!', '', 129444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness shall claim you!', '', 129443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you feel the clutch of doom?', 129442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh, the ties that bind!', 129441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life and death... interwoven!', 129440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their torment will become your own!', 129439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let their agony wash over you!', 129438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear the screams of the forlorn!', 129437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m trying to remain positive, but I really don\'t know what to expect.', 'I\'m trying to remain positive, but I really don\'t know what to expect.', 129436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard anything new today?', 'Have you heard anything new today?', 129435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I keep coming back hoping for an update, but the answer is always the same.', 'I keep coming back hoping for an update, but the answer is always the same.', 129434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it mean? I\'ve never seen anything like this before.', 'What does it mean? I\'ve never seen anything like this before.', 129433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t heard anything I didn\'t already know, $n. How about you?', 'I haven\'t heard anything I didn\'t already know, $n. How about you?', 129432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hoping for some answers.', 'I\'m hoping for some answers.', 129431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to know what\'s happening.', 'I need to know what\'s happening.', 129430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for answers. Have you heard anything new?', 'I\'m looking for answers. Have you heard anything new?', 129429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final stage of the scenario is not yet complete. You\'ll destroy the legion ship and it will be awesome. Please send any feedback you have so far!', 'The final stage of the scenario is not yet complete. You\'ll destroy the legion ship and it will be awesome. Please send any feedback you have so far!', 129428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have come far together, $n.', '', 129427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to launch the assault.', 'I am ready to launch the assault.', 129426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re safe in here, $n. Ainderu has been adamant about watching the door ever since this all began, but I\'m not concerned.', 129425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our door is always open, $n. Hopefully the atmosphere in here is calmer than it is out there.', 129424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you again, $n. Come to chat? Looking for supplies? Perhaps just a bit of relief from... whatever\'s going on out there.', 129423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the shop! Has the Council chimed in with their findings yet, $n?', 129422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, good to see you! Any updates about what\'s been happening?', 129421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it normal to see stars?', 'Is it normal to see stars?', 129420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just want to feel like myself again.', 'I just want to feel like myself again.', 129419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all too much to handle. I\'m not sure I\'m going to make it.', 'This is all too much to handle. I\'m not sure I\'m going to make it.', 129418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say it\'s all in your head, but this... this is different. I swear!', 'They say it\'s all in your head, but this... this is different. I swear!', 129417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This has to end. I can\'t take much more of this.', 'This has to end. I can\'t take much more of this.', 129416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please. You have to help us.', 'Please. You have to help us.', 129415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel it coming on again...', 'I feel it coming on again...', 129414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t feel well.', 'I... I don\'t feel well.', 129413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n.  Did you know the Royal Pond was once home to the largest and most beautiful fish in all of Azsuna?  Royalty would often gaze into the waters and watch the graceful movements, trying to forget their heavy burdens.\n\nNow... oh, something is wrong!', 129412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen anything like this before, $n. We\'ll keep at it. Make sure to send anyone presenting similar symptoms our way.', 129411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope this calms down. People have been arriving in a panic.', 129410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pretty soon we\'ll have to send people off site for help. I just don\'t think we have the resources here to maintain any semblance of order.', 129409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you any news, $n? The symptoms continue to present, but there\'s absolutely no explanation for any of it!', 129408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re running out of space for our guests. I don\'t know how much longer we can keep this up.', 129407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know how much longer we can keep this up, $n. We\'re starting to run short on supplies.', 129406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve brought in additional help and we will get to you shortly. Please have patience.', 129405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it\'s too crowded, please step outside. We have additional stations set up and an assistant ready to help.', 129404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! They just keep coming! I\'ve never seen anything like this.', 129403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please remain calm. We\'ll assist each and every one of you, but we must ask for your patience.', 129402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will accomplish nothing but angering the elements!', 'They will accomplish nothing but angering the elements!', 129401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without their power cores they have no control!', 'Without their power cores they have no control!', 129400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bending Azeroth\'s elements to their will... the Legion has gone too far!', 'Bending Azeroth\'s elements to their will... the Legion has gone too far!', 129399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If citizens continue exhibiting these symptoms, we\'ll need to start training additional help.', 129398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here to help, $n? I haven\'t been able to diagnose it yet. Their symptoms are all over the place.', 129397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you need help reaching the entrance of the Exodar. I forget that many newcomers are not intimately familiar with these hallowed halls. There is a ramp on the upper ring of the Seat of the Naaru that will lead you up to the surface.', 'Oh, you need help reaching the entrance of the Exodar. I forget that many newcomers are not intimately familiar with these hallowed halls. There is a ramp on the upper ring of the Seat of the Naaru that will lead you up to the surface.', 129396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outside to Azuremyst Isle', 'Outside to Azuremyst Isle', 129395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shrine was corrupted by the Legion!', 'The shrine was corrupted by the Legion!', 129394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The power we wield is the burden of our enemies.\"', '\"The power we wield is the burden of our enemies.\"', 129393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The wind is swift and dauntless.\"', '\"The wind is swift and dauntless.\"', 129392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"There is truth in everything.\"', '\"There is truth in everything.\"', 129391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Fortitude can be found in the land beneath.\"', '\"Fortitude can be found in the land beneath.\"', 129390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other Continents', 'Other Continents', 129389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Stormwind or Ironforge in Eastern Kingdoms', 'Stormwind or Ironforge in Eastern Kingdoms', 129388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darnassus', 'Darnassus', 129386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish to venture to our homeland of Outland you can use the portal in the Vault of Lights to get to Hellfire Peninsula.', 'If you wish to venture to our homeland of Outland you can use the portal in the Vault of Lights to get to Hellfire Peninsula.', 129385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a portal to the Night Elf capital of Darnassus that is located in the Vault of Lights.', 'There is a portal to the Night Elf capital of Darnassus that is located in the Vault of Lights.', 129384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to Storwmind you will be traveling by sea. First go up to the surface and Azuremyst Isle. From there go down the right path to the Valaar\'s Berth. The Valaar will take you as far as Rut\'theran Village. A ship departs there for Stormwind and the rest of the Eastern Kingdoms. If you need help getting tot he surface I can give you directions to the entrance as well.', 'To get to Storwmind you will be traveling by sea. First go up to the surface and Azuremyst Isle. From there go down the right path to the Valaar\'s Berth. The Valaar will take you as far as Rut\'theran Village. A ship departs there for Stormwind and the rest of the Eastern Kingdoms. If you need help getting tot he surface I can give you directions to the entrance as well.', 129383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council asks that we remain calm until they have finished their assessment of the situation.', 'The Council asks that we remain calm until they have finished their assessment of the situation.', 129382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you see any unusual behavior, magical or otherwise, please do not hesitate to report it.', 'If you see any unusual behavior, magical or otherwise, please do not hesitate to report it.', 129381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must remain calm until the Council concludes its investigation.', 'We must remain calm until the Council concludes its investigation.', 129380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will continue to work closely with the Council until the situation is resolved.', 'We will continue to work closely with the Council until the situation is resolved.', 129379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are newer to this world but have already started making connection with the major cities of the Alliance.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'We are newer to this world but have already started making connection with the major cities of the Alliance.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council is aware of the situation. They ask that you remain calm until their assessment is complete.', 'The Council is aware of the situation. They ask that you remain calm until their assessment is complete.', 129377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remain calm. Answers will come soon.', 'Please remain calm. Answers will come soon.', 129376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need answers! We\'re not sure what to expect.', 'We need answers! We\'re not sure what to expect.', 129375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s being done about people\'s behavior? They\'re frightening the children.', 'What\'s being done about people\'s behavior? They\'re frightening the children.', 129374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should we be worried?', 'Should we be worried?', 129373, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it mean?', 'What does it mean?', 129372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have long sought exclusion from others and so do not have many connections to other lands. As part of our pact with the Horde we do offer travel to the other cities and fronts.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'We have long sought exclusion from others and so do not have many connections to other lands. As part of our pact with the Horde we do offer travel to the other cities and fronts.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any updates?', 'Do you have any updates?', 129370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re just looking for answers.', 'We\'re just looking for answers.', 129369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if something happens?', 'What if something happens?', 129368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on? What aren\'t we being told?', 'What\'s going on? What aren\'t we being told?', 129367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undercity or Orgrimmar', 'Undercity or Orgrimmar', 129366, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129365, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to Undercity and on to Orgrimmar or Kalimdor, you will need to use the Teleporter located within the Sunfury Spire.', 'To get to Undercity and on to Orgrimmar or Kalimdor, you will need to use the Teleporter located within the Sunfury Spire.', 129364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Sunfury Spire.', 'There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Sunfury Spire.', 129363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other Continents', 'Other Continents', 129362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Grandmaster! The enemy has been kept at bay... for now.', '', 129361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster! We\'ve gotten word that the Felskorn are readying another attack. Please foil their plans before they have a chance to act!', '', 129360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings upon you, my friend! The monks are in your debt.', '', 129359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, we\'ve gotten word that the Felskorn are readying another attack. Please foil their plans before they have a chance to act!', '', 129358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve impressed me with your vigor, Farseer, and I trust that your faith in Thunderaan is not misplaced. I shall grant my allegiance to his.', '', 129357, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds have blown in your favor this day, Farseer. I shall reconsider my allegiance to Thunderaan.', '', 129356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems preparations are in order.', '', 129355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar will want to hear of this.', 129354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the Pillars alone cannot bring victory. Only a united army founded on strength and courage can conquer the Legion. When you and your allies are prepared for the final battle, my echo will return to aid you. The fate of Azeroth rests in your hands.', 129353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Spell_Arcane_PortalDarnassus.blp20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234676|h[Twisted Reflection]|h|r!', '', 129352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yet there is still hope. By anchoring the Pillars of Creation in the halls below, you will restore my wards and push back against the invaders. Then you must venture into the depths of the tomb and use the Eye of Aman\'Thul to eradicate the Felstorm and sever the Legion\'s link to Azeroth.', 129351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Aegwynn, Guardian of Tirisfal. I left behind this echo of my power as a safeguard in the event that the wards I put in place to protect the tomb failed. Indeed, I sense that the master of the Burning Legion now schemes to claim his prize.', 129350, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In ages past, this shield defended the young world soul against madness and corruption. Today, it serves those who fight for Azeroth.', 129349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can it be? The Guardian!', 129348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?', '', 129347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_CURSEOFMANNOROTH.BLP:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:236572|h[Annihilate]|h|r!', '', 129346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such an inelegant weapon is no substitute for a sharpened glaive, but I suppose it was effective.', 129345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our allies claim to have outfitted their ship with devastating armaments. Put their weapons to the test!', 129344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alone at last.', '', 129343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hold the skies. See to the Aegis!', '', 129342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the cold embrace of death. So liberating!', 129341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me if my glaive finds your heart, Illidan. With so many demons about, it\'s hard to distinguish you from the rest of this filth.', 129340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our death knights have unleashed an army of undead drakes to bombard this area. Care to join in on the fun?', 129339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them come. Maiev and I will hold them on the stairs below.', '', 129338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve lost. The Legion broke our lines and pushed us out of the tomb. You\'re all that stands between them and the Aegis. They are coming!', '', 129337, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 82031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Council asked me to look into these fresh scorch marks. They appear quite recent.', 129336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t get too close, $n. This area was hit recently. It\'s not safe.', 129335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous!', 129334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel corruption spreads across the beach. The Conclave is in need of your aid.', '', 129333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daumyr is waiting for you, Deathlord. Care to rain down some destruction?', 129332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These markings appear fresh. Try to stay clear until we get this sorted out, $n. Wouldn\'t want you getting hurt.', 129331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The \"historian\" part of my title requires a certain understated aura of scholarly authority. $b$bThat said, these drab robes are microfiber, moisture wicking, durable, laminated, spun-laced, tufted, antiseptic, crease resistant, shrinkage controlled bespoke robes. $b$bSo there. $b$bAlso note my skin. The moisturizing regime is vigorous.', '', 129330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should put a halt to their plans, at least for a while. Thanks for the help!', 129329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion is plotting attacks on our Ancients from this camp. Help us disrupt their plans!', 129328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will slow the spread of the fel in this dark place.', '', 129327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces have engaged the Legion on the ground floor. We must place the Aegis in the tower before our losses grow insurmountable.', 129326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel corruption spreads across the beach. Receive my gift and cleanse the land.', '', 129325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stupid demons. They\'ll never learn, will they? They can\'t beat us!', 129324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s another demon plot to attack the Ancients! Show those creeps they can\'t mess with nature!', 129323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Given your thoughts on fashion and flair, please explain the drabness of your robes.', 'Given your thoughts on fashion and flair, please explain the drabness of your robes.', 129322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing quiets the prattling of demons like finding one of their champions cold and dead. Well done!', '', 129321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erdu\'val, one of the Legion\'s most brutal warriors, boasts of his victories. Claim this braggart\'s wretched life!', '', 129320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. We will show the Legion there is nowhere they can hide from annihilation.', '', 129319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demon Dresanoth lurks among the naga. Destroy any foe who stands in your path and scour this filth from our world!', '', 129318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion bred that monster with a taste for mortal flesh. A fine kill!', '', 129317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That foul stench in the air means the Dread Stalker roams nearby. This vicious pet of the Legion must be put down if we are to reclaim the temple.', '', 129316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That greedy giant met the end he deserved. Well done!', '', 129315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gloriously executed as always, Battlelord. I expected no less of you.', '', 129314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the tomb has drawn the attention of more than just the Legion. Kelpfist, a greedy and powerful sea giant, has emerged to claim the temple\'s relics for himself. He must be stopped!', '', 129313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord! The naga and their skrog lackeys are back to their old tricks. They must be taught proper respect!', '', 129312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legends tell of Deepmaw\'s unbridled ferocity. I\'m relieved we had our own legendary heroes to stop this threat!', '', 129311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s presence has stirred an ancient hydra known as Deepmaw. Destroy this creature before its wrath is unleashed upon our world.', '', 129310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, heroes. The loss of Warlord Darjah weakens the naga\'s might within the tomb.', '', 129309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic of the Felborne is not without a certain... finesse. Such a shame they abused it. They deserved their fate.', '', 129308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHADOW_LIFEDRAIN02.BLP:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234423|h[Drain Life]|h|r!', '', 129307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The presence of the Tidestone has drawn out the fanatical followers of Queen Azshara, including the elusive Warlord Darjah. An excellent opportunity to remove this threat.', '', 129306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought! That should ensure Ryul remains in his grave.', 129305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In life, Ryul was a formidable warrior. In death, he is an abomination that has been turned against us. Put him back in his grave.', 129304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The peace earned so long ago has been returned to her. You have my thanks.', 129303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us hope this is worth it.', 'Let us hope this is worth it.', 129302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A trusted friend who lost her life defending this temple. Her rest has been defiled, and now she haunts these halls as a banshee. Release her from this torment!', 129301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lack appreciation for the gift I am giving you. The gift of a guiding philosophy is one that most go their whole lives without, $n. $b$b<sighs> Look, the point is that you will be judged throughout all time by what you wear and with my research and teaching, you will be able create legendary things that will set you apart from all others. Let us start.', '', 129300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Smashing job! Or would \"stunning\" be more appropriate?', 129299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our rogues could use a hand pulling off a mission in this cavern. These stun bombs should offer just the advantage they need!', 129298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right, Illidan. Kil\'jaeden and the Legion have defeated each of us in the past. But if we stand together, Azeroth can yet be saved. I know it!', '', 129297, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The impatience of youth. $b$bA craftsperson is only as good as his or her materials and the--let\'s face it--garbage you\'ve been using thus far is a core reason why you look more like an accountant from Stormwind than a potential legend. $b$bThink ahead--when they make paintings of you, the cut and weight of your clothing or armor will echo through history. Is that not what you\'ve always wished for?', '', 129296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden hounded my people across the stars, but we are done running. He will pay for his atrocities against our world... and my son.', '', 129295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m starting to wish I\'d chosen another profession.', 'I\'m starting to wish I\'d chosen another profession.', 129294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That explosion might\'ve been better than the last! Tethys would approve.', 129293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our spies have spotted demons infesting this cave, Shadowblade. We\'ve planted the appropriate supplies. You know what to do!', 129292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage, the Felborne in the Weeping Terrace are holding manasabers in thrall. If we free them, these magical creatures may prove useful to us!', '', 129291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold words, Khadgar, but victory requires more than courage alone. The armies of your Alliance and Horde had courage... before facing slaughter on the Broken Shore. The Deceiver will turn your fears and doubts against you.', '', 129290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will put a stop to Kil\'jaeden\'s plan, Aegwynn. This time we will not fail.', '', 129289, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elves built this temple upon a site of ancient power, a vault I believed would safeguard the husk of my fallen foe. But with his disciple\'s aid, the Dark Titan threatens to return to this world stronger than before!', 129288, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you wrapping this up soon?', 'Are you wrapping this up soon?', 129287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most useful! Did you enjoy your taste of what it is like for a demon hunter to glide through the air, hero?', 129286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevermind that! Think instead of the wasted potential of what you have made thus far! $b$bIt isn\'t all your fault, though you\'ve certainly concentrated on deeds and functionality over style. Under the HSST system, you will remedy these failings and perhaps, at last, have a chance at actually becoming a legend. $b$bThe road is hard and full of peril.', '', 129285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Pillars of Creation are in place. Return to the Cathedral and I will reveal the ancient secret this temple holds.', 129284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! Our vessel requires power cores charged with the energy of fel geysers. These tattered wings could prove useful should you find yourself aloft. Do not hesitate to deploy them!', 129283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what he was goin\' on about, but it didn\'t sound good. And he ain\'t even the first to do that this week!', '', 129282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve thought a lot about my hands.', 'You\'ve thought a lot about my hands.', 129281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hands--delicate but powerful, hardened by battle yet skilled--are the only hands that you should trust to create garments or armor worthy of a hero. $b$bMany of the legends of yore that you read of as a child were somewhat lackadaisical with spell and sword but how they dressed--oh how they dressed! This is why we speak of them still. $b$bFew know this and now you are one of them!', '', 129280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey. Come right in! Take a load off for a second, then get back out there and make sure we\'re still gonna be here tomorrow.', '', 129279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! Ah, nevermind. We thought you were one of... you know... them.', '', 129278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These tears of perfect beauty embody the dream of what our world could be. Today they purify your hearts for the battle to come.', 129277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From this stone flowed rivers and seas, the very lifeblood of Azeroth. Today it washes clean the darkness that scars our world.', 129276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My echo has guided you as far as it can, champions. In life, I shouldered too many burdens alone, and such hubris cost me dearly. Only by standing together can you overcome the darkness ahead. Fare well.', 129275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh huh.', 'Uh huh.', 129274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patented Hammerbeard System of Style and Taste is a natural philosophy of flair. Impeccably researched, finely tuned, and well tested by yours truly, the HSST philosophy will be underlying apparatus of your education. $b$bThe dangers will be many, $n, but the rewards are beyond your current capacity to understand!', '', 129273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This hammer forged ancient wonders and shaped the earth itself. Today it shatters the bonds of fate that seek to crush us all.', 129272, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are people coping out there?', '', 129271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any word on what\'s happening out there?', '', 129270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news of the skies, $n?', '', 129269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few understood my use of the naga to obtain the Eye of Sargeras, but it was a necessary tactic to secure the future of Azeroth. Let nothing stop you from doing what needs to be done!', '', 129268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard. I doubt the spirits trapped here will be friendly... or forgiving.', '', 129267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An age has passed since I last walked these halls. I did what needed to be done, though at great cost.', '', 129266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest, friend, and recover your strength. It will be needed for the trials ahead.', '', 129265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, the paths are open. Use the Pillars of Creation to bypass Aegwynn\'s wards before the Legion claims the avatar.', '', 129264, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we have no time to lose.', '', 129263, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. News of your exploits on the Broken Isles has been reaching us back home in Stormwind. You bring great honor to the Alliance.', '', 129262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can sense one of the Legion\'s masters working to reanimate the Avatar of Sargeras. Should Kil\'jaeden infuse that husk with the Dark Titan\'s power, I do not know whether any force on this world can stop it.', 129261, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many people coming and going, in and out of the shops, the bank... What\'s going on, exactly? I\'m starting to get nervous.', 129260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pastries, anyone? Nothing chases away doom and gloom like a fresh, tasty treat.', 129259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, over here! If you hear any news, please let me know at once. It takes time to pack up my goods.', 129258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do tell.', 'Do tell.', 129257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My protective wards now bar your way. Each seal can only be opened with one of the Pillars of Creation. Be warned: the demons will stop at nothing to prevent your advance.', 129256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sealed each level of this temple so that no invader could descend into its depths. I never anticipated that the Legion would find another way to breach its dark heart.', 129255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Preparation is key, $n. My goods can be yours--for a price.', 129254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have some news for you, $n, everything you\'ve learned about your profession to this point was child\'s play. There was no challenge to it, no fashion, no style, no grace! $b$bNow, I am not merely a Fashion Historian, young $r, I am also a philosopher and--I don\'t mind admitting--something of a style icon in these parts.', '', 129253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared, $n? Some of your allies are not handling the situation so well.', 129252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The echo of the Guardian Aegwynn appears, just as she did in the cathedral.', '', 129251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has brought forth some new manner of fiend. Let us test whether it bleeds like all the rest.', '', 129250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave none standing! If we fail here, Azeroth burns.', '', 129249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, bolster our ranks! We must push through!', '', 129248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The skies grow dark, $n. I hope you\'re ready.', 129247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know these times can be stressful, but don\'t be afraid to let your mind wander to a place of mystery and excitement!', '', 129246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n! We have one rule: keep your attitude positive! Don\'t let the all the commotion outside distract you.', '', 129245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing distracts a worried mind like a bit of toying around. Feel free to browse the shop!', '', 129244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come in, $n! Leave your worries at the door. The guards have assured us all is well.', 129243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.', '', 129242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh? Why would anything be wrong? Move along!', 129241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will add these to our reserves. Thanks again, Slayer!', 129240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Fel Hammer\'s power reserves run low, Slayer. The fel energy around the Tomb can replenish our power cores and you should be able to ride those geysers up there.', 129239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar or the Eastern Kingdoms', 'Orgrimmar or the Eastern Kingdoms', 129238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Located here in Mulgore we do not have many options for travel but I will help you as best I can. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'Located here in Mulgore we do not have many options for travel but I will help you as best I can. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other Continents', 'Other Continents', 129235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A portal can be found in the cave beneath Sprit Rise that will take you to the wasteland of Hellfire Peninsula in Outland.', 'A portal can be found in the cave beneath Sprit Rise that will take you to the wasteland of Hellfire Peninsula in Outland.', 129234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darnassus has a portal to Hellfire Peninsula located in the Temple of the Moon. Follow my directions to the portal up to Darnassus proper. Once there ask another sentinel if you need directions to the Temple.', 'Darnassus has a portal to Hellfire Peninsula located in the Temple of the Moon. Follow my directions to the portal up to Darnassus proper. Once there ask another sentinel if you need directions to the Temple.', 129233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nether Disruptor is ready for construction. Come donate your supplies.', 'The Nether Disruptor is ready for construction. Come donate your supplies.', 129232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nether Disruptor has been attacked!  We cant benefit from its glory any more!', 'The Nether Disruptor has been attacked!  We cant benefit from its glory any more!', 129231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nether Disruptor has been built! You can now gain access to things.', 'The Nether Disruptor has been built! You can now gain access to things.', 129230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Command Center is ready for construction. Come donate your supplies.', 'The Command Center is ready for construction. Come donate your supplies.', 129229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Command Center has been attacked!  We cant benefit from its glory any more!', 'The Command Center has been attacked!  We cant benefit from its glory any more!', 129228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Command Center has been built! You can now gain access to things.', 'The Command Center has been built! You can now gain access to things.', 129227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 'Stormwind City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 129225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other Continents', 'Other Continents', 129224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to the barren land of Hellfire Peninsula in Outlands you can take a portal located in the Temple of the Moon.', 'To get to the barren land of Hellfire Peninsula in Outlands you can take a portal located in the Temple of the Moon.', 129223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar, the ship and home of the Draenei. You will find a portal to the Exodar in the Temple of the Moon.', 'The Exodar, the ship and home of the Draenei. You will find a portal to the Exodar in the Temple of the Moon.', 129222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There ship for the Exodar departs from the western dock.', 'There ship for the Exodar departs from the western dock.', 129221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exodar', 'The Exodar', 129220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stormwind ship leaves from the southern dock just over there.', 'The Stormwind ship leaves from the southern dock just over there.', 129219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to Stormwind you must first take the portal to Rut\'theran Village located in the center of the city. Once at the base of Teldrassil, head to the southern dock to catch your ship.', 'To get to Stormwind you must first take the portal to Rut\'theran Village located in the center of the city. Once at the base of Teldrassil, head to the southern dock to catch your ship.', 129218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Living on an island we rely on the sea and our magical prowess for getting around.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'Living on an island we rely on the sea and our magical prowess for getting around.\n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shackles are in place, hero! Lure a demon into the trap to banish the fiend!', 129216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, sharpen your blades for the battles to come! The Illidari will prevail!', 129215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the Slayer to lead us, the Legion WILL fall! Let us take this moment to celebrate our victory!', 129214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82843, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems Genn and Velen are speaking about me, but I can\'t quite make out the words...', '', 129213, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must keep our voices down and act natural, lest we be heard speaking together...', '', 129212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind and other Alliance Capitals', 'Stormwind and other Alliance Capitals', 129211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howling Fjord in Northrend', 'Howling Fjord in Northrend', 129210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge is not the port town of Stormwind but we be offer\'n many a route to other continents.\n\nWhere ye be looking to travel?', 'Ironforge is not the port town of Stormwind but we be offer\'n many a route to other continents.\n\nWhere ye be looking to travel?', 129208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to fight.', 'I\'m ready to fight.', 129207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came with Magatha? I knew she would free us.', 'You came with Magatha? I knew she would free us.', 129206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, and my mace.', 'You have my thanks, and my mace.', 129205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for revenge.', 'Time for revenge.', 129204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose I should ensure the Fel Hammer is being properly repaired. See you there, Sslayer.', 129203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Howling Fjord in Northred. You be in fer a bit of a ride. Seek out Gryth Thurden the Gryphon Master to secure a flight to Menethil Harbor. The Northspear sets sail from there for Valgarde.', 'Oh, Howling Fjord in Northred. You be in fer a bit of a ride. Seek out Gryth Thurden the Gryphon Master to secure a flight to Menethil Harbor. The Northspear sets sail from there for Valgarde.', 129202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The downfall of your world has begun!', '', 129201, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape! Our reach is endless!', '', 129200, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel your hearts wrench as the grasp of Sargeras tightens around your world!', '', 129199, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak flesh and brittle bones... You are no match for the Legion!', '', 129198, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula you say. That scorched wasteland in Outland. Well, our host of mages have created a portal to git ye there in the Hall of Mysteries located in the Mystic Ward.', 'Hellfire Peninsula you say. That scorched wasteland in Outland. Well, our host of mages have created a portal to git ye there in the Hall of Mysteries located in the Mystic Ward.', 129197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world crumbles around you, mortals. We cannot be stopped!', '', 129196, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile mortals. Bow before the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 129195, 0, 48474, 396, 64, 0, 82726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Other Continents', 'Other Continents', 129194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate you...', '', 129193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh that glowy thing? I lost it.', 129192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really?! Just hand me the Shard of Binding and the spell will be broken!', '', 129191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure! How do I do that?', 129190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ever going to let me go?', '', 129189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure. Next week.', '', 129188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... Next week?', 129187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was spawned into this wretched existence eons ago within the deepest realms of the nether.', '', 129186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Iksy. When\'s your birthday? We should have a party!', 129185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being eternally suspended in a prison set by a fatuous goblin? It\'s a blast...', '', 129184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like fun floating all the time.', 129183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take that as a yes.', 129182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you come near me, I\'ll bite your hand off.', '', 129181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are demons ticklish?', 129180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 'Silvermoon City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 129179, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar in Kalimdor', 'Orgrimmar in Kalimdor', 129178, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howling Fjord in Northrend', 'Howling Fjord in Northrend', 129177, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula in Outland', 129176, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranglethorn Vale in the Eastern Kingdoms', 'Stranglethorn Vale in the Eastern Kingdoms', 129175, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic men open portal to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. Find it in their Mage Quarter.', 'Magic men open portal to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. Find it in their Mage Quarter.', 129174, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sparkly elves put in orby teleporter in ruins above Undercity. Touch it to take you to their home of Silvermoon City.', 'Sparkly elves put in orby teleporter in ruins above Undercity. Touch it to take you to their home of Silvermoon City.', 129173, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meefi take you to cold Northrend. Her balloon leaves from left tower north of the Ruins of Lordaeron. You go to Vengeance Keep in Howling Fjord to fight Vrykul.', 'Meefi take you to cold Northrend. Her balloon leaves from left tower north of the Ruins of Lordaeron. You go to Vengeance Keep in Howling Fjord to fight Vrykul.', 129172, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope.', '', 129171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t really know what they\'re for, do ya?', 129170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a secret long guarded by ancient secret keepers for secret reasons.', '', 129169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you like Nethershards so much?', 129168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is it out there, $n? With so many customers, it\'s been a challenge to fill all the orders. I hope all is well.', 129167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our patrons are quite fond of our goods. I\'m confident that if the time comes, they will not hesitate to--oh! Welcome to the shop, $n.', 129166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stick to what you know, Icks. No point in speculating. Now look alive, we have a guest.', 129165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The war has consumed all of my energy and attention. I have not had a moment to grieve.', '', 129164, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not returned to Lion\'s Rest since my father\'s memorial was moved here from the keep.', '', 129163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve fished this spot dry, but with the war and all, it\'s just too dangerous to leave the city.', '', 129162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar is the heart of the Horde, offering many forms of travel to the far reaches of Azeroth and beyond. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'Orgrimmar is the heart of the Horde, offering many forms of travel to the far reaches of Azeroth and beyond. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashran, Draenor', 'Ashran, Draenor', 129160, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula, Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula, Outland', 129159, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Areas opened up in the Cataclysm', 'Areas opened up in the Cataclysm', 129158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran above the Broken Isles', 'Dalaran above the Broken Isles', 129157, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jade Forest, Pandaria', 'Jade Forest, Pandaria', 129156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranglethorn Vale, Eastern Kingdoms', 'Stranglethorn Vale, Eastern Kingdoms', 129155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunder Bluff, Kalimdor', 'Thunder Bluff, Kalimdor', 129154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borean Tundra, Northrend', 'Borean Tundra, Northrend', 129153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undercity or Silvermoon City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 'Undercity or Silvermoon City in the Eastern Kingdoms', 129152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Honeydew Village in the Jade Forest. It is located in the middle of the Valley of Honor.', 'Our allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Honeydew Village in the Jade Forest. It is located in the middle of the Valley of Honor.', 129151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin Tor have setup a portal in the Cleft of Shadows to assist players in getting to Dalaran above the Broken Isles.', 'The Kirin Tor have setup a portal in the Cleft of Shadows to assist players in getting to Dalaran above the Broken Isles.', 129150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sheathes his weapon.', '', 129149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freeze! Ahh! How many times is this gonna happen? First the guards are checkin\' around, now you... Well, the pickin\'s are slim, but have a look.', '', 129148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hands where I can see \'em! Gah! It\'s you again. I\'ve had to chase off so many miscreants lately, I don\'t know what to think anymore.', '', 129147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mages have opened a portal just inside the Cleft of Shadows to assist players getting to the Blasted Lands and on to Draenor.', 'Our mages have opened a portal just inside the Cleft of Shadows to assist players getting to the Blasted Lands and on to Draenor.', 129146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop right there! Oh, is that you, $n? Damned looters have been in and out of here all day! Take a look around, but be quick about it.', '', 129145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Cleft of Shadow, underneath Orgrimmar.', 'There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Cleft of Shadow, underneath Orgrimmar.', 129144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait! Wait! Any updates, $n? Quite a few of us are anxiously awaiting some sort of news.', 129143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry to bother, $n, but have you any news? Guards run by every so often, but they offer little information.', 129142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, $n! Any news? I haven\'t heard much, but some folks around here are acting quite out of sorts.', 129141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet even as I walk these familiar steps, I have never felt more lost.', '', 129140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind has always been my home. I know its shops and streets as I do the back of my hand.', '', 129139, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'For Borean Tundra in Northrend you will want to take the zeppelin The Mighty Wind. Seek out Greeb Ramrocket on western zeppelin tower for when it departs for Warsong Hold.', 129138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mood on these streets darkens like the skies, yet hope can still bring light to us all.', '', 129137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Snurk Bucksquick on the western zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Ogrimmar. She is the zeppelin master for Stranglethorn Vale and will let you know more info on when the zeppelin will depart for our outpost of Grom\'gol in the southern Eastern Kingdoms.', 'Seek out Snurk Bucksquick on the western zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Ogrimmar. She is the zeppelin master for Stranglethorn Vale and will let you know more info on when the zeppelin will depart for our outpost of Grom\'gol in the southern Eastern Kingdoms.', 129136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To get to The Undercity or Silvermoon City you should seek out Frezza on the eastern zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. He will have more information on when the zeppelin departs for Brill located in the Tirisfal Glades just north of The Undercity. There is a teleporter in entranceway to The Undercity that can take you to Silvermoon City.', 'To get to The Undercity or Silvermoon City you should seek out Frezza on the eastern zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. He will have more information on when the zeppelin departs for Brill located in the Tirisfal Glades just north of The Undercity. There is a teleporter in entranceway to The Undercity that can take you to Silvermoon City.', 129135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The zeppelin to Thunder Bluff in central Kalimdor leaves from the western zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. Zeppelin master Zelli Hotnozzle will have more information for you there.', 'The zeppelin to Thunder Bluff in central Kalimdor leaves from the western zeppelin tower atop the central plateau in Orgrimmar. Zeppelin master Zelli Hotnozzle will have more information for you there.', 129134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air speaks to us in many ways, $n. What do these times say to you?', '', 129133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let the behavior of others influence your own. We must maintain our composure when faced with the unknown.', '', 129132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let the behavior of others influence your ways. We must maintain our composure when faced with the unknown.', '', 129131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember... the one who hurries to conclusions may arrive first, but may not find the destination pleasant.', '', 129130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_horn_03:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237937|h[Empowers]|h|r all of her council!', 129125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_horn_03:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237937|h[Empowers]|h|r herself and one of her allies!', 129124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_horn_03:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237937|h[Empowers]|h|r $n!', 129123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survivors! We will hold this point, you must find them before the Legion does.', '', 129122, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t be able to sustain another attack from one of those creatures. We must bolster our forces.', '', 129121, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 86221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every demon we slay here dies their final death. Do not hold back.', '', 129120, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already the vermin stir.', '', 129118, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be able to hold this line for long.', '', 129117, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 87767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far this warlock has proved to be quite useful in deciphering the magics of our enemies. \n\nHe also almost got both of us killed on several occasions but that is a danger I knew I would face when partnering with such a villain.\n\nFor all of his flaws, he has also saved my life several times. For good or ill, we will see this through to the end, together.', '', 129115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, these portals are not going to hijack themselves. I need time to do this right or you will just end up in a Legion melting pot or the gut of a Pit Lord. \n\nDo you want to teleport into the gut of a Pit Lord? Oh sure, at first it seems like a clever, unexpected attack. But then you get digested in fel juices and wonder where your great plan went.\n\nLeave me to my work.', '', 129114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of Azeroth, your class orders have grown mighty throughout our campaign on the Broken Isles. Their strength, their courage, is needed now. The time has come to unite our forces and rid Azeroth of the Burning Legion.', '', 129113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SHADOWFURYTGA.BLP:20|tOne of the runes |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237908|h[Detonates]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SHADOWFURYTGA.BLP:20|tOne of the runes |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237908|h[Detonates]|h|r!', 129112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Areas opened up in the Cataclysm', 'Areas opened up in the Cataclysm', 129111, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borean Tundra, Northrend', 'Borean Tundra, Northrend', 129110, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teldrassil or the Exodar in Kalimdor', 'Teldrassil or the Exodar in Kalimdor', 129109, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted Lands and the portal to Draenor', 'Blasted Lands and the portal to Draenor', 129108, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellfire Peninsula, Outland', 'Hellfire Peninsula, Outland', 129107, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran in the Broken Isles', 'Dalaran in the Broken Isles', 129106, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jade Forest, Pandaria', 'Jade Forest, Pandaria', 129105, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge, Eastern Kingdoms', 'Ironforge, Eastern Kingdoms', 129104, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will be your end...', '', 129103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These supplies belong to the Legion!', '', 129102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions stretch the limits of our alliance, death knight.', '', 129100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never find what you seek, death-bringer. Now, you have worn out your welcome at this temple, begone!', '', 129099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no idea what you are talking about. Now if you will excuse me, I have things to attend to. You may direct any additional questions to our steward.', '', 129098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me all you know of a great dragon that fell on a glacier to the north of Icecrown.', 'Tell me all you know of a great dragon that fell on a glacier to the north of Icecrown.', 129097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of undeath follows you into this temple of life. Do not stay overlong.', '', 129096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind is the center of the Alliance and offers many forms of travel to the far reaches of Azeroth and beyond. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 'Stormwind is the center of the Alliance and offers many forms of travel to the far reaches of Azeroth and beyond. \n\nWhere are you looking to travel?', 129095, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deeprun Tram is the fastest route to Ironforge. You will find it located in the Dwarven District.', 'The Deeprun Tram is the fastest route to Ironforge. You will find it located in the Dwarven District.', 129094, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our new allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located on the western edge of the lake next to Stormwind Keep.', 'Our new allies in Pandaria have allowed us to create a portal to Paw\'don Village in the Jade Forest. It is located on the western edge of the lake next to Stormwind Keep.', 129092, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are in luck Dalaran is currently located above the Broken Isles and the Kirin Tor have setup a portal located just inside Stormwind Keep.', 'You are in luck Dalaran is currently located above the Broken Isles and the Kirin Tor have setup a portal located just inside Stormwind Keep.', 129091, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say what you will about Arthas, but the former Lich King did have a cold efficiency when it came to dealing with the Legion.', '', 129090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Wizard\'s Sanctum located at the top of the Mage Tower.', 'There is a portal that leads to Hellfire Peninsula in Outland. It is located within the Wizard\'s Sanctum located at the top of the Mage Tower.', 129089, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mages have opened a portal just inside the Mage Tower to assist players getting to the Blasted Lands and on to Draenor. You will see the mage Sparkbright standing by next to it.', 'The mages have opened a portal just inside the Mage Tower to assist players getting to the Blasted Lands and on to Draenor. You will see the mage Sparkbright standing by next to it.', 129088, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is so nice to be away from Acherus doing some good, old fashioned field research again with fresh corpses and bone piles.', '', 129087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this is a representation of the type of necromancy that the Burning Legion relies on then we are in better shape than I ever imagined.', '', 129086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Exodar or Teldrassil located in Kalimdor, seek out the Nayura. She is the Dockmaster for The Bravery, setting sail from the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor.', 'For the Exodar or Teldrassil located in Kalimdor, seek out the Nayura. She is the Dockmaster for The Bravery, setting sail from the southernmost dock in Stormwind Harbor.', 129085, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Northrend, you are looking for Leesha Tannerby, the Dockmaster for the Kraken. It sets sail for Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra from the northern dock in Stormwind Harbor.', 'For Northrend, you are looking for Leesha Tannerby, the Dockmaster for the Kraken. It sets sail for Valiance Keep in Borean Tundra from the northern dock in Stormwind Harbor.', 129084, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies if I seem a bit on edge. Welcome to the shop.', 129083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of assistance?', 'What kind of assistance?', 129082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am certain the Council is well prepared, Kerta. Now look alive. We have another customer.', '', 129081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in! Kerta and I were just discussing recent events. I would be interested in hearing your take.', '', 129080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome. I fear our supplies have run low. We have been filling orders without much of a break since... well, you know.', '', 129079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Kerta. I do not think we have anything to worry about. Now focus. We must not keep our guest waiting.', '', 129078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, traveler! How are things out there?', '', 129077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion continues to try to recreate the masterpiece that was the Scourge. \n\nThey turn to their Nathrezim who make puppets of bones. \n\nThey turn to these fallen Spiritwalkers, who simply meddle at these magics.\n\nI am here, on behalf of the Ebon Blade, to observe and judge. And to lend assistance to you, hero, should you require it.', '', 129076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t look up then nothing\'s wrong. Carry on!', '', 129075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind your business, friend.', '', 129074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is upon us, $n! At least that\'s what they\'re saying. Might as well look the part.', '', 129073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know about you, but I for one refuse to meet my maker in a common mage\'s garb.', '', 129072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be a tool of the Legion.', '', 129071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Price is no object when it comes to going out in style. I\'m flat broke... not that it\'ll matter soon.', '', 129070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am free. Thank you.', '', 129069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what brings a $c like you around, $n? Fancy some sleek attire for the end of the world as we know it?', '', 129068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only you can end this torment, brother. Fight it!', '', 129067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n. Just the $c I was looking for. Like my new attire? Eh--who am I kidding? Won\'t matter soon anyway.', '', 129066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shrug off this corruption, my friend!', '', 129065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the rest you earned long ago, brother!', '', 129064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suggest tossing out those rags and changing into something a bit more stylish. You might as well look good as the universe ends.', '', 129063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something\'s up with my rabbits! Poor little guys... We gotta do something!', '', 129062, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 81978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That demon must be dealt with, $n! Then we can focus on Erdris.', '', 129061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, my lord. I can raise more.', '', 129060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons attack my troops before they can recover!', '', 129059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What in blazes happened to my chickens?', 129058, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and while we\'re there, naturally we can\'t forget the Cluster of Five: the Northern, Southern, Eastern, and Western Small Ice Chunks That Have Been Technically Designated As Not Glaciers, which is really a funny story...', '', 129057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a nasty knock on the head. Still, our Slayer is a strong one, my dear. Look!', 129056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Slayer remains unconscious. I fear what will happen if--', 129055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ringing the Large Northern Glacier were, in order of formation, the Medium-Sized Northeastern Glacier, the Small Southern Glacier, the Southwestern Tiny Glacier, the South-Southwestern Tiny Glacier, the South-Southeastern Tiny Glacier, the Most Southern Tiny Glacier, the First and Second Northern Tiny Glaciers That Keep Changing Positions...', '', 129054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack! Alright! There used to be... glaciers... large ones... to the north of Icecrown... they floated away years ago... I don\'t know any more, I swear! Speak to... Tariol!', '', 129053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Trizormu\'s eyes narrow.>\n\nWhat would a death-bringer like yourself want with that information, exactly?', '', 129052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello! Thank you for visiting again.\n\nOr is this your first time?\n\nWhat day is it?', '', 129051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, not that I can recall. I am terribly sorry, I am still in mourning over our dear Ysera\'s passing, I can think of little else right now. Did you ask the bronze flight? They have quite excellent memories.', '', 129050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold our Fel might!', 129049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me all you know of a glacier to the north where a powerful dragon fell.', 'Tell me all you know of a glacier to the north where a powerful dragon fell.', 129048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here goes nothing. Brace yourselves!', 129047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lethecus has a far-away look in his eyes.>\n\nOh, yes? I didn\'t see you there.\n\n<Lethecus yawns.>', '', 129046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will only take a moment!', 129045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will he? How exactly will he keep an endless army of demons from invading and killing everyone?', 129044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear has a way of playing tricks on the mind. You should get some rest, Jenny.', '', 129043, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find a way to make sense of it all. And should the time come for action, I am sure our allies will be prepared.', 'We will find a way to make sense of it all. And should the time come for action, I am sure our allies will be prepared.', 129042, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter what I do, I can\'t seem to stop looking up.', 'No matter what I do, I can\'t seem to stop looking up.', 129041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the first aid shop? The line is out the door.', 'Have you seen the first aid shop? The line is out the door.', 129040, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t possibly say you aren\'t feeling it. Look around us. This world\'s beginning to doubt itself.', 'You can\'t possibly say you aren\'t feeling it. Look around us. This world\'s beginning to doubt itself.', 129039, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long until our world crumbles?', 'How long until our world crumbles?', 129038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You destroy a few ships and claim a victory. It will be your last, I assure you. Savor this moment, for our next meeting will spell your doom!', '', 129037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another foolish mortal wishes to face me? So be it!', '', 129036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence!', '', 129035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, come forth. I could use some entertainment!', '', 129034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky grows closer every day. Is it ever going to end?', 'The sky grows closer every day. Is it ever going to end?', 129033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan, convey the Aegis of Aggramar to the cathedral. I will descend into the tomb with Khadgar and hunt the monster down. Kil\'jaeden\'s reign of destruction will soon be ended!', '', 129032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mephistroth!', '', 129031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps. But not this day, demon!', '', 129030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough bickering! Stay focused!', '', 129029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As is the Light.', '', 129028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t stop it. I\'ve tried to keep myself busy, but my mind wanders back to this feeling... this... I don\'t know what to call it anymore.', 'I... I can\'t stop it. I\'ve tried to keep myself busy, but my mind wanders back to this feeling... this... I don\'t know what to call it anymore.', 129027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are doomed to fail!', '', 129026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think a few mortals with gaudy weapons can stop us?', '', 129025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, these will help. Plant them around the ship. I will activate them from here when ready.', '', 129024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too quick to trust Illidan, Prophet. I will ensure he fulfills his duty.', 129023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan, how courteous of you to finally arrive! Wardens, see to the real work while Illidan\'s demon hunters caper about with their bats.', 129022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More portals?! Where the hell is our backup?', 129021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wardens are with you, $ct.', 129020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have won this day, but a grave threat still looms before us. The Legion\'s master has yet to play his hand.', '', 129019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warlocks took your world from you, nathrezim! I would not be so arrogant if I were you.', '', 129018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. We have our orders. Good luck.', '', 129016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But how did it get there? It couldn\'t just appear out of nowhere.', 'But how did it get there? It couldn\'t just appear out of nowhere.', 129015, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there you are, $ct. I was worried I might have activated the bombs a tad prematurely.', '', 129014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready, $ct. I\'m pulling you out and detonating the bombs!', '', 129013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their command ship remains. We must destroy it before Dalaran\'s defenses fail! The Council of the Black Harvest has set up a gate for us. You may do the honors, $n.', '', 129012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the forces of Dread Commander Arganoth lie to the northeast. We must close the portals before our allies are overrun.', '', 129011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you were doomed to fail, Lord Kalgorath.', '', 129010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archers! Rain hell upon them!', '', 129009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see them? The ones wandering, carrying on conversations with themselves?', 'Did you see them? The ones wandering, carrying on conversations with themselves?', 129008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! That\'s one ship down.', '', 129007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head up the hill to the west with the other forces. An eredar and his underlings guard the point. You know what to do.', '', 129006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! They thought they were ready for us, but they\'ve never seen the forces of Azeroth work with such unity!', '', 129005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must take the beach before we can claim the ruins to the west.', '', 129004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will not win this day! We will show them what it means to stand together. For Azeroth!', '', 129003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must take the ruins on the western side of the island. From there we can funnel all of our forces toward the central ship above the soul engine.', '', 129002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you spearheading our forces while I deal with these ships!', '', 129001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, our assault on the southern beach is being met with heavy resistance.', '', 129000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, $ct, we need you on the front lines!', '', 128999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. You don\'t think... That\'s not possible!', 'No. You don\'t think... That\'s not possible!', 128998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will divide our forces to hit them from all sides at once.', '', 128997, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what it means.', 'I wonder what it means.', 128996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $ct. Let\'s get this assault under way, shall we?', '', 128995, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 83070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hesitant to answer further questions about what\'s going on. I\'m starting to lack confidence in my responses.', 'I\'m hesitant to answer further questions about what\'s going on. I\'m starting to lack confidence in my responses.', 128994, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? Who are you?', 'Where am I? Who are you?', 128993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened to me?', 'What... what happened to me?', 128992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water... don\'t let the others drink the water!', 'The water... don\'t let the others drink the water!', 128991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried to stop but couldn\'t... it was like I was a puppet.', 'I tried to stop but couldn\'t... it was like I was a puppet.', 128990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They got into my head... into my mind!', 'They got into my head... into my mind!', 128989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I couldn\'t stop myself.', 'I... I couldn\'t stop myself.', 128988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lot of people acting strange lately... I hope there isn\'t a sickness going around.', '', 128987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking tired, have another hard day out in the fields?', '', 128986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look a bit pale. Are you feeling well?', '', 128985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sure the Council will reveal more information as it becomes available. In the meantime, remember that times like these have a way of revealing an individual\'s true character.', 'I am sure the Council will reveal more information as it becomes available. In the meantime, remember that times like these have a way of revealing an individual\'s true character.', 128984, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The moment we lose faith in the Council is the moment our threads unravel. We must band together, not harbor our fears in events that have not yet occurred.', 'The moment we lose faith in the Council is the moment our threads unravel. We must band together, not harbor our fears in events that have not yet occurred.', 128983, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please hurry, Grandmaster. The order\'s survival depends on your success!', 128982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have fought well, Farseer $p. I see Thunderaan chooses his champions wisely. I will bow to his power.', '', 128981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if this is it?', 'What if this is it?', 128980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! You need to listen to me. I\'m telling you--we need to get out of here!', 'NO! You need to listen to me. I\'m telling you--we need to get out of here!', 128979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... Grandmaster. Almai and Blanche are waiting for you down in the village. I must... rest... a bit.', '', 128978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows. The first thing I saw when I looked up was that monstrosity lingering overhead.', 'Who knows. The first thing I saw when I looked up was that monstrosity lingering overhead.', 128977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...yes, but some aren\'t sure what to expect. There is something to be said for leading by example, especially in a time like this.', '...yes, but some aren\'t sure what to expect. There is something to be said for leading by example, especially in a time like this.', 128976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I told you, I don\'t know what they were talking about. But they did look... concerned.', 'As I told you, I don\'t know what they were talking about. But they did look... concerned.', 128975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Rooksguard are newly risen, and may not have fallen fully into corruption. Perhaps they can yet be saved!', '', 128974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure what he was doing, but his behavior seemed a bit--oh. Ignore my musings. It\'s fine. Everything\'s fine!', 'I\'m not sure what he was doing, but his behavior seemed a bit--oh. Ignore my musings. It\'s fine. Everything\'s fine!', 128973, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mustn\'t let the idle mutterings upset you. It\'s times like these we must remain strong.', 'You mustn\'t let the idle mutterings upset you. It\'s times like these we must remain strong.', 128972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let fear of an uncertain future overwhelm you. We do not know what lies ahead.', 'Do not let fear of an uncertain future overwhelm you. We do not know what lies ahead.', 128971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right. We do not know what lies ahead. But if the darkness comes, we will face it together.', 'You\'re right. We do not know what lies ahead. But if the darkness comes, we will face it together.', 128970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light of Dalaran burns ever so brightly. But should the darkness gather, our allies will be ready. I\'m sure of it.', 'The light of Dalaran burns ever so brightly. But should the darkness gather, our allies will be ready. I\'m sure of it.', 128969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the unholy energy surging within you. Raise the dragon and claim it as your own.', '', 128968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have stolen the dragon\'s life energy. Now, bend it to your desires. Pervert it with your darkness.', '', 128967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense many feral undead nearby. They have been feeding on its life energy. Take it from them. Slay them all.', '', 128966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are getting close. I can sense the spark of life ahead of you. You will bring decay to this lost place.', '', 128965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, should you fail to survive, know that I shall claim Acherus for my own. Arthas may have sought revenge on the citadel, but I have... other plans.', '', 128964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is here... I can feel it. Your supplies have likely frozen. I sense feral undead buried in the ice. It seems the time has come to test your will.', '', 128963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And hold tight to your reins.', '', 128961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue north, Deathlord, into the blizzard.', '', 128960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly now into the north. Find this glacier... and your destiny.', '', 128958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are empty inside, just like me.', '', 128957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A record of their history must lurk somewhere in this sanctum. Spare who you will, or slay them all... the choice is yours.', '', 128956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has alerted his allies already. They will be expecting you.', '', 128955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reds know something. They hide their secrets in the Ruby Sanctum beneath Wyrmrest.', '', 128954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a member of the bronze flight, the tenders of history. Do not be merciful.', '', 128953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet all that remains here is the sea, and I sense no trace of undead.', '', 128952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bones of a dragon most ancient, and powerful beyond reckoning.', '', 128951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look ahead... Do you see it?', '', 128950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was here that I saw the undead swarming across an icy shelf, seeking a prize coveted by Arthas.', '', 128949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now to the far north of Icecrown, and I will show you what I have seen.', '', 128946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet when reach out through the cold tendrils of endless ice, I sense nothing there.', '', 128945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen a vision... thousands of undead marching to the far reaches of Northrend in search of a great power.', '', 128944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Helm of Domination shows me many things, Deathlord.', '', 128943, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 82970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erdris? You have been corrupted as well? It saddens me that your eternal slumber has been disturbed.', '', 128942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to all who oppose the Legion!', 'Death to all who oppose the Legion!', 128941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Legion!', 'For the Legion!', 128940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you see? The Legion has already won!', 'Don\'t you see? The Legion has already won!', 128939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no point... we\'re doomed! We\'re all doomed!', 'There\'s no point... we\'re doomed! We\'re all doomed!', 128938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape the Legion!', 'You cannot escape the Legion!', 128937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For my masters! For the Legion!', 'For my masters! For the Legion!', 128936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... tired...', '', 128935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Battlelord!', '', 128932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skyhold.', 'Skyhold.', 128931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will accompany you to Lion\'s Rest.', 'I will accompany you to Lion\'s Rest.', 128930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for prayer is over. I must know the hearts and minds of my people.', '', 128929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No luck, eh? King Greymane won\'t be happy, but I\'m sure you did your best.', '', 128928, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must know. Follow me to the keep.', '', 128927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ye done it! IT\'S CLOBBERIN\' TIME!', '', 128926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'re messin\' with the voice o\' the planet! THE PLANET!', '', 128925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me magma\'s fixin\' ta boil!', '', 128924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough o\' yer nonsense!', '', 128923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back ta work!', '', 128922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fer Azeroth!', '', 128921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight fer our world!', '', 128920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These stones have tales ta tell.', '', 128919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met!', '', 128918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I speak fer Azeroth!', '', 128917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minion! Eat this.', '', 128916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! My Summon Champion spell worked. Minion! We must do battle with another of my former masters up ahead. Get to it!', '', 128915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating! Despite the frequency with which we summon forth elementals and demons, it never occurred to me that the door might swing both ways.', '', 128914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, there is a collection of energy near our camp that seems to be specifically attuned to you. Would you investigate this disturbance?', '', 128913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Look at all this treasure!', 128912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoops! So, I guess that\'s what this thing does! Oh well.', 128911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrrg! What have you done?! Shackled to this realm forever? I cannot imagine a worse fate!', '', 128910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! How dare you! I will not bend knee to such a fatuous creature!', '', 128909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ancient Shard of Binding begins to radiate with tremendous power.', 128908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m Iks\'reeged, Treasure Master! Wait... What is that you are holding?', '', 128907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hey. Who are you?', 128906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, jerk! I think this shard you brought me is broken. I tried hitting it with a rock and everything!', 128905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no matter, in a moment I will be gone along with all of my treasure!', '', 128904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder! How did you find my lair!', '', 128903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Domatrax rips open additional Fel Portals!', 'Domatrax rips open additional Fel Portals!', 128902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, little Champion, and let us drown our enemies in the tides of justice!', '', 128901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My waters run green with taint. Perhaps a good filtering is in order.', '', 128900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall before the tide of justice!', '', 128899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stand against the flood!', '', 128898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, fel thing!', '', 128897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown on this!', '', 128896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fire is quenched!', '', 128895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Water be purged!', '', 128894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in your failure!', '', 128893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. Things were really beginning to heat up!', '', 128892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon has sent one of his greatest champions to aid our cause, and has asked for you by name. I look forward to seeing what damage the two of you can unleash.', '', 128891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The Legion... will destroy... your world...', '', 128890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will slaughter every last one of your precious Ancients!', '', 128889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glorious carnage indeed! You put those watery pests in their place.', '', 128888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero! The naga and their skrog lackeys have harassed my warriors long enough. Teach them the folly of their wicked ways!', '', 128887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage,the felbound manasabers in the Weeping Terrace must be freed! The abjurists holding them are quite powerful. A well-timed Spell Steal may come in handy!', '', 128886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A valiant battle earlier, washing away the fires of evil and drowning the aspirations of the fel.$b$bYou did well for one who is so painfully dry.', '', 128885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you back in the Dreamgrove, Archdruid. Thanks for bringing me along!', 128884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... live? Thank you friend! Thank you so much!', 'I... live? Thank you friend! Thank you so much!', 128883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks!', 'You have my thanks!', 128882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m never going to leave Nar\'thalas again!', 'I\'m never going to leave Nar\'thalas again!', 128881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero! I thought my end had come!', 'Thank you, hero! I thought my end had come!', 128880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so weak; the webs were draining away my very essence.', 'I feel so weak; the webs were draining away my very essence.', 128879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger!', 'Thank you, stranger!', 128878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t... understand...', 128877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return to the Dreamgrove. Thank you!', 'I will return to the Dreamgrove. Thank you!', 128876, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The commander must be stopped. I believe in you!', 'The commander must be stopped. I believe in you!', 128875, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Archdruid. I feared the worst.', 'Thank you, Archdruid. I feared the worst.', 128874, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I will not let that happen.', 'I will not let that happen.', 128872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal! I have been sent by the great Neptulon to bring ruin and judgment upon these fel infused fools that would invade our world.$b$bJoin me in battle, and together we shall quench the flames of their evil.', '', 128871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That commander\'s going to taste my blade!', 128867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon the heart of your world will beat no more!', '', 128866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your courage will fail.', '', 128862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain of flesh is fleeting. True torment lasts forever.', '', 128860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feeding time!', 128859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come my children and feed!', 128858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon the true face of death, and know that your end comes soon!', '', 128857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got everything I needed from this fiend before you got here. I know where their commander is!', 128854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me to the Summoning Platform where the ritual has been prepared.', '', 128845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aegis of Aggramar has been depleted!', '', 128843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Restrain the beast, and I will summon them to us...', '', 128842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep the skies clear or the conduit will never fall!', 'Keep the skies clear or the conduit will never fall!', 128841, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the tether remains intact much longer Azsuna will be lost!', 'If the tether remains intact much longer Azsuna will be lost!', 128840, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to hold the skies a little longer. We cannot afford to fail now.', 'We\'ve got to hold the skies a little longer. We cannot afford to fail now.', 128839, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The energy coming off this thing is incredible.', 'The energy coming off this thing is incredible.', 128838, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stop until the connection is severed!', 'Don\'t stop until the connection is severed!', 128837, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus your attacks. We must not allow the connection to continue!', 'Focus your attacks. We must not allow the connection to continue!', 128836, 0, 47813, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard Goldrinn! We have to find out who\'s leading these attacks now! No time to lose!', 128835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall find safety to recover. You must find out who is behind this and take them out!', '', 128834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda... stayed in... school...', '', 128833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t... think this... through...', '', 128832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t need books when I got fists!', '', 128831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HA! Who\'s the smart one now?', '', 128830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learned your lesson?', '', 128829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead doofus!', '', 128828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Books are for losers!', '', 128827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', '', 128826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mere and fight!', '', 128825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still, wimps!', '', 128824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'LL STOMP YOU!', '', 128823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must go to the Broken Shore and see for myself the sacrifice he made.', '', 128822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna run you dummies over!', '', 128821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little fools wanna outsmart the Legion? Think again!', '', 128820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my friend. I know what I must do to learn the weight of my father\'s crown.', '', 128819, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My end... was written... in the rings...', '', 128818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I... shall feed... the soil...', '', 128817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals seldom appreciate true beauty.', '', 128816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They did not show the proper respect to nature.', '', 128815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food for the worms!', '', 128814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fodder for the compost heap!', '', 128813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disturb nature\'s perfection!', '', 128812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ancient grounds are not for you!', '', 128811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My tendrils will take you!', '', 128810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A king must know the weight of the orders he gives--the price of them. If a compass breaks his spirit, how will he respond when the war arrives on our doorstep?', '', 128809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush the life from you!', '', 128808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need more than that, and so does he. Anduin wasn\'t there on the Broken Shore. He hasn\'t seen the sacrifice his soldiers made... that they continue to make.', '', 128807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This breath will be your last!', '', 128806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel your throat tighten!', '', 128805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my precious ones. The fel has brought out our true beauty.', '', 128804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is strong with Anduin. He will grow into his crown. We must have faith.', '', 128803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visions don\'t win wars, Prophet. The boy has a good heart, but he\'s untested.', '', 128802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The young king will become a great leader. I have foreseen it.', '', 128801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard the voice of the people, but how do my father\'s advisors feel? I fear they do not trust me as they did my father.', '', 128800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people like me, respect me... but they don\'t believe in me. Not like they believed in him.', '', 128799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor soul! And you think I am the cruel one...', '', 128798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since you brought my father\'s compass back to me, I\'ve prayed to the Light for guidance, and to know his spirit is at rest. The Light doesn\'t answer.', '', 128797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for that insult!', '', 128796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All my handiwork... ruined!', '', 128795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look how eagerly this soul obeys us!', '', 128794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heed, mortals! Obedient souls serve the Legion!', '', 128793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is... more pain... to come...', '', 128792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This defeat... will haunt me...', '', 128791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was their bodies that gave out! The triumph is mine!', '', 128790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal minds break so easily. It is unsatisfying.', '', 128789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s mind gave out!', '', 128788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too delicate to survive!', '', 128787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So weak a will!', '', 128786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine now!', '', 128785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t blame the lad for his choice. My father sacrificed everything to save his people. He was a great king.', '', 128784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, my dad says that too. Okay, I\'m King Varian. Look out, demons!', '', 128783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be Anduin, be Varian! He was way tougher.', 128782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for release, mortals!', '', 128781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your minds will break!', '', 128780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m King Anduin! I\'m gonna kill every demon I see!', '', 128779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resistance will only bring pain!', '', 128778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn away your defiance!', '', 128777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why endure this pain? Kneel to the Legion!', '', 128776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I offer respite from the darkness! Surrender your will to me!', '', 128775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our suffering... will be... glorious...', '', 128774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain... of failing... the master...', '', 128773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their souls shall bear the torment of defeat for all eternity!', '', 128772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death was too easy an escape for them.', '', 128771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too much to endure?', '', 128770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile mortal!', '', 128769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another broken body!', '', 128768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re right to be afraid. If we fail to stop the Legion on the Broken Shore, the demons will strike us here, at our home and hearth.', '', 128767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will hurt... I promise!', '', 128766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much can you withstand?', '', 128765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your suffering will be legend!', '', 128764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Funny, I thought I just heard... No. It must be my imagination playing tricks on me.', 128763, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed me with your screams!', '', 128762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cut you to the core!', '', 128761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least we\'re safe here in Stormwind. King Wrynn will keep the city safe.', '', 128760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agony impales you!', '', 128759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pain! Pain beyond measure!', '', 128758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They brought back my cousin\'s body from the Broken Shore last week. I expect a lot more to follow.', 128757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sooner than expected, but no matter. Our work begins!', '', 128756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! It was the suffering I inflicted which... Hold! The mortals come! That fool Goroth has failed again!', '', 128755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Physical pain? Bah! Mental anguish is the true weapon. Was it not the key to turning Rakeesh?', '', 128754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admit that I am right! Break the body and the spirit follows.', '', 128753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will not get away with this!', 'The Legion will not get away with this!', 128752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should take out those imps quickly. They\'re not the hardiest creatures, but they can overwhelm you if left unchecked!', '', 128751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up, Goldrinn.', 'Wake up, Goldrinn.', 128750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Goldrinn lays asleep, peaceful now that the fel energies are gone.>', '', 128749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I know just the spell. Follow me.', '', 128748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll need a disguise to move through the city without attracting attention.', '', 128747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Greymane said you would be coming. Please, go right in.', '', 128746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They... They\'re trying to corrupt Goldrinn! Quick, Archdruid!', 128745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No demons are coming through this portal any time soon!', 128744, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 82153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll show \'em!', 128743, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 82152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you imagine the demons coming through and ending up with a face full of vines? Classic!', 128742, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 82151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portals should be around here somewhere... Keep your eyes open!', 128741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand the need to mourn, but the king\'s place is on his throne. The Broken Shore must be our focus. Convince Anduin to end his vigil!', '', 128740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin refuses to eat or sleep. He ignores every plea to return to the palace. Nothing I say seems to offer comfort.', '', 128739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our guest arrives. Perhaps now there is hope of reaching the king.', '', 128738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for bringing my father\'s compass back to me. It is a reminder of how much I miss him.', '', 128737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since this war with the Legion began, I\'ve barely had a chance to think or breathe... or to mourn. Perhaps it\'s time to change that.', '', 128736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had this compass crafted for my father\'s birthday. I gave it to him a few months before my ship ran aground on Pandaria. A lifetime ago...', '', 128735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, let\'s go! We have to save Goldrinn!', 128734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help me! Hurry!', 128732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, coming back for more, I see? Well, ya better be a good tipper, bub!', '', 128730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t like the show? You can kiss my sparkling enchanted posterior!', '', 128729, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your path leads only to ruin. Lay down your weapons and bow before your masters!', '', 128728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take time, but thanks to your deeds the land will one day recover. Well done, hero!', '', 128727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! So long, arch-losers!', '', 128726, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 81979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense another infestation of demons nearby. Champion, I am counting upon you to eradicate them!', '', 128725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya later, prestigidi--, um, prestidigigat-- Eh, forget it!', '', 128724, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 81977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright! I\'ll grab my stuff and we can ditch these stiffs.', '', 128723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang tight a sec. I\'ll get you outta there.', '', 128722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Phew, that was a close one! Rabbits don\'t come cheap, y\'know!', '', 128721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did a wolf get in there?! Well don\'t just stand around, kill the thing!', '', 128720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright pal, just poke around in there and see what\'s going on with the rabbits.', '', 128719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the whatnow!?', '', 128718, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 81971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, now you try.', '', 128717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you just fill it with bunnies, aaaand.... bam!', '', 128716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, now the first thing you gotta do is get yourself a hat with a pocket dimension portal inside.', '', 128715, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swing back to the Hall of the Guardian, and I\'ll give ya a little something for your troubles.', '', 128714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s enough testing, bud. I think it\'s time to start thinking about mass production!', '', 128713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about our test subjects. I\'m sure they\'re used to these things by now.', '', 128712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re talkin\'! Just look at that thing go!', '', 128711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey bub! I got a proposition for ya!', '', 128710, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were having quite a time finding volunteers brave enough to enter that nest of evil. If you need a new pair of shoes after wading through those webs, I have a connection in Dalaran that can offer you a discount!', '', 128709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero! So long as the shadow of the Legion darkens our world, we must remain vigilant.', '', 128708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a foul force within Bradensbrook, hero. Search for Legion presence and destroy it!', '', 128707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a very sticky situation for you, champion. We need silk harvested from the broods of the Creeping Grotto to use for a rather complex incantation. Can you help?', '', 128706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have faced malevolent naga, angry spirits, and insidious demons. But spiders... unbearable!', '', 128705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no time to lose, Archdruid! I\'m ready to stab some demons!', 128704, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 82148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow... Aviana...', 128703, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is imperative that you destroy any clutches of eggs you find. This infestation must not spread!', '', 128702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spiders! Of all the infernal demons the Legion could dispatch into my realm, why did it have to be spiders?', '', 128701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana!', 128700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those who harm my children shall pay!', 128699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 20744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 128698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m coming for you!', '', 128697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Subject: Azeroth. Minor arrhythmia detected, but vitals within acceptable parameters. Incident reports updated.', 128690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Threat signatures neutralized. Facility defenses at 74.39 percent. Repairs in progress.', 128689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No local threats detected. Commencing assistance appreciation.', '', 128688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat neutralized. Deploying repair matrix.', '', 128687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! I came upon him in Tel\'anor caught in a harpy\'s bonds without a stitch of clothing! Ha!\n\nThe harpy was so busy arguing with a banshee over who got to play with him first, that they did not notice me at all.\n\nHe looked terribly uncomfortable, so I intervened. And the rest is history!', 128686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sar...ger...as...', '', 128685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana, your birds bring news from all over Azeroth. Please, help us find the demons\' target! We must avenge our fallen kin!', 128684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can we help?', 'How can we help?', 128683, 0, 48134, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skies aflame. A sword... in the darkness... the wound... burning...', '', 128682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To think my brothers and sisters died to a \"distraction\"... I won\'t stand for it!', 128681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you meet Aethas?', 'How did you meet Aethas?', 128680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sands... soaked in pain. Rivers... rivers of blood.', '', 128679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have always found magic to be wondrous in all of its forms. Now that the shield has dropped, I cannot wait to master all of it!', 128678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her feelin\'s are a jumble. I need ta focus, let her thoughts flow into--UNNGG!', '', 128677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana! Your children need you. The Druids of the Talon are being slaughtered at the hands of the Legion!', 128676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Titan comes! We gotta stop him! Argus... the Legion\'s homeworld. She says our destiny lies there.', '', 128675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If my elders knew I was consorting with an outlander, I would be banished... Or worse.', 128674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk ta me, lass. Tell me what\'s got ye all in a tizzy...', '', 128673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shal\'dorei have been isolated for so many generations. We find it difficult to open our minds to new ways of thinking.', 128672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These phantoms must be her dreams... her nightmares. If we help her overcome these horrors, Azeroth should be able ta give us her message.', '', 128671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not sure if this will work, but I might as well give it a shot... Stand back!', 128670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\'s triggered the defenses! Careful now, ye\'ve got company!', '', 128669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lately she\'s seemed... troubled. Hard ta read. I hope ye can help me get through ta her.', '', 128668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titans built these halls ta watch over the soul o\' the world. From this chamber I can hear her, clear as diamond.', '', 128667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here ya go. This pad\'ll bring ye deep below ground, ta a place no mortal has walked in millennia... the Hall o\' Communion! C\'mon down, I\'ve got a lot to show ye.', '', 128666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yer gettin\' close. Come ta the Makers\' Overlook, high in the eastern mountains. I\'ll show ye the way inside.', '', 128665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Azeroth needs our help.', '', 128664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are BLIND. I WILL FORCE YOUR EYES OPEN.', '', 128663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! The nightmares are contained. Keep going, I\'m just ahead in the next chamber.', '', 128662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense her fear... her doubt. We\'ve gotta help her! Looks like some o\' the defenses are down. If ye reactivate \'em, it might help snap her out o\' this!', '', 128661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Self-repair mode resumed. External assistance evaluation: appreciated.', '', 128660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reactivation sequence complete. Initiating sentry protocols.', '', 128659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anomaly detected. Engaging defense protocol Gamma Theta Phi Omicron.', '', 128658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this! I will put an end to you myself!', '', 128657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shame Brann didn\'t come with ye. Nothin\' me brother loves more than openin\' titan doors!', '', 128656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Sholazar Basin up in Northrend. Together, we\'ll get ta the bottom o\' this!', '', 128655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s tryin\' ta send me a message... a warning, methinks. But somethin\'s not right with her.', '', 128654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis good ta see ye, $n. Now that the nightmares are gone, we can find out what she wants ta tell us. Give the word and we\'ll begin.', '', 128653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you up ahead.', 128652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I discovered her quite by accident, really. Er, well, she discovered me.\n\nI got myself into a bit of a.. situation... with a harpy and a banshee, and... oh nevermind.\n\nAnyway, Ryanna freed me with some very impressive spellwork. And then asked to join the Tirisgarde.\n\nHow could I turn her down?', '', 128651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Arcanist Ryanna.', 'Tell me more about Arcanist Ryanna.', 128650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brilliant work! The contagion appears to be contained.', 128649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A terrible contagion has consumed Deadwood Landing. The harpies that infest the island are carriers. Their corruption must not be allowed to spread!', 128648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fel contagion has found its way to Deadwood Landing once again, High Priest. We must contain this sickness before it infects the mainland.', 128647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a battle! Any moment now this ship will explode into tiny pieces. No matter! One of our eagles will see you to safety!', '', 128646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A close call. Thank you for the help.', '', 128645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, heroes. Lasan needs your help!', 128644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh. Is this all this planet can offer? So very weak. I desire a true challenge.', '', 128643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Felborne trappers are using their twisted magic upon the wildlife here. Take this manaroot salve and apply it to any wounded animals you see. Hurry, before the corruption takes hold!', 128642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrgh!', '', 128641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I leave it to you to sabotage the Legion ship and rescue our allies. The demon commander is mine!', '', 128640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These war eagles will carry us to our destination. Ready to go? Then climb aboard!', '', 128639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once aboard, rescue all the captives you can. When my people are safe, set these explosives and get off the ship... fast!', 128638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must keep moving!', 128637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 128636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood. Heroes, lets get to the rendezvous point.', 128635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to attack the Legion ship. Mayla, champions, meet me outside Thunder Totem. Time to make them pay!', '', 128634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, heroes. Though only two of the tunnels were sealed, every bit helps.', 128633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes... deal with this... fiend...', 128632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argh!', 128631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of Navarrogg\'s geomancers is sealing the tunnels to stem the flow of Legion enemies. Defend him at all costs!', 128630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a traitor to our people, siding with these demon worshippers!', '', 128629, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champions, the Legion seeks to infiltrate Thunder Totem from below. Help push them back!', 128628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My chosen offer the gift of life, champion. Claim their prize and fight on!', 128627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a true protector of nature. You have my thanks.', 128626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunder Totem is under siege! Let us save our comrades before we knock that demon vessel out of the sky.', '', 128625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even with their leader dead, these felborne trappers won\'t stop! Take this manaroot salve and apply it to any wounded animals you see. Save as many as you can!', 128624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Felfire Pass is crawling with occultists loyal to the Burning Legion. We cannot let them gain a footing!', 128623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a display of power! I\'d wager those occultists regret allying with our enemy!', 128622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even with Kanrethad returned to us, these occultists remain loyal to the Legion. We cannot let them regain control of Felfire Pass. Thin their numbers and absorb their sources of power!', 128621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mighty Legion has attacked, and we are barely holding off their siege.', '', 128620, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on.', 'Go on.', 128619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saboteur was from the Horde - one of my own Sunreavers, in fact.\n\nThere are those on the Council who strongly opposed allowing us back into the Kirin Tor in the first place. As you can imagine, this gives them all the ammunition they need to lobby for our expulsion yet again.\n\nAnd if that happens, our truce will shatter and Azeroth will surely fall to the Legion.', '', 128618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re ordered to report to the battlefield at once. Take out those demons shredding our front lines!', '', 128617, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 82690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did the Legion gain access to Dalaran\'s weapons?', 'How did the Legion gain access to Dalaran\'s weapons?', 128616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems our allies somehow repelled the attack... stay at the ready.', '', 128615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We discovered the saboteur\'s corpse near the weapons core. His soul had been drained... Ugh, such a terrible way to die.\n\nThe situation is worse than I let on, I\'m afraid.', '', 128614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If this was only a distraction, where\'s the main attack? We need to ask Aviana. She\'ll know!', 128613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I went full shadow... Never go full shadow.', '', 128612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never become a real mage wearing that outfit.', '', 128611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apprentices..? Apprenticeese..? Apprentici..? Yes, I think that\'s it...', '', 128610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... did I leave the Trial of Fire on? I\'m pretty sure I turned it off...', '', 128609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep up your studies.', '', 128608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, who are you again?', '', 128607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, and do... something!', '', 128606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do try not to die now!', '', 128605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I here... or am I an illusion?', '', 128604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you like... trials?', '', 128603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can always use another apprentice.', '', 128602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 128601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am but one of many who has taken up the lance for Azeroth.', '', 128600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In our time together, my brother and I have seen wars and tests aplenty.', '', 128599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of dragons. They cannot be trusted!', '', 128598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will smite our foes!', '', 128597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('My shield is yours.', '', 128596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect the realm.', '', 128595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light grant you strength.', '', 128594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help?', '', 128593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s blessings, traveller.', '', 128592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, adventurer.', '', 128591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met.', '', 128590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fel-fire spear might prove useful right about now...', 128589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, I might look good in green...', 128588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the Legion has not been this irritating!', 128587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My bloodline is not known for having even tempers.', 128586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps my father was right about you.', 128585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop. Now.', 128584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be hunted no longer.', 128583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight with honor, outsider.', 128582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gods go with you.', 128581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not falter.', 128580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stand unbroken.', 128579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shield is ready.', 128578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is your purpose?', 128577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, outsider.', 128576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish druids... our distraction has succeeded!', 128575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t I ever get to keep the dreadsteed?', '', 128574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t you be fetching materials or something?', '', 128573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you brought me more blood?', '', 128572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel hooves grant you swiftness.', '', 128571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons will bow to us.', '', 128570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xoroth beckons.', '', 128569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadsteeds will be ours.', '', 128568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What shall we summon today?', '', 128567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You require my services?', '', 128566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What needs conjuring?', '', 128565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 128564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the dark depths of Hel with you!', 128563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'C\'mon, Archdruid! My people need our help!', 128562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Meet me near Lady Remor\'za\'s tower and I will summon a portal.', '', 128561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, keep your distance from the Nightborne Soulstone as it is siphoning energy!', '', 128560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This mage will teleport you to us. The task ahead will not be easy. Be prepared!', 128559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Upon your arrival, we will reopen the portal to the demon\'s domain and finish him... once and for all!', 128558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Prophet has prepared his incantations, and I have meditated long enough. Kruul must die.', 128557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have given my location to your mages. Once you arrive here, we will enter Tugar\'s cavern and neutralize his threat.', '', 128556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must put an end to him, along with that nasty pet of his, before they attack Thunder Totem. This will be no easy task.', '', 128555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tugar Bloodtotem has resurfaced in Highmountain. With him is an immense worm saturated with fel energy.', '', 128554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n. Let us put Erdris to rest... once and for all.', '', 128553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pair of Bradensbrook\'s fiercest fighters have insisted on joining our campaign. But even with their help, the battle ahead will be treacherous.', '', 128552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time, my friend. I have located Erdris Thorn in the upper spires of Blackrook Hold, where he plots to raise an undead army!', '', 128551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you back at the Hall of the Guardian, Archmage $n.', 128550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say, are you keen to feel the pointy part of my blade?', '', 128549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Maximillian of Northshire, damsel rescuer extraordinaire. How dare you!', '', 128548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know who it is you are addressing?', '', 128547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, then.', '', 128546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh begone! I have dragons to slay!', '', 128545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', '', 128544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I serve?', '', 128543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 128542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho!', '', 128541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us ride!', '', 128540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall slay mighty beasts together!', '', 128539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho!', '', 128538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why hello again, squire!', '', 128537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my might, I slay thee!', '', 128536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Doloria!', '', 128535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a strange looking dragon! No matter!', '', 128534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excaliberto! Attack!', '', 128533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall slay thee with my mighty sword!', '', 128532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that was easy.', '', 128531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another fiend felled by my mighty blows!', '', 128530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you take heed of my victory, squire?', '', 128529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require... a short respite.', '', 128528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assist me!', '', 128527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You handle this one, squire.', '', 128526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me, Grandmaster. I remembered my water breathing potions.', '', 128525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a refreshing swim... Reminds me of the time I swam all the way to Kezan. Grandmaster Rochu wasn\'t happy about how shriveled his paws got!', '', 128524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have I told you the tale of the hozen and the buttercream pie? Hmm... Perhaps best saved for another time.', '', 128523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wise brewmaster recognizes the importance of taking a drink... and the importance of stopping before the drink takes the brewmaster.', '', 128522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not concern yourself with failure, Grandmaster. Rather, focus on rising every time you fall.', '', 128521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best time to plant a tree is fifty years ago. The second-best time is now.', '', 128520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wise monk chooses their own style, rather than letting popular opinion dictate it.', '', 128519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A kite cannot fly unless the wind blows against it, Grandmaster.', '', 128518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To speak of change without being willing to take action is like digging a hole to catch a cloud serpent.', '', 128517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember to finish crossing the river before you tell the crocolisk he has bad breath!', '', 128516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it much further, Grandmaster?', '', 128515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Idleness rarely leads to success, Grandmaster.', '', 128514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to all voices, Grandmaster. Surrounded only by those who share your views, your mind can never grow.', '', 128513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lazy yak never gets washed.', '', 128512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell!', '', 128511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, Grandmaster!', '', 128510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might want to cut back on the mana buns, Grandmaster...', '', 128509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, Grandmaster.', '', 128508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are we going today, Grandmaster?', '', 128507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m prepared to take you to the Halls of Valor. Speak with me when your allies have gathered and you are ready.', 128506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must give up! The strength of the Legion will destroy us!', '', 128505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be stopped!', '', 128504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us return to the Wandering Isle... together!', '', 128503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are impressive indeed, Grandmaster! I would be honored to serve you, as I served the great leaders of our order who came before.', '', 128502, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 82427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is clear you embody the wisdom, integrity, and tenacity of a grandmaster. Only one test remains... Prove to me that you can fight like a grandmaster!', '', 128501, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 82426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown patience with Master Bu, honor with the grummles, duty with the Shado-Pan, and faith with the jinyu.', '', 128500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But in the midst of that reflection, I saw something new and interesting appear... you!', '', 128499, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filled with sorrow by the death of Grandmaster Hight, I wandered Pandaria to reflect.', '', 128498, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 82423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not here? Are you sure? Perhaps you should be more observant, Grandmaster...', '', 128497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster! Have you found Ban-Lu?', '', 128496, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 82402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster, I have an idea...', '', 128495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we have reached a dead end. I shall meditate on this conundrum.', '', 128494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we continue the search for Ban-Lu, Grandmaster?', '', 128493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you go? Oh, wait there. Thank you for showing patience to an old man.', '', 128492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you slow down a moment? I do apologize for my languid pace.', '', 128491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait for me, please! These old bones aren\'t what they used to be.', '', 128490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Phew! An exciting journey, but wearying. Please allow me a moment to rest. Perhaps you could ask these grummles whether they\'ve seen Ban-Lu.', '', 128489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trail of paw prints! Hmm, where might they lead...', '', 128488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you found? Let me see...', '', 128487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for any sign of where Ban-Lu might be.', '', 128486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster! Over here.', '', 128485, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 82391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps if we return there, we may find clues to his whereabouts.', '', 128484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Ban-Lu has not been seen since the Legion\'s attack on the Peak of Serenity. It seems the loss of life... affected him deeply.', '', 128483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over the centuries, Ban-Lu served as the personal mount of each grandmaster. It was a duty he was honored to fulfil!', '', 128482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xuen, the White Tiger, one of the August Celestials, had a son named Ban-Lu.', '', 128481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster! Could you spare a moment to listen to an old man\'s tale?', '', 128480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After that night, I was alone. The last of my bloodline.', 128479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I take solace knowing they will be judged by the gods when their time comes.', 128478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s no use, though. They never fail to elude my grasp. I must concentrate on the task at hand.', 128477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another ambush! Bare your steel!', 128476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cowardly scum! I would hunt down every one of them, and their masters as well, if I knew who sent them.', 128475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never forget the night they came. My mother fell before my eyes, and they had descended on my brother before I managed to escape.', 128474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would seem that escaping my past was too much to hope for.', 128473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be forewarned. They may still be on the hunt.', 128472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My last moments here were spent escaping the clutches of assassins sent to murder my family.', 128471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Movement in the trees! Watch out!', 128470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you at Valdisdall in Stormheim. We should be able to reach Skold-Ashil from there.', 128469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to fight alongside you, Battlelord $n. I will report to Skyhold. See you there!', '', 128468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Revel the night away and awake in Trueshot Lodge.>', '<Revel the night away and awake in Trueshot Lodge.>', 128467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a hunt! This, out here, is the true spirit of the wilds. Let us revel the night away and leave our cares for the morning!', '', 128466, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s squawks loudly as you approach.', '', 128465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be calm, Aviash. $n is one of our allies.', '', 128464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fate of the Tideskorn rests in your hands. Gods be with you, outsider!', 128463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Kirin Tor have found the means to convey you into Odyn\'s halls. Hurry! Sigryn must be made to see reason, before it is too late!', 128462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outsider! Sigryn has stormed the Halls of Valor, determined to confront Odyn. In her blind rage, she races headlong to her doom!', 128461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, it must be also be nightborne in origin for a harmonious marriage to be achieved. Oh - and it must be newly forged and still unattached. Anything else will result in disaster. \n\nIf the rumors are true, Aethas might be able to help. Supposedly he has taken a rather striking nightborne apprentice! It is quite scandalous.\n\nYou should ask him to introduce you to her.', 128460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where would I find such a thing?', 'Where would I find such a thing?', 128459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He will rise! He... will... reign...', 128458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My vigil ends! Let not... the dark one... awaken...', 128457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world\'s hope dies with you!', 128456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My vigil continues. But... who is it I serve?', 128455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flesh is weak!', 128454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A necessary end.', 128453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not disturb the master\'s work!', 128452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What lies below is not for mortal eyes!', 128451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The unmovable object met the irresistible force, and I found... a new calling.', 128450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For millennia I was steadfast in my vigil... unwavering. And then his voice called to me.', 128449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was not the first to place defenses in this temple, but I fear the ancient watcher charged with safeguarding this place... has been compromised. Be wary. I will offer you what protection I can.', 128448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'End me, mortals! Then rob the Deceiver of his prize!', 128447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This body... my mind... compromised. I have failed the makers!', 128446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to attend the feast.', 'I am ready to attend the feast.', 128444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn and the greatest of his hunters await your presence at the Fields of the Eternal hunt.', 128443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Felwing Ledge, Slayer $p. The Matron Mother is waiting for you down in the training area, just west of here.', '', 128442, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '(UNUSED)Your demon sight will be beneficial in keeping track of its trail of blood.(UNUSED)', 128441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Our world will never fall so long as it is defended by champions such as you!', '', 128440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, champion. Are you here to answer the call of Odyn?', '', 128439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fury of the storm boils within me! Have you finished your preparations?', '', 128438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the speed of my axe!', '', 128437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power of my father\'s blood flows through me!', 128436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give the word when you are ready, champion, and we will take to the skies.', '', 128435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demonic filth taints this land, champion. We must eradicate it!', '', 128434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION.BLP:20|t%s channels the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237945|h[Blood of her Father]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION.BLP:20|t%s channels the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237945|h[Blood of her Father]|h|r!', 128433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SHADOWFURYTGA.BLP:20|tSeveral |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237908|h[Runes]|h|r appear on the ground nearby.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SHADOWFURYTGA.BLP:20|tSeveral |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237908|h[Runes]|h|r appear on the ground nearby.', 128432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WHIRLWIND.BLP:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237866|h[Bladestorm]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WHIRLWIND.BLP:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237866|h[Bladestorm]|h|r!', 128431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARRIOR_RAMPAGE.BLP:20|t%s gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237947|h[Berserker\'s Rage]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARRIOR_RAMPAGE.BLP:20|t%s gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237947|h[Berserker\'s Rage]|h|r!', 128430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION.BLP:20|t%s starts casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237952|h[Ancestral Knowledge]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION.BLP:20|t%s starts casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237952|h[Ancestral Knowledge]|h|r!', 128429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_BOSS_SVALASORROWGRAVE.BLP:20|tSeveral Dark Val\'kyr form ranks to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237761|h[charge]|h|r across the battlefield!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_BOSS_SVALASORROWGRAVE.BLP:20|tSeveral Dark Val\'kyr form ranks to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237761|h[charge]|h|r across the battlefield!', 128428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drekirjar never yield!', '', 128427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I draw upon the power of my ancestors!', '', 128426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many treasures, just waiting for me to grab!', 128425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I command legions, mortal!', 128424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin.', 'I am ready to begin.', 128423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion may try to wear us down - to erode our allies like rain-swept valleys after a storm, but we will never surrender. It is in our blood to fight until the sun shines upon us once more.', '', 128422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure to study the runes well, $c. I don\'t want to know what will happen if we fail!', '', 128421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you there. We have to hurry--before it\'s too late!', 128418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82139, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archdruid! I need your help!', 128417, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 82138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mages of the Kirin Tor can open a temporary portal to his location. You must put an end to Xylem\'s madness... but please, spare his life if you can!', 128416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From that location, Xylem could use the Focusing Iris to wreak untold havoc on Azeroth\'s ley lines.', 128415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Along with Xylem\'s other apprentices, I have been working to pinpoint his location. I believe we have found him in the Eye of Eternity, $ct!', 128414, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s calmer now, but still troubled. I should be able ta reach her.$b$bAre ye ready, $n?', '', 128413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Druids! We were victorious! The Idol of Aviana is once again safe. Archdruid, please do the honors and put the idol back where it belongs.', 128412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. Let\'s get this idol back to the Dreamgrove.', 128411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this game!', '', 128410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aviana, please! Help us!', 128409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here!', 128408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blasphemy!', 128407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, little druid! We will use your power of flight to bring down Dalaran!', '', 128406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wrong! You die this day, demon!', 128405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion! With this idol, the cowardly mortals\' floating city will no longer protect them.', '', 128404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see what\'s going on... discreetly!', 128403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you in Azsuna, Archdruid.', 128402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What the... Flight Form\'s not working?! With the idol gone, we\'ve lost our wings! Everyone teleport out and regroup at the Dreamgrove!', 128401, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shrine is lost. Druids, take flight! Retreat!', 128400, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Noooo!', 128399, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wretched... No! The idol!', 128398, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perish before the might of the Legion!', '', 128397, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 82692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die, demon scum!', 128396, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you hear that? Screams from the shrine! We\'ve gotta get back there!', 128395, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To hell with the front lines! I\'m going around back to take out their casters and artillery. You\'re welcome to join me!', 128394, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archdruid! The Shrine of Aviana is under attack again, and this time it\'s a full-scale invasion! The Ancient needs our help!', 128393, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 82122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us hear what she has to say, Magni.', 'Let us hear what she has to say, Magni.', 128392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her nightmares... her greatest fears... we\'ve got to help!', '', 128391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, lass. We\'ll protect ye. We\'ve got to!', '', 128390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Destroyer is alive, she\'s in great danger. No wonder she\'s so troubled...', '', 128389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Matron Mother.', 'I\'m ready, Matron Mother.', 128388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you rest in peace, Brewmaster.', '', 128387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time for me to leave this realm, my friends. Almai, I believe you have grown beyond the life of a simple brewer.', 128386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82438, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster, you are that light! Do not waver in your resolve to fight the Burning Legion!', '', 128385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw a vision. A tsunami of demons crashing down upon us... extinguishing every light... save for one.', '', 128384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My entire being, even my soul... burned...', '', 128383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron-Body Ponshu coughs weakly.', '', 128382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need passage to Felwing Ledge.', 'I need passage to Felwing Ledge.', 128381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail to the Battlelord! Lok-tar!', '', 128380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to fight beside you, Battlelord $n. I will report to Skyhold.', '', 128379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s ancient, but tough! He can survive this... Right?', 128378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The echo of my power can save you!', 128377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The chasm is warded against her magic!', 128376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My ward persists! It can protect you!', 128375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck with Agatha, $c. You will need it...', '', 128374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like Fhambar has tracked down your missing mage. I\'ll be taking him back now.', '', 128373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
