('Fhambar doesn\'t find anything useful...', '', 128371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhambar senses something...', '', 128370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I...don\'t feel so good...', '', 128369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good... once they are through, the foolish \"Legionfall Offensive\" will stand no chance. Their demise shall be delivered.', '', 128368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will notify the summoners shortly. They will open the portals on my word only.', '', 128367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eve of our attack is nigh. Have you summoned the forces?', '', 128366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain vigilant, champion! We must watch for our enemy, just as they are watching us!', '', 128365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us feast, then! To the Night of the Wilds! To the great beasts! To the Huntmaster!', '', 128364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha, I think it likes you, Hunter! You and the beast are now bonded, in this realm and the mortal realm. Now, let us return to the feast, and leave our worries for the morning!', '', 128363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you accept the companionship of the Wolfhawk?', '', 128362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you understand what the tale seeks to teach us? With our companions, we are so much stronger than we are alone.', '', 128361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now come back to the fire, good hunter, and let us feast the night away!', '', 128360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With her spirit now bound to yours, the children of Haukenulfnir will answer your summons in the mortal world.', '', 128359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has found you worthy. The spirit of Haukenulfnir is with the hunter!', '', 128358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She senses your predatory prowess and kinship with beasts. She will test you, hunter, if you approach her.', '', 128357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is Haukenulfnir, who stalked the wilds when the world was new!', '', 128356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? A most rare and remarkable spirit has come forth, one that has not graced these fields for countless ages.', '', 128355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! Den-mother Fereki, great predator of the earth, and mighty Vetholnir, lord of the skies.', '', 128354, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 83041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits hold you in high regard, Huntmaster! The most renowned predators of all our legends have emerged. This is truly the grandest Night of the Wilds I have ever witnessed!', '', 128353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ranulf of the Screaming Abyss triumphed over Habrok in life. The spirit of Ranulf is with the hunter!', '', 128352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Habrok, the great owl, perches above you. All beasts once feared her talons, and hid during the night from her keen vision.', '', 128351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ketlingr was slain by Tor of the Brutal Siege. The spirit of Tor is with the hunter!', '', 128350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ketlingr, the great cat, drinks before you. A lithe, fierce predator, many learned to fear her fangs and claws!', '', 128349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garos was brought here by Bjorn of the Black Storm. The spirit of Bjorn is with the hunter!', '', 128348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You follow the trail of Garos, the great worm. Many are her children, and deep are her tunnels.', '', 128347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hyrtir was first pursued by Haldor of the Rocky Cliffs. The spirit of Haldor is with the hunter this night!', '', 128346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hyrtir, the great stag, emerges! Swiftest of the beasts, with horns sharpened to a spear\'s point. Luck be with you, hunter!', '', 128345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finding these clever beasts in the darkness will not be easy, but a true hunter is a master of tracking.', '', 128344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Once you have eaten your fill, hunter, depart the table and enter the wilderness. Your prey awaits!', '', 128343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the feast begin!', '', 128342, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your steins to the Huntmaster, our hunter of beasts!', '', 128341, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To hunt the noble spirits and return them to their honored rest.', '', 128340, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One among us has been chosen to enter the darkness.', '', 128339, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On this evening, the spirits of the great beasts of legend rise in these very fields.', '', 128338, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Night of the Wilds is upon us once more, friends.', '', 128337, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion dispatches its all-seeing eyes to spy on our war efforts. Intolerable! Ensure nothing they have learned can be used against us.', '', 128336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing gets past the Legion.', '', 128335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that? It came from over here!', '', 128334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intruder? Show yourself!', '', 128333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Fel Bomb detonates!', '%s\'s Fel Bomb detonates!', 128332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could feel my life slipping away... You have my eternal thanks, Grandmaster!', 128331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blech! I never thought I\'d be glad to taste something so vile!', 128330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was so weak... Thank you for helping me!', 128329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blessings on you, Grandmaster!', 128328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could feel my life slipping away... You have my eternal thanks, Grandmaster!', '', 128327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blech! I never thought I\'d be glad to taste something so vile!', '', 128326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was so weak... Thank you for helping me!', '', 128325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings on you, Grandmaster!', '', 128324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was... exquisite...', 128323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agatha... will be... pleased...', 128322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope this one is more entertaining than the last.', 128321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s play, $c!', 128320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Worry not, Uhrlia - this one looks spry. Surely $Ghe:she; won\'t give up so easily.', 128319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! It is done.', 128318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand back while we infuse the herbs into the brew...', 128317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way you and your allies persevered is an inspiration to our forces. Proof that together we can save Azeroth!', '', 128316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, it looks like Agatha\'s stumbled on another fun little plaything.', 128315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion cannot stand against the power of the Light. Not when it has champions like you!', '', 128314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved many lives this day, hero. For this noble act, you have my thanks.', '', 128313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have brought the Light to this dark place. Thank you.', '', 128312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! The Light has need of you!', '', 128311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light preserve us! Our allies are in need. Please, champion, help them!', '', 128310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your allies, hero. The threat you are about to face will put all your skills to the test!', '', 128309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your friends make an impressive fighting force. It is through our unity that the Legion will fall!', '', 128308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once again, I owe you a debt of thanks. I\'d say you\'re making quite a habit of this!', '', 128307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! The way you took that target down reminds me of myself in my younger days. My much, much younger days.', '', 128306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You work today has saved lives, champion. Take pride in that!', '', 128305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! We have pushed the Legion back... for now, at least.', '', 128304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your allies, champion. A grave threat is at hand, and heroes are needed!', '', 128303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! Come at once!', '', 128302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, champion!', '', 128301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts report the presence of a deadly enemy nearby. Time to go on the offensive!', '', 128300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have allies in trouble nearby, champion. Please lend your aid!', '', 128299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero! Our foes have infiltrated this area. We\'re relying on you to take them down!', '', 128298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits.', '%s spits.', 128297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot withstand me!', '', 128296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us test your resolve!', '', 128295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break you!', '', 128294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me?', '', 128293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pain rains upon you!', '', 128292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay where you are!', '', 128291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still!', '', 128290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still!', '', 128289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash you to pieces!', '', 128288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pummel you to dust!', '', 128287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will flatten you!', '', 128286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Burn in the fires of my torment!', '', 128285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... agony... to come...', '', 128284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will be pleased.', '', 128283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have earned my glory... and robbed these mortals of theirs.', '', 128282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another foe felled!', '', 128281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic mortal!', '', 128280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easily broken!', '', 128279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, face your doom!', '', 128278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will delight in your suffering!', '', 128277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will know pain!', '', 128276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! Killing you will regain my master\'s favor!', '', 128275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The energy in this place is malevolent. Let\'s go!', 128274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look like you\'ve lost something. Can I help?', 128273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got something that needs blown up? Old Icks has got just the staff for you!', '', 128272, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your comrades fought well. Such determination will be crucial in the battles to come.', '', 128271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The downfall of such an enemy will inspire our forces... and seed fear into the demons\' hearts.', '', 128270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength of arms is not the only way to strike a blow against the Legion. Well done!', '', 128269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A well-fought battle. The Legion has learned to fear you!', '', 128268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your allies are needed, champion. Gather your forces!', '', 128267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A formidable enemy is close. Strike it down with all the malice it deserves!', '', 128266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were my friend! How could you do this to me? To my FAMILY?', 'You were my friend! How could you do this to me? To my FAMILY?', 128265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like that demon\'s poison got me in the end...', 'Looks like that demon\'s poison got me in the end...', 128264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could nap all day.', 'I wish I could nap all day.', 128263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<yawn> Is it already time to go back to work?', '<yawn> Is it already time to go back to work?', 128262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies need your aid, champion. You must act at once!', '', 128261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where could it be?!', 'Where could it be?!', 128260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know I dropped it somewhere around here...', 'I know I dropped it somewhere around here...', 128259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might as well start looking for something worth salvaging.', 'Might as well start looking for something worth salvaging.', 128258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Your expertise is needed! Prepare for battle!', '', 128257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Scribe\'s Sacellum, $c. Can I interest you in some scrolls today?', '', 128256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion hit this area hard. There don\'t seem to be any survivors.', 'The Legion hit this area hard. There don\'t seem to be any survivors.', 128255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And another! Allying with these \"demons\" was a mistake.', 'And another! Allying with these \"demons\" was a mistake.', 128254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh> Another sentinel dead.', '<sigh> Another sentinel dead.', 128253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh> We lost him too soon.', '<sigh> We lost him too soon.', 128252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Elune guide your soul, my son.', 'May Elune guide your soul, my son.', 128251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll never find this buried here...', 'They\'ll never find this buried here...', 128250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once there, I shall present you with a gift to show my appreciation. May it serve you well.', '', 128249, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 82961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farseer $p, I will return you to the Heart of Azeroth. Depart with my thanks.', '', 128248, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 82960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Divided, we are scattered to the winds. But united, we are a cyclone of power. Let this council never dissipate again.', '', 128247, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the Windlord now, and all of you bluster about within my domain. But let us not leave this council with a whiff of foul air.', '', 128246, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the Farseer has edified your allegiances in my direction. Good. Let me clear away any doubts still polluting your minds.', '', 128245, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(CUT/UNUSED)Once they realize your intentions, they will seek to remove you from this plane. I will grant you a blessing that will prevent them from doing so, at least for a time.(CUT/UNUSED)', '', 128244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unmoved by your babbling, demon. Feel the wrath of a true commander\'s army!', '', 128243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha ha ha!', '', 128242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They foolishly believe Sarsarun to be the rightful heir to the throne. I need you to convince them otherwise.', '', 128241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds carry my will to the far corners of this plane, but even I cannot be everywhere at once. Here in Skywall, certain of my subjects have not fully grasped the totality of my ascension.', '', 128240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 128239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m grateful for your aid, Farseer $p. I have no doubt you will resolve this issue swiftly.', '', 128237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would not waste the time you\'ve been given to complete your task, Farseer $p.', '', 128236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve still some work to do here, but I\'ll meet you back at the Fel Hammer, Slayer $p.', 128235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow us to make the creature presentable so that it may be conferred to you at the Fel Hammer. Speak with Yrdris and he\'ll see you back to the ship.', 128234, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you\'ve tamed the beast, Slayer $p. Congratulations are in order, my dear!', 128233, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erdris... your magic is weak! We... will... resist you!', '', 128232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_SPEAR_08.BLP:20|t%s targets |cFFFF0000$n|r with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235933|h[Spear of Anguish]|h|r!', '', 128231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... doesn\'t seem right. Where am I?', 128230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this sensation? A dark force... reaching into my mind...', '', 128229, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye:20|tThrashbite\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237726|h[Scornful Gaze]|h|r falls on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye:20|tThrashbite\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:237726|h[Scornful Gaze]|h|r falls on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', 128228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt he will send his minions to stop us. Maintaining the portal will require all of my strength, so I will rely on you to hold them off.', '', 128227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will activate the portal. Once it\'s open, I\'ll need you to place the Calling Stone to draw Arax\'ath and the Wrathsteed through.', '', 128225, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tracking it should be simple, thanks to your demon sight. But if it\'s run off to the breeding grounds, I fear you may have some trouble bringing it back. Bats can be such... spirited creatures.', 128224, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies, Slayer, it seems to have escaped. Ah, but see here? A trail of blood. How convenient!', 128223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, bind the creature!', 128222, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taming such a willful beast requires a show of dominance. That is, of course, my specialty... but in this case, I suggest simply pummeling it into submission.', 128221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A few days ago, this fel bat attacked our camp. It\'s a rare treat to capture a mature specimen, so I insisted it be restrained rather than destroyed.', 128220, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidari! Bring out the beast!', 128219, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, Slayer $p, to the breeding grounds of the fel bats. We\'ve captured a fine specimen for you to bond with today.$b$bJust inform me when you\'re ready to see it.', 128218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_FelArakkoa_FelDetonation_Green:20|t Watch out! Avoid |cFFFF0404|Hspell:238005|h[Cataclysmic Force Nova]|h|r! in order to stay on the ship!', '', 128217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never felt so alive!', 128216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Daumyr made quick work of them. Did you hear their screams? Music to my ears!', 128215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horsemen kept those demons contained.', 128214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another batch down! Send them to their graves!', 128213, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 81290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see the Horsemen? Incredible that they\'re holding their own against that throng.', 128212, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 81289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will tremble beneath Daumyr\'s shadow. They\'ll plead for mercy as we rain down death and destruction!', 128211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All those demons... bah! No chance of us being overwhelmed, not when we control the power of Daumyr and her brood.', 128210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready to unveil our secret weapon?', 128209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop me, demons! RISE, SOLDIERS!', '', 128208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow weary of waiting.', '', 128207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Xorothian Ritualists are beginning to cast Cataclysm!', '', 128206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will ensure no more of Kruul\'s minions make it through. Suffer well.', 128205, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 82842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should be able to reactivate their portal. This place teems with usable souls.', 128204, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 82841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Herb_Arrowbloom.blp:20|t%s targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236304|h[Incorporeal Shot]|h|r!', 128203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will go with you, Grandmaster. We have no time to lose!', 128202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive improvisation. If only more of our forces could be entrusted with such missions. Now get out of there before reinforcements find you.', '', 128201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marius and his pet warlock managed to reverse one of the demon portals. Pass through and see what damage you can unleash on the other side.', '', 128200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was... not your fault, Almai! But... we must hurry... to find a cure. Some have already succumbed...', '', 128199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dreadlord attacked me, poisoned my Celebration Brew, and stole my form...', 128198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'ve arrived! We\'ll get the detector up and running while you get acquainted with the island.', '', 128196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Land here, peons. Wait, I smell the stench of HUMANS. Do you hear me humans? This island belong to Burgthok!', '', 128195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to return to the Temple of Five Dawns! Let me know when you\'re ready!', 128194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To falter in the face of danger is not a flaw nor a weakness, rather an opportunity to rise to the call of battle.', 'To falter in the face of danger is not a flaw nor a weakness, rather an opportunity to rise to the call of battle.', 128193, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can make good brew with my eyes closed. But Mistweaving, now that\'s a challenge. I hope to be great at it one day.', 128192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life in the Valley of Four Winds is usually so peaceful, and that\'s a good thing for most. But for me, it\'s also rather dull. I\'d prefer some excitement now and again.', 128191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My family has been making brew for generations, so of course I\'m a natural at it! Still, I\'ve always wanted to try my hand at something different.', 128190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A long wind only blows for so long before the calm sets in. We must remember our training.', 'A long wind only blows for so long before the calm sets in. We must remember our training.', 128189, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must maintain our composure! Show our allies who we truly are, not what those demons expect us to be!', 'We must maintain our composure! Show our allies who we truly are, not what those demons expect us to be!', 128188, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your head, young warrior. Our journey has only just begun.', 'Raise your head, young warrior. Our journey has only just begun.', 128187, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must remain strong.', 'We must remain strong.', 128186, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know it hurts now, but years from now we will look back upon this day and remember all we have fought for, all we have given. This is what makes us who we are.', 'I know it hurts now, but years from now we will look back upon this day and remember all we have fought for, all we have given. This is what makes us who we are.', 128185, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many warriors have sought shelter during a storm, but now is no time for shelter. We must raise our weapons and charge at the heart of nature itself.', 'Many warriors have sought shelter during a storm, but now is no time for shelter. We must raise our weapons and charge at the heart of nature itself.', 128184, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are strong, with blood warmer than summer\'s heat. I assure you they will recover in time, but we must do our part and get back out there! Our people need us!', 'They are strong, with blood warmer than summer\'s heat. I assure you they will recover in time, but we must do our part and get back out there! Our people need us!', 128183, 0, 47028, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am compelled to... ensure... the end of your existence!', 128182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My duty is one mere mortals cannot comprehend. A sacred charge to serve... to serve the master!', 128181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s ride.', 'Let\'s ride.', 128180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come! Your destiny is at hand!', '', 128179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise! Yes... rise!', '', 128178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power courses within you! Destroy these demons!', '', 128177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your commander beckons!', '', 128176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, my soldiers!', '', 128175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this is the best hunter your world has, it is truly doomed!', '', 128174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back for more? My hounds will tear you to shreds!', '', 128173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear no beast! The Legion is endless!', '', 128172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to leave the Deadmines.', 'I would like to leave the Deadmines.', 128171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster! NO!', 128170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... What just happened? What did she mean? Grandmaster, we must return to the temple at once! Let me know when you\'re ready!', 128169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work is complete, puny monks. Your order has already fallen!', '', 128168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much for that.', 128166, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almai, your naivete is so refreshing. Pity you must die!', 128165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster? What are you talking about? We\'ve been searching everywhere for you!', 128164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grandmaster, you have done better than I expected. Seems I will have to deal with you myself!', 128163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Storm Brew is amazing! No wonder the Legion fears it!', 128162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not choose my fate... neither will you!', 128161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know the torment of a soul divided!', 128160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, champions of this world, so that I may cut you down where you stand!', '', 128159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felweaver! Deal with these intruders!', '', 128158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With their commander down and shields disabled, the blue drakes can begin their assault on the ship in earnest. Their sending transport to extract you before they start.', '', 128157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! To me, quickly! We end this now!', '', 128156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drakes are providing us transport up to the Legion ship to deal with the their commander in the area. Once you\'ve dealt with him, they\'ll return to get you before the main assault on the ship begins.', '', 128155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The azure drakes in the area have pledged to help us fight back against the Legion, but they\'ll need your help. Assist them in any way you can.', '', 128154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to go to Broken Shore, Daumyr.', 'Time to go to Broken Shore, Daumyr.', 128153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Daumyr nods to you, a hollow look in her eyes.>', 128152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your precious world will burn!', 128151, 0, 48108, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the honor of Highmountain. I am ready! [Queue for Scenario]', 'For the honor of Highmountain. I am ready! [Queue for Scenario]', 128150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suggest we be quick. The skies are swarming with those foul beasts.\n\nOur opportunity to strike at the heart of the Legion presents itself. We must bring the battle to the frontlines.', '', 128149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero. The tales of your deeds will be sung within the Halls of Valor!', '', 128148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly swiftly, $ct. We will meet you there.', '', 128147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy their cannons and bring down their barriers! Let our valiant Valarjar face them in the true spirit of battle!', '', 128146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These cowardly demons hide behind their defenses. Take my blessed hammer and slay them!', '', 128145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought you could escape by huddling in your puny brewery? The Burning Legion sees all!', '', 128144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are far too late, pathetic creatures...', '', 128143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did the Legion learn about our Storm Brew? We\'ve kept its existence quiet...', 128142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no love of murlocs, but even they don\'t deserve to meet their end in the Legion\'s clutches. Thank you, hero.', '', 128141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such depravity! The demons drain the souls of innocents to power their foul magic. Stop this harvest, hero!', '', 128140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! Every victory is crucial in this war.', '', 128139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our shores are ablaze with fel fire! Strike quickly, before the threat moves inland.', '', 128138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy the chaos...', '', 128137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What delicious irony! The demons are so quick to turn on one another!', '', 128136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insolent pests! Your efforts amount to NOTHING!', 128135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pendulum swings in our favor! Make for the cliffs and dispose of that demon. I will meet you there once we\'ve secured the skies.', '', 128134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... uh... we... are...', '', 128133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not turn my allies into your mindless slaves!', '', 128132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m raising these Thorignir as my soldiers, and Daumyr is next.', 'I\'m raising these Thorignir as my soldiers, and Daumyr is next.', 128131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my peak, $ct.$b$bI am the last remaining ancient watcher of the Drekirjar. I make my home here, tending to the sacred bodies of our allies who gave their lives for our alliance. Skovald may have shattered our alliance with the Thorignir, but there are those of us who do not follow his mandates.$b$bTo this day, the Thorignir die in our joint struggle. It is all I can do to attend them as their bodies return to the snow. With Daumyr as my partner, we protect our charges with our lives.', '', 128130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll get the flame. I\'ve been looking forward to this!', 128129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes! I\'m out of here!', 'Yikes! I\'m out of here!', 128128, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the void-stricken darkness...?', 'What in the void-stricken darkness...?', 128127, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That stings!', 'That stings!', 128126, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rude!', 'Rude!', 128125, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! Why would you do that to me?', 'Ouch! Why would you do that to me?', 128124, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just going to rest for a moment...', 'I\'m just going to rest for a moment...', 128123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see clearly now!', 'I can see clearly now!', 128122, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... am I?', 'Where... am I?', 128121, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness is gone! Thank you, hero.', 'The darkness is gone! Thank you, hero.', 128120, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_IronMaidens_ConvulsiveShadows.blp:20|t The Fallen Avatar targets you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:236604|h[Shadowy Blades]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_IronMaidens_ConvulsiveShadows.blp:20|t The Fallen Avatar targets you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:236604|h[Shadowy Blades]|h|r!', 128119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Sigryn. (Free)', 'I\'m ready to face Sigryn. (Free)', 128118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Kruul. (Free)', 'I\'m ready to face Kruul. (Free)', 128117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Raest. (Free)', 'I\'m ready to face Raest. (Free)', 128116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to take on Xylem. (Free)', 'I\'m ready to take on Xylem. (Free)', 128115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was an honor to meet you, Grandmaster. I hope to see you again soon!', 128114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Agatha... (Free)', 'Take me to Agatha... (Free)', 128113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
