('Everything is green, I can\'t see!', 'Everything is green, I can\'t see!', 128102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aghhhhh! It burns, it burns!', 'Aghhhhh! It burns, it burns!', 128101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
