('', 'Excuse me, $n! Some of those disasters you have previously delayed are now actionable. Please speak with me.', 128089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_INCINERATE.BLP:20|t You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235117|h[Unstable Soul]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_INCINERATE.BLP:20|t You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235117|h[Unstable Soul]|h|r!', 128088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you goin\'?', '', 128087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nuh-uh!', '', 128086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope!', '', 128085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t get past me!', '', 128084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take my boat! Birds to da cannons! Monkeys to da sails!', '', 128083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gift to them is the bliss of ignorance. They will not realize its price until it is too late. What is done is done. I hope I have made the right choice.', '', 128082, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weight of my decision weighs heavy on my heart, but each day I see their carefree smiles eases that burden just a little.', '', 128081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They may never forgive me for what I have done, but at least they will be safe. For now, my family will be safe.', '', 128080, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 81673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the skies of home! I did not believe I would see this world again.', '', 128079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deceiver scorned my talents when I still lived. Let us see which of us survives the battle to come!', '', 128078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! Power still echoes within this ancient golem. It would be prudent to destroy it before the Legion empowers it further.', '', 128077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! This place reeks of the titans!', '', 128076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intriguing use of soul energy. They could have accomplished so much, had they merely applied themselves.', '', 128075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I detest spirits! Always blathering about their former lives. Consume their souls and be done with them!', '', 128074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are a corrupted race. They possess arcane skill, but lack the finesse inherent to my people.', '', 128073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed you do, uncle. But this is a start, I suppose...', 128072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know I have much to answer for.', '', 128071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 80797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DEMONS! ALL OF YA!', 128070, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 82483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That fool saw me as little more than a trinket for harvesting power. He has paid for his lack of vision!', '', 128069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s... happening? Blood feels... like it\'s boiling... I... I...', 128068, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 82473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s blinks, looking puzzled. His eyes glow with fel energy.', '', 128067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon... worshippers?', '', 128066, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 82381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my former master! The time for revenge is at hand!', '', 128065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one is powerful, but stupid. It would make a worthless minion.', '', 128064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know ancient incantations which could tap into the lifeblood of your world. This would be an ideal place to unleash them.', '', 128063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you sense it? The lifeblood of your world flows just under the surface of this place.', '', 128062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And here we are, the site where fools were vanquished. Remember, courage is no substitute for power.', '', 128061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills have improved significantly since we first met. Given a few thousand years, you may even rise to the level of my best apprentices.', '', 128060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is so like Argus... twisted, shattered, and broken. Almost makes me homesick!', '', 128059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your last visit here was nearly the end of you. How fortunate that you now enjoy my company.', '', 128058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you smell the charred flesh upon the wind? Ah, the scent of home!', '', 128057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place holds a mere fraction of the Legion\'s might. There are many horrors yet to behold.', '', 128056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has conquered this shore. Soon we shall conquer the Legion in turn!', '', 128055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take my death gate or open your own. Either way, I\'ll see you in Acherus.', 128054, 0, 48044, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Things are still a bit foggy, but I can stand and fight.', 128053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alana be\'lendor', '', 128052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die for pretty queen!', '', 128051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Kruul. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 'I\'m ready to face Kruul. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 128050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harjatan... no fight... so good...', '', 128049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harjatan... fail... pretty queen...', '', 128048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to smash!', '', 128047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ash\'thero sanguine!', '', 128046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, little friends! Crush!', '', 128045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal, lamer zhita!', '', 128044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More death! More carnage!', 128043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! Fetch me the Tidestone!', 128042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lend aid to our brutish champion!', 128041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions! To battle!', 128040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Useless beast! Why the queen was fond of him I\'ll never know!', 128039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet, you mindless oaf! Kill them!', 128038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Harjatan! Pummel their bones to dust!', 128037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of these failures! Now you will face the true might of the naga!', 128036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incompetents! Must I soil my hands on this rabble?', 128035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weaklings! You dare disappoint our queen?', 128034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay the intruders! Take back what is ours!', 128033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These fools bring the Tidestone to us! Just as our blessed queen foresaw!', 128032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Raest. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 'I\'m ready to face Raest. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 128031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to take on Xylem. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 'I\'m ready to take on Xylem. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 128030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. With the demons slain and the supplies recovered, we are one step closer to securing the Broken Shore.', '', 128028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Petty mortal. You gain nothing! You will bow... or you will BURN!', '', 128027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My pet will swallow you whole!', 128026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The depths will devour you!', 128025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your souls belong to the deep!', 128024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer the chill of the depths!', 128023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death rises to take you!', 128022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sea surges with power!', 128021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feast upon flesh!', 128020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consume them!', 128019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a death... is beneath me...', 128018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! The... indignity...', 128017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Queen Azshara\'s reign is absolute... as ever!', 128016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ten thousand years haven\'t made mortals any less pathetic!', 128015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chumming the waters!', 128014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to feed the fish!', 128013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet your end, mortal filth!', 128012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I claim your lives for Azshara!', 128011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the beach of demonic forces and recover the salvaged supplies for the invasion effort.', '', 128010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wreckage of our prior assault on these shores contains supplies vital to our efforts against the Burning Legion.', '', 128009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so sorry, Delas. I know it is too much to ask your forgiveness, but I must ask for your help.', '', 128008, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... this is your doing? How could you?', 128007, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 81666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their spirits are bound to the Legion, forced to do the demons\' bidding.', '', 128006, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But in the end, the pact I made cursed our ancestors with a fate worse than death.', '', 128005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must understand! I was trying to protect our family...', '', 128004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nerus? Explain yourself, uncle!', 128003, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 0, 81665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last I am free!', '', 128002, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 81669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last! Revenge... revenge is mine!', '', 128001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your resilient spirit resists the foul fel magic!', 'Your resilient spirit resists the foul fel magic!', 128000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Maw of the Damned begins to tug at your grip as you approach the Deceiver.', 'The Maw of the Damned begins to tug at your grip as you approach the Deceiver.', 127999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, hero. You\'ve done the tribes of Highmountain a great service this day.', 127998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is here the Feltotem receive demonic instruction. Cleanse the cavern of their evil and send their masters back to the Twisting Nether!', 127997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mistake. It seems the upstart \"goddess\" still holds sway here. Oh well...', 127996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wardens, secure the cathedral! We will hold here while our allies push into the tomb below.', 127995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me if my glaive finds your heart, Illidan. With so many demons about, it\'s hard to distinguish you from the rest of this filth.', 127994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would regret it if you died by another\'s hand, Betrayer!', 127993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still alive, Maiev?', '', 127992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hold this flank. Can you manage to survive without me, warden?', '', 127991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world... will belong... to the Legion...', '', 127990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh will burn!', '', 127989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The full might of the Legion falls upon you!', '', 127988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their shield has fallen! Leave no survivors!', '', 127987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infernals! Devastate their ranks!', '', 127986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiends! Tear down that shield!', '', 127985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion! Scorch them to the bone!', '', 127984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe hungers for flesh!', '', 127983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A remnant of power lingers in this broken temple. It must be ours! Come, enter the circle and take it.', 127982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shadowy figure pulls a vial of goo from the cauldron.', 127981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one... is strong. No matter! These souls will serve the master well.', '', 127980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Power Leap!', 127979, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 142275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t have time for silly catch phrases. So I\'ll just make an impressive exit instead.', 127978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 142274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You better hope we don\'t meet again.', 127977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 142273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bah! I already have what I came for, anyway!', 127976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 142272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ME!', 127975, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 142271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Besides, if you ever hurt one hair on my sweet tauren\'s head, you\'ll have a REAL problem to deal with...', 127974, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 142270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As if someone so puny could stop us!', 127973, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 142269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trying to foil our plot again? Hah!', 127972, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 142268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey you! You\'re the one the tauren was talking about!', 127971, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 142267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden sends his gratitude for delivering the Aegis into our hands.', '', 127970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must face the Deceiver on his own ground, where he is vulnerable. Come, let us taste his soul!', 127969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me guide your hand as you battle this vessel. Though it retains but a fraction of the fallen titan\'s power, you will not survive its onslaught without my expertise.', 127968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Invaders messily corrupting other invaders... typical. Far more useful to coax them along the proper path, don\'t you think?', 127967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The haughty elves of old had such regard for their own spirits. Such a delicious indignity!', 127966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do enjoy seeing the shrine of a great enemy profaned by the spirits of its own worshippers.', 127965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At times it seems the naga beg for scraps from the Legion\'s table. But the queen they serve wants far more than that.', 127964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From birth, pit lords are oversized and stupid. Somehow the Legion manages to magnify both traits.', 127963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long has this one been a blight upon your world. Not all his schemes came to fruition, but those that did caused untold ruin.', 127962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Legion brute obliterating priceless knowledge... imagine that.', 127961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel the pulse of your world quickening. Soon all will be drenched in its lifeblood.', 127960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your allies consider me a bad influence. Yet all I\'ve ever done is speed you along the path you chose.', 127959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light would have your kind remain obedient and stagnant. I offer the gifts of freedom and strength. I hope you remember my kindness.', 127958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were a good choice. No other wielder has murdered their way across a continent quite like you have. I admire your endurance.', 127957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land has seen so much upheaval. The Cataclysm, the Sundering, the Scouring... you really have no idea.', 127956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It took ages to make my return to the surface after the Sundering. The naga can be so possessive of artifacts.', 127955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This conflict is but a shadow of an ancient war that predated the meddling of the titans. Infinite armies clashed in ceaseless battle. But I\'m sure your little war is impressive... in its own way.', 127954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This trifling skirmish is little more than a distraction. The true battle draws nigh as the circle nears completion.', 127953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final... victory... will be ours...', '', 127952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was here, in ages past, that the God of the Deep lost a great battle to the God of Seven Heads. But as was so often the case, even defeat ultimately worked in N\'Zoth\'s favor.', 127951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That fel edifice towering over this land pales in comparison to the grandeur of what stood here long ago.', 127950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was always a place of power. Aegwynn was drawn here, and before her the elves, and before them the trolls. And before them...', 127949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender the shield and I will grant you a quick death!', '', 127948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How kind of you to bring the Aegis to me!', '', 127947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of these games! Let us see how you fare without your little trinket.', '', 127946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It amuses me to watch you suffer!', '', 127945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot withstand the power of the Legion!', '', 127944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the shadows!', '', 127943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run? Fool! I have led you to the slaughter!', '', 127942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t believe these lands have seen such carnage since the Battle for K\'tanth. Such a long time ago...', 127941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this not the site of what you mortals consider your greatest humiliation? I hope you fare better this time...', 127940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much death here... so much power!', 127939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere left to run, demon!', '', 127938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Posture if you must, Maiev, but for now, do what you do best and follow me.', '', 127937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you really think you could elude me, Illidan? Run again and I\'ll shackle you like the beast you are.', 127936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will track the Dreadlord. You deal with the rest of the filth.', '', 127935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons bar the path ahead, but they cannot withstand our fury.', '', 127934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will continue the hunt for Illidan. You deal with those abominations.', 127933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan left behind a mess! Stay close... we shall carve a path through these demons.', 127932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan! Curse that impetuous demon hunter!', 127931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, our guests of honor have finally arrived. I look forward to ripping those horns from your skull, Betrayer!', '', 127930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere you can flee that I cannot reach you, demon!', '', 127929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it work?', '', 127928, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 82564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Superbly done, Archmage! I never doubted your success. To the Archmage! To the Tirisgarde!', '', 127923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82511, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Business is good.$b$bReal good.$b$b<Nargle tucks a few coins into his pocket.>$b$bMister Noggenfogger will be pleased- keep it up!', '', 127922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Soulstone is in place. Use the Arcane Matrix to fire up the city\'s defenses!', '', 127921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82777, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, nevermind. Just wait until Mograine sees us flying up. He\'ll get chills!', 127920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_BOSS_LORDMARROWGAR:20|tThe %s shudders and retches forth The Desolate Host, overloading the soul conduits!', '', 127919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair enough.', 'Fair enough.', 127918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s causing the stampede, anyway?', 'What\'s causing the stampede, anyway?', 127917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the plan?', 'What\'s the plan?', 127916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look like a warlock to ye? I haven\'t the foggiest clue why. Maybe this is some sort o\' seasonal stampede, where the dreadsteeds are a-runnin for a migration, or matin\' season, or runnin\' from somethin\'...$b$bOr maybe they\'re just runnin\' through here to stop us from easily deliverin\' our brew!', '', 127915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple! Ye ride down on tha barrel. $b$bWith yer fancy footwork ye can dodge tha stampede an\' deliver the brew! As me master always said: \'If ye can dodge a horse on a barrel, ye can dodge a punch.\'$b$bMe trainin\' was... exotic. Look, just hop on tha barrel, keep rollin\' till ye reach the patrol, an watch out for the horses on the way down!', '', 127914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, am I glad ta see ya! Our brothers and sisters\'re fightin\' down tha ramp, but they\'re out of brew!$b$bThese confounded beasts are stampedin\' through, so we cannae roll the barrels down without someone...$b$bThat gives me an idea...', '', 127913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_Defile:20|tWith no souls in the Spirit Realm, %s lashes out with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236507|h[Quietus]|h|r!', 127912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_Defile:20|tWith no souls in the Corporeal Realm, the %s lashes out with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236507|h[Quietus]|h|r!', '', 127911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we\'ll shatter the bones of countless demons!', 127910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SHADESOFDARKNESS:20|t%s begins to release a mass of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236075|h[Wailing Souls]|h|r!', 127909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_SOULLINK:20|t%s chains together living essence with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236449|h[Soulbind]|h|r!', 127908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_WARLOCK_SOULBURN:20|tThe %s begins to emit a series of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236011|h[Tormented Cries]|h|r!', '', 127907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\TRADE_ARCHAEOLOGY_SHARK JAWS:20|t%s calls forth the mighty Sarukel to open his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:234621|h[Devouring Maw]|h|r!', 127906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Butcher_Whirl.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:232722|h[Slicing Tornado]|h|r!', 127905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valarjar of Skyhold! Let these walls resound with cheers for our champion!', '', 127904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That bought us a brief reprieve. My Illidari can hold the line from here.', '', 127903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need everyone on the front line. Another wave of demons is incoming!', '', 127902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion underestimates nature\'s persistence and determination... and yours, I think!', 127901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The very wildlife of Highmountain rises up against the demons! Shatter the infernals and find the source of their incursion.', 127900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Thunder Totem! My riders will hold the skies while you sweep the grounds.', '', 127899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought! Our forces are gaining gr...', 127898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion marches on Highmountain! Our allies have engaged the demons throughout our lands. To turn the tide, champion, you must strike at the heart of their forces!', 127897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No need to track down the sender. The tubes will handle that!', '', 127894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. We simply can\'t have improper mail clogging up the system.', '', 127893, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mage Tower is destroyed, it will be back up soon.', 'The Mage Tower is destroyed, it will be back up soon.', 127891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mage Tower is under attack!', 'The Mage Tower is under attack!', 127890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mage Tower is now under construction.', 'The Mage Tower is now under construction.', 127889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neither snow nor cataclysm nor demon invasion will stay us from our appointed duty. The mail must flow.', '', 127870, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll chase the trolls to their cave and find the Stormhammer Stout!', '', 127869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soren lad, find the boar that stole our Theramore Pale!', '', 127868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jona, Joren, go after the Gnomenbrau! A group of troggs carried it off!', '', 127867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took the kegs!', '', 127866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is as far as I can take you. Let\'s hope your companions are strong enough to get you the rest of the way.', '', 127865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened to me?', '', 127864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I feel sick.', '', 127863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That thing... it got into my head. I couldn\'t stop!', '', 127862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... where am I?', '', 127861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My head... what happened?', '', 127860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened? This isn\'t the lodge!', '', 127859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, catch!', '', 127858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!', '', 127857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think fast!', '', 127856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming at ya!', '', 127855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dodge this!', '', 127854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a lot of movement within the Deadmines. \n\nI suspect the place has been infested with all manner of creatures. Shall we investigate?', '', 127853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me into the Deadmines.', 'Take me into the Deadmines.', 127852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to donate War Supplies to the Mage Tower.', 'I want to donate War Supplies to the Mage Tower.', 127836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I assist you?', 'How may I assist you?', 127835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re so tiny! It\'s like playing with a rabbit.', '', 127834, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fighting style does not impress, nor concern me. You will fall to my strength soon.', '', 127833, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is amusing how you continue to fight, even though you\'re bound to lose.', '', 127832, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport me to the next tavern.', 'Teleport me to the next tavern.', 127831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merry is the day, for we have found the jewelry!', '', 127830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish your drinks! We\'re leaving in less than a minute!', 'Finish your drinks! We\'re leaving in less than a minute!', 127829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve already completed my training.', 'I\'ve already completed my training.', 127828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our riders will take it from here. Continue your fight, champion.', '', 127827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our riders wage war against the Legion in the skies. Give aid to those who have fallen. We must hold this point!', '', 127826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your victory brings hope to the hearts of my people. The Burning Legion will never take our lands!', 127825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can trust me to do whatever is needed.', 127824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My will cannot be broken!', 127823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This defeat will not break me.', 127822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go on without me. I will catch up.', 127821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The weak will always perish.', 127820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There could be no other way.', 127819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the fate you deserve.', 127818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will enjoy this!', 127817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will die by my hand!', 127816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run if you dare, though you will not get far!', 127815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will protect these lands together.', 127814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here to take my place at your side.', 127813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be alert, Huntmaster. We do not know what dangers lurk nearby.', 127812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can stop now, or I can have D\'Bynn stop you.', 127811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are crossing a line that cannot be uncrossed!', 127810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surely you know other tricks?', 127809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a persistant one, are you not?', 127808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like you better when you are silent.', 127807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my attention.', 127806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be safe.', 127805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remain vigilant.', 127804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 127803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you need?', 127802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I help you?', 127801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 127800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do what is needed in the name of the Black Harvest.', '', 127799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will know my power!', '', 127798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
