('Don\'t let me slow you down.', '', 127797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel powerless...', '', 127796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a moment to regain my strength.', '', 127795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was almost too easy.', '', 127794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power grows!', '', 127793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power cannot be matched.', '', 127792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be your undoing!', '', 127791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for our power!', '', 127790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the power of the Black Harvest!', '', 127789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies will fall!', '', 127788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is so much untapped power in this world.', '', 127787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to fight alongside such power.', '', 127786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka should have banished you instead.', '', 127785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really want to wake the demon?', '', 127784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not to be trifled with!', '', 127783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely the leader of the Black Harvest does not have time to waste like this!', '', 127782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is wrong with you?', '', 127781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
