('I will show no mercy!', '', 127725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be judged!', '', 127724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prove myself worthy.', '', 127723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to walk beside you, Highlord.', '', 127722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must pay for my mistakes.', '', 127721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a matter of fact, yes there is.\n\nA wandering shieldmaiden came through just recently, and has set up camp outside of town. She stayed only long enough to purchase supplies and avoided all eye contact while she was here.\n\nI was going to check on her to find out her business here, but you are welcome to go in my stead. You\'ll find her camped on the beach to the east.', 127720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have any vrykul passed through here that struck you as odd?', 'Have any vrykul passed through here that struck you as odd?', 127719, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m keeping my eye on you, outsider.', 127718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am familiar of the Valkyra prophecy of the Faldrottin, but I have not read their text. Let me see the scrolls you found.\n\n<Bryna pores through the scrolls\' text.>\n\nIf these scrolls are correct, that would mean we may have the heir of Skovald in our midst! Regardless of what the Valkyra believe, you would be doing us a service by removing her from here.\n\nSeek out Yngvild in the tower overlooking the town. She keeps a keen eye on the comings and goings of Jandvik, and would have noticed if anyone of note has visited lately.', 127717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slodi mentioned you could help find the vrykul mentioned in these scrolls.', 'Slodi mentioned you could help find the vrykul mentioned in these scrolls.', 127716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard Slodi\'s horn. I take it you are the outsider he was announcing?', 127715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor pups! At least you saved them from becoming slaves of the Legion. Thank you, champion.', '', 127714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know why you dabble in vrykul prophecy, but the scrolls you carry look genuine. I will alert the vrykul of Jandvik to allow you to pass so you may search for the one you seek. \n\nPriestess Bryna is the most scholarly of the village. Perhaps you should seek her out?', '', 127713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know little of prophecies, but we have seen new faces in Jandvik since the fall of Skovald. \n\nYou should speak to Priestess Bryna. Her dwelling is in the center of the town. She may know of this prophecy you speak.', '', 127712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am searching for the vrykul mentioned in these scrolls.', 'I am searching for the vrykul mentioned in these scrolls.', 127711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully, $c. The vrykul of Jandvik are wary of outsiders.', '', 127710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $c. \n\nI know of Toryl\'s edict - you will know no harm by my blade.', '', 127709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is corrupting the wolves of the Howling Hills to attack Skyhorn. These foul rituals must be stopped!', '', 127708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare interrupt me?', '', 127707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something seems... off... about you.', '', 127706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not even try to steal anything. We are watching. We are always watching.', '', 127705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, $ct $n. My fury against the Burning Legion is unending!', '', 127704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you trying to sneak away with something?', '', 127703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work or I shall have you scrubbing the cages of the pits.', '', 127702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare speak to me?', '', 127701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know your place or I shall remind you.', '', 127700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work.', '', 127699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n. I knew you would make it. I\'ll be ready to face the Legion in no time.', '', 127698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s twice I\'ve almost been killed by demons. They will not get a third chance.', '', 127697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not regret this choice, Shadowblade. I will take out any Legion demon or conspirator who crosses my path!', 127696, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 81239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you meet your end!', 'Now you meet your end!', 127695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are in vain.', 'Your efforts are in vain.', 127694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare interrupt a servant of the Legion!', 'You dare interrupt a servant of the Legion!', 127693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end is near.', 'Your end is near.', 127692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your treasures are small and dull. You should give them to me so that I might \"throw them away.\"', '', 127691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who sent you? Was it Ragchomp? Tell him it was Trickletooth that took his shiny. It wasn\'t me!', '', 127690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not be rid of the Grimtotem so easily, child. We will earn our place.', 127689, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snitchlip and Flivvelskag were sent into the maze and never heard of again. Move on or the auditors will send both of us into the maze.', '', 127688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is wrong with your face?', '', 127687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shush. The auditors may hear you.', '', 127686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave my shinies alone!', '', 127685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a nose that is ripe for biting.', '', 127684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that a big pack? Ha! I know squiggs and snifflebits that can carry more than you.', '', 127683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow bored. Tell us what we want to know or face your doom.', 127682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak!', 127681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tire of these games. Speak, or die.', 127680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are they planning, demon?', 127679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not be denied. Speak.', 127678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You WILL give me what I want, demon.', 127677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never stand a chance against the Legion!', 127676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are no match for me and my hounds!', 127675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because I know more about demonic travel than you. Get better.', '', 127674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you beat me through the portal?', 'How did you beat me through the portal?', 127673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transform?', 'Transform?', 127672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, this is where these infernal pickpockets take their trinkets.$b$bWell, while we\'re here we may as well get some of it back. I made you a theft/shopping list of things to go get.\n\nThis would be the part where some magic wielding illusionist tries to make you look like one of them. Bah! Illusions. No commitment.\n\nI am going to TRANSFORM you into one of these things. How is your method acting?', '', 127671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! We must convene the council. Only with their combined strength can we bind a beast of such power.', '', 127670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, enslave the Wrathsteed before it escapes!', '', 127669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 127668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wrathsteed will never be yours, mortal!', '', 127667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cut you down myself!', '', 127666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My worthless minions may have fallen, but I will not let you prevail.', '', 127665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are they insane?! They\'ll destroy us all!', '', 127664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The acolytes are forming a ritual circle. Whatever you do, don\'t leave enough of them alive to complete it!', '', 127663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arax\'ath is protecting his acolytes with a fel shield! You\'ll need to dispel it to take them out!', '', 127662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acolytes! Rain fire upon this insect!', '', 127661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, warlock! The bite of these felhunters is venomous to mortals. It should pose no problem for your demons, though!', '', 127660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hounds will rend the flesh from your bones!', '', 127659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! You dare try to summon my steed?', '', 127658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is open, warlock! Activate the calling stone!', '', 127657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? A mortal wishes to peer into my realm?!', '', 127656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good to see you again, $n.', '', 127655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vae Xoroth!', '', 127654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rak-ath varus mir\'enon!', '', 127653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let us pierce through the Twisting Nether and take what is ours!', '', 127652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hel\'nurath will hunt ya, $c...', 127651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will feed ya to tha dreadsteeds!', 127650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... what am I doing!? Zuriwa will have my head! Get away from me!', 'Wait... what am I doing!? Zuriwa will have my head! Get away from me!', 127649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek Zuriwa... She watches... from her tower.', 'Seek Zuriwa... She watches... from her tower.', 127648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want... our leader? Of course... anything for you...', 'You want... our leader? Of course... anything for you...', 127647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...what am I saying? Die, warlock!', '...what am I saying? Die, warlock!', 127646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...no... I will not... betray the Legion!', '...no... I will not... betray the Legion!', 127645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...enough of this! I\'ll end you, demon!', '...enough of this! I\'ll end you, demon!', 127644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leader, you say..? You can boss me around any time...', 'Leader, you say..? You can boss me around any time...', 127643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? I\'m not leader enough for you?', 'What? I\'m not leader enough for you?', 127642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our leader..? I don\'t know...', 'Our leader..? I don\'t know...', 127641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... if you put it that way...', 'Well... if you put it that way...', 127640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my... what lovely... hooves you have...', 'Oh my... what lovely... hooves you have...', 127639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh... that\'s nice... Wait, what did you want..?', 'Ooh... that\'s nice... Wait, what did you want..?', 127638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the materials you\'ve gathered, we\'re well on our way to claiming the Wrathsteed for our own. \n\nWhile we work on constructing the portal, you should focus your efforts on obtaining a lure that will draw Arax\'ath and the Wrathsteed through.', '', 127637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In order to draw out Arax\'ath, we will need to create a portal capable of a sustained link to Xoroth. This will be far more difficult than our standard portals, and will require substantial resources.', '', 127636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we have preparations to make.', '', 127635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. I knew you would not disappoint.', '', 127634, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 82532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wrathsteed will be mine!', 'The Wrathsteed will be mine!', 127633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While the wyrmtongue knew little of the steed itself, it is clear that Hel\'nurath has thus far only been able to create one. He has gifted it to his greatest general, the fel knight Arax\'ath. The tricky part is that Arax\'ath seldom leaves Xoroth, preferring to command his armies from afar.\n\nHowever, I think we might be able to draw him out. For that, I will require your help.\n\nAre you up to the challenge?', '', 127632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on...', 'Go on...', 127631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me cut right to the chase:\n\nEver since I was \"displaced\" by the Blackrock orcs in the Burning Steppes, I have continued my research into the dreadsteeds of Xoroth in hiding. During one of my rituals, I managed to capture an odd demon from the other side - one of the ones we call a \"wyrmtongue.\"\n\nAfter several weeks of questioning, the demon revealed that Lord Hel\'nurath has been working to create a more powerful steed for the fel knights of Xoroth.\n\nHe calls it the Wrathsteed.', '', 127630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you called me here?', 'Why have you called me here?', 127629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad to make your acquaintance, Netherlord.', '', 127628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet with me in Dreadscar Rift, and I will explain.', '', 127627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much time has passed since we first pierced the veil into the plane of Xoroth, but a new opportunity beckons us back to the realm of the dreadsteeds.', '', 127626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, warlock. I come before your council with a discovery I believe you will find intriguing.', '', 127625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Savor that moment when the rage in a demon\'s eyes gives way to fear. We will break them!', '', 127623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That fiend earned its death a thousand times over. Now it shall suffer the wrath of its vile master.', '', 127622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion cannot run or hide. We will hunt them down!', '', 127621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An impressive victory. Your resolve remains unwavering.', '', 127620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relish the satisfaction of dispatching yet another Legion lapdog!', '', 127619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This game will soon be at an end. The Burning Legion will fall.', '', 127618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every blow struck against the Legion forces them closer to their end.', '', 127617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The growth of your power is most impressive. The Legion knows your name... and fears it.', '', 127616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another of the Legion\'s minions draws near. Eradicate it!', '', 127615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, the unmistakable stench of Legion filth. Seek out the source and destroy it!', '', 127614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a nearby target. Strike swiftly!', '', 127613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A malignant foe is near. Do what must be done!', '', 127612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A target nears. Send this filth back to the Nether!', '', 127611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This agent of the Legion underestimates your might. Make plain the error of its ways.', '', 127610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has unleashed another of its pawns. Dispose of this threat at once.', '', 127609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is fraught with demon filth. A prime target approaches!', '', 127608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another menace eradicated. Excellent!', 127607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory by victory, we push back against  the tide of this invasion. Well done!', 127606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! Your skills are sharper than any weapon of the Legion.', 127605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive! That wretch didn\'t stand a chance.', 127604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was more mercy than the fiend deserved. On to the next target!', 127603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Message delivered!', 127602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fitting end to a vile invader.', 127601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well struck, champion. Remain on your guard.', 127600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A potent threat lurks nearby. Seek it out and destroy it!', 127599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons multiply like rats. Slay this one before it summons more of its foul kin into our world!', 127598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just ahead... a new target. Send it screaming back to the Twisting Nether!', 127597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our scouts report a significant threat in this area. Wipe it out!', 127596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have much work to do. Grant this demon a swift death.', 127595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to deliver a message to the Legion. Send this one back in pieces!', 127594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A threat looms near. Eliminate the target.', 127593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A threat must be dispatched. Be swift about it.', 127592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek the commander? Then face me, weaklings!', '', 127591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fewer fel-corrupted beasts, the better.', '', 127590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pit lords. Bah! They are arrogance made flesh. The essences from those fallen demons may prove useful in further battles.', '', 127589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slayer, you are needed on the front lines. Rip the essences from the demons pouring forth from the Tomb and use these empowered souls to sunder the pit lord in two!', '', 127588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such massive Legion war machines are ill-suited to this terrain. They should think twice before sending another!', '', 127587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not be stopped!', 127586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we will protect our home from the Burning Legion.', 127585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out, folks, Klunk\'s gonna klunk you up!', '', 127584, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, folks, Klunk\'s gonna klunk you up!', 127583, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'D\'Bynn and I will make our way to the lodge, should you need us.', 127582, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, this is not normal weather for this climate. All this Azerite must have gotten the attention of an elemental lord. Be careful. Or kill them. Or both!', '', 127581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sending workers to mine that Azerite seam now.', 127580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, our scouts have located several islands rich in Azerite. Your ship is needed immediately.', '', 127579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance! The Light has granted us this island. Leave, before blood is shed. This is your final warning.', '', 127578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 104031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Loot and plunder, ha ha! Dorp, shoot anything that moves. Sneaky Pete, give those Alliance scum a good stabbin\'. And get me that Azerite!', 127577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 104079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy, got some good stuff here.', '', 127576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your allies in the Lightforged are here to help!', 127575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got some, uh, Horde ships arriving. You might wanna speed things up a bit.', '', 127574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? We\'ve got our orders, the Azerite\'s waiting, just take a look at the table and you let me know when you\'re ready to ship out.\n\nI know, I\'m hard not to look at, I get that a lot, but we\'ve got to focus here.', '', 127573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interrupt our work. This ground belongs to the Legion!', '', 127572, 0, 36777, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land will never heal...', '', 127571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You paladins are so predictable. Come, let us see what power your blade truly possesses...', '', 127570, 0, 34080, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re halfway there, team. Now don\'t let me down.', '', 127568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 105372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The salve worked? I mean... yes, of course it worked. Nicely done, champion.', '', 127567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sent troops to survey this area, only to have them fall prey to the stares of basilisks! Use this magical salve to free our stone-bound scouts.', '', 127566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m never stepping foot near another basilisk again!', 'I\'m never stepping foot near another basilisk again!', 127565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $ct. I\'m going back to camp!', 'Thank you, $ct. I\'m going back to camp!', 127564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long was I stuck like that?', 'How long was I stuck like that?', 127563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Best not test my patience! The storm answers my call!', 127562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is your head as empty as your mug?', 127561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is quite enough, thank you.', 127560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May you sample many brews, my friend!', 127559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You never know what wonders you will see!', 127558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing beats a brew shared between friends.', 127557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One must always make time for new brews.', 127556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why slime move so fast?', '', 127555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good brew requires an abundance of love.', 127554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back! I need your core fragments!', '', 127553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy slime! Slow down!', '', 127552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you had any brew today?', 127551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I learned a new technique called \"Kick the Hornet\'s Nest!\" Shall I demonstrate it on you?', '', 127550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are making it very difficult for me to control my thoughts, little one.', '', 127549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, leave me be. I am meditating.', '', 127548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not rest until the Legion is defeated.', '', 127547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evil cannot take root if our hearts stay pure.', '', 127546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
