('Battlelord $p, when you are ready to face your final challenger, step onto the rune.', '', 127331, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A melee for the ages! Asrea has been so dominant that many spectators considered her unbeatable. It would seem her hubris has ushered in her downfall!', '', 127330, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vaunted Steelhoof defense has fallen before $p\'s skill! But will that skill be enough to best the next challenger?', '', 127329, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An excellent first round! It seems Damrul underestimated the strength of Battlelord $p.', '', 127328, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mage Tower crackles as time stops!', 'The Mage Tower crackles as time stops!', 127327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has begun to corrupt beasts. One of them has taken up residence in a cave amongst the murlocs. It must be eliminated!', '', 127325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better our forces be revived and fighting with us than to serve as fuel for the fel.', '', 127324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erdris must be located. I will scout the hold and send word when it is time to strike. See you soon, $n.', '', 127323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul demons are using our wounded allies as bait! We need every soldier back on the front line. Get in there and get them moving... and be mindful of the shadows.', '', 127322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Savor this victory while you can. I have studied your tactics... learned your weaknesses. Now I will raise my own army within Black Rook Hold!', '', 127321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. Even the most powerful of magics can be undone with the right tools.', '', 127320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huntmaster, gather your flares. Beasts of the shadows are controlling vital ground for the Legion. Reveal these creatures so that our archers might rain destruction down upon them.', '', 127319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... arise... fight the \"Legion\"!', '', 127318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To me, my troops! I require your strength!', '', 127317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call out to your troops, \"my lord\". I will raise them, make them stronger!', '', 127316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes soon.', '', 127315, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 55332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield, Battlelord. You have proven yourself beyond a shadow of a doubt to be the superior warrior.', '', 127314, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Convenient of Erdris to reveal just who we should take care of! They should be near the farmstead. Let\'s go!', '', 127313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! Stop, I... I cannot go on. You\'re clearly the stronger brul here.', '', 127312, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disa, Nethos, Tael\'thos! Form ranks! I want that infestation expunged!', '', 127311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin the final assault. [Queue for Scenario]', 'I am ready to begin the final assault. [Queue for Scenario]', 127310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion will fall!', '', 127309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... have failed.', '', 127308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to open a portal.', '', 127307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82780, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we will crush the Burning Legion, Archmage $n!', '', 127306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 'Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 127303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 'Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 127302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a while since my blade has tasted blood. I wonder if it will be pleased with yours...', 127300, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her blade has felled many a warrior inside this ring. Can the Battlelord find a way to triumph?', '', 127299, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord $p\'s next opponent is Asrea Moonblade of the proud nightborne of Suramar.', '', 127298, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I WILL NOT YIELD TO THE LIKES OF YOU, PEASANT!', 127297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are foolish, $r. But if death is what you need to learn this lesson, then so be it.', 127296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been to this trial thousands of times. And every time, I\'ve shown Odyn that his warriors aren\'t worthy to step into the ring with me.', 127295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You meddle with powers you do not understand, mortal! Your unwillingness to bow will be your end!', '', 127290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_SHADOW_SOULLEECH_1.BLP:20|t%s begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:236133|h[Blooming]|h|r !', '', 127285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bruh...', '', 127284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before the might of the Burning Legion! Your efforts are meaningless, mortals!', '', 127283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demonic presence recedes, but this is no time to be complacent. I await your arrival outside the Temple. It\'s time we press our advance.', '', 127282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Intimidation is a weapon of the Legion. Intelligence is not.', '', 127281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is attempting to repair a fel reaver using an unstable ritual. Go, disrupt their efforts, and turn their own energies against them.', '', 127280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel energies inside those crystals dissipated upon their destruction. Consider their threat neutralized.', '', 127279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Felborne were given gems of insidious power from the Legion. Rip these baubles from their hands and destroy them. The lives of these elves are now forfeit.', '', 127278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This round\'s on $n! Free drinks for the next two minutes!', 127277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bizmo\'s Boom Room has opened its doors to all brawlers, courtesy of $n!', '', 127276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n has turned in enough gold to bend the rules of the arena. Speak to a bouncer if you\'d like to fight against a random brawler!', 127275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s the low-down. You may not have EARNED the right to enter the Boom Room, but someone nicer than you paid me to let you in.\n\nYou\'re good. Come on in. And don\'t make a mess.', '', 127274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re Rank 6, right?\n\nYou\'re good. Come on in.', '', 127273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Bizmo and his team carved this pub into the side of the Deeprun Tram, he took a big risk. Lots of gold went into building this place.\n\nSo he built this VIP Room. The Boom Room, he calls it. Better views of the fight, all the top-shelf drinks you can buy, and the satisfaction of knowing that you can get into an exclusive, members-only club. For you see - he only lets you up if you\'re Rank 6 or higher.\n\nYou want to get into the Boom Room? Keep winning your fights, kid.', '', 127272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the VIP Room Rental Form.>', '<Present the VIP Room Rental Form.>', 127271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion advances on Azsuna! We must thin their ranks to expose the heart of their threat!', '', 127270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was my honor to be welcomed here by Odyn. I will prove his choice in my strength was not misjudged.', '', 127269, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not feel shame when you fall. My defense is impenetrable.', '', 127268, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be my pleasure to crush you.', '', 127267, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you to fight!', 'I challenge you to fight!', 127266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to lift with me, brul?', '', 127265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shield has fended off armies of warriors. I don\'t believe one $r will be able to pierce it.', '', 127264, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if $p\'s skill can break the infamous Steelhoof shield!', '', 127263, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord $p\'s next challenger is Omanawkwa Steelhoof of the Highmountain tribe.', '', 127262, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We might not have been able to hold out much longer. Many thanks!', 'We might not have been able to hold out much longer. Many thanks, $c.', 127261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This brew is especially frothy. It will be just the refreshment I need.', 'This brew is especially frothy. It will be just the refreshment I need.', 127260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh! Fresh, cool brew!', 'Ahhh! Fresh, cool brew!', 127259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons will pay for their crimes a thousandfold. Keep up the pressure!', '', 127258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A resounding strike against the Legion!', '', 127257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each victory bolsters our advance and empowers our forces. Thank you, champion.', '', 127256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our patrol has spotted a powerful foe in this area. Its downfall would set back the Legion\'s presence here significantly.', '', 127255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is rallying around a powerful adversary. We must stop them from gathering more forces!', '', 127254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s presence is strong here. Be ready, champion. The Light must prevail!', '', 127253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will crush the Legion wherever they appear, until they have been driven back for good.', '', 127252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For each we strike down, another shall return. Remain vigilant.', '', 127251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were not prepared!', '', 127250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This rabble dares set foot on Azeroth again. Show them the same treatment they have shown countless other worlds. Eradicate them.', '', 127249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Legion insect has scurried forth from beneath its rock. Demonstrate the might of our armies!', '', 127248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a powerful foe nearby. Strike with all your rage to banish it from our world!', '', 127247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There certainly is a great deal of carnage in the fighting ring today. Moreso than usual, I\'d say. I think I got hit with a tooth.', '', 127246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no desire to rejoin the council, though it is good to be among its members.', '', 127245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n wants to know: Do you feel lucky? Come talk to Lord Winifred Browne and test your... gold-earning potential.', '', 127244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Armies of Legionfall. We must not let this advantage go to waste!', '', 127243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. You have brought us a brief respite from their endless assaults.', '', 127242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well struck, like a true archmage! It doesn\'t have quite the same ring to it...', '', 127241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The presence of this foe poses a great threat to our armies. Defeat it to buy us more time to prepare!', '', 127240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna toss you around like a ragdoll, $r!', '', 127239, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful agent of the Legion is nearby. They are too risky to ignore, you must defeat them!', '', 127238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reports say there is a particularly powerful demon at this location. We should eliminate it quickly!', '', 127236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is he alive?', 127235, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 81813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our first combatants are the mighty Battlelord $p and the infamous drogbar, Damrul the Stronk!', '', 127234, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you\'d prefer I play the role of the monster?', 127233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave me be!', 127232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away!', 127231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to be done.', 127230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not linger.', 127229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, warriors, to the Trial of Rage!', '', 127228, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 83049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your guard up.', 127227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live my life in the shadows.', 127226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blades stay sharp.', 127225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it you ask?', 127224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Netherlord, you\'ve done it! Kanrethad has returned to us.', 127223, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 81812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shall I make a grave for you?', 127222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They say pretty girls make graves.', 127221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit prodding me!', 127220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no end to undeath.', 127219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that all?', 127218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer well.', 127217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My axe hungers.', 127216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Undeath welcomes you.', 127215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 127214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have felled champions and chieftains! You are an insignificant whelpling!', 127213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work! Our troops should be able to stay in the fight until the stampede has finished.', 127212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of our patrols has been trapped behind this stampede! We must bring them Storm Brew to restore their spirits. But how...', 127211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have more power in one finger than you have in your entire body!', 127210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not pester me, child.', 127209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Grimtotem shall rise again.', 127208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your friends close...', 127207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run away, child.', 127206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What would you ask of old Magatha?', 127205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it you want?', 127204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have little time for foolishness.', 127203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not let them siphon his power!', 127202, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 82697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not disrupt this ritual!', 127201, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 82696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kanrethad\'s power belongs to the Burning Legion!', 127200, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 83292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wounds are deep but I\'ve recovered from worse. Soon, the Legion will have my vengeance!', '', 127199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you want a knife to your throat? It\'s kinda my thing.', 127198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you not?', 127197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Knock it off!', 127196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your eyes on the skies!', 127195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the winds support you.', 127194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you later!', 127193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You scratch my back, I\'ll claw yours.', 127192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How\'s it going?', 127191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there danger? I can handle it!', 127190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m prepared! Send me to the Gates of Valor. [Queue for Scenario]', 'I\'m prepared! Send me to the Gates of Valor. [Queue for Scenario]', 127189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared to answer the call of glory, $c?', 127188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot press forward until reinforcements arrive. Fall back, everyone!', '', 127187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard the lady! Everybody out!', 127186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s collapses onto the floor in despair.', 127185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s\'s eyes glaze over as her shotgun falls to the ground.', 127184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not supposed to outlive your grandchildren...', 127183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jarod! He... he\'s gone. We need to fall back until reinforcements arrive!', 127182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Think... I\'ll just... sit a spell...', 127181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... can\'t go on...', 127180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord $p! Over here!', '', 127179, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 81219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re prepared, Battlelord. I\'ve brought supplies with me as well, should you need them.', '', 127178, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re ready to fight, challenge Damrul the Stronk. Then stand on the rune and the fight will begin.', '', 127177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re ready to fight, challenge Damrul the Stronk. Then stand on the rune and the fight will begin.', '', 127176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'ve come prepared, Battlelord. I\'ve brought some supplies with me, should you need them.', '', 127175, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord $p! Over here!', '', 127174, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 81273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, warrior.', '', 127173, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I now know what the shaman meant. I have learned humility, and have grown stronger because of it.', '', 127172, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to our match, warrior. If you should survive to see it.', '', 127171, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem like one of strong will, but my will is stronger. As is my my mind.', '', 127170, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I spoke to the shaman of my tribe, he foresaw a victory for me on this day. Perhaps you should bow out of this one, fellow warrior.', '', 127169, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I misjudged your strength, brul. I used to believe that size mattered, but perhaps I was mistaken.', '', 127168, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s alright if you want to leave. Most of my opponents lose as soon as they look at me.', '', 127167, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d let you work out with me, but these weights are as big as you. Come back when you grow muscles.', '', 127166, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your size probably matches your strength. Puny.', '', 127165, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if your name will be remembered after you\'ve failed...', 127164, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your kind should not be here. This land is OURS, and only we are worthy of entering this tournament!', 127163, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be amusing to see his shame when you fall.', 127162, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn was a fool to choose you as his champion.', 127161, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot let the Burning Legion succeed.', 127160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be stopped!', '', 127159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
