('The contagion will consume you!', '', 127104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion cannot be stopped!', '', 127103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not leave here alive!', '', 127102, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defender of Orgrimmar', '', 127101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar Invaders Slain: $1i', '', 127100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raest may have escaped, but we will track him down. When that day comes, I hope I can count on your help once again.', '', 127099, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You made a wise choice. We will accomplish much together.', 127097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not falter, regardless of what the demons do.', 'We must not falter, regardless of what the demons do.', 127096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I couldn\'t stop myself...', 'I... I couldn\'t stop myself...', 127095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My head... get... get away from that thing!', 'My head... get... get away from that thing!', 127094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what happened?', 'What... what happened?', 127093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chin up, Roland. It appears help has arrived.', 127092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_HUNTER_PET_RAPTOR.BLP:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235886|h[calls]|h|r to her pack!', '', 127091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmm, delicious... like a knife in the dark! Your final mark will be found in Stormwind. This will be the most challenging target yet!', 127090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There he is, against the wall. I hear he is a coward who trusts in his armor to protect him. Demonstrate how wrong he is!', 127089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That death scream... pure music! We have located the next mark in Ironforge, hiding in the shadows of the dwarven council.', 127088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mark is throwing a garden party near the Warrior\'s Terrace. Be wary! Her allies are powerful spellcasters, as is she. And mind the guards.', 127087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, a clean twist of the knife... delightful! Your next mark will be found in Darnassus. I suggest entering through the village below Teldrassil.', 127086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your first mark wears the guise of a humble priest, walking through the city in plain view. Be wary of his crystal golem! Separate them if you can... and keep it quiet.', 127085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember... even though you\'re trying to help them, the Alliance will assume you\'re attacking one of their own.', 127084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t risk you carrying out an assassination in an ally\'s city, but no one will question you taking down a target in the Exodar. While you handle that mark, we\'ll see to the matter in Silvermoon.', 127083, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 81253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor, pathetic marks! There\'s no place they can hide that the shadows cannot find them. Come, pay your colleagues a visit. Lord Ravenholdt has a gift for you.', 127082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! In the most crowded place imaginable---the auction house. Be silent, strike true, and vanish quickly!', 127081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmm, delicious... like a knife in the dark! Your final mark will be found in Orgrimmar. This will be the most challenging target yet!', 127080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There he is, by the bonfire. I hear he is a coward who trusts in his armor to protect him. Demonstrate how wrong he is!', 127079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That death scream... pure music! We have located the next mark in Thunder Bluff, hiding in the shadow of the tauren leader.', 127078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mark is having a tea party in the terrace above the Rogues\' Quarter. Be wary! Her allies are powerful spellcasters, as is she. You\'ll need to find a way to get up there.', 127077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, a clean twist of the knife... delightful! Your next mark awaits in the Undercity. I suggest entering from the sewers to the west.', 127076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your first mark has established himself as a wealthy aristocrat who parades around the city in plain view. Be wary of his arcane golem! Separate them if you can... and keep it quiet.', 127075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember... even though you\'re trying to help them, the Horde will assume you\'re attacking one of their own.', 127074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t risk you carrying out an assassination in an ally\'s city, but no one will question you taking down a target in Silvermoon. While you handle that mark, I\'ll head to the Exodar.', 127073, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 81252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our agents have identified suspected homunculi in Silvermoon and the Exodar.', 127072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demons knew the Illidari would find them if they tried to infiltrate our cities again, so they sent in these... homunculi.', 127071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems Legion dreadlords have found a way to craft undead operatives so lifelike that even I have difficulty detecting them!', 127070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He spoke in coherent thoughts, and his skin... so well-preserved. But a few telltale signs gave him away.', 127069, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not supposed to do that, and it\'s REALLY not supposed to be that color.', 127068, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 81247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But look what happens when I slice right here...', 127067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I consider myself an adept hunter of the undead, and even I didn\'t notice at first.', 127066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadowblade! Over here!', 127065, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 81244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_UNRELENTINGSTORM.BLP:20|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:235766|h[Lightning Nova]|h|r !', '', 127064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Roland. Let us leave this vile place before you get yourself sick again.', 127063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world is dark enough without bringing more shadow into it. You have my thanks, champion.', '', 127062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eredar conjurers are amassing dark forces from the Void. Stop them!', '', 127061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Doesn\'t this place remind you of home?', 127060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surely you have other places to be, Roland?', 127059, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Must you always be so close, Roland?', 127058, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be shielded, heroes!', 127057, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will open a portal to his location, but can\'t hold it open long. Raest must be stopped!', '', 127056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karam insisted on being sent in ahead of you, but I fear he cannot face this challenge alone.', '', 127055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have little information to work from, but it seems he found a way to use the energy of the Twisting Nether to enhance his necromantic magic.', '', 127054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Our mages have pinpointed the location of Raest Magespear within the Twisting Nether!', '', 127053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring down the monstrosity! Nothing gets through!', 'Bring down the monstrosity! Nothing gets through!', 127052, 0, 47714, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My vessel and I are needed elsewhere. Enjoy this... parting gift!', '', 127051, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 81396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d better get back to the fight.', 'I\'d better get back to the fight.', 127050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life, priest.', 'I owe you my life, priest.', 127049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your compassion will not be forgotten.', 'Your compassion will not be forgotten.', 127048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', 'I am in your debt.', 127047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fog is finally lifting...', 'The fog is finally lifting...', 127046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain has lessened. Thank you, $n.', 'The pain has lessened. Thank you, $n.', 127045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks.', 'You have my thanks.', 127044, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aegis of Aggramar must be set in place. We begin on your signal, heroes!', '', 127039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your blades! The demons come!', 'Ready your blades! The demons come!', 127038, 0, 47714, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gunners, open fire upon this mortal scum! Obliterate them with hellfire!', '', 127037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready.', 'We are ready.', 127032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves! The Legion will stop at nothing to capture this prize.', 'Prepare yourselves! The Legion will stop at nothing to capture this prize.', 127031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frost Crux is an item of immense power. It would be foolish to attempt to have more than one in your possession. Once you have unleashed the Frost Wyrm, we will be able to summon another.', '', 127030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we unable to start another ritual?', 'Why are we unable to start another ritual?', 127029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you\'ve curbed their population growth. Good! We don\'t want such abominations spreading beyond these shores.', '', 127028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are simply not prepared to have multiple Rift Cores at once. You still have one in your possession. Once you have unleashed it, we will begin charging another.', 127027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harpies are distasteful enough, but harpies pledged to the Legion? Intolerable! Keep this new threat under control, champion.', '', 127026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we unable to power the Rift Core?', 'Why are we unable to power the Rift Core?', 127025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late, mortal! My command center has just arrived!', '', 127024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Might of Dalaran can only be channeled once. You appear to still have a Focusing Crystal in your possession. Once you have unleashed it, my mages will be able to form another for you.', 127023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we not able to focus another crystal?', 'Why are we not able to focus another crystal?', 127022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Infernals are tricky things, and extremely powerful. We must be cautious with them. You still have a Phylactery in your possession, it would be foolhardy to hold more.', 127021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can we not summon another Infernal?', 'Why can we not summon another Infernal to unleash?', 127020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, we cannot rally another assault until you have deployed your currently assembled troops.', 127019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I unable to rally the Val\'kyr?', 'Why am I unable to rally the Val\'kyr?', 127018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are dangers ahead, traveler. A sickness has taken over the area.', 'There are dangers ahead, traveler. A sickness has taken over the area.', 127017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that was unfortunate. Surely someone with your skills can revive him?', 127016, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, we only have enough troops to have a single Vanguard ready for deployment at a time. Once you have given your orders, we will be able to request another.', '', 127015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can\'t I send out the call for another Vanguard?', 'Why can\'t I send out the call for another Vanguard?', 127014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cease your bickering! We have a ship to save!', 127013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82833, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no time for nasty insinuations, S\'theno my dear. They took out our weapons first thing. If you help kill these foul creatures, we can see about making repairs!', 127012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81491, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They should never have gotten sso close, Malevolence. Why did the Fel Hammer not fire on them?', 127011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82589, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cue awesome scene of the Fel Hammer destroying one of the Legion ships and the others jumping away!', 127010, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are right, S\'theno. Either we risk it or we are dead anyway. Slayer $n, we need to get to the main console upstairs!', 127009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Highlord. You have brought peace to my ancestors.', 127006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highlord, the weapon you wield is needed to free these felbound spirits. Destroy their pendants and release my ancestors from their ancient curse.', 127005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, champion. May their spirits finally know peace.', 127004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits within these ruins are bound to the Burning Legion through an ancient pact. Lay them to rest so that they may know peace.', 127003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever need another one of those, come talk to me. I\'ll hook you up.', '', 127002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How magnificent! Enjoy your creation before the magic fades.', '', 127001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should get checked.', 'You should get checked.', 127000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that the remains of those buried in these ruins have magical properties. Let us put these rumors to the test! Recover their ancient bones and place them upon the ruined altar.', '', 126999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Screw this, I\'m making my own mage order... with Hearthstone... and succubi! On second thought, forget the mage order!', '', 126998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you don\'t mind if I take a cut.', '', 126997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m charging extra for this...', '', 126996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! Stop hitting me! Hit the hero!', '', 126995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can do better.', 'I can do better.', 126994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are never ever getting back together.', 'We are never ever getting back together.', 126993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just not that into you.', 'I\'m just not that into you.', 126992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought it was you!', 'I thought it was you!', 126991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was only the one time.', 'It was only the one time.', 126990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m billing you... for my repairs.', '', 126989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was only the one time.', 'It was only the one time.', 126988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what you get for not leaving a tip!', '', 126987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really should start charging by the corpse.', '', 126986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should see other people.', 'We should see other people.', 126985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I know I\'m good.', '', 126984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not you, it\'s me.', 'It\'s not you, it\'s me.', 126983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I better be getting hazard pay for this...', '', 126982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can still be friends.', 'We can still be friends.', 126981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I got a trick for you, pal!', '', 126980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to eat fluffy, cotton-tailed death!', '', 126979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn them! Let\'s go!', 126978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82831, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a hand?', '', 126977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick a card, any card!', '', 126976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, welcome! Help yourself to some free drinks and food.', 'Welcome, welcome! Help yourself to some free drinks and food.', 126975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last call! I\'m opening a portal to the next tavern!', 'Last call! I\'m opening a portal to the next tavern!', 126974, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go, everyone! We\'re heading to the next tavern!', 'Let\'s go, everyone! We\'re heading to the next tavern!', 126973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we\'ve done enough relic huntin\' fer one day. Let\'s give the spirits time ta settle down. Enjoy yer spoils!', '', 126972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got an ace up my sleeve!', '', 126971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruins as old as these are packed with rarities that would delight any collector. Recover whatever relics ye can, but beware o\' the spirits still lingerin\' about!', '', 126970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Great Akazamzarak is ready for action!', '', 126969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got the spells if you got the coin!', '', 126968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s show these bozos a trick or two.', '', 126967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c, do you wish to research more about your artifact? \n\nI would like to assist you, but it appears you might still be carrying Artifact Research Notes. Reading them will further your knowledge.', 'Hello, $c, do you wish to research more about your artifact? \n\nI would like to assist you, but it appears you might still be carrying Artifact Research Notes. Reading them will further your knowledge.', 126966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest for now, hero. You have earned it.', '', 126965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Hold the line against the Legion\'s forces. Join our allies on the front and stand your ground!', '', 126964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion tricked us! Their attacks were merely a diversion while they established a foothold upon the isle of Shield\'s Rest!', '', 126962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion dares to assault Stormheim! Remove their foul presence from this land, champion, and glory shall be yours!', '', 126961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, but can you do it again?', 'Good, but can you do it again?', 126958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re improving.', 'You\'re improving.', 126957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent strategy.', 'Excellent strategy.', 126956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t give up.', 'Don\'t give up.', 126955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try harder.', 'Try harder.', 126954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again!', 'Again!', 126953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you are ready.', 'It seems you are ready.', 126952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful.', 'Pitiful.', 126951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin.', 'Let us begin.', 126950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your help, we can now develop a reliable cure for this poison.', '', 126949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our troops were carried away by an aranasi to feed her foul brood! Kill these arachnids and gather their venom sacs so we can develop a cure to their toxins.', '', 126948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our troops are arriving back at camp safe, sound, and most importantly, free of poison. Well done!', '', 126947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An aranasi has seized our troops to feed her deadly brood. Grandmaster, we must rely on your ability to slay that demon and Detox the captives to save them from the poison!', '', 126946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting out of here!', 'I\'m getting out of here!', 126945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was getting weaker by the second! Thank you.', 'I was getting weaker by the second! Thank you.', 126944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Grand Master.', 'Thank you, Grand Master.', 126943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions have awoken the spirits!', 'Your actions have awoken the spirits!', 126942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At most we have slowed our enemy. There will be more, and we must be ready.', '', 126941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Descend upon our enemy and break their foothold on this plane! Leave them no ground to cling to and show them no quarter!', '', 126940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this!', '', 126939, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 81401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is retreating! Leap from their vessel! Trust the hippogryphs to catch you!', '', 126938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again? It will take me ages to put this armor back on. Hmph.', 'Again? It will take me ages to put this armor back on. Hmph.', 126937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the materials you asked for, Alard.', 'Here are the materials you asked for, Alard.', 126936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While patience is a virtue, we no longer can afford its luxury. Prepare yourself.', '', 126935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you really believe your companions are ready to join our assault?', 126934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Train or perish. Out here, there are no second chances.', 126933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure Grayson will be pleased to see what we accomplished. Send him my best.', '', 126932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And there she is! Some of my finest work, if I do say so myself! You may take it now.', '', 126931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And last but not least, the jewel!', '', 126930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now if I just hammer the leystone in here... aaand here...', '', 126929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First I gotta just smelt all this ore...', '', 126928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s get this barding upgraded!', '', 126927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I live, but I\'m in no condition for battle. Hurry, champion, you must stop him!', '', 126926, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 81408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Turning the might of those big bruisers against their own was a... smashing idea!', '', 126925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga pose a persistent threat to our efforts. We\'ve subdued one of their brutes to use against them. Ride it into battle against the naga!', '', 126924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Shadowsong. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 'Send me to Shadowsong. (100 Nethershards |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_datacrystal01.blp\n:16|t)', 126923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to return, Grayson.', 'I\'m ready to return, Grayson.', 126922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready to return to the order hall, Highlord and I\'ll see to our safe return there.', '', 126921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re ready to leave, speak with me and I\'ll see to our safe return.', '', 126920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us reconvene at the Sanctum of Light. There you can bard the beast safely.', '', 126919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast is bound, Highlord! The Light has favored us this day!', '', 126918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horse! Quickly, contain it!', '', 126916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Raemien shall spread the plague over this land once more and all will bow before me!', '', 126915, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your pathetic rabble will be added to my ranks of undead!', '', 126914, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOOKING FOR SOMETHING?! HA HA HA!', '', 126913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s taken it! This does not bode well...', '', 126912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is his body?! It should be here!', '', 126911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll bring up the rear while we\'re inside dealing with Rivendare.', '', 126910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MOUNT UP, PALADINS! WE RIDE!', '', 126909, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 82499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done! The barding is ready. Now we go to Rivendare\'s crypt to confront his specter.', '', 126908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll apply the water to the barding. The rest, Highlord, lies with you and your weapon.', '', 126907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent job recovering the water, Highlord. And you have my deepest thanks for saving my paladins.', '', 126906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over?! Is this real? Highlord, it\'s you... I... I think I can make my way back. Thank you.', 'It\'s over?! Is this real? Highlord, it\'s you... I... I think I can make my way back. Thank you.', 126905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It felt like my soul was being slowly ripped from my body. The necromancer, he... I must get to Grayson.', 'It felt like my soul was being slowly ripped from my body. The necromancer, he... I must get to Grayson.', 126904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They swarmed us. I... I tried to fight, but... Thank you Highlord for saving me.', 'They swarmed us. I... I tried to fight, but... Thank you Highlord for saving me.', 126903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast on their entrails, Rotmouth!', '', 126902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take in the fumes of Pestulon and become one with my army!', '', 126901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Osseine shall grant you a swift death!', '', 126900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late to save your allies, paladin. Their souls fuel my army...', '', 126898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city belongs to the dead! And soon, so shall you!', '', 126897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your quest here is futile, paladin! This city shall spread death once again...', '', 126896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps someone of your skills would be better suited to recover the water. Please, take a pair of my paladins with you. Who knows what\'s still lurking in this place.', '', 126895, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sent in three of my best men to search for it, but they\'ve not returned. I fear for their safety.', '', 126894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Highlord $p. I\'ve been making preparations for the ritual to cleanse the barding. But so far, we\'ve been unable to secure the holy water.', '', 126893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us deal with Commander Can\'tomas. (requires Brimming Keystone)', 'Let us deal with Commander Can\'tomas. (requires Brimming Keystone)', 126892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us deal with Commander Erdris. (use Jarod\'s free keystone.)', 'Let us deal with Commander Erdris. (use Jarod\'s free keystone.)', 126891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grim and dangerous task awaits us, $n. These two demanded to come along to \"make sure we got it done right\". They should not have to do this.', '', 126890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll... pay for this! You\'ll... pay...', 126889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... My pretties!', 126888, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have safeguarded our forces from a most unpleasant aerial assault. Hmm, perhaps the Illidari can make use of the juveniles you scared off...', '', 126887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But first, you must be punished for taking away my little pet.', 126886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 85036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, my sayaad tempt your weak-willed mages. Your allies will surrender willingly to the Legion!', 126885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late! Levia\'s power is mine! Using her knowledge, my minions will infiltrate the Kirin Tor and dismantle it from the inside!', 126884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felbats! I detest those winged fiends! Not only do they harass our forces, they breed like rabbits. We need to thin their numbers!', '', 126883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 85213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The imp mother must be stopped! Good luck, champion.', 126882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Her location is well shielded, but our Kirin Tor mages should be able to open a portal to her for a short time.', 126881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By now, she has likely harnessed much of the power she stole from Levia. If so, there\'s no telling what she\'s capable of.', 126880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, I\'m glad I reached you. As Victoria no doubt informed you, we have located the imp mother, Agatha.', 126879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Act quickly! The Legion will soon overrun us.', 126878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop by Bradensbrook once in a while, plenty of birds left to shoot down!', 126877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pleasure working with you! Thanks for saving our town.', 126876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. We stopped the Legion from driving a wedge into our forces. The Kirin Tor will be pleased to learn of our victory. They gave me something to see your way back to them.', '', 126875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you have found peace, commander.', '', 126874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hold is... lost...', '', 126873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A spirit can endure much, but being consumed over time by fel energies is torment beyond the mortal mind\'s comprehension.', '', 126872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Legion vessel fell, it released what remained of the souls used in its creation. These souls wail in agony, lost in ceaseless pain. Please, free them from this torment!', '', 126871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, soldiers! Embrace my gift and bring an end to the Legion!', '', 126870, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot allow you to menace the living any longer, Erdris!', '', 126869, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 82364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us be about it, then.', '', 126868, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, champion. Something is emerging from the portal... something powerful!', '', 126867, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 81407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power of the fel!', '', 126866, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 81400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold a moment and catch your breath. Then we move.', '', 126864, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves. Erdris has been bewitched by the Legion and sees only enemies.', '', 126863, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it! Praise Elune! I doubt we had much time left.', '', 126862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your efforts, the prisoners have both their freedom and their lives. Well done.', '', 126861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prisoners are being held in this area. Do whatever you must to free them, champion!', '', 126860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They gave their lives willingly, and have earned their rest. You have done well.', '', 126859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Feltotem tauren are defiling the bodies of the fallen. No one deserves this fate. Lay them to rest, champion.', '', 126858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals! Did you truly believe the Burning Legion would be so easily defeated?', '', 126857, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 81399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lexera does not take kindly to those who meddle in her business!', '', 126856, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Beckon the tadpole to follow you.>', '<Beckon the tadpole to follow you.>', 126855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How pathetic! Syrenne has taken to compelling outsiders to do her bidding?', '', 126854, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not stop us!', '', 126853, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Send Modera my regards, $c. And... thank you.', 126852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be... behind you...', 126851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once again I must clean up your mess, brother!', '', 126850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless! Stand aside while I do what you cannot, brother.', '', 126849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gll grm grmurrmr?', '', 126848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[OLD DNT] Quickly, $ct, we need you on the front lines!', '', 126847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rogue has infiltrated our city!', 'A rogue has infiltrated our city!', 126846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for me!', 'Death comes for me!', 126845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Help!', 'Help! Help!', 126844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spies sent from the Legion are here!', 'Spies sent from the Legion are here!', 126843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take me down, villain!', 'You will not take me down, villain!', 126842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assassins are here!', 'Assassins are here!', 126841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens, aid me!', 'Citizens, aid me!', 126840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! I am under attack!', 'Help! I am under attack!', 126839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Excellent specimens, Deathlord. Here, you may find this useful.', '', 126838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me, Highlord. I... I need some time alone with my thoughts.', 126837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intriguing use of necromancy. Dark magic has its uses.', '', 126836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pet lich professes to have a plan that requires the bones of those sacrificed to the fel. Help him if you think it will aid our cause, but keep that... thing... in check.', '', 126835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in flame!', '', 126834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At every turn, the Burning Legion finds new ways to pervert the worlds they invade.', '', 126833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tormented dead are heeding the call of their demonic masters. Strike them down!', '', 126832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t regret it, Archdruid! Ready to jump into action!', 126831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though employing Kathra\'natir\'s prison to power Dalaran\'s defenses may not be a long-term solution, I am relieved that the demon\'s essence remains contained. Come, let us return to the Hall of the Guardian.', '', 126830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82776, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dag blast it!', 126828, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 82479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are mine!', '', 126827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uhhhh! My head...', 126826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This gate is closing--look out!', '', 126825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', '', 126824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can expect more defenders within. With Lord Ravencrest gone, I would wager Erdris now occupies his chambers. He always thought very highly of himself.', '', 126823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... was... that!?', 126822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hunt you down, $c! Mark my words!', 126821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shattered my illusion! Insolent wretch!', 126820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! With the fel reaver destroyed, a heavy blow has been struck to the Legion\'s forces.', '', 126819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear for the lives of our allies if something is not done about this fel reaver.', '', 126818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! It cannot be!', 126817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, you are a strong one. Breaking you will be ever so fun!', 126816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO! What have you done! I will make you suffer!', 126815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage, I was impressed to learn you captured the demon Kathra\'natir within the Nightborne Soulstone. Devising a containment shield that allows us to harness his power safely was ingenious!', '', 126814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82775, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come then, $c. Entertain me.', 126813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While Levia has kept me quite satisfied, it would be rude of me to turn down such a gift.', 126812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the Kirin Tor wishes to send me more playthings?', 126811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Ravencrest may be derelict in his duties, but I am not. Soldiers, attack!', '', 126810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better to kill \'em here than have \'em tramplin\' my crops! Let\'s be about it, elf.', 126809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No way I\'m staying behind! The attacks on my town must be stopped!', 126808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrival is well-timed. I expect the attack to come at any moment. Before it does, let me urge the two of you to return to Bradensbrook. This doesn\'t need to be your fight!', '', 126807, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 82365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fshoo has withered. May her spores sail forever on the Zangar winds!', '', 126806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fshoo comes!', '', 126805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fshoo cannot survive long aboveground without your help. We need healers, medics, and mushroom-menders to protect her!', '', 126804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention, sporelings! Honorary sporelings! Attend the spectacle of the growing of Fshoo!', '', 126803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhambar picks up Levia\'s trail!', '', 126802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go find Levia, Fhambar!', 'Go find Levia, Fhambar!', 126801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhambar patiently awaits the command to follow Levia\'s trail.', '', 126800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll get the cranes to safety. One day, when the Broken Shore is free of demons, their chicks\' chicks can finally be returned home.', 126799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... sleepy.', '', 126798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of playing with the living.', '', 126797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I return to my slumber!', '', 126796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crocolisks in Jagged Cove are encroaching on a sedge of saltwater cranes. Help me gather up those poor birdies so we can get them to safety!', 126795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! This demon invasion has destroyed so many habitats on the Broken Shore. The wildlife has nowhere to go!', 126794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill the Imp Servants before they energize Agatha!', 126793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the help! Those demons are like gnats compared to Goldrinn, but with so many of them, who knows what could have happened...', 126792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goldrinn needs our help! A demon decided to cheat the hunt by bringing in backup. Let\'s give him a taste of his own medicine!', 126791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fine hunt. Good work out there, Archdruid!', 126790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goldrinn has his prey cornered, but we should lend a hand. And by hand, I mean talon, claw... or other stabby thing!', 126789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fhambar has the scent. Meet him on the other side of the portal and he\'ll lead you to your missing mage.', '', 126787, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 82549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect me, my children! I will give you the power!', 126786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka, are you there? Do not let them take me! I could not endure such a fate!', '', 126785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of these games!', '', 126784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return me to the terrace.', 'Return me to the terrace.', 126783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] A Legion ship materializes in the distance.', '[PH] A Legion ship materializes in the distance.', 126782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our troops will make good use of these supplies. Well done, champion.', '', 126781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! We\'ve spotted the wreckage of a Horde airship. Secure its cargo before the Legion does.', '', 126780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have dealt a heavy blow to the Legion, $n. The cleansing has begun. I await your return.', '', 126779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_felrainoffire:20|t The Legion ship has started a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:235085|h[Fel Bombardment]|h|r! Watch out!', '', 126778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!', 'Yes!', 126777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy Balloon Day! Interested in a balloon ride?', 'Happy Balloon Day! Interested in a balloon ride?', 126776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have waited a long time for this, Cazarian! Now the whip is in the other hand!', 126775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, this whip isn\'t just for show. Say the word, break my contract, and I can show you what wonders it can do...', 126774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should join me here sometime when I am not bound by my contract. Oh, the things I could show you...', 126773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So you mortals think you can win against the Legion? That is so precious. You are like an adorable collection of rodents that haven\'t noticed the large predator stalking you.', 126772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, I hate these ships. So drab, not enough chains.', 126771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you see the Cazarian here speak up. He and I have unfinished...business.', 126770, 0, 47524, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tehd promised we could burn this place to ash.', 126769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For being on a ship of the Burning Legion, it is not very warm here.', 126768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am cold. My outfit was meant for inferno worlds mostly on fire.', 126767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you find a cloak on this one, I want it.', 126766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooo... giving up already?', 126765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmm. I suppose I should have told him the safe word.', 126764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that was a mean one.', 126763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is as if these demons can\'t handle a bit of whip...', 126762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Ugh, they do not build these demons like they used to.', 126761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It died. Pity. I might have had a use for that one.', 126760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you expect me to do ALL of the work?', 126759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My \"master\" ordered me to help you, so try not to die.', 126758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!', '', 126757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us, $ct! The Legion is pushing us back!', '', 126756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the terrace.', 'Send me to the terrace.', 126755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh!', '', 126754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... something\'s wrong! I can\'t... control...', '', 126753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The runes are activated. Stabilize the portal.', 'The runes are activated. Stabilize the portal.', 126752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you figured out these runes yet? We don\'t have much time!', '', 126751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done.', '', 126750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The runes seem to be working! The fel energy is subsiding...', '', 126749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'ll attempt to stabilize the portal. I hope you know what you\'re doing, $c!', '', 126748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can keep it open, but I\'ll need your help to stabilize it...', '', 126747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! The rifts are subsiding, but the portal remains too volatile to follow through.', '', 126746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the top of Black Rook Hold.', 'Take me to the top of Black Rook Hold.', 126745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had to... get away! Had to... warn you...', 'Had to... get away! Had to... warn you...', 126744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stop them...', 'You must stop them...', 126743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Halls of Valor echo with the songs of those you rescued. Magnificently done!', '', 126742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of the fallen cry out as Legion hounds drain their life essence. Free the spirits from their torment and purge the Legion filth!', '', 126741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go.', 'I\'m ready to go.', 126740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, Highlord. Lord Grayson waits inside for your arrival.$b$bHe\'s currently overseeing the preparation for the purification of the barding.$b$bWhen you\'re ready to enter, I will escort you inside.', '', 126739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need a victim... er... volunteer to go through a portal and thin the ranks of demons on the other side. Talk to Tehd, he can provide a loaner demon to get you started.', 126738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all for today. Thank you for flying... and study up next time!', '', 126737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good guess! The correct answer is: \"An illusion! What are you hiding?\"', '', 126736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Final question, for $n. What is the traditional greeting used in Suramar City?', '', 126735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very close! The answer I was looking for was \"their skin\".', '', 126734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n. What specific feature of Nightborne anatomy has been \"enhanced\" by excessive mana use?', '', 126733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consuming so much mana has had an effect on the Nightborne\'s bodies.', '', 126732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The substance they consume is, of course, mana.', '', 126731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, can you tell me what mind-altering substance the Nightborne use to relax?', '', 126730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Among other things, the Nightborne are known for being rather disagreeable.', '', 126729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One must admit the magic of the Felborne possesses a certain... flare. A pity they abuse its potential. They met the end they deserved.', '', 126728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suramar, as we all know, is home to the Nightborne elves.', '', 126727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite the talkative bunch. On with the tour!', '', 126726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. And, last on the list is $n. That must be you, correct?', '', 126725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Do we have a $n in attendance today?', '', 126724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, just say \"here\".', '', 126723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n? Is $n here?', '', 126722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first, I will be taking attendance.', '', 126721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we will be taking a scenic balloon tour over the ancient city of Suramar.', '', 126720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! Please step into the basket... and prepare for the most educational balloon ride of your life.', '', 126719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, the balloon ride is over! That was FUN!', 126718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, my turn\'s over. Somebody else go next!', 126717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And that leaves $n to marry! I could live with that.', 126716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... I would slay $n. For obvious reasons.', 126715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you\'ve got a nice face, and it looks like you\'re the only one here who brushes $Ghis:her; teeth. I would kiss you.', 126714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll go first! Let\'s see...', 126713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s easy. You just have to pick one person you would kiss, one you would marry, and one you would slay.', 126712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, ooh, I\'ve got one! It\'s called Kiss, Marry, Slay.', 126711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... any of you know some balloon party games?', 126710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, I\'m not a very experienced tour guide.', 126709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See all that stuff down there? That\'s... uh... that\'s Stormheim.', 126708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome aboard! Today I will be your guide on a tour of Stormheim.', 126707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the most cathartic balloon ride I\'ve ever had. It was even sort of fun. Thanks, all of you!', '', 126706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t forgotten about you, $n. Tell us a secret. We won\'t judge. This is a safe balloon.', '', 126705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about you, $n? Do you have any secrets burning a hole in your heart?', '', 126704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, give it a try. Tell us something you\'ve never told another soul before. Go ahead.', '', 126703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you know my secret. What about you?', '', 126702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feels good to get that off my chest. I\'ve never told that to anyone before.', '', 126701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow.', '', 126700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Whew.', '', 126699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this good enough for you, father? Huh? ARE YOU PROUD OF ME NOW, DAD?!?!', '', 126698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I HATE balloons. Hated them all my life. All I ever wanted to do was be a shaman, but no! Apparently \"ballooning is in our blood\".', '', 126697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a confession I\'d like to make to the three of you.', '', 126696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what? That\'s it. I\'ve HAD it!', '', 126695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Below us, to the right, you will see Pang\'s Stead. Be sure to keep an eye out for...', '', 126694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. Yes! YES! Not so fun to be on the receiving end, is it? Legion scum!', 126693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sigh>...', '', 126692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the balloon ride to Halfhill. Please keep your hands and off-hands inside the basket at all times.', '', 126691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MORE balloon riders? Fine, come on in... I guess.', '', 126690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let the three of you talk amongst yourselves. I need to make sure I don\'t crash this balloon into Dalaran.', '', 126689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or you, $n? What tales of exploration do you hold dear?', '', 126688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you, $n?', '', 126687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about you, $n? To what exotic lands have you traveled?', '', 126686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Netherlord, one of our warlocks has opened a portal to a Legion carrier brimming with demons. I suggest you show these vermin what it means to be the puppet of a greater power!', 126685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mages of the Tirisgarde need help investigating the Felborne occupying the Weeping Terrace. This wand may come in handy for removing their magical enhancements.', '', 126684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, pardon me for blathering on. No doubt the the tales of your own adventures are much more exciting!', '', 126683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After all the journeys I\'ve been on, I still remember that day the most clearly.', '', 126682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just over that ridge lies Sholazar Basin. There I met tribes of wolvar and murloc oracles. Such strange creatures!', '', 126681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... but I do have fond memories of my time here in Northrend.', '', 126680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sad to say that despite all my travels, I never spent much time here. I couldn\'t tell you why.', '', 126679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Below, you will see Crystalsong Forest.', '', 126678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard. Please sit back and enjoy the ride.', '', 126677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach... looks like we\'re gonna come in pretty close. Everybody wave hello to Thunder Totem!', '', 126676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or even you, $n. Someone cheer me up!', '', 126675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How \'bout you, $n?', '', 126674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you got any?', '', 126673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even shootin\' critters from a hot air balloon can cheer me up.', '', 126672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lately, though... eh, I dunno. Been feelin\' a bit down. Huntin\' don\'t bring the same joy it once did.', '', 126671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bought this balloon from a wee goblin. Claimed it\'d make a good perch fer shootin\' moose!', '', 126670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friends, to the Nesingwary balloon tour o\' Highmountain!', '', 126669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
