('The trick is, ya don\'t reveal the price to the customer \'til they\'re up in the balloon with ya!', '', 126665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya might be wondering how I can run such a classy balloon outfit and still turn a profit. Well, lemme tell ya.', '', 126664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure thing, boss.', '', 126663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
