('Hot towel? Only the best for our customers!', '', 126661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the Nar\'thalas Academy down there. A school for mages back in ancient times, I hear.', '', 126660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anybody for caviar? We got only the best!', '', 126659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we\'re flying over Azsuna, the jewel of the Broken Isles.', '', 126658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s about some free drinks? Here ya go!', '', 126657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
