('', 'I\'ve got this baby tricked out with a chronal accelerator I bought super cheap! Time is literally gonna fly! What could go wrong?', 126648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boy, are you guys in luck! This ain\'t gonna be your standard, sleepy, ultra-slow balloon ride.', 126647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome aboard!', 126646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When our war against the Legion ends, let us hope the Earthen Ring finds a way to restore balance to this scarred land.', '', 126645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, the shaman of the Earthen Ring are striving to counter intense fel curses plaguing this land. They need your aid in battle while they carry out their cleansing rituals.', '', 126644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Farseer. Your shaman can take it from here.', '', 126643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farseer! Elementals of pure felfire scorch the land with their curses. Please, cleanse those who battle these creatures and purge the magic these monsters wield.', '', 126641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry to the northern end of the ramparts! A dark presence rises atop the keep!', '', 126640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A demon stronghold in Black Rook? Remove the fiends at once!', '', 126639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I DESERVED ZHIIISSS!', '', 126638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Night Watch knows a thing or two about tracking. In Duskwood, creatures lurk in every dark nook and cranny.$b$bSometimes you catch a glimpse of their beady little eyes, peering at you from the bushes.$b$b<The watcher tries to suppress a shudder.>$b$bWhy, just the other day I sensed an unfamiliar creature stalking me in the forest, watching from the shadows.', '', 126637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Very goot. Now ve sit in silence for zhe next hour.', '', 126636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ve vill all have a very nice balloon ride, and ve are goink to enjoy it. Is zhat clear?', '', 126635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhese are zhe rules. Obey zhem, or be dealt vizh.', '', 126634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
