('Feel the power of the Light!', '', 126626, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreamweavers have lent their hippogryphs to carry you to the Legion\'s vessel. Eliminate the commander leading this assault, and the rest of these cowardly demons will retreat. Good luck, champions!', '', 126625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
