('Hmm... Laurence... let\'s see...\n\nOh yes, she was in the other day. She was looking for a staff with some very particular properties. A funny thing, really, because it seemed the kind of staff I would normally procure for one of my warlock customers.\n\nIt took me a few days to get it, but I found one and had it delivered to the Legerdemain Lounge at her request.', '', 126598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
