('The enemy must be stopped at all costs!', '', 126592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have heard the $ct\'s words, children. Go to the other orders, gather their support! May the elements guide you.', 126591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234728|h[Arcane Annihilation]|h|r!', '', 126590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must send news to the other class orders. We are going to the Broken Shore.', 'We must send news to the other class orders. We are going to the Broken Shore.', 126589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will open a portal to Arcanist Ryanna\'s  location. One moment.', '', 126588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82774, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirits guide you, $ct.', 126587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Sorceror, I need you to persuade the other class orders to join us against the Legion.', 'High Sorceror, I need you to rally the other class orders to join us against the Legion.', 126586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! This is the perfect place for arcane meditation, don\'t you agree?', '', 126585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELHELLFIRE:20|t The Avatar begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234724|h[Annihilation]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELHELLFIRE:20|t The Avatar begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234724|h[Annihilation]|h|r!', 126584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION:20|t The Corrupted Guardian begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:233856|h[Cleansing Protocol]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FEL_ELEMENTALDEVASTATION:20|t The Corrupted Guardian begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:233856|h[Cleansing Protocol]|h|r!', 126583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELHELLFIRE:20|t The Avatar begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:239132|h[Rupture Realities]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELHELLFIRE:20|t The Avatar begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:239132|h[Rupture Realities]|h|r!', 126582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELFIRENOVA:20|t The Avatar casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234059|h[Unbound Chaos]|h|r on you!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_FIRE_FELFIRENOVA:20|t The Avatar casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:234059|h[Unbound Chaos]|h|r on you!', 126581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grongo smash!', '', 126580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want the boom? You got it, bozo!', 126579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off my boat, Alliance scum!', '', 126578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off my boat, Horde scum!', '', 126577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ack!', 126576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away, unless you want a firework to the face!', '', 126575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought, $n. But there is more to be done before we can claim victory.', '', 126574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been given a free boat to use on the water\'s surface for the day. Boat safely!', 'You\'ve been given a free boat to use on the water\'s surface for the day. Boat safely!', 126573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sigh>... I was hoping to play some volleyball, too...', '', 126572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of their litter collects in this corner of the lagoon. We cannot abide this affront to nature.', '', 126571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thoughtless partying of the other races has a drastic effect on this land\'s environment.', '', 126570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I\'ll bet those pirates over yonder have some ale on \'em...', '', 126569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry.', '', 126568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come all this way to celebrate Boat Day, and ye forgot the dang-blasted ALE!', '', 126567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ACH! I can\'t believe it!', '', 126566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahoy down there! You sailors want to party?', 126565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gasp!> I can\'t believe you would resort to name-calling. On BOAT DAY, of all days.', '', 126564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, easy there, bub. I only swiped your bombs because you and your munchkin squad swiped ours first!', '', 126563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This always happens! I look the other way for one minute, and your goons have stolen our explosives!', '', 126562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. Those impudent imposters imperiled important improvements.', '', 126561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion opened a portal that is spewing forth a swarm of foul imps. Champion, these tiny fiends must be eradicated!', '', 126560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The death of those foul creatures will stoke the fire of the Legion\'s wrath. Make haste to Black Rook Hold. We must press our attack!', '', 126559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, sea giants have moved in to claim the goods. Slay the giants and scour the wreckage for our lost supplies.', '', 126558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valuable supplies were lost beneath the ocean during our first assault. They would come in handy in our fight against the Legion.', '', 126557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion is a plague that sickens the land with its presence. The demons must be purged before their forces spread any further!', '', 126556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First they invade our lands. Now the demons darken the skies.', '', 126555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to fight alongside you, Battlelord $n. I will report to Deliverance Point. See you there!', '', 126554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with honor, Battlelord $n. I will report to Deliverance Point. See you there.', '', 126553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knights! The $ct needs us! Let\'s fly!', '', 126552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, $ct. We will leave at once.', '', 126551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go gather the other class orders. We\'re going to Broken Shore.', 'Go gather the other class orders. We\'re going to Broken Shore.', 126550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I serve, $ct?', '', 126549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye can\'t find any loyalty in th\' feathered folk. Crackers might\'ve left me shipwrecked, but I can\'t be a successful pirate captain without a proper matey! Nanners is me new partner, and he\'s been right handy!$b$bWho needs a bird, anyway? Nanners is a much more useful crewmate.', '', 126548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with the hozen?', 'What\'s with the hozen?', 126547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy, $n. I\'m hopin\' fer a great explosion!', '', 126546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya... I failed you...', '', 126545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mistress\' death will be avenged! No foul outlander shall control the kvaldir while I still draw breath!', '', 126544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the forward camp at once! [Queue for Scenario]', 'Send me to the forward camp at once! [Queue for Scenario]', 126543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons will pay for what they have done. This I vow!', '', 126542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crackers! I thought ye were me matey! Yer breakin\' my heart!', '', 126541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $p. You have bought valuable time to deal with this threat.', 126540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kruul returns? We must prepare an assault on the demon\'s lair. Karlain, please ensure the Illidari are given all the supplies we can spare.', 126539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! These vrykul think they can steal our gunpowder? They\'ve got another thing coming!', '', 126537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! The gunpowder has been taken by harpies? I must gather my crew and head to Highmountain!', '', 126536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the other corner, a dwarf and his totally loyal companion who would NEVER harm its master. Ever.', '', 126535, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work taking care of those giants! The supplies you\'ve gathered will be a boon to the war effort.', '', 126534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooldowns and debuffs have been reset.', '', 126533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the other corner, a dwarf and his totally loyal companion who would NEVER harm its master. Ever.', 126532, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is nowhere to be found. She must have been taken once more!', '', 126531, 0, 0, 579, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be quiet, Crixa!', 126530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey Doloria, this one\'s looking for ya.', 126529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Umm, isn\'t that her with the mask? Oh wait, right, yes, no, haven\'t seen her.', 126528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya must be blinder than a pirate with two eye patches.', '', 126527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! I can think of no one better suited to the task. We stand ready to inform you about all known threats.', 126526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normally I\'d let nature take its course... however, I\'d prefer not to fight an army of kraken and the Burning Legion at the same time!', '', 126525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She and her kvaldir jealously stole away many souls worthy of joining our ranks. They must be freed so they can at last assume their rightful places here in the sky.', '', 126524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seem to be having a problem with over-sized eggs... well, not with the eggs per se, but the kraken hatching from the eggs.', '', 126523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors of the Alliance! We have a job to do!', '', 126522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Battlelord. You are the strong leader we need in these troubling times.', '', 126521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Darius, I need you to rally the other class orders to form a coalition against the Legion.', 'Lord Darius, I need you to rally the other class orders to form a coalition against the Legion.', 126520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Battlelord. You are the strong leader we need in these troubling times.', '', 126519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha! A clue! No, just some dust.', '', 126514, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, perhaps she\'s behind here...', '', 126513, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon me, good sir, have you seen my Doloria?', '', 126512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde warriors, move out!', '', 126511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are saved, my love! Wait... something\'s not quite right.', '', 126510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eitrigg, I need you to rally the other class orders to form a coalition against the Legion.', 'Eitrigg, I need you to rally the other class orders to form a coalition against the Legion.', 126509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0EA6DC+$1i|r |cFFFFFF00Azerite|r', '|cFF0EA6DC+$1i|r |cFFFFFF00Azerite|r', 126508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'During our imprisonment, the Kirin Tor locked Kruul\'s heart away in Dalaran\'s vaults to prevent it from falling into Legion hands.', 126507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Squire! I shall meet you in the mountains that are high.', '', 126506, 0, 0, 595, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never fear, my love, we will hunt down these bandits and secure your freedom!', '', 126505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maximillian? How did you find me here?', 126504, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doloria, my love! I have found you at last! Are you safe?', '', 126503, 0, 0, 595, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The vaults have been breached!', 'The vaults have been breached!', 126502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To me, heroes! Shield me with the Aegis while I tear this dreadlord from the shadows!', '', 126501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast that laid those eggs is in the cavern! Check the upper area!', '', 126499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve put a dent in their forces. Focus on the eggs now.', '', 126498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got its attention! Here it comes!', '', 126497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll tell ya what the Legion was after - my bottom line! Legion-grade protection wards ain\'t exactly cheap, sugar!', 126496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, the calamity! The destruction! The lack of customer trust! $B$B<Glutonia pauses to make sure you\'re looking.>$B$BMaybe the familiar smell of ten gold coins would jog my memory!$B$BUnmarked, please.', 126495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the demon slinking through a portal in all the chaos. Size of two tauren - maybe three!', '', 126494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... never... submit...', 'I will... never... submit...', 126493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... let me go. I have a family.', 'Please... let me go. I have a family.', 126492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why? Why are you doing this?', 'Why? Why are you doing this?', 126491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know anything...', 'I don\'t know anything...', 126490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get...out...of...my...head!', 'Get...out...of...my...head!', 126489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... mind... get out of my... mind.', 'My... mind... get out of my... mind.', 126488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it stop! Please, make it stop!', 'Make it stop! Please, make it stop!', 126487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open yer trap so I can fire, Oso!', '', 126486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every soul snatched from the fel forge deprives our enemy of fuel for their cause. Well done.', '', 126485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons are bringing in more hapless refugees from Suramar. Assist the rogues of the Council of Shadows in liberating the prisoners before they become fuel for the fel.', '', 126484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every soul snatched from the fel forge weakens our enemy. Well done.', '', 126483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowblade, the demons are bringing in more hapless refugees from Suramar. You and your gallery of rogues must liberate them before they become fuel for the fel.', '', 126482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tayen Steelhide', 'Tayen Steelhide', 126481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Melhen Lightfury', 'Melhen Lightfury', 126480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nalenn Heartreaver', 'Nalenn Heartreaver', 126479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guldek Stoneshield', 'Guldek Stoneshield', 126478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alawa Wisebrace', 'Alawa Wisebrace', 126477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rasean Lightfall', 'Rasean Lightfall', 126476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break enough eggs, and the monstrosity that laid them will come looking for a fight!', '', 126475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the place. Kill abominations and smash any eggs you find!', '', 126474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The paladins of the Silver Hand are attempting a holy ritual in Felfire Pass, but the Legion is pushing back. Slay the demon leader so that we may sanctify this place.', '', 126473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. You have bought our forces the reprieve we needed to finish our task.', '', 126472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your help, we can complete our work and honor Tirion\'s life of sacrifice.', '', 126471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sought to consecrate the ground where Tirion fell, but the Legion pushed us back. Your aid is needed, Highlord.', '', 126470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The allure of power is great, and many succumb to its call. Those warlocks gave us no choice but to end their sinister threat.', '', 126469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Powerful warlocks serving the Legion have gathered in Felfire Pass. We must stop them and their fanatical master before they grow too strong.', '', 126468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Least there\'s no giant eye lasers this time, eh?', '', 126467, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero! Our druids will see to the rest of this menace.', '', 126466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pains me to see this ancient land tainted by such pestilent creatures. Stop them before they spread!', '', 126465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many\'ll come this time. The machine surges with the Light.', '', 126464, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By my troth, this\'ll be the last time I go adventurin\' with a Bronzebeard!', 126463, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 81172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not done yet!', '', 126462, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take ye back whenever yer ready, High Priest.', '', 126461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to head back to Dalaran.', 'I am ready to head back to Dalaran.', 126460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are ye ready to leave, High Priest? Just gimme the word an\' I\'ll point the sub back towards Dalaran.', '', 126459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which paladin would you like to remove from your ranks?', 126454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
