('', 'I\'m here to aid and advise you on the indirect threats that the Legion poses. These missions will be extremely difficult, please be prepared.$b$bWe will require Nethershards to either breach their defenses or provide you with defenses to weather their horrific attacks. I will have some to spare occasionally, but not always. Please prepare accordingly.', 126352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
