('Enough! I have little time for games!', '', 126286, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wood may look terrible, but its magic is still strong enough for our uses!', 'This wood may look terrible, but its magic is still strong enough for our uses!', 126285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tree still has plenty of useable heartwood!', 'This tree still has plenty of useable heartwood!', 126284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s power wanes. We must end this now!', '', 126283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to bring down the power source.', 'I\'m ready to bring down the power source.', 126282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I deserved that.', '', 126281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes don\'t die, they revive!', '', 126280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me outside at once! It is time to sever the Legion\'s tendrils and free Azsuna!', '', 126279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is only... the beginning...', '', 126278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are endless! Our sight reaches far beyond your miserable world.', '', 126277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Feltotem capture my people, seeking to conscript them into their ranks. This evil must be stopped!', 126276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are the items you sell so expensive?', 'Why are the items you sell so expensive?', 126275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the war effort?', 'How can I help the war effort?', 126274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, both the Medallion of Station and the Ring of Lordship are expensive - far too expensive for any one person to purchase on their own.$b$bI suggest you team up with other adventurers and select a champion. Only one medallion or ring is required to summon the high-ranking members of the Abyssal Council - but many heroes will be required to defeat them.$b$bGood luck.', '', 126273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrupt the Twilight\'s Hammer camps, and strike at their Abyssal High Council!\n\nSlay the mighty silithid colossi that dwell in each of the three large silithid hives.\n\nGather silithyst, a valuable red spice, for our faction.\n\nVenture into Ahn\'Qiraj itself and deal with the qiraji and old god menaces that dwell inside!\n\nEven adventurers that prefer not to fight can participate by donating war supplies, in the form of meat, to our cause.', '', 126272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On this day, many years ago, a hero by the name of Kalahad rang the Scarab Gong, opening the gates to Ahn\'Qiraj and beginning a war the likes of which Kalimdor had never seen.$b$bToday, we celebrate the heroics of those past adventurers by returning to Silithus and walking in their footsteps.$b$bWhat\'s more: this is a competition between the Horde and Alliance. Whichever group can earn more credits over the next 24 hours earns the right to fly their flag next to the gong for the rest of the year.', '', 126271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agreed. High Priest, give us time ta scribe \'em into the annals o\' the Light. We\'ll meet up at Netherlight Temple.', 126270, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 81175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis ye, High Priest.', '', 126269, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 81217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She knew it wouldn\'t be long before the void o\'ertook this chamber. She knew who would protect these creatures an\' use \'em in service of the Light.', '', 126268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer wrong about that, lass. \'Tis why Azeroth called me... called us... here.', '', 126267, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 81215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one\'s left ta look after these poor creatures!', 126266, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 81174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, the custodian be powerin\' down. Might be this chamber expended all its energy.', 126265, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' that\'s the last of em\'.  Gonna hope that\'s the last time I end up in this situation...', '', 126264, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O\' course the big ones would come ta life, too. Watch yerselves!', '', 126263, 0, 0, 579, 64, 0, 81213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense some corruption amongst my brethren. Watch yerself fer purification.', '', 126262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spawns o\' Light, barely of this world. A good dispel should dissipate \'em.', 126261, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 81171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lotta good that did! Well, here we go!', '', 126260, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 81208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unable to comply. Sanitation protocol cannot be aborted. Visitors may be in a corrupted state. If you are hearing whispers of unknown origin, please step directly into the searing light.', '', 126259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Err... Stop it, then, will ye?', '', 126258, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 81206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh Aye, more than once! Yer the big important Speaker. Can ye shut it off, then?', '', 126257, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 81205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again? Ye\'ve done this before, brother?', '', 126256, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh blazes! Not again!', '', 126255, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alert! Void energies detected. Initiating sanitation protocol.', '', 126254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These noble creatures protected us before we even knew how ta protect ourselves...', '', 126253, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 81201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invasive corruptive entities have bombarded this planet since its shaping. Attrition due to combat fatalities gradually reduced the numbers of Seekers. Now, only these are known to remain.', '', 126252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, what happened to \'em?', '', 126251, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the three here, then?', 126250, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 81170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing... Current count of known Seekers: three.', '', 126249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herds, ye say? We\'ve never seen a one! How many of \'em remain?', '', 126248, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Designation: Seeker. Feral creatures infused with the Light by the Shapers. The finest specimens were selected from herds and trained to serve the watchers, speeding them to sites of corruption in accordance with containment protocols.', '', 126247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to show you.', '', 126246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, Mister Custodian, what in the name o\' the Forge is a Seeker?', 126245, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 81169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seekers... yes, that must be what she meant when she directed me ta this place. She wanted us to find these creatures.', '', 126244, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 81194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speaker status verified. Welcome, Speaker. Have you come to retrieve the seekers?', '', 126243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now what do ye mean by that? Not essential? Me? You\'re \'not essential,\' ye wee little...', '', 126242, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No essential life forms detected. Resuming scan.', '', 126241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I know sure enough what this is gonna lead to! Weapons up!', '', 126240, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 81190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life form scan in progress.', '', 126239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Systems active. Visitors detected.', '', 126238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They must be activated simultaneously. High Priest, would ye do the honors?', '', 126237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bit of a shame, that.', '', 126236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, I suppose ye don\'t need ta be lookin\' fer levers and switches n\'more, Brann!', 126235, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 0, 81167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revola ruk maez amir.', '', 126234, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 81185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, that\'s a large door! Gotta be a lever around here somewhere, though. There\'s always a lever!', '', 126233, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 81184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commencin\' dockin\' procedures.', '', 126232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'We\'re coming up ta what appears ta be the vault entrance.', 126231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It felt... like a sunrise.', '', 126230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... she sorta \'felt\' at ye, that ye should come here?', '', 126229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, let\'s say ye\'re a world soul, eh? What sorta feelin\'s do ye suppose ye\'d have? Sometimes ye feel like a crumblin\' mountain range, an\' sometimes ye feel like a deep, dark sea. I dunno exactly how ta\' describe it.', '', 126228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now what does that even mean?', 126227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so much in words. \'Tis more... feelin\'s... but not like feelin\'s ye or I would have.', '', 126226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, brother... the planet, Azeroth, she just sorta... told ye to come here?', '', 126225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sea\'s calm so far, even this close to the Maelstrom.', 126224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I borrowed a small submarine from friends o\' mine in the Explorers\' League. We\'ll be embarkin\' off the coast o\' Azsuna as soon as ye can join us, High Priest.', '', 126223, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High Priest! I got important information for ye.', 126222, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am honored to be chosen for this mission. I will not fail you, Grandmaster $n.', '', 126221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to convince the other orders to join us against the Legion. We must come together as one!', 'I need you to convince the other orders to join us against the Legion. We must come together as one!', 126220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion closes in on Azeroth. We must all do our part.', '', 126219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we celebrate the anniversary of the ringing of the Scarab Gong. You\'ll see plenty of festivities around Silithus today.$b$bPart of the tradition involves summoning those colossal insects from the three silithid hives. To do that, we\'ll need meat. Giant piles of meat.$b$bCan you help?', '', 126218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so, so weary. Yet, I cannot rest until I am certain that our order will survive.', 126217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your leadership and our Storm Brew, we will prevail!', '', 126216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will face Zen\'dral. Bring me up!', 'I will face Zen\'dral. Bring me up!', 126215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must free this land of the Legion\'s corruption!', '', 126214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears Kruul\'s lackeys were just here.', 126209, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 82834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the demise of Gul\'dan>', '<Recall the demise of Gul\'dan>', 126208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet freedom!', '', 126207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odyn bless you.', '', 126206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the doors of Valhallas open for you.', '', 126205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank Odyn, I thought I was done for!', '', 126204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you know...\n\nThey\'re around.\n\nOff you go!', 126203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the others?', 'Where are the others?', 126202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why yes, I DO lack a crown. Thank you for noticing.\n\n<The emissary smiles at you cheerily.>', 126201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grey rockss and green fire. Again.', 126200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It figuress I\'d be sent here.', 126199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why does it always have to be demonsss?', 126198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You chase me too far, $n. My precious imps will make you suffer more than you can imagine.', 126197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your persistence is annoying! My beloved imps, protect me!', 126196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 85204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the Broken Shore!', 'Send me to the Broken Shore!', 126195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You show exceptional prowess in battle. A pity you were not born a warrior! But I suppose no mortal is without flaws.', '', 126194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There remain Felskorn unaware their God-King has fallen. Join my Valarjar in glorious battle and dispatch these fools to meet their fallen leader!', '', 126193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Valarjar!', '', 126192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord! There are remaining Felskorn unaware their God-King has fallen. Go, earn my favor by sending these upstarts to join their former master.', '', 126191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interrupting my feast was a fatal mistake, mortal!', '', 126190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My computer! How... how did you guess my password?! It had many symbols and capitalized letters!', '', 126189, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She will find that she has chosen poorly. Our true ally is the Burning Legion!', 126188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have your attention please. This ship is about to Self-Destruct. Please exit this ship at your soonest convenience.', '', 126187, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did Syrenne send you? Has she really sided with an outsider over her own people?', 126186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for your treachery with your life!', 126185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a disgrace, Lexera! You swore an oath to protect our city.', 126184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ssee you back there.', 126183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was stir-crazy after so many months aboard that sstinking ship. Besides, the situation required someone with my skills...\n\nPerhapss I should have cloned myself first.', 126182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did you leave the others?', 'Why did you leave the others?', 126181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years of training in Cooking allows you to recognize this strange flower. It is safe and can even benefit your friends!', 'Years of training in Cooking allows you to recognize this strange flower. It is safe and can even benefit your friends!', 126180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a pandaren, you recognize this edible flower. Time to stuff it in your face!', 'As a pandaren, you recognize this edible flower. Time to stuff it in your face!', 126179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad you honored our pact, Sslayer $n. Perhapss I misjudged you.', 126178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism has taught you much about natural foodstuffs. This is definitely edible!', 'Herbalism has taught you much about natural foodstuffs. This is definitely edible!', 126177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Druid, you recognize the plants and materials that went into this food. It should be safe to eat.', 'As a Druid, you recognize the plants and materials that went into this food. It should be safe to eat.', 126176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n purifies the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', '$n purifies the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', 126175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n destroys the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', '$n destroys the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', 126174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter! You will pay for this... I WILL DEVOUR YOUR SOUL!', '', 126173, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wretched mortal! What have you done to my ship?!', '', 126172, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n absorbs the magic from the Infernal Tome, granting everyone damage reduction!', '$n absorbs the magic from the Infernal Tome, granting everyone damage reduction!', 126171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon Hunter training has long prepared you for this. Grasp the power from within the Infernal Tome.', 'Demon Hunter training has long prepared you for this. Grasp the power from within the Infernal Tome.', 126170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Warlock, minor fel magic such as this presents no danger to you. Absorb the power of the Infernal Tome.', 'As a Warlock, minor fel magic such as this presents no danger to you. Absorb the power of the Infernal Tome.', 126169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This orb is unnatural to Priests and must be destroyed.', 'This orb is unnatural to Priests and must be destroyed.', 126168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dedication to your holy Paladin order demands that you purify this fel taint.', 'Dedication to your holy Paladin order demands that you purify this fel taint.', 126167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scour the land! Leave not a single mortal to remain! All their souls shall be mine!', '', 126166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could have taken him... eventually. My thankss.', 126165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, Sslayer $n. Since you are here, you may as well lend a hand.', 126164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More souls to fuel the fel! I must have more!', '', 126163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muln spits at Magatha\'s feet in disgust.', '', 126162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... I must have more souls!', '', 126161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She made a few snide comments regarding our vigilance and then left on her own. I haven\'t seen her since.', '', 126160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She shall not have free reign here, I assure you.', '', 126159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But it is more of a liability to have her out in the world. It is better if we keep an eye on her.', '', 126158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know it is infuriating for you and the other tauren to see her here, Muln.', '', 126157, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic?! Farseer, kick her out! I will not stand for this!', '', 126156, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Put it to rest, you buffoon. There is more at stake here than your pathetic chieftain!', 126155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re letting this monster into our sacred space?? She murdered our chieftain!', '', 126154, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish, I can return you to the Hall of the Guardian.', '', 126153, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not know him well, but I have no doubt that Antonidas would be proud of what you have accomplished this day, Archmage $p.', '', 126152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen what your so-called \"gift\" does, demon. I\'ll never join your kind!', 126151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your defiance is futile! You will join us or I shall wear your flayed skin for a cloak!', '', 126150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Help me out of these shackles!', 126149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, small one.', 126148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank ye, if I wasn\'t chained up I would have given that ugly brute a beating myself!', 126147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More meat for the fire!', '', 126146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life for the Legion!', '', 126145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
