('', 'Do not look upon me as one of your underlings, $r. You are but a child to me.', 126093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain your focus, Archmage $p! Only one disc left to disperse. Remember, my apprentices can offer aid.', '', 126092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Archmage $p! Purging the disc of excess energy has stopped its violent resonance while in proximity to the other discs. I trust the same will happen with the final two.', '', 126091, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike at their defenses, $n. Bring these demons down!', '', 126089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the help to the Blind Marshlands.', 'I\'d like the help to the Blind Marshlands.', 126088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must deal with this threat quickly.', '', 126087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How do you expect to use the power of the Doomstone if you cannot even open your own portal? Foolish child.', 126086, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 81645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You head forward from here while I go the opposite way. I will find you afterward.', 126085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat... the Legion...', '', 126084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want the Doomstone, shaman? Come, take it!', '', 126083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Thunder Totem!', 'For Thunder Totem!', 126082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold strong!', 'Hold strong!', 126081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must help the others!', 'You must help the others!', 126080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them back!', 'Hold them back!', 126079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give in, $n!', 'Do not give in, $n!', 126078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Archmage $p. I hope you are prepared for what is to come.', '', 126076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skovald\'s kin must perish!', '', 126075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go, child. We must save my tribe.', 126074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop stalling! Where is your Farseer?!', 126073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final expulsion of power from the arcane disc will most likely mimic what you\'ve already seen. Make sure it doesn\'t grow beyond what you\'re able to destroy.', '', 126072, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These creatures grow in power the longer they stay alive. Burn them down quickly and interrupt what you can to prevent their growth.', '', 126071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re finally upon the final energy purge of the frost disc. Remember the creatures you\'ve seen so far and use that knowledge to your advantage.', '', 126070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The manifestations from this disc are trying to slow you down in order to destroy you. Counter their spells and make sure to quickly move away from where their attacks will land.', '', 126069, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the final expulsion, Archmage. Remember what the preceding enemies you faced threw at you and you should be prepared for whatever comes next.', '', 126068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re doing well, Archmage $p. Remember to gather the smaller emanations into a group so you can assault them with your area-of-effect abilities.', '', 126067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'D\'Bynn! Can you hear me? When I am freed, I will kill every last trapper for what they have done to us!', 126066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you are a sight for sore eyes, Battlelord $n!', '', 126065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But if you\'re looking to retrieve it, I\'m sure it must be somewhere in the Ruins of Alterac where they reside.', '', 126064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry though. I couldn\'t figure out how to help Antonidas with it, so I\'m sure they have no clue what to do with it.', '', 126063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By ogres no less. Filthy beasts. They raided our ruins a while back and unfortunately they made off with the disc piece.', '', 126062, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes. I do. I mean did. Well, it was stolen, you see.', '', 126061, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are your eyebrows still intact? Some of our apprentice mages who attempted that particular spell were not so lucky!', '', 126060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Cedric, I\'m looking for a piece of a disc that Antonidas gave to you. Do you happen to have it?', 'Archmage Cedric, I\'m looking for a piece of a disc that Antonidas gave to you. Do you happen to have it?', 126059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conjurer, your Tirisgarde Pyromancers have engaged the endless broods of the Creeping Grotto. Mister Manastorm has offered the use of a customized spell. He says you are \"old friends.\"', '', 126058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was working with Archmage Alturus on it at the time. He may still know where it resides. You\'ll find him just outside of Karazhan.', '', 126057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re speaking of the Tri-Disc of Fire. Yes, he gave it to me, but that was a long time ago. Back when I was still studying at Karazhan.', '', 126056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, I\'m looking for a piece of a disc that Antonidas gave you a long time ago.', 'Khadgar, I\'m looking for a piece of a disc that Antonidas gave you a long time ago.', 126055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will always remember your deeds. One day, so too will the Tideskorn.', 126054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you were right, outsider. Thank you for helping me find my path.', 126053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Have you been out there? We\'re holding the demons back as best we can!', '$n! Have you been out there? We\'re holding the demons back as best we can!', 126052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not allow these demons to defile our home!', 'We will not allow these demons to defile our home!', 126051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can fight, rally and help defend Thunder Totem! We must not give in!', 'If you can fight, rally and help defend Thunder Totem! We must not give in!', 126050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! The Legion is relentless in their assaults.', 'Be careful! The Legion is relentless in their assaults.', 126049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! We\'ve lost quite a few to their attacks already! Any help you can give will allow us to hold Thunder Totem as best we can!', '$n! We\'ve lost quite a few to their attacks already! Any help you can give will allow us to hold Thunder Totem as best we can!', 126048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But if you think you can finish what Antonidas started, then the piece is yours. Good luck with it, Archmage $n.', 126047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After Antonidas died, I decided to hide the disc away. There was no reason to continue my research into it.', 126046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t thought of that since... well since an old friend asked about it shortly before he was taken from this world.', 126045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlelord $n! It is good you found me.', '', 126044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for Antonidas\' arcane disc piece. Do you have it?', 'I\'m looking for Antonidas\' arcane disc piece. Do you have it?', 126043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $n. Is there something I can assist you with?', '', 126042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine! I will finish you myself!', 126041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your words ring true, brave $c. We must stand together!', 'Your words ring true, brave $c. We must stand together!', 126040, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion! You must warn the others!', 'The Legion! You must warn the others!', 126039, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be alright, but you must tend to the others!', 'I\'ll be alright, but you must tend to the others!', 126038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I appreciate your help.', 'Thank you. I appreciate your help.', 126037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your words carry the tone of your bravery, $n. Be safe.', 'Your words carry the tone of your bravery, $n. Be safe.', 126036, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll go make sure all the demons are truly defeated. When you have time, meet us back in the Hall of Shadows for a briefing.', '', 126035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tales shall be told, and songs sung, of the glory that awaits us this day.', 126034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With our forces combined, the Burning Legion shall fall!', 126033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! Let me just--', '', 126032, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 82320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity you won\'t be around to see it. Die!', '', 126031, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With an army of these creatures boring into the rock, I will bury Thunder Totem!', '', 126030, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a beast able to survive the fel infusion.', '', 126029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have taken the lead! For the Alliance!', '', 126028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-ka! The Horde has taken the lead!', '', 126027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, we celebrate de anniversary of de ringin\' of de Scarab Gong. You\'ll see all sorts a festivities \'round Silithus today.$b$bPart of de tradition involves summonin\' de colossal insects from de three silithid hives. To do that, we need meat. Heaps a meat.$b$bCan ya help?', 126026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No time to waste, Shadowblade. Let\'s move.', 126025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that became a combustible situation, but you handled the heat expertly.', '', 126024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, mages of the Tirisgarde need your help to purge the spider broods from the Creeping Grotto. Their pyromancers could provide you with a burning edge.', '', 126023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, use the rappel point. Down you go!', 126022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on... that drunken buffoon forgot, didn\'t he? You better find a way to light this powder, $ct. I will not let this mission fail!', 126021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to travel to the Eye of Eternity.', 'I\'m ready to travel to the Eye of Eternity.', 126020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, the job\'s almost complete. Just get out of the cave and light the powder with the match Tethys gave you.', 126019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Actually, one more thing. Plant some explosives around for a little extra \"boom\".', 126018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. The next step is simple--just get out of this cave without being seen. The gunpowder will do its job.', 126017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the way, unless you\'re looking for a fel blade in the back, you might want to avoid being seen in here.', 126016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you reach the ground, you\'ll see a barrel. It\'s full of the fel-infused gunpowder you... acquired.', 126015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Tugar. (requires Brimming Keystone)', 'I\'m ready to face Tugar. (requires Brimming Keystone)', 126014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to face Tugar. (using Navarrogg\'s Brimming Keystone)', 'I\'m ready to face Tugar. (using Navarrogg\'s Brimming Keystone)', 126013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to take the fight to Tugar and his worms! If you are ready I will take you there.', '', 126012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have helped me protect these lands. Now it is my turn to help you. Come, let us find somewhere safe to speak.', 126011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my eternal gratitude, $c.', 'You have my eternal gratitude, $c.', 126010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. You have rescued me from a horrific fate.', 'Thank you, hero. You have rescued me from a horrific fate.', 126009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Battlelord. For the Alliance!', 'Thank you, Battlelord. For the Alliance!', 126008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came just in time. I think they were going to eat me...', 'You came just in time. I think they were going to eat me...', 126007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*sniff* That was... right beautiful, matey.', '', 126006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. You have rescued me from a horrific fate.', 'Thank you, hero. You have rescued me from a horrific fate.', 126005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my eternal gratitude, Battlelord.', 'You have my eternal gratitude, Battlelord.', 126004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Battlelord. For the Horde!', 'Thank you, Battlelord. For the Horde!', 126003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came just in time. I think they were going to eat me...', 'You came just in time. I think they were going to eat me...', 126002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on... he forgot, didn\'t he? How did I know? Looks like you\'ll need another way to light that powder!', 126001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve almost done it! Now get out of there and light the powder with the match Tethys gave you.', 126000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too late, fools! I already have what I need to destroy Thunder Totem!', '', 125999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On your way, you\'ll want to drop extra explosives. Wouldn\'t want to disappoint Tethys now, would we?', 125998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good--that trail of powder left in your wake will come in handy. Now to work your way out of the cave.', 125997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also, it\'s best to not be seen in here. These demons are brutal!', 125996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At the bottom, you\'ll find the cache of gunpowder you previously acquired. You\'ll want to pick that up.', 125995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the rappel point to drop into the cave. I\'ll relay further instructions then.', 125994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re here! Soon the Legion will taste our wrath.', 125993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 125992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before I accept the crown, I must honor my family by fulfilling my brother\'s request. \n\nIf Eyir knows who was responsible for my family\'s fate, then I would hear it from her.\n\nTell me when you\'re ready.', 125991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Tirisgarde at the helm, our united forces will crush the Burning Legion once and for all!', '', 125990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would wager these abjurors possess potent enhancements. A clever mage would do well to steal such power, $n!', '', 125989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, here we are!', 125988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone... warn Tugar...', '', 125987, 0, 47060, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tugar will avenge me.', '', 125986, 0, 47060, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late... Tugar will win...', '', 125985, 0, 47060, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to head down to the base camp.', 'I\'m ready to head down to the base camp.', 125984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No time to waste, Shadowblade. Let\'s get to the top!', 125982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Now that the hard part is over, all you need to do is destroy the ship!', '', 125981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good news, $n! It appears that the portal worked! All of your limbs are still intact, yes?', '', 125980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'D\'Bynn, you are alive! I had almost lost hope, my sweet friend.', 125979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 80694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble as I unleash the full might of the Burning Legion upon this pathetic world!', '', 125976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do stay close, my lord.', 125975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it pleases you Lord Mephistroth, I shall escort you to the command console on the navigation deck.', 125974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please forgive me, master, but you must input the self-destruct codes yourself.', 125973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately, I lack the authorization necessary to issue such a command.', 125972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'With the shield generators offline, a self-destruct command can be issued to destroy the ship.', 125971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I overloaded the generators. What should I do next?', 'I overloaded the generators. What should I do next?', 125970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Tethys. Don\'t run off just yet.', '', 125967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I can hardly contain me excitement! I want te watch the explosion!', '', 125965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Stop the demon before it calls forth more of its vile kind!', '', 125964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get really weird!', '', 125963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Picking Up', 'Picking Up', 125962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have returned the energy back through the Focusing Iris. Azeroth\'s ley lines should be restored.', '', 125957, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This charade ends NOW!', 125956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A feeding frenzy!', 125955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot resist the sea\'s call!', 125954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tide will crush you!', 125953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not all storms strike from the skies...', 125952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strip their bones clean!', 125951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Had you surrendered the Tidestone, I might have let you live...', 125950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My queen has given me dominion over the seas!', 125949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Face the might that lurks beneath the waves!', 125948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I failed... my queen...', 125947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lasan\'s riders have taken to the air. Call down his eagles to aid you in defense of Thunder Totem!', 125945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Joanna, thanks to this brave $c.', '', 125944, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 81681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and I no longer sense the shadow within you!', 125943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage Xylem! You\'ve returned...', 125942, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 81487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to the Broken Shore!', 'Fly me to the Broken Shore!', 125941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope it... blows in yer face...', 125940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will scout out the Feltotem. Bring me the totems when you are done.', '', 125930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Velen saw us to safety before the explosion overtook us. Kruul wasn\'t so fortunate.', 125926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You made it! I feared we had lost you in the blast.', 125925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow will not control me!', '', 125924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will mend your wounds. Look always to the Light.', '', 125923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sigh... very well.', 'Sigh... very well.', 125922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha! Crabs, you say? Your ignorance on these matters of demons is presenting itself readily! We must continue your training posthaste, lest you fall forever into a pit of ignorance!', '', 125921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see two dead crabs, is that what you mean?', 'I see two dead crabs, is that what you mean?', 125920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, squire!  As you can see, I\'ve assaulted this shore and have secured the beach against the Legion, but there is much more work to do. They attempted to break through my defenses last eve, but I held the line stoically against their assault. You can see their demonic corpses over yonder, though you may not possess the stomach to look upon them very long.', '', 125919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training?', 'Training?', 125918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squire? Is that you? I barely recognized you. You have not aged well!  Never mind, I suppose even those of your advanced years must continue their training.', '', 125917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to leave now.', 'I am ready to leave now.', 125916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, Maximillian.', 'Hello again Maximillian.', 125915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do be careful, master!', 125914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to destroy the ship, overloading the generators will cause catastrophic engine damage.', 125913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s falls to the ground!', 125912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Override complete. If it pleases my master, I have taken the liberty of unlocking the engine room.', 125911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is overloading himself with power! Look out!', '', 125910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEHOLD THE WRATH OF KRUUL!', '', 125909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. You will not stand in our way any longer.', '', 125908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One moment while I disable the defense systems...', 125907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course. Anything for you Lord Mephistroth, your pleasure is my command.', 125906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is... not... possible!', '', 125905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your light fades, Prophet. This is your end.', '', 125904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot maintain my barrier much longer. We must finish this!', '', 125903, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come for the harness? Hah! Let us see you try!', '', 125902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why yes, that would please me greatly. Make it so.', 'Why yes, that would please me greatly. Make it so.', 125901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We... will... never... bow!', 125900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would it please my dark lord if I disabled all emergency and defensive systems on the ship?', 125899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power is infinite. Our numbers are endless. Bow before the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 125898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you are aware, Lord Mephistroth, this ship contains a variety of defense systems designed to prevent an array of catastrophic failures.', 125897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You are all that remains. There is no hope, fools.', '', 125896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho!  Welcome, weary traveler.  Come sit by my roaring fire. Never fear, I have secured this position on the beachhead, and will soon thwart the Legion\'s assault on these lands!', '', 125895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stand strong, champion. Do not give up!', '', 125894, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 83147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhhhhhh!', 125893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who are alone, Kruul! Your time has come.', '', 125892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world will crumble beneath me.', '', 125891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one is coming to save you.', '', 125890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The harness...', '', 125889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat them alive, pet!', '', 125888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The God of Fel and Flame, Sargeras himself, chose you to lead the Nathrezim to glory following the humiliating defeat of Tichondrius at the hands of Illidan Stormrage.', 125887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course my lord. You are Mephistroth, the strongest and wisest of all the Nathrezim.', 125886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, take me back.', 'Yes, take me back.', 125885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can return you to the Aetherium. Would you like me to?', 'I can return you to the Aetherium. Would you like me to?', 125884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ya think you can leave my bones here to freeze, you\'re gravely mistaken. Haha, let\'s go!', 125883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even a fraction of my power will be enough to destroy you.', '', 125882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow us to guide you to undeath!', 125881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, let\'s take the fight to him!', 125880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry for the mess. The Jarl thought one of his pets could slow me down.', 125879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work, Archmage. However, the subsequent manifestations of power you face may not be so easily defeated.', '', 125878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrogant fools! I am empowered by the souls of a thousand conquered worlds!', '', 125877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have fresh food and bandages for you Archmage, if you\'re in need of any.', 125876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have orbs you may find especially useful for your endeavors, Archmage, should you need them.', 125875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should your equipment need repairs, Archmage, I\'m at your service.', '', 125874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skovald\'s legacy, it appears, has not yet ended.', '', 125873, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At your request, I now offer a variety of services beyond my normal programming to better serve my dark lord.', 125872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My standard programming has been altered to more adequately support all of Lord Mephistroth\'s needs.', 125871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Certainly, Lord Mephistroth. Just a moment while I access your previous user settings...', 125870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to leave now.', 'We\'re ready to leave now.', 125869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to destroy the ship. What do you suggest?', 'I need to destroy the ship. What do you suggest?', 125868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about myself? Who is Lord Mephistroth?', 'What can you tell me about myself? Who is Lord Mephistroth?', 125867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about your previous settings, S.I.R.I.', 'Tell me about your previous settings, S.I.R.I.', 125866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for lifting the curse from Black Rook.', '', 125865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well this day. Thank you. We shall head back.', '', 125864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scanning opponent\'s level of swagger. Zero found.', '', 125862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your levels of funk are insufficient.', '', 125861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your lead, champion.', '', 125860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What we do now, we do together.', '', 125859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flow is deficient.', '', 125858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No step.', '', 125857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lame.', '', 125856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Funk drive re-engaged. Beat protocols set to melt face.', '', 125855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Groove battery powering down. Trash talk mode engaged.', '', 125854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Funk circuits depleted...', '', 125853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got skills!', 'You got skills!', 125852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re getting served, Beat Box!', 'You\'re getting served, Beat Box!', 125851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check those funky steps!', 'Check those funky steps!', 125850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, prepare to be rhythmically disassembled.', '', 125849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Now we must dare to venture into the Twisting Nether itself.', '', 125848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archdruid! Use your magic to close the portal for good!', '', 125847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to close the portal!', '', 125846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the wrath of my army!', '', 125844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Access granted. Greetings, Lord Mephistroth. How may I serve you today?', 125843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get weird!', '', 125842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Power failure detected... initiating system restore...', 125841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malevolent Automated Domination Assistance Matrix - M/A/D/A/M - initiated. Greetings, user.', 125840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You walk into your own death.', '', 125839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You test my patience. Die, cretin!', '', 125838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armies will all fall before my lord\'s wrath.', '', 125837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The endless flame comes for you! It cannot be stopped!', '', 125836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halt! Who approaches the Vault of Eyir?', 125835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Kruul! For the Burning Legion!', '', 125834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I brought the poisoned brew here. If only I had checked it first...', 125833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blanche! Explain yourself! The entire order is dying!', '', 125832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I came to warn you as fast as I could. I was too late...', 125831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster? You tried to kill us!', 125830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have always wanted to study Mistweaving! Farewell, Brewmaster.', 125829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should the need arise, these apprentices can supply you with essentials. I suggest you take note of their offerings.', '', 125828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antonidas had intended to complete this project himself. He was patient, wise, and a master of our disciplines. You must now prove his better in order to finish what he started.', '', 125827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will dismiss the wards keeping them in check. I believe that by channeling power through your artifact weapon into the discs, you will provoke a response.', '', 125826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this all your world could muster? Pathetic.', '', 125825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antonidas infused these discs with the very energies we mages seek to control. However, he and his fellow archmages were unable to diffuse the excess energy, leaving them in their current state.', '', 125824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see the brewmaster?', 125823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe we overdid it... We\'re going to feel awful when it wears off! At least closing the portals should be a walk in the park!', 125822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tidestone will be ours!', 125821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die here, Command-Mother!', '', 125820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost there! Keep it up!', 125819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out! More incoming!', 125818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your vaunted forces of nature cannot stand against the fel!', 125817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kruul will be reborn!', 125816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal is complete. I am with you, $p!', 125815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish them, Vazuun. My rebirth is nearly complete.', '', 125814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must defeat the commander before our forces are completely overwhelmed!', '', 125813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take wing with us. Fly fast and true!', 125811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With every moment my power grows. Your end is nigh!', '', 125810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The deviate spore can be found at the top of this crag. You\'re going to have to battle your way up there, good luck!', 125809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Doomherald opens a Nether Rift!', 'A Doomherald opens a Nether Rift!', 125808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try adding a bit of Holy magic. That usually does the trick.', 125807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After you are destroyed, if you would like to complete a short survey it will help us better assist you in the future.', 125806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The password you have entered is incorrect. Please hold while security is dispatched to your location.', 125805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way, Archdruid. She is down on the island!', 125803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This vrykul is the heir to the God-King. She seeks an audience with Eyir.', 'This vrykul is the heir to the God-King. She seeks an audience with Eyir.', 125802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up here, Archdruid! We have found her!', 125801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do you return to Skold-Ashil, outsider?\n\n...and who is this vrykul you bring with you?', 125800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus on the camp!', '', 125799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got the flanks, $ct!', '', 125798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh well. Be seeing you!', '', 125797, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 79843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I got nothing.', '', 125796, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 79842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare stand at the gate to my realm? So be it.', '', 125795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... This is harder than it looks! Have YOU ever tried to come up with a sweet catchphrase right on the spot?', '', 125794, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 79841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Errr... wait. I should say something cool and memorable before I go.', '', 125793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 79840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So listen up. While you deal with this little mess I may or may not have caused, I\'m gonna make a dramatic exit.', '', 125792, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 79839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s tough to savor a juicy slab of boar meat when you\'ve got a bloody lip. Know what I mean?', '', 125791, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 79838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me, I\'m not much of a fighter.', '', 125790, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 79837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruined a perfectly good nap.', '', 125789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 79836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You really shouldn\'t sneak up on people like that.', '', 125788, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 79835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Whoa there!', '', 125787, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 79834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help our forces, Archdruid. I will try to find their commander.', '', 125786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces have been able to push them back to their barricades, but more keep appearing as if from nowhere.', '', 125785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have made quite the home on Broken Shore. It has gone on long enough.', '', 125784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your fighting skills have improved, Almai. I think you have grown beyond the life of a simple brewer.', 125783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster, I\'m so sorry about the disruption! I will get everyone back to work right away.', 125782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grandmaster $n, you have my sincere thanks.', 125781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The enemy approaches!', 125780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your wits about you. I doubt we\'ll be alone for long.', 125779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rebellion... will never die...', 'The rebellion... will never die...', 125778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least I died... free...', 'At least I died... free...', 125777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for Suramar.', 'My life... for Suramar.', 125776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta catch \'em each!', '', 125775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get started.', 'Let\'s get started.', 125774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will end the Burning Legion or die trying.', 125773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step on the rune. Hurry!', 125772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster! Hang on! We\'re coming!', 125771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to parse this out in what we can do and what we can\'t do. \n\nWe CAN go through this portal to a demonic gateway that I made a connection with. \n\nWe CAN\'T know what\'s on the other side because magic does not work that way.\n\nSo, you go first. Good luck, \"hero.\"', '', 125770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Option 3: Use the power of your artifact weapon on the computer.', 'Option 3: Use the power of your artifact weapon on the computer.', 125769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Option 2: Take out your frustration on the computer, repeatedly kicking it as hard as you can.', 'Option 2: Take out your frustration on the computer, repeatedly kicking it as hard as you can.', 125768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Option 1: Unplug the power cable to the computer, and plug it back in.', 'Option 1: Unplug the power cable to the computer, and plug it back in.', 125767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter password: \"L0rd Meph1str0th rulez.\"', 'Enter password: \"L0rd Meph1str0th rulez.\"', 125766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter password: \"password.\"', 'Enter password: \"password.\"', 125765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter password: \"All worlds shall burn.\"', 'Enter password: \"All worlds shall burn.\"', 125764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward, to victory!', 'Onward, to victory!', 125763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May fate favor you. Kruul\'s minions will surely flock to his aid.', '', 125762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Magistrix and her thugs will fall!', 'The Magistrix and her thugs will fall!', 125761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family needs me. Thank you, hero!', 'My family needs me. Thank you, hero!', 125760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take care traveling through Stormheim, outsider. Being the daughter of Skovald has won me many enemies.', 125759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will proceed on foot. Fare thee well, outsider.', 125758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wounds... are too great...', 125757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gods smile upon me this day!', 125756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s risky, but a small taste should give us just the boost we need. Bottoms up!', 125755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen so many demons in one place! Our only chance is to drink the Storm Brew.', 125754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will fall beneath my spear!', 125753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. Rise, Sigryn! I name you God-Queen of the Tideskorn!', 125752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I will. If it takes my last breath, I will unite the Tideskorn once more, so that we may drive the Legion from this land!', 125751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you set aside your misgivings and do what is needed for your people?', 125750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know now that my visions were true. You are destined to unite the Tideskorn against the Legion.', 125749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You possess the strength and will to overcome the fel... something no vrykul before you has ever done!', 125748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?! Surely after the mistakes I\'ve made, I am unfit to rule our people!', 125747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am pleased to see you returned. My judgement is this: you are to assume the burden of the crown. You must become God-Queen!', 125746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will accept whatever punishment you deem just.', 125745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wondrous Eyir, I come to humbly beg your forgiveness for what I\'ve done.', 125744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me, Eyir...', 125743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... the fel will not take me... It will not!', 125742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vengeance will not bring her back, Sigryn. Your people require a leader. If you fail, the Tideskorn are doomed!', 125741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... mother... I must avenge your death!', 125740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must overcome the corruption, Sigryn! You have the strength!', 125739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... what am I doing? This is not right!', 125738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. You have chosen death!', 125737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will give you a choice. Leave here... or die.', 125736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s this? The outsider has come to stop me? I owe you much, but I cannot allow you to impede my quest for justice!', 125735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot hide behind these walls forever, Odyn!', 125734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can power the portal for a short time. You will need additional power if you need to use it again.', 125733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sigryn... what have you done?', 125732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother! I come to avenge you!', 125731, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 82894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will show Odyn what true fear looks like, even if I have to tear down the Halls of Valor around him!', 125730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sigryn! No! You must not let the darkness take hold!', 125729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brother was right! The titan watchers have no more honor than the Legion!', 125728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He decreed that the lineage of Skovald be ended... in blood.', 125727, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn feared that the God-King\'s heirs would offer the Tideskorn into the hands of the Legion.', 125726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?!', 125725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So be it. It was Odyn himself who ordered the deaths of Skovald\'s family.', 125724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do.', 125723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, child... no good can come of such truths. Do you truly wish to know?', 125722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me... who ordered the death of my mother?', 125721, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Ask it, child.', 125720, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, if I am to serve you as queen, I have something to ask in return.', 125719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great Eyir, as you bid me, I have defeated the rival claimants to the throne of the Tideskorn.', 125718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it is true... the highlord returns.', '', 125717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s... gone...', 125716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Brother!', 125715, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe then... you will see...', '', 125714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you should ask them who sent the assassins for us that night...', '', 125713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you think your masters so superior to mine...', '', 125712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry, brother. I cannot allow the Legion to corrupt the vrykul.', 125711, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... it\'s not possible...', '', 125710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I will not share your fate!', 125709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in, sister! Only through the fel could you hope to defeat me!', '', 125708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor sister... if you will not join me, then you are my enemy!', '', 125707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, I will never be a tool for the Legion!', 125706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something in our blood made us resist its influence... but it remains within. All you need to do is give in!', '', 125705, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 82277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you don\'t remember our father feeding us the fel. The sickness it caused in you must have clouded your mind.', '', 125704, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, Torvald... you\'ve succumbed to the fel! But how?!', 125703, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How?! I embraced the gift that father left us! The one you and mother so vehemently denied!', '', 125702, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Torvald, it is you! I didn\'t want to leave you, but I wasn\'t strong enough! How did you survive the assassins?', 125701, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sister... it\'s been a long time since you left me for dead.', '', 125700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should waste no time. To Vrekt!', 125699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you hear that? We better see what\'s happening outside!', 125698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The Drekirjar will back your claim to the throne. But there is another that should cause greater concern.', '', 125697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold! You have proven your strength! I am defeated.', '', 125696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drekirjar never yield!', '', 125695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care if you\'re the daughter of Odyn himself, girl. I\'ll skewer you for your impudence!', '', 125694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you yield?', 125693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jarl Velbrand! As the blood of Skovald and at the behest of Eyir, I claim the throne of the Tideskorn!', 125692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will continue to Hrydshal. See you there, $c.', 125691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am defeated. It seems I underestimated you, shieldmaiden.', '', 125690, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your blade!', '', 125689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cease your prattling, Runeseer!', 125688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have your father\'s fury, shieldmaiden, but I also sense in you his darkness.', '', 125687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancestors, to my side!', '', 125686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, the God-King\'s whelp comes to finish what he started? Skovald\'s time is done, girl, as yours soon shall be!', '', 125685, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Runeseer Faljar! I am Sigryn, blood of Skovald. In the name of the Valkyra, I challenge you for the rule of the Tideskorn!', 125684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will ride ahead to Haustvald. I would be honored if you would join me there, $n.', 125683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be your instrument. Tell me what I must do.', 125682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. If I truly am so important to the Tideskorn, then I cannot turn my back on this task.', 125681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know this is a great burden on you, child, but you may be our only hope.', 125680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fail, and the Tideskorn will splinter, leaving nothing to stop the Legion from overtaking Stormheim.', 125679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a child of Skovald, you hold a claim to his throne. Any who dispute your right to rule must be made to bend the knee.', 125678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The outsider speaks true. Long ago, I foresaw the Valkyra uniting the Tideskorn against a terrible foe. At its head would stand a descendant of God-King and Shieldmaiden.', 125677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This outsider says I am to unite the Tideskorn...', 125676, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the blood of Skovald has returned to the Valkyra? Do you know what this means, child?', 125675, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illustrious Eyir, the child of prophecy has arrived!', 125674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... that face... Come with me, child!', 125673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The God-King\'s heir!? What is this nonsense?', 125672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The armor these women wear... reminds me of my mother\'s...', 125671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skold-Ashil! As a girl, my mother told me stories of this place and its mighty shieldmaidens. It is as grand as she described it!', 125670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So just to be safe, I wouldn\'t mention how the would-be God-King met his end.', '', 125669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One minor detail. If this prophesied leader truly is the God-King\'s heir, Skovald\'s demise may prove to be a point of contention.', '', 125668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 83100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The command console stands coldly before you. Glowing demonic runes dancing across the surface of the terminal.>\n\nAccess granted.', '', 125667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The command console stands coldly before you. Glowing demonic runes dancing across the surface of the terminal.>\n\nPassword Required:', '', 125666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Last door! Hurry!', 125664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! We need to get this door open.', 125663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t see the brewmaster anywhere. Could she have made it out?', 125662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There he is!', 125661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon your pathetic world will learn firsthand the wrath of Kruul!', '', 125660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide? Pah! You have grown delusional in your age, Prophet.', '', 125659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, warrior.', '', 125658, 0, 41244, 0, 64, 0, 83128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, warlock.', '', 125657, 0, 18181, 0, 64, 0, 83127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, shaman.', '', 125656, 0, 40074, 0, 64, 0, 83138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, rogue.', '', 125655, 0, 18177, 0, 64, 0, 83137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, High Priest.', '', 125654, 0, 18176, 0, 64, 0, 83136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, Highlord.', '', 125653, 0, 26556, 0, 64, 0, 83135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, monk.', '', 125652, 0, 16276, 0, 64, 0, 83134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, mage.', '', 125651, 0, 18166, 0, 64, 0, 83133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, hunter.', '', 125650, 0, 7152, 0, 64, 0, 83132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, druid.', '', 125649, 0, 3622, 0, 64, 0, 83131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, demon hunter.', '', 125648, 0, 35823, 0, 64, 0, 83130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate has conspired to bring us together once more, death knight.', '', 125647, 0, 40073, 0, 64, 0, 83129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero! You have saved many noble souls from becoming fuel for the Legion\'s foul magic.', '', 125646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion defiles the shores of Stormheim! Do not allow a single demon to remain!', '', 125645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murgulis pauses for a moment and stares at you with what could be only guessed as a smile before swiftly running off.', '', 125644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh...', '', 125643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think the demons have any idea what will happen if they drink the Storm Brew?', 125642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had hoped we\'d be safe here. Until recently, the Legion didn\'t even know we existed.', 125641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, demon. You cannot hide from the Light!', '', 125640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many demons!', 125639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel a dark force in the distance, just inside the Twisting Nether. Let us see what lies behind the veil.', '', 125638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came here to peer into the void above the tomb, searching for answers to a question I did not know.', '', 125637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s completely drains the focusing iris! You lose! [PH]', '%s completely drains the focusing iris! You lose! [PH]', 125636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kruul\'s heart was stolen by the Legion.', 'Kruul\'s heart was stolen by the Legion.', 125635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will not abandon us.', '', 125634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it! I\'m cured!', '', 125633, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 82562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt your coming, $n. You bring dark omens this day.', '', 125632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murgulis motions towards the demonic structure upon the southern shore.', '', 125631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gahgll grllg!', '', 125630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 79788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have these creatures devour your soul, piece by piece!', '', 125629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this disturbance?! I will not tolerate further delays in preparing these creatures!', '', 125628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should go to the landing before we miss him again. After you!', 125627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet Velen spends much time tending the wounded. We should start in the first aid building.', 125626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was headed to Krasus\' Landing, muttering something about the tomb.', 125625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You just missed the Prophet, I\'m afraid.', 125624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never trust a mage to handle a demon hunter\'s job!', 125623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have ruined your own lands, outsider. You will not ruin mine!', 125622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, that seems to have made things worse. Try adding a bit of Shadow magic instead.', 125621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Let\'s show those demons what we\'re made of!', 'Thank you! Let\'s show those demons what we\'re made of!', 125620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks. I thought we were safe from the Legion here...', 'You have my thanks. I thought we were safe from the Legion here...', 125619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings on you, friend!', 'Blessings on you, friend!', 125618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew, that was uncomfortable. Thank you!', 'Whew, that was uncomfortable. Thank you!', 125617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murgulis points towards a sickly looking fish before looking back at you. It seems he wants you to do something about it.', '', 125616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The heart of Highlord Kruul... not good.', 125615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murglll... Gruggl urg grullulll!', '', 125614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 79958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There could still be demons lurking about. Keep ready.', 125613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s gains the effect of |cFFFF0404|Hspell:230981|h[Severed Soul]|h|r!', 125612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brute seemed awfully keen on protecting it. Took off the moment he came outta the vault.', '', 125611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All\'s I know is it looked like some sort of heart. Ring any bells?', '', 125610, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo, I saw what that demon made off with. Come over here.', '', 125609, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll tell ya what the Legion was after - my bottom line! Legion-grade protection wards ain\'t exactly cheap, sugar!', 125608, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t know for some time, I\'m afraid. The inner sections are still covered in fel flame!', '', 125607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t even know if we\'re safe yet and you\'re asking about the vault?! Only the Council of Six are even allowed inside!', 125606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it matter? The vaults are home to the our most carefully guarded relics! Any one could spell disaster!', '', 125605, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our poor brewers! Perhaps using Detox will help them.', 125604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s head in.', 125603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grandmaster $n, thank you for coming so quickly. Help me open this door!', 125602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, Glutonia. What was the Legion after?', 'Fine, Glutonia. What was the Legion after?', 125601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did it take exactly?', 'What did it take exactly?', 125600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is anything missing from the vault?', 'Is anything missing from the vault?', 125599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any idea what was taken?', 'Do you have any idea what was taken?', 125598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 125597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day to you.', 125596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was stolen in the attack?', 'What was stolen in the attack?', 125595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to access my bank.', 'I need to access my bank.', 125594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help you?', '', 125593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls to the ground!', '', 125592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrglgl! Grlmgrlmargl!', '', 125591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 79772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaghh gurl!', '', 125590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 79771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope the monks savor my Celebration Brew! Farewell for now, Grandmaster.', 125589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrglgl! Grlmrgl grmlgggl!', '', 125588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 79769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<<7.1 PTR>> Cheat me past all the 7.0 Nightfallen content! I want to test 7.1!', '<<7.1 PTR>> Cheat me past all the 7.0 Nightfallen content! I want to test 7.1!', 125587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse you outlander!', 125586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will do nicely!', 'This will do nicely!', 125585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Mischievous Sprite reveals its true form.', '', 125584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Medivh? Is that you?', 'Medivh? Is that you?', 125583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A ghostly figure of the former guardian hovers before you. You feel as if it is listening, waiting to be noticed...', 'A ghostly figure of the former guardian hovers before you. You feel as if it is listening, waiting to be noticed...', 125582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. Harmony must be maintained. Our very survival depends on it.', '', 125581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And a lot more barrels to contain it. It\'s volatile stuff, so ordinary wood won\'t be strong enough.', '', 125576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grandmaster! It is time for a celebration!', 125575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82436, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster $n! Brewmaster Blanche and I were just discussing the situation on the Broken Shore. The time has come to unite the forces of Azeroth and go on the offensive against the Legion.', '', 125574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My breath is the wrath of the storm! Show me where I should strike, little one, and our enemies will fall!', '', 125572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That vile demon is moving his vessel to attack the Gates of Valor! I\'ve sent one of my val\'kyr to aid you, hero. This battle must be won!', '', 125571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to take the Eye of Aman\'thul to Dalaran.', 'I am ready to take the Eye of Aman\'thul to Dalaran.', 125570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth rests in our hands.', '', 125569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, you seem perturbed. Do you have a problem?', 125568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Stormstout Brewery.', 'Take me to Stormstout Brewery.', 125567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. I will meet you there!', 125566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no! Just as our Storm Brew production has finally gotten underway, too!', '', 125565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grandmaster! Stormstout Brewery is being overrun by the Legion! Please help us!', 125564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready your grapple, Deathlord. Let\'s get to that peak.', 125563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die in Illidan\'s name!', 125562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The bank? How could--', 125561, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 82821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Trial of Valor (Raid).', 'I want to go to the Trial of Valor (Raid).', 125560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport me to the Broken Shore.', 'Teleport me to the Broken Shore.', 125559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Malorne looks at you, approval in his eyes.>', '', 125558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Asgrim! You will pay for this corruption, demon!', 125557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold your honored champion, Val\'kyr! I am sure this will be a touching reunion...', '', 125556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But please... do continue your feeble attempts at survival. I enjoy watching you struggle!', '', 125555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic mortals! Even your little Val\'kyr cannot save you from destruction...', '', 125554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should return to Deliverance Point at once, $n. There have been some... shall we say... new developments.', '', 125553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 83272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gruuuuu.....', 'Gruuuuu.....', 125552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mimiron, I miss Hati\'s old look, can you change it back?', 'Mimiron, I miss Hati\'s old look, can you change it back?', 125551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to be the very greatest!', '', 125550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks, friend!', 'Many thanks, friend!', 125549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t escape oblivion!', '', 125548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are futile!', '', 125547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Shriek and squirm! Let your anger shout to the heavens before you die!', '', 125546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They always blow up so fast.', '', 125545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww, you\'re all blown up!', '', 125544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the master wills!', '', 125543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood! Blood everywhere!', '', 125542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... resist...', '', 125541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters, monsters everywhere!', '', 125540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancestors speak to me! They say you must die!', '', 125539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... this isn\'t the Halls of Valhallas!', '', 125538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Odyn\'s beard... where am I?', '', 125537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, tiny stranger.', '', 125536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse these demons!', '', 125535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voices... they lied! They weren\'t the ancestors!', '', 125534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!', '', 125533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should return to my tower. I imagine we have much to discuss...', '', 125532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... $n. Thank you for sparing my life. I was... not myself...', '', 125531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... the ley lines are still too weak... Without magic... Azeroth will surely...', '', 125530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That went well. Now, on to the destruction of Azeroth...', '', 125529, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 81694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to see what limitless power can do!', '', 125528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them off! For the sake of Azeroth!', '', 125527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defy the will of the Legion, Archmage. All will perish!', '', 125526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must project this power back through the iris!', '', 125525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... this is not right!', '', 125524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have ALL THE MANA!', '', 125523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat magic, imposter!', '', 125522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drained of magic, your world will be ripe for destruction by my demon masters... and my power will be limitless!', '', 125521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, $c! With the Focusing Iris under my control, I can siphon the arcane energy from Azeroth\'s ley lines directly into my magnificent self!', '', 125520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Path of Suffering on the Broken Shore.', 'Take me to the Path of Suffering on the Broken Shore.', 125519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Arcing Depths.', 'Teleport to the Arcing Depths.', 125518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Palace Courtyard.', 'Teleport to the Palace Courtyard.', 125517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to have a blast!', '', 125516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll see that I possess an explosive personality!', '', 125515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me... with all your anguish!', '', 125514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like I\'ll have to do that myself!', 'It looks like I\'ll have to do that myself!', 125513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do they expect me to be top DPS if I have to move whenever there\'s a little bit of fire on the ground?', '', 125512, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pretty much live my life in the shadows. Why? It\'s a lifestyle choice. You probably wouldn\'t understand.', '', 125511, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t get kicked off my last team. I ditched them because they were scrubs!', '', 125510, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the secret? Go practice on boars for like ten years like I did. You\'ll get ripped... plus you get bacon.', '', 125509, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I mean to kill the hunter I dueled? Nope. I thought he was playing dead, that\'s why I kept stabbing him. I mean, who dies that easily anyway? What a scrub.', '', 125508, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I come ever come for you, you won\'t see me coming. Unless I let you, and then I\'ll be the last thing you\'ll ever see!', '', 125507, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to know what tier I am? God tier, bro. God tier.', '', 125506, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want my opinion? Live to win, \'till you die! That\'s what I do.', '', 125505, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever cheated death? You know I invented that, right?', '', 125504, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...So then I said, \"You can\'t kill what you can\'t see!\" Then I vanished! HAHA! You should have seen the look on the kid\'s face. He nearly dropped his ice cream cone!', '', 125503, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Poison? Why even bother with that, just do it from behind!', '', 125502, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I quit my last team because they were scrubs. All of them! I\'m making a new team, but I doubt you are good enough to join. Just spread the word, alright?', '', 125501, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death from above? I\'ve done that 1,979 times! Do you want to be number 1,800? Didn\'t think so.', '', 125500, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...so then I was like, \"Cool story, bro.\" HA!', '', 125499, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rezzle glad to help friend. See, Rezzle not bad demon!', '', 125498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide the Flame Orbs of Felo\'melorn', 'Hide the Flame Orbs of Felo\'melorn', 125496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reveal the Flame Orbs of Felo\'melorn', 'Reveal the Flame Orbs of Felo\'melorn', 125495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trapped in time.$b$bSee, THIS is why I stick with telemancy! Chronomancy is dangerous stuff.$b$b<Oculeth pauses for a moment.>$b$bThey could be stuck. Forever. We must stop Elisande!', '', 125494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power of the Nightwell unleashed...$b$bThere must be another way. We will find it!', 125493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande... what have you done?', 125492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t think it possible! The energies required...', '', 125491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Progress will be reset if you leave this instance. Are you sure you want to leave?', 'Progress will be reset if you leave this instance. Are you sure you want to leave?', 125490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to leave the Wailing Caverns.', 'I would like to leave the Wailing Caverns.', 125489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me into the Wailing Caverns.', 'Take me into the Wailing Caverns.', 125488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wailing Caverns are overrun with deviate pests. \n\nWe must exterminate them when their numbers grow too great.', 125487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only those who have trained extensively can enter.\n\nWhen you have trained 15 pets to their maximum level, you will be ready.', 'Only those who have trained extensively can enter.\n\nWhen you have trained 15 pets to their maximum level, you will be ready.', 125486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the requirements to enter?', 'What are the requirements to enter?', 125485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your way there at once and meet with my servant, the mighty Vethir. Together, you will show the Legion how we greet their kind in Stormheim!', '', 125482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Azsuna are in your debt, hero!', '', 125481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps. I can see a number of benefits to our new position.', 125480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the battlefield, I am ready to lend my aid.', 'Send me to the battlefield, I am ready to lend my aid.', 125479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our war against the Legion has exacted a heavy price. Many brave heroes lost their lives in this campaign. Those sacrifices must not be in vain.\n\nLet us seize our chance for victory!', '', 125478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have some cleanup to do here. See you soon, $n.', 125477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. Out of the frying pan and into the fire. Well, at least we are better positioned to fight the Legion here.', 125476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see where we ended up, shall we?', 125475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nor\'Danil Wellspring has been taken by the Legion! Eradicate the infestation before all of Azsuna is overrun!', '', 125474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, and do send the Kirin Tor my regards when you see them!', '', 125473, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s still a great deal of work to do to clear these rebels out, but thanks to your efforts it should take no time at all!', '', 125472, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve already regained control of most of the critical systems - including the teleportation network to get you back safely to Dalaran!', '', 125471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! That\'s the last time Sicco Thermaplugg will rear his ugly head in our city.', '', 125470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no you don\'t! I came prepared!', '', 125469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send everything we have. All of it! Protect me you fools!', '', 125468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Sensors indicate Thermaplugg has retreated to the Tinker\'s Court below. You have to take him out once and for all!', '', 125467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO! MY MISSILE!', '', 125466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warpweaver Tuviss conducts his business in the Simply Enchanting shop.', 'Warpweaver Tuviss conducts his business in the Simply Enchanting shop.', 125465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Talisman of the Shal\'dorei swells with power, dispelling the palace wards.', 'The Talisman of the Shal\'dorei swells with power, dispelling the palace wards.', 125464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit back, take a load off! It\'s mathematically impossible for you to do anything but die miserably at this point anyways.', '', 125463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tick-tock, tick-tock. We\'re nearly ready to launch!', '', 125462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re here.', '', 125461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt in the Mekgineer-Lord\'s name!', '', 125460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preparing to engage.', '', 125459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are.', '', 125458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have them in my sights.', '', 125457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons systems primed.', '', 125456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggressor within proximity vectors.', '', 125455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Low levels of obedience nearby. Identifying source.', '', 125454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat sensors triggered.', '', 125453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy detected. Priming combat relays.', '', 125452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unauthorized entity nearby.', '', 125451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have this unwanted intrusion under control. Do be a dear and check on Seer Akalu, won\'t you, Slayer $n?', 125450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81489, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder detected in this sector.', '', 125449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lupine Geartooth looks in your direction!', '', 125448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard something over here.', 'I heard something over here.', 125447, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t make it out of here alive.', 'You won\'t make it out of here alive.', 125446, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your head will decorate these halls!', 'Your head will decorate these halls!', 125445, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares step in Thermaplugg\'s domain?', 'Who dares step in Thermaplugg\'s domain?', 125444, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We aren\'t alone.', 'We aren\'t alone.', 125443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see that?', 'Did you see that?', 125442, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone is close.', 'Someone is close.', 125441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reveal yourself in Thermaplugg\'s name!', 'Reveal yourself in Thermaplugg\'s name!', 125440, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out so I kill!', '', 125439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What there?', '', 125438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me see thing!', '', 125437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh? What that?', '', 125436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show self!', '', 125435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trogg no stupid!', '', 125434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable! My calculations were... perfect...', '', 125433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is fine. Everything is a-ok, peachy-keen!. Just need to murder you, knock out these unsightly dents you\'ve caused, and we can finally obliterate all your precious friends.', '', 125432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon, c\'mon, where\'s that blasted explosion button? I KNOW I INSTALLED AN EXPLOSION BUTTON!', '', 125431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to think that you\'re going to die down here, all alone. Just like I was left for dead all those years ago.', '', 125430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to have to try much harder than that, noble hero. I am the greatest inventor in all of Azeroth!', '', 125429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power my allies provide. I, Mekgineer-Lord Thermaplugg, will be your end!', '', 125428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should congratulate you, hero, but I\'m afraid your efforts are in vain. I will build a new missile, and this time YOU won\'t be around to stop me!', '', 125427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He... comes...', 125426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How it this possible? You are NOTHING!', 125425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world, all worlds, will burn! It is your destiny!', 125424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are more powerful than I thought. No matter.', 125423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is hopeless. We are everywhere. We are Legion!', 125422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late, mortal. Azeroth\'s fate is sealed.', 125421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well, little gnome. Soon none will remain to stand against the might of the Legion!', 125420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The weapons are badly damaged. If we activate them now, they could destroy us, too... Perhaps if we divert energy from the main engine core...', 125419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our service, Daumyr! Hop on, Deathlord. It\'s time to return to Acherus.', 125418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot hold out much longer. We must destroy those shipss!', 125417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am impressed. Letting go of the Nightwell was no easy task.$b$bIts power and allure will fade with time. As it was with us, they will find their own way in this world.', 125416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightwell...$b$bWith this, the nightborne begin a new chapter in Azeroth\'s history. Now that they are free of the shield and the Nightwell they have room to truly flourish. I look forward to seeing their progress.', '', 125415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the right decision.$b$bThe power here is too great, the responsibility too heavy. Even Elisande was destroyed by it. We must let it go.', '', 125414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will always wonder what might have been, had we chosen to save the Nightwell. What are we without its power?$b$bIn the end I trust in Thalyssra\'s judgment. Under her leadership I know the Nightborne will forge a new path.', 125413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightwell is no more.$b$bThese nightborne will learn to survive without its corrupting power, or they will perish. Let us hope it is the former.', 125412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It had to be this way. We no longer need the Nightwell, nor its power.$b$bWe must forge our own destiny.', 125411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was difficult! I am grateful for the help. I fear Jace may be in trouble in the control room!', '', 125410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mardum has been lost. Good riddance, if you ask me. Though it would be inconvenient to lose the Fel Hammer as well.', 125409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slayer $n, glad you made it back! They mean business this time!', 125408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
