('', 'No movement just yet. I suspect Elisande is quite comfortable with the current climate in the city. It is quiet. Perhaps our people are too afraid to cry out after the atrocity at the Waning Crescent...$b$bI have not been able to locate Vanthir. His name is conspicuously absent from our discussions.$b$bAs an amusing piece of trivia, Elisande is the least punctual person I have ever had the misfortune to serve.$b$bI will report in again as soon as I can. Take care, Thalyssra.', 125245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Ly\'leth\'s image peers at you expectantly. Would you like to hear the message it bears?>', 125244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande tried to make an example of me. Instead, she gave our movement all the support it could ever want.$b$bShe cannot be forgiven for her deeds at the Waning Crescent.', '', 125243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many familiar faces from the Waning Crescent! My heart is lighter knowing so many survived.$b$bFor the rest, I weep.', '', 125242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arcan\'dor is the Nightborne\'s future. Tasting the fruit has enabled me to serve my people as I have always wanted... free from Arcwine.', '', 125241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life, $n. And to Thalyssra, I owe my future.', '', 125240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanthir struggles to his feet.', '', 125238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to down to the surface.', 'Take me to Mardum.', 125237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me leave you to it. I will monitor your progress from afar.', '', 125236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish you luck, $p. A word of warning... If you leave this place, you will lose all progress and be forced to begin the task anew.', '', 125235, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No need to jump - our felbats are happy for a chance to stretch their wings!', 125234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air grows slightly warmer.', 'The air grows slightly warmer.', 125233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strange chill of a dark presence winds through the air...', 'The strange chill of a dark presence winds through the air...', 125232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go back, Kalec.', 'I\'m ready to go back, Kalec.', 125231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it, Archmage $n. Congratulations are in order, but I would like to do so in front of the others in the order hall.$b$bWhen you\'re ready, I\'ll teleport us back.', '', 125230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidari! We are needed on Mardum. Move out!', 125228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82813, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that rumble coming from the tower ruins? A bad omen, to be sure. Tread carefully!', '', 125227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal! You have met your doom!', '', 125226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have learned so much from Silgryn but there is still much I have yet to master.$b$bI hope it will be enough when the time comes to face Elisande.', 125222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grimoire\'s hold on him has grown stronger of late. He has become paranoid and obsessive.', 125221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slayer $n! We received an urgent message from one of our scouts on Mardum!', 125220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82812, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brace yourselves! The whole place is falling apart!', '', 125219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we have liftooooooff!', '', 125218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware, $c. The archmage may not greet you with his usual jovial demeanor.', 125217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that the best you can do? I suppose the Eredar are not known for their swordsmanship, are they?', 125209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A slow and weak blow. Pathetic.', '', 125208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! That shiny! You give to me?', '', 125207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find anythin\'? Any magic? Hey! Tell me!', '', 125206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! You find somethin\' good?! Somethin\' nice?', '', 125205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to trade.', 'I wish to trade.', 125204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there! Did you notice that I have finally been granted the rank of mage? Posthumously, of course... but it is a great honor nonetheless.$b$bWith the promotion came a new charge: sprucing up the tower. It could stand to be a bit more inviting in case Archmage Khadgar has further need of it.', '', 125203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! What are you doing?', 'You there! What are you doing?', 125202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MEATBALL HUNGRY!', '', 125201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are under attack and taking heavy losses. Legion portals are opening up everywhere! We need reinforcements!', '', 125200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady S\'theno went down to lend a hand a few hours ago, but this sounds serious. Should we follow after her?', 125199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82828, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slayer $n! We just received an urgent transmission from one of Belath\'s scouts on Mardum!', 125198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82827, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s mix this up!', '', 125196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One part death... Two parts destruction...', '', 125195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a dose of this!', '', 125194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little of this... A little of that...', '', 125193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My new allies have given me gifts beyond comprehension - you\'ve merely sent your lone savior to their death.', '', 125191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve grown delusional in your old age, Gelbin.', '', 125190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been soooo long since I\'ve had fun like this!', 125189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who am I kidding? THIS is the real me!', 125188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guess I... deserved this.', 125187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always... the same...', 125186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I bet you like me better this way!', 125185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You asked for it!', 125184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No redemption... for me...', 125183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shame... SHAME...', 125182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The rift is closing!', '', 125181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Virtue is overrated!', 125180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Purge dark thoughts from your mind. Remember her teachings!', 125179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been studying advanced magic. I might even apply to the Kirin Tor!', 125178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know... I sort of miss the old days.', 125177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so glad the Maiden showed us the right path!', 125176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being good... doesn\'t pay...', 125175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... let... the Maiden... down...', 125174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tried to be good... really!', 125173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want to play? LET\'S PLAY!', 125172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I no longer fraternize with your sort!', 125171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear... you ARE tempting!', 125170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Maiden would not approve!', 125169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Levia... yeah, I know her. She stays here every now and then. Last time was a couple days ago.\n\nShadow magic is a dangerous thing - that\'s why the Kirin Tor aren\'t fond of it in the city - but the things she dabbles in are a far cry worse than your average fare. I wish she\'d at least conduct her business outside of the city.\n\nYou\'re welcome to check upstairs and see if she left anything behind.', 125168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you enjoy my creation, brother. It saddens me that it ends this way...', '', 125167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The order\'s vaults contain a vast store of magical devices. There must be something here Dalaran can use...', '', 125166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know where I can find Levia Laurence?', 'Do you know where I can find Levia Laurence?', 125165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your tiny mind cannot comprehend the forces that will soon be at my command! Perhaps I should give you a taste...', '', 125164, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, brother! Don\'t give in to the darkness!', '', 125163, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, foolish brother. The Twisting Nether awaits me, and with it, unlimited power! All of Azeroth will kneel upon my return!', '', 125162, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop this madness, brother! You can still be redeemed!', '', 125161, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 82249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, yes, Levia. Tall girl?  Light hair? She was in here buying scrolls and ink - said she needed to make runes for a ritual or something.\n\nShe mentioned something about a specific kind of staff she needed, but we don\'t deal in those items here. I sent her off to the Militant Mystic.\n\nMaybe you should check there?', '', 125160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know where I can find Levia Laurence?', 'Do you know where I can find Levia Laurence?', 125159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ONE!', '', 125158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TWO!', '', 125157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THREE!', '', 125156, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000Hyrja|r leaps back into battle!', '|cFFFF0000Hyrja|r leaps back into battle!', 125155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0404Hymdall|r! leaps back into battle!', '|cFFFF0404Hymdall|r! leaps back into battle!', 125154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to activate!', '', 125153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me upstairs where we can activate this cube away from curious shoppers...', 125152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, go ahead and activate it... I\'m going to back up to an... observational distance', 125151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone\'s coming... Who are you?! W-wait! Unhand me! How dare you! Do you know who I am?!', 125150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 79374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems there is some kind of breach that runs beneath the Nightwell and into the palace itself! They are trying to seal it, but I am sure you can find a way to-', 125149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 79373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this a joke?', '', 125148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Don\'t stop the music!', '', 125147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meow Meow Meow.', 125146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meow Meow.', 125145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate the cube!', 'Activate the cube!', 125144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s lit, fam.', '', 125143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The cube\'s thrumming imparts a sense of anticipation>', '', 125142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squad up!', '', 125141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An attack on the main gate is ill-advised, but there may be another way. Andaris has dispatched her arcanists to the Sanctum of Order.', 125140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 79372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I gonna be an optimist about this?', '', 125139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But if you close your eyes...', '', 125138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande has appointed a new First Arcanist: a dreadful woman named Andaris. Together they are working on a massive enchantment to break the siege.', 125137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 79371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suh dude.', '', 125136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalyssra, I hope this message finds you well. I have just come from an emergency council regarding the Horde and Alliance forces amassing outside Suramar.', 125135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 79370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meow.', 125134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These blood elves are battle-hardened and disciplined. Their strength will be most useful.', '', 125133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t stop the music!', 125132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves use bows! I do not think a bow has been made in Suramar in centuries. I wonder if they would let me use one for practice...', '', 125131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is hard to believe we are all descended from the same elves. None of us are truly impervious to the passage of time, it seems.', '', 125130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It takes years to master spell-fencing. Victoire is much better suited to instruct the rebellion in basic martial maneuvers.', '', 125129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SAVAGE!', '', 125128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the vaunted Kirin Tor are here to see that we do not get into any trouble. I personally feel much safer now that they are here. I wonder, will they actually intervene if the kaldorei camp causes any trouble?', '', 125127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Your armies are chaotic and unorderly. Fortunately our blood knights and magisters will form the core of this assault, striking true into the heart of the city.', '', 125126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightwell. An unimaginable font of arcane power. What would have happened to the sin\'dorei if we had such a source?...$b$bNo matter. We have forged our own destiny. Our glory is our own, and we are no longer slaves to our hungers.$b$bThis siege is a momentous occasion, $n. We stand with long-lost kin, our enemies, against some of the most powerful magi in the world. Our actions will determine the future of all elf-kind.', '', 125125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to give up without a fight!', 'I refuse to give up without a fight!', 125124, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your judgment means nothing!', 'Your judgment means nothing!', 125123, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your judgment means nothing! The Burning Legion will destroy the Silver Hand!', 'Your judgment means nothing! The Burning Legion will destroy the Silver Hand!', 125122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I respect your judgment, Highlord. In time, I will prove myself worthy.', 'I respect your judgment, Highlord. In time, I will prove myself worthy.', 125121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at your service.', 'I am at your service.', 125120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not regret this choice.', 'You will not regret this choice.', 125119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pledge myself to the Silver Hand.', 'I pledge myself to the Silver Hand.', 125118, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will serve you with honor, Highlord.', 'I will serve you with honor, Highlord.', 125117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wards have abated! Let us cut through these vile cultists!', '', 125116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $n!', '', 125115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget your disguise!', 'Don\'t forget your disguise!', 125114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms, Horsemen! Let\'s clear the rest out!', '', 125113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will scout ahead and see what I can find near this tomb. Find me at the Broken Shore, $n!', '', 125112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 82265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will pay the nightborne back tenfold for what they did to our sanctum.', '', 125111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I will write a book about the history of the night elves. Their story is truly fascinating.', '', 125110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was speaking with the sin\'dorei magi. They tell me of the vast libraries of their home. I would like to see them someday...', '', 125109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Moon Guard are sworn to protect the land. Though our numbers are few, we will do what we can.', '', 125108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What trickery is this?!', '', 125106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck.', '', 125105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, High Tinker! Lowering the barrier now.', '', 125104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Winklespring, lower the barrier for a moment, please.', '', 125103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My lord... I have failed you...', 125102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 82856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me show you Nethersworn\'s mercy!', 125101, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 82855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such fools... Did you really think you could get away so easy?', 125100, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 82854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw the Sentinels doing target practice over in their camp. They sure can shoot...$b$bWe never really embraced the bow. After all, who needs such primitive instruments when you can craft the fabric of the world to fire missiles for you?', 125099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1, 2, 3, JUMP!', '', 125098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 125097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '', 125096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These blood elves have some formidable magic. Let us hope it is enough to counter the might of the Nightwell.', 125095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Duskwatch is formidable. We will need every capable fighter if we are to complete our objective.', 125094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash your fury, Al\'anath, so our visitors might grow stronger!', '', 125093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmagi, use your power to convince these two to join together!', 125092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I summon you, Al\'anath the Frostsoul, fury of the storm, shard of the glacier!', '', 125091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
