('<Recall your first visit to Suramar>', '<Recall your first visit to Suramar>', 124929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the story of Khadgar\'s temptation>', '<Recall the story of Khadgar\'s temptation>', 124928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the story of Illidan\'s Illidari>', '<Recall the story of Illidan\'s Illidari>', 124927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the story of Gul\'dan>', '<Recall the story of Gul\'dan>', 124926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the ascension of Warchief Sylvanas>', '<Recall the ascension of Warchief Sylvanas>', 124925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the retreat from the Broken Shore>', '<Recall the retreat from the Broken Shore>', 124924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the death of King Varian Wyrnn>', '<Recall the death of King Varian Wyrnn>', 124923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall your imprisonment in the Vault of the Wardens>', '<Recall your imprisonment in the Vault of the Wardens>', 124922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall your mission to Mardum>', '<Recall your mission to Mardum>', 124921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the demise of Illidan>', '<Recall the demise of Illidan>', 124920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Recall the Lightbound Vessel>', '<Recall the Lightbound Vessel>', 124919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A presence emanating from the cube urges your mind to think back on your experiences in the Broken Isles>', '', 124918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was THE Sicco Thermaplugg I sold that targeting computer to? Oh boy.', '', 124917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Tell Mux what you learned at Thermaplugg\'s camp.>', '<Tell Mux what you learned at Thermaplugg\'s camp.>', 124916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here.', 'Let\'s get out of here.', 124915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please do not tarry long here, $ct $n. This awful place saps my will with every breath.', 124914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gravity is fading in 15 seconds!', 'Gravity is fading in 15 seconds!', 124913, 0, 0, 0, 81, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, yes, I did forget to mention. This terminal will self-destruct in juuuust a moment. Farewell!', '', 124912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('asdf', 'sdf', 124911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assuming you survive the mass irradiation of the Broken Shore and the Legion\'s subsequent glorious march on all you know and hold dear, of course.', '', 124910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re hearing this message, you have earned an exclusive invitation to my glorious coronation as king of all mortals on Azeroth!', '', 124909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, surface-dweller! It is I, the one and only Mekgineer-Lord Thermaplugg!', '', 124908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carefully remove the punch card.', 'Carefully remove the punch card.', 124907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO NO NO NO NO NO NO ARRGGGH!!!', '', 124906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh I\'m really angry now!', '', 124905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They did not see me coming. A single blade striking from the shadows goes unnoticed, and a single crack in their defense opens.', 124904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! Oh, we\'re fighting dirty huh? Well, interrupt this!', '', 124903, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<These must be the remains of Grux\'s late assistant.>$B$B<You notice something just barely sticking out of the ash. It must be the punchcard she was trying to return!>', 124902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You\'ve seen tomes like this one before in the hands of the Legion. The Council of Six\'s concerns about their agents being involved in this were clearly well-founded.>', '', 124901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Commonly used as workhorse assistant in engineering shops, this copter has seen better days.>', '', 124900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the \"mastery of the arcane\" at their disposal and they still were not prepared for a pyroblast to the face. I almost feel sorry for them. Almost.', '', 124899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert the punch card.', 'Insert the punch card.', 124898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The machine clicks rhythmically in an idle state.>', '', 124897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You notice a slot on the face of the device that may fit the punch card Mux mentioned.>$B$B<If only you could find it...>', '', 124896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine Beacon', 'Examine Beacon', 124895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arluelle places a dusky purple flower before the little planter.', 124894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These vrykul must pay for defiling my citadel. Slay them! Raise them in the name of the Lich King!', '', 124892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to retrieve Rimefang\'s harness, but you are too late. It has fallen into the hands of invading vrykul, who now use it to bind frost wyrms to their will.', '', 124891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under your command, the Four Horsemen have wreaked havoc upon the demons. But now another path to power awaits.', '', 124890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have conducted your campaign against the Legion with brutal efficiency, Deathlord. I am pleased.', '', 124889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With you leading us, $ct, the Legion stands no chance.', '', 124888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The outskirts of the grand, ancient city of Suramar, where the Nightfallen fight for survival and the corruption creeps ever so slightly...', '', 124887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll head back to Dreadscar Rift and inform the other council members of our plan.', 124886, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well then, I think this one\'s outlived his usefulness, wouldn\'t you say?', 124885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if her acting had been less transparent, we wouldn\'t be out of a job!', '', 124884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! He\'s so insufferable! What a jerk.', 124883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m actually quite smart, I\'ll have you know.', '', 124882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I wasn\'t *really* scared all that time on stage. I\'m just a good actor. Really.', '', 124881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t tell the other cast members, but I\'m a little glad we\'re on break - I was worrying about getting typecast as a man in a metal suit for my entire career!', '', 124880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall ride ahead to scout. Meet you on the battlefield, Deathlord!', '', 124879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! They stand no chance.', '', 124878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In their death, we will find atonement.', 124877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion lacks honor. That shall be their downfall.', '', 124876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Did you expect me to call you \"my pretties\"? Maybe make some whirlwinds? It\'s called *acting*, my dahling.', 124875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, daaaahling, I am so glad to see you. Did you bring roses?', 124874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'People don\'t even recognize a true ingenue anymore! It\'s all so... tragic.', 124873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outstanding work, hero! Our alliance ensures the Legion will never conquer Azsuna!', '', 124872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone\'s gaga for these oh so \"clever\" retellings. Nobody appreciates the classics anymore!', 124871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s alright, dearie. I don\'t need anyone to run my lines with me. I\'ve got them pretty well memorized by now.', 124870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He once held your position, Netherlord. Kanrethad was the founder of our council.\n\nHe brought us together, despite our differences, and lead us in pursuit of greater power than we had ever known. \n\nIt was never enough for him though. After Illidan\'s demise at the Black Temple, Kanrethad became obsessed with the powers he witnessed there. He wanted to control demonic energies as Illidan did, and was prepared to do so at any cost.\n\nI swore an oath to Kanrethad, that should he be lost to the powers he tried to control, that I would banish him. It is an oath I must keep, for him, and for everyone else.', 124869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Mount Daumyr once more, Deathlord. Lead us into battle.', '', 124868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Kanrethad?', 'Who is Kanrethad?', 124867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must keep Kanrethad banished, no matter what the cost.', 124866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must admit, I am rather curious to explore the world beyond Suramar.$B$BPrimitive cultures have always fascinated me!', 124865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not too late to join us...', 'It is not too late to join us...', 124864, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it feels so good to be my old self again.$B$B<Valtrois runs the back of her hand gently across her high cheekbone.>$B$BAs you can see, mana is wonderful for the skin!', 124863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never realized how much we needed the Nightwell. To be rid of its call is... freeing.', 124862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for his power!', 'You are no match for his power!', 124861, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel flames will consume you!', 'The fel flames will consume you!', 124860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn!', 'You will burn!', 124859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true leader of the Black Harvest will rise again!', 'The true leader of the Black Harvest will rise again!', 124858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kanrethad, lend me your power!', 'Kanrethad, lend me your power!', 124857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our leader will return!', 'Our leader will return!', 124856, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be deterred!', 'We will not be deterred!', 124855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed you, Kanrethad!', 'I have failed you, Kanrethad!', 124854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... cannot be!', 'This... cannot be!', 124853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death will not be in vain!', 'My death will not be in vain!', 124852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon, Kanrethad will be among us once again!', 124851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re too late! The ritual is almost complete.', 124850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 82852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Bandage the injured matriarch.>', '<Bandage the injured matriarch.>', 124849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The injured matriarch had kept herself hidden until she smelled her lost hatchling. She is too badly injured to care for it, though.>', 124848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Echoes of the past swirl throughout your mind. Visions appear slowly at first, but soon begin to rapidly flash into and out of existence.$B$BHolding your gaze, you peer into the eyes of the Fragment of Medivh. Worlds beyond appear, then quickly fade into darkness.>', '', 124847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to learn the fate of Karazhan.', 'I wish to learn the fate of Karazhan.', 124846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has become of the tower?', 'What has become of the tower?', 124845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Whispers cloud your mind. Your thoughts become erratic.>', '', 124844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will enter combat shortly after leaving.\n\nWe recommend you take a moment to review your spell book and setup your action bar first.\n\nAre you ready to leave?', 'You will enter combat shortly after leaving.\n\nWe recommend you take a moment to review your spell book and setup your action bar first.\n\nAre you ready to leave?', 124843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_TWILIGHTFLAMEBREATH.BLP:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227573|h[Guardian\'s Breath]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_FIRE_TWILIGHTFLAMEBREATH.BLP:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227573|h[Guardian\'s Breath]|h|r!', 124841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right this way, Arluelle.', 'Right this way, Arluelle.', 124832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much has changed for me since you brought that fruit.$b$bI miss my brother dearly but I know why he gave himself to this cause.$b$bThere is something I must ask of you. I need to repay the others for their kindness. I need to avenge my brother\'s death.$b$bPlease take me to the First Arcanist so I can pledge myself to her cause.', 124831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This will hurt, $pc.', 124830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scratch that one.', 124829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a feathered frenzy!', 124828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swoop in!', 124827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won on a wing and a prayer!', 124826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay plucky, you will do better next time!', 124825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justice rains from above!', 124824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The warchief has granted me this post to study the birds of our region, so that we may better use them for carrying messages long distances. With such a central location near the trading hubs of the Horde, I have been able to acquire quite a large menagerie of exotic species. Care to try your luck against them?', 124823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion drains our dragon allies of their magic. You must rescue them!', '', 124821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He ran as far as he could. I will stay with him until his time comes.$b$bThank you... for everything. There is nothing more either of us can do.', '', 124820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In order to free our allies at the gate, this monstrosity must be destroyed!', 124819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tendrils of power are emanating from the aberration. I believe Elisande is using this creature to maintain the time lock spell.', 124818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From here, we have access to the palace grounds. We can open the gates from the inside!', 124817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time lock is broken! They are free!', 124816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An excellent plan. Good luck, heroes.', '', 124815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt our forces will be disoriented. I will inform them what happened and see that they make ready to resume our assault.', '', 124814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s motions for you to follow.', 124813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe the good man that was Archmage Xylem still exists underneath the madness.', 124812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have one final request, $c. Though it\'s likely Xylem will not hold back, please spare him his life.', 124811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will take time, but we may be able to use it to reach him.', 124810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His portal is unstable, but an echo of it remains.', 124809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. If they aren\'t going to put our show back on soon, why do I have to keep this stupid suit on?! It\'s so itchy...', '', 124804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must follow him through his portal. Go! Before it\'s too late!', '', 124803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the grimoire took my mind, just as it has eroded Xylem\'s... and now he has escaped with the Iris!', '', 124802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Stay your weapon...', '', 124801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late! Take care of my pursuer, Apprentice Sanath!', '', 124800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, you\'re pretty strong, aren\'t you? On second thought, don\'t try to stop me!', '', 124799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Focusing Iris will make me the most powerful mage of all time! Just try to stop me!', '', 124798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xylem... what have you done?', 'Xylem... what have you done?', 124797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow is... gone?', 'The shadow is... gone?', 124796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow... it consumed us...', 'The shadow... it consumed us...', 124795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was... almost gone...', 'I was... almost gone...', 124794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... where am I?', 'Where... where am I?', 124793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to have to train harder than that!', 'You\'re going to have to train harder than that!', 124792, 0, 0, 412, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no! Your form is all wrong!', 'No no no! Your form is all wrong!', 124791, 0, 0, 412, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re never going to defeat the Legion with those moves!', 'You\'re never going to defeat the Legion with those moves!', 124790, 0, 0, 412, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apprentici... attack!', '', 124789, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 81678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold a moment... you\'re not a real apprentice! Have at thee, imposter!', '', 124788, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 81709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do be careful. Wrong answers are bad for your health. And I do mean that quite literally!', '', 124787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvelous effort... but also completely, utterly, fantastically incorrect!', '', 124786, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 81375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you trying to... to brute force the barrier? That is NOT how you were taught!', '', 124785, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Order matters, apprentice! You may want to study your notes a smidge more.', '', 124784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you stop that?! You\'re making a mess!', '', 124783, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 81372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That had to hurt.', '', 124782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no! Not that one!', '', 124781, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 81370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, I can\'t concentrate when people keep dying at my doorstep!', '', 124780, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 81369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I hear something?', '', 124779, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 81368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, could ye come over here before ye leave?', '', 124778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot leave without the vase! It means everything to my master!', '', 124777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have ye scallywags ever even been to sea?!', 124776, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back to work, ogre! What do we pay ye for?', 124775, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit yer lollygagging or I\'ll make ye walk the plank!', 124774, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you have things handled, Scarleth. You and your girls should leave while you have a chance.', 'It looks like you have things handled, Scarleth. You and your girls should leave while you have a chance.', 124773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disgusting demonic filth will not lay a hand on my girls.', 124772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot leave without my children! They must be hiding...$b$bPlease, find them!', '', 124771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am right behind you! Go!', '', 124770, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind you!', '', 124769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can hide from Elisande? Die, traitors!', 'You think you can hide from Elisande? Die, traitors!', 124768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a blood elf and a $r sitting in the corner, discussing tactics. Nothing strange at all about that.', '', 124767, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad someone else is here. Invisibility spells are only getting me so far. Do they have some way of detecting it?', '', 124766, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect you both. Let\'s go!', 'I will protect you both. Let\'s go!', 124765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion is strong here. Try not to attract any unwarranted attention, $r.', 124764, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, lucky!', '', 124763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Try again.', '', 124762, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tread carefully, the Legion\'s presence is strong here.$b$bHave the nightborne forgotten all we lost in the War of the Ancients? This way lies destruction and death.', 124761, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it has something to do with the order Xylem teaches his apprentices. \n\nI only started learning Arcane, though, so I\'m not sure what the rest of the order would be.', '', 124760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll know you\'re ready to select your barrel when they all flash white.', '', 124759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch closely as they move around, and select the correct barrel when they stop.', '', 124758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna jumble these all about; but the keg with the ale still inside will flash yellow before all that starts.', '', 124757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, hello.  Can I help you with something?', '', 124756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why we play a game o\'  course!', '', 124755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $n. Wanna know what we do when we\'ve drunk all but one keg \'o ale?', '', 124754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me? Haven\'t got a clue. Just don\'t listen to anything Wix says. \n\nHe gets some sick satisfaction from watching apprentices fry themselves on that puzzle.', 124753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 661, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you do, don\'t try touching those gems unless you know the right order. \n\nI\'ve seen what happens when you touch the wrong one, and it\'s not pretty.', 124752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that thing? \n\nWell, I\'ll tell you what I know - the first gem is definitely fire...\n\n<Wix quietly chuckles to himself.>', '', 124751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 11, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('Why are you botherin me? \n\nJust because you\'ve got some fancy robes you think you can boss us around?', '', 124750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna be gettin past da barrier? Good luck, mon.\n\nJust make sure ya don\'t touch any of da crystals twice, ya hear? Bad things happen to dose dat do.', '', 124749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be tranin\' all day to make da archmage notice me down here, but so far nothin\'!\n\nI wonda if he\'s even gonna be takin\' any more apprentices...', '', 124748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the other apprentices was pretty sure the order was simply right to left. \n\nI think his name was... Heinrich?', '', 124747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure if I study hard enough that Xylem will let me in the tower. \n\nIf I could find a bonnie hat like the one you\'ve got, that couldn\'t hurt either.', '', 124746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw one of the apprentices enter once, though all I was able to see was that he activated the white gem before the red one.', 124745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had a nice outfit like you before, but I got tired of being challenged by the other apprentices. \n\nI\'m sure Xylem will let me in the tower on the merit of my spellcasting!', 124744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of the inner circle apprentices told me \"One must master the traditional schools before delving into the realm of shadow.\"\n\nI think that was supposed to be a hint.', 124743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know anything about the barrier puzzle?', 'Do you know anything about the barrier puzzle?', 124742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah, Xylem\'s gone a little mad, but he\'s still a renowned archmage!  Just think of what I could learn from him!', 124741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eneas, you need to go now.', 'Eneas, you need to go now.', 124740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son was injured in the chaos... I have not been able to move him. Please, help us!', '', 124739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to get out of here. It isn\'t safe!', 'You need to get out of here. It isn\'t safe!', 124738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T-they gave us no warning. Lunette- my children! Ugh...', '', 124737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going!', 124736, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father!!', '', 124735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father will help you get to safety. Go downstairs now!', 'Your father will help you get to safety. Go downstairs now!', 124730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard screaming! I\'m scared!', '', 124729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father is waiting for you downstairs- hurry!', 'Your father is waiting for you downstairs- hurry!', 124728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'M-mother told me t-to hide.', 124727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Decipher the rules', 'Decipher the rules', 124726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A challenge? Very well, but ya be warned. Xylem has taught me mastery over frost.', 124725, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reset the game', 'Reset the game', 124724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF(Level 1)|r Begin the game.', '|cFF0000FF(Level 1)|r Begin the game.', 124723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a silly lookin hat anyway...', '', 124722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, geez! Take it!', '', 124721, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you for that hat!', 'I challenge you for that hat!', 124720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First the stupid trials and now he\'s got me digging through dusty old ruins. This inner circle gig better be worth it.\n\nWhat? Go away, you. I\'m archaeology...ing...', '', 124719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Archdruid! Over here!', 124718, 0, 45952, 0, 64, 0, 0, 81104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('------------------------------$bMAXIMUM DIFFICULTY$b------------------------------$b\nThe console hums and whistles as you place your hand on it. The central display flashes with a never-ending cascade of glyphs, most accompanied by skulls or faces with \"X\"s over the eyes.$b$bHappy music plays. Is the console wishing you good luck with the most difficult challenge? Or is it saying goodbye?', '', 124717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('---------------$b   LEVEL 4$b---------------$b\nThe console responds to your familiar touch, lighting up a series of hexagonal patterns and playing happy music.$b$bIt is difficult to interpret the ancient symbols that crawl across the central display, but your understanding of the next difficulty level is that the majority of players who attempt it are mercilessly killed.', '', 124716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('---------------$b   LEVEL 3$b---------------$b\nThe console greets you warmly, despite its repeated attempts to murder you.$b$bThe symbols related to the next level of challenge seem to indicate that you should be expecting fewer hints, less time, and more mines.', '', 124715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('---------------$b   LEVEL 2$b---------------$b\nThe console beeps and chirps, recognizing you by the touch of your hand. The rules appear to have changed, and the pictographs now indicate that there is a timer involved.$b$bPenalty for not completing the puzzle in time seems to be pain rather than death. That\'s nice.', '', 124714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do your best to interpret the pictographs and ignore the persistent warnings about instantaneous death.$b$bThe HexSweeper console will generate a hexagonal grid, sensitive to one\'s footsteps. Several of the hexagons are \"mined\" and will obliterate the player. Alternatively, stepping on a \"safe\" tile will reveal the count of adjacent mines.$b$bThe object is to \"clear\" the field by revealing all of the safe tiles and by marking all of the dangerous ones with the little white flags provided.$b$bIt\'s unclear why the game feels it necessary to murder players who step on the wrong tile.', '', 124713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $r! You looking for something?', '', 124712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('---------------$b   LEVEL 1$b---------------$b\nThis mysterious arcane console lights up under the touch of your hand. Page after page of instructions flitter across the central panel. The language is unclear, but the iconography is self-apparent: Lots of skulls.$b$bThis is HexSweeper, a most dangerous game wherein one must traverse an arcane mine field and identify all of the booby-trapped areas. Instant death rewards the slightest misstep.$b$bYou wonder why anyone would want to do this for fun.', '', 124711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion must be trying to take advantage of the Nightmare\'s withering. I may have been the first attack, but I doubt I will be the last. We must find and defeat whoever is leading the attacks against our people.', '', 124710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will solve this.', 'We will solve this.', 124709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion tried to corrupt me?$b$bThe death of the human king led me to turmoil. I chose him as my champion because of his ferocity, but also his ability to conquer his bloodlust to uphold his beliefs and protect his people. I entered the Dream upon his death to reflect.$b$bBut in that time, the Legion must have found me.', '', 124708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were being corrupted by the Legion.', 'You were being corrupted by the Legion.', 124707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel... uneasy. What is going on?', '', 124706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope Xylem turns you into a cockroach...', '', 124705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! No more! You can take the stupid robes!', '', 124704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can beat me?! Well, how about five of me?!', '', 124703, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, um, need your robes...', 'I, um, need your robes...', 124702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the goblins already picked these ruins clean. \n\nAt this rate, I\'m never going to find something to impress the archmage!', '', 124701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told Aluriel you would come to rescue me and she merely laughed. Well who is laughing now?', 124700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, free at last! Thank you, Outlander.', 124699, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 78646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must put the Nightwell behind us. We must take responsibility for our failings, and repay our debt to the people of Azeroth.', 124698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, you deserve to know. Let me show you our new home...', '', 124697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noressa! I thought I would never see you again...', '', 124696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me everything that happened. About our daughter...', 124695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Absolon! What happened to you?', 124694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can make it to the border. Thank you. Tell Absolon I am coming!', 124693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is.. you! You delivered the letter!', 124692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let it die.', 124691, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra? It is your call...', '', 124690, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 78643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We could stabilize it! We no longer need the Nightwell to sustain us, but we can still harness its power...', 124689, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 78642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will fuel the Legion!', 'Your soul will fuel the Legion!', 124688, 0, 46148, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is dying. Without the Eye of Aman\'thul, the Nightwell has become unstable.', '', 124687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I would never see it again!', 124686, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 78640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
