('', 'That feels much better.', 124667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loosen your grip on your blade. No need to clutch it so tightly.', '', 124666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control your breathing. Exhale forcefully with your thrust.', '', 124665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
