('I am having difficulty spotting the infiltrators, Khadgar. Can you help me detect them?', 'I am having difficulty spotting the infiltrators, Khadgar. Can you help me detect them?', 124654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
