('Nooooo!', '', 124643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis tower has been abandoned for ages, surely dere be countless wonders locked inside. \n\nXylem will be so impressed with dis bounty, he\'ll have to let me in his inner circle. Now, if only I could get dis door open...', 124642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at me!', '', 124641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck!', '', 124640, 0, 0, 70, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid the volatile energy out there and... try not to fall, eh?', '', 124639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to pass through the energy orbs to recharge the dash ability I\'ve given you.  Oh and uh...', '', 124638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll cast a spell on you to empower you to dash through the air. Use it to the reach the goal off in the distance.', '', 124637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are again, $n. Ever notice how all this ley energy seems to just fly all over the place?', '', 124636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scurry, little mice!', '', 124635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You flee at the cost of your life!', '', 124634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay inside if you want to live!', '', 124633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay in your homes!', '', 124632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who goes there?!', 'Who goes there?!', 124631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something\'s not quite right...', 'Something\'s not quite right...', 124630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An illusion! What are you hiding?', 'An illusion! What are you hiding?', 124629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land has endured much suffering at the hands of the Burning Legion. Your actions have restored a measure of peace.', '', 124628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My defenses... were perfect...', '', 124626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has spread its corruption to the Heart of Val\'sharah! Our defenders need your aid if we are to have any hope of defeating the demons.', '', 124622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 81079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did they come from?', 'Where did they come from?', 124621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such actions will not go unpunished.', 'Such actions will not go unpunished.', 124620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others! Help the others!', 'The others! Help the others!', 124619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this...', 'Not like this...', 124618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do what you can, $n, but be careful.', 'Do what you can, $n, but be careful.', 124617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kaldorei, prepare to charge the concourse! Elune calls you to rid this city of evil!', 124616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sin\'dorei, secure the Promenade and hold position! The Light will deliver justice to our enemies this day!', 124615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shal\'dorei, the time has come to take back our city! Forward! Anath\'ashar!', 124614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra, you may lead the charge.', '', 124613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps I could make an exception.', 124612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am above this. My training gives me unyielding resolve.', 124611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have endured worse.', 124610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We stand against the Legion.', 124609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My loyalties have never changed.', 124608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande cannot get away with this.', 124607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I serve Suramar. All of Suramar.', 124606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 124605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tenu\'balah.', 124604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello.', 124603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 124602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Withering was less tiresome than this.', 124601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have nothing to offer you.', 124600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not certain why you still require my attention.', 124599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 124598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goodbye.', 124597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood.', 124596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day.', 124595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hm?', 124594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my attention.', 124593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 124592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello.', 124591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What brings you to Shal\'Aran in this dark hour?', 124590, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 78540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It breaks my heart to see him like this.', '', 124589, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friend lies just in here.', '', 124588, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire at will!', '', 124587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Dark Lady!', '', 124586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send the demons to hell! FIRE!', '', 124585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target acquired! Fire away!', '', 124584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All cannons, fire at the target!', '', 124583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannons at the ready... FIRE!', '', 124582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have what we need to secure the Sanctum. Now everything rests on Valtrois. When she is ready, you will be the first to know.', 124581, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Center your mind. You will be tested in the tradition of our order.', '', 124580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the guidance of the Moon Guard.', 'I seek the guidance of the Moon Guard.', 124579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to our crucible, where our most honored mages have been tested for millennia. Why are you here?', '', 124578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tread on hallowed ground, outsider. I trust you would not do so without purpose.', '', 124577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you seek: wisdom, or power? Both perhaps?', '', 124576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry. They\'ve ignored my advice to upgrade those wards for centuries now...', '', 124575, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Won\'t their wards block your telemancy?', '', 124574, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 78159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have an idea! A mass teleport... but I need help casting it.', '', 124573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tel\'arn\'s madness knows no bounds. If not for you, the beast might have destroyed the entire terrace.', 124572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tel\'arn\'s experiments have gone too far! A beast is rampaging across the terrace!', 124571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those traitors deserved their fate. History will remember their atrocities.', 124570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande\'s sycophants and concubines loiter about her private chambers atop the Nightspire. We cannot allow them to warn the Legion of our assault!', 124569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are one step closer to ending this madness. Elisande\'s final hour has come!', 124568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we can control the Nightspire, the palace will fall. Stop the ritual!', 124567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without a steady stream of supplies, the palace will soon fall! Well done.', 124566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find the palace\'s supply route and cut it off. Flightmaster Volnath should be near the captain\'s quarters.', 124565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let this be a lesson to those who flaunt their power.', 124564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande\'s personal construct is nearby. It would be a shame if something bad happened to it...', 124563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t believe our cover has been compromised. Quickly, find Aluriel and breach the gates!', 124562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fal\'dorei have breached the palace! Stop them before the guards take notice!', 124561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May they rest in peace. The Nightwell once sustained us, but it has become a source of pain... in many ways.', 124560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The souls of my ancestors are trapped by the Nightwell\'s power. We must free them from their torment.', 124559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shudder at the thought of an ettin empowered by the Nightwell. Thank you for saving us.', 124558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An ettin is rampaging through the catacombs! Stop it before it causes further damage!', 124557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never in ten thousand years did I believe the Legion would be at the very doorstep to the grove. \n\nNo matter what, I will never allow them to enter it!', 124556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_PRIEST_FLASHOFLIGHT.BLP:20|t Hyrja targets |cFFFF0000$n|r with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228162|h[Shield of Light]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_PRIEST_FLASHOFLIGHT.BLP:20|t Hyrja targets |cFFFF0000$n|r with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228162|h[Shield of Light]|h|r!', 124555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! The portal...', 124552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold the infinite Legion!', 124551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More souls to fuel the portal!', 124550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! What have you done?', '', 124549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put those wards up!', '', 124548, 0, 46599, 0, 64, 0, 78484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will see him back to safety. Go inform Thalyssra of our success.', '', 124546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Cough.> I need... to rest now. Thank you. Thank you for everything.', '', 124545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will see... hope... in the Dusk Lily.', '', 124544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They wanted to make an example. We have stolen their message and made it ours.', '', 124543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, old friend.', '', 124542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aran\'ethil... The nightmare is over!', '', 124541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relief... at last...', '', 124540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He will be fine. The fruit will bring him back.', 124539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lay still, my friend. We will get you out.', '', 124538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know. I only hope we are not too late.', 124537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How much time do we have?', 124536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is to be made an example for all to see.', 124535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll forever be grateful for this!', 'I\'ll forever be grateful for this!', 124534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise you, hero!', 'Praise you, hero!', 124533, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, much better. Thank you!', 'Ahh, much better. Thank you!', 124532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... it was only a flesh wound! I\'m still good to... OUCH! Nevermind, I\'ll head back to the defenses.', 'It... it was only a flesh wound! I\'m still good to... ow! Nevermind, I\'ll head back to the defenses.', 124531, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That worked even better than expected! I shall continue to refine my work for the next step.', 124530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life! I\'ll head back to our defensive line.', 'I owe you my life! I\'ll head back to our defensive line.', 124528, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen enough. I believe I can dampen the effect of fel magic on the Withered. Go to the Soul Engine and I will send new subjects your way.', 124527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... I\'ll make my way back to the defenses.', 'Thank you... I\'ll make my way back to the defenses.', 124526, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps. The First Arcanist will know how to proceed. Let us get these people to Shal\'Aran.', '', 124525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fel crystals anchor the Legion\'s power here. We should see what the Withered can do against them.', 124524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! ... I will be... fuel...', '', 124523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing! Insignificant gnat!', '', 124522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaza-kiel!', '', 124521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take great pleasure in grinding your soul to nothing!', '', 124520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You walk willingly to your death, mortal!', '', 124519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The telemancy orbs are working perfectly. Best we keep this quiet until we\'re ready for the real push.', '', 124517, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must put an end to this.', 124516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This should shock me, but it does not. Not after the Waning Crescent.', 124515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have been discovered!', 124514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That shall suffice for now. This positional data will enhance-- Oh, nevermind. You did a fine job.', '', 124513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Begin when ready. Use the surveyor and follow the alignment indicator. Uh... the light. Just follow the light!', '', 124512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So be it. I will send you to Silgryn. With his training you will serve us well.', 124511, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 78542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must be Arluin\'s sister. We owe him a great debt. His sacrifice was not in vain.', 124510, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 78539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is an honor to finally meet you, First Arcanist.', 124509, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 78538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brother rests here. My name is Arluelle.', 124507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fruit from this tree plucked me from the jaws of madness. I am whole now, and I wish to fight.', 124506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you remember me, outlander?', 124505, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She is waiting for you just outside.', 124504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent timing as usual, Deline.', '', 124503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! Everyone into the boat!', '', 124502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope she sees this...', '', 124501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot tarry here for long, I fear. Catch your breath.', '', 124500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE', '', 124499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If anything goes wrong, have your Withered at the ready. Good luck, $n.', 124498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will open the portal. The element of surprise will be in your favor!', '', 124497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. The barrier should be down.', 124496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, I shall begin. When I am finished, all the devices we have \"adjusted\" will cease working.', 124495, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m hesitant to take any action at this point. I\'ll return to Shal\'Aran and continue my research.', 124494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm.. they are redirecting a portion of the ley line\'s power directly to the Sanctum of Order.', 124493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t get it...', 124492, 0, 46048, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would expect this type of low blow from a dwarf...', 124491, 0, 46048, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, this was childish.', 124490, 0, 46048, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A clever cloaking spell, but what is that device? Keep watch.', 124489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who would leave such an insulting thing here?', 124488, 0, 46048, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those fel-sucking, city-dwelling narcissists!', 124487, 0, 46048, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ley line is being leeched, but I cannot see... wait! I have an idea.', 124486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, I request your aid for the sake of Suramar. The survival of my people depends on it.', '', 124485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! I have need of your aid. There is important work to be done.', '', 124484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! It is time to demonstrate your strength and skill once again!', '', 124483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am relieved they are safe, at least for now. Hmm, perhaps I should look into adoption...', '', 124482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The owlkitten patriarch, Yowlon, is having trouble herding his kittens back home. Look into those eyes, champion. You cannot possibly leave them in danger!', '', 124481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me to aid you. My dragon form is ill-suited for fighting in such close quarters, and we are accompanied by a capable champion.', 124480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My followers and I stand with you, Archdruid. Balance must be restored!', 124479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your greatest test is at hand. You must purge the Legion\'s corruption from Azeroth... once and for all.', 124478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archdruid, I have witnessed your power grow through every trial you have overcome.', 124477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such corruption can be relentless, but you have pushed it back... for now.', '', 124476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traces of Shaladrassil\'s corruption remain within Suramar. Perhaps the horns of the vile satyrs may be put to better use.', '', 124473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much has been asked of you in the course of this war, champion. I fear even more is needed.', '', 124471, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 81324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you two share a kinship. An ally is an ally... no matter now small!', '', 124470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unusual creature near the coast is challenging the local makrura. I sense it has a connection to you... Go to its aid, champion.', '', 124469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems dancing can be dangerous! Careful not to be too loose of foot.', '', 124468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackfeathers have named a new chieftain after the last... incident. It seems they intend to give their ritual another try.', '', 124467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, champion. You fight with the fury of a storm!', '', 124466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A frigid storm is brewing atop the peak near Hafr Fjall. Strike down its source before the land suffers in its icy wake!', '', 124465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the last one. One last knot to work loose, and the energy should flow freely again.$b$bI hope you are ready.', 124464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One down, two to go. Let me know when you are ready.', 124463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, you have arrived. I expected to find something here but...', 124462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember this power... Kel\'balor! The Crimson Thicket is our destination.', 124461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes? What do you want to know?', 124460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, and I know the convergence of ley lines feeds great power to the Nightwell. Harnessing that much power is perilous, but if she could...', 124459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our thanks, champion. We refuse to let the drogbar sabotage our way of life. We are Highmountain!', 124458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unruly drogbar have thrown our supply crates to the bottom of the chasm. Luckily, we have a convenient method for their retrieval...', 124457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Order has been restored. Your aid is always welcome here, champion. For Highmountain!', 124456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The drogbar are wreaking havoc in Thunder Totem, scattering our drums and chasing off our livestock. These disruptions must be stopped!', 124455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your control over such vast energies is impressive. That was no small task.', 124454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s examines the fragment.', '', 124453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you actually visualize the lines, or is it more that you sense them? Is it a constant sensation, or can you turn it on and off?', 124452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You go on ahead and inform Thalyssra. I have a few questions for our friend here.', 124451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know what she would be capable of. That is why we must stop her.', 124450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You made an excellent assistant. Your inherent knowledge of ley lines is almost as expansive as mine.', 124449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must rest before we make our way back to Shal\'Aran. That was more taxing than I expected...', 124448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s admires you.', '', 124447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chitters happily.', '', 124446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s seems content.', '', 124445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrr....', 'Rrrr....', 124444, 0, 0, 35, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is tired after its adventure!', '', 124443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, champion! It is here!', 124442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you plan to do, do it quickly. I sense the approach of something... hungry!', 124441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('unused do not translate', '', 124440, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those... those... night elves!', 'Those... those... night elves!', 124438, 0, 46048, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those throwback, tree hugging, kaldorei filth.', 'Those throwback, tree hugging, kaldorei filth.', 124437, 0, 46048, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did they even get the stuff to make this?', 'Where did they even get the stuff to make this?', 124436, 0, 46048, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to fight a random enemy!', 'I want to fight a random enemy!', 124435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t even guess what they made this out of.', 'I can\'t even guess what they made this out of.', 124434, 0, 46048, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this some sort of joke?!', 'Is this some sort of joke?!', 124433, 0, 46048, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Withered... defeated so easily by fel magic. Please... save those you can. My wounds... are of no concern!', 124432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As if I would bother with facing you myself. Felborne! Kill them!', 124431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test the mettle of your rebellion! Send your best to face me at Ly\'leth\'s estate... before I bring in more citizens for... questioning!', 124430, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor Thalyssra... you try so hard to save your people, yet you cut them off from the one thing that can restore them! I fear Ly\'leth shall pay the price for your arrogance.', 124429, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 78355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll show you what these corpses can do. Attack!', 124428, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 78351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! This is what you bring? An outlander and a pack of mindless, mana-starved corpses? You have fallen on hard times indeed.', 124427, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 78350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande made YOU First Arcanist? The pickings must have been slim indeed. Release Ly\'leth now!', 124426, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 78349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baroo!', 'Baroo!', 124425, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erk?', 'Erk?', 124424, 0, 0, 602, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Errrrrrr...', 'Errrrrrr...', 124423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m only mildly enthusiastic about this.', '', 124422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Valtrois.', 'I am ready, Valtrois.', 124421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to begin the ritual, $n?', 124420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This cave is really well hidden. I am surprised Oculeth managed to get us here in one piece.', 124419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cozy, secluded, and teeming with arcane energy. I might need to construct a workshop here...', 124418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
