('', '$n has turned in enough gold to bend the rules of the arena. Speak to a grunt if you\'d like to fight against a random brawler!', 124406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will take the teleporter to the estate and bring our most powerful Withered. Meet me there.', 124405, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 78348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the Bag of Chipped Dice.>', '<Present the Bag of Chipped Dice.>', 124404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You feelin\' lucky? $n wants you to talk to Pit Boss Buxdoggle and test your... gold-earning potential.', 124403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the High Roller\'s Contract.>', '<Present the High Roller\'s Contract.>', 124402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you watchin\' these fights? Lots of punishment bein\' handed out in that ring. I think I got hit with a tooth.', 124401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dun\'na listen to anything Thelaron says. Nothing beats a strong hammer, a molten flame and fine steel.$b$bSpeakin\' o\'which, I should get back ta work.', '', 124400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
