('I would like to make a suggestion for your studies. Check the top of the bookcase, if you will.', '', 124377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We tend to keep our distance, though. Ever since the research incident.', '', 124376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may help me find the ley lines, if you must. Just try not to get in my way.', 124374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
