('Moving on, could I interest you in a look at the dragons of the eastern shore?', '', 124367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was certainly interesting.', '', 124366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
