('', 'Attention, brawlers! $n has made a bargain with the Spirit Healers! Go ahead and die as much as you want!', 124363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hydras. Fascinating creatures, they are.', '', 124362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
