('', 'More frenzied fowl have overtaken this area. Cull their numbers before those eggs hatch.', 124345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware the sharp talons of these avian beasts! We have found them quite ferocious.', 124344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These feathered fiends are breeding out of control! End their cacophonous revelry!', 124343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
