('', 'You have done admirably in putting down this fowl menace.', 124340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Their wings are clipped.', 124339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another victory! You have proven to be quite the hunter of beasts.', 124338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange predators are encroaching on this ecosystem. Cull their numbers before they spread!', 124337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have our thanks. We will monitor their numbers closely.', 124336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free zeppelin rides for everyone, courtesy of $n! Come on over to the teleporter!', '', 124335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No worries. You might not have EARNED the right to go up on the zep, but some schmuck PAID me to let you go on. So you\'re good to go.\n\nHop onto that teleporter! It definitely, probably won\'t kill you!', '', 124333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The next tap should go here.', 124332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, moving along!', 124331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Present the Zeppelin Rental Form.>', '<Present the Zeppelin Rental Form.>', 124330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are in it now.', '', 124329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are going to poke at a ley line, at least make sure it\'s the right spot. Try a little bit to the right.', 124328, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 78299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SHA_ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE:20|tLook away when Things That Should Not Be cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void]|h|r to avoid being feared!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SHA_ABILITY_ROGUE_BLOODYEYE:20|Look away when Things That Should Not Be cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void] to avoid being feared|h|r!', 124327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Karlain, we could use your assistance.', '', 124326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to travel to Karazhan at once and discover what the Legion is after. I\'ll conjure a portal.', '', 124325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done enough, arcanist. I shall take you both to Shal\'Aran. Come with me.', 124324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done! The flow has been redirected to Shal\'Aran.', 124323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost... there. Just need to hold out a little longer!', 124322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The currents are chaotic... this will take time.', 124321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual demands my full concentration. Please ensure I am not interrupted.', 124320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has taken Karazhan! We MUST get it back!', '', 124319, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 78177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I was so distracted by our efforts on the Broken Isles that I neglected the defenses I put in place...', '', 124318, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 78178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a pity... I\'m afraid the results are imperfect. The message encoded into the crystal is scrambled. I can only make out a few--', '', 124317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to combine the fragments you recovered.', '', 124316, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of the bears will be with you. We shall be your steady guardians. Failure is not an option.', '', 124315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archdruid... you have no doubt proven your strength to me in the past. I will proudly stand by your side to face the Legion.', '', 124314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sin\'dorei and shal\'dorei, take the Promenade and hold it against our foes. Once we have that, the kaldorei ride ahead and take the Concourse.', '', 124313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My goodness. Was that a compliment?', 124312, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This final tap will allow me to steer the flow of energy, like the rudder of a ship. Right around here should do the trick.', 124311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine! We can do it your way. But if this entire cave ends up exploding with arcane energy, it will be on your head.', 124310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have spent millennia studying ley lines. I am certainly capable of finding one right beneath my feet!', 124309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not \"poking\" it, I am tapping-- Hmph. I suppose it could work there...', 124308, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 78300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait! This isn\'t what it looks like! We simply need to tap the... Oh. I guess it is what it looks like...', 124307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can do that? Perhaps you know a thing or two after all.', 124306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I can see the line and the focus of the conduit. You want to put it there.', 124305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you sure about that placement? It would be better here.', 124304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By placing the taps on key points of the ley line, I can direct its flow.', 124303, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our champion\'s presence is the only thing staying my hand. Speak quickly.', 124302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sought to hide, Nightfallen? I could sense your teleportation signatures from Azurewing!', 124301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erk!', 'Erk!', 124300, 0, 0, 602, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step back and raise your weapon. We will infuse it with a portion of this council\'s power.', 124299, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together! We must all lend our strength!', 124298, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 81327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power manifests: Kirin\'var torel, ahm shalar, azakim!', '', 124297, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 81331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now we focus on driving their armies from Azeroth. We will give everything we have and finish this... once and for all!', 124296, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 81329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion sought to use its agents to subvert our efforts at the Tomb of Sargeras. Thanks to your efforts, they failed.', 124295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Feral Spirit now to summon these spirits.', '', 124294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Feral Spirit now to summon these spirits.', 124293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... what do you--', 124292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we are! I am more or less locked on to the location you requested. Off you go!', '', 124291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next stop, sunny Azsuna! At least... it was sunny last time I checked. Which was only a few thousand years ago.', '', 124290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 124289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to go, $n? I always love teleporting to a new place!', '', 124288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mage portals take so long to cast. With telemancy, it is like instant transmission!', '', 124287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Telemancy beacons help supply power for teleportation triangulation. We should construct additional beacons.', '', 124286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels good to no longer be hungry. I bet I could teleport anything now!', '', 124285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should not linger. Let us see to Vanthir now.', '', 124272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... isn\'t... finished...', '', 124271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know.', '', 124270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She... was right... about you...', '', 124269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet you raise your blades against us! You are nothing but a traitor!', '', 124268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late, mortals! After I deal with you, this wretched world shall burn!', '', 124267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a conscience. I serve the people of Suramar.', '', 124266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disappointed her, spell-fencer. You could have taken my place, if you had remained.', '', 124265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, but I am not alone.', '', 124264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept your fate, Silgryn. You are outmatched!', '', 124263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How good of you to join us, Silgryn. Aluriel sends her regards!', '', 124262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your blade, Thoramir!', '', 124261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think to stop this demonstration? Very well. I will make an example of you first!', '', 124260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I couldn\'t get my shield up in time. What happened?', 124259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liadrin! I will attempt to pull her out, but doing so will require total focus. Be on your guard, $n.', '', 124258, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 78590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t maintain our protection any longer! We need to go.', '', 124257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'During the shattering of Azeroth, much knowledge was lost. But I, Lunelli, speak with the earth and the wind.$b$bThey have told me much and given me knowledge to pass on to those who think themselves worthy.$b$bSo, are you such a person?', 124256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time for that now. Let me get you somewhere safe!', '', 124255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I am well. What has happened?', 124254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close! I nearly shattered the flow of time itself.. but I think it\'s better now. Are you alright?', '', 124253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande! I will attempt to pull her out, but doing so will require total focus. Be on your guard, $n.', '', 124252, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 78589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care! Hostile entities have been drawn to this disruption of time! Alright, lead the way.', '', 124251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This temporal magic rivals that of the bronze dragonflight! I must concentrate on maintaining our defenses.', '', 124250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies have suffered the brunt of the enchantment. I can protect us from the residual energies for a time.', '', 124249, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azurewing have proven to be a valuable ally. By aiding them, you\'ve ensured their support in our campaign against the Legion.', '', 124248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes enraged at the death of nearby offspring!', '%s becomes enraged at the death of nearby offspring!', 124247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far the Suramar army has been hesitant to stretch out from their walls. I hope that doesn\'t mean they are planning something.', 'So far the Suramar army has been hesitant to stretch out from their walls. I hope that doesn\'t mean they are planning something.', 124246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vereesa almost shot at Rommath this morning. Khadgar had to talk her down... again.', 'Vereesa almost shot at Rommath this morning. Khadgar had to talk her down... again.', 124245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elves keep pulling pranks on each other. We are just trying to make sure things don\'t turn to violence.', 'The elves keep pulling pranks on each other. We are just trying to make sure things don\'t turn to violence.', 124244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar put out the call to anyone willing to send troops to support this army. So who comes? \n\nBlood elves and night elves. The two races so at odds with each other it makes the feud between the Alliance and Horde seem almost paltry.', 'Khadgar put out the call to anyone willing to send troops to support this army. So who comes? \n\nBlood elves and night elves. The two races so at odds with each other it makes the feud between the Alliance and Horde seem almost paltry.', 124243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suramar is a city filled with so much magic it will be a true challenge to invade it. I just hope we can keep these armies together until we are successful.', 'Suramar is a city filled with so much magic it will be a true challenge to invade it. I just hope we can keep these armies together until we are successful.', 124242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogue Nightfallen are rebuilding mana pylons in the Ley-Ruins. The Azurewing have requested your help in eradicating this pestilence, champion.', '', 124241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conflict between the armies will not be tolerated. We are here to make sure everyone stays on target.', 'Conflict between the armies will not be tolerated. We are here to make sure everyone stays on target.', 124240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaldorei, Sin\'dorei, Quel\'dorei, and Shal\'dorei? More like Don\'torei. Am I right?', 'Kaldorei, Sin\'dorei, Quel\'dorei, and Shal\'dorei? More like Don\'torei. Am I right?', 124239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tensions between the Horde and Alliance are tight enough when they share a battlefield. But the elves? You can practically cut this tension with a knife.', 'Tensions between the Horde and Alliance are tight enough when they share a battlefield. But the elves? You can practically cut this tension with a knife.', 124238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your outline work was exceptional. I\'d ask you to tutor Kirin Tor initiates... if you weren\'t busy saving the world from demons, I mean.', '', 124237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scholars of Nar\'thalas Academy were renowned for their knowledge of spell runes. Perhaps you might glean ancient secrets from the spirits who linger there.', '', 124236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing quite like the perfect rack of ribs.', '', 124235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful, my favorite cheese.', 124234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not necessarily what I had in mind, but insight is insight. Let\'s keep an eye out for other... learning opportunities.', '', 124233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mages of Nar\'thalas were known to craft wands of exceptional quality. You might see if their techniques could aid our war against the Legion.', '', 124232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Our hippo! We submit!', '', 124230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhhh!', '', 124229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dissent is forbidden, by order of Grand Magistrix Elisande!', 'Dissent is forbidden, by order of Grand Magistrix Elisande!', 124226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who oppose the Grand Magistrix will pay dearly!', 'Those who oppose the Grand Magistrix will pay dearly!', 124225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know where your family is. Speak, or they die too!', 'We know where your family is. Speak, or they die too!', 124224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confess! You are harboring traitors to Suramar!', 'Confess! You are harboring traitors to Suramar!', 124223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knowledge of potential threats gives us an advantage in battle. As ever, you\'ve proven to be a quick study!', '', 124222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Duskwatch presume to push beyond their borders in the midst of a revolution. You repaid them for their arrogance!', '', 124221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Duskwatch have taken outposts in the Crimson Thicket. Unleash the Withered at your command and drive them out!', '', 124220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a servant, but you are welcome to join me and help me fight.', 'Not a servant, but you are welcome to join me and help me fight.', 124219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but your spirit is free to do what you will. You no longer need to serve him.', 'Yes, but your spirit is free to do what you will.  You no longer need to serve him.', 124218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I choose to join you.', '', 124217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have served for so long, I cannot recall a time when I was of my own will.  Do you need a servant?', '', 124216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:228877|h[Arcanetic Rings]|h|r collapse in from the edge of the room!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:228877|h[Arcanetic Rings]|h|r Collapse in from the edge of the room!', 124215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb.blp:20|t%s targets her enemies with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:214278|h[Delphuric Beams]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Mage_ArcaneOrb.blp:20|t%s targets her enemies with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:214278|h[Delphuric Beams]|h|r !', 124214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\6BF_Explosive_Shard.blp:20|t%s weaves |cFFFF0000|Hspell:209598|h[Conflexive]|h|r energies through her enemies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\6BF_Explosive_Shard.blp:20|t%s weaves |cFFFF0000|Hspell:209598|h[Conflexive]|h|r energies through her enemies!', 124213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_ARCANE_ARCANE01.BLP:20|tYou will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:209973|h[Explode]|h|r in 6 seconds!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_ARCANE_ARCANE01.BLP:20|tYou will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:209973|h[Explode]|h|r in 6 seconds!', 124212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_ARCANE_INVOCATION:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:210022|h[Epocheric Orbs]|h|r fall from the sky!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_ARCANE_INVOCATION:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:210022|h[Epocheric Orbs]|h|r fall from the sky!', 124211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no love for the Horde, but their soldiers have fought and bled alongside us against the demons.$b$bWere it not for their bravery and cooperation, none of us would have survived this long.', '', 124210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not leave this island until every demon has been slain and every fallen Horde warrior has been avenged!', 124209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion will not be defeated without great sacrifice. Lord Illidan knows this truth more than most.', '', 124208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That may be, but I have faith in our commander. Their guidance will lead us to victory!', 'That may be, but I have faith in our commander. Their guidance will lead us to victory!', 124204, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s forces seem to be growing stronger every day.', 'The Legion\'s forces seem to be growing stronger every day.', 124203, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are hit with anti-aircraft gunfire!', 'You are hit with anti-aircraft gunfire!', 124202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The skies grow dark. We must press on.', 124200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard there were citizens holding safe houses...', 'I heard there were citizens holding safe houses...', 124199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are demons everywhere...', 'There are demons everywhere...', 124198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, find me shelter!', 'Please, find me shelter!', 124197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! We\'re not safe here!', 'Hurry! We\'re not safe here!', 124196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am safe... thank you.', 'I am safe... thank you.', 124195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city has devolved to madness...', 'This city has devolved to madness...', 124194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... we were almost killed!', 'We... we were almost killed!', 124193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger.', 'Thank you, stranger.', 124192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Send me to the ramparts!', 'I\'m ready. Send me to the ramparts!', 124191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This humid air has made flying for any significant time rather difficult, but I\'ve developed a dusting that will allow us to take wing long enough to complete our assault.\n\nSay the word and we will begin the diversion while you infiltrate the camp.', '', 124190, 0, 35351, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve prepared a dusting that will allow my druids to fly for a short while in this humid air.\n\nSay the word and we\'ll begin the distraction while you head to the camp.', '', 124189, 0, 43622, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to get you out, Vanthir. Just hold on.', 'We\'re here to get you out, Vanthir. Just hold on.', 124188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vanthir\'s eyes focus sharply on you. He does not speak.>', '', 124187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vanthir lays still. His eyes are glazed over and staring off into space.>', '', 124186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('....', '....', 124181, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cant just ask a warlock why they fight demons!', 'You cant just ask a warlock why they fight demons!', 124180, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So.... if you\'re a warlock.... why are you fighting demons?', 'So.... if you\'re a warlock.... why are you fighting demons?', 124179, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is not attached to the Nightwell, but to the ley lines. Yet we control them, so how can she... Ah, yes. I see!', 124178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you thugs wither!', 'I hope you thugs wither!', 124177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A mana bore, perhaps? Hmm... nothing. This requires a great deal of power to maintain.', 124176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, into the ruins!', 'Quickly, into the ruins!', 124175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am saved!', 'I am saved!', 124174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very efficient! Let us get a closer look... Say, this is impressive spellwork.', 124173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The library of the Nar\'thalas Academy was said to contain detailed studies of local fauna. Such knowledge could prove quite useful. Leave no page unturned!', '', 124172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 124171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish, Battlelord. Are you ready to depart?', 124170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone get to the beach! The Legion is relentless in their attacks!', 'Everyone get to the beach! The Legion is relentless in their attacks!', 124169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to go to Helheim.', 'We need to go to Helheim.', 124168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One that will find our friend.', 124167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of spell is this?', '', 124166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra?!', '', 124165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your voice down, Silgryn. It is good to see you too.', 124164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will need to maintain my focus for this to work... are you prepared to assist me in this endeavor?', 124163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Silgryn. Be careful.', 124162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sadly familiar with Vanthir\'s captor.', '', 124161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, First Arcanist. I will see to it that our friend here comes to no harm.', '', 124160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! I sense energies converging below, but aggressive guardians bar my way. I need you to clear a path.', 124159, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank Elune you are here! I could use a helping hand with this.', 124158, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am grateful to see you, even if you are from the other camp. Come quickly, there is much to discuss!', 124157, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, reinforcements! Over here, there is much I have to tell you.', '', 124156, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $r. Try not to alert all the guards as you approach.', '', 124155, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That took more out of me than I thought it would. You will have to free Vanthir without me. I am sorry.', 124154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitors will be found and killed by decree of the Grand Magistrix!', 'Traitors will be found and killed by decree of the Grand Magistrix!', 124153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are getting close. I can taste their fear!', 'We are getting close. I can taste their fear!', 124152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no stone unturned! The traitors cannot hide from us!', 'Leave no stone unturned! The traitors cannot hide from us!', 124151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another fool on forbidden ground!', 'Another fool on forbidden ground!', 124150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The penalty for trespassing here is death!', 'The penalty for trespassing here is death!', 124149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You aren\'t supposed to be here!', 'You aren\'t supposed to be here!', 124148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My forces and I shall follow you to Broken Shore. We will drown the Legion from this world!', '', 124147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit, Farseer, I am surprised that you achieved what you did.', '', 124146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hasta la vista, soldier.', '', 124145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. I\'ll find my own way out...', '', 124144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t rest until I\'ve killed every beady-eyed, demon puke on this damned rock...', '', 124143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I\'ll have to make my own...', '', 124142, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those demon bastards stole my gear...', '', 124141, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...what are you standing around for? We\'ve got demons to kill.', '', 124140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neptulon, the Farseer requests your aid!', '', 124139, 0, 44800, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time someone showed up. I was starting to get bored...', '', 124138, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is being held at the Terrace of Order! It must be time for the display...', 124137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Focus! There!', 124136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is near to withering. His thoughts are jumbled, frantic... I just need to...', 124135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... Until he could think of nothing else!', 124134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hunger that did not pass, but grew...', 124133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was taken somewhere dark and isolated. He began to feel hunger settling its roots in his gut.', 124132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fear for those that he sheltered, those he sacrificed for.', 124131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moment he was taken from the Waning Crescent he felt such terrible fear... but not for himself.', 124130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talk to me, Vanthir...', 124129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, champion.', 124128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to review the information you\'ve gathered on the Legion\'s agents.', 'I\'d like to review the information you\'ve gathered on the Legion\'s agents.', 124127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am yours to command, Farseer.', '', 124126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
