('Your Frayfeather Hatchling digs its claws tightly into your shoulder.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling digs its claws tightly into your shoulder.', 124124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling stretches its wings.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling stretches its wings.', 124123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems bored.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems bored.', 124122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems impressed.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems impressed.', 124121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling wants to see more of the world.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling wants to see more of the world.', 124120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems to be learning.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling seems to be learning.', 124119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Frayfeather Hatchling sighs contentedly.', 'Your Frayfeather Hatchling sighs contentedly.', 124118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24642, 24642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Thalyssra.', 'I am ready, Thalyssra.', 124117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Frostbolt until you gain Brain Freeze, then cast Flurry.', 124116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While Brain Freeze is active, Flurry can be cast instantly and does significantly more damage.', 124115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Casting Frostbolt can trigger an effect called Brain Freeze.', 124114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flurry is another spell in your arsenal. While it can be cast on its own, Flurry is best used in tandem with another ability.', 124113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tracking someone this way takes a great deal of energy. I hope I can last...', 124112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
