('Casting Frostbolt can trigger an effect called Brain Freeze.', '', 124109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flurry is another spell in your arsenal. While it can be cast on its own, Flurry is best used in tandem with another ability.', '', 124108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He still controls my body though, I can feel it.', '', 124107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My stone warriors will break the Legion to dust!', 124106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The armies of Deepholm are ready, fleshling.', 124105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have slain your master, you no longer need to serve him.', 'I have slain your master, you no longer need to serve him.', 124104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stonemother... Farseer calls.', '', 124103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you ask of the earth?', '', 124102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitorous to the last...', '', 124101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean, free?', '', 124100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been alone for weeks! You must believe me!', 124099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find your friends. Confess, and your death shall come swiftly!', '', 124098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The armies of Skywall will have been summoned. The wind will be at your back.', '', 124097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard whispers on the wind. It is time to strike at the Burning Legion.', '', 124096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunderaan, the Farseer summons your visage!', '', 124095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds heed you.', '', 124094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I defeated him. You are free.', 'No, I defeated him. You are free.', 124093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not look like my master...', '', 124092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The master has prepared a dinner for his guests.\n\nI\'m afraid the guest list is quite exclusive, and I do not see your name on the list. Are you delivering something for the party?', 124091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
