('Oh? Is this egg moving?', 'Oh? Is this egg moving?', 124079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must enlist your help to hunt these targets down. You may be the only one with any chance of stopping them.', '', 124078, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 81325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
