('', 'Their agents lurk across Azeroth, threatening to subvert our efforts at the tomb. They are some of the Legion\'s most powerful champions.', 124076, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 81322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
