('You\'re really improving.', '', 124044, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 77662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much that lies ahead for all of us. Farewell.', '', 124043, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing!', '', 124042, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 77661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amazing!', 124041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outstanding!', 124040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outstanding!', '', 124039, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 77658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may be simpler to shut a door than to pass through it. But sometimes a step into the unknown is required to break the bonds of fate.', '', 124038, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 78203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough sentiment! Hear these words before I depart.', '', 124037, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 78204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t know what to say, Medivh.', '', 124036, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have all the power you will ever need, Khadgar. It is your heart, your courage, that makes you this world\'s Guardian. And a better one than I ever was.', '', 124035, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 78184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have made it clear before... I do not want such power!', '', 124034, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 78188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My path leads... elsewhere. Besides, Azeroth has found her Guardian in you, Young Trust.', '', 124033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you can see, the Legion\'s reach still extends beyond the Broken Shore.', 124032, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 81321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you need my help with?', 'What did you need my help with?', 124031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We won\'t give up without a fight.', 124030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have been purged from Karazhan! Thank you, champions. Medivh, you would be a welcome ally in our war against the Legion.', '', 124029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that was... interesting. You\'ve done your part, but I still can\'t find a way to--', '', 124028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I stand with the First Arcanist!', 'I stand with the First Arcanist!', 124027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Thalyssra! For the rebellion!', 'For Thalyssra! For the rebellion!', 124026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! My weapon is at your command.', 'Champion! My weapon is at your command.', 124025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come. I do not want to keep her waiting.', 124024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal to my estate is secure. You will want to hear this in person.', 124023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have urgent news, Thalyssra.', 124022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Legion! Death to their allies!', 'Death to the Legion! Death to their allies!', 124021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, I have come to learn from you.', 'Champion, I have come to learn from you.', 124020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silgryn sends his regards.', 'Silgryn sends his regards.', 124019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[UNUSED] This goes without saying, but be on your guard. I sense something... a presence I\'ve not felt since...', '', 124018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know. All part of a greater cycle. A cycle that now at last may be broken.', '', 124017, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 78183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It couldn\'t have been helped, you know. We tried to alter it, but it was all part of a larger scheme.', '', 124016, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 78200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is that? Don\'t do that.', 124015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop slacking. You are Nightborne preparing to defend your city and your legacy. Stand proud!', 124014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lift your weapon. Lift it up. If it is too heavy, grow stronger.', 124013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You call that a fighting stance? Any elf in this camp could rip you apart with you in that stance.', 124012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No no no. I said form ranks. Form ranks!', 124011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This goes without saying, but be on your guard. I sense something... a presence I\'ve not felt since...', '', 124010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DELETE ME', 124009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE ME', '', 124008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still no sign of Vanthir...', '', 124007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DELETE ME', 124006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will find him, Silgryn. I am certain of it.', 124005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. Everyone into the boat! It will be a tight fit.', '', 124004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way!', 124003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I must remember to shut you down from time to time. Overuse might cause you to become... erratic.', '', 124002, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defense protocols activated.', '', 124001, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you\'re ready to oversee the tower\'s protection in my absence.', '', 124000, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 78197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we need to find out what happened to Ly\'leth. You can still move freely about the city, correct?', 123999, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. I have an idea about how to put our limited forces in the right place at the right time.', '', 123998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth, we need to compensate for the loss of our reinforcements.', 123997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It shall be done.', 123996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valtrois, focus on Elisande\'s spell. Find a way to break it.', 123995, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There has been no word from her in some time. This cannot be a coincidence.', 123994, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And why didn\'t Ly\'leth warn us about this? Surely, as one of Elisande\'s advisors, she would have heard something!', 123993, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What Elisande has done... it should have been impossible! The energies required--', '', 123992, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 78475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande has captured all our forces in a timelock spell.', '', 123991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My forces have been preparing for this day. Their rage fills the Firelands.', '', 123990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Raptor Strike!', '', 123989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Raptor Strike!', 123988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does our old friend dream? Is he trapped in nightmares?', '', 123987, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another year of slumber. I wonder if Medivh will ever awaken.', '', 123986, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, Arluelle. We are expecting her.', '', 123985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prove to me you have the experience and instinct required to take down any prey!', 123984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove to me you have the experience and instinct required to take down any prey!', '', 123983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smolderon, heed this mortal!', '', 123982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, woe is me, woe! My life is over!\n\nDo you know who Dr. Weavil is? Was. Might still be? I\'m not sure.\n\nDeath would not stop him, no, he had predicted that. Brilliant gnome, the insane ones always are.\n\nThe second his heart stopped, the machines he had implanted within himself started up. He was filled with a yellow ooze, and electrified. I\'m not sure if it\'s undeath, alchemical engineering, or something... more.\n\nWhen we heard about a new internship under the great Dr. Weavil, so many of us flocked to the island to sign up. Now I\'m not sure if I\'m alive or dead, and I\'m leaking yellow ooze. Great.\n\nThe others have taken to calling themselves \"drudge gnomes.\" Good luck with them, bunch of jerks.', '', 123981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be discussed immediately. Allow me to teleport you to Shal\'Aran.', '', 123980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings Highlord.', 'Greetings Highlord.', 123979, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe you my life!', 123978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feels good to stretch my legs! Now, where\'s a demon to stretch my fists on!', '', 123977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freedom? I will not forget this!', 123976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons will pay!', '', 123975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight until my final breath!', '', 123974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Burning Legion!', '', 123973, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is my axe? I have demons to kill!', '', 123972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion will pay for this!', '', 123971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That cage would have been my coffin...', '', 123970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, champion!', '', 123969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must speak to your lord.', 'I must speak to your lord.', 123968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Raptor Strike on the target dummy.', '', 123967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raptor Strike is a quick but strong attack that you can use whenever you have the focus to do so.', '', 123966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that you target is bleeding and your pet is engaged, it\'s time to unleash your own fury.', '', 123965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Raptor Strike on the target dummy.', 123964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Raptor Strike is a quick but strong attack that you can use whenever you have the focus to do so.', 123963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that you target is bleeding and your pet is engaged, it\'s time to unleash your own fury.', 123962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I serve?', '', 123961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! Do what you can for the others, I\'ll be fine...', '', 123960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn it! Another attack. Stay alert!', 123959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 81320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The enemy breaks before the scores of withered we have unleashed! Keep training them, for the withered will prove invaluable in the days to come.', 123958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are ready to begin the offensive in Suramar. Place beacons along the city\'s outskirts and draw the withered down upon the Magistrix\'s forces!', 123957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the grog. Yes, thank you.', '', 123956, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More of our Withered are now able to withstand the fel. Our revolution will not be stopped!', 123955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Withered must be made ready for our assault on the Nighthold. Their resistance to fel can be bolstered in Felsoul Hold.', 123954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What delicious irony! Chaos erupts among the nobles as those they cast out are warped onto their very doorsteps!', '', 123953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My preparations are complete. Let us see how the nobles of Suramar react to the warp-delivery of Withered!', '', 123952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ley energy is flowing again! A job well done.', 123951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ley lines darken across Suramar as the Grand Magistrix\'s forces act from the shadows. Use my spectacles to see beyond sight, and root out the source of this interference!', 123950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should retreat while we still can.', 123949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, this is a wonderful vintage.', '', 123948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These supplies will prove crucial in maintaining our campaign. The Horde marches on!', 123947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dwindling supplies are demoralizing our troops. Go into Suramar and seize supplies from the Nightborne oppressors!', 123946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Morale has been reinvigorated by the arrival of fresh supplies. You have done well!', 123945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They teleported him away. Where, I do not know.', 123944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They said that he would be made an example for all others.', 123943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He begged them to spare his people.', 123942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Felborne killed anyone who stood in their way, but they did not kill him.', 123941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I watched from my inn when Elisande\'s forces swept into the Crescent.', 123940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our supplies are running low, but the enemy has plenty to spare. Ride into Suramar and liberate supplies from the forces of the Magistrix!', 123939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shal\'dorei must be shown that there is a future beyond this chaos. We must reach as many as we can!', 123938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar\'s citizens must be told of the arrival of the Horde. Post bulletins throughout the city. Let the oppressed know that help is on the way!', 123937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The more shal\'dorei that take up the fight, the fewer of my people who will be lost in the liberation of Suramar.', 123936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must spread word of the Alliance\'s arrival. Post notice throughout the city that the reign of the Grand Magistrix will soon be ended. Inspire the shal\'dorei to resist!', 123935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They strike down their own people for daring to seek safety? We will bring our wrath to bear on Elisande for this injustice!', 123934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shal\'dorei flee Suramar as Elisande\'s forces advance through the Crimson Thicket. Go, rout the Nightborne for the sake of those who would escape the city.', 123933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The once-proud shal\'dorei attack their own people? This situation is even more desperate than I imagined...', 123932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande\'s forces are waylaying refugees fleeing Suramar through the Crimson Thicket. A perfect opportunity to test their skills in battle!', 123931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh. Hmm. Are the rumors true then? Dalaran\'s lovely weapons are no more? I must attend the funeral...\n\nI suppose the Nightborne Soulstone could be convinced to work with us. But first we will need a very stubborn shield generator.', 123930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande is beyond forgiveness for condemning so many of our people. We must fight to save everyone we can.', '', 123929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande and the Legion are forcing citizens into boats bound for Felsoul Hold. Take a gondola and free as many shal\'dorei as you can.', '', 123928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you think of a way to safely use the Nightborne Soulstone?', 'Can you think of a way to safely use the Nightborne Soulstone?', 123927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. I think this is a matter best discussed privately.', '', 123926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 81326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Most anything is possible with enough effort! If we had all of our mages focusing on it it, I\'m sure we could safely use it... Of course that might be a tad inefficient. \n\nOr perhaps it could be securely shielded? Khadgar\'s strange friend, Ari, is brilliant when it comes to these sorts of puzzles. Let\'s see what she thinks!', '', 123925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande shamed our people when she attacked the Moon Guard. By keeping their traditions alive, you help us make amends for her transgression.', 123924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory over Elisande will require strength beyond our own. Ascend to the Lunar Crucible and seek the blessing of the Moon Guard ancients.', 123923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you think of a way we could safely use the Nightborne Soulstone as a weapon?', 'Can you think of a way we could safely use the Nightborne Soulstone as a weapon?', 123921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our whereabouts remain a secret... for now. I fear this will not be the last time Shal\'Aran is threatened.', 123920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion\'s patrols edge ever closer to Shal\'Aran. Kill them before they discover our location!', 123919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting idea, Archmage $n! Using the legion\'s own magic against themselves has a satisfying elegance. We cannot risk Kathra\'natir escaping, however... \n\nArchmage Kalec is very knowledgable about magical devices and can be trusted to remain discreet. Let\'s see what he thinks?', '', 123918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could Dalaran use the Nightborne Soulstone as a weapon?', 'Could Dalaran use the Nightborne Soulstone as a weapon?', 123917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If not for your actions, many innocents would have died in the streets. A small victory, perhaps, but an important one.', '', 123916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens have taken up arms to defend safe houses throughout Suramar. Find innocents in peril and lead them to safety!', '', 123915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father! No!', '', 123914, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... much... power...', '', 123913, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this weakness, boy! Contain your magic!', '', 123912, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 78194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must strike before their defenses reach full power! Plant a Seed of Ruin near each structure and it will be crushed as the seed sprouts. Hurry!', '', 123911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to Vanthir, Maribeth?', 'What happened to Vanthir, Maribeth?', 123910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanthir is in danger!', 123909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is not safe. We should move soon.', 123908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande and the Legion will pay for the blood they have spilled. They still have much to answer for!', 123907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many Nightborne were murdered when Elisande and the Legion attacked. Strike back! Show those devils we will not stand for tyranny.', 123906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is a relentless foe, but you have saved the forest this day. All of Val\'sharah honors your victory!', '', 123905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have taken the lands above Moonclaw Vale! The trees cry out as their life essence is drained to fuel the Legion\'s defenses.', '', 123903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then through the portal ye go!$b$bKhadgar will be waitin\'.', '', 123898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A pathetic attempt at disguise! Now you will pay with your life!', 123897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, please! I doesn\'t mean to...', 'Master, please! I doesn\'t mean to...', 123896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where have you been, little wretch?$B$BDid you think we weren\'t watching?', 123895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t have time for your games.', 123894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your kind serves us well, minion.', 123893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Begone, slave!', 123892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have called for aid in facing a great threat. They asked only for you.', '', 123891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ensure none see the item you recovered until then. Good luck, champion.', '', 123890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may not be a soldier, but even in war there are beds to be turned down and drinks to be served.$b$bIt is a duty I was born to.', '', 123889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready to take down the barrier. You will need to move quickly and secure the entrance before they realize what\'s going on.', 123888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people will be free of the Legion!', 'Our people will be free of the Legion!', 123887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fight for Suramar!', 'I am ready to fight for Suramar!', 123886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will spread the word... the Grand Magistrix\'s tyrrany stops now!', 'I will spread the word... the Grand Magistrix\'s tyrrany stops now!', 123885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Duskwatch won\'t know what hit them.', 'The Duskwatch won\'t know what hit them.', 123884, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal worked and we are still in one piece. Good! I was worried we might overload the network by adding another beacon.', '', 123883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could not... foresee... such an end...', '', 123882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the design... was flawless...', '', 123881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pathetic attempt to resist our design.', '', 123880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ends for the mortals, as I saw it would.', '', 123879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tower belongs to the Legion!', '', 123878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have foreseen your world\'s doom!', '', 123877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One by one... you fall!', '', 123876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meaningless... and inevitable.', '', 123875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One battle remains. One final conquest to complete the grand design!', '', 123874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Burning Crusade has consumed countless worlds. This tower will serve as a conduit to each of them.', '', 123873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karazhan\'s presence radiates through the Nether... a beacon drawing in the Legion\'s might.', '', 123872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master! My mission is accomplished! Come forth and claim this world!', '', 123871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grand design is complete! Every Legion world is now tethered to this tower!', '', 123870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! The doorway opens to your doom!', '', 123869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An infinite army will be brought forth from innumerable worlds!', '', 123868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preparations are complete. It is time to begin the end!', '', 123867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough interruptions! The grand design must be realized.', '', 123866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your resistance is misguided. Yield to us!', '', 123865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will kneel! You will serve!', '', 123864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take out the target!', '', 123863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your resistance is irrelevant!', 123862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incinerate that one!', '', 123861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the barrage!', '', 123860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Annihilate them!', '', 123859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness will take you!', '', 123858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the grip of entropy!', '', 123857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master! I have... failed you.', '', 123856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have never returned, foolish mortal! Your tower is ours!', '', 123855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Withered won\'t last long in there, $n. Gather an elite group of champions to fight your way through. I\'m sure you\'re familiar with such tactics! We\'ll be right behind you, of course.', '', 123854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we break the timelock holding our forces, Gul\'dan will fall!', '', 123853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can sense the Nightwell from here. Elisande must truly be desperate to overload the Nightwell like this!', 123852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With her finest arcanist dead, I doubt Elisande will send reinforcements. We have the breach. Follow me.', 123851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Over here!', 123850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Andaris was the key to their defenses. Telemancy is working inside the Sanctum again. I\'m sending Thalyssra and Khadgar to your location.', '', 123849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Thorim\'s Peak!', 'Send me to Thorim\'s Peak!', 123847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are all... as corrupt... as the Guardian...', 123846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will... never... relent...', 123845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A pure mind is an orderly mind.', 123844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lesson is complete.', 123843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! Now, onward to Helya! This day her treachery shall be ended!', '', 123842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware, champions! Helya\'s realm is guarded by a savage beast bred from the stuff of nightmares!', '', 123841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stench of corruption is upon you!', 123840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Atiesh... will be... splintered...', '', 123839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... it comes... to this...', '', 123838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so begins your purification!', 123837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought it... for as long as... I could...', '', 123836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea what it\'s like to do the things I\'ve done. Harsh things. Necessary things.', '', 123835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you get used to it, you can kill friends as easily as anyone else.', '', 123834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My staff... a relic, yes, but MINE!', '', 123833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re just like the others, aren\'t you?', '', 123832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, champions. I\'ve been expecting you.', '', 123831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A teachable moment.', 123830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fitting end for a thief!', '', 123829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All goes as planned.', '', 123828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Purified!', 123827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just. Gets. Easier.', '', 123826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have never seen the true Medivh.', '', 123825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is who I am. I was tainted from birth, polluted from before my conception, a bad seed grown to bear bitter fruit.', '', 123824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The titans wish their children to lead virtuous lives. Yet from cornerstone to spire, this tower reeks of depravity!', 123823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep still. Let it end.', '', 123822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winter is here!', '', 123821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suggest staying put.', '', 123820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It burns, burns, burns!', '', 123819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrion for the birds...', '', 123818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many pieces of me...', '', 123817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A basic spell... but effective.', '', 123816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You grow weaker... I grow stronger!', '', 123815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Repent... or DIE!', 123814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn... just like that dragon!', '', 123813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inherent nature of fire...', '', 123812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Renounce your greed and perversion!', 123811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower needed a new decoration.', '', 123810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A memory, frozen in time!', '', 123809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold, mortals! Open your hearts to virtue!', 123808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Step into the light, mortals!', 123807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More Withered tricks! I shall not fail Elisande! You will fall!', 123806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Andaris has made a critical mistake! Her shield is vulnerable to the Withered. Drop some in a safe spot and they will leech the magic in her shield.', 123805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will end you!', '', 123804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve toyed with you long enough!', '', 123803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to end this!', '', 123802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames... await me...', '', 123801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... never... be free...', '', 123800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is... never... over...', '', 123799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You called me here only to die at my feet?', '', 123798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll go no further! I\'ll die before I allow you entrance to the Nighthold!', 123797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals never learn.', '', 123796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful... as expected.', '', 123795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s next?!', '', 123794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic!', '', 123793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kindling for the fire!', '', 123792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth and burn!', '', 123791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll reduce you to ashes!', '', 123790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn the meaning of torment!', '', 123789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it! You will suffer for your insolence!', '', 123788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I damned to answer the summons of mortals for all eternity?', '', 123787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I will finish you myself!', '', 123785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again?! Oh no! Tell me you weren\'t involved!', '', 123784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miserable vermin. I shall exterminate you from the air!', '', 123783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your courage falters!', '', 123782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak-willed mortals!', '', 123781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, cowards!', '', 123780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lifeblood is my weapon!', '', 123779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn from the inside!', '', 123778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul betrays your allies!', '', 123777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aethas? You are our secret visitor? What\'s going on?', '', 123776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The righteous have nothing to fear!', 123775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By fire be cleansed!', 123774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The strong must suffer for the sins of the weak!', 123773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All shall be sanctified!', 123772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion infiltrated Dalaran and sabotaged the city\'s weapons... possibly beyond repair.', '', 123771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82773, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not good... not good at all. We will help, of course!', '', 123770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82508, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Thorim\'s Peak!', 'Send me to Thorim\'s Peak!', 123769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage! The Kirin Tor needs your aid!', '', 123768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 82772, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that Andaris\'s dog is put down, you should have access to the building. Get to the breach!', 123767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Those casters are using generators to shield the Sanctum. Eliminate them!', 123766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you are unable to enter. Find the power source for that barrier and take it down.', 123765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. I suppose it has come to this...', 'Indeed. I suppose it has come to this...', 123764, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not plan to go quietly.', 'I do not plan to go quietly.', 123763, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guards will have our heads for even discussing this...', 'The guards will have our heads for even discussing this...', 123762, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have had it with this occupation. We need to act!', 'I have had it with this occupation. We need to act!', 123761, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have prepared for the possibility of discovery. With the telemancy orbs and the fel-resistant Withered, you have the tools required to secure the breach.', 123760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how they co-opted my spell, it shouldn\'t be--', '', 123759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think we didn\'t notice your skullduggery?! Your old tricks are no match for true sorcery!', 123758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spell! What just happened?!', '', 123757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our proud city, reduced to chaos... and for what?', 'Our proud city, reduced to chaos... and for what?', 123756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am fed up with the Legion! We are stronger than this!', 'I am fed up with the Legion! We are stronger than this!', 123755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grand Magistrix has gone too far.', 'The Grand Magistrix has gone too far.', 123754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took my daughter... Something must be done.', 'They took my daughter... Something must be done.', 123753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we Shal\'dorei not better than this?', 'Are we Shal\'dorei not better than this?', 123752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not stand for this treatment!', 'I will not stand for this treatment!', 123751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, champion. The Kirin Tor and Dusk Lily rebels have secured this floor of the harbor.', '', 123750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating. I would love to compare notes when this is all over.', '', 123749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
