('We must complete the ritual as one... Until Helya\'s will is done!', '', 123583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Icon_ShadowCouncilOrb_green.blp:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:228058\n|h[Orb of Corrosion]|h|r is following you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Icon_ShadowCouncilOrb_green.blp:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:228058\n|h[Orb of Corrosion]|h|r is following you!', 123581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Icon_ShadowCouncilOrb_purple.blp:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227920|h[Orb of Corruption]|h|r is following you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Icon_ShadowCouncilOrb_purple.blp:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:227920|h[Orb of Corruption]|h|r is following you!', 123580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s foothold within the forest has been destroyed! Thanks to your help, the land will recover.', '', 123579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', 'I am in your debt.', 123578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m saved... Thank you!', 'I\'m saved... Thank you!', 123577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take this!', 123575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Catch!', 123574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me! The guards took everything I had!', 'Help me! The guards took everything I had!', 123573, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here... I haven\'t had arcwine in days!', 'Over here... I haven\'t had arcwine in days!', 123572, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, any arcwine you can spare... I have children!', 'Please, any arcwine you can spare... I have children!', 123571, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have opened a portal to bring forth more of their accursed kin. Destroy their infestation before the forest is overrun!', '', 123570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 80570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT]So be it. I will alert our forces inside the city. There is much I still have to learn about the world we left behind.', 123569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT]There are still Nightborne in the city who blindly follow the Grand Magistrix. We must be careful not to hurt any innocents!', 123568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And the shal\'dorei are stronger than you expect. When the time comes, we will fight beside you.', 123567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rebels are ready for battle? Impressive. Let us see what they can do.', 123566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even as we suffer under the heel of the Magistrix, our people must be nourished. They are the backbone of our rebellion.', '', 123565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your leaders need to get their heads in the game.$b$bVereesa is so obsessed with her desire for revenge against the Horde that we cannot trust our flank to her.$b$bTyrande is a sentinel. She knows little of war on this type of battlefield. While her scouting is useful she should recuse the Kal\'dorei from the main assault.$b$bMy blood knights are the only ones prepared to carry the weight of this conflict.', 123564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Few understand the plight of the Nightfallen better than the Sin\'dorei. My heart goes out to them.$b$bBut Thalyssra must understand that there is a difference between an insurrection and a war.$b$bUntil now, her rebels have got by with a few skirmishes here and there. But they have not been hardened by battle as we blood elves have.', 123561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. We do not have the numbers to hold this place for long. The sooner we press on the better.', 123560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the record, I counseled against trusting any Horde in this campaign. I have lost a husband and a King to the treachery of the Horde.$b$bI see no reason to trust you now or ever.', 123559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought I would share a camp with the kaldorei. But, desperate times, desperate measures.', 123558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must speak with you, champion. Meet with me as soon as you are able.', 123557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Magistrix\'s thugs are impeding Deline\'s efforts to distribute arcwine. Find her in the canals and protect her as she feeds our people.', '', 123556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the time has come to march an army upon the city of my birth. May Elune grant us a quick end to this conflict.', 123555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plans from Thalyssra.', 'Plans from Thalyssra.', 123554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar. I was born here. Never in ten thousand years did I believe I would return with an army to claim it from the same elves I once looked to for protection.', 123553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When I let you take the Tears of Elune, I assumed the next time we would see each other would be at the final battle with the Legion.$b$bI did not expect to see you in the company of mana addicts at the footsteps of the city of my birth.$b$bSpeak quickly, $r. I am not in the mood for Thalyssra\'s petitions.', 123552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak quickly, $r. I do not want you lingering in my camp.$b$bYour Horde left a good friend of mine to die on the Broken Shore. Be grateful we have a common enemy for the time being.', 123551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad to see a friendly face on this battlefield, $p.$b$bIt is... hard... for me to once again walk in Suramar. Ten thousand years have passed since my feet last felt the grass of this land.$b$bBack then, we were fleeing the Burning Legion.$b$bI never believed I would return to the place of my birth to wrest it from the grasp of those I once believed were my people.', 123550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, begin the teleportation of Dalaran to the Broken Isles.', 'I am ready, begin the teleportation of Dalaran to the Broken Isles.', 123549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion bears down on us. We have but moments to spare.\n\nThe shockwave of arcane energies we are about to unleash should prove powerful enough to send them back to their cursed dimension for a time, giving us time to catch our breath and begin the search for the Pillars of Creation.\n\nAre you ready?', '', 123548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make sure you teach that demon a lesson.', 123547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work quickly, my friend.', '', 123546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hold the perimeter!', 123545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us not squander this gift of souls. Move them out!', '', 123544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More come from Suramar every hour! Move out! Make room!', '', 123543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not leave the Soul Engine waiting!', '', 123542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick up the pace! The Soul Engine awaits!', '', 123541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let there be no slack in their chains!', '', 123540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have drawn our line in the sand. The Helarjar will find no quarter here.', '', 123538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of the Kvaldir pollutes Azsuna\'s shores! Push them back into the sea!', '', 123537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, much better. You had us worried for a moment there.', '', 123536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Tichar! Your attention!', '', 123535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need a foothold, somewhere we can keep an eye on things.', '', 123534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DELETE ME', 123533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Soul Engine will consume! Kar Dan\'Ashj!', '', 123532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The passage to Felsoul Hold is open. See that our prisoners reach their destination.', '', 123531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightborne have agreed to cast off their unwanted.', '', 123530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterhorn_03.blp:20|t A %s emerges near Helya!', 123529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t Odyn targets you with a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228918|h[Stormforged Spear]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Polearm_2H_OdynSpear_D_01.blp:20|t Odyn targets you with a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228918|h[Stormforged Spear]|h|r!', 123528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felsoul Hold... of all the ways she has betrayed us, this is surely the worst.', '', 123527, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHAMAN_IMPROVEDFIRENOVA:20|tShade of Medivh begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:228269|h[Flame Wreath]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\SPELL_SHAMAN_IMPROVEDFIRENOVA:20|tShade of Medivh begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:228269|h[Flame Wreath]|h|r!', 123526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Present circumstances make us allies.', 123525, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 78403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not an undeserved reaction. Ordinarily I would be obliged to slay you both.', 123524, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 78402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... As you say.', 123523, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 78401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_03:20|t Hymdall begins to blow the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228012|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_03:20|t Hymdall begins to blow the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:228012|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r!', 123522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Arcane-Infused Vial warms as it emanates a soft glow.', 'Your Arcane-Infused Vial warms as it emanates a soft glow.', 123521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alturus, watchout! Oh, is that you, $n? You look... different.', 123520, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, $n! Archmage Leryda and I will hold them off as long as we can, but you must hurry!', '', 123519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for coming. We are here to discuss our mutual interests.', '', 123518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra, your knowledge of the enemy will be crucial in the battle ahead. We shall call on you as needed.', '', 123517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[CUT]We share a common goal. We must stop the Burning Legion and Gul\'dan at all costs.', '', 123516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for coming. We are here to discuss our mutual interests.', '', 123515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a cure for our addiction, but it will take time to administer it to all of our people. First we must depose Elisande and cleanse Suramar of the Legion\'s filth.', 123514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cleanse it we shall. The sin\'dorei bring righteous fury upon our enemies.', 123513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand the struggles of the Nightfallen echo our own, First Arcanist. Addiction.... betrayal...', 123512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE', '', 123511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT]If that is your wish, so be it. When this war is won, my people will need allies. It is clear you will not be among them.', 123509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not intend to be slaves to the Nightwell. We seek to drive the Legion from Suramar and put an end to Elisande\'s oppression.', 123508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We know where Elisande\'s path would lead us, and ask for your help to end her reign.', 123507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And once your rival is defeated, why should we believe you won\'t betray us for the Nightwell\'s arcane power and become the next Elisande... the next Azshara?', 123506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The kaldorei will fight to see the Legion defeated and the Nightwell destroyed. Beyond that... we shall see where Elune\'s wisdom guides us.', 123505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arcanist Thalyssra. I remember where your order stood in the War of the Ancients. How do we know you won\'t betray us and become the next Elisande... the next Azshara?', 123504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So sit and slerp, relax a jibbet! Enjoy the show that we call... Wikket!', '', 123503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mean dooker locked up all us hozen! Another path she should have chosen.', '', 123502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lousy imps! Let us work!', '', 123501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave us be, pests!', '', 123500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lasuel and I have been friends since we were children. We shared the best times of our lives together.', 123499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sea witch must learn the price of her defiance!', '', 123498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have had enough of that foul sorceress\' games!', '', 123497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya must be stopped. The time has come for a reckoning!', '', 123496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya\'s foul magics trap Odyn and hinder the Valarjar. We need champions like you to stop her advances.', '', 123495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suspect the sea witch grows impatient, eager to begin her campaign by conquering the Broken Isles.', '', 123494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooooo!', '', 123493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re... too late...', '', 123492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya beckons!', '', 123491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands report! We are to get underway!', '', 123490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double your efforts, lest you go by the board!', '', 123489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let this failed rebellion be a lesson to any that would stand against the shal\'dorei!', 123487, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Suramar remembers! We are the Nightborne, last of the true elves. The rest of you are hollow echoes of our greatness.', 123486, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each of you has debased your proud lineage. Each of you has forgotten the ancient power that is our birthright.', 123485, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sin\'dorei? Of all the elves, I thought you might understand the choice I made to save my people. Instead, you ally with misfits and monsters.', 123484, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quel\'dorei? You are peasants playing at nobility, all too willing to mingle with lesser races that dilute your bloodline. You are unworthy of the name high elves.', 123483, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kaldorei? You disgrace a glorious past, hiding in trees and cloaking yourselves in false piety. You have grown as savage as the trolls that skulk about your forests.', 123482, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold this motley throng in which the rebels put their faith.', 123481, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 78243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outlander, can you hear me? Outlander? I am going to teleport a beacon your way!', '', 123480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F-father... Run...', '', 123479, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get up! We must leave!', '', 123477, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know where to find Shal\'Aran. Come, ladies. We are no longer safe in the city.', 123476, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told him not to take one step closer.', 123474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s spits on the corpse of the demon.', 123473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, thank you! This masterpiece is worth my life a hundred times over.', '', 123472, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is it? The master\'s vase?', '', 123471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise all that is good... you are both safe. Come, let us get out of here!', '', 123469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brigitte? Emille?! Where are you?', '', 123468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande knows about Vanthir\'s involvement in the rebellion. He is gone.', '', 123461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s too late for me. They took... Vanthir...', 123460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE', '', 123459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No need to delay. Onto the pad with you.', '', 123457, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 78389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DELETE', '', 123456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya can corrupt the Stormforged!', 'Helya can corrupt the Stormforged!', 123455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare she so brashly oppose me!', '', 123454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeing her master fall, Midnight unleashes all her fury!', 'Seeing her master fall, Midnight unleashes all her fury!', 123453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya has taken the souls of those Valarjar? Impossible! Strike her mystics down, then return to me.', '', 123452, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 78322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is too much... if I must be labeled a traitor then so be it!', 'This is too much... if I must be labeled a traitor then so be it!', 123451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande must be stopped!', 'Elisande must be stopped!', 123450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew there were others! I will no longer bloody my hands for Elisande!', 'I knew there were others! I will no longer bloody my hands for Elisande!', 123449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I kept quiet when the demons came, but this... this is unspeakable.', 'I kept quiet when the demons came, but this... this is unspeakable.', 123448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot believe what Elisande is doing to her own people. I must fight back!', 'I cannot believe what Elisande is doing to her own people. I must fight back!', 123447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was the only one... I stand with the Dusk Lily!', 'I thought I was the only one... I stand with the Dusk Lily!', 123446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare show yourself here!? Die, fiend!', 'You dare show yourself here!? Die, fiend!', 123445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande will praise me for killing you!', 'Elisande will praise me for killing you!', 123444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rebel! I will end you!', 'Rebel! I will end you!', 123443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
