('The hound sniffs the air excitedly.', '', 123310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ride, Midnight! To victory!', '', 123309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to face my quarry toe-to-toe!', '', 123308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My quarry never escapes!', '', 123307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Form ranks! Charge!', '', 123306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... have become... the hunted.', '', 123305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up, Midnight! Stamp them into dust!', '', 123304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Midnight!', '', 123303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They had no chance! I kill for a living!', '', 123302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy prey!', '', 123301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My trophy collection grows!', '', 123300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well! Another group of thieves trying to steal my horse!', '', 123299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should get out of here before it\'s too late.', '', 123298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one isn\'t even human.', '', 123297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought those were my bones... didn\'t you?', '', 123296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s with all the bones?', '', 123295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Oh.. now that ye\' mention it...', '', 123294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye...', '', 123293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ehmm... what bones? Oh you mean these? I.. errh...', '', 123292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brambley! I can hardly believe my eyes... yer alive!', '', 123291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a... place for us... somewhere...', '', 123290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never... stop saying... Mrrgria...', '', 123289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dug you punks an early grave!', '', 123288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A gang that don\'t own the fields is nothin\'!', '', 123287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on... scram!', '', 123286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat it!', '', 123285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s dance!', '', 123284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ya wanna rumble, do ya?', '', 123283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s you and me against the world, baby!', '', 123282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just gonna... play it cool.', '', 123281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what I call a hot foot!', '', 123280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna go for a spin?', '', 123279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the song of their love rumbles across the fields, will it end in triumph... or tragedy? And now... on with the show!', '', 123278, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 77131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Divided by generations of enmity, they are brought together by passion for dance... and violence!', '', 123277, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 77130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonight... we meet two lovers born on opposite sides of Sentinel Hill.', '', 123276, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 77129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to this evening\'s feature presentation!', '', 123275, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 77128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you sell, Moorgoth?', 'What do you sell, Moorgoth?', 123274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate your help, $n. I\'m sure my luck will change soon.$b$bSay, do you think my armor looks dark enough?', '', 123273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop troubling the master\'s guests!', '', 123272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I take your jacket?', '', 123271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems I\'ll be... retiring... for... the evening...', '', 123270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps your party would be more comfortable at the children\'s table.', '', 123269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe the master is expecting you!', '', 123268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Get Willy a healer! I haven\'t seen a gnome this pale since... oh wait, all gnomes are pale.', '', 123267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you see that?! An epic-tier full-roaming vapor! Nasty one, too!', 123266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightborne Spy has gotten away!', 'The Nightborne Spy has gotten away!', 123265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auugh! Gross! I feel funky.', '', 123264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 77646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a fortunate individual! Of course, I\'ll need a sample of your brain tissue...', 123263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, ok... but you\'re buying brunch.', 123262, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one is a disaster. I want the Gnomish piece downstairs!', 123261, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you venture into the depths of Helheim and slay Helya?', '', 123260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight her in your name, Odyn!', 'I will fight her in your name, Odyn!', 123259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Struggle hard... I like my prey exhausted.', 123258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh meat for my hounds!', '', 123257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is forfeit!', '', 123256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see what resides in your soul, mortal.', '', 123255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... your brain will do nicely... give it to me!', '', 123254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny creature... Muscle crush you!', '', 123253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My magic will put an end to you!', 123252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to your donkey?', 'What happened to your donkey?', 123251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do with Obliterum?', 'What can I do with Obliterum?', 123250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I get Obliterum?', 'How do I get Obliterum?', 123249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You watch your tongue! Desdemona was no donkey, she was a mule!\n\nAnyways, I sold her for three Bloods o\' Sargeras. I\'m gonna make some boots.', '', 123248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you\'ve got enough obliterum ash, you can kinda sorta glump it together into a little ball. Then you just rub it onto your crafted armor, and the armor becomes stronger.', '', 123247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s easy! You just take some crafted gear - you know, hats, rings, relics, flasks, that sort of thing - and you throw \'em right into this fella\'s little fiery mouth-area. Add some Blood of Sargeras, for fuel, and ka-pow! You\'ve got Obliterum!\n\nY\'see, those crafters are always usin\' stuff like FELWORT, DEMONSTEEL, and CHAOS CRYSTALS to make their gear. Lots o\' demony-stuff in that armor. Make the demony-stuff hot enough, and you\'ve got Obliterum!', '', 123246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n! You lookin\' to obliterate some gear? Maybe use some Obliterum to make the gear you\'re wearin\' more powerful? Then I\'m your dwarf! Ask away!', '', 123245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too far away! Move back in range before he gets away!', 'You are too far away! Move back in range before he gets away!', 123244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s arrival is no surprise. The power beneath the tower existed long before you or I.$B$BIt is most unfortunate how we\'ve arrived in our current state, but I\'m afraid it was only a matter of time.', '', 123241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready.', 123240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic.', 123239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hop on one of my mana sabers and steer it through the tall nodes of Ley Energy you see around you. Steer it through enough Ley Energy to fully charge it and you\'ll be done!  Remember, the mana saber is great at going fast in a straight line; but it slows down through turns.  Try and minimize the amount of steering corrections you need.', 123234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s simple really. Head over the cube and interact with it to start a round of its game. Simply follow the path it displays before filling out the entire grid and you\'ll score a round. Score enough rounds and the cube should activate for you.', 123233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply stay within any given orb as it travels through the air and you\'ll be able to fly!  See, I\'m doing it right now!  Move from orb to orb to find out where they lead.', '', 123232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_infernoblast:20|tYou are targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:227615|h[Inferno Bolt]|h|r!', '', 123231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, what?', 'Um, what?', 123230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to experience the Siege of Dalaran and summoning of Alodi.', 'I want to experience the Siege of Dalaran and summoning of Alodi.', 123229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to experience the return of Magni Bronzebeard and Khadgar\'s adventures in Karazhan.', 'I want to experience the return of Magni Bronzebeard and Khadgar\'s adventures in Karazhan.', 123228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to experience the Broken Shore and its aftermath.', 'I want to experience the Broken Shore and its aftermath.', 123227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you wish to hear a tale from the past, $n?', 123226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your enemies will find that once you have them in your sights they are unlikely to escape.', 123225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using your Harpoon ability you can snag your enemy and propel yourself towards them.', 123224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Harpoon against the target dummy.', 123223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
