('', 'That gives us a place to start, at least. We will search every inch of the Broken Isles if need be.', 122971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. My research led me to the Broken Isles. Though I never found their exact locations, I believe the Pillars lie in the hands of the peoples of that ancient land.', '', 122970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finding these artifacts is crucial. The Pillars are the only thing that can seal the Legion\'s portal in the Tomb of Sargeras.', '', 122969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course not! The Pillars represent primordial power. Even as Guardian, I dared not trifle with them.', '', 122968, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re seeking five ancient artifacts called the Pillars of Creation. Your writing didn\'t specify where to find them.', 122967, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s too bad we can\'t see Stormheim.', '', 122966, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You read my work? I didn\'t think the younger generation bothered with books anymore. Always playing games, adventuring about...', '', 122965, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion has returned. To stop them, we scoured the library of Karazhan for a tome you authored called \'Notable Antiquities of Ancient Azeroth\'.', '', 122964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know of you. The apprentice who refuses the mantle I first wore. What do you need of me?', '', 122963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Alodi. I am Khadgar, archmage of the Kirin--', '', 122962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A summons! Ages have passed since I\'ve been called upon for aid.', '', 122961, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call forth the spirit of the first Guardian!', '', 122960, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am nearly out of energy. I need to find a portal to rest at or siphon the essence of my Moon Guard.', '', 122959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I felt such power... such agony...', '', 122958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nihilam portal is being protected by an eredar known as Balaadur. Conventional spells are useless against it. I\'ll have to call down the fury of the cosmos to destroy the portal. Then it will be just me and the demon.', '', 122957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are too many demons. I... I\'ll need more of my Moon Guard\'s power. Do I go too far? No, I must remain focused! The future of my people lies in my hands!', '', 122956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boldly you stand in defiance of the Great Burning Shadow! Minions, kill the \"hero\"!', '', 122955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Thousands more! It appears as if the demon armies are coming from the portal in the courtyard below. I\'ll need to destroy it if we\'re to survive, but I\'ll need help from my Moon Guard.', '', 122954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Illidan, demon! Know my name for it spells your doom!', '', 122953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will end this... I must!', '', 122952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could anything stand against such a force?', '', 122951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must find a way to close that gateway!', '', 122950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For each demon I kill two more take its place!', '', 122949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no end to them!', '', 122948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps the wind cleared up the fog.', '', 122947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see all of Suramar from here!', '', 122946, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s not do that again!', 'Let\'s not do that again!', 122945, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 72534, 72535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My carelessness forces me to fall back. I will learn from this defeat and strike back with a vengeance.', '', 122944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion will become the first druid because he is a dedicated student. You... are NOT.', '', 122943, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will summon the spirit of Alodi, the first Guardian of Tirisfal. Let me know when you would like me to begin.', '', 122942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the summoning.', 'Begin the summoning.', 122941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have victory over the Legion.', '', 122940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran will not fall, $n.', '', 122939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion must be thwarted!', '', 122938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is just NO WAY this is a bad idea.', 'There is just NO WAY this is a bad idea.', 122937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The six-eyed master has seen your fate, $n! You will fail, and worlds will burn!', '', 122936, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish to continue studying the wilds, you may do so with your brother.', '', 122935, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brought all my big rocks for helpin\' da catapults. Gregg want to join da Horde!', '', 122934, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n sneakily adds poison to the Flask of the Solemn Night.', '$n sneakily adds poison to the Flask of the Solemn Night.', 122933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n destroys the Arcane Power Conduit, overloading all Guardian Constructs!', '$n destroys the Arcane Power Conduit, overloading all Guardian Constructs!', 122932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n interprets the Waterlogged Scroll, granting everyone increased movement speed!', '$n interprets the Waterlogged Scroll, granting everyone increased movement speed!', 122930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n routes the power on the Magical Lantern, granting everyone increased damage!', '$n routes the power on the Magical Lantern, granting everyone increased damage!', 122929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n interacts with the Nightshade Refreshments, granting everyone increased health!', '$n interacts with the Nightshade Refreshments, granting everyone increased health!', 122928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n releases the Umbral Bloom spores, granting everyone increased haste!', '$n releases the Umbral Bloom spores, granting everyone increased haste!', 122927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n absorbs the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', '$n absorbs the Fel Orb, granting everyone increased critical strike chance!', 122926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n destroys the Infernal Tome, granting everyone damage reduction!', '$n destroys the Infernal Tome, granting everyone damage reduction!', 122925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n interacts with the Starlight Rose Brew, granting everyone health and mana restoration!', '$n interacts with the Starlight Rose Brew, granting everyone health and mana restoration!', 122924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hear the roar of battle already, $n? It calls to you!', '', 122923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How war gets the blood pumping, $n! Does your axe not thirst for a duel?', '', 122912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, $n. Your ship, and glorious victory, await.', '', 122911, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... That gives me an idea... We\'ll discuss it when you\'ve handled those anomalies.', '', 122908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Modera and I will continue examining the tome we recovered from Karazhan. We WILL find those Pillars, $n!', '', 122907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m relieved we both made it out of Karazhan in one piece.', '', 122906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolyNova:20|t Hyrja begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192206|h[Sanctify]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolyNova:20|t Hyrja begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192206|h[Sanctify]|h|r!', 122900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EyeOfTheStorm:20|t Hyrja begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192305|h[Eye of the Storm]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EyeOfTheStorm:20|t Hyrja begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192305|h[Eye of the Storm]|h|r!', 122899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were right, demon. Fel is more powerful than the arcane, but you wield it clumsily! Let me show you what destruction a master\'s touch can bring!', '', 122898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare to defy the Burning Legion? Kneel before the unmatched power of fel!', 122897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, what choice exists? If I fail, Suramar falls tomorrow, and with it my beloved Tyrande. I must act now!', '', 122896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her fel magic is too strong. I could try and siphon energy from my Moon Guard and use it to unleash devastation upon this demon, but my mages will die too.', '', 122895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage, we need to leave.', 'Archmage, we need to leave.', 122894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At your command, captain!', 'At your command, captain!', 122893, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 72374, 72375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower the gate and brace yourselves! Glaive throwers at the ready!', '', 122892, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 72369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Lord Ravencrest! Lower the portcullis!', '', 122891, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 72366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! The power radiating from the portal will energize me so long as I remain nearby. I must remember to return to these portals whenever I am fatigued.', '', 122890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan thinks to himself.', '', 122889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I can repair that deactivated portal I will have the reinforcements I require and a font of power to refresh my energy.', '', 122888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It took nearly all of our energy to conjure that protective barrier. If I push these Moon Guard any harder they will die.', '', 122887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fail you, my lord!', '', 122886, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 72322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I will find that way.', '', 122884, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are doomed...', '', 122883, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if we defeat them here, it will mean nothing.', '', 122882, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond this army is another... and another... and another...', '', 122881, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our eyes... deceive us.', '', 122880, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how hard this world fights, it will fall.', '', 122879, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Screams in agony>', '', 122878, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the Legion\'s power.', '', 122877, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother-', '', 122876, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To walk this path requires sacrifice, Illidan... Something you have yet to understand.', '', 122875, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must learn respect.', '', 122874, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So I must learn from... a NOVICE... instead of a MASTER?', '', 122873, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So...', '', 122872, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. You may remain here, but I will no longer be your teacher.', '', 122871, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have cast me out, Cenarius!', '', 122870, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan, your anger is misplaced. I have not insulted you.', '', 122869, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. The child is destined for a great and prosperous future. His name... is Illidan.', 122868, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 72348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one! His eyes are golden!', '', 122867, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beautiful. Nearly identical, except for-', 122866, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 72347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Stormrage twins.', 122865, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 72346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two?', '', 122864, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 72349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run, little Ravencrest, Run! There may still be time for you to flee and live out your final miserable days cowering in a tree somewhere!', 122862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pup... has fangs...', 122861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... You killed your own soldiers?! You crazed fool! You\'ve sealed your own fate!', 122860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s this?? Ravencrest has sent a pup to face me? I will teach you to respect your betters, child!', 122859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Khadgar! Thank the Forge I found ye! Ye won\'t believe it! Me brother Magni\'s back!', '', 122858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Stormrage has given us a fighting chance! Secure the rampart, Rooksguard! Advance!!', '', 122857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do what you must! Should Black Rook Hold fall, all of Suramar will fall with it!', '', 122856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shrugs indifferently and kicks you into the sky.', 122855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your funeral.', 122854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THIEF! How DARE you steal what is mine?!', 122853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are our last hope, Illidan!', '', 122852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has slain half of our forces and scattered the rest across the grounds. What you see here is all that remains of the Rooksguard protecting the hold.', '', 122851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 72219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to challenge Downfall again, mistress.', 'I would like to challenge Downfall again, mistress.', 122850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Illidan, but the battle has only begun.', '', 122849, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 72218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are these your initials?', 'Are these your initials?', 122848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What business do you have with me, $r?', 122847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The birth of not one, but two healthy males.', 122846, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 72345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise to the goddess. She has blessed us this night with new life.', 122845, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 72344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan is dead and the Golden Army fights an endless war in our name from across the cosmos...', '', 122844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for the Army of the Light and Illidan, I am at a loss. I have never felt so powerless.', '', 122843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been on our own all along. Our gods killed before we were born.', '', 122842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It explains so much, yet I cannot help but feel an overwhelming sense of sadness.', '', 122841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead? The titans are dead?', '', 122840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may speak.', 122838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Thalyssra\'s token to Valtrois.>', '<Show Thalyssra\'s token to Valtrois.>', 122837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The echoes of magic have subsided. You have our thanks.', 122836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those meddling ghost mages managed to conjure up a being of wild magic! Put them back in line.', 122835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. We can rest easy... for now.', 122834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A gigantic beast has risen from the waters. Send it back to the depths!', 122833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen everything! Illidan! Ravencrest wants me to take over! We need to coordinate our attack and bring back some semblance of order!', '', 122832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are relieved of duty, Illidan. Rhonin, the Moon Guard are yours to command now.', '', 122831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT HAVE YOU DONE! YOU\'VE KILLED THEM ALL, ILLIDAN!', '', 122830, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 72324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on the lookout for Captain Shadowsong and his two foreign allies! We were separated in the initial assault. I pray they are still alive!', '', 122829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To make matters worse, that monstrosity in the arena will burn the hold from the inside out if it is not stopped! Take your Moon Guard and rid Black Rook Hold of this demonic invasion!', '', 122828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande... The world is only as meaningful to us as the beings that inhabit it. Even in the end, Illidan saw her as clearly as the first time he laid eyes on her. He never lost sight of his world. You must ask yourself how far will you go for yours.', 122827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With his eyes burned out for seeing the truth, Illidan still did not falter. Even under the gaze of the lord of the Burning Legion, Illidan remained resolute and defiant.', 122826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Difficult decisions had to be made, but to understand Illidan\'s perspective is essential if we are to succeed in our mission. What would you have done differently?', 122825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Few have known such failure and rejection. Most would have given up, but Illidan would continue on, guided by the unseen hand of fate. His destiny lay elsewhere.', 122824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan\'s was a life full of potential. His destiny forged in the great ordering and cast to the cosmic winds, where at last it would find a home on Azeroth. Within the tiny vessel the great cycle began anew.', 122823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An ancient memory stirs. When you are prepared, call to me and together we will uncover a piece of Illidan\'s past.', 122822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_warlock_demonsoul_nightmare:20|tUse Malfurion\'s |cFF00FFFF|Hspell:212630|h[Cleansed Ground]|h|r to avoid damage from |cFFFF0000|Hspell:210279|h[Creeping Nightmares]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_warlock_demonsoul_nightmare:20|tUse Malfurion\'s |cFF00FFFF|Hspell:212630|h[Cleansed Ground]|h|r to avoid damage from |cFFFF0000|Hspell:210279|h[Creeping Nightmares]|h|r.', 122821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soaring through the skies is immensely enjoyable!', '', 122820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
