('I am your destruction!', 'I am your destruction!', 122682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what\'s gotten into the flowers! I stopped trying to collect them once they started... well, they started collecting themselves!$B$BStrange, isn\'t it?', 122681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What\'s the story with Old Fillmaff over there?', 'What\'s the story with Old Fillmaff over there?', 122680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years passed, and we\'d relocated the entire city to Icecrown for the Northrend campaign.$b$bOne day - out of the blue - Old Fillmaff walks into the violet tower. Just strolls in! Doesn\'t say a word. He starts filing books and organizing the folios, like nothing had happened. He\'s been back at it ever since.$b$b<Varenthas leans close to you and whispers:>$b$bI\'m not sure he knows he\'s dead.', '', 122679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who, Fillmaff? That old relic? He\'s been an archivist here at Dalaran for decades. I remember him back from my student days. Always puttering around the stacks. He could find anything.$b$bThen came the Third War, when Arthas sacked the city. Fillmaff went missing, along with countless others - just another of the numberless dead. Nobody thought anything of it.', '', 122678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Arrexis was ambushed by this eredar, Balaadur?  Then he is probably in possession of the staff...\n\nWith the invasion I have no doubt he is either here or watching. I propose something... audacious.\n\nLet us recreate Arrexis\'s ritual! Conducting the ritual at an invasion point will attract Balaadur\'s attention. He will likely try an ambush, but we will be ready.', '', 122677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Saying nothing, he eyes you warily.>', '<Saying nothing, she eyes you warily.>', 122676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you say so.', 'If you say so.', 122675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t scare me.', 'You don\'t scare me.', 122674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight me, then.', 'Fight me, then.', 122673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have none.', 'I have none.', 122672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away.', 'Go away.', 122671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', 'What?', 122670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh.', 'Heh.', 122669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me alone.', 'Leave me alone.', 122668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your secret.', 'I know your secret.', 122667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_ability_rogue_envelopingshadows_nightmare:20|tIl\'gynoth has almost completed his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:223121|h[Final Torpor]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_ability_rogue_envelopingshadows_nightmare:20|tIl\'gynoth has almost completed his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:223121|h[Final Torpor]|h|r!', 122666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek to wield the weapons of the storm lord, venture within, and learn of his deeds and his unmaking...', '', 122665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve asked a question, give me an answer!', 'I\'ve asked a question, give me an answer!', 122664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, friend! It is not actually me, Khadgar, merely my ruggedly handsome countenance and vast wealth of knowledge. Should you wish the answer to any question, merely ask and request a response.\n\nSo vast is my mental landscape that there was only magical space left to impart a few response phrases into this device, so be sure that you ask VERY SPECIFIC questions.', '', 122663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannot wait. There are demons among your ranks. Let me show you.', 'This cannot wait. There are demons among your ranks. Let me show you.', 122662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Arduen was apparently being held prisoner. His face is ghostly white.>$B$B$I... broke free... and ran...$B$BI... almost made it...$B$BPlease, $n, save... the other... Illidari...', '', 122661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ulduar holds many secrets.', '', 122660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck, all of you.', 122659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'XXXX', 122658, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move while the Mana Wraiths are distracted!', 'Move while the Mana Wraiths are distracted!', 122657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be alarmed, mortal. Your consciousness has been projected to my astral presence in the Great Dark Beyond.', 122656, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am Xe\'ra, one of the first naaru to be forged here during the great ordering of the cosmos.', 122655, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jus\' say the word an\' we\'ll be off!', '', 122654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make our way to Netherlight Temple at once.', '', 122653, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I returned to Dalaran as soon as I heard the prophecy had been fulfilled.\n\nYou united the Light, just as I saw it. Let us hope that your efforts will give us the strength we need to defeat Balnazzar once and for all.', '', 122652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sirius Ebonwing looks as pale as a ghost. He shivers uncontrollably.>', '', 122651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Cassiel Nightthorn\'s body is nearly unrecognizable. He was tortured, then died from the wounds.>', '', 122650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, it\'s you.\n\nWe were in pursuit of a dangerous dreadlord. Unfortunately, he lured us right into a trap.', 122649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This demon has some fight in it!', 'This demon has some fight in it!', 122648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have the power...', 'We don\'t have the power...', 122647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its too strong!  This is madness!', 'Its too strong!  This is madness!', 122646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The one called Illidan Stormrage.', 122645, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here now on a mission of desperation. I seek the child of Light and Shadow: the boy destined to end the age of demons.', 122644, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But now, the Golden Army teeters upon the precipice of oblivion as their campaign on Argus nears its terminus. Should they fall, the Legion will initiate a new Burning Crusade, and with it the cosmos will tremble.', 122643, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the ashes of those ravaged worlds, survivors arose to stand against the demons. They became known as the Army of the Light.', 122642, 0, 0, 0, 74, 0, 0, 71881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the fall, none were left to oppose the will of Sargeras. Unfettered, the dark titan and his Burning Legion would go on to annihilate countless worlds in their Burning Crusade.', 122641, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In a time now long past, a great battle was fought that would determine the fate of all worlds. It was in that final battle that the all-powerful titan Pantheon fell to one of their own: Sargeras.', 122640, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have come to the crucible of all creation in search of answers. Listen then, and find enlightenment.', 122639, 0, 0, 1, 74, 0, 0, 71878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest in peace, old friend.', 'Rest in peace, old friend.', 122638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare has no place here, and we must do everything we can to protect Malorne. Without him, the very balance of nature is vulnerable.$B$BI fear there is nothing more important than saving him... even if it means giving our own lives.', '', 122637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It must be difficult for the wild gods to re-live this moment. I can only imagine the horror when the Legion invaded, all those years ago.', 122636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t like this place at all! Let\'s get rid of these invading monsters, Archdruid!', 122635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da enemies a\' da Nightmare are clever. Dey chose da moment when da Wild Gods fell in battle thousands a\' years ago, when dey rose up ta defend Azeroth against the Burning Legion.', 122634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sirius, are you okay?', 'Sirius, are you okay?', 122633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Asha, you\'re free.', 'Asha, you\'re free.', 122632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jagganoth will... end you...', '', 122631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIEF!', '', 122630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself, $c...', '', 122629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told them this would happen. \n\nI TOLD them. \n\nDid they listen?!', 122628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, $c, have you explored the wondrous goods that Dalaran has to offer? If you can\'t find what you\'re looking for, chances I know someone who can help.', '', 122627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corrin ma\' crate, ye bugger off!', 122626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knoooow you\'re with the Leeeegion. That\'s you. That\'s what you sound like.', 122625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello fellow citizen, what seems to be the problem?', '', 122624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Larry gonna crush you into delicious meat sauce.', '', 122623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, this guy\'s toast.', '', 122622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Glory!', 'For Glory!', 122621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They shall fear our wrath.', 'They shall fear our wrath.', 122620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for Odyn!', 'My life for Odyn!', 122619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'sharah', 'Val\'sharah', 122618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spear is yours.', 'My spear is yours.', 122617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr, the time is upon us! To battle!', 'Val\'kyr, the time is upon us! To battle!', 122616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr!  The Call has gone out!  Prepare yourselves!', 'Val\'kyr!  The Call has gone out!  Prepare yourselves!', 122615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highmountain', 'Highmountain', 122614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna', 'Azsuna', 122613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you get me a flight out of here?', 'Can you get me a flight out of here?', 122612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe I saw a $c looking for you in town, mentioning something about some ancient weapon. You should speak with them first before venturing out into the Broken Isles. You\'re going to need all of the allies you can get.\n\nI mean... I can get you a flight if you really want one. But I\'d recommend against it.', '', 122611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe our wounds have healed enough. I will continue my scouting. Be well, Lilryia.', '', 122610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'D\'ah! Now you\'re making me angry!', 122609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do we fight?', 122608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are lucky to have received Malorne\'s warning, dire as it may be. I greatly fear for the Emerald Dream, and if the Dream is corrupted, there is no telling how it will affect Azeroth.', '', 122607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought! The enemies of the Nightwatchers pay dearly for their treachery.', 122606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to assault Hrydshal.', 'Ready to assault Hrydshal.', 122605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The most powerful mages at this temple conspire against the Nightwatchers. Show them how we deal with our enemies!', 122604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even spirits understand strength. Well done!', 122603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Temple of a Thousand Lights teems with spirits gone mad. You should remind them to behave.', 122602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Activate the module using 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Activate the module using 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This module looks to have lost its energy source long ago.', '', 122600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need a ride to Dalaran, my bats are at the ready.', '', 122599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the dook?', '', 122598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hydraxian Waterlords are with you, Farseer. The Burning legion will not conquer!', '', 122597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a strange roar from the cavern ahead.', 'You hear a strange roar from the cavern ahead.', 122596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be my honor.', 'It would be my honor.', 122595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shield is yours.', 'My shield is yours.', 122594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect.', 'I will protect.', 122593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a strange crackling sound from the portals downstairs.', 'You hear a strange crackling sound from the portals downstairs.', 122592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Uncrowned are a means to an end. The Legion\'s end.', 122591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direhorn', 'Direhorn', 122590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hydra', 'Hydra', 122589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riverbeast', 'Riverbeast', 122588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rylak', 'Rylak', 122587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mechanical', 'Mechanical', 122586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to pursue the final blade.', 'I\'m ready to pursue the final blade.', 122585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm down, we will go home soon.', 122584, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you break it, mother must purchase it.', 122583, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No fingers on the glass, remember what we discussed.', 122582, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep quiet and let mother browse.', 122581, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your hands to yourself, little one.', 122580, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I better not hear anything breaking.', 122579, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to review the information we\'ve gathered on the remaining artifact weapon.', 'I\'d like to review the information we\'ve gathered on the remaining artifact weapon.', 122578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rift Core is charged, deploy the Rift Cannon at your discretion.', 'The Rift Core is charged, deploy the Rift Cannon at your discretion.', 122577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The order is given, we will begin charging up the Rift Core immediately.', 'The order is given, we will begin charging up the Rift Core immediately.', 122576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mimiron gave me a teleport pad to use in case of emergencies. I\'d say this qualifies!', '', 122575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to seeing Magni again. It\'s been too long.', '', 122574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who summon, pay the toll, forfeit now your eternal soul!', '', 122573, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish for passage to Helheim? Then you shall have it! Ahahahaha!', '', 122572, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 71768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All who summon the ferryman, must pay the toll!', '', 122571, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits! Sweep these mortals into the tides!!!', '', 122570, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stag', 'Stag', 122569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This action costs 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana. Do you wish to continue?', 'This action costs 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana. Do you wish to continue?', 122568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Free the Felbound Manasaber by spending 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Free the Felbound Manasaber by spending 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light shall burn you!', '', 122566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know I\'m King now, right?', '', 122565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suramar ascends.', '', 122564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This Manasaber has been imprisoned by the Legion, but overloading the crystal with Ancient Mana will free the beast.>', '', 122563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You try my patience.', '', 122562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is not the time for that.', '', 122561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory in the Light.', '', 122560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safe journey to you.', '', 122559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never lose hope.', '', 122558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are always welcome in Stormwind.', '', 122557, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be vigilant.', '', 122556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A King is only as noble as the causes he serves.', '', 122555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance above all.', '', 122554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A just cause is always worth fighting for.', '', 122553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes we must fight for what we believe in.', '', 122552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend.', '', 122551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind will endure.', '', 122550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind honors your service to the Alliance.', '', 122549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion shall tremble before the power of the Four Horsemen!', '', 122548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 76898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horsemen! Our Destiny is at hand!', '', 122547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 76897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! I will not allow the Ebon Blade to fall!', '', 122546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 76895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too rich to die like this!', 'I\'m too rich to die like this!', 122545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, what do we pay you for? Kill this beast!', 'Guards, what do we pay you for? Kill this beast!', 122544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Su\'esh is on the loose! Flee!', 'Su\'esh is on the loose! Flee!', 122543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all going to die!', 'We\'re all going to die!', 122542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna fight for my island! Fine! I\'ll paint it with your blood!', '', 122541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will fight honorably for the Order of the Silver Hand, $ct.', 122540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!', 'What?!', 122539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Where are your manafiends now?!', 'Hah! Where are your manafiends now?!', 122538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something need to be cleaned?', '', 122537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time to talk. Cleaning to be done.', '', 122536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Busy, very busy. M-must get to work.', '', 122535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. To Ulduar!', 'I\'m ready. To Ulduar!', 122534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d best get a move on, $n!', '', 122533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU\'RE NOT GONNA TAKE MY ISLAND!!', '', 122532, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grim task, but you did what had to be done. I\'ll prepare the Tears of Elune for transport. Meet me in the Violet Citadel.', '', 122531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIND YOUR OWN DAMN ISLAND!!', '', 122530, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS IS MY ISLAND!', '', 122529, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guards sniff at you, then grunt softly.', '', 122528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gladly.', 'Gladly.', 122527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvelous! It\'s great seeing a young hero like you take the time for a bit of history. In the end, some might say what we leave behind is all that matters.\n\nI have something here... a volume of a completely different sort that I might offer you in exchange for the great efforts you\'ve put into this. Would you like it?', '', 122526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve finished gathering all of the volumes.', 'I\'ve finished gathering all of the volumes.', 122525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, I\'ve been looking everywhere for you! Oh, the head in the crystal ball? I\'m trying something new.', '', 122524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Something terrible has befallen this lone wanderer.>\n\n<Unfortunately, there is no way to free him.>', '', 122523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
