('Recruit Silver Hand Knights', 'Recruit Silver Hand Knights', 122520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I assist you today?', 'How can I assist you today?', 122519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gamer timer', 'Gamer timer', 122518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End current round', 'End current round', 122517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tier 4 Defended', 'Tier 4 Defended', 122516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tier 3 Defended', 'Tier 3 Defended', 122515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tier 2 Defended', 'Tier 2 Defended', 122514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Imbue one of the tridents with 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Imbue one of the tridents with 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tier 1 Defended', 'Tier 1 Defended', 122512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The look of these mundane weapons belies a hidden potential.', '', 122511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a strange feral screech towards the Hinterlands gateway.', 'You hear a strange feral screech towards the Hinterlands gateway.', 122510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a strange feral screech towards the Feralas gateway.', 'You hear a strange feral screech towards the Feralas gateway.', 122509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a strange feral screech towards the Duskwood gateway.', 'You hear a strange feral screech towards the Duskwood gateway.', 122508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you want something done right, you have to kill it yourself...', 122507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me show you the power of the Legion!', 122506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the Light.', 'My life for the Light.', 122505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall fight for you.', 'I shall fight for you.', 122504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear something dart away behind you... and then just silence.', 'You hear something dart away behind you... and then just silence.', 122503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good bout...', '', 122502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse... you...', '', 122501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be a good warm-up for my actual practice.', '', 122500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the master\'s son. You are outmatched.', '', 122499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us aid our allies under the Light, and defend Netherlight Temple. To the portal!', '', 122498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are armed and ready to fight, High Priest.', '', 122497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion has begun their attack. We must defend Netherlight Temple!', 'The Burning Legion has begun their attack. We must defend Netherlight Temple!', 122496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we have arrived just in time.', '', 122495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explosions! MORE explosions! I got to have more explosions!', '', 122494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 71635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usurpers! Gnomeregan is mine!', '', 122493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 71634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horsemen! Our time has come!', '', 122492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you on the upper level when you are ready, Deathlord.', '', 122491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come to take my position as the leader of the Four Horsemen.', '', 122490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 78622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreadscar are yours to command, Overlord.\n\nMay the worlds of your enemies fall at your feet.', '', 122489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Courtesans! Defend us while we continue the ritual!', 122488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, I will draw the power of the Nightwell to wipe them out!', '', 122487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interlopers!', '', 122486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your intrusion has not gone unnoticed; but the ritual continues.', 'Your intrusion has not gone unnoticed; but the ritual continues.', 122485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_shadowyapparition:20|t%s has summoned a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:226089|h[Shadow Image]|h|r! Banish it!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_shadowyapparition:20|t%s has summoned a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:226089|h[Shadow Image]|h|r! Banish it!', 122484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 122483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me to the Seed of Ages, Archdruid. There, we will unlock additional mysteries of your weapon.', '', 122482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare begins to take you!', 'The Nightmare begins to take you!', 122481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time!  Vanguard of the Silver Hand, to Battle!', 'It is time!  Vanguard of the Silver Hand, to Battle!', 122480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For honor and glory!', 'For honor and glory!', 122479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, take me back. There is much I need to do first.', 'Yes, take me back. There is much I need to do first.', 122478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission here is gravely important. However if you need to make additional preparations, I can return you to the Aetherium. Would you like me to?', 'Our mission here is gravely important. However if you need to make additional preparations, I can return you to the Aetherium. Would you like me to?', 122477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not ready yet.', 'I\'m not ready yet.', 122476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The portal hums with magic.>', '', 122475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deciphering', 'Deciphering', 122474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord, I lend my arms to your cause.', 'My Lord, I lend my arms to your cause.', 122473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladins of the Silver Hand!  Come forth and present yourselves for battle!', 'Paladins of the Silver Hand!  Come forth and present yourselves for battle!', 122472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n. Meet me by the Forge of the Guardian.', '', 122471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of felspawn have these devils set upon us!? Mother Moon help us all!', '', 122470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Dalaran over Deadwind Pass. I have a plan. A horribly dangerous plan... but a plan nonetheless!', '', 122469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need the Pillars of Creation to send the demons back to the Twisting Nether and save our world.', '', 122468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran is under siege, $n! The Legion intends to knock us out of the sky!', '', 122467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wear your tabard with pride, $n. Our red colors will hide your wounds from your enemies.', 122466, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I have spoken seven words, that is my limit.', '', 122465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about your posts.', 'Tell me more about your posts.', 122464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We require rest, master.', 'We require rest, master.', 122463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72106, 72368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moon Guard, focus your energies into me! We shall show these monsters the power of the arcane!', '', 122462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sire, behind you! Another felmaw has opened!', '', 122461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the problem with magic, you never know when it will turn on you!', '', 122460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always hated water elementals... Especially big ones like this!', '', 122459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fishing can wait, help me put this elemental down!', '', 122458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you strike at me first or stare at me like a sniveling coward?', '', 122457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, outsider filth. I will even let you strike the first blow. Make it count.', 122456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Request a Blessing', 'Request a Blessing', 122455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Order is with you.', 122454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande will pay for her treachery.', 122453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve broken through the prison gate! The way into Dalaran is clear!', '', 122452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They should have listened to me from the start and destroyed all the satyrs before this could happen.\n\nI thank you, $p, for releasing me from the madness of Xavius.', '', 122451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power of the Nightwell calls to me.', 122450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long have I waited to return home...', 122449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Use 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana to extract a portion of the ley energy.>', '<Use 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana to extract a portion of the ley energy.>', 122448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press forward, we cannot delay here long.', '', 122447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ward pulses with overflowing energy.', '', 122446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion will fall today, champion.', '', 122445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stop Gul\'dan before he can complete the ritual.', '', 122444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madam Goya packed up da goods and left me in charge of da premises. She said somethin\' about a sky city. Haw! Cities don\'t fly!', '', 122443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can the power of the Essence of Clarity guide us into the heart of the Nightmare?', 'Can the power of the Essence of Clarity guide us into the heart of the Nightmare?', 122441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin The Defense of Netherlight Temple.', 'I am ready to begin The Defense of Netherlight Temple.', 122440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot afford to wait much longer. We must face the Legion head on.', '', 122439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should continue our patrol. There is no telling how many more of these incursions pocket the landscape.', '', 122438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I expected more out of these demons. Maybe we can find a pitlord. I always wanted to shackle the essence of a pitlord.', '', 122437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is broken.  The figure suspended within the Nightwell awakens.', 'The ritual is broken.  The figure suspended within the Nightwell awakens.', 122436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear the measured chanting and pacing of a complex ritual within the spire.', 'You hear the measured chanting and pacing of a complex ritual within the spire.', 122435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare\'s guardians have fallen. What else must be done to open the way to Xavius?', 'The Nightmare\'s guardians have fallen. What else must be done to open the way to Xavius?', 122434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it champions! The Iris is unlocked, give the word and I will open it.', '', 122433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Provide an offering of 20 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Provide an offering of 20 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Asher, son of Exurotus, the new Fury of Frostfire, wishes to bestow you with his boon.', '', 122431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, you have been called. Follow me.', '', 122430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This font looks as if it has not been used for some time.', '', 122429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of the Alliance, I write to you in Azeroth\'s darkest hour. From the maw of hell, the burning armies of the Legion have returned.', '', 122421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterful, your weapon and experience show even the valarjar can learn from the younger races. There are new enemies and new ways of fighting that I haven\'t seen in my many years. You have given me a great deal to work with, thank you.', '', 122420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them back! We cannot lose the city!', '', 122419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught off guard, we was! We be needin\' ta bring an end ta these demons once and fer all!', '', 122418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do not stop Xavius, the Nightmare will consume all of Azeroth.', '', 122417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better late than never, eh lad? Those of us that still draw breath fight on! Are you pre-', '', 122416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just stand there, $n! These demons won\'t be killin\' themselves!', '', 122415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlord!', '', 122414, 0, 923, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_molteninferno.blp:20|tThe $n |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202663|h[Detonates]|h|r as it dies!', '', 122413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone!', 'Begone!', 122412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finish mixin\' up dat mojo, we got ta get it to da Broken Shore!', 122411, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake me up from this Nightmare!', 'Wake me up from this Nightmare!', 122410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place... It\'s so much worse than I could have imagined.', '', 122409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness_nightmare:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:214876|h[Beasts of Nightmare]|h|r!', '', 122408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
