('If you like your shoes, you may want to step back a bit.', '', 122265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what you have.', 'Let\'s see what you have.', 122264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to The Gnarled Branch, $n.', 122263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this mess! All of our things thrown about! Books on the floor, tools everywhere... I really wish we had a bit more warning before the entire city moved!$B$BAnd look at Dorian over there. Poor guy is still recovering.', '', 122262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, $n, but we were asked not to take on any new trainees for a while. Once we reach our final destination I\'m sure things will return to normal.', 122261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a work order for Champion armaments', 'Place a work order for Champion armaments', 122260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me yer dead, Ill find a use for \'em.', '', 122259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The withered! They\'re upon us. Please, help me!', '', 122258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... do you hear that?', '', 122257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what you have.', 'Let\'s see what you have.', 122256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th... thank you... I... I don\'t know how to go on... I\'ve lost so much.', '', 122255, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you need, little $n?', '', 122254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed Llorian 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Feed Llorian 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a work order for Champion armaments', 'Place a work order for Champion armaments', 122252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the Light bless you.', 122251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They killed her... those withered killed my Luniel. I... I have nothing left.', '', 122250, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hear what this demon hunter has to say.', '', 122249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got to finish these samples, $n! The last batch was so unstable they nearly killed us all during the move!$B$BDon\'t tell anyone that last part.', '', 122248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the Ritual', 'Begin the Ritual', 122247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it time?', 122246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin charging the Hammer', 'Begin charging the Hammer', 122244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 122243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a work order for Champion armaments.', 'Place a work order for Champion armaments.', 122241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I be of service?', 'How can I be of service?', 122240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the Call', 'Begin the Call', 122239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you need?', 122238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luniel... sweetest Luniel... how could I let this happen to you?', '', 122237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a work order for Champion armaments.', 'Place a work order for Champion armaments.', 122236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 122235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send out the Call for the Vanguard', 'Send out the Call for the Vanguard', 122232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your command?', '', 122231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_deathknight_necroticplague.blp:20|t You are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:206480|h[Carrion Plague]|h|r!', '', 122230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... kill every last one of these monsters.', 'Please... kill every last one of these monsters.', 122229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free... finally free. How do I get out of here?', 'Free... finally free. How do I get out of here?', 122228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I think I can make it. Thank you.', 'I... I think I can make it. Thank you.', 122227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horror... the horror.', 'The horror... the horror.', 122226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t go on...', 'I can\'t go on...', 122225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am already so weak...', 'I... am already so weak...', 122224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have not yet learned to fly here in Pandaria, feel free to borrow Graddoc here for a flight into the Vale.', '', 122223, 0, 44020, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box flares once again. One more sequence and it will be fully activated!', 'The box flares once again. One more sequence and it will be fully activated!', 122222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The melody of chimes increases in volume.', 'The melody of chimes increases in volume.', 122221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box starts emitting a series of pleasant chime sounds.', 'The box starts emitting a series of pleasant chime sounds.', 122220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The box flares brightly.', 'The box flares brightly.', 122219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next time someone tells you they\'re going to move a city using magic, you better be ready for anything! And I mean ANYTHING!', '', 122218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to press the big red button labeled \"DO NOT PUSH THIS BUTTON\".', '', 122217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we may also be experiencing a minor case of total system failure.', '', 122216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dorothy\'s inside if you need her, but if you\'re looking for supplies we won\'t be able to fill any orders for the time being. My apologies.', '', 122215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quite a few people have come by seeking relief from the side effects.$B$BIf I could just find those old recipes... I know they\'re here somewhere!', 122214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, don\'t mind him. He\'s quite forgetful. All of the aged goods were stored well before our departure.$B$BBe sure to come visit us when the shop\'s up and running again! I\'m sure we\'ll reach our final destination soon enough!', 122213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only half my cheese made it! Half!$B$BHow are we to run a wine and cheese shop with an abundance of wine and only mere crumbles of delicious cheese? This is outrageous! It\'s preposterous! And...$B$BOh, my! Now I\'m feeling faint. What is this world coming to?', '', 122212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost all accounted for! Who would have thought moving Dalaran would cause such problems? One more pen, the birds and then everything will be back to normal!$B$B<Looking around the room>.$B$BExcept for that poor fellow over in the fish tank. I hope they can resolve that soon.', 122211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is a mess!', 122210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To protect the weak, uphold justice, and walk the righteous path.', 122209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shield of man, the hand of devotion, and the sword of retribution.', 122208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A warrior of Light.', 122207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With this vow, I am reborn,', 122206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And join my brothers and sisters in humble service.', 122205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I pledge my life to the Order of the Silver Hand,', 122204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, in the presence of eternal champions, I take this sacred oath:', 122202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed the manasaber 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Feed the manasaber 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The manasaber looks at you like you might have something it wants to eat.>', '', 122200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good thing the fish tank was emptied before we left. That would have been a whole other issue!', '', 122198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing I can find about this particular situation. Just hang tight! We\'ll figure something out.', '', 122197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a little more time to think. These are pretty unique circumstances. It\'s not the kind of job you can do... half way.', '', 122196, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, we\'ll have you out in a zip there... you. Why do I keep talking to this thing?', '', 122195, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we rotate clockwise a bit, then... no. Maybe it was counter clockwise...', '', 122194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak the vows at the altar when you are ready.', 'Speak the vows at the altar when you are ready.', 122193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, we could wait until we move again. Who knows? The problem might fix itself!', '', 122192, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanthir felt we would be safer here. After what happened to my dear Korine, I am inclined to agree.\n\nIt is a hard life the Nightfallen lead, but we will endure.\n\nThank you again for saving my daughter.', 122191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empower the Focusing Crystal', 'Empower the Focusing Crystal', 122190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are ready to begin.', 122189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that? Stop it! Someone\'s poking me on the other end!', '', 122188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you mean, \'might have to wait until we blink again\'? I can\'t stay here! I have things to do!', '', 122187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never noticed before, but the stones on the floor here are very well taken care of.', '', 122186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but just make sure to protect me if any demons show up! I\'m not really able to defend myself, if you know what I mean.', '', 122185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, look. Another bystander. Suuure... enjoy the show. Everybody come look at the poor gnome. When I get down from here...', '', 122184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Slow it down a little! I\'d like to keep my legs intact if that\'s possib... wait a minute! If I\'m here, then where\'s the rest of me!?', '', 122183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Specialist, huh? I\'ve been trapped here for hours!', '', 122182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The manasaber purrs warmly and beckons you closer.', '', 122181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I became a priestess to help others, but lately I have been wondering if I can do more.', 122180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recruit Ascendants', 'Recruit Ascendants', 122179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ascended cannot be commanded, only unleashed.', 'The Ascended cannot be commanded, only unleashed.', 122178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed Flameweaver Ovin 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Feed Flameweaver Ovin 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flame... falters. I am not long for this world...', '', 122176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', 'Place a work order for a Seal of Broken Fate.', 122175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put on the Stylish Spy Glasses to locate the blood trail!', 'Put on the Stylish Spy Glasses to locate the blood trail!', 122174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Uncrowned must strive to undermine the Burning Legion in all the ways we do it best: artifice, guile, deception, and of course, politics.\n\nUntil the Legion is defeated, our continued cooperation is my highest priority, $n. I trust that it is yours as well.', '', 122173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed Tempomancer Virinya 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Feed Tempomancer Virinya 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help... please. My thoughts... are slowing.', 122171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will gladly accept your help, Delas. The Light is strongest when it shines together.', '', 122170, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 71391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found one! Tighten up defense in this area at once.', '', 122169, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will tremble before me! All will tremble before me!', '', 122168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life energies amplify my own! I am unstoppable!', '', 122167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be the conduit for Azeroth\'s retribution!', '', 122166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must die, so that I may live! I have a destiny to fulfill! A world to save!', '', 122165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for this sacrifice. Your death will not be in vain.', '', 122164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('If only there were another way, but I must have power if we are to survive.', '', 122163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life energies will give our world a fighting chance, acolyte.', '', 122162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not ask for this burden, but it is what fate has deemed...', '', 122161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You walk down a dark path, Illidan. There\'s no turning back from this...', 'You walk down a dark path, Illidan. There\'s no turning back from this...', 122160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71378, 71379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother Moon take me!', 'Mother Moon take me!', 122159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71376, 71377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan... Why?', 'Illidan... Why?', 122158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71374, 71375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you not see the sacrifices I make to ensure our survival?!', '', 122157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make certain that your family is cared for, friend.', '', 122156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat of the Legion costs lives. Your lives!', '', 122155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am above your judgment! What I do, I do for Azeroth!', '', 122154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of you must die if our world is to survive!', '', 122153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be thankful that you were given this opportunity to serve!', '', 122152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you! This is the only way!', '', 122151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You serve a greater purpose now, my faithful acolyte!', '', 122150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do what must be done!', '', 122149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want my magic? Here, have a taste!', 'You want my magic? Here, have a taste!', 122148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71353, 71354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll burn for this, Illidan!', 'You\'ll burn for this, Illidan!', 122147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71351, 71352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BETRAYER!', 'BETRAYER!', 122146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71349, 71350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no better than the demons that descend upon us!', 'You are no better than the demons that descend upon us!', 122145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71347, 71348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want my mana? Then come! Take it if you dare!', 'You want my mana? Then come! Take it if you dare!', 122144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71345, 71346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have betrayed us all!', 'You have betrayed us all!', 122143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71343, 71344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are my captain no more, Illidan! DIE!', 'You are my captain no more, Illidan! DIE!', 122142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71341, 71342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rooksguard, send these devils back to their dark masters! For Azshara! For Kalimdor!', '', 122141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t kill me without a fight!', 'You won\'t kill me without a fight!', 122140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71337, 71338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a monster, Illidan!', 'You\'re a monster, Illidan!', 122139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72098, 72323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My chains will shackle you.', '', 122138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place work order for Champion armaments.', 'Place work order for Champion armaments.', 122137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you procure some valuable items.', 'I can help you procure some valuable items.', 122136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! You\'re killing us!', 'Stop! You\'re killing us!', 122135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71372, 71373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t do this, Illidan.', 'You can\'t do this, Illidan.', 122134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71370, 71371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t move... powerless...', 'Can\'t move... powerless...', 122133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71368, 71369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power wanes...', 'Power wanes...', 122132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71366, 71367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M... Master, I am dying...', 'M... Master, I am dying...', 122131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71364, 71365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sewer sharks? Nasty creatures, I\'ve seen \'em only once before!', '', 122130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your warm beer and cold sausages! Ask for Skidmark and tell him Joe sent ya!', '', 122129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has anyone seen my brother Daryl?', '', 122128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that smell?', '', 122127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things can\'t get worse. Can they?', '', 122126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jerk to the right! Now jerk to the left!', '', 122125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has anyone seen Stanky? I\'m starting to worry.', '', 122123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This jerkin ain\'t free!', '', 122122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife left me for a flounder.', '', 122120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a long way down, friend. \n\nNeed a hand?', '', 122119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh hiya, toots. You need anything, or ya want me to have someone get ya something.\n\nOr, ya know, if ya just want to talk, Nikki\'s here for ya.', 122118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? What is it?$B$BPardon my being short, but there were countless times I asked to be notified prior to us deciding to move the entire city. Now look at my shop... things are everywhere! Ildine and Vanessa will be busy for months!$B$BNow if you\'ll excuse me, I must finish these enchantments before we up and decide to move yet again!', '', 122117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', '', 122116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say the word and I shall reveal the enemy!', '', 122115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer well, $n. We will be ready when you have need of us.', 122114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the most dedicated of craftsman need a break from time to time. Pull up a sleeping fur and rest next to the safety of my hearth.', 122113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best get to Grommash Hold straightaway, $n.', '', 122112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This action costs 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana. Do you wish to continue?', 'This action costs 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana. Do you wish to continue?', 122111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Feed Leyweaver Ke\'lorin 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Feed Leyweaver Ke\'lorin 25 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:15|t Ancient Mana.>', 122110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something feels different here. The air is fine, but there\'s an odd feeling about.$B$BEvery since we arrived people have been acting strange. And I don\'t mean the dizzy heads still recovering from our trip, but more in the way people carry themselves and the occasional whispers floating about.', '', 122109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind... withering... need... help.', '', 122108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] And then a killer finale cinematic plays! [PH]', '[PH] And then a rad finale cinematic plays! [PH]', 122107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return when I can meet your price, Arluin.', 'I will return when I can meet your price, Arluin.', 122106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I make posts when I feel things.', '', 122105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The drogbar attacks have left my family with little to offer, but what we have is yours, hero.', 122104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, outsider.$b$bYour kind do not often find their way this high up the mountain, but you are welcome here all the same.', 122103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who shall be next to taste my blades?', '', 122102, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 11473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Oh, I didn\'t even know ye were there! Since when did all ye $cs get ta be so sneaky?$B$BNeedin\' ta know if we\'ll be leaving soon so I can ready my things.', '', 122100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, traveler. Join us.$b$bLet our hearth be your hearth.$b$bStay here. Join us.$b$bJoin us...', '', 122099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Demon Hunter? Disgusting! Your wings are so leathery and creepy.', 'A Demon Hunter? Ugh - your wings are so leathery and creepy.', 122098, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You weren\'t lying, Elias. The Demon Hunters are on the loose. Be careful - with those eyes, $n sees everything.', 122097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you again, $n. I trust that you are well?\n\n<Mathias looks around and then says the rest in hushed tones.>\n\nHow go the affairs of the Uncrowned? As head of SI:7, I cannot publicly support you.\n\nBut, until the war against the Burning Legion has come to an end, I pledge my full support, even if it has to be conducted in secret.\n\nUntil we meet again.', '', 122096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to recruit shieldmaidens.', 'I wish to recruit shieldmaidens.', 122095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to recruit Val\'kyr.', 'I wish to recruit Val\'kyr.', 122094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull up a resting stone, brul. Navarrogg says you allowed to rest here.', '', 122093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A demon hunter! Perfect, you\'re just what I need.', 122092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you one of them, $n? Or one of us? So much demonic energy...', '', 122091, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you can retain control of your... abilities... in this sacred place, \"Demon Hunter.\" We will be watching you.', 122090, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you done to yourself, $n? You\'re more demon than $r.', 122089, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<mutters>', '', 122088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A champion at making excuses, it would seem!', 122087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your champion, Dark Lady. It\'s my job to make you look good.', '', 122086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jace Darkweaver spoke the truth. You carry the Aldrachi Warblades, $n! With you at the head of our order, the Illidari will be unstoppable.', 'Jace Darkweaver spoke the truth. You carry the Aldrachi Warblades, $n! With you at the head of our order, the Illidari will be unstoppable.', 122085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve gotten far more kills than you, Nathanos. You\'re slipping!', 122084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I see you\'ve reclaimed the blades of Varedis Felsoul. Let us hope you have better control over the demon within you.', '$n! I see you\'ve reclaimed the blades of Varedis Felsoul. Let us hope you have better control over the demon within you.', 122083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Beacon often, the power of the Light is unending and will always be given.', '', 122082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard, $n. \n\nWe\'re all stocked and ready to ship out just as soon as you\'re ready.', '', 122081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your staff, like Velen\'s crystal, is a gift we bestow on those we try to save from destruction. So few remain, do not let it fall to the Void.', '', 122080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all its users, the draenei have wielded the Beacon the best. It is hoped the draenei survive where the others have not.', '', 122079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Beacon was silent for time, no aid did it ask for. It is good that you restored it.', '', 122078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother... Father...', '', 122077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have heard much of these two heroes. There is little doubt in my mind that their message is of the utmost importance.', 122076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arator is right. Turalyon and Alleria went to great lengths to send us this warning. Highlord, we look to you. What should we do?', '', 122075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would not have believed it if I hadn\'t seen it with my own eyes.', '', 122074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turalyon and Alleria... I cannot believe they\'ve been alive all these years...', 122073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light... what could it mean?', 122072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Say the word and I shall reveal the hidden menace!', 122071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is this cocoa butter so slippery? GET ME A TOWEL! Whoever bought the slippery cocoa butter is FIRED!', '', 122070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the shop, $n. Pardon the mess. We\'re in the process of cleaning up.$B$BThat last blink really did a number on us!', '', 122069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll have to excuse me. These bouts of dizziness catch me off guard every so often. They started shortly after our arrival.', 122068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All these papers. How did we e\'er keep track of \'em? Now they\'re just scattered all o\'er the place.$B$BIt\'ll take weeks fer me ta get \'em all sorted again!', 122067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I didn\'t see you there!$B$BWe\'ve been so busy cleaning up. Come and see us once we\'re back on our feet.', 122066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon the mess. We\'ve been cleaning up for a while now.$B$B<Peers around his shop>. Though it doesn\'t seem to help much. This place looks like a gust of wind blew right through here. And my goods are damaged. Who will want them now?$B$BThe next time we decide to move the city I\'ll be strapping everything down ahead of time.', '', 122065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Got nothing, $n. All shipments on hold until further notice.$B$BEntire place is ruined. Blinking a city... Who said that was a good idea? It will take weeks to get this place back on its feet.', '', 122064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be wise to refrain from make this inn your home for the time being. We may not be this exact location the next time you try to return.', 122063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh!', 122062, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know what is happening?', 'Do you know what is happening?', 122061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel it too? My skin is crawling...', 122060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugggh - that blade - what is that you carry? Disease and rot surround you, Death Knight!', 122059, 0, 0, 35, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That demonic blade you carry - it reeks of corruption, Death Knight. Finish your business here and take that blade far away from this sacred temple.', 122058, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An aura of disease and pestilence surround the blade you carry, Death Knight. Keep your distance from Senegos.', '', 122057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the rumors around Undercity are true - Frostmourne has been reforged! You watch yourself $n. Those blades may have a mind of their own.', 122056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this blasphemy, $n? How dare you reforge that cursed blade, the very sword that damned Lordaeron and its prince? I warned Arthas not to touch Frostmourne, and now I\'m warning you: cast those things into the sea before they damn us all.', '', 122055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that... the Maw of the Damned? Turning one of the Legion\'s weapons against their own, are we? I like the way you think, $n!', 122054, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoever did this is gonna pay! Mooks! Find them! FIND THEM!', '', 122053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute.. one of my keys is... SOMEBODY STOLE THE KEY TO MY SAFE!', '', 122052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew... it\'s gettin\' hot in here. I think it\'s time for a relaxing nap...', '', 122051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right! I\'m ready to bust some skulls!', '', 122050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mooks! Where\'s my cocoa butter?! What part of COCOA and BUTTER did you not get?!', '', 122049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I\'m going to hit the sauna for some R&R... so bring me a frozen cocktail and some cocoa butter!', '', 122048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That axe you carry... it is a Legion weapon. Are you certain you can control its hunger?', '', 122047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder text.', '', 122046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, up mooks! The pleasure palace is OFF LIMITS! I don\'t want ANYBODY setting foot on my property!', '', 122045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No text', '', 122044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you sneak into the sauna, you can grab the key while he isn\'t wearing it!', '', 122043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today is your lucky day, friend! Even as we speak, Gallywix is enjoying a relaxing stop in his personal sauna.', '', 122042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Legion.', '', 122041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those blades you carry... they are cursed. Please, do not bring the chill of death to this sacred place!', 122040, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth must not fall.', 122039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If he won\'t talk, just remind him that he owes me one for \'the you know what\' in \'the you know where\'... got it?', 122038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hit up Izak the bartender, he should know how to get the key to the safe.', 122037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Illidan knows the way.', 122036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every time we blink I have to spend days rearranging my collection. I wish there was an easier way to clean this mess up.', 122035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll have love-struck schlubs throwin\' their money at us in no time!', '', 122034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is going to be a heist of a lifetime!', '', 122033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are all that stands between the legion and annihilation.', 122032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, Death Knight. Do not defile this sacred place with that wicked axe you wield. I can feel its hunger from here.', 122031, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not yours... that scepter is not yours...', 122030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How dare you claim our beloved Queen\'s scepter as your own...', 122029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gunna pay for sneakin\' around!', '', 122028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That scepter belongs to our Queen...', 122027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gots an intruder!', '', 122026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not supposed to be here!', '', 122025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That scepter is not yours, shaman. Give it back!', 122024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sneakin\' around makes me so ANGRY!', '', 122023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gunna beat you to a pulp!', '', 122022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found you! Now you gunna die!', '', 122021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you is! Now you gunna get it!!', '', 122020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody is skulking around!', '', 122019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you there.. show yourself!', '', 122018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out where I can sees you! Coward!', '', 122017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody sneakin\' around nearby!', '', 122016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My liege! A stranger approaches, wielding a weapon that bears the mark of Queen Azshara herself.', 'My liege! A stranger approaches, wielding a weapon that bears the mark of Queen Azshara herself.', 122015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What dat noise?', '', 122014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody sneakin\' around here!', '', 122013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dat sneakin\' around?!', '', 122012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care.', '', 122011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 122010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye ask me, there\'s a foulness in the air. E\'er since we arrived here people \'ave been showin\' all kinds of odd behavior. And the Council... they\'ve been meeting quite often. Hopin\' all is well.', '', 122009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been awfully quiet since the move. Perhaps they\'re still feeling the effects. Moving all of Dalaran is no easy task!$B$BI do hope things return to normal soon.', 122008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madness beckons me beyond...', '', 122007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The abyss whispers your name.', '', 122006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It stirs, faceless, forgotten... deathless.', '', 122005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without hope, there can be no despair.', '', 122004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal! You cannot win...', '', 122003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will destroy... your soul!', '', 122002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dark beyond... awaits me.', '', 122001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for the master...', '', 122000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I cannot bend your mind, I will break your body.', '', 121999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you what happens to heroes.', '', 121998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humor me... scream for help!', '', 121997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop what is coming. Even in your dreams.', '', 121996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightmare consume you!', '', 121995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your torment will be endless!', '', 121994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send you to eternal sleep.', '', 121993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, $n. With all that\'s going on it looks like I won\'t be cutting hair for a while. Most of the other merchants have closed up their shops too.$B$B<Looks around to the other merchants.>$B$BWord on the street is there\'s something happening, and it ain\'t just around here. The cities themselves are full of... well, I don\'t know and I better not start talking too much. I wouldn\'t want to see anyone else on edge around here. We\'ve got enough of that as is.', 121992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Become prey to the darkness!', '', 121991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
