('My apologies, $n. We were ordered to hold our supplies until further notice.', 'My apologies, $n. We were ordered to hold our supplies until further notice.', 121876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
