('', 'We need to keep it contained at all costs!', 121818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think of us as smugglers. Instead, refer to us as professional salvors.\n\nWe are salvage experts. We specialize in flotsam, jetsam, lagan, derelicts, and, of course, exotic archaeological recovery.\n\nOh, and by the way, you might want to steer clear of the temple area to the south. I have my men investigating some salvage opportunities and I wouldn\'t want you to be confused for a competitor.\n\n<Mr. Shackle makes the sign of the Uncrowned, gives you the secret handshake, and then winks.>\n\nStay as long as you like, $g Mister:Miss; $n.', '', 121817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t a joke? B... But this is the heart of evil and darkness in the universe! Surely, you can\'t be serious!', '', 121816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spend 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana to gain Ward of the First Arcanist?', 'Spend 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana to gain Ward of the First Arcanist?', 121815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gain Ward of the First Arcanist for 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Gain Ward of the First Arcanist for 50 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', 121814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this a prank? Am I being pranked? Very funny, $g master:mistress;!', '', 121813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... $g master:mistress;...', '', 121812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_bannerpvp_01.blp:20|t You gain |cFFFF0000|Hspell:224811|h[For the Horde]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_bannerpvp_01.blp:20|t You gain |cFFFF0000|Hspell:224811|h[For the Horde]|h|r!', 121811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gaze of the Legion is upon you! Flee!', 'The Gaze of the Legion is upon you! Flee!', 121810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see now, human? This fate of this world is sealed. The legion cannot be stopped.', '', 121809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see, what can I order you to do today...', 'Let\'s see, what can I order you to do today...', 121808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I knew you needed more orders.', 'You know, I knew you needed more orders.', 121807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, I had been meaning to find you.', 'Good, I had been meaning to find you.', 121806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man are my arms getting tired.', 'Man are my arms getting tired.', 121805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a legend that some of our ancestors can be found on this world that are not part of the Legion. I bet they are boring.', 'There is a legend that some of our ancestors can be found on this world that are not part of the Legion. I bet they are boring.', 121804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know that on my world imps are tortured for fun? I was quite proficient at it myself.', 'Did you know that on my world imps are tortured for fun? I was quite proficient at it myself.', 121803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know this place is actually quite pleasant. We should go burn something.', 'You know this place is actually quite pleasant. We should go burn something.', 121802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this what you usually spend your free time on? Seems like a poor use of your time.', 'Is this what you usually spend your free time on? Seems like a poor use of your time.', 121801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t say I didn\'t warn ya!', '', 121800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m holding myself back... for now!', '', 121799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Stop that!', '', 121798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill you later... I mean, bye!', '', 121797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71102, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tactical retreat, eh?', '', 121796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71103, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buh-bye now!', '', 121795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71104, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have any excess priceless artifacts that were lost in time, I\'m making a collection.', '', 121794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71105, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all be my slaves! Er, I mean, hi!', '', 121793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71106, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When do we destroy the world? Soon? I hope it\'s soon.', '', 121792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to sleep. Forget everything.', '', 121791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My swarm will destroy you!', '', 121790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here- I found something.', '', 121789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arluin beckons you over.', '', 121788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well hello, my dear. I hope you don\'t mind. Kayn asked me to help bring some of your forces here.\n\nIt would seem that the Legion has quite the foothold on that island over there. He thought it best that we not let them take all of Azsuna.\n\nDon\'t worry, I\'m transporting the Illidari back and forth from the Fel Hammer as needs require. Your forces are ready to pick up and go wherever you need them at a moment\'s notice.', 121787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well hello, my dear. I hope you don\'t mind. Altruis asked me to help bring some of your forces here.\n\nIt would seem that the Legion has quite the foothold on that island over there. He thought it best that we not let them take all of Azsuna.\n\nDon\'t worry, I\'m transporting the Illidari back and forth from the Fel Hammer as needs require. Your forces are ready to pick up and go wherever you need them at a moment\'s notice.', 121786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They rounded us up like livestock. I do not know where they are sending us, but I know I do not want to go. Please...', 'They rounded us up like livestock. I do not know where they are sending us, but I know I do not want to go. Please...', 121785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them take me!', 'Don\'t let them take me!', 121784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to die, but they kill anyone who runs.', 'I don\'t want to die, but they kill anyone who runs.', 121783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who get on these boats never return... please don\'t let them take me.', 'Those who get on these boats never return... please don\'t let them take me.', 121782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... please help me...', 'Please... please help me...', 121781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I enjoy practicing a bit of statecraft. You might say I have a knack for it.', '', 121780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This action will remove 1200 Ancient Mana. Do you want to continue?', 'This action will remove 1200 Ancient Mana. Do you want to continue?', 121779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Offer: 1200x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 'Offer: 1200x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 121778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While your generosity did indeed satisfy before, I must insist.\n\nYou know how it is- the economy is constantly in flux, people are dying in the streets- it\'s only business.\n\nAs much mana as you can carry. That is my going rate.\n\n<Arluin smiles sweetly.>\n\nUnless of course you don\'t WANT my help.', '', 121777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, the Burning Legion is sending the most powerful demons in its arsenal against us. They do not intend to lose this third war and they will stop at nothing to see to it that we are all wiped from the face of Azeroth.\n\nTogether, we will return the favor.', 121776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, how goes the fight? Do you need supplies or anything repaired?', 121775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, $n. I was injured when I first came here to scout the Legion forces on Faronaar.\n\nIs there anything else that I can do for you?', '', 121774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for saving us over on Faronaar, $n.\n\nI can\'t believe that Cyana turned traitor. She betrayed us all. There are others who have also become Felsworn. We will hunt them down and kill them along with their new Legion masters.\n\nThis I swear!', 121773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need them focused on defeating the Legion, not fostering old hatreds.', '', 121772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your help over on Faronaar, $n. I am embarrassed that one of our own turned traitor and became one of the Felsworn for the Burning Legion.\n\nWe will make them pay.', 121771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you are leading your Illidari forces in their fight against the demons, I will figure out what our next move is here on Azsuna.\n\nWe must track down that Pillar of Creation. I know it is here somewhere.', '', 121770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get down there, $n. Your Illidari need our help to destroy the Burning Legion.\n\nOnce we\'ve done that, we can get to our business with the Pillar of Creation here on Azsuna.', '', 121769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are in your debt, $c, for aiding in the fight against the Legion.', '', 121768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$g Milord:Milady; $n. We are most grateful that you have come to lead us to victory against the Burning Legion.', '', 121767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n. With you here to lead us, the Legion on Faronaar will fall in short order.', 121766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c. I trust that you are here to aid the Illidari in destroying the Burning Legion?', 121765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, it is good that you are here. The matron mother has been providing our forces with transport from the Fel Hammer as we attempt to shore up our defenses here.\n\nThe Burning Legion have taken Faronaar across the isthmus. I have a plan to contain and crush them before they overrun all of Azsuna.\n\nI could use your help in leading the Illidari to victory.', '', 121764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something fixed?', '', 121763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, champions.', 121762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 11498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s right. I feel nothing... I am... nothing.', 121761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 11497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is finished. You are beaten.', 121760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 11496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My long hunt is finally over. Today, justice will be done!', 121759, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 11492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their fury pales before mine, Illidan. We have some unsettled business between us.', 121758, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 11491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 121757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your work will help create a whole new generation of astrologers!', '', 121756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Study your hardest, and someday you\'ll surpass even myself!', '', 121755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like your studies are coming along nicely. Keep up the good work.', '', 121754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
