('By Elune\'s grace, I can go on. My thanks, Archdruid.', 'By Elune\'s grace, I can go on. My thanks, Archdruid.', 121722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
