('I am rejuvenated. Thank you.', 'I am rejuvenated. Thank you.', 121719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune bless you.', 'Elune bless you.', 121718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $ct.$b$bThis chamber will house a record of your achievements. As you collect various shamanic armor sets and weapon appearances, they will be displayed here.$b$bWe are all counting on you, $ct!', '', 121717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness is leaving my mind! I... I\'m whole again! Thank you, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse... it\'s... gone! Thank you, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind is free again! I\'m in your debt, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is... is this real? I\'m in control of myself again! Bless you, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121713, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merciful Elune, the rage is gone! Thank you, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121712, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nahlen\'do, if you encounter more of my people I beg you, release them from their rage as you did for me.', '', 121711, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s our chance! Run away!', '', 121710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee! We\'re saved!', '', 121709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run while you still can!', '', 121708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes.', '', 121707, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 71043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do anything... just let me go!', '', 121706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m innocent! I supported the Grand Magistrix!', '', 121705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... somebody stop this madness.', '', 121704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find out who resists the Legion in Suramar. Confess, and I will kill you before you lose your mind.', '', 121703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sooner you turn over your allies... the sooner your pain will cease.', '', 121702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Ya know, mon, I be thinkin\' ya need a change of scenery. Should visit Westfall if ya into browns.', '', 121701, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Ya see them trees over there? They be sayin\' them trees too dark, mon. Dark be bad, they say.', '', 121700, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Ya know, mon, dey say this place be mighty brown. I know many places greenah\' than this.', '', 121699, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. They say dem waterfalls be too busy, mon. Ya can\'t tell where dey be comin\' from or goin\' to.', '', 121697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis ol\' bull be mired in his ol\' ways. He be too happy about it. I aim ta\' fix that, mon.$b$bDer be some harsh truths about dis world. Harsh truths that be wipin\' the smile off one\'s face like a slap from one\'s mama.', '', 121696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot remember what happened after except that I and a few others of my kind awoke and together we traveled as a pack through the Emerald Dream. After some time we arrived in this land and each went our separate ways.', '', 121695, 0, 0, 378, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember when the world was simpler. Where one could be a hero just by driving kobolds away from their home.$b$bAnd I remember a time when respect was shown to one\'s elders, a time before this troll outsider and his youthful... trolling.', '', 121694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a feral druid your main weapon is shapeshifting. In Cat Form, your claws and fangs rip and bleed your opponents.', 121693, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hand slipped! Forgive me!', '', 121692, 0, 43663, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This shipment is worth more than you are! How dare you treat it so carelessly!', '', 121691, 0, 43663, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The veil is lifted from my eyes, heroes. The shadows retreat, and the Dream beckons.', '', 121690, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 71040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archimonde, you will not be allowed further! The very soul of Azeroth rises against you!', '', 121689, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 71039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the citizens will not obey, we will rule by strength and fear. The resistance to the Grand Magistrix is coming to an end!', 121688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are traitors to the Grand Magistrix hiding right under our noses. We will find them, and we will end this resistance!', 121687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your quick action has saved many lives. We are in your debt.', '', 121686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a target for you. Act quickly. This is a serious threat to our resistance.', '', 121685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hands! My legs! I\'m... I\'m whole again! Wait... is that the Scythe of Elune? Thank you for releasing me, Nahlen\'do!', '', 121683, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind is still hazy but I remember combat... ah yes... we were battling the satyr when the rage overtook me.', '', 121682, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rage... it no longer claims me! Praise Elune that you found me master of the fang, or as we in the pack say, Nahlen\'do.', '', 121681, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I\'m myself again!! Thank you, Nahlen\'do! May the rage never claim you.', '', 121680, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo-ho! Yo-ho-ho! I likes t\' drink me rum!', '', 121679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SI:7 be sailin\' wit\' th\' Red Blade? \'tis be not jolly news...', '', 121678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got what we be needin\' here. Ye be off to Dalaran, I\'ll catch up!', '', 121677, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 71016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I\'ll only ask ye one more the hour... who sent ye?', '', 121676, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 71015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tethys \'o th\' Blood Sail Buccaneers!', '', 121675, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 71014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, this letter be writ\' in no ordinary code. This here code be t\' work o\' a true master!', '', 121674, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 71044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These be not th\' Red Blade\'s waters... who sent ye, laddie?', '', 121673, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 71013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye get th\' spiced rum... \'n I\'ll find us some scallywags!', '', 121672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Them ships belong to th\' Red Blade! Thar be no doubt \'bout it...', '', 121671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be off on ahead \'n search fer clues. I\'ll wait fer ye thar!', '', 121670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be knowin\' Citrine Bay. I be knowin\' it well.', '', 121669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will deal with these mongrels! Strike now, friends! Strike at the Betrayer!', '', 121668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 11390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, my minions. Deal with this traitor as he deserves!', '', 121667, 0, 0, 406, 64, 0, 11465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did I die to that?!', 'How did I die to that?! I was NOWHERE near it!', 121665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was not prepared.', 'I was not prepared.', 121664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t have a soulstone?!', 'I didn\'t have a soulstone?!', 121663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there any more rezzes?', 'Are there any more rezzes?', 121662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rebirth, please.', 'Rebirth, please.', 121661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resurrection, please!', 'Resurrection, please!', 121660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch.', 'Ouch.', 121659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
