('<Gain Leyline Mastery for 70 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Gain Leyline Mastery for 70 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', 121644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gain Leyline Mastery for 80 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Gain Leyline Mastery for 80 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', 121643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people are owed nothing. I challenge you to combat!', 'Your people are owed nothing. I challenge you to combat!', 121638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is... you... I saw you in my slumber, pursued by shadows. I have awoken, only to find those shadows reaching into our world.', 121637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have cleared the Dreamway of the Nightmare, but it now infests my precious vale with its corruption.', '', 121636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwah-hah hah HAH! By the look on your face, the only element you\'ve mastered is the element of SURPRISE. Hah!', 'Bwah-hah hah HAH! By the look on your face, the only element you\'ve mastered is the element of SURPRISE. Hah!', 121635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest whispered of your arrival, $c. It speaks of one who would become a champion of nature, a kindred spirit to these woods.$b$bThere are some who do not show the proper reverence for our sacred grove. You, however, guide their path.', '', 121634, 0, 35351, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, \"$ct,\" the Grimtotem are here. Or are Grimtotem shaman not welcome in your little club? Leave me be!', 'Yes, \"$ct,\" the Grimtotem are here. Or are Grimtotem shaman not welcome in your little club? Leave me be!', 121633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough... I yield...', 'Enough... I yield...', 121632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Don\'t make me laugh. HAH HAH. Too late. I\'m laughing now. I\'m laughing at your sorry little knitting circle.', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Don\'t make me laugh. HAH HAH. Too late. I\'m laughing now. I\'m laughing at your sorry little knitting circle.', 121631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Ridiculous! More like a \"Hoop of Fools.\" Hah.', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Ridiculous! More like a \"Hoop of Fools.\" Hah.', 121630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will your Earthen Ring do after they watch me defeat their precious $ct? Maybe they\'ll give that weapon of yours to Magatha. Hah hah!', 'What will your Earthen Ring do after they watch me defeat their precious $ct? Maybe they\'ll give that weapon of yours to Magatha. Hah hah!', 121629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" As if. More like a... \"Dirty Disk.\" Like a... mudpie. Like a - I don\'t know. You guys are terrible.', '\"Earthen Ring.\" As if. More like a... \"Dirty Disk.\" Like a... mudpie. Like a - I don\'t know. You guys are terrible.', 121628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Pfft! You guys put the \"Sham\" in \"Shaman.\"', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Pfft! You guys put the \"Sham\" in \"Shaman.\"', 121627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Pah. Ought to be called... the \"Grimy Crescent.\" Or something.', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Pah. Ought to be called... the \"Grimy Crescent.\" Or something.', 121626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Hah! More like a... \"Loop of Filth.\"', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Hah! More like a... \"Loop of Filth.\"', 121625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Earthen Ring.\" Bah. More like the \"Dirt Circle.\"', '\"Earthen Ring.\" Bah. More like the \"Dirt Circle.\"', 121624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge accepted, \"$ct.\"', 'Challenge accepted, \"$ct.\"', 121623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You. The one they call $ct. So this \"Earthen Ring\" answers to you now, is that right?$b$bWell, we are the Grimtotem! My tribe has been speaking to the elements for a hundred generations. By what right do you claim this sacred space as your own?$b$bThe resources you hoard here are ours as much as anyone\'s. By orders of Elder Crone Magatha, I am taking our share!', 'You. The one they call $ct. So this \"Earthen Ring\" answers to you now, is that right?$b$bWell, we are the Grimtotem! My tribe has been speaking to the elements for a hundred generations. By what right do you claim this sacred space as your own?$b$bThe resources you hoard here are ours as much as anyone\'s. By orders of Elder Crone Magatha, I am taking our share!', 121622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough... enough...', 'Enough... enough...', 121621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been to the Dreamgrove? Have you set eyes on Mylune? She graces my dreams.', '', 121620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save your hollow threats, $c. I am defeated and have nothing more for your pathetic \"order.\"', 'Save your hollow threats, $c. I am defeated and have nothing more for your pathetic \"order.\"', 121619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s say... 800 of that Ancient Mana substance I\'ve been hearing so much about.', '', 121618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am always open to a productive working relationship.', '', 121617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open for business.', '', 121616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes and ears are open. I can speak on what I know... for a price.', '', 121615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Arluin nods to you.>', '', 121614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spend 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana to gain Warpwalking?', 'Spend 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana to gain Warpwalking?', 121613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again, I ask you to take the withered into Falanaar. Teach them to fight, and to search for relics that can aid our cause.', 121612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are nearly there now, outlander. Oculeth should be waiting for you on the other side of this chamber.', 121611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... But nobody came.', '... But nobody came.', 121610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave us alone!  Ahhhhh!', 'Leave us alone!  Ahhhhh!', 121609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Random? Do you not find it striking that each body found is decorated with a dawn lily? The same flower adored by Thalyssra?', 121608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70998, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gain Warpwalking for 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', '<Gain Warpwalking for 10 |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t Ancient Mana.>', 121607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
