('I\'m here to ensure the Warchief\'s protection. Draw your weapon against her and you\'ll be dead before the first drop of your blood hits the ground.$b$bAs for anything else... it doesn\'t concern you. Understood?', '', 121475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
