('Do you know why Nathanos looks... different?', 'Do you know why Nathanos looks... different?', 121465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do I look like I want to die? Again, I mean?$b$bIf you\'re curious about the Blightcaller\'s visage, you can ask him yourself. Or the Dark Lady, for that matter. They\'re ever so fond of small talk.$b$b<The dark ranger smirks as she resumes her watch.>', 121464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
