('Yer sword arm looks soft, $ct.', '', 121447, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother, I come...', '', 121446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Find Romuul. Tell him to begin repairs on the vessel. We are going home.', '', 121445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grand Artificer Romuul yet lives, sir!', 121444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Receive Drek\'Thar\'s blessing.>', '<Receive Drek\'Thar\'s blessing.>', 121443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The blind shaman hears your footfalls as you approach. He reaches up to touch your face.>\n\nAh, $ct. I recognize your confident stride. <Cough>. The spirits walk in step with you, united in purpose.\n\nAges have passed since I first heard the call of the elements on Draenor. Did you go back? I heard there were some that went back... somehow... <Wheeze>. I could not bear to see my old home as it was. Before the darkness. The war.\n\nYes, but you did not come to me to hear the ramblings of an old orc. You do not judge me as the others do. My age... <Cough> this chair... I am not the frail thing the others see. My power is all around me, amongst the stones and the wind.', '', 121442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The blind shaman hears your footfalls as you approach. He reaches up to touch your face.>\n\nAlliance. Hmmm... $r, yes. <Cough> Perhaps we once met on the field of battle.\n\nI heard the call of the elements long, long ago. Another place. Another time. <Cough> I can see the spirits shining within you... I sense the very wind and waves bending to your will. Powerful, yes. Your Alliance must be very proud to have you.\n\nThese are the dark times, $r. But your strength gives this old orc hope. Perhaps I can return the favor... <Cough>... if you are not too proud to accept the aid of a former foe...', '', 121441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The blind shaman hears your footfalls as you approach. He does not turn to face you.>\nYou are not a shaman. Tread lightly here, $c, for the very stones themselves watch your every move.', '', 121440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light speed you, $ct.', 121439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see before me a mighty beast! What do you ask of me, $Gbrother:sister;?', '', 121438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the shadows, we are connected to those unseen.', 121437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear your call, druid. What do you seek?', 121436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a nurturing spirit within you, kind one.', 121435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t know what hit you!', '', 121434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naw, Wintron can handle it.\n\nThank you though!\n\nIt was a pleasure meeting you.', '', 121433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need any help?', 'Need any help?', 121432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another weakling come to party!', '', 121431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blades will be your end.', '', 121430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not underestimate me!', '', 121429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the High Priest!', 121428, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the High Priest!', 121427, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Wintron!  \n\nIt seemed a bit tedious to walk around trying to find bugs one by one, so I made him to find them for me.  \n\nGood little guy.  Snorts a lot, but that\'s fine with me.', '', 121426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And who\'s this little fellow?', 'And who\'s this little fellow?', 121425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city has a bug problem.  They\'re everywhere!  \n\nI\'m an engineer.  An automation engineer to be exact.  And I\'m trying to help out a bit.', '', 121424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you up to?', 'What are you up to?', 121423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.  Nice to meet you.', '', 121422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sear justice into the minds of those who would endanger Suramar.', '', 121421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn bright, and hit the enemy where they least expect.', '', 121420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am rekindled. You are most generous. I spare for you a bit of my magic, to bolster your abilities in combat.', '', 121419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. The Highlord says you are to be welcomed as a guest, so long as you don\'t cause trouble.', 'Greetings, $c. The Highlord says you are to be welcomed as a guest, so long as you don\'t cause trouble.', 121418, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May this be the edge you need to bring justice to Suramar.', 121417, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be swift where our enemies are slow. And... thank you. You spared my mind an ugly fate.', 121416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... that was close. Let me spare a bit of my magic for you, as a gesture of thanks.', 121415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fault? I said \"eye\" not \"I\" you blind git!', '', 121414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all your fault...', '', 121413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The raven expresses its displeasure at your presence.', '', 121412, 0, 7269, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Havi\'s companion doesn\'t seem to like you for some reason.', '', 121411, 0, 7269, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s left us no choice, Velen! If we don\'t destroy the machine this place and every living soul inside will be annihilated!', 'He\'s left us no choice, Velen! If we don\'t destroy the machine this place and every living soul inside will be annihilated!', 121410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you will not spare him then I must stop you!', '', 121409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes we mustn\'t kill Rakeesh! Stop! Please!', '', 121407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT CANNOT BE!', '', 121406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, this is all wrong. I... I have been here before, but that would mean...', '', 121405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! That thing was so bossy.', '', 121404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The raven caws at you in disapproval.', '', 121403, 0, 7269, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for House Stelleris...', '', 121402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Stelleris does not answer to lowborn scum like you.', '', 121401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corvyn... he does our dirty work. You\'ll find him down near the docks.', 'Corvyn... he does our dirty work. You\'ll find him down near the docks.', 121400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield! I\'ll tell you anything!', 'I yield! I\'ll tell you anything!', 121399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to upgrade my gear.', 'I\'d like to upgrade my gear.', 121398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open for eyes in here. Inquisitors love their eyes.', '', 121397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lowborn scum! I will never talk!', 'Lowborn scum! I will never talk!', 121396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will get nothing from me!', 'You will get nothing from me!', 121395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will die before I talk!', 'I will die before I talk!', 121394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine will be the last face you see!', '', 121393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal will take you to the Exodar. Good luck, $ct.', '', 121392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! You made the voices stop.', '', 121391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Shannon is reading intently.>', 121390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Volpin leaps with joy>', '', 121389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Volpin quivers with fear>', '', 121388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, I\'m going to get back to reading.  Nice to have met you!', 121387, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I learned this one from one of the magic tomes... took a few tries to get it right.', 121386, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Sure!', 'Sure!', 121385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah!  Never.  Not with all these things to read!\n\nAnd I write too.  And make things with my imagination.  Want to see?', 121384, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely it gets a bit boring down here after a while?', 'Surely it gets a bit boring down here after a while?', 121383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I organize the books!  I love it.  \n\nIf I could take them all down and put them back up every day, I would. \n\nBut they got kind of annoyed the last few times.', 121382, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you a member of the Kirin Tor?  What do you do here?', 'Are you a member of the Kirin Tor?  What do you do here?', 121381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello!\n\nYes!  Quite.', 121380, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good book?', 'Good book?', 121379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Shannon puts her book away as you approach.>', 121378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Horsemen, give me your strength. On this day, the Ashbringer will know our power once more!', '', 121377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s right. We must try. The Ashbringer is no longer our enemy.', '', 121376, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do, and we will - with your help. You owe us, Darion.', '', 121375, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare bring that here? You can\'t possibly hope to...', '', 121374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought it only myth...', '', 121373, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Deathlord...', 121372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them, Highlord.', '', 121371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. We can decide what to do with them after we hear their reason for daring to tread here.', '', 121370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have honor. Let them speak their piece.', '', 121369, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They do not belong. Guards! Remove -', 121368, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not the only Highlord here, paladin. What business have you with the Four Horsemen?', '', 121367, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knights of the Ebon Blade, $p, the Ashbringer, Highlord of the Silver Hand, demands audience with your horsemen.', '', 121366, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should stick together, just in case.', '', 121365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get moving.', 'Let\'s get moving.', 121364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should not stay here a moment longer than is necessary.\n\nOur safety here is tenuous at best.', '', 121363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you are ready, but do not tarry.', '', 121362, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold it, hun! That\'s a deadly drop through that portal! Don\'t go unprepared.', 121361, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THERE WILL BE AN IN-GAME CINEMATIC HERE!', '', 121360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Hurry back to Dalaran and meet me in the Chamber of the Guardian. Safe return, $ct.', '', 121359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LANDBORN FILTH! THIEVES! I WILL LEAVE YOU AS A SMUDGE IN MY LAIR!', '', 121358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is! The giant is holding it! There\'s only one way to separate a giant from its treasure. You know what to do, $n.', '', 121357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to fly to Acherus at once.', 'I need to fly to Acherus at once.', 121356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon gets one, too!', '', 121355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should give me something to work with.', '', 121354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an awesome mage indeed!', '', 121353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, could that be? YES! That\'s it!', '', 121352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to aid us with Talonclaw?', 'Have you come to aid us with Talonclaw?', 121351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, wielder of Talonclaw.', 'Greetings, wielder of Talonclaw.', 121350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will nod in agreement now. Maybe you leave me alone.', '', 121349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good at protecting one\'s head. Cannot hear very much though.', '', 121348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot hear you with this helm.', '', 121347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', '', 121346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 121345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight like every battle is the last.', '', 121344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never retreat!', '', 121343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your sword arm strong!', '', 121342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say what you have to say!', '', 121341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to fight!', '', 121340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out with it already!', '', 121339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe you keep those to yourself from now on.', 121338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve really, REALLY had enough of that demon!', '', 121337, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would be a shame if something happened to them.', 121336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have nice hands.', 121335, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do I scare you?', 121334, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem nervous.', 121333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until the final battle!', 121332, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no fear in our hearts!', 121331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your blades sharp!', 121330, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spit it out!', 121329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am ready for whatever comes.', 121328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you need?', 121327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I greet you, wielder of Talonclaw.', '', 121326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay frosty!', '', 121325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snow big deal.', '', 121324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s cold.', '', 121323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me have to put you on ice, small friend!', '', 121322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cool it!', '', 121321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you one but don\'t push it!', '', 121320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HODIR!', '', 121319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Hodir!', '', 121318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay vigilant!', '', 121317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell!', '', 121316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the winds of the north be at your back.', '', 121315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need?', '', 121314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, friend.', '', 121313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something?', '', 121312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suit yourself.', '', 121311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am very close to stuffing the rainbow bridge somewhere... painful.', '', 121310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, really.', '', 121309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you ever give up?', '', 121308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m starting to question Odyn\'s choice.', '', 121307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, on the other hand...', '', 121306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hymdall sees all... knows all!', '', 121305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you only understood the implications of your actions...', '', 121304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is eternal.', '', 121303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve Skyhold.', '', 121302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am vigilant.', '', 121301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, mortal.', '', 121300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This changes nothing, mage! Your defenses will crumble and your world will burn!', '', 121299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
