('Why did you poke me?', '', 121161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have all eternity to wreak my revenge.', '', 121160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day your control over me slips is the day you die.', '', 121159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
