('Light\'s Heart will guide you.', '', 120689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must find Mother Moon\'s blessed child. Your journey begins with his.', '', 120688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s Heart is a second chance at a destiny unfulfilled.', '', 120687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let not the sacrifices we have made here today be in vain. Listen well as soon the darkness will take me.', '', 120686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your child was made a force of darkness by the Deceiver. He lived and died ignorant of the truth - of any truth.', '', 120685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did not ask for this burden, Prophet, but it is what fate has deemed.', '', 120684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search for the budding trees, but watch out for the hungry fish!', '', 120683, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cyrille places a Dusk Lily atop Overseer Durant\'s corpse.', 120682, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorim doesn\'t have much time. Speak to Aerilya at once to go to Ulduar\'s aid!', '', 120681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ulduar\'s under attack. Send me and any forces that are ready to their aid!', 'Ulduar\'s under attack. Send me and any forces that are ready to their aid!', 120680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the Rift of Aln!', 'Send me to the Rift of Aln!', 120679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, I will send you into the Rift of Aln to face Xavius.', '', 120678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrgl mrg!', '', 120677, 179, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a great example to follow.', 'You are a great example to follow.', 120676, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With that, you might save us all.', 'With that, you might save us all.', 120675, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s Wrath, I thought it lost...', 'Light\'s Wrath, I thought it lost...', 120674, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will try to follow your ways.', 'I will try to follow your ways.', 120673, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, be careful of that staff...', 'Please, be careful of that staff...', 120672, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the Grand Magistrix, you are hereby charged with sedition. You undermine my authority and must pay the price.', '', 120671, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THAT is how you honor a fallen warrior! But I think you\'ve had enough revelry for one day.', '', 120669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Jarl has fallen in glorious battle! Today we shall honor his passing. Go forth, champion, and join in the revelry! Just... try not to let it kill you in the process.', '', 120668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_blink.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:111771|h[Blink]|h|r to bypass the Void Barrier.', 'Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonicportal_green.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:111771|h[Demonic Portal]|h|r to get past Ariden\'s barrier!', 120667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to begin the juicing demonstration?', 120666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have I told you about my grandchildren, Alexis, Kelsey, and Cara? Such bright girls!$B$BI haven\'t seen them since before... <Peggy pauses, then smiles peacefully.>$B$BWell, I miss them and hope they are doing well.', 120665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why hello, a visitor! Thank you for coming by to see me.', 120664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those artifacts would have caused grave harm in the hands of those greedy fiends. You did well to retrieve them.', '', 120663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreyrgrot is infested with pirate... vampires... pira-vamp... vampirates? GRAH! Just go slay them. The fools are plundering relics we buried for a reason. Such cursed artifacts were never meant to be unearthed.', '', 120662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorim, what is the source of your power?', 'Thorim, what is the source of your power?', 120661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infusing...', 'Infusing...', 120660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Your combat skills are impressive, as advertised. And this trade prince knows how to advertise!', '', 120659, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Way to go! You\'ve made your trade prince very proud. Just wipe your boots before coming near my palace!', '', 120658, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved the day! Nice work! I\'ll be sending you a small bill for the damages, though.', '', 120657, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the leader down! Bring me its head... and its coin purse. The latter being my preference!', '', 120656, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one wants to be the big boss! Sorry, bub, the position\'s been filled... BY ME!', '', 120655, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeesh! Ugliest demon so far! Fight in the name of your handsome trade prince!', '', 120654, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want these demons cleared out by suppertime. I can\'t afford to miss a meal!', '', 120653, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let up now! You\'ve got an obligation to defend my assets!', '', 120652, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s more work to be done! Don\'t let me catch you napping!', '', 120651, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re expanding operations! Hey, I\'m the only one who\'s supposed to do that!', '', 120650, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons are making themselves at home... in MY home! Spread out and stop them!', '', 120649, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re spreading out! Unpaid overtime is hereby authorized... find them!', '', 120648, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This demon\'s trying to muscle in on MY territory. Put a stop to it!', '', 120647, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them there\'s only room for one boss in Azshara... me!', '', 120646, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to a decision yet, $ct?$b$bI would give you guidance, but in this, you must look within.', 120645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring this one down quick! He\'s wreaking havoc on property values!', '', 120644, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it just me, or are they getting angrier and... redder?', '', 120643, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re pouring it on! Show them we\'re no slouches!', '', 120642, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bunch looks... bigger. But that\'s no excuse to slack off!', '', 120641, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like the sound of that! Stand tall... even if you\'re short!', '', 120640, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! Time to prove your worth!', '', 120639, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you heroes brought enough ammunition!', '', 120638, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like some kafa to get you started in the morning, or an icy Highmountain Refresher after a long day on the battlefield. I like Spiced Tea as a nightcap, myself. Have you tried the honey croissants? Deee-licious!$B$BAt least that\'s what I say. But you know... I\'m not really here for the coffee.', '', 120637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was with the aid of the tauren that my flesh was made wood, my skin made into leaves, and my wisdom made eternal. I shall always remember this, even if my own people do not.', '', 120636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh.> Politics as usual. Perhaps after we have liberated Suramar, my opponents will realize they were on the wrong side of history.', 120635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Masked thugs have been harassing my supporters. I know those beasts of House Stelleris are behind it!', 120634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrydshal has taken prisoners during a recent raid on Highmountain. I would ask that you free them for me. I owe a great debt to the ancestors of those who were taken and would see that debt paid.', '', 120633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems my fears were well-founded! The dreadlord is already inside. We must hurry!', '', 120632, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 69708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that Kathra\'natir knows its location, I fear the worst.', '', 120631, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe so, I would have remembered such a well-dressed, young and spry mage.', '', 120630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say, you do look rather familiar...', '', 120629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have we met before?', '', 120628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is that oddly handsome fellow?', '', 120627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was secreted to the Violet Hold. Not only was this the most secure location in Dalaran, it was a place few would think to look.', '', 120626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Legion learned of the forge\'s existence, the Council knew it had to be hidden somewhere safe.', '', 120625, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In ages past, the Forge of the Guardian was a source of great power for the Council of Tirisfal.', '', 120624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make haste to the Violet Hold. I will explain along the way.', '', 120623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much to do... so little time!', '', 120622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got a good sense about you, druid. Your spirit burns bright. You won\'t lead us wrong.', 120621, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 69653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my honor to join you, Grandmaster. My master would be proud.', 120620, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 69651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is everywhere. I welcome it, whether in glory or death.', '', 120619, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 69645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents would be proud of all that we have achieved. I will fight on for them, Highlord.', '', 120618, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 69644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not let you down, Highlord.', 120617, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 69643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The Light will guide my hand, Highlord.', 120616, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 69655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fearless is my charge, Highlord! For the Order!', 120615, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 69642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the Silver Hand, Highlord.', '', 120614, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 70172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do relish a good fight.', 120613, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 69641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong with the prophet?', 'What\'s wrong with the prophet?', 120612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did Romuul survive?', '', 120610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmph. We will have to see, then.', 120609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have seen first hand what Arcan\'dor\'s energies do for the Withered. I have faith that it is worth the risk.', 120608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me you are not seriously considering sending our friend on such a mission. That is suicide.', 120607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did not ask for this burden, Prophet. It is what fate has deemed.', '', 120606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNUSED DO NOT LOCALIZE', '', 120605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have given you all that I am, and have asked for nothing! Grant me this mercy!', '', 120604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has taken everything from me. From us.', '', 120603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, finally, as I hold you in my arms, I understand.', '', 120602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I buried that vision after Kil\'jaeden took my family from me, and for eons let it be lost in the darkest recesses of my being.', '', 120601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like yours...', '', 120600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In that vision I saw myself weeping as I held a dying eredar in my arms. His skin fel-pocked and battle-scarred.', '', 120599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In a time that is now just a whisper of a memory, I had a son. On the day of his birth, a vision came to me.', '', 120598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I did... And until this moment I did not understand.', '', 120597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked me if I foresaw this day, child.', '', 120596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day I may come for you.', 120595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die well.', 120594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will meet again soon.', 120593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dwell in the Shadowlands.', 120592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I serve a greater power.', 120591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death cannot stop me.', 120590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shield is strong.', 120589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you in battle.', 120588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be on your way, then.', 120587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shall live... this time.', 120586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it?', 120585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not tempt my spear!', 120584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shield is strong.', 120583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmph.', '', 120582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', '', 120581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off with you!', '', 120580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want?', '', 120579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not fight... today.', '', 120578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?!', '', 120577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to your enemies!', '', 120576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your battles end in victory.', '', 120575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until the next battle.', '', 120574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, champion.', '', 120573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to Odyn!', '', 120572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Valarjar!', '', 120571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My favorite Hearthstone card? It\'s got to be lightning bolt!', '', 120570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My plants are coming in nicely this year. The key is clippings from a much more primordial strain of the lotus, the alpha if you will. Quite a prized possession, that.', '', 120569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The undead would be much less of a hassle, if only they were more mortal.', '', 120568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Magical accidents happen all the time...', 120567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t test my patience.', 120566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it up and I\'ll show you my sword skills.', 120565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it?', 120564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', 120563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell. Let me know if you come across anything interesting!', 120562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your eyes open, friend.', 120561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Knowledge is power.', 120560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you have somewhere else to be?', '', 120559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must have better things to do.', '', 120558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose persistence is a good thing.', '', 120557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting a headache.', '', 120556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 120555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again!', '', 120554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know if you need my help with anything.', '', 120553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care, friend.', '', 120552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a great day to practice magic!', '', 120551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you as excited as I am to be here?', '', 120550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you!', '', 120549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I mastered a new spell today!', '', 120548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, friend.', '', 120547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not again! These demons have no respect for private property! Let\'s teach them a lesson!', '', 120546, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your toes, people! You have a sacred duty to protect the investments of your trade prince!', '', 120545, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got company! Keep track of everything the demons break... I\'m sending them a bill!', '', 120544, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sparkle and shine and fizzle away!', '', 120543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wubba lubba dub dub!', '', 120542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ants! Ants ants ants ants ants ants!', '', 120541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A merry midsummer to all!', '', 120540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sparkles, fizzles, whizzbangs ahoy!', '', 120539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? Whose body is this?', '', 120538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stopped clock is always right, when you use magic!', '', 120537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inhabitants of Sentinel Hill have been inspired to join the fight against the Legion!', '', 120536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tadpoles! Tadpoles is the winner!', '', 120535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
