('', 'Excellent. We will be training in the collapsed tunnels of Fal\'anar.$b$bHow many withered will you be bringing with you?', 120521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve come to help the withered with their combat training.', 'I\'ve come to help the withered with their combat training.', 120520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everywhere the Grand Magistrix\'s forces encroach, we will push back!', '', 120519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guards trample my people every day, with demons at their backs. Show them that we are capable of fighting back!', '', 120518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe this! Two more heading for the Hill! One to the south and another back at the north gate!', '', 120517, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huge demon headed straight for the north wall! Don\'t let it breach the gates!', '', 120516, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we must fight, I hope that it can continue to be at your side.', '', 120515, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think Hemet himself could have taught me better. I\'m happy to hunt with you anytime!', 120514, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve made a friend of Baron, and in that, you\'ve also made a friend of me.', '', 120513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are leading the order in its efforts to help those in need, then I offer myself to aid in any way I can.', 120512, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a natural instinct for survival, one that will only be strengthened in troubled times like these.', '', 120511, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the past I have guided my husband Go\'el along the path of the shaman. But for his next trial, he walks alone. What of you? What is your path?$b$bWill you be a force of nature, laying waste to our foes? A font of wisdom, discerning and fulfilling the will of the spirits? A healer, soothing the troubled and lifting up the meek? I tell you the truth, $n:$b$bA true shaman must be all of these things.', 120510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our will is yours to command.', 120509, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do whatever is needed to defend Dreadscar Rift from the Burning Legion.', 120508, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we will destroy the Burning Legion!', 120507, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will fight and win many more battles under your leadership, High Priest.', '', 120506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still remember the way to the Light\'s Hope Chapel. I will meet you there.', 120505, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 69635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no! I am KING YMIRON! I am NOT a servant!', '', 120504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt. The winds of the north are at your service.', '', 120503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will unleash the wrath of thunder upon our enemies!', '', 120502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mean we get to work by your side to smash the fiends that attacked Ulduar? Count me in!', '', 120501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I choose to believe that fate has brought us together.', '', 120500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dagg find da big treasure dis time!', '', 120499, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To live again and to fight! The glory of battle awaits!', '', 120498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... our orders...', '', 120497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not wise to question Odyn. He says you lead then you lead!', '', 120496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic writes your name in a little heart.', '', 120495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic steals a strand of your hair.', '', 120494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic claps.', '', 120493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic cheers for you!', '', 120492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic scoots a little closer to you.', '', 120491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Fanatic admires you.', '', 120490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here now to prepare a place for you amidst the ruin of tomorrow.', '', 120489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast writes your name in a little heart.', '', 120488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my master\'s house smolder the burning husks of a thousand worlds. I am here now to prepare a place for you amidst the ruin of tomorrow.', '', 120486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast steals a strand of your hair.', '', 120485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast claps.', '', 120484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast cheers for you!', '', 120483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast scoots a little closer to you.', '', 120482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Enthusiast admires you.', '', 120480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies will tremble!', 120479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My tribe is gone, $n. Those who survived the Cataclysm sought refuge in Thunder Bluff. Some of our braves were killed during the Siege of Orgrimmar. Of those that were left, none returned from the Broken Shore.$b$bThe Earthen Ring is my family now, $ct. I promise you, I will fight to the end.$b$bHow can I help you today?', 120478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will serve with honor.', '', 120477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, yeah, for the Horde!', '', 120476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, yeah, for the Alliance!', '', 120475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, let\'s rumble!', '', 120474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Highlord! I am ready.', 120472, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 69650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please take as much time as you need, Highlord. My resolve will not waver.', 120471, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 69649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the High Priest!', 120470, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the High Priest!', '', 120469, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, I must think on it further.', 'I\'m sorry, I must think on it further.', 120468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I welcome all who wish to follow the path of the Light. Meet me in the Hall of Champions.', 'Yes, I welcome all who wish to follow the path of the Light. Meet me in the Hall of Champions.', 120467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the High Priest!', '', 120466, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 69377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be foolish to think this attack will be the last, but we should take a moment to reflect on this victory and celebrate its true hero, our High Priest.', '', 120465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through your guidance and strength, we have emerged the victors in a great battle that was meant to destroy us.', '', 120464, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am honored to serve the Tirisgarde under your leadership, Archmage. Let us fight for Azeroth!', '', 120463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69383, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arcane Destroyer trills a few notes and claps its hands together excitedly.', '', 120462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will totally regret this when I\'m the boss!  I mean... you totally won\'t regret this, boss!', '', 120461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69382, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great! I will serve you and our order most faithfully!', '', 120460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69381, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would be glad to lend my skills to the Tirisgarde, conjuror. I have heard great things about you.', 120459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69590, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strength is yours, friend. Together we will protect Azeroth!', '', 120458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69380, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe my life to you, Archmage. I will serve our order tirelessly as your champion!', '', 120457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful. I am ready to fight whenever you are!', 120456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67677, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the mouth of Argus comes your doom! For soon the annihilator will have its fill and detonate with the force of a collapsing star! Nothing but ash will be left where we stand!', '', 120455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us take a moment to rest, and restore our temple to its intended glory.', '', 120454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Austerity returns to Tel\'anor, and my ancestors can rest once more. Thank you.', 120453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sacred peace at Tel\'anor is broken by harpy and spirit alike. Restore the tranquility that my people\'s ancestors deserve.', 120452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_deathknight_strangulate.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:49576|h[Death Grip]|h|r to interrupt Ariden\'s channeling.', 'Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_deathknight_strangulate.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:49576|h[Death Grip]|h|r to interrupt Ariden\'s channeling.', 120451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'ve won? You will know the taste of defeat, even if it means my own death!', '', 120450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be your faces that I see in my last waking moments. A final agonizing memory before I am turned to ash and cast into oblivion. I welcome it...', '', 120449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate brought me here, perhaps I can serve a purpose yet!', '', 120447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give up! The High Priest has arrived with reinforcements!', '', 120446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Much like fashion, some day we shall wonder how anyone thought fel was a good look.', 120445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fel infusion has become all the rage among those eager to please the Legion. There is no redeeming these traitors - hunt them down!', 120444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pressure is off and Su\'esh is well fed. We live another day.', '', 120443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will hurt, Death Knight.', '', 120442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande\'s forces are planning to sweep the city in search of dissenters. It would be a shame if Su\'esh were to find her way out of the menagerie to stop them.', '', 120441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will see to it the Nightborne end their long isolation as defenders of Azeroth, not conquerors.', 120440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, but you\'re a seasoned $c. I\'m just a bread merchant! I\'ll return when it\'s safe.', '', 120439, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your words are very kind, $n. I... I\'m not sure what to do. I best be on my way. Tell William to be safe!', 120438, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Delas, ready the portal.', 120437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Moon Guard have a long tradition of training hippogryphs for battle. Take flight, and rain justice from above!', 120436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande must not be allowed to pillage the secrets of the Moon Guard.', 120435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightborne continue to lay siege to the Moon Guard stronghold. Show them there are limits to their arrogance.', 120434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Paladins, it is time to aid our allies under the Light and defend Netherlight Temple!', 120433, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 70921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has been informing on us! We should feel fortunate we found him... the less the Grand Magistrix knows the better.', '', 120432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to look into a suspicious person who has been lurking around my tavern. Find where he is, follow him at a distance, and discover his purpose.', '', 120431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. I will examine these letters and see if there is any useful information for our movement within.', '', 120430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couriers deliver sensitive orders and information to lieutenants throughout the city. Intercept them and collect the correspondence they carry.', '', 120429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ghostly eyes are watching our every move. I don\'t think we\'ll get any privacy in this land, master.', 120428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are going to be quite the accomplished vintner! Rations leave the vineyard once more.', '', 120427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Vineyard\'s production quotas are not met, the citizens are the first to suffer. Help them reach their goals so arcwine rations continue to flow.', '', 120426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something so simple as feeding the needy, made perilous by Elisande. Your bravery is all that stands between them and a terrible fate.', '', 120425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give up, $n! The Light will prevail!', '', 120424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, be reborn!', '', 120423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have enough arcwine to spare for the needy around the city. Find those who cannot travel to my tavern and see that they drink their fill.', '', 120422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without balance, there is chaos. These will keep our ecosystem in balance.', '', 120421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mana wyrms are critical in guarding the arcan\'dor from pests. Capture more from the vineyard in Suramar City.', '', 120420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the mountains of this land will crumble before the might of lord Sargeras!', 120419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can save a lot of people with this arcwine. For many it makes all the difference.', '', 120418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without more arcwine, many citizens will wither right here in the city. Find what you can and I will see that they are cared for.', '', 120417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You made it!', '', 120416, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 69290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These poor things have been through enough today. Oculeth, send them back.', 120415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like $n ran into some trouble, Thalyssra. I\'ll get them out of there.', '', 120414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of the withered is running away. Catch him before he is lost in the tunnels!', 120413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 120412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Elfbreaker? What a dreadful name.', 120411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use caution. We don\'t want our withered to end up in cocoons.', 120410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful, $n. Do your best to minimize our losses.', 120409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow. This is a big one.', 120408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Standing by, Oculeth.', 120407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on, Thalyssra. I am sending a locked chest your way.', '', 120406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I see them. Hold on a moment...', '', 120405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth, can you get a bead on them?', 120404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be waiting for you on the other side. Good luck, $n.', '', 120403, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring these withered into the collapsed tunnels of Falanaar. Teach them to fight, and to search for relics that can aid our cause.', 120402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely many of those you freed were to be exiled. You saved many lives today.', '', 120401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Innocents are being jailed all across the city. This cannot stand! Slay the guards, take their control orbs, and set my people free.', '', 120400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the Legion is finally gone, we can gaze at the heavens in peace.', 120399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ten thousand years beneath a false sky, and we emerge to see the real one choked with vermin. Use the cannons in Felsoul Hold and blast those vile felbats!', 120398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion have begun their attack. The Conclave needs your help.', 'The Legion have begun their attack. The Conclave needs your help.', 120397, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings to you, $c. May the Light illuminate your path.', 120396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Alliance champion wields the Doomhammer now? The end times must surely be upon us...', 'An Alliance champion wields the Doomhammer now? The end times must surely be upon us...', 120395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can think of no champion more worthy to carry that hammer, $n.', 'I can think of no champion more worthy to carry that hammer, $n.', 120394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rumors are true. $n wields the Doomhammer now!', 'The rumors are true. $n wields the Doomhammer now!', 120393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see the Doomhammer in Alliance hands, $n.', 'It\'s good to see the Doomhammer in Alliance hands, $n.', 120392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the Doomhammer, $n? That\'s the very weapon that slew Sir Anduin Lothar in the second war.', 'Is that the Doomhammer, $n? That\'s the very weapon that slew Sir Anduin Lothar in the second war.', 120391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer is here! Keep the city safe, $n.', 'The Doomhammer is here! Keep the city safe, $n.', 120390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has the Doomhammer in hand. Glory to the Alliance!', '$n has the Doomhammer in hand. Glory to the Alliance!', 120389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So $n has the Doomhammer now? The Horde sure is coming apart at the seams I guess.', 'So $n has the Doomhammer now? The Horde sure is coming apart at the seams I guess.', 120388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ru-shanna shal\'dorei. The Nightborne will survive.', 120387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion landed right on our doorstep - and Elisande simply let them in. Disgusting. Strike at Felsoul Hold! Show the Legion that some of us are not so easily broken!', 120386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent. This brings us one step closer to understanding the unique power of the arcan\'dor.', 120384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<evil laughter>', '', 120383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish to study the energies in the Shattered Locus. Capture some of the critters feeding upon the crystals there. I need them alive!', 120382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall before your masters!', '', 120381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it even try?', '', 120379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easily defeated.', '', 120378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another weakling falls.', '', 120377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soul of that one would be usefull.', '', 120376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will help us to keep our own arcan\'dor stable. We must not fail.', '', 120375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcan\'dor beneath Falanaar grew unstable and failed catastrophically. Use your Lodestone to gather energy from the Shattered Locus so we can understand why.', '', 120374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!', '', 120373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not mourn for them. They are a mistake that must be corrected.', '', 120372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fal\'dorei were elves once... Now they are monsters, birthed in the chaotic energies of the failing arcan\'dor. They must be eradicated.', '', 120371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_sonicshockwave.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:78675|h[Solar Beam]|h|r to interrupt Ariden\'s channeling!', 'Use |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_sonicshockwave.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:78675|h[Solar Beam]|h|r to interrupt Ariden\'s channeling!', 120370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound effect for troops', '', 120369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is still a chance.', '', 120368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be praised. It is good to see you, Ishanah.', '', 120367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is awkward.', '', 120366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have taken well to the Light, Liadrin! It would seem that the Sunwell has renewed your vigor!', '', 120365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placing seal.', 'Placing seal.', 120364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad the earthen ring is still around, $n. Fight on!', 'I am glad the earthen ring is still around, $n. Fight on!', 120363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it is true - $n wields the Doomhammer!', 'So it is true - $n wields the Doomhammer!', 120362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer suits you, $n. Keep it well.', 'The Doomhammer suits you, $n. Keep it well.', 120361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Farseer $n, chosen keeper of the Doomhammer!', 'Hail Farseer $n, chosen keeper of the Doomhammer!', 120360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Is that the Doomhammer, $n? Is Thrall alive?', 'Is that the Doomhammer, $n? Is Thrall alive?', 120359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n will take care of the Legion. $gHe:she; has the Doomhammer now.', '$n will take care of the Legion. $gHe:she; has the Doomhammer now.', 120358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer is here! Keep the city safe, $n.', 'The Doomhammer is here! Keep the city safe, $n.', 120357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n wields the Doomhammer now - I can think of none better.', '$n wields the Doomhammer now - I can think of none better.', 120356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This imbecile, Calydus, insisted I bring him along. I refused. He followed me anyway. Let\'s get this over with before I lose my patience and incinerate him.', 'This imbecile, Calydus, insisted I bring him along. I refused. He followed me anyway. Let\'s get this over with before I lose my patience and incinerate him.', 120355, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You left in quite a hurry, $ct. We went to great lengths to track down your location. Thankfully we found you in time!', 'You left in quite a hurry, $ct. We went to great lengths to track down your location. Thankfully we found you in time!', 120354, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reporting for duty, $ct. Prophet, it has been ages since we last saw each other. Unfortunate circumstances for our reunion, but hopefully the outcome will be in our favor!', 120353, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct $n, we came as soon as we heard! Thank you for saving my people! Through the Light we will be victorious!', '$ct $n, we came as soon as we heard! Thank you for saving my people! Through the Light we will be victorious!', 120352, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already getting in trouble, $ct? Hopefully we can be of service!', 'Already getting in trouble, $ct? Hopefully we can be of service!', 120351, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$g Lad:Lass;, why would ya go off on your own without us? Do ya know how hard it is to get to this bumble-fudged island without a mage\'s portal?', '$g Lad:Lass;, why would ya go off on your own without us? Do ya know how hard it is to get to this bumble-fudged island without a mage\'s portal?', 120350, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have arrived, $ct, and brought with us good brew and an overly positive attitude!', 'We have arrived, $ct, and brought with us good brew and an overly positive attitude!', 120349, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little hero, we have come to fight and die alongside you! Or we could win I suppose. Either way, we have come to fight!', 'Little hero, we have come to fight and die alongside you! Or we could win I suppose. Either way, we have come to fight!', 120348, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors of your death are greatly exaggerated, $ct. They said the demons got you. We came to make sure.', 'Rumors of your death are greatly exaggerated, $ct. They said the demons got you. We came to make sure.', 120347, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sensed that you might be in distress, $ct. Together, we shall strike this demon down!', 'We sensed that you might be in distress, $ct. Together, we shall strike this demon down!', 120346, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies for our late arrival, $ct. The demons foolishly attempted to block our path, and we made them suffer in return!', 'Apologies for our late arrival, $ct. The demons foolishly attempted to block our path, and we made them suffer in return!', 120345, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, please forgive our tardiness! Nazgrim insisted on strangulating every demon we ran across. $G Sir:Ma\'am;, I won\'t lie... I\'m having second thoughts about him.', '', 120344, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth itself recoils as $n unleashes an ancient evil. \n\nKosumoth the Hungering walks the land once more...', 'Azeroth itself recoils as $n unleashes an ancient evil. \n\nKosumoth the Hungering walks the land once more...', 120343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unleash the eldritch wrath of the server engineers.', 'I wish to unleash the eldritch wrath of the server engineers.', 120342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woof?', '', 120341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has unleashed the eldritch wrath of the server engineers.', '$n has unleashed the eldritch wrath of the server engineers.', 120340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our journey together is done, valarjar. I have learned everything I can about the weapon you hold, and the battles it has played part in.', '', 120339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A truly heroic tale. Worthy of these halls, and of your hands. I was proud to be the one to tell it.', '', 120338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final etchings have been added. You should read them.', '', 120337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds are quiet, $n. I think we\'ve uncovered all we are going to on your weapon.', 120336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for dedicating so many resources to these efforts. I hope what we\'ve learned about your weapon has proved useful.', 120335, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just added the final chapter to our book. You should give it a read.', 120334, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that\'s it, $n. After weeks of research, I think we\'ve exhausted every scrap of history we could find about your weapon.', '', 120333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for dedicating so many resources to these efforts. I hope what we\'ve learned about your weapon has proved useful.', '', 120332, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just added the final chapter to our scroll. You should definitely give it a read.', '', 120331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve added another part to the scroll on your weapon\'s history. It\'ll be a good read if you have a minute or two.', '', 120330, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve scribed some more history on your weapon if you\'d like to take a look.', '', 120329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This weapon of yours has proven to have had quite the colorful past. I added some new translations to the scroll if you\'re interested.', '', 120328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some fascinating history turned up on your weapon. I added it to the scroll if you want to give it a read.', '', 120327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I added some more of your weapon\'s history onto the scroll. You should take a look when time permits.', '', 120326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re interested in reading some of the translated history of your weapon, I just added more on the scroll.', '', 120325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More has been etched into the stone.', '', 120324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone has been etched with more exploits of this weapon of yours.', '', 120323, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve carved more into the stone. A valorous tale.', '', 120322, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve written more of your weapon\'s legend into the stone.', '', 120321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Boss. Need anything?', '', 120320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord, let us return to your order hall. We have much to discuss.', '', 120319, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 69344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should return to Light\'s Hope, Highlord. The council needs to hear this.', 120318, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 72066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell him that if he can\'t convince enough seadogs t\' join up, he should break out th\' belayin\' pin for a good, old press gang.', '', 120317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smartly now, $g lad:lass;. Old Yancey\'s not goin\' t\' convince himself t\' join our crew.', '', 120316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No escape... so hungry...', 120315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are trying to... kill us...', 120314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mind is... slipping...', 120313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanthir... Vanthir!', 120312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arms warriors are the ultimate physical combatants, using martial skill and weaponry to crush those who stand against them.', 120311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms warriors are the ultimate physical combatants, using martial skill and weaponry to crush those who stand against them.', '', 120310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Affliction warlocks use shadow magic and disease to wear down their enemies, then drain their very life essences to empower themselves.', 120309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Affliction warlocks use shadow magic and disease to wear down their enemies, then drain their very life essences to empower themselves.', '', 120308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an enhancement shaman you channel the elemental forces directly into your weapons to make yourself a furious melee combatant, beating down your foes with the power of flame, earth, and storm.', 120307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an enhancement shaman you channel the elemental forces directly into your weapons to make yourself a furious melee combatant, beating down your foes with the power of flame, earth, and storm.', '', 120306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an elemental shaman you commune with ancient spirits and command primal elemental forces.', 120305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an elemental shaman you commune with ancient spirits and command primal elemental forces.', '', 120304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an assassination rogue you specialize in striking from the shadows, dispatching foes with a variety of poisons and bleeding attacks.', 120303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry we\'re late, $p! I\'m ashamed to admit that we got lost.', 'Sorry we\'re late, $p! I\'m ashamed to admit that we got lost.', 120302, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an assassination rogue you specialize in striking from the shadows, dispatching foes with a variety of poisons and bleeding attacks.', '', 120301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Discipline priests draw upon the opposing forces of Light and Shadow, choosing when to heal and when to inflict damage.', 120300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find out what SI:7 is up to, $n. We can ill afford to have unknown variables at this stage of the game.', '', 120299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Discipline priests draw upon the opposing forces of Light and Shadow, choosing when to heal and when to inflict damage.', '', 120298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a retribution paladin you are a stalwart protector of the weak, a bringer of punishment to the unjust!', 120297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a retribution paladin you are a stalwart protector of the weak, a bringer of punishment to the unjust!', '', 120296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a windwalker monk you use your fists and your speed to overcome enemies.', 120295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a windwalker monk you use your fists and your speed to overcome enemies.', '', 120294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'S-so... hungry...', 120293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a frost mage you excel at controlling the battlefield by freezing enemies in place as ice and hail pummel them into submission.', 120292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a frost mage you excel at controlling the battlefield by freezing enemies in place as ice and hail pummel them into submission.', '', 120291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will etch more of their stories as I learn of them. These are grand tales that I\'m eager to unfold.', '', 120290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve learned much. Heroes wielded that weapon before it came to rest in your hands. Their tales are well worthy to be carved here for all eternity, that mighty warriors might know of their valor.', '', 120289, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beast master hunters possess a deep bond with their pets, calling and bolstering them in battle while striking at foes with ranged attacks.', 120288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will keep adding to it as I learn more.', 120287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds tell me of many things, recent and ancient. There is a tale to tell with that weapon of yours. I\'ve begun to etch it in the tome over here.', 120286, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We attack on your mark, $p. Lead the charge!', '', 120285, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beast master hunters possess a deep bond with their pets, calling and bolstering them in battle while striking at foes with ranged attacks.', '', 120284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away!', 'Run away!', 120283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommy where are you??', 'Mommy where are you??', 120282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These tablets tell tale of the grandest battles fought under Odyn\'s sight.\n\nOf late, I\'ve been humbled to learn of the exploits of your races. I had not expected such ferocity and valor from people so small.', '', 120281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be good I promise!', 'I\'ll be good I promise!', 120280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go home!', 'I want to go home!', 120279, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sniff.> Thank you...', '<Sniff.> Thank you...', 120278, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a balance druid the sun, moon, and stars are your allies, enabling you to unleash these primal powers upon your enemies.', 120277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a balance druid the sun, moon, and stars are your allies, enabling you to unleash these primal powers upon your enemies.', '', 120276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grim tales, these. I quite like them.', '', 120275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The winds whisper of your exploits, and of those that came before. If I know the right questions to ask, we might learn much from them.', 120274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a feral druid your main weapon is shapeshifting. In Cat Form, your claws and fangs rip and bleed your opponents.', '', 120272, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an unholy death knight you command the powers of disease and death.', 120271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an unholy death knight you command the powers of disease and death.', '', 120270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shadows whisper many secrets, for those brave enough to listen.', 120269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wisdom is born only from failure. There is little need in fearing the trials that lie ahead of us.', '', 120268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The leaves whisper worries of fel fire and Nightmare, but as long as you stand firm, so will we.\n\nHow can I be of assistance?', 120267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hand of Illidan. How can I serve, master?', '', 120266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the hand of the Lich King. What can I do for you?', 120265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses! Can you pretend you didn\'t see that?', '', 120264, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An excellent choice. I will see to it that it gets done. Good to be working with a professional such as yourself, $n.', '', 120263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did you come from? Intruder!', 120262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck, boss.', 120261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep adding to it as our research continues. It\'s worth taking a look if you have some time.', '', 120260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This research has been quite fascinating! I\'ve begun inscribing the translated history on the scroll here.', '', 120259, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep inscribing anything I find here. It\'s worth taking a look if you have some time.', '', 120258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A weapon of legend, that\'s what you hold. I\'ve uncovered some of its history, and have written it here so that all might partake in its glory.', '', 120257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just make sure to tell everyone to be real nice to him. Otherwise, we might all wake up dead tomorrow. Ya know what I mean?', 120256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
