('It is decided, then. The Order of the Silver Hand will stand with the Conclave. We will NOT yield the Temple to the Legion.', '', 120249, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 69331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is not enough time to explain everything. I ask that you trust me, and trust in the Light.', '', 120248, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 69352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
