('', 'It is Nightborne magic... but it called to us.', 120199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I detected a strange signal coming from this place.', '', 120198, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been expecting you, $n.\n\nDelas has informed the council of Balnazzar\'s plan to attack Netherlight Temple. The question becomes, what role will the paladins play in this battle, if any? We risk a great deal if we choose to aid the Conclave.\n\nThis is not a decision to be made lightly. The council must discuss how to proceed.', 120196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is decided, then.', 120191, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 70924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I may - Balnazzar will not suspect a united force. The Conclave and the Order of the Silver Hand, fighting together.', 120190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be dangerous, but we may never get such a chance again. It may be the only way.', '', 120189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I agree with Arator, Boros. I felt great purity within the creature.', 120188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sensed no ill within him, only kinship. I know not what he is, but I believe him.', '', 120187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would trust a dreadlord?', '', 120186, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 68999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True, but if we are to believe what Lothraxion has said, this could be our only chance to slay Balnazzar.', '', 120185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think I wouldn\'t see what you truly are, demon?', '', 120184, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their temple is located deep in Legion territory. We would be putting ourselves at great risk.', '', 120183, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a tough decision before us. Do we aid the priests in their battle against Balnazzar, or do we decline and wait to fight the dreadlord on our own terms?', 120182, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 72778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
