('Even the slayer of Archimonde has accepted this world\'s fate! Come closer, then.', '', 120131, 0, 42636, 0, 64, 0, 72679, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prophet Velen, warriors of light, a well earned victory. I expected nothing less from the heroes of Azeroth.', '', 120130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great enemy is defeated this day. We have shown the Legion that Azeroth will not fall quietly.', '', 120129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... was close to withering. Come close, and receive my magic. It will ward you from whatever would do you harm.', '', 120128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... be safe.', '', 120127, 0, 0, 7, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Arcanist Ke\'lorin 50 Ancient Mana.>', '<Give Arcanist Ke\'lorin 50 Ancient Mana.>', 120126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Ashildir. We certainly do.', '', 120125, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should head back to the portal. The High Priest and I will take care of the rest.', 120124, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A victor has emerged from the crowd! The battle for the chest of riches is over!', '', 120123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
