('', 'Priest! Over here!', 120059, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 68995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Others have been captured. I\'ve seen it. They\'re everywhere!', 'Others have been captured. I\'ve seen it. They\'re everywhere!', 120058, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move! As fast as you can! Go!', 'Move! As fast as you can! Go!', 120057, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re quite the $c, aren\'t you? My thanks.', 'You\'re quite the $c, aren\'t you? My thanks.', 120056, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lands are overrun! We must stop them!', 'The lands are overrun! We must stop them!', 120055, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks. We must keep moving.', 'Many thanks. We must keep moving.', 120054, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving.', 'Keep moving.', 120053, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will guide us to the heart of the vessel. Stay within my protective barrier as I cleanse the fel taint from the pathway.', '', 120052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for ceasing the whispers, the endless hungering cries of the void are now yours to bear.', '', 120051, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone help!', 'Someone help!', 120050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me while I still draw breath!', 'You\'ll never take me while I still draw breath!', 120049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must wait a few moments before entering the battle again, Valarjar.', 120048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should we go through with this, there will be no turning back.', '', 120046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will obey, Deathlord. But know this...', '', 120044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do this... there will be a price to pay.', '', 120043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion Fordring was one of the greatest champions this world has known!', '', 120042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death has a way of quelling the madness of the mind... I am sure she will serve the Ebon Blade without compromise.', '', 120041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are few in this world who have lived with more conviction than High Inquisitor Whitemane.', '', 120040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevertheless, your will be done, Deathlord. The Ebon Blade will be honored to bring King Thoras into our fold.', '', 120038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thoras Trollbane was one of the greatest kings this world has known. The Alliance will not be pleased.', '', 120037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will be outraged, but Nazgrim will make a powerful Death Knight.', '', 120035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Four Horsemen... I have my reservations, but I will obey your will, Deathlord.', '', 120034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darion!', 120033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light protects this chapel, Darion. Darkness cannot abide within the Light!', 120032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lich King himself had no power here!', 120031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fools. Did you really think the Light would allow this?', 120030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just added the final chapter to our book. You should definitely give it a read.', 'I just added the final chapter to our book. You should definitely give it a read.', 120029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for dedicating so many resources to these efforts. I hope what we\'ve learned about your weapon has proved useful.', 'Thank you for dedicating so many resources to these efforts. I hope what we\'ve learned about your weapon has proved useful.', 120028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that\'s it, $n. After weeks of research, I think we\'ve exhausted every scrap of history we could find about your weapon.', 'Well, that\'s it, $n. After weeks of research, I think we\'ve exhausted every scrap of history we could find about your weapon.', 120027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve added another part to the tome on your weapon\'s history. It\'ll be a good read if you have a minute or two.', 'I\'ve added another part to the tome on your weapon\'s history. It\'ll be a good read if you have a minute or two.', 120026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve scribed some more history on your weapon if you\'d like to take a look.', 'I\'ve scribed some more history on your weapon if you\'d like to take a look.', 120025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This weapon of yours has proven to have had quite the colorful past. I added some new translations to the tome if you\'re interested.', 'This weapon of yours has proven to have had quite the colorful past. I added some new translations to the tome if you\'re interested.', 120024, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some fascinating history turned up on your weapon. I added it to the tome if you want to give it a read.', 'Some fascinating history turned up on your weapon. I added it to the tome if you want to give it a read.', 120023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I added some more of your weapon\'s history to the tome. You should take a look when time permits.', 'I added some more of your weapon\'s history to the tome. You should take a look when time permits.', 120022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep adding to it as our research continues. It\'s worth taking a look if you have some time.', 'I\'ll keep adding to it as our research continues. It\'s worth taking a look if you have some time.', 120021, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re interested in reading some of the translated history of your weapon, I just added an entry in the tome.', 'If you\'re interested in reading some of the translated history of your weapon, I just added an entry in the tome.', 120020, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This research has been quite fascinating! I\'ve begun inscribing the translated history in the tome over here.', 'This research has been quite fascinating! I\'ve begun inscribing the translated history in the tome over here.', 120019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skysunders were once storm drakes of great honor, charged with the protection of Shield\'s Rest. Now they have fallen into the madness of Helya\'s dark magics.', '', 120018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the peaks of Shield\'s Rest you will find the Skysunders. These drakes are powerful, ancient, and mad. Gather your allies, hero, and put one of these beasts down for its own sake.', '', 120017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This moonwell will nourish and protect everything around it. We can finally call this place home.', '', 120016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This attack costs more resources, but deals more damage as well. Thankfully, your melee attacks have a chance to trigger Stormbringer, decreasing the cost.', '', 120015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This attack costs more resources, but deals more damage as well. Thankfully, your melee attacks have a chance to trigger Stormbringer, decreasing the cost.', 120014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanish allows you to disengage from combat and make a quick getaway.', '', 120013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanish allows you to disengage from combat and make a quick getaway.', 120012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get far away from here! Go!', 'Get far away from here! Go!', 120011, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That feeling. I can\'t explain it!', 'That feeling. I can\'t explain it!', 120010, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? What happened?', 'Where am I? What happened?', 120009, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who... who are you?', 'Who... who are you?', 120008, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening?', 'What is happening?', 120007, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That thing... I have to get out of here!', 'That thing... I have to get out of here!', 120006, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... was that!?', 'What... was that!?', 120005, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet has died!. Use Revive Pet to bring it back to life.', 120004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pet has died!. Use Revive Pet to bring it back to life.', '', 120003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will bring the blessing to Mythandros directly. See you there!', 120002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. You may remain as a guest until your business with the commander is complete.', '', 120001, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!', 120000, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 68784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
