('Redhoof peers at Mythandros expectantly.', '', 119989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Fourth Horseman lays before you, Deathlord. Command him to rise.', '', 119988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But death is for the living, it has no power over the damned.', '', 119987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
