('Marin, I found this coin that has your name on it.', 'Marin, I found this coin that has your name on it.', 119982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your efforts help ensure that the Nightfallen have a future.', 119981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many ways to help the Nightfallen. Your companions can be of use as well.', 119980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show great promise.', 119979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time has come to test you and your companions. Are you worthy of the Valarjar\'s favor?', 119978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. We must remain vigilant in our defenses.', 119977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our lands must be protected. I hope you have readied your companions!', 119976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare still infests the forests of Val\'Sharah, but you and your companions have helped preserve it.', '', 119975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something threatens the creatures of Val\'Sharah. Perhaps you can direct your companions to be of aid.', '', 119974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! I speak for the court and its allies when I say, \"Thank you, hero.\"', '', 119973, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The court and its allies are in need of assistance. Perhaps your friends can help.', '', 119972, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say it\'s not strictly \"legal\" for me to bet on tournament matches. But what they don\'t know won\'t hurt \'em!', '', 119971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho! You\'ve discovered one of the tournament\'s traveling trainers! Another opportunity to show your skills and make me some gold!', '', 119970, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First my dozer breaks down, then those things come crashin\' down... I\'ll never get anything done around here!', '', 119969, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, now... easy! Leave something for the other competitors, will yah?', '', 119968, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a short time only, the Tournament is featuring one of the legendary creatures of Azeroth. Test your mettle while you can!', '', 119967, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now, and do what must be done.', '', 119966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The body of the great Tirion Fordring rests beneath the chapel.', '', 119965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for the Ebon Blade to return to Light\'s Hope.', '', 119964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without a leader, there will be no unity among the Four.', '', 119963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be one among the Four Horsemen with the power to lead.', '', 119962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel to the Scarlet Monastery and raise the High Inquisitor from her tomb inside the Cathedral.', '', 119961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her zealous power of will is necessary to strengthen the bond of the Four.', '', 119960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you considered Loken\'s final words to you?', 'Have you considered Loken\'s final words to you?', 119959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Inquisitor Whitemane was a priest whose personal tragedy forged an intense connection with the Light.', '', 119958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve an ill wind about you, priest.', '', 119957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, $c?', '', 119956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Keep it up kid, you\'re going places... and making me a pile of gold in the process!', '', 119955, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and challenge our reigning tournament champion! Winners will receive a handsome prize! Legal disclaimer: Prizes not always handsome.', '', 119954, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His strength in battle was without rival, and he shall be even more powerful in undeath.', '', 119952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is there that you will find the tomb of Thoras Trollbane, the great warrior king.', '', 119951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upon the cliffs of Arathor, stands the fallen kingdom of Stromgarde.', '', 119950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of the second horseman has come, Deathlord.', '', 119949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim, the fallen general of the Horde, shall be the firstborn. Go now and see that it is done.', '', 119948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of the Four Horsemen has come... and you will bring about their return.', '', 119947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But heroes alone will not save this world. Salvation will come at a price the living cannot pay.', '', 119946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The greatest heroes on Azeroth have gathered to face the Burning Legion.', '', 119945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help, stranger. It means more than you know.', '', 119944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe our lives to Mythandros and his druid companions. We can call Suramar home, thanks to him.', '', 119943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There were more of us when we set out. I would have died, if it were not for Mayruna\'s arrival.', 119942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whispers called to you.\n\n<Drak\'thul sighs heavily, for a moment appearing very old and frail.>\n\nI have learned many things on my years on these islands. I have delved into places I wish I had not, and learned things I long to forget.\n\nAnd now I wish to be alone, until darkness overtakes me at last.\n\nGo away.', '', 119941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightmare followed us wherever we went. It was not until we crossed into Suramar that we escaped it.', 119940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are yourself again. What happened?', 'You are yourself again. What happened?', 119938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came from a village just outside Shala\'nir. It was a narrow escape, I will admit.', '', 119937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fled Val\'Sharah during Ysera\'s attack on the temple. I was lucky enough to find Mythandros on the road.', 119936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Athu\'gag magg\'naggwa.\n\nQor\'naus\'agth lwhuk.\n\nLilth gag\'huqth\'hoq.', '', 119935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drak\'thul?', 'Drak\'thul?', 119934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Drak\'thul\'s eyes are sunken and unfocused. He has his head cocked slightly, as if listening to something you cannot hear.>', '', 119933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They do not come when I beckon, fool.', '', 119932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last of Xe\'ra\'s line, O\'ros, sits unguarded in the heart of the Exodar. If they destroy O\'ros, the information within Light\'s Heart will be lost forever.', '', 119930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 70875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of these whispers.', 'Tell me of these whispers.', 119929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And this is the true purpose of the Burning Legion\'s invasion of the Exodar.', '', 119928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the only way to know what secrets lie within Light\'s Heart is through her progeny. Which is why you were directed to bring the core to me.', '', 119927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('O\'ros, child of Xe\'ra, and heart of the Exodar, is the only being in all of the cosmos that could decipher the message locked away within Light\'s Heart.', '', 119926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 70878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet only a naaru born of Xe\'ra is capable of unlocking the core. This is why you were sent here, $p.', '', 119925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 70879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Locked away within the core is wisdom... knowledge crucial to our battle against the Burning Legion.', '', 119924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 70880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you find that? It has been many years...\n\n<Drak\'thul turns the relic over in his palm, and then hands it back to you.>\n\nThe ghosts have long since stopped their whispers. There was silence, for a while.\n\nThen they began again. Different, deeper, darker.', '', 119923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was the eldest, I was to be king. Not that runt Skovald!', '', 119922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you recognize this relic?', 'Do you recognize this relic?', 119921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skovald will pay for his treachery.', '', 119920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vile worm! You serve as lapdog to my brother!', '', 119919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t squeeze the shaman.', '', 119918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shield\'s Rest is where the most ancient Kings of Stormheim and their honored fallen were buried. Back before the Tideskorn were afraid of the sea.', '', 119917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Helarjar are defiling the tombs of Shield\'s Rest. Drive them back!', '', 119916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dead who lay at Shield\'s Rest have been undisturbed since before my time. You have done my people a great service this day.', '', 119915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carefully Grabbing', 'Carefully Grabbing', 119914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonespeakers disturb the bones of our eldest kings. The honored dead have earned their rest. Stop these betrayers.', '', 119913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drive the Witherbark tribe from my kingdom, and I will grant you access to the tomb of my father.', '', 119912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will destroy them by every means possible. Through treachery and subterfuge. Through guile and assassination. And yes, by laying down our lives if needs be.', 119911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All-out war between the Alliance and Horde has been averted. We can now focus our full attention upon the Burning Legion.', 119910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Detheroc is dead and Mathias Shaw is restored to his role as leader of SI:7.', 119909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us celebrate the one who made all of this possible, our newest Shadowblade, $n!', 119908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You already knew everything on that scroll. You\'re so smart!', 'You already knew everything on that scroll. You\'re so smart!', 119907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s get out of here, Mathias.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s get out of here, Mathias.', 119906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot begin to thank you for all that you have done, $n. You\'ve given me back SI:7 and saved the Alliance and Horde from a costly war we could have ill afford.\n\nThe Burning Legion would have destroyed us all.\n\nIt goes without saying, if there\'s anything I can do for you, just let me know.\n\nAre you ready to get back to Dalaran and the Hall of Shadows?', '', 119905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over. Speak with me when you\'re ready, $n. I\'ll get us safely out of Stormwind.', '', 119904, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps, but not any time soon, demon.', 119903, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 69538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Highlord, and the Silver Hand!', '', 119902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under our Highlord\'s leadership, we fought to the brink of oblivion... and triumphed.', '', 119901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We proved that when our wills were tested, we stood strong!', '', 119900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We turned back the Burning Legion, protecting our allies and destroying our enemies!', '', 119899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knights of the Silver Hand! Today, we have achieved a great victory!', '', 119898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, paladins of the Silver Hand.', '', 119897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We did it. The dreadlord is dead.', 119896, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooooo!', '', 119895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see your world burn to ash!', '', 119894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die in the fire of a thousand suns!', '', 119893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I will NEVER be defeated!', '', 119892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. I will hold his words in my heart.', 119891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, rally beneath the Light! Balnazzar, prepare to meet your end.', '', 119890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On order of High Exarch Turalyon, we came as fast as we could. I am sending reinforcements down to join you.', '', 119889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allies, do not despair. It is I, Lothraxion, High Commander of the Grand Army of the Light.', '', 119888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Absolon...', 119887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Noressa quickly glances over the letter.', 119886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was so certain he was dead...', 119885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is your Light now, heroes?', '', 119884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is no use! The prophet\'s vision has come to pass...', 119882, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 69647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are too many!', 119881, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 69636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! They won\'t take us down without a fight!', '', 119880, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 69338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, taste the TRUE might, of THE BURNING LEGION!!!', '', 119879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I tire of this game.', '', 119878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are alone, heroes. No one is coming to help you!', '', 119877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive, hero. Let us see how you do without your allies!', '', 119876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? The Order of the Silver Hand? Little matter. I will still destroy you!', '', 119875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladins of the Silver Hand, rally to the Highlord! Attack!', '', 119874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balnazzar, your arrogance is mighty. But Azeroth\'s heroes will stand against you!', '', 119872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, finally, your SOUL IS MINE!', '', 119871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have we searched for you, Prophet Velen. Here, you thought yourself safe from the Legion\'s gaze.', '', 119870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I agree. They will not suspect our united force. We will have the upper hand.', 119869, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Alliance and Horde are destined to destroy each other...', '', 119868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! I got a real special item today for you!', '', 119867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I need more room.', '', 119866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I am! Kill him, $n!', '', 119865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the real Mathias Shaw.', '', 119864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light damn him!', '', 119863, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 70886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the meaning of this, $n? I thought we were all on the same side!', '', 119862, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way! We have to stop Rakeesh and save O\'ros!', '', 119861, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 70882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re upstairs, $n!', 119860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on up there? Is someone fighting?', '', 119859, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are not your enemy, fool.\n\nNow go away.', '', 119858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must know much. Will you help us defeat them?', 'You must know much. Will you help us defeat them?', 119857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh. You think me a foolish old orc, frail and ready to be put to the wolves? \n\nI was communing with demons when you were in swaddling blankets.', '', 119856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons are taking over this island, you may want to leave.', 'The demons are taking over this island, you may want to leave.', 119855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away.', '', 119854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I shall deal with you myself.', '', 119853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, and destroy this intruder!', '', 119852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My creations will be the death of you!', '', 119851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_trinket6oih_orb4:20|t An |cFFFF0000|Hspell:211152|h[Empowered Eye of Gul\'dan]|h|r focuses on you!', '', 119850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A foul, foul creature. You have done well.', '', 119849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braxas is a Legion commander so vile even the other demons fear him. Reports are he slaughters any demons who are too weak to earn his respect. End him in the defense of Azeroth!', '', 119848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His power had to be contained. You have done well.', '', 119847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In our people\'s more foolhardy days, we experimented freely with the Arcane. Galeorn was brilliant, but the foul magic at work here has rendered him mad. He must be stopped.', '', 119846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a horrible creature. I shudder even thinking of it.', '', 119845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of nature\'s creations cannot be suffered to live. The Ancient Widow that has taken residence in Black Rook Hold numbers among them. Slay it!', '', 119844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. I feel no joy from this, but it was necessary.', '', 119843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Tel\'arn... one of the great heroes of the War of the Ancients. He has been returned to life, but his sorrow at his failure has driven him mad. Grant him an eternal rest.', '', 119842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Horsemen, our unholy fate awaits us! We will leave for Acherus at once.', '', 119841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will seek shelter now. I hope we meet again, friend.', '', 119840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me.', '', 119839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is gone. I thought I would join her in the ruins as a mindless husk, but you...', '', 119838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I left the City to find my daughter. She was one of those who dared speak against Elisande...', '', 119837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! The Legion will surely falter at such power.', '', 119836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work, damn you. Work!', '', 119835, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to our humble clinic. Are there wounds you need treated or are you here for supplies?', 119834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, champion. Had the mystics been left to their own devices, those dark runes would have claimed countless other souls of the Valarjar.', 119833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vile mystics of Haustvald continue to pervert the souls of our fallen warriors. Enter this place that my sisters and I dare not tread and destroy their corrupting dark runes.', 119832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord, your saddle is ready to take into battle!', 'Highlord, your saddle is ready to take into battle!', 119831, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our reinforcements are on approach!', '', 119830, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will carry this burden, Valewalker. Have a little faith.', 119829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Relieved Sigh] ... Balance is restored. The Arcan\'dor will not fail.', '', 119828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pure life essence... I only hope it is enough.', '', 119827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of the way! Future gladiator coming through!', '', 119826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger. The rage... the corruption is gone. Now I must tend to the waters I have neglected for so long.', '', 119825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everytime we kill someone, let\'s do a cool pose.', '', 119824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m already carrying a flag! Do we win?', '', 119823, 0, 42491, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, always fight on the roads. Objectives are for suckers.', '', 119822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, kill the ones in the dresses.', '', 119821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now do your victory pose!', '', 119820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, boss. I\'ll send flowers.', '', 119819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth has never before faced the full might of the Burning Legion, but with courage and diligence the Ebon Blade will be victorious.', 119818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owch, that looked like it hurt.', '', 119817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With our leader returned to us, the Forgotten Shadows may rise again.', 119816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not let the heretics finish what they started. \n\nOur leader\'s spirit may be lost to the void, but we will keep her body safe until it can be returned.', 119815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom! Never even saw it coming!', '', 119814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you goin\'? Nowhere!', '', 119813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It may take a moment to adjust your vision to the new locations of your eyes. It may be best to have a nearby perch handy.', 119812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you spread your wings, tilt them away from the incoming drafts of wind to set yourself aloft.', 119811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be warned: you will feel the STRONG urge to eat worms. I cannot stress this enough - do not eat worms, you will regret it.', 119810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your beak is for more than just chatting, keep yourself neat and preened or you may end up infested with bugs!', 119809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
