('', 'Use your tail feathers to steer. You may be unaccustomed to use of this muscle, be sure to practice a bit before you hit a tree!', 119807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you glide, search for currents of warm air to keep yourself aloft. These senses will be new to you, and you will grow accustomed to them with time.', 119806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
