('Behold the shadow of what is to come, the endless darkness that shall consume your world.', '', 119752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You topple a pawn and presume to challenge its master? Such arrogance!', '', 119751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to return the demon hunter\'s soul to his body... and deny the Legion\'s master a host!', '', 119750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Gul\'dan! I am darkness incarnate! It cannot end... like this.', '', 119749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready to leave this place and never look back.', 119748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond that, nothing is certain. Let us simply have faith that the Light will answer.', '', 119747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Netherlight Temple is in danger. Together, Knights of the Silver Hand, we can make our final stand against Balnazzar.', 119746, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Balnazzar won\'t expect heavy resistance. It could be our chance to slay him once and for all.', '', 119745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would trust the words of that stranger? The one who looked like a dreadlord himself?', '', 119744, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 68585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What if the stranger does not arrive as he promises? Can we count on his word?', 119742, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 70925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a risk, but the Temple will be vulnerable regardless. We should stand together.', 119741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 72065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your message, Priestess?', 'What is your message, Priestess?', 119740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my duty to remain and ensure the Legion does not penetrate the gates.', '', 119739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
