('I didn\'t expect salvation from the Silver Hand. My thanks to you and your order.', 'I didn\'t expect salvation from the Silver Hand. My thanks to you and your order.', 119423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My prayers have been answered. Thank you, $c.', 'My prayers have been answered. Thank you, $c.', 119422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never gave up hope, $c. You have my thanks.', 'I never gave up hope, $c. You have my thanks.', 119421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had faith that salvation would come. Thank you.', 'I had faith that salvation would come. Thank you.', 119420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we were lost once they brought us through the portal. Thank you, $c.', 'I thought we were lost once they brought us through the portal. Thank you, $c.', 119419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Light bless you.', 'Thank you, friend. Light bless you.', 119418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help, Ashildir. If you\'ll excuse us, we have some demons to attend to.', '', 119417, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... bear mighty Odyn\'s blessing. I did not think it possible!', 119416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Sha_Ability_Mage_FireStarter_nightmare:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191325|h[Breath of Corruption]|h|r!', '', 119415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should make our way to the Throne of Tides within the Abyssal Maw, where the scepter awaits. We must be careful - I fear Neptulon\'s Realm may be compromised!', '', 119414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the clues indicate that Adelee tracked the scepter into the Abyssal Maw. The trail is easy to follow... perhaps too easy. We may be walking into a trap.', '', 119413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is fortunate that Adelee\'s journal is written in waterproof squid ink. It will detail her search for the scepter. I will need time to look this over - bring it to me.', '', 119412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adelee spoke of a powerful wavestone. I see now what she meant. The auras surrounding this stone would cloak one\'s movements from Neptulon, allowing the naga to slip into his domain undetected.', '', 119411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is Wavespeaker Adelee\'s staff. Hmmm. It is attuned to the Abyssal Maw. Perhaps Sharas\'dal is in there? I warned her not to go there alone...', '', 119410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient city was once one of the jewels of Kalimdor. Leave no stone unturned in our search.', '', 119409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we can locate her, the scepter will not be far away!', '', 119408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our missing shaman, Wavespeaker Adelee, had tracked the Scepter of Tides to this sunken city before she disappeared.', '', 119407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. I spent many months in the depths of Vashj\'ir during the Cataclysm, it is like a second home to me now.', '', 119406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should strike you down for what you did to me. For what you stole from me.', '', 119404, 0, 42187, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You possessed bindings such as those once before. An eternal prison from which you freed me only to jealously seek my power.', '', 119403, 0, 42187, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so it is done, $r. Do not call upon me again.', '', 119402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the bindings that I might turn them against the Firelord and his minions, and I will reward you in kind.', '', 119401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But now that the Earthen Ring has seen to my return, I am inclined to show patience. Your errand may not be a foolish one after all.', '', 119400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And greedy mortals not unlike you freed me only to strike and steal my weapon, and my power.', '', 119399, 0, 42188, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ragnaros the Firelord once imprisoned me within bindings such as those you hold now.', '', 119398, 0, 42188, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal $r. You presume much to summon me.', '', 119397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will send you back to the tavern when you are ready.', 119396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish this had not been necessary, but you have done well.', 119395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to have lost my empowered disguise...', 'I seem to have lost my empowered disguise...', 119394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken lines shatter under our advance across these islands. Onward, for the Alliance!', '', 119393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde again claim a warden tower that should be ours. Show them the fury of the Alliance!', '', 119392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These dogs cower when faced with real might. This tower belongs to the Horde!', 119391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the tower! Greymane\'s forces will break before the might of the Horde!', 119390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Win me a title, won\'t you?', 119389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am modifying your disguise to allow you to fight like one of us.', 119388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to face Coryn.', 'I am ready to face Coryn.', 119387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All is going as planned. You do not need to worry.', 119386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to me when you are prepared to face this challenge, outsider.', '', 119385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Naglfar must be stopped, but you are not yet strong enough.', '', 119384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69869, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me atop the Sanctum when you are ready to die, whelp.', '', 119383, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 68149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no need to hide behind a champion. I will defend my own honor.', '', 119382, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tal\'ashar it is. I name my friend here as my champion.', 119381, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To murder those dryads and turn them to monstrous creatures... I did not know owlbeasts possessed such vile magic! It is good you stopped them.', '', 119380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owlbeasts are fierce guardians of sacred places. But when cut off from the light of Elune, they sometimes turn aggressive. Rescue the dryads from their menace!', '', 119379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Peace must be maintained in this forest. The Grizzleweald have long been allies of the people of Val\'sharah, and worthy of the help you provided.', 119378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grell usually keep to themselves, but they\'ve grown bold of late. They\'re attacking the Grizzleweald furbolg tribe! I fear they\'ll soon overrun the entire village.', 119377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land may never fully recover from the evil that has infested it, but we must do all we can.', 119376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dreadroot was once a beautiful wood, but now is overrun by monstrosities of the Nightmare. This cannot stand!', 119375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next task may be too perilous, even for you, little outsider. Return to me when you have fully honed your strength. \n\nOnly then would you hope to survive the Naglfar.', '', 119374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will return to Acherus. Come Horsemen, the binding of souls awaits us.', '', 119373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come, Deathlord. Tirion Fordring awaits.', '', 119372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ravis, let\'s see what you have.', 'Ravis, let\'s see what you have.', 119371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone must work together to defeat the Legion.', '', 119370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mischievous little devils! You\'ve taught the sprites a lesson, and now the bears can live in peace.', 119369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bears of the Sylvan Vale are known to possess a rare serenity, but I can sense their disquiet. Sprites are said to live nearby... I think foul play is afoot!', 119368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tendrils of Xavius\' corruption are everywhere! Sleeper\'s Barrow will yet be cleansed.', 119367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though we woke our druids trapped in Sleeper\'s Barrow, the Nightmare now stirs within. Dispatch the foul denizens who taint it!', 119366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a rough fight! Go help Hodir and I\'ll keep the way out clear.', '', 119365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Losing servants of the Dream breaks my heart, but at least they are at peace. For that, I thank you.', 119364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our keeper and dryad allies have been twisted by the insidious power of the Nightmare. You must end their suffering.', 119363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vale remains plagued by darkness, but you have brought a ray of hope back to it. I thank you.', 119362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The minions of Nightmare continue to defile Moonclaw Vale. Fight back against them, champion!', 119361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day Shala\'nir will be reclaimed and the roots of the World Tree safeguarded. We must not rest until that day dawns upon Val\'sharah!', 119360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The very roots of the World Tree are corrupted by the Nightmare. Cleanse Shala\'nir of the infestation that has claimed it.', 119359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The War of the Ancients saw many great battles like the one you just experienced. It took all of Azeroth\'s defenders working together to defeat the demons then, as it will now.', 119358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leafbeard the Storied has come! He\'s an old soul who tells a captivating tale about the War of the Ancients. Pay attention and you may learn valuable lessons that will aid you in the fight against the Legion.', 119357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How could anyone become so twisted inside that they would infect such a beautiful lake? At least you set things right.', 119356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A foul poison seeps into the waters of Mistvale. I feel in my bones that it must be the work of a corrupt druid. Seek out the defiler and end this affliction.', 119355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though we have our differences, those are still my people in Bradensbrook. It was kind of you to help them.', 119354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pity the people of Bradensbrook! They left Gilneas before falling victim to the worgen curse, but now they face the cruelty of Lord Ravencrest\'s thugs. Their village needs your protection.', 119353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved the owls from a horrible fate. Nobly done!', '', 119352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harpies seek to curse the graceful owls of our forest. Make haste! I pray you\'re not too late to stop them...', '', 119351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More than command of magic or prowess in battle, the truest trait of a hero is the willingness to help others. This day proves you have a hero\'s heart!', '', 119350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wormtalon harpies have beset Shadowfen. Thank goodness the survivors fled to safety! If you could recover the pieces of their lives they were forced to leave behind, it would be a great kindness.', '', 119349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few things enrage me more than seeing druidic magic perverted. The Darkgrove deserve their fate!', '', 119348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkgrove druids have turned the very flora against us! If they go unchecked, more of the forest will fall to their treachery!', '', 119347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare leaks into our reality like a seeping wound. But you have pushed back the darkness, at least for now.', '', 119346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare\'s assault on the Temple of Elune is ceaseless. We must lend our aid to defend this most sacred place.', '', 119345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Faerie dragons are so precious! It does my heart good to see them protected.', 119344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This time those sprites have crossed the line! They\'re trapping and killing those cute little lunarwing faerie dragons. Well, go on! Save them!', 119343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits\' forces have been weakened... for now. Can what is dead ever truly die?', 119342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many noble spirits that walk the land of the living, but Lord Ravencrest\'s cursed followers are beyond redemption. You\'d best defeat them before they rally and attack Bradesbrook in force.', 119341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have freed many acolytes, but the harpies are unrelenting. We must remain vigilant if we are to safeguard this land.', '', 119340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stoneblood harpies are using dark magic to turn Acolytes of Elo\'thir to stone! Save our noble allies from the harpy curse.', '', 119339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can afford to give no quarter to a foe as insidious as the harpies. Their presence is a corruption, and corruption must be purged.', '', 119338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The harpies ravage the forest to which they dare to lay claim. Take the fight to them and drive out their infestation.', '', 119337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More champions arrive! Ready up!', '', 119336, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s a $c! Look at that armor! I haven\'t seen such a thing afore! Looks like it\'s time fer this demon ta fall.', '', 119335, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a $c! We could definitely use more of ye!', '', 119334, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like more backup just arrived!', '', 119333, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! Though I\'m afraid that was just one of many. We\'ve got ta remove the remaining threat, champions!', '', 119332, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highlord! Over here!', 119331, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 68312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think she\'s offering aid. Look at her wing-- OH! Thank you!', 119330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of the Light, you are battle-born once more!', 'In the name of the Light, you are battle born once more!', 119329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am pleased Ohn\'ahra gave her blessing. I feared the Bloototem\'s actions had angered her. Now we can depart for Stormheim!', 119328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, champion!', 'Arise, champion!', 119327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There she goes! Ohn\'ahra wants you to follow her.', 119326, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 68170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring urgent news, My King. Danger is all around you!', '', 119325, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. We could not allow my people\'s sacred heirloom to fall in the hands of such a monster!', 119324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That monster will pay for this desecration!', '', 119323, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion overran the Vault of the Wardens seeking Lord Illidan\'s body. Gul\'dan has taken it.', '', 119322, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand, husband. But for Maiev to release them, the situation must be even more dire than we know.', 119321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having the Illidari among us makes me uneasy. Their kind has been locked away since my brother\'s fall.', '', 119320, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? What is the meaning of this?', '', 119319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... is it you? Hah! You\'ve come far my mortal friend. First you helped me defeat Loken and now you lead Odyn\'s own armies!', '', 119318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68401, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare for battle, champion. Even the Valarjar dare not tread so near Helya\'s domain.', 119317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain! Ye need ta try an\' rest! If ye don\'t, I\'ll let that demon come and fix ye up himself!', 'Captain! Ye need ta try an\' rest! If ye don\'t, I\'ll let that demon come and fix ye up himself!', 119316, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to rest and your soldiers are well trained. Now sit still.', 'You need to rest and your soldiers are well trained. Now sit still.', 119314, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye have to let them do it! It\'s their fight now!', 'Ye have to let them do it! It\'s their fight now!', 119313, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! All that yellin\' \'ill probably make it worse!', 'Enough! All that yellin\' \'ill probably make it worse!', 119312, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit yer fussin\'! Yer soldiers are trained well. They can do it.', 'Quit yer fussin\'! Yer soldiers are trained well. They can do it.', 119311, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, what do ye think you\'re doin\'? Ye aren\'t anywhere near ready ta get back in and fight.', 'Captain, what do ye think you\'re doin\'? Ye aren\'t anywhere near ready ta get back in and fight.', 119310, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn\'s valor is rivaled only by his appetite. A true warrior.', 119309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show \'em yer strength! Fer the Alliance!', '', 119308, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can assure ye - this won\'t be the last one we bring down today!', '', 119307, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep \'em on guard! Don\'t let \'em out of sight!', '', 119306, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s got some fight in \'em!', '', 119305, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I broke free for a moment. Please, if anyone finds this, you are our only hope of rescue.', 119304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are still alive, but they are taking us through the portal... to their home world. What lies on the other side?', 119303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We underestimated the Legion\'s cunning! After we attacked, the portal blazed to life. Balnazzar arrived and tore through our defenses.', 119302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We attack tomorrow. May the Light guide us.', 119301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion does not yet suspect our presence. Their leader, Brood Queen Aramis, roams the camp each day.', 119300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The priests also seek Balnazzar. Their leader, Prophet Velen, saw a vision of the dreadlord raining destruction upon Azeroth.', 119299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As she promised, Delas brought Conclave priests to join the battle. Our forces are getting along well.', 119298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We arrived at Felblaze Ingress soon after leaving Light\'s Hope Chapel. This log bears witness to our journey.', 119297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be a way to protect the heart from the volatility of the Legion\'s magic. I think I have an idea.', '', 119296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The matrix is destabilizing!', '', 119295, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-talah Kaldorei!', 119294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elun\'falah shalar.', 119293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, some good news on this day of sorrow.', '', 119292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me within the Sanctum of Order. I must prepare for the ceremony.', 119291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know of the kvaldir?', 'What do you know of the kvaldir?', 119290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya\'s domain is to watch over the souls of the unworthy, while those who die in glory are sent to Odyn in the Gates of Valor, to train for the final battle. But Helya, she is a jealous witch, and cannot be sated with the souls she is given.\n\nThus she made the kvaldir. Once mighty vrykul, now torn and corrupted by her foul magics. They serve her eternally, plundering the souls of the living to feed her unquenchable lust for death.\n\nThey are a blight, outsider. Nothing more.', '', 119289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know what you see here, little outsider? It is the fate of the Tideskorn, once not so scorned by the tides.\n\nIt was Helya, the foul sea-witch, whose wrath consumed their fleets, and whose foul mists broke the mightiest of the vrykul. The jarls had no choice but to give up the sea, for axe and sword do naught to slay mist and brine.', '', 119288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know. But we owe it to our friend to try.', 119287, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure this is going to work, Syrana?', '', 119286, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 69250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us begin the ritual at once.', 119285, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I break your elf-thing!', '', 119284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our numbers may be few, but the Legion will learn to fear the Guard.', 119283, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perfect. Shall we put our incantation to the test?', 119282, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s submits to you.', '%s submits to you.', 119281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, it\'s all here. With the right ritual, we can safely infuse the Heart with even the most powerful magic!', '', 119280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time. Take us to Niskara.', 'It is time. Take us to Niskara.', 119279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion are not the only ones who can reach through the cosmos to strike their enemies.$B$BGive the word, $n. I will maintain the gateway open from this side.', '', 119278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! I can feel it from here!', '', 119277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. We will fly straight to Pandaria.', '', 119276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s not quite the solution is it? Try activating the box again to give it another go.', 119275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure you ask for the Scroll of Elun\'dris. It alone has the information we need!', '', 119274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary, friend. It may take some time to earn the Nightfallen\'s trust.', '', 119273, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully, shaman. The mogu who haunt those ruins are long dead, but their spirits remain... as do the traps they left behind.', '', 119272, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to Furog, tiny elf-monsters!', '', 119271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We still owe you a great debt for your help in evacuating our stronghold. How can we repay you?', '', 119270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been of great service to the Guard, $p. How can we aid you in return?', '', 119269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will gladly accept your help, Delas. The Light is strongest when it shines together.', 119268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me to accompany you, sister. I will send word to the Netherlight Temple and ask for reinforcements from the priest order.', 119267, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal at Felblaze Ingress must be destroyed. With your permission, Highlord, Arator and I will deal with this.', 119266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu\'alah, Sister. Thank you for your warm welcome.', 119265, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 68352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highlord, you\'ve returned. And with Delas! It has been too long, friend.', 119264, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 68325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
