('We need your help \'persuading\' some noble houses to support Ly\'leth\'s bid for advisor. Are you in?', 'We need your help \'persuading\' some noble houses to support Ly\'leth\'s bid for advisor. Are you in?', 119241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
