('These alleys are dangerous. You never know who might pick your pockets.', '', 119235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you adore my charming demeanor, but you really should not be here unless you have business for me.', '', 119234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
