('The Death Gate... take... it.', '', 119212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?!', '', 119211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, the Four Horsemen shall have their leader...', '', 119210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will resurrect our valiant deceased, but the actions of the Ebon Blade will not be forgotten.', '', 119209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathlord! The time has come for you to leave this place and never return.', '', 119208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This burden will always be ours to bear, my son.', '', 119207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not watch my son become a monster!', '', 119206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Then your unholy crusade is at an end. The Four Horsemen will never return.', '', 119205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at what you have done! The valiant blood of your allies stains this sacred chapel. Blood that you have spilt!', '', 119204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darion, my son! What is the meaning of this?', '', 119203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such power... how can this be?', 119202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light, be purged!', 119201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t pick the lock. It is up to you, $p.', 119200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong, Taoshi?', '', 119199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One down, one to go.', 119198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll get your chance soon enough, Mathias.', 119197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here so that I can help.', '', 119196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us speak to Thalreus and his kin. We will need their knowledge to empower the Heart further.', '', 119195, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Moon Guard are the only ones versed in the ancient magic we need to empower the Heart further. You must save them.', '', 119194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few have returned after journeying so deep into the dark.', '', 119193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taoshi, pick the locks. I\'ll take care of the demons.', 'Taoshi, pick the locks. I\'ll take care of the demons.', 119192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must get Shaw out of this cage.', 119191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for everything, Senegos. I hope that one day our paths will cross again.', '', 119190, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear you don\'t understand the depths of their depravity, brother. We must continue to push the boundaries of possibility, or we may well still fail.', '', 119189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must lend our strength, Kalecgos. There is too much power!', '', 119188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... don\'t remain too long in there, alright?', '', 119185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your mark, $p.', '', 119184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Uncrowned to the rescue. I wouldn\'t expect anything less.', '', 119183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... But if anyone would laugh, it would be THEM.', '', 119182, 0, 42107, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preposterous! A joke at my lord\'s expense? Only a madman would attempt it!', '', 119181, 0, 42107, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, that\'s simply impossible...', 119180, 0, 42107, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is the symbol of House Stelleris... but that could not be. Coryn was Ruven\'s dearest friend...', 119179, 0, 42107, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Why WOULD he do such a thing...?', '', 119178, 0, 42107, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely NOT! Why would he do such a thing? Has he no honor?!', '', 119177, 0, 42107, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here they come!', 119176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is talk in the streets that they found a silver crescent near his corpse- is that true?', 'There is talk in the streets that they found a silver crescent near his corpse- is that true?', 119175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I overheard a rather crude joke at poor Ruven\'s expense while visiting the Stelleris family. I can\'t imagine you would want to hear it...', 'I overheard a rather crude joke at poor Ruven\'s expense while visiting the Stelleris family. I can\'t imagine you would want to hear it...', 119174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that Coryn Stelleris has begun to purchase the remaining Duskmere attendants - is that true?', 'I heard that Coryn Stelleris has begun to purchase the remaining Duskmere attendants - is that true?', 119173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', 'I see.', 119172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my dear Ruven...\n\nHe was such a brash child, so full of pride. I always knew he would take great power for his own some day.\n\nBut not this... I did not see this coming. Oh my child...', 119171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord Ruven promised such power, if he were to ascend to the palace. I believed him! I made plans!\n\nNow he is dead, and I cannot show my face without drawing stares. I am ashamed.\n\nHow could one such as he fall so low?', '', 119170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was personal attendant to lord Ruven himself. Now I am reduced to delivering wine and sweets to petulant, coddled  nobles with no real power or influence.\n\nPathetic.', '', 119169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Kalecgos! We are just beginning. We must now delve deep into the Nightmare itself.', '', 119168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible! But the power of one essence is simply not enough.', '', 119167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You keep them off me and I will get SI:7 here out of his cage.', 119166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s... it\'s working!', '', 119165, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have everything we need. Well done!', '', 119164, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, $r.  I want nothing to do with your foolish plans.', '', 119163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious.\n\nThunderaan has returned through the efforts of the Earthen Ring. The new Windlord has risen, and it is he you should speak to about these wretched creations.\n\nBut even then, just one Binding is of little use even to the lord of Skywall.', '', 119162, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no desire to imprison the Windlord.  I wish to come to an arrangement with him.', 'I have no desire to imprison the Windlord.  I wish to come to an arrangement with him.', 119161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I will deal with you myself.', '', 119160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would the Windlord require to arrange an audience?', 'What would the Windlord require to arrange an audience?', 119159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold, $r.  The elemental lords are not known for their generosity.\n\nStill, should you recover both bindings, and ore powerful enough to turn them into something of use, then I will arrange your audience with Thunderaan the Windlord.\n\nUse the time between then and now to consider the wisdom of this meeting.  I shall understand if you do not return.', '', 119158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I care little of your Bindings.\n\nThunderaan has returned through the efforts of the Earthen Ring. The new Windlord has risen, and it is he you should speak to about these wretched creations.\n\nBut even then, just one Binding is of little use even to the Windlord.', '', 119157, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Lifebinder... I thought the Heart was just another legend.', '', 119156, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 69272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now look what you\'ve done. Didn\'t want to listen, did you?', '', 119155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... I have failed you my lord, Detheroc...', '', 119154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... I hope you like eating raw fish, $n.', '', 119153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steel your heart, young one. None are safe from the Nightmare\'s grasp.', '', 119152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not fear the Windlord.  As long as I have this binding, he should fear me.', 'I do not fear the Windlord.  As long as I have this binding, he should fear me.', 119151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You possess a powerful binding from the Firelord\'s kin.  These are no toys, $r.  Bindings such as these threaten even the great elemental lords.  They are unspeakably dangerous to possess.\n\nDo you seek to imprison the Windlord with these bindings?  Or do you have some other intent?', '', 119150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with me when you have finished your business here, so we might leave this place.', '', 119149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oakheart protected the great tree for untold years, never once wavering in his vigil. A tragic end.', '', 119148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take caution! Azshara\'s minions will not relinquish the Heart easily.', '', 119147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Eyeballing you up and down suspiciously.>', '', 119146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, really... I kind of... just fell into this place.', 'I don\'t know, really... I kind of just... fell into this place.', 119145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may well not have been, save for the efforts of your friend.', '', 119144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you alive and well, Senegos.', '', 119143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Words are weapons.', 119142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'House Lunastre will always rise above.', 119141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trying to annoy me? How quaint.', 119140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good riddance.', 119139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave me.', 119138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disgraceful.', 119137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What.', 119136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spit it out.', 119135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get this over with.', 119134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disgraceful.', '', 119133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me.', '', 119132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good riddance.', '', 119131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get this over with.', '', 119130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit it out.', '', 119129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What.', '', 119128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gone! You have caused me enough trouble already.', '', 119127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember that one must reap what one sows.', '', 119126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rethink your path.', '', 119125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense unrest within you.', '', 119124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yourself.', '', 119122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ande\'thoras-ethil.', '', 119119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know someone brought Ailen Astravar here. Tell me where he is.', 'I know someone brought Ailen Astravar here. Tell me where he is.', 119116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek harmony.', '', 119115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', '', 119112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk with purpose.', '', 119107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All unite under the Light.', '', 119106, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgotten shadows rise!', '', 119105, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An old enemy becomes an ally.', '', 119104, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s becoming clear.', '', 119103, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know my path.', '', 119102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a path that leads to our victory! You are there, walking with the Light, guiding us all.', '', 119101, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooooooooo!', '', 119100, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 67898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be our fate... unless...', '', 119099, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be our fate. We are doomed to die at the hands of the dreadlord Balnazzar.', '', 119098, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our order will fall at his hands, everyone within will perish.', '', 119097, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a great darkness looming over Netherlight Temple. The shadow of the Burning Legion, ready to strike.', '', 119096, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is a heavy burden.', '', 119095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 119094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishnu-alah.', '', 119093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I enjoy coming here to think. In the presence of the statue, I feel bathed in serenity.', 119092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings to you, $c. May the Light illuminate your path.', 119091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...You are lucky my owl likes you.', '', 119087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Sic \'em, Kal! Go for the eyes!', '', 119086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<grumble> Be strong... be strong...', '', 119085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am disciplined by thousands of years of training. Your petty harassment rolls off like morning dew from the leaves of my garden.', '', 119084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mustn\'t stop fighting. Press on!', 'We mustn\'t stop fighting. Press on!', 119083, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate your help. Now, if you\'ll excuse me, I must continue.', 'I appreciate your help. Now, if you\'ll excuse me, I must continue.', 119082, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be alright. Now get moving!', 'I\'ll be alright. Now get moving!', 119081, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are trying to incite me, it will not work.', '', 119080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your blades clean.', '', 119079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\'ratha adore.', '', 119078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step carefully.', '', 119077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', '', 119076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be kind. Or be strong.', '', 119075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shal\'dorei are suffering.', '', 119074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another interloper? Do not meddle in Highmountain affairs!', '', 119073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my blade, I will protect Suramar.', '', 119072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only this stubborn spirit would obey!', '', 119071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Order must be restored.', '', 119070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aran\'arcana.', '', 119069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met.', '', 119068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your tribe had plenty of time to reclaim the spear, but failed. I will bring back Talonclaw... for the Bloodtotem!', '', 119067, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 68166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why are you doing this? I know the peace has always been uneasy, but--', 119066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, I tire of being asked \"more power, more power.\" The arcway is not just some wagon that can be heaped with goods - it is a series of conduits!', 119065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where I am from, this kind of behavior has consequences...', 119064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this some kind of primitive ritual? Poking someone until they lose their patience?', 119063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Val-TWAH. Twwahhh! The \"R\" is silen- you know what, never mind. Call me whatever.', 119062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Ahem.> You are still here.', 119061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 119060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aran\'arcana.', 119059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Well shot, $n. That\'ll do for today.', '', 119058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, enough of the classroom lecture. Get in there and try and fire at the targets I\'ve marked.  I\'ll be back over here collecting data.', '', 119057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And of course by, \"Throw,\" I mean to say shoot. With fire.', '', 119056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic isn\'t all about conjuring balls of fire and hurling them at your enemies you know.  Sometimes you need to throw rocks, really BIG rocks.', '', 119055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met $n. Care to help me with some science?', '', 119054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The arcane is infinite.', 119053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good help is so hard to find.', 119052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run along.', 119051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may speak.', 119050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your aid will help us win this war.', 'Your aid will help us win this war.', 119049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', 'I am in your debt.', 119048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, priest.', 'You have my thanks, priest.', 119047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shal\'assan torah.', 119046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande was wrong to doubt our magic.', 119045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Power is out there, we need only reach for it.', 119044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something is wrong. There is strange... Look out!', 119043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every now and then, a brave hunter seeks Talonclaw. They commune with the Eagle Spirit, receive her blessing, and begin their hunt. Sadly, these pursuits have always ended the same way: death.', 119042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 119041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See, now you made me swear. <Sigh.>', '', 119040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent, $n! This information will prove invaluable to our research.', 119039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Head over to the box and interact with it to start the puzzle.', 119038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a fascinating discovery, $n. This device seems to be guarded by some puzzle.', 119037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, blink off already!', '', 119036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a teleport? Preferably somewhere far...', '', 119035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were just leaving right?', '', 119034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test. Observe. Repeat!', '', 119033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your path be clear.', '', 119032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tel vallath.', '', 119031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respect magic, or it will break you.', '', 119030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is our destination?', '', 119029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar-ammenos.', '', 119028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you made a discovery?', '', 119027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why hello.', '', 119026, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 67939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so putting that shield back up when this is over.', 119025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh.> Ten thousand years of paradise. And now, I am stuck here. With you.', 119024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, time to go...', 119023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are all outlanders this... eager?', 119022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar must be free.', 119021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work, $n! I can\'t wait to analyze the mana saber. The Ley energy will saturate the air around it I\'m sure!', 119020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful who you trust...', 119019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An\'ratha adore.', 119018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did the other one go?', '', 119017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our isolation has ended.', 119016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightwell calls to me...', 119015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amused? Good. Enjoy it while you can.', 119014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not test me. I will win.', 119013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know who I am?', 119012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 119011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will honor my father\'s name.', 119010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The people will rise.', 119009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory to the shal\'dorei.', 119008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day.', 119007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 119006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 119005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This guide appears to have been mangled by at least a dozen different wild animals. Though heavily patched, it is no longer readable. It has an unpleasant, musky scent.>', '<This guide appears to have been mangled by at least a dozen different wild animals. Though heavily patched, it is no longer readable. It has an unpleasant, musky scent.>', 119004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there, the one who set off the explosions!', '', 119003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you\'re spotted. Vanish!', 119002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you procure some valuable items.', 'I can help you procure some valuable items.', 119001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I chugged my share of mana potions back in the day. Not something I\'m proud of, but I did what I had to do!', '', 119000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunters of all races, working together... not how it was in the old days!', '', 118999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outland had its charms. But when I heard about this lodge, I had to come see it for myself.', '', 118998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been guiding hunters for a lot of years. Makes me proud to see how far we\'ve come!', '', 118997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turn back from this unholy mission, or be purged by the Light!', 118996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death Knight! Your actions here are an affront to all that is holy!', 118995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are only as strong as our will.', 118994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One day at a time.', 118993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_temporalshield:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:219815|h[Temporal Orbs]|h|r flow out of the Nightwell!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_temporalshield:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:219815|h[Temporal Orbs]|h|r flow out of the Nightwell!', 118992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s just down the stairs. Hurry, $p!', 118991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not far now.', 118990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is in here.', 118989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to waste, $p.', 118988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must get to Mathias quickly.', 118987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p. This way.', 118986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep up. Mathias Shaw is not far.', 118985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us stealth quickly to Mathias Shaw.', 118984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead me to Mathias.', 'Lead me to Mathias.', 118983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mathias Shaw is being held inside the Halls of the Eclipse to the south.', 118982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just might be possible...', '', 118981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to take care of a small matter before heading down. I\'ll see you soon.', '', 118980, 0, 42047, 1, 64, 0, 69279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a drink.', '', 118979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaand it\'s closing time.', '', 118978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only by working together with these heroes have we won this day! Quickly, brethren, to the Vault of Lights! The Prophet needs our help!', '', 118977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I reserve the right to refuse service. To anyone.', '', 118976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight as one! We can only defeat them if we stand united!', '', 118975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!', '%s has used the Wild Mana Wand on $n!', 118974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care.', '', 118973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Waning Crescent never closes.', '', 118972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something you need?', '', 118971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has signed a contract with the Widowsister rogues! Hang onto your wallets!', '%s has signed a contract with the Widowsister rogues! Hang onto your wallets!', 118970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has summoned imps!', '%s has summoned imps!', 118969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has awoken the bats! Watch your head!', '%s has awoken the bats! Watch your head!', 118968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My doors are always open.', '', 118967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has flushed the crocs out of the sewer pipes!', '%s has flushed the crocs out of the sewer pipes!', 118966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need only ask.', '', 118965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help?', '', 118964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 118963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased some Young Mutant Warturtles from Laura Malley! Come tame them before they get away!', '%s has purchased some Young Mutant Warturtles from Laura Malley! Come tame them before they get away!', 118962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has chummed the waters in the Black Market! Come fish up some Sightless Eyes!', '%s has chummed the waters in the Black Market! Come fish up some Sightless Eyes!', 118961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased a crate of Ratstallion Harnesses! Come get your temporary rat mount near the guard station!', '%s has purchased a crate of Ratstallion Harnesses! Come get your temporary rat mount near the guard station!', 118960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased a banquet! Come get a meal in the inn!', '%s has purchased a banquet! Come get a meal in the inn!', 118959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though swordplay is not my specialty, I must say her abilities were most impressive.', '', 118958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the palace gardener turned himself into a plant?', '', 118957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This astronomer seemed to think very highly of himself. But a good mage knows that intellect isn\'t everything!', '', 118956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was for Tirion Fordring, monster! Krosus may not have struck the killing blow, but he played a part in our great champion\'s fall.', '', 118955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the Third War, Tichondrius fell in battle against Illidan Stormrage. I think the demon hunter\'s spirit is pleased that the dreadlord has met another painful end.', '', 118954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep an eye on your progress. Good luck!', '', 118953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The people of Suramar owe these heroes a debt we can never fully repay. I will stand with them until the end.', 118952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see to fortifying our position here. Thalyssra, your guidance has been invaluable to our champions so far. They\'ll rely upon your wisdom in the battles ahead.', '', 118951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gates are breached! Sorry we couldn\'t join you sooner, but we had a bit of a mess to clean up out front.', '', 118950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should have seen to your elimination myself instead of leaving it to Melandrus. After I finish with these whelps, your blood will stain my blade!', 118949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You!', 118948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll soon have the opportunity to assess the value of her gift. It\'s time to bring the fight to Gul\'dan!', '', 118947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skawn! No! I will make you suffer for that!', 118946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aluriel trained countless Nightborne in the art of the blade. She would have been a valuable ally, but she chose the wrong side.', 118945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I say? He took his job seriously.', 118944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Etraeus thought himself superior to... well, everyone. I confess I enjoyed seeing him humbled.', 118943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surprised to find me alive, Aluriel?', 118942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people have paid a terrible price for Elisande\'s bargain with the Legion. I hated her for it! But perhaps the magic she bestowed upon you can help bring down our enemies... and earn her some small measure of forgiveness.', 118941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must drive out the Legion before their meddling unleashes more such manifestations!', 118940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve tried breaking out, but the wooden bars are too thick.', 118939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The reign of the Grand Magistrix ends today! Take her tower, my friends! Topple the tyrant and set my people free!', 118938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightborne stand beside our allies, both ancient and new, to drive back the Legion. Our fates are joined, my friends! In saving this city from the demons, we save all of Azeroth as well! Tor ilisar\'thera\'nal!', 118937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last, the battle to liberate Suramar is joined! No more must our resistance hide in the shadows!', 118936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Spellblade! Once she is defeated, nothing will stop us from opening the palace gates!', 118935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The palace grounds are just ahead. You\'ll find them even more heavily defended than the lower levels.', 118934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a momentous day, my friends. Until the Legion came, no outsider was permitted inside the corridors of the Nighthold for ten-thousand years.', 118933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This cage may be strong, but remember, a murloc\'s mind is weak and easily controlled!', 118932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shanar daloras! I have no idea how such an entity came to be, but the essence of the Nightwell is surging through it.', 118931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Priest, over here! I need your help!', 118930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the fate of my people rests in the hands of outsiders... all of you... to save us from the terrible bargain made by our queen.', 118929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my thanks.', 118928, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will shred your flesh from bone!', 118927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rend their flesh apart, my pet!', 118926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What madman thought to infuse this creature with the Nightwell\'s power? Have a care. If this abomination was created to protect lower reaches of the citadel from invaders, it must be particularly deadly.', 118925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, there are times I feel that the commoners don\'t properly appreciate us.', 'You know, there are times I feel that the commoners don\'t properly appreciate us.', 118924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve lived quite comfortably for so long. Why must outsiders come and stir up trouble?', 'We\'ve lived quite comfortably for so long. Why must outsiders come and stir up trouble?', 118923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t mind the Legion presence at all. It feels good to know we\'re on the winning side.', 'I don\'t mind the Legion presence at all. It feels good to know we\'re on the winning side.', 118922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wine is terrible. I\'ll wager Melandrus watered it down.', 'This wine is terrible. I\'ll wager Melandrus watered it down.', 118921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw Spellblade Aluriel pacing about. She always seems so... angry.', 'I saw Spellblade Aluriel pacing about. She always seems so... angry.', 118920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know that Star Auger Estraeus is so smart that his head weighs three times that of a noble-born elf? And six times that of a commoner!', 'Did you know that Star Auger Estraeus is so smart that his head weighs three times that of a noble-born elf? And six times that of a commoner!', 118919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... What I mean is that order has been restored! We are perfectly safe, thanks to the Grand Magistrix!', 'Uh... What I mean is that order has been restored! We are perfectly safe, thanks to the Grand Magistrix!', 118918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet down! The Grand Magistrix is about. Do you want to draw her ire?', 'Quiet down! The Grand Magistrix is about. Do you want to draw her ire?', 118917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wager Vandros was only the first. Every noble in Suramar has a target on their back!', 'I\'ll wager Vandros was only the first. Every noble in Suramar has a target on their back!', 118916, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? I\'d assumed it was some sort of dissident, but a scorned lover sounds much more exciting!', 'Really? I\'d assumed it was some sort of dissident, but a scorned lover sounds much more exciting!', 118915, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard it was a jilted lover.', 'I heard it was a jilted lover.', 118914, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any leads on the murder of Advisor Vandros?', 'Any leads on the murder of Advisor Vandros?', 118913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kindness? Are you joking? Take away their arcwine and they\'ll come crawling back on their own!', 'Kindness? Are you joking? Take away their arcwine and they\'ll come crawling back on their own!', 118912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Lunastre has the right idea. Showing kindness to the common folk will get them on our side.', 'House Lunastre has the right idea. Showing kindness to the common folk will get them on our side.', 118911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have urgent business I must attend to presently, but I\'ll see you soon.', '', 118910, 0, 42047, 1, 64, 0, 69280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if he did it, I\'d still rather see him become advisor before Ly\'leth Lunastre.', 'Even if he did it, I\'d still rather see him become advisor before Ly\'leth Lunastre.', 118909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coryn Stelleris a murderer? I don\'t believe it!', 'Coryn Stelleris a murderer? I don\'t believe it!', 118908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re not even in the running! They\'ve tied their fortunes to Lunastre.', 'They\'re not even in the running! They\'ve tied their fortunes to Lunastre.', 118907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('House Astravar should fill the open advisor spot, if you ask me.', 'House Astravar should fill the open advisor spot, if you ask me.', 118906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wager commoners are responsible. The lowborn ruin everything!', 'I\'ll wager commoners are responsible. The lowborn ruin everything!', 118905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you at the repose shortly. Travel well.', '', 118904, 0, 42046, 1, 64, 0, 69281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanted to see Ruven Duskmere as the new advisor. Such a pity.', 'I wanted to see Ruven Duskmere as the new advisor. Such a pity.', 118903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s a bleeding heart, I hear. Too sympathetic to the lowborn.', 'She\'s a bleeding heart, I hear. Too sympathetic to the lowborn.', 118902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karzak, I call upon you! FINISH THEM!', '', 118901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure I can support Lunastre for the advisor position. If Ranthos were still around, perhaps, but that daughter of his...', 'Not sure I can support Lunastre for the advisor position. If Ranthos were still around, perhaps, but that daughter of his...', 118900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Sisters, end this nonsense!', '', 118899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take them by ground and air! Felguards and doomguards, attack!', '', 118898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras himself shall recognize my genius. Will his power expand my mind? Or will my mind expand his power?', '', 118897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67734, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many worlds must be out there, needing to be purged. Who better than me to locate them?', '', 118896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67733, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me that defiant aberration\'s head!', '', 118895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion is entirely focused on the task at hand. They need someone with my vision to guide their future.', '', 118894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67732, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is he? Where is my Ailen?', 118893, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, that will keep them under heel!', 'Yes, that will keep them under heel!', 118892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Ailen... you are too young to be involved in this.', 118891, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I simply can\'t fathom why some citizens resist the Grand Magistrix\'s plan.', 'I simply can\'t fathom why some citizens resist the Grand Magistrix\'s plan.', 118890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse these tricks. What have they done with my son?', 118889, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He should have returned by now.', 118888, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are they doing to my boy?', 118887, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where could they have taken him?', 118886, 0, 42045, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As their hunger grows, the rebels will turn on each other like starved rats. Any sympathizers will be exposed and order will be restored!', 118885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67731, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lowborn filth! Perhaps reducing their rations of arcwine will remind them who it is they serve.', 118884, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67730, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 118881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly marvelous! I wonder...', '', 118880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few mortals know the history of Highkeeper Ra, his mastery over the elemental planes, and his relation to the mogu empire.', '', 118879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shal\'dorei will be redeemed.', 118878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your companion waits for you. Return to me at my temple. We shall see if you can succeed where the Thunder King failed.', '', 118877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory! Mend your wounds and regain your strength, for we must stay ready. The Legion\'s efforts have only begun...', '', 118876, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lei Shen could match the Highkeeper\'s storm and fury, but not his mastery over the elements themselves. Perhaps you have that power.', '', 118875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman, the Thunder King took up the weapons of Ra-den, but he could not wield them.', '', 118874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu proved to be Ra-den\'s undoing. Many ages later, corrupted by the curse of flesh and led by Lei Shen the Thunder King, the Highkeeper was overthrown.', '', 118873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revel in our victory, but never forget... time is not our ally. The Legion will return.', '', 118872, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When it came time to war against the Black Empire, Highkeeper Ra created an army of stone to do his bidding. These creatures were called the \"mogu,\" and they called their god \"Ra-den,\" or \"Master Ra.\"', '', 118871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He embedded the key to these realms into his shield, \"The Highkeeper\'s Ward.\" Ra walked among the elemental planes, as both their jailor and master.', '', 118870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together with the titan-forged sorceress Helya, Highkeeper Ra created four elemental realms in which to imprison the wayward elemental lords.', '', 118869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titan Aman\'Thul bestowed upon the Highkeeper a fist of light, a claw forged in the heavens that spoke the language of storms and placed the power of lightning within Ra\'s clenched fist.', '', 118868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bathe in sorrow, demon! You cannot break us! The Burning Legion will fall!', '', 118867, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In ages long past, before the era of the mortal races, Highkeeper Ra reigned over southern Kalimdor.', '', 118866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of your madness, demon! Your time is at an end!', '', 118865, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even more of them come! They must be stopped!', '', 118864, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness grows. Their influence spreads! Oppose them!', '', 118863, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No demon may walk in Hillsbrad unless it answers to me! Spread out! Expunge them!', '', 118862, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory can yet be ours, champions. Move out and rid our lands of this demonic presence!', '', 118861, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure this one pays for its impudence!', '', 118860, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aran\'arcana.', 118859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relieve this demon of its head! The tide will turn in our favor!', '', 118858, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such brutish force! They grow stronger! Do not falter!', '', 118857, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More of them! Do not let fear cause you to shirk your duty!', '', 118856, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons come! Make... them... pay!', '', 118855, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! Give no quarter!', '', 118854, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise, champions! Heed the call of battle! The Burning Legion sets its sights on Tarren Mill.', '', 118853, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forsaken! Allies! The hour to stand against the Burning Legion is at hand! Prepare yourselves!', '', 118852, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve regained control of Southpoint Gate. My forces have been ordered to continue their patrols. Ensure the others are taken care of. We cannot allow the Legion to advance any further!', 118851, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your words are very kind, but I\'m afraid I shouldn\'t be here. I\'ll return shortly.', 118850, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would appear as though I wasn\'t quite ready for these... events. Perhaps I should return when things have settled down.', '', 118849, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Collect enough energy to sate the mana saber for our research and you\'ll be done.', 118848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mana saber will travel very fast in a straight line; but it tends to slow down through turns.', 118847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hop on a mana saber and ride through the ley line spots, it will absorb any energy still present.', 118846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings $n. We\'re keenly interested in a series of ley energy nodes strewn about the area.', 118845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met! A glorious battle awaits us on the Broken Shore! The Warchief expects every hero of the Horde to be sharp and ready. I suggest we use the time for a bit of combat training. Say the word and we\'ll begin!', 118844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard! King Wrynn needs every hero of the Alliance at their best when we face the Legion. As we journey to the Broken Shore, let\'s use the time to brush up on your battle skills. Let me know when you\'re ready to get started.', '', 118843, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve retaken Eastpoint Tower! Continue your efforts. Our lands must be restored.', '', 118842, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nor\'bethos Suramar.', '', 118840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do come again.', '', 118839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s looks around nervously, taking her time before entering the fields.', 118837, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to fry!', '', 118836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kind words, $n. Perhaps our forces could benefit from some fresh supplies. I\'ll gather what I can.', 118835, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empower your master!', '', 118834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lend me your charge!', '', 118833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the hunt begin!', '', 118832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels like these bones of mine haven\'t moved in years! Come, let\'s find some place to talk where we won\'t be caught by a basilisk\'s gaze.', '', 118831, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I be needin\' a bit more trainin\'.', 'Looks like I be needin\' a bit more trainin\'.', 118828, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do ye call those things? I ne\'er saw it comin\'!', 'What do ye call those things? I ne\'er saw it comin\'!', 118827, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t see that comin\'! I\'ll need a bit ta rest me head.', 'Didn\'t see that comin\'! I\'ll need a bit ta rest me head.', 118826, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... That\'s gonna need some stitching. Be back afore this is over!', 'Hmm... That\'s gonna need some stitching. Be back afore this is over!', 118825, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! That\'s gonna leave a mark. Best get myself healed up.', 'Oof! That\'s gonna leave a mark. Best get myself healed up.', 118824, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Asking questions will get you killed. Allow me to demonstrate!', '', 118822, 0, 42022, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not disturb my charges while they enjoy the Menagerie. I will be obliged to remove you.', '', 118820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think they meant to kill me!', '', 118819, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one down! Nicely done. Now get out and find the rest of \'em! Plenty more o\' those things about.', '', 118818, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void sends whispers of our fate, a gruesome death! Light a candle for your loved ones, priest, because the end is near and inescapable.', '', 118815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t hear them, do you? Their laughing... their warning. Our time is coming.', '', 118814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t get away with this, Darion! Tirion... the Light will not allow it!', '', 118813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Nobundo! Let them come!', 'I am ready, Nobundo! Let them come!', 118812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re taunting us, you know. The shadows. They see our end.', '', 118811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons killed most of my shaman. We retreated here to make one last stand.$B$B<Nobundo sighs.>$B$BIf you are here to help, then prepare yourself for a great battle, friend!$B$BI think I hear the next battalion coming. Are you ready?', '', 118810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion\'s body rests below, us in the Hall of Champions. We will join you shortly, Deathlord.', '', 118809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war will not be won without sacrifice. Tirion understood the price of freedom.', '', 118808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re taunting us, you know. The shadows. They see our demise.', '', 118807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready! It\'s comin\' down!', '', 118806, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Who sent you? I asked fer the best $c they could muster, an\' they sent you?$B$BWell then... ye best get ta work. Plenty of demons runnin\' about. Don\'t be shy about it.', '', 118805, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make yerself useful and lend us a hand. Does nobody no good with you just standin\' round here.', '', 118804, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make \'em dead! And be quick about it.', '', 118803, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased to offer you my services.', '', 118802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another shadow priest spouting nonsense. I can\'t say I\'m surprised. Things like this are bound to happen when you linger too close to the void.', '', 118800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot afford to make careless assumptions, Alonsus. We need to find out if this shadow priest speaks the truth.', '', 118799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These acolytes will serve you well.', '', 118798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We have retreated into the collapsed shaft on the northern edge of the Crystal Hall. We are holding back the demon onslaught, but our defenses are quickly falling apart!', '', 118797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, ace. I can\'t risk losing my business over this. I\'ll be back when it\'s safe.', 118784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open the skies!', '', 118783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm clouds gather...', '', 118782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, High Priest. What can I do for you?', '', 118781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Setting', 'Setting', 118780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The terrible light of the outside world hurts your rat\'s eyes! Return to the Underbelly!', 'The terrible light of the outside world hurts your rat\'s eyes! Return to the Underbelly!', 118779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Set up the explosive distractions around Felsoul Hold. I will meet you there.', 118778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you... I will remember this.', 118777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand... He never could stay out of trouble...', 118776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Cough.> Arluin, is that you? It is so dark...', 118775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who is there?', 118774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For now, we shall gather our strength. When the time comes, I trust we can call upon you to help us liberate Suramar.', 118773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without you, none of this would have been possible.', 118772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are on the brink of a new age for the Nightborne.', 118771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Devour this morsel slowly, my pets!', '', 118770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hounds will eat well with this one!', '', 118769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fate worse than death awaits you, little draenei!', '', 118768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fuel for the fel...', '', 118767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh meat dangles for the taking!', '', 118766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feeding time nears, my pets!', '', 118765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful. Jarvox, take care of his execution. Slowly and with great agony, if you will.', '', 118763, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auuuuughhhhhh! Auuuughhhh!', '', 118762, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die by my blade!', '', 118761, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice...or vengeance, paladin? Choose carefully, for hatred leads down a dark path.', '', 118760, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can go no further, Balnazzar. I will have justice for my slain brethren!', '', 118759, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, the defenders of the Light arrive. We have been waiting.', '', 118758, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my thanks, outlander.', 118756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\shaman_pvp_lightninglasso:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:220101|h[Deathbolt]|h|r! Interrupt it!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\shaman_pvp_lightninglasso:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:220101|h[Deathbolt]|h|r! Interrupt it!', 118755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful creatures... you\'ll die screaming!', '', 118754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps there is a new path for us after all...', 118753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not interfere with my research!', 118752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 118751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go to the Court of Stars (Dungeon).', 'I want to go to the Court of Stars (Dungeon).', 118750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions, you\'ve done it! I sense Gul\'dan\'s ritual growing in power, we must hurry.  I can teleport you back to the Nighthold. Are you prepared?', '', 118749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is friend\'s chance! Use altar to summon bad portals, not good ones! Quick!', '', 118748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must find Mathias Shaw and use him to prove that Detheroc has taken his place.', 118747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boros!', 118746, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 68364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord, our scouts report that Balnazzar is in this valley. We can corner him if we act quickly!', '', 118745, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 68388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entire journal is filled with notes on the cave\'s effects on the local flora and fauna, but a few entries catch your eye.\n\nEntry #5:\nThe properties of this cave are interesting. I have brought crystals from my workshop and set them around the area to see what effect the energies here will have on them. \n\nEntry #17: \nAfter attuning with the crystals, I can create barriers of energy capable of negating all forms of magic against me. This discovery could lead to whole armies of invulnerable soldiers! \n\nEntry #23:\nThe barrier is not without its flaws. While attuned to all three crystals, another user could combine their power to negate the barrier. I must work to fix this flaw before I show this work to my superiors.', '', 118744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run!', 'Run!', 118743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astounding.', '', 118742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, $n, at last you\'ve come to prove yourself on the peninsula of Storm\'s Reach! You\'ve shown you are brave, but bravery is not enough here.$b$bThe wild beasts of this ravine care nothing for your past heroics. They answer only to power.$b$bRight now, heroes like you attempt to tame these beasts and best each other in combat. Are you up to the challenge?', '', 118741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through this shallow ravine wander goats, stags, worgs, and bears. Ferocious beasts indeed, but all can be tamed if you demonstrate your strength.$b$bBest the creatures in a fight and they will show you obedience. Mounted atop them, you can send your enemies to their deaths on the rocks below.$b$bBut beware Stormtalon, the dragon that rests along the rocks of Storm\'s Reach. Many say he cannot be tamed. Few have tried. None have survived.', '', 118740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This tree came at a high cost... You are sure it can sustain us?', 118739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get moving!', 'Get moving!', 118738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on here?', 'What is going on here?', 118737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving. We must not keep the Soul Engine waiting.', '', 118736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not be missed. Take comfort in that.', '', 118735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion welcomes your sacrifice. You should feel proud!', '', 118734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outstanding, $n!', '', 118733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop your sniveling! You give your lives for a worthy cause.', '', 118732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get them in the boats. The Soul Engine requires fuel!', '', 118731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you find out?', '', 118730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These orbs of ley energy seem to be following some sort of pattern.  I wonder where they lead?', '', 118729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating! Look here, $n.', '', 118728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Raven\'s Eye is the key to deciphering the SI:7 letter.', 118727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, is it? I have heard your name spoken among the vrykul.$b$bThese cliffs have gone quiet. Return at a later time to prove yourself in combat among the beasts of this peninsula.', '', 118726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcan\'dor will not merely sustain you. By the fruit of its bough, you will be made whole again.', '', 118725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am ready to go wherever is needed, do whatever it takes, to assure the goals of the Uncrowned are met.', 118724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold. The gift of the ancient magi.', '', 118723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A very good day to you, $n. I trust that the affairs of the Uncrowned are in order?', 118722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come... Let us check on the others.', 118721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is gone.', 118720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. You saved us. Please... try to rest.', 118719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We pulled it off... <wheeze> didn\'t we?', '', 118718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... <cough> Tell Vanthir I said... thanks... for every...', '', 118717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not speak! You are wounded-', 118716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> Nghh...', '', 118715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no...', 118714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is Arluin?!', 118713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh... we made it...', 118712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth, get us out of here!', 118711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hhghh-AAAHHHH!!!', '', 118710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arluin! NO!!', 118709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you doing?!', 118708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys owe me...', '', 118707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn it...', '', 118706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is too dangerous! The arcane torrents would tear us apart!', 118705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Erath-omnas!', 118704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank... ye...', '', 118702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nae hope left for any of us, don\'t ye see that?', '', 118701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The manastorm is only getting stronger! We need to shut that thing down!', '', 118700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 118699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all ye\'ve got? I could do this all day!', '', 118698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye won\'t be takin\' this son of Ironforge. Eat lead!', '', 118697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi!', 118696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you want some magic juice? I\'m full.', 118695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wanna play with us? You have to be the bad guy though.', 118694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, you\'re tall!', 118693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not in trouble, right?', 118692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sky is amazing!', 118691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky is amazing!', '', 118690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not in trouble, right?', '', 118689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, you\'re tall!', '', 118688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna play with us? You have to be the bad guy though.', '', 118687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want some magic juice? I\'m full.', '', 118686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi!', '', 118685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easier said than done...', '', 118684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just need to hold out until the storm is over!', 118683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rath, anu\'telar!', 118682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no choice. This must be done.', 118681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, aren\'t we supposed to leave BEFORE the storm starts?', '', 118680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Small words, please.', '', 118679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunger.', '', 118678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must protect me!', 118677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot last too much longer.', 118676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must reach our destination, and quickly.', 118675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am too weak to defend myself. Help!', 118674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! I cannot fight these creatures!', 118673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must hurry.', 118672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found Timirgos!', 'You\'ve found Timirgos!', 118671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fuse is broken. We must trigger the manastorm manually.', 118670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something is wrong... The temporal warp sequencer-', 118669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you gotta do, do it quick! Lots of guards heading our way.', '', 118668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go.', 'I am ready to go.', 118667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to depart to Black Rook Hold?', '', 118666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Place the manastorm generator near the conduit.', 118665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just give me one moment.', '', 118664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never met a lock I could not open.', '', 118663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not looking real conduit-y. You sure the old man knows his stuff?', '', 118661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. We are close.', 118660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde rises.', 'The Horde rises.', 118659, 1, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your assistance is highly valued.', 'Your assistance is highly valued.', 118658, 1, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has only begun.', 'The battle has only begun.', 118657, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Continue to fight. We mustn\'t wane.', 'Continue to fight. We mustn\'t wane.', 118656, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest first, then retribution.', 'Rest first, then retribution.', 118655, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your aide is greatly appreciated.', 'Your aide is greatly appreciated.', 118654, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a debt of gratitude.', 'I owe you a debt of gratitude.', 118653, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are fighting against a power you cannot even comprehend!', '', 118652, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 69446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should watch your tone, Galen.', '', 118651, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 69445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems your... Deathlord... has finally arrived.', '', 118650, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the most important, by far. If we fail, Suramar is doomed.', 118649, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 67336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get in, plant the device, get out before it goes off. Not the most complicated job I have been on.', '', 118648, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is important - once that manastorm gets going, there will be too much interference for me to teleport anyone. You must get out before the storm!', '', 118647, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 67334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teleport you in past the main defenses. When you are ready to leave, activate this beacon so I can locate you and pull you back.', '', 118646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... a little tart, with a hint of- oh, my... there it is.', '', 118645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright everybody, gather in close. Do not be shy now. Group hug.', '', 118644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All set. I believe I have the coordinates we need.', '', 118643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beginning survey...', '', 118642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh and don\'t worry about my usual fee - you can pay me when the job is done.', '', 118641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought you were only interested in lining your pockets.', 118640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will pay for this!', '', 118639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel energy... it is gone...', '', 118638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eredar witch! Defeating her is our last chance to save Hodir!', '', 118637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not succeed, Darion. The Light will not allow it!', '', 118636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have come for the body of Tirion Fordring. Do not make this harder than it needs to be.', '', 118635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not let you destroy my newest pet! When I\'m through with you, you will all serve the Legion!', 118634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord! We\'re under attack... it\'s... it\'s the Ebon Blade!', '', 118633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh and don\'t worry about my usual fee - you can pay me when the job is done.', '', 118632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not sitting this one out. The stakes are too high. So I am in, you got that?', '', 118631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, I am not blind. I see what is happening in Suramar.', '', 118630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard about this crazy job you guys are planning. You weren\'t thinking of leaving me out, were you?', '', 118629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away.', 118628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, ma\'am!', '', 118627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spare us the details, just make it happen. I am counting on you.', 118626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. But it could work! We create a localized warp field, then-', '', 118625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A manastorm, are you insane?', 118624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A manastorm might do the trick.', '', 118623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What could make the leyline flare up?', 118622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their warlocks strike from above!', 118621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If that leyline were to flare up, the surge could theoretically reach all the way back to Shal\'Aran.', 118620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... The main conduit beneath Suramar city pulls ten times what we have here.', 118619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valtrois, can you think of any way to draw more power? Even briefly?', 118618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not enough...', '', 118617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every leyline feed is active and at full power!', 118616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must activate the remaining leyline feeds.', 118615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outlander, speak with Valtrois at once!', 118614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you repair my equipment?', 'Can you repair my equipment?', 118613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without enough power to mature into its final form, it will die.', '', 118612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcan\'dor is at a critical stage.', '', 118611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is happening?', 118610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valtrois finale lines.', 118609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valewalker finale lines.', '', 118608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beneath the arcan\'dor, you will be renewed. There is no other path now.', '', 118607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give Alaina the Charred Locket?', 'Give Alaina the Charred Locket?', 118606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you recognize this locket?', 'Do you recognize this locket?', 118605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Arrogant. In time, you will see.', '', 118604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His locket? Where did you get this?\n\nNo! I don\'t believe you! He can\'t be gone! \n\nCedric, oh my dear Cedric, please come back to me.\n\nDon\'t leave me all alone...', 118603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw you leave for the Broken Shore. Please, tell me, did you see my husband?', 118602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are masters of the arcane, night elf. I think we can handle a tree.', 118601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HATE!!', '', 118600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s continue research on my artifact.', 'Let\'s continue research on my artifact.', 118599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this is what the chamber was built for... but what is it?', 118598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pleasure to see you again, $n.', 118597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To care for the arcan\'dor is a great burden - one which we now share.', '', 118596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A tree, made to feed upon the leyline. It can bring life... or desolation.', '', 118595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an arcan\'dor - a gift of the ancient magi.', '', 118594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seed is awakening. It thirsts.', '', 118593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hgnh... my prize... it grows heavy...', '', 118592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing escapes from my web!', '', 118591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcan\'dor will live again! With its power, we shall return to the surface!', '', 118590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, my children! Feast on their bones!', '', 118589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! What have you done?!', '', 118588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now the power of the arcan\'dor is mine!', '', 118587, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 67273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh a gift fit for a queen. You have my thanks...', '', 118586, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 67272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Hodir! What have they done to you?!', '', 118585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are alive, Boros, and that is what matters. Come, let us return to Light\'s Hope Chapel.', 118584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A peace we so desperately need for ourselves.', 118583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67466, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many paid for my foolish mistake. This is not the way of righteousness, and I see that now.', '', 118582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Highlord. I... I was blinded by revenge.', '', 118581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The gryphon\'s wings flap in anticipation of the coming battle.>', '<The gryphon\'s wings flap in anticipation of the coming battle.>', 118580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin the assault on Broken Shore!', 'Let\'s begin the assault on Broken Shore!', 118579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Leave and join the assault on Broken Shore>', '<Leave and join the assault on Broken Shore>', 118578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, champion.', 'Hail, champion.', 118577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something which gave you peace...', 118576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67464, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There... you found something, didn\'t you?', 118575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67463, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Lady watch over you, $p.', 'Dark Lady watch over you, $p.', 118574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You remember. You were there.', '', 118573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King\'s honor, $p.', 'King\'s honor, $p.', 118572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just have to wake them up.', 118571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems Thalyssra and I had the same idea - the old leyline feeds might keep us alive, if barely.', 118570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Out here, so far from the Nightwell, we must settle for any source of magic we can find.', 118569, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let our eternal foe tremble before the fury and destruction you unleash!', '', 118568, 0, 42710, 4, 64, 0, 69019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your blade before the forge. Watch it infuse the weapon with its might!', '', 118567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Such wicked glory awaits you! With this weapon, you will bind the Legion to our will! Even Kil\'jaeden will cower like a craven dog!', '', 118566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature\'s essence flows through your weapon! In your hands, it shall make the dark forces threatening Azeroth tremble! Andu-falah-dor!', '', 118565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your weapon serve you well on the path to victory!', '', 118564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have ever been a champion of the Light. Now you hold a weapon truly worthy of the noble cause you serve!', '', 118563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now those are weapons truly worthy of one who commands the Shadows! May your blades strike silent and true.', '', 118562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May this blessing illuminate your path to victory, $ct!', '', 118561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel bat screeches in pain as you drive your weapon into it!', '', 118560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris:20|t%s interrupts the Anomaly with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:212115|h[Temporal Smash]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris:20|t%s interrupts the Anomaly with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:212115|h[Temporal Smash]|h|r!', 118559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a supply of Order Hall Resources.', 'I need a supply of Order Hall Resources.', 118558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Legion Beta! \n\nI can provide you with select provisions for your Order Hall.', '', 118557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go!', '', 118556, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must learn why the old arcan\'dor failed. Its shattered bones may have the answers.', '', 118555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in this state, the arcan\'dor continues to grow.', '', 118554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many years ago, exiles from the shielded city came to rest here.', '', 118553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the temple of Fal\'adora. We must study the past to preserve our future.', '', 118552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, quick, through my portal! Flee!', '', 118551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find me when this is over, $n. The Frostwolf could use a $c like you.', '', 118550, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if they come back?', '', 118549, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d rather be safe than dead!', '', 118548, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just, uh... checkin\' to see if it\'s clear up here. Ayep... it\'s clear alright.', '', 118547, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last time you said that one of those demons almost ate me alive!', '', 118546, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know... It doesn\'t look too safe to me.', '', 118545, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s not the time. Get down already!', 'Now\'s not the time. Get down already!', 118544, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait all day. Someone\'s gotta fix these shredders.', 'I can\'t wait all day. Someone\'s gotta fix these shredders.', 118543, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got our own muscle right here. Trust me! We\'re safe.', 'We got our own muscle right here. Trust me! We\'re safe.', 118542, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon! We can\'t wait all day! It\'s safe. I promise!', 'C\'mon! We can\'t wait all day! It\'s safe. I promise!', 118541, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you get down here already? We got work to do!', 'Would you get down here already? We got work to do!', 118540, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gladly serve if you will have me. I have access to all of Razelikh\'s knowledge. Allow me to aid you in the war against the Legion.', '', 118539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest, you know. Your champion came and retrieved me, and here I am.', '', 118538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next thing I knew, we were expelled from the Twisting Nether, summoned by the Burning Legion to the invasion of Azeroth. At the Felblaze Ingress, I did my best to disrupt their efforts.', '', 118537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within this new body, our souls are still entwined in eternal conflict. I am in control... most of the time, though it is a constant struggle. We demon hunters are accustomed to containing the demon within.', '', 118536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some time later, the blade was destroyed. Our souls escaped only to be sent to the Twisting Nether. However, Razelikh has a very powerful demon soul. As happens with many dreadlords, a new body eventually formed. It is said that they can only truly be killed within the Twisting Nether.', '', 118535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, the Defiler possessed me, and in turn, I sacrificed myself so that we both would die. Our souls were trapped within an enchanted blade to battle for all eternity.', '', 118534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Razelikh the Defiler was a dreadlord who had been charged with the conquest of the Blasted Lands. I traveled there to stop him. But, that did not turn out the way that I had planned.', '', 118533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where to begin? I suppose the only thing that matters was the battle between me and the demon.', '', 118532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Yes, tell me everything, Loramus.', 'Yes, tell me everything, Loramus.', 118531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I suppose an explanation is in order if there is ever to be any trust between us.', '', 118530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
