('', 'Victory Rush is available! Use it now!', 118258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Victory Rush!', 118257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whirlwind can damage multiple enemies!', 118256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Whirlwind!', 118255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your opponents may try to overwhelm you with numbers, but they underestimate your true might!', 118254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whirlwind allows you to swing your weapon in wide arcs, cutting a swath of carnage into all enemies around you.', 118253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Whirlwind to take out this group of enemies.', 118252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the heat of battle there will be times you need to move quickly to avoid danger... or confront it!', 118251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroic Leap allows you to bound across the battlefield to accomplish either goal.', 118250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Practice using Heroic Leap.', 118249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agony is an appropriate name for your first attack ability.', 118248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agony deals more and more damage over time, making it a great way to start a fight.', 118247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Agony on the target dummy.', 118246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you cast Agony, you don\'t need to cast it again until your original spell is close to expiring.', 118245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will inflict suffering on anyone foolish enough to fight you.', 118244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corruption is a spell that afflicts its target, dealing shadow damage as long as the affliction lasts.', 118243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Corruption on this target dummy.', 118242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you cast Corruption, you don\'t need to cast it again until your original spell is close to expiring.', 118241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After afflicting your target with Agony and Corruption, you can begin to drain the very life from them.', 118240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drain Soul is the most frequent attack you will use, healing you as it damages your foe.', 118239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Drain Soul on the target dummy.', 118238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As Agony damages your enemy, it has a chance to generate a Soul Shard. You can use these shards to empower new abilities.', 118237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unstable Affliction is a powerful spell that deals damage over time like Agony and Corruption, but uses a Soul Shard to deal more damage.', 118236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Unstable Affliction on this target dummy.', 118235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While Unstable Affliction deals damage over time, every re-cast increases its potency. Use this attack whenever you can!', 118234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But please, don\'t hurt them too badly. I need them for later.', 118233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an affliction warlock.', 118232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agony has expired! Cast it again!', 118231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Agony!', 118230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Recast Agony just before it expires to preserve its amplified damage!', 118229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corruption has expired! Cast it again!', 118228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Corruption!', 118227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Summon your Doomguard now!', 118226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Drain Life on your target!', 118225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Drain Life!', 118224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Fear!', 118223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re low on health, use your Healthstone!', 118222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Life Tap to replenish your mana!', 118221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Voidwalker has died. Use Summon Voidwalker to bring it back.', 118220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unstable Affliction is available! Cast it now!', 118219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Unstable Affliction!', 118218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have maximum Soul Shards. Cast Unstable Affliction!', 118217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Affliction warlocks use shadow magic and disease to wear down their enemies, then drain their very life essences to empower themselves.', 118216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your command of dark magic enables you to summon a demon servant to do your bidding.', 118215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Summon Voidwalker to summon your demonic minion.', 118214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many spells have a heavy mana cost. But you have a clever way around this problem.', 118213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life Tap allows you to steal your own life force to replenish your mana. Don\'t worry, you can always drain the life from your opponent to heal.', 118212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Life Tap to replenish your mana reserves.', 118211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At times you may find yourself overwhelmed by multiple enemies, or a single enemy that is too strong for you.', 118210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To force a foe to stop fighting for a short time, utilize fear itself to strike terror into their heart.', 118209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Fear to frighten my warrior.', 118208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While greater demons like Infernals and Doomguards cannot be controlled for long, you can summon one to your side for short periods of time to fight for you.', 118207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t do this often, so save this demon for an emergency.', 118206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Summon Doomguard now to summon this demon.', 118205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A portion of your power can be coalesced into a Healthstone. If you take damage, ingest the Healthstone to recover health.', 118204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Create Healthstone.', 118203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, heal some of the damage you\'ve taken with your Healthstone.', 118202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, heal some of the damage you\'ve taken with your Healthstone.', 118201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Astounding! Your mastery over demons has given you great power!', 118200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A well-prepared warlock can survive almost anything... even death!', 118199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using your Soulstone ability preserves your very soul for later. Don\'t worry, you weren\'t using it anyway! With your soul stored, you can return from the dead at will.', 118198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Soulstone to survive death.', 118197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an enhancement shaman you channel the elemental forces directly into your weapons to make yourself a furious melee combatant, beating down your foes with the power of flame, earth, and storm.', 118196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The first attack we\'ll try is Flametongue, which emblazes your weapons and scorches your enemy with fire.', 118195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Flametongue on the target dummy.', 118194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that your weapons are burning, you can focus on your primary attack.', 118193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rockbiter empowers your weapons with the forces of earth to deal damage.', 118192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Rockbiter on the target dummy.', 118191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using Rockbiter generates Maelstrom, a resource that powers stronger attacks.', 118190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lava Lash uses Maelstrom to charge your off-hand weapon with lava, allowing you to deal a mighty blow.', 118189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lava Lash on the target dummy.', 118188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your most powerful Maelstrom-fueled ability is Stormstrike.', 118187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to use Stormstrike whenever Stormbringer triggers.', 118186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Stormstrike on the target dummy after Stormbringer triggers.', 118185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Stormstrike now!', 118184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are fighting multiple enemies, it is time to unleash the full fury of the storm!', 118183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crash Lightning deals damage to all targets in front of you. Hitting multiple enemies empowers your weapons, dealing even more damage!', 118182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Crash Lightning to dispatch this group of enemies.', 118181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you find yourself taking too much punishment in a fight, Shamanistic Rage reduces incoming damage for a short period of time. Try it!', 118180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Shamanistic Rage to reduce incoming damage.', 118179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show me you fight with the fury of the elements!', 118178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
