INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'As an elemental shaman you commune with ancient spirits and command primal elemental forces.', 118162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Flame Shock ability will set your enemies ablaze, burning them while you cast other spells.', 118161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Always remember to use Flame Shock to keep your enemies burning.', 118160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Flame Shock on the target dummy.', 118159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why stop with fire? Once your enemies are burning, you can hurl molten lava at them.', 118158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using Lava Burst while your enemies are affected by Flame Shock increases its damage.', 118157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lava Burst on the target dummy.', 118156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurling lightning from your hands is your main weapon for overcoming enemies.', 118155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lightning Bolt whenever other abilities are not available.', 118154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lightning Bolt on the target dummy.', 118153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Earth Shock is one of your most powerful spells. Casting it requires Maelstrom, a resource generated by your other attacks.', 118152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Earth Shock on this target dummy.', 118151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use your Lightning Bolt on the Target Dummy until you have the maximum amount of Maelstrom, then use Earth Shock.', 118150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you become surrounded in combat, use Thunderstorm to knock enemies back and give yourself some breathing room.', 118149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Thunderstorm to knock away the enemies surrounding you.', 118148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unleash the elements to achieve victory, $p!', 118147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an elemental shaman.', 118146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Chain Lightning!', 118145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are at maximum Maelstrom! Use Earth Shock!', 118144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Earth Shock!', 118143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait until you are at maximum Maelstrom to use Earth Shock!', 118142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Fire Elemental!', 118141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Flame Shock to burn your enemy!', 118140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Flame Shock!', 118139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only use Flame Shock when it\'s about to expire!', 118138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heal yourself with Healing Surge!', 118137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lava Burst while your enemy is burning!', 118136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lava Burst!', 118135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using Lava Burst after your enemy is burning from Flame Shock increases its damage!', 118134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Lightning Bolt!', 118133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Thunderstorm to knock enemies away!', 118132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever wanted to turn someone into a frog? Hex allows you to do just that!', 118131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your target won\'t attack you while it\'s a frog, but the effect is temporary. The enemy will revert back to its original form if attacked.', 118130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turn my warrior into a frog!', 118129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are times you\'ll face multiple opponents on the battlefield. Fortunately, you have a potent ability called Chain Lightning.', 118128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you strike an enemy with Chain Lightning, it jumps to additional foes near your target, damaging all of them.', 118127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Chain Lightning against several enemies at once.', 118126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve taken damage, but this presents no problem for you.', 118125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just as the elements can destroy, they also have the power to restore.', 118124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Healing Surge to replenish your health to full.', 118123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a master of the elements, you are able to coalesce primal elemental forces into physical form to aid you in battle.', 118122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Fire Elemental now to summon your elemental!', 118121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an assassination rogue you specialize in striking from the shadows, dispatching foes with a variety of poisons and bleeding attacks.', 118120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Before we get started we need to apply poison to your weapon.', 118119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Deadly Poison to coat your weapon with poison for one hour.', 118118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assassins favor trickery and cunning. And what\'s trickier than attacking before your target sees you coming?', 118117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stealth makes you invisible to most enemies. When in Stealth, you can close the distance to enemies undetected.', 118116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Stealth to fade from view.', 118115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an assassin, you weaken your enemies before finishing them off.', 118114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The best way to start a fight is with Garrote, a debilitating bleeding attack that causes your enemy to take damage over time.', 118113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Garrote on this target dummy.', 118112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always remember to use Garrote to keep your enemies bleeding.', 118111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your main attack is called Mutilate. It deals damage as well as generates combo points that can be used for powerful finishing moves.', 118110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Mutilate to attack the target dummy.', 118109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that you\'ve built up 5 combo points, it\'s time to use Rupture.', 118108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
