('', 'In those cases, a little bit of extra protection is needed. Ice Barrier creates a shield of ice to absorb enemy attacks.', 117953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Ice Barrier to reduce incoming damage.', 117952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need to get out of a fight in a hurry? Invisibility is a great spell for getting out of a sticky situation.', 117951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use it and enemies will be unable to target you, letting you escape form combat. But be careful! It doesn\'t last long.', 117950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Invisibility to escape combat.', 117949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show me the raw power and superiority you wield!', 117948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an ice mage.', 117947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Blizzard!', 117946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Frost Nova!', 117945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need to freeze your enemy in place before they reach you.', 117944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Frost Nova!', 117943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Frostbolt!', 117942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Frozen Orb is available! Cast it now!', 117941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Frozen Orb!', 117940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Ice Barrier!', 117939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fingers of Frost has triggered! Use Ice Lance now!', 117938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Ice Lance!', 117937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your target is frozen! Use Ice Lance!', 117936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait until you have Fingers of Frost, or your target is frozen, to use Ice Lance.', 117935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Invisibility!', 117934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Water Elemental has died. Cast Summon Water Elemental to call it back!', 117933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battlefield can be a dangerous place, so moving about is crucial to your survival.', 117932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But using your legs is so mundane! Fortunately, you have a spell that befits a master of the magical arts.', 117931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blink allows you to teleport a short distance to avoid danger or close in on an enemy.', 117930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Practice using Blink.', 117929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What if you could freeze foes in their tracks, preventing them from even reaching you?', 117928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Frost Nova freezes nearby enemies in place, allowing you to move away and destroy them safely. For now, let\'s just practice freezing them in place.', 117927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freeze my warrior using Frost Nova.', 117926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember that Ice Lance does extra damage to frozen targets, so using Frost Nova and Ice Lance together is a powerful tactic.', 117925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 75237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are master of dealing damage to many enemies at once.', 117924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can pelt a target location with shards of ice by using a potent spell called Blizzard. Great name, don\'t you think?', 117923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Blizzard to dispatch this group of enemies.', 117922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now let\'s see what other forces of nature you command.', 117876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dire Beast will allow you to summon a nearby beast to join the fight and attack your target for a short time.', 117875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Dire Beast on the target dummy.', 117874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure you\'re ready to join in on the action. Cobra Shot is your primary ranged attack, pummeling your enemy while your pet keeps their attention.', 117873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Cobra Shot on the target dummy.', 117872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Bestial Wrath while attacking the target dummy.', 117871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When in combat, Bestial Wrath sends you and your pet into a frenzy of rage that increases your damage for a short time.', 117870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While under its effects, using Dire Beast will shorten the time before you can trigger Bestial Wrath again.', 117869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prove to me you have the necessary skill and cunning required to hunt any prey!', 117868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as a beast master hunter.', 117867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bestial Wrath is available! Use it now!', 117866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Bestial Wrath!', 117865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Call your pet!', 117864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Cobra Shot!', 117863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dire Beast is available! Use it now!', 117862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Dire Beast!', 117861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill Command is available! Use it now!', 117860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Kill Command!', 117859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet is hurt! Use Mend Pet!', 117858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Multi-Shot!', 117857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beast master hunters possess a deep bond with their pets, calling and bolstering them in battle while striking at foes with ranged attacks.', 117856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alongside your trusty pet, you are the master of your environment. Call Pet will summon your pet to your side.', 117855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Call Pet to bring your pet to battle.', 117854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sending your pet to attack and distract an enemy gives you more time to line up your ranged attacks.', 117853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, your pet is resilient! Using Kill Command will cause your pet to perform a strong attack, and is also a great way to initiate a fight.', 117852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Kill Command multiple times on the target dummy.', 117851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet has been wounded! Fortunately, you can aid your trusty companion.', 117850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mend Pet will allow you to heal damage your pet has taken.', 117849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Mend Pet to heal your pet.', 117848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet has died! When this happens, your Mend Pet ability changes to Revive Pet, which will bring your faithful companion back to life.', 117847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes you\'ll find yourself outnumbered. When you do, you can unleash destruction upon a host of adversaries at once!', 117846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Multi-shot allows you to fire a spread of projectiles hitting several enemies near your target.', 117845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using this attack causes your pet to cleave multiple enemies as well.', 117844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Multi-Shot to dispatch all the enemies.', 117843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the greatest adventurers sometimes find themselves in over their heads.', 117842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When facing certain defeat, use Feign Death to trick your enemies into thinking you\'re no longer a threat.', 117841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Feign Death to trick my soldier into breaking off his attack.', 117840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As an unholy death knight you command the powers of disease and death.', 117775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disease wears your enemy down while your strong melee attacks finish them off.', 117774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But your greatest ally is death itself. Raise Dead will animate a corpse to serve as your ghoulish minion.', 117773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should always try to have a minion with you.', 117772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Raise Dead to summon your minion.', 117771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The best way to start a fight is to infect your enemy with a host of diseases from a distance.', 117770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outbreak will deal damage over time and unleashes a Virulent Plague that spreads to nearby enemies.', 117769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fallen! Your allies retreat.', '%s has fallen! Your allies retreat.', 117768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Outbreak on the target dummy.', 117767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that your enemy is reeling from a miasma of plagues, it\'s time to strike up close.', 117766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Festering Strike deals damage and inflicts Festering Wounds on your target.', 117765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Festering Strike on the target dummy.', 117764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that looks like it hurts! After infecting your target with Festering Strike, you are ready to burst the lesions you\'ve caused using Scourge Strike!', 117763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Festering Strike followed by Scourge Strike is a one-two punch few enemies can withstand.', 117762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Scourge Strike on the target dummy after it is infected with Festering Strike.', 117761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to only use Scourge Strike when your target is affected by Festering Wounds.', 117760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your attacks build Runic Power that can be used to cast Death Coil, a spell that hurls a blast of unholy energy at your target and restores energy to your ghoul minion.', 117759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Death Coil on the target dummy.', 117758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your attacks sometimes allow you to cast Death Coil without costing Runic Power. Take advantage of this when you can.', 117757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your undead minion is a valuable asset in battle. Dark Transformation allows you to temporarily transform your ghoul into a hulking monstrosity with increased power and abilities. Try it out!', '', 117756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Dark Transformation to empower your ghoul.', '', 117755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a death knight, you control the battlefield!', '', 117754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death and Decay to corrupt the ground beneath your feet, dealing damage to all foes in the affected area and empowering some of your attacks to hit additional targets.', '', 117753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death and Decay to dispatch the group of minions.', '', 117752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When taking excessive damage in battle, Death Strike can help even the odds.', 117751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Its dark power damages your foe and recovers a portion of your health.', 117750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Death Strike on the target to recover some of your health.', 117749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show me you\'ve mastered the powers of darkness!', 117748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an unholy death knight.', 117747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Army of the Dead!', 117746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is a good time to cast Dark Transformation!', '', 117745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re facing multiple enemies. Try using Death and Decay!', '', 117744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death Coil is free!  Cast it now!', 117743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Death Coil!', 117742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Death Strike!', 117741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your target is not infested with Festering Wounds. Use Festering Strike now!', 117740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Festering Strike!', 117739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outbreak has expired from your target, use it now!', 117738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cast Outbreak!', 117737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Virulent Plague has expired from your target. Use Outbreak now!', 117736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your minion is dead. Cast Raise Dead to summon a new minion.', 117735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Scourge Strike!', 117734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Using Scourge Strike after Festering Strike is a potent combination!', 117733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your target has maximum Festering Wounds. Use Scourge Strike!', 117732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some foes would prefer to keep you at arm\'s length.', 117731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death Grip allows you to reach out to a distant target and pull them toward you. No enemy can escape your icy grasp!', 117730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Death Grip to pull my warrior to you.', 117729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death Grip can be used from a good distance away. Try moving further away from the target and using it.', 117728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being able to call upon the powers of death means you rarely need to be outnumbered.', 117727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Army of the Dead raises a swarm of ghouls to attack anything and everything near you.', 117726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This powerful ability cannot be used often, so save it for an emergency.', 117725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use Army of the Dead now to summon in your minions.', 117724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect her while I heal her injuries!', 117723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroic Leap allows you to bound across the battlefield to accomplish either goal.', '', 117722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whirlwind allows you to swing your weapon in wide arcs, cutting a swath of carnage into all enemies around you.', '', 117721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleave allows you to attack several enemies that are in front of you. For every enemy hit, your next Whirlwind does additional damage!', '', 117720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Victory Rush ability can only be used during this time, restoring health as you strike a new enemy.', '', 117719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal Strike is such an attack. Use it whenever it is available.', '', 117718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you cannot defeat an opponent that\'s out of reach. Fortunately, you have a skill to solve this problem.', '', 117717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mathias Shaw led our SI:7 team on a secret recon of the island. We were awaiting extraction.', 117716, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 71651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using your Soulstone ability preserves your very soul for later. Don\'t worry, you weren\'t using it anyway! With your soul stored, you can return from the dead at will.', '', 117715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot do this often, so save this demon for an emergency.', '', 117714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To force a foe to stop fighting for a short time, utilize fear itself to strike terror into their heart.', '', 117713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life Tap allows you to steal your own life force to replenish your mana. Don\'t worry, you can always drain the life from your opponent to heal.', '', 117712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your command of dark magic enables you to summon a demon servant to do your bidding.', '', 117711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unstable Affliction is a powerful spell that deals damage over time like Agony and Corruption, but uses a Soul Shard to deal more damage.', '', 117710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drain Soul is the most frequent attack you will use, healing you as it damages your foe.', '', 117709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corruption is a spell that afflicts its target, dealing shadow damage as long as the affliction lasts.', '', 117708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agony deals more and more damage over time, making it a great way to start a fight.', '', 117707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This presents no problem for you however. The Light gives you the power to restore the health of yourself or your allies.', '', 117706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortunately, you are not defenseless in such cases. Psychic Scream terrifies nearby opponents, causing them to run away in fear.', '', 117705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always remember to maintain your shield during fights.', '', 117704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of your most useful defensive abilities is Power Word: Shield, which absorbs all damage from attacks when active.', '', 117703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is your most frequently used damage spell, best used when Penance is not available.', '', 117702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Penance is a potent spell that deals damage to your enemies. Use Penance whenever it is available.', '', 117701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow Word: Pain taints your foes with shadow energy, wounding them slowly over time.', '', 117700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... cannot be...', 117699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot... resist...', 117698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will scorch the world!', 117697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oblivion awaits!', 117696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where one falls... two shall rise.', 117695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are... endless.', 117694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stop us all...', 117693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last, some fitting prey...', 117692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will deliver your head to Gul\'dan myself.', 117691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not toy with us!', 117690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will conquer all!', 117689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, some amusement.', 117688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your soul will serve us for eternity!', 117687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Annihilate them!', 117686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your conviction allows you to heal yourself and your allies. Flash of Light is a cornerstone of your healing arsenal.', '', 117685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Divine Shield prevents incoming attacks from harming you.', '', 117684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash this divine magic through Templar\'s Verdict, a powerful melee attack that infuses your weapon with the strength of the Light.', '', 117683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once your foe has closed to striking range, unleash your weapon using Crusader Strike.', '', 117682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As your enemy closes in, unleash a potent mid-range attack called Blade of Justice.', '', 117681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your devotion to the Light empowers you to hurl a mighty hammer of Judgment at your foes.', '', 117680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks are a mix of ranged spells and melee that build up and unleash Holy Power.', '', 117679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. I will find you soon...', 117678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Enjoy your freedom... for now.', 117677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. My prey can wait...', 117676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do we have here? Someone hiding?', 117675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a spy among us.', 117674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run, for now. You will only die tired.', 117673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh.> Very well. I am Valtrois.', 117672, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you find yourself in trouble during combat, you can summon two feral wolf spirits to fight at your side.', '', 117671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crash Lightning deals damage to all targets in front of you. Hitting multiple enemies empowers your weapons, dealing even more damage!', '', 117670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to use Stormstrike whenever Stormbringer triggers.', '', 117669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lava Lash uses Maelstrom to charge your off-hand weapon with lava, allowing you to deal a mighty blow.', '', 117668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rockbiter empowers your weapons with the forces of earth to deal damage.', '', 117667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first attack we\'ll try is Flametongue, which emblazes your weapons and scorches your enemy with fire.', '', 117666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as the elements can destroy, they also have the power to restore.', '', 117665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you strike an enemy with Chain Lightning, it jumps to additional foes near your target, damaging all of them.', '', 117664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your target won\'t attack you while it\'s a frog, but the effect is temporary. The enemy will revert back to its original form if attacked.', '', 117663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Lightning Bolt whenever other abilities are not available.', '', 117662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Lava Burst while your enemies are affected by Flame Shock increases its damage.', '', 117661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Flame Shock ability will set your enemies ablaze, burning them while you cast other spells.', '', 117660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes a strategic retreat is necessary so you can live to fight another day.', '', 117659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fan of Knives unleashes damage on all enemies encircling you. It will also generate a combo point for every enemy hit.', '', 117658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By using Shadowstep, you will remain in stealth and be poised to strike.', '', 117657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crimson Vial is an alchemical concoction that will restore a portion of your health.', '', 117656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your target is already affected by Rupture, then using Envenom with 5 combo points deals good damage and maximizes the effect of your poisons.', '', 117655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whenever you use Rupture with 5 combo points, you will do a strong bleeding attack that damages enemies over time.', '', 117654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best way to start a fight is with Garrote, a debilitating bleeding attack that causes your enemy to take damage over time.', '', 117653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darion Mograine! What is the meaning of this?!', '', 117652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your blade before the forge. Watch it infuse the weapon with its might!', '', 117651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we get started we need to apply poison to your weapon.', '', 117650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use it whenever it is available.', '', 117649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your primary means of mobility is Roll, which causes you to quickly roll a good distance in whatever direction you are moving.', '', 117648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use it whenever you meet someone you don\'t like, although you might want to save it for your toughest enemies!', '', 117647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find yourself facing three or more opponents, tap your inner spirit to duplicate yourself, making you your own ally! Your allied selves will attack enemies automatically.', '', 117646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take one enemy out of the fight by paralyzing him! Paralyze will knock out an enemy for a short time, but the foe will recover if he takes any damage.', '', 117645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flying Serpent Kick to launch yourself at your enemy. Using it a second time while you are in the air will end your flight and deal damage to enemies nearby.', '', 117644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will also hit additional enemies near your target. Use Fists of Fury whenever it\'s available, or if you face multiple enemies.', '', 117643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your legend grows, and it is fitting that the fearsome artifact you wield increases in potency as well.', '', 117642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It hits much harder than Tiger Palm, so use Blackout Kick to spend your extra Chi.', '', 117641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Start by using your primary attack, Tiger Palm, to deal damage and generate Chi.', '', 117640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This builds up Chi, a resource that allows you to unleash your most powerful attacks.', '', 117639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought well.  I was wrong to question my father\'s choice. The forces of Ulduar will stand behind you if you are willing to aid us in finding Hodir.', '', 117638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68402, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are gone... the portal is closed!', '', 117637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68112, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step before the Altar of the Eternal Hunt. Let it infuse your weapon with power and make it mightier than ever before!', 117636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh, I recognize that symbol. So Thalyssra has recruited an outlander to our cause... Are we truly so desperate?', 117635, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 67478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using this attack causes your pet to cleave multiple enemies as well.', '', 117634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hodir has always been too impulsive for his own good.\n\nHis judgment was accurate about you, however. I did not think it possible for a mere mortal to be worthy of Odyn\'s blessing. You are an enigma, $n.\n\nI will teleport you out of here when you are ready.', '', 117633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When facing certain defeat, use Feign Death to trick your enemies into thinking you\'re no longer a threat.', '', 117632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Multi-shot allows you to fire a spread of projectiles hitting several enemies near your target.', '', 117631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mend Pet will allow you to heal damage your pet has taken.', '', 117630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, I will be killing you now. Any last words?', 117629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, your pet is resilient! Using Kill Command will cause your pet to perform a strong attack, and is also a great way to initiate a fight.', '', 117628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There we are. Open at last.', 117627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alongside your trusty pet, you are the master of your environment. Call Pet will summon your pet to your side.', '', 117626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While under its effects, using Dire Beast will shorten the time before you can trigger Bestial Wrath again.', '', 117625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there! Outlander! Be a dear and step on that other switch, will you?', 117624, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 67475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dire Beast will allow you to summon a nearby beast to join the fight and attack your target for a short time.', '', 117623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you\'ve taken damage, use Regrowth to restore your health.', '', 117622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dash increases your movement speed significantly for a short time. It can\'t be used often, so save it for when you really need it.', '', 117621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to go, friend! Here!', '', 117620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrash will damage all nearby enemies, causing them to bleed for a short time.', '', 117619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hodir has always been too impulsive for his own good. \n\nIt appears that he was right about you, however. I did not think it possible for a mere mortal to be worthy of Odyn\'s blessings. You are an enigma, $n.', '', 117618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swipe deals damage to all nearby foes, but that damage is increased if your targets are bleeding. It\'s a good idea to use Thrash and Swipe together.', '', 117617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survival Instincts reduces incoming damage for a short time. Save it for when you really need it!', '', 117616, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entangling Roots will cause plant roots to spring from the ground and hold the target in place for a short time.', '', 117615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like Ferocious Bite, Rip is a finishing move, and is best used when you have 5 combo points.', '', 117614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an alternative to Ferocious Bite, Rip can be used to deal bleeding damage over time to your target, and is a good ability to spend combo points on early in a fight.', '', 117613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiger\'s Fury restores some energy and also increases your damage for a short time.', '', 117612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Your betrayal only delays the inevitable! I will save a special prison for you when all you know is destroyed and you lie broken before me.', '', 117611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66434, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Shred ability also deals extra damage to bleeding targets, so these are great abilities to use together.', '', 117610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 75233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rake will cause your target to bleed, wounding them over time.', '', 117609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to use it when you have a full 5 combo points.', '', 117608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ferocious Bite is a finishing move that deals increased damage the more combo points you have.', '', 117607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though powerful on its own, using Shred on a bleeding target increases its damage, so try keeping rake up.', '', 117606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon they\'ll be weak enough for you to go for the throat with a mighty finishing move.', '', 117605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entangling Roots will cause plant roots to spring from the ground and hold the target in place for a short time.', '', 117604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lunar Strike deals damage directly to your target, but also deals damage to nearby foes.', '', 117603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will be... explosive.', '', 117602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drugon should\'ve stayed hidden on his peak. Thank you champion, my people are safer because of you.', 117601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalyssra finale lines.', 117600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oculeth finale lines.', '', 117599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drugon the Frostblood is an ancient foe of my people and has been spotted within Snowblind Cliffs. Put an end to this creature.', 117598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we can begin to restore the ancient network. If you find any of my old beacons out there, be sure to activate them!', '', 117597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Celestial Alignment causes the celestial bodies to align, increasing the damage of your solar and lunar spells for a short time.', '', 117596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starsurge costs Astral Power, so use Solar Wrath to build up your reserves.', '', 117595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Solar Wrath is a ranged ability that deals damage and generates Astral Power, a resource used to fuel more powerful attacks.', '', 117594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These attacks deal their damage over time, and either makes an excellent start to a battle.', '', 117593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can shapeshift into Moonkin form, which increases both your damage and defense.', '', 117592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come! Begin the incantations. Focus the scepter on the altar. Today we usher in the end of this world!', '', 117591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66432, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not surprising that you came out the victor. I considered aiding Allaris against you, but your resourcefulness may prove useful. Consider this... a promotion. Do not disappoint me!', '', 117590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66431, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oculeth, can you restore the teleporters in this chamber?', 117589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slain... by a lowborn... how beneath me...', '', 117588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have yet to experience my true power!', '', 117586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already on it! Once our friend completes the survey, we will have our first connection.', '', 117584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can pelt a target location with shards of ice by using a potent spell called Blizzard. Great name, don\'t you think?', '', 117583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we are to be foes after all. Pity, you would have made an excellent servant!', '', 117582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frost Nova freezes nearby enemies in place, allowing you to move away and destroy them safely. For now, let\'s just practice freezing them in place.', '', 117581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blink allows you to teleport a short distance to avoid danger or close in on an enemy.', '', 117580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But using your legs is so mundane! Fortunately, you have a spell that befits a master of the magical arts.', '', 117579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use it and enemies will be unable to target you, letting you escape form combat. But be careful! It doesn\'t last long.', '', 117578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In those cases, a little bit of extra protection is needed. Ice Barrier creates a shield of ice to absorb enemy attacks.', '', 117577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, I only need ONE of you for the ritual. \"Discuss\" the matter quickly, and be ready...', '', 117576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66429, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, though, as it hits all enemies in its path, not just your target.', '', 117575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hodir, wait!', '', 117574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68111, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_RapidRegeneration:20|tSnaggle begins a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:219848|h[Pistol Barrage]|h|r! Leap to the ground!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_RapidRegeneration:20|tSnaggle begins a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:219848|h[Pistol Barrage]|h|r! Leap to the ground!', 117573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostbolt occasionally triggers the Fingers of Frost effect, which gives a huge boost to Ice Lance damage. Let\'s test it out.', '', 117572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice Lance\'s real power lies in using it against a frozen target, which greatly increases its damage.', '', 117571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This long-range attack will damage and slow your enemies, and has a chance to empower other attacks.', '', 117570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mastery of ice allows you to call forth a water elemental pet, so we\'ll start there.', '', 117569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... great master? Which of us is to wield the Scepter?', '', 117568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66428, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will go through the portal and act as a stabilizing anchor on Argus. You will focus the ritual energy through the scepter, widening the breach and creating a myriad of portals.', '', 117567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66427, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using the Book, the Eye, and the Scepter, we will amplify this portal and open gateways to countless other demon worlds. The Legion\'s full might will fall upon this pitiful planet!', '', 117566, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66426, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have both done well to acquire these artifacts. Your positions in the Shadow Council are all but assured.', '', 117565, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66425, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the Book is here at last... borne by one whose meddlesome handiwork I know well! Come to join the winning side, \"hero\"?', '', 117564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66424, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_siege_engineer_overload:20|tRax\'s shredder goes |cFFFF0404|Hspell:219614|h[Haywire!]|h|r Leap to the zeppelin!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_siege_engineer_overload:20|tRax\'s shredder goes |cFFFF0404|Hspell:219614|h[Haywire!]|h|r Leap to the zeppelin!', 117563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But first, I will need allies.', 117562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a perfect refuge. A temporary home, until I can return to Suramar.', 117561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This powerful ability cannot be used often, so save it for an emergency.', '', 117560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Sigh.> I have more questions now than before!', 117559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And those keepers protecting it... How long their vigil must have been...', 117558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What could have required such power? A weapon, perhaps?', 117557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reinforcements from Undercity on approach!', 117556, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Army of the Dead raises a swarm of ghouls to attack anything and everything near you.', '', 117555, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 64840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Grip allows you to reach out to a distant target and pull them toward you. No enemy can escape your icy grasp!', '', 117554, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its dark power damages your foe and recovers a portion of your health.', '', 117553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
