('Keep your voice down.', '', 117213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each of my pieces is impeccable. Even the ones made by my apprentice.', '', 117212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work is second to none.', '', 117211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our jewelry is second to none.', '', 117210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need my help?', '', 117209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not last long out here.', 117208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must get back.', 117207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry back!', 117206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In saving Tarren Mill, you defended all of Lordaeron. Savor our victory, but remember... this was only the beginning!', '', 117205, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draw forth your power, whether magic or might! Send the demon back to the Nether!', '', 117204, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes of Azeroth! If you ever loved Hillsbrad, whether in years past or this day, stand and fight!', '', 117203, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleasure doing business with you.', '', 117202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fight continues, allies. Spread out! Purge these demons from Hillsbrad!', '', 117201, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muster your might! Focus your attacks! Bring down this foul creature at once!', '', 117200, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their strength surges! Whether you fight for god, king, or gold, take them down!', '', 117199, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy yourself at the party? I heard it was a scandalous affair.', '', 117198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not waver! Bring them down!', '', 117197, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion approaches! Muster your strength and ready your incantations, for war has arrived!', '', 117196, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 67703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shalas\'aman would never have wished to exist as an agent of corruption. The Dreamweavers mourn his loss, but rejoice that his torment is at an end.', 117195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find Lorin in the square. Sylessa frequents the canals. Just search the bazaar for Cyrille. They\'ll catch your eye.', '', 117194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 117193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I am the leader of SI:7!', '', 117192, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, but I will. And you, Mathias Shaw, will help us to do it.', '', 117191, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never get away with it, Detheroc!', '', 117190, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me assure you, your precious fleets will fall into our trap.', '', 117189, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you hold a weapon truly worthy of my war bringer! May you continue to bring honor and glory to the Valarjar!', '', 117188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, before the Forge of Odyn, you will see your ancient artifact reshaped to become mightier than ever before!', '', 117187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your glorious campaign in the Broken Isles has yielded victories and resources that can reforge your weapon, awakening its true potential.', '', 117186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over the long ages of my watch, rarely have I seen a warrior so in tune with a weapon. It is as if your very blood flows through its steel.', '', 117185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold as the Altar of Ancient Kings infuses the artifact you wield with power, making it mightier than ever before!', '', 117184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the victories achieved and resources gathered in your crusade against the darkness, we have the means to unlock even greater potency in your armament!', '', 117183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct! The weapon you wield on behalf of the Silver Hand is truly a wondrous instrument of righteous retribution!', '', 117182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All hail the $ct! May your aim never falter and your weapon strike true!', 117181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the victories you\'ve achieved and the resources you\'ve gathered, we now have the means to unlock the artifact\'s full potential.', 117180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Although you have walked the lonely road for but a short while, your bond with the ancient weapon you wield grows ever stronger.', 117179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your weapons before the Crucible of the Uncrowned. Watch as it does its work, infusing your blades with deadly power!', '', 117178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you have uncovered our little secret.', '', 117177, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The resources you\'ve gathered across the Broken Isles will allow us to unlock even greater killing potential in your weapons.', '', 117176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In our line of work, we tend to develop a fondness for the tools of our trade. But your affinity for those blades is like nothing we\'ve seen before.', '', 117175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst! Got a missive for you... straight from the Raven himself!', 117174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as our faith stays strong and you stand as our champion, the Burning Legion will never claim Azeroth!', '', 117173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the Raven\'s Eye. Decipher the code in the SI:7 letter, $n.', 117172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battles you\'ve won and the resources you\'ve gathered have shown us a way to awaken the full potential of your artifact.', '', 117171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The island is crawling with demons. Far more than we anticip...', 117170, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 69489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $ct. In the course of your service to the Conclave, we have witnessed your bond with the ancient weapon you hold grow stronger.', '', 117169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, I have a message for you from Bishop Faol.', 117168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything, lieutenant?', '', 117167, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lifeblood of Azeroth flows through your weapon! May you wield it with wisdom against our foes!', '', 117166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your weapon to the skies, Farseer. Let the spirits of earth, air, fire, and water aid their champion\'s cause!', '', 117165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have shown us a way to harness the resources you\'ve gathered to unlock the the artifact\'s true potential.', '', 117164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They must turn their fleets around. The Broken Shore is a deathtrap.', '', 117163, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, the spirits have watched the bond between you and your ancient weapon grow stronger.', '', 117162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our evac is almost here. We have to warn the Alliance and Horde.', '', 117161, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 69486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farseer, I have a message for you from Nobundo.', '', 117160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your weapon before the Forge of the Guardian. Let it infuse your weapon with might!', '', 117159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The victories you\'ve achieved for the Tirisgarde, along with the resources you\'ve gained, shall allow us to unlock the artifact\'s full potential.', '', 117158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your choice to seek out that artifact you wield has borne fruit. I\'m not sure I\'ve ever seen so close a bond between mage and weapon.', '', 117156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
