('We of the Black Harvest have been admiring your skill, Netherlord. To master a weapon of such considerable power is truly inspiring!', '', 117153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using the resources you\'ve gathered for our cause, we now have the means to awaken the full potential of these ancient blades!', '', 117151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $ct. Throughout the campaign against the Legion, we have witnessed your affinity with the weapon you wield grow stronger.', '', 117150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using the resources you\'ve gathered for our cause, we now have the means to awaken the full potential of these ancient blades!', '', 117149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $ct. Throughout the campaign against the Legion, we have witnessed your affinity with the weapon you wield grow stronger.', '', 117148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could use my sword, but I\'d hate to dull it on the likes of you.', 117147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I have a message for you from Kayn.', '', 117146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will be upon us shortly. I can teleport us somewhere safe.', '', 117145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I have a message for you from Altruis.', '', 117144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take all of the Timeworn Artifacts I have on me!', 'Take all of the Timeworn Artifacts I have on me!', 117143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gurglll... wait, oh! Hey. Careful out here, those naga aren\'t friendly. They\'ve been enslaving this nearby Shaolfin murloc tribe. This refuge is all they have left against the incursion. We could really use your help!\n\nOne more thing... if you find any of those Timeworn Artifacts the naga are carrying, mind bringing them back to me? I need them for my research. It\'ll be worth it, I promise!', '', 117142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m just as good with a sword as I am with spells. Any preference?', 117141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Seed of Ages infuse your weapon with power! Watch it grow mightier than ever before!', '', 117140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion killed my family. Die!', 117139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All done, friend? Good, good! Calydus open portal for you. Back to Dalaran, quick, quick!', '', 117138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death by sword or death by spells, it\'s all the same to me!', 117137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, through the victories you\'ve achieved and the resources you\'ve gathered, we can awaken your artifact\'s full potential.', '', 117136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever have you been a fierce defender of the wilds. The skill with which you wield your ancient weapon proves you worthy to be our champion.', '', 117135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archdruid, I bring you a message from the Circle!', 117134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing \"exotic\" about fel magic!', 117133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done! Against your strength, the Legion will surely fall!', '', 117132, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 68714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have studied many forms of magic from many sources. And while each believes that their way is the best, I can tell you that they are more alike than different.', 117131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By infusing the resources you\'ve gathered with the souls you\'ve claimed, the forge will unlock the true potential of your weapon\'s destructive might!', '', 117130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be glad to lend my skills to the order, Archdruid. I have heard great things about you.', '', 117129, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trained to be a warrior when I was young... That seems like a lifetime ago, now. I\'m still pretty decent with a sword, though!', 117128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, we have all watched in awe as you cut a swath through our foes with your ancient weapon.', '', 117127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you go. These treants are ready for battle.', 117126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My claws are sharpened and I\'m ready to hunt.  Dey won\'t even see me comin\'.', 117125, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 66804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will call upon Elune to restore the injured and resurrect the fallen. Thank you, Archdruid.', 117124, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 66762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooooh! Let me give you a big hug! We\'re going to save so many creatures together!', 117122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strength is yours, Archdruid. Together, we will protect the wilds.', '', 117121, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay! I like you... let\'s fight lots of enemies together!', '', 117120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stand by you, Archdruid. Let us fight for Azeroth!', '', 117119, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to fight with you, Archdruid. Together, we will protect the balance of nature.', '', 117118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Grand Master! I bear a message from Master Ponshu.', '', 117117, 0, 41849, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rebuilding the portal will be no easy task. It will take several moons to complete the ritual.', '', 117114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malorne\'s warning cannot be ignored. The great father of the forest is in dire peril, and we must help him... or the very wilds may be lost.', '', 117112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Moon Guard are no more. There is no saving our beloved Stronghold.', 117110, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have also decided that it is time to leave this place.', '', 117109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to me when you\'ve gathered enough essence of the wilds, Archdruid. I trust none other to accomplish this difficult task.', '', 117108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again! Lothrius and Syrana have just informed me of your deeds.', '', 117107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you expect me to waste time chattering with vapid nobles even as my enemies close in? Look there, you fool! We are not alone.', 117106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67614, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
