('Suramar is still a shining jewel in the rubble of the Sundering.', 'Suramar is still a shining jewel in the rubble of the Sundering.', 117041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65743, 65947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
