('Which means I can fry you in an instant if you keep bothering me!', 'Now look. I am sparkling like diamonds. Because of magic.', 117024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65824, 66002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I even had a focused study in battle magic. I graduated top of my class.', 'Now back to me. Sadly, you are not me. Look down, now up.', 117023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65823, 66006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I attended the most prestigious magical academy in Suramar.', 'Now back to you. You cannot even cast the easiest of cantrips.', 117022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65822, 66001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, not everyone can master the arcane as well as I.', 'Look at you. Now back to me. I am a master of magic.', 117021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65821, 66000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is it! See if I invite you to my promotion party.', '<Sighs> I should have taken that post in Azshara.', 117020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65704, 65892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because you are about to find some.', 'Can you let me do that? Will you let me do my ushering?', 117019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65703, 65891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you looking for trouble?', 'Look, I just want to finish my shift and usher in a new era for Azeroth.', 117018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65702, 65890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, enough.', 'How about you go bug someone else for a while?', 117017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65701, 65889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
