('', 'When will this nightmare end?', 117012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Laughter]', '', 117011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin.', 'I\'m ready to begin.', 117010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While you are in Black Rook Hold, there is an urgent matter I must attend to. I will meet you back at the Hall of Shadows.', 117009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you\'re not a Night-bore?', 'You are really a night-thorn in my side.', 117008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65678, 65850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along!', 'As in, anywhere but here?', 117007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65677, 65849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you insist on pestering me?', 'Is there somewhere else you could be right now?', 117006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65676, 65848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come now, I have things to do.', 'Excuse me, I have things to do.', 117005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65675, 65847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wanna play now.', 117004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on! Go do something amazing!', 117003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
