('Bye!', '', 116983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My inventions are always magnificent. In fact, I already have plans for my next one! I\'d be happy to discuss it!', '', 116982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope your inventions help us in the fight against the Legion.', 'I hope your inventions help us in the fight against the Legion.', 116981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just wanted to make sure that Titanstrike, and the Thunderspark within, are in good working order. I\'m quite proud of those creations, you know!', '', 116980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66816, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titanstrike and Hati are both powerful.', 'Titanstrike and Hati are both powerful.', 116979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Technically this is a projection of myself, not the real thing. It\'s a very handy way to check in from time to time.', '', 116978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66815, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct! We of the Broken Temple have watched the bond between you and your ancient weapon grow strong.', '', 116977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mimiron! Why are you here?', 'Mimiron! Why are you here?', 116976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again, $n. I see you are making good use of Titanstrike.', '', 116975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66814, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the Eye, and you have the Book. Well, I\'ll let you keep it for now. Make haste to the Tomb of Sargeras. Do not keep Gul\'dan waiting.', '', 116974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll retrieve the Eye. No doubt your crude attempts at its removal would cause irreparable damage.', '', 116973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast falls! I am victorious once again.', '', 116972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66453, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_fire_felfire:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:219571|h[Felfrost Deathblast]|h|r! Interrupt it!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_fire_felfire:20|t%s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:219571|h[Felfrost Deathblast]|h|r! Interrupt it!', 116971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmph, so much to do... so little time... but this little faerie dragon must keep going.', '', 116970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In your brief life span, I\'m sure you have never faced a void terror. Avoid its eye attacks and stay out of my way. I am not here to protect you!', '', 116969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66458, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To think the Horde and Alliance once waged war to control this prison. As usual, their small-minded efforts were misguided and futile.', '', 116968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66457, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is here the most dangerous prisoners were kept. Best not wander about. No telling what may lurk in the shadows...', '', 116967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66456, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fal\'dorei are my failure. I will not fail again.', '', 116966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcan\'dor died. In a flash of wild magic, the inhabitants of Falanaar were twisted.', '', 116965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would not last. The tree became unstable.', '', 116964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An arcan\'dor. For a time it sustained them. For a time, they were safe.', '', 116963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no, my pretty grove is hurting. Friend, can you help?', '', 116962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion shall regret ever laying their sights on my domain. My armies are at your command! Lead them into glory!', '', 116961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
