('Magni snaps his fingers.', '', 116032, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on, Thorim! These filthy demons are no match for us!', '', 116031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab a chain and help me!', '', 116030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin.', 'I am ready to begin.', 116029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems like yesterday that you and I stood in this very place, ready to destroy the Light in the name of the Lich King.$b$bToday we stand here, not to destroy... but to save this world from destruction.', '', 116028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we could use your help with a tactical decision.', '', 116027, 0, 40459, 66, 64, 0, 64598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'m glad Kor\'vas was able to find you quickly.', '', 116026, 0, 37647, 66, 64, 0, 64597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is too late for me... I can only feel...', '', 116025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve the Legion now!', '', 116024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trogg will rise again!', '', 116023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will make us great!', '', 116022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are saved!', 'We are saved!', 116021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time is now brothers and sisters! To the Vault of Lights!', 'The time is now brothers and sisters! To the Vault of Lights!', 116020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hero of the Exodar has cleared a path for us!', 'The hero of the Exodar has cleared a path for us!', 116019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re saved! Everyone to the Vault of Lights!', 'We\'re saved! Everyone to the Vault of Lights!', 116018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n. Anything that I can do for you? Latest scouting report or an update on Legion activity on Azeroth?', '', 116017, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, too late... Within the Crumbling Depths... The Legion has it by now...', '', 116016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We told the demon where to find it. Geth\'xun was his name.', '', 116015, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We saw the hammer fall from the sky. We know where it is.', '', 116014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out. Out! We will tell you nothing!', '', 116013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion claims this realm, shaman. The troggs serve or the troggs die. This we know.', '', 116012, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She has sent a surface-dweller to do her dirty work. Destroy the shaman!', '', 116011, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stonemother sends her dragons. Take cover!', '', 116010, 0, 0, 39, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathlord, we will begin at your command.', '', 116009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do what we must.', '', 116008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Silver Hand will not give him to us willingly. So, we will take him by force!', '', 116007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interred just beyond those walls is the body of Tirion Fordring, one of the greatest champions our world has known.', '', 116006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('And so, I have gathered you here today to bring such a leader into our fold.', '', 116005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One whose strength of spirit and loyalty to our world is without reproach.', '', 116004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Four Horsemen are to do battle against the might of the Burning Legion, they will need a leader.', '', 116003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh and... apologies for the sequence. Warden Malace is very fond of puzzles.', 116002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defeat the demon, then complete the start up sequence to restore power to the vault.', 116001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $g mister:miss;.', 'Thank you, $g mister:miss;.', 116000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it safe to go back?', 'Is it safe to go back?', 115999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was so scared! Those angry draenei are hurting everyone!', 'I was so scared! Those angry draenei are hurting everyone!', 115998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my mommy?', 'Have you seen my mommy?', 115997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want my papa!', 'I want my papa!', 115996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are the other draenei trying to hurt us?', 'Why are the other draenei trying to hurt us?', 115995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Divinius, $ct $n has crushed the incursion. Now is the time to take the Chosen and finish off the leftover demonic taint within our halls. Secure the Exodar for our people once more!', '', 115994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you do, wikket? The brew\'s boiled over! It\'s ruined! Guess now we gotta start over!', '', 115993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fear not $c, we will avenge the Broken Shore, and I will be right there with you when the day comes.', 115992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to browse your goods.', 'I would like to browse your goods.', 115991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not $c, we will avenge the Broken Shore, and I will be right there with you when the day comes.', '', 115990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your will be done, master!', '', 115989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taming Aluneth will be no easy task. Take these scrolls. Aegwynn used them when she bound Aluneth to her will, perhaps you can do the same.', '', 115988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right then, what do you have?', 'All right then, what do you have?', 115987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes! Come closer, friend!$B$BI see you has nice things! What does friend need? Perhaps some trinkets do you well?', '', 115986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken Temple we toast! King loves this place most!', '', 115985, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Broken Temple!', '', 115984, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Grandmaster!', '', 115983, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 66718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the Grandmaster!', 115982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the Grandmaster!', 115981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the Grandmaster!', '', 115980, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And let us never give up the fight for another tomorrow!', '', 115979, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 66714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under the Grandmaster\'s leadership, let every day be a new dawn!', '', 115978, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we celebrate the dawn of a new order! Today, we toast to friendship and fellowship!', '', 115977, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But today, is NOT that day.', '', 115976, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of us still grieve for our fallen friends. We long for the yesteryears of peace. And like you, I fear the dark days yet to come.', '', 115975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Burning Legion arrived, they took much from us.', '', 115974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought. Now, finish the traitor.', 115973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The field won\'t hold forever, of course. Head into the Vault and deal with the creature once and for all.', 115972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve gotten reports that a particularly troublesome prisoner has nearly made their escape.  Thankfully one of the Vault\'s security measures has it trapped.', 115971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to you we won\'t ever know. Now find the traitor, make her pay for what she has wrought.', 115970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shudder to think what would have become of the creature were it left to its fel subsistance.', 115969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find a way into the Demon Hunter wing and deal with whatever remains in the shadows.', 115968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suspect not all of the Felsworn managed to escape their prison. Normally I\'d leave prisoners to their fate, but a Demon Hunter left lurking in the dark is a danger far too great to let be.', 115967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll know the warden who last held those Moonglaives by sight alone.  I issued and trained each one.', 115965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With so few of us left, we need all the arms we can gather. Venture into the vault and recover the Moonglaives of our fallen sisters.', 115964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As quartermaster, it was my duty to issue and train all of the Wardens in the use of the Moonglaive.', 115963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work. Now find and defeat the traitor.', 115962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Subtlety is not one of Warden Mirana\'s qualities.', 115961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want you to venture inside and complete an energy transfer procedure. The procedure is simple enough; but the security measures are severe.', 115960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The other Wardens tell me that the third sublevel of our vault was hit particularly hard, and that some of its systems may soon lose power.', 115959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work, that should keep the Vault\'s containment functioning until we can retake it. Now find and vanquish the traitor!', 115958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Vault is replete with magical safeguards. One such system may be found within the prison built for the demon Glazer.', 115957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
