('The last lens submerges, and you hear the sharp rise and gentle hum of power coursing through the room.', '', 115952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the demon falls, you hear the sounds of a larger lens sentry rise in the entry to this room.', '', 115951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the sentries periodically issues a very insistent alarm.', '', 115950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
