('For this and countless other successes, we bestow one of our highest honors, the title of Slayer upon $n.', '', 115947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For this and countless other successes, we bestow one of our highest honors, the title of Slayer upon $n.', '', 115946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have regained the Sargerite Keystone. We have defied Kil\'jaeden and invaded a Legion world. And, we have vanquished our nemeses, Caria and Varedis Felsoul.', '', 115945, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
