('We gather here today to pay tribute to one who has served with both honor and distinction as our indomitable leader.', '', 115943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gather here today to pay tribute to one who has served with both honor and distinction as our indomitable leader.', '', 115942, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
