('Illidari! Servants of Illidan! Hear me!', '', 115940, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aeosera calls for her drakes to assault Needlerock!', '', 115939, 0, 0, 51, 64, 0, 38815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want a job done? I can get a job done.', '', 115938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How would you like to improve the order hall?', 'How would you like to improve the order hall?', 115937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
