('', 'We have been through so much together. Of course I accept!', 115935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wretched creatures! You\'ve already stolen my life! What else do you wish to take from me?', 115934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recruiting Allari and Jace as your champions is long overdue. They have earned it.', '', 115933, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 66871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recruiting Allari and Jace as your champions is long overdue. They\'ve earned it.', '', 115932, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 66968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That doesn\'t sound good at all. Sounds like something very big outside the Fel Hammer to the south.', '', 115931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All we need are these last few parts from the other command centers. Otherwise, the Fel Hammer is ready to jump to Niskara.', '', 115930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break your bodies upon the prophet\'s barrier, minions! Soon it shall fall, and with it the hopes of the draenei!', '', 115929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
