('We won\'t go down without a fight!', 'We won\'t go down without a fight!', 115916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save us!', 'Save us!', 115915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
