('', 'I have always been honored to be one of the Servants of Illidan. But, to officially become one of the Illidari... look away, $n, I think I might cry.', 115913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor me, $n. When we started all of this, I never would have imagined being chosen as one of your select few. I will not fail you.', '', 115912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
