('Hodir\'s room\'s behind that door. We need to get it open.', '', 115821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hodir\'s cut off from the rest of the temple. They\'ll surround him soon if we don\'t move fast.', '', 115820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In here! We can leap over the flames!', '', 115819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68083, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have left the combat area. You will be teleported back shortly.', 'You have left the combat area. You will be teleported back shortly.', 115818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve done it again! Well fought everyone, but we shan\'t celebrate just yet. There\'s plenty else needin\' our help.', '', 115817, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements\'ll be \'ere soon! Give \'em no ground!', '', 115816, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep at it! More reinforcements just arrived!', '', 115815, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give \'em everythin\' ye got!', '', 115814, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let up! We\'ve got more ground ta cover after this one\'s laid ta rest!', '', 115813, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, another brave adventurer. Show \'em yer strength!', '', 115812, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This here beasty thinks he\'s got some bite! Show \'em how we treat unwelcome guests.', '', 115811, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New arrivals! Yer right on time! We\'ve got \'em cornered!', '', 115810, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calydus is here, friend! Council flees! Haha!', '', 115809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the readout for this sentry, you see a small representation of the trapped creature at the top of the elevator shaft.  There is one talon frantically flashing red.', '', 115808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry\'s readouts seem to have calmed down, relatively speaking. There\'s still a danger indicator on the lower levels...', '', 115807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry is alive with arcane energies.  Its eyes are constantly scanning the environment.', '', 115806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is the sentry Sira mentioned. As indicated, the talon is flashing red.  All that remains is begin the energy transfer sequence and to survive.', '', 115805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Koltira is being held nearby! We must hurry!', '', 115804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Troubles on the surface don\'t belong down here, shaman. I hope you intend to put this right.', 115803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the sequence completed, the sentry\'s lens is alive with runes scrolling to and fro.  You\'re not sure what to make of it all though.', '', 115802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry seems inactive but for one of its talons flashing intermittently.', '', 115801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A second talon flashes intermittently; but the sentry is otherwise inactive. It is as though it waits for some outside input.', '', 115800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry hums with arcane energies as indecipherable elfish runes dance faintly across the surface of its lens.  There is one talon that glows faintly.', '', 115798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This should help you get around while you\'re down there. It doesn\'t last long, so be quick.', 115797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trogg chieftain knows where your hammer fell, shaman. Beat the information out of him! The stone dragons are at your disposal.', 115796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here comes my new favorite fleshling. You are a true friend of the Stonemother, shaman.', 115795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh how lovely, lovely! The clutch is safe. Join me back at my throne. I know where to find your hammer - and the stone dragons are now free to help.', 115794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something is whipping the troggs into a frenzy. Maybe it has to do with that missing hammer of yours. Be a dear and take care of them, hm?', 115793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You overreact, Terrath. Answers will come. Ah, a mortal approaches. Whenever there is trouble, the flesh is not far away, hm?', 115792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us leave this place, and celebrate our victory among friends.', '', 115791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done what the Kirin Tor could not do for ourselves. The Houndmaster\'s death will deliver a crushing blow to the Burning Legion\'s forces.', '', 115790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ancestors... forgive me...', 115789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch yourself down there. There are some other creatures that linger near the crabs that you don\'t want to cross paths with.$b$bYou know, I could have been a $c like you had I not followed in my father\'s footsteps and took to the sea.', 115788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Give me the buoys.', 'I\'m ready. Give me the buoys.', 115787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a proposition for you. Just beneath us lies some excellent crab meat... I mean, they\'re still alive, but you understand my point.$b$bI have some buoys here you could use to bring them to the surface. You go down and attach the buoys and I\'ll capture what rises to the surface.$b$bDo this for me and I promise you\'ll be rewarded handsomely. What do you say?', 115786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons are near! Sentinels, ready your blades!', 115785, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should meet back up at Therazane\'s Throne once we know more. Good luck to both of you!', '', 115784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman, you must seek out the Stonemother. But be cautious - she is quick to anger.', '', 115783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see if the Earthen at Stonehearth saw anything.', 115782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will speak with the shaman at the Temple of Earth.', '', 115781, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer could be anywhere. We\'ll have to split up.', '', 115780, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 68828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Send up a flare, and we shall see.', 115779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has Hakkar taken the bait?', '', 115778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it working?', 115777, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 66612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My archers have their bows loaded, ready to shoot any demons that dare enter these walls.', 115776, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rangers are armed and ready to fight by your side!', '', 115775, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone... water... my plants...', '', 115774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bitter... harvest...', '', 115773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wherever will I store all this fertilizer?', '', 115772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is merely part of the great cycle.', '', 115771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems I\'ve a bit of pruning to do!', '', 115770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you disturb my pristine gardens!', '', 115769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More food for the worms!', '', 115768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will make a fine compost!', '', 115767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suramar owes its beauty to my blooms! I alone have mastered the delicate intertwining of magic into nature\'s grand cycle.', '', 115766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hope to stand against the three primal forces that shape life itself?', '', 115765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you face three aspects of life, even as your cycle is about to end!', '', 115764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither in my heat, little weeds!', '', 115763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun warms my beauties... but it shall scorch your bones!', '', 115762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night falls upon you!', '', 115761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make a fine seedling for my power!', '', 115760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature nourishes those who truly appreciate it.', '', 115759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the light dies... so do you!', '', 115758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rage against the dying of the light!', '', 115757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least power is something your feeble minds comprehend!', '', 115756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One garden pest deserves another!', '', 115755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful not to singe the buds as you burn!', '', 115754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While my essence is contained within the vessel, I will be in a weakened state, unable to assist.', '', 115753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the process is complete, Hakkar should be drawn to the vessel\'s magic.', '', 115752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will begin to channel my essence into the arcane vessel.', '', 115751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_massentanglement_nightmare:20|tThe Eye of Il\'gynoth begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:218415|h[Death Blossom]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_YoggSaron_01:20|tA Dominator Tentacle faces you and readies |cFFFF0000|Hspell:208689|h[Ground Slam]|h|r!', 115750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry releases its energies.  You hear the faint whistle of something falling.', '', 115749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('As the sentry\'s power builds, you feel the hairs on the back of your neck raise with static.', '', 115748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cell door is unlocked, you feel  a sizeable amount of power emanating from within.', '', 115747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until then, watch your step. The city is on high alert, and the guards will kill you on sight.', 115746, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 64453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have successfully vanquished the rogue construct.', 'You have successfully vanquished the rogue construct.', 115745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the construct.', 'Release the construct.', 115744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s rescue Koltira and get out of here.', 'Let\'s rescue Koltira and get out of here.', 115743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must rescue Kotira quickly, before we are discovered.', '', 115742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart of Azeroth resides at the intersection of the elemental powers on this world. There is no place on Azeroth that is more connected to each of the elements.', '', 115741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall also send Hydraxis to aid the Earthen Ring. He is my greatest champion and will prove valuable in your quest.', '', 115740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion! Where is my beloved?', 115739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero of the Light! We will now safeguard this area and give you assistance!', 'Well done, hero of the Light! We will now safeguard this area and give you assistance!', 115738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the Tears of Elune are added to our arsenal. May they bring us victory against the Legion!', 115736, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though I am often at odds with your Horde, I cannot question the courage you\'ve shown saving Val\'sharah.', 115735, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today we celebrate a great triumph, one paid for with the blood of those most dear to us.', 115734, 0, 923, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure do! Just go out into the water and you should be good to go!', '', 115733, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the Tears of Elune are added to our arsenal. May they bring us victory against the Legion!', 115732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to your courage, the ancient lands of Val\'sharah can at long last begin to heal.', 115731, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today we celebrate a great triumph, one paid for with the blood of those most dear to us.', 115730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m coming too!', 115729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to eat to survive in the wild.$B$BBoar meat makes a hearty meal when cooked over an open flame. It should not be eaten raw, however.$B$BThere are many berries that grow in this region. Some are edible, while others cause minor sickness when ingested. You can often determine which are safe to eat by their smell. A sweet aroma indicates the berry is unsafe to eat.$B$BFirewood can be obtained from dying trees. They are easily identified by their dry, purple leaves.$B$BAre you ready to begin?', '', 115728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Living in the wild you never know what will happen next, but a good hunter can survive on skill and instinct.', '', 115727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you happen to have an extra raft I can borrow?', 'Do you happen to have an extra raft I can borrow?', 115726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tylos, jump us back to Mardum.', '', 115725, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tylos, jump us back to Mardum.', '', 115724, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fish sure are biting today!', '', 115723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, my dears.', 115722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malevolence, get us out of here.', '', 115721, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malevolence, get us out of here.', '', 115720, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am a collector of herbs, flowers, and plants. My travels have taken me all across the Broken Isles, as well as into the Emerald Dream. How can I help you?', 115719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we wish to defeat the Houndmaster, we\'ll need to lure him to a location of our choosing.', '', 115718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Stonestep... your sacrifice will not be in vain!', 115717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bite their knees!', '', 115716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scratch their feets!', '', 115715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash their smashies!', '', 115714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonk them to the ground!', '', 115713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their stuff!', '', 115712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh... Oh, my head!', 115711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look to the heavens and witness the rebirth of Thunderaan... THE WINDLORD!', '', 115710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, Thunderfury has been restored and Thunderaan\'s spirit can finally be released.', '', 115709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if friend trick Gul\'dan into giving up scepter? Then ruin ritual and run away! Haha! This can work, friend!', '', 115708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should teach them to stay away... you move into a cottage in the middle of the forest and never find peace.', '', 115707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More grell?! Was ransacking my home not enough?!', '', 115706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will use Scepter, Eye, and Book to make portals bigger and stronger. Many, many demons pour through! Friend not want that, I think.', '', 115705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Tell Calydus about the ritual and the Scepter.>', '<Tell Calydus about the ritual and the Scepter.>', 115704, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calydus is here to help!', '', 115703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it looks like I\'ll be speaking to her.', 'Well, it looks like I\'ll be speaking to her.', 115702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmph! Wait... something is wrong!', '', 115701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not worth the effort, dear! Let them rot in their crypt. The fires of the Legion will come for them soon enough.', 115700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! The Book of Medivh is ours! Would have saved ourselves time if you\'d just let me kill those death-lovers!', '', 115699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let him down easy.', 'I\'ll let him down easy.', 115698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay, fine. Anytime you\'re interested in browsing my wares, let me know!', '', 115697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to go.', 'I have to go.', 115696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? I thought she might...$b$bOh, I get it. I figured she had a thing for you. Makes sense. Brave hero, leader of the Unseen Path... How can a guy like me compete with all that?$b$bThanks anyway, $n. No hard feelings, right?$b$bSay, I don\'t suppose you\'d talk to Dark Ranger Alina for me, would you? She\'s so gorgeous...', '', 115695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, Moorgoth. She said no.', 'Sorry, Moorgoth. She said no.', 115694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did Velonara say? Is she interested? Would she like dinner? I\'ve been known to roast a mean boar loin.', '', 115693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you wish to summon Elementals?', 'Do you wish to summon Elementals?', 115692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The dark ranger sighs.>$b$bI suppose he has a certain charm. He can\'t help his ignorance.$b$bBut he must realize that my heart is incapable of feeling love or happiness, nor could we... engage in the sort of intimacy he desires. I am a dead, rotting thing, and only the abyss awaits me.$b$bPlease, if you have any fondness for him at all, break his heart now. It will save him true pain later.$b$b<Velonara pauses a moment, then takes a single black rose and caresses its petals.>', 115691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He doesn\'t seem like such a bad guy.', 'He doesn\'t seem like such a bad guy.', 115690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was a maiden, pure and true. A young ranger in service of Silvermoon, betrothed to the nobleman of my dreams.$b$bThen Arthas came.$b$bI fell in battle as the mad prince cut a black scar through the land I loved. But at least I was at peace, I suppose. For a time. Until the Banshee Queen pulled me back from beyond and damned my soul into her service.$b$bYou\'ll have to pardon me if I have little patience for imbeciles like Moorgoth, who take for granted what they have and think to find happiness in pain.', 115689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sound as if you miss your previous life.', 'You sound as if you miss your previous life.', 115688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mean that moping, black-clad imbecile across the way? The one who keeps leering at me?$b$bYes, I\'ve noticed him. He\'s not the first mortal to obsess over a dark ranger. I don\'t understand the fascination some have with death. He should spend his time pursuing the living, not longing for a dalliance with one who has already passed.$b$bLife is often wasted on the living.', 115687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my brother? I hope he made it to the Prophet!', 'Have you seen my brother? I hope he made it to the prophet!', 115686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I ever repay you for this, hero?', 'How can I ever repay you for this, hero?', 115685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just talking to Moorgoth, and he...', 'I was just talking to Moorgoth, and he...', 115684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can make it back on my own now. Your heroics have strengthened my resolve!', 'I can make it back on my own now. Your heroics have strengthened my resolve!', 115683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s fantastic! You\'re really the greatest. Oh, I hope Velonara has noticed me!', '', 115682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life!', 'I owe you my life!', 115681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light bless you!', 'Light bless you!', 115680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t really want to get involved...', 'I don\'t really want to get involved...', 115679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I mean, just look at Velonara over there. She\'s like a dream! So brooding, so mysterious, so... dark.$b$bHave you worked with her before? What was it like? Say, have you two ever...$b$bNevermind. Best not to know such things. The past is the past, and I need to focus on the future. My future with her.$b$bThat\'s why I got all these black roses. I was going to give her a dozen, but that doesn\'t feel like quite enough to impress her. Say, would you talk to her? About me, I mean? Maybe bring her a gift?', '', 115678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c! Without you I would have surely perished!', 'Thank you, $c! Without you I would have surely perished!', 115677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait. What?', 'Wait. What?', 115676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There aren\'t a lot of us. That is to say, only a few. Okay, it\'s me and a couple buddies. But our ranks will grow!$b$bOur mandate is to patrol the shadowed roads of Azeroth and the realms beyond, keeping it safe for the innocent. And...$b$bLook, I\'m going to be honest. We just really, really think dark rangers are amazing and we want to be near them.', '', 115675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think I\'ve ever heard of \"death hunters\".', 'Don\'t think I\'ve ever heard of \"death hunters\".', 115674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you skirted the vast abyss of death? Have you stared entropy in the eye? Then you have met Moorgoth!$b$bOh. Right. I guess you have, haven\'t you? I should have thought that through.$b$bI realize I didn\'t receive some divine calling to come here like some of the others, but I thought you would have need of my services.', '', 115673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, have we met before?', 'Uh, have we met before?', 115672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Moorgoth the Death Hunter, stalker of the night and master of shadows.$b$bWould you like to browse my wares?', '', 115671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion appeared out of nowhere. They must have a portal nearby. Let\'s go find it!', '', 115670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68082, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I was getting weary.', '', 115669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68081, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on Cora, it\'s time to head home.', 115667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I do for ye?', 115665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail. I am Helgar, master smith of Skyhold.', '', 115664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can use the Forge of Odyn to alter the very core of your artifact, allowing us to redistribute its power as you wish.\n\nHowever, we must use a small fragment of its power to work the blade in this way.', '', 115663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I AM RENEWED! Come, little ones. Let us put an end to this invasion!', 115662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 115661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see it in ya eyes - ya be wanting somethin\' different for that artifact ya be wielding. Somethin\' new.\n\nYa come ta the right place, Overlord. I can help ya... but I be makin\' no guarantees that every drop gonna be where ya left it.\n\nDemon blood be too volatile for guarantees.', 115660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world shifts ever beneath our feet, $ct. As shaman, we must always be ready to adapt.\n\nPerhaps you need to change the properties of the weapons you wield? The elements are listening.\n\nI can convince them to alter how their power flows through your artifacts - they ask for but a small portion of it released back to them in return.', '', 115659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered Starcaller unlocked!', 'Withered Starcaller unlocked!', 115658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered Spellseer unlocked!', 'Withered Spellseer unlocked!', 115657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered Mana-Rager unlocked!', 'Withered Mana-Rager unlocked!', 115656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! I bear orders from Greymane!', 115655, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered troops will now focus more of their attacks on enemies!', 'Withered troops will now focus more of their attacks on enemies!', 115654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst! Hey, $n, over here!', 115653, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 69881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, that no look good! Come, wikket, this way. There\'s greenies about, but we\'ve no time to play.', '', 115652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_demonhunter_chaosnova:20|t%s drains a spider to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:218217|h[Unleash]|h|r its energy!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_demonhunter_chaosnova:20|t%s drains a spider to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:218217|h[Unleash]|h|r its energy!', 115651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear the sounds of chitinous legs descending from the shadows...', 'You hear the sounds of chitinous legs descending from the shadows...', 115650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get movin\', wikket! Yu\'lon be in trouble. Let\'s get to her side and give aid on the double!', '', 115649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered troops are now less likely to run away when injured!', 'Withered troops are now less likely to run away when injured!', 115648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey wikket, come here! Great danger is near!', '', 115647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gave you what you wanted, now leave me be!', '', 115646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saa\'ra\'s been teachin\' me more an\' more about how to use the altar. If ye want, I should be able ta help ye change how the power\'s sittin\' in yer blade.\n\n\'Course, I\'m still learnin\', so it won\'t be a perfect transfer. A bit o\' the power will dissolve into the nether.', 115645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish to change the way your Chi flows through your weapon, it is as simple as willing it to be so. I can help you focus your thoughts in this effort.\n\nKeep in mind, Master $n, while most of the Chi will follow your new path... some will not. Such is its nature.', '', 115642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Keep \'em cleared out at ground level! My boys are stickin\' it to them at the airfield as we speak!', '', 115641, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you desire to reflow the power within your weapon to achieve new results, Conjurer, just say the word and I can assist you.\n\nJust know that the incantation will use a small portion of the power as a catalyst.', '', 115640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the $c they were talkin\' about! One of my pilots saw you from above. Said you were puttin\' on quite a show down here! Keep at it.', '', 115639, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t lose the airfield! I\'m sending my best pilots there now. Help keep things calm down here and we\'ll clear the skies.', '', 115638, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be one of the brave ground forces. Keep up the good work! I\'m sending my best pilots up to keep \'em busy at the airfield.', '', 115637, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n! Keep at it down here! My pilots will keep the skies clear above.', '', 115636, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to have heroes like you here, $n. With all that\'s goin\' on I had to scramble my pilots to keep the skies clear!', '', 115635, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! I command it! How dare you turn on your master?!', '', 115634, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I were younger so I could show these grell the tips of my claws and the points of my teeth.', '', 115633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you so wish, I can call upon the primordial forces present here and help you to infuse new power entirely into your weapon.\n\nJust be cautious: the ancient powers involved are volatile, and some power must return to the wilds in the process.', '', 115632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them!', '', 115631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68109, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with valor!', '', 115630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68108, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A worthy enemy!', '', 115629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68107, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Valarjar!', '', 115628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68106, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel my wrath!', 115627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68094, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Odyn!', 115626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68093, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
