('Withered Berserker unlocked!', 'Withered Berserker unlocked!', 115623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Withered health increased!', 'Withered health increased!', 115622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready!', 'I\'m ready!', 115621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe we can use these withered as a weapon. But first we must teach them how to survive in battle.', 115620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people have been goin\' missing, the dead have been seen walking, and the fires are lit in the old fortress.$b$bThere\'s evil afoot, no doubt about it.$b$bIf you\'re here to help, then see our mayor down the road at Bradensbrook. Careful though, I think the pressure might be gettin\' to him.', '', 115619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can use the magic in the grove to help you change the power within your weapon!\n\nThe spell\'s a bit unstable, though, so you\'ll lose a little bit when I cast it.', 115618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is all too simple with this forge to rework the steel of your weapon to alter its power.\n\nSome souls will be lost, of course, but some always are.', '', 115617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can reflow the venom within your blades to unlock new power wthin.\n\nThere\'s no charge for you, of course, but beware that some strength is lost in the process.', 115616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitorous spies must die!', 'Traitorous spies must die!', 115615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time is up!', 'Your time is up!', 115614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind will be left behind!', 'Your kind will be left behind!', 115613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you so wish, I can help you alter the power within your blades.\n\nBe warned! Such change will not come without loss.', '', 115612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have joined us when you had the chance!', 'You should have joined us when you had the chance!', 115611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How tiny thing...?', '', 115610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bridge is mine!', '', 115609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving! No telling what else is out here!', 'Keep moving! No telling what else is out here!', 115608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sure am glad to see you! I thought I was a goner.', 'I sure am glad to see you! I thought I was a goner.', 115607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a life saver!', 'You\'re a life saver!', 115606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stick to the shadows, $n.', 'Stick to the shadows, $n.', 115605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! That was a close one!', 'Thanks! That was a close one!', 115604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess I\'ll have to be a bit more careful. Thanks.', 'Guess I\'ll have to be a bit more careful. Thanks.', 115603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you change the power within your weapon if you\'re interested. I\'m the best smith this side of Ironforge!\n\nFair warning, though: some of the power will be lost in the process.', '', 115602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thirst... never... ends.', '', 115601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The taste of mana!', '', 115600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance for Margaux!', 'Vengeance for Margaux!', 115599, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande will have your heads for this!', '', 115598, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 69828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defy me!', '', 115597, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 69827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Grand Master $. What can I do for you?', '', 115595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it weren\'t fer you I\'d be... well, I can\'t say where I\'d be. Probably dead if it weren\'t fer you.', '', 115593, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best be gettin\' back. They\'ll be wonderin\' where I been.', '', 115592, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t pay me no mind. Just gone ta stick around a bit. Least I can do.', '', 115591, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best if we stick together!', '', 115590, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not!?', '', 115589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, held under the dorsal guiding feathers?', '', 115588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple! They\'d just use some rope from the tents!', '', 115587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, they\'d have to have it on a line.', '', 115586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supposing two gryphons carried it together?', '', 115585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But then, of course, you\'d never find a Gilnean gryphon around these parts anyway.', '', 115584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh a Gilnean gryphon maybe, but not one of these local gryphons, that\'s my point.', '', 115583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It could be carried by a Gilnean gryphon!', '', 115582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shouldn\'t stick around. More will be here soon.', 'We shouldn\'t stick around. More will be here soon.', 115581, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A 500 pound gryphon could not carry a two thousand pound cannon.', '', 115580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not a question of where he grips it. It\'s a simple question of weight ratios!', '', 115579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It could grip it by the trunnion!', '', 115578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really?! A gryphon carry a cannon?', '', 115577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got gryphons!', '', 115576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannons?! And how are we supposed to get them here?', '', 115575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why didn\'t we bring some cannons?', '', 115574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are stronger side by side, $n.', 'We are stronger side by side, $n.', 115573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must find the others!', 'I must find the others!', 115572, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I reckon so. Take care, $n. We\'ll see one another again.', '', 115571, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like that, brother! But I think me friend here has some work ta do.', '', 115570, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay, Brann. She has... other duties for me. But I\'d be obliged if ye\'d stay fer a chat.', '', 115569, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what of ye, brother? Will ye go back ta Ironforge?', '', 115568, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not every day a planet points me to my own library. Thank you, Magni. I will go to Karazhan at once. $n, follow me through the portal when you\'re done here.', '', 115567, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye must find the Pillars! Combined, their power kin seal the Legion\'s gateway to Azeroth. \'Tis the only way to save her!', '', 115566, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, Khadgar. The knowledge was placed in the care o\' the Guardian of Tirisfal, and remains there still!', '', 115565, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your tale sounds familiar... I\'m sure I\'ve heard of these Pillars before.', '', 115564, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When their work was done, the keepers sealed the Pillars away. But like so many relics, they ended up in the hands o\' mortals.', '', 115563, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After defeatin\' the Old Gods, the keepers were giv\'n the task o\' orderin\' the world. The titans gave \'em five mighty artifacts... the Pillars o\' Creation!', '', 115562, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps it is your imperfection... that which grants you free will... that allows you to persevere against all cosmically calculated odds. You prevail where the Titan\'s own perfect creations have failed.', '', 115559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 15401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c9999000010 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', '|c9999000010 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', 115558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c999900005 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', '|c999900005 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', 115557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The constellar was jus\' doin\' his job, such as it was. And in the end, ye taught him a lesson.', '', 115556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes! I\'m gettin\' flashbacks o\' Algalon!', '', 115555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She sealed her fate, as you have sealed yours!', '', 115554, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 69825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder! Face my blade!', '', 115553, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 69824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen your deeds in the vineyards. You have oppressed the Nightborne long enough. Prepare to die, Elvire!', 'I have seen your deeds in the vineyards. You have oppressed the Nightborne long enough. Prepare to die, Elvire!', 115552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had better provide a good reason for this interruption.', '', 115551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother... I AM the key.', '', 115550, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t we need a key?', '', 115549, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s more I gotta say. Come inside the Celestial Planetarium and I\'ll show ye the truth.', '', 115548, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A titan? That... actually explains a great many things.', '', 115547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me own brother turned ta diamond and started talkin\' ta titans?', '', 115546, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual that changed me body also opened me ears ta the voice o\' Azeroth herself. She ain\'t just a hunk o\' rock. She\'s a titan!', '', 115545, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know ye have questions, but they gotta wait. Time is short. She wants me ta pass along an important message.', '', 115543, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni! \'Tis good to see ye again! But why did ye leave Ironforge? Why come here? What happened to--', '', 115542, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly the Legion doesn\'t want us hearing what Magni has to say.', '', 115541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears to be a dwarf. How is he still alive?', '', 115540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68608, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who is that fighting so fiercely ahead?', 115539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68089, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade thirsts for demon\'s blood!', '', 115538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68103, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to keep moving!', 115537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68088, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inform your master that I\'ve grown rather attached to it.', '', 115536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the mage! Gul\'dan wants his head!', '', 115535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since you have this under control, I... I must attend to other guests. Please excuse me!', '', 115534, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good thing I have experience with fel barriers. Say the word, $n, and I\'ll bring it down!', '', 115533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magni\'s in there! We gotta save \'im!', '', 115532, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have gathered here to recognize your valor in battle. Turn and approach your peers.', '', 115531, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An efficient kill. Most admirable!', 115530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We never doubted that you would succeed.', 115529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The legend of the Wardens grows thanks to your deeds.', 115528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well-struck, like a true Warden.', 115527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Justice is served.', 115526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Didn\'t stand a chance.', 115525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Didn\'t even see you coming.', 115524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know what is required. Good luck.', 115523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strike fast. Strike deadly.', 115522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies outnumber us. We have need of your skills.', 115521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have an assignment for you.', 115520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your target is marked. Be about your work.', 115519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show them how we deliver justice.', 115518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mark is nearby, assassin.', 115517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another danger thwarted. Nicely done!', 115516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You strike with impressive skill, friend.', 115515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You struck true. Well done!', 115514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another mark dispatched. Excellent!', 115513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are getting quite good at this, ally.', 115512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have kept the peace for another day.', 115511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wardens thank you once again.', 115510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A deadly mark is near your location. Prove yourself to be deadlier.', 115509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A potent enemy lurks nearby. Bring it to justice!', 115508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware! A threat is near. It must be eliminated.', 115507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a target for you in this area. Be vigilant.', 115506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our owls have spotted a target near your location. Dispatch it.', 115505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a mark near you. Eliminate it in the name of justice.', 115504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful menace lurks nearby. Be on your guard!', 115503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An efficient, impressive kill. Your deeds are worthy of the Wardens!', 115502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nicely done! Many others would show fear in the face of such danger, but you knew only courage.', 115501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The land is safer for your actions this day. But stay vigilant! Danger will surely rise again.', 115500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skills show great promise! No doubt we shall call upon you again.', 115499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you have a sense of the duty each Warden bears, friend. Thank you for aiding our order.', 115498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not forget your aid this day, champion! The Wardens are in your debt.', 115497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fortune smiles upon us! You are near a threat we have been tracking for some time. Destroy it, and we will remember your service to the Wardens.', 115496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We believe your skills are well-suited for bringing this target to justice. Serve our order and you will be rewarded.', 115495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wardens have pledged to bring justice to this world, but we cannot be everywhere. We offer you the honor of taking down a grave threat.', 115494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Threats abound in these lands, friend. A test of your courage stands before you. Strike fast and true!', 115493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Broken Isles is a land rife with danger, friend. The Wardens need your help in taking down this menace.', 115492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wardens\' duty is to protect our people from dangerous creatures such as this one. Strike without hesitation or mercy!', 115491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for battle! For Odyn!', '', 115490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68104, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The temple is completely overrun! Let us crush these demons!', 115489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68090, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Elisande... will hear... of this...', '', 115488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this delay!', '', 115487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must hurry. I do not know how much longer I can keep this barrier active!', '', 115486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This barrier protecting my people requires all of my energy and focus. I am afraid you must venture into the demon infested halls alone. Please, search for survivors and eliminate the Legion invasion point portals that you find across the Exodar.', '', 115485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brann! They\'re tryin\' ta invade me mind!', '', 115484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop the interlopers! I must find out what the prisoner knows!', '', 115483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 115482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the arcwine. I am getting out of here.', '', 115481, 0, 43663, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS START EVENT FIRED LIKE A BOSS', '', 115480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 115479, 0, 43663, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rakeesh... His name means \"butcher\" in Eredun. It is no coincidence that Kil\'jaeden sent an eredar to slaughter my people. The Deceiver revels in his \"creative\" punishments for those that dare defy him.', '', 115478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to requisition a Squad of Initiates.', 'I would like to requisition a Squad of Initiates.', 115477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are ready for your requests.', 115476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight for my pleasure.', '', 115475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I arise!', '', 115474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave the sentry.', 'Leave the sentry.', 115473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done much for us, friend. I will call upon you again soon- until then, please accept my thanks.', 115471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, show me what you have brought. We haven\'t much time.', '', 115470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c999900002 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', '|c999900002 Withered:|r Bring the chest back to Thalyssra.', 115469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Please, step forward.', '', 115468, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chest is locked with a mysterious power, and cannot be opened here.$b$bYou can dismiss some of your withered troops and have them bring it back to Thalyssra.', '', 115467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate has delivered you to us in this most dire time, hero! While I sense that your mission is urgent, if we do not push back these invading demons, we will all perish.', '', 115466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, Illidari. Your fate is sealed. You will perish with your world.', '', 115465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are all going to die painfully, especially you, $n.', '', 115464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden, bring me back to life again...', '', 115463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My lord Kil\'jaeden, save me...', 115462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pleasure. Step back.', '', 115461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving now. You might want to step back.', '', 115460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shade, move the Fel Hammer into position. Bring down this fel barrier.', '', 115459, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, move the Fel Hammer into position. Bring down this fel barrier.', '', 115458, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You really think we are going to just let you in? You came all this way for nothing, demon hunters.', 115457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is over. The Felsouls are dead and the will not be coming back.\n\nWe are ready to return to the Fel Hammer when you are, $n.', '', 115456, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s done. The Felsouls are dead and they\'re not coming back.\n\nWe\'re ready to return to the Fel Hammer when you are, $n.', '', 115455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Kayn. Let\'s get back to the Fel Hammer and jump back to Mardum.', 'I\'m ready, Kayn. Let\'s get back to the Fel Hammer and jump back to Mardum.', 115454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Altruis. Let\'s get back to the Fel Hammer and jump back to Mardum.', 'I\'m ready, Altruis. Let\'s get back to the Fel Hammer and jump back to Mardum.', 115453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid $r, you don\'t know what you give up. Delicious!', '', 115452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Ma\'haat hungry! I want ORE!', '', 115451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have a Fossilized Egg?', 'Do you have a Fossilized Egg?', 115450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma\'haat go deep. Ma\'haat collect shinies. Ma\'haat hungry.', '', 115449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Channel the energy of fire.', 'Channel the energy of fire.', 115448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Channel the energy of earth.', 'Channel the energy of earth.', 115447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Channel the energy of water.', 'Channel the energy of water.', 115446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Channel the energy of air.', 'Channel the energy of air.', 115445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The pillar hums with energy. As soon as you touch its surface, you feel a vast pool of untapped power just beneath its surface.>', '<The pillar hums with energy. As soon as you touch its surface, you feel a vast pool of untapped power just beneath its surface.>', 115444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The pillar is warm.>', '<The pillar is warm.>', 115443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The pillar glows slightly. It is no longer ice cold, but still cool to the touch.>', '<The pillar glows slightly. It is no longer ice cold, but still cool to the touch.>', 115442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The pillar is quiet and cold.>', '<The pillar is quiet and cold.>', 115441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will see that it is not wasted. Well done, my friend.', 115440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalyssra smiles warmly.', 115439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer the Gift-Wrapped Arcwine Bottle.>', '<Offer the Gift-Wrapped Arcwine Bottle.>', 115438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah yes, I can definitely do something with this water. I will need time to work with it. Thank you, Farseer.', 115437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! I suggest we pick up the pace.', '', 115433, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might be the Old Gods ain\'t the only ones tryin\' ta find their way in!', '', 115432, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city\'s defenses have been compromised. Units assigned to safeguard the Speaker are not responding to my queries!', '', 115431, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not again! The keepers will make me fill out an incident report!', '', 115430, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh look! Isn\'t she extraordinary! She will serve you well, $n, if you ask her nicely.', 115429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can still do a few magic tricks if I set my mind to it...', 115428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many things I can do to help strengthen your class hall, though some tough choices will have to be made.', 115427, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My body is broken... I can\'t keep up.', '', 115426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... have mercy... I can\'t go on.', '', 115425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Magistrix will have this shipment of Arcwine at once. Exhaustion is no excuse!', '', 115424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get up! The Magistrix will have this delivery on time!', '', 115423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jade Serpent taught me: king do what king must. We not gonna leave you. There\'s greenies to bust!', '', 115422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t worth dying for!', '', 115421, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will come soon.', '', 115420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee! The Magistrix will kill us for failing her!', '', 115419, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, come closer. See what I have in store for you.', '', 115418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can use the Bloodstone. It will be powerful enough to control the sisters when they\'re in a weakened state.', 115417, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All souls will be ours...', '', 115416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul, too, will be added to my cage.', '', 115415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I couldn\'t be more pleased, Farseer. It has taken quite a lot of work to restore the maelstrom pillar to its maximum capabilities, but it was well worth the effort.$B$BGo ahead and try it yourself - the stone conducts the elements in powerful ways!', 115414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your help has been instrumental to my progress here, Farseer. The stone is nearly complete. With the powers of water, air, and earth restored, the remaining element needed is fire.', 115413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We continue to make progress, Farseer. The maelstrom pillar is revitalized with the power of air. With any luck, we will be able to restore its full potential soon.', 115412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Lord Neptulon\'s gift has already done wonders. The stone appears to be channeling my powers of water again.', 115411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Maelstrom pillar\'s power was exhausted during our defense of the Heart of Azeroth. The pillar will recharge slowly, but this process could take decades and we have no such luxury. We need to find a way to accelerate its regeneration.', 115410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me my Class Advancement options.', 'Show me my Class Advancement options.', 115409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da elements be tricky wit their secrets, but I watch and I lissen. If ya know how ta speak ta dem, der secrets can be yours, too.', 115408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a token of my gratitude, allow me to see you home.', 115407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it down, brats. You will join the others soon.', 115406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
