('Do not show yourself! You cannot help her now. No one can.', '', 115260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed we shall.', 115258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Atonement? I doubt that such a thing exists for me...', 115257, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why then? Why have you done this to me?', 115256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I live? Is the anguish of death over?', 115255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 71579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us, and we will find out together.', '', 115254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Knights of the Ebon Blade have come to offer you a chance at atonement.', '', 115253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Day of Reckoning is at hand. The Burning Legion has come to destroy our world.', '', 115252, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have not come to offer peace, High Inquisitor.', '', 115251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up, High Inquisitor! Your Deathlord calls you back to this world!', '', 115250, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever happened to this place? It put sad look on wikket\'s face.', '', 115249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I\'m alive! Thank you, priestess!', '', 115248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all in the branding! That\'s why I call \'em Programmable Electronic Tactical Sidekicks... P.E.T.S.!', '', 115246, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey Practicus, do you ever worry other hunters won\'t appreciate our tamed mechs?', 115245, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the energy transfer sequence.', 'Begin the energy transfer sequence.', 115244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No talking in class!', 115243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The juices need a little massaging- step into the vat and jump to squish the mixture around!', 115242, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 66303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think a sour note is in order. Add a shadefruit, please.', 115241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us add a little moisture. Just enough to keep the taps flowing.', 115240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! It needs something floral, to add a little brightness.', 115239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Exactly what it needed. But there is still something missing...', 115238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, my friend, are a natural. The blend needs something more, though. Let me think...', 115237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. Now let me see...', 115236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is my favorite part! The smells, the textures, the invigorating rush! I think you will appreciate why I have remained in the vineyards after you have made Arcwine yourself.', 115234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are preparing to make the unfortified wine. Are you ready to assist?', 115233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your place near the table. Once we begin, it is important that we keep up the pace. These delicate ingredients spoil quickly.', 115231, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! You did very well- are you certain you have never made wine before? I will have this bottled immediately.', 115230, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel as though you are losing focus. Is something else on your mind? Step back for a moment and we will try again.', 115229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you certain you are ready to participate? This batch will have to be destroyed.', 115228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hm... the ingredients have soured. We will have to start again I am afraid.', 115227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, actually I am fine.', 'Oh, actually I am fine.', 115226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would I be unhappy? Students are always in the halls, they never go to sleep, they always want more provisions, the place is a mess. There is water everywhere! And do they hire someone else to help, no! Filrich will take care of it they say. I drew the line at cleaning up those infernal books.\n\nNow what was it \'you\' needed again?', '', 115225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem unhappy.', 'You seem unhappy.', 115224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? 10,000 years working here and I get no respect. Filrich do this, Filrich do that. What can Filrich do for you?', '', 115223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The word is given. Move out.', 'The word is given. Move out.', 115220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You destroyed all of the demons here, but many more await us ahead. We will have to fight through their lieutenants to get to Caria and Varedis.\n\nJust give the word and we will begin our assault.', '', 115219, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The word is given. Move out.', 'The word is given. Move out.', 115218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You destroyed all of the demons here, but many more await us ahead. We\'re going to have to wade through their lieutenants if we want to get to Caria and Varedis.\n\nGive the word and we will begin.', '', 115217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, fools. Come down. Jump to your deaths.', '', 115216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You five, come with me and $n. Niskara awaits!', '', 115215, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 66933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You five, come with me and $n. Niskara awaits!', '', 115214, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 66932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shade, you and the others will remain behind to protect the Fel Hammer.', '', 115213, 0, 0, 29, 64, 0, 66931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, you and the others will remain behind to protect the Fel Hammer.', '', 115212, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 66930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari, hear me. The time has come. All of our struggles... all of our sacrifices have led to this moment.', '', 115211, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You a lucky $gguy:lady;. You can break your chain and walk right out the door.$b$bGolk can break his chains very easy, but can Golk fit out the door?  Nope.', '', 115210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari, hear me. The time has come. All of our struggles... all of our sacrifices have led to this moment.', '', 115209, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your souls are forfeit!', 115208, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give the order, Kayn. Let\'s get down there.', 'Give the order, Kayn. Let\'s get down there.', 115207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time is upon us. The invasion of Niskara represents the fulfillment of Illidan\'s dream and all of our sacrifices.\n\nLead us to victory, $n.', '', 115206, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give the order, Altruis. Let\'s get down there.', 'Give the order, Altruis. Let\'s get down there.', 115205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time is upon us. The invasion of Niskara represents the fulfillment of all of our sacrifice and planning.\n\nLead us to victory, $n.', '', 115204, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari Redoubt is the perfect vantage point, and it\'s free from the rabble up above.', '', 115203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caria, Varedis, we\'re coming for you!', '', 115202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caria, Varedis, we\'re coming for you!', '', 115201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidari! The gateway is open. To the Fel Hammer!', 115200, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Sentinel Hill at once! Together we cast this demon back into the Twisting Nether!', '', 115199, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, heroes! Defend the Hill! Slay the demons\' master!', '', 115198, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s determination grows! End this vile corruption at once!', '', 115197, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their forces have spread! We must not let them reach Stormwind!', '', 115196, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take back what is ours! Show these demons their way back to the Nether!', '', 115195, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste! Spread throughout the lands! Purge this infestation!', '', 115194, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Save us!', '', 115193, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... must... OBEY!', '', 115192, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They may scorch our lands... they may slay our kin... but we will NEVER surrender! For Azeroth!', '', 115191, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not in control!', '', 115190, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your efforts, the Burning Legion has failed yet again! The Westfall Brigade is in your debt!', '', 115189, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in death, these spirits serve.', '', 115188, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise spirits, and serve The Legion.', '', 115187, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you soon, gorgeous.', 115186, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allies of all flags and kingdoms! The time to fight for OUR lands is NOW!', '', 115185, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you soon, handsome.', 115184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doomguards make their descent! Ready at the Hill!', '', 115183, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give ground! Do not yield! Fight on!', '', 115182, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hold the Hill for Stormwind! For all of Azeroth!', '', 115181, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHH!', 115180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steel at the ready! We have incoming!', '', 115179, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your blades, allies! The battle begins!', '', 115178, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for battle! We won\'t allow the Legion to destroy what we\'ve built here!', '', 115177, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky burns, allies! The Legion comes at us again!', '', 115176, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, my friends! Minimally discounted Noggenfoggers all around!', '', 115175, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not every day you get to save the... day! I\'m gonna work on that.', '', 115174, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Black Harvest is ready to serve.', 'The Black Harvest is ready to serve.', 115173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s big, it\'s ugly, it\'s... uh... Just get your behinds to Gadgetzan and kill it already!', '', 115172, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We make our stand at Gadgetzan! Time to stick it to their boss! Dibs on everything in his pockets!', '', 115171, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourselves! They\'re popping up everywhere... like broke relatives!', '', 115170, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is getting outta hand! They\'re on the move again! What gives?', '', 115169, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody get out there! It\'s time to kick these things to the curb... if Gadgetzan had curbs!', '', 115168, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pack up your things! We\'re bringing the fight to them.', '', 115167, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like those two are joining the party! Get the hats and sparklers ready!', '', 115166, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for their shins, or knees, or... or whatever you can reach! Just take \'em out already!', '', 115165, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something must be getting under their skin! They\'re much bigger and meaner!', '', 115164, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh look! They\'ve gotten a bit larger... but way more angry!', '', 115163, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not a drill! Here they come! First priority: PROTECT MY STUFF!', '', 115162, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody get ready! We have incoming... and they sound testy!', '', 115161, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion ship to the east! Lock up shop! Hide your breakables! Things are about to get interesting.', '', 115160, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, this is not good! Legion ship overhead! If you owe back taxes, now\'s the time to pay up!', '', 115159, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great work, all o\' ya! I fear this willna be the last we see o\' the Burnin\' Legion, but when they come back... we\'ll be ready!', '', 115158, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, champions! Ironforge won\'t soon be fergettin\' yer efforts \'ere on the battlefield!', '', 115157, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spit out yer blood, bind yer wounds, an\' git yer arses ta Kharanos! We got one last fight in us!', '', 115156, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ta Kharanos! We gotta stop their leader! Fer the glory o\' Ironforge!', '', 115155, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Tevaris fades into the shadows.', '', 115154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Legion camps spotted! Bring \'em down, an\' be quick about it!', '', 115153, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Tevaris emerges from the shadows.', '', 115152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers keep growin\'! We\'ll watch the skies o\'er head. Clear \'em out down below!', '', 115151, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spread out! This fight\'s jus\' gettin\' started!', '', 115150, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mount up! We gotta stop their advance!', '', 115149, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them demons no mercy!', '', 115148, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to requisition some Imps.', 'I would like to requisition some Imps.', 115147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the might o\' Ironforge, rise up! Bring them foul demons a swift death!', '', 115146, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from there!', '', 115145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What inspired such idiocy? Nightwell energy is intensely volatile in this state!', '', 115144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pragmatic as always, Highlord. There are dozens of logistics to consider. Supplies, communications, weapons, armor... We should get started.', '', 115143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be daft- move away from there!', '', 115142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I strongly advise against that!', '', 115141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon me... do you have a death wish?', '', 115140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Imps are hungry...', 115139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree, Highlord. The demon incursions will only grow worse if left unchecked. A strong defense is necessary.', '', 115138, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good idea, Highlord. With additional allies of the Light, our strength will be magnified.', '', 115137, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 68376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent thinking, Highlord. We should attack the problem at its source - their leader, Balnazzar.', '', 115136, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will ne\'er prevail if the Dark Iron have a say \'bout it!', 115135, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 64775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how tired ye be, how wounded... show \'em no weakness! We fight together!', '', 115134, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the might o\' the Dark Iron! Fer Ironforge!', 115133, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 64774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold strong, brothers an\' sisters! We make our stand fer Azeroth!', '', 115132, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand strong! Show them demons they\'ll ne\'er take Ironforge!', '', 115131, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Procure supplies for the army.', 'Procure supplies for the army.', 115130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Git ready! \'Ere they come!', '', 115129, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend against the demon invasions.', 'Defend against the demon invasions.', 115128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek allies under the Light.', 'Seek allies under the Light.', 115127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunt the dreadlord, Balnazzar.', 'Hunt the dreadlord, Balnazzar.', 115126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got compn\'y! Legion ship spotted o\'er head! Ready up!', '', 115125, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s returned! Send word ta Ironforge an\' get ta yer posts!', '', 115124, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bellows a grateful roar.', '', 115123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, that won\'t do at all. Start over, and this time, please pay attention!', '', 115122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you had a glass or three before coming here? We\'ll have to throw out this batch...', '', 115121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, this simply won\'t do. We\'ll have to start over from scratch.', '', 115120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will it be, Highlord? What should we do next?', '', 115119, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 68374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed, Arator. Brothers and sisters, the time to stand united is now. We must follow the Highlord\'s leadership more than ever.', '', 115118, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard my father. We must act!', '', 115117, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 68328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, son. Do not lose faith, for it is in the darkest moments that the light shines brightest.', '', 115116, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 69330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Overseer will hear of this. Mark my words, Margaux.', 'The Overseer will hear of this. Mark my words, Margaux.', 115115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agh!', '', 115114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hear none of your excuses. Back to work!', 'I will hear none of your excuses. Back to work!', 115113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just resting. I-', '', 115112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Back to work!', 'You there! Back to work!', 115111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what\'s this? Which Malfurion is real, and which is part of the Nightmare...? [Laugh]', '', 115109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come to me, Warrior of the Horde. Our chase is finished.', 115108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To me, champion. Our chase is done.', 115107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You attempt to interact with the sentry; but to no avail.', 'You attempt to interact with the sentry; but to no avail.', 115102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! I hear you! I am close now!', 115101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on, my love! I am near!', 115100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating self-destruct procedure.', '', 115099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You insolent... little...', 115098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune curse you, Xavius! You will pay for this charade, I swear it!', 115097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There we are! Lovely work as always, $p.', 115096, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My love! I am here! Come to me!', '', 115095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are you Malfurion? Answer me!', 115094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot keep me from her! Tyrande?!', '', 115092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you Tyrande? I need you!', '', 115091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! I cannot fight much longer...', '', 115090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut down the start up sequence.', 'Shut down the start up sequence.', 115089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot tell where his voice is coming from! Search the buildings to the east! I will scour the west for signs of him!', 115088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare the start up sequence.', 'Prepare the start up sequence.', 115087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was not aware of that.', 'I was not aware of that.', 115086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot tell where his voice is coming from! Quickly, search the buildings to the east. I will scour the west for signs of him!', 115085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the instructors mentioned that, yes...', 'One of the instructors mentioned that, yes...', 115084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to lead me to the Tidestone of Golganneth.', 'I need you to lead me to the Tidestone of Golganneth.', 115083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no time for games!', 115082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess again, mortal!', '', 115081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my \"dream\" home! Your beloved Malfurion awaits within.', '', 115080, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You students have been warned countless times. I will have to make an example of you!', 115079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sentry stands resolute.', '', 115078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket come to ask a thing? What does you want from Monkey King?', '', 115077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready when you are, dear.', 115076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, just like that! Hmm... what does this batch need now?', '', 115075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a natural! What does the recipe call for next...', '', 115074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Now, what next...', '', 115073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you fly me to Tian Monastery? I need to speak to the Monkey King.', 'Can you fly me to Tian Monastery? I need to speak to the Monkey King.', 115072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The furbolg of this weald are a peaceful tribe. They are in a panic right now, and are in need of our help.', '', 115071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\spell_warlock_demonsoul:20|t Halldora begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:217283|h[Soul Harvest]|h|r Run away!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\spell_warlock_demonsoul:20|t Halldora begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:217283|h[Soul Harvest]|h|r Run away!', 115070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer deeds ought be praised, champions! The Legion\'s been stopped! Ya did it!', '', 115069, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More on the horizon! Spread out afore they reach the Gates!', '', 115067, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader be attackin\' Kharanos! C\'mere an\' show \'em what ye got!', '', 115065, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'re takin\' the fight to \'em!', '', 115064, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ain\'t got this far ta give up jus\' yet! Bring \'em down!', '', 115063, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Didn\'t think the Dark Iron\'d let the lot o\' ye have all the fun, did ye?', 115062, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 64773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers be growin\'! We\'re gonna need more from every one o\' ya!', '', 115061, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blades at the ready! We got incomin\'!', '', 115060, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burnin\' Legion! Lads, lasses, git ta yer positions. If ye can\'t fight, take shelter!', '', 115059, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can use the console here.', '', 115058, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just use the console here.', '', 115057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you bombard the demons below with the Fel Hammer\'s artillery, I will get our forces ready.', '', 115056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you bombard the demons below with the Fel Hammer\'s artillery, I\'ll get our forces ready.', '', 115055, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azeroth is the last light of hope, Arator. Fight, or all is lost.', 115054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must gather the defenders of the Light, Arator. Keep the Light alive. Fight, or ALL is lost.', '', 115053, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In retribution, the dreadlord Balnazzar has been sent to Azeroth to destroy all that I hold dear.', '', 115052, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We  hope you can forgive us for leaving, but we did it out of love for you. To ensure your safety and the survival of our world, we chose to make this sacrifice.', '', 115051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For ages, I have hunted the Burning Legion across the stars.', '', 115050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can hear this, I have an important message.', '', 115049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vessel... it senses young Arator\'s presence!', '', 115048, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 68383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our beloved child.', 115047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arator. Son.', '', 115046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light... what does that mean for Azeroth?', 115045, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 68307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alive... we think. It appears his army suffered a great defeat at the hands of the Legion.', '', 115044, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it true that Turalyon is alive?', 115043, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 68366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will meet you at the next station. My assistant Sylverin will be happy to show you how the infusion process works.', 115042, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 66285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is much to do if we are to defeat the Burning Legion. I will not allow them to destroy my city for a second time.', 115041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And this is where I leave you. I must prepare the next activity.', 115040, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is here that we instill our wine with Nightwell essence, which gives it the restorative properties our people enjoy.', 115039, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Across this bridge is the most crucial part of our winemaking process.', 115038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe the Kirin Tor must accept help from all quarters if we are to defeat the Burning Legion.', 115037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where were we?', 115036, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 66281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so sorry- please forgive this mistake. I will personally ensure it does not happen again.', 115035, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 66280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t hurt him!', 115034, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Magistrix monitors these activities very-', 115033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we arrange to send hundreds of barrels and casks of arcwine out to the city.', 115032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahead you will see our distribution facility.', 115031, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A cask of arcwine from our vineyard can be safely stored for hundreds of years!', 115030, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each bottle is sealed with magic to prevent any of the Nightwell\'s essence from fading.', 115029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The buildings before you house our bottling facilities.', 115028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin Tor supports the new Tirisgarde wholeheartedly, $n.', 115027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one houses a species of tree that produces extra sweet fruit, which you tasted in the Infusion.', 115026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are at all familiar with the wine crafting process, you know that it is necessary to allow the juice to ferment.', 115025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To my left you will see one of our orchards.', 115023, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We prefer to shorten the process using time magic. Such power is our birthright!', 115022, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The building we approach now is called the Aging Chamber.', 115021, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a great debt, Archmage $n. I have not forgotten.', '', 115020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that Kathra\'natir is no longer a threat, we can safely search for powerful weapons to use against the Burning Legion.', '', 115019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kathra\'natir was a voice in my head, calling from far away. I am so glad he has been silenced!', '', 115018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our chances against the Burning Legion are grim at best. However there is still hope, especially with experienced mages such as yourself on our side!', '', 115017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I enjoyed our little excursion, $n. I would go into battle with you any time.', '', 115016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are quite accomplished for a mortal mage, $n.', '', 115015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion is coming for everyone and everything... We must embrace the fires of Azeroth if we hope to see the dawn.', 115014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is requested.', 'Your counsel is requested.', 115013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The night is dark and full of demons.', 115012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 115011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see... shall we carry on, then?', 115010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Margaux sighs.>\n\nThe odds are stacked against us. We are beaten and exiled at every turn. But you and the First Arcanist still stand with us. I can believe in this.\n\nI believe in the Dusk Lily.\n\nBut enough of this. Are you ready to finish our tour?', 115009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not think it is safe to say, Margaux.', 'I do not think it is safe to say, Margaux.', 115008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They just - I hate them! We serve at their pleasure or we face exile and death. But I can do nothing while the Grand Magistrix seeks to keep this area secure.\n\nSurely you must have a vast network to have made your way here. Is the resistance growing? Can it truly stand against Elisande?', 115007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I am ready to move on now.', 'Thank you! I am ready to move on now.', 115006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now... why exactly did you come here? This is certainly one of the least safe places for members of the resistance.', 115005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you, Margaux.', 'After you, Margaux.', 115004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so relieved to hear that. Let us move on, though.', 115003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insects? Do you have an insect problem?\n\n<Margaux eyes you curiously for a moment.>\n\nNo matter. The answer, you see, is in front of you. Mana wyrms prey on the insects that prey on our trees. They keep our precious plants whole and they eat very well.\n\nI will be sure to make time in our tour to allow you to gather some.', 115002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Margaux glances around anxiously before leaning in close to whisper to you.>\n\nThalyssra must be alive, if others are moving in the shadows. Who else but the First Arcanist could inspire such action?\n\nTell me- how is she?', 115001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope is not lost. We are making progress every day.', 'Hope is not lost. We are making progress every day.', 115000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra said you had a unique way of dealing with insects. What is it?', 'Thalyssra said you had a unique way of dealing with insects. What is it?', 114999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is surviving, but not easily.', 'She is surviving, but not easily.', 114998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe you won\'t let me have the Nightborne Soulstone. It contains the power of the Burning Legion!', '', 114997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t give me that Soulstone right now, I\'ll get angry. You really wouldn\'t like me when I\'m angry...', '', 114996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise you won\'t regret it if you give me the Nightborne Soulstone... I\'ll use its power only for good. Really!', '', 114995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just thinking about all the damage we could cause with that Soulstone has got me all excited. Let me have it! Please!', '', 114994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna torch a few demons once I get the Nightborne Soulstone!', '', 114993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is great! I just know it has information I can use to my advantage!', '', 114992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is requested.', 'Your counsel is requested.', 114991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get the Nightborne Soulstone right away, $n! I bet I can make the biggest explosion you\'ve ever seen!', '', 114990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is requested.', 'Your counsel is requested.', 114989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, Highlord, you will hear my words. We should focus our efforts on hunting down the dreadlord Balnazzar. It\'s time for retribution!', '', 114988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I stood this vigil, $n. I am tired of watching and waiting. The time to strike is now, or we will lose everything.', '', 114987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons\' souls will power the gateway. On your mark.', '', 114986, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, a council of war is a good idea. The Legion\'s forces are spreading across the Broken Isles. We must not lose our foothold there!', 114985, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 68367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Order of the Silver Hand is reborn. Its new leaders will not let it fail.', 114984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard rumors that we recovered a message from my father. Are my parents alive?', '', 114983, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 68329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel free to try the samples we have available today. We will continue the tour when you are finished.', 114982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have always felt drawn to the Light. Perhaps because this was my father\'s calling as well, and I wished to follow in his footsteps.', '', 114981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is our tasting pavilion. We serve only the finest varietals here - many of them enjoyed in the palace!', 114980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can purchase souvenirs and gifts from Sylverin, my assistant. Perhaps you could do that on your way out?', 114979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The courtyard you just left is open to visitors. From here forward, one of my staff must accompany you.', 114978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Highlord. I will speak my mind. The path of light is righteous and just. Whatever our means, let them remain virtuous.', 114977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is requested.', 'Your counsel is requested.', 114976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every day I learn more about the Light and its purpose in this world. And yet, I am still so far from the truth.', 114975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see your hunt was a success! I had no doubt it would be, of course.', '', 114974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A tour? Of course! I will show you the grounds myself.', 114973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Margaux glances to each side, silently assessing the situation.', 114972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had heard rumors... they seemed a little too good to be true.\n\nBear with me- we will need to tread carefully to avoid arousing suspicion. They are... not kind to us.', 114971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, Highlord. I will give an accurate account of our army and our operations.', 114970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 68363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the most dynamic Archmage I have encountered in centuries, $n. I am proud to call myself your champion.', '', 114969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage $n! You have certainly earned the title, my friend.', '', 114968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so glad I was right to choose you for the Tirisgarde, Archmage $n!', '', 114967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show your Sigil.>', '<Show your Sigil.>', 114966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please feel free to look around.', 114965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May I help you?', 114964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think you\'ll enjoy the view, $p. Let\'s go!', 114963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is requested.', 'Your counsel is requested.', 114962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We ride together.', 114961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Ah! The vineyards!', 114960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember seeing something like this before. But where...', 114959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I feared. The arcan\'dor is in peril.', '', 114957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n.', 114956, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoying the vineyard?', 114955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re everywhere...', 'They\'re everywhere...', 114954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Big Gamy Ribs.>', '<Give Big Gamy Ribs.>', 114953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Highmountain Salmon.>', '<Give Highmountain Salmon.>', 114952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Silkweave Bandages.>', '<Give Silkweave Bandages.>', 114951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! A great batch, for an amateur. I\'ll have it bottled at once!', '', 114950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Unseen Path is always welcome here.', 114949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my hope that one day our tribe may know peace.', 114948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We called the beast Dakarr. A once noble creature, driven to madness by a deranged vrykul mystic. Dorro fought it off, then tracked the beast back to Stormheim. He never returned, and Talonclaw was never seen again.', 114947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is sobering to think of how easily Kathra\'natir subverted my will. Thanks to $n\'s hard work, I am free and he is not.', '', 114946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67681, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These heroes slew terrible monsters and fought off countless invaders. Dorro Highmountain was last to wield it. His end came at the claws of a corrupted nightsaber that preyed upon our villages.', 114945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talonclaw has been lost for so long that many tauren have never even laid eyes upon it. The elders still tell stories of how our greatest hunters wielded the spear in defense of our land.', 114944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us be off. Follow me!', 114943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toss in something floral for a bit of class.', '', 114942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to add a bit of moisture or you\'ll back up the taps!', '', 114941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The batch needs something sour... something shady.', '', 114940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get into the vat and jump on the fruit!', '', 114939, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a drowned mana for you.', 'I have drowned mana for you.', 114938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yes, it\'s a flower.', '', 114937, 168, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes a flower, Father!', '', 114936, 168, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a heavy blend of barely-ripe shadowberry and manafruit, triple infused with Nightwell essence. It is best appreciated in small sips.', '', 114934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this is a fine vintage. Seventh generation manafruit entangled with slippery nightsap flavors and a delicate walnut finish.', '', 114933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This three year Infusion incorporates delightful berry elements with a scintillating melon bouquet. Refreshing, yes?', '', 114932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please teleport me back to Dalaran.', 'Please teleport me back to Dalaran.', 114931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks.', '', 114930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for letting me be a guest in your hall. I wish we were meeting under better circumstances.', '', 114929, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Brewfest is a sham! One day, everyone will recognize that Dire Brew is the best!', '', 114928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you need a hand, Ilsa.', 114927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone looks thirsty!', 114926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast! I\'m not your friend anymore.', '', 114925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67680, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have any rare fishing goods?', 'Have any rare fishing goods?', 114924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin then. I\'ll call out what you need to do, just follow my instructions.', '', 114923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I am ready to help make arcwine.', 'Yes, I am ready to help make arcwine.', 114922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing quite like the smell of fresh wine, ready for the barrel. Try making some for yourself, and you\'ll see!', '', 114921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another connoisseur? Perhaps you\'d like to help me prepare the unfortified wine?', '', 114920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... have you come to learn more about the ancient art of wine making?', '', 114919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inhabitants of Kharanos have been inspired to join the fight against the Legion!', '', 114918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Best get goin\' \'fore I\'m put out fer good.', 114917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms at the ready! We\'ve got comp\'ny!', 'Arms at the ready! We\'ve got comp\'ny!', 114916, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately we will be unable to keep that promise, Millhouse. So long as the Soulstone serves as Kathra\'natir\'s prison it is best left untouched. I\'m sure there are plenty of other powerful artifacts out there for you to find!', '', 114913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67679, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... the Nightborne Soulstone! All mine... I mean ours, of course!', '', 114912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67678, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a shining example of the strength of the new Tirisgarde! To our newest Archmage, $n!', 114911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 74825, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think our luck is changing for the better, old friend. With our newest Archmage and the might of the Tirisgarde, we will defeat the burning legion!', '', 114910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71585, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t just stand there waiting to be killed. Attack. Deploy the devastators!', 114909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not been this well in an eternity. The Nightborne Soulstone has rendered Kathra\'natir completely powerless. You have my utmost gratitude.', '', 114908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! When you defeated Kathra\'natir, I felt a great weight leave my mind!', '', 114907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71754, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ya $glad:lass;.', '', 114906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of \'em nearly took me head off! I\'ll track \'em down. You keep on, $n.', '', 114905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I? Let me get my head on straight and I\'ll be back.', '', 114904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! Need to fetch me a few weapons. Seem ta have lost mine... just can\'t remember where.', '', 114903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww... Me head! Thanks fer helpin\' me up. I\'ll be back when I can stand on me feet long enough ta help.', '', 114902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... who am I kidding? I\'m not a fighter. I better head inside. You be safe out here!', '', 114901, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just me and you. Fightin\' off those demons!', '', 114900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re right, $n. With a brave $c like you by my side we\'d be unstoppable!', '', 114899, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re quite brave, ya know. Think it best if I stay inside \'til it\'s a bit safer out here.', 114898, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not quite cut out fer this, I\'m afraid. Come back an\' see me when this is all over.', '', 114897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard \'em! Ready up!', 114896, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place contains a wealth of knowledge, $n! I have been reading a fascinating history of the Council of Tirisfal. Did you know that Meryl and Alodi actually created the Forge of the Guardians?', 114895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Hall of the Guardian\'s library rivals Silvermoon City\'s even in its current disarray. I will make sure that the Magisters support our efforts here.', 114894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your guidance to lead us, I am sure we will prevail against the Burning Legion!', '', 114893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deeds are quickly becoming the talk of the Hall, $n! I am proud to serve as your Champion.', '', 114892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe much to you, $n. I hope I am able to repay you in time.', '', 114891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What smells like dook? Oh, it is this strong brew. Wikket watch out! Don\'t spill it on you!', '', 114890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooo-hoo! This here wikket is makin\' good speed! But with my other riddles can this one succeed?', '', 114889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think they can come into our lands and cause a bit o\' trouble, eh? We\'ll see about that!', '', 114888, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade\'s ready fer a little action!', '', 114887, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sharpen yer blades! This ain\'t o\'er yet!', '', 114886, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time fer battle!', '', 114885, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 114884, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready yer weapons! Don\'t be caught off guard!', '', 114883, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are pathetic. I will be back.', '', 114882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me, $c! The Legion sees all! The Legion knows all!', '', 114881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I walk the land. I watch. I listen.$b$bThat is probably why you haven\'t seen me here before. Nothing suspicious.', '', 114880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These wounds? Hah! They\'ll make me a nice little story ta tell.', '', 114879, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ask. Just be ready to fight.', '', 114878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still a tad bit weak. I\'ll return once I\'m sure I can fight by yer side.', '', 114877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have ta come back when I\'m a tad stronger.', '', 114876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooooo! Mine...', '', 114875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You no take! I kills the thief!', '', 114874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohh! This taste! I must have more!', '', 114873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take yer rest. Ye ought ta be better in no time.', '', 114872, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My my, that was fun. We should do this again sometime.', 114871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye sure don\'t look like yerself, but... I\'m sure you\'ll be back ta normal in no time!', '', 114870, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheer up. You\'ll be back on yer feet in no time.', '', 114869, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh you terrible thing - I wasn\'t done here yet. Die!', 114868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Malefica watches the other druids intensely, until your presence disturbs her.>$b$bShhhh, $c. I am listening.$b$b<She turns her attention back to the nearby druids.>', 114867, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never caught a glimpse of what it was until it was too late.', '', 114866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely there\'s some way I can still be of some use.', '', 114865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The woman you are looking for is named Margaux. She has shown interest in our cause.', 114864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve procured a palanquin for you. Try to look imperious- it helps with the illusion.', 114863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try not to stare too long. For the upper echelons of our society, this place is hardly a distraction.', 114861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! I see you! Come and get me when this is over! Until then, please go away. You\'ll bring them here!', '', 114860, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a wrench and a very angry leper gnome! You better keep out, demons!', '', 114859, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can hear you up there! You demons better think twice before coming down here!', '', 114858, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up, before I lose my patience.', '', 114857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think me so foolish as to stand alone?', '', 114856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am nathrezim. Your efforts mean nothing!', '', 114855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh he hah... BATS!', '', 114853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arghh - no. NO! My disguise. I am Legion. I will destroy you!', '', 114852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bats bats bats.$b$bBats bats. Bats.', '', 114851, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our father\'s memorial is just around the corner. I am sure you will find Anarys nearby.', 114850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are here because I will it. You live because I will it. And you will serve because I will it!', '', 114849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are out of your league, paladin.', '', 114848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_jewelcrafting_immactaladite_purple:20|t Boulderfall begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:216970|h[Elemental Resonance]|h|r. Find cover!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_jewelcrafting_immactaladite_purple:20|t Boulderfall begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:216970|h[Elemental Resonance]|h|r. Find cover!', 114847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can get us access to the Violet Hold, where we\'ll be able to fight Hakkar without worry of any collateral damage.', 114845, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A coward\'s death to these traitorous \"draenei!\" Mar their corpses so the living may see the fate that awaits them!', '', 114844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring you a message from Kil\'jaeden, to be served in the blood of your people! JUSTICE WILL BE MET!', '', 114843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did your visions foretell of this day, Prophet? Did you see our coming?', '', 114842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We make our last stand at the Vault of Lights! If you can make your way here you will find sanctuary, although I cannot say for how long...', '', 114841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up, fool! The Bonespeakers will never let an outsider be judged worthy!', '', 114840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You again?! Do you really think to beat me, with the Legion at my side?', '', 114839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_playingwithfiregreen:20|t %s gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:208903|h[Burning Claws]|h|r!', '', 114838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together...', '', 114837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must... unite...', '', 114836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour of justice... has come...', '', 114835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... is our final stand...', '', 114834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not lose faith...', '', 114833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone up top. Commence bombardment!', '', 114832, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone up top. Commence bombardment!', '', 114831, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving into position above Niskara.', '', 114830, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving into position above Niskara.', '', 114829, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light... grant me one final blessing...', '', 114828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This power... it burns so brightly.$b$bMy brothers are fools to ignore this gift. Once I have enough energy I could take back the city by myself!', '', 114827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE', '', 114826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will sow havoc behind the lines. Nowhere is safe.', '', 114825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work here is not finished. Die, meddling $c!', '', 114824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The houndmaster grunts at you and glares with feral eyes.>', '', 114823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<grunts> Get out of here, $n! I\'ll find my--', '', 114822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out! Evasive maneuvers!', '', 114821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is filthy with corruption. I fear a long campaign awaits us.', '', 114820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll break Tirion free. You must find the Ashbringer while there\'s still time!', '', 114819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion! By all that is holy... what have they done to you?', '', 114818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Possession:20|t Legertha begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:57697|h[Horrific Visage]|h|r. Look away!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Possession:20|t Legertha begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:57697|h[Horrific Visage]|h|r. Look away!', 114817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that explains the chanting coming from his tent at all hours of the night. And the smell of sulphur.', 114816, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What...? Dareer was a demon all along? How did we not see that coming?', '', 114815, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guys, thanks. I am really proud of you. You all did a really great job.', '', 114814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrrrargg... No! No! Not the eyes...', '', 114813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t panic, we can do this... Aaahhhhh!', '', 114812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guys we have come a long way... Argggh', '', 114811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, don\'t stand in the Blizzard!', '', 114810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please help me!', '', 114809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', '', 114808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not again!', '', 114807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is called Ice Block, you big stupid Arrggghhh!', '', 114806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaaahh! My spine is going to Gaaarg!', '', 114805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are crushing me!', '', 114804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK, just stop squeezing.', '', 114803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaaaaaaaaaaaaa!', '', 114802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to be sick!', '', 114801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop shaking me!', '', 114800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want snow! Make the snow!', '', 114799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No place is safe. No mountain is too high to flee from the Legion\'s rage. I will return!', '', 114798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light... my flesh... No no NO you will ruin everything, fool of a $c!', '', 114797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You play with fire, fool $c! YOU WILL BURN!', '', 114796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was an ancient parable. About a woodcutter. He chopped wood as the forest burned.$b$b\"Why is it you chop wood?\" they ask him. \"The forest burns. Soon your house will burn.\"$b$bThe woodcutter, he watches the flames, he breathes in the smoke. \"Who am I to change?\" he asks. \"I am what I am.\"$b$b<Dareer chops another cord of wood.>$b$bThere is no moral.', '', 114795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glmrg! Gmlrgm mglrmgrl mrmglr!', '', 114794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one... that\'s two... ah yes, that is three! Now we find out if right wikket be!', '', 114793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consume my blood for power!', '', 114792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me, Mother of Worms!', '', 114791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flesh is yours, Naraxas!', '', 114790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up, wikket, make your feet into dancers! For my riddles you\'ll go off and find all the answers.', '', 114789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket got water, clear and pure, \'fore greenies from sky could dook it for sure.', '', 114788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari, prepare for the jump to Niskara!', '', 114787, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari, prepare for jump to Niskara!', '', 114786, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To me, servant!', '', 114785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Legion, come to our aid!', 114783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgrlilgrl! Mrglmr gmrlgrmglr?!', '', 114782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a Bushel of Apples!', '$n prepares a Bushel of Apples!', 114781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am shal\'dorei! I will not be denied!', 'I am shal\'dorei! I will not be denied!', 114780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to do something!', 'I have to do something!', 114779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll die without it! You have to help me!', 'I\'ll die without it! You have to help me!', 114778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Please help me!', 'Please! Please help me!', 114777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t keep me out!', 'You can\'t keep me out!', 114776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brah hah. Hah hah. Smashed. Disguises are a good plan. Hah hah.', '', 114775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braaahhhgg magic disguise stupid plan anyways. It is time to kill!', '', 114774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ogre. Totally ogre. Definitely not... NOT ogre.', '', 114773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<roars> Make them pay, $n! Make them--', '', 114772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannons! Fly low and dodge the blasts!', '', 114771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to select the appropriate target. A Soul Engine, perhaps? That battleship might do...', '', 114770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t live like this!', 'I can\'t live like this!', 114769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you have more! Give me the wine!', 'I know you have more! Give me the wine!', 114768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t take this anymore! Let me in!', 'I can\'t take this anymore! Let me in!', 114767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone!', 'Begone!', 114766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You forget your station, filth!', 'You forget your station, filth!', 114765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are out of line!', 'You are out of line!', 114764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back!', 'Stand back!', 114763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn your place, dog!', 'Learn your place, dog!', 114762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop right there!', 'Stop right there!', 114761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt!', 'Halt!', 114760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, a great weight has been lifted. Let us return to the Hall of the Guardian.', '', 114759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66492, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would not have thought it possible had I not witnessed it myself. Bravo!', 114758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66491, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, my mortal friend! We should bring that back to the Hall of the Guardian for safekeeping.', '', 114757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66490, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done it! Kathra\'natir is safely imprisoned within the Nightborne Soulstone!', '', 114756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66489, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really think you could defeat me, little mage? I am invincible!', '', 114755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s the Nightborne Soulstone! He\'s using it against an image of Meryl...', '', 114754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66494, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would see you banished before I allow you to grant judgment to an outsider!', '', 114753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spit on your ancient rites, shieldmaiden!', '', 114752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have defiled the old ways, mystic! The God-King is not worthy of the Halls of Valor!', 114751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some call me eccentric or even daft, but they fail to see the bigger picture. Our only hope in defeating the burning legion is to find new sources of power, even if that means taking great risks. \n\nYour new weapon is a testament to that!', '', 114750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each must die someday.', 114749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You could not kill me if you tried for a hundred years!', 114748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squish you!', '', 114747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Humongris is dead, and Padawsen is alive. Well done.', 114746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The powerful wizard, Padawsen, has been captured by Humongris. Find Humongris and kill him before he kills Pawdawen.', 114745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the strength... to shatter these bonds....', '', 114744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. This will be a fine test.', '', 114743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot fight my will. You are mine.', '', 114742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, kneel. Kneel before your new master!', '', 114741, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 63802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade is blinded by hatred and fear... driven to madness and murder. They are beyond redemption and undeserving of mercy.', '', 114740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years, our souls struggled against each other in the Twisting Nether. Then recently, we appeared back on Azeroth. That is how I found myself fighting for control of this new dreadlord body.', '', 114739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a Felsworn hiding amongst you. Did you know that?', '', 114738, 8, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Legion comes, and allow me to assure that they will, your little command center here will not be able to protect you.', '', 114737, 8, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to do whatever I can to defeat the Burning Legion, $p.', '', 114736, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for bringing me into your midst, $p. This \"trap\" will not be able to hold me forever.', '', 114735, 8, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While Razelikh is not privy to the Legion\'s current plans, he does know a great deal of magic that can give us an edge.', '', 114734, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to assure you, demon hunters, that you cannot trust anything that comes out of this mouth.', '', 114733, 8, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do my best to keep control over Razelikh and share all of its demonic knowledge with you.', '', 114732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOTHING CAN PREVENT YOUR WORLD FROM BURNING!', '', 114731, 8, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Loramus... no, I AM RAZELIKH! Enough demon, you will submit. I compel you!', '', 114730, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An eternity of exquisite pain and suffering await you. Know my name, Illidari, for I am Razelikh the Defiler!', '', 114729, 8, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long must I endure?!', '', 114728, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p. Illidari. Hear me. I will take great pleasure in sacrificing each of you to Kil\'jaeden just as soon as I break Loramus\'s hold on my body.', '', 114727, 8, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO, demon! You will not prevail.', '', 114726, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, to break these fetters and feast upon your souls. Ahahahahahaha!', '', 114725, 8, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike me down, you fools, before Razelikh regains control!', '', 114724, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tsk, tsk, Varedis. Fair is fair. Until we meet again in the flesh, $n.', 114723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I for one hope that you refuse. Then, those warglaives will once again return to their rightful owner.', '', 114722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great power will be imbued into those who join us. Painful agony awaits those who do not.', 114721, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me, Illidari! All present are welcome into the embrace of the Legion.', '', 114720, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 66922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... and to prove that you are not safe, not even here on the Fel Hammer.', 114719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, enough with the pleasantries. Our lord, Kil\'jaeden, has sent us to let you know that you and your Illidari will soon be joining the Burning Legion...', '', 114718, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite the ragtag bunch you have here, $n. I would have thought you could do better.', '', 114717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How touching. A few more champions. As if that will help in any way.', 114716, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kil\'jaeden will have you...', '', 114715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Kil\'jaeden has ordered your capture. You will join the Burning Legion.', '', 114714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Molten Charskin becomes |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200672|h[Crystal Cracked]|h|r!', '', 114713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. You have sealed your fate. Varedis and Caria will deal with you.', '', 114712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may grovel now, demon hunter.', '', 114711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your Illidari will join the Burning Legion. You will become Felsworn.', '', 114710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny mortal. Your insolence has come to an end.', '', 114709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All things must end. The dream is dead. Forever.', '', 114708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am revealed! Fight me if you must - your kind will never win.', '', 114707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nightmare consumes, $c. It devours from within. It overwhelms one\'s thoughts as easily as it creeps across the terrain.$b$bInevitably, the mind fills with shadows, and all hope is eclipsed.$b$bIt is terrible. It is... beautiful...', '', 114706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there, upon that terrible sight. How many disasters must we face before we can at last find peace?', '', 114697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63543, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope ya shot that demon right between the eyes!', '', 114685, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My masters will hear of this... The Legion will set this whole coast aflame...', '', 114684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Blast you, $c scum! My ruse was flawless!', '', 114683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Caprina reeks of animal fur and dung.>$b$bWhat\'re you looking at, $c? Why don\'t you go bother Crawford or Heathrow?', '', 114682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokmora creates |cFFFF0000|Hspell:215898|h[Crystaline Ground]|h|r! Don\'t move!', '', 114681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, commander. Danath awaits you on Krasus\' Landing.', '', 114680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you please, this is an urgent matter that requires your attention!', '', 114679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bear an important message from Danath Trollbane!', '', 114678, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander! I have a message for you!', '', 114677, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 63534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grunts and shoves the goat away, embarrased.', '', 114673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nudges Maxwell\'s ankle.', '', 114671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others await you in the sanctum beneath the chapel, $n.', '', 114670, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others should be waiting for you in the sanctum beneath the chapel, $n.', 'The others should be waiting for you in the sanctum beneath the chapel, $n.', 114669, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is our likely end on those shores. You know this, yet I can see the determination in your eyes. Perhaps you have honor to regain there as well.', '', 114668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 75604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For ours is the Unseen Path.', 114667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We walk the lonely road.', 114666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the eagle on the wind.', 114665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the watchers in the wild.', 114664, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I will go with you. No one should fight alone.', 'Then I will go with you.', 114663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We exist to protect those who need it most, often without reward or recognition.', 114662, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not fight for glory, for fame, or riches.', 114661, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 66624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That battle, I can find no glory in it. Too many died, but I did not. The anger within me grows every minute I stare at that storm.\n\nI will return to the Broken Shore, for those under my command. I will kill demons until their glory is found and my honor restored. Do not seek to counsel against this, I am set in my ways.', '', 114660, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In times like these, our oath is more important than ever.', 114659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion is at our doorstep, demanding to be reckoned with.', 114658, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be naive to assume this is the last threat Azeroth will face.', 114657, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 66621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You struck the fel lord down before he had a chance to terrorize the city. You upheld the oath we all took to watch and protect.', 114656, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With Hakkar dead, the citizens of Dalaran will be safe. Most will never know the threat they faced, thanks to your heroic actions.', 114655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will teach you to interfere with the Legion\'s plans...', '', 114654, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What must you do?', 'What must you do?', 114653, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
