('As I fell, I saw one of the nightfallen slinking into our caves.', '', 114497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did we do to deserve this?', '', 114496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, little $c. Senegos was wise to trust in you.', '', 114495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light of Elune no longer shines on the wildkin of this grotto. They have become fearsome owlbeasts and are a danger to all.', 114494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting. Cultivated with extreme care. It seems even the reckless Nightborne know that life and magic must exist in balance.', '', 114493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know how Suramar\'s isolation changed its inhabitants - but what of the plant life? Satisfy my curiosity with samples from the Court of Stars.', '', 114492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is quite a story. Let\'s go.', 'That is quite a story. Let\'s go.', 114491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prepare the ceremony while you assist our allies.', '', 114490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 114489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The death of his enforcer should send the right message. Finish the ritual, he\'s sure to attack soon.', '', 114488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work. That should slow them down.', 114487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the vaunted Duskwatch. If you could liberate some of their supplies, it would greatly aid our cause.', 114486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortals within Stormheim are forever in your debt. Come, claim your prize.', '', 114485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plaguemaw scours the seas of Helheim, leaving only carrion in his wake. Destroy this menace!', '', 114484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see you\'re a friend of the Crusade. I\'ve managed to smuggle some equipment out of the Monastery in an attempt to raise funds for our order. We will not rest until the unliving have been driven from Azeroth!\n\nDo keep in mind you and your ilk have left us on the verge of ruin, so what I\'m selling won\'t come cheap.', 114483, 0, 40972, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and I both know your \'order\' is broke and can use every copper you can get your hands on. Quiet your empty protests and take my money.', 'You and I both know your \'order\' is broke and can use every copper you can get your hands on. Quiet your empty protests and take my money.', 114482, 0, 40974, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Crusade!', 'For the Crusade!', 114481, 0, 40972, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interlopers like you are responsible for gutting the strength of the Scarlet Crusade! We would\'ve eradicated the unliving from this world and the Burning Legion would have never come this far! Begone!', 114480, 0, 40973, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose you\'ll just have to trust me, won\'t you?', 114479, 0, 40972, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unliving scum! Your very existence is an insult to everyone who lost their families to the Scourge. Take that tabard off and crawl back into your grave before I put you there!', 114478, 0, 40974, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sudden reappearance of the Scarlet Crusade with a newfound drive to wipe out the undead of the world? I\'ve heard this one before. You\'re a dread lord, aren\'t you?', 'Sudden reappearance of the Scarlet Crusade with a newfound drive to wipe out the undead of the world? I\'ve heard this one before. You\'re a dread lord, aren\'t you?', 114477, 0, 40972, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the Highlord\'s absence has affected more than just the living.', '', 114476, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 63814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me, small one...', '', 114475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes! Surrender your power, dragon. These pools belong to the Nightborne now!', '', 114474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin points at the Leyscar Scuttler.', '', 114473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is your ship, $n. Light be with you.', 'This is your ship, $n. Light be with you.', 114472, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give them hell, $n.', 'Give them hell, $n.', 114471, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 114470, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should leave for Uther\'s Tomb at once.', '', 114469, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters, we must not forget the Ashbringer. Tirion may be gone, but the highblade is still out there somewhere.', '', 114468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63775, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s looking at you!', '', 114467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are reports that the Legion brought a demonic watchdog known as Velimar into the city. Convenient! I could use its eyes to enhance the network.', '', 114466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll scout out ahead for a good vantage point. Meet me close to the city wall once you have a grapple.', 114465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use protection magic! That damage is too much for me to heal!', '', 114464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis not enough rum in the world to make yer face look good, ye blasted, sorry sea bass!', '\'Tis not enough rum in the world to make yer face look good, ye blasted, sorry sea bass!', 114463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis good ye\'re here. Ye\'ll scare away the rats!', '\'Tis good ye\'re here. Ye\'ll scare away the rats!', 114462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer ship has more holes than a sponge, ye slack-jawed cockroach!', 'Yer ship has more holes than a sponge, ye slack-jawed cockroach!', 114461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the grid is clearing up nicely. I knew I could count on you!', '', 114460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have detected an anomaly in the area drawing power from our network! Locate and dispose of it in any fashion you see fit.', '', 114459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take this round.', 'You take this round.', 114458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine duel.', 'Fine duel.', 114457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have bested me.', 'You have bested me.', 114456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I won\'t be so easy on you!', 'Next time I won\'t be so easy on you!', 114455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take care of the Houndmaster, and we\'ll focus our attacks on his hounds.', '', 114454, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have won.', 'You have won.', 114453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the duel.', 'Thank you for the duel.', 114452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well struck.', 'Well struck.', 114451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good battle.', 'Good battle.', 114450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s duel.', 'Let\'s duel.', 114449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel like training with me?', 'Feel like training with me?', 114448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admire your skill in battle. How about a quick match?', 'I admire your skill in battle. How about a quick match?', 114447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel like showing me a few pointers?', 'Feel like showing me a few pointers?', 114446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you\'ve got!', 'Show me what you\'ve got!', 114445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could use a good fight.', 'I could use a good fight.', 114444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about a duel?', 'How about a duel?', 114443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now you fools have fallen into my trap. Let\'s see how you fare in the dark.', 114442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye be as repulsive as a monkey in a negligee!', 'Ye be as repulsive as a monkey in a negligee!', 114441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I already have the Sargerite Keystone. But I stayed just so that I could put an end to you... once and for all.', 114440, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 63244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A black spot upon thee, ye barnacle bottomed sluggard!', 'A black spot upon thee, ye barnacle bottomed sluggard!', 114439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have what I was after. But I stayed just so that I could put an end to you... once and for all!', 114438, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 63243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye smell of fish an\' swine, ye mermaid marryin\' monkey!', 'Ye smell of fish an\' swine, ye mermaid marryin\' monkey!', 114437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll skewer yer gizzard, ye fish-kissin\', vile cur...', 'I\'ll skewer yer gizzard, ye fish-kissin\', vile cur...', 114436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye fight like a dairy farmer, ye lyin\' scabby halfwit!', 'Ye fight like a dairy farmer, ye lyin\' scabby halfwit!', 114435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye don\' need a sword. Yer face be deadlier! Garr!', 'Ye don\' need a sword. Yer face be deadlier! Garr!', 114434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll devour yer parrot ye mutinous blowfish!', 'I\'ll devour yer parrot ye mutinous blowfish!', 114433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How utterly predictable! I knew that you would come.', 114432, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 63242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Is Kathra\'natir behind the attack on Meryl?', 'Is Kathra\'natir behind the attack on Meryl?', 114431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. It is Meryl he is after. He is using the Nightborne Soulstone and the power of the Nexus to drain Meryl of his power. Together you and I may be able to stop him. \n\nHe is still here, somewhere below. We must find him!', '', 114430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never willingly betray our cause, $n!\n\nI was gathering notes on the Nightborne Soulstone when I was contacted by an emissary of the Empyrean Society. When I arrived at their enclave, our old nemesis Kathra\'natir was waiting for me. \n\nHe has been in my head ever since, controlling my every word and action.', '', 114429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have much to explain. Why have you betrayed us?', 'You have much to explain. Why have you betrayed us?', 114428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks! I had been hanging there for an eternity.', '', 114427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66496, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... it BURNS... You will pay for this, $c!', '', 114426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am forever indebted to you, $n.', '', 114425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay with your life for what you\'ve done!', '', 114424, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hounds!', '', 114423, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran will fall to the Burning Legion!', '', 114422, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once sated, my hounds will charge the city, slaughtering everyone in their path.', '', 114421, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yarrrrr! Thar be Ol\' Eary, terror of the open seas! Now\'s our chance boys, git \'em!', 114420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When they are done tearing you apart limb from limb, they will begin their feast on the magical prisoners within these cells.', '', 114419, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence was not accounted for, but I believe my hounds will enjoy making a meal of you nonetheless.', '', 114418, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So we meet again.', '', 114417, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('No offense, but I don\'t have time to chat. I have a shield to find!', '', 114413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re needed urgently at Krasus\' Landing first. Tyrosus sent me.', 'You\'re needed urgently at Krasus\' Landing first. Tyrosus sent me.', 114412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one has survived this trial ever!', '', 114411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plunder these tombs no more!', '', 114410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more challengers! Disturb these kings no more!', '', 114409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archers, mark your targets!', 114408, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight no matter what comes our way!', 'We fight no matter what comes our way!', 114406, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand up and fight! For the Horde!', 'Stand up and fight! For the Horde!', 114405, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground. This war\'s only just beginning.', 'Hold your ground. This war\'s only just beginning.', 114404, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep them out! Reinforcements are on the way.', 'Keep them out! Reinforcements are on the way.', 114403, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them back! We\'re not giving this camp up without a fight!', 'Hold them back! We\'re not giving this camp up without a fight!', 114402, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may not be alone in this after all, Tahu! Let\'s see what Tyrosus has ta say.', '', 114401, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrosus, now he\'s a good man. Count me in! There\'s too much danger about to turn down a wee bit o\' help!', '', 114400, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fallen souls may float adrift for eternity, but none more by her hand. Thank you, champion.', '', 114399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that\'s the one! Shield Hill it is. There\'s no time ta waste.', '', 114397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The troops are itching for a fight, $n. Why don\'t you show them a few moves?', '', 114396, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soulfiend Tagerma preys upon the souls of worthy vrykul! Slay her, and you shall be justly rewarded.', '', 114395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are in your debt. I will pass word of your deeds here to Prince Farondis.', 114394, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest now, sister. Your torment has ended.', 114393, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greenies from sky done grooked my best grookers.$b$bSo we train with the wikkets. Sometimes kings can\'t be choosers!', '', 114392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there is any chance of finding aid, Efrina and I will come. Stay, Dawnbreaker.', '', 114391, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 63776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to Krasus\' Landing. We may be able to help your order.', 'Come to Krasus\' Landing. We may be able to help your order.', 114390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you walk in the path of the Light.\n\nWhat guides you here this day?', '', 114389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even if no one here will help us, we must fulfill our duty. Let us pray that what remains of our order will be enough.', '', 114388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the top of Thorim\'s Peak.', 'Take me to the top of Thorim\'s Peak.', 114387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Throrim\'s Peak outside the Thorignir Refuge.', 'Take me to Throrim\'s Peak outside the Thorignir Refuge.', 114386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the top of the Galebroken Path.', 'Take me to the top of the Galebroken Path.', 114385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish, I can take you back up to the mountains.', '', 114384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect. These specimens are ideal for focusing magic.', '', 114383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is residual magic all about this island. If you gather some Azsunian pearls, we can use them as foci for some of our magics.', '', 114382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t come all the way out here for this!', '', 114381, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s goin\' on around here?', '', 114380, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! Now get moving! No telling when they\'ll be back.', 'Thanks! Now get moving! No telling when they\'ll be back.', 114379, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One second I was up, the next I was... well, you know. Take care of yourself. It\'s crazy out here!', 'One second I was up, the next I was... well, you know. Take care of yourself. It\'s crazy out here!', 114378, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s clucks loudly as it moves in your direction.', '', 114377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you only knew what was coming...', '', 114376, 0, 40924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin breaks the cocoon open.', '', 114375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglrg! Glrmglmrg mglrmgl gmlrg. Mrglmrg?', '', 114374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgrlilrgl shakes their head and looks at Pearlhunter Phin.', '', 114373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrlgmrlg, mgrmlgr rgmlrgmlr?', '', 114372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grlgr mrlgml. Mrglrglmr!', '', 114371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglglrm! Mrlgmrlg mglr!', '', 114370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grmlrgr! Mlrgmlrg mglrm glrmg!', '', 114369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mlrgmlrg. Mrlg mrglmr, mlrglrmgr? Grlgmlmrg rglmrglmr.', '', 114368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glrgm! Mrglmrlg mrglmglr? Mrl? Grlm?!', '', 114367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Mrglglrm gestures at you.', '', 114366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grmlrgm... mrglrgml mlrmglrg mrmg. Mrgl...', '', 114365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Meet me at Krasus\' Landing when you are ready.', '', 114364, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 63770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grlgm. Mrglmrglr!', '', 114363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglrmglr? Grlmglrg!', '', 114362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here when you are ready.', '', 114361, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your counsel is paramount to our next move against the Legion.', '', 114360, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sincere apologies for the insistence, $p, but we must speak immediately.', '', 114359, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require your aid with a matter of the utmost importance.', '', 114358, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
