('You imagine yourself to be free, but you will always be His instrument...', '', 114202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You exist by His whim alone.', '', 114201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet you do as He commands.', '', 114200, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 64181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You believe that you are in control, that your will is your own...', '', 114199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rabbits! They\'re everywhere! They control everything!', '', 114198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep that up and you might just disappear, bub.', '', 114197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, how bout you help with with a new trick? I just need to find that saw...', '', 114196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where\'d that rabbit run off to?', '', 114195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tips are appreciated!', '', 114194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is mana, friend!', '', 114193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah?', '', 114192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick a card!', '', 114191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you wanna go?', '', 114190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up!', '', 114189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Guardians protect you.', '', 114188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the Council commands.', '', 114187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it.', '', 114186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Guardian stands ready.', '', 114185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I needed?', '', 114184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust the wisdom of the Council.', '', 114183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have accomplished a great deal in bringing us all together here. With our renewed resolve and carefully considered plans, I have no doubt that we can win this war.\n\nWhen this is all over, the Burning Legion will no longer be a threat and all of our sacrifices will have been worth it.', '', 114182, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve accomplished a great deal in bringing us all together here. With the changes that you are making in how the Illidari operate, I have no doubt that we can win this war.\n\nWhen this is all over, the Burning Legion will no longer be a threat and all of our sacrifices will have been worth it.', '', 114181, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consume your soul! Oh my, now where did that come from?', '', 114180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consume your soul!', '', 114179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would not like me when I\'m angry.', '', 114178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some demons are best left unwakened.', '', 114177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tirisgarde must not fail.', '', 114176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlords must fall.', '', 114175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the Nathrezim.', '', 114174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor the Tirisfalen.', '', 114173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my ear.', '', 114172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help how I can.', '', 114171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 114170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What knowledge do you seek?', '', 114169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late. Vargoth has already won!', '', 114168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRGRLM! Mlrgmr, gmrlg Glrmrgl mrlg Mrgrlilrgl.', '', 114167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglrg! Grmgl, grmlgrmlg mlrgr lrrg.', '', 114166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin triumphantly pulls out handful of long fangs from the pile of sand.', '', 114165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin runs over and begins digging furiously.', '', 114164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrlg. Grlgm.', '', 114163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grglrgl! Lrgl... Grgrmrmlgr! MLGMRMLGR!', '', 114162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgrlg! Glrgmrl mgrlgr...', '', 114161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin throws their arms in the air, seemingly frustrated.', '', 114160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin hops around impatiently.', '', 114159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin groans and kicks a nearby rock.', '', 114158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a nice space for a mortal. Let\'s see what secrets it is hiding.', '', 114157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67674, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'ve seen it rain cats and dogs, but I\'m not sure what to call this!', '', 114156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Field could use a few more bombs!', '', 114155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you, $n, but my ancestors were more brave than I.', '', 114154, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me help goblin lady fight bad guy!', '', 114153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I make these Demon Hunters nervous. Little old me. Tehd from Lordaeron. Hee hee.$b$BAlways remember, in a land of fel infused ancient elves, the peasant with a good banish spell is king.', '', 114152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating! This is a spell book of ancient Nightborne rituals. I must borrow it sometime.', '', 114151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is interesting. I had no idea Archmage Vargoth was also interested in the breeding habits of angelfish!', '', 114150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67672, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals and their crystal balls... Although this one may actually be more than just a novelty.', '', 114149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That stinks! It\'s covered in mold. Archmage Vargoth has been away longer than I thought.', '', 114148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67670, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst, hey, got some lucky charms here. Don\'t want to face the Legion without a little luck on your side, do ya?', '', 114147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEFORE YOU!!!', '', 114145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KNEEL...', '', 114144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we will NEVER...', '', 114143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. I knew what I must do.', '', 114142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m giving you an opportunity to kneel before me, princeling. Maybe something can be done about that little curse...', 114141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And look at you now! A spectre of your former self, cursed to an eternity of undeath and ineptitude.', 114140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a healer, it shouldn\'t be too difficult to save this civilian.', 'As a healer, it shouldn\'t be too difficult to save this civilian.', 114139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomb\'s up ahead. Let\'s get in there and find that shrine! We\'ll follow yer lead, $n.', '', 114138, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These feltotem pretty tasty once get them out of crunchy shell.', '', 114137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the shipment in? Please tell me there is more... please...', '', 114136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fantastic job. We can absolutely use this in our research.', 114135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar\'s wand crackles to life.', 'Khadgar\'s wand crackles to life.', 114134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That does not mean I am wrong.', 'That does not mean I am wrong.', 114133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone might hear you!', 'Someone might hear you!', 114132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somehow I do not think we have been merely overlooked.', 'Somehow I do not think we have been merely overlooked.', 114131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t seen a porter in days... how is it possible to overlook an entire community like this?', 'Haven\'t seen a porter in days... how is it possible to overlook an entire community like this?', 114130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a turtle of massive size inhabiting Deepbeard\'s Cove. Bring me the shell so that we can investigate its legendary toughness.', 114129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Afflicted Nightborne Citizen shivers violently while staring blankly into the distance.', 114128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-soon, little one. Soon,  I promise.', '', 114127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, I\'m thirsty... can I have some mana juice?', 'Father I\'m thirsty... can I have some mana juice?', 114126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flame of the shal\'dorei flickers. We must re-ignite it.', 114125, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 67562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her attempts to control time\'s flow are futile. Subtle forces work against her, ones far more powerful then she could ever imagine.', '', 114123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has seen into the Great Dark and beheld the Legion\'s glorious works. I wonder how you will react when you glimpse them as well!', '', 114122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like most of the nathrezim, Tichondrius is as arrogant as he is deadly. His ego will be his undoing!', '', 114121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has strong ties to the Dark Lord. To consolidate our control over the Legion, we should eliminate our competition while we have the chance.', '', 114120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it not glorious to witness such mighty beings bowing at your feet? I sacrificed everything, EVERYTHING, for such power. One day you too must pay ambition\'s price.', '', 114119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me no stay here!', '', 114118, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one bears partial blame for me being in this form! He will not escape my wrath, but there are others far more responsible who must be dealt with first!', '', 114117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raaar!', '', 114116, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me hurt dem later!', '', 114115, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! Dey hurt!', '', 114114, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me no like dem.', '', 114113, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watching you hone your craft brings back old memories. I was an instructor, millennia ago. My students were the finest summoners of Argus... until we were betrayed.', '', 114112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will face my former kin in this conflict. Good! I\'ve awaited my revenge for millennia. They will pay for what they did to me!', '', 114111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' ain\'t right.', 'Somethin\' ain\'t right.', 114110, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm? What was that?', 'Hmm? What was that?', 114109, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I might\'ve spotted somethin\' over here.', 'I think I might\'ve spotted somethin\' over here.', 114108, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on out, before I lose me patience!', 'Come on out, before I lose me patience!', 114107, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy now... I just wanna talk.', 'Easy now... I just wanna talk.', 114106, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t be gettin\' past me that easily.', 'You won\'t be gettin\' past me that easily.', 114105, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on out, ya scoundrel!', 'Come on out, ya scoundrel!', 114104, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, someone\'s nearby.', 'Aye, someone\'s nearby.', 114103, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, cretin!', 'Show yourself, cretin!', 114102, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s an intruder nearby.', 'There\'s an intruder nearby.', 114101, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light, what was that?', 'By the Light, what was that?', 114100, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll find you in the king\'s name!', 'I\'ll find you in the king\'s name!', 114099, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell a cultist!', 'I smell a cultist!', 114098, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While my blades yearn to spill demonic blood, I am under orders strictly to observe.$b$bThe knowledge these spiritwalkers have of the local area as well as the spirits that threaten our forces has already proven invaluable.$b$bWe will continue to offer them shelter and supplies as long as they continue to be useful.', '', 114097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of \'em is close!', 'One of \'em is close!', 114096, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', 'What was that?', 114095, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard something.', 'I heard something.', 114094, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family has watched over these burial grounds since the days of Huln himself! We tended the honored dead with pride, skilled in our charge to guide their spirits and learn from them.$b$bNow thanks to the thrice foul Bloodtotem tribe, if they even call themselves that anymore, I find I must ask for aid from outsiders.$b$bThese are dark days indeed.', '', 114093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s meet at the hall. There\'s still work to be done.', 114092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be a way through!', 'There must be a way through!', 114091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No...', '', 114087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve given them the finest enchantment I can offer.', 114086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, the weapons are finished.', 114085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My work is almost complete. I just need a few more moments without interruption...', 114084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep doing what I do best, as long as you keep those demons away from me and my enchanting table.', 114083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The materials used are extremely volatile. An interruption of any kind could prove disastrous.', 114082, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons will be drawn to the power I\'ll call upon to enchant your weapons.', 114081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However you wish this to proceed, we are with you, $n. I remind you that he betrayed the Master, leading to our imprisonment and Illidan\'s death.\n\nIf it weren\'t for Akama, the Burning Legion might already be defeated. While we want him as an advisor, his previous actions suggest that he is not to be trusted.\n\nDon\'t misunderstand, the Master said that we should recruit Akama, so I am in favor of the plan. However, it does not sound like he is willing to be reasonable.\n\nAllari and I have formulated a contingency plan just in case.', '', 114080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However you wish this to go down, we are with you, $n. Though, I would counsel restraint, if possible.\n\nThe knowledge that he has could prove instrumental in bringing down the Burning Legion. We want Akama to become a trusted advisor, despite his past history with the Illidari.\n\nHopefully, he will listen to reason. The tone of his voice suggests not.', '', 114079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements to the keep at once. They\'re here!', '', 114078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ship is waiting at the end of this dock, $n. Be careful out there.', '', 114077, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sam! Where did you get that stick? Put it down, it\'s dirty.', '', 114076, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll protect you, Ella! I\'ve got a sword and everything!', '', 114075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good!', 114074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, baby, he\'ll be home before you know it.', 114073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Momma, is daddy coming home soon?', 114072, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got them!', 114071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, keep me away from that thing! I don\'t need my magic to be drained again.', '', 114070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m tracking someone... the gate\'s been breached!', 114069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baron runs back to camp with his tail wagging.', '', 114068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the feeling is mutual.', '', 114067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this looks cheery.', '', 114066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one reminds me of a felguard. Big, strong, and stupid.', '', 114065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry up, Than! Let\'s find them!', 114064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I thought we\'d lost them forever.', 114063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? Kallistia and Olothil are here?', 114062, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this creature. Such sloppy technique! It would never be able to master the binding magic needed for a warlock.', '', 114061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got some o\' the forge\'s best armor polish for the troops here, $n. Don\'t be shipping off without gettin\' some o\' those scuffs out first.', '', 114060, 0, 924, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! I\'m really free!', 'I\'m free! I\'m really free!', 114059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to check on my wife. Thank you!', 'I have to check on my husband. Thank you!', 114058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is the last time I complain about the demons!', 'That is the last time I complain about the demons!', 114057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was innocent, but they didn\'t listen...', 'I was innocent, but they didn\'t listen...', 114056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can go home!', 'I can go home!', 114055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not know if I would make it out of this alive. Thank you.', 'I did not know if I would make it out of this alive. Thank you.', 114054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baron has found something.', '', 114053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon the monstrosity before you. The Legion had no part in its creation. No, this creature is the folly of the titans\' designs.', '', 114052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light reveals all!', '', 114050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear them? The screams of the souls that form every board and nail of this ship. They\'re like... music!', '', 114049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a faint caw in the distance and then silence...', '', 114046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well. The Dreamweavers are in your debt.', 114045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The majestic Mythana has become befouled by the Nightmare. Search her out and put her out of her misery.', 114044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Severing, secure the keep gates! We\'re moving the king to a secure location.', '', 114042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, listen to reason.', '', 114041, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re here to help us find mom and dad.', 114040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that brought back some unpleasant memories.', '', 114039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are only here to talk, Akama.', '', 114038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The recruitment of the eredar was quite a win for Sargeras. He desperately needed more intelligence in his warhost.', 114037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oops. Sorry.', 114036, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, brother! Someone\'s here to...', 114035, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is ironic that the weakest of us may be the ultimate victor. C\'Thun, Yogg-Saron, Y\'Shaarj, and... well. Only one would remain to consume the world, that was always meant to be.', 114034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. Now at least something will remain once the naga have been driven out.', 114033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Valarjar were able to be unleashed from this place they would be a significant hindrance to the Legion. Stuck here, they\'re useless.', '', 114032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There has been a rumored sighting of the behemoth known as Shellmaw, carving a swath of destruction through the Whispering Willows!', 114031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another mindwarped servant of Xavius. A druid should have better control of his own mind, don\'t you think?', 114030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A corrupted corpse of a dragon... how dangerous could that possibly be?', 114029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<evil laughter>', 114028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<short chuckle>', 114027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long has this one\'s time been coming. A true servant of the fallen titan, he seeks the doom of all things. As if that would really save them from the Void.', 114026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She claims to know the future, but those who have lived far longer than her know the truth. Her desperate bid to remain in control dooms her people.', 114025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is one who has caught the merest glimpse of your grim reality. It warped his mind forever.', 114024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such arrogance, even for a long-lived elf. The taste of her life force is... exquisite.', 114023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An interesting amalgamation of fel species. I wonder, are there more of its kind?', 114022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An interesting mutation of an ancient species. Its shell is nearly impregnable. Nearly...', 114021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That creature may seem impressive, but the spells which give it form are barely holding it together. Break the ritual supporting it and the rest shall soon crumble.', '', 114020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, the Shade of Xavius must be stopped.', 'Please, the Shade of Xavius must be stopped.', 114019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am alive? Thank you!', 'I am alive? Thank you!', 114018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, adventurer.', 'Thank you, adventurer.', 114017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your existence is at an end, mortals!', '', 114016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha. Fools! You know nothing!', '', 114015, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... are... EVERYWHERE!', '', 114014, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion cannot be stopped!', '', 114013, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can protect you.', '', 114012, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The God of the Deep writhes in his prison, breaking free ever so slowly. You should hurry and defeat the fallen titan... there are greater battles yet to fight.', 114011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before the might of the Legion!', '', 114010, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals. NOTHING can save you!', '', 114009, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We may face some of my brethren in this conflict... a prospect that delights me. Their power will be mine! They will pay for what was done to me long ago.', 114008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I remember the Dark Iron fondly. Modgud was so easy to influence, such was her hate. Imagine her fury when I abandoned her to the Wildhammer at the worst time. I can be very easy to lose... remember that.', 114007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Xavius is crafty. He hides his true form while gathering power with an illusion. We would do well to learn from him.', '', 114006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The nearness of the Void here is comforting. I was used in the sacrifice of many creatures in a place like this. Every death brought us closer to the complete corruption of this world.', 114005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, they were just normal crab claws but larger? That\'s unfortunate.', 114004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reports indicate that there is a colossal crab dwelling within the Shipwreck Shoals. Supposedly, its claws are stronger than steel! We could fashion them into mighty weapons.', 114003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I long for the day our masters can truly pass into this realm. You have only seen fragments, shadows, the faintest of echoes. Ask the ethereals what one of these manifestations is capable of.', 114002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, sorry.', 114001, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'CURSED SPIRITS!', 114000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and then she got so mad that she turned everybody into... into...', 113999, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"HOW DARE YOU DEFY ME!?\"', 113998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and then Queen Azshara was like...', 113997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"NO!\"', 113996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember how Queen Azshara was working with the demons? Well apparently, when Prince Farondis found out, he was like...', 113995, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you feel it cease to exist?', 113994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get a load of this, brother!', 113993, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boring.', 113992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy that?', 113991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every little death helps.', 113990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Delicious.', 113989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do the naaru speak of the eternal conflict? That the entire history of your world is but a fraction of the time that has passed? Of those that came before the draenei? No? <short chuckle>', 113988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve gathered quite the group of followers. It is fortunate they are focused on this incursion and not the true war. The scope of it might destroy your minds.', 113987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, if it isn\'t my prodigal student Talixae. She was missing when the Vindicators put me in chains and slew the rest of my disciples. I look forward to witnessing her death!', '', 113986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know the naaru consider us horrors to be resisted. We do not share this view. They are merely beloved brethren that lost the true path. They will return to their masters... in time.', 113985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The research into the Void here is commendable, but ultimately futile. How could you possibly understand what the titans did not?', 113984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware! His advisor is far more than he seems. Keep your wits about you!', '', 113983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The walls between realms are thin here, so easy to tear open. Do you know what would happen if true shadow and light met here?', 113982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has drunk deeply of the fel. It\'s unfortunate we don\'t have time to see if she can be bound like any other demon.', '', 113981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting... what a creative use of residual soul energy! We must remember to research this technique!', '', 113980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost completely gone, as if it never existed. But the Rift is deep and vast, and somewhere down there it stirs. Something has changed, the last prison weakens. We must prepare.', 113979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xavius, running from one master to the next. Scrambling for power, yet defeated again and again. The God of the Deep picks a poor champion, or is there something else at play?', 113978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like this place. Release me!', '', 113977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ocean\'s depths are dark and foreboding. So like the endless Void.', '', 113976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is nothing but a shadow of itself. We will crush it last so that its inhabitants may despair at the destruction of their world!', '', 113975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xavius uses the power of his new master well. Warping the mind of a demigod is no mean feat.', 113974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land\'s destruction is an unfinished work. Once complete, it will be a fitting tribute for the great Sargeras.', 113973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corrupting the guardians of the Dream is a bold move, but Xavius may be overreaching. He would be better off quietly spreading the Nightmare\'s influence instead of raising such alarm.', 113972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see spirits all throughout the ruins of this land. Souls ready to be harvested!', '', 113971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another defender of the titans brought low. Every death makes it easier. Perhaps now his misery will end... though I doubt it.', 113970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another seed of corruption planted in death. An unquiet spirit will wander in anger and grow in pain. Easy prey for the God of the Deep.', 113969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears the prison of N\'Zoth is not as strong as it once was. What you see is a tiny growth of the behemoth that may yet consume your world.', 113968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great dragons bent to the will of Xavius, who serves the God of the Deep. Instead of breathing life, she consumes all around her.', 113967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we\'re going to the beach! Time off is in my contract, right?', '', 113966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do whatever it takes to preserve peace on Azeroth.', '', 113965, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place was devastated long ago. Why do you waste my time, mortal?', '', 113964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you that raise fallen kings from the earth? Speak.', '', 113963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 113962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! By the way, we have recovered your blade, Trol\'kalar. It is quite legendary.', '', 113961, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare creeps across this land. A tempting power to harness, but to do so without understanding its nature would be foolish.', '', 113960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stromgarde is lost, but there is still hope for this world... if you will join us.', '', 113959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never thought I\'d get stuck out here. Thanks for the help.', 'Never thought I\'d get stuck out here. Thanks for the help.', 113958, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. I better let \'em know what\'s goin\' on here.', 'Thanks. I better let \'em know what\'s goin\' on here.', 113957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do what the living cannot.', '', 113956, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Ebon Blade. Knights of undeath who protect this world.', '', 113955, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to stop volunteering for this.', 'I need to stop volunteering for this.', 113954, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that was close.', 'Wow, that was close.', 113953, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t expect to see you here! Now, if you\'ll excuse me...', 'Didn\'t expect to see you here! Now, if you\'ll excuse me...', 113952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I owe ya one.', 'Thanks! I owe ya one.', 113951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve gotta get back to Gadgetzan! They\'re never gonna believe this!', 'I\'ve gotta get back to Gadgetzan! They\'re never gonna believe this!', 113950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate this place! Free me from the torment of this journey!', '', 113949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death and ruin. Time has not been kind to this place.', '', 113948, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Everything.', '... Everything.', 113947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We took his life, my lord. The prince left us little choice.', '', 113946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then leave it to rust. I care not.', '', 113945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there a shortage of steel in this future world?', '', 113944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I have failed as both a father and a king.', '', 113943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has become of Stromgarde?', '', 113942, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the prince who murdered his king?', '', 113941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son. Where is Galen?', '', 113940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is impossible.', '', 113939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, demon hunter, how did it feel being locked up for all of those years?', '', 113938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You show some skill. But not as much as your dead master.', '', 113937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reinforcements from Ironforge are arriving now. Stormwind will not fall on our watch!', 113936, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need answers!', 113935, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re everywhere. This is madness!', '', 113934, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_warlock_demonsoul_nightmare:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:214505|h[Entangling Nightmares]|h|r!', '', 113933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I destroy this world, this land will be one of the first consumed.', '', 113932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trees everywhere! The fires will be glorious!', '', 113931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful dragon could be a powerful tool. Alas, gone are the days of Galakrond.', 113930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These three have enjoyed the secret favor of N\'Zoth for long enough. Sadly their reaving days are done.', 113929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you meant to say nightmares.', '', 113928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When do you think she turned? Centuries ago? She hides her hunger for power behind a cloak of suffering and righteousness.', 113927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A land full of dreams, but none of them about me? It\'s enough to hurt a girl\'s pride.', 113926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one is old, but still not one of the first. These creatures were too hungry for magic to obey our masters, though they still prove useful from time to time.', 113925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy is not wearing a cloak!', 'The spy is not wearing a cloak!', 113924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
