('The spy is wearing gloves!', 'The spy is wearing gloves!', 113915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy is a female!', 'The spy is a female!', 113914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy is a male!', 'The spy is a male!', 113913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy has a dark colored vest on!', 'The spy has a dark colored vest on!', 113912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another fool who believed Illidan\'s lies of sacrifice and righteousness. Tormented, he turns on everyone.', 113911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy has a light colored vest on!', 'The spy has a light colored vest on!', 113910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Really, these thugs of Sargeras are SO interchangeable. This one is good with his axe. Oh, how unique!', 113909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Her mother was more impressive. This one\'s hunger is uncontrollable and her tactics overused. An easy target.', 113908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How far the Manastorms have fallen! Relying on crude machines and weak arcane wizardry did them no favors. Still, they had their uses.', 113907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For this idiotic pustule of N\'Zoth to have lived so long... it does little to refute my opinion of this world\'s new owners.', 113905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How?', 113901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to relax, friend. We will find her.', '', 113900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh where could she have gone...', 113899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A traitor to his world and to his kind. His end was never in question... only who would deliver it.', 113898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another nameless brute of Sargeras, pretending to aid these elves. Little do they know their fate.', 113897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_protectionformnature:20|t%s begins to cast |cFF00FFFF|Hspell:212681|h[Cleansed Ground]|h|r!', '', 113896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sentinels stand ready to assist. Together, we will take down the Houndmaster.', 113893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the plan is to set a trap for the Houndmaster, we\'ll need to place it in a secure location.', 113892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'A beast of stone who ignorantly throws around power he barely controls. He should be put down before he ruins our plans.', 113891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Farstriders will fight at your side and help bring the Houndmaster to his knees.', '', 113890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Though he is not one of our servants, he has heard our whispers. They darkened him forever.', 113889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Loken did fine work turning her, but in truth, Odyn\'s arrogance takes most of the credit.', 113888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was thought his kind was incorruptible. A lesson for my brothers, I suppose.', 113887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrival is timely. Welcome to my tavern.', '', 113886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough for those most in need. The rest- Ah! Welcome, welcome.', '', 113883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think you will have enough?', '', 113882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, the third fleet ships are loading up at the end of the dock.', '', 113881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delivery of cannons and cannonballs directly from the great forge for ye\'.', '', 113880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grapple point is on the top of the wall over there. Follow me!', 113879, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 69885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let that weaponry fall into the wrong hands.', '', 113878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to say, I think this might be my finest work yet.', '', 113877, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapons I\'m crafting should be sharp enough to pierce through any armor, and sturdy enough for repeated use.', '', 113876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whelp. Looks like I\'m out. I\'m only kiddin\'! I got bombs for days.', 'Whelp. Looks like I\'m out. I\'m only kiddin\'! I got bombs for days.', 113875, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are tricky materials to work with, but I think you\'ll be impressed with the final product.', '', 113874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked for it!', 'You asked for it!', 113873, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes another one!', 'Here comes another one!', 113872, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph, you\'re still alive.', 'Hmph, you\'re still alive.', 113871, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must have went through some trouble to get your hands on this oak and ore.', '', 113870, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bet you didn\'t see that comin\', did ya?', 'Bet you didn\'t see that comin\', did ya?', 113869, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s green everywhere! Just not my preferred shade.', '', 113868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea! How you like that one?', 'Yea! How you like that one?', 113867, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... much... to... BURN!', '', 113866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halduron told me to expect you.', '', 113865, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we wasting time by walking through this forest?', '', 113864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin presents the pearl to Mr. Mrglglrm.', '', 113863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here in the forest you will see the flaw in the titans\' plans.', '', 113862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place crawls with creatures, malformed and twisted from a warped mind. They will burn all the same.', '', 113861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Mrglglrm knocks the pearl down, cracking it!', '', 113860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mlgr! Mlgrmlrgrlmgr! Mlgrg mlgrmlgrrlm! Rlmgrlmgr!', '', 113859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mgrlgl. Gmrglmr?', '', 113858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 18071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grgmrlg! Glrmg, mglrmglrgr.', '', 113857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrg, mrlgmrlg...', '', 113856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grlmgrl, mgrlgrg. Glrgrlmrgl mrglrlgr lrglr! Rlmgrlm mgrglrmg mrglrglrm. Mrlgrgmrlg gmrlgrl mlrglrg?', '', 113855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 23615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is worse then the last one.', '', 113854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this height, we can almost reach the Void.', '', 113853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanthir came through again... how can he keep this up?', '', 113852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Donatien takes a quick draught of the mana-wine.', '', 113851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mountain will come crumbling down!', '', 113850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! Plenty for both of us today.', 113849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He found more?', '', 113848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmmm! The tauren here are so... tall.', 113847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF00FFPerfect gem activated.|r', '|cFFFF00FFPerfect gem activated.|r', 113846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gem deactivated.', 'Gem deactivated.', 113845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gem activated.', 'Gem activated.', 113844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush you... Thank Vanthir for me, won\'t you?', '', 113843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah. Not so fast! You may choke.', '', 113842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clotaire tentatively sips at the wine, then takes a deep gulp.', '', 113841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is Arcwine. For you. Go on, brother.', '', 113840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-what?', '', 113839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know there must be something here that will help Meryl... But where....', '', 113838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast! This library is a disaster! We will have to clean it up if we are to have any hope of finding more texts on magical afflictions before it is too late...', '', 113837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ambrena shakily takes a drink.', 113836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Treatise On The Habits Of Ravens looks quite interesting! But, no, it will not help poor Meryl recover...', '', 113835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It isn\'t far. Thank you.', 113834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There must be more books on magical illness around here somewhere...', '', 113833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67666, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will get her home. It is nice to know Vanthir still thinks of us.', 113832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nightwell be praised... I thought I was going to die.', 113831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, there, old friend. We will figure this out...', '', 113830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67665, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a powerful presence in this land, though not as strong as Lord Sargeras.', 113829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this height, I can see everything!', '', 113828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we leave this place? I... I\'m a bit afraid of heights...', '', 113827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many beasts in this land to slaughter!', '', 113826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those peaks stretch up to touch the firmament. What a delight it will be to watch them crumble!', '', 113825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommy!', '', 113824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Much better. Thank you. Thank you so much.', 113823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lunette nods and takes a drink.', 113822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will survive until tomorrow. Vanthir always takes care of us. You know that.', '', 113821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But you need...', 113820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me a moment to inspect this beast, and I can discover its weaknesses.', 113819, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a drink, darling. You will feel better.', '', 113818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get up...', 113817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next demon.', '', 113816, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them the next demon.', '', 113815, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next illusion, please.', '', 113814, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is so... fresh. I can\'t sense any demonic corruption here. It\'s... revolting.', '', 113813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This demon has clearly been bred to be resistant to both magical and physical attacks.', 113812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These scales are unlike anything I\'ve seen.', 113811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AwardContributionPoints called', 'AwardContributionPoints called', 113810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Terenas would have had you thrown out of here faster than he did Medivh.', 113809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once hid in a muddy ditch for two days while slavering ghouls patrolled the area. Your prattle does not faze me.', 113808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like this place either!', '', 113807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometime I miss the beautiful court of Lordaeron, and my father.', 113806, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s talk again soon.', 113805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goodbye.', 113804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk in the Light.', 113803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I stand ready to help.', 113802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go.  Get out of my city before I change my mind.', '', 113800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king was never in danger, but where my men failed to stop this cultist, you did not. That spares you from prison at the very least.', '', 113799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I assist you?', 113798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Its just Calia now.', 113797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower your weapons! We\'re not here to fight you.', '', 113796, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 63602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can take my boat there to get back if you have no other means.', '', 113795, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, you take it. Give it to Marcia in Dalaran. She\'s great at turning things into fishing rods.', '', 113794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea, I know that may seem gross, but just look at it! Fish\'ll come flocking towards something like that.', '', 113793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, that lure on the top of its head would make for a great fishing rod...', '', 113792, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do know there\'s an invasion going on, right?', '', 113791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bored? I could arrange discourse with a Shadowfiend.', '', 113790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a beast! And a great catch to boot!', '', 113789, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what would happen if you split someone into pure Light and pure Void. Interested in volunteering?', '', 113788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Light and Shadow guide you.', '', 113787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us get to work.', '', 113786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until next time.', '', 113785, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will accomplish much together.', '', 113784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', '', 113783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hide in shadows no longer.', '', 113782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The felguard, front-line forces of the Legion. Almost always seen with heavy, two-handed weaponry. They are slow to strike, but hit quite hard, and are more agile than they look.', '', 113781, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a dark place near, touched by void.', '', 113780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new land, primed for destruction!', '', 113779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with my thanks.', '', 113778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not fear me, hero.', '', 113777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait to charm one of those big, muscular vrykul!', 113776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sun and Moon light your path.', 113775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hunt well.', 113774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goodbye.', 113773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello.', 113772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 113771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am glad to see you.', 113770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These vrykul should sing the praises of Sargeras, not their empty hymns to the titans.', 113769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a drab place! It would look far better covered in fire.', '', 113768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you could summon me a body while you\'re at it?', '', 113767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only ONE eye? Don\'t complain to me because you have no depth perception.', '', 113766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wrathguard, elite warriors of the Legion\'s front lines. Often seen wielding two weapons with equal measure, avoid letting them get the upper hand in swordplay, lest you face a rain of blows from which you will not emerge.', '', 113765, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lowly imp, a creature of felfire and trickery. Not a large threat alone, but often found in large groups which can quickly overwhelm your defenses from a distance.', '', 113764, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have only recently learned of this variant of the felhound, which we are calling the \"felstalker.\" Faster and more coordinated than their brethren, they are often seen hunting in packs and utilizing a crude form of pack communication. Avoid their bites, as they are laced with all sorts of foul magics.', '', 113763, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The felhound, a quick, wiry beast often seen in large packs. Each hound has two tendrils, ending in a sucker of sorts. Should they latch on to you, they will drain your power and, eventually, your life. Hit them before they hit you.', '', 113762, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use that bait wisely. I don\'t have many entrails left.', 113761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need more bait.', 'I need more bait.', 113760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is never enough for the both of us... I choose to suffer over her.', '', 113759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He stares at you blankly.> You are not my brother.', '', 113758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'S-so... hungry... mind is... slipping!', 113757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Th-they need it more... I will be f-fine...', 113756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elisande and the Legion seek to bring us to heel. Through fear. Through hunger.', 113755, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 67561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our prison.', 113754, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 67560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should get back to it.', 113753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you around.', 113752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright then.', 113751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What brings you out here?', 113750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blue is best!', 113749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there.', 113748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again.', '', 113747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye.', '', 113746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Tyr guide you.', '', 113745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met.', '', 113744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 113743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Tyr.', '', 113742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! A bit of magic to help you follow in Galford\'s footsteps. Good luck!', 113741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrlgrrl, rglrlg rlgrlmgmlr?\n\n<Phin looks at you expectantly.>', '', 113740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not faced so noble a challenger in millennia!', '', 113739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good start! You fight well!', '', 113738, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmph.', '', 113737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us talk.', '', 113736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are shorter than I expected.', '', 113735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, seeker of truth.', '', 113734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye.', '', 113733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet again.', '', 113732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another time then.', '', 113731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend.', '', 113730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bid you welcome.', '', 113729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I greet you.', '', 113728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye.', '', 113727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fare well to ye.', '', 113726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you around.', '', 113725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 113724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t perform any tests if I\'m lacking a subject.', 113723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello!', '', 113722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are you doing?', '', 113721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There I found the shrine to Tyr\'s champion, but was denied entry. I tried many times, until I could bear the pain no longer.', '', 113720, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold, Suramar. Our haven. Our sanctuary.', 113719, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 67559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I returned in disgrace and sought to wash away my failure in the blood of others.', '', 113718, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re just in time... We were about to call forth one of this temple\'s most tortured souls, in the hopes of finally ending her misery.', 113717, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While a cave wouldn\'t be my first choice of setting up a camp, it does keep us from drawing any unwanted attention to ourselves.$b$bShall we get to work now?', '', 113716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is my duty to convey you to the Halls of Valor. Speak to me when you are ready!', 113715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doomguard, commanders of the front-line forces. An excellent target of opportunity that will cripple the enemy\'s line. Be wary of fire magics and dark curses, as well as their capable strikes in melee.', '', 113714, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Phin the fine sand.>', '<Show Phin the fine sand.>', 113713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Phin the crab claw.>', '<Show Phin the crab claw.>', 113712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Phin the crab oil.>', '<Show Phin the crab oil.>', 113711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She is upon us! Coura, Master of Arcana, we will bring you to eternal rest!', 113710, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coura was the resident Master of Arcana. She crafted spells as easily as you breathe air.', 113709, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quin\'el, Master of Chillwind, come forth! We will end your eternal suffering!', 113708, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quin\'el was the Master of Chillwind. Just being near her sent a shiver up my spine. Be prepared!', 113707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like they\'re getting stronger! None of you better be feeding those things!', '', 113706, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Phin the crab shell.>', '<Show Phin the crab shell.>', 113705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin excitedly grabs the sand and begins scrubbing the flaw on the pearl.', '', 113704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin\'s eyes roll back in its head as it sighs heavily.', '', 113703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin hops around in frustration.', '', 113702, 0, 0, 35, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pearlhunter Phin\'s jaw drops as it stares at you, bewildered.', '', 113701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the blades. You\'ve more than proven your skill as an assassin. Perhaps you can overcome the darkness within their steel.', 113700, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being in this palace with these daggers brings back... dark thoughts. Impulses I\'ve spent years trying to be free of.', 113699, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Our work is done.', 113698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglrgr! Mrlgrlr mrlgrl grlrglr. Mrglrgrl?', '', 113697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M-master...?', '', 113696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My plans will not be ruined. My destiny will not be denied. You will burn!', '', 113695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, your servant requires aid!', '', 113694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you not see? Can you not feel their warm embrace?', '', 113693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have arrived! Oh, they are even more beautiful than I imagined!', '', 113692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the beautiful gifts they bring. You do not understand!', '', 113691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fledgling felhound rushes into the cave, lured by the scent of magic.', '', 113690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place it here, where it can drink of the leyline.', '', 113689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, you must plant the seed!', '', 113688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, assassin.', '', 113687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready up! I\'ve got a bad feeling about this!', '', 113686, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('East over the water! Looks like the Legion\'s back for more! Positions! Hurry up!', '', 113685, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure more backup will be arriving shortly. I\'ve got friends in the highest of places.', '', 113684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show this one the exit, boys!', '', 113683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When this is all over, remind me to take out some more insurance on this place.', '', 113682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This doesn\'t look like a place you belong, friend.', '', 113681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When this is all over, don\'t forget your free - or slightly discounted - Noggenfoggers!', '', 113680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re lookin\' a bit lost, friend.', '', 113679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you take \'em down don\'t forget their weapons! Those\'ll fetch a pretty penny.', '', 113678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Small? Whad\'ya mean, small?$B$BAlright, $n. We\'ll see who cleans this place up the most.', '', 113677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normally I\'m pretty nice guy, but if you block my shot we\'re gonna have some words, friend.', '', 113676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t everyday I get to bring out the ol\' secret weapons!', '', 113675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pit lord is a massive, terrifying behemoth, don\'t expect to face one with much less than an army and come out alive. Capable of rending a man in two with a single glaive swing, and burning half of a squad to a crisp with fel energy, they are a threat at any distance.', '', 113674, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, bub. I\'m on watch. Somebody\'s gotta remind this demon filth who they\'re messin\' with!', '', 113673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord, perhaps most insidious of all of the Legion forces. Capable of bending minds to their will, they will turn half of your army against you before you\'ve even seen one. Take note of their shadowy magics and control over carrion insects, and steel yourself against their frightening illusions.', '', 113672, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreaded infernal, siege weapon of the Legion. Expect these brutes to be hammering down your defenses with blazing fists made of fel fire and stone. They will often arrive on the battlefield as meteors launched from afar, then unfurl themselves to cause further devastation.', '', 113671, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t yet know much about this new breed of demon that we have taken to calling the \"imp mother.\" Limited reports indicate that her stomach may operate as a kind of portal from which imps emerge. Use caution, we\'re not sure what you\'re up against here.', '', 113670, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new breed of felguard, the fel lord towers over his lesser minions and often wields a massive, yet slow, weapon. Should you find yourself facing one alone, I would suggest a tactical retreat.', '', 113669, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eredar, one-time Draenei that fell under the control of the demon lord Sargeras. Skilled sorcerers in both fel and shadow magics, adjust your wards accordingly. Often in command of contingents of demon forces, they are both a high threat and an excellent target of opportunity.', '', 113668, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately I\'m not much of a fighter. Be safe out there!', 113664, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inhabitants of Gadgetzan have been inspired to join the fight against the Legion!', '', 113663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel her... Selia, the Master of Balefire. She stirs!', 113662, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the heck is goin\' on around here?', '', 113661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t quite what I expected! Now if you\'ll excuse me...', '', 113660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was I thinking comin\' down here?', '', 113659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy. I sure picked the wrong day to be out here!', '', 113658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_ironmaidens_bloodritual:20|t Lucard begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:215000|h[Consume the Living]|h|r! Slay the corsair quickly!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_ironmaidens_bloodritual:20|t Lucard begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:215000|h[Consume the Living]|h|r! Slay the corsair quickly!', 113657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Selia, Master of Balefire, come forth and we will end your torment!', 113656, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you have been rebuilding the old teleporters. The beacon here will connect us to your shal\'dorei friends.', '', 113655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not far now.', '', 113654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to see these hills go up in flames!', '', 113653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This passage will lead us out.', '', 113652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These vrykul are not as easy to destroy as you might think.', '', 113651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s get things organized, shall we? We\'ve a lot of work to do!', '', 113650, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 64216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vrykul here believe themselves to be warriors without peer. I will show them the error of their ways!', '', 113648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in over my head! Be back in business soon as this thing blows over!', '', 113647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land may look pure, but even here I sense the Legion\'s presence.', '', 113646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These foolish vrykul cling to the notion that the titans will someday return.', '', 113645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They come!', '', 113644, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate the words, $n, but I\'ll come back when this blows over.', '', 113643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me your story?', 'Can you tell me your story?', 113642, 0, 37625, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeking a creature from the Twisting Nether? Grabbing a beast of the Void? Oh... you\'re just summoning a friend...', '', 113641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back when I had a body, I never needed help with this ritual. I was a summoner without peer!', '', 113640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gruesome work, but done well. Our southern coast is safer, for now.', '', 113639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike at their leaders, and leave these pirates in disarray!', '', 113638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spies have brought me information suggesting many key leaders of Mr. Shackle\'s so-called salvage fleet are vulnerable.', '', 113637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without vigilance and quick action, Shackle\'s lackeys will strip Azsuna\'s coast of its history and its valuables. They\'ll be back, and I suspect you\'ll be ready.', '', 113636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just because Shackle is useful in some places doesn\'t mean I have to tolerate this. Show them that piracy doesn\'t pay here in Azsuna!', '', 113635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Some so-called salvage team is ransacking Azsuna\'s coastline, working on behalf of Mr. Shackle.', '', 113634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, hero.', 113633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay valiant, hero. There is still more to come.', 113632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very impressive, druid.', 113631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vale is a little safer now.', 113630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another enemy vanquished.', 113629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together, we can defeat the Nightmare.', 113628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dream is a little safer now.', 113627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is kind of fun!', 113626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We did it!', 113625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We sure showed him!', 113624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s what you get for being a bully!', 113623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He wasn\'t very nice!', 113622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one didn\'t stand a chance.', '', 113621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Let us fight on!', '', 113620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. Stay strong!', '', 113619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory!', '', 113618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one wasn\'t so tough.', '', 113617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We work well together, hero!', '', 113616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another vile creature defeated.', 113615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Creature a\' da Nightmare, be gone!', 113614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, this process may trigger my defensive protocols. So I may poke you in the eye. Just giving you a little warning.', '', 113613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you\'ve come here in search of a companion. Very well, I will join you, hunter.', '', 113612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My name is... Error: Cannot Locate Data... Hmm, Seems I need a name.', '', 113611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Pearl isss mine!', 113610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('South of Ashenvale! There\'s demons everywhere! Get up here before they spread!', '', 113609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like they\'re pushing towards Ashenvale! Our allies are under attack!', '', 113608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Structures scouted far north! Getting hit pretty hard up here!', '', 113607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huge camp down along the east! We need reinforcements! We\'re being overrun!', '', 113606, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve taken out our reinforcements to the far east! We\'re holding them at the bridge!', '', 113605, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need help to complete a summoning ritual? You can\'t do it by yourself? How pathetic!', '', 113604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
