('Kill that mongrel, $p! No... wait. I have a better idea.', '', 113553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you are right. It seems that times have changed and with it, the Illidari. I will aid you.', '', 113552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, think! You know I opposed Illidan. You can trust us.', '', 113551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then, you leave me no choice, Akama. One way, or another, you WILL help us to defeat the Legion.', 'Then, you leave me no choice, Akama. One way, or another, you WILL help us to defeat the Legion.', 113550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then rise and join us, Akama.', 'Then rise and join us, Akama.', 113549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never aid you, demon hunter. Like all your kind, you are no better than the demons, which you consort with. I see no difference between you.\n\nThe Legion and your master destroyed my beautiful temple. Trust me when I say that one day, I will have my revenge.\n\nYou can go twist in the Nether, $n.', '', 113548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have beaten me with honor. Perhaps I have misjudged you, demon hunter.\n\nIt will take some time before there is full trust between us. However, like you, I wish to see the Burning Legion\'s downfall.\n\nThey destroyed my beautiful temple. I will have my revenge.\n\nToward that goal, I will aid you, $n.', '', 113547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we finish this like beings of honor? Can you manage that much, demon hunter?', '', 113546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if I can impress you.', '', 113545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even here, I have heard your name spoken, $p. But, I am not impressed.', '', 113544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you will not be deterred. Come then, Illidari. Face your destiny.', '', 113543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
