('Pick Lock', 'Pick Lock', 113472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin-Tor. Contemptable mortals groveling about for what meager scraps of power their tiny minds can comprehend.', '', 113471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For generations the mages of your world have trained in this city, like children playing with fire.', '', 113470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dear child, you hold yourself back. The power is within your grasp to send this entire city tumbling into the sea.', '', 113469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Dalaran. The city of spires perches itself once more between you mortals and the end of your world.', '', 113468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite the petty bickering of the mortals who lead it, this place is nonetheless a passable assembly of arcane knowledge.', '', 113467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mages of this city see it as the arcane focus of this world. How little they know, child.', '', 113466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran. The city endures even after generations of its mortal inhabitants die off.', '', 113465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in intensive study, a mortal mage acquires so little knowledge in a lifetime. It\'s a wonder they even bother.', '', 113464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
