('For generations the mortal mages of Dalaran have sought to bury their fears within these walls. They are so weak, child.', '', 113457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you see the futility of a council of mortals overseeing an arcane trove of this magnitude?', '', 113456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A splendid empire, ensorcelled by magic for thousands of years. Let us shatter these halls and drink deep from the ruins.', '', 113455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city was built upon a matrix of mighty arcane energies. Ah, yes... power enough for us both...', '', 113454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The glories of an ancient empire remain. There is power here, child... you need only seize it!', '', 113453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is infused with the power of the arcane... can you feel it? So much power...', '', 113452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The filth that occupy this place are an insult to the glory of a once proud dragonflight.', '', 113451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titans imbued the great dragonflights with considerable power. The black dragonflight has been decimated. We should claim what power remains.', '', 113450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neltharion withheld many secrets from the other dragonflights. Some of them may be of interest to us, child.', '', 113449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dragonflights once reigned over this world in the titans\' stead. See how these creatures pick at the carcass of their greatness.', '', 113448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are trying to reclaim past glory amidst these ruins. They grovel for scraps. Show them what real power looks like.', '', 113447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga wield magics, yes, but without finesse. There was a time Azshara\'s people had the potential to rival the titans.', '', 113446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Azshara... do not underestimate her grasp of the arcane. Or the devotion of her minions.', '', 113445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea queen once forged an empire with magic. She has since turned to... a more shadowy benefactor.', '', 113444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That dumb cow won\'t even see it coming... we\'ll be in charge of the fleet, once and for all!', 113443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done it! Guard it well until you can return to me.', 113442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re more meddlesome than a banshee!', '', 113441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deactivate Security Measures', 'Deactivate Security Measures', 113440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prismatic security card insertion successful.  Disabling security locks.\n\n01010111 01100001 01110011 00100000 01110100 01101000 01101001 01110011 00100000 01100001 01101100 01110111 01100001 01111001 01110011 00100000 01101100 01101111 01100011 01101011 01100101 01100100 00111111', '', 113439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the wind guide your arrows.', '', 113438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will fall!', '', 113437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not falter!', '', 113436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with courage!', '', 113435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May victory be ours!', '', 113434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do my duty for Azeroth.', '', 113433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings.', '', 113432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, hold still. I will get you out of there.', '', 113431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I imagine it is less hospitable now. Hold still, I will get you out of there.', '', 113430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the Temple of Fal\'adora. Those halls once glowed with prayers to Elune.', '', 113429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brzzzzt!$B$BWelcome to Matrix Punchograph 3005 stroke E, a security level beta terminal.$B$BYou must possess a prismatic punch card to access terminal functions.\n\n01001000 01110101 01101110 01110100 01100101 01110010 01110011 00100000 01101111 01101110 01101100 01111001 00100001', '', 113428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Silvermoon!', '', 113427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Farstriders stand ready.', '', 113426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brzzzzt!$B$BWelcome to Matrix Punchograph 3005 stroke E, a security level beta terminal.$B$BPrismatic punch card detected.  Access Granted.\n\n01010011 01110100 01100001 01101110 01100100 00100000 01100010 01100001 01100011 01101011 00100001 01010011 01110100 01100001 01101110 01100100 00100000 01100010 01100001 01100011 01101011 00100001', '', 113425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 113424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim true!', '', 113423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge awaits!', '', 113422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this war won!', '', 113421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?', '', 113420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My bow skills are second to none!', '', 113419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 113418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t lived ten-thousand years to be pestered by you!', 113417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May your weapon strike true!', 113416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ande\'thoras-ethil.', 113415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our duty is to all of Azeroth.', 113414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your service.', 113413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take care!', 113412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hour of battle is at hand!', 113411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met.', 113410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Unseen Path welcomes you!', 113409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-dal-dieb.', 113408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-alah.', 113407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck!', '', 113406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory will come.', '', 113405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strive for peace, but be ready to fight!', '', 113404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to resume our search for the missing mages?', '', 113403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are living in troubled times.', '', 113402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be best if they did not know who I was conversing with before.', 113400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just in case the library does not survive Elisande\'s insanity, I\'ll keep an eye on these tomes.', 113399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My robes! Ah, I\'ve missed these! I hope they still fit...', 113398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re rifling through my drawers- thieving rats! Please, recover my belongings.', 113397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve the ranger-general.', '', 113396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must all do our duty.', '', 113395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bal\'a dash, malanore.', '', 113394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Waste MY time? I don\'t think so!', 113393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until next time.', 113392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we will save Azeroth!', 113391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember those we lost.', 113390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Al diel shala.', 113389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight well!', 113388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My bow is at the ready!', 113387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 113386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Let\'s go before reinforcements arrive. I\'ll open a portal back to the hall.', '', 113385, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 64215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion must be stopped!', 113384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal is closing! Get out of there!', '', 113383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
