INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Bal\'a dash, malanore.', 113381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it was that Huln\'s mercy gained the allegiance of his family\'s oldest ally: me.', '', 113380, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 62102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world... will... fall...', '', 113379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I need no meager weapon to destroy you!', '', 113378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Withered Leyhunter has noticed you!', '', 113377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never again will you use Ebonchill to kill a mage, demon!', '', 113376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Withered Leyhunter detects your presence!', '', 113375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You possess the might of an archmage! But I\'m not out of tricks yet...', '', 113374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This display is meaningless! Your doom is at hand!', '', 113373, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 64209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For your insolence, your end will be painful and slow!', '', 113372, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 64208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t get away with this, Hakkar!', '', 113371, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 66571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muscle gonna hurt dem good!', '', 113370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ay Muscle, you got company!', 'Ay Muscle, you got company!', 113369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never know too much about your foe. These tomes and scrolls come directly from the Stormwind Library.', '', 113368, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again.', '', 113367, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My minions look forward to making a meal out of you, Archmage.', '', 113366, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, my pets. You will have plenty to feed on soon enough.', '', 113365, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon they will be strong enough to draw the magic out of every mage in Dalaran!', '', 113364, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hounds are hungry, and your mages make quite the meal.', '', 113363, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere with their feeding!', '', 113362, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 66565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secure the entrance! We\'ve got the cultists right where we want them.', '', 113361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shackle ain\'t gonna be happy if we ain\'t done soon! Hurry with the loading already!', '', 113360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re never gonna make quota. Move faster you louts!', '', 113359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, we must slaughter these beasts before they do more harm!', '', 113358, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up ahead, I see the mages! They\'re surrounded by the Houndmaster\'s minions.', '', 113357, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 66563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guardians, they are awaking!', '', 113356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Guards!', '', 113355, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is more than one way to deal with a corruption.', '', 113354, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These eggs are corrupted. We should destroy them now.', '', 113353, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 62099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The situation is under control. You are all completely safe.', '', 113352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens in need of shelter are to report to the Trader\'s Hall at once.', '', 113351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit picking on me!', '', 113350, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I might be the baby, but at least I get all the attention!', '', 113349, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really think your ploy would work? Come to me, little mage!', '', 113348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That demon is Vadina, one of Valadors enforcers. I think we have his attention. Aid me!', '', 113347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Another intruder approaches!', '', 113346, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stick around... it\'s meal time!', '', 113345, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s painfully obvious that you could use someone of my considerable talent. Let us join forces to go after Vargoth and the Soulstone!', '', 113344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67664, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! He will not get away with this!', '', 113343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67663, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must speak with the Council. Until we meet again, my mortal friend.', '', 113342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66487, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We may have missed our chance at the Grand Magistrix tonight, but her time will come. Sooner or later we\'ll find another way to settle the score...', 113341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a terrible turn of events...', '', 113340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66486, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power is building. They will know we are doing something momentous. Another group incoming, assist me!', '', 113339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Superb casting! Get back to the Focus. I\'ll keep an eye out.', '', 113338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work hard... beach easy.', '', 113337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A gift, for me?', 113328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! I could use a bit of help!', '', 113321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up an\' finish blessin\' those bandages, we need to get them off to the front!', '', 113320, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silgryn nods.', '', 113319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I.. am not... defeated...', '', 113311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood sustains me!', '', 113310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will bleed!', '', 113309, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Did you really think a little piece of wood would stop me?!', '', 113308, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to master!', '', 113303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s a big sentient robo-wolf? You are! You are!', '', 113302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to master!', '', 113301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good boy!', '', 113300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t leave home without flying your colors, buy a tabard today!', 113299, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tabards here! Rally your allies by showing your allegiance!', 113298, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My word! I barely got you out of there in time! You should take care out there, old chum!', '', 113297, 0, 0, 33, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tabards for sale! Show your colors on the front!', 113296, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for using the Ulduar Teleportation Network!$b$bAll destination points are currently offline for maintenance. If this is an emergency, please contact a Visitor Information Representative during regular business hours.$b$bHave a nice day!', '', 113295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pocketing', 'Pocketing', 113294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you use the bomb, you\'d better hightail it out of there. Hammond and his boys will descend on that hall like moths to the flame.', '', 113293, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasn\'t easy to get this on such short notice with the city locked down, you know.', '', 113292, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, there you are. Elling\'s waiting for you upstairs.', 113291, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attaboy! Now let\'s go find those mages!', '', 113290, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how well that nose of yours works.', '', 113289, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blight', 'Blight', 113288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain calm. The city\'s finest are on the case.', '', 113287, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do your damn job! We can\'t keep living like this!', '', 113286, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick! Kill it with fire or whatever it is you adventurers use!', '', 113285, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the great sea is that thing?!', '', 113283, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get up there, Kayn. It\'s time to convince Akama to join us.', 'Let\'s get up there, Kayn. It\'s time to convince Akama to join us.', 113278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know not why you have returned, Illidari, but it is a grave mistake. This time, there will be no prison in the end... only death.', '', 113277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, we are here to convince Akama to join us, not to kill him.', '', 113276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yea! There\'s definitely something down there. Let\'s fish it up, $p.', '', 113275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m wondering if whatever\'s down there is what\'s been causing them to act up. Let\'s see if I can\'t rustle it up from where it\'s hiding.', '', 113274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re home now. Thank goodness.', 113271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I was running around fishing up the frenzies, I noticed some large bubbles over in this lagoon.', '', 113270, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They yelled and put me in a cage! I missed you...', 113269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my sweet little girl! Are you hurt? Were they mean to you?', 113268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we could blink past the barrier!', '', 113267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! Concentrate on building the Ritual Focus. I will do what I can to support you.', '', 113266, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
