('', 'The Wardens are now few in number, yet justice must not rest, friend. Aid us in dispatching this foul creature. Show the people of this land that the Wardens remain ever vigilant!', 113094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has Verstok gone mad? Wielding the Fangs enhances one\'s senses, but I\'m afraid it also heightened his paranoia.', '', 113093, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you! You may look like a druid, but I can tell you\'re a demon in disguise. I won\'t fall for your trick! You\'ll never get the Fangs from me!', '', 113092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fangs are mine! MINE!!', '', 113090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', '', 113089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', '', 113088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vrykul Shepherd pleads with his flock once more, hoping for any assistance.', '', 113087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vrykul Shepherd calls out to his flock again, hoping for further assistance.', '', 113086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul Shepherd calls for help from his flock.', '', 113085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught off guard! I\'ll be back before this is over!', '', 113084, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even my blade couldn\'t protect me from those things.', '', 113083, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters - today we defend our lands against the blight of the Burning Legion. We are strong. We are one. For the Horde!', '', 113082, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, goodie. A new box of toys!', '', 113081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Illidari believe themselves untouchable. They will soon learn better.', 113080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think we don\'t know what you\'re up to, $n?', '', 113079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An imp? What\'s going on here, $n?', '', 113078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon hunter, that imp just stole the grimoire. Catch it!', '', 113077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grr... Persistent vermin...', '', 113076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mind the landing, dear.', 113075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not suffer a fool!', 113074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s test your immortality, shall we?', 113073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is your magic now?', 113072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silence, insect!', 113071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish surface-dwellers! Be gone!', '', 113069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Begone, wretch!', '', 113068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your shield cannot protect you any longer!', '', 113067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run! Cower! Scream!', '', 113066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel my gaze, and despair!', '', 113065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before the might of the Legion!', '', 113064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He seems to like you. Will you take care of him for me?', '', 113063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treble!', '', 113062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions of the Legion, destroy these worms!', '', 113061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Kyranith, meet me at the Oculus once you\'ve taken care of our overly ambitious friends here.', '', 113060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thousands of worlds will be mine to conquer!', '', 113059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightborne Soulstone is mine. You are becoming quite a nuisance.', '', 113058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66483, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long sucker!', '', 113057, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 69873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are going to get Rush and Treble back, we\'re going to need some help...', '', 113056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My forces are limitless!', '', 113055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it was your idea to give them free will!', '', 113054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe our camouflage module was a bit too effective.', '', 113053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think you stand a chance simply because you have come this far. You are nothing! NOTHING!', '', 113052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were in charge of the tracking units!', '', 113051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I expected more of a fight.', 'I expected more of a fight.', 113050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you did seems to have annoyed those withered. This might work to your advantage. See if you can find another switch.', '', 113049, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you return, I\'ll be ready.', 'When you return, I\'ll be ready.', 113048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for the Illidari.', 'You are no match for the Illidari.', 113047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your strength was no match.', 'Your strength was no match.', 113046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shame you were not prepared.', 'Shame you were not prepared.', 113045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion has returned.', 'The Burning Legion has returned.', 113044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! The ruins are infested by withered, pitiful creatures with an unending hunger for the arcane. The power of the Fangs might have lured some to Verstok\'s trail.', '', 113043, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our battle has only just begun.', 'Our battle has only just begun.', 113042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel their presence growing?', 'Do you feel their presence growing?', 113041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swift blades and unrelenting devotion. Nothing less.', 'Swift blades and unrelenting devotion. Nothing less.', 113040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion will fall!', 'The Burning Legion will fall!', 113039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our presence will remain.', 'Our presence will remain.', 113038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion shows no mercy.', 'The Legion shows no mercy.', 113037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do give Lan\'dalock my love, $n.', 113036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them no mercy.', 'Show them no mercy.', 113035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All goes as planned. Once Brother Shadowgaze arrives, we leave for Stormwind!', 113034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My foolish protege was in such a rush to escape the Shrine, I\'ll wager he failed to mask his scent. Shift into cat form and you\'ll likely detect it.', '', 113033, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh!', '', 113032, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 69874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...they\'re starting to smell. Think we should mo-', '', 113031, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 69875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hear me through this thing, $n? You should be near Verstok\'s location by now.', '', 113030, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be so sure... Hey there, friend!', '', 113029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...probably dragon food by now...', '', 113028, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 69877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hey there, chum.  How can we help?', '', 113027, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 69878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh! Someone\'s coming...', '', 113026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 69879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, we got a... business arrangement with them. \n\nYeah, they want us to fly this stuff over to Dalaran and sell it for them there. After all, there aren\'t a whole lot of people to sell it to here, right? And who\'s a better salesperson than a goblin? \n\nThose tauren sure have an eye for business!', '', 113025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you moving the taurens\' goods over to your zeppelin?', 'Why are you moving the taurens\' goods over to your zeppelin?', 113024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure those tauren will be back any minute.\n\nTill then, how can I help you, chum?', '', 113023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assassin! Run for your lives!', '', 113022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s my Moozy...', 113021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother!', 113020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage, we saw your flares. Please let us know how we can help.', 113019, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not interfere. The Legion will rise!', 113017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Herald has promised us freedom and respect. We will not be denied!', 113016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vargoth and his limited intellect will never be able to unlock the Soulstone\'s full potential. I\'m the only one who can really show you what it can do!', '', 113015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know the Nightborne Soulstone can be used to control millions of people? I\'m sure going to have some fun when I get it!', '', 113014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, if I had a fancy weapon like yours I\'d be running this place!  And much more competently, I might add.', '', 113013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aegis will be mine you fools, and there\'s nothing you can do to stop me.', '', 113012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that is a fancy weapon? You should let me borrow it sometime!', '', 113011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must see with my own eyes what horrors have befallen my beloved teacher. Steel your hearts against the darkness, heroes.', '', 113010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moonglade is the most sacred place in all the Dream. To think that my shan\'do could play any part in its corruption...', '', 113009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold, the Iris opens! The way to Cenarius is clear.', '', 113008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I grow tired of this.', '', 113007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pray that purging the Nightmare\'s corruption buys us enough time to defeat the Legion and catch our breath before the black armies rise up from the depths.', '', 113006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once I get that Soulstone, nobody will be able to stop me!', '', 113005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No doubt Xavius and his ancient master delight that so much of our attention goes into fighting the Legion. Their insidious shadow seeps into our world, distracting us with whispers and doubts.', '', 113004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this seed takes hold, the roots of its infestation will wind their way into the heart of Azeroth. The Nightmare would devour our world, claiming everything... everyone. This must not come to pass!', '', 113003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What horror is this? A tumor of Nightmare infecting a world tree, here in the reflection of the titans\' own playground?', '', 113002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had a deep love for the lands of Alterac, old friend. I vow to tend the vale in your name.', '', 113001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer ambushed and murdered Elerethe, misleading her into believing Hamuul Runetotem played a part in her death. It seems her spirit was so twisted that she sought to take vengeance upon all of Thunder Bluff.', '', 113000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The illusion of corruption falls away! Behold a druid who was as a sister to me... Elerethe Renferal. I feel her loss keenly, heroes.', '', 112999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to find that Soulstone if it\'s the last thing I do!', '', 112998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67652, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What manner of foul creature is this? It seems poised to unleash its corruption upon Thunder Bluff! The spirit of the tauren people must not fall prey to the Nightmare!', '', 112997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you find peace at last, old friend.', '', 112996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh Ysondre! How cruel fate can be! Cleansed of the Nightmare once before, only to become its victim yet again. Some wounds never truly heal.', '', 112995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not be stopped!', 112994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this sacred place has been made into a conduit for the Nightmare to spread its corruption. This we cannot allow!', '', 112993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was the Emerald Dreamway. During my long slumber, it was here I communed with the Green Dragonflight.', '', 112992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly there was never a soul more noble than Ursoc\'s. I pray his spirit finds its way back to the Dream.', '', 112991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need further proof of how insidious the Nightmare is, look there! Even the fierce heart of Ursoc has succumbed. Release him, I beg you!', '', 112990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s make our way to the watch tower.', 112989, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From each of these pathways, a palpable evil emanates. Choose a course, and know that I will stand with you.', '', 112988, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 61374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense the touch of Cenarius upon this Iris. It is a portal that leads to Moonglade, but the way has been sealed by dark magic. We must sever the tendrils of power that bind it.', '', 112987, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 61373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have faced the Nightmare before, but never has it had so thorough a stranglehold on the Dream. It hungers, desperate to seed its corruption. Do not let its whispers seduce you into madness!', '', 112986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must put an end to the Nightmare. Say the word and I will take us into the heart of that twisted place.', '', 112985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alas, poor Nythendra! She served faithfully as Guardian of the Dream, only to be perverted into a gatekeeper of corruption.', '', 112984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must follow protocol. Whoever is firing those flares obviously needs our help.', 112983, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidari, salute our new leader, $n!', '', 112982, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 66856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are... too late...', '', 112981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It can\'t be... Those flares haven\'t been used in hundreds of years.', 112980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail, $n, our new leader. Illidari, salute!', '', 112979, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 66855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More bones for the Legion!', '', 112978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for yourself!', '', 112977, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 71624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The emergency signal flares. They\'re being fired above the lodge!', '', 112976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have consulted with the Master\'s soul and gained wisdom.', '', 112975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm down, Pierce. What are you talking about?', 112974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me $pc, this may hurt a little.', '', 112973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look to the sky! It\'s happening, above the lodge!', '', 112972, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 66575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan\'s soul has spoken. Our way forward is clear.', '', 112971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We aren\'t alone, brothers and sisters.', 'We aren\'t alone, brothers and sisters.', 112970, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s someone here.', 'There\'s someone here.', 112969, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', 'What was that?', 112968, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard something over here.', 'I heard something over here.', 112967, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emmarel! Commander! Have you seen it?', '', 112966, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Hydrannon without getting attacked', '', 112965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collect ten globules of living water without getting attacked', '', 112964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you up top. We will break the news together.', '', 112963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intriguing turn of events. I will see you up top.', '', 112962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us!', 'Help us!', 112961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... No!', 'No... No!', 112960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you waiting for? Let\'s get moving!', 112959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Little Moozy is a gorgeous calf.', 112958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen Moozy\'s smile? Gets it from me, I suspect.', 112957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When do you think Sella will give me more grandchildren?', 112956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My daughter really is a beautiful woman.', 112955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go see Moozy!', 112954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a nice young $gman:woman;.', 112953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, these old bones haven\'t moved in a while.', 112952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come closer, $r.', 112951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get where I can see you!', 112950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait for me!', 112949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There was a time when young ones were nice to old ladies.', 112948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess you\'d rather I fall off the edge of Thunder Totem than escort me.', 112947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why is everyone always in such a hurry?', 112946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slow down, $gbull calf:heifer;!', 112945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t see you, $n!', 112944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your family is at the Hammer\'s Cradle.', 'Your family is at the Hammer\'s Cradle.', 112943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that you say? Moozy is where?', 112942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay inside the shrine and avoid the whirlwinds', '', 112941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tear this weakling apart, Brinebeard. I have business elsewhere...', 112940, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brinebeard, rise again! Serve the Legion in undeath!', 112939, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late, mortal!', 112938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you over here, $n.', '', 112937, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troubling.', '', 112936, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a handful of scouts have returned, none recently.', '', 112935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No word has reached us from the front lines?', '', 112934, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The third fleet has been deployed against the southern shores of the Broken Isles.', '', 112933, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can run, but you cannot hide, sweetling...', 112932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come out, come out, little one...', 112931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do we have here? Someone hiding?', 112930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm, maybe nothing after all...', 112929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Enjoy your freedom... while it lasts.', 112928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hide for now. I will find you soon...', 112927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get used to groveling, Nightborne.', 112926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel before your betters, whelp.', 112925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are our playthings, little one. Remember that.', 112924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know your place, worm.', 112923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You make the most amusing pet, little elf.', 112922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down. Follow the water.', '', 112921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! The fal\'dorei make their home in the ruins below.', '', 112920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak creatures, ripe for the slaughter!', '', 112919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll eat your... heart...', '', 112918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, fresh meat for the spit!', '', 112917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this city! So much magic to feed upon!', '', 112916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a miserable excuse for a city.', 112915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n. Use my crystal to speak with me inside.', '', 112914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will enjoy seeing this city destroyed.', '', 112913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A city? Do we HAVE to go in there!?', '', 112912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void reaches out to this land.', '', 112911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that? Speak into my good ear.', 112910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows grow dark in this place.', '', 112909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that?', 'Did you hear that?', 112908, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A curse upon you, shaman. Destroy $ghim:her; my pets!', '', 112907, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reveal yourself!', 'Reveal yourself!', 112906, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who goes there?', 'Who goes there?', 112905, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh look, master! A city full of naughty little elves!', 112904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters in arms!', 'Brothers and sisters in arms!', 112903, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We prevail!', 'We prevail!', 112902, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it!', 'We did it!', 112901, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 112900, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done everyone!', 'Well done everyone!', 112899, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elves huddle behind their walls for protection. Fools! The very world around them will crumble if the Legion is victorious!', '', 112898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elves of this land wither away for lack of magic. Pathetic! They could have easily taken it from others.', '', 112897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is nothing compared to Mac\'Aree, and soon it will burn with hellfire just the same.', '', 112896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the land, see how the Legion has drained it of every useful bit of magic? Not even the soul of a worm remains! Such efficiency must be praised!', '', 112895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strong, powerful, cunning... dragons would make ideal minions if they were only more... subservient.', '', 112894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of this land bought their freedom from the Legion, a price paid in blood. A sacrifice made in vain, as you shall soon see.', '', 112893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ymiron was a fine tool. He did more to spread the blessing of flesh than any other of his kind.', 112892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn was a great enemy... until his own arrogance proved his undoing. You should ask him if he has considered Loken\'s final words to him. Go ahead!', 112891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skovald seeks to join the ranks of the destroyers, unaware that so many of those who dare are betrayed.', 112890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold the wasted power of the titans before you, done in their name, no less.', 112889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is possible N\'Zoth may be responsible for her form, but her arrogance is all her own.', 112888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xavius\'s tricks are cunning. Why reveal yourself when you can control from afar?', 112887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another tortured soul, long overdue for oblivion. I am more interested in his advisor, though...', 112886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much fury in this soul! It will be a good harvest.', 112885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elves here are desperate to save themselves from the Nightmare, while the demons seek to harness its might. Both will fail.', 112884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you will see why the Legion\'s invasion is ultimately futile. All can be corrupted, dreams and demons alike.', 112883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To see Yogg-Saron\'s nightmare in full bloom fills me with jealousy... and some pride.', 112882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tauren here are remarkably resilient to corruption, considering their origins.', 112881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More of the titans\' failed experiments grow here unchecked. The drogbar prove their failure as creators.', 112880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at what I can do!', 'Look at what I can do!', 112879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65776, 65973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can still see you.', 'I can still see you.', 112878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65775, 65972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invisibility!', 'Invisibility!', 112877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65784, 65981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ring around the city...', 112876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hearts are full of pity...', 112875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crashing! Clashing!', 112874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outside lies doom.', 112873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher said my magic was strongest!', 'Teacher said my magic was strongest!', 112872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65787, 65977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fair, I never get to be the Grand Magistrix!', 'No fair, you always get to be the Grand Magistrix!', 112871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65771, 65976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents say I\'m too young for arcwine.', 'My parents say I\'m too young for arcwine.', 112870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65772, 65975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t break through the force fields! The shields are too strong!', 'You can\'t break through the force fields! The shields are too strong!', 112869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65773, 65988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pew pew pew! Lightning Missiles!', 'Pew pew pew! Lightning Missiles!', 112868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65774, 65974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pew pew pew! Lightning Missiles!', '', 112867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t break through the force fields! The shields are too strong!', '', 112866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fallen Aspect\'s lair is near. He was the strongest of them, and yet the easiest one for us to corrupt.', 112865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents say I\'m too young for arcwine.', '', 112864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fair, I never get to be the Grand Magistrix!', '', 112863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teacher said my magic was strongest!', '', 112862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outside lies doom.', '', 112861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crashing! Clashing!', '', 112860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hearts are full of pity...', '', 112859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ring around the city...', '', 112858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fallen elves cower behind their wall. They know no other way...', 112857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suramar, its \"noble\" citizens greedily slurping at their world\'s very lifeblood.', 112856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This city of elves pales in comparison to the sleeping city...', 112855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters...', 'Monsters...', 112854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65734, 65944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Elisande thinking, letting them in?', 'What is Elisande thinking, letting them in?', 112853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65735, 65943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your vile magic is an abomination!', 'Your vile magic is an abomination!', 112852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65736, 65942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush, they are nearby.', 'Hush, they are nearby.', 112851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65737, 65941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot endure your presence any longer!', 'We cannot endure your presence any longer!', 112850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65738, 65940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Get out of our city!', 'Enough! Get out of our city!', 112849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65739, 65939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be impressed by tall icons of the titans which stand here. The towers of sacrifice in Ny\'alotha dwarf these pathetic temples.', 112848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Helya and her cult are strong here. So close to the truth, yet so far.', 112847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spawn of the titans infest this area. Despite our \"gift\" of flesh, they still worship those false gods.', 112846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion burrows deep here. If they burrow deeper, they may not like what they find.', 112845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dragons are weak here. You would do well to exploit this fact.', 112844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disaster abounds here. Elf ruins filled with unquiet souls ripe for harvest.', 112843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vindictive Spirit emits an empty howl.', '', 112842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vindictive Spirit stares in your direction.', '', 112840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is little time. Listen closely.', '', 112839, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord.', '', 112838, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I have been expecting you. Ah good... Kayn Sunfury.', '', 112837, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was here very recently -- he can\'t have gotten too far ahead!', '', 112836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast! It\'s gone! That Vargoth is going to be sorry when I catch up with him!', '', 112835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67650, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not be able to contact me like this again. The Illidari are now yours, $n.', '', 112834, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have attracted attention. I must move.', '', 112833, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find out where the Wardens hid it away.', '', 112832, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must also regain the Sargerite Keystone to invade the Legion\'s worlds.', '', 112831, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He alone knows every detail. You will need his counsel if you are to succeed.', '', 112830, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it, $p! Now let\'s fish up those frenzies!', '', 112829, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I entrusted the duplicitous Akama with planning the campaign against the Legion.', '', 112828, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. There is little time.', '', 112827, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan.', '', 112826, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking', 'Taking', 112825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh. It looks like the inner vault has been breached! We\'d better see if the Nightborne Soulstone has been taken...', '', 112824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67649, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I have been expecting you, though not the traitor, Altruis.', '', 112823, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light shines in Westfall for another day, thanks to all of you. But we must remain vigilant!', '', 112822, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A collection of your notes on the \"Veiled Hand\" cult.', 'A collection of your notes on the \"Veiled Hand\" cult.', 112821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Legion guide you, and do not forget to destroy this letter. We must leave nothing to chance.', '', 112819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sister Ebonlocke has gathered the Skull and Blood of the Innocents. She awaits your escort.', '', 112818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl Felstorm says you have a ride for me to Faronaar.', 'Meryl Felstorm says you have a ride for me to Faronaar.', 112817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother Shadowgaze, it is time for our glorious ascension. Make haste to Darkshire.', '', 112816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The Underking is not getting away. Not this time.', 112815, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 62098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coward! There is no hole you can hide in that we cannot follow.', 112814, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 62097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While I do not have the same strength outside of Dalaran, I will be with you \"in spirit,\" as it were.', '', 112813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will arrange transportation at Krasus\' Landing. Talk to the flight master when you are ready.', '', 112812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are learning, child.', '', 112811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much power.', '', 112810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consume it.', '', 112809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes...', '', 112808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can hide from our wrath.', '', 112807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are others. Find them. Destroy them.', '', 112806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is energy here.', '', 112805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We work well together.', '', 112804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fulfill your calling, child. Do not stop.', '', 112803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, child. Such... potential.', '', 112802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More. Find more.', '', 112801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its energy sustains me.', '', 112800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They call you \"hero.\" Why, child, do you concede to their every whim?', '', 112799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we can remake this world.', '', 112798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I drink... but I am never fulfilled...', '', 112797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcane energies knit this world together... do you feel it, child?', '', 112796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are ambitious, child. Like the one before you.', '', 112795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They seek to control us, to check our power. Do not allow it.', '', 112794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
