('<Ebonfang glances at you for a moment before sitting down to allow you to climb upon her back.>', '', 112571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arcane communion forms a bond that transcends physical space.', 112570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ngahh...', '', 112569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall do my best to keep Theryn off the line...', 112568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you hear me? Do not be alarmed.', 112567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have vengeance for Fardonis\' arrogance!', '', 112566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic will be the end of you!', '', 112565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse remains...', 'The curse remains...', 112564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse... will never let me rest...', 'The curse... will never let me rest...', 112563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die here, among the cursed!', 'You will die here, among the cursed!', 112562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is forfeit, outsider!', 'Your life is forfeit, outsider!', 112561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their curse is as ours, and they will never rest. At least, for now, you\'ve prevented them from lashing out against my Court.', '', 112560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The game... is far... from over...', 112559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death... is only the beginning.', 112558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The game... is far... from over...', '', 112557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... is only the beginning.', '', 112556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel before me! Beg for mercy!', 112555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are no match for our immortal army!', 112554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
