('You are no match for our immortal army!', '', 112552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I claim this land for the Legion! Every mortal will be purged!', 112551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness your lands being devoured before your very eyes!', 112550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I claim this land for the Legion! Every mortal will be purged!', '', 112549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness your lands being devoured before your very eyes!', '', 112548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your end is upon you! All will burn!', 112547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such fragile beings. How quickly your end approaches!', 112546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end is upon you! All will burn!', '', 112545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such fragile beings. How quickly your end approaches!', '', 112544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems Tash\'irel was trying to lift the curse through sheer force of magic. Such a waste. At least now, the tomes have found their rightful home.', '', 112543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only... delay... the inevitable.', '', 112542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... return!', '', 112541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impudent whelps! Stand and face me!', '', 112540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrogance means nothing! Come and face a lord of the Legion!', '', 112539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scour their lands! Snuff out every life!', '', 112538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remove them from existence! Leave nothing in your wake.', '', 112537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A sect of former subjects, insane from arcane magics they could not control, plots vengeance against me and mine. Destroy them!', '', 112536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miserable wretches! The hour of doom is at hand!', '', 112535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion comes! Your world will be PURGED!', '', 112534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A momentary... setback...', '', 112533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will... return!', '', 112532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lives mean nothing! I will relish ending them!', '', 112531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accept your challenge, mortals. Time to see just how fragile you truly are!', '', 112530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wipe them out! All of them!', '', 112529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spread out! Leave them nothing!', '', 112528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal filth! You will stain this world no more!', '', 112527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 112526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another will... take... my place...', '', 112525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is but a mask.', '', 112524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand before me and DIE!', '', 112523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are in vain, mortals! We cannot be stopped.', '', 112522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere you can hide from us!', '', 112521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel our power scorching your lands!', '', 112520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bid farewell to the lives you knew. The Legion has come!', '', 112519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
