('These mortals cannot stop the inevitable! Spread out! Destroy them all!', '', 112512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We come to burn your world to cinders!', '', 112511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doom of your world is upon you!', '', 112510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the... the Fangs are gone! What happened, $n?', '', 112509, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! The Legion\'s attack has been broken!', '', 112508, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The arcana will save us... it must.', 112499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will cure this curse... in time...', 112498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare defile our sacred texts?', 112497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ours! This knowledge is OURS!', 112493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our arcana is not for you, outsider!', 112489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and Sisters, the shrine is under attack! By fang and claw, purge it of the desecrator!', '', 112488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tightly, my mortal friend. A fall from this height would be a shame.', '', 112487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood of any of the demons on the Broken Isles will do. Wish I was going with you.', 112485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanthir and I need your help to avenge-', 'Vanthir and I need your help to avenge-', 112482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
