INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Another annoyance?! I\'m going to enjoy watching this world burn!', '', 112478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It lies near my corpse. I... I think it\'s keeping me here. Please, take it far away. Perhaps then I will finally be able to go home.', 112477, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 64236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you want the ritual to work, you need the focus. I tried to keep it from the monsters, but I was too weak.', 112476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was told to stand watch, but no one ever came back for me. I wasn\'t strong enough to defend the site... or perhaps I was simply here too long. I\'m not sure anymore.', 112475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you here to take me away? Or do you only seek that which was left behind?', 112474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Verstok was at the shrine! Find out what\'s going on up there. I\'ll meet up with you as soon as I can, $n.', '', 112473, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a good look, brute! You\'ll never see the Fangs again!', '', 112472, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not that I have anything against fireballs. But, I\'ve always been a cloak-and-dagger sort, myself. Thank you, $r. These are truly a marvel.', '', 112470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The modern warrior is too dependent on his armor, he realizes only too late that a small weapon slipped between the joining of plates will kill him surer than the largest warhammer or the most magical of fireballs.', '', 112469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very, very nice $n. If hate could be forged into a weapon, it would look like this.', '', 112468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we can talk freely, $n, I\'ve been meaning to ask you about those daggers of yours...', '', 112467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have my spies misled me, or are those indeed Anguish and Sorrow, the blades that killed King Llane Wrynn? A most impressive find, $n.$b$bI know a thing or two about daggers. May I see them? Just for a moment, of course.', '', 112466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so the Legion is here. I thought we would have more time.$b$bSo much to do, so very much to do...', '', 112465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid you\'re on your own out there until you can find Garona. I\'d be recognized in a heartbeat that close to Alliance territory.', 112463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the center of Dalaran is a portal that can take you to Karazhan. Start your search in the mountains west of the tower. I seem to recall a mention of something up there.', '', 112462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose even astral entities need a change of pace now and again. It\'s still a she though... right?', '', 112461, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 64240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RRAAAUUUGHHHH!', '', 112460, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh, I\'m pretty sure she\'s a goblin now.', '', 112459, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 64239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust the Baroness was still there? I don\'t know how old that elf is.', '', 112458, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be careful out there!', 'You be careful out there!', 112457, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! I wasn\'t finished yet.', 'Hey! I wasn\'t finished yet.', 112456, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it back in one piece!', 'Bring it back in one piece!', 112455, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful with that thing!', 'Careful with that thing!', 112454, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT] Moonfall Retreat. Thank you, Valtrois. That will be all.', 112453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT] Magically speaking, the area is in chaos. With one notable exception...', 112452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT]What of your tests? Did you sense anything in Falanaar?', 112451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[CUT] Something incredibly powerful WAS there, but it expired long ago. Rather violently, from what I can tell.', 112450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, boys, looks like we\'re going with my plan after all. Let\'s talk details.', 112449, 0, 40432, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mana betrays us...', 'The mana betrays us...', 112448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop it. Stop talking! Stop the voices!', 'Stop it. Stop talking! Stop the voices!', 112445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the assistance, but I\'ve got to keep moving. You should do the same.', '', 112441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate your help, but I must find the rest of my party.', '', 112439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Offer Mana Wine.>', '<Offer Mana Wine.>', 112433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent mortal! We will hunt you down! You only delay the inevitable!', '', 112431, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never let Ashamane\'s Fangs fall to your kind!', '', 112430, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blades are mine!', '', 112428, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic barriers mean nothing to the Legion!', '', 112427, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secure the perimeter! And get rid of their corpses. I don\'t want their foul stench drifting about.', '', 112426, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_felarakkoa_feldetonation_green:20|t You are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206222|h[Bonds of Fel]|h|r!', '', 112425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_felarakkoa_feldetonation_red:20|t You are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206221|h[Empowered Bonds of Fel]|h|r!', '', 112424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very brave of you to come all the way out here, $n. We are in your debt.', 112423, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks.', '', 112422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! They\'re magic is quite powerful.', 'Be careful! They\'re magic is quite powerful.', 112421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These things... I couldn\'t stop them!', 'These things... I couldn\'t stop them!', 112420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others... I must find them!', 'The others... I must find them!', 112419, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings be upon you, brave one.', 'Blessings be upon you, brave one.', 112418, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we are stronger.', 'Together we are stronger.', 112417, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earth Mother watches over us.', 'The Earth Mother watches over us.', 112416, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time streams are mine to command! You cannot win!', 112415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The threads of time answer to me!', 112414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you race through time? Or be trapped in an endless eternity?', 112413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time itself heeds my call!', 112412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I control the battlefield, not you!', 112411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the waves of time crash over you!', 112410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll find time can be quite volatile.', 112409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 77036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be returnin\' to me village til it\'s safe.', 'I be returnin\' to me village til it\'s safe.', 112408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best get movin\', mon.', 'Best get movin\', mon.', 112407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave of ya to come for us, $n.', 'Brave of ya to come for us, $n.', 112406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem magics ain\'t like none I been seein\' before.', 'Dem magics ain\'t like none I been seein\' before.', 112405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I am fine.', 112398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks... Can I have more food, please?', 'You have my thanks... Can I have more food, please?', 112397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conjured Mana food never tasted so good...', 'Conjured Mana food never tasted so good...', 112396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A brief client scene happens here.', 'A brief client scene happens here.', 112395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I was barely hanging on.', 'Thank you. I was barely hanging on.', 112394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons! Everywhere!', 'Demons! Everywhere!', 112393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wished to speak to me?', 'You wanted to speak to me?', 112392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quite a view, isn\'t it?', 112391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something terrible is afoot, traveler. I can feel it.', 112390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, $c, do not tarry. I cannot imagine a world without Cenarius!', 112389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I certainly get myself into some very interesting situations!', '', 112388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AAIGHH!!', 112387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you, help a fellow mage out! That demon, Norvir, has the key!', '', 112386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67645, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will cost this weapon 500 Artifact Power.  Are you sure that you want to respec your artifact?', 'This will cost this weapon 500 Artifact Power.  Are you sure that you want to respec your artifact?', 112385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to refund the traits in my artifact.', 'Yes, I\'d like to refund the traits in my artifact.', 112384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel them. His memories.', 112383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you refocus the power in that weapon you have there.\n\nYou\'ll lose a little in the process though.', 'I can help you refocus the power in that weapon you have there.\n\nYou\'ll lose a little in the process though.', 112382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away... STAY AWAY!', 'Stay away... STAY AWAY!', 112381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take them. But only for a moment.', 'Take them. But only for a moment.', 112380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, $r. I am impressed. Many lives have been ended by the Kingslayers... go now, and send the weak to their end.', '', 112379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So slender, so quick. These are not the weapons of a warrior, no, they strike from the shadows.', '', 112378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach, I can feel their thirst. Forged in darkness these were. Many have fallen to their caress.', '', 112377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, $c. Let me see those blades - they stink of death.', '', 112376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those daggers you hold. They have tasted the blood of Kings. Give them here, I wish to see them closer.$b$bHah ha! Such a sour face you make. I will not keep them, rogue. I am long past the need for your mortal steel.', '', 112375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my day, I put blades in the hands of armies. What of you, mortal? What do you seek?', '', 112374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Changing', 'Changing', 112373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give in, $n. We must fight!', '', 112372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You tell that big lug that if he ever wants to pick up where we left off, he can pay me a visit! I\'m here every day... whatever the hour!', 112371, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 64252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you bear his sigil. How\'d you manage that? Well, rules are rules.', 112370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmph! You don\'t look a thing like him! Fine, let\'s have a look...', 112369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like access to the personal vault of Alodi, Archmage of Dalaran.', 'I would like access to the personal vault of Alodi, Archmage of Dalaran.', 112368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasure them, $n. I am pleased that you are the head of our order. Thank you.', '', 112367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see these channels here, along the flat of the blade? They drive poison deeper into the wounds. These blades drink blood and spit poison. Such deadly craftsmanship!', '', 112366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the rumors are true. Anguish and Sorrow are once again in the hands of a skilled assassin. Ah yes, they do not disappoint.', '', 112365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst! $n! Come this way. I\'m over here. Near the Campfire.', '', 112364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet now. They haven\'t found my position yet. I\'ve been stirring up a good deal of trouble back here.$b$bMy fellows in the Hall of Shadows report that you\'ve got your hands on Garona\'s old daggers. Is that true? May I see them?', '', 112363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t give away my position. Like you, I\'m doing the devil\'s work behind the lines.', '', 112362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
