('The Legion cannot be stopped!', 'The Legion cannot be stopped!', 112357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile mortal! Your end has come!', 'Fragile mortal! Your end has come!', 112356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul shall suffer!', 'Your soul shall suffer!', 112355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
