('', 'Our bank is so secure you\'ll have trouble getting your own things out! Ha ha!', 112352, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t stop! That thing wouldn\'t let me!', 'I couldn\'t stop! That thing wouldn\'t let me!', 112351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
