('I felt so weak!', 'I felt so weak!', 112349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this... is this really me?', 'Is this... is this really me?', 112348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They know our secrets! Our thoughts are not our own!', 'They know our secrets! Our thoughts are not our own!', 112347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
