('Get out of here! This is chaos!', '', 112336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to the bank manager. The sigil I just gave you should grant access. There may still be wards guarding the vault, so be careful.', '', 112335, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For us, the Hammer of Khaz\'goroth has always been a symbol of unity, a reminder of our proud history. But in your hands, it will serve an even greater purpose.', 112334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any information you can find on Arrexis, how he died, and the whereabouts of Ebonchill would be greatly appreciated.', '', 112333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits whisper that our fates our intertwined, $n. My people stand ready to aid you in the war against the Legion.', 112332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On behalf of the tribes of Highmountain, I entrust the hammer to you and your allies. May it strike true at the heart of the enemy!', 112331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you first set foot upon our shores, I prayed to the spirits asking if you could be trusted. By helping to reunite our tribes, you have proven yourself a true friend to our people.', 112330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Now that we have the key, the way to the balcony should be open. It\'s time to put an end to Elisande!', 112329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That just might work. We need the details of this ritual, as well as the power to pull it off. Let us get to it.', '', 112328, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us recreate Arrexis\'s ritual! Conducting the ritual at an invasion point will attract Balaadur\'s attention. He will likely try an ambush, but we will be ready.', '', 112327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the invasion I have no doubt he is either here or watching. I propose something... audacious.', '', 112326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Come closer. There are rumors about those daggers of yours...', '', 112325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Note the serrated reverse edge, allowing the wielder to cut back if the first slice misses. Not that Garona ever missed. Her victims were dead before they hit the ground. These are truly a treasure, $n - thank you.', '', 112324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Garona, she preferred short, curved blades. They allow one to draw the weapon from the scabbard and slice the target\'s throat in a single, deadly motion. Oh, glorious!', '', 112323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, yes. Daggers. The weapon of choice for skilled assassins. Easily concealed, leaving no chance of the victim surviving. Some prefer stiletto blades, for rapid piercing of the victim\'s vitals.', '', 112322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it is true. You carry with you Anguish and Sorrow, the twin blades that once slit the throat of the Alliance King.$b$bI consider myself an aficionado of poisoned blades, $n. May I see them a moment? I can tell you a little about their history...', '', 112321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poisons. Poisons, here! Family owned and operated since our untimely death.', '', 112320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! Now we can begin our counter attack!', '', 112319, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My staff... in the hands of the enemy! We must get it back!', '', 112318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Arrexis was ambushed by this eredar, Balaadur?  Then he is probably in possession of the staff...', '', 112317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Inform Meryl of the information you uncovered.>', '<Inform Meryl of the information you uncovered.>', 112316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrexis was a powerful and well known member of the Order of Tirisfal around the First War. I barely spoke to him, busy with my own goals. I knew he wielded Ebonchill. Then, mysteriously, I returned from a long journey and he was gone. His apprentices were gone and any materials and belongings related to him. The other members of the order were very tightlipped, only saying that something horrible had befallen him.\n\nEbonchill was nowhere to be found.', '', 112315, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me more about Arrexis?', 'Can you tell me more about Arrexis?', 112314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_felfireraid_d_01:20|t %s readies |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206675|h[Shatter Essence]|h|r.', '', 112313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
