('Nothing escapes these walls.', '', 112002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63032, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Violet Hold.', '', 112001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63031, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just visiting?', '', 112000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63030, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caaaaaaw!', '', 111999, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caaaw?', '', 111998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speaking with chatty nobles may reveal the spy. Just avoid drawing attention to yourself with wild accusations!', 111997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My informants claim that a Burning Legion spy is attending this party.', 111996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Vargoth suddenly loses his balance and lurches to one side.', '', 111995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Vargoth\'s fingers twitch spasmodically.', '', 111994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Vargoth looks into the distance.', '', 111993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm, have we met before? Your face is quite familiar.\n\nOh! You are the hero I\'ve been hearing so much about. You are most impressive...', '', 111992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! We will hunt later.', '', 111990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Explore the area and find a way to separate the council members. Divided, they cannot stand against you!', 111989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out up here. I\'ve heard tell of a demonic council that draws strength from one another. This bond must be broken.', 111988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm. Something isn\'t right...', '', 111987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world will cry out in anger against us, but the air that fills their lungs will have been bought with the price of our souls.', '', 111986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.', 'Yes.', 111985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems we have an accord, then. Shall I fetch your diamond?', 111984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_socererking_arcaneacceleration|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:207278|h[Arcane Lockdown]|h|r! Jump to remove the effect!', '', 111983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are proving yourself to be a very capable member of the Tirisgarde, $n!', '', 111982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The recent events and Meryl\'s illness are most distressing. I\'m glad we have you to rely on, $n!', '', 111981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are living up to your reputation, $n. Thank you for handling my duties while I am indisposed.', '', 111980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Get out of our city!', '', 111979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot endure your presence any longer!', '', 111978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightborne falls silent.', 'The Nightborne falls silent.', 111977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush, they are nearby.', '', 111976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stupid one stays in the jar! So stupid! It angers master!', '', 111975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Watch it!', '', 111974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s debt is paid... paid it is! Away!', '', 111973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh thank you! Thank you, strong one! I help, you see!', '', 111972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caw? Caaaaw!', '', 111971, 0, 0, 403, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caaw ca-caw.', '', 111970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caw! Caaaaaw!', '', 111969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming! We\'re under attack!', '', 111968, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got incoming!  Look out!', '', 111967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General!', '', 111966, 0, 924, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[OLD] I am ready to begin.', '[OLD] I am ready to begin.', 111965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we\'re launching a full assault on Broken Shore.  Before we hit the shore, we need every soldier to be combat ready.\n\nAre you ready for your combat training?', '$n, we\'re launching a full assault on Broken Shore.  Before we hit the shore, we need every soldier to be combat ready.\n\nAre you ready for your combat training?', 111964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve stumbled right into my traps!', '', 111963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes the BOOM!', '', 111962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t miss!', '', 111961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Says you. If I ever meet Garona, I will strangle her myself.', '', 111960, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes it is best to allow the past remain in the past.', '', 111959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those are the Kingslayer daggers, aren\'t they $n? My father served King Llane Wrynn in the first war, before those very daggers took the King\'s life.', '', 111958, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
