('Yes, I have the lasher seed from the roots below Shaladrassil.', '', 111956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, watch it!', '', 111955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my blades were sharper I\'d stay for a little fun.', '', 111954, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shops closed! I\'ll be back when it\'s safe.', '', 111953, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t be stickin\' round here, $n!', '', 111952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your words carry the tone of a great $c, $n. May the Earth mother watch over you.', 111951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kind of you, brave one, but I\'m no great warrior.', '', 111950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave of you, $n. I be returnin\' soon.', '', 111949, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see you soon, $n.', '', 111948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best be comin\' back when its safe.', '', 111947, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I best be returnin\' later, mon.', '', 111946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get moving!', '', 111945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory to Elisande.', 111944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent. The shipment will proceed as scheduled, then. It will be delivered to the docks within the hour. See that it is not left unattended. There have been far too many thefts lately.', 111943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust you were careful to deter any pursuers?', 111942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Grand Magistrix.', 111941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Naturally. I took a circuitous route through the city.', 111940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
