('I find your lack of faith disturbing.', '', 111938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me who to smite and they shall be smoten!', '', 111937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woe befalls the heretic.', '', 111936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the Light\'s vengeance.', '', 111935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with the Light.', '', 111934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light redeems.', '', 111933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you the Light.', '', 111932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can the Light serve?', '', 111931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you need?', '', 111930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you mind? I\'m working on a very important paper, and it\'s difficult to concentrate with you neophytes shooting everything in sight.', '', 111929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Are those truly the Kingslayer daggers you carry? I know a few collectors who would pay a pretty penny for those particular pieces of history. I can connect you... for a small finder\'s fee, obviously...', '', 111928, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see why Arluin put his faith in you. Give him our regards.', 'I can see why Arluin put his faith in you. Give him our regards.', 111927, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is not the time for this, Verstok! We must tend to our wounded.', '', 111926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No horseplay in the study hall!', '', 111925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not here to have fun, underclassman. We\'re here to learn.', '', 111924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good gracious, mind your wand fire.', '', 111923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My word.', '', 111922, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep this up and I\'ll have to give you extra homework.', 111921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s minus fifty points for shooting the teacher.', 111920, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s it. I\'m giving you a zero for the day.', 111919, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t forget to aim before you fire.', 111918, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re gonna get in trouble if you keep doing that.', 'You\'re gonna get in trouble if you keep doing that.', 111917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit it!', 'Quit it!', 111916, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow!', 'Ow!', 111915, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ca-caaw!', '', 111914, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrs. Azuremoon! $n is wanding me!', 'Mrs. Azuremoon! $n is wanding me!', 111913, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m trying to study over here.', 'I\'m trying to study over here.', 111912, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch where you\'re wanding!', 'Watch where you\'re wanding!', 111911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Is it true you wield the Kingslayers? When I was just a girl, my gran told me the stories. The King of Stormwind grasping at his throat, red blood spattered on the white stones of the keep... I would hide under my covers at night, thinking assassins were everywhere.', 111910, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only do as I am told! Don\'t hurt me!', 111909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You. Me. By the flagpole. After class.', 'You. Me. By the flagpole. After class.', 111908, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', 'Hey!', 111907, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you the shrine isn\'t safe! Look at what your stubbornness has caused!', '', 111906, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 62265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your vile magic is an abomination!', '', 111905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide! They\'ll eat you!', '', 111904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Elisande thinking, letting them in?', '', 111903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t eat me!', '', 111902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s play somewhere else for a while.', '', 111901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh!', '', 111900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters...', '', 111899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to speak to Overseer Elvire.', 'I need to speak to Overseer Elvire.', 111898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may call upon my services at any time.', 111897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How may I serve you?', 111896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glory to the Shal\'dorei.', 111895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live to serve the Magistrix and her people.', 111894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are those indeed Garona\'s old daggers, $n? I saw her tear apart a demon in the Karazhan library once with those very blades. If I had only known what was to come...', '', 111893, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 73004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, those daggers you wield - the very same that killed Llane Wrynn in cold blood. The sight of them takes me to a dark place.', '', 111892, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 73005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I recognize those blades of yours, $n. They cut the throat of my King and my friend. Please... put them away in these chambers.', '', 111891, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 73006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scary...', '', 111889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That battle was one part skill, one part strategy, and ten parts adorable! Keep this up kid, you\'re going places... and making me a pile of gold in the process!', '', 111888, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most shamans prefer wolves, but this one prefers... corgis? You might think she\'s barking up the wrong tree, but she\'s beaten every doggone challenger so far! Who will take down these pugnacious pups?', '', 111887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how you found me out, but now it\'s time to die!', 'I don\'t know how you found me out, but now it\'s time to die!', 111886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
