('You insult my honor, $n. Who exactly are you?', 'You insult my honor, $n. Who exactly are you?', 111881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The musicians are quite good, aren\'t they?', 'The musicians are quite good, aren\'t they?', 111880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is quite the party, isn\'t it?', 'This is quite the party, isn\'t it?', 111879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suramar be eternal, friend.', 'Suramar be eternal, friend.', 111878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a flight to Ashamane\'s Fall.', 'I need a flight to Ashamane\'s Fall.', 111877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, friend. I have no business with you.', 'Move along, friend. I have no business with you.', 111876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now now, let\'s not be hasty $n. Why don\'t you follow me so we can talk about this in a more private setting...', 'Now now, let\'s not be hasty $n. Why don\'t you follow me so we can talk about this in a more private setting...', 111875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you accuse me of such a thing, $n? Do you know who I am? I don\'t recognize you at all...', 'How dare you accuse me of such a thing, $n? Do you know who I am? I don\'t recognize you at all...', 111874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be coy. I know you\'re here to spy for the Grand Magistrix.', 'Don\'t be coy. I know you\'re here to spy for the Grand Magistrix.', 111873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on...', 'Go on...', 111872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sooner I am back in the city, the better.', 111871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T-traitors...', '', 111870, 0, 40285, 0, 64, 0, 69829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww.', 111868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a monster!', 111867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But he was so cute!', 111866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woof.', 111865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Corgis. Am I right?', 111864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Salty?', 111863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to give you guys the wittle bandages for your wittle boo-boos!', 111862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teehee!', 111861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re all bark and no bite.', 111860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at their wittle faces! They\'re so cute I\'m going to die!', 111859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to enter the ring and earn glory in neverending combat?', 111857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Arluin your Sigil.>', '<Show Arluin your Sigil.>', 111853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I might be interested in what you have to say... with the right motivation.', '', 111852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the Windmaster\'s Totem.', 'Take the Windmaster\'s Totem.', 111851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Master finds us, turns us to meat!', '', 111850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '(CUT)', 111849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always helpful, Ishpip, but Master only yells...', '', 111848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '(CUT)', 111847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We leave the master! No more mean Bilebrain.', '', 111846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence! You waste my time with these constant interruptions!', '', 111845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Bilebrain! The enemy... they are advancing!', '', 111844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am needed elsewhere.', '', 111843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Vargoth shivers and mutters something unintelligible under his breath.', '', 111842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show your Sigil.>', '<Display your allegiance.>', 111841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snowfeather swoops down from the sky.', '', 111840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is an incredibly dangerous proposition you are making. How do I know you truly speak for Vanthir?', 111839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead. I\'m ready for my disguise.', 'Go ahead. I\'m ready for my disguise.', 111838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It should fool the gibbering, wine-soaked guests, but a keen eye could see through it. Should the illusion falter, the guards will quickly descend upon you.', 111837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s broken free! Run for your lives! It\'s... It\'s... NUTZ!', '', 111832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl chokes and coughs up bile.', '', 111829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl groans and clutches his stomach.', '', 111828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_fire_blueimmolation_nightmare:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:211471|h[Scorned Touch]|h|r!', '', 111827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl is wracked by a violent coughing fit.', '', 111826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl coughs and shivers feverishly.', '', 111825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreamweavers care not for your mortal differences, $r. Here, we are druids. Here, we are united toward a common cause.', '', 111824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be at peace while you rest here. The Dreamgrove is sanctuary to all of our kind.', '', 111823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know of \"alara\'shinu,\" druid? It means finding beauty in imperfection. Those who live by this philosophy understand the transience of nature, accept the cycle of life and death, and derive joy from this truth.', '', 111822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To understand nature is to understand the great cycle of all things. A blooming flower will someday return to the earth to fuel new seeds. The sun sets each day, to rise again and give new life. Our order is dedicated to understanding and preserving the continuation of this pattern.', '', 111821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of our order still remember when Shaladrassil first took root. We\'ve watched it grow over the ages, until it has towered over this vale. We have been blessed to live under the shade of its branches for so long.', '', 111820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreamweavers have watched over this grove for eons. We follow the path of Cenarius, and protect the forests of Val\'sharah.', '', 111819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should be planning our attack on Suramar!', 111818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lenora, release the beast. It poses no threat to us.', '', 111817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is precisely what I am doing.', 111816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you find this beast? I\'ve never seen one quite like it.$B$BTo the untrained eye, this felhound may look like any other minion, but a close examination of its jaw shows an extra set of razor-sharp teeth.$B$BIt is clear to me now that this is the beast that is responsible for the death of our companion.$B$BPlease apologize to Hilaire for the mix up. We can\'t be too careful these days.', '', 111815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am losing control...', 111814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dismiss these memories so we can proceed.', 111813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us move on.', 111812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the head of the beast that killed your mage.', 'This is the head of the beast that killed your mage.', 111811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help you?', '', 111810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s days like these that make me long for the comforts of home.', '', 111809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not yet. I need more time.', 'Not yet. I need more time.', 111808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 111807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is always a pleasure to be able to stretch my wings! Are you ready to go?', '', 111806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is always a pleasure to be able to stretch my wings!', '', 111805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Hippogryphs have been well fed and are ready to take you anywhere.', 111799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again.', '', 111798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67643, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait. Is that a journal you\'ve found? That may be what we are looking for!', '', 111797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67642, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The years have not been kind to me, $n.$b$b<Fillmaff coughs, weakly.>$b$bI think I may be dead.', '', 111796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell.', '', 111794, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, druids of the Dreamgrove. May you prosper under the leadership of your new Archdruid.', '', 111793, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To accomplish this task, I gift you with my blessing. Use my power to serve and protect the wilds.', '', 111792, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is perfectly safe! Oh, right... watch out for spiders down there. Whatever you do, don\'t cut yourself down from the rope!', '', 111791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, Xavius, Lord of the Nightmare, still lives. Only when he is defeated, will Azeroth truly be safe.', '', 111790, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we dealt a great blow to the unseen enemies of the Nightmare.', '', 111788, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 66776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon heading for the wall to the northeast!', '', 111787, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna BASH you!', '', 111786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls are so easily corrupted, mortals.', '', 111785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'South gate! Another demon in the fields!', 111784, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Portal coming up!', '', 111783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67641, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you know what you\'re doing. But if not... At least we\'re in for some fireworks. Good luck out there!', 111782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tick, tock!', '', 111781, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', '', 111780, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<A shadowy image of a gnome floats before you, a distant memory from the past. She is concentrating on a powerful spell, but mistakes you for someone else as you approach.>\n\nAlodi! You\'ve returned. Let me see that staff of yours. Yes, yes... I can help you, of course. But you should hear what the rest of the council is saying behind your back. You\'re lucky they need you.', 111779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In time we must all face our demons. Better you than me.', '', 111778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa... I didn\'t expect the queen to show up... I\'ll get you out of there. Hang on!', '', 111777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A half-remembered shadow lurks in the rear of the tavern, nosing through scrolls. The high-elf is a memory from another time. He recognizes your staff and greets you as an equal.>\n\nThe moment of truth arrives. Are you ready, Alodi? Are you certain that you can handle so much power?', '', 111776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[CUT] Day 20: Captured a new subject today. Number 16. He seems different somehow.', '', 111775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown the Legion that they will be hunted anywhere they dare tread in Azsuna. Excellent work!', '', 111774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their forces are massing in Faronaar. Strike there, and cripple them before they move deeper into Azsuna!', '', 111773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So arrogant are the Legion that they defile my lands and think themselves safe.', '', 111772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes I wish Garuhod\'s research called for less... distasteful reagents. Alas, these will do. Thank you.', 111771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You certainly don\'t shy away from the dirty work. Well done.', 111770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can brew a powerful draught of demon detection with the right pile of entrails. Collect them for me, and together we will retake Faronaar!', 111769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outstanding! They must make repairs before their soul engine can re-engage. You have bought us valuable time.', 111768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Each Legion detachment draws power from a soul engine. Incapacitate the demons\' vile machine and slay the eredar who maintain it!', 111767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those whelps were so small, so helpless. How despicable of the Legion to prey upon the weak!', 111766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion has captured a clutch of Stellagosa\'s azure whelplings! Save them, so our ally\'s brood may grow stronger!', 111765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. Make this count, mage.', 111764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<A ghostly shade lingers in the citadel, a long-dead memory from Dalaran\'s past. The slender figure recognizes your staff and mistakes you for someone else. She lazily looks you over through half-lidded eyes.>$b$bArchmage Alodi. You go to face Kathra\'natir, then? The rest of the council ignores my warnings.$b$bVery well. I will not stop your suicide. If you seek to add my power to yours, you need only ask.$b$b<Fiora sips her wine, sadly, and does not look you in the eye.>', 111763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A secret order?', 'A secret order?', 111762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Tyr\'s Guard. We are a secret order of paladins that have been guarding a great secret for a very long time. Unfortunately current events have caused us to end our secrecy.', '', 111761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are with you, champion. Let us end this beast!', '', 111760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you desire, I can take you back to your city in the sky. I will return later for Galford\'s remains.', 111759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will help if I must. You\'ve concentrated so much power into that staff - I worry what will become of you!', 111758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that the spy left their cape in the palace before coming here.', 'I heard that the spy left their cape in the palace before coming here.', 111757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy dislikes capes and refuses to wear one.', 'I heard the spy dislikes capes and refuses to wear one.', 111756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<A shadowy figure sits peacefully in the park, like a half-forgotten memory of a long-dead figure from the past. She seems to recognize your staff and greets you warmly, believing you to be someone else.>$b$bHello Alodi, old friend! Join me, would you? One of life\'s most sublime pleasures is sitting in a park with a familiar old book.$b$bI think I shall plant a sapling here, so that in the years to come mages can sit beneath the shade of a small tree.', 111755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone mentioned the spy came in earlier wearing a cape.', 'Someone mentioned the spy came in earlier wearing a cape.', 111754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy enjoys wearing capes.', 'I heard the spy enjoys wearing capes.', 111753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone told me the spy hates wearing long sleeves.', 'Someone told me the spy hates wearing long sleeves.', 111752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend of mine said she saw the outfit the spy was wearing. It did not have long sleeves.', 'A friend of mine said she saw the outfit the spy was wearing. It did not have long sleeves.', 111751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy wears short sleeves to keep their arms unencumbered.', 'I heard the spy wears short sleeves to keep their arms unencumbered.', 111750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy enjoys the cool air and is not wearing long sleeves tonight.', 'I heard the spy enjoys the cool air and is not wearing long sleeves tonight.', 111749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone said the spy is covering up their arms with long sleeves tonight.', 'Someone said the spy is covering up their arms with long sleeves tonight.', 111748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend of mine mentioned the spy has long sleeves on.', 'A friend of mine mentioned the spy has long sleeves on.', 111747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just barely caught a glimpse of the spy\'s long sleeves earlier in the evening.', 'I just barely caught a glimpse of the spy\'s long sleeves earlier in the evening.', 111746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy\'s outfit has long sleeves tonight.', 'I heard the spy\'s outfit has long sleeves tonight.', 111745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy is not carrying any green potions.', 'I heard the spy is not carrying any green potions.', 111744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A musician told me she saw the spy throw away their last potion and no longer has any left.', 'A musician told me she saw the spy throw away their last potion and no longer has any left.', 111743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These lamps guided me to this place. I only hope the path on my return is safe...', 111742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Turn this great power against the foes of Tirisfal!', '', 111741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend said the spy loves gold and a belt pouch filled with it.', 'A friend said the spy loves gold and a belt pouch filled with it.', 111740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy\'s belt pouch is filled with gold to show off extravagance.', 'I heard the spy\'s belt pouch is filled with gold to show off extravagance.', 111739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy always has a book of written secrets at the belt.', 'I heard the spy always has a book of written secrets at the belt.', 111738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumor has is the spy loves to read and always carries around at least one book.', 'Rumor has is the spy loves to read and always carries around at least one book.', 111737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A friend of mine managed to steal a pink potion off the belt of the spy earlier. Wherever the spy is now, he or she definitely does not have any pink potions!', 'A friend of mine managed to steal a pink potion off the belt of the spy earlier. Wherever the spy is now, he or she definitely does not have any pink potions!', 111736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy is not carrying any potions around.', 'I heard the spy is not carrying any potions around.', 111735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy\'s belt pouch is lined with fancy threading.', 'I heard the spy\'s belt pouch is lined with fancy threading.', 111734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy carries a magical pouch around at all times.', 'I heard the spy carries a magical pouch around at all times.', 111733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Tyr!', '', 111732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is the spark. Take it and flee! Keep the memory of my fallen friend alive.', '', 111731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loken\'s enchantment won\'t let me die. We have only a moment before I fall into madness again.', '', 111730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain! It frees my mind of the curse... for the moment.', '', 111729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are strong! Perhaps you can end my unceasing vigil.', '', 111728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You leave me no choice! I must destroy you!', '', 111727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pretty sure the spy has potions at the belt.', 'I\'m pretty sure the spy has potions at the belt.', 111726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy brought along potions, I wonder why?', 'I heard the spy brought along potions, I wonder why?', 111725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone told me the spy arrived carrying a green flask of some sort. I wonder what that would be for?', 'Someone told me the spy arrived carrying a green flask of some sort. I wonder what that would be for?', 111724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I saw the spy with a green potion on the belt.', 'I think I saw the spy with a green potion on the belt.', 111723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy brought along some potions... just in case.', 'I heard the spy brought along some potions... just in case.', 111722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t tell you this... but the spy is masquerading as an alchemist and carrying potions at the belt.', 'I didn\'t tell you this... but the spy is masquerading as an alchemist and carrying potions at the belt.', 111721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy avoids having gloves on, in case some quick actions are needed.', 'I heard the spy avoids having gloves on, in case some quick actions are needed.', 111720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know... I found an extra pair of gloves in the back room. The spy is likely to be bare handed somewhere around here.', 'You know... I found an extra pair of gloves in the back room. The spy is likely to be bare handed somewhere around here.', 111719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a rumor that the spy never has gloves on.', 'There\'s a rumor that the spy never has gloves on.', 111718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy dislikes wearing gloves.', 'I heard the spy dislikes wearing gloves.', 111717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy carefully hides their hands.', 'I heard the spy carefully hides their hands.', 111716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a rumor that the spy always wears gloves.', 'There\'s a rumor that the spy always wears gloves.', 111715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone said the spy wears gloves to cover obvious scars.', 'Someone said the spy wears gloves to cover obvious scars.', 111714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy always dons gloves.', 'I heard the spy always dons gloves.', 111713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy definitely prefers darker clothing.', 'The spy definitely prefers darker clothing.', 111712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumor has it the spy is avoiding light colored clothing to try and blend in more.', 'Rumor has it the spy is avoiding light colored clothing to try and blend in more.', 111711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy\'s vest is a dark, rich shade this very night.', 'I heard the spy\'s vest is a dark, rich shade this very night.', 111710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy enjoys darker colored vests... like the night.', 'The spy enjoys darker colored vests... like the night.', 111709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People are saying the spy is not wearing a darker vest tonight.', 'People are saying the spy is not wearing a darker vest tonight.', 111708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I overheard the spy saying dark vests clash horridly with silver hair and to never be caught in one.', 'I overheard the spy saying dark vests clash horridly with silver hair and to never be caught in one.', 111707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spy definitely prefers the style of light colored vests.', 'The spy definitely prefers the style of light colored vests.', 111706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that the spy is wearing a lighter vest to tonight\'s party.', 'I heard that the spy is wearing a lighter vest to tonight\'s party.', 111705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear some woman has been constantly asking about the district...', 'I hear some woman has been constantly asking about the district...', 111704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A guest saw both her and Elisande arrive together earlier.', 'A guest saw both her and Elisande arrive together earlier.', 111703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone\'s been saying that our new guest isn\'t male.', 'Someone\'s been saying that our new guest isn\'t male.', 111702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say that the spy is here and she\'s quite the sight to behold.', 'They say that the spy is here and she\'s quite the sight to behold.', 111701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the musicians said he would not stop asking questions about the district.', 'One of the musicians said he would not stop asking questions about the district.', 111700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A guest said she saw him entering the manor alongside the Grand Magistrix.', 'A guest said she saw him entering the manor alongside the Grand Magistrix.', 111699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard somewhere that the spy isn\'t female.', 'I heard somewhere that the spy isn\'t female.', 111698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see all those demons outside? They are keeping an eye on us! There\'s a spy in here somewhere, I just know it.', 'Did you see all those demons outside? They are keeping an eye on us! There\'s a spy in here somewhere, I just know it.', 111697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out there. There\'s a rumor the Burning Legion snuck a spy into the party.', 'Be careful out there. There\'s a rumor the Burning Legion snuck a spy into the party.', 111696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rumor about someone new to the party? I heard it\'s a member of the Burning Legion keeping tabs on us!', 'A rumor about someone new to the party? I heard it\'s a member of the Burning Legion keeping tabs on us!', 111695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How exciting! There\'s supposedly a mystery guest out and about! Wait, what? A spy you say...', 'How exciting! There\'s supposedly a mystery guest out and about! Wait, what? A spy you say...', 111694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some are saying there\'s a member of the Burning Legion attending this party incognito...', 'Some are saying there\'s a member of the Burning Legion attending this party incognito...', 111693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The one that Elisande invited to the party? Now I didn\'t say this, but that one is really a spy for the Burning Legion.', 'The one that Elisande invited to the party? Now I didn\'t say this, but that one is really a spy for the Burning Legion.', 111692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, now I\'ve heard a juicy rumor about the party. I heard there\'s a Burning Legion spy here, making sure we\'re still loyal!', 'Hmm, now I\'ve heard a juicy rumor about the party. I heard there\'s a Burning Legion spy here, making sure we\'re still loyal!', 111691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems like there are some new faces here at tonight\'s party...', 'It seems like there are some new faces here at tonight\'s party...', 111690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the spy is here and he\'s very good looking.', 'I heard the spy is here and he\'s very good looking.', 111689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You see a great blue dragon, resting languidly atop the greenhouse. She seems to be a memory from your staff, Ebonchill, and not part of this world. To your surprise, the mighty creature turns to face you, speaking slowly:>$b$bThe great Alodi returns, seeking ever more power. Tell me, mage, has the Council considered the impact of granting so much magical energy to a single mortal, hmmmm?$b$bAnd what if their beloved Guardian should ever betray them?$b$bI will be watching you...', '', 111688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are currently on good terms with our northerly neighbors, but should our friendship wither, it can\'t hurt to know how they fight.', '', 111687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Is that... a dragon, languidly resting atop the greenhouse? The creature is there, and simultaneously not. She seems to be a memory from your staff, Ebonchill, and not part of this world. A draconic advisor from a forgotten time.>', '', 111686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lastly, I\'d like to brush up on dragons. Blue dragons, to be precise.', '', 111685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find me a book on skrogs. Anything will do.', '', 111684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, I\'m afraid that our library suffers a scarcity of information on these creatures.', '', 111683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, a more pressing concern to our academy is the constant encroachment of the skrogs.', '', 111682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating.', '', 111681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fetch me a secondary reference on kobolds. I\'d like to verify this hypothesis.', '', 111680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just read an interesting paper on the lowly kobold. Apparently, these creatures are more fierce than their visual affordance might suggest.', '', 111679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all I\'ve got, old friend. The Legion won\'t know what hit \'em!', '', 111678, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The gnome flickers in the corner of your consciousness, a half-remembered shade from another time. His face lights up when he sees the staff in your hands.>\n\nIs it time, Alodi? Is your staff ready?', '', 111677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A just cause. I shall stand with you against the might of Jotun, $n. Be ready!', 111676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Galford was the bearer of a spark of Tyr\'s essence. It seems Jotun killed him and took it. I need the spark to claim Tyr\'s warhammer.', 'Galford was the bearer of a spark of Tyr\'s essence. It seems Jotun killed him and took it. I need the spark to claim Tyr\'s warhammer.', 111675, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me what is going on. What is it you seek, $n?', 111674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this essence the giant speaks of? I would have words with you, $n.', 111673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place! Loken\'s curse compels me to slay the allies of Tyr. Until he comes to collect Tyr\'s spark, I must defend it!', '', 111672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am truly sorry. It looks as though your friend was crushed. What could have...', 111671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, mage. I will do as you ask... but please, be careful. No mortal has ever possessed such power.', '', 111670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I seek the wisdom of the council.', 'I seek the wisdom of the council.', 111669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalyssra! Are you alright?', 111668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such confusion... such rage...', 111667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A ghostly figure rests on the stairway, a half-remembered shade from another time. He recognizes the staff you carry and nods towards you, grimly.>\n\nYou haven\'t changed your mind, Alodi? It doesn\'t trouble you that we\'re pouring all of our energy into that staff of yours?', '', 111666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unnngh...', '', 111665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This hunger... this fear...', 111664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The day he was exiled...', 111663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I, too have felt it...', 111662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RrrggaaAAHHGGHH!! RAAGGGHH!', '', 111661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been looking all over for you. Have you found... Oh, no...', 111660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrgghhh...', '', 111659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nar\'thala vas manari...', 111655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', '', 111654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The shadowy figure glimmers in the corner of your eye like a shade from a forgotten time. He does not react to your presence.>', '<The shadowy figure glimmers in the corner of your eye like a shade from a forgotten time. She does not react to your presence.>', 111653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thalyssra, you cannot be serious? Wasting your time on this... creature!', 111650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Understood.', 111648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us begin. Come along, Theryn.', 111647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Say no more.', 111644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. This illness is magical in nature. You were right to summon me, Ravandwyr.', '', 111643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67640, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, thank you for coming so quickly! He is declining rapidly!', '', 111642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67639, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The owl hoots at dusk.', 'The owl hoots at dusk.', 111641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saber prowls the plaza.', 'The saber prowls the plaza.', 111640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cruel caskmaster has breathed his last.', 'The cruel caskmaster has breathed his last.', 111639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 111638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something you require?', '', 111637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail.', 111636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_spider.blp:20|t %s calls for |cFFF00000|Hspell:212364|h[Feeding Time]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_spider.blp:20|t %s calls for |cFFF00000|Hspell:212364|h[Feeding Time]|h|r.', 111635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your friend sought out Jotun, but the Spark did not warn him of the cruel curse with which Loken twisted the watcher\'s mind. The paladin rushed to the chasm south of here, only to meet his doom.', 111634, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve perfected my murloc mindmeld technique over many years.', '', 111633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl coughs and retches violently.', '', 111632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I think I will. Thank you for taking over for me, $n.', '', 111631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71755, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A silver hand was forged by Jotun, Tyr\'s dearest friend for many ages. When Tyr found proof of Loken\'s betrayal, it was Jotun who stayed behind to hold off the fallen watcher\'s pursuit.', 111630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl, please get some rest! $n, I hope to see you in Azsuna shortly.', '', 111629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67638, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are much discussed amongst the Kirin Tor, $n. I look forward to seeing you in action!', '', 111628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been hearing great things about you, $n.', '', 111627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel as if I know you from somewhere, $n...', '', 111626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t sound so good.', '', 111624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Perhaps you should get some rest, Meryl.', '', 111623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67636, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think that cough is getting worse.', '', 111622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67635, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eviscerate the bourgeoisie!', 'Eviscerate the bourgeoisie!', 111621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lotus shall bloom once more!', 'The Lotus shall bloom once more!', 111620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live the Resistance!', 'Long live the Resistance!', 111619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meryl clears his throat and coughs.', '', 111618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion is attacking Azeroth once again. The world is in chaos, but Deepholm faces a more urgent threat.$b$bI cannot go hunting jackals while wolves snarl at my doorstep!', 111617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like Furlbrow\'s needs some help! Send ground forces immediately!', 'Looks like Furlbrow\'s needs some help! Send ground forces immediately!', 111616, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve scouted another camp down here along the coast! It\'s a big one!', 'We\'ve scouted another camp down here along the coast! It\'s a big one!', 111615, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\warrior_talent_icon_thunderstruck:20|t Nithogg unleashes a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:212841|h[Crackling Jolt]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\warrior_talent_icon_thunderstruck:20|t Nithogg unleashes a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:212841|h[Craclkling Jolt]|h|r!', 111614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexston\'s been overrun as well! We\'ve taken shelter in the barn!', '', 111613, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen Ring stands with you as well, my friend.', '', 111612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is still much to do. Advisor Sevel is waiting for you. He is making preparations for the coming battle against the Burning Legion.', '', 111611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, Farseer, as Champion of The Elements and bring defeat to the Burning Legion!', '', 111610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agh!! Make them stop! Please make them stop!', 111608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Begin the spell.', 'I am ready. Begin the spell.', 111604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As have I. He has been quite preoccupied of late.', '', 111603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68873, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ansirem, I have been following $n for some time now and these are not spurious charges. I too observed Archmage Vargoth behaving oddly.', '', 111602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop following me!', 111601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
