('I\'ve fought with the best.', '', 111422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all have to pull together in this.', '', 111421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you ask of me?', '', 111420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on.', '', 111419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never give in.', '', 111418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not lose hope.', '', 111417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must fight together or we will perish alone.', '', 111416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always knew this day would come.', '', 111415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news?', '', 111414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will stop at nothing.', '', 111413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our darkest hour.', '', 111412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_dragonhawk.blp:20|t Elerethe begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:212707|h[Gathering Clouds]|h|r and prepares to fly to another platform!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_dragonhawk.blp:20|t Elerethe begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:212707|h[Gathering Clouds]|h|r and prepares to fly to another platform!', 111411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull me finger! Okay no wait - no pull this one. Ahh, okay wait wait - no - come back later we try again.', '', 111410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buh-bye.', '', 111409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We done? Okie-dook.', '', 111408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take off.', '', 111407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it jookin\'?', '', 111406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you need?', '', 111405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where we goin\'?', '', 111404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! You\'re the one they sent? Good luck...', 111403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion must be stopped, and I will do everything in my power to make it so. NOTHING is more important than their destruction!', '', 111402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 62459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me teach these things a lesson!', 'Help me teach these things a lesson!', 111401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind lendin\' me a hand o\'er here?', 'Mind lendin\' me a hand o\'er here?', 111400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should slaughter them before they have the chance.', 111399, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The twins are helping Mephistroth build an army. They intend to attack Dreadscar, and steal the Felblood Altar.', 111398, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Sacrolash and her sister, Alythess. They are responsible for this foul magic that infects my blood.', 111397, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are improving. Keep practicing.', 'You are improving. Keep practicing.', 111396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Let\'s see that new spell again, conjuror.', 'Let\'s see that new spell again, conjuror.', 111395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Outpost at Moonbrook! We\'re under attack! Moonbrook\'s been overrun!', '', 111394, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kindness will not be forgotten.', 'Your kindness will not be forgotten.', 111393, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are very brave, $n. Be safe.', 'You are very brave, $n. Be safe.', 111392, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we are stronger.', 'Together we are stronger.', 111391, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War brings us together. We must fight as one.', 'War brings us together. We must fight as one.', 111390, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', 'Over here!', 111389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, if you could!', 'Please, if you could!', 111388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! It\'s not safe out here.', 'Be careful! It\'s not safe out here.', 111387, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be safe, $n!', 'Be safe, $n!', 111386, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I fight by your side, brave $r?', 'May I fight by your side, brave $r?', 111385, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements will guide us, $n.', 'The elements will guide us, $n.', 111384, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those foul demons... I wasn\'t ready.', 'Those foul demons... I wasn\'t ready.', 111383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness_nightmare:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:212726|h[Forces of Nightmare]|h|r!', '', 111382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My precious children! I will devour you!', '', 111381, 0, 0, 589, 64, 0, 67069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mortal seeks to awaken the cursed weapon! Devour the shaman, my children!', '', 111380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye of Il\'gynoth is creating a Nightmare Horror!', 'The Eye of Il\'hynoth is creating a Nightmare Horror!', 111379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills serve our people well during these times. Perhaps we shall meet again.', 'Your skills serve our people well during these times. Perhaps we shall meet again.', 111378, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate your kindness, but as long as the skies remain dark, I must remain vigilant.', 'I appreciate your kindness, but as long as the skies remain dark, I must remain vigilant.', 111377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pledge my service to you.', 'I pledge my service to you.', 111376, 7, 0, 16, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us reclaim our lands together!', 'Let us reclaim our lands together!', 111375, 7, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$GSir : Madam;! I\'d hate to be a burden, but would you mind?', '$GSir : Madam;! I\'d hate to be a burden, but would you mind?', 111374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNUSED No! I have failed...', '', 111373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful what you wish for...', '', 111372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well. What have we here? A thief?', '', 111371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet I still crave more. Your soul will do nicely!', '', 111370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, much better. I have all the power I could want.', '', 111369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so that is the key. MORE! MORE!', '', 111368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much power! I can handle it! I can take more!', '', 111367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready, assistant. I shall begin drawing power from the ship\'s stores.', '', 111366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you have need, call us on the field of battle. Together, we will protect this world!', 111365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me on the other side of this portal. I must prepare for the ritual there.', '', 111364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me?', 'Can you help me?', 111363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ysera left me in charge of defending the Dream. My brethren and I have been patrolling this realm for eons.$B$BWe will lend our power to this fight.', 111361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see! You are the one I was waiting for. All I need is a full boat and I\'ll be on my way.', 111360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you can manage better than our last wine thief, rest his soul.', 111358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need a ride, stranger?', 111357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! This cask contains a large amount of arcwine. Go ahead and put it into the gondola.', 111356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a cask of wine!', 'I found a cask of wine!', 111355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need a ride?', 111354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... the Illidari. And, the Burning Legion is here, too.', '', 111336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathtaking. Imagine all of the arcane knowledge lost to the ages here.', '', 111335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOM!', '', 111331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, come on!', '', 111330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re cheating!', '', 111329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, Zoom!', '', 111328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get \'em Zoom!', '', 111327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zoom is best!', '', 111326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I choose you to fight with me.', 'I choose you to fight with me.', 111324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wouldn\'t miss dis final fight, $n. I will leap inta battle in my feral form. Choose me and I will fight bravely.', 111323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings $n. I am glad to lend my aid to the fight.$B$BIf you wish me to accompany you, I will restore your health and help keep you alive.', 111322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi $n! I think it\'s time for those nasty nightmare demons to scram! If you choose me to help you, I\'ll call upon the balance of nature to smite our enemies!', 111321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring the ferocity of the bear to battle!$B$BI can taunt enemies, if you will attack them and heal me.', '', 111320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed: 300x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 'Feed: 300x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 111319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Theryn seems entranced.>', '', 111318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well, he hasn\'t really been the same lately. Arguing with himself, being more secretive, ignoring ceremonies. I think the stress of this investigation just got to him. I hope he\'s alright.', '', 111317, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power... I can control it. Yes! I need it all!', '', 111316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace? What was wrong?', 'Peace? What was wrong?', 111315, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, he left in quite a hurry. After dealing with the accusations against Benedictus, he decided to go investigate the matter personally. Hopefully he will find some peace on his mission.', '', 111314, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bishop Farthing has left too?', 'Bishop Farthing has left too?', 111313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?$b$bIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus or Bishop Farthing, they have both gone on missions.', '', 111312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies shall burn.', '', 111311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two more demons heading for the Hill! Ready at the gates!', '', 111309, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the gods... some kind of structure southeast of the Hill! It just appeared out of nowhere!', 111308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do what I can for Senegos, but I urge you to be quick about your business, $n. I fear that he might not survive much longer.\n\nMatters elsewhere call for my attention, and I must depart soon. However, I will return as soon as I am able.', '', 111307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supply camp as well... we\'re getting bombarded out here!', 'Supply camp as well... we\'re getting bombarded out here!', 111306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $c. Are you interested in enchantments, or are you here to help against the naga?', 111305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of your interference! DIE!', '', 111304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t hold them off!', '', 111303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our farm! Please! Somebody hurry!', '', 111302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have fulfilled your end of the bargain. As promised, I give you a taste of the Legion\'s power. Earn more by proving your strength!', '', 111301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well well, the little elf returns. You are most... persistent.', '', 111300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom! The feeling is sweet, but Mephistroth\'s magic has diminished my power. Let\'s depart this place before the dreadlord is able to return.', '', 111299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, not that! We work faster!', '', 111297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jump to remove effects of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:182815|h[Stoneblood Poison]|h|r.', 111296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to learn any of my enchantments, you need only ask. And bring me some materials.', 111295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take up the Scepter, shaman. You have earned it.', '', 111294, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 60709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her power over the waters here is absolute. We must be cautious.', '', 111293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to see what enchantments you have available.', 'I would like to see what enchantments you have available.', 111292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Zithreen is in the throne room beyond.', 111291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are we not firing yet? Work faster, or face the lash!', '', 111290, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You use the Scepter to curse and destroy. In our hands, it will cleanse and heal!', '', 111289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your cause is hopeless, sea witch! No matter how you bend the elements to your will, they will never truly serve you.', '', 111288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While I still no longer possess a physical body, I feel alive again having my enchanting rod back in my possession.$b$bIf you wish to learn any of my enchantments, you only need to bring some materials as trade.', 111286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sharas\'dal is mine, for the glory of my queen alone!', 111285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be crushed beneath the waves.', 111284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The seas will devour you!', 111283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I used to be a great enchanter once, before I fell. Now my spirit is bound to my home.$b$bIf only I could have my enchanting rod back...', 111282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This realm belongs to Azshara now, shaman. How fitting that the Earthen Ring will be swept away by the sea!', 111281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has dominion of the waters of Azeroth, the very stuff of life. In the right hands, it could be a font of healing instead of corruption.', '', 111280, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it dangerous?', 111279, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 60672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sharas\'dal, the Scepter of Tides, is steeped in Legend. Through its power, Azshara enabled her followers to live in the sea.', '', 111278, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('During the Cataclysm, I spent many terrible weeks as a prisoner in the Abyssal Maw. I have no desire to return there, but I know the place well.', '', 111277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for something specific?', '', 111276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you! I will not give in!', '', 111275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the forsaken.', 'My life for the forsaken.', 111274, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spit on you!', 'I spit on you!', 111273, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrrghhh!', '', 111272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live the Banshee Queen!', 'Long live the Banshee Queen!', 111271, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A curse upon you and yours!', 'A curse upon you and yours!', 111270, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Lady will prevail.', 'The Dark Lady will prevail.', 111269, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no honor, $c.', 'You have no honor, $c.', 111268, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coward!', 'Coward!', 111267, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance scum!', 'Alliance scum!', 111266, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think I would stand idle as you clawed your way through my minions? Listen, mortal, as the treasure you fight so hard to obtain is broken to my will!', '', 111265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer is not merely a weapon. It is a symbol. A symbol of hope, of power... Proof that an individual can change the world.', '', 111260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember the night Orgrim fell, run through by a knight\'s lance during the liberation of the last orc internment camp. As he bled out onto the fields of Arathi, he bestowed the Doomhammer to me.', '', 111259, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I see.$b$bI\'d like you to do something for me, $n. Take this enchanted pen and paper and survey archaeological digsites so that my pen may make notes of your process.$b$bReturn to me when you\'re finished and bring me back anything you find.$b$bIf you don\'t already know how to survey, just talk to Dariness, I\'m sure she can fill you in again on the finer points of being an archaeologist.', '', 111258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the imposter, shaman! Bring me his heart!', '', 111256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your champions crumble, Pyroth!', '', 111255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mortals do my bidding. A pity you do not share their enthusiasm!', '', 111254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 111253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', '', 111252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you!', 111251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slain by a mortal? It cannot be...', '', 111250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare oppose the son of Rhyolith? You will be destroyed!', '', 111249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You approach your demise, shaman. Turn back while you still live!', '', 111248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spoken with Dariness and here\'s what she was trying to say...', 'I\'ve spoken with Dariness and here\'s what she was trying to say...', 111247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chargore... my champion! You will pay, mortal!', '', 111246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you so weak, Lord Smolderon, that you require the help of mortals?', '', 111245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Duty calls!', 111243, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like this is gonna be a long day!', 111242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today just isn\'t your day!', 111241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re messin\' with the wrong girl!', 111240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like somebody\'s really askin\' for it! Lemme at \'em!', 111239, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you back in the Hall of the Guardian. Esara, you are welcome to join us there.', '', 111238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67634, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t strike me as the archaeology type. You see, surveying an area can be quite time consuming.$b$bYou have to place down your equipment, which is some work, then study the results and then try to move closer to where you believe the fragment may exist.$b$bAll I was asking for was something to speed up that process. But apparently my explaining of our process to Nalthanis was just too much for him to listen to.$b$bPerhaps you can explain it better to him than I can.', 111236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well as you know, surveying an area can be quite time consuming.$b$bYou have to place down your equipment, which is some work, then study the results and then try to move closer to where you believe the fragment may exist.$b$bAll I was asking for was something to speed up that process. But apparently my explaining of our process to Nalthanis was just too much for him to listen to.$b$bPerhaps you can explain it better to him than I can.', 111235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came to speak to you about your needs for archaeology gathering.', 'I came to speak to you about your needs for archaeology gathering.', 111234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! I thought I was a goner. Thank you!', 'Whew! I thought I was a goner. Thank you!', 111233, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The patient is bleeding profusely from a large wound. If you know how to stabilize the wound, you\'ll know how to treat him.>', '<The patient is bleeding profusely from a large wound. If you know how to stabilize the wound, you\'ll know how to treat him.>', 111232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back you beasts!', 'Get back you beasts!', 111229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh, hmm... what? Afraid? Hah!$B$BListen here, bub. I\'ve seen fighters come and go. A few demons don\'t scare me. Besides, somebody\'s gotta survive long enough to keep this thing runnin\'. Might as well be me.$B$BMoney ain\'t gonna make itself.', '', 111226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t belong here! I\'m no fighter! I just make things!', '', 111212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye. You go on ahead, dear. We\'ll be along soon.', 111211, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 66846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should return to the Heart of Azeroth, Farseer. There is still much to be done.', '', 111208, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Stonemother.', '', 111201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 67060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earthen Ring is deeply grateful, Stonemother.', '', 111199, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Suffering from a fever. If you know how to treat a fever, you\'ll know how to heal him.>', '<Suffering from a fever. If you know how to treat a fever, you\'ll know how to heal her.>', 111198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect the Earthen Ring, Avalanchion. Pave the ground with the corpses of the Burning Legion!', 111196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a symbol of our alliance, I will bestow upon you one of my greatest warriors.', 111195, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Stonemother always pays her debts.', 111194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Earthen Ring has done a great service to Deepholm. We will return the favor.', 111193, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning: The skies are not safe! Ground yourself immediately!', 'Warning: The skies are not safe! Ground yourself immediately!', 111188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though he was once Thorignir, Nithogg\'s madness was a blight on this land. You have done a great deed today, outsider.', '', 111187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nithogg terrorizes Stormheim from his roost atop the sundered peak, Nastrondir. His continued existence is an affront to the legacy of the Thorgnir. End it.', '', 111186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Subtlety flash your insignia.>', '<Subtlety flash your insignia.>', 111185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you would find our rare ore reserves in the back room more to your liking.', '', 111184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can find any tool... for the right price.', '', 111181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, champion! The sanctity of this place is preserved thanks to your help.', 111179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These wretches defile our sacred ground collecting souls for their cursed queen! Finish them!', 111177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s unfortunate that affairs have come to this, but what are we going to do? Wait for them to come slaughter us in our sleep and go out of business?', '', 111167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will see you on the other side in Nordrassil, Archdruid.', '', 111166, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord of the tides curse you, $r!', '', 111165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! It\'s mine. You can\'t have it!', '', 111164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunwell, once a perennial fount of arcane power, now channels the Holy Light... providing hope that the Sin\'dorei, under the leadership of Lor\'themar Theron, may at last be on the road to overcoming their magical addiction. Though the blood elves aided in both the defeat of the Iron Horde and the battle against Garrosh, their once-possible future with the Alliance has been cast into doubt. As the blood elves face a turbulent and uncertain future, you must remain ready to defend what remains of your once-mighty civilization, and redeem the embattled soul of your people.', '', 111163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inspired leadership of High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind has brought prosperity and stability to the night elf people. Also, with the help of Archdruid Malfurion Stormrage, nature throughout Hyjal has flourished in the aftermath of the Cataclysm\'s widespread destruction. The formerly corrupted, mighty World Tree Teldrassil continues to heal, rejuvenating the spirits of the embattled night elves... and ancient demigods roam the world anew. All is not peaceful, however, in the misty boughs of Teldrassil. The reawakened demigods sense that old enemies will reemerge, bringing with them a terrible doom. Now, as your people have done so many times before, you must stand ready to pull Azeroth back from the brink of oblivion.', '', 111162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the bold leadership of Lady Sylvanas, the Forsaken have once again attained a position of strength among the warring factions of Azeroth. Bolstered by the dark and powerful magics of her Val\'kyr, Sylvanas has replenished her ranks and once again created a safe harbor for her people in the capital of Undercity. However, shadows from the past still haunt the undead queen. Traitorous plots carried out by agents under her command, such as the betrayal at the Wrath Gate, continue to cast fear and doubt on the Forsaken\'s allegiance to the Horde. As a dedicated member of Sylvanas\' undead army, it will fall to you to help prove the Forsaken\'s loyalty, and to slay anyone who would dare threaten her rule.', '', 111161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('but now, Magni Bronzebeard has returned from his crystal prison. All is not well, however, as the dwarven king bears grim tidings of a dark and uncertain future. It is unclear how this ominous prophecy will affect both the council\'s accord and the destiny of the dwarves. What is clear is that you must do all within your power to protect your people in these perilous and unpredictable times.', '', 111160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stalwart king of the Dwarves, Magni Bronzebeard, was taken from his people when a terrible curse fused his physical form into the diamond heart of the dwarven capital of Ironforge. To avert civil war in the king\'s absence, the dwarves created a council of three hammers that would share power amongst the feuding clans. Over time this coalition has maintained a tenuous stability...', '', 111159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am NOT cut out for this!', '', 111158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having served as vanguard in the Alliance\'s campaign against the ruthless Iron Horde, the human nation of Stormwind has once again risen to preeminence. After successfully invading Orgrimmar and bringing justice to the infamous warchief Garrosh Hellscream, High King Varian Wrynn has vowed that the world of Azeroth must never again fall prey to tyranny. Now, as dark clouds loom on the horizon and tensions between the humans and their long-time enemy the Horde begin to rise, the Alliance must once again serve as an example to those who would fight for righteousness. As the storm draws near, it falls to you to uphold the honor of humanity.', '', 111157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exiled years ago from their lands in Stanglethorn Vale, the Darkspear attempted to make a new life for themselves amongst the disparate races of the Horde. The crimes and treachery of warchief Garrosh Hellscream, however, devastated all possibilities of unity within the Horde. With the defeat of Garrosh, the cunning and resourceful trolls have once again embraced the promise of a more hopeful future under the keen leadership of Vol\'jin. And though a renewed threat of attack from the renegade Zandalari tribe looms large, Vol\'jin strives for a day when all trolls stand reunited. Now, it is up to courageous young trolls like you to help ensure that Vol\'ljin\'s bold vision of unity becomes a reality.', '', 111156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our methods may be unorthodox to some, but the powers we have mastered are priceless.', 'Our methods may be unorthodox to some, but the powers we have mastered are priceless.', 111155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although the defeat of former warchief Garrosh Hellscream speaks to a brighter future for the tauren, the mantle of leadership weighs heavily on the shoulders of Baine Bloodhoof. It is his belief that the tauren encompass the heart of the Horde, but he is concerned that in the wake of Garrosh\'s disastrous reign, the tauren have lost both vision and purpose. Now, it is up to brave tauren like you to safeguard the lands of your ancestors, and to restore both honor and greatness to your tribe, and... to the Horde.', '', 111154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the aftermath of their campaign against the vicious Iron Horde, the mighty orcs of Durotar have now set their sights on the future. Striving to put the dark legacy of its former warchief, Garrosh Hellscream behind it, the Horde now looks to a new leader, the wise and courageous troll, Vol\'jin. Though Garrosh\'s atrocities have caused tensions to rise once again between the Horde and its perennial enemy, the Alliance, it is up to orcs like you to forge a path to redemption, and to reclaim the former glory of the Horde.', '', 111153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Empyrean Society of Exotic Magical Arts is always willing to accept new members. You should join us before it is too late.', 'The Empyrean Society of Exotic Magical Arts is always willing to accept new members. You should join us before it is too late.', 111152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep all of this between you and me, $c. As they say, loose lips sink ships.', 111151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowsong had one last favor to ask of Huln: Defeat the lord of the Nathrezim, Tichondrius. With his defeat, the attack on Azshara would fail and balance could be restored.', '', 111150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jarod Shadowsong awaited Huln\'s arrival in the battlefield below. He had a special task for Highmountain while organizing and commanding his troops.', '', 111149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion worked to bring reinforcements from a verdant realm beyond the borders of physical creation. He needed protection while performing the final magical incantations.', '', 111148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion Stormrage eagerly awaited the arrival of Huln and his tauren reinforcements. Krasus--also known as the dragon Korialstrasz--aided their efforts from the sky.', '', 111147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln sought Eche\'ro, a beast injured in combat with many demons.', '', 111146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I\'ll be in the shop \'til this blows over.', '', 111144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no heroes in oblivion!', '', 111141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall oppose the Twilight\'s Hammer!', '', 111140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the harbingers of destruction!', '', 111139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cry for help... none shall answer you!', '', 111138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The twilight is upon you!', '', 111137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall withstand the power of our master!', '', 111136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your destruction!', '', 111135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will kneel before our master!', '', 111134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I said, I will see to it that Lord Greymane gets this information. There is no need for you to mention this to anyone else, $c.', '', 111133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna stomp you REAL good!', '', 111132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna seperate your HEAD from your BODY! BWAHAHA!', '', 111131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BWAHAHA! I needed a few more scars on my face!', '', 111130, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are next!', '', 111129, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I wouldn\'t give to wrangle me one of those demons. Talk about a money maker!', '', 111128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna break you, like I break your friend!', '', 111127, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marlan must evaluate your gift before I can speak with you further. Farewell.', 'Marlan must evaluate your gift before I can speak with you further. Farewell.', 111126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show the Illidari they have an ally in Nar\'thalas. Free them and take the fight to their demon captors!', '', 111125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It the end of the world... and I feel fine! HAHA!', '', 111124, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna stop the hammer? I don\'t think so!', '', 111123, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me gonna crush you so hard!', '', 111122, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga will not wait long before turning the Tidestone against us. We should make haste.', '', 111119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go. Destroy the Twilight\'s Hammer and you shall win my favor!', 111117, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We understand, Stonemother. The Earthen Ring stands by you.', '', 111116, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not fight the Burning Legion while the Twilight\'s Hammer lays siege to Deepholm!', 111115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll do that. See you soon, $n.', 111114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By all means, keep splashing around and attract attention.', '', 111113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trial is currently in progress. You can assist with its completion or wait until the arena is clear to begin another.', '', 111112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step into the arena and we will test your resolve.', '', 111107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use my teleportation pad to exit the workshop. We need to get you to the Temple of Storms before that vrykul arrives!', '', 111104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things need to get back to normal around here. I got a business to run!', '', 111102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello. Have you come to join the Empyrean Society of Exotic Magical Arts?', 111101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your friend is right. We should work together.', 111098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66477, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all bow to her as you once did to me, and carry out her will against the Legion!', '', 111097, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 60302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not to leave a breadcrumb back to us, hero.', '', 111096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right then, I\'m gone.', '', 111095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her exemplary deeds in the name of the Ebon Blade have shown her to be one of the best of us, worthy of our highest honor.', '', 111093, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 60301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it shine, Krinkle!', 'Make it shine, Krinkle!', 111092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a little gloss, a little shine in that armor there, $n? I got what you need!', '', 111091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please sharpen my weapons!', 'Please sharpen my weapons!', 111088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got yer weapons ready there, $G lad:lass;?', '', 111087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now go. Tell your Earthen Ring that the Windseeker lives again.', '', 111084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My warlord... we have... guests...', 111083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fool! You do not understand the forces you tempt!', 111082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So be it. Then you will rot in these halls.', 111081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flee now, and you may yet leave with your fragile lives.', 111080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will find only death here!', 111079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knowledge is but the first step. Only when these tales roar within your heart will you become a hero worthy of our legacy!', '', 111077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throughout the ages, the legends of my stormforged champions have spurred warriors to greatness. Go forth and learn these tales, that you might be so inspired!', '', 111076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These eggs will make a fine present to Vethir. The scars you earned collecting them mark you a true champion. Well done!', '', 111075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek to forge an alliance with Vethir, the mighty drake of Stormheim. Collect a clutch of eggs from my own brood so that I might make a gift of them.', '', 111074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A magnificent battle! Well done, champion.', '', 111073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only by strength in battle can you be measured a champion. Let my stormforged begin your test!', '', 111072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you mortal, Earlnoc will poach these fields no longer.', '', 111071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earlnoc is a misshapen pest! Long has this ettin poached the Fields of the Eternal Hunt. Put an end to his troublemaking!', '', 111070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthfael is a foe worth fighting! Prove your valor! Slay the beast and my reward is yours.', '', 111069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, once more you have proven your valor to me.', '', 111068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I was... supposed to... win...', '', 111067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live... AGAIN!', '', 111066, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 67050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! You are... inferior...', '', 111065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a predictable demise.', '', 111064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Laughable! As if you had a prayer of stopping the ritual...', '', 111063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dealings with this... warlock... are a means to an end.$b$bI wish to learn from this creature, to study it. And if need be, to slay it before it does more harm than good to this world.', '', 111062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be thankful you died fast!', '', 111061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another twig for the kindling!', '', 111060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I know you may be asking yourself why a demon hunter and a warlock are so far out here away from the action.$b$bBut while you are asking yourself that, also ask yourself to be quiet and mind your own business.', '', 111058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never trust a mortal to do a demon\'s work!', '', 111057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think getting past a few power-addled elves means you can stand against a true son of the Legion?', '', 111056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but I suppose we will reward our \"allies\" soon enough. Until then, I\'ll amuse myself by cleaning up their mess!', '', 111055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incompetent mortal filth! These Nightborne can\'t even defend their own palace from invasion! If it were up to me...', '', 111054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show these pretenders how to fight!', '', 111053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Underlings! Get in here!', '', 111052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light has abandoned you!', '', 111051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness your end!', '', 111050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed my hunger, wretch!', '', 111049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic! You\'re putting me to sleep. Here, let me return the favor!', '', 111048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fester and die!', '', 111047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Quickly, shaman! Hand me the blessed blade and Thunderaan will return!', '', 111046, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 66832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $r. You\'ve proven yourself a true ally. I wish you strength in your fight against the evils of this land.', 111045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you friend or foe, $r? If you think yourself a friend of the forest, then prove it. Help drive back the corruption that threatens to take over my home.', 111044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from there!', 111043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Idol... it\'s gone!', '', 111042, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 66759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the shrine, druid. Our help is needed.', '', 111041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry... I can\'t get caught again... sorry... come and find me another time ...', '', 111040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that a guard?', '', 111039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to check out my latest acquisitions?', '', 111037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Give Shinfel the Elixir of Suspension.>', '<Give Shinfel the Elixir of Suspension.>', 111034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, Huey. Easy.', '', 111033, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on! We\'re comin\' in for a landing!', '', 111032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Huey. Let\'s get back to Dalaran!', '', 111031, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was quite an adventure, eh?', '', 111030, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 62556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will begin the preparations for Thunderaan\'s rebirth. Find me when Thunderfury has been recharged!', '', 111029, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in over my head here!', 'I\'m in over my head here!', 111028, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not cut out for this!', 'I\'m not cut out for this!', 111027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lemme at \'em!', 'Lemme at \'em!', 111026, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you could use a little muscle!', 'Looks like you could use a little muscle!', 111025, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could really use some help right about now!', 'I could really use some help right about now!', 111024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! I\'m over here!', 'Here! I\'m over here!', 111023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know anything about the Band of Farondis?', 'Do you know anything about the Band of Farondis?', 111022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic>... Ring of what now?', '', 111021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, I know the ring. I even saw it, as recently as yesterday.$b$bIt\'s not good news, unfortunately. It was among the many trinkets that were stolen away by those horrible murlocs. I was able to dispatch a few of them on their way out, but they made off with plenty of treasure... including that ring.', 111020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeing as I am the prince after whom the ring was named... yes, I suppose I do. It was my ring, once, when such material possessions were of value to me.$b$bIt has long since been stored away, somewhere within the palace. You\'re welcome to ask around for it.', '', 111019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this...?', '', 111018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! Ravandwyr!', 111017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66478, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone save me!', 'Someone save me!', 111016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s getting really hot!', 'It\'s getting really hot!', 111015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', 'Help!', 111014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', 'Thanks!', 111013, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelPyroblast:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206219|h[Liquid Hellfire]|h|r.', '', 111012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treat the patient\'s burns.', 'Treat the patient\'s burns.', 111011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The patient has been severely burned from felfire. If you know how to treat felburn wounds, you\'ll know how to heal the patient.>', '<The patient has been severely burned from felfire. If you know how to treat felburn wounds, you\'ll know how to heal the patient.>', 111010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage Vargoth will hear of this intrusion!', 111007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lovely view up here. Hmm, now that book warrants a closer look.', 111006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66481, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to Dalaran. I\'ll call Huey. No matter how far I go, he manages to find me. Oh, Huey!', '', 111005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen no finer hunter in all my days roaming the wilds. Yer faith is well-placed, Thorim!', '', 111004, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 62634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a fel rune locking that door! The Empyrean Society should not be using such magic!', 111003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66476, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hati\'s noble spirit is forevermore bound to the weapon. He will be a loyal companion to you in the dark times ahead.', '', 111002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this day forth, I charge you to wield Titanstrike against the enemies of creation who would destroy this world.', '', 111001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Beacon is strongly linked to the naaru, having their aid could be exactly what we need to turn the tide! Are you sure?', '', 111000, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Odyn\'s beard! You did it!', '', 110999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This staff has great power that can be used for good, if you have the will to control it. It could also immolate you. Are you sure?', '', 110998, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that this Blade dates back to antiquity, even before the titans! An excellent choice, unless you are reconsidering.', '', 110997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fools still cling to the promises of their false god-king. It is good that you have wounded them so.', '', 110996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Drekirjar continue to enslave and torment my kin. Show them the allies of the Thorignir do not fear their nets and harpoons!', '', 110995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll beg to be put back in a cage when I\'m done with you!', '', 110994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more escapes on my watch!', '', 110993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am impressed, $n. Never have I seen a mage capable of controlling Aluneth.', '', 110992, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy your victory while you can, warlock. This isn\'t over between us. It has only begun!', '', 110991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear me, mortal? Mephistroth imprisoned me at the far side of the valley. Hurry! I sense he is preparing for something... significant.', '', 110990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please return to Azsuna as soon as you can. There is much yet left to do, $n.', '', 110989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I and my people owe you a debt of gratitude that we can never repay.', '', 110988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been ages since I have seen the Tidestone whole, but there it stands.', '', 110987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your persistence will be the death of you! Minions, attack!', '', 110986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kalazzius the Guileful... I have heard the name. He lurks in a cave east of the vale! We\'ll meet you there!', 110980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can think of no one better to hold the Silver Hand, wield it well. Return to Tyrosus and tell him of our success. We will meet again.', '', 110977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though his halls are no more, Tyr is now protected by several tons of stone and water. The prison is buried as well.', '', 110976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies for the hasty retreat! The tomb\'s collapse was triggered by the hammer\'s removal.', '', 110975, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Actually, sister, playtime has only begun!', 110971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... that\'s it, $p. If you bind Hati\'s spirit to your own, you can channel the power back into Titanstrike! You\'ll save Hati and restore the gun!', '', 110970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalazzius does not fear you, druid. Face him if you want your precious idol.', '', 110969, 0, 40030, 0, 64, 0, 68344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Idol is ours, $r. I\'ll never give up its location!', '', 110968, 0, 40030, 0, 64, 0, 68343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We spit on your sacred relics, druid. Now, face me!', '', 110967, 0, 40030, 0, 64, 0, 68347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What your science cannot achieve, this master of beasts can do by instinct alone.', '', 110966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your heart aches at Hati\'s loss, $p, just as mine does. You have a kinship with the spirits of wild creatures greater than any I have seen before.', '', 110965, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, is that Felo\'melorn? THE Felo\'melorn, undying flame of the Sunstriders? The last time I saw that blade, it was in the hands of Prince Kael\'thas, before the third war.', 110964, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Playtime\'s over, mortal!', 110963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even though Hati is a creature of lightning magic, his body can\'t contain such intense power. My science cannot help him. I fear the Thunderspark\'s power is soon to be lost.', '', 110962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Erase everything and try again', 'Erase everything and try again', 110961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is alive, but only barely. It appears this noble companion absorbed Titanstrike\'s energy, protecting us from the explosion.', '', 110960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hati! That poor wolf took the brunt of it. Is he...?', '', 110959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My liege! A strange mage approaches, and $ghe:she; bears the flaming blade of Dath\'Remar Sunstrider.', '$n, I see you have inherited Felo\'melorn. Let us hope it serves you better than it did Prince Kael\'thas.', 110955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know nothing of this idol, foolish druid. I do know that I\'ll have your head!', '', 110954, 0, 40030, 0, 64, 0, 68342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even your sacred shrines are no longer safe from us, druid!', '', 110953, 0, 40030, 0, 64, 0, 68345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF600000<This story doesn\'t seem to be working out so well. It\'s not very steamy, and it\'s definitely not romantic.>|r', '', 110952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His immaculate choice of words had won the princess over. Her hands flew to her chest, as if to stop a beating heart from escaping.$b$b\"Oh, Lord Gravesbane!\" she exclaimed.', '', 110951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek the Idol of the Wild? I will tell you nothing, interloper!', '', 110950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Yikes! Don\'t kill me!\"', '\"Yikes! Don\'t kill me!\"', 110949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"But your majesty... why take my head, when you already have my heart?\"', '\"But your majesty... why take my head, when you already have my heart?\"', 110948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Umm... duhhhh... Lord Gravesbane?\"', '\"Umm... duhhhh... Lord Gravesbane?\"', 110947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I would settle for a robe drop, I suppose... but your majesty should definitely keep the shoulderpads ON.\"', '\"I would settle for a robe drop, I suppose... but your majesty should definitely keep the shoulderpads ON.\"', 110946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"You insolent buffoon! I should have your head for this!\"$b$bA score of angry guards unsheathed as many crystalline swords. The princess was angry. One word from her, and Lord Gravesbane would be sliced to ribbons. He would have to choose his next words very carefully.$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say to get out of this one?>|r', '', 110945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will... pay for this... shaman! You...', '', 110944, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Why would you say such a stupid thing to me?\"$b$bLord Gravesbane had been called many things before: foul, lecherous, repugnant, perverted, and occasionally even troggish, but never \"stupid\". This was new. He replied...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say or do now?>|r', '', 110943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, Mortals! Your kind has no place here!', '', 110942, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Pants? Here in my court, we simply wear robes and shoulderpads.\"$b$bLord Gravesbane surveyed the throne room chamber, and indeed, every single member of the princess\'s court was donned in long, flowing robes, and decorated with large crystalline shoulderpads. Not a single pant was in sight. He replied...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"You insolent buffoon! I should have your head for this!\"', '\"You insolent buffoon! I should have your head for this!\"', 110940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I see you have inherited Felo\'melorn. Let us hope it serves you better than it did Prince Kael\'thas.', '$n, I see you have inherited Felo\'melorn. Let us hope it serves you better than it did Prince Kael\'thas.', 110939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Why would you say such a stupid thing to me?\"', '\"Why would you say such a stupid thing to me?\"', 110938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Pants? Here in my court, we simply wear robes and shoulderpads.\"', '\"Pants? Here in my court, we simply wear robes and shoulderpads.\"', 110937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Like, REALLY cute.\"', '\"Like, REALLY cute.\"', 110936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"No, your majesty. Only to those princesses with eyes like sapphires in a stormy sea.\"', '\"No, your majesty. Only to the ones with eyes like sapphires.\"', 110935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Yes, I say it to nearly every woman I meet. I define my self-worth solely by the quantity of my romantic partners.\"', '\"Yes, I say it to nearly every woman I meet. I define my self-worth solely by the quantity of my romantic partners.\"', 110934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Well, I think you\'re terribly unclever!\"$b$bThe azure-skinned princess put on quite a show of being offended. So much, in fact, that it was clear to Lord Gravesbane that she was bluffing. He saw his chance.$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Simply \'cute\'? You\'ll have to do better than that, Lord Gravesbane.\"$b$bLord Gravesbane frowned. \"Perhaps I\'m simply having an off day\", he thought, clearly disappointed with his game.$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say to recover?>|r', '', 110931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I\'ll bet you say that to every princess you meet.\"$b$bLord Gravesbane could see her for what she really was now: yes, she was the ruler of an unbeatable warrior nation... but she was also a girl, still trembling under the terrible weight of a crown. He replied...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you carry Felo\'melorn, mage. My father spoke of that blade. He witnessed its fire during the War of the Ancients, long before the exodus of the quel\'dorei.', '', 110927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Is that a gnome in your legplates, or is that two gnomes in your legplates?\"$b$bLord Gravesbane stumbled backwards, clearly caught off-guard by the directness of the princess\'s question. He quickly re-gathered his wits and replied...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"That\'s a big sword you have there. Are you sure you know how to wield it?\"$b$bLord Gravesbane shifted his eyes towards his trousers, then back up at the regal draenei. Matching her hidden half-smile, he replied...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I am immune to your charms, outsider. Flattery will get you nowhere.\"$b$bLord Gravesbane held the princess\'s icy glare for one, two, three agonizing seconds, before replying...$b$b|cFF600000<What might Lord Gravesbane say now?>|r', '', 110924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
