('', 'Titanstrike\'s power will be mine!', 110324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nexus Vault is weakening! That arcane energy can only mean Aluneth is no longer fully contained.', '', 110323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best these whelps can manage? I could do this all day!', '', 110322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep yer eyes peeled! Prustaga\'s around here somewhere.', '', 110321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem quite capable, mage. With their magics gone, I feel my strength returning.', '', 110320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Theodore and I can take \'em! For the wilds!', '', 110319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! Now, before the master returns, slay my captors and free me!', '', 110318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, servant of hellfire! Rid me of this uninvited guest.', '', 110317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for you, treacherous skull, I\'ll deal with you later.', '', 110316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish warlock! Did you really think I would remain unaware of your infantile plot to steal my treasure? You underestimate the Nathrezim!', '', 110315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master is gone and his minions gorge upon my power. Come, repay this degradation! Introduce them to unfathomable levels of pain!', '', 110314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('There you are, mortal! I sense you are near. Move quickly and head down the path!', '', 110313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An intruder! I must warn the others!', '', 110312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, and with no time to waste. Let\'s move!', '', 110311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have wounded! Aid them while I cover you!', '', 110310, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 63383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! They are... gone!', '', 110308, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 63380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the Spark. The battle this place has seen has warped reality too much. We must finish this now.', '', 110307, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last of my brothers and sisters. I am all that remains of the Tyr\'s Guard.', '', 110306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we shall slay the enemy together! Come, vrykul! Face the fury of the storms!', '', 110300, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 62639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll have to wait, Thorim. There\'s a crazed vrykul on her way here to steal the power of Titanstrike!', '', 110299, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, and you are joined by one of the mortals who freed us from the grip of the Old God! We must hold a feast to celebrate!', '', 110298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bronzebeard! Back again, I see! Hati has missed you, as has Skoll. Skoll? Bah! Where has that worg run off to?', '', 110297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, Bronzebeard. Now hold on! I\'m taking you in.', '', 110296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really now? \'Twill be nice to be around one of our own... even if he\'s a bit tall for my likin\'.', '', 110295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pity you aren\'t joining Thorim under more pleasant circumstances. He\'s a lover of animals as well. Always going on and on about those wolves of his.', '', 110294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch yourself, Andoren. Belloc would be displeased to see you fraternizing with the Alliance...', 110293, 0, 26703, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stories are true. A hero once more wields Felo\'melorn! I thought the blade lost in the wastes of Icecrown. As relics go, it predates the War of the Ancients. May I... may I see it?', '', 110292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the monster! For the Light!', '', 110291, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 63379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear if we dally much longer, those giants will pound Nar\'thalas into the sea.', '', 110290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! It is hot to the touch! How do you even...? No matter. I see this blade is in good hands. Thank you, $n, for allowing me to touch a piece of my peoples\' history.', '', 110289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felo\'melorn! A blade fit for royalty. In the hands of Anasterian Sunstrider, a thousand Amani trolls fell before its fury.', '', 110288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n - is it true that you carry Kael\'thas\'s former blade? Come closer!', '', 110287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you on the other side.', '', 110286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Is it true? Do you wield Felo\'melorn? Come, speak with me!', '', 110285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost Owlkitten spots you and scampers away in fear!', '', 110284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost Owlkitten slowly raises its head and looks around.', '', 110283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED', '', 110282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEPRECATED', '', 110280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While trapping animals can be traumatic, it\'s a far better fate than what awaited them. I wish you and your new companions well.', '', 110279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The Speaker\"? That\'s me brother Magni, ye infernal contraption!', '', 110278, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the corruption of the Nightmare spreading, I fear for the wildlife of Val\'Sharah. I feel some would be safer in your care.', '', 110277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to Ulduar! The Speaker awaits you in the Celestial Planetarium. Please, follow me!', '', 110276, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aerial Command Unit can take you directly to the temple. Hop in!', '', 110275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gaze of the Legion has spotted you!', '', 110274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a master of the elements, you are able to coalesce primal elemental forces into physical form to aid you in battle.', '', 110273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I will see you withered for wasting my time!', '', 110268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disturbances are punishable by death! Do not let this happen again!', '', 110267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that I hear?', '', 110266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely done, but those demons won\'t give up so easily. Stand ready!', '', 110265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that sound?', '', 110264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_pet_broom.blp:20|t %s calls Scrubbers to |cFFF00000|Hspell:207513|h[Tidy Up]|h|r.', '', 110263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is very unstable now thanks to the previous visitors. We need to kill that thing to get what we need, but I\'m not sure what it will do to our surroundings.\n\nIt would be best to kill it quick and get out of here. Say the word, $n.', '', 110262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe that will stop their influx for now. Thank you, champion.', 110261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s that?! One of the bigger worms is burrowing through! Stand ready!', 110260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An infestation of leyworms has broken out in the Leyhollow caves! If you plug their tunnels with heavy stones, it should help contain them.', 110259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This chasm oozes darkness... Light protect us! That thing has what we need. Prepare yourselves, friends.', '', 110258, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are a secretive bunch and tend to speak in riddles, so not very much. It is known that they search the world for rare forms of magic to study, and this enclave may have found something quite powerful. \n\nI intend to discover whatever it is they are hiding.', 110257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tend to your companions\' wounds. You did well.', '', 110256, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be fooled! That creature is not one of our brood. Tread carefully, hero.', '', 110255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about their activities?', 'What do you know about their activities?', 110254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade is yours, $n.', 'My blade is yours, $n.', 110253, 7, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am a bit of a misfit, to be honest. Most sin\'dorei are content to live out their entire lives within the confines of Silvermoon City. However I found it stifling after so many years living on Draenor. I\'ve never been one to hold my opinions back...\n\nWhen Grand Magister Rommath asked me to leave and become the Magisters\' Seeker of Wisdom, it was a relief for us both. I intend to discover if the Empyrean Society possesses anything of use.', 110252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks. Allow me to repay you with my service.', 'My thanks. Allow me to repay you with my service.', 110251, 7, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They came out of nowhere! Be careful!', 'They came out of nowhere! Be careful!', 110250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patrol... they\'re dead! All dead!', 'My patrol... they\'re dead! All dead!', 110249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems all creatures are susceptible to the Legion\'s corruption. No matter how... small.', '', 110248, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you interested in the Empyrean Society?', 'Why are you interested in the Empyrean Society?', 110247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is a most... unusual murloc. There\'s something familiar about him, but I can\'t quite place it. Could you take a closer look?', '', 110246, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing you cannot handle!', '', 110245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Lunar Strike!', '', 110244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Entangling Roots!', '', 110243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to root the target before it can reach you! Let\'s try again!', '', 110242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try using Entangling Roots to immobilize your target!', '', 110241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Starsurge!', '', 110240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starsurge is available! Cast it now!', '', 110239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Solar Wrath!', '', 110238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Solar Wrath to generate Astral Power!', '', 110237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Sunfire!', '', 110236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Moonfire!', '', 110235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sunfire has expired on your target! Cast Sunfire on your target!', '', 110234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moonfire has expired on your target! Cast Moonfire on your target!', '', 110233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Moonkin form!', '', 110232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Lunar Strike to dispatch this group of enemies.', '', 110231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A balance druid is well equipped to face multiple opponents at once.', '', 110230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Celestial Alignment to increase damage, then use Solar Wrath on the target dummy.', '', 110229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a boost of damage? Look to the stars!', '', 110228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as a balance druid.', '', 110227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as a feral druid.', '', 110226, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me that you can harness the power of the universe itself!', '', 110225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Entangling Roots to root my soldier to the ground.', '', 110224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you need an enemy to stay put so you can close the distance to them... or make a hasty retreat.', '', 110223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Solar Wrath on the target dummy until you have enough Astral Power to cast Starsurge.', '', 110222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take care of this!', '', 110221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of your most potent attacks, Starsurge unleashes a surge of stellar energy at your target.', '', 110220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Solar Wrath on the target dummy.', '', 110219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once your enemy is taking damage from your other attacks, it\'s time to unleash Solar Wrath.', '', 110218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both these attacks deal damage over time. Once cast, you don\'t need to cast them again until their effect on the target has expired.', '', 110217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Moonfire and Sunfire on the target dummy.', '', 110216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wield the very power of night and day against your foes. Moonfire and Sunfire represent that power.', '', 110215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Moonkin Form and assume the form of a wildkin.', '', 110214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a balance druid the sun, moon, and stars are your allies, enabling you to unleash these primal powers upon your enemies.', '', 110213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Crash Lightning!', '', 110212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Feral Spirit!', '', 110211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Stormstrike!', '', 110210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormbringer has triggered! Use Stormstrike now!', '', 110209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Lava Lash!', '', 110208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lava Lash is available! Use it now!', '', 110207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess Stitches just... unraveled. Get it? Stitches? Unraveled? Man, I\'m on fire!', '', 110206, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rockbiter!', '', 110205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rockbiter to generate Maelstrom!', '', 110204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An entry from someone named... Abercrombie. He asked me to read the following: \'I fooled the bearer of this note into announcing my latest, most dire creation!\' Weird guy, that one.', '', 110203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flametongue!', '', 110202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Flametongue buff has expired! Use Flametongue!', '', 110201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shamanistic Rage to reduce incoming damage.', '', 110200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find yourself taking too much punishment in a fight, Shamanistic Rage reduces incoming damage for a short period of time. Try it!', '', 110199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Crash Lightning to dispatch this group of enemies.', '', 110198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are fighting multiple enemies, it is time to unleash the full fury of the storm!', '', 110197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Feral Spirit if you need to boost your damage in a fight!', '', 110196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You share a kinship with animal spirits such as wolves.', '', 110195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Stormstrike now!', '', 110194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Stormstrike on the target dummy after Stormbringer triggers.', '', 110193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your most powerful Maelstrom-fueled ability is Stormstrike.', '', 110192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Lava Lash on the target dummy.', '', 110191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Rockbiter generates Maelstrom, a resource that powers stronger attacks.', '', 110190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rockbiter on the target dummy.', '', 110189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that your weapons are burning, you can focus on your primary attack.', '', 110188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flametongue on the target dummy.', '', 110187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an enhancement shaman you channel the elemental forces directly into your weapons to make yourself a furious melee combatant, beating down your foes with the power of flame, earth, and storm.', '', 110186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life never gets any easier around here.', 110185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
