('Need to get out of a fight in a hurry? Invisibility is a great spell for getting out of a sticky situation.', '', 110170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Ice Barrier to reduce incoming damage.', '', 110169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite your best efforts, you may not be able to prevent an enemy from reaching you.', '', 110168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an enhancement shaman.', '', 110167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me you fight with the fury of the elements!', '', 110166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Blizzard to dispatch this group of enemies.', '', 110165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are master of dealing damage to many enemies at once.', '', 110164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember that Ice Lance does extra damage to frozen targets, so using Frost Nova and Ice Lance together is a powerful tactic.', '', 110163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 75236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freeze my soldier using Frost Nova.', '', 110162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if you could freeze foes in their tracks, preventing them from even reaching you?', '', 110161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practice using Blink.', '', 110160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlefield can be a dangerous place, so moving about is crucial to your survival.', '', 110159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Frozen Orb on the target dummy.', '', 110158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another potent spell you can wield is Frozen Orb. Cast this spell whenever it is available, as it can make your Ice Lance more powerful.', '', 110157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Frost Bolt on the target dummy until you trigger Fingers of Frost. While the effect is active, use Ice Lance.', '', 110156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feet don\'t fail me now!', '', 110155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Frostbolt on the target dummy until it triggers Fingers of Frost, Then use Ice Lance.', '', 110152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is one more way that Ice Lance can be used to maximize its power.', '', 110151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Ice Lance on the frozen target dummy.', '', 110150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'ll take a look at Ice Lance. It\'s similar to Frostbolt, but can be cast instantly, albeit for less damage.', '', 110149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you still doin\' here? Get!', '', 110148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Frostbolt on the target dummy.', '', 110147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your most fundamental and reliable attack is Frostbolt.', '', 110146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Summon Water Elemental to summon your pet.', '', 110145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a frost mage you excel at controlling the battlefield by freezing enemies in place as ice and hail pummel them into submission.', '', 110144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death Strike!', '', 110143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re facing multiple enemies. Try using Death and Decay!', '', 110142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is a good time to cast Dark Transformation!', '', 110141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Army of the Dead!', '', 110140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death Coil!', '', 110139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Coil is free!  Cast it now!', '', 110138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Scourge Strike after Festering Strike is a potent combination!', '', 110137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Scourge Strike!', '', 110136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Festering Strike!', '', 110135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your target is not infested with Festering Wounds. Use Festering Strike now!', '', 110134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Outbreak!', '', 110133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outbreak has expired from your target, use it now!', '', 110132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your minion is dead. Cast Raise Dead to summon a new minion.', '', 110131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. I have labored a hundred lifetimes and have not seen its like.', '', 110130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death Strike on the target to recover some of your health.', '', 110129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When taking excessive damage in battle, Death Strike can help even the odds.', '', 110128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not some brutish cleaver for the hacking of flesh. It is the slender blade of a tactician. Strands of arcane energy have been woven into the steel with each fold. I can feel its heat radiating down my arms. Magnificent!', '', 110127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death and Decay to dispatch the group of minions.', '', 110126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a death knight, you control the battlefield!', '', 110125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Felo\'melorn. The Flamestrike! Such craftsmanship, such elegance...', '', 110124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Dark Transformation to empower your ghoul.', '', 110123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your undead minion is a valuable asset in battle. Dark Transformation allows you to temporarily transform your ghoul into a hulking monstrosity with increased power and abilities. Try it out!', '', 110122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me you\'ve mastered the powers of darkness!', '', 110121, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 59736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Army of the Dead now to summon in your minions.', '', 110120, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 59737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being able to call upon the powers of death means you rarely need to be outnumbered.', '', 110119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Grip can be used from a good distance away. Try moving further away from the target and using it.', '', 110118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death Grip to pull my soldier to you.', '', 110117, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 59740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some foes would prefer to keep you at arm\'s length.', '', 110116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you know that in the past many Magisters studied amongst the Kirin Tor in Dalaran? Perhaps it is time to set aside our grudge and fight the Burning Legion together.', 110115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks sometimes allow you to cast Death Coil without costing Runic Power. Take advantage of this when you can.', '', 110114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Death Coil on the target dummy.', '', 110113, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 59743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks build Runic Power that can be used to cast Death Coil, a spell that hurls a blast of unholy energy at your target and restores energy to your ghoul minion.', '', 110112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to only use Scourge Strike when your target is affected by Festering Wounds.', '', 110111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Scourge Strike on the target dummy after it is infected with Festering Strike.', '', 110110, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 59746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argent Crusaders, secure this area! We will press on!', '', 110109, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 63376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that looks like it hurts! After infecting your target with Festering Strike, you are ready to burst the lesions you\'ve caused using Scourge Strike!', '', 110108, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 59747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Festering Strike on the target dummy.', '', 110107, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 59748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that your enemy is reeling from a miasma of plagues, it\'s time to strike up close.', '', 110106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Outbreak on the target dummy.', '', 110105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best way to start a fight is to infect your enemy with a host of diseases from a distance.', '', 110104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Raise Dead to summon your minion.', '', 110103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As an unholy death knight you command the powers of disease and death.', '', 110102, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you enjoy traveling, $n? As the Magisters\' Seeker of Wisdom, I am on the road quite a bit. I find it strange that most sin\'dorei dislike it so much. But then I am not like most sin\'dorei, as they never fail to remind me.', 110101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That Pearl of Arcane Wisdom you found is quite impressive. I brought an old spell book I took from a rather nasty ghoul in Deatholme. He didn\'t know what hit him. Ha!', 110100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Prowl to enter stealth!', '', 110099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Thrash!', '', 110098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rake has expired on your target! Use it again!', '', 110097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may. But only for a moment.', 'You may. But only for a moment.', 110096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrash continues to damage your foes for a short period, so you don\'t need to use it again until your targets stops being affected by it.', '', 110095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Thrash to damage several enemies at once.', '', 110094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When fighting multiple enemies at once a feral druid can become a whirlwind of fangs and claws, damaging everything around them.', '', 110093, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Thrash then Swipe is a great combination!', '', 110092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now use Swipe!', '', 110091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re fighting multiple enemies, try using Swipe!', '', 110090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Swipe to damage several enemies at once.', '', 110089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrash isn\'t your only tool for fighting multiple enemies.', '', 110088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the stories are true - you\'ve recovered Felo\'melorn!$b$bShattered during the third war, Prince Kael\'thas ordered its repair. Elven blades grow stronger with each reforging, but only in the hands of the finest craftsmen.$b$bI have never seen such a wonder. May I hold it?', '', 110087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Survival Instincts!', '', 110086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Survival Instincts to reduce incoming damage.', '', 110085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When in Cat Form you can rely on the instincts of an animal to help pull you through a tough fight.', '', 110084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Entangling Roots!', '', 110083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to root the target before it can reach you! Let\'s try again!', '', 110082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try using Entangling Roots to immobilize your target!', '', 110081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are preparing to ascend. I hope Marlan finds your gift acceptable so you can join us.', 'We are preparing to ascend. I hope Marlan finds your gift acceptable so you can join us.', 110080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Entangling Roots to root my soldier to the ground.', '', 110079, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you need an enemy to stay put so you can close the distance to them... or make a hasty retreat.', '', 110078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Cat Form.', '', 110077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using spells will usually pull you out of shapeshift forms. Don\'t forget to return to cat form for combat.', '', 110076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heal yourself with Healing Touch!', '', 110075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Regrowth to restore yourself to full health.', '', 110074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You also have the ability to call on the powers of nature for a variety of other abilities, like healing!', '', 110073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practice using Dash to increase your movement speed.', '', 110072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever needed to quickly get out of a sticky situation? You excel at doing this.', '', 110071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rip!', '', 110070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have 5 combo points! Use Rip!', '', 110069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rip on the target dummy with five combo points.', '', 110068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tougher enemies may require a diverse set of abilities to overcome.', '', 110067, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Tiger\'s Fury!', '', 110066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re low on energy! Use Tiger\'s Fury!', '', 110065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Tiger\'s Fury to restore some energy and then attack the target dummy with Shred.', '', 110064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of your attacks require energy to use. You might find yourself low on energy at times, rendering you unable to use any abilities.', '', 110063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Ferocious Bite!', '', 110062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have 5 combo points! Use Ferocious Bite now!', '', 110061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have 5 combo points, use Ferocious Bite on the target dummy.', '', 110060, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Both your Shred and Rake abilities generate combo points which can fuel powerful finishing moves.', '', 110059, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rake!', '', 110058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rake inflicts its damage over time, so you don\'t need to use it again until your target is no longer affected by it.', '', 110057, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Rake on the target dummy.', '', 110056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you\'ve reached your prey in stealth, it\'s time to ambush them.', '', 110055, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ascension is at hand. Have you brought us something worthy?', 'Our ascension is at hand. Have you brought us something worthy?', 110054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shred!', '', 110053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shred to generate combo points!', '', 110052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shred on the target dummy while it\'s bleeding from Rake.', '', 110051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Your primary attack is Shred.', '', 110050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stealth lasts until you cancel it, attack, or take damage.', '', 110049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Prowl to enter stealth.', '', 110048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a cat you can move with uncanny stealth, allowing you to approach your enemies undetected. Prowl puts you in stealth mode.', '', 110047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not in Cat Form!', '', 110046, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to be in Cat Form to fight!', '', 110045, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Cat Form and assume the form of a cat.', '', 110044, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a feral druid your main weapon is shapeshifting. In Cat Form, your claws and fangs rip and bleed your opponents.', '', 110043, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! You have shown yourself to be worthy.', '', 110042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Touch of Death on the target dummy.', '', 110041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your monk training has taught you the precision necessary to strike an enemy\'s pressure points. Touch of Death deals massive damage, but takes a short time to take effect.', '', 110040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re facing multiple enemies! Try using Storm, Earth, and Fire!', '', 110039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Storm, Earth, and Fire to attack all three of these target dummies at once.', '', 110038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fights aren\'t always fair... or are they?', '', 110037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paralyze the soldier who attacks you.', '', 110036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you might get in over your head, facing more enemies than you can handle.', '', 110035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flying Serpent Kick!', '', 110034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flying Serpent Kick to travel to the target dummy and damage it.', '', 110033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roll is not your only ability for mobility. Windwalker monks can also launch themselves through the air, flying at their targets.', '', 110032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an unholy death knight.', '', 110031, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your allies spill the blood of their rivals upon the field of battle. Join them and prove your valor!', '', 110030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me you fight with savagery and cunning!', '', 110029, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t see anything unusual about this brazier. It looks to be in pretty good shape for something so ancient.', 110028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66475, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us make our way to the platform above.', '', 110027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heal yourself with Effuse!', '', 110026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Effuse to replenish your health to full.', '', 110025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking damage is part of battle, but you can tap the spiritual mists to heal yourself or an ally. Use Effuse to heal your wounds.', '', 110024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roll, roll, roll!', '', 110023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thorim\'s throne at the Temple of Storms. I suggest you get moving. We don\'t have much time!', '', 110022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it? Where\'s Prustaga headed?', '', 110021, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 62650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
