('Tougher enemies may require a broader range of abilities to overcome. As an alternative to Eviscerate, Nightblade can be used to deal damage over time to your target, and is a good ability to spend combo points on early in a fight. Like Eviscerate, Nightblade is a finishing move, and is best used when you have 5 combo points.', '', 109857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Cleave!', '', 109856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Cleave and Whirlwind to take out this group of enemies.', '', 109855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whirlwind is not the only attack you can use against multiple enemies.', '', 109854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you feel ready, explore your spellbook and the talent tree for additional abilities you can learn.', '', 109853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me you\'ve got the stuff.', '', 109852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me you fight with fearlessness and ferocity!', '', 109851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as a subtlety rogue.', '', 109849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In order to enact the failsafe ritual we will need to clear the room. Say the word and I will begin.', '', 109848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as an arms warrior.', '', 109847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in trouble! Use Vanish!', '', 109846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Eviscerate!', '', 109844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Practice using Heroic Leap.', '', 109843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the heat of battle there will be times you need to move quickly to avoid danger... or confront it!', '', 109842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Whirlwind!', '', 109841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whirlwind can damage multiple enemies!', '', 109840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there! The sacred hammer\'s wards remain strong! First we must purge this infestation. Let me know when you are ready.', '', 109839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you need to do is deactivate the two control panels over by the fusion press. Bronzebeard and I will man the central console.', '', 109838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect!', '', 109837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Whirlwind to take out this group of enemies.', '', 109836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those alarms indicate that we\'re encountering some... minor technical difficulties with the fusion press unit.', '', 109835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your opponents may try to overwhelm you with numbers, but they underestimate your true might!', '', 109834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shadowstrike!', '', 109833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calydus found a perfect spot for the ritual! Come, friend, meet Calydus in the room behind the curtains at the place called the Violet Gate.', '', 109832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfurl your winds, friend, and I will soothe the tempest.', 'Unfurl your winds, friend, and I will soothe the tempest.', 109831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Victory Rush!', '', 109830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory Rush is available! Use it now!', '', 109829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eliminate an enemy, enabling Victory Rush to be used on your next opponent.', '', 109828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you defeat an opponent, your heart will sing with the glory of victory!', '', 109827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Colossus Smash!', '', 109826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Colossus Smash is available! Use it now!', '', 109825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Colossus Smash on the Target Dummy.', '', 109824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of your most devastating attacks is Colossus Smash. Always use it as soon as it becomes available and no foe will stand against you for long.', '', 109823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Slam!', '', 109822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Slam on the target dummy.', '', 109821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dealing damage to your enemy builds up Rage, which fuels your attacks. Use Slam to spend Rage and deal damage to your enemy.', '', 109820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Mortal Strike!', '', 109819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal Strike is available!  Use it now!', '', 109818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Mortal Strike on the target dummy.', '', 109817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you reach your target you will perform basic attacks automatically, but a skilled combatant unleashes a variety of advanced abilities to defeat a foe.', '', 109816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors don\'t stroll up to face a foe! Use Charge to close the distance on your opponent. Try it!', '', 109815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your Charge ability to cover the distance to this target dummy.', '', 109814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arms warriors are the ultimate physical combatants, using martial skill and weaponry to crush those who stand against them.', '', 109813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Zinnin bows his head slightly, silently acknowledging your presence.>', '', 109812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the Dreadscar demons under your control, their power will be ours to dissect and command.', 109811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I escape one demon world, only to dwell within another demon world. \n\nAt least this one is under your control.', 109810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did right by your fellow warlocks, which is commendable, and surprising.', 109809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you are busy, Calydus will search for a suitable location for the ritual.', '', 109808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The wind whips furiously as you approach, crackling with lightning discharges. The elemental at the storm\'s core calls out to you with a distorted voice.>$b$bPlease... shaman...$b$bI cannot contain the tempest within... Help me... Help...', '', 109807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The wind whips furiously as you approach, roiling with lightning. Perhaps a shaman could be called in to speak with the restless elemental?>', '', 109806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting combat from stealth is more effective.', '', 109805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Backstab!', '', 109804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Backstab to generate combo points.', '', 109803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you start to feel woozy from the poison, seek out a priest immediately.', 109802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let the size of that brute fool you. He\'s as dangerous as the rest of his kind. Watch out for his poison scales!', 109801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! I\'ll give the recipe a try. The real trick will be finding someone willing to drink it...', 109800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe I may have discovered the secret of Garuhod\'s recipe. I need you to gather some specific ingredients, but you must be careful. These creatures are most delicate!', 109799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems you know your stuff. We may have a use for you.', 109798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to aid our cause, you\'ll need to sharpen your skills.', '', 109797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That whelp will recover in time. You have my thanks.', 109796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The local wildlife preys upon our injured whelplings. Please, protect them.', 109795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pity to waste wine, but it looked like a sour vintage anyway.', 109794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This once-proud winery has been tainted, and foul creatures now seep from the defiled barrels. Cleanse this cursed placed!', 109793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! We were lucky to get to them early, before the naga\'s influence could fully take hold.', '', 109792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have been using their foul sorcery to dominate the minds of the local murlocs. That group there seem to be in the early stages. See if you can knock some sense back into them.', '', 109791, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arkethrax... avenge me!', '', 109789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will purge this land in fel fire!', '', 109788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot... be stopped...', '', 109787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna will fall before the Legion!', '', 109786, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Treat the patient\'s fever.', 'Treat the patient\'s fever.', 109783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should keep them at bay for now. Fare you well, champion. We will handle it from here!', 109775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we can push the Legion back!', 109774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demons are encroaching on our lands from Suramar. We must drive them back! If you take out their leaders, my Scalewardens will bring down their portals.', 109773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need to leave, $c... NOW!', 109771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s gasps.', 109770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $p, for restoring Cenarius to his natural state.  Our world has once again been saved through your deeds.', '', 109769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to get started.', 'I\'m ready to get started.', 109763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my, yes! This is going to yield so much exciting data!', '', 109762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not too familiar with these parts. I best keep on.', 109761, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful out here, $n. The air is full of their foul odor.', 109760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You keep \'em at a distance. I\'ll do the rest.', 109759, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you could use some company.', 109758, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful! They\'re stronger than they seem!', 109757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My gun... it\'s jammed!', 109755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astounding! Your mastery over demons has given you great power!', '', 109754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Soulstone to survive death.', '', 109753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A well-prepared warlock can survive almost anything... even death!', '', 109752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re low on health, use your Healthstone!', '', 109751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, heal some of the damage you\'ve taken with your Healthstone.', '', 109749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, heal some of the damage you\'ve taken with your Healthstone.', '', 109748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Create Healthstone.', '', 109746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A portion of your power can be coalesced into a Healthstone. If you take damage, ingest the Healthstone to recover health.', '', 109744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 109740, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 59066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We study that which gives us the power to ascend. You must bring your gift to Marlan.', 'We study that which gives us the power to ascend. You must bring your gift to Marlan.', 109739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, that is indeed interesting. We study exotic magic of all types in order to prepare ourselves for ascension.', 'Hmm, that is indeed interesting. We study exotic magic of all types in order to prepare ourselves for ascension.', 109738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summon your Doomguard now!', '', 109737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Summon Doomguard now to summon this demon.', '', 109736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to learn from us? What did you bring us?', 'Are you here to learn from us? What did you bring us?', 109735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While greater demons like Infernals and Doomguards cannot be controlled for long, you can summon one to your side for short periods of time to fight for you.', '', 109734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cast Fear!', '', 109733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought you a Pearl of Arcane Wisdom. What is it you do here, exactly?', 'I brought you a Pearl of Arcane Wisdom. What is it you do here, exactly?', 109732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Life Tap to replenish your mana!', '', 109731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Unstable Affliction!', '', 109730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unstable Affliction is available! Cast it now!', '', 109729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While Unstable Affliction deals damage over time, every re-cast increases its potency. Use this attack whenever you can!', '', 109728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to join us? I hope you brought us something powerful to study.', 'Have you come to join us? I hope you brought us something powerful to study.', 109727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done!', '', 109726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was touched... by filthy outsiders?!', '', 109725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good.', '', 109724, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 59064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work!', '', 109723, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 59061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great!', '', 109722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!', '', 109721, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 59060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work!', '', 109720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye! Quite the brave $c, aren\'t ye.', 'Thank ye! Quite the brave $c, aren\'t ye.', 109719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The intruders are here!', '', 109718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Drain Life!', '', 109717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Drain Life on your target!', '', 109716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... how did...?', '', 109715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Corruption!', '', 109714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corruption has expired! Cast it again!', '', 109713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you cast Corruption, you don\'t need to cast it again until your original spell is close to expiring.', '', 109712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Agony!', '', 109711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agony has expired! Cast it again!', '', 109710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you cast Agony, you don\'t need to cast it again until your original spell is close to expiring.', '', 109709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Appreciate the help, but I\'ve got ta keep movin\'.', 'Appreciate the help, but I\'ve got ta keep movin\'.', 109708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Voidwalker has died. Use Summon Voidwalker to bring it back.', '', 109707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always wanted ta test my skills alongside a $c.', 'Always wanted ta test my skills alongside a $c.', 109706, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind some comp\'ny? We\'re ere fer the same cause.', 'Mind some comp\'ny? We\'re ere fer the same cause.', 109705, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Obtain the blood with your dark magic.>', '<Obtain the blood with your dark magic.>', 109704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Carefully take a small blood sample.>', '<Carefully take a small blood sample.>', 109703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The beast looks at you for a moment and neighs.>', '', 109702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ne\'er thought I\'d see you out here! Mind lendin\' a hand?', 'Ne\'er thought I\'d see you out here! Mind lendin\' a hand?', 109701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light! What are ye doin\' all the way out here? Ne\'er mind that! Help me with this thing!', 'By the Light! What are ye doin\' all the way out here? Ne\'er mind that! Help me with this thing!', 109700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flips through the pages of his spellbook.', '', 109699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to be missing some of my newer spells, though I\'m sure we won\'t run into too much trouble.', '', 109698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks like the perfect opportunity for me to hone my skills!', '', 109697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now it is your turn!', '', 109696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67627, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friend has been dealt with.', '', 109695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67626, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Kirin Tor Spies!', '', 109694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67625, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<If you had an herb, you could plant it here.>', '<Plant a flower?>', 109693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of mess have I gotten myself into?', '', 109692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spellbook! How can I - Hey! Over here!', '', 109691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Mind lending a hand?', '', 109690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep moving! They\'re everywhere!', 'Keep moving! They\'re everywhere!', 109689, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. I need find the others, but hopefully this helps.', 'Thanks. I need find the others, but hopefully this helps.', 109688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like this fight\'s just beginning.', 'Looks like this fight\'s just beginning.', 109687, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
