('Excellent! You made it through in one piece! You can never be sure about the reliability of stolen teleporters...', '', 109668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will move when the way is clear. Your bravery is worth more than you know, friend.', 109667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
