('They are lying to you!', '', 109567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go. Destroy the Nightmare Lord. Only this way can the Dream be restored... and Azeroth be saved.', '', 109566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My bond with the Emerald Dream gives me great power... but it also makes me vulnerable to the rift\'s darkness. I have peered inside it and know this to be true. Should I step within, I would be lost... just as Cenarius was.', '', 109565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
