('It is done! Cenarius is beaten, but my great teacher lives. Now I must focus all of my strength to cleanse him.', '', 109563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cenarius! Do not listen to him!', '', 109562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your weapons! He begins to see the truth!', '', 109561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Cenarius! We are here to save you!', '', 109560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been deceived, my teacher! Xavius has twisted your perceptions! I beg of you, let me cleanse you of his evil!', '', 109559, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 58895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can it be? My old master is blind to the lies of Xavius and thinks WE are the source of the infestation!', '', 109558, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 58894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
