('Master, we fight to save them! To save you!', '', 109556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not lose you, shan\'do!', '', 109555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
