('The Dream must endure!', '', 109530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, corrupter!', '', 109529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacred vines, entangle the corrupted!', '', 109528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beloved daughter, restore my strength!', '', 109527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion of the Dream, strike with wing and claw!', '', 109526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeds of life, purge the wicked from this grove!', '', 109525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noble ancient, stomp out the stain of their evil!', '', 109524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is joined!', '', 109523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack the corruptors!', '', 109522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must strike back at the Nightmare!', '', 109521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature will rise against you!', '', 109520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allies! To my side!', '', 109519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth and fight for the Dream!', '', 109518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul shall suffer!', 'Your soul shall suffer!', 109517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile mortal! Your end has come!', 'Fragile mortal! Your end has come!', 109516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion cannot be stopped!', 'The Legion cannot be stopped!', 109515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the might of the Legion!', 'By the might of the Legion!', 109514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape!', 'You cannot escape!', 109513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are everywhere!', 'We are everywhere!', 109512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak!', 'You are weak!', 109511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So helpless... where am I?', 'So helpless... where am I?', 109510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt fear like never before...', 'I felt fear like never before...', 109509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They know our secrets! Our thoughts are not our own!', 'They know our secrets! Our thoughts are not our own!', 109508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... is this me? Am I myself again!?', 'My... is this me? Am I myself again!?', 109507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so weak...', 'I feel so weak...', 109506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t stop! I swear it!', 'I couldn\'t stop! I swear it!', 109505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
