('', 'Aye, she be outside directin\' her demons ta load up more captives. I be havin\' a score to settle wid her, so if ya be aimin\' ta take her out, count me in!', 109214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
