('Jewelcrafting grants you the skill to rework and \"improve\" this statue.', 'Jewelcrafting grants you the skill to rework and \"improve\" this statue.', 109098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your experience with Mining grants you the knowledge to work... and deface stone.', 'Your experience with Mining grants you the knowledge to work... and deface stone.', 109097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A realistic and ornate statue of a Suramar noble.', 'A realistic and ornate statue of a Suramar noble.', 109096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for your trial, Yrgrim.', 'I am ready for your trial, Yrgrim.', 109095, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must see if you possess the will, the strength, and the stamina to wield this shield. Will you face me in a trial of combat?', '', 109094, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight at your side, demon hunter!', '', 109093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I waited for one who proves worthy. Face me in battle that we might test your heart!', '', 109092, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 63305, 0, 1, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, hero! Jace was heading this way.', '', 109091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. With my strength renewed, I am able to dispel this foul magic.', '', 109090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<sigh> Dear child... Do you not realize what he died for?', 109089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hear no more of your scheming! You endanger everything our father worked for!', 109088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not up for debate, Anarys. You are either with us, or against us. Choose wisely.', 109087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. Come my wounded friends, let us see if I might have the strength that is needed to carry you to safety.', '', 109086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a barrel of Starlight Rose tea. It appears to have been aged such that the brew is sickeningly strong.\n\nJust the smell of it nearly causes you to retch. Clearly it has been left here for too long.', 'It\'s a barrel of Starlight Rose tea. It appears to have been aged such that the brew is sickeningly strong.\n\nJust the smell of it nearly causes retching. Clearly it has been left here for too long.', 109085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strong tea is merely a challenge to the auspicious Monk. Down the hatch!', 'A strong tea is merely a challenge to the auspicious Monk. Down the hatch!', 109084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Death Knight, tea strong enough to wake the dead is just what you need.', 'As a Death Knight, tea strong enough to wake the dead is just what you need.', 109083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a barrel of Starlight Rose tea. It appears to have been aged such that the brew is sickeningly strong.', 'It\'s a barrel of Starlight Rose tea. It appears to have been aged such that the brew is sickeningly strong.', 109082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrival was timely. Had we waited even a few more moments I would not be here today to thank you.', '', 109081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Yrgrim, Champion of Tyr! Let us see if you are worthy to bear his shield.', '', 109080, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bid you greetings, Opener of Doors. You are the first.', '', 109079, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These braves are near death. They will not be able to move themselves.', '', 109078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Bless the Light, you made it! This place is crawling with evil!', '', 109077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time left. Run!', 'There is no time left. Run!', 109076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They did not give me enough time to gather my things. Do you think they will be safe? I don\'t want those drogbar rummaging through my personal stuff.', 109075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My home! Dargrul blew up my home. I... I don\'t... I can\'t even...', 109074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another tablet! This champion is still forged, never touched by the curse o\' flesh! We should take care.', '', 109073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She fought with everything she was, but there were simply too many. What are we going to do, Galar\'thus?', 109071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am not leaving without my Kaya!', 109069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry!  I\'m here!', '', 109068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archdruid! Watch out!', 109067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my thanks. I can find my own way back to Dreadscar Rift.', 109066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zinnin Smythe bows his head in silent thanks.', '', 109065, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! Better\'n being a pile of ash on the ground, ain\'t it?', '', 109064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their hideout should be close. I smell the stench of satyr to the east.', 109063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re on the right track. Keep searching.', '', 109062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golarb failed...', '', 109061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord came for her. Golarb tried to help...', '', 109060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistress is gone...', '', 109059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golarb is unresponsive.', '', 109058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p! You are now prepared to do battle as a beast master hunter.', '', 109057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target practice is over, $p. It\'s time to prove your mettle. Combine all the lessons you\'ve learned and use them to defeat my men in combat.', '', 109056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 59069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your courage and zeal in the heat of combat!', '', 109054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove to me you have the necessary skill and cunning required to hunt any prey!', '', 109053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Feign Death to trick my soldier into stopping his attack.', '', 109052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the greatest adventurers sometimes find themselves in over their heads.', '', 109051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Multi-Shot to dispatch all the enemies.', '', 109050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes you\'ll find yourself outnumbered. When you do, you can unleash destruction upon a host of adversaries at once!', '', 109049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When in combat, Bestial Wrath sends you and your pet into a frenzy of rage that increases your damage for a short time.', '', 109046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Bestial Wrath while attacking the target dummy.', '', 109045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Cobra Shot on the target dummy.', '', 109044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure you\'re ready to join in on the action. Cobra Shot is your primary ranged attack, pummeling your enemy while your pet keeps their attention.', '', 109043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Dire Beast on the target dummy.', '', 109042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s see what other forces of nature you command.', '', 109041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Kill Command multiple times on the target dummy.', '', 109040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sending your pet to attack and distract an enemy gives you more time to line up your ranged attacks.', '', 109039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Call Pet to bring your pet to battle.', '', 109038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beast master hunters possess a deep bond with their pets, calling and bolstering them in battle while striking at foes with ranged attacks.', '', 109037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cultists are blinded by the twilight... deprived and recluse, taking cover in the night.', '', 109036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This magical lantern is different in some way. Almost as if it is leaking.\n\nYou\'re sure someone will come along and fix it in due time.', 'This magical lantern is different in some way. Almost as if it is leaking.\n\nYou\'re sure someone will come along and fix it in due time.', 109035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This faulty device of Elven construct is familiar to you and can be altered to provide magical empowerment.', 'This faulty device of Elven construct is familiar to you and can be altered to provide magical empowerment.', 109034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Mage, you are long familiar with the intricacies of ley magic. It can be repurposed to a... better cause.', 'As a Mage, you are long familiar with the intricacies of ley magic. It can be repurposed to a... better cause.', 109033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This magical lantern is different in some way. Almost as if it is leaking.', 'This magical lantern is different in some way. Almost as if it is leaking.', 109032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tablet says ye need to withstand the door\'s \"gaze\". I\'m bettin\' that\'s not gonna be pleasant. Care to give it a try?', '', 109031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glowing door... Wee bit obvious, don\'t ye think? What have we here?', '', 109030, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! I haven\'t much time.', 109029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets of the Burning Legion will be ours to unlock!', '', 109028, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under the First, our power will reach new heights.', '', 109027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council of the Black Harvest lives once again.', '', 109026, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our leader has done what no other could do.', '', 109025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You succumbed to the Nightmare! Defeat your fears to wake up.', 'You succumbed to the Nightmare! Defeat your fears to wake up.', 109024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not disappoint the Banshee Queen.', '', 109023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck with the Trials... \"hero.\"', '', 109022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so we enter the lair of the beast. May the Light protect us!', '', 109021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The destruction of Azeroth is at hand! Soon... the very elements that shape this world will cause its demise!', 109020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My little ones learn quickly... they drink from the void and thirst endlessly for more!', 109018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your wakened life is a disease!', 109017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Consumed from within!', 109016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My children will learn these secrets and together we shall tear this world asunder!', 109015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... I still have much to do... RETURN TO ME!', 109014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have no more need of this life!', 109013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark secrets have been revealed to me through the void... ways of subjugating the elements to my will!', 109012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Breathe deeply. Embrace your fate.', 109011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will take these poor, pathetic creatures under my wing and lead them to the glorious destiny they yearn for!', 109004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let your names be forgotten.', '', 109003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande... forgive me!', '', 109002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I have heard the prayers of their faithful... crying out for destruction!', 109001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never heard my blade coming!', '', 109000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victim of my artistry.', '', 108999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you blink... you bleed!', '', 108998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will speed you towards your demise!', '', 108997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t counter what you can\'t see!', '', 108996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bleed for the Grand Magistrix!', '', 108995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death by a thousand cuts!', '', 108994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind slices to the bone!', '', 108993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Twilight\'s Hammer is all but destroyed. This once great order has been laid low... scattered and leaderless.', 108992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66848, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Betrayers, will you remember killing me now?', 108991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt your betters!', '', 108990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mercy? None for you! Only gushing blood and broken bodies!', 108989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This time I\'m ready for your treachery!', 108988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally. I\'ll make this quick.', '', 108987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not afraid of spiders, are you?', 108986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My beak will tear your flesh, vermin!', 108985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the crush of my talons!', 108984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll adorn my web with your bones!', 108983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scream for me!', 108982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such juicy morsels!', 108981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is nowhere left to hide!', 108980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scurry, scurry, little rats!', 108979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you have become prey!', 108978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your faces no longer appear familiar. Did you truly deserve my wrath?', 108977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Revenge is said to be sweet, but I taste only bitterness.', 108976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I recall my final moments surrounded by those I had trusted. Your satisfied sneers as I drew my last breath.', 108975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you remember murdering me? Or have you grown so used to slaughter that my cries of agony are long forgotten?', 108974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! To me!', '', 108973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Betrayers! Liars! Murderers! Has Hamuul sent his lapdogs to fetch the knife from my back?', 108972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt!', '', 108971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone left some goods out in the open...\n\nThey seem to be monitored by magical means.', 'Someone left some goods out in the open...\n\nThey seem to be monitored by magical means.', 108970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If a Rogue were to pilfer some of these, you\'re sure someone would take notice.', 'If a Rogue were to pilfer some of these, you\'re sure someone would take notice.', 108969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be a pity if a Warrior were to smash them.', 'It would be a pity if a Warrior were to smash them.', 108968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone left some goods out in the open...', 'Someone left some goods out in the open...', 108967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Archdruid. Take the Idol back to the Dreamgrove, and we will meet you there.', '', 108966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This metal is all bent out of shape. A strong Blacksmith could hammer these pieces back into working order.', 'This metal is all bent out of shape. A strong Blacksmith could hammer these pieces back into working order.', 108965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right there on the line.', '', 108964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just go ahead and sign it.', '', 108963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t bother reading it or anything.', '', 108962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All forces, spread out! Legion corruption rises in all directions!', '', 108961, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Our forces have spread across these foul lands. We have defiled and corrupted your precious soil... Let us see how you deal with our legion now.', '', 108960, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More camps on the horizon! Bring them down!', '', 108959, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Bloodtotem had been growing more distant for years now. But to side with the Legion? None of us could have foreseen that.', 108958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too many of the Bloodtotem have gone over to the legion. Now, these Feltotem are gathering their strength. I do not intend to let their betrayal go unpunished.', 108957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace the fel energies of our new masters. Kneel, and you shall rise stronger than ever.', '', 108956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces of Highmountain, the drogbar, even the elves, will be swept away in the flames of our wrath.', '', 108955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow, bow to the might of Sargeras. Bow and receive his gifts.', '', 108954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits, the elements, they are but pitiful shadows compared to the power of the legion.', '', 108953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get going. The portal is just ahead.', '', 108952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It takes many years to build a reputation, and only one mistake to tarnish it.\n\nI have my work cut out for me, but I hope that serving on the council will help towards restoring pride to the Fizzlebang name.', 108951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll do whatever it takes to restore pride to the Fizzlebang name.', 108950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see the times are changing.  \n\nOne warlock, no matter how powerful, can\'t take on the Burning Legion alone.\n\nWhile I\'ll never believe anything Ritssyn does is selfless, it\'s clear that rebuilding the council is the right thing to do.\n\nI would be honored to count myself one among the six, if you\'ll have me.', 108949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I choose you to be the Sixth.', 'I choose you to be the Sixth.', 108948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are others trapped inside. Please, rescue them if you can. Thank you again, $n!', 108947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
