('Let us gather and give our oaths!', '', 108944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just enjoy the party for a bit. You know... mingle.', '', 108943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylendra, can we still recover the idol?', '', 108942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for that welcome distraction.', '', 108941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who goes there?', 108940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Against us, your strength is nothing. All you love will turn against you. You will face your greatest fears.', '', 108939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no use, druid. You cannot fight us.', '', 108937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up, druid. Your ancient god... cannot... be saved...', '', 108936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should do it. I think we both deserve a pat on the back, $n. Wouldn\'t you agree?', '', 108935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had to deal with those awful scribes over at The Scribe\'s Sacellum. But, ultimately, it was worth the effort.', '', 108934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, we have much to discuss.', '', 108933, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... resting my eyes... for a moment...', '', 108932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that reminds me. While you were off doing the easy work, I was out taking care of the other part that was needed.', '', 108931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your god is no match for ours, druid!', '', 108929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out here, no one will hear your screams!', '', 108928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me, $c. The Illidari must learn what the Legion is planning in Faronaar!', 'Thank you for freeing me, $c. The Illidari must learn what the Legion is planning in Faronaar!', 108927, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It shames me to have been taken alive by these creatures. Thanks to you, I will fight another day.', 'It shames me to have been taken alive by these creatures. Thanks to you, I will fight another day.', 108926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When that brute Kraggosh and his overseers moved into the Undercity, we were forced to do our real work in secret.$B$BSurely you can see how such an arrangement inevitably led me here.', '', 108925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These foul demons sap our strength and seek to bend our will. Show them no mercy!', 'These foul demons sap our strength and seek to bend our will. Show them no mercy!', 108924, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I shall return to the Illidari to recover.', 'Thank you. I shall return to the Illidari to recover.', 108923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had thought my battle over. You have my gratitude.', 'I had thought my battle over. You have my gratitude.', 108922, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookee! Seems Yrgrim was the champion, and he came here after Tyr\'s fall.', '', 108921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sinu a\'manore. You were fortunate I was in the area. What brings you to this forsaken place?', '', 108920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will meet your death by our hands!', 108919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doomguards make their descent! Prepare yourselves!', '', 108918, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
