('A Rotdrool Grabber bursts from the husk of the grub!', '', 108910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My work will shine for eternity...', '', 108909, 0, 39512, 0, 64, 0, 66066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
