('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_MindFreeze:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:209983|h[Control Thoughts]|h|r on Grash!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_MindFreeze:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0404|Hspell:209983|h[Control Thoughts]|h|r on Grash!', 108907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time on this world ends now, demon! Allies, gather at Sentinel Hill!', '', 108906, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t escape me this time, Valith! Tell me where your master is and I may grant you a quick death!', '', 108905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the fall of Sargeras\' hound Goremaw, his dreadlords took the beast\'s fangs and forged them into a pair of daggers known as the Fangs of the Devourer. It\'s said they still carry the monster\'s bite.$B$BSargeras called upon one of his top assassins to wield the fangs, an eredar named Akaari Shadowgore. Despite our best attempts, we haven\'t been able to stop her.', 108904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jorach spoke highly of you. He\'s a good friend to have.', 108903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just after the Cataclysm, one o\' me best discovered a pair o\' golden cutlasses unlike any ye\'ve e\'er seen. The moment Eliza touched \'em, she had a vision o\' herself conquerin\' city after city, commandin\' a crew o\' lost souls.$B$BYe may doubt such a grand tale, but it indeed came t\' pass. The Dreadblades \'ave claimed countless souls, and now we\'re comin\' for \'em!', '', 108902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m close to locating a foe we\'ve been hunting for years. With a bit of help, we can take her out and lay claim to her daggers.', 108901, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kingslayers are the only way to ensure the Legion\'s end. Hear me out!', 108900, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for ya?', '', 108899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimme yer ear, $n. I got a plan that\'s guaranteed to put worthy blades in them hands!', '', 108898, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 63606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I plan to acquire the cursed daggers that took down King Llane Wrynn. Garona hid the Kingslayers for good reason. Their power is not to be underestimated.$B$BI need your help to retrieve them. These storied blades are just what we need to destroy Gul\'dan and his foul allies.', 108897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about your plan.', 'Tell me about your plan.', 108896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s the matter? Never seen a princess who knows how to twist a blade?', 108895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
