('', 'That was a legendary performance! Thank you for proving that friendship is overrated.', 108808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! You\'ve pushed back the Naga and cleared out their Murloc slaves sufficiently! If you have any Timeworn Artifacts on you, bring them on by!', '', 108807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve cleared a path for you. You can escape if you hurry!', 'I\'ve cleared a path for you. You can escape if you hurry!', 108806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, keep your voice down!$b$bIf they catch me talking to you... they\'ll kill me!', 'Please, keep your voice down!$b$bIf they catch me talking to you... they\'ll kill me!', 108805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkbrul Arena is a place for the clans to challenge each other. Get in there and prove that the Stonedark and their allies are the toughest!', '', 108804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonicportal_green.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:111771|h[Demonic Gateway]|h|r to get past Ariden\'s barrier!', 'Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonicportal_green.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:111771|h[Demonic Portal]|h|r to get past Ariden\'s barrier!', 108803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $Gsir:madame;. Might I suggest you check out our new arrivals in the VIP room?', '', 108802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm, |5$r of your tastes might find our private selection in the back to your liking.', '', 108801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right this way, $GMister:Miss; $n.', '', 108800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your order\'s in the back room, $Gsir:madame;.', '', 108799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just mount the wee birdy here and follow me! To Stormheim!', '', 108798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something bit your head? That\'s all? Would you like me to kiss it for you?', 108797, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lay your insignia on the table.>', '<Lay your insignia on the table.>', 108796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar, what\'s wrong? What happened?', 108795, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you have available.', 'Show me what you have available.', 108794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can pay, I can supply.', '', 108793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something... bit my head I think.', '', 108792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW!! What in the light was that?!', '', 108791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carefully pluck a single strand of hair from Khadgar\'s head.', 'Carefully pluck a single strand of hair from Khadgar\'s head.', 108790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Judging by what you\'re asking for I assume you\'re an alchemist?$b$bAnd if that\'s true, isn\'t there some sort of invisibility potion you can brew? Skaggldrynk I believe it\'s called.$b$bHe\'ll never see you coming.', 108789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How in the light am I supposed to get a hair from an archmage?!', 'How in the light am I supposed to get a hair from an archmage?!', 108788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well why didn\'t you just say so to begin with? There aren\'t any guards around, we\'re perfectly safe to speak freely.', 108787, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, uh... well I\'m looking for some burettes?', 'Oh, uh... well I\'m looking for some burettes?', 108786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, but what does, \"Mum\" mean? Is there something you need?', 108785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mum.', 'Mum.', 108784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Point me to the nearest demon!', 'Point me to the nearest demon!', 108783, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty!', 'Reporting for duty!', 108782, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the gates!', 'Hold the gates!', 108781, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 108780, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir.', '', 108779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close ranks! We make our stand here!', '', 108778, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mage reinforcements from Stormwind! We fight as one!', '', 108777, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump on Azuregos\'s back to avoid |cFFFF0404|Hspell:209863|h[Force of Gravity]|h|r!', 'Jump on Azuregos\'s back to avoid |cFFFF0404|Hspell:209863|h[Force of Gravity]|h|r!', 108776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That beast is trying to take her soul! Hurry, we can still save her!', '', 108775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. The depths await!', '', 108774, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until our paths cross again.', '', 108773, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 63736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valeera said you would know where to meet her upon your return. Not wise to keep her waiting.', '', 108772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you made it. Well done!', '', 108771, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 63734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priest, perhaps you can use your magic to influence his mind... Trick him into snuffing out his own flame!', '', 108770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clever. He\'s absorbing the flame back into his body to become whole again.', '', 108769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This creature is using its own life essence to harm us! He dies a little more with every attack!', '', 108768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am your end!', 108767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you feel your mind slipping away?', 108766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The citadel has begun a self-destruct sequence. Make your way to the portal once you have the fangs!', '', 108765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join me... in the Nether...', 108764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No more games.', 108763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have broken entire worlds from the inside out. Azeroth will crumble!', 108762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mephistroth guide my hand! I will not fail!', 108761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel the fangs\' bite withering the flesh from your very bones?', 108760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us finish this once and for all.', 108759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! In the skies! More of our reinforcements! Hold strong!', '', 108758, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t never been formally trained, but I\'m sure this here pointy end means trouble.', '', 108757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of our crops were destroyed!', '', 108756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything I\'ve worked for... gone!', '', 108755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the Hill at all costs!', '', 108754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve taken the fields!', '', 108753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this, Grash!', 'Let\'s finish this, Grash!', 108752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snake witch powerful, but with Grash help kill!', '', 108751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do it!', 'Let\'s do it!', 108750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish-breath still alive.$b$bYou ready for fighting?', '', 108749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rokmora rears back for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:188169|h[Razor Shards]|h|r!', '', 108748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just soiled myself...', '', 108745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let that be a lesson they will not soon forget. Thank you, champion.', '', 108744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the sea giants wish to ally with the naga, then they have become our enemy. Champion, show them that the Highborne are not to be trifled with!', '', 108743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I commend your bravery, champion. The Nightwatchers will take care of their remaining forces. We are in your debt.', 108742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The audacity of these scaly cretins is truly limitless! Now they dare disgrace the city of Nar\'thalas with their presence? As a friend of the Nightwatchers, you must not let this stand!', 108741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the foul demons were behind it all! You have my thanks for foiling their scheme. Without the demons inciting them, the makrura threat should subside.', '', 108740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad enough that naga and demons invade our home... now these makrura plague our shores! We must find out what dark force is driving them to madness. Will you help?', '', 108739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should teach the naga to stay out of Azsuna! The citizens of Nar\'thalas owe you a debt of gratitude, $c, as do the Nightwatchers.', 108738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First the naga assault our city! Now it looks like they\'re trying to make off with our relics as well. Show them what it means to incur the wrath of the Nightwatchers, champion!', 108737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a dark task, but one that needed to be done. You have my gratitude, champion.', '', 108736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pains me to see my brethren reduced to such a state. There is nothing left for them now but hunger. Please, put them to rest.', '', 108735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! That should teach them not to tangle with the Nightwatchers!', 108734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These demons are even more persistent than the wretched naga! We must drive them back! My Nightwatchers will aid you.', 108733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Illidari freed, the demons\' threat is contained. You have done a great service to our land, champion.', '', 108732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons of Faronaar seek to bend the Illidari to their will. This must not be allowed to transpire!', '', 108731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fly, $n. Lightfeather is saddled and ready to go.', '', 108730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This book is unnatural to Priests and must be destroyed.', 'This book is unnatural to Priests and must be destroyed.', 108729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dedication to your holy Paladin order demands that you purify this fel taint.', 'Dedication to your holy Paladin order demands that you purify this fel taint.', 108728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a book. That floats. Why did the demons leave it here?\n\nIt looks sinister, but probably not worth your time.', 'It\'s a book. That floats. Why did the demons leave it here?\n\nIt looks sinister, but probably not worth your time.', 108727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a book. That floats. Why did the demons leave it here?', 'It\'s a book. That floats. Why did the demons leave it here?', 108726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ularogg enters the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198510|h[Stance of the Mountain]|h|r!', '', 108725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought I would someday long for the peace and quiet of the Maelstrom.', 108724, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us return to the others.', '', 108723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic stick!', '', 108722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel its power coursing through you, shaman. The waters that Azshara tried to turn against us are now yours to command.', '', 108721, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 60710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imps aren\'t ideal test subjects. They\'re easy enough to summon, but often too fragile for my experiments.', 108720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You can\'t just sneak up on someone like that. Not while this is going on!', '', 108719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should help to contain the spread of their corrupted... spirits. You have my thanks.', '', 108718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The specters here continue to concoct a wine so foul it serves only to poison the drinker. Azsuna would be better served with them gone.', '', 108717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will taste blood in your name!', 108716, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 63726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has it passed? I can\'t wait to warm up baked goods for our troops once this is all over.', '', 108715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who knows when this will end?', 108714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not foresee this...', '', 108712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see your future, mortal...', '', 108711, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brooch? Bah, I have bigger things to worry about than Lespin. Unfortunately for you, I no longer have the brooch.$b$bIt was stolen by Venlis Swiftsea, undoubtedly part of some plot to assassinate my reputation. It is a clever move, since now I cannot be seen near him.$b$bIf you were to go \"speak\" with him and recover the brooch, I think we would both benefit from this mess.', '', 108709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for your true test. Use the Fangs to dismantle Azeroth\'s kingdoms from within. Let their shattered husks pave our path to victory!', '', 108707, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fangs... their power is beyond comprehension! I am your humble servant, my lord!', 108706, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 63725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azhir manari kirel. Akim manari galar!', '', 108705, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well, Akaari. You have earned my blessing.', '', 108704, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 63727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, Lord of Flame! Welcome, Kil\'jaeden!', 108703, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 63724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She would say that, wouldn\'t she? Further proof that you can\'t trust a Fizzlebang!', '', 108702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lulubelle says you\'re to blame.', 'Lulubelle says you\'re to blame.', 108701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be quick! I wouldn\'t want us to be caught off guard while you\'re browsing my wares.', '', 108700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... not me. Definitely not me.\n\nLike I told the guards in Dalaran, it\'s probably the Fizzlebang girl. Just like her brother, always summoning a mess of demons she can\'t control.', '', 108699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello? Is anyone out there? I can\'t see...', '', 108698, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate betrays you mortal', '', 108697, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All answer to their fate.', '', 108696, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I already know your next move.', '', 108695, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will turn to ash.', '', 108694, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacrifices must be made.', '', 108693, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sight diminishes.', '', 108692, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as I foresaw it.', '', 108691, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to know the exact time and date of your death?', '', 108690, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see your future mortal.', '', 108689, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fates be damned! I cast my lot in with yours, champions. Go now, face Gul\'dan. I will aid you as best I can, and perhaps together we can save us all.', 108688, 0, 0, 691, 64, 0, 0, 79723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps you will win. And in saving your world, my people would be freed from the terrible bargain we were forced to make.', 108687, 0, 0, 485, 64, 0, 0, 79722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you defeat the Legion? Will you fail? Time eddies about you in fits and starts. Nothing is certain!', 108686, 0, 0, 691, 64, 0, 0, 79721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In all the possible futures I scryed, I did not foresee one in which you were victorious. I wonder...', 108685, 0, 0, 485, 64, 0, 0, 79720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I take no joy in this victory, but it was inevitable.', 108684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s... not possible! I... I was destined to win...', 108683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were destined to die.', 108682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An inevitable outcome.', 108681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just as I foretold.', 108680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is... slipping away! How can it be so?', 108679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time streams are mine to command! You cannot win!', 108678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time shifts again, and your doom draws near!', 108677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You exist in but a single moment. I am far less limited!', 108676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll find time can be quite volatile.', 108675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the waves of time crash over you!', 108674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I control the battlefield, not you!', 108673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time itself heeds my call!', 108672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you race through time? Or be trapped in an endless eternity?', 108671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The threads of time answer to me!', 108670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your timelines end here!', 108669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your deaths ensure the future of the Nightborne. Come forward, then. Let us speed you toward your fate.', 108668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58560, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I see a future where the Legion is victorious and my people endure. This is the thread that must be preserved. I will do everything in my power to make it so!', 108667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58559, 603, 0, 0, 9, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could not allow my people to starve, to waste away without its energies sustaining us. So a bargain was struck.', 108666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58558, 485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion\'s victory is inevitable. Every time stream shows it to be so. Had we resisted, they would have taken the Nightwell by force and left us bereft of it.', 108665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58557, 485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people faced a similar dilemma. I peered into all possible futures in search of an answer... and found only one.', 108664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58556, 25, 0, 0, 7, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I foresaw your coming, of course. The threads of fate that led you to this place. Your desperate attempt to stop the Legion.', 108663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58555, 457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop, please! I\'ll pen a confession, assuming you didn\'t break my writing hand...', '', 108662, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for us, we should get back to Dalaran. I\'ll meet ye there!', '', 108661, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was my honor to serve. I must go to Netherlight Temple and inform the Conclave of our success. Good luck.', '', 108660, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for yer help, Tahu. I won\'t forget this!', '', 108659, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet you at Krasus\' Landing. We can take my gryphon down to the island.', '', 108658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m coming with you, $n. You helped one of my men, so it\'s only fitting that I return the favor.', '', 108657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to your rest, and be disgraced no more.', '', 108656, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will finish what ye started.', '', 108655, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems you compel me to answer... My journey took me to Stormheim, to a tomb of warrior kings.', '', 108654, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve read yer saga. Where did ye find the shield?', '', 108653, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I died to ease the pain of my failure. Why do you disturb me?', '', 108652, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 63284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get to it!', '', 108651, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will begin the ritual. Focus your will upon the spirit while our friend keeps us safe.', '', 108650, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the next step?', '', 108649, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have found you... and you have found the grave.', '', 108648, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel Magic reacts violently to your spell!', 'The Fel Magic reacts violently to your spell!', 108647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want? I have few friends in these dark days. I am prepared to defend myself!', '', 108646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s just inside. Please, do whatever you can to save him.', '', 108645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Progress is slow, but steady. I will be back in the good graces of the courts soon, and it is all thanks to you.', '', 108644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you are. Now, run along.', 108643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions...?', '', 108642, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come minions, aid me in battle against this accuser!', '', 108641, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lespin wants his brooch back.', 'Lespin wants his brooch back.', 108640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, this will be sufficient. Now let me see that silk of yours.', 108639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crimes? The only thing I am guilty of is being the most powerful warlock in all of Azeroth!', '', 108638, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are your draughts.', 'Here are your draughts.', 108637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you brought me my draughts?', 108636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How fortuitous! A fellow tailor!$b$bWelcome to the leyweavers\' guild of Suramar. Perhaps you have heard of us?', 108635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, leyweaver. What can I do for you?', 108634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confess your crimes!', 'Confess your crimes!', 108633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are of no interest to me. I come from an accomplished lineage of Suramar tailors. You, obviously, do not.', 108632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare request such a menial task from me? Surely you must be joking.$b$bYou\'re not? I see. Well, I have been away from Suramar for some time now and from the look of you, I take it you\'re an alchemist, yes?$b$bI\'d be willing to trade my services with you for a price that I deem is fair.$b$bI long for an Ysera\'s Dream Draught. It\'s an ancient elven drink. To concoct it, you\'ll need some dreamleaf as well as the leaves of a Dreamer\'s Tear.$b$bOne grows not to far from here in the clearing of some ruins. Take my flask, make this drink for me, and I\'ll do as you ask.', 108631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who summoned all these imps?', 'Who summoned all these imps?', 108630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, warlock? Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 108629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it\'s not too much trouble, could you mend this cloth for me?', 'If it\'s not too much trouble, could you mend this cloth for me?', 108627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms!', 'To arms!', 108626, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for idle chatter, $n.', '', 108625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those tendrils are using dark magic to become immune to attack. Interrupt their casting so you can strike!', '', 108624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find somewhere safe! I\'ll find you when this is over.', 108623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to Dalaran.', 'I\'d like to travel to Dalaran.', 108622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My beasts have been blessed by the Light to enhance their speed and agility. You\'ll not find a swifter ride.', '', 108621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A leyweaver from Suramar came through here not too long ago. I believe she headed east towards the Sylvan Falls.', 108620, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you happen to know of a tailor in these parts?', 'Would you happen to know of a tailor in these parts?', 108619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why yes, we do. There\'s some on that chest over there. But we\'re in short supply, so please don\'t take too much.', 108618, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for some Shaldorei Silk. Do you have any to spare?', 'I\'m looking for some Shaldorei Silk. Do you have any to spare?', 108617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you in need of healing?', 108616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone foul beast!', '', 108615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 108614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light give me strength!', '', 108613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find them. Akaari will not be disturbed!', '', 108612, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye made it! This land haunts me still... so much pain and death. Well, let\'s get on with it.', '', 108611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63277, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You asked the Sunwalkers for aid, and I have come. May my presence bring success to your quest, Orik.', '', 108610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63279, 0, 1, 1, 0, 2, 2, 0, 39653),
('The tower in the middle o\' Dalaran has a portal to Wyrmrest Temple. Should get ye most o\' the way there. Tahu, thanks again fer helping us paladins.', '', 108609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63278, 0, 1, 1, 0, 2, 2, 0, 39653),
('Even my most loyal vrykul dare not enter the mists for fear of their souls. I commend your bravery, mortal.', '', 108608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, a great malevolence has risen in the mists. Gather your most powerful allies and meet the kvaldir in battle!', '', 108607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanted to speak with you about a gem design.', 'I wanted to speak with you about a gem design.', 108606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you again! I cannot thank you enough for what you did, dear.$b$bI am already hearing good things about the new jeweler. Perhaps I should pay him a visit and get a new piece commissioned...', 108605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, what is it? I am very busy planning my next gala.', 108604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone glows brightly, this is the correct grave!', 'The stone glows brightly, this is the correct grave!', 108603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Concentrating', 'Concentrating', 108602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone grows dull, this is the wrong grave. A relative probably.', 'The stone grows dull, this is the wrong grave. A relative probably.', 108601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I misjudged how long ago this happened. I will need more time to prepare myself for the ritual.$b$bIn the meantime, I have attuned this stone to the scroll Orik brought. Certain graves will glow to your mind\'s eye. Go to them and concentrate on the stone to see if you have found the correct grave. We want the writer himself, not a descendent or ancestor.', '', 108600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orik says you can speak to these spirits, how do we begin?', 'Orik says you can speak to these spirits, how do we begin?', 108599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I greet you, $n. I am glad to help.', '', 108598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barrem!', '', 108597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion ships on the horizon! All forces to Sentinel Hill!', '', 108596, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 64733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead now.', '', 108595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then... I guess... I guess we\'re done talking here.', '', 108594, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agraaahh!!', '', 108593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tell you NOTHING!', 108592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over, Zithreen! Tell us... what did Azshara plan to do with this realm?', '', 108591, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 60702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not suffer Helya\'s minions to gain territory unfought. Your loyalty shall be rewarded.', '', 108590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Among the souls you have rescued, there are some who wish to regain their honor fighting alongside you against the kvaldir.', '', 108589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I need fresh air!', '', 108588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill them, you fools! I will not be denied my destiny!', 108587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is your best chance to eliminate the Grand Magistrix. Good luck!', 108586, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 70449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done well so far, but we must ensure you blend in at the party. I\'ll enhance your disguise, infusing it with latent magic to make you appear as one of the nobles.', 108585, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 70450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll take a side entrance to the grounds... too many eyes are watching the front.', 108584, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 70448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our spies report that Elisande herself will attend. This presents a rare opportunity to catch her away from her source of power.', 108583, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 70447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your arrival is fortuitous. Tonight, the nobles have gathered in honor of the Grand Magistrix.', 108582, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 70446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send a signal to Ly\'leth Lunastre.', 'Send a signal to Ly\'leth Lunastre.', 108581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This lantern appears to have been slightly modified. It must be the one you need to use to send a signal.', 'This lantern appears to have been slightly modified. It must be the one you need to use to send a signal.', 108580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the signal lantern to alert Ly\'leth Lunastre of your arrival.', 'Use the signal lantern to alert Ly\'leth Lunastre of your arrival.', 108579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fangs are within your grasp!', '', 108578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It should be enough to fool the other guests, but stay clear of the guards.', '', 108577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find Ly\'leth. You stay out of trouble.', '', 108576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanted masks. Simply don the mask, and a magical costume will envelop your body.', '', 108575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall use the garden entrance.', '', 108574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'m a druid and... well... I\'m kind of stuck like this for a while.$b$bWhile patrolling the sea around the Broken Shore, an infernal crashed into the water right on top of me. The blast instantly knocked me unconscious.\n$b$bWhen I woke I was here in the care of the nurses. They say after a few days I should have the strength to shift back. In the meantime, I\'m stuck in this contraption to keep me from drying out.\n$b$bDo me a favor. Don\'t mention this to any of the other druids. They\'ll never let me live it down!', '', 108573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this...', 'Not like this...', 108572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re you lookin\' at? Ain\'t ye ever seen a sea lion before?', '', 108571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s give them a moment to regroup and prepare, $n.\n\nWhen they\'re ready, speak with me again, and I\'ll throw you into the arena to get this fight started.', '', 108570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAHHHHHHHHhhhh...!', '', 108569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, $p, talk with Sternfathom. Let\'s get this fight started!', '', 108568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On this day, the mother tree is reborn! G\'Hanir is whole once more!', 108567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirits of the forest! Guardians of nature! Hear our plea!', 108566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the fog of battle clears, and the Burning Legion is defeated, we shall stand victorious!', '', 108565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The armies of Skywall shall stand shoulder to shoulder with the mortal races in battle against the Burning Legion.', '', 108564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen well, Farseer... I will aid the Earthen Ring for now.', '', 108563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightmare is inescapable.', 108562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will devour you and take the Staff of Four Winds for myself!', '', 108561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish shaman! You really think that Thunderaan can save your world?', '', 108560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone mortals! The time of the Windlords has passed!', '', 108559, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 67016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last... the long dream comes.', 108558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give yourself over, as I did.', 108557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A priest! Thank the Light!', '', 108556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one resists the Nightmare!', 108555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fail to amuse me.', '', 108554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And foxflower flourishes all around Highmountain. Good luck, $r.', '', 108553, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find a pumpkin patch at the Rivermane\'s camp. Choose the ripest ones for their juice.', '', 108552, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May your hunt be ever fruitful, my sister.', 108551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our efforts were not in vain. The Moonwhisper Matriarch watches from afar.', 108550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed.', 'Agreed.', 108548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ask for my help, yet you have nothing to offer in return, $r. If that\'s the case, then perhaps you can do my tribe a favor.$b$bIt\'s been years since we\'ve tasted the Rivermane\'s brew. Their remedy is known to have revitalizing powers and it does wonders for the teeth. And fortunately I happen to know how to brew it.$b$bI\'ll give you my mortar and pestle, along with the recipe for creating the remedy. You bring back enough for my tribe and I\'ll fix your flask.$b$bAgreed?', '', 108547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silverfang lets out a low, passive growl.', '', 108546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silverfang deposits a shiny, smooth Nightsaber Fang onto the dirt.', '', 108545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you be able to repair this flask for me?', 'Would you be able to repair this flask for me?', 108544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Startalon dips her head in silent thanks and takes to the skies once more.', '', 108542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Startalon settles and tucks her head under her wing for a moment. She straightens again and offers a dry owl talon out to Mayruna.', '', 108541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I should clear away this mess and make room for the new instruments.', '', 108540, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh green food grows and your enemies are fewer. We seek only your blessing in return.', '', 108539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears as though we have arrived, $n. Let us see what Celestos would have us do next.', '', 108538, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Redhoof carefully digs into the soil with a hoof.', '', 108537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always suspected something was amiss with you.', '', 108526, 0, 39512, 0, 64, 0, 66067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had such high hopes for you. An amateur merchant believes that a partner is a valuably ally. A master knows that they are competition and a liability.', '', 108525, 0, 38122, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Flash of Light to heal your wounds.', '', 108523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Divine Shield protected you from the mage\'s first attack, but the second attack has left you wounded.', '', 108522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yowlon purrs quietly.', '', 108520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe my brother Mardranel is prepared to accompany you. Thank you for your help, friend.', 108518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who needs henchmen? I\'ll burn you myself!', 108517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will amuse me to watch you melt!', 108516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m feeling positively radiant!', 108515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mortal flesh... so pretty when it burns!', 108514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! You bought my agents enough time to secure almost all of their Arcwine.', 108513, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You! Have a look over there!', 108512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A great banquet will be held tonight for the city\'s nobles. The chef is having all the Arcwine reserves brought to his kitchen. We need you to distract him while we \"liberate\" as much of it as we can.', 108511, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you waiting for? Check out that noise!', 108510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make yourself useful and take a look around!', 108509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like I have a roast to prepare!', 108508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My funeral pyre... will be... glorious...', 108507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More kindling for the bonfire!', 108506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scorched bones... so delightful!', 108505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not very clever of you to challenge all of us!', 108504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will devour your flesh until nothing remains...', '', 108503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RRAAAUUUGHHHH!', '', 108502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE WILDS TREMBLE BEFORE MY FURY!', '', 108501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL FLATTEN YOU LIKE SAPLINGS!', '', 108500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Watcher\'s gift is mine once more! No... not mine... it belongs to the Nightmare.', '', 108499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have released me from the Nightmare. The Claws... have served you well...', '', 108498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sacred gift from the Watchers! Yes, Nightmare Lord... yes... the fury of the Claws must be mine once more!', '', 108497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare consumes me... compels me... to serve... to kill!', '', 108496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome the embrace of the twisting dark.', '', 108495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end is inevitable.', '', 108494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is only the beginning.', '', 108493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Divine Shield to make yourself temporarily invulnerable to all damage!', '', 108492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will face many dangerous situations, and preparation can be the key to your survival.', '', 108491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay where you are!', '', 108490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Basely done... cowards!', '', 108489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will even the odds!', '', 108488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need reinforcements!', '', 108486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A job well done!', '', 108485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My watch... is ended.', '', 108484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just what you deserved!', '', 108483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should teach you!', '', 108482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise to protect you, Grash. Smash your way inside!', 'I promise to protect you, Grash. Smash your way inside!', 108481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No trespassers allowed!', '', 108480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The snake witch. She is inside.$b$bGrash is... afraid.$b$bThe snake witch will try to control Grash with her magic stick.', '', 108479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to recheck the recipe.', '', 108478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smells awful.', '', 108477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone is a critic.', '', 108476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have superior ingredients!', '', 108475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I herald your endless torment.', '', 108474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of the kitchen!', '', 108473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can\'t take the heat...', '', 108472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot work in these conditions!', '', 108471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally. Now, back to my preparations.', '', 108470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must get back to my cooking!', '', 108469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing in here? Can\'t you see I am busy preparing meals that will astonish and delight!', '', 108468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They came outta nowhere! Mind lending me a hand?', 108467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! Please...', 108466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I\'m alive! By the Light, I live again!', 108465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can escape my gaze...', '', 108464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time, $n. We have all that we need to resurrect Prince Thunderaan. We must hurry.', '', 108463, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements here are in a state of total chaos... they require a Windlord to guide them.', '', 108462, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Staff of Four Winds is almost complete. We must move swiftly, much is at stake.', '', 108461, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You too will be guided, Farseer. You need only listen.', '', 108460, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was in my darkest hour, that the elements called out to me.', '', 108459, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was a time when I wandered the wastes of my world, hopeless and broken.', '', 108458, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dark times, $n, but you must never lose hope.', '', 108457, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', 'Thanks!', 108456, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should continue onward with great haste!', '', 108455, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart of Skywall holds the power to recharge the blade.', '', 108454, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must unite the elements to our cause... else our worlds share the same fate.', '', 108453, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Burning Legion invaded Draenor, I failed to save my people... to save my home.', '', 108452, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not envy you, $n. To lead our order through this crisis must weigh heavily on your shoulders.', '', 108451, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get out while you still can!', 108450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen nothing like it on my own world. I wonder if such a place exists beyond Azeroth?', '', 108449, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xirus is here. Run!', '', 108448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('An entire plane of existence, dedicated to the element of Air. It is truly wondrous...', '', 108447, 0, 0, 669, 64, 0, 67002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! He comes...', '', 108446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xirus, deal with them. We have nearly made contact.', 108445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mistress! The prisoner has escaped!', '', 108444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Psst. Table behind the house. Lady Ly\'leth is waiting for you.', 'Psst. Table behind the house. Lady Ly\'leth is waiting for you.', 108443, 0, 39476, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you might be selling something I\'m looking for...', 'I hear you might be selling something I\'m looking for...', 108442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tideskorn earned their name the day the mists took their greatest harbor. Since then, no vrykul loyal to Odyn has willingly entered that cursed place.', 108441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again the accursed mists creep in from the sea. Venture forth and vanquish the kvaldir there before their darkness spreads further.', 108440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come to visit ol\' Scowling Rosa, have you?$B$BWhat can I do for you hun?', 108439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bag_10_red.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:185438|h[Pick Pocket]|h|r to escape!', '', 108438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That jailer presents an opportunity for your escape.', '', 108437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move out, armies of Kil\'jaeden! Glory awaits!', 108436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never board one of my ships, demon! Not while I\'m alive!', '', 108435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t say it again! Get... off... my... dock!', '', 108434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman, lead Grash forward. He can act as a breakwater for us.', '', 108433, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 60695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zithreen is trying to crush us beneath the waves!', 108432, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 60694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a true alpha.', '', 108431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread lightly, lest you prefer to be my beast\'s dinner.', '', 108430, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies will feel the fangs\' agonizing bite! They will all perish!', 108429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourselves, minions. Our lord requires us on the field of battle.', 108428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $pc. I am Stellagosa.', 108427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO ONE can be allowed to become a Felsworn traitor working for the Legion.', 108426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wet!', '', 108425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skywall is truly a wondrous place, $n. I have seen nothing like it in all my life.', '', 108424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eyir has taken notice of your deeds. Be careful to not disappoint.', '', 108423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ancient stones have not been animated in eons. Once again you must be tested. Place your hand on the stone and prepare.', '', 108422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you deliver the letter, please give Prin... King Anduin my condolences.', '', 108421, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! When this is over you\'ll have to come back and fish sometime!', '', 108420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put on a proper costume or I will have you thrown out.', 'Put on a proper costume or I will have you thrown out.', 108419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of costume is THAT? I cannot be seen with you.', 'What kind of costume is THAT? I cannot be seen with you.', 108418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A full-body outlander transformation? Ghastly.', 'A full-body outlander transformation? Ghastly.', 108417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send reinforcements north of Crossroads! Tower\'s under attack! We\'re surrounded!', '', 108416, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take them to the holding cell. Lord Kil\'jaeden will be most pleased.', 108415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!', 108414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were dead the moment you arrived here.', 108413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to keep up.', 108412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who let you in here?', 'Who let you in here?', 108411, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scandalous!', 'Scandalous!', 108410, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm. Yes. Fascinating.', 'Hm. Yes. Fascinating.', 108409, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This conversation is boring me.', 'This conversation is boring me.', 108408, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, the Magistrix has spies everywhere.', 'You know, the Magistrix has spies everywhere.', 108407, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious...', 'Curious...', 108406, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuse me while I pretend we never met.', 'Excuse me while I pretend we never met.', 108405, 0, 39475, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowgore Stalker perks up!', '', 108404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowgore Stalker\'s hairs bristle.', '', 108403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowgore Stalker sniffs the air excitedly.', '', 108402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowgore Stalker growls.', '', 108401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I heard something.', 'I thought I heard something.', 108400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reveal yourself.', 'Reveal yourself.', 108399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm?', 'Hmm?', 108398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that?', 'What was that?', 108397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if we tried not watching the world burn? Just for once, to see if we like it.', 'What if we tried not watching the world burn? Just for once, to see if we like it.', 108396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there nobody left who will stand up to Elisande?', 'Is there nobody left who will stand up to Elisande?', 108395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Just wink a lot.>', '<Just wink a lot.>', 108394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you do, fellow Nightborne?', 'How do you do, fellow Nightborne?', 108393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can we be free in the Legion\'s shadow?', 'How can we be free in the Legion\'s shadow?', 108392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlocks are not known to be trustworthy. What if Gul\'dan betrays us?', 'Warlocks are not known to be trustworthy. What if Gul\'dan betrays us?', 108391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Scoff.> Demons. Am I right? <Roll your eyes.>', '<Scoff.> Demons. Am I right? <Roll your eyes.>', 108390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did anyone ever find Thalyssra\'s body?', 'Did anyone ever find Thalyssra\'s body?', 108389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick - my costume looks more elegant in motion.', 'Make it quick - my costume looks more elegant in motion.', 108388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sigh.>$B$BI thought for sure I would have the most exotic costume this time, but it seems I have been outdone once again.', '<Sigh.>$B$BI thought for sure I would have the most exotic costume this time, but it seems I have been outdone once again.', 108387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... an outlander costume beneath your normal costume?$B$BGenius!', 'Is that... an outlander costume beneath your normal costume?$B$BGenius!', 108386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Security here is much tighter since the barrier went down. We cannot just let in any riff-raff, now can we?', 'Security here is much tighter since the barrier went down. We cannot just let in any riff-raff, now can we?', 108385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite the... unique... costume you have there.', 'Quite the... unique... costume you have there.', 108384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, I heard someone else came as an owl.$B$BWell, ONE OF US will have to change...', 'Ugh, I heard someone else came as an owl.$B$BWell, ONE OF US will have to change...', 108383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my costume IS the most fabulous. Thank you for noticing.$B$BIt hardly matters that I cannot move.', 'Yes, my costume IS the most fabulous. Thank you for noticing.$B$BIt hardly matters that I cannot move.', 108382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell myself I will socialize at these parties, but I always end up lingering about the desserts.', 'I tell myself I will socialize at these parties, but I always end up lingering about the desserts.', 108381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The estate is gorgeous, is it not? Simply walking the grounds brings me peace.', 'The estate is gorgeous, is it not? Simply walking the grounds brings me peace.', 108380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To be a monk is to strive for harmony and balance. There is no one better to lead us than you, $n.', 'To be a monk is to strive for harmony and balance. There is no one better to lead us than you, $n.', 108379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot give up the fight, Master. I trust your judgment completely.', 'We cannot give up the fight, Master. I trust your judgment completely.', 108378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our efforts are going to pay off, I know it.', 'Our efforts are going to pay off, I know it.', 108377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you off to today, Master?', 'Where are you off to today, Master?', 108376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Order of the Broken Temple will survive under your leadership. It must...', 'The Order of the Broken Temple will survive under your leadership. It must...', 108375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, Master. You put us all in good spirits.', 'It is good to see you, Master. You put us all in good spirits.', 108374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone is worried about the Legion, but we believe in you, Master.', 'Everyone is worried about the Legion, but we believe in you, Master.', 108373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
