('', 'Akaari retreated upstairs as we arrived. She\'s all yours.', 108197, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 63750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All clear, $p.', 108196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lounge is secure, $p.', 108195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Four brothers. Each raised a hand in slaying his father. Each raised a hand in slaying each other. And so Skovald became king, for his blade was the fastest.', 108194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The three fallen brothers of God-King Skovald have arisen. Find them, champion, and remind them why they should stay dead.', 108193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the greatest of the Valkyra are worthy of Eyir\'s gift.', 108192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I go to face my destiny...', 108191, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir... guide me to your side.', 108190, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Akaari... your time has come.', 108189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall stain this ground with your blood.', 108188, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall claim the honor of your death.', 108187, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us have a glorious battle.', 108186, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent... you will find Akaari in the Legerdemain Lounge.', '', 108185, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Hand the Rune of Portals to Val\'zuun.>', '<Hand the Rune of Portals to Val\'zuun.>', 108184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! Know that you face Bretta, the herald of your doom.', 108183, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wards detected someone entering the study. Find them at once!', 108182, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are!', 'There you are!', 108181, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard it, too, Archmage. I will expel them at once!', '', 108180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I definitely heard something. Don\'t worry, Archmage, I\'ll find them!', 108179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Celindra must not be disturbed!', 'Archmage Celindra must not be disturbed!', 108178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reveal yourself!', 'Reveal yourself!', 108177, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I go... to the halls... of valor.', 108171, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lespin is reaching the end of his usefulness, I think. You would be wise to be careful.', '', 108170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Ah, what a beautiful perch. A perfect replacement for the broken one.', '', 108169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have something for me, yes?', '', 108168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Borrowing\'', '\'Borrowing\'', 108167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a lovely day.', '', 108166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My birds sing such lovely songs.', '', 108165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are those among the Valkyra who wish to test you in single combat. Go to Skold-Ashil and face them in battle. None shall attack until you strike the first blow.', 108164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen Anastae\'s newest coat. Tell me, are you going to be getting more pelts? I will pay you more than what you are currently making running errands for Lespin.', '', 108163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, my gold pin is here. After all, an illustrious official deserves an equally illustrious badge of office, does he not?', '', 108162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am busier now than I have been in almost ten thousand years. What do you want with me?', '', 108161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it quick. The seas wait for no one.', '', 108160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Millennia without so much as a barge to log, and now I am up to my ears in manifests and shipping records.', '', 108159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir! Witness my deeds as I slice down this so-called champion.', 108158, 0, 39396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have your package from Lespin.', 'I have your package from Lespin.', 108157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sparring partner Naltethis told me what you did. You would make a good soldier.', 108156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, the diamond stabilizers we commissioned. Maybe now the power conduits will stop shorting out.', 108155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'State your business, or move along. I am expecting someone.', 108154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, citizen?', 108153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The captain will have my head if I do not return soon...', 108152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] You are about to drop Poop, get out of the raid!', '', 108151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory in battle!', '', 108150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! Bring me more to rip apart!', '', 108149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torn by claws!', '', 108148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am disgraced.', '', 108147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Bears prove to be the strongest once again!', '', 108146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bjorn! Bless me with savagery!', '', 108145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looting', 'Looting', 108144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay in the shadows to avoid detection. The Kirin Tor are no fools.', 108143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory in battle!', '', 108142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! Bring me more to crush!', '', 108141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crushed under hoof!', '', 108140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am disgraced.', '', 108139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Musken prove to be the strongest once again!', '', 108138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Musken! Bless me with fortitude!', '', 108137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been detected!', 'You\'ve been detected!', 108136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bears will rend the flesh from your bones!', '', 108135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Musken will trample your bones to dust!', '', 108134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Judgment on this target dummy.', '', 108133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a retribution paladin you are a stalwart protector of the weak, a bringer of punishment to the unjust!', '', 108132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 59973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Oshenko fella\' is always using \"screwdrivers\" on his screws. Hasn\'t he ever heard of a hammer?', '', 108131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... you didn\'t see any nuclear bombs on your way in, did you? No? Alright, I\'ll keep looking.', '', 108130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t exploded anybody yet today. It\'s a good day!', '', 108129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yes, I know the one. It should be on one of the shelves upstairs. Feel free.', '', 108128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard you might have a tome I\'m looking for.', 'I heard you might have a tome I\'m looking for.', 108127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not think... the future will be so easy.', '', 108126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you don\'t have any leylight shards on you, I\'m afraid I can\'t finish the ritual.$b$bMaybe you left some in your bank?', 108125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you upstairs in Glorious Goods when you\'re done. Another one of Khadgar\'s dogs has been nosing around, asking too many questions...', 108124, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re finally closing in on her after all these years...', 108123, 0, 39370, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will remove a |cFF0070dd|Hitem:124441:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:90:0|h[Leylight Shard]|h|r from your inventory. Are you sure?', 'This will remove a |cFF0070dd|Hitem:124441:0:0:0:0:0:0:0:90:0|h[Leylight Shard]|h|r from your inventory. Are you sure?', 108122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, care for some Moist Azsunian Feta while you\'re here? It has a lovely tangy flavor!', '', 108121, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing to share, I\'m afraid. The wine gets people talking, but sometimes they just don\'t have anything useful to say.', '', 108120, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows reveal.', 'The shadows reveal.', 108119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your latest wares.', 'Show me your latest wares.', 108118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I carry only the highest quality products.', '', 108117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was beginning to doubt you would come.', '', 108116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can not avoid annihilation.', '', 108115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to nothing.', '', 108114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lespin wants his sculpture back.', 'Lespin wants his sculpture back.', 108113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Mornath, a collector of fine arts and collectibles. Would you like to see my statue collection?', '', 108112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are here to see my most prized possession, I am afraid that I have it locked away.$b$bI might bring it out in a hundred years or so. Would you like to make an appointment?', '', 108111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! Are you here to see my exquisite collection?', '', 108110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We go to the Temple of Elune. Ash\'alah will carry you this once. Prepare yourself.', 108109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We go to the Temple of Elune. We will ride more swiftly on Ash\'alah\'s back. Are you ready to depart?', 108108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until then, our business is complete.', '', 108107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63741, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gladly tell you where... in exchange for a rune of portals.', '', 108106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63740, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akaari is in this very city as we speak, spying for her masters.', '', 108105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63739, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. It is a horrid duty, but this work is essential for our survival.', 108104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fate is on your side.', '', 108103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those creatures over there are empowered by ancient mana. It is awful to ask this of you, but I need you to dispatch them and siphon their energy.', 108102, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to the matter at hand.', 'Let\'s get back to the matter at hand.', 108101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars have judged you, and found you wanting.', '', 108100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I provide information that no other can.$B$BThat is all you need to know.', '', 108099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I cannot control... the void... it comes!', '', 108098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the beings who will devour the future you so futilely fight to protect!', '', 108097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avatars of non-existence... knowing nothing but hunger.', '', 108096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well... witness what I have seen, and TREMBLE!', '', 108095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that not enough? Must I show you the true horror of our reality?', '', 108094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What meager petulance. I expected more from you.', '', 108093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you exactly?', 'What are you exactly?', 108092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Held to the majesty of the stars, you are nothing - less than nothing.', '', 108091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could we hope to resist? Can you?!', '', 108090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion. Slayers of whole worlds.', '', 108089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows reveal.', 'The shadows reveal.', 108088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to this lawless place?', '', 108087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done well this day, champion. May the Twisting Nether be filled with the lamentations of your enemies.', 108086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons continue to march on the Gates of the Valor. Your aid is required.', 108085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Backstab on this target dummy. Attacking from behind inflicts more damage.', '', 108084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $p. As a subtlety rogue you specialize in striking from the shadows, dispatching foes quickly and quietly. Let\'s begin your training with your primary attack, Backstab.', '', 108083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meddling... whelp...', '', 108082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are everywhere. We are Legion.', '', 108081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe deep of its spores. As a Druid, you are attuned to nature and can recognize this flower\'s beneficial properties.', 'Breathe deep of its spores. As a Druid, you are attuned to nature and can recognize this flower\'s beneficial properties.', 108080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Picking the flower just here should release invigorating spores. You know this because you studied Herbalism and know about plant things.', 'Picking the flower just here should release invigorating spores. You know this because you studied Herbalism and know about plant things.', 108079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We shall meet again, $n. May Elune guide our paths.', 108078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing here.', 'There\'s nothing here.', 108077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To think I would live to see such profane use of runic magic. It saddens my heart.', '', 108076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inkbinders have lost their way! They forget the true purpose of our runic magic traditions. They must be stopped before they pervert these customs further.', '', 108075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Search the body for clues.>', '<Search the body for clues.>', 108074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Desmond seems to have crossed someone he shouldn\'t have.', '', 108073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This glowing flower very distinctly stands out. It looks to have been meticulously cared for by someone with great horticultural skills.\n\nProbably best to leave this one to someone more in tune with nature.', 'This glowing flower very distinctly stands out. It looks to have been meticulously cared for by someone with great horticultural skills.\n\nProbably best to leave this one to someone more in tune with nature.', 108072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better you taught them their place is in this life now than delude themselves further.', '', 108071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These new challengers seek to complete the trials you have bested. Show them how a true champion fights!', '', 108070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This glowing flower very distinctly stands out. It looks to have been meticulously cared for by someone with great horticultural skills.', 'This glowing flower very distinctly stands out. It looks to have been meticulously cared for by someone with great horticultural skills.', 108069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to begin the ritual?', 'Are you ready to begin the ritual?', 108068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 108067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to begin the encounter?', 'Are you sure you want to begin the encounter?', 108066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not overextend yourself. The time will come when Helya will face Odyn\'s full wrath. But until then, you have weakened her forces.', 108065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 108064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, once again we must ask that you go where we cannot follow. Helya\'s forces must be weakened if we are to prevail.', 108063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to leave?', 108062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should go. There\'s nothing left for us here. Let me know when you\'re ready to leave and I\'ll take us back to our bodies in the normal world.', 108061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did it, $n! You got him!', 108060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must go attend to my prize. Malithar, I leave the claws to you. Use them to exterminate this filth.', '', 108059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your allies have fallen! The ritual has failed!', 'Your allies have fallen! The ritual has failed!', 108058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is finished! The claws are ours!', 108057, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 69748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In times like these, everyone must get their hands dirty.', '', 108056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s bark begins to splinter!', '', 108055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must keep these catacombs clear. Not all of us are strong enough to use the portals and must resort to other means of travel, unsettling though they may be.', '', 108054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 108053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us! We will kill the \"snake witch\" and take this \"magic stick!\"', 'Join us! We will kill the \"snake witch\" and take this \"magic stick!\"', 108052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are looking for a shaman. Have you seen her?', 'We are looking for a shaman. Have you seen her?', 108051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seek a magic stick! What does it look like?', 'We seek a magic stick! What does it look like?', 108050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this snake witch?', 'Who is this snake witch?', 108049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will kill snake witch?$b$bYou will take away magic stick?$b$bYes! Grash will help!', '', 108048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sha-man? Like, little one who speaks to water and storms? $b$bYes, Grash has seen her. She fights the snake witch and loses.$b$bSnake witch keeps her alive. Says stupid people will come for her.$b$bHa hah! Snake witch is the dumb one. No one stupid enough to come for shaman lady.', '', 108047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grash frowns.>$b$bMagic stick is very old. Very powerful. It is made of living water.$b$bSnake witch says the magic stick came from her queen. It speaks to the sea. Sea monsters obey the stick. It heals their wounds.$b$bStick fill the heads of giants with dark and pain. The dark comes from the witch, not the stick.', '', 108046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She calls herself \"Lady Zithreen.\" She has many snakes. Snakes who follow her. Snakes on her face.$b$bShe claims water throne for her queen, using magic stick.', '', 108045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Grash, son of Gralashar.$b$bThe snake witch controls us with magic stick. Those who fight she takes away to kill.$b$bHave you come to kill snake witch?', '', 108044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other spiders seem wary of this one.', '', 108043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard your call for aid, great one. Are there any teeny lil\' fuzzy animals in danger? Oh! Oh my!', 108041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Gul\'dan.', 'I want to teleport to Gul\'dan.', 108040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Grand Magistrix Elisande.', 'I want to teleport to Grand Magistrix Elisande.', 108039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Krosus.', 'I want to teleport to Krosus.', 108038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to High Botanist Tel\'arn.', 'I want to teleport to High Botanist Tel\'arn.', 108037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Astromancer Etraeus.', 'I want to teleport to Astromancer Etraeus.', 108036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kayn, I need to return to the Black Temple.', 'Kayn, I need to return to the Black Temple.', 108035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Tichondrius.', 'I want to teleport to Tichondrius.', 108034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Spellblade Aluriel.', 'I want to teleport to Spellblade Aluriel.', 108033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Trilliax.', 'I want to teleport to Trilliax.', 108032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Chronomatic Anomaly.', 'I want to teleport to Chronomatic Anomaly.', 108031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Crystal Scorpion.', 'I want to teleport to Crystal Scorpion.', 108030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sacred peak is for hunters alone.$bTurn back, or the eagle spirit will carry you away!', 'This sacred peak is for hunters alone.$bTurn back, or the eagle spirit will carry you away!', 108029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Suramar Palace!\n\nI can teleport you directly to any bosses that are currently available for testing.', '', 108028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... um... misplaced that crystal thing you gave me. Do you have another?', 'I... um... misplaced that crystal thing you gave me. Do you have another?', 108027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, friend.', '', 108026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fluke! A mishap! Someone of my station does not lose to a commoner with such boorish manners. Tell no one of this encounter.', '', 108025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meeting me must be overwhelming. Understandable... the low-born are often stricken dumb in my presence. Luckily for you, I am feeling charitable and will honor you with a battle.', '', 108024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, mighty Ursoc!', 108023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69747, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Ursoc, I merely returned the claws to their rightful place; a place where their power would not be abused.', 108022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We humbly request your aid. The power of your claws could defeat our enemies once and for all.', 108021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Ursoc, the Burning Legion has returned. $n is our best hope to drive back the Legion AND the Nightmare, but we must have the claws if we are to succeed!', 108020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you, druids. These abominations of Nightmare are relentless! They will stop at nothing to snatch the claws from my lair.', '', 108019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'H-help! I can\'t hold... on...', 108018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Augghhh!!', 108017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is too much to bear!', 108016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t... hold... anymore...', 108015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warrior of the Horde! To me! I have found something!', 108014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot tell where his voice is coming from! Search the buildings to the west! Now! I will scour the east for signs of him!', 108013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These hoofprints follow the path to the left. After them, quickly!', 108012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot discern between a victory or a sacrifice.', '', 108011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unfortunate miscalculation.', '', 108010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting, show me more.', '', 108009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one isn\'t fit to clean my quarters, much less battle!', '', 108008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn respect or I will continue to educate you in it.', '', 108007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So undisciplined.', '', 108006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone! I need time to contemplate this affront.', '', 108005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lesson over.', '', 108004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin your lesson in humility.', '', 108003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have all the time in the world.', '', 108002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the stars wax, so your lives wane!', '', 108001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mortal may abrogate the precepts of fate!', '', 108000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stars align! Fear their portents!', '', 107999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See for yourself the cruel, frozen void that lies beyond the margin of Azeroth\'s skies!', '', 107998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such insolence... very well, I shall show you!', '', 107997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only you knew what lay beyond...', '', 107996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pets are so atrocious, I consider it a provocation!', '', 107995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was only a matter of time.', '', 107994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Ursoc.', 'I want to teleport to Ursoc.', 107993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My time has come.', '', 107992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Cenarius.', 'I want to teleport to Cenarius.', 107991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Precise. Perfect. Inevitable.', '', 107990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Xavius.', 'I want to teleport to Xavius.', 107989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time waits for no one.', '', 107988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel like time is standing still?', '', 107987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Dragons of Nightmare.', 'I want to teleport to Dragons of Nightmare.', 107986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time will not be kind.', '', 107985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Nythendra.', 'I want to teleport to Nythendra.', 107984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time races past you.', '', 107983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wheels of time turn against you.', '', 107982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is on MY side.', '', 107981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So linear. So limited.', '', 107980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Il\'gynoth, Heart of Corruption.', 'I want to teleport to Il\'gynoth, Heart of Corruption.', 107979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A timely demise.', '', 107978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to teleport to Elerethe Renferal.', 'I want to teleport to Elerethe Renferal.', 107977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why defy that which devours all things?', '', 107976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Emerald Nightmare!\n\nI can teleport you directly to any bosses that are currently available for testing.', '', 107975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are stronger than you look, monk, but I will not be defied! Jorvinax! Keep that portal open!', 107974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot hide from me, monk. Try as you might, but your monastery will burn!', 107973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you, monk! Your struggle is for naught. My forces will purge your order from the face of this world!', 107972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_archonpet:20|t%s reaches |cFFFF0000|Hspell:207972|h[Full Power]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_archonpet:20|t%s reaches |cFFFF0000|Hspell:207972|h[Full Power]|h|r !', 107971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_archonpet:20|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:211927|h[Power Overwhelming]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_archonpet:20|t%s begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:211927|h[Power Overwhelming]|h|r!', 107970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_altertime:20|tYou\'ve been given a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206617|h[Time Bomb]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_altertime:20|tYou\'ve been given a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:206617|h[Time Bomb]|h|r.', 107969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Pandaren, all food is familiar to you. Nothing can break your iron belly. Time to eat!', 'As a Pandaren, all food is familiar to you. Nothing can break your iron belly. Time to eat!', 107968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years of training in the culinary arts has strongly developed your skill in Cooking. These parts here are safe to eat.', 'Years of training in the culinary arts has strongly developed your skill in Cooking. These parts here are safe to eat.', 107967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a tray of treats. It looks like this tray in particular has been infused with some strange arcane magic.\n\nEating random magically infused food might be bad for your system... you don\'t know if it is safe or not.', 'It\'s a tray of treats. It looks like this tray in particular has been infused with some strange arcane magic.\n\nEating random magically infused food might be bad for your system... you don\'t know if it is safe or not.', 107966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a tray of treats. It looks like this tray in particular has been infused with some strange arcane magic.', 'It\'s a tray of treats. It looks like this tray in particular has been infused with some strange arcane magic.', 107965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual I\'m about to perform is complicated, and will take some time to finish, but it is the only way to drop the barrier.', 107956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69742, 1, 0, 0, 0, 50, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Ursoc! Quickly $n, to his side!', 107955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Andu-falah-dor!', 107954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show them nature\'s wrath!', 107953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Smite the defiler!', 107952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show them no quarter!', 107951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals! Soon this place will belong to the master!', '', 107950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, Lord Smolderon... you will kneel before the true Firelord!', '', 107949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are unafraid of death, meet me at my throne. You may prove useful after all...', '', 107948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] And then a rad finale cinematic plays! [PH]', '[PH] And then a rad finale cinematic plays! [PH]', 107947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well fought, but Legion reinforcements are approaching as we speak. We must depart.', 107946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out! Doomguard headed your way!', 107945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tournament is saved! I\'m not sure how those rodents got out of their cages. Umm... did I say cages? What cages? It\'s not like I\'m part of a magically enhanced rat smuggling ring or something!', '', 107944, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Due to technical difficulties, today\'s tournament is canceled! Ow! That one bit me! Ow! Err... Please stand by! This little rat problem should be resolved shortly.', '', 107943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What could he... Oh no... My father! He means to claim my father!', 107942, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day... but you are not yet a worthy vessel for my power. No... I have a more... formidable chieftain in mind!', '', 107941, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never serve you!', 107940, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still... there is power in your bloodline, child. I shall relish claiming it.', '', 107939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ancestors were overconfident as well. It shall prove to be your undoing.', '', 107938, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people stopped you in ages past, Darkness. We will defeat you again.', 107937, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ronir have grown strong during my long absence, Highmountain. But not strong enough.', '', 107936, 0, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show your face, Grey One!', 107935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I claim this vessel.', '', 107934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Featured in today\'s pet battle spectacular, it\'s... Hey, who put that egg in the arena? Uh... Step right up and fight a big egg! Beat up a defenseless egg, limited time only!', '', 107933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turns out the egg held an ancient magical creature bent on watching the world burn. Luckily our challenger was victorious!', '', 107932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to me, warrior of the Horde! I have found something!', 107931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I admit, I was wary to have one of your kind accompany me. But you have fought with bravery and valor. Let us see this through together.\n\nAre you prepared to enter the epicenter of this chaos, $r?', 107930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shala\'nir is just ahead. You should be ready for whatever foulness awaits us.', 107929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to mourn. Elothir is beyond my reach now. Come, and do not delay.', 107928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower those weapons, pale elves. I am here for $p.', '', 107927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The corruption is thick here. What is that across the bridge? Follow closely.', 107926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The path splits. Wait, what is that?', 107925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close. Do not let the Nightmare confound you.', 107924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not let anything disturb my meditation.', 107923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me back at the refuge and we will continue our search. Be quick about it!', 107922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I pray we are not too late.', 107921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my honor you will come to no harm, priestess.', 'By my honor you will come to no harm, priestess.', 107920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will need to focus on the vision to understand its message.\n\nWe have had our differences in the past, but this is bigger than both of us. Can I trust you?', 107919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge me my children! Avenge me...', '', 107918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rend your flesh and dine on your entrails!', '', 107917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my web, delicious mortal! I do hope you\'ll stick around!', '', 107916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like a war zone out there. Nicely done!', '', 107915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower those weapons, bonemen. I am here for $p.', '', 107914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh. I must find a physician!', '', 107913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fruit is horrible...', '', 107912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, what is happening?', '', 107911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I feel unwell...', '', 107910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a delicious looking intruder! It has been ages since I\'ve dined on mortal flesh! Long have I hungered for the taste...', '', 107909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion is only the beginning. My blades call upon power from beyond!', 107908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a match! Bodhi may be terrible at pet battles, but he sure is easy on the eyes!', '', 107907, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will claim every soul on this pathetic world!', 107906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And in this corner, we have Bodhi Sunwayver... the shirtless guy! Why doesn\'t he wear a shirt? Is it being washed? Did he lose a bet? No one knows!', '', 107905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual is nearly ready. Stop them, you mongrels!', 107904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, you just witnessed an epic victory over a guy who fights with a toy strapped to a bird. Frankly, it\'s not that impressive... but a win\'s a win!', '', 107903, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today in the arena, it\'s the mighty Sir Galveston! He may be a bit of a nut case, but he paid the entrance fee... so he\'s in! Step right up and challenge the local lunatic!', '', 107902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I underestimated your strength...', '', 107901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful shaman. Play with fire and you will get burned...', '', 107900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firelord? You are nothing but a pile of rocks!', '', 107899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion witch is dead. Grandmaster, I think this calls for a celebration!', 107898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you believe in miracles? Our challenger defeated Tiffany Nelson! Keep an eye on this up-and-coming superstar!', '', 107897, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in Dalaran from her successful world tour, it\'s... Tiffany Nelson! Today only, step up and challenge a true pet battle superstar!', '', 107896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewing', 'Brewing', 107895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greg. You\'re fired.', '', 107894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it Greg! We finally hit the big time! People from all over Azeroth are here at OUR event!', '', 107893, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
