('I pay you to dance Greg, not mope! So put some boogie into it!', '', 107891, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greg! Dance harder! People actually showed up to this scam... I mean event!', '', 107890, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Master.', 107889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear Aegira, your skills are already beginning to surpass mine. From this day forward, no longer are you my apprentice. Go forward proudly as a Brewmaster, and continue my legacy.', 107888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master... I am unworthy. I wish I had more time to learn from you. But you were avenged. Mornjirn is dead, and we recovered your Storm Brew recipe.', 107887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to MY world!', '', 107886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
