('Fascinating. You still think you can win?', '', 107883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your petty weapons are no match for me here.', '', 107882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You failed to save your father in life. Now you fail his spirit! Such a disappointing daughter!', '', 107881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resist him, father! Do not let him control you!', 107880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
