('The flask shimmers and bubbles.\n\nUnfortunately, you lack the proper ingredients to create something truly sinister.', 'The flask shimmers and bubbles.\n\nUnfortunately, you lack the proper ingredients to create something truly sinister.', 107773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time in this life is short. The Darkness has seen it.', '', 107772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ward will help seal away a great evil. So long as I draw breath, the Darkness will never be free!', '', 107771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Rogue, you are intimately familiar with poisons. Adding a lethal dose to this flask should be easy...', 'As a Rogue, you are intimately familiar with poisons. Adding a lethal dose to this flask should be easy...', 107770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flask shimmers and bubbles.', 'The flask shimmers and bubbles.', 107769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel magic surges around within the orb almost... invitingly.\n\nThe depths of fel magic are beyond you.', 'Fel magic surges around within the orb almost... invitingly.\n\nThe depths of fel magic are beyond you.', 107768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a Warlock, minor fel magic such as this presents no danger to you. Absorb the power of the fel orb.', 'As a Warlock, minor fel magic such as this presents no danger to you. Absorb the power of the fel orb.', 107767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel magic surges around within the orb almost... invitingly.', 'Fel magic surges around within the orb almost... invitingly.', 107766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to walk in the memories of Dargrul.', 'I am ready to walk in the memories of Dargrul.', 107765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walking in the memories of spirits can sometimes be dangerous, but it is a responsibility we Spiritwalkers must accept.', '', 107764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be ours...', '', 107763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle!', 'To battle!', 107762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people need our help!', 'Our people need our help!', 107761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to push them back!', 'We have to push them back!', 107760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons stand no chance with me by your side.', 'These demons stand no chance with me by your side.', 107759, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight together, $n!', 'We fight together, $n!', 107758, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll not ruin our lands!', 'You\'ll not ruin our lands!', 107757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The foul breath on these... help me take them down!', 'The foul breath on these... help me take them down!', 107756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! I...', 'Over here! I...', 107755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those things... I couldn\'t...', 'Those things... I couldn\'t...', 107754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta keep movin\'! The Legion is everywhere.', 'Gotta keep movin\'! The Legion is everywhere.', 107753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $n. Others be needin\' my help, but take this.', 'Thanks, $n. Others be needin\' my help, but take this.', 107752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time we be gettin\' back to battle.', 'It\'s time we be gettin\' back to battle.', 107751, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookin\' like you could use help, $n.', 'Lookin\' like you could use help, $n.', 107750, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t fend them off much longer! Please! Help!', 'I can\'t fend them off much longer! Please! Help!', 107749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve taken the others! Please! Help!', 'They\'ve taken the others! Please! Help!', 107748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! Please - my magic... they devour it!', 'Here! Please - my magic... they devour it!', 107747, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pains me to ask, but I could really use your help!', 'It pains me to ask, but I could really use your help!', 107746, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others must be warned.', 'The others must be warned.', 107745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stick to the shadows. This isn\'t over yet.', 'Stick to the shadows. This isn\'t over yet.', 107744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blades are ready, $n. Just show me the target.', 'My blades are ready, $n. Just show me the target.', 107743, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll never see us coming.', 'They\'ll never see us coming.', 107742, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get these things off me!', 'Get these things off me!', 107741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have stayed in the shadows. Mind lending me a hand?', 'I should have stayed in the shadows. Mind lending me a hand?', 107740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go on ahead, I\'ll catch up with you in a few!', 'You go on ahead, I\'ll catch up with you in a few!', 107739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta recharge the ol\' mana battery! Save some for me, would ya?', 'Gotta recharge the ol\' mana battery! Save some for me, would ya?', 107738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make way! Wrecking crew comin\' through!', 'Make way! Wrecking crew comin\' through!', 107737, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get to it, shall we? These demons ain\'t gonna kill themselves!', 'Let\'s get to it, shall we? These demons ain\'t gonna kill themselves!', 107736, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Over here! Boy am I sure glad to see you!', 'Hey! Over here! Boy am I sure glad to see you!', 107735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me outta here!', 'Get me outta here!', 107734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others. There were more of us... I must find them.', 'The others. There were more of us... I must find them.', 107733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for your help, $n, but our people must be warned at once!', 'I thank you for your help, $n, but our people must be warned at once!', 107732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us purge this threat together.', 'Let us purge this threat together.', 107731, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic is yours, $n.', 'My magic is yours, $n.', 107730, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I hadn\'t been caught off guard I\'d... You there! Lend me a hand!', 'If I hadn\'t been caught off guard I\'d... You there! Lend me a hand!', 107729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic... they resisted everything! Please, help!', 'My magic... they resisted everything! Please, help!', 107728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut them down! There\'s more on the way!', '', 107727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', '', 107726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pick \'em out. I\'ll take \'em down.', '', 107725, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight together, $n.', '', 107724, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. In the wrong hands these relics could tear apart the fabric of our world.', '', 107723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legends tell of lost relics from the days of the great dragon Neltharion. Should you come across one, bring it to me, I will ensure it remains protected.', '', 107722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stonedark thank you.', '', 107721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have been taken by Dargrul\'s minions, forced to do his dark bidding or face death at the hands of his slavers. Aid them if you are able.', '', 107720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our waters are safe to drink again, thanks to you.', 107719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dargrul commits atrocities against even the wildlife, polluting our rivers with turtles twisted by his crystalline magic. Find the source of these powerful beasts.', 107718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done the Highmountain tribes a great service today.', 107717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dargrul has trapped a great basilisk mother deep within the vault. If we don\'t put her down now, he will emerge with an army of trained basilisks!', 107716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have cleared the skies and the mountain at once. The Skyhorn are in your debt.', '', 107715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts report flocks of giant, diseased bats overtaking them in the skies around the fiery mountain. See if you can find out where they are coming from.', '', 107714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s suffers as a darkness grows within.', '%s suffers as a darkness grows within.', 107713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s writhes in pain.', '%s writhes in pain.', 107712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wielding', 'Wielding', 107711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Promising! You and your friends are a skilled bunch indeed.', '', 107710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! How about a quick battle to keep our friends strong?', '', 107709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This loss is irrelevant! The Nightmare will consume all! Until next time, interloper...', '', 107708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late! The corruption of your world can\'t be stopped. I\'ll help it along... starting with your precious companions!', '', 107707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I promise you this, monks of the Broken Temple... the next time we meet, you will PAY for your insolence!', 107706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trifling creatures... once again you have disrupted my plans.', 107705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warblades will consume you!', '', 107704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Derp', '', 107703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t hold \'em off forever! Get the lead outta yer boots and get outta there!', '', 107702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those cursed twins... They will pay for what they did!', 107701, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take care of you myself!', '', 107700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... noooo! Mistress will not be pleased that her prisoners escaped!', '', 107699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brute incoming!', '', 107698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great. Now help us!', 107697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how bad things get, remember that there\'s always an open car on the happy train. Toot toot!', '', 107696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn it down, burn it all down, ha ha ha!', '', 107695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth... must... burn...', '', 107694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your hopes crumble!', '', 107693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To ashes with you!', '', 107692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll melt away that courage!', '', 107691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will meet your end!', '', 107690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace agony!', '', 107689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A life worth less than nothing.', '', 107688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is a gift, mortal!', '', 107687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come then! Meet your end!', '', 107685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me n\' Roo used to be adventurers, just like you. We fought our way from here clear to Pandaria, even been to Outland! Stabbin\' an\' healin\' an\' everything between.\n\nNowadays we just want to spend some time in a quiet place with our two little dogs, ye ken?', '', 107684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements! Now!', '', 107683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We believe we may have finally found the warblades. Allari led an army to track them down.', '', 107682, 0, 39194, 1, 64, 0, 58202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allari led a small army to follow a lead on the Warblades. We may have finally found them.', '', 107681, 0, 39194, 1, 64, 0, 64668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not one of my pack. What brings you to the den?', 107679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve breached the temple! Defend the Warblades!', '', 107678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Angus! Sylara! It\'s good to see ya. You... ahhh... got anyting ta drink on ya?', '', 107677, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earth Mother watch over you.', 'Earth Mother watch over you.', 107676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I am in your debt, but I must check on the others.', '$n! I am in your debt, but I must check on the others.', 107675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Earth Mother watch over us.', 'May the Earth Mother watch over us.', 107673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey look, da door opened!', '', 107672, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the elements guide our ways.', 'May the elements guide our ways.', 107671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More enemies!', 107670, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 66689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any day now, Hiro!', '', 107669, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey mon, da lock be jammed an\' me head\'s spinnin\'! You do it if yer so smart, dwarf!', '', 107668, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 66708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, take this key and get yerself outta there!', '', 107667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh. Looks like we\'ve got company.', '', 107666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hiro! Hey Hiro, are you all right, mate?', '', 107665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is why we brought you here. Destroy them!', 107664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Courage... power... discipline...$b$bMaster these traits and the spirit of the bear will be within your heart.', '', 107663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that we have Ursol\'s blessing, we can travel into the Emerald Dream and retrieve the claws! Come, $n, let\'s not waste a single minute!', 107662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place makes my skin crawl. Elune, give me strength.', 107661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'re going in! C\'mon, Theodore!', '', 107660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the Storm Brew, Master. It will be your only hope against them.', 107659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Storm Brew turns the vrykul into brutal, unstoppable machines. Be careful.', 107658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can find my way back to the order hall. Thank you.', 107657, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful. These vrykul are nearly unstoppable.', 107656, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
