('', 'I am in your debt, Master.', 107655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Storm Brew, Master. It will be your only hope against them.', '', 107654, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Storm Brew turns the vrykul into brutal, unstoppable machines. Be careful.', '', 107653, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can find my way back to the order hall. Thank you.', '', 107652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful. These vrykul are nearly unstoppable.', '', 107651, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt, Master.', '', 107650, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Banshee Queen sends her regards, $ct.', 107649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ernest Carlisle sighs.', '', 107648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ritssyn sent me. We need help curing a doom curse.', 'Ritssyn sent me. We need help curing a doom curse.', 107647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh! Keep your voice down.\n\nI haven\'t gone by that name in years. I gave up the practice of alchemy some time ago, in favor of a calm life here on the farm.\n\nWhat business do you have with \"Mad Ernie\" anyway?', '', 107646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you Mad Ernie?', 'Are you Mad Ernie?', 107645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those undead invaders put up quite a fight, but Marl and I won\'t let the farm be taken.', '', 107644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep its soul intact. Caria has plans for this one.', 107643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late! He comes...', 107642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eternal soul... for Caria...', '', 107641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not going anywhere!', '', 107640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Scepter is here, this may be our only chance to capture it and turn its power against the Legion!', '', 107639, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 60686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You underestimate the shaman I have brought.', '', 107638, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should turn back. This whole realm is a trap.', 107637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sharas\'dal is held by Lady Zithreen. She was using me as bait.', 107636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re using it to whip creatures of this realm into a frenzy.', 107635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Scepter of Tides... it\'s here. I found it.', 107634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buuuuuurrrrrnnnnssss...', '', 107633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shinfel Blightsworn mumbles incoherently, clearly in pain.', 107632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<groans> ...', 107631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do whatever is needed to defend Dreadscar Rift from the Burning Legion.', 107630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now Xavius has me by the throat. I must abandon my beloved, and subdue the most beautiful creature I have ever known.', 107627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When Malfurion returned to my side, we worked as one. As if he had never been away. Have you ever loved as I have?', 107626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even in slumber, his presence calmed me. I left my fears below the earth and emerged, ready to lead my people.', 107625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whenever I was plagued with doubt, I would descend into his barrow. I watched over him as he slept.', 107624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak to me when you are ready to leave.', 107622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU\'VE FALLEN INTO MY TRAP! NOW YOU DIE!', '', 107621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you.', 107620, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 66649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will aid me in my conquest of Val\'sharah, starting with your precious Temple of Elune.', '', 107619, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay.', 'Okay.', 107618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s calls out to nearby creatures for aid.', 107617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, no. I am from Thunder Bluff. I am an adventurer, like you. These Highmountain tauren are as foreign to me as they are to you.\n\nI am, however, an avid student of Huln Highmountain, one of the greatest tauren ever to walk this land. Probably THE greatest. Here, in Highmountain, I stand the best chance of learning more about him.', 107616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you live here in Thunder Totem, Lessah?', 'Do you live here in Thunder Totem, Lessah?', 107615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The High Examiner eyes you condescendingly.>\n\nHave you not heard of the Reliquary before, $r?\n\nWe seek power, of course. Scores of invaluable artifacts lie littered within the strata of this land. The Highborne have forgotten more about the arcane arts than you or I will ever know. I seek to uncover their forgotten relics, and wield their power for myself and my people.\n\nNow please, no more questions.', '', 107614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here in the Broken Isles, High Examiner?', 'What are you doing here in the Broken Isles, High Examiner?', 107613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, all kinds of relics from the War o\' the Ancients. Plenty o\' battles fought on this very land. Where d\'ye think all the felslate comes from? But nothin\' Titan. Not yet, anyway...', '', 107612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you found so far?', 'What have you found so far?', 107611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Same thing I\'m always doin\' - learnin\' anything I can learn about the Titans! Where we came from. Why we\'re here. This land has answers, I can feel it.\n\nThere ain\'t any city-size, Titan-made architecture here in the Broken Isles, though. No Ulduars, Uldamans... no Uld-anythin\'! So I\'m looking into the history of the demons. I figure maybe I\'ll learn somethin\' about Sargeras, the fallen Titan.', '', 107610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here in the Broken Isles, Brann?', 'What are you doing here in the Broken Isles, Brann?', 107609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moonwell water is essential. Don\'t leave the Dreamgrove without it! I\'ll await your arrival in Grizzly Hills.', 107608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough chatter. Move!', 107607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And our dear Ysera! Would you believe she has had a change of heart?', '', 107606, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra lives? Come, let us talk in private.', '', 107605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will NOT lose you!', 107604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande, no! It\'s a trap!', '', 107603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR CALL FOR DEATH SHALL BE GRANTED!', '', 107602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are Azshara\'s minions doing to this place?', '', 107601, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! These creatures are being controlled by another.', '', 107600, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The giant has seen Sharas\'dal, the Scepter of Tides! We are close. Keep him alive and he will protect us.', '', 107599, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! The energies from the vault seem to be stabilizing. Now hurry back before the portal closes and you\'re locked inside!', '', 107598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve failed, just as I did. Yet we can learn from this and change your destiny. Speak with me again.', '', 107597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He and his \"allies\" were concocting a plot to poison Elisande! That will teach him to mess with a Moongrow!', '', 107596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65645, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rawk! Landmines!', '', 107595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daglir is sure to be ruined now. I have already begun to hear rumors that he is a traitor in league with the Nightfallen.', '', 107594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rawk! Sneak past! Sneak past!', '', 107593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Front door\'s already open. That\'s handy!', '', 107592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These creatures are merely a distraction! Get to the tomb!', 107591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 107590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pipe down! We\'re after yer gun for a good cause, ghostie!', '', 107589, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 62573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thief! Coveter! It belongs to me!', '', 107588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never understood why ghosts get so uppity \'bout their loot...', '', 107587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defiler... no... not yours...', '', 107586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say, you hear somethin\'?', '', 107585, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your job is simple! Dispatch the spirits while I shatter the wards sealing the tomb.', 107584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck out there. I\'ll be watchin for yer signal.', '', 107583, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 63671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... looks like some fools plundered the tomb and stirred up all sorts o\' spirits.', '', 107582, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I care nothing for friendship, soft-earthen. So long as this one helps us enter the tomb, I will tolerate the intrusion.', 107581, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prustaga! Brought a friend to join us, as promised.', '', 107580, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 62568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... word of warning. I wouldn\'t exactly say she\'s the cuddliest sort.', '', 107579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems Prust wants the Legion out of here as much as we do. Worked night and day to find this tomb!', '', 107578, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First I should introduce you to Prustaga.', '', 107577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal will take you back to Kalecgos. Please give him my regards.', '', 107576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to get underway.', 'I\'m ready to get underway.', 107575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will use that time to secure the Nexus. It must never again fall into the wrong hands!', '', 107574, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for freeing me. You have given me the greatest gift of all... that of time.', '', 107573, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bit of a bumpy ride, eh? Flyin\' through these clouds ain\'t easy, even on as fine a gryphon as Huey.', '', 107572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ethereals have been routed and you have the weapon you came for. Your business here is finished. Mine, on the other hand, has just begun.', '', 107571, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am impressed, $n! Never have I seen a priest capable of controlling Light\'s Wrath.', '', 107570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Either my legend has spread beyond the city, or we have a mutual acquaintance...', '', 107569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $c.', '', 107568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it! But to leave this place with the weapon, you must first gain control of it.', '', 107567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you assist us Kira?', '', 107564, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra sent me.', 'Thalyssra sent me.', 107563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you Silgryn?', 'Are you Silgryn?', 107562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a lot of nerve approaching me, outlander.', '', 107561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll help, of course. Unlike you, I do not abandon a fellow warlock when they might need me most.', 107560, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn back, Tyrande!', '', 107559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hold me!', '', 107558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You take care of that foul mouthed satyr. I am going to my husband!', 107557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By Elune, your foulness will be purged from this place!', 107556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master chose well, all will see! The Monkey King is tough as can be!', '', 107555, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 66659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not without you!', 107554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion?! Call out to me!', 107553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These hoofprints follow the path to the left. Come, quickly!', 107552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be at your service when you call, Grandmaster.', '', 107551, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, to me! I have found something!', 107550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are you Malfurion? Answer me!', 107549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot tell where his voice is coming from! Quickly, search the buildings to the west. I will scour the east for signs of him!', 107548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, Champion. Let us show these invaders the meaning of strength.', 107540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As with most rituals, it will require three warlocks to complete. \n\nAre you ready to begin?', '', 107539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...blackness...', 107538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lord of the Nightmare, he -', 107537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightmare consumes all!', 107536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My eyes are open at last, priestess. I see night eternal.', 107535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is your end, mortals. The Dream is undone!', 107534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 78725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sleep now, dear Ysera. Sleep forever, and dream no more.', 107533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhhh, shhh... It is over now, Ysera.', 107532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will end your torment, Dreamer. And I promise we will avenge you.', 107531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the light of Elune, we will end this madness!', 107530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you truly lost, Ysera? After all we have built? All we have done?', 107529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Koda, keep her distracted. Lyanis, mend our wounds. Champion - with me!', 107528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not while I still draw breath.', 107527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not going anywhere!', '', 107526, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thistleleaf Bully pinches Trapped Lunarwing', '', 107525, 0, 0, 390, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you now!', '', 107524, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkness. It  came and... I am sorry my Chieftain. But the Darkness has taken your father\'s body to the summit.', '', 107523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spiritwalker! What happened here?', 107522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return with you to the Wandering Isle. From there, we will devise a plan.', '', 107521, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friends be missin\'! We can\'t quit! But these ookers be scary, I gotta admit!', '', 107520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader, Lady Keletress, must be stopped.', '', 107519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The door seal is about to collapse! All is lost if the Legion breaks through the door!', 107518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. The rest of the survivors are up here.', '', 107517, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good, $n! The spirit of the bear truly dwells within you!', '', 107516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, is there anyone willing to fight at your side, $c?', '', 107514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen what this hero can do. I will gladly help!', 107513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your adoring husband will be joining me in the nightmare. His was a special invitation.', '', 107512, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A dose of plague might teach you manners aboard my ship!', 107511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take you with me!', 107510, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande Whisperwind! I have longed for this encounter for many years.', '', 107509, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final trial will not be easy, druid. Speak with me when you are ready.', '', 107508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Thunder Totem.', 'Send me to Thunder Totem.', 107507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even Deathwing could foresee the evil that the Darkness could unleash if left unchecked.$b$bThis is a grim day for us all.', '', 107506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has, indeed. And you should keep that in mind the next time you attempt to speak to me...', 107505, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power has grown, Kira.', '', 107504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grandmaster! Greetings to you, and good tidings! I hope you\'re ready with some Crackling Jade Lightning!', '', 107503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are strong. Perhaps I shall claim you as my next vessel.', '', 107502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All in good time, hero. Your body is not quite ripe yet. I will come for you again, but first my soul requires a more appropriate vessel.', '', 107501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master Taran Zhu is waiting for you down the hill.', 107500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the line! Don\'t let them take the monastery!', 107499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in a bad dream.', '', 107491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your insolence.', '', 107490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one wouldn\'t have lasted long anyway.', '', 107488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the corruption spreading!', '', 107487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, let the anger swell inside you!', '', 107486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The seed has been sown.', '', 107485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible!', '', 107484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Involve Tyrande.', 'Involve Tyrande.', 107483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break the satyr\'s wrist.', 'Break the satyr\'s wrist.', 107482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp on the satyr\'s tail.', 'Stomp on the satyr\'s tail.', 107481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful.', '', 107479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your worst nightmare.', '', 107478, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nightmare has already tainted these creatures, now how about we taint yours?', '', 107477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.', 'Yes.', 107476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please take me to the Temple of Five Dawns.', 'Please take me to the Temple of Five Dawns.', 107475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monastery is saved, but our work is far from over.', '', 107474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, you have witnessed with your own eyes the Legion\'s capability for destruction.', '', 107472, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 66667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Well that will do.', '', 107471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, my friend! He has seen our missing shaman AND the artifact we seek. Now we must find a way through this ice barrier...', '', 107470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall prepare a holding area for the subjects while you are away.', 107469, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 67262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up now, I\'m right behind! The King\'s got your back if you get in a bind!', '', 107468, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold them back here. Strike at the demons now, or it will be too late!', '', 107467, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, $n. Those fel spreaders are doing incredible damage.', 107466, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More fire. More, more, MORE!', '', 107465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glorious fire, so beautiful!', '', 107464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch it burn, watch it burn!', '', 107463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll torch you up good!', '', 107462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wheee.... fire!', '', 107461, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the end of your people.', '', 107460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will turn your monastery to ash.', '', 107459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rain fire and fury upon you!', '', 107458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tear you apart, $c!', '', 107457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die by my blade, $c!', '', 107456, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion lives forever...', '', 107455, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our WILL is not broken. We will fight to our last breath, demon-lover.', '', 107454, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your order is broken, monks! You can do nothing against us.', '', 107453, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 66663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course we will help you!', '', 107452, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have become void!', '', 107451, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 61632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blerk.', '', 107450, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman, speak with him. Perhaps we can gain a new ally down here.', '', 107449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They control us. They kill.', '', 107448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mean you no harm, giant.', '', 107447, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grblgrbl waugurblurg.', '', 107446, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My tolerance for Ritssyn is low, but I\'ll do my best to remain focused despite having to be in his presence.\n\nShould I begin summoning the gateway?', 107445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am here to repay my debt, and nothing more.', 107444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not rest until the council has been rebuilt.', '', 107443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n wanes from existence.', '', 107442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you are prepared!', '', 107441, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 61630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will bring whatever power I have to bear against the Nexus-Prince, $c. But in my weakened state, it falls upon you to finish this threat.', '', 107440, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 61629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Harbaron begins to drain the soul of the %s.', 107439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('old', 'old', 107438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus your attacks! Bring them down!', '', 107437, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 75578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The %s returns to the Halls of Valor...', 107436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is corrupted beyond anything I have ever seen... Malfurion, please hold on.', 107435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 107434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared to venture to the epicenter of this chaos, $r?', 107433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The %s dies, passing into the Maw of Souls...', 107432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer well. Show Caria no mercy!', '', 107431, 0, 36910, 66, 64, 0, 64669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Now tear this monastery to shreds!', 107430, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 66662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, mistress. The Tideskorn will keep them captive until you are ready to harvest their souls.', '', 107429, 0, 0, 2, 70, 0, 66661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such pitiful creatures. Is that the last of them?', 107428, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 66660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We die in Illidan\'s name... as will Caria.', '', 107427, 0, 36911, 66, 64, 0, 58203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power... deserts me.', '', 107424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This must be it, over here!', '', 107423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another wave of reinforcements coming in! Hold your positions!', '', 107422, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your blades! War is coming.', 'Ready your blades! War is coming.', 107421, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Honor!', 'Blood and Honor!', 107420, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free. Free! FREE! Free of that accursed prison.', '', 107419, 0, 0, 0, 76, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I have an idea.', '', 107418, 0, 36911, 1, 64, 0, 71003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I have an idea.', '', 107417, 0, 37647, 1, 64, 0, 64661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have their position. That will have to do.', '', 107416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on down there? Allari!', '', 107415, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 64665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn it all! INCOMING!', 107414, 0, 0, 440, 64, 0, 0, 64664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... <garbled> Caria... <garbled> Broken Shore... <garbled> heavy resistance...', 107413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allari, report in. Have you located the Warblades?', '', 107412, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 64662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, are you here after them? In that case, I could use a hand...', '', 107411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $n. You\'re tapping into magic even Illidan would have considered dangerous.', '', 107410, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Councilors, this is the demon hunter I spoke of.', '', 107409, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 64660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind is free! The magic of death empowers me!', '', 107408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... will fall... to the Magistrix...', 107407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How arrogant, to tread so close to Suramar!', 107406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My mana will bring you to your knees!', 107405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How... my mana abandons me!', 107404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Im... Impossible!', '', 107403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mighty Ursol, our ancient foe has returned! My companion has traveled here to seek your aid in recovering the Claws of Ursoc.', 107402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are thousands of years behind us! How could you hope to win?', '', 107401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Screeeek...', 107400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Screeekk! Nothing sacred, nothing clean!', 107399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you mind grabbing it? These crystals tend to have an adverse effect on non-demonic beings.', '', 107398, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 64659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fan out! Purge this demonic infestation!', '', 107397, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 75600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Olokk... all washed up.', '', 107396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hulls shatter, your bones are next!', '', 107395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-ha! Here we are... a crystallized soul. That ought to do the trick!', '', 107393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcane powder... soul shards... that\'s definitely not it...', '', 107392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I must\'ve put it over here.', '', 107391, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 64656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s see... apexis crystals? No, no, those won\'t do at all.', '', 107390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on just a moment. I fear I\'m a bit of a pack rat.', '', 107389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have just the thing. Follow me.', '', 107388, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, my enormous friend. The Earthen Ring is here.', '', 107387, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert awesome healing/DPS wave event!', '', 107386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graahh?', '', 107385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to get the power source.', 'I\'m ready to get the power source.', 107384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate to admit it, but I find myself in need of an ally. I suppose you\'ll do.', '', 107383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear. Hurry, little $r! I can\'t keep this open for long!', '', 107382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can open a portal to the vault, but I\'ll have to remain on this side to keep it open.', '', 107381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! So much for the all-powerful void. You know, you\'re not a bad ally. Pity you\'re not a dragon!', '', 107380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What!? The void cannot be defeated! Noooo!', '', 107379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ethereum will rise again!', '', 107378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, interlopers. Nothing can stop me now!', '', 107377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! Time to show these ethereals that I still have a bit of fight left in me!', '', 107376, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 61628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like they\'re channeling the energy from the vault into the breach. This is not good.', '', 107375, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh great, more ethereals...', '', 107374, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! You may have destroyed the Surge Needles, but you are too late to stop us! The power of Light\'s Wrath will rip open the breach!', '', 107373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... didn\'t there used to be a bridge here?', '', 107372, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 61624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! We must head to the rift. It\'s the only way!', '', 107371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was too close! If the weapon goes unchecked much longer, it will bring this whole place down around us!', '', 107370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A-ha! That\'s... wait a moment... the energy from the vault is surging. Brace yourself!', '', 107369, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the powers it holds resonating through the Nexus. There must be another way to reach the vault!', '', 107368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I suspected! The entrance to the vault was broken off when Malygos breached the Twisting Nether during the Nexus Wars.', '', 107367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here. Now, let me see if I can find a way into the vault...', '', 107366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire seems to have superheated the ground here. I hope you have a way to get us over it...', '', 107365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a most potent and chaotic weapon. It will lash out at us as we try to approach. Be prepared.', '', 107364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nexus Vault is weakening! That holy fire can only mean Light\'s Wrath is no longer fully contained.', '', 107363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we?', '', 107362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first, I think I\'ll slip into a more comfortable form. These halls were never quite spacious enough for my tastes.', '', 107361, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, access to the vault is proving... difficult. If you help me access the Librarium, I will find a way through. We must not let the Ethereum obtain the artifacts it holds!', '', 107360, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assume you come seeking the Nexus Vault. Why else would anyone return to this place?', '', 107359, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a capable healer, priest. I feel my strength returning.', '', 107358, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make haste. I fear the Ethereum will be upon us any moment!', '', 107357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see you are a follower of the Light. Restore my strength and I will fight by your side.', '', 107356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void magic wielded by these ethereals has weakened me considerably. I am of no use to you in this state.', '', 107355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well this is... unexpected.', '', 107354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it\'s looting you desire, as your kind so often does, then I suggest taking the fight to them.', '', 107353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ethereum have taken the bite out of this old dragon, and I fear they have robbed me of anything you would deem useful.', '', 107352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve come to engage me in battle in hopes of obtaining some spurious trinket, I\'m afraid you\'re too late.', '', 107351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the lock on the Nexus has been broken, and by a common $r, no less. Will wonders never cease?', '', 107350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear you may be on your own from here. Good luck!', '', 107349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The volatile energies within the Nexus seem to be interfering with the image crystal.', '', 107348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga are tormenting that sea giant. How should we proceed?', '', 107347, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a noise from behind you!', 'There is a noise from behind you!', 107346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mistress, I... have... failed...', 107345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Inconceivable! I... am... the... best...', 107344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if I\'ll ever face a worthy foe...', 107343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a shame. I had hoped for a proper challenge.', 107342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should have thought better of challenging me!', 107341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Annihilate!', 107340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Animate!', 107339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Detonate!', 107338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Replicate!', 107337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where\'s the fun in so easy a kill?', 107336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unworthy. A waste of my time!', 107335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A gallant attempt... but a vain one.', 107334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I let you strike first and that\'s the best you can do?', 107333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! I trained those guards myself... they are not easily bested. I suppose you merit the honor of facing me. Strike at your leisure. As a courtesy, I grant you the first blow.', 107332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Entire armies have fallen by my sword. What chance could you possibly have against me?', 107331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They aren\'t letting up! Stand firm!', '', 107330, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 75574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you again, shan\'do. I will remain here in the Dreamgrove if you ever have need of my guidance.', 107328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Therefore, I hereby pass along my station to $p. A true protector of life... a true guardian of the Dream!', 107327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For centuries I have watched over G\'Hanir. Today it nearly fell to the corruption I swore to fight. It is time for another to take my place.', 107326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Both G\'Hanir and Nordrassil would have been destroyed by the Legion.', 107325, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Were it not for $p\'s actions, we would have all perished atop Mount Hyjal.', 107324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons have fallen to our blades! They were no match for the champions of Azeroth!', '', 107323, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 75589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great Ursol, wise bear of the woods, this daughter of the wilds calls to you! Please accept these humble offerings and grant us an audience!', 107322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must chap yer hide that ya got upstaged so easily. Ha!', '', 107321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nithogg and his brood are killers and murderers of the worst sort. You have done the world a service by disposing of them.', '', 107320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now yer talkin! Biggest skull wins the wager.', '', 107319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brood of Nithogg kill my kind and yours without mercy or remorse. Meet their cruelty in kind! Rend the scales from their hide!', '', 107318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, sister. Set the hex correctly. As the Witchqueen commanded.', 107317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fools of Rivermane will never expect the wilds to turn on them so violently.', 107316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These wingless creatures shall be ours to command.', 107315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move quickly, sisters. We must finish the spell so that no outsider or tauren can break its hold!', 107314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry my sisters, before the wretched tribes discover our plan.', 107313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let these wingless creatures feast upon themselves.', 107312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. Without you, we would have surely fallen.', '', 107311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
