('Too... strong! Stop! No more fight!', '', 107150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That creature unworthy of great Ursol! I crush it!', '', 107149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must protect me until the ritual is complete, or G\'Hanir will be lost!', 107148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will prepare the well\'s waters for the cleansing.', 107147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find Brytag... kill the naga...', '', 107146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elothir? By Elune... not you too! Have you seen my husband?', 107145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The corruption is thick here. What is that across the bridge? Be on guard.', 107144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feathers and blood... It is still wet! There may still be time!', 107143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The path splits. Wait, do you see that?', 107142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first trial will test your might against the strongest of my followers. Show me that you possess the strength of the bear!', '', 107141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... black barracuda. Delicious with snails and onions.', '', 107140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barracuda in the north sea are meaty, but hard to reach. Sometimes one of the tauren shaman can help you with a water walking spell.', '', 107139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t miss a single one! How long have you been fishing, brul?', '', 107138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come. We must make haste.', 107137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fish in this area swim up river to... well, I\'m not sure, but they seem very excited about it. Great time for spear fishing!', '', 107136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Vanish to evade this brute.', '', 107135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s just one last thing you need to learn. Sometimes a strategic retreat is necessary so you can live to fight another day. Vanish allows you to disengage from combat and make a quick getaway.', '', 107134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me back at the refuge and we will continue our search.', 107133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land belongs to the Wormtalon! Squaaaaak!', 107132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Preparations are complete. We are ready to begin.', 107131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am ready to begin the ritual, $n!', 107130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, you must save our injured. I will prepare the cleansing ritual.', 107129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only pray that we are not too late.', 107128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such malevolent laughter... Xavius, you cruel creature! I am coming for you!', 107127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion! He is in pain! Keep fighting, my love!', 107126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see... swirling red mist. Gnashing teeth.', 107125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must go deeper into the nightmare. Wherever he is, peril is already upon him!', 107124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His location is still unclear, but he lives.', 107123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared!', 'I am prepared!', 107122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain you are ready? This will be your most difficult task.', '', 107121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bless ya, $n. I could feel me soul returnin\' to da loa.', 107120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not let anything disturb my meditation. I must see through the chaos.', 107119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Ash\'alah, to me.', 107118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The well was nearly lost during the assault. But so long as a single drop remains, there is hope!', 107116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has not forgotten their defeat here.', '', 107115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, my head... I feel dizzy...', 107114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. We barely survived their last attack.', '', 107111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ronir! Today is the day you die!', '', 107110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient stares at you expectantly.>', '', 107109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was she here for days? Years? Centuries? The mage was right... time has little meaning in this place.', 107108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, $r. Why have you disturbed my rest?', '', 107107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you done with Alleria, monster?', 107106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No!', 107105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skylord, you must inform the Dreamgrove. We will ensure no further life is lost this day.', 107104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tend to the others first. Their wounds are more dire than my own.', '', 107103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gates of hell poured forth upon us. They were everywhere...', '', 107102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were sent to clear out a stray pack of fel hounds. But what we found...', '', 107101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 107100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were... too much...', '', 107099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Tyrande.', 'Yes, Tyrande.', 107098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will need to focus on the vision to understand its message. Guard me while I do this, $n.', 107097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vision is chaotic, unfocused. I need to concentrate.', 107096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish karkun! Let\'s see how fast you die!', '', 107095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stone! Obey me!', '', 107094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness take you!', '', 107093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fear the deep dark!', '', 107092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the darkness beneath the mountain!', '', 107091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, shan ronir!', '', 107090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That blood of yours will do fine...', '', 107089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone answers to me!', '', 107088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan ronir! Go kiss a tauren!', '', 107087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny karkun! Shouldn\'t be here!', '', 107086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mess with the mountain!', '', 107085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness gonna take you!', '', 107084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such devastation...', 107083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those foul harpies better stick to the trees, or we\'ll make sure a sea of feathers and witch blood carpets the forest floor.', '', 107082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The witches of the forest are getting too bold. They leave their woods and attack my people while we hunt down the Feltotem.', '', 107081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings a follower of Cenarius to my lair?', '', 107080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murky is great at learning new tricks! He sometimes forgets what I teach him just as easily, though.', '', 107079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A massive Clackbrine has risen to power on the coast. But I don\'t think Murky is quite strong enough to defeat it without some extra help!', '', 107078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can hear the squeals of delight from the tadpole cave. They\'ll grow big and strong!', '', 107077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the tadpoles Murky recruited are getting hungry! We\'re in luck, though. A crab migration has begun, and their meat is so sweet! Not that I would know...', '', 107076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your direction, Murky and his tadpole tribe are safe once again.', '', 107075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murky needs your help! The Clackbrine amass in great numbers and are likely to attack Murky\'s hard-won lair.', '', 107074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It makes me shudder to think what you had to do to those poor things, but it could not be avoided.', '', 107073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Swamprock are up to no good again! That crab rider leads them to do rather dreadful deeds.', '', 107072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I try so hard to set murlocs on the right path. With the wrong leaders, they can get ouf of control quite quickly.', '', 107071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those depraved murlocs keep finding new ways of sinking ships! I\'m sure recovering supplies from those shipwrecks would be appreciated.', '', 107070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n... thank the Ancients you\'ve come.', '', 107069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 107068, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the center of town! Mount up! We fight as one!', '', 107067, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was a costly lesson in not overextending my forces. I appreciate your help, champion.', 107066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The drogbar are assaulting Thunder Totem and too many of my forces have been drawn off to engage with the Legion. Can you assist us, champion?', 107065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, karkrun! The Grey One shall be free!', '', 107064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only hope we are not too late to save G\'Hanir.', 107063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once G\'Hanir is pure again, we can help Archdruid Greathelm cleanse any remaining Nightmare at the Dreamgrove.', 107062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the ancients bless us all.', 107061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay them all... for Jandvik...', '', 107060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hamuul Runetotem led a small party to investigate Legion activity near Nordrassil not long ago. He may be able to aid you.', '', 107059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'Hanir grows more corrupt with each passing moment. May your feet carry you swiftly!', '', 107057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right behind you, Uncle Chen!', 107056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li, let\'s go check on the little ones.', '', 107055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uncle!', 107054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chuang!', '', 107053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could they be the threat? What did Malygos promise them?', '', 107050, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 61771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal is very similar to ones used by the ethereals in Outland.', '', 107049, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoever wielded it must be seeking to harness void energy. But for what purpose?', '', 107048, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This weapon has been infused with dark energies from the Twisting Nether.', '', 107047, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The design looks very familiar...', '', 107046, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to the Earthen Ring. Bring them together. Turn their might against the Legion. This is your time.', '', 107045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must go my own way. I have a great deal of thinking to do. Aggra will be at the Maelstrom shortly. Listen to her counsel... she has taught me so much.', '', 107044, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 68825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer chose you, shaman. Already you wield it with a power that I never tapped into.', '', 107043, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This device appears to draw upon the void energy released when Malygos forced Azeroth\'s ley lines into the Twisting Nether.', '', 107042, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crok! The Grey One has been unleashed. We must get out of here before the vault\'s defenses return.', '', 107039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grey One was a drogbar so evil, Neltharion encased him in stone as a lesson to us all. We must not let these zealots free him.', '', 107038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are fanatics, believing this Vault holds one of their greatest legends: The Grey One.', '', 107037, 0, 38951, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fall... sooner or later...', '', 107036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pity... I will not see the world... burn...', '', 107035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After Dalaran falls, what hope does the world have?', '', 107034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now to cast this lofty city from the skies...', '', 107033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another so-called hero falls to the Legion!', '', 107032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not as easy as the prisoners, am I?', '', 107031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of Dalaran will join you soon.', '', 107030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! These prisoners are useless. As the old saying goes: \"If you want to destroy a floating city the right way, you have to do it yourself.\"', '', 107029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I expected more from these prisoners. If they cannot break you, then I will.', '', 107028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The very earth beneath your feet and the skies above your head will lash out against your damned crusade!', '', 107027, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come now, Anub\'esset! You call yourself a great crypt lord, and you can\'t even burrow your way out of this prison? Show us why you are to be feared!', '', 107026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The whole of Azeroth will rise against you, demon.', '', 107025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crypt lords do not take defeat well. Being locked in this prison will have made this one angry... Very, VERY angry.', '', 107024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The San\'layn are cold and arrogant creatures. They inflict pain for pure entertainment. All in all, they sound like my kind of people.', '', 107023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood-Princess Thal\'ena... You must be hungry after all these years in prison. Go and slake your thirst on the blood and souls of Dalaran!', '', 107022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... even I have heard of Shivermaw, the fallen blue dragon once known as Eldragosa. She will be perfect for terrorizing the skies of Dalaran.', '', 107021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements are here! Push them back!', '', 107020, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even with magical wards in place, I can still smell the reek of this wretched Abomination. Do the world a favor and dispose of it, will you?', '', 107019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense great fury and bitterness in this gnome. She has kept these feelings bottled up for so long... It is only a matter of time before she explodes.', '', 107018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have witnessed horrors that would put your darkest nightmares to shame, but I have never seen anything as terrifying as THIS... an angry gnomish inventor.', '', 107017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armor might protect you from blade and claw, but it is useless against this Faceless One. With a mere whisper, it can drive a mortal mind to madness.', '', 107016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fall of Dalaran begins here. These prisoners will stain the streets red with blood. And when they\'re done, the Legion will bring this city crashing to the ground!', '', 107015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are just in time for the Legion\'s first strike on Dalaran. These prisoners will paint the city streets red with blood. It\'s a shame you won\'t be alive to see it happen.', '', 107014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been energized by the Azuregale Zapper!', '', 107013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer! Get the Doomhammer! Prove your power as a shaman...', '', 107010, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must aid Bashana in cleansing the remaining Nightmare. G\'Hanir\'s fate rests with Lyessa and $p.', '', 107009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'Hanir will not last much longer. It must be cleansed!', '', 107008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Ancients, you have it! You have G\'Hanir!', '', 107007, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 62239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saving', 'Saving', 107006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us reconvene in the physical world.', 107005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would have surely been overwhelmed if you had not arrived. Thank you.', 107004, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 62233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please help! I can\'t hold the corruption back much longer!', 107003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to keep moving. Geth\'xun is close...', '', 107002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IN-FER-NO!', '', 107001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another will take my place. Your world is doomed...', '', 107000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trifling mortals! Your arrogance will be your undoing!', '', 106999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a bow worthy of a hero like Alleria... a hero like you. Take Thas\'dorah, $n. Use it to lead the fight to save Azeroth!', 106998, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 61837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria was here... her bow\'s presence is the proof! Doubtless she escaped, and the Inquisitor sought to use me to lure her back.', 106997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light... There! It\'s her bow! Thas\'dorah!', 106996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your legion is no match for an orc and his people, demon!', '', 106995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doomhammer... it felt like dead weight in my hands. The elements were silent. It has been this way since I used it to slay Garrosh.', '', 106994, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep your eyes on Thrall. He\'s wounded. He\'s likely to kill himself down here, and I don\'t wanna be the one who has to tell his wife!', 106993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is far enough, ronir lovers. You ain\'t gonna pass.', '', 106992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two trainers enter. One leaves a winner. The other has dinner.', '', 106991, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab and go! Grab and go! We\'re leaving now!', '', 106990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry. The ronir and their pet, $p, will be here soon.', '', 106989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, roggs. Find what you\'re looking for or forget it.', '', 106988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search faster, roggs.', '', 106987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, roggs. We can\'t hold here forever.', '', 106986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re done with that one, it\'d make a great stew!', '', 106984, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too slow!', '', 106982, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a little slime on your face.', '', 106981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like he\'s cooked.', '', 106980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll save him for later.', '', 106979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! Dinner!', '', 106978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just got snailed!', '', 106977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least dead snails are delicious.', '', 106976, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the more reason to get to the Doomhammer first.', '', 106975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can best my snails?', '', 106974, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inquisition sees all! Every truth! Every lie!', '', 106971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scout the chambers ahead... I will stay nearby...', '', 106970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer is somewhere in these chambers. I can feel it.', '', 106969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 68814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the lines! Nothing gets through!', 'Hold the lines! Nothing gets through!', 106968, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!', 'For the Warchief!', 106967, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 106966, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monstrosity! East gate needs reinforcements!', '', 106965, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trifling mortals! It is time you felt the power of the Burning Legion!', '', 106964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! While your petty outpost was under attack our forces spread across your sacred lands!', '', 106963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT LOCALIZE', 'DO NOT LOCALIZE', 106962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel artillery! Spread out!', '', 106961, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My kin are safe and the seawarden is dead. I will return to Jandvik now.', '', 106960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drink this vial of moonwell water, it\'ll help you relax so you can enter the Dream. Then lay down in front of the stone and we can begin.', 106959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies... Infernals - INCOMING!', '', 106958, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm your mind, let go and your spirit will enter into the Dream. I\'ll join you soon.', 106957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you made it, $n. We need only a few more things before we can begin.', 106956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I urge you to be cautious. You must not let the Nightmare overcome you.', '', 106955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care! I can feel the Nightmare encroaching on your mind!', '', 106954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, $n. I had to wake you before you fell too deeply.', '', 106953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowstrike to a target, generate 5 combo points with Backstab, and finish them with Eviscerate. That should leave you in stealth, ready to Shadowstrike to your next target.', '', 106952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re learning how to paint with a dagger. Now it\'s time to perfect your art.', '', 106951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR POWER WILL BE MINE!', '', 106950, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should knock him down to size!', 106949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rocko is back! Whenever he grows too big, it triggers nasty earthquakes. Shaving off a bit of shale every now and then keeps him stable. You mind helping out?', 106948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha! Well done, Champion. That should show those sky hags a thing or two.', '', 106947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me their story.', 'Show me their story.', 106946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I imagine you have heard of Huln Highmountain, but have you heard the story of the rest of the tribes? They too were champions of the War of the Ancients.', '', 106945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The harpies are swarming the nesting grounds of our eagle allies. They want a fight? Ha! We will give them a fight!', '', 106944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re nearly there! Just stay focused!', '', 106943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you alright? I think you\'re past the worst of it.', '', 106942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameStrike:20|t Krosus targets you with an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:205344|h[Orb of Destruction]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameStrike:20|t Krosus targets you with an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:205344|h[Orb of Destruction]|h|r!', 106941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you! This is going to take hours to fix!', '', 106940, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 106939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is there always an extra screw? It must go somewhere...', '', 106934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Eviscerate with 5 combo points.', '', 106933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that you\'ve built up 5 combo points, it\'s time to Eviscerate. Whenever you Eviscerate with 5 combo points, you will do massive damage and immediately enter stealth.', '', 106932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That did it! You go on ahead. I\'ll deal with things down here.', 106931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Shadowstrike to attack the target dummy.', '', 106930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The path is blocked! I think I can clear it out.', 106928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stopped the spread of fel corruption before it could reach our waters. We are ever in your debt.', 106927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the Feltotem corrupt their own waters to turn even nature against us.', 106926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. You were able to stop them before anything could come through.', 106925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Feltotem work to open a portal at Torok\'s Bluff. What they plan to bring through, I hope I never know.', 106924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodtotem will regret taking the offer of their demonic masters.', '', 106923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torok\'s son, Mellok, is rallying the Feltotem against us. Stifle their efforts before they can invade Stonedark Cavern!', '', 106922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve arrived!', '', 106921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want eat Feathermane!', '', 106919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where meat?!', '', 106918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HUNGRY.', '', 106917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lunch, where are you?', '', 106916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you go, munchy feathers?', '', 106915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lost Owlkitten raises its nose to the air and chirps in recognition of its surroundings.', '', 106914, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone... anyone! I can\'t escape these roots!', 106913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Honor!', 'Blood and Honor!', 106912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh. I could always use a little more practice.', 'Heh. I could always use a little more practice.', 106911, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 106910, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears I underestimated the Legion\'s power. Perhaps I may join you?', 'It appears I underestimated the Legion\'s power. Perhaps I may join you?', 106909, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic is now yours, $n.', 'My magic is now yours, $n.', 106908, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d prefer to avoid these horrors. Let\'s sneak past them!', 106907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought I was done for!', 106906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n - I must report these events at once!', '$n - I must report these events at once!', 106905, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must warn the others!', 'I must warn the others!', 106904, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could always use more practice.', 'I could always use more practice.', 106899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies $n, but I must keep moving.', 'My apologies $n, but I must keep moving.', 106898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you could use some help.', 'Looks like you could use some help.', 106897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got to check on the others, but this should help.', 'I\'ve got to check on the others, but this should help.', 106896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands... what have they become?', 'These lands... what have they become?', 106895, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements guide my blades.', 'The elements guide my blades.', 106894, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must warn the Warchief at once!', 'I must warn the Warchief at once!', 106893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to repay you.', 'Allow me to repay you.', 106892, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep movin\'!', 106891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements be by your side.', 106890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks.', 106889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t be givin\' in. We must fight!', 106888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse these naga!', '', 106887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!', '', 106886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good fight! The tribes will sing songs of your bravery. Now, was it the winner who buys dinner, or the loser?', 106885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off my face!', '', 106884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid squid!', '', 106883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... what...', '', 106882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t breathe...', '', 106881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need... air...', '', 106880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must have traveled very far to face me. If it\'s battle you seek, I\'ll happily oblige. Loser buys dinner!', 106879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, take it! Just don\'t hurt me any more. The chest is over there.', '', 106878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one of Lespin\'s thugs? I have had it with him. My pet will teach you a lesson!', '', 106876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'Hanir rests at the Circle of Spirits above, but it oozes Nightmare into the barrow den. You must hurry before you succumb to the corruption!', '', 106874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hear me, $n?', '', 106872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dread to think what they were going to do with us.', 'I dread to think what they were going to do with us.', 106871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They hit us hard and fast. I have not seen the vrykul attack like that in many many years.', 'They hit us hard and fast. I have not seen the vrykul attack like that in many many years.', 106870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to find some weapons!', 'Time to find some weapons!', 106869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vrykul have grown bold. Be careful.', 'The vrykul have grown bold. Be careful.', 106868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Champion. I will find my own way out of here.', 'Thank you, Champion. I will find my own way out of here.', 106867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Earth Mother you arrived in time. They had dark plans for us.', 'Thank the Earth Mother you arrived in time. They had dark plans for us.', 106866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul scum! I will have my revenge.', 'Vrykul scum! I will have my revenge.', 106865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, brother. *sigh*', 106864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience...', '', 106863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fel_elementaldevastation:20|t Krosus raises his left arm and charges a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Fel Beam]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fel_elementaldevastation:20|t Krosus raises his left arm and charges a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Fel Beam]|h|r!', 106862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fel_elementaldevastation:20|t Krosus raises his right arm and charges a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Fel Beam]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fel_elementaldevastation:20|t Krosus raises his right arm and charges a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Fel Beam]|h|r!', 106861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Stealth to fade from view.', '', 106860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogues favor trickery and cunning. And what\'s trickier than attacking before your target sees you coming? Stealth makes you invisible to most enemies. When in Stealth, you open up specialized tactics that can devastate foes.', '', 106859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah!', 106858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No...!', 106857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Val\'Sharah Exile tries to shoo the kitten away.', 106856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey!', 106855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious Owlkitten knocks the cup off the table.', '', 106854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious Owlkitten stares directly into Val\'Sharah Exile\'s eyes.', '', 106853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious Owlkitten reaches a paw out and lightly bats at the cup.', '', 106852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Backstab on this target dummy. Attacking from behind inflicts more damage.', '', 106851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $p. As a subtlety rogue you specialize in striking from the shadows, dispatching foes quickly and quietly. Let\'s begin your training with your primary attack, Backstab.', '', 106850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will guide your journey from here. Good luck.', '', 106849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now just relax and focus your mind on the Dream. I will guide your spirit from here.', '', 106848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still have the moonwater, yes? Good, good! Then you are ready.', '', 106847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid the Dream is in a worse state than we thought.', '', 106846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful. It isn\'t safe in the Dream right now!', 106845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up ahead... that looks like the interrogation area.', 106844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry! $n will fix this, just you wait!', 106843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The vrykul have always been bold, but these vile giants have gone too far. Thank you for putting them back in their place.', 106842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Those fiends from Hrydshal have gone too far! The  vrykul there led a brutal raid on Highmountain, taking many captives. Please, help us get our people back!', 106841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A feast for my brethren...', '', 106840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consume their flesh!', '', 106839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bleed and die, vermin.', '', 106838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only scraps will remain!', '', 106837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush your bones to POWDER!', '', 106836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your strength means NOTHING!', '', 106835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But it is MY destiny to rule Azjol-Nerub...', '', 106834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot hear the Lich King... has he abandoned me?...', '', 106833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you expect me to be a simple obstacle, fools?', '', 106832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too easy an end. How disappointing.', '', 106831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one crushed between my pincers.', '', 106830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have died in Northrend.', '', 106829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I *crave* the smell of freshly spilled blood. How convenient that you are here.', '', 106828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally free... and you will NOT imprison me again.', '', 106827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Elune guide your path.', '', 106826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naga are vile creatures and dangerous if left unchecked. The death you gave them was more noble than they deserved!', '', 106825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loathsome naga have crawled forth from their dark holes beneath the sea. I cannot abide the presence of such corrupt beasts! Show them the meaning of honorable battle.', '', 106824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n. The trees whispered of your arrival.', '', 106823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The room\'s countermeasures are now armed.', '', 106822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, I got it!', '', 106821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'Hanir is in danger? Then there is no time to waste.', '', 106820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('G\'Hanir has been touched by the Nightmare.', 'G\'Hanir has been touched by the Nightmare.', 106819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost there, $glad:lass;. Just hold on a bit longer.', '', 106818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! That doesn\'t sound good. Hold that thing off while I finish over here.', '', 106817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need your blessing so that I may enter the Emerald Dream.', 'I need your blessing so that I may enter the Emerald Dream.', 106816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course you may.$B$BWhat pulls you towards the Dream with such fervor, Shan\'do?', '', 106815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders detected. Initiating termination protocols.', '', 106814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drawing Sacred Water', 'Drawing Sacred Water', 106813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their lines break, and their captain falls. This is the sound of Gilnean vengeance! For the Alliance!', '', 106812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken look weak. This tower is ripe for the taking. Show them what happens to enemies of the Alliance!', '', 106811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our forces prevail! Watch them panic and flee like the dogs they are! For the Horde!', 106810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, raspberries! I don\'t know what to do!', 106809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will have this tower, along with the heads of the Gilneans who hold it! Attack!', 106808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can do this, $n. G\'Hanir is counting on us!', 106807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mylune puffs out her chest assertively, sniffling.', 106806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I leave my blade to you. Strom\'kar deserves to be wielded in battle, not locked away in a tomb. It was forged by a master swordsmith and imbued with elven magics. I know not whether being buried in that beast for centuries has affected it, but I trust that it will serve you well.', '', 106805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve made it! And would you look at that, a titan console! I\'m on it, $glad:lass;. You jes make sure that nothin\' bothers me while I\'m workin\'.', '', 106804, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now make a left here, and we\'re pretty much at the end.', '', 106803, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jes keep going straight, and then make a right at the end there.', '', 106802, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day to you, $ct.', 106801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything\'s fantastic in the forest, $ct.', 106800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi, $ct!', 106799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Dis gonna be good! If you be needin\' something done you just tell Zen\'Kiki.', '', 106798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh good, the prototype made it back in one piece. And, er, you survived too!', 106797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, friend! We\'re looking for an \"assistant\" to help us test some of these weapons. Interested?', 106796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never ssstop usss. Jandvik will fall!', 106795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this real or an illusion? You are going mad... mad... mad...', '', 106794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The will of N\'Zoth is made manifest! IT CANNOT BE CONTAINED!', '', 106793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the writhing shadow of N\'Zoth, all light fades and dies.', '', 106792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a prisoner in your own body. A SERVANT OF FEAR!', '', 106791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be the first of many to glimpse the madness of N\'Zoth!', '', 106790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no light after death. Only a place where even shadows fear to go.', '', 106789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crooked serpent with no eyes is watching from the endless sky.', '', 106788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of N\'Zoth runs through me... I cannot die...', '', 106787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not the first... I am not the last...', '', 106786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Old Ones beckon. Go... go... go...', '', 106785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will wander roads that twist in endless spirals.', '', 106784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Black Empire once ruled this world, and it will do so again! Your pitiful kind will know only despair and sorrow for a hundred thousand millennia to come!', '', 106783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Black Empire once ruled this pitiful world, and it will do so again! We will reforge our dread citadels atop the fly-blown corpse of this kingdom!', '', 106782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mortal wards have no effect on the spawn of N\'Zoth!', '', 106781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voice of N\'Zoth whispers from the deep. It sings of unspeakable horrors.', '', 106780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al\'ksh syq iir awan? Iilth sythn aqev... aqev... aqev...', '', 106779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So that lass Emmarel Shadewarden sent you my way? Seems she\'s good as her word, that one.$b$bDon\'t know a thing about this Unseen Path she\'s part of, but I\'m willin\' to hear her out.', '', 106778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N\'Zoth iiyoq raz\'tal\'vsak! IIYOQ NEL\'OTHK AR\'AFGH!', '', 106777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mg\'uulwi N\'Zoth, eth\'razzqi worg zz oou.', '', 106776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iilth ma paf\'qi\'ag sk\'halahs. GAZ SKSHGN!', '', 106775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iilth qi mah\'shar fhn oorql N\'Zoth!', '', 106774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('En\'othk uulg\'shuul. Mh\'za uulwi skshgn kar.', '', 106773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poq\'yith mazzka awan ki uhnish\'philfgsh.', '', 106772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeh\'glu N\'Zoth okom hoq... Y\'za sythn oou...', '', 106771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y\'za noq mah... Y\'za noq ormz...', '', 106770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shath\'gral ynyq. Weq... weq... weq...', '', 106769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sk\'yahf qi\'magg luk sshoq anagg\'qen.', '', 106768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shath\'mag vwyq shu et\'agthu, Shath\'mag sshk ye! Krz\'ek fhn\'z agash zz maqdahl or\'kaaxth\'ma amqa!', '', 106767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shath\'mag vwyq shu et\'agthu, Shath\'mag sshk ye! Ag\'rr hazz ak\'yel ksh ga\'halahs pahg!', '', 106766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Phnagg\'ba teq\'nir ssq qwal N\'Zoth!', '', 106765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Il\'zarq N\'Zoth phgwa an\'zig. Il\'zarq taag ov\'kadaq.', '', 106764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware! Zakajz grows desperate. He may change his tactics!', '', 106763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m grateful Lady Shadewarden found you, $n. We have a chance to strike a major blow against the Legion!', '', 106762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!', 106761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha. That was almost better and bloodier than I would have done! My thanks, champion.', '', 106760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those vile harpy skywitches are trying to take our most sacred of artifacts: the Skyhorn. I have sent several squads to stop them, but to no avail. Will you help?', '', 106759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My commander, Ranger-General Vereesa Windrunner, has uncovered a possible lead as to the whereabouts of her missing sister Alleria.$b$bAlleria\'s knowledge of the Legion would be invaluable to our cause. And the bow she carried with her, Thas\'dorah, is an artifact of awesome power.$b$bTogether, you and the ranger-general can save them both!', '', 106758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been workin\' with ol\' Brann Bronzebeard, searchin\' the Broken Isles for any edge against the Legion.$b$bWe\'re close to findin\' the tomb of some vrykul warlord the legends say stole a rifle called Titanstrike. Brann got all excited, goin\' on about how that gun is infused with the power of storms and such!$b$bSounds interestin\', eh? If you\'re up for fetchin\' it, I\'m your dwarf!', '', 106757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'Emmarel Shadewarden is a noble soul. The tauren of Highmountain have long been allies of the Unseen Path.$b$bTalonclaw, the spear wielded by my ancestor Huln Highmountain, was lost in battle against a fierce nightsaber called Dakarr. Many have tried to retrieve it... all have failed.$b$bOur elders believe recovering Talonclaw is the key to driving the Legion from our lands.$b$bMy brother Wuho and I are heading out to slay the beast and claim the spear. If you were to join us, we\'d be sure to succeed!', 106756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accordin\' to me notes, it\'s a bit of a trek, but shouldn\'t be too long. Let\'s go!', '', 106755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune guide your path, $n.', '', 106754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last the nightmare is over! I can finally leave this place and be at peace.', '', 106753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what needs to be done. Take up the Warbreaker and end the threat of Zakajz once and for all!', '', 106752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done what I could not. You defeated Zakajz and lived.', '', 106751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Brann. Let\'s go.', 'I\'m ready, Brann. Let\'s go.', 106750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know of a weapon that could help fight the Legion?', 'Do you know of a weapon that could help fight the Legion?', 106749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast seems slow... confused. The sword wounds it still! Quickly, strike it down before it recovers completely!', '', 106748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! We are too late! Zakajz has awakened!', '', 106747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She said you know something about an ancient weapon.', 'She said you know something about an ancient weapon.', 106746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m told you know about an ancient weapon.', 'I\'m told you know about an ancient weapon.', 106745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright $glad:lass;, I\'ll meet ya at the entrance. Ye come and find me when ye\'re prepared to go inside.', '', 106740, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This dark ore, this... elementium, it is a weapon that I hope the drogbar never master.', 106739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The drogbar have uncovered an ancient knowledge from the days of Deathwing. I can hear the spirits cry out in pain. Please, stop them!', 106738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_stormvine:20|t%s begins to emit a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:192985|h[Cry of Wrath]|h|r!', 106737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_stormvine:20|t%s begins to emit a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:192985|h[Cry of Wrath]|h|r!', 106736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the hides are unusable. The harpies will pay for this!', 106734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The harpies must have cursed these poor bears. How terrible! Please put them out of their misery.', 106732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing\'s secrets belong to us now, shan ronir!', '', 106731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those bears are so unruly! Thanks!', 106730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those bears are so unruly! Thanks!', 106729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets of the Earth Warder is OURS!', '', 106728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those bears drove us out of our settlement and are tearing through our supplies. Drive them off, and see if you can recover any of our grain while you are there.', 106727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to your help, we may be able to retake that outpost!', 106726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First our outpost is overrun by bears, and now poachers are stealing our bear hides! Could this get any worse?', 106725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you want this, rogg?', '', 106724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ore is heavy and itchy.', '', 106723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where I put ore?', '', 106722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', 'I see.', 106720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga use these parasites to control weaker beings, but I was able to resist it.$B$BWe have formed a symbiotic relationship that allows me to communicate with other beings. Our minds are as one.$B$BTo remove it now would kill both of us.', '', 106719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... you have something attached to your head?', 'Uh... you have something attached to your head?', 106718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my honor to welcome $n as an Archdruid of the Cenarion Circle! May all the creatures of the wilds celebrate your ascension!', '', 106717, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength, ferocity, and nobility you have shown are without peer. It is time you were honored accordingly.', '', 106716, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts have not gone unnoticed, $n. Time and again you have proven yourself to be one of our finest.', '', 106715, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 106714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, $n. I just heard about your deeds from Remulos. Well done!$b$bIt is time that you are recognized for your deeds in service to the Cenarion Circle.', '', 106713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In time, your powers will reach heights undreamed of.', '', 106712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan\'do Malfurion awaits. Go, be recognized for your accomplishments.', '', 106711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are already more powerful than many senior members of our order. Still, I sense that even more growth is yet to come.', '', 106710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s rare that I\'m proven wrong. In this case, I\'m pleased that I was.', '', 106709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admit, I had my doubts. I never believed I\'d see anyone capable of obtaining the weapon you now hold.', '', 106708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, what ye say mon?', '', 106707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zen\'kiki want ta\' be a big an powerful, like you. I be thinkin\', I stay here and be watchin\' over ye place, keep it real good an tidy. Then, sometimes you be teachin\' me some tips.', '', 106706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Cenarion Circle gonna bring de balance to these lands with ye\' here. I be feelin\' it!', '', 106705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ey, mon! Dis be your place now. All the best digs for da Archdruids!', '', 106704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, I know a way out!', '', 106703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way. I\'ll be right behind you.', 'Lead the way. I\'ll be right behind you.', 106702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, I\'m alive and Mangelrath is dead. Let\'s get out of here before more demons arrive.$b$bI think I know a shortcut out of here, follow me!', '', 106701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so so sorry...', 'I\'m so so sorry...', 106700, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Where\'s that noise coming from?', 'Huh? Where\'s that noise coming from?', 106699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid Ringtail! You\'ve snuck into our pantry for the last time!', 'Stupid Ringtail! You\'ve snuck into our pantry for the last time!', 106698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay Haramad no mind. Deep down I know he appreciates all of that free stone.', '', 106684, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my, that doesn\'t sound good. Go ahead and head back to The Postmaster - I\'ll dismantle this portal real quick.', 106683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Katy, would you help $p and go open the old Consortium portal by the Antonidas Memorial?', '', 106681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have need of repair to your leathers I\'ll be glad to help. All of my skins were taken only from creatures that died of natural causes.', '', 106679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you there!', 106677, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t hold this forever! Do it!', 106676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this, stranger. I will find you... and I will destroy you.', '', 106675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? More of this blasted stone?!', '', 106674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your city is doomed!', 106658, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plagues of the Legion will destroy your fragile city!', 106633, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now don\'t keep me waiting, philistine. Chop chop!', '', 106625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleasure doing business with ya. You just made my freakin\' career, pal!', '', 106583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, yes.', 'Unfortunately, yes.', 106582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah, $Gman:lady;, are you sure? This ain\'t some sort of prank?', '', 106581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I.... have to sell this horse to you.', 'I.... have to sell this horse to you.', 106580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She must also be after the Pillar of Creation. This is unexpected.', '', 106575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there... naga forces. We have competition from Queen Azshara herself!', '', 106574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demon hunters have set up camp on the far side of the island. Perhaps they can help us locate the Pillar of Creation.', '', 106573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer using the greatstaff Atiesh\'s raven form. Nothing\'s worse than saddle sores.', '', 106570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the elf your elf could be, if he was me.', '', 106567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_skyreach_wind:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204316|h[Shockwave]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_skyreach_wind:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204316|h[Shockwave]|h|r.', 106522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t I just have it?', '', 106521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t lose again! It\'s mine!', '', 106520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know how long I\'ve been waiting for this?', '', 106519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t understand - I need this!', '', 106518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dibs. Dibs! I called dibs!', '', 106517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw it first!', '', 106516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will laddy! I\'ll stay alive for the both of us!', '', 106515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can still hear Brambley\'s voice in my head, tellin\' me to stay alive.', '', 106514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MassDispel:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204471|h[Focused Blast]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MassDispel:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204471|h[Focused Blast]|h|r.', 106507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Stage 2 Complete>', 106506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Stage 1 Complete>', 106505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n. With the Felsworn weakened we are one step closer to fixing this mess.', 106503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Felsworn cannot be allowed to thrive on our isle. You know what to do.', 106502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, $n!', '', 106501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, $n! We must hurry!', '', 106500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, $c!', '', 106498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine victory, and a blow dealt to the Forsaken. Vengeance moves with the Gilneas Brigade!', '', 106497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A garrison in this warden tower would be a vital strategic victory. Drive the Forsaken from it, for Gilneas!', '', 106496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 70957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A decisive victory! These Alliance lapdogs scatter before the might of the Horde!', 106495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greymane\'s forces hold this Warden tower. Break their ranks! Show no mercy!', 106494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush the puny creature!', '', 106493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the wretched slime!', '', 106492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to challenge King Morgalash!', '', 106491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, what a strange structure you are on! I can now send you directly to Highmountain from Skyhold whenever you choose!', 106490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, step through the portal into the Dreamway. I will meet with you on the other side.', '', 106489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are my options again?', 'What are my options again?', 106488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must each choose our own path.', '', 106487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_thunderking_overcharge:20|t Odyn begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Summon Stormforged Obliterator]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_thunderking_overcharge:20|t Odyn begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201215|h[Summon Stormforged Obliterator]|h|r!', 106486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_flashoflight:20|t Odyn begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:198077|h[Shatter Spears]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_flashoflight:20|t Odyn begins to |cFFFF0404|Hspell:198077|h[Shatter Spears]|h|r!', 106485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s go.', '', 106484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just follow my lead when we\'re inside and try not to disturb anything unless I say so.', '', 106483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to get to work? There are many artifacts to be found in these lands.', '', 106482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve marked the location of the entrance on your map. Meet me there when you\'re ready to continue.', '', 106481, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day 40: A massive ettin trampled through my workshop at Koralune Manor. Scared him away with magic. Have a feeling he will be back...', '', 106480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insignificant slime. You have meddled in our affairs for the last time.', '', 106479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure can! Take this metal and melt it by the forge. Then pour it into the mold. When that\'s done, you can cool it over by the quenching trough.', '', 106478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alard, could you help me cast a new set of keys?', 'Alard, could you help me cast a new set of keys?', 106477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work. That ore was a favorite of Deathwing\'s during the cataclysm. It is a powerful weapon when used for evil.', '', 106476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Greystone drogbar managed to somehow acquire elementium. Neither they nor the Highmountain tribes can possibly understand how dangerous this material is. Please, recover it from them.', '', 106475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He gave them a cause worth fighting for. Not a weapon to rally behind.', '', 106474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huln united the tribes even before finding the hammer? How?', 106473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that your experience with new leaders talking, Lowlander?', 106472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. It is my experience with hot headed leaders.', '', 106471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must learn to trust those who are willing to help you.', '', 106470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameRing:20|t Skovald begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:193826|h[Ragnarok]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameRing:20|t Skovald begins to cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:193826|h[Ragnarok]|h|r!', 106469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my case, saving my people also means getting revenge for my father.', 106468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They tell me your father was killed as well. Did you avenge him?', 106467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not as such. I had to make the choice, as you do, of indulging my desire for revenge or saving my people.', '', 106466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wise words, Lowlander.', 106465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for getting those bottles back for us!', 106460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Doomhammer...', '', 106459, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to leave the instance?', 'Are you sure you want to leave the instance?', 106458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will let the other wardens know of Cordana\'s fate.', 'I will let the other wardens know of Cordana\'s fate.', 106457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planting Explosives', 'Planting Explosives', 106456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This crown once adorned the brow of Mavrana Mooncrest. It conveyed an incredible amount of arcane power, allowing her to achieve nearly-limitless mastery over the magical arts.$b$bDuring the War of the Ancients, the crown was stolen by rival nobles, and its precious jewels were removed and sold. It was eventually recovered, but without the Jewels of Aellis which gave it such potency.$b$bTo this day, the jewels remain lost.', '', 106455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for the felfire breath! Hide behind something when he does that!', '', 106454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It IS my voice you daft dwarf! I\'m ALIVE!', '', 106453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Angus, I\'m alive! I\'m up here!', '', 106452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! That should remind those vrykul that Highmountain is no easy summit to take.', '', 106451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul raiders are testing our border defenses. Our forces are stretched too thin. Can you help?', '', 106450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. That should remind the vrykul that Highmountain is no easy summit to take.', '', 106449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul raiders are testing the border defenses of Highmountain. Our allies could use your help, champion.', '', 106448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Brambley\'s Dagger! We\'ll take it home an\' bury it with the rest o\' him.', '', 106447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och, looks like the demons chewed on this one. Aye, it\'s still moist...', '', 106446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take ye home Brambley! Piece by piece, I swear it!', '', 106445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good eye! That\'s his alright... I\'d know it a mile away!', '', 106444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ACK! Don\'t tell me we\'re still missn\' a piece!', '', 106443, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here lies his mighty arm that defended the realm in so many battles!', '', 106442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all the pieces. Now why is there a hole in the middle... ?', '', 106441, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So then this piece goes over here...', '', 106440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this disc assembled, shall we?!', '', 106439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry Brambley, I\'ll carry yer wee head to safety!', '', 106438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this vantage point I can keep a watchful eye on the Alliance supply routes to the Swamp of Sorrows.$b$bIt is a thankless task, but vital should our enemies move against our forces at Stonard.', '', 106437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water Elemental - Explanation', '', 106436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water Elemental Intro', '', 106435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just out for a stroll. I might tour the Menagerie. Have you been there recently?', '', 106434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must apologize, but I do not have time to speak with you right now. I am waiting for someone.', '', 106433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a day. What a lovely day.', '', 106432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deception! Perfidy! We are invaded!', '', 106431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, this is surprising. Tell me, does Lespin know?', '', 106430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, can I help you?$b$bLespin sent you? So he could not even be bothered to show up himself.$b$bWell, I suppose I have already received my payment, so I do not particularly care what happens to the ring now.$b$bHere, take the ring. Tell Lespin it had better be worth it.', '', 106429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Patience, brother. To gaze upon Talonclaw will be a sight to remember. Look! Our friend returns!', 106428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our tribe\'s greatest weapon and its ancient enemy are but a few strides away! I will not be stopped by some foul fog magic!', '', 106427, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 62680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feathermane Kitten playfully swipes at the reeds.', '', 106426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm yourself, Wuho!', 106425, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 62679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come here, friend. I\'ve got something that will help you with clearing out these Forsaken!', '', 106424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your flare gun to mark your target. Our assassins attack on your command!', '', 106423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death claims you!', 'Death claims you!', 106422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Banshee Queen sends her regards.', 'The Banshee Queen sends her regards.', 106421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another skull for the pile.', 'Another skull for the pile.', 106420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness cloaks my every move...', 'Darkness cloaks my every move...', 106419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Climb on the Toogus\' back.', 'Climb on the Toogus\' back.', 106418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I fade into darkness.', 'I fade into darkness.', 106417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike!', 'Strike!', 106416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The sea turtle speaks directly to your mind.>$B$BYou are a stranger to my waters. What purpose could bring you here?', '', 106415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, die, die!', 'Die, die, die!', 106414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A val\'kyr arrives and pulls you from the brink of death!', 'A val\'kyr arrives and pulls you from the brink of death!', 106413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you spare my life, I promise to swear my allegiance to you. And here, look, I have a valuable artifact that you may have as well.', '', 106412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, stop! Please don\'t kill me!', '', 106411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PREPARE TO FACE YOUR DOOM, $n! IT IS I, WYRMY TUNKINS AND I WILL BE THIS WORLD\'S UNDOING!', '', 106410, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot be stopped!', '', 106409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are everywhere!', '', 106408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 106407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is only the beginning!', '', 106406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those hand blades look so sharp! Why, I bet you could slice a boulder in half!', 'Those hand blades look so sharp! Why, I bet you could slice a boulder in half!', 106405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something must be wrong with me, it\'s getting hot all of a sudden.', 'Something must be wrong with me, it\'s getting hot all of a sudden.', 106404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sword... oh no... is that Apocalylpse!? I\'m glad the Burning Legion didn\'t get their hands on it!', 'That sword... oh no... is that Apocalylpse!? I\'m glad the Burning Legion didn\'t get their hands on it!', 106403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skull on that axe looks... hungry.', 'The skull on that axe looks... hungry.', 106402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those blades... just looking at them makes me feel cold.', 'Those blades... just looking at them makes me feel cold.', 106401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The apparition speaks, but you hear nothing.$B$BHe gestures at your equipment.>', '', 106400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
