('Enough of this! To me, Su\'esh! Destroy these interlopers!', '', 106261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine start! The Kirin Tor have given us a permanent portal to Dalaran, as well as one that will bring you from the city back to Netherlight. Good luck!', '', 106260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test the Legion Beta! \n\nI can teleport you directly into a number of raid or dungeon instances that are currently open for testing. This is just a teleport, not a match-making service, so I hope you have a party ready to tackle the challenges waiting inside. If not, you might want to check out our new Group Finder feature to find some allies.\n\nMake sure you have selected the difficulty you want to test before teleporting, since you may not be able to zone out easily if you need to change the difficulty setting!', '', 106259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon the Burning Legion\'s presence on Azeroth.', 'Gaze upon the Burning Legion\'s presence on Azeroth.', 106258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel blood froths violently, a swirl of obfuscated shapes bubbling just below the surface.', 'The fel blood froths violently, a swirl of obfuscated shapes bubbling just below the surface.', 106257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so... beautiful!', 106256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That eagle would fly better with mechanical wings!', '', 106255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My people tell legends of such spirits, but I have never seen one.', 106254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The eagle loa! Praise the spirits!', 106253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the local trash have been stealing our vintage bottles, can you track them down and bring them back to me? Some of those bottles are irreplaceable!', 106252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll want to see this for yourself.', '', 106251, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plight of Azeroth is far more grave than we first thought.', 106250, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('temp:\nCasting Frostbolt will occasionally grant you Fingers of Frost and Brain Freeze effects.  Fingers of Frost causes your Ice lance to treat your target as if it were frozen, doing incredible damage.  Brain Freeze will resets the cooldown on Frozen Orb.  Try using both now.', '', 106249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('temp:\nYour hardest hitting abilities are Ice Lance against frozen targets and Frozen orb.  Since not every creature can be frozen and because Frozen Orb has a long cooldown, there are two effects you will gain in combat.', '', 106248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes my former student, $n, death incarnate! One day I\'d like to hear about the techniques you\'ve learned in the field.', '', 106246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see to the others, Farseer.', 'I will see to the others, Farseer.', 106245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. I am pleased you received Thrall\'s summons.$b$bYou can see, there are no factions here. We few are all that remain of the Earthen Ring, and we must struggle together or surely we will perish alone.$b$bSurvivors continue to make their way here from the four corners of Azeroth. See that their wounds are tended to. They need hope if they are to rejoin the fight, $n. You must inspire them!', '', 106244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skinning', 'Skinning', 106243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing sweeter... than to die at sea...', '', 106242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders on the Naglfar! Give no quarter to these scallywags!', '', 106241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57461, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their trinkets for yourselves, but leave their souls for me!', '', 106240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut them down and heave their souls into the tides!', '', 106239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your foul magics are no match for my blade!', '', 106238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!', '', 106237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands will not be ruined by your kind!', '', 106236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 106235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the Crossroads until reinforcements arrive! Show these demons what it means to fight for the Horde!', '', 106234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements to the Crossroads at once! We\'re under attack!', '', 106233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push them back! We cannot let the Crossroads fall!', '', 106232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons think we will just give up the Crossroads without a fight?', '', 106231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was taught to see every $r as my enemy. But the Legion would wipe us all from this world.$b$bSo I have chosen to follow the Unseen Path, and I stand with you.', 106230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friends in the Kirin Tor have created one of their magical portals to provide quick travel to Dalaran. You can find it near the steps to the temple.', '', 106229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been waiting for this day.', '', 106228, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 58205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whenever you\'re ready.', '', 106227, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and Sisters, the invaders come for us. Repel them! Attack!', '', 106226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please excuse me, $n. I\'m preparing a report for the other masters.', '', 106225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our new home, $n.', '', 106224, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 58206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Slime_01:20|t A Congealing Goo was able to finish |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201495|h[Recongealing]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Slime_01:20|t A Congealing Goo was able to finish |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201495|h[Recongealing]|h|r!', 106222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now. Hruthnir waits at the Sky Launch to aid you.', '', 106221, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 70414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is steeped in titan architecture. Why, jes over that hill to tha north is a \'uge titan chamber!', '', 106219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new continent full of forgotten secrets!', '', 106218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Fragments of the Past!$b$bAre you interested in learning about Archaeology?', 106217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muffinus, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan.', 'Muffinus, allow me to introduce $n, who helped us rescue survivors in Gnomeregan.', 106216, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Muffinus Chromebrew.', 'Follow me, $n, and I\'ll introduce you to your trainer, Muffinus Chromebrew.', 106215, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you as excited as me to be here, $c?', 'Are you as excited as me to be here, $c?', 106214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry $g pal:lady;, I can\'t help ya. Find a $c trainer. I only teach hunters!', 'Sorry $g pal:lady;, I can\'t help ya. Find a $c trainer. I only teach hunters!', 106213, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch over me from above, my brothers, and save me a seat in the hall!', '', 106212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there! The val\'kyr!', '', 106211, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the val\'kyr claim you, Haardgrim!', 106210, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 60432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alrik, my battle brother! I will avenge you!', '', 106209, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 60431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s get down to Azsuna, Khadgar.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s get down to Azsuna, Khadgar.', 106208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A val\'kyr approaches! We must greet her with respect. Come, heroes!', 106207, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye:20|tSmashspite\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198079|h[Hateful Gaze]|h|r falls on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_BloodyEye:20|tSmashspite\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198079|h[Hateful Gaze]|h|r falls on $n!', 106206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s mine! You won\'t take her!', '', 106205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul, harvested!', '', 106204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord.. I have.. failed you...', '', 106203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will unleash a scourge upon this citadel never before known to your kind!', '', 106202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A death most deserved.', '', 106201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic worm!', '', 106200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our hatred knows no bounds!', '', 106199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will fuel our engines!', '', 106198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such insolence! We will make your death terrible, and your suffering long.', '', 106197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the best laid plans don\'t survive contact with the enemy.', '', 106196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the wind be always under your wings.', 'May the wind be always under your wings.', 106195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All are welcome to take the great Aviana\'s test of flight. Please form an orderly line to receive her blessing.', 'All are welcome to take the great Aviana\'s test of flight. Please form an orderly line to receive her blessing.', 106194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am certain that if anyone can help you find this Pillar of Creation, it will be my grandfather.', 106193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sadly, it\'s probably too late for him... don\'t foolishly throw your lives away for a dead man!', '', 106192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friend was taken to the felstalker pits beneath the great Burning Legion command ship.', '', 106191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In rescuing Stellagosa, you have made a powerful friend and ally.\n\nI am relieved that the Blue Dragonflight has survived, even if just barely. We must travel to the Azurewing Repose and speak with this Senegos.\n\nIf anyone can point us down the right path to locating the Pillar of Creation, surely it will be him.', '', 106190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_48:20|tFree $n from their bonds before they are |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202361|h[Executed!]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Sword_48:20|tFree $n from their bonds before they are |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202361|h[Executed!]|h|r', 106189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG - Path Failed', '', 106188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here!', 'Let\'s get out of here!', 106187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_felfireraid_d_01:20|t%s readies their axe for a  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:203641|h[Fel Slash]|h|r at $n!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_felfireraid_d_01:20|t%s readies their axe for a  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:203641|h[Fel Slash]|h|r at $n!', 106186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fought well this day, $n. I am in your debt.$b$bI\'m ready to use the portal stone and take us back to Dalaran.', 106185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Dismantle:20|tYou\'re caught in a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204348|h[Cruel Trap]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Dismantle:20|tYou\'re caught in a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:204348|h[Cruel Trap]|h|r!', 106184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It fades. It all fades away...', 106183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children of madness! I release you upon this world!', '', 106182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace is but a fleeting dream! Let the Nightmare reign!', '', 106181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wicked souls shall feed my power!', '', 106180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense the shadow on your hearts. There can be no rest for the wicked!', '', 106179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taste the Nightmare\'s corruption!', 106178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope is a disease of the soul! This land shall wither and die!', 106177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come forth, dreamers... and claim your vengeance!', 106176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The strands of life have been severed! The dreamers must be avenged!', 106175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vrykul are nothing! We will wash over them and destroy their village!', '', 106174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will be victorious! Slay any intruder that daresss enter our watersss!', 106173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You put on a good show in there!', '', 106172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are few rules atop these cliffs... and absolutely no mercy! Tame a beast, mount up, and kill everyone you see! If you die, you prove your lack of worth.', '', 106171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work hard, my naga! We will destroy Jandvik!', '', 106170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not the best yet, but I\'m gonna keep practicing!', 106169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turns out there\'s a lot more to being a hunter than just shooting game!', 106168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your training really inspired me to join the Unseen Path!', 106167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you must come to the Azurewing Repose and meet with my grandfather, Senegos.', 106165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be no feast for the ettins this night. The Rivermane thank you!', 106163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those ettins are building a huge bonfire to cook and eat my tribesmen! You have to stop them!', 106162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those ettins are building a huge bonfire to cook and eat my tribesmen! You have to stop them!', 106161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as we hold this ground the scum can\'t move freely in the area. They\'ll have no choice but to fight!', 'So long as we hold this ground the scum can\'t move freely in the area. They\'ll have no choice but to fight!', 106160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience. The enemy will bring themselves to us, and we will show them Gilnean fury!', 'Patience. The enemy will bring themselves to us, and we will show them Gilnean fury!', 106159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On a scale of 1 to 10, how bad does this hurt?', 106158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I know these towers are strategically important, but Lord Greymane promised me vengeance!', 'I know these towers are strategically important, but Lord Greymane promised me vengeance!', 106157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope this doesn\'t kill you... I want to play more...', 106156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Greymane promised we\'d be neck deep battle by now. I didn\'t sign up for guard duty!', 'Lord Greymane promised we\'d be neck deep battle by now. I didn\'t sign up for guard duty!', 106155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t run, I want to see your tears.', 106154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t leave, you can NEVER LEAVE!', 106153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get over here, I want to play with your blood.', 106152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t get away. You are MINE!', 106151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you scream loud enough, maybe I will let you die.', 106150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ettin prince is dead! Let\'s get out of here!', 'The ettin prince is dead! Let\'s get out of here!', 106149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which do you like more, screaming or crying? I like to hear you do both.', 106148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your screams are funny... Make me laugh!', 106147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have tried to teach them to kill you slowly... But they just won\'t listen.', 106146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run. Heh,  it is fun to watch you run.', 106145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And along came a spider...', 106144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t look behind you.', 106143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What!? Why would you do this?', 106142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope the next one doesn\'t break so quick.', 106141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate it when my toys stop screaming.', 106140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do they break so easy?', 106139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is why I can\'t have nice things.', 106138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh goody, playthings.', 106137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I have a CRUSH on you. Heh.', '', 106136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you to splinters.', '', 106135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will snap you like a twig!', '', 106134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be my campfire!', '', 106133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 106132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rip the Claws from your lifeless hands!', '', 106131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to become kindling!', '', 106130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The sword... How can you overcome its power?!', '', 106129, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. The Dreamgrove has its own gate to the Dreamway. Through it, you can travel to the far corners of Azeroth.', '', 106128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sss... souls of the dead! Aid your master!', '', 106127, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not the only one who can control the undead, death knight!', '', 106126, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elune-Adore, $n. I must speak with you at once!', '', 106125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The balance must be restored.', '', 106124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are ready for you.', 106123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, do your best. Nightglaive has been undergoing some \"changes\".', 106122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks, $pr. Now I am going to finish off the warden who did this to me.', 106120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_insect_swarm2:20|t Nythendra inhales for an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:202977|h[Infested Breath]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_insect_swarm2:20|t Nythendra inhales for an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:202977|h[Infested Breath]|h|r!', 106119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The greatest shaman in the world are gathering below. What\'s left of \'em, that is.', 106117, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 60520, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More o\' the Deacon\'s mind games. We could Mass Dispel \'em or just fight through, but I would\'na get too close!', '', 106116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trap! Destroy the creature before it kills us!', '', 106115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It calls to souls long dead... RISE!', '', 106114, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathwing_assualtaspects:20|t%s goes into a crazed |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198388|h[Blood Frenzy]|h|r!', '', 106113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapons of old... Yes, they would help indeed! But they are beyond our ability to wield.', '', 106112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A moment of your time, warlock. The Council of the Black Harvest requests your assistance.', '', 106111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 71324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, I wish our meeting were under better circumstances. Surely you have felt the tremors emanating from the Emerald Dream?', '', 106108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE NIGHTMARE GROWS! THE NIGHTMARE DEVOURS!', '', 106107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STAMP AND TRAMPLE! CRUSH AND CRUMPLE!', '', 106106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should have fled. SHOULD HAVE LISTENED!', '', 106105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the will of the Nightmare Lord!', '', 106104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are free of this place... how I envy you!', '', 106103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare\'s veil is lifted... I return at last... to the long slumber.', '', 106102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have fled! Now I\'ll feed your bones to the storm crows!', '', 106101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_bearhug:20|t%s targets |cFFFF0000$n|r with an intense |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198006|h[Focused Gaze]|h|r!', '', 106100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, we must find the Druids of Val\'sharah and request their aid.', '', 106099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s causes a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204839|h[Whirling Maelstrom]|h|r!', '%s causes a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204839|h[Whirling Maelstrom]|h|r!', 106098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear. Come, let us continue to our destination.', '', 106097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! Even now the foul creep of the Nightmare has begun to recede.', '', 106096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cleanse these Nightmare vines from our path. Go forth, $n, and destroy the source of the corruption that spawned them!', '', 106095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The Nightmare... in this part of the Dream? How is it possible?', '', 106094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, I feel something... disturbing. Quickly $n, this way!', '', 106093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Dreamway, $n. A journey that would take days upon Azeroth is but a few steps here.', '', 106092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the cannonballs. Let\'s go blast some naga.', 'If you want to kill more naga, bring me more cannonballs.', 106091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blade was taken somewhere in northwestern Tirisfal. I\'ve marked a location on your map where you can begin your search.', '', 106090, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want to kill more naga, bring me more cannonballs.', '', 106089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your human friend was taken by the demons. Grant me my freedom and I will tell you where he was taken!', '', 106088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204779|h[Drifting Away]|h|r! Dispel him!', '%s is |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204779|h[Drifting Away]|h|r! Dispel her!', 106087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready.', 'I\'m ready.', 106086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dark times - I\'m glad you\'re with us.', '', 106085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have chosen well. Such a weapon will strike fear into the hearts of our foes!', 106084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings to you both. The tremors from the Emerald Dream grow more potent. We must begin the ritual at once!', '', 106083, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon hunters? How odd, covering your eyes like that. Doesn\'t it make it hard to see the world around you?', '', 106082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me select my artifact.', 'Let me select my artifact.', 106081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can Calydus help you, friend?', '', 106080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unless we find a way to turn this around, Azeroth will fall!', 106079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a massacre out there. All around the world, our forces fall back.', 106078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the site of my final battle... and there lies my foe. Even now, Zakajz struggles for consciousness. You must hurry!', '', 106077, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 60467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thank you for playing. The second half of the Demon Hunter Intro in the Vault of the Wardens will be coming soon.>', '', 106076, 0, 38477, 0, 81, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_stranglevines:20|tUse |cFFFF0000|Hspell:339|h[Entangling Roots]|h|r, knockbacks, or stuns to keep Ariden away from you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_stranglevines:20|tUse |cFFFF0000|Hspell:339|h[Entangling Roots]|h|r, knockbacks, or stuns to keep Ariden away from you!', 106075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin the ritual.', 'Let\'s begin the ritual.', 106074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to begin, $n?', '', 106073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which fist do ye want? How about both!', '', 106072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och, what happened to yer face? MAH FISTS!', '', 106071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, shaman! We\'ve no time to lose.', 106070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, I\'ll go easy on ye!', '', 106069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, THAT\'S a face worth punching!', '', 106068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who ordered a knuckle sandwich?!', '', 106067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och! This one fell off the ugly tree an\' hit my fists on the way down!', '', 106066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who needs an axe when ye\'ve got fists o\' steel!', '', 106065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye wanna fight, eh? I\'ll give ye a fight!', '', 106064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The history of the Tirisgarde is a storied one. In short, it is a gathering of Azeroth\'s most battle-hardened mages armed with relics of great power. They are charged with defending Azeroth in the absence of the Guardian of Tirisfal. \n\nThey are normally only called together when the world faces a grave threat. The last time they were assembled was to bring back the rogue Guardian, Aegwynn. For centuries the Tirisgarde hunted her, utilizing some of the most powerful artifacts that Azeroth had known. \n\nWith the dissolving of the Council of Tirisfal, their mission was left unfinished. We will not let that happen here.', '', 106059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits thank you. Hopefully the stink of drogbar doesn\'t linger too long.', 106058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These brutes have no respect for the spirits. They\'ve infested our sacred cavern with their stench!', 106057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 76672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got a light touch with that foot of yours. Most of those fish survived the kicking.', 106056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill one drogbar, and another comes out of the darkness to crap in our river! In my day, they stayed in their caves... Mind sending them back to the shadows?', 106055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon me, I forget that my name is not well known these days. \n\nI am Meryl Felstorm, once known as Meryl Winterstorm. I was a founding member of the Council of Tirisfal, but was required to abandon my duties when I became possessed by the dreadlord Kathra\'natir. I was able to contain him... for the most part... but the risk was too great for me to remain on the council.\n\nI have since dedicated my life to finding a way to banish the demon once and for all. It seems I have failed.', '', 106054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forge of the Guardian is an artifact of incredible power. \n\nIt was devised by the Archmage Alodi as a method of permanently transferring the arcane power of many mages into the body of one, thus creating a Guardian of Tirisfal. \n\nThe last time it was used was in the time of Aegwynn. Since she refused to return her powers so another Guardian could be imbued, the forge was locked away behind the arcane barriers of the Violet Hold.\n\nIts location was known only to the Council. That is, until now.', '', 106053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for helping with the harvest, $n. Bugs make my old bones crawl...', 106052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our crops are dying! I don\'t know what the drogbar did or how they dug up even more insects to throw at us, but we need your help!', 106051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Tirisgarde.', 'Tell me more about the Tirisgarde.', 106050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, who are you again?', 'Wait, who are you again?', 106049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Forge of the Guardian?', 'What is the Forge of the Guardian?', 106048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $n?', '', 106047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord Kathra\'natir is defeated, but only for now. If we wish to save Azeroth from his evil, we must reform the Tirisgarde. \n\nThen we can hunt him down in the Twisting Nether before he has a chance to share his secrets with the Burning Legion.', '', 106046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must make haste to the Violet Hold! \n\nKathra\'nathir must not be allowed access to the Forge of the Guardian!', '', 106045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Softsssskin fights well... retreat!', '', 106044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yesssss... killl them all.', '', 106043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
