('The Rockaway murlocs are in pain! Their normally pure waters are full of muck. The Murkwater naga must be driven back to the depths!', '', 106041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, filthy $c! Baelbug find the glaive and keeps it!', '', 106040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself. Step into the circle when you are ready.', '', 106039, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect the lodge, boy. That\'s a good wolf!', 106038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
