('My bark is worse than my bite.', '', 105981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t make it in time...', 105980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Guard is no more.', '', 105979, 0, 0, 457, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could not protect them all...', '', 105978, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Throndyr lies dead in the mud.>', '', 105977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A legion of these naga could not overpower Jarl Throndyr. Only their venomous treachery could defeat him.', '', 105976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The vrykul barely acknowledges your presence.>', '', 105975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find wood to construct a pyre. I will take care of moving his body.', '', 105974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will wait for you in Shal\'Aran, return there when you are ready. We have much to discuss.', 105973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion has been dealt a great blow this day, but our work is far from over.', 105972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice place ya got here!', '', 105971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Thank you, hero.', '', 105970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_DeviousPoisons:20|t Nythendra infests you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204463|h[Volatile Rot]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_DeviousPoisons:20|t Nythendra infests you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204463|h[Volatile Rot]|h|r!', 105969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My naga will wash over Jandvik in a tidal wave of destruction!', 105968, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without its leaders, I will easily destroy Jandvik from within!', 105967, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ssshould thank you for doing my dirty work, $n. But now you are proving too troublesome to keep alive.', 105966, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infidels! Submit to my will, or DIE in the flames of the Legion!', '', 105965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Piece o\' cake! See ya on the other side!', '', 105964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s see if I can get a portal through those wards you\'re talkin\' about.', '', 105963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over there, on the right. That must be the cauldron we are looking for.', 105962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this is the Halls of Valor? Amazing. Wait... is that my master?', 105961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! There may be more coming soon.', 'Quickly! There may be more coming soon.', 105960, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in your debt, $n.', 'I\'m in your debt, $n.', 105959, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not every day you get rescued by a $c!', 'Not every day you get rescued by a $c!', 105958, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thought I\'d never escape!', 'Thought I\'d never escape!', 105957, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you\'re hunting, Razik has a gadget that\'s guaranteed to take your target down.', 105956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons are relentless!', 'These demons are relentless!', 105955, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks.', 'Thanks.', 105954, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204237|h[Gravely Wounded]|h|r and cannot fight until healed!', '%s is |cFFFF0404|Hspell:204237|h[Gravely Wounded]|h|r and cannot fight until healed!', 105953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you in need of rest or healing today?', 105952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kobolds cause a tremendous amount of damage with their sloppy mining techniques. That high up they could bring a chunk of that mountain down on top of us in no time. Well done rooting them out.', '', 105951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pathfinders report a nest of kobolds is taking up residence in the Echoing Halls. Feel up for a rat chase?', '', 105950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every now and then something evil lurking in the deep places of the world decides to crawl up and threaten us. I am grateful you caught it early.', 105949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something dark is afoot in the Echoing Halls. We have felt a malevolent presence there perverting the waters that flow to the rest of the land. Find the source of the corruption and exterminate it.', 105948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t even want to guess how much damage those enraged furies could have unleashed upon Thunder Totem if left unchecked.', 105947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hear the scream of the earth. The drogbar shardmasters are performing a dark ritual that drives these crystal furies into a horrendous rage. The furies must be stopped before they cause untold damage to Thunder Totem.', 105946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, excellent choice in crystals. This should be enough for my rituals.', '', 105945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need crystals for my rituals and you need to have less furies amassing on the Thunder Totem border. I have a plan to get both of us what we want. How are your riding skills?', '', 105944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, champion. The Greystone drogbar are getting far too ambitious these days.', 105943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shardmasters from Greystone are performing some sort of empowering ritual within the chasm of the Crystal Fissure. This is too close to Thunder Totem for comfort. Can you stop them?', 105942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I used to applaud the drogbar\'s kinship with nature until they used it to slaughter my people and attack my lands. You have my thanks, champion.', 105941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Basilisk Bazaar is a very dangerous event held by the drogbar where they trade, fight, and skin their lizard pets. Disrupting this will set their forces back a peg or two and keep our local farmlands safe for a time.', 105940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pathfinders tracked a pair of Stonebinders to Bitestone Enclave. They were disciples of Dargrul and are very dangerous. This is a meeting that must be stopped.', '', 105939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! That should slow down their efforts to get organized.', '', 105938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Bitestones. All brul and no brains. Well done!', '', 105937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bitestone keep stealing goods from my people. Time to steal some of it back. Up for a little burgling?', '', 105936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. I appreciate you preventing my people from being reduced to basilisk chow.', '', 105935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We lost contact with one of my pathfinder teams that was scouting the Greystone area. Please, find them.', '', 105934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse... you...', '', 105933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will answer for the Sashj\'tar you have ssslain!', '', 105932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Restore them, and help us create a new locus of power here in Shal\'Aran!', 105931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See here. This is the feed from Anora. And there are many others still lying dormant.', 105930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blizzard Explanation', '', 105929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blizzard Intro', '', 105928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is... atop the crypt! Prepare yourself!', '', 105927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are victorious!', 105926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here they come!', 105925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses upon ye, demons! CURSES UPON YE!', '', 105924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I feared, one of the monster\'s minions has returned. Its presence is corrupting the wards of the tomb and blocking the path. You must destroy the tendrils to draw it out!', '', 105923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice Lance explanation\n(Icelance does double damage against frozen targets)', '', 105922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice Lance Intro', '', 105921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those demons musta\' ate ol\' Brambley... look at him! He\'s just bones, now!', '', 105920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! That\'s Brambley\'s helm, I\'d recognize it anywhere!', '', 105919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brambley! No... no it canna\' be true!', '', 105918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, let\'s get him the key... but be on your guard. This place is crawling with demons.', '', 105917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta get to Brambley, before it\'s too late!', '', 105916, 0, 38708, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you\'re hunting, Razik has a gadget that\'s guaranteed to take your target down.\n\nHis latest prototypes are preloaded and ready to go. Just grab one from the weapon rack and start shooting.\n\nJust remember, you test at your own risk!', 105915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hobart\'s not gonna be too \'appy to \'ear about \'is gunpack. How \'ave ye been, $glad:lass;?', '', 105914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As soon as yeh stop, everythin\' will reset an\' yeh should be good ta go fer another try.', '', 105913, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll be goin\' so fast, ye\'ll stay afloat. So mind yer ammo, cause when it runs out, yer goin\' kerplunk into tha water.', '', 105912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, just as one pulls thread from cotton, so too can we draw power from the leylines.', 105911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Sashj\'tar come!', 'Let the Sashj\'tar come!', 105910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Far below us, rivers of raw arcane power course throughout the land. The leylines are eternal, primal, and impossible to control.', 105909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are a fine $c. I would gladly fight by your side again!$B$BWhen I return to Jandvik, we shall sing songs of our battle over flagons of ale!', 105908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Allow me to educate you on the fundamentals.', 105907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have much experience with leyline energy? I should think not.', 105906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail $c!$B$BI tracked a group of Sashj\'tar across the bay to this cave.$B$BMany fell to my blade, but a few managed to slither away. I have little doubt that they will return with greater numbers to try and slay me.$B$BIf you welcome a glorious battle, bolster yourself and ready your weapon.$B$BIf not, stay out of my way or I will kill you myself.', 105905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, we can examine the feed from down here.', 105904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, First Arcanist.', 105903, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 67257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You would be wise not to turn your nose up at the outsiders. None of us would be here without their help.', 105902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 67256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And Valtrois?', 105901, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 67255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If... you insist.', 105900, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 67246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and bring the outlander with you.', 105899, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 67247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Crunchy bones.', '', 105898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat you up.', '', 105897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tasty morsel.', '', 105896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still... hungry...', '', 105895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh! Meat!', '', 105894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couple of quick tips \'bout them booties. As soon as yeh activate them, yer gonna take off faster than a rogue in an arena match.', '', 105893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Portals are good to go, boss! Now if ya don\'t mind, I\'m gonna check out the digs here...', '', 105892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I saw this antechamber, I knew we had found something... momentous. Here was a door so oddly familiar, like a long-forgotten memory. We broke the first seal.', '', 105891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those murlocs be up ta no good, oh aye. I know this \'cause I can smell somethin\' fishy.', '', 105890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I notice you\'re not wearing any earrings. Could I interest you in pair of bolt-action carbine hoops? They\'re not very rusty!', '', 105889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gratitude, stranger.', 105888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too heavy. Lift more!', '', 105887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry! Darkness come soon.', '', 105886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shinies!', '', 105885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no! Lift more! Lift!', '', 105884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vile... ssslime...', '', 105883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can be prisoners for the Tidemistress now or I can ssslay you now!', '', 105882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De spirits, they be silent ta\' me on dis. That mean dey not opposed ta it either. Very well, I\'ll meet ye at da ritual.', 105881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prepare a fel bat at Krasus\' Landing to take you to Suramar. Varedis\' time has come.', '', 105880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrupting Portal', 'Disrupting Portal', 105879, 0, 38172, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sssssssssssssssssssssssssss...', '', 105878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all we needed. Finish him off.', '', 105877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not test our patience. Tell us where your master is... or die!', '', 105876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ensure no one interferes. The demon is all yours.', '', 105875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zen\'tabra closes her eyes for a moment.', 105874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, time to see if we can really be makin\' this happen. This gonna\' be needin\' everything we have ta give and more.', 105873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the naga!', '', 105872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now\'s our chance!', 105871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Sashj\'tar!', '', 105870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion is ready to begin. He asks that you head to the ritual site.', 'Malfurion is ready to begin. He asks that you head to the ritual site.', 105869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts mean NOTHING! Soon all of Suramar will bow to my master\'s will!', '', 105868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya be needin\' something?', 105867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in death, the monster is restless. Its corruption has spread throughout the tomb. You will have to fight your way through!', '', 105866, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it time for the ritual to begin? Very well, I\'ll meet you there.', '', 105865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gently tap on his shoulder.>', '<Gently tap on his shoulder.>', 105864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Quietly stand nearby.>', '<Quietly stand nearby.>', 105863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call it Strom\'kar, the Warbreaker.\n\nThe Arathi held to the oldest ways of weaponsmithing, older than I can remember. I used those and special metals to craft my sword. Then I took it through the greatest battles any of us had ever seen and it never let us down. It has saved my life many times and turned many a battle in my hands to victory.\n\nAfter the Troll Wars the grateful elves gave me a personal gift. Their greatest mages and smiths took Strom\'kar and empowered it with strong elven enchantments. I think it is that magic that is keeping the creature from awakening. I fear what centuries of lying buried in that monster has done to the Warbreaker.', '', 105862, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Naralex sits quietly with his eyes shut.>', '<Naralex sits quietly with his eyes shut.>', 105861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No need to be quiet, $n. The trees already whispered to me of your arrival.', '', 105860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eternal... slumber...', '', 105859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who disturbs my sleep?', '', 105858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... eels...', '', 105857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny slime! My eels will eat you alive!', '', 105856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about your sword that keeps the monster dead.', 'Tell me about your sword that keeps the monster dead.', 105855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course.', '', 105854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It had been laying down there for countless centuries, its master an ancient evil that Tyr fought even longer ago. With the seals down it began to heal and in its awakening it called deep below the earth for aid.\n\nHorrific creatures crawled out of the chasm inside the prison and we were attacked. I knew I had made a terrible mistake, this thing was more powerful than even the trolls. I knew it had to be stopped before fully awakening.\n\nWe made the ultimate sacrifice. Even barely conscious the monster killed the last of my comrades easily, but they gave me time. I managed to bury my sword, Strom\'kar, into its brain even as its claws crushed the life from me.\n\nIt is dead, but the seals cannot be replaced. Its death is only temporary.', '', 105853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair enough. Let\'s get this over with, then.', '', 105852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re fortunate that Khadgar trusts you. But make no mistake... I do not share his sentiment.', '', 105851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good ta see yeh again, $glad:lass;! These elves need all tha \'elp we can give \'em!', '', 105850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All we want is a few moments with the eredar... alone. He has information we need.', '', 105849, 0, 36911, 1, 64, 0, 58207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was dead but awoke?', 'It was dead but awoke?', 105848, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eredar you\'re holding possesses critical information. We need a few minutes alone with him.', '', 105847, 0, 36910, 1, 64, 0, 64625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After seeing Arathor in good hands, I took my closest retainers and began my quest for the origins of our tribes. We roamed throughout these lands digging up pieces of the past until our path came here.\n\nIn my excitement and need for answers I ignored the warnings and had my mages break open the seals to something beneath this lake. It was a tomb like nothing I had ever seen before. We were so close and rushed in deeper before truly understanding what we were seeing. Lying there was the being that brought our ancestors here, bearing the symbol that had haunted and inspired people from this area forever.\n\nBut that wasn\'t all. The monster this \"Tyr\" fought also lay here, and I had broken the seals that kept it dead.', '', 105846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have to lose either way?', 'What do you have to lose either way?', 105845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to find out?', 'Do you want to find out?', 105844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a threat?$B$BNeed I remind you that you are surrounded by my guards in my prison.', '', 105843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 105842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Thoradin, first king of Arathor. \n\nLong ago humans were warring tribes of barbarians, slowly being exterminated by the trolls. My tribe, the Arathi, and I unifed the tribes to form the kingdom of Arathor. With my noble brothers Ignaeus and Lordain we pushed back the trolls, though I knew it was but temporary.\n\nAfter a time we allied with the elves and fought the longest and bloodiest war humanity had ever seen. If not for the arrogance of the trolls we would have perished. Instead we gained the strongest of friendships with the elves, and the teachings of their magic. The cost was countless soldiers and my great friend, Lordain.\n\nOnce the kingdom was safe and growing ever stronger I relinquished my crown and began my quest.', '', 105841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t have time to explain, then I don\'t have time to waste on you.', '', 105840, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 64624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no time to explain. Let us inside the hold, warden.', 'There\'s no time to explain. Let us inside the hold, warden.', 105839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us inside or I\'ll show you the difference.', 'Let us inside or I\'ll show you the difference.', 105838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t trust your kind, \"demon hunter\".$B$BYou and the Legion are one and the same in my book.', '', 105837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to know more about you.', 'I want to know more about you.', 105836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast upon their bones!', '', 105835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your master needs you!', '', 105834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, my pets.', '', 105833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you there.', '', 105832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 58208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to meet with our new goblin ally in the War Room. You can begin planning your next steps there.', '', 105831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient title symbolizes the awesome responsibility borne by the Tirisgarde. May you carry it with honor.', '', 105830, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Here, in presence of many of Azeroth\'s greatest mages, it is my honor to dub you $n, Conjuror of the Tirisgarde.', '', 105829, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done, then.', '', 105828, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To this end, I hereby reform the Tirisgarde. Will you join us and take up arms against the Legion?', '', 105827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hunt him down in the Twisting Nether. Only then will we know his knowledge cannot be used against us.', '', 105826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord Kathra\'natir has escaped into the Twisting Nether, carrying with him the secrets of the Council of Tirisfal.', '', 105825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mages of Azeroth! I have summoned you here because we face a threat to the future of the world itself!', '', 105824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sweat, chum! I\'ll get your mages here in a jiffy!', '', 105823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright Akazamzarak, you have the locations. Do you think you can manage the portals?', '', 105822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
