('', 'Hmph. I was fine. You need not concern yourself.', 105784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down there a malevolent creature is slowly coming back to life despite my sacrifice. You must brave its corrupted depths and slay it for the last time. I will share what knowledge I have with you.', '', 105783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For many ages, the sword has kept the beast from rising again. But now it stirs once more, so I must ask you to delve into the depths of the tomb and finish what I started. I will go with you, to offer what aid I can.', '', 105782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men begged me to walk away. I refused. My pride would be my downfall... and theirs. The evil stirred, unleashing death upon us. With my last breath, I drove my blade, Strom\'kar, into the beast\'s skull.', '', 105781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My staff and keg are pledged to you, Grandmaster. Call upon me, and I will fight for our order!', '', 105780, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 66706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ick... bitter. We must find a better solution!', 105779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there no more? Hm.. that will have to suffice.', 105778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eugh... I will never get used to that.', 105777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, my yearning for knowledge led me here, to a tomb that lies beneath the lake. Within its cold stone walls, I found something long buried... a terrible darkness, an ancient evil.', '', 105776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... thanks. Though we have never met before, I sense great courage in your heart. Yes... you are the hero I need!', '', 105775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your guard up out there. Varedis\' skills are the stuff of legend.', '', 105774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I don\'t think... or, wait... I can\'t... why can\'t I remember?', 'No, I don\'t think... or, wait... I can\'t... why can\'t I remember?', 105773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The arcanist raises an eyebrow at your greeting.>\n\nListen closely: \"val-TROIS.\"\n\nThe \"s\" is silent.', 105772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without leadership, I can only hope that the demons lose sight of their goals and leave our dead alone.', 105771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Eredar lead the demonic forces at the burial ground, bringing back our chieftains and other fallen as cursed husks. Perhaps if we put an end to the Eredar, we can slow them down.', 105770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At long last. Sustenance worthy of a Nightborne.$B$BI suppose I owe you my gratitude.$B$B<Valtrois spares you a curt nod.>', 105769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their ranks are Legion, but you have quelled their efforts here for a time.', 105768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t we already defeat them there? I\'m confused.', 'Didn\'t we already defeat them there? I\'m confused.', 105767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons and feltotem occupy one of the holiest sites in Highmountain. Kill them all! Banish them from this place!', 105766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces should meet the enemy here...', 'Our forces should meet the enemy here...', 105765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We once nursed upon the very essence of magic itself. An elixir to rival even the Well of Eternity.$B$BTo think we now resort to bottom-feeding.$B$B<Valtrois curls her lips in disgust.>', 105764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Valtrois does not respond. Her expression betrays a deep pain welling within.|cFFF92304Her hunger must be sated before all else.|r>', 105763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darksorrow and Ravencrest will join you on the hunt, $n. You should be able to slip into the hold undetected.', '', 105762, 0, 36910, 0, 64, 0, 64627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can only hope they are unable to reanimate the dead after being destroyed by your artifact.', 105761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Feltotem and their demon allies are using our sacred burial grounds as a conduit to raise the dead for their own purposes. Defeat the risen dead and lay them to rest.', 105760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$GHe\'s:She\'s; a real hero!', 105759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got this, Uncle Chen!', 105758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
