('', 'The demons are desecrating our fallen chieftains, resurrecting them as mindless pawns to their evil will. Destroy these corrupt remains so they may rest once again.', 105756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
