('Find the vermin and bring me their heads! Leave no stone unturned!', '', 105699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My, my... Someone has made quite a mess down here. It has been too long since we purged these catacombs of refuse. It appears we have a rat infestation.', '', 105698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_BorrowedTime:20|tRe-engage Advisor Vandros before you are |cFFF00000|Hspell:203935|h[Lost In Time]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_BorrowedTime:20|tRe-engage Advisor Vandros before you are |cFFF00000|Hspell:203935|h[Lost In Time]|h|r!', 105697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you again, Master $n.', 105691, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us fight for the fallen, and bring peace to this world once again!', 105690, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the legendary Storm Brew, our efforts in the war against the Legion will redouble!', 105689, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, we have gained new strength thanks to our leader, $n.', 105688, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Monks of the Broken Temple!', 105687, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that the portal has been opened, the path to Azoran is clear.', 105686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Jarl Throndyr!', '', 105685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Jarl Throndyr!', '', 105684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail Jarl Throndyr!', 105683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Jarl Throndyr!', '', 105682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your soul find its way to Valhalas.', '', 105681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostbolt explanation', '', 105680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frost mage intro + Frostbolt A', '', 105679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gonna light you up!', 105678, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey mon, you not be comin\' ta Zen\'tabra for some fish. What ya be wantin\'?', 105677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I walk in shadow.', 105676, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you!', '', 105675, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine hall ya have here!', '', 105674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 66587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Refined leyline energy will flow from here to Shal\'Aran.', 105673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done! The station is back online.', 105672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sentinels stand ready to assist you.', 105671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dark Lady has lent her rangers to your cause, $ct.', 105670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warlock_ImprovedSoulLeech:20|t %s begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194325|h[Fragment]|h|r $n.', '', 105669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show\'s over, folks! Go on, scram!', '', 105668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what I call a tip!', '', 105667, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something foul is afoot.', 105666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who does she think she is?', 105665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t trust her.', 105664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something foul is afoot.', '', 105663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who does she think she is?', '', 105662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t trust her.', '', 105661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fine work. Three more to go.', 105660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heave!', '', 105659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will sharpen my blade with your bones!', '', 105658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will flay you!', '', 105657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill the intruder!', 105655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have come to die!', 105654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A $r!', 105653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroy the $c!', 105652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the $c!', '', 105651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $r!', '', 105650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to die!', '', 105649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the intruder!', '', 105648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Not that card! Give it back!', '', 105647, 0, 48928, 61, 64, 0, 61706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! A golden Dr. Boom!', '', 105646, 0, 48928, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick a card, any card...', '', 105645, 0, 48928, 0, 64, 0, 61705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, for this trick I\'ll need a volunteer.', '', 105644, 0, 48928, 1, 64, 0, 61704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gaze into the nether crucible. It will show you what we have seen.', 105643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... bam!', '', 105642, 0, 48928, 0, 64, 0, 61703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now for my next trick! As you can see, there\'s nothing up my sleeve...', '', 105641, 0, 48928, 0, 64, 0, 61702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, thank you. Your tips are appreciated.', '', 105640, 0, 48928, 0, 64, 0, 61701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze in astonishment as I produce a rabbit from this ordinary hat!', '', 105639, 0, 48928, 0, 64, 0, 61700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, feast your eyes on these feats of prestidigitation!', '', 105638, 0, 48928, 1, 64, 0, 61695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s keep the show moving! The Great Akazamzarak appreciates your coin!', '', 105637, 0, 48928, 5, 64, 0, 61694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Gather \'round and witness mystical wonders like you\'ve never seen before!', '', 105636, 0, 48928, 1, 64, 0, 61693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up! Behold the amazing magical talents of the Great Akazamzarak!', '', 105635, 0, 48928, 22, 64, 0, 61692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every moment counts! You should return to Dalaran and secure passage to the Broken Isles at once.', '', 105634, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we can use the Fel Hammer to plan our assault on the Legion... all thanks to you!', '', 105633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will fall by our hands!', '', 105632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Illidan would be pleased.', '', 105631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail $n! Savior of Jandvik!', 105630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail the fallen!', 105629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must retrieve an artifact from Tirisfal Glades.', 'I must retrieve an artifact from Tirisfal Glades.', 105628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail Jarl $n! Hail!', '', 105627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail the glorious dead!', '', 105626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I hit something...', '', 105625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else could we throw?', '', 105624, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not ready to begin your trial.', '', 105623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For this, I proclaim that $n is the new Jarl of Jandvik. All hail $n!', 105622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As sole remaining elder of Jandvik, it is my duty to lead Jandvik into prosperity.', 105621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We all owe Jandvik\'s salvation to one brave $c. Glory to $n! Slayer of Tidemistress Sashj\'tar!', 105620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail the glorious dead!', 105619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have lost much at the hands of the Sashj\'tar. Calder, Eynar, and Jarl Throndyr have all fallen to their treachery.', 105618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Underbelly Guard will protect you from other players\' attacks for 5 minutes.\n\nDo you want to hire a bodyguard?', 'An Underbelly Guard will protect you from other players\' attacks for 5 minutes.\n\nDo you want to hire a bodyguard?', 105617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know... I hear if you drop these on someone from high enough up it will kill them.', '', 105616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to hire a personal bodyguard.', 'I want to hire a personal bodyguard.', 105615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Citizens of Jandvik! Gather round the fire and hear the glorious news!', 105614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly now, $n! Jandvik must know of our triumph!', '', 105613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you prepared to begin the trial?', '', 105612, 0, 38319, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 105611, 0, 38261, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings. I am here to test your strength.', '', 105610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chen, I wondered how long it would take for you to come to your senses.', 105607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yalia, I made a terrible mistake. All of this - fighting the war, risking my life, enjoying the sunrise - is MEANINGLESS without you.', 105606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy! What can I do fer ya?', '', 105605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is Skyseer Ghrent and the Eye of Odyn. May your orders come swift and your battles victorious, $ct!', 105604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you will follow me. The Eye of Odyn is a powerful scrying and communication device. With it you will be able to see the Broken Isles, send orders to your champions, and enact your own special operations. Skyseer Ghrent will help you manage the Eye.', 105603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll get started on fixin\' it up with stuff I have around the shop.', 105602, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engaging', 'Engaging', 105601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, if you are finished honing your weapons, I have something I wish to show you.', 105599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to your power, we can use the Fel Hammer to plan out every aspect of our assault.', '', 105598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should return to Dalaran and secure passage to the Broken Isles immediately.', '', 105597, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 58210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, thank you for helping to re-unite us. Come, let us take Yalia\'s balloon back to the turtle.', 105596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must act now, or I fear the situation will become... unsalvageable.', 105595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The situation is more dire than we knew. The demons have already infested the surrounding isles.', 105594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold the Legion\'s primary gateway into Azeroth... the Tomb of Sargeras.', 105593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have finally eliminated the Sashj\'tar threat.', '', 105592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You begin to feel drowsy!', 'You begin to feel drowsy!', 105591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well... you never cease to amaze me, Yalia. Now let\'s finish this brew!', 105590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The only one I see in danger is you, Chen!', 105589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yalia! What are you doing here? It\'s too dangerous!', 105588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey!!! You look like you could use a hand!', 105587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Auughhh! It\'s too strong, $p! No... we can\'t lose now!', 105586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, what is that thing? $p, hold it off while I finish the brew!', 105585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep it up, $p. It\'s working!', 105584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throw those ingredients into the pot. Things might get a little messy!', 105583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s begin brewing!', 'Let\'s begin brewing!', 105582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The challenge is complete! $n is a totemic master!', '', 105580, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_soulswap:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200904|h[Sapped Soul]|h|r will make the next ability you use unavailable!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_soulswap:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200904|h[Sapped Soul]|h|r will make the next ability you use unavailable!', 105579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the rules again...?', 'Tell me the rules again...?', 105578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the next challenge!', 'I am ready for the next challenge!', 105577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The currents are aligned - now engage the seal!', 105576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Both currents feed into the central chamber. Use the coils and switches to direct the currents and power all four seals in the central chamber!', 105575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak to me again when you return to Dalaran. We have much to discuss.', 105574, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Teleport:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200898|h[Teleports]|h|r to nearby cells and begins releasing prisoners!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Teleport:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200898|h[Teleports]|h|r to nearby cells and begins releasing prisoners!', 105573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flip the totems until they\'re all water totems', '', 105572, 0, 38304, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This coil projects a high-potency current. You will find a low-potency coil at the far end of the facility.', 105571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That one never saw it coming.', 105570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion attacks are growing more frequent. The sooner we can make this Storm Brew, the better.', 105569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that enough crystals? All right, we\'ll head back to the order hall.', '', 105568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creature begins to growl in your presence.', '', 105567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will grant you my blessing, allowing you to float gracefully to the ground. As you fall, attempt to gather as many of the emerald globes as you can. \n\nFew hatchlings gather more than a couple on their first flight. But most survive to try again.\n\nShould you gather them all in one flight, I may have something extra for you.', 105566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you\'re hunting, I have a weapon that\'s guaranteed to take your target down.', '', 105565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rest of the Illidari won\'t disturb you here.', 105564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE', 'REUSE', 105563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Aviana looks at you with a predatory expression.>\n\nI want to smell their blood from here, Talon.\n\nSee the raven behind you, Trinket, should you require supplies in your hunt. He is quite good at finding useful and shiny objects.', 105562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I complete your test?', 'How do I complete your test?', 105561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n, glad we caught up with you! We heard about your progress and decided to help out.', '', 105560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An illusion! What are you hiding?', '', 105559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something\'s not quite right...', '', 105558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who goes there?!', '', 105557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to attempt the flying challenge, please grant me your blessing.', 'I would like to attempt the flying challenge, please grant me your blessing.', 105556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The falcosaurs have been breeding out of control, driving nearby predators to starvation.', 'The falcosaurs have been breeding out of control, driving nearby predators to starvation.', 105555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Aviana stretches her wings to their full, terrible length, and looks at you as if you were a mouse.>\n\nYou deign to tell me of the laws of nature? I speak for the winds and the wilds, child. Do not presume to lecture ME.\n\n<She pauses for a moment, smoothing her feathers.>\n\nAnd yet, I see the wisdom in your choices, and I see the kindness in you.\n\n<She looks from you to your falcosaur mount, then back again.>\n\nYou have done a great thing for this matriarch and her hatchling. Yet the crimes committed against their kind cannot go unpunished, do you understand?', 105554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand. How can I be of aid?', 'I understand. How can I be of aid?', 105553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be the talons of vengeance.', 'I will be the talons of vengeance.', 105552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'REUSE', 105551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In my domain, fledglings are hurled from the nest as soon as they can stretch their wings. They fly. Or they die.\n\nI have created a test of dexterity for the druids I have taken under my wing. Would you like to attempt it as well?\n\nWith my blessing you will be able to float gracefully through the skies... for a time.', 105550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Aviana\'s eyes narrow when she sees you approaching.>\n\nI know what you have done. I see a trail of broken feathers and shattered beaks trailing behind you.\n\n<Aviana\'s feathers visibly ruffle.>\n\nWhat do you have to say for yourself?', 105549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Aviana scans the horizon with unnaturally sharp eyesight.>\n\nThe avian beasts you call falcosaurs must be kept in check, it is the nature of balance, this is true.\n\nBut so must my vengeance.\n\nMortals cannot think that they may simply slaughter my children without thought or repercussion. You must show them that my wings stretch across these lands, neverending.\n\nYou will be my talons.\n\nIf you accept this charge, take this shed talon, and bring vengeance in my name.', 105548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nightglaive went southwest with a warden named Cordana Felsong.', 105547, 0, 32381, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cyana Nightglaive turned traitor. She joined the Legion.', 105546, 0, 32380, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A warden tried to convince us to turn traitor. I heard screaming.', 105545, 0, 32379, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demons promised us unimaginable power.', 105544, 0, 32378, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They did... things... to me.', 105543, 0, 32377, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t give in.', 105542, 0, 32376, 0, 64, 0, 0, 72644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
