('We\'re glad we could be of help to you, $n.', '', 105529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He must decide if he wants to love. To love someone is to accept ALL of it. The joy AND the heartache.', 105528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be pleased to know that training goes well at the order hall.', '', 105527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a conflict in Chen\'s heart. He desires family, and he desires to fight for peace. He believes he must choose one, but this is false.', 105526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We heard you were looking for ingredients to the legendary Storm Brew.', '', 105525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You are difficult to catch up with, but we finally found you.', '', 105524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move, you fools! Show $p some respect!', '', 105523, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 64705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_SummonWaterElemental_2.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202098|h[Brackwater Barrage]|h|r. Look out!', 105522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s good to know. Can I try again?', 'That\'s good to know. Can I try again?', 105520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may find it comforting to know that no matter what terrible state you\'ve gotten the puzzle into, it is always solvable. This is true in totems as well as life.$b$bStill, sometimes a fresh start can be beneficial.', '', 105519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to enjoy hunting you!', 'I\'m going to enjoy hunting you!', 105518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret trespassing in these fields!', 'You\'ll regret trespassing in these fields!', 105517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shoot to kill!', 'I shoot to kill!', 105516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shouldn\'t be here!', 'You shouldn\'t be here!', 105515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s mine!', 'This one\'s mine!', 105514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make a fine hunting trophy!', 'You\'ll make a fine hunting trophy!', 105513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunt begins!', 'The hunt begins!', 105512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll mount this one\'s head on my wall!', 'I\'ll mount this one\'s head on my wall!', 105511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t my first dip into the ocean... I wish D.E.H.T.A. worked more with warm-water murlocs.', '', 105510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t I remember you from somewhere?', 'Don\'t I remember you from somewhere?', 105509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t it obvious? These Murlocs have been pushed from their homes! We can\'t just leave them to die!', '', 105508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you dressed like that?', 'Why are you dressed like that?', 105507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrglrrlrlg! I mean, hello! Sorry, I\'ve been living among these Murlocs a bit longer than planned.', '', 105506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr grlrlgl... wait... is that? Well, I can\'t say I was expecting company...', '', 105505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try it again... with a little less gurgling this time!', '', 105504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand. Begin the challenge!', 'I understand. Begin the challenge!', 105503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve guarded it carefully ever since. I think it will prove quite useful to you.', '', 105502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m stuck! Can you reset the puzzle?', 'I\'m stuck! Can you reset the puzzle?', 105501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the final challenge!', 'Begin the final challenge!', 105500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the fourth challenge. Let\'s do this!', 'I am ready for the fourth challenge. Let\'s do this!', 105499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the third challenge. Bring it on!', 'I am ready for the third challenge. Bring it on!', 105498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the second challenge. Begin!', 'I am ready for the second challenge. Begin!', 105497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for the first challenge. Begin!', 'I am ready for the first challenge. Begin!', 105496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the rules.', 'Tell me the rules.', 105495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no further challenges for you, shaman. Training and practice can only get one so far. From here, you must perfect your technique out in the real world.$b$b<Puzzlemaster Lo sinks back into deep meditation.>', '', 105494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final challenge is a grueling test of your mettle as a shaman. This is the puzzle that killed my father. Know that if you succeed, you will have the spirit, intelligence, and tenacity to conquer any challenge that life throws your way... in this room, at least.$b$bIt is easy to remain strong when fate is going our way. The TRUE test of character is how one fares when EVERYTHING is on fire...', '', 105493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the aftermath, we uncovered an ancient Nathrezim forge used to create many of the Legion\'s most powerful weapons.', '', 105492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The totemic matrix is a training method that has been in use since before the mortal races recorded the passing of the days. Long, long ago, totems were not used at all. Instead, gnomes were set on fire. That was a joke, shaman. You may laugh now, should you choose.$b$bThe next challenge may appear simple, but it will truly test your abilities.', '', 105491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am impressed. You are not just a shaman... you are an elemental craftsman. An artist! Azeroth is your canvas.$b$bSo far the challenges have all been balanced in their own right. But as you know, such order rarely appears in nature. How will you fare in an asymmetrical challenge?', '', 105490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see why you answered the call of the shaman, $n. You have a natural instinct for the interconnectedness of all things.$b$bAre you ready for a slightly more difficult challenge?', '', 105489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The totemic matrix awaits, $c! Touch a totem to reverse its nature, as well as the totems around it. Try to change all the totems into water totems.', '', 105488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion reinforcements arrived soon after you left for the Black Temple, destroying the portal behind you. Oh, it was a glorious battle!', '', 105487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be presented with a five-by-five matrix of elemental totems. Some are fire, some water. Your objective is to change them all to water totems.$b$bSimply touch a totem to flip its elemental alignment. Ah, but the elements are connected to one another! Flipping a totem will also change the four totems adjacent to it.$b$bThrough patience, trial, and error, you should be able to coax all of the totems into water totems. Try your best, $c!$b$bIf you find yourself completely lost, speak to me and I can reset the puzzle for you.', '', 105486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To develop harmony with the elements, one must study and understand the interactions between them. The totemic matrix is an ancient training method, a puzzle that will challenge one\'s mind and spirit.$b$bThe object of the exercise is to transform all the totems to water totems. Simply touch a totem to invoke it. Know that all things are connected, a lesson invaluable in this puzzle... as in life!', '', 105485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, of course! Right this way.', '', 105484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $c! This elemental realm at the precipice of the Maelstrom is the Heart of Azeroth, a most sacred space for those with shamanistic beliefs. In this room, those who proclaim a mastery over the elements may test their strength of spirit in a series of challenges.$b$bBut you for, there is nothing.$b$bNot even snacks.', '', 105483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, the Mother of Dreams has arrived at last.', '', 105482, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 68235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion, my old friend... the perfect bait!', '', 105480, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrnnggggh...', '', 105479, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa there, boyo! You\'re a bit eager with that little spear of yours!', '', 105478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should be proud, $n. You almost saved Jandvik. Now you will die in this hole without Brandolf or Jandvik ever knowing how you failed to stop the Sashj\'tar!', 105476, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will need its might if we are to defeat the Burning Legion.', '', 105475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alodi, we need your help. We must take the Forge of the Guardian to a safer location.', '', 105474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After I died, Odyn granted me passage to his fabled Halls of Valor. It is here that his warriors feast and celebrate in eternal glory. I humbly provide his champions with their favorite brews.', 105473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what we acquired in our conquest.', 'Show me what we acquired in our conquest.', 105472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no such thing as \"too many dead demons\".', '', 105471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Item Upgrade', 'Item Upgrade', 105470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jandvik will never fall to your vile naga! Never!', 105469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out! This is an imposter!', 105468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harbaron won\'t have your kind around here, mortal.', '', 105467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you finished interrupting, naga?', '', 105466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, as I was saying...', '', 105465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will wash over the Burning Legion by your will.', 105464, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope Melba is looking upon me now. How long have I waited for vengeance!', 105463, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My master, Melba, taught me everything she knew, including the fighting techniques of ancient vrykul brewer-kings and queens.', 105462, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Filthy dogs... the Tideskorn were always merciless thieves and murderers.', 105461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Illidari!', '', 105460, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will follow $p into battle, and we will strike down the Legion once and for all!', '', 105459, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel Hammer is ours at last. Gaze upon the might of the Twinblades of the Deceiver!', '', 105458, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightborne deceived us. The Moon Guard will soon be lost forever.', 105457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. Your forces await.', '', 105456, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 105455, 0, 38261, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to defend me while I perform the scrying?', 105454, 0, 38261, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I never... solved it....', '', 105453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets of the Storm Brew are mine! You will not have them!', '', 105452, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hrydshal fortress lies to the south. I will meet you there. Slifna flies faster than the wind.', 105451, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Across the way lies the Arena of Glory, where warriors vie for supremacy in epic combat. Before us lies the Great Mead Hall where drink and stories flow freely!', 105450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I may interject, I would like to speak with you, $p.', 105449, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return here once you have retrieved the artifact, $n. In the meantime, I\'ll see about tidying up a bit.', '', 105448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to face your doom!', '', 105447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Fel Hammer, $n.', '', 105446, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 58271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What say you, $n?', '', 105442, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 61735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall reform the Tirisgarde. And this mage will be its first champion.', '', 105441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what is your plan?', '', 105440, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 61733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wards protecting this place are still strong. I think it will serve our needs.', '', 105439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hall hasn\'t seen any use since the disbanding of the Council of Tirisfal.', '', 105438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hall of the Guardian! It pains me to see it in such disrepair.', '', 105437, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 61730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pillage! Plunder! Leave none standing!', '', 105435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No prey, no pay. Now secure the Naglfar!', '', 105434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy these landlubbers!', '', 105433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands on deck!', '', 105432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Belay these bilge rats!', '', 105431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57462, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve enabled Reaves\' piloted combat mode. Just activate it when you\'re ready, $n.', 105427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right this way.', 105426, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 58270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ILLIDARI!', '', 105425, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the blades that will strike down the Legion. We are the chosen warriors of Lord Illidan.', '', 105424, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power of the Twinblades of the Deceiver. The Fel Hammer is ours!', '', 105423, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. We must address the others.', '', 105422, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 58215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not dead and you are not vrykul, yet Odyn summons you still. I know not what awaits you in his halls, but I believe you are worthy of its glory...', 105421, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ragnvald, Finna, you have been judged worthy for Odyn\'s halls. Come with me to glory!', 105420, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on, hero... For me... the Halls await...', '', 105419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can still... fight...', 105418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will salute your courage in the Halls of Valor... or over this monster\'s corpse!', 105417, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! With all of us together, we may yet be victorious! Either way, I\'ll not go down easily. Let us be about it then!', '', 105416, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 60444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I say we kill the demon instead! Little hero, you have proven yourself a worthy ally. Will you stand with us, even though it could mean our deaths?', 105415, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! This is the glorious death Havi promised me!', '', 105414, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well... will you look at that...', 105413, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... what was that?', '', 105412, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I almost broke a sweat... but not quite! What else do they have?', 105411, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A brute has joined the battle, little hero! Come and meet your fate before your place is taken!', '', 105410, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 60436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn\'s will is no so easily stayed. You three are worthy of his halls and this warrior has freed you. Come with me to glory!', 105409, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will prepare for the next fight. It will be soon so be quick!', 105408, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This quest is yours alone, do not keep Odyn waiting!', '', 105407, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are more here that are worthy but I cannot claim them. To the west a demon keeps their souls imprisoned. Small one, prove your strength and free them!', 105406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many... secrets... remain...', '', 105405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haardgrim! Alrik! Odyn has judged you worthy for his halls. Come with me to glory!', 105404, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New subjects! What delicious secrets will you hold?', '', 105403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready, $n?', '', 105402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My word...', '', 105401, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That old seer is mad, but rarely wrong. Come \"friend,\" more demons approach! Prove your valor!', '', 105400, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! The Tidestone!', '', 105399, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Havi didn\'t say they would be so short!', 105398, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 60429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aaaahhh!', 105397, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 58473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shrug off your wounds, warriors! Another battle awaits!', '', 105396, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 60428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, my friend!', '', 105395, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you hear me, my friend?', '', 105394, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 62762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah!', '', 105393, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 58474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tasting', 'Tasting', 105392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness consumes all!', '', 105391, 0, 0, 603, 78, 0, 63448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See how I bend your mind to my will!', '', 105390, 0, 0, 603, 78, 0, 63447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get me out of this cage!', 105389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot trust your own mind!', '', 105388, 0, 0, 603, 78, 0, 63446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My patience has run out, wyrmtongue. Where does your master hide?', 105387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, mother of Odyn! That tasted worse than runehorn curd!', 105385, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 66634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmmm. Good flavor, but it\'s as weak as rainwater.', 105384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, now that\'s strong! But my master\'s was still better.', 105383, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 66632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the right place. We will find the stolen recipe here.', 105379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got this side of the portal secured.', '', 105378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told Baron Sliver that you were coming, but he ran in anyway. That fool is going to get himself killed!', 105377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CreepingPlague:20|t Nythendra infests you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:203096|h[Rot]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CreepingPlague:20|t Nythendra infests you with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:203096|h[Rot]|h|r!', 105376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually, Didi, I have something else I have to do right now.', 'Actually, Didi, I have something else I have to do right now.', 105374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s show \'em what Reaves can do!', 105373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor Margrave! The final death claimed you at last.', 105372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer well, old friend.', '', 105371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, now let\'s get out of here. The Lich King will be eager to hear of our success.', '', 105370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll guzzle your blood!', '', 105369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Netrezaar... take... you...', '', 105368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Too... strong...', '', 105367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to deep...', '', 105366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
