('Sashj\'tar survive...', '', 105364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die... now...', '', 105363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush you like clam.', '', 105362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush your bones!', '', 105361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bury you in sand!', '', 105360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sashj\'tar foe.', '', 105359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little pest.', '', 105358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy! Easy there! I hope that vrykul leaves soon!', 'Easy! Easy there! I hope that vrykul leaves soon!', 105357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for Brewmaster Melba.', 'I\'m looking for Brewmaster Melba.', 105356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reaves is ready to be piloted.', '', 105355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The altar acts as a focus for ancient powers... the Wild Gods, the Keepers, even elven wells of magic.$b$bCertain ancient relics can be infused by such powers to become even more potent. The weapon you carry is such a relic.$b$bThink of this altar as a conduit to those primordial forces. Make use of it whenever you are able, for you\'ll need every advantage to lead us against the Legion!', '', 105353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does the altar do?', 'What does the altar do?', 105352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said this altar was carved from a slab of stone brought back from the Field of the Eternal Hunt by Huln Highmountain himself!$b$bThe stone resonates with the life force of the creatures who dwell in that sacred hunting ground.$b$bAfter the Trueshot Lodge was founded, Huln\'s descendents had the stone carved to honor the eagle spirit Ohn\'ahra and presented it to the members of the Unseen Path.', '', 105351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did this altar come from?', 'Where did this altar come from?', 105348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s our chance! Let\'s bring him down!', '', 105347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the eagle spirit guide your hand.', '', 105346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could... use a little... help here!', '', 105345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tidemistress... I have failed you...', 105344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will perish in thisss cave, $r!', 105343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war is brutal. We need every advantage we can get.', '', 105341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This barrel should do. Is Chen going off on another mission?', 105339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to battle, Didi!', 'I\'m ready to battle, Didi!', 105335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Black Abyss...', 105333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot ssstop us all.', 105332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sea callsss me home...', 105331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sssilence of the deep...', 105330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Tidemistress...', 105329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chen! Are you going somewhere?', 105328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These supplies should do. Tell Chen good luck with his journey.', '', 105327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That poor boy. The temple puts a heavy burden on his shoulders, yet all he wants is to settle down with Yalia.', 105326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a cold one, Sliver. Fine! I\'ll help, but if we have any chance of getting Margrave out alive, we should take it.', 105325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you go. Tell Chen to be careful out there. We have already lost too many to the Legion attacks.', 105324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will fall before the Sashj\'tar!', 105323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to our enemiesss!', 105322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stop the Sashj\'tar!', 105321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jandvik is oursss.', 105320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will send you to the abyss.', 105319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re leaving soon, Yalia.', 'We\'re leaving soon, Yalia.', 105318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chen wanted me to ask for some honey.', 'Chen wanted me to ask for some honey.', 105317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have hops and yeast?', 'Do you have hops and yeast?', 105316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you give me an empty barrel?', 'Can you give me an empty barrel?', 105315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I help you with, $n?', '', 105314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know only too well the pain and suffering that comes from losing a loved one. That\'s why I joined this fight, and the brew here\'s not so bad, either.', 105313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been helping the villagers at Dai-Lo Farmstead recover from their vermin infestation.$B$BChen told me stories about Shen-zin Su, but I never expected the turtle to be so vast!', 105312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, what a situation. I\'m out of here.', 'Oh my, what a situation. I\'m out of here.', 105311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Valhallas shine upon you.', 'May Valhallas shine upon you.', 105310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank Odyn, I thought I was fishbait.', 'Thank Odyn, I thought I was fishbait.', 105309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast ye, Sliver! Fine! I\'ll help ye, but I\'ll rescue Margrave first chance I get!', '', 105308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What!? Don\'t you have any sense of duty to aid your fellow knights?', 105303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What!? Don\'t ye have any sense of duty to aid yer fellow knights?', '', 105302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care! Slaying the demon is our first priority. Come, we\'ve wasted enough time with this blathering.', '', 105301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to slay a demon, not rescue every failure who couldn\'t get the job done.', '', 105300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Switching', 'Switching', 105299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
