('You will meet your ancestors this day!', '', 105246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my blade!', '', 105245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will spit on your corpse!', '', 105244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', '', 105243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to Jandvik.', '', 105241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have what we came for, but I\'d be remiss if I didn\'t try to bolster Karazhan\'s defenses before I leave. I owe that much to Medivh... the good man he once was, not the pawn of Sargeras he became.', '', 105240, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Owwww!!! Owwww!!', '', 105239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'re ye waiting for? Get a move on!', '', 105238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Has your mind rotted to dust? The Legion\'s magic is easily avoided.', '', 105236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Melba\'s Storm Brew was the rarest and most desired of her recipes. It was even said that the thunder god Odyn served this brew in his hall of champions.', 105235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Morjirn has the recipe now, but he lacks skill. What you drank at the Gates of Valor was pure sludge. It holds only a fraction of Storm Brew\'s TRUE power.', 105234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Morjirn, head brewer of a nearby clan, harbored jealousy of my master\'s skill. He sent a band of raiders to kill her, and steal the recipe.', 105233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My master\'s recipes were famous for their taste and potency. We used to ship barrels every day. Goldenapple, sweet and crisp. Black Brew, dark and bitter. Woodheart, oaken and bright.', 105232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, monk. Walk with me.', 105231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re about two years too late, my friend. Melba is dead.', 105229, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 66655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you looking for Melba? I\'m her apprentice, but you won\'t find my master here.', 105228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Black Brew is running low, Slifna. If Melba were still here, we would never run dry.', 105225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lothrius sent me. Will you help me close the portals?', 'Lothrius sent me. Will you help me close the portals?', 105223, 0, 38172, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still need to get this sorry excuse for a wagon fixed. Where is Jolfang with that axle, eh Slif?', 105222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Goldenapple is setting quite nicely, Slifna.', 105221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 66651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the murlocs!', 'Unleash the murlocs!', 105220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you need to unleash another wave of murlocs, $n? Just give the word.$b$bSo many eggs remain... As individuals, murlocs are easily destroyed. But as a village? They are all but indestructible.', '', 105219, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been far too long, $p. Far too long!', 105218, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 58269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Farstriders vow to fight at your side!', '', 105217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Silver Covenant stands with you!', 105216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I know what must be done...', '', 105215, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord\'s defeat is only temporary. Once he regains his strength in the Twisting Nether, he will seek the forge again.', '', 105214, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My grandfather, Gnopetto Bizzfuse was a great inventor. You may have heard of his one and only invention, the Blingtron unit.$b$bEveryone wanted to learn his secrets of how he created Blingtron\'s internal circuitry but he refused to share it.$b$bHe died many years ago after the sea rose and devoured his shop. I doubt you\'d be able to find anything more, but if you\'re up to it, you can go for a swim and check it out.$b$bYou can even borrow my diving helm if you like.', 105213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, old friend. Though I wish it were under better circumstances.', '', 105212, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alodi!', '', 105211, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Count your days, mage. I will return!', '', 105210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! The Legion will know your secrets...', '', 105209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of you, Felstorm. Prepare to meet your end!', '', 105208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take my power, champion! Banish this demon back from whence it came!', '', 105207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually I\'m here to ask you about your grandfather.', 'Actually I\'m here to ask you about your grandfather.', 105206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like a smart fellow, so I\'ll give you the biggest clue you need. Forget about it!$b$bBlingtron\'s the invention of some no-good, dirty, little gnome who don\'t know nuttin about engineering.$b$bAnd DEFINITELY don\'t go visit his granddaughter, Winkey, down on Southbreak Shore, southeast o\' here. She\'s worse than he was.', '', 105205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s working! Activate the forge!', '', 105204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work! Now destroy the rifts siphoning power from the forge!', '', 105203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not escape so easily, little mage!', '', 105202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a way past his barrier! I\'ll try to keep him occupied.', '', 105201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s too strong! We need the power of the forge!', '', 105200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are pathetic! Your feeble spells cannot stop me!', '', 105199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forge of the Guardian will be mine!', '', 105198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful wretch! You should have brought an army! What can one little mage do against the might of the nathrezim?', '', 105197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hic! You wanna ...hic! You wanna ...hic! You wanna know about Blingtron?$b$bOh sure, ya, ya, ya. Okay, sho, I wash down in, um ...hic! Oh right!$b$bI wash down in Gadaget... Gaget... Gadgistan, an\' I was talkin to thish little green fellow bout him. Come closher.$b$b<Chief Engineer Foote beckons you closer and starts whispering in your ear, loudly.>$b$bSho Nixsh Shprocketshpring ish thish guy\'sh name. Ha ha! And he told me, to tell you, to tell ...hic!$b$bOh, I forget. Jush leave me alone, would ya.', '', 105196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over, dreadlord. Your evil reign ends here!', '', 105195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the dreadlord is one step ahead. Hurry, the passage is this way!', '', 105194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have much time. The demon will surely have found the forge by now. I will meet you in Violet Hold.', '', 105193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, you made it. I\'m afraid we have an escaped dreadlord on our hands.', '', 105192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Thank goodness I\'ve reached you! I need your help.', '', 105191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that old tale? Sure, I can tell it again, if ya like.$b$b<Ricket raises her hands and begins to talk in a deep voice.>$b$bSo says the legend that he was big like a fel reaver, with a face that could spook even ol\' Deathwing. They say he lost his arm makin\' the Blingtron unit. Replaced it with a SPIDER TANK!$b$b<Ricket begins to chuckle a bit.>$b$bActually the last real bit of information I heard about him was from this sailor I met in Ratchet. Drunk as a skunk, but I believe there was a small bit of truth to what he was sayin\'.$b$bHis name is Chief-Engineer Foote. He might be able to give you a real clue as to where you can find the inventor.', 105190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pledge my axes... and my pets... to your cause, $n.', '', 105188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up in the sky! Behold Ohn\'ahra! The spirit of the eagle has returned!', 105184, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 61854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inventor of the Blingtron unit? Well now, that\'s quite the question!$b$bAs the legend goes, he was a great, tall fella, \'bout four gnomes high, with big ol\' muscly arms to lift the pieces of his inventions around.$b$bHe had beautiful purple sideburns, and lightning in his eyes!$b$bWell... at least that\'s what my cousin Ricket told me.$b$bShe knows the rest of the story, if you really want to know more. You can find her at K3 in the Storm Peaks.', '', 105183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion took my weapons from me, so it\'s only fitting that I take one of theirs.', 105182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be taking this for me self!', '', 105181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion has no concept of mercy or remorse. If we wish to defeat such a threat, we must abandon those ideals as well.', 105180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for information about the inventor of Blingtron.', 'I\'m looking for information about the inventor of Blingtron.', 105179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More crystalline beasts are coming, dig your hooves in!', 105178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zach, give me something to yell!', 105177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak now, demon. Lead me to your master and I may let you live.', 105176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coming, $p?', 105175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 70230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking oath of service', 'Taking oath of service', 105174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come $n! I will fight by your side as we cut a bloody swath into these naga!', '', 105173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Opening a gateway now, dears. Step back.', 105172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brandolf\'s alive! I must go to him!', '', 105171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no naga! Where is Brandolf?', '', 105170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must find Jarl Throndyr!', 105169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that you are no ally to these naga, $r! Get me out of this cage!', 105168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CHEAT - Reset my eligibility to 0.', 'CHEAT - Reset my eligibility to 0.', 105163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 3.', 'CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 3.', 105162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 2.', 'CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 2.', 105161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 1.', 'CHEAT - Make me eligible for Chapter 1.', 105160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you wish to find me when Grimwing is slain... follow the trail of demon corpses.', 105159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 71821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beakbuck sends a placeholder event!', '', 105158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Headed down to the Broken Shore, eh? I know right where you need to go, Zeomus here will get ya there.', '', 105157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They tell me to clean up Underking\'s mess. But look at \'dis. It gonna take forever.', '', 105156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Twinblades are even more impressive in person.', 105155, 0, 39227, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p! You\'re alive!', 105154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to introduce you to Calia Menethil... yes, that Menethil. She has been a great help these past few years. I\'d like her to assist you, helping the helpless, conveying your word to the world, all that.', '', 105153, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thank you for my freedom, $n.$b$bUnfortunately, the soul harvester has taken much of my strength. I will regain the full extent of my powers shortly.', 105152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bones suit you.', '', 105151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya has different plans for you, dog.', '', 105150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For ours is the Unseen Path.', 105149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We walk the lonely road...', 105148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the eagle on the wind.', 105147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the watchers in the wild.', 105146, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer a miracle worker, Saa\'ra. It came out better than I designed it!', 105145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The altar is complete, Betild.', '', 105144, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hunger never ends...', 105143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None can resist the thirst!', 105142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now your will is mine!', 105141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Submit to the thirst.', 105140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of you will be food, some will be thralls, but all of you will die.', 105139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrr grmrgl mrgl!', '', 105138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgl glrlrglgrr!', '', 105137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot be stopped!', '', 105134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed...', '', 105133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The defenses are breached...', '', 105132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hold them here!', '', 105131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Suramar! For Elisande!', '', 105130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, fiends!', '', 105129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s a small taste of my fel magic.', 105128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am of Argus, the mightiest world in all of the Great Dark.', 105127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare?!', 105126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wither before my might!', 105125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your death will be swift and unmerciful.', 105124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finish them. Recast the cloaking spell.', 105123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have the spectral sight!', 105122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can they see us?', 105121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend the Soul Engine.', 105120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill them before they get up to the Fel Hammer.', 105119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your soul will be ours.', 105118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In Sargeras\'s name.', 105117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend the portal.', 105116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our ritual is interrupted.', 105115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world will be purged!', 105114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Brood Queen.', 105113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kill the Illidari.', 105112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion\'s will be done.', 105111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, finish the summons.', 105110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t have much time! Margrave was taken to the citadel. The only things I\'ve seen come out of that place are demons and corpses! We\'ll need to break in there to get him out.', 105090, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 60323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! That\'s much better!', 105089, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 60318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An infernal! Use all your training to defeat it!', '', 105088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You learned well! Next we will see... Hold on, is that...? To arms! The Legion is attacking!', '', 105087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 58007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work! Now demonstrate your skill against two foes at the same time.', '', 105086, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 58006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is interrupted and a dark energy amasses!', '', 105085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eliminate... all... life...', '', 105084, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen! We don\'t have much time. They took Margrave to the citadel. We\'re gonna have to break in there to get \'im out!', '', 105083, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! That\'s much better!', '', 105082, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 60316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally the keystone is ours! Let\'s head back.', '', 105079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you\'ll be more useful to us alive. Very well, let\'s be swift about this.', '', 105078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have stolen a gem of power from one of the Underking\'s lackies.$b$bUse this gem and you will have a crystal fury at your command.$b$bI ask that you use it to recover more crystals from within the Crystal Fissure. With those crystals, I and my tribe can better aid Thunder Totem in its... whatever it does.$b$bDo we have a deal?', '', 105074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the crystal.', 'Give me the crystal.', 105073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being partnered with you, my ears hurt more than anything.', 'Being partnered with you, my ears hurt more than anything.', 105072, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This job really zaps my energy. My legs hurt. My shoulders hurt. Even my heart aches a little...', 'This job really zaps my energy. My legs hurt. My shoulders hurt. Even my heart aches a little...', 105071, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brodrick doesn\'t pay us to wonder.', 'Brodrick doesn\'t pay us to wonder.', 105070, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you ever wonder what Brodrick does with the bear cubs we catch?', 'Do you ever wonder what Brodrick does with the bear cubs we catch?', 105069, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can\'t use small words, then keep your mouth shut!', 'If you can\'t use small words, then keep your mouth shut!', 105068, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, synthetic fur would be less cruel, not to mention more comfortable.', 'You know, synthetic fur would be less cruel, not to mention more comfortable.', 105067, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little weakling...', '', 105066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep talking like that and I\'ll put you in a cage!', 'Keep talking like that and I\'ll put you in a cage!', 105065, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cold sand...', '', 105064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we should let the cubs go. I won\'t tell Brodrick if you won\'t...', 'Maybe we should let the cubs go. I won\'t tell Brodrick if you won\'t...', 105063, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tidemistress...', '', 105062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for feelings.', 'I don\'t have time for feelings.', 105061, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
