('Sashj\'tar destroy you!', '', 105060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you ever feel bad doing what we do?', 'Do you ever feel bad doing what we do?', 105059, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die now!', '', 105058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s going to buy them? They\'re about as soft as your mother\'s beard!', 'Who\'s going to buy them? They\'re about as soft as your mother\'s beard!', 105057, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smash you!', '', 105056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
