('', 'These cursed demons are going to learn a new meaning of suffering when I get free! A beast called Zalinor carries the keystone that unlocks these bindings. Set me free and I\'ll help you rip the bastards apart!', 105042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
