('', 'Over the centuries, most of my fellow watchers have been lost. The few of us remaining sought out heroes worthy to heed the call when the Unseen Path was needed once again.', 105032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrglrrgl! Mgrlrgrrr!', '', 105031, 0, 0, 51, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the elves who founded the Unseen Path left Mount Hyjal to return to the Broken Isles, the Highmountain tauren recognized the nobility of their cause and offered them friendship. It was the descendants of Huln Highmountain who led the Unseen Path to this peak.$b$bSince the Legion\'s return, the Highmountain have helped restore the lodge, such as replacing two damaged watch towers with tauren structures.', '', 105030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As we arrived here to build the Trueshot Lodge, the eagle spirit, Ohn\'ahra, appeared and gave her blessing. From that day forth, we called this mountain Talon Peak.', 105029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Unseen Path was founded after the War of the Ancients to safeguard the people of Azeroth. From these Broken Isles, we watched for the Legion\'s return.', 105028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
