('Jandvik is leaderless! It will crumble before the Sashj\'tar!', '', 104900, 0, 38033, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jandvik\'s jarl lies dead before me! Now you shall join him!', '', 104899, 0, 38033, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A puny outsider challenges me?', '', 104898, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Jandvik! You are not welcome here!', '', 104897, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww! Come on, you didn\'t have to take them just yet. Let\'s get outta here Shoob.', '', 104896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey, hey. I don\'t want no trouble. Go right ahead, geez!', '', 104895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll do just fine. Thank you kindly!', '', 104894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Hold a weapon to Marin\'s throat.> How\'s this for business?', '<Hold a weapon to Marin\'s throat.> How\'s this for business?', 104893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure?', 'Are you sure?', 104892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s 100 gold. Fair?', 'Here\'s 100 gold. Fair?', 104891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All\'s fair in love and business.', '', 104890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful with that thing next time, will ya? Dragon-powered magical forges ain\'t easy to come by.', '', 104889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, whoa, whoa. Is that the new Shadow I see walkin\' into my vault? Un-freakin\'-believable!', '', 104888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need a bit of time to recover and... contemplate. We will speak again soon.', 104887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, you can use the new teleporter to reach the surface quickly. Anora Hollow is somewhere north of here.', 104886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Additional summoners are required to complete the ritual.', '', 104885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you fly me to the Terrace of Endless Spring?', 'Can you fly me to the Terrace of Eternal Spring?', 104884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaren write so boring! Wisdom, wisdom, wisdom - not \'nuff dookin\'.', '', 104883, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me more ingredients, Master $n. Meat, fish, blood... whatever you can find out there in the scary outdoors. I will help you turn them into delicious dishes!', '', 104882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! I\'m pleased you have returned. Finding Thas\'dorah was only the beginning!', 104881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should mention... the survey may reveal a few tele-spatial anomalies. Maybe a warptime ripple or two...', '', 104880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Survey complete. Now place the beacon!', '', 104879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two-way connection established. Use it freely - the distance is short, so it requires very little power.', '', 104878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Master $n. What are we cooking today?', '', 104877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out! Demons walk among us!', 104876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can look at my helmet, $n, but you dare not touch it.', '', 104875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for basilisks. They can see through this.', '', 104874, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect! I have a new recipe for you, $p.', '', 104873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps this would work better if I were holding a beer...', '', 104871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting! If I remove the bones after drying, I lose less of the meat...', '', 104870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s try filleting them lengthwise first...', '', 104868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None will be spared!', '', 104862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact calls to us!', '', 104861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will take what is ours!', '', 104860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact belongs to Karazhan, $c!', '', 104859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Research recipes using Silver Mackerel.', 'Research recipes using Silver Mackerel.', 104858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here comes the heat!', 104857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to EXPLODE?', 104856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me in the grave!', 'Join me in the grave!', 104855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you bring me back here?!', 'Why would you bring me back here?!', 104854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this desecration!', 'You will pay for this desecration!', 104853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will share in our curse!', 'You will share in our curse!', 104852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I don\'t want to come back!', 'No! I don\'t want to come back!', 104851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come find me in Dalaran! We can share recipes.', '', 104850, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jandvik will fall to the Sashj\'tar!', '', 104849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? A little $r has come to challenge me?', '', 104848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen... can you hear it? The skies weep and thunder for King Varian.', '', 104847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know what the lad is going through. I too have lost a father... and a king.', 104846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sobbing> Varian... Old friend...', '', 104845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light has lost a powerful ally. I have lost a good friend. Yet we must carry on.', '', 104844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He led with grace and courage. We were fortunate to have an ally like King Varian.', 104843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lost, and now must find balance, despite our shared grief.', '', 104842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m proud to have fought beside him. Varian was a good man.', '', 104841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Varian overcame so many trials. We should all learn from his example.', 104840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glorious death!', 104839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By my ancestors!', 104838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Val\'kyr take me!', 104837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not welcome here!', 104836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will cast you down!', 104835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die outsider!', 104834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glorious death!', '', 104833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my ancestors!', '', 104832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'kyr take me!', '', 104831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R are not welcome here!', '', 104830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 104829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die outsider!', '', 104828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That won\'t hold them long. We must get to the library!', '', 104827, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must be the one to lead Jandvik.', 104826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those two idiots cannot lead Jandvik.', 104825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jandvik is doomed.', 104824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shockingly, I\'d prefer to live.', 104823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VanCleef, the Uncrowned still have a use for you. You have a choice... live and serve as $p\'s agent... or die where you stand.', '', 104822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm, earth, and fire! Heed my call!', '', 104821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whew! That feels much better! Let me at \'em!', 104820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks.', '', 104819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gave everything to fight the demons, to use their own powers against them. Let us serve the Horde.', 'We gave everything to fight the demons, to use their own powers against them. Let us serve the Horde.', 104818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are the demon hunters who escaped the Vault of the Wardens?$B$BYou draw your very power from those who seek to destroy our world. Tell me, why should I possibly trust you?', 104817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archivist, post a notice in the hall. $p is now a Shadow. Fear them as you fear us all.', 104816, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanessa\'s position in the Shadows is yours. Take a seat.', 104815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, Tethys told me what transpired in Azsuna. You have impressed us.', 104814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust you will be true to your word, Vanessa. I\'d hate to imagine your father being disappointed in you.', '', 104813, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it\'s settled. Congratulations, $p. VanCleef is one of our best, as you\'ve seen firsthand.', '', 104812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Success!', 104811, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You found something?! That\'s amazing! You\'re amazing, $n! Keep your fingers crossed, I\'m gonna put it in now.', 104810, 0, 0, 69, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a long shot, but there may be someone here in Dalaran who has one. Try asking Bonegrim in the Ledgerdemain Lounge if he\'s come across any.', 104809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you alright? *Cough, cough* I\'m thinking the only thing that\'s going to work here is a fel-infused core.', 104808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, I\'m going to pour in the solution now. Watch yourself, not sure how this is going to react.', 104807, 0, 0, 69, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go to the alchemy shop and ask Deucus for a potion with some punch in it.', 104806, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flashy, but ineffective. We\'ll have to try something else. Maybe we need a chemical reaction.', 104805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me just insert this into the core and we\'ll see what happens.', 104804, 0, 0, 69, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope, for both our sakes, that we do not meet again.', '', 104803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take your weapon, $c. I must return the other artifacts to their rightful owners.', '', 104802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over. The deed is done.', '', 104801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They say I died in the Deadmines. Fools! It\'s all too simple to mimic the effects of death when your assailants\' minds are addled with neurotoxins.', 104800, 0, 37983, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps the others were right.', 104799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop! Stop! No more!', 104798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you really think I had died in the Deadmines? My elixir brought me just close enough to death to fool your weakened mind.', 104797, 0, 37981, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Blitering Beetle is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202480|h[Fixated]|h|r on you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Blitering Beetle is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:202480|h[Fixated]|h|r on you!', 104796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s nothing personal. This is purely business.', 104795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuse me! Hello?', '', 104794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Catriona, I heard someone was looking for you downstairs.', 'Catriona, I heard someone was looking for you downstairs.', 104793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a pity, really. Jorach did so much for me. He won\'t be happy when he comes to and finds you dead.', 104792, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Let\'s see how long you last.', 104791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you know that I was favored to become the final Shadow? Yet despite their assurances, every single one of them put their lot in with you instead!', 104790, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 63627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice doing business with you, friend.', '', 104789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s this lovely, red jewel upstairs that caught my eye. Get it for me and I\'ll trade you the core for it.', '', 104788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea, I got what you\'re looking for. But I ain\'t just gonna hand it over. I need something in return.', '', 104787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s the jewel, now give me the core.', 'Here\'s the jewel, now give me the core.', 104786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my friend! May the White Tiger bless your campaign against our foes!', '', 104785, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 61962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder where they went to. Oh well, perhaps they\'ll come back.', 104784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, was someone looking for me?', 104783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, the Junior Seafarers can share a gun.', 'No, the Junior Seafarers can share a gun.', 104782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, well then I\'ll be right down. Coming!', 104781, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Saurfang looks you up and down with narrowed eyes.>$b$bWhen Khadgar claimed we would be seeing demon hunters today, I laughed in his face. When he said I should hear you out, I laughed louder.$b$bAnd yet, here you are.$b$bI will permit you alone to enter the Hold. You will leave your weapons and companions at the door. You will not speak until spoken to.$b$BOne false move and my axe will end you.', '', 104780, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excuse me, but that\'s my jewel. Could you please leave it alone?', 104779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can the Junior Seafarers have guns?', 'Can the Junior Seafarers have guns?', 104778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn the emperor\'s staff against the Legion, champion. We will be right behind you.', '', 104777, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But this time, the Pandaren will not hide away. We chose to FIGHT!', '', 104776, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand years ago, Emperor Shaohao used that very staff to cloak our land in a veil of mists, hiding us from the Burning Legion.', '', 104775, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There it is, the staff of our last emperor. You have proven yourself worthy to wield it, friend of the Shado-Pan.', '', 104774, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 61958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done! You have done a great service for Pandaria this day.', '', 104773, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to take the jewel.', 'Try to take the jewel.', 104772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A large, radiant ruby set upon a pillow.', '', 104771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are free.', '', 104770, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest now, my son. The curse is lifted.', '', 104769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That voice... father?!', '', 104768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power was not yours, Ariden. You did not wield Apocalypse. Its dark energies wielded you as its weapon.', '', 104767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The power... is mine!', '', 104766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the wrath of the world-ender!', '', 104765, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well! If you so thirst for the power of Apocalypse, then I will show it to you myself!', '', 104764, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 60241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This magic is too strong for me to resist, but you may be able to cross it with your abilities, death knight.', '', 104763, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want the blade, death knight, come and claim it!', '', 104762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, Li Li should be at the Laughing Crane. That\'s the village inn just down the stairs from the temple.', '', 104761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We invite you to this table because we are confident you have the skills it takes to face this threat directly... and to prevail.', '', 104760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sewer entrance is this way. Follow me!', '', 104759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not the least of these methods is secrecy. As our titles suggest, we prefer to stay in the shadows.', '', 104758, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Shadows, leaders of the Uncrowned.', '', 104757, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to have a new face at the table! I was getting tired of Tethys\'s ugly mug... No offense, Tethys.', 104756, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 63652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Settle in, then we can discuss the details.', '', 104755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thirsty... I must find arcwine!', '', 104754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mana... I need mana! The Nightwell... no... no! Take me back!', '', 104753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand thanks to you my friend!', '', 104752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I... I will try to escape.', '', 104751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting out of here!', '', 104750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not staying here any longer!', '', 104749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! I\'m free!', '', 104748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
