('I must return to the place of my tutelage, the primal groves of Val\'sharah, to seek guidance.', '', 104726, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, to find a fragment of that power in the hands of the Legion? A terrible portent....', '', 104725, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
