('That place radiated an ancient evil with such intensity that we dared not venture closer.', '', 104723, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have encountered this power once before, within the depths of the Emerald Dream, near an abyss known as the Rift of Aln.', '', 104722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... you are certain this came from the Defiler himself?', '', 104721, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
