('I will see you... in Helheim...', '', 104679, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beaten... by a weakling... like you...', '', 104678, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders! Crush them!', '', 104677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We built a prison to contain and study the fallen creature. A place to commune with the naaru and ponder the nature of the Twisting Nether. It is here that I would take you.', '', 104676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last we found a way to repay their kindness. We came upon a terrible sight, a naaru that had turned to the void. There had to be a way to save it!', '', 104675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over the long years of the dranei\'s flight from the Burning Legion, the naaru helped us... sometimes at the cost of their very lives. We would have perished without their aid.', '', 104674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mages have established a portal for us to use. If you would follow me, I would speak of the naaru and the draenei.', '', 104673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I warn you, my kin do not like outsiders. You would be wise to avoid unnecessary confrontation.', 104672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will visit the church and pray to the Light for mercy upon both our souls.', '', 104671, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understand, I cannot be a part of what you must do. When you are finished, meet me outside Karazhan.', '', 104670, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heard some bruls say the Stonedark turned against us. Good! We are better off without those weaklings. They were small... and weak. And small.', '', 104669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lost, brul? You look lost.', '', 104668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should visit the mushroom merchant. He has some Giantstalk for you. Ha!', '', 104667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry brul! Soon our new underking will crush the weak ronir and their allies and your small, pitiful shape will not be needed to fight after that.', '', 104666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The new underking will make us strong again!', '', 104665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you looking at? Step off, brul.', '', 104664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you so small, brul? You look like a ronir calf. Ha!', '', 104663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brul, do you even lift?', '', 104662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
