('', 'I will meet you outside Jandvik. Do not enter the village until we have spoken again.', 104660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That be a fine choice. C\'mere, I\'ll share the finer details of me plan over a mug or two!', '', 104659, 0, 37869, 0, 64, 0, 63609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Silence. There is little time.', 104658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vrykul dogs, get over here and fight or I\'ll kill you myself!', '', 104657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By my ancestors! I will be the next jarl of Jandvik! No outsider will stand in my way!', '', 104656, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who challenges my right to lead Jandvik? None can defeat me in battle!', '', 104655, 0, 37994, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me hunt them down, and I will tell you what I know.', '', 104654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Riders will be upon us soon enough, and nothing is gained if we both die here!', '', 104653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Stay your weapon!', '', 104652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Have you not come to finish what the Dark Riders started?', '', 104651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back, $c! I may be wounded, but the Light will protect me!', '', 104650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With that we are in agreement. Now, speak with Velen. He has an... interesting matter to discuss with you.', '', 104649, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re offering you a seat at our table, $p. Take it, and your questions will be answered. You have but to sit.', '', 104648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done indeed!', '', 104647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This champion shows talent!', 104646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! $n has returned!', '', 104645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To lead this effort, we require a priest who is a proven champion to all people. I believe you are that hero, $n, but others must be convinced. Will you accept this challenge?', '', 104644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion poses a threat that cannot be ignored. So I have decided to step out from the shadows. I believe we must unite priesthoods of all denominations against our common enemy.', '', 104643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive the secrecy... old habits die hard. I am Alonsus Faol. At times I have been a leader of a church, a mindless minion of the Scourge, and a commander in a secret war. But I have always been a priest first.', '', 104642, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanted to get a look at you for a moment before we spoke. I apologize for the secrecy, old habits die hard. I am Alonsus Faol. At times I have been the leader of a church, a mindless minion of the Scourge, and a mastermind in a secret war. But I have always, first and foremost, been a priest.', '', 104641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnasher gonna turn you to rubble!', '', 104640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on here, Toryl?', 'What\'s going on here, Toryl?', 104639, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so glad that you followed me here, $n. I was afraid that you may have stumbled upon my plan.', 104638, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll sail to Dalaran, it\'s a short voyage from here. I\'ll meet ya in the Hall of Shadows!', '', 104637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My plan was working, you irritating slime. My naga should have killed you and Brandolf\'s band of whelps. But no! You had the gall to survive!', 104636, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without a leader to unite them, Jandvik would fall to the combined might of the sea giants and my naga in a tidal wave of death and destruction. My queen would have a prime foothold in Suramar.', 104635, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should thank you for dispatching Calder and Eynar for me. I needed all of Janvik\'s potential leaders dead, but I could not let the village suspect that I was the cause of their demise.', 104634, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have been both a willing pawn and a thorn in my side, $n', 104633, 0, 37846, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
