('Foolish mortal! You walked right into my trap!', '', 104628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortal! You walked right into my trap!', '', 104627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I owe you one, $n. I almost had my final death there.', '', 104626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60303, 0, 66, 603, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('You have earned my blessing, champions! I look forward to meeting you within the Hall of Glory!', '', 104624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Contaminating', 'Contaminating', 104623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swab the decks till they shine, ya dirty bags of bones. The Dread Admiral demands perfection!', '', 104622, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 63662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take cunning and guile to slay this beast - a perfect test of your worthiness', '', 104621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mighty Fenryr stalks these grounds. It will take cunning and guile to slay this beast - a perfect test of your worthiness.', '', 104620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 68701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
