('You hear something?', '', 104607, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings brul.$b$bWant to look like a drogbar? Want to enter Bitestone Enclave unfindable by its people? Want to mess with the drogbar who stole Barbrul\'s personal recipes? Want to get Barbrul\'s recipes back?$b$bThen drink this special drog and become all that is brul!$b$bReturn to me if you need more. Oh, and watch out for basilisks.', '', 104606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreadhound growls.', '', 104605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreadhound stares in your direction.', '', 104604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your allies have fallen. My army will crush you before you can see the light of day!', '', 104603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your persistence is admirable, but my demons have infiltrated every floor of the Vault. Only death awaits you.', '', 104602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, demon hunters, your attempts are futile. Even your master, the great Illidan Stormrage, is now a prisoner of the Legion.', '', 104601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha... so the desperate Warden has turned to her enemies? Give up, demon hunter! If you hope to escape the Vault, you will have to face ME.', '', 104600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you the one I\'m supposed to meet? Why all the way out here?', 'Are you the one I\'m supposed to meet? Why all the way out here?', 104599, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye made it out in one piece! Ah, and you have \'em! I\'ve seen no finer swords in all me days.', '', 104598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there! You were not followed, were you?', 104597, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kayn has always been a loyal soldier, a fearless leader, and a master strategist.$B$BHowever, I believe his loyalty to Illidan blinded him.$B$BAs Illidan\'s power grew, he started losing control to the demonic energy that he had absorbed.$B$BI knew my actions could be construed as betrayal, but I was only doing what I thought was right.$B$BNow, Kayn is starting down the same path. Such a man should not lead the Illidari.', '', 104596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin!', 'Let us begin!', 104595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your plan is solid, $n. Of course, our success depends on your ability to keep us all alive.$b$bFor my part, I will try to hold the creature\'s attention and absorb the brunt of its fury.$b$bLet me know when you are ready, and I will give the order to begin the assault.', '', 104594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you like Kayn?', 'Why don\'t you like Kayn?', 104593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many years ago, during Lord Illidan\'s time at the Black Temple, Altruis the Sufferer split from our leader and the demon hunters.$B$BBelieving that Illidan had become the very thing he hated, Altruis then began a sinister campaign to orchestrate our master\'s downfall.$B$BHe was instrumental in the deaths of four of our comrades - Alandien, Theras, Netharel, and Varedis.$B$BThese were our teachers, our brothers and sisters.$B$BFor that, I cannot forgive him.', '', 104592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you get along with Altruis?', 'Why don\'t you get along with Altruis?', 104591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eliza\'s fleet is bombardin\' the temple. If yer gonna match muskets with her, ye\'d better make it quick!', '', 104590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_frostbomb:20|tShivermaw begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:201960|h[Ice Bomb]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_frostbomb:20|tShivermaw begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:201960|h[Ice Bomb]|h|r!', 104589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Hold them off! We must prepare!', '', 104588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will it be Kayn or Altruis?', 'Will it be Kayn or Altruis?', 104587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rip them apart!', '', 104586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... changes... nothing...', '', 104585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible...', 104584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How DARE you enter this place! I\'ll rip the flesh from your bones!', '', 104583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place will test your mettle and, if you are found worthy, the Aegis of Aggramar will be yours!', '', 104582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I awaited noble champions to enter my realm. Behold! The Halls of Valor!', '', 104581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It seems we have pests...', 104580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ENOUGH! I\'ll run you through!', 104579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the scourge of the seas, the fear in sailors\' hearts! You are NOTHING!', 104578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have already seen my destiny. You are not a part of it!', 104577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be my pleasure.', 104576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think to stop me? With this weapon I can do anything! ANYTHING!', '', 104575, 0, 0, 603, 78, 0, 63445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them. Your blades thirst.', '', 104574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No longer used.', 104573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No longer used.', 104572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This outsider is under my aegis. Those that show aggression against $ghim:her; will answer to me.', 104571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As the last remaining successor, it falls on me to lead our people against the invading Sashj\'tar naga!', 104570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kinsmen of Jandvik! Calder and Eynar have fallen in combat. They were not worthy to lead Jandvik.', 104569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Hatecoil is vulnerable! She must not fall!', 104568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shielding weakens!', 104567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are two obstacles that impede us, $n.$B$BWe are proud warriors and can easily defend our village, but our clan has forsaken the sea. We cannot defeat an enemy that dwells in a place that we cannot enter.$B$BTo make matters worse, our jarl is missing. Members of our clan struggle for power in his absence.', 104566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toryl, why do you require my help? Can your clan not battle these naga on its own?', 'Toryl, why do you require my help? Can your clan not battle these naga on its own?', 104565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My village of Jandvik is being assailed by naga. I have come to seek your aid.', 104564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! You killed daddy! Now me kill you!', '', 104563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool! The Dreadblades will claim you too!', '', 104562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None will defy us. Unleash the fury of the tides!', '', 104561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They know no equal... I know no equal! Turn back now, and you may yet live to tell the tale.', 104559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Dreadblades have claimed entire fleets. Impenetrable fortresses have gushed rivers of blood by their will. To utter their name instills fear in sailors\' hearts.', 104558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what you seek, druid, and I may be of assistance.', '', 104557, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This can only mean the Scythe of Elune has returned to Duskwood... and the Dark Riders cannot be far behind.', '', 104556, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First the Nightbane are driven mad, and now a druid comes to investigate Manor Mistmantle?', '', 104555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I need some help here! I\'m not going to ask again!', '', 104554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 60352, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little and... down it goes!', '', 104553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 60324, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep an eye on that blade, though. No tellin\' wha\' somethin\' that old be capable of.', '', 104552, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll bring down the barrier. Watch my back!', '', 104551, 0, 38044, 0, 65, 0, 60319, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye did it! The cultists ha\'e run off! Ha ha! Ye should get back ta Faol. I\'ll use this Twilight portal stone fer ye!', '', 104550, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 63455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The worgen escape down the cliff toward Karazhan!', 'The worgen escape down the cliff toward Karazhan!', 104549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re out o\' cannonballs! Ye\'ll have to figure yer own way past the temple door.', '', 104548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eliza escaped into the temple ahead. We\'ll make sure none o\' her mangy crew follow ya. Go get \'er!', '', 104547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cultists may try to stir him again, or he could awaken on his own. We must consume his essence to ensure he is gone forever. You know this must be done.', 104546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire all cannons! Fire. Fire!', '', 104545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, we are eager to feast on the fallen titan\'s minions. But first... Zakajz.', 104544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got that briny bastard! Let \'im have it!', '', 104543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your people to safety, we\'ll keep the Legion\'s forces at bay.', 'Get your people to safety, we\'ll keep the Legion\'s forces at bay.', 104542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate the crystals when we get in trouble, right.', 'Activate the crystals when we get in trouble, right.', 104541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snake masters say tiny creature must die!', 'Snake masters say tiny creature must die!', 104540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush! Yes, crush tiny creature!', 'Crush! Yes, crush tiny creature!', 104539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no meaning in your existence! Succumb to the abyss!', 'There is no meaning in your existence! Succumb to the abyss!', 104538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life falls inevitably toward the void!', 'Your life falls inevitably toward the void!', 104537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_06:20|t Festerface begins to wretch a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201598|h[Congealing Vomit]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_06:20|t A Black Bile begins to emit a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201753|h[Necrotic Aura]|h|r!', 104536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_05:20|t A Black Bile begins to emit a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201753|h[Necrotic Aura]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_05:20|t A Black Bile begins to emit a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:201753|h[Necrotic Aura]|h|r!', 104535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least... tummy... feel better...', '', 104534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm! So good!', '', 104533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yummy!', '', 104532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste better going in!', '', 104531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna lose it!', '', 104530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not feel so good!', '', 104529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Better look out... blegh!', '', 104528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too much stinky for you!', '', 104527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you get an owie?', '', 104526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one broken!', '', 104525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast\'s wrath will end you!', '', 104524, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 60269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uuuugh, you pick bad time to interrupt! My. Tummy. No. Good!', '', 104523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got yer back. Lead the beast into our line of fire!', '', 104522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ride... again...', '', 104521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reappears!', '', 104520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s vanishes, summoning |cFFFF0404|Wild Imps|r!', '', 104519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear, just as the Great One promised! This tower is ours for the taking!', '', 104518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That which was foreseen has come to pass. The circle nears completion. Sentries, attend to our \"guests\"!', '', 104517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will know the blades of Dread Admiral Eli--', '', 104516, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 63679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It took half our crew to subdue this creature. Let\'s see what it does to you.', '', 104515, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 63678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure, admiral.', '', 104514, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 63677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Release the giant. I have business to attend to within the temple.', 104513, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 63676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, you\'re the one who stole MY ship and killed MY crew.', 104512, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 63675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, on the other hand... Yes, I foresee us doing great things together. Take hold of my haft and I will aid you... for now.', 104511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me another chance! No! Noooo!', '', 104510, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 63451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weak and pitiful! The Twilight Father did not dare wield me, for he knew the price of failure.', 104509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... this shouldn\'t be happening! Why aren\'t you protecting me?!', '', 104508, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 63449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found the scurvy dog! To arms!', '', 104507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll pay for what you\'ve done, fiend!', 104506, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 61811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|t  Fenryr cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:196838|h[Scent of Blood]|h|r on you! Run!', '', 104505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooo! My potions...', '', 104504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N... No! My potions...', '', 104503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Needed more... sulphur...', '', 104502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Irlik raka glab markzan!', '', 104501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a little field testing!', '', 104500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a perfect test subject!', '', 104499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back into the cage with you!', '', 104498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes peeled. The admiral is not to be disturbed.', '', 104497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why have you turned against us?', 104496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t leave me like this...', 104495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please... Help me...', 104494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh...', 104493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest easy. I will take care of you.', 104492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are lucky to be alive, my sister.', 104491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be still and let me mend your wounds.', 104490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must... protect...', 104489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come to me, my sisters...', 104488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters!', 104487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My plants...', 104486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Intruder!', 104485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are corrupting our habitat!', 104484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not harm our plants!', 104483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel the power of the ley line.', 104482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000$n|r attack the brute without the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:199556|h[Brutal Attacks]|h|r buff!', '', 104480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_115:20|t%s equips the Massive Sword and gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:199556|h[Brutal Attacks]|h|r!', '', 104478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is nae good! I kin hear more comin\' from above. I\'ll handle \'em. Ye take care o\' the Deacon!', '', 104477, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 63443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll provide naval support as soon as we\'re up and runnin\'.', '', 104476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll be findin\' Eliza in the temple ruins ahead. Keep yer wits about ya! Her whole crew\'s onto us now.', '', 104475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s an offer I can\'t refuse! Fall back to the temple. They can have this pile of driftwood!', '', 104474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a Lavish Suramar Feast!', '$n prepares a Lavish Suramar Feast!', 104473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n prepares a Hearty Feast!', '$n prepares a Hearty Feast!', 104472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dreadhound sniffs the air excitedly.', '', 104471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst! Over here, $n.', 104470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it\'s lying, we\'ll have its head. But if there\'s even a chance it speaks the truth, we have to try!', 104469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stinks of a trap. You can\'t rely on the word of a demon!', '', 104468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you want the Scythe, druid, come and claim it!', '', 104467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven an unexpected ally, $c. The Scythe of Elune is yours. Let us hope it can turn the tide in this war.', '', 104466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the fury of the beast!', '', 104465, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well! If you so thirst for the power of the Scythe, then I will show it to you myself!', '', 104464, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 60261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drogbar leap down from the stands!', 'Drogbar leap down from the stands!', 104463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naraxas\' |cFFFF0000|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r begins to salivate!', 'Naraxas\' |cFFFF0000|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r begins to salivate!', 104462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hold back, Taoshi! Do your worst to that thing and I will keep you alive.', 'Don\'t hold back, Taoshi! Do your worst to that thing and I will keep you alive.', 104461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be too aggressive - keep yourself alive, even if it means sacrificing damage.', 'Don\'t be too aggressive - keep yourself alive, even if it means sacrificing damage.', 104460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your well-timed rescue, $c. We could\'ve used your help in the Pandaren Campaign. My name is Taoshi, the silent blade of the Shado-Pan. I slip unseen through enemy territory and strike where they are weakest.$b$bI\'ll do my part. While Taran Zhu holds that thing\'s attention, I will stalk it from behind and bury my daggers in any weak spots. I can also help you move quickly around the battlefield - stand near me to gain charges of your Roll, Chi Torpedo, and Mistwalk abilities.$b$bHow aggressive do you want me to be? I could throw caution to the wind and wage an all-out assault, but I\'ll need to know you have my back!', 104459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! It has been such a long time. You should visit us in Pandaria more often. You and I made a great team.$b$bYou know my strengths, $n. While Taran Zhu holds that thing\'s attention, I will stalk it from behind and bury my daggers in any weak spots. I can also help you move quickly around the battlefield - stand near me to reset your roll and flying kick abilities.$b$bHow aggressive do you want me to be? I could throw caution to the wind and wage an all-out assault, but I\'ll need to know you have my back!', 104458, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do as much damage as you can, Nurong, even if it puts you at risk. I will keep you alive!', 'Do as much damage as you can, Nurong, even if it puts you at risk. I will keep you alive!', 104457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Concentrate on keeping yourself alive, Nurong. Fight defensively.', 'Concentrate on keeping yourself alive, Nurong. Fight defensively.', 104456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c! It is good to have a healer at our side. We are the Shado-Pan, the last defense of Pandaria. I am Hawkmaster Nurong, Master of the Wu Kao discipline - we are the eyes of the Shado-Pan, the scouts who make our enemies fear the darkness.$b$bNow, to business! I will assault Aspersius at range while my hawk Whitefeather swoops in to harass him with beak and claw. Stand near me and I will help you attack faster.$b$bI could go for an all-out attack, but it would put myself at risk. How aggressive should I be?', '', 104455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n! Your training has progressed far since we last adventured together in Pandaria. I\'d venture that even Lord Taran Zhu could learn a thing or two from you. It\'s a pleasure to be fighting with you again.$b$bNow, to business! I will assault Aspersius at range while Whitefeather swoops in to harass him with beak and claw. Stand near me and I will help you cast spells faster.$b$bI could go for an all-out attack, but it would put myself at risk. How aggressive should I be?', '', 104454, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do your worst, Fei Li! Even if it puts you in danger. I\'ll keep you alive.', 'Do your worst, Fei Li! Even if it puts you in danger. I\'ll keep you alive.', 104453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Concentrate on staying alive, Fei Li. I need to focus on the others.', 'Concentrate on staying alive, Fei Li. I need to focus on the others.', 104452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should try to find a way to stop his channeling...', '', 104451, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $c, for coming to our aid. I am Fei Li, and I have a reputation among the Shado-Pan for setting things on fire. Usually our enemies. Sometimes our Monastery. Lord Taran Zhu isn\'t too pleased with me at the moment...$b$bHelp me get back into his good graces. If you can keep me on my feet, I will be able to break Aspersius\'s ice walls and otherwise bring him to a boil. Stand near me and my Brilliance Aura will restore your mana.$b$b<Fei Li grins savagely.>$b$bDo you want me to REALLY light this thing up or should I concentrate on keeping myself alive?', 104450, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so good to see you again, $n! We really lit Pandaria up together, didn\'t we?$b$bI\'ve been perfecting my fire spells since you last worked with the Shado-Pan. If you can keep me on my feet, I will be able to break Aspersius\'s ice walls and otherwise bring him to a boil. Stand near me and I will enhance the power of your Jade Lightning.$b$b<Fei Li grins savagely.>$b$bDo you want me to REALLY light this thing up or should I concentrate on keeping myself alive?', 104449, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks, champion! Now to contend with the vile drogbar who caught us.', 104448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $c. I must return to my sisters.', 104447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
