('', 'The others are waiting for you. Good luck.', 104328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right this way, please.', 104327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a fool walks into the Hall of Shadows unaware! Prepare to--', '', 104326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions! Feast on their souls!', 104325, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s thanks you, sheepishly.', '', 104324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$ct, My mission was a success! The demons have been crushed and our brother in undeath still lives. Meet with me in Acherus as soon as you are able.', '', 104323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not without the Ranger-General\'s order. Understood?', '', 104322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that our business is concluded, I shall take me leave. See ya around, $n.', '', 104321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent choice. You can find my problem in the Circle of Wills. His name is Inkrot, and I need someone to send him a lesson. I believe you know what to do, $c.', 104320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come alone, and ensure you are not followed. The eyes of the Uncrowned are upon you.', '', 104319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the Glorious Goods storefront and utter \"the raven calls\" to Red. He will show you the way.', '', 104318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, your presence is requested in the Hall of Shadows at once.', '', 104316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 104314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If anything gets close... I\'ll kill it.', 104313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll look into doing that favor for you.', 'I\'ll look into doing that favor for you.', 104312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of demons out there, but nothing we can\'t handle.', '', 104311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should just end its miserable existence now!', 104310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to Niskara! Then you will see!', '', 104309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d better not be lying, worm!', '', 104308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pustulio speaks the truth! The Windrunner is captive on Niskara!', '', 104307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell.', 104306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is for your eyes only. Once you\'ve read it, destroy it.', 104305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll just have to get used to one another\'s company until you\'re ready to speak.', 104304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must insist that we speak. It will only take a moment!', 104303, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid I cannot leave without delivering this missive to you.', 104302, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Apologies for my persistence, but this message is quite urgent.', 104301, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, a moment, please. I bear an urgent message for you.', 104300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us plan the future of our order.', '', 104299, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you lead us to glory against the Legion!', '', 104298, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I name you, $n, the First of the Council of the Black Harvest.', '', 104297, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 63892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With our members scattered and a dreadlord on our heels, we need you to take leadership of the council. Through your power, we can rebuild.', '', 104296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more thing, warlock.', '', 104295, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what of the rest of the council?', '', 104294, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 63887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems not even a pit lord can keep you down, warlock!', '', 104293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... live!', '', 104292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The great Lulubelle Fizzlebang, at your service!', 104291, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am fading fast. Where is Thalyssra?', '', 104290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to deal with Thwen before we can leave.', '', 104289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra is near Meredil. Can you teleport us?', 'Thalyssra is near Meredil. Can you teleport us?', 104288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the Feeble Husks sucked out all of the Arcano-Plasm, destroying FTW-001 in the process.', 'It looks like the Feeble Husks sucked out all of the Arcano-Plasm, destroying FTW-001 in the process.', 104287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul was headed towards a harpy nest when he was ambushed. Let\'s head there now and search for those stones.', '', 104286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the depths we ssstrike!', 'From the depths we ssstrike!', 104285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot maintain your current form in this area.', 'You cannot maintain your current form in this area.', 104284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkswell will devour you!', 'The Darkswell will devour you!', 104283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This robot is broken beyond repair.', 'This robot is broken beyond repair.', 104282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now we have two allies to rescue. Follow me in!', 104281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orestes, you fool!', 104280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At once, Ranger-General. But beware! Time flows unpredictably so deep in the Nether.', 104279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. The sacred waters have already been corrupted. If you help me rescue the others, we may be able to reclaim this place.', '', 104278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion knows the importance of this sacred place. I personally led the patrol here, but we were ambushed and overcome.', '', 104277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t feel well.', '', 104276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go! The path to the prison should be ope... Well, if it ain\'t me old friend! We\'d be doin\' the world a favor riddin\' it o\' this baddie!', '', 104275, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hemet and his hunters bring death and destruction wherever they go, slaughtering innocent animals for sport.\nThey must pay for their crimes against nature.\n\nIf the animals of this basin could speak, they would ask for our help. Let\'s level the playing field a bit and let those hunters be hunted for a change.\n\nI will alter your form to resemble a creature native to this region. Once transformed, those hunters will become your prey.\n\nAre you ready?', 104274, 0, 37683, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He may be trying to leave discreetly. I\'d start looking down in the Underbelly.', 104273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These buggers are suppressin\' Tyr\'s wards so the Deacon can do his work below. We need ta take \'em down! Start by dispellin\' the wards on the ritualists!', '', 104272, 0, 37673, 1, 64, 0, 63437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An\'ratha... an\'tal-thandros!', 104271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'No! This place... it must bend to my will!', 104270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t much left... <cough> I will get us as close as I can... Come close.', '', 104269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thwen always took magic too lightly... She was a terrible student... <cough>', '', 104268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless the crane! A healer!', '', 104267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wanna see a trick my uncle Chen taught me?', 104266, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 68702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not forget to use the gem to suck the soul out of the demon corpses.', 104265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are indomitable. We are Illidari.', '', 104264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see to it that the Legion gets no farther.', '', 104262, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 57441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see to it that the Legion gets no farther.', '', 104261, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 57445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, Kor\'vas, and Cyana attack the Legion from within. Then, we\'ll wipe them out together.', '', 104260, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 57442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your artifact looks powerful, $c. Speak with Jace and Allari if you intend to help.', '', 104259, 0, 37647, 0, 64, 0, 57443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like Blink, Frost Nova has a long cooldown.  So you can train more effectively though, I\'m filling this room with arcane energy so you can use them more often.', '', 104258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar? $n? I was not expecting you.', '', 104257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'m glad that you\'re here. Malevolence has been providing us with transportation back and forth from the Fel Hammer.\n\nThe Burning Legion have invaded Faronaar across the isthmus. We must destroy them before they overrun the rest of this island.', '', 104256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ughhhhhh...', '', 104254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ill-fated chance brings our paths together, $r?', '', 104253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed the Nightfallen Ancient Mana. <NYI>', 'Feed the Nightfallen Ancient Mana. <NYI>', 104252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightfallen appears to be alive, but is unresponsive.', '', 104251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Altruis and the others await you at Krasus\' Landing. I\'ll meet you there.', 104250, 0, 36910, 1, 64, 0, 0, 58225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> Unstable... space...', '', 104249, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My warp field is not working! Where have you taken us?!', 104248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never escape the Legion.', '', 104247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... could...', '', 104246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will envelop these lands.', '', 104245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hope to best me, $r.', '', 104244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cut you down.', '', 104243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are taking back these lands.', '', 104242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightwell has failed me.', 104241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never leave this place.', 104240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Legion.', 104239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stand little chance against me.', 104238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are taking back these ruins for the Legion.', 104237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not belong here, $r.', 104236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what if that space is already unstable?', '', 104235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graa.... Ooh... oooWAAAAAHHHH!!!!', '', 104234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good trick... <cough> Warping the space around your body like that.', '', 104233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Face it, old man. I have surpassed you.', 104232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh!!!', '', 104231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel funny...', '', 104230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad... Kind of minty...', '', 104229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a small tasterino of the Arcano-Plasm...', '', 104228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p. We managed to clear the skies while you dealt with Varedis.', '', 104227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the Twinblades and destroy the interloper!', '', 104226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not yet your time, Varedis.', '', 104225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. If we overcharge enough coils, the entire system will failsafe into a lockdown.', '', 104224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are more coils in the chamber below - and more intruders, I imagine.', '', 104223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overcharging', 'Overcharging', 104222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This coil taps into the ancient leylines. Crank it up to full power!', '', 104221, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why put yourself at risk to help them?', 'Why put yourself at risk to help them?', 104220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak quickly. My entire operation requires that I do not attract unwanted attention.', '', 104219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you feel you need more time to practice then take this portal to the Proving Grounds. There you can train with Master Rotun and truly master your class.  Otherwise, use that gyrocopter over there and head into battle.', '', 104215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$ct, I\'ve found someone new to join us! Come meet us at the Wandering Isle as soon as you can.', 104214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, you\'ve done it!  You truly are a skilled in your art.  There is little more I can teach you here, this is simply where your journey begins.', '', 104213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have finally found you, Dorion. And now I will end you.', 104212, 0, 37630, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still do not feel safe.', '', 104211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never go anywhere without Sif and Nel.', 104210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we\'ll triumph against the Legion!', 104209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such an honor to be part of the rebirth of the Unseen Path!', 104208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m happy to finally be done with that jungle.', 104207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Station Li Li.', 'Station Li Li.', 104206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at your service, $ct', '', 104205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you okay?', 'Are you okay?', 104204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And your wife?', 'And your wife?', 104201, 0, 37625, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did your daughter carry with her, Valendrel?', 'What did your daughter carry with her, Valendrel?', 104200, 0, 37625, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Contacting nearest Seeker.', '', 104198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power reserves depleted.', '', 104197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Primary core damaged...', '', 104196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat level minimal.', '', 104195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating combat mode.', '', 104194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evaluating target.', '', 104193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge my death, Idriana.', '', 104192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic... creature... I will...', '', 104191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande... I have failed you.', '', 104190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish creature. I will show you real power.', '', 104189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the might of the Nightwell!', '', 104188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the betrayer?', '', 104187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Avenge me, Anishar!', 104186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have failed my mission.', 104185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To think I was slain... by a...', 104184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall before the might of Suramar.', 104183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are nothing.', 104182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was looking for the betrayer.', 104181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us at the Circle of Wills in Dalaran\'s underbelly, warlock. My portal will take you there directly. We will be waiting.', '', 104179, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Frost Nova to freeze your enemies in place and get away.', '', 104178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness lifts... thank you.', '', 104167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold off these beasts until the trap is sprung!', 104166, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 62692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot fight the monster until you place the trap! Hurry!', 104165, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 62698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your kindness. I will never forget it.', '', 104164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_03:20|t Hymdall blows the |cFFFF0404|Hspell:191284|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r summoning Storm Drakes!', '', 104163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh!', '', 104162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can deal with Thwen. You overload the coils!', '', 104161, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dispose of them!', 104160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, my. You look rather gaunt, honored teacher. Are you eating enough? Ahahaha!', 104159, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 67293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should be proud! Your handiwork is going to help us reclaim every corner of our ancient lands.', 104158, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 67294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thwen... I should have recognized your uniquely oafish meddling on my network.', '', 104157, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! How did they get in here?!', '', 104156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange... the defenses are offline...', '', 104155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
