('', 'I will speak to my brother a bit longer and then we will head to the barrier. Good luck!', 104153, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did it get here? What is this place?', 'How did it get here? What is this place?', 104152, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to hear about this Spear.', 'I\'d like to hear about this Spear.', 104151, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about the Bane of the Highmountain.', 'Tell me more about the Bane of the Highmountain.', 104150, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead, I am right behind you.', '', 104149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Absolon shakes violently.>\n\nGo away. Leave me to my suffering.', '', 104148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orestes, try to... Orestes!', 104147, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 61847, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so damned cold...', '', 104146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hounds... I got sloppy... let them get too close.', '', 104145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, friends. Save... Alleria...', '', 104144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, Snowfeather delivered my message. Good! We have need of you.', 104143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 64290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a Hot Streak, Cast Pyroblast!', '', 104142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is forfeit!', '', 104141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our numbers are infinite.', '', 104140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orestes!', 104139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, Tess! The gunship will be ready to leave soon!', 104138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re almost at the keep. Please tell King Anduin he\'s in our thoughts, $n.', 104137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such is the cost of vengeance. Gilneas has waited for it long enough.', 104136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear there will soon be more funerals.', 104135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father stands with the king. The Forsaken will never see our forces coming!', 104134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. It\'s sometimes hard to know where the rage ends and the man begins.', 104133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All Gilneans have a rage inside us, Tess. Your father more than most.', 104132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen my father angry before, but never like this. He is consumed by his lust for vengeance.', 104131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!  It\'s one thing to hit a target dummy though.  It\'s time for your final test.  You\'ll need to use everything you\'ve learned.  Defeat my men in combat and prove you\'re ready.', '', 104130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is bohhhring. Let\'s go do something.', 104129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh, got something on your mind?', 104128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s up?', 104127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there!', 104126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s do this!', 104125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry about me, I can take care of myself.', 104124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And down it goes!', 104123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah! That\'s the stuff!', 104122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! Got you!', 104121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All bark... no bite...', 104120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What delightful banter! The High Inquisitor will be pleased to host such spirited guests!', '', 104119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witch! I\'ll gut your beasts and take your head for what you\'ve done!', 104118, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 61826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mortals are always so confident! Come forward, then. My darlings are positively ravenous!', 104117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How convenient! Your little group will make an excellent meal for my hounds!', 104116, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 61825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defensive calibration complete. Acquiring targets.', '', 104115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protection mode enabled. Targets identified.', '', 104114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Threat detected. Pursuing.', '', 104113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mentioned a magical blade, can you tell me more?', 'You mentioned a magical blade, can you tell me more?', 104112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shadow Deacon? Who is this new leader?', 'The Shadow Deacon? Who is this new leader?', 104111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That blade... I knew Moira would want ta know. I think that dagger has been behind some of the worst nightmares Azeroth has seen if I remember me stories. It looks similar ta stories told about the War o\' Three Hammers... and Grim Batol.$b$bIt oozes shadow and seems ta cut the verra light! I think it might have a mind of its own too, it seems the Shadow Deacon is sometimes talkin\' and arguing, but to nobody at all!$b$bWe\'d best stop this ritual and pry that blade loose o\' the cult.', '', 104110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hammer has been in disarray since their Twilight Father and Deathwing took a dive. I\'m guessin\' tha when the Legion attacked one o\' the leaders that was left took to the idea of takin\' over while everyone was distracted.$b$bHe dredged up an ancient artifact o\' the Old Gods and is planning on using it on that dead monstrosity down there to cement his takeover o\' the cult.$b$bI dinna get a good look at the Deacon, but he seems really familiar...', '', 104109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can ye believe they found the Tomb of Tyr himself?! He died here LONG ago fighting some monstrous general of the Old Gods. His comrades buried him \'ere and the corpse o\' that beast further in.$b$bThis tomb was also meant to guard the prison tomb o\' that monster but the Twilight\'s Hammer put a stop ta that.$b$bThe Shadow Deacon used that blade o\' his ta get in and his minions to keep the wards down while he went below.', '', 104108, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was sort of sudden, where are we? What\'s going on?', 'This was sort of sudden, where are we? What\'s going on?', 104107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We dinna hae much time, but ye deserve some answers. What ye want to know about? The Shadow Deacon? The Blade? What the hell is going on? Hah!', '', 104106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should get back to the Dreamgrove, $n. The Archdruid will know how to unlock the power of the Claws.', 104105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th\' Shadow Deacon is already below startin\' his ritual. Ta get there, we\'ll need ta do a bit o\' work. If ye have any questions lemme know, but we best hurry!', '', 104104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moira said ye\'d be comin\'. I\'m Slaghammer, payin\' me family\'s debt by hangin\' oot wi\' these buggers. Lemme take down this barrier.', '', 104103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HRK!', 'Gah...!', 104101, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to face me?', '', 104100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to challenge you Odyn!', 'We are ready to challenge you Odyn!', 104099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My winds shall rip you apart!', '', 104098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s your first critical strike, now cast Inferno Blast to get a second.', '', 104097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pyroblast takes a long time to cast unless you\'re on a Hot Streak.  Try using Fireball and Inferno Blast to gain a Hot Streak before casting Pyroblast this time.', '', 104096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that\'s how you do it.  Let\'s practice that a couple more times and then I\'ll give you a real challenge.', '', 104095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re on a Hot Streak, cast Pyroblast now!', '', 104094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Magic!!! Hurry up, let\'s see what it does!', 104093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gain a Hot Streak by landing two consecutive critical strikes.  Because Inferno Blast will always be a critical strike, start casting Fireball.  When you get your first critical strike use Inferno Blast to get the second, then cast Pyroblast.', '', 104092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve mastered the fundamentals mage, now it\'s time to learn something more advanced.  Pyroblast is your most powerful spell and it gets even more powerful when you\'re on a Hot Streak.  More Importantly, while on a Hot Streak it will have no cast time.', '', 104091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
