('I will keep this between us. Now be still while I patch you up.', 'I will keep this between us. Now be still while I patch you up.', 104071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flame Strike is a slow spell that does a tremendous amount of damage to everything in an area.  Use Flamestrike to quickly dispatch this group of oozes.', '', 104070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
