('You must take up the Scythe of Elune, champion. May its power serve you well.', '', 104054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our champion arrives! We have been sent by Tyrande bearing a weapon that may turn the tide of this war.', '', 104053, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That demon will just open another portal if we don\'t take care of it first. Prepare yourself, $p!', '', 104052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
