('Darkness swallows them whole!', '', 104003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness finds them. Darkness follows them.', '', 104002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drogbar big and stupid. They have cave, but no have candle.', '', 104001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They smash and scare. We take candles and hide.', '', 104000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day drogbar come in. Say cave is theirs.', '', 103999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They like shinies, we like wax. Fresh from ears is best.', '', 103998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig for treasure. Trade with harpies.', '', 103997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Catch rats. Sometimes eat them.', '', 103996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kobolds live here long time. Make home in nooks.', '', 103995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A curious discovery, but you will not find the equipment we need in there.', '', 103994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wherever you are, it is unstable. The telemancy will not hold long.', '', 103993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is wrong... I have lost your position...', '', 103992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want story.', 'I want story.', 103991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very busy. Always jobs to do!\n\nSmart workers catch rats. Smartest workers light candles.\n\nOthers... dig.', '', 103990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harpies like shinies.\n\nWe trade treasures for wax.\n\nBuild biggest candle ever!', '', 103989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rats tastier than rabbit, and easier to catch.', '', 103988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Rats not afraid of darkness.', '', 103987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rats good diggers. Or good dinner if not.', '', 103986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reactivate the sentries once I finish their adjustments. I\'ll reinforce the door and send the guardians against the Legion. That will buy us time to find what we\'re after.', '', 103983, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I no stop candle making! ...Unless you want story?', '', 103982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower\'s defenses have been compromised! I sense the tendrils of Medivh\'s magic thwarting my safeguards!', '', 103977, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things won\'t ever be the same again...', 'Things won\'t ever be the same again...', 103976, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was such a noble king...', 'He was such a noble king...', 103975, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If King Varian couldn\'t stop the Legion, how can anyone?', 'If King Varian couldn\'t stop the Legion, how can anyone?', 103974, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange, you should have been recalled by now. Whatever you just did, it bought you more time.', '', 103973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of the teleporters work the same way. Use them to find that equipment!', '', 103972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Calm Moonkin hoots at you in appreciation.', 'The Calm Moonkin hoots at you in appreciation.', 103971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The teleporter is just outside. Activate it first, then step on the pad.', '', 103970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then there is still a chance... Come quickly! I need your help.', '', 103969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackroot Squirrel chirps in appreciation.', 'The Blackroot Squirrel chirps in appreciation.', 103968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N\'eth ana!', '', 103967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did warn you. Tel\'vasha!', '', 103966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies, ladies, calm down. I think this is that jewelcrafting master that $n has been working with.', '', 103965, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHAT THE HELL IS THAT THING?!?!', 103964, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For blood and honor, Warchief!', 'For blood and honor, Warchief!', 103962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, the famed $c from the Broken Shore has returned.$b$bYour deeds have earned you leniency from my bow, but do not press me. As you can imagine, there is much I must address now that I am Warchief.$b$bWe will speak later. You can wait.', 103961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Jace, I will use my spectral sight to look into the cave.', 'Yes, Jace, I will use my spectral sight to look into the cave.', 103960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I believe there is something very powerful in this cave. But, because of the immense fel energy that permeates Mardum, I cannot be certain. My vision is clouded.\n\nIf there is something in there, we can\'t afford to ignore it. Your mastery of spectral sight is greater than any, save Lord Illidan.\n\nWill you turn your spectral sight on the cave and confirm my suspicions?', '', 103959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello!', '', 103958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHOA! That guy is huge!', 103957, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I thought I asked you to tell your friend to STOP sending those letters of his?!', 103956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forget about me... save the bow... save Thas\'dorah!', 103954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frost nova will freeze any nearby enemies in place allowing you to blink away and destroy them in safety.  For now, let\'s just practice freezing them in place.', '', 103953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fun, isn\'t it? Moving is only half the equation though, what if you could freeze your enemies in place, prevent them from even reaching you?  As a mage, you can do just that.', '', 103952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. The trap.', '', 103951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sign of the dusk lily... This is the First Arcanist\'s seal! Is she alive?!', '', 103950, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? A coin...', '', 103949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blink will allow you to teleport a short distance to avoid danger or close the distance to an enemy, try using it now.', '', 103947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job with that ooze.  To stay alive on the battle field moving around will be critical.  However using your legs is so mundane. You\'re a mage, are you not?  It\'s time to learn how to blink!', '', 103946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Identify yourself, before I teleport you to the depths of the Great Sea.', '', 103943, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 67420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you are not from the palace... and you are no demon, at least not entirely.', '', 103940, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 67419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is far enough.', '', 103939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is Dalaran? Jabrul is impressed. This way to the jewelcrafting masters?', '', 103938, 0, 0, 589, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mist dissipates, revealing %s in the trap!', '', 103937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OH! That feels SO much better.', '', 103936, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break open the crate.', 'Break open the crate.', 103935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello? $n, are you there?', '', 103934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Wait! Jabrul changed his mind!', '', 103932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mail Jabrul.', 'Mail Jabrul.', 103931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a tight fit, but Jabrul should be fine.', '', 103930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the front gate when you\'re ready, $n.', '', 103929, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll need your help in there. It feels a lot like going home, but for the occasional brushes with death that are surely in store.', '', 103928, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran is situated above the largest repository of arcane knowledge on Azeroth. You can guess this is not by mistake.', '', 103927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to crate you up now, Jabrul.', 'I\'m going to crate you up now, Jabrul.', 103924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul will get to Dalaran somehow.', '', 103923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must... kill the Inquisitor... claim Alleria\'s bow!', 103922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Free, but... fel magic.. still afflicting me.', 103921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I present you with a gift from Lord Illidan himself.', '', 103920, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 55617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Vereesa should prove useful... until she breaks. You, however... well, every mortal life must end.', '', 103919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You refuse to surrender! How splendid! We did not anticipate the high elf would bring along so... persistent an ally.', '', 103918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forget about me! Save Alleria!', 103917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Windrunner for my collection! Oh, the secrets you will confess to me!', '', 103915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our uni-directional gift distribution threshold has been reached. Thresholds reset daily.', '', 103914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes his head.', '', 103913, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you never fail to surprise me.', '', 103912, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think that means we\'re on the right track. See what you can find in that journal.', '', 103911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn away now, interloper! The horrors of the past will be your undoing!', '', 103910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You will suffer for your trespass!', '', 103909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Mine!', '', 103908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_shadowward:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:200002|h[Blur of Shadows]|h|r!', '', 103907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please leave your weapons with me, $ct.', 103905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Honor!', '', 103898, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Inquisition\'s work will not be disturbed!', 'The Inquisition\'s sacred work must not be disturbed!', 103897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trifle with forces you do not understand!', 'You trifle with forces you do not understand!', 103896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal must be maintained!', 'The portal must be maintained!', 103895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must not interfere with our work, mortal!', 'You must not interfere with our work, mortal!', 103894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this interruption? Syphonus, deal with these mortals. No witnesses.', '', 103893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You must come quickly! Saurfang has been looking for you!', '', 103892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mortals have endured so much to rescue your precious Alleria. Come forth and reap your reward!', '', 103887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Insert awesome flyover showing your new demon digs and transitioning to the real order hall', '', 103886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring the heart to the altar! This way!', '', 103882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had the use of my arms...', '', 103881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die for this!', '', 103880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baaaaaaaa.', '', 103879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well this is hardly fair.', '', 103878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Place your hand upon the altar and sleep.', 103877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our druids guard the claws now in his lair within the Emerald Dream. It is there we shall go now, to retrieve them.', 103876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After his death, we placed the Claws in the Emerald Dream for safekeeping.', 103875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thousands of years ago, the great proto-dragon, Galakrond, tried to encroach on these forests. Ursoc fought him and where they fell, they created these valleys, and where their claws struck the earth, they forged mountains. Eventually, Ursoc drove the dragon away, to the west.', 103874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ursoc\'s Den is just up ahead. He roamed the wilds while the world was still young, and returned here to rest and train.', 103873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there $n! I knew you would have no problem passing through the Emerald Dreamway.', 103872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, take these designs. I came up with them myself.', '', 103871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We await your command, Overlord.', '', 103869, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, the Dreadscar have come to serve at your command!', '', 103868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I banish you to the mist!', '', 103867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy of being here!', '', 103866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ward will not tolerate your presence!', '', 103865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from here!', '', 103864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Khadgar is waiting for you in Dalaran. Take the portal when you\'re ready.', 'Archmage Khadgar is waiting for you in Dalaran. Take the portal when you\'re ready.', 103863, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Khadgar is waiting for you in Dalaran. Take the portal when you\'re ready.', 'Archmage Khadgar is waiting for you in Dalaran. Take the portal when you\'re ready.', 103862, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mephistroth will... take you...', '', 103861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet again...', '', 103860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Savor your victory while you can, warlock. This war is far from over!', '', 103859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, mortal, you have slain one of my generals...', '', 103858, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jagganoth is slain! Now take his heart. You will be lord of the Dreadscar!', '', 103857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... cannot be!', '', 103856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This power you wield... it\'s not possible!', '', 103855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, warlock! You will be broken!', '', 103854, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 63850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will be pleased to receive yet another gift, and I will happily deliver you to him.', '', 103853, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late to save your friends. They have the honor of amusing my lord, Mephistroth.', '', 103852, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... the little warlock returns.', '', 103851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be mistaken, friend.', '', 103850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A demon in Lorlathil? Nonsense.', 'Oh my, I think I\'m going to like you.', 103849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thought I was a demon?', 'This may be the first time I\'ve ever been mistaken for a demon.', 103848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you always greet people this way?', 'At least get to know me first...', 103847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just felt a tingle in my... nevermind.', 'What just happened?', 103846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! You traitor!', '', 103845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! I was expecting \'im, but I don\'t think you were...', '', 103844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Slaghammer! We have an intruder!', '', 103843, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Address the Council, Khadgar.', 'Address the Council, Khadgar.', 103842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This could be uncomfortable. Are you ready, $n?', '', 103841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Adding mini event here: defeat hounds first, then mistress.', '', 103840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have the honor of meeting the High Inquisitor... if you get past me!', '', 103838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You believe yourselves worthy to enter the cathedral? Then come forth and be tested!', '', 103837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deacon has started the ritual! He is not to be disturbed!', 'The Deacon has started the ritual! He is not to be disturbed!', 103836, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there was a demon in Lorlathil, I\'d know.', 'What a strange sensation... where can I get one of those?', 103835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a strange sensation...', 'Oh my... that tickled!', 103834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Install module for Wormhole Generation Mode.', 'Install module for Wormhole Generation Mode.', 103833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
