('Install module for Failure Detection Mode.', 'Install module for Failure Detection Mode.', 103827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Install module for Repair Mode.', 'Install module for Repair Mode.', 103826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Wormhole Generation Mode.', 'Activate Wormhole Generation Mode.', 103825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Thermal Anvil Mode.', 'Activate Thermal Anvil Mode.', 103824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind. Let me pick a different artifact.', 'I\'ve changed my mind. Let me pick a different artifact.', 103823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did not start this war, but we will end it.', '', 103822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Piloted Combat Mode.', 'Activate Piloted Combat Mode.', 103821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Bling Mode.', 'Activate Bling Mode.', 103820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Snack Distribution Mode.', 'Activate Snack Distribution Mode.', 103819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Fireworks Mode.', 'Activate Fireworks Mode.', 103818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Failure Detection Mode.', 'Activate Failure Detection Mode.', 103817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate Repair Mode.', 'Activate Repair Mode.', 103816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apply a new module.', 'Apply a new module.', 103815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was tired of this disguise anyway!', '', 103814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Latara, my love. I will continue to fight for you. For us.', '', 103813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GREETINGS, CREATOR', '', 103812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, not so fast, $n. I have another request of you.', '', 103811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNCROSS THE WIRES TO SAVE MY DIGITAL LIFE', 'UNCROSS THE WIRES TO SAVE MY DIGITAL LIFE', 103810, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was... difficult. But we must move forward. We will send our invitation to the Warchief at once. We have a war to win.', '', 103809, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This Council is blind to the truth. When the Horde betrays you again, remember who warned you. Farewell.', 103808, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina, please... we are doing what\'s best for Azeroth. Stand with us!', 103807, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me... go...', '', 103806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Modera! Vargoth! How could you?', 103805, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vote carries. I\'m sorry, Jaina, but the stakes are higher than they\'ve ever been.', '', 103804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye.', 103803, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me... sage... for yoooou!', '', 103802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nay.', '', 103801, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nay.', 103800, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye.', '', 103799, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye.', '', 103798, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the matter of allowing the Horde into Dalaran and offering membership in the Kirin Tor, I vote aye.', '', 103797, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. But consider your choice carefully. If you let those vermin back into this city, I will not be counted among your ranks when you welcome them.', 103796, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A vote has been called. Shall we proceed?', '', 103795, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They obliterated Theramore. They left us to die on the Broken Shore. Again and again they\'ve proven to be monsters... cowards!', 103794, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve made my case. With respect, I move for a vote.', '', 103793, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, we know the pain you\'ve endured. But this is about--', '', 103792, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NEVER! Do you hear me, Khadgar?', 103791, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I\'ll get right to the point. For the Kirin Tor to fight at full strength, we need the mages of the Horde to join our ranks.', '', 103790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you proposing?', 103789, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Precisely the two points I wish to address. The demons are evolving their methods. To beat them, the Kirin Tor must do the same.', '', 103788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That much is obvious, Khadgar.', '', 103787, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friends, we\'ve all seen the battle reports. The Legion is laying siege to every kingdom in Azeroth.', '', 103786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar, we don\'t have time to waste in meetings. The Legion is advancing and the Horde arms for battle.', 103785, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you all for gathering on such short notice.', '', 103784, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This book holds a spell that will take you to the library. Get going! And be ready for anything!', '', 103783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re to have any hope of holding back the Legion, I need to get the sentries back on our side.', '', 103782, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\trade_archaeology_vrykul_runestick:20|t Odyn marks all enemies with a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:197961|h[Runic Brand]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DivineProvidence:20|t $n is afflicted with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192067|h[Expel Light]|h|r!', 103781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Val\'sharah has the most beautiful flowers. Do you enjoy picking flowers too?', 103780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You survived the summoners... such determination! A pity you won\'t live to experience our glorious cathedral!', '', 103778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I place you in charge of the grove\'s efforts here. I must travel to the south and seek out Cenarius. Only with his aid will we stop the Legion.', '', 103777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic of your weapon runs deep. Its power will grow with you.', '', 103776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll have to subdue the guardians before my calibration can take effect. No need to be gentle!', '', 103775, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some kind of abomination. Watch yourselves! Do not hesitate!', '', 103774, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence is a testimony to the valor of the Horde. To some... that may not be enough.', '', 103773, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will propose that we invite the Horde back into the Kirin Tor. To certain colleagues on the Council, this will be... controversial.', '', 103772, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Council is already assembled. Let\'s not keep them waiting.', '', 103771, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please trust my judgment. A world at war with itself cannot stand against the Legion for long.', '', 103770, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I propose we invite the Horde back into the Kirin Tor. You may not like this idea. Some of my colleagues certainly won\'t.', '', 103769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old prejudices must be set aside for the greater good of Azeroth.', '', 103768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re going to make it through this, we must bring the Kirin Tor to full strength.', '', 103767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s attacks will only intensify. We must do whatever is necessary to bolster our strength.', '', 103766, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the tome, $n. The information it holds is vital!', '', 103765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kirest-alak yrthog norush...', '', 103764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who will be made to serve!', '', 103763, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 63941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals! You think yourselves worthy to enslave the mighty Jagganoth?', '', 103762, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aieeeeee!', '', 103761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trifling gnome! I think not!', '', 103760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is I, Zelifrax Wobblepox! You will serve me, demon!', '', 103759, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 63937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares summon me?!', '', 103758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! The portal!', 103757, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 63935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... or was it teloth? I\'m always mixing those up!', '', 103756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zelifrax!', '', 103755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zor-arik var... um... telosh?', '', 103754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep focused... I sense a being of great power on the other side...', '', 103753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gal nortalesh da val...', '', 103752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be prepared! We\'re reaching deeper into the Nether than ever before. Who knows what we may find!', 103751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power is impressive, warlock. The ritual begins!', '', 103750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you waiting for, new blood? Begin!', 103749, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 63926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not our concentration that should concern you. Let us hope our newest addition can keep up.', 103748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need everyone to channel on the portal. This ritual requires our unwavering concentration!', '', 103747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akris nor-menoth!', '', 103746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah. Don\'t worry about me, hothead! I know what needs to be done.', '', 103745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zelifrax will lead us in the ritual. You have studied the rites, gnome?', '', 103744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sixth is here. Let us begin.', '', 103743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that book into Modera\'s hands in Dalaran. I\'ll join you soon. And... thank you.', '', 103742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help, Archmage?', 'How can I help, Archmage?', 103741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How was the flight in? Seems we moved Dalaran from one dark, gloomy land to another.$b$bAt least it\'s warmer here. And I must admit, being so close to Karazhan brings back many memories.', '', 103740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xavius will avenge me...', '', 103739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve arrived just in time. I was growing tired of these mangy beasts!', '', 103738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have turned back when you had the chance!', '', 103737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero! Xavius is right.... his strength is... unbreakable. I cannot hold him forever.', '', 103735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaarrghhh ArrrghhhhH!', '', 103734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am LORD of the Nightmare! I have been shaped by the powers of the Old Gods. Tremble before me!', '', 103733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will resist you to my last breath, usurper! I will never submit to one such as you!', '', 103732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never reach Xalethar alive!', '', 103730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!', '', 103729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Ursoc. When next you bare your fangs, it will be at my command!', '', 103728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this sorcery!? When I get free, I\'ll tear out your foul throat, Xavius!', '', 103727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish bear! You\'ve fallen for my trap!', '', 103726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold, guardian. I feel a chill deep in my spirit.', '', 103725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those healers will make things more difficult. We should try and defeat them first!', '', 103724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those casters cannot be left alone! We must deal with them quickly!', '', 103723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emerald Dream is a paradise, a hope of the world that could be. I will not let it be destroyed!', '', 103722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart of the bear never falters! Hold the line, hero!', '', 103721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware! The Nightmare\'s corruption has spread to the trees!', '', 103720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control the enemies. You can determine where they fall!', '', 103719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their blood will burn the very ground where they fall. Don\'t let them touch our defenders!', '', 103718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up, defenders! We will never yield to these invaders!', '', 103717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect our healers and casters, guardian. We must not let our allies fall!', '', 103716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creatures of the wild, heed my call! Come to our aid!', '', 103715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These foes are weak, but fight in numbers. In life, I paid the price for underestimating my enemy. Never again!', '', 103714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be fine. Just give me a moment to rest.', 103712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ow! Ow! Owww! I really need a moment to rest.', 103711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gee, this is going to hurt. I\'m so sorry!', 103709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand within my healing circle, guardian, and be restored.', 103708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will heal you, guardian!', 103707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from me you big, stupid... stupid head!', 103705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! These big meanies won\'t leave me alone!', 103704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The furbolgs have been acting strange lately...', '', 103703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be on your guard, friend. There have been demon sightings in the area.', 103702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s falls to the ground!', '', 103701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s faints and falls onto the ground.', 103700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my stars! I just can\'t stand violence! I hope this ends quickly.', 103699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonsoul:20|tYou are afflicted by  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194960|h[Soul Echoes]|h|r !', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonsoul:20|tYou are afflicted by  |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194960|h[Soul Echoes]|h|r !', 103698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, it appears my safeguards may have been altered. Keep an eye out while I open the way.', '', 103696, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warn the others. Now, WAKE UP!', '', 103695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grant you my blessing, $n. With it, all others will know you are my chosen champion.', '', 103694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_felfirenova:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:199828|h[Chaos Nova]|h|r!', '', 103693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_bosskilrogg_deadeye:20|tIllysanna Ravencrest\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197674|h[Eye Beams]|h|r begin tracking you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_bosskilrogg_deadeye:20|tIllysanna Ravencrest\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197674|h[Eye Beams]|h|r begin tracking you!', 103692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_demonhunter_felrush:20|tIllysanna Ravencrest prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197484|h[Dark Rush]|h|r towards you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_demonhunter_felrush:20|tIllysanna Ravencrest prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197484|h[Dark Rush]|h|r towards you!', 103691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin Tor have established a portal in a chamber beneath the city to Dalaran\'s former home in the Hillsbrad Foothills - Light\'s Hope is a short ride from there.$B$BThere are teleportation pads in Runeweaver Square that will take you to the chamber. I have marked one on your map.', '', 103690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I get to Light\'s Hope Chapel?', 'How do I get to Light\'s Hope Chapel?', 103689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are dark times, $n. I\'m glad you\'re here.', '', 103688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear! More invaders are coming!', 103687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthy you may be, but if you would wield my claws to defend this world, you must make haste to retrieve them. Even now, I sense more of the enemy approaching!', '', 103686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vile beasts of the Nightmare! You will never take my claws!', '', 103685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! Is this the relic you seek?', '', 103684, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 60285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wards! More sentries are coming after us. Fortunately, I always keep a few tricks up my sleeve.', '', 103683, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sentry! Look out!', '', 103682, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
