('', 'Come forth, my children. Feast upon our enemies.', 103517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You merely... prolong...', '', 103516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn in the flames of Sargeras!', '', 103515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None can resist my kiss.', 103514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but misbegotten pawns.', '', 103513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late. The end was set in motion long ago.', '', 103512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arrival heralds the end.', '', 103511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My swarm will feast on your soul!', '', 103510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fire will leave only your bones behind.', '', 103509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deprecated', '', 103508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press forward, $n! I cannot return to Jandvik until I have avenged the death of Throndyr!', '', 103507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The body is that of a young high elf. Too young to be Alleria.', 103506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The invasions are beginning! Go rally my brethren in the Mage Quarter, champion!', '', 103505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out! They\'re hidin\' in the dust!', 103503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like we\'re about to be overrun. Let us leave this wretched place to the demons.', 103501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen\'s brood will hatch soon.', '', 103500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreamway is ready! Good work, everyone.', '', 103498, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! The path is taking form! It grows more stable by the moment!', '', 103496, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual will focus our energy into a portal at the center of the structure. We must keep it stable!', '', 103495, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 62132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like my new sword? Take a closer look.', '', 103494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you talking to me? FIGHT THESE DEMONS!', '', 103493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve returned with the artifact! Well done, $n!', 103492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a high elf body up ahead. It looks like...', '', 103491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My fel secrets will consume you!', 103490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opening the path to this ancient home of all druids will be no small feat. I hope you\'re ready for the task.', '', 103489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Anduin, the hero of the Broken Shore approaches.', 103488, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s arrival has thrown our world out of balance. I\'ve sensed great unrest within the Emerald Dream.', '', 103487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their knowledge of druidism is ancient and unparalleled. Having their might on our side is essential if we are to stop the Legion.', '', 103486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are powerful druids in Val\'sharah who grew under Cenarius\'s tutelage after the Great Sundering.', '', 103485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion waits for you by the barrow dens to the east. Follow me.', '', 103484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe never misses its mark.', '', 103483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Na\'ser! Answer your masters call!', '', 103482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His valor inspired us all, even in death. His spirit will be with us, always.', '', 103481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He died with honor, protecting his people. He was a true king.', '', 103480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe he\'s really gone.', '', 103479, 0, 0, 579, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not only is Inferno Blast instant but it will always score a critical hit. This will be important later. Eliminate the Ooze over there with Inferno Blast.', '', 103478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good.  Fireball is a powerful spell but takes a while to cast.  Sometimes you need something quicker.  Let\'s teach you how to cast Inferno Blast.', '', 103477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to put an end to this inquisition!', '', 103476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here... over here!', '', 103475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, but... didn\'t make it to cathedral. Wounds bad... it\'s so cold...', '', 103474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess your mage was right... time goes crazy in the Nether. Least I lasted long enough... to warn you.', '', 103473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not this time... wounds are bad. The hounds... don\'t let them get near you.', '', 103472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turns out... rushing through that portal... not my best idea...', '', 103471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As my master wills!', '', 103470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, Lord Typhinius.', '', 103469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These intruders will fall by my hand!', '', 103468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I want them alive! There\'s no challenge in dead rabbits!', '', 103467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from that spire!', '', 103466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistress Torvis! Intruders approach!', '', 103465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re just in time for dinner... for my pets, that is!', 103464, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 61810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... who will feed my darlings?', 103463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hardly more than a morsel, but I suppose you\'ll have to do!', 103462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With it, we\'ll be able to invade any Legion world, even Argus.', '', 103461, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 55246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Razormaw Shark has the scent of your blood! Get back to land!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Razormaw Shark has the scent of your blood! Get back to the land!', 103459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it! Then we can leave this place before Jagganoth finds us!', '', 103458, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! This is the tome you seek, friend!', '', 103457, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not to mention the power they could give us...', 103456, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is amazing! Think of all we could learn from these tomes!', 103455, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 63863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see... nothing...', '', 103454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see... intruders!', '', 103453, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This feature is not yet ready for testing. You have been given credit for this objective.', 'This feature is not yet ready for testing. You have been given credit for this objective.', 103452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are. $n, over here. Azsuna awaits.', '', 103450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet you there as soon as you conclude your business in Dalaran.', '', 103449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. It is fortunate I found you. Your presence is requested at Moonglade.', '', 103448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our mission is of critical importance!', 103447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That structure in the distance must be the cathedral. Lead on, I\'m with you!', 103446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal magic of the eredar struck me... I need a moment to recover.', 103445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not disturb the work of the hound mistress!', '', 103444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Portal mages! Take them out before they bring reinforcements!', 103443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The eredar are summoning in more demons!', 103442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A sentry! Destroy it before it warns the others!', 103441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no!', 103440, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 63880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have your head for that. Hsss...', '', 103439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hsss... Hsss...', '', 103438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hsss... My strength is gone!', '', 103437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you... Hsss... done to me?', 103436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tidemistress! They are weakening me!', 103435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you done? Hsss...', 103434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The path is clear! Hurry!', '', 103433, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay... the monster. Find... Talonclaw...', 103432, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 62701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zinnin...', 103431, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 63879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These wounds... they are not healing. We must finish this quickly, before we bleed out!', 103430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee, friend! We must escape through the gateway!', '', 103429, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Lord Typhinius... I have failed you...', '', 103428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy $r, I\'ll bring your head to lord Typhinius!', '', 103427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shall be avenged! We must finish this. Follow the monster!', 103426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to know. When I\'m through with you, I\'ll take care of her too!', '', 103425, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ms. Xiulan sent you to get rid of me?', '', 103424, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ms. Xiulan sends her regards!', 'Ms. Xiulan sends her regards!', 103423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zinnin, look out!', 103422, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 63877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They were here all along!', 103419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep them outside of the gates!', 103418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The others... I\'ll warn them immediately!', 103417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure? You may only pursue one empowerment at a time.', 'Are you sure? You may only pursue one empowerment at a time.', 103416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to review the empowerments we might pursue.', 'I would like to review the empowerments we might pursue.', 103415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you smell them, on the wind? The Legion\'s invasion has begun.', '', 103414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_carrionswarm:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198947|h[Carrion Storm]|h|r!', '', 103413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to go.', 'I am ready to go.', 103408, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again I thank you. I will find the spirits of your friends and ensure they do not stay here.', '', 103407, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last the monster is dead and our relic reclaimed. My spirit can finally move on from this place...', '', 103406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your presence is not welcome here!', 103405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one\'s mine!', 103404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back to the nether with you!', 103403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did they come from?', 103402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yikes! Get outta here! Go!', 103401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons... gotta warn da others.', '', 103400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get goin\', $n!', '', 103399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patience wears thin. Relinquish the feast to me before we do battle or you will never set foot in these shining halls again!', '', 103398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you seek? Power? Glory? Be reasonable! My warriors\' hunger knows no end!', '', 103397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And here is your diamond. A pleasure doing business with you. Please return soon.', 103396, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why must you continue to taunt me with that feast you carry? My Valarjar enjoy nothing more than a banquet after a worthy bout!', '', 103395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you have brought a truly bountiful feast with you. Do you not wish to share it with me?', '', 103394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve taken care of Inkrot.', 'I\'ve taken care of Inkrot.', 103393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 50 gold.', 'Pay the 50 gold.', 103392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 100 gold.', 'Pay the 100 gold.', 103391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 125 gold.', 'Pay the 125 gold.', 103390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 200 gold.', 'Pay the 200 gold.', 103389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 120 gold.', 'Pay the 120 gold.', 103388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 175 gold.', 'Pay the 175 gold.', 103387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay the 250 gold.', 'Pay the 250 gold.', 103386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well the fairest price you\'ll hear from me is one hundred, take it or leave it.$b$bOf course, my favor is still on the table, if you\'d rather take that route.', 103385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you weren\'t such a charmer I\'d have ended this exchange before it ever began.$b$bBut I like you. You\'re rather stubborn and a good haggler.$b$bYou have a deal at fifty.', 103384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I think I\'m done haggling here.$b$bOne hundred and twenty gold, take it or leave it.$b$bOf course, my favor is still on the table, if you\'d rather take that route.', 103383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come now, surely you\'re not that poor?$b$bFine, I\'ll go down just a bit more. How does a cool one hundred gold sound? A fair price for the fairest of diamonds.', 103382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no need to take that tone with me, $gsir:madam;. It\'s shame to work with someone with such little money.$b$bWill one one hundred and twenty five gold break your bank?', 103381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You come up, I\'m supposed to come down, yes? An exchange I\'m all too familiar with.$b$bVery well, I\'ll go as low as one hundred and seventy five, take it or leave it.$b$bOf course, my favor is still on the table, if you\'d rather take that route.', 103380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t begin this exchange with you to be insulted. Two hundred fifty is my final offer, take it or leave it.$b$bOf course, my favor is still on the table, if you\'d rather take that route.', 103379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Twenty five gold for this diamond of diamonds? I think not.$b$bBut you have a wise face. I suppose I could part with this for two hundred gold.', 103378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Aggressive) You\'re still too high. 40 is the fairest price I\'m going to offer.', '(Aggressive) You\'re still too high. 40 is the fairest price I\'m going to offer.', 103377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Fair) I hear you at 100, but I\'m afraid I can\'t offer any higher than 50. Final offer.', '(Fair) I hear you at 100, but I\'m afraid I can\'t offer any higher than 50. Final offer.', 103376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Aggressive) 125 is still out of the question. I think 35 is still a fair price.', '(Aggressive) 125 is still out of the question. I think 35 is still a fair price.', 103375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Fair) We\'re getting closer with 125, but not close enough. How about 40?', '(Fair) We\'re getting closer with 125, but not close enough. How about 40?', 103374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Aggressive) Look, there\'s no way I\'m paying 200. How about 35?', '(Aggressive) Look, there\'s no way I\'m paying 200. How about 35?', 103373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Fair) I still can\'t go as high as 200. How about 75?', '(Fair) I still can\'t go as high as 200. How about 75?', 103372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Aggressive) 250 gold is outrageous for one diamond! I\'ll give you 10.', '(Aggressive) 250 gold is outrageous for one diamond! I\'ll give you 10.', 103371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Fair) 250 gold is much too high for just one diamond. How about 25?', '(Fair) 250 gold is much too high for just one diamond. How about 25?', 103370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why yes, I do. But just the one. A rather large and exotic, rare jewel from across the sea.$b$bI\'d be willing to part with it for, oh... two hundred and fifty gold pieces? I also accept favors as currency.$b$bA nuisance has sprouted up around here named Inkrot. If he were to be eliminated, I\'d be willing to part with the diamond.$b$bSo, which do you choose?', 103369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for some diamonds. Do you have any?', 'I\'m looking for some diamonds. Do you have any?', 103368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have the most exotic of wares from across the world.$b$bWhat is it you\'re looking for?', 103367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not over, warlock! I will see the end of you!', '', 103366, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn you to cinders!', '', 103365, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ungh! Press on, warlock... close the portal!', 103364, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 63881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skull will make a fine trophy!', '', 103363, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not get away! I\'m not done with you yet!', '', 103362, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Burn in fel fire!', '', 103361, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will smash you like the insignificant gnats you are!', '', 103360, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shinfel! No!', 103359, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 63872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haughty warlocks! You presume to issue commands to my kind! Face the consequences for your insolence!', '', 103358, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ungh... Unhand me, wretch!', 103357, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 63870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think you could escape my grasp so easily?', '', 103356, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would appear we\'ve been discovered.', 103355, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 63868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent wretches!', '', 103354, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 63867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot allow them breach the gates!', '', 103353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your eyes cannot show you what they cannot see.', 'Your eyes cannot show you what they cannot see.', 103352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the proof.', 'Show me the proof.', 103351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be deceived by your mortal eyes! The Legion is already among us!', '', 103350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you down at the gateway on the Molten Shore.', '', 103349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is his signal! Let us land and see what he learned.', 103348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you are. And next time, perhaps you should try crafting it yourself before coming to me and put both our time to better use.', 103347, 0, 0, 483, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These designs are interesting, did you come up with them yourself? But yes, I could cut these for you.', 103346, 0, 0, 483, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I myself would never dream of going down there, but I assume you\'d have no problem given your primary career as a $c.', 103345, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t currently have any, no. But I hear they have all sorts of items in the Underbelly.', 103344, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiffany, can you cut this diamond into some lockpicks please?', 'Tiffany, can you cut this diamond into some lockpicks please?', 103343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope my brother didn\'t go after the beast himself. He can be... impulsive.', 103342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, you get one now and one when we get there. No complaining!', 103341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, Mr. Crane. Here\'s two juicy fish if you\'ll take me to Uldum.', 103340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My friend Mr. Crane can fly me to Uldum. Here, you can use my kite to follow us.', 103339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m certain, Sevis. I need to sacrifice you to power the gateway.', 'I\'m certain, Sevis. I need to sacrifice you to power the gateway.', 103338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. I willingly sacrifice myself for the cause. What demon hunter wouldn\'t?', '', 103337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold a moment, Sevis. I\'m reconsidering.', 'Hold a moment, Sevis. I\'m reconsidering.', 103336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! Okay $n, let\'s go!', 103335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for some diamonds, Tiffany, do you have any?', 'I\'m looking for some diamonds, Tiffany, do you have any?', 103334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me. My brother Wuho was supposed to scout out a \"safe\" area where we can fly in. We will take a hippogryph to the harbor and he should send us a signal of where to land.', 103333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve made up my mind. Sacrifice me, Sevis, and power the gateway.', 'I\'ve made up my mind. Sacrifice me, Sevis, and power the gateway.', 103332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly nothing I say is going to change your mind. Fine, go on your adventure. Just come back to me unharmed.', '', 103331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scowls.', '', 103329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain, $n? You\'re far more important to the mission than me.', '', 103328, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought you might say that... Look, I have a guardian, and it\'s even the master of the monks. I\'ll be fine!', 103327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li, I told you I don\'t want you going off on your own again.', '', 103326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Okay, Pop. It\'s been... it\'s been something. I need to get on with my travels.', 103325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shivarra and many other demons swore fealty to Lord Illlidan when he defeated their former master, the pit lord Magtheridon. We also have naga, broken, and some other creatures working for us.\n\nIf the Lord of Outland is okay with it, then I guess that\'s good enough for me.', '', 103324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s your opinion about the Shivarra?', 'What\'s your opinion about the Shivarra?', 103323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind. Let me pick a different artifact.', 'I\'ve changed my mind. Let me pick a different artifact.', 103322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never rest till the Legion is defeated.', '', 103321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go have your fun, pup. I have had my fill for the day.', '', 103320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will go no farther!', '', 103319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the decree of Vol\'jin, acting Warchief of the Horde, I enact you, Lady Sylvanas Windrunner, as the new Warchief of the our people.', '', 103318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Warchief who knows strategy - who commands without hesitation.', '', 103317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'According to the story, the lord of air was filled with great wrath and decided to play a trick on Irmaat.$b$bThe lord of air imbued the weapons with the purest form of his essence, knowing that Irmaat could not possibly wield such power. Irmaat named his creation the \"Fists of the Heavens\" and held them to the sky to admire his work. This was a mistake, for when he did this it conjured a great vortex of swirling sand and air that was completely out of his control! The vortex scattered the smith\'s blades and buried his home under the desert sands.$b$bWouldn\'t it be neat if the blades were real? I\'d give anything to get out of here and go search for them!', 103316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened then?', 'What happened then?', 103315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s REALLY dry and covered all with sand like a big kitty box! I briefly went there with my Uncle Chen. I wish I could see it again!$b$bSo according to the story thousands of years ago there was this smith called Irmaat who used to live there. The smith was known all throughout the land for his excellent work in creating magical weapons that represent the air spirits that live there.$b$bHis finest work was said to be a set of hand blades that were formed from the essence of pure air. The story goes on that he attempted to summon the lord of the winds to imbue the weapons with its power.$b$bThat didn\'t go so well for him.', 103314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh that\'s so cool! I was there only for a little while. I wish I could visit there again sometime.$b$bSo according to the story thousands of years ago there was this smith called Irmaat who used to live there. The smith was known all throughout the land for his excellent work in creating magical weapons that represent the air spirits that live there.$b$bHis finest work was said to be a set of hand blades that were formed from the essence of pure air. The story goes on that he attempted to summon the lord of the winds to imbue the weapons with its power.$b$bThat didn\'t go so well for him.', 103313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been there before.', 'I\'ve been there before.', 103312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve also heard of it.', 'I\'ve also heard of it.', 103311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Li Li\'s ears perk up.>$b$bWell, the story goes that there is a land covered by sand called Uldum.', 103310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, go on.', 'Please, go on.', 103309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah! Let me think... I heard it back when Uncle Chen and I were still traveling the world before we found the way to Pandaria.$b$bWe were in Booty Bay one night staying at a place called the Salty Sailor. While there I met a giant creature who called himself a Tol\'vir.$b$bWe chatted for a long time and he told me of his homeland, a place covered in sands called Uldum.', 103308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that you know a tale describing a set of mysterious hand blades.', 'I\'ve heard that you know a tale describing a set of mysterious hand blades.', 103307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Onward to adventure!', 103306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm... These tornadoes simply won\'t do.', 103305, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sia\'la yemil!', '', 103302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are all of my servants weaklings? Fine, I shall end you myself!', '', 103300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mortals will not die! Zaurac, defend your master!', '', 103299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unacceptable! Melezan, destroy them or I will cast your miserable essence to Deepholm!', '', 103298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, servants of the storm! Defend your master!', '', 103297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small victory! Enjoy it while you can!', '', 103296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent whelps! Witness the powers at my command! Al\'\'burq wa Alra\'ed hiyah!', '', 103295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny mortals, you tread in MY realm now! There is no one to save you!', '', 103294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals, in MY domain? They must not disrupt my plans! Slaughter them!', '', 103293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for you outsider, do not step foot into Jandvik or it will be your corpse I spit on next.', '', 103292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spit on your corpse, serpent!', '', 103291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go.', 103290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No sign of Orestes. He\'s headstrong, but should have the sense to wait here for us!', 103289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done! Walk proudly this day and relish your victory.', '', 103288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have truly impressed me. To pass these trials is a triumph, to do so with such speed makes of you a legend!', '', 103287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must discover what the cause of this attack is before there\'s no one left to fight.', 103285, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be waiting for you at the underground base. Until then, farewell.', 103284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'During your battle with Azoran, I was able to secure information from the ship\'s database. We have much to discuss.', 103283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, our work is still far from over...', 103282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks to you, Azoran has been slain and a great blow has been struck against the Burning Legion.', 103281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
