('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_ticket_tarot_vengeance:20|t%s summons an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197796|h[Avatar of Vengeance!]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_ticket_tarot_vengeance:20|t%s summons an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197796|h[Avatar of Vengeance!]|h|r', 103277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_flytrap:20|t%s throws |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197379|h[Cruel Traps]|h|r around the platform!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_herb_flytrap:20|t%s throws |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197379|h[Cruel Traps]|h|r around the platform!', 103276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep moving! That was only the first!', 103275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul will stay here and study these necklaces.$b$bJabrul will not forget you and the help you\'ve given him, $n.', '', 103274, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power burns... How have you twisted the Scythe of Elune to obey your will?', '', 103273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll take this one out, no problem!', '', 103272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are blessed with great restorative powers, druid, but I will rip you all apart in the end!', '', 103271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What power comes from those fangs, defiler? You fight with the strength of the Ancients themselves.', '', 103270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense great cunning and prowess from you, druid, but I will not be defeated!', '', 103269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I share my power with you alone, champion. Bathe in the light of creation. Bask in the glory of the valorous!', '', 103268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_MasterMarksman:20|t%s begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194289|h[Focusing]|h|r a beam of energy! Use the Lenses to reflect it back at him!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_MasterMarksman:20|t%s begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194289|h[Focusing]|h|r a beam of energy! Use the Lenses to reflect it back at him!', 103267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with the fury of Ursoc himself! No... I will not be defeated!', '', 103266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_arcaneorb:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194880|h[Pulse]|h|r of energy that will ricochet off the walls.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_arcaneorb:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:194880|h[Pulse]|h|r of energy that will ricochet off the walls.', 103265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
