('Jabrul has found the other stone. We should make our way back to the safety of the night elves.', '', 103253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul doesn\'t understand how the harpies can treat their jewelry with such disregard.', '', 103252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul needs your protection once more. Jabrul will try to be quick.', '', 103251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As for you, champion... well done. Well done!', '', 103250, 0, 42213, 0, 64, 0, 69198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul found one of the stones he was looking for. The other one must be around here somewhere.', '', 103249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These harpies aren\'t very good at keeping their trinkets safe. Most of these are broken.', '', 103248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep harpies off of Jabrul while he looks for good necklaces.', '', 103247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul will meet you inside the night elf house. Come find Jabrul when you\'re ready.', '', 103246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally your allies. Do not relent. Your trials are nearly complete!', '', 103245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must surge forward while hope remains in your heart!', '', 103244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must place trust in your allies. The truly valorous do not walk alone.', '', 103243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s ascend the rise ahead and see what we\'re up against.', 103242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trip through that demon portal was unsettling. Bide a moment, then let me know when you\'re ready.', 103241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many before have followed the path you walk. None possessed the strength to persevere.', '', 103240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deprecated', '', 103239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another... will take... my place...', '', 103238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A noble effort, but you are not yet worthy of my blessing.', '', 103237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek my blessing, then you must complete the ancient trials of the Valarjar.', '', 103236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 69204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_shieldreflection.blp:20|tKrustallos casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:78939|h[Elementium Bulwark]|h|r!', '', 103235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I felt those eyes peering into my soul. Had you not freed me...', 103234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s tearing into my mind!', 103233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! I must know if Alleria was truly held captive here, or if this was all a ruse to trap us!', 103232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61833, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have committed no crime, Tirathon. Whereas you and your associates have to answer for yours!', 103231, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 55438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the night shroud you in shadow, and the moon illuminate your foes.', 103230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will make my way to the surface, but you should inform the other wardens of what you have accomplished today.', 103229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The traitor is defeated. Thank you, we owe you a great debt.', 103228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you intend to venture deeper you will find far more terrifying things lurking in our Vault.', 103227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your help. Your intervention saved my life.', 103226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to crackle with lightning...', '%s begins to crackle with lightning...', 103225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Jabrul, I\'m ready to go.', 'Alright, Jabrul, I\'m ready to go.', 103224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul needs to find unbroken versions of the two stones the harpies use in their necklaces.$b$bLet Jabrul know when you are ready to look for them.', '', 103223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect! The one I\'ve been waiting for!', '', 103222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren, orc, troll, elves, goblins... forsaken. All of us be feelin\' da same ting.', '', 103221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people be strong. Let there be no mistakin\'... we in dis together.', '', 103220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He always be tinkin\' da Horde be one. Dat be da truth, mon.', '', 103219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Such a tremendous loss for us all.', '', 103218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe he\'s gone.', '', 103217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve witnessed such sadness too often in my lifetime.', '', 103216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a horrible tragedy.', 103215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never met him, but... I liked knowing he was there, ya know?', 103214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just can\'t believe it.', 103213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us honor the deeds of those who fought for our well-being.', '', 103212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assure you, little one, he will not be forgotten.', '', 103211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When our journey ends, it is only the beginning.', 'When our journey ends, it is only the beginning.', 103210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will pay for their crimes.', 'The Legion will pay for their crimes.', 103209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits will guide him.', 'The spirits will guide him.', 103208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings be upon him.', 'Blessings be upon him.', 103207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Earth Mother watch over him.', 'May the Earth Mother watch over him.', 103206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wonderin\' what be happenin\' to our people now.', 'Wonderin\' what be happenin\' to our people now.', 103205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May de spirits guide him.', 'May de spirits guide him.', 103204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De son of Sen\'jin be restin\' wit\' his fatha now.', 'De son of Sen\'jin be restin\' wit\' his fatha now.', 103203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest his soul.', 'Rest his soul.', 103202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessin\'s of de Loa be wit him.', 'Blessin\'s of de Loa be wit him.', 103201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De pain de warchief went tru... ain\'t nothin\' we be forgettin\' soon.', 'De pain de warchief went tru... ain\'t nothin\' we be forgettin\' soon.', 103200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Darkspear gonna be rememberin\' dis day.', 'De Darkspear gonna be rememberin\' dis day.', 103199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today be de day of reflection.', 'Today be de day of reflection.', 103198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will pay for his death with their blood!', 'The Legion will pay for his death with their blood!', 103197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde was meant to be led by an orc, if you ask me!', 'The Horde was meant to be led by an orc, if you ask me!', 103196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe will strike down foes in his honor.', 'My axe will strike down foes in his honor.', 103195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you paid respects?', 'Have you paid respects?', 103194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was it the poison that made Vol\'jin name her-- Uh, nevermind.', 'Was it the poison that made Vol\'jin name her-- Uh, nevermind.', 103193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He died with honor.', 'He died with honor.', 103192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will lead us to victory in this war.', 'She will lead us to victory in this war.', 103191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe he\'s gone.', 'I can\'t believe he\'s gone.', 103190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the spirits are indeed drawn to this place. Let us hope they are friendly.', '', 103189, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The catacombs\' entrance is just down this path. Make haste!', '', 103188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now begone!', 103187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wear proudly our mark, and perhaps you will prove worthy of Odyn\'s blessing.', 103186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have proven your worth as a Valkyra, but the trials to come are arduous.', 103185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s shatters all remaining ice blocks, freeing the geists inside!', 103184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_leatherscrap_17.blp:20|t %s has no one to melee and begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198520|h[Wing Buffet]|h|r!', 103183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel before me, mortal.', 103182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand on the dais and we will begin.', 103181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashildir has told me of your exploits. You seek my mark so that you might impress Odyn.', 103180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 69210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who lead sacrifice a great many things.', '', 103179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a sad day indeed.', '', 103178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we remember. Tomorrow we train.', '', 103177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not much in the mood for fishing today.', '', 103176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not right now, $n. This whole thing\'s got me down.', '', 103175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nighteyes hoots at you in a grateful tone.', '', 103174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s your bag, Jabrul.', 'Here\'s your bag, Jabrul.', 103173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jabrul was attacked by the harpies and barely managed to hide.$b$bJabrul dropped his bag of jewels. Jabrul needs those jewels to heal himself.', '', 103172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to you?', 'What happened to you?', 103171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to finish off Jabrul? If so, make it quick!', '', 103170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haven\'t seen him since though. Hopefully he didn\'t succumb to the same affliction as the harpies.', 103169, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He passed through here a few days ago. Went towards the Wretched Hollow to study the harpies.', 103168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Oh, you\'re looking for Jabrul.', 103167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to review weapons we might pursue.', 'I would like to review weapons we might pursue.', 103166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a master jewelcrafter.', 'I\'m looking for a master jewelcrafter.', 103165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me inside Grommash Hold.', 'Take me inside Grommash Hold.', 103164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doors to Grommash Hold have been sealed. The leaders of the Horde must be protected!', '', 103163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snowfeather swoops down and hovers expectantly. She has a message!', '', 103162, 0, 36931, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am pleased you have arrived.', 103161, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rarrgh!!', '', 103156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for giving me newfound purpose. I will meet you at Shal\'Aran. I think I will be needing a source of magic after all.', '', 103155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall aid you, friend. Let us banish this foul presence from Tel\'anor!', '', 103154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush, demon. This will all be over soon.', 103153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wretched Illidari! What have you done to me?', '', 103152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dropped the weights...', 'I dropped the weights...', 103151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These bruls could learn a thing or two from you.', '', 103150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re stronger than I thought, brul.', '', 103149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, brul. You don\'t look very strong to me...', '', 103148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your eyes are deceiving you. Do not trust them!', 103147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the proof.', 'Show me the proof.', 103146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such arrogance.... To think you can stand against the Legion!', '', 103145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom is but a hopeless dream.', '', 103144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never see the light of this world again.', '', 103143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(TEMP) FUNERAL CINEMATIC PLAYS (10 second delay)\nQuest Criteria will Progress in 8 seconds', '(TEMP) FUNERAL CINEMATIC PLAYS (10 second delay)', 103142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That feels SOO much better. Thank you, errr... what do I call you?', '', 103141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot afford to lose Kayn and Altruis here. Waste no time and help them, quickly!', 103140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 68365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will you do now?', 'What will you do now?', 103139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send in the skeleton crew!', '', 103138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57457, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No quarter to these scallywags! Helya doesn\'t abide intruders.', '', 103137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57460, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arggh! What power... is this?!', '', 103136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t that $n? $GHe:She; made it back!', 'Isn\'t that $n? $GHe:She; made it back!', 103135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I was at the Shore. I would have fought alongside $n.', 'I wish I was at the Shore. I would have fought alongside $n.', 103134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t know $Ghe:she; was a $c.', 'I didn\'t know $Ghe:she; was a $c.', 103133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder why they asked for $Ghim:her;?', 'I wonder why they asked for $Ghim:her;?', 103132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, that\'s the $c!', 'Look, that\'s the $c!', 103131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the $c. $GHe:She was there.', 'That\'s the $c. $GHe:She was there.', 103130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is your Light to protect you now?', 103129, 0, 0, 38, 64, 0, 0, 61900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How quaint. Do you really think your Holy Light can protect you from the Legion\'s onslaught?', 103128, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 61899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your worthless lives will pave the way for the Legion!', 103127, 0, 0, 38, 64, 0, 0, 61898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were fools to think such a pitiful force could oppose an agent of Sargeras!', 103126, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 61897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not fret. Through Ulthalesh, you will be so much more in death than you were in life.', 103125, 0, 0, 38, 64, 0, 0, 61896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DivineProvidence:20|t $n is afflicted with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192067|h[Expel Light]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DivineProvidence:20|t $n is afflicted with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:192067|h[Expel Light]|h|r!', 103124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such poor souls. You don\'t even belong here, but you will be forever bound to this place.', 103123, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful around this one. Who knows what he\'s capable of.', 'Be careful around this one. Who knows what he\'s capable of.', 103122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', 'Very well.', 103121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish Illidari! Have you come to die as well?', '', 103120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will devour your soul!', '', 103119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that really $Ghim:her;?', 'Is that $Ghim:her;?', 103118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build a pyre around Jarl Throndyr.', 'Build a pyre around Jarl Throndyr.', 103117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pardon me, but if I may be so bold as to interrupt...', 103116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand down! This one has purpose for treading here.', 103115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 69211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"May the night shroud me in shadow...\"', 103114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pretty neat, huh?', 103113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]We\'ve seen the creatures use this room to travel to the lands below; with it we can escape this place.', '', 103112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[ph]I\'m free, but others of my people are still suffering on the walls above. Please, help them!', '', 103111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterspidercarapace_01:20|tNearby |cFFFF0000|Hspell:198235|h[Spider Eggs]|h|r will hatch soon if not destroyed!.', '', 103110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Broken Shore was just the beginning. The Alliance will retaliate. Given the opportunity, they will strike when we are weak.', 103109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is not the time, $n.', '', 103108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All this adventuring\'s making me sleepy. Let\'s head back to the Wandering Isle.', 103107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
