('Fight back! Do not let him manipulate you.', '', 102786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can trust no one-not even your comrades!', '', 102785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will waste away slowly, painfully.', '', 102784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fracture your feeble mind!', '', 102783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand together if you hope to win!', '', 102782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First you suffer; then you die!', '', 102781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind games hold no sway over me, dog!', '', 102780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your voice is but a whisper in this realm.', '', 102779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity you have come this far only to die at the hands of Xavius!', '', 102778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold words for a prisoner. Even an echo of my power was enough to overwhelm you!', '', 102777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An empty threat. You hold no sway over this realm, Nightmare Lord.', '', 102776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity you have come this far only to die at the hands of Xavius!', '', 102775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, weakling! When you open your mouth again, it will be to cry for mercy!', '', 102774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will be more than prepared, for your true power rests in the Nightmare.', '', 102773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fluke. Savor it, and pray you do not face me next.', '', 102772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be still, worm! I will deal with you shortly.', '', 102771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So says the shadow of Xavius.', '', 102770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who challenge me only speed themselves to an agonizing death.', '', 102769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
