('Big bosses king of mountains. We bring you to big boss!', '', 102742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me kill you! Make big bosses proud!', '', 102741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ayiyiyi!', '', 102740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rehgar and I are ready!', 'Rehgar and I are ready!', 102739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true hero never fights alone. This challenge will demonstrate your cunning and prowess as part of a team. Work with your partner to overcome this test.$b$bIs your team ready?', '', 102738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crok it all!', '', 102737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could... something so small...', '', 102736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot destroy mountains.', '', 102735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Deep... calls...', '', 102734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not stop us! This land is ours!', '', 102733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be fun to crush.', '', 102732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perish under the weight of the mountain!', '', 102731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll crush your skull like a ripe fruit.', '', 102730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re far from home, little $r.', '', 102729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is gonna be GREAT.', 102728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Avenge me, sisters!', 102727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grawk... the Mother will get you...', 102726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aieee!', 102725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shall drop you off the cliffs and feast on your flesh.', 102724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take warglaive!', '', 102723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Screeekk!', 102722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will drape my nest in your bones!', 102721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to recall your champion? They will no longer aid you in combat.', 'Are you sure you want to recall your champion? They will no longer aid you in combat.', 102720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is our land now, $r!', 102719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to station one of my champions in an area.', 'I would like to station one of my champions in an area.', 102718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where would you like to station a champion?', 'Where would you like to station a champion?', 102717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing beat Rok!', '', 102716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny piddle, big puddle.', '', 102715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rok SMASH!', '', 102714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rok... no... break', '', 102713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rok stronger!', '', 102712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve come seeking a master of the darkness, then you have found him.', '', 102711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rok shatter!', '', 102710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold Moorgoth, master of the dark abyss!', '', 102709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware the shadows, for that is where I hunt!', '', 102708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to station a different champion.', 'I would like to station a different champion.', 102707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help you manage your valarjar from up here and let you know of any opportunities or emergencies that crop up.', '', 102706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure? Your champion will be unable to embark on missions while stationed. (NYI)', 'Are you sure? Your champion will be unable to embark on missions while stationed. (NYI)', 102705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would you like to station in Val\'Sharah?', 'Who would you like to station in Val\'Sharah?', 102704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'Sharah', 'Val\'Sharah', 102703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fireball is your fundamental damage dealing ability.  It does a large amount of damage up front and then continues to burn your opponent over time.  Use Fireball to destroy this target dummy.', '', 102702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m pleased to be out of the garrison and serving somewhere more suited to our line of work, $ct.', 102701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome.  As a fire mage you specialize in igniting your opponents with impressive bursts of flame, leaving them to burn to cinders. We will begin with your most basic ability - Fireball.', '', 102700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Based on our success on Draenor, I\'d say we make a good team, $n.', 102699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was an honor working with you at your garrison, $ct.', 102698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skylord, your friend has finished recovering. It is different to raise a living being to the Halls, but I have done just that!', 102697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First, select and equip a weapon from the rack over there. As a caster, you do not attack with your weapon, but it is a source of great power, empowering your innate arcane abilities.', 102696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to reclaim the hammer. Not go for a walk.', 102694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are High Chieftain. You must show your people that no artifact - no weapon - can stand before the might of a united Highmountain.', '', 102693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You merely... prolong...', '', 102692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything you know will burn in fel flame.', '', 102691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nowhere is safe.', '', 102690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all serve the Legion.', '', 102689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must assist at Whitewater Wash before it is too late.', 102688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, release me from this webbing and I will aid you!', '', 102683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_volatileearth.blp:20|t %s has no one to melee and begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:196534|h[Slam]|h|r!', 102682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me?!', '', 102681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Insects! Vermin! You are nothing to me. I will consume you all!', '', 102680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all burn!', '', 102679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are no spirits. These are echoes from the past. Something bad happened here.', '', 102678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s mine! I saw it fall from sky!', '', 102677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My jewel? I suppose so. It\'s over there on the side table.', 102676, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure thing. They\'re right over there on that table. They\'ve been working out great!', 102675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yes, they\'re right there on the table. There isn\'t anything wrong with them, is there?', 102674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I interest you in a new trinket?', 102673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to inspect the jewels Tiffany Cartier gave you.', 'I\'m here to inspect the jewels Tiffany Cartier gave you.', 102672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to inspect the gem chips Tiffany Cartier gave you.', 'I\'m here to inspect the gem chips Tiffany Cartier gave you.', 102671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you got some springs loose, I can probably show you how to fix \'em up!', 102670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power levels low. Shutting down to preserve system memory.', '', 102669, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Current status: corrupted. High levels of fel energy tripped failsafe mechanisms. Initial analysis suggests purification necessary to restore function.', '', 102668, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to inspect the jewel Tiffany Cartier crafted for you.', 'I\'m here to inspect the jewel Tiffany Cartier crafted for you.', 102667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('History Module. Watchers tasked with guarding portions of Pantheon\'s power on Azeroth in case of catastrophic loss. Initial results deemed successful.', '', 102666, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband is always running off without cleaning up after himself, leaving me to clean up after him.$b$bIf you see him around Dalaran, could you let him know that I love him more than he loves me?', 102665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing shrine module XK-47-09. Processing.', '', 102664, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d recommend talking to Catriona Macrae first. She was my most recent customer.', 102663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn values these creatures?', 102662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think you have won? You have merely survived the storm... The seas are unstoppable.', 102661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life... death... I am but one ripple in the eternal ebb and flow...', '', 102660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one rides for free!', '', 102659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to review weapons we might pursue.', 'I would like to review weapons we might pursue.', 102658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course. I will convene the Council of Six at once.', 102657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Jaina.', '', 102656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only hope so.', '', 102655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then I will take my leave. The Council of Six must be convened.', 102654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s my mistake to make, Jaina. This is my decision now.', '', 102653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With respect, you are making a huge mistake. Our chances fade the longer we wait to strike back at the Horde.', 102652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father dead... disaster on the Broken Shore... Jaina fixed on revenge... Everything is falling apart.', '', 102651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must not falter, Your Highness. Even now, the Legion is upon you!', '', 102650, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not splinter like this... not now. Please, Jaina!', '', 102649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dalaran will help protect the Eastern Kingdoms, but I will NOT allow the Horde to set foot within my city!', 102648, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome mage it\'s time to begin your training. As a Mage, you are a master of magic, able to conjure and control arcane energy to do your bidding. We will begin with the fundamentals.', 102647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You are my greatest weapon now, $n.', '', 102646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware... the hound mistress...', '', 102645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you expect each jewel in the bag, your eyes grow wider and wider with surprise.$b$bALL of these gems are fake! You must take this bag back to Tiffany as quickly as possible.', 'As you expect each jewel in the bag, your eyes grow wider and wider with surprise.$b$bALL of these gems are fake! You must take this bag back to Tiffany as quickly as possible.', 102644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gem chips lying on the table are definitely real. They bear the same imperfections you\'ve seen before.$b$bThe last person on the list is Debbi Moore at Curiosities and Moore.', 'The gem chips lying on the table are definitely real. They bare the same imperfections you\'ve seen before.$b$bThe last  person on the list is Debbi Moore.', 102643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upon close inspection, the jewel appears to be real. This must not be the commission in question.$b$bThe next person on the list is Didi the Wrench at the engineering shop.', 'Upon close inspection, the jewel appears to be real. This must not be the commission in question.$b$bThe next person on the list is Didi the Wrench at the engineering shop.', 102642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t none of us be standin\' here without her actions at da Shore.', '', 102641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave \'em. Dem guards be remindin\' us of those we lost. They be remindin\' us we be one Horde. And dey be remindin\' us - ain\'t nobody be sittin\' down when war be upon us.', '', 102640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what of my guards, Warchief? We cannot afford to leave the city in its state. The Legion is threat enough, and the Alliance - the Alliance will surely strike when our guard is down.', 102639, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem serious times. Tell your people it\'s time to be gettin\' ready. Everybody gettin\' ready.', '', 102638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... and we ain\'t gone be fightin\' de Legion alone. It be time we be reachin\' out. I be goin\' to visit an old friend.', '', 102637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warchief, even with the might of the Horde behind us, the Legion\'s power continues to grow. We know neither their numbers nor their true power, but as you said, we know their intentions.', 102636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Now we all be seein\'... united as one, but we also be need\'n an old knowledge. Someone who understand dem fel magics from long ago. Someone ta help understand de fight dey be bringin. Helpin\' us prepare... for war.', '', 102635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat willingness to sacrifice - to make dem decisions when da time comes - dat be the sign of a true Warchief.', '', 102634, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is unfortunate... for all of us, but the time has come to defend our people - all of our people.', 102633, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief, I understand, but we cannot afford to send everything we have at the Legion. Some of our people are not ready for a war. It is -', '', 102632, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All your instinct be true. Innocent lives be valued, indeed, but dem magics... Demons we ain\'t been seein\' before. I be fearin\' dis only be de beginnin\'.', '', 102631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin...', '', 102630, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If dis only de beginning, ain\'t gonna be easy. If we fight, everyone gonna be makin\' sacrifices.', '', 102629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When de time comes, you be ready to fight?', '', 102628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can sense a demon presence... Above us, $n, on the ledge!', 102623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria! Can you hear me? Alleria!', 102622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61831, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Odyn.', 'Take me to Odyn.', 102620, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you ready to meet Odyn?', 102619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem powers we seen - dat be more dan any us be dealin wit on our own.', '', 102617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken Shore be our lesson. And now... now knowledge be our weapon.', '', 102616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No man... She...', '', 102615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And when the time comes, let us hope these words bear a heavier weight than the air in which they\'re spoken.', 102614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions at the Shore have shown what it takes to be a leader. When lives are at stake... lives of loved ones, of warriors, of the Horde...', '', 102613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By coming here, you have sealed your doom!', '', 102612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your reluctance to defend the Horde is choice enough, I\'m afraid.', 102611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No single army is large enough to defeat the Legion. Our blood on the battlefield will attest to that. I will not put the lives of innocent people in harm\'s way.', '', 102610, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And who would you have lead, Warchief? No man can command an army that suffered such losses as we...', '', 102609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earth Mother watch over us. What will become of the Horde?', '', 102608, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warchief...', 102607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, you\'ll be hearing about $Ghim:her; soon enough.', '', 102606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, who\'s this then?', '', 102605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is something troubling you?', 'Is something troubling you?', 102604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, I\'d like a rematch!', '', 102603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thinking of lost friends... and a promise I need to keep.', '', 102602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n.', '', 102601, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
