('I heard the drogbar have already begun attacking Whitewater Wash and even Thunder Totem.$b$bThese are dark days.', 'So, you are the one Ebonhorn has been talking about?$b$bIt was a strange prophecy from a strange spiritwalker.$b$bToo strange, if you ask me.', 102517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
