('I believe I am next.', '', 102477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be the second for my champion! Who will we fight?', '', 102476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true hero never fights alone. The next trial is a test of teamwork. You must choose a partner.', '', 102475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to negotiate.', 'Ready to negotiate.', 102474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you must be the one I am hearing whispers about. Tales of your great deeds and powerful artifact precede you.$b$bI am Spiritwalker Ebonhorn. I have heard much about you and your journeys beyond these isles.$b$bLet us see if the stories of your heroism are true, shall we?', '', 102473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shaman has triumphed! The first trial is complete.', '', 102472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, champion. This isn\'t over yet.', '', 102471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve almost got this, champion!', '', 102470, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 60617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible form! A fighter in perfect harmony with the elements!', '', 102469, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 60616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3... 2... 1... Fight!', '', 102468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will grant you a lightning shield, but don\'t let him get too close!', '', 102467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This vrykul is all talk. Use his strength against him.', '', 102466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first trial is a test of strength. Only one of you may pass. Speak with me to begin.', '', 102465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who challenges me!? The weapons of the storm belong to my clan by rights!', '', 102464, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in good hands, friend. Did I mention I trained King Wrynn for the arena?', '', 102463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many seek the artifacts of the Keeper of Storms. None have passed the trials. Come, and be judged!', '', 102462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. \'Storm, Earth, Fire...\' that\'s kind of my thing.', '', 102461, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormstout! You seek the weapons of the storm as well?', '', 102460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste to Krasus\' Landing. I will try to gather support from the mages.', '', 102459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you seek the weapons of the storm god? Step forward, shaman.', '', 102458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, friend. I will coach you through the trials as best I can.', '', 102457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this the best your pathetic Earthen Ring can muster!?', '', 102456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand and fight!', '', 102455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The north winds obey my command...', '', 102454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory will be mine in the Halls of Valor!', '', 102453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I alone deserve the favor of the storm god!', '', 102452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('- YOU HAVE COMPLETED THE NIGHTMARE PORTION OF THE PLAYTEST -', '', 102451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we\'ve requisitioned this hippogryph to take you to the Broken Isles!', '', 102450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urrlllllm.', '', 102449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyumnyum.', '', 102448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rulllmm!', '', 102447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... mrrmmmm...', '', 102446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you up, $n. I would ask a favor before my army leaves for war.', '', 102445, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve taken certain... precautionary measures. My guards will remain present throughout the city until the Alliance threat stands down.', 102444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar will contact you before long. I must ready Undercity for war. Are you with us, $n? Or with the humans?', 102443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As for the Warchief, he assumes the required knowledge lies with the Kirin Tor. I\'m sure Khadgar will be most pleased by his visit.', 102442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And the Alliance? They have no honor. Given the opportunity, they will strike when we are weak.', 102441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Broken Shore was just the beginning. The Legion\'s forces grow stronger as we speak. Soon we will not be able to match their power.', 102440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The innocent will not die in vain. They will die for the Horde.', 102439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT LOCALIZE', 'DO NOT LOCALIZE', 102436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back here once you have freed those soliders, $n. Elune be with you.', 102435, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune... guide me...', 102433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t over, shaman. Someday we will meet on a true field of battle.', '', 102432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... yield...', '', 102431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have bested the kraken. I have slain giants. You are nothing!', '', 102430, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60662, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two Kings Defeated', 'Two Kings Defeated', 102429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The vrykul warrior scoffs at you.>$b$bYou are to be my first test? Bah! I have scars more intimidating than you.', '', 102428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always good to have you around camp, commander.', '', 102427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All quiet around the lodge, commander.', '', 102426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, commander.', '', 102425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fight!', 'I am ready to fight!', 102424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed. I\'m sorry, Jaina, but vengeance must wait. I trust you\'re mobilizing the Kirin Tor as we discussed?', '', 102423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your first trial is a test of strength. This vrykul champion also seeks the weapons of storm on behalf of his clan. Only one of you may pass.', '', 102422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people know the price of facing the demons as a world divided. It is time to unite our forces and defend our lands.', '', 102421, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And with the return of the Illidari, we have a valuable weapon on our side. You were wise to accept them into Stormwind, King Anduin.', 102420, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowards, both of you. King Anduin, you know what we must do. We must strike quickly, to scatter the Horde to the winds and let them fend for themselves against the Legion.', '', 102419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde betrayed your father and left us to die! To fight alongside those cowards would dishonor everything he stood for.', 102418, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen is right. We must stand beside the demon hunters and focus on the Legion. Now is not the time to--', '', 102417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To fight two wars at once would be folly. For all our sakes, we need the Horde\'s strength added to our own.', '', 102416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you forgotten the Horde\'s treachery? It\'s time to bring them to heel like the dogs they are!', 102415, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not alone in this, My King. We stand behind you.', '', 102414, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was a seasoned strategist, yet his army was shattered on the Broken Shore. How can I hope to succeed where he failed?', '', 102413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arille, get me a drink!', '', 102412, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... and what will you have us do, Warchief?', '', 102411, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saved us... I worry the Alliance will think we left them for dead.', '', 102410, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin...', 102409, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Feltotem will own this mountain!', '', 102408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torok will be pleased with your death!', '', 102407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our allies give us power!', '', 102406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will know my strength!', '', 102405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came to the wrong place.', '', 102404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tear your arms off!', '', 102403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell blood in the forest.', '', 102402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off our mountain!', '', 102401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace...', '', 102397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, we rest.', '', 102396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, White Tiger.', 'I am ready, White Tiger.', 102395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has become of us?', '', 102394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people... shu dalees-na.', '', 102393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your reputation precedes you, $c. I am told you were at the front lines on the Broken Shore. You, more than any other, know what our world is up against.$b$bIf you seek the weapons once possessed by Ra-den, the Keeper of Storms, know that many have tried to wield their power and none have succeeded. You will face a series of challenges, but make no mistake... the weapons themselves will be the most dangerous test of all.$b$bDo you wish to continue?', '', 102392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rest now.', '', 102391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elisande... stop her...', '', 102390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the chill of the grave!', '', 102389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be cold... like us.', '', 102388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Desecrator...', '', 102387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trespasser...', '', 102386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thandae-alah...', '', 102385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 66044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What HE said!', 102384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was like success... but the opposite.', 102383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well I don\'t know WHAT that was all about...', 102382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You were NOT INVITED! But I just love surprises!', 102381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t know we had a play date!', 102380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'BACK OFF, NUADA! I saw them first!', 102379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to go sleepy-bye!', 102378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it painful? No, really I want to know!', 102377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come bearing a letter from your father.', 'I come bearing a letter from your father.', 102376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope your muscles don\'t get tired from pushing up all those daisies!', 102375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so I fall! Like a leaf... in fall!', 102374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooohh where am I off to now? I hope there\'s trees...', 102373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait a minute it\'s all clear to me now... the Nightmare had me insane, I-agh, ack! Aaaghhh...', 102372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not fair, NOT FAIR!', 102371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to Stormwind, $n. I\'m relieved you survived the Broken Shore.$b$bWe could not afford to lose you!', '', 102370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like you, I really do! That\'s why I\'m going to make your death slow and excruciating.', 102369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death should be savored, like a fine wine. Enjoy!', 102368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not mad at you... I just want you to SUFFER AND DIE!', 102367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You might feel a liiiittle prick. Followed by a slow and painful death.', 102366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t get under your skin... I BURN right through it.', 102365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'ll stop the world and I\'ll MELT YOU!', 102364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This might burn a little... or a LOT.', 102363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just relax. Let your cares melt away.', 102362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I insist you stay right here. You don\'t want to miss any of the FUN!', 102361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'STAY! If you don\'t want to stay, I\'ll MAKE you stay!', 102360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You all... need to... WAIT YOUR TURN!', 102359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DON\'T RUN!  They don\'t like it when you run, see?', 102358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this serve as a lesson to all who would threaten nature\'s tranquility!', '', 102357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody has successfully wielded the weapons of the Keeper of Storms. Will you be the first?', '', 102356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here in defeat, bold intruders fell. What inspired such overconfidence? No one may tell.', '', 102355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pests exterminated.', '', 102354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have guests! Or, perhaps I should say, pests!', '', 102353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature welcomes you!', '', 102352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve opened a minor portal to help the wounded get to the ship more quickly.', 'I\'ve opened a minor portal to help the wounded get to the ship more quickly.', 102351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be more than enough to go around!', '', 102350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, to you, I say! Tomorrow might have been a brighter day.', '', 102349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make great compost...', '', 102348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life, death... all the same, really.', '', 102347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much was given for me to know... yet into the unknown now must I go.', '', 102346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell sister! I would say it has been a pleasure, but I do not wish my final words to be a lie.', '', 102345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! I am ready... to embark on my... new adventure...', '', 102344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is the... cycle of nature.', '', 102343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... there is a fungus among us!', '', 102342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead, get close... take a big sniff.', '', 102341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have cultivated a gift for you!', '', 102340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many wonderful things to see... take care though, to know where danger be.', '', 102339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature, you see, is a paradox... infinite beauty coupled with merciless lethality.', '', 102338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, slow down! Where\'s the fire?', '', 102337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why all the haste to depart? Vardalla has a message for you... straight to the heart!', '', 102336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still and listen when my sister is talking to you!', '', 102335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is everyone always in such a hurry?', '', 102334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must appreciate nature in all its many forms.', '', 102333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nature\'s darker minions... creeping, crawling, scattering from the light. Looking to have just one bite.', '', 102332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creeping horrors... they\'ll tickle your skin... looking for a way IN.', '', 102331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the skittering denizens of the dark!', '', 102330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light will cleanse us all, soldier.', 'The light will cleanse us all, soldier.', 102329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back in the fray!', 'Get back in the fray!', 102328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let you fall!', 'I won\'t let you fall!', 102327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will heal you, $n.', 'I will heal you, $n.', 102326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am yours to command.', 'I am yours to command.', 102325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the ashes!', 102324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn in the flames!', 102323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of these games. This ends here!', 102322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
