('', 'I\'ll deliver you to Tyranna myself.', 102150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion\'s victory is inevitable, child.', 102149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to play with my little imps?', 102148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll die for this!', 102147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My children will cook you up nicely.', 102146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, my little imps, dance for mother.', 102145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Climb inside my mouth, tiny thing.', 102144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My meal comes to me.', 102143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so hungry.', 102142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what you\'re made of, tiny thing.', '', 102141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterspidercarapace_01:20|t%s disappears |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197414|h[Into the Shadows]|h|r!', 102140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are Legion.', '', 102139, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 55369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel my wrath!', '', 102138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... medium or well-done?', '', 102137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy!', '', 102136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re no match for me.', '', 102135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you.', '', 102134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion conquers all.', '', 102133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal flesh parts so easily.', '', 102132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are easily dealt with.', '', 102131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die by my blade.', '', 102130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve.', '', 102129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could do this with my eyes closed! But don\'t worry, I won\'t.', 102128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think we make a pretty good team.', 102127, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learning to hunt is a dream come true.', 102126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a small taste of my fel magic.', '', 102125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am of Argus, the mightiest world in all of the Great Dark.', '', 102124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare?!', '', 102123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither before my might!', '', 102122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Your death will be swift and unmerciful.', '', 102121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a wild shot! You\'re okay, right?', 102119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grand Magistrix exiled many Nightborne from Suramar. Those who did not agree with the bargain with the Legion, political enemies, and people she simply did not trust were all banished from the city.$b$bWe need to be united now more than ever. I bring them back into the city and they can access the Nightwell\'s energies again. The people I rescue are able to retain their magical abilities. I give them another chance at something greater.', '', 102118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... what was that?', '', 102117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is... over for me... you must... finish this.', 102116, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 62700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not again, beast! I will-- AAARGHH!!', 102115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beloved brother... I should never have brought you!', 102114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wuho! No!', 102113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siege Worms! Fire on my mark!', '', 102112, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Highmountain, we are one!', '', 102111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As Highmountain, we are one!', 102110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Highmountain, we are one!', '', 102109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together, we are Highmountain!', 102108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We entered this place as three tribes. Now, we are one.', 102107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A glorious day is upon us!', 102106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much power! I cannot be stopped!', '', 102105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be proud, weakling. You are special to me, for you will be the instrument of my ascension.', '', 102104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FEL MASTERS, I BRING YOU YOUR FINAL SACRIFICE! Nine times nine souls I have brought you, my own kith and kin!', '', 102103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence. I tire of your prattling. Do not worry, it will all be over soon.', '', 102102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t understand. This isn\'t the city. Wher-', 102101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here.', '', 102100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve already directed a portrait to Stormwind for you, $n. Follow me, please.', '', 102099, 0, 26703, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, step through the portrait to teleport to Stormwind.', '', 102098, 0, 26703, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n. Now, make haste! We need your help to the west.', 102097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please fire the event to start the \"Quality of Life\" event.', 'Please fire the event to start the \"Quality of Life\" event.', 102096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] This is a test gossip because I haven\'t hooked things up for reals yet!', '[PH] This is a test gossip because I haven\'t hooked things up for reals yet!', 102095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to be a Warbrave just like my dad when I grow up!', '', 102094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fish only bite when my little brother\'s asleep. He\'s a lot for my mom to handle on her own.', '', 102093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such ferocity would better serve as an ally against the Legion than an enemy. I will aid you.', '', 102092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! You have proven your power, warlock.', '', 102091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it! By the Light be purged!', '', 102090, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 61901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems fitting that the hero who fought at his side, who displayed courage and valor immeasurable, should succeed him.', '', 102089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oro would not want me to lose myself in grief. I will be strong for him, and for our boys.', 102088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! I have everything prepared inside. Follow me.', 102087, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 62005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I will tell you what I know.', '', 102086, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61905, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your words are acid, but there is truth in them. Though I detest the methods you employ, it seems we may have no choice.', '', 102085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61904, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell you what I know.', '', 102084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61903, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, I am ready. Let us make haste. I worry that we will be found by our enemies.', 102083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 65932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be afraid. Soon all will be set right.', '', 102082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must leave now. Soon we will be home.', '', 102081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us all give honor to Master $n! May she lead us with strength and wisdom.', 102080, 0, 34244, 603, 64, 0, 0, 62009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us all give honor to Master $n! May he lead us with strength and wisdom.', 102079, 0, 34243, 603, 64, 0, 0, 62008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Master Hight has passed on to join the ancestors, and we are left with a void in our ranks.', '', 102078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Monks, our greatest challenge still lies ahead. Under our new master, we will send a message of defiance to our enemies. They will not take our home without a fight!', 102077, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But as we teetered upon the brink of annihilation, $n stayed with Grand Master Hight and fought the demons to ensure our survival.', '', 102076, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 62004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The attack at the Peak of Serenity shows that the Burning Legion wishes to shatter our order. They will destroy our homes, defile our sacred temples, and strive to break our spirit.', 102073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To all members and students of our combined schools, I offer you my thanks for joining us.', 102070, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nowhere to hide now, precious.', 102068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world will burn.', 102067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, little fly.', 102066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve caught you in my web.', 102065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! By the Light...', '', 102064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab the keystone! Let\'s get to the portal down below and back to the Black Temple!', '', 102063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked! Slay the monster!', 102062, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 62693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It claws at us from the mist! Hurry!', 102061, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 62691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Crossroads!', 'Take me to Crossroads!', 102060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand with Highmountain.', '', 102059, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand in my way.', '', 102058, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods approvingly.', '', 102056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a hard day ahead of us.', 102055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Dreadmist Camp!', 'Take me to Dreadmist Camp!', 102054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am not!', '', 102053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s motions for you to follow.', '', 102052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear the truth in your words, $c. We may walk very different paths, but I see you fight for a noble cause.', '', 102051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61902, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we wish to complete our goals, it is clear we must work together, $c. \n\nLet us not waste any more time.', '', 102050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this! You will answer me or die, priest! <Attack>', 'Enough of this! You will answer me or die, priest! <Attack>', 102049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw your holy warriors broken on the rocks outside the Tomb of Sargeras! This is unlike any Legion force we\'ve seen, and we\'ll need more than your Holy Light to drive it back this time!', 'I saw your holy warriors broken on the rocks outside the Tomb of Sargeras! This is unlike any Legion force we\'ve seen, and we\'ll need more than your Holy Light to drive it back this time!', 102048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are wrong. I was at the Broken Shore. I saw the demons cut through our men, holy and unholy alike. If we cannot turn the tide now, we are all lost.', 'You are wrong. I was at the Broken Shore. I saw the demons cut through our men, holy and unholy alike. If we cannot turn the tide now, we are all lost.', 102047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is you who are foolish, $c! \n\nThe Light is a bulwark for the faithful! It has aided us in holding back the Legion before, and it will do so again!', '', 102046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will not falter so long as the brave hold it in their hearts. \n\nWe have seen it bring about the Legion\'s defeat before, and it will do so again.', '', 102045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forget this. I will take the answers I need! <Attack>', 'Forget this. I will take the answers I need! <Attack>', 102044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a fool! You\'ll cling to your Holy Light, even as the Legion purges this world. How will your Light serve you when you\'re left a slave?', 'You are a fool! You\'ll cling to your Holy Light, even as the Legion purges this world. How will your Light serve you when you\'re left a slave?', 102043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do not act, Sargeras will take this world. There will be no remnant of your Holy Light to follow. Where will your duty be then?', 'If we do not act, Sargeras will take this world. There will be no remnant of your Holy Light to follow. Where will your duty be then?', 102042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To me, there is no greater threat than those who despoil the Light! \n\nI will not guide the hand of a sinner to power, no matter the ultimate cost!', '', 102041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admit that the Legion is a great threat, but my duty is to the Light. \n\nI must stand vigilant against its enemies at all times, no matter how dire the situation appears.', '', 102040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you will not tell me, I will strip the answers from your soul! <Attack>', 'If you will not tell me, I will strip the answers from your soul! <Attack>', 102039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time for your nonsense, priest! The Burning Legion is the greater threat!', 'I don\'t have time for your nonsense, priest! The Burning Legion is the greater threat!', 102038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power would serve to defeat the Legion. You consider that an evil goal?', 'The power would serve to defeat the Legion. You consider that an evil goal?', 102037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you hunt the Dark Riders as well? Long have I searched for a way to rid Duskwood of their curse, but now it seems I have become the hunted. \n\nThough we share a common enemy, the sins you bear prevent me from aiding your cause. The Light is not well served by taking power from one evil only to bestow it upon another.', '', 102036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your selection is not yet ready for testing. Please choose another.', 'Your selection is not yet ready for testing. Please choose another.', 102035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few, but I think Oro\'s scaring away all the fish.', '', 102034, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you had any bites Mycah?', 102033, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you fall into the water, your brother\'s not fishing you out!', 102032, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oro, stay where I can see you!', 102031, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oro, how many times do I have to tell you not to run around with that stick in your hand?', 102030, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaardoun?', '', 102029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps something explosive to disperse the mist? We are right behind you, master trapper. We will stand guard as you set it.', '', 102028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It went into that deep patch of mist. It could be hiding anywhere! Hero, do you have a trap strong enough to hold the beast?', 102027, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 62689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CUT SCENE PLACEHOLDER - Elune weeps over the death of Ysera and you get the tear of Elune.', 'CUT SCENE PLACEHOLDER - Elune weeps over the death of Elune and you get the tear of Elune.', 102026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lowborn dirt. You don\'t know who you\'re dealing with. Hah... hah... haaaa ha ha ha haaaa!', '', 102025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, what are you doing? My siphons!', '', 102024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. Soon you will all kneel before Azsuna\'s new prince!', '', 102023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought as hard as the rest of you! But I did not murder thousands of innocents.', '', 102022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did that dragon send you, interloper? Or was it that beggar, Runas?', '', 102021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go.', 102020, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Protect me!', '', 102019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how you deal with this!', '', 102018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I worry for Oro\'s safety, but he has a duty to protect our tribe.', 102017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All mortals will fuel the Soul Engines.', '', 102016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another soul for the Legion.', '', 102015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishkaneth, you fool. You\'ve spilled your blood and you\'ve spilled my mana.', '', 102014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Picking off my lieutenants? I suppose you think you\'re clever.', '', 102013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, then. Have a taste!', '', 102012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interloper... you\'re here to steal my mana, aren\'t you!?', '', 102011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inhabitants of The Crossroads have been inspired to join the fight against the Legion!', '', 102010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More... I need more!', 102009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power to destroy you!', 102008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s Maxon? He should probably take a look at you before you head back out.', '', 102007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just hang tight. I\'m used to fixing mechanical things, not dwarves.', '', 102006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know why you thought you had something to prove. You coulda been back out there in your tanks by now.', '', 102005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can you defeat me while I control the wilds!?', 102004, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend yourselves!', 102002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No talk! Must dig!', '', 102001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why no have candle? Darkness eat you if no have candle!', '', 102000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trust no one and believe in nothing, Altruis. You are a leader with no followers.', '', 101999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More wax, bigger candle. More candle, less dark.', '', 101998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dig. I find. I keep!', '', 101997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say only the pure can wield the highblade. Come, champion. Claim your destiny!', '', 101996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You would trust the Warden? She hates us almost as much as the Legion.', '', 101995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sit in chair one day.', '', 101994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enter the portal and fight your way to Azoran.', 101993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Intruders. They will not get far.', '', 101992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardians of the ritual, prepare yourselves! She will not be disappointed!', '', 101991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_frozenorb:20|t|cFFFF0000$n|r is the target of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:197365|h[Crushing Depths]|h|r!', 101989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is here.', '', 101988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would Maiev free us? There could only be one reason...', '', 101987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The beast is there! An\'she protect us!', 101986, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 62687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And yet, I am certain we are being watched...', 101985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 62686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot sense any beasts at all!', '', 101984, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 62685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is... eerily quiet.', 101983, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 62684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good as new. This engine packs quite a punch! Try it out on some of those big ones up near the airfield!', 'Good as new. This engine packs quite a punch! Try it out on some of those big ones up near the airfield!', 101979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combat engineers here! Look out below!', 'Combat engineers here! Look out below!', 101978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall fall, like the Wardens before you!', '', 101977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the defenders of this world? Pitiful!', '', 101976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cleave you in two!', '', 101975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stem the Legion\'s tide!', '', 101974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will be swift and brutal.', '', 101972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never see the light of day!', '', 101969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hope is lost.', '', 101968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are fragile times.', '', 101967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we know you\'re one we can trust? I\'ve heard whispers of dreadlords roaming about.', '', 101966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Escape is but a dream.', '', 101965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will pry the answers from your corpse.', '', 101964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not right now, $n. There are more pressing matters to attend to.', '', 101963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve seen better days, friend.', 'You\'ve seen better days, friend.', 101962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shake them, I bash them!', '', 101960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them, brother!', '', 101959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... hammered...', '', 101958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... noooo! You shall never be free...', '', 101957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my thanks. Those hunters wouldn\'t have stopped until they had my head. Whatever they had is yours.', 101956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the Story of Huln.', 'Tell me the Story of Huln.', 101955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I \'ppreciate it, $n. Now ye best get goin\' \'fore they come back.', '', 101954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me beard... it\'s... it\'s - they\'re gonna pay fer this!', '', 101953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 101952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t let them reach the Gates!', '', 101951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself $Glad:lass;. Fight\'s only beginnin\'.', '', 101950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord, I have found paladins worthy to stand by your side. I will meet you at Light\'s Hope Sanctum at once.', '', 101948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Frostmane Front!', 'Take me to Frostmane Front!', 101947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Gates of Ironforge!', 'Take me to the Gates of Ironforge!', 101946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now you will bear witness to Huln\'s trials...', '', 101945, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 54802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell you the story of Huln Highmountain.', '', 101944, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 54801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battling his grief, Huln spoke with the leaders of the remaining tribes. He convinced them to unite under one banner to oppose this new threat.', '', 101943, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 54800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once, upon returning from such a battle, Huln Highmountain found his people slaughtered by a previously unknown foe.', '', 101942, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 54799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For generations, the tauren of this mountain fought. Countless lives--even entire tribes--were lost.', '', 101941, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 54798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t lost a battle yet and I don\'t plan on losin\' one today!', '', 101940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got the higher ground. Use it against \'em!', '', 101939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve ne\'er seen anythin\' like this before. They jus\' don\'t stop comin\'!', '', 101938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! If they break us again we\'ll be pullin\' the troops back!', '', 101937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to hold \'em back! Our boys are strugglin\' ta keep \'em outta the Gates!', '', 101936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is my fate as well... unless...', 101935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do your glasses get fogged? I don\'t know how to stop it. I only have about half my normal visibility.', '', 101933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This bucket is kinda heavy. If I hold it in this arm too long it falls asleep. My arm, I mean. Not the bucket.', '', 101932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you get all the grime out from under your nails? Mine doesn\'t go away... and it smells funny.', '', 101931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much longer you think \'til I\'m ready? I mean, it\'s been almost 3 weeks so far. Starting to consider myself to be quite the apprentice.', '', 101930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does your shirt itch? Mine itches... I\'m not sweating either.', '', 101929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! This ain\'t the time for sightseeing, kiddo!', 101928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arnie! Quit diddling around!', 101927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arnie! Wrench!', 101926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wrench!', 101925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One wrench, coming up!', '', 101924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here it comes!', '', 101923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
