('No! I need more...', '', 101915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... more...', '', 101914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thieving wretch!', '', 101913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I warned you!', '', 101912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be consumed!', '', 101911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away!', '', 101910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from my mana!', '', 101909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I will not succumb!', '', 101908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thieves! The mana is MINE!', '', 101907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! It\'s mine!', '', 101906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve finally found you, little elf. You are not worthy of being our equal!', '', 101905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ambush! You were followed!', '', 101904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is as far as we go. Thanks for helpin\'. This hunter never forgets a friend.', '', 101903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... you cannot have the power.', '', 101902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow us and we can work together to retake the airfield! Scrapper, let\'s go!', '', 101901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy... these demons are ruinin\' mah huntin\' getaway. May as well start huntin\' them for the trouble they\'re causin\'.', '', 101900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yep. This part\'s busted too. This could be a while, gents.', '', 101899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well this coil does nothing. Hope you don\'t mind if I just throw it on the floor here.', '', 101898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surprised I got one working already. These things aren\'t built like anything I\'ve worked on before.', '', 101897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surprised I got one working already. These things aren\'t built like anything I\'ve worked on before.', '', 101896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda negotiated a higher rate. This thing is ginormous!', '', 101895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure is a lot bigger than the machines I\'m used to workin\' with.', '', 101894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Alleria is here, she must be close!', 101892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The inquisitor must be coming to interrogate Alleria! We have to save her!', 101891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost there! Keep fighting!', 101890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Gol\'Bolar Quarry!', 'Take me to Gol\'Bolar Quarry!', 101889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Gates of Ironforge!', 'Take me to the Gates of Ironforge!', 101888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Frostmane Front!', 'Take me to Frostmane Front!', 101887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Gol\'Bolar Quarry!', 'Take me to Gol\'Bolar Quarry!', 101885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them before they take me back!', '', 101884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t hurt me!', '', 101883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, NO! I wasn\'t escaping! I was just going a different spot to dig!', '', 101882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there.', '', 101881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, you don\'t understand... I\'m not game to be hunted!', 101880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll let us into the lodge for sure if we bring \'em this lion\'s head as a trophy!', '', 101879, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got it cornered, boys!', '', 101878, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, Orestes. I won\'t risk anyone else until we\'re certain Alleria\'s there. I do not trust the demon\'s word. But this might be our only chance to save my... to retrieve a valuable ally.', 101877, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 61780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be going with you. If this is a trap, you need my bow covering your backs!', '', 101876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are discovered. Destroy $ghim:her;!', 101875, 0, 0, 463, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charge!', 'Charge!', 101874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you could join us, $p.', '', 101873, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 63765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done much for my people, $p. It is an honor to have you with us on this battlefront today.$b$bReady to face off against the Underking?', 101872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, up ahead! It\'s Orestes!', 101871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admit it, Vereesa! This mission is personal!', '', 101870, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 61782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alleria\'s knowledge about the Legion could help us defeat them once and for all. Our goal is to reacquire a strategic asset... nothing more!', 101869, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 61783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deprecated', 101868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My eldest sister, Alleria, has been missing for years. A demon we captured claims she is being held on a Legion world called Niskara by some sort of inquisition. Her return would be invaluable!', 101867, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 61781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They ARE desperate.', '', 101866, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 57328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, then. The Wardens are coming, with the Illidari in tow.', 101865, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 57327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana.blp:20|t%s begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:196392|h[Consume Mana]|h|r from a Mana Source!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana.blp:20|t%s begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:196392|h[Consume Mana]|h|r from a Mana Source!', 101864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ability_socererking_arcanereplication.blp:20|t $n is marked with |cFFF00000|Hspell:196562|h[Volatile Magic]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ability_socererking_arcanereplication.blp:20|t $n is marked with |cFFF00000|Hspell:196562|h[Volatile Magic]|h|r!', 101863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. Let us go across!', 101862, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan is still my charge!', 101861, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 57375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful! I can just attach them here and...', 101860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 62682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demon hunters, you have to survive. Find the one named Archmage Khadgar. You can trust him.', 101859, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 57374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, Warden. This vault will be your tomb.', '', 101857, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 57373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Judge me all you like, sister, but you cannot stop us.', 101856, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 57309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Show Apata the runes and explain how to cross the river.>', '<Show Apata the runes and explain how to cross the river.>', 101855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, you found something in that nightmarish village?', 101854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
