('<The ancient sea spirit speaks to you with warmth and respect.>$b$bShaman, turmoil in these seas has sapped me of my life essence and scattered it throughout the bay. It is driving these young sharks into a frenzy.$b$bWaterwalk across the waves and collect 10 globules of living water. Beware the sharks - if they drag you into the water you will lose what you have collected.', '', 101802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
