('<The elemental peers down at you treading water.>$b$bWhy, hello shaman! You are truly touched by the elements.$b$bCome, walk upon the water with me, so we may speak as equals. I need your help.$b$b<The elemental looks warily at the sharks encircling it.>', '', 101793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
