('', 'Hopefully this ends soon. I\'ve got some work cut out for me.', 101788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroyed my striders, singed my hair - if I see one more of those infernals I\'m gonna kick it in it\'s shins... if it has shins. If it doesn\'t I\'ll start throwin\' wrenches.', 101787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
