('How are we s\'pposed to stay calm? We\'re under attack!', '', 101700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did ya see those things? How are we gonna defend against that?', '', 101699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re down here underground while the whole world\'s bein\' torn apart!', '', 101698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting worked up won\'t help anyone. We have to try and stay calm.', 'Getting worked up won\'t help anyone. We have to try and stay calm.', 101697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 101696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just try and relax. We\'re all in this together.', 'Just try and relax. We\'re all in this together.', 101695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve got ta calm yerself. We\'ve got the best in the lands out fightin\' right now.', 'Ye\'ve got ta calm yerself. We\'ve got the best in the lands out fightin\' right now.', 101694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If those demons see you it\'s already too late.', '', 101693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just trying to keep everyone fed until it\'s all over.', '', 101692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep hunting!', 101691, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to the Ironforge Airfield.', 'Fly me to the Ironforge Airfield.', 101689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you a great debt, $n. Thank you once again.', '', 101688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not today, friend. Gotta finish helpin\' me lads reinforce our wares.', '', 101687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The airfield is under attack! Demons are everywhere. I\'ve sent the best of our fleet to hold \'em off.$B$BKeep at it down here! You\'re the best chance we\'ve got!', '', 101686, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cenarius, the Lord of the Forest.$b$bNever have I seen him in such a state. Stay vigilant, friend. Our fragile world has been plunged into deep peril.', '', 101685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The vrykul is bloody and is barely breathing.>', '', 101684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen them, $n? The demons... I just saw a shopkeep run by screaming! This is madness!', 'Have you seen them, $n? The demons... I just saw a shopkeep run by screaming! This is madness!', 101683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $n. I just saw an infernal fall from the skies!', 'Careful, $n. I just saw an infernal fall from the skies!', 101682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies... have you ever seen anything like it?', 'The skies... have you ever seen anything like it?', 101681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many injured already. Will you be the one who ends it, $n?', 'So many injured already. Will you be the one who ends it, $n?', 101680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen an attack quite like this!', 'I\'ve never seen an attack quite like this!', 101679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find shelter! The others have gone inside for safety!', 'Find shelter! The others have gone inside for safety!', 101678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, but now is not the time, $n.', 'My apologies, but now is not the time, $n.', 101677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Apologies, but now is not the time $c.', 101672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To arms, $n. This is not the time to be wandering about. Take shelter inside if you must.', 101671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When this is over, the boar ribs and malt are on me.', '', 101670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First troggs, now this? No matter. The mountaineers fight \'til the end!', '', 101669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again for sparing my life. I trust you know that I\'d willingly sacrifice everything to further Lord Illidan\'s plan. The Burning Legion must be destroyed at any cost.\n\nI owe you everything, $n.\n\nNow, you must tell me how you survived. I killed you! It would seem the rumors about you are true... you\'re nearly as powerful as Illidan.', '', 101668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and me to the very end, $n.', '', 101667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Lord Illidan! For the Illidari!', '', 101666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been looking forward to this for a long time.', '', 101665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be the one dying today, demon!', '', 101664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we have a huge problem here.', '', 101663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you at the final gateway.', '', 101662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was brave and proved himself worthy. We should all be so lucky to make the ultimate sacrifice in Lord Illidan\'s name.', '', 101661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Ashtongue mystic will willingly sacrifice his soul for the cause if you\'re the one to do it.', '', 101660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sevis looks down at the dying broken mystic.', '', 101659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, hurry! You don\'t have much time.', '', 101658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will move ahead and find Allari.', '', 101657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plenty of souls were sacrificed here. The activator is powered.', '', 101656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sacrifice will NOT be in vain!', '', 101655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sevis paid the ultimate price so that you could use the Legion Gateway and summon in your Shivarra forces.>\n\n<Don\'t allow his sacrifice to have been made in vain.>', '', 101654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been... an honor.', '', 101653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to sacrifice me in order to power the gateway.', 'I want you to sacrifice me in order to power the gateway.', 101652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sevis, I need to sacrifice you in order to power the final gateway.', 'Sevis, I need to sacrifice you in order to power the final gateway.', 101651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brood queen must have done something to this gateway. Not even the souls of several mo\'arg were enough to unlock it.\n\nThe soul of a demon hunter, however, would do the trick. You have a choice to make, $n...\n\n... One of us must die.', '', 101650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The corpse of the Ashtongue Mystic lies here bereft of its soul, which has powered the Legion Gateway.>', '', 101649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mystic, thank you for your sacrifice.', 'Mystic, thank you for your sacrifice.', 101648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The broken mystic barely clings to life.>\n\nI am as good as dead. Do... what must... be done.', '', 101647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, friend.', '', 101646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will bring your case before the others... but I cannot promise the outcome will be in your favor.', 101645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A swift death is more mercy than you deserve.', 101644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mercy? The legion burns worlds... and you beg mercy?', 101643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alar il raka Azoran il zennrakkan oth kamilgolad! Morgul... morgul!', '', 101642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will trust the traitor? I can do no more here.', '', 101641, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no convincing you, I see. Very well, I will take my leave. $n, beware that you do not share Illidan\'s fate.', '', 101640, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! Let us defeat this evil!', '', 101639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed I do. And nothing happens in that citadel unless its master wills it. I would not be surprised to learn he had a hand in this.', '', 101638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Icecrown. You believe you\'ll find her there?', 101637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But with the Legion\'s coming, I decided to begin my own search for the location of the blade. I saw a vision of Lyandra with the weapon in hand. Around her the land was covered in ice, and an all-too-familiar fortress loomed behind her.', '', 101636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your master, demon. Where does he hide?', 101635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wounds inflicted by the Divine Bell incident run deep, Aethas. Others in the council are not as forgiving as I.', 101634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, soldier. Evac is coming soon.', 'Hang in there, soldier. Evac is coming soon.', 101633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wounds are great in number.', 'Your wounds are great in number.', 101632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light heal your wounds!', 'Light heal your wounds!', 101631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you die on me!', 'Don\'t you die on me!', 101630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spellstone... someone please... use it to carry on my work...', '', 101629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must save the others!', 'We must save the others!', 101628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, priest.', 'Thank you, priest.', 101627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved my life. I will not forget this.', 'You have saved my life. I will not forget this.', 101626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must fall back!', 'I must fall back!', 101625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was down for good. You have my thanks.', 'I thought I was down for good. You have my thanks.', 101624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, shaman. Without you, this world would succumb to chaos.', '', 101623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent work, $n. Here are the recipes for each piece of the barding as well as the final barding recipe. Good luck!', 101622, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve acquired all the leather. What\'s next?', 'I\'ve acquired all the leather. What\'s next?', 101621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Yes, well, you see, the problem that adventurers keep whining about is that their mounts will occasionally buck them from their saddles when hostile creatures attack.$b$bI told them to stop running through wild packs of animals, but apparently that\'s \"not the fastest way to travel.\"$b$bSo, I figured if I couldn\'t convince them to stick to the roads, then perhaps it would be easier to build some armor for their mounts to protect them from all the attacks.$b$bThe major things we need to protect are the head, the neck and the body. In other words... pretty much everything.', 101620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Pool of Judgment can remind Kayn and Altruis of our past... a shared past forged by Lord Illidan himself.', 101619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ominous golem seems to be deactivated. You are drawn to a button on it\'s back. Do you press it?', '', 101617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are behaving like children.$B$BStill, I knew this was coming. They might as well work out their differences now.', 101616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Namha asked me to talk to you about mount barding.', 'Namha asked me to talk to you about mount barding.', 101615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect us from whatever monstrosities lie under the sea!', '', 101614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, you may think our hats look silly, but they will help us adapt to the flooding of the world quickly!', 101613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you here to add to our stores? If you have any meat, make sure it\'s not salted. Trand says salted meat spoils faster.', 101612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sharpen your blades, $n. This fight ain\'t over yet.', 'Sharpen your blades, $n. This fight ain\'t over yet.', 101611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve ne\'er seen anything like this before!', 'I\'ve ne\'er seen anything like this before!', 101610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today will not be my last!', 'Today will not be my last!', 101609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We usually invite our guests in with a pint, but for the demons I\'ll be sharing the pointy end of me blade instead.', 'We usually invite our guests in with a pint, but for the demons I\'ll be sharing the pointy end of me blade instead.', 101608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! Yer quite the $c, aren\'t ya.', 'Thanks! Yer quite the $c, aren\'t ya.', 101607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 101606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t let them reach the Gates!', 'We can\'t let them reach the Gates!', 101605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you champion. We should be safe now. Come, let us speak with Mayla.', 101604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mayla, child, the Underking has destroyed Riverbend.', 101603, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect all who stand in Azeroth\'s defense. You shall not fall this day!', '', 101602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You who dares brave the trials ahead - I bestow upon you the ephemeral power of creation!', '', 101601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be lifted by my power - leave no boundary uncrossed!', '', 101600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worry not, my children. We will stand by you in the dark times to come.', '', 101599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smite down all those who would destroy this world. Burn them in righteous fire!', '', 101598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This ends now!', 101597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Receive my blessing and carry with you the wisdom of ages yet to pass.', '', 101596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My glaives have gone too long without tasting demon blood...', 101595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh will feed my pets!', '', 101594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azoran must die...', 101593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you held on to your materials, you\'ll need them for the final version of those boots.', 101592, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use my tanning rack and workbench to craft everything. You\'ll find a solution for tanning on my bench as well.', 101591, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Safe travels, $n.', 101590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t remember what happened.', '', 101589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this fussin\'. What we need is fightin\'!', '', 101588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too many new faces, if ya ask me.', '', 101587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said it!', '', 101586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not gonna lose our lands to the damn demons, thats fer sure!', '', 101585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I hadn\'t the cough keepin\' me down, I\'d be out there fightin\' as well!', '', 101584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sooner they\'re both gone, the better! This camp\'s hardly big \'nuff for us!', '', 101583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assure you - they\'ll be on their way as soon as these demons are taken care of.', '', 101582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know it\'s a nuisance sharing the camp, but we have to work together or we\'ll have nothing left!', '', 101581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boys, boys - we have to stay calm. As much as we hate to admit it, these Hunters are quite the help in holding the quarry.', '', 101580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t the place to be now. I\'ll come back when it\'s safe.', '', 101579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful here. This isn\'t a spot I want to be in until it\'s all clear.', '', 101578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My target, lads!', '', 101577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, looky at what kind of beasty we have \'ere!', '', 101576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!!', '', 101575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Perform the earth ritual.>', '<Perform the earth ritual.>', 101574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ground here is in torment and rumbles alarmingly beneath your feet. As a shaman you can perform a ritual to draw out and soothe the angry earth spirits... but you should be ready for a fight.>', '', 101573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feeding Time!', '', 101572, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go... before the Lich King decides we\'ve overstayed our welcome. I must plead my case before the council.', '', 101571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An inglorious stain upon the Sunstrider name has been cleansed. Good work, hero!', '', 101570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ground here roils and rumbles alarmingly beneath your feet. Perhaps a shaman could be brought here to soothe the restless earth?>', '', 101569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies are looking pretty grim. Be careful out there!', '', 101568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand blessings upon you, my highlord. If you need me, I will be in the wondrous Goldshire inn.', '', 101567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the golden fields of Westfall - what strange land do you brave this time, oh $ct?', '', 101566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not, townsfolk. Adventure has arrived!', '', 101564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be many festivities after we are through. For the Silver Hand!', '', 101563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho, oh illustrious and impenetrable $ct $p? I am forever in your service.', '', 101562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Doloria\'s grace, I have arrived my $ct! What dragon dares threaten your greatness?', '', 101561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Count your days numbered, dragons of fire and flame. Today you fall to Maximillian of Northshire! And $ct $p!', '', 101560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hup Hup, Pimento! $ct $p requires our aid!', '', 101559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish mortal! You should have fled when you had the chance.', 101558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You defeated a few of our weakest fighters... no matter. When the fel blood courses fully through our veins, even that precious artifact of yours won\'t do us harm.', '', 101545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out here, $n! Wouldn\'t want a fine $c like yourself to get hurt!', '', 101542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pity... that wretched shardling isn\'t moving? Its death was neither quick nor painless, I assure you.', '', 101539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t no way these demons are taking o\'er our land! Not while I\'m in charge!', '', 101538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not realize that you\'re groping in the darkness! Felo\'melorn would be wasted in your hands!', 101537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will slay you and all your kin; and when I\'m done I will fulfill the dreams of my mentor.', '', 101530, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 55445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you say the same as you stand there intoxicated with the power of the Legion?', 101529, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 55446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what was my reward?  Eternal torment from my \"sisters.\"', '', 101528, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 55447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A ruse to study their prey here in safety.', '', 101527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to what end?', '', 101526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You made a terrible mistake coming here.', 101525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will make a satisfying meal.', 101524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... Tyranna is dead!', 101523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect the eggs at all costs.', 101522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vengeance for the brood queen!', 101521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... cold....', 101520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you long for my blade so badly, then you shall have it!', 101519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All doubt has been banished! You are truly worthy of the blade! Claim your prize and leave, hero. The living have no place within my prison of ice.', '', 101518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 60509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using Artifact', 'Using Artifact', 101517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me think me have just the right touch...', 'Me think me have just the right touch...', 101516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Candle almost ready! Just needs magic touch and Candleking will have best candle I ever make!', '', 101515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blade is mine, by the will of the master... and by rights of blood! Oppose me and you WILL be struck down!', 101514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only when the blinding pain of life left me did I see the truth! Only then was the majesty of the plan revealed!', 101513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best kill job me seen! You get best reward...', 'Best kill job me seen! You get best reward...', 101512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I find biggest basilisk in cave! It dead now! I get reward?', '', 101511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You keep one. I keep rest.', 'You keep one. I keep rest.', 101509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me find shiny coins at bury place! So many, so shiny. What me do with them?', '', 101508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you take the east and recover any remaining survivors. Lynore and I will take the soldiers and push them back in the west.', '', 101506, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A scout just informed me that there is a jailer demon to the east with at least ten of our soldiers being tortured.', 101505, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great job, $n. We were able to save a lot of good soldiers, but we haven\'t accounted for all of our lost forces yet.', 101504, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little is known of this ancient weapon, other than that its power was responsible for taking the life from the place you call Deadwind Pass.', '', 101503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entrance to this place remains hidden, known only to the riders themselves.', '', 101502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will fail in their efforts.', '', 101501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s trying to counter my spell! I won\'t be able to hold her much longer. Hurry!', '', 101500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will crumble! We will darken your skies, crush your armies. Come, whelps! Die before my might!', 'This world will crumble! We will darken your skies, crush your armies. Come, whelps! Die before my might!', 101499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig rocks, find pretties! More pretty is better.', 'Dig rocks, find pretties! More pretty is better.', 101498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I mine! You no take pickaxe! Where you want rocks dug? Want the metals? Pick a little dull.', '', 101497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, but now is not the time.', '', 101496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember who you were. But the creature before me now is but a walking corpse!', '', 101495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar.', '', 101494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of yourself out there. If ye ever need anything, ye know where to find me.', '', 101493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they come, I\'ll be ready.', '', 101492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aethas! How DARE you! Have you forgotten who I am?', 101491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not one for conversation - much remains to be done. May our paths cross again, $p.', '', 101490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have watched many lead their people down dark paths. Tirion often spoke of the Light that guided his hand and his people - let it guide you to greatness as well.', '', 101489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He always thought highly of you - from what I hear from others his trust has not been misplaced.', '', 101488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion was my brother by blood. We saved one another\'s lives many moons ago. He was a good man... an honorable man.', '', 101487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit with me if you would - just for a few moments.', '', 101486, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-Ka, Highlord $p. I see we both value some peace and quiet now and again.', '', 101485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make big candle! Lots of wax!', 'Make big candle! Lots of wax!', 101484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want me do? Can wax off extra hairs? Make drip bath? Check ears for waxes?', '', 101483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m with you, hero! I\'ll hold Lyandra at bay. Focus on destroying that monster of hers!', '', 101482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give ye some time alone. Just somethin\' to think about in the days ahead.', '', 101481, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all come from the same earth and stone around us; Alliance and Horde, dwarf and gnome- as a leader, ye\'ve got to see past the differences and unite yer people against the Legion. Azeroth depends on it.', '', 101480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye don\'t mind an old dwarf talkin\' yer ear off, I\'d like to share a piece of advice with ye that I\'ve carried with me since I was a lad.', '', 101479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer is a truly wondrous blade, ain\'t it? I remember forging it many years ago back in Ironforge - my finest work.', '', 101478, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a seat with me for a moment, won\'t ye?', '', 101477, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well if ain\'t the Highlord $Ghimself:herself;! I reckon\' it\'s good for even the hardiest of us to take a moment and reflect now and again. I\'m right fond of this spot.', '', 101476, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need kill? My chisel axe best in sharpness ever!', '', 101475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kill basilisk! Biggest in cave! Bring back!', 'You kill basilisk! Biggest in cave! Bring back!', 101474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything else?', 'Anything else?', 101473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I\'ll be... the Ashbringer. They say King Magni worked for three days straight to forge that blade.', '', 101472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riverbend was destroyed with a single blow. How can we stand against such power?', 101471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_socererking_arcanewrath:20|tYou are targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:196070|h[Suppression Protocol]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_socererking_arcanewrath:20|tYou are targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:196070|h[Suppression Protocol]|h|r!', 101470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done! The monster is contained. Let\'s meet up with the others.', '', 101469, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 57333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go find shiny! Dig dirt in dead place.', 'Go find shiny! Dig dirt in dead place.', 101468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want me find? Me have shovel!', '', 101467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot hold out like this forever. We need to contain him!', '', 101466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer... will falll...', '', 101465, 0, 34080, 0, 64, 0, 53939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $n! Activate the countermeasures around the room!', '', 101464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold fast, Illidari! We must trap him in this chamber!', '', 101463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\trade_archaeology_naarucrystal.blp:20|t $n is imprisoned in |cFFF00000|Hspell:195791|h[Quarantine]|h|r!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\trade_archaeology_naarucrystal.blp:20|t $n is imprisoned in |cFFF00000|Hspell:195791|h[Quarantine]|h|r!', 101462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer?! Lord Balnazzar will have your head!', '', 101461, 0, 34080, 0, 64, 0, 53938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Applebough notices G\'Hanir and tosses you a fresh apple!', '', 101456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the harpies hit Skyhorn hard. Lasan has been pulling back all of his forces to defend their home.', '', 101455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unacceptable! My minions will rip you apart!', 101454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are done with Highmountain. The Bloodtotem must look to new allies.', '', 101453, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mayla cannot even stand against the drogbar. What hope does she have against the Legion?', '', 101452, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sitting', 'Sitting', 101451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s arises to the call for battle as its stiff branches crackle, releasing age old dust to the ground below.', '', 101450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hammer is not a weapon, you know that.', 101449, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got it from here, $n. Thanks for your help. And if you see Celea again, tell her I owe her one.', '', 101448, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell that to the Riverbend Refugees.', 101447, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We never should have listened to Ebonhorn. We should have used the hammer against the Legion and the drogbar when we had it.', 101446, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n, I\'m your shadow from here on out. Try not to get us killed.', '', 101445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to Deepholm, Mylra!', 'Fly me to Deepholm, Mylra!', 101444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hallo shaman! We got separated from one another after the assault on the Maelstrom.$b$bCome, there\'s work ta be done. Stormbeak here will fly ya to Deepholm.', 101443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next!', '', 101442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jumping from this bridge is training for my boys. If you can jump from here, you can jump from your eagle! They\'ll be ready to fight the good fight before we know it. We\'re happy to be back in Thunder Totem.\n\nYou can try, if you\'d like.', '', 101441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Knights of Acherus, I send to you $n who will serve as the enforcer of my will. Follow her commands as you would my own.', '', 101440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Subjects released... I can no longer protect them...', '', 101439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day 50: The sky... has turned black. Demons... everywhere. And this hunger... this endless hunger...', '', 101438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day 33:  Low on arc-wine. Theryn making excellent progress. Shal\'an remains stubborn. Crystals becoming harder to find.', '', 101437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wield your weapons with purpose! Drive them back!', '', 101436, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shinfel and Zinnin attack Jagganoth!', 'Shinfel and Zinnin attack Jagganoth!', 101434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
