('Day 16: Breakthrough! Using Theryn\'s essence as the base, I have crafted a spell that calms the withered. At least, it works sometimes...', '', 101432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer...', 'The Ashbringer...', 101431, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Honor, champions! Show them your strength! Stand together! Fight together!', '', 101430, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You honor us with your strength, champions. I ask that you fight - bleed for our cause! We will not fall to the Legion!', '', 101429, 1, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Taldranis. Let\'s go.', 'I\'m ready, Taldranis. Let\'s go.', 101428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready, $n. I can\'t wait to get out of here.', '', 101427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
