('That pup is still alive? Glorious!$B$BI will follow you, but keep your hands off my helmet.', '', 101385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad you\'re here. We could use some backup.', '', 101384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am no naga, Stokalfr! I come on behalf of Brandolf!', 'I am no naga, Stokalfr! I come on behalf of Brandolf!', 101383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t no way these things are taking over.', '', 101382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the Harbor at all costs!', '', 101381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! Is that my blood or yours?', '', 101380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the horns on my head, I will kill every last one of these naga!', '', 101379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure didn\'t see that coming! I\'m gonna warn the others.', '', 101378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to journey to Stonedark Grotto.', 'I wish to journey to Stonedark Grotto.', 101377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings brul.$b$bIf you tire of the stench of wood and clean air then speak with me, Bogrogg, the STONESCREAMER!$b$bI can send you by way of stone and earth to the Stonedark Grotto.', '', 101376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never forget the great deeds you have done in service of our people... until we do.', '', 101375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I relish what little sleep I can manage. Tomorrow I begin looking for subjects.', '', 101369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Day 5: Wards prove effective at deterring the withered, but do nothing for the cacophony of critters and beasts outside. The nights are so loud out here.', '', 101368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 67434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know who you are, but you best get out of here before the giants catch you.', '', 101367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer if you want to die, naga!', '', 101365, 0, 38051, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Doomhammer fell somewhere below. Hold on! This part always gives me tummy the wubblies!', 101364, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your movements have caused a Frost Block to break open!', 'Your movements have caused a Frost Block to break open!', 101362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a fine day for a hunt.', 101361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trand is an inspiration. He\'s strong willed, a good leader, and he cares about others. When he had the vision of Deathwing\'s return, he didn\'t just run off by himself. He told us, his peers, and called us to follow him if we wanted to live. \n\nI\'ve known many a shaman in my life, but Trand really knows how to... ride the lightning, so to speak.', '', 101359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He returned to his homeland after the War of the Ancients and it was renamed in his honor.', '', 101358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln cast Tichondrius out of this world with the Eagle Spear.', '', 101357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a very difficult request you ask of me, $n. Here, take one. I only hope it leads to ending this war.', '', 101356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scale? The nighfallen take our essence and you ask for my scale?! Leave before I confuse you with one of them!', '', 101355, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These damn Nightfallen are relentless. Have you come to aid us in our fight against them?', '', 101354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you checked the storehouse up the hill? We\'ve been trying to gather all the good bits we can find. Things that will last. You know; bananas, milk... that sort of thing. \n\nI think we\'re doing a good job!', 101353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take it you need this for some vital task? Since I\'m of no help to my kin, I suppose the least I could do is help you.', '', 101352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come here, at this hour, and ask for such a thing? Leave me be, $c.', '', 101351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could do more to aid Senegos.', '', 101350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'SKREEE! IT BURNS! I will flay you alive for this!', 101349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strange request, $n, but I trust it will go towards a good cause. Here, take it, and may it help you against the legion.', '', 101348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, $n, but I cannot simply give you one of my scales. In this time of need, we must keep all of our strength.', '', 101347, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came for the Illidari, but Azoran will be pleased when I bring him your corpse as well!', '', 101346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was wondering if you would be able to part with one of your scales?', 'I was wondering if you would be able to part with one of your scales?', 101345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there something I can help you with, $c?', '', 101344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fjolrik mumbles to himself.>$B$BAsta! Is it time to battle?', '', 101342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fjolrik mumbles to himself.>$B$BNot so rough, Asta!', '', 101341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Fjolrik mumbles to himself.>$B$BNot now, Asta. I\'m trying to sleep.', '', 101340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repeatedly poke the vrykul with a stick', 'Repeatedly poke the vrykul with a stick', 101339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firmly kick the vrykul.', 'Firmly kick the vrykul.', 101338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to rouse the vrykul.', 'Try to rouse the vrykul.', 101337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The vrykul seems to be unconscious.>', '', 101336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pride will be the end of you!', '', 101335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who taught you how to shoot a gun, a murloc?', 101334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrgl. Mrrglrgrgrgl. Rrglrgl, mrglrgl. RRGL!! Mrglrgl. Mrr, mrgl. Rglrglmrr, glrmrlr. Mrglrrrr. Gllrmrl. Mrr? Grmlrml!\n\nMrgl. Mrrky. Mrg.', '', 101332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we lose ground here they\'ll siege Bilgewater! Throw the kitchen sink at \'em. We ain\'t losin\' Bilgewater!', '', 101331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re not gonna lose the Strand! Air reinforcements are comin\' soon!', '', 101330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold \'em off \'til we can get some backup here!', '', 101329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like they\'re trying to surround the Harbor! Keep \'em busy until reinforcements arrive!', '', 101328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we are Highmountain!', '', 101327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Navarrogg, leader of the Stonedark drogbar, declare my allegiance to the Highmountain tribe.', '', 101326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am nervous about entering this place. Best hurry in before they change their mind about allowing me safe passage.', '', 101325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my people from the Feltotem and their Legion allies. We will now help you and your Highmountain allies against Dargrul and his mindless followers.', '', 101324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mglrrglrgl! Grml. Mrgrmlgr.', '', 101322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grmrglrgml? Mrgrl. RGL!', '', 101321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MrglRGLRGLRGL. Mrrrmrgl!', '', 101320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrgl, grrglrrgl. GURGLRRGLRRRGL! Mrgl.', '', 101319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Murky\'s Egg to mindmeld with him and guide his actions.', '', 101318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t get to you right now, but I can throw my warglaive at your demon.', '', 101315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After we take this place, you need to summon our forces through that huge Legion gateway.', '', 101314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to need my warglaive back after you kill that demon.', '', 101313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to plant the banner?', '', 101312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far, so good, $n. We\'re about to take the ridge.', '', 101311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re too spread out. Everyone regroup!', '', 101310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you could use a little help.', '', 101309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I, too, came to Icecrown in search of Felo\'melorn. The Lich King gave me the blade... and more. He gave me purpose!', 101308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n. I\'ll see you up in the volcano.', '', 101307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Ravencrests have sacrificed much and more in defense of this land. I see now we may rest, safe in the knowledge that heroes still live who will defend our world.', '', 101306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes. A great veil has been lifted from our eyes.', '', 101305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will count on it. Whenever you come, we will meet you. And we WILL defend our world.', '', 101304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... will... return!', '', 101303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes - we may bend, but never break.', '', 101301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Souls of my ancestors! To me! Aid our champions!', '', 101300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why... why do you bother to struggle? You will fail - if not today, then tomorrow, or the next...', '', 101299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You expect these worthless mortals to defy the Legion?', '', 101297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! You must defeat him!', '', 101296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ancestors... Illysanna! No, forgive me...', '', 101295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I? This is... not...', '', 101294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no...', '', 101293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot comprehend that which you face, mortals...', '', 101292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are legion!', '', 101291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Your skin crawls...', '', 101290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep, now...', '', 101289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, you.', '', 101288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Trand started spreading news of Deathwing\'s coming, my family did not want to follow. My heart told me to stay with them, but my body... \n\nI want to live, $c. There is no shame in that.', '', 101287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ravencrest, you worthless husk. Ten thousand years have not been kind.', '', 101286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I tire of this.', '', 101285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn away!', '', 101284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take our world!', '', 101283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall cleave you in twain!', '', 101282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiends, you shall never have our world!', '', 101281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They do. Together we shall defeat them, Latosius.', '', 101280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kur\'talos... they come for you.', '', 101279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I can\'t... lose...', '', 101278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Neutralized.', 101277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out with the refuse.', '', 101276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take this!', '', 101275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Got you!', '', 101274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t bother running, flea...', '', 101273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble beneath me.', '', 101272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So long as the Legion does not break our spirit, they cannot triumph.', 101271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our defeat at the Broken Shore was a disaster. What\'s left of the Alliance and Horde are at one another\'s throats.$b$b$C, heroes like you may be our last great hope. Stay strong, and do not give up.', '', 101270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got one! How\'s that for being a \"bad shot\"?', '', 101269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of your barking, Emily!', '', 101268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the love of the Naaru, I missed again!', '', 101267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will paint this keep with your blood!', '', 101266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! YOU... you killed him!', '', 101265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think Hemet himself could have taught me better.', 101264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kassarus! Dispose of these intruders.', 101263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maxxael! The master will not tolerate sloth... Where are you?!', '', 101262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes! Use the portal! Hurry, friend!', '', 101261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go then, warlock, but I cannot abandon the Council. Let us hope we can survive to see your return.', 101260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calydus will go help his friend find weapon. Then we will return with the power to defeat Jagganoth. We must hurry!', '', 101259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we cannot leave them!', 101258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Friend must not confront Jagganoth without the weapon! Friend will surely be defeated!', '', 101257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They cannot hope to face him alone. Come, warlock!', 101256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shinfel! Zinnin!', 101255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Killing us would have been your salvation, Jagganoth. Now, you will have to pay for Zelifrax! Band\'or shorel\'aran!', 101254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will see me again at the Temple of Elune.', 101253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? The petulant mortals disrupt my portals and invade my archives? I should have simply destroyed you like that petty little gnome.', '', 101252, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent worms! You will burn for this!', '', 101251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hm, I don\'t remember ever agreeing to let you go.', 101250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My knowledge has been granted. Now, release me from my bonds!', '', 101249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed, my pet. Indeed...', 101248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In their unending search for powerful relics, the Dark Riders plucked Ulthalesh from its resting place and stashed it in their armory.', '', 101247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deep beneath the keep of Karazhan rests the dread scythe Ulthalesh, The Deadwind Harvester.', '', 101246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. If you truly wish to defeat Jagganoth, there is only one artifact you would wish to seek.', '', 101245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She would.', 101244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wouldn\'t!', '', 101243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In that case, how about I simply cast you out into the Great Dark? You can spend eternity observing the nothingness.', 101242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never!', '', 101241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll consider it, demon, but first, what can you tell me about these artifacts that Jagganoth is hunting?', 101240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannot be! Release me at once!', '', 101239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is weakened! Quickly, banish him before he recovers!', 101238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone else marked that target.', 'Someone else marked that target.', 101237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! You will suffer for your trespass!', '', 101236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defend yourselves!', 101235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s just too strong!', 101234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think he means to cooperate. Let\'s see how brave he is when we take away his strength.', 101233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What mortal dares approach the archives? Such insolence will not be tolerated!', '', 101232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even if you stop us here we will never be done.', 101231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 101230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The archive is just ahead! Xel\'toth waits there, coveting all of Jagganoth\'s knowledge to himself. Question him, and you will find your artifact!', '', 101229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure.', '', 101228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re wasting your time, Maruul! Your aim will never be as good as mine!', 101227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another down! You\'ve got nothing on me!', 101226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 101225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Minions - Attack!', 101224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got another, Maruul! You\'re falling behind!', 101223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, you will all succumb to the Legion...', '', 101222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I can see now... betrayed...', 101221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s find this archive and get out of here before it\'s too late.', 101220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you\'re no fun.', 101219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should hurry. I would rather avoid a confrontation if we can.', 101218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like we got his attention.', 101217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this commotion I hear? Why has the portal been closed?', '', 101216, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And nobody from the palace would think to search for us here.', 101215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For now, at least, we know the withered have learned to avoid this place.', 101214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the Arcway. Great halls which run beneath the entire region... even the city itself.', 101213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this place?', 101212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you...', 101211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will burn you alive!', 101210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guards! Hold them off!', 101209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hunt is eternal...', 101208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to fight with you again.', 'It is good to fight with you again.', 101207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your actions cannot disrupt our studies! The power will soon be ours!', 101205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have a way to stave off the hunger - long enough to find a cure. Let us help.', 'We may have a way to stave off the hunger - long enough to find a cure. Let us help.', 101204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be afraid, for I am not. I will soon be reunited with my lady love. These heroes that surround you were men and women just like me. They too had their own loves and vices, and they understood the meaning of sacrifice. Let this be mine.$b$b<Thaedris sighs.>$b$bPerhaps you are right, $n. I have been so tired and weary with the shame of our people. I believed that I had no path, no recourse. Truly it would be impossible for me to atone for our actions. I am no hero, despite what you may think. I am simply an old man who has seen too much for one lifetime.', '', 101203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zin-Malor is ours!', 101201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Mindbenders! Do not give in!', 101200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the intruders!', '', 101198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This memorial is not as grand or famous as the others here, but it holds special importance for me. Within lies Lady Latara, a consummate huntress and my wife. Oh, how I miss her.', '', 101197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They desecrate our ruins!', 101196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brothers and sisters! The temple - it must be preserved!', 101195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can not escape.', 101194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are... infinite...', '', 101193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will... perish...', '', 101192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will burn!', '', 101191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now might be a good time, Zinnin...', 101190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn our stories, outlander. They carry great meaning.', '', 101189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is all.', '', 101188, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never work with hides that are still attached to the animal. Especially if it\'s alive. Just trust me on this.', '', 101187, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fall before me!', 101186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couldn\'t have said it better myself.', '', 101185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said it, sister!', '', 101184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be nice when things are back to normal \'round here.', 101183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some kinda party, eh? So many uninvited guests.', 101182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice of you to show up. Haven\'t seen much backup yet.', 101181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make sure you give those demons what\'s comin\'!', 101180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not the only one with minions, demon!', 101179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, puny creature? You want a lesson? Okay, I\'ll give you a lesson.', '', 101178, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gestures toward Thrall.', '', 101177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I found you! The four winds have been sent to seek you out. Come with me.', '', 101176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please find Moozy. I will try to recover and search as well. If you find him, take him to his mother upriver.', '', 101175, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah. Never trust a dragon. At least he showed us a way out. Once we get these disks back to Ironforge I\'ll be able to really dig into them.', '', 101174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, that incident with Iron Horde was just a misunderstanding. Garrosh was supposed to convince them to fight the Burning Legion, not invade Azeroth.', '', 101173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me one reason not to let Talas here rip yer wings off and beat ya with \'em.', '', 101172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep... at last....', '', 101171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Confidence in your conclusions will give you strength, but fluidity with your actions will grant you wisdom.', '', 101169, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sooner I crush you the faster I go back to sleep!', '', 101168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The same methods one uses to shape one\'s leather can also be used to shape one\'s spirit and mind.', '', 101167, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Respect is paid, and knowledge is given. Hear now my lesson of flexibility.', '', 101166, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 101165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the drogbar threat to my people quelled, we are happy to rejoin Mayla Highmountain\'s cause. I am ready to begin the ritual when you are.', 101164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many small things will always add up to something bigger, and often just as strong.', 101163, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Selentia wails, calling forth ancient keepers!', 'Selentia wails, calling forth ancient keepers!', 101162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together, we are Highmountain!', 101161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let it be known that I, Jale Rivermane, Chieftain of the Rivermane tribe, declare my allegiance to Highmountain once again.', 101160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, Thunder Totem. This feels right. My knees? Not so right.', 101159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have a history of both harvest and war. Never are we stronger than when together with the other tribes.', 101158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, thank you for coming. Through this hall you can see the history of my people. A history I have been part of for the better part of a century.', 101157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not throw away the scrap simply because you don\'t see an immediate use for it.', 101156, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your respect is humbly received, $r. The wisdom I grant to those who honor me is frugality.', 101155, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Awaken, Gorewing! Tear my foe asunder!', 101154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright! That should be enough. I\'ll meet ya near the exit to this dragon hole.', '', 101152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try aimin\' fer the titan defenders. Them orbs are what are holdin\' the portals open.', '', 101151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like ol\' Deathwing left the automated defenses on. Watch me back.', '', 101150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, Deathwing wants this titan hammer kept secret? Perhaps this is the weapon we need to challenge the beast.', '', 101149, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot use Spymaster Jenri\'s Scope on a target with that debuff.', 'You cannot use Spymaster Jenri\'s Scope on a target with that debuff.', 101148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blessings to you.', 101147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May you always strive for balance.', 101146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be vigilant and guard against corruption.', 101145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show honor through your deeds.', 101144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure you send those demons our regards.', '', 101143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is for your help.', '', 101142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cave belongs to the Murkloc tribe!', '', 101141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true master knows that the experience in its entirety is what fuels the mind. Never forget the beginning simply because you have reached the end.', '', 101140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some believe the journey is most important, while others believe it\'s the destination.', '', 101139, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stranger from another land has come to honor my name? I\'m pleased to see this. The knowledge I have to pass on to you is that of totality.', '', 101138, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold out here \'til it\'s over.', '', 101137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just took hold of me... I\'ve never felt anything like that before.', '', 101136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be sure to see me again after you\'ve gained further renown in the Broken Isles, $n. There is more for us to do!', '', 101135, 0, 36663, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Astral Portal will return you to Dalaran whenever you wish, Farseer. I will keep it open so that you may return here any time.', '', 101134, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From this map you may dispatch members of the Earthen Ring throughout the Broken Isles. Lead us to victory, Farseer!', '', 101133, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will bury you here, fools.', 101132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are these mortals doing here? Guards, seize them!', '', 101131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Men! The invaders come for us. Do not let them pass! For Kalimdor!', 101130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will... burn...', '', 101128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You step into the land of the dead, mortal. The Lich King has decreed that the living shall not enter Icecrown!', 101127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
