('', 'Meet me at Riverbend as soon as you can, $n. I\'ll meet you there--my old bones don\'t move like they used to.', 101118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While the arkhana will allow me to do most of the work, I\'ll still need a stronger reagent for the final word. A leylight shard, to be exact.$b$bNow, let\'s put those big, scary demon words to work!', 101117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
