('They just keep coming!', '', 101106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They keep clippin\' my wings! Not sure how much longer I can keep her in the air.', '', 101105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
