('I dunno what them tauren were huffin, but these ain\'t no spirits. These are time echoes. Somethin\' bad happened here.', '', 101100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mayla, this is something your father made me promise I would do for you. Please, your people need this. You need this.', '', 101099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54888, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we taking bets on how long the gnome lasts?', 101098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One dress, clean as new. Thank you for your business.', '', 101097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
