('Pay the 2 gold.', 'Pay the 2 gold.', 101094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you clean this dress for me, Shandy?', 'Can you clean this dress for me, Shandy?', 101093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But be warned! I will not be responsible for the fate which befalls you... any more than I was for what happened to the last seeker who hoped to take my relic.', '', 101092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 53944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
