('Enough of this foolishness.', '', 101071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little goblin - your ignorance reeks of mortality.', '', 101070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defenders of the Horde, we have visitors from the Burning Legion. Let us not leave them unattended!', '', 101069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave the Sunreavers to me.', '', 101068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That the best you got? And here I thought my guys would have to work for what little pay they earn...', '', 101067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Rivermane! ... Did you say something? Speak up!', 101066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m getting too old for this.', 101065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We tried peace, now we try war!', 101064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s working, we just need more time!', 101063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re trying to disrupt our channeling! Stop them!', 101062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your magic is weak here!', 101061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to the depths! Ow! My back!', 101060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is it! Let\'s see if we can make this portal a little less stable!', 101059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get out of my cavern! I didn\'t spend a lifetime nurturing its magic only to hand it to you upstarts!', 101058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The water will wash over you!', 101057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Earthmother will receive your corpse!', 101056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone!', 'Begone!', 101055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong here, $c.', 'You do not belong here, $c.', 101054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Southern wall - Incoming!', '', 101053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ayep! That\'s definitely the ground shakin\'!', '', 101052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Er... did, uh... did you feel that?', '', 101051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, nicely done! Maybe now they\'ll think twice about who they\'re messin\' with.', '', 101050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have much to lose - your father\'s life, most of all.', '', 101049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not stop me! I will not fail!', '', 101048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is ours now!', '', 101047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never defeat us! We are Legion!', '', 101046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before your new masters!', '', 101045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, hero!', '', 101044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Crush them!', '', 101043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Rivermane are not a warlike tribe, but this trespass of our sacred cavern will not go unpunished. The drogbar will know the power of water magic.\n\nWith age comes wisdom, and with wisdom comes power!', 101042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess we\'ll just have to take it, then.', 101041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The key! They\'re using it to stabilize the portal.', 101040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be a fool! The portal isn\'t yet stable enough for an army.  Do you wish to be lost to the Twisting Nether?', 'Don\'t be a fool! The portal isn\'t yet stable enough for an army.  Do you wish to be lost to the Twisting Nether?', 101039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up with that portal, man\'ari! Jagganoth hungers for the blood of these mortals.', '', 101038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got your back, $n.', '', 101037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thalyssra escaped? She always was one of the more rational ones. I am glad that she did not stay and join the Grand Magistrix in her road to damnation.$b$bStill, it is hopeless. Our allies are few and scattered, and our enemy has gained a powerful one. We cannot possibly stop their combined forces.$b$bCome now. There is much to be done if you would earn my coin.', '', 101036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay safe, Rulen. Thank you!', 101035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Follow me, everyone! Hurry, give the guards some space!', 101034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is another way, Thaedris. We have a refuge not far from here. Thalyssra is there.', 'There is another way, Thaedris. We have a refuge not far from here. Thalyssra is there.', 101033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the city, $r. It is beautiful, and it is tragic.$b$bWe were cowards to hide beneath that shield. Azeroth was in our care, and we chose to abandon her. We failed our sacred duty to protect the world, and our shame is too great.', '', 101032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have breached the passage to the crypts. Illysanna, you must hold them here.', '', 101031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More reinforcements! Ready your spells!', 101030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stefen, Isirami, get everyone to the cellar! The Legion are coming to stop Archmage Khadgar!', '', 101029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rulen, you take the tavern. Selone, you handle the upper level. Everyone else, find a defensible location!', '', 101028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion! They\'re already upon us. Spread out, cover the Enclave. Send these Demons back to the hells from which they\'ve come!', '', 101027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance will be ready. I\'ll sound the alarm throughout the Silver Enclave.', '', 101026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal will take you directly inside Icecrown. Hurry, it won\'t last long! I\'ll follow after you as soon as I can.', '', 101025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60493, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless minions! I\'ll take care of you myself!', '', 101024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prisoners are escaping! After them!', '', 101023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Moozy! Oh, thank the Earthmother that you are okay! Bless you!', 101022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Earthmother bless you!', 'May the Earthmother bless you!', 101021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die!', 'I thought I was going to die!', 101020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 101019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wield such power!', 'You wield such power!', 101018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting out of here!', 'I\'m getting out of here!', 101017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life!', 'You saved my life!', 101016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did all these drogbar come from?!', 'Where did all these drogbar come from?!', 101015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger!', 'Thank you, stranger!', 101014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After Kael\'thas\'s betrayal, she became obsessed with finding Felo\'melorn to claim it for her own. I told her it was a fool\'s errand, that she\'d never find the relic. Indeed, it has been many years since I last heard from her.', '', 101013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once knew Lyandra Sunstrider, a distant relative of King Anasterian. Though she bore the Sunstrider name, in truth her branch of the family held no claim to the throne.', '', 101012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Precisely why I\'m here. If I can\'t return to my former position, then perhaps the council will at least consider restoring my access to the city. As a show of good faith, I have information to offer.', '', 101011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you both for meeting me in such an inhospitable location. I assure you that if I were able to join you in Dalaran, I would.', '', 101010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As for us... we do not belong here. Farewell, and may Elune\'s light guide you.', 101009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here - father showed me this passage! Take it, and find him!', '', 101008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... understand now. You... you must find Kur\'talos. You must put a stop to this.', '', 101007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody touch it! Not until our guest arrives.', '', 101006, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... aren\'t the ones who did this?', '', 101005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The darkness... it is gone.', 101004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... now I see...', '', 101003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons! You did this to us!', '', 101002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are... why are we here?!', 101001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! I...', '', 101000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n. I\'m glad you received my message.', 100999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This energy... it is too much!', '', 100998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient souls of the Black Rook, rise and join our chorus!', '', 100997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The harvest has come!', '', 100995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this meager vessel, and join us...', '', 100994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feed on your essence...', '', 100993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off with you, then. Find me some cliffthorn.', '', 100992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Due to the sensitive nature of this matter, I must ask for your discretion. If you attempt to speak to me at any other location, I will disavow all knowledge of this message!', 100990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so it was, that Leyota, daughter of Garhan had changed the ways of the past for her people. To this day, the leather armor of Highmountain continues to use nearly all of the animal to give it its strength.', '', 100989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The animals we kill can protect all of us in this way, if you\'ll let me continue to make our armor this way.\" she continued.$b$bAn elder emerged from the crowd and approached Leyota. He examined her armor, especially the point at which the spear had struck.$b$bHe nodded his head as he spoke, \"I understand now, Leyota. There is no vanity here, just strength.\"$b$bHe turned round to the tribe and said, \"Leyota has given us a stronger future. Our tribe will not fall so easily to those we hunt, or those who hunt us. And we will continue to honor our animal brothers and sisters in their death by the armor we wear.\"', '', 100988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is only the beginning...', '', 100987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... death shall take you.', '', 100986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh... give me your flesh.', '', 100985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OoooooooOoooo.', '', 100984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brave stood up, still clutching his spear and began to examine the tip. It was slightly bent.$b$bHe looked down at Leyota and she lay there, clutching at her chest, yet there was no blood to be seen. After a while, Leyota stood up, breathing heavily, but appearing unharmed. \"This is what I wanted to show you!\" she announced. \"The animal that I slew was given no disrespect as its life and its body was taken to protect me.\"$b$bThe tribe had fallen silent now, all eyes and ears paying full attention to what Leyota had to say.', '', 100983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Leyota!\", a voice yelled from the crowd. A young brave emerged with a spear in hand, \"I\'ll take your challenge. You have committed a great disrespect to our ways by what you have done. It would be my honor to send your spirit away from here.\"$b$bThe brave rushed at Leyota, yet she didn\'t move a muscle. The spear tip came into contact with her chest, right where her heart was and sent her falling to the ground with the weight of the brave behind it. As the dust settled, an unusual sight emerged. The spear had not penetrated the armor.', '', 100982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is mine.', '', 100981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will swallow your soul.', '', 100980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die. Die. Die.', '', 100979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assuming we can even reach the gateway...', 100978, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They must have linked their gateway to our summoning portal. They plan to attack Dalaran! We need to close that portal!', 100976, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next day, Leyota emerged from her tent wearing an unusual set of armor. Everyone looked at her quizically as she approached the center of the camp.$b$b\"This armor is made with the teeth and claws of a bristlefur bear I killed the other day.\" Shocked looks came over the people of the tribe as the realization of what she had done sunk in.$b$b\"I challenge any of our warriors to run me through, if they can.\" The tribes people looked around at one another, unsure to what to make of Leyota\'s challenge.', '', 100975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 100974, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 21449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no... the portal!', 100973, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us... join us forever...', '', 100972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready your weapons, children of my wrath! Tonight we strike at the heart of the mortals\' defenses!', '', 100971, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would appear the pit lord is planning an invasion.', 100970, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know. I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.', 100969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 63906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the smell of gunpowder and explosions.', '', 100968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('What dat green-skinned cripple did to dis jungle is terrible. Not even ogres are dis bad about ruining da world!', '', 100967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They might have magic, but we got dynamite!', '', 100966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"To change tradition, is to change our way of life. We do not believe that adding those components to ones armor will do anything for it save to make it look disrespectful to the animal from whom it came.\"$b$bLeyota\'s brow raised as the elders continued, \"We are sorry, Leyota, but we will not allow you to spoil our armor in such a way. If your quest is to strengthen our armor, you will have to find another way.\"$b$bThe elder\'s left the tent, leaving a frustrated Leyota to think.', '', 100965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down there! Keep \'em comin\'!', '', 100964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be far better to die in battle than to toil away all the years of my life producing arms and armor for... whatever this is that Gul\'dan has done to my brothers and sisters.', '', 100963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"It is our ways,\" one elder spoke up, \"We leave their spirits with their weapons so they may hunt in the next realm. It is a sign of respect, Leyota. You know this.\"$b$b\"I see it differently, elder. Do we not show respect by ensuring that our prey\'s death was not in vain?\" she asked. \"Should we not use everything it has to offer? We can strengthen our armor two-fold if we used the rest of the animal in our construction.\"$b$bThe elders spoke silently for a moment amongst themselves then looked up to Leyota.', '', 100962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leyota, daughter of Garhan the Great, followed in her father\'s footsteps as one of the greatest leatherworkers of Highmountain. Yet her greatest achievement was her willingness to go against the grain and change the old ways.$b$bWhen Garhan had passed, all eyes looked to Leyota to carry on his tradition. She spoke to the elders of the tribe, \"My people, long have we hunted these lands, and its bounty has given us food, shelter and protection.\"$b$b\"But we are wasteful,\" she continued, \"We bury our kills with their teeth, their hooves, their claws.\"', '', 100961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we run out of ammunitions, start throwin\' wrenches, boys!', '', 100960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got more where that came from!', '', 100959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t no uninvited guests gettin\' into our house. Not today... not ever!', '', 100958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consume! Devour!', '', 100957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s my little buddy doing?', '', 100956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demon has been secured.', 100955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Later, sucker!', '', 100954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for using Steamwheedle Express!', '', 100953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Hey, $gguy:lady;! Hold up! Got a delivery for ya.', '', 100952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p! Need a ride?', 100951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These wicked vermin must not prevail over my precious grove.', '', 100950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough of this for now. I ain\'t gonna die out here today!', '', 100949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I await your arrival.', 100948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My source is... well... unable to join us within the city. I ask that you meet with me at the crater of Dalaran\'s foundation in Hillsbrad.', 100947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. I trust this projection is clear! This is Modera, Archmage of the Council of Six. I\'ve come across a lead on a weapon that could significantly aid your fight against the Legion.', 100946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will continue our plans when this is over.', '', 100945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU! Join us!', '', 100944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... this hunger...', '', 100943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monstrosity is dead! Ready yourselves! We\'re not through it just yet.', '', 100942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are in your debt, champions.', '', 100941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demon has been slain! Ensure the remaining attackers are disposed of and we may begin to rebuild.', '', 100940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should be focused on readying the casks for the queen. Why do I feel so... unsettled?', 100939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar... ogar...', 'Lok\'tar... ogar...', 100938, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light... save me...', 'Light... save me...', 100937, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Mannethrel.', '', 100936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anath\'ashar!', '', 100935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 65818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
