('Fu Lin\'s got this. His speed is only second to the Master!', 'Fu Lin\'s got this. His speed is only second to the Master!', 100785, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard the Archmage! Defensive positions!', 100784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I will be your Farseer!', 'Yes. I will be your Farseer!', 100783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements have chosen you as their champion, $n. The artifact you wield is proof.$b$bIt is your destiny to lead the Earthen Ring against the Burning Legion. We need you. Do you accept this burden?', '', 100782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten gold on Cao.', 'Ten gold on Cao.', 100781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cao has only started training a year ago and he can already take on three of the tiger school at the same time!', 'Cao has only started training a year ago and he can already take on three of the tiger school at the same time!', 100780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry friend, Cao is clearly the superior fighter. Just look at that form!', 'Sorry friend, Cao is clearly the superior fighter. Just look at that form!', 100779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look ready for a beating!', '', 100778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I still get a refund?', '', 100777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I thought this was pay to win!', '', 100776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who sold me this junk?', '', 100775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smoked.', '', 100774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom, baby!', '', 100773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always hit my mark.', '', 100772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You call yourself a pet tamer?', '', 100771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll be easy!', '', 100770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! You must have cheated!', '', 100769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the chosen defender of Azeroth! May your wisdom guide this circle to victory, and may the power of the weapon you wield crush those who would bring chaos to this land.', '', 100768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take your place among the circle, Farseer. The Earthen Ring is forged anew, and with it, we rekindle hope for this world.', '', 100767, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons, you\'ve got to answer to Linzy Blackbolt!', 100766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand at the precipice of oblivion, but we do not stand alone. Come forward, shaman.', '', 100765, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay hidden, ok? I\'ll keep them out of the shop.', 100764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t overreact, Patty. We\'ve got the whole council in residence. We\'ll be ok!', 100763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re coming for us... it\'s the end of the world!', 100762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Path of Huln is more than just a tradition of our people. It is the right of passage for any who would carry the mantle of High Chieftain.$b$bIt is a dangerous path, and not all who have aspired to be chieftain have returned.$b$bLet me know when you are ready to depart.', '', 100758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. He must not be allowed to gather his strength so close to our homeland. We must drive him from his lair.', '', 100756, 0, 36408, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyhorn have tracked the beast to a nearby cave.', '', 100755, 0, 36408, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaggggghhhhh!', '', 100754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, wait... I can\'t contain the power.', '', 100753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mannethrel, prepare yourself. I am going to fill you with the power of the Legion\'s secrets.', 'Mannethrel, prepare yourself. I am going to fill you with the power of the Legion\'s secrets.', 100752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So Huln never backed down, no matter the enemy?', 100751, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 54880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to learn the Legion\'s secrets, Kor\'vas?', 'Are you ready to learn the Legion\'s secrets, Kor\'vas?', 100750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If it weren\'t for the Black Temple being under attack, I wouldn\'t mind staying here longer.\n\nThere are so many demons to kill.', 100749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could destroy the Legion on my own!', 100748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kayn, I will teach you what I\'ve learned of the demonic mysteries.', 'Kayn, I will teach you what I\'ve learned of the demonic mysteries.', 100747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel it coursing through my veins. Altering my body.', '', 100746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love to fight alongside Master $p someday!', 'I\'d love to fight alongside Master $p someday!', 100745, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that Master $p once fought bare handed against the former Warchief of the Horde for over a year!', 'I heard that Master $p once fought bare handed against the former Warchief of the Horde for over a year!', 100744, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been told that the Master doesn\'t sleep. $gHe:She; fades away into nothingness each night!', 'I\'ve been told that the Master doesn\'t sleep. $gHe:She; fades away into nothingness each night!', 100743, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that $p can strike so precisely that $ghe:she; can kill a demon with just one finger.', 'I\'ve heard that $p can strike so precisely that $ghe:she; can kill a demon with just one finger.', 100742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it true that $p rescued everyone at the Peak of Serenity all by $ghis:her;self?', 'Is it true that $p rescued everyone at the Peak of Serenity all by $ghis:her;self?', 100741, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More... I want more power!', 100740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the power of the titans, I banish you from this land Earth Warder!', '', 100739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen closely, Cyana. This is what I learned from the Tome of Fel Secrets.', 'Listen closely, Cyana. This is what I learned from the Tome of Fel Secrets.', 100738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know about you, but I\'m willing to do whatever it takes to survive.\n\nWhat we need is more power!', 100737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now Huln! While the dragon is weakened.', '', 100736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] $p, I will help the others to safety. You must complete the hunt!', '', 100735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allari, these are the secrets I\'ve uncovered.', 'Allari, these are the secrets I\'ve uncovered.', 100734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our primary goal here is to get the Sargerite Keystone.\n\nWe need to finish up down here and get up onto Tyranna\'s floating command center.', 100733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maiev is alive. For that, I will forever owe you my thanks.', '', 100732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demonic energy... I feel deadlier.', 100731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the lady! Outside, with arms!', '', 100730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEATH IS ALL THAT AWAITS YOU!', '', 100729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you not see? Kil\'jaeden offers power Illidan never could!', 100728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orland, Alard, you\'re with me!', 100727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horace, take a few of your boys out front.', 100726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arm yourselves, comrades! The council needs our help!', 100725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that smell? Is that... Illidari?', '', 100724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! The latest batch is just outside.', '', 100723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach us what you have learned, $n.', '', 100722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww, shucks.', '', 100721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show\'s over, everyone.', 100720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think Hemet himself could\'ve taught me better. Hopefully he\'ll be impressed with my progress.', 100719, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54843, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to get your latest recipe. That last one was quite the drink! We ran out of kegs on the first night!', '', 100718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I\'ll be... you are never boring, old friend.', '', 100717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still think me an old man, Jedidiah? If this city\'s going to burn, I\'m going with it.', '', 100716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go upstairs, Dorian. I\'ll protect the shop.', '', 100715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must have come a long way, would you like some water?  Oh, a pet battle?  If you insist.', 100714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fought bravely little one.', 100713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a warm-up.', 100712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now I am getting serious!', 100711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll have to work harder to win.', 100710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That last pet seemed a little weak.', 100709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe a stronger pet would be better?', 100708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s okay, you can try again.', 100707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the bravest prove victorious!', 100706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are truly a master strategist.', 100701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah... I\'m pretty sure this isn\'t my training session.', 100700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brassbolt! You\'re going to short circuit! Get back here!', '', 100699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I\'m in the wrong class...', 100698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safety mechanism override... complete. Defensive mode engaged!', '', 100697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this the right training session?', 100696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] That is the mark of the Soulrenders. Vernus the Sourender once used the blades to tear the souls out of his enemies and feed his own power.', '', 100695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh... I\'m not a child.', 100694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight alongside the Alliance in battlegrounds, for now.', 'I will fight alongside the Alliance in battlegrounds, for now.', 100693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you\'re interested, the Alliance needs more troops.', '', 100692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, Master Aysa, can we do something else today? I want to learn the spinning crane kick!', 'Aw, Master Aysa, can we do something else today? I want to learn the spinning crane kick!', 100691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I agree to fight alongside the Alliance in Ashran. Send me there now!', 'Yes, I agree to fight alongside the Alliance in Ashran. Send me there now!', 100690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you\'re interested, the Alliance needs more troops.', '', 100689, 0, 36754, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, now. You can\'t run without first learning to walk.  Everyone, get into your stance.', 100688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello children. Today we will work on the basics.', 100687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think I missed a single shot!', 100686, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54844, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodtotem have always been a treacherous tribe to deal with, but I never expected them to accept the offer of a demon. They must be stopped before they destroy all of Highmountain.', '', 100684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me! Ritssyn Flamescowl is no one\'s burden!', '', 100683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... too wounded to go with you, warlock. Find the others. Together... you might survive this.', '', 100682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was Jubeka! The others might yet live!', '', 100681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A scream sounds from the top of the pit.', '', 100680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 14987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Injuries... more severe than I thought... must recover my strength.', '', 100679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What trickery is this? No one escapes my cells!', '', 100678, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 63913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your destiny awaits!', 100677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Let\'s move out.', '', 100676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will aid you... as I can.', '', 100675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Before our jailer turns his attention to us. You may be able to control him long enough...', '', 100674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ungh! Pain... hard to... focus...', '', 100673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to The Noxious Lair!', 'Take me to The Noxious Lair!', 100672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to The Gaping Chasm!', 'Take me to The Gaping Chasm!', 100671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons! Their search won\'t be very fruitful once I\'ve taken their heads!', '', 100670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... what happened? My head - I...', '', 100669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my camel! Thank you my friend! You are most kind.', '', 100668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honorable $gsir:lady;, I am sorry but I must respectfully ask that you remain in the temple grounds or Mandori Village.', 'Honorable $gsir:lady;, I am sorry but I must respectfully ask that you remain in the Temple Grounds or Mandori Village.', 100667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The imp mother is in that cave, right there.', 100666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow weary of your presence! Tell Odyn that this changes nothing. He will suffer my wrath for ages to come!', 100665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-ASIRA DAWNSLAYER.blp:50:80|t$b[Kor\'vas Bloodthorn] Those fallen soldiers... their souls have been torn from their bodies.', 100664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vigfus, you weak fool! Your torment will be unending!', 100663, 0, 0, 409, 64, 0, 0, 60381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this is the champion of Odyn! Let them die by Odyn\'s own blades! I bless these weapons with the fury of Helheim! Go, Vigfus! Slay this champion and earn my favor for all eternity!', 100662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I\'m getting the hang of it!', 100660, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54845, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya know, every time you run back \'n\' forth you hit me with sand! Not only am I mildly injured, but now I got sand in my hair, my eyes... bleh!', '', 100659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been pacing for hours! Would ya give it a rest already?', '', 100658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yea. You\'ll show them! What are you gonna do? Punch \'em to death?', '', 100657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you keep quiet? You\'ll attract the others.', '', 100656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want a piece of this?', '', 100655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can pick on us \'cause we\'re small? Huh?', '', 100654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back, demons!', '', 100653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not the pain, numbskull - the sand! It BURNS!', '', 100652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just lie still! Help\'s comin\'! I know it!', '', 100651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know. You just hang in there! I promise the wounds will heal!', '', 100650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the pain...', '', 100649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the cargo! Protect... the souls...', '', 100648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hemet asked you to teach me how to hunt? \n\nI\'m glad you\'re up for the job. There\'s a lot I need to learn, but I think I know which end of the rifle to shoot with...\n\nI\'m ready whenever you are!', 100647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After this is over, we\'ll all go out for a pet treat.', '', 100646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ladies, my child\'s only a little thing! I don\'t even want to THINK about her getting in any dangerous situations!', 100645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a rest my friend.', '', 100644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad that Kane only needed to go through his rites of age... I definitely would not be able to breathe if I knew he was ever in danger!', 100643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Personally, I would prefer to avoid such torment.', '', 100642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We would seem to be Jagganoth\'s prisoners on some forsaken Legion world. Imagine the horrors he has planned for us...', '', 100641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, the new blood awakens. You were spared the brunt of the pit lord\'s assault. A pity the rest of us... weren\'t so lucky...', '', 100640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you okay little guy?', '', 100639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bond is not yet strong enough.', '', 100638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should take better care of your friends.', '', 100637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take no joy in this.', '', 100636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you stop calling them pets and begin calling them friends, then can you defeat me.', '', 100635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we must...', '', 100634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. You must have a strong connection with your companions.', '', 100633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are not my pets! These are my friends! However, they are eager to beat you.', '', 100632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal!', '', 100631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me have stones. Good stones! Much magic!', '', 100630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ronir bring more skins?', '', 100629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least that\'s a place to start.', 100628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then let us strike a bargain here at the trading totem. Our skins for your stones. Deal?', 100627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed we did.', 100626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet! One approaches.', 100625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was the past. We must build a new future.', 100624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can learn much from the spirits of beasts, Fasho.', 100623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t work yourself up too much, Gala. Henle, like Turn, is a talented young tauren. She has earned her right to trial, and I know she will succeed.', 100622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still don\'t trust them... but I like their stones. I mean crystals!', '', 100621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their crystals here have proven useful, I suppose.', '', 100620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m not letting my guard down. The drogbar are only good for--', '', 100619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not what I... Listen, they\'re dangerous. Servants of corruption!', '', 100618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t trust them, Borra. They\'re little more than beasts!', '', 100617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together!', '', 100616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That must not come to pass.', '', 100615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Skyhorn will not stand with these savages! They are as wretched as the demons!', '', 100614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My little Henle is out on her first trial to become a shaman... I am just so worried about her! Ferra, how did you handle yourself when Turn was doing his trials?', 100613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together.', '', 100612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let us stand as one. For Highmountain.', '', 100611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Will you doom our people for the sake of your pride? The Legion will leave nothing behind but the silent bones of our elders... our children.', '', 100610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln is right. We must unite against the Legion. It is the only way.', '', 100609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will bathe the mountain in fel blood!', 100608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never!', 100607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have a care, bird tender!', 100606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Bloodtotem will never fight beside fishers and rock climbers!', 100605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then can we eat?', '', 100604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Here\" here? You mean we finally found our new home?', '', 100603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t hear anything. Except the rumble of my hungry belly!', '', 100602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother, are we there yet?', '', 100601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then we can eat.', 100600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, my son. In the embrace of the high mountain before us, we shall make our home. Run and fetch the elders.', 100599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits are whispering, if you stop chattering long enough to listen. Yes... yes, we are here!', 100598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you to stop asking! Wait. Do you hear that?', 100597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare speak of sacrifice to me?', '', 100596, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 55451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We protect life, often at great risk.  Too often at great cost.', 100595, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 55452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fought for Illidan, you imprisoned the world\'s villains here for all eternity. And then you imprisoned us.', '', 100594, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 55453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crimes? Our crime was to sacrifice everything to save this world.', '', 100593, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 55454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what this pool will reveal about you, Drelanim.', '', 100592, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 55455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<cough> I need to rest...', 100591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange. Why do they not follow?', 100590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are so many...', 100589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<cough> I... need a moment...', 100588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n cackles maniacally as they prepare to implode!', '', 100587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the bluffs!', 'Take me to the bluffs!', 100586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it going, $n? You don\'t have to answer that, I already know. Knew. I think you will have known how it was going. We think. You\'ve thought? Tenses are confusing.', 'How\'s it going, $n? You don\'t have to answer that, I already know. Knew. I think you will have known how it was going. We think. You\'ve thought? Tenses are confusing.', 100584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bye, $n. A parting thought: Do bronze dragons buy into timeshares? Scheduling vacations must be a nightmare.', 'Bye, $n. A parting thought: Do bronze dragons buy into timeshares? Scheduling vacations must be a nightmare.', 100582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goodbye $n! If you fly your mount fast enough, you can come visit me next time. You\'ll need to attach a Fel Lightning (Unstable X-treme) Capacitor to it. Has that been invented yet?', 'Goodbye $n! If you fly your mount fast enough, you can come visit me next time. You\'ll need to attach a Fel Lightning (Unstable X-treme) Capacitor to it. Has that been invented yet?', 100581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to southern camp!', 'Take me to southern camp!', 100580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OooOOOooo! I\'m the Ghost of Winter Veil Future! If you play nice, play fair, we\'ll buy ourselves new armor to wear! Don\'t frown, don\'t fret; if we don\'t want armor, we can have a battle pet!', 'OooOOOooo! I\'m the Ghost of Winter Veil Future! If you play nice, play fair, we\'ll buy ourselves new armor to wear! Don\'t frown, don\'t fret; if we don\'t want armor, we can have a battle pet!', 100579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n! Uh oh... is this the time we go to an inn, and you want help cheating at Hearthstone? Shame on us!', 'Hey $n! Uh oh... is this the time we go to an inn, and you want help cheating at Hearthstone? Shame on us!', 100578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long, $n! I hope I get back to the right timeline. Chromie explains how it works, but we\'ll get confused.', 'So long, $n! I hope I get back to the right timeline. Chromie explains how it works, but we\'ll get confused.', 100577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, $n! Say, do you think bronze dragons get any free time? Get it? Free time? They can time travel! Tough crowd.', 'Good to see you, $n! Say, do you think bronze dragons get any free time? Get it? Free time? They can time travel! Tough crowd.', 100576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the help. I\'m gonna lie down. Not feelin\' so hot.', 100575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks, $n. I\'ll be back when this whole thing blows over.', 100574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to go, but it\'s vital that you remember to-', 'I have to go, but it\'s vital that you remember to-', 100573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time we\'re in Alterac Valley, whatever you do: DON\'T. CLICK. THE PORTAL.', 'Next time we\'re in Alterac Valley, whatever you do: DON\'T. CLICK. THE PORTAL.', 100572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is also your only way back. Find it and return to the Black Temple.', '', 100571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you later, $n! Remember, I used to be you. I still am, but I used to be, too.', 'See you later, $n! Remember, I used to be you. I still am, but I used to be, too.', 100570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every time you spend money repairing our gear, you\'re making it that much more difficult for me to buy Unclaimed Black Market Containers. Stay safe!', 'Every time you spend money repairing our gear, you\'re making it that much more difficult for us to buy Unclaimed Black Market Containers. Stay safe!', 100569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, $n, that transmogrification really is truly amazing! That is so amazingly amazing, I think I\'d like to use it.', 'Wow, $n, that transmogrification really is truly amazing! That is so amazingly amazing, I think I\'d like to use it.', 100568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can have this spot. I\'ll find a better one.', 'You can have this spot. I\'ll find a better one.', 100567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just about to leave, anyway.', 'I was just about to leave, anyway.', 100566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hunt where I want, and you won\'t stop me!', 'I\'ll hunt where I want, and you won\'t stop me!', 100565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one tells me what to do!', 'No one tells me what to do!', 100564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you\'re the one that should be leaving!', 'I think you\'re the one that should be leaving!', 100563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, why haven\'t you enchanted that item yet? We aren\'t going to replace it for a while, believe me.', '$n, why haven\'t you enchanted that item yet? We aren\'t going to replace it for a while, believe me.', 100562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n. No warnings this time. Just sayin\' hey.', 'Hey there, $n. No warnings this time. Just sayin\' hey.', 100561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, me, listen up. I\'ve got a warning for you! Us! I\'m in danger. I mean, we\'re in danger. I mean... I\'ve been in danger, and you\'re going to be in danger. Darn time travel...', 'Hey, me, listen up. I\'ve got a warning for you! Us! I\'m in danger. I mean, we\'re in danger. I mean... I\'ve been in danger, and you\'re going to be in danger. Darn time travel...', 100560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret telling me to leave!', 'You\'ll regret telling me to leave!', 100559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello and welcome to the Laughing Crane!', 100558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] $p, we advance on your mark.', '', 100557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Illidari, form up. Caria will not escape our wrath so easily.', '', 100556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... I can feel your will weakening.', 100555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-ASIRA DAWNSLAYER.blp:50:80|t$b[Kor\'vas Bloodthorn] Doomguard incoming from above!', 100554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varedis has shown me the true path. The Legion can make us strong once more!', 100553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 64681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will join you as soon as I am able.', 100552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wounds are severe. I fear you must push ahead alone.', 100551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been waiting long, $r?', '', 100549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to ask me twice.', 'You don\'t have to ask me twice.', 100548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hi. Hi. Hello. Hey. Hi. HI!', '', 100547, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there! We have some of the finest food you\'ll find anywhere.$b$bWe\'ve also a brand new brewery on the top floor. Try some of our new creations!', '', 100546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever since my husband came back we\'ve really been able to expand the place.$B$BWe\'ve even put in a brewery up top staffed by some of those nice monks from the temple!', 100545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get them off the barrier!', 100544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The barrier is being drained!', 100543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on!', 'Bring it on!', 100542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, is that you? Finally some good news!', 100541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This wouldn\'t have happened if your backside weren\'t so...<ahem>... GENEROUS.', 100540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the headbutt champ! You think a squishy thing like you can take me on? Hah! You make Jag laugh!', '', 100539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! It\'s good to see you again! Is there anything I can do for you?', '', 100538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, stranger? Can I help you?', 100537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be damned if any demon is ruinin\' my city. To arms, lads!', '', 100536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like the looks of them, mage. They smell of demon filth.', '', 100535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open the gates, Lord Saurfang. I have brought guests for the Warchief.', '', 100534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Caria left me for dead... the fool!', 100533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from that, outsider!', '', 100532, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ye dare say I look like me brother. I\'m clearly taller!', '', 100531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Legendary Leathers. How may I help you?', 100530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hide up here, Charles. We\'ll stop the demons!', 100529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all gonna die!', '', 100528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my healing, Archmage!', '', 100527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The intense magical currents here interfere with the mirror.', 'The intense magical currents here interfere with the mirror.', 100526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What that? It magic? Is it? Is it? Is it? Is it?', '', 100525, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! Pretty! You give?!', '', 100524, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! Hey! You find somethin\' good yet?!', '', 100523, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid box! Gimme dem shinies!', '', 100522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SMASH CHEST! BASH CHEST!', '', 100521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHHH!', '', 100520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 71617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the patience of an ancients.', 'You have the patience of an ancients.', 100519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After dealing with those troublesome Thistleleaf, I decided to venture into the ancient lands of Suramar.$B$BUnfortunately I came across these murlocs on my journey. I could not allow them to run about unchecked.', 100518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to the Murloc Shoals?', 'What brings you to the Murloc Shoals?', 100517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not leaving! This is my family\'s shop, and we\'ll defend it to the last!', 100516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool. Our curse will be your undoing...', '', 100515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cases are secure! Can\'t we evacuate, Tiffany?', '', 100514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Runes curse you. I will send you to the bottom of the sea where you belong!', '', 100513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yikes! What a mess! Gotta run to warn the others!', 'Yikes! What a mess! Gotta run to warn the others!', 100512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today just isn\'t my day. I should get going before I\'m put out for good!', 'Today just isn\'t my day. I should get going before I\'m put out for good!', 100511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy is my head throbbing! Thanks, $n! Be careful out here.', 'Boy is my head throbbing! Thanks, $n! Be careful out here.', 100510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sprites of the Lunawing Shallows were a thorn in my side, but these murlocs are absolutely the most ill-mannered creatures that I have ever had the displeasure of meeting.', 100509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re doing great, Olisarra!', 100508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to come to terms with it: Riverbend is destroyed. One day, we will rebuild our home. But for now we must wait and help Thunder Totem however we can, just as they help us.', '', 100507, 0, 48585, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
