('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-KERISTRASZA.BLP:50:80|t$b[Korialstrasz] You honored your promise to come, Highmountain. Do not fear my fire; it is demons who need fear my flames and your Eagle Spear.', '', 100421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
