('Mrr mrrgl? Mrglglgl.', '', 100346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrlrlrlrlrgl! Grglrgl!', '', 100345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrglrrgl?', '', 100344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 51, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a job for Murky in order to prove himself. Use his egg to mindmeld with Murky.', '', 100343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am using the Scythe of Souls to interrogate these demons, but they do not know anything about the location of the Sargerite Keystone.\n\nThey just keep repeating their loyalty to some queen.\n\nCyana and Jace have moved ahead. Unfortunately, I think Cyana got herself captured trying to help some of our other demon hunters.\n\nThere is something not quite right with her...', 100342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyana, Jace, Allari... find the keystone.', '', 100341, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 55144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'E\'rath omnas!', 100340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My strength is fading... we must find shelter...', 100339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such is the fate of nightborne who cannot drink of the Nightwell.', 100338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In-leva dathos. REUSE', 100337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure an enchanter like you will make good use of the Sentinel\'s essence.', 100335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archimonde the Defiler spent an eternity exposing the darkest tendrils of the arcane arts. Thousands of years, countless worlds\' knowledge and history are locked away within this tome\'s pages.$B$BNow we will tell your tale, $g milord:milady;.', '', 100333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot leave our post. If we look away for even a second, that weird guy in the murloc suit might do something insane. Thunder Totem will send relief when it is necessary. They haven\'t forgotten about us.', '', 100331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so sick of Scout Proudhill. All I want to do is go remind Thunder Totem that we\'re still out here! He refuses to let a single one of us leave our post. What could possibly be happening back home that\'s so important that they forgot about us?!', '', 100330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We were sent out here to keep an eye on the murlocs. They told us that they\'d send relief after a week... we\'ve been here for a month and seen no other tauren. I\'m getting sick of these two. They can\'t be near each other or they\'ll start bickering like an old married couple.', 100329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They sing of Huln\'s thirst to spill demonic blood.', '', 100328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some believe Huln\'s bloodlust was too strong.', '', 100327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps they were correct in their belief that Huln\'s love of fighting was too strong.', '', 100326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you have some useful goods.', 'I hear you have some useful goods.', 100325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me find my way?', 'Can you help me find my way?', 100324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skyhorn! Take to the air and show these harpies and their rocs the meaning of battle!', '', 100323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright Murky! Time for you to get big and strong!', '', 100322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t remember him killing THAT many demons. You\'re exaggerating, Spiritwalker.', '', 100321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This smoldering corpse is clutching a totem still wreathed with wind spirits.', '', 100320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln\'s prowess in combat was unmatched.', '', 100319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the call of Krasus, he defied the Legion and defeated many demons with the Eagle Spear.', '', 100318, 0, 37009, 0, 64, 0, 54789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huln was the strongest of champions and first of our tribe.', '', 100317, 0, 37009, 0, 64, 0, 54788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little farther before we fight, hero! I have a surprise for you...', '', 100316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This prey has quite a bite! Follow... if you dare!', '', 100315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Demons! In the mine! Look, I know we Venture Company haven\'t been easy competitors, but just this once, you gotta help us!', 100314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Prepfoot... we know! We have seen the future and will prepare until the time comes. We shall survive... nay, thrive!', '', 100313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely, you may think, the Alliance and Horde will take him down with their great airships. But his body will cause the earth to shake, and the oceans will rise up to swallow us all.', '', 100312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so I declare, Deathwing has not been defeated. He lays in wait for Azeroth\'s distraction. Soon he will return, flying over the world and spreading his destruction.', '', 100311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re no match for my pets!', '', 100310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strategy is flawless!', '', 100309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just aren\'t very good.', '', 100308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Okay?', '...Okay?', 100307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion? Hah! They are naught but a sign. Listen to my sermon.', '', 100306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrrrr....', '', 100305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How? My plan was foolproof!', '', 100304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My guide didn\'t say anything about this!', '', 100303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try again, if you dare!', '', 100302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Deathwing? You mean the Burning Legion?', '...Deathwing? You mean the Burning Legion?', 100301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What doesn\'t kill you makes you stronger!', '', 100300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanderer! Have you come to save your soul?\n\nIt will soon be upon us! The second coming! Deathwing is returning, and Azeroth will be destroyed! We must be prepared for the ocean to swallow the world!', '', 100299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take you to Helheim myself, \"hero\" of Azeroth!', '', 100298, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 60370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only one of us is coming out of this alive...  Wait...', '', 100297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be dead, but my pets are still kicking!', '', 100296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit your target fast. This thing is packed and will blow when it runs out of fuel!', 'Hit your target fast. This thing is packed and will blow when it runs out of fuel!', 100295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just remember, you\'re the \"smart\" part, so you gotta point this thing at the demons!', 'Just remember, you\'re the \"smart\" part, so you gotta point this thing at the demons!', 100294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In-leva dathos. REUSE', 100284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'REUSE', 100283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That will buy me some time...', 100282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE', '', 100281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rath-anu\'tanos!', 100280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand down, Erasmus! Can you not see that Elisande has forsaken us?!', 100279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE', '', 100278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REUSE', '', 100277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Narala ith\'el! <cough>  REUSE', 100276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The wounded satyr scowls at you as you approach. He doesn\'t have long to live.>$b$bHave you come to finish what your Archdruid started, $r? You mortals think you\'ve won... but Malfurion is in the Master\'s hands now.$b$bThat fool fell right into our trap... haha-HAHA...', '', 100274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This appears to be a plume from Malfurion\'s coat.$b$bSearching the area closely, you are able to make out a faint set of footprints heading southwest along the path.$b$bThese footprints differ from the cloven hooves of Satyr...', 'This appears to be a plume from Malfurion\'s coat.$b$bSearching the area closely, you are able to make out a faint set of footprints heading southwest along the path.$b$bThese footprints differ from the cloven hooves of Satyr...', 100273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pages have been ripped from their binding and scattered across the room. The inn appears as though it was hit by a cyclone.', 'The pages have been ripped from their binding and scattered across the room. The inn appears as though it was hit by a cyclone...$b$bThere are clear signs that a struggle took place here, but Malfurion is nowhere to be found.', 100272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throughout your trials, you have demonstrated strength, skill, and intellect-traits shared by the greatest of our vrykul kings. Now... you will face them in combat. Emerge victorious, and you may yet claim your prize!', '', 100271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'N\'eth narala. REUSE', 100269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Withered... I must be getting close.', 100268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reuse', '', 100267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reuse', '', 100266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ngh... need to keep moving.', 100265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reuse', '', 100264, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, be that way. I\'ll follow you around this whole city if I have to!', '', 100263, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope someone out there is listening...', 100262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reuse', 100257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ith\'nala kanesh!', 100256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something seems amiss, but... I cannot place it...', 100255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our finest casks will soon be on their way to Queen Azshara! She will be so pleased!', 100254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits of my dear friends have been entrusted to you. Keep them safe, enchanter.', 100253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My dear friends... what has become of them? Why does everything feel so... different?', 100252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a safe journey.', '', 100251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know how big the temple is? It takes weeks to finish! Please, listen to the message!', '', 100250, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, just give me a moment. Master Jang is going to make me paint the whole temple again if I don\'t deliver this!', '', 100249, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! I got to deliver this message!', '', 100248, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you going? Hey, got a message for you!', '', 100247, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n! Message for you from Grand Master Hight!', '', 100246, 0, 36340, 0, 64, 0, 62014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A storm is gathering...', 100245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just you wait...', 100244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_StaticShock:20|t%s starts to invoke a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193597|h[Static Nova]|h|r. Get out of the water!', 100243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I need to deliver this message fast! If I\'m late Master Jang is going to have me painting the temple again!', '', 100242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the victor go the spoils... The Aegis of Aggramar is yours for the taking.', '', 100240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot understand the Sentinel\'s song, $r? Then perhaps you will allow me to speak for him.', 100239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_SummonWaterElemental:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:193682|h[Beckon Storm]|h|r!', 100238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The waters rise...', 100237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no escape!', 100236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fry, landwalkers!', 100235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrrglrrgl!', '', 100234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pitiful.', 100231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too much to handle?', 100230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you feel the winds? They come for you...', 100228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Continue the ritual! I will handle these fools!', 100227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The corpse of this unfortunate earthen explorer has been shredded open. His entrails - which look like sand and pebbles - are spilled all over the floor. Traces of fel emanate from the gaping wounds.>', '', 100226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just point me in the right direction.', 100225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s next, $n?', 100224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Having fun? I am!', 100223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! Racking up the kills.', 100222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $n. We cannot assure safety to those who wander our lands in these dire times.', 'Be careful, $n. We cannot assure safety to those who wander our lands in these dire times.', 100221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I should be in command.', '', 100220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have some ideas for how to proceed.', '', 100219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies weep as the lands beneath suffer tremendous loss.', 'The skies weep as the lands beneath suffer tremendous loss.', 100218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gut tells me the keystone is up in that volcano.', '', 100217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Illidan places a lot of faith in you.', '', 100216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These intruders defile our sacred lands, slaughtering the innocent...$B$BWe will not stand for this!', 'These intruders defile our sacred lands, slaughtering the innocent...$B$BWe will not stand for this!', 100215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Earth Mother watches over us.', 'The Earth Mother watches over us.', 100214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you\'re leading us, $n.', '', 100213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll scout forward after this and find the keystone.', '', 100212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find the Sargerite Keystone.', '', 100211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should gather intel on their leaders.', '', 100210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are too many of them!', 100209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fel energy is everywhere. It\'s hard to resist.', 100208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Illidan chose you to lead. I follow.', 100207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did we bring enough of us?', 100206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Scythe of Souls will cut you down!', 100205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My scythe will compel them.', 100204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is the keystone, demon?', 100203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should capture and interrogate some of these demons.', 100202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vanquishers have already taken possession of it, Skovald, as was their right. Your protest comes too late.', '', 100200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can not allow the Legion to establish a foothold here. We need to close that portal down!', '', 100199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those were my husks, mortal! You will pay for depriving me of my property!', 'Those were my husks, mortal! You will pay for depriving me of my property!', 100198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chen, take the cubs as far away from this place as you can. $n, and I will stay and seal the portal. White Tiger walk with you, my friend.', '', 100197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought, $n, but we\'re not done yet.', '', 100196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was all thanks to this hero, who arrived just in time to help us out.', '', 100195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chen, I\'m glad to see you and the children are safe!', '', 100194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Master Hight, it\'s a relief to see you!', '', 100193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is infinite and all-knowing!', '', 100192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do they want with our small Villa?', 100191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion! Quickly, get inside! He\'ll have to blow the house down to get to us!', 100190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion shall prevail!', '', 100189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power is infinite!', '', 100188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, children, we must get to the temple. $n, I\'ll need your help. The complex is crawling with evil!', '', 100187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic mortals! The armies of the Legion will crush you!', '', 100186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jade Serpent watch over you, $n.', 100185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murky, we need you to get stronger! The fate of this coast depends on it!', '', 100184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion is a grave threat. We must find a way to stop their assault before all that we hold dear can be...', '', 100183, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 62030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
