('As a druid, the overgrowth in this area concerns me. As an herbalist, however, I couldn\'t be happier.', '', 100035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An honor to meet you, $n. Of course, I have your report right here.', '', 100034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I am. Kuhuine Tenderstride sent me to collect your felwort analysis.', 'Yes, I am. Kuhuine Tenderstride sent me to collect your felwort analysis.', 100033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... wouldn\'t happen to know how to get out of this crater, would you?', '', 100032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I\'m not lost - I\'m simply looking for rare herbs. I... wait, are you $n? The herbalist, $n?', '', 100031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet! I\'m listening to the plants.', '', 100030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, yes. Here it is. Nasty plant, that.', 100029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kuhuine Tenderstride sent me to collect your felwort analysis.', 'Kuhuine Tenderstride sent me to collect your felwort analysis.', 100028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you bring my analysis to Kuhuine? What did she say?', 100027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suspected I would find some sort of greenery if I followed Freya\'s trail, but I never expected anything like this!$b$bWhat can I do for you?', 100026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do I know you? What are you doing here?', 100025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must eliminate the Legion threat on this ridge so that you can bring the rest of our forces in from the Black Temple.', '', 100024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll cut a hole through the demons and meet you in the volcano.', '', 100023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard Lord Illidan. Let\'s find that keystone.', '', 100022, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 55248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Yes, I\'m good at swords. This is a two-handed sword. I bought it at the sword store.\"', '\"Yes, I\'m good at swords. This is a two-handed sword. I bought it at the sword store.\"', 100019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"OK, bye.\"', '\"OK, bye.\"', 100018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Why do I suspect that \'nowhere\' is the name of your majesty\'s private bedchamber?\"', '\"Why do I suspect that \'nowhere\' is the name of your majesty\'s private bedchamber?\"', 100017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Is that a gnome in your legplates, or is that two gnomes in your legplates?\"', '\"Is that a gnome in your legplates, or is that two gnomes in your legplates?\"', 100016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"That\'s a big sword you have there. Are you sure you know how to wield it?\"', '\"That\'s a big sword you have there. Are you sure you know how to wield it?\"', 100015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I am immune to your charms, outsider. Flattery will get you nowhere.\"', '\"I am immune to your charms, outsider. Flattery will get you nowhere.\"', 100014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I think you\'re cute.\"$b$bThe princess continued watching Lord Gravesbane\'s mouth, as if she expected more compliment to come out. As time wore on, it became clear that his utterance was indeed limited to only four words.$b$bOnce she fully realized it was her turn to speak, she replied...$b$b|cFF600000<How might the draenei princess have responded?>|r', '', 100013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"You look as beautiful as the two moons of Azeroth.\"$b$bThe faintest suggestion of a smile appeared on the edge of the blue-skinned monarch\'s mouth. She quickly suppressed it, lest Lord Gravesbane discover her true feelings. She replied quickly:$b$b|cFF600000<The next line is blank. How might the draenei princess have responded?>|r', '', 100012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn you, outsider! You\'ll never have the secrets of the shal\'dorei herbalists! I\'ll take them to my grave!', '', 100011, 0, 36203, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF600000<The story is started, but unfinished.>|r$b$bThe ever-eloquent Lord Gravesbane stepped into the royal chamber. Before him stood the draenei princess, widely-known for her beauty, grace, and biting wit.$b$bHe greeted the bejeweled princess with his most reliable compliment.$b$b|cFF600000<The next line is blank. What might Lord Gravesbane have said?>|r', '', 100010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I\'m hoping for some epic pants drops tonight.\"', '\"I\'m hoping for some epic pants drops tonight.\"', 100009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I think you\'re cute.\"', '\"I think you\'re cute.\"', 100008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"You look as beautiful as the two moons of Azeroth.\"', '\"You look as beautiful as the two moons of Azeroth.\"', 100007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I agree to fight alongside the Horde in Ashran. Send me there now!', 'Yes, I agree to fight alongside the Horde in Ashran. Send me there now!', 100006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras\'s keystone is the crux of my plan to defeat the Burning Legion.', '', 100005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A small pile of dried herbs litters the floor. These are not natural - they were placed here by someone... or something.>', '<A small pile of dried herbs litters the floor. These are not natural - they were placed here by someone... or something.>', 100004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She must have come this way. Keep looking!', '', 100003, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 67554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rath-domaas!', 100002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eagles of Highmountain are in danger of becoming extinct if the drogbar aren\'t stopped.', '', 100001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My watch has ended.', 100000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see you now...', 99999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not disturb... the Enduring.', 99998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not need sight to defeat you!', 99997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will see you dead before you reach the Enduring!', 99996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sight has waned, but my blade remains sharp!', 99995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed you, my watchers. The king will not return.', '', 99994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the king!', '', 99993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, my king. My vigilance... is broken.', '', 99992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not spoil the king\'s return!', '', 99991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will continue my watch for the king unabated!', '', 99990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the king\'s blade. I am the Enduring!', '', 99989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to the Gates of Valor.', 'Take me back to the Gates of Valor.', 99988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skovald may have escaped, but victory is still ours. His demons will no longer be able to plague Stormheim, thanks to you.\n\nLet us return to the gates, friend. I believe that Havi will wish to thank you.', '', 99987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place 20 fjarnskaggl at the foot of the cairn.>', '<Place 20 fjarnskaggl at the foot of the cairn.>', 99986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The ancient burial mound of a long-forgotten vrykul.>', '<The ancient burial mound of a long-forgotten vrykul.>', 99985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not allow Skovald to take these filth into the Halls of Valor!', '', 99984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repelled by a mystic force within Shattrath!', 'Repelled by a mystic force within Shattrath!', 99983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you prepared?', '', 99982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you, Bjorn.', 'I challenge you, Bjorn.', 99981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you, Haldor.', 'I challenge you, Haldor.', 99980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you, Ranulf.', 'I challenge you, Ranulf.', 99979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you, Tor.', 'I challenge you, Tor.', 99978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get lost, $r! There\'s an ale callin\' my name.', '', 99977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight alongside the Horde in battlegrounds, for now.', 'I will fight alongside the Horde in battlegrounds, for now.', 99976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem like the type that just wants a fight. If you\'re interested, the Horde needs more troops.', '', 99975, 0, 36754, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have strength, but lack speed!', '', 99974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try again, monster!', '', 99973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PLACEHOLDER - You\'re queued for the scenario. Ultimately we will push you directly into the scenario after this quest. For now, enjoy this exposition.]', 99972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
