('', '[PLACEHOLDER - In this quest we walk around the ship while I explain the mission.]', 99971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry.', 'Sorry.', 99970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, sir.', 'Sorry, sir.', 99969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, mister Stormstout.', 'Sorry, mister Stormstout.', 99968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense that we will have more battles ahead of us.$b$b<Jang glances over at the cubs.>$b$bAnd I\'ve got to get them out of here!', '', 99967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children! Behave yourselves!', '', 99966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the assistance, friend! That foul creature put up quite a fight!', '', 99965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yes, we just received a shipment the other day. I believe it\'s still upstairs if you want to go get it.', 99964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for some leather book cloth.', 'I\'m looking for some leather book cloth.', 99963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello! Are you interested in learning how to craft leather wares?', 99962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PLACEHOLDER - Did I say evil? I didn\'t mean that. Forget you heard anything. You are queued for the scenario. Now listen to this awesome exposition.]', 99961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[PLACEHOLDER - In this quest you walk around the boat with me while I explain my evil plan.]', 99960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die before you finish your last stroke!', '', 99959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall NOT finish what you have begun!', '', 99958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ARCANE... ENERGY...', 99957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'SEEK... MAGIC...', 99956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You meddle in affairs you do not understand, gnome!', '', 99955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Evan Banlip begins to whistle a grim tune.', '', 99954, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see if I can scrounge up a few more parts! We need every bit of help we can get.', '', 99953, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place the dreamleaf at the foot of the crystal.>', '<Place the dreamleaf at the foot of the crystal.>', 99952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The crystal emanates a sinister energy.>', '<The crystal emanates a sinister energy.>', 99951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THE STORM AWAKENS.', 99950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TEMPEST!', 99949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DROWN!', 99948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'CRUSH!', 99947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'TORN ASUNDER.', 99946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WASHED AWAY.', 99945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WATER... ETERNAL...', 99944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ALL WILL BE ERADICATED!', 99943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may take longer than expected. Salvaging the necessary parts for these is quite difficult!', '', 99942, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the top, Vethir!', 'Take me to the top, Vethir!', 99941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('God-King Skovald has been spotted at the top of the gates. \n\nWhen you are ready, we will take the fight to him!', '', 99940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! We did it, $n!', '', 99939, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaah!', '', 99937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo, champ! We\'ve been researchin\' and cataloguin\' day and night to make sure every bozo in this joint knows all there is to know about the one and only Grand Assassin $n.$B$BThere\'s only one of you, right?', '', 99932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms! Avenge me!', '', 99931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Bladewind! A warrior is attacking us!', '', 99930, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 60364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m almost finished, I swear.', '', 99929, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is looking pretty good so far. Don\'t stop now, $n.', '', 99928, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew, this is a lot harder than it looks.', '', 99927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just be ready in case anything happens, $n.', '', 99926, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alert, $n.', '', 99925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready when you are, Nicholo.', 'I\'m ready when you are, Nicholo.', 99924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Go here, Nicholo.\"$b$b\"Fetch me that, Nicholo.\"$b$bOne day I\'ll be giving the orders, I tell ya.', '', 99922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try not to be so conspicuous. Much more can be learned by observing than by engaging your enemy in combat.', 99919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, children! I\'ll protect you from this monster!', '', 99913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Over here!', '', 99910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think you could hit me with that?', '', 99907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost had me that time! Try again!', '', 99906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Swamprock murlocs\' favorite thing to do is cause shipwrecks with their makeshift lighthouse. Murlocs are fascinating, but these are ruthless.\n\nWe must save this coast! I have been raising this young murloc, Murky. We need to help him become stronger so he can teach the tadpoles to be better than their elders.', '', 99905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin the ritual.', 'I\'m ready to begin the ritual.', 99904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it you seek, $c?', '', 99903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No good! We don\'t have time to fight our way through that horde!', 99901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must retrieve an artifact from Tideskorn Harbor.', 'I must retrieve an artifact from Tideskorn Harbor.', 99900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get my point?', '', 99899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, nowhere to hide!', '', 99898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was for Athissa.', '', 99897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like fish in a net.', '', 99896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless. All of you!', '', 99895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stop.... the storm...', '', 99894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Get out of the way!', '', 99893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hatecoil, drown them out!', '', 99892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
