('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Spear_07:20|t%s targets you with an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191977|h[Impaling Spear]|h|r! Get behind someone!', '', 99873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Master Hight... <gasp> Grand Master Hight! A giant... THING appeared in the sky!', '', 99872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!!', '', 99871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let this $c scare you away, Darahir! Wait... come back!', '', 99870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Darahir, my friend! Come have a drink!', '', 99869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Placeholder Event] - Sylvanas welcomes you to the Horde.', '[Placeholder Event] - Sylvanas welcomes you to the Horde.', 99868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Placeholder Event] - Anduin welcomes you to the Alliance.', '', 99867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world will crumble into ashes.', '', 99866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Resistance only delays the inevitable!', '', 99865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the avatar of your destruction!', '', 99864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for your own demise!', '', 99863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your doom awaits.', '', 99862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are but the beginning of the tide.', '', 99861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have watched many of your kind walk the path of life, but none have carried themselves with a stride such as yours.$B$BI look forward to telling your story.', '', 99860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is the last standing. It, too, will be purged.', '', 99859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will temper my differences for now. The enemy is nearly at our doorstep, and we will be more effective united as one.', '', 99858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was difficult, but I\'ve managed to gather some weapons and supplies. What do you need?', 99857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, $r, I\'ll send the supplies to the enchanting shop. Now leave me to drink in peace!', '', 99856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For years we were shunned, banished to the darkest depths of the world by the Wardens. \n\nNow, we must rise to the hardest challenge our world has ever faced. Now, we must defend Azeroth against its greatest enemies.', 99855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve already ruined my business. Can\'t you just leave me alone?', '', 99854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These beasts are quite feisty, unless you know how to deal with them. This one should listen to your commands... for a little while, at least.', '', 99852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are almost to the exit, $n. Our freedom is near.', '', 99851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Jailer\'s Shard to break Vethir\'s prison.', 'Use the Jailer\'s Shard to break Vethir\'s prison.', 99850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for ascension is upon you. Prepare yourselves; Odyn awaits your arrival.', 99849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fel circle is similar to the ones used in Skovald\'s attempts to enslave the Thorignir dragons of Thorim\'s Peak. $B$BIt appears to be too powerful to break by normal means.', '', 99848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chen Stormstout was teaching a class of youngsters when the attack began. He\'s one of the strongest monks I know, but even he won\'t be able to hold out forever. Come, we must rescue them!', 99847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dargrul didn\'t just steal a hammer, he shattered our people, driving a wedge between our tribes.', 99846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our last High Chieftain, Ulan, tried to stop him and was slain. Mayla may have picked up her father\'s totem, but she is not High Chieftain yet.', 99845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When Dargrul stole the Hammer of Khaz\'goroth he did so right in front of myself and the other chieftains.', 99844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in danger here. Grand Master Hight needs everyone to gather at the Shrine of the Ox.', 'You\'re in danger here. Grand Master Hight needs everyone to gather at the Shrine of the Ox.', 99843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Most of the roster entries are blank. There is a sloppily written note on the corner of one of the drafts.>$B$BDamn these mists to Helheim! Not long after they arrived, many of my craftsmen have vanished, and the few that remain have not the sense in their head to work. They act as if they had run headlong into the mast.$B$BHow am I supposed to get Sten\'s ship ready to sail with a sparse bunch of loons at my disposal?$B$BI will do what I can to get the ship seaworthy, alone if I must, but I need good men to fill my work roster.', '', 99841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<There is a note attached to a supply requisition.>$B$BHarbor Master Kjell,$B$BI do not know what foul bane these mists carry, but barely a day after they engulfed the harbor, our entire stock of provisions spoiled. We need to resupply our stock immediately.$B$BDispatch Captain Sten on a supply run as soon as he is able, assuming he can stop his crew from bickering long enough to set sail.$B$BIn the meantime, we will all have to tighten our belts and stretch what little we have left. Since most of the town has gone missing, this shouldn\'t be too difficult.', '', 99840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A curse has fallen upon our harbor.$B$BGulls drop like stones from the sky. I saw one fall on a deck hand\'s head the other day. It knocked him out cold.$B$BSchools of fish rot belly-up in the shoals. Our fishermen have not had a decent catch in weeks and the stench of dead fish is horrible.$B$BI have taken on extra shifts in the tower, as most of my watchmen have gone missing. I take respite up here, as the foul odor and stale air are not as stifling.$B$BThe harbor is dead. The mists have choked the very life from it.', 99839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, friend! My students died to protect these scrolls. Centuries of history could have been lost!', 99838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck to all of you. I will get the rest of us up there, $n.', 99837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you made it through!', '', 99836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make the Illidari Foothold your home.', 'Make the Illidari Foothold your home.', 99835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe it\'s best that I stay here in the foothold. I still haven\'t recovered from my wounds when I was held prisoner down below.\n\nThis world is overflowing with demonic energy. It\'s making it harder for me to contain my own fel power.', '', 99834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give up! You only strike at the wind!', 99833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Away with you, monster!', 99832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your foul magic is in vain, monster! These writings are under my protection.', 99831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have accomplished the impossible. I must admit, I had my doubts about your leadership, $n. But no more.\n\nLet\'s get back and put an end to the attack on the Black Temple. Lord Illidan awaits.', '', 99830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry. Kayn has already launched the attack on Tyranna.', 99829, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 55095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mists are having an ill effect on my crew. They have become wild and uncontrollable. They care not for the sea and prefer to bicker and brawl with each other.$B$BKjell, the harbor master, has ordered us to depart for fresh supplies as soon as we are able. I have assigned extra duties in hopes that the work will occupy their time until we ship out.$B$BI can only hope that the sea air will calm my crew and return their vigor.', '', 99828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The keystone was entrusted to me by Sargeras himself. You will not have it!', 99827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! You and your demon hunters are nothing.', 99826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push them back! Don\'t let them take yer brothers and sisters!', '', 99825, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
