('So much energy... We\'ve got to stay here and ensure the Demons can take no more from this crater. Keep up the fight!', 'So much energy... We\'ve got to stay here and ensure the Demons can take no more from this crater. Keep up the fight!', 99823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
