('Well timed, champion. We have cleared a path to Dargrul. This way...', '', 99798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, how I\'ve longed for this!', 99797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
