('We will destroy the Burning Legion.', '', 99731, 0, 36090, 0, 64, 0, 55037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battlelord sent me.', '', 99730, 0, 36090, 0, 64, 0, 55036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battlelord sent me.', '', 99729, 0, 36089, 0, 64, 0, 55035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empower: 1x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_OFFHAND_PVEALLIANCE_D_01.BLP:20|t|Hitem:129094|h|cFF0070DD Nightwell Ambrosia|r|h', 'Empower: 1x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_OFFHAND_PVEALLIANCE_D_01.BLP:20|t|Hitem:129094|h|cFF0070DD Nightwell Ambrosia|r|h', 99728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told ya what ya wanted to know. Ain\'t that enough?$b$bDon\'t exactly want to draw attention to myself here...', '', 99727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Voila! Finished.', '', 99726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And for the final touch, just a bit of magic and...', '', 99725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fish pigment really is something. I should start selling it...', '', 99724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THEY THREW AWAY A... errr... I mean, let\'s see what I can do with these.', '', 99723, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are the cards you wanted.', 'Here are the cards you wanted.', 99722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My underking, this one still lives.', '', 99721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough. I\'m moving back to Moa\'ki Harbor the first chance I get.', '', 99720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a word with you, Belamy.', 'I want a word with you, Belamy.', 99719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll inform Ildine that you tried to cheat her.', 'I\'ll inform Ildine that you tried to cheat her.', 99718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, okay! You called my bluff. I\'ll tell you what you want to know, tough $Gguy:gal;.$b$bI sold the enchanting supplies to a fence up in Dalaran. Grimbore, Boargrim... somethin\' orcish like that.$b$bNow beat it, will ya? I\'ve got a customer on the way.', '', 99717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Threaten Belamy.>', '<Threaten Belamy.>', 99716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick tip on bribes, $r: make sure you actually have the money before you make the offer. Now get out of my sight, unless you\'re looking for a room in Violet Hold!', '', 99715, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I know that people are fighting out there. My guards are simply... taking a break.$b$b<Raethan lowers his voice to a whisper:>$b$bYou want us back on duty? Come back in a few minutes, and bring some Sightless Eyes with you.', '', 99714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re thinking about bribing me, think again. I have a duty to keep these sewers safe!$b$b<Raethan lowers his voice to a whisper:>$b$bCome back in a few minutes and we\'ll talk, $c.', '', 99713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Ildine I got a better offer. Now scram, before I have to get rough!', '', 99712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ildine sent me. Where\'s the shipment you owe her?', 'Ildine sent me. Where\'s the shipment you owe her?', 99711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah? So what do you want? I\'m tryin\' to do business here!', '', 99710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Vanessa!', '', 99709, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I lost the obliterum.', 99708, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem to be on good terms with Khadgar - maybe you should ask him, $n.', '', 99707, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll need permission from the ruling council of Dalaran before we can build a forge big enough to create obliterum en masse.', '', 99706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you even trying?', 99705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe use your good pets.', 99704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you AFK?', 99703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What the heck is wrong with you?!', 99702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seriously?!?', 99701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aw, come on!', 99700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take it!', 99699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t tell anyone, ok?', 99698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve already lost two sisters to the demons. You want to investigate that cart? It\'s all yours.', 99697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring it on!', 99696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, me bein\' all hidden ain\'t enough of a clue that I wanna be left alone?$b$bGet lost, if ya know what\'s good for ya!', '', 99695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'My husband says I battle too much.  What does he know?', 99694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That went better than expected. Yes, this pigment WILL work out nicely.', '', 99693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I too would like to experiment with this pigment. Let\'s see here...', '', 99692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you in there, Okuna. Did you think you could kill my father and get away with it?', '', 99691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody! Anybody! Help!!!', '', 99690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can escape... Helya\'s grasp...', '', 99689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, hero! Follow us, and we\'ll help you take down these demons!', 'Come on, hero! Follow us, and we\'ll help you take down these demons!', 99688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hack ye in two!', '', 99687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in the choking tides!', '', 99686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer soul belongs to Helya now, worm!', '', 99685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 99684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, you made it! Defeat Helya and I will set these souls free!', '', 99683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, rest your weary soul on a feathery bed.', '', 99682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want this shan ronir to tell the others. Tell them their doom will come once I master this hammer.', '', 99681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54278, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of the Dark Lady!', '', 99680, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... my village. It is gone.', 99679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you champion. But be careful, the drogbar Underking wields a tool of the titans.', '', 99678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed Ancient Mana |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t x100', 'Feed Ancient Mana |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t x100', 99677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spend |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_OFFHAND_PVEALLIANCE_D_01.BLP:20|t|Hitem:129094|h|cFF0070DD Nightwell Ambrosia|r|h to Empower this Nightfallen?', 'Spend |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_OFFHAND_PVEALLIANCE_D_01.BLP:20|t|Hitem:129094|h|cFF0070DD Nightwell Ambrosia|r|h to Empower this Nightfallen?', 99676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion has begun its invasion of our world. From sea to shore, brave defenders of the Alliance and Horde are answering the call to arms.\n \nHowever, they will ultimately fail without the aid of the demon hunters. You were uniquely trained as ruthless weapons against the Legion. It is time to go on the offensive.', '', 99675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed: 100x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 'Feed: 100x |TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\INV_MISC_ANCIENT_MANA.BLP:20|t|Hcurrency:1155|h|cFFFFFFFF Ancient Mana|h|r', 99674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold your defenses! I\'m headed your way!', 99673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve regained control of Southpoint Gate! I\'m sending ground patrols toward Tarren Mill!', 99672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The balloon\'s patched up, but I left a parachute in there just in case! At least, I think I did.', 'The balloon\'s patched up, but I left a parachute in there just in case! At least, I think I did.', 99671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big pile of bombs for ya. Make sure they land on the demons, ok?', 'Big pile of bombs for ya. Make sure they land on the demons, ok?', 99670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Battlelord, report!', '', 99669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful givin\' it gas. The tanks are a bit creaky!', 'Be careful givin\' it gas. The tanks are a bit creaky!', 99668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our assault is underway. I\'ll join in when you attack the overseer.', 99667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve encountered heavy resistance near the Soul Engine.', 99666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captains, report!', '', 99665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, champion.', '', 99664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the fight to \'em! Demons will burn by Horde might!', 'Take the fight to \'em! Demons will burn by Horde might!', 99663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spikes... big rocks... everything looks ok. Smash those Demons good!', 'Spikes... big rocks... everything looks ok. Smash those Demons good!', 99662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s a bit rough on the stick. Be careful goin\' downhill boss.', 'This one\'s a bit rough on the stick. Be careful goin\' downhill boss.', 99661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once that witch is defeated I can free the stolen souls of the valejar.', '', 99660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya is defeated; it is time to call in the val\'kyr!', '', 99659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon hunters, Azeroth needs your help.', '', 99658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57364, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Archmage Khadgar, leader of the Kirin Tor.', '', 99656, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57302, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it, Illidari! FREEDOM IS OURS!', '', 99653, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 57363, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive you have made it this far, demon hunters. Now, I will extinguish your souls like a candle\'s flame!', '', 99652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Helya will surely reward me for this offering.', '', 99651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! I can feel the power coursing through me!\n\nI am whole again.', 99650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 67379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightwell is a font of incredible power. We must not allow the Legion to make use of it.', 99649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Thalyssra is shaking uncontrollably and can barely speak. |cFFF92304Her hunger must be sated before all else.|r>', 99648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we stand at an impasse. $n, you must resolve this conflict.', '', 99647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I respect our past, but I cannot forgive Illidan\'s methods. The Illidari deserve a better leader.', '', 99646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving. The others are in the chamber just ahead.', 99645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a disaster... but we can win this! Keep the tanks rolling. Keep our birds in the air. The world won\'t end without tasting some Gnome ingenuity!', 99644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eagle nods his thanks before flying away, free.', '', 99643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe he\'s gone...', 99642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, Champion. I will rally what forces I can to assault the drogbar stronghold to our south. Meet me at the cavern\'s mouth when you are ready.', '', 99641, 0, 36058, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth depends on us fighting in the skies. Stay strong, for all of us.', 'Azeroth depends on us fighting in the skies. Stay strong, for all of us.', 99640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in this together, ok? You\'re doing great up there! We\'re gonna make it.', 'We\'re in this together, ok? You\'re doing great up there! We\'re gonna make it.', 99639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to stay sharp. Too much is riding on us, and we\'re going back up soon.', 'We\'ve got to stay sharp. Too much is riding on us, and we\'re going back up soon.', 99638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m exhausted... I don\'t know if I can take another flight today.', 'I\'m exhausted... I don\'t know if I can take another flight today.', 99637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always wanted to fly... but not during the end of the world.', 'I always wanted to fly... but not during the end of the world.', 99636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three hours in the air is too much. We need more pilots!', 'Three hours in the air is too much. We need more pilots!', 99635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me!', 'Thank you for saving me!', 99634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to defend the temple!', 'We need to defend the temple!', 99633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the light of Elune, thank you!', 'By the light of Elune, thank you!', 99632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a reason why Taurson is the best! Keep training!', '', 99631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, I thought I was going to die!', 'Thanks, I thought I was going to die!', 99630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winning isn\'t that bad. You should all try it sometime!', '', 99629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mix \'em up, mix \'em up! C\'mon now!', '', 99628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knead with your fists, not your face!', '', 99627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soulkeeper Uriah exhales tiredly as the last bit of breath leaves his lifeless body.', '', 99626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can, Rosalyn, and you will. You\'re more gifted than you let yourself believe.', '', 99625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... but I don\'t know how, Uriah. I cannot do it without you!', 99624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This platform will take you into the sacred Hall of Chieftains where Mayla Highmountain awaits you.', '', 99623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54291, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m still in training, Mac. But I\'m going to win my belt back from you!', '', 99622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flummox no need pets! Flummox eats them NOW!', '', 99621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle!', '', 99620, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha! Now we show them our true power!', '', 99619, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! You have little creatures! Let\'s fight, and if I win I get to EAT one!', '', 99618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the rescue. I will see if any of the other warbraves survived the attack.', '', 99617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Soul Engine.', '', 99616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them before they can get up to the Fel Hammer.', '', 99615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be ours.', '', 99614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Open the wells and unleash a torrent of souls on him.', 99613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have precious little time to waste. Speak or leave.', 99612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soulkeeper Uriah takes a slow, pained breath.', '', 99611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am beyond saving, Rosalyn. You need to focus on finding the demons that have been released from the soul chambers and trap them once again, before it\'s too late.', '', 99610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $p. We are forever indebted to you.', '', 99609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, defeat them! I\'ll protect my son!', '', 99608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guuuaaaahhh!', '', 99607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s kick the tires and light the fires!', 'Let\'s kick the tires and light the fires!', 99606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be... careful... this is a... trap...', '', 99605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death from above is the best kind, wouldn\'t you agree? Give \'em hell!', 'Death from above is the best kind, wouldn\'t you agree? Give \'em hell!', 99604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loaded with munitions and ready to hit \'em hard. Fly safe!', 'Loaded with munitions and ready to hit \'em hard. Fly safe!', 99603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything!', 'Everything!', 99602, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What must we give in return?', 'What must we give in return?', 99601, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess that isn\'t so bad...', 'I guess that isn\'t so bad...', 99600, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few tons of Gnomeregan\'s finest anti-Demon engineering! Put it to good use.', 'Just a few tons of Gnomeregan\'s finest anti-Demon engineering! Put it to good use.', 99599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ram on this one\'s supercharged. My handiwork! Bag a few demons for me!', 'The ram on this one\'s supercharged. My handiwork! Bag a few demons for me!', 99598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bring this back in one piece, ok? Go get \'em!', 'You bring this back in one piece, ok? Go get \'em!', 99597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, champion, to Thunder Totem. In better days we would have warriors from the Bloodtotem tribe or eagle riders from the Skyhorn tribe. Today, we are so few we could barely keep a kobold out.', '', 99596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54290, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
