('', 'Beware, $n. There is a dreadlord inside that Soul Engine.', 99574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well that was terrifying. Thanks for helping, $p. Maybe I should find a demon hunter partner...', 99573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a bad feeling about this.', '', 99572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something about this doesn\'t seem right.', '', 99571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He went easy on you, outsider. Come, speak.', '', 99570, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail champion.$b$bI was sent by the High Chieftain Ulan to find you.', '', 99569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are not what they seem, $n. I suggest keeping a close eye on those around you.', '', 99568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready!', 'I\'m ready!', 99567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
