('Sylvanas has instructed me to take ALL of your heads! And I WILL deliver.', '', 99564, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! These treacherous creatures know NOTHING of war!', '', 99563, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this be a lesson to all who invade OUR lands!', '', 99562, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might of the Legion? Hah! We\'ll see about that...', '', 99561, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay stop! STOP! Watch the jaw! You win! I\'ve never seen such speed before. You\'re a good kid, mac. Keep it up. I\'ll be back for my belt some day.', '', 99560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should wear a helmet when you fight me!', '', 99559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can match the strength of my fists?', '', 99558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your experience doesn\'t match mine!', '', 99557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna charge right over you!', '', 99556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not summon you for nothing. Destroy them!', '', 99555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! My colossal infernal will crush you.', '', 99554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve discovered an exciting new way to extract demonic essence from our crafted armor, but to do so, we need your permission to build a forge.', 'We\'ve discovered an exciting new way to extract demonic essence from our crafted armor, but to do so, we need your permission to build a forge.', 99553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed our own people! You spit in the face of our sacrifices!', '', 99552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could only trust my own sight, brother. Lord Illidan was becoming no better than our enemy.', '', 99551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Illidan taught us to fight and to persevere. Together, we destroyed countless demons. YOU chose the coward\'s path.', '', 99550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop this foolish bickering. We do not have time for this!', 99549, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 57295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gargoyles lift off from their pressure plates and the portcullis slams shut!', '', 99548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How mysterious. Very well! Archmage Karlain will assist you, $n.', '', 99546, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps better you didn\'t know, sir.', '', 99545, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? Who?', '', 99544, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually, Khadgar, I believe I may know someone that can build this forge. An expert.', '', 99543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, but your request has been den--', '', 99542, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. You of all people should know that dealing with this type of power carries great danger, demon hunter. I cannot allow it in my city.', '', 99541, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. Our artisans lack the skills to build such a forge. The dangers of toying with demonic powers are simply too great.', '', 99540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot recommend this, Khadgar. Our knowledge of demonic forces is limited. We risk attracting the attention of the Legion, or worse.', 99539, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it\'s a start.', '', 99538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'About two grains. Two grains of obliterum.', 99537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
