('', 'This is sheer madness! The Wardens have lost control of their prison.', 99531, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 57323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the Warden. We are the only ones who can defeat the Legion. We MUST survive this place.', '', 99530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A demon?! I\'m not that kind of hunter! I\'M NOT THAT KIND OF HUNTER!', 99529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He made the hard choices. He sacrificed EVERYTHING. What did you give?', '', 99528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You followed Illidan blindly, like a dog. Even when he lost his way.', '', 99527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was fighting it, as we all do. He needed us to have faith in him, Altruis.', '', 99526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After ten-thousand years of imprisonment, Illidan succumbed to the fel energy within. When he was freed, he was not in his right mind.', '', 99525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not speak to me of old times, Altruis. You betrayed Illidan. You betrayed us all!', '', 99524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
