('Is it a SCROLL?', '', 99448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Powder\'s not really my thing, kid. I\'m more of an \"inks and scrolls\" kind of guy.$b$bNow, let\'s think this through logically:$b$bThis powder of yours... is it an INK?', '', 99447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know why your cart exploded into fel flames?', 'Do you know why your cart exploded into fel flames?', 99445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She was a fine cart, she was.$b$b<Caelen wipes a tear into his beard.>', '', 99444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not belong here! I wish to leave Helheim!', 'I do not belong here! I wish to leave Helheim!', 99443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya\'s massive presence looms in the distance from the platform. \n\nThis altar appears to be a means to communicate with her.', '', 99442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wasn\'t in my crates. I always do a thorough investigation of everything I buy, and I woulda\' noticed some glowy green stuff. Reminds me of enchanting dust. You should talk to the enchanters.', '', 99441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wasn\'t in my crates. I always do a thorough investigation of everything I buy, and I woulda\' noticed some glowy green stuff.', '', 99440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, what do you know about this powder?', 'Now, what do you know about this powder?', 99439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', '', 99438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re mine, eagle!', 99437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will soon be a roc!', 99436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FINE. I believe you.', 'FINE. I believe you.', 99435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spent the last eleven years huddled shoulder-to-shoulder in a humid, smelly auction house, trying to make a few silver off a crate o\' leather hats. I\'m not some demon-corrupted adventurer... I\'ve never even SEEN a demon. Hell, I can\'t even wield half the gear I sell.$b$b<Caelen looks at you through anguished tears. He is, by all external signs, telling the truth.>', '', 99434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Well, when you put it that way, I believe you.', 'Well, when you put it that way, I believe you.', 99433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop fighting, Skyhorn beast!', 99432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, that\'s what I\'m saying.', 'Yes, that\'s what I\'m saying.', 99431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Counterfeit receipts? Really?$b$bLet me say this out loud, \'cause I wanna get it straight in my head.$b$bYou\'re saying that I brought a bunch of demonic... SOMETHING... into Dalaran, lit it on fire, hung around while it burned, and then produced a bunch of counterfeit receipts in case anybody asked me questions?$b$bI\'m right about that, right? That\'s correct? That\'s your story?', '', 99430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see everything is on the up-and-up here. I believe you.', 'I see everything is on the up-and-up here. I believe you.', 99429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These look like counterfeit receipts.', 'These look like counterfeit receipts.', 99428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, here, look...$b$b<Caelen removes a pile of receipts from his pockets.>$b$bSee! All the stuff I bought, purchased legitimately from reputable Dalaran arms dealers.', '', 99427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe your story.', 'I believe your story.', 99426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your whole story is falling apart, Caelen.', 'Your whole story is falling apart, Caelen.', 99425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I spent every last copper I had on that cart full o\' gear! I mean it! I don\'t have any money to give you!', '', 99424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course not! I believe your story.', 'Of course not! I believe your story.', 99423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'m extorting you.', 'Yes, I\'m extorting you.', 99422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute... are you EXTORTING me?', '', 99421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just being thorough. I believe you.', 'Just being thorough. I believe you.', 99420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WANT to believe you, but you\'re not making it easy for me.', 'I WANT to believe you, but you\'re not making it easy for me.', 99419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know why you\'re so intent on questioning me. I just lost my cart and everything I own.', '', 99418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK, I believe you.', 'OK, I believe you.', 99417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your MULE? You\'ve got to be kidding me.', 'Your MULE? You\'ve got to be kidding me.', 99416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, me mule was there.', '', 99415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, I believe you.', 'Fine, I believe you.', 99414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were there any other witnesses to what happened?', 'Were there any other witnesses to what happened?', 99413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I\'m one of the good ones! I... I donated to charity, once! And I hardly ever litter!$b$bAnd I never, EVER undercut.', '', 99412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I believe you.', 'Very well. I believe you.', 99411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your kind. A dirty auction house speculator.', 'I know your kind. A dirty auction house speculator.', 99410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just an honest trader, just lookin\' to buy all the goods on the auction house, sell \'em back to the people at a much higher price, make my ten million gold, and go home in peace! Is that so much to ask?', '', 99409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe you.', 'I believe you.', 99408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I believe you?', 'Why should I believe you?', 99407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear, I don\'t know nothin\' about any demon flames! I was just buyin\' and sellin\' armor, is all!', '', 99406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Deathlord. I will not let you down.', '', 99405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $ct.  I need to go see Corvis about getting my armor repaired. By your leave, $gsir:ma\'am;.', '', 99404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here to waste time with the \"help,\" I must speak with the $ct at once.', '', 99403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you as well, but we can reminisce later. I must speak with the $ct at once.', '', 99402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, look who decided to show up. It\'s been a while since you\'ve been in the halls of Acherus.', 99401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You WILL be avenged, my love!', 99400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Convenient.', 99399, 0, 923, 153, 64, 0, 0, 53612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of earth, aid me!', '', 99398, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyone have any ideas how we\'re going to get across this thing?', 99397, 0, 923, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All da Horde, get ta Thrall!', '', 99396, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 53609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, across the chasm, Gul\'dan! He has Tirion!', '', 99395, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 53608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was too easy, something\'s wrong.', 99394, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 0, 53607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be retreatin\'.', '', 99393, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 53606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There were so many of them.', 'There were so many of them.', 99392, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61545, 69146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We couldn\'t stop them...', 'We couldn\'t stop them...', 99391, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61544, 69145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', 'I am in your debt.', 99390, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61543, 69144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am wounded, but I can move.', 'I am wounded, but I can move.', 99389, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61542, 69143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Tirion?', 'Where is Tirion?', 99388, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61541, 69142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see a friendly face.', 'It\'s good to see a friendly face.', 99387, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61540, 69141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were not prepared!', 'We were not prepared!', 99386, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61539, 69140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your aid.', 'Thank you for your aid.', 99385, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61538, 69139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am singed, but I can still fight.', 'I am singed, but I can still fight.', 99384, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61537, 69138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find Tirion.', 'We must find Tirion.', 99383, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61536, 69137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earth Mother... guide me...', 'Earth Mother... guide me...', 99382, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 70933, 70934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return... to the earth...', 'I return... to the earth...', 99381, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 70935, 70936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is... the end...', '', 99380, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness... calls...', '', 99379, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Earth Mother!', '', 99378, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take heart, heroes!', '', 99377, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the earth with you!', '', 99376, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll never bow to you.', 99375, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right to the face!', 99374, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s half of the city down, this is going better than expected.', 99373, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too easy.', 99372, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One shot, one kill.', 99371, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find him. Horde forces, keep your eyes open for survivors, rescue as many as you are able!', '', 99370, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An no sign of Tirion.', '', 99369, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead... dying... they descended on us in seconds... nowhere to run...', 'Dead... dying... they descended on us in seconds... nowhere to run...', 99368, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 61535, 69136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is Argent Crusade insignia, can you speak? Where is the rest of the Crusade?', 99367, 0, 923, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now we know how to destroy them. It\'s them or us. Let\'s get moving so we make sure it\'s not us.', 99366, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These structures rose from the ground in moments, spewing forth demons in the hundreds in the blink of an eye.', '', 99365, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This invasion is unlike any I have ever witnessed, and I don\'t think we\'ve seen the last of their surprises.', '', 99364, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that was invigorating. Now how did they manage to get so many demons here so quickly?', 99363, 0, 923, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break the crystals!', '', 99362, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard him, rangers, we cut those demons down! Fire a volley on my mark... NOW!', 99361, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those crystals again... if we can get close to them, we can bring this thing down.', '', 99360, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their reinforcements are endless!', '', 99359, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You looked like you could use a hand.', '', 99358, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time you showed up!', 99357, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move!', '', 99356, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re alive!', '', 99355, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nock your arrows! Hold! Fire!', 99354, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 0, 53567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s no invasion force. Dat\'s an army!', '', 99353, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 53566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 99352, 0, 923, 0, 70, 0, 53565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya, mon. Dis ain\'t da same Legion.', '', 99351, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re expanding faster than we\'ve seen before.', '', 99350, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas\' ship must \'av crashed just ahead.', '', 99349, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get movin\'.', '', 99348, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s only one way to the tomb, are you ready?', '', 99347, 0, 923, 6, 64, 0, 53560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t never gonna get used to you callin\' me dat.', '', 99346, 0, 923, 153, 64, 0, 53559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to fight with you again, Warchief.', '', 99345, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... will... return...', '', 99344, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master will mend my flesh again and again. You have not won. You cannot win. We are endless! We are Legion!', '', 99343, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like ya chose da wrong side.', '', 99342, 0, 923, 153, 64, 0, 53555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will know endless agony.', '', 99341, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpses will feed my hounds.', '', 99340, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felfire rains from the sky! Look out!', '', 99339, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all burn!', '', 99338, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus on the commander!', '', 99337, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna die just like all da others.', '', 99336, 0, 923, 397, 64, 0, 53549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings. Must I do everything myself? Very well, prepare yourselves!', '', 99335, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up! We almost got dem!', '', 99334, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You destroy but one of the master\'s endless instruments of your demise! INFERNO!', '', 99333, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two more ta go.', '', 99332, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... they must anchor it to this world.', '', 99331, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde, make for dem crystals! We gonna see if ya hunch is right.', '', 99330, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s something odd about the crystals surrounding that spire. They feel... wrong... like they\'re in two places at once. Hmm.', '', 99329, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep them away from the spires!', '', 99328, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them!', '', 99327, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, the fools attack!', '', 99326, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da Horde!', '', 99325, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one\'s mine.', '', 99324, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die.', '', 99323, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 99322, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements will destroy you!', '', 99321, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the Nether!', '', 99320, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be da end...', 'Dis be da end...', 99319, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 69130, 70941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da pain!', 'Da pain!', 99318, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 69129, 70942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not... going to make it...', 'Not... going to make it...', 99317, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 70943, 69117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return... to the elements...', 'I return... to the elements...', 99316, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 70944, 69116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up! Dere\'s only one way offa dis beach, and it be t\'rough alla dose demons ahead of us. But dey don\'t know who dey be dealin\' wit. Let\'s show dem what it means ta be Horde!', '', 99315, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s only one way out of this one, old friend.', '', 99314, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good ting! We don\'t got much beach left ta retreat to.', '', 99313, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like our reinforcements have arrived.', '', 99312, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing we can do! The ridge is lost! Horde forces, if you value your lives, cut a path through to the shore! We have to get out of here, or there won\'t be anyone left to fight!', 99311, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are so many of them...', 99310, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varian, behind us!  The Horde is gone!', 99309, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will defeat you, just as we always have.', '', 99307, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see now, human? The fate of this world is sealed. The Legion cannot be stopped.', '', 99306, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And burn it to a husk.', '', 99305, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 53518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To conquer this puny world.', '', 99304, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 53517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We return.', '', 99303, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 53516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, Alliance!', '', 99302, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now you will fall.', '', 99301, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 53514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many demons you throw at us, we will cut you down, monster.', '', 99300, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 53513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone pull back to me! We make our stand here!', 99299, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are... too many of them!', '', 99298, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin! Pull him back! Keep your lines steady! We have to hold!', 99297, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even more demons be pouring from dat portal. Get ready!', '', 99295, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shelds up, here they come!', 99294, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the end of your pitiful world, Wrynn. You will perish in felfire, like ten thousand worlds before your own. The legion is ENDLESS.', '', 99293, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 53506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Less chatting, Wrynn. Kill him already!', 99292, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never fall to you, Gul\'dan. The combined forces of Azeroth will triumph today.', '', 99291, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 53504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pull Baine back to my position, close ranks!', 99290, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot... take much more of this...', '', 99289, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 53502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take up positions. We hold them off. We have to.', 99288, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to hold dis ridge, no matter da cost.', '', 99287, 0, 923, 396, 64, 0, 53500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down the ridge behind us, another portal!', '', 99286, 0, 923, 5, 64, 0, 53499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold steady, we\'ve broken their lines before, we will again. Charge!', '', 99285, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run? Ha. You are right, human. There is nowhere to run from my master.  Now, witness the true might of Lord Sargeras!', '', 99284, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 53497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere to run, Gul\'dan. Give up now, and I will grant you a swift death.', '', 99283, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 53496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you.', '', 99282, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 53495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck, Varian.', 99281, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas, thank you.', '', 99280, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 53493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll take the ridge and cover your flank.', 99279, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, across the chasm!', '', 99278, 0, 924, 5, 64, 0, 53491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No time to gloat, Wrynn. We\'ve got to stop Gul\'dan before he summons another one of those things!', 99277, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 53490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, the bigger they are...', '', 99276, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 53489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got him this time! All forces, concentrate your fire!', '', 99275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All yours, Alliance.', 99274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
