('Spirits... hear my call...', '', 99123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help the others!', '', 99122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha-hah!! You are a champion in the making!', '', 99121, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 60546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Master has not won yet.', '', 99120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take to your knees, and my Master may yet be merciful.', '', 99119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is where you insects crawled!', '', 99118, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
