('I knew yer crap bird was too slow.', '', 99116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They followed us here!', 99115, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 60551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 99114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see? It\'s working. This world will fight for itself if we give it the tools to do so.', '', 99113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just needs a little... boost. Shaman, can you help?', '', 99112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This thing has sat useless for ten thousand years.', '', 99110, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion destroys us in the open fields. Even Thunder Bluff isn\'t safe from the Infernals.', 99109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shush, you! Dis wood be wet and me hands be shakin\'.', '', 99108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What kind of a shaman can\'t light a fire?', 99107, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 60560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Highlands are completely overrun. The clan is scattered.', 99106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 60550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye, shaman.', '', 99105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help her! She\'s fadin\' fast!', '', 99104, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 60539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are ancient safeguards here. We must use them.', '', 99103, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will come for us.', '', 99100, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need weapons capable of overcoming the Legion.', '', 99097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, we must strike back. But how?', '', 99096, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 60554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman! I have an urgent message.', '', 99095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, my naga are trapped by a nearby pit lord.', 99094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks. Come, my brothers... back to the battle!', 99093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible!', '', 99092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inhabitants of Tarren Mill have been inspired to join the fight against the Legion!', '', 99091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
