('How do I obtain spooky supplies and merry supplies?', 'How do I obtain spooky supplies and merry supplies?', 99089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chief is expecting you down in the cave, Rivermane.', 'The chief is expecting you down in the cave, Rivermane.', 99088, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s Torok?', '', 99087, 0, 36914, 6, 64, 0, 54762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raethan, call back your guards.\n\n[Cost: 50 |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_kirintor_offensive.blp:12|t Sightless Eyes]', 'Raethan, call back your guards.\n\n[Cost: 50 |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_kirintor_offensive.blp:12|t Sightless Eyes]', 99086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raethan, call off your guards.\n\n[Cost: 50 |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_kirintor_offensive.blp:12|t Sightless Eyes]', 'Raethan, call off your guards.\n\n[Cost: 50 |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_kirintor_offensive.blp:12|t Sightless Eyes]', 99085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar and his \"council\" may rule the roost above, but down here? My men and I run the show.$b$bI don\'t want to see any funny business while you\'re in my sewer, $r. That is, of course, unless you could convince me to look the other way...', '', 99084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sewer guards! Return to your posts!', '', 99083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sewer guards, time to take a break!', '', 99082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What juicy little morsels you will make.', 99081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re free to try, demon hunter.', 99080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, we\'ll kill the brood queen and take the Sargerite Keystone.', '', 99079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Intruders on the Fel Hammer!', 99078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it. Our forces have gained the upper hand.', '', 99077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See if there are others around the fortress.', '', 99076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That device you just destroyed helps stabilize the Legion\'s buildings.', '', 99075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You saved those Illidari from a fate worse than death.', 99074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soul harvesters are a vile Legion creation.', 99073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ask that you honor our pact and come to their aid.', 99072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot have them. They are mine!', '', 99071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...', 99070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me dear, have you considered joining us?', 99069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How droll. Even from up here, I can sense your uncertainty.', 99068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s YOU who won\'t survive, demon witch!', 99067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d look forward to us meeting, but you will not survive.', 99066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I commend you on a good start. However, your forces are already wavering.', 99065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way... and keep your head down. If those wyrmtongue catch a whiff of my concoctions they\'re sure to come running. Damn scavengers.', '', 99064, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, allow me to repay you.', '', 99063, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep pondering on how we can improve our leystone techniques, $n. Your training isn\'t done yet.', '', 99062, 0, 33133, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Our anchoring crystals are destroyed? I will flay the flesh from your bones, mortals!', 'What is this? Our anchoring crystals are destroyed? I will flay the flesh from your bones, mortals!', 99061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare to assault Sargeras\' legion head-on? Come then, mortals, and face me!', 'You dare to assault Sargeras\' legion head-on? Come then, mortals, and face me!', 99060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug zug.', '', 99059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something need doing?', '', 99058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh what a lovely day!', '', 99057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood will rain from the sky!', 99056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feast on their eyes my beauties!', 99055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will fall like all the others!', 99054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Highmountain!', 99049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caww! $p! $p!', '', 99048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Skyhorn are nothing without their eagles!', 99047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brul, you saved us from the Bloodtotem, so now I stand with Highmountain.$b$bWhile we Stonedark are no match for Dargrul\'s fighters in open combat, we do have other ways to help defeat your enemy.', '', 99046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t be forgettin\' that hunt anytime soon! \n\nI don\'t know if we could\'ve taken that beast down without you and Addie.', '', 99045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hemet only allows those with exceptional hunting skills to join his hunting party.', 99044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve more than proven your worth. It was an honor to hunt beside you and Addie.', 99043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I await your orders, Skylord.', '', 99042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I await your orders, Skylord. Now to explore this place!', 99041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d have better luck teaching a boar to fly than trying to teach a gnome to hunt.', '', 99040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elevator will be here shortly. The others are waiting for you above.', 99039, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swing harder, and faster! This world\'s resistance must be broken!', '', 99038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blades are nearly as dull as your skills! Work harder, whelps!', '', 99037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again! A legion fighting as you do is an embarrassment to Sargeras!', '', 99036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may have lost my bet, but I cannot deny your hunting skills.\n\nYou and the gnome have made fine additions to the hunting party.', '', 99035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $p. Arru will terrorize Thunder Totem no more. Instead, he will be a great aid. Help yourself to what he took from town.', '', 99034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have more skill than I thought |5$r could possess.', '', 99033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'March the warpath with me, and let us remind them that together, WE... ARE... HIGHMOUNTAIN!', 99032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, the underking\'s forces march on Snowblind Mesa. Let us meet them in battle and show them the true power of Highmountain!', 99031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The underking\'s forces assault Snowblind Mesa. Come! March the warpath with me and let us show them the might of Highmountain!', 99030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure it will be over soon.', 99029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These lands have seen battle, but none like this...', 99028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We appreciate your visit, but this is not the time.', 99027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are fine here. Please, just go... and be safe.', 99026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A visitor! Hey... is it safe out there yet?', '', 99025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s someone outside!', '', 99024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it over yet?', '', 99023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Izal, get me back up there.', 'Izal, get me back up there.', 99022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whitemoon, I\'ll be taking one of your felbats. We\'re going to get what we came here for.', 'Whitemoon, I\'ll be taking one of your fel bats. We\'re going to get what we came here for.', 99021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I have captured a few felbats. They will be ready when you decide to fly up to that Legion command ship.', 99020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks. Be safe out here.', 99019, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could always use more target practice!', '', 99018, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are NOT your lands!', '', 99017, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caww! $p! $p!', '', 99016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoo! Get out of here!', '', 99015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may seem like nothing more than a tiny hole that no army can fit down, but it leads to the very lair of Neltharion himself.$b$bWithin, you shall find yourself behind the main assault force of the drogbar loyal to Dargrul.$b$bProceed with caution though, as those you do find will be more formidable than the drogbar you have encountered thus far. Good luck, brul.', '', 99014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $n. Use the keystone to activate the portal. We must rejoin the fight at the Black Temple.', '', 99013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Lord Sargeras, no!!!', 99012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds good, prepare yourself!', 'Sounds good, prepare yourself!', 99011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on tight!', 'Hold on tight!', 99010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m surrounded by weaklings! Just look at them, they couldn\'t cut their way out of a paper bag. \'Gonna be a liability when we fight the demons unless we can drill some proper skills into \'em.$b$bHow about we have a quick spar? Show \'em how real knights fight!', 'I\'m surrounded by weaklings! Just look at them, they couldn\'t cut their way out of a paper bag. \'Gonna be a liability when we fight the demons unless we can drill some proper skills into \'em.$b$bHow about we have a quick spar? Show \'em how real knights fight!', 99009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it, Illidari! FREEDOM IS OURS!', '', 99008, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 57366, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_volatilewater:20|t%s begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191873|h[Submerge]|h|r!', '', 99006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many seasons have I slumbered. \n\nIt is good to smell the Runewood air again.', '', 99005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel footsteps... but they are not familiar...\n\nStranger... you must help...', '', 99004, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can find Grand Master Corvus working on the forges upstairs, $gsir:ma\'am;.', 99003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They outnumber us by an order of magnitude. Can we defeat them?', 99002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
