('Sure am glad to see you, $n!', '', 98994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normally I\'d offer my guests a snack, but I don\'t think those things would taste very good.', '', 98993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
