('They got me good! I\'m fadin\' fast. Goodbye world...', '', 98991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood... ew! Wait a minute... yep - it\'s mine.', '', 98990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... the humanity!', '', 98989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathlord, I must speak with you.', 98987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Coughing rather vigorously>$b$bWell that was unexpected! You alright, $n?', '', 98986, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mebok was right, the smarts are in the horns... but he kept trying to separate them from the raptor! We need the raptors intact, so we can use \'em to fight against the Legion.\n\nIf Mebok\'s books were right, I oughta be able to slather myself in some raptor pheromones and make myself their leader. Wish me luck!', '', 98985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soul chambers are brilliant, but fragile gems that can be used to imprison demons.\n\nSoulkeeper Uriah and I were in possession of a handful of these shards until kobolds ransacked our caravan.\n\nThose mindless vermin have no idea what terror they may have unleashed.', 98984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
