('Your will is our command.', '', 98973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to station a follower in Azsuna.', 'I would like to station a follower in Azsuna.', 98972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This brave adventurer saved us.', '', 98971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Naman, still in a daze, looks around the room, searching for something.', 98970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... what happened? My supplies - they\'re gone!', 98969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your name... it\'s familiar. I believe this is the hero the others were talking about.', 98968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naman and I will hold out here.', '', 98967, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may empty all of your current Glyph slots for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'You may empty all of your current Glyph slots for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 98966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lend you my power Hyrja!', '', 98965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 98964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you give me a lift back to the Foothold?', 'Can you give me a lift back to the Foothold?', 98963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', 'Yes?', 98962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may unlearn your current Class Specialization for a price, so that you may select a new one.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'You may unlearn your current Class Specialization for a price, so that you may select a new one.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 98961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eons ago, Sargeras created Mardum to imprison demons. He also created the Sargerite Keystone to lock them away.\n\nBut when the Titan decided to burn all of creation, he shattered Mardum, sending its fragments hurtling throughout the Twisting Nether. Thus was born the Burning Legion.\n\nSargeras safeguarded his keystone on this particular fragment. It\'s a \'skeleton key\', allowing access to any Legion world. It\'s also the key to Lord Illidan\'s plan for the Legion\'s destruction.', '', 98960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to cure us all, $n?', '', 98958, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, let\'s get up there!', '', 98957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not last much longer if those devastators are not destroyed!', '', 98956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', '', 98955, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Welcome back! Don\'t you just love the smell of hot steel in the morning?', '', 98954, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve made quite the name for yourself, $n. It\'s good to see my instruction wasn\'t wasted.', 98953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the disciple returns triumphant! You\'ve done well to remember the lessons I\'ve taught you.', '', 98952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be mine, Arru!', '', 98951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes... but I will take you with me!', '', 98950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will DIE like the insect you are!', '', 98949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you yet stand. Impossible!', '', 98948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this! Face your destruction!', '', 98947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can manage, weaklings? A few scratches?', '', 98946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic resistance only delays the inevitable. All will die to the Legion!', '', 98945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $p. He\'s right up here. Follow me!', '', 98944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me any available missions.', 'Show me any available missions.', 98943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This table lists all of your currently available missions.', 'This table lists all of your currently available missions.', 98942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll see to securing the caverns. Thanks for your help, hero!', 98941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this.', 'Let\'s do this.', 98940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bear in the cave up ahead has immense power. He has been terrorizing Thunder Totem for a long time. He is too grand to put down... $b$b$p, I need you to help me weaken him so I can tame him. Will you help?', '', 98939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push them back! The Horde will not succumb to Legion swine!', '', 98938, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time you be given a position that befits your accomplishments, $n.', '', 98937, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t break through the demon\'s defenses. We need to reactivate the warden\'s trap to disable him!', 98936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the creature\'s destructive beam is focused upon me. Redirect the final mirror to shatter its shield!', '', 98935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shield is broken! Quickly, everyone out while the creature is stunned!', '', 98934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Placeholder Event: I get stunned!]', '[Placeholder Event: I get stunned!]', 98933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, you\'re here! Let us return this foul creature to the Twisting Nether.', '', 98924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are holding the demon back, but at great cost! I only have a few demon hunters left. We could use your help.', '', 98922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This affront to nature cannot stand. These are our lands!', 98921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is too strong! Our only hope is to reactivate the orbs and seal him inside the chamber!', '', 98920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many who opposed him, but Illidan was right all along. We are the weapons that will bring down the Burning Legion.', 98916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The demon is weak enough for me to begin the containment spell. This should only take a moment.', 98915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In death I return to ash.', '', 98914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you how my fire can not only destroy homes, but lives!', '', 98913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I will break you myself!', '', 98911, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 60440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Feltotem... will be... your end.', 98910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion empowers me!', 98909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you have saved me!', '', 98908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... you have saved me!', 98907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you have saved me!', '', 98906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt myself slipping away...', '', 98905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I felt myself slipping away...', 98904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt myself slipping away...', '', 98903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude, traveler.', '', 98902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my gratitude, traveler.', 98901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude, traveler.', '', 98900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless you, stranger!', '', 98899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bless you, stranger!', 98898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless you, stranger!', '', 98897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, to breathe again!', '', 98896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, to breathe again!', 98895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, to breathe again!', '', 98894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live!', '', 98893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live!', 98892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live!', '', 98891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choosing', 'Choosing', 98890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we will imprison these demons once again.', 98887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for the Horde.', 'My life... for the Horde.', 98885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Help me out with this one!', 'Help me out with this one!', 98884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 98883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will see your grave soon enough, $n.', 'You will see your grave soon enough, $n.', 98882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die scum!', 'Die scum!', 98881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure.', 'With pleasure.', 98880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s mine.', 'This one\'s mine.', 98879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be interesting.', 'This will be interesting.', 98878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think I\'ll make it through this one.', 'Don\'t think I\'ll make it through this one.', 98877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been an honor fighting by your side.', 'It has been an honor fighting by your side.', 98875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My forces are legion! Your efforts are futile!', '', 98874, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 60438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this...', 'Not like this...', 98873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never... give up...', 'Never... give up...', 98872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight... to the death...', 'Fight... to the death...', 98871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am being summoned elsewhere. Until our next adventure, friend!', 'I am being summoned elsewhere. Until our next adventure, friend!', 98870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve enjoyed fighting by your side, but I must be going now. Be safe!', 'I\'ve enjoyed fighting by your side, but I must be going now. Be safe!', 98869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve fought well, champion. The time has come for me to venture onward.', 'You\'ve fought well, champion. The time has come for me to venture onward.', 98868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, you not real kobold!', '', 98867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... no... take... candle...', '', 98866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you doing here?! All candles my candles! See big horns?!', '', 98865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take green candle!', '', 98864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not say you take candle!', '', 98863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_venomouswounds:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191855|h[Toxic Wound]|h|r!', '', 98862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many centuries ago, I was the leader of the Skyhorn tribe. Never have I seen this sort of desecration of our ancient burial ground!', 98861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More than ten millennia ago, Malorne and many other powerful ancients fought the Burning Legion\'s demons when they first invaded Azeroth.$b$bHe died nobly during the war, sacrificing his life so that his injured son, Cenarius, could be brought to safety and healing.$b$bNo parent could wish for a nobler death than to die protecting a child.$b$bHowever, let me be clear: to ancients like Malorne, we are all their children. We are fortunate that he has been restored to life and returned to us.', 'More than ten millennia ago, Malorne and many other powerful ancients fought the Burning Legion\'s demons when they first invaded Azeroth.$b$bHe died nobly during the war, sacrificing his life so that his injured son, Cenarius, could be brought to safety and healing.$b$bNo parent could wish for a nobler death than to die protecting a child.$b$bHowever, let me be clear: to ancients like Malorne, we are all their children. We are fortunate that he has been restored to life and returned to us.', 98860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re bombarding the pass into the volcano.', '', 98859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve taken the foothold, but with some losses.', '', 98858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re vulnerable while they remain active.', '', 98857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beliash\'s eredar are using those portals to summon in demonic reinforcements.', '', 98856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those things spew fel energy, corrupting everything they touch.', '', 98855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'sharah has remained tranquil for ages, until recently. We\'ve underestimated the danger. Have no fear, champion. We will not be caught by surprise again.', 'Val\'sharah has remained tranquil for ages, until recently. We\'ve underestimated the danger. Have no fear, champion. We will not be caught by surprise again.', 98854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like Malorne himself, we spend most of our time in the wilds.$b$bIn these dire times, however, seclusion is a luxury no one can afford. We must stand together, or we will surely fall.', 'Like Malorne himself, we spend most of our time in the wilds.$b$bIn these dire times, however, seclusion is a luxury no one can afford. We must stand together, or we will surely fall.', 98853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... it would appear that they\'re on to us, $n.', '', 98852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your attempt to gain my lord Sargeras\'s keystone will fail.', 98851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoever this is, you\'re caught in my web now.', 98850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you choose, it will feel good to use more of the Legion\'s power against them.', 98849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Last I saw, Kor\'vas cut a swath of destruction on her way across the bridge.', 98848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inquisitor Baleful? Who is this? Speak!', '', 98847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon hunters are using the gateways!', '', 98846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have to go. Kayn\'s called me back to handle something. He probably needs help killing a demon.', 98845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a full report now!', '', 98844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I just see one of the gateways activate?', '', 98843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! $n is here! We have a chance warriors, one more charge! LOK\'TAR!', '', 98842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rosalyn! Where is Rosalyn?!', '', 98841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shrug off your wounds, warriors! Another battle awaits!', '', 98840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will honor Uriah\'s memory by delivering the soul chambers to Allari as planned.', 98839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This road isn\'t safe, adventurer.\n\nKobolds attacked our caravan and made off with the soul chambers we were meant to deliver to Allari for interrogation.', 98838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you so much $c! That dog was going to eat me!', '', 98837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feelin\' fine. [PH]', 98836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was... nearly broken... You have my thanks.', '', 98835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These foul demons will pay for their treachery!', '', 98834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know not why you came, but you have my gratitude.', '', 98833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, outsider. I will make my way to the summit.', '', 98832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take Candle', 'Take Candle', 98831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I surge with power! I cannot possibly contain any more.', '', 98830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I can feel the magic coursing through me. I am whole again.', '', 98829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cravings have stopped. For now.', '', 98828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, if you find anything which can keep this hunger at bay, bring it to me.', '', 98827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[TEMP] Click on each gossip option to view half of the available zone options. You can only pick one of the four available initially. This will eventually be on the mission map.', '[TEMP] Click on each gossip option to view half of the available zone options. You can only pick one of the four available initially. This will eventually be on the mission map.', 98826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Stormheim and Highmountain.', 'Tell me about Stormheim and Highmountain.', 98825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Azsuna and Val\'Sharah.', 'Tell me about Azsuna and Val\'Sharah.', 98824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what missions you have prepared.', 'Show me what missions you have prepared.', 98823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some tales say that Malorne fell in love with the goddess of the moon during the world\'s first nightfall.$b$bHer light guided him through the woods and showed him he was not alone. It banished fear and brought hope.$b$bMany creatures have loved the moon and pursued her to madness. She grants light as she will, on her own timetable, and moonlight cannot be captured or possessed.$b$bEven so, night after night, the White Stag chased her across the skies. He grew so swift and strong that at last he succeeded in reaching her.$b$bShe was so moved by his devotion and beauty that she made him her consort. To this day he loves the wilds best when they are lit by her radiance.', 'Some tales say that Malorne fell in love with the goddess of the moon during the world\'s first nightfall.$b$bHer light guided him through the woods and showed him he was not alone. It banished fear and brought hope.$b$bMany creatures have loved the moon and pursued her to madness. She grants light as she will, on her own timetable, and moonlight cannot be captured or possessed.$b$bEven so, night after night, the White Stag chased her across the skies. He grew so swift and strong that at last he succeeded in reaching her.$b$bShe was so moved by his devotion and beauty that she made him her consort. To this day he loves the wilds best when they are lit by her radiance.', 98822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight together until the end, $n.', 'We fight together until the end, $n.', 98821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For honor!', 'For honor!', 98820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be an honor to fight alongside you in battle, $n.', 'It would be an honor to fight alongside you in battle, $n.', 98819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please - allow me to repay you with my services.', 'Please - allow me to repay you with my services.', 98818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. I will fight by your side.', 'Thank you, $n. I will fight by your side.', 98817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more minutes here...  She will be seaworthy shortly!', '', 98816, 0, 924, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard the tale of the White Stag and the Moon? It is said the tauren hunted Malorne and nearly cornered him. To escape, he leapt into the sky, but his antlers became tangled in the stars.$b$bNo matter how he struggled, he remained trapped. When the moon goddess Elune found him there, she offered to free him if he would love her and end her solitude.$b$bAh, but that is only one version of the myth, a tale shaped by the proud hunters who have passed it down for generations.', 'Have you heard the tale of the White Stag and the Moon? It is said the tauren hunted Malorne and nearly cornered him. To escape, he leapt into the sky, but his antlers became tangled in the stars.$b$bNo matter how he struggled, he remained trapped. When the moon goddess Elune found him there, she offered to free him if he would love her and end her solitude.$b$bAh, but that is only one version of the myth, a tale shaped by the proud hunters who have passed it down for generations.', 98815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('View available missions.', 'View available missions.', 98814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
