('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_galewinds.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191797|h[Violent Winds]|h|r are picking up from the |cFFFF0000East|r!', '', 98811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_galewinds.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:191797|h[Violent Winds]|h|r are picking up from the |cFFFF0000North|r!', '', 98810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Satyr have invaded our grove. They were once night elves, but pledged themselves to the Legion and became twisted by demonic magic. Such creatures have no place in nature.', 'Satyr have invaded our grove. They were once night elves, but pledged themselves to the Legion and became twisted by demonic magic. Such creatures have no place in nature.', 98809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dreamgrove is spread thin these days, I fear.$b$bMalorne\'s Refuge is a bastion of druidic power in the Broken Isles. We cannot let it fall.', 'The Dreamgrove is spread thin these days, I fear.$b$bMalorne\'s Refuge is a bastion of druidic power in the Broken Isles. We cannot let it fall.', 98808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand firm. Do not let them break through!', '', 98807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the line, demon hunters. We fight in Lord Illidan\'s name!', 98806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can Corvus do for you?', '', 98805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It wouldn\'t have taken years to rebuild the forges if I had some help!', '', 98804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This tropic air is too damp, makes me feel like there\'s flesh hanging from my bones again.', '', 98803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make the weapons better, Corvus! Saronite isn\'t good enough anymore, Corvus! .. Bah! I\'ll show them what I can do to a blade.', '', 98802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I work all this time to improve the forges and do I get a single word of thanks? No!', '', 98801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH OF THIS! Guards, punish these outsiders for their insolence!', '', 98800, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from here, trespassers!', '', 98799, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see now. My weapons are yours, warrior. May they bring you glory as you strike down Helya\'s minions!', '', 98798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... have fallen. Hruthnir... you are a valarjar?', '', 98797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me now, let us dine with Odyn tonight.', '', 98796, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am, as you will be. Come, let us go to the Halls of Valor. This mortal warrior will find the revenge you crave...', '', 98795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Silgryn is shaking uncontrollably and can barely speak.>', '', 98794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will protect you, Hruthnir.', 'I will protect you, Hruthnir.', 98793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feelin\' fine.', '', 98792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to face Magnar with me, $n?', '', 98791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I need time to recover.', 'Thank you. I need time to recover.', 98790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t remember what happened...', 'I don\'t remember what happened...', 98789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlefield could use more heroes like you, $n.', 'The battlefield could use more heroes like you, $n.', 98788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands are in peril. Be careful.', 'These lands are in peril. Be careful.', 98787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battle is upon us, $n. Prepare yourself!', 'Battle is upon us, $n. Prepare yourself!', 98786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord, may I speak with you for a moment?', '', 98785, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kayn and Altruis have already gone ahead. Take this felbat and join them.', '', 98783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you\'re alive!', 98782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, yes... We all know how attached you are to your alchemy table!', 98781, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just make sure $Ghe:she; doesn\'t make a mess on my alchemy table!', '', 98780, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d be happy to! Have a look at my stock, $n.', 98779, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patricia! Would you be so kind as to show our friend here the newest recipes we\'ve discovered?', '', 98778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before us this day stands our comrade in arms, $n.', '', 98777, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared to receive your gift.', 'I am prepared to receive your gift.', 98776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we proceed, I would like to bestow upon you a gift of the Thorignir.\n\nRaise your weapon, outsider, and brace yourself. This may prove uncomfortable for your kind.', '', 98775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Candle burn too bright!!!', '', 98774, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven yourself a powerful hero, outsider. \n\nToday, you may also consider yourself a friend of the Thorignir.', '', 98773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AIIIEEEEeeeee', '', 98772, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hot Hot Hot!!!', '', 98771, 0, 0, 0, 80, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little candles burn bright!', '', 98770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portal will take us to the western shore of the island not far from the city. Let\'s get down there, shall we?', '', 98769, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna was once home to the great city of Nar\'thalas - one of the centerpieces of night elven civilization. It is a fine place to start our efforts against the Legion.', '', 98768, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in representing your guild here in Frostwall?', 'Interested in representing your guild here in Frostwall?', 98767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will cleanse the universe in fire.', '', 98766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where you die.', '', 98765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are outmatched and outnumbered.', '', 98764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade will cut through you.', '', 98763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brood Queen Tyranna orders your death.', '', 98762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not gain the keystone.', '', 98761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the Legion.', '', 98760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live to serve.', '', 98759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve arranged a flight directly to Dalaran for you, Highlord.', 98758, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So HE is the key to Azeroth\'s downfall.', 98757, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 57342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let the others know of your gift, $n. Thank you again.', '', 98756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you lot! If you need a quick pick-me-up, come and get a Rivermane Remedy!', '', 98755, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are fruitless, demon hunter. Lord Gul\'dan sees all.', '', 98754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope Maiev was right about freeing you, demon hunter. Go on - I will hold the line.', 98753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to Vethir, he will take you to the summit!', '', 98752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we haven\'t time for pleasantries, I must rally the Thorignir!', '', 98751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free! You are a true savior, outsider.', '', 98750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re on your own from here. Good luck!', 98749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now\'s our chance. Let\'s get up that tower!', 98748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 58284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You go ahead, I\'ll report back to Greymane. Good luck, champion.', 98747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our way is clear! Let\'s get to the top of the tower!', 98746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place the blade on the altar when you are ready. The Light will be our forge.', '', 98745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 72333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thork - the northern portal is destroyed! We will push forward beyond Grol\'dom and make way toward the north.', '', 98744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The altar lies just behind you, Highlord.', '', 98743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay here and await Gryan\'s return, Highlord.', '', 98742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course it worked! I\'ve woken up things that were twice as dead for three times as long. This one was easy.', 98741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked! $GHe\'s:She\'s; alive!', 98740, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, you have been turnin\' quite a lot of heads lately amongst the Explorer\'s League.$b$bOl\' Ebonhorn here seemed to know who I was and asked fer me to come help ya on this next journey.$b$bI hope ya don\'t mind but I dusted off me ol\' Talas here. I heard there were ettins involved and figured we could use us some heavy metal.', '', 98739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons aim to destroy our world. We need to release our allies.', '', 98738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for answers later. There are demons to kill.', '', 98737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Highlord\'s will be done.', '', 98736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I also wanted to ask about...', 'I also wanted to ask about...', 98735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will need your help to stop Gul\'dan. Free the other Illidari, quickly!', 98734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn this world with my fury!', '', 98732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take up your weapons, $n. I trust you can still handle a blade.', 98731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have been well, $n. The fall of the Lich King was a wonder to behold. If only all of Northrend\'s troubles had been solved by that victory.$b$bAh, but the past is the past. It feels great for Dalaran to be on the front lines of a new campaign! Though I admit, I\'m grateful you\'re out there fighting the battles instead of me.', 98730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How have you fared since Northrend?', 'How have you fared since Northrend?', 98729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wake up, demon hunter.', 98727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I admit, I never would have guessed that my work as an alchemist would be so thrilling!$b$bBut look who I\'m talking to... you\'ve seen far more adventure than I have!', 98726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fog has lifted and I can see the truth once more. Thank you, $pc. If you would join me at my old shop, perhaps we can speak further.', '', 98725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds like an exciting life!', 'Sounds like an exciting life!', 98724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! Stop! You\'re... you\'re no demon...', '', 98723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here to pillage our wares, demon?! You shall take NOTHING!', '', 98722, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you know, nothing much. Just helped move an entire city from the frozen north to a haunted keep, then on to a chain of demon-infested islands! All in a day\'s work, I suppose.$b$bI\'m semi-retired these days, so having Deucus take over has been wonderful. He\'s a good sort... if perhaps a bit overly fond of his alchemy table!', 98721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, Linzy. What\'s new with you?', 'Hello again, Linzy. What\'s new with you?', 98720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You too fast. Stay!', '', 98719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop moving! Me can\'t keep track.', '', 98718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come here goaties!', '', 98717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy holidays!', 'Happy holidays!', 98716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis the season!', '\'Tis the season!', 98715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many presents there are, we could always use more!', 'No matter how many presents there are, we could always use more!', 98714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a wonderful time of year!', 'What a wonderful time of year!', 98713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Years and years with only the voices in my head. I thought I would go insane.', 98712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will need weapons and supplies if we are to break out of here. I am on it, $n.', 98711, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, it has been a long time since Mardum. I am ready for another fight.', 98710, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhh, it feels good to MOVE again. Thank you, $n.', 98709, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Wardens seek our help? Things must be desperate.', 98708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 57334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
