('S - Save the temple! <choking sound> Hurry!', '', 98706, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 53187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Easy now. This remedy takes time. You must rest.', 98705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time! Xavius must be stopped!', '', 98704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will all bow to him as you once did to me, and carry out his will against the Legion!', '', 98703, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you approach, the regal druid regards you with friendly curiosity.>$b$b<After a moment, he gives a chuff of approval and lowers his stately head before you.>', '', 98702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 900, 39653),
('By the will of the Lich King and upon my authority as Highlord, I declare that $n, wielder of Apocalypse, will henceforth be known as Deathlord of the Ebon Blade.', '', 98701, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 60233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
