('By the will of the Lich King and upon my authority as Highlord, I declare that $n, wielder of the Blades of the Fallen Prince, will henceforth be known as Deathlord of the Ebon Blade.', '', 98699, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His exemplary deeds in the name of the Ebon Blade have shown him to be one of the best of us, worthy of our highest honor.', '', 98697, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have all heard the legends of countless battles fought... of trials overcome at great cost.', '', 98696, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Knights of the Ebon Blade! Assemble as we honor one of our own!', '', 98695, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 61914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
