('Like I always say, if you can\'t reach it, throw something at it. Never fails!', '', 98691, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That door is sealed with lightning. We must find a way through!', '', 98690, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', '', 98689, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His madness infects his guards, they do not recognize me.', '', 98688, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can charge from here.', '', 98687, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s ponders the situation at hand.', '', 98686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These spirit winds are relentless! We cannot walk through.', '', 98685, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 98679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go SQUISH!', '', 98678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snowball incoming!', 'Snowball incoming!', 98677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snow for everyone!', 'Snow for everyone!', 98676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is my favorite holiday!', 'This is my favorite holiday!', 98675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Shadowbreaker, the Highlord would like to peruse the reconnaissance you\'ve gathered on the Broken Isles.', '', 98674, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Shadowbreaker will be expecting you, $n. This way.', '', 98673, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it! The alchemy table looks good as new!$b$bWith my brains and your brawn, we make a great team. Thank you, $n!', '', 98672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a lot of work ahead of us to fix the alchemy table!', '', 98671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live. I die. I...', 98670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am the chosen of Eyir! What chance do think you have?', 98669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! I require a moment of your time.', '', 98668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will send Gul\'dan\'s filth to the bottom of the sea!', '', 98667, 0, 20069, 1, 64, 0, 50641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sell the recipes that Deucus and I research together. As we learn new ones, I add them to my inventory.$b$bBe sure to check back from time to time to see if anything new is available!', 98666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be a slave to your hammer. It is an extension of your arm. YOU are its master.', '', 98665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not simply use your arm to swing the hammer. You have your torso, your legs, your spirit.', '', 98664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What sorts of things do you sell?', 'What sorts of things do you sell?', 98663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s eyes Reylar the Stormcaller cautiously.', '', 98662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To hammer the metal is to hammer yourself. How far are you willing to bend, greenhorn?', '', 98661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Send a bat - tell them we are leaving shortly.', 98660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Oblivion has landed nearby. They are building fortifications now and will be ready to lay siege at your command.', 98659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'News from Captain Dreadwake, my lady. They have found the temple.', 98658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not while I reign. Not when there are still beings out there with the power to stop death.', 98657, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 53173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. The Forsaken will never stop fighting.', 98656, 0, 0, 661, 64, 0, 0, 53172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think often about our future, hero. My people cannot reproduce. Are we not destined, then, to wither away eventually?', 98655, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nathanos has been training a new generation of rangers. They represent both our past, and our future.', 98654, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Setting her vigil aside for a moment, the majestic druid turns to look at you. Her dark eyes widen in recognition and warmth.>$b$b<Without a word, she makes it clear that you will always be welcome here.>', 98653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 900, 39653),
('', 'Truthfully, Stormheim holds another treasure. One that I will be pursuing by my own means.', 98652, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust you are more than capable of handling whatever trials stand between you and the Aegis.', 98651, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The new catapults are faster and more powerful than ever before. I have our goblin allies to thank for that.', 98650, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 53167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to buy from you.', 'I\'d like to buy from you.', 98649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The alchemy table looks terrific! Deucus is so relieved. Thank you for all the work you did restoring it.$b$bHere\'s hoping we don\'t see another vrykul ghost in the shop ever again!', 98648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The alchemy table looks good as new!', 'The alchemy table looks good as new!', 98647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their legends speak of the Aegis of Aggramar. To claim it, one must undergo some kind of trial. One must be... worthy.', 98646, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That awful Svena made a mess of the alchemy table. Poor Deucus! I know he hides it, but he\'s heartbroken.$b$bI certainly hope you can help him finish rebuilding it!', 98645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna get you next!', 'I\'m gonna get you next!', 98644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha. This is great!', 'Haha. This is great!', 98643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that\'s cold!', 'Wow, that\'s cold!', 98642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you familiar with the vrykul? Towering, brutish warriors from an ancient stock. Subtlety is not a value they hold in high regard.', 98641, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', 'Hey!', 98640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a shame what happened to the alchemy table.', 'It\'s a shame what happened to the alchemy table.', 98639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t our alchemy table wonderful? Deucus spent years assembling the components. He\'s so proud of it!', 98638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make the journey with us. Together, we will ensure that no one can oppose the might of the Horde!', 98637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To that end, my fleet is preparing to sail for the Broken Isles. When you set foot in Stormheim, you shall have the full power of the Forsaken at your back.', 98636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion: As your new Warchief, I share with you the burden of securing our future.', 98635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof! That had to hurt.', 'Oof! That had to hurt.', 98634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s free!', 'That one\'s free!', 98633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hehe!', 'Hehe!', 98632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotcha!', 'Gotcha!', 98631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this alchemy table?', 'What can you tell me about this alchemy table?', 98630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a wide selection of recipes available.', 98629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Suramar.', 'Suramar.', 98628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highmountain.', 'Highmountain.', 98627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'sharah.', 'Val\'sharah.', 98626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna.', 'Azsuna.', 98625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormheim.', 'Stormheim.', 98624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran.', 'Dalaran.', 98623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me help you get where you want to go. As you travel through the Broken Isles I will be able to get new destinations from you as well! Keep exploring!', 98622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Broken Shore.', 'Take me to the Broken Shore.', 98621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to fly? You\'ll have our fastest mount.', '', 98620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let me see the gauntlet.', '', 98619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It worked?! I mean... it worked! Of course it did. That\'s excellent news.', '', 98618, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spider fortress, the soul engine, and the forge are their primary targets. The Servants of Illidan must succeed.', '', 98617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Preparations are nearly complete. Please make yourselves comfortable.', 98616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not in the habit of tracking prey unless I intend on killing it.', '', 98615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It had better.', '', 98614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 53158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I strongly suspect the situation will demand it.', 98613, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are to track them from a safe distance. We may engage, but only if the situation demands.', 98612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Three days ago, the Forsaken fleet set sail from Durotar, heading straight for the Broken Isles. We think Sylvanas Windrunner herself may be among them.', 98611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The 7th Legion. The toughest men and women the Alliance has to offer. They, too, have come on direct orders from the king.', 98610, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 53154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unofficially, however, we have another mission...', 98609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just be upstairs so I can better observe your actions... at a safe distance.', '', 98608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive, aren\'t they? The new guns could bag a wyvern at full speed from three hundred meters. Go ahead, have a look.', 98607, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 53151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our official orders are to escort you to Stormheim and ensure your success on this trial.', 98606, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vrykul legends speak of a trial - to conquer this trial is to prove one\'s worth, and lay claim to the Aegis.', 98605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stormheim is home to one of the Pillars of Creation - the Aegis of Aggramar.', 98604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, forgive the interruption. I bring an urgent message from the king.', 98603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We pledge ourselves to your cause, Highlord!', '', 98602, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Skyhold! Here the brave live on forever!', 98601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Blood Knights stand by you, Highlord $p. Azeroth will not fall!', 98600, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 63837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why... so serious...?', '', 98599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll catch me soon, friend...', '', 98598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I am mysterious...', '', 98597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem delirious!', '', 98596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, my impish kin! We shall devour the power within!', '', 98595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please address the gathered paladins on my behalf, Gryan.', 'Please address the gathered paladins on my behalf, Gryan.', 98594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light gives us strength.', '', 98593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look how easily it bends...', '', 98592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaping the ore...', '', 98591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me bear the brunt of Ysera\'s attacks, hero. You can rely on me: I am quite sturdy.', 98589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'O Elune, grant us your light and strengthen us for what we must do!', 98588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shine your light down, Mother Moon, and lend us your strength!', 98587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand in Elune\'s light, and her blessing will strengthen your attacks!', 98586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no choice: Ysera must die. She would agree, were she in her right mind.', 98585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By Elune! Clearly Ysera is beyond saving. All we can do is end her suffering.', 98584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'New foes incoming! Brace yourselves!', 98583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fresh adversaries approach! Fight on!', 98582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another wave of attackers! Hold the line!', 98581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, thank you, Nightsong. Will you see to my equipment?', 'Yes, thank you, Nightsong. Will you see to my equipment?', 98580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust that your valor and discretion will serve the Alliance well, as it always has. With honor, King Anduin Wrynn.', '', 98579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orders? Do you need anything repaired before we head out?', 98578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incoming! Defend the temple!', 98577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Report to Stormwind Harbor as soon as possible - they are under strict orders not to leave without you.', '', 98576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies are launching a new attack!', 98575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemy reinforcements headed this way!', 98574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, champion! Lead on. We must help the other defenders!', 98573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53114, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion: The Skyfire is about to embark on an urgent mission. I must ask that you accompany them.', '', 98572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am in your debt, hero. Come. Let us destroy these demons together!', 98571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then turn around and be recognized!', '', 98570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now for the simple step of applying the flux. Lean in closely and watch my technique.', '', 98569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s see what we can make with it.', '', 98568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s see what we can do with this ore. First things first: we heat the ore.', '', 98567, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be honored.', 'I would be honored.', 98566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Leyweaver. I offer this gift in hopes that you will mend some silk for me.', 'Greetings, Leyweaver. I offer this gift in hopes that you will mend some silk for me.', 98565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach, $n.', '', 98564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your gift is appreciated, $r. These potions will be most useful.', 98563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Matron Mother, I need you to take your shivan across the gap to the Forge of Corruption. Make them suffer.', 'Matron Mother, I need you to take your shivan across the gap to the Forge of Corruption. Make them suffer.', 98562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is of the essence. Come, sisters, our former brethren await our tender mercies.', 98561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will see it done. I urge you to remember that the Black Temple is under attack.', 98560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stand together against the coming darkness. We must cast aside the shackles of race and kingdom. We must unite as one!', '', 98559, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is the Vault of Neltharian.$b$bNow I see why Wrathion was so eager to visit this place. The secrets here could easily turn the tide in any war.$b$bBut this place has been abandoned by the living for thousands of years.$B$bWe should be on our guard. There is no telling what sort of sorcery and traps were left behind.', '', 98558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us observe a moment of silence for a great soldier, leader, and friend. In the Light we are one, brother. Always.', '', 98557, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Path of Huln was something I knew I might have to walk some day. I had just hoped I could wait until after dealing with Dargrul to walk it.$b$b', 98556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Milady, you will take your naga north. Disrupt the ritual the demons are performing at their Soul Engine.', 'Milady, you will take your naga north. Disrupt the ritual the demons are performing at their Soul Engine.', 98555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us be done with this business. A volcano is no place for naga.', 98554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A fine task for the Coilskar. I am in agreement.', 98553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another question.', 'I have another question.', 98552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer...', '', 98551, 0, 43820, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dead are everywhere! Their souls must be sworn to Magnar.', '', 98550, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings champion.$b$bWe are dangerously low on allies in this land and the Highmountain tribe is the only tribe in known tauren history to lock horns with the Burning Legion.$b$bI am here to lend whatever aid they need so that they can unite under the same totem once again and join us in the fight against the Legion.', '', 98549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We make a good team, you and I. The alchemy table looks good as new!$b$bOne day we\'ll look back on this whole vrykul ghost mishap and have a good laugh. Thank you, $n!', '', 98548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll cover you. Go help Greymane!', 98547, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been many years since my people swore our loyalty to the Horde.$b$bThe Horde aided my people in our time of need, and I am here to speak well of that accord.$b$bThe Highmountain tribe is known even to us in the North, and respect must be paid.', '', 98546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High Chieftain asked for me to join him in this negotiation.$b$bThe Highmountain tribe is spoken of in our legends and remembered with reverence.$b$bIt was important that we show respect for such an ancient tribe.', '', 98545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it means freedom for my people, then I welcome any consequences she throws at us.', '', 98540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insidia is all that remains of the flight in this tomb. We must be wary, one does not lift a weapon against a daughter of Deathwing without suffering consequences.', '', 98539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spiritwalker, have you any spells that might assist us with healing?', '', 98538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come now, High Chieftain. It is only an ettin. I\'m sure you will be fine.', '', 98537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('History is forged by the hearts of heroes, child. This is the truth your father wanted you to see.', '', 98536, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 61685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be warned, the path ahead is quite dangerous. I can only provide you guidance and healing. Nothing more.', '', 98535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Huln, the War of the Ancients did not end at the Well of Eternity. With the Legion defeated, he focused on the monster that got away.', '', 98534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death Knights of Acherus, I send to you $n who will serve as the enforcer of my will. Follow his commands as you would my own.', '', 98533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re trying to bring the ship down from the inside.', 98532, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 53100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
