('', 'Nooooo!', 98503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your terms were met, Helya. It seems even you must honor your word.', 98502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one leaves Helheim! No one!', 98501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Her hold is weakening. She cannot keep us here!', 98500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? This cannot be!', 98499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such insolence! None will leave Helheim while I rule!', 98498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done, Helya! We have fulfilled your bargain, and we will collect our payment!', 98497, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done, Helya! We have fulfilled your bargain, and we will collect our payment!', 98496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! My darling pet! You will pay for this!', 98495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The time for planning is over, champion. Now, we take action!', 98494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How resourceful you are. You might make a worthwhile plaything yet.', 98493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not think you are close to winning, unworthy one.', 98492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are clever, outsider, but your efforts will only prove futile.', 98491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our foe is great, champion, but we will win the day.', 98490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have fun with my pet, outsider. I will enjoy watching him break you!', 98489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your spirit feels... weaker. What has she done?', 98488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unworthy! You will kneel before addressing the great Helya!', 98487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help ya out, $c.  I remember seeing some documents at the end of the docks.  Head down there and take a look.', '', 98486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
