('', 'You must not languish here. The Aegis cannot fall into enemy hands!', 98484, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 53012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, my loyal hero.', 98483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you ever make it out of here, that is.', 98482, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 53013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter. Soon you will witness the birth of a new age.', 98481, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 53011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here? Another one of Greymane\'s mercenaries?', 98480, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember our bargain, banshee. Do not dare to cross me...', 98479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
