('', 'Disgusting! This plan better work, spirit.', 98476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps this cowering wretch might be of some use.', 98475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
