('', 'I really must make a trip to Dalaran sometime.', 98382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, hero. You have just given the Black Dragonflight a second chance.', '', 98381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will signal my contacts on the other side of the tunnel. Meet me there as soon as you are able.', '', 98380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfection! You can now make potions with precise exactitude!', '', 98379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This core contains a script written in an ancient Highborne dialect, which I can\'t read. Professor Pallin in the Scribes\' Sacellum may be able to translate this.', '', 98378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deucus always sends me the most challenging puzzles to solve! Let\'s see that burette!', '', 98377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Data Extratinator 3000 might be able to decipher this core. Cross your fingers that it doesn\'t explode in the process.', '', 98376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perfect calibration! Tell Deucus I shall make a trip to Dalaran soon to say hello.', 98375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deucus? I thought he was dead! Of course I would be happy to help my old friend.', 98374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Odyn awaits ahead. I will go forth and announce you. Be respectful!', 98372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here ya go! Tell Deucus I treated ya fair \'n square!', '', 98371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behind you lies the Eye of Odyn, which peers across all of Azeroth! This way lies the Forge, where the mightiest weapons of the valarjar are crafted by Helgar, the greatest smith in the Halls.', 98370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deucus? That undead has some nerve! Called me a cheater once... but I suppose I can forgive him. Lemme see...', '', 98369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve done my best to calibrate the burette. Give Deucus my regards.', 98367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deucus Valdera? A blustery fellow, but honorable. I will be pleased to assist you with calibration.', 98365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to build a destroyer.', 'I would like to build a destroyer.', 98364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There, much better. Please give my best to Deucus.', 98360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be undone by some mortal filth! I am the Earth Warder!', '', 98359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could use a few more decorations around here. Wouldn\'t want our neighbors showing us up with their decorations this season, would we?', '', 98358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t happen to see a squirrel running about, did you? Damn thing came in with the trees...', '', 98357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lousy holiday bonus. Who needs a Smokeywood Pastures lifetime membership anyway?', '', 98356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place can never have too much holiday spirit!', '', 98355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go, $n. This moisture makes my joints hurt; make it snappy.', 98354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We checked every bulb, didn\'t we?$B$BMaybe we oughta check \'em again.', '', 98353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deucus is an old fla--er, friend. I\'d be happy to calibrate the burette for you.', 98352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to build another destroyer.', 'I would like to build another destroyer.', 98351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, Ysera! Destroy all who stand in your way.', '', 98347, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 53185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you\'ve arrived! The Sanctum of Light is just ahead. This way.', '$n, you\'ve arrived! The Sanctum of Light is just ahead. This way.', 98346, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again. A true, true friend helps a friend indeed.', 98345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welp, better get back to it. These presents won\'t count themselves.', '', 98344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break time!', '', 98343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it? Precision requires focus, you know.', 98342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a small, fragile body. Yet it holds such power.', '', 98341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One, two...', '', 98340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... eight? Aw, not again...', '', 98339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His weapons are yours now, champion. There is nothing left for us here. Let us feast in the Halls of Valor, together!', '', 98338, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the son of Magnar the Great, Champion of the Valarjar. Father, look at me! I am Hruthnir. I am your son!', '', 98337, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not my son! He is in the Halls of Valor, called by Odyn before his time!', '', 98336, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four, five... six...', '', 98335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LIAR! You will DIE for saying his name! I shall send you to Helheim myself!', '', 98334, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you, demon? Why do you torment me so?', '', 98333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You died in glorious battle! The Halls of Valor await. Come with me, father!', '', 98332, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 60413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lies! Can you not see my faithful soldiers?!', '', 98331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fell in battle. We ALL fell. None survived the onslaught. Not even you!', '', 98330, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It IS me. I fell before you in the battle of the Pass. We were betrayed!', '', 98329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta start somewhere!$B$BNow if you\'ll excuse me, I have some very important business to attend to.', '', 98328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son died before my very eyes. I FAILED to protect him! You will not--', '', 98327, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, it\'s me... your son. Odyn sent me here to--', '', 98326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 60405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say the word and we shall begin.', '', 98325, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, we must save him! I will find the words to spur him on to the Halls of Valor, but he may resist the truth and turn his guards against me.', '', 98324, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should be able to leap over this.', '', 98323, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 60397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guardians do not obey me! Seems we will have to do this the hard way.', '', 98322, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good fight! Follow me. I will open the tomb.', '', 98321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Desecrators! We must slay these abominations!', '', 98320, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 60423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They buried him here after his only defeat...', '', 98319, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 60422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His tomb is not far.', '', 98318, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glorious landing! Are you ready to find Magnar?', '', 98317, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 60384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is harmony in precision, $r.', 98316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lifespring Cavern is to the west. Meet me there when you can.', 98313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the holiday without a lil\' smooch?', 'What\'s the holiday without a lil\' smooch?', 98312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s make this the most wonderful holiday ever!', 'Let\'s make this the most wonderful holiday ever!', 98309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Happy holidays!', 'Happy holidays!', 98308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis the season!', '\'Tis the season!', 98307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how many presents there are, we could always use more!', 'No matter how many presents there are, we could always use more!', 98306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a wonderful time of year!', 'What a wonderful time of year!', 98305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t know what ya heard, but my numbers are exact. EXACT, I tell ya!', '', 98304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others should be waiting for you in the sanctum beneath Light\'s Hope Chapel, $n. You should make haste.', '', 98303, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Krimple\'s the name, precision\'s my game!', '', 98302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give Moozy back! Where is he?!', 98301, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you deep-dwellers touched a hair on Moozy\'s head you\'ll never leave that cave alive!', 98300, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, over here!  I have the plans you are looking for.', '', 98299, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we trust this creature?', 98298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. But if this is indeed Neltharian\'s Vault, he will prove useful.', '', 98297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion?!', '', 98296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our journey will be a quick one. A single leap from Skyhold will take us to Azeroth. Follow me!', '', 98295, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 60357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my friends, to the Vault of Neltharian.', '', 98294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come champion, I will need your help while the time scars are fresh.', '', 98293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us go to the tomb.', 'Let us go to the tomb.', 98292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gave everything for the Ashbringer... you gave everything, $n. Tirion would be proud to see you wielding that blade.', '', 98291, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 54097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magnar Icebreaker was one of the greatest heroes of our time. He won many victories, became king, and crafted the greatest weapons I have ever seen, including the Armaments of the Black Wyrm.\n\nHe lost only one battle, his last. We were betrayed by jealous warriors led by cultists of Helira, that dark witch! They killed me first before we could react and he would not command after that.\n\nThey crafted his tomb with reverence, but he did not move on to the Halls of Valor. I hope his rage has not driven him to madness. He deserves to be here.', '', 98290, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my friends, to the Vault of Neltharion. Or as the world came to know him: Deathwing.', '', 98289, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 54262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Magnar Icebreaker?', 'Who is Magnar Icebreaker?', 98288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be scared. My brews only show you what was already there to begin with.', 98287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your ties to this reality are but threads. Care to cut a few?', 98286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odyn believes you are worthy to wield the Armaments of the Black Wyrm. I am here for Magnar Icebreaker. Let us both be successful, eh?', '', 98285, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('God-King Skovald summons a pack of felstalkers!', 'God-King Skovald summons a pack of felstalkers!', 98284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('God-King Skovald summons a Felblaze Brute!', 'God-King Skovald summons a Felblaze Brute!', 98283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to the summit, Vethir.', 'Fly me to the summit, Vethir.', 98282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('God-King Skovald summons a squad of Felskorn vrykul!', 'God-King Skovald summons a squad of Felskorn vrykul!', 98281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have finished your business here, speak to me and I will fly you to the summit. $B$BOnce we leave, we may not return.', '', 98280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The deeds you have done are great, but we have not finished here yet. $B$BSpeak to me when you are ready to ascend to the mountain\'s summit.', '', 98279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your aid to the Thorignir will not go unrewarded, outsider. $B$BIf you truly wish the blessing of our brood, then help us to rid this scourge from our home.', '', 98278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deucus sent me. He says you can help calibrate this burette.', 'Deucus sent me. He says you can help calibrate this burette.', 98277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. Let\'s be certain to take care of that.', 98276, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 55091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re doing important work here in Feralas.', 98275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have sundered your forces...', '', 98274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot launch our attack until we\'re sure we won\'t be flanked.', '', 98273, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 55264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel lord is just ahead.', '', 98272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They won\'t escape us. Illidari, attack!', '', 98271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... no...', 98270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark Lady...', 98269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... at last...', 98268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh... not this again...', 98267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no...', '', 98266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Lady...', '', 98265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... at last...', '', 98264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... not this again...', '', 98263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you die!', 98262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Dark Lady!', 98261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will suffer as we have!', 98260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Abandon hope!', 98259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join us in death!', 98258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will feast on your bones!', 98257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the living!', 98256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you die!', '', 98255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Dark Lady!', '', 98254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer as we have!', '', 98253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon hope!', '', 98252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us in death!', '', 98251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feast on your bones!', '', 98250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the living!', '', 98249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Sylvanas!', 98248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Sylvanas!', '', 98247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your wits about you, $p. Varedis will be a cunning adversary.', '', 98246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, $n, I have some Spritethorns for sale if you need any for your bag recipe.', 98245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I name you Valarjar! Bring glory to these halls on the wings of my val\'kyr!', '', 98244, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 60363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you propose?', 'What do you propose?', 98243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have foreseen the coming of a mighty champion to these shores. One who would slay countless foes and prove their valor time and again. One who would lead my armies to victory against the great darkness that seeks to devour this world!', '', 98242, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 60362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, bruls, get to work!', '', 98241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you brought me here?', 'Why have you brought me here?', 98240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven yourself the greatest living warrior on Azeroth. It is for this reason I have saved you.', '', 98239, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 60361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it wise to wait in a field of ettins?', '', 98238, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should really keep moving.', '', 98237, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No rush, Champion. We are just in the middle of a field of ettins. I am sure nothing bad could possibly happen.', '', 98236, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you are ready to continue, champion.', '', 98235, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 54266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just got a fresh shipment of Runic Catgut, $n. If your supply is low, you can buy some from me.', 98234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torok will not trouble the Stonedark again. Let\'s head to the homeland of my people.', '', 98233, 0, 35605, 0, 64, 0, 54761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, use my table in the middle of the room to perform your tasks. You\'ll find some Runic Catgut on it as well.', '', 98232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Path of Huln follows in the footsteps of Huln\'s last and greatest hunt.', '', 98229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if I explain that I was just borrowing it, they\'ll have me back. No, no, no! Tytallo would never go for that.', '', 98227, 0, 35518, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shame about that fellow that was living here before. But you did what you had to, Lyndras, to survive.', '', 98226, 0, 35518, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This simply will not do. I MUST find better accommodations.', '', 98225, 0, 35518, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish them. Recast the cloaking spell.', '', 98224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have the spectral sight!', '', 98223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 56999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can they see us?', '', 98222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 56998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One... two... three, four... yes. They\'re all here.', '', 98221, 0, 35518, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
