('$n, will you use your spectral sight on the cave entrance? Something\'s not right.', '', 98201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hear about my future, Ikalyi.', 'Let\'s hear about my future, Ikalyi.', 98200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
