('For the Dark Lady! For Sylvanas!', '', 98189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on tight and try not to scream - Duchess has very sensitive ears.', 98188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should be enough. Get up to the top deck.', 98187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You heard Nathanos. No survivors!', 98186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember our bargain, banshee. Do not dare to cross me...', 98185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?! Impossible... What manner of being are you?!', 98184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wretched mortal - your soul belongs to me!', 98183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, you bilge-rats! I\'ll give you a burial at sea!', 98182, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 52515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
