('', 'At last! With this victory, despair takes root on Azeroth!', 98163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgive me. It felt... so real...', 98162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
