('', 'A small force has infiltrated the Black Temple, but the Sha\'tari army is still being repelled.', 97787, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, there you are. Lord Illidan has placed my Shivarra at your disposal.', 97786, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on your guard. I have no doubt Deathwing left many traps behind to guard these treasures.', '', 97785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, champion. Stay close.', '', 97784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready.', 'Ready.', 97783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize for the ruse, but I did not wish to reveal my identity in front of a tribe of known dragonslayers.$b$bI don\'t think they would approve of the real reason I am here.$b$bChampion, do you stand ready to assist me? I shall make it worth your while.', '', 97782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Socrethar summons aid from portals around the room!', 'Socrethar summons aid from portals around the room!', 97779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lap dogs, all of you!', 'Lap dogs, all of you!', 97778, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 51832, 51832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None may challenge the Brotherhood!', 'None may challenge the Brotherhood!', 97777, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 51831, 51831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! Oh, it\'s you, $n. I was just looking for something. My apologies. I\'ll return to the shop immediately.', '', 97774, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows.... Everywhere....', '', 97773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you think yourself a hunter, using that little toy to lead you around? Let me show you true strength....', '', 97772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRRGHH... My leaves... have fallen...', '', 97771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insects! I will stomp you into the ground!', '', 97770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Val\'sharah will... perish!', '', 97769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was a fool to resist the call of Xavius.. behold my power!', '', 97768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master...', '', 97767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal pulses faintly, but fails to locate any nearby prey....', 'The crystal pulses faintly, but fails to locate any nearby prey.....', 97766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lovely... another fel volcano.', 97765, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I assume the foothold has been established?', 97764, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Illidan sends his best wishes for a speedy success.', 97763, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidari $n, I present the Coilskar.', 97762, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 55301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world is... doomed...', '', 97761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up! There is no hope for this world...', '', 97760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death will not... stop us...', '', 97759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine are not the only hands... stained in blood...', '', 97758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raaarrgh...', '', 97757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terror is all that awaits... you...', '', 97756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master will burn this world... and you with it!', '', 97755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late... this land is ours!', '', 97754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! This land is already ours!', '', 97753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your moon goddess has no power here!', '', 97752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These potions are just delightful...', '', 97751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see your entrails!', '', 97750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from me!', '', 97749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll beg for death when I\'m done with you!', '', 97748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will awaken the darkness inside you!', '', 97747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing will save you from our master!', '', 97746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a taste, that\'s all I need! Just, one... little... TASTE!', '', 97745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why won\'t this blasted cabinet open up!!', '', 97744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s in here! I know it!', '', 97743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'OH GOD, WHAT IS THAT THING?! Someone, help! Please! It\'s tearing my room apart!', 97742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The village is... ours...', 97741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! NO! Craaawwkk...', 97740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coward! You\'ll pay for this...', 97739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curses upon you!', 97738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... Squaaggk!', 97737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters! Avenge me...', 97736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Craaawwkk!', 97735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None shall survive!', 97734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scraaawk! Make it bleed!', 97733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll enjoy killing you!', 97732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shred its flesh! Scraaawk!', 97731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Squaaak! You\'ll regret this!', 97730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A prize for the Witchmother!', 97729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rip the flesh from its bones!', 97728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Squaaak! I\'ll tear you apart!', 97727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroy them! Leave nothing but ash!', 97724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glaive Throwers cannot withstand the terrain outside of the Ravencourt. Return immediately or you will be ejected.', '', 97723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have failed... Lord Balna...', 97722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The mortal approaches the Ashbringer. To arms!', '', 97719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have passed the Trial of Might, outsider. Seek me at the vault\'s entrance, and I will grant you the blessing of the Watchers.', '', 97718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unbelievable! Decades of waiting without a worthy challenger, only to be beaten twice in the same day!', '', 97717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is enough, outsider...', '', 97716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trial of Might sequence concluded.', '', 97715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have brought my armor and glaive...', 97714, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Playtime has ended.', '', 97713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How terribly disappointing.', '', 97712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls are mine.', '', 97711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what\'s behind door number...', '', 97710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death becomes you.', '', 97709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity.', '', 97708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooohh... New subjects.', '', 97707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now you fools have brought me the key. I\'ll thank you to hand it over... willingly or otherwise.', 97706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew she had that artifact secreted away after the events at the Black Temple.', 97705, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 55457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How utterly predictable! Maiev is nothing if not persistent.', 97704, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 55458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your death was inevitable.', 97703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beaten? How! You are... nothing', 97702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not be stopped! I have fought too long, suffered too much. Victory must be mine!', 97701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My powers have grown since joining the Legion. Here, let me show you.', 97700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All night elf children learn to love the dark.', 97699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vengeance will be mine!', 97698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your step! It\'s a long way down.', 97696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your downfall is inevitable.', 97695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeeeah!', 97694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A warden\'s glaive can pierce the toughest armor.', 97693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The best prison needs no walls.', 97692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death embraces you, perhaps not for the first time?', 97691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should know better than to challenge a warden.', 97690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So be it. I will slay you all.', 97689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to my next set of guests.', '', 97685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I could see the future...', '', 97684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That didn\'t look that close...', '', 97683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse the wardens and their mirrors.', '', 97682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
