('Follow the bouncing ball.', '', 97675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can watch from the floor.', '', 97674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t see that one coming did you?', '', 97673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visitors? How exciting!', '', 97672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn this prison to the ground!', '', 97668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... Extinguished.', '', 97667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot contain these flames!', '', 97665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... C.. Cold.', '', 97664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flame! Death!', '', 97663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make ashes of you all!', '', 97662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire has a life of its own.', '', 97661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We give rise to flame.', '', 97660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will blacken, your life extinguished.', '', 97659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh will know the sweet caress of fire.', '', 97658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More fuel for our fire.', '', 97657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire consumes all.', '', 97656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ... long ... where is my Lord of Fire, why does he not answer my call?', '', 97655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot be stopped.', '', 97651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power.. Wasn\'t enough?', '', 97650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anger, hate, rage! These will fuel me with the power I crave!', '', 97649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My powers wane, I must have more!', '', 97648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need no blade to defeat you.', '', 97647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play with fire and you\'ll get burned.', '', 97646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hatred flows through me.', '', 97644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... and I will unleash my fury upon you all!', '', 97643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cast you all aside...', '', 97642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blades hunger.', '', 97641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More power for my blades.', '', 97640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is weakness leaving the universe.', '', 97639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself!', '', 97638, 0, 45594, 0, 64, 0, 52385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the keeper of this vault, it is my duty to test the might of those who wish to proceed.', '', 97637, 0, 45594, 0, 64, 0, 52384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you are ready to face your first trial, outsider.', '', 97636, 0, 45594, 0, 64, 0, 52383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activating sequence: Trial of Might...', '', 97635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so good to fight again.', '', 97634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insignificant gnat. I will enjoy breaking you.', '', 97633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meanwhile, you and I will follow his trail from here. Malfurion must not fall.', 97632, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 52932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make haste to the World Tree. He may be headed there, all too ready to take reckless risks.', 97631, 0, 0, 25, 70, 0, 0, 52930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cenarius\'s loss has left Malfurion unable to see reason.', 97630, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 52927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have wasted too much time here. No more!', '', 97629, 0, 0, 5, 70, 0, 52160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calm yourself, Malfurion. You have not seen the terrible power Xavius now possesses.', 97628, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 52923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time we do not have. The temple was saved, but Cenarius was lost to the Nightmare.', '', 97627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On the contrary, the temple was saved, and there is still time to recover the Tears.', 97626, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 52926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tears of Elune, stolen by Xavius! Then our champion\'s efforts were for nothing?', '', 97625, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 52158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Nightmare Lord must be vanquished, or Val\'sharah is lost.', 97624, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 52921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shaladrassil, the World Tree, has fallen to the Nightmare\'s corruption and spreads its curse across our precious land.', 97623, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Emerald Dream is being overtaken by the Nightmare. The Legion and the satyr Xavius are to blame.', 97622, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 52925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No need to explain, Malfurion. I have seen what is coming.', 97621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Ysera, thank you for answering our call. We face a dire threat!', '', 97620, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 52204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me... hurry, before more come...', '', 97619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p... save... the Ashbringer...', '', 97618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 63798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archive device power at 75 percent...', '', 97617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archive device power at 50 percent...', '', 97616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[Placeholder] My time is short, Spiritwalker. Explain why you have summoned me.', 97615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[Placeholder] I will be honest, the battles have not been going well. While our troops are powerful and well trained, they are not as familiar with war.', 97614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sundering of this one\'s soul has been... taxing. But he will be ours soon.', '', 97613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? How? The whole time?!', 97612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 54273, 6, 5, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('You mortals are so vain... so arrogant. You will suffer for your hubris.', '', 97611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons control Black Rook Hold. You must... stop them...', '', 97610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blood... it burns! The fel energy... I can\'t.... control it... AAAAUUUGGGGHHH!', '', 97609, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander Thalanor, patrol reporting in!', 'Commander Thalanor, patrol reporting in!', 97608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
