('Don\'t mistake me for these weak-minded fools. I\'m here on orders.', '', 97413, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My voice will be the last thing you hear.', 97412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Nazjatar!', 97411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea will claim your corpse.', '', 97410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, landwalker!', '', 97409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no match for us, landwalker.', '', 97408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is plenty of room in my cage for your souls.', '', 97407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Sylvanas! Face the beast you have unleashed!', '', 97406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Can\'t... control...', '', 97405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm the vault! For Gilneas!', '', 97404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your toes, $n! Our defenses are under constant attack from the Legion.$B$BYou can stay and find what comfort there is left, but remember - if you fight, you fight in the name of the Warchief.', '', 97403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!', 97402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your life ends here, dog!', 97401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death awaits you all!', 97400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Stay close.', '', 97399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for your interference!', 97398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will tear your pitiful worgen apart, Greymane!', 97397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help escort the children to safety!', 'I will help escort the children to safety!', 97396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These children... The innocent need not die here on the field of battle.$B$BIf you are brave enough, I could use a hand escorting them to safety.', '', 97394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the best trip ever! I\'m never gonna leave!', '', 97393, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rhol! Look! Look at them all! Rhol? Rhol? Rhol?!', '', 97392, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my god! There\'s another one and it\'s even bigger than the last one!', '', 97391, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is time actually money? Or is it, in fact, a more abstract concept?', '', 97390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite what they say, these people need help. Defend their farms, and we will ease their suspicions.', '', 97389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DNT', '', 97388, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade will bathe in Legion blood before this fight is over.', '', 97387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any word on those picks? I\'m down to me last one.', '', 97386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mineral composition of this stone is amazing... err... who are you?', '', 97385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t mind, I\'m rather busy right now.', '', 97384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s everything I\'ve been able to gather from the obsidian here. Hopefully there\'s something in it that can help with your venture.', '', 97383, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin cowards! GET LOST!', '', 97382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have it all! No fish left behind!', '', 97381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This oil is promising! Gather all the fish you can carry! Melt their bones!', '', 97380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s safe now.', 'It\'s safe now.', 97379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'W-w-where is everyone?', 97378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama Diggs sent me to collect your obsidian analysis report.', 'Mama Diggs sent me to collect your obsidian analysis report.', 97377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am through with this charade! Your soul will feed the Twinblades.', '', 97376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are ready to depart, Aviash can fly you to Thunder Totem.', '', 97375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you crave death, elf? Do you dare face my lord\'s wrath alone?', '', 97374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand what you\'re saying, but I just don\'t have it in me to fight, $n.', 'I understand what you\'re saying, but I just don\'t have it in me to fight, $n.', 97373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be back when it\'s all over.', 'I\'ll be back when it\'s all over.', 97372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good. Can $Ghe:she; fight?', 97371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, $n. It\'s not that I\'m afraid. I\'m just no good in battle.', 'Apologies, $n. It\'s not that I\'m afraid. I\'m just no good in battle.', 97370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the words, $n. I wish I could stay, but I\'ll return when it\'s a bit safer around these parts.', 'Thanks for the words, $n. I wish I could stay, but I\'ll return when it\'s a bit safer around these parts.', 97369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A true $c, $n. I admire your bravery. Please don\'t think less of me. I\'ll be when it\'s safe.', 'A true $c, $n. I admire your bravery. Please don\'t think less of me. I\'ll be when it\'s safe.', 97368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$GHe\'s:She\'s; waking up!', 97367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_ammo_bullet_04:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:190249|h[Explosive Rounds]|h|r on you! Close to melee range to disrupt the Huntress.', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_ammo_bullet_04:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:190249|h[Explosive Rounds]|h|r on you! Close to melee range to disrupt the Huntress.', 97366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you lost one of our naval equipment blueprints?  I can help you out with that!', '', 97365, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another set of Blast Furnace blueprints.', 'I need another set of Blast Furnace blueprints.', 97364, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you lost one of our naval blueprints?  I can help you out with that!', '', 97363, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another set of Destroyer blueprints.', 'I need another set of Destroyer blueprints.', 97361, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s really nothing more I can teach the boy. I wish Mama would send for him already.', '', 97360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, thank you for finding my daughter. Please, you are most welcome here.', '', 97359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, here ya go $Glad:lass;! Could ye let Mama know I\'m running low on picks down here when ye see her again?', '', 97358, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Shadowsong, I was wrong about you. Everyone, put down your arms!', '', 97357, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 52187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Concentrate fire on the Blightcaller!', '', 97356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riders! Circle back. Turn this ship to splinters!', '', 97355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphon Riders! To me!', '', 97354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we\'re not wanted, Minerva. I guess we\'ll just guard the entrance then.', '', 97353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re already dead, idiot!', 97352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 61922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhh!', 'Ahhhhhhh!', 97349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama Diggs sent me to collect your mineral analysis report.', 'Mama Diggs sent me to collect your mineral analysis report.', 97348, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes yes, Diarmad, the dragons are nice, just don\'t bother them or me right no...', '', 97347, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a fellow miner! Mama must have sent you to help me study the forest here. Or perhaps to relieve me of her son, I pray?', '', 97346, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of Amal\'thazad\'s students? Bah! Fine, take your gold.', '', 97345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up, Minerva! We\'re about to pull out of here. Mograine will kill us if we hold things up!', '', 97344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, it\'s $n! I told you $Ghe:she; was going to be the one chosen. Now, pay up!', 97343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have seen too much suffering. It was the Scourge uprising that led us to flee Gilneas many years ago.$B$BNow, undead creatures have risen from the fortress to the north.$B$BI will defend this village to the bitter end.', '', 97342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have our paths crossed before, hero?$B$BI once commanded the night elf forces who defended this land from the Burning Legion, ten thousand years ago.$B$BMy sister is the warden named Maiev, and it is because of her that my path leads here.', '', 97341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happening here?', 'What\'s happening here?', 97340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 97339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Genn is resting.$B$BWe should focus on making contact with the fleet and getting to a fortified position.', 97338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Morashu has lingered in these mountains as long as any tribe. His presence is needed to carry out the cycle of life and death that keeps nature in balance.\n\nIt is said that Morashu guides the spirits of animals when they meet their end. He is with them when the light leaves their eyes, and leads them down a path where their spirits may rejoin nature.', 97337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I never thought to see a demon here in Val\'sharah.', '', 97336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome to anything of value you find on its corpse.', '', 97335, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Morashu.', 'Tell me more about Morashu.', 97334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Skyhorn are not the only ones to suffer at the hands of the harpies. \n\nThe wildlife native to these mountains are plagued by the witches\' cruelty and chaos, and without Morashu to guide their spirits, they will never know peace.', 97333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Placeholder Event: High Crawliac attacks, stealing Zephyrus and leaving the player at this upcoming position>', '', 97332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, mortal, let us see what you are made of.', '', 97331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who calls me?', '', 97330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of the way you must go alone. Follow this path up until you find the Skyhorn. If you live, I shall join you in the skies over Highmountain!', '', 97329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zephyrus is a great spirit, and not easily tamed. Even if we win today, my people will need more reasons to follow you than some artifact from beyond the sea. This may prove the symbol they need to see you as a leader.', '', 97328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The skies belong to the Crawliac!', 97327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a new spell just for you.', 97326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crawliac descends upon you all!', 97325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will make such lovely spells from your bones.', 97324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your corpse shall feed my young.', 97323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot stand against the might of our covens.', 97322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For High Crawliac!', 97321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools. This mountain is ours!', 97320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told Eitrigg not to worry, but I am impressed nonetheless. A powerful artifact obtained and a major demon lord slain!', '', 97319, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!', 'Yes!', 97316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never forget that horror. If it comes to that, we\'ll build another ship. We started over once, and we can do it again.', '', 97314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m telling you, Alistair, I don\'t like this one bit. Don\'t you remember the Scourge uprising back in Gilneas?', 97313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the demons that threaten the the Halls of Valor and Odyn will surely let you compete in the final trial for the Aegis of Aggramar.', '', 97311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep up the good fight, commander! There are other hotspots throughout Tanaan that are now vulnerable to attack.', 97310, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve got Gul\'dan\'s minions scrambling, commander. Consider attacking some of the other Tanaan battlefields while they are on the run.', 97309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, commander. Rangari scouts report that the other battlefields throughout Tanaan are now vulnerable.', 97308, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another triumph for the Alliance! You should press our advantage and attack one of the other Tanaan hotspots.', 97307, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Moonclaw Vale!', '', 97306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare encroaches.', '', 97305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should keep up the pressure, commander. The other hotspots throughout Tanaan are now vulnerable to attack.', 97304, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another glorious victory! If your blood still runs hot, know that the rest of Tanaan\'s battlefields are ripe for the plucking...', 97303, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have the momentum, commander. You should assault the other battlefields throughout the jungle.', 97302, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, if you wish to continue the fight, the other battlefields throughout Tanaan are now ripe for conquest.', 97301, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am confident you are up to the task, $n.', '', 97300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c.', '', 97299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-King Ymiron.blp:50:80|t$bYou\'ve lasted longer than most.', '', 97298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flames will consume you!', '', 97296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will burn!', '', 97295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares awaken me?', '', 97294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion will fall.', 97293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The White Stag returns your gaze, approval in his glowing eyes. His gleaming white fur is so radiant that you have to blink away afterimages.>$b$b<Historically, sightings of Malorne have been rare and fleeting. Clearly your heroic deeds here have earned his favor.>', '', 97292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I am not without mercy... You shall live long enough to watch your precious temple be destroyed.', '', 97291, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy! Turn back now or face the might of the Valarjar!', '', 97289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s gonna blow! Get to safety!', '', 97288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The finest in Goblin applied sciences. All yours, for savin\' my rig!', '', 97287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close! I\'ve got somethin\' to help you stick it to these demons up on top of the rig!', '', 97286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry and get up here or this rig\'s a goner! Bombs, bombs, bombs!', '', 97285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re getting closer! If they destroy the Pressure Control we\'re all gonna have a bad day!', '', 97284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t afford to lose this rig, boys! Break out the bombs!', '', 97283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Sound the alarm! The Sludge Fen rig\'s under attack!', '', 97282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Well done. The fool told us everything.', '', 97281, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Who is your master? Where is he hiding? SPEAK, DAMN YOU!', '', 97280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have what we came for. Finish him!', '', 97279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet Taldath, one of the most powerful eredar we\'ve ever encountered. I\'m sure you two will be fast friends.', '', 97278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you would do the honors, I will stand guard to ensure no one interferes.', '', 97277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 57565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Speak, demon. Who dares hunt the Illidari?', '', 97276, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m outta here! Good luck savin\' the world, boss!', 97275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounding', 'Sounding', 97270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright boss, but you better watch my flank!', 97269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll protect you, Torrix. Get the Demolisher working!', 'I\'ll protect you, Torrix. Get the Demolisher working!', 97267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yo! Think I can get that Demolisher outside up and runnin\', if you think it\'s safe!', 97266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you have a building to build?', 'Don\'t you have a building to build?', 97265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaagh! Vengeance for our sisters!', 'Aaaaaagh! Vengeance for our sisters!', 97264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go make that potion!', 'Let\'s go make that potion!', 97257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is more important tings to do dan sellin\' me goods today, mon.', 'Is more important tings to do dan sellin\' me goods today, mon.', 97256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, $n. May the Waywatcher guide your path.', 'It is good to see you, $n. May the Waywatcher guide your path.', 97255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Savannah Highmane roars ferociously, licks his wounds and surrenders his services.', '', 97254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas will not escape...', '', 97253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilneas... will rise...', '', 97252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greymane... avenge me...', '', 97251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape justice...', '', 97250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51689, 51689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas cannot hide from justice!', '', 97249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll tear you to ribbons!', '', 97248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde will pay for their treachery!', '', 97247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 97246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Gilneas!', '', 97245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have retribution!', '', 97244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give us the Banshee Queen!', '', 97243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thankfully I sensed her presence before she could do too much damage. Is anyone hurt?', '', 97242, 0, 0, 6, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must commend you on ending that miserable worgen, Greymane. \n\nMy only regret is that I was not there to witness his final throes.', 97241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must commend you on ending that miserable worgen, Greymane. \n\nMy only regret is that I was not there to witness his final throes.', 97240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! Invaders!', '', 97239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll chop you up into chum.', '', 97238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not from the ship!', '', 97237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An offering for the tides.', '', 97236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great kraken take you!', '', 97235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make for a fatty meal.', '', 97234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that you have there? A shiny weapon?', '', 97233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sea spray and sand!', '', 97232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Dark Lady.', 97227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Formidable for you, perhaps. We\'ll see how they fare when confronted by the Banshee Queen!', 97226, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Dark Lady, the vrykul here have proven more formidable than anticipated.', 97225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So you mean to tell me that not only were you not able to secure the vault, you were unable to even overtake the village?', 97224, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord of the Seas take you!', '', 97215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PERSIST IN PLUNDERING ITS SECRETS AND YOUR LIFE SHALL BE FORFEIT!', 97214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ATONE FOR YOUR CRIMES! RETURN THE BOOK TO MY PEOPLE!', 97213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MY TOME HOLDS WISDOM GLEANED FROM A THOUSAND LIFETIMES!', 97212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ONCE AGAIN YOU STEAL FROM THE VRYKUL, OUTSIDER!', 97211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friend $n can help rebuild your precious table, Deucus. Oh, and next time, have more care when handling ancient relics!', '', 97210, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be fine, Archmage, but... look what that wretched creature did to my alchemy table!', '', 97209, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dalaran is under my protection, vrykul! BEGONE!', '', 97208, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YOU WILL PAY FOR YOUR INSOLENCE! THIS ENTIRE CITY WILL BURN!', 97207, 0, 0, 463, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ITS SECRETS ARE NOT YOURS TO STEAL, MORTALS!', 97206, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHO DARES TAMPER WITH MY BOOK?', 97205, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see here...', '', 97204, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me over here, $n. I believe we have some of the reagents here on this shelf.', '', 97203, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try the recipe for this \"Draught of Wild Magic\", shall we?', '', 97202, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tiny bait for my hook.', '', 97201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make a fine fillet.', '', 97200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plainsland Cheetah voraciously defends its kin.', '', 97199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fun to smash small people.', '', 97198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_enchant_voidsphere.blp:20|t A Void Star is |cFFF00000|Hspell:189894|h[Fixated]|h|r on you!', '|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\inv_enchant_voidsphere.blp:20|t A Void Star is |cFFF00000|Hspell:189894|h[Fixated]|h|r on you!', 97197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The disturbed tomb, demons here at Black Rook Hold, and the enemy night elves are no coincidence.$B$BThe Legion has resurrected Lord Ravencrest. My former master lives again.', '', 97196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could feel that explosion from here! \n\nThat Gilnean bastard never knew what hit him!', '', 97195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! With the cannons stopped, we can press our advance. \n\nNow we just need to find a way to take out his ship for good...', '', 97194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Koru, you must remain calm. These are our lands. Our people... we will not be defeated.', '', 97193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good that you arrived when you did. Our walls can\'t take much more of a beating from Greymane\'s cannons.', '', 97192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve known these lands for so long...', '', 97191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, Koru. I sense them too, but worry is for the weak. The Legion will not succeed.', '', 97190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 97189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t nobody gone sit at home durin\' these times. Everybody gonna fight.', 'Ain\'t nobody gone sit at home durin\' these times. Everybody gonna fight.', 97188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If dey want war, we gonna bring \'em war.', 'If dey want war, we gonna bring \'em war.', 97187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t nobody \'fraid o\' dem Legion.', 'Ain\'t nobody \'fraid o\' dem Legion.', 97186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin the defense of the temple!', 'I am ready to begin the defense of the temple!', 97185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ysera is attacking the Temple of Elune!$b$bWe must stop her before the temple is completely destroyed... we don\'t have much time!', 97184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe dey got de ships, but we got de lands, tools, and we got eacho\'da.', 'Maybe dey got de ships, but we got de lands, tools, and we got eacho\'da.', 97183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey not gone take dis land from us. Dat be the truth, mon.', 'Dey not gone take dis land from us. Dat be the truth, mon.', 97182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence is not welcome in our lands!', 'Your presence is not welcome in our lands!', 97181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands will not succumb to your kind.', 'These lands will not succumb to your kind.', 97180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Honor!', 'For Honor!', 97179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 97178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us leave this place, $c.', 97177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy your last moments as my venom destroys you from the inside. I delight to know how much you will suffer.', 97176, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\TRADE_ENGINEERING.BLP:50|tClear signs of a confrontation... but Malfurion is not to be found...', '', 97175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\TRADE_ENGINEERING.BLP:50|tAnother of Malfurion\'s plumes... and signs of a struggle. We must find him before it is too late!', '', 97174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\TRADE_ENGINEERING.BLP:50|tA plume from Malfurion\'s coat... he may be close. You must continue the search!', '', 97173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meddlesome worgen, you should have let the flames take you.', 97172, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bat Handler Alzyzek calls forth a Screeching Felbat to rally nearby Legion forces!', 97171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\LFGFRAME\\LFGICON-SUNWELL.BLP:50:80|t$bEnough! You only delay the inevitable!', '', 97170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\LFGFRAME\\LFGICON-SUNWELL.BLP:50:80|t$bThe end has come!', '', 97169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\LFGFRAME\\LFGICON-SUNWELL.BLP:50:80|t$bI do not have time to waste with this distraction. Felguards, cut this one down!', '', 97168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\LFGFRAME\\LFGICON-SUNWELL.BLP:50:80|t$bYou arrogant insect, you think your pathetic blades will harm me?', '', 97167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wager a good amount of gold that she\'ll shoot $n before she shoots her target!', '', 97165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\LFGFRAME\\LFGICON-SUNWELL.BLP:50:80|t$bBurn to Ashes!', '', 97164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warlock_curse_shadow_aura:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186348|h[Wrath of Gul\'dan]|h|r!', '', 97159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consuming', 'Consuming', 97158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merely touch the brazier, and you will be fortified for the battles ahead.', 'Merely touch the brazier, and you will be fortified for the battles ahead.', 97157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, champion! Malorne himself has blessed this gazebo\'s flame.', 'Over here, champion! Malorne himself has blessed this gazebo\'s flame.', 97156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from here, outsider!', '', 97155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw the signs early, but I was trapped within the dream. If only I had warned them sooner!', 97154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am relieved to see my brethren safe. The satyr have been defeated, but our fight is only beginning, I\'m afraid.$B$BIf what they said was true, then our vigil within the Emerald Dream must continue, with even greater urgency than before.', 97153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arthas is healed when the scourge are sacrificed to Frostmourne!', '', 97152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out!', '', 97151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you!', '', 97150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target acquired!', '', 97149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the World Tree! For Val\'sharah!', '', 97148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With our combined might, we will destroy their demonic presence once and for all. They cannot hope to stand against us.', '', 97147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will correct the mistakes of the past and slay these satyrs. I will see their blood as payment for their curse!', '', 97146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not stand idly by and watch my home succumb to this corruption!', '', 97145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, thousands of years later, some malevolent force has broken their bonds, rousing these demons to fight us once again.', '', 97144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The council foolishly decided to banish the satyrs deep below the roots of the World Tree.', '', 97143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These satyrs should never have been allowed to live. A demon can never be redeemed.', '', 97142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lands suffer because of the council\'s shortsightedness...', '', 97141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thaon snarls> These satyrs should never have been allowed to live.', '', 97140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the War of Ancients, the surviving satyrs were assembled together. I argued to execute them for their transgressions, but our merciful nature won the day. I was overruled.$b$bInstead, the satyrs were placed in an eternal sleep deep below the roots of Shaladrassil. Now, somehow, they have awoken.$B$BWe shall not make the same mistake again, if I must kill them all myself!', '', 97139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xandris has seen his last moonrise!', '', 97138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the infinite power of the Twinblades!', '', 97137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it over? Can I go home now?', 'Is it over? Can I go home now?', 97136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A free rescue? You\'re some kind of hero!', 'A free rescue? You\'re some kind of hero!', 97135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll find a way to repay you, I swear!', 'I\'ll find a way to repay you, I swear!', 97134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More outsiders in my skies?! Die!', 97133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show yourselves you cowards...', 97131, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damnit! We\'re sitting ducks out here!', 97130, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 51740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreamworg phases into reality!', 'The dreamworg phases into reality!', 97129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me a moment to catch my breath, hero. The long years of vigil have taken their toll.', 97128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s clobbering time.', '', 97127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet you at Krasus\' Landing. The hunt begins.', '', 97126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just think of the power they could hold... power you could use to destroy the Legion.', '', 97125, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me on deck when the vials are in place. There is someone here I want to kill personally...', '', 97124, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have our revenge, but I\'m far more interested in the blades the demon spoke of.', '', 97123, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place a few vials near their ammunition - before long, the ship will be tearing itself apart from the inside.', '', 97122, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mixture in those vials is extremely volatile. Once you pop the cork, there\'s no containing it.', '', 97121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one is unfortunately resilient. Ready when you are.', 97120, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphons incoming! Man that catapult!', '', 97119, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Varedis will not rest until your heads decorate his throne!', '', 97118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will not be the last ally you lose. Even rats abandon a sinking ship.', '', 97117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
