('The other one put up quite a struggle.', '', 97116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He put up quite a fight, but your archdruid belongs to me now...', '', 97115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to return to the Iron Bulwark.', 'I wish to return to the Iron Bulwark.', 97114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A single gunship? Are they insane?', '', 97113, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 51742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I aid you, $c?', '', 97112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Black Gate.', 'Teleport to the Black Gate.', 97111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to the Destructor\'s Rise.', 'Teleport to the Destructor\'s Rise.', 97110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are victorious! Khadgar was watching the island, but the demons blocked us somehow for teleporting earlier. I should have known you would need no assistance.', '', 97109, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
