('<Skoller pelts you in the face with several nuts before realizing you\'re not a squirrel.>$b$bOh, hello friend. Even in the heart of a war-torn jungle, it\'s important to take care of the little ones.$b$bHey... c\'mere. Since you took the time to say hello... Would you like a gift?', '', 97089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Skoller pelts you in the face with several nuts before realizing you\'re not a squirrel.>$b$bOh, hello friend. Even in the heart of a war-torn jungle, it\'s important to take care of the little ones.', '', 97088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the icy chill of death around you!', '', 97087, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 64174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beasts all over the ship! Put them down!', '', 97086, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a GOD! KNEEL BEFORE ME!', '', 97085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 58252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the Deceiver! Behold the glory of the demon within!', '', 97084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me! Unleash your true power. Do not let the weak hold you back!', '', 97083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, Illidari, you seek my head, that you might take the Twinblades as your own? Allow me to introduce you to their power... personally.', '', 97082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re not going in there, are we?', 97081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was Illidari once... left for dead at the Black Temple. Now you will witness the might of my new master!', '', 97080, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 52043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m feeling a bit more comfortable with my rifle.', 97078, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On to the next one!', 97075, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should we take a S.E.L.F.I.E.?', 97074, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t beat the thrill of hunting something ten times your size!', 97073, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 54849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse Helya! Curse her cowardly followers! I\'ll not rest until she is dead!', '', 97071, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 60406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is pretty much the best day ever!', 97070, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 54850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
