('Pathetic. Begone from my sight... I can\'t stand grovelers.', 'Pathetic. Begone from my sight... I can\'t stand grovelers.', 97054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only laugh that you mortals keep holding on. The master even foresaw the coming of these days.', 'I can only laugh that you mortals keep holding on. The master even foresaw the coming of these days.', 97053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you speak to me!', 'How dare you speak to me!', 97052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nicely done! Patricia has a new recipe for you, $n.', '', 97051, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for heroic dungeon', 'Queue for heroic dungeon', 97050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for dungeon', 'Queue for dungeon', 97049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Often rare finds only come from the darkest of places, $n. Dare I speak the name aloud? Venture into Helheim... if you dare!', '', 97048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That particular burette was designed by Alchemist Mallory of Stormwind. I\'ve heard that similarly valuable equipment might be stored in the Violet Hold.$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127878', '', 97047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The alchemists of old were known to be buried alongside their implements. Searching within Suramar Crypts may yield results.$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127877', '', 97046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artifacts of such potency are supposedly kept within the Vault of the Wardens. There are whispers of trouble in those halls, so be careful!$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127876', '', 97045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The delicate yet resilient fabric needed for this sort of filter would come from a place of majesty and power. The locals speak of something called the Halls of Valor... you might investigate.$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127875', '', 97044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s said the ancient vrykul collected such powderfrom the residue of dragon\'s breath. If it\'s true that Neltharion\'s Lair lies somewhere below us, it seems a likely source.$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127874', '', 97043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We require a flask capable of mixing more than reagents. Thoughts, ideas, dreams...$b$bYou may have to search the Emerald Nightmare for such an item!$b$bPLAYTEST CHEAT: CI 127872', '', 97042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naga have been known to hoard all manner of potions, so they might have the sort of corks we need. The best place to search is the Eye of Azshara itself!', '', 97041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard that someone over in the engineering shop is selling a burner that might be usable. You could likely negotiate a fairer price than I could!$b$bThe shop is just across the street. I\'ll make a note on your map for you.', '', 97040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our alchemy table remains woefully incomplete.$b$bI shall use my extensive knowledge to point you in the direction of replacement parts, but I fear you will have to do some legwork on your own.', '', 97039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
