('What, good $gsir:madam;, can I do to assist you today?', '', 97028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face not Malchezaar alone, but the legions I command!', '', 97027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 9322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashtongue, forward!', '', 97026, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 55048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will assist in establishing the volcano foothold.', '', 97025, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 55047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
