('DIE!', '', 97023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If this is truly the end of the world, then I, for one, will go out fighting. For Samara, for Maraad, for all those who gave their lives to give us this day!', 97022, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our warriors are blessed by the light, sure of purpose and hardened by battle. They await your orders.', 97021, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan\'s fel minions are closing in around us. We MUST go on the offensive, commander!', 97020, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have the latest reports from the Rangari right here, commander. Where should we strike?', 97019, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This jungle hides dangers untold. But if we are wise, we can use it to mask our next attack.', 97018, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan will not break us. The Legion will NEVER break us! Today we fight back.', 97017, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan is creating his own army of zealots. Where should we strike back?', 97016, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle rages throughout Tanaan, Commander. Where shall we focus our attention today?', 97015, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a tragic waste. Even in death, he only wanted to protect our people.', '', 97014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here! This sewer will take us back outside. We should go before our enemies regroup.', 97013, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\'arg, to the front! This has gone on long enough.', '', 97012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ends here, Demons!', '', 97011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there you are!', '', 97010, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test my hammer, and YOU will be the one to break!', '', 97009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have secured the walls, demon! You will not escape here alive.', '', 97008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lieutenant Stareye commands. Death to all intruders!', 97007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Dreadmist Peak!', 'Take me to Dreadmist Peak!', 97006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay to ease this prisoner\'s passing. It won\'t be long, now. Go ahead and find Maiev.', '', 97005, 0, 35324, 1, 64, 0, 52651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrgghhh... ENOUGH!', '', 97004, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take out the guards inside the prison. Get those keys and meet me within the cells.', '', 97003, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop holding back, old man! Show us the real you.', '', 97002, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monsters! You have no place in this world!', '', 97001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call us monsters? How rich.', '', 97000, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 51754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from me!', '', 96999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, Sylvanas!', '', 96998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, hero. I did not expect salvation from this place. Where is my brother?', 96997, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll reduce this camp to rubble if I have to!', '', 96996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas! Come and face your executioner!', '', 96995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hand over the Banshee Queen!', '', 96994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay them all! For the Dark Lady!', '', 96993, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 51752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, return to your other duties for now. Soon we will face Lord Ravencrest himself.', 96992, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must retrieve it. He\'s still my charge. We\'ll have to invade the tower. But it will be no easy task.', 96991, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to believe it. Lord Ravencrest cannot be working with Gul\'dan.', '', 96990, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sira and the other Wardens are doing everything they can to find Maiev.$B$BThe attack on the Vault of the Wardens was devastating. Of hundreds, only a handful survived.$B$BBut the Wardens are tough as steel. They will survive.', '', 96989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How strange... Ravencrest\'s army sees us as invaders. It\'s as if they are trapped within their own memories.', '', 96988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wardens are searching every corner of the Broken Isles for Gul\'dan.$B$BThey have reason to believe the warlock hides some secret within Black Rook Hold. And if he is here, then so perhaps is my sister, Maiev.', '', 96986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a fine day for a hunt.', '', 96985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death makes me stronger.', '', 96983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you afraid of?', '', 96982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... really isn\'t so bad.', '', 96981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
