('For now, our goals align with his. And in the meantime, it is in our best interests that the Scourge stay... contained.', '', 96964, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 61926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gates of Icecrown lie to the north. Do not keep our ally waiting!', '', 96962, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 61927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
