('The Silver Hand will remove your blight from this world!', '', 96956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace... at... last...', '', 96955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You unholy monster! The righteous fury of the Light will tear you apart!', '', 96954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... no...', '', 96953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You an\' that prince of yours are gonna pay for what he did to ole\' Muradin!', '', 96952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king may have fallen but I will never abandon Lordaeron!', '', 96951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not pass!', 'You shall not pass!', 96950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here!', 'You are not welcome here!', 96949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quel\'Thalas will never fall!', 'Quel\'Thalas will never fall!', 96948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See that you do.', 96947, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 55075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, I can rest.', 96946, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You handle the Witchqueen. We will contend with her brood.', '', 96945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, champion. Let us pluck this Witchqueen from her throne.', '', 96944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares stand against the might of the Legion?', '', 96943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry to hear that Arduen didn\'t make it. I will make sure the demons pay for his death.', 96942, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is ancient vrykul script, the property of someone named \"Svena\". A rare and intriguing find indeed. Tell Deucus he is now in MY debt!', '', 96941, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I do owe that blowhard a favor. Lucky for you, translation is my specialty!', '', 96940, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The differences that have set the Arakkoa apart for years seem so trivial today. We have squandered the might of our people on fear and mistrust of one another when we should have been looking beyond the safety of Skyreach. There is nothing to be done about the past, but know that there are some who wish for our people to be more than a footnote to what Gul\'dan has wrought.\n\nI will help you, $c. We must all help one another now, or this world is doomed.', '', 96939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Now that was a battle.', '', 96938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skyhorn, to me!', '', 96937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deucus said you owe him a favor. I have a tome in need of translation.', 'Deucus said you owe him a favor. I have a tome in need of translation.', 96935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Scribes\' Sacellum!', '', 96934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I almost... made it... out...', '', 96933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will personally deal with their leader, my queen.', '', 96932, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 55141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $c! Your help is needed inside!', '', 96931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each Vision of Death rune needs someone within it to avoid raid damage!', '', 96930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My master has granted me many gifts. Witness the power of the Deceiver!', '', 96929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n... it\'s been years. You should know better than to stand against me.', '', 96928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lieutenant has ordered your execution.', 96927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enjoy this moment. It will be your last!', 96926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you won\'t return to your world, I\'ll send you there in pieces!', 96925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My strike is swift and true!', 96924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop, interloper. I\'ll make you bleed first!', 96923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never miss!', 96922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will grant you a swift death, trespasser.', '', 96921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have slain hundreds before you. You\'ll simply be one more notch on my belt.', '', 96920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wipe your blood off my blade, just like the rest!', '', 96919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind is not welcome here!', '', 96918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world has no place for you, demon!', '', 96917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll get no further, invader!', '', 96916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been training for this moment!', '', 96915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder! Sound the alarm!', '', 96914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 60989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another prisoner for my cells? Looks like I\'ll need to break you first!', '', 96913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have gone far enough, mortal. This ends here.', '', 96912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand firm, champions! Our might is tested, but we shall prevail!', '', 96911, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally to me, soldiers! No matter the foes we face, Black Rook Hold shall not fall!', '', 96910, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors, you pledged your blades to the House of Ravencrest. Today, we take up arms and fight!', '', 96909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These demons think us easy prey. Today they will learn that the kaldorei stand down to no one.', '', 96908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people look to us for aid. Make these foul creatures regret the day they invaded our world!', '', 96907, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exposition', '', 96906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_antimagicshell.blp:20|t |cFF2959D3|Hspell:184366|h[Anti-Magic Shell]|h|r to avoid harmful spells!', 'Use |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_antimagicshell.blp:20|t |cFF2959D3|Hspell:184366|h[Anti-Magic Shell]|h|r to avoid harmful spells!', 96905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_deadofnight.blp:20|t Cull the scourge before they are sacrificed!', '', 96904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of the souls freed by Frostmourne\'s destruction wander the halls of Icecrown, lashing out in eternal torment.', '', 96903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 52482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! This is a perfect natural harbor.', '', 96902, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 50555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the darkness consume you! Feast upon the souls of the damned!', '', 96900, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 64192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find my husband in the battlefield to the west! I pray our losses were not too great.', 96899, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 50347, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seek out Maladaar in the west. I fear he may have encountered the brunt of Gul\'dan\'s forces.', 96898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50584, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks! Let\'s get to work. Here kitty, kitty, kitty...', 96897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish the portal, damn you! We must protect the wards!', '', 96896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to purchase Seals of Tempered Fate.', 'I\'d like to purchase Seals of Tempered Fate.', 96895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death awaits...', '', 96894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your failure will please the master!', '', 96893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wrath of the Legion will destroy you!', '', 96892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final hour is at hand, the master comes! This is your purpose, summoners. Mannoroth will be whole again!', '', 96891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar! They are pushed back! To the portal! Gul\'dan is mine!', '', 96890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will not fall so easily, demon. Its people will not give up without a fight. Our will is unbreakable! For Draenor!', '', 96889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YES! YES! I SEE IT! I can see... the... end...', '', 96888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT OVERWHELMS ME!', '', 96887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I CANNOT... CONTAIN...', '', 96886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RIP APART!', '', 96885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN!', '', 96884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot remain... I am becoming... EVERYTHING! NOTHING!', '', 96883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be swallowed! No life shall remain!', '', 96882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These gaps in reality... I must tear them wider!', '', 96881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I TEAR APART! AND WITH ME, YOU TOO SHALL DIE!', '', 96880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEGION! Destroy all who stand before you!', '', 96879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corruption! Flame! Ash!', '', 96878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All life must decay.', '', 96877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Servants of the Void! Swallow this world!', '', 96876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have so much to show you...', '', 96875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter how it all ends, you will die here.', '', 96874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will BURN! Die! The master wills it!', '', 96873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, they become nothingness... or, perhaps...', '', 96872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many worlds... so many layers of existence...', '', 96871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishnu-dal-dieb, traveler.', '', 96870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Queen\'s thirst for power doomed us all.', 96869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara kept her secrets well. By the time I saw the demons first-hand, it was already too late.', 96868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time I put you down, Greymane!', 96867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bathe them in hellfire! Halt their advance!', '', 96866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARRGHHHHHH!!!', '', 96861, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 64173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! The darkness... I can\'t... I...', '', 96860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interfere! His soul belongs to ME!', '', 96858, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 64191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons underestimate your power. Punish them for their hubris!', '', 96857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me, Banshee Queen. Answer for your crimes!', '', 96856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms! Lord Felsoul must not be disturbed.', '', 96855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? An intruder! You won\'t stop me! Frostmourne will be mine!', '', 96854, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 64171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will suffer for this! Bring me his head!', 96853, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insolent dog!', 96852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... you are right... I will bear any curse to have my revenge...', '', 96851, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take up the blade, Arthas Menethil. Embrace your destiny!', '', 96850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 64190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hyyeeaahhhaaay!', '', 96849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charge!', 'Charge!', 96848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That wasn\'t necessary of ya, but you have my thanks.', 96846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even though these woods have been lost to the corruption of Shaladrassil, this is still our home.$b$bThe fate of the forest is ours to share.', 96844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to sketch group! Grab an easel, get comfortable. No judgments here - unless you\'re a Paladin, of course.$b$bToday we\'re studying the nexus. Such beauty! Such chaos! So much... blue.', '', 96843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand back. I do not need your assistance.', 96842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient moonwell has seen better days, but its waters still glow with the radiant  moonlight of Elune.', '', 96841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should have listened... On your guard, $c.', 96840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shalll enjoy putting you down.', '', 96838, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I find you spending your last moments with this, this beast.', '', 96837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho ho. Well looky here. We got ourselves something new to hunt.', '', 96836, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone up for sketch group?', '', 96835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a workout!', '', 96834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How ya doin\'?', '', 96833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorefiend begins to cast |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_misc_zandalari_council_soulswap:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:181973|h[Feast of Souls]|h|r!', 'Gorefiend begins to cast |TInterface\\Icons\\spell_misc_zandalari_council_soulswap:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:181973|h[Feast of Souls]|h|r!', 96832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
