('Score? Don\'t be a fool. You are badly injured.', 'Score? Don\'t be a fool. You are badly injured.', 96831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be fine, $c. Turn back. This is my score to settle.', 96830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you ever listen to your elders, $c? No matter, you did save my life.$B$BLet me rest a while. I\'ll be fine, just wait.', 96829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the antlers of Cenarius! Where is it?', 96828, 0, 35394, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where could it have gone?', 96827, 0, 35394, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe the current moved it...', 96826, 0, 35394, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... it must be around here somewhere!', 96825, 0, 35394, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t trust a gnome with a gun. \n\nAddie\'s more likely to shoot you than any of her intended targets.', 96824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
