('I am everburning!', '', 96625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my memory serves me... there was an outpost not far from here.', '', 96624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That citadel\'s not going to destroy itself! Clear a landing site on the farm and we\'ll get you some birds for the assault!', '', 96623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the field of these demons and we\'ll get you the birds you\'ll need to attack this citadel!', '', 96622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your darkness burns within me!', '', 96621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like the wind!', '', 96620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great kill down there! Here comes the air support!', '', 96619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! We must press onward... The fate of the world is at stake!', '', 96618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you further ahead... We must hurry!', '', 96617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot... allow Xavius... to get away with this! We must get to Shaladrassil... and put an end to the demon!', '', 96616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel Touch is within your grasp!', 'The Fel Touch is within your grasp!', 96615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to earn the Legion\'s gift!', 'You have to earn the Legion\'s gift!', 96614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Shields up, everyone. We\'re headed outside! Form up!', 96613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sergeant! I hear movement outside. It could be our reinforcements!', '', 96612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re dead if we stay here too long. Allen, keep your eyes open for any sign of help! We move as soon as reinforcements are in sight!', 96611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! I won\'t stand for this cowardace.', 96610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re completely cut off. We have to wait for reinforcements!', '', 96609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priom\'s right. Those things will crush us! It\'s just the five of us!', '', 96608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t go out there! Are you crazy? Have you seen those things?', '', 96607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT TRANSLATE', '', 96606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish druid. The power of your goddess is pitiful. Behold the might of Xavius!', '', 96605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Little brother. You came for me. Even after I tried to k--', 96604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('White Lady, grant me your light so that I may purge these waters of the vile corruption of Xavius.', '', 96603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you find Maiev.', 'I\'ll help you find Maiev.', 96602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT TRANSLATE', '', 96601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know my sister. She\'d never commit such crimes unless she was under some foul influence.$B$BEven so, rather than investigate fully, I assumed the worst.$B$BI\'ve been a poor brother, but there\'s still time for me to make things right.', '', 96600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She murdered innocents, hoping to sever our people\'s ties with the Alliance.$B$BStill, I couldn\'t bring myself to kill her.$B$BAt first I thought that I\'d been weak -- that love had left me unable to do what was necessary.', '', 96599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maiev and I chose very different paths in life.$B$BNot long after the Legion\'s first defeat on Azeroth, she dedicated her life to the pursuit of justice.$B$BSome would say she\'s gone too far in that pursuit at times.', '', 96598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So why are you trying to save her?', 'So why are you trying to save her?', 96597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did she do?', 'What did she do?', 96596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you and your sister get separated?', 'How did you and your sister get separated?', 96595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The undead approach! To arms!', '', 96593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be thrown into the prisons, just like the others.', '', 96588, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52245, 52245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall never reach Lord Ravencrest\'s tower!', '', 96587, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52244, 52244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In death, I see the truth. You are no enemy.', 96586, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My loyalty to Lord Ravencrest will not falter.', '', 96585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52242, 52242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Ravencrest, I have served you loyally.', 96584, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve come for the warden, you\'re too late!', '', 96583, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His loss was tragic for us all. We owe him... everything.', '', 96582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Ravencrest saved our people and rescued our world from annihilation.', '', 96581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the ancient war began, we suffered countless losses. Our cities burned.', '', 96580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir, mother of the Val\'kyr, I offer you this one chance to submit willingly.', 96579, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s Maiev\'s weapon! She was here!', '', 96578, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Despite our attempts to extract information, the Warden remains stubbornly resistant.\" Could they be talking about Maiev?', '', 96577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one met a grisly end. No sign of Maiev here.', '', 96576, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! Show them we will not be broken by such petty sorcery.', '', 96575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... such a pleasant aroma.', '', 96574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A touch of this for ailments... or double for a more... sinister use, perhaps.', '', 96573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Potions by day. Potions by night.', '', 96572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elixirs require such a delicate touch.', '', 96571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ingredients as far as the eye can see...', '', 96570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The smallest touch adds a just enough.', '', 96569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vermin! My lord wields power beyond your comprehension! He will end you!', '', 96568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twinblades... will be your end...', '', 96567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varedis will hunt down every one of your disgusting ilk. Pity you won\'t be around to witness it.', '', 96566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 64644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOL! You dare face me alone?!', '', 96565, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 64639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-ARCHIMONDEWOD.blp:50:80|t$B[Taldath the Destroyer] Insolent whelps! Release me now and I may yet spare you.', '', 96564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Warlock_Summon_DoomGuard.blp:50:80|t$bWe didn\'t kill all of you at the Broken Shore? I shall correct that mistake now!', '', 96563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Warlock_Summon_DoomGuard.blp:50:80|t$bI am here Pillik! What insect scared you off?!? Come out of there insect or I will bring everything down upon you!', '', 96562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darksorrow and Ravencrest will have the honor of accompanying you into Suramar, $p. A small force will have the best chance of flying undetected into the hold.', '', 96561, 0, 36911, 0, 64, 0, 57566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Selin Fireheart.blp:50:80|t$b[Kayn Sunfury] Do not hold back, $n. Show him your wrath.', '', 96560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Despite a heavy cloth across his eyes, the wizened seer gazes up at the skies with a contemplative look.>$B$BThe stars shape our destinies, child, granting their blessing to the worthy and shunning the weak.', '', 96559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may carry a book instead of a rifle, but I assure you $n, I\'m a hunter at heart.', 96558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186407|h[Shadowfel Annihilation]|h|r detonates on $n!', 'A |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186407|h[Shadowfel Annihilation]|h|r detonates on $n!', 96556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slash. Burn. Harvest!', '', 96555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New directives: Serve Legion. Destroy property.', '', 96554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-King Ymiron.blp:50:80|t$bYou are the one, bring them glory and they will bring glory to you. I will finally take my place in the Halls of Valor, where the brave may fight forever.', '', 96553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xhul\'horac targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186333|h[Void Surge]|h|r!', 'Xhul\'horac targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186333|h[Void Surge]|h|r!', 96552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was an exhilarating kill, one that will make a fine chapter in my next novel.', '', 96551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 54837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin the trial.', 'I am ready to begin the trial.', 96550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heard any pet battle news out of Tanaan Jungle?', 'Heard any pet battle news out of Tanaan Jungle?', 96547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve heard rumors of no less than 15 very powerful pets, corrupted by the fel energies unleashed by Gul\'dan. Find and defeat them and you\'ll surely find some rewards of value!', 96546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dread-Riders, grab as many vials as you can carry and form up on me! We are bringing down that gunship.', '', 96543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy worgen... A beast in a hat is still a beast.', '', 96542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Xhul\'horac targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186407|h[Fel Surge]|h|r!', 'Xhul\'horac targets you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186407|h[Fel Surge]|h|r!', 96541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing but a scale? Hah! A scale from the most hard to kill dragon in the world!\n\nMagnar realized what he had and spent years learning the forge under masters both titanforged and vrykul. When he was finally skilled enough, he crafted from the scale a shield and sword that have never seen an equal. Those are the Armaments of the Black Wyrm. In the right hands they project the strength and invulnerability of the Earthwarder himself.\n\nTo this day I am still unsure if he was lucky to survive that encounter or if the Black Wyrm judged him worthy enough to live.', '', 96539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So he left with nothing but a scale?', 'So he left with nothing but a scale?', 96538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know of the Earthwarder, Neltharion? He was a glorious beast before he... fell. He was invulnerable to all but the gods in that age. Magnar worshipped him in his youth.\n\nEven though he was a venerated warrior Magnar wanted to be like him, invulnerable. His plan was arrogant. He would storm the nest of Neltharion himself and take something from his legendary hoard.\n\nMagnar and his warband fought Neltharion\'s younglings in a fierce battle. They had just made the nest when the dragon returned. With one breath he wiped away entire force. Magnar grabbed one of his cast off scales, used it to shield himself, and was blown down the mountain.', '', 96537, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the Armaments of the Black Wyrm?', 'What are the Armaments of the Black Wyrm?', 96535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to pass my legacy on to someone powerful enough to wield them. Survive my trial and you will be given the strongest sword and shield this world has ever seen...', '', 96533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrier', '', 96529, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroyer', '', 96528, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battleship', '', 96527, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Submarine', '', 96526, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transport', '', 96525, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must take the fight to them. But it would be rude to show up without a gift... The apothecaries will have just what we need.', '', 96523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Submarine', '', 96522, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battleship', '', 96521, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir... I have failed...', 96519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The temple must not fall...', 96518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Break upon my shield!', 96517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect the temple!', 96516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle is upon us, sisters!', 96515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shield remains... unbroken...', 96513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was... a glorious death...', 96512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Halls of Valor await...', 96511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir, be my wings...', 96510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters, to battle!', 96509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 60751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are but another test!', 96508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My shield will not falter!', 96507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not worthy of ascension!', 96506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir, guide my spear!', 96505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyir take you!', 96504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You defile these grounds!', 96503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroyer', '', 96502, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrier', '', 96501, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transport', '', 96500, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bold fools are boarding my ship. Come on!', '', 96499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DO NOT TRANSLATE', '', 96498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, we are safe and secure within the walls. There is no need for panic.', 'Ladies and gentlemen, we are safe and secure within the walls. There is no need for panic.', 96495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, listen a moment. We are forcing them back as we speak!', 'Please, listen a moment. We are forcing them back as we speak!', 96494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will not penetrate our defenses. I assure you!', 'The Legion will not penetrate our defenses. I assure you!', 96493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest assured, Sentinel Hill is well protected!', 'Rest assured, Sentinel Hill is well protected!', 96492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, please! Please! We are doing all we can to address the situation.', 'Ladies and gentlemen, please! Please! We are doing all we can to address the situation.', 96491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_Warlock_EmpoweredImp.blp:50:80|tOuch ouch! I must get help!', '', 96490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\Ability_Warlock_EmpoweredImp.blp:50:80|tI smell power behind this door! Let\'s dig it up!', '', 96489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seek your fate in the vault, $n. May Eyir be your wings.', 96488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 51701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may proceed, but know that Eyir may not regard you as I do.', 96487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know your worth. I will grant you an audience with Eyir.', 96486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 51699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this? The hero of Helheim seeks entrance to the vault?', 96485, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 51693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... who is the murderer?', '', 96484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You high and mighty types are worse than demons!', '', 96483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t work with murderers. The Defias are never to be trusted!', 'I don\'t work with murderers. The Defias are never to be trusted!', 96482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s team up. If we fight, we only help the demons.', 'Let\'s team up. If we fight, we only help the demons.', 96481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally we get some help around here. That is, if you\'re willing to put aside past differences, for now.', '', 96480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_astralrecalgroup:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:187702|h[Twisted Reflection]|h|r!', '', 96479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
