('Greetings, and thank you for helping to test patch 6.2!\n\nI can teleport you directly into Hellfire Citadel or Tanaan Jungle. This is just a teleport, not a match-making service, so I hope you have a party ready to tackle the challenges waiting inside. If not, you might want to check out our new Group Finder feature to find some allies.\n\nMake sure you have selected the difficulty you want to test before teleporting, since you may not be able to zone out easily if you need to change the difficulty setting!', '', 96300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[WALKS FORWARD.] Wait, what is this? His tomb has been disturbed! His ashes are gone!', '', 96299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The tower beckons, but I fear its call. Hurry, free us before it\'s too late!', 96298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Ravencrest appointed me as Queen Azshara\'s personal guard.', 96297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are not parts one should wander alone, $n. Allow me to offer you safe travel.', '', 96296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glad to see you out here, $n. Care for a lift?', '', 96295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears we both have been wandering for quite some time. Would you care for some company?', '', 96294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Ravencrest died long ago, but I will always revere him as my mentor.', '', 96293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I fight in your name!', '', 96292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a go with me mortar. I\'ll spot for ye!', '', 96291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tirion!', '', 96290, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul demons! You are no match for the Horde!', '', 96289, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was drawn back to this place, and for a moment I mistook you for the enemy. Be careful, hero. This place reeks of restless spirits.', 96284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queen Azshara... betrayed us...', 'Queen Azshara... betrayed us...', 96283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? Stay back - I will protect the Queen with my last breath!', 'Who are you? Stay back - I will protect the Queen with my last breath!', 96282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... The taint of Xavius is too strong.', '', 96281, 0, 0, 20, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Investigate the map.', 'Investigate the map.', 96280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A map of the Broken Isles showing the current status of your forces.', 'A map of the Broken Isles showing the current status of your forces.', 96279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn... BURN!', '', 96278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I walk in shadow...', '', 96277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To cinders!', '', 96276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To ash...', '', 96275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade seeks vengeance!', '', 96274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! I want MORE!', '', 96273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rip the meat from your bones!', '', 96272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink your blood! Eat your flesh!', '', 96271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush you!', '', 96270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush you!', '', 96269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to feast!', '', 96268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Dark Lady.', '', 96267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know you\'re after something. Out with it!', 'We know you\'re after something. Out with it!', 96266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Organize our defenses beginning with the rear. I want bat-riders in the air and catapults at the ready!', 96265, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me scratch you to bits!', '', 96264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, of course. Come along... \"hero.\"', '', 96263, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Queen, your safety must be our first concern. Surely we can leave a few ships behind to-', '', 96262, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us your plans, imp!', 'Tell us your plans, imp!', 96261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not question me, Nathanos. Now go - make for the Eternity, and bring this hero with you.', 96260, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ArRRgghhHhh...', '', 96259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ArRRgghhHhh...', '', 96258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ArRRgghhHhh...', '', 96257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron Horde will CRUSH you!', '', 96256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance will be upon us soon, and we have nowhere to run.', 96255, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And then the dead shall rise once more.', 96253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The void, it hungers!', 96252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It rips. It tears. It is boundless and eternal...', 96251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will carry the darkness with them.', 96250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have been marked.', 96249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has fallen. It is mine now.', 96248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'How it struggles when death is near!', 96247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sweet mercy... of death.', 96246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gurtogg! Dispatch our enemies...', 96245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They come for us! They will not find what they seek...', 96244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 96243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For centuries you have acted as uninvited guests in OUR world.', 'For centuries you have acted as uninvited guests in OUR world.', 96242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No presence is greater, mortals. In time you will see...', 'No presence is greater, mortals. In time you will see...', 96241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope is your only enemy.', 'Hope is your only enemy.', 96240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile beings serve no purpose under the Legion!', 'Fragile beings serve no purpose under the Legion!', 96239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The world crumbles under the Legion!', '', 96238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic! Do these lands offer no challenge?', 'Pathetic! Do these lands offer no challenge?', 96237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands will fall to our hand.', 'These lands will fall to our hand.', 96236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it breathes, put it out of its misery.', 'If it breathes, put it out of its misery.', 96235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand united!', '', 96234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bask in the glory of the Light.', 96233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will never leave your side.', '', 96232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Face your judgment!', 96229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can handle the defense of the research station from here. Heroes, close the portals to cut off their line of attack!', 96228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The relic shall be ours!', 'The relic shall be ours!', 96227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our numbers are infinite!', 'Our numbers are infinite!', 96226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before the might of the Legion!', 'Cower before the might of the Legion!', 96225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use that flare gun to mark the birds. That\'ll daze \'em long enough for me to take \'em out!', 96224, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 52264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope they are still alive. It would break the Mayor\'s heart if we couldn\'t find his little girl.', 96223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will interfere no longer, mortals. Surrender the relic, or the Legion will burn you to ash and pluck it from your cinders! [PH]', '', 96222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few more o\' these and I might even join this fight.', '', 96221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We was supposed to be off hours ago... at least we have these brews, eh?', '', 96220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Papa, papa, I\'m home! $GMister:Miss; $p saved me!', 96219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Penelope? Thank goodness you\'re all right! I was so worried!', '', 96218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Ashildir tells you about the Val\'kyr.', '', 96217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Fel Lord has fallen, and the legion has retreated! We have pushed them back for now, but we must stay vigilant. [PH]', 96216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion is invading the research station! Heroes, rally with me. We must protect the Kirin Tor at all costs! [PH]', 96215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Portal Lord collapses, leaving its portal exposed! (Click the portal, glow is broken)', 'The Portal Lord collapses, leaving its portal exposed! (Click the portal, glow is broken)', 96214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more minutes here...  She will be seaworthy shortly!', '', 96213, 0, 923, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this works, druid.', 'I hope this works, druid.', 96212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption of the Nightmare has seeped into the waters of the river.$B$BStand by, $c. I will call upon the power of Elune and purge this river.', '', 96211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of Xavius is too potent. I do not know what we can do against his Nightmare.', '', 96210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 96208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempt to commune with the statue.', 'Attempt to commune with the statue.', 96207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you stands a statue depicting the leader of the Shieldmaidens in Skold-Ashil. \n\nHer features look familiar...', '', 96206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Communing With Ashildir', '', 96205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, Commander!  Let\'s get started on these naval missions!', '', 96203, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I almost lost the fight against the fel energy inside me.', '', 96202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 55311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Controlling our fleet is no easy task, Commander.', '', 96201, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk to me about naval missions.', 'Talk to me about naval missions.', 96200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings Commander!  We have lots of work to do before we get this shipyard operational!', '', 96199, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord Tirion Fordring\'s last light fades.', 'Highlord Tirion Fordring\'s last light fades.', 96198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be missed, brother.', '', 96197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will be all for now. Go on, then.', 'That will be all for now. Go on, then.', 96196, 0, 34216, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should start by filling the dyeing tub. Green dye\'s on the shelf, but you\'ll have to get the brimstone shavings from Alard Schmied in the blacksmithing shop.', 96195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brimstone? What could she possibly want THAT for? Gah, tailors. Here you go.', '', 96194, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanithria at the tailoring shop needs some brimstone shavings for a pattern.', 'Tanithria at the tailoring shop needs some brimstone shavings for a pattern.', 96193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill the tub with green dye and brimstone shavings.', 'Fill the tub with green dye and brimstone shavings.', 96192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This is a tub suitable for dyeing fabric. The pattern you are working on requires a combination of green dye and brimstone shavings.>', '', 96191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dye the silkweave.', 'Dye the silkweave.', 96190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill the tub with amber dye.', 'Fill the tub with amber dye.', 96189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This is a tub suitable for dyeing fabric.>', '', 96188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With his final breath, Khadgar unleashes a mana explosion that decimates everyone.', '', 96187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s our status, Orc?', 96186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must go to Light\'s Hope Chapel at once. Highlord Fordring deserves to be put to rest amongst the ancient heroes of the Light buried there.', '', 96185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The last thing you see is a Hellblaze Mistress laughing over your corpse.', 96184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your last moments are agony as you fall before the Hellblaze Fiend.', '', 96183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After years of heroism, your life is snuffed out by a Hellblaze Imp.', '', 96182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, come closer and let me have a good look at you.$B$BAh! A $c, all the way out in these parts? My goodness!', 96181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a long way down!', '', 96180, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds will punish you!', '', 96179, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had better learn to fly!', '', 96178, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terokk can not protect you!', '', 96177, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Veil can not hide my might!', '', 96176, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness true power!', '', 96175, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think you have won? You know nothing!', '', 96174, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like shootin\' fish in a bloody barrel.', 96173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Headshot. Easy as pie.', 96172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somebody order a bullseye?', 96171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pow! Right in the kisser!', 96170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got that one, clear as day.', 96169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No way I\'ll miss this shot!', 96168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see \'em. Good job with those stun grenades, $Glad:lass;!', 96167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got \'em in my sights!', 96166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I took a pretty bad hit up there... my bird\'s still in good shape though. Bag a few Demons for me, eh?', 'I took a pretty bad hit up there... my bird\'s still in good shape though. Bag a few Demons for me, eh?', 96164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 30, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll return to camp. You bring word of our findings to Greymane. Hurry, $c, this place is about to go down on our heads!', '', 96163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Briefing', 'Briefing', 96162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Crowley rigs explosives to the machine.', '', 96161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us dispatch of this infernal machine. At least we may be able to prevent Sylvanas from creating a new army of Val\'kyr...', '', 96160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, the Veil covers all!', '', 96159, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses! The banshee witch escaped! Greymane will not be pleased...', '', 96158, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terokk\'s lies are proven false!', '', 96157, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only truth is your death.', '', 96156, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you dwell in darkness.', '', 96155, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Sylvanas narrowly escapes, leaving you to fight her newest dark Val\'kyr!', '', 96154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind the veil, all you find is death!', '', 96153, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows will envelop you!', '', 96152, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world is full of kindling... a storm of fire is upon you, mortals!', '', 96151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems that we are again a step behind. We must move quickly!', '', 96150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a titan construct! It must have been guarding the prize that Sylvanas seeks.', '', 96149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this?!', '', 96148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deal with these insects, Beliash.', 96146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eredar are summoning in more demons to attack them from behind, your highness.', '', 96145, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 55135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
