('Hey, watch this!', '', 95965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple, but it has an antique charm to it.', '', 95964, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... quaint.', '', 95963, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neither have I. Something has changed, this isn\'t the same legion we\'ve fought before.', '', 95962, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 53384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen the demons expand this quickly.', 95961, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varian\'s forces should have landed just around this hill, let\'s hope they had more luck.', '', 95960, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 53382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed.', '', 95959, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 53381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll have to mourn them later, we need to move before more demons arrive.', 95958, 0, 924, 396, 64, 0, 0, 53380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The front lines are broken! Hold fast, I\'m sure reinforcements are coming!', 95957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Steady! Hold this line or Menethil will fall!', 95956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Singed, but alive. We lost many good troops.', '', 95955, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 53379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is everyone alright?', 95954, 0, 924, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... will... return...', '', 95953, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid dragon! That\'ll cost you.', '', 95952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In-Game Cutscene', '', 95951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_lavaboltgreen.blp:20|t %s has marked you for |cFFF00000|Hspell:182108|h[Artillery]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_lavaboltgreen.blp:20|t %s has marked you for |cFFF00000|Hspell:182108|h[Artillery]|h|r!', 95950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, leyweaver. What can I do for you?', '', 95949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How fortuitous! A fellow tailor!$b$bWelcome to the leyweavers\' guild of Suramar. Perhaps you have heard of us?', '', 95948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are of no interest to me. I come from an accomplished lineage of Suramar tailors. You, obviously, do not.', '', 95947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someday I hope to see this \"Azeroth\" of yours. What an amazing world it must be.', 95946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK, how much?', 'OK, how much?', 95945, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are in luck. I can teach you those patterns myself.$b$bThey will come at a cost. Our clients are demanding, and our shop consumes a great amount of raw materials.', 95944, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoulder armor is the domain of Leyweaver Phaxondus. He prefers to spend his time near the exposed ley lines of Azsuna. I\'ll mark his position on your map.', 95943, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leyweaver Tellumi, who is currently traveling in Stormheim, maintains that pattern for our guild. I\'ll mark her position on your map.', 95942, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe Leyweaver Athystro knows that pattern. You\'ll find him just west of here overlooking Felsoul Hold. I\'ll mark his position on your map.', 95941, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak with Leyweaver Yaphisteia. She walks the roads of Highmountain. I\'ll mark her position on your map.', 95940, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leyweaver Erenyi. She\'s currently out researching druidic patterns in Val\'sharah. I\'ll mark her position on your map.', 95939, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should speak with Leyweaver Jorjana, in southern Suramar within the Docks District. I\'ll mark her position on your map.', 95938, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leyweaver Mithrogane, just outside this hall, knows that pattern.', 95937, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave cloaks?', 'Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave cloaks?', 95936, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Epaulets?', 'Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Epaulets?', 95935, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Pantaloons?', 'Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Pantaloons?', 95934, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Gloves?', 'Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Gloves?', 95933, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Slippers?', 'Where can I learn how to make Imbued Silkweave Slippers?', 95932, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Cinch?', 'Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Cinch?', 95931, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Hood?', 'Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Hood?', 95930, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Robe?', 'Where can I learn how to make an Imbued Silkweave Robe?', 95929, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful out there!', 95928, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it you need?', 95927, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY SHINY EYE! MINE! MINE! MINE! MINE!', '', 95926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many other leyweavers out wandering the world. I can show you where they are.', 95925, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inondra and I can help, but we cannot teach you all the patterns you need. You will need to earn or purchase them from others.', '', 95924, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have shown you how to make Imbued Silkweave, and I\'ve also given you the pattern for Imbued Silkweave Bracers.', '', 95923, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_AntiMagicZone:20|tA nearby Dreadstalker begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:186562|h[Consume Magic]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_AntiMagicZone:20|tA nearby Dreadstalker begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:186562|h[Consume Magic]|h|r!', 95922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re tailors, $n, and so are you. No price is too high if it means a better robe. Am I right?', 95921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, I\'d prefer that the leyweavers operate without anyone\'s assistance, but the quality of this demonically-imbued cloth far surpasses anything we could do on our own.', 95920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve come to an arrangement with Gul\'dan. We provide him and his forces with supplies, and in return, he\'s granted us a few of his more capable inquisitors.', 95919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Iskar... I\'ve failed you...', '', 95918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cursed beasts! After I return to the skies I will have your pathetic races obliterated!', '', 95917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go for a joyride!', '', 95910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A gift from your sister, Helya. Now... kneel!', 95909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrest this world\'s secrets from the earth! The Legion will have every drop of power this place has to offer.', '', 95908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work quickly! No relic is to fall into mortal hands!', '', 95907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am nothing like him! Behold!', 95906, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your secret.', 'Show me your secret.', 95905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tytallo mentioned something about sacrifice.', 'Tytallo mentioned something about sacrifice.', 95904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How attentive of you. Yes, our order has made a bargain with a higher power, in order to gain more skill in our trade.$b$bI am prepared to show you our secret. Behold, the power of the Leyweavers!', 95903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The loom itself, frankly, isn\'t anything special.$b$bIt\'s a thing of beauty, to be sure. It\'s quite old, but at its core it\'s nothing but alderwood and a few nails. We do our best to maintain it.$b$bBut no, the loom itself is immaterial to our methods.', 95902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the loom.', 'Tell me about the loom.', 95901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wh- what is this power?! It.. can\'t be...', 95900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n.', 95899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The others were speaking of |5$r $c that knew how to sew. I assume that you are that $c.$b$bIf Tytallo thinks you\'re ready, then I can show you the Queen\'s Grace Loom.', 95898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You aren\'t supposed to be up here, $n.', 95897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Yrel.', 'I am ready, Yrel.', 95896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is an honor to fight alongside you, $n. From the moment I first encountered you inside that horrible tunnel behind the Dark Portal, your presence has always inspired me.$b$bK\'ara, too, sees your inner strength. Are you ready to speak with the Naaru?', 95895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no use - the weather systems around Stormheim are too strong. I can\'t get a signal through.', '', 95894, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 51759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any luck contacting the fleet?', '', 95893, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 52940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sound design is the best!', 'Sound design is the best!', 95892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sylvanas will pay for her crimes...', 95891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gilneas demands justice!', '', 95890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will seize the Aegis in time - we must not miss this opportunity to take out Sylvanas!', 95889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, master.', '', 95884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the might of the legion!', '', 95883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have foolishly rushed to your end. The Black Gate is whole!', '', 95882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will fall to your own arrogance. As did the one who created you.', 95881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish girl! You cannot comprehend the forces you meddle with.', 95880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Intro cinematic of Skyfire unloading a volley on the fleet from above the clouds.]', '[Intro cinematic of Skyfire unloading a volley on the fleet from above the clouds.]', 95879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Refuse, and I will take your gifts by force!', 95878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know your purpose, Banshee Queen! You should turn away, lest you invoke my wrath!', 95875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go on and run, I won\'t cower under a tent! If the next shot has my name on it, so be it.', 95874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into the breach! Show these weaklings what the might of Sargeras does when brought to bear on an enemy!', '', 95873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no honor in death! Your cities will burn. Your armies will break. It is inevitable!', '', 95872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lines are weak, mortals. Our ranks are endless! Lay down your arms and serve Sargeras!', '', 95871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now my warriors! The Halls of Valor are moments away!', 95869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Elderbranch know little of lands beyond our own.$B$BYou are good to have come here to help us, so far from your home.', '', 95868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once I have the Aegis of Aggramar -- the gods will kneel to me.', '', 95867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is he that Nightfallen rat? We caught him snooping around the edges of town. Looked suspicious. He\'s been thrown into Violet Hold for questioning.', '', 95866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Lyndras?', 'Have you seen Lyndras?', 95865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of Violet Hold if you know what\'s good for you, $r. I don\'t like the look of some of the creatures they\'re storing in there.', '', 95864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, reinforcements are arriving daily. Use this portal to travel between here and our stronghold in Ashran.', 95863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww man not again.', 'Awww man not again.', 95862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do what I can.', 'I will do what I can.', 95861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Odyn? I kneel before no god.', '', 95860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Thistleleaf have always been a minor nuisance. However, lately their behavior has changed from puerile to hostile and destructive.$B$BI do not know what has caused this change, but something must be done to protect these faerie dragons.', 95859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may take your rest here without fear of nightmares.', 95858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May Odyn bless you on your trials.', '', 95857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about these Thistleleaf sprites?', 'What can you tell me about these Thistleleaf sprites?', 95855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have never seen these sprites so agitated.', 95854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As with Moonglade, this village and its denizens are under my protection. I only wish I could shelter more of the wilds and its caretakers.$B$BWould that I were strong enough to protect you all.', 95853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig faster! We must bury this giant before the other challengers arrive.', '', 95836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are in luck. Had the Underking learned all of the secrets of the Hammer, we would not be having this conversation.$b$bFor now he is like a child with a new toy. Dangerous, yes, but not as much as he will be the longer he possesses the hammer.', '', 95831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never defeat Bloodbeard!', '', 95808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Share in our curse!', '', 95807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will join the others!', '', 95806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When our hearts falter, we cease to respect the world around us.$B$BNature holds a mirror to our souls.', 95805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thorns are a means of defense for green and growing things: fragile flora that would otherwise be defenseless.$B$BDo not curse the thorns. Rejoice in the blossoms they make possible.', 95804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, please! Stranger, forgive us. We\'re all a tad wary of strangers these days.', 95803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the Tomes of Chaos to break Cordana\'s shield', 'Destroy the Tomes of Chaos to break Cordana\'s shield', 95799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, HELL no!', 'Oh, HELL no!', 95798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', 'No.', 95797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, your ring. THE ring! The one Khadgar has been cooking up for you since we arrived on Draenor.$b$bGive it here. I just want to... borrow it.', 95796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A squire from the Argent Crusade? Here?', '', 95791, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing.$b$bNothing that concerns you.$b$bI have this under control.', 95790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar wants you to destroy these books.', 'Khadgar wants you to destroy these books.', 95789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...What are you doing with the Orb of Dominion, Cordana?', '...What are you doing with the Orb of Dominion, Cordana?', 95788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove to me that you are worthy of this power! Free my brethren from their ghostly imprisonment, then come to me with their mark upon you.', '', 95787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lyndras, please, stop! Get a hold of yourself, man!', 'Lyndras, please, stop! Get a hold of yourself, man!', 95786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had thought $p dead in the explosion, but $Ghe:she; survived and slew the demon! Never in all my days have I - there you are! I was just telling your men about your fight with Malgalor.', '', 95785, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear, I\'m staying put. No more exploring the city for me. I\'m happy right here in the tailoring shop.', '', 95784, 0, 33133, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destiny calls to you, $n.', '', 95779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Err... I was just uh... looking for new dyes. Yes, that\'s it. New dyes. I\'ll return to the shop immediately.', '', 95778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer glows brightly and protects you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:642|h[Divine Shield]|h|r!', 'The Ashbringer glows brightly and protects you with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:642|h[Divine Shield]|h|r!', 95777, 0, 34050, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I welcome the darkness. I have always... loved... the night.', '', 95776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord will hear of this and know... you are... no mere nuisance.', '', 95775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lyndras, what are you doing here?', 'Lyndras, what are you doing here?', 95774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those damned leyweavers had no right to throw me out. No right at all, I say.', '', 95773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have... won this fight, and yet I... almost pity you.', '', 95772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother Moon, have mercy. Let me rest now.', '', 95771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You encroach upon our lands. For that, you shall pay dearly.', '', 95770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last hero to oppose me lies dead at my feet. Join her.', '', 95769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept your death. It is bitter, but preferable to what is coming.', '', 95768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero! <cough> Get those chemical flares away from the ammo!', 95767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gryphon riders, back them up!', 95766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think to challenge me, infant? A poor decision.', '', 95765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With every passing moment, Gul\'dan grows in power. But he no longer slinks through the shadows - we know where he is. We know what he\'s doing. Now, we strike! May the Light have mercy on all our souls.', '', 95764, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 50647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of our world is in your hands, commander. Lok\'tar ogar.', '', 95763, 0, 0, 2, 68, 0, 50305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will do all he can to sever our connection to the elements, to deprive us on their power. You must stop him.', '', 95762, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 50304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, champion. Know that the primal heart of Draenor burns within you.', '', 95761, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 50303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of flame, lend us your fury, that our enemies will be driven before us!', '', 95760, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of water, give our hero the gift of your wisdom.', '', 95759, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of air, grant our champion quickness of mind and body.', '', 95758, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of stone, lend your strength to our champion.', '', 95757, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The very elements of Draenor tremble, friend. Can you hear them? Listen... listen...', '', 95756, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 50298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, is that you? Your aura has grown quite strong.', '', 95755, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 50297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We stand with you!', 95754, 0, 0, 2, 68, 0, 0, 50576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, whatever you should do next, know that you have the full support of the draenei people.', 95753, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 50575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you hear anything? Did the Naaru speak to you?', 95752, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 50574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of two worlds hangs in the balance...', '', 95751, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now, with the Light\'s blessing. Take the fight to our enemies.', '', 95750, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The righteous will flock to your banner. You must not falter.', '', 95749, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion. A great darkness has taken root on Draenor.', '', 95748, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed are the valorous, who stand fast in an unjust world.', '', 95747, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed are the torchbearers, who bring the light to darkness.', '', 95746, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take your knee, champion. It is a rare and special privilege to be blessed by a Naaru.', 95745, 0, 0, 2, 68, 0, 0, 50573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, commander! Khadgar tells me you\'ve accomplished so many great things...', 95744, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 50572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oblivion... comes...', '', 95743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic wretch!', '', 95742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All life will be eradicated!', '', 95741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the legion\'s power!', '', 95740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power grows!', '', 95739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer my wrath!', '', 95738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life ends now!', '', 95737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 95736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elemental spirits of Draenor await you, champion of the Horde!', '', 95735, 0, 923, 25, 64, 0, 50646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 95734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now to Karabor, champion of the Alliance!', '', 95733, 0, 924, 25, 64, 0, 50645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion comes!', '', 95732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, walk away. Nothing will stop Gul\'dan, for the Legion stands behind him. Mark my words: Your leaders will betray you. AZEROTH WILL BURN.', 95731, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 50325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such is the power of the Legion!', 95730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar is just a child, swaggering around, torturing his prisoners, playing with lives, dabbling in magics he pretends to comprehend.', 95729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Orb of Dominion spoke to me. I saw the TRUTH.', 95728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then I will TAKE it from you! For the Glory of Gul\'dan!', 95727, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 50321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll do for now. I think I\'d like to... explore your city some more.', '', 95726, 0, 33126, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, give me your ring. I need it. Give it here!', 95725, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 50320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Books of power... books of knowledge... books written in the language of chaos... Don\'t you worry, champion, all will be destroyed.', 95724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Books. Yes, Gul\'dan\'s tomes. Are you sure Khadgar didn\'t try to use them?', 95723, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 50318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And save me his skull. For... reasons.', '', 95722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan has fled to the Dark Portal! Quickly, champions! He has no place left to run - we will finish this!', '', 95721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal is unlocked! It will take us directly to Gul\'dan. Now he will pay for his crimes.', '', 95720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final seal has fallen! My work here is almost finished.', '', 95719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal is nearly complete, the next seal has been removed.', '', 95718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another seal is open! Oh, I am good.', '', 95717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give Cordana my best. She\'s been quite distant lately.', '', 95716, 0, 924, 6, 64, 0, 50644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve breached the first seal, soon the portal will take us to Gul\'dan.', '', 95715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This entire citadel seethes with Gul\'dan\'s corruption! A second portal is nearby. Keep his demons at bay while I break the seals and attune the portal to his location.', '', 95714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal is ready, champion. Steel yourselves, I know not what further atrocities Gul\'dan has unleashed in this place.', '', 95713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never believed Gul\'dan would go this far... We must press on. A portal lies within these ruins that will take us further into the citadel.', '', 95712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will plumb the depths of Draenor for all its secrets!', '', 95711, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 50643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The citadel is breached! Gul\'dan is within. I will establish a foothold here - press forward!', '', 95710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never! This world will stand against the legion and prevail!', '', 95709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me, champions! This is not our final hour! We must survive!', '', 95708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farahlon is mysterious land. Only send a crew you trust... or can afford to lose.', '', 95707, 0, 924, 274, 64, 0, 50642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will send Gul\'dan\'s filth to the bottom of the sea!', '', 95706, 0, 20068, 1, 64, 0, 50641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $n. Cordana has declared Khadgar\'s tower off-limits. She\'s acting odd.', '', 95705, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Easy enough...', 95704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Done! Tell Tanithria that she owes me another silk pillow.', 95703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was told you can sharpen these needles for me.', 'I was told you can sharpen these needles for me.', 95702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something very expensive, please.', 'Something very expensive, please.', 95701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Cartier and Company Fine Jewelry, $c. I can tell you\'re a customer with an appreciation for the finer things.$b$bWhat can I show you today?', 95700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. I need to... acquaint myself with this shop before I can train you any further.', '', 95699, 0, 33121, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure there is much we can learn from one another.', 95698, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not at all. Make yourself at home.', 95697, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a lovely tailoring shop you have here. Do you mind if I look around?', '', 95696, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... this is Dalaran.', '', 95695, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Such a pleasure to see you again!', '', 95694, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on a sec... there! I\'ve got him!', 95693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A summon? Sure! Where did you say he was?', 95692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need somebody summoned up to Dalaran. Can you help me?', 'I need somebody summoned up to Dalaran. Can you help me?', 95691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s no time to waste. Let\'s move!', 95690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178020|h[Event: Risen Spirits]|h|r has begun at the Ashmaul Burial Grounds!', '', 95689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178021|h[Event: Ogre Fires]|h|r has begun at Brute\'s Rise!', '', 95688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178019|h[Event: Collect Empowered Ore]|h|r has begun at the Molten Quarry!', '', 95687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:186255|h[Event: Apexis Marks]|h|r has begun at the Ashran Excavation!', '', 95686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178022|h[Event: Stadium Racing]|h|r has begun at the Amphitheater of Annihilation!', '', 95685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not to forget me, or how helpful I was!', '', 95684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just be waiting here patiently to be summoned to Dalaran.', '', 95683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, take your time.', '', 95682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should hurry. The Legion could attack at any moment.', 95681, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:186255|h[Event: Apexis Marks]|h|r begins at the Ashran Excavation in 3 minutes.', '', 95680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us make haste. We must find the Legion before they strike again.', '', 95679, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shipyard is currently full, try back once the current ship completes.', 'The shipyard is currently full, try back once the current ship completes.', 95678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s whines piteously.', '', 95677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrrruff!', '', 95676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woof!', '', 95675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe that peasant Holly McTilla was trusted with the finest weapons and armor. A dwarf! Honestly, it\'s no wonder we haven\'t taken this island yet.', 95674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to build a transport.', 'I would like to build a transport.', 95673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to build a battleship.', 'I would like to build a battleship.', 95672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regrettably inform you that the finest arms and armaments for use in the field of battle are now sold by Ms. Crunchpaw. Don\'t worry, I\'m hard at work figuring out how to modify what I do have to be even better. I\'m thinking... extra arms! That you control with your mind!', '', 95671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quality of my equipment is inferior to that of the lovely Malukah Lightsong. Speak wit her if you intend to buy the best equipment available.', '', 95670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The quality of my wares is inferior to those sold by Malukah Lightsong. You should talk to her if you intend to take on the Alliance.', '', 95669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah yeah, I know, my stuff isn\'t as good as what Tae\'lox is sellin\'. But ya know what, it\'s still prettier, right? Whaddaya mean you think it looks the same? It\'s CLEARLY different! You ungrateful bum! You\'re lucky my contract is still being enforced.', 95668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tae\'lox Soulshrivel is the one you seek if you wish to claim the highest quality rewards for your honor in battle.', 95667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cladd Dawnstrider is the one you seek if you wish to claim the highest quality rewards for your honor in battle.', 95666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should speak with Malukah Lightsong if you intend to buy the best equipment available.', '', 95665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This equipment isn\'t as good as what Fobbly Kickfix sells. I suggest you arm yourself with her wares first.', '', 95664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will always answer the Light\'s call. Let us know where we are needed.', 95663, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, Incindrius! Show these fools the might of the Burning Legion!', '', 95662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not stand idle while the Legion threatens our home. Our blades are yours.', '', 95661, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While the Nightfallen look much like I do, they are craven, twisted ley-addicts who will stab you in the back to get a taste of your mana. I am a friendly tailor who has simply fallen on hard times. Note the difference!', '', 95660, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fascinating...', 95659, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... those are ancient Highborne patterns!', '', 95658, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like night elf cloth to... wait a moment...', '', 95657, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ainderu! What do you make of this cloth?', 95656, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'mar', '', 95655, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lion\'s Watch', '', 95654, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Y\'should speak with Holly McTilla if you\'re lookin\' to square off against the best the Horde has to offer. Also, ask her who does her hair for me would ya?', 95651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amelia over there has much bett\'r gear than what I can offer yeh if you\'re lookin\' to take on the Horde.', 95650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not live to see another moon.', '', 95649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the master\'s name!', '', 95648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tor ilisar\'thera\'nal!', '', 95647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bandu thoribas!', '', 95646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No obstacle shall stand in our way.', '', 95645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste steel.', '', 95644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade is sharp, and my arrow, swift. We will not be easy targets.', 95643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In Azshara\'s name, begone from this place!', 95642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Countless worlds have you destroyed, but we will not fall so easily.', 95641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interlopers! The kaldorei protect these lands.', 95640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Invader, this world will not fall to your kind!', 95639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune bless my arrow. Let my aim be true!', 95638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('They should have been here by - ah, there they are.', '', 95637, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m off to Dalaran to find paladins worthy of joining our cause. Knights, stay here in case $n needs anything while I\'m gone.', 95636, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve led well so far, $n - I see no reason to change direction now.', 95635, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000%s|r is being drained of energy!', '', 95634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000%s|r is creating an energy well to empower his allies!', '', 95633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must make them heed my words, not my sword. Novices will often resort to force, but persuasion is a master\'s weapon.', '', 95632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will restrain my hand against these civilians. They do not know who I am, and I am in no danger from them.', '', 95631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000%s|r begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:186045|h[Solar Chakram]|h|r at you!', '', 95630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lunges at new prey.', '', 95629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what have I done?', '', 95628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did that traitor of a prince send you? So be it, I\'ll show no mercy!', '', 95627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... um... well, this is terribly embarassing, but I\'ve misplaced the Branch of Nordrassil.', 'I... um... well, this is terribly embarassing, but I\'ve misplaced the Branch of Nordrassil.', 95626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
