('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_ironmaidens_convulsiveshadows:20|tYou are afflicted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181799|h[Shadowforce]|h|r!', '', 95481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_auraofdarkness:20|tYou have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181099|h[Mark of Doom]|h|r!', '', 95480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_ORC_MALE.BLP:40|t[High Overlord Saurfang] Your invasion stops now, demon.', '', 95479, 0, 33545, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aspect of Ursol', 'Aspect of Ursol', 95478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The druid continues to mumble in his sleep, occasionally tossing and turning.>', '', 95477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Hahaha!', '', 95476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! You have invoked the wrath of the Forsaken!', '', 95475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Outro cinematic of Skyfire flying away in flames, shaking from explosions.]', '[Outro cinematic of Skyfire flying away in flames, shaking from explosions.]', 95474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one will ever think to look behind the dishes.', '', 95473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Outro cinematic of Skyfire flying away in flames, shaking from explosions.]', '[Outro cinematic of Skyfire flying away in flames, shaking from explosions.]', 95472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what goods you have for sale.', 'Show me what goods you have for sale.', 95471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the greatest heroes have tae rest every now and again.', 95470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks to you, now leave me.  I have a trophy to carve.', '', 95469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish him heroes, that I may drive that cursed axe down his throat and cut out his fel heart.', '', 95468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh Heh Heh, they are besting you demon.', '', 95467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter, we will crush you all.', '', 95466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have your skull for my helm when I next face your foul legion.', '', 95465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See how they struggle, not even their combined might will be enough to save you.', '', 95464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... will.. NEVER be slaves!', '', 95463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourselves. My powers can only hold them for so long...', '', 95462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still holding out hope Hellscream? Your precious Horde will serve the Legion.', '', 95461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! You must not let them reach the Caverns!', '', 95460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take a Nitro-Electric Jumpstarter, Nurse.', 'I\'ll take a Nitro-Electric Jumpstarter, Nurse.', 95459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re not dead yet, $n. That means they\'re potential customers!\n\nIt\'s simple. You take my Nitro-Electric Jumpstarter and use it on some Bruisers who look a bit worse for wear. Then, they pay me! I\'m gonna be rich!', 95458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a war outside. That means lives to save and money to be made, $n!\n\nWhadda ya say to taking my Nitro-Electric Jumpstarter and helping the Bruisers on the front shake it off? Don\'t forget to leave \'em the bill!', 95457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gently shake the sleeping druid.>', '<Gently shake the sleeping druid.>', 95456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde have captured the center control zone', '', 95454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance captured the center control zone', '', 95453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The center control zone is now active!', '', 95452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The druid speaks softly in his sleep.>$B$BThey will never find my treasure. I have hidden it too well.$B$B<He begins mumbling inaudibly afterwards.>', '', 95451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time has come - and now it shall end.', '', 95445, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mortals dare stand against the might of the Legion?', '', 95444, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squires, heroes, and damsels alike! Bring thineselves here, and be protected by me!', '', 95443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rustling sounds grow louder. The forest sprites are approaching the cave entrance! Prepare for their attack.$b$bThe baby bear looks helpless and frightened.', '', 95442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wouldst thou consummate our secret love with a smile, or, perhaps, a wave?', '', 95441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While dragons bled on the ground, my heart bled for thee!', '', 95440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NAY! I nearly died, amidst that clanging melee, simply from unsatisfied desire!', '', 95439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know this, my worship: I nearly died this day. But my mortality was not threatened by any dragon-wound.', '', 95438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A noble hero never forgets what beauty he fights for.', '', 95437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice has been laid. Heroic deeds of valor, performed. I must now attend to matters of CHIVALRY!', '', 95436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! My Power!', '', 95435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this magic?! You\'ll pay for this!', '', 95434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, hero. I could not have done this alone.', 95433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeowch! That\'s gonna leave a mark!', 'Yeowch! That\'s gonna leave a mark!', 95432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, boss... but two hundred gold? What a rip-off!', 'Thanks, boss... but two hundred gold? What a rip-off!', 95431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bear cub sits on your foot and looks up at you trustingly.', '', 95430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creature of dreams, begone!', 'Auughh! Creature of dreams, begone!', 95429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare disrupt our rituals?', '', 95428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away, monster of dreams!', '', 95427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I make you bleed!', '', 95426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll poke holes in you!', '', 95425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My arrow kill you!', '', 95424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic is ours, thief!', '', 95423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stab it until it\'s dead!', '', 95422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 95421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero! Avenge Swiftflight!', 95420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your beloved Swiftflight is dead! You managed to survive the fall, night elf. You will not be so lucky again.', '', 95419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are tracks here. Swiftflight must have gone this way!', 95417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragons! I\'ll slice off your tails, should I find them!', '', 95416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Destroying this barrier will take a great deal of my strength. I fear I may not be able to aid you after it is broken.', 95415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Art that the best thou canst do?', '', 95414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say! Know you nothing of honor, dragon?', '', 95413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste the steely justice-blows of my blade!', '', 95412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', 'I see.', 95411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to Rethu?', 'What happened to Rethu?', 95410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Rethu\'s mining.', 'Tell me about Rethu\'s mining.', 95409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was he like?', 'What was he like?', 95408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me your story.', 'Tell me your story.', 95407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody knows. He left the enclave while they slept, and never returned. Some say he sailed off in search of new challenges. Others say that he dug too deep and uncovered something he should not.\n\nEither way, his legacy lives on, threefold. He left us this land. He left us his knowlege. And he left a lineage - some of us, myself included, bear his surname.', '', 95406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In his youth, he walked the land. He carved out caves and canyons. He spoke to the rocks. Some stories say that this rock-speech was the reason he was ejected from his original tribe.\n\nHis knowledge of leystone was legendary. His time on Azeroth, much like ours, was also plagued with demons, and he worked with ore much like the felslate that you see nowadays.\n\nHe was a pioneer, $n. We all walk in his long shadow.', '', 95405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All stories mention his patience, and most refer to his wisdom. He may have been the greatest miner that our people have ever known, but he was not afraid to share his knowledge with the rest of the herd.\n\nHe trained his sons and daughters, of course, but he also took on apprentices. Greenhoofs who sought direction found themselves ascending Highmountain to learn what he had to teach.\n\nEverything we know, we owe to him.', '', 95404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first ancestor that any of us can remember was Rethu.\n\nRethu Ironhorn was the first of our kind to set hoof on this mountain. He made this plateau his home, and raised his children here. Some say he carved this very camp out of the mountain itself.\n\nHe was a smith, and he was a father, but before any of that... he was a MINER.', '', 95403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open your ears, $n.', '', 95402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, miner. Do you seek training?', '', 95401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Ironhorn Enclave.', '', 95400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll adopt you, little cub.', 'I\'ll adopt you, little cub.', 95399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kneel down and hold out a hand. The baby bear runs to you and sniffs at your fingers.', '', 95398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you, $n. What is the plan?', 95397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyrukh, what are you doing? Only flesh and blood oppose you!', '', 95396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenor itself serves the Legion now. See how the elements bend to my will!', '', 95395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I enjoy watching you squirm. You make a fitting sacrifice.', '', 95394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only wanted a little fun. This is... no fun...', '', 95393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bears don\'t like you! Why protect them?', '', 95392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never yield the wilds!', '', 95391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bigger you are, the more there is to hurt!', '', 95390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 95389, 0, 32869, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be sorry!', '', 95388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll stab you in the knees!', '', 95387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay close! Here we go!', 95386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll save you, poor little thing.', 'I\'ll save you, poor little thing.', 95385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! It burns!', '', 95384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*cough* Augh my eyes!', '', 95383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*cough* You\'re going to pay for that!', '', 95382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you - all of you. Everyone get ready. This isn\'t going to be easy.', 95381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... *cough* filthy swine!', '', 95380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Porsha! Get a move on it, sister!', 95379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They hurt our friend Lixi over there. It\'s time for some payback!', 95378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait...! Wait for us...', 95377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad you made it, champion! Better prepare for a bit of action. The Legion seems to have found a power source located in Un\'Goro. We must stop them!', 95376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll need some time to look at this, $glad:lass;. I may need to consult with some of my... contemporaries, as well. Come back in a few and I\'ll tell you what I\'ve learned.', 95375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take everything for the Legion! Leave no spoils behind.', '', 95374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Faster, swine! Move faster! You serve Sargeras now!', '', 95373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the totem is mine. You won\'t take it!', '', 95372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks as if woodland sprites have slain this little bear\'s family.$b$bVisibly trembling, the cub looks up at you with desperate eyes.$b$bYou hear rustling in the woods nearby: the forest sprites are coming back.$b$bThe baby bear won\'t survive on its own. Are you willing to rescue it?', '', 95371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, the Skyfire is being overrun. They need you up there!', '$p, the Skyfire is being overrun. They need you up there!', 95370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:184476|h[Reaps]|h|r all marked foes!', 95369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you have completed your mission, meet me at Saberfang Cavern! This corruption ends now!', '', 95368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The leader of the satyrs was seen near Saberfang Cavern. I shall go on ahead to confront him.', '', 95367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must fight our way deeper into the corruption if we are to strike at the heart of this threat!', '', 95366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do not act quickly against the satyrs, the vale will be lost. We have little time...', '', 95365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only did what I thought was right.', '', 95364, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 52808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Legionnaires, move out! Storm those ships and find Sylvanas!', 95363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure the new pilots coming in will do great!', '', 95362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hit \'em hard, sir!', '', 95361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four hours up in the air... It\'s time for a rest.', '', 95360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are free! Until we meet again, champion.', 95359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Sargerei Dominator protects Socrethar with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:184053|h[Fel Barrier]|h|r!', 'A Sargerei Dominator protects Socrethar with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:184053|h[Fel Barrier]|h|r!', 95354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! What did they do to you!?', 95353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... unmade...', '', 95352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken!', '', 95351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fragile!', '', 95350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruin!', '', 95349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shatter!', '', 95348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break!', '', 95347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak!', '', 95346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destruction!', '', 95345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None Escape!', '', 95344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crushed by earth!', '', 95343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn to Ashes!', '', 95342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown!', '', 95341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash!', '', 95340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy!', '', 95339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is complete once more. Helira\'s hold on you is slipping away.', '', 95338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill!', '', 95337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swiftflight! Where is Swiftflight!?', 95336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... survived the fall.', 95335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There... Go! Stop Gul\'dan!', 95334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh...', 95333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the name of the prophet. In the name of the light. This place shall be cleansed!', 95332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare yourself. Gul\'dan is at his most powerful.', 95331, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 50568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
