('Not... over..', '', 95159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will haunt you... forever...', '', 95158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is sacred ground! Prepare to die!', '', 95157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care of my rifle...', '', 95156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can kill just as fast up close!', '', 95155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should have died... on my own ship...', '', 95154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t backstab me again Torglork! I\'m already dead!', '', 95153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Az\'jtal calls upon its servants!', 'Az\'jtal calls upon its servants!', 95152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH]The Runeseer banishes you to Helheim!', '', 95151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze upon your end.', '', 95150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ithvil azj shnk naush.', '', 95149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no light in the darkness. There is no hope.', '', 95148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yglath vu\'aghth qol. Yglath ish\'za.', '', 95147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where one falls, many shall take its place.', '', 95146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iilth vwah, uhn\'agth fhssh za.', '', 95145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has been set in motion will come to pass.', '', 95144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaqol ish\'wi agthshh.', '', 95143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you took your first unholy breath it was in the musty halls of Acherus.$b$bIt is here where we must set aside our differences and work as a united Knights of the Ebon Blade if we are to defeat the Demons.', '', 95142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Koltira glowers at you.>$b$bLeave... I have nothing to say to you.', '', 95141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Koltira regards you with an emotionless stare.>', '', 95140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Yesssss! With that power in my hands, I can get him back.', '', 95139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of apocalypse is upon us once again, $n.$b$bWill you rise to the occasion?', '', 95138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nether! It... consumes me...', '', 95137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out! It is too good for you, pitiful soul!', '', 95136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot control it... it is MINE!', '', 95135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life ends here!', '', 95134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither away, fools!', '', 95133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me in death!', '', 95132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargerei! To me!', '', 95131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul itself shall strike you down!', '', 95130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The binding... I cannot control...', '', 95129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! I\'m at 100% Life!', 'HEY! I\'m at 100% Life!', 95128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before me!', '', 95127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am more powerful than ever!', '', 95126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time itself bends to my will!', '', 95125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder cinematic: The player is granted freedom by Helira.', '', 95124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here. Let us walk in together.', '', 95119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed me once, mortals. It will not happen again.', '', 95118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death could not stop me - how do you hope to?', '', 95117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now, I believe we have a score to settle, fleas.', '', 95116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The construct is fully powered... the final binding will have to wait. For now, I believe we have a score to settle, fleas!', '', 95115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have expected as much. No matter.', '', 95114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight, you fools! Stop them!', '', 95113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a bit longer, and the binding will be complete...', '', 95112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could not stop me in Shattrath. You will not end me here, fools.', '', 95111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They come for me. Stop them, Sargerei!', '', 95110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And afterward I\'ll give you two a juicy clefthoof steak!', 95109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry Nel. We\'ll find our prey soon.', 95108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HA HA HA!  Bloodbeard, it looks like your challenger has arrived.', 95107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I\'ll deal with you myself.', '', 95106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I won\'t bother with you, peasants. I\'ll let my students deal with your kind.', '', 95105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence is NOT welcome in OUR chamber! Your kind could never fathom the knowledge flowing through these runes!', '', 95104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineers! Throw yourselves upon them!', '', 95103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re on our way!', '', 95102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes executor!', '', 95101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sir, it was only these two.', '', 95100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job Warder! Did any get away?', '', 95099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve set up along the cliffs at the southern pass! We will hold them off as long as we can...', 'We\'ve set up along the cliffs at the southern pass! We will hold them off as long as we can...', 95098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho! The pathway to Un\'goro Crater is embroiled in a great fracas! I suspect dragons!', '', 95097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is as far as we go. We\'ll secure the perimeter and meet up with you soon.', '', 95096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep pushing! We\'ve gotta go help the others.', '', 95095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got it from here! We\'ll push them back at the other camps!', '', 95094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free!', '', 95093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening here?', '', 95092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:182582|h[Fel Incineration]|h|r is following you!', '', 95091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar nods to Stellagosa.', '', 95090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'ll meet you up there. You will find the repose up the road to the northeast.', '', 95089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not linger here too long. The Legion is attacking everywhere.', '', 95088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come because you\'ve heard of the legend of $p, the paladin proven worthy of wielding the Silver Hand and succeeding Tirion. With $p at our head we can be the weapon brought to bear against the Legion.', '', 95087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This river is ours!', 95086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Succumb to the Nightmare or die.', 95085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This river will flow with your blood.', 95084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xavius commands us.', 95083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER: Xavius escapes with Malfurion to the dungeon. Ysera has been sent to destroy the temple. Koda the Archdruid is dying...', '', 95082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never be taken prisoner again. Never!', 95081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 55089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get down there, $n. The Illidari need our help to destroy the Burning Legion.\n\nOnce we\'ve done that, we can get to our business with the Pillar of Creation here on Azsuna.', '', 95080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER: Cenarius is taken by the Nightmare. Enraged, Malfurion pursues Xavius, leaving the others behind.', '', 95079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear that this forest is beyond hope. We must make haste.', 95078, 0, 33395, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Call down my wrath to purge these unnatural creatures.', 95077, 0, 33395, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such devastation. We must destroy these monstrosities.', 95076, 0, 33395, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry. The Illidari are about to be overrun.', '', 95075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna is only the beginning.', 'Azsuna is only the beginning.', 95074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us. We are infinite.', 'You cannot stop us. We are infinite.', 95073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender the Tidestone, mortal.', 'Surrender the Tidestone, mortal.', 95072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azsuna will fall!', 'Azsuna will fall!', 95071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-ARGALOTH.blp:50:80|t$b[Malgalor] You will all DIE!', '', 95070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare will consume all of you!', '', 95069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you think you will fare against the might of Xavius?', '', 95068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power will destroy this pathetic land!', '', 95067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... must get to the temple...', 95066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, smith! HIT IT!!!', '', 95065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all you can do? You\'ll have to do much better than that.', '', 95064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, $p, hit the metal as hard as you can.', '', 95063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The sapling that grew from the Seed of Life is lush and vibrant, starkly contrasting the twisted destruction all around. From within the glowing leaves of the tree, the whisper of a voice can be softly heard...>', '', 95062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has become of our precious Shaladrassil... our beloved Cenarius?$b$bI have failed them.', '', 95061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will flay the flesh from your bones!', '', 95060, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will fuel the soul forge!', '', 95059, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out, infernals!', 95058, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xavius...$b$bHe must be stopped...', '', 95057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion will crush you! INFERNO!', '', 95056, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got him now! Focus on their commander!', 95055, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... did you...?', '', 95054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power is undeniable!', '', 95053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Cenarius... now... Ysera?$b$bXavius will pay for what he has done... they will be avenged!', '', 95052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat of the Emerald Nightmare approaches as an unstoppable storm upon the horizon... but we would sooner die fighting than run away and let it claim all that we hold dear.', '', 95051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s gotta hurt!', '', 95050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom!', '', 95049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! Funnel them into range of my bombs!', '', 95048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get some, demons! I\'ve got one bomb for each of ya!', '', 95047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This temple has stood for generations as a tribute to The Moon Goddess, Elune.$b$bThis is not the first time the Burning Legion has sought to destroy it... and they will fail just as they did before.', 95046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say let them come. We will defeat them together... or die trying.', '', 95045, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion is coming. It is in our best interest to be ready for them.', '', 95044, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Construct faces you and readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180221|h[Volatile Fel Orb]|h|r!', 'The Construct faces you and readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180221|h[Volatile Fel Orb]|h|r!', 95043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last I see... I failed long ago...', '', 95042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will conquer this jungle! I will bring it all to the light! You will not stop me!', '', 95041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away! Stay away! I do you favor!', '', 95040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Construct prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:184247|h[Felblaze Charge]|h|r towards you!', 'The Construct prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:184247|h[Felblaze Charge]|h|r towards you!', 95039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave! The Crusader must not be disturbed!', '', 95038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never should have come here! He is lost!', '', 95037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Firmament Stone is sacred to our order.$b$bIt is not unheard of for an outsider to seek out our anvil... but access does not come easily.', '', 95036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can resist the Legion. In time, all will serve.', '', 95035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your feeble minds will be mine to harvest!', '', 95034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be quick about your work. You\'ll only have a small window of time to hammer out those red-hot leystone bars into the components you need.', 95033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A responsible smith does not waste material. You may use any pieces of scrap metal that you find around our camp.', '', 95032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noo! My power!', '', 95031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go see if you can find a frost mage to help us, $n. If we can get our quenching trough cool enough, we can perform this leysmithing technique.', '', 95030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what to do, smith: temper, heat, hammer, and weld. You can use any of the shop\'s equipment.', '', 95029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of Gul\'dan!', '', 95028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strip the flesh!', '', 95027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood! Blood! BLOOD!', '', 95026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna enjoy gutting you!', '', 95025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR BLOOD IS MINE!', '', 95024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all!', '', 95023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', 'Burn!', 95022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Gul\'dan! For the Legion!', 'For Gul\'dan! For the Legion!', 95021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of Gul\'dan is upon you!', 'The might of Gul\'dan is upon you!', 95020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostiles in the camp! Destroy them - in the name of Gul\'dan!', 'Hostiles in the camp! Destroy them - in the name of Gul\'dan!', 95019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did... I... lose....', '', 95018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt my entertainment!', '', 95017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan hasn\'t broken us yet, commander. Where shall we strike today?', 95016, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If this is truly the end of the world, then let us meet our end in the fields of combat!', 95015, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The jungle hides many dangers. It would be wise to go on the offensive today.', 95014, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many foes... so little time... Who should die today?', 95013, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our outriders have reported back, commander. We are greatly outnumbered on all sides. It is a glorious day to fight!', 95012, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The very mountains bleed today, commander. Come, let us stave off armageddon one more day!', 95011, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You called, and the Hand of Argus has answered.', '', 95010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies surround us, commander. Where shall we spill their blood today?', 95009, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle continues, commander. Where shall we concentrate our efforts?', 95008, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
