('Come down, come down, my little bony friend. We might let you live if you tell me what I want to know.', '', 94856, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are building weapons of war, but now they power them with Gul\'dan\'s fel might. Soon we will face fel cannon, tanks, and smaller weapons.$b$bAlso, something else... something bigger.', '', 94855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Perfect! A fresh lead. Where is your banshee queen?', '', 94854, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not save yourself the pain and tell me where Sylvanas is? You could spare both of us a lot of inconvenience if you would just come clean.', '', 94853, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the strongpoint!', '', 94852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Iron Horde dere are in trouble. When de fel stuff broke da land, it angered da Pale. They be attacking each other in da tunnel.$b$bWe don\'t have ta worry about dat tunnel too much, but dere may be sum useful stuff in dere.', '', 94851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Sylvanas? We shall stalk this entire wood if necessary.', '', 94850, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should tell me what you know. My hounds are getting... hungry.', '', 94849, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply tell me where Sylvanas is, and I will end this quickly.', '', 94848, 0, 33264, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Don\'t scratch it up!', 'Hey! Don\'t scratch it up!', 94847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'m on a break.', 'I\'m on a break.', 94846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At first it wasn\'t impressive... raptors, snakes, big bats, nothing special.$b$bBut there is something in there... something really creepy that kills people. I got out of there super quick after that. And I\'m not going back.', '', 94845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s bad stuff going on up there. Evil glowy draenei are messing with wolves and summoning demons. I think they killed all the normal draenei up there.$b$bIsn\'t there some sort of giant rock you can drop on all of them?', '', 94844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten hours in the sky. It\'s time for a break! You can take \'er up, if you have the skills.', '', 94843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands are safe no longer...', 'These lands are safe no longer...', 94842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt, but I must hurry to warn the others!', 'I am in your debt, but I must hurry to warn the others!', 94841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot thank you enough! You saved me!', 'I cannot thank you enough! You saved me!', 94840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brave souls have been chosen to strike into the depths of hell itself to rescue Highlord Tirion. This is your last chance to turn back.', '', 94839, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready yourselves, men! The Broken Shore awaits. We leave on $n\'s command.', '', 94838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a lift?', 'Need a lift?', 94837, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have fun! Second gear sticks a little.', 'Have fun! Second gear sticks a little.', 94836, 0, 0, 70, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insects! I am the will of Sargeras made manifest in your world. Stormwind is helpless before me!', '', 94835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us in death, and the Master of the Tower will grant you eternal glory!', '', 94834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t get a great look but I didn\'t need to, it is a Burning Legion paradise up there. Giant demons being summoned, infernals raining down from the sky, cultists continuing the flow of corrupted water...$b$bYou should be really careful up there, everything there is big and mean. I highly recommend you bring friends before you take any offensive actions there.', 94833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel corrupted water is just pouring down from the mountain. What is going on at the Throne of Kil\'jaeden?', 'Fel corrupted water is just pouring down from the mountain. What is going on at the Throne of Kil\'jaeden?', 94832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Combine typical Iron Horde mass weapons building with fel corruption and you have that mess down there.$b$bThey are building tanks, cannons, and infantry weapons infused with fel energy. Also something bigger further in, something we should really stop them from building.', 94831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Fel Forge looks completely corrupted, what are they building there?', 'The Fel Forge looks completely corrupted, what are they building there?', 94830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is just as I feared. Lord Ravencrest\'s remains are gone.', '', 94829, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hold still has forces in it, but with the recent \"landscaping\" from the citadel, they have apparently been breached by more of those Pale.$b$bWe could probably leave it alone and let the Iron Horde and Pale fight it out in there, but I suspect there may be useful resources to \"acquire\" as well.', 94828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How defended is that Iron Horde tunnel?', 'How defended is that Iron Horde tunnel?', 94827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody owns the swamp, it is a death trap. Raptors, giant bats, giant snakes... and something else. There\'s some kind of giant shadow that prowls there. I felt its eyes on me while I inspected a mutilated corpse.$b$bNeedless to say I did not linger.', '', 94826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know of Zorammarsh?', 'What do you know of Zorammarsh?', 94825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must... get... another weapon...', 'Must... get... another weapon...', 94824, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan is turning orcs into beasts!', '', 94823, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... I will re-arm myself back at camp.', 'Thank you... I will re-arm myself back at camp.', 94822, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These animals fight without honor - were our people ever this savage?', 'These animals fight without honor - were our people ever this savage?', 94821, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life. I will return to camp!', 'I owe you my life. I will return to camp!', 94820, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life. I\'ll make my way back to camp.', 'You saved my life. I\'ll make my way back to camp.', 94819, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The carnage...!', 'The carnage...!', 94818, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll try to make it to safety. Thank you.', 'I\'ll try to make it to safety. Thank you.', 94817, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re animals! What has Gul\'dan done?', 'They\'re animals! What has Gul\'dan done?', 94816, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you... I\'ll make my way back behind the lines.', 'Thank you... I\'ll make my way back behind the lines.', 94815, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will turn you into a weapon of the Legion. With your death, the last glimmer of hope for this world will be extinguished.', '', 94814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls will feel the agony of a thousand worlds!', '', 94813, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of you.', '', 94812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut me down and I will grow anew!', '', 94811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hope to stop me.', '', 94810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duty calls!', 'Duty calls!', 94809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll regroup with you shortly. I\'ve got to repair.', 'I\'ll regroup with you shortly. I\'ve got to repair.', 94808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to check in with Stormwind for updates.', 'I\'m going to check in with Stormwind for updates.', 94807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will spread the Nightmare to every mountain and valley!', '', 94806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can withstand the might of Xavius.', '', 94805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live to serve Xavius.', '', 94804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise! Grow! Take this forest!', '', 94803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been thousands of years since I last walked these grounds, and yet, the memories flood back quickly.$B$BIt was here that we rallied our efforts to hold back the demon invasion.', '', 94802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light will not fail!', 94801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I will never give in to darkness. The legion will fall!', 94800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kur\'talos Ravencrest, Lord of Black Rook Hold, was respected and feared by many.', '', 94799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light protect us from this atrocity! Grant us your strength to banish this evil!', 94798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Ravencrest was the greatest commander of his time. Only few can be considered his equal.', '', 94797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After Lord Ravencrest\'s passing, I led his army. The weight of command seasoned me quickly.', '', 94796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Centuries ago, Black Rook Hold was known amongst all the kaldorei. The masses feared its cruel justice, and the nobility were in awe of its power.', '', 94795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish your business here, then meet me in the keep.', '', 94794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summa dem kitties been around a while. They only come out when ya challenge dem.\n\nGo kill summa dem cats.\n\nI take ya claws and make a challenge totem. Take it to da Fang\'rila arena and place it. It be sure to anger one of dem really big ones. Make sure ya bring friends, them kitties be no joke!', '', 94793, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do those challenge totems you sell do?', 'What do those challenge totems you sell do?', 94792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jus to da southeast lies Fang\'rila. You be bringing friends wit ya, de Blackfang saberon are de most powerful tribe I ever seen. \n\nYou bring back da claws and mebbe I have some tings for ya...', '', 94791, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here lies Javen Moonpaw, devoted father and loyal soldier. He fell in the Battle of Rinuin to a demon\'s blade. He shall be remembered always.', '', 94790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming barrage! Brace yourselves!', '', 94789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have failed this world!', '', 94788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miserable worm.', '', 94787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fall so easily!', '', 94786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 94785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the defiler! Lord of the Burning Legion! This world will feel my wrath and burn!', '', 94784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oblivion draws closer, mage! Give up!', '', 94783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will shatter this pathetic world! Its broken husk will be torn apart in the twisting nether for all time!', '', 94782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow tired of this pointless game. You face the immortal Legion, scourge of a thousand worlds.', '', 94781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Worthless mongrel! Your miserable race will suffer endlessly for your rebellion.', '', 94780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destructions comes! Lok thorje sorankar!', '', 94779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look upon the endless forces of the Burning Legion and know the folly of your resistance.', '', 94778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Your meaningless struggle ends now!', '', 94777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have only delayed the inevitable! The Burning Legion consumes all!', '', 94776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rikk amanalar golad mishun amir shi!', '', 94775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pitiful light you call upon is powerless against me, child. End this foolishness!', '', 94774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This meaningless little world has already succumbed to my corruption. The land itself seethes with the mark of the legion!', '', 94773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your souls are mine.', '', 94772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will come to ruin!', '', 94771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan sent me here to keep the peace between the Laughing Skull survivors and the Draenei.$b$b<Frogan looks uncomfortably toward the filthy Laughing Skull refugee camp.>$b$bI\'d rather be fighting something.', '', 94770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate is sealed!', '', 94769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion cannot be stopped!', '', 94768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your existence ends now!', '', 94767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn! Burn in the fires of my wrath!', '', 94766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are powerless to stop me!', '', 94765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The infinite darkness shall claim you!', '', 94764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never escape the endless void!', '', 94763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul shall know endless torment!', '', 94762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be mine!', '', 94761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face my eternal wrath!', '', 94760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Manach sheek-thrish!', '', 94759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your foolish resolve will break.', '', 94758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape my power!', '', 94757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before the might of the legion!', '', 94756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are so easily corrupted.', '', 94755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kirel narak!', '', 94754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akim-kurai!', '', 94753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept your miserable fate.', '', 94752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will burn in the legion\'s fire.', '', 94751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness the flames that have consumed countless worlds!', '', 94750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will burn!', '', 94749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vermin!', '', 94748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anach kyree!', '', 94747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insignificant whelps!', '', 94746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your foolish crusade ends here, mortals. The legion comes and with it this world breathes its dying breath!', '', 94745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the echoes of doom resound across this wretched world, that all who live may hear them and despair.', '', 94744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My coming heralds the end of your pathetic world, insects. Your meager forces shall be the first of many to be consumed by the Burning Legion!', '', 94743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan, ready the Black Gate for my invasion. These vermin will not delay me. The last light will fall by my hand.', '', 94742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble, mortals and despair! Doom has come to this world.', '', 94741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akrrilo has been challenged at the Arena!', '', 94740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Barrage incoming to the gates! Take Cover!', 94739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rage has blinded Malfurion. He and Xavius have a long history of conflict.', 94738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You must... the Ashbringer. Leave me... there... isn\'t much time...', '', 94737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that weren\'t too bad. Time we get a move on it!', '', 94736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time fer me ta get movin\'! This evil ne\'er seems ta stop!', '', 94735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great work! Better get movin\' to the next spot \'fore it\'s too late!', '', 94734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The Light burns in my heart... I will NEVER surrender!', '', 94733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accept your challenge.', '', 94732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I go now to the Halls of Valor. You have my everlasting thanks, champion. May you one day die with honor.', '', 94731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By besting me in battle, by destroying my body, you have undone the vile curse laid upon me by the mystics.', '', 94730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! Free from that accursed body!', '', 94729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat.', '', 94728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh. Meat\'s back on menu.', '', 94727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yum-my.', '', 94726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself. Make one wrong move and we\'ll throw you in chains.', '', 94720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that I am speaking to a seasoned veteran.', '', 94719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Ysera. Let us find Malfurion!', 'I am ready, Ysera. We must find Malfurion!', 94718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not tarry, $r. We cannot afford to squander such time.', 94717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was a desperate plan, some might even say foolish. It was a gamble to ask the druids for help.$B$BThey have treated me kindly, but it looks like they have their own battle to fight.', 94716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The villagers tell stories about the people of the forest, but until today, I had never seen a... a druid.$B$BTheir magic is beyond my comprehension. It\'s as if the very forest can hear their commands.', 94715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have come too far to give up now. My people are in danger.', 94714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster! Fail me and you will know horrors beyond reckoning!', '', 94713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can observe Zeth\'Gol from here. The Bleeding Hollow clan is in chaos as one by one their leaders embrace Gul\'dan\'s dark gift. It is a good time to strike.', 'We can observe Zeth\'Gol from here. The Bleeding Hollow clan is in chaos as one by one their leaders embrace Gul\'dan\'s dark gift. It is a good time to strike.', 94712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Hulking Terror howls in rage!', '', 94711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $Gmister:miss;! I was so scared all by myself, but I know a shortcut back to town!', 94709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another volunteer! New blood to be spilled!', 'Another volunteer! New blood to be spilled!', 94708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-GRAND CHAMPIONS-ALLIANCE.blp:50:80|t$b[Gryan Stoutmantle] You\'ve done it! Meet back at camp at once!', '', 94707, 0, 33196, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, someone\'s rescuing us for a change. I\'ll try not to get used to it.', 'Heh, someone\'s rescuing us for a change. I\'ll try not to get used to it.', 94706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
