('Worthless wretch. I hope you fall in.', '', 94696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make me come over there.', '', 94695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you should try some REAL work.', '', 94694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you shut up about the fish?!', '', 94693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
