('I\'d love a ride.', 'I\'d love a ride.', 94659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gates are surrounded by vrykul. No doubt a small task for a champion like yourself.$b$bI\'m sure you are weary after your travels through Helhiem.$b$bYou will need your full strength if you wish to defeat the gatekeeper.$b$bIt would be my honor if I could carry you to the Halls of Valor.$b$bWhat say you, champion?', '', 94658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think this is over, paladin? Our journey together has just begun...', '', 94657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOT YOU $n!', '', 94656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will meet you outside Light\'s Hope Sanctum when you are ready, Highlord $p. ((Liadrin and Gryan walk outside.))', 94655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They came so quickly! We\'re outnumbered!', 94654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing.', 'You are nothing.', 94653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces grow stronger while you hide from your surroundings.', 'The forces grow stronger while you hide from your surroundings.', 94652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows offer no protection.', 'The shadows offer no protection.', 94651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, there is nothing...', 'In the end, there is nothing...', 94650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your safety is quite an illusion.', 'Your safety is quite an illusion.', 94649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into the shadows you go... But will you escape?', 'Into the shadows you go... But will you escape?', 94648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your form means nothing! We sense your being regardless of physical presence.', 'Your form means nothing! We sense your being regardless of physical presence.', 94647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, mortal, are merely postponing the inevitable...', 'You, mortal, are merely postponing the inevitable...', 94646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Charge!', 'What are you waiting for? Charge!', 94645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bringing such divided forces together is quite the feat, but there is still much to prove. I pray you live up to the Ashbringer\'s legacy, Highlord. Call on me when needed.', 94644, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gather anyone still able to fight and join you on the battlefield, $p.', '', 94643, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are strong, we are legion!', '', 94642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, enough of your chatter.', '', 94641, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your head will be a gift to Gul\'dan!', '', 94640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to face the might of the Legion? Ha, very well. The master will reward me for your souls.', '', 94639, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more and the shore is ours!', '', 94638, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this transgression. The legion is endless! INFERNO.', '', 94637, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One down, two to go.', '', 94636, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked!', 94635, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wolf is going to eat well tonight!', '', 94634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hope you\'re right.', '', 94633, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 53363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those crystals appear to be anchoring the structures to our dimension. Take them out, and I bet the whole structure would crumble!', 94632, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-ARGALOTH.blp:50:80|t$b[Malgalor] This world will burn. Listen to the screams of your allies, \'champion\'.', '', 94630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wrong... mixture....', 94629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me back through the storm. I am ready to enter the Halls of Valor.', 'Fly me back through the storm. I am ready to enter the Halls of Valor.', 94628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
