('But it will get you started. Find me near Aggramar\'s Vault, and I will put your strength to the test.', '', 94620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-GRAND CHAMPIONS-ALLIANCE.blp:50:80|t$b[Gryan Stoutmantle] Your invasion stops now, demon.', '', 94619, 0, 33196, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength alone will not win what you seek.', '', 94618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 53057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find the cipher!', '', 94617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our crew will rendezvous with the Alliance navy and continue hunting Sylvanas.$B$BYou, however, have bigger fish to fry.', 94616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We had the Forsaken fleet right where we wanted them - trapped in that bay like fish in a barrel.$B$BThere was no time to wait for reinforcements.$B$BWe had one shot, so I gave the order.$B$BI have no regrets.', 94615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
