('The God King has already entered the Halls of Valor. It is time for you to finish your trials and defeat the Gatekeeper.', 'The God King has already entered the Halls of Valor. It is time for you to finish your trials and defeat the Gatekeeper.', 94608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
