('There\'s only one way out of this, Alliance, and it\'s through that line of demons! Cannons, lay down covering fire! All forces, CHARGE!', '', 94585, 0, 924, 5, 64, 0, 53348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
