('Broadcasting Signal', 'Broadcasting Signal', 94582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will defend our homeland to the death!', '', 94581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
