('My beautiful leaves! You fleshbags will pay!', '', 94575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light bless you, $n. Azeroth would be lost to the Legion if it weren\'t for you.', 'Light bless you, $n. Azeroth would be lost to the Legion if it weren\'t for you.', 94574, 0, 36946, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many of the greatest paladins to walk Azeroth were buried on these sacred grounds. The others await you within the sanctum just below, $n.', 'Many of the greatest paladins to walk Azeroth were buried on these sacred grounds. The others await you within the sanctum just below, $n.', 94573, 0, 33185, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
