('This creature is the chieftain of your Horde, $n? I like him. He is not afraid of brash action, but he waits to build a consensus among his people before he makes a move.$b$bWe will need a bold strategy if we are to attack Tanaan Jungle. Your warchief is fortunate to have you at the ready.', '', 94452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
