('No, friend. We have a common enemy and need your skills.', '', 94431, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seek Solog Roark!', '', 94430, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 50348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tOkay. It appears that leystone interacts violently with flux. Let\'s stop right there.', '', 94429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On this day, the Order of the Silver Hand is reborn! Together, Sargeras himself shall shudder at our might!', '', 94428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all know the noble deeds of the champion at my side. $p has been chosen by the Light to succeed Tirion as Highlord. Under our new leader, this order shall become a mighty weapon brought to bear against the Legion!', '', 94427, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladins of Azeroth, you\'ve gathered to mourn the loss of Highlord Tirion Fordring. Many of you looked to him as an ideal, the paragon of what we all strive to be.', '', 94426, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 63832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fine men and women need a leader, $p. Your deeds prove you are the clear choice to bear that burden. Come, I will address them on your behalf.', '', 94425, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 63831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything rests upon your shoulders, commander. Build us a navy so we can assault Gul\'dan from all sides. Good luck!', '', 94424, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The metal will not bend so easily, try striking harder.', 94423, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive.', '', 94422, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh-eh, marvelous, marvelous.', '', 94421, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 50823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have arrived, whelps. Come face me and get this over with!', '', 94420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, hurry! Iroxus must not be allowed to enter Dire Maul!', '', 94419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tVery good. Let\'s get ready to weld. Apply some of the flux from my workbench.', '', 94418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tYou know what to do next. Heat the bar, then hammer it into shape.', '', 94417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tThat should be hot enough. Next, we\'ll draw the metal out into a bar.', '', 94416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tNow, bring the metal up to drawing heat in the forge.', '', 94415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tSee? It already looks better. Heat and quench again.', '', 94414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tNow, quickly, quench it in the trough.', '', 94413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\ACHIEVEMENT_CHARACTER_HUMAN_MALE.BLP:40|tI can already tell that we\'ll need to pre-temper this. Heat the ore in the forge.', '', 94412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The avatar of an |cFFFF0000%s|r enters the battle!', 'The avatar of an |cFFFF0000%s|r enters the battle!', 94410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000%s|r protects its master with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180040|h[Sovereign\'s Ward]|h|r!', '', 94408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r attempts to heal its master!', 94407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Polishing', 'Polishing', 94406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r focuses you with an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:182459|h[Edict of Condemnation]|h|r!', 94405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180608|h[Gavel of the Tyrant]|h|r!', 94404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r begins to channel an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180312|h[Infernal Tempest]|h|r!', 94403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r targets you with an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180260|h[Annihilating Strike]|h|r!', 94402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r activates an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179991|h[Aura of Malice]|h|r!', 94401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r activates an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179986|h[Aura of Contempt]|h|r!', 94400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|cFFFF0000%s|r activates an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181718|h[Aura of Oppression]|h|r!', 94399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will weep for the lost souls later. We will seal this breach...', 94398, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must stop them before they accomplish their dark goals.', 94397, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your plan is working, commander. Our landing met little resistance.', 94396, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The plan is working. Our landing was unopposed. We have taken them by surprise!', 94395, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And stay off, you crab faced filth!', '', 94394, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming!', '', 94393, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear what?', 'Hear what?', 94392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nathanos has charged us with restoring his ship to operational status.$b$bBut these lazy fools are taking forever to... wait... do you hear that?', '', 94391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to let the Alliance sink your ship? Prove the feebleness of their weapons by getting this barge floating.', '', 94390, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammer you fools! We have a schedule to keep.', '', 94389, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster! Get this ship floating before more of those scum scavenging crab people notice us.', '', 94388, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those fires out before Nathanos returns! I don\'t want to be food for his dogs.', '', 94387, 0, 33099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! This means nothing. One way or another, this world will burn!', '', 94386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not this time Gul\'dan! Hurry, get the Cipher!', '', 94385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... another succulent world ready to be beat into submission!', 94384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... my power...', '', 94383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each death only makes me more powerful!', '', 94382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll savor your soul the most.', '', 94381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must feast!', '', 94380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! I must have more!', '', 94379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must have more souls!', '', 94378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry... it gets worse.', '', 94377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither and DIE!', '', 94376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death!', '', 94375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in!', '', 94374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have feasted upon a thousand souls.  Yours will be next!', '', 94373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my blood they require fools! They\'ll let no harm come to me.', '', 94372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each death has given me untold power.  Now I unleash it upon you!', '', 94371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, activate the temple\'s defenses to amplify my magic!', 'Quickly, activate the temple\'s defenses to amplify my magic!', 94370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, up here! This portal is too strong for my magic to close!', 'Heroes, up here! This portal is too strong for my magic to close!', 94369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am looking for treasure.', 'I am looking for treasure.', 94368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there!$b$bI\'m a placeholder treasure hunter. I travel around telling people where the treasures are that I can\'t actually get myself because of \'reasons.\' Eventually I may be found in exotic and/or common places once I make up my mind.$b$bDo you want to hunt treasures?', 94367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have found all you will find down here. Now leave and do not return...', '', 94366, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard Kilrogg! What happened?!', '', 94365, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 50313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan\'s Horde is ready for us. A full-frontal assault would be costly at best and suicide at worst.$b$bThere\'s got to be another way...', '', 94364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The human King is quite versed in military strategy, but even he can\'t perform miracles.$b$bIf we\'re to break through into the jungles of Tanaan, we\'re going to need some sort of diversion.', 94363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return...', '', 94362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay... defiler...', '', 94361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed my chieftain...', '', 94360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kilrogg... they come for the eyes...', '', 94359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay infidel... someday...', '', 94358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Others will guard the eyes after me...', '', 94357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can loot the Bleeding Hollow\'s most treasured relics?!', '', 94356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will guard the eyes with my eternal soul!', '', 94355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You trespass on sacred ground!', '', 94354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies grow bolder with each passing day. Thank the Light we have you at the helm of our efforts.', '', 94353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What threats shall we tackle first? Say the word and consider it done.', '', 94352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say the world and I will rally your best knights, $GLord:Lady; $n.', '', 94351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s honor, Highlord.', '', 94350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what happened in Azsuna.', 'Show me what happened in Azsuna.', 94347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whenever ye accomplish a great feat, I\'ll be sure tae jot it down in yer libram for posterity!', 94344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The knowledge of our forefathers is laid bare before us. What a marvelous opportunity!', 94343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lookin\' fer somethin\' specific, Highlord?', 94342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'G\'day to ye, Highlord $n. Can I help ye find somethin\'?', 94341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a true mystery. Gul\'dan went through great lengths to get this dagger. He says it was quite the adventure. \n\nHe made sure I knew it was the most important part of the spell. Truth be told, when I held it I felt nothing. I\'m not entirely sure it did anything at all, but we should get it just in case. Gul\'dan wouldn\'t have given it to me otherwise... right?', '', 94340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this... Mac\'Gufin?', 'What is this... Mac\'Gufin?', 94339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tome was stolen from the Imperator Mar\'gok himself, though he blames the Frostwolf clan for the theft. It is more arcane in nature but is still usable by warlocks.\n\nThe enchantments from this tome are a core component to the barrier spell. Fear not, I can dispel it though it may cost me dearly.', '', 94338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Tome of Protection?', 'What is the Tome of Protection?', 94337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Black Candle... I know not where Gul\'dan found this. It never burns down and exudes a corruptive smoke as it lights everything with an unholy glint.\n\nMy fingers still feel oily from when I touched it.', '', 94336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Black Candle?', 'What is the Black Candle?', 94335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These poor people. Gul\'dan will stop at nothing to get what he wants!', '', 94334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Click the nearby Grapple Point to launch yourself to the top of the wall. Grapple points within range will light up.', '', 94333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Climb to the top of the ridge to get a good view of the grapple point.', '', 94332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s moans in agony.', '', 94327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These new cannon... dey be something else...', 94326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We saved Draenor once, I will help you save it again.', '', 94325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take good care of him, adventurer!', 94324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will accompany Brimbil.', 'I will accompany Brimbil.', 94323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, hello traveler!$B$BSometimes, young saplings just need a little push to gain confidence, you know?$B$BYoung Brimbil here has everything he needs to take his first journey across the forest, but perhaps he could use some guidance.$B$BWould you escort him to Keeper Ferthalos, across the river?$B$BJust follow Brimbil. He should know the way.', 94322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be another after me...', '', 94321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I will take your blood as payment for your interference!', '', 94320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blood... joins the others...', '', 94319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the rituals, you can only join them!', '', 94318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, Brimbil. Every young sapling must step into the real world. You\'ll be fine!', 94317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blood... for Kilrogg...', '', 94316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood for the Blood Moon!', '', 94315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hunters will find you... wherever you...', '', 94314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you flee, I will hunt you to the ends of the world!', '', 94313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spears... you have failed me...', '', 94312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try and dodge my spears fool!', '', 94311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Kilrogg...', '', 94310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest... at last...', '', 94309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush... you...', '', 94308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood for Kilrogg!', '', 94307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp and smash!', '', 94306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush you!', '', 94305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you die!', 'Now you die!', 94304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50359, 50359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kilrogg will still be victorious...', 'Kilrogg will still be victorious...', 94303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brothers will make you pay.', 'My brothers will make you pay.', 94302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill you... kill... you...', 'Kill you... kill... you...', 94301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us!', 'You cannot stop us!', 94300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50360, 50360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kilrogg... I\'ve failed you...', 'Kilrogg... I\'ve failed you...', 94299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood will be most useful!', 'Your blood will be most useful!', 94298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to the Bleeding Hollow!', 'Glory to the Bleeding Hollow!', 94297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will skin you alive!', 'I will skin you alive!', 94296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will serve in our rituals!', 'Your corpse will serve in our rituals!', 94295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the enemies of Kilrogg!', 'Death to the enemies of Kilrogg!', 94294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a curious little house he has! I\'ll stay and make sure he\'s all right. Thank you, hero.', 94293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s beckons to the chest inside the den, as if he wants you to have it.', '', 94292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s bows to you.', '', 94291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, it looks like he wants us to follow him!', 94290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, my wonderful forest friend has been saved!', 94289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eep! Watch out! Defend me, hero!', 94288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I\'ll defend you.', 'Yes, I\'ll defend you.', 94287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hello there!$B$BMy poor friend here was attacked by wolves, and now I\'m nursing him back to health!$B$BI\'m having a little bit of trouble with this spell, so it should just take a few more minutes.$B$BI think some of those nasty predators are still nearby, so could you hold them off while I finish here?', 94286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arg, why isn\'t it working? The power of my friendship should heal all wounds!', 94285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s grunts.', '', 94284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it! How do you feel, old friend?', '', 94283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the spirit, Oakleaf. Thank you, adventurer. He seems to have regained control of his senses.', '', 94282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness, come forth!', '', 94281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will help. Let\'s begin.', 'I will help. Let\'s begin.', 94280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something is wrong with my friend. A darkness has taken root within him, paralyzing him with fear.$B$BI believe the only recourse is to cleanse his mind, but in doing so, we will face his nightmares.$B$BI cannot defeat this evil alone. Will you help me?', '', 94279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will get worse before it gets better, old friend. Let us begin!', '', 94278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, Oakleaf. I know it is painful, but please, hold on!', '', 94277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us test your strength, champion! Prepare yourself! [OUR ABILITIES AND CLEANUP AREN\'T SET UP YET!]', '', 94276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
