('One rift closed, but there are still more demons. Do they ever cease?', 'One rift closed, but there are still more demons. Do they ever cease?', 94267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great work, heroes! Keep up the fight!', 'Great work, heroes! Keep up the fight!', 94266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOL! You will fall before the might of the Legion!', 'FOOL! You will fall before the might of the Legion!', 94265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
