('', 'My collection... they were all... I had...', 94263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pah! You\'re too ugly for my collection. Better to kill you!', 94262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stranger, do you see those flowers growing on the lake shore?$B$BElune\'s Kiss, we call them. I\'ve searched the forest for days to find this patch, only to find it guarded by that foul monster.$B$BPlease, adventurer. I need to get those flowers.', 94261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adventurer, over here!', 94260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did it! Why don\'t you take a bloom yourself, adventurer? Elune\'s Kiss has powerful properties.', 94259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is why you should cover your buildings in spikes!', '', 94258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
