('I\'ve got to get my hands on those plans. They are my life\'s work.', '', 94250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... is done. Go and stop him...', '', 94249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
