('', 'Are you ready, Tiris?', 94226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The owls of this grove are in grave danger from a murderous vulture known as Gorebeak.$B$BTiris and I plan to lure the beast down from its lair.$B$BWe must slay him to restore balance to the forest, but we could use all the help we can get.', 94225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
