('The contract continues in a progressively smaller font:$b$bPage 2:$b\"These terms include the acquisition of materials required for the Ritual of Sharazaan, hereafter referred to as \'the gig,\' and any extermination, elimination, assassination, or murderation of subjects, living or otherwise, that resist the afore mentioned assets required by the gig and Daglop.\"', '', 94193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
