('We are all doomed to spend an eternity here.', '', 94145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover\'s blown. Now you die!', '', 94144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one... more... fight...', 'Just one... more... fight...', 94143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hold on. We will outlast them, I know it.', 'We must hold on. We will outlast them, I know it.', 94142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archdruid Steelclaw is still down in the barrows, with the others. We must save them quickly.', 'Archdruid Steelclaw is still down in the barrows, with the others. We must save them quickly.', 94141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart of a Druid of the Claw never falters. We are the ones who endure.', 'The heart of a Druid of the Claw never falters. We are the ones who endure.', 94140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something has stirred the furbolgs into a frenzy. In my memory, never have they attacked in force like this.', 'Something has stirred the furbolgs into a frenzy. In my memory, never have they attacked in force like this.', 94139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nowhere to hide.', '', 94138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s targets you for |cFFFF0404|Hspell:180372|h[Heart Seeker]|h|r!', '', 94137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This beautiful madness... why did I fight it?', '', 94136, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helira! You can\'t hold me here forever! I will be free!', '', 94135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not feeding me to the hounds this time!', '', 94134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not dying again without a fight!', '', 94133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Tattersail tells you what she knows and runs away.]', '[Tattersail tells you what she knows and runs away.]', 94132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My guess? She landed somewhere up the coast and continued on foot.', 94131, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 51730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We got the queen into a rowboat, but she didn\'t want an escort. Told us to stay behind and fight.', 94130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s not... the archdruid has... save yourself... run!', '', 94129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Trade_Engineering.blp:20|tThe |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181300|h[Empowered Fel Hand]|h|r |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180442|h[Releases]|h|r a fatal burst of Fel Energy!', '', 94128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_rune.blp:20|tAn |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180370|h[Explosive Rune]|h|r explodes on its own.', '', 94127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_rune.blp:20|t$n triggers an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180370|h[Explosive Rune]|h|r.', '', 94126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_green.blp:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181371|h[Violent Reaction]|h|r occurs from Kormrok leaping into the Foul Pool!', '', 94125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_orange.blp:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181370|h[Violent Reaction]|h|r occurs from Kormrok leaping into the Fiery Pool!', '', 94124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_purple.blp:20|tA |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181365|h[Violent Reaction]|h|r occurs from Kormrok leaping into the Shadowy Pool!', '', 94123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Green.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Foul Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181299|h[Fel Grasp]|h|r.', '', 94122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Orange.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Fiery Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181296|h[Explosive Runes]|h|r.', '', 94121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Purple.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Shadow Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181292|h[Fel Outpouring]|h|r.', '', 94120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Green.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Foul Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181300|h[Empowered Fel Grasp]|h|r.', '', 94119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Orange.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Fiery Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181297|h[Empowered Explosive Runes]|h|r.', '', 94118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Bijou_Purple.blp:20|tKormrok leaps into the Shadow Pool, gaining |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181293|h[Empowered Fel Outpouring]|h|r.', '', 94117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_Strangulate.blp:20|tA Fel Hand starts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181345|h[Crushing]|h|r $n!', '', 94116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Mage_LivingBomb.blp:20|t$n is going to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181324|h[Explode]|h|r!', '', 94115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_teleportdalarancrater.blp:20|tWith no one to absorb their |cFFFF0000|Hspell:182427|h[Impact]|h|r, $n perishes.', '', 94114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.blp:20|t$n is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181305|h[Launched]|h|r into the air!', '', 94113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Requiem.blp:20|tKormrok summons |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181300|h[Dragging Hands]|h|r from the ground!', '', 94112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Requiem.blp:20|tKormrok summons |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181299|h[Grasping Hands]|h|r from the ground!', '', 94111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_rune.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:181297|h[Empowered Explosive Runes]|h|r appear on the ground!', '', 94110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_rune.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:181296|h[Explosive Runes]|h|r appear on the ground!', '', 94109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves.blp:20|tAll three pools start generating |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181293|h[Fel Globules]|h|r!', '', 94108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves.blp:20|tThe Shadow Pool starts generating |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181292|h[Shadow Globules]|h|r!', '', 94107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_GolemThunderClap.blp:20|tKormrok begins |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180244|h[Pounding]|h|r the ground!', '', 94106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool dwarf. Deliver his head to the foothold!', '', 94105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush the weak!', 'Crush the weak!', 94104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50358, 50358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unstoppable!', 'Unstoppable!', 94103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50357, 50357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn!', 94102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon you will burn with the rest of Azeroth!', 94101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR AZEROTH!', '', 94100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, this is the death I saw!', '', 94099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were not the ones I saw.', '', 94098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you believe you could kill me?', '', 94097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 94096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was this how you wanted to die?', '', 94095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to cut your heart out!', '', 94094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze into my eyes and witness your doom!', '', 94093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how many fall before I do!', '', 94092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been waiting for this day!', '', 94091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The choice is simple, Ariok. Submit, or die.', '', 94090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me from these bonds and I will show you my rage, Kilrogg!', '', 94089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you resist your own blood, Ariok? Give into your rage.', '', 94088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now!', '', 94087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears the Iron Horde is summoning all of its farflung holdings back here. Most Iron Horde troops disembark at the harbor and immediately go to get converted. The rest stay and bring in munitions and other resources to feed their army.$b$bIf Gul\'dan is allowed to convert the entire Iron Horde he will have an unbeatable army!', 94086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of ships coming into that harbor, what\'s going on there?', 'Lots of ships coming into that harbor, what\'s going on there?', 94085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not sure if I\'ve ever been in an area that was more determined to kill me!$b$bThat being said I have some early information on Ironhold Harbor just to the northwest, the Fel Forge to the southeast, and the Throne of Kil\'jaeden up on the mountain right behind you.', 94084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye won\'t stop my hunt!', '', 94083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat up, lads! We\'ve a witch to hunt!', '', 94082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one of hers alright...', '', 94081, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 51727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sign of Sylvanas in the hills. What have we here?', '', 94080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Nathanos leaps down from the cliff and walks over.]', '[Nathanos leaps down from the cliff and walks over.]', 94079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thievery will not be tolerated, slave.', '', 94078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Directly ahead, Alliance ships! Make for the beach! Hold on everyone, this is going to get worse before it gets better!', 94077, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 53303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Nathanos and his rangers move out.]', '[Nathanos and his rangers move out.]', 94076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our men are waiting outside to take us back to Dalaran. We should leave while we still can!', '', 94075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The outcasts are concerned about their brethren. Some lost souls are being trained by the Shadow Council in fel magics and demon summoning. They have even recruited some high arakkoa as well but that area is significantly more dangerous, you will need allies to clear that particular area out. We should clear out this poisonous nest soon.', 94074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arakkoa in Tanaan? Tell me more of Aktar\'s Watch.', 'Arakkoa in Tanaan? Tell me more of Aktar\'s Watch.', 94073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hunt continues here, commander. I have reports on Aktar\'s Watch just to the northwest and the Ironmonger\'s Hold, that big tunnel to the southeast.', 94072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ashbringer...', 94071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible. With the Ashbringer and your might at our head, we might still stand a chance of turning the Burning Legion back.', '', 94070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('They destroyed this village some time ago and replaced it with training grounds, demon summoning, and corrupting the wildlife into fel weapons.$b$bThe people that died here must be avenged, commander!', '', 94069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening at the Temple of Sha\'naar?', 'What is happening at the Temple of Sha\'naar?', 94068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This poor village... crushed by the Sargerei...', 94067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Bleeding Hollow are fearsome hunters and trappers. They have lived well in this jungle. Deep inside their village they practice dark blood magic. That cannot be good for us, so I must recommend reducing this village to ash at the earliest opportunity!', '', 94066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helya, witness my strength. I am worthy!', '', 94065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of Zeth\'Gol.', 'Tell me of Zeth\'Gol.', 94064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again, friend. This place is not Gorgrond, but I do not miss the giant beasts that shake the earth!$b$bI have reports on Zeth\'Gol, the Temple of Sha\'naar, and the Zorammarsh.', '', 94063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ascend!', '', 94062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will bathe in your blood!', '', 94061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not win this fight!', '', 94060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 94059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our siege began the moment you took the boats. It looked like it would be a long battle until a large part of their forces departed suddenly, most likely when you attacked from the east.$b$b\nThen we hit them with everything. Thaelin brought in a massive powered ram and the gates fell quickly. Then we ran into this new foe... the fel orcs. They press us sorely and we can make no headway. I hope you are having better luck in the east.', '', 94058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our losses were almost more than I could bear... but we made it through. To this!', '', 94057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we do not act swiftly, the vale will be overrun. Druids, lend me your claws!', '', 94056, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helira, send me to the eternal battlefield. I am worthy!', '', 94055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doomed... we are all doomed.', '', 94054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helira! Hear my calls! Please... set me free.', '', 94053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought well in life... I don\'t belong here', '', 94052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them feed me to the hounds again...', '', 94051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is lost...', '', 94050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent location... good fields of fire... excellent recon routes. I recommend planting your banner here, commander.', 94049, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, commander!', 94048, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly now, you must see this place!', 94047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pull the Ashbringer out of the ground, holding it up triumphantly. A moment later, Balanazzar appears in front of you.', '', 94046, 0, 0, 0, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will bring me back... he is never finished with... us...', '', 94045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally a break from the boredom of all this \"preparation!\"', '', 94044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_mastercleaver.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun\'s axe sends out |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_mastercleaver.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun\'s axe sends out |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r!', 94043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your will, Archdruid? Death and terror surround us...', '', 94042, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_orgrimmarraid_d_01.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun frenzies and is now |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179671|h[Heavily Armed]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_orgrimmarraid_d_01.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun frenzies and is now |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179671|h[Heavily Armed]|h|r!', 94041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_pvphorde_a_01blackhigh.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun takes up his axe again, |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179670|h[Arming]|h|r himself.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_axe_2h_pvphorde_a_01blackhigh.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun takes up his axe again, |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179670|h[Arming]|h|r himself.', 94040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_moltencoregreen.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun\'s axe begins emitting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179622|h[Fel Explosions]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_moltencoregreen.blp:20|tFel Lord Zakuun\'s axe begins emitting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179622|h[Fel Explosions]|h|r!', 94039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathwing_grasping_tendrilsgreen.blp:20|tThe |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179582|h[Rumbling Fissures]|h|r harden into |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179620|h[Fel Crystals]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathwing_grasping_tendrilsgreen.blp:20|tThe |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179582|h[Rumbling Fissures]|h|r harden into |cFFFF0000|Hspell:179620|h[Fel Crystals]|h|r!', 94038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SeedOfDestruction.blp:20|tYour |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181508|h[Seed of Destruction]|h|r will emit |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SeedOfDestruction.blp:20|tYour |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181508|h[Seed of Destruction]|h|r will emit |cFFFF0000|Hspell:181498|h[Wakes of Destruction]|h|r.', 94037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
