('If this reaver isn\'t finished in time, I will devour your souls!', '', 93899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster, I will not tolerate any further delays!', '', 93898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your thoughts, insipid.', 93897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your failures, absolute.', 93896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your existence, without purpose.', 93895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your attempts, meaningless.', 93894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p will wield its power against the forces of the Legion. They will strike at the very heart of darkness. The Light shall TRIUMPH!', '', 93893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All Paladins, hear my voice. The Ashbringer has chosen its successor.', '', 93892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pathetic defeat was... inevitable.', 93891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blade glows so brightly... not even at the top of Icecrown Citadel have I seen it so powerful. It must be so.', '', 93890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insects deserve to be crushed!', 93889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By all that is good in this world... you did it. The Ashbringer is saved!', '', 93888, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A tempest of righteous fire!', 93887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a... tragedy...', 93886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! This is where you die!', 93885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Eredar are no strangers to war. Are you so eager to meet your end?', 93884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sovereign watches over me!', 93883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Harbinger, restore my wounds!', 93882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was to be... undying...', 93881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will trespass no further!', '', 93880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the Enforcer\'s will... and your demise.', '', 93879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once more into the breach!', '', 93878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am returned...', '', 93877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disciples! Your work is not yet done!', 93876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me, damn you. Our lord must not be disturbed!', '', 93875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll find the giants to the southeast. There are a few ways into their arena. Good luck.', 93874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eternal suffering.', '', 93873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face my wrath.', '', 93872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a foulness in the air, and we are headed directly towards it.', '', 93871, 0, 924, 1, 64, 0, 53301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t seen so much as a seagull for hours now.', 93870, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 53293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our first combat mission, time to prove that Bravery isn\'t just a name.', 93869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 53292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any regular fish bait?', 'Any regular fish bait?', 93868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
