('Bwahaha... HAHAHA!', 'Bwahaha... HAHAHA!', 93836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re chasing me... They... Make them stop!', 'They\'re chasing me... They... Make them stop!', 93835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me! Why won\'t you help me?!', 'Help me! Why won\'t you help me?!', 93834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightmare comes for you!', 'The Nightmare comes for you!', 93833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
