('Terrors... everywhere!', 'Terrors... everywhere!', 93831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have saved all that we can, $n. I\'ll meet you back in the grove. Elen\'elora-ethil.', 93830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
