('Come at me!', '', 93800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 93799, 0, 32869, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wretched! Soon... <cough>... you will follow me in death!', 93798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools! This forest will soon die... and you with it!', 93797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These harpies have coexisted peacefully with us for ages.$b$bWhat could have prompted such aggression?', '', 93796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forest whispered of your arrival, young one.$b$bFew outsiders have entered my precious grove. Please show reverence during your visit.', '', 93795, 0, 43622, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep Aktar safe Percy. I\'ll be back soon.', '', 93794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just speaking with Aktar. Did you know that he used to be a Sky Admiral before he was banished by the adherents?', '', 93793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If anyone is going to be able to stop Iskar, it\'s you.', '', 93792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no place to linger. I\'ll head back to Aktar\'s camp.', '', 93791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, faster. Let\'s get this gear on the boat to Tanaan. Today, you scrubs!', '', 93790, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan wants us in Tanaan. This is our last chance. Haul those crates!', '', 93789, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step it up, you peons. You don\'t want to be left behind.', '', 93788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re pulling out. Go go go!', '', 93787, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get moving! We need to get these supplies to Tanaan.', '', 93786, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of Gul\'dan!', 'For the glory of Gul\'dan!', 93785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fate is sealed.', 'Your fate is sealed.', 93784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Archdruids have studied at the feet of Cenarius himself for thousands of years.', 93783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never defeat us. We are legion!', 'You\'ll never defeat us. We are legion!', 93782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Gul\'dan!', 'For Gul\'dan!', 93781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need some help with the shopping list?\n\nI hate to encourage theft, but the Ogres partying at the Ring of Blood love their Bass Blaster. I doubt they\'ll be in a fighting mood, but don\'t stick around after you swipe it from them.\n\nI had a Laz-tron Disc Reader stolen from me a few weeks ago, and I couldn\'t get the Goblin smell out of my bunk for a week. Check Pinchwhistle Point.\n\nPhonic Amplifiers are tough to find. A piece of metal from an Arakkoa construct might be enough.\n\nIf you\'re up to sticking it to some Iron Horde, their shredders in Talador usually have the sort of capacitor I need.\n\nAnd for the finishing touch, wood from the ancients in Gorgrond, if the Commandojacks have spared any.', 'Need some help with the shopping list?\n\nI hate to encourage theft, but the Ogres partying at the Ring of Blood love their Bass Blaster. I doubt they\'ll be in a fighting mood, but don\'t stick around after you swipe it from them.\n\nI had a Laz-tron Disc Reader stolen from me a few weeks ago, and I couldn\'t get the Goblin smell out of my bunk for a week. Check Pinchwhistle Point.\n\nPhonic Amplifiers are tough to find. A piece of metal from an Arakkoa construct might be enough.\n\nIf you\'re up to sticking it to some Iron Horde, their shredders in Talador usually have the sort of capacitor I need.\n\nAnd for the finishing touch, wood from the ancients in Gorgrond, if the Commandojacks have spared any.', 93780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A quiet garrison is a sad garrison. Nothing some music can\'t fix!', '', 93779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great day for some tunes, eh Commander?', '', 93778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, my starlight is in danger! Protect her!!', '', 93777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will feast on the dragons instead!', '', 93776, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 52825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forget the Tidestone, brothers. Let the lizards and the lowborn have their crystal.', '', 93775, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 52846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come join us, $p. We could use your weapon.', 93774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, my prince.', 93773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
