('The Tidestone calls to them. We cannot let them approach.', '', 93760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to help. The naga are right on our tail.', '', 93759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farondis, old friend. Is that you?', '', 93758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those are no enemies, starlight.', '', 93757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see enemies coming in from the lagoon!', 93756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There were... too many...', 93755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Reshad reads over the page.>$B$BSo, his travel here was in truth to hide his search for this \"cipher.\" This is troubling but there are many unanswered questions that remain.$b$bI have a small vial of enchanted sands that when paired with the book will show us what occurred when it was last in Iskar\'s hands.$b$bWhen you are ready we will see what really happened.', '', 93754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malfurion Stormrage has sent me to find the Archdruid of the Prowl.', 'Malfurion Stormrage has sent me to find the Archdruid of the Prowl.', 93753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Were it not for the Archdruid Seferaes Nightmane, we would not be alive.$b$bWe were greatly outnumbered and wounded, but Seferaes ferociously fought to preserve our lives with no regard to his own safety.$b$bThe Archdruid was wounded in the battle and, though we tried to treat his wounds, he insisted that there was no time.$b$bLast I saw of him, he fought his way up the cliff to Moonrise Cavern.', 93752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fel is not a curse. It\'s a gift. A wonderous gift!', 'The fel is not a curse. It\'s a gift. A wonderous gift!', 93751, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our time is now. Gul\'dan will save us. Our power will be infinite!', 'Our time is now. Gul\'dan will save us. Our power will be infinite!', 93750, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your faith in Gul\'dan. He knew what was right all along.', 'Put your faith in Gul\'dan. He knew what was right all along.', 93749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power - you\'ve never experienced anything like it.', 'Such power - you\'ve never experienced anything like it.', 93748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still need more music rolls! Where should I go to finish my collection?', 'I still need more music rolls! Where should I go to finish my collection?', 93747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I get some really hard to find music rolls?', 'Where can I get some really hard to find music rolls?', 93746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls make some... interesting music. Their best stuff is somewhere in Zul\'Gurub.', '', 93745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about fishing the Bluffs? An eccentric musician is known to toss rolls of hers in there, from time to time.', '', 93744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feeling a song of war? Domination Point in Pandaria used to shake with heavy drum beats.', '', 93743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that song reminds you of the wilds of Northrend!', '', 93742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here you go!', '', 93740, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it was nice talking to you.', '', 93739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', 'No.', 93738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, please.', 'Yes, please.', 93737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!', 'Yes!', 93736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, yes! The wilderness is both serene and wild, the perfect subject of a song.\n\nI happen to have one of the old lumberjack\'s songs written down here. Would you like a copy?', '', 93735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t say I\'ve had too many of those, spend most of my time around these parts.', '', 93734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t sing songs ABOUT lumberjacking. That would be crazy.', '', 93733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A song about the wilderness.', 'A song about the wilderness.', 93732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A song about adventure!', 'A song about adventure!', 93731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A song about lumberjacking?', 'A song about lumberjacking?', 93730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A song? Well, there\'s nothing that goes better with lumberjacking than singing, that\'s for sure!  \n\nWhat kind of song are you looking for?', '', 93729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sure do like to talk about air! Bit of a one-trick subject, though. \n\nBoring, is what I\'m saying.', '', 93728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The... mountain air?', 'The... mountain air?', 93727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Well I wish you the best in your travels, then!', '', 93726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing in particular.', 'Nothing in particular.', 93725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a song...', 'I\'m looking for a song...', 93724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s a game of Hearthstone going on there, you\'ll probably find my father as well.', '', 93723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d rather be in a tavern right now.', 'I\'d rather be in a tavern right now.', 93722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! There you go! Now what brings you out here, friend?', '', 93721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Breathe deeply.>', '<Breathe deeply.>', 93720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I literally just said that.', '', 93719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s crisp!', 'It\'s crisp!', 93718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you just love the outdoors? Go ahead, breathe in that crisp mountain air!', '', 93717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lorewalkers love great music almost as much as they love food and drink.', '', 93716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande herself loves the mysterious Shalandis Isle roll. She has the only copy I\'ve ever seen.', '', 93715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas\' legendary lamentation was recorded only once. Rumor is she keeps it in a very safe place.', '', 93714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hearing carousel music always takes me back. Maybe the Darkmoon Faire has a roll of that somewhere?', '', 93713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan songs of Ulduar are awfully hard to come by these days.', '', 93712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once ran into a grizzled musician in the hills of Northrend with a ton of talent. He\'d be worth finding.', '', 93711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Willing to get dirty for a new track? I hear the Stranglethorn Arena\'s prize pot has been sweetened lately.', '', 93710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faerie Dragons are known to make amazing music, if you catch them in the right Glade.', '', 93709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Songs of Northrend valor are worth seeking out as morale boosters for your troops.', '', 93708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Opera can make a great roll, if you\'re adventurous enough to find it.', '', 93707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invincible is a pretty bold name for a music track, let alone a horse.', '', 93706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Songs of the Black Temple used to echo through the Warden\'s prison. I wonder if I\'ll ever hear those again.', '', 93705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashenvale\'s a magical place. Musicians have been known to find shady nooks there, and write for weeks on end.', '', 93704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I camped out once in Winterspring with this amazing artist who loved cold, crisp weather. I\'d love to hear his stuff again.', '', 93703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you dying for more music? I hear the spirits of Duskwood are something to behold.', '', 93702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tinkertown is good, clean fun. Good music, too!', '', 93701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got a rod and reel handy? I hear there\'s an artist leaving her work in creative places in Ironforge.', '', 93700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EXTREMELY PLACEHOLDER EVENT!!!! YSERA ARRIVES, POOF!', 'EXTREMELY PLACEHOLDER EVENT!!!! YSERA ARRIVES, POOF!', 93699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lion\'s Landing has a track as fresh as the sea. Watch out for sharks!', '', 93698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re already leading a campaign against the Iron Horde. Might as well take Blackhand\'s music roll collection while you\'re at it.', '', 93697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conquering fear itself will help you glimpse the Heart of Pandaria, musically speaking, of course.', '', 93696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finding classic tracks takes hard work, and sometimes that means flying on the back of a colossal, cataclysmic dragon. Them\'s the breaks.', '', 93695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face his wrath, in that flying fortress, with that icy weather? All for new music? You\'re crazy!', '', 93694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up for a journey into the Black Temple? You still won\'t be prepared for the hard hitting bass of the track you\'ll find.', '', 93693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deep in the heart of Blackrock is a track so legendary, it takes two dragons to protect it.', '', 93692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory in the name of Gul\'dan!', 'Another victory in the name of Gul\'dan!', 93691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill me if you can - but nothing will stop the Legion I serve!', 'Kill me if you can - but nothing will stop the Legion I serve!', 93690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I get more music rolls?', 'Where can I get more music rolls?', 93689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing will stop us.', 'Nothing will stop us.', 93688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them - in the name of Gul\'dan!', 'Destroy them - in the name of Gul\'dan!', 93687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need some help with the shopping list?\n\nBass Blaster\'s easy. The Ogres love loud music to go with their fights at the Ring of Blood. The spectators aren\'t there to fight. Just take it from them!\n\nI seem to remember a working Laz-tron down at Pinchwhistle Point, from a gig I played there once.\n\nWe\'ll never find a real Phonic Amplifier, so just rip a big hunk of metal off of one of those Arakkoa sun constructs. That\'ll do fine.\n\nAs for the capacitor, you\'ll probably need to break open an Iron Horde shredder. Seems like your kind of work.\n\nOh, and the kind of wood I need has to be seriously ancient, so Everbloom Wilds is probably your best bet in Draenor.', 'Need some help with the shopping list?\n\nBass Blaster\'s easy. The Ogres love loud music to go with their fights at the Ring of Blood. The spectators aren\'t there to fight. Just take it from them!\n\nI seem to remember a working Laz-tron down at Pinchwhistle Point, from a gig I played there once.\n\nWe\'ll never find a real Phonic Amplifier, so just rip a big hunk of metal off of one of those Arakkoa sun constructs. That\'ll do fine.\n\nAs for the capacitor, you\'ll probably need to break open an Iron Horde shredder. Seems like your kind of work.\n\nOh, and the kind of wood I need has to be seriously ancient, so Everbloom Wilds is probably your best bet in Draenor.', 93686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not your destiny. Gul\'dan will lead us to victory. It is not too late!', 'This is not your destiny. Gul\'dan will lead us to victory. It is not too late!', 93685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your leaders have failed you! Only Gul\'dan can save our race. Join us or perish in defeat.', 'Your leaders have failed you! Only Gul\'dan can save our race. Join us or perish in defeat.', 93684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your destiny lies in Tanaan. Come! Drink the fel gift, and you will be as war incarnate.', 'Your destiny lies in Tanaan. Come! Drink the fel gift, and you will be as war incarnate.', 93683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great is the power of the Legion. You will know no fear. No doubt. Everything is clear!', 'Great is the power of the Legion. You will know no fear. No doubt. Everything is clear!', 93682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will save us. Gul\'dan is our last hope. His is the way!', 'Gul\'dan will save us. Gul\'dan is our last hope. His is the way!', 93681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power - it courses through my veins! It is like nothing you\'ve ever felt.', 'The power - it courses through my veins! It is like nothing you\'ve ever felt.', 93680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
