('Khadgar, can you direct this portal to Stormwind?', '', 93628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Magni of Ironforge wants to see you at once.', '', 93627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, old friend! I hate to interrupt, but I need to speak with $n immediately.', '', 93626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will follow your lead, champion. We mustn\'t keep Saurfang waiting.', '', 93625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, can you direct this portal to Orgrimmar?', '', 93624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurfang wants to see you at once.', '', 93623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, there you are! We must speak at once, champion.', '', 93622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here invader, but we must talk.', '', 93621, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, men! You have saved your beloved captain and- wait... where are you all going?', '', 93620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We go. Find me Kilrogg.', '', 93619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for taking a moment to appreciate my hard work. It really makes me happy!', 93618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand to and bring that thing down or its the gullet for all of you.', '', 93617, 0, 32768, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s the spirit! Fire another salvo across that thing\'s chin.', '', 93616, 0, 32768, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put yer backs into it! I don\'t want to get ate.', '', 93615, 0, 32768, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here spirits are restless. They are angry we are here. They will not stop me.', '', 93614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on lads! Slay that large beast so we can be off.', '', 93613, 0, 32768, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally up ya scurvy dogs. Are you going to let this big burly giant drag your fortunes to the bottom of the sea?', '', 93612, 0, 32768, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die desecrator!', '', 93611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not allow you to take that!', '', 93610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must protect our sacred grounds...', '', 93609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will reap your souls.', '', 93608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BEHOLD! My wondrous creation! Convincing, isn\'t it?', 93607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 250, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, why not?', 'Sure, why not?', 93606, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not defeat us so easily!', '', 93605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give Sargeras my regards!', '', 93604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather them together, champions! My magic will do the rest!', '', 93603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been an honor to fight by your side all these years, but our strength was not enough to save Azeroth. Before we meet death, let\'s send a few hundred demons screaming back to the Twisting Nether!', '', 93602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you survived that last assault, but when the Burning Legion makes its final push, they\'ll wipe us out.', '', 93601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 50633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'ve had better nights... I was working on a beautiful enchantment for months and months but no one got to see it!\n\nHey, would YOU like to see it?', '', 93600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are you?', 'How are you?', 93599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The faerie dragon looks sad.>', '', 93598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die gloriously in battle protecting your home... that is the fate all true warriors strive for.', '', 93597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My name is Fen Tao, and I am from Pandaria.  I have spent many days traveling to these lands.  Why you ask?\n\nWe are a family of helpful people, and you look like someone that could use some help.  Just let me know how I can be of service to you.', '', 93596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you here?', 'Why are you here?', 93595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... that\'s mine! I think...', '', 93594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Party pooper get smashed!', '', 93593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hit you more hard than bass blaster!', '', 93592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat not smart, little thing!', '', 93591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard stories of your glorious deeds in Pandaria!  It\'s an honor to finally meet you in person!', '', 93590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow Fen Tao to join our cause?', '', 93589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you like to join our cause?', 'Would you like to join our cause?', 93588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands feel very foreign to me.  Conflict, anger and hate are everywhere.', '', 93587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin.', 'I\'m ready to begin.', 93586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? This book looks... familiar.', '', 93585, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can rebuild it. This will be my final gift to you.', '', 93583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid it will be of no use to you in its current shattered state.', '', 93581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tidestone of Golganneth...', '', 93580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look alive, nightwatchers! Our prince needs us!', '', 93579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hatecoil! Seize them!', 93578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Malfurion.', 'I am ready, Malfurion.', 93577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work is nearly done.$b$bI must thank you for including me in your adventure, $n. I may have assisted you in finding the Tidestone itself, but I feel you have done so much more for me and my people.', '', 93575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen well, $n.', '', 93574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We--we don\'t know. It only just appeared.', 93571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this... corruption?', '', 93570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52743, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was in the Dream, but now he won\'t wake. We cannot stir him.', 93569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must come quickly; something\'s happened!', 93568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you agai--', '', 93567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion! Thank Elune you\'ve come!', 93566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me.', '', 93565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then you will be free to collect Aegwynn\'s other relics.', '', 93564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will direct us to the Tears of Elune.', '', 93563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall stand in the presence of the Lord of the Forest.', '', 93562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Prepare yourself, hero. We draw near to the Grove of Cenarius.', '', 93561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merely an echo, but Val\'sharah is as close to the Dream as this world can come.', '', 93560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[lose this]', '', 93559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ages ago, the first druids molded this land to be a reflection of the Emerald Dream.', '', 93558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every step in this forest brings back precious memories.', '', 93557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to me when you wish to depart. I know these forests better than any other.', '', 93556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Lorlathil, sanctuary of the druids. Though this forest has aged, its spirits still remember me.', '', 93555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are, $p. Welcome to Val\'Sharah.', '', 93554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Yes. There is a way for you to... see... some of Kilrogg\'s future... and your own.', '', 93553, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We share a problem then. Will you aid us?', 'We share a problem then. Will you aid us?', 93552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this is written in the language of the Apexis. \"... buried... evil... forbidden...\" Without the other half of this fragment this is all I can discern. We must carry on.', '', 93551, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In this cave, chieftains of the Bleeding Hollow perform a ritual to see glimpses of the future, and their own death. The other chieftains... they blindly follow Kilrogg... but not us. Grommash was worthy, Gul\'dan...\n\nWe have felt disturbances deep in Draenor. We believe Gul\'dan means to do great harm to Draenor, and our tribe will suffer greatly for it.', '', 93550, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not attack. What is this place?', 'You do not attack. What is this place?', 93549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know why you and your abomination are here.', '', 93548, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the jukebox parts?', 'Where are the jukebox parts?', 93547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You keep the garrison safe, and I\'ll supply the tunes.', '', 93546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every garrison could use a bit more bass, wouldn\'t you agree Commander?', '', 93545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shrine to Terokk! The Sethekk revere the Talon king, why would they deface their own shrine? Hmm... we must continue to investigate.', '', 93543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightmare consume you!', '', 93542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your torment will be endless!', '', 93541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send you to eternal sleep.', '', 93540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Become prey to the darkness!', '', 93539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 61461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish.', 93537, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stranger? Hopefully $ghe:she;\'s an assassin, to finally do away with that prince!', '', 93536, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d rather not say.  Last time I talked about it, another author stole my idea and made it into a disturbing romance novel.', '', 93527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any inspiration so far?', 'Any inspiration so far?', 93526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello there.  I don\'t get many visitors up here.\n\nYou may not know this, but I\'m the author of Tome of the Clear Mind.  It\'s a best seller, for sure, but I came up here for inspiration on something less technical.', '', 93525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Warlord Parjesh escaped with it through the magic portal ahead.', '', 93524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad to have your loyalty again. It\'s been a long time Thaldrys.', '', 93523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nightwatchers are yours to command once more, my prince.', '', 93522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any elf with the courage to stand up against the Queen herself is worth following.', 93521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We saw what you did.', '', 93520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you despised me.', '', 93519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, Thaldrys? Why did you and your men come to my aid?', '', 93518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great and all-powerful Highlord has called upon me. What dragon needs slaying, $ct $p?', '', 93517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to relay mission orders.', 'I need to relay mission orders.', 93516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares, squire.', 'Show me your wares, squire.', 93515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you require, oh most noble Highlord? Are there any damsels that are in a state of distress?', '', 93514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again, $n.', '', 93513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are everywhere... you cannot hide!', '', 93512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So warm, so red!', 'So warm, so red!', 93511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49771, 49771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always pumping, always pumping!', 'Always pumping, always pumping!', 93510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49772, 49772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spurts of crimson!', 'Spurts of crimson!', 93509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49773, 49773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scent of blood...so delicious!', 'The scent of blood...so delicious!', 93508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49774, 49774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More blood!', 'More blood!', 93507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49775, 49775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dripping and pouring and clotting!', 'Dripping and pouring and clotting!', 93506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49776, 49776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood blood blood BLOOD BLOOD!!', 'Blood blood blood BLOOD BLOOD!!', 93505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49770, 49770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Yes! More blood!', 'Yes! Yes! More blood!', 93504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27751, 27751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... witness the full power of Millhouse Manastorm!', 'Now... witness the full power of Millhouse Manastorm!', 93503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49767, 49767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah-ha! I\'ve got you right where I want you!', 'Ah-ha! I\'ve got you right where I want you!', 93502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49765, 49765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D\'ah! Now you\'re making me angry!', 'D\'ah! Now you\'re making me angry!', 93501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49763, 49763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You landlubbers are tougher than I thought! I\'ll have to improvise!', 'You landlubbers are tougher than I thought! I\'ll have to improvise!', 93500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49762, 49762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!', 'We\'re under attack! Avast, ye swabs! Repel the invaders!', 93499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49761, 49761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Check out that noise!', 'You there! Check out that noise!', 93498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49760, 49760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am sorry.', '', 93497, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 52787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who wrote this message? Come, let\'s continue the search.', '', 93496, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000%s|r prepares a brutal attack!', '', 93495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us proceed, $p.', '', 93494, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmmmm, you look tasty!', '', 93493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dead orc clutches an unsent letter in his hand.>$B$BDear Ma, I\'ve decided to leave da Iron Horde army.$B$BNot enough grub, and I miss your cooking.$B$BLove, Your Son.', '', 93492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our time is at an end. You must return again. But for now, leave before the Legion detects us here.', '', 93491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah Interesting... \"Come to Tanaan. Assist me, and I will return you to the skies.\"', '', 93490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 50815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and the Illidari must recover my corpse from Black Rook Hold before it is too late.', '', 93489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a powerful artifact that you carry. Powerful enough to destroy the Legion.', '', 93488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is how it looked millennia ago, before the Burning Legion started its march of destruction across the cosmos.', '', 93486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around. What do you see? Worlds enough to fill the sky.', '', 93485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planting Seeds', 'Planting Seeds', 93484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what offerings do you have for me?', 93483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Illidan.', 'I am ready, Illidan.', 93482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a great deal of information to give to you, but time is short. I will tell you what I can and you will have to find a way to return later to hear the rest.', '', 93481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scroll is addressed to Iskar. You quickly show it to Reshad.', 'The scroll is addressed to Iskar. You quickly show it to Reshad.', 93480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t make any sudden moves around Alexi, or you might lose a finger.  Or worse.', '', 93479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan\'s army awaits within the armored walls of Hellfire Citadel. What horrors lie within, we have yet to find out.$B$BOur forces here at Lion\'s Watch will hold back the demonic threat until the last of us falls.', 93478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The glyph is covered with fine writing in an unknown language. A large portion of it appears to be missing.', 'The glyph is covered with fine writing in an unknown language. A large portion of it appears to be missing.', 93477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan\'s soul is in the Twisting Nether. I must get back to him.', 'Illidan\'s soul is in the Twisting Nether. I must get back to him.', 93476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how you handle a different threat.', 'Let\'s see how you handle a different threat.', 93475, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I win again. But well played.', 'Looks like I win again. But well played.', 93474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you just unleash the hounds on me?', 'Did you just unleash the hounds on me?', 93473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
