('Long ago, the Titans used powerful tools called the Pillars of Creation to shape Azeroth. They are the key to seal the Legion\'s gateway into our world forever.', '', 93321, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Legion\'s numbers are endless. If we are ever going to put a stop to their assault, we need to stop them at the source - the Tomb of Sargeras.', '', 93320, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word has already spread of your exploits on the Broken Shore. The Ashbringer... the forces of the Legion will surely cower in your wake.', '', 93319, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('((This will be a brief cutscene. You attempt to give Tirion the Ashbringer, but he refuses.)) No... I am too crippled to continue the Ashbringer\'s legacy. The burden must fall on your shoulders, $p. From this day forward, you will wield the Ashbringer against the forces of darkness wherever you are needed, champion.', '', 93312, 0, 923, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('((This will be a brief cutscene. You attempt to give Tirion the Ashbringer, but he refuses.)) No... I am too crippled to continue the Ashbringer\'s legacy. The burden must fall on your shoulders, $p. From this day forward, you will wield the Ashbringer against the forces of darkness wherever you are needed, champion.', '', 93311, 0, 924, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer...', '', 93310, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ashbringer...', 93309, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Ashbringer...', 93308, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cffADFF2F+$1i Artifact Power|r', '|cFF0000FF+$1i Artifact Power |r', 93307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praying', '', 93306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BETA: Trigger the Invasion', 'BETA: Trigger the Invasion', 93304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect Reshad.', 'Protect Reshad.', 93303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, you must come quickly. Tirion called for you by name. I fear he does not have long for this world. Hurry!', '', 93302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-COMMANDER SARANNIS.blp:50:80|t$b[Lady Liadrin] Hero, we\'re up on the ledge behind you!', 93301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The strange gnomish robot has one eye hanging loose from its socket. A cardboard sign on its chest says, \"BETA.\" Most of its wiring is duct-taped in place. Suddenly, it speaks in a warbling voice:>$b$bGreetings adventur-er-er*click*! Inp-p-p-*clink* TEST PARAMETERS REBOOT 001011010 Greetings adventurer!', '', 93300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAHA!! Now that I have consumed the blood of my brothers, I have the power to destroy you and the God King!', '', 93297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough. Never again will that damned blade slay my brethren! YOU... WILL... DIE!', '', 93296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Balnazzar.blp:50:80|t$b[Balnazzar] Impressive... but not enough. Infernal, crush them.', '', 93295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B$B|TINTERFACE\\ENCOUNTERJOURNAL\\UI-EJ-BOSS-Balnazzar.blp:50:80|t$b[Balnazzar] You really think you can stand against me? My endless felguard will cut you down.', '', 93294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one will challenge the God King!', '', 93293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy of the trials! Hail the God King!', '', 93292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The God King commands your death!', '', 93291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The God King will have the Aegis!', '', 93290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the God King!', '', 93289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not wanted here!', '', 93288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legion has chosen its champion!', '', 93287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate', '', 93286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not right now, my friend. Not right now.', '', 93285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Next time I need to remember to have a soulstone ready.', '', 93284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too big! Too big! KILL IT!', '', 93283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are enough demons for us to kill without you summoning more.', '', 93282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares summon me?', '', 93281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your cowardice is showing, Marius. We must learn the limits of our enemy if we are to defeat them.', '', 93280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay...?', 'Okay...?', 93279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $p. Good. I am in need of someone with a calmer head than Marius here.$b$bThis location is prime for summoning a demon more powerful than any I have summoned before.$b$bI need you to ensure that this demon hunter doesn\'t do anything foolish like killing the demon before I have a chance to force it into submission.$b$bWill you stand with me?', '', 93278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL return!', '', 93273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn everything, my pets. Leave only ash.', '', 93272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light will always triumph against darkness.', '', 93271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got your back, champion!', 93270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been waiting for you, paladin. Know that I will rip the soul from your flesh and make your body my own.', '', 93269, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the Light\'s greatest champion has arrived to claim the holy Ashbringer and lay waste to my kin.', '', 93268, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will return!', '', 93267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mortals and your arrogance. You will burn in my flames!', '', 93266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... help...', '', 93265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... you can\'t... have it.', 93264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know why you are here, small one...', '', 93263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Avenge me, my children!', 93262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve been a naughty child. Time to be punished.', 93261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was once a noble elf, good dragon. I know the meaning of honor.', '', 93256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the whelplings, then. But if you deceive me, prepare to face the wrath of a dragonflight.', '', 93255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only want to help, good dragon.', '', 93254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But it seems we have little choice.', '', 93253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not trust Nightfallen...', '', 93252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take up the blade and fulfill your destiny, champion. You are... The Ashbringer.', '', 93251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me drown you in the sea.', '', 93250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Prince Oceanus!', '', 93249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush you underfoot, little fish.', '', 93248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enforcer, enact my will!', 93247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. The blade awaits.', '', 93246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are pure of heart and noble of spirit. You are the one the Ashbringer was searching for.', '', 93245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You not supposed to be here!', '', 93244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light... it really is you.', '', 93243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I...', '', 93238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'LL DRINK THE MANA FROM YOUR BROKEN BONES!!', '', 93237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warlock_FireandBrimstone:20|tYou have been targeted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180776|h[Overwhelming Flames]|h|r! Move away from your allies!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Warlock_FireandBrimstone:20|tYou have been targeted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180776|h[Overwhelming Flames]|h|r! Move away from your allies!', 93236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as my twisted soul dwells within the Ashbringer you will not take it!', '', 93235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be afraid. My venom weakens. Makes you cooperative.', '', 93234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My poison is fast to act, but slow to burn.', '', 93233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victim for the queen and her demonic friend.', '', 93232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A taste of my venom and you\'ll be mine.', '', 93231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not belong. I\'ll kill ya for the queen.', '', 93230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll enslave you with my spells.', '', 93229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look like a sailor, but you\'ll do.', '', 93228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More slaves for the queen and her new master.', '', 93227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are getting so very frail and weak.', 93226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 50591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove yourself.', '', 93225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough. If you are worthy of the Ashbringer...', '', 93224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more babblin\'. Let\'s get to fightin\'!', '', 93223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, now, Zeliek. Perhaps this is the chosen one the blade speaks of?', 93222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ashbringer can only be wielded by the pure. You waste your time!', '', 93221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You truly think yourself worthy?', '', 93220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get some!', 'Get some!', 93219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Keep \'em coming!', 'Yeah! Keep \'em coming!', 93218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat this!', 'Eat this!', 93217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They all laughed when I said I could out brew them. I told them I would make something worthy of Lady Challiane, maybe even worthy of the queen herself.', '', 93216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But, I was promised...', 93215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leaving', 'Leaving', 93214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger! Can you help me? None of these fools will believe me.', '', 93213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wine is only for Queen Azshara!', 93212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never! You and your new mistress will die by my warglaives.', 93211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you only knew the Legion\'s power. Join us, Kor\'vas.', 93210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are nothing but a coward.', 93209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Not you, too...', 93208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get up, brother. Wake up.', 93207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhh...', '', 93206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are stronger than I thought. Come.', '', 93205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention, soldiers! Commander $p passing through.', 'Attention, soldiers! Commander $p passing through.', 93204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is dead.', '', 93203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Renault! My son... by the Light... help me up!', '', 93202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to get out of here before more demons come. Quickly, the Highlord is just outside the temple.', '', 93201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, follow the Highlord\'s spirit! We will hold this ground!', 93200, 0, 32512, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> I\'m good.', '<cough> I\'m good.', 93199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on ahead, I can make it from here.', 'Go on ahead, I can make it from here.', 93198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $c. I\'ll be fine.', 'Thanks, $c. I\'ll be fine.', 93197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... I feared we might lose that one. He was so weak when I found him. Pick him up and take him to Senegos.', '', 93196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am busy, $n. Finish your business here and move on.', 93195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Rescue the Warchief\"', 'Play \"Rescue the Warchief\"', 93194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Silvermoon\"', 'Play \"Silvermoon\"', 93193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"The Zandalari\"', 'Play \"The Zandalari\"', 93192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Zul\'Gurub Voodoo\"', 'Play \"Zul\'Gurub Voodoo\"', 93191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Undercity\"', 'Play \"Undercity\"', 93190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Mulgore Plains\"', 'Play \"Mulgore Plains\"', 93189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Thunder Bluff\"', 'Play \"Thunder Bluff\"', 93188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"War March\"', 'Play \"War March\"', 93187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I was betrayed... cut down... by my own son.', '', 93186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I carved through thousands of foul scourge. No creature of darkness could stand against The Ashbringer.', '', 93185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will see if you are truly worthy. Come, and prove yourself a champion of the Light.', '', 93184, 0, 32514, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... YEEESSSSS!', '', 93183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need... more... power!', '', 93182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You rats aren\'t fit to touch the hem of my robe!', '', 93181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Have the peasants come to grovel before their prince?', '', 93180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannot be! I had it all...', '', 93179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel, lowborn scum!', '', 93178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... thirsty...', 93177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... NO! I still thirst. Give me more!', 93176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! Stay back!', '', 93175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look at me!', '', 93174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back! It\'s mine... MINE!', '', 93173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found it first!', '', 93172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make you kneel.', '', 93171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll drag you down with me!', '', 93170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will rise again.', '', 93169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night falls...', '', 93168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Orgrimmar\"', 'Play \"Orgrimmar\"', 93167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will slay those that disrupt our rituals! Prepare for death!', '', 93166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Mountains\"', 'Play \"Mountains\"', 93165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... much... blood! Death to the enemies of the Bleeding Hollow!', '', 93163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you what I\'ve learned.', '', 93162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master demands a sacrifice!', '', 93161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve a new master now!', '', 93160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been shown the path to true power!', '', 93159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sethekk will rise again!', '', 93158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The masters come!', 'The masters come!', 93157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will be pleased when I bring him your soul!', 'Gul\'dan will be pleased when I bring him your soul!', 93156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual is weakening, try harder!', 'The ritual is weakening, try harder!', 93155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the dark power flow through you. Focus it!', 'Let the dark power flow through you. Focus it!', 93154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good, soon you will be ready for the next lesson.', 'Very good, soon you will be ready for the next lesson.', 93153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My poor, poor children. We can\'t afford to lose a single one of you.', '', 93152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another Nightfallen attack? Bring my child to me, young one.', '', 93151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could fight all day. Bring it!', 'I could fight all day. Bring it!', 93150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah, I hate needles! But... that does feel nice.', 'Gah, I hate needles! But... that does feel nice.', 93149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe ya one - and Mishka, too!', 'I owe ya one - and Mishka, too!', 93148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stuff isn\'t habit-forming, right?', 'This stuff isn\'t habit-forming, right?', 93147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly what I needed!', 'Exactly what I needed!', 93146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks - my back has been killing me since the crash.', 'Thanks - my back has been killing me since the crash.', 93145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that\'s the stuff!', 'Ah, that\'s the stuff!', 93144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has reached home base! $GHe:She; is safe!', '%s has reached home base! $GHe:She; is safe!', 93141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has tagged $n, the Seeker wins!', '%s has tagged $n, the Seeker wins!', 93140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s was unable to tag any players! The Hiders win!', '%s was unable to tag any players! The Hiders win!', 93139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to count down. Find a hiding spot!', '%s begins to count down. Find a hiding spot!', 93138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready or not, here I come!', 'Ready or not, here I come!', 93137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '1...', 93136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '2...', 93135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '3...', 93134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('4...', '4...', 93133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('5...', '5...', 93132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('6...', '6...', 93131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you soon, starlight.', '', 93130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('7...', '7...', 93129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, grandfather.', 93128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('8...', '8...', 93127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('9...', '9...', 93126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course.', 93125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('10...', '10...', 93124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stellagosa. Do me one last favor. Your younger brothers and sisters need your help.', '', 93123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is your party ready to begin?', 'Is your party ready to begin?', 93122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My keepers are overrun. We will require aid.', '', 93121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to begin!', 'We\'re ready to begin!', 93120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Highlord Tirion sent me to find you. He needs to see you right away!', 93119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the Light I found you! Please wait a moment, champion!', 93118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After you, $n. Your presence is of the utmost importance.', 93117, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you, $n. Your presence is of the utmost importance.', '', 93116, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My grandfather is the last among us that clings to any magical power. Do you really want him to expend it all on this Tidestone?', 93115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I overestimated my strength. All of the dragons - even the Aspects themselves - have been greatly weakened since the fall of Deathwing.', 93114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras sends forces against you!', 'Sargeras sends forces against you!', 93113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kirin Tor is here to help! When I\'m fully-implemented, I\'ll help you close a rift and give you something good if I survive!', 'The Kirin Tor is here to help! When I\'m fully-implemented, I\'ll help you close a rift and give you something good if I survive!', 93112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna get nasty.', '', 93111, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need my help with anything today, commander?', '', 93110, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you found any more artifacts, commander?', '', 93109, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing surprises me, commander. I\'m a scientist.', '', 93108, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call THIS archaeology?', '', 93107, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this one to me!', '', 93106, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks dangerous. You go first!', '', 93105, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate snakes, kid. I hate\'em!', '', 93104, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He chose... poorly.', '', 93103, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortune and... glory...', '', 93102, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya around... kid...', '', 93101, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too good to be... true.', '', 93100, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortunately I kept some of these handy. It had to be snakes!', '', 93099, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highlord Tirion sent me to find you. He needs to see you right away!', '', 93098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light I found you! Please wait a moment, champion!', '', 93097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll give ya a tip, kid. \"X\" never, ever marks the spot.', '', 93096, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m making this up as I go!', '', 93095, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m like a bad penny. I always turn up.', '', 93094, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortune and glory, kid. Fortune and Glory.', '', 93093, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you injured?', 93092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... awakened!', '', 93091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$B***** RULES OF THE GAME *****\n$B$GHe:She; who starts the game will be the|cFF990000 Seeker|r and gain the ability to|cFF2959D3 Tag|r party members. All other party members will gain the ability to|cFF2959D3 Hide|r.\n$BThe |cFF990000 Seeker|r has 60 seconds from the time the game begins to find and|cFF2959D3 Tag|r a party member.\n$BHidden party members will be revealed if they move OR if the|cFF990000 Seeker|r draws near. Players who can reach home base without being|cFF2959D3 Tagged|r win!', '', 93090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let us discuss where our efforts are best focused.', '', 93089, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can direct them almost anywhere on Azeroth we need to go. It is with these that we will gather the resources we need to defeat the Legion.', '', 93088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the portrait room. Each picture works as a portal.', '', 93087, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sarim!', '', 93086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, $n. I read all about this place when I was studying to join the Kirin Tor. I\'ll show you around.', '', 93084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aha! There we are.', '', 93083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ish valah, wynn talos...', '', 93082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on for just a moment while I unlock the seal.', '', 93080, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mind must be strong, like ogre! If you weak then you die. Our path be that simple.', '', 93075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your focus and bend the chaos to your will.', '', 93074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, you\'re getting better! Soon you will be ready to summon your first imp!', '', 93073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 396, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
