('Reigniting', 'Reigniting', 93064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Theramore Tabard.', 'I\'ve lost my Theramore Tabard.', 93063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Mountains of Thunder\"', 'Play \"Mountains of Thunder\"', 93062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play Default Garrison Music', 'Play Default Garrison Music', 93061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost track of Garona.', 'I lost track of Garona.', 93060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one beat Gutrek... no one...', '', 93059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda... brought more... rockets...', '', 93058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll blast you to pieces!', '', 93057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to the nether...', '', 93056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void will claim you!', '', 93055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The crystal... is mine...', 93054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowmoon will break you!', 93053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death cannot take... its master...', '', 93052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be made to serve!', '', 93051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Azshara!', '', 93050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We remember the queen.', '', 93049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is not for you.', '', 93048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should not be here.', '', 93047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Begone from this place. Our works are not for the lowly likes of you.', 93046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wine is only for the queen.', 93045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are unworthy of our craft!', 93044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lookin\' to learn something?', 93043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s try this again. For Garona!', 'Let\'s try this again. For Garona!', 93042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will do whatever it takes to stop Gul\'dan. Wherever you lead, I will follow... commander!', 93041, 0, 0, 66, 68, 0, 0, 49639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe everything to you! To both of you!', 93040, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan... he\'s not in my head anymore...', 93039, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 0, 49627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s gasps in pain.', 93038, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 49626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haven\'t you given up already, mage?', 93037, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me that orb, Khadgar. I will destroy that hideous thing.', 93036, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not like this.', 93035, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are using the tools of our enemy!', 93034, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage. That is dark magic you\'re working with.', 93033, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 49594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me, Garona. Together we will plan for Gul\'dan\'s downfall.', '', 93032, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 49605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaken, Garona. You are free at last.', '', 93031, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 49604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, destroy that thing!', '', 93030, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 49603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Om na ka om, Fel na om kal...', '', 93029, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not \'til my dying breath. I will end your torment, Garona.', '', 93028, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 49601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re using the tools of our enemy against them.', '', 93027, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 49600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. This is exactly what I need to undo Gul\'dan\'s hold on Garona.', '', 93026, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 49599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will soon be free, drake.', 93025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather what you need and meet me outside the entrance.', '', 93024, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stand in one of the great wonders of the world.$b$bOur wine is made of the finest fruits, and our oils the finest of olives.$b$bI dare anyone to claim they have better.', 93023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A warden working for the Legion? I look forward to killing her.', 93021, 0, 32381, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, let\'s get out of here before we\'re overrun.', 93020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me up at the overlook. We will finish this business together.', 93019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have to find Stellagosa and Cyana Nightglaive.', 93018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cyana. Do not give in!', 93017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am more powerful than all of you!', 93016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are no demon. Friend or foe?', 93015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You WILL talk, foul demon!', 93014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s he talking about? Meet me outside the gem.', 93013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot allow them to regain their momentum or the Broken Isles are lost.', 93012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Yes, my mistress...', 93011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Felsworn Nightglaive, prove yourself. I have other matters to attend to.', 93010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve dealt them a telling blow. But even now, the Legion is summoning in more powerful demons.', 93009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve been expecting you, $p. How is Khadgar?', 93008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel the fel energy course through...', 93007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to free that pitiful drake, demon hunter?', '', 93006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'LL KILL YOU! I\'LL RIP OUT YOUR HEART!', '', 93005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... what is that you\'re holding?', '', 93004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did Cyana Nightglaive go? I need to find her!', 93003, 0, 32381, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a kind small thing, $n.', '', 93002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These four whelplings need to be treated with ley crystals immediately.', '', 93001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Nightfallen have assaulted the whelplands.', '', 93000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgent message for Senegos!', '', 92999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The great dragon acknowledges you with a smile.>', '', 92998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you are beginning to ANGER ME!!', '', 92997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very painful to be hit with.', '', 92996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you friend. It means that an ancient secret has been revealed to the worst person possible.$b$bI will need to summon the rest of my order to defend it.$b$bYou lead the army that opposes Gul\'dan? You are welcome here and we will assist where we can. We are few, but are well respected by the elemental forces of Draenor.$b$bWe will speak of this secret later. Go in peace.', '', 92995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are Lagar? I bring word from a shaman of your order. He says... Gul\'dan knows. May I ask what this means?', 'You are Lagar? I bring word from a shaman of your order. He says... Gul\'dan knows. May I ask what this means?', 92994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, is there something I can help you with?', '', 92993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your warrior tried to save me but my captors caught up with us. I am sorry for your friend.$b$bUp on the mountain a powerful demon was slain by Grommash. It was left alone for some time but the Iron Horde has a new master... one with renewed interest. Minions of Gul\'dan summon demons and keep the fel corrupted waters flowing.$b$b It is extremely dangerous up there, you should not go alone.', '', 92992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 92991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was this your friend? He died well... saved me...', '', 92990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears Gul\'dan is calling in all Iron Horde from across Draenor. They come in from the harbor on ships... then they go east... to the pits.$b$bThere they are... converted... into fel orcs. It is horrible. We must destroy this place at once!', '', 92989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me what occurs at Ironhold Harbor.', 'Tell me what occurs at Ironhold Harbor.', 92988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander! I have news! I can tell you about Ironhold Harbor, the Fel Forge, and the Throne of Kil\'jaeden.', '', 92987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... I can use your soul for the next lesson!', 'Ah... I can use your soul for the next lesson!', 92986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt my instruction!', 'How dare you interrupt my instruction!', 92985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now it be time to demonstrate what we learned!', 'Now it be time to demonstrate what we learned!', 92984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be Aktar. De followers of Sethe an\' the Shadow Council be gatherin\' in tha ruins near here and he be keepin\' a eye on em. Also mo\' a da flyin\' arakkoa are here causing trouble. Der be a lot of bird poop to clean up here.$b$bAlso if ya need to head east, dere\'s a big tunnel to the southeast, take ya right to Ironhold Harbor. Might be dangerous though.', '', 92983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are the arakkoa doing here? And who is this?', 'What are the arakkoa doing here? And who is this?', 92982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey commandah. De arakkoa are here in Aktar\'s Watch. Also I checked out that big tunnel to de southeast there.', '', 92981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stellagosa, no... come back. Damn!', 92980, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 57398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve slaughtered the civilians there some time ago. I couldn\'t get too close but they are corrupting the wildlife with fel energy and summoning demons.$b$bThis fallen village should be razed to the ground, commander.', '', 92979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sargerei? What\'s going on up there?', 'The Sargerei? What\'s going on up there?', 92978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander beware! The Sargerei are here!', '', 92977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! So these Bleeding Hollow guys are almost as dangerous as Laughing Skull, but they spend too much time looking at the skies. They have tons of traps and hunt like raptors in the jungle. Deeper in their town they are doing weird things with blood and magic.$b$bI think sending a magnaron through the center of this village would do it a lot of good!', '', 92976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh okay... so what do you have for me Scout Cutter?', 'Uh okay... so what do you have for me Scout Cutter?', 92975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaz said I could help! This place is so cool!$b$bI can tell you about Zeth\'Gol to the northwest, the Temple of Sha\'naar to the south, and the Zorammarsh to the southeast.', '', 92974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eating', 'Eating', 92973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the situation?', 'What\'s the situation?', 92972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(';p;', '', 92971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We began our siege the moment you took the boats. We fought cautiously until a large contingent of Iron Horde left, probably to face you. That is when we truly struck!$b$bYour Gazlowe fashioned a terrible device to destroy the gates and we charged through... only to be met with this new foe... the fel orcs. They have managed to stop our advance and keep us here. I hope you are having better luck in the east.', '', 92970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These new fel orcs fight hard. This will not be over soon...', '', 92969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
