('Play \"Ironforge\"', 'Play \"Ironforge\"', 92952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch yourself, champion. The Shadow Council will prey on your doubts and weaknesses.', 92951, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 49598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Iron Front.', 'Take me to the Iron Front.', 92950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw the corpse to the felhounds, hah hah hah!', '', 92949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not leave this cave alive!', '', 92948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All must serve or DIE.', '', 92947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give yourselves to the shadow. None can resist the master.', '', 92946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graaah, and who do YOU think you are?', '', 92945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 49619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_purple:20|t%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:180148|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_purple:20|t%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:180148|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', 92944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will be consumed in my flames!', '', 92943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightglaive went southwest with a warden named Cordana Felsong.', '', 92942, 0, 32381, 0, 64, 0, 52709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cyana Nightglaive turned traitor. She joined the Legion.', '', 92941, 0, 32380, 0, 64, 0, 52708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A warden tried to convince us to turn traitor. I heard screaming.', '', 92940, 0, 32379, 0, 64, 0, 52712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons promised us unimaginable power.', '', 92939, 0, 32378, 0, 64, 0, 51887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t give in.', '', 92938, 0, 32376, 0, 64, 0, 52711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They did... things... to me.', '', 92937, 0, 32377, 0, 64, 0, 52710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drawing Power', 'Drawing Power', 92936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s your share of the winnings, champ!', '', 92935, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I take back what I said about cannons. We\'ll have to fight our way through.', 92934, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What foul magic was that warlock cooking up? I think I preferred fighting Iron Horde cannons!', 92933, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Bleeding Hollow are running rampant out here. Where is their leadership?', 92932, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How strange that Gul\'dan\'s Horde has all but abandoned this area. I was expecting more of a fight.', 92931, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll have to hold on a minute, pal. I can\'t start the next fight until this one\'s finished.$B$BI may be a profiteering heartless fight promoter leading countless innocents to their untimely deaths, but I have a conscience for coin\'s sake.', '', 92930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fight the champion.', 'I\'d like to fight the champion.', 92929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fight Dreshax.', 'I\'d like to fight Dreshax.', 92928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fight Rotvine.', 'I\'d like to fight Rotvine.', 92927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fight Fracktus.', 'I\'d like to fight Fracktus.', 92926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to fight Skull Chewer.', 'I\'d like to fight Skull Chewer.', 92925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a great find, commander!', 'This is a great find, commander!', 92924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These will help immensely, commander.', 'These will help immensely, commander.', 92923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just give me a moment...', 92922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m still unfamiliar with such strategy, such numbers. We must do our best to minimize casualties, our soldiers deserve better.', 92921, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I prefer to go around such problems, and I think you do too, commander.', 92920, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand the need to defeat this foe, but my heart breaks for the lives it will take from us.', '', 92919, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to put an end to this commander, no matter the cost.', '', 92918, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll be quite tha siege, commander!', '', 92917, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hate you... hate you all...', 92916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is Iron Horde property! You will pay for trying to take it!', 92915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... makes... no difference...', 92914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looters are not welcome here! This belongs to the Iron Horde!', 92913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, the Burning Legion is sending the most powerful demons in its arsenal against us. They do not intend to lose this third war and they will stop at nothing to see to it that we are all wiped from the face of Azeroth.\n\nWe will return the favor.', 92912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have this outta here in a jiffy, boss!', 'I\'ll have this outta here in a jiffy, boss!', 92911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They just leave this stuff laying around? Sweet!', 'They just leave this stuff laying around? Sweet!', 92910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s anyone that can crack this nut, its you, commander.', '', 92909, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those walls boss... and those orcs in the way... woo boy!', '', 92908, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I long to spill the blood of our foes, but I can be patient when I need to.', 92907, 0, 0, 595, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find a way to break into Tanaan again!', '', 92906, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_blacksmithdye_black.blp:20|t %s dropped |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180147|h[Felfire Munitions]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_blacksmithdye_black.blp:20|t %s dropped |cFFFF0000|Hspell:180147|h[Felfire Munitions]|h|r.', 92905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot thank you enough for what you and Khadgar have done for me. I am yours to command.', 92904, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None can oppose us! Not Gul\'dan, not the Shadow Council, not even the Legion itself.', 92903, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give me a target, commander. I am ready for anything.', 92902, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s next...?', 92901, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am all yours, commander.', 92900, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any last words?', 92899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come to the wrong house, puppet.', 92898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave this one to me.', 92897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The hunt begins!', 92896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re finished.', 92895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love the hunt!', 92894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swift and silent...', 92893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another one down.', 92892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not like this...', 92891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This hunger is consuming my very mind. It is taking every ounce of my energy to just... just...', '', 92890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, good dragon. Ahh, look! We are here.', '', 92889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this one ever stop talking?', '', 92888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... why are you here in Azsuna, friend? Just visiting, or...?', '', 92887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh! Mana crystal. Just a moment.', '', 92886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bunch of mana addicts, that lot, ha hah! Not me, though. My discipline is iron.', '', 92885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...to kill them, of course, for harming your dragon.', '', 92884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good! Off to Zarkhenar, then. Off to see all my friends and family and loved ones.', '', 92883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand, good dragon. My people have earned your distrust. Allow me to make amends.', '', 92882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightfallen. I do not trust you and your kind.', '', 92881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am called Runas, son of Indarril, formerly of Suramar. Pleased to make your acquaintance.', '', 92880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is this?', '', 92879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can not see you anymore.', '', 92878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite an impressive weapon, my friend!', '', 92877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think... perhaps it is time to say goodbye, then.', '', 92876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, look! Mana crystal! Just a taste.', '', 92875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch. I shall prove it to you. I am not just some mana-addled FREAK, like the rest of those wretches.', '', 92874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my friend, for letting my last few hours mean something.', '', 92873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go on, my friend. I will stay here.', '', 92872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you can see beyond my tattered robes and desperate behavior. I am not a monster.', '', 92871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feeding on such raw energy... it clouds my judgment.', '', 92870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I surrender. Please, my friend, forgive me. I am truly, truly sorry.', '', 92869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you know who I am?', '', 92868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in blazes are you doing?', '', 92867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
