('', 'We on our way!', 92863, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This be a prime spot. We can see for miles. Plant your banner, commander.', 92862, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, commander!', 92861, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan has only grown in power since our last encounter. He must still have contact with the Burning Legion. Stopping him is more important than ever.', '', 92860, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He doesn\'t have a choice.', '', 92859, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Warlock. Show us what you\'ve got.', '', 92858, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 49614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief does not want to see you.', '', 92857, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 49613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just... just lead the way, Runas.', 'Just... just lead the way, Runas.', 92856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, my friend. My good, dependable friend $n.$b$bYou wouldn\'t happen to have any mana crystals on you, would you?$b$bListen, my friend. If you ever need anything - I stress, ANYTHING - you just come talk to your loyal friend Runas. I will make your problems go away. You can count on me.$b$bOf course, if I needed something, I assume you would assist me, correct? For example, if I needed a mana crystal or something similar, you would give me one?', '', 92855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Entering', 'Entering', 92854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After you, $n. Your presence is of the utmost importance.', 92853, 0, 32450, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion thinks we are finished. We will show them how wrong they are.', '', 92852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, these cannons are WORTHLESS! Face our latest creation, the Fel Orc!', '', 92851, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[[Spectacular Cinematic of Gul\'dan Being a BOSS!]]', '[[Spectacular Cinematic of Gul\'dan Being a BOSS!]]', 92850, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will leave on your command, friend.', '', 92849, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting. The Bleeding Hollow clan are showing signs of insubordination. Perhaps the Iron Horde is falling apart?', 92848, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 49638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grommash ordered a full retreat behind the walls of Tanaan.', 92847, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 49637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jackpot! Iron Horde plans and papers...', 92846, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 49636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan\'s thugs are up to something. I do not know what they are planning so near the Dark Portal, but they are in the way.', 92845, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re ready when you are, Highlord.', 92844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hiding', 'Hiding', 92843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bah! We can do better.', 92842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 49631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grrr! We were almost through.', 92841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 49630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was THAT?', 92840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 49629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bleeding Hollow scavengers. We should crush them before they threaten our supply lines.', 92839, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 50342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Discipline is lax. Your campaign against the Iron Horde is wearing them down.', 92838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 49632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teleport you out of there if you get into trouble.', '', 92837, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 49608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close to Garona, and stay out of sight!', '', 92836, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are afflicted with |TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ChillTouch.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:179977|h[Touch of Doom]|h|r!', 'You are afflicted with |TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ChillTouch.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:179977|h[Touch of Doom]|h|r!', 92835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Higher morale scores will greatly increase your progress when the Arakkoa Outcast is led to safety.', 'Higher morale scores will greatly increase your progress when the Arakkoa Outcast is led to safety.', 92834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If a freed Arakkoa Outcast expires before being led to safety its morale will be lost.', 'If a freed Arakkoa Outcast expires before being led to safety its morale will be lost.', 92833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kills made with freed Arakkoa Outcasts in tow will increase their morale. Morale is added to your progress when you guide the freed Arakkoa Outcasts to safety.', 'Kills made with freed Arakkoa Outcasts in tow will increase their morale. Morale is added to your progress when you guide the freed Arakkoa Outcasts to safety.', 92832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guide freed Outcasts to the safety of the Darkscryers. Their morale will be added to your progress.', 'Guide freed Outcasts to the safety of the Darkscryers. Their morale will be added to your progress.', 92831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free the outcasts from their shackles, the Labormasters will definitely have keys.', 'Free the outcasts from their shackles, the Labormasters will definitely have keys.', 92830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you outside and prepare our mounts. I formed the Order of the Silver Hand to defeat the Burning Legion - this will be its first charge.((Tirion walks outside))', '', 92829, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewing Elixir', 'Brewing Elixir', 92828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaboom!', '', 92827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. NO! I will tolerate no more setbacks!', '', 92826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. I will meet you at the Highlord. ((Gryan runs outside))', '', 92825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let us make haste.', 'Then let us make haste.', 92824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave when you are, $n.', '', 92823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] I NEED TEXT', '[PH] I NEED TEXT', 92822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm, not bad. Take your prize from my coffer. You live... for now.', '', 92821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT YOU CALL ME?!', '', 92820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the exhibition match BEGIN!', '', 92819, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come one, come all, and witness history in the making! Today we have an exhibition match in the the bloodiest place in Draenor, the Ring of Blood! We have a real treat for you today. $n and their friends will take on Mogor\'s newest, exclusive find. Ousted from Highmaul, completely blind but with a special sense for magic, it\'s the one and only Nullifier Darkoor!', '', 92818, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek the seeker.', 'I seek the seeker.', 92817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what contracts are available.', 'Show me what contracts are available.', 92816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care, $C, lest it be your skull that is taken.', '', 92815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, I will bring you to him.', '', 92814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, this one wishes to find the Skulltaker?', '', 92813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gu\'rakh very close! Take all the skulls!', '', 92808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not stray, friend. The ground-walkers will lead the way.', '', 92807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend brings more skulls to pick clean?', '', 92806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrong way, two-leg! Turn around!', '', 92805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow us. We show!', '', 92804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend want Gu\'rakh. Can take you to high place.', '', 92803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have skulls? Gu\'rakh can carry all skulls!', '', 92802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid the darkness, friend. Your mind-sight is fragile.', '', 92801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you take me to Skulltaker?', 'Can you take me to Skulltaker?', 92800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<As you approach the ravager, a high-pitched, chittering voice echoes in your mind.>\n\nYou drink the seeing juice, and now you speak! You must be friend of the skull-head. \n\nYou here to take skulls too?', '', 92799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Before you stands... not Senegos himself, but a magical projection of him. He appears strong, confident, and cheerful. This is not the decaying dragon you saw languishing in a pool.>', '', 92798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get back to Azurewing Repose!', 'Let\'s get back to Azurewing Repose!', 92797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should return to grandfather.', '', 92796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be so eager to mourn, starlight. Give me this one last adventure.', '', 92795, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest now, grandfather! You must save your energy.', 92794, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 52869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place your hand upon Senegos\' horn.>', '<Place your hand upon Senegos\' horn.>', 92793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive my granddaughters. They think they need to protect me from every $r $c that stumbles through my pools.$b$bGo on, then.', '', 92792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the youthful one approach. I am not as dead as I look.', '', 92791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa now! I nearly didn\'t get you out in time.', '', 92790, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 49611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close. You should be more careful.', '', 92789, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re safe. I\'ve got you.', '', 92788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 49609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way!', '', 92787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am with you, $n. ((Liadrin runs outside))', 92786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, it is time. We leave immediately.', 'Yes, it is time. We leave immediately.', 92785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tirion said you would come. Is it time?', 92784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alarms sound! You\'ve been caught!', '', 92783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is sounding the alarm!', '%s is sounding the alarm!', 92782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Compassion? It has been so long since I have known that. I will remember this, $r.', '', 92781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a fortified high-security bastion. Only a fool would go into there without an army.$b$bI mean... good luck, Champion.$b$b<Khadgar gives you a comforting pat on the shoulder.>', '', 92780, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You blue-scaled lizard-breaths slew many of my friends in Northrend!', '', 92779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make your kind PAY for what you did in Northrend!', '', 92778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I must be allowed to end these creatures! I will have my revenge!', '', 92777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test line!', 'Test line!', 92776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish him.', 'Finish him.', 92775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let him live.', 'Let him live.', 92774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I remember you. From Northrend. You helped me interrogate the foul minions of these blue scaled beasts.$b$bUnder Malygos\' command, they killed my friends, my family, and my wife, simply because they disagreed with our use of magic.$b$bDo what you must with me, but know that I will never stop hunting them until they share the pain I feel.', '', 92773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under Malygos\' command, these blue scaled beasts killed my friends, my family, and my wife.$b$bDo what you must with me, but know that I will never stop hunting them until they share the pain I feel.', '', 92772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest in peace, brother... we will never forget the events of the Broken Shore.', '', 92771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After you, $n. Your presence is of the utmost importance.', '', 92770, 0, 32449, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light watches over us all, friend.', '', 92769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderlord sage didn\'t make it very far through Magnarok. Hopefully he still possesses some useful information...', '', 92768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde cowers behind their walls.', '', 92767, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, what do you suggest?', '', 92766, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde has regrouped behind fortified walls.', 92765, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But heavy equipment remains. Enough to commandeer a ship!', 92764, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The orcs left behind some siege equipment here, at the Iron Siegeworks.', 92763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rangari report that very little equipment remains for us to steal.', 92762, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maraad would\'ve argued for a direct assault on the gates. But how could we hope to succeed?', 92761, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take care of this, commander.', 'I\'ll take care of this, commander.', 92760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are like the wind!', 'You are like the wind!', 92759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Real Big Race will reopen any second! Good luck!', 92758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The Real Big Race will reopen in 1 minute!', 92757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This Real Big Race will reopen every 15 minutes. Be ready!', 92756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place offering of raw clefthoof meat.', 'Place offering of raw clefthoof meat.', 92755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This appears to be the altar the ogres use to place offerings for the ancient rylaks. The bones of previous meals lay scattered about.\n\nIf you can find a proper offering, perhaps you could lure one of the rylaks down. \n\nThe bones may provide some clue as to what they would eat...', '', 92754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Genius, commander! We\'ll sail around Tanaan and hit the Iron Horde from the sea where they least expect it.', '', 92753, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shipyard. We could use the abandoned equipment there.', '', 92752, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, but no shipbuilding materials. I think the commander is looking for a naval strategy.', '', 92751, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters are mined, and there are more soldiers than supplies there.', '', 92750, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you have another plan, Commander. A feint perhaps?', '', 92749, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many would die in a direct assault.', '', 92748, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, what do you suggest?', '', 92747, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True wisdom can only be reached when we focus as one.\n\nIt is then that the path will be opened.', '', 92746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that you\'re ready to race! Well step right up and we\'ll get you started.', 92745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright boys, this dock isn\'t going to clear itself! Get to work!', '', 92744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an uprising!', '', 92743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prisoners are breaking free!', '', 92742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have no game tokens. Get at least one and then come back to me.', 92741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin the invasion.', 'Let us begin the invasion.', 92740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will lead the diversion on the western gates and draw the Iron Horde forces to me. This will give you and Draka enough time to establish a base of operations on their flank.', '', 92739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1', '', 92738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2', '', 92737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3', '', 92736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bomb has been planted. Stand clear!', '', 92735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sheds the net in which it was entangled!', '%s sheds the net in which it was entangled!', 92733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare stand against us?', '', 92732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will sharpen my trident.', '', 92731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Nazjatar!', '', 92730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to drown?', 92729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Azshara\'s wrath will drown you.', 92728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will claim the Tidestone and there is nothing you can do to stop us!', 92727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Queen!', 92726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have some nerve showing your face around here.', 92721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the |cFFE86B17|Hspell:179576|h[Net]|h|r to stop Tremor\'s submerge!', 'Use the |cFFE86B17|Hspell:179576|h[Net]|h|r to stop Tremor\'s submerge!', 92720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Docks... yes, your earlier assault put it out of commission.', '', 92719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a harbor there. Could we commandeer any boats?', '', 92718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde cowers behind their walls.', '', 92717, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The iron siegeworks. We could steal some of their cannons.', '', 92716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to the garrison.', 'Take me back to the garrison.', 92715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rukhmar\'s gifts belong to the Arakkoa!', '', 92714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity that you arrived too late. Now you must be punished for your insolence!', '', 92713, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, the surface-dweller seeks to fly upon the golden wings of Rukhmar?', '', 92712, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep that trident up you lazy sea snakes.', '', 92711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
