('These sickly looking creatures are more... pliable than the others. They give themselves over to our brothers.', '', 92364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These little ones are most curious, always so eager to explore, experiment, and learn. Much like us.', '', 92363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t explain why; but we feel great unease around these feathered ones and their cave.', '', 92362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These big ones are strange. Big and slow yes; but with the potential for great intellect just slipping away.', '', 92361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My queen.', '', 92360, 0, 0, 397, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your goods!', 'Show me your goods!', 92359, 0, 62, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tidestone calls to them...', 'The Tidestone calls to them...', 92358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Khadgar? $C? An unexpected surprise.', '', 92347, 0, 33556, 0, 64, 0, 52717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This does not look good. He is not well.', '', 92346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come friend, let us walk in together and greet this Senegos.', '', 92345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 51876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Already, the Burning Legion spreads like a wildfire across the Broken Isles.\n\nWe must hunt them down and destroy them wherever they pop up.\n\nYou must see to it that the Tomb of Sargeras is resealed.', '', 92344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c.\n\nThe Burning Legion have taken Faronaar. I have a plan to contain and crush them before they overrun all of Azsuna.\n\nWe could use your assistance in doing so.', '', 92343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the meaning of this?', '', 92342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you going?', '', 92341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you? You\'re no slave!', '', 92340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get the key. Let\'s get over there and free that drake.', 92339, 0, 32396, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, $p, we have to find the key to those demonic locks. I\'d bet anything it\'s on that big jailer to the east.', 92337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize:20|tRight-click on corpses to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:174133|h[Consume]|h|r them after you\'ve looted them.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize:20|tRight-click on corpses to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:174133|h[Consume]|h|r them after you\'ve looted them.', 92336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Amorphic Cognitor tightens its grip on your head once again, its voice booms through your mind.', 'The Amorphic Cognitor tightens its grip on your head once again, its voice booms through your mind.', 92335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a sweet taste of our future evolution. We must have more.', '', 92334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We sense the deaths of some of our brothers. This is good, they were clearly unfit to evolve.', '', 92333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, $p, break the next soul gem.', 92252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidari, what happened here?', 92248, 0, 32376, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our combined will is stronger than your scythe. I will not tell you.', '', 92247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful demon I have kept trapped in the gems is helping them to resist.', 92246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, you must enter the soul gem and force Arev\'naal to reveal Lord Illidan\'s location.', 92245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I understand why this is not working.', 92244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have all been tortured.', 92243, 0, 32377, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will work together to destroy the Legion from within.', 92242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 56344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did anyone give in?', 92241, 0, 32380, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who did this to you?', 92240, 0, 32379, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What did they do? What did the demons offer you?', 92239, 0, 32378, 0, 64, 0, 0, 57183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Allari. Let\'s begin.', 'I\'m ready, Allari. Let\'s begin.', 92238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is the Legion keeping Illidan\'s body? Tell me or your suffering will be the stuff of legend.', 92237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooka, may I please have some of your delicious Fighter Chow? I hear it\'s the best.', 'Ooka, may I please have some of your delicious Fighter Chow? I hear it\'s the best.', 92236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for us to put aside our petty differences. The united force of Dalaran will crush the Burning Legion!', '', 92235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the Battle at the Broken Shore, it was only fitting that I step down so that Khadgar could lead the Kirin Tor.', 92234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll learn nothing from me, Souleater!', '', 92233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strange parasite detaches from your head and disappears into the distance.', 'The strange parasite detaches from your head and disappears into the distance.', 92232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot leave our home, $r. We will continue our life cycle without you.', '', 92231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together, we will release the demon souls from the gems and use the scythe to compel them to talk.\n\nLet me know when you are ready to begin.', 92230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the Amorphic Cognitor evolves, you feel yourself pulled off the ground. You are evolving with it!', 'As the Amorphic Cognitor evolves, you feel yourself pulled off the ground. You are evolving with it!', 92229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Amorphic Cognitor tightens its grip on your head, it is getting stronger.', 'The Amorphic Cognitor tightens its grip on your head, it is getting stronger.', 92228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Amorphic Cognitor undulates with excitement, it is clearly pleased with your actions.', 'The Amorphic Cognitor undulates with excitement, it is clearly pleased with your actions.', 92227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strange parasite attaches itself to your head, you feel an intrusion in your thoughts.', 'A strange parasite attaches itself to your head, you feel an intrusion in your thoughts.', 92226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our powers are ready, we EVOLVE!', '', 92225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are learning! We can see the next phase of our life cycle.', '', 92224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power grows...', '', 92223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating, we will have to remember this.', '', 92222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? We must know more. Move closer!', '', 92221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We hunger... kill more of them! Let us consume their corpses!', '', 92220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us feed... slay them all!', '', 92219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such interesting thoughts! Show us more, $r. Kill the others here! Let us feed on our enemies, exploit their machines and discover the wonders that our home hides!', '', 92218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there. Stop!', '', 92217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall have it arranged, Cenarius.', '', 92216, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Prince Farondis, you can secure the Tidestone of Golganneth?', '', 92215, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, Queen Azshara colludes with demons. She puts our world at risk.', 92214, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'We are fighting the greatest danger our world has ever seen!', 92213, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. We are firing a cannon at sparrows.', '', 92212, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fah! We need simply to do away with Queen Azshara herself, not the very source of our people\'s power.', '', 92211, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That, my friend, is precisely the plan.', '', 92210, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cenarius. I can wield the Tidestone, but I must warn you: we risk destroying the entire Well of Eternity!', '', 92209, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We plotted to use the Tidestone of Golganneth against the queen.', '', 92208, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was during the pinnacle of Queen Azshara\'s power over the elves. Her abuse of magic had grown dangerously strong.', '', 92207, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand years ago, I found myself mixed up with a rebel alliance of sorts.', '', 92206, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 49588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 92205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?', '', 92204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good idea, let\'s kill it.', '', 92203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say we kill it.', '', 92202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Torture? Hard labor? Kill it?', '', 92201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What should we do with this one?', '', 92200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was visiting a different girl.', '', 92199, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 92198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? No, of course not!', '', 92197, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aldryth. You weren\'t out consorting with that servant girl, were you?', 92196, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Going for a walk.\" Hah! He\'s probably out visiting that little common girl he fancies so much.', '', 92195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw my chance. I would attack the naga leaders and save you from captivity.', '', 92193, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 52782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our humble place of business, traveler.', '', 92192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somehow, the Burning Legion is nullifying my demon wards. If we don\'t get those defenses back in working order, we\'ll be overrun and I will have failed all of us.', '', 92190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your boar looks weary but healthy, leave it with us for tonight and we will take care of it.', 'Your boar looks weary but healthy, leave it with us for tonight and we will take care of it.', 92184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clefthoof will need a good brushing and some water, check back tomorrow for more training.', 'The clefthoof will need a good brushing and some water, check back tomorrow for more training.', 92183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elekk is nearly asleep after today\'s training, we will let it rest for the night.', 'The elekk is nearly asleep after today\'s training, we will let it rest for the night.', 92182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The riverbeasts are not so used to land combat, we will need to let this one retire for tonight.', 'The riverbeasts are not so used to land combat, we will need to let this one retire for tonight.', 92181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The talbuk training appears to be going well, it should rest for the night.', 'The talbuk training appears to be going well, it should rest for the night.', 92180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wolf is a fiery predator, but will require a day\'s rest before it can be trained further.', 'The wolf is a fiery predator, but will require a day\'s rest before it can be trained further.', 92179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wolf\'s a fiesty one, but he\'s all curled up and asleep after today\'s training, come back tomorrow for more.', 'That wolf\'s a fiesty one, but he\'s all curled up and asleep after today\'s training, come back tomorrow for more.', 92178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elekk\'s already almost asleep, we\'ll let it rest up a bit before more training.', 'The elekk\'s already almost asleep, we\'ll let it rest up a bit before more training.', 92177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye fought well today, we\'ll let the riverbeast bed down for the night.', 'Ye fought well today, we\'ll let the riverbeast bed down for the night.', 92176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your boar looks like he could use a good brushing and feeding, check back tomorrow.', 'Your boar looks like he could use a good brushing and feeding, check back tomorrow.', 92175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re tough, for sure, but your clefthoof will still need to rest for a while.', 'They\'re tough, for sure, but your clefthoof will still need to rest for a while.', 92174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great job on the training, let\'s let your talbuk rest for the night.', 'Great job on the training, let\'s let your talbuk rest for the night.', 92173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accompany Prophet Velen to Lunarfall.', '', 92172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Escort Prophet Velen to Lunarfall.', 'Escort Prophet Velen to Lunarfall.', 92171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hurry to Lunarfall.', '', 92170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accompany Prophet Velen to Lunarfall.', '', 92169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must all be taught a lesson.', 92164, 0, 0, 474, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, Kor\'vas, and Cyana attack the Legion from within. Then, we will wipe them out together.', '', 92163, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 51888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I await your orders, $g sir:ma\'am;.', '', 92162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger, quickly. Over here.', '', 92161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s beckons the sailor forward.', '', 92160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think of us as smugglers. Instead, refer to us as professional salvors.\n\nWe are salvage experts. We specialize in flotsam, jetsam, lagan, derelicts, and, of course, exotic archaeological recovery.\n\nOh, and by the way, you might want to steer clear of the temple area to the south. I have my men investigating some salvage opportunities and I wouldn\'t want you to be confused for a competitor.', '', 92159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! That\'s not for you.', '', 92158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless, like the rest of her kind. I\'ll deal with you, myself!', '', 92157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I thinking? This fight is all yours, my queen.', '', 92156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $r, how refreshing. Come closer, child.', '', 92155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The queen...', '', 92154, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard... makrura ate... the captain!', 'I heard... makrura ate... the captain!', 92153, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demon... here...', 'Demon... here...', 92152, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were... going to Stormheim... after the Broken Shore.', 'We were... going to Stormheim... after the Broken Shore.', 92151, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain... taken...', 'Captain... taken...', 92150, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm... ran aground.', 'Storm... ran aground.', 92149, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Makrura queen... demon...', 'Makrura queen... demon...', 92148, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ship crashed... gilblin swarmed us.', 'Ship crashed... gilblin swarmed us.', 92147, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were headed for... Stormheim.', 'We were headed for... Stormheim.', 92146, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
