('This \"Alliance\" from another world intrigues me. I would give them our full support.', '', 91953, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is wisest to fight where we are strongest.', '', 91952, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would risk everything we have built. I cannot agree!', '', 91951, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 46722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch Haataru - How do you plan to vote with the council?', '', 91950, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 46721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
