('The Horde has taken control of the Draenei Ruins!', '', 91917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been a long time, Kayn. I still believe in the cause. But, I do not blindly follow anyone... even Illidan.', '', 91916, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 57285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lingering in this prison is a waste of our time. We need to get out of here as soon as possible.', '', 91915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I advise we cooperate with our jailors... for now.', '', 91914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Burning Legion has overrun the vault and most of my wardens are dead. That\'s why I\'m setting you free. No one kills demons like you, $n.\n\nThey\'re heading for Illidan\'s tomb. We have to work together to stop the Legion.', 91913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will not harm our people.', 91912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garad... I am coming...', 91911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry it ended this way.', 91910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will harm our people no more.', 91909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These people are protected.', 91908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It did not have to be this way.', 91907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is my son, Durotan?', 91906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will this war ever end?', 91905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you heard from my son, Durotan?', 91904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
