('An Alliance spy has snuck in amidst the chaos!', 'An Alliance spy has snuck in amidst the chaos!', 91894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew, thank goodness I got to you in time! I know you are eager, hero, but we should build our strength before facing the dangers of Tanaan Jungle.', 'Whew, thank goodness I got to you in time! I know you are eager, hero, but we should build our strength before facing the dangers of Tanaan Jungle.', 91893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, where did that lovely girl run off to?', '', 91892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
