('Drive them out! Do not hold back!', '', 91855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and Honor!', '', 91854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 91853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want an audience? You\'ve got one!', '', 91852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug zug!', 'Zug zug!', 91851, 0, 23504, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zug! You lead to great hall?', 'Zug! You lead to great hall?', 91850, 0, 23504, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going down, Oceanus!', '', 91849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $p, I\'m right over here in this cage. Let me out!', '', 91848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We really did it. We took out Oceanus!\n\nNow we\'re free.', '', 91847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sooner we deal with Oceanus, the sooner we can get out of here.', '', 91846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You start things off and I\'ll be sneaky.', '', 91845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outstanding! Let\'s get to work.', '', 91844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hero! Say, you don\'t happen to have my weapons?', '', 91843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, Morthis Whisperwing from the Druids of the Talon was looking for you. He can be found beneath the great tree to the south.', '', 91842, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s takes a deep breath.', '%s takes a deep breath.', 91841, 0, 30987, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all. Let Neptulon sort them out.', 'Kill them all. Let Neptulon sort them out.', 91840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the giants. Death to Prince Oceanus!', 'Death to the giants. Death to Prince Oceanus!', 91839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better to die free than as a slave.', 'Better to die free than as a slave.', 91838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up. Let\'s kill them all.', 'Rise up. Let\'s kill them all.', 91837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to pay the price of iron, skrogs.', 'Time to pay the price of iron, skrogs.', 91836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t my weapon, but she feels good in my hand.', 'This isn\'t my weapon, but she feels good in my hand.', 91835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaarr! Now you die, scum.', 'Aaarr! Now you die, scum.', 91834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom!', 'Freedom!', 91833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Okuna Longtusk\'s pack lies here on the ground. One of the straps is broken and there are signs of a struggle. But otherwise, it\'s intact including its contents.\n\nOdds are that Okuna was captured and taken to Prince Oceanus. Time to proceed without him.>', '', 91832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow Maraad', '', 91822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe you know the rest of the story, $n.', '', 91821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be gone, spirit! The Tidestone belongs to us now!', 91820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had finally found their slave pen.', '', 91819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the entrance to the cave, however, I ran into an old acquaintance.', '', 91818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Athissa and the Tidestone had evaded me. Rather than pursuing her, I set off to rescue you, my champion.', '', 91817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 62547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Curse you and your kind, elf. The queen herself will hear of this!', 91816, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You deal with our guest, Athissa. I shall take the prisoner to the slave pens.', '', 91815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the midst of the chaos, I saw it: the sorceress had dropped the Tidestone.', '', 91814, 0, 37087, 0, 64, 0, 52793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I followed them as closely as I dared.', '', 91813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, my mistress.', '', 91812, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 52901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make sure that prisoner doesn\'t awaken, Parjesh.', 91811, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 53658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I resolved to follow you into the academy.', '', 91810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guilt overcame me. I could not simply WAIT while you fought my battles.', '', 91809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened, Farondis?', 'What happened, Farondis?', 91808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve seen me at my worst, $n. My husband taken from me... my wolf killed by the coward, Fenris. I know intimately the price of war.$B$BWe must bring the Iron Horde to an end. Grant me a place by your side on the battlefield and I will bring the elements to bear to reap vengeance on our enemies.$b$bYou have only to accept my axe, and I will come.', 91807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lokra, I choose you!', 'Lokra, I choose you!', 91806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kal\'gor the Honorable, I choose you!', 'Kal\'gor the Honorable, I choose you!', 91805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve surpassed me on the battlefield more than once, and that\'s no simple feat.$b$bStill, there is much I can do that you\'ve not yet seen. The spirits have seen it fit to grant me their coldest, most harsh powers. The elements are my allies, and the bane of our enemies.$b$bIt would be my honor to serve at your side.', '', 91804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greatmother Geyah, I choose you!', 'Greatmother Geyah, I choose you!', 91803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have lost two sons this day. I would see this war end before more brothers and sisters of the clans fall prey to the Iron Horde.$b$bMy way is that of a healer. It is my gift to aid others injured by life or battle.$b$bIf you will have me, I shall lend my healing talents to your forces.', 91802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, Tidemistress.', '', 91801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Parjesh! Rally the rest of our forces. I shall make short work of this minor interruption.', 91800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' wikket! Walk away, just like your brother.', 'Ookin\' wikket! Walk away, just like your brother.', 91799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the ook? This not sanctioned fight!', '', 91798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ookin\' outa here.', '', 91797, 0, 31406, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eeeeek! A dooker on you!', '', 91796, 0, 31406, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathwing_bloodcorruption_earth.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:163689|h[Sanguine Sphere]|h|r!', 91795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make Team Sternfathom proud.', '', 91794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re ready, Sternfathom. Toss me into battle.', 'They\'re ready, Sternfathom. Toss me into battle.', 91793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! So good to see you.\n\nYou can come back and fight for me anytime.', '', 91792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
