('Ready to be thrown into the arena?', '', 91790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Discretion is the better part of valor. Now flee!', 91789, 0, 31196, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
