('Great job, $p! Only two more to go.', '', 91773, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, my little friend.', '', 91772, 0, 45656, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
