('Free the outcasts, lead them in battle, escort them out to the Darkscryers, don\'t let them perish. Got it.', 'Free the outcasts, lead them in battle, escort them out to the Darkscryers, don\'t let them perish. Got it.', 91742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, good! You have freed more outcasts from our oppressive brothers. Quickly now, we must get them to safety.', '', 91741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve rescued these outcasts, guide them to safety.', 'I\'ve rescued these outcasts, guide them to safety.', 91740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people are being held captive, $r. Please help us free them. Head into the ruins and free our brothers from their oppressors. Leading them in battle will greatly aid our cause; but you must get them back to one of the Darkscryers safely!', '', 91739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll free and arm the pit fighters in there. That\'ll get us some help dealing with the giants.', '', 91734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you\'re doing that, I\'m heading into Oceanus Cove.', '', 91733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $n. Dhow\'s a light sleeper.', '', 91732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out.', '', 91731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! Where do you think you\'re going?', '', 91730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you see that worthless grunt can you tell him I\'m looking for him?', '', 91729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Azuka is able to retrieve the heart, there is no telling what type of evil she will unleash on our people.', '', 91728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As for you... you will make an acceptable slave.', 91727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Queen Beneath the Tides can reassemble the pieces.', 91726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How perfectly convenient... the brainless $r led us right to the Tidestone.', 91725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MUST PROTECT TIDESTONE...', '', 91724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
