('Intruders in our halls! Inform the headmistress!', 'Intruders in our halls! Inform the headmistress!', 91720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sul\'dren il nathas!', 'Sul\'dren il nathas!', 91719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You\'ve disturbed my studies!', 'Fool! You\'ve disturbed my studies!', 91718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the stink of that traitor Farondis on you...', 'You have the stink of that traitor Farondis on you...', 91717, 0, 31167, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nooo! Must... protect... the Tidestone...', 91716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you are ALSO aware that infringement upon said quarantine carries punishments as severe as death or even detention, correct?', 91715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You - pff - what!?$b$bYou ARE aware that the Tidestone Chamber is under quarantine, and has been so since the very day of Prince Farondis\' betrayal, correct?', 91714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, yes, what is it?$b$bIf this is about the evocation final, then the answer is no, you may not take it again.', 91713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
