('Whalebelly, what\'s all this?', '', 91632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get you, $p, if it\'s the last thing I do.', '', 91631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... what?', '', 91630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see this blade? I\'m going to stick it so far up your...', '', 91629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s where you\'re wrong, chum. Dead wrong.', '', 91628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on to you and your little friend over there. You think you can muscle in on what I\'ve got going on here?\n\nNever going to happen.\n\nLet me assure you that by the end of the day, you\'ll be groveling on the arena floor with my boot to your neck, $r.', '', 91627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greblin Fastfizzle\'s last known location was the Broken Precipice. You might want to catch a flight out there before it\'s too late.', 91626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show the demon-tainted Shadow Council the strength of freedom!', '', 91625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let the dark sky fool you. This is a good day.', '', 91624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss Whalebelly, it\'s great to meet you. Just letting you know that I\'m going to be the arena champion by the end of the day.', 'Boss Whalebelly, it\'s great to meet you. Just letting you know that I\'m going to be the arena champion by the end of the day.', 91623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s a puny $r like you doing in here?\n\nOh, we\'re going to have a good time making chum of you.', '', 91622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whalebelly can make our job more difficult. Try not to offend him.', '', 91621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fum fee fo fie!  Get back to work or it\'s time to die!', '', 91620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, show me where the Tidestone lies.', 'Please, show me where the Tidestone lies.', 91617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, the Nar\'thalas Academy. This is where it all happened.', '', 91616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DIE... FARONDIS....', 91615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farondis! You traitor! You brought this upon us!', '', 91614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elves in this area are much less hospitable than I am. Tread carefully.', '', 91613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me.', '', 91612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a very long time ago.', '', 91611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember - I stowed the Tidestone within the confines of the Nar\'thalas Academy.', '', 91610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them get by us!', '', 91609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, let\'s go.', 'Khadgar, let\'s go.', 91608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you are helping the Illidari in their fight against the demons, I will figure out what our next move is here on Azsuna.\n\nWe must track down that Pillar of Creation. I know it is here somewhere.', '', 91607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
