('If the giants didn\'t want you alive for their sport, you\'d be dead.', '', 91598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what, Ooka? You have a dook for a head!', 'You know what, Ooka? You have a dook for a head!', 91597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaldrys, my trusted captain.', '', 91596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! Watch out!', '', 91595, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 52536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 91594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. How long has this road been flooded? I must have the groundskeepers attend to it.', '', 91593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am taking my leave, nightwatchers... though I doubt you will miss me.', '', 91592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
