('Leading Kargath Bladefist into an active Fire Pillar will counter his Berserker Rush.', 'Leading Kargath Bladefist into an active Fire Pillar will counter his Berserker Rush.', 91590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
