('You want to fight in the arena? No? Work harder!', '', 91587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flip blookin dook-sniffer. You better take that back!', 91585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
