('Lookin\' to buy somethin\'? What, exactly?', 'Lookin\' to buy somethin\'? What, exactly?', 91574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ujia handles the beasts for most of us around here. I\'d just be careful around her raptors. \n\nYou can find her outside the cave in the troll quarter.', 'Ujia handles the beasts for most of us around here. I\'d just be careful around her raptors. \n\nYou can find her outside the cave in the troll quarter.', 91573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outside the Brokenspear Tavern, you can find Jasa\'s trade hut. \n\nThere you can find whatever adventuring supplies you might need.', 'Outside the Brokenspear Tavern, you can find Jasa\'s trade hut. \n\nThere you can find whatever adventuring supplies you might need.', 91572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bren Puresun in the tauren quarter has been working to keep our tradesmen supplied. \n\nSeek him out if you need goods for crafting.', 'Bren Puresun in the tauren quarter has been working to keep our tradesmen supplied. \n\nSeek him out if you need goods for crafting.', 91571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got a couple different factions holed up in Warspear Hold. \n\nI\'ve heard they\'ve even got stuff for sale, though they\'re picky who they sell to.', 'We\'ve got a couple different factions holed up in Warspear Hold. \n\nI\'ve heard they\'ve even got stuff for sale, though they\'re picky who they sell to.', 91570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The birds have set themselves up next to our training grounds in the southern part of town. \n\nThey say they\'re looking for ancient relics, and have some pretty nice gear to trade for them.', 'The birds have set themselves up next to our training grounds in the southern part of town. \n\nThey say they\'re looking for ancient relics, and have some pretty nice gear to trade for them.', 91569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer hides and furs myself, but if you prefer to work with dainty cloth, then you should seek out the blood elf, Saesha Silverblood. \n\nShe\'s set up with her kin, across from the tauren quarter.', 'I prefer hides and furs myself, but if you prefer to work with dainty cloth, then you should seek out the blood elf, Saesha Silverblood. \n\nShe\'s set up with her kin, across from the tauren quarter.', 91568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Huntsworns have skinned just about every kind of beast on Draenor, so if you need training, go to them. \n\nYou can find Kondal working his skins in the tauren quarter.', 'The Huntsworns have skinned just about every kind of beast on Draenor, so if you need training, go to them. \n\nYou can find Kondal working his skins in the tauren quarter.', 91567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re lookin\' for a good miner, go find Murg Stonecrack. He\'s so good that they promoted him from a peon and put him in charge of the mining operations here in Warspear. \n\nLast I saw him, I think he was working the rocks east of the goblin quarter.', 'If you\'re lookin\' for a good miner, go find Murg Stonecrack. He\'s so good that they promoted him from a peon and put him in charge of the mining operations here in Warspear. \n\nLast I saw him, I think he was working the rocks east of the goblin quarter.', 91566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tauren that came over with us seem to have the best grasp on leatherworking around here. \n\nSeek out Burga Stronghide in their quarter for leatherworking training.', 'The tauren that came over with us seem to have the best grasp on leatherworking around here. \n\nSeek out Burga Stronghide in their quarter for leatherworking training.', 91565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small group of Blood Elves set up camp across the way from the tauren. \n\nYou\'ll find a jewelcrafter there by the name of Alixander Swiftsteel.', 'A small group of Blood Elves set up camp across the way from the tauren. \n\nYou\'ll find a jewelcrafter there by the name of Alixander Swiftsteel.', 91564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best scribe we have in Warspear is Joro\'man over in the troll quarter. \n\nFor your sake, I hope he doesn\'t write the way he talks.', 'The best scribe we have in Warspear is Joro\'man over in the troll quarter. \n\nFor your sake, I hope he doesn\'t write the way he talks.', 91563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need help with herbalism, you should look in the undead quarter. \n\nAnthony Allain is over there next to the alchemist\'s hut. He should be able to show you a thing or two.', 'If you need help with herbalism, you should look in the undead quarter. \n\nAnthony Allain is over there next to the alchemist\'s hut. He should be able to show you a thing or two.', 91562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brix Rocketcast is the goblin with the most fishing know-how around here. \n\nYou can find his little island off the shore, north of the goblin quarter.', 'Brix Rocketcast is the goblin with the most fishing know-how around here. \n\nYou can find his little island off the shore, north of the goblin quarter.', 91561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren, Wei Suremend, has been tending to our grunts. He\'s probably your best bet for first aid training. \n\nYou can find him in the barracks. Just follow the sound of training orcs.', 'The pandaren, Wei Suremend, has been tending to our grunts. He\'s probably your best bet for first aid training. \n\nYou can find him in the barracks. Just follow the sound of training orcs.', 91560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve got a pretty good engineering setup in Gallywix\'s Garage over in the goblin quarter. Just look for the biggest building in the area.\n\nOnce you\'re there, talk to Han Leaprocket if you need training.', 'They\'ve got a pretty good engineering setup in Gallywix\'s Garage over in the goblin quarter. Just look for the biggest building in the area.\n\nOnce you\'re there, talk to Han Leaprocket if you need training.', 91559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people treat you with contempt. Why? What did you do?', 'Your people treat you with contempt. Why? What did you do?', 91558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trolls are taking care of all our enchanting needs in Warspear. \n\nLook for Hane\'ke in the Enchanter\'s Study over in their quarter. He should be able to help you out.', 'The trolls are taking care of all our enchanting needs in Warspear. \n\nLook for Hane\'ke in the Enchanter\'s Study over in their quarter. He should be able to help you out.', 91557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best cook on Warspear is Guy Fireeye, no doubt about that. He makes all the grub for the Brokenspear Tavern. \n\nYou can usually find him manning the kichen below the inn itself.', 'The best cook on Warspear is Guy Fireeye, no doubt about that. He makes all the grub for the Brokenspear Tavern. \n\nYou can usually find him manning the kichen below the inn itself.', 91556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to speak with me?', '', 91555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mazdon Bizratchet is your best bet for blacksmithing around here. \n\nYou can find him in the goblin quarter, behind Gallywix\'s Garage.', 'Mazdon Bizratchet is your best bet for blacksmithing around here. \n\nYou can find him in the goblin quarter, behind Gallywix\'s Garage.', 91554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Steamwheedle Preservation Society is your best bet for archaeology around here. \n\nYou can find them in the smaller garage in the goblin quarter. Just seek out Reena Cogscrap there.', 'The Steamwheedle Preservation Society is your best bet for archaeology around here. \n\nYou can find them in the smaller garage in the goblin quarter. Just seek out Reena Cogscrap there.', 91553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re lookin\' to make a new plague, there\'s no better than the Forsaken. \n\nLook for Kristoph Cossey in their quarter, inside the alchemy hut.', 'If you\'re lookin\' to make a new plague, there\'s no better than the Forsaken. \n\nLook for Kristoph Cossey in their quarter, inside the alchemy hut.', 91552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of profession did you need help with?', 'What kind of profession did you need help with?', 91551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken have set up a portal to the Undercity in their quarter. \n\nLook for it behind their alchemy hut.', 'The Forsaken have set up a portal to the Undercity in their quarter. \n\nLook for it behind their alchemy hut.', 91550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Thunder Bluff has been set up in the tauren quarter. \n\nIt should be right next to the Auction House.', 'The portal to Thunder Bluff has been set up in the tauren quarter. \n\nIt should be right next to the Auction House.', 91549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find the portal to Orgrimmar in the Tower of Elements. \n\nJust head east from the big totem.', 'You can find the portal to Orgrimmar in the Tower of Elements. \n\nJust head east from the big totem.', 91548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mages set up a handful of portals to different places. Which one did you want?', 'The mages set up a handful of portals to different places. Which one did you want?', 91547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The goblins have set up a mailbox outside of Gallywix\'s Garage. \n\nIt\'s the biggest building in the goblin quarter, on the east side of town.', 'The goblins have set up a mailbox outside of Gallywix\'s Garage. \n\nIt\'s the biggest building in the goblin quarter, on the east side of town.', 91546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bankers put a mailbox right outside of Warpsear Hold that you\'re welcome to use. \n\nIt\'s the big building to the south of the totem.', 'The bankers put a mailbox right outside of Warpsear Hold that you\'re welcome to use. \n\nIt\'s the big building to the south of the totem.', 91545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got a mailbox right outside the Auction House, in the tauren quarter.\n\nIt\'s just north of the big bonfire.', 'We got a mailbox right outside the Auction House, in the tauren quarter.\n\nIt\'s just north of the big bonfire.', 91544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s one right outside of the Brokenspear Tavern. \n\nYou can find it right off the road heading north from the big totem.', 'There\'s one right outside of the Brokenspear Tavern. \n\nYou can find it right off the road heading north from the big totem.', 91543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got plenty of mailboxes. Which one were you lookin\' for?', 'We\'ve got plenty of mailboxes. Which one were you lookin\' for?', 91542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are in need of rest, the Brokenspear Tavern is where you should be headed. \n\nYou will find it off of the road heading north from the big totem.', 'If you are in need of rest, the Brokenspear Tavern is where you should be headed. \n\nYou will find it off of the road heading north from the big totem.', 91541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got a couple of trained wind riders in Warspear if you need to travel quickly. \n\nSeek out Ilalu at the top of the hill behind the inn, if you have need of them.', 'We\'ve got a couple of trained wind riders in Warspear if you need to travel quickly. \n\nSeek out Ilalu at the top of the hill behind the inn, if you have need of them.', 91540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can keep your extra gear protected by leaving it with the bankers in Warspear Hold. Nobody would be crazy enough to try to steal anything from that place! \n\nIt\'s the big building just south of the totem, you can\'t miss it.', 'You can keep your extra gear protected by leaving it with the bankers in Warspear Hold. Nobody would be crazy enough to try to steal anything from that place! \n\nIt\'s the big building just south of the totem, you can\'t miss it.', 91539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re lookin\' to try your hand at the markets, you might want to seek out the Auction House. \n\nYou can find it in the tauren quarter, in the northern part of Warspear.', 'If you\'re lookin\' to try your hand at the markets, you might want to seek out the Auction House. \n\nYou can find it in the tauren quarter, in the northern part of Warspear.', 91538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
