('Apexis Shard Vendor', 'Apexis Shard Vendor', 91525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have many merchants who have set up shop here in Stormshield. Which one were you looking for?', 'We have many merchants who have set up shop here in Stormshield. Which one were you looking for?', 91524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wish to stable your animals, seek out Orville Manfred, outside the inn in the southern part of Stormshield.\n\nDespite his ferocious appearance, I hear he takes quite good care of the animals.', 'If you wish to stable your animals, seek out Orville Manfred, outside the inn in the southern part of Stormshield.\n\nDespite his ferocious appearance, I hear he takes quite good care of the animals.', 91523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trader Caerel offers various goods for adventurers such as yourself. \n\nYou can find his wagon set up just outside the Town Hall, next to the central monument.', 'Trader Caerel offers various goods for adventurers such as yourself. \n\nYou can find his wagon set up just outside the Town Hall, next to the central monument.', 91522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kenneth Knowles has set up shop in the center of Stormshield, close to many of our profession trainers.\n\nIf you are in need of materials for your craft, seek him out there.', 'Kenneth Knowles has set up shop in the center of Stormshield, close to many of our profession trainers.\n\nIf you are in need of materials for your craft, seek him out there.', 91521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Various factions throughout Draenor have gathered in the Town Hall to offer their assistance in Ashran. \n\nThey even have goods for sale to those with sufficient reputation with them.', 'Various factions throughout Draenor have gathered in the Town Hall to offer their assistance in Ashran. \n\nThey even have goods for sale to those with sufficient reputation with them.', 91520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Order of the Awakened have set up shop right outside the Auction House, in the southern part of Stormshield.  \n\nI hear they\'re offering great rewards to any adventurer who can help them in their search for Apexis relics.', 'The Order of the Awakened have set up shop right outside the Auction House, in the southern part of Stormshield.  \n\nI hear they\'re offering great rewards to any adventurer who can help them in their search for Apexis relics.', 91519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Joshua Fuesting is the finest tailor in all of Draenor. There\'s no better to assist you with anything done with needle and thread. \n\nYou can find him in his stall in the trade center of town. Just looks for the sharp-dressed models, they are easy to spot.', 'Joshua Fuesting is the finest tailor in all of Draenor. There\'s no better to assist you with anything done with needle and thread. \n\nYou can find him in his stall in the trade center of town. Just looks for the sharp-dressed models, they are easy to spot.', 91518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangari Laandon has been lending his expertise on skinning to our forces here in Stormshield. \n\nHe can be found in the leatherworking stall, right outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of town.', 'Rangari Laandon has been lending his expertise on skinning to our forces here in Stormshield. \n\nHe can be found in the leatherworking stall, right outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of town.', 91517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need help with mining, I\'d speak with Jonath Chainfist. He\'s the expert in these parts. \n\nYou can find him just outside the Engineering Works, in the center of town.', 'If you need help with mining, I\'d speak with Jonath Chainfist. He\'s the expert in these parts. \n\nYou can find him just outside the Engineering Works, in the center of town.', 91516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jistun Sharpfeather is the local expert on leatherworking. \n\nYou can find his stall just outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault, in the center of town.', 'Jistun Sharpfeather is the local expert on leatherworking. \n\nYou can find his stall just outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault, in the center of town.', 91515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei Artificers are lending a hand with our operations in Stormshield. \n\nIf you seek training in jewelcrafting, find Artificer Nissea in the draenei encampment, just west of the center of Stormshield.', 'The draenei Artificers are lending a hand with our operations in Stormshield. \n\nIf you seek training in jewelcrafting, find Artificer Nissea in the draenei encampment, just west of the center of Stormshield.', 91514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the Mage Tower you will find Scribe Chi-Yuan. \n\nShe is the finest scribe in all of Ashran, and can train you for any of your inscription needs.', 'In the Mage Tower you will find Scribe Chi-Yuan. \n\nShe is the finest scribe in all of Ashran, and can train you for any of your inscription needs.', 91513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormshield\'s premier herbalist, Jie Wildblossom, has travelled all the way from Pandaria to study the native flora of Draenor. \n\nYou can find her outside the Hero\'s Rest Inn, if you require instruction in Herbalism.', 'Stormshield\'s premier herbalist, Jie Wildblossom, has travelled all the way from Pandaria to study the native flora of Draenor. \n\nYou can find her outside the Hero\'s Rest Inn, if you require instruction in Herbalism.', 91512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Austin Windmill is the best with a rod and reel here in Stormshield. Seek him out for your fishing needs.\n\nYou can normally find him outside his house along the shore, just behind the Town Hall and Auction House.', 'Austin Windmill is the best with a rod and reel here in Stormshield. Seek him out for your fishing needs.\n\nYou can normally find him outside his house along the shore, just behind the Town Hall and Auction House.', 91511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Telys Vinemender is our resident first aid expert. \n\nYou can find her and her apprentice tending to the wounded in the barracks.', 'Telys Vinemender is our resident first aid expert. \n\nYou can find her and her apprentice tending to the wounded in the barracks.', 91510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Queen Azshara wills it, and so shall it be done!', 91509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'FIND THAT TIDESTONE!', 91508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slay anyone and anything that gets in your path!', 91507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pillage the ruins!', 91506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scour the sands!', 91505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These creatures only pretend to understand its power. The Tidestone belongs to Azshara, Her Radiance, the Light Beneath the Tides!', 91504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your orders are clear! Find the Tidestone, and return it to Her Glory, Queen Azshara!', 91503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 52615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:159996|h[Infesting Spores]|h|r!', '', 91502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please fly me to Spires of Arak.', 'Please fly me to Spires of Arak.', 91501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for releasing us both.', 'Thank you for releasing us both.', 91500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But she wouldn\'t leave my side, Gara. Not until the proper effigy was burned, that my soul may find peace.', 'But she wouldn\'t leave my side, Gara. Not until the proper effigy was burned, that my soul may find peace.', 91499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
