('If you run into some trouble with alliance around here, use one of Frizzo Sparkrocket\'s flares.$B$BWe can\'t help you if we don\'t know where you\'re at.', '', 91496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
