('If you seek training in enchanting, Bil Sparktonic is the most knowledgeable enchanter in Stormshield. Just be careful of anything he offers at a \"discount.\"\n\nYou can find him and his associate, Bob, hanging out behind the Auction House, crying their wares.', 'If you seek training in enchanting, Bil Sparktonic is the most knowledgeable enchanter in Stormshield. Just be careful of anything he offers at a \"discount.\"\n\nYou can find him and his associate, Bob, hanging out behind the Auction House, crying their wares.', 91480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you draw some lucky hands today!', '', 91479, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for the best cook in town, seek out Elton Black over at the Hero\'s Rest Inn.\n\nHe may seem a bit silly with his props and gadgets, but he knows how to make some seriously great eats.', 'If you\'re looking for the best cook in town, seek out Elton Black over at the Hero\'s Rest Inn.\n\nHe may seem a bit silly with his props and gadgets, but he knows how to make some seriously great eats.', 91478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aimee Goldforge is our local blacksmithing expert. \n\nYou can find her and her crew around the open-air forge outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of Stormshield.', 'Aimee Goldforge is our local blacksmithing expert. \n\nYou can find her and her crew around the open-air forge outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of Stormshield.', 91477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me too!', 'Me too!', 91476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our resident archaeologist, Manda Darlowe, has set up shop outside the barracks in the center of Stormshield.\n\nShe is accompanied by a strange arakkoa who may be able to assist you in your endeavors as well.', 'Our resident archaeologist, Manda Darlowe, has set up shop outside the barracks in the center of Stormshield.\n\nShe is accompanied by a strange arakkoa who may be able to assist you in your endeavors as well.', 91475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets of Draenor alchemy are well known by our resident alchemist, Jaiden Trask. \n\nYou can find him outside of the Hero\'s Rest Inn, in the southern part of town.', 'The secrets of Draenor alchemy are well known by our resident alchemist, Jaiden Trask. \n\nYou can find him outside of the Hero\'s Rest Inn, in the southern part of town.', 91474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the Iron Horde is making its move. Soldiers! Get the townsfolk to safety!', '', 91473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In what particular profession were you seeking training?', 'In what particular profession were you seeking training?', 91472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Stormwind has been set up outside Andromath\'s Rise.\n\nIf you head up the road past Bronzebeard\'s Vault you\'ll run right into the tower.', 'The portal to Stormwind has been set up outside Andromath\'s Rise.\n\nIf you head up the road past Bronzebeard\'s Vault you\'ll run right into the tower.', 91471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind', 'Stormwind', 91470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not surprisingly, the portal to Ironforge has been set up outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault. You can find it on the south side of the building.\n\nIt\'s the big metal one with the cannon on top in the center of town.', 'Not surprisingly, the portal to Ironforge has been set up outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault. You can find it on the south side of the building.\n\nIt\'s the big metal one with the cannon on top in the center of town.', 91469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ironforge', 'Ironforge', 91468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Darnassus can be found near the night elf moonwell on the eastern side of Stormshield. \n\nJust follow the road past the auction house and that will lead you to it.', 'The portal to Darnassus can be found near the night elf moonwell on the eastern side of Stormshield. \n\nJust follow the road past the auction house and that will lead you to it.', 91467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darnassus', 'Darnassus', 91466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mages have set up portals to a few different locations in various parts of the settlement. \n\nWhere would you like to go?', 'Our mages have set up portals to a few different locations in various parts of the settlement. \n\nWhere would you like to go?', 91465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find another mailbox just outside the Town Hall. \n\nJust head to the southern part of town. The Town Hall is just past the central monument.', 'You\'ll find another mailbox just outside the Town Hall. \n\nJust head to the southern part of town. The Town Hall is just past the central monument.', 91464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Town Hall', 'Town Hall', 91463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find that mailbox right next to the door to the Hero\'s Rest Inn. \n\nJust take the road through the stone walls and follow it west and you\'ll run into the inn at the bottom of the hill.', 'You can find that mailbox right next to the door to the Hero\'s Rest Inn. \n\nJust take the road through the stone walls and follow it west and you\'ll run into the inn at the bottom of the hill.', 91462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find that mailbox right outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of town.\n\nIt\'s the big metal building with the cannon on top.', 'You can find that mailbox right outside of Bronzebeard\'s Vault in the center of town.\n\nIt\'s the big metal building with the cannon on top.', 91461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve actually got a few mailboxes about. Were you looking for one in particular?', 'We\'ve actually got a few mailboxes about. Were you looking for one in particular?', 91460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking to take a load off, then you\'ll want to head down to the Hero\'s Rest Inn. Jaesia should be able to set you up with a room and a mug of ale.\n\nJust take the road past the stone walls and follow it to the west. That\'ll take you right to it.', 'If you\'re looking to take a load off, then you\'ll want to head down to the Hero\'s Rest Inn. Jaesia should be able to set you up with a room and a mug of ale.\n\nJust take the road past the stone walls and follow it to the west. That\'ll take you right to it.', 91459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you need to travel by gryphon, you\'ll want to speak to our Gryphon Master, Ernst ten Bosch. \n\nYou can find him at the top of the hill past the mess hall.', 'If you need to travel by gryphon, you\'ll want to speak to our Gryphon Master, Ernst ten Bosch. \n\nYou can find him at the top of the hill past the mess hall.', 91458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarves of the Explorer\'s League have been allowing adventurers to use the extra space in Bronzebeard\'s Vault to store their excess goods.\n\nIt\'s the big metal building with the cannon on top in the center of town. You can\'t miss it.', 'The dwarves of the Explorer\'s League have been allowing adventurers to use the extra space in Bronzebeard\'s Vault to store their excess goods.\n\nIt\'s the big metal building with the cannon on top in the center of town. You can\'t miss it.', 91457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whether you\'re looking to make a little coin or spend it, the Tyron family and their associates should be able to help you.\n\nThey\'ve set up shop just down the road from the Town Hall, next to the arakkoa refugees.', 'Whether you\'re looking to make a little coin or spend it, the Tyron family and their associates should be able to help you.\n\nThey\'ve set up shop just down the road from the Town Hall, next to the arakkoa refugees.', 91456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pair of ethereals have set up shop in the lower floor of Andromath\'s Rise. \n\nSeek them out there if you wish to use their services for Transmogrification or Void Storage.', 'A pair of ethereals have set up shop in the lower floor of Andromath\'s Rise. \n\nSeek them out there if you wish to use their services for Transmogrification or Void Storage.', 91455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for information on pet battling, seek out Misty Webtangle.\n\nI believe she\'s staying in the cellar of the inn. Let\'s hope she can keep her pets from wandering too far from there.', 'If you\'re looking for information on pet battling, seek out Misty Webtangle.\n\nI believe she\'s staying in the cellar of the inn. Let\'s hope she can keep her pets from wandering too far from there.', 91454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
