('', 'Who goes there? Keep your hands and weapons where I can see them.', 91438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 51893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am SUPER excited to be here today!', '', 91437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect our Priests in the Road of Glory if you see them under attack.$B$BI\'ve trained them myself, their healing power is unmatched this side of the Dark Portal.', 91436, 0, 17483, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flames coming out of the braziers near the Ring of Conquest may look ordinary at first glance. However, I believe they have been enchanted by ancient Highmaul magic.$B$BI was strangely drawn to them. Touching one, I was suddenly filled with magical energy.', 91435, 0, 17483, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have been following your lead, and capturing mounts to train for use in the garrison. Of course, you are welcome to take one out for the day, simply tell me which whistle you would prefer.$B$BBe aware that they are not as well-trained as your own mount, and will tire out after only a few battles.', '', 91434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been following your lead, and capturing mounts to train up for the rest of the garrison. You\'re welcome to take one out for the day, just ask and I\'ll hand you the whistle.$B$BKeep in mind that they\'re not as well-trained as your own mount, and will tire out after only a few battles.', '', 91433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Night Elves are attempting to resurrect an Ancient to be used against us using the power of the Artifacts found here in Ashran.$B$BIf you see any alliance out there, take any fragments they carry by any force necessary.', '', 91432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the mounts-in-training.', 'Tell me about the mounts-in-training.', 91431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find yourself within the Dark Woods, keep an eye out for the blooming Song Flower. They have powerful magical properties.$B$BYou may have to fight off a few of the Arakkoa for them though.', '', 91430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we\'re done here, whaddaya say we go to shore and grab a drink?', '', 91429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you need an analysis? I can have it ready for you by the end of the week.', '', 91428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rylai Crestfall has been slain by the Horde!', '', 91427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jeron Emberfall has been slain by the Alliance!', '', 91426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The good doctor reeks like the floor of tavern and wears a face like five miles of bad road. His color is washed out and he\'s making a deliberate effort not to be sick all over your feet.>$b$bHey Com-om-mander! <Urp> S\'was one HELLUVA bender at Pinchwhistle last night. But I got home all-right for ready! Duty! Yessir. <Belch> Man you really did a number on this garrison since yessserday. With um. Spikes. Furs. And... snow? Did you do that?  I\'mma sit down.', '', 91425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a large work order for fur.', 'I would like to place a large work order for fur.', 91424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a work order for fur.', 'I would like to place a work order for fur.', 91423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a large work order for meat.', 'I would like to place a large work order for meat.', 91422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a work order for meat.', 'I would like to place a work order for meat.', 91421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a large work order for leather.', 'I would like to place a large work order for leather.', 91420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a work order for leather.', 'I would like to place a work order for leather.', 91419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Making plays!', '', 91418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Globalized!', '', 91417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoops! My bad.', '', 91416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met.', '', 91415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrrawr I thirst for blood!', '', 91414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to go back to the nest.', 'I\'d like to go back to the nest.', 91413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You had no chance.', 91412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am unimpressed.', 91411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are not welcome here.', 91410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s why I\'m here.', '', 91409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And not a hair out of place.', '', 91408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut down to size.', '', 91407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... what were you expecting? Frostmourne or something?', '', 91406, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool... we\'ve already... won...', '', 91405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void is coming... it will destroy you all!', '', 91404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No... nooo... the darkness...', '', 91403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooo... it is you who should die!', '', 91402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop the destruction...', '', 91401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master will devour your soul...', '', 91400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hour is near... soon you will die...', '', 91399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The master... will burn your soul!', '', 91398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winter... has... come for me...', '', 91397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You dare challenge the might of the Spiteleaves? Die!', '', 91396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fight against the Warsong clan is honorable, but I don\'t think Hemet has taken very well to the change of priorities here in Nagrand.', '', 91395, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consume all!', '', 91394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are pulled into the Void Realm!', 'You are pulled into the Void Realm!', 91393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skill at tracking allows you to remain in this realm!', 'Your skill at tracking allows you to remain in this realm!', 91392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You instinctively use Deterrance to avoid the attack!', 'You instinctively use Deterrance to avoid the attack!', 91391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it... thank you. Goodbye, Gara, my soul is at peace now. I hope... that you find this peace some day, too. I am so sorry, my dearest Gara.', 'You\'ve done it... thank you. Goodbye, Gara, my soul is at peace now. I hope... that you find this peace some day, too. I am so sorry, my dearest Gara.', 91390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is being swallowed by the void! You must help her! There is only one way, tame her, now! Maybe you can find a way to reverse the process, and put her soul at rest, as you have done mine!', 'She is being swallowed by the void! You must help her! There is only one way, tame her, now! Maybe you can find a way to reverse the process, and put her soul at rest, as you have done mine!', 91389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never escape from the void! Your souls will be devoured!', '', 91388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will fill the void!', '', 91387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall take this one as compensation!', '', 91386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you set her soul at rest. Om\'ra\'s soul belongs to the VOID!', '', 91385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gara was my wolf, back before we forsook shamanism for these... dark magics. She wouldn\'t even look at me, not after I was tainted by the void.', 'Gara was my wolf, back before we forsook shamanism for these... dark magics. She wouldn\'t even look at me, not after I was tainted by the void.', 91384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Beast Mastery) I am not with the Shadowmoon, and I want to help this wolf!', '(Beast Mastery) I am not with the Shadowmoon, and I want to help this wolf!', 91383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My soul... feels at peace... thank you.', 'My soul... feels at peace... thank you.', 91382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gara sniffs the berries, then looks at you expectedly.>', '', 91381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(Beast Mastery) Show Gara the Shadowberries.', '(Beast Mastery) Show Gara the Shadowberries.', 91380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry commander...', 91379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... tried my best...', 91378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it warm in here? Or is it just me...', 91377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander! It\'s an honor.', 91376, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anything I can do for you, commander?', 91375, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice to see you!', 91374, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, commander! Got any missions I could go on? I\'m ready!', 91373, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did it! I got one!', 91372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe you\'ll think twice next time! Wait....', 91371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You aren\'t so tough.', 91370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got what you deserved.', 91369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve spotted one. Over here!', 91368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freeze!', 91367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want to play rough, huh?', 91366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t go easy on you!', 91365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been snuffed out...', '', 91364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not... cool...', '', 91363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honored as always, commander.', '', 91362, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely time for a stroll around the garrison, commander.', '', 91361, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any spells you need cast, commander? Portals you need opened? Diabolical schemes you need carried out?', '', 91360, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pleasure to see you, commander.', '', 91359, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was inevitable, really.', '', 91358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, now, don\'t get all burned out on me.', '', 91357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it warm out here, or is it just me?', '', 91356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did try to warn you.', '', 91355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might feel a slight burning sensation.', '', 91354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re wearing fire resistant armor.', '', 91353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ought to be entertaining.', '', 91352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Want to see a magic trick?', '', 91350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness comes for us all...', 'The darkness comes for us all...', 91349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auchindoun welcome me...', 'Auchindoun welcome me...', 91348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light... fades...', 'The Light... fades...', 91347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward march. For Auchindoun!', 'Forward march. For Auchindoun!', 91346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stand against the darkness.', 'We will stand against the darkness.', 91345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits watch over us!', 'Spirits watch over us!', 91344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light grant us strength!', 'Light grant us strength!', 91343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Auchindoun!', 'For Auchindoun!', 91342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me... smash... you...', 'Me... smash... you...', 91341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I strong... you stronger...', 'I strong... you stronger...', 91340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die in ring...', 'You die in ring...', 91339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me smash you!', 'Me smash you!', 91338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You came to wrong place, runt!', 'You came to wrong place, runt!', 91337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! You no gladiator!', 'Ha! You no gladiator!', 91336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I crush you!', 'I crush you!', 91335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not worthy of ring!', 'You not worthy of ring!', 91334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do fer ya?', '', 91333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! We could never have defeated the golem alone.', 'Thank you! We could never have defeated the golem alone.', 91332, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t forget your help, $n. Without your aid, we all would have fallen to Blackhand.', '', 91331, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never forget you... old friend.', '', 91330, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrim did what he thought was right. He did not know the path he was following.', '', 91329, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for everything you did, $n. Without you... none of us would have survived.', 91328, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He paid the ultimate price for our freedom. We can never forget his sacrifice.', 91327, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everything Maraad did... he did to protect our people.', 91326, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattrath will not fall again. Let us go put these Iron Horde dogs in the ground.', '', 91325, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrim\'s warpath stops here. I will see to it that my old friends meets the fate he has earned.', '', 91324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VERMIN! I WILL TURN YOUR WORLD TO ASH!', '', 91323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, my minions! Rend their flesh.', '', 91322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your suffering will be legendary.', '', 91321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only we were able to bring a Zeppelin through the portal. We could take out Stormshield from the skies!', '', 91320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen how many Death Knights are within our ranks? Why is it that we still can\'t penetrate Stormshield? Are they not using Necrotic Plague?', '', 91319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogue spies have informed us that the Alliance are building machinery used to drill through rocks. Do you think its for the mines?', '', 91318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truce? With the Alliance? Never.', '', 91317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is as we feared, we must venture into the mines. Who knows what ancient dangers are within there...', '', 91316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must focus all of our efforts into the mines. I agree with Dr. Jones, the Artifact has to be there. It has to be!', '', 91315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only we had an airship. We could take out Warspear from the skies!', '', 91314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we supposed to win this battle against the Horde without siege engines?', '', 91313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While the battle against the Horde indeed lies within what we\'re calling the Road of Glory, we must also focus our efforts at trying to find the Artifact. Who knows where it may be.$B$BLeave no stone unturned. We must find the Artifact before the Horde.', 91312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Harrison Jones is convinced the Artifact may lie within the mines. If that\'s true, the next stage of this battle will be fought underground.$B$BWhat new dangers await us in there? That\'s what I need to find out.', 91311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the riverbeast-in-training.', 'I\'d like the riverbeast-in-training.', 91310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the wolf-in-training.', 'I\'d like the wolf-in-training.', 91309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the elekk-in-training.', 'I\'d like the elekk-in-training.', 91308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the boar-in-training.', 'I\'d like the boar-in-training.', 91307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the clefthoof-in-training.', 'I\'d like the clefthoof-in-training.', 91306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like the talbuk-in-training.', 'I\'d like the talbuk-in-training.', 91305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any mounts left to train?', 'Do you have any mounts left to train?', 91304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a number of mounts that still need to be trained. They aren\'t as hardy as your mounts, though, and will tire out after a few battles.', '', 91303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you see any Horde out there, use some of Bixxie Rocketsocket\'s relief flares. Alliance in the area are sure to come assist you.', 91302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have time to chat. Grand Marshal Tremblade is in desperate need of tanks to help in the battle against the Horde.$B$BWhere did I put that Arclight Spanner...', '', 91301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, commander. Some willing recruits may still wish to join our garrison. I will gather the contracts for you, so that you may peruse them at your leisure.', 'Greetings, commander. Some willing recruits may still wish to join our garrison. I will gather the contracts for you, so that you may peruse them at your leisure.', 91300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
