('I want to watch you bleed.', 'I want to watch you bleed.', 90972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scream for me!', 'Scream for me!', 90971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to hear you scream as I peel the flesh from your bones!', '', 90970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an ambush!', '', 90969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming into our camp was reckless, but facing me is suicide.', '', 90968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return to the earth, but I will rise again enflamed!', '', 90967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What wonderful timing. My last plaything had to split.', '', 90966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relent to the unstoppable power of the elements!', '', 90965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat the spirit of the Warsong!', '', 90964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will feed your bones to the wolves, outsider.', '', 90963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me the blessings of the anvil and the forge.', 'Grant me the blessings of the anvil and the forge.', 90962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r.$B$BI can see from your demeanor that you are no ordinary adventurer.$B$BDraenor is a harsh world and many dangerous enemies lurk in both palaces and crypts. They aim to bring terrible destruction to this land using devastating weapons and magic. Securing these places and their treasures would mean excellent rewards for you and your companions.$B$BHowever, do not tread idly into these places, for other adventurers are nipping at your heels and only a race against time will prove your skills to be unmatched!$B$BAre you up for the new challenge Draenor has to offer?', 'Greetings, $r.$B$BI can see from your demeanor that you are no ordinary adventurer.$B$BDraenor is a harsh world and many dangerous enemies lurk in both palaces and crypts. They aim to bring terrible destruction to this land using devastating weapons and magic. Securing these places and their treasures would mean excellent rewards for you and your companions.$B$BHowever, do not tread idly into these places, for other adventurers are nipping at your heels and only a race against time will prove your skills to be unmatched!$B$BAre you up for the new challenge Draenor has to offer?', 90961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void within Oshu\'gun grows... and with it our path to the mortal realm! The feast of souls is upon us!', '', 90960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know genesaur have skulls? I didn\'t know. It took a long time to get all the vines off of it.', '', 90959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legions of the void are without number! Nothing will stand in our way!', '', 90958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh hi! Kaz told me you might be back. She comes by sometimes to see how I\'m doing and burn bodies.', '', 90957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light within Oshu\'gun is dying... soon our path will be clear to invade the realm of the living!', '', 90956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait till I\'m strong enough to wear THIS skull!', '', 90955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open the portals to the realm of the living! Soon we shall feast upon their souls!', '', 90954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the interlopers! The siphoning must not be disturbed! (We\'re making a void god!)', '', 90953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nagrand: And Justice for Thrall', 'Nagrand: And Justice for Thrall', 90952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Paladins are unhappy about their pay, they go on Crusader Strike.', '', 90951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When a trinket gets angry, it needs to cooldown.', '', 90950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanaan Jungle: A Taste of Iron', 'Tanaan Jungle: A Taste of Iron', 90949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue me up for the Coliseum!', 'Queue me up for the Coliseum!', 90948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Mage who cannot fish is considered a bad caster.', '', 90947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never argue with a Tauren, it goes in one ear and out the udder.', '', 90946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blasted Lands: Into the Portal', 'Blasted Lands: Into the Portal', 90945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hunters take bad photographs because they are always out of focus.', '', 90944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cuz it\'s cold!!!', '', 90943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you start a fire! Don\'t you see the crates of ammo piling up over there!', '', 90942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Pandaren who cooks in the dark must use a Shado-Pan.', '', 90941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rogue\'s favorite drink is subtle tea.', '', 90940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When one Tauren spies on another, it\'s called a steak out.', '', 90939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried getting Feldspar on the line and he isn\'t answering, I bet he\'s off talking to Foreman Jorge again.', '', 90938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowmoon Valley: Darkness Falls', 'Shadowmoon Valley: Darkness Falls', 90937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talador: Battle for Shattrath', 'Talador: Battle for Shattrath', 90936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When a gnome clockmaker is hungry, he goes back 4 seconds.', '', 90935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These crates of Ore are piling up, those guys up in the Blast Furnace sure are slacking!', '', 90934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostfire Ridge: Thunder Pass', 'Frostfire Ridge: Thunder Pass', 90933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talador: The Battle for Shattrath', 'Talador: The Battle for Shattrath', 90932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When a Druid fights in tree form, he\'s called a combat log.', '', 90931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not now! These humans have brought in all of this mouth watering meat! Just look at it! Imagine, gnashing and shredding it with your fangs. The juices and the ripping of meat from the bone as you\'re devouring it... \n\n<The worgen\'s eyes wander off...>\n\nWhat did you want again?', '', 90930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong with Kromog? I haven\'t heard him rumbling in a while.', '', 90929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man who turned the heat off, it\'s FREEZING in here!', '', 90928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tales of your deeds travel far, $c. Allow me to recount some of your greatest exploits.', 90927, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place needs more spikes.', 'This place needs more spikes.', 90926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These weapons aren\'t imbued! Ka\'graz go on break or something?', '', 90925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The load of weapons from the Forge never showed up, what\'s going on up there?', '', 90924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to the Prophet\'s final message.', 'Listen to the Prophet\'s final message.', 90923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shipment from the Forge never arrived, so the boys took off early.', '', 90922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shrine has dozens of niches where the Prophet\'s followers have placed memory crystals, mourning the great leader\'s sacrifice. There are hundreds of prayers and remembrances here, from peasants to Exarchs and everyone in-between.', '', 90921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want spikes? Got lots of spikes. Spikes go good on everything! Make it look spikier.', '', 90920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_burningbladeshaman_molten_torrent.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:154938|h[Molten Torrent]|h|r killed you.', '', 90919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_burningbladeshaman_molten_torrent.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:154938|h[Molten Torrent]|h|r killed you. Standing near a group of allies reduces the amount of damage taken by everyone affected!', '', 90918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did everyone go?', '', 90917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_burningbladeshaman_molten_torrent.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:154938|h[Molten Torrent]|h|r killed you. Minimize damage by standing near several allies.', '', 90916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s just won a game of Hearthstone!', '%s just won a game of Hearthstone!', 90915, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s opens up a new pack of Hearthstone cards. Mmm, love that new card smell!', '%s opens up a new pack of Hearthstone cards. Mmm, love that new card smell!', 90914, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s throws down a Hearthstone board! Who\'s ready to play?', '%s throws down a Hearthstone board! Who\'s ready to play?', 90913, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tales of your deeds travel far, $c. Allow me to recount some of your greatest exploits.', 90912, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Leave me.', '', 90911, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it is, my Prince: The Tidestone of Golganneth, one of the seven Stones of Creation, and treasured relic of the kaldorei.', 90910, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid that the Tidestone of Golganneth may be our last hope.', '', 90909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch. I shall conjure an image of the few memories I have about this... Tidestone.', '', 90908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for its heart!', 'Aim for its heart!', 90907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tasty tasty!', '', 90906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cavorting with Cenarius behind my back? I will NOT tolerate dissent!', 90905, 0, 0, 474, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This whole valley is filled with plotters and schemers.', 90904, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...what?!', '', 90903, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a shame that you won\'t LIVE to reap the benefits of my gratitude.', 90902, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done me a great service today, Farondis.', 90901, 0, 0, 430, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, Cenarius. I believed in your cause, but I couldn\'t bring myself to turn against...', '', 90900, 0, 0, 397, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only Queen Azshara herself stands a chance against a demigod like him.', '', 90899, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we do, then?', '', 90898, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know. But you aren\'t strong enough to keep Cenarius away from the Tidestone... even with my help.', '', 90897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a doomsday device!', '', 90896, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He wants to use the Tidestone of Golganneth! To destroy the Well of Eternity itself!', '', 90895, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan, I have doubts about Cenarius\' plan.', '', 90894, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I could rely on you, Farondis.', '', 90891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.', '', 90890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree... but must we use the Tidestone? Such a drastic solution.', '', 90889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Queen Azshara\'s abuse of magic has attracted the attention of a legion of demons. We have little time left.', '', 90888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farondis, the time to move is now.', '', 90887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('That is all I can remember. Help me reclaim my memories, and I may be able to aid you.', '', 90886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Farondis... the Tidestone of Golganneth... our last hope...', '', 90885, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cycle... continues...', 'The cycle... continues...', 90884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give life to my master.', 'I give life to my master.', 90883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great genesaur, feed on me.', 'Great genesaur, feed on me.', 90882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be harvested!', 'You will be harvested!', 90881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will feed our god!', 'Your corpse will feed our god!', 90880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remove this... bramble from our garden.', 'Remove this... bramble from our garden.', 90879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The god in bloom will not be disturbed!', 'The god in bloom will not be disturbed!', 90878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah ha! More for the mulch!', 'Ah ha! More for the mulch!', 90877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My brothers shall avenge me.', 'My brothers shall avenge me.', 90876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not fear death.', 'I do not fear death.', 90875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bin huruk thora korro... rra hokumm ura korak.', 'Bin huruk thora korro... rra hokumm ura korak.', 90874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trespasser!', 'Trespasser!', 90873, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your path leads only to death.', 'Your path leads only to death.', 90872, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These rylaks are property of the Iron Horde!', 'These rylaks are property of the Iron Horde!', 90871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you lost?', 'Are you lost?', 90870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere!', 'You will not interfere!', 90869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I return... to Rukhmar.', '', 90868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, commander, but I am feeling a bit... cooped up. Do you have an away mission for me?', '', 90867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad to be among new allies.', '', 90866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are looking rather radiant today.', '', 90865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light of the Awakened is at your command.', '', 90864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, commander. I trust everything is in order?', '', 90863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A brilliant future awaits us.', '', 90862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blind fool.', '', 90861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no tolerance for savagery.', '', 90860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such is the cost of progress.', '', 90859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No-no-no-no-no...', 'No-no-no-no-no...', 90858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no place in our future.', '', 90857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you no good.', 'You... you no good.', 90856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rukhmar, guide my hand.', '', 90855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn for your crimes!', '', 90854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!', 'Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!', 90853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Order!', '', 90852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will reduce you to ashes!', '', 90851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you no die?', 'Why you no die?', 90850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will only hurt for a moment.', '', 90849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No kill?', 'No kill?', 90848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We kill! Kill-kill-kill!', 'We kill! Kill-kill-kill!', 90847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hee hee hee! Blood!', 'Hee hee hee! Blood!', 90846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look tasty-tasty!', 'Look tasty-tasty!', 90845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinner time? Dinner tiiiime!', 'Dinner time? Dinner tiiiime!', 90844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm. Smell meat!', 'Mmm. Smell meat!', 90843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die! Die-die-die-die!', 'Die! Die-die-die-die!', 90842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneecaaaaps!', 'Kneecaaaaps!', 90841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Live by the fossil, become a fossil.', 90840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey commander. Can I get salvage rites to this place after you die?', 90839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are all sorts of shiny trinkets buried under the ground here.', 90838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oops.', 90837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Note to self, $n is very sensitive to fire.', 90836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Interesting results.', 90835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, so that happened.', 90834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I mostly work with fossils, so, this might hurt.', 90833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you an animal, vegetable, mineral, or other?', 90832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hold still. I want to try a new spell.', 90831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mind helping with an experiment?', 90830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
