('', 'For the Sha\'tari.', 90818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light shall burn you.', 90817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This did not have to end in violence.', 90816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pay dat sign no heed, mon. Just a harmless bit a\' advertisin\'.', 90815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sign reads:\n\n\"I\'m Commander $n, and this is my favorite merchant in Warspear.\"', '', 90814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! It worked. And we haven\'t been temporally inverted.', '', 90813, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These trolls aren\'t so bad. They may be skinny and talk funny, but they make a fun spear launcha! \n\nI can\'t wait to skewer some dwarves with this thing!', 90812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Temporal juxtaposition incoming!', '', 90811, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the toll taken from our assault on the Dark Portal, much of our remaining forces came to regroup here in Ashran. It is unfortunate that hostilities with the Alliance came shortly after.\n\nDo you seek refuge here, as well, or do you wish to stoke the flames of battle further?', '', 90810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about we see who is on the other side of these anomalous shenanigans?', '', 90809, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that\'s... surprisingly accurate.', '', 90808, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, the taste kinda reminds me of the runoff water from cooling the machines back home. It\'s all we had to drink when I was a kid.', 90807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nostalgic? How does that swill make you nostalgic?', '', 90806, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It ain\'t so bad. It kinda makes me nostalgic.', 90805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is beer the only thing these orcs drink? What does a goblin gotta do to get a nice cocktail around here?', '', 90804, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh I ain\'t afraid, baby. It\'s just that death puts a steep cut in the profit margins.', '', 90803, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought you were tellin\' me that you laugh in the face of danger? Sounds like you might be afraid of this place.', 90802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It ain\'t the digs I\'m concerned about. Everywhere you turn either an ogre is trying to club your head in, or one of those Alliance goons wants to stick a sword in ya!', '', 90801, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s wrong with this place? The digs ain\'t bad.', 90800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man, I thought it would be a pretty sweet gig coming out here with the Society. Boy was I wrong!', '', 90799, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have honored the memory of my kin, $c. Take this blessing with you on your journey, so that it may it guide your arm and swiften your step.', '', 90798, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the saberon strip the bones of the innocent. I have seen the remains of my clansmen cooked in their wretched cauldron. Now... it shall be the saberon whose bones are desecrated and boiled!', '', 90797, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n detonated Destructive Resonance!', '', 90796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need talk to Varzok in Orgrimmar!  Any guard there should be able to give directions to him.\n\nDa portal to Orgrimmar inside shaman hut.  Good luck!', '', 90795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zarg like kitties. Zarg train his little kitties to be cute little warriors. \n\nWhat? Why you look at me like that? \n\nYou got something against kitties?', '', 90794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This boat is quite legitimate!', 90793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we improve this boat, I\'m going to replace all the parts for half the price!', '', 90792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like it here in Shadowmoon Valley. It\'s so peaceful and quiet... not like that bone zone.', '', 90791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been to the Crescent Hearth? They have some delicious pies. Or Embaari Village? The fresh produce is shipped in from Elodor daily!', '', 90790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried the local fare? These draenei sure know how to cook.', '', 90789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I improved our map by color coding each destination by its danger level!', 90788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did we have to come to Shadowmoon? Min Loo knows I hate the dark...', 90787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The artifact that we discovered in Gorgrond appears to have a similiar signature to this one.$B$BIt is almost certain that it was a smaller fragment of this larger, intact device.$B$BIf the splinter was capable of summoning a colossal creature to your aid, then what could this device be capable of?', 90786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
