('I\'ll be pulling thorns out of my armor for weeks...', '', 90402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of sun and moon flow through me with a deafening boom!', '', 90401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The goren fled, but I don\'t think they fled from us...', '', 90400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let\'s put these demon-spawn out of their misery!', '', 90399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s beat these ogres back to Highmaul!', '', 90398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alive or dead, I tower over you!', '', 90397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unstoppable!', '', 90396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeated? No! Charles, where were you?!', '', 90395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader is here. For the Horde!', '', 90394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is not your day to die!', 90393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light mend your wounds!', 90392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be healed!', 90391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this last one\'s bigger than the rest.', '', 90390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power is surpassed only by my stature!', '', 90389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, we\'ll assemble the troops at your command.', '', 90388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From a distance, you look very small.', 90387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many adventurers have come to Ashran of late. Some seek their own personal fortune, while others come to aid the Alliance in their plight against the Horde.\n\nWhat adventure do you seek here, friend?', '', 90386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cold certainly bothers you', 90385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Two seconds as a woman and I\'m already getting hot flashes.', 'Oh! Two seconds as a woman and I\'m already getting hot flashes.', 90384, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there, poppet!', 'Hello there, poppet!', 90383, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shadowmoon Clan shames all Orcs. Every one we kill is a lesson to the rest.', '', 90382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel them down there...', '', 90381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open. They might spring from anywhere.', '', 90380, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a fight...', '', 90379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where they\'ll attack first...', '', 90378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in luck! Once again, we can show the demons that the true Horde will not be swayed!', '', 90377, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a stench in the air. Demons...', '', 90376, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take me alive ...hic!', '', 90375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that sound? Reminds me of a kodo stampede...', '', 90374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, you\'ll like this.', '', 90373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You da champ! Dat means you can\'t fight in Coliseum for six...hundred years. Or maybe it one week? Me no know!', '', 90372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over, Jacob. Come quietly and we\'ll get you on the first gryphon to prison for treason.', 'It\'s over, Jacob. Come quietly and we\'ll get you on the first gryphon to prison for treason.', 90371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shome commander you are ...hic! I\'ve been working with the orcsh shince the shtart! ...hic!', '', 90370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apologies, gladiator, but you have already been victorious in the Coliseum this week. Come back next week.', '', 90369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this coordinating work is tiring. I sure could use a frosty brew.', '', 90368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is Wobblewrench? She\'s been working on that spider tank for ages!', '', 90367, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long does normal maintenance take, Springfizzle? We needed that tank on the field hours ago!', '', 90366, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need that rock clearing bot on the double, Sparkswift. Do you expect Harrison Jones to clear out that mine with a pick?', '', 90365, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clockspan, we need to get that tank repaired. Our troops need some assistance on the front line!', '', 90364, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never keep a kaliri in the bedroom. They hear EVERYTHING.', '', 90363, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wut is it? Me need to work out more!', '', 90362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cost to do battle in the Coliseum is 100 Broken Bones. Do you wish to proceed?', '', 90361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to battle in the Coliseum!', 'I wish to battle in the Coliseum!', 90360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can Kharg assist you, gladiator?', '', 90359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kharg seems uninterested.>', '', 90358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Macro power!', '', 90357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only had one shot.', '', 90356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'War does not simply visit these lands, it lives here.  The violence thrives in past, present, and future...', 90355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Itty bitty living space.', '', 90354, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PHENOMENAL COSMIC POWERS!', '', 90353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check THIS one out!', '', 90352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey everyone, John Swifty here!', '', 90351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the Blasted Lands before the invasion.', 'Show me the Blasted Lands before the invasion.', 90350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank ye, commander. I\'ll see ye at your garrison.', 90349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you do characters?', 'Do you do characters?', 90348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone been to Silvermoon? I only ever play Silvermoon one night at a time. It\'s a hideous, gaudy place.', '', 90347, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, could I have a moment o\' yer time?', 90346, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You guys have it great out here. You got the right to bear arms, the right to arm bears. Whatever the hell you want to do!', '', 90345, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know the difference between a bar fight and an orcish wedding? Me neither.', '', 90344, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about those draenei? Or as they like to say, the other blue race. How can you trust an army that makes warhammers out of pink gemstones?!', '', 90343, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin \"engineering\" - yeah, right. You goblins got hands and a brain, and only enough blood to run one at a time!', '', 90342, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But hey, the Alliance aren\'t all bad. If you want a linguistic adventure, go drinking with a dwarf!', '', 90341, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If this artifact that Harrison is seeking is as powerful as he seems to think, I hope it remains undiscovered.\n\nRegardless of intentions, the wielding of great power often comes with drastic consequences.', 90340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s one thing I\'ve learned on Draenor, it\'s never to pick a fight with an ogre; they\'ve got nothing to lose.', '', 90339, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter what people tell you, words and ideas can change the world.', '', 90338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re only given a little spark of madness... and if you lose that, you\'re nothing.', '', 90337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, commander. I will see you at your garrison.', 90336, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your order has already been placed.', 90335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, friend.', 90334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps they fight with such ferocity because they fear we will use it against them.', 90333, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think they wish to use it against the Alliance?', '', 90332, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the Horde forces, Priestess. They fight with great savagery to obtain the artifact before us.', '', 90331, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You seem troubled, Myshal. What vexes you?', 90330, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope that day does not come, Myshal.', 90329, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love goblins, but they are a tough audience.', '', 90328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if they don\'t listen? What if our allies\' lust for power leads them down the path of destruction?', '', 90327, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is why we must assure that our allies are the ones to retrieve it. Once recovered, we will offer our guidance to ensure it is not misued.', 90326, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Priestess, if the artifact is as powerful as they say, the destruction that could be wrought by its wielder could be devastating!', '', 90325, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand your concerns about this artifact, Myshal, but we must not interfere with our allies efforts to retrieve it.', 90324, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, may I have a moment?', 90322, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You like meat? We got lots o\' fresh meat here! How much you want?', '', 90321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dem ogron workin\', or start bashin\' skulls!', '', 90320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get control of da ogron, now!', '', 90319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get dem ogron back to work!', '', 90318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test - male.', 'Test - female', 90317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin is on his way soon.', 'Thaelin is on his way soon.', 90316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go into the Road of Glory!', '', 90315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit wanderin\' round and break some rocks ya stupid ogron!', '', 90314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better start breakin\' rocks before I break you!', '', 90313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back ta work ya lazy ogron!', '', 90312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeah? What? This fighter chow is a special family secret.\n\nThere\'s no ookin way you\'re getting any, $r.', 90311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two ogron! Har har har!', '', 90310, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey, wanna know what\'s more stupid den a ogron?', '', 90309, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_EmpoweredTouch:20|t Tarlna begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:175979|h[Genesis]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_EmpoweredTouch:20|t Tarlna begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:175979|h[Genesis]|h|r.', 90308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even dead talbuk be more useful den dese stupid ogron!', '', 90307, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All dem muscles and you can\'t break boulders?! Useless ogron!', '', 90306, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_massentanglement.blp:20|t You are entangled in |cFFFF0404|Hspell:176001|h[Savage Vines]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_massentanglement.blp:20|t You are entangled in |cFFFF0404|Hspell:176001|h[Savage Vines]|h|r!', 90305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lose the crowd again and you will all pay dearly!', '', 90304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I not a gracious host? Are you not entertained?!', '', 90303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s better! Do not disappoint us again!', '', 90302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, insect!', '', 90301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn in the master\'s fire!', '', 90300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, servants!', '', 90299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn.', '', 90298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master claims your soul.', '', 90297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world... ALL worlds... shall burn!', '', 90296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares meddle in the works of the Legion?!', '', 90295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You do not understand... must not get away...', '', 90294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Tectus. Bend to master\'s will!', '', 90293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night! My blood... stars....', '', 90292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yjj\'rmr... Xzzolos...', '', 90291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MASTER! I COME FOR YOU!', '', 90290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kral\'ach.... The darkness speaks.... A VOICE!', '', 90289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His sacrifice will echo through our generations... forever.', '', 90288, 0, 31108, 0, 64, 0, 45214, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FLESH. WEAK.', '', 90287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RETURN TO THE EARTH.', '', 90286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
