('I... AM... ETERNAL!', '', 90280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THE EARTH CONSUMES YOU.', '', 90279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BREAK.', '', 90278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALL THAT LIVES, TO DUST.', '', 90277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AUGHHHHH!', '', 90276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY WILL... I WILL NOT BE... BROK... EN....', '', 90275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwargh! Nobody spills my brew... DIE!', '', 90274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?', 'What happened here?', 90273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand victorious, but at a high cost.', '', 90272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snowfury mournfully paws at the rubble.', '', 90271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $n!', '', 90270, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I found ya!', '', 90269, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy $n!  Any luck out here?', '', 90268, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck on the lunkers!', '', 90267, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be back later, save me a beer!', '', 90266, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya!', '', 90265, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My patience has run out! I WILL MAKE YOU FIGHT!', '', 90264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pace is not to my liking! This should help...', '', 90263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crowd grows weary of this battle! Perhaps a little fire can liven things up!', '', 90262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*YAWN* It would seem that you require some outside assistance!', '', 90261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looters Stopped: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 90260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infiltrators Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 90258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrion Worms Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 'Carrion Worms Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 90257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will enslave all!', '', 90256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to concentrate on getting weapons to give to the other prisoners and setting you up as Sternfathom\'s champion pit fighter.\n\nThen, we can go kill Prince Oceanus.', '', 90255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seriously?  I think I would actually just throw that one back.', '', 90254, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*HIC!*  Was that a dolphin?!  *HIC!*  I love dolphins!', '', 90253, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any bites yet?  I have found that patience (and beer) really helps bring in the big catch!', '', 90252, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
