('', 'You look like the adventering type!$b$bIf you find any relics or artifacts while you\'re out there, bring them back here and we\'ll make a deal!', 90230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
