('<Bozzil flails his arms wildly as you approach>$b$bWhoa! Hey! Who\'s there?$b$bOh, sorry... I haven\'t been able to see very well since that whole... Xelganak thing.', '', 90221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You help out the Steamwheedle Preservation Society and we help you back! But don\'t forget, sharing may be caring but gold is how it\'s sold!', '', 90220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hack imposters like Harrison Jones may frown on my methods, but fossilization takes thousands of years!$b$bThe best way to preserve a rare and fascinating creature is to do it yourself!$b$bWhy wait thousands of years for nature to do something that you can do a better job of yourself?', '', 90219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My body has fallen, but my spirit rises. I will always be with you.', 90218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun! The last gladiator standing will be victorious!', '', 90217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forged in flame, my power knows no bounds, my allies fear nothing!', 90216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then taste the Scythe of Souls...', 90215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! Honor your champion! See the riches bestowed upon the most powerful of your kind!', '', 90214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amidst the chaos and carnage of the Coliseum, one among you has emerged the victor. $n! Shout $ghis:her; name in praise! Glory be to $n on this day!', '', 90213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
