('Hollowed Skull', 'Hollowed Skull', 90211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take five, guys. We\'ve got a little conversing to do here.', 90210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, all right! I\'ll talk! Just call off your goons!', '', 90209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Persuade em, boys.', 90208, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not talkin! I ain\'t no rat!', '', 90207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did that loosen up your tongue a bit, or do you need more persuasion?', 90206, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh well, we can do this the hard way.', 90205, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t got nothin\' to say to you!', '', 90204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So how about you tell us a little bit about these machines you and your cronies have been making for the Iron Horde?', 90203, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only a sense of regret for letting you talk me into this...', '', 90202, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right... hey you feel something crawling around in your skull?', 90201, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So all we gotta do now is wait until they go to sleep and then scram with the bones?', '', 90200, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The disguise is working! Those dumb gronn don\'t even know we\'re here!', 90199, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just follow the sound of the money you\'ll make when we sell off all these bones!', 90198, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t even see out of this thing... how\'s the plan supposed to work if we can\'t see where we\'re going?', '', 90197, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
