('', 'The reagents of Draenor are as wondrous as they are mysterious.\n\nFor a price, I can teach you to harness their potential.', 90186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creature must exist! I will seek it to the end of my days!', '', 90185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
