('Now dat\'s a good rapta!', '', 90179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zikk mon. Could ya be doin me a fava and grab me da scroll from da enchantas?', '', 90178, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Alliance making themselves a threat again on Ashran, the demand for quality weapons and armor is higher than ever!\n\nDo you smell profit?', '', 90177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Iron Horde guys think they know how to make machines. \n\nJust wait until they see what a goblin can do once we get our hands on their tech!', '', 90176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da right words have da powah of da strongest voodoo. \n\nDem dat keep da words, dey know real powah!', 90175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see ya wishin\' to enhance ya gear with da powah of da voodoo. \n\nGed\'kah can be of service, mon.', '', 90174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei crystalsmiths closely guard the secrets to harnessing the latent power of the gems of Draenor. \n\nI, however, have managed to access these secrets and can share them with a talented jewelcrafter.\n\nFor a price, of course.', '', 90173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you could use an updated wardrobe.  \n\nLuckily for you, I may just be able to teach you how to make some of the finest tailored garments in Draenor.\n\nCare to take a look at my patterns?', '', 90172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessing of A\'dal', 'Blessing of A\'dal', 90171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
