('Blessing of D\'ore', 'Blessing of D\'ore', 90169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone statue gives off a restful aura. A plaque on the sign reads:$B$BThose blessed by the light of A\'dal shall gain fortitude and armor to confront the most challenging of foes.$B$BSeek the blessing of D\'ore to be healed in times of need.$B$BK\'ara guides the weapons of the blessed, granting the chance for additional strikes in times of war.$B$BK\'ure rewards the faithful, granting their movement the swiftness of wind.', 'The stone statue gives off a restful aura. A plaque on the sign reads:$B$BThose blessed by the light of A\'dal shall gain fortitude and armor to confront the most challenging of foes.$B$BSeek the blessing of D\'ore to be healed in times of need.$B$BK\'ara guides the weapons of the blessed, granting the chance for additional strikes in times of war.$B$BK\'ure rewards the faithful, granting their movement the swiftness of wind.', 90168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi! This fort is swell.', 90167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m right in the middle of communicating cross-dimensionally with Nibly, if you DON\'T MIND.', '', 90166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many beasts of Draenor have hides as resilient as the toughest kodo. \n\nWith the proper skill, I can show you how to work these hides into fine armors.', '', 90165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
