('I love boats!', '', 90160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fight, sit by fire. Fire warm, outside cold. You sit.', '', 90159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if this world has any world-destroying artifacts? We can\'t allow them to fall into the hands of the enemy, you know!', '', 90158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Gamon, will save us!', '', 90157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
