('I need rest, $n. Shorel\'aran!', 'I need rest, $n. Shorel\'aran!', 90155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, hello commander! Would you like me to tell you a lengthy story about a bridge?', '', 90154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
