('If you are exalted by Undercity, Thunder Bluff, the Darkspear trolls, Silvermoon City, Bilgewater Port, the Huojin pandaren, or if you are a death knight exalted by the Knights of the Ebon Blade, you can recruit guards from their respective ranks by talking to the right recruiting officer in your Great Hall.', 'If you are exalted by Undercity, Thunder Bluff, the Darkspear trolls, Silvermoon City, Bilgewater Port, the Huojin pandaren, or if you are a death knight exalted by the Knights of the Ebon Blade, you can recruit guards from their respective ranks by talking to the right recruiting officer in your Great Hall.', 89258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
