('', 'We will never surrender to you! Champion, now is the time! Use the artifact!', 88965, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 44738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Mount-In-Training runs away in fear!', 'Your Mount-In-Training runs away in fear!', 88964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death incarnate now walks the land. These Forsaken are a crime against life itself... anathema to the Light. For that alone they must all be purged from Draenor.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls, conspirators one and all. The troll invaders must be crushed and sent back to their savage gods!$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On Argus we hunted powerful horned beasts like your tauren for sport. Prove your might over this worthy adversary!$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren had a choice to serve in your mighty army, but instead opted to betray the Alliance and join the enemy. Now they aid the orcs in their mission to kill all draenei. The traitorous pandaren of the Horde must be exterminated.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my tongue, goblin roughly translates to parasite. A fitting name they have given themselves. As with any pest, they must be exterminated. Let their deaths serve as a lesson to the rest of this so called \"Alliance.\"$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I return... to the Light.', 88958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... no, she cannot! My mind is not my own!', 88957, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 43238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
