('We obey Ner\'zhul\'s will!', 'We obey Ner\'zhul\'s will!', 88827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_H_H.BLP:##|t |cFFF00000%s|r the man slayer is hunting you.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ACHIEVEMENT_PVP_H_H.BLP:##|t |cFFF00000%s|r the man slayer is hunting you.', 88826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again, $p. Your kindness will not be forgotten... and neither will Tuliaa.', '', 88825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no use.', '', 88824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This unusual arakkoa seems to have suffered mortal wounds from some sort of powerful dark magic.\n\nWhatever caused these wounds, however, is nowhere to be seen.', '', 88823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay boss.', '', 88822, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tormmok, head back to the barracks.', 'Tormmok, head back to the barracks.', 88821, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way, boss.', '', 88820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool!', '', 88819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will meet the same fate!', '', 88818, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 10110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got it, boss. I meet you outside.', '', 88817, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The feeble arakkoa thought he could enslave me, but nothing can contain the void\'s eternal gaze!', '', 88816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 10112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannot be! My gaze is.. eternal...', '', 88815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for the stadium will begin in 3 minutes!', '', 88814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for the quarry will begin in 3 minutes!', '', 88813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have found him...', '', 88812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Story time is over!', '', 88811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away, Exarch. May the dead speak through you.', 88810, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_voidentropy.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:174016|h[Decimate]|h|r! Run into a Neutralization Zone!', '%s begins to cast |TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_voidentropy.blp:20|t |cFFFF0404|Hspell:174016|h[Decimate]|h|r! Run into a Neutralization Zone!', 88809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle for the ritual fires will begin in 3 minutes!', '', 88808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings champion.$b$BI volunteered for this expedition to examine the oddities and abnormalities of Draenor.$b$bIf you find any strange anomalies during your journey I would be interested in examining them.', '', 88807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please don\'t die... please! Nyami said I cannot fail again!', 88806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I toiled at my craft, stranger. There is no greater pursuit, in my opinion, than to admire and reflect upon the beauty of this world.', '', 88805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The half-orc snarls at you from within her arcane prison. Her eyes are filled with fire and hate - it\'s clear that Gul\'dan still has her under his complete control.>', 88804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrion Worms Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A giant Carrion Worm smells his next meal!', 'A giant Carrion Worm smells his next meal!', 88802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in Inscription.', 'Train me in Inscription.', 88801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in Archaeology.', 'Train me in Archaeology.', 88800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The past has much to teach us.', '', 88799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this, we can delve into the tale of Terokk\'s fall.', '', 88798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully, stranger. I am not accustomed to visitors in this wasteland.', '', 88797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This gift will surely prove useful - but we still need the Talonpriests to perform the rites.', '', 88796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, thanks to the bangle you recovered from Ikiss, we can go right into the tale of Terokk\'s fall.', '', 88795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of the story will have to wait until you\'ve returned from Talon Watch.', '', 88794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Felfire Batriders Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aren\'t you thankful?', '', 88792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Council Voidrenders Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow Council Portals Destroyed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadowblades Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imps Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow Anguishers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abyssal Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 88786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you made it here safely. Are you ready?', 'I\'m glad you made it here safely. Are you ready?', 88784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the light... watch... over you...', 'May the light... watch... over you...', 88783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... you... are kind...', '... you... are kind...', 88782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain... thank you...', 'The pain... thank you...', 88781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... return... to... the light...', '... return... to... the light...', 88780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gates have been breached! They have come for the stones!', '', 88779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My liege, the city is lost! We must abandon the palace!', '', 88778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank... you...', 'Thank... you...', 88777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not fear you!', 88776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... I\'m gonna need your raptor again.', 'Um... I\'m gonna need your raptor again.', 88775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye be lookin\' lost, mon.', 88774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to embark on a dangerous mission, and you may not be able to return immediately. Are you sure?', 'You are about to embark on a dangerous mission, and you may not be able to return immediately. Are you sure?', 88773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about Aluneth?', 'What can you tell me about Aluneth?', 88772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That weapon... I\'ve never seen anything like it before.$b$bMy lady used to talk to the thing, like it was alive. She\'d talk about spells, rituals, other matters of the arcane... all of it well over my head.$b$bShe was always a bit wild, my lady was, but she never quite struck me as batty. Odd to be talking to a staff, though.', 'That weapon... I\'ve never seen anything like it before.$b$bMy lady used to talk to the thing, like it was alive. She\'d talk about spells, rituals, other matters of the arcane... all of it well over my head.$b$bShe was always a bit wild, my lady was, but she never quite struck me as batty. Odd to be talking to a staff, though.', 88771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mean the Magna\'s weapon? I can tell you what I know.$b$bOnce, when I was much, much younger, I reached out to touch the greatstaff, as my lady had left it propped up against her chamber door. The staff rejected my touch with painful tendrils of pink and purple lightning.$b$bNot one second later, the Magna appeared and wrested the weapon away from me.$b$bShe shared a powerful bond with that staff - one that I will never fully understand.', 'You mean the Magna\'s weapon? I can tell you what I know.$b$bOnce, when I was much, much younger, I reached out to touch the greatstaff, as my lady had left it propped up against her chamber door. The staff rejected my touch with painful tendrils of pink and purple lightning.$b$bNot one second later, the Magna appeared and wrested the weapon away from me.$b$bShe shared a powerful bond with that staff - one that I will never fully understand.', 88770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the great weapon once, in my lady\'s library, moving on its own through the stacks!$b$bI pretended not to see it, but I fear it noticed my stare.', 'I saw the great weapon once, in my lady\'s library, moving on its own through the stacks!$b$bI pretended not to see it, but I fear it noticed my stare.', 88769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... Aluneth. You speak of the Magna\'s greatstaff.$b$bI knew from the start it was not a weapon of normal means. My lady would simply reach upwards and GRAB the staff out of thin air, wave it around a bit, and then... just PUT it back into the thin air it came out of.$b$bThere was no cloaking or charlatan\'s invisibility going on here. That staff came from another realm. And the Magna knew how to reach into that realm and pluck it out.', 'Ahh... Aluneth. You speak of the Magna\'s greatstaff.$b$bI knew from the start it was not a weapon of normal means. My lady would simply reach upwards and GRAB the staff out of thin air, wave it around a bit, and then... just PUT it back into the thin air it came out of.$b$bThere was no cloaking or charlatan\'s invisibility going on here. That staff came from another realm. And the Magna knew how to reach into that realm and pluck it out.', 88768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curs. You are outmatched!', 'Curs. You are outmatched!', 88767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You worms dare to oppose us?', 'You worms dare to oppose us?', 88766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A storm of iron comes!', 'A storm of iron comes!', 88765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can stop the Iron Horde!', 'Nothing can stop the Iron Horde!', 88764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wipe them out!', 'Wipe them out!', 88763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the iron hand of war!', 'We are the iron hand of war!', 88762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give them no quarter!', 'Give them no quarter!', 88761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t end well for you.', 'This won\'t end well for you.', 88760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to the enemies of the Warsong!', 88759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My brothers... will avenge me...', 88758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world don\'t give us nothing, $n. It be our lot to suffer... and our duty to fight back.$b$b\nThis Horde be our family! We don\'t always see eye-to-eye. We come to blows before. But when we work together - ah - there\'s nothing this Horde can\'t do.', '', 88757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"When unused, Aluneth must be allowed to return to its own plane.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', '\"When unused, Aluneth must be allowed to return to her own plane.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', 88756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Aluneth\'s power should be immediately apparent to any who wield it. Its subtleties, however, will only become more apparent with time.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', '\"Aluneth\'s power should be immediately apparent to any who wield her. Her subtleties, however, will only become more apparent with time.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', 88755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Aluneth is capricious. The entity must be quickly bound to her summoner before its curiosity leads it astray.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', '\"Aluneth is capricious. She must be quickly bound to her summoner before her curiosity leads her astray.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', 88754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Aluneth will defy those who attempt to wield it. The greatstaff\'s willful spirit must first be broken.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', '\"Aluneth will defy those who attempt to wield her. The greatstaff\'s willful spirit must first be broken.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', 88753, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The great staff Aluneth resides in a plane unreachable by all except the most skilled arcanists. Archmage Rentarric was the first to summon it. I was the last.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', '\"The great staff Aluneth resides in a plane unreachable by all except the most skilled arcanists. Archmage Rentarric was the first to summon her. I was the last.\"$b$b- Magna Aegwynn', 88752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leaf me alone!', '', 88751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re going in, could you say a kind hello to Damarcus and Vessup at the main gate for me? They must miss me.', '', 88750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond this point is Stormshield Stronghold. I suggest you stay away if you aren\'t too keen in battle.', '', 88749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M UNSTOPPABLE!', '', 88748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... uh oh...', '', 88747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Cast the spell to summon Aluneth.>', '<Cast the spell to summon Aluneth.>', 88746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The book is filled with spells - some strange, many familiar. One spell, in particular, is of special interest.>', '', 88745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chris Clarkie rewards handsomely if you bring him some Tauren Hooves.$B$BI don\'t know why.', 88744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have any spare Artifact Fragments, $n? My friend Ecilam could use them.', 88743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can\'t be stopped!', 88742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tectus directs his Crystalline Barrage towards you!', 'Tectus directs his Crystalline Barrage towards you!', 88741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind. I feel there is an enemy more worthy of my rage.', 'I\'ve changed my mind. I feel there is an enemy more worthy of my rage.', 88740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarves are integral to the Alliance as they are the builders of war machines. For this reason alone they must all be slain. Show no mercy, as none will be shown to you.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night elves, conspirators one and all. The night elf invaders must be crushed and sent back to their moon gods!$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, that\'s a fine one, commander. I\'ll get \'er back to the stables now.', '', 88737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheers, commander. We found this Iron Star here just waitin\' to be repaired, and Gazlowe over there has been helpin\' me fix it up.\n\nIt should be ready for action when you are.\n\nKhadgar said he\'d meet ya down by the harbor with the others. I\'m a wee bit jealous that ya get to roll over some Iron Horde in this thing.', '', 88736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks. I\'ll meet them at the docks.', 'Thanks. I\'ll meet them at the docks.', 88735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, check this thing out. We found an Iron Star and Thaelin over there has been helping me get it fully operational.\n\nI think it\'s ready for action, if you want to give it a test roll.\n\nKhadgar and the others said they\'d meet you at the entrance to the harbor. Maybe run over any Iron Horde you encounter along the way for kicks.', '', 88734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 3000, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whether an aberration of nature or a cruel joke by the gods of your world, gnomes have no business living. Their extinction will clear the way for a more powerful species to rise. You must be the instrument of their demise!$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren had a choice to serve in your mighty army, but instead opted to betray the Horde and join the enemy. Now they aid the draenei in their mission to kill all orcs. The traitorous pandaren of the Alliance must be exterminated.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These worgen that have invaded our lands share the same ferocity and animal instincts of the native saberon, but with none of their survival sense. Let their deaths serve as a lesson to the rest of this so called \"Alliance.\"$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve done it, $n! K\'ara\'s energy has destroyed what\'s left of the Iron Horde army.$B$BWe are safe.', 88729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will hold the Temple. I will not accept any other outcome.', 88728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all night elves from the face of Draenor.', 'I swear to eradicate all night elves from the face of Draenor.', 88727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all gnomes from the face of Draenor. And hopefully the rest of the known universe.', 'I swear to eradicate all gnomes from the face of Draenor. And hopefully the rest of the known universe.', 88726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all worgen from the face of Draenor.', 'I swear to eradicate all worgen from the face of Draenor.', 88725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all dwarves from the face of Draenor.', 'I swear to eradicate all dwarves from the face of Draenor.', 88724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all pandaren from the face of Draenor.', 'I swear to eradicate all pandaren from the face of Draenor.', 88723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear to eradicate all draenei from the face of Draenor.', 'I swear to eradicate all draenei from the face of Draenor.', 88722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lasso breaks! The beast got away!', 'The lasso breaks! The beast got away!', 88721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenei...$B$B<Raza\'kul spits.>$B$BYou would do all denizens of this world a great service by ridding these lands of draenei.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fine choice. Humans are a blight upon this world and must be destroyed or driven out of Draenor.$B$BThe path before you will be beset on all sides by those that would seek to stop you in your righteous mission. There can be only one outcome: victory or death.$B$BAre you certain about this choice?', '', 88719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have selected pandaren as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 'You have selected pandaren as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 88718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have selected dwarf as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 'You have selected dwarf as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 88717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have selected worgen as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 'You have selected worgen as your nemesis.\n\nAre you sure?', 88716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
