('Want bodyguard? You not need one, but I can help you kill stuff.', '', 88649, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must inform Warchief Vol\'jin. Keep alert, $c. Dark times lie ahead.', '', 88648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in Archaeology.', 'Train me in Archaeology.', 88647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Reliquary guys look like they mean business.\n\nTo me, that sounds very bad for business.', 88646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you mad?', '', 88645, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food! Please, take my spell scroll, I no longer have need of it.', 'Food! Please, take my spell scroll, I no longer have need of it.', 88644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fair enough, ten. And I wouldn\'t try any funny business if I were you. Nobody wants in bad with the Cartel.', '', 88643, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy pal, how \'bout I give you a nice discount and you can be on your way. How does five percent sound?', '', 88642, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen, you green little twerp! You\'ll hand over the artifacts or we will be forced to take them!', '', 88641, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That still doesn\'t answer my question.', '', 88640, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde needs those artifacts! We must study them if we wish to gain the upper hand in this war.', '', 88639, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my experience, \'priceless\' just means really expensive. What do you expect me to do, give them away?', '', 88638, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Business?! These are priceless artifacts that you\'re offloading here!', '', 88637, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! What\'s the big deal trying to bring your goons in here to stop my business?', '', 88636, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go find my artifact!', 'I\'m ready to go find my artifact!', 88635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will reseal the Tomb of Sargeras and defeat the Burning Legion.', '', 88634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In this circle of blood only glory matters! Throw the broken bones of your enemies upon the altar and a conqueror\'s tribute will be yours.', '', 88633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Murg guy is great. It\'s a real inspiration watching him yell at those peons.\n\nMaybe after we get off this rock, I\'ll acquire his services for some of my operations.', '', 88632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need help! How can I defeat that monstrosity?', 'I need help! How can I defeat that monstrosity?', 88631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murg used to be a peon just like these orcs, but I got to be the best stone cracker out there!\n\nNow, they give Murg the name \"Stonecrack\" and lets me boss around these little guys. It\'s the best job, I tell ya!', '', 88630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will defeat it for you.', 'I will defeat it for you.', 88629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The damned thing has a powerful enchantment on it. Sure, a powerful mage might be able to |cFF0000FF[Steal its Spell]|r somehow, but I\'m just a guy with a broom...', 'The damned thing has a powerful enchantment on it. Sure, a powerful mage might be able to |cFF0000FF[Steal its Spell]|r somehow, but I\'m just a guy with a broom...', 88628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master has asked me to clear the vermin out of the lyceum. This one particular rat, however, has me completely vexed.', 'The master has asked me to clear the vermin out of the lyceum. This one particular rat, however, has me completely vexed.', 88627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need help! How can I get past these walls?', 'I need help! How can I get past these walls?', 88626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find a way past the walls.', 'I will find a way past the walls.', 88625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Children grow so fast. |cFF0000FF[Blink]|r twice and they\'re all grown up...', 'Children grow so fast. |cFF0000FF[Blink]|r twice and they\'re all grown up...', 88624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really should go put my daughter to sleep. It\'s centuries past her bedtime.$b$bI can\'t seem to get past these walls, though. What\'s a parent to do?', 'I really should go put my daughter to sleep. It\'s centuries past her bedtime.$b$bI can\'t seem to get past these walls, though. What\'s a parent to do?', 88623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need help! What can I possibly do to feed a hungry companion?', 'I need help! What can I possibly do to feed a hungry companion?', 88622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will get you some food.', 'I will get you some food.', 88621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... you look like a conjurer, of sorts. You must have a way to |cFF0000FF[Conjure Refreshments]|r for me...', 'Hmm... you look like a conjurer, of sorts. You must have a way to |cFF0000FF[Conjure Refreshments]|r for me...', 88620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My stomach growls louder and louder with each passing year. I could really use a bite to eat.$b$bI might even be convinced to give my scroll to you if you could help me sate this hunger.', 'My stomach growls louder and louder with each passing year. I could really use a bite to eat.$b$bI might even be convinced to give my scroll to you if you could help me sate this hunger.', 88619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
