('What kind of fish is that? I have never seen anything like that before, get over here and let me check it out!', 'What kind of fish is that? I have never seen anything like that before, get over here and let me check it out!', 87948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 87947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will know pain...', 87946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
