('Much thanks again, mon, for gettin\' me back my gear. \n\nNow da fishes don\'t stand a chance against Abu\'gar!', '', 87855, 0, 28630, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
