('Are you ready to join up, Nat? I can\'t wait for you to join the team!', 'Are you ready to join up, Nat? I can\'t wait for you to join the team!', 87588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you need, commander?', 87587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a way to finish under construction garrison buildings instantly.', 'I need a way to finish under construction garrison buildings instantly.', 87586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a set of blueprints for all of the Tier 1 and Tier 2 buildings.', 'I need a set of blueprints for all of the Tier 1 and Tier 2 buildings.', 87585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get another Hookshot Bait?', 'Can I get another Hookshot Bait?', 87584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Let\'s catch some fish!', 'What are you waiting for? Let\'s catch some fish!', 87583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upgrade my garrison to the next tier.', 'Upgrade my garrison to the next tier.', 87582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Create a garrison for me.', 'Create a garrison for me.', 87581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, I have no interest in lumber or the collection of wood.$b$bSee me when you have completed your tasks with the Iron Horde, and perhaps after you have gained more experience in combat.$b$bWith a bit of coin I could have this lumber yard removed and replaced with a sparring arena you would be proud of.', '', 87580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want a garrison.$B$BI know.', '', 87579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build a Lumber Yard instead.', 'Build a Lumber Yard instead.', 87578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not much use in a sparring arena. But if ya fancy a lumber yard, I\'m yer dwarf.$b$bCome see me when you are a bit more experienced an\' finished your Iron Horde vendetta.', '', 87577, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That sparring arena of yours is way too sweaty and violent for my tastes.$b$bNow, if you want something that is more practical, then I got what ye need!$b$bWe could build a big ol\' lumber yard with what I got in me mole machine.$b$bI think I even have the schematics for a goblin mechano-shredder.$b$bYou get the coin together an\' I can build it for ya.', '', 87576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build the Sparring Arena instead.', 'Build the Sparring Arena instead.', 87575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, Gorgrond is a hardy place. If you let it, it can shape you into a weapon.$b$BSpeak with me if you grow tired of chopping down trees.$b$BWith a bit of coin we can replace this lumber yard with a prized sparring arena.', '', 87574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Centurions Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Sentinels Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Cohorts Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Mage-Lords Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Arcanists Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Elementalists Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorian Bruisers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 87567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rally Score Earned!', 'Rally Score Earned!', 87566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We will be back... you cannot stop us...', '', 87565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may be wounded but you will find us strong still!', '', 87564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps your corpse will distract the gronn!', '', 87563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think to take advantage of us while we recover? Think again fool!', '', 87562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would think so many gronn would be here? Our scouts should be broken for this!', '', 87561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust Greldrok, he will get us out of this... mess...', '', 87560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once I get this thing working we\'ll be able to clear-cut this island in no time flat.\n\nLasers, baby!', '', 87559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish fall down the waterfall and right to my bait.$B$BI hope to share my catch with Tega back at camp. She is... ferocious.', 'Fish fall down the waterfall and right to my bait.$B$BI hope to share my catch with Tega back at camp. She is... ferocious.', 87558, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rexxar is not quick to trust, is he? It is lucky that you happened upon us when you did.', 87557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Laughing Skull will rise again!', '', 87556, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will make it.  Greldrok has a way of getting out of these things...', '', 87555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taming these gronn is stupid... we should rely on our own strength!', '', 87554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I heal, the gronn will pay...', '', 87553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me... I will only slow you down... Lok\'tar...', '', 87552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I needed for?', '', 87551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just stepped on me like an ant...', '', 87550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was brave... wasn\'t I?', '', 87549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to requisition my seal for the week.', 'I\'d like to requisition my seal for the week.', 87548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the entrance soldiers! Once the gronn lose interest we will move out!', '', 87547, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for that!', 'You will pay for that!', 87546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go fishing!', 'Let\'s go fishing!', 87545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I made it! This place is a long way from home!', 'I made it! This place is a long way from home!', 87544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Exarch Council is the \"Hand of the Prophet.\" We represent the draenei people, and act as the Prophet\'s messengers, enforcers, and conscience.', '', 87543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you Nat Pagle?  I have been looking all over for you!', 'Are you Nat Pagle?  I have been looking all over for you!', 87542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mirin\'?', '', 87541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this \"Nat Pagle\" character?', 'What can you tell me about this \"Nat Pagle\" character?', 87540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may commune with Gro the Uncreator.', 'You may commune with Gro the Uncreator.', 87539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have never heard of Nat Pagle? The man is a legend!\n\nNat has traveled the world over, always looking for the biggest catch! Speaking of big catches, I bet there are some huge catches for us out here in Draenor. If only we could get Nat to come out here and teach us the way...  Keep working on that fishing skill and come back to me when you are fully trained.', 'You have never heard of Nat Pagle? The man is a legend!\n\nNat has traveled the world over, always looking for the biggest catch! Speaking of big catches, I bet there are some huge catches for us out here in Draenor. If only we could get Nat to come out here and teach us the way...  Keep working on that fishing skill and come back to me when you are fully trained.', 87538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever heard of Nat Pagle? No? Well come over here and let me tell you about him!', 'Have you ever heard of Nat Pagle? No? Well come over here and let me tell you about him!', 87537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just because I have a shield doesn\'t mean you have to run!', 'Just because I have a shield doesn\'t mean you have to run!', 87536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just try to get through my shield. I dare you!', 'Just try to get through my shield. I dare you!', 87535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attacks are no match for my armor!', 'Your attacks are no match for my armor!', 87534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shield has never been broken!', 'My shield has never been broken!', 87533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My attacks never miss their mark.', 'My attacks never miss their mark.', 87532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I strike without hesitation!', 'I strike without hesitation!', 87531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got something better than weapons - magic!', 'I\'ve got something better than weapons - magic!', 87530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t need mana to take you down!', 'I don\'t need mana to take you down!', 87529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel my spell\'s wrath!', 'Feel my spell\'s wrath!', 87528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll have to get through me first!', 'You\'ll have to get through me first!', 87527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold them off while you take them down!', 'I\'ll hold them off while you take them down!', 87526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get behind me! Quickly!', 'Get behind me! Quickly!', 87525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t avoid my shots forever!', 'You can\'t avoid my shots forever!', 87524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Moving targets... my favorite!', 'Moving targets... my favorite!', 87523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand close! Healing is on its way!', 'Stand close! Healing is on its way!', 87522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel healing\'s touch upon you.', 'Feel healing\'s touch upon you.', 87521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skills are no match for my blade.', 'Your skills are no match for my blade.', 87520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strikes are swift and true.', 'My strikes are swift and true.', 87519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade\'s edge will cut right through you!', 'My blade\'s edge will cut right through you!', 87518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the healing mend your wounds.', 'May the healing mend your wounds.', 87517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 87516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 87515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash you... into mountain.', '', 87514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RRRRRRRRRrrooaaaarrr...', '', 87513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your ground! Show the Iron Horde that we will not be broken!', '', 87512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with all of your might for each inch of the battlefield!', '', 87507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teach the Iron Horde the value of cold steel!', '', 87503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with courage and victory will be ours!', '', 87502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Push back the Iron Horde with all your strength!', '', 87496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold the line! Do not let the Iron Horde break your ranks!', '', 87495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To battle!', 'To battle!', 87494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow my lead!', 'Follow my lead!', 87493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon then! Battles don\'t start every day, you know!', 'C\'mon then! Battles don\'t start every day, you know!', 87492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First one to fifty kills wins!', 'First one to fifty kills wins!', 87491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand together! We fight as one!', 'We stand together! We fight as one!', 87489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold just a little longer!', 'Hold just a little longer!', 87488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! I\'ll cover you!', 'Go! I\'ll cover you!', 87487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that fighting?', 'You call that fighting?', 87486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only you put up more of a fight!', 'If only you put up more of a fight!', 87485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is how it ends...', 'So this is how it ends...', 87484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove allegiance to your guild by conquering all the dungeons in Draenor with your guild mates.  Once you complete this task, you may purchase Garrison Guild Banners from the Guild Vendor.\n\nCome see me once you have acquired the item and I will help you display guild banners in your Garrison for all to see.', 'Prove allegiance to your guild by conquering all the dungeons in Draenor with your guild mates.  Once you complete this task, you may purchase Garrison Guild Banners from the Guild Vendor.\n\nCome see me once you have acquired the item and I will help you display guild banners in your Garrison for all to see.', 87483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, I can find rest.', 'Finally, I can find rest.', 87482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people.  What have they done?', 'My people.  What have they done?', 87481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last... freedom.', 'At long last... freedom.', 87480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings to you stranger, you have my thanks.', 'Blessings to you stranger, you have my thanks.', 87479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta be careful in Gorgrond, even in the sky!', '', 87478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde have no idea how much potential lies within the artifact. Let us give them a proper demonstration, shall we?', 87477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can stop us now that we have the artifact. Come, let us paint these rocks with their blood!', '', 87476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t be a problem.', 'This won\'t be a problem.', 87475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am needed urgently at the Iron Docks.', 'I am needed urgently at the Iron Docks.', 87474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fantastic choice! I\'ll go ahead and head on to your garrison.', 87473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold just a little longer!', 'Hold just a little longer!', 87472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have trained harder!', 'You should have trained harder!', 87471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall rule the skies, and all the lands below them!', '', 87470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SKRAWWAWWW!!', '', 87469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is over, their defenses are shattered. We have won this battle, but without the artifact we have far to go. Let us rally back at your outpost, commander. We must plan our next course of attack.', 87467, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 44742, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us rally back at your outpost, commander. We must plan our next course of attack.', 87466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is over, their defenses are shattered. We have won this battle, but without the artifact we have far to go.', 87465, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 45563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With pleasure.', 87464, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 44741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With pleasure.', 87463, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 45562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The artifact... What has he done?! We must restore it, we must get it to safety!', 87461, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 45561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brace yourself, champion. The light is with you. I will not let you fall.', 87459, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 45560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will never surrender to you! Champion, now is the time! Use the artifact!', 87457, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 45559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahaha! Not so confident now, are we?! Face me on even ground, cowards!', '', 87456, 0, 0, 574, 68, 0, 46593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! I will DIE before I let you take what is mine! YOU... WILL NOT... WIN... THIS... WAR! AAARRRRGHH!', '', 87455, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 46592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGH... UNBELIEVEABLE! You will DIE for your insolence! I\'LL TEAR YOU LIMB FROM LIMB!', '', 87454, 0, 0, 53, 68, 0, 46591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gronnlings, attack!', '', 87453, 0, 0, 25, 68, 0, 46590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RELEASE THE IRON STARS!', '', 87452, 0, 0, 273, 68, 0, 46589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never withstand the might of Goc!', '', 87451, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 46588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See what weapons I have in my arsenal!', '', 87450, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 46587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha, so be it! IRON HORDE, ADVANCE!', '', 87449, 0, 0, 574, 68, 0, 46586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a shame that you\'re too late to stop me. Surrender the artifact, and I will allow you to escape with your lives.', '', 87448, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 46585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, there it is. There\'s MY artifact. How foolish of me to trust Brak with something so valuable.', '', 87447, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 46584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood shall become sap.', '', 87446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your body will serve us in death.', '', 87445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you enter our sacred grove.', '', 87444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burners and usurpers!', '', 87443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More invaders?', '', 87442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
