('My brother must be brought to justice!', '', 87438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you got for sale?', 'What have you got for sale?', 87437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is quaint. It reminds me of the servant\'s quarters in my summer retreat on the shores of Lordamere Lake - only more rustic. And dirtier.$B$BPerhaps you should make an investment in some of Barov Industries\' wares to secure this make-shift tree fort before a light breeze topples the structure.', '', 87436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me up to Cragplume Cauldron.', 'Take me up to Cragplume Cauldron.', 87435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! I\'m scouting for danger.', 87434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gorian Empire will... prevail...', '', 87433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde will fight on without me!', '', 87432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But who... will stop... the White Kraken...', '', 87431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain... so exquisite...', '', 87430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me down to the ground.', 'Take me down to the ground.', 87429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have already discovered hundreds of new species here on Draenor. There is so much to study, so much to collect, so much to catalog!', '', 87428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The White Kraken could attack at any time! I need those mines loaded now!', '', 87427, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want the head of the orc that dumped those mines into the harbor!', '', 87426, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s Wicked Curse has found a more suitable host and jumps to $n.', '%s\'s Wicked Curse has found a more suitable host and jumps to $n.', 87425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build the Fight Club instead.', 'Build the Fight Club instead.', 87424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xuk...', '', 87423, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trees? Bah! Why rebuild when we can destroy!$b$bI can show you and your soldiers tricks no shredder could compete with.$b$bCome back when you are older and have some coin, and we\'ll get ourselves a proper fight club going.', '', 87422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! It is working! The spirits were right!', '', 87421, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits of the Laughing Skull have spoken. We must join together to fight our common enemy, the Iron Horde!', '', 87420, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gro the Uncreator, I call to you!', '', 87419, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you find anything on O\'rok\'s body? A letter perhaps? Or some orders?', 87418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you like scars?', 87417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, what a great question.  Let me write that one down.', 87416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any pet stuff for sale?', 'Any pet stuff for sale?', 87415, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nevermind!', 'Nevermind!', 87414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pursue Garona!', 'Pursue Garona!', 87413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kid, don\'t start with me.', 87412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone else asked me that once... just once.', 87411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Lio growls softly.>', 87410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
