('Build the Lumber Yard instead.', 'Build the Lumber Yard instead.', 87405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this whole fight club thing just isn\'t my style. I\'m more of a rip the trees down with a homemade giant mechanical monster kind of gal.$b$bIf you change your mind later, come talk to me and I can flip this fight club out of your way and replace it with a nice big rompin\' lumber camp! Complete with its own shredder!$b$bOf course, that ain\'t gonna be cheap.', 87404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, I can\'t heal your pets right now.  I can help if you come back in a few minutes.\n\n(You cannot heal your pets within 3 minutes of logging in.)', 'Sorry, I can\'t heal your pets right now.  I can help if you come back in a few minutes.\n\n(You cannot heal your pets within 3 minutes of logging in.)', 87403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
