('It is done. Meet me at Lithic\'s Rest.', '', 87150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will darken the skies, and all will fall!', '', 87149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me, $n! My life force is fading!', '', 87148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect me, $n! Sethe\'s blood is harmful to all who cross its path.', '', 87147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to join Anzu in his fight with Sethe?', 'Are you ready to join Anzu in his fight with Sethe?', 87146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready Anzu, we will not fail.', 'I am ready Anzu, we will not fail.', 87145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to fight Sethe, $r?', '', 87144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I dwelt in the shadows. I can hide no longer.', '', 87143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn The Barbarian!', 'You have drawn The Barbarian!', 87142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn The Warp!', 'You have drawn The Warp!', 87141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn The Herd!', 'You have drawn The Herd!', 87140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn The Void!', 'You have drawn The Void!', 87139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Swiftness!', 'You have drawn Swiftness!', 87138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Vulnerability!', 'You have drawn Vulnerability!', 87137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Frailty!', 'You have drawn Frailty!', 87136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Nimbleness!', 'You have drawn Nimbleness!', 87135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Devastation!', 'You have drawn Devastation!', 87134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have drawn Wrath!', 'You have drawn Wrath!', 87133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaz! Kaz! Kaz! This no-mask took me on an adventure! We saw infested orcs, a green ogron, and we set everything on FIRE!', '', 87132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh good, you\'re back! Enjoy yourself in there?', '', 87131, 0, 0, 70, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch Maladaar has opened his weapon stores to any willing to lend their hand to the battle.', '', 87130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you soon! Hehehe...', '', 87129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this place. The botani are monsters.$b$bI think I am starting to see why the Laughing Skull are as brutal as they are.', 87128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The door... do you see it? I...', '', 87127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SEE IT!', '', 87126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secret seeker it\'s a - NO! No-no-no...', '', 87125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrgrhlflffbrrrr...thhpppttpt', '', 87124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Row... roads... row-ads heh heh', '', 87123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyaaana na na na... haha', '', 87122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... heheh... hah', '', 87121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ergh... mfmff...', '', 87120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MOGOR CANNOT DIE!!!', '', 87119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Mogor... cannot die...', '', 87118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna steal the Statement of Subordination!', '', 87117, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to join the Sargerei.', 'I\'d like to join the Sargerei.', 87116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This note appears to have fallen off the crate. It reads:\n\n\"Caution. Contents extremely dangerous and unpredictable. Do not tamper with or compromise shipping containers.\"', '', 87115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry, Garona. We will find another way.', '', 87114, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You - you\'re right. Gul\'dan has butchered her mind already.', '', 87113, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t even know what you\'re fighting for anymore.', 87112, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But she knows...', '', 87111, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar, stop! What\'s the difference between this and torture?', 87110, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s grasps her head.', 87109, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TELL ME!', '', 87108, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage...', 87107, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is he hiding?', '', 87106, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argghgh - he - will undo you -', 87105, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You first. Where is Gul\'dan!?', '', 87104, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn... in a thousand... hells...', 87103, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is your master? Tell me!', '', 87102, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44942, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s reels in pain.', 87101, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here to kill you, assassin.', '', 87100, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just kill me and be done with it, archmage.', 87099, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me. Gul\'dan will not give up control of his pet without a fight.', '', 87098, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so the foundry falls! You\'ve got the Iron Horde on the run, commander.', '', 87097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I maintain a pair of goblin jumper cables for just such an emergency. Are you well, commander?', '', 87096, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It worked.', 87095, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Pinchwhistle Gearworks.', 'Take me to the Pinchwhistle Gearworks.', 87094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go!', '', 87093, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They assault your foundry. They murder your allies. Mine is the only way.', '', 87092, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told you - get out!', '', 87091, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Grommash. Drink.', '', 87090, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I draw my strength, from the HEART of Draenor...', '', 87089, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This magic is extremely reliable and - maybe a tiny bit fatal. Hold still, I said!', '', 87088, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, stand perfectly still.', '', 87087, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck, champion. Be careful in that foundry!', 87086, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be keeping my eyes on you.', 87085, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may not share my husband\'s enthusiasm for fish, but I am happy that we will have enough food for a while.', 87084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Am I seeing stars? Nope, it\'s just another great contender for the Firebird\'s Challenge!', 87083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great prizes await, just a fuse away!', 87082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fly high in the sky with the Firebird\'s Challenge!', 87081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, you look like someone that might enjoy strapping a dozen fireworks to their back!', 87080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today has been a great day for fishing! Now we can have fish for every meal!', '', 87079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hand over a game token and I\'ll strap one of our newfangled \"Firebird\"-class fireworks to your back. You\'ll be launched up high in the air and sprout wings of flame!$B$BNow here\'s the tricky part: you only have 10 seconds of flight, and there are a bunch of fiery rings scattered around the fairgrounds. Each ring you pass through will count towards your total of collected rings, and most importantly, will give you another 10 seconds of flight.$B$BCollect 15 rings and the prizes are yours! But if you fail to collect enough rings, it will cost you another token!', 'Hand over a game token and I\'ll strap one of our newfangled \"Firebird\"-class fireworks to your back. You\'ll be launched up high in the air and sprout wings of flame!$B$BNow here\'s the tricky part: you only have 10 seconds of flight, and there are a bunch of fiery rings scattered around the fairgrounds. Each ring you pass through will count towards your total of collected rings, and most importantly, will give you another 10 seconds of flight.$B$BCollect 15 rings and the prizes are yours! But if you fail to collect enough rings, it will cost you another token!', 87078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome! We\'ve got a special delivery of \"Firebird\"-class fireworks ready to strap to your back and send you soaring in search of rings and glory!', 87077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friend needs them. The hardest trials are yet to come.', '', 87076, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These are dangerous forces you\'re working with, archmage.', 87075, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Omnivus, al-vitrade! Arcanum totalus!', '', 87074, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 47377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power once reserved for the Sorcerer Kings, I place in your hands.', '', 87073, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, this way. This will only hurt - well, quite a bit actually.', '', 87072, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep protecting our archmage, Commander. We\'d be lost without him.', 87071, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 46449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard you\'ve also been working with the Horde. The rest of the Council of Six wouldn\'t approve. I don\'t.', 87070, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 46448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I work with the best.', '', 87069, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 44925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Commander. You\'re an asset to the Alliance.', 87068, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 46447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stubborn old man!', 87067, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 46446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not the first time I\'ve disagreed with the council and it won\'t be the last.', '', 87066, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rest of the Council of Six doesn\'t want the Horde anywhere near Kirin Tor business.', 87065, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 46445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re worlds away from the conflict in Azeroth. I need all the help I can find.', '', 87064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you\'ve been working with the Horde.', 87063, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 46444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to fly! |cFF0008E8(Darkmoon Game Token)|r', 'Ready to fly! |cFF0008E8(Darkmoon Game Token)|r', 87062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No - no priest. Cordana, stitch me up.', '', 87061, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years I was enslaved by the Bloodmaul deep within their mines, but no longer.', 'For years I was enslaved by the Bloodmaul deep within their mines, but no longer.', 87060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodmaul ogres are relentless. They stop at nothing to maintain their workforce.', 'The Bloodmaul ogres are relentless. They stop at nothing to maintain their workforce.', 87059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am freed, but others are still captive. I shall avenge my brothers and sisters when the time is right.$B$BThe Bloodmaul do not realize what is coming.', 'I am freed, but others are still captive. I shall avenge my brothers and sisters when the time is right.$B$BThe Bloodmaul do not realize what is coming.', 87058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This wound is grisly. You should see a priest.', 87057, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s groans in pain.', '', 87056, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be still, Khadgar. Garona\'s dagger was enchanted.', 87055, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, champion! We got the murder weapon just in time.', 87054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I play Firebird\'s Challenge?', 'How do I play Firebird\'s Challenge?', 87053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gul\'dan takes what he wants. Always. I am nothing.', 87052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re too late. Nothing can save your Archmage now.', 87051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better kill me quick. You don\'t have much time.', 87050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still on your feet? You\'re a tough one!', 87049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The poison is like fire in your veins, isn\'t it? Don\'t worry - it\'ll all be over soon!', 87048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Got you!', 87047, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 44465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trail ends! Where did she go...?', 87046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Following my trail? You\'re strong AND crafty. I LOVE a good hunt.', 87045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come out into the open, \"hero.\" Let me get a good look at you.', 87044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a brave one, coming after me all alone...', 87043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will stay with the archmage and find help. Quickly! Capture Garona!', 87042, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 44148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion - The archmage!', 87041, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mage. Your death will be excruciatingly slow. I only wish I could be there to enjoy it.', '', 87040, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage, look ou-', 87039, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your clumsy magic works both ways. I have also found you.', '', 87038, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you know how this ends. Give yourself up.', '', 87037, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been inquiring about you, \"Khadgar.\" It would seem we have a history.', '', 87036, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have found you!', '', 87035, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! The human mage from Tanaan...', '', 87034, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...there! Gul\'dan! He is -', '', 87033, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, come, come... I will find you...', '', 87032, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes are open: Val\'mir, khar abra, mal ozymius...', '', 87031, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have him where we want him!', '', 87030, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mines are sweltering. The heat permeates through everything. I had no energy to move, yet somehow I was able to work countless days without rest.$B$BI would never wish what I went through on another being. It was unbearable...', 'The mines are sweltering. The heat permeates through everything. I had no energy to move, yet I worked countless days without rest.', 87029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage, be careful.', 87028, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan will NOT be able to hide from my gaze this time.', '', 87027, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marvelous... we have everything we need!', '', 87026, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sorcerer King comes from a long lineage of terror. To crush him in battle was no small feat.', '', 87025, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let down your guard, my friend. The ogres of this era are not all brainless brutes. Some among them are dangerously clever.', '', 87024, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, I should\'ve mentioned that you would be... slightly killed.', '', 87023, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold out your hand, and step into the light!', '', 87022, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you. Let us augment the power of that ring of yours...', '', 87021, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have to tear artifacts from the very heart of the Ogre Empire.', '', 87020, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mines are an unspeakable place.', 'The mines are an unspeakable place.', 87019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know now how to defeat Gul\'dan\'s magic and reveal the Shadow Council. But we\'ll need more power.', '', 87018, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those ogres treated us like dirt. They enslaved our people, forced them to work and slaughtered our kind for their own enjoyment.', 'Those ogres treated us like dirt. They enslaved our people, forced them to work and slaughtered our kind for their own enjoyment.', 87017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am forever indebted to those who set me free.', 'I am forever indebted to those who set me free.', 87016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good night, my time-lost prince.', 87015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kairoz created this world. We will use his power to find Gul\'dan within it.', '', 87014, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many were lost inside the mines...$B$BI barely escaped, but so many are still enslaved.', 'So many were lost inside the mines...$B$BI barely escaped, but so many are still enslaved.', 87013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory! Champion, you did it!', '', 87012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...it\'s okay. We have all the time in the world.', 87011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...we\'ll have to try that again.', 87010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...I fixed it.', 87009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
