('I\'m going to try to counter Morakh\'s spell.', '', 86863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ain\'t nuthin\' better than ridin\' the ol\' red rocket!', 86862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spell has been nullified. Our crystals pulse with vigorous energy once again.', '', 86861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good you are here, there is more trouble than even I can handle.', '', 86858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be able to get back to Karabor by the end of the week.', '', 86857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His powers were much greater than I anticipated.', '', 86856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... do you hear that?', '', 86855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hears the whispers growing, louder and louder as the secrets become overwhelming.', '', 86854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may take a moment.', '', 86853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filth! I\'ll send you back where you belong!', '', 86852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, I\'m in control of myself again! Thanks, friend!', 'Whoa, I\'m in control of myself again! Thanks, friend!', 86851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I doing here? I got to get somewhere safe!', 'What am I doing here? I got to get somewhere safe!', 86850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was like someone else was controlling my body.', 'It was like someone else was controlling my body.', 86849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh wow, my head hurts...', 'Oh wow, my head hurts...', 86848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes their commander!', '', 86847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron Horde Flame Tanks Destroyed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 'Iron Horde Flame Tanks Destroyed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 86846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you be looking to make a few more coppers there will be work for you at your garrison. I will take my leave. Find me there if you wish.', '', 86845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('+$1i VP', '+$1i VP', 86844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, thank you for the assistance, young peasant. Here is a token of my gratitude.', '', 86843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MMMMF! HELFFP!! STMUCK UMDER LOG!', '', 86842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N.U.K.U.L.A.R. Launch Detected', 'N.U.K.U.L.A.R. Launch Detected', 86841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll see about that!', '', 86840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frost is clearly the superior path. Give up!', '', 86839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad for the help, $c.', '', 86838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is power here. I will take it.', '', 86837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PLACEHOLDER] WORK WORK!', '', 86836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tink der\'s a woman stuck under der, boss! We gotta help her!', '', 86835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PLACEHOLDER] YOU GOT IT!', '', 86834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get that scared little girl out from under the log, $g sir:ma\'am;!', '', 86833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful out there, $c.', 86832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can wait no longer. The Talon King must return.', '', 86831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will await your return at the Throne of Elements.', '', 86830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to battle the Shadowmoon clan.', 'Prepare to battle the Shadowmoon clan.', 86828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have nothing to offer me enchanter. Let me return to my study.', '', 86827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The exit is just ahead!', '', 86826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to battle the Shadowmoon clan.', 'Prepare to battle the Shadowmoon clan.', 86825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 86824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The opening is just ahead!', '', 86823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will wait for you at the Throne of Elements. Be safe.', '', 86822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want, weakling?', '', 86821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me alone. Only one who is familiar with the art of enchanting will understand my dilemma.', '', 86820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outsider! I\'ll have your head!', '', 86819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn my body, it\'s the only way to stop them.', 86818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mustn\'t give them another host!', 86817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! They will take you too!', 86816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away! GET AWAY!', 86815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Surely the cold will make them wither?', 86814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, fire! Fire will burn away the contagion.', 86813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flee! The vines! They control us all!', 86812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... You can\'t... It\'s... I can\'t FIGHT IT!', 86811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must carry our strengths not just for ourselves, but for our people!', 'We must carry our strengths not just for ourselves, but for our people!', 86810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The people of Karabor will overcome the losses. The fate of our people will not succumb to the acts of savages.', 'The people of Karabor will overcome the losses. The fate of our people will not succumb to the acts of savages.', 86809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city is safe now.', 'The city is safe now.', 86808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like the pandaren to protect the garrison.', 'I would like the pandaren to protect the garrison.', 86807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. I would like the worgen to protect the garrison.', 'I do. I would like the worgen to protect the garrison.', 86806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like the draenei to protect the garrison.', 'I would like the draenei to protect the garrison.', 86805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like the gnomes to protect the garrison.', 'I would like the gnomes to protect the garrison.', 86804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are at your service, commander.', '', 86803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others think they can help. That\'s laughable. Only the might and the ferocity of the worgen can match these lands and protect your garrison. Don\'t you agree?', '', 86802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only say the word, commander, and the draenei will help to keep the peace.', '', 86801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gnomish infantry stands at the ready, commander!', 86800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of Ironforge is at your call, commander.', '', 86799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like the dwarves to protect the garrison.', 'I would like the dwarves to protect the garrison.', 86798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve completed the vehicle bays, which will allow us to make siege weaponry right here in the shop!$B$BAll we need are some resources, and in about a day\'s time we\'ll be able to deliver a high-powered weapon of destruction.$B$BThe siege weapon will be limited by its fuel consumption, so be sure to watch that gauge!', 'We\'ve completed the vehicle bays, which will allow us to make siege weaponry right here in the shop!$B$BAll we need are some resources, and in about a day\'s time we\'ll be able to deliver a high-powered weapon of destruction.$B$BThe siege weapon will be limited by its fuel consumption, so be sure to watch that gauge!', 86797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad that you asked! Our manufacture of the rare 7-sided wingnut have unlocked our most brilliant inventions yet!$B$BThe Prototype Chopper is the most rapid ground-faring vehicle we\'ve ever created, and comes with an explosive ejector seat.$B$BYou want to go faster? Try  the XD-57 \"Bullseye\" Guided Rocket Kit! It can\'t stop, or slow down, and explodes when it hits things!$B$BThe Sentry Turret Dispenser will rapidly build a turret capable of shredding your foes into a fine, fragrant mist.$B$BThe GG-117 Micro-Jetpack will allow you to rapidly leap from location to location, creating a explosion when you land.$B$BFinally, the N.U.K.U.L.A.R. Target Painter: select a location, and we\'ll launch a huge rocket capable of massive destruction!', 'I\'m glad that you asked! Our manufacture of the rare 7-sided wingnut have unlocked our most brilliant inventions yet!$B$BThe Prototype Chopper is the most rapid ground-faring vehicle we\'ve ever created, and comes with an explosive ejector seat.$B$BYou want to go faster? Try  the XD-57 \"Bullseye\" Guided Rocket Kit! It can\'t stop, or slow down, and explodes when it hits things!$B$BThe Sentry Turret Dispenser will rapidly build a turret capable of shredding your foes into a fine, fragrant mist.$B$BThe GG-117 Micro-Jetpack will allow you to rapidly leap from location to location, creating a explosion when you land.$B$BFinally, the N.U.K.U.L.A.R. Target Painter: select a location, and we\'ll launch a huge rocket capable of massive destruction!', 86796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This workshop is great! Each day we\'ll have a different invention available for you to try out. Right now we have the plans and machinery to make four inventions.$B$BThe Sticky Grenade is a grenade that... sticks to things. After a bit, it will explode for terrible damage!$B$BThe Pneumatic Power Glove can pull foes towards you or push them away, using the power of steam and magnets. It will automatically detect which feature to use, depending on your combat abilities.$B$BThe Robo-Rooster is based on the OOX technology we thoroughly tested in Azeroth, this robot fowl can also go berserk, furiously decimating foes!$B$BFinally, we\'ve packaged up a glider and rocket into the \"Skyterror\" P.D.S. The best in highly-explosive one-way travel!', 'This workshop is great! Each day we\'ll have a different invention available for you to try out. Right now we have the plans and machinery to make four inventions.$B$BThe Sticky Grenade is a grenade that... sticks to things. After a bit, it will explode for terrible damage!$B$BThe Pneumatic Power Glove can pull foes towards you or push them away, using the power of steam and magnets. It will automatically detect which feature to use, depending on your combat abilities.$B$BThe Robo-Rooster is based on the OOX technology we thoroughly tested in Azeroth, this robot fowl can also go berserk, furiously decimating foes!$B$BFinally, we\'ve packaged up a glider and rocket into the \"Skyterror\" P.D.S. The best in highly-explosive one-way travel!', 86795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about making vehicles.', 'Tell me about making vehicles.', 86794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What new inventions will be available now that we\'ve upgraded?', 'What new inventions will be available now that we\'ve upgraded?', 86793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With me, $p! We fight as wolves!', '', 86792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am with you, $p! We shall face this evil together!', '', 86791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Thank you, hero.  Today, we taste victory! Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 86790, 0, 0, 71, 68, 0, 48919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait then, Grommash. Wait, because we are coming for you.', '', 86789, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 48918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lay down your weapons, Grommash! Look around you. You are lost.', '', 86788, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 48917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle is finished. We\'ve pushed the Iron Horde army back to the gates.', 86786, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fell off yer glider right into me lap!', '', 86785, 0, 0, 213, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hands where I can see \'em, big \'n\' tall.', 86784, 0, 0, 213, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the protector of these forests. Time to die!', '', 86783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eternal darkness awaits!', '', 86782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The might of the forest will destroy you!', '', 86781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bones will be ground into fertile soil!', '', 86780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done!', '', 86779, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a moment, $n, please allow me to prepare the materials.', '', 86778, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about how inventions work.', 'Tell me about how inventions work.', 86777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, Commander! You will find today\'s glorious invention waiting for you on the workbench.', 'Greetings, Commander! You will find today\'s glorious invention waiting for you on the workbench.', 86776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, our rylak riders have weakened da magnaron, but we\'re pinned outside. We need ya help ta break inta da main compound.', '', 86775, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis battle is jus\' gettin\' started. Let no Iron Horde survive!', '', 86774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chirps excitedly and flutters away.', '', 86773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as I thought! There is an opening not far ahead!', '', 86772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for help from its mother.', '', 86771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, let\'s get in there!', 86770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart aches over the loss of K\'ure... but there is little time to mourn. We must find a way out of this place. Follow me!', '', 86769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K\'ure is transforming into a void god... and we are all that stands between it and the destruction of this land!', '', 86768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru... this cannot be!', '', 86767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a cool draft on my skin and the smell of earth and leaves... there must be an opening to the outside!', '', 86766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great furies must be informed of what has transpired here. Quickly, follow me!', '', 86765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Auchindoun is safe... for now. Fan out and find Teron\'gor and Gul\'dan.', 86764, 0, 26702, 603, 64, 0, 0, 45724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold fast, $n! The naaru is transforming into a void god... we have no choice but to stand and fight!', '', 86763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the elements... what has Cho\'gall done?', '', 86762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got dis $p!', '', 86761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You riding or biting today?', '', 86760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good that nobody touched my... work... here. I chose this place to avoid those who would intrude on my... collection...', 86759, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d you get up here? Harrison Jones didn\'t mention this adventure would be so... dangerous.', '', 86758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search him for the gavel.', 'Search him for the gavel.', 86757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was almost back to base with a sack of those artifact fragments when some Horde stole them from me. Watch your back at all times, $n.', '', 86756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, commander. It has been a pleasure seeing you in action.', 86755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goren teeth make an excellent tool for cutting through the thickest armor.', 86754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes berserk and begins to attack friend and foe alike!', '', 86753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOO!!', '', 86752, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void beckons for your soul!', '', 86751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Congratulations, hero. This victory is ours.', 86750, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 45528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, Grommash... then we will come for you.', 86749, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 45527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give up, Grommash! Look around you. You are beaten!', 86748, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 0, 45526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me, hero!', 86747, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Iron Horde is bad news. We need ta put a stop ta dis.', '', 86746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ya see Pazaztick, tell\'em Rokhan be lookin\' for him.', '', 86745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the rest of the army?', 'Where is the rest of the army?', 86744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doh! Me sorry for being stupid! STUPID ME! STUPID! STUPID! Choppy dis tree now, boss!', '', 86743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss, me not what dey call smart, but dis tree not right. Maybe we no chop dis one?', '', 86742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"High Seas\"', 'Play \"High Seas\"', 86741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Stormwind\"', 'Play \"Stormwind\"', 86740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"A Siege of Worlds\"', 'Play \"A Siege of Worlds\"', 86739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Heart of Pandaria\"', 'Play \"Heart of Pandaria\"', 86738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"The Shattering\"', 'Play \"The Shattering\"', 86737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Wrath of the Lich King\"', 'Play \"Wrath of the Lich King\"', 86736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"The Burning Legion\"', 'Play \"The Burning Legion\"', 86735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play \"Legends of Azeroth\"', 'Play \"Legends of Azeroth\"', 86734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, my, my... another delivery from Goggles\'. What\'s next? Flyin\' Alarm-o-Bots?', 86733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! Where did you come from? This thing isn\'t even hooked up yet!', 86732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
