('Our elders once spoke of the most ancient and powerful beasts on the western plains of Nagrand. We now have a trap with jaws that can rival any war wolf. Should you manage to bring down one of these beasts, the furs, meats, and leathers will last us for some time.', '', 86600, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have managed to create a trap that closes more tightly than the last. With this improved iron trap, you will be able to bring down the mighty boar and riverbeast.$B$BBoar and riverbeast meat are thick and tasty. We can make them into the perfect meal.', '', 86599, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
