('My research station is near the shore, not far from here. I\'ll wait for you there!', '', 86519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marybelle Walsh sent me to rescue you. Go and I\'ll protect you!', 'Marybelle Walsh sent me to rescue you. Go and I\'ll protect you!', 86518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure to meet you! My name is Dr. Hadley Ricard, and as you can see I seem to be in a pickle of sorts...$b$bI\'ve been taken captive by these podlings, and if my assessment of their intentions is correct... they mean to kill me and use my remains as fertilizer for their offspring!', '', 86517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have yet to fully unravel the mysteries of the Zangar fungi, but I am making great progress.$b$bIf my theories are correct, an understanding of the fungal strains in relation to the local ecology will teach us a great deal about the various species on Draenor!', '', 86516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry to disappoint you, but If you\'ve come to join up with the Nesingwary Safari then you\'re out of luck.$b$bThe safari has been put on hold while Hemet assists the Alliance and Horde in their fight against the Warsong.$b$bA shame really, this land is one of the most majestic and savage that I have ever laid eyes on.', 86515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re far from home, $r. For the right coin, I\'ll offer you a flight instead of an axe, but don\'t tarry.', 86514, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
