('', 'Quickly, draw it towards the flames!', 86423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 86422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got its attention!', 86421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal is lost! We must stop this beast before it can escape!', 86420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s puts a letter into the mailbox.', '%s puts a letter into the mailbox.', 86419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never make it out alive!', 'You\'ll never make it out alive!', 86418, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But do you know the power of my blade? The more it kills, the stronger it grows.', 86417, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! Not bad... for a rat that escaped its cage.', 86416, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will head to your garrison now, $n.', '', 86415, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready, Archmage.', 'I am ready, Archmage.', 86414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have your ring with you? Good! Are you ready?$b$bHold on to your helm, $c!', '', 86413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_halloween_rottenegg_01.blp:20|tXeri\'tac begins unleashing Toxic Spiderlings down on you!', '', 86412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coward.', 86411, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want to see how you fight.', 86410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for the Trial of Faith.', 'I\'m ready for the Trial of Faith.', 86409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we fightin\' hard or hardly fightin\' in this joint? Put some feeling into it, people!', '', 86408, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of mom and pop show is this? Get someone in that ring!', '', 86407, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t blame ya pal, you\'d probably be dead by now if you\'d gone through with it.', '', 86406, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear out, clear out. We have a tight schedule, folks.', '', 86405, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s the action at? I\'m falling asleep over here! Next!', '', 86404, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time\'s up, and time is money. Let\'s get movin\'!', '', 86403, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we have a no-show folks. Bring out the next fight!', '', 86402, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, alright, move along. No shame in not fightin\'. NEXT!', '', 86401, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am so sorry that I let my anger consume me father.', 86400, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to fight in the Blood Championship.', 'I\'m ready to fight in the Blood Championship.', 86399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_disruptingshout.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:169498|h[Deafening Shout]|h|r!', '', 86398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n. If you are ever in need of aid, please come back and see me.', 86397, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My poor assistant...', '', 86396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c? Oh, are you a sight for sore eyes.$b$bWe didn\'t expect to hit anything when digging through the ground like we were.', '', 86395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You already have, Kugra, you already have....', '', 86394, 0, 0, 579, 64, 0, 0, 0, 579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d sure hate to be on the end of one of those Burning Blade swords. Talk about painful.', '', 86393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, I swear to make you proud!', 86392, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe my allegiance to $n now. I will accompany $Ghim:her; on $Ghis:her; mission to confront this new Iron Horde threat.', '', 86391, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not good...', '', 86390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See what happens? Now your assistant is all burned up and dead. How does that make you feel?', '', 86389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kugra, you owe me no apologies! Please, honor me by taking up my hammer and continuing to fight!', '', 86388, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, boss.', '', 86387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I had no idea. I am so sorry that I let my anger consume me, father.', 86386, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some assistant you are. You need to learn to keep better tabs on your employees.', '', 86385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderlords wanted me to forge weapons to be used against our brothers and sisters.', '', 86384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kugra, you owe me no apologies! But now, I must ask that you continue my work here.', '', 86383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried, Kugra! They hunted me... tortured me....', '', 86382, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why didn\'t you try to flee!?', 86381, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderlords spared my life, but they forced me to work... forging weapons to be used against our own.', '', 86380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, Kugra... but, I wanted to help put an end to this miserable conflict.', '', 86379, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t understand why you had to go.', 86378, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The teleporter to the central platform is now active!', '', 86377, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, Kugra... but, I had to support our forces.', '', 86376, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was so angry when you didn\'t return. I couldn\'t understand why you had to leave.', 86375, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The barrier behind Exarch Hataaru slides open!', '', 86374, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The entrance to the main vestibule opens!', '', 86373, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You looking for a fight, champ?', '', 86372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Win or die, mon! Win or die! You can\'t be fleein\'!', '', 86370, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it on over to Ma back there, she\'ll grill you up a mean steak.', '', 86369, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the biggest, iron-est trap we could create, and it\'ll allow you to take down the largest beasts this world has to offer. Out in Nagrand you\'ll find the most powerful critters around. Trapping one of them will net you tons of the best materials!', '', 86368, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This trap\'s a sure sight more resilient than the last one. With the improved iron trap, you\'ll be able to take down boars and riverbeasts.$B$BBring us back a boar or riverbeast and ma back there will cook you up some of the tastiest grilled meat you\'ve ever had!', '', 86367, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you just pick up one of these traps I\'ve got right beside me here. Then, head on out to and find yourself a beast. You\'re looking for talbuk and elekk, but wolves and clefthooves can do in a pinch.$B$BAll you got to do is give the beast of your choice a whallop until it ain\'t got much fight left in it, then lead it into the trap. Be careful now, that trap can snap shut on your feet, too!$B$BBring the trap back to us, and we can turn it into materials. The type of creature you trap will determine what all we can get out of it: clefthooves and elekk produce the best leathers, while talbuks and wolves have the most fur.', '', 86366, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do with meat obtained from trapping?', 'What can I do with meat obtained from trapping?', 86365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about the deadly iron trap?', 'What about the deadly iron trap?', 86364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s new with the improved iron trap?', 'What\'s new with the improved iron trap?', 86363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me about trapping beasts?', 'Can you tell me about trapping beasts?', 86362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bein\' out here with so many different types makes me wonder if those Maclures are really so bad after all.', '', 86361, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma does the grillin\' around here. She can cook you up a mean flank!', '', 86360, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure wish we didn\'t have to live in this barn, not sure I\'ll ever get the smell out of my clothes.', '', 86359, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever seen one of those rylaks? Kinda wonder how one of them would taste.', '', 86358, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure is awful quiet out here at night, makes me miss the sounds of Goldshire in the distance.', '', 86357, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got a bit tired of Elwynn after so many years, and figured we should come on out and do our part.', '', 86356, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incredible work. The archmage would be lost without you!', 86355, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44155, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll find that dragon, dead or alive!', '', 86354, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azuka Bladefury emerges from the shadows!', '', 86353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s one to tell the kids about, folks. I haven\'t seen carnage like that in years!', '', 86352, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going... going... dead! Definitely dead. Oh, the humanity!', '', 86351, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right in the face! I could feel that one from here!', '', 86350, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wodin, toss me the scraper. It\'s a mess down here!', '', 86349, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a one-sided fight! Absolutely unfair. Not even remotely close!', '', 86348, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, for the love of... I just had this place cleaned! Can you kill a little bit neater next time?', '', 86347, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish him! Oh, wait, you did. All over the arena floor, too. We need a cleanup over here!', '', 86346, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even close, baby! What a slaughter!', '', 86345, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Blood Champion title fight BEGIN!', '', 86344, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up, ladies and gentle-ogres. Witness utter carnage and devastation in the one and only Ring of Blood! In this once in a lifetime battle for the coveted Blood Champion title we have $n from parts unknown versus Katsuo of the Burning Blade!', '', 86343, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you got what it takes, $n? Remember, once a battle starts you have to stay in the arena. It\'s life or death!', '', 86342, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent, more raw materials!', '', 86341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It cannot be! My wings have failed me once again...', '', 86340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n. Allow me to return you safely to the surface.', '', 86339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wings were taken from me once. You will not take them again!', '', 86338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grom\'kar archers, fire at will!', 86336, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LUG\'DOL! What dis little thing do to you?!', '', 86335, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never underestimate the ingenuity and mischief that can be caused by a child who has mastered Invsibility.', '', 86334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This week we are discussing ley lines... again. Their practicality when it comes to magical understanding cannot be understated.', '', 86333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If your spell fails to land, make sure the arcana you are trying to wield has enough power to manifest at its destination.', '', 86332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before one can truly understand the artistry of weaving a spell, one must first ask themselves how many bunnies can you see?$b$bWhen you understand the meaning of this question, the foundation of the universe will become more clear.', '', 86331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firebolts, ice blocks, arcane blasts, all of these are simple manifestations of arcana.$b$bThey are safe spells, proven time and again to be both stable and effective.$b$bNow, if you really want to blow up the universe, well... some things are best kept for the advanced class.', '', 86330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few truly understand how fragile the fabric of this world is.$b$bWhy, a poorly designed spell could bring our entire reality to a screeching halt.', '', 86329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t yell at your students; Instead, speak very softly but firmly when disciplining them.  It forces them to listen more carefully and frankly it\'s a lot scarier than yelling.', '', 86328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mutated Defenders Killed: $1i (+$2i)', '', 86327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attacking Vines Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 86326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll defend us.', 'I\'ll defend us.', 86325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll heal us.', 'I\'ll heal us.', 86324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll deal out the damage.', 'I\'ll deal out the damage.', 86323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The three of us all bring different talents to the table. Chromie can manipulate time to heal our wounds, and I am capable of bearing the brunt of the dragon\'s attacks. All of us are worthy fighters.$b$bBut YOU are the tactical expert. We\'ll follow your lead. In what role are you strongest? Say the word and we\'ll begin!', '', 86322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draenor is not without its own primal beauty.', '', 86321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You nowhere near tough enough.', '', 86320, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deez Ashmaul dunt break my Boulder Shield so dey threw me in dis cage... Now dat I\'m free I dun need it no more, you have it $n.', '', 86319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry for all the times you\'re about to get killed. If it\'s any consolation, you won\'t remember any of them.', 86318, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one time, I killed two clefthoof at once with bare hands!', '', 86317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never before have the spirits spoken with such strength to me.', '', 86316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to fight, hmm? How tough are you?', '', 86315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000-1 reinforcement|r', '', 86314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0000FF-1 reinforcement|r', '', 86313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000+$1i score|r', '', 86312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('+$1i score', '', 86311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will remember this day, heroes. I will remember your names and your faces, and when the time comes, I will carve you limb from limb.', '', 86310, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde is never beaten! I will NEVER surrender!', '', 86309, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The battle is finished! We\'ve routed the Iron Horde and pushed them back to the gates!', 86308, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Hellscream shows himself.', '', 86307, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 48916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halt! Hellscream approaches.', 86306, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 45525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... noooo... Warchief... I have... failed you...', 86305, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade thirsts for your blood!', 86304, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 0, 46346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow tired of our games, little mouse. It\'s time to finish this.', 86303, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 46345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care a  Bladefury. Bring me her head!', '', 86302, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be needed near da main gate. Dey say Grommash has joined da battle.', '', 86301, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taz\'dingo! Well fought, mon. But we ain\'t leavin\' until da she-orc be dead.', '', 86300, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find Bladefury. Bring me her head!', '', 86299, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am needed near the gates. Warchief Hellscream has been spotted on the battlefield.', '', 86298, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast is defeated, but we cannot rest yet. One enemy still remains.', '', 86297, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will crush your armies and your pitiful fortress.  But first, it will crush YOU!', 86296, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 46344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This magnaron walked Draenor before the first orc took breath.  And now it bends to my will.', 86295, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 46343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gaze upon the source of your demise, heroes.', 86294, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 46342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let faith guide you, Yrel.', '', 86293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go with my blessing, Yrel. Do not forget those less fortunate.', 86292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck to you, Yrel. Courage comes from the mind and heart.', '', 86291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EXARCH YREL!', '', 86290, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, RISE...', '', 86289, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel, do not forget that an exceptional leader inspires greatness in others. Trust in your people, and trust in yourself.', '', 86288, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dedication to Lady Yrel proves to us that she is worthy. We did not choose the next Exarch. YOU did.', '', 86287, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We saw your bravery in Frostfire, your persistence in Nagrand, and your loyalty in Auchindoun.', '', 86286, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, we have watched you throughout this trial.', '', 86285, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, we measure a leader not only by her merit, but also by the character of her companions.', '', 86284, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven courage, kindness, faith, and strength... pillars upon which our society has arisen.', '', 86283, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
