('Begin your spell.  I\'ll protect you!', 'Begin your spell.  I\'ll protect you!', 86124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do some investigating.', 'Let\'s do some investigating.', 86123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some sort of veil has descended on this outpost. We need to find the cause.', 86122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have my people suffered the Curse of Sethe, and long have we sought a cure.', '', 86121, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you are the one Azuka spoke of. So puny, I thought this would be a challenge.  Prepare to die.', '', 86120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool, you challenge me? I will boil your insides.', '', 86119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been waiting for you. I\'m going to have to cut you now -- and it\'s going to burn.', 86118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive...', '', 86117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think yourself a worthy vessel for my power? Prove it!', '', 86116, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 46472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just two packages for now.', '', 86115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well it is good to see you. What can I get you?', '', 86114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard about the attacks and came out to help.', '', 86113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Berethal? It has been a long time. What brings you back here?', '', 86112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s that hollering?', '', 86111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomen? Are you in there?', '', 86110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get another Moonshell Claw Bait?', 'Can I get another Moonshell Claw Bait?', 86109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad Jayciel made it out of Karabor.', '', 86108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just two more years, then I can branch out on my own.', '', 86107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, I will have a greenhouse of my own.', '', 86106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rare items from the fabled Azeroth!', '', 86105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come try out the best tools in Draenor!', '', 86104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come take a look at my newest goods!', '', 86103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep, sure bigger\'n... wait, what?', '', 86102, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bigger\'n three cows tied together!', '', 86101, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s even bigger than the last one!', '', 86100, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back in my day, wolves would eat both of our feet, both ways to and from Ironforge, in the snow.', '', 86099, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wolf nearly ate my foot!', '', 86098, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya know, haulin\' these things back ain\'t a walk in the park.', '', 86097, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should really work on my aim if I expect to win the competition!', 'I should really work on my aim if I expect to win the competition!', 86096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tommy Joe, last time you tried that you ended up with a bad case of broken face.', '', 86095, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another shot, another miss.', 'Another shot, another miss.', 86094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wanna eat it already, how about just a little bite?', '', 86093, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Folks back at the garrison will appreciate this one.', '', 86092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how the other competitors are doing.', 'I wonder how the other competitors are doing.', 86091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess you can\'t make milk without breakin\' a few eggs!', '', 86090, 0, 0, 574, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... So close that time!', 'Oh... So close that time!', 86089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at him go!', '', 86088, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught yerself a fiesty one here, Commander!', '', 86087, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in the light, there is shadow.', '', 86086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tommy Joe, last time you took a bath \nwas before the Cataclysm.', '', 86085, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, ain\'t his fault he\'s stinky, is it fella?', '', 86084, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy light, did ya hafta get the worst-smelling one of the bunch?', '', 86083, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My muzzle\'s never missed its mark! The prize is as good as mine!', 'My muzzle\'s never missed its mark! The prize is as good as mine!', 86082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dusk will rise to the stars.', '', 86081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies are not out of reach. No, not out of reach.', '', 86080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They took Corporal Thukmar!', '', 86074, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha...haha... AHHAHAHAHA! Didn\'t anyone ever tell you not to play with fire?', '', 86073, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 45471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Matriarch is safe. You have proven to be a worthy ally; I look forward to fighting alongside you again.', '', 86072, 0, 25298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Same answer as the last two times.', '', 86071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nah.', '', 86070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we should move on?', '', 86069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, still...', '', 86068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any bites?', '', 86067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caught anything?', '', 86066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, mom.', '', 86065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bye Mom.', 86064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you stay out of trouble!', 86063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, I want you to come home before dark.', 86062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Syd, Brae!', 86061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Race you back!', 86060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No peeking.', 86059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found you!', '', 86058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twenty! Ready or not, here I come!', '', 86057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1, 2, 3...', '', 86056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t have time for this. Your end is near, hero. The next time we meet, be prepared for death.', 86055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, no fair.', 86054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... is free. Warlord, we have failed...', 86053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 42894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I win!', '', 86052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Race you back!', '', 86051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warlord, we have it under control.', 86050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 42893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Race you around!', 86049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately for you, my blade hungers.', 86048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish little rodent, you are too late! The Heart of Gorgorek is mine.', 86047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tag you\'re it!', 86046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So how many Alliance have you slain today, $n?', 86045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My mind is not my own! Serathil!', '', 86044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178537|h[Knight Riders]|h|r have been slain by the Horde!', '', 86043, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178537|h[Knight Riders]|h|r are out for duty!', '', 86042, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry! The axe whispers and I must obey!', '', 86041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Now I fight... you?', '', 86040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mage Portal has been destroyed by the Horde!', '', 86039, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Axe of Serathil compels you!', '', 86038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have activated the |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178538|h[Mage Portal]|h|r! Good work!', '', 86037, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We currently have $9311w collected. We need $9707w total.', '', 86036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily, we\'ve discovered that the native mushroom species have immense restorative properties.$B$BWhile we search for the cause of the mist, we have been eating the mushrooms to recover our strength and combat the poison.', '', 86035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creatures native to this swamp seem unaffected by the poison mist.$B$BThere must be something about the clackers and crabs that make them especially resilient to this strange phenomenon.', '', 86034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bless you, stranger. I can find my way back from here.', 'Bless you, stranger. I can find my way back from here.', 86033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gratitude to you, hero. I thought my fate was surely sealed.', 'My gratitude to you, hero. I thought my fate was surely sealed.', 86032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger. What brought this mist upon us so suddenly?', 'Thank you, stranger. What brought this mist upon us so suddenly?', 86031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mist took me by surprise. Thank you for helping me.', 'The mist took me by surprise. Thank you for helping me.', 86030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was done for. Thank you, hero.', 'I thought I was done for. Thank you, hero.', 86029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fury of Water, heal our injured!', '', 86028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fury of Wind, honor these soldiers with your presence!', '', 86027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fury of Fire, ignite our fists and weapons!', '', 86026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Fury of Earth, grant these heroes your protection!', '', 86025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s timber all across this world, commander, but I would recommend that you start your search in Shadowmoon Valley or Gorgrond.$B$BIf you\'re a risk taker you can try Frostfire Ridge, but I hear the Horde controls that region. You might run into some trouble if you\'re not careful.', '', 86024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s timber all across this world, commander, but I would recommend that you start your search in Gorgrond.$B$BIf you\'re a risk taker you can try Shadowmoon Valley, but I hear the Alliance controls that region. You might run into some trouble if you\'re not careful.$B$BFrostfire isn\'t so great for trees, but if you\'re desperate you can look around. You might find a few small timber.', '', 86023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Logging is just a hobby. My true calling is singing and dancing. Me and my group, \'N Swing, are going to be rich and famous some day.', '', 86022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, I was just wondering. Has Baros mentioned me by any chance? What? Oh... no reason.$b$b<Thorn blushes>', 86021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, commander, what do you think of Lieutenant Thorn? Whenever she\'s around, I get so flustered.$b$bI\'m just... not really good with women. Which she is an exceptional example of. A woman, that is. Although she is also a worgen. Which I also like. Oh, that long, silky fur...$B$BSigh...', '', 86020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! Your size makes you weak, giant.', 86019, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 41799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you, commander?', 86018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baros was such a sweet man.$b$bIf only I would have paid more attention to him when he was alive. I\'ll never forgive myself for letting him slip through my fingers.', 86017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life is short, commander. It is important to seize the moment.', 86016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should have brought an army to fight the Iron Horde!', 86015, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 45564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorgrond is no place for armies. This land swallows all who enter. We will be fortunate to even lay eyes upon the Iron Horde base.', '', 86014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many leagues of deadly land yet stand between us and the Blackrock.', '', 86013, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Poor Thorn, she\'s so heartbroken. I don\'t think she will ever leave her worgen form again.', 86012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe Baros is gone... If you will excuse me commander I really need to focus on my work right now.', 86011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nagrand is the final frontier for harvesting timber, $g sir:ma\'am;.$B$BOf course the rest of Draenor is wide open to your keen harvesting skills.', '', 86010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s timber all across this world, commander, but I would recommend that you harvest in the Spires of Arak or Talador.$B$BBoth of those regions are overflowing with timber to chop down!', '', 86009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s timber all across this world, commander, but I would recommend that you harvest in Gorgrond or Talador.', '', 86008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s timber to be found across all of Draenor!', '', 86007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Ka\'alu when you are ready to fly.', '', 86006, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa! What was that?', 86005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What!? They were only supposed to be observing; we need to get a rescue team down there pronto!', 86004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miss Pinchwhistle! The \"Mother Lode,\" it just crashed into the mountains south of here!', '', 86003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heart of the magnaron... the power we now wield against the Iron Horde is immense.', '', 86001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44840, 0, 603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know not what you will find out there, but if you encounter any of the Iron Horde, show them no mercy.', '', 86000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44839, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown great courage and recovered an invaluable artifact. Lok\'tar.', '', 85999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45264, 0, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully. If the rumors I hear are true, you will find yourself in grave danger.', '', 85998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45263, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR AZEROTH!', 'FOR AZEROTH!', 85997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The archmage focuses intently on the portal.>$b$bLook. Their numbers are abating, however briefly. This may be our chance.$b$bAre you prepared to face whatever\'s on the other side of that portal?', '', 85996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this point, we are just waiting for an opening. Once the stream of enemies abates, we make our move.', '', 85995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like an able fisherman, do you think you can help us out?\n\nWe have established a small garrison nearby, but we are finding it difficult to feed our troops. Any fishing advice you could give us would really help.', 'You look like an able fisherman, do you think you can help us out?\n\nWe have established a small garrison nearby, but we are finding it difficult to feed our troops. Any fishing advice you could give us would really help.', 85994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I am trying to fish here?', 'Can\'t you see I am trying to fish here?', 85993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is it. Garrosh Hellscream sits smugly on his throne just beyond these gates.$B$BWe can\'t let him escape this time, $n.', 85992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It came... in the night...', '', 85991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s does not detect any nearby enemies, and initiates |cFFFF0404|Hspell:168929|h[Cannon Barrage!]|h|r!', '', 85990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snap out of it, mon. Come back to us.', '', 85989, 0, 26702, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, Bryan. Snap out of it!', '', 85988, 0, 26703, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect! Oh, we are so close to success!', '', 85987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fantastic! The power of the ritual is increasing!', '', 85986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Correct, you are doing fine.', '', 85985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good! Did you rehearse when I wasn\'t looking?', '', 85984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oregorger has gone insane from hunger!', '', 85983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were it not for you, this would be Nisha\'s resting place as well.', '', 85982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bags have been pickpocketed by |c00FFFF00|Hspell:168798|h[Pick Pocket]|h|r. You\'ve lost 5 |c00FFFFFF|Hcurrency:944|h[Artifact Fragments]|h|r.', 'Your bags have been pickpocketed by |c00FFFF00|Hspell:168798|h[Pick Pocket]|h|r. You\'ve lost 5 |c00FFFFFF|Hcurrency:944|h[Artifact Fragments]|h|r.', 85981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44578, 44578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Rooby Roo looks hungry. Perhaps her owner has something that would help.>', '', 85980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dark one promised me so much... if I succeeded...', '', 85979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
