('', 'My head be hurtin\' somethin\' terrible.', 85825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, commander, I can\'t thank ye enough. I\'ll get the ol\' brewery up and runnin\' in two shakes of a talbuk\'s tail.', '', 85824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, me head.', '', 85823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Administer the antidote to Lunzul.', 'Administer the antidote to Lunzul.', 85822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Lunzul\'s eyes are closed and her skin is pale.>', 85821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Administer the antidote to Kolrigg.', 'Administer the antidote to Kolrigg.', 85820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kolrigg\'s eyes are closed and his skin is pale.>', '', 85819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nisha flutters her wings, ready to go scouting for Rexxar.>', '', 85818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Place your hand on Nisha\'s head.', 'Place your hand on Nisha\'s head.', 85817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to submit a work order.', 'I\'d like to submit a work order.', 85816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. Here to do some lumberjacking?', '', 85815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Commander Gar.', 85814, 0, 0, 273, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Finish your work and bring them to me.', '', 85813, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have learned how to dominate the minds of gronn.', 85812, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What progress do you have to report? This better not be like last time!', '', 85811, 0, 0, 603, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The enemy battleship is just off the coast.  We will hold off Blackhand, it\'s up to you to disable that boat and save Shattrath!', '', 85810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s lets out a long, drawn out sigh.', 85809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 10577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Next time... I will reduce ALL of them to ash!', 85808, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why must the orcs cause so much suffering?', 85807, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such devastation...', 85806, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 9676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fly again, Ka\'alu.', 'I am ready to fly again, Ka\'alu.', 85805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lumber shipment en route to your lumber mill!', 'Lumber shipment en route to your lumber mill!', 85804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please take a step back.', 'Please take a step back.', 85803, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This area is off limits.', 'This area is off limits.', 85802, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let\'s hurry!', 'Then let\'s hurry!', 85801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make Graveltooth ANGRY! Now you go squish!', '', 85800, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
