('I... <gasp> I\'m fine, $p. I just need to catch my breath.$b$bI wasn\'t expecting the ride to be so fast.', '', 85779, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
