('Your Alchemy Lab is under attack!', 'Your Alchemy Lab is under attack!', 85751, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting in!', 'Reporting in!', 85750, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty, Sir!', 'Reporting for duty, Sir!', 85749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take you out with me!', '', 85748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh, well then, I\'ll just have to end this myself.', '', 85747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let those Horde anywhere near Stormshield, $n.', '', 85746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let this nuisance anywhere near the cannon.', '', 85745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, Sir! Reporting for duty, Sir!', '$n, Sir! Reporting for duty, Sir!', 85744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How goes the fight from the front lines, $n?', '', 85743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the light embrace you!', '', 85742, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make no mistake, we will NOT be caught unprepared again!', '', 85741, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Starting today, new patrols will be instituted across all of Shattrath.', '', 85740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although we were unprepared for the attack, each one of you performed admirably.', '', 85739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Due to your heroic actions, however, many more lives were saved!', '', 85738, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many lives were lost in the attack, both friends and family alike.', '', 85737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shattrath has been attacked by a terrible foe!', '', 85736, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, at least we took care of that thing. Come on, hero. We\'d better report this back to headquarters.', 85735, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Argghh! Looks like we\'ll have to deal with that gronn.', 85734, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What should I paint... what should I paint?', 'What should I paint... what should I paint?', 85733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeeeesssss', 85732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death comes...', 85731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aaaaahhhh!', 85730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now... Nowww!', 85729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeeeesssss', '', 85728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes...', '', 85727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaahhhh!', '', 85726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('now... Nowww!', '', 85725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get another Icespine Stinger Bait?', 'Can I get another Icespine Stinger Bait?', 85724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the situation?', 'What\'s the situation?', 85723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you make of that... thing? It\'s enormous.', 85722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acidback Rollers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 'Acidbacks Rollers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 85721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goren Burrowers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 'Goren Burrowers Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', 85720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goren Gluttons Killed: $1i (+$2i)', 'Goren Gluttons Killed: $1i (+$2i)', 85719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise the Raven Mother, we have everything ready! Speak with me again when you are prepared to begin.', '', 85718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They must breed like Murlocs.', 'They must breed like Murlocs.', 85717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost count. How many was that?', 'I lost count. How many was that?', 85716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More to slay.', 'More to slay.', 85715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They keep coming!', 'They keep coming!', 85714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Next thing I know I\'m waking up behind the shop with it all in my hair!', 85713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So I said, \"I can do it, but not for cheap.\"', 85712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So then he pulls out a handful of moss. What a weirdo!', 85711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeeeeeeek!', '', 85710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot wait to target some Iron Horde.', 85709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, what\'s wrong?', '', 85708, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell you what, go grab me five or so and bring them back to the Mage sitting near the campfire over there. Ecilam\'s his name. He\'s using the artifact\'s power to summon some Mage portals within Ashran.', '', 85707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do my best!', 'I\'ll do my best!', 85706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should I bring them to you?', 'Should I bring them to you?', 85705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are they, exactly?', 'Where are they, exactly?', 85704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VERMIN! I WILL TURN YOUR WORLD TO ASH!', '', 85703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, my minions! Rend their flesh.', '', 85702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin, let\'s change this building into a corral.', 'Thaelin, let\'s change this building into a corral.', 85701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first... I think I need to wash my hands. I will meet you back at your camp.', '', 85700, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin, let\'s change this building into a tankworks.', 'Thaelin, let\'s change this building into a tankworks.', 85699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your suffering will be legendary.', '', 85698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will lend my power as often as I can.', '', 85697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foreman, change this building into a corral.', 'Foreman, change this building into a corral.', 85696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But so long as you tread in Arak, some piece of me will remain with you.', '', 85695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, I can never again grant you my full power. Kargath severed that bond.', '', 85694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have one already.', '', 85693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stouttoe! Is that you?', 'Stouttoe! Is that you?', 85692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We got wind that there are hidden artifacts here, in this place called Ashran. Artifacts from a remnant Highmaul Ogre clan.$B$BThey could be the key to our success against the Iron Horde.', 85691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far the Alliance found them all over Ashran. Killing any creature you can find will no doubt increase your chances for discovery.', '', 85690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must strike your own path. Lay the past to rest and raise new champions.', '', 85689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Switching the building will cost 5,000 gold.\n\nAre you sure?', 'Switching the building will cost 5,000 gold.\n\nAre you sure?', 85688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children, it will take more than a fading memory from the past to overcome the challenges you face today.', '', 85687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That orc... Kargath. Even at my full strength, he would prove a challenge.', '', 85686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We barely got you out in time.', '', 85685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foreman, change this building into a tankworks.', 'Foreman, change this building into a tankworks.', 85684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me, $n. She\'s up this way.', 85683, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This magnaron walked Draenor before the first orc took breath. And now, it... and an endless army of these destroyers... bend to MY will!', 85682, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, hero... I knew you would come. You are just in time to witness the heart\'s power.', 85681, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So it is true. The heart CAN infuse life into these creatures.', 85680, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light\'s power resonate within your actions. We shall not let the hatred of our savage enemies overcome our will to survive. Carry forth and return our people to health!', 'May the Light\'s power resonate within your actions. We shall not let the hatred of our savage enemies overcome our will to survive. Carry forth and return our people to health!', 85679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey, boss-mon. Take a load off. Relax.', '', 85678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven that you have the strength to survive even the most dangerous of situations. Your technique in combat is unlike anyone I have seen. I am glad to call you friend.', '', 85677, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, commander! You sure you aren\'t part Laughing Skull?', '', 85676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can help you. (Give Abu\'gar his rod, reel and lure)', 'I think I can help you. (Give Abu\'gar his rod, reel and lure)', 85675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It bein\' just my luck, mon! I be findin\' da best fishin\' spot down \'ere, but only after da elementals and da ogres broke up all my gear. \n\nNow I\'m needin\' a new rod, reel, and da special voodoo lure so I can land da big ones hidin\' in da weeds.', '', 85674, 0, 28629, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is now we must come together, stronger than ever.', 'It is now we must come together, stronger than ever.', 85673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people nor our city shall fall to the savages!', 'Our people nor our city shall fall to the savages!', 85672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defenders of Karabor stand ready!', 'Defenders of Karabor stand ready!', 85671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patrols have been increased throughout the city.  We will not succumb to attacks by these savages.', 'Patrols have been increased throughout the city.  We will not succumb to attacks by these savages.', 85670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me check the map, Fellworth. I will decide where we travel next.', 85669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t find a lot of that out here...', '', 85668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I know, tell that to my C.O.', '', 85667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
