('So, what do you do for a living?', '', 85665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We weren\'t lost; I was just taking the adventurous route!', '', 85664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not be disappointed. Finally my long adventure is over! Arise Dionor!', '', 85663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
