('', 'Fellworth got our group lost by finding a \"shortcut\" through the hollow and now my boots are full of slime and mud!\n\nI think I will be charge of the map from now on.', 85659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
