('Take me back to my outpost.', 'Take me back to my outpost.', 85529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The wyvern looks at you expectantly.>', '', 85528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know the old saying?$b$bOne goblin\'s junk, is another goblin\'s garbage, so sell it to someone stupid enough to buy it.$b$bMy dear old mother told me that one, right before she sold me to that caravan of worgen.$b$bStill not sure how I feel about that.', '', 85527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you find anything that looks like it needs some preserving let me know, chances are I can sell it somebody who likes old stuff.', '', 85526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have dedicated my life to preserving priceless artifacts and then quickly selling them for profit.$b$bIt\'s a difficult job, but I like money. Know what I\'m sayin?', '', 85525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Derrook waves good bye.', '', 85524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another pup enters the fray?', '', 85523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut them down! Nothing will keep us from taking the city.', '', 85522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remain calm while I administer healing.', '', 85521, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remain calm while I administer healing.', 'Please remain calm while I administer healing.', 85520, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you feel it? This tree is scared. I\'d say it\'s petrified...', '', 85519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go do what you\'re good at and I\'ll do what I\'m good at: killing trees.', '', 85518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve pooped timber bigger than this! Step aside and let me get to work!', '', 85517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, those are sawblades. Now step aside! I got a tree to murder!', '', 85516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here Mr. Lizzy... over here.', 'Here Mr. Lizzy... over here.', 85515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you outcasts land on my terrace! I\'ll see your bodies broken upon the stones below!', '', 85514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... not into the darkness...', '', 85513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay down. Their camp is right here.', 85512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep yer volume down, their camp is right here.', 85511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life... for Rukhmar...', '', 85510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greblin Fastfizzle\'s last know location was the Broken Precipice. Dungar will set you up with a flight, when you\'re ready.', 85509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You cannot stop us...', '', 85508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy scum! How dare you set foot on my terrace!', '', 85507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see your corpse broken on the stones below!', '', 85506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall end this pathetic uprising here and now!', '', 85505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the will of Rukhmar, you shall die!', '', 85504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After I\'m done with you even the Kaliri will refuse to pick at your corpse!', '', 85503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Gorgrond or Tanaan Jungle!', '', 85502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got this, Commander $n. Go save some orphans or kill an orc or something equally heroic.', '', 85501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know that we commandojacks have a twenty percent survival rate in the wild?', '', 85500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you have a world to save, $n? Let me do the dirty work here!', '', 85499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need a tree murdered, commander?', '', 85498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant Thorn is a shining example to us all. Never have I seen such a dedicated leader.$B$BI haven\'t worked up the courage to speak to her, but perhaps someday, she will know my name.', '', 85497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander! I trust you are prepared to have your mind blown away by my designs.$b$bI am thinking... wood! Yes, wood! Lots of it. In BOLD arrangement the way that only the orcs of the original horde could conceive.$b$bAnd spikes! Yes, spikes. We must not forget the spikes. That is how you know it is Horde.', 85496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Brightstone? My latest assistant is more than a handful.$b$bShe does everything to the extreme - drinking, talking, rushing from one task to another...$b$bShe is a damn fine architect though, and probably the brightest student I\'ve ever had.$b$bI\'ll give her that.', '', 85495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So you\'re the new commander, eh? I thought you\'d be taller.', 85494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That Thorn needs to throw back a pint n\' lighten up!  Er um... Commander!', 85493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey Commander, ye ever catch a game of Battle Ball? GO FORGERS!', 85492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Psst, do ye think Alexston and Thorn would make a cute couple? HEEHEE!', 85491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haha, Who\'d thought an apprenticeship\'d plop me here? It\'s quite exciting!', 85490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my hammer!', '', 85489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not so fast, mon!', 85488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blood runs rose red. This heart beats for Gilneas.', 85487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In Pandaria I did not make a habit of asking for \"help\" on missions. Perhaps that is why we haven\'t met before?', 85486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dangers of this land are not to be underestimated.$b$b<Thorn points to her eyepatch>$b$bI bear the mark of my naivety and own this mistake.', 85485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Warsong will tear you apart!', 85484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me the honor of holding back these raiders!', '', 85483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don worry mon. I keep dese raiders off ya back!', 85482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warsong! To me!', 85481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 85480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 85479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 85478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is far from over.', '', 85477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn!', '', 85476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah. Ditto.', '', 85475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! None shall possess my potency!', 85474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your blood washes over me!', 85473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You dare contest my power??? Our blood surges with energy!', 85472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The blood of the slain comes to my aid!', 85471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away, captain! It will be my pleasure.', 85470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward! The superweapon is on one of these ships. Follow me!', '', 85469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draka, join the draenei in searching for any survivors.', '', 85468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course.', 85467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, hero, for releasing my soul from Cho\'gall\'s malevolent grip.$b$bThough my body rests, my spirit will stand vigil and maintain the balance until a new earthen fury takes my place.', '', 85466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 'How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 85465, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we can gather enough of the artifact fragments found within Ashran we can activate the Warlock Gateways so we can move between the areas faster. $B$BHow many have you brought me?', '', 85464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warlocks have finished activating the Gateways and they are now fully functional. Good work, $n.', '', 85463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody call for a highly overqualified lumberjack?', '', 85462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gateways are located in the North-West and South-East and can be used to move between those two points.', '', 85461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mages will summon a portal west of Ashran which can be used to take you back to Warspear Outpost.', 85460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do the Warlock Gateways do?', 'What do the Warlock Gateways do?', 85459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do the Mage Portals do?', 'What do the Mage Portals do?', 85458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 'How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 85457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal is up, $c. Good work.', 85456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The power lies within the artifact fragments, $n. Bring back enough of those and the mages will summon a portal so we can return back to Warspear Outpost faster.$B$BHow many have you brought me?', 85455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They seem focused on their ritual. Maybe destroying those blood orbs will get their attention.', '', 85454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BE CONSUMED BY FLAME!', '', 85453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I LIVE!', '', 85452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, what\'s up ahead?', 'Aggra, what\'s up ahead?', 85451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh has escaped justice time and again, but we\'re going to finish him off this time, once and for all.', 85450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D\'kaan, what\'s up ahead?', 'D\'kaan, what\'s up ahead?', 85449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This son of Hellscream is a madman.$B$BI don\'t want justice... I want vengeance for what he did at Telaar.', '', 85448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you want?', '', 85447, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me not that kind of orc.', '', 85446, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll take \'er from here!', '', 85445, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me busy. Leave me alone.', '', 85444, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$g Yessir:Yes ma\'am;, right away, $g sir:ma\'am;.', '', 85443, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t bigger than Princess!', '', 85442, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad touch! Bad touch!', '', 85441, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaaat?', '', 85440, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OWWWW! Okay, okay, me go back to work!', '', 85439, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something me doing?', '', 85438, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wowee, that\'s a big one!', '', 85437, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call upon Terokk.', 'Call upon Terokk.', 85436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh Boss-mon! Ol\' Vol\'jin da warchief be sendin\' me some shadow hunters to be ya eyes an ears.$b$bWhen I hear of tings out there in da world ya should be hearin\' of, I\'ll be lettin\' ya know.', '', 85435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will never defeat the Light, demon!', 85434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Super Thrall Action Option 1!', 'Super Thrall Action Option 1!', 85433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Super Thrall Action Dialogue!', '', 85432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackrocks... CRUSH THEM!', '', 85431, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What good are a handful of slaves against the Blackrock war machine?', '', 85430, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? What\'s going on down there?', '', 85429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... couldn\'t save them.', 'I... couldn\'t save them.', 85428, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we please head back now?', 85427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no reason to be scared!', 85426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to killl the gronn!', 'I\'m going to killl the gronn!', 85425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s alright... they are all gone now.', 85424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... something helpful?', 'Hmmm... something helpful?', 85423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n browses the books.', '$n browses the books.', 85422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhhhhhh! I\'m hit!', 85421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Event sent.', '', 85420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tick tick tick... BOOM!', 85419, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 46129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time is money, friend! And it looks like you\'s outta both!', 85418, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 46132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d better step back. I\'m calling in the Bombsquad!', 85417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooooh! Is there killin\' ta be done? Lemme at\'em!', 85416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you ain\'t so tall no more.', 85415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn with me.', '', 85414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade thirsts for more.', '', 85413, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revel in the slaughter!', '', 85412, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terror overwhelms you, death is near.', '', 85411, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A death worthy of a warrior!', '', 85410, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it? You barely drew blood!', '', 85409, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them have it!', '', 85408, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Start the funeral pyres!', '', 85407, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warsong arrows sing from the sky! They\'ll be the last thing you hear as I crush your skull.', '', 85406, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No quarter. No mercy.', '', 85405, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you have what it takes to bear the standard of the Iron Horde?', '', 85404, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get in there and show me what you\'ve got.', '', 85403, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop showin\' off.', '', 85402, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 46242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let your lust for battle cloud your sight.', '', 85401, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One shot, one kill!', '', 85399, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 46240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t shoot until you see the whites of their eyes!', '', 85398, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get these war machines ready for the siege.', '', 85397, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Warsong orc looks to have died trying to carry a giant stone through the Gorian outpost. \n\nThere\'s no clear indication of where he was taking the stone, but it obviously didn\'t help him in combat.', '', 85395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the light bless you $r!', 85394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
