('', 'Have hope $n!  The Light will protect you.', 85392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!', 'AAHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!', 85391, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
