('WHAT THE HELL?!', 'WHAT THE HELL?!', 85372, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s coming right for us!', 'It\'s coming right for us!', 85371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the plan, Khadgar?', 'What\'s the plan, Khadgar?', 85370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready?', '', 85369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!', 85368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe we\'re both standing here, $n. It\'s Draenor... but it\'s not Draenor. I feel as though we\'re trespassing on the far side of the looking glass.$b$bLet\'s finish the job and get out of this place, hm?', '', 85367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No touchin\' da merchandise without proof of purchase.', 'No touchin\' da merchandise without proof of purchase.', 85366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is finished. I must rest a moment. The flagship is up ahead. I will join you there once I regain my energy.', '', 85365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must give the wizard more time! Hold the line!', '', 85364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot hold for much longer!', 85363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acquiring', 'Acquiring', 85362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! Too much!', '', 85361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Till we meet again, $n.', 85360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now if you will excuse me, I have more blood to spill. Take care of this worm.', 85358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and your friend are too late, $n. My blade has already tasted the blood of Ugbright. My power will soon be unstoppable.', 85357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He did not. He turned my words against me!$b$bHe ordered me and my loyal supporters to go on this cursed expedition to find the first ogre civilization and find some stupid relics! I could not disobey... now my troops are all dead and I cannot return...', '', 85356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I doubt he took that well...', 'I doubt he took that well...', 85355, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever since \"Sorceror King\" Mar\'gok came to power and found those artifacts its been Felbreaker this and Firebreaker that. With his newfound power he thinks he doesn\'t need the Legion!$b$bThis empire was forged with ogre strength and ogre blades and I told him as such!', '', 85354, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one should become fertilizer for these monsters.  How did you come to be here?', 'No one should become fertilizer for these monsters.  How did you come to be here?', 85353, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the first thing that has not immediately attacked me since my expedition arrived in this forsaken land... I should not even be here!', '', 85352, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate this jungle... You there! I would speak with you.', '', 85351, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will always be more of us... here...', '', 85350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will grow countless of us!', '', 85349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can clear the way to the flagship. Hold off these invaders while I finish my spell!', '', 85348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fool. He\'s going tae lead us straight to his brewin\' operation. Come on.', 85347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT ARE YOU DOING JUST STANDING AROUND? GO SLAY SOME ALLIANCE SCUM. BRING ME BACK THEIR HEADS, TEETH, TAILS... WHATEVER! GO, NOW!!', '', 85346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put the corporal out of his misery.', 'Put the corporal out of his misery.', 85345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill... eat... torn to pieces... ate... alive... they took us... DIE... kill... me... kill me... KILL ME... please...', '', 85344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kronus will patrol into the Road of Glory and clear it of any Alliance it finds.', '', 85343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fool. He\'s going to lead us straight to his brewing operation. Follow me.', 85342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We currently have $9253w collected. We need $9706w total.', '', 85341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We currently have $9262w collected. We need $9708w total.', '', 85340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We currently have $9312w collected. We need $9707w total.', 85339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 'How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 85338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does Kronus do?', 'What does Kronus do?', 85337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We currently have $9313w collected. We need $9705w total.', '', 85336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 'How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 85335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our best Wolf Riders will ride around Ashran to protect and serve. Tear those Alliance dogs to shreds.', '', 85334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do the Wolf Riders do?', 'What do the Wolf Riders do?', 85333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not enough that the wolf regard you as its master. To ready your wolf for riding, you must break its will completely.\n\nOnce you have subdued your wolf, you will mount it and ride it to the top of the tallest peak in Nagrand. If your wolf is willful, it will throw you to your death on the mountain slopes. \n\nIf you survive to the peak, the will of your wolf will be broken. \n\nThen, you can call yourself \"Wolfrider\".', '', 85332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once your display of strength is set for all to see, you must claim your wolf.\n\nGo to their hunting grounds. There you must find the largest wolf in the pack, and subdue it in the presence of its kin. You will likely be eaten alive, but if you survive the ordeal, the wolf will answer to you as its master.', '', 85331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To prove yourself worthy of the wolf, you must first test your strength and tenacity. \n\nTo do this, you must gather a heavy stone from the quarry and bear it on your back into the lands of your enemy. Once you have cut your way through their ranks, place the stone in a place of prominence, and set upon it a trophy of your foe.\n\nOnly then, when your strength is displayed for all to see, can you hope to claim the wolf as your subject.', '', 85330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be a struggle to make quota this week.', '', 85329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hopefully there will not be any more interruptions.', '', 85328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, that is coming along nicely.', '', 85327, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, good.', '', 85326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alive, $n.', '', 85325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alive, $n.', '', 85324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good plan. Now, let\'s get moving.', '', 85323, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 44989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we should deprive them of their allies. The ogres here in Nagrand are vulnerable now.', 85322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45570, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde remains a threat. We should hit them where it hurts, and take out the Blackrock Foundry.', '', 85321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45267, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha, wind cannot hurt me!', '', 85320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not flesh bag, you will do more good in the ground than above it. I will see to that.', '', 85319, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t waste my time.', '', 85318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anybody want to go to Tanaan?', '', 85317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will NOT die in this accursed jungle! I will not become plant food! My death is meant for something far more glorious than you plants!', '', 85316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vindicator Yrel says that we must work with both the Alliance and the Horde from your world.$B$BBut, if your world created monsters like Garrosh - why should we trust you?', '', 85315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just keep coming like the weeds you are! Fine then! I\'ve killed a hundred of you, I can kill hundreds more!', '', 85314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?! I\'ve put bigger forests to the torch in my campaigns!', '', 85313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We Frostwolves have always walked alone, with only our wolves at our side. But, our clan is a part of this world, and it\'s clear that we have a role to play in protecting it.$B$BThis \'Garrosh\' was a dangerous one. Still, he showed us something valuable. I see now that, united, the orcs can be great. It is more important than ever to have a righteous voice to guide them.$B$BThe Frostwolves must be that voice.', 85312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The word.', 'The word.', 85311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The archmage is gearing up for another campaign. All he can talk about is finding Gul\'dan.$B$BBut, I worry... Gul\'dan has already tried to kill Khadgar once. The Archmage is going to need all the help he can get.$B$B<Cordana looks at you, pointedly.>', 85310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like a strong, capable $c. I could use a champion like you.$b$bInterested in risking your life on a suicide mission to save Azeroth?$b$bJust say the word.', '', 85309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not supposed to be here yet! The assault on the Dark Portal isn\'t ready!$b$bCome back later, $c.', '', 85308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you... Mar\'gok...', '', 85307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yet live you green beasts! Come face Tormmok if you dare!', '', 85306, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve closed this chapter. But Garrosh only set these events in motion... We\'ll have to close all the loops if we want to keep Azeroth safe. That means finding and neutralizing Gul\'dan.$B$B<Khadgar breathes a heavy sigh.>$B$BStill, a little celebration may be in order before we get back to business. I\'ve got a bottle of aged Dalaran red saved up for just such an occasion, if you\'d care to meet me in my tower later.', '', 85305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lord, I -', '', 85304, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough. I will handle this myself.', '', 85303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Husband, please reconsider. No good can come of this.', 85302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that brings us to today! With the relics and the Talonpriests in place, we are ready to call upon the Talon King.', '', 85301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, peach - great to be back under your command!$b$bGazlowe said you might need some goblin firepower, ingenuity, and awesomeness out here, so naturally I was chosen.$b$bAnd this has absolutely nothing to do with him not wanting me around his explosives.$b$bI got your back, commander!', 85300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoping to rejuvenate their fading king, the Talonpriests sealed Terokk away in the shadows.', '', 85299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitors, all of you. You\'ve led the enemy to our doorstep!', '', 85298, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amazing what you can dig up if you don\'t mind fighting through monsters, traps, bandits, and any other number of things trying to kill you.', 85297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to make me something.', 'I want you to make me something.', 85296, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a new recipe for myself.', 'I want a new recipe for myself.', 85295, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good Job!', 85294, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give them a piece o\' their own medicine.', 85293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show them no mercy.', 85292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok, Percy. Bang!', 85291, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me back enough of those artifacts and I can gear up our Wolf Riders and send them out into battle. $B$BHow many have you brought me?', '', 85290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a good boy.', 85289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on Percy!', 85288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is Sir Percival today?', 85287, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll get our chance.', 'We\'ll get our chance.', 85286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s breathes heavily, attacking their target with precision and focus.', '%s breathes heavily, attacking their target with precision and focus.', 85285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s adjusts their combat stance, improving balance and form.', '%s adjusts their combat stance, improving balance and form.', 85284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s swings with great force at their target.', '%s swings with great force at their target.', 85283, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets loose a whisper from under his breath, slowly releasing a pained sigh.', '%s lets loose a whisper from under his breath, slowly releasing a pained sigh.', 85282, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s ignores the pain, allowing nearby injured brethren to be cared for.', '%s ignores the pain, allowing nearby injured brethren to be cared for.', 85281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s inhales slowly, each breath increasing discomfort.', '%s inhales slowly, each breath increasing discomfort.', 85280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n says a prayer for the spirit of the departed.', '$n says a prayer for the spirit of the departed.', 85279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings aide your wounds.', 'Blessings aide your wounds.', 85278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wounds are great, but the spirit is stronger.', 'The wounds are great, but the spirit is stronger.', 85277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know it hurts, but you must try and rest.', 'I know it hurts, but you must try and rest.', 85276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mending begins.', 'The mending begins.', 85275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'ve you got?', 'What\'ve you got?', 85274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to Highmaul and my claws will tear you apart....', '', 85273, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 45794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s tosses a coin in the fountain.', '%s tosses a coin in the fountain.', 85272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need some luck!', 'I need some luck!', 85271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on in there, champ!', '', 85270, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_fixated_state_red:20|tA Phoenix has |cFFFF0000fixated|r on you! If it reaches you it will |cFFFF0000|Hspell:167630|h[Explode]|h|r!', '', 85269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rukhmar takes flight!', 'Rukhmar takes flight!', 85268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taking a look...', 'Taking a look...', 85267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love the smell of burnt gladiators in the morning!', '', 85266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge Brokyo.', 'Challenge Brokyo.', 85265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This head used to be attached to a large brute, until it was ripped off by a larger brute name Brokyo.>', '<This head used to be attached to a large brute, until it was ripped off by a larger brute name Brokyo.>', 85264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a taste of Gorian civilization!', '', 85263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work. Your skills are improving.', 'Excellent work. Your skills are improving.', 85262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maintain your balance. You must remain steady at all times.', 'Maintain your balance. You must remain steady at all times.', 85261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good...good.', 'Good...good.', 85260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The savages won\'t be so kind to forgive attacks like that.', 'The savages won\'t be so kind to forgive attacks like that.', 85259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mind your form.', 'Mind your form.', 85258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light\'s blessing be upon us.', 'Light\'s blessing be upon us.', 85257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It hasn\'t just affected our lives - the weather is gloomier.  The attack is mourned by all.', 'It hasn\'t just affected our lives - the weather is gloomier.  The attack is mourned by all.', 85256, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and the children. Who will care for them now?', '...and the children. Who will care for them now?', 85255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could this have happened...', 'How could this have happened...', 85254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t yet know of the casualties.', 'We don\'t yet know of the casualties.', 85253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dark Lady watch over us. We weren\'t the only ones.', 85252, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s worse than I thought. They hit here, too.', 85251, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Come at me, bro!', '', 85250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense one who is not of the flock. Come closer, child.', 85249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bahaha! You so puny!', '', 85248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna crush dem good, Porkchop!', '', 85247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put axes in our hands and I promise you, every Frostwolf orc here can take down ten orcs of any other clan.', '', 85246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find us weapons and armor, and I swear my people will carve a path through these orcs all the way to Karabor if we must.', '', 85245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul... Help me...', '', 85244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void consumes you!', '', 85243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer... and burn!', '', 85242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You - from beyond the portal! You will make a marvelous sacrifice.', '', 85241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see your friends in the chamber up above. I think I can get there safely.', 85240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, it\'s time to go!', '', 85239, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will make sure that he is fully healed.', 85238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
