('Charge!', '', 85084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 85083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, fool!', 'Stand down, fool!', 85082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself, dog!', 'Watch yourself, dog!', 85081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this one of yours?', '', 85080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Raven God Anzu gifted Terokk and his guards with dark powers. In time, they would be known as Talonpriests.', '', 85079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet ye there.', 85078, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you there.', 85077, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strange orb peeked out from the wastes. Gazing into it, Terokk met the being that had saved him.', '', 85076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! You\'ve walked right into my trap!', '', 85075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A strange power filled the Talon King. A presence urged him on.', '', 85074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But in that darkness, something found him.', '', 85073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeing her broken body, Terokk despaired. He surrendered to the creeping darkness.', '', 85072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As he withered, Terokk had but one concern: his daughter Lithic.', '', 85071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The accursed blood seared his flesh and tore at his mind.', '', 85070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Talon King\'s own sages betrayed him. Terokk and his allies were cast into the pools.', '', 85069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am at your command.', '', 85068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_avengersshield:20|t %s hurls his |cFFF00000|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r at $n!', '', 85067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to serve you, commander.', '', 85066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Shadow\'s Vigil.', 'Take me to Shadow\'s Vigil.', 85065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept Terokk\'s power.', 'Accept Terokk\'s power.', 85064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Touch the bangle to witness Terokk\'s fall.', 'Touch the bangle to witness Terokk\'s fall.', 85063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This map bears many markings within Tanaan Jungle, including drawings of fortifications and troop movements. Hellscream seems quite interested in that region.>', '<This map bears many markings within Tanaan Jungle, including drawings of fortifications and troop movements. Hellscream seems quite interested in that region.>', 85062, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Scraps of paper surround the map of Blackrock Foundry. They look like manufacturing orders for war machines.>', '<Scraps of paper surround the map of Blackrock Foundry. They look like manufacturing orders for war machines.>', 85061, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Written on a nearby piece of paper:$B$BWe have uncovered Gorgorek the Worldrender, an ancient magnaron frozen in the stone pools of Gorgrond.$B$BThe Warsong elders believe this magnaron was a once-powerful alpha, with the ability to command lesser beings of its own kind.$B$BAncient clan records suggest that the beast can be awakened.>', '<Written on a nearby piece of paper:$B$BWe have uncovered Gorgorek the Worldrender, an ancient magnaron frozen in the stone pools of Gorgrond.$B$BThe Warsong elders believe this magnaron was a once-powerful alpha, with the ability to command lesser beings of its own kind.$B$BAncient clan records suggest that the beast can be awakened.>', 85060, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Backup has arrived! Dispose of dose dat remain.', '', 85059, 0, 30987, 0, 64, 0, 46569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grommash Hellscream met with his Warlords - Blackhand, Kargath Bladefist, Kilrogg Deadeye, and Azuka Bladefury. I\'d watch out for Azuka... it seems she is charged with destroying the Alliance forces here on Draenor.', '', 85058, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the ogres! Wait... there are no more ogres... all gone so long ago. Only their broken ruins that must be returned to the ground...', '', 85057, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are free to go, you need only fly away. Hee hee.', '', 85056, 0, 26553, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I do not remember... what is this?  Fleshbags in my domain! Slay them my minions!', '', 85055, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I will stay until the job is done my brothers... return to the Overgrowth and I will meet you there in a few thousand years... I will not rest until my minions have crushed every worked stone to dust!', '', 85054, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The proud Y\'kish, bound in chain and leagues upon leagues from your precious Skettis.', '', 85053, 0, 26553, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know about Grommash Hellscream\'s plans?', 'What do you know about Grommash Hellscream\'s plans?', 85052, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you going, my brethren? It has only been a thousand years since we saw the last ogre! They may return anytime, we must be vigilant!', '', 85051, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll poke around here. See if you can find anything elsewhere in the camp.', '', 85050, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. I know my way around here.', '', 85049, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not presume your parlor tricks will work on me.', '', 85048, 0, 26553, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you kneel before me, I will grant you a quick death before feeding you to my digestion pool!', '', 85047, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the choicest bits of the intruders my minions! Find them and bring them to me!', '', 85046, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone invaders! I, Malkor, rule here now! My minions will feast on your bones!', '', 85045, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a clever bird. How clever are you feeling now?', '', 85044, 0, 26553, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, little draenei, that thing should not have cut you. You are getting sloppy.', '', 85042, 0, 27343, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang tight, $Gsir:my lady;. I\'m here to help you.', '', 85041, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onaala, I choose you!', 'Onaala, I choose you!', 85040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chel, I choose you!', 'Chel, I choose you!', 85039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to speak to the others.', 'I\'d like to speak to the others.', 85038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure this is the follower you want?', 'Are you sure this is the follower you want?', 85037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Andren, I choose you!', 'Andren, I choose you!', 85036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster! You should have been able to kill that thing in half the time it took you.', '', 85035, 0, 27343, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn to salute after each kill, or I will take your other eye.', '', 85034, 0, 27343, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Getting tired yet, little draenei?', '', 85033, 0, 27343, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight another.', '', 85032, 0, 27343, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fists and gratitude are yours, stranger. How do you feel about killing an ogre chief before you go?', '', 85031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... my husband... did you save my husband?', 85030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More supplies commander? Our soldiers could always use them.', 85029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, little mouse. I haven\'t forgotten about you. I\'ll take care of you... later.', 85028, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove yourself, Azuka, and I shall esteem you among my Warlords.', '', 85027, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry forth your ancestral blade. Bathe it in the blood of our enemies. Show me its legendary power.', '', 85026, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha... bold words from my newest Warlord. Very well!', '', 85024, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrahh... I will slice off your tongue for that!', '', 85023, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade skills surpass those of my sires, Warchief. I can clean up Blackhand\'s mess.', 85022, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. I will have you deal with the other-worlders as well. Or... do you lack the bloodlust of your forefathers?', '', 85021, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, Warchief. We need only the Heart of Gorgorek to give it life.', 85020, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 46350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azuka! How goes the search for the alpha?', '', 85019, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again, Blackhand? All I hear are excuses.', '', 85018, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance and Horde forces strike at the Foundry, but they are nothing I cannot handle.', '', 85017, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of you, Blackhand?', '', 85016, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am keeping a close eye on the Highmaul ogres, Warchief. So far, they remain... obedient.', '', 85015, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Operations in Tanaan go well. The Citadel is almost complete.', '', 85014, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I can kill who I want, when I want! Meet me in the ogre mound when you are done and we will rip faces together!', '', 85013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ogres of Stonemaul forced us to be gladiators.$b$bEveryday we fight, we kill, and we salute.$b$bThey made us battle whatever beast or creature the ogres had found that day.$b$bIt took a long time planning, but some of us managed to escape.', 85012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, it is a pleasure to meet you.$b$bWhen I was young I trained hard to become an anchorite in the priesthood, but the Light walks us down mysterious paths. My defensive spells were so powerful that the Prophet himself encouraged me to train with the Vindicators.$b$bThese days, I am not afraid to stand toe-to-toe with our enemies, protecting those behind me. Choose me as your follower and my faith will be your shield, my armor a bulwark protecting your garrison from our many enemies.', 85011, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vindicator Onaala, ready for orders.', 85010, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander!$b$bI am Apprentice Artificer Andren. Before Hataaru was murdered I was one of his most trusted assistants. As an Artificer I use draenei technology to disable foes long enough for me or someone else to crush them. I suppose among your people I\'d be considered a... warrior engineer?$b$bI will do my best to serve your interests if you choose me as a follower.', '', 85009, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday I hope to drop the \"Apprentice\" title.', '', 85008, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, commander! My name is Rangari Chel.$b$bWhen we first arrived on Draenor, this whole world was a mystery - a dangerous mystery. The rangari were tasked with exploring all these new, hostile environments. We learned to survive on our feet - using the natural resources of the land around us to survive and slip unseen in and out of enemy territory.$b$bAs your follower, I\'d focus on staying out of sight, keeping foes at bay, and doing serious damage.', 85007, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final setting sun draws near.', '', 85006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rangari Chel reporting for duty.', 85005, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eager for the glory of battle, the young chieftain had hoped to incite a war with the arakkoa.', '', 85004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, commander.$b$bI\'ve been scouting around the garrison to make sure the perimeters are secure. Unfortunately, I wasn\'t alone. Something was watching me from the underbrush, but it ran away. The trail gets cold at the river\'s edge.$b$bStay on your guard!', 85003, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Satisfied that his message was clear, the Talon King left the Bloodmane to pick up the pieces of their broken tribe.', '', 85002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, commander!$b$bNeed anything fixed? Tinkered with? ...Killed?', '', 85001, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their pridelord was fierce, but he was no match for Terokk.', '', 85000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello commander! What\'s the plan for today?$b$bPut me in the front, I\'m ready for anything!', 84999, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the sweep of his wings, he cut down even the strongest of the Bloodmane like so many blades of grass.', '', 84998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He moved with grace and power matched only by the wind.', '', 84997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gggrrr... You are unworthy to fight Vul\'gor!', '', 84996, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Talon King came alone, and what ensued was not a war. It was a slaughter.', '', 84995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, a Bloodmane pridelord commanded his hunters to bring him ten thousand arakkoa feathers.', '', 84994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis gladiator may be da new champion of da ring, but dey is still no match for Vul\'gor!', '', 84993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We are truly kindred spirits, $n. Until we meet again.', '', 84992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da only gladiator strong enough to beat Roakk is Vul\'gor! Dis fight is over before it even start!', '', 84991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now Captain Boomspark is da extra crispy one! Save me a drumstick! HAHAHA! Drumstick!', '', 84990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da best part of Captain Boomspark fights is eatin\' da extra crispy challengers! HAHAHA!!', '', 84989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea, yea... I not impressed! Let\'s see how da next fight goes!', '', 84988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hol\'yelaa kill da last challenger before da fight even start! HAHAHA!!', '', 84987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raketalon was weak! Da next fight won\'t be so easy!', '', 84986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raketalon always fight harder when she hungry, and we not feed her dis week! BAHAHAHA!!', '', 84985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It obvious dat dis was a fluke! Dat is my expert opinion, Jhorn!', '', 84984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crushmaul gonna win dis by a landslide! HAHAHA!!', '', 84983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible! The Ring of Trials has a new champion! What you think, Thoktar?', '', 84982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me north of here when you are finished.', '', 84981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come for the final bout! Roakk the Zealot versus the challenger!', '', 84980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a rat among us. I will find out who.', '', 84979, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. Stand down, Exarch. Enough damage has been done.', '', 84978, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 43280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I forbid it! He has suffered enough!', '', 84977, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 46726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is my duty to know. Allow me to speak with the body.', '', 84976, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 44585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem to know an awful lot about the tools of our enemy.', '', 84975, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 43279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapon is tainted with fel energy.', '', 84974, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 44584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We ALWAYS argue. That doesn\'t mean I killed him!', 84973, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch Naielle, weren\'t you overheard arguing with Hataaru earlier?', '', 84972, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 43278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is how he was found. Murdered!', '', 84971, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All systems are active. Fire!', '', 84970, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me hook up the apparatus. Just a moment.', '', 84969, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capain Boomspark is defeated! Only one gladiator remains!', '', 84968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance fools! You expect to attack my base and live?!', '', 84967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will be my gift to Warchief Hellscream.', 84966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, well, well... look who\'s walked right into our trap.', 84965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please stop doing that.', '', 84964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop that.', '', 84963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready for the next bout! You going up against Captain Boomspark and the Burninator!', '', 84962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Alliance be at de gates! To Arms soldiers of de Horde!', '', 84961, 0, 30987, 0, 64, 0, 46573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRUUL CRUSH YOU NOW!!!', '', 84960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gruul... Fall... Down?', '', 84959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more.', '', 84958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 84957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scurry....', '', 84956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No escape!', '', 84955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRUUL SMASH!', '', 84954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stay...', '', 84953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha, Gruul kill you so easy!', '', 84952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gruul smell flesh...', '', 84951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rumbles into laughter.', '', 84950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To dust....', '', 84949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into... nothing....', '', 84948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
