('With Gar\'mak dead the Iron Horde will be in disarray until they appoint a new leader here on Azeroth. Although we have won this battle, I fear the war has just begun.', '', 84795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
