('We must keep pushing back on the Iron Horde. They need to know we will not sit by and watch as they kill our brothers and sisters.', '', 84793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plant the Alliance flags inside Nethergarde, our men will do the rest.', '', 84792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charge!', '', 84791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got someone you need to shank, bludgeon, cleave, or perforate? I\'ve got the right weapon for any job!', 84790, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhh!', '', 84789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You lookin\' to fight in the arena? I\'ve got everything you need under one roof!', 84788, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... it appears the Iron Horde has formed an alliance with the Dreadmaul ogres. This is going to be more difficult than I thought.', '', 84787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come get your burgers! You like sausage? I\'ve got the juiciest clefthoof wieners around!', '', 84786, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring those battleplans back to me and we can begin to dismantle this Iron Horde.', '', 84785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can fly again!', '', 84784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Scrape your knee in the arena? I can fix any injury for the right price!', 84783, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Raven Mother!', '', 84782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hopefully the prisoners you saved will have an opportunity to rebuild Nethergarde to its former glory.', '', 84781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the night!', '', 84780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the freshest meat come to Meatgut! If you don\'t, I\'ll pound your face in!', '', 84779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nethergarde has lost so much already, I can\'t stand to see them lose more.', '', 84778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My goods is only for ogres and gladiators! If you is something else, I\'ll crush your face with my hammer!', '', 84777, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With those scouts dead we have a greater chance of catching the Iron Horde by surprise. Excellent work, $n.', '', 84776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrifying Gronnling Killed: $1i (+$2i VP)', '', 84775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot win this battle if the enemy is always one step ahead of us.', '', 84774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With those machines destroyed we can focus on our next move.', '', 84773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot win this battle if those Iron Horde war machines remain operational.', '', 84772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad you are on our side, $n.', '', 84771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must hold the frontline!', '', 84770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Nethergarde!', 'For Nethergarde!', 84769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 84768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', 'Attack!', 84767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This madness ends now, Gar\'mak!', '', 84766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gar\'mak is dead. You fought well today. Meet me back at camp.', '', 84765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 84764, 0, 23503, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Take me to the town hall!', 'Please! Take me to the town hall!', 84763, 0, 23503, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiate harvesting of organics.', '', 84762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell the remaining exarchs to number their days.', '', 84761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! When next we meet, it will be on MY terms.', '', 84760, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 43292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are others at my command. In Shattrath and Auchindoun.', '', 84759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will prevail.', '', 84758, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 43294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take my rightful place.', '', 84757, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 43290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise never to lie, cheat, or steal ever again! Honest!', '', 84756, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth has been invaded by a vicious enemy that seems bent on world domination.$b$bWe must act quickly if we are to put a stop to the chaos that is unfolding around us.', '', 84755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re pretty much the worst archer I\'ve ever seen!', '', 84754, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I did was borrow your purse... and your gear... and your mount. I was going to give it back!', '', 84753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, you want to fight in the arena with that aim?', '', 84752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can let me down now, I learned my lesson!', '', 84751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody ever taught me that stealing was wrong! I was misled as a youth!', '', 84750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t mean to steal from you, honest!', '', 84749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one almost hit me!', '', 84748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh... You\'ll be okay, Nisha.', '', 84747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut down in the prime of his life, sadly the arbiter didn\'t make it.', '', 84746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check for a pulse.', 'Check for a pulse.', 84745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lighting Torch', 'Lighting Torch', 84744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey oh! These plant people make quite a spread, but I canno\' stand the sight o\' it much longer!', '', 84743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have sworn the sacrament. I have taken my new name... Socrethar.', '', 84742, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 43289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You will eat, breathe, and kill for the glory of the arena!', '', 84741, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you die in there, I\'ll make sure Meatgut puts what\'s left of you to good use!', '', 84740, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wimps aren\'t even worthy to clean the arena floor!', '', 84739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord Sargeras will scorch this pathetic world, as he has countless others.', '', 84738, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you try to dance like a butterfly... you\'ll get crushed like one!', '', 84737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve our true master now. The Legion whose call I once denied.', '', 84736, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 43286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to laugh when you weaklings die in the ring!', '', 84735, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More supplies commander? Our soldiers could always use them.', '', 84734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s was holding a Bloodmaul Cache!', '', 84733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have supplies for me commander?  Every piece helps the war effort.', '', 84732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not the traitor here. It was the false prophet Velen who betrayed our people.', '', 84731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go on, I\'ll be fine! I\'ll catch up.', 84730, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see you there. Don\'t wait up!', '', 84729, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight harder or I\'ll save you the trouble of dying in the arena and kill you myself!', '', 84728, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you are gladiators? I could crush your skulls between my toes!', '', 84727, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the rappelling rope down, commander.', '', 84726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work it harder! Better! Faster! Stronger!', '', 84725, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you!', 'Thank you!', 84724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s dead! I\'m out of here!', 'She\'s dead! I\'m out of here!', 84723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run!', 'Run!', 84722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s my chance!', 'Now\'s my chance!', 84721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bodies shall feed the bloom. Aren\'t you thankful?', '', 84720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, COME! Sit yourself by my fire. Would you like some frogs legs?', 84719, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve worked my whole life for this one moment. To die for Azeroth is the most glorious of deaths!', 'I\'ve worked my whole life for this one moment. To die for Azeroth is the most glorious of deaths!', 84718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear that Gul\'dan is here! Is it true, commander?', 'I hear that Gul\'dan is here! Is it true, commander?', 84717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem that the gate is being powered by the souls of innocents!', 'It would seem that the gate is being powered by the souls of innocents!', 84716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my death results in success for your mission it will be a death well spent.', 'If my death results in success for your mission it will be a death well spent.', 84715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get us home safely, $n. I have a family I\'d like to see again.', 'Get us home safely, $n. I have a family I\'d like to see again.', 84714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, Commander $n. Judgment day is upon us! We must be victorious!', 'This is it, Commander $n. Judgment day is upon us! We must be victorious!', 84713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth depends on you, $n!', 'The fate of Azeroth depends on you, $n!', 84712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that a battle axe? It looks more like a cheap hatchet....', '', 84711, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $p.$B$B I knew you couldn\'t leave the Adherents to run free - not after witnessing what they did in Aruuna and Veil Shadar.', '', 84710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would sooner take a tree branch into combat than this shield....', '', 84709, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are these gladiator weapons or souvenirs?', '', 84708, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your prices are reasonable... but these weapons are battered.', '', 84707, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These blades are too dull for combat....', '', 84706, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This blade has someone\'s initials engraved in it... did you find this on the arena floor?', '', 84705, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This axe couldn\'t chop a twig... let alone a gladiator!', '', 84704, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This blade looks worn and rusted... you said it was newly smithed!', '', 84703, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to move forward, we must understand what we\'ve left behind.', '', 84702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a traditional wayshrine. Terokk built many of them around the land to guide outcasts to Skettis.', '', 84701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rifling Books', 'Rifling Books', 84700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This jungle is no place for the temple-kneeler or the metal-bender.$b$bYou, however, I am not so sure of.$b$bYour weapons and gear speak of one who is experienced in a number of environments.', 84699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REMOVE - Good work. The artifact is yours to use.', '', 84698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This jungle is beautiful. I have never seen a place like this before.$b$bOf course, Kaalya keeps insisting that is why \'the jungle will kill you.\'', 84697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion\'s power is unsurpassed.', '', 84696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I had Hataaru killed. And you are next.', '', 84695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn him. I thought I\'d gotten rid of Maladaar when I gave him up to the Iron Horde.', '', 84694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heretics! Kill! Feast!', '', 84693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m indebted to you for life, commander.$B$BOlgra and I were promised to each other. One day, she\'s going to be my wife.', '', 84692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel like a fool for not having gone with her.', '', 84691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for everything, commander.$B$BI\'m happy to be back here with Mankrik, even if he is a jerk sometimes. Don\'t tell him, but I kinda like him, too.', 84690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits of my family are forever with in my heart.', 84689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, just barely. Are we late?', '', 84688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reshad! You survived Skettis!', '', 84687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good on you, kid.', '', 84685, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t ever want us to be apart again.', '', 84684, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for sending the commander, Mankrik.', 84683, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My family must be avenged.', 84682, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re frostwolf. We don\'t lose, blood elf.', '', 84681, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better get used to loss, kid. That\'s life.', '', 84680, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, commander. I don\'t know what I\'d do if something happened to her.', '', 84679, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The Raven Mother\'s voice coos within your mind.>$B$BDo you know why I allow these accursed, forgotten children of Rukhmar to live among my flock? it is because I weep for them.$B$BThey are trapped between two gods: one who fears and rejects them, and one who would enslave them to his dark will.$B$BTheir only champion abandoned them long ago, and nobody has stood beside them since.$B$BUntil you came along.', 84678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on ahead, I would like a word with $p.', '', 84677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes. And something unexpected, too! We have much to discuss.', '', 84676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have the relics?', '', 84675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Adherents grow bolder each day. It\'s all we can do to keep Veil Terokk shrouded from them.', '', 84674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows gather...', '', 84673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raastok, I need a shroud at that dig site. Kura, back him up.', '', 84672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The news!', 'The news!', 84671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All\'s quiet!', 'All\'s quiet!', 84670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set me free!', '', 84669, 8, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fly, Ka\'alu.', 'I am ready to fly, Ka\'alu.', 84668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost there. Come along, Percy!', '', 84667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vanguard will hold the front, commander. You must complete your mission!', 'The vanguard will hold the front, commander. You must complete your mission!', 84666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For now, we can consider this a monumental victory. Thank you, hero.', 84665, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178535|h[Warlock Gateway]|h|r has been destroyed by the Horde!', 84664, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without their leader, the Sargerei will crumble. The Auchenai will soon be able to reclaim their city.', 84663, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, we have defeated one of Gul\'dan\'s strongest allies.', 84662, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178535|h[Warlock Gateway]|h|r has been activated! Check your map for the locations.', 84661, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A call is coming, hero. I feel it, large and looming, just beyond the horizon. When the time  comes, the draenei must answer.', '', 84660, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He questioned our complacency. Perhaps we have been too content, too SAFE, hiding here on Draenor.', '', 84659, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I admit, even in Socrethar\'s madness, there was a hint of truth.', '', 84658, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Socrethar is working directly with the Shadow Council. To stop the Burning Legion, we must end his reign.', 84657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot allow the Burning Legion to gain a foothold here on Draenor. Socrethar\'s reign must end.', '', 84656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have we here? A friend of the family?', '', 84655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bring this strange gift and helped those in Skettis... yes, I think we can come to an arrangement. The shadows cover much.', '', 84654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have brought this as a peace offering. I hope we can become close allies.', 'I have brought this as a peace offering. I hope we can become close allies.', 84653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Gronnling is terrifying your troops!', 'A Gronnling is terrifying your troops!', 84652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Let us proceed, $p.', '', 84651, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Same to you, Exarch. We have much to report to Archmage Khadgar.', 84650, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought, Lady Liadrin. Let us meet back at the Spire of Light.', '', 84649, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you on the next dig, $n! We couldn\'t have done it without you!', '', 84648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But my old bones would only slow you down. I\'ll be fine here.', '', 84647, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, how sweet of you, Reshad! I never knew you cared.', '', 84646, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 46233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ornekka, it is not safe here - the Adherents are out in force. Come with us to Veil Terokk.', '', 84645, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Failure!', '', 84644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do the Gateways do?', 'What do the Gateways do?', 84643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Gateways activate at the South-East and North-West of Ashran. Use them to teleport between the two points.', 84642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is what the little sneak was hiding... the High Sage will be pleased.', '', 84641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t allow that relic to fall into ogre hands! It belongs in a private collection!', '', 84640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wretched outcast begged for death in the end - and so will you!', '', 84639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you see Gazmolf, tell him Gabby sent you!', 84638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, DIE!', '', 84637, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never! My power is that of the Burning Legion... endless.', '', 84636, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to challenge me? I am the voice of those who will burn this world to ash!', '', 84635, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They fell beneath the glory of the Light. As you will fall before us, demon!', 84634, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Socrethar! We bear proof of your slain lieutenants. Will you take retribution against us, or are you afraid?', 84633, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yield, old friend... and we shall show mercy in your final hour.', '', 84632, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We currently have $9261w collected. We need $9708w total.', 84631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our work here is finished. The forgotten children of Rukhmar fight bravely against their headstrong brethren. Now, we must continue our attack. Hold tightly, our destination is the next spire.', 84630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'ve done it?  Well, then.  Be gone and leave me to my mourning.\n\nSo young... she was so young...', '', 84629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s nothing now, a twisted soul chained to our world.  My sister was so sweet, so loving, so young... The Shadowmoon did this!  Twisted her by some foul magic! They left her walking the world as a shadow, crying out in eternal torment.\n\nI couldn\'t.  I can\'t.  I cannot end her pain.  I cannot be the one to relive her pain.\n\nRelease her spirit.  Put her to rest.  I cannot bear seeing her like this.', '', 84628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Warlocks will erect Gateways so we can move around Ashran faster. We just need the magical power from those scattered artifact pieces found around Ashran. $B$BHow many have you brought me?', 84627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Gateways are up and running, $n! Use them to move around Ashran faster.', 84626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that? Is that Maladaar\'s work? No no, you don\'t need to do that. He is not to be trusted.', '', 84625, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 43282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fangraal will march into the Road of Glory and clear it of any Horde it finds.', '', 84624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to meet with Rangari Erdanii.', 'I need to meet with Rangari Erdanii.', 84623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the skies can be dangerous in Gorgrond. Be on your guard.', 84622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well \'ello there! \'Ave ya got somethin\' for me today?', 84621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, it\'s you. Trust me, friend, I will handle this. You may go.', '', 84620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the shadows for us, Percy.', '', 84619, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does the Ancient of War do?', 'What does the Ancient of War do?', 84618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nagrand is just full of amazing artifacts and the Steamwheedle Preservation Society is here to find them!', 84617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think you cleaned those Warsong out good an\' proper. No sense in risking your neck out there anymore.', 84616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful if you plan on taking the glider over Grommashar, pal. Those orcs down there are not too fond of the pop-in.', 84615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Ka\'alu calmly gazes at you a moment before her voice fills your thoughts.>$b$bIn all of these eons I have never allowed anyone to ride upon my back. But now is the time for my vanity to end, too many lives hang in the balance.$b$bThe children of Rukhmar threaten both these accursed ones and my flock. I know that it is only together, with all of our strength, can we prevail.$b$bAre you ready to do that which must be done?', 84614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The goren fled, but I don\'t think they fled from us...', '', 84613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one more bolt to tighten....', '', 84612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... we could have ruled Gorgrond with this... red everywhere...', '', 84611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s be done with this. There is power here, I can smell and taste it! No screaming marsh or misty monsters are going to stop me!', '', 84610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sticky spores are going to stop me!', '', 84609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell D\'kaan... I am... sorry...', '', 84608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is so hazy here, I can barely see... and its so loud.  I wish everyone would be quiet!', '', 84607, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t seem to get this filth off of me... don\'t worry, I\'ve crawled through worse...', '', 84606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The miasma here coats everything! We should not stay long...', '', 84605, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Warsong guys couldn\'t possibly need all of the supplies they\'ve been stockpiling here - especially after the Horde puts the hurt on \'em. \n\nSo the way I see it, if we want to take some to make some profit on the side, what\'s the harm?', '', 84604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
