('', 'With all these rampaging elementals, we\'re running short on pilots. Got plenty of gliders, though. Take one out for a spin and see what you find!', 84505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Soulgrinder is purged!', '', 84504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purge the void energy from the Soulgrinder!', '', 84503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is about to vomit ectoplasm!', '', 84502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyami, take the body to Auchindoun and lay it to rest.', '', 84501, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 44616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He mentioned an Exarch. A betrayal from within the council itself?', '', 84500, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened? Why did you stop it?', '', 84499, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We were about to lose him. You saw him - he called out to me for help. His spirit is safe now.', 84498, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s points at Soulbinder Nyami.', '', 84497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Soulbinder...', '', 84496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<coughs> What foul stench!  I don\'t think I got a full breath of it though...', '', 84495, 0, 924, 584, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who, Hataaru? Who had you killed?', '', 84494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the Exarch\'s orders...', '', 84493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maladaar. We\'re losing him.', 84492, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 43627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...wanted what, Hataaru? The codes to Auchindoun? Your security wards?', '', 84491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auchindoun... they wanted...', '', 84490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Exarch, they\'re tearing his soul apart. We must stop this!', 84489, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 43626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K\'ure will be deeply missed by my people, but the story of your courage in the face of evil will inspire them.', '', 84488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exoch, maloch, talomai! Hataaru, come to the light...', '', 84487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Not until we know. We must know who did this to him!', '', 84486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rent Constructs for 1 copper?', 'Rent Constructs for 1 copper?', 84485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you like my constructs?', '', 84484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put them away please.', 'Put them away please.', 84483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, I\'ll rent them.', 'Ok, I\'ll rent them.', 84482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rent my constructs.', '', 84481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My presence is requested for duty.  I must leave immediately.', '', 84480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a party in your heart, and all the bladed weapons are invited.  Have a pleasant day.', '', 84479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still alive, eh? If I were you, I\'d cut my losses while you\'re ahead. There can\'t be anything more worth finding around here anyway.', '', 84478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glider\'s all yours, friend. I\'d go myself, but untimely death is not my thing.', '', 84477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We currently have $9250w collected. We need $9706w total.', '', 84476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A persistent one, aren\'t ya? I think you\'re safe to move on now, boss.', '', 84475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 'How many Artifact Fragments have we collected?', 84474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can help you. Just... set me free.', '', 84473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to disable the Dark Portal?', '', 84472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... strange invaders...', '', 84471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hiya, pal. Nice day for some gliding, eh?', '', 84470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly now, I have a bad feeling about all this...', '', 84469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golad, maloch, valsheva. Follow the sound of my voice, spirit. Lend your sight to the living. Golad, maloch, valsheva!', '', 84468, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like this spot\'s dried up. Maybe you should try one of the other gliders.', 84467, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The glider is good to go! Just let us know if you find anything good, okay?', 84466, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away, old man. (Soon Highmaul will burn. Then, the world!)', '', 84465, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re insane.', '', 84464, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve learned much from K\'ure. (We\'re writing a book.)', '', 84463, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golad, maloch, valsheva! Golad, maloch, valsheva - Light give me strength...', '', 84462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have claimed his body, but his immortal soul is mine to protect.', '', 84461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone, exarch. This one, and all he knows, belongs to us now.', '', 84460, 0, 27250, 0, 64, 0, 45523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Golad, maloch, valsheva. Follow the sound of my voice, spirit - lend your sight to the living. Golad, maloch, valsheva!', '', 84459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there and welcome to the Rusty Cylinder Bar and Grill!', 84458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! A little cosmic radiation never hurt anybody!', '', 84457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The body is ready, Exarch. I will anchor his spirit.', 84456, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 43625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be unable to help once the ritual begins. Stay focused.', '', 84455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get moving! $n, we\'ll see you back at camp.', '', 84454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A traitor among us - a fallen Exarch!$b$bThis is... unthinkable.', '', 84453, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready. Begin the ritual, Exarch.', 'I am ready. Begin the ritual, Exarch.', 84452, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fel energies are even now devouring Exarch Hataaru\'s soul. We must act quickly.$b$bSoulbinder Nyami will anchor Hataaru\'s spirit to this realm while I exorcise the demons assaulting him. With luck, we will find out who murdered him.$b$bIt will be up to you to destroy the evil as I unleash it. Are you ready, $n?', '', 84451, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Boss, you sure this thing\'s safe?', '', 84450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THAT\'S how archaeology is done!', '', 84449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think not. (We\'re done taking orders from you!)', '', 84448, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will obey, disciple. Hand over its reins.', '', 84447, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power? (It\'s MY power!)', '', 84446, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is my power, ogre?', '', 84445, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet freedom!', 'Sweet freedom!', 84444, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. May the spirits guide you.', 'Thank you, $n. May the spirits guide you.', 84443, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to slay every ogre I see!', 'I\'m going to slay every ogre I see!', 84442, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar!', 'Lok\'tar!', 84441, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a true hero.', 'You are a true hero.', 84440, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light! I shall go rescue my sisters.', 'Thank the Light! I shall go rescue my sisters.', 84439, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never forget this.', 'I\'ll never forget this.', 84438, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I would have surely died in there.', 'Thank you! I would have surely died in there.', 84437, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard you like da beaten!', '', 84436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
