('Let me get to da beaten!', '', 84431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows gather in Veil Terokk, beneath the lonely spire.', '', 84430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merely adolescent gronn, Khadgar. Nothing that Commander $p couldn\'t handle alone.', '', 84429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44777, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight on, brothers and sisters! $p will see us through this war!', '', 84428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44776, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
