('', '<The two Exarchs are in the middle of a heated argument.>$b$bExarch Hataaru focuses too much on what we lost. I keep trying to tell him - it would be folly to turn this world into a second Argus, even if we had the power. Draenor is unique, and we should build our technology to suit this new world. Not the other way around!$b$bHe seems willing to listen to you. Maybe you can talk some sense into him.', 84146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The two Exarchs are in the midst of a heated argument.>$b$bThank you for all your help, $n. Apparently my devices have riled up the local flora - not to mention my fellow Exarch.$b$bIt is no matter. I will do whatever it takes to defend our people and rebuild what we lost... the occasional bug is to be expected. Surely you agree!', '', 84145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When will you learn that this world is nothing like Argus?', 84144, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you sink resonance crystals in the ground again? You\'re driving the creatures of the earth berserk!', 84143, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is going on here? The entire mushroom forest is riled up.', 84142, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
