('', 'This is a Draakorium Fey Dragon. It\'s as maneuverable as a jackrabbit and can flip end to end in less than a second.', 84083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
