('', 'You\'ve all flown before, but you\'re about to enter a whole new world, so pay attention.', 84081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Attention, trainees! My fellow riders call me Moonstag. You may address me as \"Sir.\"', 84080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel, let\'s blow open those gates and take Grommashar.', 'Yrel, let\'s blow open those gates and take Grommashar.', 84079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Strange thing. Come, eat! The food is so delicious. You must taste.$b$bIt is so tasty I have not thought to stab you once... yet.', '', 84078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to be an adventurer like yourself...$b$bI remember it like it was yesterday. I was back in Azeroth at my favorite establishment, maybe you\'ve heard of it? Goes by the name of Lion\'s Pride Inn, smack dab in the middle of Goldshire.$b$bWell, there I was across from ol\' Dobbins enjoying myself a nice bit of fine aged cheddar and washing it back with a flagon of melon juice when Dughie runs into the tavern!$b$bHis face was white as snow...nay, whiter than snow! Says he spotted a kobold not far off and it was carrying a candle, like it was fixin\' to burn Goldshire to the ground!$b$bI threw down my fine aged cheddar, made for the door and tripped over a dwarven hunter.$b$bWe crashed to the ground and POW! I took an arrow right to the knee!', '', 84077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will destroy the Breakers of this canyon and avenge those I have lost!', '', 84076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
