('', 'Brighteye is one of the smartest fey dragons we\'ve trained at the Draakorium. He loves doing tricks for visitors!\n\nWhy don\'t you see if Brighteye can do a trick for you?', 84064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatsh do you want? Can\'t you shee I\'m trying to drinksss here? Pour yourshelf one.$B$BHemetsh, come to Nagrandsss the Alliance and Horde shaid. There\'sh big game to hunt shtill.$B$BBut, when I gots here wasss that what they wantsh me to do? NO!$B$BHemetsh, hunt the Warshong\'s wolvesss. Deprive the orcsh of their mountsss.$B$BThat\'sh no job for Hemet Neshingwary!', '', 84063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done all we can from up here...', '', 84062, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s your watch. Wake up!', '', 84061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So getting that bloom back might fix things... interesting...', 'So getting that bloom back might fix things... interesting...', 84060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When a champion like Dionor falls, a Death Bloom will grow from his husk. I was to collect this Bloom and perform a sacred rite here to release his life force back to the overgrowth.$b$bAs I was about to do this I was set upon by fur-covered two legs and they took the Bloom first. We tried to follow but they raised barriers and used fire to drive us back.$b$bSo now I stand vigil over my failure until we are all ground into the tortured soil by our great enemy...', '', 84059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were you supposed to do?', 'What were you supposed to do?', 84058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dionor was a powerful and bold champion of our kind. He sought to break the ancient lines of battle and take the fight to the enemy.$b$bIt ended with his defeat at the hands of several Magnaron... Here he fell, some of his energy creating a small sanctuary for those of us that remained until I could fulfill my duty... but I cannot...', '', 84057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, Brighteye, now play dead!', 'Okay, Brighteye, now play dead!', 84056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit, Brighteye, sit!', 'Sit, Brighteye, sit!', 84055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for not killing me.  What duty have you failed?', 'Thank you for not killing me.  What duty have you failed?', 84054, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brighteye, go fetch!', 'Brighteye, go fetch!', 84053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brighteye looks at you eagerly, awaiting a command.', '', 84052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A building is being eaten!', '', 84051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should crush you but what would be the point... I have failed in my duties and can only wait until I am crushed to dust...', '', 84050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is where we train the young fey darters to follow commands. \n\nThough their antics may seem silly, the discipline they learn now is imperative if we ever wish them to take a rider.', '', 84049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
