('', 'Don\'t let them take the artifact!', 84040, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Genedar was once a vessel guided by the naaru and powered by the Light itself. Now, as we stand among the wreckage of that great ship, the Light is absent... I sense only darkness here.', '', 84039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What remains of this corpse is now fertilizer for the seeds growing in this pool.', 'What remains of this corpse is now fertilizer for the seeds growing in this pool.', 84038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Laughing Skull looks as though they were eating a lot before they were slain, their body grown fat and distorted before death.', 'This Laughing Skull looks as though they were eating a lot before they were slain, their body grown fat and distorted before death.', 84037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The remains of this corpse are being devoured by the roots and vines of the swiftly budding seeds in the pool.', 'The remains of this corpse are being devoured by the roots and vines of the swiftly budding seeds in the pool.', 84036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible!', 84035, 0, 0, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Touch the sword.>', '<Touch the sword.>', 84034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal has taken me into the Twisting Nether.', 'The portal has taken me into the Twisting Nether.', 84033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shaman stone that the furies gave to us at the Throne of Elements allows us to communicate through the elements.', '', 84032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do we have to?', 'Do we have to?', 84031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, I was just about to win...', 'Alright, back to work.', 84030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, back to work.', 'Alright, back to work.', 84029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have learned all the recipes from this research.', 'You have learned all the recipes from this research.', 84028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beneath the crystal mountain the orcs call Oshu\'gun lays the wreckage of the Genedar. Were it not for the Prophet Velen and the mercy of the naaru K\'ure, my people would have perished to the Burning Legion.', '', 84027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We brought this sapling with us from our home, and now it is dying. I cannot sense any evil nearby, but I will keep trying.', 84026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly! Into the cave, before they thaw.', '', 84025, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, with me!', '', 84024, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I guess we owe you one.', '', 84023, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. I only counted ninety-nine kills, wizard.', '', 84022, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, but we don\'t have that kind of time.', '', 84021, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now - kill your hundred, or die trying!', '', 84020, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got the enemy in my sights. Hold the line, lads!', 'I\'ve got the enemy in my sights. Hold the line, lads!', 84019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve had enough. You\'re fired!', '', 84018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have you written up for this!', '', 84017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your break isn\'t for another hour. Back to work!', '', 84016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work! Commander Taylor won\'t be kept waiting.', '', 84015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know... Tall Buck\'s a silly name. But, we have to call him something, and he is rather large.', 84014, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t underestimate the talbuk, wolf-$g brother:sister;. While they\'re mostly peaceful creatures, they hit as hard as an elekk.', 84013, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make Azeroth proud, commander.', '', 84012, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll see who\'s best.', '', 84011, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, wolf-$g brother:sister;.', 84010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me, and stay close.', '', 84009, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, commander. How may I help you?', 84008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had heard of the Throne of Elements, a place where the elements could speak with the orcs. I had never dreamed that one day I would stand here in the presence of giants.$b$bThough I am a stranger here, I feel as if I have been here before...in a dream perhaps.', '', 84007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must act swiftly, Oshu\'gun awaits.', '', 84006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, we will commune with the great furies.', '', 84005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must attune yourself with the elements upon the plateau.', '', 84004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have our aid. We will find the fury of earth and restore the balance.', '', 84003, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Nobundo, a humble paladin. I have been called here by a voice upon the wind. How may we aid you?', '', 84002, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know... Tall Buck\'s a silly name. But, we have to call him something, and he is rather large.', 84001, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t underestimate the talbuk, $c. While they\'re mostly peaceful creatures, they hit as hard as an elekk.', 84000, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make Azeroth proud, commander.', 83999, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll see who\'s best.', 83998, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The villagers were easy. You\'re next.', '', 83997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... when you see her... tell her I love her.', '', 83996, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... when you see her... tell her I love her.', '', 83995, 0, 26830, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wh-who are you? Where\'s Bryan?', 83994, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show the spectral essences to Alice.', 'Show the spectral essences to Alice.', 83993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Alice doesn\'t seem to acknowledge your presence.>', 83992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varasha charges into her lair!', '', 83991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gronn, gnash them in your teeth!', 83990, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gronnlings, break their bones and bring them to me!', 83989, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, come on through. Steady... Steady...', '', 83988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde Win!', '', 83987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sit, Moonglow, sit! Good dragon!', '', 83986, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh- what happened? Where am I?', '', 83985, 0, 26702, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright Moonglow, now play dead!', '', 83984, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh- what happened? Where am I? Jasper... is that you?', '', 83983, 0, 26703, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin the Ritual of Binding.', 'I am ready to begin the Ritual of Binding.', 83982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks to be a hydra egg and is very close to hatching.$b$bIts mother would likely be nearby and would not appreciate you being near her nest.', '', 83981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s a pretty fey dragon? You\'re a pretty fey dragon!', '', 83980, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though much has been lost, I sense a great peace in the elements. I will remember your courage always, friend.', '', 83979, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show the schematic to Bryan.', 'Show the schematic to Bryan.', 83978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Where did all of my workers go? They\'ll be working overtime to finish this.', '', 83977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you hungry, little Moonglow? Here, let me get you some fish.', '', 83976, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go! I will hold back any reinforcements that attempt to follow!', '', 83975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light heals all wounds.', '', 83974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, there. It will all be okay.', '', 83973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance Win!', '', 83972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bryan! It\'s me, Jasper. What happened to you?', '', 83971, 0, 26703, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some sorta bad voodoo be happenin\' here, commander.', '', 83970, 0, 26702, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no. The whole thing\'s all wrong!', '', 83969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll get you there, son.', 'That\'ll get you there, son.', 83968, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah. Tastes like home.', 'Ah. Tastes like home.', 83967, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s like a little piece of Ironforge.', 'It\'s like a little piece of Ironforge.', 83966, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just like Mom used to make.', 'Just like Mom used to make.', 83965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh!', '', 83964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The furies await you at the Throne of Elements, $n.', '', 83963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At long last... my time has come! This world shall crumble beneath the power of the void!', '', 83962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cave will serve us well.', '', 83960, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n.', '', 83959, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t die or they\'ll eat you!', '', 83957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if I could sell their crystals...', '', 83956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size of its teeth!', '', 83955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are so many of them!', '', 83954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s too many of these things!', '', 83953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do these keep coming from?', '', 83952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone find a way to collapse that tunnel!', '', 83951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get the goren!', '', 83950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haunted Hound has spotted you!', '', 83949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is ready! Go inside and power on the console while I observe...', '', 83948, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, all I have is spare parts and whatever primitive materials we can cobble together.', '', 83947, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On our homeworld, art, science, magic and technology were all as one. Ah, such wonders we would build!', '', 83946, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step inside the chamber of truth and be cleansed!', 83945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Oh no...', '', 83944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Best be quick with that thing. We got incoming!', '', 83943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions! Nyami\'s agents - they went this way!', '', 83942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With respect, I disagree. We MUST not underestimate them. Take me to the Exarch Council.', '', 83941, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orcs would be fools to attack our fortified cities.', '', 83940, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice da best!', '', 83939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who the dummy now?', '', 83938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch Akama, these attacks are just the beginning.', '', 83937, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grr! Now I show you!', '', 83936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! Come get me now!', '', 83935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get moving!', 83934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow ow ow! Why me?!', '', 83933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you gonna get it!', '', 83932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hansel! You\'re alive! Here... let me help ya load.', '', 83931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy! Commander! That genesaur found us. The lasses are outside tryin\' to keep it at bay. They are gonna need yer help!', '', 83930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their attack is weakening.', 'Their attack is weakening.', 83929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few whacks more.', 'Just a few whacks more.', 83928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re on the run now.', 'They\'re on the run now.', 83927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t hear any more digging...', 'I can\'t hear any more digging...', 83926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spread out! Spread out!', 'Spread out! Spread out!', 83925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll be going for our buildings!', 'They\'ll be going for our buildings!', 83924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They could come from anywhere.', 'They could come from anywhere.', 83923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... CHOOO!', '', 83922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh...', '', 83921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New babies are just the thing to get these two feeling right as rain.', '', 83920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find those cherries under any of the trees.', '', 83919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pity that I cannot stay to watch you die. (We\'re going to Highmaul!)', '', 83918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger.', '', 83917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold, a void god is born! (You fools are too late!)', '', 83916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you don\'t look infected. You must be the $Gguy:lady; my niece was telling me about. Come on over!', '', 83915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh gross! Well, that wasn\'t it.', '', 83910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rangari do not leave people behind.', 83909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did you join us, Kaalya? If we are such an inconvenience, why not leave us to our own devices?', 83908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet Velen trusted me to turn the Iron Horde from Karabor. I can handle the jungle.', 83907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll move ahead and check for any orc ambushes, commander.', '', 83906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be goin\' ahead and makin\' sure it not a trap, commander.', '', 83905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmmph. Just keep up if you can.', 83904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A temple-kneeler and a metal-bender have no place in this jungle. You will need my help to survive.', 83903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is he dead? Phew... great work, commander. I\'ll stay here and take care of any stragglers.', 83902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178358|h[Fangraal]|h|r has been slain by the Horde!', '', 83901, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many injured who need my aid. There is no time to waste.', '', 83900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ungh! Brain freeze!', '', 83899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! Brain so cold!', '', 83898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search to the northwest. I will be right behind you.', '', 83897, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact fragments contain enough magical power to restore this Ancient to full strength. $B$BHow many have you brought us?', '', 83896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fangraal is born! He is pushing forward on the Road of Glory at this moment.', '', 83895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey commander, you have a second?', '', 83894, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m on it.', 83893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_surgeoflight.blp:20|t %s readies |cFFF00000|Hspell:153006|h[Consecrated Light]|h|r. Hide!', '', 83892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As we stand beneath the shadow of the once mighty Gordawg, I can feel the elements weep.', '', 83891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. I will endeavor to bring more, should the opportunity arise. Anu belore dela\'na!', '', 83890, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! |c00FFFF00|Hspell:178358|h[Fangraal]|h|r marches into Ashran to cleanse the Horde filth. Don\'t let him die, Alliance!', '', 83889, 0, 36470, 0, 64, 0, 8173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With any luck, we will escape before they can complete their transformation ritual.', '', 83888, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, a moment, please.', '', 83887, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of you, double your efforts! I want this place spotless for our commander.', '', 83886, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up, maggots. We\'re doubling up patrols. Nothing goes wrong while the commander is here, understood?', '', 83885, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bleeding Hollow orcs use savage blood magic to transform their warriors into hulking berserkers.', '', 83884, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you are. Now get to work, you slackers!', '', 83883, 0, 31251, 25, 64, 0, 44536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it.', '', 83882, 0, 31251, 1, 64, 0, 46718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supplies? What supplies? I have no idea what you are talking about.$b$b<Scrap\'s eyes dart back and forth and he nervously clears his throat.>$b$bWhat? I\'m not trying to steal them or anything... I mean, if I knew what you were even talking about, which I don\'t.', '', 83881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are almost there.', '', 83880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For $p! For the Alliance!', 'For $p! For the Alliance!', 83879, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I swear if he is swimming again... he has a horrible work ethic. He says he lost those supplies. I don\'t believe him for a second.', 83878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Start gathering everybody together, we need to expand our operation. And let me know if you find Pippers... he stole my favorite slippers.', 83877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another attack. They must think us an easy target. Hah!', '', 83876, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. I remember these hills well.', '', 83875, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Atten-tion! Our commander has arrived. Salute!', '', 83874, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look!', '', 83873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, ranger. These spider\'s eggs should aid in the concoction of an antidote for their venom.', '', 83872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve found another egg for your experiments, Teris. I hope this one helps.', '', 83871, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far, none of our medicines have had any effect on the spiders\' poison. \n\nWe must gather more specimens before we can concoct an effective antidote.', '', 83870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now. I will cover the rear.', '', 83869, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 46717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out - here they come.', '', 83868, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a joy to see Exarch Akama in action.', '', 83867, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, commander!', '', 83866, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Debug - Shutdown Scenario', '', 83865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For $p! For the Horde!', 'For $p! For the Horde!', 83864, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand up straight, you pathetic savages! Our commander approaches!', '', 83863, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deeds here will not be forgotten, $n. Your name shall be spoken in reverence among the spirits of my people.', '', 83862, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like Khadgar and the rest are on the move. Our work is nearly done, champion!', '', 83861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m coming for you, intruders...', '', 83860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in your kitchen, Kilrogg! Come and get us!', '', 83859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see you...', '', 83858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we stand, cowards! Come... FIGHT US!', '', 83857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and I against an entire clan? Sounds like my kind of fight.', '', 83856, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will move ahead and ensure the troops are ready for your inspection.', '', 83855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be goin\' ahead to get da troops ready for your inspection, commander.', '', 83854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead and sign off whenever you\'re ready, sir.', '', 83853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar has asked us to go distract the Eye of Kilrogg.', 'Khadgar has asked us to go distract the Eye of Kilrogg.', 83852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do to help?', '', 83851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Supervising of course. Now, get moving!', 83850, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, ma\'am.', 83849, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'About time! Come on, Gazwitz.', 83848, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here you are, miss Pinchwhistle!', '', 83847, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the prisoner go. Its master has earned a favor from us.', '', 83846, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will draw a cloak of midnight across the burning sky.', '', 83845, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your prisoner is with me. He means your people no harm.', 'Your prisoner is with me. He means your people no harm.', 83844, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night consumes us! (We have won! All will be as foretold!)', '', 83843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He comes... (You can never escape...)', '', 83842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in to darkness.', '', 83841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace the end.', '', 83840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end draws closer! (This is our purpose!)', '', 83839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes! (We know it well.)', '', 83838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world will be swallowed in darkness! (All will hear his call!)', '', 83837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze into the abyss. (It sees you! It knows!)', '', 83836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have waited long for this moment. The true power of the stones will be realized at last! (None shall survive. We shall be the unmaking! Destroy them! Wash over this world!)', '', 83835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, we need to get going pronto!', 83834, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master commands and I obey!', '', 83833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master has made us strong... behold his gifts!', '', 83832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... closer, $c... delve deeper and I will show you the true power of the Pale! Our master has been good to us...', '', 83831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see a... delicious, fleshy $c... do you like what you see before you? Cho\'gall has taught us so much...', '', 83830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna load up me tank and head southwest. I\'ll see if I can\'t get one of these rangari to be a guide.', '', 83829, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We haven\'t been able to use our Crow shapeshift in this strange world yet, but I heard a rumor we\'ve found a way to do so here by using the power of the artifacts.', '', 83828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re from Moonglade, have you been? It\'s great this time of year.', '', 83827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power is not strong enough to revive this ancient, but we\'ll keep trying. Are you going to help us?', '', 83826, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lets out a soft, deep groan>', '', 83825, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of darkness lingers in the air here...it is not as I remember.', '', 83824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tressia was a good solider, but when the venom took its hold on her, she left me no choice. \n\nI hope we wipe every member of the Shadow Council from the face of Draenor. Our people deserve better than to end up like this.', '', 83823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kosh\'harg is just a memory now. The Warsong have claimed Oshu\'gun for their own.', '', 83822, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('During the Kosh\'harg, our clans would meet at the foot of the great mountain in celebration.', '', 83821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountain of Oshu\'gun was once a place of peace and worship.', '', 83820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Shadowmoon Valley.', 'Take me to Shadowmoon Valley.', 83819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for that!', 83818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such little faith. Give me your sickle. Watch what is possible with the light.', '', 83817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t fight them. We\'re just farmers! We don\'t even have weapons!', '', 83816, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have returned! Submit, peasants, to the might of the great Ogre Empire!', '', 83815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an ambush - Shadowmoon orcs. They are circling back for the kill.', '', 83814, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The red ones, yes, they will bear witness to my devastation!', '', 83813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little blue warriors, you have proven yourself worthy of avoiding my wrath.', '', 83812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly me to the Spirit Woods near Oshu\'gun.', 'Fly me to the Spirit Woods near Oshu\'gun.', 83811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, soldiers. Time to make your commander proud.', '', 83810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('prelude. Stage: $8883w sub-stage: $8938w', '', 83809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These great defense crystals are just one of the myriad uses for the crystals in the Jorune mine. \n\nIt is a pity that the Shadow Council forces us to use them only for instruments of war.', 83804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got this boss.', '', 83803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re nearly out of supplies, but the refugees keep coming. This cannot continue for long.', '', 83802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey dummy! How would you like it if I broke all your things?!', '', 83801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! That was my last samophlange! Do you know how hard those are to get?', '', 83800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was my entire collection of Hearthstone cards!', '', 83799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You big oaf! Quit breaking my things!', '', 83798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skirmishes with the Shadow Council have left many travelers stranded in Auchindoun. \n\nUnless the tide of battle turns, it is likely we will never leave this place.', '', 83797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pilgrims gather from all over Draenor to hear the wisdom of the spirits interred at Auchindoun. \n\nFor the draenei people, such wisdom comes with great reward.', 83796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I watched with great joy as you brought peace to Gar\'rok during his final hours of life. We will be forever grateful for your kindness and bravery.', 83795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The voice calls us to Oshu\'gun...and my ancestors answer. In time, we shall have no choice but to answer as well.', '', 83794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pinchwhistle Point is completely lost. We only saw one guy who didn\'t look infected but we lost control of the zeppelin before we could make contact.', 'Pinchwhistle Point is completely lost. We only saw one guy who didn\'t look infected but we lost control of the zeppelin before we could make contact.', 83793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pinchwhistle Point is crawling with the infected, I... I think the town\'s a lost cause.', 'Pinchwhistle Point is crawling with the infected, I... I think the town\'s a lost cause.', 83792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the patch-up! Since you saved me here\'s some advice, stay away from Pinchwhistle Point.', 'Thanks for the patch-up! Since you saved me here\'s some advice, stay away from Pinchwhistle Point.', 83791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go. They went through that portal.', 83790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liadrin, I have it. Finish it!', '', 83789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ANGO\'ROSH! TO ME!', '', 83788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today I repay my debt. I will handle the portals.', '', 83787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are bound together by the Light. We fight as one.', '', 83786, 0, 26703, 0, 64, 0, 44604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t stand alone. The Light gives us strength!', 83785, 0, 26702, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the children of the Light. We ask for naught but peace.', '', 83784, 35, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide us from the Dark One. Protect our people from the Great Shadow.', '', 83783, 35, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deliver us from the darkness and shine your light upon us.', '', 83782, 35, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light of Lights, cover us from those who wish us harm.', '', 83781, 35, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are far too powerful to attack head-on. Restalaan is most familiar with this area. I believe he has a plan.', '', 83780, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leafshadow has hidden our position from Teron\'gor, and his forces have not yet left Gul\'rok for their final march on Auchindoun. We have the element of surprise on our side.', 83779, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, $n. We\'ve got your back!', '', 83778, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to be on our guard. This place is crawling with ogres.', 83777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand that our relationship with the Draenei has been through some trying times, but right now, these soldiers need my help. \n\nWe need to stick together if we all wish to defeat the Shadow Council.', 83776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stop Teron\'gor before this world falls... as so many others have.', '', 83775, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 44601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Exarch, have your soulbinders meet me at my camp. I intend to stop Teron\'gor before he unleashes more demons.', 83774, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 45718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find my way to your garrison. Fight with honor.', '', 83773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, Commander, my life has gotten quite exciting since I started following you around.$b$bI see you managed to get the genesaur artifact. Here, take the seeds and water as well and please bring them to Maraad back at the main outpost.$b$bWe will help Thaelin remove his tank in the meantime.', 83772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re right. The dead grow... fearful. Something truly dark is coming.', '', 83771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kicking', 'Kicking', 83770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Git to the surface an\' keep that genesaur busy. I\'ll git this cannon firin\' soon as I can!', '', 83769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Starfall isn\'t far. Good luck, Qiana.', 83768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Command Table to send Qiana on a mission.', '', 83767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Unchecked Growth absorbs a nearby Aqueous Globule and comes to life!', '', 83766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has absorbed enough water to become active again!', '', 83765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_embers.blp:20|t %s is completely dehydrated and has |cFFFF0404|Hspell:164275|h[Brittle Bark]|h|r!', '', 83764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of the larger demons can tear through our ballistae relatively quickly. \n\nIf I can\'t produce them more rapidly than they get destroyed, then there may be no stopping the Shadow Council.', 83763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!', '', 83762, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have my utmost respect, commander. I will follow you into the dark anytime.', 83761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 83760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Communing', 'Communing', 83759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is your mission of subterfuge going? In order to infiltrate the enemy, make sure you are wearing a Sargerei disguise.$B$BYou can create one by collecting the cowl, robe, and slippers from fallen Sargerei enemies.', 83758, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never sneak onto another wagon again. I swear!', '', 83757, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, initiate. What can I do for you?', '', 83756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My contract was for burning fungus, repairing engines, and salvage work. It said nothing about dealing with bugs!', '', 83755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 100, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you\'re here just in time!', 83754, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The latent power of Draenor can be found in every rock. When harnessed with care, it will never falter.', '', 83753, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A leader is only as strong as the weakest of those they lead. The key to victory is to empower even the lowliest soldier to greatness.', 83752, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces of the elements can offer unlimited power, but will surely lead to destruction for those who fail to maintain the balance.', '', 83751, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Naaru have blessed the draenei people with the gift of the Light. Let it guide you and be your solace.', '', 83750, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The greatness of our civilization cannot maintain if even a single draenei voice is silenced by its leaders.', '', 83749, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wars cannot be won solely by destroying your enemies. Without the protection of your people, you can never be victorious.', 83748, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength is of little importance without the wisdom to know when to properly use it.', '', 83747, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This spot\'s good for either a corral or a tankworks. You choose and I\'ll make sure it gets built.', '', 83746, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, fine.', 'Ok, fine.', 83745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, the secret phrase is, \"The rain falls on Shadowmoon.\"', 83744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My uncle\'s in Pinchwhistle Point, I hope everyone\'s ok.', 83743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, break time\'s over fellas.', 83742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... come. Greet your death.', 83741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are all fools. This world is damned.', 83740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feast your eyes upon the terrible might of the Burning Legion.', 83739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None will be spared. Slay them all!', '', 83738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You face the burning hatred of the master, cretin.', '', 83737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will be turned to ash!', '', 83736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make this quick.', '', 83735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave nothing alive. All life must burn!', '', 83734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spill blood in the master\'s name!', '', 83733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The talbuk and elekk are blessed gifts bestowed upon us by Draenor. Take of them only when necessary and give back whenever able.', '', 83732, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sargerei must be kept in check.', '', 83731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remmel has been telling me the story of his people. We have more in common than one might think.', '', 83730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat of the Burning Legion is larger than the Alliance and the Horde. We must set aside our differences, even reluctantly, to ensure that history does not repeat itself.', '', 83729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care, the demons can strike again at any moment. It seems the Shadow Council will stop at nothing to breach the gates of Auchindoun.\n\nWe must remain vigilant!', '', 83728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Help!', '', 83727, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU NO ATTACK MORKURK!', '', 83726, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Witch Lord requires your blades! Attack!', '', 83725, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders! Defend Morkurk, you fools!', '', 83724, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dunna ask how we found that artifact. It\'s not what ya\'d call a \'happy\' story.', '', 83723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll take more than a handful o\' mouthy earth beasts ta take out ol\' Heavyhands!', '', 83722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight well, $n.', '', 83721, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n.', '', 83720, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, our champion, will stay back and disrupt the enemy camp. The rest of us will seek safe passage through the jungle.', '', 83719, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot stay here long. Soon, the entirety of the Iron Horde will be upon us.', '', 83718, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Dis gonna save our souls!', '', 83717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be our way out!', '', 83716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna help you, cuz\' you helpin\' us!', '', 83715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da old king, and da new one!', '', 83714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna fight for you!', '', 83713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da king tell me you gonna free us!', '', 83712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In here!', '', 83711, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require a new shaman stone.', 'I require a new shaman stone.', 83710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru...is dying! Hurry, you must stop Cho\'gall before all is lost!', '', 83709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to me from the Twisting Nether and we shall speak more.', '', 83708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How ye doin\'? Welcome to the finest garage on Draenor.$b$bIf you need repair work on your trike, hot rod, shredder, flamethrower, or rocket sled we\'re the best!$b$bIn fact you could say we got the market cornered.', 83707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show no mercy when facing Invalidus, such kindness will not be returned to you.', '', 83706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How ye doin?', 83705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countless portals are opening from within the Twisting Nether. They must be closed with all haste!', '', 83704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monsters of the void grow in strength and number. They must be stopped.', '', 83703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your way to the ancestral grounds and discover the cause of the disturbance there.', '', 83702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find this Greyseer and bury him back into the mud from where he came!', '', 83701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pale orcs sound dangerous. Hopefully this is the last we see of them.', '', 83700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How the Pale have learned to enslave the elements, I do not know, but it cannot be allowed to continue.', '', 83699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, commander. If these pale orcs are real, who knows what powers they possess.', '', 83698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44817, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have entered the Twisting Nether, use the shaman stone to contact me.', '', 83697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary of the ritual leaders. The source of their power is corrupt, but it is by no means weak.', '', 83696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warsong shaman have turned their backs on the old ways, $n. Do what must be done.', '', 83695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must depart for Oshu\'gun with great haste.', '', 83694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The barracks looks fantastic. You should go check in with Maraad. I\'m going to hang out here and admire my handy work.', '', 83693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of our other buildings are going to take quite a while longer to construct.', '', 83692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What little supplies we had upon arrival are quickly being used up for the needs of the refugees. \n\nI hope we are able to leave here soon, lest we become stranded in Auchindoun just like them.', 83691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A |cFFFF0404%s|r comes lurking from the depths!', '', 83690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our presence here has gone undetected by the Sargerei so far. Let\'s keep it that way.', 83689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde have landed upon these shores. It is our task to make them regret it.', '', 83688, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The barracks should take the men no time to complete at all.  Follow me, commander.', '', 83687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over...*cough*... here...', '', 83686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War is not a time for reason. Lieutenant, deal with them.', '', 83685, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 46084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See reason, old friend. You must stop this lunacy!', '', 83684, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 45295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to get back to work.', 'Time to get back to work.', 83683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baros is looking for me?$b$bI\'ve been right here with my crew the whole time... Poor guy is so busy he\'s losing it.$b$bAlright, break time is over.', 83682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel so relieved. Maybe I can actually do some stargazing tonight. That would be a nice change of pace.', '', 83681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I supposed to do this all myself!? Keep it together, Baros... keep it together.', '', 83680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auughh auuuughhhhh!', '', 83679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auuughhhh!', '', 83678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With pleasure, master.', 83677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zamaya, finish him!', '', 83676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool, your soul will be mine, even in death! Shattrath, Auchindoun, Elodor, Karabor... ALL shall fall!', '', 83675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never. Will you take Kil\'jaeden\'s blessing, only to give up your soul?', '', 83674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me, brother. Velen was wrong to refuse the Burning Legion\'s gifts.', '', 83673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is the traitor in our midst.', '', 83672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eww, some of these supplies are really water logged and... sticky? These will get the job done, but truly, this is disgusting.', '', 83671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe those orcs have something on that boat we can use?... besides tooth piercing devices.', '', 83670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With me!', '', 83669, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, I will meet you ahead. I must join Draka.', '', 83668, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 45296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My visions show me otherwise.', '', 83667, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you not see it? The Iron Horde will destroy Draenor!', '', 83666, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 45294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother? You have allied with enemy invaders, Durotan. You\'ve chosen your side.', '', 83665, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 46082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrim! Brother, what have you done?', '', 83664, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light! You truly are a great champion.', '', 83663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems like most of the earthfuries are coming out of this cave.', '', 83662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah ummm... I just need to adjust my gloves really quick.', '', 83661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go first.', '', 83660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t even think it\'s possible to kill it. I mean, it\'s made of dirt and stone.', '', 83659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It took Talakuu. The fool got too close to the entrance of the cave.', '', 83658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see the size of that thing? It\'s even bigger than I thought.', '', 83657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll free the draenei over my corpse, whelp.', 'You\'ll free the draenei over my corpse, whelp.', 83656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll rot with the draenei.', 'You\'ll rot with the draenei.', 83655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei will not go free!', 'The draenei will not go free!', 83654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In fact, I\'ll take care of you myself. Zamaya is bound to promote me for this!', '', 83653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talking won\'t do any good. I know what I saw!', '', 83652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rend the mortal flesh from your bones and feast upon your soul!', '', 83651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah. The little one is the taskmaster.', '', 83650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will escort this caravan and meet you in Elodor, commander.', '', 83649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find our Alliance is full of surprises, Exarch. This is the commander I told you about.', '', 83648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy, let\'s talk about what you saw.', 'Hey buddy, let\'s talk about what you saw.', 83647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were fools to follow Velen\'s path. Socrethar is our true leader!', '', 83646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander! You have built a most impressive garrison. I am eager to see your men in action.', '', 83645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the commander. MOVE OUT! Go, go!', '', 83644, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are all annoying.  I\'m going to go get some sleep.', '', 83643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! You don\'t belong here! Vexaar, tell Laanda that we have a traitor in our midst.', 'Hey! You don\'t belong here! Vexaar, tell Laanda that we have a traitor in our midst.', 83642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good, Zipfizzle. Move out.', 'Very good, Zipfizzle. Move out.', 83641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, commander, sir!$b$bOn Maraad\'s orders I rounded up a bunch of lackeys - erm - quality skilled labor. Say the word and we\'ll get this caravan to Elodor and secure some food.', '', 83640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat new kind! Da Keeper keep it!', '', 83639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon people step it up here. We got hungry bellies to fill.', '', 83638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This dwarf appears to have gained a lot of weight prior to his death.', 'This dwarf appears to have gained a lot of weight prior to his death.', 83637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stunned look of surprise is frozen on the dead face of this dwarf.', 'A stunned look of surprise is frozen on the dead face of this dwarf.', 83636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring them to me alive, Roltall. They will fetch an excellent price.', '', 83635, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 42066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never... be... free...', '', 83634, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn to obey!', '', 83633, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool!', '', 83632, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your charred remains will make a fine example.', '', 83631, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements hear me and obey!', '', 83630, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be slaves to the slag!', '', 83629, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 83628, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, I break your spirit, then, I sell your future.', '', 83627, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be a pleasure to break you.', '', 83626, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 42068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This area is back to normal thanks to you!', 83625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engorged seeds and roots within the pool are digging into the corpse of Lera, feeding on the remains.', 'Engorged seeds and roots within the pool are digging into the corpse of Lera, feeding on the remains.', 83624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not a moment too soon, this ogre bastion is much busier than it used to be.$b$bLet\'s do something about it, yes?', 83623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see everything... your time on this world ends here.', '', 83622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look into the maw of your demise!', '', 83621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I foresee... your defeat.', '', 83620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been watching you, $r. Come closer.', '', 83619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The goren mumbles something incomprehensible to you.', '', 83618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeeeooowwwch!', '', 83617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eeeeeerk!', '', 83616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooohuuffuu!', '', 83615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guuughfff!', '', 83614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwaaaah!', '', 83613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abuuuguu!', '', 83612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not goren one!', '', 83611, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you prepared to meet Azeroth\'s greatest champion?!', '', 83610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spread out all available missions for your forces on the command table.$B$BSay the word and I will send a courier to your garrison immediately with your will.', '', 83609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have laid out a list of available missions for your forces on the command table for you.$B$BI will relay any orders to your garrison for your convenience, commander.', '', 83608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My return will be your end.', '', 83607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send you dogs to the void!', '', 83606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to place a work order.', 'I would like to place a work order.', 83605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... wind magic?', '', 83604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will eat your Wind magic all up!', '', 83603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone else will finish my research!', '', 83602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stop me!  I will make our Breakers even stronger!', '', 83601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spread out! Protect the structures!', '', 83600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That can\'t be all of them.', '', 83599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We control the flow of power here.', '', 83598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in control here.', '', 83597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out!', '', 83596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unstoppable.', '', 83595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tear you in half!', '', 83594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
