('AHHHHHH!', '', 83580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 83579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am finished with you!', '', 83578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your magic is powerless here!', '', 83577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, I never had this problem in Alterac Valley.', '', 83576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you Horde scum enjoy a shield to the face!', '', 83575, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me guess me need more practice...', '', 83574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But my research!  Reglakk... needs... it...', '', 83573, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reglakk says no complications... you is a complication.', '', 83572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last practice is over! Taste dis axe!', '', 83571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must find a way to enhance my performance for next time.', '', 83570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die puny thing!', '', 83569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da Empire!', '', 83568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It dinna matter where we are. SI:7 is gonna get the job done.', '', 83567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you think you doing?', '', 83566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day has come for true retribution!', '', 83565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collapsing Portal', 'Collapsing Portal', 83564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p saved what is left of Aruuna. Let $Ghim:her; leave in peace.', '', 83563, 0, 23504, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finalizing', 'Finalizing', 83562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this $r doing here?', 'What is this $r doing here?', 83561, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did it, Papa! I made a wish!', 83560, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. I am prepared for stormy weather.', '', 83559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is that?', '', 83558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think so, do you?', '', 83557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal has taken me into the Twisting Nether, Farseer.', 'The portal has taken me into the Twisting Nether, Farseer.', 83556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elekk is nature\'s most noble animal.', 'The elekk is nature\'s most noble animal.', 83555, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Modera sends her regards.', 'Modera sends her regards.', 83554, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rain falls on Shadowmoon.', 'The rain falls on Shadowmoon.', 83553, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Laanda lowers his voice to a whisper.>$B$BYou have the appearance of an ally, but I cannot speak long. I am working to infiltrate the ranks of the Sargerei, to take down their system from within. So far, no one suspects my identity.', '', 83552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re coming...', '', 83551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as you hold the shaman stone, we will be able to speak with one another through the power of the elements.$b$bThe stone also grants me the ability to see the world through your eyes.', '', 83550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, initiate. Those who wish to join our order must prove themselves. You look... promising.', 83549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where they\'ll attack first...', '', 83548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty!', 'Reporting for duty!', 83547, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sargerei will reclaim what is rightfully ours.', 83546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We ARE the chosen race.', 83545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the strong prevail.', 83544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you want, initiate?', 83543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, commander.', '', 83542, 7, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D\'kaan, where are those parts? I\'ve only got two hands over here.', '', 83541, 7, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, kindly. I shall notify you of my results later.', '', 83540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A rescue? At last! I\'m never eatin\' another fruit again.', '', 83539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are fattening you up. Your friends have been turned into mulch to feed the botani seedlings.', 'They are fattening you up. Your friends have been turned into mulch to feed the botani seedlings.', 83538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were lookin\' for something to help fight goren and I got separated.$b$bThen these botani lads showed up and just started feeding me berries, mead, honey.$b$bI swear I\'ve gained twenty pounds at least since I got here.', '', 83537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I could use a lot less spiders over here, Liveia!', '', 83536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope nope nope nope!', '', 83535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little spider?! Do you have eyes?', '', 83534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could use a little help over here, Hostus.', 83533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This thing keeps wriggling! Could you please come give me a hand?!', 83532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, come on! It\'s just a little spider!', 83531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imperator Gor\'vidus laughs.', '', 83530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll meet you at the base of the fortress.', 83529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I command the arcane!', '', 83528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from my sight.', '', 83527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, see the error of your ways.', '', 83526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arcane bends to my will, as shall you!', '', 83525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have earned my wrath!', '', 83524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power knows no limit!', '', 83523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence bores me.', '', 83522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn your place.', '', 83521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you at the base of the fortress.', '', 83520, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... king...', '', 83519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of this. Begone!', '', 83518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work, soldiers.', '', 83517, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, block!', '', 83516, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heavy strike!', '', 83515, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike!', '', 83514, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goren engorged: $9169w (-$9170w)', '', 83513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Hungry Goren ate his fill! (-$9168w)', '', 83512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a flight to the border of Nagrand.', 'I need a flight to the border of Nagrand.', 83511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take cover within the shield!', '', 83506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did Pippers go? Little guys keeps stealing my supplies.$b$bOops! I meant to check in with Baros, we have just been really busy.$b$bThis forest is almost out of wood... I need to get a logging operation together. I\'ll send a full report to Baros as soon as possible.', 83505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather Shelly\'s report.', 'Gather Shelly\'s report.', 83504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, reinforcements from the arcane sanctum have arrived!', '', 83503, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 45103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mines are overrun!', 'The mines are overrun!', 83488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pinchwhistle Point can\'t be lost, I got to find a cure!', '', 83485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pinchwhistle Point is a nice town as long as you don\'t mind the heat and the oppressive humidity.$b$bOk, as long as you don\'t mind the heat, the oppressive humidity, and the infectious fungus.', '', 83484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow ow ow! You\'ll pay for that!', '', 83483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for a little goblin ingenuity!', '', 83482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got this!  Keep them off me!', '', 83481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold \'em off! I\'ll get this Iron Star activated!', '', 83480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take cover within the shield!', '', 83479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the Battle at the Stones of Prophecy.', 'Remember the Battle at the Stones of Prophecy.', 83478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storied Gorehowl rests here planted firmly in the grassy hill. At your touch, a barely-noticeable power vibrates from the axe.', '', 83477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Split up and meet back at Akaani and Kash\'drakor. Kor\'gall\'s axe is yours for the taking, $p.', '', 83476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Note the information.', 'Note the information.', 83475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to my base in Talador.', 'Take me to my base in Talador.', 83474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband takes all the responsibility of the world on his shoulders, as if it\'s his burden alone. He needs to learn that we all have a role to play.$B$BFriend, this whole world remains in turmoil. The elements cry out. They are being tortured in the depths of the Blackrock foundry, and Gul\'dan is still at large.$B$BSo much remains to be done... and the stronghold you\'ve built is the key. Never hesitate to call on me for aid. This is my fight, too.', 83473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Thrall is deep in thought and doesn\'t appear to want to speak at the moment.>', '', 83472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A cannon for an arm and explosives on the back? Seriously?', '', 83471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Molten helms don\'t fit on gronn as well as one might think.', '', 83470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks as if the Iron Horde attempted to fuse a cannon with this gronn\'s spine.', '', 83469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh came out of nowhere, and manipulated the clans as you would play a drum. It is good that he is finished.$B$BBut, the damage is already done. It\'s like I don\'t recognize my own people anymore. Grommash Hellscream has turned family and friends alike against one another, and it has to stop. We must dismantle his war machine: First by taking out his ogre allies, then by demolishing the Blackrock Foundry.$B$BAfter that, we will bring Hellscream himself to justice. Just as we\'ve seen today.', '', 83468, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces are massed. We\'re ready to strike.$B$BLead the way, commander. Let us be rid of this Garrosh Hellscream once and for all.', '', 83467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was my favorite ravager. You filthy savage. I will kill you with my own bare hands!', '', 83466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such impudence. I will see you consumed by my favorite pet.', '', 83465, 0, 26574, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We march on your order, commander. Garrosh and his forces await.', 83464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A meager victory. Let us see how you fair against my personal ogron.', '', 83463, 0, 26573, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Archmage tells me that Garrosh set all of these events in motion. He was a criminal from your world, yes? I have never seen the orcish idea of \'justice\' before.$B$BI wish I could say it\'s over, but this war is only beginning. Grommash\'s Iron Horde continues to grow stronger. My people will never be safe so long as his foundries continue churning out their terrible weapons. We draenei were not ready for this fight, but we must be prepared to finish it.$B$BThere are shadows before us - but only because the light is at our back.', 83462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? A new challenger? We will enjoy watching you consumed by my little pet.', '', 83461, 0, 26572, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Attack - 1.1 Complete', '', 83460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the resonance crystal - it\'s driving them crazy!', 'It\'s the resonance crystal - it\'s driving them crazy!', 83459, 0, 26456, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a nightmare!', 'Thank you - the whole mine is overrun!', 83458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must go.  I am so close now...  I must find it.', '', 83457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of my sight.', 'Get out of my sight.', 83456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Breaker Artifact. We have located it! It is deep within Ogron Grotto west of this location. We were going to take it from them before this camp was destroyed.', 83455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on.', 'Go on.', 83453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait! Spare me and I will tell you what you want to know!', 83452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release the creature from its chains.', 'Release the creature from its chains.', 83449, 0, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The creature is still alive, but is completely incapacitated by the Iron Horde\'s chains.>', '', 83448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the dust with you!', '', 83447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A %s cries out incoherently and rushes up the ramp.', '', 83446, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... THE SHOVELER!', 'I am... THE SHOVELER!', 83445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I am ready, commander. Where would you like to start?', 'I am ready, commander. Where would you like to start?', 83444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession Building Blueprint', 'Profession Building Blueprint', 83443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...get back!', '...get back!', 83442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got one!', 'Got one!', 83439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what I hate about the arena?$b$bThe losers!$b$bThey keep dying so quickly. It is embarrassing. I barely have time to finish giving them a proper smile...', '', 83438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run back to Akaani and tell her I will rip this place apart, burn it to the ground, and laugh at the corpses of all the ogres!', '', 83437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and yes, I suppose I can wait for her signal.', '', 83436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that a fighting style? Ha ha ha!', '', 83435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I laugh in the face of my own defeat!', '', 83434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a cute child\'s toy of a weapon you got there. Let\'s see what it can do against my orcish fists!', '', 83433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life. Now I must repay the debt. I will teach you tricks and ways of fighting only seen in the darkest corners of Skettis.', '', 83432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! Join me in the ogre mound when you are done, and we shall slay the ogre chieftain together.', '', 83431, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wait for Akaani\'s signal.', '', 83430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead dead dead.', '', 83429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! This not real arena.', '', 83428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight me. Do not let the ogres witness weakness.', '', 83427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see Akaani left a mark on your cloths. So the time has finally come to make our escape?', '', 83426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell Akaani I will be ready for her signal.', '', 83425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms! To your posts! And look beneath you. They\'ll come from below....', '', 83424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the defense of Domination Point.', 'Tell me of the defense of Domination Point.', 83423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
