('You win this round. But when we fight in the \"real\" arena, I will end you.', '', 83418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it look real, or they are going to flood this place with ogres.', '', 83417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountain of Oshu\'gun stands tall above the valley of Nagrand. This place is sacred among all orc clans, but now the Warsong have claimed it as their own.', '', 83416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
