('COMMANDER $N. WARRIDERS ATTACK!', '', 83414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azik sent you to me for answers, and I promise you will have them.$B$BBut for now, we need to escape.', '', 83413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
