('Eh? A traveler? It\'s a dangerous time to be in Skettis, you know.', '', 83411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARSONG, WE RIDE.', '', 83410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... I\'m a versatile goblin. I can build out of almost anything. You find treasure lying about or some extra mean monsters with a nice hoard of loot, chances are there will be extra materials I can use.$b$bI\'ve been hearing of all sorts of rare beasts around here that might stash materials you could use. Not to mention I\'m pretty sure Lady Sena skimmed off the top and stashed those extra materials around your garrison somewhere.$b$bGet out and explore.', '', 83409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I get materials?', 'How do I get materials?', 83408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Hop inta that turret and keep \'em away!', '', 83407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we arrived just in time.', '', 83406, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
