('The Laughing Skull fighting technique is a delicate balance of stabbing your enemy until long after they are dead while also laughing in a fine tuned insulting fashion.', '', 83401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
