('...wait for it...', '', 83398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There she goes...', '', 83397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was really mean, $n. I\'m not sure I can forgive you and Yrel after that.$B$B...$B$BAh, who am I kidding? I guess I had it coming.$B$BIt was a pretty good prank, don\'t ya think?$B$BI need to figure out what the next one\'s going to be. She\'ll never see it coming.', '', 83396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 6, 396, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wolf-$g brother:sister;, it is always good to see you.$B$BIt has been many years since last I strode the great Land of Winds. Yet some things, never change.$B$BThe Warsong are as dishonorable as ever, and now worse with this Garrosh Hellscream as their new warlord.$B$BI understand you have had trouble with him before. We shall have to see about dealing with him.$B$BBringing Garrosh to justice is just about the only thing that Thrall talks about.', 83395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eleena\'s a fine lass. I\'m sure she\'s just takin\' her sweet time gettin\' a proper look-see at them ogres.', '', 83394, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You here to register for fire duty or what?', '', 83393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
