('Blessings of the naaru upon you, my friend.$B$BIs it not strange to be back on Draenor? I would not have guessed in a million years I would have ever returned.', '', 83349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t mind all of the noise and dust, commander.$B$BWhat can I get for you? Food? Drink? A place to put your feet up?', 83348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ranchers of Embaari raise elekk and talbuk to supply Shattrath, as well as many of the smaller draenei villages. \n\nIf you wish to review the livestock, you can find their ranches along the outskirts of the village.', 83347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The skies hold untold wonders, waiting to be discovered. Our researchers study the stars and beyond over at the observatory. \n\nIf you have time, traveler, I would recommend paying it a visit.', 83346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trade is the backbone of Embaari Village. As a representative of the tradesmen of our village, it falls under my responsibility to keep these operations running smoothly.', '', 83345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am very thankful that you are here, $n. You are one of the few people I know I can trust.', 83344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is so much to do. We must stay focused.', 83343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet Velen was truly a great teacher. I will remember him, always.', 83342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have lost both my sister and my mentor, and yet I know there are others who suffer even more greatly.$B$BIt is for them that I must go on.', 83341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
