('The bonds weaken. Freedom will be mine!', '', 83282, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! I... need... more!', '', 83281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, now!', '', 83280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your demise awaits.', '', 83279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 83278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... become... something greater!', '', 83277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither away!', '', 83276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destruction!', '', 83275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear my name.', '', 83274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will fall before me.', '', 83273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elum... a liftetime of healing, now you shall fuel disease and decay!', '', 83272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Joraa, paragon of Order - I shall twist your soul to power destruction!', '', 83271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iruun... You battled demons in life... in death, your power will feed them!', '', 83270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This power... you will be the first to know it.', '', 83269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, all shall bow before me!', '', 83268, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On one side, our enemy, the Warsong. On the other, our more ancient foe, the ogres of Highmaul.$B$BWe must bring both to justice. We must rid Nagrand of their very presence.', '', 83267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...hungered... to be more...', '', 83266, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long have I waited...', '', 83265, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan, such foolishness. This gift... so much more than you could ever know....', '', 83264, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will meet again... $n.', '', 83263, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not delay, mortal. I can feel the life-essence of your armies fading. There will be time for regret later...', '', 83262, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion comes for you.... We will feast on these souls.', '', 83261, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grommash will pay for his arrogance.', '', 83260, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Yes!', '', 83259, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such decadence... it will all burn.', '', 83258, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44425, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sever my bonds... and the portal falls...', '', 83257, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you dare challenge me, defenders of Auchindoun?!', '', 83256, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knew the draenei held such... delicious treasures in their temple?', '', 83255, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before the Sethekk!', '', 83254, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is one thing you must learn about us draenei.$B$BWe will learn everything we can from others, and use it to our advantage.', 83253, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowmoon are an ancient clan with untold knowledge of this world and its secrets. If only we had access to their records!', 83252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My rangari are the absolute best at laying traps and creating camouflaged illusions. The Shadowmoon have no idea we are here.', '', 83251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stealth and speed are our greatest friends.', '', 83250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live for Sethe now!', '', 83249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ikiss demands sacrifice!', '', 83248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your entrails will make a fine tribute to Sethe.', '', 83247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rukhmar has forsaken us.', '', 83246, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the other side...', '', 83245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Talon King Ikiss!', '', 83244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sethekk will rise!', '', 83243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terokk...', '', 83242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of Sethe is a gift, not a curse! We will show them all!', '', 83241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usurper! I AM the Talon King!', '', 83240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh good, it\'s you, commander. This \'thing\' is ready for you.', '', 83239, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harness the power of the void! Call upon this gift and realize your true destiny!', 'Harness the power of the void! Call upon this gift and realize your true destiny!', 83238, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As mortals, you are weak! Drink of the void and become endowed with power!', 'As mortals, you are weak! Drink of the void and become endowed with power!', 83237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let this dark gift flow through your veins! Feel it grow within you!', 'Let this dark gift flow through your veins! Feel it grow within you!', 83236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no glory in weakness! Bathe yourself in this dark power and become mighty!', 'There is no glory in weakness! Bathe yourself in this dark power and become mighty!', 83235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unleash the void! None shall resist the might of the Warsong!', 'Unleash the void! None shall resist the might of the Warsong!', 83234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this dark gift, none shall challenge the superiority of our clan!', 'With this dark gift, none shall challenge the superiority of our clan!', 83233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink of the void my brothers and sisters! The Warsong grow stronger!', 'Drink of the void my brothers and sisters! The Warsong grow stronger!', 83232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draw upon the void! Feel the power seep into your bones!', 'Draw upon the void! Feel the power seep into your bones!', 83231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power will destroy you!', 'My power will destroy you!', 83230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory or death!', 'Victory or death!', 83229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warsong will prevail!', 'The Warsong will prevail!', 83228, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the storm!', 'I am the storm!', 83227, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be your death!', 'I will be your death!', 83226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will scatter your bones upon the wind!', 'I will scatter your bones upon the wind!', 83225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warsong will eradicate you!', 'The Warsong will eradicate you!', 83224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind will destroy you!', 'The wind will destroy you!', 83223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Heart of the Mountain goes berserk!', 'The Heart of the Mountain goes berserk!', 83222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I broke every bone in my body. I think I even broke some bones that we don\'t have names for!', 'I think I broke every bone in my body. I think I even broke some bones that we don\'t have names for!', 83221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a REAAAAAALY nice explosion! Wish I wasn\'t in the middle of it.', 'That was a REAAAAAALY nice explosion! Wish I wasn\'t in the middle of it.', 83220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the rescue pal. That crash was rough.', 'Thanks for the rescue pal. That crash was rough.', 83219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I\'m so glad to see a face that\'s not been covered in fungus!', 'Thanks! I\'m so glad to see a face that\'s not been covered in fungus!', 83218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are finally here.  This place stinks, let\'s be done with this mess quickly...', '', 83217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are okay, I\'m ready to go.', 'If you are okay, I\'m ready to go.', 83216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the rescue pal! I knew we shouldn\'t have tried to get out on a half-built zeppelin.', 'Thanks for the rescue pal! I knew we shouldn\'t have tried to get out on a half-built zeppelin.', 83215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your wares.', 'Let me browse your wares.', 83214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like meat\'s back on the menu!', '', 83213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash!', '', 83212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get the blood flowing!', '', 83211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a slice off the top.', '', 83210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off! You ain\'t worth eatin\'.', '', 83209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lanky, gamey, little runts!', '', 83208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna make a Pale stew.', '', 83207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All crunch and no meat.', '', 83206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come here you scrawny grabbers!', '', 83205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no turning back. We press on, through the very jaws of the beast.', '', 83204, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close.', '', 83203, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So juicy!', '', 83202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give it to us raw... and wiggling!', '', 83201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for the meat grinder!', '', 83200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will break you!', '', 83199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', '', 83198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t fail me, Bulgorg, you are worth a hundred ogre warriors!', '', 83197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are most entertaining but there\'s no stopping the Breakers!', '', 83196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s just getting started!', '', 83195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander! Shadowmoon forces are gathering up outside of the garrison. Our troops are in defensive positions and await your orders.', '', 83194, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Ravenous Bloodmaw is released from its pit!', '', 83193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In my profession I have learned that the nature of crystals is very much like that of the Draenei people. \n\nThe core material has amazing potential, but begins as rough and heavily flawed. It is only through careful shaping and nurturing that its potential can truly be reached. \n\nOnly then can it show its magnificent beauty and wondrous clarity.', '', 83192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('How am I supposed to make any money if we just sit here all day?$b$bYeah, I know Gidwin looks a little sick, but I have a lot of merchandise I need to sell over here!', '', 83191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to make sure no more travelers are attacked by the botani.$b$bArepheon just left with the others, if you leave now you should be able to catch up with him.', 83190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Detonating the explosives... now!', 'Detonating the explosives... now!', 83189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45648, 45648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully, $c. This bloom is as deadly as it is beautiful.', '', 83188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not sure we could have defeated that genesaur without you. Until we meet again, $n.', '', 83187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the charge against the genesaur, $n. The rangari will be right behind you.', '', 83186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish that all we had to deal with in Nagrand were the Warsong and Highmaul.$B$BThere\'s a whole world of hurt on the other side of the river.', '', 83185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just get me free, stranger. I could kill a hundred of these pigs with this shovel alone.', '', 83184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let up on that Frostwolf pup. We must break his spirit.', '', 83183, 0, 26453, 0, 64, 0, 43610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell that Frostwolf to keep shoveling! Hrah hrah hrah...', '', 83182, 0, 26453, 0, 64, 0, 43609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that Frostwolf runt broken yet?', '', 83181, 0, 26453, 0, 64, 0, 43608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need fish for the garrison, are you up to the task?', 'We need fish for the garrison, are you up to the task?', 83180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see you at the gates of Grommashar.', 83179, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch yourself, commander. Despite our victory, I have a bad feeling about this.', 83178, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The botani are never this hostile.$b$bIf this keeps up we are going to have to venture into the bloom.', '', 83177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve fallen right into my trap, \'commander\'. WARSONG ATTACK!', '', 83176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That monster\'s loose!', '', 83175, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hell\'s broken loose out there!', '', 83174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gidwin and I were out fishing when those things showed up and attacked us.$b$bWe would be dead for sure if wasn\'t for these draenei.$b$bI would have killed them myself but somebody needed to carry Gidwin back to camp... foolish little dwarf.', '', 83173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your worst nightmare!', '', 83172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it bleeds, we can kill it!', '', 83171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fought as well as we could. But in the end, too many of my friends were lost.', '', 83170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not leave the fallen to the children of the genesaur. I will protect their bodies until D\'kaan arrives.', '', 83169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I see it now.  We must take this.  Take it back to our people and show them the way.  You have been very helpful. I think its time you joined us.', '', 83168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we have crushed the slavers and brought upon them swift destruction. They who have taken everything from me. \n\nBut, I have one last thing to give. To be a part of something greater... I\'d forgotten what that feels like.', '', 83167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the smell of victory. If only I had my sword with me... the things I could accomplish.', '', 83166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry about me, my friend. I will await D\'kaan\'s arrival. Please, find the others.', '', 83165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here.  Yes here!  This is where I need to be.', '', 83164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those foul creatures poison their spears. I keep an antidote but it will take time for my head to clear enough for me to move.', '', 83163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go without me, stranger. I will only slow you down. I shall hold my own until D\'kaan arrives.', 83162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D\'kaan is coming with help.', 'D\'kaan is coming with help.', 83161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One thing we learned early from the Laughing Skull: podlings hate fire.', 83160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll... be... back...', '', 83159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re connected to the ley line network. Now we can create a portal directly to your garrison.', 83158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough talk!', '', 83157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost... almost there.  Just a little further.  Soon...', '', 83156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pilfering', 'Pilfering', 83155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lets do this!', 83154, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 44681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Come with me if you want to live.', '', 83153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that matters is that we few stood against many.', '', 83152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No man shall live in chains!', '', 83151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can hurt me! Only pain.', '', 83150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet Velen is a great teacher, but he\'s too serious sometimes!$B$BI would much rather live out the holy principles than read about them in a book, don\'t you agree?', 83149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For me, there is no spring.', '', 83148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This I can trust.', '', 83147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not men, not women, not beasts...', '', 83146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the light, what a battle!', 83145, 0, 0, 4, 68, 0, 0, 44672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel is my brightest student, and at times the dimmest.$B$BShe is fierce in battle, but does not discipline herself through training.$B$BShe learns quickly, but cannot sit still enough to read a book.$B$BShe would much rather play with the village children than memorize the holy texts.$B$BIf only she would focus!', '', 83144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh!  I can\'t think with all these beasts shouting at me.  Stop their screaming!', '', 83143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, at last.', '', 83142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live, I love, I slay, and I am content.', '', 83141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I can see you are brave, but danger is my trade!', '', 83140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m okay.  We must keep moving.  It calls to us.', '', 83139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nandaez might think he\'s clever for fishing the cover down below, but you can literally see the fish up here! Just look at them! What a fool he is.', 83138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arbor Glen is in trouble. We had better go see if we can help.', 83137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Personnel evacuation system engaged.', '', 83132, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out in the field, weapon in hand, this is almost as fun as being at the forge!', '', 83131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we\'re connected, we can create a portal directly to your garrison.', '', 83130, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GORN!', '', 83129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SESK!', '', 83128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That danged army should be here any minute. Let\'s move!', '', 83127, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good day, children! I\'ve brought a hero from a far away land to meet you.', 83126, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 45672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A hero! A hero!', '', 83125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s back!', '', 83124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stranger will help us!', 83123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 42890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yrel! She\'s come to save us!', 83122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 42889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello stranger!', '', 83121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay! You\'re here!', '', 83120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a lovely plant, yes? What color would be best suited for Shattrath\'s markets? \n\nDoes anyone even buy plants these days?', '', 83119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trader with an empty cart, such a sad sight, no? \n\nIf only my partner Daruun would make up his mind so we could be on our way.', '', 83118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You still owe me six copper!', 83117, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yrel! Is that you? You still owe me six copper!', 83116, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 43495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will take more than some orcs to defeat me!', 83115, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel!?! Have you come back from the dead?', '', 83114, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 45410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah, weak. Come back when you\'re stronger.', '', 83113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blacksmith Haephest creates some of the finest arms and armor in Shadowmoon. His wares will fetch a hefty sum in the Shattrath markets.', '', 83112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyami awaits you in the western ritual chamber, champions.', '', 83111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your assistance, $n. I am sure we will meet again in due time.', '', 83110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your aid, $n. I hope we meet again.', 83109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t see...  I need a moment...', '', 83108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll go first and clear the way, meet me on the other side.', 83107, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That magical barrier is too strong for our explosives to break open. I can\'t find a way to bring it down so we\'re going to have to sneak in around it.', 83106, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, over here!', 83105, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is... is this the place?  Is it here?  Clear these creatures so I can think!', '', 83104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m well aware that the fish are more plentiful in the upper pools. However, a real professional knows that the big ones prefer a spot with a little more cover. \n\nJust wait until Roluna sees what I can land down here in the weeds!', '', 83103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll move forward and scout their gates while you\'re taking out those catapults. Dioniss aca.', 83102, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your weapons hot. You\'re going to be teleporting straight into hell.', '', 83101, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 45511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay frosty, men. You\'re going to teleport into the heart of ogre territory.', 83100, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 44034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That concludes today\'s lesson. Be sure to study up for our next lesson on the wonders of our new homeworld of Draenor.', 83099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, done Ariaana. That is correct.', 83098, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Man\'ari, Miss Kierii.', 83097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For extra credit, what do we call these minions, now that they are no longer recognizable as Eredar? Ariaana?', 83096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our people, the Draenei, were the only ones to escape the absolute corruption of Sargeras. The remaining Eredar were transformed into his dark minions.', 83095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good, Hakaam!', 83094, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Naaru!', '', 83093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go ahead, Hakaam.', 83092, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, I know this!', '', 83091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does anyone know the name of the beings that helped Velen save the Draenei people?', 83090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However, even a prophet such as Velen could not hope to save the Draenei alone. In his quest he was aided by divine beings of light.', 83089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed it is. Well done.', 83088, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Velen, Miss Kierii.', 83087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, we make a pretty good team.$b$bAt first I just wanted to honor the memory of my master but now, I could really see working for you in the long term. Thanks for giving me a chance.', 83086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who can tell me the name of the prophet that saved our people from corruption and led us to Draenor? How about you, Ariaana?', 83085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When Sargeras approached the Eredar with his plans, our wise prophet saw through his lies and was able to save a small number of his people. Those few survivors are what make our civilization today.', 83084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good, child.', 83083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras, I think...', '', 83082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They need your help with Blackhand! I can get you there. Speak with me when you\'re ready.', '', 83081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, Rastaak, could you tell me the name of the fallen deity who was responsible for corrupting the Eredar?', 83080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Eredar were a wise and powerful people. It was only through the deceitful corruption brought upon them by a fallen deity that led to their downfall.', 83079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good guess, Hakaam, but the world is actually called Argus.', 83078, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... Is it Eredor?', '', 83077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hakaam, please tell the class the name of the world that the Eredar once called home?', 83076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long ago, before the exodus aboard the Genedar, the Draenei made up just a small portion of the great Eredar civilization.', 83075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ordinary to you, perhaps. These yokels have never even seen a chicken before! I\'m going to make a fortune!', 83074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exotic pets? These all seem pretty ordinary...', 'Exotic pets? These all seem pretty ordinary...', 83073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone said I was foolish to collect all of these pets. Now look who\'s having the last laugh!', 83072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, I feel it.  It is closer now.  Quickly! To me!', '', 83071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Formation, NOW!', '', 83070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re here... GET UP!', '', 83066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, swines! Move like you signed up for this.', '', 83065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the home of the Frostwolves!', '', 83064, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Shadowmoon!', '', 83063, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get underway then. We will need to build a stronghold if we hope to end the Iron Horde threat. And we\'re going to need help from the natives.', '', 83062, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignore his threats. We will go to Shadowmoon for reinforcements. This time, the draenei will triumph.', '', 83061, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Frostwolves will be waiting for you, Hellscream! You, your ogres, your whole Iron Horde... You\'re as good as dead!', '', 83060, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead... or used up.  I was so sure I would find what I needed here!', '', 83059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no place to run, outsiders. This is MY world. We will find you!', '', 83058, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way. Go, go, go!', '', 83057, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Head for the ships at the end of the road.', '', 83056, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  Let me see it... up close.  This has to be it!', '', 83055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where now?', '', 83054, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their entire army is behind us.', 83053, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their entire army is behind us.', '', 83052, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep moving. I see the ships ahead.', 83051, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 45558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look out!', 83050, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 45557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be a fool, Ga\'nar - Run! We will fight another day.', '', 83049, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come at me, Hellscream!', '', 83048, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The docks. Run to the docks. Run. RUN!', '', 83047, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After everything we went through in escaping Shattrath his sickness finally caught up to him.$b$b My dear master, you will be missed.', 83046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This looks amazing! If only Ared was alive to see this, he would be so proud!', 83045, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ared would not want to see me standing here crying like this. Let\'s go to this armory of yours.', 83044, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wish to speak with Ared? I\'m sorry, his wounds were great and the illness too strong.', 83043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see now... this is not my death. My death was long ago... and it was glorious!', '', 83042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do I feel no pain from your blows?', '', 83041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare approach the Giantslayer? I will cleave your head from your body!', '', 83040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of the Warsong, I will crush you!', '', 83039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The echoes must be put down if the remaining spirits here are to rest.', 83038, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the pyres remain unlit, we too shall be drawn into the void and consumed.', '', 83037, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit of Golmash is merciless. Let this gift of ancestral wind guide your hands.', '', 83036, 0, 0, 51, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest your weary bones for a spell?', 83035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. I\'ll meet you there. Stay safe.', 83034, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it now? Well, I suppose we should abandon this post now that it has been compromised. The fara will not allow us to stay now that they have our scent.', '', 83033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya don\'t have to tell me twice. I\'ll meet ya on the road.', '', 83032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The way is clear.', 'The way is clear.', 83031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, a hero has come to our rescue. Be careful my friend, Gorgrond is no place for a hero.', '', 83030, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think it would be best if you left, $r.', 83029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man... this war is crazy huh?$b$bI can\'t wait till it\'s over so I can go home and see my girls.$b$bWant to see some pictures?$b$bThis is my wife Ashley and my beautiful daughter Ella. Man, I miss them.', '', 83028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make for the road.', 'Make for the road.', 83027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Them plant people are tryin\' to mulch me!', '', 83026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dinah is a sweetheart. Just watch out for her claws, especially when she gets those crazy eyes.', 83025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Awww... Isn\'t Barbar the sweetest little kitty you\'ve ever seen?', 83024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love my little kitty buddies!', 83023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please tell me you\'re ready to get back to the village! We\'ve been here for hours.', 83022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you going to kneel there forever?', 83021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How long must we wait here?  It\'s not safe Amnumi.', 83020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a few more minutes.  It\'s so peaceful here, it reminds me of... of the past.', 83019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon.  My meditation is almost complete.', 83018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not too much longer.', 83017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My younger sister comes here to ponder the Light.  Muku and I make sure the orcs think twice about bothering her.', 83016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes I come here just to clear my head.', 83015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... breathe... this foul smelling gas makes me even angrier!', '', 83008, 0, 923, 584, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here, hero, before they see us! Listen - they\'re talking about the Dark Star.', 83007, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 45640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come see Chelie\'s Mystical Menagerie! Gaze upon these exotic creatures from faraway lands!', 83006, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take home a wondrous creature, never before seen on Draenor!', 83005, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I need you to help me operate that enormous tank.', 'Yes. I need you to help me operate that enormous tank.', 83004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mm? Need somethin\'?', '', 83003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Ravenspeaker, this outsider has come to us just as written! Yes.', '', 83002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Ravenspeaker, may the Raven Mother always keep you in her sacred shadow.', '', 83001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to us at the perfect time, yes. Soon the Raven Mother herself will join us here!', '', 83000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen any of the hidden artifacts?$B$BYou can find fragments all throughout Ashran. I hear killing the creatures in this the outskirts off of the Road of Glory has uncovered some recently. $B$BYou can give me any you find, and I\'ll distribute them to those who need them.', 'Have you seen any of the hidden artifacts?$B$BYou can find fragments all throughout Ashran. I hear killing the creatures in this the outskirts off of the Road of Glory has uncovered some recently. $B$BYou can give me any you find, and I\'ll distribute them to those who need them.', 82999, 0, 27639, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should never have left Dalaran. What was I thinking?', '', 82998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, I take you to the High Ravenspeaker, yes.', '', 82997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on, Gidwin. Help is on the way.', 82996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, we found this draenei laying on the road outside our walls.', 'Commander, we found this draenei laying on the road outside our walls.', 82995, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The caravan was led by a woman that looked like a wolf. I must admit, I\'m still getting used to you Azerothians. They left here just a few hours ago.', '', 82994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the keystone, you will be able to pass through, alone. Once inside, deactivate their shields and we will join you.', '', 82993, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re moving in a different direction. Tear this building down!', '', 82992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Change of plans. Tear it down!', '', 82991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course sir.', '', 82990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold to your faith scribe! Remember the lesson in the Scroll of the Dark Dawn, \"Ravens of the flock should stay together.\" Once the Raven Mother has returned and all her children are in the nest then we will truly be safe!', '', 82989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Raven Mother\'s shadow! How can such such a slaughter have happened to us?', '', 82988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re eating riverbeast tonight, boys!', '', 82986, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooo! My... Soulgrinder...', '', 82985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s cast |cFFFF0404|Hspell:155277|h[Blazing Radiance]|h|r on you!', 82984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178380|h[Kor\'lok, the Ogre King]|h|r has elected to fight alongside the Horde!', '', 82983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178380|h[Kor\'lok, the Ogre King]|h|r has returned to his throne.', '', 82982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178380|h[Kor\'lok, the Ogre King]|h|r has elected to fight alongside the Alliance!', '', 82981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178380|h[Kor\'lok, the Ogre King]|h|r slumbers once more.', '', 82980, 0, 30987, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FFFF00|Hspell:178380|h[Kor\'lok, the Ogre King]|h|r awakens!', '', 82979, 0, 71710, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not my father... but... you have something of his...', '', 82978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, come closer. It\'s so dark...', '', 82977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s there? Father... is that you?', '', 82976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise the Raven Mother!', '', 82975, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, High Ravenspeaker.', '', 82974, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scribe! Did you get all of that?', '', 82973, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until that time comes give your praise to the Raven Mother! Look after her great kin for guidance and strength. May she cast her shadow upon you!', '', 82972, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Raven Mother will come from the heavens for her children. We will rise upon her great ebon wings to take our rightful place in her dark kingdom!', '', 82971, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When all of the flock have gathered the end shall come. The world will be torn asunder in a great catastrophe! Fear not, for the Raven Mother will save us!', '', 82970, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the Raven Mother spoke to me: Krikka, you are my dear child. You shall seek out my other wayward children and bring them back to the nest.', '', 82969, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent form. Now, press the attack!', '', 82968, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep up your guard!', '', 82967, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are yours to command, $p.', 82966, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was his plan?', '', 82965, 0, 923, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a plan.', '', 82964, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You three! Follow $p onto the battlefield, and listen for my call.', '', 82963, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the lesson of the Scroll of The Broken Glass! You must shake before the might of the Raven Mother, do not swish around in life as if stirred to swirl in an eternal cycle! Through the Raven Mother\'s blessings the Flock will endure!', '', 82962, 0, 27082, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I grind yer soul!', '', 82961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You gunna pay...', '', 82960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s frenzies!', '', 82959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You worthless swine!  Get back to work.  We have a quota to make!', '', 82958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_mindbomb.blp:20|t Siege Bombs are locked on to you!', '', 82957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That wasn\'t on the... schedule...', '', 82956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the END of the LINE!', '', 82955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are running out of time...', '', 82954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a schedule to keep!', '', 82953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not impressed. More trains are inbound!', '', 82952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re just in time for the rush.', '', 82951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s step up the pace.', '', 82950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah hah, this timetable is a killer!', '', 82949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couldn\'t keep up, eh?', '', 82948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right. On. Time.', '', 82947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All aboard!', '', 82946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah, flat as a copper piece.', '', 82945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terminated!', '', 82944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End of the line.', '', 82943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster! Bat the stack off her!', '', 82942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send \'er on down the line!', '', 82941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Express, coming through.', '', 82940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Redball incoming!', '', 82939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here come the boomers!', '', 82938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s my artillery.', '', 82937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming in hot.', '', 82936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes the brass.', '', 82935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The command car is here.', '', 82934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come - hit the grit, boys!', '', 82933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troop train - inbound!', '', 82932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements, right on time.', '', 82931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah - reinforcements.', '', 82930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the tracks!', '', 82929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
