INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Trains inbound!', '', 82927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inbound on four.', '', 82926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track four!', '', 82925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track three inbound.', '', 82924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track three.', '', 82923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incoming on two.', '', 82922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track two!', '', 82921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Live iron on track one!', '', 82920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Track one.', '', 82919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackhand won\'t tolerate any more delays.', '', 82918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackhand wants to see these shipments in Talador. NOW!', '', 82917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Raven Mother\'s shadow be upon you.', '', 82916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Ravenspeaker, I have brought you this gift and wish an audience with you.', 'High Ravenspeaker, I have brought you this gift and wish an audience with you.', 82915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Raven Mother sends these beasts to test our resolve! We must lift our voices to her with even more fervor!', '', 82914, 0, 27082, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be resolute brothers and sisters of the flock! Our faith is merely being tested by the Raven Mother!', '', 82913, 0, 27082, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borrowing', 'Borrowing', 82912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please help... come to me...', 'Please help... come to me...', 82911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring you... to the Heart...', 'Bring you... to the Heart...', 82910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join... us...', 'Join... us...', 82909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind is the voice of the elements, it whispers gently upon the breeze and howls fiercely within the storm.', '', 82908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those with burning conviction and fierce courage often attune themselves to the way of the flame.', '', 82907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me rip, you die!', '', 82906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Butchered!', '', 82905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break you!', '', 82904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who draw upon the strength of the earth will crush their enemies like gravel beneath their feet.', '', 82903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water nourishes and sustains life, yet also has the power to cut through earth and rock.', '', 82902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is hardly a fitting camp for a member of the Gorian Empire.  If your Iron Horde wishes to remain allies you would do well to treat us well!', '', 82901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have for the moment earned my curiosity, yes. Tell me, what is it that brings you to us?', '', 82900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me to the moments preceding the Fall of Deathwing.', 'Bring me to the moments preceding the Fall of Deathwing.', 82899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Siege of Wyrmrest Temple.', 'Take me to the Siege of Wyrmrest Temple.', 82898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sands of time have passed you by, but I can return you to the hour of twilight, when the Destroyer threatened to crush the world in his grasp.$b$b(Auridormi will allow you and your party members to access the Raid Finder version of Dragon Soul directly, without outside assistance.)', 82897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return when you have weathered the sands of time further. You are not yet ready for this challenge.', 82896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find Gar\'rok high upon a cliff, overlooking the Throne of Elements.', '', 82895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My time is at an end, but I die knowing that I have honored her memory.', '', 82894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have always suspected Challe, but I have not had the proof necessary to bring justice upon her.', '', 82893, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire and thorns of the ember blossom have always reminded me of her strength and conviction.', '', 82892, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although they are weakened, the Avatars upon the plateau are still mighty incarnations. Do not underestimate their strength.', '', 82891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $c. The Cycle of Rebirth must take place.', '', 82890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, I will commune with the great furies.', '', 82889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only when you are attuned to the elements, will you be able to undertake the Ritual of Binding.', '', 82888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s get moving!', '', 82887, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 44850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be.', '', 82886, 0, 26151, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I\'m not afraid of that old cutthroat.', '', 82885, 0, 26151, 14, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a chance. Malrok would skin us both if I let anyone near that thing.', '', 82884, 0, 26151, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just let me look at it!', '', 82883, 0, 26151, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not one of the flock but you leave an impressive gift for the Raven Mother.', '', 82882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not be able to pass through their gates. If you wish to try, I will wait for you here.', 82881, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Downfall of Garrosh Hellscream.', 'Tell me of the Downfall of Garrosh Hellscream.', 82880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Underhold beneath Orgrimmar.', 'Tell me of the Underhold beneath Orgrimmar.', 82879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the war that came to the Gates of Retribution.', 'Tell me of the war that came to the Gates of Retribution.', 82878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Vale of Eternal Sorrows that surrounds us.', 'Tell me of the Vale of Eternal Sorrows that surrounds us.', 82877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of Lei Shen\'s Pinnacle of Storms.', 'Tell me of Lei Shen\'s Pinnacle of Storms.', 82876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the twisted mogu Halls of Flesh-Shaping.', 'Tell me of the twisted mogu Halls of Flesh-Shaping.', 82875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Forgotten Depths beneath the Throne of Thunder.', 'Tell me of the Forgotten Depths beneath the Throne of Thunder.', 82874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Last Stand of the Zandalari.', 'Tell me of the Last Stand of the Zandalari.', 82873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That only leaves one. Cromaug.', 82872, 0, 26116, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Terrace of Endless Spring.', 'Tell me of the Terrace of Endless Spring.', 82871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Nightmare of Shek\'zeer.', 'Tell me of the Nightmare of Shek\'zeer.', 82870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Dread Approach to the Heart of Fear.', 'Tell me of the Dread Approach to the Heart of Fear.', 82869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Vault of Mysteries.', 'Tell me of the Vault of Mysteries.', 82868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not long ago, outsiders\' ships were cast upon the shores of Pandaria, bearing strife but also courage. Listen, and I will speak of how a deep shadow crept across Pandaria, and how brave heroes brought us a new dawn.', '', 82867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sing of arms and a man who.... Oh, hm, you are not quite ready for this one. Return when you have experienced more of the world.$b$b(You must be at least level 35 to hear Han\'s stories.)', 'I sing of arms and a man who.... Oh, hm, you are not quite ready for this one. Return when you have experienced more of the world.$b$b(You must be at least level 35 to hear Han\'s stories.)', 82866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Guardians of Mogu\'shan.', 'Tell me of the Guardians of Mogu\'shan.', 82865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you return when you are wiser, I will regale you with tales of great heroics.$b$b(You must be at least level 50 to hear Shin\'s stories.)', 'If you return when you are wiser, I will regale you with tales of great heroics.$b$b(You must be at least level 50 to hear Shin\'s stories.)', 82864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rargh!', '', 82862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! Get them!', '', 82861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone call for a lift?', '', 82860, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your |TInterface\\Icons\\CREATUREPORTRAIT_GOBLIN_ROCKET.blp:32|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:162896|h[Emergency Rocket Pack]|h|r now!', '', 82859, 0, 26121, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander! When I heard the ogre\'s death cry I came as soon as I could. Did everything go well?', '', 82858, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After everything I\'ve gone through who would have thought I\'d end up here?$b$bNothing quite like gutting ogres while sticking it to my pompous ass former bosses in the Iron Horde!', '', 82857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of the elements rests in your hands.', '', 82856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your will is understood. Gordawg will be found and the balance restored.', '', 82855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges to haunt you!', '', 82854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to commune with the furies.', 'I am ready to commune with the furies.', 82853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Throne of Elements.$b$bYou stand in the presence of furies, $n. Here, the earth lives beneath your feet and the wind watches your every move.$b$bThis place is truly hallowed ground.', '', 82852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If left imbalanced, the elements will rage across this valley tearing all life asunder.', '', 82851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The balance has been disrupted. The Elemental Plateau has grown unstable and must be purged.', '', 82850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gordawg must be found and returned to the throne.', '', 82849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without a fury of earth upon the throne, the elemental bonds that hold this world together weaken.', '', 82848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Furies of the Throne of Elements, we answer your call. How may we serve?', '', 82847, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 46704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A dark presence grows in the west. Gordawg, the great earthen fury, has gone missing.', '', 82846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filling', 'Filling', 82845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll teleport us back.', 82844, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get back to your outpost. Your forces can handle any remaining ogres.', 82843, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your forces are waiting for our teleport spell. Morkurk won\'t know what hit him.', 82842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just need to find Vorgorsh now.', 82841, 0, 26133, 4, 64, 0, 0, 44031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re an incredible fighter! We\'ve only got Zulmork and Vorgorsh left now.', 82840, 0, 26119, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
