('', 'I don\'t see many visitors all the way out here. It is so very nice to have a guest.$b$bWill you be staying for dinner?', 82683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This sure is a lot of wood!', '', 82682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:162497|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', '%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:162497|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', 82681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your forces are waiting to teleport in. Morkurk won\'t last long against all of us.', '', 82680, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void will consume all...', '', 82679, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Star approaches...', '', 82678, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows grow closer!', '', 82677, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness... comes...', '', 82676, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Impressive. Thank you for reporting back to me so quickly, $n.', 82675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will find the Rangari Hidden throughout the marsh. Report back after you have spoken to each of them.', 82674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hydras are causing quite a bit of chaos. We will eventually need to take care of them to ensure our safety.', 'Hydras are causing quite a bit of chaos. We will eventually need to take care of them to ensure our safety.', 82673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Granny Loola needs to be more careful. She has been wandering around the marsh kissing toads again.', 'Granny Loola needs to be more careful. She has been wandering around the marsh kissing toads again.', 82672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like a number of Botani have started to move into the marsh.', 'It looks like a number of Botani have started to move into the marsh.', 82671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The swamplighters seem especially upset tonight.', 'The swamplighters seem especially upset tonight.', 82670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Rangari are trained to endure long vigils. I have not moved a single muscle for several hours.', 'We Rangari are trained to endure long vigils. I have not moved a single muscle for several hours.', 82669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone need Kafa ? 10 gold a bean.', '', 82668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s portal in slave labor.', '', 82667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this pick made of? Lodestone?', '', 82666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When\'s the beer break?', '', 82665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should get the peons to help.', '', 82664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the last of them. We won\'t have to worry about them interfering.', '', 82663, 0, 26019, 4, 64, 0, 45509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The harder we work, the faster we profit.', '', 82662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air\'s thin up here...', '', 82661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll move this impenetrable shield to Grommashar. There\'ll be no stopping the Warsong.', 82660, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this count for hazard pay?', '', 82659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two down, only Zulmork to go.', '', 82658, 0, 26007, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to find Vorgorsh and put an end to his miserable existence.', '', 82657, 0, 26007, 4, 64, 0, 45507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterful fighting! We need only take our Zulmork and Vorgorsh now.', '', 82656, 0, 26010, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two down, only Vorgorsh to go.', '', 82655, 0, 26009, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to find Cromaug and put an end to his miserable existence.', '', 82654, 0, 26006, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterful fighting! We need only take out Vorgrosh and Cromaug now.', '', 82653, 0, 26008, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two down, only Zulmork to go.', '', 82652, 0, 26007, 4, 64, 0, 45508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now to find Cromaug and put an end to his miserable existence.', '', 82651, 0, 26006, 4, 64, 0, 45506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterful fighting! We need only take out Zulmork and Cromaug now.', '', 82650, 0, 26005, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know... seems suspicious. Maybe I should kiss a couple toads just to be sure.', 82649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varmint...', 'Varmint...', 82648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh not again... Loola, I\'m right here. I\'m not a toad... for Light\'s sake.', '', 82647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey honey, I\'m back.', '', 82646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll have to kiss each toad to break the spell on my husband.', 82645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to destroy all of these wards before we can use the scroll of mass teleportation we prepared.', '', 82644, 0, 26003, 1, 64, 0, 45496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring me back any toads you find hibernating in the mud; I\'m sure one of them is my husband.', 82643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to enjoy this.', '', 82642, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Warsong descended on us by surprise. Tensions have been high in Nagrand since the formation of the Iron Horde, but we didn\'t expect this.$B$BLet\'s be clear. There are only two reasons that I\'m helping you, $r.$B$BFirst, your shadow hunter here saved my life, albeit for her own selfish reasons. I certainly don\'t expect to see another sunrise.$B$BSecond, if the Warsong manage to learn how to use Telaar\'s shield, there\'ll be no stopping them.', 82641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope, this won\'t do at all.', 'Nope, this won\'t do at all.', 82640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... This looks just about right.', 'Hmmm... This looks just about right.', 82639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At this rate, we might never get paid for this job.  Speed it up!', 'At this rate, we might never get paid for this job.  Speed it up!', 82638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No sleeping on the job fellas!', 'No sleeping on the job fellas!', 82637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chop, Chop boys, these rocks aren\'t gonna blow themselves up!', 'Chop, Chop boys, these rocks aren\'t gonna blow themselves up!', 82636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got it. One fully armed and operational army of motivated peons coming right up.', '', 82635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, my lady, what about our reserve in the pon-', '', 82634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hush you.', 82633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to check back for more resources later, commander. The peons will keep putting them in this chest while you are away.', 82632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a shaman of the old ways and I care not for the petty conflicts between clans.$b$bThroughout the years many clans have called this valley home, but it has always belonged to the elements first.', '', 82631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kargora is out in de open. Time ta kill her an\' destroy dat shield, mon.', 82630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dey kill me huntas. You an me, we gonna have some fun wit dese wolves.', 82629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attuning', 'Attuning', 82628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now time for a little well deserved rest and relaxation! If you need me, I will be back at your garrison.', '', 82627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 43256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Devout shoulders! I knew they were here! My quest is complete.', '', 82626, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 43255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check and see if it has my shoulders!', '', 82625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leerooooy! Jeeeeeenkins!', '', 82624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not my fault. At least I have chicken.', '', 82623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to get a front row seat for Stormwind\'s destruction?', 82622, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 43556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now, you die!', 82621, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 43563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade will end you!', 82620, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 43562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flames will consume you!', 82619, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 43561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will burn!', 82618, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 43560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you dead or just pretending, coward?', 82617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All who stand against the Iron Horde will fall.', 82616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now you have tasted the blade of the Dragonmaw.', 82615, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sorry Garrosh, I have failed you.', 82614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rubble Pile is too close and %s throws over it!', '', 82613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now nothing will stop the Iron Horde!', 82612, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work!', 'Get back to work!', 82611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder who\'s going to fly in.', 82610, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mommy says you\'re a mean, ol\' kitty. But I don\'t think so.', 82609, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, Mr. Scratch. Follow me.', 82608, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bad kitty.', 82607, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s play, Scratch.', 82606, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mr. Scratchy.', 82605, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kitty!', 82604, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, life is the light, and light is life itself. They may be exchanged, but nothing is ever lost.', '', 82603, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To see K\'ara\'s transformation into shadow was a heavy burden to bear. When the naaru returned to us... I did what I had to do.', '', 82602, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owed K\'ara a great debt. Without the naaru\'s aid, my people would never have escaped our homeworld of Argus.', '', 82601, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was once a creature of faith and beauty became a dark and hungering God, a living font of darkness.', '', 82600, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a fallen naaru, ejected from our vessel in moments of panic and terror. Its name was K\'ara.', '', 82599, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The \"Dark Star\" that appeared in the skies above Draenor that terrible night was no celestial body.', '', 82598, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we draenei first arrived on this world, naaru accompanied us. But they could not stop our vessel from crashing.', '', 82597, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But if their death is near, they lose their essence, collapsing into creatures of shadow.', '', 82596, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The naaru that we draenei revere are creatures of pure light.', '', 82595, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you an explanation.', '', 82594, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are hearing this message, it means that I am no more - but Karabor is safe.', '', 82593, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, savior of my people!', '', 82592, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 45364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to teleport to the ship.', 'I am ready to teleport to the ship.', 82591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero, you fought fearlessly. For that, please accept my thanks.', 82590, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 45632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Victory is ours!', '', 82589, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is the naaru doing?', 82588, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 0, 45631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up there! The fleet commander shows himself.', 82587, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 45630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH. Play time is over. I will deal with you myself.', '', 82586, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness the TRUE power of the Iron Horde!', '', 82585, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve done it! Now to put an end to this assault...', 82584, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 45629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, the naaru has come to aid us. We must defend it while it gathers power!', 82583, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 45628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll approach the enemy from the south. Light of the naaru, guide you.', 82582, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 45626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, I need you to fight your way to the harbor.', '', 82581, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 46724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the last of our forces. We\'ll stay here to hold the temple gates.', '', 82580, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 46723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve broken the main siege. We should meet with our forces on the ground.', '', 82579, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it! We broke the blockade!', '', 82578, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done all we can from up here...', '', 82577, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry the light, brothers and sisters!', '', 82576, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press onward. By the light of the naaru!', '', 82575, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never again will you orcish hordes darken the light of Karabor!', '', 82574, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, old friend!', '', 82573, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exarch Akama! Watch your flanks!', '', 82572, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Circle back. We must clear the steps.', '', 82571, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are at the very temple gates - fly closer! Hurry!', '', 82570, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The purifying light of the naaru is both our hammer AND shield.', '', 82569, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly with me, hero. We will assist them from above!', '', 82568, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 44799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero, are you with us?', 82567, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 45609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How we survived this far is a mystery to me. You are quite the field commander.', '', 82566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope Ga\'nar\'s fighting skills are better than his navigation skills.', 82565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go! Let\'s, shall we?', '', 82564, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gordunni have been disconnected from the empire for too long. They really think a wall can stop us?', '', 82563, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, I will gather the troops from your garrison. Do not delay long, they will need your leadership on the battlefield.', '', 82562, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as the defense crystal stands, we will hold.', '', 82561, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 44810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, I need your help to stop the Dark Star\'s arrival. Maraad, can you hold Karabor until we are finished?', '', 82560, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Ner\'zhul poses an equal threat. What should we do, Prophet?', 82559, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 45602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde fleet has been sighted off the coast. We\'re calling every defender to the Temple.', '', 82558, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll see about that!', 82557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is but a fraction of the Dark Star\'s power.', '', 82556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, all will be consumed.', '', 82555, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Samaara! I\'m back!', 82554, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 45600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light granted me strength when I needed it most. It is good to be home.', 82553, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yrel? After the Iron Horde took you, I feared the worst!', 82552, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 46911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait to surprise my sister, Samaara. I never thought I would see her again.', 82551, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have a natural gift.', 82550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me guess. You\'ve done this before.', 82549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the flesh!', 82548, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive.', 82547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will aid you as best I can.', 82546, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that? I couldn\'t hear you! Quickly hero, let\'s go before she comes after me!', 82545, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 45671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! I\'ve never seen anyone move like that before.', 82544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I watched so many of my people die... and I could do nothing to help them.', 82543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never thought I\'d come back from the slave camps of Tanaan alive.', 82542, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are nearing draenei lands. Come now, my sister is waiting for us!', 82541, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a bad feeling about these woods. I\'ll stay here if you want to venture within.', 82540, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gloomshade Grove hides many dangers. If you enter, I will wait for you outside.', 82539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That temple is the home to the Shadowmoon Clan. Their leader is the warlord, Ner\'zhul.', 82538, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello Mister Taarvos!', 82537, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 45663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your garrison is impressive, hero. Even draenei builders could not work so quickly.', 82536, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will go with you, hero. A warm welcome awaits us at Embaari Village.', 82535, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anything so beautiful. It\'s good working with you, $n.$B$BWe\'re going to crush the Warsong!', '', 82534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tankworks is built. Time to put it to good use and bring justice to Nagrand.', '', 82533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corral is built. Time to put it to good use and bring justice to Nagrand.', '', 82532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade is yours, $n. I will fight by your side until the end of my days.', '', 82531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s kill some ogres!', '', 82530, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder, what a battle!', '', 82525, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $pc. Issue your challenge. We will allow you to fight... and die.', '', 82524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you find me?', 'How did you find me?', 82523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dran\'ruk, your theft of $g his:her; blueprints brought $g him:her; here.', '', 82518, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overloading', 'Overloading', 82517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lantresor spits and throws his banner on the ground.', '', 82516, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You remain a half-breed and an exile. You are not worthy of the Burning Blade. Leave and never return.', 82515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As for you, Lantresor of the Blade, you had no right joining this one\'s challenge.', 82514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any clan member who wishes to challenge me may do so.', 82513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, $pc, may leave unharmed. However, if I see you again, you will die.', 82512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear me, Burning Blade! By right of ascension, I, Azuka Bladefury, daughter of Dharl, assume the mantle of warlord.', 82511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dharl. You have no honor. You will die.', '', 82510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll kill you myself. Honor be damned!', '', 82509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My boys. You\'ve destroyed my legacy!', '', 82508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cut you down, $pc!', '', 82507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For father! For honor!', '', 82506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed their father outside. It\'s only fitting they return the favor.', '', 82505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you will face a true challenge -- my grandsons.', '', 82504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was only Warsong and did not fight very well in any case.', '', 82503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s finish this, pup.', '', 82502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure.', '', 82501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish it. Show us the might of the Warsong.', '', 82500, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bomb Exploded: $9067w (-$8911w)', '', 82499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A challenge has been issued from this $g man:woman;... this outsider.', '', 82498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll go first and clear the way, meet me on the other side.', '', 82497, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn these ogres and their magic! I can\'t find a way to bring the barrier down so we\'re just going to have to sneak in around it.', '', 82496, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s my chance!', 'Now\'s my chance!', 82495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, Over here!', '', 82494, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All my stuff in dat tower too...', '', 82493, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope it run out of juice soon.', '', 82492, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not gonna turn around.', '', 82491, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic is scary.', '', 82490, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t break it!', '', 82489, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe we can fix it?', '', 82488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It broke.', '', 82487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll move forward and scout their gates while you\'re taking out those catapults. Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 82486, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see you at the ring. Fight with honor, $n.', '', 82485, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those damned Goren, they took out over half of our numbers before we were able to evacuate the mine.$b$bWe\'re holding our own out here but we\'re going to need some serious help if the mine is going to be made safe again.', 'Those damned Goren, they took out over half of our numbers before we were able to evacuate the mine.$b$bWe\'re holding our own out here but we\'re going to need some serious help if the mine is going to be made safe again.', 82484, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want my things?', '', 82483, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lantresor cuts through his chains.', '', 82482, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am weak, but I can follow.', 'I am weak, but I can follow.', 82481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogres will pay in blood.', 'The ogres will pay in blood.', 82480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wrists are raw from the chains, but I can fight.', 'My wrists are raw from the chains, but I can fight.', 82479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us slaughter these ogres!', 'Let us slaughter these ogres!', 82478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will see what a cornered wolf is like!', 'They will see what a cornered wolf is like!', 82477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are others, we must save them.', 'There are others, we must save them.', 82476, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogre blood will be spilled!', 'Ogre blood will be spilled!', 82475, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I demand vengeance!', 'I demand vengeance!', 82474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This much timber will burn quickly, be ready!', '', 82473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, nice and thick, and enough to coat the entire pile.', '', 82472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
