('I am injured, but you must press on!', 'I am injured, but you must press on!', 82464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear that sound, $p? It\'s the sound of opportunity knocking at your door with a huge pile of money!', '', 82463, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you run into any of my lazy workers down there, tell \'em that if they want to get paid they\'d better start working!', 82462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, $n! There\'s nobody left to beat after Roakk! Get in there and give \'em hell!', '', 82461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody has been able to extinguish Boomspark! He\'s burned through the competition like a thatched roof cottage!', '', 82460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve slain Raketalon and you\'ve crushed Crushmaul! Get in there and do the same thing to Hol\'yelaa! Good luck!', '', 82459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
