('Most gladiators have got a mean right or a mean left; Crushmaul... he\'s just mean!', '', 82457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be the adventure of a lifetime!', '', 82456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s still time to save the others...but you\'ll have to hurry!', '', 82455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d worry less about the saberon and more about what Pyxni will do to us if we don\'t get her stuff back!', '', 82454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find out what happened to that trade shipment, $p. I\'ll make it worth your while!', 82453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
