('It\'s time to finish this. Meet me in the Masters\' Cavern.', '', 82410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. We stand here against the Iron Horde. I will fight.', 82409, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mm.', '', 82408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply a back-up plan. Hopefully we don\'t need it.', '', 82407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you planning, Ariok?', '', 82406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am needed here. Champion, please help the others!', '', 82405, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the darkness closes in... follow the light.', '', 82404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmnnn. That is good. This world is perched on oblivion. Many trials lie ahead. Many heroes will surely give their lives.', '', 82403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many of us owe our lives to these strangers.', 82402, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assure you, my Prophet, the commander we\'ve chosen represents the very best of the Alliance.', '', 82401, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do hope my trust in your people is not misplaced.', '', 82400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it, boys! Let\'s break some ground and take this world for the Alliance!', '', 82399, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The King assured me that our best builders will be ready.', '', 82398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can open up a portal to Stormwind only briefly.', '', 82397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plant the banner, commander, and claim your destiny.', '', 82396, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 45381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you sense the potential? A great army will someday stand on this very spot, and they will look to you for guidance.', '', 82395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! This location commands the entrance to our valley.', '', 82394, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will deal with one problem at a time. First, we must settle your people.', '', 82393, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed, we have many enemies both within and without.', '', 82392, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prophet, I must warn you: the Iron Horde intends to strike out against all who oppose him. We must prepare our defenses!', '', 82391, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, my child. My people welcome your aid, champion. Come with me.', '', 82390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need a base of operations on your world, Great Prophet.', '', 82389, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am extremely grateful, champion.', '', 82388, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 45388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet, this hero - and many others from another world - have come to aid us.', 82387, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel, my student! I thought you had perished for sure.', '', 82386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see the Prophet! He\'s here!', 82385, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 45635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
