('[%s] confesses: I frequently get Vale of Eternal Blossoms and Valley of the Four Winds confused.', '[%s] confesses: I frequently get Vale of Eternal Blossoms and Valley of the Four Winds confused.', 82239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I have no idea how to pronounce Draenor.', '[%s] confesses: I have no idea how to pronounce Draenor.', 82238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I knew he played a priest...', '[%s] confesses: I knew he played a priest...', 82237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: After so much talk about Garrison, I thought it was a person.', '[%s] confesses: After so much talk about Garrison, I thought it was a person.', 82236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Building Burning! (-$9063w)', '', 82235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, your pack of peons awaits your orders.', '', 82234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe needs your extra construction materials.', 'Gazlowe needs your extra construction materials.', 82233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BOLD! Is that what this garrison says to you, commander? No! It does not! But then this is why I was hired.$b$bUsing the small plots we can build a striking array of structures like... an apothecary! Yes, an apothecary. Or perhaps a smithy or a workshop.$b$bIf we use the large plots, we could outfit you with a barracks for your troops that will strike fear into the hearts of your enemies and sleep into the faces of your soldiers.$b$bThe sky is the limit, as is the width and length.', 82232, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off your lazy butts. It\'s time to get to work.', '', 82231, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe needs your extra construction materials.', 'Gazlowe needs your extra construction materials.', 82230, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show them what you\'re made of!', 82229, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Blade is an honorable clan, but they have chosen the wrong side in this conflict.', '', 82228, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can get the building started, but I can\'t finish it without the blueprints. They\'re the key to everything we\'re doing here.', '', 82227, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... can\'t...', 82226, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can never stop this train!', 82225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah!', 82224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How shocking.', 82223, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light \'em up!', 82222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another one!', 82221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rakun, let\'s give \'em hell!', 82220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was not expecting the arcane energy to be this... potent.', '', 82219, 0, 25796, 1, 64, 0, 45495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander! Great! Can you tell Gazlowe that if he is serious about trying to use this plot up here for fishing and farming that he is going to have to find someone who knows what they are doing?', 82218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar speaks highly of you. You have quite the list of accolades.', '', 82217, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen large numbers of Thunderlords massing nearby. They are preparing for an attack.', '', 82216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t go without a fight, Deadeye.', '', 82215, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! We can make our scroll of mass teleportation with these.', '', 82214, 0, 25790, 1, 64, 0, 45515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nobody stops the Iron Horde. Nobody!', 82213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t... even... try...', '', 82212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can compete!', '', 82211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So weak!', '', 82210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another contender down!', '', 82209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Let\'s take this down to your level.', '', 82208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give \'em all ya got.', '', 82207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RAPID FIRE!!!', '', 82206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got my sights on you.', '', 82205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let \'em have it, boys!', '', 82204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Readdyyyyyyyy!!!', '', 82203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares challenge me?', '', 82202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready for me to go fishing?  I will return with a shipment soon.', 'Ready for me to go fishing?  I will return with a shipment soon.', 82201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great fishing in these local waters, just have to get out there!', 'Great fishing in these local waters, just have to get out there!', 82200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With luck, the small ones will now flee, and we can begin construction.', '', 82199, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', '', 82198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s odd that these ancient protectors never awakened despite all this mess.', '', 82197, 0, 25787, 1, 64, 0, 45503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Madam Goya has decided to move her operations to more lucrative markets. It seemed like a prudent time to give up a thankless job.', 'Madam Goya has decided to move her operations to more lucrative markets. It seemed like a prudent time to give up a thankless job.', 82196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. Perhaps we can use these energized mushrooms to our advantage.', '', 82195, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been had! You\'ve been took! You\'ve been hoodwinked. Bamboozled!', '', 82194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When was the last time Gazmolf let us party? We\'ve got to fight for our right to party!', '', 82193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Make some noise! Let old Futzwangler know that we ain\'t budging until we get a bigger cut!', '', 82192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need better pay! More leisure time! Fewer regulations!', '', 82191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time we had a new contract! Revise the labor agreement!', '', 82190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Futzwangler wants the diggin\' done in Stonecrag Gorge, then he can do it himself!', '', 82189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These rampaging elementals are a threat to worker safety! This wasn\'t in the contract!', '', 82188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lands. Attack him!', '', 82187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it fellas, as of right now we\'re on strike!', '', 82186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Earthmother, this land will test us at every turn!', '', 82185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me! I cannot move!', '', 82184, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s burn it up!', '', 82183, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The little girl wails inconsolably.>', 82182, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, did you fight off all the orcs? You\'re strong!', '', 82180, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought everyone forgot about me. Thank you, $Gkind mister:kind lady;!', '', 82179, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! Thank you thank you thank you SO much!', 82178, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.', 'Hello.', 82177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence font allows you to break down weapons and armor into enchanting materials.  The item is PERMANENTLY destroyed.\n\nDo you wish to continue?', 'The essence font allows you to break down weapons and armor into enchanting materials.  The item is PERMANENTLY destroyed.\n\nDo you wish to continue?', 82176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to disenchant some old gear.', 'I wish to disenchant some old gear.', 82175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Steamwheedle Preservation Society was created to help ensure the safety of valuable artifacts and antiquities across Azeroth and Draenor.$b$bWe travel far and wide to obtain the most precious relics and artifacts ever seen!$b$bOur mission is to put all of these priceless artifacts exactly where they belong... in the hands of the highest bidder!', '', 82174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful! Thank you, Archmage. I can handle things from here.', 82173, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there you are! This is the one I was telling you about.', '', 82172, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend is just ahead.', '', 82171, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m Mr. G\'s right hand gal on this expedition. A genius like Mr. G can\'t be bothered to deal with mundane everyday problems.$b$bThat\'s what I\'m here for, to get the doing done so that he can focus on the important stuff!', 82170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No outsiders allowed. Lady Proudmoore\'s orders.', '', 82169, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Splendid! I can take things from here.', '', 82168, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vorka is landing, quickly destroy him and stop this Bombardment of Karabor!', '', 82167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I am Magister Krelas. Pleasure. Let us begin, yes?', '', 82166, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 45516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. I\'m sure I\'ll be seeing the both of you soon.', '', 82165, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If those mines aren\'t cleared by daybreak tomorrow I will fire on the dock I swear!', '', 82164, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be out there killing the White Kraken but instead I have to clean up this mess! Get more orcs down there!', '', 82163, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 82162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fools! How could you dump mines into the harbor?!', '', 82161, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, there you are! This is the one I was telling you about.', '', 82160, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend me and I will break this siege $n!', '', 82159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend is just ahead.', '', 82158, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOOOO... FIND... KHADGARRRR....', '', 82157, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Fight me instead!', '', 82156, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like you could use a hand.', '', 82155, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t go without a fight, Deadeye.', '', 82154, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look what dragged itself through my jungle. Fresh meat!', '', 82153, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARLORD OF THE BLEEDING HOLLOW', 'WARLORD OF THE BLEEDING HOLLOW', 82152, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILROGG DEADEYE', 'KILROGG DEADEYE', 82151, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BLOOD AND HONOR!', '', 82150, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what I must do.', '', 82149, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get this far?', '', 82148, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too easy!', '', 82147, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friends will join you soon!', '', 82146, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlord Zaela! I have regained my honor!', '', 82145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now let us finish this.', '', 82144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Warlord, I have failed you.', '', 82143, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! Now you will pay for embarrassing me!', '', 82142, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fetch my mount, I am tired of watching you peons disgrace my Iron Horde.', '', 82141, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Warlord! I will handle this personally!', '', 82140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is attracted by the smell of fresh blood!', '', 82139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, take this portal down to my tower.', '', 82138, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 44908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hear no more of these excuses. I am going to go prepare the weapon, take care of these invaders or I will show you how a true orc deals with failure.', 82132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancestors help us... look at that!', '', 82131, 0, 924, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up ahead! Look at that!', '', 82130, 0, 923, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t understand, these intruders fight with the fury of Grommash himself.', '', 82129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is pitiful! Do your men not know where the sharp part of the axe goes?', 82128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so hard to find good ingredients around here.', '', 82127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, Archmage. As you wish.', '', 82126, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The mule looks at you with its big old eyes... then it tries to eat your shirt.>', '<The mule looks at you with its big old eyes... then it tries to eat your shirt.>', 82125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Archmage.', '', 82124, 0, 923, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde cares nothing for the quality of a blade or the workmanship that goes into it. They craft them big and heavy to make up for the poor steel they\'re made with.$b$bPathetic.', 82123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done.', '', 82122, 0, 924, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maraad, take command of the remaining survivors and meet us up ahead.', 'Maraad, take command of the remaining survivors and meet us up ahead.', 82121, 0, 923, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall, take command of the remaining survivors and meet us up ahead.', 'Thrall, take command of the remaining survivors and meet us up ahead.', 82120, 0, 924, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My tower lies just through this pass.', '', 82119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let Jaina take it up with me. I am a member of the Council, and you WILL let me and my friend pass!', '', 82118, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 44906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am forming a small party to scout the enemy\'s fortifications.', 'I am forming a small party to scout the enemy\'s fortifications.', 82117, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Proudmoore has expressly forbid Horde from entering Kirin Tor grounds.', '', 82116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them you fools!', '', 82115, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Unacceptable!', '', 82114, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done Commander, but it seems that the intruders are still quite alive.', 82113, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us pass, gatekeeper.', '', 82112, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Cordana!', '', 82111, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eh boss-mon! Ya be needin\' a rest?', 82110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $p. I will introduce you to a friend of mine who can help you with your tower.', '', 82109, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will bring justice to Garrosh and the Warsong clan.', '', 82108, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46388, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tankworks is built. Time to put it to good use and bring justice to Nagrand.', '', 82107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corral is built. Time to put it to good use and bring justice to Nagrand.', '', 82106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no time for laziness!$B$BOnce this beauty\'s built, we\'re going to crush the Warsong and anyone else who gets in our way.', '', 82105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s a beauty, there\'s no doubt about it. We do good work together, $n.$B$BWe\'re going to crush the Warsong!', '', 82104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, but don\'t take long. I will require both of you later, and you will need to be alive.', '', 82103, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t just run away while these brutes bleed my people dry. We have to stop them!', '', 82102, 0, 923, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t just run away while these barbarians bleed my people dry. We have to stop them!', '', 82101, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Total Score: $1i', '', 82100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss killed! (+$9048w)', '', 82099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_whirlwind:20|t%s readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:157943|h[Whirlwind]|h|r!', '', 82098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_shieldguard:20|t%s readies a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:158136|h[Shield Charge]|h|r!', '', 82097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will sink these crystalline resonance emitters into the earth, harnessing the very energies of Draenor itself to power our defenses.', '', 82096, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way, friend. The ward is nearly at full power.', '', 82095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to save the poor broken cat?  Perhaps its time to switch pets!', '', 82094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m busy with my \"honored\" guest?!', '', 82093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
