('', 'I will live to protect the righteous, the helpless, and the hopeless. You are a wise teacher, $n.', 81929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re absolutely right, $n. Samaara and the others are depending on us. For them, I must survive!', 81928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your allies\' lives will mean nothing if you give up here. Let their sacrifice inspire you.', 'Your allies\' lives will mean nothing if you give up here. Let their sacrifice inspire you.', 81927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not our deaths that matter in the end, but how we live. How will you live, Yrel?', 'It is not our deaths that matter in the end, but how we live. How will you live, Yrel?', 81926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot abandon them to this fate. If we forsake our friends now, we are no better than Ner\'zhul.', 'You cannot abandon them to this fate. If we forsake our friends now, we are no better than Ner\'zhul.', 81925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work!', '', 81924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 52698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lusting for carnage, the crowd howls for a blood bath. $B$B x3 Drunken Bileslingers|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_ogre.blp:32|t x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Screaming with blood lust, the crowd wreaks havoc on the arena! $B$B x2 Drunken Bileslingers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_ogre.blp:32|t x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No army can function without orcs like me supplying them.', 81921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. My story began on the streets of Gilneas.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. My story began on the streets of Gilneas.', 81920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. I began my journey in the tranquil boughs of Teldrassil.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. I began my journey in the tranquil boughs of Teldrassil.', 81919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. Once, I was just a trainee on a faraway isle called Shen-zin Su.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. Once, I was just a trainee on a faraway isle called Shen-zin Su.', 81918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. My life began after emerging from the wreckage of the Exodar.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. My life began after emerging from the wreckage of the Exodar.', 81917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. I took my first steps outside an abbey in Elwynn Forest.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. I took my first steps outside an abbey in Elwynn Forest.', 81916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge the might of Skog?!', '', 81915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sergeant, Thunderlord orcs are at the walls!', 'Sergeant, Thunderlord orcs are at the walls!', 81914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms! To your posts! Show the Thunderlords what it is to be Horde!', '', 81913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A revenge assault, eh?  Scout, sound the Call to Arms! Get the peons inside!', '', 81912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the vile taint flowing through me.', '', 81911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one! That is the one that I need!', '', 81910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will catch you and I will fix you.', '', 81909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t try to run, you will only die tired.', '', 81908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many pieces!', '', 81907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I hope those limbs aren\'t too broken.', '', 81906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just think all the things I will make out of your parts.', '', 81905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel this in my soul.', '', 81904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will destroy you.', '', 81903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t handle this!', '', 81902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think that arm is still usable, and maybe the leg.', '', 81901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, repurpose me!', '', 81900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take the next one! Just watch!', '', 81899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you teach me to fight like that?', '', 81898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That...was...AWESOME!', '', 81897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check and see if there\'s any loot!', '', 81896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you rich and famous? If so, I want to be just like you when I grow up!', '', 81895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s split the loot! How does 60/40 sound?', '', 81894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That just happened!', '', 81893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I helped! Did you see?', '', 81892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Qiana just headed out to Moonflower Valley. She is quite eager to explore this new land.', '', 81891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44816, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the barracks complete we can finally shelter all of these troops from this eternal night.', '', 81890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44815, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baros is just down the stairs. I\'m sure he will be more than happy to help you construct a barracks.', '', 81889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you we have a terrific foothold here in Shadowmoon Valley.', '', 81888, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you are ready to start construction, commander.', '', 81887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive work, commander. I know I\'ll sleep a lot better without those giant killer birds flying around.', '', 81886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An excellent choice of lumber, if I do say so myself.', '', 81885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the giant defeated we shouldn\'t have any more trouble clearing out the area.', 81884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is going according to plan, commander. How may I help you?', '', 81883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar\'s magic is strong indeed. He managed to open a permanent portal directly to Stormwind.', '', 81882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I be of service, commander?', '', 81881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s creates an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:162277|h[Epicenter]|h|r!', '', 81880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a wild |cFFFF0404|Hspell:162275|h[Tantrum]|h|r!', '', 81879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s creates an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:159044|h[Epicenter]|h|r!', '', 81878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a wild |cFFFF0404|Hspell:155222|h[Tantrum]|h|r!', '', 81877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it, I\'ve had it! $p, you can have him! I\'m going back to tank-building from here on out!', '', 81876, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Pleasure-Bot 8000. Execute command X47G5!', '', 81875, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows what we might invent with the materials on this world?', '', 81874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like an able fisherman, do you think you can help us out?\n\nWe have established a small garrison nearby, but we are finding it difficult to feed our troops. Any fishing advice you could give us would really help.', 'You look like an able fisherman, do you think you can help us out?\n\nWe have established a small garrison nearby, but we are finding it difficult to feed our troops. Any fishing advice you could give us would really help.', 81873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me be.', 'Leave me be.', 81872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know how dangerous this place is, but I ain\'t leaving until I get back what\'s mine!', '', 81871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn it all, I give up. $p, you can have him! I\'m done!', '', 81870, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gift of the Naaru imbues you! Push through the courtyard, we will meet you at the harbor!', '', 81869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Command unrecognized. Will only accept commands from Pleasure-Bot 8000 owner: $p.', '', 81868, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Pleasure-Bot 8000. Get back to work!', '', 81867, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Power fluctuator active. Rebooting core systems. Please wait.', '', 81866, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh Boss-mon! We be needin\' ya for sometin\' important over here.', '', 81865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-Narash!', 'Lok-Narash!', 81864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 81863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nagrand is for the Warsong.', 'Nagrand is for the Warsong.', 81862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you die.', 'Now you die.', 81861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Garrosh!', 'For Garrosh!', 81860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die outsider!', 'Die outsider!', 81859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder!', 'Blood and thunder!', 81858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warsong!', 'For the Warsong!', 81857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv-mount_raven_54.blp:20|tRukhran has no one to melee and begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:153896|h[Screech]|h|r!', '', 81856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_feather_14.blp:20|tRukhran unleashes a shower of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:159382|h[Quills]|h|r - take cover!', '', 81855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n crafts a Sun Trinket!', '$n crafts a Sun Trinket!', 81854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n crafts a Defense Prism!', '$n crafts a Defense Prism!', 81853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go through the portal, Gazlowe said. You\'ll be rich, he said.$B$BWhat a load of bologna.', '', 81852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon, we will crush the draenei survivors. For the Warsong!', 81851, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Faster! I intend to ride upon Telaari Station soon.', 81850, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve rid our homeland of the draenei. This is a glorious day for the Warsong.', 81849, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warsingers, more power. Once the draenei shield surrounds all of Telaar, no one can get in.', 81848, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No more prisoners. Kill outsiders on sight!', 81847, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All glory to the Warsong. All glory to the new warlord, Garrosh Hellscream!', 81846, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find the intruder and those damned rangari.', 81845, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want this shield surrounding all of Telaar, now.', 81844, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is looking pretty run down.', '', 81843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will get as much ore out of here as we can. We might need to reinforce some of these walls.', '', 81842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, commander!', '', 81841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, $n. Finish it. Exact justice for the fallen of Telaar.', '', 81840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahahaha. Come get your precious blueprints. If you can!', 81839, 0, 924, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have what you want, commander. You\'ll have to come to me. Warsong, find $g him:her;!', 81838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink the elixir and focus on the crystal, $n. Let the ebb and flow of time wash over you...', '', 81837, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A third ancient moves to attack!', '', 81836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A second ancient is called to battle!', '', 81835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grove of Ancients begins to awaken!', '', 81834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will return with help.', 81833, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 45556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll take this draenei back to Khadgar. Stop that orc from opening that portal!', 81832, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 45714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar wants us to scout the cave.', 'Khadgar wants us to scout the cave.', 81831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their depravity sickens me.$b$bWe should wipe this Iron Horde off the map.', 81830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar wants us to scout the cave.', 'Khadgar wants us to scout the cave.', 81829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honored to be fighting by your side, $n.', '', 81828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t be needin\' me, you\'re in charge after all.', '', 81827, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can handle things from here, I\'m sure. Well done!', '', 81826, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 43536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta get this new structure up to snuff pronto, alright? Get to it yesterday!', '', 81825, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo everybody, listen up. Thanks to our commander we got a new building up!', '', 81824, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot... hold them... back...', '', 81823, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to need to work together to get it up to full production. See to it our commander is not kept waiting!', '', 81822, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 43535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good people of Fort Wrynn, our commander has finalized construction on a new building!', '', 81821, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 43534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come along, Percy!', '', 81820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll slip away while you keep the herald busy. Meet us near the bridge just outside of town!', '', 81819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Percy, would you hold still?! How do you expect me to read it with you fluttering about like that?', '', 81818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The waters begin to stir.>', '<The waters begin to stir.>', 81817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<An inscription on the hilt reads:>\n\n\"Here Vindicator Torvath fell in battle to end the rage of the ancients.\n\n May the light shine upon this grove that he so valiantly fought to protect and may it forever bring peace upon its denizens.\"', '', 81812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me back at Twilight Glade, champion. We have much to do.', '', 81810, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul leads us to this destiny. To save Karabor, we must stop him.', '', 81809, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NO! This cannot be the fate of my people!', '', 81808, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 45360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack... I\'m a bit woozy. Ya got this? I need ta get back ta the station.', '', 81807, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I softened \'em up fer ya.', '', 81806, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years I\'ve worked to tame these gentle creatures.$bThey are fantastically intelligent, you know. We have so much we could learn from them, if only we had more youngsters willing to learn the delicate art of communing with them.$b$b<Alorn sighs>$b$bWere the world more peaceful I could have taught others my trade, but I\'m afraid we have more pressing concerns to deal with.', '', 81805, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not that far. Come on, just jump already!', 'It\'s not that far. Come on, just jump already!', 81804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be fine. Just jump!', 'You will be fine. Just jump!', 81803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way! It\'s too far! Seriously... get a ladder!', 'No way! It\'s too far! Seriously... get a ladder!', 81802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not jumping! Just go get a ladder!', 'I am not jumping! Just go get a ladder!', 81801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should be fine... I just twisted a hoof.', 'I should be fine... I just twisted a hoof.', 81800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, again, for the aid. Luckily, I was able to get the eggs into the spare incubators.$bI wish I had more strength in my arms for swinging a weapon or I\'d be out there dealing righteous justice but... taking care of the eggs is about all I can do. Please find the cause of this mess and get rid of it, the fey dragons and I are counting on you!', '', 81799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to be okay?', 'Are you going to be okay?', 81798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the western gate!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the western gate!', 81797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vindicator... Arbiter, can ya hear me? I\'m comin\'.', '', 81796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye\'ve harmed the wee one or her mum, I\'m gonna kill ya twice... painfully!', '', 81795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where ya got the survivors stashed, ya animals?', '', 81794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry. I\'m comin\' fer all o\' ya.', '', 81793, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be shy. There\'s plenty o\' me ta go \'round.', '', 81792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
