('Horrible creatures of appeared out of nowhere and are killing the drakes! $b$bThey are all going to be killed if we don\'t do anything!$b$bIf you could get rid of the creatures attacking them and help me gather some of their lost eggs it would be a huge help.$b$bPlease, $c, I\'m the only eggtender left, I need your help if they are to survive!', '', 81766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
