('At your service, commander.', 'At your service, commander.', 81747, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our commander approaches! Men, at the ready!', 'Our commander approaches! Men, at the ready!', 81746, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome Commander $n. It is an honor to serve under you.', 'Welcome Commander $n. It is an honor to serve under you.', 81745, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orders, commander?', 'Orders, commander?', 81744, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, I\'m begging you. Let us go!', 81743, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re monsters to threaten a defenseless woman and her child!', 81742, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you harm my baby, I will kill you!', 81741, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe if I were to talk with your leader? Explain things? You\'d see it\'s okay for us to leave.', 81740, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just want to take my daughter and leave. We aren\'t any threat to you.', 81739, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We never harmed any of you. We all used to get along so well.', 81738, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least let Isel go. She\'s just a child.', 81737, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
