('<whispers> No noise!', '', 81728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Giant killer ravens... I have a feeling it\'s going to be a long, cold night.', '', 81727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you mark those trees, Shelly\'s lumberjacks will do the rest.', '', 81726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Killing the beast will surely gain the respect of Karabor peacekeepers.', 81725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up! I can\'t hold this thing open forever!', '', 81724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much glory riding for the Iron Horde!  The enemies of the Iron Horde are often strong and dangerous.  This is not something to fear though!  Strong enemies make us stronger, and while we can be hurt, we have never fallen.  We never will!', '', 81723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you fear the smoke and recoil from the fires.  I tell you these are not things to fear!  Our armor is impenetrable!  Our weapons unstoppable!  The fires of our industry make you the greatest warriors that have ever existed!', '', 81722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask not what the Iron Horde can do for you, but what you can do for the Iron Horde.  With your help, the Iron Horde can reach across the continent and rule everything the way it should be ruled!', '', 81721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory and death!', '', 81720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to establish a foothold here in Shadowmoon Valley as soon as possible. There is a clearing not far from here that will be a perfect place to start.', '', 81719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to die!', '', 81718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trials that lay before you will not be easy, $n. Some of your most trusted companions will surely be lost. When the darkness closes in, follow the light.', '', 81717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re coming with me!', '', 81716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me.', 81715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, teacher. $n, jump on that Elekk and we will be on our way.', 81714, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll explain on the way there.', '', 81713, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel, my most promising student returns home. Please lead our friends here to the Shadowmoon Ruins.', '', 81712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not let doubt trouble you! Where there is light there is hope. Strike now!', 81711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the light against the darkness! Shield of the meek! Hope for the helpless!', 81710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Shadowmoon Valley. I\'ve been expecting you.', '', 81709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no power stronger than hope!', 81708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are the shield against the darkness!', 81707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, strike with the power of holy light!', 81706, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true that both foe and glory abound on the plains of Nagrand. That was not enough for your warchief though, and he has made a place for you at his side across ALL of Draenor.  The Iron Horde will see true glory across two worlds!', '', 81705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
