('More intruders!', 'More intruders!', 81703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde is like nothing you\'ve ever seen!  Every meal a banquet, every plunder a fortune!  We are unstoppable and the glory will be unending!', '', 81702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prophet, your attempts are meaningless. Witness the TRUE might of the Iron Horde!', '', 81701, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As long as I live, Karabor shall not fall!', '', 81700, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
