('Iron Fleet! Darken the skies!', '', 81655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin Construction [Build Garrison]', 'Begin Construction [Build Garrison]', 81654, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
