('I\'ve got these ones!', 'I\'ve got these ones!', 81650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrraahh!', 'Grrraahh!', 81649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, you ugly brutes!', 'Over here, you ugly brutes!', 81648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want fight in the arena? Talk wit\' Dexyl, he puts the fights together.$b$bMe? I just here to start the match... and clean up the bodies after! BAWHAHA!', '', 81647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marking', 'Marking', 81646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light will protect you!', 'The light will protect you!', 81645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not going down that easy!', 'You\'re not going down that easy!', 81644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, sir!', 'Hang in there, sir!', 81643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you, Commander!', 'I\'ve got you, Commander!', 81642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you, Commander?', 'What can I do for you, Commander?', 81641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Ring of Trials! I\'m here setting up fights for the arena. If you\'re looking to make some extra cash, you\'ve come to the right place!', '', 81640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, sir!', 'Yes, sir!', 81639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to come on patrol with me.', 'I need you to come on patrol with me.', 81638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_improvedfirenova:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156357|h[Blackrock Shrapnel]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_improvedfirenova:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156357|h[Blackrock Shrapnel]|h|r!', 81636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_pyriumgrenade:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:160703|h[Blackrock Grenades]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_pyriumgrenade:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:160703|h[Blackrock Grenades]|h|r!', 81635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball02:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:160702|h[Blackrock Mortar Shells]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball02:20|t $n has picked up |cFFFF0000|Hspell:160702|h[Blackrock Mortar Shells]|h|r!', 81634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your heads! Iron capsules incoming!', 81633, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We couldn\'t stop the Dark Star, Prophet. The Iron Horde have taken the harbor!', 81632, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel, what is happening?', '', 81631, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is hosting a Feast of Blood. Enjoy!', '$n is hosting a Feast of Blood. Enjoy!', 81630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Work faster fools, the Dark Star draws ever closer!', 81629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There must be something we can use in these old bones.', 81628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close to me, champion!', '', 81627, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! That defense crystal was our only hope.', 81626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH! Play time is over. Ships, on my mark, FIRE ON THE CRYSTAL!', '', 81625, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the barricades! Protect the defense crystal at all costs!', 81623, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... no... it cannot be. The temple is under attack!', '', 81622, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Temple of Karabor? No... it cannot be. We are under attack!', '', 81621, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrisons - Attack Stage 1.3 Begin', '', 81620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrisons - Attack Stage 1.2 Begin', '', 81619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n', '$n', 81618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n', '', 81617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be feelin\' better \'bout our chances wid you here, $n.', 81616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Debug - Garrison - Toggle Stage 1 Version', '', 81614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, this is where we will build your garrison.$b$bHave you commanded this many troops before?$b$bI\'m sure you\'ll do fine... I hope.', '', 81613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn away to avoid Hypnocroak\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:160664|h[Hypnotic Gaze]|h|r', '', 81612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn the bridge! Nothing must interfere!', 'Burn the bridge! Nothing must interfere!', 81611, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh! Don\' blow my cover.', '', 81610, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh! Act natural.', '', 81609, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\' let dem see us talkin\'!\n\nDey never question a two-head.\n\nDagg is unanimous in dis.', '', 81608, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\' blow Dagg\'s cover!$B$BDey never question a tree.$B$BDagg is unanimous in dis.', '', 81607, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plant your banner, and claim your destiny.', '', 81603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44819, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel it, $n? A great army will stand at this very spot, and they will look to you for guidance.', '', 81602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light you showed up.', 'Thank the Light you showed up.', 81601, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand blessings, $c.', 'A thousand blessings, $c.', 81600, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free!', 'I am free!', 81599, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger. Now I may finally enter Auchindoun.', 'Thank you, stranger. Now I may finally enter Auchindoun.', 81598, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great leader sets an example for all those who follow.$b$bThey know when to speak, and when to listen.$b$bThey know when to stand and fight for their survival, and when to sacrifice it all for the greater good.$b$bAre you ready to lead, $n?', '', 81597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unanimously agree with Dagg? (Garrison Follower)', 'Unanimously agree with Dagg? (Garrison Follower)', 81596, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna have to ask demself, \"Did Dagg get catched or did Dagg catched dem?\"\n\nBig hero been blowin\' Dagg\'s cover! But you special, Dagg t\'inks. Dagg is master of dis guys and want to join you.\n\nDagg is unanimous in dis.', '', 81595, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi again.', '', 81594, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dunno how dem orcs keep catchin\' me. <Dagg snickers disarmingly.>', '', 81593, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t mind me. I\'m staying out of this fight.', '', 81592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you join me in the fight against the Iron Horde?', 'Will you join me in the fight against the Iron Horde?', 81591, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar said stay out of his way, so I am doing just that. I am not going to get myself killed in the name of the Iron Wolf or his kin.$b$bWe should talk... if you survive this.', '', 81590, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oregorger is full of blackrock ore!', '', 81589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Luuka, follow me. It is time we returned to the garrison.', 81588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander! Your timing is impeccable as always.', 81587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot thank you enough for all of your help, $n.', 81586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dagg tanks you, friend! <Dagg lets out a guttural chuckle.>', '', 81585, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! The little Prowlers have been frightened senseless by the fire and won\'t evacuate! Please, calm them down so they can escape!', 81584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A bomb is placed! Find it!', '', 81583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oregorger has grown hungry and wants to eat more blackrock ore!', '', 81582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The poor dear, she injured herself trying to escape the flames.$b$b<Vilonia pats Miss Purr-Purr softly on the head.>$b$bLook at that sad face, I can\'t just leave her to face the fire alone.', 81581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You give my people hope, stranger.', 'You give my people hope, stranger.', 81580, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh!', 'Ooh!', 81579, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels good.', 'It feels good.', 81578, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never held a weapon before.', 'I\'ve never held a weapon before.', 81577, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks.', 'Thanks.', 81576, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make them suffer, like I suffered.', 'Make them suffer, like I suffered.', 81575, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them. Kill them all.', 'Kill them. Kill them all.', 81574, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your spirit find rest with those of your people\'s ancestors.', 'May your spirit find rest with those of your people\'s ancestors.', 81573, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go with the Light, sister.', 'Go with the Light, sister.', 81572, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will avenge you, Tannosh.', 'I will avenge you, Tannosh.', 81571, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, pig!', 'Die, pig!', 81570, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how long I\'ve been waiting to do this.', 'You have no idea how long I\'ve been waiting to do this.', 81569, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die here.', 'I thought I was going to die here.', 81568, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light!', 'Thank the Light!', 81567, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, my love.', 'Farewell, my love.', 81566, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, freedom!', 'At last, freedom!', 81565, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s see how THEY like being cut open!', 'Now, let\'s see how THEY like being cut open!', 81564, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A weapon!', 'A weapon!', 81563, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Praise the Light!', 'Praise the Light!', 81562, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks.', 'You have my thanks.', 81561, 0, 0, 2, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I got him.', 'I think I got him.', 81560, 0, 0, 11, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out behind you!', 'Look out behind you!', 81559, 0, 0, 5, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to build stuff!', 'Time to build stuff!', 81558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes! Yes! The crystal hums... just a bit of focus and...', 81557, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 43643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try as you might, this place is doomed. It is only a matter of time...', 81556, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 43642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are YOU, Tuulani, and your outsider friends.', 81555, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 43641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the town square!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the town square!', 81554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the western wall!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the western wall!', 81553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the mine!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the mine!', 81552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the back gate!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the back gate!', 81551, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n regains their Damage Shield!', 81550, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n loses their Damage Shield!', 81549, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! It is good that you have joined us! I will hold these Thunderlord off in case any of your allies arrive.', '', 81548, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that the Heart of Auchindoun is back inside, our defenses should be impenetrable!', 81547, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seismic Shockwave! Use a steam vent to get off the ground!', '', 81546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done more than you know. Our people can never thank you enough.', 81545, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now we can rebuild... we must rebuild. We will never allow our souls to fall to the Legion.', 81544, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here - this is not enough to thank you for your actions, but it is what we have to give.', 81543, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You... you did it!', 81542, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 44650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll gather any who remain loyal here and protect them. You - please, go put a stop to this madness!', 81541, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 44649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She had help. So many of our order were corrupt...', 81540, 0, 0, 603, 64, 0, 0, 44648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She... got away. The defenses...', 81539, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh!', 81538, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 44646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...The protector... still answers her call... you\'ll have to defeat it!', 81537, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 44645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have to stop them!', 81536, 0, 0, 5, 70, 0, 0, 44661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this? Oh, no... no...', 81535, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 0, 44660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nyami! We are here -', 81534, 0, 0, 22, 70, 0, 0, 44659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Vindicators and Exarchs of the past. Heroes all - their souls still remain with us here.', 81533, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us proceed.', 81532, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 44657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strange... why is the door sealed? No matter...', 81531, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 44656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beautiful, isn\'t it? Just think - you\'re one of the first outsiders to see inside Auchindoun.', 81530, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 44655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nyami is working to bolster the defenses against their assault - follow me, we will report to her.', 81529, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 44654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good! We must have arrived before Teron\'gor and Gul\'dan!', 81528, 0, 0, 3, 64, 0, 0, 44644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 1.1 Begin', '', 81527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
