('Invaders have been spotted near the town hall!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the town hall!', 81525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the farm!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the farm!', 81524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders have been spotted near the front gate!', 'Invaders have been spotted near the front gate!', 81523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_improvedfirenova.blp:20|tThe frequency of the Heart of the Mountain\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:155209|h[Blast]|h|r has been increased!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_improvedfirenova.blp:20|tThe frequency of the Heart of the Mountain\'s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:155209|h[Blast]|h|r has been increased!', 81522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those peons under control!  You heard Ner\'zhul, no one leaves this village!', 'Get those peons under control!  You heard Ner\'zhul, no one leaves this village!', 81521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s enough outta you, gasbag.', 81520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know how easy it is to hide a body under one of these things?', 81519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait to hear a job\'s done.', '', 81518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might want to repair that stamper before Northrend thaws!', '', 81517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
