('', 'Keep flappin\' yer gums, if you want to be an orc kabob.', 81515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery Strike Inbound!', 'Artillery Strike Inbound!', 81513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have more frost iron ingots for you.', 'I have more frost iron ingots for you.', 81512, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found some strange metal for you to examine...', 'I found some strange metal for you to examine...', 81511, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like an equipment upgrade...', 'I\'d like an equipment upgrade...', 81510, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just be ready when our ships arrive at Karabor.', '', 81509, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 43663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have a pretty good shop going on here. Much bigger then the shack I used to work at in Shattrath.', 81508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to be ejected from your Telaari Tank. Return to Nagrand.', '', 81506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n activates the Great Spire\'s Focusing Iris!', '$n activates the Great Spire\'s Focusing Iris!', 81505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are right, $n. I will not bow quietly to these enemies. I must fight!', 81504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You choose the strangest times for humor, $c. Nevertheless, you have a point. I must have courage!', 81503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are truly wise, $n. I must believe in myself, for I carry the Light within me.', 81502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people have triumphed over endless persecution. Will you let their hopes die here without a fight?', 'Your people have triumphed over endless persecution. Will you let their hopes die here without a fight?', 81501, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Doubt the Light\' just doesn\'t have the same ring to it.', '\'Doubt the Light\' just doesn\'t have the same ring to it.', 81500, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light is only as strong as its champions. Believe in YOURSELF.', 'The Light is only as strong as its champions. Believe in YOURSELF.', 81499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is it true? Good doesn\'t always triumph over evil.', 81498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe in the Light! Despite setbacks, it will always prevail.', 'Believe in the Light! Despite setbacks, it will always prevail.', 81497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are right, $n. My choices do matter. I choose... to fight!', 81496, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must choose, Yrel. Will you rise and fight, or fall here to doubt?', 'You must choose, Yrel. Will you rise and fight, or fall here to doubt?', 81495, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! I needed to hear that, $n. I must not fall prey to my own fears.', 81494, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull yourself together, Yrel! You can do better than this!', 'Pull yourself together, Yrel! You can do better than this!', 81493, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see, $n. You have never backed down from a challenge. I must strive to do the same.', 81492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all start from humble beginnings. I once hunted troggs in the cold mountains of Dun Morogh.', 'We all start from humble beginnings. I once hunted troggs in the cold mountains of Dun Morogh.', 81491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A hero? Hardly! I am just an initiate, and not a very good one at that.', 81490, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t give up now! Heroes learn from their mistakes.', 'We can\'t give up now! Heroes learn from their mistakes.', 81489, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why? What is the use of saving them? Only death awaits us all in the end.', 81488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think of your people. The captives still need our help!', 'Think of your people. The captives still need our help!', 81487, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s hopeless. How are we going to get out of here?', 81486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now go. The Rangari follow your orders. Find the prisoners.', '', 81485, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are capable of more than you know, Yrel.', '', 81483, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master Velen, I have never led soldiers before. Are you sure--', 81482, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 45613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enraged by the lack of corpses, the crowd showers the arena with explosives! $B$B x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81481, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enthralled by the violence, the crowd attempts to up the body count! $B$B x3 Drunken Bileslingers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_ogre.blp:32|t x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81480, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eager for bloodshed, the crowd rains destruction onto the arena floor! $B$B x1 Drunken Bileslinger|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_ogre.blp:32|t x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81479, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drunken Ogres begin hurling |cFFFF0000|Hspell:159410|h[Mauling Brew]|h|r from the stands! $B$B x2 Drunken Bileslingers|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_reputation_ogre.blp:32|t x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81474, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A throng of angry orcs begin throwing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:159386|h[Iron Bombs]|h|r into the arena! $B$B x5 Iron Bombers |TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_character_orc_male_brn.blp:32|t', '', 81473, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is attempting to free an ally from all crowd-controlling effects!', '$n is attempting to free an ally from all crowd-controlling effects!', 81472, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n crafts an Air Trinket!', '$n crafts an Air Trinket!', 81471, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all counting on you, $n.', '', 81465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fracking', 'Fracking', 81464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capping', 'Capping', 81463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At your service, commander.', '', 81462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to be ejected from your Wor\'var Demolisher. Return to Nagrand.', '', 81461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept the Blood Oath of Lokra. (Garrison Follower)', 'Accept the  Blood Oath of Lokra. (Garrison Follower)', 81460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '[ph] Can I follow you?', 81459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cutting down unarmed prisoners? Why not fight a real battle?', '', 81458, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take care of the lieutenants, champion. Bladefist is mine.', '', 81457, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept the Defection of Gronnstalker Rokash. (Garrison Follower)', 'Accept the  Defection of Gronnstalker Rokash. (Garrison Follower)', 81456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen your forces marching boldly across the landscape with the confidence of the Warsong.$b$bYou have my attention.', '', 81455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby Void Occulus is alerted to you! Get away before it attacks!', 'A nearby Void Occulus is alerted to you! Get away before it attacks!', 81454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby Void Wolf is alerted to you! Get away before it attacks!', 'A nearby Void Wolf is alerted to you! Get away before it attacks!', 81453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ared\'s breath comes in short gasps as he lays in an uneasy sleep. Beads of sweat cover his head and a noxious odor rises from his bloody wounds. It would seem that what time he has left will not last for long.>', '', 81452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine Ared\'s condition more closely.', 'Examine Ared\'s condition more closely.', 81451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ared\'s breath comes in short gasps as he lays in an uneasy sleep.>', '', 81450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! To Thunder Pass. We are outnumbered 50 to 1. They don\'t stand a chance!', '', 81448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He made his choice.', '', 81447, 0, 0, 274, 68, 0, 44099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I will never be okay with this.', '', 81446, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you okay, husband?', 81445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be ready. They will NEVER take the pass.', '', 81444, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is right. The Iron Horde will move against us. We must be ready.', '', 81443, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work work work...', '', 81442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha! Guess dis batch will have some impurities.', '', 81441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna tell Blackhand we got a stamper that ain\'t stampin\'?', '', 81440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So? Go un-jam it den!', '', 81439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey you! Get in dere and un-jam that stamper!', '', 81438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t un-jammin it! I un-jammed it last time!', '', 81437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Franz? Franzok! We got a jam!', '', 81436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 47411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t giving up easy! Garrosh personally promised me Stormwind!', '', 81435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IGNORE ME!', '', 81434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will give her the proper last rites. Come, let us speak with Durotan.', 81433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoever it was, they must have recovered Asha\'s body.', 81432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde has been feeding these wolves to the rylaks.$b$bThis little runt was trying to get away when I broke the gate open.$b$bLet\'s see if he is of any use to us.', '', 81431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is her body?', '', 81430, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look here - wolf tracks. They turn into orc tracks. One of our shamans found her.', 81429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is where it happened...', 81428, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to choose the outpost building now.', 'I\'m ready to choose the outpost building now.', 81427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teron\'gor does not desire further disturbances. Dispose of the intruder!', '', 81426, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s plants an Ironmarch War Banner!', '%s plants an Ironmarch War Banner!', 81425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eye of Gul\'dan has spotted you!', '', 81424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! There you go... good girl.', '', 81423, 0, 25298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fly her to safety. Meet me at the islands east of here. Nisha will fly you there if you wish.', '', 81422, 0, 25298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steady...  steady. You are no longer in danger. I will not hurt you.', '', 81421, 0, 25298, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are freed! Follow me, shaman. We will escape through the hills.', '', 81420, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a visitor. Perhaps... a savior.', '', 81419, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the flames dying down. What is happening, exarch?', '', 81418, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody help!!! I need back up!!', '', 81417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell my brethren at the arena of your courage. Be safe.', '', 81416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with honor, $p.', '', 81415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Hold on! Now, just wait a second! We can talk this through!', '', 81414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go, $n. Our hunt continues.', '', 81413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As promised I will set you free. But I think these wolves would like to talk with you before you go.', '', 81412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I said I\'d help with the war effort I thought I\'d be a soldier helping win the war through skill with a weapon.$bInstead I\'m here drawing up plans and placing bricks.$b$bI guess I\'ll live longer this way at least.', '', 81411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for the Iron Horde to learn a little respect for the hunt. Haratha, see to it that our friend here is protected.', '', 81410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought!', 'Well fought!', 81409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to our enemies!', 'Death to our enemies!', 81408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, we\'ll kill them yet!', 'Ha, we\'ll kill them yet!', 81407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wipe out the Unmanned Shredders and meet us on the south side of the island.', '', 81406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here to end your suffering, friend. Go in peace, your tormentors will not go unpunished.', '', 81405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must help the others. Slay more of them for me!', 'I must help the others. Slay more of them for me!', 81404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you imagine a live colossus? They say this was the last one, and the Thunderlord clan took it down generations ago.', 81403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight by your side.', 'I will fight by your side.', 81402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you!', 'I\'ll help you!', 81401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Asha! To me!', 81400, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air...it smells like...something is wrong.', '', 81399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest have fled...but not from us.', '', 81398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees to report your position!', '%s flees to report your position!', 81397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of the innocent stains your claws!', '', 81396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come at me with tooth and claw!', '', 81395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mangy beasts! You fight like kittens!', '', 81394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry to disappoint you.', '', 81393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love fighting draenei. You people always look so scared before you die.', '', 81392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I do. Would you like to take a closer look?', '', 81391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wield a Blackrock hammer, green-skin.', '', 81390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ptuh! And I thought you were an orc...', '', 81389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do when we share a common enemy.', '', 81388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you always let a draenei fight your battles for you, green-skin?', '', 81387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll do one better and put my blade where your throat is!', '', 81386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... looks like somebody already put his blade where his hand was.', '', 81385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you put your blade where your mouth is, Kargath?', '', 81384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to cut off that head of yours, draenei.', '', 81383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Khadgar, champion! We will buy you the time you need!', '', 81382, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Thought you\'d never ask.', '', 81381, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I\'m afraid you\'re not much more than a warm-up, draenei. Doesn\'t anyone else feel like dying today?', '', 81380, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold everything! Now, they speak my language!', '', 81379, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s not very sportsmanlike, Bladefist. Why don\'t we settle this in the arena?', '', 81378, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two on one? Now, you speak my language!', '', 81377, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sound afraid, Kargath.', '', 81376, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wouldn\'t last ten seconds against me, draenei.', '', 81375, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kargath, you coward!', '', 81374, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen enough here.', '', 81373, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I t\'ink I\'m getting colder...', '', 81372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaahh! How me supposed to learn how to control da ice if you breaks me out of it! Me gonna smash you for dat!', '', 81371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Live!', 'Live!', 81370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not dying on my watch!', 'Not dying on my watch!', 81369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Gul\'dan. Your will be done.', 'Yes, Gul\'dan. Your will be done.', 81368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... dinner....', '', 81367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Teron\'gor. Our contact has provided another entrance to Auchindoun. Your feast of souls awaits.', '', 81366, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 45341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
