('%s cries out for help!', '%s cries out for help!', 81221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart lies heavy in my chest. Thank you for showing the Mother of Wolves her proper respects.$B$BShe will be avenged.', '', 81220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mark my words, $g brother:sister;, no good will come of Cho\'gall\'s interest in these Pale.', '', 81219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I had it within my power, I\'d go back in time and strangle Gul\'dan before he drank of Mannoroth\'s blood.', '', 81218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, wolf-$g brother:sister;. We are dishonored for letting the archmage be attacked here in our home.', '', 81217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win da Circle of Blood, me give you dat slave I gots locked up outside.', '', 81216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hit harder or me hit you!', '', 81215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lot need to smash harder! We gotta beat da Bladespire at da next Circle of Blood!', '', 81214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan is down below. Do whatever you must, $n, but capture him before he escapes.', '', 81213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You continue to impress, Commander $n.$B$BOne thing remains: to capture Gul\'dan.', '', 81212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is of the essence, commander. Gul\'dan could leave at any moment.$B$BYou must destroy those fel crystals and get to him inside the Gloomspire.', '', 81211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, $n. The next step is to move throughout the ruins, using the infernal\'s heart to destroy the fel crystals.', '', 81210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re to destroy the fel crystals and bring down the barrier protecting the Gloomspire, you must find the demon key.$B$BI\'d start by killing Fernus.', '', 81209, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, our work here is done. Please use the portal to return to Throm\'var.$B$BWe\'ll speak at length of next steps when you return.', '', 81208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. They can\'t see this projection.$B$BEverything we do here is leading to one thing, $n: Gul\'dan\'s capture.', '', 81207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be fine!', 81206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d bet you my spare blade that whatever\'s causing these ground tremors is also directly responsible for those rockworms.$B$BOf course, you have no idea how to wield one of these. Maybe you could mount it on your wall.', 81205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadow Council are disgusting. But, infusing the bodies of dead frost wolves with demonic energy is a new low!', 81204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies for not joining you, commander. I\'d love to be out there killing the Shadow Council with you.$B$BHowever, my duty to protect the archmage must come first.$B$BOf course, you could whisper in his ear to have one of my sisters come and take my place.', 81203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan\'s a slippery one.$B$BDon\'t let it get you down, commander. We\'ll catch him.', '', 81202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Crypt of Forgotten Kings (Heroic).', 'Tell me of the Crypt of Forgotten Kings (Heroic).', 81201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the tale of a Brewing Storm (Heroic).', 'Tell me the tale of a Brewing Storm (Heroic).', 81200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the tale of Blood in the Snow (Heroic).', 'Tell me the tale of Blood in the Snow (Heroic).', 81199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Secrets of Ragefire (Heroic).', 'Tell me of the Secrets of Ragefire (Heroic).', 81198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the unearthing of the Dark Heart of Pandaria (Heroic).', 'Tell me of the unearthing of the Dark Heart of Pandaria (Heroic).', 81197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Battle on the High Seas (Heroic).', 'Tell me of the Battle on the High Seas (Heroic).', 81196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings. I have focused my studies on the heroic deeds of recent visitors to these lands. Would you hear any of these tales?', '', 81195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, wolf-$g brother:sister;. Warm yourself by the fire.', 81194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frenzied Manafeeder has entered a weakened state.', '', 81193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll lead the wounded to safety. Cover our escape!', 81192, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 44643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you are ready, I will teleport you back to Jorune Mine, $p.', 81191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'True arcane mastery only comes with patience and dedication. Kaelynara was naive to think otherwise...', 81190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are ready, I will teleport you back to Jorune Mine.', '', 81189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kaelynara\'s betrayal was unfortunate. I will inform Astalor as to what has become of his apprentice...', '', 81188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This has gone on long enough! Your madness ends here Kaelynara!', '', 81187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your guard, $n. Once I break through Kaelynara\'s shield I will teleport us outside the mine!', '', 81186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few nights ago there was a bunch of weird looking lights flashing from the cave across the lava flows. More of that foul ogre magic no doubt.', 'A few nights ago there was a bunch of weird looking lights flashing from the cave across the lava flows. More of that foul ogre magic no doubt.', 81185, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was helping to move the bodies out of the western cave. There was a tall skinny female with green hair and pale blue skin that was still alive! It didn\'t look like an orc or if it was it was by far the most sickly looking thing I\'ve ever seen. One of the ogres took her down to the cave in the north east.', 'I was helping to move the bodies out of the western cave. There was a tall skinny female with green hair and pale blue skin that was still alive! It didn\'t look like an orc or if it was it was by far the most sickly looking thing I\'ve ever seen. One of the ogres took her down to the cave in the north east.', 81184, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, I\'ve seen the bodies that come back after their \"boss\" has finished with them. They have no markings of torture on them but their faces are all frozen in a scream.', 'Be careful, I\'ve seen the bodies that come back after their \"boss\" has finished with them. They have no markings of torture on them but their faces are all frozen in a scream.', 81183, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to heroically CTRL-E through the portal with me!', '', 81182, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just get me free, stranger. I could kill a hundred of these pigs with this shovel alone.', '', 81181, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will sing songs of your heroism, Dar\'toon.', '', 81180, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shared that duty with you, Dar\'toon.  We will meet the enemy together.', '', 81179, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage, let me stay behind. It was my sworn duty to watch over this portal.', '', 81178, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sacrifices will not be forgotten, Netherwane.', '', 81177, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vanguard is falling. We will not let their great sacrifice be in vain!', '', 81176, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mercy!', '', 81175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll always be remembered, as a smudge on my boot.', '', 81174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You break so easily!', '', 81173, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s give the crowd something to chew on.', '', 81172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape.', '', 81171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carnage!', '', 81170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You owe me a fight, cowards.', '', 81169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, let\'s go over what happened when Garona attacked.', 'Khadgar, let\'s go over what happened when Garona attacked.', 81168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:158986|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', '%s |cFFFF0404|Hspell:158986|h[Fixates]|h|r on you!', 81167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pathetic magic will have no control over me back in da normal world. Once I\'ve fed your friends to da Soulgrinder I\'ll return for you!', '', 81166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrogant spirit, you dare to summon me?!', '', 81165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Attack Prototype - Reduce Reinforcements', '', 81164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, I have been waiting for a fight!', 81163, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 43554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Attack Prototype - Building Burning', '', 81162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunate, but now we know more. You can take the portal back to Throm\'var.', '', 81161, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait...what are you...?! Nooooo!!', 81160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My vindicators will handle things here. May the Light return you both in safety.', '', 81159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears that one of your allies has arrived, mage.', '', 81158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you have decided to join me on my quest to tame the Darktide Matriarch?$b$bIt appears you are not the only one. The Iron Horde is destroying this island and the creatures that inhabit it. They have no respect for the rylaks they hunt.$b$bRest assured $c, I will not let this disgraceful slaughter go unpunished.', '', 81157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This madness ends now Kaelynara! We will not allow you to cause further destruction!', 81156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand ready, $n. As soon as her shield is broken I will teleport us out of the mine.', 81155, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the tale of Blood in the Snow.', 'Tell me the tale of Blood in the Snow.', 81154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Secrets of Ragefire.', 'Tell me of the Secrets of Ragefire.', 81153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the unearthing of the Dark Heart of Pandaria.', 'Tell me of the unearthing of the Dark Heart of Pandaria.', 81152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of how Varian and Tyrande learned a Little Patience.', 'Tell me of how Varian and Tyrande learned a Little Patience.', 81151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Battle on the High Seas.', 'Tell me of the Battle on the High Seas.', 81150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Dagger in the Dark that felled Vol\'jin.', 'Tell me of the Dagger in the Dark that felled Vol\'jin.', 81149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of Theramore\'s Fall.', 'Tell me of Theramore\'s Fall.', 81148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Brewmoon Festival.', 'Tell me of the Brewmoon Festival.', 81147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Assault on Zan\'vess.', 'Tell me of the Assault on Zan\'vess.', 81146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the tale of a Brewing Storm.', 'Tell me the tale of a Brewing Storm.', 81145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Arena of Annihilation.', 'Tell me of the Arena of Annihilation.', 81144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of the Crypt of Forgotten Kings.', 'Tell me of the Crypt of Forgotten Kings.', 81143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of Unga Ingoo.', 'Tell me of Unga Ingoo.', 81142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me of Greenstone Village.', 'Tell me of Greenstone Village.', 81141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tales I have to tell are still yours to experience! Go forth and adventure!$b$b(You must be at least level 50 to hear Fu\'s stories.)', 'The tales I have to tell are still yours to experience! Go forth and adventure!$b$b(You must be at least level 50 to hear Fu\'s stories.)', 81140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, traveler. This land has seen hard times of late, but also great heroism. Would you like to walk in the steps of these brave adventurers and witness their deeds?', '', 81139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Furnace pressure is out of control - the Heart of the Mountain starts gaining more heat!', 'Furnace pressure is out of control - the Heart of the Mountain starts gaining more heat!', 81138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get going! Commander, we\'ll meet ye at the tower.', '', 81137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought! We will meet you just up ahead!', '', 81136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to return to the Jorune Mine.', 'I am ready to return to the Jorune Mine.', 81135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to confront Kaelynara.', 'I am ready to confront Kaelynara.', 81134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\' be freezin\' on me now. Stay warm!', '', 81133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jus\' stay close to da fire. Wyverns ain\'t be made for such cold. Jus\' stay warm.', '', 81132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stop the rest!', '', 81131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Jus\' stay warm. It be okay. Ya gonna be fine.', '', 81130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stop the Frostwolf!', 'We will stop the Frostwolf!', 81129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Report to the front lines!', 'Report to the front lines!', 81128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let any more of them through!', 'Do not let any more of them through!', 81127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunderlord! To the front!', 'Thunderlord! To the front!', 81126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help. These brutes will have to try harder than that to beat us!', '', 81121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll head back to the front. For Auchindoun!', '', 81120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, girls. I won\'t let anything happen to you.', '', 81119, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back, you mongrels! You\'ll get out of here over my dead body!', '', 81118, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light is with us!', 81117, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not too late. Turn from this dark path and let us help you.', '', 81116, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The power of the Dark Star will be MINE!', '', 81115, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Footmen, to arms! We\'re damn sure not dying in Draenor today! To your posts!', '', 81114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunderlords, here?  Scout, ring the Call to Arms bell to get everyone inside!', '', 81113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rain? Now? This feels unnatural, and I bet I know who is behind it.', '', 81112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sir, Thunderlord Orcs are marching on the garrison!', 'Sir, Thunderlord Orcs are marching on the garrison!', 81111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Auchindoun will be mine. Every soul I consume grows my power. You face the wrath of a power greater than you can possibly imagine.', '', 81110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, hero! This beast must be stopped!', 81109, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah much better! Fits a bit loose but nothing a couple mugs o\' ale can\'t sort out.', '', 81108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows have already consumed my soul, prophet.', '', 81107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got issues, mon. Serious issues. What dat wolf ever do to you?', '', 81106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at dat tiny wolf, mon. There no way it can pull the whole sledge. Ya just bein\' mean.', '', 81105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya can\'t tie a wolf to dat sledge, mon. Dem Frostwolf orcs gonna kill you for dat if dey be findin\' out.', '', 81104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no darkness light cannot pierce, Ner\'zhul!', '', 81103, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 45377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tagar, destroy the intruder! These souls are nearly mine!', '', 81102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your reign has come to an end, the infinite night begins. (Darkness comes!)', '', 81101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept the The Staff of Archmage Vargoth. (Garrison Follower)', 'Accept the The Staff of Archmage Vargoth. (Garrison Follower)', 81100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It baffles me to see so much that was once majestic and beautiful be reduced to the fel infested wasteland that is Outland.', '', 81099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know nothing of the power you meddle with, Mar\'gok. (It calls to us. We know! Its power will be ours!)', '', 81098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Add Kill Bar', '', 81097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breaking Lock', 'Breaking Lock', 81096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should never have gone into that forest. I... I don\'t know how I\'m going to get over this.', '', 81095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should never have gone into that forest. I... I don\'t know how I\'m going to get over this.', '', 81094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Riasa blinks through tears.> I feel terrible about what happened to Norana. She was my best friend!', 81093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Ankaa blinks through tears.> I feel terrible about what happened to Isaari. She was my best friend!', 81092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again, $n! Thank you again for your help back there.', '', 81091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again, $n! Could you please wait a minute?$B$BNorana should be back at any moment. We should thank you together.', '', 81090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
