('Not good!', 'Not good!', 81072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Down, ye filthy beast!', '', 81071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cower before me, you insolent mortals!', 81070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn in fel fire, you insignificant maggots!', 81069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve come to Talador at the request of Archmage Khadgar to assist the Auchenai against the Burning Legion. When I learned of the situation here at the mine I came to offer my aid.', 81068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those bodies don\'t look like they\'ve been laying there for long. Lets keep onward to that cave but keep ye eyes an ears open.', '', 81067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Claiming', 'Claiming', 81066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike their hearts!', 'Strike their hearts!', 81065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Timber!', '', 81064, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I told Liadrin that I would take care of this...situation. The last thing the Sunsworn want right now is to lose the trust of the Auchenai.', '', 81063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mind control device is sitting on the table.', 'A mind control device is sitting on the table.', 81062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nyami. Tuulani. We ride for Light\'s Rest immediately.', '', 81061, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 44602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will not stop here. They desire Auchindoun too much.', '', 81060, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 44600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:156479|h[Massive Demolition]|h|r killed you.  Move away from the impact point to decrease damage taken.', '', 81059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh... I don\'t feel so good...', 'Oooh... I don\'t feel so good...', 81058, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teron\'gor! The Light comes for you!', 81057, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 45719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Legion won\'t give up so easily. Auchindoun is too valuable to them.', 81056, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 45717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to dust.', '', 81055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweet release...', '', 81054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At... last... freedom.', '', 81053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My enslavement... is over.', '', 81052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today we fulfill our eternal oath. We will protect Auchindoun with our lives!', '', 81051, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will stand by you, Exarch. No demon will set foot in Auchindoun on my watch.', 81050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must recover Karab\'uun at all costs. March forward the moment you see a hole in their lines!', 81049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are sworn to Auchindoun\'s protection. Keep up the defenses!', 81048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 47218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you already know, arcane crystals are an important part of Draenei culture. The crystals from this mine are used in many places, but are mostly supplied to Shattrath and Auchindoun.$b$bWhen treated with care these crystals can be powerful sources of arcane energy. Attempting to unleash the energy from a crystal this size is reckless and foolhardy.$b$bThe earth elementals you see rampaging throughout the mine typically slumber far beneath the ground. It appears as though Kaelynara\'s tampering has enraged them.$b$bMy vindicators will be successful in reclaiming the mine, but the battle will be hard fought.', '', 81047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The defenses will not falter. We are Auchindoun\'s protectors!', 81046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 47217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t give up, soulbinders. Auchindoun must be protected!', 81045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 47216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Concentrate, sisters! We must maintain Auchindoun\'s defenses.', 81044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 47215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this place?', 'What can you tell me about this place?', 81043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go! Win us a great victory. Tell my husband I will defend the town until he returns.', 81042, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 41804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ga\'nar did not wait for the muster call. His blood burns too hot.', 81041, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 41803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Legion will rise! Draenor will be bathed in hellfire!', '', 81040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come here, hero! I need your help!', '', 81039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Draenei brothers and sisters of the Alliance warned us of the Blood Elves\' lust for magical power. If such is the cost of their aid against the Burning Legion, I will gladly fight the demons alone.', '', 81038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Jorune Mine provides many of the crystals used to power Auchindoun and Shattrath.', 81037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Reinformcement Killed', '', 81036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is one of the totems that Borgal used to channel his magic before he unearthed the Soulgrinder. $b$bI sense there is still quite a bit of spiritual power emanating from it. If we can find the rest of his totems I can use them to eject Borgal out of the Spirit world. Once he has been cut off from the power of this plane you and Owynn should be able to end him.', 81035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found this totem, can you tell me anything about it?', 'I found this totem, can you tell me anything about it?', 81034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Borgal\'s death is only a matter of time, and time is something I have plenty of.', 81033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Durotan\'s goal. He will not ask for it, but we will need your help!', '', 81032, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If our people are to have any hope to survive, we must rout the ogres from their stronghold.', '', 81031, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bladespire Citadel. Once a far-flung outpost of the ogre empire.', '', 81030, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is THAT? I see a fortress of stone!', '', 81029, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes! I worry about Durotan\'s brother. Always quick to fight. His need for vengeance will make him more reckless than ever.', '', 81028, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar seemed bent on dealing out retribution to both.', '', 81027, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan walks a cliff\'s edge, pinned between the Thunderlord orcs and Bladespire ogres.', '', 81026, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wor\'gol is the winter home of the Frostwolf Clan.', '', 81025, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead us to Durotan, old friend.', '', 81024, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this -- Wise-ear! You are alive!', '', 81023, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repel the invaders!', 'Repel the invaders!', 81022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', 'Die!', 81021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give my life for my home!', 'I give my life for my home!', 81020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To honor our fallen!', 'To honor our fallen!', 81019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lust for power has overcome you, Kaelynara. I will not allow you to destroy this mine!', '', 81018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must stop this madness Kaelynara! Look around at the destruction you are causing!', 81017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Enemy Killed', '', 81016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never take our homes!', 'You will never take our homes!', 81015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How naive you are. This place is nothing but a shell, a husk, to be torn and discarded from the fruit of power that I shall devour!', 81014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such power...such potential. The latent energy within this crystal shall go to waste no longer!', 81013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, I can only channel this barrier for a short time. You must defeat Kaelynara before it is too late!', '$p, I can only channel this barrier for a short time. You must defeat Kaelynara before it is too late!', 81012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! It was not supposed to happen...this way...', 81011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! Once I dispose of you interlopers nothing will stand in my way!', 81010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fools! I will make you pay for this interruption!', 81009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_rapidregeneration.blp:20|t Admiral Gar\'an looks towards you and readies |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156626|h[Rapid Fire]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_rapidregeneration.blp:20|t Admiral Gar\'an looks towards you and readies |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156626|h[Rapid Fire]|h|r!', 81008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nearby hatchlings try to skitter away...', 'The nearby hatchlings try to skitter away...', 81007, 0, 25099, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She makes a good argument. Honestly boss, I think we should give her a shot. We might need her help.', '', 81006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Omnuron, step up our operation in Gorgrond. Whatever the Iron Horde are planning, I want to be ready.', '', 81005, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah yeah, okay, one little sacking.', '', 81004, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 47507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasn\'t it recently sacked?', '', 81003, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar! The impenetrable fortress!', '', 81002, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 47506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe, here, oversaw the construction of Orgrimmar.', '', 81001, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... You\'re entrusting a goblin to be your foreman?', '', 81000, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody call for a fixer?', '', 80999, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 47505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The very best.', '', 80998, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can open up a portal to Orgrimmar only briefly. Reinforcements are standing by, I hope?', '', 80997, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This terrain is ideal for a stronghold.', '', 80996, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not fear the snow and ice. Use it. If you are wounded you can quickly slow the damage until you get help from a healer. Embrace the cold and you survive.', 'Do not fear the snow and ice. Use it. If you are wounded you can quickly slow the damage until you get help from a healer. Embrace the cold and you survive.', 80995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I have Borgal to thank for this... this state I\'m in. I want to see his spirit flayed for what he\'s done to me and all of the others who he has murdered. Is that reason enough to believe me?', 80994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at me, isn\'t my reason obvious? I\'m dead! My body is rotted and gone! I used to go climb the mountains and watch the sunrise in the morning. Now I\'m doomed to not know the warmth of daylight ever again.', 80993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When dealing with Thunderlord, it is vital to reduce their numbers quickly. In a group they are lethal. Individually you can squash them like the bugs they are.', 'When dealing with Thunderlord, it is vital to reduce their numbers quickly. In a group they are lethal. Individually you can squash them like the bugs they are.', 80992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunderlord hunt in packs and prefer large prey. Are you large prey?', 'Thunderlord hunt in packs and prefer large prey. Are you large prey?', 80991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have strength on your side, but the cold will sap that from you in the first few seconds of combat. Stay warm if you want to stay alive.', 'You may have strength on your side, but the cold will sap that from you in the first few seconds of combat. Stay warm if you want to stay alive.', 80990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell like something the Thunderlord would hunt.', 'You smell like something the Thunderlord would hunt.', 80989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $p. At least you have the stomach for my research. With the peace treaty under way in Azeroth I find I am in need of fresh corpses.$b$bFortunately, you seem to leave plenty in your wake.', '', 80988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I clearly underestimated the size of the bones one can find here. I will need a larger hacksaw, and a few of those wolf sleds, and maybe a few extra wolves for resear... er... labor. Yes, labor.', '', 80987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get it. How you be gettin\' fire and ice in da same place at da same time?', '', 80986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell like yeti. Dis pleases me.', '', 80985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat fur really be workin\' mon.', '', 80984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be warmer now! I can think a full thought again wit\'out swearin\' at da cold.', '', 80983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ma breath just froze in front of me. It fell like ice to da ground. I hate dis place.', '', 80982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who in charge thought island trolls be good for a frozen land war?', '', 80981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh mon. Eh. I dare ya to lick the metal. Do eet!', '', 80980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried to have a drink from me flask earlier. It froze just after it hit me tongue. Took two orcs to pry it off. Dey ain\'t happy \'bout that.', '', 80979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How they not be tellin\' us this be a frozen wasteland. Even da fire be frozen. How can fire be frozen?', '', 80978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya mon. These furs be lettin\' me legs thaw. I can feel my toes again.', '', 80977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be so cold I can feel me mojo freezin\'. Dis not what I signed up for.', '', 80976, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! THE LEGION WILL CONSUME ALL!', '', 80975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shard is mine. The portal will grow!', '', 80974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those poor people! Hurry $Glad:lass;, we got to get rid of Grubnor then follow Borgal through that portal to... wherever the blazes it goes!', '', 80973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 80972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay let\'s do this! Borgal\'s been having prisoners delivered to a cave on the other side of the lava flows.', '', 80971, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should destroy it.', '', 80970, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It reeks of hatred and dust, Omnuron. I don\'t like this.', 80969, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you make of it, Yrel?', '', 80968, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope.', '', 80967, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saddle up maggot, you\'re going for a ride!', 80965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m gonna rearrange your nuts and bolts!', 80964, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eh, boss-mon. We gonna be needin\' a lot more furs. No one told us how cold it be on dis side of the portal before we stepped through.', 80963, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flesh is macerated almost beyond recognition.', 'The flesh is macerated almost beyond recognition.', 80962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mangled body is scored by deep claw marks.', 'The mangled body is scored by deep claw marks.', 80961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Half of this orc\'s body was seared away by a steam fissure.', 'Half of this orc\'s body was seared away by a steam fissure.', 80960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orc\'s face has been chewed off.', 'The orc\'s face has been chewed off.', 80959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem we need to rely on the local rylak for air travel.', 'It would seem we need to rely on the local rylak for air travel.', 80958, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are going to have to find a better way to shield our wyvern from the cold.', 'We are going to have to find a better way to shield our wyvern from the cold.', 80957, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks as though we will not have allies in the skies for this one.', 'It looks as though we will not have allies in the skies for this one.', 80956, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even our wyverns are not prepared for this type of cold.', 'Even our wyverns are not prepared for this type of cold.', 80955, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will crush you just the same!', 'We will crush you just the same!', 80954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s another come to die.', 'Here\'s another come to die.', 80953, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot save them!', 'You cannot save them!', 80952, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weak deserve this!', 'The weak deserve this!', 80951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 3 End', '', 80950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 2 End', '', 80949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 1 End', '', 80948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 3 Begin', '', 80947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 2 Begin', '', 80946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrison - Event - Orc Attack Stage 1 Begin', '', 80945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any Thunderlord get in here, we\'ll carve them up!', 'Any Thunderlord get in here, we\'ll carve them up!', 80944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, little ones. We\'ll make it through this.', 'Don\'t worry, little ones. We\'ll make it through this.', 80943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have perished without your aid. You have my gratitude!', 'I would have perished without your aid. You have my gratitude!', 80942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Iron Wolf!', 'For the Iron Wolf!', 80941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fallen demand vengeance!', 'Our fallen demand vengeance!', 80940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please help the others...I\'ll try to make it out on my own.', 'Please help the others...I\'ll try to make it out on my own.', 80939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have surely died. Thank you, Hero.', 'I would have surely died. Thank you, Hero.', 80938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should we trust ye?', '', 80937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That fat ogre needs to pay for the suffering he caused! Maybe we can work together? If you help me out, I\'ll be able to help you track down Borgal.', 80936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honestly boss, I\'m a wee bit out o\' me element here. I think we should give her a shot. We might need her help.', '', 80935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, chieftain. We will establish a foothold immediately.', '', 80934, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Frostwolf territory, but you may claim this plateau as your own. Consider it a reward for rescuing my people.', '', 80933, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, hold your weapons! I mean you no harm. I just needed to make sure you\'re not here with Borgal. From the way you two look, I don\'t think you\'re going to be on friendly terms when you catch up to him.', 80932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks! I think I can make it out on my own.', 'My thanks! I think I can make it out on my own.', 80931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mine began to quake and then the creatures appeared...', 'The mine began to quake and then the creatures appeared...', 80930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought my life was over! My thanks to you.', 'I thought my life was over! My thanks to you.', 80929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing.', '', 80928, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what are you supposed to be?', '', 80927, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t stop us!', 'You can\'t stop us!', 80926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold up, I sense we\'re not alone in here. Come out peacefully before I have to flush ye out! Show yourself!', '', 80925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This belongs to the Thunderlord now!', 'This belongs to the Thunderlord now!', 80924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take from the weak!', 'Take from the weak!', 80923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Just try and stop us!', 'Ha! Just try and stop us!', 80922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, now... that thing shatters and we\'re toast.', '', 80921, 0, 0, 430, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That stuff makes an awesome lubricant. You know, for engines.', '', 80920, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up ya go!', '', 80919, 0, 0, 70, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choluna, step up our operation in Gorgrond. Whatever the Iron Horde are planning, I want to be ready.', '', 80918, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps. First, we must find out what purpose it serves for Blackhand.', '', 80917, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should destroy it.', '', 80916, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like it even less in the hands of the Iron Horde.', '', 80915, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It reeks of hatred and dust, Choluna. I don\'t like having it here at the garrison.', '', 80914, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you make of it, Thrall?', 80913, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Connecting Rocket Chicken', 'Connecting Rocket Chicken', 80912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, not a chance. Light it up!', 'Ha, not a chance. Light it up!', 80911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never bow to you!', 'We will never bow to you!', 80910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them!', 'Kill them!', 80909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill it with arrows.', '', 80908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolf are weak!', '', 80907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wolf cannot help you now!', '', 80906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch!', '', 80905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t get away with this!', 'You won\'t get away with this!', 80904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderlord are the strongest!', 'The Thunderlord are the strongest!', 80903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your clan is no match for us!', 'Your clan is no match for us!', 80902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not give up...', 'I will not give up...', 80901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this one day.', 'You will pay for this one day.', 80900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will take everything!', 'We will take everything!', 80899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Let us live!', 'Please! Let us live!', 80898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will burn your homes to the ground!', 'We will burn your homes to the ground!', 80897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are home.', '', 80896, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got you!', 80895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Axes down, brothers! Don\'t you recognize your own clan?', '', 80890, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get back here! You are not free to go!', 80889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, Soulgrinder! Devour the souls that we have brought for you!', '', 80888, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Foolish creature! Return to me!', 80887, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for this.', 80886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stupid Beast! Your training is not done!', 80885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got birds in the air all over Gorgrond. If Blackhand so much as visits an outhouse, I want to know about it.', 80884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the fuel, Gazlowe. After my great escape, maybe I\'ll pay you a visit and show you how I did it.', '', 80883, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must return to the spirit world to continue my research. Guard this room and make sure that NO ONE touches the portal!', '', 80881, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay! We unstoppable! We unstoppable!', '', 80880, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to loiter. What do you like to do?', 'I like to loiter. What do you like to do?', 80879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('we both like to loiter2', 'we both like to loiter2', 80878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('we both like to loiter', 'we both like to loiter', 80877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a lumberjack. you\'re the boss.', 'I\'m a lumberjack. you\'re the boss.', 80876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a lumberjack. How\'s the guarding?', 'I\'m a lumberjack. How\'s the guarding?', 80875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not understand... You cannot know...', '', 80874, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 41917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the way of things. You cannot stop it.', '', 80873, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 41916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defy the Great Work.', '', 80872, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 41915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not understand the Great Work.', '', 80871, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 41914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Looks like there\'s only one way out, hero. UP!', 80870, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The others will follow. The Legion will rise!', 'The others will follow. The Legion will rise!', 80869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here!', 80868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up this way, $n!', 80867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! The cavern is unstable. Let\'s get out of here. Follow me!', 80866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this what the Iron Horde were after?', 80865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... I feel a tremendous power. It\'s coming from the back of the cavern!', 80864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a fearsome creature. Well done, champion.', 80863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold a moment $Glad:lass;, keep quiet and come over here.', '', 80862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! We dwarves prefer to blast the OTHER guy to smithereens - not ourselves. I\'ll leave that to the goblin engineers.', '', 80861, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $n! This must be the chamber they were looking for.', 80860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You turned into some kinda hero, huh? Alright, suit yourself. Here.', '', 80859, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t leave with my work still in the hands of the Iron Horde. I\'ve got a plan to make things right, if ye can spot me a can of yer famous rocket fuel...', '', 80858, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you better use it to die in a blaze o\' glory!', '', 80857, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gazlowe! Listen, they forced me to build a drill-', '', 80856, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drill ain\'t a problem no more. You ready to get outta here?', '', 80855, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo, Darkanvil! Nice digs you got here - I\'d prefer fewer bloodthirsty orcish warmongers, but whatever turns your crank I guess.', '', 80854, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhh... Yes, now the Soulgrinder hums with power! With this, we shall be unstoppable!', '', 80853, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush, you idiot!', '', 80852, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, their wretched spirits will serve me better than their weak bodies ever could!', '', 80851, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De slaves are ready for ye boss.', '', 80850, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please open a portal to Azeroth, Khadgar.', 'Please open a portal to Azeroth, Khadgar.', 80849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The threat on Draenor is one that impacts us all. I am glad that at least a few of you have agreed to work together against such great odds.', '', 80848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah-HAH! This one\'s signed \"DA\" with an anvil-shaped box around the letters. Now THAT\'s a mark I recognize.', '', 80847, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was mass-produced at the foundry in Gorgrond. Looks like they ship some of the parts in and assemble them here.', '', 80846, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm, no mark on this one.', '', 80845, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s signed \"Uratok\" ...with a backwards \"r.\" Something tells me that\'s not who we\'re lookin\' for.', '', 80844, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nah... this is junk.', '', 80843, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shopping\'s my thing. What\'s yours?', 'Shopping\'s my thing. What\'s yours?', 80842, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like shopping. You like loitering.', 'I like shopping. You like loitering.', 80841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to shop and you like to loiter', 'I like to shop and you like to loiter', 80840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho\'gall?! Traitorous scum - I knew you were behind this!', '', 80835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its power grows beyond comprehension!', '', 80834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards, remove these peasants.', '', 80833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Long have the Sorcerer Kings guarded these chambers. Today you will see our secret power.', '', 80832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My activator is $n.', 'My activator is $n.', 80831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its energy overflows! Soon it will be unleashed!', '', 80830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such power! It takes form to destroy you!', '', 80829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King\'s guard, to my side! I must focus my power and awaken the stone!', '', 80828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have seen but a fraction of my power. Behold the ancient magics unearthed by my empire!', '', 80827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish this was a beer barrel...', '', 80826, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The key to avoiding detection is to never be detected.', '', 80825, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope your disguise is as good as mine, Adele.', '', 80824, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait...what is this...termites!?', '', 80823, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to know who came up with the phrase \"barrel of fun\", because I think I picked the wrong one.', '', 80822, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess it could be worse...I could be in an outhouse.', '', 80821, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Superlative work, $p! The Iron Horde operation in Grommar has been sufficiently attenuated thanks to your efforts!', '', 80820, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Cauldron is just up ahead.', 80819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know what this battleship needs, $p? Explosions!', '', 80818, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in range of the fortress, $p! Explode them!', '', 80817, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The second tower is in range! Hit the detonator!', '', 80816, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower is within range, $p! Use the detonator!', '', 80815, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hop on $p!', '', 80814, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Cragplume Cauldron.', 'Take me to Cragplume Cauldron.', 80813, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have never before seen such a large network of steam vents and craters. What a fascinating place to study!', 80812, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde cannot hide from our sharp eyes.', 80811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Barrels are the operative\'s perfect disguise. Nobody ever suspects a barrel...', '', 80810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borgal! Get back here, you murdering son of a trogg!', '', 80809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My trusty wrist-mounted, gnomatic cloaking device allows me to repair my gyrocopter unseen. An ingenious device if I do say so myself!', '', 80804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde should never be underestimated, $n. Although they wield weaponry and sizeable forces that are worthy of respect, it is their unwavering persistence that must never go unchecked.', 80803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve always had a fascination for blending in with the locals, but the inside of this Iron Horde armor smells awful. Maybe they\'d be less angry if they took a bath once in a while...', 80802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are. What is this place?', 80801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hang on tight, $n.', 80800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, speak to Choluna. Let\'s go investigate this... Cragplume Cauldron.', 80799, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our power is too great for the likes of you.', 'Our power is too great for the likes of you.', 80798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!', 'DIE!', 80797, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... am... LEGION!', 'I... am... LEGION!', 80796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
