('You want a burger, $p?', '', 80634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meat still looks too rare...', '', 80633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother?', 80632, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll sneak into the camp. When you finish I\'ll meet you at the rendezvous point I marked on your map.', '', 80631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to my furnace? Where are my guards? Shut these intruders down!', '', 80630, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_ragnaros_lavabolt.blp:20|t %s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156928|h[Slag Eruption]|h|r!', '', 80629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_blackhand_demolition.blp:20|t %s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:156425|h[Demolition]|h|r!', '', 80628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Grommar when you\'re done! Nobody sinks my battleship and gets away with it!', '', 80627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You face your executioner, $r.', 80626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better not forget my good axe!', '', 80625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just before you kill them, let \'em scream. It\'ll make a better distraction.', '', 80624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
