('Location 07', 'Location 07', 80610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lava and snow', 'Lava and snow', 80609, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Primal forest', 'Primal forest', 80608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grassy plains', 'Grassy plains', 80607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once hunted Clefthooves for meat and skins, now I hunt Thunderlords for their heads. Not much of a difference really.', '', 80606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not rest till the Thunderlords are destroyed!', '', 80605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too many Frostwolves have died in this war.', '', 80604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick your second location.', '', 80603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadows...', 'Shadows...', 80602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A reddish-orange forest', 'A reddish-orange forest', 80601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A jagged landscape', 'A jagged landscape', 80600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wormhole is spinning really fast.  You\'ll have to jump first and hope for the best.', '', 80599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:157059|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r!', '', 80598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weak should know better than to test me!', '', 80597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disappoint me, I thought you\'d be tougher.', '', 80596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
