('And you... yes! You! Bow to your traitor king and DIE FOR YOUR INSOLENCE!!!', '', 80177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO SENT YOU HERE?! Deathbloom. Surely it was Deathbloom. CURSE YOU!', '', 80176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may find refuge here, traveler. A battle is always better after a good rest.', 'You may find refuge here, traveler. A battle is always better after a good rest.', 80175, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Few of the Frostwolves are willing to trade their goods this far east.', 80174, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt, little one. You have saved my people from an eternity of suffering.', '', 80173, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 45766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will help you defeat your enemies. We will repay our debt to you, tiny one.', '', 80172, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 45767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am FREE!', '', 80171, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 45765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 80170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Temporary cut-scene with my brother? Let\'s do it!', '', 80169, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our strength comes from working together.', '', 80168, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 45210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OUR - FATHER - would BE - ASHAMED - of WHAT - YOU\'VE - BECOME!', '', 80167, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your Chieftain; you and your warriors will fall back in line.', '', 80166, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 45205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel! We will spill some orcish blood...', '', 80165, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 44782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin\'s Quick Fix is ready to deploy!', 'Thaelin\'s Quick Fix is ready to deploy!', 80164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not need your precious key. We are... Legion...', '', 80163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Blackheart! Intruders are in the tomb!', '', 80161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cindermaw submerges and tunnels north.', '', 80152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend me! I must maintain the portal!', '', 80151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('% is overcome with the energy from the crystal.', '', 80150, 0, 24467, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cindermaw submerges and tunnels southeast.', '', 80149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde were merely testing us...', '', 80148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This forest is ours!', '', 80147, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Star\'s power flows through us! You will not stop us!', 'The Dark Star\'s power flows through us! You will not stop us!', 80146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Our work cannot be interrupted!', 'No! Our work cannot be interrupted!', 80145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This data...is shocking. What kind of monster would mutate their own people like this?', 80144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Iron Horde represents a clear and present danger to all that we hold dear on Draenor.', 80143, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fallen before...', '', 80142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 80141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You struggle against the inevitable.', '', 80140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attempt to stop me ends now!', '', 80139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all!', '', 80138, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul is mine!', '', 80137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vul\'gath will reward me well when I bring him your head!', '', 80136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostile in the camp!', '', 80135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just made the wrong choice!', '', 80134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder in the camp!', '', 80133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye gonna be hog food!', '', 80132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Frostwolf scum to feed my pet! Gutgore, attack!', '', 80131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! GUARDS!? Where are those worthless fools?', '', 80130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A beauty, isn\'t it? Now let\'s go cause some damage.', '', 80129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suit! Come to papa!', '', 80128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been workin\' on a little secret project whenever the guards are away.', '', 80127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this kind of thing common on your world?', 80126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did the orcs build such a monstrosity?', 80125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s got to be a weak spot - get behind it!', 80124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the light - what IS that thing!?', 80123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now it is time to drive them out of Shadowmoon once and for all.', '', 80122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'LAUGHING SKULL! LAUGHING SKULL! HAHAHAHAHA!', 80121, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LAUGHING SKULL! LAUGHING SKULL! HAHAHAHAHA!', '', 80120, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t have to do this, Yrel. Take the survivors and flee.', '', 80119, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 44814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Nightstalker keeps scratching at the rickety wooden barrier.>', '', 80118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, then! The prototype should be able to take us to Thaelin!', '', 80115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MMmmff! Mmffmf!!', '', 80114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet! What have you done to yourself!?', 80113, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do whatever you can to delay Ner\'zhul...', '', 80112, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, champion. I will get there as soon as I can.', '', 80111, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What needs to be done, child.', '', 80110, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must stop the Shadowmoon Chieftain.', '', 80109, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul\'s ritual... begins! We are out of time!', '', 80108, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light. Pure light. Hope in times of despair, brightness in our darkest hour!', '', 80107, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. I have always felt my fate and that of the Dark Star are intertwined.', '', 80106, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei will fall, and ALL will kneel before the void.', '', 80105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re destroying our city!', '', 80104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re being attacked!', '', 80103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul has given us power over the void!', '', 80102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul peered into the void, and it answered...', '', 80101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength through darkness.', '', 80100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void calls to us!', 'The Void calls to us!', 80099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood will feed the Dark Star...', 'Your blood will feed the Dark Star...', 80098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ritual will soon be complete. The Dark Star comes!', 'The ritual will soon be complete. The Dark Star comes!', 80097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul has shown us power in the darkness!', 'Ner\'zhul has shown us power in the darkness!', 80096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_stormearthfire.blp:20|t%s begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:155493|h[Firestorm]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_stormearthfire.blp:20|t%s begins to channel |cFFFF0404|Hspell:155493|h[Firestorm]|h|r!', 80095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet Velen will save us.', 80094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, $n!  I see Velen up ahead!', 80093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The prophet is just up ahead!', 80092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are just throwing their lives away!', 80091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are just throwing their lives away!', 80090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\item_summon_cinderwolf.blp:20|t%s summons|cFFFF0000 Cinder Wolves|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\item_summon_cinderwolf.blp:20|t%s summons|cFFFF0000 Cinder Wolves|r!', 80089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will our temple ever recover from being a war zone?', 80088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Problem solved.', 80087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I shudder to imagine the carnage outside of our walls.', 80086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are... brutal and direct. You have seen combat before.', 80085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose that works.', 80084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These orcs are forged of steel and fire. They never used to act this way.', 80083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will aid you as best I can.', 80082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your step, $n! He\'s burning everything in sight!', 80081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That must be their leader, up on the gardenhouse.', 80080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will turn our palace of light into some sort of... dark temple!', 80079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not trained for combat. I am no Vindicator!', 80078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once this is over, I hope to return to my studies.', 80077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought we would be safe here! Who would attack a temple?', 80076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fight heroically, $n.  You are an inspiration.', 80075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never expected to come back from the slave camps of Tanaan, only to see my home in flames.', 80074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was trained in this temple. I expected to spend my whole life here.', 80073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am no fighter, but I will do my best.', 80072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot sit back and watch Karabor burn, $n.  I am coming with you.', 80071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The podlings were saving these elekk to snack on later. If you wish, ride this one back to the outskirts of the forest.', 80070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The crystal that we came for is right over there, on the hill.', 80069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fenris Wolfbrother was once a Frostwolf, but his ambition and pride led him astray. He left the pack in search of personal glory, and fell in with our hated enemies.$B$BWho knows where my own reckless ways would have led me... where I\'d be now if you hadn\'t found me in Bladespire.$B$BAmbition and talent will grant you the power to take many lives. But the strength required to protect even one... that comes from somewhere else.$B$BThank you, $p.', 80068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for your help, $n. I\'ll report these findings back to Velen.', '', 80067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was the final crystal. See me atop Mount Teluuna - there is no time to lose!', '', 80066, 0, 24467, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only one crystal remains. We need all of their power if we are to succeed.', '', 80065, 0, 24466, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have located two of the four crystals. We must find the others before Ner\'zhul completes his ritual.', '', 80064, 0, 24464, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If he succeeds in bringing down the Dark Star, his clan - and his world - will suffer for his arrogance.', '', 80063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To do so, he\'s dabbling with terrible shadow magic he cannot possibly control.', '', 80062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul struggles to earn the trust of the Iron Horde.', '', 80061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was the final crystal. See me atop Mount Teluuna when your work is done, champion.', '', 80060, 0, 24467, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the first of four crystals. We must find the others!', '', 80059, 0, 24465, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The energy you gather is our only hope if we are forced to encounter the shadow of the Dark Star...', '', 80058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! This crystal has been lost to us for decades.', '', 80057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we must never, ever, forsake the light... Even should it consume us.', '', 80056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could not help but overhear. Maraad is right. Sometimes, we must give ourselves wholly to the cause.', '', 80055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prophet - are you okay?', 80054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust in the light to protect you - and if that fails, trust in yourself to do what must be done.', '', 80053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have learned the hard way, Yrel. You must fight for what you love, with every fiber of your being.', '', 80052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please find the prisoners, hero. My sister is among them. Were I a fighter, I could help you...', 80051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay your weapons. This must be the messenger the draenei prophet promised.', 80050, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread carefully, stranger.', 'Tread carefully, stranger.', 80049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt right there.', 'Halt right there.', 80048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43277, 43277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An outsider approaches.', 'An outsider approaches.', 80047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you lost, stranger?', 'Are you lost, stranger?', 80046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done good work here, champion. Now we only have three more crystals to find.', '', 80045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be okay. Thank you again for all of your help, $n.', 80044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear our arrival here has forever altered the fate of the Shadowmoon orcs.', '', 80043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sadly, the \"Dark Star\" Ner\'zhul spoke of also came with us.', '', 80042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n. These crystals fell from our vessel centuries ago when we first arrived on this world.', '', 80041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostwolves and Laughing Skulls? Working together? You orcs are more desperate than I suspected.', '', 80040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn burn burn burn torch and burn and cinder and burn and FIRE!', 80039, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders at the Blast Furnace have been eliminated. Throw their bodies into the furnace and return to your posts!', '', 80038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t take the heat? Get out of the furnace!', '', 80037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44398, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn this mountain unto ash!', '', 80036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fire is... Exting..uished.', '', 80035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn!', '', 80034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 80033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I consume all!', '', 80032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SUFFER!', '', 80031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My flames will lick the flesh from your bones!', '', 80030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drown in fire!', '', 80029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inferno!', '', 80028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will reduce you all to ashes!', '', 80027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freeeedommmmm!', '', 80026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The work of prophecy is difficult. Sight of the future is often clouded, and one must rely on instinct to discern what WILL come to pass, and what MIGHT come to pass.', 80025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, meet us at Twilight Glade. We must save the prisoners.', '', 80024, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 45395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do it, then.', 'Let\'s do it, then.', 80023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have pushed them back to their bastion.$b$bNow it is time to drive them out of Shadowmoon once and for all.', '', 80022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us leave this place. Yrel has already returned to Karabor, and wishes to speak to us both. [NYI - Shadowmoon Playtest Complete!]', '', 80016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, go! Cleanse that base!', '', 80015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But his light is within all of us now. Nothing can stop us.', 80014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
