('For Doomhammer!', 'For Doomhammer!', 79860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friends, be ready to move out. This hero is going to secure us an entrance in to that slave camp!', '', 79859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INCOMING! TAKE COVER!', '', 79858, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait, $n... I will come with you.', 79857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have to get to the other shards before it\'s too late.', 79856, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 43629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Emanation breaks free of its bonds!', '', 79855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s enough. We don\'t have the men to spare. We\'re staying here.', '', 79854, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Husband? It was his forces that killed your brother.', 79853, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always sentimental, Durotan. I am as loyal to my people as you are to yours. Do not presume that I walk this path willingly. Some things are more important than honor.', '', 79852, 0, 24372, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have not forgotten or forgiven that. But Orgrim was once an honorable orc, and my closest friend. I owe it to him to at least try to help him regain some of his honor.', '', 79851, 0, 24372, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Auchindoun is safe as long as it is kept sealed. We need to retrieve the fragments so my priests can protect them.', 79850, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 43630, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your hand, hero. I want him alive.', '', 79849, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Iron Horde murdered my brother, threatened my people, and deal in slaves and blood. You would have us work with that?', '', 79848, 0, 24360, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you mistake me for one of those weak creatures we have you fight in the arenas?', '', 79847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will bow before me as you beg for death.', '', 79846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrim Doomhammer! You will be made to answer for your attack on my people!', '', 79845, 0, 24360, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed, Soulbinder. We cannot risk leaving Auchindoun vulnerable even for a moment. We will stand our ground with what forces we have left.', '', 79844, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan? Draka? What are YOU doing here?', '', 79843, 0, 24360, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'gall, your guards are worthless. Dispose of this invader.', '', 79842, 0, 24360, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re saved! Thank you, hero.', 'We\'re saved! Thank you, hero.', 79841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is there no end to these orcs?', '', 79840, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thaelin, I want the Tank ready to go. Now!', '', 79839, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde\'s days are numbered.', '', 79838, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mercy for the likes of you.', '', 79837, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find these Iron Horde cowards. Give them the Light\'s justice.', '', 79836, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hansel! What\'s going on down there?!', '', 79835, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy coward.', '', 79834, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the best you can do?', '', 79833, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There were too many of them.', 'There were too many of them.', 79832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teron\'gor said... we would have the bodies... and he would eat the souls...', '', 79830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will use Auch\'naaru to enact your will, my lord!', '', 79829, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE IN THE NAME OF TERON\'GOR!', '', 79828, 0, 0, 53, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel my lord\'s power... coursing through my veins...', '', 79827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me fly like birdy? Me no have wings!', '', 79826, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But...me afraid of heights!', '', 79825, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis gonna be bad...', '', 79824, 1, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And while you\'re in there, get the main cannon firing again.', '', 79823, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There ya go.', '', 79822, 7, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, let me make some adjustments.', '', 79821, 7, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No excuses, Kor\'gall. We are at WAR with another world. Motivate your people, get a mining pick yourself, I do not care. You WILL meet your quota or find your clan the target of our next weapon test.', '', 79820, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am trying to divine Ner\'zhul\'s plans, but alas, I have nothing yet.', 79819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!!!', '', 79818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them through! Release the wolves!', '', 79817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, nelly, ain\'t she a big \'un? Ya need ta get back up there an\' tell Maraad.', '', 79816, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gunners, roll out! Don\'t let them into the hold!', '', 79815, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The intruders are here! Shadowmoon orcs, take your positions!', '', 79814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
