('Discovered Shamanstone: Blessing of the Wolf', 'Discovered Shamanstone: Blessing of the Wolf', 79794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m almost certain it\'s Yrel, but Maraad can\'t afford the distraction right now. If she\'s alive, we\'ll rescue her.', '', 79793, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '3...', 79792, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '2...', 79791, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '1...', 79790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emma was here recently. Follow her trail up the hill!', 'Emma was here recently. Follow her trail up the hill!', 79789, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh!!!!! Finish it! Just let me die!', '', 79788, 0, 24312, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those dirty bags of fur came out of nowhere!', 'How could this happen to me?!', 79787, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were going to eat me!', 'I thought I was done for! Thanks pal!', 79786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, friend! I\'ll let you buy me a drink back at the arena!', 'They took my coin purse too...got any gold I can borrow?', 79785, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks pal! I\'d offer you a reward but you don\'t seem like the type!', 'I never thought I would get out of here!', 79784, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were saving me for dessert!', 'Boy am I glad to see you!', 79783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the wolves have come to play with the skulls? I will speak with Durotan but I will not hold out hope. His wolves are soft and lack conviction.', 79782, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My heart aches with grief for the loss of my kin...', '', 79781, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain of this stake is nothing compared to that of my failure...', '', 79780, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'On behalf of the Frostwolf clan, I greet you, $c.', 79779, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 500, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan wishes for an alliance.', 'Durotan wishes for an alliance.', 79778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. And what are you supposed to be? Are you with the iron orcs? Shall we see if you burn as well as they do?', 79777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your health is low!$b$bThe Frostwolf healers are located behind the choke point.', 'Your health is low!$b$bThe Frostwolf healers are located behind the choke point.', 79776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_astralstorm.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:155105|h[Soul Storm]|h|r!', '', 79775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will make a perfect gift for Raa\'la. Thank you, $n. I\'ll meet you back at camp when I\'m done here.', '', 79773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not going back until I\'m finished here.', '', 79772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Krunk sent you huh? I was just finishing up. I\'ll see you back at camp.', 79771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill it, eat it, burn it!', '', 79770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Juicy innards, so fresh...', '', 79769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill it. It threatens the master!', '', 79768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teron\'gor comes for you, mortal...', '', 79767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal with these, insects!', '', 79766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. You are too late!', '', 79765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flowers?', '', 79764, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hate cooking duty. I should be out there hunting.', '', 79763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything but flowers!', '', 79762, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legends are true!', '', 79761, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this...', '', 79760, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not me! Not now!', '', 79759, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... no flowers...', '', 79758, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flowers?! Noooooo!', '', 79757, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? I must have passed out. I suppose a warm fire and hot meal with my family wouldn\'t be so bad.', '', 79756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness is my strength! With this power, the Shadowmoon will be conquerors!', '', 79755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Goliath Cannon will destroy all that you hold dear.', 79743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did you survive the Goliath Cannon?', 79742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pitiful weapons are useless against our Goliath Cannon!', 79741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wolf has been gutted and left to rot.', '', 79740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world will be ours, just as the Master foretold.', '', 79739, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master needs the key fragment. We will protect it until Lord Blackheart arrives!', '', 79738, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once Master Blackheart\'s portal is active, he will come to take the key to the Master.', '', 79737, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will secure our borders!', 'We will secure our borders!', 79736, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None escape the Void!', '', 79735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that right? Good job, Orac. You will make a fine hunter one day.', '', 79734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have seen it uncle! I had that filthy Saberon right where I wanted him.', '', 79733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last time I saw Orac, he was chasing Icepaw out the southern gates of Wor\'gol.', '', 79732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is he dead? I think he was saving me for later. Come on Icepaw, let\'s get out of here.', '', 79731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coming, $n?', '', 79730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me!', '', 79729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light bless you.', '', 79724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go, Exarch.', 'I\'m ready to go, Exarch.', 79723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, hero. Your world will be cast into shadow!', '', 79722, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Teron\'gor devours the souls within, the results would be catastrophic.', '', 79721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we must stop Teron\'gor and his Bonechewer allies from breaking into Auchindoun at all costs.', '', 79720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are not prepared to defend against an assault like this. Auchindoun is a mausoleum, not a fortress.', '', 79719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogres will suffer for what they\'ve done!', '', 79718, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If Teron\'gor devours the souls within, the results would be catastrophic.', 79717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can see. I can see the shift of the elements, the movement of the spirits through the land. It is glorious.', '', 79716, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Auchenai are not prepared to defend against an assault like this. Auchindoun is a mausoleum, not a fortress. They need our help.', 79715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has become one with the fury. Their spirits are now merged.', '', 79714, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drek\'Thar, what has it done to you?', 79713, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 41800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY SPIRIT... BURNS!', '', 79712, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you\'re here, $n. Our forces are stretched thin. I need someone I can count on.', 79711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There might be something. Exurotus, I offer my spirit as host to your own. Join with me, so that your fire may not be quenched.', '', 79710, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fury is dying. We don\'t have much time.', '', 79709, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 46375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There must be something you can do.', 79708, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I were stronger...', '', 79707, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exurotus is too weak. The most I can do is free him of his bonds. Death will claim him shortly afterward.', '', 79706, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have to stop Teron\'gor and his Bonechewer allies from breaking into Auchindoun at all costs.', 79705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go meet Durotan.', 'Let\'s go meet Durotan.', 79704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without you, I would still be in that jungle, or worse.', '', 79703, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will save my clan, even if I must forfeit the souls of my ancestors.', '', 79702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going on break.', 'Going on break.', 79701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Returning to job, infirmary.', 'Returning to job, infirmary.', 79700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light p-protect you...', '', 79699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lead it away from Drek\'Thar!', 79698, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('P-please... somebody... anybody...', '', 79697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work or me gonna bash yer skulls!', '', 79696, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Puny workers make me so ANGRY! RARGH!', '', 79695, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BWAAAR! Work harder filthy slave things!', '', 79694, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
