('Pack it yourself. I quit. I\'m going to find a job that doesn\'t involve being eaten by spiders.', '', 79545, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '*Sigh* It\'s so hard to find good help these days', 79544, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would be happy to join you and the caravan, $n. Start packing our stuff Greblin.', 79543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great... now I\'ve lost four assistants this week. Thanks, $n.', 79542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure I\'ll join you. As long as the money is good and you promise I won\'t get eaten by spiders.', '', 79541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This deal is getting worse all the time.', '', 79540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invite Greblin to join the caravan?', 'Invite Greblin to join the caravan?', 79539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fenris!', '', 79538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helga has no respect for me or any of her other assistants for that matter.$b$bAnd honsetly... the pay ain\'t all that hot.$b$bI think it\'s time I find a new employer.', '', 79537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Fenris?', '', 79536, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could have been a disaster? I gotta find a new line of work.', '', 79535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t thank you enough, $c. This could have been a real disaster.', 79534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, Warlord. It is over.', '', 79533, 0, 0, 397, 68, 0, 45240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'That\'s the third assistant I\'ve lost this week.', 79532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Iron Wolf\" indeed! A coward, hiding behind his minions.', '', 79531, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not for long.', '', 79530, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful, $n. I\'ll join you as soon as I can.', 79529, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this works. I\'m living paycheck to paycheck over here.', '', 79526, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I feel much better. Thank you, $c. Now listen carefully. We need your help.', 79525, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darksting Queen huh? Good luck with that. I\'ll be back here taking care of Helga if you need me.', '', 79524, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to do what with the eyeballs? That\'s just gross.', '', 79523, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would have read it myself, but it\'s not in my job description.', '', 79522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invisible bunnies? Sheesh... talk about crazy.', '', 79521, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helga was writing in her journal when she lost it. It\'s right over here.', '', 79520, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_chilltouch.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:154766|h[Summon Ancient Spirits]|h|r!', '', 79519, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So many spiders... So many bunnies...', 79518, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Am I alive? Who am I? Who are we? So much pain!', 79517, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$GHe:She;\'s coming to! $n, talk to me!', 79516, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Pale walk these lands at night. They have no morals. They attack children and the elderly without even a second thought.$b$bI will not let their horrible deeds go unpunished.', 79515, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invite Helga to join the caravan?', 'Invite Helga to join the caravan?', 79514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The barrier is down! Let us put an end to this.', '', 79513, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re going to be ok... I promise... just hang in there...', 79512, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely not. I\'m not going to lose you again.', '', 79511, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What about me? $p and I are a team!', 79510, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can\'t I ever catch a break?$b$bI figured tagging along with a Nesingwary was a surefire way to make some moolah.$b$bI should have stayed in Azeroth.', '', 79509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Helga has been like this ever since she returned to camp.$b$bShe was babbling something about needing a cure -- then she started eating dirt.$b$bI am not getting paid enough for this.', '', 79508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrupt Rune Conduits to weaken Gor\'ashan\'s defenses.', '', 79507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, I need you out there. There\'s no way we\'ll be able to fight them off without you.', '', 79506, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will forestall any counterattacks by the enemy. Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 79505, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will ride ahead. Frostwolves, hold the tower. Igrimar, with me!', '', 79504, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower is ours! Regroup and press on!', '', 79503, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of a boar beast. Beware its tusks... Charge!', '', 79502, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements approach. Attack!', '', 79501, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is joined. Lok-Narash!', '', 79500, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reading', '', 79499, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mixing', '', 79498, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So hungry.', 'So Hungry.', 79497, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bandage up those who can still walk! No orc of able body will be denied this fight.', '', 79496, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are hurt. Your flesh is pale.', '', 79495, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept the Blood Oath of Blademaster Na\'Shra. (Garrison Follower)', 'Accept the  Blood Oath of Blademaster Na\'Shra. (Garrison Follower)', 79492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have done me a great service. This blade is as much yours as it is mine.$b$bI offer you this blood oath: I shall serve your cause and lend my knowledge of blades and mining to your forces.$b$BWill you accept it?', 79491, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oops! Wrong wire. Watch out!', 79488, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You now stand before Na\'Shra! Weaponsmith of the Frostwolf Clan. For your service, I give you mine.', 79487, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\mocking_banner:20|t%s places a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:153799|h[Rallying Banner]|h|r to call nearby allies!', '', 79486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done! The blade is forged.', 79484, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits were kind to guide you to me at this moment.', 79483, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fomic ore is tougher than hardened steel. You will need my goren-toothed pick axe to cut through the rock.', 79482, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead us to Durotan, old friend!', '', 79481, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We leave now, and return to the pack. The Iron Wolf will answer to the full might of the Frostwolf clan.', 79480, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lokra... with you at my side, I feel invincible! Let us challenge the Iron Wolf right now and end this!', '', 79479, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight well, $p! With you here, the odds are stacked in our favor.', '', 79478, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visions! No!  You pay for interfering!', '', 79477, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan!', '', 79476, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mentioned the Frostwolf Chieftain...', '', 79475, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are! Wor\'gol, home of the Frostwolves.', '', 79474, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wise beyond his years, but still young. I fear he has been thrust into the Gronn\'s jaws - our people are in great danger.', '', 79473, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes. Garad\'s youngest: a noble soul named Durotan.', '', 79472, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I worry about Ga\'nar. Always quick to fight. His need for vengeance will make him more reckless than ever.', '', 79471, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes may not work, but the familiar chill of the air is comforting.', '', 79470, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wise-ear! You are alive!', '', 79469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friends, you have earned a hero\'s welcome. Follow us to the Frostwolf Chieftain.', '', 79468, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep the Iron Horde at bay!', 79467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bladespire Citadel! I will have my vengeance on those ogres, even if I have to tear it down stone by stone.', '', 79466, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bladespire ogres threw me into that hellhole. I\'ll notch my axe with their skulls until vengeance is mine!', '', 79465, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan, your brother has already rushed ahead.', '', 79464, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here - Gormaul Tower. This will be our foothold. Leave none alive! LOK\'TAR OGAR!', '', 79463, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He never listens. His ruthlessness may cost us.', '', 79462, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar is a great fighter, but he is impatient. He has taken some of our best warriors with him.', '', 79461, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight as one. We win this - together!', '', 79460, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will claim Bladespire Citadel as our own.', '', 79459, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors! Today the tide turns.', '', 79458, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Draka looks at Drek\'Thar, concerned.', 79457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come with me, shaman. Let me see your wounds.', 79456, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 41805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits will never abandon you, Drek\'Thar. This I can promise.', '', 79455, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel it. This land speaks to me, but in a language I do not yet understand.', '', 79454, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 46382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am still scarred by those infernal warlocks. The spirits are quiet.', '', 79453, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 46688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reach out to the Shamanstone. Embrace the wisdom of this land and the ancestors that came before us.', '', 79452, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, friends. If you wish to fight with our clan, we welcome you to receive our blessings.', '', 79451, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not need eyes to see it; they are noble of heart. They saved our kin -- including your brother.', '', 79450, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are champions from a faraway realm, pledged to fight the Iron Horde.', '', 79449, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can barely stand. But for the actions of these heroes, I would be dead.', '', 79448, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 46689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, strangers. You have earned the trust of our shaman. I will not turn away the help.', '', 79447, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Yes. Ga\'nar is already causing trouble.', '', 79446, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your eyes don\'t work, shaman, but this one has green skin.', '', 79445, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who? These strangers you\'ve brought?', '', 79444, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drek\'Thar, old friend, you\'re alive!', '', 79443, 0, 31541, 396, 68, 0, 45256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visions this mushroom has given.  Truth told!', '', 79442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wash in holy spores.  Feel might of mushroom!', '', 79441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mushroom show future.  Believe!', '', 79440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like this is the bowl Helga was going to use to create a cure.', '', 79439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were hunting a large pale orc when the spiders attacked.$b$bI lost my assistant Ganky in the chaos. I was bitten countless times as I ran.$b$bThe spider bites are affecting my ability to think straight. I need to create a cure quickly before my mind escapes me.', '', 79438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing worthwhile ever is.', 79437, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 41802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please bring her back, $n. She\'s the only family I have left.', '', 79436, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is up to you, champion. I will stay here and help with the wounded slaves you rescued.', '', 79435, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your wits about you. Some of the refugees reported seeing a plant hydra in the forest near the podling den to the west.', '', 79434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My torment is over!', 79433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you!', 79432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m free!', 79431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before me!', '', 79429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your undying souls will fuel my ascension from the darkness!', '', 79428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will drown this world in shadows!', 79423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits are mine to command!', 79422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Return to this world!', 79421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your oath is unfinished!', 79420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shadows envelop you!', 79419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Too late... my Master... comes...', 79418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blissful afterlife is over.', '', 79417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will coil your souls into darkness!', 79416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 43636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WEEE wee wee!', '', 79415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 79414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we have today?', 'What do we have today?', 79413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe this?', 'Can you believe this?', 79412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maraad says his injury is not serious, but in truth, he was gravely wounded by Ner\'zhul. Though I am not sure which suffered greater ill - his body or his pride.$B$BNevertheless, he was very lucky you showed up when you did.', 79411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For many years, the Shadowmoon Clan and the draenei of Karabor have lived in relative peace.$B$BThings began to change after this... Iron Horde... arrived.', 79410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Samaara is the only family that I have. As long as I can remember, she has taken care of me.$B$BShe is good and kind, whereas I am... not as convicted.', 79409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was barely a scratch! I should recover quickly.', '', 79408, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse him!', '', 79407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry the light, brothers and sisters!', '', 79406, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Sniff*', '*Sniff*', 79405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather your strength!', '', 79404, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give up!', '', 79403, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fortress will fall.', '', 79402, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolves will triumph.', '', 79401, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press the attack!', '', 79400, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to join the attack against the Iron Horde.', 'I am ready to join the attack against the Iron Horde.', 79399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dulcet chiming tones reverberate within your mind.>', '', 79398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dorogg has fallen! Stay close, Frostwolves - the citadel is not yet ours.', '', 79397, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Velen\'s sacrifice means nothing if the temple falls.', 79396, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 45607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s wipes away a tear.', 79395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel! The defense crystal is broken. The Iron Horde have overrun Karabor. We\'d need a miracle to break through.', '', 79394, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 44813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I can\'t believe he\'s gone...', 79393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s lost blood.', 'This one\'s lost blood.', 79392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, defend me while I destroy the barrier!', '', 79391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must breach the inner chamber. Kilrogg cannot get away with this!', '', 79390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time to waste! We strike NOW!', '', 79389, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Bladespire! Attack!', '', 79388, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 44069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were fools to come here. I will rip the souls from your bodies and raise the Colossal to crush your feeble clan!', '', 79387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... that mutt... <cough> is being broken... with the other beasts.', '', 79386, 0, 23991, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kilrogg! I should have known you were behind this.', '', 79385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The might of my ancestors flows through me!', 79384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can bring it down but I need time to harness the elements.', '', 79383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay away from me! Stay away! I\'ll kill you! I\'ll kill you all!', 79382, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m crazy!', '', 79381, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on ahead. Durotan awaits. I must catch my breath.', '', 79380, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems the elements of Draenor do not respond to me as they do on Azeroth...', '', 79379, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 47062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have driven the Iron Horde back, $p, but the inner chamber remains sealed.', '', 79378, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back!', '', 79377, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb my research!', '', 79376, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 43920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think me defeated so easily?', '', 79375, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar!', 'Lok\'tar!', 79374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar, $p!', '', 79373, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. I hope Princess Greymane can find the cure soon. It has be out here somewhere.', 79372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi. See you later!', 'Hi. See you later!', 79371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, you!', 'Hi, you!', 79370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('U\'luut thanks you for saving him and the forests of Shadowmoon Valley.', '', 79369, 0, 0, 377, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I don\'t feel well.', 79368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t remember much. Just a spirit... of pure rage. It called to me.', 79367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, $c. Wreak havoc. Impose justice on those who so thoroughly deserve it!', '', 79366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hemma, we\'re here. Are you alright?', 79365, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lost control. You\'re on a hilltop near camp.', 'You lost control. You\'re on a hilltop near camp.', 79364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wh - where am I? Where is the spirit?', 79363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Coward! Release Karg and face me!', 79362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, that\'s the stuff...', 'Ah, that\'s the stuff...', 79361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This talbuk has been ripped to pieces by Hemma. She must be close by.', '', 79360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, drink this. How are you feeling?', 'Here, drink this. How are you feeling?', 79359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m losing control... please, help...', 79358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, you\'re the fastest one here. Track Hemma down and try to get her under control. We\'ll catch up!', 79357, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hemma! Please, wait! Control yourself!', 79356, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HUNGRY!!!', 79355, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'HnnGYAAHH!!', 79354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Asha?! Asha, NO!!', 79353, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I feel...', 79352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free yourself of weakness, or be swept away by the Iron Tide!', '', 79351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are fierce, pup, but your attachments make you weak!', '', 79350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No effect, Princess. We tried.', '', 79349, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hemma. Drink this. It\'ll help you feel better.', '', 79348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, Princess.', '', 79347, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here, $p. Give this potion to Hemma. It might help.', 79346, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hydrating.', 'Hydrating.', 79345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I refuse to remain in Darnassus any longer. There are people that need help.', 79344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Docking.', 'Docking.', 79343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready whenever you are.', 'I\'m ready whenever you are.', 79342, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Kadus. We have to try. There\'s too much at stake.', 79341, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a sip, be easy on her!', 79340, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Princess.', '', 79339, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are you feeling, Hemma?', 79338, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s too late for this one.', '', 79337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... what is that light?', '', 79336, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde are moving toward the Temple of Karabor. The attack has beg--', '', 79335, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reporting for duty.', 'Reporting for duty.', 79334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve called every able-bodied soldier to defend the city.$B$BStay stalwart, hero. This is the hour for courage.', '', 79333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to look this up.', 'I need to look this up.', 79332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never enough...', 'Never enough...', 79331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despicable. The Iron Wolf has no respect for beast or brother - they are all just weapons for the hunt.', '', 79330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar Ogar!', 'Lok\'tar Ogar!', 79329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check Crate.', 'Check Crate.', 79328, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect the Pool of Visions. Do not let them get to the Farseer.', 79327, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come down and face me, \"Iron Wolf\". I\'ll show you how a true wolf fights!', 79326, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will make Durotan proud this day!', 79325, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch for their warleader, Gargrak.', 79324, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They can only attack us when most of our clan is away. Kill these Thunderlord cowards.', 79323, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the south, now my brothers and sisters.', 79322, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch for Thunderlord from the ledge to the north.', 79321, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reinforcements to the east.', 79320, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorcerous coward.', 79319, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
