('Did you hear that?', '', 79260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron Horde, we have unwanted visitors!', '', 79259, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! We have intruders!', '', 79258, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need backup!', '', 79257, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up! We need to break free now! Look at that thing!', '', 79256, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Iron Tide comes for us because Durotan is strong and the Frostwolf would not join them.', '', 79255, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We kill you soon.', '', 79254, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to break free of these bonds. Hurry!', '', 79253, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ran as soon as I had a chance. Poor Laabru. I hope he is still alive.', 79252, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This.. this is horrible. What are we going to do?', 79251, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits are restless, Durotan.', '', 79250, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got enough blasting powder to wipe that gronn right off the face of Draenor. Just show me where to drop it.', '', 79249, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve given you some smoke grenades. Use these to help Thaelin target the Arkonite Protector.', '', 79248, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Healing.', 'Healing.', 79247, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
