('It appears the Shadowmoon clan is having difficulty integrating with the Iron Horde. This could play out in our favor.', '', 79245, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat you friends! Then eat you!', '', 79244, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little ones! Grow! Kill!', '', 79243, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No chance now!', '', 79242, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Army! Grow!', '', 79241, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See what you can dig up. If the Shadowmoon clan joins forces with the Iron Horde, I worry our darkest days are yet to come.', '', 79240, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
