('Korhol, Zhakta, Trokar... move in from all sides. Gargrak, hold for now.', '', 79234, 1, 0, 0, 68, 0, 41762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to your little village, Ner\'zhul.  You can watch the stars while the Iron Tide washes over you.', '', 79233, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
