('Savor this victory, mortal. Now that you\'ve heard our whispers, it is only a matter of time until you belong to us.', '', 79065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger!', '', 79064, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n? Great timing! I was just about to make my escape.', 79063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for coming to get me, $n.$B$BI must get back to Maraad.', 79062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YREL, MY LOVE!', '', 79061, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out, it\'s going to explode!', '', 79060, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MARAAD!', 79059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n. You have no idea how much this means. Let\'s get out of here.', 79058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pendant Maraad gave me. The ogre took it when he captured me.', 79057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ok\'mok is at the top of this giant tower. Let\'s go.', 79056, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s nice not being so naked. Let\'s find Ok\'mok and my pendant from Maraad.', 79055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Much better. Now I have something to fight with.', 79054, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think my armor\'s inside here.', 79053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great timing, $n! I was just about to make my escape. Where\'s Maraad?', 79052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My weapon is in this tower.', 79051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly! Stand within the healing soils to protect yourselves!', 79050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmph!', '', 79049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmph! Mmmmppphhhh!', '', 79048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmmmppphhhh!!!', '', 79047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I die, so do you!', '', 79046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warbringer Trosk and his siege weapon will fall this day!', '', 79045, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight to the last! We will not bow down to these brutes!', '', 79044, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure we tend to the wounded! They could launch a new attack at any moment!', '', 79043, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mongrels will learn to never set foot in our home again!', '', 79042, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gaining ground! Keep it up!', '', 79041, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly! Stop the ritual!', 79039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not of the chosen.', '', 79035, 0, 26739, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scour the room! Check every corner and shadow, and do not move the artifact until we can be certain it is safe.', '', 79034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But... my... training...', 79033, 0, 23792, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, a challenge.', 79032, 0, 23791, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pitiful skills are no match for my talents.', 79031, 0, 23791, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will use your bones to sharpen my blade.', 79030, 0, 23791, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spin in the maddening whorls of eternity!', '', 79029, 9, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I would idly wait while you stab pointlessly at me?', '', 79028, 9, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will collapse under the weight of your own madness...', '', 79027, 9, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Iskar. And now that you have become acquainted with the arakkoa, I wonder if you might aid me in subverting them.', '', 79026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fearlessly delving into the unknowable. Seeking answers in the dark...', '', 79025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I understand.', 'Now I understand.', 79024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have some brew for the Master Artificer?', 'Do you have some brew for the Master Artificer?', 79023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These draenei are funny lookin\', dontcha think?', '', 79022, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is some place al\'right.', '', 79021, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have Romuul\'s Wrench?', 'Do you have Romuul\'s Wrench?', 79020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have an Optical Disc?', 'Do you have an Optical Disc?', 79019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you need something fixed?', 79018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we were banished from the spires our wings were clipped. It was Skreek who had the idea to tame a mount. To fly on the back of a beast would be humiliating for most arakkoa. To my brother and me -- it was a chance to reclaim the skies.$b$bSkreek found Swiftshadow just a few days after we had been banished. She had fallen from her nest.$b$bMy brother and I raised her. We gave her shelter and food.$b$bSkreek taught her how to fly and in return Swiftshadow gave us back the gift of flight.', '', 79017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, I beg you, don\'t kill me!', '', 79016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing back here?$B$BGet to your work assignment before I squash you!', '', 79015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last chance, $n. Let me go unharmed and surrender now, or else!', '', 79001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s lazy and should be beaten. You get back to work, foreling!', '', 79000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you or your brother need a mount like Swiftshadow to fly?', 'Why would you or your brother need a mount like Swiftshadow to fly?', 78999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. You\'ll find her toiling away just down the hall.', '', 78998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to know where your friend is? Mine these rocks for me.', '', 78997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re alright for a $r. You can do my work for me anytime.', '', 78996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you bothering me? Can\'t you see I\'m on my break?', '', 78994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After being banished from the spires my older brother Skreek and I sought refuge.$b$bWe traveled a great distance on the back of Swiftshadow before the saberon shot us down not far from here. I can only assume they planned to eat us.', '', 78993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that, $n!', '', 78992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing in Gorgrond?', 'What are you doing in Gorgrond?', 78991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t if I were you!', '', 78990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killstripe? He\'s a saberon. They don\'t talk. Give up now, $n. I\'ll be lenient.', '', 78989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Muura is on the other side of the farm. Hurry!', 78988, 0, 23766, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Points to the mine and draws an image of a foreling in the dirt.', '', 78987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killstripe points at one of the ogres and makes a cutting motion in front of his throat.', '', 78986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These guys aren\'t so tough!', 78985, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Killstripe nods his approval.>', '', 78984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The saberon narrows his eyes, judging you.>', '', 78983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel? Is that the draenei woman they brought in yesterday?$B$BYeah, I don\'t know where she is, but Killstripe might.', '', 78982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killstripe might know. He\'s up the hill. Here, take this crate of rocks so you look like you\'re working.', '', 78981, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The two of you will never escape alive!', '', 78980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH! SOUND THE ALARM!', '', 78979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illona is on the other side of the farm. Hurry!', 78978, 0, 23767, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a light in these dark times, $p.', 78977, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mining', 'Mining', 78976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muura and Illona are further out. You\'ll need to cut through the Iron Horde\'s forces to get to them.', '', 78962, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<whispers>The first slave you should talk to is on the way to the quarry. Keep your head down and we\'ll be fine. Just don\'t let your ranger friend kill me.', '', 78961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up, slave! Get to your assignment!', '', 78960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold the line. Go find the others!', '', 78959, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to work!', '', 78956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster or it\'s the cooking pot for you!', '', 78955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re pathetic!', '', 78954, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An orc known as Warlord Zaela led the attack; assisting her were her Dragonmaw clan, a number of dragons, and a band of hired pirates.\n\nOnce Garrosh escaped, Zaela and the surviving Dragonmaw fled on dragon-back.\n\nThe pirates were abandoned but know nothing of Garrosh\'s whereabouts.', 'An orc known as Warlord Zaela led the attack; assisting her were her Dragonmaw clan, a number of dragons, and a band of hired pirates.\n\nOnce Garrosh escaped, Zaela and the surviving Dragonmaw fled on dragon-back.\n\nThe pirates were abandoned but know nothing of Garrosh\'s whereabouts.', 78951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the attack.', 'Tell me about the attack.', 78950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kairozdormu is one of the bronze dragonflight.\n\nHe was assisting in the trial, conjuring images of Garrosh\'s past atrocities.\n\nThere is no known link between Kairoz and Garrosh, and neither we nor the bronze dragonflight know why he aided the orc.', 'Kairozdormu is one of the bronze dragonflight.\n\nHe was assisting in the trial, conjuring images of Garrosh\'s past atrocities.\n\nThere is no known link between Kairoz and Garrosh, and neither we nor the bronze dragonflight know why he aided the orc.', 78949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Kairoz?', 'Who is Kairoz?', 78948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria\'s waterspeakers assure us that he has fled that land.\n\nBeyond that, we cannot say.', 'Pandaria\'s waterspeakers assure us that he has fled that land.\n\nBeyond that, we cannot say.', 78947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did Garrosh go?', 'Where did Garrosh go?', 78946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allies of Garrosh attacked the Temple of the White Tiger during his trial.\n\nIn the confusion, Kairoz -- a bronze dragon assisting with the proceedings -- betrayed us all and opened a magical portal through which both he and Garrosh fled.', 'Allies of Garrosh attacked the Temple of the White Tiger during his trial.\n\nIn the confusion, Kairoz -- a bronze dragon assisting with the proceedings -- betrayed us all and opened a magical portal through which both he and Garrosh fled.', 78945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened?', 'What happened?', 78944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t belong here, $pr. Get back to work!', '', 78943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you eyeballing me?!', '', 78942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, $pr, or it\'s the cooking pot for you!', '', 78941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder!', '', 78940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to get a beating if you don\'t move it!', '', 78939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see how you do when you don\'t have a machine of MY design at your disposal...', 78938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Is this |5$pr? Pathetic!', '', 78937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No slacking off!', '', 78936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $p! Meet us at the rendezvous. Time to see how to drive this beast.', 78935, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up, slave!', '', 78934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The murlocs flee in the face of Aku\'mai\'s wrath!', '', 78933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh Hellscream has escaped.\n\nIf you have any information regarding the war criminal\'s whereabouts, please inform your local authorities and any agent of the Shado-Pan you see.', 'Garrosh Hellscream has escaped.\n\nIf you have any information regarding the war criminal\'s whereabouts, please inform your local authorities and any agent of the Shado-Pan you see.', 78932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take refuge, my brethren. Ramtusk will protect the Kraul.', 78931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Roogug has failed us!', 78930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They killed Bonetusk... we must hold them off!', 78929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swiftshadow and I could not be more grateful for your actions today, $c.$b$bWe are in your debt.$b$bI\'ll meet up with you and the caravan after I am done burying my brother.', '', 78928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My bond with Swiftshadow is almost as important to me as the bond I share with my brother.', '', 78927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without Skreek and Swiftshadow I don\'t know how I will survive.$b$bMy brother has always taken care of me. If it wasn\'t for him I would have suffered a far worse fate than having my wings clipped.', '', 78926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invite Y\'kish?', '', 78925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The caravan I\'m traveling with could use some help. You seem like you would fit right in.', 'The caravan I\'m traveling with could use some help. You seem like you would fit right in.', 78924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is too large to bring with us. While the added firepower would be nice we still need to keep a low profile. He was not the only gronn in the Iron Horde arsenal.$b$bWe will probably leave him here for now. Those harnesses will keep him in place. Given how many orcs he has consumed, I have no problem leaving him here to starve for his crimes.', 78923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will happen to the gronn?', 'What will happen to the gronn?', 78922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Safe? No. But managable. Goc would eat us if he could but the Iron Horde succeeded in driving their devices into his brain in just the right way.$b$bHe can\'t move unless operated by a controller.$b$bJust hope none of those bolts loosen or we will have a giant problem on our hands.', 78921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the gronn safe?', 'Is the gronn safe?', 78920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armies have quaked before my coming. You will learn this, soon enough.', '', 78919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope for you. You should just line up in the order of fattest so that I might consume you more efficiently.', '', 78918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hunger. FEED ME!', '', 78917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Release me and I shall consider not slaying all of you.$b$BMaybe just those chuckling orcs over in the corner.$b$bEspecially the one that keeps stabbing me.', '', 78916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to eating your precious pack beast.$b$bAnd you. Do not forget that I will eat you as well!$b$bBut mostly I am looking forward to eating your pack beast.', '', 78915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You insignificant vermin cannot hold me forever.', '', 78914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice shot! Easy shot. But nice one! Now let\'s get out of here before they can launch a counter attack. Hold on to something!', 78913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p! Fire the main cannon and bring that tower down!', 78912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get in there you worthless $c and don\'t come out until either you or the raptor is dead!', '', 78911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re going after it?! Suit yourself. I am getting out of here!', 78910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s my girl. Now stay close to Papa. Let\'s go!', '', 78909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll try!', 78908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s stands up straight and puffs out her chest.', 78907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right! Can you be brave for me, Vindicator Melani?', '', 78906, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...they\'re brave.', 78905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what are vindicators like?', '', 78904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<sniff> <sniff> ... a vindicator.', 78903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you remember what you want to be when you grow up? Come now, you just told me this morning.', '', 78902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, lightning bug. But Papa needs you to be brave right now.', '', 78901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Papa, I\'m scared!', 78900, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have stayed in your cage. Now you will die like your brother!', '', 78899, 0, 23731, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s Swiftshadow! He\'s still alive!', '', 78898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have bought you all the time that I can, Death Speaker.', '', 78897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You struggle in vain.', '', 78896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
