('Chuume, I will see that your sons grow into fine young men. Your deeds will be honored, sister.', 'Chuume, I will see that your sons grow into fine young men. Your deeds will be honored, sister.', 78742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Navine is one of the many Anchorites who stayed near the frontlines. Her courage saved many lives today. Walk with the Light, brave one.', 'Navine is one of the many Anchorites who stayed near the frontlines. Her courage saved many lives today. Walk with the Light, brave one.', 78741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ranha, none could match your skill with the bow and arrow. Your aim was true to the end. Walk with the Light, brave one.', 'Ranha, none could match your skill with the bow and arrow. Your aim was true to the end. Walk with the Light, brave one.', 78740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safta and her husband both fought in the battle. Such courage in a pair so young. You walk with the Light now.', 'Safta and her husband both fought in the battle. Such courage in a pair so young. You walk with the Light now.', 78739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tavala, bright and talkative. Walk with the Light.', 'Tavala, bright and talkative. Walk with the Light.', 78738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unaa, swift of hoof. She could run from one end of the Valley to the other before sunset. Now, you run with the champions of Auchindoun.', 'Unaa, swift of hoof. She could run from one end of the Valley to the other before sunset. Now, you run with the champions of Auchindoun.', 78737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jeluuna, your passing is a great loss to us. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Jeluuna, your passing is a great loss to us. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78736, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feraan, lover of music. She used to sing me songs as a young child. Walk with the spirits, child.', 'Feraan, lover of music. She used to sing me songs as a young child. Walk with the spirits, child.', 78735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ruidan, skilled in the healing arts. Her passing is a great loss to us. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Ruidan, skilled in the healing arts. Her passing is a great loss to us. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kevana, artist of the written word. Your stories will live on in the great library at Shattrath. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Kevana, artist of the written word. Your stories will live on in the great library at Shattrath. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78733, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrvaa, your sons shall know their mother\'s courage in her final hour. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Yrvaa, your sons shall know their mother\'s courage in her final hour. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78732, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farvi, favorite of the younger children. They will remember your stories. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Farvi, favorite of the younger children. They will remember your stories. May your spirit go with peace.', 78731, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brea, youngest amongst the acolytes. Your courage cannot be denied. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Brea, youngest amongst the acolytes. Your courage cannot be denied. May your spirit go with peace.', 78730, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amuura, twin of Faari. May your spirit go peacefully.', 'Amuura, twin of Faari. May your spirit go peacefully.', 78729, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hareeni, I blessed you on the day that you were born. Brave in life, brave in death. Go in peace, now.', 'Hareeni, I blessed you on the day that you were born. Brave in life, brave in death. Go in peace, now.', 78728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maani, youngest of her family. She wished to someday travel across all of Draenor. Travel now with the Light, child.', 'Maani, youngest of her family. She wished to someday travel across all of Draenor. Travel now with the Light, child.', 78727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judging from his wounds, it took ten Iron Horde to take Inavu down. Your deeds shall be honored, friend.', 'Judging from his wounds, it took ten Iron Horde to take Inavu down. Your deeds shall be honored, friend.', 78726, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Veraan\'s spirit was gentle, but his hammer struck fiercely today. Walk with the Light, brother.', 'Veraan\'s spirit was gentle, but his hammer struck fiercely today. Walk with the Light, brother.', 78725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merool was the last of his bloodline. He never married nor had children. Your name will be remembered with honor, warrior.', 'Merool was the last of his bloodline. He never married nor had children. Your name will be remembered with honor, warrior.', 78724, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anmet was born on a farm in Talador. He took up the paladin\'s hammer in his elder years to defend our city. Your courage shall be honored.', 'Anmet was born on a farm in Talador. He took up the paladin\'s hammer in his elder years to defend our city. Your courage shall be honored.', 78723, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Timoor, quiet and shy. You fought bravely. Your deeds shall be remembered, child.', 'Timoor, quiet and shy. You fought bravely. Your deeds shall be remembered, child.', 78722, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Armoot has six brothers, all of whom serve proudly in Karabor\'s guard. They will honor your deeds, brother.', 'Armoot has six brothers, all of whom serve proudly in Karabor\'s guard. They will honor your deeds, brother.', 78719, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Temple will be too quiet now without the sound of your voice, Barada. Walk with the Light, brother.', 'The Temple will be too quiet now without the sound of your voice, Barada. Walk with the Light, brother.', 78718, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gheeda joined the Vindicators to follow in his father\'s footsteps. Now, let your spirits be joined in Auchindoun.', 'Gheeda joined the Vindicators to follow in his father\'s footsteps. Now, let your spirits be joined in Auchindoun.', 78717, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hemeer recently celebrated the arrival of his first son. They will know of your courage, brother. Walk with the Light.', 'Hemeer recently celebrated the arrival of his first son. They will know of your courage, brother. Walk with the Light.', 78716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sanduur held the forward gate until reinforcements could arrive. Walk with the Light now, brother.', 'Sanduur held the forward gate until reinforcements could arrive. Walk with the Light now, brother.', 78715, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baruud helped build the walls of Karabor, which still stand today thanks to him. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Baruud helped build the walls of Karabor, which still stand today thanks to him. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78712, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kamuur joined the city\'s defenses against his mother\'s wishes. You served us proudly, brother. Now be at peace.', 'Kamuur joined the city\'s defenses against his mother\'s wishes. You served us proudly, brother. Now be at peace.', 78711, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thakuur showed early signs of prophetic talent. Your passing is a great loss. Rest now, my brother.', 'Thakuur showed early signs of prophetic talent. Your passing is a great loss. Rest now, my brother.', 78710, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Umaat wished to someday become a teacher. We will remember you always. Walk with the spirits, now.', 'Umaat wished to someday become a teacher. We will remember you always. Walk with the spirits, now.', 78709, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
