('Jarool was the only son of my former apprentice, Neerva. He inherited his mother\'s boldness. Walk with the spirits, child.', 'Jarool was the only son of my former apprentice, Neerva. He inherited his mother\'s boldness. Walk with the spirits, child.', 78708, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rakmun, son of Arva. As a young child, you used to beg me for candy. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Rakmun, son of Arva. As a young child, you used to beg me for candy. May your spirit go with peace.', 78705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harvu, you earned your initiation into the vindicators only a moon ago. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Harvu, you earned your initiation into the vindicators only a moon ago. May your spirit go with peace.', 78704, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maarkus, you always greeted me with a bright smile. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Maarkus, you always greeted me with a bright smile. May your spirit go with peace.', 78703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raknur was as skilled with a hammer as he was with a paintbrush. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Raknur was as skilled with a hammer as he was with a paintbrush. May your spirit go with peace.', 78702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aphuun, your parents will be proud of your courage. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Aphuun, your parents will be proud of your courage. May your spirit go with peace.', 78701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave Kaati. It is said that she feared nothing. She leaves behind two young children.', 'Brave Kaati. It is said that she feared nothing. She leaves behind two young children.', 78700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many saw Enaka shield her comrades with her own body when the wall fell. Your deeds will be honored, sister.', 'Many saw Enaka shield her comrades with her own body when the wall fell. Your deeds will be honored, sister.', 78699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Markeet\'s brothers once bet her that she couldn\'t lift an elekk. They did her chores for a week after. Walk with the Light, my child.', 'Markeet\'s brothers once bet her that she couldn\'t lift an elekk. They did her chores for a week after. Walk with the Light, my child.', 78698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheerful Shalu. Her laugh could be heard echoing around the halls of the Temple. You bring joy to the spirits, now.', 'Cheerful Shalu. Her laugh could be heard echoing around the halls of the Temple. You bring joy to the spirits, now.', 78697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady Giana, who took up the paladin\'s charge. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Lady Giana, who took up the paladin\'s charge. May your spirit go with peace.', 78696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will take care of the rest here, champion. Return to Akama and see what else needs to be done.', 'I will take care of the rest here, champion. Return to Akama and see what else needs to be done.', 78695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: more than 5', '', 78694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 5', '', 78693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 4', '', 78692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 3', '', 78691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 2', '', 78690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 1', '', 78689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Racers ahead of you: 0. You\'re winning!', '', 78688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, $n, I\'ve got it reprogrammed. All you have to do is push the plunger. EVERYONE BRACE YOURSELVES!', '', 78687, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s jus\' one in a long line o\' orcs I intend ta \"question\".', '', 78686, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Thamuun. For twenty years, he hid his love for a woman named Thalia. He never found the courage to tell her.', 'Ah, Thamuun. For twenty years, he hid his love for a woman named Thalia. He never found the courage to tell her.', 78685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zaanve was always a rascal. He loved to play jokes on his friends. You will be remembered, friend.', 'Zaanve was always a rascal. He loved to play jokes on his friends. You will be remembered, friend.', 78684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ralkura never knew his parents. He has led a hard life. Let his spirit find peace in the halls of Auchindoun.', 'Ralkura never knew his parents. He has led a hard life. Let his spirit find peace in the halls of Auchindoun.', 78683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sartuu loved this world so much. Old friend, walk with the spirits, now.', 'Sartuu loved this world so much. Old friend, walk with the spirits, now.', 78682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Antur, I still remember the day you were born. May your spirit go with peace.', 'Antur, I still remember the day you were born. May your spirit go with peace.', 78681, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know some of these orcs. We must proceed with caution. If they discover me we will have more Iron Horde on us than even we can handle.', '', 78680, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we are to defeat the Iron Horde, we will need power beyond that which we possess. It is my hope that this land will reveal answers we had not thought of yet.', '', 78679, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother Kashur once told us the story of the great colossus: Gorgrond.$b$bIt was the largest beast to ever walk the world, and when it fell, its body became the land, its spine the mountains, its blood the ore, and its will the savagery that rules this place.$b$bIt may have only been a fireside tale, but I can see how this story was inspired.', 78678, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Goliath Cannon will...', '', 78677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know ye were part o\' it! Yer gonna pay fer what ye did to me Elsa, orc!', '', 78676, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk! Tell me where yer bosses are!', '', 78675, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'s Malkorok?!', '', 78674, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $r! The podlings are attacking!', 'Be careful, $r! The podlings are attacking!', 78673, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Naaru protect us from the terrors that follow us across the universe.', 'May the Naaru protect us from the terrors that follow us across the universe.', 78672, 35, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope it\'s okay me asking you to do this. If you get me these things, we\'ll be able to destroy that monstrosity.', '', 78671, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet ya o\'er there. We\'ll make that orc sing!', '', 78670, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye fer the help, $p. I\'ll meet ya back at the camp.', '', 78667, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know ya can understand me! I WANT MY WIFE BACK!', '', 78666, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this place, outsider. It will be your final resting place.', 'Leave this place, outsider. It will be your final resting place.', 78665, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 43612, 43612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was once a place of peace. A place for eternal rest...', 'This was once a place of peace. A place for eternal rest...', 78664, 0, 0, 579, 64, 0, 42014, 42014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wade through a river of souls, stranger. It\'s best to turn back.', 'You wade through a river of souls, stranger. It\'s best to turn back.', 78663, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 42012, 42012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul will not hear us, he hears only darkness now.', 'Ner\'zhul will not hear us, he hears only darkness now.', 78662, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 43611, 43611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An eternity in darkness... cannot... escape...', 'An eternity in darkness... cannot... escape...', 78661, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 42013, 42013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take care of him, $n. The others were asking after you.', '', 78660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The iron horde followed us here! What do we do now?', 'The iron horde followed us here! What do we do now?', 78659, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got the drop on me, $r. Next time, you won\'t be so lucky.', '', 78658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a draenei female back at our slave pens. We captured her yesterday. Perhaps you would trade my life for hers?', '', 78657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'blah blah blah', 78656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please hurry. I don\'t know what I would do if something happened to her.', '', 78655, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $p. Feeding all of these people is hard work!', 78654, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have water soon, friends. I will not fail you again.', '', 78653, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 78652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First the iron horde destroyed Tuurem, now podlings are here. Will it ever end?', 'First the iron horde destroyed Tuurem, now podlings are here. Will it ever end?', 78651, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
