('Grrowl!', '', 78639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll die for those refugees, fool.', 78638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogre will have chains and manacles you can secure him with. Poetic when you think about it.', '', 78637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the birds of Gorgrond feast on your bones!', '', 78636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody, come quickly! Please!', '', 78635, 0, 23614, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, dwarf!', '', 78634, 1, 23617, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yah! Come ta papa, ya scummy orc bastich!', '', 78633, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is your only option.', '', 78632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iron will, iron blood!', '', 78631, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them! Make them slaves!', '', 78630, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Almost done. Hold on!', 78629, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Runda.\n\nShe\'s usually just north of the barracks entrance.', 'Look for Runda.\n\nShe\'s usually just north of the barracks entrance.', 78628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Earth Mother watch over you traveler, what is it you seek?', 'Earth Mother watch over you traveler, what is it you seek?', 78627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it is sparring lessons you are looking for Tarshaw Jaggedscar can be found in the barracks on the east side of town.', 'If it is sparring lessons you are looking for Tarshaw Jaggedscar can be found in the barracks on the east side of town.', 78626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dhugru Gorelust hides behind the barraks on the east side of town practicing his craft.', 'Dhugru Gorelust hides behind the barraks on the east side of town practicing his craft.', 78625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
