('Before I kill you know this, heroes. Aku\'mai will devour this world!', '', 78445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, you will not live long enough to behold his glory. Finish them!', '', 78444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late, heroes, the summoning of Aku\'mai is complete.', '', 78443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve won nothing, fools. Aku\'mai arises!', '', 78442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, $p: the sun burns the flesh. Only in shadow will you find refuge.', '', 78441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 46311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guess I\'d better find a way to make myself useful. Do you think a blind old warrior can still make a difference?', '', 78440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
