('%s spits on the ground.', '', 78438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we shall meet again, yes?', '', 78437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, these will be worthy companions for the long journey home.', '', 78436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thruk... want... Guardian... TREASURE!', '', 78435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I delayed you long enough... Aku\'mai will rise...', '', 78434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was hoping you would make it to me. Now I get the pleasure of removing your heads!', '', 78433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My flesh will be claimed by the Old Gods...', 78432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who dares interrupt my sacrifice?! Slay them!', 78431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 45732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... wheel...', '', 78430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow... I still in shock.$b$bI was amazing.$b$bYou need my help or not? I\'m sure you do.', '', 78429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With dying breath... me hate you...', '', 78428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
