('Iron will, iron blood!', '', 78416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mighty Durotan descends from his mountain without an army. It would seem you have grown tired of living.', 78415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 46175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you all of the things?', '', 78414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is ready.', 'Everything is ready.', 78413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been a long time since I was in the presence of the Laughing Skull. I remember them being taller.', '', 78412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Laughing Skulls have agreed to help.', 'The Laughing Skulls have agreed to help.', 78411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the blast. I SAW it. The scream of the elements as their combined essences were ripped asunder and turned into a weapon of destruction. Such a weapon must not exist!', '', 78410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it. It\'s firing again!', '', 78409, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I half-expected him to vaporize you, but you dispatched him quite handily. An impressive display...', '', 78408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive my deception. I had to appeal to your sympathy in order to play you against Kairyx.', '', 78407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, Aku\'mai, and feed!', '', 78406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What precious treasures my murlocs have lured to me.', '', 78405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aku\'mai, kill them all!', '', 78404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy that wretched prism! We cannot risk it falling into their hands.', '', 78403, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now just relax, $p. You and I are going to have a chat.', '', 78402, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The prism hums with energy. It could be salvaged, though the strange machine it once powered - perhaps a devastating weapon, or some kind of depraved torture device - looks to be completely ruined.>', '', 78401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, this is what they were after... Thank you for clearing the way.', 78400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be honored if you continued to fight by our side.', '', 78399, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was impressed by your skill in our battle against Dorogg the Ruthless.', '', 78398, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our hold on Bladespire is tenuous, and some of my best warriors have raced off with my reckless brother.', '', 78397, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven yourself loyal to my clan. Capable of great things.', '', 78396, 0, 0, 396, 68, 0, 45198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Kraul with your life!', '', 78395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, wolves and skulls need each other. You need to know where the big Iron Hordy weapon is at. We need your $p.', '', 78394, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have come to hunt the Iron Horde. I could destroy what remains of your ruined village, or perhaps we could assist one another.', '', 78393, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Limbflayer forgot to be nice. I saw pretty orc. I wanted to see if she could dance. Sorry. Sorry.', '', 78392, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah! He tried to stab me! I told you we couldn\'t trust the Laughing Skulls.', 78391, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your worst nightmare...', '', 78390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
