('', 'I came as quickly as I could. Were you able to catch their leader?', 78128, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The arkonite crystals around Shadowmoon fell from the wreckage of our original descent to Draenor, nearly three hundred years ago.$B$BIt\'s a testament to draenei technology that they are still functional.', '', 78127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife always says I should relax more.', '', 78126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any other master artificer wouldn\'t have a sporebat\'s cahoot how to fix the city\'s shield, that\'s what I\'d like to say.$B$BWhat would they do without me?', '', 78125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be a talbuk\'s hind if I let that shield be the end of Karabor.$B$BWe must activate those arkonite crystals, now!', '', 78124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of all the things that could go wrong, it had to be Karabor\'s shield.$B$BNo, it couldn\'t be a malfunctioning resonancy code. It wasn\'t a bad shipment of agentite.$B$BIt just had to be the shield protecting the largest draenei city in Shadowmoon!', '', 78123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She doesn\'t want me going with you. But, I can help by magically projecting myself.', '', 78122, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There were three ogres and a draenei; a female by the look of the tracks. The survivors headed north. I\'ll tell Maraad when I know more.', '', 78121, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They got \'emselves somethin\' big \'n nasty o\'er there.', '', 78120, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you\'re here. I don\'t want to go in alone.', '', 78119, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel never showed and has gone missing.$B$BI worry for her, but also about how Maraad will react to bad news.$B$BRegardless, I think it\'d be wise for us to leave this place soon.', '', 78118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorgrond is unforgiving. I\'m glad you\'re here, $n.', '', 78117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IMPUDENT FLEA! Now you will see what power lies in this fortress.', '', 78116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothin\' I hate more than orcs, \'cept fer Blackrock orcs!', '', 78115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill Hellmaw\'s Felblood to stop him from regenerating!', '', 78114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll drown you in the blood of your little army!', '', 78113, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the $c that snooty draenei, Taalo said was comin\' round.$B$BBy the looks o\' ye, we\'re gonna have some fun!', '', 78112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the $r Taalo said we were waiting for.', '', 78111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hi. Do you need something?', '', 78110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Life is the Light, and the Light is Life itself. They may be exchanged, but nothing is ever lost.', '', 78109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Romuul, I need you to take care of this. I will send reinforcements after you.', '', 78108, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand and more were lost defending the temple, but our walls still stand.', '', 78107, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal is malfunctioning again. What we really need is a high-grade crystal shipment from Talador.$B$BThese old components just aren\'t holding together anymore.', '', 78106, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde were merely testing us. They will come again, with a larger force.', '', 78105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yrel never arrived. I fear the worst.$B$BI won\'t lose her again, $n.', '', 78104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the last... of us...', '', 78103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits... guide my blade.', '', 78102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
