('You are too late, fool. The Destroyer of Dreams\' plans are nearing fruition.', '', 78094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your conquered clan will fill my slave pens...', '', 78093, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 41881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will end you, little lone wolf.', '', 78092, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 41880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
