('Destroy the void fragments before they merge with the %s!', '', 78088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I join... the earth...', '', 78087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls in reinforcements!', '', 78086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your prey closely... and fire!', '', 78085, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
