('%s has calmed down, and looks ready to be ridden into battle.', '', 78082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He was willing to lose everything to be with her.>', '', 78081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<She waited for him until her breath froze.>', 78080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die! Thank you.', 'I thought I was going to die! Thank you.', 78079, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I\'ll return to the gate.', 'Thank you. I\'ll return to the gate.', 78078, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger. I owe you my life.', 'Thank you, stranger. I owe you my life.', 78077, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mustn\'t let Auchindoun fall!', 'We mustn\'t let Auchindoun fall!', 78076, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to stop them! They\'re mad!', 'You have to stop them! They\'re mad!', 78075, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the letter.', 'Take the letter.', 78074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<This orc appears to have been camping here for several days before succumbing to the bitter cold. Her face is frozen in a woeful stare, gazing southwest toward the icy flats.$B$BClutched to her breast is a neatly folded letter.>', 78073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know Death Speaker Blackthorn\'s newest creation, Mushlump, spews forth plague from every pore and he has reenlisted Mordresh Fire Eye\'s help in rallying the undead.$B$BEven the Death\'s Head has been helping Blackthorn.  Their Arachnomancers have created a monstrosity of fang and plague, a spider of enormous size named Aarux.$B$BIf you could defeat these enemies and clear the plague blocking my path we could climb the Spiral of Thorns to defeat Death Speaker Blackthorn and recapture Amnennar\'s phylactery before it is too late.', 78072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skeletons assault you constantly and plague roils out of the caves.  How can I help stop the ritual?', 'Skeletons assault you constantly and plague roils out of the caves.  How can I help stop the ritual?', 78071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A powerful necromancer such as Amnennar can store his soul in a physical vessel, allowing himself to be reborn if the proper rituals can be completed.$B$BI should have searched across Kalimdor for Amnennar\'s Phylactery, but I was too prideful in our previous victory.$B$BNow, all of that work may come undone.', 78070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A phylactery?', 'A phylactery?', 78069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I too thought Amnennar the Coldbringer had been defeated; a grave mistake indeed. How clouded my judgment must have been to forget the true power of a lich lies in their phylactery.', 78068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought Amnennar was destroyed.', 'I thought Amnennar was destroyed.', 78067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are good to have come so quickly.  I\'m afraid I must ask you to put your lives in danger again to save Kalimdor.$B$BAmnennar\'s apprentice, Death Speaker Blackthorn, hopes to return his master to the realm of the living!  We must quickly make our way atop the Spiral of Thorns and defeat him before the ritual can be completed.$B$BWe must strike together, only with our combined force can we hope to stop him!', 78066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the scroll.', 'Take the scroll.', 78065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<A lone orc traveler lies dead in the snow, apparently overwhelmed by ravenous tundra wolves. Judging by his gear, he was prepared for a long journey through harsh conditions.$B$BTucked into the front of his robe is a scroll bound in leather laces, with a furry trinket dangling from one end.>', '', 78064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Together we can put a stop to Death Speaker Blackthorn\'s plans.  We must be quick, the ritual is almost complete!', 78063, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With pleasure. Vindicators, follow me into the fray!', '', 78062, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must defeat Commander Vorka. There he is, at the very gates of Karabor.', '', 78061, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see to the defense of Karabor - even if it requires laying down my own life.', '', 78060, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve defended against orc raids before, but the size of this army is much greater than any I\'ve ever seen.', '', 78059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karabor is as much a fortress as it is a temple.', '', 78058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have done it.  I will take the phylactery into safekeeping. Amnennar will no longer control the Quilboar nor threaten Kalimdor.', 78051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No darkness can hold back the powers of the Life-Binder.', 78050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the power of the red dragonflight mend your wounds!', 78049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! The more blood you spill, the easier it will be for Aku\'mai to rise!', '', 78048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm-hnng - yeah, come here! I\'ll put you in chains.', '', 78047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Amnennar will be reawakened!', 78046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too late!  The ritual has begun.', 78045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes! I require your aid!', 78044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borrok snatches %s from the feeding area!', 'Borrok snatches %s from the feeding area!', 78043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Borrok the Devourer demands sustenance! Feed him Grimfrost Ogres!', '', 78042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHH!!!', '', 78041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion! Focus your attacks on that... THING! I will protect the others.', 78040, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our scouts are positioned across the marshes and the forests. We keep a close eye on the Shadowmoon orcs.', '', 78039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My team is the best out there. We get the job done.', '', 78038, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll carry out any job, for the right price.', '', 78037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you?', '', 78036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am very interested in the Shadowmoon\'s particular brand of magic. It seems their most powerful abilities involve some type of blood pact, and thus, sacrifice.', 78035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such powerful casters the Shadowmoon are. Their magic is one I am not entirely familiar with, but that\'s why it is so fascinating.', 78034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowmoon clan lived in peaceful coexistence with us for many centuries. Only recently have we noticed more hostile behavior from the clan.', 78033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of all the orc clans, it seems the Shadowmoon have the strongest affinity with  mysticism and superstition.', 78032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The first step to fighting your enemy is understanding them.', 78031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowmoon clan is of special interest to me. I believe that the more we know of their history, the more we can come to understand them.', 78030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. Prophet Velen has told me of your deeds.', '', 78029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes and senses sharp. Danger lurks in the marsh.', '', 78028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are always on the hunt.', '', 78027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BIG WORM!', '', 78026, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Grimfrost ogres pay tribute to you! Show yourself!', '', 78025, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('COME OUT WE GOTS FOOD!', '', 78024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY, COME OUT!', '', 78023, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mighty Devourer, come and claim this offering from da Grimfrost!', '', 78022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, Borrok!', '', 78021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yrel... my dearest sister...', 78018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold my power, Warchief Hellscream. With my clan at your side, you will be unstoppable.', '', 78016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True sacrifice is willingly given. Ammi\'s sacrifice is a pact made in cold blood. It is capable only of the basest of magic. True sacrifice is made with one\'s soul, with no selfish intentions, with the purest of goodwill for one other than yourself. This type of sacrifice is capable of miraculous things.', '', 78015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no darkness that the light cannot pierce.', '', 78014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs heavily.', '', 78012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, locating our prisoners may slow Ner\'zhul\'s plans, but we will need the power of all four crystals if we are to triumph over his schemes.', '', 78010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are still enemies among us. EVERYONE TO ARMS!', '', 78005, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 43704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The twin crystals powering Karabor\'s shield took my artificers over a year to engineer.$B$BIts creation was an unrivalled accomplishment, and its destruction, an utter waste.$B$BThe four arkonite shards that lie dormant across Shadowmoon were created ages ago, but still, they may prove serviceable.', '', 78003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, give me one moment...', '', 78001, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we would never need their power, but the time has come. Take my staff, and gather their energy for me.', '', 78000, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... Very good. Around Shadowmoon Valley are four arkonite crystals, ancient wreckage from our vessel.', '', 77999, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Light never falters. We WILL prevail!', 77998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get our eyes onto the field. The Rangari can help us.', '', 77993, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 45394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaves! Fight or die!', '', 77992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ner\'zhul, stop this! What do you want?', 77991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... Samaara!', 77990, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 45637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light you were here. You saved my life.', 'Thank the Light you were here. You saved my life.', 77989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That will do. You have my thanks.', 'That will do. You have my thanks.', 77988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was done for. Thank you, healer.', 'I thought I was done for. Thank you, healer.', 77987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude.', 'You have my gratitude.', 77986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, priest.', 'Thank you, priest.', 77985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the battle.', 'Back to the battle.', 77984, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', 'Thank you.', 77983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am feeling much more healthy now.', 'I am feeling much more healthy now.', 77982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give them an inch! Hold your ground!', '', 77981, 0, 24449, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold strong against these hordes. We will outlast them!', '', 77980, 0, 24449, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karabor cannot fall!', '', 77979, 0, 24449, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold that barricade! I don\'t want to see a single orc past these lines.', '', 77978, 0, 24449, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait... wait! It\'s too soon! NOOOOOoooooo...', 77977, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Resisting my magic is useless Ghamoo-Ra! Soon you will be under my power, then I shall unleash your fury on these meddling heroes!', 77975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s laugh echoes ominously in your mind.', '', 77974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s inhales deeply.', '', 77973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away, little ones! Ha ha!', '', 77970, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that one!', '', 77969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
