('Deez rocks smash you!', '', 77962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dorogg see how punies like hot rocks!', '', 77961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run them through!', '', 77960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pin them!', '', 77959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My boars will overrun you!', '', 77958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many shots, one kill!', '', 77957, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought they sent me ORCS!', 'I thought they sent me ORCS!', 77956, 0, 0, 480, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shovel like a Shadowmoon! Would you like to draw a little circle in the snow? Maybe light some candles and ask the wheel nicely to come out?!', 'You shovel like a Shadowmoon! Would you like to draw a little circle in the snow? Maybe light some candles and ask the wheel nicely to come out?!', 77955, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig like you mean it!', 'Dig like you mean it!', 77954, 0, 0, 480, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde war machine has toppled nations, and you idiots can\'t get us over a PILE of SNOW?!', 'The Iron Horde war machine has toppled nations, and you idiots can\'t get us over a PILE of SNOW?!', 77953, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, put your backs into it!', 'Come on, put your backs into it!', 77952, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cargo is worth more than your lives!', 'This cargo is worth more than your lives!', 77951, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIG, YOU MAGGOTS! DIG!', 'DIG, YOU MAGGOTS! DIG!', 77950, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes, step quickly into the redeemed soils and allow life to flow back into you!', 77949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 43606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! AAAAaaahhhhhhh...', 'No! AAAAaaahhhhhhh...', 77948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww... I knew you would come around.', '', 77947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to say, it is a bit terrifying utilizing some of his inventions at first, but ultimately very enjoyable.', '', 77946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel free to use the gyro Thaelin made to get back to the observatory.', '', 77945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are going to report back to Velen now.', '', 77944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s flees in fear!', '', 77943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come along, heroes! The water is fine. HAHAHAHAHA!!!', '', 77942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders?! Move the prisoners! Their flesh belongs to Lord Bathiel.', '', 77941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were going to feed us to the beast Aku\'mai. There are more prisoners deeper in the dungeon. Please, save them!', 'They were going to feed us to the beast Aku\'mai. There are more prisoners deeper in the dungeon. Please, save them!', 77940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes!', 'Thank you, heroes!', 77939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep digging, worthless scum!', '', 77938, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder.', '', 77937, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig faster.', '', 77936, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pay attention! You are going to weld that right to the main axle.', 77935, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Put some muscle into it.', 77934, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tighten that up. I don\'t want to see a wheel fall off of this as it moves into battle.', 77933, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pathetic, you call that welding? Do better.', 77932, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fan out. I want to know who was on that plane.', '', 77931, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Failure is not an option.', '', 77930, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep looking. If there are any survivors from the crash I want them dealt with immediately.', '', 77929, 0, 23301, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders in the Kraul! Drive them back!', '', 77928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be honored, fools! Your blood will feed Aku\'mai, the destroyer of Azeroth!', '', 77927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world will BURN!', '', 77926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see how you fare against the searing winds of the Twisting Nether!', '', 77925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
