('I can\'t believe they actually shot me down. I swear, if Rommul wouldn\'t have been yelling in my ear the whole time we would have been back at the observatory hours ago.', '', 77912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_selfdestruct.blp:20|t %s\'s |cFFF00000|Hspell:150734|h[Unleashed Flames]|h|r reaches full strength!', '', 77911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackrock leadership is easy to identify. Just look for the biggest, loudest, ugliest orcs on the field.', '', 77910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just give me a second to think! I\'m working with scraps over here.', '', 77909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get moving. How much longer?', '', 77908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you see any boombots that look like they might be duds give them a good kick.  That\'ll get them moving again.', '', 77906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay... seems stable. Now, if just activate the-- there we go!', '', 77905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
