('Are you sure this is safe?', '', 77903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, $n.', '', 77902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready?', '', 77901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need you to stay on the ground and keep these orcs distracted while I search for Romuul.', '', 77900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our paths start and end at very different places, visitor. But they will cross again. Go with the blessing of the naaru.', '', 77899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand now why you have come to Draenor, visitor. You do not belong here - but you have a noble reason to be here.', '', 77898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My body... returns... to the Kraul...', 77897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 41845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
