('Karabor ki\'le!', 'Karabor ki\'le!', 77884, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Karabor ki\'le!', '', 77883, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light guide our path!', '', 77882, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These orcs have violated the sanctity of Karabor. Their attack ends NOW!', '', 77881, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Six ancient crystals lie dormant throughout this valley. If we can activate them before the star descends... there is hope.', '', 77880, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot stop it. But, we may be able to purify the darkness when it arrives.', '', 77879, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ner\'zhul has used this observatory to call down the \"Dark Star,\" a creature of shadow who darkens these skies.', '', 77878, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
