('', 'You\'ve done it!  The plague preventing my access has been disrupted and we can now begin our final push to disrupt Death Speaker Blackthorn\'s ritual.  Lead on if you are ready to begin.', 77867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
