('I will help you heal the wounded defenders.', 'I will help you heal the wounded defenders.', 77770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a friend of the anchorites, visitor. I will see you back at the rallying point.', '', 77769, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be grateful, visitor. You may use this sigil to heal the wounded soldiers, if you need it.', '', 77768, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Prophet calls, and of course, I follow. But first, I have a request.$b$bMy anchorites are well-trained in the healing arts, but are less skilled in battle. I have many wounded defenders down beyond enemy lines, without any battle-hardened adventurers to rescue them...', '', 77767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Visitor. What is it you wish?', '', 77766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Rommul. I will repair your crystal for you.', 'Yes, Rommul. I will repair your crystal for you.', 77765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done? Good. Once this battle is over, we will have to begin repairing Karabor\'s proper shield defenses.', '', 77764, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent news. The malfunctioning crystal is just to the north, along the temple grounds\' outer wall.', '', 77763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You - you are the hero from Tanaan, yes? I need your aid.$b$bIn the absence of Karabor\'s normal defensive shields, we\'ve been installing Aeluun defense crystals. That crystal down at the bottom of the stairs is malfunctioning, and I can\'t leave this post until it\'s repaired. Could you place this resonator on the crystal?', '', 77762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get this crystal repaired as soon as possible, but the nearby wolves are not making it easy.$B$BCan you defend me while I work on the repairs?', '', 77761, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Velen\'s orders.', 'Velen\'s orders.', 77760, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know the details of the plan, but he\'s asking for the rangari, the anchorites, the vindicators, AND the artificers.', 'I don\'t know the details of the plan, but he\'s asking for the rangari, the anchorites, the vindicators, AND the artificers.', 77759, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I place my trust in Velen\'s wisdom. He is, after all, the Prophet of my people. Follow me, men!', '', 77758, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many? Very well. When the Prophet calls, the rangari answer. Follow me, men! Velen requests our aid!', '', 77757, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is highly unusual. We are in perfect position! Why leave now?', '', 77756, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, keep your voice down. I don\'t want to give away our position.', '', 77755, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
