('Ease off, Hansel. I assure you there\'s plenty of opportunity to kill more Iron Horde.', '', 77703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 77702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 77701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 77700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat the void!', '', 77699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood only makes me stronger.', '', 77698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is that monstrosity?', 77696, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The void... HUNGERS!', '', 77695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord of the Void, hear us. Let our blood herald your arrival into this world!', '', 77694, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 77693, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lorgosh! Korga! We ride!', '', 77692, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. We end this now.', '', 77691, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Ga\'nar. It\'s too dangerous. We need to follow the plan.', '', 77690, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, brother. We can\'t let him escape!', '', 77689, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rest of us will follow in and we can secure...', '', 77688, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar, you will spearhead the attack and take out their catapults.', '', 77687, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak, tiny, frail creatures. I will enjoy watching you die.', '', 77686, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... Gorr\'thog? Out here?', '', 77685, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tread lightly, stranger. There is fight in me yet.', 77684, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These thick plates are being tempered to withstand extreme heat.', 'These thick plates are being tempered to withstand extreme heat.', 77683, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These stones appear to retain the force and heat being hammered into them.', 'These stones appear to retain the force and heat being hammered into them.', 77682, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of the wind! Heed my call! We have need of your wisdom.', '', 77681, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 46638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This weapon looks like it could have belonged to someone from the missing search party.>', '', 77680, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find more clues, at the beach.', '', 77679, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found a weapon a friend might wield.', '', 77678, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [SHIPYARD CAMP].', 'Take the caravan to [SHIPYARD CAMP].', 77677, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [STEAM CAPPING CAMP].', 'Take the caravan to [STEAM CAPPING CAMP].', 77676, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [PIPEWORKS CAMP].', 'Take the caravan to [PIPEWORKS CAMP].', 77675, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [OGRE SLAVE CAMP].', 'Take the caravan to [OGRE SLAVE CAMP].', 77674, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [TANK TEST FACILITY].', 'Take the caravan to [TANK TEST FACILITY].', 77673, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the caravan to [LAUGHING SKULL RUINS].', 'Take the caravan to [LAUGHING SKULL RUINS].', 77672, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will expunge your existence.', '', 77671, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wasted material.', '', 77670, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! Keep it away from the huts!', 'Careful! Keep it away from the huts!', 77669, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one! How many of these did they set loose in here?!', 'Another one! How many of these did they set loose in here?!', 77668, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The clefthoof chews what little grass he can find. Pickings are slim in Gorgrond.>', '', 77667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fight when you are.', 'I am ready to fight when you are.', 77666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fight with my father\'s spirit watching over me. No ogre or orc can stand in my way.', '', 77665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lokra, wait! Gah... so impulsive, that one.', 'Lokra, wait! Gah... so impulsive, that one.', 77664, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill him! I will be free!', '', 77663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... the brute weakens...', '', 77662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ghostfur will take you to Durotan and Ga\'nar.', '', 77661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Go on inside and take your reward.$B$BDon\'t you have enough manners to accept a gift?', 'What are you waiting for? Go on inside and take your reward.$B$BDon\'t you have enough manners to accept a gift?', 77660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will defend this home to my last breath.$B$BI only hope death finds me in battle, and not in bed.', 'I will defend this home to my last breath.$B$BI only hope death finds me in battle, and not in bed.', 77659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah hah! So weak.', '', 77658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, rocks are dumb!', '', 77657, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom!', '', 77656, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a rockslide!', '', 77655, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are but a pebble amongst boulders...', '', 77653, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time, I get ta pick first, ya pasty blue blowhard!', '', 77652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pound to dust...', '', 77651, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash!', '', 77650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 41738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE!', '', 77649, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Uh... stone!', '', 77648, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away! I will fix this!', '', 77647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 42051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on inside my hut - you\'ll find an old chest in the corner. I want you to have what\'s inside.', 'Go on inside my hut - you\'ll find an old chest in the corner. I want you to have what\'s inside.', 77646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the thrill of battle! I feel young again!', 'Ah, the thrill of battle! I feel young again!', 77645, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, fools! Break yourselves upon us!!', 'Come, fools! Break yourselves upon us!!', 77644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spoken like a true orc! And here comes your chance to prove it. Thunderlords incoming!', 'Spoken like a true orc! And here comes your chance to prove it. Thunderlords incoming!', 77643, 0, 0, 113, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The old orc spits again. You\'re pretty sure a tooth came out this time.>$B$BPAH!!$B$BCome back when you grow a spine!', '<The old orc spits again. You\'re pretty sure a tooth came out this time.>$B$BPAH!!$B$BCome back when you grow a spine!', 77642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would have us sit idle while Gorr\'thog still breathes? I refuse!', '', 77641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing wrong with a little tactical retreat...', 'Nothing wrong with a little tactical retreat...', 77640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand and fight! Victory or death!', 'Stand and fight! Victory or death!', 77639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Fall back to the outpost!\" they said.$B$B\"The Thunderlords will overwhelm you!\" they said.$B$B<The old orc spits.>$B$BPah! This is my hut, and I\'m not moving. I\'ll stand my ground and die with honor!$B$BHow about you, pup? Will you run, too? Or stand and fight?!', '\"Fall back to the outpost!\" they said.$B$B\"The Thunderlords will overwhelm you!\" they said.$B$B<The old orc spits.>$B$BPah! This is my hut, and I\'m not moving. I\'ll stand my ground and die with honor!$B$BHow about you, pup? Will you run, too? Or stand and fight?!', 77638, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. I\'ll paint the walls with your blood, orc.', '', 77637, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorr\'thog! I, Ga\'nar, son of Garad, come for your head!', '', 77636, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be plenty of time to loot the place after we come back with those cannons. Let\'s go!', 'There will be plenty of time to loot the place after we come back with those cannons. Let\'s go!', 77635, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your talbuks, will you? There\'s loot in here.', 'Hold your talbuks, will you? There\'s loot in here.', 77634, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just waiting on sticky fingers over there.', 'Just waiting on sticky fingers over there.', 77633, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry it up! Tiny is getting anxious. Aren\'t you girl? Who\'s a good girl?', 'Hurry it up! Tiny is getting anxious. Aren\'t you girl? Who\'s a good girl?', 77632, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brutes! Attack!', '', 77631, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These animals have done nothing but leave chaos and death in their wake. Let\'s send them an unmistakable message.', '', 77630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan and Ga\'nar are just ahead. Let\'s go.', '', 77628, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only hope that we are enough.', '', 77627, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our entire existence depends on it.', '', 77626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t have much time. We have to help the Frostwolves.', '', 77625, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan\'s forces have already begun attacking! Hold on, we\'re going in.', '', 77624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re nearing the fortress now.', '', 77623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogres! Brazen, freeze them!', '', 77622, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bladespire ogres have been attacking more frequently. He wants to launch an assault on their fortress soon.', '', 77621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have already met with their chieftain to discuss an alliance. Durotan has been... resistant.', '', 77620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is in a fragile state. We cannot afford to raise an army of our own.', '', 77618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Frostfire Ridge. The Frostwolf Clan journeys here each year so their newly aged warriors may bond with their own wolf.', '', 77617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must kill their king... they headed off to the west... save them. Save my wife!', '', 77616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shelly and the others were captured by the podling king... we must find them. I... I will not let them die.', '', 77615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was horrible. The podlings ate Ryan right in front of me...', '', 77614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you suggest should be good enough to bring down a forger, but only for a few seconds at a time.', '', 77613, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goren... lots of goren. We will distract them in order to sneak you into the Ice Forge.', 77612, 0, 22102, 0, 68, 0, 0, 41801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So this is the pact of iron we have heard about. In truth, many clans working together to crush anyone who does not share their vision.$B$BDurotan was wise to refuse this so-called Iron Horde. I can only hope we are strong enough to withstand it.', '', 77611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel hundreds of goren burrowing through the earth. This will not be easy.', '', 77610, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 46672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of tortured stone fills the air, Draka. What do you see?', '', 77609, 0, 22102, 0, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s ride.', '', 77608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Climb on Brazen\'s back when you are ready to leave. I will explain everything on the way.', '', 77607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you again, $n. There isn\'t a moment to spare.', '', 77606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin your ritual.', 'Begin your ritual.', 77605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exurotus was always believed to be a legend. A story told from shaman to shaman as a symbol of a true elemental spirit.$b$bTo see something so revered in shackles is an affront to orcs, to shamanism, and to me.', '', 77604, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frost Wolf nuzzles its master\'s side, whining softly.', '', 77603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the flames of the fury!', '', 77602, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman, you alone were strong enough to hear my call. You were wise enough to know what needed to be done. Give me your totem.', '', 77596, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C! You have freed my children and made me whole. Accept my boon and bring the full fury of Frostfire to your enemies.', '', 77595, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I felt invincible once; I was wrong. We return to the pack. The Iron Wolf will answer to the full might of the Frostwolf clan.', 77594, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rumbles in assent.', '', 77593, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, he will. Trust me.', 77592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You taught me long ago that the elements have always been there for us. Now it is our turn to be there for them. Victory or death, we owe it to them to try.', 77590, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What hope is there against a foe that can consume the very elements?', '', 77589, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bah! That should just come close to making it a fair fight. On your feet, old man.', 77588, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not forget, child, one of us is blind and unable to call upon the spirits like he used to.', '', 77587, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Draka, help me up. We shou- hrraarh!', '', 77586, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 46649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorr\'thog will pay for this...', 'Gorr\'thog will pay for this...', 77585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their catapults destroyed our forces...', 'Their catapults destroyed our forces...', 77584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to die this way. Laying here...like a coward.', 'I refuse to die this way. Laying here...like a coward.', 77583, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m fine sh...shaman. I need to fight.', 'I\'m fine sh...shaman. I need to fight.', 77582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no supposed to be here! Smash!', '', 77581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This only hurt for a second.', '', 77580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make tasty snack!', '', 77579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody tougher than me! Rwargh!', '', 77578, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me crush you!', '', 77577, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We under attack!', '', 77576, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s frightening how quickly the orcs have adapted to their new technology, even if it is crude.', '', 77575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve broken through! Kill them all!', 'We\'ve broken through! Kill them all!', 77574, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is unclear what will happen to us from here, but one thing is certain. My loyalty to Chieftess Rulkan is absolute.', 77573, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are here in self-exile. We refused to tap the magic of Ner\'zhul\'s Dark Star.', 77572, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shadowmoon Clan is no longer. Even if physical remnants remain, its spirit is corrupted.', 77571, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ner\'zhul\'s methods are brutal and direct. He cuts his enemies down by force.$B$BRulkan is clever and wise. She will turn an enemy\'s own blade against them.', 77570, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rulkan was Ner\'zhul\'s most trusted advisor for many years. Ner\'zhul\'s strength and ambition guided our lives, but Rulkan\'s wisdom and vision inspired our spirits.', 77569, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got the primal! On to the next forger.', 77568, 0, 23043, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should be enough motes. This totem can barely hold any more.', 77567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember you from the battle at Bladespire. You must have killed twenty ogres! Take whatever you need.', 'I remember you from the battle at Bladespire. You must have killed twenty ogres! Take whatever you need.', 77566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now! Bring it down!', 77565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have it chained! Quick! Hit it hard!', 77564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quick $p! Hit it hard while I have it tied down!', 77563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have the chains and grapples you got from the Thunderlord. If you attack a forger I will use these to expose its weaknesses.', 77562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey mon, help us! Da Twilight\'s Hammer be fixin to sacrifice our green hides.', 77561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 45524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The road is secure, adventurer! And I see you have successfully cast our invaders back to the sea. Truly, you are a champion of the light.', '', 77560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well, champion. Shadowmoon rests now... and so should you.', '', 77559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find them you imbeciles! Lord Bathiel will not be denied his sacrifices!', '', 77558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 43722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look lost, outsider! What is your business here?', 'You look lost, outsider! What is your business here?', 77557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bloodshed is the only answer here. Go with my blessing, champion.', '', 77556, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
