('You be lookin\' to hone de art of Alchemy?  Den you better be off to Yelmak\'s.  He be holed up in his shop, Alchemy and Potions in de middle of de Drag.', 'You be lookin\' to hone de art of Alchemy?  Den you better be off to Yelmak\'s.  He be holed up in his shop, Alchemy and Potions in de middle of de Drag.', 77419, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me mark de location on your map.', 'Let me mark de location on your map.', 77418, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De shaman of de Earthen Ring set up portals to all over de world up on the cliffs north of de zeppelin towers.\n\nIf ya be lookin\' to go to Tol Barad der be a portal there too.', 'De shaman of de Earthen Ring set up portals to all over de world up on the cliffs north of de zeppelin towers.\n\nIf ya be lookin\' to go to Tol Barad der be a portal there too.', 77417, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Hall of Legends be high up on de west side of de Valley of Strength.', 'De Hall of Legends be high up on de west side of de Valley of Strength.', 77416, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Wyvern\'s Tail, just outside the Hall of the Brave, be a great spot to rest!', 'De Wyvern\'s Tail, just outside the Hall of the Brave, be a great spot to rest!', 77415, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Innkeeper Grishka in de Valley of Strength.  Her inn be on de east side, north of de city\'s gates.', 'Look for Innkeeper Grishka in de Valley of Strength.  Her inn be on de east side, north of de city\'s gates.', 77414, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Second building on de right in de Valley of Strength as you enter de city be de inn mon.  Gryshka be running da place.', 'Second building on de right in de Valley of Strength as you enter de city be de inn mon.  Gryshka be running da place.', 77413, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Horde Embassy be in de Valley of Strength.', 'De Horde Embassy be in de Valley of Strength.', 77412, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be lookin\' for Urtrun Clanbringer?  He be around de west side of de Valley of Strength.', 'You be lookin\' for Urtrun Clanbringer?  He be around de west side of de Valley of Strength.', 77411, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the right hands, it restores hope for this world. In the wrong ones, it is a weapon of absolute destruction.', 77410, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Arbitum is only as powerful as the one who uses it.', 77409, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See this hammer? In my hands, it strikes with magical force against enemies. But used by an inexperienced trainee, it is no more than a blunt rock.', 77408, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know the workings of our magic, traveler?', 77407, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the Prophet\'s vision of what will come to pass.', 77406, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunately, it looks like the Shadowmoon are collecting them as well. We cannot allow them to succeed.', 77405, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Five Iris Crystals have fallen from the skies around Shadowmoon Valley.', 77404, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Luckily, Iris Crystals do not originate from Draenor. We think three should be enough to supply the energy we need.', 77403, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Activation of The Arbitum requires an incredible amount of energy - energy of a kind that can\'t be found on this world.', 77402, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I pray that the day of judgment shall never come. Power like this can only come at great cost.', 77401, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This shrine holds the power to save us from destruction.', 77400, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Prophet foresaw a time in our future when our people would come into grave danger.', 77399, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the Arbitum.', 77398, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doras be at de top of de Sky Tower in de Valley of Strength.', 'Doras be at de top of de Sky Tower in de Valley of Strength.', 77397, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be lookin\' for Huinli Wingpaw, mon. You\'ll be findin\' her at The Barracks in da Valley of Honor.', 'You be lookin\' for Huinli Wingpaw, mon. You\'ll be findin\' her at The Barracks in da Valley of Honor.', 77396, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avaros Dawnglaive be in da Valley of Honor.  He be stayin\' at The Barracks. You can speak wit\' him dere, mon.', 'Avaros Dawnglaive be in da Valley of Honor.  He be stayin\' at The Barracks. You can speak wit\' him dere, mon.', 77395, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What trainer you be lookin\' for?', 'What trainer you be lookin\' for?', 77394, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battlemasters be at de Hall of the Brave in de Valley of Honor.', 'Battlemasters be at de Hall of the Brave in de Valley of Honor.', 77393, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De barber? Her shop be in de cliffs above the Valley of Strength.', 'De barber? Her shop be in de cliffs above the Valley of Strength.', 77392, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Valley of Honor\'s bank is just before de gate to de Drag.', 'De Valley of Honor\'s bank is just before de gate to de Drag.', 77391, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Valley of Strength\'s bank is south Grommash Hold, northwest of de main gate.', 'De Valley of Strength\'s bank is south Grommash Hold, northwest of de main gate.', 77390, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De goblins set up shop in de Valley of Honor, across the bridge.', 'De goblins set up shop in de Valley of Honor, across the bridge.', 77389, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s in de Valley o\' Strength, east of Grommash Hold.', 'It\'s in de Valley o\' Strength, east of Grommash Hold.', 77388, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three ethereal technomancers have set up shop in Orgrimmar, over in de Drag.\n\nLook for de weird machinery and purple lights... ya can\'t miss it.\n\nDey might be havin\' what cha lookin\' for.', 'Three ethereal technomancers have set up shop in Orgrimmar, over in de Drag.\n\nLook for de weird machinery and purple lights... ya can\'t miss it.\n\nDey might be havin\' what cha lookin\' for.', 77387, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for de orc Varzok up on de city\'s central mesa, just east of de Flight Master. Ya can\'t miss him mon.', 'Look for de orc Varzok up on de city\'s central mesa, just east of de Flight Master. Ya can\'t miss him mon.', 77386, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be lookin\' lost, mon.', 'You be lookin\' lost, mon.', 77385, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run $c, it\'s a trap!', 'Run $c, it\'s a trap!', 77384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot defeat us all, weaklings.', '', 77383, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let it get away!', 'Don\'t let it get away!', 77381, 0, 22997, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay with us!', 'Stay with us!', 77379, 0, 22997, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... are... FROSTWOLVES!', '', 77378, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those of you bold enough to stand with me - come! We will show the world the might of the Frostwolves!', '', 77377, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 44109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make no mistake. We are at war. And we need a Warchief!', '', 77376, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 44108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honored brothers and sisters! Today we achieved what Durotan would not even dare to try.', '', 77375, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 44107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food!', 'Food!', 77374, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s de end of Hellscream.$b$b<Vol\'jin eyes you warily.>$b$bWhat next, $r?', '', 77371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. Maybe my brother Durotan will be brave enough to join us against Gorr\'thog.', '', 77370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bomb_05:20|tYou have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:145996|h[Set to Blow]|h|r! Use |cFFFF0000|Hspell:146364|h[Throw Bomb]|h|r to throw them!', '', 77369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorr\'thog! I, Ga\'nar, son of Garad, come for your head! Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 77368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He will regret crossing me.', '', 77367, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin\'s one tough nut. Stabbed in the neck, still he comes back to collect what\'s due. I like this guy!$b$bMy people need security and profit. Under Hellscream, we got a whole lot of neither.', '', 77366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Warchief Vol\'jin.\" Does it sound absurd to you, $c? I, for one, certainly won\'t be taking orders from a troll.$b$b\nBut, he put this little coalition together, and won the day. He\'s also proven to be impossible to kill - I admire that.$b$b\nTime to test what he\'s made of...', 77365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We are all in this together, $c.', '', 77364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I find politics exhausting. I am confident Vol\'jin will take us where we need to go.$b$b<Lor\'themar glances over to Sylvanas.>$b$bAssuming he can hold this Horde together.', '', 77363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought Garrosh was ready. I thought the mantle of Warchief would give him perspective. Of the many problems facing our people, he saw only one solution - his vision of the Horde brought us to the brink.$b$bIt is time for a new direction. Vol\'jin will take us there. In many ways he did not want this responsibility... but I think that will make him a better leader.', '', 77362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand tall, $c. Today ya saved de soul of de Horde.', '', 77361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace is all that is worth fighting for.', '', 77360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A major victory, to be sure. We turn our attention now to our Gilnean homeland - ravaged by disease. Wrynn has pledged his help rebuilding my kingdom, but it is difficult to know where to begin.', '', 77359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varian and I spoke at length about the price of peace before his decision here today. I am willing to allow the Horde the use of Azshara\'s lumber if they abandon Ashenvale for good. Knowing the way that goblins chew through resources, we will see how long that will sustain them.$b$bI support this peace, but I do not share the High King\'s confidence. If the Horde breaks treaty to engage us again... my people will be ready.', 77358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing like a common enemy to bring people together. The dwarven clans have never been so united. If the peace holds, our three kingdoms will be stronger than ever before...', 77357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory for the Alliance! Before we clear out of here, my people will grab as much of this crazy goblin technology as we can get our hands on.', '', 77356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think my father did the right thing. If we tried to occupy Orgrimmar, the fighting would never stop. And what about the rest of the Horde? Would we resort to internment camps? We\'ve been down that road before - it doesn\'t work!$b$bWe deposed of a warmonger and replaced him with a leader we can work with. It\'s our only chance for peace in the future.', '', 77355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'King Wrynn will rue the day he allowed the Horde to name another Warchief.$b$bWe should\'ve kept fighting. Who\'s to say this new Warchief won\'t get any ideas in his troll head a few years from now?', 77354, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand your desire to inflict more suffering on the Horde. But when do we stop? How many more Alliance will number among the dead if we invaded Thunder Bluff, Azshara, and the Echo Isles? And how would we govern the conquered people?$b$bThe Pandaren always question why we fight. Today, we\'ve won justice, and have given the Horde an opportunity to atone by supporting their rebellion. Further bloodshed would be for vengeance alone - and it would reap vengeance in return.', '', 77353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are unified like never before. We\'ve bought our people security in Kalimdor, an end to the blockade, and an end to the total war that\'s spilt so much blood on either side of the great sea.$b$bNow, to the work of winning the peace. I would like to station a garrison near Theramore. We need to investigate cleansing the plague from Gilnean lands so they can rebuild. We must contain Sylvanas.$b$bFrom here on forward, the Alliance will be proactive. Never again can there be another the likes of Hellscream.', '', 77352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not keep fighting?', 'Why not keep fighting?', 77351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s next for the Alliance?', 'What\'s next for the Alliance?', 77350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. You and your companions were the tip of the Alliance spear: Your work exploring Pandaria, securing the Vale, and ultimately assaulting Garrosh\'s stronghold is what made this victory possible.$b$bOur triumph here will put a stop to the fighting in Kalimdor, but even in peace, there\'s much to be done - here, back home, and elsewhere.', '', 77349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing to say to you, $r. Your people have a lot to answer for. But maybe this is a new beginning.', '', 77348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing to say to you, $r.', 'I have nothing to say to you, $r.', 77347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show Krag no mercy.', 77346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your final clue, is in the cave.', '', 77345, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their mounts is dead, they must be saved.', '', 77344, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find more answers in the field.', '', 77343, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found the armor, no friend in reach.', '', 77342, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clues you seek, is by the pond.', '', 77341, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You friends was here, now they gone.', '', 77340, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will gather my strength and we will meet you upstairs after you have found the others.', 77339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this! I will deal with you myself!', '', 77338, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your ideals make you weak, draenei. Survival is the only truth in this world.', '', 77337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will mercy, truth, and goodness save you now?', '', 77336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaaa... your defiance only fuels us, draenei.', '', 77335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them! Destroy them in the name of the Shadowmoon clan!', '', 77334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostwolves! Fan out and harry the Thunderlord. For vengeance!', '', 77327, 0, 0, 53, 69, 0, 44103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_powerinfusion.blp:32|t\nK\'ara has blessed you. You can now track the remaining orcs on your minimap.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_powerinfusion.blp:32|t\nK\'ara has blessed you. You can now track the remaining orcs on your minimap.', 77325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run for your lives!', '', 77324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the boats!', '', 77323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back to the ships!', '', 77322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The draenei are coming! Fall back!', '', 77321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You find thousands of tiny puncture marks covering the dead mule\'s body.>', '', 77320, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<It looks like this shield belonged to the missing search party.$b$bUpon further inspection, you find what appears to be hundreds of little puncture marks covering the blood-stained armor.>', '', 77319, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n. Let us discuss how to best help Durotan and his clan.', '', 77318, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You saved some for us? How thoughtful!', 77315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar! We are with you! Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 77314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run for your lives! They\'re in our walls!', '', 77313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retreat!', '', 77312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retreat!', 'Retreat!', 77311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall back!', 'Fall back!', 77310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the tower!', 'To the tower!', 77309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to the tower!', 'Back to the tower!', 77308, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t stand a chance against them!', '', 77307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, brothers! Run away!', '', 77306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('IT BURNS!!!!', '', 77305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHH!!!', '', 77304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde... comes...', '', 77303, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron tide will wash over you, friend of the draenei...', '', 77302, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames will catch you, soon enough...', '', 77301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh heh heh... you runts gonna die in here...', '', 77300, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dark star... brightens...', '', 77299, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness will overcome you! ATTACK!', '', 77298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Naaru\'s Momentum to damage enemies, or to quickly escape danger.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Heroism.blp:64|t', '', 77297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let the material rest!', '', 77296, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Those are good strikes.', '', 77295, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every swing brings us closer to crushing our foes!', '', 77294, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep up the momentum!', '', 77293, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want weapons like the Blackrock, you need to WORK like the Blackrock!', '', 77292, 0, 0, 23, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to hear that metal sing!', '', 77291, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on you louts, put some muscle into it!', '', 77290, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad you have accompanied me on this journey, friend.', '', 77289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those sparks are weakness leaving the metal.', '', 77288, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FPOW!', '', 77287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make every swing count! You aren\'t slamming out spearheads anymore.', '', 77286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See here? This is the reaction you are looking for.', '', 77285, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay attention! This part is important.', '', 77284, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
