('Your skull will adorn my necklace.', '', 76948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements... what have we done...', '', 76947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!', 'The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!', 76946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39027, 39027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crumbling earth, plagued with rust!', '', 76945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anguished water, stagnant and poisonous!', '', 76944, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
