('Storm!', '', 76941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My wolf will feast on your blood!', 76940, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hear them no longer...', 76939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!', 'The blood of the True Horde lusts for power!', 76938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39028, 39028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long-dead fire, black and smouldering!', 76937, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tortured wind, stale and toxic!', 76936, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not ask the elements for aid...', 76935, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bend to our will!', 'Bend to our will!', 76934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 39013, 39013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Earth!', 76933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 39016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My expertise is needed elsewhere, heroes! When you see Garrosh, tell him he should\'ve invested in gnomish technology!', '', 76932, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, we\'ve got your back!  Forge ahead, brave heroes!', '', 76931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello friends! We\'ve just about secured the surface, it looks like the real fight\'s going to be down here.', '', 76930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deploy the gear! Establish a perimeter!', '', 76929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No orc steps foot in Karabor and gets away with it.', '', 76928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes!  A song about the lore and all the lessons we can learn from it all.  Sounds exciting, doesn\'t it?$b$bBut... we\'re still working on it.  Chadrik seems easily distracted lately.  Is there something on my tabard?', 76927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A song?', 'A song?', 76926, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know why he won\'t listen to me!  I\'m just trying to explain how to make his noodles even better.', 76925, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes Tonsa lets me ride on his back... but he\'s kinda stinky.', 76924, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That dumb cricket keeps me up at night.  Don\'t tell Uncle, but I want you to squash it!', 76923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewly keeps drinking Uncle\'s brew.  Hope it makes him strong in the fight!', 76922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
