('Go away!', 'Go away!', 76912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retrieving the Iris Crystal', 'Retrieving the Iris Crystal', 76911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take you down with me, $c!', '', 76910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y... yes, sir. We will leave right away. You have my word.', '', 76909, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...but not today.  Today, we show mercy.  Pack up your machines of war and leave this place.', '', 76908, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would be within my rights to behead you and raze this town...', '', 76907, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s more, we thoroughly outclassed your orcs on the battlefield.', '', 76906, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
