('', 'We should have dealt with the Iron Horde when we had the chance.', 76898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foul Stream is being cast on you!', '', 76897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A crawler mine detonated on $n!', '', 76896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the demon is weakened, read from the Scripture of Elune.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Scroll_12.blp:64|t', '', 76895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Vial of Moon Water to compel the All-Seeing Eye.$B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_Potion_20.blp:64|t', '', 76894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
