('', 'Performing the same action multiple times in a row will get you a small bonus. Try seating many customers or delivering their orders in rapid succession to earn extra points!', 76857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the naaru, I\'m saved!', 'Thank the naaru, I\'m saved!', 76856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die!', 'I thought I was going to die!', 76855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never wanted a fight...', 'I never wanted a fight...', 76854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why? Why do they attack us?', 'Why? Why do they attack us?', 76853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll show those smelly orcs a thing or two.', '', 76852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to need more than a couple props and a can of Kaja\'Cola to pull this off.', '', 76851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to hurry. The sooner we start blowing stuff up, the sooner we can focus on activating the crystal.', '', 76850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that roast, Ufga! I bet our Iron Horde guests have never tasted anything like it.', '', 76849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t have time to waste here, $n.', 76848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of here!', 'Get me out of here!', 76847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th-thank you, stranger...', 'Th-thank you, stranger...', 76846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let me see that. Here we go! The Iris Crystal has been moved, but it\'s still in the area. We still have time to find it and return it to the Prophet.', 76845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the amount of weapons and ammunition they intend to build Karabor will be left in ruins!', 76844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t so much a journal as it is an order form...', 76843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is terrible... Grommash Hellscream has ordered a second attack on Karabor. So much for a peaceful resolution.', 76842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll handle this one!', 76841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not belong in Shadowmoon orc filth!', 76840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let this be a message to Grommash!', 76839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your betrayal will not be forgotten, orc!', 76838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will purge you from this land!', 76837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time we try a little hostile negotiations!', 76836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hellscream will pay for this dishonesty with his life!', 76835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The only good orc is a dead orc...', 76834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should have never trusted the Iron Horde!', 76833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I\'m itching to bury my mace in some orc skulls!', 76832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to hurry. The Iron Horde will mobilize again soon by the looks of it.', 76831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All we\'ve done is given them time to regroup.', 76830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should not have shown them mercy...', 76829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What need would the Iron Horde have for weapons if they did not intend to attack again?', 76828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just look at all of these supplies being amassed!', 76827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Prophet will be disappointed to hear of our failure.', 76826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will make sure the Iris Crystal gets back to the prophet. I sense you still have much to do.', 76825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve won this battle, but the war is far from over, $n.', 76824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re building weapons, but why?', 76823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We show these orcs mercy and how do they repay us?! Just look around!', 76822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha!', 'Haha!', 76806, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha!', 'Ahahaha!', 76805, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or fed to our wolves?', 'Or fed to our wolves?', 76804, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... no...', 'Uh... no...', 76803, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you sleeping on duty AGAIN?', 'Were you sleeping on duty AGAIN?', 76802, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Rangari spy? Here, in our village?', 'A Rangari spy? Here, in our village?', 76801, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see that? He nearly took my head off!', 'Did you see that? He nearly took my head off!', 76800, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without the protection of the Celestials you are forcibly ejected from Ordos\' temple!', 'Without the protection of the Celestials you are forcibly ejected from Ordos\' temple!', 76798, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we\'ve dealt with the ogres, the Burning Blade, and the orcs at Lok-rath, we\'ll be ready to move on Grommashar.', '', 76797, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must find Thrall and put a stop to Hellscream\'s reign.', '', 76796, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a limitless supply of Kor\'kron at my command you fools! Surrender now and I will give you a quick death.', '', 76795, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sound of grinding metal reverberates through the halls as the lock on the Nexus doors releases.', '', 76794, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magic sky lanterns for sale! Light the candle and watch it float, even without wind!', '', 76793, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so happy to share this moment with my son.', '', 76792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so happy to share this moment with my son. Thank you again for all that you have done for us.', '', 76791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For generations I protected my people with the mists, and yet with each and every champion I see before me, I realize more and more the error of my ways. May you learn from the lessons of Pandaria, as I have.', '', 76790, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Courier! Go to the main lodge and deliver the Iris Crystals to Chieftain Ner\'zhul. We mustn\'t keep our Iron Horde friends waiting.', 76789, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry up then! The draenei temple will fall... SOON.', '', 76788, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Patience, Commander. We are faithful servants of the Iron Horde. It will be soon, now.', 76787, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
