('People be dyin\' up above. Da city is in chaos. I\'m gonna finish it - stop da bloodshed. I\'ll come back for ya.', '', 76617, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine, you and your warriors hold this junction. These heroes should forge ahead an\' flush the Warchief out of hiding.', '', 76616, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh be concealin\' a whole hidden base. Where did his lust for power take him?', '', 76615, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 39146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande...', '', 76614, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da beast be slain!', '', 76613, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 39145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be heroes, no doubt about dat.', '', 76612, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey must have taken da docks!  Ha ha!  Welcome to da\' fields of slaughter.', '', 76611, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t no other way, mon. We gotta stop Garrosh here an\' now, else we be runnin\' the rest of our lives.', '', 76610, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 39151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time can be both beautiful and cruel.', 76609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you stupid AND dead!', '', 76608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rahh! I crush anyone who challenge me!', '', 76607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda stayed outta my way!', '', 76606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dats what I thought!', '', 76605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so tough now!', '', 76604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My body becomes one with the volcanoes.', '', 76603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve made your final mistake, foreigner. Feel the power of lava as your bones melt!', '', 76602, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tough guy, huh? I show you tough!', '', 76601, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Had enough yet?!', '', 76600, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah, my eye! Where you learn that?!', '', 76599, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urgh, I kill you for that!', '', 76598, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outta my way!', '', 76597, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh! I kill you first, den I smash little one!', '', 76596, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back off, dis one is mine!', '', 76595, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hit me, stupid!', '', 76594, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! I hit you back for that!', '', 76593, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, watch it!', '', 76592, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry for such a short meeting. I must seek my rylak companion. She disappeared before I was captured. Again, you have my thanks.', '', 76591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turgall was a cruel master. He tortured his slaves and let us starve to death!', '', 76590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I don\'t know if I would have survived without your help.', '', 76589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hands on deck! The Barnacle\'s under attack!', '', 76588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that in the distance? Sails? Ahoy! We\'ve been stranded fer nine days! Help us!', '', 76587, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t seen mist this thick before. We\'ll have to drop our sails and wait for it to pass. I don\'t much like the thought of beaching The Barnacle on a shallow reef today.', '', 76586, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That storm pushed us off course. We could be anywhere between Kul Tiras and Lordaeron, so stay sharp!', '', 76585, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes are playing tricks on me! Are those... skeletons manning that ship?', '', 76584, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A historian\'s work is never done, you see. There\'s always something important happening that we will need to remember.$B$BI\'ve written much of your legacy already, but there is still so much to learn! Surely your feats will be remembered for ages to come.', 76583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your challenge has been answered, outsider. Ordon, claim this area in the name of the Burning God!', '', 76582, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my comrades?', '', 76581, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Light.', '', 76580, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beautiful day, isn\'t it?', '', 76579, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hohohoho, that\'s a funny one! Tell me another.', '', 76578, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha... Oh, I\'m holding my sides at that one!', '', 76577, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaha... hahahahahaha!', '', 76576, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nah, I don\'t much care for that one. Do you have any more?', '', 76575, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, you\'re pretty funny.', '', 76574, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha, that was a good one!', '', 76573, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know any good jokes, $r?', '', 76572, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('POOF!', '', 76571, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell my friends, for time grows short. I must depart.', '', 76570, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $n.', '', 76569, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you\'re workin\' with!', '', 76568, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to complete the ritual now! Faster!', '', 76567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your backs into it!', '', 76566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should be thankful you aren\'t on kitchen duty chopping wood!', '', 76565, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One more mistake and you\'re going in next!', '', 76564, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster! Keep moving!', '', 76563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your face!', 76562, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hello!$B$BPlease, come in, come in! Rest for a while.$B$BWould you like something to eat? To drink?', 76561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Examine his goods.', 'Examine his goods.', 76560, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The scruffy old pandaren snores peacefully. A pile of assorted bottles are strewn about next to him.>', '', 76559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eee! Wh-what?! Oh...$B$BD-did you n-need something?$B$BWhy d-did I ever let my sister convince me to visit here... have you SEEN how b-big the animals get?!', 76558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 430, 2, 6, 0, 1, 3, 39653),
('<PH> REUSE', '<PH> REUSE', 76557, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the mail service.', 'Use the mail service.', 76554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have parcel to pick up? You have mail to send?$B$BVery fast service, yes!', '', 76553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yay! I\'m the best!', '', 76552, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww! No fair!', '', 76551, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pet fell down!', '', 76550, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go easy on me!', '', 76549, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I only have one pet! I hope that\'s ok!', '', 76548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
