('I like shorts! They\'re perfect for this weather!', 'I like shorts! They\'re perfect for this weather!', 76547, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The third lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. The cage opens!', 'The third lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. The cage opens!', 76546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The second lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. One Remains.', 'The second lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. One Remains.', 76545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. Two Remain.', 'The first lock of the Thrice-Locked cage clicks and falls to the ground. Two Remain.', 76544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold the line, $n. You just worry about putting an end to Garrosh\'s madness.', '', 76543, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End it, for the Horde.', 'End it, for the Horde.', 76542, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for helping me end the great mistake I made long ago, that led our people into this dark place. I could not do it alone. Let me regain my honor, and end Garrosh\'s reign of terror once and for all.', '', 76541, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh will pay for his crimes.', 'Garrosh will pay for his crimes.', 76540, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, the time for justice is at hand. This monster will answer for each and every Alliance life that we have lost in this war.', '', 76539, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! I am Historian Llore! Everyone says I smile too much, but I don\'t think that\'s possible!', '', 76538, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, mon! I be Adjutant Historian Ju\'pa. Dey not add dat to me title yet, but I be sure that be temporary.', '', 76537, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, soo... hungry... Ack!!', '', 76536, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethings smells funny... AHA! I see you $c!', '', 76535, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare interrupt my dinner?!', '', 76534, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Requires Skeleton Key', 'Requires Skeleton Key', 76533, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard the king, bolster the line! Give our heroes the time they need to reach Garrosh!', '', 76532, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The festival has begun! Invite your friends!$b$bBe sure not to miss the fireworks at the beginning or end of the festival. They\'re the most important part.', '', 76531, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler!$b$bAre you coming to the Wanderer\'s Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It\'s quite the sight.$b$bWithin the next hour, the festival will begin. Check back at the top of the hour!', '', 76530, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler!$b$bAre you coming to the Wanderer\'s Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It\'s quite the sight.$b$bThe festival will begin under two hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!', '', 76529, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler!$b$bAre you coming to the Wanderer\'s Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It\'s quite the sight.$b$bThe festival will begin under three hours from now. Check back at the top of the hour!', '', 76528, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, traveler!$b$bAre you coming to the Wanderer\'s Festival tonight? Pandaren will gather right here on Turtle Beach shortly after sunset! It\'s quite the sight.$b$bSpeak to me as the event draws near and I will let you know how long you have to wait.', '', 76527, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
