('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! What was the original name of the world connected to Azeroth via the Dark Portal?', 76202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! This structure, located in Zangarmarsh, was controlled by naga who sought to drain a precious and limited resource: the water of Outland.', 76201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Before she was raised from the dead by Arthas to serve the Scourge, Sindragosa was a part of what dragonflight?', 76200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Brown-skinned orcs first began showing up on Azeroth several years after the Third War, when the Dark Portal was reactivated. What are these orcs called?', 76199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Malfurion Stormrage helped found this group, which is the primary druidic organization of Azeroth.', 76198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Who is the current leader of the gnomish people?', 76197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! What is the highest rank bestowed on a druid?', 76196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! White wolves were once the favored mounts of which orc clan?', 76195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is correct!', 76194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Incorrect!', 76193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mur\'liches.', 'Mur\'liches.', 76192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wolvar.', 'Wolvar.', 76191, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mur\'ghouls.', 'Mur\'ghouls.', 76190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us test your knowledge of history, then! Tell me, hero, what are undead murlocs called?', 76189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ku\'ma stares at you.>', '', 76188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorlocs.', 'Gorlocs.', 76187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'This island is equal parts fascinating and terrifying.', 76186, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhh! Or maybe it does. I better, um, go check on the others.', '', 76185, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 38574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go get it boys, that contraption\'s got nothin\' on real goblin engineering!', '', 76184, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 38573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Garrosh thinks he can cheat ol\' Grizzle out of a payday, huh?!', '', 76183, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 38572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, ho ho... Hey now. What do we have here?', '', 76182, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 38571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A right deadly machine, that is. Best watch yer step down here, heroes.', 76181, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 38190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, that looks dangerous. Get in there, boys, and show em\' what we\'re made of.', 76180, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 38189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heroes, I salute you. There\'s something right foul in these chambers below the city.', 76179, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 38188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oi! That was a fun ride!', 76178, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 38187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_gouge:20|t%s attempts to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143330|h[Gouge]|h|r you, turn away!', '', 76177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Vazuvius, rise from the depths!', '', 76176, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
