('Your pain will be endless.', '', 76162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh will melt.', '', 76161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will take my place on the eternal brazier.', '', 76160, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I burn... for all time...', '', 76159, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames... never cease...', '', 76158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pain... is endless...', '', 76157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrraaaaghhhh!!', '', 76156, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in the Veiled Stair when the deed is done - assuming you\'re still alive when this is over.', '', 76155, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what needs to be done, champion.', '', 76154, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to change the world, $n?', '', 76153, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be done, Lord Gul\'dan.', '', 76152, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 44440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I require is its limitless power.', '', 76151, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Razuun, you stay here. I have other plans for... what is that?', '', 76150, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eye, what are you looking at?', '', 76149, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all fun and games until...', '', 76148, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 45330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The human wizard and his pet elf are to blame. The land knows they don\'t belong.', 'The human wizard and his pet elf are to blame. The land knows they don\'t belong.', 76147, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone calm the wolves.', 'Someone calm the wolves.', 76146, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does the ground shake? Are we under attack?', 'Why does the ground shake? Are we under attack?', 76145, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps the Thunderlord have come to play.', 'Perhaps the Thunderlord have come to play.', 76144, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great worm twists in its lair.', 'The great worm twists in its lair.', 76143, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The farseer says that Shui Halad has awakened.', 'The farseer says that Shui Halad has awakened.', 76142, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
