('One?', '', 76103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis harder den I finked.', '', 76102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Land of Winds belongs to the Warsong.', '', 76101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar - someone\'s here!', 76100, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal vibrates at your touch!', 'The crystal vibrates at your touch!', 76099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I am confused why female draenei like gnomes.', '[%s] confesses: I am confused why female draenei like gnomes.', 76098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I\'m going to totally ninja that hunter\'s loot.', '[%s] confesses: I\'m going to totally ninja that hunter\'s loot.', 76097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I feel bad for my ground mounts. I hardly ever use them anymore.', '[%s] confesses: I feel bad for my ground mounts. I hardly ever use them anymore.', 76096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I still carry around Argent Crusade Scourgestones. You never know when they\'ll be useful again.', '[%s] confesses: I still carry around Argent Crusade Scourgestones. You never know when they\'ll be useful again.', 76095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I used to think Medivh was a druid because of all the feathers.', '[%s] confesses: I used to think Medivh was a druid because of all the feathers.', 76094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I think one time I tried to kill Lei Shi instead of Lei Shen.', '[%s] confesses: I think one time I tried to kill Lei Shi instead of Lei Shen.', 76093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I haven\'t visited Sunsong Ranch in months. I can just imagine weeds and virmen everywhere.', '[%s] confesses: I haven\'t visited Sunsong Ranch in months. I can just imagine weeds and virmen everywhere.', 76092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...kill... me.', '...kill... me.', 76091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-Narash!', '', 76090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your journey ends here cowards! These doors won\'t open as long as I live!', '', 76089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you believe this place?  There\'s so much to learn and discover!  I\'m going to fill up books and books with all my findings here.$b$bBut it\'s just so much information, I don\'t know how anyone could possibly read through it all.  Chadrik thought we could write it up as a song, but that\'s silly... right?', 76088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c.  Have you come to learn the secrets of the Timeless Isle?', '', 76087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranded on this island you will find the most dangerous creatures in all of Pandaria. Explore if you must, Prince Anduin. But be cautious.', '', 76086, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. This place overturns our very notion of time, and how it shapes the universe.', '', 76085, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should like to find out! Perhaps it is related to the mists? Or the power that was unleashed in the sundering ten thousand years ago? We must investigate!', '', 76084, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly. Time is frozen in perpetuity. Cause and effect - rendered all but meaningless.', '', 76083, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pandaren enigma, my young prince! A mystery in the mists.', '', 76082, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will.', '', 76081, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 38022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it dangerous?', '', 76080, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could create such a thing?', '', 76079, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been here for hours and the sun hasn\'t moved...', '', 76078, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What IS this place?', '', 76077, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn your corpses to ash!', '', 76076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win this round...', '', 76075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well played.', '', 76074, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will destroy you!', '', 76073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We stand behind Dezco and his choices. We will stand against the mogu, the saurok, the sha, even the warchief of the Horde. We will protect this Vale to the last, if necessary.', 76072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for my next shift at the noodle stand!', 'I\'m ready for my next shift at the noodle stand!', 76071, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
