('The Spineclaw scuttles away in fear!', '', 76069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut up.', '', 76068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please be swift and merciful. The Mother of Wolves is the true victim here.', '', 76067, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rabbits are pretty weak.', '', 76066, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight, my brothers. Show them what it means to be Warsong.', '', 76065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
