('....', '', 76062, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion of the Frostwolf clan, if they are friends of yours, then they are welcome here.', '', 76061, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, if you\'d be so kind as to make our introductions.', '', 76060, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To think: This place has been outside our time stream - and existence itself! - for millennia.\n\nOur most experienced Weavers assure us the island\'s temporal position is presently stable, but still, I wonder...\n\nWhat would happen if it vanished again while we were upon it?', 76059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Warden, let\'s go make your introduction to the farseer at Throm\'var.', 'Warden, let\'s go make your introduction to the farseer at Throm\'var.', 76058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... what\'s your point?', '', 76057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s imperative we find the council\'s base of operations and deal with them.', '', 76056, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45013, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because it\'s tainted with this youngling\'s weak blood.', '', 76055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throm-Ka, warriors of the great Frostwolf clan.', '', 76054, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45012, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed, I don\'t even want my spear anymore...', '', 76053, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t that the same spear you use to hunt rabbits?', '', 76052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not?', '', 76051, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done!', 76050, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve let too many customers get away. Perhaps you should try again?', 76049, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('/sigh', '', 76048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaha... you are too late. Even now, the crystal is on its way to Shaz\'gul.', '', 76047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honorless pup. His death is his greatest achievement.', '', 76046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. Soon there will be enough felblood to make thousands for the Burning Legion.', '', 76045, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? No...', '', 76044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 46271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Razuun, your time has come.', '', 76043, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not that easy.', '', 76042, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, my friend. Gul\'dan is not to be underestimated no matter how prepared you might be.', '', 76041, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. They can\'t see this projection.$B$BEverything we do here is leading to one thing, $n: Gul\'dan\'s capture.', '', 76040, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly. Combine the shards to forge a soul trap for Gul\'dan.', '', 76039, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have the demon\'s heart, we\'ll forge the soul trap.', '', 76038, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone warn the master!', '', 76037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks as if $n has decided to heal and revive his pets!  $gHis:Her; progress in the tournament has been reset, and they will be allowed to attempt each challenge again.', '', 76036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_posthaste.BLP:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146497|h[Impatient]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_posthaste.BLP:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146497|h[Impatient]|h|r', 76035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_COOKED_GREATPABANQUET_POT.BLP:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146498|h[Hungry]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_COOKED_GREATPABANQUET_POT.BLP:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146498|h[Hungry]|h|r', 76034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You meddle in affairs beyond your comprehension.', '', 76033, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It falls to you to defend your master.', '', 76032, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must protect me.', '', 76031, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend me!', '', 76030, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These interlopers must be stopped before our work is undone!', '', 76029, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters have not been cleansed!', '', 76028, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! We are not finished.', '', 76027, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... help....', '', 76026, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We know only despair now. A fitting punishment for our failure....', 76025, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 38415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook... does not know... head... is cloudy....', '', 76024, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... Rook knows you....', '', 76023, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 38718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand in the light and be judged!', '', 76022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the ever-burning flame!', '', 76017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve the fire gods!', '', 76016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Ordos!', '', 76015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will perish in agony!', '', 76014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fate is written in flames!', '', 76013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames are truth!', '', 76012, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ordos guide my way!', '', 76011, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the flame!', '', 76010, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you leaving the camp?\n\nThe August Celestials have requested that we not push our forces any further into the island, so we\'re staying here to secure this landing point.\n\nWatch yourself out there. The enemy has taken an interest in this place, too. Their camp is on the other end of the beach, and well-guarded.', '', 76009, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 66, 0, 0, 5, 0, 39653),
('', 'Excellent! Now your customer will happily eat the noodle soup you\'ve made for them. When they\'re done they\'ll leave happy.', 76008, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now click on the seated customer to deliver them their noodle soup.', 76007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that the soup is made, pick it up by clicking on it. Soups will go bad if left out too long so only make what you need for your customers.', 76006, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make some noodle soup for your customer. This is a scholar so they like the simplicity of a standard noodle soup. Try making one now.', 76005, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the pools!', '', 76004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work is not yet complete! Stop them!', '', 76003, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must defend the pools from their corruption!', '', 76002, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Khadgar, let\'s go over what happened when Garona attacked.', 'Khadgar, let\'s go over what happened when Garona attacked.', 76001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_fork&knife.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146448|h[Waiting for Food]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_fork&knife.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146448|h[Waiting for Food]|h|r', 76000, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When a customer has been selected, click on an open seat and the customer will go sit there.', 75999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_racial_timeismoney.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146506|h[Waiting in Line]|h|r', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_racial_timeismoney.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000|Hspell:146506|h[Waiting in Line]|h|r', 75998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Click on a patron who is waiting in line. You should see them wave to you when you have successfully interacted with them.', 75997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shrine was corrupted by Ordos!', 'The shrine was corrupted by Ordos!', 75996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Strength and power are as different as sun and moon.\" - Xuen', '\"Strength and power are as different as sun and moon.\" - Xuen', 75995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Hope\'s fire grows when the flames come together.\" - Chi-Ji', '\"Hope\'s fire grows when the flames come together.\" - Chi-Ji', 75994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"The truth shines brightest in clouded times.\" - Yu\'lon', '\"The truth shines brightest in clouded times.\" - Yu\'lon', 75993, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Though blood floods the ground, the mountain is unmoved.\" - Niuzao', '\"Though blood floods the ground, the mountain is unmoved.\" - Niuzao', 75992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have fun dealing with this.', '', 75991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He did so to keep the land whole. Living with the mantid for ten thousand years has made us both STRONG.', '', 75990, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOTHING!', '', 75989, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38862, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time, I will leave nothing to chance.', '', 75988, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38861, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I promise you this: I will stop at nothing to prepare this world for the battle to come.', '', 75987, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38860, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...you ...you\'re just a WAITER!', '', 75986, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38859, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhh... wha?', '', 75985, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38858, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...He destroyed my inn. He left no tip. He is not nice.', '', 75984, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 38412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mistake your greatest strength for weakness. Do you see this?', '', 75983, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it is with your Alliance and your Horde. They are not strong despite one another; they are strong BECAUSE of one another.', '', 75982, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the last emperor hid our land from the rest of the world, he also preserved the homeland of our ancient enemy, the mantid. Why did he do this?', '', 75981, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, there is balance in all things. Wisdom etched in our very fur: Black and white. Darkness and light.', '', 75980, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always you speak. Never do you listen! You ignore the lessons of Pandaria!', '', 75979, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Talk! Talk! Talk!', '', 75978, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!!', '', 75977, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 38404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Assassin!', 75976, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain!', 'The pain!', 75975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do give my regards to Khadgar. I\'ve a present coming for him.', '', 75974, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s squints menacingly.', '', 75973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful out there.\n\nAside from all the gigantic beasts, there\'s an enemy camp on the other end of this beach.', '', 75972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have already done what you can for this lost knowledge.', '', 75971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Sha of Doubt defeated you are ready to read the scroll.', '', 75970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While our end is inevitable, let us try to take as many of them down with us as we can. Be ready.', 75969, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again, you must defend me. Rotun, give us a challenge this time.', 75968, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, again. Our next trial will be more challenging. Prepare to defend me.', 75967, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings. I am Sikari, master of jade lightning, chi, and healing mists. For this trial, you must protect me from the incoming illusions, while I heal you and dispatch our foes.', 75966, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am down. Maybe I should bring more healing herbs for next time.', 75965, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, I cannot heal through that much damage! Did you forget to equip your heaviest armor?!', 75964, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illusionary Foragers are attacking. Do not let their cute faces fool you. They can work together to cause terrible devastation.', 75963, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illusionary Ambushers! Get their attention, quick. And get them away from me, so they cannot hit me with their devastating bananas!', 75962, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beware! Illusionary Wind-Guards can use their wings to knock you back. When they do, they will likely switch to attacking me instead.', 75961, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A new enemy, Illusionary Flamecallers. They cast fireballs and spew lava. Use the lava to your advantage; it will burn the other illusions.', 75960, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare your defenses. That is an Illusionary Conqueror! When they become enraged, they gain great strength, and nothing can stop them.', 75959, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illusionary Rippers approaching. They should pose little challenge; they are but mindless grunts.', 75958, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you standing in?! Get out of the fire!', 75957, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! Get these things off of me!', 75956, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please take care, $n.\n\nThe August Celestials will not tolerate aggression between the Alliance and Horde here.', '', 75955, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s will not be pulled from his tower!', '%s will not be pulled from her tower!', 75954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should\'ve taken over the throne room myself. Like Auntie Onyxia. Get things DONE.', '', 75953, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38857, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did he allow another warchief? He could\'ve united the world under the Alliance banner. What a fool I was to trust his ambition!', '', 75952, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38856, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that idiot, IDIOT Wrynn! \"High King\" indeed!', '', 75951, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38855, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The emperor is very near; fought doubt, hate, rage, despair, and fear.', '', 75950, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never forget your greatest friend, they stick with you until the end.', '', 75949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the river turns left or right, flow along it instead of fight.', '', 75948, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko had an idea. Grookin\' club!', '', 75947, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko like all the fireworks!', '', 75945, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, don\'t look so surprised! I\'m a black dragon. My loyalties are my own.', '', 75944, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 38854, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko Riko has a nice ring to it...', '', 75943, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, please, meet me near the Big Blossom Mine in the center of the Vale. There is something I wish to show you there.', '', 75942, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have tried everything to remove this cave-in!  Black Ox give me fortitude, I cannot move even a single rock. Perhaps if I were to borrow one of the great weapons of legend from the temple grounds...', '', 75941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have walked the trial of fortitude, and learned of the path of the Black Ox. May it bless your passage.', '', 75940, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have walked the trial of hope, and learned of the path of the Red Crane. May it guide your footsteps through time.', '', 75939, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have walked the trial of strength, and learned of the path of the White Tiger. May you remember this lesson, always.', '', 75938, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have walked the trial of wisdom, and learned of the path of the Jade Serpent. May you learn from this lesson, as I did.', '', 75937, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the face of great fear, the Black Ox taught me fortitude. Through terror and darkness it persevered. The fear was vanquished.', '', 75936, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Red Crane saw hope in me, and instructed me to look inward. Despite my visage of despair, I found this hope, and the despair was vanquished.', '', 75935, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When my journey began, I was reckless in my strength. The White Tiger taught me control. My hatred, anger, and violence were vanquished.', '', 75934, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, the Jade Serpent instructed me to purify my spirit and become one with the land, my doubts were vanquished.', '', 75933, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to finally face you in combat. Lok\'tar Ogar, for Honor, and for the Horde!', '', 75932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('So, it has come to this. Together, we have learned and grown over the years, and now we find ourselves face to face on the battlefield. Do not think I will go easy on you, nor do I expect any quarter. What we do now, we do for the horde, both of us.', '', 75931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the horde...', '', 75930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the end, I stood by the warchief, because it was my duty, and I am glad that it was you who struck me down. May your strength... lead the horde... into a new era of prosperity...', '', 75929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... you have learned much... and learned well... an honorable battle.', '', 75928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... Gamon... you have finally learned... I am proud... to have died... at your hands...', '', 75927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I die... with honor... Lok\'tar Ogar...', '', 75926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have trained harder.', '', 75925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Nazgrim, fist of the Warchief and General of the Horde Army. If I must die today, I will die with honor, in battle, for the horde!', '', 75924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No alliance hand has ever struck me down. Do you think you are seasoned enough?', '', 75923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Kor\'kron, to the gates! Now!', '', 75922, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 38207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have defeated my war machine, but the gate still stands. You will not take Orgrimmar today.', '', 75921, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 38206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be foolish, Vol\'jin! You have no siege weapons left! You cannot win this battle!', '', 75920, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha... ha ha... well-struck...', '', 75919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, finally some action. Lok\'tar Ogar!', '', 75918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are strong, stronger even than you realize. Carry this thought with you into the darkness ahead, and let it shield you.', '', 75917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38212, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return twice as powerful!', '', 75916, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38214, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not mistake the power that darkness offers for true strength!', '', 75915, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38217, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have the power to change your destiny!', '', 75914, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38216, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe in your strength!', '', 75913, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38215, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! The trial commences!', '', 75912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38211, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength. It is far more than simple physical prowess. When you are truly tested, will you be able to tell the difference between strength and power?', '', 75911, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38213, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your wisdom has seen you through this trial. May it ever light your way out of dark places.', '', 75910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38223, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn from your mistakes!', '', 75909, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38225, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always consider the consequences of your actions!', '', 75908, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38228, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let your judgment be clouded in trying times!', '', 75907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38227, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to your inner voice, and seek out the truth!', '', 75906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38226, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trial begins!', '', 75905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38222, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lesson of true wisdom lies within you dear heroes, and in the choices you make. When faced with overwhelming darkness, will you make the right decisions?', '', 75904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38224, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hope shines brightly, and even more brightly when you work together to overcome. It will ever light your way in even the darkest of places.', '', 75903, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38025, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not give up on yourself!', '', 75902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38027, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Create the destiny you seek!', '', 75901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38030, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Without hope, there is no brightness in the future!', '', 75900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38029, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe in one another, and let others carry hope for you!', '', 75899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38028, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then let us begin.', '', 75898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38024, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When faced with challenges the like you have never seen, what do you hope for? What is the future you seek?', '', 75897, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38026, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though you will be surrounded by foes greater than you can imagine, your fortitude shall allow you to endure. Remember this in the times ahead.', '', 75896, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38756, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must persevere!', '', 75895, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38758, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be vigilant in your stand, or you will never achieve your goals.', '', 75894, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38761, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the mountain, unmovable by all but time.', '', 75893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38760, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds may be strong, and the sleet may sting.', '', 75892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38759, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see.', '', 75891, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38755, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you stand on the tallest peak, winds and sleet buffeting your skin, until the trees wither and the mountains fall into the sea?', '', 75890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38757, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It cannot end... like... this...', '', 75889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought with honor. Gamon will ensure that your legacy lives on. For the Horde, my friend.', '', 75888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are an honorable Orc, Nazgrim. I regret what I must do.', '', 75887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not fall again!', '', 75886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah ha! Wonderful job, everyone! Friend, see Rotun about beginning the next trial.', '', 75885, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no end in sight to these illusions, but we shall hold out as long as we can.', '', 75884, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh... please... take care... of Speedy!', '', 75883, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, Illusionary Tunnelers! Speedy and I have faced these foes before. Beware, they may burrow into the ground and then suddenly pop up under a new target, and CHOMP! Hah ha hah ha.', '', 75882, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Ohhhh, ohhh!', '', 75881, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear. Speedy, help!', '', 75880, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 38964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The illusions will not hold back, this time. Their attacks will be relentless. Be prepared to use your strongest healing spells.', 75879, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, did you forget to heal yourself?', 75878, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am down. Let us try again!', 75877, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illusionary Flamecallers! Watch your feet, everyone. Do not stand in the lava.', 75876, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, our first enemy! Illusionary Rippers are but simple warriors. Now, let us do this!', 75875, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sooli, move!', 75874, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sure they are trying, Kavan. Be nice.', 75873, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, vanishing!', 75872, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 38580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again. More illusions approach, and we will require your healing arts.', 75871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 38963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am down! Quick healing spells would be best for emergencies like that!', 75870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 38962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Illusionary Aqualytes will affect us with dark magic. Dispel it quickly.', 75869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 38961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An Aqua Bomb has detonated! Dispel it faster, next time.', 75868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 38959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oto! I cannot attack them while they are attacking me!', 75867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 38958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fallen. I am sorry, I shall train harder for next time.', '', 75866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a new challenge, Illusionary Conquerors! When they become enraged, they strike with incredible power.', '', 75865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illusionary Hive-Singers! Their sonic waves will harm us all.', '', 75864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a wall of iron, but I cannot hold much longer!', '', 75863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold tight! I am coming!', '', 75862, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. For this trial, you must keep us alive while we face the incoming illusions. I am Oto, and will protect you.', '', 75861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Illusionary Banshee! Kill it, quickly, before it explodes!', '', 75860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Illusionary Slayer will test your ability to damage your opponent. Do not worry; it cannot harm you.', '', 75859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the Illusionary Sha! Save your strongest attacks for when its barrier falls, leaving it exposed.', '', 75858, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A master of defense, the Illusionary Guardian deflects all attacks from the front. Stay behind it.', '', 75857, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Illusionary Mystic will heal any ally that is significantly wounded. Interrupt its healing spells.', '', 75856, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the Illusionary Banana-Tosser! It will rapidly toss bananas toward you. Move to avoid them. Prevent it from running away from you, if you can.', '', 75855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Illusionary Amber-Weaver conjures globs of amber that float toward you and explode on any contact. Lead the amber globs into other illusions.', '', 75854, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illusionary Varmints come in packs, and are harmless. Use attacks that affect multiple opponents to kill them quickly.', '', 75853, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have run out of time. Shall we try again?', '', 75852, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! Hah, well done. See me for your next trial.', '', 75851, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This trial will test how far your skill can take you. It will never end; it only gets more challenging.', '', 75850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself for the most difficult illusions. Defeat them before time expires, and success will be yours.', '', 75849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As before, defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out. This time, you will encounter more difficult illusions.', '', 75848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Proving Grounds. Your first trial will now begin. Defeat each wave of illusions before time runs out.', '', 75847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
