('I thought Hellscream\'s victory was assured before he turned half of his Horde against him. So I changed my allegiance.', '', 75841, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38853, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Yes, I was backing the Alliance.', '', 75840, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 38852, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TONG! DRINK! NOW!', '', 75839, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38851, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh sure, another year of fighting. Enormous casualties trying to take Thunder Bluff. But the rest of the Horde would\'ve caved, eventually.', '', 75838, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38850, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did everything in my power. The whole world was his, he needed only seize it!', '', 75837, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38849, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That fool king!!', '', 75836, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38848, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kazdar said they knew of the prophecy... but how? This is disturbing news, indeed.', 75835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were there! Is it true then? What happened in Orgrimmar?', '', 75834, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 38847, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
