('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 75830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me, hero. Let us return to the Vale. There is someone I think who would be particularly interested in this turn of events, if we can get his attention.', '', 75829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever darkness it once exuded is silent at last.', '', 75828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My my - this is all that remains of the terrible being that haunted Pandaria all these years.', '', 75827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, hero!', '', 75826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Garrosh, son of Grom, will show you what it means to be called Hellscream!', '', 75825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NO... This world... Is my destiny... My destiny...', '', 75824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
