('Never interrupt an artist!', '', 75816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody beats Blackfuse. NOBODY!', '', 75815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
