('What can I buy with timeless coins?', 'What can I buy with timeless coins?', 75810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Falling to me would probably be the greatest achievement they could hope to obtain.', '', 75809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What else would you expect from those without valor?', '', 75808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, those cowards will likely sneak by rather than face my wrath.', '', 75807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the intruders come this way! I look forward to crushing their skulls.', '', 75806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hold some of the emperor\'s most prized possessions. Should you wish to curry favor with Shaohao, you may aid us by driving back the Ordon yaungol that seek to overtake the Celestial Court.', 'I hold some of the emperor\'s most prized possessions. Should you wish to curry favor with Shaohao, you may aid us by driving back the Ordon yaungol that seek to overtake the Celestial Court.', 75805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
