('For Warchief Garrosh!', 'For Warchief Garrosh!', 75782, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fall before the true Horde!', 'You will fall before the true Horde!', 75781, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears that this fishgorged crane suffered a violent death.$B$BThere are bites and claw marks all over its body and most of its viscera have been consumed.$B$BThis must be a favorite meal of something ravenous.', 'It appears that this fishgorged crane suffered a violent death.$B$BThere are bites and claw marks all over its body and most of its viscera have been consumed.$B$BThis must be a favorite meal of something ravenous.', 75780, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know what? I don\'t even want \'em. I like being able to float around freely.', '', 75779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really thought I\'d be more excited about this...', '', 75778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wicked! You found my body! Look at them old bones.', '', 75777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These outsiders have brought chaos to this land. Can we trust them to set it right?', '', 75776, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out. Invaders!', '', 75775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful. The demon will try to trick you.', '', 75774, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the cost... such a terrible cost.', '', 75773, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dear Emperor. It is done. The darkness that you once struggled against has been purged from Pandaria - forever.', '', 75772, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want the Iron Horde to crush us? Keep moving!', 'Do you want the Iron Horde to crush us? Keep moving!', 75771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde needs these supplies. Faster!', 'The Iron Horde needs these supplies. Faster!', 75770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put your back into it!', 'Put your back into it!', 75769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think this is a game, runt? Work harder!', 'You think this is a game, runt? Work harder!', 75768, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop working and I\'ll sacrifice you to the dark!', 'Stop working and I\'ll sacrifice you to the dark!', 75767, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Armageddon\"-class defense systems fully on-line. Here comes the explosions!', '', 75766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System\'s shutting down.  HEY DOES ANYONE KNOW IF ITS SUPPOSED TO BE DOING THIS?', '', 75765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_garrosh_empowered_whirling_corruption.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:144985|h[Empowered Whirling Corruption]|h|r!', '', 75764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a great day and don\'t let the door hit you on the way out.', '', 75763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_titankeeper_uncheckedcorruption.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:147011|h[Manifest Rage]|h|r!', '', 75762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Security system deactivated.  Welcome back Siegecrafter Blackfuse.', '', 75761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System resetting. Don\'t turn the power off, or the whole thing will probably explode.', '', 75760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Module 2\'s all prepared for system reset.', '', 75759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating system reset. Module 2 at 50%%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete.', '', 75758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Module 1\'s all prepared for system reset.', '', 75757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiating system reset. Module 1 at 50%%. Hey, system reset requires two modules to complete.', '', 75756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin-like typing detected, unlocking cache of riches and treasures.', '', 75755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activating GB-11010 \"Armageddon\"-class defense systems. Hey, does anybody know if we\'re zoned for this?', '', 75754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_garrosh_whirling_corruption.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:144985|h[Whirling Corruption]|h|r!', '', 75753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, now you did it, that was really really really not the correct input code.', '', 75752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Checking out the datas, hold on a second will ya.', '', 75751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we recording?  Yeah?  Okay.  Goblin-Titan control module starting up, please stand back.', '', 75750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to lend our aid. We can help you rebuild the Vale.', '', 75749, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 38017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Half of the Vale lies in ruin! These outsiders have been more destructive than the mantid and mogu combined!', '', 75748, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blame your companions!', '', 75747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one is unworthy of your group.', '', 75746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one is WEAK.', '', 75745, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve let your pride cloud your vision, Titan puppet! You can never contain ME!', '', 75744, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should bow to no king or warchief.', '', 75743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrogance feeds me!', '', 75742, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb to your pride!', '', 75741, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your arrogance compels you...', '', 75740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are better than your companions!', '', 75739, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So foolish...', '', 75738, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, face me. Give in to your pride. Show me your \"Greatness.\"', '', 75737, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accept this gift.', 'I accept this gift.', 75736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n. You have freed me from this cave, and I wish to thank you. Please, accept my gift and my humble gratitude.', 75735, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor our death $n!!', '', 75734, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed. The Shadow Council is nearby and with them, Gul\'dan. I can feel it.', '', 75733, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, commander. It is good to see you again.', '', 75732, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, farseer. We come on a matter of great urgency. $n, the savior of Wor\'gol, will vouch for us.', '', 75731, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 45015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar. I was just explaining the situation.', 75730, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44143, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please be swift and merciful. Those creatures are the true victims here.', 75729, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be wary... I suspect the stones will be heavily-guarded.', '', 75728, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell my story.', 'Tell my story.', 75727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been apprising the lorewalker of your deeds, champion. Are you ready to hear your tale?', '', 75726, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Imbeciles!', '', 75725, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal with the devilsaur first, then we\'ll lock the rest up!', '', 75724, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shock it until it can\'t move anymore!  It\'s causing a riot in here!', '', 75723, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s busting out of the cage!  Arm the shock collar, get that thing under control!', '', 75722, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know, I\'ve got a bad feeling. It\'s way too quiet in there.', '', 75721, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh, sounds like Malkorok just tore apart those intruders.', '', 75720, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely they... are worth fighting for.', '', 75719, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the greatest treasures in life.', '', 75718, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find peace within yourself, so that you may share it with the world around you.', '', 75717, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face your fears. Calm your hatreds.', '', 75716, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the question still remains... why do we fight?', '', 75715, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown Pandaria the power of a true hero.', '', 75714, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You triumphed over the darkness I had locked away.', '', 75713, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But as your war-fleets crashed upon our shores, all of my old doubts and fears rose up, to torment the land once again.', '', 75712, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Cataclysm struck, I decided the time had come to part the mists ... and help heal our broken world.', '', 75711, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For ten thousand years ... as the veil of mists kept Pandaria hidden from prying eyes.', '', 75710, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And there ... they remained.', '', 75709, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One by one, I overcame them - and buried them deep within the earth.', '', 75708, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A long time ago, this land was beset by the shadows of doubt, of fear, and hatred.', '', 75707, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not despair the damage that was done here.', '', 75706, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 39079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zooooooooom!', '', 75705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be difficult to recover from such a loss.', '', 75704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unexpected move.', '', 75703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have strength I didn\'t see at first.', '', 75702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A glass cannon sometimes breaks before it can fire.', '', 75701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the strongest ally can fall to draconic magic.', '', 75700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I warned you before, dragons are known for their deadly attacks.', '', 75699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n.  You picked your friends wisely and led them with honor.', '', 75698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I can win a battle like that, I may have a chance against the Celestials.', '', 75697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragons are dangerous at any size, as I\'m sure you\'ll find out.', '', 75696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eons have awakened me.', '', 75695, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ebbs and flows of battle are to be expected.', '', 75694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The river does not stop from a single stone.', '', 75693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My companion is dispersed.  She will flow back to me when the time is right.', '', 75692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleansed by the righteous waters!', '', 75691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone thinks itself unmovable until the ground is washed away beneath it.', '', 75690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so they are washed away with little trace of what once was.', '', 75689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rivers foretold of this defeat.', '', 75688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rivers foretold of this triumph.', '', 75687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As water cracks stone, so shall we be your undoing.', '', 75686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When one Shado-Pan falls, another steps forward to take his place.', '', 75685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory often requires sacrifice.', '', 75684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He fought and died with honor.', '', 75683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you survive with what remains?', '', 75682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You lack the necessary discipline.', '', 75681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly as I had planned.', '', 75680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It requires a cunning strategist indeed to defeat my monks.  Well done, $n.', '', 75679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impatience is the road to defeat, you must learn to master your timing.', '', 75678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be fooled by their diminutive size, $n, they are disciplined and quick.', '', 75677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oi, you\'ll pay for that one you will!', '', 75676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse my dwarven luck!', '', 75675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Not again!', '', 75674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fer a moment there, I thought we were in trouble.', '', 75673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, sorry, that fella\'s gunna need some tender lovin\' later.', '', 75672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha!  That worked better than I thought!', '', 75671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach, so much for being good with animals. Now how do these bandages work?', '', 75670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one\'s for you, Gizmo!', '', 75669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer lucky Gizmo couldn\'t be here, but I\'ll still wipe the floor with ye, $c.', '', 75668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fear cuts deeper than swords.', 75667, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep killing my pets and you may find a dash of poison in your drink tonight.', 75666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The things we love destroy us every time, $c, remember that.', 75665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You bastard, my pet may never walk again!', 75664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is so easy it would be boring -- if it weren\'t so much fun.', 75663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, was that one of your favorites?  My bad.', 75662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take the right opponent out and it\'s all downhill from there.', 75661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the Celestial Tournament, either you win or you die.', 75660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re lucky it was just your pets... this time.', 75659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, I hope you like surprises.', 75658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A worthy sacrifice?', '', 75657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When one virtue is lost, cling to those that remain.', '', 75656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die would be a wonderfully grand adventure.', '', 75655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like the stream meeting the cliff, there is beauty in the fall, if you know where to look.', '', 75654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat is merely a lesson masked by disappointment.', '', 75653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The autumn leaves must fall to make room for spring blossoms.', '', 75652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A worthy sacrifice.', '', 75651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have taught me much, $r.  It seems the master has again become the student.', '', 75650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today you have lost -- but what have you learned?', '', 75649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now face Patience!  Wisdom!  Knowledge!  What virtues do you possess, $n?', '', 75648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinos... dropping?  Dropping?', '', 75647, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you got on that team of yours, King Mukla?', '', 75646, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s, that\'s chaos theory.', '', 75645, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m, I\'m simply saying that life, uh... didn\'t find a way.', '', 75644, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pet had its shot, and nature selected it for extinction.', '', 75643, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead?  Don\'t you mean extinct?', '', 75642, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s so great about victory? It\'s a violent, penetrative act that scars what it explores. What you call victory... well, nevermind.', '', 75641, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gee, the lack of humility before nature that\'s being displayed here, uh... staggers me.', '', 75640, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were so preoccupied with whether or not you could win, you didn\'t stop to think if you should.', '', 75639, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe, uh, maybe you\'re ready for a lesson in chaos?', '', 75638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest for now, little friend.', '', 75637, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a glorious defeat!', '', 75636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew that was coming.', '', 75635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fortunate attack!', '', 75634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wind blows in my favor.', '', 75633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did he fight?  To die, apparently.', '', 75632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
