('What are the requirements to enter the Celestial Tournament?', 'What are the requirements to enter the Celestial Tournament?', 75470, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A legend is born!', '', 75469, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38106, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, and meet me at the Seat of Knowledge.', '', 75468, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38369, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To complete our great work, we will need a sacred place.', '', 75467, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38368, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thinking of trying to grow some crops here.$B$BCan you imagine what might happen if I planted an engima seed?', '', 75466, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few mortals possess such spirit, such power. Believe me - I have tested many!', '', 75465, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38367, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'d you like to make yourself useful and top me off?', '', 75464, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion... you\'ve done it...', '', 75463, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38366, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not a fighter. I grow vegetables and raise yaks.$B$BYou fight, I\'ll watch.', '', 75462, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been quite some time since I have been so at ease!', '', 75461, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must enjoy this time together before yet more conflict arrives on our doorsteps.', '', 75460, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see Niuzao healthy and strong.', '', 75459, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It good thing that this place is timeless. Ken-Ken hopes this never ends!', '', 75458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need drink! Drink! Be happy!', '', 75457, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody fighting in the good way. Everybody drinking. Everybody happy!', '', 75456, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel drawn to Chi-Ji. Maybe the Red Crane will impart some of its wisdom to me.', '', 75455, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I buy with Celestial Coins?', 'What can I buy with Celestial Coins?', 75454, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to enter the Celestial Tournament.', 'I\'d like to enter the Celestial Tournament.', 75453, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry boss...', '', 75452, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Celestial Tournament tests your leadership skills through pet battles with other contestants, and if you are successful enough, the children of the celestials.', '', 75451, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand up straight!', '', 75450, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After fighting the mogu, how much stronger could any other foes really be?', '', 75449, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thinking about jumping in the ring myself... just not right now.', '', 75448, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once a customer is done eating, the seat they were using will need to be cleaned. Just click on them and I\'ll go clean up.', 75447, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_titan_01.blp:20|t You have been blessed with |cFFF00000|Hspell:144359|h[Gift of the Titans]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_titan_01.blp:20|t You have been blessed with |cFFF00000|Hspell:144359|h[Gift of the Titans]|h|r!', 75446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with great skill and purpose. I hope to one day follow your path.', '', 75445, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight well, and bring honor to your people!', '', 75444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen anything like the water here. It speaks, but I know not what it says.', '', 75443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They say time does not affect this island. There must be many amazing things to find here!', 75442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think I could ever challenge one of the celestials.', 75441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is truly an honor to be in the presence of Xuen and the other celestials.', 75440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can learn much by watching others do battle.', '', 75439, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain vigilant, but do not forget to enjoy the finer things in life. Good food, good friends, and good drink!', '', 75438, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax. You are among friends.', '', 75437, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here to join in on the fun, I see!', '', 75436, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much adventure to be had on this isle!', '', 75435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mantid tried to follow me here.$B$BIt didn\'t end well for him.', '', 75434, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Players capture control of the North Tower Anti-Air Turret!', 'Players capture control of the North Tower Anti-Air Turret!', 75433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay true to yourself always, and your resolve will be that of a mighty glacier.', 75432, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is a serenity to this place. It is untainted by the wars that ravage the mainland.', 75431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it down! Stupid dog.', '', 75430, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fei Li needs to chill with all the fireworks.', 75429, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so nice to have a break from fighting the sha.', 75428, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This sure is exciting, isn\'t it?', 75427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see a good fight!', 75426, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m workin\' on a new invention that\'s goin\' to blow your mind!$B$BAnd probably maim other body parts.', '', 75425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two words: Ka-boom!$B$BAll I\'m sayin\' is that this shindig could benefit from a powder keg or two.', '', 75424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would\'ve thought this sort of place existed when we first saw Pandaria from Hellscream\'s Fist?', '', 75423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Want to give Kah Kah some of your shinies?$B$BThink of all the grookin\' Kah Kah could do with a weapon like that!', '', 75422, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' jinyu shouldn\'t be here!$B$B$n $n want help Kah Kah ook some jinyu?', '', 75421, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to fight celestials. Eh, wikket?$B$BKah Kah glad to watch, but not help.', '', 75420, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the warchief guide you to victory.', 75419, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we will be fortunate enough to watch an Alliance dog get torn limb from limb.', 75418, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After all the Alliance has done to the pandaren, they still allow them here!', 75417, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us see this day who defeats a celestial, and who is themselves defeated.', 75416, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is unfortunate that this is not a contest of brewing. Never have I seen so many brewmasters gathered at once!', 75415, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Facing the celestials will test your resolve, question your skills, and call forth your greatness.$B$BAre you prepared?', 75414, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why so surprised, $n?$b$bIt is as I have always told you. Pandaria is a wondrous land full of secrets and mysteries.', '', 75413, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many gathered here from many walks of life. Today, we are all equal as audience to these epic battles.', 75412, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A good battle always makes my adrenaline rush.', 75411, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My vigil never ends, but I cherish this short reprieve in my duty.', 75410, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why come they make me watch stupid dead wolves?...  no fair.', '', 75409, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody has fun but me.', '', 75408, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody understands me...', '', 75407, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who ever said fire can\'t be beautiful?', 75406, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is really heating up!', 75405, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn, baby, burn!', 75404, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower reinforcements will not abandon their post!', 'The tower reinforcements will not abandon their post!', 75403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n. Won\'t you try some of my hot noodle soup?', 'Hey there, $n. Won\'t you try some of my hot noodle soup?', 75402, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is remarkable, don\'t you think?', '', 75401, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_ability_rogue_sturdyrecuperate.blp:20|t The %s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:144563|h[Imprison]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_ability_rogue_sturdyrecuperate.blp:20|t The %s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:144563|h[Imprison]|h|r!', 75400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that.', '', 75398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too bad.  Now for a real pet.', '', 75397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My olfactory sensors detect a burning odor.', '', 75396, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your minion has been terminated.', '', 75395, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, I have quite an appetite today!', 'Wow, I have quite an appetite today!', 75394, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now get out there and make some noodle soup!', 75393, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Other customers are impatient, they won\'t wait as long; but are really happy when they are served quickly.', 75392, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful. I would not want you to fall into the arena.', '', 75391, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some customers are hungry, they\'ll want a second bowl after they finish their first.', 75390, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some tips: You can always tell what a customer wants by their outfit.', 75389, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once seated, a customer will wait a short while for you to deliver their noodle soup. As with waiting in line, be sure to get the customer their food before they decide to leave.', 75388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Customers will line up and wait for you to tell them to sit down. They will only wait for a short while before leaving so be sure to get them to a seat before they leave.', 75387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
