('The door barring the South Tower has been breached!', 'The door barring the South Tower has been breached!', 75327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grom\'gar. Built in the corpse of a colossus. Look at the size of that thing...', 75326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think Karg is out this far.', 75325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Grom\'gar is to the southeast. Look for the gigantic skeleton - you can\'t miss it.', 75324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will begin a solo scenario. Are you sure you wish to proceed?', 'This will begin a solo scenario. Are you sure you wish to proceed?', 75323, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to discover the secret ingredient in the Lin family\'s secret ingredient noodle soup!', 'I\'m ready to discover the secret ingredient in the Lin family\'s secret ingredient noodle soup!', 75322, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $n.', 75321, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell my story...', 'Tell my story...', 75320, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My troops are yours to command, my King.', 'My troops are yours to command, my King.', 75319, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do my best, Regent Lord. My troops are ready.', 'I will do my best, Regent Lord. My troops are ready.', 75318, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where it matters, hero. You may signal to me when you are ready to press the attack. Oh, and, do try to keep Lady Sylvanas in line, would you?', '', 75317, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many have to die before Garrosh\'s bloodlust is sated? It is with both shame and honor that I storm the walls of Orgrimmar, but I am glad to have you heroes at my side.', '', 75316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are, at the precipice of war. Signal to me when your troops are in order and I will issue the command to attack.', '', 75315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurrah for our new champions!  You have shown your own inner strength, and it is reflected in those you have raised.  They are lucky to have such a strong leader.  May the lessons of the Celestials light your way in the most trying of times.', '', 75314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall face off against the true visages of wisdom, strength, fortitude, and hope - the children of the Celestials themselves!  Be warned, they have power and abilities the likes of which have not been seen for generations.', '', 75313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you have raised your pets well, and beaten some of Pandaria\'s most seasoned and charismatic trainers.  But the trial is not over, oh no!', '', 75312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, you will face many trainers, who have honed their skills and proven themselves.  Will your pets tell the same story about you?  We shall see!  Good luck!', '', 75311, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In this trial, you will not be allowed to heal your pets.  One of the marks of a great leader is the ability to lead many subjects from many backgrounds, united under one banner.', '', 75310, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to a very special trial!  The wisdom of a leader is reflected in the greatness of his followers. Let us see if your training has truly inspired those you lead...', '', 75309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with the ferocity of a raging river.  Let us hope you do not run dry.', '', 75308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears we have more training to do.', '', 75307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do ye even HEAL an undead raccoon?', '', 75306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lone wolf dies but the pack survives.', 75305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have beaten me today, but you will need all the virtues to take on the Celestials.', '', 75304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I, uh, I need to rethink everything.  Everything!', '', 75303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $n.  You fight as well as I can drink!', '', 75302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Congratulations on your lucky win.  May your gift packages be filled with dead moles.', '', 75301, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you face the living waters and evade defeat?', '', 75300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My monks were shrunken by a troll witch doctor, and thus meet the size requirements for battle.  Do you wish to face them in combat?', '', 75299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never thought I was any good with animals \'til these little fellas started showin\' up.  So what do ye say, wanna fight?', '', 75298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you come to see my pretty face, or are you looking for a fight?', 75297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Celestial Tournament is nearly as old as Pandaria itself.  Many have come to test their mettle.  Shall we test yours?', '', 75296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pet battles are the most awesome force that Azeroth has ever seen, but I\'ve seen those that wield it like a kid that\'s found his father\'s crossbow.  What about you?', '', 75295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve brewed up a real fight if you think you can handle it.', '', 75294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the party, $n.  Would you like to receive a lesson in how to fight with minions?', '', 75293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godspeed, heroes. It will be an honor to fight alongside you in battle.', '', 75292, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
