('Indeed. After the Cataclysm, my flight\'s connection to the timeways forever changed.', '', 75184, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38872, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As would I! The presence of the Timeless Isle is proof that many things are possible beyond the boundaries of linear thinking.', '', 75183, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38871, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until recently this place was lost in the mists. Those few inhabitants who found themselves stranded here were forced to mint their own currency, immune to time distortion. It is the only way trade is possible.', '', 75182, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38870, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is frozen in this place. The island teems with life, yet somehow never changes.', '', 75181, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38869, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not know! That is precisely why I am here.', '', 75180, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38868, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pleasure.', '', 75179, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 38867, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I like the way you think!', '', 75178, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 38390, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh?', '', 75177, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38389, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would very much like to study such unique items.', '', 75176, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38388, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us again why this island is so unique?', '', 75175, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 38387, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kairoz! I want you to meet one of my most accomplished of agents.', '', 75174, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 38386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Juggernaut focuses a |cFFFF0404|Hspell:144918|h[Cutter Laser]|h|r on you!', '', 75173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief demands it!', '', 75172, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The overwhelming power!', '', 75171, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die... for the warchief... is... an... honor...', '', 75170, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand and FACE ME!', '', 75169, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true Horde cannot be STOPPED!', '', 75168, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power of the warchief will overwhelm you!', '', 75167, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness the might of the true Horde!', '', 75166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge the warchief?', '', 75165, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings!', '', 75164, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh gives me strength!', '', 75163, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never fail the warchief!', '', 75162, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim has failed us. Kor\'kron, destroy these intruders!', '', 75161, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you wish to defeat the corruption, you will first need to purify the corruption within yourselves.', '', 75160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand tall and proud atop your accomplishments, and this will be your downfall.', '', 75159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... It looks like these bunnies are to blame for the sickness that is spreading around.', 'Hold still. More help should arrive soon.', 75158, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from me with those things!', '', 75157, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re certain the Shadow Council is involved, but we\'ve yet to pinpoint them.', 75153, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been scouting the dunes. A demonic force has infected some of the beasts.', 75152, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Khadgar will join us on the way. Come, Throm\'var lies just over the ridge.', 75151, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew it. You should\'ve stayed back at the garrison, Archmage.', 75150, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warsong will NEVER surrender!', '', 75149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. I had that handled. Cool as a cucumber.', '', 75148, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 45001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... is a good death.', '', 75145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember when we compelled the All-Seeing Eye to spy upon the Shadow Council?', 'Remember when we compelled the All-Seeing Eye to spy upon the Shadow Council?', 75144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just look at this place! An entire ecology secluded, cut off from all known timelines!$b$bIt is rare for one such as I to be surprised by, well, anything really. I shall relish every moment I spend here.', '', 75143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I could have used... some enhancements... of my own...', '', 75142, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, dead already?  I wonder if a session of micro-sonic deep-gene probing can reanimate them...', '', 75141, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curses!  More data lost to an untimely death.', '', 75140, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Natural evolution takes far too long. Here, let me help you along...', '', 75139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! They are alive!', '', 75138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... new test subjects!', '', 75137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They made it this far? I told you the others needed some micro-sonic genetic alterations.', '', 75136, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought Wakener.  We will meet again...', '', 75135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did warn you, Wakener.', '', 75134, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch how I soar!', '', 75133, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a leaf on the wind!', '', 75132, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will carry you one last time Wakener... to your doom!', '', 75131, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look brothers, the Wakener is here!', '', 75130, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never discovered... how to put a stopper... in death...', '', 75129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing the proper mixture can\'t handle.', '', 75128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My alchemy is supreme!', '', 75127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All reactions begin with the proper catalyst.', '', 75126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many wonderful varieties, which concoction shall I give you?', '', 75125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to try my new concoctions, Wakener?  I assure you these are nothing like you\'ve tasted before.', '', 75124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Mantid serve a power far greater than they or their gods.', '', 75123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunter... becomes... the hunted....', '', 75122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target practice has ended.', '', 75121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another kill, another trophy!', '', 75120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My intelligence suggests this one is a high-value target.', '', 75119, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... a target of great importance.', '', 75118, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a little target practice.', '', 75117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come children of the Titans, you face the Paragons.', '', 75116, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pandaren legend is born! Sing praises to our new hero, $n!', '', 75115, 0, 22592, 0, 71, 0, 38119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kovok... come to me... I need...', '', 75114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the feast begin!', '', 75113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fitting meal for my children.', '', 75112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is only one way to find out.', '', 75111, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zor\'lok wasn\'t the only one with a strong voice.', '', 75110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind has grown weak since we last met.', '', 75109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come little Kunchongs, it\'s feeding time!', '', 75108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It matters not, the Old One will not suffer their intrusion.', '', 75107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return me to the amber...', '', 75106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How will the story end?', '', 75105, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We remain unscathed.', '', 75104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Usurpers abandoned you.', '', 75103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Old One grants us strength.', '', 75102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The amber protects us.', '', 75101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You now face the Prime. Bow down to your superior!', '', 75100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have endured the Usurpers, their children, the loss of the Old One, and soon... you.', '', 75099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My calculations, incorrect? Perhaps another 800 years...', '', 75098, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So easily solved, you are not so complicated after all!', '', 75097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I predicted that to be a likely outcome.', '', 75096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see many threes repeating...', '', 75095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An interesting commonality, now to exploit it!', '', 75094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, champion! Collect your well-earned reward!', '', 75093, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about a game?', '', 75092, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaos is order unrecognized by a lesser mind!', '', 75091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How illogical, did they not hear your warning Kil\'ruk?', '', 75090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overwhleming power. Use it to heal or destroy! To protect or annihilate!', '', 75089, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse this chitinous shell, I was not fast enough!', '', 75088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look how they fall, like so many blades of grass in the wind.', '', 75087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much too slow.', '', 75086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold! Latent titan power, imbued with my own draconic essence, tempered by the wisdom of the pandaren celestials.', '', 75085, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See Kil\'ruk? Speed is king!', '', 75084, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, please think carefully about the legacy you will leave behind.', '', 75083, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Muahahahahaha!', '', 75082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ache with power!', '', 75081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You move too slowly, how does your kind catch any prey?', '', 75080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will slay you all as easily as we slew the Pandaren of old.', '', 75079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An agent of destruction, forged by my will to forever change the face of Azeroth.', '', 75078, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avenge me, brothers!', '', 75077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another notch for my blade.', '', 75076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast on the blood of our enemies!', '', 75075, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us stop for a moment - what kind of hero are we talking about?', '', 75074, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will drink your blood!', '', 75073, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then the Old One will remake this world for the Mantid!', '', 75072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 38677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('POWER acquired for WAR and CONQUEST!', '', 75071, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, knowledge uncovered for the benefit of the world.', '', 75070, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One by one the secrets of an ancient empire were laid bare.', '', 75069, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the mighty Thunder King fell before our champion\'s might.', '', 75068, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A faction standard-bearer, beloved by the people and feared by their foes.', '', 75067, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When war came to Pandaria\'s shores, our hero was ready.', '', 75066, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight with spirit of the pack in your blood and the fire of love in your heart. Precious gifts. Do not waste them.', '', 75065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their power and wisdom seized for a greater glory!', '', 75064, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Makar.', 75063, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will show Fenris the Hunter there are yet jaws he cannot muzzle.', '', 75062, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mantid and mogu alike were brought low by the hero\'s fury.', '', 75061, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rally the strongest of our riders from Stonefang. Find us where the giant\'s shadow meets the mountain of fury.', '', 75060, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Venturing into forgotten vaults...', '', 75059, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must we use the word, \"Conquer?\"', '', 75058, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 75057, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conquering a strange new land!', '', 75056, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, and I would not try.', '', 75055, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An outsider, from beyond the mists!', '', 75054, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am going to Thunderfall, shaman. I will free Karg or die trying.', 75053, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It starts with a hero.', '', 75052, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Asha. \"Open sky.\" She will be fine. She is strong, like you.', '', 75051, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaren will tell this tale for generations!', '', 75050, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Makar! I told you not to call me that anymore...', 75049, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You run fast, Little Paw, and kill for your love. But you must think also of the pack. And of your own safety.', '', 75048, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait wait wait - let me make sure I get the story right.', '', 75047, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 38108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, of course! My old friend from the Jade Forest!', '', 75046, 0, 16604, 0, 71, 0, 38107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! My champion arrives!', '', 75045, 0, 16604, 0, 71, 0, 38370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You push yourself too hard, Little Paw.', '', 75044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so sorry, Asha. If only I had trained more... if only I\'d been faster.', 75043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was here... I let them slip away.', 75042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 75041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light will not suffer your taint.', '', 75040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the pure of heart may pass!', '', 75039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 75038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be purified in the light!', '', 75037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face your inner demons!', '', 75036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look inside yourself and cleanse the darkness within.', '', 75035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The light cleanses; but it is not gentle.  Gird yourselves and be purified!', '', 75034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:142842|h[Breath of Y\'Shaarj]|h|r!', '', 75033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
