('Very well, I will create a field to keep your corruption quarantined.', '', 75031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to me again when you are prepared to face your inner demons.', '', 75030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you pass this door, at this time, you would fail!  You, all of you, are corrupted with the insiduous plague known as Pride.', '', 75029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to purge the corruption?', '', 75028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
