('NO! I will feed your bones to her pups!!!', '', 75022, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away sir.', 'Right away sir.', 75021, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go tell Aklana Swifthoof the fight is getting out of control.', 'Go tell Aklana Swifthoof the fight is getting out of control.', 75020, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there.', 'You there.', 75019, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What should we do?', 'What should we do?', 75018, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Iron Horde continue to attack from the south.', 'The Iron Horde continue to attack from the south.', 75017, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begin the ritual.', 'Begin the ritual.', 75016, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. I\'ll take it back to the outpost and see that it\'s secured.', 75015, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work is vital to the world.', '', 75014, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 41913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still. More help should arrive soon.', 'Hold still. More help should arrive soon.', 75013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s go, Sky! After them!', 75012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Swiftly, Asha! After them!', 75011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll run them down. Catch up to us when you can!', 75010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not a child to cower beneath your cape, Cordana.', '', 75009, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 44993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In here.', 75008, 7, 0, 0, 68, 0, 0, 44119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going ahead to the demon\'s lair. We\'ll capture it together.', 75003, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'d be easier to guard you if you stayed out of sight, Khadgar.', 75002, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 44123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break the chains.', 'Break the chains.', 75001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Gana strains to look around, then speaks in a hushed whisper.>$B$BAre... are they gone?', 75000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SEE YOU!', '', 74999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho... the outsiders... THEY did this... we should never have let them in...', '', 74998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Cough cough* Nyyyunnngggg...', '', 74997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! You\'re alive. I brought help.', '', 74996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will find help!  Try to hold off the Sha for as long as you can!', '', 74995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t speak, friend, I will take you to the healers.', '', 74994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taran Zhu!', '', 74993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Please let us pass!', '', 74992, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 38143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Further corruption?  No, we are here to stop the corruption, and save Pandaria!', '', 74991, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 38142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my!  What is this?  Hello!  I am Lorewalker Cho!', '', 74990, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 38141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the chamber ahead, under our peaceful land, slept the heart of an Old God.', '', 74989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It must have been hidden away long before recorded history.  And with good reason!', '', 74988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astounding! Another chamber that looks to originate from these \"Titans.\"', '', 74987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your souls become one with the land you gave your life to protect.', '', 74986, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be at peace, dear friends.', '', 74985, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a fate far worse than death - please, heroes!  Set their souls free!', '', 74984, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOO!', '', 74983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 36, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. This sha energy has trapped their spirits here, to endlessly relive their failure. It feeds on their despair.', '', 74982, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes!  Rook Stonetoe!  You remember me!  What has happened to you?', '', 74981, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Golden Lotus... they pledged their lives to defend this place.', '', 74980, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can it be...? Oh no, no no no no no.', '', 74979, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 38131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take much time for the Vale to heal, but you have given us hope!', '', 74978, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel their life-giving energies flow through you?', '', 74977, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 38129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you have done it!  The waters are pure once more.', '', 74976, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a foul, foul thing - destroy it, before it seeps deep into the soil and corrupts all of Pandaria!', '', 74975, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, the malignance of the Old God has manifested itself within the waters.', '', 74974, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is these waters that kept the Vale in bloom.  Their runoff into the Valley of the Four Winds created the most fertile farmland in the world!', '', 74973, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 38125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once, the Titans used these life-giving waters to create and shape all life in Pandaria.', '', 74972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, let us see what other horrors Garrosh has unleashed upon our land.', '', 74971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land is scarred, the ever-blooming trees and plants wither and die as the water from the pools drains away.', '', 74970, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 38122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, what has become of the Vale?', '', 74969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, we adventure together again, except this time I am afraid that the circumstances are much more dire.', '', 74968, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 38120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free yourself of arrogance.', '', 74966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be humble.', '', 74965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... must... contain... it...', '', 74964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It did not matter. It comes.  Steel your hearts and prepare your souls.', '', 74963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The corruption is amplifying.  The fragments must be purged before it becomes too great.', '', 74962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can get back to the outpost from here. Find me if you need leatherworking!', 74961, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. Mother must be worried sick about me!', 74960, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhh... not so loud!', 74959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been judged, and proven yourselves worthy. But be warned, what lies beyond will try your souls to their utmost.  When you are fully prepared, you may enter the chamber.', '', 74958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQEEEE!!', '', 74957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rage is power!', '', 74956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Read the scroll.', 'Read the scroll.', 74954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An old scroll covered in various pandaren pictograms. You suspect that unless the sha corruption in the temple is cleansed you won\'t be able to peruse the contents further.', '', 74953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the rumors are true, you should be able to find Jewel Danio here. $b$b<Ben marks a spot on your map.>$b$b', '', 74950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some terrible things have happened in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, but the real tragedy is that it\'s no longer a good place for fishing. All that Jewel Danio! Gone!  $b $bFortunately for you, I\'ve heard of an island off the eastern coast where you can still fish Jewel Danio. If the rumors are correct, you should be able to find a lake full of them there.', '', 74949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a storm of pain!', 'I am a storm of pain!', 74946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38283, 38283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay for your crimes!', 'Pay for your crimes!', 74945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38272, 38272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste my axe!', 'Taste my axe!', 74944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38271, 38271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I, Gamon, will save us!', 'I, Gamon, will save us!', 74943, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 38282, 38282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ends here!', 'This ends here!', 74942, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 38281, 38281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For every orc that struck me, I will cleave a thousand of their skulls!', '', 74941, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But never again.', '', 74940, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 38279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many times have I fallen at the hands of an Orc, and many times have I risen again.', '', 74939, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 38278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may be bruised and beaten, but the hatred boils inside me.', '', 74938, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 38277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrnngg... thank you...', '', 74937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on ahead, friend. I will catch up. I just need a moment to regain my strength.', '', 74936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but she is the hunter, not the quarry. And ahead of the pack as usual...', '', 74935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could hear Lokra... moments ago...', '', 74934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hngg... huh? I could hear Lokra... moments ago...', '', 74933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will see you on the inside, $p. Spirits guide you. Orgrock, lend me a hand if you will.', 74931, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am getting him out of here.', 74930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji, I am so sorry, we can be together now, please, let us just go back to the turtle, please do not die.', 74929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji... I am sorry...', 74928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji! No! I will kill you!', 74927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have practically beaten him unconscious! I have to do something!', 74926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, Ji! They are going to execute him!', 74925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji must be in here somewhere, I have to find him!', 74924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, if you won\'t talk, you won\'t need your head anymore.', '', 74923, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 39053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see this burning candle? You have until it burns out to tell us about the Pandaren artifacts! Now start talking!', '', 74922, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 39052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have anything to say for yourself, Pandaren?', '', 74921, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 39051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back in line!', '', 74920, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 39049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack them!', '', 74919, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 39048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shut up!', '', 74918, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 39047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I owe you my life!', 74917, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 39045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We didn\'t want to do this!', 74916, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 39044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, let us go!', 74915, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 39043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, find my babies!', 74914, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 38570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so sorry!', 74913, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 38569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I.. I can\'t... they took my children!', 74912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it is. The carcass. I... I don\'t think I can go with you in there. My arm will not stop shaking and it is as if the land itself is screaming in my mind.', 74911, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirits save me but it is cold. My lungs feel like they are on fire.', 74910, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are also notorious for etching down their favorite tactics on armbands. I assume they are either bragging or failing to remember.', 74909, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Thunderlord are fools for the most part, but they understand combat with giants.', 74908, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirits of the wind, lend us your speed.', 74907, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s gone.', '', 74906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Lighting Fuse...', 'Lighting Fuse...', 74905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve walked into your own grave, pup.', '', 74904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have not slept in weeks, and my mind is filled with a screaming that no one else seems to hear.$b$bWhat kind of shaman is unable to lift her own totem? How can I claim Ga\'nar is wrong if when I hoist my own axes my arms buckle? I am not fit for war, I am not fit as a shaman.$b$bI must find what the spirits purpose is for me. Only their guidance can set me on the right path now. They obviously have a plan or I would not have access to my powers as a shaman anymore.', 74903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dropped your totem?', 'Dropped your totem?', 74902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I dropped my totem.', 74901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you out here?', 'Why are you out here?', 74900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome. [Vignette Reward Here]', 'You are welcome. [Vignette Reward Here]', 74899, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving us from the Pale, $n. I shudder to think what horrors might have been in store for us.', 'Thank you for saving us from the Pale, $n. I shudder to think what horrors might have been in store for us.', 74898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not your friend!!!!', '', 74897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE $C!!', '', 74896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wildhammer Shaman places a Resistance Totem to aid you!', '', 74895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! We owe you one!', '', 74894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here! Please let us out! They key is around here somewhere!', '', 74893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doyo\'da places a Resistance Totem to aid you!', '', 74892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanks mon, we won\'t be forgettin dis!', '', 74891, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey mon, help us out! Find da key!', '', 74890, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 38937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh will not tolerate demon worship within the walls of Orgrimmar. You will submit and allow yourselves to be taken into custody or be destroyed.', 74889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I can\'t! I won\'t!', '', 74888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see if you are so defiant after we start breaking your bones.', '', 74887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh demands the wealth you\'ve accumulated.  You will give me access to your vaults!', '', 74886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh will not tolerate failure.  AGAIN!', 'Garrosh will not tolerate failure.  AGAIN!', 74885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! Again!', 'Good! Again!', 74884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-alah, commander.', 74883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think twice before you fight the might of the Kor\'kron.', 'Think twice before you fight the might of the Kor\'kron.', 74881, 0, 8525, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you\'re planning, these Kor\'kron will be ready when you strike.', 'I know what you\'re planning, these Kor\'kron will be ready when you strike.', 74880, 0, 8525, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ll thank me for being hard on them when the battle starts.', 'They\'ll thank me for being hard on them when the battle starts.', 74879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s up to me to ensure these Kor\'kron are ready.', 'It\'s up to me to ensure these Kor\'kron are ready.', 74878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stench that surrounds your kind is overwhelming.  You will pay with all the others who commune with demonkind.', 74877, 0, 18181, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will root out all corruption within Orgrimmar.', 74876, 0, 22210, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These warlocks will suffer for their demonic pacts.', 74875, 0, 22210, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lash him to the tree!', 'Lash him to the tree!', 74874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking forward to gutting this one.', 'I\'m looking forward to gutting this one.', 74873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve finally captured this tauren.', 'We\'ve Finally captured this tauren.', 74872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not with the rebellion, are you?', 'You\'re not with the rebellion, are you?', 74871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m keeping my eye on you $r.', 'I\'m keeping my eye on you $r.', 74870, 0, 8525, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These rebels are nothing.  Garrosh will stomp them beneath his heel.', 'These rebels are nothing.  Garrosh will stomp them beneath his heel.', 74869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true Horde will triumph.', 'The true Horde will triumph.', 74868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da greater enemy be Garrosh, not da Alliance.', '', 74867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall be me brother, I hope he be safe.', '', 74866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
