('Witness the power of the True Horde\'s arsenal!', '', 74707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people should have taken this world long ago, during the First War. But they fell to corruption.  In their weakness, they allowed the pitiful races of Azeroth to join the horde.  I will succeed where they have failed, and no power in this world can stop me!', '', 74706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you wish to face off against a real Orc Warchief.  So be it.', '', 74705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool. My Dark Shaman have twisted and tortured the elements for miles around. They cannot hear you now. Once again you prove too weak and powerless to do anything.', '', 74704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are an Orc no longer, and speak for none but yourself. You betrayed our people to forge your fragile alliances, and I will take great pleasure in tearing them apart.', '', 74703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Orcish Horde, the True Horde.  We die, bloody and thrashing on the field of battle, like true orcs SHOULD.', '', 74702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Do you remember nothing of Honor? Of glory on the battlefield?  You who would parlay with the humans, who allowed warlocks to practice their dark magics right under our feet.  You are weak.', '', 74701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never powerless Garrosh. And never alone.', '', 74700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then you have forced my hand.  I will correct the mistake I made long ago.  Spirits of the wind, the earth, the water, hear my call!  Come to my aid!', '', 74699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not too late, Garrosh. Lay down the mantle of Warchief. We can end this here, now, with no more bloodshed.', '', 74698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TIME TO DRINK ALL THE  STUFF.', '', 74697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Pandaren Treasure Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Pandaren Treasure Noodle Cart!', 74696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Pandaren Treasure Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Pandaren Treasure Noodle Cart!', 74695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Deluxe Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Deluxe Noodle Cart!', 74694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Deluxe Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Deluxe Noodle Cart!', 74693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Noodle Cart!', 74692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has set up a Noodle Cart!', '$n has set up a Noodle Cart!', 74691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Copying', 'Copying', 74690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drek\'Thar! I don\'t know what you are doing up there but it is angering the goren to no end.', 74689, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 41780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfinished weapons begin to roll out on the assembly line.', 'Unfinished weapons begin to roll out on the assembly line.', 74677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More! More!', '', 74676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another round!', '', 74675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I heard you like mines, so... enjoy!', '', 74674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s nods at his foes.', '', 74673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You too have failed.', 74672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not... my friend...', '', 74671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t... think you\'ve won...', '', 74670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The SD-5 Automated Shredder defense unit. A labor of love.', '', 74669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Start the assembly line!', '', 74668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya\' ever wonder how magnets work?', '', 74666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet the LT-403 Evaporation laser. A personal point of pride.', '', 74665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s better than a bomb, huh?! I\'ll tell ya - a bomb with two bombs inside!', '', 74664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Presenting... the beautiful new ST-03 Shockwave missile turret!', '', 74663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another satisfied customer.', '', 74661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s for the Juggernaut.', '', 74660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like I\'m in the market for a new assistant.', '', 74659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_monk_ringofpeace:20|t%s calls upon |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143955|h[Misery, Sorrow, and Gloom]|h|r!', '', 74658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, Shanna. You\'re up.', '', 74657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggron! Show \'em who\'s boss!', '', 74656, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 38451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_deadliness:20|t%s creates a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143840|h[Mark of Anguish]|h|r!', '', 74655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goro\'dan! You\'re on deck!', '', 74654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_typhoon:20|t%s enters a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143559|h[Dark Meditation]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_typhoon:20|t%s enters a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143559|h[Dark Meditation]|h|r!', 74653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s enters a meditative pose to heal his wounds.', '', 74652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay strong, $c.  Hold on tightly to those you love.  We never know how long any of us will have for this world.', '', 74651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve made so many sacrifices, and our fight lingers on. These battles have a way of wearing away at my spirit...', 74650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, $n, but I\'m not really up for talking.  Leave me in peace.', '', 74649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s signals for help.', '', 74648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sun... He... aid me.', '', 74647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook fight!', '', 74646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
