('Feeling... better now... Thank you... little friend.', '', 74638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 38717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We return to when we lost our way. You... are very kind.', 74637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have not fulfilled our oath!', 74636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will you succeed where we have failed?', 74635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protectors, come to my aid!', 74634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will suffer from our failure.', 74633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must redeem the Vale.', 74632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 38418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our prayers have been answered!', '', 74631, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 38932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just open this door.', '', 74630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength of my clan will be with you. I swear it.', '', 74629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 39141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
