('Stop, my brothers! Do you not see the beast of burden before you?', '', 74383, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 38927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic... it burns ... AUUUUGGGHHHHHH!', '', 74382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... KILL ME...', '', 74381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This warrior died from several puncture marks across his body. He was positioned in a ceremonious and caring fashion before set ablaze.', '', 74380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll carve right through them if we have to.', '', 74379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! Thunderlord filth. Not enough room for all of them in that carcass they call home?', '', 74378, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar, the Thunderlord clan trains their hunters in the canyon this time year.', '', 74377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s ride!', '', 74371, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we take vengeance on the beast who killed Garad!', '', 74370, 0, 0, 4, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scorpar are at bay and our mounts are ready, old friend.', '', 74369, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers! Today, we do what Durotan will not!', '', 74368, 0, 0, 5, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrgh... K-... KILL THEM!!', '', 74367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your father MAY be able to identify what\'s left of your tiny skull.', '', 74366, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 44088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you beg like a good dog, my father may-', '', 74365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come sniffing for a place among the Thunderlords? Hrah hah hah!', '', 74364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or did you like it so much the first time you decided to come back for more?', '', 74363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar? Is that you? I thought we killed you already.', '', 74362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 46952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold!', '', 74361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls green catalyst around the room!', '', 74360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls purple catalyst around the room!', '', 74359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls orange catalyst around the room!', '', 74358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls yellow catalyst around the room!', '', 74357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls red catalyst around the room!', '', 74356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xaril hurls blue catalyst around the room!', '', 74355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_pathofthedevout:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143497|h[Bond of the Golden Lotus]|h|r.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_priest_pathofthedevout:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143497|h[Bond of the Golden Lotus]|h|r.', 74354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The carcass looks fresh and largely un-carved, with the exception of six careful incisions on the belly.$B$BBehind each incision you find a large cavity where some critical organ may once have been housed.', '', 74353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rifleman', 'Rifleman', 74352, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me money for cool things', '', 74351, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_racial_avatar.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143594|h[Berserker Stance]|h|r!', '', 74350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_defensivestance.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143593|h[Defensive Stance]|h|r!', '', 74349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_offensivestance.blp:20|t General Nazgrim assumes a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143589|h[Battle Stance]|h|r!', '', 74348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such... power...', '', 74347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am proud, but I admit you bested me, brother. I wish to learn more of your strength. We shall rejoin you.', '', 74346, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Why have you come? Was it for your precious wolf pups? Their flesh is mine!', '', 74345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your corpse will be of great use to me. Hair, flesh, and bone. So many concoctions I could make.', '', 74344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and try not to die. Scorpar are unkind to corpses.', '', 74343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still alive, pup? I guess I won\'t have to save you after all. Come, we should talk.', '', 74342, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, brother. I would welcome you with open arms.', '', 74341, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost? How could this be?', '', 74340, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t belong here! Urtok is going to teach you a lesson about strength!', '', 74339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar!', '', 74338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess you aren\'t a pushover.', '', 74337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I yield.', '', 74336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come stand with us, brother. Join your forces with us. There is much work to be done.', '', 74335, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THAT is what makes the Frostwolves strong.', '', 74334, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a family, Ga\'nar. Family stands together.', '', 74333, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strength that comes from protecting the ones you love.', '', 74332, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up, brother. I need you. This clan needs you.', '', 74331, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance does not make our clan strong.', '', 74330, 0, 0, 6, 71, 0, 45209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who cannot stand... deserve... to... die! [PH - Targets Draka and is about to charge.]', '', 74329, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her presence defiles Frostwolf honor. The other clans will spit upon us.', '', 74328, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chieftain.', '', 74327, 0, 0, 2, 71, 0, 44075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End it.', '', 74326, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 44074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father chose wrong. This clan needs strength!', '', 74325, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 44073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vengeance neither feeds nor protects our clan. Do you not see why father chose me as his heir when our eldest brother went missing?', '', 74324, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Family looks to its own! Only I cared to avenge our father\'s death!', '', 74323, 0, 0, 15, 71, 0, 44072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must not do this! You are family!', 74322, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 0, 44699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has come to this.', '', 74320, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are no Chieftain of mine, brother. By my rights as second son, by the justice I have dealt today, I declare mak\'gora.', '', 74319, 0, 0, 274, 71, 0, 44071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fool crusade left us exposed to attack. Many died.', '', 74318, 0, 0, 25, 71, 0, 45204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have slain the sons of the Iron Wolf. He drowns in the blood of his own.', '', 74317, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 44070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar! It is about time you returned. What grisly trophies are these?', '', 74316, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 45203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shawaterelemental_reform.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143469|h[Reforms]|h|r!', '', 74315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\sha_spell_fire_blueflamestrike:20|t%s focuses her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143602|h[Meditation Spikes]|h|r at $n!', 74314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A frostwolf pup excitedly nips at your ankles before falling in step with your stride.', '', 74313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shawaterelemental_split.blp:20|t%s |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143020|h[Splits]|h|r!', '', 74312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:143309|h[Swirl]|h|r!', '', 74311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I can\'t decide between Horde and Alliance. Horde has goblin mages with quad-pigtails but Alliance has dwarf priests with twirly braids.', '[%s] confesses: I can\'t decide between Horde and Alliance. Horde has goblin mages with quad-pigtails but Alliance has dwarf priests with twirly braids.', 74308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I care more about transmogrification gear than upgrade gear.', '[%s] confesses: I care more about transmogrification gear than upgrade gear.', 74307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I always sell all of my old gear to the same vendor. Dude\'s rich or something.', '[%s] confesses: I always sell all of my old gear to the same vendor. Dude\'s rich or something.', 74306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: When pandaren tell me to slooow doooown, I just want to punch them.', '[%s] confesses: When pandaren tell me to slooow doooown, I just want to punch them.', 74305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I inspect others to see if they are inspecting me.', '[%s] confesses: I inspect others to see if they are inspecting me.', 74304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I always ask someone else how to reforge my gear.', '[%s] confesses: I always ask someone else how to reforge my gear.', 74303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I get heart of the wild and the other heart of the wild confused.', '[%s] confesses: I get heart of the wild and the other heart of the wild confused.', 74302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I don\'t use the strongest battle pets. Just the cutest ones.', '[%s] confesses: I don\'t use the strongest battle pets. Just the cutest ones.', 74301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: When my allies get mind controlled, I try really hard to kill them.', '[%s] confesses: When my allies get mind controlled, I try really hard to kill them.', 74300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want?', '', 74299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to be on a racing ram to receive a keg! Return to Ram Master Ray and ask for another.', '', 74298, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to be on a racing ram to receive a keg! Return to Neill Ramstein and ask for another.', '', 74297, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to interrupt my magiks?', '', 74296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooo! You fool! The ritual grows... out of... control...', '', 74295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have another racing ram?', 'May I have another racing ram?', 74294, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bones of the Ancient Clefthoof stir to life!', '', 74293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But then, Ga\'nar has always put his own needs before the clan.', '', 74292, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear the cost of Ga\'nar\'s impatience will be Frostwolf blood.', '', 74291, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry. This hero will convince Ga\'nar to return. Your brother values strength, and my friend possesses that in abundance.', '', 74290, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 46371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Line Deleted] Help him, $p. You will not be able to turn him from his path of vengeance, and it is dangerous to try.', '', 74289, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar\'s impatience could tear the Frostwolves apart. It is just like my brother to put his own needs above the clan.', '', 74288, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 45234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valn can aid you.\n\nSeek him out on the south side of Azure Watch.', 'Valn can aid you.\n\nSeek him out on the south side of Azure Watch.', 74287, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Saren, in the Falconwing Square inn.\n\nYou\'ll find him upstairs, near the kitchens.', 'Look for Saren, in the Falconwing Square inn.\n\nYou\'ll find him upstairs, near the kitchens.', 74286, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Iranis Shadebloom.\n\nYou\'ll find him inside the inn, on the main floor.', 'Seek out Iranis Shadebloom.\n\nYou\'ll find him inside the inn, on the main floor.', 74285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Runda.\n\nShe\'s usually just north of the barracks entrance.', 'Look for Runda.\n\nShe\'s usually just north of the barracks entrance.', 74284, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want Nedric Sallow, in the inn.\n\nHe\'s just to the right of the stairs down.', 'You want Nedric Sallow, in the inn.\n\nHe\'s just to the right of the stairs down.', 74283, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll want ta seek out Wembil Taskwidget, just along the south road.\n\nHe can help ye with any profession ye\'re interested in!', 'Ye\'ll want ta seek out Wembil Taskwidget, just along the south road.\n\nHe can help ye with any profession ye\'re interested in!', 74282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you hear the howling winds? It is a lonely sound. Make no mistake - if you are not careful, the land will claim you for its own.', '', 74281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That green skin of yours marks you as the aberration you are. You are no more orc than the filth at the bottom of this pit.', '', 74280, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More corrupted filth. As if this scorpar infestation were not enough.', '', 74279, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar, we caught Durotan\'s green orc tracker that has been tracking us.', '', 74278, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still demon. At this range it wouldn\'t take much to pierce that armor.', '', 74277, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah. Let me show you what I think of my brother\'s \"message\".', '', 74276, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan must have sent $Ghim:her; for a reason.', '', 74275, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More vermin come to infest our sacred grounds.', '', 74274, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ga\'nar, we caught Durotan\'s tracker.', '', 74273, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still pup. At this range it wouldn\'t take much to pierce that armor.', '', 74272, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My thanks for your assistance, champions. I will tend to the slain and wounded here before returning to Ironforge.', 74271, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to heal himself with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:141423|h[Hekima\'s Wisdom]|h|r.', '', 74270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s detects a cluster of injured enemies and goes into a  |cFFFF0404|Hspell:143440|h[Blood Frenzy]|h|r!', '', 74269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urtharges\' death severely wounds the remaining elementals!', 'Urtharges\' death severely wounds the remaining elementals!', 74268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('+10 Artifact Bonus!', '+10 Artifact Bonus!', 74267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('+5 Artifact Bonus!', '+5 Artifact Bonus!', 74266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFE1CF7|Hspell:139267|h[Reliquary Pick]|h|r Special artifacts revealed!', '|cFFFE1CF7|Hspell:139267|h[Reliquary Pick]|h|r Special artifacts revealed!', 74265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out Lien Farner. He\'ll be able to train you in any profession.', 'Seek out Lien Farner. He\'ll be able to train you in any profession.', 74264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!', '', 74263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frostwolves! Kill the gronn! Find the coward!', '', 74262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 44105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hatock, son of the Iron Wolf! I come for your head.', '', 74261, 0, 0, 53, 69, 0, 44104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You good, $r! We gonna crush Garrosh\'s army wit\' dis!', '', 74260, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More supplies! De Alliance be like a machine. Soon we cut our way through Garrosh\'s goons... A lotta orcs done picked the wrong side.', '', 74259, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dese be strange times... Thanks, $r. We gonna spill a lot of Kor\'kron blood wit\' dis.', '', 74258, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This\'ll keep da rebellion around a little longer. Orgrimmar will fall!', '', 74257, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, $r. Many Kor\'kron gonna die thanks to ya help.', '', 74256, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin sees his opportunity slipping away. He holds up his hands.>$b$bWait now, $r! Orgrimmar be a fortress. My people, we ain\'t gonna crack dat nut on our own. How long we gonna last out here? Days? Weeks? Vol\'jin can\'t say.$b$bYou keep da supplies comin\', an\' I promise, more Kor\'kron gonna die. Before ya troops even land! The blood bein\' spilt ain\'t even ya own! Surely dat be worth a few crates of meat?', '', 74254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Call his bluff] Why don\'t WE wait until YOU attack Orgrimmar, and then mop up YOUR dead?', '[Call his bluff] Why don\'t WE wait until YOU attack Orgrimmar, and then mop up YOUR dead?', 74253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may not be a Frostwolf, but you WILL bleed like them.', '', 74251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blades are no match for our cunning.', '', 74250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I defy death and you!', '', 74249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thought I was dead, eh?', '', 74248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die like the other Frostwolf filth.', '', 74247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish creature. Taste the true sting of the desert.', '', 74246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
