('', 'Hmph. Too easy.', 74059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope you like pain.', 74058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How foolish.', 74057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your back...', 74056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I failed...', '', 74055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing stands against me.', '', 74054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will flatten you!', '', 74053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies! SMASH!', '', 74052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush any who oppose the Warchief!', '', 74051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could you... have beaten me?', '', 74050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak. How predictable.', '', 74049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let it rain!', '', 74048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might have gotten past the weaklings. You aren\'t gonna get past me.', '', 74047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to work, you pathetic grunts! A bunch of rebels and Alliance weaklings aren\'t going to stop us!', '', 74046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sleep... finally...', '', 74045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dead. Happy.', '', 74044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heart will stop!', '', 74043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one. Should be fun kill.', '', 74042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smell blood. Puny fleas afraid to fight.', '', 74041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, a worthy opponent.', '', 74040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How sad. I expected more.', '', 74039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dodge this!', '', 74038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! A challenge?!', '', 74037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder! Challengers, your death comes for you!', '', 74036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blown... to... bits...', '', 74035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEATH FROM ABOVE!', '', 74034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couldn\'t deal with our explosive tempers, huh?!', '', 74033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bombs away!', '', 74032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My boys may not be the brightest, but we can take all of you on!', '', 74031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like my fuse... went out...', '', 74030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ashes! Smoking craters! AHAHAHAHA!', '', 74029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proto-Drake Whelps hatch from the nearby eggs!', '', 74028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you go? Come back!', '', 74027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh... Hah!', '', 74026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand still! I am trying to kill you here!', '', 74025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n picked up the Horde gold cart!', '', 74024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n picked up the Alliance gold cart!', '', 74023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAM! BOOM! A-hahahahaha!', '', 74022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck!', '', 74021, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 37429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose the challenge most appropriate for your unique talents.', '', 74020, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 37428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, we must visit all four, but we only need to complete ONE of the four challenges.', '', 74019, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 37427, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you at each of the four shrines, champion.', '', 74018, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 37426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that was a bad move, buddy. A baaaaad move.', '', 74017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s ROCKET TIME, ladies! Come and get it!', '', 74016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You aren\'t gonna off the Hoff!', '', 74015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoff... out...', '', 74014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MUGG! Get over here! The Hoff\'s under attack!', '', 74013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya\' better stay away, chumps. No one hassles the Hoff!', '', 74012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion is blindfolded, so attack from behind for bonus damage!', '', 74011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! So strange to see you here, far from the green forests of Pandaria.$b$bWhen I first sailed away from the Wandering Isle, years ago, this ragged shore was one of the first places I visited. Ahh! The air still smells the same!$b$bBut times have changed. Back then I helped Thrall, Vol\'jin, Rexxar and Rokhan to lay the foundation of Orgrimmar. Today, I hardly recognize the place.$b$b<Chen\'s face falls.>$b$BSo much needless bloodshed. I just don\'t understand. Has Pandaria taught us nothing?', '', 74010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here, Chen Stormstout?', 'What are you doing here, Chen Stormstout?', 74009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, I helped put the Horde together on these very sands. My... how times have changed.', '', 74008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don\'t see you fat an\' happy like his Kor\'kron.$b$bLook, ya be an orc, maybe ya don\'t see it. Da ghettos in Orgrimmar. De way he talk \'bout de other races. De way he use \'em like cannon fodder. Are ya one of de chosen few, $n? Or are ya disposable, like de rest of us? De trash he throw away once he get his monstrous way. He promise glory but bathes our Horde in blood.$b$bMe an\' Thrall, we see a diff\'rent Horde.', '', 74007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an\' pick us back up. We all each other got, see?$b$bHellscream, he don\'t see family. Ain\'t never had one. All he see is power, like he just come through the portal.$b$b<Vol\'jin stares off into the distance.>$b$bWe stand against him - together, here, now - or he stomp us out. One. By. One. I got de scars ta prove it.$b$bWho do ya trust, $n? Where be your loyalty now? Hellscream? Or family?', '', 74006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya still call him \"Warchief,\" $c? Is he still YOUR Warchief? What of de spoils of his war? I don\'t see you fat an\' happy like his Kor\'kron. His Horde be an orc Horde. Do ya still feel welcome here, $r? Are ya a part of his plan? Or are ya trash he gonna do away wit\' once he has his way? He promise glory, but bathes our Horde in blood, an\' steps on anyone who see it diff\'rent.$b$bYa wanna know how I see de Horde? De Horde dat me an\' Thrall built?', '', 74005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin allows a grim smile to creep across his scowling features.>$b$bNot yet he don\'t. Maybe he hearin\' rumors. Maybe he thinkin\', dey ghost stories. Maybe ol\' Vol\'jin comin\' back ta haunt him. Hah.$b$bHe find out soon enough. Too bad I\'m not gonna be there ta see da look on his fat, beady-eyed face when he hears ol\' Vol\'jin is back, an\' gonna make good on me promise. Ta end his sad little reign. Ta fire de arrow dat pierces his black heart.', '', 74004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin runs his three-fingered hand over his scar.>$b$bIt been a long road, friend. Garrosh tried ta take me life wit\' a knife in de throat. Left me for dead. I crawl out dat cave, couldn\'t even speak. It was Chen Stormstout who found me, nursed me back from de brink.$b$bWe travelled to de Shado-Pan monastery, an\' dey help me do some soul-searching. Figure out who I was. Who de Horde was. Me father...$b$bI made up me mind. I\'m takin\' de Horde back. No matter de cost.$b$bDarkspear never die.', '', 74003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you see the Horde?', 'How do you see the Horde?', 74002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you fighting against our own Warchief?', 'Why are you fighting against our own Warchief?', 74001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does Garrosh know you\'re alive?', 'Does Garrosh know you\'re alive?', 74000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to you in Pandaria?', 'What happened to you in Pandaria?', 73999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin cackles, the stench of his hot breath reeking in your nostrils.>$b$bOh, ya got anudda plan? I got anudda plan, too. I let ya siege Orgrimmar on ya own. See how far ya get. An\' once da city be filled wit\' corpses, den me shadow hunters come in, we mop up what left, kill Kor\'kron an\' Alliance alike. Give ya dead ta Sylvanas. Hmm! I save a lot a Darkspear lives wit\' dis plan!$B$BMmnn? You don\'t like? Then, we stay wit\' da first plan. We work together.$b$bWe don\'t even have ta like each other.', '', 73998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For him, Horde be about orcs, an\' buildin\' up orc power. Like he just come through de portal. Anyone stand in his way, anyone tink any diff\'rent, he shut \'em up.$b$b<Vol\'jin runs his three-fingered hand across his scar.>$b$bHe like an angry dog. Oh, I fight next to Hellscream in battle, sure. But put him in charge? Ya askin\' for trouble. He pick his favorites, start his war, shove me bruddahs aside... He don\'t tink he need nobody else. Well, he wrong.$b$bHe gonna learn: ya never cross family.', '', 73997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin twists his face into a scowl.>$b$bYa wouldn\'t understand. What\'s de Horde ta ya, $r? Hm? Diseased? Alien? Betrayers? Demon-blooded? Beasts? I know what ya say \'bout us.$b$bI\'ll tell ya what de Horde is. De Horde dat me an\' Thrall built. It be a family. When de whole world try ta put us down, de family come an\' pick us back up.$b$bHellscream, he don\'t see family. Ain\'t never had one.', '', 73996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should we help you? What if we kept the Barrens supplies for ourselves?', 'Why should we help you? What if we kept the Barrens supplies for ourselves?', 73995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about Hellscream? What does the Horde mean to him?', 'What about Hellscream? What does the Horde mean to him?', 73994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are the Darkspear in rebellion against Garrosh?', 'Why are the Darkspear in rebellion against Garrosh?', 73993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The stench around Vol\'jin\'s makeshift revolutionary camp is intolerable. The troll leader allows you to speak first, while his guards eye you warily.>', '', 73992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spirits be restless.', '', 73991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
