('The Vision of Deathwing fixates on Wrathion, heal him!', '', 73989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Darkspear is gonna destroy Garrosh!', 'De Darkspear is gonna destroy Garrosh!', 73988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
