('De Darkspear will be your end!', 'De Darkspear will be your end!', 73985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin lives!', 'Vol\'jin lives!', 73984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
