('', 'My thanks, $r. I won\'t be forgettin\' dis.', 73969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance willing to help da Darkspear? Never thought I would live to see de day.', 73968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now\'s your chance to escape. Make a run for it!', 'Now\'s your chance to escape. Make a run for it!', 73967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya not gonna be foolin\' ol\' Zen\'tabra with dat cat disguise. I be rememberin\' dis, $r.', 73966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time to waste... let\'s blow this wall to pieces!', '', 73965, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help a goblin out and grab some of them fancy artifacts.  Meanwhile, my guys will clear the entrance to the mine.', '', 73964, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be destitute if I don\'t recover my losses from this disaster.', '', 73963, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhhhhhhhhhhh!', '', 73962, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what\'s going on?  Somethin\'... in... my head...', '', 73961, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like some sort of gigantic chest... probably full of gold.  And it\'s all ours!', '', 73960, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was some explosion!  Let\'s check it out.', '', 73959, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all clear then?', '', 73958, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is fine.  Look, there\'s too much to explain...', 'Everything is fine.  Look, there\'s too much to explain...', 73957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were working on this wall here and... well, I don\'t even remember.  Who are you, anyhow?  Where\'s Gearslip?', '', 73956, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast, these scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!', '', 73955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast, these Horde scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!', '', 73954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how this works!', '', 73953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m out!', '', 73952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire in the hole!', '', 73951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out!', '', 73950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'ll teach \'em!  Now hop in that cannon and converge on their lead ship!', '', 73949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and steal their explosives to blow it to smithereens!', '', 73948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FIRE!', '', 73947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('En Garde!', '', 73946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast...', '', 73945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy Lieutenant coming aboard, fend him off!', '', 73944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More are coming aboard.  Hold \'em off!', '', 73943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ruffians are swinging aboard to steal our treasure.  Fend them off!', '', 73942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Alliance pigs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!', '', 73941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Horde dogs are swinging aboard.  Fend them off!', '', 73940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('15', '', 73939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('14', '', 73938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('13', '', 73937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('12', '', 73936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('11', '', 73935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You already had that artifact!  Combo chain restarted...', 'You already had that artifact!  Combo chain restarted...', 73934, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, destroy these insects!', '', 73933, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taunt the Vision of Deathwing when he fixates on Wrathion!', '', 73932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jade Serpent is the incarnation of wisdom in Pandaria. Let\'s see what she has to say.', '', 73931, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 37384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your body to shield Wrathion from the incoming attacks!', '', 73930, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I see why the Darkspear are fighting back!', 'Now I see why the Darkspear are fighting back!', 73929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought Garrosh would turn against orcs!', 'I never thought Garrosh would turn against orcs!', 73928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief is caging all the dissidents. Even us orcs!', 'The Warchief is caging all the dissidents. Even us orcs!', 73927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh\'s goons didn\'t like that I kept working with trolls.', 'Garrosh\'s goons didn\'t like that I kept working with trolls.', 73926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step onto that teleporter. Ratchet, comin\' right up!', '', 73925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, go, go! Get on that teleporter. Got lotsa customers today, so hurry it up!', '', 73924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, step right up, $r. Right up there on the teleporter.', '', 73923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel to Ratchet.', 'I\'d like to travel to Ratchet.', 73922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My state of the art teleporter will take you straight to the Northern Barrens. Whaddaya say?', '', 73921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never had an unsatisfied customer! Try Chatterswitch Travels today!', '', 73920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need ta go somewhere? As long as that somewhere is Ratchet, I\'ve got yer fast track right here!', '', 73919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey hey hey! You lookin\' fer some fast travel to the Barrens?', '', 73918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know our next step. Meet me back atop Mason\'s Folly - you\'ll be pleasantly surprised at what I have in store for you!', '', 73917, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 37431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have done it, hero! We have the blessings of the celestials, and we have completed their challenge.', '', 73916, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 37430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_windsofwoe:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:142306|h[Ruined Earth]|h|r!', '', 73915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathknight_remorselesswinters:20|t%s summons a |cFFF00000|Hspell:142320|h[Glacial Freeze Totem]|h|r!', '', 73914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis ain\'t a task for da weak-hearted, stranger. But if ya help us, maybe Vol\'jin begin ta trust ya. Either way ya weaken de Warchief\'s grasp on his own lands. Tink a soft-skinned Alliance can do it? Ahahahahaaa!', 73913, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'De Alliance want a second front on Orgrimmar? We can do dat. You can help. We be needin\' resources: Stone. Wood. Oil. Meat. Only den can we move on da city.', 73912, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We turn eyes now ta de final prize - Orgrimmar.', 73911, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hellscream thought Vol\'jin dead, \'til Vol\'jin show up at Sen\'jin Village. Den de Warchief try to crush de rebellion, but we was waitin\' for \'im. We fought back de Kor\'kron at Sen\'jin, and den we took Razor Hill, hah, right under de Warchief\'s nose!', 73910, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What he did? He woke de fury a\' de Darkspear tribe.', 73909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hellscream already try ta have Vol\'jin killed. Heh. Ain\'t so easy ta kill a troll.', 73908, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep ya hands where we can see \'em. Everybody be jumpy. We be in a war here, a war against de Warchief hisself.', 73907, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk wit\' me, $r.', 73906, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell Vol\'jin I bring an ambassador from de Alliance.', 73905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait! Lower ya weapons. I know of dis one.', 73904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look mon, Alliance filth washed up from Theramore. Kill it!', '', 73903, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not it!', '', 73902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s my girl, fanning the flames! I like it. Now, which one o\' us is brave enough ta pay a little visit to tha Darkspear?', '', 73901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vol\'jin is backed into a corner. With our aid, he\'ll be the spear that breaks open Hellscream\'s fortress. Let our enemies weaken one another, while we wait in the wings for our chance to strike.', 73900, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute! Are you suggestin\' that we help Vol\'jin?', '', 73899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. This is just the opportunity the Alliance needs. We\'ll use the trolls as a diversion while the main Alliance fleet assembles. You get what I\'m saying, Sully?', 73898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the rumors are true? Vol\'jin is alive and out for Garrosh\'s blood?', '', 73897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did good, $n. Looks like trouble is brewing within the Horde. Garrosh has a full-scale troll rebellion on his hands.', 73896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a risk I have to take. But if I am killed, please watch over Aggra and my boy.', '', 73895, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are coming aboard!  Get up to the deck and help fend them off!', '', 73894, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, speak to Vol\'jin. Prepare yourself. From here on out, we be askin\' more of you den ever before.', '', 73893, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s where we need you, $Gbruddah:sistah;.', '', 73892, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we gotta feed dis war machine. Stone, wood, oil, meat - we be needin\' \'em in large supply.', '', 73891, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De spark becomes a flame, de flame becomes a fire, de fire... an inferno. We gonna burn our way ta da gates a\' Orgrimmar.', '', 73890, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, look around you. De Darkspear rebellion begins. Hellscream\'s worst nightmare.', '', 73889, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Vol\'jin come back ta us, I saw he was changed. Da light a\' revolution be burnin\' in his eyes!', '', 73888, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin survived, but he still remember da sting a\' Hellscream\'s betrayal. Darkspear never die.', '', 73887, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De \"Warchief\" still believes Vol\'jin be dead, slain by his Kor\'kron assassin in Kun-Lai Summit.', '', 73886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk wit\' me, $c. Vol\'jin be seein\' ya in just a moment.', '', 73885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s hands you a climbing rope.', '', 73884, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avast, these Alliance scallywags have made their way onto our ship.  Take care of them!', '', 73883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, young prince. Take this lesson to heart.', 73882, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!', 73881, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 37359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seek out your true enemy! Do not be fooled by his false images!', 73880, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll defend until the last goblin is out! See you all at the rendezvous!', '', 73879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone out before more of them show up!', '', 73878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call \'dat a battlecry? We be startin\' a revolution. Roar like ya already won and deh\' other side just not figured it out yet.', '', 73877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the coliseum.  You\'ve played an important role in this.  You deserve to see the results.', '', 73876, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SPAWN ACTION', '', 73875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remembah! Kor\'kron axes gotta\' hit you wit\' their blade. Ya maces ain\'t got dat kinda limitation.', '', 73874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We be facin\' da Kor\'kron. Deh be da meanest, baddest orcs deh\' Horde have ever seen. Ya betta\' not be sleepin\' through \'dis trainin\'.', '', 73873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re alive.  I\'ll take that as a good sign.', '', 73872, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be callin\' dat a grip on your weapon? Any Kor\'kron worth \'is hide will have dat ting disarmed in a pinch.', '', 73871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will finish what my father started this day, and I will heft his spear and shield in his memory.  I will remind the clan how a true Frostwolf warchief behaves.', '', 73870, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father lead such a group here to kill the ancient gron, Kolloc, but none of them returned.', '', 73869, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The strongest of the Frostwolf clan come here when they wish to prove themselves as leaders.  They bring warriors of their choosing, and return to the clan with the head of a freshly slain gron.', '', 73868, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaughter them all, men!  Leave no Thunderlord alive!', '', 73867, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spit on your corpse, orc.  You are weak!', '', 73866, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself, Graktul!  I am challenge you here, in front of your men.  I will show them the color of your innards!', '', 73865, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will call out their leader and put his head on a pike, and then we will slaughter any that remain in our way.', '', 73864, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunderlord clan.  My scouts informed me of their presence here in the oasis, blocking our way to the grotto.', '', 73863, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will witness these acts, and should you somehow live, you will tell my brother and his clan what I have done this day.', '', 73862, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We ride now to avenge my father, and remind the entire Frostwolf clan how a true warchief behaves.', '', 73861, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At every turn, Durotan shows his weakness, and spits on the strength of our ancestors.', '', 73860, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He refuses to lead our warriors against the gron and avenge our father\'s death, saying we can\'t spare the men.', '', 73859, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He wastes the food of our people on his sickly wife, Drakka, rather than sending her out into the cold, as is custom for the weak.', '', 73858, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He led us to this northern home of ours early in the season, fleeing the new orc clans in Nagrand.  He inflicts cowardice upon our people.', '', 73857, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Durotan is weak and impotent. He lacks the strength to lead the Frostwolves.', '', 73856, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Durotan claims himself a leader.  He wears the title, and fools the clan into following him.', '', 73855, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can speak about my fledgling brother\'s request once this task is done.', '', 73854, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can prove your strength by subduing a frost wolf, you will be allowed to ride with us, and bear witness.', '', 73853, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men and I prepare to ride to gron grotto, to unleash our fury upon the gron there.', '', 73852, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I have a more important message that you will deliver for me.', '', 73851, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know why you\'ve come to the northern wastes, curr.  I should gut you and leave you here for the scavengers as a message to my feeble brother.', '', 73850, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was certain we would find you impaled on its stinger...', '', 73849, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya been invaluable to the revolution, mon. We be armin\' up now.', 'Ya been invaluable to the revolution, mon. We be armin\' up now.', 73848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Darkspear gonna\' be ready.', 'We Darkspear gonna\' be ready.', 73847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of me best friends be orcs. Dis\' be a bad time.', 'Some of me best friends be orcs. Dis\' be a bad time.', 73846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem Kor\'kron not be catchin\' us off guard dis time.', 'Dem Kor\'kron not be catchin\' us off guard dis time.', 73845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to da\' revolution.', 'Welcome to da\' revolution.', 73844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya here to join da revolution, mon?', 'Ya here to join da revolution, mon?', 73843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya gonna\' be helpin\' us, $c?', 'Ya gonna\' be helpin\' us, $c?', 73842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon we gonna\' be seein\' dem Kor\'kron rollin\' up over da hills.', 'Soon we gonna\' be seein\' dem Kor\'kron rollin\' up over da hills.', 73841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dem Kor\'kron be gatherin\'.', 'Dem Kor\'kron be gatherin\'.', 73840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The teleporter is ready! Let\'s get out of here!', '', 73839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! The true Horde cannot be stopped by the likes of you.', '', 73838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
