('', 'My challenge, if you accept it, will test your cunning and footwork even in the midst of life-threatening danger.', 73754, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come forward! I will give you my blessing.', 73753, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To learn THAT is to learn true wisdom.', 73752, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But true wisdom comes from KNOWING what is right. And sometimes, DOING nothing at all.', 73751, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spoken like a true child of the Aspects. Always seeking to change the world.', 73750, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me, dragon child: What is the nature of wisdom?', 73749, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things.', 73748, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
