('My champion and I seek the blessing of your wisdom.', '', 73734, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 37466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great Jade Serpent! Hear our plea.', '', 73733, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 37449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it.$b$b(Scenarios require item level 425 or greater.)', '', 73732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you, my friend. So much is transpiring it is hard for a Lorewalker like myself to keep up. I have seen many things through my dream brew, but we will need a hero such as yourself to help write this next chapter of our history.', '', 73731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s never seen an opponent that he wouldn\'t fight. Ah, small correction: he\'s never seen an opponent. He\'s the Blind Hero!', 73730, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ever wonder what we do with all our obsolete robots? We send them to their deaths in bloody gladiatorial arenas, of course! Here comes Blingtron 3000!', 73729, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s a strategic mastermind, and he doesn\'t even have a head. Or an elbow, even. It\'s Ro-Shambo! Let\'s give him a hand!', 73728, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s this? Bruce is back! A better, faster, stronger Bruce! It\'s MECHA-BRUCE!!!', 73727, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brawl\'gar veterans may remember Blat, the self-replicating ooze. Today, we meet his meaner, uglier, older sister: Splat!', 73726, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s probably the most deadly brawler we\'ve ever had here at the Brawl\'gar Arena. Unfortunately, he\'s a little out of his element. Everybody raise your glass for Razorgrin!', 73725, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throw down your weapon and pick up your gloves. It\'s time for a good old-fashioned boxing match. Prepare to be floored by Ty\'thar!', 73724, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No introduction could possibly do our challengers justice. Feast your eyes on the Bear and the Lady Fair!', 73723, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dust off that luckydo, because you\'re gonna need it. It\'s Grandpa Grumplefloot!', 73722, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s not a real doctor, but he\'s going to attempt some facial reconstruction surgery. On his next opponent. Welcome, Doctor FIST!', 73721, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww... look at the cute little snake, Nibbleh! Go ahead, let him nibble on your toes. Let\'s see what happens.', 73720, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s better than an explosion? Lots and lots of explosions! In this corner, we have Big Badda Boom!!', 73719, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hope you all like your brawlers extra-crispy! Here comes Anthracite!!', 73718, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s got two modes. Both modes are labeled \"KILL\". Let\'s hear it for T440!', 73717, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He may be a huge chicken, but he\'ll still put up a fight. It\'s Tyson Sanders!', 73716, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He doesn\'t need blades or magic to defeat his enemies. Our next challenger, Hexos, fights his foes with the powers of GEOMETRY!', 73715, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
