('Vol\'jin jabs his spear into the ground, saying nothing.', '', 73690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many artifacts lay here, seemingly discarded. Most appear to have come from Garrosh\'s dig site in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Whatever he is trying to find, it does not appear to be among these forgotten relics.', '', 73689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Young proto-drake eggs line the cavern floor. Many recently hatched eggs fill the surrounding area. With this many proto-drakes, no place would be safe from Garrosh\'s invasion.', '', 73688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has put a |cFFFF2222|Hspell:132998|h[Sticky Bomb]|h|r on you!', '', 73687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These crates bear the mark of the Kor\'kron. Various weapons and other war supplies lay strewn about the cavern. From the looks of things, Garrosh is planning an invasion.', '', 73686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:141387|h[Urtharges\' Shield]|h|r has been broken!', '', 73685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend us until the teleporter is ready!', '', 73684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Recruits, you\'re the only ones left that can fight!', '', 73683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them! FOR THE HORDE!', '', 73682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of Azeroth will run red with the blood of the lesser races.', '', 73681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The true Horde, the pure Horde, cannot be stopped!', '', 73680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
