('%s begins to cast |cFFFF2222|Hspell:136473|h[Counter Shot]|h|r at $n.', '', 73670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warn us a little sooner next time!', '', 73669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That door didn\'t even budge...', '', 73668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
