('Urtharges calls on the aid of an elemental!', '', 73666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('cautiously rolls the old pirate dice. The dice tumble resulting in |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141967|h[Snake eyes]|h|r.', 'cautiously rolls the old pirate dice. The dice tumble resulting in |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141967|h[Snake eyes]|h|r.', 73665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, turn your foe\'s strength and confidence against him. I believe in you.', '', 73664, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is enough.', '', 73663, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as I expected. Do you want to give it another go?', '', 73662, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 37432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased that our hero is still alive. Thank you for your blessing, mighty tiger.', '', 73661, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 37439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PAH! A lopsided challenge.', '', 73660, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Young prince, I hope you take this lesson to heart.', '', 73659, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope now you understand the limits of strength without vision. It is one thing to change the world, but quite another to do what is right.', '', 73658, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good - lay down your weapons!', '', 73657, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you re-stealth me?', 'Can you re-stealth me?', 73656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We just need to stay focused on our mission so we can get out of here in one piece.', 73655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been in the middle of a few messes in my day, but this is ridiculous!', 73654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was not expecting this many troops...', 73653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Warchief won\'t be pleased. He is wasting valuable troops fending off their pathetic rebellion.', 73652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you do not engage in combat soon, you will forfeit!', '', 73651, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the detonator goes off in... err... NOW!', '', 73650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This thing could open Gallywix\'s personal safe!', '', 73649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The longer we spend standing here the sooner Garrosh\'s men are going to find us.', '', 73648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care what it\'s for! Is it going to get this door open?', '', 73647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t question my genius!', '', 73646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What the heck is the pool pony for?', 73645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s... it\'s beautiful!', '', 73644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My masterpiece is finished!', '', 73643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Disable?!', 73642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little more power...', '', 73641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should give us enough power to disable the stabilization matrix.', '', 73640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The most important ingredient!', '', 73639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I leave that for you to decide.  Go now and prove me wrong.', '', 73638, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must warn you though, Ga\'nar and his warriors did not leave on good terms, and are not likely to welcome you with open arms. I think what Go\'el is asking of you may not even be possible.', '', 73637, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve had no contact with Ga\'nar or his exiles for sometime, but I suspect they are in the north.', '', 73636, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Frostwolf clan needs to be reunited if it is going to stand strong against the Iron Horde. We need Ga\'nar and his warriors to return.', '', 73635, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, I was hoping you might aid me yet again. The Frostwolf clan is divided. Many are here, under Durotan\'s command, but many of their strongest warriors traveled into the desert months ago, lead by Durotan\'s brother, Ga\'nar.', '', 73634, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, this $c is far more than $ghe:she; first seems. Your brother values strength, and $p possesses that in abundance.', '', 73633, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you misunderstand my brother, Go\'el.  He is not the type to be convinced by a stranger. Especially one so small.', '', 73632, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this is exactly the $r I was hoping for.', '', 73631, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You carried that with your hands?! Uh... you should probably see a medic when we get back...', '', 73630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may be my greatest work yet!', '', 73629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! This isn\'t a toy!', '', 73628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s exactly what we needed!', '', 73627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
