('A Kor\'kron shipment of lumber has been overturned!', '', 73623, 0, 20106, 0, 65, 0, 37503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow ol\' Bom\'bay! He know de way!', '', 73622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can turn my steel against the \"Warchief,\" but only against his corrupt soldiers - leave the civilians out of your bloodshed!', '', 73621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have trained hundreds of young warriors. The Warchief sheds their blood recklessly. He is no longer MY Warchief.', '', 73620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna pay for what ya done to me raptors!', '', 73619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please - don\'t hurt us! Vol\'jin is welcome to quarter his revolutionaries here.', '', 73618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief should\'ve never crossed the Darkspear. He tore the Horde apart.', '', 73617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rapier has fallen to the ground.  Pick it up to engage Admiral Hagman!', 'The Rapier has fallen to the ground.  Pick it up to engage Admiral Hagman!', 73616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
