('%s prepares a massive |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141187|h[Vertical Strike]|h|r.', '', 73607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that, goblin?', '', 73606, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind DISGUSTS me.  Small.  Weak.  Honorless as thieves.  Be thankful the warchief still tolerates your presence at all.', '', 73605, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 37186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief graciously permits the families of the dead to live in his city.  To die in the service of the Horde should be a great honor, but you see it as another opportunity to line your filthy pockets!', '', 73604, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 37185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
