('You are paid for all workers present, foreman.  The warchief does not compensate the dead.', '', 73602, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 37183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step aside goblin.  This artifact is exactly what the warchief hoped to find here.  I am taking it under Kor\'kron protection.', '', 73601, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 37182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
