('Such wind! Such cold! Once, it would have filled these old bones with despair. But on this day, I am filled with hope.', '', 73408, 0, 0, 396, 71, 0, 37300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My, you are strong! When I was young, I might have doubted that we could do this. But now, I have no doubts at all.', '', 73407, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 37299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh has turned Orgrimmar into a fortress. You may need to seek out allies... beyond the Horde.', '', 73406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm?', '', 73405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are preparing. I just need time to ensure the safety of my people. But Vol\'jin...', '', 73404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lor\'themar be ready to strike once he finish wit da Isle of Thunder, and da Banshee Queen need no excuse, but they both across da sea. Without ya strength, we can\'t breech the city. I need tauren arms.', '', 73403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only stoopid wants to meet Bad Luckydo.', '', 73402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckydo, or Luckydon\'t?', '', 73401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flooting isn\'t for stoopids.', '', 73400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should dance for my floot toot!', '', 73399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must tread carefully. Many of my people are still within Orgrimmar.', '', 73398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine. We be needin\' ya support. Razor Hill be but an outpost - the walls of Orgrimmar be fortified since da Cataclysm.', '', 73397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin - you\'re alive! It is true then - an open rebellion against the Warchief.', '', 73396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My floot is good luckydo! You can\'t have it!', '', 73395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be done! Razor Hill is ours! Da Warchief probably see da fires all the way from Grommash Hold...', '', 73394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin and his animals will be put down like the filth they are!', '', 73393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU are the traitors, here!', '', 73392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is the true Horde!', '', 73391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can turn my steel against the \"Warchief,\" but only against his corrupt soldiers - leave the civilians out of your bloodshed!', '', 73390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please - don\'t hurt us! Vol\'jin is welcome to quarter his revolutionaries here.', '', 73389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have trained hundreds of young warriors. The Warchief sheds their blood recklessly. He is no longer MY Warchief.', '', 73388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief should\'ve never crossed the Darkspear. He tore the Horde apart.', '', 73387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkspear, with me! We ride! No sleep \'til Orgrimmar!', '', 73386, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde.', '', 73385, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For da Horde.', '', 73384, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has to be said, Vol\'jin. If we do not make it through this - I want you to know. You have always been my friend. My brother.', '', 73383, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t hear ya say such tings.', '', 73382, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to Orgrimmar, alone. Eitrigg, Saurfang, surely they are standing against Garrosh. I must find others.', '', 73381, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You set one foot in Orgrimmar, Hellscream gonna bury a knife in ya neck!', '', 73380, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to believe that all of my brethren support Garrosh.', '', 73379, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know. I trust you to lead the siege. I am needed elsewhere.', '', 73378, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need ya, mon.', '', 73377, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait Vol\'jin. Horde is spilling Horde blood. It is tearing me apart.', '', 73376, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone who can still fight, come wit\' me!', '', 73375, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regroup! We press da advantage. Before the Warchief fortifies Razor Hill, we take it for da revolution, an\' close off da road to da Barrens.', '', 73374, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold! Let dem run away. Hellscream will execute dem as cowards if they go back. Sen\'jin Village is safe!', '', 73373, 0, 0, 22, 71, 0, 37226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time ta show dis Warchief da fury of da Darkspear!', '', 73372, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 37225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey come! Hellscream tink his own people gonna roll right over.', '', 73371, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 37224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not quite, old friend. Times have changed. The line between friend and foe is not so clear.', '', 73370, 0, 21600, 1, 71, 0, 37318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at us three. Back to da sands of old Durotar! It be just like old times.', '', 73369, 0, 21600, 1, 71, 0, 37212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we survive dis, maybe someday I call you... \"Friend.\"', '', 73368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkspear and her allies will attack Orgrimmar by land, so that you can attack her by sea. It be the only way.', '', 73367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Ya earned me trust. I will put me faith in tha Alliance to do tha right ting.', '', 73366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may not trust the Alliance, but we need their help if we are to take back the Horde.', '', 73365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko got dis beach on lockdown!', '', 73363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard? The traitorous trolls have launched an attack on Razor Hill.', '', 73362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief demands that this shore is secured! When the Alliance makes its move, the tides will run red with their blood!', '', 73361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We pandaren are no strangers to dealing with tyrants. The coming battle will try your souls. May the celestials guide your actions.', '', 73360, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. You have until season\'s end. No longer.', '', 73359, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taran Zhu stares grimly into the distance.', '', 73358, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please. Give us time to make this right.', '', 73357, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sunwalker, I respect your people. You have aided us in our campaign against the Sha and the Thunder King. Otherwise, I would\'ve already ordered the Shado-Pan to purge this entire shrine. But my patience is at an end. The Horde must leave.', '', 73356, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give us time, Lord Zhu. Give us the opportunity to bring Hellscream to justice.', '', 73355, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your politics are no concern of mine. Your Horde has disrespected the sanctity of this place. You are no longer welcome here - leave at once!', '', 73354, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Zhu, please understand - the orc \"Warchief\" who ordered the deed no longer speaks for the whole of the Horde. Many voices are rising up against him.', '', 73353, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tauren! What have your people done? You have dredged open a scar within our sacred Vale!', '', 73352, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 6, 5, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I see you!', 'I see you!', 73351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Warchief!', 'For the Warchief!', 73350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will feed you to my wolf.', 'I will feed you to my wolf.', 73349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t hide from me!', 'You can\'t hide from me!', 73348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance are here!', 'The Alliance are here!', 73347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
