('We\'re under attack!', 'We\'re under attack!', 73345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance are here!', 'The Alliance are here!', 73344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More blood for my axe!', 'More blood for my axe!', 73343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders!', 'Intruders!', 73342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a $r. I haven\'t killed one of your kind in a while.', '', 73341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 73340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! A proper challenge for my power.', '', 73339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits have abandoned you.', '', 73338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from da voodoo.', '', 73337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe dey make Bom\'bay full Witch Doctor after dis!', '', 73336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya mon.', '', 73335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis the kind of trainin Bom\'bay needs.', '', 73334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself, hero. Your challenge will begin soon.', '', 73333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ELEC... TRICITY... GREATEST... WEAKNESS...', '', 73332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya want a present?! WELL, MY LEGS DON\'T EVEN WORK!!!', '', 73331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cut down anyone I see fleeing from battle. For Garrosh!', 'I will cut down anyone I see fleeing from battle. For Garrosh!', 73330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have an ale for every scalp you bring!', 'I have an ale for every scalp you bring!', 73329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This village is ours! Death to the trolls!', 'This village is ours! Death to the trolls!', 73328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wipe the Darkspear from the face of Azeroth!', 'Wipe the Darkspear from the face of Azeroth!', 73327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkspear will know the true price of defiance!', 'The Darkspear will know the true price of defiance!', 73326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief will hear of your failure!', 'The warchief will hear of your failure!', 73325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warchief will hear of our success!', 'The warchief will hear of our success!', 73324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one disobeys Hellscream!', 'No one disobeys Hellscream!', 73323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those blades clean. There\'s troll blood to be spilled today!', 'Get those blades clean. There\'s troll blood to be spilled today!', 73322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make sure your blades are sharp. We\'ve got enemies to cleave today!', 'Make sure your blades are sharp. We\'ve got enemies to cleave today!', 73321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiery Anger is about to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141456|h[Detonate]|h|r!', 'Fiery Anger is about to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:141456|h[Detonate]|h|r!', 73320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Excellent, a shipment of stone. Send it to Orgrimmar!', '', 73319, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move it south, to the Valley of Trials. We have hungry young orcs to feed.', '', 73318, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh meat! Straight from the slaughterhouse. Good.', '', 73317, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send it to Orgrimmar.', '', 73316, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we have here? Oil?', '', 73315, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one will question the might of Hellscream\'s Horde!', '', 73314, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar\'s walls need to be taller! Thicker!', '', 73313, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Packed up with lumber? Good. Send it up to Orgrimmar.', '', 73312, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that stands in our way... is pride.', '', 73311, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are going to get worse before they get better. Only by working together can we overcome the darkness.', '', 73310, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware of pride! Be humble! The world is plunging into chaos. Old enemies must work together. Proud races must admit they need help.', '', 73309, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pride. It is the most insidious of sha. It is good until it is bad. And then it is more dangerous than all the others combined.', '', 73308, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought we could solve our own problems. But for ten thousand years, we stagnated, our doubts and fears buried in the land, rising up to fester whenever we allowed them.', '', 73307, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pride cloaked this land in mists! I thought we were better than the rest of the world.', '', 73306, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I held on to one vice. The one sha I never conquered. PRIDE.', '', 73305, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I conquered my doubts, my fears, my anger... I buried all of it within the land.', '', 73304, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The realm you see all around you was mine to command.', '', 73303, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was EMPEROR.', '', 73302, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was going to teach you a lesson but instead, it is you who have taught me. You see, when I was young... when I was young... when I was young...', '', 73301, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You surprised me. I expected a hero such as yourself to balk at the task of carrying an old man up a mountain. Most are too proud.', '', 73300, 0, 0, 396, 71, 0, 37305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, here we are. Oh - oh, these old bones are tired. More than you can imagine.', '', 73299, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ring the Gong [Ranged DPS Challenge]', 'Ring the Gong [Ranged DPS Challenge]', 73298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ring the gong to accept Yu\'lon\'s Challenge. You need only to overcome one of the four celestial\'s challenges.', '', 73297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream\'s Horde has no need for your voodoo tricks, troll. Now get out of my sight!', '', 73296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trainin\' de mages.', '', 73295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troll! What are you still doing in my town?', '', 73294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'ll fix dem.', '', 73293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bom\'bay found a volunteer!', '', 73292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis\'ll help Bom\'bay\'s Witch Doctorin.', '', 73291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hex dem good.', '', 73290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:141407|h[Frozen Solid]|h|r. Break $ghim:her; free!', '', 73289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh!', '', 73288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up against Garrosh Hellscream! Today is de new dawn of de Horde!', '', 73287, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight de oppression!', '', 73286, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin lives, me bruddas!', '', 73285, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VOL\'JIN LIVES!', '', 73284, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portals are shut down. I hear the orcs still have a portal to the Blasted Lands open, down in the Cleft o\' Shadow.', 73283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for Dark Heart of Pandaria.', 'Queue for Dark Heart of Pandaria.', 73281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for the Secrets of Ragefire.', 'Queue for the Secrets of Ragefire.', 73280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Queue for Blood in the Snow.', 'Queue for Blood in the Snow.', 73279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
