('Queue for A Little Patience.', 'Queue for A Little Patience.', 73277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a cave, north o\' here, across a bridge. If ye can slay the elemental within, the storm ought ta stop.', '', 73276, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen: The storm. We figured out what\'s makin\' it. That sneaky Zandalari has these ice trolls makin\' blood sacrifices ta elemental spirits.', '', 73275, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy monsters! I owe ye me life.', '', 73274, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 37294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, $c. I got nothin\' for ya.', 73273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might wanna keep your distance, $c. We on pretty strict Kor\'kron lockdown around here. No knowin\' what might happen.', '', 73272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Huju glances warily over his shoulder.> Not now. Things be gettin\' pretty hot in here lately.', '', 73271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
