('', 'Best be takin\' your business elsewhere, $r. Don\'t wanna be causin\' suspicion.', 73267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No auctions today, $r. No auctions for a while, by the look o\' things.', 73266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Xon\'cha looks nervously over his shoulder.> You\'ll have to go elsewhere if you want to get at your pets, $c. The Kor\'kron be watchin\'.', '', 73265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no room for you here, $n. The Kor\'kron have taken over my inn as a temporary barracks.', 73264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not now, $n. The bank\'s been taken over for the time being.$b$bThe Kor\'kron leader said that they won\'t be makin\' any \"unauthorized withdrawals\", but... you might wanna check an\' make sure.', '', 73263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There be no fishin\' today. Kor\'kron orders.', '', 73262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, $c. De ink\'s run dry \'round here.', '', 73261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. Not now.', 73260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trainin\' services are on temporary hiatus. You wanna learn how to cook? You\'ll have to look somewhere else.', 73259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya need trainin\'?  You picked a real inconvenient time to come pokin\' through the Valley of Spirits.$b$b<Your trainer\'s voice lowers to a whisper.>$b$bThe Kor\'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb. I could be killed if they saw me talkin\' to you.$b$bLucky for you, they don\'t ever see me. Lean in close, $n. We gotta keep this on the down low.', '', 73258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not now, $c. I cannot train you today.$b$b<Your trainer\'s voice lowers to a whisper.>$b$bThe Kor\'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb.$b$bYou want to help? Find Vol\'jin. He will know what to do.', 'Not now, $c. I cannot train you today.$b$b<Your trainer\'s voice lowers to a whisper.>$b$bThe Kor\'kron watches our every move. Garrosh has the Valley of Spirits under his thumb.$b$bYou want to help? Find Vol\'jin. He will know what to do.', 73257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just northwest o\' here; if ye hurry, ye might be able ta save some! Sorry I don\'t know anythin\' more...', 73256, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s only a few of us left; the ones they don\'t eat, they butcher at some big altar.', 73255, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 37293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that was a CLOSE one, thank ye!', 73254, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 37292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mouthwatering brew has an almost hypnotic aroma coming from it.', '', 73253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BUT STAY AWAY FROM THE  BIG VILLAGE! There\'s dozens o\' mad ice trolls in there! Oh, that Zandalari priest has \'em whipped up into a great frenzy.', '', 73252, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw \'em draggin\' Boldbrew, kickin\' and bitin\', towards some hut south o\' here. Now if ye hurry, ye can help her, and she might know more.', '', 73251, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... right. Now: Did the human king send ye? Oh, his spies are all dead... and most of us are, too.', '', 73250, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 37297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho ho ho ho! By my beard, I thought I was done for! Oh, thank ye. Thank ye!', '', 73249, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 37296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
