('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_102.blp:20|t %s Chooses |cFFFF0000Scissors|r! You Tie!', '', 73247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
