('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_scroll.blp:20|t %s Chooses |cFFFF0000Paper|r! You |cFF00FF00Win|r!', '', 73245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_scroll.blp:20|t %s Chooses |cFFFF0000Paper|r! You Tie!', '', 73244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_scroll.blp:20|t %s Chooses |cFFFF0000Paper|r! You |cFFFF0000Lose|r!', '', 73243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the laws of physics you\'re here!', '', 73242, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 37164, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now! Go to Durotar! Make your mark as history unfurls around you!', '', 73241, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, brave hero - you are strong enough to leap into the center of events as they transpire.', '', 73240, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, something is about to give. I wish I could experience the next chapter of the story, but alas, I am just the storyteller.', '', 73239, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So! Even as the Alliance binds itself ever closer together, the Horde is ripping itself apart.', '', 73238, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The story is still being written...', '', 73237, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To my surprise, his people have found something! Right here, in the sacred vale! What will happen now?', '', 73236, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He promised gold and riches to any who could discover for him the hidden secrets of this land that fill Pandaria with such a dark and powerful energy.', '', 73235, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meanwhile, in the city of Orgrimmar, Warchief Garrosh Hellscream sent goblin dig teams all across the continent of Pandaria.', '', 73234, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free to trust one another, all three dwarven leaders pledged their full strength to the Alliance cause.', '', 73233, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so it was a human king who helped to unite the dwarven clans so long divided.', '', 73232, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other dwarven leaders were ashamed of their behavior, and vowed never again to allow fear or distrust to cloud their judgment.', '', 73231, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High King, his champions, and the Dark Iron dwarves worked together to save Ironforge.', '', 73230, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens next? I must know!', '', 73229, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so Moira and the High King set out into the snow to save the city, leaving the others to think about their actions.', '', 73228, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only one dwarf offered to help the king. \"We will lend you our strength,\" said Moira, of the Dark Iron. \"We will trust our dwarven brothers, and we will show them what loyalty means!\"', '', 73227, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king was furious. \"If none of you help, then Ironforge will fall under siege!\"', '', 73226, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We cannot help you,\" said the Wildhammer dwarf. \"For if we turn our back on the Dark Irons, they will defeat the Bronzebeard and take over Ironforge!\"', '', 73225, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We cannot help you,\" said the Bronzebeard dwarf, \"For if we turn our back on the Dark Irons, they will defeat the Wildhammer and take over Ironforge!\"', '', 73224, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what the king did not realize is that the dwarves did not trust one another!', '', 73223, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely, the king thought, if he helped them with their troll problem, they would give him more troops for his campaign against the Horde.', '', 73222, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king\'s scouts had discovered that Zandalari trolls threatened the dwarven capital.', '', 73221, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once upon a time - moments ago, in fact - a great king sought the help from a trio of powerful dwarves: The Council of Three Hammers.', '', 73220, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 37118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nearest is just ahead. If ye can save him, he may know a thing or two.', '', 73219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 37263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There ye are. Here\'s the lay of it: The king\'s spies are dead to a man. Only a handful o\' dwarven scouts are left.', '', 73218, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 37262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill it anyway! Let us see how it tastes.', '', 73217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, this isn\'t a Frostwolf.', '', 73216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this that trespasses in my new lair? A pet of the Frostwolves perhaps?', '', 73215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a way to stop that conjured storm, champion, and rescue whatever prisoners you can.$B$BFare you well.', '', 73214, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 66, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop whatever wickedness is conjuring up that storm, and the Forgeguard will assault the ridge and wipe out the Frostmane and Zandalari both.$B$BUse my mountaineers and whatever prisoners the trolls have taken to guide your way.', 73213, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dissension within the Council of Three Hammers must come to an end.', 73212, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will prove our loyalty - to the Council, Ironforge, and the Alliance - here, today, and with our own blood.', 73211, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could smell you tracking us from a league away. If you had not peaked our curiosity you would be dead now.$b$bAs it stands, the way you slew this creature, you have gained our attention.$b$bWhat do you want of us?', '', 73210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yu\'lon awaits!', 'Yu\'lon awaits!', 73209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Yu\'lon, then.', '', 73208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are - the ancient seat of pandaren wisdom.$b$bShall we begin?', '', 73207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see you when it\'s done, King of Stormwind.', 73206, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 37196, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Indeed. With the aid of your champions, the Dark Irons will put an end to the Zandalari threat in Dun Morogh.', 73205, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 37195, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you have mine, Varian. Your words rang true in the throne room...', 73204, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 37194, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If they can stop that storm, I\'ll lead the Forgeguard to the top myself.', 73203, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 37193, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye. I am loath to send my men into that. It reeks of ambush and bloody disaster.', 73202, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 37192, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve lost many mountaineers to this freakish storm, or the trolls slithering about in it.', 73201, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 37191, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shimmer Ridge. I know it well. The Frostmane trolls breed and plot atop that snow-blown mesa.', 73200, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 37190, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrmmm. Fare well, Queen Regent.', '', 73199, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 37333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and so you marshaled your personal guard, even without the support of the other clans?', '', 73198, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is heartening to see you here, Moira. You have my thanks.', '', 73197, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 37332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My champions will go. They will see what can be done, and rescue who they can.', '', 73196, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. This weather is not natural.', '', 73195, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only imagine what foul business the Zandalari have with them...', '', 73194, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 37329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where my agents tracked the Zandalari.', '', 73193, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 37328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] This fallen orc is dressed in the fashion of the Frostwolf Clan. Perhaps there are more nearby.', '', 73192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
