('', '$gHey there, stranger. I\'d brawl with you any day of the week.  And I promise you, it\'ll last longer than 2 minutes.\n\n<Helga winks disarmingly.>:I saw you making eyes at Harr back there. That tauren is MINE.\n\nWhy don\'t you drag your ugly, gold-digging face to another blimp?;', 73147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m done with the brawling ring.  These days, I am looking for a different kind of ring.', 73146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$gHey there, handsome.  You want to go somewhere after this?  Just you and me?:Back off, skank.  I\'m trying to put out a vibe here, and you\'re ruining it.;', 73145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know Riko?  He good party.', '', 73144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Googa fight one time, but then get a little bit eaten by crocolisk.$b$bEverybody root against Googa.$b$bGooga feel sad because of this.', '', 73143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Googa not actually supposed to be here.  Googa just not sure how to get down.', '', 73142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stare at me like that one more time and I will push you off the side of the boat.', 73141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t BELIEVE she wore the same dress as me.  How embarrassing.', 73140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? Can\'t a death knight get a little dressed up every once in a while?', 73139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A piece of advice?  Never underestimate your foe, no matter how short, waddly, and heart-meltingly cute they might be.', '', 73138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh yes, I remember the first time I fought against the Dark Summoner.  And the second time... and the third...', '', 73137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, I\'m not brawling. I\'m mainly here to cheer for Bruce.', '', 73136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you say something?  I\'m sorry, I tend to not pay attention to conversation when things are being killed for my amusement.', 73135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always cheer for the robots.', 73134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The view really is much better from up here.  Not to mention the distinct lack of blood-spatter.', 73133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, my brawlin\' days are over.  Nowadays, I fill my time with fancy ale and not-so-fancy lasses.', '', 73132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
