('Cavern Burrower alerted nearby Shale Stalkers to your presence with |cFFF00000|Hspell:140600|h[Sonic Call]|h|r!', '', 73041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cavern Burrower begins to call nearby Shale Stalkers to aid it.', '', 73040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
