('', 'Paw-paw says I\'m not s\'posed to talk to strangers.', 72970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m helping!', 72969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the key, let\'s start the raid. [Queue for solo instance.]', 'I have the key, let\'s start the raid. [Queue for solo instance.]', 72968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transmogrification and Void Storage', 'Transmogrification and Void Storage', 72967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_volatilefire:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:139822|h[Cinders]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_volatilefire:20|tYou are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:139822|h[Cinders]|h|r!', 72966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_piercing chill:20|tYou are being targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:139866|h[Torrent of Ice]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_piercing chill:20|tYou are being targeted by |cFFF00000|Hspell:139866|h[Torrent of Ice]|h|r!', 72965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stirred up a great deal of trouble, $n. But it was worth it.', '', 72964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s only one solution. I have to join the council. As for the farm...', '', 72963, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where the Warchief commands, my blade shall follow.', '', 72962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF2222[Electrified]|r  You can discharge the electricity at a nearby Lightning Rod.', '|cFFFF2222[Electrified]|r  You can discharge the electricity at a nearby Lightning Rod.', 72961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The discharged electricity has manifested itself as an elemental!', 'The discharged electricity has manifested itself as an elemental!', 72960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'dok resurrects a fallen ally to aid him in battle!', '', 72959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s uses |cFFFF0000|Hspell:138019|h[Lightning Prod]|h|r! Get away from the Saurok!', '', 72958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s winds up a massive |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136847|h[Shockwave]|h|r!', '', 72957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to pound nearby targets with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137074|h[Ground Slam]|h|r!', '', 72956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is unable to find a target to melee, so resorts to its |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136854|h[Death Stare]|h|r!', '', 72955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sweeps the area with its |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136898|h[Flamethrower]|h|r!', '', 72954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready!', 'I am ready!', 72953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You made it! Excellent. Now we can begin.', '', 72952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for my Blacktalon Quartermaster here in the tavern. He can resupply you with any rewards I have given you previously... for a price of course. As you no doubt have noticed, the materials I work with are not at all cheap.', '', 72951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I replace items you have awarded me in the past?', 'How can I replace items you have awarded me in the past?', 72950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome. I can replace any any rewards you may have gotten from the Black Prince... for a price.', '', 72949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have earned the respect of his majesty, the Black Prince, then you will have earned mine. Complete more of his tasks.$b$bUntil then, begone. I have nothing to sell to you.', '', 72948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you make of Wrathion?', 'What do you make of Wrathion?', 72947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you trust a black dragon, after what they put your family through?', 'How can you trust a black dragon, after what they put your family through?', 72946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to your leg? Are you wounded?', 'What happened to your leg? Are you wounded?', 72945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion claims to be the last living black dragon. Do you think that\'s true? Weren\'t there others still in Outland somewhere?$b$bRegardless, I find him fascinating. He\'s not like any other dragon I\'ve ever met. He is honest, almost painfully so. I can\'t decide if he thinks mortal lives are absolutely precious or completely expendable.', '', 72944, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know of our history with the black dragonflight, do you? I won\'t soon forget what Lady Prestor - Onyxia - did to my family. Maybe that\'s why I sought Wrathion out.$b$b<Anduin peers across the table at his unusual companion.>$b$bBut... he\'s not like the other black dragons, is he? He\'s completely honest and yet always hiding something. Not at all what I expected.', '', 72943, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, this? <Anduin indicates his crutch.>$b$bGarrosh Hellscream tried to use an ancient mogu artifact to summon and control sha energy. I found a way to stop him, but probably shouldn\'t have confronted him on my own. He thought I was dead when he left me buried under the wreckage of his failed plan. I swear he shattered every bone in my body.$b$bThe pandaren mistweavers got me back on my feet again, but it may be some time before I can walk without assistance.', '', 72942, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Anduin\'s bodyguards edge closer the moment you address the prince.>$b$bIt\'s okay. I\'d just like to have a chat with my friend. We\'re far from any battlefronts here. Can some part of the world still be safe for civilized conversation?$b$bCome, sit down! Join us!', '', 72941, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion claims to be the last living black dragon. Do you think that\'s true?$b$bHe\'s got the most curious outlook on the world. I can\'t decide if he thinks human life is precious or expendable! I do enjoy talking with him, however.', '', 72940, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your hand! Not here - not now!', '', 72939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No - stop. Stop this at once!', '', 72938, 0, 0, 5, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c!$b$bChieftain Baine Bloodhoof was distressed to learn of Garrosh\'s savage attack on the human prince. Our causes for grievance against the Alliance are many, but none are the responsibility of this little one.$b$bThe prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger. On my honor I have pledged that I will do what I can to keep him safe.$b$b<Despite his words and the warmth the prince directs his way, the tauren paladin suffers distrustful glances from the royal bodyguards in the corner of the room.>', '', 72937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The tauren paladin looks you up and down, as if sizing up your intentions.>$b$bI mean you no hostility, $c. The human prince and I met at the Temple of the White Tiger, and he often seeks me out to talk about my Chieftain, Baine, and to discuss matters of war and peace.$b$b<The paladin and the Prince\'s bodyguards periodically exchange distrustful glances at one another.>', '', 72936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The bodyguard glowers at you, his fist tightly clenching his sword.>$b$bThe prince wants to have a quiet chat, $c. If you start any trouble, we\'ll respond in kind.', '', 72935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The king wanted Prince Anduin to stay in the vale until he recovered. But the prince insists on wandering around talking to people. What are we to do when a prince wants to disobey his king?$b$bBest to stay close and keep him out of trouble.', '', 72934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This unfortunate Zandalari has been gored and trampled. The expression on his face is not one of fear, but one of steely determination, even in death.$b$bHis open eyes appear to burn with intense passion, even as they stare unblinking into the sky. A fly crawls along their still-moist surface.', '', 72933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slickies love wikket slerp...  Hozen grookin\' love wikket slerp!', '', 72932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' slicky just ooked me in the nib tickler!', '', 72931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many slickies...  Hozen grookin\' love slickies!', '', 72930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nibbin\' these slickies gonna grook you in the jerb.', '', 72929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First the fish!...  Now you?', '', 72928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the rudest thing anyone\'s ever done to me!', '', 72927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I\'m really angry!', '', 72926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can tell that booming voice that he\'s nothing but hot air!', '', 72925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before your terrestrial overlord as fire rains down upon you!', '', 72924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste hot TNT you fishy fiends!', '', 72923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was never that good with a fishing pole...  No matter!', '', 72922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha!  Take that you unsuspecting water dwellers!', '', 72921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh wait, I have a better one!', '', 72920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, well on second thought...', '', 72919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no, that\'s not what I want.', '', 72918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want a panther encrusted in the world\'s finest jewels!  Wait, doesn\'t one of my friends already have one of those?', '', 72917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh I know!  I wish for all the beer in Stormstout Brewery!', '', 72916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish for a million gold, wait a second  I already have a million gold...  I wish for a million million gold!', '', 72915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightning is better than thunder right?  Well, then I wish to be crowned the Lightning King of Pandaria!', '', 72914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is very sad that fish have no trails or mountains to climb.  If I bring them more fish friends will they be happy?', '', 72913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The smell of good fortune is upon this lake...  or is that just Fishbreath?', '', 72912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you happen to have any fishing supplies?', 'Do you happen to have any fishing supplies?', 72911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t even know how to fish! Can you teach me?', 'I don\'t even know how to fish! Can you teach me?', 72910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These fish jump up and down like a bouncing luckydo!', '', 72909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even better, can you just show me on my map?', 'Even better, can you just show me on my map?', 72908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, I\'d love to hear a secret.', 'Sure, I\'d love to hear a secret.', 72907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mad Qao Pao and his Jewel Danio were last found  in the Summer Fields in Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Probably around this area. $b$b<Ben marks a spot on your map.>$b$b', '', 72906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mad Qao-Pao doesn\'t mean any harm. Truly, he doesn\'t. He heard that the pond in front of the Mogu\'shan Palace granted wishes, you see... like a wishing well. $b $b And... well... the poor guy has more gold than wit. Last I heard, he\'s been dumping gold into the water... hoping to become king of the world! $b $b Sadly, Jewel Danio\'s favorite treats are fireflies that fly low on the water. The glimmer of the coins lures them out in droves. $b $b Hopefully the poor things aren\'t swallowing too many coins. Today\'s the day to get Jewel Danio if you want, though. You may even find a couple of coins yourself.', '', 72905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tiger Gourami will be found near the pagoda of Shado-pan Monastery... here, in Kun-Lai Summit. $b$b<Ben marks a spot on your map.>$b$b', '', 72904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Last night, Master Snowdrift was giving some lessons at the Shado-Pan monastery in Kun-Lai Summit. He was teaching his students how to cast fists of frost. $b $b The good news is, the students did great. The bad news is, hundreds of icy fist balls were cast into the water. This froze the Tiger Gourami living in the surrounding lake!$b $b If you\'re looking to catch some Tiger Gourami today, that\'s probably your best bet.', '', 72903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Spinefish are right here on your map. Off the shores of Bin\'an Village in Kun-Lai Summit. Anywhere the sky is dark and heavy.', '', 72902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jin\'yu of Binan Village in Kun-Lai Summit spoke to the water today, and it is TEEMING with Sha. $b $b You may already know this, but the Spinefish is a rather aggressive fish. Now, you mix that with a little bit\'o that Sha mojo, and you\'ve got a proper frenzy in the make!  $b $b If you can catch those angry beasties, you may help restore balance to their fragile ecosystem... not to mention gettin\' yourself a dream catch of Spinefish.', '', 72901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find the Krasarang Paddlefish AND that no-good goblin in the biggest pool of the Krasari River. Right in the heart of Krasarang Wilds. Right here. $b$b<Ben pokes a hole in your map with his claw.>$b$b', '', 72900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I look angry? Well it\'s because I AM! $b $b My arch nemesis, Wizak Blastbait, is encroaching pretty close onto my turf. He\'s a nasty little goblin, who uses... non-conventional means of fishing.  $b $b Last I saw him, he was at Krasari Falls. You should fish there today if you want Krasarang Paddlefish, I bet he\'s scaring them up left and right. Maybe if he sees other people fishing there, he\'ll deem the area overcrowded and leave. $b $b Oh, and if you can,  make a rude gesture at him. Tell\'m old Ben sent\'ya.$b$b<Ben smirks to himself.>$b$b', '', 72899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best place to go for Emperor Salmon would probably be right outside the brewery here in the Valley of Four Winds. I\'ll mark it on your map.', '', 72898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here in Valley of the Four Winds, we have our famous Stormstout Brewery. You may have noticed that a rather destructive bunch of Hozu have decided to make that place their own. Their drunken debauchery is known to get a little out of hand. $b $b Sometimes, after a new batch of brew is made, they are known to have beer fights. That\'s right, gallons upon gallons of brew are wasted and wash away into the Yan-Zhe river. $b $b The beer attracts Emperor Salmon, and they swarm like nothin\' I\'ve ever seen. They\'re a bit easier to catch, too... seein\' as they\'ve had a few.', '', 72897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ben scratches his head.>$b$b I\'m not the greatest with directions, but I reckon the Redbelly Mandarin are about\'s here, in the Fields of Niuzao in Townlong Steppes. $b$b<Ben circles a general area on your map.>$b$b', '', 72896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So today as I was gathering supplies, I found a wandering sherpa who sold exotic potions and oils. One of the more strange oils he had was known as a \"love potion\" for fish.  $b $b Nevermind how he created it, just know that the stuff REALLY works! It DOUBLED the Redbelly Mandarin population in his pond! $b $b I found him at the lake north of Niuzao Temple. You\'d probably do some good if you helped even out the population there.', '', 72895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, sure. The Jade Lungfish are found about here, in the Enchanted Woods of the Lost in Jade Forest on your map. It\'s not the biggest pool in Pandaria, but it\'s majestic all its own.', '', 72894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('During a full moon, the sprite darters in The Woods of The Lost in Jade forest are known to shed their scales. They do it late at night and it\'s actually beautiful to see. $b $b Their scales glow with a bright jade light and fleck off into the water. This attracts Jade Lungfish like you wouldn\'t believe! Like moths to the light! $b $b Careful not to disturb those mogu, though... they ain\'t exactly the friendly type.', '', 72893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thinkin\' the Reef Octopi are hereabouts this area in Sri-La village of Jade Forest. $b$b<Ben stuffs a pin along the Northeast shore of Jade Forest on your map.>$b$b', '', 72892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Anglers over at Sri-La village are reporting an unusually high number of Reef Octopi at their village. I\'d wager that it\'s spawning season, but who knows? $b $b The problem is, that the increased octopus influx is damaging the shellfish population... and everyone knows the real money is in shellfish. $b $b Dangle your bobber there for a minute or two, I bet you\'d walk away with swarms of those octopi.', '', 72891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure thing, friend. I\'ll mark where you can find Mantis Shrimp map. Take a look at the Northwest corner of Dread Wastes, it\'s a place called Gokk\'lok Shallows.', '', 72890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After a high tide in the Gokk\'lokk Shallows in Dread Wastes, sometimes the increased fish activity loosens the kelp along the shore. $b $b Shrimp, octopus, and all manner\'o\'things get tangled up in there. I bet you could get you a small fortune o\' Mantis Shrimp if you fished out there a while.$b $b  Let me know if you need help finding it.', '', 72889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you lookin\' to hear a secret about where to fish?', '', 72888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna get in on a little secret? It\'s about where to fish today...', '', 72887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is great arcane power on this island. I cannot yet tell if it lies in the hands of the Thunder King, or in the hands of our old Sunreaver allies.$B$BWe will find out in time.', '', 72886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My ship took a beating to make landing on these shores. I will see to it that they pay for every single nick on her hull.', 72885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enemies litter this isle, both old and new. We will not gain a foot of ground here without spilling blood for it.', 72884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is discouraging that Lei Shen has found so many allies to flock to his throne so soon after his return. We should have done a better job to eliminate them during his absence.', 72883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be happy to help you empty that pack of yours.', '', 72882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make it out of there with anything good?', 72881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.  Let\'s get out of here.', 'I\'m ready to leave.  Let\'s get out of here.', 72880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make every second count.\n\nWhen you\'re ready to go, let me know and I\'ll get you out of here.', '', 72879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s the key.  Let\'s go.', 'Here\'s the key.  Let\'s go.', 72878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu and Zandalari are in the process of moving another shipment of treasures from Lei Shen\'s tomb to his throne room.  We will strike quickly and take as much as we can before his forces arrive.  You will only have a limited time before we pull you out, so be efficient $n.\n\nWe\'re only getting one shot at this, so make it count.\n\nWhen you\'re ready to begin, hand me the key and I\'ll open the door.', 72877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence of Xuen roars triumphantly and disperses into celestial dust.', '', 72876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardian Tak\'u has awakened!', '', 72875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stone begins to fall away from the guardian. The ritual is almost complete!', '', 72874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The guardian begins to move with a rumble.', '', 72873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dust falls from the guardian as it begins to crack.', '', 72872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence of Niuzao rumbles in acceptance of your aid.', '', 72871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence of Yu\'lon smiles warmly at you as it fades into the sky.', '', 72870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The essence of Chi-Ji dissipates, leaving a scattered trail of stardust.', '', 72869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, these will have to do. The Klaxxi\'va send their thanks, though I don\'t know why.', '', 72868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for my mission.', 'I\'m ready for my mission.', 72867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have the required pumpkins?', '', 72866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmmm! I just love green cabbage soup!', '', 72865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is our order of green cabbages ready to go?', '', 72864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just love the sound they make when they explode!', 'I just love the sound they make when they explode!', 72863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could use some more of those beautiful striped melons!', 'We could use some more of those beautiful striped melons!', 72862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you so much! The Golden Lotus is in your debt.', 'Thank you so much! The Golden Lotus is in your debt.', 72861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re in desperate need of those turnips!', 'We\'re in desperate need of those turnips!', 72860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, here they are! Lion\'s Landing thanks you!', '', 72858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have the witchberries?', '', 72857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Domination Point thanks you!', 'Domination Point thanks you!', 72856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here for the order of red blossom leeks.', 'I\'m here for the order of red blossom leeks.', 72855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farmer Yoon, will you join the council of the Tillers Union?', 'Farmer Yoon, will you join the council of the Tillers Union?', 72854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am working with Seedkeeper Shing Sing to develop more efficient methods of farming, harvesting, and storage. Delicious, fresh, high-quality produce is what the Tillers aim to deliver!', '', 72853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear that the Shado-Pan are preparing to assault the Isle of Thunder to the northwest. They will need plenty of food, and we\'re the ones to supply it!', '', 72852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friends down in the Krasarang Wilds have quite the appetites. There\'s an endless demand for fresh produce.', '', 72851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever since the Vale opened up its gates, we\'ve been sending shipment after shipment of vegetables north.', '', 72850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got my hands full around here, but The Heartland is prospering.', '', 72849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is Sunsong Ranch doing, $n?', '', 72848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never knew that helping the Tillers Union would be so much work.', '', 72847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d better head up and talk to Nana. The farm is yours now, $n. I know you\'ll take great care of it.', '', 72846, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'m gifting Sunsong Ranch to you. You\'re in charge, now!', '', 72844, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This farm has been in my family for generations. How can I give it up? Yet, a greater responsibility has fallen upon me.', '', 72843, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I don\'t think I\'ll have time to work for the council, AND run Sunsong Ranch.', '', 72842, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nana Mudclaw asked ME to join the Tillers council?', '', 72841, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just think of all the knowledge I could share. Think of all the food we could grow!', '', 72840, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: INITIATED', '', 72839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sparkmaster Vu stares at you mutely. With a powerful swing of his halberd, he attacks!', '', 72838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My hammer always strikes true! Let the fires rage once again!', '', 72836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who wishes to test my spears?', '', 72835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to waste. The Horde move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!', 72834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Plotting your demise', '', 72833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no time to waste. The Alliance move on the Isle of Thunder as we speak!', 72832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Setting doom level to 15,000 milli-dooms', '', 72831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Successfully dividing by zero', '', 72830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: COMPLETE', '', 72829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Repressing urge to activate early', '', 72828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Starting micro suppressors', '', 72827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Deciphering command parse', '', 72826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Rerouting auxiliary power', '', 72825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activation Sequence: Matrixing protocols', '', 72824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good, a $c. We could use more of your kind for some of these tasks.', '', 72823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All this electricity in the air is wreaking havoc on my hair.', '', 72822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n makes the catch!', '$n makes the catch!', 72821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_disease_02.blp:20|tThe Eye Servant picks up |cFFFF0000$n|r and |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134668|h[Gnaws]|h|r on them!', '', 72820, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye Sentry pulls nearby enemies into its field of misery, defeat it to get free!', '', 72819, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upon dying, the Hidden Fog\'s Burst of Light reveals all Pale Fogs in the area.', '', 72818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nearby activity of living flesh drives some Bore Worms to action!', '', 72817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Corpse Spider stirs from its sleep in the webs above!', '', 72816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Gastropod starts chasing |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_removecurse.blp:20|tThe Dark Parasites morph into a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133598|h[Dark Plague]|h|r!', '', 72814, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ji-Kun goes into a berserk rage!', '', 72813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_animalhandler.blp:20|tJi-Kun |cFFFF0000|Hspell:138923|h[Caws]|h|r, sending powerful sound waves at her enemies!', '', 72812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_dragonhawk.blp:20|tJi-Kun sends her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134380|h[Quills]|h|r flying in all directions!', '', 72811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_galewinds.blp:20|tJi-Kun uses her wings to create a massive |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134370|h[Down Draft]|h|r!', '', 72810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly up to the nests above to stop Juveniles from hatching.', '', 72809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p. The crystals of this island are better in our hands than the Kirin Tor\'s.', '', 72808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A powerful gem.', '', 72807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slain Hatchlings will drop feathers, use the feather to fly for short periods of time.', '', 72806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the Hatchlings before they get a chance to eat and mature.', '', 72805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm. This is a good crystal. You have done well, $p.', '', 72804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly the Kirin Tor has no clue about the power of this island. They are just here to stop us out of spite. Those ignorant amateur mages must be taught a lesson.', '', 72803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step out of the illuminated area before Force of Will finishes casting to avoid being knocked down.', '', 72802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your way through the maze of Eye Sores while avoiding Durumu\'s Disintegration Beam.', '', 72801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forge is safe, and we must take our leave.  Good luck on your quest, adventurer.', '', 72800, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'alah belore, hero. Good luck.', '', 72799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough talk. You know how precarious our position is. Between the Alliance and the Thunder King, only with the help of heroes like you can we hope to succeed here.', '', 72798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha-hah! It will feel good to bloody my blade again. Against Alliance or mogu, does not matter to me.', '', 72797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up!', '', 72796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the event of an uprising, we must be prepared.', '', 72795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, in defeating him, we must seek out the source of his great power. We must claim it for ourselves, as leverage against our \"Warchief.\"', '', 72794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are here to fight the Thunder King. Justice demands it, and Hellscream is too preoccupied at Domination Point to pay attention here.', '', 72793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Warchief\'s campaign across Kalimdor and Pandaria is pulling the Horde apart at the seams.', '', 72792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero, you have served the Horde nobly across many campaigns. I feel I can take you into confidence.', '', 72791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aethas, leave us for a moment.', '', 72790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to speak with the Lord Regent. He\'s waiting for you at the prow.', 72789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa! Careful - it is nearly impossible to fly anywhere near the island!', 72788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we have our own reasons for assisting them. I will allow Lor\'themar to explain.', 72787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'The Pandaren are terrified that the former Emperor will try to reclaim his empire, and enslave them once again.', 72786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Just ahead: The Isle of the Thunder King.', 72785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! Can you feel the power of this crystal? I can almost feel my hair standing on end.', '', 72784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Thunder King built a palatial fortress on the borders of his empire. We should see it soon...', 72783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He united the mogu, defeated the other pandaren races, and founded a glorious nation with the slave labor of those he conquered.', 72782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pandaren legends tell of Lei Shen, \"The Thunder King.\" He was the brutal founder of the Mogu empire over 12,000 years ago.', 72781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re here! The Regent Lord had asked about you specifically. Are you ready to go?', 72780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready! [Queue for solo instance.]', 'I am ready! [Queue for solo instance.]', 72779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This fight will take everything we have. I hope you are ready.', 72778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde will find no purchase on these shores. And when the Thunder King lies beaten, the Pandaren will see that it was Alliance heroes who stood by them in their hour of need.', 72777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But this time, we\'re a step ahead.', 72776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They seek to defeat the Thunder King, not to protect Pandaria, but to claim his power for themselves.', 72775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just down the coast, the Horde is searching for a place to land their troops.', 72774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lesson is clear. From here on out, I\'m taking the initiative.', 72773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This has been the worst year of my life: Theramore, destroyed. And a betrayal from within the Kirin-Tor.', 72772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Jaina Proudmoore would like to see you as soon as possible.', 72771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoa - look out! We have to land. It is almost impossible to fly here!', 72770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the Thunder King is not defeated, Pandaria will suffer. But worse: if the Horde lays their hands on the source of his power, the whole WORLD will pay the price.', 72769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it is! The Isle of the Thunder King. Already, the Horde is circling it like hungry birds of prey.', 72768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Legend has it that the Thunder King possessed enormous power, and built himself a palatial fortress. We should be able to see it soon...', 72767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He united the mogu, conquered the other pandaren races, and built an empire that would last for thousands of years.', 72766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35971, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over 12,000 years ago, the Mogu empire was founded by Lei Shen, \"The Thunder King.\"', 72765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Pandaren are deeply concerned about the return of this \"Thunder King.\" But I\'m more concerned about the Horde. We can talk during the flight.', 72764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you\'re here! Proudmoore needs all the reinforcements she can get. Are you ready to go?', 72763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35968, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight well, $r.', 72762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us be done with this, so we can all return to our homes.', 72761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to clean up the mess that stems from the Skumblade saurok.$b$bWhile theirs is a different type of mess than I\'m accustomed to, there are certainly several similarities.', '', 72760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saurok intrigue me.$b$bSo much so, in fact, that some have started calling me \"Skumblade Steve\".', '', 72759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The saurok are despicable, but they may end up useful.$b$bIf we can incite them against the mogu, they can draw attention away from our men.', 72758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can\'t ignore our flanks.$b$bWhile both the Horde and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment.', 72756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light be with you, brave $r.', '', 72755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care not to forget the true price of war.', '', 72754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the color cones to reveal and slay the three hidden fog beasts.', '', 72753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m here to deal with the disease and plague that stems from the Skumblade saurok.$b$bWhile theirs is a different type of plague than I\'m accustomed to, there are certainly several similarities.', 72752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The saurok intrigue me.$b$bHow is it that they\'ve survived so long in the shadow of their clearly superior enemy?', 72751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saurok are despicable, but they may end up useful.$b$bIf we can incite them against the mogu, they can draw attention away from our men.', '', 72750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth.blp:20|tDurumu infects his enemies with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133597|h[Dark Parasites]|h|r!', '', 72749, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Megaera\'s rage subsides.', 'Megaera\'s rage subsides.', 72748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll drag your corpse to the filth pit!', '', 72747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear the mogu to pieces!', '', 72746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die in pain, mogu!', '', 72745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Ihgaluk!', '', 72744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the mogu!', '', 72743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Removing the tome.', 'Removing the tome.', 72742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunder Forge has begun to charge an area nearby.  Run into it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[Overcharge]|h|r yourself!', '', 72741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regroup behind the wards, everyone. They will counter-attack... but we will be ready.', '', 72740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Again you are at the forefront of a Horde triumph. And once more I am in your debt.', '', 72739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. This is where I belong.', '', 72738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers - to me! We have broken their lines!', '', 72737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m hit! Leave me - finish that thing off!', 72736, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 36382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Horde!!', 72735, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 36378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather up those explosives!', '', 72734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry - bring me those explosives!', '', 72733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s nothing. I\'m fine.', 72732, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s dead! You\'re an inspiration to the Kirin Tor!', 72729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bar the gates. The Zandalari have failed to hold the wall.', '', 72728, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Zandalar!!', '', 72727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be punished! Your life a lesson in futility!', '', 72726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too much... the spirits cannot contain his might...', '', 72725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was chosen. My blood burns with his power!', '', 72724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step forward! Witness the gift of the Thunder King!', '', 72723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
