('', 'I\'m hurt - don\'t back down.', 72721, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the light - what did they DO to that thing?', 72720, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the breech! Focus on their priests - they\'re empowering the others!', 72719, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way - the Zandalari are falling back!', 72718, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! We\'re through - pull together, everyone. Press the advantage!', 72717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wall is wired up and ready to go - the honor is all yours!', 72716, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 35922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must break through - where are my explosives?', 72715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry up with the explosives!', 72714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn away, weaklings. This be the realm of the Thunder King!', '', 72713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu and Zandalari cower behind the Thunder King\'s walls. Lady Jaina has a plan to blast our way through. Speak to me when you\'re ready!', 72712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C! Come to my aid!', '$C! Come to my aid!', 72711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, it is good to see you. It will be an honor to face Lei Shen.$b$bThe lorewalkers of the Wandering Isle told us many stories of the dreaded Thunder King. We must proceed with caution here. If legends are to be believed, he was as clever as he was brutal.', 72710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $p!$b$bWe have a chance to stop the Thunder King himself before he can reclaim his former power.$b$bEven on the Wandering Isle, his hateful name is remembered, and the sound of thunder feared by pandaren children.', '', 72709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaol\'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!', 'Shaol\'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!', 72708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m with you. Let\'s break into that shipyard! [Queue for solo instance.]', 'I\'m with you. Let\'s break into that shipyard! [Queue for solo instance.]', 72707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe Thunderwing here is our opportunity to score a devastating blow against Lei Shen.', 72706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lei Shen must not be allowed to marshal his full strength.$b$bA direct assault on the front gates will take time, and the aid of your Alliance and Horde. But if there is one thing we Shado-pan know it is that where there is a wall, there is a way around.$b$bThe sewers at the back of this tunnel lead all the way to the fortress entrance. We must hold this entrance.', '', 72705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bar the gates. The Zandalari have failed to hold the wall.', '', 72701, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Zandalar!!', '', 72700, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 36001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be punished! Your life a lesson in futility!', '', 72699, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 36000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
