('', 'You need to get back to camp. I can\'t lose you.', 72694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vereesa, are you hurt?', 72693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done! We\'re through - pull together, everyone. Press the advantage!', 72692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
