('', 'Kill that thing!', 72690, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m hurt - do not back down.', 72689, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the Light - what did they DO to that thing?', 72688, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the breech! Focus on their priests - they\'re empowering the others!', 72687, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way - the Zandalari are falling back!', 72686, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regroup behind the wards, everyone. They will counter-attack... but we will be ready.', '', 72685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Again you are at the forefront of a Horde triumph. And once more I am in your debt.', '', 72684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35635, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nonsense. This is where I belong.', '', 72683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers - to me! We have broken their lines!', '', 72682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Lord Regent - you should not be so close to the front lines.', 72681, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 36383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What... what did they DO to that troll!?', 72680, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 36381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through the breech! Target the wounded!', 72679, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 36380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way - the Zandalari are falling back!', 72678, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 36379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spectacular! Move up - press onward. Show them no quarter!', '', 72677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sha Amalgamation begins casting |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139382|h[Insanity]|h|r!  Discharge one of the anvils to stop it!', '', 72676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to tear down the wall! [Queue for solo instance.]', 'I\'m ready to tear down the wall! [Queue for solo instance.]', 72675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gods and Monsters.', 'Gods and Monsters.', 72674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumbles of Thunder.', 'Rumbles of Thunder.', 72673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari Prophecy.', 'The Zandalari Prophecy.', 72672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure that you no longer want the Codex of Xerrath?', 'Are you sure that you no longer want the Codex of Xerrath?', 72671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka, I no longer wish to be tainted by this fel energy.', 'Jubeka, I no longer wish to be tainted by this fel energy.', 72670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n. \n\nKanrethad\'s power is too great to allow him to be free. I\'ll ensure he stays banished, for as long as I exist.\n\nStill, a taste of the fel energies he is saturated with should cause no ill. Feel free to drain some for your own use. Should you ever grow tired of its effects, I can purge the fel energy from you, for a price.', 72669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are being chased by lightning!', '', 72668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An empty crate waits to be filled and prepared for delivery.', '', 72667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be exterminated!', '', 72666, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 35725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared, $n?', 72665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taoshi nods toward the crewman on the right. Sneak up behind him to knock him out!', 72664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lance is finished. Quickly, hurl it at the sha!', '', 72663, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 36411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve overcharged the anvils. They will be VERY effective against the sha, but each one can only be used once more!', '', 72662, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 36410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You aren\'t harboring any bad thoughts, are you?', '', 72661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh - I may have spoken too soon. The sha grows in strength! Destroy it!', '', 72660, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 36408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There. Problem solved.', '', 72659, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps if I overcharge the forge, it will destabilize this sha nuisance? Let\'s try it.', '', 72658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This foundry should be sufficient.  We will empower the metal with an electrical charge.', '', 72657, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan are here! They may be of use to us. We should help.', '', 72656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\trade_archaeology_whitehydrafigurine:20|tMegaera begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:139458|h[Rampage]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\trade_archaeology_whitehydrafigurine:20|tMegaera begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:139458|h[Rampage]|h|r!', 72655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And thank YOU, hero. It will be difficult to hold the forge, but think of what we can learn here!', 72654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, they will be. But knowledge is power, and I will never turn down an opportunity to study something new. Thank you, Taoshi.', 72653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vereesa, gather up everything we can find before the mogu return. Leave nothing for the Horde to claim.', 72652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But together we have delivered a terrible blow to the Thunder King!', 72651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My lady. Weapons of the Thunder King are an abomination. They should be destroyed.', 72650, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 35847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We share a common enemy, Lady Proudmoore. Nothing more.', 72649, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 35846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You two did it! I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies.', 72648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rangers! Secure the forge. Smash the gate, so it cannot be closed!', 72647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Proudmoore, it is safe for you to enter.', 72646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do I look like a human?', 'Why do I look like a human?', 72645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the tale of A Little Patience!$B$BIt was here that the king of men, Varian Wrynn, counseled patience to Tyrande Whisperwind, high priestess of the night elf\'s moon goddess and leader of their people.$B$BKing Varian\'s plan -- and the work of three bold adventurers! -- saw to an Alliance victory at the temple of the Red Crane, despite being vastly outnumbered by Commander Scargash\'s Horde forces.', '', 72644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, because you are an actor in this tale!$B$BMuch better than simply reading history from some musty old scroll, wouldn\'t you agree?$B$BNow go forward, and learn!', '', 72643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 6, 0, 39653),
('Why do I look like a troll?', 'Why do I look like a troll?', 72642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the tale of the Dagger in the Dark!$B$BIt was here that three bold adventurers saved Vol\'jin, leader of the Horde\'s Darkspear trolls, from certain assassination.', '', 72641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Observe your demise.', '', 72640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m keeping an eye on you.', '', 72639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mists hide many secrets ... if you know where to look.', '', 72638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your footing ... muhahaha!', '', 72637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like you couldn\'t keep up ... pity.', '', 72636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see what I did there?', '', 72635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ... welcome ... the void\'s ... embrace.', '', 72634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I expected so much more. How ... disappointing.', '', 72633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power of the void.', '', 72632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thousands of years ... without new playthings ... I will enjoy this.', '', 72631, 0, 0, 558, 65, 0, 35339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have met the various factions in Pandaria, work orders will pour in.', '', 72630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Shado-Pan agent will meet you behind the mines. Good luck!!', 72629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be ready to dogfight in the air. Jump from mount to mount if you have to!', 72628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari may come after you.', 72627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think you can ride it?', 72626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This beautiful creature you rescued is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island.', 72625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the Fall of Shan Bu scenario.', 'Enter the Fall of Shan Bu scenario.', 72624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vereesa is waiting for you, champion.', 72623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak to me when you are ready to begin.', 72622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I have a plan to infiltrate the Thunder King\'s armory. We\'ll use that creature you recovered, with a little help from the Shado-Pan.', 72621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail, friend!', 72620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu, the mantid, the saurok... they are not just enemies to defeat. They are mysteries to solve!', '', 72619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, have a drink. The prince here is showing me how to play one of the local games.', '', 72618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren embrace life. With so much fighting all around us, it is refreshing to know what we\'re fighting for.', '', 72617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We still have so much to learn.', '', 72616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This continent does not give up its secrets easily.', '', 72615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, if you are looking for the Black Prince, you will find him upstairs.', '', 72614, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have doomed yourselves. It... is... unleashed.', '', 72613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 35724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The power... It cannot be wielded this way! You tempt forces you do not understand!', '', 72612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 35722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them! The Animus must not be disturbed!', '', 72611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 35725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I swore an oath to the Kirin Tor. That bond was one of trust and mutual understanding. And then they betrayed that bond. It is time to remind them the blood elves do not suffer betrayal lightly.', 72610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah ha ha... You thought you could defeat me? NOTHING can kill me now, puny mortal!', '', 72609, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! And you\'ll get in trouble for that too! Now ring the bell you big baby.', '', 72608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But my dad says I\'m too little to drink.', '', 72607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep! You don\'t do this and I\'ll tell everyone in Dawn\'s Blossom you are a big chicken who likes wine instead of beer!', '', 72606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*gulp* Dou... dou... double hozen dare?', '', 72605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard that from your sister and she doesn\'t count. She\'s a big meanie. I double hozen dare you to ring the bell!', '', 72604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bellmaster is right over there. I heard he turns kids into bells!', '', 72603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I double dare you!', '', 72602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No way. That bell is bigger than my daddy\'s belly!', '', 72601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dare you!', '', 72600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nuh uh! And besides, that\'s not a gong! It\'s a bell. I didn\'t say I would hit a bell.', '', 72599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You said you would ring the gong first.', '', 72598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:134916|h[Decapitate]|h|r killed you.  The further you are from Lei Shen, the lower the damage from Decapitate. Have the off-tank taunt!', '', 72597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My parents once spoke of a strange, furry folk that lived far to the south of our homeland before the Sundering. I always assumed they spoke of smarter furbolgs.$b$bI know now just how wrong I was. Would that they still walked this world and could see this.', '', 72596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ancient beast stirs within the mists!', 'An ancient beast stirs within the mists!', 72595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cavern trembles violently!', 'The cavern trembles violently!', 72594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOOLS! I will show you how it is done!', '', 72593, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I no longer remember where the others are. Indeed it has been so long since we last saw each other the others may very well be dead, or replaced by their pupils. I can only have faith that there are still five of us left.', '', 72592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Five sorcerers?', 'Five sorcerers?', 72591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I told you... it would not be called a secret, now would it?', '', 72590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What secrets?', 'What secrets?', 72589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My order has long wandered these lands, lending aid where we can. Ever since the days of Lei Shen there have been five of our order, passing the secrets of our order from generation to generation.', '', 72588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFF00000Megaera|r rises from the mists!', '|cFFF00000Megaera|r rises from the mists!', 72587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Got a work related complaint to register? Great! That\'ll be five hundred macaroons for investigation fees and three hundred macaroons for assorted palm greasing.', 72586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, and don\'t die.', '', 72585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must make preparations back on the mainland. Return to me at the Veiled Stair when you have what I need.', '', 72584, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 36054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is important to throw the spear just before slaying the beast. Not a moment too soon! Not a moment too late!', '', 72583, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 36053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful! The moment it pierces his hide, you will be assaulted by his power.', '', 72582, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 36052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must thrust the spear into the heart of the Storm Lord while he still lives.', '', 72581, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are done here, but the weapon is not yet tempered.', '', 72580, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Our work is complete - we have forged a masterpiece!', '', 72579, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no - this isn\'t right at all. Let\'s get out of here.', '', 72578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forge is overwhelmed! We\'ve got to leave!', '', 72577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no good - too dangerous. We\'ll try again later!', '', 72576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! Protect the forge - I am almost finished.', '', 72575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up. I am working miracles here!', '', 72574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forge draws power from the surrounding land. Amazing! I suspect at one time this whole island looked like the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', '', 72573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re an expert at destroying sha by now. Clean up this mess!', '', 72572, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 36042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that. This old Titan technology is acting like a magnet for the sha.', '', 72571, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this - \"Anomaly detected.\" Anomaly?', '', 72570, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 36040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King.', '', 72569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohh, look at that!', '', 72568, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 36038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly there\'s an easier way - oh. Ah! There we go!', '', 72567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortunately I can just disable the security. What would you do without me, hm?', '', 72566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do me a favor and silence those things. I am otherwise engaged.', '', 72565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You titans infuriate me. I am acting on behalf of the greater good.', '', 72564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Security Protocols?\" Ridiculous. Why were the Titans so obsessed with hiding all of their wonderful toys?', '', 72563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect the forge!', '', 72562, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 36032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, keep away the distractions.  I need to concentrate on this.', '', 72561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that. How easy it must have been for Lei Shen to build an empire, for he wielded the power to create worlds.', '', 72560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch my back while I activate the forge. Did you know that all dragons innately understand the language of the Titans? No doubt a part of their \"grand design.\"', '', 72559, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now if I were a dwarf I would just start randomly pushing buttons. But you and I are here for a purpose.', '', 72558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How interesting! This forge is built atop of ancient Titan machinery. Lei Shen, you clever, clever tyrant, you!', '', 72557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! The materials are prepared.  Follow me.', '', 72556, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 36026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to concentrate. Keep the foundry clear!', '', 72555, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 36025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear out the rabble, would you?', '', 72554, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 36024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready to fight if we draw too much attention.', '', 72553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This foundry should be sufficient.  Help me manipulate the molds.', '', 72552, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 36022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trillium you brought me must be refined for our purposes.', '', 72551, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 36021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! You\'re here.  Speak to me when you\'re ready to begin.', '', 72550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dunna\' be judgin\' too quickly, ya? Dis lil\' trinket be exactly what ya looking for, smeller man.', '', 72549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, come on! Dis\' deal be a good one and ya know it ya snuffler.', '', 72548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ya be smellin\' fortune eh? What say ya come with me to Bilgewater and we make a fortune at the gamblin\' tables.', '', 72547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya can\'t be riding yaks into the mountains without a bonified \"Lucktug\"! That be madness! Lemme sell ya some for cheap.', '', 72546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya grummles be good sports. I be likin\' the cut of your jib.$b$bFor dat reason, I be willing to part with this \"Luckydo Kazoo\" which be makin\' only deh most luckiest of music.', '', 72545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that smell? What is that smell?! Is that you Griftah? How can you have that smell? This is most offensive. Most offensive, yes.', '', 72544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And to think, my friends say I \"troll\" too much. I must show them you, Griftah.', '', 72543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Griftah! That is one of my luckydos! Where did you get that?', '', 72542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren have many legends about trolls like you, Griftah. Many legends indeed.', '', 72541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Griftah, your nose is too pointy to smell good fortune. And you smell like unwashed yak.', '', 72540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Griftah, you think those are luckydos? They smell more like luckydon\'ts.', '', 72539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya tink these herbs and fancy incense be givin\' ya luck in dah mountains? Ha ha! Ya not be tradin\' with dah right mon, mon. Come be gettin\' you a genuine Lucky Lock!', '', 72538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahaha, get a load \'a me, mon!$b$bGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!$b$bWant more luck for deh mountains? Want tah buy the best \"luckydo\" ya ever smelled? Well step right up and don\' be talkin\' to grummles. Just let your good ol\' friend Griftah lead ya right.$b$bThese miraculous baubles be cheap at tripple the price!', '', 72537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Celestial Defender manifests an area of |cFFFF2222|Hspell:140068|h[healing energy]|h|r!', '', 72536, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Celestial Defender is near death!', '', 72535, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Celestial Blacksmith is near death!', '', 72534, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We found a saddle and harness from one of the carcasses of the various beasts being shot out of the sky.$b$bA little polish and a little magic and presto... good as new!', '', 72533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am astounded by how quickly this creature grows. At first the diet of cheeses was simply irritating the beast.$b$bBut then we fed it some of the local goats and it started booming in size.$b$bA voracious creature to be sure.', '', 72532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a delightful specimen you have captured. I have been teaching it to not electrocute our servants. Though it is still a hatchling, and you have to expect such behavior when it is this young.$b$bThankfully the sunwalker over there has been quite helpful in healing those injured by such mischief.$b$bOh, and I took the liberty of giving your tiny creature a name.', '', 72531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Such an exotic land. I am sure there is quite a menagerie of animals and beasts to be found here. And all with that delightful electrical discharge popping off their bodies.', '', 72530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:135096|h[Thunderstruck]|h|r killed you.  Move away from the impact point to decrease damage taken.', '', 72529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before me!', '', 72528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightning strikes.', '', 72527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My judgment is final.', '', 72526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 72525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minuscule.', '', 72524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this!', '', 72523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sought only to finish... the work of the Gods...', '', 72522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! You are UNWORTHY! I... AM... THE THUNDER KING!', '', 72521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are NOTHING! I wield the power of the heavens!', '', 72520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I will crush you myself. Let us see how you fare against Lightning.', '', 72519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would challenge me in my own sanctum? Witness your folly!', '', 72518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have sealed your doom!', '', 72517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power cannot be contained!', '', 72516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind, heed my call!', '', 72515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lightning, seek my foes!', '', 72514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Submit!', '', 72513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 72512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel!', '', 72511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Lei Shen, slayer of kings and gods. You have made a grave mistake.', '', 72510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! You have earned my ire. I will make an example of you, such that all who look upon my might will tremble and submit.', '', 72509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks.', '', 72508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have swept the filth from my doorstep. Perhaps you are worthy of my attention.', '', 72507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These insects have not yet learned their place, Gara\'jal. If you wish to prove your \"might\" on such weaklings it matters not to me.', '', 72506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s devours your Enslave Demon!', '', 72505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many imps! Handle it!', '', 72504, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...AUGHHHHHH!!!', '', 72503, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka?! What are you...?!', '', 72502, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, your sad tale comes to an end.', '', 72501, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah ha ha... You thought you could defeat me? NOTHING can kill me now, puny mortal!', '', 72500, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now go, and use what you\'ve learned. If you ever wish to have the fel energy purged from you, or reabsorb some of Kanrethad\'s, talk to me. I\'ll be at the Altar of Damnation in Shadowmoon Valley, keeping him banished.', 72499, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kanrethad enveloped himself with so much fel energy that it corrupted him totally. But a small taste of his power should not be harmful. Go ahead.', 72498, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, thank you for your help. While the world will not know, you\'ve saved them more than they\'re aware. Kanrethad had to be stopped. I\'ll see to it that he stays banished.', 72497, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is only what you once asked me to do if it came to this, Kanrethad. You brought this on yourself.', 72496, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the smallest demon can be valuable, in large enough numbers.', '', 72495, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If two imps are better than one imp, what\'s better than two imps? SIXTY IMPS.', '', 72494, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The felhounds are always hungry for magic to devour.', '', 72493, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While not the most powerful combatants, a pack of felhounds still has many uses.', '', 72492, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ered\'ruin have had no master since Archimonde\'s death. Now I shall be that master.', '', 72491, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archimonde\'s use of the ered\'ruin was brilliant. Their command of the dark energies is unparalleled.', '', 72490, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaotic magic always has the potential for unexpected results.', '', 72489, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrible destruction awaits you when this seed erupts.', '', 72488, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give you the gift of destruction!', '', 72487, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what this seed will grow into?', '', 72486, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plant a seed and watch it grow...', '', 72485, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destructive forces corrupt you from the inside.', '', 72484, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run in fear, coward.', '', 72483, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am untouchable!', '', 72482, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Away from me, mongrel!', '', 72481, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The anguish will creep up on you.', '', 72480, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rising pain.', '', 72479, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twist in agony.', '', 72478, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may seem meager at first, but give it a moment. Soon, the pain will be unbearable.', '', 72477, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still...', '', 72476, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll burn for that.', '', 72475, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can it be?!', '', 72474, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('UNFATHOMABLE!', '', 72473, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AUGHHHH!', '', 72472, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOO!', '', 72471, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clock is ticking...', '', 72470, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaotic energy will destroy you.', '', 72469, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chaos will reign.', '', 72468, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pure... CHAOS.', '', 72467, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn.', '', 72466, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CATACLYSMIC POWER!', '', 72465, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be your END.', '', 72464, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop your final Cataclysm!', '', 72463, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing had unstoppable power. And now, it is MINE.', '', 72462, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing!', '', 72461, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll shatter your soul!', '', 72460, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT?! Now you\'ve angered me.', '', 72459, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Annihilan are incredibly destructive creatures. Their sheer strength and power is absolutely unrivaled.', '', 72458, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to see you try.', '', 72457, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah. Your feeble attacks are entertaining. Would you like to see one of my new pets?', '', 72456, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power is unimaginable!', '', 72455, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think I\'ve gone too far? There is no such thing. The Black Harvest will enslave the most powerful demons, draw on their power, and destroy all who oppose us, in this world, and on Azeroth! Do YOU mean to stop me, little one?', '', 72453, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEHOLD! I have truly mastered the fel energies of this world! The demonic power I now command... It is indescribable, unlimited, OMNIPOTENT!', '', 72452, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO!', 72451, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No coppa? This flights on me.', '', 72450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you packed some feathers, Priest.', '', 72449, 0, 18176, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going... up?', '', 72448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a safe fall, Rogue.', '', 72447, 0, 18177, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 72446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab them ma pets!', '', 72445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da view from above is... breathtaking!', '', 72444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won a Brawler\'s Guild invitation just now! I\'ll surely be rank 8 by tonight!  I sure hope I don\'t lose my ticket before I get there.', '', 72443, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone look! I won a Brawler\'s Guild invite! I can\'t wait to try it out!', '', 72442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess I wasn\'t ready to be a brawler.', '', 72441, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YES! Finally! I won a Brawler\'s Guild invite! Nobody can stop me now!', '', 72440, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'dok winds up a powerful shield slam.', '', 72439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tinzo the Emberkeeper is stealing all of your heals!', '', 72438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tinzo the Emberkeeper is nearing full health!', '', 72437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be... punished...', '', 72436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before your master!', '', 72435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bend before me!', '', 72434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be in chains before I am done! You will beg for death!!', '', 72433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not a slave. How did you get here?', '', 72432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will soon put you in your place.', '', 72431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? Another uprising?', '', 72430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A Shado-Pan contact will be waiting to meet you behind the mines. Good luck!!', 72429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be ready to dogfight in the air. Jump from mount to mount if you have to!', 72428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very good!  Once you take to the skies, the Zandalari will try to stop you.', 72427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think you can ride it?', 72426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This creature you\'ve recovered is immune to the lightning strikes that protect the island.', 72425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the Skumblade Ritualist before the Echo of Kros eats it!', '', 72424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. You\'ll need to prove your dominance over the Horde scum before I\'ll entrust them to you.', 'My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. You\'ll need to prove your dominance over the Horde scum before I\'ll entrust them to you.', 72423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. Come see me after you\'ve swept the fields clean of Alliance filth.', 'My wares are reserved for those who have proven themselves on the field of battle. Come see me after you\'ve swept the fields clean of Alliance filth.', 72422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to begin my mission.', 'I\'m ready to begin my mission.', 72420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help, adventurer.  We will assist you as best we can in fending off the mogu.', '', 72419, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 72418, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again adventurer.  Are you ready to begin?', '', 72417, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With all respect - these abominable tools should be destroyed!', 72416, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We share a common enemy, Regent Lord, nothing more.', 72415, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 35883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In good time, my pandaren friend. In good time.', '', 72414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regardless, we have delivered a terrible blow to the Thunder King today. Horde metalsmiths can begin studying mogu fabrication techniques immediately.', '', 72413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incredible work. I knew the Shado-Pan would make excellent allies.', '', 72412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers! Secure the forge. Smash the gate, so it cannot be closed!', '', 72411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35665, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elsia is waiting for you, champion.', '', 72410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to me when you are ready to begin.', '', 72409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35663, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the help of the Shado-Pan and this beast you recovered, I believe we can infiltrate and disable the Thunder King\'s armory.', '', 72408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sinu a\'manore, champion.', '', 72407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clear a path from the ship to the gate at the upper level - we will need to cross on foot.', 72406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35862, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Zandalari!', 'Death to the Zandalari!', 72405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Let\'s keep going!', 'Come on! Let\'s keep going!', 72404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s take this fight to the Thunder King!', 'Let\'s take this fight to the Thunder King!', 72403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude.', 'You have my gratitude.', 72402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for that. Now let\'s take down that wall!', 'Thank you for that. Now let\'s take down that wall!', 72401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Press the attack!', 72400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Press the attack! We\'re smarter than they are strong!', 72399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone, stay together. Stay focused.', 72398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Zandalari are nothing but lap-dogs. Do you hear me? You are pets for the mogu!', 72397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t fall back. Don\'t give them an inch!', 72396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits shall consume you!', '', 72395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb me?', '', 72394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them, I command you! No, stop, stop!', 'Destroy them, I command you! No, stop, stop!', 72393, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 35736, 35736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you interrupt our preparations! The Zandalari will not be stopped, not this time!', 'How dare you interrupt our preparations! The Zandalari will not be stopped, not this time!', 72392, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 35737, 35737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your class cooldowns have been reset!', 'Your class cooldowns have been reset!', 72391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Light!', '', 72390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop casting! %s is generating an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:138763|h[Interrupting Jolt]|h|r.', '', 72389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, I need time to... \"digest\" what I have learned.  But soon, we will take action.', '', 72388, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 36070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are wise not to.', '', 72387, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you talking about? I don\'t trust you.', '', 72386, 0, 0, 5, 69, 0, 35310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is gone. I don\'t remember any of it. Oh! None of them remember. The irony!', '', 72385, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you trying to pull?', '', 72384, 0, 0, 274, 69, 0, 35309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE HAVE FALLEN. WE MUST REBUILD THE FINAL TITAN. DO NOT FORGET.', '', 72383, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh - I see them - a million, million worlds - glittering in their perfection - but one above all others - oh -', '', 72382, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is filled with Titan magic, the very language of creation...', '', 72381, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing? You\'re not seriously going to eat that-', '', 72380, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 35308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh - the heart of a King. The powers of a God.', '', 72379, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something tells me our friend has returned triumphant.', '', 72378, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 36063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A chill just went up my spine!', '', 72377, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 35307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring me his cruel, black heart. We will be doing the Pandaren a favor, and the powers that we liberate will once again be put to the service of Azeroth.', '', 72376, 0, 0, 25, 69, 0, 36062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunder King took within himself the powers of a Titan keeper. We must take them back!', '', 72375, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been looking forward to your return, champion.', '', 72374, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, return to me at the Veiled Stair. We should talk face-to-face.', '', 72373, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! The final piece of the puzzle. The Thunder King took on the powers of Ra-Den, the very essence of a Titan. He united the mogu into an empire and tried to continue the Titans\' work. Of course he saw himself as a God!', '', 72372, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm. This runestone speaks of mogu savagery. They fell apart into warrior clans. But one King was more ambitious than the others - Lei Shen. The Thunder King. When the Titan Keeper fell silent, Lei Shen decided to speak for him.', '', 72371, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found another piece of the puzzle! This was carved by the mogu. They were frustrated - a thousand years with no orders from their master, and their bodies had turned to flesh. The mogu began to argue among themselves.', '', 72370, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This runestone is more recent than the others. Something about \"The sleeping keeper.\" I think it\'s referring to Ra-Den. But why was he asleep?', '', 72369, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, this fragment speaks of \"The Winged Legions of Y\'Shaarj.\" Servants of an Old God? Could this mean the mantid?', '', 72368, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re beginning to put the pieces together, champion. The mogu were created and sent here to guard the Vale for their Titan masters. Guard it from what? Were the Old Gods still a threat?', '', 72367, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This runestone speaks of a \"Cradle of Life.\" A place where the Titans could create new creatures. Oh - of course - the Vale of Eternal Blossoms! It was a living laboratory, much like Un\'goro Crater or Sholazar Basin.', '', 72366, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, there is mention of an Old God. \"Y\'Shaarj.\" A beast with seven heads, who breathed darkness. I suspect that thing was the source of the sha that haunts Pandaria to this day.', '', 72365, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to this, the mogu and their master were sent to Pandaria. They were pursuing a great darkness - ah, the fragment is incomplete. We must find others.', '', 72364, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu served a Titan keeper. His name was \"Ra.\" In the mogu tongue, \"Ra-den\" means \"Master Ra.\" Fascinating! I must know more!', '', 72363, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve found another stone! What have we learned? The \"curse of flesh\" made the mogu mortal. Ah - but later, they found a way to reverse the process. A clever race.', '', 72362, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to this runestone, the mogu were Titan constructs, soulless creatures built of stone. We suspected as much.', '', 72361, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion... I would think twice before putting that thing on your head.', '', 72360, 0, 21064, 6, 69, 0, 35319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be watching you closely, hero!', '', 72359, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crown I have given you will be as your third eye. It will tie us together. I will see what you see. Together we will lay the secrets of the Titans bare.', '', 72358, 0, 0, 273, 69, 0, 36098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were the mogu sent here to guard? Or destroy? We are missing the final puzzle pieces, and YOU will help me find them!', '', 72357, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 36097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know now that the mogu share their roots with the Titans. But many mysteries remain. Why were they here? Why Pandaria?', '', 72356, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me.', '', 72355, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the ember. You are the spark! You are the fire that will spread across the world. You will awaken Azeroth\'s potential!', '', 72354, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will do better, champion. Behold! The Crown of Heaven! My gift to you.', '', 72353, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They built an empire, when they could have built a new world.', '', 72352, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But they could have been so much more.', '', 72351, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu, ah! The mogu! Their minds were so small! They were built to serve, and when they lost their masters, they served themselves.', '', 72350, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly, lightning is a gift of the Gods.', '', 72349, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They fed the fire every hour of every day. Hot coals were carried from one primitive camp to the next. Do you see? In a single flash of light, civilization was born.', '', 72348, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortals gathered around the fire in awe and wonder. It could cook their food and warm their homes. They seized it! And protected it!', '', 72347, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It rent a tree asunder and set it aflame.', '', 72346, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They shivered in the cold and the rain until - in one instant - lightning tore the sky!', '', 72345, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the dawn of the world, when the mortal races were young, they did not yet possess the secrets of fire.', '', 72344, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Behold the fruits of your labors!', '', 72343, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about to get even more awe-inspiring.', '', 72342, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s breathtaking.', '', 72341, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Truly a splendor! Have you ever seen such a view, Prince Anduin?', '', 72340, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I implore my Horde friend here not to push you off of the cliff.', '', 72339, 0, 923, 6, 69, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I keep no secrets! You are welcome to accompany us, Anduin Wrynn. If your injury permits.', '', 72338, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you two plotting?', '', 72337, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 35317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me atop Mason\'s Folly, where we met before!', '', 72336, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did I tell you? Few mortals possess such courage and tenacity.', '', 72335, 0, 21047, 1, 69, 0, 36078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remind me to tell you the story about my friend here and what we accomplished together at Ravenholdt. Good times!', '', 72334, 0, 21046, 1, 69, 0, 36077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe you\'re still alive.', '', 72333, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 35316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tong, is that our friend?', '', 72332, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, if you blindly trust a black dragon in the search for greater power, are you any better than Garrosh Hellscream? Please - just be careful.', '', 72331, 0, 924, 1, 69, 0, 35306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, I know that our people are at war, but if you blindly trust this black dragon in the pursuit of power, are you any better than your warchief? Please - just be careful.', '', 72330, 0, 923, 1, 69, 0, 35305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, hero! Let us shape a new Azeroth together!', '', 72329, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dear prince, you and I share the same goals. We only differ in our level of commitment.', '', 72328, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Using a mogu weapon forge whose powers you barely understand?', '', 72327, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...world peace!', '', 72326, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To what end? What are you two working towards?', '', 72325, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, return now to the Isle of the Thunder King. I will meet you at the forge, where together we will create an instrument of legendary power.', '', 72324, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s ridiculous! Why would you even play!?', '', 72323, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 36019, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a Pandaren board game. The object is for both players to win.', '', 72322, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 35302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Why did you play that piece just now?', '', 72321, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 36018, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm.', '', 72320, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two in DRAGON years. It is your move.', '', 72319, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you lecturing me? You\'re what - two years old?', '', 72318, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I worry you may be too soft to wear your kingdom\'s crown, Prince Anduin. You would do well to learn some of your father\'s hardness.', '', 72317, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, the mogu were overthrown! THAT should be the lesson of the Thunder King. It\'s your move, by the way.', '', 72316, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I\'m not so sure about that. But I can tell you: no great empire has ever stood the test of time by crushing its own citizens.', '', 72315, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Benevolence is a luxury for the strong, young prince. No great empire was ever built with kindness.', '', 72314, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t imagine a crueler tyrant. He enslaved this entire continent.', '', 72313, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you imagine what his empire would be like today if it had not been overthrown and hidden by the pandaren?', '', 72312, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunder King! What a magnificent individual.', '', 72311, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break them!', '', 72310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them! Bleed them!', '', 72309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eviscerate them! Our gods will drink their blood!', '', 72308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits give us strength!', '', 72307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them, me brothers!', '', 72306, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 35992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut them down. Show them our might!', '', 72305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35629, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Horde. We do NOT back down.', '', 72304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35628, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press forward! We shape our own destiny today!', '', 72303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS is who I am. No paperwork, no politics - just the hot fury of magic and steel!', '', 72302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cover one another! Stand your ground!', '', 72301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I, mm, talking to myself? I am? See there, I\'m right again.', '', 72300, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really do hate being right all the time.', '', 72299, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think they\'ll have this on the, ah, tour? Hm?', '', 72298, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s, ah, the cycle of life, mm. The Light creates troll, troll creates dinosaur, dinosaur eats human, trolls inherit Azeroth.', '', 72297, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remind me to thank Hamlock for a lovely weekend.', '', 72296, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m fairly alarmed here.', '', 72295, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyone, ah, hear that? It\'s ah, it\'s ah, an impact tremor.', '', 72294, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agrant? Nellie? Isn\'t it a bit dangerous to be outside of the zeppelin?', '', 72293, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could the expedition be a failure? I spared no expense!', '', 72292, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What we need is some sort of protein-based population control. Perhaps we should have thought of that before coming here.', '', 72291, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For some odd reason, I love to stare at this cane. Hmmm...', '', 72290, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we have control of the expedition again, everything will be fine...', '', 72289, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You only brought enough food for seven days! Seven! That\'s just great.', 72288, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How could we know anything about an extinct ecosystem? Even the plants are poisonous!', 72287, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you that you weren\'t machine compatible!', 72286, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At least there are no electrified fences. Or trolls.', 72285, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can make it if we run!', 72284, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful, Agrant!', 72283, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is about to end |cFFFF0000Supercharge Conduits|r!', '', 72282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should drink some tiger blood. Then we\'d surely be winning!', '', 72281, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should use your wand when you get low on mana! You DO have a wand, right?', '', 72280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried NOT standing in that? It might work better.', '', 72279, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I want BLUE fire!', '', 72278, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Curse of Ultimate Doom looks pretty dangerous! Dispel it, quick!', '', 72277, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Healthstone! Use your Healthstone!', '', 72276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t think he was just going to GIVE you green fire, did you?', '', 72275, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run to the center!', '', 72274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you manage to make it this far? Props to your healers!', '', 72273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has anyone ever told you that you slouch? Good posture is important to proper spell casting!', '', 72272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last warlock who tried this failed as well.', '', 72271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It doesn\'t seem like you\'re casting enough Shadowbolts.', '', 72270, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...okay, stop DoTs.', '', 72269, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More DoTs! More DoTs! Throw more DoTs!', '', 72268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we should jump off the side of the Black Temple, and see what\'s down there!', '', 72267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s drains power from the other golems with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:138644|h[Siphon Anima]|h|r!', '', 72266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taoshi motions at Captain Halu\'kal, then draws a finger across her neck.', 72265, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready.', 'I am ready.', 72264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you prepared, $n?', 72263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardian Tak\'u has gained Waves of the Hydra! Dispel now!', '', 72261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardian Tak\'u is casting Fire of the Serpent! Interrupt now!', '', 72260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is affected by |cFFF00000|Hspell:136192|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r !', '$n is affected by |cFFF00000|Hspell:136192|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r !', 72259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is pursuing you!', '', 72258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go now, to Ihgaluk Crag. I will apply the second half of your illusion once you have arrived.', 'Go now, to Ihgaluk Crag. I will apply the second half of your illusion once you have arrived.', 72257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies, sending arcing lightning to a nearby ally!', '%s dies, sending arcing lightning to a nearby ally!', 72256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_thunderstorm:20|t%s begins to channel an intense |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137313|h[Lightning Storm]|h|r!', '', 72255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_throwdown:20|t%s grabs $n and readies his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137175|h[Thundering Throw]|h|r!', '', 72254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gather up the explosives and get them to the wall while I rally the reinforcements.', 72253, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The siege is underway but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall!', 72252, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 35920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... you have earned the right to try. Farewell.', '', 72251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But there is a yawning chasm of darkness beneath you, mortals. Vast, endless, and all-consuming. I do not believe that you can correct this doomed course.', '', 72250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.', '', 72249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Righto.', '', 72248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are depressed because they have no work to do?', 'They are depressed because they have no work to do?', 72247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! I am... I am not your enemy. You are powerful. More powerful than he was, even.... Perhaps you are right. Perhaps there is still hope.', '', 72246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the best this world has to offer? Ha, no wonder it has fallen to ruin.', '', 72245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You still think victory possible? Fools!', '', 72244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amusing. You really thought you could win.', '', 72243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accept the inevitable.', '', 72242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel your own life essence betray you.', '', 72241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I am finished with you, I shall not rest until this world is cleansed. Now perish!', '', 72240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This twisted world is beyond redemption, beyond the reach of deluded heroes. The only answer to corruption is destruction. And that begins... now.', '', 72239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the naive hope in your eyes. You... think you are my saviors? Wring that mocking pity from your hearts and focus it inwards, for you shall soon know my agony.', '', 72238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For millennia I have waited in darkness, in silence pierced only by the shrieks of the tormented, my dreams a waking nightmare.', '', 72237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The touch of creation... and destruction.', '', 72236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the familiar embrace of the storms....', '', 72235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do the peasants seem depressed?', 'Why do the peasants seem depressed?', 72234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is but a taste of my power.', '', 72233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to work.', '', 72232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000Southwest|r doors begin to open, causing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136889|h[Violent Gale Winds]|h|r!', '', 72230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000Southeast|r doors begin to open, causing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136889|h[Violent Gale Winds]|h|r!', '', 72229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000Northeast|r doors begin to open, causing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136889|h[Violent Gale Winds]|h|r!', '', 72228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our strategy is sound. We must not falter now, when we have so much still to gain.', 72227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are vastly outnumbered here, but with a well-executed strategy, I believe we can succeed.', 72226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The peasant wishes there was more work to do.', '', 72225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 72224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?', '', 72223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve decided to write a book. \"The Mysteries of Mogu Magic.\" Has a nice ring to it, don\'t you think?', 72222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Archmage Modera is taking a straightforward strategy - defeat the mogu by force. I believe that with further research, we may be able to discover the mogu\'s weaknesses.', 72221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve grown quite interested in mogu culture and history. I would call it a bit more than a passing hobby.', 72220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay strong, $c. The mogu will not lay down their arms quietly. We will have to fight for every inch of land on this forsaken island.', '', 72219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The peasant contemplates what life means without work.', '', 72218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 1290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The blood elf is visibly shaken.>$B$BIt was horrible, just horrible! After we were caught, a mogu took me by the throat. I expected to die then and there, but instead, the mogu made a clutching motion and PULLED. All of a sudden, it was as if all the air were gone from my lungs.$B$BI felt a terrible twisting and ripping. My skin and bones felt as if on fire. Suddenly I was floating out of my own body.$B$BThe mogu laughed in my face, and I knew that my soul would suffer for the rest of eternity.$B$BHave you ever felt complete and utter terror, $c? I have.$B$B<The blood elf shudders and grows quiet.>', '', 72217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast ward has fallen! Defend the council with ya lives, brothas!', '', 72216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu\'s history is fraught with savage conquest and tests of strength. After thousands of years, only the strongest members of their race have survived.', 72215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is imperative that we understand the mogu\'s history. Our best chance at a successful offensive will come from knowledge of our enemy.', 72214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More work?', '', 72213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright. Let\'s go.', 'Alright. Let\'s go.', 72212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Harsh Light reveals a Pale Fog!', '', 72208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blue Rays reveal an Azure Fog!', '', 72207, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bright  Light reveals an Amber Fog!', '', 72206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Infrared Light reveals a Crimson Fog!', '', 72205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\priest_icon_chakra.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Yellow Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134124|h[Bright Light]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\priest_icon_chakra_red.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Red Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134123|h[Infrared Light]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\priest_icon_chakra_blue.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Blue Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134122|h[Blue Rays]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Evil Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133597|h[Dark Parasite]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_lifedrain02.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Hungry Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133795|h[Life Drain]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_eye_02.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Appraising Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133792|h[Lingering Gaze]|h|r!', '', 72199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_monk_forcesphere.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his Mind\'s Eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136932|h[Force of Will]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 72198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will destroy this cave in, and then we can sneak in from behind. Let me know when you are ready.', 72197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to deal with these mogu once and for all.', 72196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Witness the true meaning of pain!', 72195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lu\'lin! Lend me your strength!', 72194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BLAZE OF DEATH!', 72193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'INTRUDERS! GUARDIANS OF THE THRONE, AWAKEN!', 72192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can see the light.', 72191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Die in agony!', 72190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hahahahaha!', 72189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'More kindling for the flame! Come, Lu\'lin... let us burn them to ash!', 72188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are they gone yet?', 72187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... lonely.', 72186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just this once...', 72185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, just go! You are making her angry.', 72184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just... leave me alone!', 72183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is warm.', 72182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shouldn\'t have come here.', 72181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Was that really necessary...?', 72180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I must...', 72179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('USELESS!', '', 72178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaaaahh!', '', 72177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can this be?!', '', 72176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn back now, strangers! You face the army of Iron Qon!', '', 72175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this! Come now, weaklings. You have earned your reward. You may now face the Iron Qon.', '', 72174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGH! Worthless mongrels! I will kill you myself!', '', 72173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He fought with honor. His first and last mistake.', '', 72172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus, Weisheng. Show your enemy the meaning of pain!', '', 72171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All brawn. No brains. A recoverable loss.', '', 72170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike quickly, Manchu. Show them no mercy!', '', 72169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dam\'ren!  Freeze them to oblivion!', '', 72168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quet\'zal! Unleash the storm upon my enemies!!!', '', 72167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More... training...', '', 72166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall at my feet!', '', 72165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I run you through!', '', 72164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a pathetic display.', '', 72163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stare into the face of true power!', '', 72162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THEY ARE NO MATCH FOR MANCHU!', '', 72161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, master! I will fight with my life!', '', 72160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 36017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Animus goes berserk!', '', 72159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... perhaps someone is in hiding. Fetch the Saurok slaves! They will sniff them out...', '', 72158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see no one. Ha. Stupid trolls can\'t even collapse a tunnel properly.', '', 72157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! What was that?', '', 72156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop interruptin\'.', 'Stop interruptin\'.', 72155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De power of loa comes.', 'De power of loa comes.', 72154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should fear de loa.', 'You should fear de loa.', 72153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You never be stoppin\' us!', 'You never be stoppin\' us!', 72152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De ritual don\'t stop.', 'De ritual don\'t stop.', 72151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one\'s death be fun.', '', 72150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis one too brave.', '', 72149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anotha fool come to die.', '', 72148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis was a mistake fo\' you.', '', 72147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You weak, friend.', '', 72146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me pets have a big feast, brudda.', '', 72145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes dey start eatin\' before you dead.', '', 72144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be good eatin\' for me pets.', '', 72143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dinner be here!', '', 72142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me aid, pets.', '', 72141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear ya blood flow.', '', 72140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love to spill dis one\'s blood.', '', 72139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anotha sacrifice, bruddas!', '', 72138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in, I make it quick.', '', 72137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I be needin\' is your heart.', '', 72136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How especially true this is, when the parents are gods. And their children - monsters.', '', 72135, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Parents cannot always be assured of the legacy they will leave behind.', '', 72134, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but such terrible works!', '', 72133, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I truly believe now that the mogu thought they were doing the work of the titans. They fought against the mantid and used the powers of the Vale to create new life.', '', 72132, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu grew restless. Many generations later, when Thunder King united them, they seized upon their legacy!', '', 72131, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But eventually the titans fell silent. And their creations were cursed with flesh.', '', 72130, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And they created a magical cradle of life in a hidden valley that we now call the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', '', 72129, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the titans\' command, they fought the terrible servants of the old gods. They shaped the mountains and carved the rivers of the land.', '', 72128, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu were children as well. Children of the titans. They were once a legion of stone, heartless and obedient.', '', 72127, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Parents place their children on a path, but they do not always know where the road will take them.', '', 72126, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What sort of world will we create and leave behind for our daughters and sons?', '', 72125, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will our children learn from our mistakes?', '', 72124, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What values do we choose to instill in our progeny?', '', 72123, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fathers and sons. Mothers and daughters. As parents, we pass our legacy on to our children.', '', 72122, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not see any rainbows today. Do you?', '', 72121, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that after the revolution, the Red Crane of Hope placed the rainbow in the sky, so that pandaren would know not to fear the storms any longer.', '', 72120, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my friend - that awful sound. For a hundred hundred generations the crash of thunder filled the hearts of pandaren with terror.', '', 72119, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I will be... The Thunder King.\"', '', 72118, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"It is thunder that sends animals cowering and fills the hearts of peasants with dread. Let thunder be my herald, so that my power is felt throughout the land.\"', '', 72117, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Thunder quakes the skies long before the lightning strikes, and thunder echoes in the hills long after lightning\'s power is spent.\"', '', 72116, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"But thunder. Thunder! Thunder proclaims the coming of the storm.\"', '', 72115, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35677, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Lightning strikes in an instant and is over in a flash,\" he said.', '', 72114, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35676, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But Lei Shen did not agree.', '', 72113, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that he tore out the very heart of the mogu God. And from that hateful act he gained power over wind and storm.', '', 72112, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His followers fell to their knees before him. \"We will call you \'The Lightning King,\'\" they said.', '', 72111, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu tell a legend about Lei Shen, the Thunder King.', '', 72110, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 35672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The moment they fail, they cede their power to the one who can.', '', 72109, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see, the TRUE power of kings and emperors stems from the power to aid their people.', '', 72108, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari people turned to their King for help, but there was only one Zandalari equipped to help them: The prophet Zul. The prophet, and the mighty warfleet he had assembled while his King sat idle.', '', 72107, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Deathwing rose from the Maelstrom, dark, angry waves crashed into the Zandalari capital. The spine of the land broke in two, and soon, the city and all its riches began to slide into the hungry sea.', '', 72106, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And his visions DID come to pass.', '', 72105, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan tired of Zul and his troubling nightmares. To be rid of the prophet, he granted Zul the use of his largest ships, so that he and his followers could seek a new land if his visions came to pass.', '', 72104, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He described the golden capital of Zandalar slowly sinking beneath the waves in the aftermath of the Cataclysm, its once-great people drowning as their mighty works slipped forever beneath the sea.', '', 72103, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, mere months before the Cataclysm, Zul returned. Tearing his clothes and throwing his staff to the ground, Zul spoke of earthquakes and tidal waves.', '', 72102, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, King Rastakhan did nothing.', '', 72101, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Months later Zul returned, bearing more grim news from his visions. He saw a legion of serpents pouring forth from a gaping fissure that tore open the floor of the ocean.', '', 72100, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan did nothing.', '', 72099, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul warned King Rastakhan of a terrible Cataclysm. For Zul had seen a vision of a great armored dragon clenching the world in his ferocious jaws.', '', 72098, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, as he sat on this opulent seat of power, he was visited by his most trusted prophet: Zul.', '', 72097, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said the God King Rastakhan, ruler of the Zandalari, lords over his mighty kingdom from a throne carved of solid gold.', '', 72096, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 36432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone told me these crystals are blue in their natural state. I am so glad someone took the time to apply some proper aesthetics.', 'Someone told me these crystals are blue in their natural state. I am so glad someone took the time to apply some proper aesthetics.', 72095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are these going to be enough to take out those pterrorwings?', 'Are these going to be enough to take out those pterrorwings?', 72094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is days like this I miss using fel magic. Sure it was evil, but it got the job done.', 'It is days like this I miss using fel magic. Sure it was evil, but it got the job done.', 72093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is it everywhere on this island I go my hair always feels like it is standing on end?', 'Why is it everywhere on this island I go my hair always feels like it is standing on end?', 72092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think the crystal on the left is defective. We should never have rushed their construction. This is how accidents happen.', 'I think the crystal on the left is defective. We should never have rushed their construction. This is how accidents happen.', 72091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do the instructions clarify how much mana these crystals will require? I do not want to get converted to a wretched by using this thing.', 'Do the instructions clarify how much mana these crystals will require? I do not want to get converted to a wretched by using this thing.', 72090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In theory, these crystals are natural insulators. They should absorb most of the lightning strikes in the area.', 'In theory, these crystals are natural insulators. They should absorb most of the lightning strikes in the area.', 72089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CARRIER HAS ARRIVED.', '', 72088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could you lose another one? I swear, there are gems in my shoes that have more intelligence than you.', '', 72087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you drop one more crate I swear I am sending you off to be disenchanted.', '', 72086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the barrels? Did you lose the barrels? We need more barrels!', '', 72085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you even know how to walk? Move those legs of yours you worthless golden scrap heap!', '', 72084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not a construct break. Get back to work.', '', 72083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you still standing there? Deliver those boxes!', '', 72082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No no no! Put those down.', '', 72081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look nothing like him.', '', 72080, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close... enough.', '', 72079, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your master.', 'I am your master.', 72078, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return as my master.', '', 72077, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ghost fades away into the mist...', '', 72076, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amani forces pour from the Amani Tribal Door!', 'Amani forces pour from the Amani Tribal Door!', 72075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drakkari forces pour from the Drakkari Tribal Door!', 'Drakkari forces pour from the Drakkari Tribal Door!', 72074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gurubashi forces pour from the Gurubashi Tribal Door!', 'Gurubashi forces pour from the Gurubashi Tribal Door!', 72073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farraki forces pour from the Farraki Tribal Door!', 'Farraki forces pour from the Farraki Tribal Door!', 72072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have it! The gates are undone!', 72071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep him busy! I am almost finished!', 72070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This lock... it is more complicated than I thought...', 72069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There - the slave master! Hold his attention while I undo the lock.', 72068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step lightly! We are almost to the gate.', 72067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shado-Pan will never rest.', 72066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35840, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your skills in combat are most impressive.', 72065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I prefer a swift, silent kill. But your methods have their advantages.', 72064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will learn that no place is safe from the Shado-Pan.', 72063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have trained my entire life for this.', 72062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are in the heart of the mogu war machine.', 72061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have seen many things. But the cruelty of the mogu still curdles my blood.', 72060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shado-Pan strike from the shadows, so that our enemies fear the dark.', 72059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Slaves - everywhere slaves. You can see what we fight against.', 72058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35832, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu forge weapons of both blood and steel. Their blades feast on death.', 72057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35831, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can slip through here quietly, or fight our way through. It is your decision.', 72056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35830, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way. The doors can only be opened from within.', 72055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35829, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well now. You sure know how to arrive in style.', 72054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35828, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
