('', 'Best of all, you\'ve forever disabled his infernal machine, leaving nothing for the Horde to claim as their own.', 71963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can feel it ... the Thunder King\'s power courses through my staff.', 71962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did it! Incredible! Pandaren Lorewalkers will be telling your story for generations!', 71961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve earned my trust hero. Simply place my staff on the Thunder King\'s dais and it will do the rest. You are very brave to take this mission on; good luck!', 71960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It has been a great honor to fight by your side. Thank you.', 71959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But after what I have seen today, I have faith in you.', 71958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero, it will be up to you to defeat the Storm Lord Nalak. You will have to marshal a small army!', 71957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yalia, take Lord Zhu to safety.', 71956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
