('', 'Go!', 71851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait for it...', 71850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s move.', 71849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember to stay clear of those sentry totems.', 71848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35872, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The courtyard gate is directly up that hill.', 71847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... never get outta here... alive.', '', 71846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am UNSINKABLE!', '', 71845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh hoh, you tickle me. But I be done playin\' with you.', '', 71844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this be the caliber of pandaren to resist us, this land be ours in no time!', '', 71843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm-wha? Stowaways!', '', 71842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snores peacefully.', '', 71841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be a very unpleasant surprise waiting for the next troll who disturbs these. Let\'s keep moving.', 71840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not as quiet as I would prefer, but it works.', 71839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will take the ugly one.', 71838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Easy now... Get in close and incapacitate them.', 71837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should sabotage the siege weapons toward the bow. Then we will go below decks and find the captain.', 71836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35868, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our time is up. We need to get aboard that ship.', 71835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunder King wills it; it shall be done.', '', 71834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaken, Hu\'seng! The docks are your responsibility. See that none pass his majesty\'s gates.', '', 71833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have got to disable more of their defenses or we will never be able to get in! Loop around again.', 71832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot circle up here for long. Do what you can while I plan our next move.', 71831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35863, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of these smoke bombs will blind a sentry totem.', 71830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35861, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here: Use these darts to take down as many archers as you can.', 71829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35860, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And their shamans have laid out a network of sentry totems.', 71828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35859, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those archers are keeping a close watch over the shipping area.', 71827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35858, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Zandalari are more cautious than I thought. Look down there - swarming with patrols.', 71826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35857, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hyah!', 71825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a little closer...', 71824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35855, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will neutralize him and take his route. Let\'s go!', 71823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of them flies higher than the others... He loops far out over the water - alone. He is over-extending. That is our in.', 71822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I count six... no, seven guards on patrol in the sky.', 71821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely you agree that decisive action wins wars, Lord Zhu.', '', 71820, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 35671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been afflicted by Spirit\'s Wrath.  Run away!', '', 71819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sheer audacity of the plan is exactly what intrigues me. If we breech the shipyard, we will deprive the mogu of further Zandalari reinforcements.', '', 71818, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 35670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Champion, we were just talking about you.', '', 71817, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 35669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak with me when you are ready.', 71816, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Lord Zhu. I will not let you down.', 71815, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 35851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, Taoshi. If our champion here agrees, the mission may proceed.', '', 71814, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 35916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love it! Brains over brute force.', 71813, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 35546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once inside, we sabotage the Zandalari ship. In the chaos, we will slip into the courtyard and open the gates from within.', 71812, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, hear me out: We strike the shipyard at night, using this magnificent beast you have tamed.', 71811, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we are to bring down the Thunder King, we must breech the shipyard. Now is the time for bold ideas!', 71810, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 35545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It does not matter. Taoshi\'s proposal is too dangerous.', '', 71809, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 35915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! Hero, we were just talking about you.', 71808, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 35544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Draining Spirit is draining your soul. Hide from it to break the spell!', '', 71807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Restless Spirit is after your soul.  Don\'t let it reach you!', '', 71806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the golems that wander these paths, $c? Spirits bound to servitude of the Zandalari for all of eternity.$b$bPerhaps, the Mogu and the Zandalari are more alike than we ever anticipated.', '', 71805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic emanating from this area is fascinating, $c. I\'m anxious to study their artifacts. There is so much we can learn.', '', 71804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari here practice a dark magic I am unfamiliar with. They mix arcane powers with shadow; a frightening and dangerous combination.', '', 71803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This island is home to a very powerful magic. If we can harness it, no one will be able to stand in our way.', '', 71802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As my emperor wills!', '', 71801, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan Bu, secure the inner courtyard. None should look upon my works and live.', '', 71800, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All will fall before us!!', '', 71799, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make a demonstration of these invaders, such that all nations tremble before me.', '', 71798, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have robbed it of its strength. Now rob it of its life!', 71797, 0, 20556, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guardian has awoken! Destroy it!', 71796, 0, 20556, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must hurry!', 71795, 0, 20556, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guardian\'s power grows! Kill them before it\'s too late!', 71794, 0, 20556, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The priests imbue the guardian with their loa! They must be stopped!', 71793, 0, 20556, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', '', 71792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 30 seconds!', '', 71791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 1 minute!', '', 71790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 2 minutes!', '', 71789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have robbed it of its strength. Now rob it of its life!', 71788, 0, 20514, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guardian has awoken! Destroy it!', 71787, 0, 20514, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guardian\'s power grows! Kill them before it\'s too late!', 71786, 0, 20514, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must hurry!', 71785, 0, 20514, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The priests imbue the guardian with their loa! They must be stopped!', 71784, 0, 20514, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War-God Al\'chukla, add my strength to your own.', '', 71783, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The unworthy have not yet learned of my power.', '', 71782, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 35577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan.', '', 71781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor.', '', 71780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me, Shan Bu! Or is the court of the Thunder King a den of cowards?', '', 71779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yalia - we need more healing! Taoshi - cover the rear!', '', 71778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zandalari reinforcements are coming.', '', 71777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan Bu! Again you try to create a God. When will you learn?', '', 71776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here.', '', 71775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who needs a God? We have the Thunder King!', '', 71774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn their hides. Rangers! Hold this position!', '', 71773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Regent Lord - more Zandalari approach from the mines!', 71772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Thunder King\'s palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress.', 71771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear.', '', 71770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Taoshi, get those doors open.', '', 71769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!', '', 71768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taran Zhu! It does not matter how many you array against the Thunder King. Soon all will kneel before him.', '', 71767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU will kneel when you beg for my mercy, monster.', '', 71766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One problem at a time, people. Focus on the Zandalari!', '', 71765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_unrelentingstorm.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000|Hspell:135683|h[West Conduit]|h|r has burned out and caused |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137176|h[Overloaded Circuits]|h|r!', '', 71764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_unrelentingstorm.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000|Hspell:135682|h[South Conduit]|h|r has burned out and caused |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137176|h[Overloaded Circuits]|h|r!', '', 71763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_unrelentingstorm.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000|Hspell:135681|h[East Conduit]|h|r has burned out and caused |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137176|h[Overloaded Circuits]|h|r!', '', 71762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_unrelentingstorm.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000|Hspell:135680|h[North Conduit]|h|r has burned out and caused |cFFFF0000|Hspell:137176|h[Overloaded Circuits]|h|r!', '', 71761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will deal with Proudmoore.', '', 71760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers! Advance!', '', 71759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh, so the grand lady of the Kirin Tor wants a fight, does she?', '', 71758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', '', 71757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance is waiting for us just across the courtyard.', 71756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Regent Lord! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but...', 71755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, you are here.', 71754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 36594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to launch the assault [Queue for solo instance.]', 'I am ready to launch the assault [Queue for solo instance.]', 71753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_frostbomb:20|t$n is afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:136922|h[Frostbite]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_mage_frostbomb:20|t$n is afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:136922|h[Frostbite]|h|r!', 71752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathknight_remorselesswinters2:20|tMove away from your allies! You are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:136991|h[Biting Cold]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathknight_remorselesswinters2:20|tMove away from your allies! You are afflicted with |cFFF00000|Hspell:136991|h[Biting Cold]|h|r!', 71751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock:20|t%s begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:137166|h[Discharge]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock:20|t%s begins to |cFFF00000|Hspell:137166|h[Discharge]|h|r!', 71750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock:20|t%s |cFFF00000|Hspell:137149|h[Overloads]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock:20|t%s |cFFF00000|Hspell:137149|h[Overload]|h|r!', 71749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_monk_envelopingmist:20|t%s summons a deadly |cFFF00000|Hspell:136894|h[Sandstorm]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_monk_envelopingmist:20|t%s summons a deadly |cFFF00000|Hspell:136894|h[Sandstorm]|h|r!', 71748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_priest_divinestar_shadow2:20|t%s summons a |cFFF00000|Hspell:137350|h[Shadowed Loa Spirit]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_priest_divinestar_shadow2:20|t%s summons a |cFFF00000|Hspell:137350|h[Shadowed Loa Spirit]|h|r!', 71747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_priest_divinestar:20|t%s summons a |cFFF00000|Hspell:137203|h[Blessed Loa Spirit]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_priest_divinestar:20|t%s summons a |cFFF00000|Hspell:137203|h[Blessed Loa Spirit]|h|r!', 71746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is a locksmith supposed to make a living in a world with no locked doors?', 'How is a locksmith supposed to make a living in a world with no locked doors?', 71745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_moguraid_03:20|t%s is |cFFF00000|Hspell:136442|h[Possessed]|h|r by the spirit of Gara\'jal!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_moguraid_03:20|t%s is |cFFF00000|Hspell:136442|h[Possessed]|h|r by the spirit of Gara\'jal!', 71744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n calls for food!', '', 71743, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horaki launches a Hail of Arrows into the sky!', 'Horaki launches a Hail of Arrows into the sky!', 71742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horaki readies a Frost Shot!', 'Horaki readies a Frost Shot!', 71741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die, intrudah!', '', 71740, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, ya got where you were goin\'. Too bad you\'re not gonna live long enough to see it!', '', 71739, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did ya think ya could just fly ova\' hea\' unnoticed?!', '', 71738, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The charges are placed. Hero - you may have the honor.', 71737, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 36377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari Dinomancer drops an Orb of Control!', 'The Zandalari Dinomancer drops an Orb of Control!', 71736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n forces Horridon to charge the Amani door!', '$n forces Horridon to charge the Amani door!', 71735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n forces Horridon to charge the Drakkari door!', '$n forces Horridon to charge the Drakkari door!', 71734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n forces Horridon to charge the Gurubashi door!', '$n forces Horridon to charge the Gurubashi door!', 71733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n forces Horridon to charge the Farraki door!', '$n forces Horridon to charge the Farraki door!', 71732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not seen the full might o\' the Zandalari!', '', 71731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impressive!', 71730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like your style, hero.', 71729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the name of the Kirin Tor!', 71728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35965, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As much as I expected from a troll.', 71727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, hero. Let\'s move on.', 71726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Champion, you have exceeded my expectations. Our position on the isle is secured, thanks to your courage and your will. Now, the true work begins.', 71725, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone take up positions! Enemies surround us on all sides! There is no time to waste.', 71724, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 35533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vereesa, establish a perimeter. Modera, place the sentry wards. Narasi, begin porting in tents and supplies.', 71723, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 35532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the Alliance spirit for you - unstoppable!', 71722, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 35531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jaina was right to recommend you. You saved this mission from disaster... and saved my life.', 71721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shield - it is down! We did it!', 71720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 35961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
