('We are the perfect one, yes, yes, not a failure, no no, not a failure...', 'We are the perfect one, yes, yes, not a failure, no no, not a failure...', 71588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35746, 35746, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not be forgotten, no, no, no...', 'We will not be forgotten, no, no, no...', 71587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35745, 35745, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So cold, so dark...', 'So cold, so dark...', 71586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35744, 35744, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find no better riding companion than our dragon turtles. Their low stance means the rider experiences no bounce or jostle, even when cornering sharply. If you are interested in purchasing one, you must prove your trust to the Tushui.', 'You will find no better riding companion than our dragon turtles. Their low stance means the rider experiences no bounce or jostle, even when cornering sharply. If you are interested in purchasing one, you must prove your trust to the Tushui.', 71585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies.', 'Have you seen our magnificent riding turtles? They only appear slow at a glance - an experienced rider may keep pace with the swiftest wolves on all of Kalimdor. Alas, they are reserved only for our most trusted allies.', 71584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"THANK YOU\"', '', 71583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EXECUTING GRATITUDE PROTOCOL.', '', 71582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOCATION UNRECOGNIZED. RETURNING TO LAST KNOWN BASE LOCATION.', '', 71581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('POWERING ON...', '', 71580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MEMORY RECORDS DESTROYED. WHO ARE YOU. RETURNING TO BASE.', '', 71579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTEMPTING TO DESTROY MEMORY RECORDS OF PREVIOUS 6 HOURS.', '', 71578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MANA FLOW RATE NOMINAL. RETURNING TO BASE.', '', 71577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"$N WILL MAKE IT ALL BETTER\"', '', 71576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"EVERYTHING IS ALRIGHT\"', '', 71575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"EVERYTHING IS OK\"', '', 71574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTEMPTING MANA FLOW RATE REDUCTION OVERRIDE PROTOCOL.', '', 71573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WARNING: MANA FLOW RATE STILL ELEVATED.', '', 71572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EXECUTING SAND EXTRACTION PROTOCOL.', '', 71571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEG FAILURE LOOP BROKEN. RETURNING TO BASE.', '', 71570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RECOVERY FAILED. INCREMENTING SHAME PARAMETER. RETURNING TO BASE.', '', 71569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTEMPTING TO RECOVER FROM EMBARRASSING MALFUNCTION...', '', 71568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SYSTEM ONLINE. FEELING MUCH BETTER NOW.', '', 71567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('REBOOTING...', '', 71566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like the scavengers may be sending a large party out into the swamp soon. Tell the archmage to be ready.', 71565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the archmage know that everything is under control here at Ihgaluk. I\'ll have another report in a few days.', 71564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The saurok are restless. They\'re planning something. Aethas will want to know.', 71563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell Aethas that the saurok have been quiet today. No impending attacks.', 71562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saurok have been quiet lately, and are becoming restless. The time is ripe to turn them against the mogu.', '', 71561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saurok leadership has called off their attacks on the mogu. They plan on attacking the Horde and Alliance instead.$b$bIt may be time to intervene.', '', 71560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These saurok just returned from an attack on the mogu. I will continue to observe them.', '', 71559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From what I\'ve gathered, they\'re preparing for an attack on the mogu at dawn.', '', 71558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve been talking all day about the mogu weapons they found within Ihgaluk Crag.$b$bThey don\'t suspect us at all. Keep up the good work.', '', 71557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve been chanting: \"Kill the mogu\" all day. Whatever Aethas has you doing, it\'s working.', '', 71556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The filth pool is more rancid than I\'ve ever seen it. We need to get somebody in here to clean up before it gets any worse and starts spreading outside the crag.', '', 71555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been busy. A few of the Saur-Priests have been calling for Horde and Alliance blood.$b$bNaturally, I killed them in their sleep.', '', 71554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret this...', '', 71553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I smelled something...', '', 71552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, coward...', '', 71551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kros, give me strength...', '', 71550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this magic?', '', 71549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Kroshik\'s teeth, how did you get here?!', '', 71548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to kill.', '', 71547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength.', '', 71546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You die now.', '', 71545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N-no!', '', 71544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want from me?', '', 71543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back!', '', 71542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blech!', '', 71541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll throw your corpse in the filth-pool!', '', 71540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come to steal our filth?', '', 71539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah!', '', 71538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rip you apart!', '', 71537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders!', '', 71536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggh!', '', 71535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength always to the Skumblade!', '', 71534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this magic?', '', 71533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt.', 'You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt.', 71532, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. You have rescued me from a terrible fate.', 'Thank you, friend. You have rescued me from a terrible fate.', 71531, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my eternal gratitude, hero.', 'You have my eternal gratitude, hero.', 71530, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could the mogu be capable of such atrocity? Thank goodness you arrived when you did.', 'How could the mogu be capable of such atrocity? Thank goodness you arrived when you did.', 71529, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 'Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 71528, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I can find my way back to camp from here.', 'Thank you. I can find my way back to camp from here.', 71527, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once.', 'Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once.', 71526, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back.', 'If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back.', 71525, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should tear you apart, Horde scum! I will restrain myself this once.', 'I should tear you apart, Horde scum! I will restrain myself this once.', 71524, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay my hand this time, Horde hero. Let it not be said that the Silver Covenant does not show gratitude.', 'I will stay my hand this time, Horde hero. Let it not be said that the Silver Covenant does not show gratitude.', 71523, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Horde hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy.', 'Thank you, Horde hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy.', 71522, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Alliance hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy.', 'Thank you, Alliance hero, but next time we meet, I will show no mercy.', 71521, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once.', 'Although we are enemies, I will thank you. Just this once.', 71520, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back.', 'If you had not just rescued me from certain death, I would kill you where you stand. Next time we meet, I will not hold back.', 71519, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay my hand this time, Alliance hero. Let it not be said that the Sunreavers do not show gratitude.', 'I will stay my hand this time, Alliance hero. Let it not be said that the Sunreavers do not show gratitude.', 71518, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should tear you apart, Alliance scum! I will restrain myself this once.', 'I should tear you apart, Alliance scum! I will restrain myself this once.', 71517, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the Sunreavers would not desert me. Thank you, champion.', 'I knew the Sunreavers would not desert me. Thank you, champion.', 71516, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the Silver Covenant would not desert me. Thank you, champion.', 'I knew the Silver Covenant would not desert me. Thank you, champion.', 71515, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Silver Covenant send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue.', 'Did the Silver Covenant send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue.', 71514, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt.', 'You have saved my life, champion. For that, I am in your debt.', 71513, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my eternal gratitude, hero.', 'You have my eternal gratitude, hero.', 71512, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could the mogu be capable of such atrocity? Thank goodness you arrived when you did.', 'How could the mogu be capable of such atrocity? Thank goodness you arrived when you did.', 71511, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 'Thank you, champion. Please, free the others as well!', 71510, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I can find my way back to camp from here.', 'Thank you. I can find my way back to camp from here.', 71509, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Sunreavers send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue.', 'Did the Sunreavers send you? Thank you for the well-timed rescue.', 71508, 0, 923, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. You have rescued me from a terrible fate.', 'Thank you, friend. You have rescued me from a terrible fate.', 71507, 0, 924, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Quicksilver falls off his blades! Kill the blobs to absorb their power!', 'The Quicksilver falls off his blades! Kill the blobs to absorb their power!', 71506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin Tor can keep Dalaran for all I care. This is where I feel most at home, behind enemy lines, right in the thick of things!', 71504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death, danger, the return of the Zandalari and their magic. Exciting!', 71502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid ting!', '', 71501, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Gura commanded the very power of the storm at his fingertips. With a single word, he could blanket the earth in crackling electricity. Those caught in his storm died a terrible, scorching death.', 'Lord Gura commanded the very power of the storm at his fingertips. With a single word, he could blanket the earth in crackling electricity. Those caught in his storm died a terrible, scorching death.', 71500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Metal Lord Mono-Han prepares a whirling attack!', 'Metal Lord Mono-Han prepares a whirling attack!', 71498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:20|t The |cFFFF0000Northwest|r doors begin to open, causing |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136889|h[Violent Gale Winds]|h|r!', '', 71497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength always to the Skumblade!', '', 71496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshik!', '', 71495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His flesh will feed us, and give us strength. His rotting insides will be thrown into the filth-pool, protecting us from intruders. His bones will build our homes. His seed will continue the cycle indefinitely.$b$bStrength always to Kroshik. Strength always to the Skumblade.', '', 71494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat the flesh of Kroshik, and be cleansed of your weakness.', '', 71493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Close your mouth and take a knee, fool. Kroshik is near.', '', 71492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show some respect, saurok. Do you not see Kroshik?', '', 71491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The saurok kneels in silent reverence.>', '', 71490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, fool! Kroshik approaches!', '', 71489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The shortfang recoils in fear.>', '', 71488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are ways for a shortfang to become stronger. If I wanted, I could escape the scorn of my tribe.$b$bThere are ways... but I am afraid. I am too scared, too weak.$b$bThey do not understand me. I will be a shortfang all my life.', '', 71487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.$b$bI am nothing, I am no one, I am weak.$b$bI am nothing...', '', 71486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, stronger?', '', 71485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bend down to speak with me? A pet-keeper? A shortfang?$b$bI know my place in this world, stronger. I am not strong enough to fight on my own, so I keep a pet. I am called weak, and pushed to the edge of the village.$b$bYou should stay away from me, before they see you.', '', 71484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saur-priests have seen my weakness. The brutes beat me, and call me shortfang. If I did not have my basilisk to protect me, I would be all alone.$b$bLikely dead.', '', 71483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, stay back, stronger. I want no fight.', '', 71482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The saurok cowers behind its pet.>', '', 71481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filth protects us. Our enemies cannot stand the smell of Ihgaluk.$b$bBut it is hard to keep filth on the beach. The ocean drinks our filth faster than we can create it. There must be other ways to protect our shores.$b$b<The seadragon flashes a razor-toothed smile.> That\'s where I come in, $gbrother:sister;.', '', 71480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some saur-priests call me traitor. \"Kroshik does not hunt in the sea,\" they say.$b$bI follow the path of Kros, but I do not agree with these priests. Kroshik hunts WHEREVER HE CAN, and so do I.$b$bThese priests and their stubborn, closed-mind idea of Kroshik have no place in today\'s Skumblades.', '', 71479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell intruders. They are near.$b$b<The seadragon eyes you suspiciously.>', '', 71478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of corpses in the sea. More than usual.$b$bThere is war nearby.$b$bThis is good for the saurok. More corpses means more food, more filth.', '', 71477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We see strange ships. These are not mogu ships.$b$bWho are the invaders? What do they want? What do they taste like?', '', 71476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Altar of Kros is sacred ground, $gbrother:sister;. Watch where you tread when you\'re on my beach.', '', 71475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seadragons rank high in the eyes of Kros. The sea is home to good food and filth.', '', 71474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep an eye to the sea, $gbrother:sister;. The mogu can attack from anywhere.', '', 71473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never weak. Always strong.', '', 71472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mercy for weak.', '', 71471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fear. No remorse. Kill invader.', '', 71470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sharp teeth, sharp claws.', '', 71469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill. Eat. Kill.', '', 71468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to mogu.', '', 71467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy is walking meat.', '', 71466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill mogu.', '', 71465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Live a life devoted to the ideals of Kros. Never stop fighting, never stop growing. Each day, stronger than before.$b$bFight through pain. Suffer through filth. Everyone is your enemy.$b$bDie with your weapon in your hand. Give your body to Ihgaluk.', '', 71464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshik is the blood of Kros, our creator. We are Kros\' chosen people.$b$bWith his strength behind us, we can never die.', '', 71463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshik gives us his body, his bones, his strength, and his spirit. We owe our existence to him.', '', 71462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humble yourself before Kroshik, saurok. In this world, he is the closest to Kros that you will ever get.$b$bSavor in his presence. He will not live forever.', '', 71461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be strong.$b$bBe vicious.$b$bKill more than you can eat.$b$bMake no friends, and take no pets.$b$bDie fighting.$b$bThese, and many more, are lessons we can learn from Kroshik.', '', 71460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu are our enemy. They seek to eliminate us from this world. Why should we believe the creation myths that they feed us?', '', 71459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshik is a gift from our creator, Kros. He reminds us of our strength, of our heritage, of our legacy. He gives us a glimpse at our glorious future.', '', 71458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu claim to have created us... to have twisted us into our current forms. Do not believe their lies.$b$bWe are our own people, evolved from the great creator, Kros himself!', '', 71457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from the sea. Too clean.$b$bThe saur-priests can tell you: Filthiness is next to godliness.', '', 71456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ever need any filth, come talk to me. I can help.', '', 71455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try not to step on my roaches, $gbrother:sister;.', '', 71454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know if you catch anybody interfering with our filth-pool. I\'ve heard stories about intruders.', '', 71453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! You have a clean spot, $gbrother:sister;. Let me just get that for you...', '', 71452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your hunger in check, $gbrother:sister;. Always leave some meat behind to rot.$b$bOverly-ravenous saurok will bring doom to us all.', '', 71451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is our responsibility to keep the muck fresh. The filth keeps us safe. It keeps our enemies away.', '', 71450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at you, clean-scale. Do you want the mogu to attack you? Do you want to be their pet?$b$bProtect yourself, $gbrother:sister;. Get your filth on.', '', 71449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you prefer to kill? With tooth? With blade? From behind? From darkness?', '', 71448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength always to the Skumblade. Death and dismemberment to our enemies.', '', 71447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the mogu.$b$bKill the mogu.$b$bKill the mogu.', '', 71446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight, kill, eat, live another day.$b$bIf you die, die where your brothers and sisters can eat you. No point in feeding your enemies.', '', 71445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your claws sharp. You never know when another piece of meat will walk by.', '', 71444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Made any good kills lately?$b$bI killed a draenei yesterday. You can still find her near the filth-pool... just look for the blue entrails.', '', 71443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu seek to destroy us. The mogu are our enemy. I will slay every last mogu that comes close to our home.$b$bWill you help?', '', 71442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Made any good kills lately?$b$bI killed a tauren yesterday. It took three scavengers to bring his parts back to the filth-pool!', '', 71441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Change is coming to Ihgaluk. The saurok are turning on one another. Some think that there are intruders among us.', '', 71440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do me a favor: deposit your extra filth into the filth-pool.', '', 71439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found any good meat lately?$b$bI ate a blood elf the other day. He tasted like he\'d been rolling in flowers.', '', 71438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I watch our new enemies.$b$bThe straight-back trolls ally with the mogu, but the other invaders fight against them.$b$bPfah! I do not care. Their battles have given us many new corpses to scavenge. The Skumblade have never been stronger.', '', 71437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not eat clean meat. The Skumblade are just as strong on the inside as they are on the outside.', '', 71436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a good bit of filth out in the swamps today. The filth-mongers will be proud of me.', '', 71435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have roach on your foot, $gbrother:sister;.$b$bWatch your step.  The roaches help us spread disease.', '', 71434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Found any good meat lately?$b$bI ate a gnome the other day. Hardly worth the effort of pulling all those pink hairs out of my teeth.', '', 71433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not participate in their false ritual. There is nothing special about Kroshik, or his meat. Meat is meat.', '', 71432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurok who worship Kroshik only do so because they are scared.$b$bThey pretend that we are all just little walking devilsaurs, proving our \"strength\" to gain the favor of an invisible, all-powerful devilsaur that lives in the sky.$b$bThat is truly what they believe.$b$bWe are not devilsaurs. We are saurok. And when we die, there will be no eternal hunt, no promised paradise, no punishment for the weak, and no Kros. We will be eaten, and our remains thrown into the filth-pool. And that is all. I have seen it.', '', 71431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were created by the mogu. There is no reason not to believe it. Anybody who denies it is ignorant, or living in fantasy.$b$bI refuse to pretend I am a devilsaur. I know what I am. I know where my strength comes from.', '', 71430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saur-priests will tell you that our strength comes from Kroshik. Don\'t listen to their religious talk.$b$bOur strength comes from our claws, from our teeth, from our weapons. It comes from the filth that the filth-mongers gather and cultivate.$b$bIt comes from us.$b$bI don\'t care whether we descended from some devilsaur in the sky or we were created by the mogu. All I care about is protecting this land from our enemies.', '', 71429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what I think? <Tomma glances quickly behind him.>$b$bThe saur-priests are as filled with filth as the village itself.$b$bTheir Kroshik-worship makes them weak. They preach strength, but do they hunt? Do they kill? Do they roll in the decaying remains of their fallen brothers?$b$bNo. They hide in their caves and talk. If they were truly strong, they would be out here fighting with us.', '', 71428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat the flesh of Kroshik, and be cleansed of weakness! Let the spirit of Kros pass through your body!', '', 71427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kros, our creator, will not save the weak. The souls of the weak will exist in eternal fear, always fleeing from the teeth and claws of Kros and his followers.$b$bIf you are strong, Kros will allow you to hunt. Your eternity will be spent chasing the weak, eating their flesh, and becoming ever stronger.$b$bBe strong, saurok.$b$bStrength always to the Skumblade. Strength always to you, saurok.', '', 71426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu lie to our people. They tell us that we are their creation, that they twisted our flesh into its current form. They claim that we owe our existence to them.$b$bI DEFY the mogu! They have no power over us! They do not know what we see, how we live, what we feel! They cannot see into our souls!$b$bOnly Kros, the great creator, knows what is in your soul. Kros knows, and Kros understands. Kros gave you your strength, saurok. No mogu owns you.', '', 71425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kroshik has a body of meat and bone, but he carries with him the spirit of Kros.$b$bOne day, Kroshik\'s hunt will end. But Kros\'s hunt goes on forever.', '', 71424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are born from the flesh of Kros. We were fashioned from his meat, his bones. He is our creator.$b$bKroshik is the blood of Kros. He watches over us. He is our connection to Kros. He has the strength of Kros, yet he walks on our world.$b$bWhen the time comes, Kroshik will die, and we will take his strength. Then, the cycle will start again.', '', 71423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell through your disguise, stranger. You are bold to come to such a sacred ritual.$b$bWhat do you intend here? Will you eat the flesh of Kroshik?', '', 71422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your secret, outsider. I know you are an enemy. I smell through your false skin.$b$bI am not scared of you. Fear is for the weak. I am not weak.', '', 71421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen your magic. I know that you are not saurok. You are other.$b$bYour magic makes you weak. You are not brave. You are coward who hides in enemy\'s skin. YOU ARE NOT STRONG!$b$b<Gokkar spits at your feet.>', '', 71420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you are not one of us. You are one of them.$b$bI follow you. I watch you. You kill our people, but you also kill mogu. You kill straight-back trolls.$b$bI do not care who you kill. I pick up the meat afterward. So very, very much meat.', '', 71419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell you, outsider. I know you are not one of us.$b$bWhy do you sneak into our village? Why do you wear the skin of our people? I do not understand.', '', 71418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a shortfang, I must wait until the stronger saurok have had their share of meat.', '', 71417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They tell me that I can shed my shame. I only need to do one thing, and then I will not be a shortfang.$b$bBut I cannot do that. I cannot take Farros\' strength for myself. Not after what he has done for me...', '', 71416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will never know the strength of Kros. I will never hunt in his fields.$b$bI am not the predator. I am the prey.', '', 71415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father was a brute. My mother was a saur-priest. I am nothing.$b$bI am a disgrace to the Skumblade. I will die in the filth, and they will not eat my meat.', '', 71414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was not always a shortfang. I was strong.', '', 71413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_thunderking_lightningwhip.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136850|h[Lightning Whip]|h|r!', '', 71412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die by the fury of the storm!', '', 71409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not anotha!', '', 71408, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back, stupid vermin!', '', 71407, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be gettin\' back!', '', 71406, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_focusedrage.blp:20|t Horridon goes on a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136821|h[Rampage]|h|r after seeing War-God Jalak fall!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_focusedrage.blp:20|t Horridon goes on a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:136821|h[Rampage]|h|r after seeing War-God Jalak fall!', 71405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the lair of the beasts. While I admire the Zandalari skill with beasts I am more impressed with their ability to endure this foul odor.$b$bKeep a devilsaur upwind of you and it will never catch you off guard.', '', 71404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horridon sets his eyes on $n and stamps his tail!', 'Horridon sets his eyes on $n and stamps his tail!', 71403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, come closer, little one. My scalpel thirsts for your blood!', '', 71402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a new subject? I will take you apart... piece by piece!', '', 71401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will not come swiftly. I can guarantee that!', '', 71400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The more you struggle, the more it will hurt!', '', 71399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the incision is made, the blood flows quickly.', '', 71398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer. Just a little cut, I promise!', '', 71397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya soul be weak.', '', 71396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a taste of Zandalari magic!', '', 71395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die ya trespassah.', '', 71394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Loa gonna\' eat you up.', '', 71393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be nothin\' but fuel to me.', '', 71392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gonna\' feed ya soul to dah beasts.', '', 71391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya come to the right place to die.', '', 71390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be feedin\' time!', '', 71389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before the Zandalari!', '', 71388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya came to the right place... to be eaten!', '', 71387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the food be arrivin\'.', '', 71386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good! Mah pet be gettin\' hungry, mon.', '', 71385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Came to the wrong place, ya did.', '', 71384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya barely be fit tah\' feed to de big one.', '', 71383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too late for ya to be runnin\' away now, mon!', '', 71382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna\' feed ya to the big one!', '', 71381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be makin\' da big one mad, mon!', '', 71380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Removing', 'Removing', 71379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stealing artifact', 'Stealing artifact', 71378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find a way to strip our enemies of their power. Without their strength, we can easily overcome them with our will.', '', 71377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While our goals call for the eradication of the mogu, we can\'t ignore our flanks.$b$bWhile both the Alliance and the saurok attack the mogu alongside us, either could turn on us at any moment.', '', 71376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We blood elves have weathered many a storm. Whatever the Thunder King unleashes against us, we shall strike him an even greater blow!', '', 71375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On this island I must ask you to face great dangers. Your loyalty and trust are appreciated, $n.', '', 71374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Capacitor will Discharge in 10 Seconds! Get to a Drill!', 'Your Capacitor will Discharge in 10 Seconds! Get to a Drill!', 71373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 71372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_dust.blp:20|tDurumu begins charging up his eye to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:134169|h[Disintegration]|h|r!', '', 71371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve pushed them back to their ship.  Swing over and use some of their explosives to blow it to smithereens!', '', 71369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve held them off for now.  Hop in the port-side cannon and help out our other ships!', '', 71368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Betrayal of the Guardian', 'Betrayal of the Guardian', 71367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ghastly Charger', 'Ghastly Charger', 71366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Portal Heartstone', 'Dark Portal Heartstone', 71365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gusting Grimoire', 'Gusting Grimoire', 71364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re sending boarding parties from the sea.  One of you man the aft cannon and take \'em down!', '', 71363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More are coming aboard.  Hold them off!', '', 71362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me share dis gift with ya!', '', 71361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am but...the darkness...before the storm...', 'I am but...the darkness...before the storm...', 71360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35731, 35731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky weeps for your demise!', 'The sky weeps for your demise!', 71359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35733, 35733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The air crackles with anger!', 'The air crackles with anger!', 71358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35735, 35735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clouds arc with vengeance!', 'The clouds arc with vengeance!', 71357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35734, 35734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel a chill wind blow? The storm is coming...', 'Can you feel a chill wind blow? The storm is coming...', 71356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35730, 35730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am born of thunder!', 'I am born of thunder!', 71355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35732, 35732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to return to Lion\'s Landing.', 'I want to return to Lion\'s Landing.', 71350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again, $p! Enjoying your second chance?$B$BIf you continue along the adventure here until the Skyfire leaves, you\'ll automatically re-join the normal timeline and find Lion\'s Landing established again.$B$BOr, if you\'d rather go back, er... forward to Lion\'s Landing now, let me know!', 71349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for Old Man Barlo out by Silmyr Lake, northeast of Shattrath City.', 'Look for Old Man Barlo out by Silmyr Lake, northeast of Shattrath City.', 71348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $p! Just the $c I\'ve been looking for.$B$BDo you remember how the Alliance came to Pandaria? You were there, weren\'t you? But your presence in that part of Pandaria\'s timeline is... incomplete. You saw only a portion of the events which transpired that day.$B$BMaybe you fled the chaos of war to walk the peaceful valleys of this land. Or perhaps the call of treasure from dungeons exotic and ancient was louder than the call of your king to find his White Pawn.$B$BRegardless, I am not here to judge. I merely offer a second chance.$B$BSay the word, and I will transport you back to that day. Lion\'s Landing will not yet have been built, and the Skyfire will loom over Jade Forest.', 71347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a booming call, attracting nearby turtles.', '', 71346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to change your phase?', 'Are you sure you want to change your phase?', 71345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to see the Skyfire in Jade Forest. Take me back.', 'I want to see the Skyfire in Jade Forest. Take me back.', 71344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, $p! Just the $c I\'ve been looking for.$B$BDo you remember how the Alliance came to Pandaria? You were there, weren\'t you? But your presence in that part of Pandaria\'s timeline is... incomplete. You saw only a portion of the events which transpired that day.$B$BMaybe you fled the chaos of war to walk the peaceful valleys of this land. Or perhaps the call of treasure from dungeons exotic and ancient was louder than the call of your king to find his White Pawn.$B$BRegardless, I am not here to judge. I merely offer a second chance.$B$BSay the word, and I will transport you back to that day. Lion\'s Landing will not yet have been built, and the Skyfire will loom over Jade Forest.', 71343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Me? I practice the art of the Jade Lightning. My fists are so fast, you won\'t even be able to see them!', 71342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are investigating the sewer system - perhaps there is another way in to the citadel.', 71341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are few thundering cloud serpents left in our world.', 71340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An enormous thundering cloud serpent bars our entrance into Lei Shen\'s domain.', 71339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not long ago, but I\'ve already seen terrible suffering in this place!', 71320, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When did you arrive on this island?', 'When did you arrive on this island?', 71319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe the Zandalari actually make living sacrifices!', 71318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Zandalari are proving to be a greater threat than I expected.', 71317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hopefully taking these offerings will slow their sacrificial rituals down.', 71316, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those innocent pterodactyl hatchlings now have a chance at a real life.', 71315, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s fewer accursed Zandalari Priests we have to deal with.', 71314, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n, ya heart be a worthy sacrifice!', 'Ah, $n, ya heart be a worthy sacrifice!', 71307, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to fight?  You\'re gonna need an invite.$b$bYou\'re welcome to watch, though.', 'You want to fight?  You\'re gonna need an invite.$b$bYou\'re welcome to watch, though.', 71306, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to fight?  Come back when you\'re a bit stronger.$b$bYou\'re welcome to watch, though.', 'You want to fight?  Come back when you\'re a bit stronger.$b$bYou\'re welcome to watch, though.', 71305, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Without these throwing axes, their axe throwers will certainly be less effective.', 71304, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swear the blood oath with Vol\'jin', 'Swear the blood oath with Vol\'jin', 71303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin holds his hand out to you.', '', 71302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will show no mercy!', '', 71301, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 20505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Void Binder', 'Void Binder', 71299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void Binder can be found in the Ethereal Corridor, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building.', 'The Void Binder can be found in the Ethereal Corridor, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building.', 71297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Void Binder can be found in the Hall of Secrets, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building.', 'The Void Binder can be found in the Hall of Secrets, just upstairs and to the right as you enter the building.', 71296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were hit! Weapons temporarily disabled!', 'You were hit! Weapons temporarily disabled!', 71295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice one, $p! That was close.', 'Nice one, $p! That was close.', 71294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s talk!', 'Let\'s talk!', 71293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ro\'shak! Grant me wings of flame!', '', 71292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 35468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stealing', 'Stealing', 71291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs.', 'Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs.', 71290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss-Lady is nuts if she thinks I\'ll just eat this grub!', 'My sensibilities are offended by this mess!', 71285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who eats this stuff anyway?', 'Sezik calls this food?!', 71284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, yuck! This food is terrible!', 'Why don\'t buffets ever have anything good?', 71283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, $p! We\'ll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately.', 'Good work, $p! We\'ll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately.', 71282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those scorpid are moving the towers! Take them out!', 'Those scorpid are moving the towers! Take them out!', 71281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Mantid are protecting the towers, $p. Take them out or we won\'t be able to land any shots.', 'Those Mantid are protecting the towers, $p. Take them out or we won\'t be able to land any shots.', 71280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s and Rak\'gor Bloodrazor exchange hushed words.', '', 71278, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here.', '', 71276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will go, but only as a witness for my people. Someone gotta keep you in check, Garrosh.', '', 71275, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The speed of sound in dry air is approximately 343 m/s!', 'The speed of sound in dry air is approximately 343 m/s!', 71274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thunder begins with a shock wave in the air due to the sudden thermal expansion of the plasma in the lightning channel!', 'Thunder begins with a shock wave in the air due to the sudden thermal expansion of the plasma in the lightning channel!', 71273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Thunder King Raid!', 'This is the Thunder King Raid!', 71272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to set your worldstate area!', 'Don\'t forget to set your worldstate area!', 71271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons up, you magnificent monsters! They\'re about to charge.', '', 71268, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here comes the final assault. For Domination Point! BUTCHER THEM ALL!', '', 71267, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep on fighting, grunts! THE EYES OF HELLSCREAM ARE UPON US!', '', 71266, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! Hellscream would be proud! Here comes some more meat for the grinder...', '', 71265, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! HOLD FAST!', '', 71264, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory! VICTORY FOR THE HORDE!', '', 71263, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all ready.', 'We\'re all ready.', 71262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to help.', 'We\'re here to help.', 71261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready up, you mangy grunts!', '', 71260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good timing. Here they come again!', '', 71259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need information, NOW. How many Alliance are left, and how many orcs we still have - and help that mad goblin Clutchpop set up some defenses.', '', 71258, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My commanding officers are all dead or missing.', '', 71257, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Alliance thinks a few reinforcements are all it takes to conquer MY fortress, they\'ve got another thing coming!', '', 71256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(General Nazgrim will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(General Nazgrim will follow you.)|r', 71255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll hold Domination Point or die trying!', '', 71254, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miserable gnomes! They dropped out of the sky and set fire to EVERYTHING.\n\nNow the whole refinery\'s alight, and the main Alliance forces will advance on the keep at any moment!\n\nWe don\'t have the numbers to stop them...', '', 71253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s start explodinatin\'!', '', 71252, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Rivett will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Rivett will follow you.)|r', 71251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a good thing I spend all my spare time tinkering on my greatest passion: High-power directed explosives!\n\nLet\'s use some to set up defensive positions at the gates.', '', 71250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 153, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kiryn will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kiryn will follow you.)|r', 71249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'ll never see me coming.', 71248, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyone not already standing is dead. Bloodhilt has all the fighters he\'ll get.\n\nSo... I\'m ravenous. Shall we go find something to eat?', 71247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kromthar will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Kromthar will follow you.)|r', 71246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s slaughter them all.', 71245, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alliance dogs!\n\nLook at my poor wyverns...', 71244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Shokia will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Shokia will follow you.)|r', 71243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep you covered.', 71242, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s too much smoke in the air to see very far.\n\nI can\'t make out much of anything on the beach, and sniping\'s useless.', 71241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SHOOP DA WHOOP!', '', 71240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M FIRING MY LASER!', '', 71239, 13, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M CHARGING MY LASER!', '', 71238, 13, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, yes I am new to Stormwind.  Is it that obvious?', 71237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right this way!', 'Right this way!', 71236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boss Bizmo said no nobodies allowed!', 'Boss Bizmo said no nobodies allowed!', 71235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this wise guy!', 'Look at this wise guy!', 71234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come back when you actually deserve to go up to the Boom Room!', 'Come back when you actually deserve to go up to the Boom Room!', 71233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t let just any riffraff off the street in here!', 'We don\'t let just any riffraff off the street in here!', 71232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And stay out!', 'And stay out!', 71231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to take the portal to Orgrimmar?', 'Are you sure you want to take the portal to Orgrimmar?', 71230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to take the portal to Stormwind?', 'Are you sure you want to take the portal to Stormwind?', 71229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax, Aethas. This attack cannot be traced. I am certain.', '', 71228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to pay the toll!', '', 71227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Pandaren are sittin\' on a treasure trove. They even got books in here about vrykul. I mean the vrykul! Come on! How could they possibly have encountered them?', '', 71226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
