('', 'Do not let your eyes deceive you.', 71200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is for Theramore!', 'You\'ll burn for your crimes!', 71199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warranty voided.  I hope you are happy.', '', 71198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenger defeated. Uploading report for analysis and verbal harassment.', '', 71197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engaging hostile entity.  Removing protective failsafes.', '', 71196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The night elves didn\'t properly secure their portals in Dalaran. It was a simple matter to exploit the ley lines...', '', 71195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never leave this jungle alive!', 'So, you\'ve come to die?!', 71194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re routing this attack through Dalaran? Proudmoore will suspect the Sunreavers! Stop this immediately!', '', 71193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I smelled something!', 'Death to the Horde!', 71192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heigh-ho... heigh-ho... OH NO!', '', 71191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d give you a thumbs down, but I can\'t find it.', '', 71190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fanlyr, what is going on here? I didn\'t authorize this.', '', 71189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hugs... we want hugs...', '', 71188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t belong here!', 'For the Alliance!', 71187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Do you want me to report to Garrosh that you asked us to bow to that Kirin Tor wench?!', '', 71186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trespassin\' huh?!', 'Thief!', 71185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Alliance!', 'For the Horde', 71184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, coward. You\'d better ask where your loyalties lie: With the Kirin Tor? Or with the Horde?', '', 71183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get outta here!', 'I thought I smelled something!', 71182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your hands off that!', 'Hey you there!', 71181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never take this land from us!', 'Garrosh will have your head!', 71180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria is ours!', 'You\'re trespassing!', 71179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'Death to the Alliance!', 71178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I smelled something!', 'Hey!', 71177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', 'Get your hands off that!', 71176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps the mogu hid the bell for a reason, Warchief.', 71175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What if the Divine Bell is in disrepair too? Are you certain you can use it even if we do find it?', 71174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve been searching for days. All we have found are dusty scrolls and broken statues.', 71173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re close! These documents all mention the bell and Kun-Lai Summit. It must be here.', '', 71172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine Bell is a weapon of unquestionable power. It belongs in horde hands. It belongs to me!', '', 71171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will concern myself with how it works once I have it in my possessions, Blood Elf.', '', 71170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep looking, Reliquary. We will find it. The bell is meant to ensure Horde victory. I feel it in my bones.', '', 71169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go track down those thieves!', 'Let\'s go track down those thieves!', 71168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like our people, the Horde is always in motion, always changing. But make no mistake. We will endure.', '', 71167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a portal to Dalaran.', 'I need a portal to Dalaran.', 71166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surprise us both and do something smart, like running away.', '', 71165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell worse than a sulfur mine filled with unwashed yaks.', '', 71164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just keep standing there looking dumb, it suits you.', '', 71163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that a hit?  My grandma could hit harder and she\'s dead!', '', 71162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fighting skills are bad and you should feel bad.', '', 71161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad for a newbie.', '', 71160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the Alliance sent... you?', '', 71159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learn well from your experience here, $p. In the future, your efficient efforts may be well rewarded.', 71158, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you supply our camp, strive to keep the benefits from wearing off.', 71157, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wood, snake oil, food and water will speed our progress, $p. Please, do what you can to keep us supplied.', 71156, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No surrender!', 'No surrender!', 71155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch over us, $p. We are not accustomed to fighting. We will require your protection if we are attacked.', 71154, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will NOT submit!', 'I will NOT submit!', 71153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is my home too!', 'This is my home too!', 71152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not shirk, friend. Keep us well supplied and our work will be completed sooner.', 71151, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Spirit-Kissed Water from the local sprites will nourish our saplings well. And once the bucket is filled, you will not need to replenish it.', 71150, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance witch!', 'Alliance witch!', 71149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring us wood to graft into our saplings, $p. We shall make do with the roots in the region.', 71148, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We typically shy away from eating the flesh of beasts, but our predicament requires that we make exception.', 71147, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are accustomed to wisps carrying out our labors. Please bring food to keep us sustained.', 71146, 0, 20177, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our home too! You can\'t do this!', 'This is our home too! You can\'t do this!', 71145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our resources are well stocked, thanks to you. Please strive to keep them so.', 71144, 0, 20176, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have served us well, $p. Please continue as we draw near completion.', 71143, 0, 20176, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Things could not be going better, friend. Thank you for your aid.', 71142, 0, 20176, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Static> Come in, $p, this is Sky Admiral Rogers.', 71141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Practice being as efficient as you can, $p! One day, time might be a factor...', 71140, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep us well supplied, $p. Don\'t let the effects expire or you\'ll have to start from scratch!', 71139, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can often supply us with multiples of an item for extra effect. Just try to keep the benefits from wearing off.', 71138, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Snake Oil, Krasari Iron, Food... keep an eye out for anything that might benefit our crew!', 71137, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye on us, $p! We\'re builders, not fighters. We\'ll need your protection if any beasties come around!', 71136, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep us well supplied for the greatest production benefit.', 71135, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The lizard folk around here are likely to carry anything. Watch for \'em!', 71134, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye out for oily serpents, $p. They\'re easy enough to catch. Put their oil in the cauldron and we\'ll work even faster.', 71133, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey $p, we\'ll work faster if we have plenty of metal to work with. The local Krasari Iron Ore will do fine.', 71132, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Collect meat from the local wildlife or rations from the orcs. We\'re not picky eaters.', 71131, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We gnomes have a high metabolism, $p. Make sure we don\'t run outta food!', 71130, 0, 20174, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re doing great, $p! At this rate, our defenses will be complete in no time!', 71129, 0, 20173, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is as fast as I\'ve ever seen this team work! Keep it up, $p!', 71128, 0, 20173, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woohoo! You\'ve got us running at peak efficiency, $p!', 71127, 0, 20173, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We didn\'t know th-', 'We didn\'t know th-', 71126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
