('If your enemies harass the worker, productivity will cease until the threat is dealt with.', '', 71123, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have delivered supplies, your work is not done. Do your best to keep our resources topped off.', '', 71122, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My workers are highly skilled, but they are ineffective when it comes to combat. Do not wander too far off.', '', 71121, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here she comes!', 'Here she comes!', 71120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is usable wood, even in these swamps. Look for brittle roots protruding from the soil.', '', 71119, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food and wood are our primary needs. Speak with me if you seek to aid us further.', '', 71118, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just deposit any food you gather on the table here. We can take it from there.', '', 71117, 0, 20171, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
