('', 'Don\'t worry. I\'ll get Anduin back to Lion\'s Landing safely. We\'ll meet ye there.', 71108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no! Prince Anduin!', 71107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Saw yer flare \'n came quick as I could!', 71106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take my advice, $p. It\'s best to keep our resources stocked up!', '', 71105, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Productivity stops if we\'re attacked. Keep an eye on us!', '', 71104, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go wanderin\' off too far, $p. We\'re darn near defenseless without the likes of you.', '', 71103, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s orcs out there, $p. I can smell \'em. And they\'re bound to have supplies we can make use of.', '', 71102, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
