('C\'mon, $p! We need resources if we\'re gunna get this job done! Food, wood, iron... whatever you can find!', '', 71100, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a type of iron unique to these parts. Bring back any ya find, $p. Ain\'t no iron in Azeroth us dwarves can\'t forge.', '', 71099, 0, 20168, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
