('Let\'s see how this one\'s bleeds...', '', 71011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $p, let\'s take this one out!', '', 71010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right between the eyes...', '', 71009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I like our chances, $p.', '', 71008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus your fire, $p!', '', 71007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'ll be dead before long, $p.', '', 71006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rommath... I... I don\'t know what came over me.', '', 71005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what was that?', '', 71004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem this \"sha\" energy is far more powerful than I previously thought.', '', 71003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the jungle, $rt. You\'re gunna die!', 'Welcome to the jungle, $rt. You\'re gunna die!', 71002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood will not be the last my blades taste today, $c!', 'Your blood will not be the last my blades taste today, $c!', 71001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been an age of the world or more since I felt any emotion at even a fraction of that.', '', 71000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your beloved king has taken the bait! He\'ll die in this jungle!', 'Your beloved king has taken the bait! He\'ll die in this jungle!', 70999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May your wounds be mended, $p.', 70998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not let you fall, $p!', 70997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry, $p, I will heal you!', 70996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the light of the eternal sun heal you, $p!', 70995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call for your king, $rt! Draw him in!', 'Call for your king, $rt! Draw him in!', 70994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Commander will have the Alliance king\'s head on a spike!', 'The Commander will have the Alliance king\'s head on a spike!', 70993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scargash won\'t allow any alliance to escape the jungle!', 'Scargash won\'t allow any alliance to escape the jungle!', 70992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea what\'s waiting for you!', 'You have no idea what\'s waiting for you!', 70991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('--GREETINGS, $P. PLEASE PROCEED DOWN THE TUNNEL BEHIND THIS UNIT. HIS HIGH AND POWERFULNESS THE GRAND MAGISTER ROMMATH AWAITS YOUR ARRIVAL.--', '', 70990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not be gettin\' the drop on us again ya half wit Kor\'kron!', 'Ya not be gettin\' the drop on us again ya half wit Kor\'kron!', 70989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin not be givin\' ya permission to question us like this.', 'Vol\'jin not be givin\' ya permission to question us like this.', 70988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us Darkspear not the type to wear chains well, mon. Ya be learnin\' this the hard way... soon.', 'Us Darkspear not the type to wear chains well, mon. Ya be learnin\' this the hard way... soon.', 70987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah not a traitor mon! Ya not gonna be shacklin\' me again.', 'Ah not a traitor mon! Ya not gonna be shacklin\' me again.', 70986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya mon! A hero done freed our raptors!', 'Ya mon! A hero done freed our raptors!', 70985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan Kien\'s eyes glow with Sha Magic!', '', 70984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shan Kien\'s hand twists into a Sha Claw!', '', 70983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to the gnome foreman, Rosey Axlerod, who will use the Soggy Journal to permanently grant a significant increase to the gnome rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t', 'Speak to the gnome foreman, Rosey Axlerod, who will use the Soggy Journal to permanently grant a significant increase to the gnome rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_BOOK_11.blp:64|t', 70982, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to the jinyu foreman, Elder Adler, who will use the Adorned Sceptre to permanently grant a significant increase to the jinyu rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t', 'Speak to the jinyu foreman, Elder Adler, who will use the Adorned Sceptre to permanently grant a significant increase to the jinyu rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_STAFF_2H_PANDARIATRADESKILL_C_05.blp:64|t', 70981, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Unexploded Cannonball at the dwarven construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_SIEGEENGINECANNON.blp:64|t', 'Use the Unexploded Cannonball at the dwarven construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_SIEGEENGINECANNON.blp:64|t', 70980, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirit-Kissed Water will awaken Master Brownstone, boost progress at pandaren construction site, or increase progress rate at night elf site! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_VOLATILEWATER.blp:64|t', 'Spirit-Kissed Water will awaken Master Brownstone, boost progress at pandaren construction site, or increase progress rate at night elf site! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_VOLATILEWATER.blp:64|t', 70979, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $p, do not tell Garrosh what we have done here today. I must make some weighty decisions before confronting him directly.', '', 70978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Snake Oil at the night elf or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_OILJETS.blp:64|t', 'Use the Snake Oil at the night elf or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_VEHICLE_OILJETS.blp:64|t', 70977, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But know this, the Horde IS family, even if some of its leaders have forgotten that fact. To prove this, I shall remain with you and lend what strength I can to your chosen leaders until Vol\'jin returns.', '', 70976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Misplaced Keg at the pandaren construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_CASK_04.blp:64|t', 'Use the Misplaced Keg at the pandaren construction site to permanently boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_CASK_04.blp:64|t', 70975, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Meaty Haunch at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_50.blp:64|t', 'Use the Meaty Haunch at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_50.blp:64|t', 70974, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Liquid Fire on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_BURNINGEMBERS.blp:64|t', 'Use the Liquid Fire on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_WARLOCK_BURNINGEMBERS.blp:64|t', 70973, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Krasari Iron at the dwarven or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ORE_PLATINUM_01.blp:64|t', 'Use the Krasari Iron at the dwarven or gnome construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ORE_PLATINUM_01.blp:64|t', 70972, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Jungle Hops on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_HERB_08.blp:64|t', 'Use the Jungle Hops on the Blast-brew Cauldron at the pandaren construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_HERB_08.blp:64|t', 70971, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Brittle Roots at select construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_WEAPON_SHORTBLADE_09.blp:64|t', 'Use the Brittle Roots at select construction sites to boost their rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_WEAPON_SHORTBLADE_09.blp:64|t', 70970, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls and orcs have fought together. Died together. We are family. And family looks after its own.', '', 70969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land was harsh. Time and again it was Vol\'jin and his people who ensured the Horde\'s survival, saving us from starvation, or taking up arms when we were attacked.', '', 70968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made our home in this desert, and named it after my father Durotan, Chieftain of the Frostwolf Clan.', '', 70967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember when Vol\'jin and I first came to this land. The Horde was just an idea then. A hope. We needed one another.', '', 70966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Battle Rations at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_WHEAT_02.blp:64|t', 'Use the Battle Rations at any construction site to boost its rate of progress! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_FOOD_WHEAT_02.blp:64|t', 70965, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes things just need doin\' even if it does mean breakin\' a few things along the way!', '', 70964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Use the Laborer\'s Tool at any construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_HAMMER_17.blp:64|t', 'Use the Laborer\'s Tool at any construction site for a progress boost! $B$B|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_HAMMER_17.blp:64|t', 70963, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Kor\'kron business! Nothing to see here.', 'This is Kor\'kron business! Nothing to see here.', 70962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will rout out dissention among these mongrels!', 'We will rout out dissention among these mongrels!', 70961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall rout all traitors to the Horde!', 'We shall rout all traitors to the Horde!', 70960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF00ff00+5 Construction Progress|r', '|cFF00ff00+5 Construction Progress|r', 70959, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time you got here, $n. This battle isn\'t going to win itself!', 70958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF00ff00Construction Progress: Rate increased!|r', '|cFF00ff00Construction Progress: Rate increased!|r', 70957, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' smell funny.', '', 70956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many places, so little time. Where to, $Gbrother:sister;?', '', 70955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you want to go?', '', 70954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF00ff00+25 Construction Progress|r', '|cFF00ff00+25 Construction Progress|r', 70953, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carry on!$b$bThe attack will commence once two defenses are constructed.', 'Carry on!$b$bThe attack will commence once two defenses are constructed.', 70952, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done it! WE\'VE DONE IT!', '', 70951, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is it! Their final assault! FOR LION\'S LANDING!', '', 70950, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep on fighting, lads! DON\'T GIVE UP!', '', 70949, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s how we do it, lads! Here comes more!', '', 70948, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come! HOLD FAST!', '', 70947, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready! They\'ll charge any moment now.', '', 70946, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me reports from that SI:7 team - how many Horde are left, and how many men we still have - and help Sully set up some defenses.', '', 70945, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My commanding officers are all dead or missing.', '', 70944, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re all ready.', 'We\'re all ready.', 70943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time to operate.', 70942, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get to work!', '', 70941, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Sully will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Sully will follow you.)|r', 70940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nodd and Nimm were out in the submersible when the Horde attacked.\n\nStill, I\'ve put all their gear and explosives to good use.\n\nWe can set up a defensive position at the front.', '', 70939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready up, lads!', '', 70938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good timing, too. Here comes the assault\'s commander!', '', 70937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to help.', 'We\'re here to help.', 70936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Bloodhilt thinks a few reinforcements are going to be enough to take Lion\'s Landing, he\'s got another thing coming!', '', 70935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Mishka will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Mishka will follow you.)|r', 70934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve done all I can for the wounded here. Twinbraid has all the bodies he\'ll get.\n\nI\'m defending the injured... unless you have a better plan?', 70933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll keep you covered.', 70932, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Amber will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Amber will follow you.)|r', 70931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s too much smoke in the air to see very far.\n\nI can\'t make out much of anything on the beach, and sniping\'s useless.', 70930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to cook with fire?', 'Ready to cook with fire?', 70929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No tunic, no boots, no service!', 'No tunic, no boots, no service!', 70928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have reservations?', 'Do you have reservations?', 70927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to cook in that?', 'You\'re going to cook in that?', 70926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think the meat has gone bad.  Oh wait, that\'s you!', 'I think the meat has gone bad.  Oh wait, that\'s you!', 70925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you could cook more and eat less, no?', 'Maybe you could cook more and eat less, no?', 70924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I woudn\'t serve that to a Worg!', 'I woudn\'t serve that to a Worg!', 70923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just going to say it: you\'re fat.', 'I\'m just going to say it: you\'re fat.', 70922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your attire is UNNACCEPTABLE!', 'Your attire is UNNACCEPTABLE!', 70921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rak\'gor has dropped a gas bomb.  Stand in a Healing Ward to heal yourself!', '', 70920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a true hero of the Horde!', 'You are a true hero of the Horde!', 70919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a true hero of the Alliance!', 'You are a true hero of the Alliance!', 70918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, $p! We\'ll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately.', 'Good work, $p! We\'ll take these bombs back to the admiral immediately.', 70917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horde cannot be stopped!', '', 70916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool!', '', 70915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empress...', '', 70914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood will paint Zan\'vess red!', '', 70913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this what you came for?', '', 70912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zan\'vess will never fall!', '', 70911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... have... failed...', '', 70910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are powerless before Garrosh!', '', 70909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood and thunder!', '', 70908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 70907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance scum!', '', 70906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varian will honor me for this victory!', '', 70905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varian... I have... failed... you', '', 70904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowardly dogs!', '', 70903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 70902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde scum!', '', 70901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid in the construction of at least two of the five defenses.', 'Aid in the construction of at least two of the five defenses.', 70900, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop those horde! They\'re storming the island!', 70899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The shield is down! Quickly get to the beachhead!', 70898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sending you the coordinates of the next towers now.', 70897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice shooting, $p! The shield is weakening!', 70896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re approaching the first towers now! Take them out!', 70895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need you to take them out before the horde overrun us.', 70894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My scouts report that the shield is maintained by several generators around the island.', 70893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
