('', 'Oh, yes I am new to Orgrimmar.  Is it that obvious?', 70737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place looks rough and tumble, but everyone around here is a softie on the inside.', 70736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, sorry, I can\'t buy you a drink.  I\'m a bit broke right now, but that\'ll turn around.', 70735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, I\'ll get into the ring.  Let me finish these two kegs first.', '', 70734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t get why so many other monks throw kegs around.  So wasteful.', '', 70733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could break through four hardened pine boards using just your forehead.  Want me to demonstrate?', '', 70732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Druids can sometimes be so serious, but I\'m a real party animal.  Yes, that was a joke.  You should laugh.  Now.', 70731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'City life changes a druid.  I used a flight path for the first time last week... and it was great.', 70730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always cheer for Goredome anytime he\'s up.  That angry little shoveltusk makes quick work of the slow chubby ones.', 70729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few nights back some guy threw a ball and told me to fetch. In response, I did the same, but with his head.  Needless to say, he didn\'t have a witty comeback.', '', 70728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get some medication for my allergies.', '', 70727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I smell bacon?', '', 70726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is great.  Anywhere else I\'d be called a violent sociopath.  Well, they call me that here too, but at least they say it to my face with a smile.', 70725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yeah, there are plenty of false rumors going around about me.  That I grew up as an attraction in the Darkmoon Faire, that I killed six demons on my fifth birthday using only a spoon, or even -- and this is my favorite -- that I\'m actually a natural blonde.  Folks will believe anything.', 70724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re better off not trusting anything I say.  In fact, disregard this.', 70723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gotsh somethin\' to say to me? You do the talkin\' and I\'ll do the drinkin\'!', 70722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yesh, Brom here\'s the love of my life.  We\'re two peash in a pod, even if he\'s a lightweight!', 70721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Buy me a drinksh will ya?', 70720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shpilled me drink!', '', 70719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... *burp*', '', 70718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is thish room is shpinning?', '', 70717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here goes nothing. My research did not have nice things to say about this Jade Warlord. Be ready for battle.', '', 70716, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blast... the Silver Covenant\'s here.', '', 70715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So it\'s come to this, eh?', 70714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Sunreavers!', 70713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You\'ll have to wrench me out of here!', '', 70712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll scribble you out of existence!', '', 70711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The... Empire... will rise again.', '', 70710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are next in line!', 'You are next in line!', 70709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! And now to be rid of you filthy hozen rebels.', '', 70708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ships! What in the name o\' me beard happened?!', '', 70707, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Night Elf Construction Site Under Attack!', 'Night Elf Construction Site Under Attack!', 70706, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 34768, 34768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to return to Pandaria.', 'I\'m ready to return to Pandaria.', 70705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have long waited for an opportunity to deal with the Sunreavers. I asked my late husband to remove them from the city, but he believed too firmly in the neutrality of the Kirin Tor.$b$bHe was wise, but he was short-sighted. This has always been the destiny of the Kirin Tor: to serve the Alliance.', 70704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Darnassus.', 'Take me to Darnassus.', 70703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Silvermoon City.', 'Take me to Silvermoon City.', 70702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $c, you looking to go to Stormwind? Travel fast with one of my portals! If you ain\'t got the commissions, you\'ll have to get there on your own.', '', 70701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlord Bloodhilt prepares a Bloodthirsty Strike!', '', 70700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
