('|cff0000ffRank 5:|r\n  Big Badda Boom: $8072w-$8071w\n  Millie Watt: $7457w-$7458w\n  Bruce: $7427w-$7428w\n  Leper Gnome Quintet: $7437w-$7438w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 6:|r\n  Proboskus: $7485w-$7486w\n  Doctor FIST: $8076w-$8075w\n  Unguloxx: $7483w-$7484w\n  Yikkan Izu: $7467w-$7468w', '', 70698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 3:|r\n  Blat: $7435w-$7436w\n  Vian the Volatile: $7429w-$7430w\n  Ixx: $7447w-$7448w\n  Mazhareen: $7459w-$7460w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 4:|r\n  Tyson Sanders: $8066w-$8065w\n  Nibbleh: $8074w-$8073w\n  Dominika the Illusionist: $7455w-$7456w\n  Meatball: $7489w-$7490w', '', 70697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 1:|r\n  Goredome: $7431w-$7432w\n  Sanoriak: $7445w-$7446w\n  Smash Hoofstomp: $7471w-$7472w\n  Akama: $7461w-$7462w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 2:|r\n  Dippy: $7443w-$7444w\n  Kirrawk: $7453w-$7454w\n  King Kulaka: $7479w-$7480w\n  Fran & Riddoh: $7441w-$7442w', '', 70696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back.', 'Go back.', 70695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('View records for Rank 7 bosses.', 'View records for Rank 7 bosses.', 70694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('View records for Rank 5-6 bosses.', 'View records for Rank 5-6 bosses.', 70693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('View records for Rank 3-4 bosses.', 'View records for Rank 3-4  bosses.', 70692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('View records for Rank 1-2 bosses.', 'View records for Rank 1-2 bosses.', 70691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, lucky. You like numbers?$b$bI keep track of all the fights around here. I can tell you how many fights each of the challengers won.$b$bMight come in handy, especially if you wanna... I dunno... predict the winner of one of these fights, for some... monetary benefit. You catch my drift?', '', 70690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 7:|r \n  GG Engineering: $7411w-$7412w\n  Dark Summoner: $7413w-$7414w\n  Battletron: $7375w-$7376w\n  Ahoo\'ru: $8038w-$8037w', '', 70689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 5:|r\n  Big Badda Boom: $8032w-$8031w\n  Millie Watt: $7393w-$7394w\n  Bruce: $7363w-$7364w\n  Leper Gnome Quintet: $7373w-$7374w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 6:|r\n  Proboskus: $7421w-$7422w\n  Doctor FIST: $8036w-$8035w\n  Unguloxx: $7419w-$7420w\n  Yikkan Izu: $7403w-$7404w', '', 70688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 3:|r\n  Blat: $7371w-$7372w\n  Vian the Volatile: $7365w-$7366w\n  Ixx: $7383w-$7384w\n  Mazhareen: $7395w-$7396w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 4:|r\n  Tyson Sanders: $7873w-$7874w\n  Nibbleh: $8034w-$8033w\n  Dominika the Illusionist: $7391w-$7392w\n  Meatball: $7425w-$7426w', '', 70687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cff0000ffRank 1:|r\n  Goredome: $7367w-$7368w\n  Sanoriak: $7381w-$7382w\n  Smash Hoofstomp: $7407w-$7408w\n  Akama: $7397w-$7398w\n\n|cff0000ffRank 2:|r\n  Dippy: $7379w-$7380w\n  Kirrawk: $7389w-$7390w\n  King Kulaka: $7415w-$7416w\n  Fran & Riddoh: $7377w-$7378w', '', 70686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Emperor\'s Reach.', 'Take me to Emperor\'s Reach.', 70685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Valley of Emperors.', 'Take me to the Valley of Emperors.', 70684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Darnassus.', 'Take me to Darnassus.', 70683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Ruins of Korune.', 'Take me to the Ruins of Korune.', 70682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Garrosh\'ar Advance.', 'Take me to Garrosh\'ar Advance.', 70681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Shrine of Seven Stars.', 'Take me to the Shrine of Seven Stars.', 70680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Mogujia.', 'Take me to Mogujia.', 70679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Dalaran.', 'Take me to Dalaran.', 70678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Fire Camp Bataar.', 'Take me to Fire Camp Bataar.', 70677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s can now be put to sleep.', '', 70676, 0, 20081, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did someone order a portal to Orgrimmar? No? TOO BAD!', '', 70675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar portal open, Brawl fans!  Tell \'em Bubbles sent ya.', '', 70674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve made a portal to Orgrimmar. Who wants to kick some Horde butt?', '', 70673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This practice is all fine and dandy, but Orgrimmar won\'t smash itself!', '', 70672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You folks want violence and bloodshed? Let\'s go take it to the Horde!', '', 70671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is packed to the rafters with Alliance all-stars!  Let\'s go tear apart Orgrimmar!', '', 70670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The portal to Stormwind is good to go!  Get in!', 70669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve opened a portal to Stormwind.  Get in there and kick some butt!', 70668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Portal\'s up! Get in there and show \'em how the Horde do it!', 70667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you\'re so thirsty for blood, why not group up and go tear apart Stormwind?', 70666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is packed! We should all team up and go kick Varian in his pretty little face!', 70665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s take this show on the road and go wreck up Stormwind!', 70664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOW THE... WHAT THE...  DAMMIT!', 'HOW THE... WHAT THE...  DAMMIT!', 70663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was supposed to be a sure thing! I BET EVERYTHING!', 'It was supposed to be a sure thing! I BET EVERYTHING!', 70662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I LOSE? NO YOU LOSE!', 'I LOSE? NO YOU LOSE!', 70661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! NO NO NO!', 'No! NO NO NO!', 70660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I had my whole paycheck riding on that one!', 'Bah! I had my whole paycheck riding on that one!', 70659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever ye do today, hero, ye\'re doin\' fer all the Alliance.', 70658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll go back fer reinforcements.', 70657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quick - they haven\'t spotted us yet.', 70656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, why can\'t this dang kite go faster?', 70655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re amassin\' an army to head Garrosh off, but that will take time, and the Prince may already be in danger.', 70654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ye\'ve either got to stop the boy or help him... one o\' the two!', 70653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boy\'s naive enough ta think he can change the Horde \'an save the world... but... he\'s still just a child.', 70652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin went on ahead. That cheeky, light-spoutin\', clod-brained fool!', 70651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s going to use the Divine Bell, and Light help us if we can\'t stop \'im in time.', 70650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh is amassing his troops on the northern side of Kun-Lai Summit.', 70649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time ye showed up. Doomsday is a comin\'.', 70648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck.', 70647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope Anduin\'s got some plan up his sleeve.', 70646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now, Garrosh has the Divine Bell. He could attack us any day!', 70645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still, I can\'t help but get an uneasy feelin\' that the Horde ain\'t goin\' to take that quietly.', 70644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Course she\'s goin\' ta feel upset. Course she\'s got a right to throw those nasty Sunreavers out o\' Dalaran.', 70643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then the Sunreavers betray her trust and open portals straight ta the Bell from her own city!', 70642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard her say it meself - that Dalaran would be a shining example of peace \'tween Alliance an\' Horde fer the rest o\' the world.', 70641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was ready ta forge a new future for the Kirin Tor, one where the Horde-allied Sunreavers and the Alliance-sided Silver Covenant could work together in peace.', 70640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She was ready ta forgive the Horde fer the destruction o\' Theramore.', 70639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard that Lady Jaina\'s still in shock about what happened.', 70638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still cannae believe the Horde stole the Divine Bell, after everything we did to keep it safe in Darnassus.', 70637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t say I approve o\' the boy roamin\' round by himself, but I can understand his thinkin\'.', 70636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, I know right where the Prince is hidin\', so I\'ll take ye right to \'im.', 70635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That man\'s bound ta get all jealous, an\' I don\'t want him poppin\' a cap inta the royal son.', 70634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lucky fer you, I\'m Prince Anduin\'s best gal. We\'re friends, but don\'t go tellin\' Agent Connelly.', 70633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, Admiral Taylor asked me to hitch you a ride up to the Valley o\' Emperors.', 70632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ain\'t flyin\' no kite to Darnassus! I can barely navigate that thing in the mountains. Ye think we\'d last over an entire ocean? Ye\'d best talk to Seamus Goldenkicks over there.', 70631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I ain\'t flyin\' no kite to Dalaran! I don\'t even know where Jaina moved the city! Ye\'d best take the portal over there.', 70630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck!', 70629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are. There\'s no time to waste.', 70628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re sendin\' out our best, and that means you.', 70627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander Skyglaive is already workin\' with a team of Explorer\'s League archaeologists at the dig site.', 70626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we don\'t get to that Divine Bell first, that lizard-livered nut-brain Garrosh will. I don\'t much fancy fightin\' a Horde that commands the power o\' the bleepin\' sha.', 70625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve been lookin\' all over Kun-Lai Summit fer a place that matches what ye saw in that mogu\'s memory, and we finally found the Korune\'s hidin\' place.', 70624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We ain\'t got no time ta lose.', 70623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get on the kite, quick!', 70622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck!', 70621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'d better meet up with him in the field and see what Garrosh is up to.', 70620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds like the Horde are close to finding the location o\' that Divine Bell, and that ain\'t no good.', 70619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, Agent Connelly sent me word to bring ya to him in Kun-Lai Summit.', 70618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe Varian ain\'t such a sour grape after all! Good ta see our King show some heart.', 70617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I also heard that King Varian swore he would never use the sha to no good.', 70616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If ye and Prince Anduin hadn\'t been there, we could all be turnin\' on each other, lettin\' our anger get the best o\' us!', 70615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After I dropped ye off last time, I heard there was some kind of sha infectin\' our soldiers at the Shrine of Seven Stars.', 70614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy. How are ye today?', 70613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you go. Good luck!', 70612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Makes me shudder even ta think.', 70611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imagine what would happen if that knotty-pated axe-bludgeoner Garrosh could manipulate the sha to his bidding.', 70610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the Korune were capable of such a feat, ain\'t no wonder Garrosh is after their knowledge!', 70609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They worked from the shadows, and get this... somehow, they managed to master the sha.', 70608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the looks o\' it, the Korune were loyal to the Thunder King, thousands o\' years ago... before even the pandaren came to rule this land.', 70607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those mogu belong to a tribe called the Korune.', 70606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not supposed ta say anything \'bout this, but ye\'ve got a face that says ye like a good Dwarven stout, so I trust ye!', 70605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'ve been studying the relics that the blood elves were stealin\'.', 70604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'After the excavation trip to Mogujia, the Explorer\'s League brought their findings back to our city in the Vale o\' Eternal Blossoms.', 70603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The young Prince Anduin\'s been askin\' after ya.', 70602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m supposed to get ye to the Shrine o\' Seven Stars.', 70601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go wreck those Horde!', 70600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are.', 70599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t do much since I\'m just Hilda\'s assistant, but ye can. I hope ye can find out what they\'re up to.', 70598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll be a snot-nosed ninny if we don\'t beat \'em to the punch!', 70597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Reliquary is hot on the trail o\' that bell at Mogujia.', 70596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one knows where the artifact was hidden, but the Horde\'s doing anything they can ta get their hands on it first.', 70595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That bell\'s capable of turning a normal army into killin\' machines!', 70594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I heard that the Horde\'s learned of an ancient mogu artifact... somethin\' called the Divine Bell.', 70593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have ye heard all the buzz that\'s been going \'round Lion\'s Landing?', 70592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I trust that ye\'re well and good?', 70591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, we meet again.', 70590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You lookin\' ta go to Dalaran? Heard the Lady Jaina Proudmoore herself\'s expectin\' ye! Go on through the mage portal down the path.', 70589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let Connelly know that Fennie\'s askin\' about him!', 70588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m takin\' you close ta a Horde encampment though, so you\'d best be on yer guard.', 70587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s out in the field now, and waitin\' fer ya special.', 70586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agent Connelly, ain\'t it? That man\'s got some charm... and some nerve! His sweet words made me blush ten ways out of Ironforge!', 70585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyway, I met that SI:7 agent that you brought back outta retirement.', 70584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She won\'t let me go down to the excavation, so I\'ve become somethin\' o\' a personal assistant and chauffeur.', 70583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My older sister, Hilda, told me to expect ye.', 70582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sorry, I\'m still gettin\' the hang o\' things \'round here.', 70581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oops, how do ye fly one o\' these things? Fer light\'s sake! Ye crummy piece o\' whackery, WORK!', 70580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my. Ye must be the hero that everyone\'s been tellin\' me about.', 70579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m up ta me pretty knickers in ad-mino-strative duties, but wot else is new?', 70578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As if I ain\'t got enough on me hands, those dwarves at the mines\'ve gotten all crazy recently about some new drink called kafa.$B$BThey\'re insistin\' I bring \'em fresh cups o\' kafa every mornin\'!$B$BDo they know wot I \'ave ta do to get those kafa beans? Honestly!', 70577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hilda\'s left all the documentin\' to me. Ye know that fer every artifact we find, I\'ve got six forms ta fill out? Whaddaya we need all these forms fer, I ask!?', 70576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
