('Don\'t tell anyone where you\'re goin\', he said!', '', 70473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A big pandaren came and asked me to take you there.', '', 70472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, we\'re almost to Binan Village. You mus\' be doin\' somethin\' real ookin\' important.', '', 70471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is yer Warchief gonna look fer that bell now? Anything mogu is dangerous... an\' powerful.', '', 70470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess I can head back to Silvermoon...', 'Leave Dalaran? Where will I even go...', 70469, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard somethin\' about a bell, made by those crazy mogu... thousands of years ago. Jimeny wikkets!', '', 70468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you and the pretty elves find somethin\' while you was there?', '', 70467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anyway, Tak-Tak hear a lot of stuff goin\' on at the camp. I heard that your Warchief Garrosh was lookin\' around the Vale o\' Eternal Blossoms.', '', 70466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We meet again. You havin\' a good day now?', '', 70465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck out there.', '', 70464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, looks like we\'re here!', '', 70463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, if you say so.', 'As long as you\'ve got my back...', 70462, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He looked real important. Tak-Tak try to chitchatter with \'im, but he jus\' stared at me so I shut my jabber real quick.', '', 70461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You know, big brown guy was lookin\' for a trip up north earlier. Some Garrod... err... Ganosh... err... anyway, I didn\'t get his name.', '', 70460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did all of that? You bammin\'!', '', 70459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not safe here anymore. You need to evacuate Dalaran.', 'It\'s not safe here anymore. You need to evacuate Dalaran.', 70458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They said Lady Proudmoore wanted us out. I... I don\'t understand.', 'They said Lady Proudmoore wanted us out. I... I don\'t understand.', 70457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have the Silver Covenant lost their mind? Surely the Kirin Tor won\'t stand for this!', 'Have the Silver Covenant lost their mind? Surely the Kirin Tor won\'t stand for this!', 70456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There I was, minding my own business, enjoying a nice game of cards when these Silver Covenant... slugs came around telling us to hand over our belongings. What gives?', 'There I was, minding my own business, enjoying a nice game of cards when these Silver Covenant... slugs came around telling us to hand over our belongings. What gives?', 70455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait an ookin\' jibbet! Are you the wikket dat cleared the beach of jerb-derkin\' Alliance slicky-siders?', '', 70454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya! I\'m Tak-Tak. I\'ll take you to the Vale now, just like the big green guy over there told me to.', '', 70453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is all this nonsense about a\"purge?\"', 'What is all this nonsense about a\"purge?\"', 70452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard shouting through the pipes - what\'s happening?', 'I heard shouting through the pipes - what\'s happening?', 70451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe this? These Silver Covenant goons are trying to shake us down.', 'Can you believe this? These Silver Covenant goons are trying to shake us down.', 70450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll stay out of this if you know what\'s good for you.', 'You\'ll stay out of this if you know what\'s good for you.', 70449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along. This doesn\'t concern you.', 'Move along. This doesn\'t concern you.', 70448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this!', '', 70441, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Daggin will follow you.)|r', 'Fight with us. |cFF0008E8(Daggin will follow you.)|r', 70440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some day we\'re havin\', eh?\n\nMe poor gryphons...', '', 70439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_massdispel.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:132275|h[Obliteration]|h|r killed you. Move out of the energy vortex before it deactivates.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_massdispel.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:132275|h[Obliteration]|h|r killed you. Move out of the energy vortex before it deactivates.', 70437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a winner!  $n has won THIRD PLACE in the tournament!', '', 70436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a winner!  $n has won SECOND PLACE in the tournament!', '', 70435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another challenge?', 'Another challenge?', 70433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you honestly believe you can defeat me?', 'Do you honestly believe you can defeat me?', 70432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It just so happens that Mishi returned it to me. You should be more careful! This artifact is a rare one of a kind piece.', '', 70431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet us west of the temple, $rt. We shall require your aid.', 70429, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This smells like a trap, but we have no time to lose. Let\'s go!', '', 70428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come children. May Elune guide our deeds this day.', 70427, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are to surround the temple with defenses. Can your druids help?', 'We are to surround the temple with defenses. Can your druids help?', 70425, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, friend.', 70424, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varian sent me to keep an eye on the temple while you finish building the defense.\n\nHave a little patience and don\'t approach the temple until Varian gives the word.', 70423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not incite violence on my temple grounds, $p. Be patient.', 'Do not incite violence on my temple grounds, $p. Be patient.', 70422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Some insult about how the Alliance is weak and boast about how Garrosh is awesome.', '', 70421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll send for my hozen friends, the mallet must be made anew.', '', 70420, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If \"Garrosh\" has the bell than there is only one thing to do,', '', 70419, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Combined with evil\'s ointment, the bell\'s evil can be undone.', '', 70418, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The head, the handle, these two must be made as one.', '', 70417, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disguised as \"nifty nibs\", never to fall into mogu hands.', '', 70416, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Hozen took the pieces and scattered them across the lands,', '', 70415, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Monkey King broke the mallet and sent the pieces afar.', '', 70414, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu are not bright, they fail to see things for what they are.', '', 70413, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think of the horror if those dookers stole the mallet too.', '', 70412, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu had stolen the bell, what is a hozen to do?', '', 70411, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the ookin\' bell it was meant for could never be mine.', '', 70410, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There once was a jibby nib mallet all shiny and divine.', '', 70409, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the portal!', '', 70408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... YOU must die!', '', 70407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You chose your warchief over the Kirin-Tor.', 70406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you think your actions would have no consequence?', 70405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dalaran is a better place without your kind.', 70404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You had your chance to run.', 70403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You brought this on yourselves, Sunreavers.', 70402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin Tor will not tolerate insurrection.', 70401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be silenced, Sunreaver!', 70400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor Chief Ingoo Ingoo. His family forget what rod was for. He so mad.$b$bIf he keeps, he will corrupt his people. Very sad.', '', 70399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is of the essence, $n. Proveditor Grantley may be able to help you get back to Stormwind. Of course, everything has a price.', '', 70398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that is the real Monkey King.', 'But that is the real Monkey King.', 70397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Monkey King no take rod! You no take rod! This not even real Monkey King.$b$bChief Ingoo Ingoo have rod from father Ingoo Ingoo, and his father before him, and his father before him.$b$bMonkey King give rod to my family in long long ago time. My family becomes chiefs.$b$bNo hozen live that long! None!', '', 70396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOUD NOISES!', '', 70395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did that story go again?', 'How did that story go again?', 70394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I strike from the shadows!', 70393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will die here, by my blade!', 70392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Denizens of the sky, attack!', 70391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My death... means... nothing. The Divine Bell is already in Darnassus. You filthy Horde... will never... have it!', 70390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well. I will face you myself. This is for the Alliance!', 70389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arg! My archers should have stopped you! Sentinels! Now!', 70388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde. It\'s a shame you were so slow to get here. The Divine Bell is already ours. Rangers! STRIKE!', 70387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take it somewhere safe. Sentinels! Let\'s get to work.', 70386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that thing? No matter. We will strike down any who stand in our way.', 70385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it is, hero! The Divine Bell!', 70384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay vigilant, hero. This place has been sealed for centuries. Who knows what we will encounter within.', 70383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, General Twinbraid is dead? He was a pivotal figure in the Alliance push through Southern Barrens. Impressive work.', '', 70382, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 34560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, champion of the Horde! How fares the battle along the coast?', '', 70381, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 34559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you killed him? Bloodhilt served the Horde in Southern Barrens. You\'ve avenged a great many lives today, champion.', '', 70380, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 34558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, hero of the Alliance! How fares the battle along the coast?', '', 70379, 0, 0, 6, 69, 0, 34557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to make sure that you are properly equipped for the trials ahead.', '', 70378, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions in the coming weeks will come to define your people.', '', 70377, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU are the soul of the Horde.', '', 70376, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts on Pandaria\'s southern shores and elsewhere have given me my answer.', '', 70375, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I asked you: Who is the soul of the Horde?', '', 70374, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We spoke of your Warchief. His inner conflicts and his outer conquests.', '', 70373, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you recall our earlier conversation?', '', 70372, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause.', '', 70371, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay vigilant, hero. The return of the Thunder King is both a threat... and an opportunity!', '', 70370, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 34601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose your reward!', '', 70369, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like you, I continue to refine my skills here in Pandaria. I think you will appreciate the outcome.', '', 70368, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dedication to your cause deserves to be rewarded.', '', 70367, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tong: fetch my things!', '', 70366, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But with heroes like you in his pack, there is little your Alliance cannot accomplish.', '', 70365, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His journey is long. He has only taken the first steps.', '', 70364, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your King is calling his pack to him, assembling an Alliance in the truest sense of the word.', '', 70363, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wolves are pack animals.', '', 70362, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Having seen him in action, I now know what that means.', '', 70361, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true: he has the spirit of the wolf. And he fights like a wolf.', '', 70360, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We discussed the merits of your High King. I have been observing him closely.', '', 70359, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you recall our earlier conversation?', '', 70358, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause.', '', 70357, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prove to me that your Horde is worthy of ruling over Azeroth.', '', 70356, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what your Horde is made of, Champion!', '', 70355, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find the answers here in Pandaria.', '', 70354, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is my question to you: What is the SOUL of the Horde?', '', 70353, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or is it an alliance of convenience, a confederacy of unlikely partners free to pursue their own agendas?', '', 70352, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it a refuge for those who need shelter, a commonwealth of the downtrodden, built for mutual support?', '', 70351, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it an instrument of vengeance, hellbent to carve out a future for its people?', '', 70350, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What IS the Horde?', '', 70349, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Horde finds itself at a turning point. This war will define you.', '', 70348, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A warrior like Garrosh comes to power with something to prove.', '', 70347, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand you, Garrosh. I know what it is like to bear the weight of your father\'s deeds.', '', 70346, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On Draenor, he was a miserable wretch. The actions of his father hung heavy on his heart.', '', 70345, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He did not always command such power.', '', 70344, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh Hellscream! Warchief of the Horde.', '', 70343, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if your Alliance has what it takes to rule Azeroth.', '', 70342, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see what he is truly made of.', '', 70341, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make no mistake. Pandaria will challenge your King.', '', 70340, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s the bigger question: Can principles win a war?', '', 70339, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this because he is weak...? Or because he is principled?', '', 70338, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varian Wrynn didn\'t use the disaster to gain a military advantage.', '', 70337, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde soldiers thundered across the realm in the wake of the devastation.', '', 70336, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think about it! His enemies took advantage of my father\'s Cataclysm.', '', 70335, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He IS a fighter. But... is he a leader?', '', 70334, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, he earned the name \"Lo\'Gosh,\" or \"Ghost Wolf.\"', '', 70333, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffering from amnesia, he fought for his life in Horde arenas.', '', 70332, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know, he was once a gladiator? Oh yes, I\'ve been doing my research.', '', 70331, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The High King. Varian Wrynn - Leader of the Alliance.', '', 70330, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tong! Something to eat, please.', '', 70329, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_thunderking_thunderstruck.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:135096|h[Thunderstruck]|h|r! Run!', '', 70328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine Bell means a great deal to the Horde.$b$bThe Warchief is counting on us.', '', 70327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, an end to the horror...', '', 70326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spirit leaves this cursed place at last...', '', 70325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trapped here... forever... am I... free at last?', '', 70324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, an end to the suffering...', '', 70323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light... what is this light? Bless you...', '', 70322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... could only see darkness... Thank you.', '', 70321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this your best?', '', 70320, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 70319, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowards!', '', 70318, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am done with you!', '', 70317, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Alliance is WEAK!', '', 70316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this how you fight your battles?', '', 70315, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the warchief!', '', 70314, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring up the grunts. Attack!', '', 70313, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance dogs! Where are your teeth?', '', 70312, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This day brings victory, but more difficult trials lie ahead...', '', 70311, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A sword is the weapon of a warrior, but patience is the weapon of kings.', '', 70310, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A test! A trial of patience. Will the wolf behave as a warrior... or a King?', '', 70309, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see that now. Our strength is yours to command, High King. May this be the first of many victories.', 70308, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 34280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would have charged right in. Many more lives would have been lost in my rush for victory.', 70307, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 34279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our fortifications are ready.', 70306, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They mock us from within the temple.', 70305, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do we not attack them outright?', 70304, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are being tentative, Varian. You must be decisive if you wish to lead the Alliance.', 70303, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are wasting time. We should move in for the kill!', 70302, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are wasting precious time.', 70301, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 34292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All the more reason to purify it.', 70300, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 34291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have them cornered inside the temple. We should strike now!', 70299, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 0, 34290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just need to stand together. You have to trust me. Know that I will do the right thing. If we act as one, we cannot fail.', '', 70298, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande, I may not be a politician. But I am a fighter. I know we can win this war.', '', 70297, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From now on, we define the terms of the engagement.', '', 70296, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was a time where I would have done the same. But I\'ve learned a lot over the years. I\'ve fallen for too many of Garrosh\'s tricks.', '', 70295, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day is ours! And not a drop of blood was shed on holy ground.', '', 70294, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34655, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A total victory! Thanks to your resourcefulness and efficiency, we didn\'t lose a single soul. Accept this reward, along with my sincere gratitude.', '', 70293, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good work! Our defenses held with minimal casualties. Please accept this reward for your outstanding effort.', '', 70292, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While we mourn the fallen, many more would be lost if not for your efforts. Please accept this gift of gratitude from the Alliance.', '', 70291, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was a costly victory, but it could have been much worse. You have earned this reward.', '', 70290, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Predictable. Fall back behind the lines - let them come!', '', 70289, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no army here. Only a handful of heroes stand between you and the King of Stormwind. Are you afraid?', '', 70288, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come out and count them, coward!', '', 70287, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re coming. Get behind the defenses!', '', 70286, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work! Let\'s see what these pandaren homesteaders are capable of.', '', 70285, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, gnomish ingenuity! The Horde won\'t know what hit \'em.', '', 70284, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see our jinyu allies are prepared. How go the rest of the preparations?', '', 70283, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good sturdy dwarven construction. That oughta do some damage.', '', 70282, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. The plan is coming together.', '', 70281, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. That means they\'re about to break.', '', 70280, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t throw away Alliance lives. I will accept nothing less than total victory.', '', 70279, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Tyrande. We\'ll have our victory, but we\'re not going in unprepared.', '', 70278, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Tyrande.', '', 70277, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make use of every resource! Leave them nowhere to run!', '', 70276, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep working! We\'ll win on our terms.', '', 70275, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This terrain is ours. Make them pay for every inch.', '', 70274, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t charge in. Let them make the first mistake.', '', 70273, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Force them into bottlenecks. Let them think they can win...', '', 70272, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re almost ready. Keep on working!', '', 70271, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to support one another. They\'ll target any weakness.', '', 70270, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the terrain to our advantage.', '', 70269, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those defenses ready.', '', 70268, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand your ground! Wait \'em out.', '', 70267, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready our defenses. They have to come out eventually.', '', 70266, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from the temple doors, you\'re playing into their hands.', '', 70265, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back! Don\'t let them lure you in.', '', 70264, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You three are my eyes and ears. Fan out! Prepare a defense!', '', 70263, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 34690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re defending a fixed position. I\'m not going to play their game. We\'ll draw them out.', '', 70262, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 34689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are rarely what they seem, Tyrande. And my son tells me this is a sacred place.', '', 70261, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 34688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin-Tor has a legacy of abuse. Kel\'thuzad turned his knowledge of the arcane arts toward Necromancy.', 70258, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fluffy wikkets stole the mallet head! Kunzen hozen lost it many years ago. Now the fluffy wikkets hide inside their lair and worship the head like it some kind of fancy shmancy carrot.$b$bBe careful, those fluffy wikkets bite hard.', '', 70257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So ye want me to go join the Alliance front in this... Pandaria... eh?', '', 70256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I get you something to drink?', 70255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is not nearly enough dancing in this club!', '', 70254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something about watching people fight to the death really warms my heart!', 70253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t a girl just get a drink without being hassled?', 70252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Took you long enough!', 70251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time you showed up with this!', 70250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be ridiculous. Of course it\'s my drink!', 70249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at me! Do I look like I would order that?!', 70248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The audacity!', 70247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get that out of here before you spill it on me!', 70246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know the service down here just keeps getting worse and worse!', '', 70245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am offended that you would think that belongs to me!', '', 70244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yuck! That looks disgusting!', '', 70243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I can really get this party started!', '', 70242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that is a sight for sore eyes!', '', 70241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time! I\'m parched over here!', '', 70240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who else would this belong to? What\'s that funny look for? You look like I was about to hit you!', 70239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course it\'s my drink! I invented this ya know!', 70238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally! I thought I was never going to get my drink!', 70237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who do you think you are?! The nerve!', 70236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How dare you!', 70235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why in the world would I order that?!', 70234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does this drink belong to you?', 'Does this drink belong to you?', 70233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You didn\'t happen to order a Rusty Dagger did you?', 'You didn\'t happen to order a Rusty Dagger did you?', 70232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this your drink order?', 'Is this your drink order?', 70231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assemble the Mallet.', 'Assemble the Mallet.', 70230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got this! Give me the last clue.', 'I got this! Give me the last clue.', 70228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is easy! I\'m ready for the next clue.', 'This is easy! I\'m ready for the next clue.', 70227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, hit me with another clue!', 'Ok, hit me with another clue!', 70226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for the first clue.', 'I\'m ready for the first clue.', 70225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This guest wears a memento of a love lost. I guess it\'s true what they say; every love story has its thorns, just like every night has its dawn.', 70224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They say the eyes are the window to the soul. If that\'s the case, I\'m guessing this guest and their soul have something to hide.', 70223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s best not to get on the bad side of those that prepare your food. However, I\'m not sure this patron has anything but a bad side...', 70222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sparkly!', '', 70221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monkey King is a big big wikket!', '', 70220, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no king! Chief Ingoo Ingoo not vote for you!', '', 70219, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Stop playing! Stop! Stop! Stop!', '', 70218, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more brew! Remember last time with Captain Ook? Want that to happen again?', '', 70217, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monkey King is not in charge! Chief Ingoo Ingoo in charge! Listen to the Chief!', '', 70216, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No singing!', '', 70215, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Stop partying! This not the real Monkey King! Monkey King die long long long long long long long time ago!', '', 70214, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! No no no! No more party! This still Ingoo Ingoo\'s village!', '', 70213, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Silly wikket cannot take the hozen mighty rod!', '', 70212, 0, 19980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In pieces three the mallet be. Handle, head and ointment. You ring the bell without the mallet? You going to get an ear and face full of evil.', '', 70211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okee dokee! Let\'s see what you got.', '', 70210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Didn\'t expect to see me here did you? The Monkey King does not delegate duelery! Now, are you hero? Or are you wikket?', '', 70208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p - good work. Without your assistance, I\'m afraid this whole business would have ended quite nastily.', '', 70207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll be handing him over to Hellscream once he\'s had some time to cool off. Can\'t have him destroying our prize, can we?', '', 70206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright everyone. Make preparations to take the prisoner back to the Vale. We\'ll be handing him over to Hellscream once he\'s had some time to cool off.', '', 70205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Debug Error: Spell Failed. Bug This!', '', 70204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s impulsive, but we\'ll get results. He\'ll see our way is right.', '', 70203, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... that was interesting. Let\'s go meet with Lor\'themar back outside.', '', 70202, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is our only way to find the bell. We WILL make him talk. Give us time.', '', 70201, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you the agent that is following Connelly?', 'Are you the agent that is following Connelly?', 70200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhhhh! You\'ll blow my cover!', 70199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck with your interrogation.', '', 70198, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disrespect me again, and I\'ll have your head on a pike outside the gates of Orgrimmar.', '', 70197, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('But, elf...', '', 70196, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whether he talks or not, I\'ll tear this continent to pieces if it means I find what I seek... if it means glory for the Horde.', '', 70195, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Very well. He is yours, Blood Elf.', '', 70194, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t see my people die at Mogujia to have you snuff out our only remaining avenue to the Bell.', '', 70193, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elf! What is this treachery?!', '', 70192, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh! Stay your hand!', '', 70191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. You\'ve made your choice, mogu. Now, you die...', '', 70190, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graaagh!', '', 70189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could you hope... <cough>... to control the Bell?', '', 70188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough>... you are impudent, impatient, childish. You cannot even... control yourself, your own fear... your own rage.', '', 70187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bell... speaks with the voice of the gods...', '', 70186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha... <cough>... the Divine Bell... what could you hope to do with it?', '', 70185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Iiiiiiiiii\'m back Wikkets!', '', 70184, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Ahem* Many greetings to you, traveler!', '', 70183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Jaina warms to you immediately.>$b$bA kindred soul! Thank you, $p, for your honesty. You seem to understand my struggle. Every day, the hard decisions. Every night... the nightmares.$b$bBut I have a responsibility to preserve the Kirin Tor. I\'m glad you\'re with me on this. The King would never see it this way. Do you think we can explain it to Anduin?', 70182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! A very bold decision in times like these. Your honesty is refreshing!$b$bTell me, leader of the Kirin Tor, what if the Horde killed your friends? Your family? Destroyed everything you had. Could you maintain your convictions even then, Archmage $p?', 70181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Jaina smiles.>$b$bIf only we all shared your strength and conviction! To be honest, I struggle. Every. Day.$b$bBut you are right. The Kirin Tor is bigger than you, me, Alliance or Horde. I have a responsibility to preserve it, and to use its powers wisely.$b$bYou and I seem to agree. I doubt the King sees it that way. But... do you think we can convince Anduin?', 70180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would struggle to maintain our neutrality.', 'I would struggle to maintain our neutrality.', 70179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Jaina brushes her hair from her eyes, deep in thought.>$b$bYou\'re so passionate for your cause and clear in your convictions. Believe me when I say that the Sunreavers are the same. The Horde is their family.$b$bNot all of them support Garrosh. But they\'re not about to abandon their own people... I couldn\'t ask them to do so without tearing the Kirin Tor apart.$b$bThe Kirin Tor is sacred to me. We need to stay united.', 70178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not if they renounced the Horde.', 'Not if they renounced the Horde.', 70177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You WILL, or I will shove my boot down your throat!', '', 70176, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure?', 'Are you sure?', 70175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Jaina\'s eyes grow sad.>$b$bSo... you would purge the city? Cast the Sunreavers from their homes? The very same Sunreavers who helped humans discover magic in the first place?$b$bYou and I are obviously very different. I suppose I see my role - and the mission of the Kirin Tor - a little differently. My mind is set. Would you like to hear what I think?', 70174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Horde is Horde.', 'Yes. Horde is Horde.', 70173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spoken like a stalwart Alliance $c! Believe me, I understand the sentiment.$b$bNow then, as leader of the Kirin Tor and a faithful part of the Alliance, what would you do about the Sunreavers? True, they are advocates of the Horde. But they have been allies and productive members of the Kirin Tor for over 2000 years. This city is their home.$b$BWould you expel them?', 70172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... will tell you... nothing.', '', 70171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha... <cough>... you young races... so impatient, petulant. Orc... you cannot even control yourself... your own rage, your own fear.', '', 70170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Varian sent you as well? I\'m outnumbered in my own city!$b$b<Jaina\'s eyes flash mischievously.>$b$bLet\'s go about this a different way. Put yourself in my shoes. Imagine that YOU are the leader of the Kirin Tor. $p! The most influential archmage in all of Azeroth!$b$bWhat would YOU do?', 70169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is the Divine Bell?!', '', 70168, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will bathe in your blood!', '', 70167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander Scargash is filled with rage! Avoid his melee attacks!', '', 70166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... if you value your life, scum, you\'ll tell me what I need to know.', '', 70165, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic! You and your mogu are nothing to the might of the Horde!', '', 70164, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, the Korune spellweavers laid claim to their instrument and hid it away. Since then, the Bell has been lost to history.', '', 70163, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eventually, the Thunder King fell, and the Bell changed hands. Many tried to use its power. Some tried to silence its sound. All failed.', '', 70162, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awed by its power, the Thunder King described the instrument as \"the voice of the gods,\" and named it the Divine Bell.', '', 70161, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bell\'s screaming voice struck fear and doubt into the hearts of the Emperor\'s enemies, sending them fleeing in his path.', '', 70160, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It fueled their hatred and anger, lending them strength on the field of battle.', '', 70159, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taken to war, the bell\'s cacophonous tones stirred the hearts of Lei Shen\'s warriors.', '', 70158, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
