('Hmm... you\'re second in line. Won\'t be long now.', '', 70025, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, you\'re next. Unless someone cuts in front of you, that is.', '', 70024, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are not some mind controlled savages you are dealing with. To defy Hellscream is to defy the greatest orcs of the Horde!', '', 70023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream will find out about this!', 'Hellscream will find out about this!', 70022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you forgotten what it means to be an orc?! We are the blood of the Horde! Not these island beggars.', 'Have you forgotten what it means to be an orc?! We are the blood of the Horde! Not these island beggars.', 70019, 1, 7274, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These trolls cannot continue to defy the Warchief! They must be dealt with.', 'These trolls cannot continue to defy the Warchief! They must be dealt with.', 70017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitor. You are a disgrace to your race.', 'Traitor. You are a disgrace to your race.', 70016, 1, 7274, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the carousel.', 'You need a Darkmoon Ride Ticket to use the carousel.', 70015, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grizzle has given you a portable flamethrower!  Use it on the saurok eggs nearby.', '', 70014, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A nearby group of Darkhatched Eggs begins to hatch!', '', 70013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Darkhatched Sorcerer has put the boat into Stasis!  Kill it to interrupt the spell.', '', 70012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do me this courtesy, $p, and do not share with Garrosh what has transpired here today. I could confront him directly, but I see now not all orcs share my view of the Horde.$b$bWho am I to command their allegiance if I must become another dictator to do so?$b$bWhat I can do is aid the Darkspear in fortifying their home while their heroes are abroad for the war. When Vol\'jin returns, we will plan our next move.', '', 70011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be wantin\' our land? We gonna bury you here.', 'You be wantin\' our land? We gonna bury you here.', 70010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda\' left when ya had the chance.', 'Shoulda\' left when ya had the chance.', 70009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not be so tough from the dead now are ya?', 'Ya not be so tough from the dead now are ya?', 70008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show ya how to use your own weapon, mon.', 'Let me show ya how to use your own weapon, mon.', 70007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not be needin\' dis weapon again now are ya?', 'Ya not be needin\' dis weapon again now are ya?', 70006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, my lord.', 70005, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another mission with Aenea? If I must.', '', 70004, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orestes! Aenea! You are to accompany $p on his mission.', '', 70003, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in trading up your pet battle-stones?', 'Interested in trading up your pet battle-stones?', 70002, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The things I do for the Alliance...', '', 70001, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will harm no more sons or daughters of the Horde. Your purpose has been corrupted.', '', 69997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is changing! Vol\'jin refused to change with it, and he\'s poisoned his people.', '', 69995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How... many... of your own people must you kill... so you can have \"your\" Horde back?', '', 69994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us use persuasion, not force. I have here a cask of pandaren Memory Wine. It will allow us to see into Shan Kien\'s past.', '', 69991, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not the only ones who bleed for dah Horde ya orcs!', 'Ya not the only ones who bleed for dah Horde ya orcs!', 69990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who you be to challenge our loyalty?', 'Who you be to challenge our loyalty?', 69989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Warchief not be in his right mind.', 'Da Warchief not be in his right mind.', 69988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya not be welcome here!', 'Ya not be welcome here!', 69987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where be Vol\'jin?', 'Where be Vol\'jin?', 69986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why ya be doin\' dis? We all part o\' dah Horde.', 'Why ya be doin\' dis? We all part o\' dah Horde.', 69985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be our home! You ain\'t welcome here, Kor\'kron.', 'Dis be our home! You ain\'t welcome here, Kor\'kron.', 69984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ain\'t got dah right to keep us captive!', 'You ain\'t got dah right to keep us captive!', 69983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By order of the Warchief this \"city\" is now under Martial Law. Any who refuse the will of the Warchief shall be branded as traitors!', '', 69982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! The fight\'s goin\', no more guesses!', '', 69981, 0, 46036, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, who\'s in?', '', 69980, 0, 46036, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t gonna support you if you ain\'t brawlin\' yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", chief.\n\nGo talk to one of them guards and tell \'em you wanna fight. Then we can play.', '', 69979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?\n\nAin\'t nothin\' shady going on here, no $gsir:ma\'am;. Just enjoying a little friendly bloodsport, without ANY gold changing hands. Everything here\'s on the up-and-up!', '', 69978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, you in?$b$bQuick quick, who d\'ya think\'s gonna win this one, bucko?', '', 69977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why ya be doin\' this? We be loyal to da Horde!', 'Why ya be doin\' this? We be loyal to da Horde!', 69976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis\' be our home, mon. If ya be tinkin\' we goin\' quietly ya mistaken.', 'Dis\' be our home, mon. If ya be tinkin\' we goin\' quietly ya mistaken.', 69975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be lettin\' us outta here now!', 'Ya be lettin\' us outta here now!', 69974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu are imperious, arrogant, and powerful - all characteristics that will send Garrosh into a rage when he arrives. \n\nThis is why it is critical that we capture and interrogate the leader of these mogu before that happens.', '', 69973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, my good $gsir:lady;. Who do you predict will win the next fight?', '', 69972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to take your guesses if you aren\'t participating in the brawl yourself. You need \"skin in the game\", if you will.\n\nGo talk to one of the guards and queue for the brawl. Then we can play.', '', 69971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_MONSTERCLAW_04.BLP:32:32:0:0|tThe monster.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_MISC_MONSTERCLAW_04.BLP:32:32:0:0|tThe monster.', 69970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_SWORD_04.BLP:32:32:0:0|tThe hero.', '|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_SWORD_04.BLP:32:32:0:0|tThe hero.', 69969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?\n\nI can assure you that everything here is perfectly legitimate, good $gsir:ma\'am;. We are just a pair of wealthy entrepreneurs enjoying a little friendly bloodsport, without ANY gold changing hands.', '', 69968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it! No more wagers! Let\'s see what happens!', '', 69967, 0, 47751, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will now accept your guesses and wagers on the victor of the match.', '', 69966, 0, 47751, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet down, everyone... we don\'t want to make it angry. Just gaze in silent awe at Unguloxx, the murderaffe!', '', 69965, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear... I\'m sorry, but it looks like you\'re going to have to fight Proboskus.', '', 69964, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. That\'s actually some pretty good engineering down there. It\'s Disruptron time!', '', 69963, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is what I\'m talking about! More dinosaurs, please! It\'s King Kulaka!!', '', 69962, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: The Dark Summoner. Wow, he doesn\'t even have a real name. Spooky!', '', 69961, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!', '', 69960, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And in the other corner, we have... a big cloud of scary floating eyes? This doesn\'t look good.', '', 69959, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff! Look at those GREAT shoulderpads!', '', 69958, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready to dance! Deeken\'s in the house!', '', 69957, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!', '', 69956, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a special guest today: the always-endearing, ever-resilient, Millhouse Manastorm! Good luck, MillMan!', '', 69955, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Everybody\'s favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?', '', 69954, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some of you veterans might remember this guy. He may be Broken, but today, he means to break you! It\'s Akama!', '', 69953, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We spent days trying to find this one in Sholazar Basin. Welcome to the jungle! It\'s Mazhareen!', '', 69952, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Up next, it\'s Millie Watt! I used to date her in engineering school!', '', 69951, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I see her smile, it makes me smile. When she casts a spell, it puts a spell on me. When I see her horns, it makes me feel... intrigued. It\'s Dominika!', '', 69950, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Kirrawk, wind-wielding arakkoa of the Terokkar Forest!', '', 69949, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And in this corner! He\'s angry. He\'s deadly. He\'s a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it\'s Crush!', '', 69948, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his special surprise!', '', 69947, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. From the looks of him, somebody mostly killed him already. It\'s Ixx!', '', 69946, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From deep within the bowels of Blackrock Mountain, it\'s Sanoriak, master of flame!', '', 69945, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll peck your eyes out if you give him a chance. It\'s Dippy!', '', 69944, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the other corner... a disgusting green pile of goblin idiocy, riding on a lumbering chariot of shame. It\'s Fran and Riddoh! Everybody boo!', '', 69943, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Battletron! This hunk o\' junk is just waiting to explode all over you!', '', 69942, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The opposition includes some of Gnomeregan\'s finest... although they\'ve all seen better days. It\'s the leper gnome quintet!', '', 69941, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey hey! Look what we\'ve scooped up for you today... it\'s Blat!', '', 69940, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, wrap me in leather and tug my leash: it\'s Dungeon Master Vishas!', '', 69939, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Goredome! He WILL attempt to gore you. With his dome.', '', 69938, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!', '', 69937, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Also entering the arena: Bruce, a crocolisk that we found!', '', 69936, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be hearing from my lawyer!', '', 69935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Better luck next time! BWAHAHAHAH!', '', 69934, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice try, sweet cheeks.', '', 69933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a little something something you\'re gonna love...', '', 69932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one laughs behind the great Millhouse Manastorm\'s back and lives to tell the tale!', '', 69931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard the rumors and the jokes...', '', 69930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stonecore was merely a setback!', '', 69929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have learned how to make an ancient pandaren tincture that will allow us to see into Shan Kien\'s past. We have but to gather the elements for this brew.', '', 69928, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak, then!', '', 69927, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh, please. There may be another way. One that requires no bloodshed.', '', 69926, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ishi, draw your blade. A few carefully delivered cuts will change his mind.', '', 69925, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill me if you must, but I owe no allegiance to you or your Horde. The only master I serve is the Thunder King.', '', 69924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am losing patience, Shan Kien. Tell me where I can find the Divine Bell!', '', 69923, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Brownstone and his crew have fallen asleep!', 'Master Brownstone and his crew have fallen asleep!', 69922, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. Now I will just add a hair from our prisoner, Shan Kien, and combine the ingredients.', '', 69921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! The female yak bleats at you peacefully.', 'Success! The female yak bleats at you peacefully.', 69920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, why? You interrupted the most pleasant dream...', '', 69919, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! Look at what you\'ve done to my fur!', '', 69918, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, just a power-nap. All ready to go now!', '', 69917, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This yak was male! The angry yak turns on you!', 'This yak was male! The angry yak turns on you!', 69916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oof, I was... just listening to the ground - you know, for signs of enemies approaching. We seem to be safe... for the moment.', '', 69915, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, many thanks, friend. I needed that.', '', 69914, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha? Huh? Oh, yes. The defenses...', '', 69913, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come and face me, $p!', 69912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now is not the time for this, $p. Leave me in peace.', 69911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, $p. Prove yourself to me and I will aid you in your fight.', 69909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have to help us, Nove!', 'You have to help us, Nove!', 69908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is not my fight, $p.', 69907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde are attacking, Nove!', 'The Horde are attacking, Nove!', 69906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing lasts forever, $p', 69905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is OUR Horde!', '', 69904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall not stand in our way!', '', 69903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has no room for such weakness.', '', 69902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These trolls need to learn their place.', 'These trolls need to learn their place.', 69901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Traitor!', 'Traitor!', 69900, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re routing out the traitors. Looks like we\'ve found another...', 'We\'re routing out the traitors. Looks like we\'ve found another...', 69899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare defy the Warchief?!', 'You dare defy the Warchief?!', 69898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Never again!', '', 69897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n wins! $n wins!', '$n wins! $n wins!', 69896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep \'em comin\', $n.', 'Keep \'em comin\', $n.', 69895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh ha ha ha! So much blood! Nice.', 'Ahhh ha ha ha! So much blood! Nice.', 69894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wanna make an omelet, you\'re gonna have to break a few eggs.', 'You wanna make an omelet, you\'re gonna have to break a few eggs.', 69893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honestly, $n... were you even trying?', 'Honestly, $n... were you even trying?', 69892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, $n. Now would you kindly remove your corpse so that the others can have a go?', 'Sorry, $n. Now would you kindly remove your corpse so that the others can have a go?', 69891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brilliant victory, $n! Now get back in line.', 'Brilliant victory, $n! Now get back in line.', 69890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$gHis:Her; name was $n.', '$gHis:Her; name was $n.', 69889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s wrong, $n? Afraid to fight? Come on, let\'s keep this arena moving!', 69884, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me a minute, I want to finish watching this fight.', 'Give me a minute, I want to finish watching this fight.', 69883, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, scrub! You interested in a fight?', '', 69882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing the Tushui Pandaren!', '', 69881, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing Gilneas!', '', 69880, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing the Exodar!', '', 69879, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing Darnassus!', '', 69878, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing Gnomeregan!', '', 69877, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing Ironforge!', '', 69876, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is representing Stormwind!', '', 69875, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet down, everyone... we don\'t want to make it angry. Just gaze in silent awe at Unguloxx, the murderaffe!', 69874, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha ha ha! What bad luck you have! It\'s Proboskus! Ahhh ha ha ha! I\'ve got twenty five gold that says you die in the fire!', 69873, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. That\'s actually some pretty good engineering down there. It\'s Disruptron time!', 69872, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now this is what I\'m talking about! More dinosaurs, please! It\'s King Kulaka!!', 69871, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also entering the arena: The Dark Summoner. Wow, he doesn\'t even have a real name. Spooky!', 69870, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!', 69869, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And in the other corner, we have the many eyes of Zen\'shar! What\'s next, a fighting nose?', 69868, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff!', 69867, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get ready to dance! Deeken\'s in the house!', 69866, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!', 69865, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! Another gnome? Apparently this one calls himself Millhouse Manastorm. Get out there and kill him!', 69864, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also entering the arena: Everybody\'s favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?', 69863, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some of you veterans might remember this fella\'. Sure, he\'s broken, but he means to break you! It\'s Akama!', 69862, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We spent days trying to find this one in Sholazar Basin. Welcome to the jungle! It\'s Mazhareen!', 69861, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Up next, probably the weakest, ugliest, and least genius combatant I\'ve ever seen. It\'s the stupid, smelly gnome, Millie Watt! Everybody boo!', 69860, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, she\'s wearing a dress, and her knees bend the wrong way, but that doesn\'t mean she can\'t walk all over you. It\'s Dominika!', 69859, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And in this corner! He\'s angry. He\'s deadly. He\'s a little bit adorable. Straight out of Neverest, it\'s Crush!', 69858, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also entering the arena: Destructobyte... and his ridiculous gnomish holographic machinery!', 69857, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We found this one scuttling in circles in Silithus. Looks like somebody mostly killed him already. It\'s Ixx!', 69856, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We also welcome everybody\'s favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!', 69855, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the other corner... hey look! It\'s my buddy, Fran! And he brought his mount with him!', 69854, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also entering the arena: Battletron! Sure, it\'s not goblin-engineered... but it still might kill you!', 69853, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Five on one hardly seems fair, but come on... they\'re half-dead gnomes. It\'s the leper gnome quintet!', 69852, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey hey! Look what we\'ve scooped up for you today... it\'s Blat!', 69851, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We also welcome our pain-packing crowd favorite: Dungeon Master Vishas!', 69850, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Also entering the arena: Goredome! So-named because he will gore you. With his dome.', 69849, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!', 69848, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is worse than I suspected.', '', 69847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall, we no longer answer to you. We have a new Warchief now. And he has reminded us that we are STRONG!', '', 69846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take as long as you need, Go\'el. If Vol\'jin believes his people are in danger then you had best aid them as you can.', 69845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready.', 'Ready.', 69844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a good thing to spend time in a place like this. We must always remember what it is we struggle so hard to protect.', '', 69843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you can\'t choose a side?', 'Are you sure you can\'t choose a side?', 69842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU GOT SMASHED!', '', 69841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I SMASH. YOU DIE. DEAL WITH IT!', '', 69840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THESE SHOULDERS... SO HEAVY...', '', 69839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOBLIN DID NOTHING TO YOU.  YOU ARE JERK!', '', 69838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I GO GET ANOTHER AFTER I STOMP YOU!', '', 69837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GOBLIN WAS NOT LUCKY AT ALL!', '', 69836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SMASH MY GOOD LUCK? I SMASH YOU!', '', 69835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we are in the land down under.$b$bIt is just as beautiful as the stories I was told as a cub on the Wandering Isle. Though the fish could be larger.', '', 69834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm yourself, Ishi. The Lord Regent may speak his mind.', '', 69833, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold your tongue, blood elf! You dare question our Warchief\'s judgment?', '', 69832, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, we should discuss matters back in Krasarang. For now, thank you for your help. There is a portal that can return you to Lion\'s Landing whenever you choose.', '', 69831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would commit our order to an Alliance victory!', 'I would commit our order to an Alliance victory!', 69830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And did the good King Varian send you as well to bid for our aid?', 69829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An honorable meeting, $c. I have heard rumblings from my brothers here on Pandaria. Dark rumblings of dissent, and worry.$B$BI have come myself to support the Horde\'s efforts, but also... to make sure that things don\'t get too out of hand.', '', 69828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eye of the Storm... countless battles have been fought just to find that artifact. I know not why Xi\'ri entrusted it to your care, $c... but be warned... no one has wielded its power without paying a greater price.', '', 69826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons are no longer attacking... what happened here?!', '', 69825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the place to discuss such matters. Join me in the chambers beneath the Farstrider Square.$b$bOh, and come armed. I believe we will have need of your skills.', '', 69824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose wisely, $n.', '', 69823, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will unlock the crystal\'s power, but only you can decide how it is to be used.', '', 69822, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Warchief demands results on your research.', 'The Warchief demands results on your research.', 69821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It grants the ability to perform magic on a grand scale... but they quickly lose the ability to control that power.', '', 69820, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact that Kanrethad attempted to create is incomplete.', '', 69819, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind can tread where we cannot. Your kind can survive where others might perish.', '', 69818, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina Proudmoore now sits as head of the Kirin Tor and rules Dalaran.$b$bThat puts the citadel square in the hands of the Alliance no matter how much Aethas brags about neutrality.$b$bThis young upstart may have forgotten, but the Alliance tried to imprison and massacre our people during the third war.$b$bForgive me if I do not share his faith in their... \"neutrality\".', '', 69817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you can succeed where Illidan failed... perhaps you can accept the disorder of this universe.', '', 69816, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As Azeroth has fought the legion and survived, you have faced the darkness within yourself and controlled it.', '', 69815, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon has been allies with Dalaran for over 2000 years. It is not a friendship we should idly toss aside at the whim of our \'esteemed\' Warchief Garrosh.$b$bOh... are you here about the artifact?', '', 69814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You walk the line between absolute power and total corruption.', '', 69813, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like Illidan, you constantly struggle to bend the all consuming chaos to your will.', '', 69812, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The existence of your kind has not escaped our notice, $c.', '', 69811, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By any chance do you have another one of those super rare, hard to find, amulets?', 'By any chance do you have another one of those super rare, hard to find, amulets?', 69810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeker of Chaos... Summoner of Demons... Wielder of Shadows...', '', 69809, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh\'s prize, not ours. Mark my words, this construct is dangerous.', '', 69808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We already know the mogu mastered imprisoning living energy in devices. This is not a magic we need know more about.', '', 69807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rommath, without allies we will be crushed by the tides of this war. There is no middle ground with Garrosh. We either have to be with him, or against him.', '', 69806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And bowing to the Warchief is any better? Garrosh\'s obsession with these mogu artifacts is such that I haven\'t seen since Kael\'thas walked amongst us.', '', 69805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But of course it is dangerous. This artifact\'s secrets would be useless to us otherwise.', '', 69804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always so impatient, young one. There is no knowledge that is not power. This artifact dates back to the same era as the Divine Bell. To know its secrets is to bring us closer to Garrosh\'s prize.', '', 69803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Sin\'dorai! We should not have to bow to anyone. Not the Kirin Tor, not the Alliance, and certainly not the Horde.', '', 69802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You continue to bow to the Kirin Tor as if they were our saviors. Do not forget their treachery, Aethas.', '', 69801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The device indicates you are very close to the anomaly.', 'The device indicates you are very close to the anomaly.', 69800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s party!', 'Let\'s party!', 69799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is up, my primary $gmale:female; sibling?  Are you ready to appear visually attractive to your species?', '', 69798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you say... Warchief.', '', 69797, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Scourge beat all the courage from your people, blood elf? We are the HORDE. Where there is power, we SEIZE it. My Horde has no place for the weak!', '', 69796, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What madness is this?', '', 69795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But their empire fell. Perhaps to the sha, perhaps to the pandaren, or perhaps... to their own pride.', '', 69794, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sha can be a powerful tool. The mogu may have once harnessed its power into the Divine Bell, and look at the glorious empire they built in its wake.', '', 69793, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guards! Destroy that abomination.', '', 69792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh, you do truly believe the sha can be controlled? Have you seen what it\'s done to our men?', '', 69791, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourselves. The seals are breaking.', '', 69790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, I Biebered...', '', 69789, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Och!\n\nWe\'ve got ghosts AND the Reliquary to contend with here?! I dunno what\'s worse!', 69788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course the Explorer\'s League stumbled into a foolish situation and are in over their heads.\n\nAnd of COURSE we are going to take advantage of it.', '', 69787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do they call me \"toasty\"? \n\nYou really gonna ask me that? Look, it\'s not MY fault that the chemicals reacted that way! Blame SCIENCE!', '', 69786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must prevent the Horde from taking Pandaria... but we must also work to minimize suffering as we do.', 69785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to secure this beach stronghold. We let the Horde have a foothold here, all of Pandaria is going to look like Theramore.', '', 69784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rotating', 'Rotating', 69783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shake it off, brothers. It\'s brewin\' time.', '', 69782, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter the Temple.', 'Enter the Temple.', 69781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka\'s mark clearly indicates she entered the Black Temple here.', 'Jubeka\'s mark clearly indicates she entered the Black Temple here.', 69780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you were the right one for this task, $c. Meet me back upstairs when you are finished here.', '', 69779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yesterday\'s sundown celebration went a little long, you see. We may have... overmeditated.', '', 69778, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh. I\'m afraid you\'ve chosen a bad time for building defenses, friend.', '', 69777, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up! The Horde is near - we must prepare defenses!', 'Wake up! The Horde is near - we must prepare defenses!', 69776, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The pandaren snores deeply.>', '', 69775, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true, it may be possible to someday harness the sha into a weapon. But we risk destroying our own people in the process. That is not a price I am willing to pay.', '', 69774, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Release the Monkey King.', 'I\'m ready. Release the Monkey King.', 69773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the flying city of Dalaran, the leader of the Kirin Tor, Lady Jaina Proudmoore!', 'From the flying city of Dalaran, the leader of the Kirin Tor, Lady Jaina Proudmoore!', 69772, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, thank you for helping me today. I knew we could convince my father of the right course. Please, go back to your other duties for now.', '', 69771, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This power is too dangerous. I will have none of it!', '', 69770, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well said, my son.', '', 69769, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh\'s example is not one that I care to follow. The Alliance should make its own decisions. The RIGHT decisions.', '', 69768, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think, Anduin?', '', 69767, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh is using every weapon he can lay his hands on. Shouldn\'t we level the playing field?', 69766, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes! Very interesting! Perhaps I could distill it into a new power source?', '', 69764, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It couldn\'t hurt to study it. \'Tho I don\'t much care for the way it\'s lookin\' at me.', '', 69763, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Highness, we should study it. Weaponize it! The Horde already outnumber us here on Pandaria. We need to gain every possible advantage.', 69762, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw first-hand what the sha did to my soldiers in the Jade Forest. My strongest men were rendered helpless by crippling doubt.', '', 69761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I agree. Only suffering can come of such a creature.', '', 69760, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense great darkness emanating from this... thing. Destroy it, now!', 69759, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Don\'t go near it!', '', 69758, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the light, is that a sha?', '', 69757, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yer Majesty! Look!', '', 69756, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t the same, father. The sha cannot simply be defeated. It feeds on our inner-most weaknesses. It twists our thoughts. Don\'t underestimate it!', '', 69755, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Alliance have rallied to defeat many enemies, my son. The sha will fall to us, just like any other.', '', 69754, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, father. I encountered sha energy in my travels. At its full power it is terrible to behold.', '', 69753, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. So it was this... sha... that caused such violent behavior in our troops?', '', 69752, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Representing the draenei, the wise and noble Farseer Nobundo from the Exodar!', 'Representing the draenei, the wise and noble Farseer Nobundo from the Exodar!', 69751, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the faraway boughs of tranquil Darnassus, High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind arrives!', 'From the faraway boughs of tranquil Darnassus, High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind arrives!', 69750, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail the King of Gilneas, Genn Greymane!', 'All hail the King of Gilneas, Genn Greymane!', 69749, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... I trust you, father.', '', 69748, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 34190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll bring a small group of champions with me and talk to Tyrande myself. Anduin, I can handle this. I need you to trust that I\'m going to do the right thing here.', '', 69747, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But father-', '', 69746, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, calm down. This sounds like one of Garrosh\'s traps. He\'s trying to lure us from the beach. Troteman? Round me up some peasants and a mortar team, and don\'t let down your guard.', '', 69745, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AND it\'s a historical treasure trove.', 69744, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 34248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father! You can\'t let them turn the Crane Temple into a war zone! That place is still recovering from a sha infestation...', '', 69743, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 34188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rangers? ...Tyrande.', '', 69742, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer Majesty! The Horde, they\'ve holed up in a temple west of here. Night elf rangers have surrounded it and locked it down...', 69741, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 34247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together...', '', 69740, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then we\'ll protect it with our lives. Son, I need you with me on this. We in this together?', '', 69739, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is - different than ours. It\'s a treasure.', '', 69738, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy, son. We\'re fighting a different war now. This isn\'t about hatred of the Horde. This is about a love of what\'s right. About doing what needs to be done.', '', 69737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father, you can\'t do this. All the hatred and anger our war brings here - it poisons this place.', '', 69736, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 34185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin... you\'re safe...', '', 69735, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 34693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father!', '', 69734, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What-?', '', 69733, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 34692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father!', '', 69732, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 34183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal, excellent work fortifying the harbor. Our next priority is -', '', 69731, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The honor is yours. Signal the fleet.', '', 69730, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34654, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion! Without your pioneering efforts on Pandaria, this foothold wouldn\'t have been possible.', '', 69729, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34653, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From here we can reach out to the natives and keep Horde aggression in check.', '', 69728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything is in place. We\'ll construct a town center on this peninsula, using resources from along the coast.', '', 69727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm. I used to think leadership was all about strength. I see things more clearly now - it\'s a little bit of give, a little bit of take. It\'s about binding people together. A bundle of sticks is not easily broken.', '', 69726, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mean it? Oh, I cannae WAIT to see the look on Brann\'s face when he finds out I got an excavation green-lit by the King himself! You\'ll have your quarry by next sundown!', 69725, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 34252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll make a deal with you, Hornswaggle. Help my men get a stone quarry operation running, and we\'ll protect your dig site.', '', 69724, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somethun\' even BETTER. History! Artifacts from an ancient an\' powerful race!', 69723, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 34251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take it. Anything else?', '', 69722, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 34708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Plenty of stone, aye. But no sign of major ore veins in this whole area.', 69721, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 34250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad to see you contribute to the war effort. But I need supplies. What have you got?', '', 69720, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Explorer\'s League reporting in, sir!', 69719, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 34249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, let\'s see to our supplies...', '', 69718, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marshal, see to it that you hold this position until construction is complete.', '', 69717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to see a tower built right here.', '', 69716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The survey team has done well. This is an ideal deep-water port.', '', 69715, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Troteman, you old dog, I knew I\'d find you stirring up trouble.', '', 69714, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, you know this land better than anyone. You\'re with me. Let\'s go find Troteman.', '', 69713, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Yer Majesty!', 69712, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 34246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hornswaggle, notify the rest of the survey team. Quarry and mining operations will begin as soon as the fleet arrives.', '', 69711, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lynna, stay here and establish a camp. Your first priority should be medical tents and shelters. When the peasants arrive, see that they begin construction of the docks.', '', 69710, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 34685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... Troteman may have gotten himself in over his head. We\'ll split up.', '', 69709, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Marshal Troteman and a handful o\' scouts pursued a Horde warband up the beach. They haven\'t come back.', 69708, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 34245, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde?', '', 69707, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 34683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer Highness! This site has everything we need. Lumber, stone and-', 69706, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 34244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the situation?', '', 69705, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s my survey team. Bring us in.', '', 69704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34681, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will go no further! Now face me. I will give you a swift death!', '', 69703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! The Bell....', '', 69702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only death awaits you!', '', 69701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such horror... Such emptiness...', '', 69700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, too, shall know the silence!', '', 69699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This crypt will be your grave!', '', 69698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be cast into darkness!', '', 69697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardians, awaken! Destroy those who would steal the Thunder King\'s treasure!', '', 69696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... you are not mogu! Intruders!', '', 69695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have kept the Bell safe as promised, Master.', '', 69694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light... I see... light. Finally, after centuries of silence, someone comes at last.', '', 69693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And neither, Avartu, will yours.', '', 69692, 0, 0, 5, 70, 0, 34340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their sacrifice will not be in vain.', '', 69691, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 34339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time. The Shado-Pan trackers are too close. They cannot learn the location of the Bell.', '', 69690, 0, 0, 274, 70, 0, 34338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, then. May the ghosts of our brothers guard this place for all eternity.', '', 69689, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 34204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have but to evacuate the workers and the rest of our warriors.', '', 69688, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 34203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Warlord. The traps are set. The Divine Bell will be safe within this crypt, ready for the day that the Thunder King returns.', '', 69687, 0, 0, 273, 70, 0, 34202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are the preparations complete?', '', 69686, 0, 0, 6, 70, 0, 34337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just... be right here. Don\'t forget about me!', '', 69685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, take this! It\'ll help you against any swarms.', '', 69684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Griz, you guard da boat. Da rest of ya wit\' me.', '', 69682, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! Stop da boat here.', '', 69681, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re busting up our boat!', '', 69680, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 34372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack, get that thing off us!', '', 69679, 0, 0, 430, 65, 0, 34371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill anyting dat squirms!', '', 69678, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of you man da guns, the rest on foot.', '', 69677, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('And... done! A self-propelled saurok-slaying machine.', '', 69676, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 34370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can take this boat inside. Just let me make a few modifications...', '', 69675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s like dey got weapons, but no brains.', '', 69674, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you fought dese \'tings before?', '', 69673, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 34526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on, me bruddahs!', '', 69672, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Scouts say dere\'s ancient magics in dese caves. Warchief wants \'em checked out.', '', 69671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey - wait for me! I don\'t like goons, either.', '', 69670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s mount up and move out!', '', 69669, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad you here to watch me back. I don\'t like da look of Garrosh\'s goons.', '', 69668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As da Warchief commands...', '', 69667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proceed by foot. We\'ll circle around and look for another entrance.', '', 69666, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone be here now. Let\'s get dis done wit.', '', 69665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay by my side!', '', 69664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay by me! We\'re going out the tunnel!', '', 69663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aethas, this way! Into the portal!', '', 69662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay your hand and step aside. Very well.', '', 69661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aethas isn\'t here... they must have moved him. We can continue without him.', '', 69660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go go go go! To the center of the city! This way!', '', 69659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34272, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait for my command...', '', 69658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34271, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s chaos up there. We need to save whoever we can, and we\'ll need to move quickly.', '', 69657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34270, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina\'s gone over the edge. She\'s imprisoning the Sunreavers and attacking those who resist. What\'s worse, the Silver Covenant has seized the opportunity to join the bloodshed.', '', 69656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to try a sip of the water of youth?', 'Are you going to try a sip of the water of youth?', 69655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may come to that. Bring me my blades. The next move is mine.', '', 69654, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord. YOU would make a fine Warchief.', '', 69653, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord. YOU would make a fine Warchief.', '', 69652, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And get this damn thing out of my sight! Hellscream bought his treasure with the blood of my people. I hope it destroys him.', '', 69651, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Sin\'dorei will take our future into our own hands.', '', 69650, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hal\'duron, summon the rangers. Rommath, assemble the Blood Magi, and add the Sunreavers\' strength to your own.', '', 69649, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Lord...', '', 69648, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When will they learn? When will they see that the Horde exists BECAUSE of the Alliance? Because of their prejudice and their bigotry!? They force us ever closer to Hellscream\'s Horde.', '', 69647, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s gone too far. I\'m certain the Alliance can move their war mages through the city at will. That human ... witch!', '', 69646, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Proudmoore! She\'s gone and expelled the Sunreavers from the city. She\'s purging the Horde from the Kirin Tor!', '', 69645, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anar\'alash denal! Will someone tell me WHAT is going on in Dalaran?', '', 69644, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to this hero, a few of us made it out of there. Many more have been sent to the Violet Hold.', '', 69643, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aethas! You\'re alive.', '', 69642, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send for Velen. Bring him here at once!', '', 69641, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34646, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s alive, but his bones are shattered.', '', 69640, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin, what were you thinking? I should\'ve sent you back to Stormwind!', '', 69639, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin!', 69638, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 34295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh attacked my son...? Where is he?', '', 69637, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, please don\'t go - we need to talk!', '', 69636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The game has changed.', '', 69635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t get soft on me, Varian.', 69634, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina. We\'ve got to work together on this. The Alliance must act as one.', '', 69633, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re fooling yourself. Once Horde, always Horde. I see that now. I\'m mobilizing the Kirin Tor.', 69632, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve driven them back to the Horde.', '', 69631, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They chose their own path.', 69630, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was trying to negotiate with the Sin\'dorei. I was opening discussions to bring them into the Alliance! By attacking their people, you\'ve forced their hand-', '', 69629, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How I run the Kirin Tor is my business.', 69628, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina, you need to talk to me before you act-', '', 69627, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those that surrendered are being taken to the Violet Hold. I make no guarantees about those who chose to fight.', 69626, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of the Sin\'dorei - the Sunreavers?', '', 69625, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you said-', '', 69624, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34720, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know what I said. My trust was misplaced.', 69623, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve purged the Horde from Dalaran. You have what you wanted, Your Majesty: The Kirin Tor belongs to the Alliance.', 69622, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How?', '', 69621, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34719, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin Tor was betrayed from within. I\'ve handled the situation.', 69620, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jaina! What\'s happening in Dalaran? Has there been an attack?', '', 69619, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You, Aethas, will be coming with me.', 69618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hah! I see. I will remove the Sunreavers by force, then.', 69617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is OUR city too, Proudmoore.', '', 69616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have it all wrong, Jaina. I did nothing.', '', 69615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You looked the other way. You and your insubordinate kind are no longer welcome here.', 69614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve betrayed the Kirin Tor, Sunreaver. You\'ve allowed Garrosh to move his forces through MY city.', 69613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aethas Sunreaver!', 69612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will NOT be betrayed again! Those responsible for this will be punished!', 69611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These portals connect to Dalaran. That means the Kirin Tor... MY OWN Kirin Tor... helped the Horde commit this atrocity.', 69610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come with me.', 69609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'UNUSED', 69608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They couldn\'t possibly have gotten through... this was an inside job. Somebody inside the city has the Bell, unless... no...', 69607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I had Darnassus LOCKED DOWN! Every fumbling rogue that tried to sneak into the city, I CAUGHT them! I snatched every two-bit charlatan that attempted to teleport through my traps!', 69606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, no, no! The Bell!', 69605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 34304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something you can do, troll, to demonstrate your value to the Horde. A mission in the heart of this continent.', '', 69604, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the difference between me and you, Vol\'jin. I won\'t let MY people starve to death in the desert. I will stop at nothing - NOTHING - to ensure a proud and glorious future for the orcs and anyone with the courage to stand with us. Wait here.', '', 69603, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All dis bloodshed make everyone tink twice \'bout joinin\' da Horde.', '', 69602, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 34506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A show of might on these shores will make the pandaren think twice about joining the Alliance.', '', 69601, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 34234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look around you, Vol\'jin. This land is rich in resources: wood, stone, iron, fuel. And people.', '', 69600, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The question is, what are WE doin\' here? Yeh bring \'dis war to anudder corner of Azeroth, and I wanna know why.', '', 69599, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 34505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your lack of vision is why your people are still primitives, and your lack of loyalty is why I did not summon the Darkspear for this campaign.', '', 69598, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin. What are you doing here? Shouldn\'t you be on your island kissing frogs?', '', 69597, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see, champion? There is little my Horde cannot accomplish. What is this?', '', 69596, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch the might of the Horde in action as we turn this slab of land into DOMINATION POINT.', '', 69595, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired guards to protect the outpost!', '%s has hired guards to protect the outpost!', 69594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, you have earned the honor. Signal our fleet.', '', 69593, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 34228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The landing site is secure. We\'re ready for work to commence.', '', 69592, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me. I have much to think about.', '', 69591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least the human prince is dead. King Wrynn now knows the price of his continued defiance.', '', 69590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much I do not know about this artifact. The weak-willed cannot control this sha energy, but I WILL master it.', '', 69589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Ishi. You have.', '', 69587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief! I... I have failed you.', '', 69586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your fear, Ishi! Turn it on your foes. When death arrives, will you stand and face it or kneel in defeat?', '', 69585, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At night, I see the faces of all those I have slain. Where do our spirits go after our bodies lay cold? I fear... death.', '', 69584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Control your hatred, Ishi. There is killing, and then there is murder. Direct your rage to our enemies.', '', 69583, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should we be slaves to honor, when we could slaughter the children of our enemies while they sleep? My blade thirsts for Alliance blood!', '', 69582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our suffering is at an end. When this war is won, our people will see prosperity at last.', '', 69581, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lost so much, Warchief. Our families, dead. Our friends, lost. Our homeland, gone. How much more must our people suffer?', '', 69580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doubt is for the weak! Do not question your strength, Ishi. We will survive because we must! The Horde will prevail!', '', 69579, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you speak the truth, Garrosh? Can the Horde truly survive another war?', '', 69578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight the sha - master it! Use it!', '', 69577, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auuugh... Auuuuuugggghhhhh! This pain! I cannot control it!', '', 69576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop me then, human.', '', 69575, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not let you do this. I swear to it.', '', 69574, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaha... so in the end, it is not Varian, but his whelp who comes to face me. You run bravely to your death, young one.', '', 69573, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 34222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop, Garrosh! You do not know what that bell is capable of!', '', 69572, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 34177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is but a test of our strength. We will pass this trial, just as we have passed others!', '', 69571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Feel the power within you. Fight your fears. Conquer your hatred!', '', 69570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If our enemies should choose to push us, we will drive them into the ground!', '', 69569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our victory is all but assured. With the power of the bell on our side, we will be unstoppable.', '', 69568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together, we will destroy the Alliance and claim what is rightfully ours. Let our song of victory begin.', '', 69567, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 34217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Divine Bell, I will burn away any remnants of weakness within us. Fear... despair... hatred... doubt. The lesser races are buried beneath their weight. But WE will control their power.', '', 69566, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the HORDE. We are slaves to nothing and no one!', '', 69565, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will let you live so that you can tell your King of the price for his continued defiance!', '', 69564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Alliance must be at its end if you\'re sending your children against me.', '', 69563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not let you do this, Garrosh.', '', 69562, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu made the Divine Bell to create chaos, but the pandaren created a special mallet to turn the echoes of that chaos into perfect harmony. That mallet was hidden for thousands of years, until now.', '', 69561, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, whelp!!', '', 69560, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is where you are wrong, Garrosh.', '', 69559, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your interference has cost me a great warrior, young prince. You\'ll pay with your life.', '', 69558, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarf Construction Complete!', 'Dwarf Construction Complete!', 69553, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s gotta be some riches around this place... c\'mon boss, you know you want to...', '', 69548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... yo, $n! Remember me? Good, good... hey, listen... we don\'t have to help this guy...', '', 69547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looting', 'Looting', 69544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Solve the other riddles, I am demanding! And then meet me down south at Lion\'s Landing.', '', 69543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eek! Quick, strong, dangerous. You know how to stick it. I no longer afraid you just some filthy wikket.', '', 69542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s flavor is intended for friends to share after a battle. Come... friend... and battle me if you dare.', '', 69541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be warned, this recipe has been handed down from generation to generation, tought to my family by the great Monkey King himself.', '', 69540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so there is one who wishes to taste the might of the Metal Brew?', '', 69539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Some of my men are trapped in the basement - there is little time, help me save them!!', '', 69538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you love demons so much... then you shall have them!', '', 69537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:113134|h[Mass Resurrection]|h|r!', 69536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the souls of those your kind doomed to perish, Warlock!', '', 69535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin, why are we here?', 'Anduin, why are we here?', 69534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh is going to try to use the Divine Bell to wreak havoc on the land. We must find a way to stop him.', '', 69533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found an incantation to release these two from their prison. But it will release both of them. Once I cast this, defeat the Jade Warlord before he can get his bearings.', '', 69532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!', '', 69531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tricky part is, he was frozen in jade while dueling a mogu that history names \"The Jade Warlord.\"', '', 69530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The powers of this place are NOT for your kind, warlock!', '', 69529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I did find, however, was the final resting place of the infamous \"Monkey King.\"', '', 69528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But then the Monkey King one day decided to steal the mallet and hide it as a prank. There is no record of the mallet after that.', '', 69527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When using the mallet on the Divine Bell, the pandaren monks were able to create pure harmony.', '', 69526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to my research, the pandaren long ago made a special mallet that was intended for the Divine Bell.', '', 69525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. We\'ll return later after the crystal is fully charged.', '', 69524, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you hear that?! Those Ashtongue dogs are coming. Let\'s hurry up and start the ritual!', 69523, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I liked you better when your jaw was missing.', '', 69522, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...', 69521, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... shut up.', '', 69520, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... oh dear, are you going to regale me with yet another of your horrible stories?', 69519, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was there... at the end...', '', 69516, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '... why do you talk so much, Kanrethad?', 69515, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Didn\'t you notice? The demons under Illidan\'s command were free of the entropic, fel-green corruption that pervades the Legion.', '', 69514, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?? You have no proof of such a claim.', 69513, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe this is the original power source he intended to offer the blood elves to free them from their addiction to the Sunwell... but for some reason he didn\'t let them near it...', '', 69512, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By feeding upon this place\'s power, they were broken free from their addiction to the Legion\'s magic.', '', 69511, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. The payment for the demons\' service was to drink from the energy of this place.', '', 69510, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So this is how Illidan bound so many demons to his will...', 69509, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The powers of this room are not unlike the original Well of Eternity in Azeroth.', '', 69508, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summon... ha, imagine what we could become if fused with power of this magnitude...', '', 69507, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Imagine what we could summon with just a fraction of this power!', 69506, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... is amazing... an untapped store of raw arcane energy.', 69505, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For years it has languished, slowly growing in strength...', '', 69504, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use caution, there are many traps still active within. Perhaps one of your demon spells will grant you the ability to scout ahead before advancing forward.', '', 69503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area.', '', 69502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place.', '', 69501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have decided to trust this warlock for now. Let $ghim:her; move about the temple freely.', '', 69500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow me. They visited both the Shrine of Lost Souls and the Temple Summit.', '', 69499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I\'m still not sure what they were after.', '', 69498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you and your Horde  did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan\'s grasp. $B$BI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you.', '', 69497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan\'s grasp. $B$BI will help you as a show of mutual trust.', '', 69496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akama, lead the way!', 'Akama, lead the way!', 69495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me where they went.', 'Show me where they went.', 69494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you and your Alliance did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan\'s grasp. $B$BI will help you as a show of mutual trust and repayment of the debt I owe you.', '', 69493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance did much to aid my people in freeing the Black Temple of Illidan\'s grasp.$B$BI will help you as a show of mutual trust.', '', 69492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Wrynn seeks the Black Harvest council members who trespassed here recently.', 'King Wrynn seeks the Black Harvest council members who trespassed here recently.', 69491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warchief Garrosh seeks the Black Harvest members who trespassed here recently.', 'Warchief Garrosh seeks the Black Harvest members who trespassed here recently.', 69490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... your name sounds familiar to me, $n. $B$BWhat do you want from the Black Temple? Stay a moment and speak with me, rather than skulk about like a rogue.', '', 69489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... you\'re not one of the warlocks that snuck in here before. Why then are you here?', '', 69488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish warlocks. I knew you would try again to ransack our temple...!', '', 69487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Mantid are protecting the towers, $p. Take them out or we won\'t be able to land any shots.', 'Those Mantid are protecting the towers, $p. Take them out or we won\'t be able to land any shots.', 69486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work! The shield looks like it\'s weakening.', 'Nice work! The shield looks like it\'s weakening.', 69485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs.', 'Good shot, $p! Keep aiming for those bombs.', 69484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for those amber bombs, they\'ll cause a huge explosion if we manage to set one off!', 'Aim for those amber bombs, they\'ll cause a huge explosion if we manage to set one off!', 69483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going in! Take out those towers!', 'We\'re going in! Take out those towers!', 69482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse these mantid! All remaining air units, get to those towers and take them out!', 'Curse these mantid! All remaining air units, get to those towers and take them out!', 69481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral they\'ve activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up.', 'Admiral they\'ve activated some sort of force field, the control towers all over the island just lit up', 69480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we don\'t get this shield down soon we\'re going to be overrun.', 'If we don\'t get this shield down soon we\'re going to be overrun.', 69479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shield generators all over the island are protecting the Heart of Zan\'vess, preventing us from reaching the weapons cache.', 'Shield generators all over the island are protecting the Heart of Zan\'vess, preventing us from reaching the weapons cache.', 69478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got our work cut out for us, $p.', 'We\'ve got our work cut out for us, $p.', 69477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! I am being attacked!', '', 69476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy this well earned brew. The recipe has been in my family for over ten thousand years. Once enjoyed by the Monkey King himself, they say.', '', 69475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, hero! I yield to your might.', '', 69474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re late, $n.\n\nLet\'s get right to the point. Our latest recon shows the last of Shek\'zeer\'s forces are holed up at the heart of the island. They\'re protecting a large weapons cache that Garrosh has ordered us to retrieve. Problem is they\'ve activated the island\'s defenses, a massive impenetrable shield that enshrouds all of Zan\'vess.\n\nThis is where you come in. I need you to take one of these gunships and shoot down the shield generators. As long as they\'re active none of our forces can reach the weapons cache.', 69473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased a box of Overridden Excavationbots!', '%s has purchased a box of Overridden Excavationbots!', 69472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased a Mind Vision Altar!', '%s has purchased a Mind Vision Altar!', 69471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
