('', 'I see our city as a beacon of light, showing the way.', 69459, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we can trust one another here, then there\'s hope for the rest of the world.', 69458, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see our city as a beacon of light, showing the way.', 69457, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As long as we stay above the war, then there\'s hope for the world as a whole.', 69456, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Sunreavers still operate within this city. Alliance and Horde work together.', 69455, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every day I ask myself: \"What\'s the right thing to do?\"', 69454, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin, you know more than anyone, it\'s important to separate the Horde from its people.', 69453, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kael\'thas Sunstrider was also a student here, another of our fold who betrayed us.', 69452, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Kirin-Tor has a legacy of abuse. Kel\'thuzad turned his knowledge of the arcane arts toward Necromancy.', 69451, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Jaina!', '', 69450, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not proud.  Since then, Kalecgos and I have talked at length about power, and how it should be used.', 69449, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the aftermath of Theramore, my first instinct was to decimate Orgrimmar - to kill every man woman and child in the city.', 69448, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come with me - look around you a moment.', 69447, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nobody dislikes Garrosh more than me. I wrestle with my anger every day.', 69446, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anduin, I know exactly what he\'s asking. Oh - look who\'s arrived.', 69445, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 34310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father isn\'t asking you to pledge the Kirin-Tor to the Alliance-', '', 69444, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 34179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open, champion. We are all in this together... for now.', '', 69443, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know this: I won\'t stand idle if the Horde interests conflict with those of my people. I may reconsider old Alliances.', '', 69442, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I look at our Warchief, and I begin to see the very same racism. He is willing to throw away our lives for his agenda.', '', 69441, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Sin\'dorei were driven to the Horde by the bigotry and distrust of the Alliance.', '', 69440, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people, who have suffered through so many challenges and betrayals, look to me to secure their future.', '', 69439, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a ranger, not a politician. But like it or not, the mantle of leadership has fallen on my shoulders.', '', 69438, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a hero of the Horde. Your deeds in Northrend and during the Cataclysm are the stuff of legend. For this reason, I trust in your discretion.', '', 69437, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, may I have a word with you? In private... ?', '', 69436, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 34261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dwarf Construction Site Under Attack!', 'Dwarf Construction Site Under Attack!', 69435, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 34768, 34768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another warlock? After what happened last time, you should be glad we don\'t kill you on sight.', '', 69434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This temple is the domain of the Ashtongue Brotherhood. I must ask you to leave - now.', '', 69433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind are not welcome here, warlock.', '', 69432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did you see, brother?', '', 69431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls for the help of a nearby guard!', '', 69430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, you have been here for many weeks, and know this land well. Come with me.', '', 69429, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 34243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This island will make a perfect coastal stronghold. Rokla! When the peons arrive, clear these trees and begin construction of the docks.', '', 69428, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! Stop the boats here.', '', 69427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt! This city is under Martial Law. Declare yourselves.', '', 69426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin\'s body was found in a well a few days ago.$b$bA poison flows through his veins that is halting his regeneration. This was designed to kill a troll.$b$bIf I had to guess, I would say this wound was made by an assassin\'s hand. And one who is not from Pandaria.', '', 69425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to Vol\'jin?', 'What happened to Vol\'jin?', 69424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin was a friend of mine, once upon a time. It has been many years since our paths crossed.', '', 69423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm? What was that?', 69422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Show yourself!', 69421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is somebody out there?', 69420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What was that noise?', 69419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine Bell! I knew I could count on you, $n.', '', 69418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you keep teleporting all over the place, Jaina will catch onto us. Please, be more careful next time.', '', 69417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your distance from the Alliance, $n. We can\'t have you getting captured this deep in enemy territory.', '', 69416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful, $n. We can\'t risk being caught.', '', 69415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back so soon?', '', 69414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Stay away from the guards! This spell should shield you from the night elves\' vision, but you\'ll still need to keep your distance.  If you get into trouble, return to safety here.', '', 69413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes.', 'Yes.', 69412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll have to tread carefully with all this teleporting in and out. We CANNOT risk Jaina finding out about this.$b$bAre you ready to go in?', '', 69411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Vol\'jin lays on the floor unconscious and barely breathing.>', '', 69410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And, we\'re off!', '', 69409, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are our Allies! You watch over them like they\'re a threat. Why? You WILL answer to me!', '', 69408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-yes sir! We struck it big. There\'s crude all along the coast. We\'ll get an operation going right away, your hugeness!', '', 69407, 0, 0, 430, 65, 0, 34355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought the Warchief himself would come to bail me out!', '', 69406, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 34354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you will. I\'m sending in grunts to make sure of it.', '', 69405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have I been away so long that you have forgotten who I am?', '', 69404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'kron? Here? What has Garrosh been up to?', '', 69403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t come to save your sorry hide, goblin. Did you find fuel or not?', '', 69402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 34237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold this ground, Blood Guard. Here is where we will build our keep. Expect peons within the hour, and be ready to motivate them.', '', 69401, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 34240, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pitiful skirmish! The Alliance fights without conviction.', '', 69400, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 34239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mount up, lads! Time ta go an\' earn our ale.', '', 69399, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead on, friend. It\'s time to set up your defenses!', 'Lead on, friend. It\'s time to set up your defenses!', 69398, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, $g lad:lass;. What can we be doin\' fer yeh?', '', 69397, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well my beloved. Come friend, let us ride to the home of the Darkspear.', '', 69396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, I should not be long. The Darkspear are a strong people and I doubt they have much need of my assistance.', '', 69394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s oil here alright, and we\'re gonna need it!', '', 69393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up, boys. More tin-men comin\' our way!', '', 69392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the Horde!', '', 69391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More elves to slaughter!', '', 69390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh dear...', 69389, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s something... strange about them... something out of place...', 69388, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They were trivial by comparison! These things are never in the same place.', 69387, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the problem? You handled the binding of the fel imps and voidlords effortlessly.', '', 69386, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, I\'ve spent weeks trying to understand how to summon one of these things. If you know something I don\'t, I\'d appreciate it if you\'d share it with us \"lesser\" mortals.', 69385, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How should I know?', '', 69384, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, he\'s gone too... so why are they still around?', 69383, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh?', 69382, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The observers were in the service of Illidan... not the Legion.', '', 69381, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...there\'s a slight flaw in that supposition.', '', 69380, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such strange creatures. Why do they remain so long after the Legion has left?', 69379, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $n.$b$bTake the laborers from camp here, and any others you can find in the region. Assist them in building defenses to ensure no Horde can escape our vengeance.$b$bOne more thing. These troops are not trained for battle and must be protected from harm if they are to succeed.$b$bNow go, and be quick about it. Time is running out!', '', 69378, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orders, your majesty?', 'Orders, your majesty?', 69377, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jubeka, complete the ritual.', '', 69376, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t believe that is part of our contract. We are done here.', '', 69375, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have your petty secret, Kanrethad. Now, I demand knowledge from you... why do you care?', '', 69374, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sacrificial magic was considered the greatest violation of life and we were attuned to instantly punish those who delved into such... delicious sorcery.', '', 69373, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... before Sargeras freed us, we were the Titan\'s hounds. Forever enslaved to police the use of arcane magics.', '', 69372, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you do not care then there is no harm telling me.', '', 69371, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What an odd demand. Not even my own kind care about our origins. Why should you?', '', 69370, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STAY OUT OF THIS! The demon will answer, NOW!', '', 69369, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This knowledge is useless... what are you trying to achieve, Kanrethad?', 69368, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind far predates Sargeras\'s betrayal. What WERE you?', '', 69367, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not attempt to deceive me, demon!', '', 69366, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My contract is to fight for you, not to reveal the Legion\'s secrets, mortal.', '', 69365, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tire of your evasive babble, doomguard. Explain to me why you and your kind are drawn to sacrificial magics.', '', 69364, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And what depraved reason is that...?', 69363, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... If I fail, I need you to banish me forever.', '', 69362, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I chose you as my companion for a reason.', '', 69361, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... and those that threaten us from within.', '', 69360, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... the threats that besiege us from the outside...', '', 69359, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are two sides to the blade of demonology...', '', 69358, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 69357, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...you toy with becoming one yourself!', 69356, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Stay back...! You... you\'re dangerous. I remain content summoning demons, but you...', 69355, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What...? No! I.. I have... no idea...', 69354, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gul\'dan destroyed this world in his bid for power... you\'re concerned I will do the same to Azeroth.', '', 69353, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is it you wished to show me...?', 69352, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... I\'ve seen the fear in your eyes, Jubeka.', '', 69351, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We struck liquid gold with this place, $c! All we had to do was tear down some useless trees and clear out some pesky animals!', '', 69350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be ready for anything, $n. We may have to use force against our own men.', '', 69349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have... more important matters to attend to than you. Go away, scum.', '', 69348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', 69347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_knife_1h_mantid_02.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Daggers|r!', '', 69346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bomb_01.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Bombs|r!', '', 69345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_2h_mantid_01.blp:20|t%s equips his |cFFFF0000Sword|r!', '', 69344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Researcher Morian has arrived!', 'Researcher Morian has arrived!', 69343, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goremaw has arrived!', 'Goremaw has arrived!', 69342, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks.', 'I fought against the anger, but it overwhelmed me. You have my thanks.', 69341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince.', 'Thank you for saving me, soldier. You too, young prince.', 69340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head.', 'I don\'t know what came over me. Thank you for clearing my head.', 69339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!', 'Thank you for saving me from that nightmare. I wanted to rip everything apart!', 69338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dreamt that I turned into a monster. Good thing you woke me.', 'I dreamt that I turned into a monster. Good thing you woke me.', 69337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-what happened? I couldn\'t control my own body.', 'W-what happened? I couldn\'t control my own body.', 69336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unngh... my head... it hurts!', 'Unngh... my head... it hurts!', 69335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t feel so good...', 'I don\'t feel so good...', 69334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('D-don\'t come any closer!', 'D-don\'t come any closer!', 69333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Stay... away!', 'No! Stay... away!', 69332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free! Free at last after ten thousand years! This a happy day! Very happy happy day! Gonna need biggest party ever! With nibs! And dibs! And brews! And jungle hozen! And mountain hozen! And sky hozen!', '', 69331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. I wish to talk about something else.', 'Very well. I wish to talk about something else.', 69330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Here? Now? We\'re in a battle!$b$bAs much as I love your enthusiasm to learn the wonders of Gnomish Engineering this really is a conversation best saved for when we are back under the protection of Tinkertown\'s walls in Ironforge.', '', 69329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Self Destructing is SO COOL.', '', 69328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... I\'m OUTTA HERE!', '', 69327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what exploding feels like?', '', 69326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh... later!', '', 69325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it was nice knowing you.', '', 69324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s check the ol\' programming... SELF DESTRUCT?!', '', 69323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh boy! A new program! Let\'s see here... BLOW MYSELF UP?!', '', 69322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, looks like I\'ve been programmed to... <sigh> Self-Destruct.', '', 69321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Orders! Let\'s see here... Self Destruct?!', '', 69320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hash table collision detected. Resolution: SELF-DESTRUCT.', '', 69319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Error: Divide by zero. Resolution: SELF DESTRUCT INITIATED.', '', 69318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Null Pointer Exception. Self-destruct protocol initiated.', '', 69317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Error: Attempt to write to protected memory. Resolution: Move at enemy and self-destruct.', '', 69316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interpreting program \"Hello World\". Line 1: Blow up in enemy\'s face.', '', 69315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bomb_01.blp:20|tYou are the target of |cFFFF0000|Hspell:133925|h[Bombs]|h|r! Run!', '', 69314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! I forgot to reverse the bipolar collaboration inverter.', '', 69313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That doesn\'t sound good!', '', 69312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gnome Construction Site Under Attack!', 'Gnome Construction Site Under Attack!', 69311, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 34768, 34768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well whaddya know? It worked!', 69310, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? Ya found it! Wahoo! I\'ll get right to work!', 69309, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Are they gone?', '', 69308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this your journal, Rosey?', 'Is this your journal, Rosey?', 69307, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Rosey fights back tears as she speaks.>$b$bMy... my journal. It\'s gone missin\'.$b$bIt\'s mostly full of memories of my pappy, and his endless search for the perfect place to build his paradise city. It was to be the pinnacle of gnomish engineering!$b$bAnyway, one of his old schematics might actually be useful here. Please let me know if ya find it somewhere in all this thick green grass.', 69306, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Get into da big bad voodoo zones mon\'! It\'ll shield you from his powa!', '', 69305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well? What is it?', 'Well? What is it?', 69304, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Get them!', '', 69303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was startin\' to think you\'d never ask!$b$bWe\'ll get \'er done eventually, but there\'s plenty you can do to help.$b$bWe gnomes have a high metabolism - and it only gets higher when we\'re hard at work. Food will always be welcome.$b$bThen there\'s oil. These traps are tricky enough without having to worry about gears jamming. Bring us any oil ya find out there.$b$bOutside\'a that, just keep us safe!$b$b<Rosey looks aways for a moment, then whispers.>$b$bTh-there might be one other thing...', 69302, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] De Saurok been created by da Mogu?', '', 69301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll never finish in time! Can\'t we make them go faster?', 'We\'ll never finish in time! Can\'t we make them go faster?', 69300, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My life for the Horde.', '', 69299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goob and friend did good!', '', 69298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok. Goob go back to Zino.', '', 69297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t need Goob\'s help?', '', 69296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\'Sweet child\', pappy\'d always call me. Well, what we\'re plannin\' for these Horde vermin ain\'t so sweet!', 69295, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goob help!', '', 69294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating...', 'Fascinating...', 69293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the way of the Observer to bear witness to all things that come to pass. So many delicious magics have I tasted at your side, $gmaster:mistress;.', '', 69292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had no idea you were so well-informed.', 'I had no idea you were so well-informed.', 69291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! This codex is written in the ancient Nathrezim tongue. Nathrezim, or the Dreadlords, as you call them, were once an enlightened and powerful race. Their skill in summoning and gateway magics was unsurpassed by any in the Great Dark Beyond. $B$BThis particular tome contains instructions to open a gateway to another world. Sadly, I fear that world no longer exists. It was destroyed as a show of power during the enslavement of Xoroth.$B$BThe tome is useless, I\'m afraid. No $r $c could open such a gateway alone.', '', 69290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $gMaster:Mistress; $n, how might I be of assistance?', '', 69289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The felhunter just tilts its head and stares at you strangely.', '', 69288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks at you blankly.', '', 69287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot read the words... but the magic points to a world that exists no longer. It was destroyed by the Legion.', '', 69286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to speak with me...? Unusual...', '', 69285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Words are not the way of the void. I do not know... it appears to connect two... stars together...', '', 69284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dismiss me... I wish to return to the void.', '', 69283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I have no idea.', '', 69282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... yeah? Sup, boss?', '', 69281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. I won\'t help your kind read an ancient Nathrezim text. Now, release me!!', 69280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do YOU want, you miserable excuse for a $r?', 69279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? You just want me to look at some dirty old tome? Ugh, how disappointing. $B$BThis is the script of the Nathrezim, what you call Dreadlords. They rarely use it outside of their home.', 69278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello Master... what kind of service can I provide you today... ?', 69277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I recall seeing such script on the Nathrezim homeworld. I cannot read it and I doubt any of your kind could either.', '', 69276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about this tome?', 'What can you tell me about this tome?', 69275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... what do you want?', '', 69274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has conjured a portal to Stormwind!', '%s has conjured a portal to Stormwind!', 69273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has conjured a portal to the Shrine of Seven Stars!', '%s has conjured a portal to the Shrine of Seven Stars!', 69272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has conjured a portal from Lion\'s Landing to the Skyfire!', '%s has conjured a portal from Lion\'s Landing to the Skyfire!', 69271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If pappy could see me now... runnin\' my own crew in service to the king. He\'d be gushin\' with pride.', 69270, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, you lollygaggers! Let\'s pick up the pace!', 69269, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I documented some special schematics in my journal, but it\'s gone missin\'. We\'ll just hafta make do.', 69268, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Things would go faster with more iron... maybe there are some deposits around here.', 69267, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The crew\'s lookin\' a touch low on fuel. There anything safe to eat in these parts?', 69266, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seems we\'re a little low on oil. Just keep your eyes peeled for snakes and we should be fine.', 69265, 0, 19692, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I am correct, $n, then this... Divine Bell... is exactly the type of weapon that Garrosh is looking for. Return to your other duties for now. I will bring this information to the Warchief myself.', '', 69264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Time to meet your end, invaders!', '', 69263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Squad! Initiate Operation: Cackleberry!', 69262, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, we know just the thing....', 69261, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mercurial Guardian\'s skin becomes as hard as silver!', '', 69260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must let no Horde escape this place. Any ideas?', 'We must let no Horde escape this place. Any ideas?', 69259, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What can I do for ya, $g handsome:missie;?', 69258, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should consider yourself lucky to be doin\' the Boss-Lady\'s chores!', '', 69257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A swarm of Mantid appear from nearby and attack!', '', 69256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have some spare commissions you\'d like to spend? I\'ll take them off your hands.$b$bWhat would you like to buy?', '', 69255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'People are always accusin\' me of using my family connections to get promoted. I choose to see it as using my resources wisely.$b$bBesides, what else would I use my family for?', 69254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not just anyone can be the boss ya know! It takes skill, brains, and of course looks!', 69253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should start chargin\' people to be in my presence.', 69252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It aint easy bein\' this classy, but someone\'s gotta do it!', 69251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shredders used to be so simple to work on. They have this new operating system now though. Darn thing crashes every five minutes!', 69250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These bots are what I will go down in history for inventing.$b$bSure there are a few side effects, but this is at least a better sollution than how we used to handle spiders.$b$bAfter awhile burning down your home just doesn\'t seem practical!', 69249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This rig is a fine piece of machinary. I\'ve actually formed quite the bond with it. I even nicknamed it Bruce!$b$bIt just doesn\'t work right all the time, it\'s a little leaky, and it\'s probably a hazard to anyone within 10 miles of it.', 69248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We all have a job to do, $c. Just, some do it better than others!', 69247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can\'t you see I\'m busy over here!', 69246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My theory is there isn\'t anything that can\'t be fixed with fire!', 69245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They break it and I fix it! It\'s a very symbiotic relationship.', 69244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nice thing about trees is they always grow back. This is what you would call sustained income!', '', 69243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My first field test of this technology went better than expected!  Take this with you, it should be useful against any more swarms you run into.', '', 69242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about the trees. It\'s the circle of life! They grow, we chop \'em down, and then we use \'em to build things!$b$bI guess that\'s less of a circle, and more of a line...', '', 69240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thinkin\' of opening a lumber depot here.$b$bAll these trees just sittin\' around waiting to get chopped down. I would be a fool to pass up this opportunity!', '', 69239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deforestation is such a nasty word. I prefer to think of it as clearing the view!$b$bHow could anyone see the ocean through all those trees?!', '', 69238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We got work to do, $c. This forest isn\'t going to chop itself down!', '', 69237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-What\'s happening? It\'s coming alive!', 'W-What\'s happening? It\'s coming alive!', 69236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mercurial Guardian comes to life!', '', 69235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is to warm and sticky and smells of bad fortune.', '', 69234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, $c?', '', 69232, 0, 19672, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu, Warchief. In the tome of pandaren history, they are written as cruel, relentless leaders. They were feared, not loved.', '', 69231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed? It appears I have much to learn from these \"mogu.\"', '', 69230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me again the names of those who built this kingdom.', '', 69229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just look at this place, Malkorok. THIS is the prosperity that our people deserve!', '', 69228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GG, Horde wins!', '', 69225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GG, Alliance wins!', '', 69224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, report for duty immediately!', 69223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your assistance, $n. As the leader of the blood elves, it is my duty to protect my people. It is not a responsibility to be taken lightly.', '', 69222, 0, 19665, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your assistance, $n. You have helped me enough for today. I shall seek you at Domination Point if I have further need of you.', '', 69221, 0, 19663, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is clear to me that these mogu deserve more investigation. Our work here is done for today, $n. If we have need of you, we will contact you at Domination Point.', '', 69220, 0, 19663, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. And now we know exactly where they are doing so. Well done, $n.', '', 69219, 0, 19664, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $c. These blood elves are actively researching the mogu. It\'s clear that Garrosh is searching for artifacts of power, but we won\'t let him succeed.', 69218, 0, 19662, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not bad, $c. Our work here is finished for today, but stay sharp. I wouldn\'t be surprised if your next orders came from Lion\'s Landing in a few days\' time.', 69217, 0, 19661, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Use dis to heal yourself, mon!', '', 69215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Use dese to heal yourself, mon!', '', 69214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will end you swiftly, $r!', 'I will end you swiftly, $r!', 69213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere with our research!', 'You will not interfere with our research!', 69212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, Alliance scum!', 'Die, Alliance scum!', 69211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you know savagry?!', '', 69210, 39, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face your death!', '', 69209, 39, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! An up close fight!', '', 69208, 39, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Dis cave be lookin dangerous. You three split up, one of you man dis cannon here and de rest of you split up in de caves.', '', 69207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Defiant is mine! Stand down or die!', 69206, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will NOT have Horde on my ship!', 69205, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get... off... my... SHIP!', 69204, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria is ours!', 'Pandaria is ours!', 69203, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be crushed!', 'You will be crushed!', 69202, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 69201, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Alliance is not welcome here.', 'Your Alliance is not welcome here.', 69200, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be purged from this land.', 'You must be purged from this land.', 69199, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little help over here! Somethin\' is wrapped around the propeller!', '', 69198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] It looks like you all could use some help getting through this cave.  I\'ve been working on some modifications to my boat here...', '', 69197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 69196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 6189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have fought by Sarannha\'s side for as long as I can remember. She is fierce in battle, and I watch her back.', '', 69195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I scouted the ruins. The blood elves are here in full force.', '', 69194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So far, so quiet. We\'re lying low around those blood elves.', '', 69193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back at the barracks, I heard murmurings of this \"sha.\"$B$BYou should have heard the crazy stories - sha possessing our strongest troops? Simply tales to scare children.$B$BThe sha are nothing that I and my sisters cannot handle.', 69192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have a bad feeling about the mogu\'s presence.$B$BThere can only be one reason why they\'re excavating these mogu artifacts, and it\'s not for knowledge.$B$BThey\'re looking for clues to the mogu\'s power.', 69191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never been fascinated by ancient artifacts, but this mission has proven more dangerous than I thought.', 69190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t think this mission would amount to much, but the blood elves\' presence has us all on high alert.', 69189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any report from Lion\'s Landing, $c?', 69188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are many o\' us in the Explorer\'s League who stay in the library, cataloguing and analyzing all of our findings.$B$BI spent the last five years doin\' just that while Brann went out into the world, caperin\' from one inneresting site to another.$B$BWell Hilda\'s finally back in the field, and it\'s about time I find somethin\' BIG!', 69187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, are ye one o\' Brann\'s friends? Betcha didn\'t know that back in archaeology school, he used to copy MY notes!', 69186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu are an ancient civilization spanning back thousands of years. Perhaps we can learn somethin\' from \'em!', 69185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe those Reliquary blood elves beat us here? We can\'t let them go on excavatin\' our artifacts!', '', 69184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here on a research and excavation mission. No gettin\' into trouble, I promise!', '', 69183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well, well. $p. I figured I best not be here in person. Don\'t want to give your ambition any ideas.', '', 69181, 40, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria. Land of opportunity. Time to get rich or get bent.', '', 69180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you, Hilda. Mogu mixin\' up with sha? I don\'t like that one bit! We\'d better bring this evidence back to the King. $n, thanks fer yer help today, but we\'ll take it from here!', '', 69179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... according to this codex, the Korune mogu are attempting to harness the very power of the sha. This map shows us their very location! Well done, $n. You have helped us enough for today.', '', 69178, 0, 19663, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Brann, jus\' look at this claw! I have a creepin\' suspicion that these mogu are meddlin\' with some dark magic.', 69177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] We can\'t abuse this power.  A Horde dat would use this isn\'t da Horde I signed up for.', '', 69176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s stabs Vol\'jin in the neck.', '', 69175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] You may have slain my men, but you won\'t stop me, old troll!', '', 69174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look up!', '', 69173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t.... move...', '', 69172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Garrosh told us you couldn\'t be trusted.', '', 69171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] It looks like we\'ve found the source!  Look around and see if you can find what we came here for.', '', 69170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] *weakly* Hurry, flee from here. Tell da Warchief that ol\' Vol\'jin is... dead.', '', 69169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Ohh... this be black magic, mon... this kind of abuse... tis not da way of the Horde. Let\'s leave, quickly.', '', 69168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] This is da place, mon. Look around, tell me what chu find...', '', 69167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... you\'re smarter than you appear, I see.', 69166, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at you! HAH!', 69165, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems as though this cave used to contain powerful Mogu magic.', '', 69164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statue appears to be of an ancient Mogu emperor.', '', 69163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would love to walk on the water.', 'I would love to walk on the water.', 69162, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb the Korune? You shall pay for your insolence!', '', 69161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to the Shrine of Two Moons.', 'The portal to the Shrine of Two Moons.', 69159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Orgrimmar.', 'The portal to Orgrimmar.', 69158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal to Sparkrocket Outpost.', 'The portal to Sparkrocket Outpost.', 69157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can maintain a two-way portal to Sparkrocket Outpost, as well as one-way portals to the Orgrimmar and the Shrine of Two Moons.$b$bWhat kind of mercenary would you like to fuel?', '', 69156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'ve found your precious sceptre. Hurry, take it!', 'I\'ve found your precious sceptre. Hurry, take it!', 69155, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, alright. If you insist.$b$bYou see, $r, legends tell of an ancient mogu artifact in this region - a richly ornamented sceptre. It is said that the one who wields this treasure will have the love and devotion of those who serve him. That or fear and respect, I forget which.$b$bEither way, it couldn\'t hurt. Hmm?', '', 69154, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extend our shaman\'s contract.', 'Extend our shaman\'s contract.', 69153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extend our rogue\'s contract.', 'Extend our rogue\'s contract.', 69152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extend our warrior\'s contract.', 'Extend our warrior\'s contract.', 69151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
