('Extend our priest\'s contract.', 'Extend our priest\'s contract.', 69149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extend our paladin\'s contract.', 'Extend our paladin\'s contract.', 69148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extend our mage\'s contract.', 'Extend our mage\'s contract.', 69147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hire a shaman for a spell haste bonus.', 'Hire a shaman for a spell haste bonus.', 69146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired guards to protect the tower!', '%s has hired guards to protect the tower!', 69145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired guards to protect the graveyard!', '%s has hired guards to protect the graveyard!', 69144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is running out! Tell me!', 'Time is running out! Tell me!', 69143, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has purchased a banquet!', '%s has purchased a banquet!', 69142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fueled a portal to Orgrimmar!', '%s has fueled a portal to Orgrimmar!', 69141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fueled a portal to the Shrine of Two Moons!', '%s has fueled a portal to the Shrine of Two Moons!', 69140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm, perhaps there is something...$b$bWe were just about to dine when you delivered the king\'s command. I imagine a little sustenance might provide some extra energy.$b$bAlso, come to think of it, we could use a little more wood for our spikes. Perhaps you could collect some?$b$bThen... well there\'s... oh, nevermind.', '', 69139, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has fueled a portal from Domination Point to Sparkrocket Outpost!', '%s has fueled a portal from Domination Point to Sparkrocket Outpost!', 69138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a shaman!', '%s has hired a shaman!', 69137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a rogue!', '%s has hired a rogue!', 69136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a warrior!', '%s has hired a warrior!', 69135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a druid!', '%s has hired a druid!', 69134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a priest!', '%s has hired a priest!', 69133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a paladin!', '%s has hired a paladin!', 69132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has hired a mage!', '%s has hired a mage!', 69131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have some spare commissions you\'d like to spend? I\'ll take them off your hands.$b$bWhat would you like to buy?', '', 69130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll never finish in time! Can\'t we make them go faster?', 'We\'ll never finish in time! Can\'t we make them go faster?', 69129, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] It\'s protectin\' dem eggs! Crack its skull, mon.', '', 69128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord prepares to unleash a group of Water Jets!', '', 69127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Kite him through da statis trap, mon!', '', 69126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord calls for help!', '', 69125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Summoner\'s protective magics are active once again.', '', 69124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Summoner is vulnerable for a short time, now\'s your chance!', '', 69123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hero, you must defeat the Dark Summoner\'s minions in order to weaken his protective magic.  Until then he will be invulnerable.', 69122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Use the Guardian\'s Light to stop the Dark Summoner\'s minions!', 69121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jinyu Construction Site Under Attack!', 'Jinyu Construction Site Under Attack!', 69120, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 34768, 34768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Get in da boat, mon!', '', 69119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Boat Ride Over!', '', 69118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Water. I hate water, mon. CALL IN DA BOAT!', '', 69117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, my back! You\'ll pay for that!', '', 69116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrrrggggghhh!', '', 69115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare disturb the Saurok brood? That is punishable by death.', '', 69114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, children, feast on their flesh!', '', 69113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s your turn to die!', '', 69112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This jungle will soon be cleansed of Alliance filth!', '', 69111, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll run every last one of you fools from this land!', '', 69110, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out here, or we start beating these laborers!', '', 69109, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell you, $pr. Come and fight!', '', 69108, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show youselves, Alliance scum!', '', 69107, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tightening the valve.', 'Tightening the valve.', 69105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My... grand creation! How DARE you?', '', 69102, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah- hah hah hah hah haaa!', '', 69101, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, choke on your own hubris!', '', 69100, 0, 0, 23, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! You thought they were hidden, deep in the sands of Uldum...', '', 69099, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Destructobyte, the great usurper! And as you can see, I have found your secret plans!', '', 69098, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all head up the hill, we\'ll check for another entrance.', '', 69096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see no more of my people\'s blood shed meaninglessly. Waste your men if you wish, Warchief, but you will waste none of mine.', '', 69095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take care, Garrosh. You would destroy the Horde to create your perfect future.', '', 69094, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not question my loyalty, Warchief. We came across an ocean to fight for you.', '', 69093, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could have, had we been given any warning. You threw my people to the wolves.', '', 69092, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gave us no warning about the mogu, Warchief. These statues came to life!', '', 69091, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too timid, Regent. Blood is the price we pay to carve our place in this world.', '', 69090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I must pay with some elven blood, then so be it.', '', 69089, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, and with your help, we will pry the secrets from this land. For the glory of the Horde!', '', 69088, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your weakness is not my failing, Regent. My Horde has room only for those strong enough to stand within it.', '', 69087, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was I wrong to assume your Blood Elves could handle themselves?', '', 69086, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here on Pandaria, I see a land that the Horde deserves. We will take it for our own, and if anyone stands in our way, mogu or Alliance, we will raze them to the ground.', '', 69085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no use for cowards in my army. Lately, I have been questioning the blood elves\' courage, and loyalty.', '', 69084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh spouts on about honor and strength, but in truth our leader sees only two outcomes - either fight and survive, or be defeated and forgotten.', '', 69083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has our loyalty not been tested and proven, time and again? All I hear from our Warchief\'s mouth are falsehoods and excuses.', '', 69082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a difference between testing one\'s strength and blindly walking into harm\'s way. Garrosh sent us to do the latter, and this I cannot accept.', '', 69081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought my people here at Garrosh\'s request. Little did I realize we were to be sacrificed like pawns in a game.', '', 69080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will use all the resources at my disposal to expose the source of the mogu\'s power.', '', 69079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under the Warchief\'s orders, we will reveal all of the mogu\'s secrets.', '', 69078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mogu brutes have incredible raw strength.', '', 69077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you see the size of this beast? It took nearly six of us to overpower him.', '', 69076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now where did I put my Windwool Bandages?', 69075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This one is in pretty bad shape.', 69074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhh, this patient needs to rest.', 69073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just a few broken bones and some internal bleeding. Nothing an icepack can\'t fix!', 69072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, I\'ll fix you right up!', 69071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the war, kid.', '', 69064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would have died in the Jade Forest had it not been for a pandaren mistweaver who healed my wounds after the battle.$b$bThese pandaren are good people and deserve our protection from the domination of the Alliance.', 69063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s your escape device.', 'Here\'s your escape device.', 69062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. You\'ve arrived. Now I can get out of here before I throw this goblin into the ocean.', '', 69061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go.', 69060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to get dis thing started?', '', 69059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Dat Saurok be their commander. Take him out, now!', '', 69058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] It seems dere be some Saurok guardin da cave.  Let\'s take care of \'em.', '', 69057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Know what... it be time to be mountin\' up, mon.', '', 69056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] As the Warchief commands...', '', 69055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste my blade!', '', 69054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, squad. Dismissed!', '', 69052, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s a traaaap!', '', 69051, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Khaz Modan!', '', 69050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death comes for ye!', '', 69049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this?!', '', 69048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms!', '', 69047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait \'till ya see me in action!', '', 69046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did I ever leave Goldshire?!', '', 69045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never even got to meet Lady Jaina...', '', 69044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaahhhhhhh!', '', 69043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heeeeeelp!', '', 69042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t wanna die!', '', 69041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is coming! The Horde is coming!', '', 69040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the Horde!', '', 69039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Help!', '', 69038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This fortress will be harder to take than Garrosh\'ar was. But sooner or later, they will break. The Horde always breaks.', 69036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings! I am Tinkmaster Overspark, the chief architect of modern Gnomish Engineering.$b$bOur assembly bay is hard at work fashioning all sorts of great mechanical wonders to aid you in not getting stabbed, slashed, blowed up, or otherwise banished from this realm of existence.$b$bOr at least, not by our enemies.', '', 69035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They crushed us as if we were ants. What monstrous power these mogu have!', 'They crushed us as if we were ants. What monstrous power these mogu have!', 69034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I watched the mogu torture my friends. Thanks to you, I have been spared.', 'I watched the mogu torture my friends. Thanks to you, I have been spared.', 69033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu\'s sorcery is unlike any we have encountered before.', 'The mogu\'s sorcery is unlike any we have encountered before.', 69032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If our reinforcements had arrived, we may have had a chance.', 'If our reinforcements had arrived, we may have had a chance.', 69031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu\'s strength is astonishing.', 'The mogu\'s strength is astonishing.', 69030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero. You have granted me another chance at life.', 'Thank you, hero. You have granted me another chance at life.', 69029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to buy some portal shards.', 'I want to buy some portal shards.', 69028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', '', 69027, 6, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds good.', 'Sounds good.', 69025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Small, one-time portals to a major Horde or Alliance city.$B$BThe shards all washed down the drain together, so there\'s no way for me to know which shard will end up going where. The best I can do is figure out whether they came from Sunreaver portals or Silver Covenant portals. Both sides like to put a little signature in their portal magic - typical elvish flair.$B$BI\'ll sell you shards appropriate for your faction, and you\'ll find out where they go once they\'re stabilized.', '', 69024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblins sure do love their bombs. Let\'s go ahead and show them how a gnome makes a bomb. I\'ll be right back.', '', 69023, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Goblin Bombs? It seems like only yesturday I was getting rid of a pile of goblin bombs. Wait here a moment.', '', 69022, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin bombs. They have one major weakness: Other Bombs. I\'ll be right back.', '', 69021, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Testing, testing, 1, 2, 7. Can you hear me $p? I have deployed Scout-o-meters in the field to gather data for the Siege-o-Matic here. This should help with a proper and mostly non-lethal test of my Siege-o-Matic.', '', 69020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of portals will the shards allow me to open?', 'What kind of portals will the shards allow me to open?', 69019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('-sniff- Woo! The old robe\'s getting a bit ripe.$B$BMaybe I can sneak a bath in that pond tonight...', '', 69018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren make some pretty good hooch, but none of them have heard of my favorite drink.$B$BMaybe I\'ll teach it to them some time...', '', 69017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four months magic-free and it feels great.$B$BWho needs the infinite mystery of the arcane when you\'ve got fresh fruit and hot tea like this?', '', 69016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Discovering the power in these shards gave me the will to drag myself out of the gutter and get my life together.$B$BOh, and also I was kicked out.', '', 69015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better hurry it up! We don\'t wanna be here when the fighting starts.', '', 69014, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swing those hammers, squishies!', '', 69013, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
