('Only a matter of time, now.', '', 68410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ought to rejoice that you even came close to defeating one of my pets.', '', 68409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clearly, I was wrong about you.', '', 68408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you learn from your defeat.', '', 68407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not earned the right to defeat me, tamer.', '', 68406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes even the finest make mistakes.', '', 68405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Capitalizing on your enemy\'s weaknesses is key.', '', 68404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A smart fighter knows when retreat is the best option.', '', 68403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a worthy foe. The day is yours.', '', 68402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The day is mine. Well fought.', '', 68401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see who is the greater tamer.', '', 68400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is going south quick!', 68399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re really plowing through your team now!', 68398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you think I\'m out for the count, think again!', 68397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My entire team\'s been razed!', 68396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew I could count on my team to win!', 68395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My pets are all hand-grown! You don\'t stand a chance!', 68394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!', '', 68393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the stuff!', '', 68392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\'ruk not done yet!', '', 68391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\'ruk...got beaten?', '', 68390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\'ruk\'s the best!', '', 68389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to lay down da beatdown!', '', 68388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are quite powerful indeed.', 68387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All is as it should be.', 68386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Live to fight another day, and prosper.', 68385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done. I applaud your skills as a tactician.', 68384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must go - there are others who have landed on our southern shores.', '', 68383, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not lament. Continue your training, and you shall achieve greatness.', 68382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish you the best of luck.', 68381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall persevere.', '', 68380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the grace of Prince Anduin I shall achieve victory this day.', '', 68379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not through with you yet!', '', 68378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was warned about you. I should have heeded that warning.', '', 68377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another victory for the Alliance military!', '', 68376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the might of King Varian\'s throne, I shall defeat you!', '', 68375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why it no move?', '', 68374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me win?', '', 68373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Me save this one for later.', '', 68372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You good at battling!', '', 68371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me win! Me win!', '', 68370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me go first or you?', '', 68369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for that.', '', 68368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 68367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not rest until I defeat you!', '', 68366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! You miserable wretch! I do not lose!', '', 68365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consider yourself fortunate that I was so merciful.', '', 68364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me? I\'ll show you the true power of the Horde!', '', 68363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was using that.', '', 68362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, it\'ll all be over soon.', '', 68361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unexpected twist.', '', 68360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a most...unfortunate turn of events.', '', 68359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did warn you. Pity.', '', 68358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to regret this, I assure you.', '', 68357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut down in its prime...', '', 68356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we\'re talkin\'!', '', 68355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy, will ya?', '', 68354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you\'ve done it!', '', 68353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shot out of the sky!', '', 68352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull the Mist-Shaman\'s torch out from the ground!', '', 68351, 0, 19175, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail $n, savior of the Vale! Conqueror of the Shao-Tien, and defender of the people! May the stars sing your name!', '', 68350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our war against the mogu is not yet over. But today we can rest, and proclaim our victory.', '', 68349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leven! You\'re alive! That must mean...', '', 68348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the Celestials\' aid, we tore through the mogu advance. Our soldiers were able to clean up the rest, and drive them from the valley.', 68347, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, thanks to $n. Zhao-Jin, leader of the Shao-Tien, is slain!', '', 68346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re flying high!', '', 68345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s take flight!', '', 68344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no! That wasn\'t good...', '', 68343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice! I\'m on my way to victory!', 68342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come back before you get hurt!', 68341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, practice makes perfect I suppose.', 68340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did it!', 68339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember your training, Helena...you\'ve got this.', 68338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An unfortunate business expense.', '', 68337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can forfeit if you\'d like.', '', 68336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been many years since I have seen it manifest so dramatically.', '', 68335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us rout them from your land, and your kind can stand tall and proud with the Horde!', '', 68334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trying to pull a fast one on me, are you? I think not!', '', 68333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So...how about we forget about our little wager and carry on with our busy lives?', '', 68332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll take that gold now, if you would be so kind.', '', 68331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the spectacle begin!', '', 68330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a $c incoming! Don\'t let $Ghim:her; through!', 'Stop $Ghim:her;! $GHe:She; must not get to Doren!', 68329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve blown through the second barricade! Fight them back!', 'They\'ve blown through the second barricade! Fight them back!', 68328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doren just needs a little more time. Hold the line!', 'Don\'t let the horde scum through!', 68327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n? What are you doing here? We need you up on the Skyfire! Quick, take the portal!', '', 68326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to summon |cFFFE9A2EFlamecoaxing Spirits|r! Defeat them to stop the Flame Wall!', '', 68325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came to lend my aid to the fight. Is there anything I can do to help?', '', 68324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $r! Our factions may be at war, but we have greater worries at the moment!', '', 68323, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot hold this barrier forever. Quickly, you must deal with the warlord on the palace steps!', '', 68322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... must... hold on!', '', 68321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am holding the other mogu from entering the palace steps. Hurry!', '', 68320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If we do not defeat the Shao-Tien now, all is lost!', 68318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zhao-Jin the Bloodletter storms the gates! We must stop him from entering the palace vaults!', 68316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beasts of this land aren\'t like whatever it is you have in your home. Train with me so that you may know how to properly skin them.', '', 68315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You aren\'t from around here. Are you interested in learning about the native plant life of Pandaria?', 68314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth has much to offer us, so long as we learn to take from it properly. I can teach you how, if you so wish.', '', 68312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should not fight here. Not like this!', '', 68308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It. Is. PAYBACK TIME!', 68307, 0, 0, 412, 65, 0, 0, 32553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those green dirtbags down there plagued your homes in Southshore, laid siege to your children in Redridge, and massacred every man, woman and child in Theramore.', 68306, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 32552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about our adventures together at the Temple of Chi-Ji.', '', 68305, 0, 19157, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the ship that took down Deathwing. You think some raggedy little Horde outpost stands a chance against the pride of the Alliance fleet? NO!', 68304, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 32551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Men, you\'ve trained for this. You\'re among the elite.  You are Skyfire men!', 68303, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 32550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe that the Alliance\'s future is tied to that of Pandaria.$B$BAfter we landed here, we set certain paths into motion. We were there when the Serpent\'s Heart fell. In a way, we helped fulfill Lorewalker Cho\'s vision of the future.$B$BBecause of this, I cannot return to Stormwind until I have helped to set things right.', '', 68302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen so much during my journey through this land. I feel older and perhaps a bit... wiser.', '', 68301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The more that I travel this land, the fonder I grow of the pandaren people. Such delicious food and drink does not hurt, either.', '', 68300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sentinels and I exchanged stories of our time in the Krasarang Wilds. I told them all about my adventures at the Temple of Chi-Ji.', '', 68299, 0, 19158, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It pained me to see so many displaced from their homes in Kun-Lai. I am very happy we found a safe haven for those in need of protection.', '', 68298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We managed to earn the Celestials\' trust and open the Vale, but we must continue to show them that we are on a mission of peace.', '', 68297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The journey was long, but I finally found the Vale. Now I am working with the Sentinels to understand the pools\' mysteries.', '', 68296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to see what goods you have for sale.', 'I\'d like to see what goods you have for sale.', 68295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My best guess is that the enormous floating fortress deterred any would-be travelers as of late.', 68294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you seek to improve your cooking skill, I have knowledge to share with you.', 68293, 0, 17441, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Set aside your weapon and take up a carving knife, traveler. The Ironpaws can teach you all manner of roasting, brewing, stewing, steaming, and grilling!', 68292, 0, 17441, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re known for trade, where are the pandaren from other towns?', 'If you\'re known for trade, where are the pandaren from other towns?', 68291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! You\'re here! Assault their leader and we will back you up.', '', 68290, 0, 19152, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you like to cook? Well you\'re in luck, because I like to help aspiring chefs.', 68289, 0, 17441, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there traveler, you looking to learn how to cook?', 68288, 0, 17441, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come to the right place! Halfhill Market\'s got everything you need.', 68287, 0, 19144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You here to buy or sell? Feel free to look around.', 68286, 0, 19144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What goods do you have available?', 'What goods do you have available?', 68285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Halfhill Market!', 68284, 0, 19144, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You chose a good day to come to the market, neighbor.', 68283, 0, 19144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a town of brewers and farmers. We hunt on occasion when we need to.$B$BThat\'s where I come in. It\'s awfully hard to hunt without a quality bow!', '', 68282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you tell me anything about your village?', 'Can you tell me anything about your village?', 68281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you currently have for sale?', 'What do you currently have for sale?', 68280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C-c-c-cowards...', '', 68279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who c-c-c-calls?', '', 68278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I want to keep going until we see what\'s over that big wall to the west, but Raj\'ku just keeps staring at all the giant vegetables around here. Maybe deep down, he\'s itching to be a farmer!', 68276, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Raj\'ku and I, we\'ve been traveling for days and days. Just when we think we\'ve seen it all, we\'re surprised again.', 68275, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me and Gunny, we wash up wid a few of our crew near Sri-La Village in da Jade Forest. Our feet was itchin\' to walk da land after months on da churnin\' sea. We came here an\' found paradise.', '', 68274, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen all the goods that I sell? You\'ll have to earn favor with the Tillers to buy them from me, but in order to do that, you\'ll need to gain more experience by traveling this land.', 68273, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, that house that Farmer Yoon lives in is a dump! He should talk to Tina. I hear she\'s real good at redecorating.', 68272, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you ever thought about adding some animals to your farm?', 68271, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen Merchant Greenfield\'s supply of seeds? There are all sorts of strange and wonderful things you can grow on your farm.', 68270, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Folks \'round here are always in need of a hand, but you\'re not strong enough yet. Once you\'ve walked more o\' this land, you come back and they\'ll be begging you for aid.', 68269, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Folks \'round here are a little wary of strangers, but they warm right up once you get to know them.$B$BOnce you\'re more experienced, you can get to know them by helping them out.', 68268, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look a bit weak, $r. You\'ll need to travel more of the land before you\'re strong enough to help the folks out here.', 68267, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, stranger. You getting along all right at the farm?', 68266, 0, 19124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shiny tools mine! Tasty carrots mine! All for Kunzen. All for Chief Yip-Yip!', '', 68265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why didn\'t you return to Stormwind with the SI:7?', 'Why didn\'t you return to Stormwind with the SI:7?', 68264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could not bear to sit in Stormwind Keep while my people\'s blood spills here!$B$BPandaria has so much to teach us. There is great power here. Power that could save thousands of lives.$B$BAnd I aim to find it.', '', 68263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the SI:7 found me, they wanted to take me home. I ran away.$B$BIt wasn\'t long before the Horde found me.$B$BDuring the battle at Serpent\'s Heart, I managed to slip away in the chaos. A merchant allowed me to ride with his family as they fled west, to Zhu\'s Watch.$B$BIt was there that I met Mei Barrelbottom.$B$BShe told me of the Crane Wing order, and on her advice I accompanied a courier to the temple to seek an audience with Chi-Ji, the Red Crane.$B$BI was studying with the disciples there when the sha arrived.', '', 68262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you end up here?', 'How did you end up here?', 68261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I brewed the tea wrong? Yes, that must be it. I brewed the tea wrong. My apologies.', '', 68260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It should be beautiful. It should be pristine!', '', 68259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... That\'s not right...', '', 68258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
