('Your will is strong, but it seems mine was stronger.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again.', '', 68154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not know what the ultimate consequences will be. Nobody does.', '', 68153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If it is war you mean to bring to our shores, the very land itself will respond to your passions and your violence.', '', 68152, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 32577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems your efforts to defeat me have failed.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again.', '', 68151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems my strength proved too much for you.  Speak with me when you are ready to try again.', '', 68150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
