('I can\'t wait to grow up!', '', 68143, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather what the villagers are willing to sell us and prepare the others to leave.', '', 68142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! We will relocate shortly. These creatures have destroyed most of what was left from the ship.', '', 68141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those are the casualties of war!', '', 68140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can you remain neutral after watching them blow us out of the sky?!', '', 68139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A war we did not have until you arrived!', 68138, 0, 19072, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will bring more destruction to our village!', 68137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well what about the bombs that landed in our farms from your warship!', 68136, 0, 19072, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should we allow them to stay here? They have wounded to tend to.', '', 68135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help. Try not to blow anything else up!', '', 68134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help. I\'ll make sure this Honeybrew gets back to the village. Try not to blow anything else up!', '', 68133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m very sorry, but I no longer have relics to sell you. Their magic seems to have extinguished! Perhaps I\'ll go into dancing full time now, it would be a nice change of pace.', 68132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should get moving. That Honeybrew isn\'t going to find itself!', '', 68131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, this way! The cannon fire has opened a passage to the courtyard!', '', 68130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Honeybrew is the lifeblood of this village. Now THAT is something worth fighting for!', '', 68129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My village will not enter your conflict. Though, I fear your arrival has changed our peaceful existence forever.', '', 68128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions will no doubt attract the attention of the Shado-Pan. I may even get to meet one!', '', 68127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you brought your war to our land? What of your homes? Was there nothing worth fighting for there?', '', 68126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A minor inconvenience.', '', 68125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up now while you still have the chance!', '', 68124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those are Horde vessels... General quarters! Get our birds in the air. Clear the decks. Stations, people. Let\'s go to war!', 68123, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 32545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen such a magnificent being?', '', 68122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were on our way to Dawn\'s Blossom for a festival before you arrived! When I imagined fireworks tonight, I didn\'t expect it to be like this!', '', 68121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only delay us. We cannot be stopped.', '', 68120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeydew Village is run by the Honeydews, but the real heart of the village is the brewery! The brewery belongs to my family, the Honeypaws. Best Honeybrew you\'ll find anywhere!', '', 68119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps now you\'re ready to see things my way?', '', 68118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot possibly comprehend the forces stacked against you.', '', 68117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is it you can\'t just talk out your differences? I have never encountered a problem that a good long talk couldn\'t fix!', '', 68116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde, Alliance... what\'s the difference?! Do you not both love a good brew? Do you both not value your friends and families the same?', '', 68115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
