('But your farm is lookin\' pretty good. You know if you make friends with the folks around here, they might give you stuff to fancy it up even more.', '', 67936, 0, 19067, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrible, but don\'t tell him I said so. Vermins is running everywhere. Crops ain\'t growing. And something keeps eating the harvest.', '', 67935, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, isn\'t that Mung-Mung coming up the road?', '', 67934, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Yoonie! It\'s me, Mung-Mung!', '', 67933, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello Mung-Mung. How\'s everything at Mr. Mudclaw\'s farm?', '', 67932, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All manner of strange creatures are just ... falling from the sky!', 67931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get started.', 'Let\'s get started.', 67930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Klaxxi have spoken. The Empress must fall.', '', 67929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A valiant effort, but not enough.  Speak to me when you are ready to try again.', '', 67928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the trainer I\'ve heard about. Tell me, do you fear defeat?', '', 67927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coward!', '', 67926, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 32523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to The Heartland!', 67925, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Settle yourselves in first. You\'ll be able to farm your fields, but I\'m afraid you\'re too inexperienced to continue further. Once you\'ve seen more of Pandaria, be sure to stop by.', 67924, 0, 13442, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Settle yourselves in and come by the market any day if you are looking for work.', 67923, 0, 54164, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are four other votes you\'ll need to get, but that\'ll come in time.', 67922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Listen, since you two did such a good turn by helping me out, I\'m casting the first vote to help you join the Tillers.', 67921, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey Farmer Yoon!', 67920, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cooks are always looking for fresh vegetables. Anything you grow on your farm, you can use for cooking or sell to other cooks.', 67919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, you sure saved my hide with those scallions.', 67918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come walk with me, $n. I would like to pay Farmer Yoon a visit.', 67917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Gina! Didn\'t expect a visit from you.', '', 67916, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember to take your Bag of Wu Kao Supplies!', 'Remember to take your Bag of Wu Kao Supplies!', 67915, 0, 19055, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s could not see his prey!', '', 67914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_tigersroar.blp:20|t %s hides and prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:131271|h[Leap from Shadows]|h|r!', '', 67913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though the peak is safe, the areas around it are not.  Be more careful!', '', 67912, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to walk with Kil\'ruk?', 'Are you sure you want to walk with Kil\'ruk?', 67911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you show me the chamber beneath Klaxxi\'vess again?', 'Can you show me the chamber beneath Klaxxi\'vess again?', 67910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want to show me, Kil\'ruk?', 'What do you want to show me, Kil\'ruk?', 67909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to seriously rethink your definition of help lady! You\'re dangerous with that stick!', '', 67908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need more time to prepare the mixture, $n. I\'ll let you know when it\'s ready.', '', 67907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll meet you back in the village.', '', 67906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s summons |cFF298A08Sra\'thik Workers|r to his aid!', '', 67905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, it sounds like the Kunzen hozen are causing quite a lot of trouble for Mr. Mudclaw. Maybe we can help.', '', 67904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hui\'s earth magic even brought Kiri\'s jade lion statue to life!\n\nIt ran off to who knows where...', '', 67903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t think I could have held them off much longer.\n\nYou have my gratitude!', 67902, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hui\'s curse even turned some of our famous Greenstone Brew against us!\n\nHis minions stole what little wasn\'t affected.', 67901, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This village was built with Hui\'s approval, but that was many generations ago.', 67900, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see?\n\nHui cursed Greenstone Quarry\'s jade and transformed it into those monsters.', '', 67899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the forest\'s lovely flowers were turned against us...', 67898, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Generations of your people have passed as I\'ve prepared for this day.', '', 67897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anyone with such a talented green thumb needs to be a Tiller. I don\'t care what that hare-brained grandson of mine says! Haohan is wrong about Farmer Yoon. You have my vote, $n.', 67896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world...all worlds...will burn!', '', 67895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we understand how Ragnaros has affected the lesser denizens of Hyjal, we may better understand how to repair it.', '', 67894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s anyone that\'s an expert on rocks and stones, it\'s a dwarf!', '', 67893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, I could just leave you up there!', 67892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey you got yourself stuck there! I\'m just trying to help!', 67891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you want to stay stuck in the tree?!', 67890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are in no position to complain about the help you are receiving!', 67889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much whining! You would think I was trying to kill you!', 67888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh stop complaining and grab the stick!', 67887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These cabbages have convinced me, $n. Anyone who can grow produce like this belongs in the Tillers. I\'m casting my vote for you and Farmer Yoon. See you back at your farm in a bit.', '', 67886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You scum will NOT destroy this land as you defiled Kalimdor!', '', 67885, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 32466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mung-Mung impressed, $n. You help me without asking for anything in return. That\'s what being a Tiller is all about. I\'ll meet you back on your farm. Mung-Mung will give you his vote.', '', 67884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve beel afflicted with Master Hsu\'s Deadly Poison.  Detox yourself to remove it!', '', 67883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh hey $n... Gina\'s a voting member of the Tillers, so... try and make a good impression, okay?', '', 67882, 0, 13442, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that we\'re acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks \'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends. Unfortunately, you\'re too green to help them out or give gifts yet, so get stronger first!', 67881, 0, 13442, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Manifestation of Terror has appeared on the battlefield!', '', 67880, 0, 19022, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shox\'tik has entered the battlefield!', '', 67879, 0, 19022, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Akkolon has entered the battlefield!', '', 67878, 0, 19022, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your doubts and hatreds have wrought havoc all throughout these ruins. Clean up after yourselves and meet me in the village below - I will do my best to explain.', '', 67877, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not our desire to get wrapped up in your bloodshed. Now have your men lower their weapons, or you will face TWO enemies on this continent.', '', 67876, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger - your own doubts have been made manifest. Pandaria is not like whatever land you come from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here.', '', 67875, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 32574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We bring only our honor and the desire to crush our enemies. Have your kind been aiding the Alliance?', '', 67874, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Bear-creature. What kind of sorcery was this?', '', 67873, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They all must die.', '', 67872, 0, 18961, 0, 71, 0, 32760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is - no - NO! They had an airbase, a hidden airbase... my ship - my - Hellscream will have my head!', '', 67871, 0, 18961, 1, 71, 0, 32525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done.  Your training is now complete.  Come see me in the Shrine of the Ox for your reward.', '', 67870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit pokin\' me with that thing!', '', 67869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch it lady! I\'m very fragile!', '', 67868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! What\'s with the stick?!', '', 67867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch it!', '', 67866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough with the stick already!', '', 67865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey lady! Watch it would ya!', '', 67864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you, too, have braved the perils of Kota Peak. You have proven yourself worthy to do battle with me.', '', 67863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is all that is to be said. Come, take your reward. And remember what you have learned today.', '', 67862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The wisest among you will do the same.', '', 67861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Old Ones ever return, we mantid will once again stand by their side.', '', 67860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your gods are not our gods, outsider.', '', 67859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell you now, because you have earned this warning.', '', 67858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His last terrible breath has haunted this land ever since, but the shadows he left behind are mere whispers of his former glory.', '', 67857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the usurpers came - the ones you call \"Titans\" - Y\'shaarj was destroyed.', '', 67856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear.', '', 67855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y\'shaarj.', '', 67854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn\'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub.', '', 67853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With each generation, we grow ever stronger.', '', 67852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each cycle, our young swarm their walls. The pandaren slay the weak. The strong return.', '', 67851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mantid are an elder race. The pandaren you associate with - they are but children. They have their role to play.', '', 67850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are to be rewarded. Walk with me.', '', 67849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wakener, your deeds have earned you the trust of the Klaxxi.', '', 67848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forward! The Klaxxi reveal themselves as traitors. Decimate them, and leave nothing behind.', '', 67847, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Unscathed,\" indeed.', '', 67846, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kl-kl-kl-kl-klagh!', '', 67845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The desperate Klaxxi have resorted to digging up fossils. Very well: let us finish this.', '', 67844, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blaspheme!', '', 67843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Klaxxi are to be disbanded, by the will of the Empress.', '', 67842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your \"Empress\" has fallen. The Klaxxi have pronounced judgment. Stand aside or be brushed away.', '', 67841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Vizier Zor\'lok, voice of the Empress.', '', 67840, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak your name puppet, that our annals will be complete.', '', 67839, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 30911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treasonous Klaxxi... her magnificence was right about you.', '', 67838, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who holds this swarm? Show yourself! Answer to the Klaxxi.', '', 67837, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going down!', 'You\'re going down!', 67836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is within the most sacred realm of Pandaria that you will now face your most difficult challenge.', 67835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Braving these wastes has made my pets undefeatable.', '', 67834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have spent countless hours preparing for this battle.', '', 67833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This year\'s harvest yielded more than just crops!', 67832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mo\'ruk gonna beat ya!', '', 67831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must do everything we can to protect the shrines and temples of my people.', 67830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well partner, I got some bad news for you. You can come back every day to plant and harvest your vegetables, but you\'ll need more experience before helping me join the Tillers Union. But don\'t forget - you\'re welcome here on the farm any time!', '', 67829, 0, 13442, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well partner, looks like you\'re ready to work this farm on your own. Come back every day to plant and harvest vegetables if you like. If we work hard, we might even be able to upgrade this place!', '', 67828, 0, 54164, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just remember, real crops will take a day to grow, so after you\'ve tilled and cared for your plants, come back the next day to harvest your bounty!', '', 67827, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First packet of seeds is on the house! Come back to me anytime you want to buy more seeds, ya hear?', '', 67826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not falter! We will soon unite with our ancient mogu allies!', '', 67825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave no stone unturned in our search!', '', 67824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep these ruins secure at all costs!', '', 67823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel them, the spirits of long dead Mogu!', '', 67822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hidden power lies here, and we must reveal it!', '', 67821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your conflict will have immense consequences here. Do NOT bring your war to these shores!', '', 67820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we will not participate in this... race war... bloodbath of yours.', '', 67819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your conflict will have immense consequences here. Do NOT bring your war to these shores!', '', 67818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we will not participate in this... genocidal... bloodbath of yours.', '', 67817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your training is complete for today.  Return tomorrow and we will continue.', '', 67816, 0, 18973, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gong peals a taunting note to the mantid armies below, accelerating the pace of their assault.', '', 67815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch these mercenaries closely, brothers!', '', 67814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your flea ridden paws out of the food, you mangy beasts!', '', 67813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard these supplies with your lives, you filthy mutts!', '', 67812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break any of these supplies, and I\'ll break your skull!', '', 67811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder you lazy mongrels, or I\'ll roast you alive!', '', 67810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those ropes tied down, team! We need this drake secured immediately.', '', 67809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n, would you like to learn how to acquire and work with the various metals found around our land?', '', 67808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike them down, and I become more powerful than you can ever imagine.', '', 67807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, you are one step closer to the real challenge.', '', 67806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was but a trainee.  The will of a master is stronger!', '', 67805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was weak, but I am stronger!', '', 67804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that \"Wisdom lights the path.\"$b$b...But wisdom never kept me from stubbing my toe at night.', '', 67803, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The temple must not fall!', 67802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not be caught in the middle of your war for any longer than we can help it. You may stay here and tend to your wounded, but that is the end of our involvment.', 67801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well it was peaceful until you arrived.', 67800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are not interested in your war, outsider. This is a peaceful village.', 67799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your airship just about took out our balloon!', 67798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sister and I haven\'t seen this much activity in Honeydew since, well ever!', 67797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All I wanted to do today was harvest my crops. Instead, I\'m wrangling prowlers!', 67796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want my help? I\'m a little busy trying to restore the peace that you disrupted.', 67795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My assistance?! You want my assistance?! I will not be part of your petty fighting.', 67794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is in need of your assistance.', 'The Horde is in need of your assistance.', 67793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well isn\'t this just a fine mess?', 67792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collecting Honeybrew Barrel', '', 67791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have pets, too. We fight?', '', 67790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bask in the glory of the Alliance, $r. Know today that you stand no chance of defeating me!', '', 67789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will fight with honor and valor for the glory of the Alliance!', '', 67788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re on!', 'You\'re on!', 67787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cool stuff will happen here! Explosions!', '', 67786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the brew... gone...', '', 67785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you so blind that you would continue this war?', '', 67784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that this is just the beginning.', '', 67783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every action creates a reaction. Do you see what your actions have created?', '', 67782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions will have grave consequences if you do not move from your path of war.', '', 67781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next ten orcs I kill are gonna be for you, friend.', '', 67780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mishka\'s gonna take good care of you, you hear me?', '', 67779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to do right by these people if we want a chance at understanding this land.', '', 67778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These bandages are filthy. Let\'s get you cleaned up.', 67777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His pulse is stable, Mishka. But it\'s weak.', '', 67776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, bud. You\'re going to be okay.', '', 67775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One approaches Morulu...', '', 67774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day I\'m going to explore the whole world, and my pets are coming with me!', '', 67773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C\'mon, you guys. We can do this. Fly!', '', 67772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will attack from the opposite side, $c. The alliance won\'t expect a ground assault this quickly. Find me when the slaughter is over.', '', 67771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me find these crawling inside me.', '', 67770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clever tricks, but do you really assume I only have one set of weapons to fight you with? I have been waiting for a worthy opponent to use my poison coated swords against.', '', 67769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 67768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the time we are done here, the Alliance will wish they had never set foot on this land.', '', 67767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have not even begun to see the fury of the Horde!', '', 67766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will claim this land in the name of the Horde, or die trying!', '', 67765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Alliance scum will learn what it is to anger the Horde!', '', 67764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not let others fool you. Dragons are weapons of war; nothing more.', '', 67763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ribbit', 'Ribbit', 67762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s unsafe to wander through the forest alone, don\'t you think?', '', 67761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t earned my wings yet, but neither have my pets!', '', 67760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But our orders stand - Hellscream will have his foothold here. We will NOT allow the Alliance to lay claim to this new world!', '', 67759, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 32512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a hostile land, and we have no reinforcements. We\'re going to have to improvise, champion.', '', 67758, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are not afraid to fight. Our warriors, while few in number, are extremely skilled.', '', 67757, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you afraid to fight?', '', 67756, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 32510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people have stood tall without you for thousands of years.', '', 67755, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 32572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You again. Do you see it now? Alliance arrogance!', '', 67754, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your foe was overwhelmed by a dark energy we call the\"Sha.\" It thrives on negative emotions, such as doubt.', '', 67753, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 32571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this... shadow? What is the Alliance playing at?', '', 67752, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 32508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished him - well done!', '', 67751, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 32507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader is still in hiding. Find him!', '', 67750, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 32506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caw!', 'Caw!', 67749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apothecary, may I have some more of your Dit Da Jow?', 'Apothecary, may I have some more of your Dit Da Jow?', 67748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEHOLD MY POWER!', '', 67747, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 32684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem willing to clean up your mess, outsider. Maybe we can help each other.', '', 67746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to have misplaced Dog\'s Whistle.', 'I seem to have misplaced Dog\'s Whistle.', 67745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I understand perfectly. I have eyes. But Pandaria is not like whatever land you came from; it lives and breathes. You should be careful what kind of energy you bring here. Now put those weapons away!', '', 67744, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t understand - we\'re fighting a war here-', '', 67743, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the place to explain. In short, your own doubts have been made manifest, as a consequence of your actions.', '', 67742, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are from the Alliance, and mean you no harm. Tell me, what was that shadow you drew out of me?', '', 67741, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Men, stand down - this is one of the natives.', '', 67740, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 32671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You beasts! What sort of madness is this?', '', 67739, 0, 0, 5, 71, 0, 32562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some decisions have dire consequences.', 67738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
