('Left to their own devices, the Horde will overwhelm your land. Will you not help us fight them?', '', 67709, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen your sky-fortress. Your people have an interesting notion of \"peace.\"', '', 67708, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
