('', 'Target acquired. Light it up.', 67688, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 32534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The winds of Outland speak of calm and peace.', '', 67687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
