('Spend a few years of yer life with Sulfuras over yer head, and you\'ll learn tae appreciate the lava beetle\'s resilience.', '', 67680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most people hate swamps, but I know that they hold great secrets just beneath the murky surface.', 67679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, now. Don\'t be scared. Brave heroes are fighting the sha right now. And as long as I\'m here, nothing will hurt you.', 67678, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are the sha going to come in here?', 67677, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m scared!', '', 67676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be stupid! The sha are dangerous!', 67675, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I go out and fight the sha, too?', '', 67674, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The defenders of the temple are hold strong on the ground, while the Order of the Cloud Serpent fights from above. Working together, we will dispel the sha from our home.', 67673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our battle is most difficult, Tai-Feng. The sha of doubt is subtle and insidious. Once the dark seed of doubt is planted, only one of strong mind and heart can remove it.', 67672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many great conflicts have occurred in these swamps. I can still feel the lingering energy.', 67671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The guardians of the temple are few, but their spirits remain strong. I believe we can defeat the sha and expel them from our temple, but it will be a long and difficult battle.', 67670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even as we speak, Taran Zhu and the Shado-Pan march west. When they find the sha, justice will be done.', 67669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It matters not how the sha broke free of their ancient prisons. We must plan a course of action forward. How can we dispel them again from our land?', 67668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not fear, Tai-Feng. Yu\'lon is strong. She will break free of the sha\'s corruption, I know it.', 67667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
