('I am studying the life of this area for...research purposes.', '', 67650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Warbringer approaches! Fall back!', '', 67649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like that very much, Chi-Ji.', 'I would like that very much, Chi-Ji.', 67648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You hear Chi-Ji speaking in your mind.>$b$bLet me assist you to get to the top of the pavilion, my friend.', '', 67647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do, Chi-Ji.', 'I do, Chi-Ji.', 67646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You can hear Chi-Ji\'s voice echoing in your mind.>$b$bI sense that you need my help to get to the top of the dome.', '', 67645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the skies!', '', 67644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, please, Chi-Ji.', 'Yes, please, Chi-Ji.', 67643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Chi-Ji\'s voice fills your mind.>$b$bDo you need help getting to the top of the pedestal, $n?', '', 67642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How you doin\', sugar?', 67641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You aren\'t hot enough to handle me!', 67640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t let you get away with that!', 67639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your pet is a cold, ruthless killer!', 67638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You handle the cold better than I thought.', 67637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shattered!', 67636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re snowballing out of control! You don\'t stand a chance now!', 67635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take a break and chill, sweetie. You\'ll get your turn again soon.', 67634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ouch! I just got burned!', 67633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you, sugar. You aren\'t hot enough to handle me!', 67632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to knock you out cold!', 67631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am defeated.', 'I am defeated.', 67630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nooooo! My precious snakes!', 67628, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take that!', 67627, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try this guy on for size!', 67626, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No way! I will get you next time!', 67625, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You never stood a chance against me and my lovely snakes!', 67624, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My snakes are pretty right? ...RIGHT?', 67623, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you\'re a battle pet trainer, $r. How about you test your skills against the might of a Grimtotem?', 67622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalimdor belongs to the Grimtotem. Nobody can stand in our way.$B$BWe are supreme in all things, as you will now see as I crush your pathetic team.', '', 67621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demons are the future of this world. The sooner you embrace that, the sooner you join the winning team.', '', 67620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sargeras will live once more!', '', 67619, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to accept the Master\'s gift? Will you be blessed by his loving wrath, or consumed by it like all of the others?', '', 67618, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Master, protector of all life, will soon blind all of the heretics and grants us immeasurable power!', '', 67617, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of you must work to aid in the great revival of our Master. Only through Him may we usher in eternal peace for all!', '', 67616, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master shall rain hellfire upon Azeroth, and then we will at last cleanse the Light from this wretched world!', '', 67615, 8, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to beat you very, very slowly.', '', 67614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The marsh out here smells almost as bad as Onyxia\'s breath!', '', 67613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t had a real adventure until you\'ve skipped through Onyxia\'s whelp pits!', '', 67612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can ya believe Onyxia just left these sitting around in her egg pit? I\'m going to make a fortune!', '', 67611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'m concentrating... can you bother someone else?', '', 67610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who ever said machines aren\'t natural? My pets are at least 50% natural!', 67609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wings give us the freedom to soar.', 67608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The roads of Kun-Lai are cold, dangerous, and unforgiving. But there is little satisfaction - or profit! - for deals easily concluded.', '', 67606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that was a big one, that loooked like it hurt!', '', 67605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I accompany the Shado-Pan to chronicle their many deeds beyond the wall. It is not easy - I do not wish to lose any of my journals in the chaos of battle!$b$bIt has happened before. The Lorewalkers have been cataloging pandaren history for many ages. Their notes are scattered throughout Pandaria. I am certain that if you were to assemble them, the Lorewalkers would be most appreciative!', '', 67604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for that drink now.', 'I\'m ready for that drink now.', 67603, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have a few moments to spare?', '', 67602, 0, 0, 6, 68, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch!  I guess that one was a little bigger than I thought...', '', 67601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa, I think I\'ve got a big one...', '', 67600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', '', 67599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see if I can fix you up...', '', 67598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should really be more careful...', '', 67597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW! Not again.', '', 67596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are carrying too much brew. Return to the Brewing Cauldron to turn in what you have.', 'You are carrying too much brew. Return to the Brewing Cauldron to turn in what you have.', 67595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What came over me?', '', 67594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A warlock! He couldn\'t have ported far - there must be another base.', '', 67593, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By our sweat and your blood, this land WILL be ours!', '', 67592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I don\'t know what\'s inside, either.', '', 67591, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are you waiting for?  The initiates need your help!', 67590, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you greatly, friend.', 'I owe you greatly, friend.', 67589, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will make these beasts pay...', 'I will make these beasts pay...', 67588, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s smirks at $n.', '', 67587, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never again.', 'Never again.', 67586, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The horrors I witnessed...', 'The horrors I witnessed...', 67585, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion\'s agents whisper quietly to one another.', '', 67584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just gather what we need and let him figure it out. Are you ready? Let\'s move.', 67583, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe they\'ve known all along. Maybe that\'s why they\'ve stayed hidden.', '', 67582, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think the pandaren realized what they were sitting on here?', '', 67581, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the wikket!', '', 67580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steal jab-jab from wikket!', '', 67579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No hozen num nums for you!', '', 67578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spent enough time with clumsy XX here that I\'ve picked up a thing or two about treating injuries.  Perhaps I can pass some of that along to you?', '', 67577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not fear you, $r. You would be wise to fear me...', 67576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $n.  Are you interested in the mystical art of Inscription, or perhaps the intricacies of Herbalism?', '', 67575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hellscream\'s armies will paint this land red!', '', 67574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me browse your wares.', 'Let me browse your wares.', 67573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetins $n.  You want to learn the art of workin with leather?  I also got a fine selection of crafted goods if that\'s whatcha need.', '', 67572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll make a fine corpse, $c.', 'You\'ll make a fine corpse, $c.', 67571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
