('I thought I smelled something...', 'I thought I smelled something...', 67559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', 'Hey!', 67558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, Horde scum!', 'Die, Horde scum!', 67557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to the Horde!', 'Death to the Horde!', 67556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your filthy hide out of our base!', 'Keep your filthy hide out of our base!', 67555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria will be ours, mongrel!', 'Pandaria will be ours, mongrel!', 67554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory to the Alliance!', 'Victory to the Alliance!', 67553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horde invaders! Men, to arms!', 'Horde invaders! Men, to arms!', 67552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks! I don\'t like the Horde.', 'Thanks! I don\'t like the Horde.', 67551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss my family. I miss my home!', 'I miss my family. I miss my home!', 67550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Papa! I\'m coming home, Papa!', 'Mama! I\'m coming home, Mama!', 67549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know the way home. Thanks, $gmister:lady;!', 'I know the way home. Thanks, $gmister:lady;!', 67548, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought those eyes would NEVER leave me alone!', 'I thought those eyes would NEVER leave me alone!', 67547, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can... can I go home?', 'Can... can I go home?', 67546, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I thought I\'d be here forever...', 'I... I thought I\'d be here forever...', 67545, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me OUT OF HERE!', 'Get me OUT OF HERE!', 67544, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving.', 67543, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally... something worth fighting.', '', 67542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still, beast!', '', 67541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t move, $r!', '', 67540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, that\'s it... stand right there...', '', 67539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll put a bolt through that thick skull of yours!', '', 67538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready to die, $r.', '', 67537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not what he was expecting at all.', '', 67536, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes these goons make it too easy.', '', 67535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*Yawn*', '*Yawn*', 67534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that supposed to hurt?', 'Is that supposed to hurt?', 67533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not very good at this torture thing.', 'You\'re not very good at this torture thing.', 67532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That doesn\'t even tickle.', 'That doesn\'t even tickle.', 67531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all you got?', 'That\'s all you got?', 67530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can understand he\'s upset, but this attack is simply going too far!', 67529, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites.', 67528, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many thanks!', 67527, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many thanks! $B$BThe local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites. $B$BI can understand he\'s upset, but this attack is simply going too far!', 67526, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please hurry!  I must stay and tend to the wounded.', 67524, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank the Light you\'re here, $n.  Something has gone horribly wrong and our leader is killing everyone!', 67523, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want a piece of me?', 'You want a piece of me?', 67522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it on, jerk.', 'Bring it on, jerk.', 67521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh.  Mr. Big Mean Mogu.  I\'m so scared.', 'Oooh.  Mr. Big Mean Mogu.  I\'m so scared.', 67520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow.  That really hurts.  Not.', 'Ow.  That really hurts.  Not.', 67519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go, General.', 'I\'m ready to go, General.', 67518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare yourself, $n.$b$bWe\'ll be entering a target-rich environment!', '', 67517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This land has endured much, and yet it thrives in the wake of the worldbreaker. You will find that my pets possess similar fortitude.', 67516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid snake. I said shoot fire!', '', 67515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightwind! Take your men and scout the interior. Look for a Horde presence. And find Prince Anduin!', '', 67514, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 32442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Improvise.\" Humph.', '', 67513, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 32441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godspeed.', '', 67512, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 32440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Admiral.', '', 67511, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 32439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I supposed to do until then? I\'ve got no men! We don\'t know where the Horde are, or how many we\'re dealing with!', '', 67510, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 32438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 67509, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 32437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Catherine. It\'s good that you\'re here: With full carrier support we can push north-', '', 67508, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe you can recruit some of the locals. I\'ll leave the situation here in your capable hands.', 67507, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 32558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Put on your big-boy pants, Taylor. I will leave the SI:7 officers with you. I suggest a scouting mission.', 67506, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 32557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been ordered back to the main battlegroup to provide carrier escort. The full might of the Alliance navy will arrive in two months\' time.', 67505, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 32556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m afraid you\'ll have to push forward without us.', 67504, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 32555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Admiral! It\'s good to see that you are okay.', 67503, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 32554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.  I have a fine selection of brews available for you.  If you are interested, I can also teach you to make your own.', '', 67502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brews do you have available?', 'What brews do you have available?', 67501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are my favorite teacher ever!', 'You are my favorite teacher ever!', 67500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Smash! I said smash!', '', 67499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land will be your grave.', '', 67498, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn, Alliance scum! BURN!', '', 67497, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They defied us - they defied Hellscream\'s Horde - I should\'ve executed the whole town!', '', 67496, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s something about this land - you don\'t understand...', '', 67495, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance \"hero.\" Let\'s see how you fight without a flying warship to cover your back!', '', 67494, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you two going to order anything?', 'Are you two going to order anything?', 67493, 0, 54167, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', 'No.', 67492, 0, 54167, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watched you investigating the ship and dealing with those creatures down there. Good work. You find anything?', '', 67491, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must focus on your training!  Try again!', 67490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He is creating a new world for us. He is not... making a salad!', 67489, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You crazy! Girl, YOU CRAZY!', '', 67488, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW!', '', 67487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the warchief!', 'For the warchief!', 67486, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory or death!', 'Victory or death!', 67485, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!!', 'FOR THE HORDE!!', 67484, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...There\'s definitely something going on here. Before we return, perhaps we should collect some of the enlarged vegetables they grow in this region?', '', 67483, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s similar to a pattern I once noted in Sholazar Basin.', '', 67482, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How very strange. I wouldn\'t call these waters enchanted, but there\'s a faint residual energy.', '', 67481, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You be feelin\' dis fight for a long time.', 67480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That doesn\'t make any sense. Doublecheck your work.', 67479, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My pets speak to me. They tell me stories late at night.', 67478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on important business for his majesty.$b$b\"Need to know\" buisness. And you don\'t need to know!', '', 67477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just like an angry rabbit... except bigger... and toothier.', '', 67476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like how it\'s looking at the pumpkins...', '', 67475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is as close as we can get. See what you can find out!', 67474, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re clear. Let\'s keep moving.', 67473, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First you must prove yourself against my assistants.  Defeat them, and then you may face me.', '', 67472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people have an interesting practice of arrival to someone\'s home.', '', 67471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen many things in my life, but never have I encountered a creature as strange as you.', '', 67470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not trust you, $r.', '', 67469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was a simple town to oversee for my father. We spent some days growing crops, others brewing. Once a year we would travel to other villages to trade. It was a life that we all enjoyed.$B$BNow, the echoes of war bounce all around us, and we must navigate these troublesome times with care. I only hope we may find a resolution quickly.', '', 67468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Level two grappling is done. Now to tighten up level three...', '', 67467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... a cherrywood drive-shaft? Who does that?!', '', 67466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait and see, lads. We\'ll have ourselves a fine killin\' machine in no time.', '', 67465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeesh! Me great nan could build a more reliable manifold than this. An\' she has!', '', 67464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this - total amateur hour! Doesn\'t even have a second-stage turbine blade.', '', 67463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve always wondered when outsiders would breach out shores, and so now you have come.', '', 67462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you come here with armaments of war? What goal could you possibly have in your coming here involving war and bloodshed?', '', 67461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have known nothing but peace for so long, I don\'t know how anyone is going to handle the arrival of war on our shores.', '', 67460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s mumbles to himself while tinkering with the shredder.', '', 67459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pretty sure this \"valve\" is a toenail. Goblins...', '', 67458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come here?', '', 67457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see... if I just uncrank the fuel-chugger here...', '', 67456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do your people hate the other outsiders so? I do not understand it.', 67455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your flying death machine is a sign of the end times.', 67454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah, this thing\'s a death trap!', '', 67453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that your arrival here will upset the land\'s delicate balance.', 'I fear that your arrival here will upset the land\'s delicate balance.', 67452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may not be warriors by trade, but we will do anything to save our home and our land.', 'We may not be warriors by trade, but we will do anything to save our home and our land.', 67451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you bring war and bloodshed to our land? Pandaria is a place of peace.', 'Why do you bring war and bloodshed to our land? Pandaria is a place of peace.', 67450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A monk\'s training never ceases. There is always a higher step to reach with both body and mind.', '', 67449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would gladly give my life to ensure the safety of Honeydew Village. Its legacy is my own.', '', 67448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family has guarded this town for generations. I pray that I will be able to uphold their legacy.', '', 67447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! Fire!', 'Fire! Fire!', 67446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, don\'t bring your battle here. We have no part in it!', 'Please, don\'t bring your battle here. We have no part in it!', 67445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we lose our crops we\'ll lose our brew!', 'If we lose our crops we\'ll lose our brew!', 67444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do we do? We\'re losing everything!', 'What do we do? We\'re losing everything!', 67443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bow to me and we shall begin.', 67442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have not known war here for a very long time. I hope for the good of us all that we may find peace soon.', '', 67441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are not the first dark times we have endured. There is always a light at the edge of the shadows.', '', 67440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a very intriguing sort, $c. What longing in your heart has brought you to Pandaria? Is it the thirst for adventure? The thrill of battle? Or perhaps something more?', '', 67439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you have learned to control your own actions, you must learn to control your opponent to gain the upper hand.  An opponent may expose a weakness when trying to heal themselves, allowing you an opportunity to interrupt them.  This can mean the difference between a victory and defeat.', 67438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sometimes a well timed precision strike is all you need to take down even the toughest of foes.', 67437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some enemies gain most of their power from the weapon that they wield.  Me? I prefer both a large weapon and inflicting deadly poisons on my enemies.', '', 67436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes the best defense is to prevent your opponent from acting against you.', '', 67435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a monk, your reflexes are among your greatest resources.  Often, the ability to think and move quickly can save your life.', '', 67434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to me and we shall begin.', '', 67433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all problems can be solved with your fists.  Sometimes you must center yourself and channel your energy towards a distant target.', '', 67432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A well-timed application of force to a pressure point will stop an opponent in their tracks, regardless of what they are doing.  Use this to your advantage to avoid dangerous attacks.', 67431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feh! You\'re not welcome here!', '', 67430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to depart.', 'I am ready to depart.', 67429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Skyfire has had a complete overhaul since our encounter with Deathwing! We now carry a full complement of both fixed-wing and gyro aircraft as well as a battery of 18-inch smoothbore shore bombardment cannons.$b$bThe Horde won\'t be able to hide from her reach. Not on land, not at sea, not in the air.', 67428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just give me a little more time, I can fix it. I know it.', 67427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bow to me and we shall begin.', 67426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please hurry. I want to get going.', 67425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t have a choice! We need to alert the other villages of what\'s going on here!', 67424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It isn\'t ready to fly yet, sister!', 67423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brew coming through!', '', 67422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let him through! That strapping young pandaren is saving a keg of Honeybrew!', '', 67421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the roads, the brew runner is coming!', '', 67420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to get the brew to safety. My brews are the lifeblood of this entire town!', '', 67419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in times of great strife like these, food is always needed and appreciated. It makes the hours I spend cooking well worth it.', '', 67418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many people forget that a fine brew has equal application in cooking as it does for drinking! There\'s nothing in all of Pandaria quite like my famous Honeydew glazed fish!', '', 67417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Food is essential to life. Even a brave $c such as yourself can take the time to sit down and enjoy the essence of life!', '', 67416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where did you obtain such exquisite armor? Can I...touch it?', 67415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 24, 0, 0, 1, 0, 39653),
('', 'Care to lay down and rest for a time? Surely that sounds better than fighting.', 67414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my...that is an impressive weapon.', 67413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 24, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honeydew Village is ill-prepared for battle. I hope this fighting ends soon!', '', 67412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are not warriors. I produce only tools and light weaponry for hunting.', '', 67411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow tired of this village. I wish I could travel and see the world. Maybe when I\'ve saved up enough gold, I\'ll go on my own epic adventure!', 67410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a bluff south of here that would make a fine farm. It overlooks a gorge. You may be right, stranger.', '', 67409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why not regrow your farm somewhere else? I\'m sure the other villagers would help you.', 'Why not regrow your farm somewhere else? I\'m sure the other villagers would help you.', 67408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stray bomb from the firefight destroyed my farm. How am I supposed to survive like this?', '', 67407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are known for trade, not war. Would you like to see what I have for sale?', 67406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have no quarrel with your people. Would you like to sample our wares?', 67405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take one step closer and I\'ll...I\'ll...attack! I swear!', '', 67404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children will not know war if I have anything say about it!', '', 67403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll defend my home with my life!', '', 67402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look as though you have endured much. Please, let me know if there\'s anything you\'d like to purchase to aid you in your travels.', 67401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps we could arrange the sale of some of our remaining goods for your gold? We\'ll need to purchase food and water from other villages now if we\'re to survive.', 67400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sinan, may I please have the Wings of Hope again?', 'Sinan, may I please have the Wings of Hope again?', 67399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make their deaths quick! We have much to do!', '', 67398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show them the might of the Trolls!', '', 67397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rip the flesh from their bones!', '', 67396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surround them! Let none escape!', '', 67395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you have defeated them, help your allies collect Jungle Brew for Bo!', '', 67392, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final wave of hozen ships has come to attack!', '', 67391, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.', '', 67390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.', '', 67389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am defeated.', '', 67388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.', 67387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done.  Remember that swiftness of mind and body can keep you alive.', '', 67386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to challenge you.', 'I wish to challenge you.', 67385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to challenge you.', 'I wish to challenge you.', 67384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to challenge you.', 'I wish to challenge you.', 67383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I\'m the other Cheng. No relation. \n\nYes, I am a monk, though I always dreamed of being a demon hunter.', '', 67382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to challenge you.', 'I wish to challenge you.', 67381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hight is always going on about the \'sheep tons\' of work we have to do. See if you can get him to say it. It\'s like a drinking game.', '', 67380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to challenge you.', 'I wish to challenge you.', 67379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like to see fellow monks in pain. But I\'ll get over it.', '', 67378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to think it was priests that were overpowered. Now I think it\'s rogues.', '', 67377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like to offer my competitors something nice to eat. Before I crush them.', 67376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will continue to monitor the mogu\'s activity, $n. However, I am afraid that what lies ahead will require greater strength than you currently possess. Return to us when you have gained more experience.', 67375, 0, 13442, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve dabbled in various forms of restorative magic, from the power of the tides to the might of the divine, but my true calling will always be to the grace of the mists.', '', 67374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well look what we have here. Our first keg of recovered brew! I\'ll take this one, folks.', '', 67373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m used to fighting off the small ones...', '', 67372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack if it tries to cross this bridge!', '', 67371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever you do, don\'t look like a carrot!', '', 67370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay still and I don\'t think it\'ll attack us!', '', 67369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Mischievous Snow Sprite emerges from the Suspicious Snow Pile.', '', 67368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would do well to not disrupt this fancy fancy ritual.', '', 67367, 168, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a very fancy ritual.', '', 67366, 168, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us go! The barrels are out in the orchard.', '', 67365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Courage, Teng! The Applebloom family cider is at stake!', '', 67364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may not be a warrior, but I will protect my home and family!', '', 67363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must protect the brew!', '', 67362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get... out... of... my... orchard!', '', 67361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeaaaarrrghhh!', '', 67360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from here, trespassers!', '', 67359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am no warrior, but I, too, will help defend Paw\'don Village!', '', 67358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders, all of you! Out!', '', 67357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Ah, such troubling thoughts. Our last emperor advised us not to live in the shadow of fear. Do you see now why we love to drink and celebrate?', '', 67356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We do not wish to enter your conflict. But I fear that when war is on the horizon, peace is not a choice.', '', 67355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
