('Can... can I go home?', 'Can... can I go home?', 67203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can leave now?', 'I can leave now?', 67202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $g mister:lady;! That guy smelled.', 'Thanks, $g mister:lady;! That guy smelled.', 67201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, outsider.$b$b<Zin eyes you warily.>', '', 67200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outsiders are rare here. Rarer still are outsiders who arrive on a floating ship of death.', '', 67199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again for your aid, $n. Our children have returned safe, and your enemies have turned tail.$b$bAs far as I\'m concerned, you and your Horde are always welcome here in Pandaria.', '', 67198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hesitant to ask an outsider for help. Still, if you\'re offering...', '', 67197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I win this round. Better luck next time.', '', 67196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have bested me fairly. Well done.', '', 67195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is better to face your challenges, than to run from them.', '', 67194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin. Good luck.', '', 67193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PH - My attention is elsewhere. Please speak to me in a moment.', '', 67192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just as I expected. You are too weak to defeat me!', 67191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? I... I lost? Auuugh! I\'ll have to work harder to beat you!', 67190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Running away? Come face me again when you have found your courage.', 67189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see who is stronger serpent rider.', 67188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m busying showing this rookie the back of my fist!', 67187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! Suchi wins this round.', 67186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Running away? I guess I\'m pretty scary after all!', 67185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Darnit, I lost! Oof... I feel tired...', 67184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel a rush of energy coming on. Let\'s do this!', 67183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey $n, I\'m in the middle of something right now. I need to concentrate!', 67182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This used to be a peaceful brewing village. Now, the horrors of war have already robbed our children of their innocence.$B$BTake your war elsewhere, $r.', '', 67181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Hsu has inflicted you with a deadly poison! Use Detox to remove it.', '', 67180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last newcomers stole our children. What are you here for? Our wives? Our ale?', '', 67179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What matter of creature are you? So strange...', '', 67178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May our ancestors protect us from these outsiders and their violent ways.', 67177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no running away from a challenge.', '', 67176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I win this time. It seems that you are the one who needs more training.', '', 67175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost again! I\'d better keep training.', '', 67174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master Kistane is about to get healing from a Jade Serpent Statue.  Use Spear Hand Strike on her and defeat her before she can heal herself again!', 67173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bowing out so soon? I knew you weren\'t up to the challenge!', '', 67172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, I\'m a little pre-occupied at the moment. This is my chance to show off for the ladies. Talk to me after I\'ve won this fight!', '', 67171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n caused Retaliation.', '', 67170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t it beautiful? Such grace it has, as it dances in the sky. One day, I hope to be as graceful as the crane.', 67169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing is good for the soul, but crabbing is good for the belly!', '', 67168, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need more focus.  Try again!', 67167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your attacks are strong, but my defenses are stronger!', 67166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy! I\'m a little busy at the moment. Talk to me when I\'m done creaming this rookie!', '', 67165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our village is small, but my family has been producing Pandaria\'s finest cider atop these hills for generations.$B$BI want nothing more than for peace to return so that we may collect our harvest and reunite with our children.', 67164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see which one of us is the better student. I challenge you to a duel!', 'Let\'s see which one of us is the better student. I challenge you to a duel!', 67163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Roars.>', '', 67162, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 28232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s both do our best!', '', 67161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww, I knew you\'d win! I\'d better practice some more...', '', 67160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ground beneath your feet lives and breathes. It may hold you steadily right now, but bring war and suffering here and it will respond in kind. Such is the way of nature.', '', 67159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explore Pandaria, but be cautious. This land holds great bounty and danger alike to the unwary.', '', 67158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, the winds spoke of newcomers to our village. I feel that we will learn much from each other, so long as our minds are open and our spirits pure.$B$BPerhaps your people will be more respectful of mine than the Horde was.', '', 67157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jor Jor hails from the Valley of the Four Winds. Born a farmer\'s child, he left his home to come here when he heard of your arrival. He believes himself a warrior, but I can assure you he is but an arrogant youth, longing for the thrill of combat without ever having endured its horrors.', '', 67156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of Jor Jor? He seems to protect the mayor.', 'What of Jor Jor? He seems to protect the mayor.', 67155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the sole protector of this village. My name is Chut Sri Nu.$B$BI bid you welcome, but know that my meditation has shown me that your travels here will bring great change to this land. Let us both hope that you leave Pandaria better off than you found it.', '', 67154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should we trade with you? How are you any different than your Horde friends save the color of your banner?', '', 67153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your power is impressive.  I admit defeat.', 67152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I win this round, rookie!', '', 67151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive! I\'m going to have to watch out for you.', '', 67150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right, ladies! Watch this!', '', 67149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Maolin.', 'Thank you, Maolin.', 67147, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are welcome here, $r. Please, make yourself at home. There is plenty of food and ale, and there\'s a bed upstairs if you need to rest.\n\n<Maolin smiles warmly at you.>', 67146, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Duyi looks at you, beaming with pride.>', '', 67145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to me and we shall begin.', '', 67144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, Duyi. What have you got there?', 'Wow, Duyi. What have you got there?', 67143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imma healin.', '', 67142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That is an awfully impressive weapon for someone that comes in peace, stranger.', 67141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Duyi the Fish Snack! Hah!', 67139, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe we should feed YOU to that fish!', 67138, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My goodness, Duyi. What have you been feeding that thing?', 67137, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be careful with that thing, Jun-Jun! One strong gust of wind could carry you into the sea!', 67135, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'m going to follow the clue and see where it leads me!', '', 67134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do that. I bet it\'s just going to lead you in a giant circle and you\'ll never find the answer!', 67133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good idea!', '', 67132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s crazy talk! See, this is why we shouldn\'t leave the village!', 67131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t be ridiculous. It\'s just a jar full of bugs. It\'s gross if you ask me.', 67130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Waaaaauughh!!', 67129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What letters? Oh, the ones on the lid? It\'s probably just someone\'s intials. It doesn\'t mean anything.', 67128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just don\'t get it! This could be a herald to the end times!', '', 67127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has to be a message! Maybe even a clue to something important!', '', 67126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found this jar of bugs in a shack in the middle of Kun-Lai. I didn\'t think anything of it until I saw the letters...', '', 67125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, Fran, it looks like I somehow lost your watering can.  May I have another, please?', 'Um, Fran, it looks like I somehow lost your watering can.  May I have another, please?', 67124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imma runnin away.', '', 67123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A rogue bomb from the battle flew towards us. I survived, but...my husband...', 67122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 18, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('Please, don\'t cry. What happened next?', 'Please, don\'t cry. What happened next?', 67121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...ter...', 67120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband wanted to see what was happening down by the water. That\'s when...when...$B$B<Elder Yoon Su begins to sob uncontrollably.>', 67119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s wrong?', 'What\'s wrong?', 67118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gy... ro... cop...', 67117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why...why him? We are simple farmers...what did we do to deserve this?', 67116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m out of ideas. Gyrocopter Attack?', 67115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s just try the Gyrocopter Attack again!', 67114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you!', 'I challenge you!', 67113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gyrocopter Attack!', 67112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to all who dare challenge my empire!', 67111, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 29283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for the Tillers quartermaster, Gina Mudclaw\'s your girl. She\'ll be running the market at Halfhill.$B$BLet me mark her location on your map.', 'If you\'re looking for the Tillers quartermaster, Gina Mudclaw\'s your girl. She\'ll be running the market at Halfhill.$B$BLet me mark her location on your map.', 67110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan quartermaster can be found at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark their location on your map.', 'The Shado-Pan quartermaster can be found at the Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark their location on your map.', 67109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('San Redscale is the quartermaster for the Order of the Cloud Serpent.$B$BYou can find him at The Arboretum in The Jade Forest.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 'San Redscale is the quartermaster for the Order of the Cloud Serpent.$B$BYou can find him at The Arboretum in The Jade Forest.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 67108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek Tan Shin Tiao. She can be found in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu\'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 'You seek Tan Shin Tiao. She can be found in the Seat of Knowledge, above Mogu\'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 67107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, I\'m afraid I know little of the Klaxxi, but I have heard whispers of their city, Klaxxi\'vess, far to the west in the Dread Wastes. Perhaps you can find the Klaxxi Quartermaster there.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Hmmm, I\'m afraid I know little of the Klaxxi, but I have heard whispers of their city, Klaxxi\'vess, far to the west in the Dread Wastes. Perhaps you can find the Klaxxi Quartermaster there.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 67106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He can be found walking around the steps of Mogu\'shan Palace, here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark his location on your map for you.', 'Ah, you seek Jaluu the Generous! He can be found walking around the steps of Mogu\'shan Palace, here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark his location on your map for you.', 67105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to talk to Teng Thundermalt! He can be found at the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds.$B$BLet me mark the location on your map for you.', 'You need to talk to Teng Thundermalt! He can be found at the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds.$B$BLet me mark the location on your map for you.', 67104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 'The August Celestials quartermaster can be found here in the Vale. Sage Lotusbloom stands with the other faction representatives, in the lower section of The Golden Terrace.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 67103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here you go, Su-Shi. You\'re my best friend!', '', 67102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking to find the Anglers Quartermaster? That would be Nat Pagle. You can find him at the Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.$B$BLet me mark the location on your map for you.', 'Looking to find the Anglers Quartermaster? That would be Nat Pagle. You can find him at the Anglers Wharf in Krasarang Wilds.$B$BLet me mark the location on your map for you.', 67101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You like it here, don\'t you Su-Shi?', '', 67100, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s okay. I think he likes it there.', '', 67099, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He outgrew his bowl, so now we keep him in this pond!', '', 67098, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('But papa said I fed him too much, so he got fat.', '', 67097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uncle Deming got me a goldfish for my birthday. He calls it Su-Shi.', '', 67096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The valor quartermaster, Commander Oxheart, can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 'The valor quartermaster, Commander Oxheart, can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark her location on your map.', 67095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can trade your marks of justice with Commander Lo Ping, who can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 'You can trade your marks of justice with Commander Lo Ping, who can be found at Niuzao Temple in the Townlong Steppes.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 67094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Honor Quartermaster can be found on the Serpent\'s Spine, the great wall to the west.$B$BI will mark their location on your map for you.', 'The Honor Quartermaster can be found on the Serpent\'s Spine, the great wall to the west.$B$BI will mark their location on your map for you.', 67093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find the Conquest Quartermaster and the Glorious Conquest Quartermaster on the Serpent\'s Spine to the west.$B$BI will mark their location on your map.', 'You can find the Conquest Quartermaster and the Glorious Conquest Quartermaster on the Serpent\'s Spine to the west.$B$BI will mark their location on your map.', 67092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Safe journey, traveler!', 67091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to stop by again soon!', 67090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the winds be kind to you!', 67089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take care, friend!', 67088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, what quartermaster are you searching for? Perhaps I can help you find them.', 'Ah, what quartermaster are you searching for? Perhaps I can help you find them.', 67087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transmogrification and Void Storage services can be found in your home city.', 'Transmogrification and Void Storage services can be found in your home city.', 67086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogo, I need another Pot of Fire.', 'Ogo, I need another Pot of Fire.', 67085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, looking for your class trainer? Unfortunately none of them have made it here to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BYou can return to your home city to find those.', 'Oh, looking for your class trainer? Unfortunately none of them have made it here to the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BYou can return to your home city to find those.', 67084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no battlemasters here in the Vale.$B$BYou must return to your home city to queue for battlegrounds or arenas of war.', 'There are no battlemasters here in the Vale.$B$BYou must return to your home city to queue for battlegrounds or arenas of war.', 67083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t see what you need in the city?$B$BWhat are you looking for? Maybe I can help you find it.', 'Don\'t see what you need in the city?$B$BWhat are you looking for? Maybe I can help you find it.', 67082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The faster you race, the better your prize.', 67081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The stakes will be high.', 67080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Victor Pearce sells his wares in the chamber of masters. I will mark the location on your map.', 'You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Victor Pearce sells his wares in the chamber of masters. I will mark the location on your map.', 67079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to Han Flowerbloom at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.$B$BI will mark his  position for you.', 'If you seek to learn more of the herbalism arts, I suggest you speak to Han Flowerbloom at the Halfhill Market in the Valley of the Four Winds.$B$BI will mark his  position for you.', 67078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That concludes our lesson.', 67077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, fly UNDER the finish line!', 67076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the finish line. After you have flown through all 10 checkpoints, fly under the finish line to lock in your place.', 67075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember, in a real race, you will compete against the other trainees in the Order.', 67074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have shown you part of the course. Now, let us see the finish line. Follow me!', 67073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may find that other paths are faster.', 67072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pennants mark the race course, but you will not be penalized for finding other routes.', 67071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember - fly through 10 checkpoint flags, then fly under the finish line.', 67070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could use another emergency buoy, Arie.', 'I could use another emergency buoy, Arie.', 67069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haven\'t had much luck. I think it\'s my bait.', '', 67068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see them wiggling around in the water, but they aren\'t biting!', '', 67067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not much so far, but the day is young.', '', 67066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They do that all day.  I get exhausted just looking at them.', 67065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t come crying to me when you fall and scuff your knees!', 67064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, these kids never run out of energy!', 67063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', '', 67062, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It feels so good to stretch my limbs!  It was cramped in there.  They really should invest in more roomy cages!', '', 67061, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve made a mental note, mogu are light sleepers.  Pass the word.', '', 67060, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What took you so long?  I almost thought they weren\'t going to send someone for me this time... my heart frowned a little.', '', 67059, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the last time I\'ll let them catch me, promise.', '', 67058, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ren bet me that I couldn\'t steal one of the mogu cannons.  I didn\'t think they\'d be so heavy!', '', 67057, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was relieving myself into one of the golden pools when they caught me.  I guess you could call it a karma capture.', '', 67056, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I\'ve been stuck in these cages watching the mogu a lot, but I\'m pretty sure I\'ve never seen a girl mogu.  What\'s with that?', '', 67055, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be glad I didn\'t marry you for your fishing skills...', 67054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wouldn\'t mind that you wasted each day if you caught a few more fish.', 67053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s a kiss for good luck, I think you\'re going to need it.', 67052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 17, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you\'re fishing... again.  Are you doing better than yesterday?', 67051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any luck today?  You haven\'t brought any back yet.', 67050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So I take it you aren\'t having any luck?', 67049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting rusty... and my lockpicks are too apparently.  Do me a favor, don\'t let Ren know you found me here, kay?', '', 67048, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet, slave! You\'re worth just as much dead as alive.', '', 67047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Open the portal to Kun-Lai Summit, you fools! Quickly!', '', 67046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master cannot wait any longer for these artifacts.', '', 67045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get these slaves to Kun-La Summit! Open the portal!', '', 67044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die like the rest, slave!', '', 67043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t catch me Lo!', 67042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m barely even trying!', 67041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
