('You must be seeking Zen Master Lao! He is working at the Setting Sun Garrison in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 'You must be seeking Zen Master Lao! He is working at the Setting Sun Garrison in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BI will mark his location on your map.', 67014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
