('These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?', 'These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?', 67000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.', 'Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.', 66999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
