('I\'m from the Horde. We\'re here to save you and rebuild your village.', 'I\'m from the Horde. We\'re here to save you and rebuild your village.', 66994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
