('Derenda Enkleshin carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Derenda Enkleshin carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the chamber of masters, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, so you\'re an up and coming chef, are you? You can find everything you need from Barleyflower. She sells her wares in the keggery.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Ah, so you\'re an up and coming chef, are you? You can find everything you need from Barleyflower. She sells her wares in the keggery.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Initiate, may I have another quiver please?', 'Initiate, may I have another quiver please?', 66973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to get those arrows and get out of here.', '', 66972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for some brew, eh? The Keggary is the place to go for fine ales! I\'ll mark it on your map.', 'Looking for some brew, eh? The Keggary is the place to go for fine ales! I\'ll mark it on your map.', 66971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blacksmiths all work in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The blacksmiths all work in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tomb of Conquerors is directly below you. Follow the dirt path to the entrance. You must hurry!', '', 66969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter\'s hall. I will mark the location on your map.', 'You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter\'s hall. I will mark the location on your map.', 66968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vendors from all over the land have found their way into the city. What are you looking for?', 'Vendors from all over the land have found their way into the city. What are you looking for?', 66967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tracker Lang, the stable master, can be found on the main terrace before you enter the main building. He stands next to the pet battle trainer.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Tracker Lang, the stable master, can be found on the main terrace before you enter the main building. He stands next to the pet battle trainer.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a battle trainer by the name of Gentle San who trains her pets out on the main terrace.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'There is a battle trainer by the name of Gentle San who trains her pets out on the main terrace.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The inn is located on the main floor, to the right as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The inn is located on the main floor, to the right as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skydancer Shun can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map.', 'Skydancer Shun can teach you how to fly in Pandaria. He rides his cloud serpent on the main terrace. I will mark his location on your map.', 66962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flight master is located out on the main terrace, at the top of the twin stairs and before you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The flight master is located out on the main terrace, at the top of the twin stairs and before you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bank is located on the second floor, on the left side of the building as you enter.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The bank is located on the second floor, on the left side of the building as you enter.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 66960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
