('Do you like my snakes? I get the feeling they don\'t like you!', 'Do you like my snakes? I get the feeling they don\'t like you!', 66916, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think you\'re doing?! No matter - I no longer need the staff.', '', 66915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay Ancient Spirits to empower the Staff of Pei-Zhi!', 'Slay Ancient Spirits to empower the Staff of Pei-Zhi!', 66914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The central courtyard is heavily guarded. We\'ll go around.', 66913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take care. The temple grounds are patrolled by mogu and their saurok slaves, and their beasts lurk in the grass off the roads.', 66912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They were taken towards a waterfall to the southeast. I\'ll lead you there.', 66911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We were investigating the temple when a mogu warlord and his retinue arrived.$B$BThose of us not slain immediately were taken prisoner.$B$BI was left for dead and have been hiding here since.$B$BI don\'t know what the mogu are here for, though it can\'t be anything good!', 66910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you lead us to the prisoners?', 'Can you lead us to the prisoners?', 66909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the expedition?', 'What happened to the expedition?', 66908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful! If they see you, they\'ll raise the alarm.$B$BDid the Golden Lotus send you to rescue us? I\'m the only one not dead or captured...', 66907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A furious Orchard Needler appears above you!', '', 66906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice spirit - I think I\'ll take it.', '', 66905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is only the beginning of your punishment!', '', 66904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold still, it will be over soon...', '', 66903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will cleave the soul from between your bones!', '', 66902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! Your fate is sealed!', '', 66901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will join the others in eternal servitude!', '', 66900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a jar waiting just for you!', '', 66899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A lively spirit for the taking...', '', 66898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 66897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shan... will take you...', '', 66896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender your spirit to a stone body!', '', 66895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such insolence!', '', 66894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us! Our army will lead the coming storm!', '', 66893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The body fails... but the spirit... can endure...', '', 66892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will free you from that pitiful form and reforge you in our service!', '', 66891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another restless spirit...', '', 66890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare to cross the Shan\'ze?!', '', 66889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won\'t need that body where you\'re going!', '', 66888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you follow my blade?', '', 66887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of all the wild serpents, the onyx serpent is the rarest. These elusive black cloud serpents are known to lay their eggs on Windward Isle to the northeast.$B$BIf you come across any Onyx Eggs, please bring them to me. I shall reward you handsomely.', 66886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The wild cloud serpents breed very rarely, and as such, each egg is extremely precious.$B$BIf we do not work to help and protect the wild cloud serpents, they may one day disappear.', 66885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like to keep an eye on all of my students. I will watch your progress eagerly.', 66884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A long journey is best traveled one step at a time.', 66883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treat your cloud serpent with kindness and respect, and it will grow to trust you.', '', 66882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new student? Ah yes, very good. Have you spoken to Elder Anli?', '', 66881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen many students over the years, but there is something different about you.', '', 66880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, the hatchlings are quite safe here.', '', 66879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r.$B$BI am but a young sapling, grown here in Pandaria to become one with the land so that Tyrande may benefit from the stories it holds.The Strongbows have volunteered to protect me in my infancy so that our mistress\' wishes are fulfilled.', '', 66878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, partake in the buffet laid out by the Golden Lotus as a thanks to your people for their aid in protecting the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', 66877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mograine...', 66876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot join you this day, friends. I must prepare my fish for the coming feast!', 66875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost.', '', 66874, 0, 13118, 11, 65, 0, 29674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost.', '', 66873, 0, 18353, 0, 65, 0, 29674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never have enough... shoes...', '', 66872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just wanted... one more... pair...', '', 66871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Our precious collection!', '', 66870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noooo! That\'s my favorite pair!', '', 66869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing!? Don\'t touch those!', '', 66868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away, shoe stealer!', '', 66867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooo! Precious shoes!', '', 66866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Few people know this, but I was once a pit fighter myself. A gladiator for the Horde\'s amusement. So I know a thing or two about martial combat.', '', 66865, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleaning', 'Cleaning', 66863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instill me with your wisdom, Advisor.', 'Instill me with your wisdom, Advisor.', 66862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only love can drive out hatred.', '', 66861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Violence may appear to do good for a time, but the evil it does will remain forever.', '', 66860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The early bird gets the worm, but the patient pandaren receives a hearty brew.', '', 66859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you judge a fish by its ability to climb a tree, it will live its life believing it is inadequate.', '', 66858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oftentimes, the silent grasshopper knows how to best avoid the boot.', '', 66857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engaging total destruction sequence. Good bye.', '', 66856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will write of your adventures right now!', 66855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My apologies, Advisor. I did not recognize $Ghim:her;!', 66854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jenji! This is $n, of course. Have you not heard of $ghis:her; deeds as of late? $GHe:She; has done much for our people.', '', 66853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, so that\'s who you are. I\'ve already heard stories of your deeds, $N. I will write stories about you so that you will be remembered, you have my word.', 66852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My name is...', 'My name is...', 66851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A historian\'s work is never done, you see. There\'s always something important happening that we will need to remember.$B$BI\'m beginning to collect the history of your people\'s coming here. What is your name, so that future generations may read your story and know your tale?', 66850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goodbye...', 66849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All of you have my deepest thanks. With the Focusing Iris removed, this lifeless bomb is merely a sickening testament to Garrosh\'s brutality. The winds of change blow fiercely; Azeroth is on the brink of war. My apologies, but you must excuse me... I have much to consider. Farewell.', 66848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you afraid of spiders? Some feel them crawling on their skin as they wander through the endless woods.', '', 66847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll clear the ruins of Horde while you work.', 'We\'ll clear the ruins of Horde while you work.', 66846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a farm once, but that was a long time ago. I prefer a good battle, don\'t you?', '', 66845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
