('', 'The Horde will pay for what they\'ve wrought here.$B$BOnce I reclaim the Focusing Iris from this... abomination... Garrosh will know the true meaning of destruction.$B$BOrgrimmar... will DROWN.', 66844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Have you sheen the rum? ...hic! I can\'t sheem to find it anywhere!', '', 66843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you afraid of spiders? Some feel them crawling on their skin as they wander through the endless woods.', '', 66842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I began to fear that no help would come. That everyone had forgotten me. Thank the Order that they sent you!', 'I began to fear that no help would come. That everyone had forgotten me. Thank the Order that they sent you!', 66841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While I was trapped in that web, I had such feelings of doubt and despair. You have freed me from my own fears.', 'While I was trapped in that web, I had such feelings of doubt and despair. You have freed me from my own fears.', 66840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did not think that help would come. You have given me new hope, stranger.', 'I did not think that help would come. You have given me new hope, stranger.', 66839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Orgrimmar.', 'Take me to Orgrimmar.', 66838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Stormwind.', 'Take me to Stormwind.', 66837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I only caught two rabbits. Now I have lots!', 66836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had a farm once, but that was a long time ago. I prefer a good battle, don\'t you?', '', 66835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was finished. Thank you, and thank the Order. I can get out of here on my own.', 'I thought I was finished. Thank you, and thank the Order. I can get out of here on my own.', 66834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other victims... they made such awful sounds. Thank you for coming to my rescue!', 'The other victims... they made such awful sounds. Thank you for coming to my rescue!', 66833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Order of the Cloud Serpent send you? Bless them. Please help the others!', 'Did the Order of the Cloud Serpent send you? Bless them. Please help the others!', 66832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was fishing along the coast when the spiders got me! Thank you for saving me.', 'I was fishing along the coast when the spiders got me! Thank you for saving me.', 66831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the sea, stranger! I can get back to Sri-La village on my own.', 'Thank the sea, stranger! I can get back to Sri-La village on my own.', 66830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who needs friends when you have cats?', 66829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double fortune to you, $r.$B$BIf you are looking for a lucky charm, I can help set you right up.', '', 66828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Double fortune to you, $r.$B$BIf you are looking for a lucky charm, I can help set you right up.', 66827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never leave Theramore alive!', '', 66826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s so much knowledge of the ancient world stored here that we\'re only just now discovering!', '', 66824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"And that is how the shining blade came to, and left, Pandaria, its final destination unknown.\"$B$BOur people\'s lore is a woven quilt of rich stories. It is my job to bind the tomes so that they may last a thousand lifetimes.', '', 66823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We rowdy!', '', 66822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We grow better!  You bad!', '', 66821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AYEEEEEE!', '', 66820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rake in face!', '', 66819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahahaha!', '', 66818, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Away from our crops!', '', 66817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will offer you accomodations for as long as you are of use to us.', '', 66816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am surprised the Klaxxi\'va allowed you to live, but it is not for me to question.', '', 66815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may stay while you are still useful, outsider.', '', 66814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can find a way into our sleep chambers, you may use them.', '', 66813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I get you a refreshment?', 66812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would be nice to leave the Vale some day, but it\'s so pretty here!', 66811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Shoes off of the table! AND FEET!', 66810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I haven\'t seen Tweets in a while, I hope she\'s ok!', 66809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someday, I want to be an explorer!', 66808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I could really go for one of Uncle Gus\' jokes about now, this place is scary!', 66806, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to ask Tina to come with me next time, she\'d LOVE these plants!', 66805, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shh, jinyu. It\'s hard enough to fish here as it is!', '', 66804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '2...', 66803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '1...', 66802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh...uh...', 66801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '41,814...', 66800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '41,813...', 66799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '41,812...', 66798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doctor is in!', 'The doctor is in!', 66797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 49768, 49768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until next time, my friends.', '', 66796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Young Dustback Mushan cries for help!', '', 66795, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, friends! Let us all enjoy a fine brew.', '', 66794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! MY SHIP! Who did this?!', 'What?! MY SHIP! Who did this?!', 66793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ship... NO! Did everyone escape? Gather here!', '', 66792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you very, very much.', '', 66791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the ship?!', 'What happened to the ship?!', 66790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there beautiful, I\'d like to make a withdrawal.', '', 66789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ship\'s aflame!', 'The ship\'s aflame!', 66788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! FIRE!', 'Fire! FIRE!', 66787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire!', 'Fire!', 66786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know? You act like you\'re the savior of Azeroth!', '', 66785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He knows more about this land than we do. Perhaps you should heed his warnings.', 'He knows more about this land than we do. Perhaps you should heed his warnings.', 66784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This old pandaren is a fool. How are we supposed to fight without emotion? It\'s impossible!', '', 66783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fool does not understand. He carries negative emotion with reckless abandon. We will all suffer the consequences if such action continues.', '', 66782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lao-Chin\'s Healing Spheres heal him as they fade away!', '', 66781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not falling for your tricks, $r. Victory shall be mine!', '', 66780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m partaking in a staring contest right now?', '', 66779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you believe that they won\'t let me in? Me, of all people?', '', 66778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes, the fragile wasp is far more effective than the mighty bull.', '', 66777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flames of passion serve only to ignite the kindle of others.', '', 66776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your armor is your skin in combat. Protect it and honor it, and it shall do the same for you.', '', 66775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not if your weapon leaves your grasp. Your body is an ample tool against any foe.', '', 66774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A falcon\'s talon is only as useful as the grace of his flight.', '', 66773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n.  My services as an auctioneer are available to those with skill in engineering.  Sadly, you have none.  Please leave.', '', 66772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being a legendary explorer is hard work!', 66771, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have to take some of these flowers back home!', 66770, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if I\'m too cute for the jungle?', 66769, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These rocks are so lifelike!', 66768, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen roots like this before!', 66767, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eek! I\'m outta here! Gyrochromatic Invisibility Engine engage!', 66766, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These trees are AMAZING!', 66765, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if my shoes are too fancy for exploring?', 66764, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t you come dance with me instead good lookin\'?', '', 66763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this astounding dirt! It\'s so dirt-like!', 66762, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Train me in First Aid.', 'Train me in First Aid.', 66761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whew, time to take a break!', 66760, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are so many wounded...', 66759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can I get any of you another drink?', 66758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sarya Teaflower sighs.', 66757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sarya Teaflower washes her hands.', 66756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have any fizzy energy drinks?', 66755, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think these grow on trees?', 66754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li, I need another dragon gun.', 'Li, I need another dragon gun.', 66753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will give you a free meal if you can get this dwarf off of my new chair!', '', 66752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surely a hot bite and a fresh pint will help those battle wounds heal a bit faster, eh?', '', 66751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come and get it!', '', 66750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come take a seat and eat! It\'s never a bad time for a hearty meal!', '', 66749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell your hatred, your violence, your doubt. Your soul bears the weight of a lifetime of hardship. Why do you continue onward down a path that can only lead to ruin?', '', 66748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At what point are our hearts as full of darkness as the great evil we so tirelessly try to subdue?', '', 66747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The north still reeks of undeath. Our homelands lay in ruin. Pandaria oozes our hatred and doubt. What hope is there for this world when the Burning Legion again lands upon our shores?', '', 66746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We openly deal with the ethereal, ignorant of their true intentions. Could we be aiding in the preparation of our own demise?', '', 66745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happens when our wars are over? Do you expect to return to civilian life without incident despite the horrors you\'ve witnessed?', '', 66744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do we continue to fight in a war we have nothing to gain from? Do the dying screams of thousands not haunt your very dreams?', '', 66743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread lightly, $r. The rage of this land has yet to be quenched. Your very presence here causes it anguish the likes of which it has never endured.', '', 66742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off the ship before fire engulfs it!', '', 66741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n stepped on a lightning trap!', '$n stepped on a lightning trap!', 66740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tireless efforts of the Shado-Pan are the only thing keeping this land from being ravaged by the mantid swarm. We do not ask thanks for this, but now we are faced with a time when we can no longer accomplish this task alone.', '', 66739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will soon join the corpses buried here, little $c!', '', 66738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders in the crypt!  Don\'t let them leave alive!', '', 66737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope we meet again soon, my new friend.', '', 66736, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I overheard a great deal through the cage. Rensai will be pleased with what I have to tell him.', '', 66735, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I owe you greatly.', '', 66734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek...a reward?$B$BSurely the joy of a successful catch is reward enough? The thrill of the open sea? The comraderie that only a fishing pole can grant?$B$BYou have much to learn, $r.$B$BMy opinion aside, there is much to be gained from the art of fishing.$B$BYou may improve your fishing skill.  One day, you may purchase powerful fishing rods.$B$BThe most revered fishermen may receive access to a special fish pet, a water stride mount, and a fishing raft.', '', 66733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds is home to the most avid of all fisherman this side of Pandaria.$B$BIf you love the reward of a day spent with the great sea, I urge you to honor us with your presence.', '', 66732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, have your journeys brought you to Krasarang recently?$B$BIt would be wise to venture there. The fish are as bountiful as the most fortunate harvest.$B$BAs my father said, the early fisherman gets the catch!', '', 66731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, sir. I don\'t believe so.', '', 66730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oy, lad! Have ye gotten that Thundertank XT 9000 workin\' yet?', '', 66729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mister Pleeb is teaching me how to be a taxidermist. Personally I think he is a little too dated and could benefit from a little gnomish \"engi-nuity.\"', 66728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble!', '', 66727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence... at last.', '', 66726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face your demise!', '', 66725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gaze into the inevitable!', '', 66724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
