('Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.$B$BYo ho ho, even.$B$BI just come back from the land of Pandaria, with its rolling hills and harsh mountains, and the strangest rum I ever tasted.  I crashed me ship into the Jade Forest and me cargo made the land uninhabitable, but in the meantime I can take ye to the Valley of the Four Winds, lickey-split.$B$BDo yeh trust me, $c?', '', 66602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 7394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
