('What is this place?', 'What is this place?', 66591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May a lucky star shine upon you, $c. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. Speak to them to find out if you are the brave adventurer that they seek.', 66590, 0, 54164, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Good fortune to you, $r. Here you will find representatives from all the factions of Pandaria. When you have had a little more experience under your belt, come back and speak to us. Great adventures and great rewards await.', 66589, 0, 13442, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AID ME!', '', 66588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Vale, friend. Stay and be at peace.', '', 66587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are like... piece of iron...', '', 66586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only to the most trusted allies do we reveal the Golden Lotus\'s deepest secrets.', '', 66585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May you seek honor and courage in all your days, $r.', '', 66584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always strive to achieve the impossible.', '', 66583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can Jaluu do you for today?', '', 66582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The creature\'s shell is glinting with light.', '', 66581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('War has come, Wakener.', '', 66580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'ik was just the first to betray us. No one can be trusted.', '', 66579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much damage to repair.', '', 66578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the object.', 'Take the object.', 66577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a glint of light coming from something on the creature\'s back.', '', 66576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THERAMORE!', '', 66575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To have witnessed the opening of the gates... it is a tale I will pass down to my children\'s children.', 'To have witnessed the opening of the gates... it is a tale I will pass down to my children\'s children.', 66574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was this really the home of the ancient emperors of Pandaria? It is beautiful.', 'Was this really the home of the ancient emperors of Pandaria? It is beautiful.', 66573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here they come, Halters! Get ready!', 66572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we can find a new home here in the Vale.', 'Perhaps we can find a new home here in the Vale.', 66571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard all kinds of stories about what lay behind the gate. I never imagined it would be something like this.', 'I heard all kinds of stories about what lay behind the gate. I never imagined it would be something like this.', 66570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan told us this would be a safe haven for all the refugees from Kun-Lai. Perhaps here, we shall finally find peace.', 'The Shado-Pan told us this would be a safe haven for all the refugees from Kun-Lai. Perhaps here, we shall finally find peace.', 66569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard some hero from a far away land convinced Xuen, the tiger god, to open the Vale. Maybe I\'ll see them someday.', 'I heard some hero from a far away land convinced Xuen, the tiger god, to open the Vale. Maybe I\'ll see them someday.', 66568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just look at this place! It\'s amazing!', 'Just look at this place! It\'s amazing!', 66567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve always wondered what lay behind these gates.', 'I\'ve always wondered what lay behind these gates.', 66566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Merely a transport, Grud. Not a warship.', 66565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care! I\'M KILLING EVERYTHING ON BOARD! Move it, grunts!', '', 66564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a ship! An ALLIANCE ship!', '', 66563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Captain! Please keep your crew safely on board. We\'ll defend the ship if it\'s attacked.', 66562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-yes sir!', '', 66561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 66, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('If someone\'s bold enough to investigate, we\'ll keep the ship here as long as we can.', '', 66560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abe, get below deck and hide. Everyone else, keep watch and be ready for an attack.', '', 66559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Light... Theramore! What has happened here?!', '', 66558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did the Horde do this?!$B$BLight save us all...', 'Did the Horde do this?!$B$BLight save us all...', 66557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if anyone survived...', 'I wonder if anyone survived...', 66556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a disaster!$B$BWhat could have done this?!', 'What a disaster!$B$BWhat could have done this?!', 66555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here?!$B$BLady Proudmoore\'s tower is just... gone!', 'What happened here?!$B$BLady Proudmoore\'s tower is just... gone!', 66554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll defend the ship and crew for as long as we\'re able.$B$BDon\'t worry about us!', 'We\'ll defend the ship and crew for as long as we\'re able.$B$BDon\'t worry about us!', 66553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep the ship here as long as I can.$B$BBe safe!', '', 66552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 66, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('You wouldn\'t happen to have another bundle of that incense would you?', 'You wouldn\'t happen to have another bundle of that incense would you?', 66551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I carry out her will! We shall crumble this wall and devour the lands beyond!', '', 66550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wall cannot stop the might of the mantid!', '', 66549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is wrong. It is not yet time to swarm.', '', 66548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren were prepared. This attack was folly.', '', 66547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are we? We were... swarming?!', '', 66546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I... here...?', '', 66545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no... this swarm is too early. I must speak with the Adjunct!', '', 66544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening? Why do we swarm so soon?', '', 66543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You impress me, my young student. You have great strength in you.', '', 66542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our work here is finished for now. Let us deliver news of our victory to the Klaxxi Council. They await our return.', '', 66541, 0, 17347, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Right Click] on the trainee\'s weapon in your inventory to equip it.\nThe default key to open your bags is [B]', '[Right Click] on the trainee\'s weapon in your inventory to equip it.\nThe default key to open your bags is [B]', 66540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Lake of Stars.', 'Take me to the Lake of Stars.', 66539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to travel somewhere.', 'I need to travel somewhere.', 66538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wish to pay me tribute? Then pay it in blood!', '', 66537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Briny Wastes.', 'Take me to the Briny Wastes.', 66536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
