('This is not over...', '', 66534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s nearly defeated! Keep punching!', '', 66533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The colossus is injured! Don\'t stop striking!', '', 66532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is he gone? Is it over?', '', 66531, 0, 18130, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was foolish of you to interrupt, outsider.', '', 66530, 0, 18532, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire the cannons to kill the bombardiers!', '', 66529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come outsider! Fight me if you dare!', '', 66528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is fitting that I be the one to destroy the pet of the Klaxxi!', '', 66527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_ravage.blp:20|t Garalon fails to hit at least two players and gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122754|h[Fury]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_ravage.blp:20|t Garalon fails to hit at least two players and gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122754|h[Fury]|h|r!', 66526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have known you would not come alone Kor\'ik.', '', 66525, 0, 18531, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me the resonating crystal you puny little bark eater!', '', 66524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Powerful Throw incoming! Don\'t get knocked off the mountain!', '', 66523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sees the opportunity to splash Toxic Hivebomb in the whirlwind!', '', 66522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantid are coming over the wall!', '', 66521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', '', 66520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmphhh', '', 66519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait what...?!', '', 66518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ggrgll!', '', 66517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders by the pool of life!  Don\'t let them escape!', '', 66516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fighting make me... HUNGRY!', '', 66515, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vegetron 4000 is recharging, try again later.', '', 66514, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
