('Insert a stack of Red Blossom Leeks.', 'Insert a stack of Red Blossom Leeks.', 66509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Pink Turnips.', 'Insert a stack of Pink Turnips.', 66508, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Mogu Pumpkins.', 'Insert a stack of Mogu Pumpkins.', 66507, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Jade Squash.', 'Insert a stack of Jade Squash.', 66506, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Green Cabbage.', 'Insert a stack of Green Cabbage.', 66505, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Juicycrunch Carrots.', 'Insert a stack of Juicycrunch Carrots.', 66504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert a stack of Ginseng.', 'Insert a stack of Ginseng.', 66503, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please insert vegetation......', '', 66502, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... SPICY!!!', '', 66501, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many SEEDS!', '', 66500, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... SWEET!', '', 66499, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Om nom nom nom...', '', 66498, 0, 0, 466, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is woken from its slumber by the sound of combat!', '', 66497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! Those who failed deserved to die; you have merely culled the weak!', '', 66496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand fast and slay the rest!', '', 66493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let up! No mercy!', '', 66492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:128419|h[Gathering Speed]|h|r!', '', 66491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was your old job?', 'What was your old job?', 66490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why is that?', 'Why is that?', 66489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you make beer out of it.', 'And you make beer out of it.', 66488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beer made with sap? That sounds...', 'Beer made with sap? That sounds...', 66487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 66486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dumpling presser.$b$b<Vu sighs.>', '', 66485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trees are dying. Kypari Vor is already dead... a victim of the sha. It will never again produce amber. It barely even looks like a tree anymore.$b$bThe few amber-producing trees that remain are either being overharvested by the mantid, or in danger of succumbing to sha. Either way, no more sap means no more sapmasters. At which point, I\'d have to return to my old job.', '', 66484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly. The traditions of the sapmasters reach back through countless generations. I am but one link in a chain of sap-thirsty pandaren.$b$bSometimes, however, I fear that I may be the final link.', '', 66483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...disgusting, I know. But it\'s not.$b$bThe amber that these trees produce has amazing healing properties. The mantid can\'t get enough of it. They consume it, they use it in their weapons and architecture... I\'ve even heard legends that they embalm their great heroes in the stuff.', '', 66482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a good question. We\'re a strange lot... not many pandaren choose to live on this side of the wall.$b$bIn short, we\'re making beer. Not just any beer, though... beer brewed with the sap of the great kypari trees.', '', 66481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This soft one should serve well. Come, Wakener.', '', 66480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before I was cast in amber, I made a great gamble.$B$BI realized the amber could perform a miracle that I would never achieve, not even with a thousand years of careful experimentation.$B$BBefore I became a paragon, I injected myself with a dozen lethal poisons. The life-giving properties of amber protected me as I guessed, and time did the rest.$B$BAnd now, I can handle any poison I desire without fear.', '', 66479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, Klaxxi\'va.', '', 66478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me no more, Council. I will see my old home with my own eyes. I would gaze upon the ruin that Shek\'zeer has wrought.', '', 66477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait. The Klaxxi speak to me. Yes, Council, I have heard the Empress\'s intentions. Her reign must end.', '', 66476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What makes you think I would sell to you, outsider?', '', 66475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'d you get that weapon from, your sister?', '', 66474, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 27954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'d you get that weapon from, your sister?', '', 66473, 0, 0, 396, 64, 0, 27939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Purged by fire!', '', 66472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29528, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck to you, friend!', '', 66471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the winds guide your journey!', '', 66469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I can interest you in a magic map? Oh nevermind, we\'re all sold out.', '', 66468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel free to browse, but do not feel free to touch!', '', 66467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! So you seek items of wonder? Well you have come to the right place!', '', 66466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my shop, traveler!', '', 66465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A walk? Sure!', 'A walk? Sure!', 66464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'ve stayed here long enough. Would you like to go on a walk with me?', '', 66463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A walk always goes faster when you have a friendly $r $c by your side.', '', 66462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re enjoying this as much as I am.', '', 66461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you ask: no, we are not there yet.', '', 66460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing gets your blood flowing quite like a long, slow walk.', '', 66459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! When did you get here?', '', 66458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost track of how long we\'ve been walking now.', '', 66457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You like walking? I like walking.', '', 66456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure is a nice day today.', '', 66455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 66454, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The nearby forces of the Scarlet Crusade stand ready to assist their Commander if he is attacked.', '', 66453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I not say that my wings were swift? You move most slowly, Wakener.', '', 66452, 0, 17110, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears that Empress Shek\'zeer has let our empire fall into chaos. This we must address. But first, I must regain my strength.', '', 66451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, outsiders. Master Snowdrift is waiting for you inside the school. Please remember to show proper respect to the Master.', 'Welcome, outsiders. Master Snowdrift is waiting for you inside the school. Please remember to show proper respect to the Master.', 66449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to show you the power of amber alchemy...', '', 66448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think you stood a chance?!', '', 66447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your carved bones will decorate the weapons of our warriors!', '', 66446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... I was... who will...?!', '', 66445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah-hah! The lot of you will soon wish you hadn\'t come this way...', '', 66444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope they make it this far. Then my strength and skill will be clear to all!', '', 66443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance wins!', '', 66442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde wins!', '', 66441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What dragon turtles are for sale?', 'What dragon turtles are for sale?', 66440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?', 'I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?', 66439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?  I am sorry.  I cannot help you until you prove yourself a loyal ally of my people.', 'I assume you are here about the dragon turtles, child?  I am sorry.  I cannot help you until you prove yourself a loyal ally of my people.', 66438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! Sri\'thik, Zar\'thik, Kor\'thik, to the top of the terrace! We must defend the Empress!', '', 66437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garalon, grind their bones to dust!', '', 66436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breath of the empress, bring mighty Garalon to us!', '', 66435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Set\'thik, in formation! Show them who controls the winds of Pandaria!', '', 66434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful, wingless grubs. You step out into my domain, and I will hear your death screams as you plummet from this terrace!', '', 66433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30348, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump to prevent the resin from hardening!', 'Jump to prevent the resin from hardening!', 66432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your voice. Your hands. THESE are the tools of true heroes. Use them well... and you can change the world.', '', 66431, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30129, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('And when they rose... they rose as warriors.', '', 66430, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30128, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('The farmers, the bricklayers, the shepherds and the smiths... they all bowed before Kang. \"Teach us,\" they said. \"Teach us to fight.\"', '', 66429, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30127, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('\"Our backs are hardened by the whips of the mogu,\" he told them. \"Our arms are powerful from building their fortresses. Our minds are sharp from working alongside our enemy. You think the mogu are stronger? I say we are their strength!\"', '', 66428, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30126, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Surprised, the beleaguered Pandaren slaves tried to strike Kang. One by one they failed, for he intercepted their blows like a dancer and sidestepped their attacks like a reed in the wind.', '', 66427, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30125, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('One day, the beloved monk issued a challenge to his fellow slaves. \"Hit me!\" he called out.', '', 66426, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30124, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Until Kang, the Fist of First Dawn, opened our eyes.', '', 66425, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30123, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, when my people were slaves of the mogu empire, we were forbidden from carrying any weapon at all. We were not fighters. And no one believed we could fight the mogu without magic and steel.', '', 66424, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30122, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('What is the source of YOUR power? Think carefully before you answer. Many adventurers point to their weapons, or their equipment, or to tomes of arcane might.', '', 66423, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30121, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('You will not disrupt the tuning!', '', 66422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see. Much has transpired since I first entered my long sleep.', '', 66421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Klaxxi\'va. How long I have waited to hear the Council\'s command!', '', 66420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s time to Randall P. jump.', '', 66419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\item_earthenmight.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:128107|h[Raise Earth]|h|r!  Watch out!', '', 66418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was enjoyable. Now it\'s time for a Randall P. rest.', '', 66417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... no path. Guess I\'ll have to Randall P. swim.', '', 66416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think it\'s time to go for a Randall P. walk.', '', 66415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another successful operation!', '', 66414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Donate...my body...to science...', '', 66413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a little open-heart surgery!', '', 66412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a grinding noise coming from the elevator shaft!', 'You hear a grinding noise coming from the elevator shaft!', 66411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tower is just there. I will cover you from the sky. Be quick.', '', 66410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will drop you near the tower. Do not get used to this.', '', 66409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fury is UNLEASHED!', '', 66408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29011, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed me with your ANGER!', '', 66407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let your rage consume you!', '', 66406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel your rage!', '', 66405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does that make you angry?', '', 66404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extinguished!', '', 66403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to me when you are ready to try again.', 'Speak to me when you are ready to try again.', 66402, 0, 17968, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon Wrathguard', 'Abandon Wrathguard', 66401, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon Observer', 'Abandon Observer', 66400, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon Shivarra', 'Abandon Shivarra', 66399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon Voidlord', 'Abandon Voidlord', 66398, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abandon Fel Imp', 'Abandon Fel Imp', 66397, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Break it! Free me from this amber sleep!', '', 66395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A presence approaches! Someone out there can hear me! But... it is no Klaxxi.', '', 66394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time of awakening must be near, but they have not yet come for me. Why do the Klaxxi wait?', '', 66393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear grips her mind and body. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire.', '', 66392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even in my sleep, I hear her terror.', '', 66391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoah...', '', 66390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should keep that crossbow, Ku-Mo.', '', 66389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on. I think it\'s time to go home.', '', 66388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really?', '', 66387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'m done fighting for a while, Ku-Mo.', '', 66386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This chunk of amber may be exactly what the Klaxxi are looking for.', '', 66385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you can shoot the mantid!', '', 66384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought you your crossbow, Dad!', '', 66383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dad!', '', 66382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three players are needed to cleanse the Pool of Life!', 'Three players are needed to cleanse the Pool of Life!', 66381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Burlap Trail!', '', 66380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s at the Shado-Pan Garrison right now. Here\'s a kite. Go see him!', 'He\'s at the Shado-Pan Garrison right now. Here\'s a kite. Go see him!', 66379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Your son, Ku-Mo, has been looking for you.', 'Yes. Your son, Ku-Mo, has been looking for you.', 66378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My son... he\'s here? Alive!?', '', 66377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... Shado-Pan. You\'re here to help me?', '', 66376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope I find him.', '', 66375, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for your help, $gmister:ma\'am;. I\'m going to keep looking for my dad now.', '', 66374, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re looking for Ku-Yao? I haven\'t seen him in days. You don\'t think he\'s in trouble, do you?', 'You\'re looking for Ku-Yao? I haven\'t seen him in days. You don\'t think he\'s in trouble, do you?', 66373, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is Ha-Cha, Sentinel Ku-Yao\'s yak.', 'This is Ha-Cha, Sentinel Ku-Yao\'s yak.', 66372, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ku-Yao\'s bedroll is empty. He\'s not here.', 'Ku-Yao\'s bedroll is empty. He\'s not here.', 66371, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shield is engraved: Sentinel Ku-Yao. It belongs to the boy\'s father.', 'The shield is engraved: Sentinel Ku-Yao. It belongs to the boy\'s father.', 66370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small fee for supplies is required.', 'A small fee for supplies is required.', 66369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alarm, oh great masters! ALARM!', '', 66368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple is breached, masters! ALARM!', '', 66367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alarm, my masters! INTRUDERS!', '', 66366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MASTERS! Intruders in the temple!', '', 66365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple has been infiltrated! Alarm! ALARM!', '', 66364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple walls have been breached!', '', 66363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alarm! Trespassers have entered the temple!', '', 66362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are intruders within the temple!', '', 66361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Klaxxi said they needed someone to continue punishing fools in a future generation.$B$BI told them, \"I\'m your mantid.\"', '', 66360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders! The prisoner cages are under attack... send reinforcements!', '', 66359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think me to be mad, do you? Yes... yes, perhaps a little.$b$bYou see, even after eight hundred and seventy-seven years of quietude, the desire to breathe does not go away.$b$bPerhaps something went wrong with my encasement. Perhaps it was my... preternaturally keen intellect. Whatever the cause, I was fully aware of the passage of time during my years in the amber.$b$bAfter seventy-eight years, I stopped trying to escape. I kept my mind sharp by creating and solving puzzles. The amber took care of the rest of my body.$b$bBut my sanity? No, I cannot say with good confidence that it survived intact.', '', 66358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hrgghh!!', '', 66357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the assist, friend. I\'d better report back to Bowmistress Li.', '', 66356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to break every bone in your body!', '', 66355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll crush your skull!', '', 66354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your agony will be BOUNDLESS!', '', 66353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You DARE stand before a student of Scrollmaster Fon?!', '', 66352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade is peerless!', '', 66351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have your head!', '', 66350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the name of the Thunder King!', '', 66349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the glory of General Zhun!', '', 66348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two titanic constructs appear in the large alcoves!', 'Two titanic constructs appear in the large alcoves!', 66347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see we have a pet battler here in our training grounds.  Cloud serpents are cut out to do almost anything, including fighting other pets!  The key to finding the hatchlings is building a friendship with an adult.  Once you are exalted with the order, you will find them scattered across the arboretum.', 66346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are these serpent hatchlings suitable for pet battles?', 'Are these serpent hatchlings suitable for pet battles?', 66345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must defend the villagers! I will take the front gates, the rest of you spread out and don\'t let any yaungol get past you!', '', 66343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. Are you enjoying the festival?', '', 66342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The festival reminds me of how beautiful Kun-Lai is.', '', 66341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see everyone in such high spirits.', '', 66340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xuen has taught us the meaning of strength.', '', 66339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go save him.', 'Let\'s go save him.', 66338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Lorewalker is slain, many of us will have died for nothing...\n\nWill you accompany me to stop the execution?', '', 66337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They intend to execute Lorewalker Fu! Please, you must help me stop them...', '', 66336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, ma\'am!', 66335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters, the village need our help. Head to the front lines and heal the wounded!', 66334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Mistweaver Nian is a strict teacher but has a kind heart.', 66333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As mistweavers, we must always protect those in need.', 66332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you, $n! My students and I came to try Brewmaster Boof\'s famous brew and to celebrate the brewmoon!', 66331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ow! Ow! Ow!', '', 66330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Tian Monastery.', 66329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen are not always the best brewers, but the ones on Unga Ingoo somehow steal the best ingredients.', '', 66328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monks, doesn\'t all that rolling make you dizzy?', '', 66327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet, you.', '', 66326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrr... I need to kill something. All this waiting around is driving me crazy.', '', 66325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Point taken.', '', 66324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How would you like to suddenly become \"intrigued\" by your own thorax? I bet your skilled hands could perform a self-vivisection in mere seconds if they were properly compelled.', '', 66323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I am just saying, Dissector, that you do not appear to possess any resistance to sonic manipulation.', '', 66322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am just saying... I bet his genes tell quite a story...', '', 66321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not even ask.', '', 66320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All those years in stasis followed by sudden, rapid growth.', '', 66319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No.', '', 66318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is quite an impressive beast you have there, Manipulator. Very intriguing.', '', 66317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never imagined my work would go so far. It is a testament to the great power of the kypari. Our civilization would never have recovered if it weren\'t for them. Remember that.', '', 66316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, he certainly looks... healthy.', '', 66315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to the careful notes you kept while developing the preservation chamber, I was able to create a modified version that could preserve Kovok here as well.', '', 66314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to serve alongside you, Prime. I have studied your work extensively.', '', 66313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How does it feel? I have no regrets, if that is what you are asking. I am honored to serve the will of the Klaxxi.', '', 66312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She trusts no one. Paranoia gnaws at her mind. She is driven by fear unrelenting.', '', 66311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When she tried to forbid the swarm, it was to prevent, as she put it, \"a senseless loss of life.\"', '', 66310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I served Shek\'zeer for a time, you know. Before I was preserved. Her madness is nothing so rational as ambition.', '', 66309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And having seen what Grand Empress Shek\'zeer is doing to our land... I need no convincing.', '', 66308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course.', '', 66307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
