INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What you want?', 'What you want?', 66076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you call Wikky?', 'Why you call Wikky?', 66075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gots munchins?', 'You gots munchins?', 66074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want Wikky?', 'You want Wikky?', 66073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah! A fan of potions? The brewmasters work their concoctions but often miss some of the finer notes to a potion or remedy.', 66072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:119360|h[Draw Power]|h|r!', '', 66071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:124967|h[Draw Power]|h|r!', '', 66070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! A luckydo comes to learn? I have many skills to teach.', '', 66069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Aysa appears to be deeply lost in her excercises.>', 66068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_lambstotheslaughter.blp:20|tYou are |cFFFF0000|Hspell:127275|h[Marked for Execution]|h|r!', '', 66067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we can use the Horde\'s might to make a better world.', '', 66066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lets find out what this warchief of theirs is made of.', '', 66065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come friend, the Horde awaits.', '', 66064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we lose the healers, Shen-zin Su dies, and all of us with him!  Keep them safe.', '', 66063, 0, 19275, 0, 65, 0, 27288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close and keep these healers safe.  Our lives depend on it.', '', 66062, 0, 19275, 0, 65, 0, 27287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the healers and get them free of the fight.  We need them here at the wound!', '', 66061, 0, 19275, 0, 65, 0, 27286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are healers under some of the wreckage!  Get them free.', '', 66060, 0, 19275, 0, 65, 0, 27285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammer and tongs. Hammer and tongs. All day long its hammer and tongs.', '', 66059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was a tough one...', 66058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And it looks to me like you made a new friend.', 66057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have to admit, that looked pretty fun!', 66056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My family has crafted jade and gems for nearly ten generations. You may be surprised at what I can teach you.', 66055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This day seems to be one full of hard decisions.  Having the courage to make them is gravely important, for the sake of us all.  I did what I had to do, and we may have all been doomed if I had not... but sadly, not all see it that way.$B$BIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su, that those here might be free from the burden of my difficult choice, and that I might fight on for the sake of a much larger world.$B$BI\'ve only known Korga a short time, but he and I could be brothers if he were born in different skin - he possesses bravery and honor that I would gladly stand beside.  You too could be my $gbrother:sister;, after all we\'ve been through together.  I\'m hoping you might join us, but I understand that there is much to consider.', '', 66054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is all that is to be said. Come, take your reward. And remember what you have learned today.', '', 66053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wisest among you will do the same.', '', 66052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the Old Ones ever return, we mantid will once again stand by their side.', '', 66051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your gods are not our gods, outsider.', '', 66050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell you now, because you have earned this warning.', '', 66049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His last terrible breath has haunted this land ever since, but the shadows he left behind are mere whispers of his former glory.', '', 66048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the usurpers came - the ones you call \"Titans\" - Y\'shaarj was destroyed.', '', 66047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great was the Old One, and terrible was His wrath. He consumed hope and begat despair; He inhaled courage and breathed fear.', '', 66046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our Gods were many, and powerful. We mantid worshipped the seven heads of Y\'shaarj.', '', 66045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before your history began, our empire was vast. We shared this world with our sister kingdoms, Ahn\'Qiraj and Azjol-Nerub.', '', 66044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, maybe I should have taken the cart in for its tune-up after all.', 'Hmmm, maybe I should have taken the cart in for its tune-up after all.', 66043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With each generation, we grow ever stronger.', '', 66042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each cycle, our young swarm their walls. The pandaren slay the weak. The strong return.', '', 66041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We mantid are an elder race. The pandaren you associate with - they are but children. They have their role to play.', '', 66040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can never rest until we get to the top! Heh? Get it?', 'We can never rest until we get to the top! Heh? Get it?', 66039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are to be rewarded. Walk with me.', '', 66038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand that the mind of the Tushui is not the only path to wisdom, but there are yet choices that should not be accepted.  Risks that are too dangerous to ever be taken.  Decisions that I cannot forgive...$B$BIt is time for me to leave Shen-zin Su.  I have found respect for Delora Lionheart for her confidence and valor, and her tales of the Alliance speak well of her people.  I do not yet know if I will find a home there, but wherever my path may lead, I will find a way to help the world beyond this isle.$B$BDespite everything, I\'ve enjoyed what little time we\'ve had together, $n.  I hope that you might join me, but I understand that this decision is not an easy one.', 66037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is your first trip up Neverest? It\'s mine too!', 'This is your first trip up Neverest? It\'s mine too!', 66036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this yak knows the way up the mountain because I sure don\'t!', 'I hope this yak knows the way up the mountain because I sure don\'t!', 66035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wakener, you deeds have earned you the trust of the Klaxxi.', '', 66034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we there, yeti?', 'Are we there, yeti?', 66033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your seatbelts fastened... Just kidding, we don\'t have seatbelts!', 'Keep your seatbelts fastened... Just kidding, we don\'t have seatbelts!', 66032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<cough> <hack> I have... returned.', '', 66031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you fascinated by the wonders of metallurgy? The artistry of smelting? The beauty of mixing metals and alloys?', 66030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only a mind at peace can fully ready a body for battle.', 66029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the gathered mind is truly prepared to face any trial.', 66028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blaspheme!', '', 66027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your \"Empress\" has fallen. The Klaxxi have pronounced judgment. Stand aside or be brushed away.', '', 66026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak your name puppet, that our annals will be complete.', '', 66025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who holds this swarm? Show yourself! Answer to the Klaxxi.', '', 66024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! Uh, it\'s... interesting!', 66023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find strength in patience.', 66022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, sure.', 66021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fa... ther....', '', 66020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek more than anything to help young pandaren explore their potential within these grounds. True mastery comes with much time and much practice, but there is value even in finding the first beginnings of a fitting path.', '', 66019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There exist two great disciplines among our people. The Tushui are patient, pensive, and deliberate. The Huojin are fierce, forward, and active. Both disciplines serve us in their own way, and neither could exist effectively without the other.', '', 66018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She should be a pile of bones and slime! Strong of stomach, indeed...', '', 66017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, yes. Hrm. I\'m... sorry it wasn\'t to your liking...', '', 66016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here... try this.', '', 66015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep those archers off the wall. Raigonn must reach the gate.', '', 66014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All enemies of the Shado-Pan will fall before Tenwu the Red Smoke!', '', 66013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tenwu the Red Smoke greets you.', '', 66012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must go, we are not done yet.', '', 66011, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!', '', 66010, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I...I see everything clearly now.', '', 66009, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 30190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They call to me, the discs...I must...', '', 66008, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These discs look familiar, but I cannot place their origin.', '', 66007, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'None will stand against the Shado-Pan.', 66006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The machine has been destroyed, and so the mogu\'s power weakens.', '', 66005, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 30187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will be the blade at the throat of our enemies.', 66004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
