('Do you require anything?', '', 66002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear...this could get messy. I will observe from a safer distance!', '', 66001, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Magnificent! It talks! This seems beyond what we thought the mogu were capable of.', '', 66000, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116529|h[Power Down]|h|r!', '', 65999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
