('Enabling', 'Enabling', 65997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sensors online. All cores operating at peak efficiency.', '', 65996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhh, somethin\' ain\'t right, General... We\'re losin\' altitude! Fast!', '', 65995, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More strangers seem to wash up on our beaches every day.$b$bThis bunch was still trying to shoot at each other until yesterday evening. I hope this isn\'t a sign of what\'s to come.', 'More strangers seem to wash up on our beaches every day.$b$bThis bunch was still trying to shoot at each other until yesterday evening. I hope this isn\'t a sign of what\'s to come.', 65994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This seems to be a terminal controlling the device. Let\'s see here...', '', 65993, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fascinating, I have never heard tales of anything like this. The mogu hide their secrets well.', '', 65992, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This room pulses with energy, but feels unlike any we have seen so far.', '', 65991, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Land ho!', '', 65990, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 27905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Direct hit! She\'s goin\' down!', '', 65989, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
