('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_charge.blp:20|t%s sets his eyes on |cFFFF0000$n|r and begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:127245|h[Fatal Blow]|h|r! Move!', '', 65987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemy ship, starboard! Ready the guns! Fire at will!', '', 65986, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 65985, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance ship! Portside!', '', 65984, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Back to your post, soldier! We\'ll find this land, or die trying.', '', 65983, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been flying in this mist for hours, General. The crew grows... uneasy.', '', 65982, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 27992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The architecture in here is strange, differing in many ways from traditional mogu design. This room seems to be a device of some sort, but I see nothing of its purpose in my notes.  \n$bThe only way for us to figure out what this is for is to activate it and observe.\n$bWhat\'s the worst that could happen?', '', 65981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_soulsiphon:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126299|h[Unleash Souls]|h|r! Get in the water!', '', 65980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No no, don\'t try to get up. Your war isn\'t here, soldier - you need your rest', 65979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead and turn this thing on.', 'Go ahead and turn this thing on.', 65978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pheromones should be useful when dealing with multiple enemies.', '', 65977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let my strength be your strength. Go and destroy our enemies!', '', 65976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance... near...', '', 65975, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just one... more... catch!', '', 65974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their strength is an inspiration... and sorely needed. We must trust that their hearts are pure.', '', 65973, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have faith in our friends from beyond the mists.', '', 65972, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us draw ourselves together to rebuild this sacred place, the first step toward healing a war-torn world.', 65971, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 38221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children of Pandaria. The mists have fallen. For good or for ill, our land is open to all.', 65970, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 38220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fixing', 'Fixing', 65969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, how did it go? Well, I hope?', 'Well, how did it go? Well, I hope?', 65968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw the Bouncy Ball to your serpent and see how long you can keep it in the air! When you are done playing, speak to me and I will take your serpent. Good luck!', 'Throw the Bouncy Ball to your serpent and see how long you can keep it in the air! When you are done playing, speak to me and I will take your serpent. Good luck!', 65967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search the island to collect brew for Bo\'s cauldron! But be sure to leave one person nearby to defend Bo!', 'Search the island to collect brew for Bo\'s cauldron! But be sure to leave one person nearby to defend Bo!', 65966, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is all shiny. Not sure I like it. Seems like it is missing that \"lived in\" smell.', '', 65965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am done practicing. Please take your hatchling back.', 'I am done practicing. Please take your hatchling back.', 65964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like you are already playing catch with your serpent, $n. You can only play catch with one serpent at a time.$B$BPlease finish your current training session before practicing with another serpent.', 65963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to practice catch with a baby serpent.', 'I would like to practice catch with a baby serpent.', 65962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grooka Grooka gonna light this party up!', '', 65961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookie\'s still cookin\' and brewin\'!', '', 65960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heyarrr! I has me brew.', '', 65959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dancin\' like a monkey!', '', 65958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ba-Bam still up and Bammin\' Brews!', '', 65957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is dismounted from his wind rider.', '', 65956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid or destroy Gash\'nul\'s Storm Totems.', '', 65955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow, incredible! Look at all the lights!$b$BWhat\'s going on do you think? Who\'s the guy on the turtle?$b$bWaaaaaiitt - is that Liu Lang?$b$bThat turtle must be Shen-zin Su. It IS! That statue is of a tiny baby Wandering Isle!$b$BWe\'re home, Uncle Chen!$b$bWell, sorta.', 65954, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here\'s a real surprise for you. What do you suppose they\'re celebrating? And what do you think would be the proper drink to mark the occasion?', '', 65953, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I am delighted to see that you are celebrating the Wanderer\'s Festival with us!$b$bIt is often said that pandaren are not the adventurous sort. But look around at these faces - ah, you see? The starry eyes of dreamers!$b$bI should think that someday soon, there will be many more pandaren adventurers to speak of, making a difference all over the world. Don\'t you think?', '', 65952, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Lorewalker!', 65951, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your voice is so beautiful. Sometimes I swear I could hear a whole orchestra when you sing!', 65950, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you sing for us the song of Liu Lang?', 65949, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lorewalker Cho! I\'m so glad you\'re joining us this week.', 65948, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n!$b$bThis is the \"Wanderer\'s Festival,\" where we celebrate the deeds of the first pandaren explorer and gather on the beach to gaze out across the sea.$b$bThere was a time when the mists that cloaked Pandaria were so thick, sometimes you couldn\'t even see that large rock just off the shore there. Now look at it - what a glorious night! I\'m glad you are here for this.', 65947, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on here?', 'What is going on here?', 65946, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the Wanderer\'s Festival, $n! Where pandaren with the spirit of adventure gather to celebrate the first explorer to venture beyond the mists.$b$bIt\'s a time of contemplation and song. Thank you for joining us!', 'This is the Wanderer\'s Festival, $n! Where pandaren with the spirit of adventure gather to celebrate the first explorer to venture beyond the mists.$b$bIt\'s a time of contemplation and song. Thank you for joining us!', 65945, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legend has it that Liu Lang once set out to explore the seas beyond Pandaria on the back of a giant turtle. Every few years, he would come back, always seeking new explorers to travel with him. To this day, whenever a pandaren is daydreaming or staring off into space, we ask if they\'re \"waiting for the turtle.\"$b$bMost pandaren aren\'t very adventurous - they like to stay close to hearth and home. But some of us are still dreamers... Tonight we gather at Turtle Beach on the southern coast to gaze out at the sea and celebrate Liu Lang\'s spirit of adventure.$b$bIt\'s called the Wanderer\'s Festival.', 'Legend has it that Liu Lang once set out to explore the seas beyond Pandaria on the back of a giant turtle. Every few years, he would come back, always seeking new explorers to travel with him. To this day, whenever a pandaren is daydreaming or staring off into space, we ask if they\'re \"waiting for the turtle.\"$b$bMost pandaren aren\'t very adventurous - they like to stay close to hearth and home. But some of us are still dreamers... Tonight we gather at Turtle Beach on the southern coast to gaze out at the sea and celebrate Liu Lang\'s spirit of adventure.$b$bIt\'s called the Wanderer\'s Festival.', 65944, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Wanderer\'s Festival?', 'What is the Wanderer\'s Festival?', 65943, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wanderer\'s Festival is tonight. Are you coming?', 'The Wanderer\'s Festival is tonight. Are you coming?', 65942, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are on our way to the Wanderer\'s Festival. You should join us!', 'We are on our way to the Wanderer\'s Festival. You should join us!', 65941, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
