('Mmmmm. Mmmmmm...... This is... simply put... amazing. Your friend Ella has real talent! Tell her to speak to my Uncle Gao at the Brewery. I think she has found a new home with us Stormstouts.', '', 65916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your skill in cooking is only as great as your most advanced Way.', 'Your skill in cooking is only as great as your most advanced Way.', 65915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mmmmm, I haven\'t tasted a brew of this complexity and clarity since... well... since the golden age of the Stormstout Brewery! Whoever made this has a real talent.', 65914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm, that\'s mighty tasty, $n. I wouldn\'t mind another round of that... or two... hic!', '', 65913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, this is excellent! EXCELLENT! This is the best stuff I\'ve tasted in a long time. Who brewed it?', '', 65912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! Thish ish shome amazing shtuff! Where can I get shome more?', '', 65911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is said, \"Turn your face towards the sun, and the shadows will fall behind you.\"$b$bI hope you find many bright days ahead of you, $n!', 65910, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was going to charge you a pretty penny for that peach, but Ella is such a good customer at my market, this one\'s on the house. Just this once, ya hear!', 65909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little Ella\'s trying her hand at brewing? Well, I\'ll be! I wish her luck. Brewing isn\'t something a novice can just take up, you know. Anyhow, I can spare a Lakemelon for her.', '', 65908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
