('Your perseverance strengthens us. Your courage leads us. Your honor inspires us.', '', 65724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, we welcome you into the Shado-Pan.', '', 65723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe you a great debt.', '', 65722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not allow this to come to pass.', '', 65721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple will not fall!', '', 65720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, everyone to arms!', '', 65719, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 29780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make an excellent pet.', '', 65718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have come to your grave.', '', 65717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will serve me well.', '', 65716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another weakling.', '', 65715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a weak creature.', '', 65714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your minds is weak.', '', 65713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not like this...', 'Not like this...', 65712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect me!', 'Protect me!', 65711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must recover my strength.', 'I must recover my strength.', 65710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a minute to recover.', 'I need a minute to recover.', 65709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It didn\'t come out very good, $n. You wouldn\'t want any.', 65708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s all that noise outside?', 65707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s ready! I put it over on the table.', 65706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, $n! I\'m brewing up something special for the festival. Come back later and I\'ll share some with you.', 65705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work, $p, you saved the village. We are forever in your debt.', '', 65704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s rename the village to $p town!', 'Let\'s rename the village to $p town!', 65703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You really kicked some yaungol butt, $p!', 'You really kicked some yaungol butt, $p!', 65702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With $p around the yaungol didn\'t stand a chance!', 'With $p around the yaungol didn\'t stand a chance!', 65701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Marry me, $p!', 'Marry me, $p!', 65700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the greatest, $p!', 'You\'re the greatest, $p!', 65699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The festival is saved!', 'The festival is saved!', 65698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would we do without you, $p?', 'What would we do without you, $p?', 65697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved us, $p!', 'You saved us, $p!', 65696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone quiet down, let Hsieh speak.', '', 65695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t we get one night of peace?', 'Can\'t we get one night of peace?', 65694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Again?!', 'Again?!', 65693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yaungol ruin everything!', 'The yaungol ruin everything!', 65692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are we going to do?!', 'What are we going to do?!', 65691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no...', 'Oh no...', 65690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haha, flightless fools!', '', 65689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reinforcements, get over here and kill these weaklings!', '', 65688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Artillery will scorch the ground, leaving nothing!', '', 65687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed, but you will not live to tell anyone of this victory!', '', 65686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools, you will die with me!', '', 65685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WIKKETS!!!', '', 65684, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhi sent me.', 'Zhi sent me.', 65683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here anyway?  Come all the way down here to bask in my marvelous company?', '', 65682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...ugly!', '', 65681, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s... so...', '', 65680, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now where\'s that big mogu baddy that came tramping through here a short bit ago?', '', 65679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I would quite enjoy skipping stones down that hallway.  It would be quite the display!', '', 65678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm, shall we?', '', 65677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see, I see.', '', 65676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu, they seem not so good at this game, if their dead bodies are any indication.', '', 65675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Phew! That was close. Ok, here\'s the deal...', '', 65674, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh dear! It looks like we\'ve got company... You take care of those mongrels, and I\'ll get the brew going.', '', 65673, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cloud tile good.  Other tiles bad.  There was a tile at the bottom of the entrance stairs that tipped me off.  My sharp eyes have saved my delicate features yet again!', '', 65672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa!  Careful over there!  These tiles have violent tendencies...', '', 65671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Err... What was that?', '', 65670, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will fail.', '', 65669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the weapon of kings! What makes you think you have a chance?', '', 65668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought this was a tournament of \"strength.\" Yet I see only weakness.', '', 65667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can use the bombs and cannons nearby to blast the hozen away!', 'You can use the bombs and cannons nearby to blast the hozen away!', 65666, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He continues cautiously.', '', 65665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He motions for you to wait.', '', 65664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He points down the hall ahead.', '', 65663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He collapses to the floor in exhaustion.', '', 65662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He struggles to free himself.', '', 65661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He gestures towards the eastern vale, then disappears in the shadows.', '', 65660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He tampers with the lock on your cage.', '', 65659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a sad story!', 65658, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s un-possible!', '', 65657, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What? What?', 65656, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?', '', 65655, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lorewalker! What ever happened to Liu Lang?', 65654, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh. Well, forget it then.', '', 65653, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No you don\'t. It\'s full of trolls.', 65652, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to explore the world!', '', 65651, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like Chen and Li Li Stormstout!', 65650, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we don\'t explore very much anymore, do we?', 65649, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does that mean our moms and dads and grandparents were all explorers, too?', '', 65648, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born!', 65647, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But isn\'t Pandaria hidden somewhere? Nobody can find it!', 65646, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...Whenever he got hungry?', 65645, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blerch! I\'d rather jump off this bridge.', 65644, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, you should all be more like me.', '', 65643, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', '', 65642, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even Hao?', 65641, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does the turtle know we\'re here?', '', 65640, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just thought it was weird that the mountains had flippers!', '', 65639, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sheesh, Hao. Haven\'t you ever paid attention?', 65638, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live on the back of a big turtle?!', '', 65637, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, please cheer for the NEW CHAMPIONS of the Arena of Annihilation!', '', 65636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shen-zin Su!', 65635, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is the song about?', 65634, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, that\'s one killer carp whose slaying days have come to a fishy end.', '', 65633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flitting through the mists with death upon his fists comes the sinister and serene jinyu assassin: Satay Byu!', '', 65632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why can\'t I understand any of the words?', '', 65631, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is most strange. Shado-Pan are our best customers. We sell them supplies, and they keep us safe.$b$bWhy are they turning us away? This I do not understand.', '', 65630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this Shado-Pan not let us in soon, I will make him smell MY luckydo.', '', 65629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my yak on the road here. This is most not good.', '', 65628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My nose is cold. That is a very bad sign.', '', 65627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We travelled through angry hozen, rampaging yeti, and unclean yaks to get here. Now the Shado-Pan act like we are strangers.$b$bThis very bad fortune indeed.', '', 65626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We travel long long way. Now Shado-Pan say they do not want our goods. This is most strange.', '', 65625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan always friend of the grummles. Why are they not letting us in to trade?', '', 65624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An honorable end to the noble Maki... I\'m sure his clan would be proud, if he hadn\'t been the last of them!', '', 65623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could you sing it once more, for the students who just arrived?', 65622, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Ruolin! That was beautiful.', 65621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We tell his story, so that he will always be remembered.', 65620, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And I think he lived a very very good life. We owe everything we have to Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer.', 65619, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s not a sad story! Liu Lang himself said, \"Never mourn a life well-lived.\"', 65618, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Along with the budding staves of all the elders who came before us, growing now into giant trees.', 65617, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, it\'s true. If you ever go to the Wood of Staves, you can see it.', 65616, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His umbrella... sprouted! It grew roots, flowered, and became a tree!', 65615, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He closed his eyes, and became one with the land. And then - do you know what happened?', 65614, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He opened his umbrella, planted it in the ground, and sat underneath its cool shade.', 65613, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then, Liu Lang went up to the Wood of Staves, carrying with him a bamboo umbrella that he always took on his adventures.', 65612, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tired now, Liu Lang said goodbye to Shen-zin Su, his oldest friend.', 65611, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shen-zin Su has never returned to Pandaria.', 65610, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But nobody else wanted to go exploring with him. So he left.', 65609, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eventually he grew very old, and visited Pandaria one final time.', 65608, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad you asked, Yin. Liu Lang explored the world his entire life, and raised many children here on the Wandering Isle.', 65607, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, like Chen and Li Li! They\'re out, exploring the world. Maybe someday you will, too.', 65606, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shen-zin Su hasn\'t made landfall for a long time. But that hasn\'t stopped some pandaren from exploring, anyway.', 65605, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes Hao! Only the BRAVEST pandaren joined Liu Lang on his turtle to explore the world.', 65604, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s right! Liu Lang always had a way back home. Every five years, he would return, to pick up more explorers.', 65603, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does anyone remember how Liu Lang was always able to find it? Nan?', 65602, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are right, Yin. It IS hidden away, behind a cloak of mists.', 65601, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He returned to the main continent of Pandaria once every five years.', 65600, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haha, no Yin. Liu Lang would eat wherever he explored.', 65599, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does anyone know how often Liu Lang went back to Pandaria?', 65598, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Students! Students! Pay attention now.', 65597, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"We should all be like children, for the world is our elder, and has many things to teach us.\"', 65596, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Especially Hao! Liu Lang once said, \"Noble is he who always asks questions.\"', 65595, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I am certain that Shen-zin Su knows we are here. And he cares for every one of us!', 65594, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a good question. Nobody has spoken to Shen-zin Su for many generations. He only ever spoke to Liu Lang.', 65593, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Liu Lang discovered many things as he explored the world - oh - yes, Hao?', 65592, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Hao - our home is on Shen-zin Su\'s back.', 65591, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Question, Hao?', 65590, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He grew and grew and grew, SO big, that now some people call him \"The Wandering Isle.\"', 65589, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s right, the turtle was called Shen-zin Su. At first, he was only big enough for Liu Lang to sit on.', 65588, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Does anyone remember the turtle\'s name? Yin?', 65587, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brave Liu Lang set out to explore the world on the back of a sea turtle.', 65586, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is all about his adventures.', 65585, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The song is written in the old tongue, the language of emperors and scholars. Hardly anyone speaks it anymore.', 65584, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the Song of Liu Lang, the first pandaren explorer.', 65583, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'ll slice and dice in ways that aren\'t nice! Please bow respectfully for Maki Waterblade, saurok samurai!', '', 65582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give up now.', '', 65581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish child.', '', 65580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no escape from our might!', '', 65579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall reign over Pandaria once more!', '', 65578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vale belongs to the Shao-Tien!', '', 65577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lei Shen returns, weakling.', '', 65576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shall teach you the meaning of strength.', '', 65575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
