('Pitiful creatures.', '', 65574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello $n! The Lorewalker is beginning her lesson just down these stairs if you want to listen in.', '', 65573, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
