('', 'Flying Snow is chasing you with her |cFFFF0000|Hspell:|h[Whirling Steel]|h|r technique! Run away from her until she chooses someone else!', 65523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
