('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_weapon_hand_30.blp:20|tMaster Snowdrift uses his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106853|h[Fists of Fury]|h|r technique!', '', 65520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Snowdrift is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chasing]|h|r you! If he catches you he will use his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[Tornado Slam]|h|r technique on you! Run away from Master Snowdrift until Chase Down expires!', 'Master Snowdrift is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chasing]|h|r you! If he catches you he will use his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106352|h[Tornado Slam]|h|r technique on you! Run away from Master Snowdrift until Chase Down expires!', 65519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, these will do quite nicely. They feel almost as if they were meant for me all along.', 65518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s find out!', 'Let\'s find out!', 65517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_sickem.blp:20|tMaster Snowdrift sets his sights on |cFFFF0000$n|r to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:118961|h[Chase Down]|h|r!', '', 65516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_earthbind.blp:20|tMaster Snowdrift uses his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106434|h[Tornado Kick]|h|r!', '', 65515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the spirits be with you, brave one.', '', 65514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_parry.blp:20|tMaster Snowdrift enables his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106454|h[Parry Stance]|h|r!', '', 65513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. The way to defeat Fear is to look it straight in the eye, unblinking, unwavering.', 'I do. The way to defeat Fear is to look it straight in the eye, unblinking, unwavering.', 65512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see you here, child.', '', 65511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saboteur Kip\'tilak sets off a series of explosions!', '', 65510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[Sabotaged]|h|r!', 'You\'ve been |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[Sabotaged]|h|r!', 65509, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand before your death.', '', 65508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_bomb_05.blp:20|tSaboteur Kip\'tilak casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107268|h[Sabotage]|h|r on |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 65507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have your armor as a trophy!', '', 65506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, face your death.', '', 65505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got the glow!', '', 65504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I say: \"Who\'s the Master?\" You say: \"Shonuf!\"', '', 65503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a historic moment, $n. What do you think lies beyond the gates?', '', 65502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once this ritual ceases, we will not be able to resume it, and the corruption will remain at full strength. Your courage is admirable, but if you fail, we are all doomed. Do you understand what you ask? Do you understand the consequences?', '', 65501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This being may feed on Fear, but we have none to offer it. Cease your ritual, for we require no assistance to cleanse this place.', 'This being may feed on Fear, but we have none to offer it. Cease your ritual, for we require no assistance to cleanse this place.', 65500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These sacred waters are befouled, but hope is not lost. Our ancient rituals endure and cleanse, even in the face of this great corruption. And as the waters recover, the strength of those who taint them wanes.', '', 65499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travel through the Spirit World has left you with a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117723|h[Frail Soul]|h|r temporarily! If you attempt to travel to the Spirit World again before Frail Soul expires you will perish instantly!', '', 65498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Chen acknowledges you with a nod but looks uncharacteristically sullen.>', '', 65497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace the Wanderer\'s Way! It is not so much a course of action as it is an attitude.$b$bEvery one you meet is a story. Every place you go is an adventure. Every drink you have is the best you\'ve ever tasted.$b$bThis is not such a bad life, is it?', '', 65496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you spent enough time here in the valley, perhaps you could make friends with all the locals. Maybe even some day settle down with a farm plot of your own.$b$bImagine that - YOU, the world-weary $c, settling down to manage a farm!$b$b<Chen closes his eyes and laughs a deep belly-laugh.>', '', 65495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family left mainland Pandaria to explore the world on the back of the Wandering Isle. That was many generations ago.$b$bBut I have learned that there are other Stormstouts, here, on Pandaria! My long-lost family. What are they like? Do they still brew, as I do? Are they adventurers, like you and I?', '', 65494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you always in such a rush, $n? It is like you dash madly from one stranger in need to another, bent on gaining new experiences.$b$bLife is not simply a glass you fill up! Stay a while, and enjoy the places you discover!', '', 65493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren farmers are entertaining folk! A very tight-knit community. Everyone knows one another.$b$bIt is very different from the big cities in Kalimdor or the Eastern Kingdoms.', '', 65492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li does not understand why I always stop to sample the local brews. But in my experience, you can learn a lot about a people by what they drink!$b$bHave you tried mainland pandaren ales? Very crisp, very dark. One sip and you know that they are brewed to be savored slowly. It is the drink of a people that are in no hurry, who enjoy time with their friends.$b$bWhat do YOU drink, $c? And what would it tell me about you, hm?', '', 65491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My niece Li Li is so impatient to explore Pandaria. But one never learns a new land by rushing headlong from place to place. It is important to talk to everyone you meet, to experience a place until it becomes a part of your soul.$b$bIt is the Wanderer\'s Way!', '', 65490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to see another explorer! When some people discover a new land, they immediately seek out the fortresses and temples.$b$bNot me.$b$bTo get the measure of a people, you need to get your feet dirty. Come, walk the land with me! Let us see what these mainland pandaren truly value.$b$bIt is the Wanderer\'s Way.', '', 65489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. And there is so much more we can add to it.$b$bAs you explore our land, keep an eye out for objects of interest that might help us learn more of our past. Piece together enough of our history, and I may be able to share a story or two with you.', '', 65488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ballad of Liu Lang.', 'Ballad of Liu Lang.', 65487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seven Burdens of Shaohao.', 'Seven Burdens of Shaohao.', 65486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Song of the Yaungol.', 'Song of the Yaungol.', 65485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is Worth Fighting For.', 'What is Worth Fighting For.', 65484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heart of the Mantid Swarm.', 'Heart of the Mantid Swarm.', 65483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you again, $n. For a moment, I was worried that you wouldn\'t come.$B$BLet\'s finish this, shall we? The Scarlet Crusade has proven that it\'s not going to put an end to itself.', 65482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark Heart of the Mogu.', 'Dark Heart of the Mogu.', 65481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fish Tales.', 'Fish Tales.', 65480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen in the Mist.', 'Hozen in the Mist.', 65479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was mind control boy. There\'s a difference. And don\'t worry. If big game huntin\' were easy, everybody\'d be doing it.', '', 65478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that\'s a start at least. Do ya remember who you are?', '', 65477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get... out... of my boy\'s... head!', '', 65476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... pop. Sorry I got me head all snared by that thing.', '', 65475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...ouch?', '', 65474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Hooded Crusader gazes down upon the high inquisitor\'s blade-skewered corpse.', 65473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, my name\'s Lilian. You don\'t mind if I take those blades, do you?', 65472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now enough of this deception.', 65471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is done. You did it, $p!', 65470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My daughter has spirit and persistence! I worry less about her than I do my husband.', 65469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Change is inevitable, even for those as stubborn as Doshu.', 65468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This village is normally so peaceful.', 65467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari should never have underestimated us!', '', 65466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('Despite what I may have said in the past, I never doubted your abilities!', '', 65465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('I knew we would defeat the invaders!', '', 65464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('They outnumber us! This is madness!', '', 65463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('We are but one tiny village... What could we possibly do to defeat the Thunder King\'s forces?', '', 65462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('This is terrible! How will we ever defeat the Zandalari?', '', 65461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('', 'It is always a good idea to make friends with fisherman. You will never go hungry!', 65460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will not be the only village to rise against the Thunder King!', 65459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is because of you this village has found its strength again!', 65458, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m confident you will be able to help us.', 65457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These hardships will pass and we will grow stronger because of them.', 65456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must not only see the negative when there is much to be positive about.', 65455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we face the Thunder King we will be prepared.', '', 65454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To see only the defeat of losing the remains would be foolish. This village is the first of many that will rise against the Thunder King. This is a great victory!', '', 65453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This village has you to thank for their victory.', '', 65452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a lesson to be learned in every challenge we face.', '', 65451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every villager counts. Without each grain of sand we would have no beach to enjoy the ocean from.', '', 65450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have to work quickly if we want to find the remains.', '', 65449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m ready for the world, but I\'m not sure it\'s ready for me!', 65448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe next time it will be me saving you!', 65447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I look forward to when our paths cross again!', 65446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have grown so much thanks to you!', 65445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have not only saved our village; you have also repaired my family.', '', 65444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for opening my eyes to who my daughter really is.', '', 65443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These events have shown me so much.', '', 65442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have our respect and our thanks.', '', 65441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can finally return to my knitting! Those winter scarves won\'t make themselves!', '', 65440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a true hero!', '', 65439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last peace can be restored!', '', 65438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Zandalari won\'t know what hit them when I\'m done!', '', 65437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surviving this attack will take a miracle.', '', 65436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This village has been peaceful for longer than I can remember. Our weapons are surely as rusty as our fighters.', '', 65435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In all my years I never expected to see the Zandalari.', '', 65434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kovok chitters happily... you think.>', '', 65433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kovok look at you with concern.>', '', 65432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Kovok\'s eyes widen as he looks at you.>', '', 65431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shomi is such a child!', '', 65430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shomi should not want to fight. That is a man\'s job!', '', 65429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I hadn\'t gotten a splinter I would be out there defending our village too!', '', 65428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battlefield is no place for a girl!', '', 65427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To Zandalari voice he will awaken...', '', 65426, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Zandalari blood he will be taken...', '', 65425, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alive the dispossessed...', '', 65424, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But blood of brother kingdom keeps...', '', 65423, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm long spent there rests...', '', 65422, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Under Kun-Lai Thunder sleeps...', '', 65421, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 30093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:121970|h[Trapped]|h|r! Free $Ghim:her; by clicking on the barrel!', '', 65420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it.', '', 65419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this arrogance or merely folly? Your death awaits within these walls. If we leave you shall have no aid. Do you realize what you are saying?', '', 65418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, we will handle this our own way.', 'Yes, we will handle this our own way.', 65417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are more than capable of handling this without assistance. Withdraw. When you return, you will find the Empress slain and your problems solved.', 'We are more than capable of handling this without assistance. Withdraw. When you return, you will find the Empress slain and your problems solved.', 65416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you have come here, to the heart of the pollution. We will aid you. Our song will resonate through the walls of this twisted place, weakening the resolve of those who have forsaken our race.', '', 65415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis only just begun... we ain\'t gonna jes\' roll over and die...', '', 65414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need dis land! Da cataclysm destroyed our home!', '', 65413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Thunder King lives! Our empires be united once more...', '', 65412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Thunder King shall live again...', '', 65411, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secure da remains, bruddahs!', '', 65410, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woe to da pandaren usurpers! The mogu will rule dis land again, and we Zandalari will have a new homeland...', '', 65409, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really hope you know what you are doing.', '', 65408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now, da true emperor of Pandaria lives and breathes once more.', '', 65407, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We performed da ancient rites...', '', 65406, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da remains of da Thunder King were taken to da Isle of Reckoning.', '', 65405, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late.', '', 65404, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 31492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain? This is a dangerous place, and our initial researchers have not yet returned from their expedition. If we disable the dampening field, we will leave until the ruins are safely secured, and cannot reactivate the devices.$B$BI ask again: Are you certain?', '', 65403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, please disable the devices.', 'Yes, please disable the devices.', 65402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It may be best not to dabble in mysteries not yet fully understood. Perhaps you should disable the dampening devices. My companions and I can handle ourselves. I\'m sure we will be fine.', 'It may be best not to dabble in mysteries not yet fully understood. Perhaps you should disable the dampening devices. My companions and I can handle ourselves. I\'m sure we will be fine.', 65401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent news. Our studies of this site\'s energies and artifacts have begun to pay off.$B$BWe have unraveled some understanding of the mogu devices found here, and even better, a way to turn them in our favor. The very walls of this structure will siphon and sap the might of any enemies within.', '', 65400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will always be my little girl and I will always fear for you, but I know now you can take care of yourself.', '', 65399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your words honor me, daughter. This is a proud moment.', '', 65398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never before has a father felt such pride for their child, Shomi.', '', 65397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will keep this village safe so that you may retire your weapons.', 65396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would like to continue my training so that I may always defend our home.', 65395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, I am no longer the helpless child you feared for.', 65394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am proud to have defended our village.', 65393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riders approach!', '', 65392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shiny...', '', 65391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sss mine!', '', 65390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot have it!', '', 65389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shiny isss mine!', '', 65388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, back to the brewing!', '', 65387, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneeling down, the Hooded Crusader examines the Flameweaver\'s corpse, looking for something.', 65386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you get the codex?', 65385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are a lot of corpses out there.  Nicely done, $p.', 65384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'d say that we\'re about halfway done, wouldn\'t you? Scarlet Halls down, Scarlet Monastery yet to go.$B$BDon\'t be surprised if I disappear -- I have to get over there quickly.', 65383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_challangingroar.blp:20|tGara\'jal casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117752|h[Frenzy]|h|r!', '', 65382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all have talents, outsider. Some are just not as easy to see as others.', '', 65381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Klaxxi do not give their trust easily, outsider. It has taken me many years to even be seen by them.', '', 65380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday the Klaxxi will elevate my rank. I will be allowed to consume amber.', '', 65379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116161|h[Crossed Over]|h|r to the Spirit World! You or an ally must heal your spirit to 90% health within 30 seconds or else you will perish!', '', 65378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am busy, outsider.', '', 65377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shaman_astralshift.blp:20|tYour spirit has been healed sufficiently to return to its body in the real world! Use your |cFFFF0000|Hspell:120715|h[Revitalized Spirit]|h|r action button to save your spirit!', '', 65376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be my honor to sacrifice myself for what I believe.', '', 65375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beacons sing to each other, outsider. Important messages are sent.$b$bYour ears will not hear the messages. Only those that the Klaxxi trust hear the words they speak.', '', 65374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_enchant_voidsphere.blp:20|tGara\'jal has |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116727|h[Banished]|h|r you to the Spirit World completely! You and your allies must defeat all Severers of Souls to return to the real world.', '', 65373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
