('', 'Here, take these supplies. You\'ll need them for your missions.', 65369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Storm the shores! Steal their brew!', '', 65367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions! Bring me a brew worthy of Ook!', '', 65366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another torch.', 'I need another torch.', 65365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_hunter_pet_spider.blp:20|t %s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126652|h[Call Swarmers]|h|r!', '', 65364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will remain here to examine Kor\'ik\'s remains. I will meet you back in Klaxxi\'vess when you have completed these tasks.', '', 65363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grew up hearing legends of the White Tiger. He is a hero to the pandaren people. It is a real honor to be here training.', 65362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is worth it. I wish to augment my agility.<Pay 10,000 gold.>', 'It is worth it. I wish to augment my agility.<Pay 10,000 gold.>', 65361, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have certainly proven that you are worthy of it, but the materials do not come without cost.$b$bI\'m sure I can arrange something with Madam Goya, but it won\'t come cheap.$b$bPlease keep in mind that only one Crystal of Fear can be equipped at any time.', '', 65360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to upgarde another sha-touched weapon. Can you help?', 'I would like to upgarde another sha-touched weapon. Can you help?', 65359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n fend off the yaungol while I finish the brew!', '', 65358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empress Shek\'zeer knows your plans. Your treachery will be punished...', '', 65357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I find your faith inspiring, little one. But I wonder if you have ever met our warchief?', '', 65356, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 32461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empress Shek\'zeer will destroy you!', '', 65355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will consult the others. Meet me at the gates.', '', 65354, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, Master White Tiger. You will see. I believe that my people - and the Horde - are essentially good.', '', 65353, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 27595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is decided. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms shall remain open. The transgressions of the outsiders have been great... but I see in them the capability to right what has been wronged.', '', 65352, 0, 0, 377, 69, 0, 38210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are making a terrible mistake!', '', 65351, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one has indeed proven mastery over anger. Between the young cub\'s words and the actions of this hero, I think I understand. Those from beyond the mists are hardened by battle. They are scarred, yes, but they have learned much. I trust them.', '', 65350, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump to free yourself from the webs!', 'Jump to free yourself from the webs!', 65349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light up the oil!', '', 65348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archers, attack! Make him burn!', '', 65347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast is covered in oil, light him up!', '', 65346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_soulburn.blp:20|t %s is casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126288|h[Decimate]|h|r!', '', 65345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No you\'re not! Here, take this!', 'No you\'re not! Here, take this!', 65344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... Oh no... I\'m going to die here...', '', 65343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well met, $c. I mean you no harm.$B$BI\'m here posing as one of the Scarlet Crusade because they have become irredeemably corrupt and evil.$B$BI need your help to put an end to them once and for all.', 65342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... that looks just like Garrosh Hellscream!', '', 65341, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That looks like... my father!', '', 65340, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not deceive us. We see you for who you truly are!', '', 65339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only madness here is your own, Kor\'ik! Did you really think you would go unnoticed forever?', '', 65338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and the Klaxxi are fools! Your arrogance will be your end!', '', 65337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He cannot allow him to live in this madness. The Klaxxi will want him put down.', '', 65336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The paragon does not speak truth, Wakener. His mind did not survive encasement.', '', 65335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see the paragon has been awakened.', '', 65334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor\'ik! How long have you worked for the empress?!', '', 65333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_iceshard.blp:20|tHuo-Shuang casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126321|h[Frozen Arrow]|h|r!', '', 65332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_searingarrow.blp:20|tHuo-Shuang casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126304|h[Flaming Arrow]|h|r!', '', 65331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace will come. I swear it. And old hatreds will go away. You have to believe me.', '', 65330, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How interesting. They bring much to our land, but they also bring the shadow of war.', '', 65329, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, that\'s not true - there is so much more to us than this!', '', 65328, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See? See how these outsiders hate one another! They wear their hatred to battle and carry it to their graves!', '', 65327, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well spoken, Zhi. The strangers from beyond the mists have no shortage of passions, but let us see if they indeed control them. Beyond anger lies hatred, the wellspring of all misery. What is this? Your hatred has a face!', '', 65326, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_battleshout.blp:20|tThe Spirit of Lao-Fe casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126471|h[Oppress the Weak!]|h|r!', '', 65325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To live without anger is not to live at all. It is ours to overcome. In defeating our anger, we draw great strength.', '', 65324, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you seek to conquer is each other!', '', 65323, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anger is a part of us all, yes. But we value control. The orcs were once driven solely by anger - they lived in a state of bloodlust - but they conquered it.', '', 65322, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls. Those were actual trolls! We have heard of them in stories. But to see them in person. And every bit as ferocious as the tales tell.', '', 65321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were those trolls after? We are just a simple fishing village.', '', 65320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Now I wish I had stayed awake during those defense lessons at the monastery when I was a cub.', '', 65319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a fearsome battle.', '', 65318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you will see. Traitors hide within our ranks.', '', 65317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What were the trolls after?', 65316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was a tough fight. The most we ever have to worry about are saurok raiders or the occassional hungry hozen.$b$bThose trolls... they fight differently.', 65315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $p! Your courage saw us through the battle.', 65314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always thought trolls were stuff from old stories.', 65313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all sons and daughters of the storm!', '', 65312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well... Metal Brewmaster.', '', 65311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may disorient you momentarily, Wakener. It is always difficult the first time your eyes truly see.', '', 65310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Present your challenge.', '', 65309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop it, both of you. You are smarter than this. Can you be clever like a jinyu and get along? Or are you just going to keep misbehaving like a hozen?', 65308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ty, stop tattling on your brother. Liu, do not give your brother a reason to tattle.', 65307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you do not behave I will turn this picnic right around and we will go home. Is that what you want?', 65306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop it. You both are behaving like a pair of hozen!', 65305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nuh uuuh!', '', 65304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You told me to!', '', 65303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He started it!', '', 65302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No I didn\'t!', '', 65301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mommm! Liu punched me!', '', 65300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mom! Liu keeps acting like a hozen!', '', 65299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liu stepped on my foot!', '', 65298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Liu took my jinyu trinket!', '', 65297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mooooom! Liu keeps poking me!', '', 65296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not often have troubles with predators up here. Sometimes when it rains the saurok come out. But that is only when there is a lightning storm.', 65295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I promised the boys a picnic up here but it is a dangerous place. Just the other day I hear there was an actual fight between strangers like yourself.$b$bAnd someone from... the turtle.$b$bI always thought the turtle was a legend.', 65294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These boys are a handful.', 65293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would do anything for love. But I won\'t do that. At least, not right away.', '', 65292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like my women like I like my beer: full-bodied.', '', 65291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is best in life?\n\nBrothers, ballads and beer!', '', 65290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When dawn rises, the hammer shall fall.', '', 65289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need ingredients and equipment for my kitchen.', 'I need ingredients and equipment for my kitchen.', 65288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in Pandaren cooking.', 'I seek training in Pandaren cooking.', 65287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you like to learn how to cook?', 'Would you like to learn how to cook?', 65286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you need something?', 'Did you need something?', 65285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It smells delicious, doesn\'t it?', 'It smells delicious, doesn\'t it?', 65284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', 'Yes?', 65283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Oven.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Oven.', 65282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Steamer.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Steamer.', 65281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Pot.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Pot.', 65280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Grill.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Grill.', 65279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_ore_cobalt:20|t%s transforms into |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126405|h[Blue Granite]|h|r!', '', 65278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_gem_stone_01:20|t%s transforms into |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126401|h[Green Granite]|h|r!', '', 65277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_03:20|t%s transforms into |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126384|h[Red Granite]|h|r!', '', 65276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand on an elevated surface to avoid the Shadow Fog!', 'Stand on an elevated surface to avoid the Shadow Fog!', 65275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Every day I archive something new, and something old. Sometimes it is an ancient scroll of wisdom. Sometimes it is a painting of the Vale an Inkmaster made.$b$bWe preserve the lore so that future generations will learn from our successes... and our failures.', 65274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can agree it is noble to fight for a righteous cause: to defend home or family. But what of vengeance? What of anger? I sense these emotions run deep in this one.', '', 65273, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Brew.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Brew.', 65272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek training in the Way of the Wok.', 'I seek training in the Way of the Wok.', 65271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am no longer a mantid. I am something... more.', '', 65270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Won\'t you try a taste of poison, Wakener? Not even just a drop?', '', 65269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood in my veins is now thick with toxins. I shall fear no poison ever again. Truly, I am my own masterpiece!', '', 65268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am made anew!', '', 65267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower at your own folly!', '', 65266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will reclaim what is rightfully ours!', '', 65265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 65264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak!', '', 65263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not grant you a swift death, weakling.', '', 65262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool. Do you think to stop the full might of the mogu empire?', '', 65261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have nowhere to go, weakling!', '', 65260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will show you the strength of a true warlord!', '', 65259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true. They are strong. There is much they can teach us.', '', 65258, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower at the sight of your own doom!', '', 65257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spear will finish you!', '', 65256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy of me. Dago! Come crush this insignificant flea!', '', 65255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha! Such a pitiful creature!', '', 65254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PREPARE TO DIE, VILLAIN!', '', 65253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb me? Show your cowardly faces and kneel before me!', '', 65252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... we are fighters. But we come from a violent land. We fought off demons, we fought off death, we even fought against the very end of the world!', '', 65251, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaarrrghhh!  Mage, when we next meet, I will separate your head from your body.', '', 65250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not as weak as I thought, but the helm is still mine...', '', 65249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Violence. See? They are filled with it.', '', 65248, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rip out your soul!', '', 65247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will extinguish the life from your body!', '', 65246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before my might!', '', 65245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no cages this time, I will tear your limbs from your bodies!', '', 65244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would seem my guards are useless.  I will have to take care of you myself.', '', 65243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle Helm of the Thunder King...', '', 65242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My next great adventure is about to begin.$B$BIs that a Light I see?', '', 65241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw these prisoners in the cages.  Let the men have their way with them.', '', 65240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are ignorant to the powerful secrets contained within this vale.  I will take them, and then I will destroy all of your kind.', '', 65239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your struggle is pointless.', '', 65238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and all for nothing.  Take them!', '', 65237, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How noble, rescuing your friend from certain death...', '', 65236, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You leave your friend to die...', '', 65235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My statue will crush the life from him, leaving nothing but a shattered corpse.', '', 65234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your rogue friend is not as nimble as he thinks he is.', '', 65233, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 28196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The endless might of the Jade Armies is mine to control!', '', 65232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die weaklings!', '', 65231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And with them, I will crush the Golden Lotus and retake the vale in the name of the Thunder King!', '', 65230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are far too late.  The Jade Armies are mine.', '', 65229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so the Golden Lotus arrive...', '', 65228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must feed!', '', 65227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hunger!', '', 65226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s over. The curse is lifted. Thank you, $p. Thank you!', '', 65225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally.', '', 65224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_baneofhavoc:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126299|h[Unleash Souls]|h|r! Move quickly!', '', 65223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He looks down the hall intently.>', '', 65222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop him! Forget about her!', '', 65221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here to lend our aid. We can help protect the Vale.', '', 65220, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful.', '', 65219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel, worm.', '', 65218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have witnessed your \"help\" in the Jade Forest. This \"Horde,\" this \"Alliance\" of yours - you have no control over your own nature. You leave misery in your wake.', '', 65217, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon they will overwhelm this continent! Where do we draw the line?', '', 65216, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand years ago, the last Pandaren Emperor came seeking my advice. He, too, was filled with conflict. Let us see if you are correct, Taran. Let us see how this stranger deals with turmoil of the soul.', '', 65215, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29031, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, another stranger from beyond the mists.', '', 65214, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 29030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There he is! Kill him now, $p!', '', 65213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish child.', '', 65212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak!', '', 65211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow to the Shao-Tien!', '', 65210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! I remember when Un\'sok was still a drone, afraid to mix his first toxin. I dare him to face me alone. Then we shall see whose alchemy is supreme.', '', 65209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was once the Empress Shek\'zeer\'s most prized royal alchemist, peerless, and above all others.', '', 65208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', '', 65207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever tried drinking poison, Wakener? You must start with something very mild, only a few drops at first.$B$BYou will likely become violently ill. Perhaps you will even lose an antennae or two.$B$BBut do it long enough, and you will become quite used to it.', '', 65206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, destroy that thing. We have to catch Gandling!', '', 65205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are many wonderful poisons, Wakener. Some can boil you alive. Some will eat your flesh. Some burst you open from the inside.$B$BSo many wonderful varieties.', '', 65204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Get back here coward!', '', 65203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the great crane guide your steps.', '', 65202, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 31814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn the machine on, I will lock the door behind you.', '', 65201, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must destroy it. Here, now, before any harm can come to Pandaria.', '', 65200, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 31812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An endless army of soulless abominations...I shudder to think of the violence that would erupt from such a machine.', '', 65199, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 31811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot allow this to fall into the wrong hands.', '', 65198, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astounding! An actual, functional Mogu construct machine.', '', 65197, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 31809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I fear that our war against our ancient enemies is still far from over.', '', 65196, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done, then. Yet...how many of these machines are hidden beneath the earth? How much do we not know about the dark secrets of the mogu?', '', 65195, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 30205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear a faint humming. It is coming from this direction!', '', 65194, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Jinyu have been locked in an eternity of servitude.', '', 65193, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once, the mogu enslaved all of the races of Pandaria, and bent them to their nefarious will.', '', 65192, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the dust along the floor, these dark halls have not seen footfalls for many centuries.', '', 65191, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A secret passage has opened beneath the platform, this way!', '', 65190, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will stay behind and investigate this dais further...', '', 65189, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 30210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry I did not tell you earlier! These vaults house a weapon of unimaginable power! Stop them!', '', 65188, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Captain Ook!', '', 65187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their nibs!', '', 65186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take brew!', '', 65185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heyarrrr!', '', 65184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Party crashers!', '', 65183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets!', '', 65182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Zandalari, ancient allies of the mogu! They must seek the legendary weapon within the depths of the Vaults!', '', 65181, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not the last we have seen of Feng...', '', 65180, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozekateers! Assemble!', '', 65179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feng the Accursed was betrayed by four emperors of the mogu, his body destroyed each time, only to rise again.', '', 65178, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30196, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have disturbed what should not have been disturbed. He cannot be free to escape this prison! You must destroy him!', '', 65177, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30195, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the stories were true...', '', 65176, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seem to have awakened a spirit of some kind.', '', 65175, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The door mechanism seems to have activated with the demise of the guardians. I fear what we may find within.', '', 65174, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close!', '', 65173, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 30180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The large Quilen seem to be guarding that door. Tread carefully, lest you wake them.', '', 65172, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu held considerable power over the stones of the earth. Their magic lingers on, even centuries later.', '', 65171, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many young Pandaren warriors have vanished into this...tomb. Have your wits about you.', '', 65170, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30199, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All for one! And one for Ook!', '', 65169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ancient vaults of the mogu, untouched by time for thousands of years, who knows what secrets await?', '', 65168, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heyarrrrrrrr!', '', 65167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No brew for you!', '', 65166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brew run!', '', 65165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silly wikket! Brew is for hozen!', '', 65164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That makes sense!', 'That makes sense!', 65162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do!', 'I do!', 65161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend! I do not get many visitors up here, do you wish to hear a tale of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?', '', 65160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And THEN what happened?', 'And THEN what happened?', 65159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say that Alani can only see the flash of the greatest lightning, and may only hear the echo of the greatest thunder. Should you wish to get her attention, you will need to harness the very essence of the sky that spawned her.', '', 65158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the blaze subsided, a cloud serpent hatching could be seen flying around the center of the lake. Its scales sparked with storm and fire, and where it flew, great clouds formed in the sky. My people named it Alani, the Stormborn.', '', 65157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blood of the fallen was washed away by the storm and carried to Whitepetal Lake, turning the waters a deep red. With its final breath, the storm struck the center of the lake, igniting the very water itself.  The lake burned with a crimson hue for many days.', '', 65156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For days following the fall of Lei Shen, the vale was shrouded in a cloud of the deepest black. Summoned by Lei Shen in his final moments, the otherworldly storm blanketed the vale with rainfall and struck jagged spears of lightning into the hills.', '', 65155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_improvedsoulleech:20|tYou are afflicted by |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126228|h[Severed Soul]|h|r! Kill it!', '', 65154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STORM the shores, and PAINT THIS NEW CONTINENT RED!!', '', 65153, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 31807, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve decided to search for the Vale... Vale... Vale...', '', 65152, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 31806, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry, but I cannot go back just yet.', '', 65151, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 31805, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one carrying my SON goes missing!', '', 65150, 0, 0, 1, 71, 0, 31808, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, Gandling! Kill him!', '', 65149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Legends tell of a great battle that took place in this very vale, turning the golden fields to crimson with the blood of many brave monks. The armies of Lei Shen the Thunder King, emperor of the mogu, fought brutally, but were eventually overcome.', '', 65148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have the time, you should visit Binan\'s famous Brewmoon Festival. I will be brewing some of my famous Kun-Lai Kicker Brew.', '', 65147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To be honest, I did not believe the truth of Vaeldrin\'s visions at first. But this place radiates an unusual magic - could these be the fabled \"Pools of Youth?\"', 65146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While we research the pools, we will patrol the city\'s borders and protect these people.', 65145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have heard reports of mogu infiltrating this valley. They will not get beyond us.', 65144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could the waters of this vale be the fabled \"Pools of Youth?\" Perhaps immortality is within our grasp once again...', 65143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never in my ranging have I seen a place like this.', 65142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trees here are more beautiful than even the ones in the southern jungle.', 65141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande sent us here as a vanguard for the Light.', 65140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh\'s pride has destroyed the Vale. What was will never be restored.', 65139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Us meeting in this Vale is more than just random chance.', 65138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is some kind of barrier that shields this Vale, preventing my use of portal magic.', '', 65137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will rest here in the Vale until we have gathered our research. Then, we must find a way home.', 65136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ill-wind blows from the southern shores. Are you ready?', '', 65135, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was my father\'s dream to see this place. I must carry out his wishes in his place.', 65134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This Vale is truly a paradise.', 65133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My squad\'s morale has improved since we entered the Vale.', 65132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sentinels have faced many dangers since we came to this new land. We are ready for whatever the future has to offer.', 65131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I believe we may have finally found my father\'s Pools of Youth. We must gather as much information as we can for Tyrande.', 65130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are just beginning our pandaren campaign, $n.', '', 65129, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $c! My contacts throughout Pandaria tell me that you have been quite busy here. I admire mortals with your... \'initiative.\'$b$bHistory finds us at a turning point. If you are prepared to meet destiny with me head on, I will ensure that you are richly rewarded for your efforts.', '', 65128, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am glad you have returned, $n! I trust you are now acclimated to this strange new continent of Pandaria?$b$bYou have already proven yourself to me in the past, so we can dispense with any sort of tests or trials. Let\'s get right to it.$b$bAre you ready to change the world?', '', 65127, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly I\'m allowed to have SOME secrets. Wouldn\'t you agree, $n?$b$bI arrived shortly after the mists collapsed - I was able to fly here after my Ravenholdt colleagues learned of a naval battle off of these shores.$b$bThis land has been hidden for ten thousand years. I\'ve only just begun to plumb its depths!', '', 65126, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing in Pandaria?', 'What are you doing in Pandaria?', 65125, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 65124, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have chosen the name \"Wrathion.\" To my knowledge, I am the last of the black dragons.$b$bMy father was Deathwing, the Worldbreaker, the Aspect of Death, the Destroyer... But I hope you will not hold that against me.$b$bI have no love for my father, whose corruption destroyed my race, or for the red dragonflight, who stole away and experimented on my egg to create me.$b$bLet\'s just say, I am... unaffiliated. And I am always on the lookout for like-minded heroes.', '', 65123, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Black Prince looks you up and down.>$b$bIt is very good to meet you, $c. You are one of the vanguard, it would seem - an explorer in a strange new land. And how have you been finding the mysterious continent of Pandaria?$b$bYou have the look of someone who gets things done. I want you to return to me once you\'ve gotten the lay of the land.$b$bI will be right here.', '', 65122, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again. $n, was it? Yes yes... I believe we left behind some unfinished business back in the Eastern Kingdoms. How have you been finding Pandaria?$b$bI have another assignment for you, if you are up to the challenge this time. I assure you the rewards will be worth it.$b$bBefore we begin, it\'s important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here.', '', 65121, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is very good to see you again, $n! I trust the weapons I gave you at Ravenholdt have served you well?$b$bI have another \"assignment\" for you here in Pandaria. This will again require all of your skills, and again I assure you... it will be worth it!$b$bBefore we begin, it\'s important that you familiarize yourself with the lay of the land. Come visit me once you have earned more experience here.', '', 65120, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But when war comes to these shores, you and I will be ready for it!', '', 65119, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 29134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are just getting started, friend! Our greatest challenges lie ahead.', '', 65118, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 29133, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There. My work is done. You can now greatly augment the power of any sha-touched weapon.', '', 65117, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a gift from me. Make no mistake: the Black Dragonflight lives on!', '', 65116, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 29131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here! The embodiment of the fear that you\'ve conquered. May it now strike terror into the hearts of your enemies!', '', 65115, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the wisdom of those you\'ve outsmarted.', '', 65114, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29129, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold: The power of the foes you\'ve vanquished.', '', 65113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done great things, friend. I can assure you this is but the beginning of our work together.', '', 65112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the same way about Azeroth herself.', '', 65111, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 29126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?', '', 65110, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 29125, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I often venture out here to think. The view is breathtaking, would you agree?', '', 65109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29124, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to gather up my things, and I will meet you there.', '', 65108, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 29156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are looking pale, my friend! I trust you have not allowed fear to get the better of you?', '', 65107, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 29155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Terrace is just up the hill here. Stay on your guard; few visitors have returned.', '', 65106, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 29154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh! So returns my conquering hero.', '', 65105, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 29153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try to stay alive! We are only just beginning our legendary journey.', '', 65104, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 29152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must ensure that you are up to the task... and then equip you accordingly.', '', 65103, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we bring a swift and decisive end to the conflict? I believe the answer lies with heroes like you.', '', 65102, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with your Horde.', '', 65101, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want you to know that your Alliance has my full and unwavering support in this campaign.', '', 65100, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our strength!', '', 65099, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness.', '', 65098, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the war deeply troubles me. Do you see my concern?', '', 65097, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home.', '', 65096, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, to my point: I believe we are headed towards a reckoning. And no, I am not talking about the current conflict between the Alliance and the Horde.', '', 65095, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, thank you Tong.', '', 65094, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness.', '', 65093, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest.', '', 65092, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile.', '', 65091, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth.', '', 65090, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tong! Drinks, please.', '', 65089, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Let\'s talk.', '', 65088, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 29136, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, if it isn\'t my favorite master assassin! I was hoping I would find you here in Pandaria.', '', 65087, 0, 0, 1, 68, 0, 29135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Talking Skull proceeds into the next chamber without saying a word.', '', 65086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t bear to watch.', '', 65085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...hic...!$B$B...what is a... what is a \"gus\"...?', '', 65084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What would happen if King Varian became corrupted?$B$B...$B$BI don\'t know, but it would be pretty SHA-king!', '', 65083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why was the tank nervous before the fight?$B$B...$B$BBecause he was a worrier!', '', 65082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ask me how to fight a warlock. I a-VOID them. Hahahaha!', '', 65081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m no healer, but I\'m priest to meet you!', '', 65080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does an out-numbered army eat for a snack?$B$B...$B$BRetreats!', '', 65079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Talking Skull seems hesitant to enter the hall, but proceeds with you nonetheless.', '', 65078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Talking Skull cackles gleefully as the instructor\'s soul is destroyed.', '', 65077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A man must honor his family.', '', 65076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_monsterfang_02.blp:20|t %s traps his prey in his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126187|h[Vice Jaws]|h|r! Kill him!', '', 65075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re coming for you, Chillheart! Time for payback!', '', 65074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_corpseexplode.blp:20|t %s ate too much and begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126126|h[Upchuck]|h|r!', '', 65073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go. Do try to keep yourselves alive until the end.', '', 65072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why hello, $n. I know everything that happens around The Heartland, my dear. You don\'t get to be my age without making a few loose-lipped friends.', 65071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A hoe is an honest $Gman\'s:woman\'s; weapon.', 65070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there anything I can get you?', 65069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Hello, my dear. Have you been out in the fields?', 65068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi $c! Don\'t you think my pets are adorable?', 65067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $r. I may be small, but size doesn\'t matter in a pet battle!', 65066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi! Would you like to battle my pets?', 65065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, but we need to stay here for a little while. The Horde is keeping us safe.', 65064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we go back to Kun-Lai? The air smells funny here.', '', 65063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss my toys. Can we go home?', '', 65062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When can we go home?', '', 65061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we go play with the goblins? I\'m taller than them!', '', 65060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we go see the undead lady? She looks funny.', '', 65059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we see the tauren? They look like yaungols.', '', 65058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not today, little one. We have errands to run.', '', 65057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we go see the serpents?', '', 65056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought all was lost when the yaungol attacked our home. It is cliche, but the old monks are right when they say: \"When one door shuts, another opens.\"$b$bOr something like that. Wasn\'t too big on their teachings.', '', 65055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We lost our home to the yaungol. But this place... this place offers us a new beginning.', 65054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu, the mantid, and the Alliance all threaten the safety of this ancient place. We must protect it, at all costs.', 'The mogu, the mantid, and the Alliance all threaten the safety of this ancient place. We must protect it, at all costs.', 65053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance followed us here. Even in this serene place, I smell war on the wind.', 'The Alliance followed us here. Even in this serene place, I smell war on the wind.', 65052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for opening the gates for us, $p. You honor us with your presence.', 'Thank you for opening the gates for us, $p. You honor us with your presence.', 65051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fixing for a snack, $r?', 65050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Food and drink for sale!', 65049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Care for a bite to eat, traveler?', 65048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
