('[%s] confesses: I always forget to gem my gear.', '[%s] confesses: I always forget to gem my gear.', 65005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The knowledge in this library is astounding.', '', 65004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Nightingale Lounge, $c. What can we play for you today?', 65003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $r! Stay and listen for a while.', 65002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aren\'t they great? I\'m their number one fan!', '', 65001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that I\'ve had my peek into the Vale, I gotta say, some o\' this place feels a bit... familiar.$B$BI know it don\'t look like it, but I can\'t shake that feeling. What do you think that means!?', '', 65000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must keep your mind strong to withstand the ever present whispers from the empress. Weaker minds will fall to her will without even noticing.', '', 64999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve always had a good head for numbers!$B$BOnce the natives saw how fast I could add, subtract, and do differential equations in my head, they hired me on the spot!', 64998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empress I served was also frightened and paranoid. Ultimately it was her fear that lead to her demise.', '', 64997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who seek power through force will often find themselves alone in it.', '', 64996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empress has spies everywhere.', '', 64995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You never know who can actually be trusted. Unless you\'re me; then you know.', '', 64994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever since I crash landed on this shore, I been wanderin\' all over, $r!$B$BI\'ve been all the way from the Temple o\' the Jade Serpent to the Krasarang coast to the top o\' Mount Neverest herself!$B$BThis land is quite remarkable, and I been cataloging all o\' my findings.$B$BI can\'t wait to tell my fellow colleagues at the Explorer\'s League about everything I\'ve seen!', '', 64993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once, jinyu ruled all of Pandaria from this place, from this seat of power.$B$BWe must learn all that we can from the histories, so that we may once again regain our ancient wisdom.', '', 64992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I have \"borrowed\" things from my guild bank.', '[%s] confesses: I have \"borrowed\" things from my guild bank.', 64991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened in the Jade Forest was a terrible tragedy. It is my firm belief that the only way to avoid repeating our mistakes, is by learning from them.$B$BThere is much knowledge in this library. Already I have learned much about the sha.', '', 64990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we first arrived, we found a resplendent Vale. The water of its pools were like none other that we had ever seen.$B$BBut then came the one named Garrosh Hellscream, and he left only destruction in his wake. By the time he left, the waters of the Vale were no more.', '', 64989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live to fight another day, $r.', '', 64988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our home is lost, but as long as we are still alive, there is still a home to be made... somewhere.', '', 64987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hello, $n.$b$bYour timing couldn\'t be better.', '', 64986, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$b$bWho could have imagined the warchief was capable of destroying such a beautiful place.$b$bThe Golden Lotus feared that one day the mogu would retake this land, but it would seem they underestimated the depths of Garrosh\'s pride.', '', 64985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I and my family fell victim to this place what seems like ages ago.$B$BLet our fate serve as a warning to those who would meddle in necromancy.$B$BHelp me to lift the curse, $c. Destroy Darkmaster Gandling.', '', 64984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Spoken like a true disciple of Garrosh Hellscream. Our \"Warchief\" would be proud.$b$bBut MY horde does not fight unarmed children. Nor would I dare bring our war to this sacred chamber, in the presence of an August Celestial himself.$b$bBesides, this little one has earned the friendship and trust of High Chieftain Baine Bloodhoof. For that reason, consider him under my protection.$b$bFor now.', '', 64983, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See some armor you like, $r? These rare armor sets can only be obtained by proving your worth in the most challenging dungeons in Pandaria.$B$BYou must seek out these dungeons and enter them by foot. Those who pass the challenges with enough speed shall earn the regard of our master armorers, and may find a gift of rare armor awaiting them in the mail.', '', 64982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Prince of Stormwind is unguarded! Why don\'t we capture him for the Horde?', 'The Prince of Stormwind is unguarded! Why don\'t we capture him for the Horde?', 64981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light be with you, $r.', '', 64980, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See some armor you like, $r? These rare armor sets can only be obtained by proving your worth in the most challenging dungeons in Pandaria.$B$BYou must seek out these dungeons and enter them by foot. Those who pass the challenges with enough speed shall earn the regard of our master armorers, and may find a gift of rare armor awaiting them in the mail.', 64979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[%s] confesses: I once took a bow that a hunter wanted.', '[%s] confesses: I once took a bow that a hunter wanted.', 64978, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are Alliance survivors!  Send... reinforcements...', '', 64977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sure do like his pretty face.', 64976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He keeps talking about arclight spanners and overcharged capacitors. He sure knows to lead a girl on. Rawr!', 64975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m flirting as hard as I can, but I don\'t think he\'s getting the message!', 64974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, what if he thinks I\'m too furry? What if he doesn\'t like black and white women?', 64973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think he likes me, but I can\'t be sure. What do you think, $r?', 64972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are all men this slow at asking women out?', 64971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know she likes a man who can hold his liquor, so I\'ve been building up my tolerance by getting sloshed every night.', '', 64970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have the big beer belly. I need a big beer belly. All right. I\'m workin\' on it!', '', 64969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think I should go to one of those monasteries and train to become a monk? You know, to impress her?', '', 64968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet she likes her men hairy-chested. What am I supposed to do?', '', 64967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think she could ever have feelings for someone like me? I\'m so... unfurry!', '', 64966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I tell her how I really feel? Oh, I\'m not good with words!', '', 64965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s so smart and funny! I\'m head over heels for her.', '', 64964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NRAAAH! I\'ll bring the Warchief your HEAD!', '', 64963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brave words, mage.  I\'ll SPIT in your FACE when you beg for mercy.', '', 64962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t she beautiful? Sigh...', '', 64961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO ONE CAN PROTECT YOU!  Kill the Proudmoore wench, and bring me that bomb.', '', 64960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You spit on mercy?  Then you will have NONE.  You want carnage?!  Garrosh will get more blood than EVER he bargained for!', 64959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your people are despicable cowards, orc. You are nothing more than rabid dogs, and you will be put down!', 64958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must attune to the Focusing Iris before transport. Protect me!', 64957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde cannot be allowed to recover the Focusing Iris.  Eliminate what remains of their forces, and I will secure the artifact.', 64956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This aberration destroyed... everything.  Everyone.', 64955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess so.', '', 64954, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we ride some kites, Connor?', 64953, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dunno. Maybe he\'s magical.', '', 64951, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s because jinyu are fish. Sort of.', '', 64949, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If he\'s a fish, how come he\'s not swimming in water?', 64948, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like a big fish!', 64947, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a jinyu.', '', 64946, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
