('', 'My inn has all the comforts of home, and more. Please make yourself comfortable here.', 64899, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you eating enough, $r? Please remember to take care of yourself.', 64898, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have the softest featherbeds you can find for a thousand miles. Would you like to try one?', 64897, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Golden Lantern, the finest inn in the Vale. If anyone wants to argue with me, I will show them my fists.', 64896, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here at The Golden Lantern, the taps never empty and the barrels never stop rolling! What can I get for you?', 64895, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you are looking too thin, $r. You must have something to eat. Sit and I will get you something.', 64894, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest your weary feet, $r. Fine food and drink await you within.', 64893, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, traveler. Welcome to The Golden Lantern!', 64892, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go. Should you pass through Silvermoon City, come and say hello, hmmm? Al diel shala...', '', 64890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give us a chance to put things right.', '', 64889, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 38016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...I\'ve seen them with my own eyes: Mogu legions, storming the Vale in force. We are not trained for mass combat!', '', 64888, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now an airship draws near; its arcane payload will flatten Theramore Isle and everyone still standing upon it.', '', 64887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great Tiger, the strangers from beyond the mists, they cannot be trusted. The wreckage in the Jade Forest can attest to this.', '', 64886, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 28416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thinking about setting off a spark or two? I should go buy some fireworks myself! The vendor can be found out on the main terrace.$B$BI\'ll mark the location on your map.', 'Thinking about setting off a spark or two? I should go buy some fireworks myself! The vendor can be found out on the main terrace.$B$BI\'ll mark the location on your map.', 64885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to speak to Michael Bedernik. He has an ample supply of meats.$B$BI\'ll mark his location on your map. Good luck!', 'You need to speak to Michael Bedernik. He has an ample supply of meats.$B$BI\'ll mark his location on your map. Good luck!', 64884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The baker is usually wandering all around the shrine. He around the main hall or out on the terrace.', 'The baker is usually wandering all around the shrine. He around the main hall or out on the terrace.', 64883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Itching for something sweet? You need to find Pink Peony.$B$BShe\'s usually wandering around the front terrace or the main hall of the shrine.', 'Itching for something sweet? You need to find Pink Peony.$B$BShe\'s usually wandering around the front terrace or the main hall of the shrine.', 64882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for some brew, eh? Well, there are two brewmasters who wander around the city selling their excellent ales.$B$BIf you don\'t run into them, then Hara Alebelly up at the Nightingale Lounge or Sarya Teaflower in the inn can fix you right up.', 'Looking for some brew, eh? Well, there are two brewmasters who wander around the city selling their excellent ales.$B$BIf you don\'t run into them, then Hara Alebelly up at the Nightingale Lounge or Sarya Teaflower in the inn can fix you right up.', 64881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then the Sway Dish Chef in the inn has exactly what you\'re looking for.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Are you looking for some food and drink? If so, then the Sway Dish Chef in the inn has exactly what you\'re looking for.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jewelcrafting? That\'s fine work, indeed. You can purchase supplies from Bero in the crafter\'s hall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Jewelcrafting? That\'s fine work, indeed. You can purchase supplies from Bero in the crafter\'s hall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I hope the injury is not serious! The healers can be found inside the main hall, just to the left of the central stairs.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Oh, I hope the injury is not serious! The healers can be found inside the main hall, just to the left of the central stairs.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There\'s on in the crafter\'s hall, if I recall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Leatherworking and skins? You must be looking for a tanner. There\'s on in the crafter\'s hall, if I recall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to recall there is an engineer in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'I seem to recall there is an engineer in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can purchase mining supplies in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'You can purchase mining supplies in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blacksmiths all work in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The blacksmiths all work in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to cook up a hot meal? You can find everything you need from Jojo. She sells her wares in the crafter\'s hall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Ready to cook up a hot meal? You can find everything you need from Jojo. She sells her wares in the crafter\'s hall.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter\'s hall. I will mark the location on your map.', 'You are looking for the apothecary. He makes some truly wonderful potions and tinctures. Got rid of my rash in no time!$B$BAhem... Apothecary Greenmoss sells his wares in the crafter\'s hall. I will mark the location on your map.', 64872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Tommy Tinkerspade can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Yes, there is a vendor of herbs in the city. Tommy Tinkerspade can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a scrollmaker! You\'ll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Ah, a scrollmaker! You\'ll be looking for inks and vellum, I suppose? They can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clara Henry carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Clara Henry carries enchanting supplies. She can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raishen the Needle is well-known for her beautiful clothes.$B$BShe works in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Raishen the Needle is well-known for her beautiful clothes.$B$BShe works in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yanyra Moonfell peddles reagents and can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'Yanyra Moonfell peddles reagents and can be found in the crafter\'s hall, to the left as you enter the building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 'The ethereals set up shop in the upstairs corridor to the right as you enter the main building.$B$BI will mark the location on your map.', 64866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
