('The ships are aflame! Troops, to the harbor!', '', 64859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Couldn\'t have done that better myself.$B$BWell, probably not.', 64858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?', 'We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?', 64857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?', 'We were fortunate enough to find the Vale after it opened its gates. We sought refuge, and have found safe haven.$B$BAre you lost? May I help you find something?', 64856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shado-Pan Ice Archers appear on the rooftops!', '', 64855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know what I would have done without you.  It\'s good that you came.', 64853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re wearing him down.  Keep it up!', 64852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s calling allies!  I\'ll keep him busy while you handle them.', 64850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get clear when it when it raises its weapon, it\'s even stronger than it looks.', 64849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank Shen-zin Su that you\'re here.  I could use your help!', 64848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Which brewmaster would you like to aid today?', 64847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rescue the villagers of Greenstone from mischievious (and dangerous) forest denizens.', 64846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brew something delicious and defend from yaungol attackers.', 64845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rescue Jungle Brew from the clutches of the evil hozen pirates of Unga Ingoo.', 64844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster Blanche is trying to make Boomer Brew in the middle of a storm, but some formidable enemies are getting in her way.', 64843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The largest brewery in Pandaria is the Stormstout Brewery in the Valley of the Four Winds. You might start there if you\'re looking for adventure.$B$BBrewmasters are also wanderers by nature, and can be found roaming all over the land searching for rare ingredients or concocting new brews.$B$BSuch brewmasters are often found in unique scenarios.$B$BBrewmaster Tzu defends against enemies in the Greenstone Village scenario.$B$BBrewmaster Bo seeks tropical flavors in the Unga Ingoo scenario.$B$BBrewmaster Boof celebrates the season at The Brewmoon Festival scenario, and Brewmaster Blanche is cooking up something shocking in A Brewing Storm.', 64842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those who participate in the Brewmaster scenarios will earn valor. And if you find any rare items as you adventure with a Brewmaster, they are yours to keep!', 64841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaddaya mean, what\'s in it for you? What kind of question is that?$B$BIsn\'t the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?$B$BThat ain\'t enough?!?$B$BLet me tell you, the life of a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; is rewarding beyond compare!$B$BYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. There are Craftsmen Tokens to be earned for helping out the locals. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.$B$BWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet and a water strider mount. There\'s even a fishing raft, for crying out loud!', '', 64840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best fishing can be found down at the Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds. Anyone is welcome to visit us and take up a fishing rod!', '', 64839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantid artillery is here, you must hurry heroes!', '', 64838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, where does Dooka begin!?$B$BFirst, farmer sows seeds and harvests crops. Vegetables can be used in cooking, sold at market, traded to other buyers, and lots of other stuff. I\'ve even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for special items... like a little pet!$B$BThen there\'s everyone in Halfhill to meet! The people who live there are real interesting, even to a monkey like me. You give them gifts, make nice friends, and they might give you some nice gifts, too!$B$BAlways plenty to do around the fields!', '', 64837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, the Tillers won\'t be crowning you in jewels or building you for war.$B$BFarming is a little different.$B$BIt\'s a slower life, but a good one. You ask Dooka, Dooka knows!$B$BYou can build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy eating all the food you grow! That\'s Dooka\'s favorite part!$B$BSo if that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!', '', 64836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The keg bursts, dousing %s\'s flames!', '', 64835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once you enter the Order of the Cloud Serpent, you will begin the journey of a serpent rider.$B$BYou will raise a baby serpent from the egg, train with it every day, and watch it grow to adulthood.', 64834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no greater honor than rising through the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent.$B$BOnce you have proven yourself, you will be free to wander the land with your serpent as your flying mount.$B$BYou will also earn the Cloud Serpent Riding skill, which will allow you to ride any cloud serpent mount from Pandaria.', 64833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Order of the Cloud Serpent is sworn to defend the Jade Forest. We train at the Arboretum, just to the north of the Temple of the Jade Serpent in the Jade Forest.', 64832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ji Firepaw warmly hugs you back.', '', 64831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw them into chaos while we regroup. The eyes of Hellscream are upon you!', '', 64830, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 30645, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('I do not know, $r.$B$BWe know so little about the Klaxxi. They seem to be quite ruthless, so perhaps your only reward would be a swift death.$B$BThen again, their civilization is quite vast and advanced. If you play your cards right, perhaps they will grant you untold power.$B$BThere is only one way to find out.', '', 64829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a mystery to me, $r. If you want to find out, you are both crazy and foolish!$B$BBut I suppose there is no other way to meet the Klaxxi than to venture beyond the wall into the Dread Wastes.', '', 64828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have just returned from the wall.$B$BThere, I heard rumors of a faction called The Klaxxi from beyond the Serpent\'s Spine. Supposedly, they are a council of mantid elders who have split off from the Mantid Empire, and now work in direct defiance of the mantid queen.$B$BI have seen with my own eyes the power that these mantid wield.$B$BIf these rumors are true, then perhaps there is a way to ally with these... Klaxxi... and work with them to stop the mantid swarm.', '', 64827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn their ships. Butcher their flight master. Sabotage their war machines. And rescue our spy!', '', 64826, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('There are a few ways to earn our esteem.$B$BWe are busy dealing with sha eruptions at Firebough Nook in Kun-Lai Summit. Help us there, and you will gain a foothold into our brotherhood.$B$BThe Shado-Pan Monastery is also in trouble. You may be able to assist our brothers and sisters there.$B$BThe Sha of Anger roams the fields of Kun-Lai to the north. Defeat it, and you will gain great respect from our order.$B$BA Shado-Pan contigent chases the Sha of Hatred in the Townlong Steppes. They may need help.$B$BIf you wish to earn our highest esteem, you must first prove yourself by earning revered standing with the Golden Lotus. Only then, speak to my brothers and sisters at Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.', '', 64825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan is an ancient order that accepts and trains only the most elite and worthy.$B$BShould you manage to make yourself useful, you may find many powerful items available to you.', '', 64824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story\'s telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.$B$BAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds.', 64823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lorewalkers will send you to explore significant areas of Pandaria to recover cultural artifacts.$B$BOnce you find all the artifacts that belong to a collection, you will be able to hear the entire story from start to finish.$B$BFind all the artifacts and collect all the books to become a Lorewalker!$B$BIf you would like to become a researcher, then you should speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge.', 64822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Lorewalkers travel the world, discovering new tales and retelling old ones.$B$BWe explore the rich history of the places and people in Pandaria.$B$BIf you would like to hear some of these stories for yourself, speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge, above the entrance to Mogu\'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', 64821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing left to be done for the Vale at this time, $n. The mogu disappeared shortly after you killed their leader. We are safe, thanks to you.', '', 64820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.$B$BGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y\'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.$B$BNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight.', '', 64819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. It is only fair that we reward those who risk their lives for our cause.$B$BBy helping to defend the Vale, you will not only keep our borders safe, but you will also gain access to our vast stores of powerful treasures.', '', 64818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Niuzao, the Black Ox, stands firm against the enemies beyond the wall.$B$BHe desperately needs aid to fight off the encroaching mantid.$B$BIf you wish to help, travel west to the temple in the Townlong Steppes.', 64817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chi-Ji watches over the Temple of the Red Crane to the south.$B$BShe is trying to regain order after the sha eruption created chaos across the land.$B$BIf you wish to help her, travel to the Cradle of Chi-Ji in the Krasarang Wilds.', 64816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Xuen, the White Tiger, guards against the cold winds of the north.$B$BToday, he seeks to test the greatest champions of the land in a series of trials.$B$BIf you believe yourself worthy, travel north to the Temple of the White Tiger, and make your challenge!', 64815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yu\'lon, the Jade Serpent, keeps vigil over the east. Unfortunately, her temple has fallen to the sha of doubt.$B$BEven now, the temple needs our help. We must do everything we can to keep the sha at bay!', 64814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'By defending the four temples, you will earn great standing with the August Celestials. You will be granted the ability to purchase items of great power.$B$BIn addition, you will help defend this land against some of our greatest enemies.', 64813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterfully done.$B$BWe wouldn\'t have succeeded without you.', '', 64812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, over here near the end of the bridge.', '', 64811, 0, 17710, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stand in the fire ya git.', '', 64810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for the eye!', '', 64809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time ya go hunting, cover that glowing eye of yours. It gives ya away.', '', 64808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know what that thing is?', '', 64807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a dark gloom to be sure. Be careful!', '', 64806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch out for those mists! That stuff looks poisonous.', '', 64805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that filthy thing out of my boy\'s head!', '', 64804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one messes with MY boy!', '', 64803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, bad, I\'m the guy with the gun.', '', 64802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you how a Nesingwary hunts!', '', 64801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you forget who you\'re messing with?!', '', 64800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! You\'re not gonna get my boy that easily.', '', 64799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in the world is that?', '', 64798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hardly anyone. It\'s guarded by a group called \"The Golden Lotus.\" Members of the Golden Lotus are hand-picked by the Celestials to maintain a vigil over the Vale, but few are chosen.$b$bI\'ve heard stories about the Vale since I was a cub. Can you believe such a place actually exists?$b$bDo you think the legends of the pools are true? I wish I could see for myself!', '', 64797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 396, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Your mind is plagued with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[Visions of Demise]|h|r !', 'Your mind is plagued with |cFFFF0404|Hspell:124862|h[Visions of Demise]|h|r !', 64796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is in the Vale now?', 'Who is in the Vale now?', 64795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say \"hello\" to \"goodbye\"!', '', 64794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got a present for you.', '', 64793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets gonna get Ba-Bammed!', '', 64792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ba-ba-ba-ba BAM!', '', 64791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bam bam BOOM!', '', 64790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dance, wikkets! Dance!', '', 64789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets gonna get served!', '', 64788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to hozango!', '', 64787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket stew, coming up!', '', 64786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking time with Ookie!', '', 64785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are what\'s on the menu!', '', 64784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna shiver your timbers!', '', 64783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heyarrrrrr!', '', 64782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh - of course you haven\'t heard of the Vale.$b$bTwelve thousand years ago, it was the seat of Mogu power, the heart of an empire. Legend tells of sacred pools in there, the source of Mogu magic that allowed them to twist and shape flesh. But they could also be used for healing miracles. That is, if you believe in the legends.$b$bAfter the pandaren revolution, the Celestials agreed to seal away the Vale, so that the power of the pools could never be used for mischief.', '', 64781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 396, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 39653),
('Avast... dookers!', '', 64780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrrrrrrrrrrr... wikkets!', '', 64779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We fight the mantid, yaungol, and mogu. Enemies face us from all sides.\n\nI\'m here to make sure there are no surprises.', 64778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?', 'What is the Vale of Eternal Blossoms?', 64777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, traveler.', '', 64776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have I got a yak for you!', '', 64775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are sieging Niuzao Temple.$B$BYou are known to us, $n. Your help is necessary once more.', '', 64774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I make the luckydos luckier. Bring me an item and I will change its fortune to better serve your own... for a price.', '', 64773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come with the yak. If a luckydo is wise enough to buy, I will be wise enough to sell my wares to them.', '', 64772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Simply amazing!  You can fight by my side any day.', 64769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s down!  Let\'s finish it off.', 64768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve done it!  Now quickly, lets attack it while it\'s grounded.', 64767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s the way to do it!', 64766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re quick on your feet.  Keep it up!', 64765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji finished setting up the fireworks.  Use them to get it out of the sky.', 64764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The serpent is here!', 64763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the Klaxxi?', 'How can I help the Klaxxi?', 64762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How will I be rewarded by helping the Klaxxi?', 'How will I be rewarded by helping the Klaxxi?', 64761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know, $r.$B$BWe know so little about the Klaxxi. They seem to be quite ruthless, so perhaps your only reward would be a swift death.$B$BThen again, their civilization is quite vast and advanced. If you play your cards right, perhaps they will grant you untold power.$B$BThere is only one way to find out.', 64760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a mystery to me, $r. If you want to find out, you are both crazy and foolish!$B$BBut I suppose there is no other way to meet the Klaxxi than to venture beyond the wall into the Dread Wastes.', 64759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have just returned from the wall.$B$BThere, I heard rumors of a faction called The Klaxxi from beyond the Serpent\'s Spine. Supposedly, they are a council of mantid elders who have split off from the Mantid Empire, and now work in direct defiance of the mantid queen.$B$BI have seen with my own eyes the power that these mantid wield.$B$BIf these rumors are true, then perhaps there is a way to ally with these... Klaxxi... and work with them to stop the mantid swarm.', 64758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the Lorewalkers?', 'How can I help the Lorewalkers?', 64757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I help the Lorewalkers?', 'Why should I help the Lorewalkers?', 64756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story\'s telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.$B$BAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds.', 'The journey is its own reward, young one. Seek pleasure in a story\'s telling, and you will come away with riches beyond compare.$B$BAh yes, and one more thing. Those who rise in the ranks of the Lorewalkers are granted a very special gift - the ability to ride upon the clouds.', 64755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lorewalkers will send you to explore significant areas of Pandaria to recover cultural artifacts.$B$BOnce you find all the artifacts that belong to a collection, you will be able to hear the entire story from start to finish.$B$BFind all the artifacts and collect all the books to become a Lorewalker!$B$BIf you would like to become a researcher, then you should speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge.', '', 64754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Lorewalkers travel the world, discovering new tales and retelling old ones.$B$BWe explore the rich history of the places and people in Pandaria.$B$BIf you would like to hear some of these stories for yourself, speak to Lorewalker Cho at the Seat of Knowledge, above the entrance to Mogu\'shan Palace here in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.', '', 64753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the Shado-Pan?', 'How can I help the Shado-Pan?', 64752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I help the Shado-Pan?', 'Why should I help the Shado-Pan?', 64751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan is an ancient order that accepts and trains only the most elite and worthy.$B$BShould you manage to make yourself useful, you may find many powerful items available to you.', '', 64750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are a few ways to earn our esteem.$B$BWe are busy dealing with sha eruptions at Firebough Nook in Kun-Lai Summit. Help us there, and you will gain a foothold into our brotherhood.$B$BThe Shado-Pan Monastery is also in trouble. You may be able to assist our brothers and sisters there.$B$BThe Sha of Anger roams the fields of Kun-Lai to the north. Defeat it, and you will gain great respect from our order.$B$BA Shado-Pan contigent chases the Sha of Hatred in the Townlong Steppes. They may need help.$B$BIf you wish to earn our highest esteem, you must first prove yourself by earning revered standing with the Golden Lotus. Only then, speak to my brothers and sisters at Shado-Pan Garrison in the Townlong Steppes.', '', 64749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please fly me to Kypari Zar.', 'Please fly me to Kypari Zar.', 64748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please fly me to Zan\'vess.', 'Please fly me to Zan\'vess.', 64747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help The Golden Lotus?', 'How can I help The Golden Lotus?', 64746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will I be rewarded for helping to defend the Vale?', 'Will I be rewarded for helping to defend the Vale?', 64745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course. It is only fair that we reward those who risk their lives for our cause.$B$BBy helping to defend the Vale, you will not only keep our borders safe, but you will also gain access to our vast stores of powerful treasures.', 64744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.$B$BGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y\'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.$B$BNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight.', 64743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Vale of Eternal Blossoms is in great danger, $r.$B$BGarrosh Hellscream has tainted the waters of our sacred Vale with the Heart of Y\'Shaarj, a dark relic from an ancient evil. The effects of his act... well... you can see them for yourself here in the Vale.$B$BNow, remnants of the sha threaten our very existence. We have no choice but to fight.', 64742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the August Celestials today?', 'How can I help the August Celestials today?', 64741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I help the August Celestials?', 'Why should I help the August Celestials?', 64740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By defending the four temples, you will earn great standing with the August Celestials. You will be granted the ability to purchase items of great power.$B$BIn addition, you will help defend this land against some of our greatest enemies.', '', 64739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niuzao, the Black Ox, stands firm against the enemies beyond the wall.$B$BHe desperately needs aid to fight off the encroaching mantid.$B$BIf you wish to help, travel west to the temple in the Townlong Steppes.', '', 64738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chi-Ji watches over the Temple of the Red Crane to the south.$B$BShe is trying to regain order after the sha eruption created chaos across the land.$B$BIf you wish to help her, travel to the Cradle of Chi-Ji in the Krasarang Wilds.', '', 64737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xuen, the White Tiger, guards against the cold winds of the north.$B$BToday, he seeks to test the greatest champions of the land in a series of trials.$B$BIf you believe yourself worthy, travel north to the Temple of the White Tiger, and make your challenge!', '', 64736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now THAT was a fine display of harpoonery!', 64735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yu\'lon, the Jade Serpent, keeps vigil over the east. Unfortunately, her temple has fallen to the sha of doubt.$B$BEven now, the temple needs our help. We must do everything we can to keep the sha at bay!', '', 64734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need a little fortune in your favor, $r? Everyone needs a little luck to spruce things up!$B$BDon\'t worry, I can help tweak the odds in your favor!', 64733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mazu\'s been good to me. Her waters have sustained me and her winds have carried me to far off places. What better life could I have asked for?', '', 64732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fighting off that leviathan was fun, but I think I\'ve had enough adventure for a lifetime. Safe travels to you, $p. Stop by any time!', '', 64731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the reward for rising through the Order of the Cloud Serpent?', 'What is the reward for rising through the Order of the Cloud Serpent?', 64730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does it mean to join the Order of the Cloud Serpent?', 'What does it mean to join the Order of the Cloud Serpent?', 64729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you enter the Order of the Cloud Serpent, you will begin the journey of a serpent rider.$B$BYou will raise a baby serpent from the egg, train with it every day, and watch it grow to adulthood.', '', 64728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no greater honor than rising through the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent.$B$BOnce you have proven yourself, you will be free to wander the land with your serpent as your flying mount.$B$BYou will also earn the Cloud Serpent Riding skill, which will allow you to ride any cloud serpent mount from Pandaria.', '', 64727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Order of the Cloud Serpent is sworn to defend the Jade Forest. We train at the Arboretum, just to the north of the Temple of the Jade Serpent in the Jade Forest.', '', 64726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of stuff can I do with the Tillers?', 'What kind of stuff can I do with the Tillers?', 64725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why should I help the Tillers?', 'Why should I help the Tillers?', 64724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, the Tillers won\'t be crowning you in jewels or building you up for war.$B$BNah, the life of a farmer is about somethin\' a little different.$B$BIf you stick with it, you might meet some real interesting folks. You\'ll be able to build up your own farm, plant your own crops, and enjoy the fruits of your own labor.$B$BSo if all that sounds interesting, then you should go to Halfhill and see for yourself!', '', 64723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, where should I begin!?$B$BFirst, the life of a farmer involves sowing seeds and harvesting crops. The crops that you sell can be used in cooking, sold on the auction house, traded to other buyers, or traded for meat and fish. I\'ve even heard of rare seeds that can be planted for unique items... perhaps even a little pet!$B$BThen there\'s all of Halfhill to explore! The best way to make friends with the locals is to give them gifts, and if you become friends, they might just give you some nice gifts in return.$B$BThere\'s always plenty to do around the fields, and an extra pair of hands would sure be appreciated.', '', 64722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r.$B$BI can see from a glance that you are a great adventurer.$B$BAll across the land, there are dark crypts and vast palaces, all full of terrible and mighty enemies. They guard many secrets, but also... harbor great rewards.$B$BThe bravest of heroes may venture to attempt these encounters, but beware! You would be racing against time, as well as testing your skill against other heroes!$B$BAre you up for the challenge?', '', 64721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VICTORY!', '', 64720, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29027, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whaddaya mean, what\'s in it for you? What kind of question is that?$B$BIsn\'t the joy of fishing The Big One out of the sea enough? What about feeling the sun on your neck and the saltwater spray of the ocean on your face? What about opening a cold brew while sitting back with your friends?$B$BThat ain\'t enough?!?$B$BLet me tell you, your future life as a $Gfisherman:fisherwoman; will be rewarding beyond compare!$B$BYou can improve your fishing skill for starters. Gain enough skill, and you can purchase powerful fishing rods.$B$BWell-respected fishermen can get access to a special fish pet, a water strider mount, and even your own personal fishing raft!', 64719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The best fishing can be found down at the Anglers Wharf in southeastern Krasarang Wilds. Anyone is welcome to visit us and take up a fishing rod!', 64718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
