('Boss... this is real nice. Thank you.', '', 64545, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feather for Chee Chee? Thank you.', '', 64544, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
