('Ooh, nice gift for Chee Chee! Thank you!', '', 64541, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me?!', '', 64540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did you know that I like cats?', 64539, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 64538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Out of all the people in the heartland, you gave this to me? I don\'t even know what to say, except I\'m mighty honored.', 64537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our home was stolen! So we will take yours!', '', 64536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s so nice of you, to think of me.', 64535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, you are so very kind, $n.', 64534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Owning a little piece o\' jade is like having a charm to ward off evil spirits. Thanks so much for this little cat! It\'ll keep me safe, I just know it.', 64533, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jade is so very lucky, didn\'t you know? Thanks for giving this to me.', 64532, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, my pappy always said these little cat figures were lucky!', 64531, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yer so nice, $n. I\'m so glad to know someone like you.', 64530, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, I didn\'t get you anything in return! Boo...', 64529, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, it feels good to get salt in the old fur again.', '', 64528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sure \'bout that, $n? Wow, thank you!', 64527, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some folks might ask why I like flowers so much. That\'s just me appreciatin\' the beauty of this land.', '', 64526, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We claim your lands for our own!', '', 64525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s mighty nice of you, sharing such a lucky flower with me.', '', 64524, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are yaungol lands!', '', 64523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My momma always told me these flowers were lucky.', '', 64522, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
