('Your consciousness is expanding. Concentrate on who you are looking for. The boy prince - the young lion. He is here, isn\'t he? Journey through time and space... open the eye of your soul. Do you see him?', '', 64459, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
