('There have been no Shado-Pan down this way recently. That cannot be good.$b$bWe were supposed to still have a few years before the next mantid swarm.', 'There have been no Shado-Pan down this way recently. That cannot be good.$b$bWe were supposed to still have a few years before the next mantid swarm.', 64438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once saw a strange creature in the Grummle Bazaar. It looked like a haunched over jinyu but was mean and said something like \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".$b$bI guess one of the grummles brought it up from the coastline.', 'I once saw a strange creature in the Grummle Bazaar. It looked like a haunched over jinyu but was mean and said something like \"Mrggmrmrgmgmgl\".$b$bI guess one of the grummles brought it up from the coastline.', 64437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountain hozen are on the ravage. Be careful when you travel the roads.$b$bProbably only a matter of time before they figure out the Shado-Pan are not here and decide to march down on us.', 'The mountain hozen are on the ravage. Be careful when you travel the roads.$b$bProbably only a matter of time before they figure out the Shado-Pan are not here and decide to march down on us.', 64436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you heard the sha? We keep hearing its voice on the wind. Not good. Not good at all.', 'Have you heard the sha? We keep hearing its voice on the wind. Not good. Not good at all.', 64435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grummles usually have Shado-Pan guarding them. I guess there must be danger on the Serpent\'s Spine.', 'Grummles usually have Shado-Pan guarding them. I guess there must be danger on the Serpent\'s Spine.', 64434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you up the mountain?', 'What brings you up the mountain?', 64433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You from the low lands? We tend to not see low landers up this way very often.', 'You from the low lands? We tend to not see low landers up this way very often.', 64432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guarding grummles is not what I would call my dream role in life, but they pay well. Plus you see many strange things on the mountain roads.', 'Guarding grummles is not what I would call my dream role in life, but they pay well. Plus you see many strange things on the mountain roads.', 64431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaagghhhh!!', '', 64430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta warn the others!', '', 64429, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEVIATHAN!!', '', 64428, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the...', '', 64427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind Lord Mel\'jarak senses more than 4 of his allies are incapacitated and frees them!', '', 64426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_2h_mantid_01.blp:20|tWind Lord Mel\'jarak begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:122407|h[Rain of Blades]|h|r!', '', 64425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n is trapped in an Amber Prison! Free them!', '$n is trapped in an Amber Prison! Free them!', 64424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a beautiful creature, wouldn\'t you agree? Do not let his small size deceive you. Even at a young age the Kunchong are lethal.$b$bBefore my discovery, the Kunchong were used as weapons with little regard for their intelligence. We struggled to control them until it occurred to me that we didn\'t fully understand them.$b$bBy forming a bond with the creatures we no longer needed to exert control forcefully. Instead, a partnership occurred.$b$bKovok was the next step in my experiment.', '', 64423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all of the paragons were choosen for the physical skills, Wakener.', '', 64422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Saurok runs down a hidden set of stairs with some of the treasure!', '', 64421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, boss! Chee Chee got stuff to do at the market today, then he be there soon.', '', 64420, 0, 13910, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I can\'t leave the market today, but I\'ll be there as soon as I can.', 64419, 0, 13913, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I\'ve just gotta take care of some stuff here at the market, first. I\'ll be there soon as I can!', 64418, 0, 13912, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was wonderin\' when you would ask. Sure thing, but I can\'t today. Once I finish my business at the market, I\'ll be right over!', '', 64417, 0, 13904, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well all right, I s\'pose I could hop on over to the farm now and again. I can\'t do it right away though. I have some business to finish at the market, first.', 64416, 0, 13908, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? That whole pond, just for me? I\'ll be right there... right after I finish this drink... hic!', '', 64415, 0, 13907, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon\'s. Let me finish up my business here at the market, first.', '', 64414, 0, 13906, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I s\'pose the chickens won\'t mind if I visit fer a bit. I\'ll meet ya there after I\'ve done my business here at the market today.', '', 64413, 0, 13905, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sunsong Ranch needs my help? I\'ll meet you there after I\'m done here at the market today.', 64412, 0, 13911, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I\'ll be there after I\'m done at the market today.', 64411, 0, 13909, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reflexes built in the survival ring are what keep these trainees alive beyond the wall.  There, the threats are much less forgiving.', '', 64410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I weep for the fortune of this village. Their hard times seem to be without end, and with the mogu in the vale, it will likely be some time before they ever will.', 64409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the darkest of times, it is often a patient spirit and a reassuring hand that carry the most value.', 64408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu are cruel captors. We should not risk any time if any of our brave warriors have fallen into their hands.', 64407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Within these ruins rest many ancient mogu secrets.  This entire vale was theirs once, and some corners of it have yet to be tread by pandaren feet.', 64406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why old mogu build broken pillars and walls here?  Why not build full buildings like everyone else?  Mogu dumb.', '', 64405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook want to smash mogu, but villagers not safe!  If Rook keep villagers safe, can you help smash mogu?', '', 64404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rook treats friends good.', '', 64403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I often worry, if the blossoms in this vale are truly eternal, it would be quite dangerous for new ones to sprout, no?  We\'d be swimming in sea of choking flowers, fragrant and soft as they might be.$B$BI like to play it safe and squash the small ones under my boot, just to keep things in balance, you know?', '', 64402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well this all is all manner of spooky, is it not?  And these traps, quite unwelcoming.  These mogu could desperately use some decoration advice.', '', 64401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard nothing but tales of how peaceful and beautiful this vale was, far before any of us were ever allowed in. Now that we\'re here, there\'s all manner of beasty trying to smash our head or bite off our feet.$B$BSo are the tales a lie, or are we just horrid company? I humbly exclude myself from the latter possibility, because to consider such would be silly.', '', 64400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A budding village is a wonderful place to make a living!  So many goods needed, so many goods to be traded.  I think I could grow fat and happy here indeed!', '', 64399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the most bountiful land in all of Pandaria! A smart man could grow rich here!', '', 64398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if our fates are somehow cursed. The horrors inflicted on us never seem to cease.$B$BSometimes all you can do is try to maintain good spirits, and perhaps a mild appreciation for fickle twists of fortune, whichever way they turn.', 64397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are as new to this vale as you. We came when the gates opened, having lost our homes in Kun-Lai. There is much to build, much to mend.', 64396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu are a mighty threat, but they\'re nothing compared to the horrors my men and I have faced in the Dread Wastes. I have no doubts that we can hold the Vale.', '', 64395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rising threats of the mogu\'s return and the mantid swarms in the west have brought far more trainees to bare than usual. This is good. They will be needed.', '', 64394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no corner of this vale that the Shao-Tien can hide from us in. They underestimate the tenacity of the Shado-Pan.', '', 64393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t love spiders. Or statues that move. Or sprites that steal your things.  There are a lot of things I don\'t love about these ruins.  Fortunately for me, Anji\'s here to keep my good-looks intact!', '', 64392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to think of myself as the brains and the beauty of this operation. Anji\'s the brawn. And the second beauty.$B$BWe\'ve got a lot of beauty.', '', 64391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He stares at you blankly.>', '', 64390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He\'s eyes light up as you approach.>', '', 64389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He looks to you grimly.>', '', 64388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is important for the trainees to learn the sting of defeat, that they might appreciate the value of victory.', '', 64387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of my ancestors took part in the uprising at Tu Shen, and now lies among the graves.  I would pay my respects if only I could, but the spirits there know no peace.', '', 64386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me Kovok.', '', 64385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many mouths to feed, and never enough ingredients to feed them!', '', 64384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t he magnificent?!', '', 64383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It can be difficult for a hardened veteran to grow accustomed to a peaceful setting, but that is our duty.  These villagers do not long for war, let us not bring it to their doorstep if we do not have to.', '', 64382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Setting foot in the Dread Wastes taught me the value of knowing the terrain and understanding the enemies\' movements.  Whether the goal is victory or simply survival, the best route is always to be two steps ahead of your opponent.', '', 64381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We all served under Leven in excursions past the wall.  We honed our blades against countless mantid and yaungol.  These mogu think us weak, but that mistake in judgment will cost them dearly.', 64380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These trainees are weak.  They are not ready to walk the wall, much less face the mantid or the mogu head-on.  It will be some time before we can depend on them in any real sense.', 64379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Shao-Tien have taken a great interest in these ruins.  They intend to recover power from its depths.  I intend to leave their corpses littering them.', 64378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To run on water, one must run very fast.', '', 64377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You move like a pregnant yak. You are not ready to be trained here.', '', 64376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your struggle is pitiful and weak!', 'Your struggle is pitiful and weak!', 64375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even death will not free you from my grasp!', 'Even death will not free you from my grasp!', 64374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have your head on a pike, $r!', 'I will have your head on a pike, $r!', 64373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush the life from your skull!', 'I will crush the life from your skull!', 64372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The return of the Emperor will doom your entire race!', 'The return of the Emperor will doom your entire race!', 64371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your soul will be mine to torture!', 'Your soul will be mine to torture!', 64370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your eyes fail to see what is before you. No doubt this is a result of your flawed eating habits.', '', 64369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will blanket the Vale in your bloody bodies!', 'We will blanket the Vale in your bloody bodies!', 64368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn under the might of the Shao-Tien!', 'You will burn under the might of the Shao-Tien!', 64367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your stance is wrong. Your footing is totally off balance. Your head is too soft.$b$bReturn here when you have learned that you are ready to learn.', '', 64366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yield or fall!', 'Yield or fall!', 64365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shao-Tien march to their deaths!', 'The Shao-Tien march to their deaths!', 64364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vale will never fall into mogu hands!', 'The Vale will never fall into mogu hands!', 64363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Golden Lotus will never yield.', 'The Golden Lotus will never yield.', 64362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand together.  We will never fall!', 'We stand together.  We will never fall!', 64361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to munch on some mutton!', '', 64360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the will of the Celestials!', 'By the will of the Celestials!', 64359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long live the Golden Lotus!', 'Long live the Golden Lotus!', 64358, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmmm! I smell a delicious sheep!', '', 64357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never yield our defense of the Vale!', 'We will never yield our defense of the Vale!', 64356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the timely rescue, hero.', 'Thank you for the timely rescue, hero.', 64355, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too long in that cage.  I\'ll show these mogu what I think of their captivity...', 'Too long in that cage.  I\'ll show these mogu what I think of their captivity...', 64354, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am grateful, friend.  Let me fight by your side.', 'I am grateful, friend.  Let me fight by your side.', 64353, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you.', 'Thank you.', 64352, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for battle Wakener!', '', 64351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve earned my aid.  Where to?', 'You\'ve earned my aid.  Where to?', 64350, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m at your side, friend.', 'I\'m at your side, friend.', 64349, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life.', 'I owe you my life.', 64348, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attackers approach!', '', 64347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of the initiates pulled a prank on me the other day. He said I was supposed to sniff his \"healing mists\". There was nothing healing about that mist.', 'One of the initiates pulled a prank on me the other day. He said I was supposed to sniff his \"healing mists\". There was nothing healing about that mist.', 64346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait! Something hostile approaches!', '', 64345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger.', 'I thought that was it... I thought I was going to die.  Thank you, stranger.', 64344, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you!  You saved my brother not even a week ago.  You\'re a true hero!', 'I know you!  You saved my brother not even a week ago.  You\'re a true hero!', 64343, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m alive thanks only to you... I won\'t forget this.', 'I\'m alive thanks only to you... I won\'t forget this.', 64342, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mogu won\'t scare us away.  This is our home now.', 'These mogu won\'t scare us away.  This is our home now.', 64341, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems there are hazards to living in a place so beautiful...', 'It seems there are hazards to living in a place so beautiful...', 64340, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They came without warning.  There\'s nothing the guards could have done.', 'They came without warning.  There\'s nothing the guards could have done.', 64339, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor Sheepie... his restless wandering finally did him in.', '', 64338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can... I can barely breathe.  I\'m alive thanks to you.', 'I can... I can barely breathe.  I\'m alive thanks to you.', 64337, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never knew how much variety there was to brewing tea.', 'I never knew how much variety there was to brewing tea.', 64336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t talk now. Must... focus.', 'Can\'t talk now. Must... focus.', 64335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am learning how to slap the pain out of someone. How neat is that?', 'I am learning how to slap the pain out of someone. How neat is that?', 64334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone was saying I was \"overhealing\" the other day. I am so confused.', 'Someone was saying I was \"overhealing\" the other day. I am so confused.', 64333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am trying to learn how to heal. The problem is you have to get hurt before you can be healed.', 'I am trying to learn how to heal. The problem is you have to get hurt before you can be healed.', 64332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you met Brewmaster Blanche? She wanders the roads to the south and east of here. She has been known to visit us with some of her more astounding brews.', 'Have you met Brewmaster Blanche? She wanders the roads to the south and east of here. She has been known to visit us with some of her more astounding brews.', 64331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are quite calm here usually. We only have problems with the occassional saurok hunting party. And the saurok tend to only come out during a heavy storm.', 'Things are quite calm here usually. We only have problems with the occassional saurok hunting party. And the saurok tend to only come out during a heavy storm.', 64330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Do not let the armor deceive you. We train in healing practices here.', 'Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Do not let the armor deceive you. We train in healing practices here.', 64329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If there is one thing in life you can learn, it is that there is always more to learn.', 64328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Thunderpaw Refuge. Here we practice our craft of focusing our chi into healing.', 64327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Healing has turned the tide of many battles.', 64326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never underestimate the importance of healing.', 64325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not sure how I got here. But... good fortune often finds the open minded.', '', 64324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More visitors? Bah!', '', 64323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is some first-rate harpoonery!', '', 64322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like he sprung a leak!', '', 64321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right! Back to the depths with ya!', '', 64320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it up!', '', 64319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HURGHH!!!', '', 64318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mazu, guide my arm...', '', 64317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! What do you think of that, you old squid?!', '', 64316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice shooting!', '', 64315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoot it in the face! And the sides! And the pooper! You know, the soft bits.', '', 64314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Err, sorry... Let me put that another way.', '', 64313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aim for the bow, the port and starboard buoyancy sacs, and the stern...', '', 64312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Man the harpoon cannon!', '', 64311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Mist-Hopper Jr. is on the dock just southeast of here. Let\'s go!', '', 64310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been affected by |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116417|h[Arcane Resonance]|h|r !', 'You have been affected by |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116417|h[Arcane Resonance]|h|r !', 64309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is... remarkable, $n! These notes provide invaluable knowledge to our farmers. We are truly in Old Man Thistle\'s debt for keeping such records, and in your debt for recovering them. Thank you!', 64308, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We made it out alive! Boy oh boy, wait until my friends hear all about this. They\'ll never believe it! See you later, $n!', 64307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They approach? Good. Now, if only my students were here to see and learn from the coming display of martial prowess...', '', 64306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They failed their test. Will you?', '', 64305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One technique alone is not enough.', '', 64304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They should have studied harder.', '', 64303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mere initiates.', '', 64302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You sure? I hear it happens to everyone at some point.', 64301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Nope.', '', 64300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... want to talk about it?', 64299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gossip - Option 2 - Test - HW', 'Gossip - Option 2 - Test - HW', 64298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gossip - Option 1 - Test - HW', 'Gossip - Option 1 - Test - HW', 64297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That thing is seriously scary-looking! You saved our lives, $n!', 64296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll try my best to be a good student.', 'I\'ll try my best to be a good student.', 64295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will we be learning next?', 'What will we be learning next?', 64294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you think I\'ll make a good cook eventually?', 'Do you think I\'ll make a good cook eventually?', 64293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oooh, this is so exciting! A real life treasure hunt!', 64292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up, I want to be the best chef in Pandaria.', 'When I grow up, I want to be the best chef in Pandaria.', 64291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are my favorite teacher ever!', 'You are my favorite teacher ever!', 64290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I often wonder about the jinyu here. But they know how to fish and better than the rest of us so who am I to judge.', 64289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are the seas like where you come from?', 64288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fish here long enough and you will see everything. I once saw a walrus with legs and arms. Not only that, but it talked!', 64287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did the Serpent Riders send you? Their serpents keep stealing our best catches.', 64286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You probably have seen the ships crashed off our shores. Would any of those happen to be yours?$b$bThe mists often bring us a number of \"gifts\" like that.', 64285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One of the children swears up and down they saw a cross between a shark and an octopus the other day.$b$bI know there are a lot of strange things in the ocean but that seems extra silly to me.', 64284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'New here? It is like we tell the children, do not go into the water without a handful of distracting bait and an exit strategy.', 64283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I knew a monk once who specialized in a fish-fighting style. It was pretty limiting but he could make an amazing fish stew.', 64282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Usually these shores are covered in mists. It looks like they cleared out for some reason.', '', 64281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, what are the fish like where you come from?', '', 64280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever see a kracken before? Old Jin claims to have caught one, once upon a time, but let it go on acount of it looked too \"gamey.\"$b$bWe have a betting pool going to see if he ever finds it again.', '', 64279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of bait you use? I knew a pandaren once, would use his own arm to bait the fish.$b$bWe called him the Noodler.$b$bRumor has it he\'s retired and went south.', '', 64278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the coast of Pandaria! Where everything that can wash ashore has, or will, wash ashore.', '', 64277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You a fisher? With them flabby arms and that heavy armor?', '', 64276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once saw a fish so big you\'d swear it was a shark. Come to think of it...', '', 64275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We drove back the sha, your kind will fall before us as well.', '', 64274, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not tolerate those who unleashed the sha upon our land.', '', 64273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now go, impart my techniques to the initiates.', '', 64272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh yeah? Tell me more.', 'Oh yeah? Tell me more.', 64271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now they say that whoever can git their hands on that map, can find that lost treasure...', 64270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the story of Old Man Thistle.', 'Tell me the story of Old Man Thistle.', 64269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woowhee! I still can\'t believe we found Old Man Thistle\'s treasure. I guess all those folk stories weren\'t so true after all, but I still like tellin\' them!', 64268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ken I do fer ya, $n?', 64267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you try to sneak up on me! My pappy always said I got eyes in the back o\' my head!', 64266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see that big fish down there, $n?', 64265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('5.0 Cooking - Cooking Student Default 1', '', 64264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not supposed to talk to strangers.', 64263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a long walk from town to Sri-La, but good for the spirit. And it certainly helps get little Aerial here outdoors.', 64262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family and I are bringing fresh fish from the Anglers to town. Would you like to buy some?', '', 64261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can take me in battle?  Most girls hate snakes, but I think they\'re cute!', 'Think you can take me in battle?  Most girls hate snakes, but I think they\'re cute!', 64260, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can someone whisper secrets into the echoing dark?', 'Where can someone whisper secrets into the echoing dark?', 64259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find the ancestors\' stair?', 'Where can I find the ancestors\' stair?', 64258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever heard of a maiden laughing behind a fan?', 'Have you ever heard of a maiden laughing behind a fan?', 64257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you make anything of these clues?', 'Can you make anything of these clues?', 64256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I HAVE heard of the ancestors\' stair. That\'s what some folks call those mountains to the north.', '', 64255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, I reckon I don\'t know, $r. All I can understand is the part about the valley - that\'s right here! The Valley of the Four Winds!', '', 64254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What echoes and what\'s dark? It\'s simple! A cave!', '', 64253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The maiden, eh? Hmm, I remember that\'s what my father used to call that river to the north. Other than that, I wouldn\'t have the slightest clue.', 64252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jumping jackhoppers! We found it! We really found it! It\'s Old Man Thistle\'s hidden treasure! Oh boy oh boy oh boy!!!', 64251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wooooowwwww!', 64250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There it is! Old Man Thistle\'s treasure!', 64249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eeewwww! What is THAT THING?', 64248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oooooh, isn\'t this scary? Do you think there are ghosts in there?', 64247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow! I never knew this was back here.', 64246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No honey bear. I need you to get those legs nice and strong. You want to be as strong as me one day, right?', '', 64245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you carry me, daddy?', 64244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re almost there. Just a bit more to go.', '', 64243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we there yet?', 64242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time to get the fish from the market.', 64241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are we going?', 64240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('The ancient chest is covered in dust...', '', 64239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s time.', '', 64238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are we gonna see a shark?', 64237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Eh? What did you say?', '', 64236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got nothin\' to say to you! I will only be talkin\' to $p.', '', 64235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much... lost.$b$bAnd I fear, $n, that this is only the beginning.', '', 64234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you help us against the sha?', 'Will you help us against the sha?', 64233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did all of the jinyu and the hozen perish in that battle? Were there survivors?', 'Did all of the jinyu and the hozen perish in that battle? Were there survivors?', 64232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The poor hozen and jinyu! We knew they didn\'t like each other but to go this far...', 'The poor hozen and jinyu! We knew they didn\'t like each other but to go this far...', 64231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you help us heal the land?', 'Will you help us heal the land?', 64230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this \"sha\"? Where did it come from?', 'What is this \"sha\"? Where did it come from?', 64229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jade Serpent statue was destroyed? How could this have happened?', 'The Jade Serpent statue was destroyed? How could this have happened?', 64228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, just look at this storm! Well, crops like water, right?', '', 64227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the sky, $n! It\'s raining! Should be good for the crops, eh?', '', 64226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s raining yaks and mushan today! Well, I\'ve got a market to run, rain or shine!', 64225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The farmers pray for rain, but I don\'t! It\'s terrible for business. Just look at my market! Sopping wet!', 64224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you just love watching the birds? I wish I could fly, too.', 64223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jade Serpent statue was destroyed? How could this have happened?', 'The Jade Serpent statue was destroyed? How could this have happened?', 64222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there, traveler. I\'m hard at work making my next masterpiece!', '', 64221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, hello there, $r!$B$BThis is where we keep all our farming history and knowledge.$B$BWe have records of the local weather and resulting harvest, detailed notes on every seed and every plant that grows in the Valley, and even a bank of seeds for all the plants that we may ever need to grow.$B$BThis knowledge is sacred to us. If disaster should ever strike this land, our seeds must be saved.', 64220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, when is my son going to meet a nice young lady? All he does is hang around yaks all day!$B$BWhat girl is going to want a stinky yakherd, huh? Ai-ya, Mama worry so much...', 64219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you come to see Mama? Oh, sit for a while!$B$BLet me tell you, I hear some gossip the other day.$B$BI heard that Gina Mudclaw and her father, Haohan Mudclaw, don\'t get along!$B$BHe wanted to marry her to Farmer Fung up by the Belt, but she wouldn\'t have it! Wanted to run her market, she said.$B$BAi-ya! What has become of the young girls these days? Don\'t want to marry handsome young man and raise a family?$B$BEspecially that Fung... he\'s such a catch! So good-looking, and grows such big vegetables too.$B$BWhy I not have handsome young son like that?!', 64218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What does this mean? The end of peace in Pandaria? Are we doomed?', 'What does this mean? The end of peace in Pandaria? Are we doomed?', 64217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jade Serpent... what will it do now?', 'The Jade Serpent... what will it do now?', 64216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My son Dion is out in fields all day. He works so hard. Makes Mama so proud.', 64215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hozen and the jinyu have always fought, but never like this...', 'The hozen and the jinyu have always fought, but never like this...', 64214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mama loves oranges, but oranges are so hard to find in the Valley.$B$BI tell my son to buy some oranges at the market, so I give him some copper.$B$BWhat does he do? He buys some beans!$B$BWe are not farmers! We are yak-herders! What do I do with stupid beans, I ask you?', 64213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My son Dion say Mama make the best dumplings in all of Valley!$B$BOoohoohoohooo. That\'s my boy.', 64212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why my son must be so short? I wanted tall, strong young son.$B$BI told him not to open umbrellas indoors when he was little. You will grow up short, I say!$B$BWhat does he do? He play with umbrellas all the time! Inside! Tcha!', 64211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My son does not eat enough. Look at him! So scrawny and skinny! I must feed him more.', 64210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told my son, I told Dion, don\'t take the yaks to the field when it\'s raining. And what does he do? He takes out the yaks when it is raining.$B$BIt is no surprise that we now have sick yaks!$B$BAi-ya! How did I raise such a foolish son?', 64209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Jade Serpent! It... it broke.', 'The Jade Serpent! It... it broke.', 64208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been to Dawn\'s Blossom? Did you happen to pick up an extra cask of Goldendraft while there?$b$bIt is not the easiest thing to have them deliver here.', 'Have you been to Dawn\'s Blossom? Did you happen to pick up an extra cask of Goldendraft while there?$b$bIt is not the easiest thing to have them deliver here.', 64207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a place of peace. We watch, we meditate, we work on our crafts, and we are content.', 'This is a place of peace. We watch, we meditate, we work on our crafts, and we are content.', 64206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The farmers from the nearby fields bring their wheat, and we mill and sort the grains here.$B$BSome of the grain will be made into food, some of it is traded, but most of it is sent to the Stormstout Brewery for... you guessed it... beer!', '', 64205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Serpent\'s Overlook. Did you happen to bring a kite with you?', 'Welcome to the Serpent\'s Overlook. Did you happen to bring a kite with you?', 64204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When standing on the precipice, do not forget to breathe.', 'When standing on the precipice, do not forget to breathe.', 64203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From here we meditate on the wonders of Pandaria.', 'From here we meditate on the wonders of Pandaria.', 64202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you smell the winds, stranger? They bring change.', 'Can you smell the winds, stranger? They bring change.', 64201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to enjoy the view?', 'Are you here to enjoy the view?', 64200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Music is good for the mind, body, and soul!', 64199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $r, don\'t try anything funny! I\'ve got several wands up my sleeves and I\'m not afraid to use them!', '', 64198, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey now, this is no place to start a fight. Otherwise, no one will get to enjoy this food.', 64197, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead of bloodshed, how about we settle our differences... in a battle of the DANCE?', '', 64196, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey ugly, I would punch you right now... if I thought I could hit ya! Anyway, did ya know that they brew BEER here?', '', 64195, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m watching you, $r.', 64194, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our search has taken us across vast oceans and deep jungles, and yet we encounter one another here, of all places. It truly seems that our conflict is inevitable, wherever we go.', 64193, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us not bring bloodshed to this peaceful place, $brother:sister;.', 64192, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\' know, $r. Dis big vegetables don\' seem right, mon. How can dey just eat dem like it\'s nuddin\'? Where is all dey MEAT?', '', 64191, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, let us remain civil while we are guests in this town. I suspect our hosts will not react kindly to bloodshed.', '', 64190, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grummles have good noses. Can tell the difference between good and bad fortune by the smell. You have the smell of good fortune about you.', '', 64189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most good fortune to you, $r! My brother and I come from far away to share our luckydos.', '', 64188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most good fortune to you, $r! My brother and I come from far away to share our luckydos.', '', 64187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to enjoy the fruits of the earth, but not to excess.', '', 64186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaah, I believe that happiness is a full belly.$B$BFill your stomach with good food, and you fill your soul with warmth.', '', 64185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fill your cup with joy, and you will drink joy. Fill your cup with sorrow, and you will drink sorrow.$B$BChoose your brew wisely, my friend.', '', 64184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best brew in all of Pandaria is made right here in the Valley, at the Stormstout Brewery.$B$BWell, at least I think so.', '', 64183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wise man rests when he is weary.', '', 64182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a wand peddler by trade. Luckily for you and me both, most of my wands survived through the shipwreck!', '', 64181, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The locals here certainly have an idyllic lifestyle. It makes me wonder if I should lay down my wand and pick up a hoe.', '', 64180, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $c, fancy meeting you here! Were you sent to seek the young Prince, too?', '', 64179, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He keeps telling me that he likes my accent, and I just keep asking, what accent?', 64178, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you tried Kol\'s cooking? I can\'t seem to get enough of it.', 64177, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I just love listening to Kol talk about his delicious recipes. I never knew there were so many ways to grill meat.', 64176, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab a drink and join us, $r!', '', 64175, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say that there are over five thousand brews in Pandaria. I ain\'t leavin\' until I try them all!', '', 64174, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re hard at work, searching for Prince Anduin. We\'re just stoppin\' fer a bite and a drink.', '', 64173, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral Taylor sent us here to look fer the young Prince. Did ya know that they brew BEER here?', '', 64172, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All the stuff here... It\'s so... so... different!', 64171, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen the wall over to the west? I wonder what lies beyond it?', 64170, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This troll complains about the food, but he eats more than any of us.', 64169, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The locals here insist that the great healing waters we seek are no further than a certain... Stormstout Brewery. We may have to investigate their claims.', 64168, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dezco sent us ahead to scout this region. We may have found a path to the great healing in Leza\'s vision.', 64167, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\' know, $r. Dis big vegetables don\' seem right, mon. How can dey just eat dem like it\'s nuddin\'? Where is all dey MEAT?', '', 64166, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were lucky to meet up with these other Horde survivors. I did not realize that our brethren had washed up elsewhere on this new land.', '', 64165, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The enormous bird shies away from you.>', '', 64164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The great cat barely bats an ear at you, even when you run your fingers through her thick fur.>', '', 64163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Jiying says we have to continue our research, but it\'s nice to come here and relax every once in a while.', '', 64162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This food is delicious. I never want to leave.', '', 64161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew! That is some strong brew!', '', 64160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our brother over there drowns his sorrows in apathy and wine, instead of work and toil.', '', 64159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jogu is from a different tribe than us. He came far from the north, and will not speak much of what led him here.', '', 64158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, our brother Jogu has not fared well since his family died.', '', 64157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water in this pond is... quite awful.', '', 64156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We think that the unique qualities of the water in the Valley is the main reason for the abundance in the region.', '', 64155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people and I are studying the nearby rivers and ponds. Never before have we seen such revitalizing water.', '', 64154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I call upon the watersss of my homelands... DELIVER MY ENEMIES UNTO ME!', '', 64153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In our travels, we have sung many songs, but there are many more songs to sing.', 64152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We travel where the winds take us, good $r. Would you like to listen for a while?', 64151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh! You stirred up some spiders!', 'Uh-oh! You stirred up some spiders!', 64150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh! You stirred up some angry crabs!', 'Uh-oh! You stirred up some angry crabs!', 64149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There - do you feel it? A perfect stillness of the soul! Feel the dream brew take effect.', '', 64148, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really owe you one, so I\'ll tell ya what. I\'ll talk to my father about letting you guys join the Tillers Union.', 64147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Negative emotions, like anger or doubt, they take on a strange power here on Pandaria. But this you will discover in time.', '', 64146, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I\'ve decided I like having you as a friend. Makes me think that maybe I can have other friends, too.', '', 64145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s my good friend, $n. I\'m feeling more lucid today. Maybe because I\'ve cut back a little on the sauce.', '', 64144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, care to sit with me and share a drink?', '', 64143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend of jinyu, come sit with me a while.', '', 64142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m awful thirsty, buddy.', '', 64141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy, got shome coin to shpare a poor jinyu?', '', 64140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The watersh tell of good fortune today, $n.', '', 64139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What brings you to my well today, $Gbrother:sister;?', '', 64138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buy a fish a drink?', '', 64137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey shtranger... you got some coin for a thirsty traveler?', '', 64136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was mighty kind of you to help me, $r. I\'m in your debt.', '', 64135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you going to do, Farmer Yoon?', 'What are you going to do, Farmer Yoon?', 64134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what? I\'m going to show them that I can also become a master farmer!$B$BI\'m going to turn this farm into one of the most prosperous in the Valley!$B$BIt\'s too much work for one pandaren, though. Whaddaya say? Want to help me?', '', 64133, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mung-Mung in big, stinky dook without you! Mung-Mung is in your debt. Maybe you and Yoon aren\'t such jibnibbers after all.', '', 64132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at you! The picture of serenity. I knew I liked you.', '', 64131, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about ... THIS?', '', 64130, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so sorry, that did not alarm you did it, hmm? We Pandaren value calm under any circumstance.', '', 64129, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good, I see you are not easily distracted. We Pandaren are extremely focused on the moment, sometimes to our detriment.', '', 64128, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, you must STAY CENTERED. You can focus or relax, but above all else, remain in the center.', '', 64127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A good dream brew is VERY powerful. It will require a focused mind to gain any kind of clarity from the visions!', '', 64126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deck Boss said you needed some help.', 'Deck Boss said you needed some help.', 64125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dream brew that you sampled earlier can expand your consciousness and show you events transpiring around the land. I will teach you how to use it properly, and we will find your prince!$b$bBut first, help me to create a fresh batch.', '', 64124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... in... Mazu\'s... name... HRRGHHH!!', '', 64123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrr... whatever I\'ve got here is big. Keep up the good work on those lines while I land this baby!', '', 64122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that\'s unusual...Take care of it, then tug another line when you can.', '', 64121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick any of these fabulous rods and CAREFULLY tug the line. That should help set the hook into whatever\'s flailin\' around at the other end.', '', 64120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You WILL tell us where the remains have been hidden!', 64119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('You barbarians will think twice before attacking our village again!', '', 64118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('I have a task for you.', 'I have a task for you.', 64117, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think of my pet?', 'What do you think of my pet?', 64116, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to heal and revive my battle pets.', 'I\'d like to heal and revive my battle pets.', 64115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHEEEEEEE!', '', 64114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_dust.blp:20|t%s begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:124359|h[Burrow]|h|r!', '', 64113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warbring Qobi dropped his axes. Grab one!', '', 64112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more excuses, Empress! Eliminate these cretins or I will kill you myself!', '', 64111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32647, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the item from his hand.', 'Take the item from his hand.', 64110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statue appears to be holding something...', '', 64109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses in a heap and expires suddenly.', '', 64108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Amber Growth seeps into %s\'s wounds, replenishing its vitality.', '', 64107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_volcano.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:125391|h[Fire Lines]|h|r!', '', 64106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our empires will take what is ours!', 'Our empires will take what is ours!', 64105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Zandalari were meant to have this land!', 'Da Zandalari were meant to have this land!', 64104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be interferin\' with de wrong empire!', 'You be interferin\' with de wrong empire!', 64103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not take dis land from us!', 'You will not take dis land from us!', 64102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Creepy, aren\'t they? Never seen \'em before, but I\'ve been pulling \'em in all day.', '', 64101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What will the sea bring us today?', '', 64100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death has gained you nothing!', '', 64099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are too late...', '', 64098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When two great empires reunite, the world will crumble around them...', '', 64097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your victory will be short lived...', '', 64096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death will not save you from what is coming...', '', 64095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your weakness offends!', '', 64094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will serve, or you will die!', '', 64093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will rebuild our empire on the corpses of our enemies!', '', 64092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life will be a fitting sacrifice to our emperor!', '', 64091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be the first of many to die!', '', 64090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not welcome here!', '', 64089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind should not be allowed in the valley!', '', 64088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your death will be neither swift nor painless!', '', 64087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will regret this intrusion!', '', 64086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you set foot in the valley!', '', 64085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for this disturbance!', '', 64084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go and see Brewmaster Boof for some Kun-Lai Kicker!', '', 64083, 0, 17573, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $p! Now we can use it to kick some yaungol butt!', '', 64082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me some quick! Before the yaungol get it all!', 'Give me some quick! Before the yaungol get it all!', 64081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $n! Are you ready for the best brew in all of Pandaria? I\'ll warn you now, after drinking this brew you may want to kick things. Which is good because we have a lot of yaungol that need a good kicking!', '', 64080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there any other defenses?', 'Are there any other defenses?', 64079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Binan fishermen could catch a greased hozen in their nets while blindfolded, $n. Surely they could snare a few yaungol for us. Talk to them about helping us defend the village!', 64078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Derpa Derpa wanders into town every now and then and tries to sell us strange gadgets that he\'s found rummaging around Kun-Lai Summit. Talk to him and see if he has anything that we could use as a weapon.', 64077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Xuen shield bearers come down from the Temple of the White Tiger each year, $n. They could block the yaungol advance and prevent them from getting into the village. Talk to them and see if they can aid us.', 64076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cianz comes to bless our festival each year, $n. He will not fight in battle but maybe there is something he can do to help us. Ask if there is anything he can do.', 64075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are some jovial villagers in town that claim they created a helmet that makes them better at everything. While I\'m skeptical, having a helmet on couldn\'t hurt, right? Talk to them and see if they\'ll lend you one.', 64074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are Tian mistweavers here from the Tian monastery, $n. Their skills with mistweaving would allow us to fight even longer! Ask them to aid us in this fight.', 64073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are some Vale marksmen in town that stopped to rest for the night, $n. They have defended the Gate of the Setting Sun against the mantid for many years with their mortars. See if you can wake them up!', 64072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are some damaged cannons inside the storehouses and behind the inn, $n. If you could repair them, the villagers could use them to blast the yaungol!', 64071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are Tian disciples in town celebrating the Brewmoon, $n! Surely they could use their training to help us. Talk to them and see if they can stop these yaungol!', 64070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have barrels of fireworks all over the town for the festival celebrations, $n. Place a few of them in the right locations and give them a good wack and they would cause all kinds of destruction. Grab a barrel and I\'ll mark the locations we should place them.', 64069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Briaw Shan is a champion brew tosser, $n. He could toss a barrel into the air and then have it come crashing down on these yaungol! I saw him over by the inn earlier today. Go see if he can help!', 64068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Krasarang Wild Brew is extremely volatile, $n! We could set the barrels near where the yaungol will approach and then blow them up. Grab one and I\'ll put a marker where we should place them.', 64067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Binan fishermen.', 'Tell me about the Binan fishermen.', 64066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Derpa Derpa.', 'Tell me about Derpa Derpa.', 64065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the Xuen shield bearers.', 'Tell me about the Xuen shield bearers.', 64064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about Cianz.', 'Tell me about Cianz.', 64063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me about the jovial villagers.', 'Tell me about the jovial villagers.', 64062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
