('Thank you, $p. You have saved us all.', '', 63896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t need your healing skills.', 'We don\'t need your healing skills.', 63895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We require your aid.', 'We require your aid.', 63894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am one with the mists and heal those in need.', 'I am one with the mists and heal those in need.', 63893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it. I shall do this myself!', '', 63892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could use a kite to Grookin\' Hill.', 'I could use a kite to Grookin\' Hill.', 63891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must be $n.$b$bI\'ve been expecting you.', 63890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Seat of Knowledge. And never was there a greater repository of information and wisdom to be found about the ancient days of Pandaria.', '', 63889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me and my trusty nets will not fail this village!', '', 63888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve mastered catching fish, now on to catching yaungol!', '', 63887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hei Feng is landing!', '', 63886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s okay, you hang onto those nets.', 'That\'s okay, you hang onto those nets.', 63885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright then, lets go tie them up!', 'Alright then, lets go tie them up!', 63884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pretty handy with nets, I could trap those nasty yaungol in them.', '', 63883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here. With this weapon we will lay waste to the Empresses\' army!', '', 63882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your intelligence will come in handy almost as much as your skill for battle. I see much potential in a mind like yours Wakener.', '', 63881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your thoughts intrigue me. There is purpose to your actions. Your complexity is impressive.', '', 63880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mind is strong Wakener. Even now I struggle to communicate with you. Controlling you would be near impossible...', '', 63879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will have to work quickly Wakener. This area is not safe.', '', 63878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never ask Hawkmaster Norung about his eye patch. You will never hear the end of it.', 'Never ask Hawkmaster Norung about his eye patch. You will never hear the end of it.', 63877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountain roads can be a dangerous place.', 'The mountain roads can be a dangerous place.', 63876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be careful around my hawk. She\'s a biter.', 'Be careful around my hawk. She\'s a biter.', 63875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The saurok make it difficult for anyone to visit here other than by flying.$b$bOf course, that makes slipping off to the Tavern in the Mists very difficult.', 'The saurok make it difficult for anyone to visit here other than by flying.$b$bOf course, that makes slipping off to the Tavern in the Mists very difficult.', 63874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $p. We have been watching your accomplishments since your arrival in our land.', 'Welcome, $p. We have been watching your accomplishments since your arrival in our land.', 63873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word reaches me you served with my brother in Townlong Steppes. How is the young fellow? Did he ever tell you how he lost his eye?', '', 63872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $p. We have been watching you for some time.$b$bYou are the gust of wind that heralds the storm of change.', '', 63871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hei Feng takes a Deep Breath! Move behind him!', '', 63870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Tavern serves to those who do not ask too many questions.', 'The Tavern serves to those who do not ask too many questions.', 63869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much and more that can be found at the Tavern in the Mists.', 'There is much and more that can be found at the Tavern in the Mists.', 63868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Veiled Stair is under Madam Goya\'s protection.', 'The Veiled Stair is under Madam Goya\'s protection.', 63867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What an unlikely spot for my shield to be, irregardless, now we fight!', 'What an unlikely spot for my shield to be, irregardless, now we fight!', 63866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that\'s embarrassing. To battle!', 'Well that\'s embarrassing. To battle!', 63865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! You found it! Now time to fight back those yaungol.', 'HAH! You found it! Now time to fight back those yaungol.', 63864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry I haven\'t seen it either.  Maybe it\'s for the best...', 'Sorry I haven\'t seen it either.  Maybe it\'s for the best...', 63863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('... Your shield is on your back.  Now get up and HELP US!', '... Your shield is on your back.  Now get up and HELP US!', 63862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t find my shield, I\'ve looked all over the village! I wish I could help, but without my shield I\'m good for nothing!', 'I can\'t find my shield, I\'ve looked all over the village! I wish I could help, but without my shield I\'m good for nothing!', 63861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The \"orc\" tried to punch me.', '', 63860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of saurok live in the Ancient Passage.', '', 63859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Saurok are very dangerous.', '', 63858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tigers.', '', 63857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen attack grummles.', '', 63856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, and the tigers.', '', 63855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These people are farmers, not fighters! They may need our help!', '', 63854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are those refugees? What\'s going on over there? Do I hear fighting?', '', 63853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had that coming. Waving your incense about in his face... wait a minute. Something doesn\'t feel right about this.', '', 63852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s safe. I brought Lorewalker Cho and his strange companions up this way not long back.', '', 63851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spears are just for show. As long as we don\'t get out of the boat or make eye contact or get hit by a spear then we should be fine.', '', 63850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... yes. There are problems with the hozen.', '', 63849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever been to Kun-Lai before? It\'s great. Long flowing farmlands. Beautiful mountains. And absolutely nothing dangerous whatsoever.', '', 63848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hopefully this time we won\'t run into any hiccups.', '', 63847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since the dark days of the old kingdom, we pandaren have turned to the mystical art of brewing to keep our spirits and strength high.$B$BEven as we speak, brewmasters wander the world, seeking rare and powerful ingredients to craft the finest of brews.$B$BThose who seek out these elusive brewmasters and lend them aid may earn flavorful items. At the very least, you will drink plenty of brew!', '', 63846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a member of the Tillers, the hardworking farmers of Pandaria. If you wish to learn more about us, we are located at Halfhill in the Valley of the Four Winds.', '', 63845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me, $r, have you ever had a hankering to fish?$B$BIf so, you might want to visit the Anglers down in the Krasarang Wilds.', 63844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are four August Celestials who rule over this land.$B$BYu\'lon the Jade Serpent, lifegiver of the east.$B$BChi-Ji the Red Crane, hope of the south.$B$BXuen the White Tiger, whose strength upholds the north.$B$BAnd Niuzao the Black Ox, who stands tall in the west.$B$BRecently, with the advent of the sha, turmoil has engulfed each of their temples. They need our help, $r.', '', 63843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Golden Lotus is charged with defending the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BIf you wish to help us, defeat enemies of the Golden Lotus who currently occupy the Vale.$B$BYou may also speak to Anji Autumnlight at the Setting Sun Garrison training camp for further tasks.', 63842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan hold the eternal vigil, keeping watch over the dark sha energies that were sealed away into the earth long ago.$B$BUnfortunately, the sha have escaped their prisons, and now we must defeat them once again.', '', 63841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!', 'I\'m... alive?  Thank you... thank you so much!', 63840, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not a chance, you can keep that Mr. Derpa.', 'Not a chance, you can keep that Mr. Derpa.', 63839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure! I\'ll give it a whirl.', 'Sure! I\'ll give it a whirl.', 63838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got this from some goblin, he said it can stop anything in their tracks, want to give it a try?', 'I got this from some goblin, he said it can stop anything in their tracks, want to give it a try?', 63837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Since the dark days of the old kingdom, we pandaren have turned to the mystical art of brewing to keep our spirits and strength high.$B$BEven as we speak, brewmasters wander the world, seeking rare and powerful ingredients to craft the finest of brews.$B$BThose who seek out these elusive brewmasters and lend them aid may earn flavorful items. At the very least, you will drink plenty of brew!', 63836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Existence ends... I become nothing...', '', 63835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hei Feng prepares to land!', '', 63834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy Conduits active, draw stable.', '', 63833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Redirecting power.', '', 63832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Energy Vortex ramping down.', '', 63831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll defend the brew until it\'s ready. Then we can use it against these Bataari raiders! Everyone else, get to safety!', '', 63830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They must be after the Kun-Lai Kicker! $p, investigate these sightings and setup the village defenses! They won\'t get my brew without a fight!', '', 63829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Conduits offline.', '', 63828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the energies consume you!', '', 63827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yaungol!? Now!?', '', 63826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drawing from reserve power.', '', 63825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach! Feel the power of the titans!', '', 63824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countermeasures successful.', '', 63823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was is no longer.', '', 63822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spark of life fades.', '', 63821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there. I don\'t think you want to go down that tunnel on foot. The saurok are out in force today and they are mighty territorial.', '', 63820, 0, 15324, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever been to the Valley of the Four Winds?$B$BWe farmhands hear about the crisis here in the Vale, and the Tillers are hard at work growing food for refugees.$B$BIf you want some time out in the country, visit us at Halfhill!', '', 63819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fish are biting like crazy down in Krasarang!$B$BI\'d still be out on the sea, reeling in the big one, but I came here to sell this morning\'s catch. Got lots of hungry mouths to feed here!', '', 63818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Golden Lotus is charged with defending the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.$B$BIf you wish to help us, defeat enemies of the Golden Lotus who currently occupy the Vale.$B$BYou may also speak to Anji Autumnlight at the Setting Sun Garrison training camp for further tasks.', '', 63817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love it, thank you.', 'I\'d love it, thank you.', 63816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beautiful day for fishing, don\'t you think?  You a fisherman, $n?  I\'ve got this old fishing lure if you\'d like it, works wonders in the waters here.', '', 63815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan hold the eternal vigil, keeping watch over the dark sha energies that were sealed away into the earth long ago.$B$BUnfortunately, the sha have escaped their prisons, and now we must defeat them once again.', '', 63814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are four August Celestials who rule over this land.$B$BYu\'lon the Jade Serpent, lifegiver of the east.$B$BChi-Ji the Red Crane, hope of the south.$B$BXuen the White Tiger, whose strength upholds the north.$B$BAnd Niuzao the Black Ox, who stands tall in the west.$B$BRecently, with the advent of the sha, turmoil has engulfed each of their temples. They need our help, $r.', 63813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s looks around cautiously before leaving his mark on the whale corpse.', '', 63812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rubs against the prow of the Mist-Hopper and whimpers.', '', 63811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('%s swims excitedly through the vents of warm water.', '', 63810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They don\'t look very helpful, we should let them sleep.', 'They don\'t look very helpful, we should let them sleep.', 63809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAKE UP! We have to defend the village, get to your mortar and help us!', 'WAKE UP! We have to defend the village, get to your mortar and help us!', 63808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ZzzZZzzzz', 'ZzzZZzzzz', 63807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Dog looks at you quizzically.>', '', 63806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The amber congeals to form an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[Amber Trap]|h|r !', 'The amber congeals to form an |cFFFF0404|Hspell:125803|h[Amber Trap]|h|r !', 63805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been selected by the |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[Heart of Fear]|h|r !', 'You have been selected by the |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[Heart of Fear]|h|r !', 63804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No thanks...', 'No thanks...', 63803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The honor is mine, to your post!', 'The honor is mine, to your post!', 63802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have studied for years to master the art of the chi blast and would be honored to fight by your side. Would you like my assistance?', '', 63801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, times were getting tough up north.  While the scourge problem has been dealt with, we are constantly on the move and looking for food.  I decided it was time to head out and find some new fishing grounds!$b$bAfter almost a month at sea, I ended up here.  Good thing I packed a few crates of pickled herring for the trip!', 'Well, times were getting tough up north.  While the scourge problem has been dealt with, we are constantly on the move and looking for food.  I decided it was time to head out and find some new fishing grounds!$b$bAfter almost a month at sea, I ended up here.  Good thing I packed a few crates of pickled herring for the trip!', 63800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing so far from home?', 'What are you doing so far from home?', 63799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Call me crazy, but I love this warm weather!  I always felt like an outcast back in Borean but I think this new climate is going to work out great for me!', 'Call me crazy, but I love this warm weather!  I always felt like an outcast back in Borean but I think this new climate is going to work out great for me!', 63798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need to get this grain to Brewmaster Boof so we can start the festival. See you there, $p!', 63797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll teach those virmen to try and eat me!', 63796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Is that....LAND?', 'What? Is that....LAND?', 63795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27448, 27448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our systems are jammed, Commander! I can\'t control this plane!', 'Our systems are jammed, Commander! I can\'t control this plane!', 63794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27447, 27447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh! We\'ve been hit!', 'Ugh! We\'ve been hit!', 63793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27446, 27446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re firing on us, sir!', 'They\'re firing on us, sir!', 63792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27445, 27445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull up!', 'Pull up!', 63791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27444, 27444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, we\'re picking up an Alliance distress signal ahead.', 'Commander, we\'re picking up an Alliance distress signal ahead.', 63790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27443, 27443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you excuse me for a moment, $p? I\'ve, uh... I\'ve got somethin\' in both my eyes.', '', 63789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow...', '', 63788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Sincerely, all of us. Even Dog.\"', '', 63787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We\'ll always be your crew, Soggy. Ship or no ship. We\'d follow you anywhere.\"', '', 63786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Thank you for chasing fortune on the distant horizon. Thank you for dreaming. And most of all, thank you for bringing us along.\"', '', 63785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We just wanted to say: Thank you.\"', '', 63784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"What should have been a week of easy fishing turned into a wild misadventure that ran us aground in the most dangerous place on the continent and nearly got us all killed, because you couldn\'t stop chasing your hunches.\"', '', 63783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"We know the Mist-Hopper wasn\'t hired to venture this far beyond the wall. We know it was supposed to be a routine job off the coast of Jade Forest.\"', '', 63782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Dear Soggy, if you are reading this it means you finally worked up the guts to send someone after the old charter. Well, you\'re too late.\"', '', 63781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the...?! This ain\'t the charter! It\'s a letter. In Arie\'s handwriting?', '', 63780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bladestorm.blp:20|tWind Lord Mel\'jarak begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:121896|h[Whirling Blade]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bladestorm.blp:20|tWind Lord Mel\'jarak begins to cast |cFFF00000|Hspell:121896|h[Whirling Blade]|h|r!', 63779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_mindmastery.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok uses his voice to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122740|h[Convert]|h|r members of the raid to fight on his side!', '', 63776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\trade_archaeology_delicatemusicbox.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok sings the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123791|h[Song of the Empress]|h|r, damaging all players until they engage in combat with him!', '', 63775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_disruptingshout.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok shouts with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122713|h[Force and Verve]|h|r!', '', 63774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_psychicscream.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122761|h[Exhales]|h|r with great force at |cFFFF0000$n|r!', '', 63773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_stamedingroar.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122852|h[Inhales]|h|r a large breath!', '', 63772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_battleshout.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok sends |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122336|h[Sonic Rings]|h|r across the room!', '', 63771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok flies to one of his platforms!', '', 63770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coldbite Matriarch begins to summon Coldbite Hatchlings.', 'Coldbite Matriarch begins to summon Coldbite Hatchlings.', 63769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will NEVER yield!', '', 63768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No thanks...', 'No thanks...', 63767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely! I\'d love to see that!', 'Absolutely! I\'d love to see that!', 63766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve won the Brew Toss competition six years running! If you\'d like, I can toss this brew all the way across the village and cause a brew strike! All you have to do is point.  Would you like that?', 'I\'ve won the Brew Toss competition six years running! If you\'d like, I can toss this brew all the way across the village and cause a brew strike! All you have to do is point.  Would you like that?', 63765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You suffer in silence for a people who give little thanks.', '', 63764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You bear the burden of an entire people upon your shoulders. And how have they repaid you?', '', 63763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lay your duties aside and rest.', '', 63762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31214, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantle of a god must be heavy to bear.', '', 63761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wield the powers of a god, but you are beaten!', '', 63760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your charge, the sha of fear, has escaped.', '', 63759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha, the great Niuzao, strength of the west, divine celestial, protector of the weak...', '', 63758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright. Let\'s go.', 'Alright. Let\'s go.', 63757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niuzao... we must save him!', '', 63756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My compliments, friend.  I can\'t remember the last time someone bested me so handily.', '', 63755, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are impressive indeed.  It would be my honor to fight beside you.', '', 63754, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... have... bested me...', '', 63753, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHITEFEATHER?!  Nooooo!', '', 63752, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You give a good fight!  Don\'t stop now.', '', 63751, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hold back.', '', 63750, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see you in the ring.', '', 63749, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been quite some time since someone was brave enough to challenge me.', '', 63748, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30774, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That, my friend, is for you to decide.', '', 63747, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who then, was the wiser? The father or the cub?', '', 63746, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the cub concluded, \"I should very much like to live like a hozen!\"', '', 63745, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"I learned that we work and toil on our little farm, but that the hozen have the whole world as their garden,\" the cub said. \"I learned that we squint by the light of a single candle, but that the hozen enjoy the light of the stars. I learned that I go to school every day, but that the hozen learn by doing.\"', '', 63744, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Afterwards, the father asked his cub what he had learned.', '', 63743, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hozen are quite lively indeed. A short-lived race, few hozen survive past their 20th birthday. Their leaders are all 14 or 15. How mature were you at 14 years old? Meditate on that!', '', 63742, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To teach him a lesson, the father dragged the cub out to the forest, to watch how the hozen live. \"Do you see what the hozen are like?\" he asked. \"Do you want to live like that?\"', '', 63741, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One day, a father grew tired of his young cub\'s misbehavior.  \"You act just like a hozen!\" the father scolded. Still, his son misbehaved.', '', 63740, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, dear emperor.', '', 63739, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 30113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would that we could all live like our most sacred emperor. That we could put aside all our burdens and exist in harmony with the cosmos. THAT, I believe, was his message to us... before he became one with the land, and hid Pandaria away from the terror of the Sundering.', '', 63738, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that all the trees in the vale blossomed as he entered, and continue to blossom to this day.', '', 63737, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30111, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I want you to imagine standing in this very valley on the day he returned from his journey. Imagine being here when the gates opened for him. By then our emperor was a creature of pure light: No doubts, no fears, no hatred...', '', 63736, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30110, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is known; and there are temples to mark these most sacred of places.', '', 63735, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30109, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We know that he purged his doubts in the Jade Forest. That he cleansed himself of despair in the Krasarang Wilds. That he overcame his fear in Townlong Steppes. And that he defeated anger, hatred, and violence high in the mountains of Kun-Lai.', '', 63734, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! You wish to learn of our last and greatest emperor, Shaohao? My friend, I do not have the time here to recount all of his adventures, but his actions ten thousand years ago resonate to this very day.', '', 63733, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All that matters is what you do with it.', '', 63732, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30106, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate is like fire; it can shape or destroy us.', '', 63731, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30105, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has fate been cruel to the yaungol? You may as well ask if fire is good or bad.', '', 63730, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the flames of fate, the yaungol were born. They survive beyond the wall, for they refuse to submit to any law but their own.', '', 63729, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those noble hunters found a way to survive on their own. Fire was the key. They drew up oil from the ground. They used it to heat their homes, cook their food, and burn their enemies. They grew STRONG.', '', 63728, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30102, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, a group of sturdy nomad hunters wandered the world. By a stroke of fate, they were here in Pandaria when the Sundering split apart the continents of Azeroth. The wanderers found themselves trapped in the Townlong Steppes, a harsh and dangerous land.', '', 63727, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire is the instrument of change.', '', 63726, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire! It is the most magical of elements. It warms us, it cooks our food. It is the hearthfire that makes a house a home. In the right hands, fire can shape iron into swords or plowshares. Left uncontrolled, fire could destroy a city.', '', 63725, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and was no longer afraid.', '', 63724, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In their hubris, the mogu never foresaw that their downfall lay in wait, not among their enemies, but among the oppressed. The day that one slave stood...', '', 63723, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the empire grew, the mogu began to experiment with the secrets of the Vale. They crafted terrible weapons of living flesh and stone. And my people were afraid.', '', 63722, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was the mogu who built the Serpent\'s Spine. The most unlucky of slaves were sent to aid in its construction and defense, to be fodder for the mantid. And my people were afraid.', '', 63721, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu were masters of pain and torture, of dark magics and brutal weapons. No pandaren, hozen, or jinyu could resist the power they held. And my people were afraid.', '', 63720, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the ancient days before the sundering of the world, the mogu emperors ruled over Pandaria. My people were made slaves, and they were afraid.', '', 63719, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you fear most in this world? Have you conquered your fear... or has your fear conquered you?', '', 63718, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is what the mantid have taught us.', '', 63717, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here is what the pandaren do know: By massacring our people, by slaughtering tens of thousands of pandaren, generation after generation, they have taught us the value of life. A precious but fleeting gift. Easily snuffed out... in an instant.', '', 63716, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody has ever befriended the mantid.', '', 63715, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps, if you were to befriend the mantid, and earn a reputation among them, they would teach you their secrets. But I warn you:', '', 63714, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We pandaren do not know.', '', 63713, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30171, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our ancient writings indicate that the mantid have always been here. They predate even the mogu. Where did they come from?', '', 63712, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30170, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('We pandaren do not know.', '', 63711, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every generation, the mantid swarm the Serpent\'s Spine wall in great numbers. They murder many pandaren, so we kill many times their number in return. Yet each generation, they attack once more. Why do they do this?', '', 63710, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantid are harsh teachers.', '', 63709, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my student - you wish to study the mantid? Be warned: the pandaren frontier is littered with the graves of former pupils.', '', 63708, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30166, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('Think about it: the smallest voice can change the world. Consider that, friend, the next time you decide to start throwing stones!', '', 63707, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their visions built empires, freed slaves, and warned our Last Emperor of the Sundering that shattered Azeroth ten thousand years ago.', '', 63706, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jinyu and their waterspeakers stand at the very heart of the greatest events in Pandaria\'s history.', '', 63705, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the whispering waters, they can hear the future.', '', 63704, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30155, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wisest of the jinyu are very wise indeed - they can speak to the rivers the way you and I would consult our elders.', '', 63703, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30154, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The magic of the pools expanded their minds and grew their bodies, until they became one of the great ancient cultures of Pandaria.', '', 63702, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jinyu also have humble origins. Once primitive creatures, they were fortunate enough to live near the enchanted pools within the Vale.', '', 63701, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30152, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until I throw a stone. Such a small thing - but soon, ripples engulf the whole of the lake!', '', 63700, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 30151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great events often have humble beginnings. Consider: a quiet pond. Still. The water is like a sheet of glass.', '', 63699, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 30150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And that is the lesson of Liu Lang, my friend. Everyone always laughs at the explorer. They always laugh... until he returns.', '', 63698, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30120, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each time he returned, more and more pandaren answered Liu Lang\'s call, and joined him on his growing turtle. They were the bravest among us: The explorers. The adventurers.', '', 63697, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every few years, he returned - with tales of mysterious cities in the sand, nomadic people living on endless grassy plains, a great empire under the ice, and a magical kingdom gilded in gold.', '', 63696, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30118, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, how the pandaren laughed at him. But Liu Lang was more clever than anyone thought. Sea turtles always return to the beach where they were born. And so, despite the mists that envelop our land, he always had a way home.', '', 63695, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30117, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We celebrate his bravery with statue and song, but if you were actually there on the beach that very day - well, I\'m sure he looked quite silly, indeed.', '', 63694, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But as the centuries passed, one young explorer decided to see what was out there. His name was Liu Lang. And he set out to discover the world... on the back of a turtle!', '', 63693, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30115, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Sundering ripped apart the continents of Azeroth, we pandaren thought that the rest of the world had been utterly destroyed.', '', 63692, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... I seem to have lost my sword.', '', 63691, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a break from your enemies? You have come to the right place, and the right person.', '', 63690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s still more virmen in the silos! Can you scare them off for me, $p?', 63689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! You have... already... failed...', '', 63688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan sends a lackey to do their work? Perhaps Shan\'bu was wrong about them...', '', 63687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s the Den Mother! Look out, $p!', 63686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get those virmen, $p!', 63685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Save the grain, $p!', 63684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from there!', 63683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoo!', 63682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get those virmen!', 63681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, can you help me get rid of these virmen?', 63680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The virmen are eating all of the grain!', 63679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks, $p! They were going to eat me!', 63678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in catching a shark?', 'Interested in catching a shark?', 63677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another shark!', 'I need another shark!', 63676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhhhhhhh!', 63675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help! Help!', 63674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone save me!', 63673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not food!', 63672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m too young to die!', 63671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get them away from me!', 63670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They are going to eat me!', 63669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help!', 63668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The beacon hums softly.>', '', 63667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the cannons! Shoot down the mantid!', '', 63666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell, stranger. When next we meet, I hope to call you \'friend.\'', 63665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Walk this land with Chen at your side. Make friends among the people here. You will find answers in time.', 63664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is another visitor from beyond the mists here. \"Chen Stormstout\" he is called. He is Pandaren, but from a different homeland.', 63663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can learn a great deal about this land from the Valley of the Four Winds.', 63662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I am certain that the mists parted for a reason. YOU are that reason. Find your purpose here.', 63661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is clear that you are not here to bring your war to these lands. There is a darkness hidden here in Pandaria - this you have seen for yourself!', 63660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not know why the mists have opened. But I know that it is for a reason.', 63659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Learn from this, stranger!', 63658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This battle has extracted a heavy toll. My own rebirth will have to wait for several years.', 63657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We meet again, stranger from beyond the mists.', 63656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin... run...', '', 63655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29622, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks again, $p! I\'ll get this to Brewmaster Boof right away.', 63654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preparing this village is not just about putting weapons in their hands. We must teach them to use them with confidence.', '', 63653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was once a great fighter. Let us hope old age has not taken too much of my skill from me.', '', 63652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I retired from battle to live in peace with my family. It seems battle will not let me retire so easily.', '', 63651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had almost fooled myself into believing Zouchin was protected from the darkness in the world.', '', 63650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought I would have to pick up a weapon to use it again...', '', 63649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me get out on the water, Tart?', 'Can you help me get out on the water, Tart?', 63648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings friend! Will you require a room for the night?', 63647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the North Wind Tavern.', 63646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There you go. Tastes like seaweed and hot garbage, doesn\'t it?', 63645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drink up, $p. I wanna see that vial empty before you so much as dip a toe into the sea.', 63644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A hunter hunts. An artist... arts.$b$bI am here to capture the ferocity of the hunt through my art.$b$bWe are in strange lands, and few in the known world are familiar with the strange creatures of our hunt.$b$bThrough my art, I prove your success, and the success of the Nesingwarys.', '', 63643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\creatureportrait_bubble.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:124653|h[Water Shell]|h|r! Use the Water Spouts to pop it!', '', 63642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah good! You found the safari. That jungle is a little rough to navigate without some travel sense.$b$bThose mogu kept getting in the way of my hunting.', 63641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is so much life here. And so much space.$b$bBack on the Wandering Isle there was never enough space for predators to grow large enough to hunt.', 63640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! I think I recognize you. You\'re from the Wandering Isle right?$b$bIsn\'t it so strange to be in Pandaria?$b$bI always thought this place was nothing more than a legend. I can\'t believe it actually exists!', 63639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I first met the Nesingwarys in Stranglethorn. I\'ve been bumping in to them off and on ever since. I finally earned a place in their safari!', 63638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'First time in Pandaria? Mine too. I remember the stories they would tell us of this place. So exciting!', 63637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grew up on the Wandering Isle. Space was so limited there. Never room to hunt and never really any predators worth mentioning.$b$bBut here... here there are the great mushan and wolves and all sorts of predators. This is this hunter\'s dream come true.', 63636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The air is so clean here.', 63635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where... where did you come from? Thank you!', 'Where... where did you come from? Thank you!', 63634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always knew a $pc could beat up a yaungol!', 'I always knew a $pc could beat up a yaungol!', 63633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me! What a hero!', 'You saved me! What a hero!', 63632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that... HEY! You brought \'em back!', '', 63631, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brewmaster! Bataari scouting parties have been sighted outside the village!', 63630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get back to the festival, $p. Stop by my house later, I\'m making something special!', 63629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like he\'s just unconscious. I should be able to wake him up.', 63628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show no mercy! Thrive on the scent of blood! The more you attack, the more health you will regain.', '', 63627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The amber offers a paragon\'s respite, Wakener. Should you fall near death, it will activate on its own.', '', 63626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you\'re ready to head out?', 'Are you sure you\'re ready to head out?', 63625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Good! You made it. It is time to teach these \"pirate\" hozen why they should not raid our villages.', '', 63624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get this to Brewmaster Boof before the festival starts. Thanks again for saving me, $p!', '', 63623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I panicked when I saw all those saurok and wrecked my boat.', '', 63622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $p! I thought I was done for.', '', 63621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Dawn\'s Blossom.', 'Send me to Dawn\'s Blossom.', 63620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a flapper?', '', 63619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The trick, Wakener, is to be like water. Do not resist your enemy\'s force - simply flow with it. Let his blows drift past you. Then IMPALE HIM.', '', 63618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Malik. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 'Grant me your assistance, Malik. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 63617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get grooked, wik-', '', 63616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang on, men! Reinforcements are inbound!', '', 63615, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand down, savages! I claim this land in the name of the Alliance!', '', 63614, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few monkeys are no match for the Alliance!', '', 63613, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s do or die, chaps! No turnin\' back!', '', 63612, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s Horde to kill, lads! I can smell \'em!', '', 63611, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look lively, mates!', '', 63610, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final ingredient, a secret passed down through generations of my family, comes all the way from the Krasarang Wilds. I sent Assistant Buzaki to pick it up for me a few days ago, and received word that he reached the Tavern in the Mists last night. Can you head into the Ancient Passage and find out what\'s keeping him? He better not still be asleep at the tavern!', '', 63609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get grooked, dooker!', '', 63608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dooker OOKED!', '', 63607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket whacked!', '', 63606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything else I can do?', 'Anything else I can do?', 63605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find Assistant Buzaki?', 'Where can I find Assistant Buzaki?', 63604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You see a brief glimmer along the east wall...', '', 63603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gem shatters!', '', 63601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A high pitch humming noise emanates in the distance...', '', 63600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a faint clicking noise coming from the west...', '', 63599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repairing the damage Kor\'ik did will take time, but it can be done.', '', 63598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to fly, Xaril.', 'I am ready to fly, Xaril.', 63597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Zor\'lok, voice of the Empress. Her obedient little pet.', '', 63596, 0, 17347, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Un\'sok down there. I see he has renamed himself Ambershaper. Ha! His skills never did surpass my own.', '', 63595, 0, 17346, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Ta\'yak there, just in front of the palace. The Empress\'s champion of blades. In my time, he stood undefeated.', '', 63594, 0, 17345, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that my slumber was brief. I recognize Mel\'jarak, lord of the skies. Once, my brother. Now, no longer.', '', 63593, 0, 17344, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No matter. Even I can feel the evil that taints their minds. Let us end their madness.', '', 63592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something drives them. They are frightened.', '', 63591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Travelling on Valley roads is strange. The ground is so flat here and it is too hot.$b$bI miss Kun-Lai.', '', 63590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are they already swarming? The time has not yet come.', '', 63589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just look at those mantid below us. The Empress orders the Swarm much too early! Another sign of her chaotic delusions.', '', 63588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this white blight the work of the sha? I see now what disease spreads across our civilization. The infected must be purged!', '', 63587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many years have passed since I first entered the slumber? This vess, the palace, my Empress. All have changed.', '', 63586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Wakener. Let us meet our enemies.', '', 63585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have coated your weapons with a special serum. Use it to inject your enemies. Too many injections, and their systems will overload.', '', 63584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let my strength be your strength. For every damaging strike you make, you shall steal some of your opponent\'s life in return.', '', 63583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the amber protect and nourish you, Wakener.', '', 63582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All creatures have their uses, Wakener, but you must kill them to find out!', '', 63581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have coated your hands with a special mixture, Wakener. Every time you defeat an enemy, their corpse will be injected with a special toxin. Observe the results, and use them to your advantage.', '', 63580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no! I cannot stop now. My mutations must live!', '', 63579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My research must continue.', '', 63578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A fellow angler I see!  I have a variety of gear from these local fisherman, just let me know what you need!', '', 63577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Going to Kun-Lai? Hop in the boat and I\'ll give you a ride.', '', 63576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kovok seems to have weathered the years in hibernation well.', '', 63575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank goodness you\'re here!  Toss that fishing pole and help us out!', 'Thank goodness you\'re here!  Toss that fishing pole and help us out!', 63574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I swear I saw that little Syra Goldendraft giving my boy \"the looks\". Can\'t have that.', '', 63573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry elders! You must hide!', '', 63572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('We\'re doomed!', '', 63571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('Hozen only give name name to good grookers.$b$bMaybe one day they call you $n $n.', '', 63570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to keep looking for jade. May want to ask around and see if anyone could use a hand.', '', 63569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... you\'re the stranger Cho was talking about.$b$bWelcome to Dawn\'s Blossom! I am Peiji Goldendraft and my family makes only the finest brews in Pandaria.$b$bUnlike those Wanderbrews who keep slinking around ruining the good name of Brewmasters everywhere. I think I even spied the young one eyeing my daughter. Can\'t have that! Goldendrafts and Wanderbrews do not mix.', '', 63568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:107140|h[Magnetic Shroud]|h|r.  Group up to release the healing energy!', '', 63567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You battled well today, $p. May you wear your title with honor.', '', 63566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('So you are the creature who gave the jinyu the courage they needed to stand their ground against the hozen.$b$bSuch courage is something we have not seen in some time. I welcome you to our humble home.', '', 63565, 0, 17264, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind is better bent, than broken. ...get it? I made a funny.', '', 63564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('I am told you were a guest of the forest hozen and survived. I suspect we will see interesting things from you in the coming days.$b$bI welcome you, traveller, to our humble home.', '', 63563, 0, 17263, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your visit is like the gust of wind before the storm.', '', 63562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The art of the Windfur Punch has been handed down from generation to generation in my family since the dark days.$b$bIt is said this punch was first attempted during the dark days of the mogu empire, and aided in earning pandaren their freedom.', '', 63561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And how have you been enjoying our land? Have you been learning?', '', 63560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am curious, in your homeland, is there ever peace?', '', 63559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word of your travels has reached me. You ride on the winds of change.', '', 63558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Please fly me to the Terrace of Gurthan.', 'Please fly me to the Terrace of Gurthan.', 63557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall rise again!', '', 63556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:119374|h[Whirlwinding Axe]|h|r trap!', '', 63555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:120142|h[Crossbow]|h|r trap!', '', 63554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me back to Mogu\'Shan Palace!', 'Take me back to Mogu\'Shan Palace!', 63553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in my group and ready to teleport to Mogu\'Shan Palace!', 'I\'m in my group and ready to teleport to Mogu\'Shan Palace!', 63552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s activates his |cFFFF0404|Hspell:119311|h[Stream of Blades]|h|r trap!', '', 63551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu\'Shan Palace, a level 87-89 dungeon in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, is now available for testing. Please be in your full group before teleporting to the dungeon. Meeting Stones are not available for this dungeon yet.\n\nTo leave Mogu\'Shan Palace, simply exit through the normal exit inside the dungeon and you will be teleported to Dalaran. If you die and release, you should teleport back from this NPC.', '', 63550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Been working for the anglers?  Check out these rewards!', '', 63549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello fellow angler!  Have you been around these parts long?  Me and my buddy \"Big Hook\" here travel far and wide looking for the next big catch!$b$bWe ran into this place by accident and the locals were friendly with both their supplies and booze so we decided to stick around!', '', 63548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you eyeing my cat?', 'Are you eyeing my cat?', 63547, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful with the scorpion, he may look friendly but he is a beast in battle!', 'Careful with the scorpion, he may look friendly but he is a beast in battle!', 63546, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m gonna go play.', 'I\'m gonna go play.', 63545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bye!', 'Bye!', 63544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you later!', 'See you later!', 63543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your timing is flawless. I was just about to leave. But please, stay and enjoy the town while Toya gathers the jade we need.', '', 63542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now I must leave you. Toya is gathering jade for my project. When he is finished I would like you to bring it to me at the Emperor\'s Omen so that we might look at what secrets history has hidden from us.', '', 63541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, this is Dawn\'s Blossom! The heart of Pandaren life here in the Jade Forest. If you wish to make an impression, I am certain many of these citizens could use your help.', '', 63540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30092, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get those supplies moved!', '', 63539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you make so many angry sounds?', 'Why do you make so many angry sounds?', 63538, 0, 7274, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you so green?', 'Why are you so green?', 63537, 0, 7274, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you so thin?', 'Why are you so thin?', 63536, 0, 7268, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho said you were a \"hooman\". Is that like a hozen?', 'Cho said you were a \"hooman\". Is that like a hozen?', 63535, 0, 7268, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there other grummles coming?', 'Are there other grummles coming?', 63534, 0, 7272, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! I\'m taller than you!', 'Wow! I\'m taller than you!', 63533, 0, 7272, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. Mind if I tag along and take some revenge?', 'Thank you. Mind if I tag along and take some revenge?', 63532, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m almost as tall as you!', 'I\'m almost as tall as you!', 63531, 0, 7270, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you of beard-sprite?', 'Are you a sprite?', 63530, 0, 7270, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw it first!', 'I saw it first!', 63529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stranger is here!', 'The stranger is here!', 63528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi!', 'Hi!', 63527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How fitting. The fisherman eaten by the fish...', '', 63526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not dead yet you scavenger!', '', 63525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What has the world come to when you can\'t even die without crabs picking at you?', '', 63524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does the agony ever stop?', '', 63523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blade Lord Ta\'yak marks $n for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122949|h[Unseen Strike]|h|r!', '', 63522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a good day for a hunt.', '', 63521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
