('You are too late! The Thunder King will rise and take dis land from you.', '', 63378, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my new Alliance friend! How can I be of service?', '', 63377, 0, 0, 404, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, my birds have taken a liking to you. I will follow their lead.', '', 63376, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 31796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please remember that not all of your allies in Pandaria will be won over by sword point.', '', 63375, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they come, yes, yes. You see how easy it is to make friends here?', '', 63374, 0, 0, 404, 65, 0, 31795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people are both stout and ferocious. But always remember, the lion kills only when hungry.', '', 63373, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see - one of your great Alliance warriors, is it? You have chosen a lion as your crest.', '', 63372, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What could it mean? I can see a lot of turmoil in your heart, my new friend.', '', 63371, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have we here? Fields of red and blue, violently clashing in a green land.', '', 63370, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 31792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer a little more meat on my birds, of course, but I can see that your people and mine are not so different after all.', '', 63369, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Haha - I can see now what your Alliance fights for.', '', 63368, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 31791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Paint something heroic.>', '<Paint something heroic.>', 63367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Paint something abstract.>', '<Paint something abstract.>', 63366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Paint something sexy.>', '<Paint something sexy.>', 63365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, find me in the Cave of Words, just up the hill here, when you have time to speak!', '', 63364, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be one of those folk from that sky-ship that crashed. I have MANY questions for you, but this is a terrible place to chat.', '', 63363, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 30079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is angry!!', '', 63362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I live and breathe - an actual troll! You look just as the stories describe. You\'ve taught the Hozen quite the lesson.', '', 63361, 0, 5579, 5, 65, 0, 30078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
