('I will be fine.$B$BThis is nothing compared to the thousand scars of battle!', '', 62875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They warned me of the wakening sickness, but I did not believe it would be this bad.', '', 62874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will slay a hundred foes! As soon as I... can catch my breath.', '', 62873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! Why does my strength fail me?', '', 62872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the strongest survive.', '', 62871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only way I know is that of the warrior.', '', 62870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peace is for the weak!', '', 62869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In order to survive, you must fight.', '', 62868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid me brethren!', '', 62867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight like cowards!', '', 62866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will pay for your transgressions!', '', 62865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30347, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wings of the empress cannot fail!', '', 62864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To die for the empress is an honor!', '', 62863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mighty Zar\'thik bend the wind to their will!', '', 62862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sra\'thik command the elements of this land, leaving their foes imprisoned for all time!', '', 62861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Kor\'thik have no equal in combat!', '', 62860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The skies belong to the Empress!', '', 62859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blade never misses its mark!', '', 62858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful.', '', 62857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Empress commands it!', '', 62856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Empress... I have... failed you...', '', 62855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of Pandaria will fall beneath the Wings of the Empress!', '', 62854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your defiance of the Empress ends here!', '', 62853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me subjects! Your empress is threatened by these outsiders. They wish to kill me... to kill us all!  Destroy them!', '', 62852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! You will suffer for your insolence at the hands of my greatest champions.  Surely they will protect their empress!', '', 62851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did they send you?  They wouldn\'t dare!  Would they?', '', 62850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My voice, gone?  How will my subjects hear me?  Will they still love their empress?  Will they turn on me as the Klaxxi have?', '', 62849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swarmborn! Filthy muckeaters! You defile our grotto. You will not escape!', '', 62848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then HIT THAT GONG, and show these monks what you\'re made of! ...one way or another, heh.', '', 62847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Wakener. I will stay a while longer to quench my blade\'s thirst. You may tell the others of my return, but I believe my swift wings will bear me to Klaxxi\'vess before you.', '', 62846, 0, 17110, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a bit longer, Wakener! They are on their last legs!', '', 62845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings! Fools! You cannot stand before the Bloodseeker!', '', 62844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes... Wakener, doesn\'t the scent of blood fill you with new strength?', '', 62843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our first officially-sanctioned combat event, the Arena of Annihilation!', '', 62842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garalon\'s massive armor plating begins to crack and split!', 'Garalon\'s massive armor plating begins to crack and split!', 62841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise little one! And destroy!', '', 62840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r his opponents!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon prepares to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r his opponents!', 62839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Fight harder! Do not let these puny pandaren defeat you!', '', 62838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_healingwavelesser.blp:20|t Garalon |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123495|h[Mends]|h|r one of his legs!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_healingwavelesser.blp:20|t Garalon |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123495|h[Mends]|h|r one of his legs!', 62837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to make the water not cloudy anymore. Will... will you help?', '', 62836, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to go now.', '', 62835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... ah... oh! Did I...? Was I...? It was... so... cloudy.', '', 62834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 29325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Klaxxi\'va. What does the Council command? Skeer hears. Skeer obeys.', '', 62833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skeer the Bloodseeker has returned! Unnngghhh...', '', 62832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! What is... happening...', '', 62831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but you\'re no stranger to your past! A Pandaren from the Wandering Isle. I admit, I thought your homeland was just a legend. Pandaren from the Isle are far more adventurous than those on the mainland... it\'s in your blood!', '', 62830, 0, 13210, 396, 65, 0, 31802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... that\'s interesting. Most of your ancestors died in a fire. Oh my. Your people put themselves at great personal risk in the name of progress! I wish more Pandaren had your initiative.', '', 62829, 0, 10103, 396, 65, 0, 31801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, noble is your lineage! Your people possess GREAT power, and all the terrible burdens that come with it. Equally great has been your suffering. Now I see why you call yourself  \'Blood\' elves.', '', 62828, 0, 5576, 396, 65, 0, 31800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my - as I suspected. Your ancestry dates back to the dawn of the world. Great were the ancient empires of the trolls. I see a spark in your eyes, a powerful will - you wish to be great again, yes?', '', 62827, 0, 5579, 396, 65, 0, 31856, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that. Your people revere their ancestors as well. And you cherish the land. We have much in common! Ah, but I see that your ancestors were nomads, whereas we Pandaren prefer the comforts of hearth and home. You\'ll find few travellers among us.', '', 62826, 0, 7273, 396, 65, 0, 31799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How fascinating. I thought you looked sickly - but now I see the truth. Your people suffer under the weight of a terrible darkness. What strength you must have, simply to press onward!', '', 62825, 0, 7275, 396, 65, 0, 31798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Astounding! A lineage of great warriors... From a different world, no less! It is rare for a Pandaren to leave his or her homeland. You are rightfully proud of who you are.', '', 62824, 0, 7274, 396, 65, 0, 31797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would very much like to hear about your ancestors, stranger. Light the incense and let\'s reflect on where you came from, hm?', '', 62823, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 31777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stealer of signals! This is the Empress\'s tower!', '', 62822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek your own death, trespasser!', '', 62821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guard the tower!', '', 62820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kzzsst! Paragon! Klaxxi infiltrator!', '', 62819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the wrath of the new Empire!', '', 62818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind will be made to serve.', '', 62817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare stand in our way?', '', 62816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life is forfeit.', '', 62815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for mercy.', '', 62814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before me, supplicant!', '', 62813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Lord Reclaimer!', '', 62812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your age of this world has passed.', '', 62811, 0, 13211, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren are not hear to save you now.', '', 62810, 0, 13211, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We return!', '', 62809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge the Empire?', '', 62808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These lands belong to the Thunder King.', '', 62807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trespasser!', '', 62806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('For the Empire!', '', 62805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Empire rises again!', '', 62804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m just walking along, cataloging the local wildlife here in Azuremist, when suddenly...\n\nBAM! <Mojo mimicks an explosion with his hands.>\n\nI don\'t think I\'ve ever heard an explosion that loud in my life!', '', 62803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we are not about to let that change.', '', 62802, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It belongs to our children.', '', 62801, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It belongs to our ancestors...', '', 62800, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land, it belongs to us...', '', 62799, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any one of us would lay down our life to protect this land.', '', 62798, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have got another wall... and it\'s made up of the people who call this place HOME.', '', 62797, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were surrendering? Why? Because these invaders can break down a wall?', '', 62796, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Gimme one o\' them pitchforks!', '', 62795, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does it matter who we are? We are here to help you.', '', 62794, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you think you could challenge the might of the mogu?', '', 62793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', '', 62792, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrrraaaa!!!', '', 62791, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 29747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone, fall back! FALL BA-', '', 62790, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t stand a chance...', '', 62789, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn your place.', '', 62788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind will soon learn who their real masters are.', '', 62787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone else! If you can hold a weapon, protect the village! Don\'t let them past this line! You...', '', 62786, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leven, take the right side! You\'re on your own!', '', 62785, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greentill! Blacksoil! Cover our left flank! I don\'t want any surprises!', '', 62784, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You three! $n! Assist Captain Oakenshield in the front!', '', 62783, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Men! To arms!', '', 62782, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... no...', '', 62781, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will make fine slaves for the empire.', '', 62780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know where it CAME from, what was it?', '', 62779, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It came from the wall, sir.', '', 62778, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that noise?', '', 62777, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the...?', '', 62776, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 32476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! It would be an honor.', '', 62775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, here comes another survivor. Seems good with their hands... maybe you can teach them your fighting skills?', '', 62774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No - this is our problem, we must deal with it ourselves.', '', 62773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But, I am a master fighter, with extensive knowledge of this world\'s flora and fauna. Surely I can help?', '', 62772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put it with the others for the Lord Reclaimer\'s inspection.', '', 62771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will this suffice?', '', 62770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it? I am busy.', '', 62769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think these mogu are from here. They seem to be scavenging old relics, not digging in or pillaging.', '', 62768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are they digging up? I\'ve never seen mogu use tools and weapons like those before.', '', 62767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the old Imperial Road. They say the mogu empire used to bring their prisoners here for torture.', '', 62766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!', 'Have you ever seen such a beautiful rabbit?  I can help you catch your own!', 62765, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?', 'You look like someone that might be interested in some rare pets?', 62764, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interested in catching some rare pets?', 'Interested in catching some rare pets?', 62763, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite your obvious weaknesses, I have grown fond of you, Wakener. I was made a paragon because of my prowess on the battlefield. It was said that I could cheat death itself. I shall lend you this very ability, Painkiller, to protect you during the task ahead.', '', 62762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was my Great Grandfather who first told me the tale of the mogu that I recently shared with you.', '', 62761, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 31775, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We Pandaren do not worship our ancestors, but we revere their memory and the wisdom that they have passed on to us.', '', 62760, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 31776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are lucky you were able to find amber and flesh nearby, Wakener.$B$BIf there was none to be found, you would have been my sustenance.', '', 62759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel better.$B$BIt will take me some time to regain my full strength, but I am strong enough to fight, at least.', '', 62758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I appreciate that your wife led us here, old friend, but she chose a poor time to have a child.', '', 62757, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dezco, we should keep pressing westward. We are vulnerable here.', '', 62756, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the Alliance wasn\'t supposed follow the same visions your wife was having.', '', 62755, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dezco, this is a weapon of the horde. You should unleash it on the Alliance.', '', 62754, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was not supposed to be a combat mission.', '', 62753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What part of our journey gave you the impression of choice?', '', 62752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not while Leza is in labor. We must wait.', '', 62751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we let the kypari die out, then we will have lost a great treasure.$B$BThe amber is life.', '', 62750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One healthy kypari remains, far to the southwest, but the Empress\'s slaves are destroying it as we speak.', '', 62749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All across the wastes, the kypari are dying.$B$BI fear that this... sha... is the cause.', '', 62748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It worked, just as I knew it would!$B$BBut even so, the effects of the stasis have surpassed even my original calculations.', '', 62747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I no longer recognize this world. Everything is unfamiliar, yet I have a great duty to fulfill.', '', 62746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My duty is to the Klaxxi Council. Whatever they ask of me, I must obey.', '', 62745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As soon as I awakened, the Klaxxi sensed my presence and relayed as much as they dared.$B$BThey confirmed my own suspicions. The Empress is no longer fit to rule the empire. She must be... cleansed.', '', 62744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I awoke, the Klaxxi told me of you. It seems you are not without your uses.', '', 62743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been asleep far longer than I thought possible. So much has changed.', '', 62742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... need... sustenance.', '', 62741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s emerges from her protective bubble.', '', 62740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel strong enough to continue on my own, $n. I must report this... sha... presence to the Council immediately. If we meet again, it shall be at Klaxxi\'vess.', '', 62739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, hurry! You must stop the siege!', '', 62738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31502, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoops, did I say thirty? I meant three.', '', 62737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see here... thirty second fuse...', '', 62736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, this gate is locked, but I think I have something that\'ll open it.', '', 62735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li and Lo, go look after our friends down below.', '', 62734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31498, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harvesting Amber', '', 62733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
