('You are truly welcomed to Rikkitun Village, outsider.', '', 62592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s summons an |cFFFFFFFFEmbodied Terror|r!', '', 62591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come.', '', 62590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone! Send everything! Slaughter these cowards, they are making us look like fools!', '', 62589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warriors, trample these weaklings!  Crush them!', '', 62588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demolishers, get in there!  Leave nothing but a pile of ash!', '', 62587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swarmers are coming up the ramp -- use the sap to slow them down!', '', 62586, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 31511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_surgeoflight.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122789|h[Sunbeam]|h|r!', '', 62585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring it, uglies!', '', 62584, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 31513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this party started, shall we?', '', 62583, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 31510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li and Lo, get the sap into position!', '', 62582, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 31509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s give these mantid a taste of their own medicine!', '', 62581, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 31508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm... I have a crazy idea that just might work, but we\'ll need your help heroes!', '', 62580, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 31507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to approach the platform!', '', 62579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wave of |cFFB600B8Sik\'thik Demolishers|r joins the battle.', '', 62578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait till you see what I have for you...', '', 62577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I am needed elsewhere.', '', 62576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For eight hundred and seventy-seven years, I waited in that crystal... watching shadows pass through the cracks, counting decades.', '', 62575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freedom...', '', 62574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! The Klaxxi! Hold that crystal together... don\'t let it escape!', '', 62573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll explain on the way back to the Sapmasters.', '', 62572, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'STORMSTOUT? No. You\'re foolin\'. Really? A Wandering Isle Stormstout, here, on Pandaria! Where\'s the rest of the family?', 62571, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 30220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Chen Stormstout. From the Wandering Isle.', '', 62570, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 29764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh that. Bah, I\'ve been through worse. And who exactly are you?', 62569, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were being mind-controlled by some sort of malevolent ancient insect creature.', '', 62568, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... wah... where? What is going on?', 62567, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PH', '', 62566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Bloodseeker. [Klaxxi Augmentation]', 'Grant me your assistance, Bloodseeker. [Klaxxi Augmentation]', 62565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Dissector. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 'Grant me your assistance, Dissector. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 62564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Xaril.  [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 'Grant me your assistance, Xaril.  [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 62563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Prime. [Klaxxi Augmentation]', 'Grant me your assistance, Prime. [Klaxxi Augmentation]', 62562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The amber sustained me as I slept, but I felt its powers drain over time.$B$BIf you had not awakened me when you did, I fear I would have soon slipped into eternal sleep.', '', 62561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Create Rubbing', '', 62560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This valley is proof that our nightmares can become reality.', '', 62559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('Spiritbinding is a brutal practice. Depriving the dead of their eternal peace is an unspeakable cruelty.', '', 62558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('This places chills me to my core, $c.', '', 62557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('Many of the Mogu emperors buried their servants with them trapping their spirits in servitude for eternity.', '', 62556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Theses tombs hold many secrets, $n.', '', 62555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('So much emotion has been realeased from the tombs. So much anger and fear...', '', 62554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('Collecting Supplies', '', 62553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tearing Page', '', 62552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that was fun, wasn\'t it?', '', 62551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31497, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh ho ho, you and I are going to have a LOT of fun together!', '', 62550, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have certainly earned my respect. No easy feat, my friend!', '', 62549, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then! It seems all those muscles are not just for show!', '', 62548, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not bad, not bad... but we are not done yet!', '', 62547, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28176, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not worry, I will go easy on you.', '', 62546, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahah, I do not think you know what you are getting into...', '', 62545, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28174, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek to challenge the infamous Tenwu of the Red Smoke? Come friend, let us see what you have got!', '', 62544, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going too! See you there, $p.', 62543, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '\"Incantations fae and primal\"... that must refer to the Rikkitun sprites.', 62542, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rikkitun... that\'s IT!', 62541, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rikkitun Village!', '', 62540, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nowhere.', '', 62539, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are you two going?', 62538, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YEAH! BEEEEER!!', '', 62537, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, Olon! Brew-ty calls!', '', 62536, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon senses the passage of Pheromones and begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon senses the passage of Pheromones and begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r!', 62535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon detects $n under him and begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|t Garalon detects $n under him and begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122774|h[Crush]|h|r!', 62534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah!! BEEEEEER!', '', 62533, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignore her, $p. Help us brew this beer.', '', 62532, 0, 0, 30, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p! You\'ll help me stop the mantid?', 62531, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are wrong, teacher.', 62530, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah!! BEER!', '', 62529, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a beer recipe!', '', 62528, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, my student, look at these words here: \"vessel\", \"quench\", \"recipe\"...', '', 62527, 0, 0, 483, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see that!', '', 62526, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It describes a way to stop the mantid. A way to stop the sha!', 62525, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sapmaster... look at this scroll!', 62524, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-whoah... what\'s that thing? Do you want to fight!? Why am I so dizzy? I\'m going to... going to...', '', 62523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotta calm down now... a little confused... just need to focus.', '', 62522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, what did you pour on me? It\'s disgusting!', '', 62521, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened? Last I remember I was...', '', 62520, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAHHHHH!', '', 62519, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pour some of the Dreadbrew onto Han\'s amber. Just to see what happens.>', '<Pour some of the Dreadbrew onto Han\'s amber. Just to see what happens.>', 62518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Han is encased in a tomb of amber.>', '', 62517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '', 62516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Drinking is not guarding.', 62515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sure they are just being overly superstitious.', 62514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So who is protecting the Burlap Trail?', 62513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hit by what? Sprites?', 62512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course.', 62511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s a yaungol?', 62510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What?! Don\'t give me that look!', 62509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heartless? Is it too much to ask for a clean outhouse?', 62508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. I never really liked that place. The outhouses were always dirty.', 62507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. And no kafa either. Dark days are coming.', 62506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who says that?', 62505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that before or after you built the wall with your own two paws?', '', 62504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Superstitious or not, you won\'t find me exploring some place a grummle is afraid to travel.', '', 62503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s impossible. Nothing gets through the wall.', '', 62502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They got recalled to Serpent\'s Spine.', '', 62501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope they made it out all right. Ol\' Muskpaw might be rough around the edges but he was always the decent sort.', '', 62500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imagine one of those walking around on two feet, only angrier.', '', 62499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know what a yak is?', '', 62498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are heartless. What about the grummles?', '', 62497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No Kota Kafa? How am I going to wake up in the morning?', '', 62496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you only felt weather in your knees.', '', 62495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...before.', '', 62494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! I was a Shado-Pan once.', '', 62493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still remember when I used to guard the Burlap Trail.', '', 62492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear, some of the grummles are refusing to go up Mount Neverest?', '', 62491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell that to the farmer that told me. Poor guy lost all his crops to the invaders.', '', 62490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the yaungol made it through the Pandaren Wall.', '', 62489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhh...', '', 62488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t seen any Shado-Pan lately.', '', 62487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yaungol.', '', 62486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds like the Muskpaw Ranch was hit.', '', 62485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the yaungol have taken over most of the farmlands in the south.', '', 62484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the Burlap Outpost got destroyed by hozen.', '', 62483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has there been any word from Kota Basecamp?', '', 62482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s my right knee. My left knee feels hozen ravages.', '', 62481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen are on the ravage again. I can feel it in my knees.', '', 62480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... well.. you know... \"they\".', '', 62479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, they say these mountains are full of yeti.', '', 62478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aysa? I don\'t know what to say to her. Should I tell her she\'s gorgeous, or would she find that creepy? Maybe I could tell her I admire her poise - but then she might think I don\'t have any personality!', '', 62477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you should talk to her.', 'Maybe you should talk to her.', 62476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will not give in to the despair of the dark void. If Her will for us is to perish, then it shall be so.', '', 62475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are as unwavering as the amber that shapes our halls. With Her might we will vanquish all who dare intrude upon Her divine home.', '', 62474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She tests us. We will not disappoint Her.', '', 62473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her gifts are many, our gratitude immeasurable.', '', 62472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her will is greater than us all. You will join us or you will perish.', '', 62471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our voice gives form to Her will.', '', 62470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the voice of Her divine wrath.', '', 62469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the air we breathe, She strengthens our voice.', '', 62468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is but to serve; yours is but to die.', '', 62467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine will not suffer your taint here, outsider.', '', 62466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine chose us to give mortal voice to Her divine will. We are but the vessel that enacts Her will.', '', 62465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand close to the keg to catch the beer!', '', 62464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And so it falls to us, Her chosen voice.', '', 62463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are unfazed. We will stand firm.', '', 62462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They were clearly unworthy of Her divine embrace.', '', 62461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Divine challenges us to face these intruders.', '', 62460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing.', '', 62459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The chaff of the world tumbles across our doorstep, driven by fear; Her royal storm will whisk them away.', '', 62458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness.', '', 62457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure.', '', 62456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight, toil, and serve so that Her vision for us is made reality.', '', 62455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never to question, nor to contemplate; we simply act.', '', 62454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is but to serve in Her divine name.', '', 62453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the extension of our Empress\'s will.', '', 62452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will drop you with force enough to decimate anyone nearby. Choose your landing carefully.', '', 62451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gather enough enemies, and I will strike from the sky.', '', 62450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please fly me to the Clutches of Shek\'zeer', 'Please fly me to the Clutches of Shek\'zeer', 62449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grant me your assistance, Wind-Reaver. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 'Grant me your assistance, Wind-Reaver. [Klaxxi Enhancement]', 62448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you can take me down in a pet battle?  Step right up and let\'s find out!', 'You think you can take me down in a pet battle?  Step right up and let\'s find out!', 62447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fly with me, Wakener, and I will show you the way of the Wind-Reaver.', '', 62446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Should try the special.', 62445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re in luck! We got a great new shipment in.', 62444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
