('At level 15 you will choose your first Talent.\n\nIf you later decide to choose different Talents, you may reset your previous choices here for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'At level 15 you will choose your first Talent.\n\nIf you later decide to choose different Talents, you may reset your previous choices here for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 62307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
