('At level 10 you will choose a Class Specialization.\n\nIf you later decide to choose a different Class Specialization, you may reset your previous choice here for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'At level 10 you will choose a Class Specialization.\n\nIf you later decide to choose a different Class Specialization, you may reset your previous choice here for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 62305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock.blp:20|t %s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117958|h[Materialize Protector]|h|r!', '', 62304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', 'How may I help you?', 62303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I need no further convincing. If you need me, I will be waiting on the hill behind the tents.', 62302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are as strong as they say, especially considering you defeated ME. Well fought.', 62301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What!?!? I lost!?!?!', 62300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I promise this won\'t hurt... too much.', 62299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I accept your challenge!', 62298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to clear all of my Glyphs.', 'I wish to clear all of my Glyphs.', 62297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may empty all of your current Glyph slots for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'You may empty all of your current Glyph slots for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 62296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to unlearn my Talents.', 'I wish to unlearn my Talents.', 62295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 'You may unlearn all of your current Talents for a price, so that you may select new ones.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additonal time you do so.', 62294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do you like the portal? We couldn\'t have done it without your help!', '', 62293, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may change your Primary Specialization for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additional time you do so.', 'You may change your Primary Specialization for a price.\n\nThis will become more expensive each additional time you do so', 62292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see how you fare against the Vor\'thik without the wind at your back...', '', 62291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wind-Reaver will not accompany you on this task, Wakener. His talents are needed elsewhere.', '', 62290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we open this portal, we will be able to travel much more quickly between here and the garrison.', '', 62289, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are working to open a portal from here to Shado-Pan Garrison.', '', 62288, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must tread carefully. The Shan\'ze tribe practices dark magic that we still do not fully understand.', '', 62287, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFF01DF01Green|r orb has been returned!', '', 62286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFFFF8000Orange|r orb has been returned!', '', 62285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFFBF00FFPurple|r orb has been returned!', '', 62284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFF01DFD7Blue|r orb has been returned!', '', 62283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the |cFFBF00FFPurple|r orb!', '', 62282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the |cFF01DF01Green|r orb!', '', 62281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the |cFFFF8000Orange|r orb!', '', 62280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the |cFF01DFD7Blue|r orb!', '', 62279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is your Luckydo?', '', 62278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to our most humble camp.', '', 62277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Kota Peak. Home of super famous Kota Kafa. A luckydo would be wise to sniff and savor exotic brews.', '', 62276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sent Assistant Kieu to the silos to collect a sack of grain but she still hasn\'t come back. Could you go check on her for me? You can find the silos on the western edge of town.', '', 62275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! Brewmast Boof sent me to fetch a vial of pure water from the water spirits but Poppers ate the offering. Now I have no way to convince them to give me one and they don\'t look very friendly. Do you think you could persuade them for me?', 62274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kieu, Tart, Buzaki toss the ingredients in!', '', 62273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work, $p! Now I can collect the pure water!', 62272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, Poppers. Let\'s go!', 62271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find Assistant Tart?', 'Where can I find Assistant Tart?', 62270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YAUNGOL!', 62269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On the night of the Brewmoon, water spirits can be found on Inkgill Mere performing a ritual. Over the years we have made offerings to them in return for a vial of pure water used in crafting the Kun-Lai Kicker. I sent Assistant Tart out to the lake but she hasn\'t come back yet. Can you head to the north and find out what\'s keeping her, $n?', '', 62268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where can I find Assistant Kieu?', 'Where can I find Assistant Kieu?', 62267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so glad you\'re here, $n! Tonight is the night of the Brewmoon Festival and none of the ingredients for my famous Kun-Lai Kicker have been delivered. I sent my assistants out to gather them but none of them have returned. Could you find out what is keeping them?', '', 62266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, $n! Do you have a minute?', '', 62265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a brew with us, $n!', 'Have a brew with us, $n!', 62264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s $n!', 'Hey, it\'s $n!', 62263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been awhile, $n.', 'It\'s been awhile, $n.', 62262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n!', 'Hey, $n!', 62261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was wondering when you would get here, $n!', 'I was wondering when you would get here, $n!', 62260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is going to be the best Brewmoon yet with $n here!', 'This is going to be the best Brewmoon yet with $n here!', 62259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the party, $n!', 'Welcome to the party, $n!', 62258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woooo, $n!', 'Woooo, $n!', 62257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I need your help!', 62255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for the backup, friends.', '', 62254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mantid are born with little on their mind but a lust for battle. Participation in a swarm is not only a cultural rite of passage - it is the catalyst for our physical maturation.$B$BOnly those who return from battle can develop from a swarmborn into a fully-aware, individual citizen.', '', 62253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re ready to defend!', 'We\'re ready to defend!', 62252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for saving us!  Are you ready to get this party started?', '', 62251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now comes the hard part. Everyone stand back, precision is the key to the perfect Kun-Lai Kicker!', '', 62250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the last of the ingredients! Good work, $p! Now the festival can begin!', '', 62249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you!', 'I challenge you!', 62248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you really as strong as the others say?', 62247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And serve you shall. Arm yourself at the quartermaster. The drones here are at your disposal.', '', 62246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And countless more to come, Klaxxi\'va. It is my honor to serve in our time of need.', '', 62245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never a glancing blow laid upon you, but countless foes cut down by your halberd.', '', 62244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Malik the Unscathed.', '', 62243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am returned. I heed the call of the Klaxxi.', '', 62242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold off the swarm while Malik the Unscathed awakens!', '', 62241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BLECCHH!!', '', 62240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happening? What day is it?', '', 62239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up! Wake up! They stealing junglebrew!', '', 62238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Someone steal junglebrew?', '', 62237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step!', '', 62235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From death comes life, and from life, death....', '', 62234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel fortunate to receive this gift.', '', 62233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent!', '', 62232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that all?', '', 62231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you done? No, this will not be how my work ends. I will not allow it!', '', 62230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must think yourselves mighty. How little you know. Behold now, my greatest creation!', '', 62229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive me, Empress....', '', 62228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I see you have found a few of my experiments.  Step closer, and you may witness the full glory of my work here.', '', 62227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be powerful, to have come this far. Yes, yes... you will make worthy test subjects.', '', 62226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This path leads to Kun-Lai Summit. Good fortune to those who travel it to shop at grummle shops.', '', 62225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like you to come with me today.', 'I would like you to come with me today.', 62224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is quiet here today. Good.', '', 62223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go ahead and start pulling some of the younger flowers. Just not too many.', 62222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Confidence in your abilities will go a long way. Overconfidence will quickly get you killed.', 62221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not expose your weaknesses.', 62220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your enemy will not show you mercy. Give him the same courtesy.', 62219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good form is the key to defeating your enemies. Don\'t swing wildly with your weapon. Be disciplined with your attacks.', 62218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eee! Monsters are attacking Greenstone Village! RUN AWAY!', 'Eee! Monsters are attacking Greenstone Village! RUN AWAY!', 62217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe next time I won\'t be around to save you!', 62216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everybody gets one...', 62215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have GOT to be more careful!', 62214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you! These rocks are slippery!', 62213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re lucky you were near me, eh?!', 62212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Freeze!$B$BHa! I love saying that.', 62211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen ships appear in the distance!', '', 62210, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s shakes off the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:120778|h[Caustic Tar]|h|r!', '', 62207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is the wanderer\'s way.', '', 62206, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 29686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More ale... hic!', 'More ale... hic!', 62205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for your training, $n. I hope to one day be as good a fighter as you!', 62204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The children are frightened, but they will be all right. We will keep them safe!', 62203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, $r. They will not get past me.', 62202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are the sha approaching?', 62201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The days pass quickly when I am busy.$B$BI must remind myself to stop and enjoy the moment.', 62200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spring is my favorite season of the year. What is your favorite season?', 62199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you are having a wonderful day, $r.', 62198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flowers are blooming at this time of year. They smell so fragrant!', 62197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Would you like to take a walk with us?', 62196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at all the children! They bring such joy to my heart.', 62195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spring lives eternally in the heart.', 62194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at all the flowers blooming. Aren\'t they lovely?', 62193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...Now, charge!', 62192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So much destruction... so much death... will this ever stop?', 62191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This beach used to be such a peaceful place. Now it\'s polluted with these barbarians!', 62190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These ruins are supposedly haunted. I don\'t believe in ghosts though. Then again, I didn\'t believe in Zandalari either.', 62189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I was born to be an adventurer. Like those Pandaren from the Wandering Isle...', 62188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I always thought the Zandalari were just made up to make me behave when I was younger.', 62187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t help but wonder if I could be doing more damage if my gear was better...', 62186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If fighting is like dancing I may be in trouble. I\'m a terrible dancer...', 62185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a lot more work than I thought it would be...', 62184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll show my father I have what it takes to be a great fighter.', 62183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An adventurer like you has probably won many battles!', 62182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father is so overly protective. I never get to do anything!', 62181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Revenge is a dish best served by ME!', 62180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fighter spirit is about to hit you in the face!', 62179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must be swift as a rushing... stream!', 62178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll teach you to mess with my village!', 62177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can do this, I know I can do this...', 62176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AHHH! It looked at me!', 62175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see... your eyes never leave the target. Total focus!', 62174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Empress would force this swarm and raze our own lands in the process.$B$BThe cost is too high.', '', 62173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The mantid councilor narrows his enormous eyes on you briefly.>', '', 62172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior coming in!  Focus your fire!', '', 62168, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 31512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must finish this myself, then. So be it!', '', 62167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust in the will of the Klaxxi. They know what is best for our people.', '', 62166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So few Klaxxi\'va are even left.$B$BWhat has happened to my people while I slept?', '', 62165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shan\'ze Stormclaw comes to its senses!', '', 62164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will send you to your grave!', '', 62163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only death is eternal.', '', 62162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us...', '', 62161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you!', '', 62160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will tear out your eyes!', '', 62159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
