('Let\'s get this training started!', 'Let\'s get this training started!', 61835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huinli Wingpaw oversees the training of monks in Orgrimmar. You can speak with her at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 'Huinli Wingpaw oversees the training of monks in Orgrimmar. You can speak with her at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 61834, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek Huinli Wingpaw. You will find her at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 'You seek Huinli Wingpaw. You will find her at The Barracks in the Valley of Honor.', 61833, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monk', 'Monk', 61832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get behind the barricades!', 61831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take cover behind the barricades!', 61830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work. Let\'s meet back up with Lord Zhu. There\'s nothing more we can do here.', 61829, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 31376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ready when you are, $p.', 61828, 0, 0, 396, 69, 0, 0, 31373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like we have our work cut out for us...', 61827, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 31372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People here really see the world the way I do. You\'ve got to make a place for yourself, you know?', '', 61826, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are my kind of people. You can really feel like they\'re going somewhere!\n\nAnyways, what can I show you about being a monk, friend?', '', 61825, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have as much a right as any in the village to fight for my home. If I only knew a hero that could train me...', 61824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father thinks he can tell me what to do still! I\'m not a child anymore and he needs to see that.', 61823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I may not know how to fight yet, but I do know what\'s worth fighting for!', 61822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, a brawler are ye\'? You\'ll find your pandaren friend at the Stonefire Tavern.', 'Ah, a brawler are ye\'? You\'ll find your pandaren friend at the Stonefire Tavern.', 61821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Liu of the Bottomless Tankard? He\'s been in a drinking contest for the longest time at the Stonefire Tavern, just north of the gates of Ironforge.', 'Oh, Liu of the Bottomless Tankard? He\'s been in a drinking contest for the longest time at the Stonefire Tavern, just north of the gates of Ironforge.', 61820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monk', 'Monk', 61819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re messing with the wrong Mogu, $R.', '', 61818, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re lucky our clan leader is holding me back.', '', 61817, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back out there and fight!', '', 61816, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re supposed to hit the big guy, not me.', '', 61815, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fight is THAT way, $R.', '', 61814, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Lord Zhu.', 61813, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 31355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ATTACK!!!', '', 61812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience... let them come to us!', '', 61811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are so many strange and interesting things in this land. It is different, but I am impressed.', 61810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This city is so unlike anything from home...\n\nAh, friend, how may I help you?', 61809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fancy yourself a martial artist, eh? You\'ll find training with Juisheng Halfclaw at the Training Hall in Old Town.', 'Fancy yourself a martial artist, eh? You\'ll find training with Juisheng Halfclaw at the Training Hall in Old Town.', 61808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monk', 'Monk', 61807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you see - power is easily taken, but should not be lightly given.', '', 61806, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30140, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu emperor then ordered all of the saurok to be purged. He tried to wipe out their entire race, to no avail. They still plague Pandaria to this day.', '', 61805, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30139, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, they started killing the mogu themselves.', '', 61804, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30138, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then they killed the subjects of the mogu.', '', 61803, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30137, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The heartless saurok, even with their tiny lizard brains, soon realized the truth of their position. They killed the enemies of the mogu.', '', 61802, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30136, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who, now, wields the power?', '', 61801, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30135, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, but there is a problem with creating a living weapon. Do you see?', '', 61800, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30134, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They used the powers of the Vale, and their own flesh-warping magics, to twist and shape a race of ferocious lizards into a living weapon. They created an army. An army of Saurok. Bloodthirsty savages created to enforce the will of the emperor.', '', 61799, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30133, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thousands of years ago, the mogu held all the power. They ruled this land with fists of iron. But as their empire grew, they needed a way to police and control it.', '', 61798, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30132, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find her in the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 'You\'ll find her in the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 61797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monk trainer is in the inner ring of the War Quarter. She\'s training some of our Deathguards in her people\'s fighting style.', 'The monk trainer is in the inner ring of the War Quarter. She\'s training some of our Deathguards in her people\'s fighting style.', 61796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She scare me, she mean and say we smell bad. She in War Quarter, inner ring.', 'She scare me, she mean and say we smell bad. She in War Quarter, inner ring.', 61795, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In War Quarter inner ring. She drunk lots.', 'In War Quarter inner ring. She drunk lots.', 61794, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monk', 'Monk', 61793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is she saying?', '', 61792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Forsaken are quick students. I guess you can teach an old... and, well, formerly living dog new tricks.', 61791, 44, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are so curious about the mantid, I will tell you more on the way to Klaxxi\'vess.$B$BOtherwise, leave me to my work.', '', 61790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes?', 61789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Wreck of the Sky Shark!', 'Take me to the Wreck of the Sky Shark!', 61788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will say, the Forsaken have... strange taste when it comes to brew. I get the feeling they\'re not exactly preparing it for friends, though.', 61787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s barks loudly, calling nearby allies to its aid!', '%s barks loudly, calling nearby allies to its aid!', 61786, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Wreck of the Sky Shark!', 'Take me to the Wreck of the Sky Shark!', 61785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am returned to serve the council. But you are no Klaxxi\'va...', '', 61784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Why we are the grummles! The mountain ferries. The packers of the trails. The guides through the mountains. and the deliverers of supplies.$b$bWe are the people who keep the defenders of the wall fed, and we are the people who travel the Burlap Trail since the time of the mogu dynasties.$b$bWe also have the most best noses for smelling luck!', '', 61783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a grummle?', 'What is a grummle?', 61782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to ask something else.', 'I want to ask something else.', 61781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Luckydo? Why it is a person, place or thing of good luck and fortune.$b$bIt is a most high compliment from grummles to be called a luckydo.$b$bUsually a luckydo has special smell to it. Grummle noses are keen for finding luck by its scent.', '', 61780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is a \"luckydo\"?', 'What is a \"luckydo\"?', 61779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll handle the rest of this. You take those arrows and get down to the action at the bridge.', 61778, 0, 16728, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, Taoshi, help these men get their camp in order.  I\'ll assess the state of the bridge.', '', 61777, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Zhu! They are down at the bridge, holding off a mantid attack force, sir.', '', 61776, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 28164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, initiate. Where are the troops?', '', 61775, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Their camp is in shambles. What happened?', 61774, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel that...?', 61773, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. The Sha of Hatred has been through here.', '', 61772, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Appreciated, Lord Zhu.  Good luck in your hunt.', '', 61771, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve done all we can here. Farewell Gao-Ran. I will send more men as soon as I am able.', '', 61770, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May the road rise to meet you, traveler.$b$bWhat brings you here?', 61769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At once, Lord Zhu.', 61768, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 31371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My head swims... I am... not myself yet.', '', 61767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sticky orange fluid oozes from Kil\'ruk\'s mandibles.>', '', 61766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will need more veteran Shado-Pan among us before we can confront it.  We\'ll stop at the encampments along the way.', '', 61765, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come. Let us go.', '', 61764, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time for us to continue westward $p, after the Sha of Hatred.', '', 61763, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve gone too long without visiting the front, Gao-Ran. Your long efforts are appreciated.', '', 61762, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The men will be glad to have you with us, Lord Zhu.', '', 61761, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taoshi, go north and make sure there are no mantid on our flank. I will see to the defenses.', '', 61760, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had come to seek strong pandaren to hunt the Sha of Hatred, but we will step in here and help you fortify the barricade first.', '', 61759, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we should pull back to the wall?  If the full force of the mantid come, we can confidently hold them there.', '', 61758, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Zhu, the mantid have not been seen in these numbers since the swarm more than 90 years ago. My men are going days without sleep just to hold this line.', '', 61757, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, we will not be pulling back. It\'s many years yet before the mantid birth their next swarm. I will not see the Townlong Steppes given to them freely.', '', 61756, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all due respect, Lord, we have not grown lax. We are stretched thin. We are beset on all fronts, my men are worked to the bone, and I have not a single warrior to spare.', '', 61755, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the northern sentries? I didn\'t spot a single one of your men before reaching the camp. You grow lax, Gao-Ran.', '', 61754, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now!', 61753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait for it...', 61752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just wanted my yaks back...', '', 61751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get off me!', '', 61750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh the pain!', '', 61749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Needles on my face!', '', 61748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', '', 61747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sooo spikey! Ouch! Ouch!', '', 61746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get them off me! Get them off me!', '', 61745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Help! Sprites!', '', 61744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HURGHHH!!', '', 61743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to light this place up!', 'I\'m ready to light this place up!', 61742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30715, 30715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every Shado-Pan knows one another by name. We have trained together, fought together, and survived together.$B$BWhen you can say the same, then perhaps you are ready to join our brotherhood.', '', 61741, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From the west, the mantid stir.$B$BFrom the northwest, the mogu practice their dark arts.$B$BFrom the north, the yaungol press us.$B$BThere is too much to do, and too little time.', '', 61740, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan are few in number, but we make up for it in strength.', '', 61739, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To become a Shado-Pan, one must dedicate $Ghimself:herself; in body, mind, and soul.', '', 61738, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me.', 'Join me.', 61737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you accompany me?', 'Would you accompany me?', 61736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play with fire, and you might just get burned.', 'Play with fire, and you might just get burned.', 61735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the Piles of Corpses to stop the Zombified Corpses!', '', 61734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C... approach me...', '', 61733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this?! Now they come over the wall to oppose us? The fools!', '', 61732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How DARE you question her will!', '', 61731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is... the empress who has betrayed... our people...', '', 61730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Klaxxi have betrayed her majesty. Your corpses will be strung from the palace walls for this.', '', 61729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been affected by |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116784|h[Wildfire Spark]|h|r !', 'You have been affected by |cFFFF4809|Hspell:116784|h[Wildfire Spark]|h|r !', 61728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<This is more than just a chunk of amber - there\'s a mantid inside!>', '', 61727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is about to Overload!', '', 61726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb this crypt?', '', 61725, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('World state variables have been reset.', 'World state variables have been reset.', 61724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finish him! Boot him off the wall!', '', 61723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are YOU to make demands of the SHADO-PAN?', '', 61722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There should be plenty of food stored around this temple.', '', 61721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You lead the way. I\'ll carry the food.', '', 61720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get going then!', '', 61719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just point me in the right direction. I\'ll carry the load.', '', 61718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must not sit idly by in our mountain-top fortress as Pandaria falls apart. And that is why you and I must demand an audience with Taran Zhu.', '', 61717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By closing the monastery - for whatever reason - Taran Zhu has jeopardized that eternal charge.', '', 61716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Suna! If we march into Townlong alone, we compound our problems. We must focus on the Monastery and get reinforcements.', '', 61715, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He must have pursued the fleeing yaungol while we intercepted their leader.', '', 61714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lao-Chin! We have won the day. Why are you weeping?', '', 61713, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find out. Without the Shado-Pan, Pandaria will surely be engulfed in darkness...', '', 61712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taran Zhu leads the Shado-Pan, as his father did before him. But he has elected to close our Monastery gates - why?', '', 61711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must find out. Without the Shado-Pan, Pandaria will surely be engulfed in darkness...', '', 61710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taran Zhu leads the Shado-Pan, as his father did before him. But he has elected to close our Monastery gates - why?', '', 61709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaria does not have a standing army. We, the Shado-Pan, are its first - and only - line of defense.', '', 61708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In all my years, I have never seen the Sha so active as when your soldiers landed on our shores.', '', 61707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is our sacred duty to monitor and imprison the Sha. To defeat it wherever it darkens the hearts of our people.', '', 61706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These negative emotions can manifest in physical form. We call this dark energy \"Sha.\"', '', 61705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dark energies embrace this land. Anger, Hatred, Fear, Doubt...', '', 61704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our charge is an ancient one, dating back to the time of Shaohao, our founder and the last emperor of Pandaria.', '', 61703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As a stranger to these lands, you may not be familiar with the Shado-Pan.', '', 61702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After all this... our brothers and sisters passing, Lin captured by yaungol, my beer gone, I think it\'s time to move along.\n\nPerhaps I\'ll take the fight to the mantid...', '', 61700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to tell you, I love it when a plan comes together.', '', 61699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, peace and quiet. Perhaps enough to allow me to contemplate the passing of our brothers and sisters.', '', 61698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are standing in a lethal cloud!', '', 61697, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another attack?!\n\nThese yaungol will not relent until we push them back into Townlong. Or, even better, into the sea.', '', 61696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, $n. The beast stirs from its lair!', '', 61695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t bring our brothers and sisters back, but knowing that we are better than the yaungol helps us sleep better at night.', '', 61694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will give anything, to my last dying breath, to save Lin.', 61693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow. I could hear the explosions from up on the wall.\n\nI guess not ALL of Lao-Chen\'s ideas are terrible.', 61692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, you really sent them flying. I could hear their... bleating from here. \n\nBleating? Is that what you call the sound of a yaungol flying off a wall?', 61691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe we had to kill one of my order... where has the world gone?', '', 61690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something feels... different up here. I don\'t know what, but I expect we shall find out soon enough.', '', 61689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An ill wind blows here in Kun-Lai. I fear a presence unseen for many years may be returning, and these yaungol are just a symptom of it.', '', 61688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, outsider. Unless you are here on official business, I\'m afraid I can\'t be of any assistance to you.', '', 61687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From beneath the dark roots of the nearby tree, an ancient terror awakens...', '', 61684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you inside the Monastery!', '', 61682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Demand?! You DEMAND?!', '', 61678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here with Ban Bearheart, and we demand an audience with Taran Zhu!', 'I am here with Ban Bearheart, and we demand an audience with Taran Zhu!', 61677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
