('Here we are. Climb aboard, friend.', '', 61675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At first, my deference and respect for Taran Zhu prohibited me from questioning his decision to close the monastery to outsiders.\n\nThen, when the yaungol first attacked, my focus on the battle at hand prevented me from leaving the front lines to question his inability to send reinforcements.\n\nNow, three Shado-Pan lie dead, one is captured, and my patience is beyond worn thin - it is gone. I plan to go to the monastery and demand an audience with Taran Zhu.', '', 61674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then he\'s out there alone! We\'ve got to find him!', 61673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
