('Shocking.', '', 61533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you trespass here!', '', 61532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The terrace... must not... fall...', '', 61531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot escape the storm!', '', 61530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I command the elements to destroy you!', '', 61529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28394, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your fear will consume you!', '', 61528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A storm approaches.', '', 61527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone!', '', 61526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weakling!', '', 61525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We... are... endless...', '', 61524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None can match my strength!', '', 61523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not be controlled!', '', 61522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My strength grows!', '', 61521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The terrace was not meant for your kind!', '', 61520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll see you after class.', 61519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps you should have studied more.', 61518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THIS CANNOT BE!', 61517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve learned nothing.', 61516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can never die!', 61515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your soul cannot withstand my power!', 61514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Class is now in session.', 61513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The forces of Niuzao are weak!', '', 61512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The empress demands it!', '', 61511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have failed you, empress...', '', 61510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put down your weapons or die!', '', 61509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flank! To the flank!', '', 61508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop them! Mantid attack!', '', 61507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My army will crush you!', '', 61506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The temple will fall! You cannot stop my forces!', '', 61505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You ready?', 61504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two parts oil to one part brew... no, it will need more oil...', '', 61503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I\'m ready to get back to the front.', 'Alright, I\'m ready to get back to the front.', 61502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We could use a $c. Glad to see my husband sent you along.\n\nI\'m a scout, not much for face-to-face combat. And Lao-chen here... well, normally he\'s a fighter, but he\'s still exhausted from the last battle.\n\nAnd, he\'s too busy cooking up some scheme.', 61501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crush these invaders, and hurl them from the wall!', 61500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niuzao\'s forces attack from the rear!', '', 61499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prisoners are escaping!', '', 61498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient Pandaren heroes freed the grummles from slavery.', '', 61497, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And their skulls are harder than granite. Curiously, they all appear to be related.', '', 61496, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A grummle can carry five times their own weight. They never sweat. They have an outstanding sense of smell.', '', 61495, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it was a difficult battle. So sad to have lost friends.\n\nThough, I am glad I had them build the battlefield refreshment device.\n\nWithout it, and without the power of my stout brew, who knows how many more would have been lost...', '', 61494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every Shado-Pan makes three eternal oaths:\n\nTo defend this land, to protect its people, and to train their pupil.\n\nWhen a Shado-Pan dies, they must be released from these bonds.', '', 61493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Will dominates all it beholds.', '', 61492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Breath is regained.', '', 61491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Breath abates.', '', 61490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Courage burns everlasting.', '', 61489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Strength grips this land with fists of iron.', '', 61488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor\'s Rage echoes through the hills.', '', 61487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Endless Army will crush the Emperor\'s foes.', '', 61486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have some cookies for you!', 61485, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 28533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Abandoned? Oh heavens no! Uncle Gao is in charge while the others are beyond the wall. Isn\'t that exciting?', 61484, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 28532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen the size of Esme\'s turnips?', 61483, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 28531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is certainly a nice day outside!', 61482, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 28530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Zan! You remind me so much of your father.', 61481, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 28529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, hello Zan, it is good of you to visit ol\' Auntie Stormstout.', 61480, 0, 0, 17, 65, 0, 0, 28528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At what cost? The Brewery is trashed! Infested!', '', 61479, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 29773, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uncle Gao, this brewery was left in your care! What have you done?', '', 61478, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 31998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait - these are ghost cookies. These aren\'t filling at all!', '', 61477, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 29772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time for cookies! Well, one cookie. Just one.', '', 61476, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see - and where is Uncle Gao?', '', 61475, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes. That happens.', '', 61474, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 32002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, \"Chen Stormstout,\" we all can\'t be heroes, running from our responsibilities, tromping around the Dread Wastes, saving the world. Some of us are \"Artists.\"', '', 61473, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Details, details.', '', 61472, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 32000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do, for I wield the sword!', '', 61471, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30131, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us talk about the nature of power. In my hands I hold a sword. I ask you: Who wields the power?', '', 61470, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 30130, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard from the others... you need a kite to the wall?', '', 61469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a kite to get up to the wall!', 'I need a kite to get up to the wall!', 61468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to take a kite somewhere.', 'I\'d like to take a kite somewhere.', 61467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_blackironbomb.blp:20|t The |cFFdd7400Sik\'thik Amberwing|r moves into position to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:120559|h[Bombard]|h|r the platform!', '', 61466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What he created, was the \"grummle.\"', '', 61465, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So he took a strange, diminutive cave creature he found and warped it with the powers of the Vale.', '', 61464, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emperor was in need of trusted messengers and deliverymen.', '', 61463, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our story begins long ago in the days of the monstrous Emperor Tian.', '', 61462, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between a Saurok and a Hard Place.', 'Between a Saurok and a Hard Place.', 61461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would ever guess how much knowledge was hidden behind these walls. Between the wealth of information here and the lore you have uncovered in your travels, I believe I can weave together a few tales of our forgotten past.$b$bWhich one would you like to hear?', '', 61460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha haaa! I haven\'t felt like this in YEARS! Don\'t worry, $p... I\'ve been in worse scraps than this. A fighting spirit like yours is welcome in the Alliance.  Now, let\'s get back to business.', '', 61459, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 29573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, pandaren! HIT ME!', '', 61458, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful, $p! You do not want to hurt your new king...', 61457, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 27393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the matter? You\'ll have to do better than that.', '', 61456, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t hold back now! Let\'s have it!', '', 61455, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, pandaren... let me see what you\'ve got!', '', 61454, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready.', '', 61453, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For every ill or evil that rises in Pandaria, there is always a perfectly complementary cure. I find it to be a good analogy to all problems.', 61452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I\'m ready to take that walk now.', 'I think I\'m ready to take that walk now.', 61451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About that sparring match you suggested...', 'About that sparring match you suggested...', 61450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should never have left the Dread Wastes, mantid.', 61449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take that message back to your queen, mantid.', 61448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will learn to fear our blades, mantid.', 61447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What desperation makes them think they stand a chance past our lines...', 61446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You would have had a better chance at the blockade, mantid.', 61445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It wasn\'t ready to face the Shado-Pan.', 61444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deadly efficiency.', 61443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. We are nearly finished, $p.', '', 61442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes... of course.', 61441, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 0, 27392, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I make myself clear?', '', 61440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am deeply sorry, but the battle lines have been drawn. I will not tolerate any fraternizing with the enemy, as you could expose our Alliance to danger.', '', 61439, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who you once considered friends, or even those you might have loved, are now your sworn adversaries.', '', 61438, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 29585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They, along with the other barbarian clans of the Horde, are your new enemies.', '', 61437, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some have sided with the Horde.', '', 61436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not all pandaren have chosen the same path as you three.', '', 61435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Because that brings me to my second point.', '', 61434, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 29581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Certainly.', 61433, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 27391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a simple guideline, but a meaningful one. Do you understand?', '', 61432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gap in the defenses is in this path. Mantid are sneaking past the scouts and getting around the barricade.$B$BWe need to cut them off before we find ourselves surrounded.', 61431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are expected to provide aid to Alliance members in need, whether they be human, gnome, draenei... or pandaren like yourselves.', '', 61430, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First: the races of the Alliance look out for one another.', '', 61429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes. Go on.', 61428, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 27390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But there are a number of things I need to make clear to you.', '', 61427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We always have need of allies. I\'d be a fool to turn you away, especially at a time of war.', '', 61426, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand you want to join the Alliance.', '', 61425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk with me. All three of you.', '', 61424, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, that\'s good news. Once we join the Alliance, we certainly won\'t run out of things to do.', 61423, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this!', 61422, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get going, $p. If we are going to be of any use out here, we are going to need allies.', 61421, 0, 16600, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... uh... look, I\'m doing the best I can, okay?! The sprites keep knocking the orbs out of my hands, or stealing them back when I\'m not looking!$B$BI hate these things!', '', 61420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are dozens of the pesky little brats. Can\'t grab the orbs with them tormenting us. Can\'t catch them to kill them.$B$BAt least I haven\'t lost my weapon, unlike some people...', '', 61419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never thought I\'d see one of your kind walk through here.', 'Never thought I\'d see one of your kind walk through here.', 61418, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re here to join the Alliance. We seek audience with your Emperor.', 61417, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the Light?', '', 61416, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s keep moving.', 61415, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look carefully, Lucas. The Light is strong with them. Particularly that one.', 61414, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Outsiders, yes - but their intentions are good.', 61413, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quiet, Naanae. Outsiders approach.', '', 61412, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaren? I mussht be seein\' thingssh...', '', 61411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to Stormwind!', 61410, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s... just keep moving.', '', 61409, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good move. It worked out well for me.', '', 61408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heh... pandaren. You must be here to join the Alliance.', '', 61407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pandaren? Here, in Stormwind?', 61406, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Those are pandaren, Moni.', '', 61405, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Teacher... look!', 61404, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those are FURBOLGS.', 61403, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those aren\'t gnolls, silly. Use your eyes.', 61402, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, look! Gnolls!', '', 61401, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behave yourselves inside Stormwind, pandaren. You\'re in Alliance territory now.', '', 61400, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<%s eyes Jojo\'s pillar.>', '', 61399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Emperor? You\'ll find KING Anduin inside Stormwind Keep.', '', 61398, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pandaren? What business do you have in Stormwind?', '', 61397, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has cleansed the Pool of Life!', '$n has cleansed the Pool of Life!', 61396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Redeem, nay, PROVE yourselves now. Deal with these intruders. The clan who brings me their heads will have my favor!', '', 61395, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 28354, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless, all of you! Even the guards you give me in tribute can\'t keep these lesser beings from my palace.', '', 61394, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 28353, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cleansing', 'Cleansing', 61393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I die, it will be in battle!', '', 61392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have a right to this land, same as you!', '', 61391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die today.', '', 61390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Upstart pup! Think you can best me?', '', 61389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have sores older than you.', '', 61388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will smoke your ashes.', '', 61387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die in bed like a coward.', '', 61386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was sleeping!', '', 61385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you with my own two fists.', '', 61384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you can get the drop on me?', '', 61383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble before me!', '', 61382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die well!', '', 61381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sha will take you all.', '', 61380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is ours now!', '', 61379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A challenge!', '', 61378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am your death!', '', 61377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear me!', '', 61376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', '', 61375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I did not expect to see $rs in this land. You are certainly welcome here.$b$bPlease, do you have supplies for trade? We are low on an assortment of things.', 61374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh I got something for you to \'taste\'! Come a little closer...', '', 61373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were on our way to the Tiger Temple when you caught us. Lucky for you our healer was napping... apparently.', '', 61372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are three of us, which is two more than I need to eat your head.', '', 61371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why have you come so far north? And why are you trespassing in our lands?', '', 61370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear saurok taste like chicken. Let\'s find out.', '', 61369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many more of you are there?', '', 61368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silly lizards. Did you think you could defeat the mighty yaungol?', '', 61367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been to the Jade Forest? To the Valley of the Four Winds? To the low lands of Kun-Lai?$b$bTell me, do they enjoy their peace? Are they still ignorant of the price it costs for that peace? How much Shado-Pan blood must be spilled to maintain their peace?$b$bI suppose it is best they do not. Peace is a thing best enjoyed by the ignorant so they may savor their lives without worry.', '', 61366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the watchers of the wall, the keepers of darkness, the masters of shadows. We know what evil lurks in the heart of Pandaria. We... are the Shado-Pan.', '', 61365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look as one who has seen much fighting. But tell me, was it in service to yourself, or others?', '', 61364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is the way of highest service. I have no time for petty conversation or challenges from a low lander.', '', 61363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You come as the carrion bird before a battle.', '', 61362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find no peace here.', '', 61361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You smell of the low lands. You should go back to them. There is no peace in these mountains for travelers.', '', 61360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What matter of \'thing\' are you?', '', 61359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a sacred place. Strangers are unwelcome.', '', 61358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your presence here is unwelcome.', '', 61357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face me. Show me your full potential.', '', 61356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look what the winds blew to my door! Take a break from your adventures and rest, $c.', 61355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to my inn, traveler. We have hot meals and soft beds.', 61354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $r. Have a look around.', 61353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You look weary, traveler. Come share our warm fire and good brew.', 61352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ho, $c, welcome to the eastern temple! Make yourself at home.', 61351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs.', '', 61350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stinky tofu, come and get your stinky tofu! I\'ve got the stinkiest tofu in all of Pandaria!', '', 61349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Try the hottest spices from here to the great wall! Delicious, spicy soup!', '', 61348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tasty, fresh, wholesome and delicious! Come get some of Tao\'s noodle soup!', '', 61347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steaming hot noodle soup, come and get your hot noodle soup!', '', 61346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steamed buns, delicious steamed pork buns! Come and get them!', '', 61345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noodles here, get your delicious noodle soup!', '', 61344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I require the flame, master.', 'I require the flame, master.', 61343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Temple of the Jade Serpent.', 'Take me to the Temple of the Jade Serpent.', 61342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MINE!', '', 61341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Takers keepers!  Don\'t be dumb.', '', 61340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop it meanies!  Maybe I take your sword too!', '', 61339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mean sword-takers. Go away!', '', 61338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If dumb man lose sword, it not dumb man\'s sword no more!', '', 61337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me and sword alone!  No retakes allowed!', '', 61336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you try to take my sword?  It\'s MY sword!', '', 61335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found it!  It\'s mine!', '', 61334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope our paths cross again, $n! Until then, may your journey be safe and meaningful.', '', 61333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 3, 0, 6, 8, 39653),
('With the villagers help we will surely track down the Zandalari.', '', 61332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes the roads we travel teach us more about ourselves than we would expect.', '', 61331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m grateful to you, friend.', 'You\'re my hero!', 61330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those Zandalari will regret attacking Zouchin!', 'So... sore...', 61328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My poor old bones were starting to get stiff out here.', 'Thanks to you I\'ll be rested when those barbarians return.', 61327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was starting to wonder how long I would be out here.', 'You do us a great service friend.', 61326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s emerges from the Dread Expanse!', '', 61324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s submerges beneath the Dread Expanse!', '', 61323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get that Saurok!', '', 61322, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Saurok\'s making off with our loot, get him!', '', 61321, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the King is going to force us to fight each other. Not that it will take much for that to happen.', '', 61320, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all these clans here I bet a fight\'s going to break out.', '', 61319, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the King is going to force us to fight each other. Not that it will take much for that to happen.', '', 61318, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet the other clans can\'t even use magic anymore. What good could they be to the King!', '', 61317, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our clan is the greatest in all the land, he must choose us!', '', 61316, 0, 0, 23, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do you think the King will pick?', '', 61315, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That poor village was ambushed when the Zandalari arrived. They don\'t even have any skilled fighters to defend themselves! You have to help them. Shin will make sure you get to the village safely.', 61314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 5, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is the horde trying to do down here?', 61313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
