('Have patience, Mrs. Mann. These strangers from beyond the mist continually surprise me.', '', 61071, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall to your knees, coward!', '', 61070, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See how effortlessly I CRUSH your bones!', '', 61069, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tender your souls, mortals! These are the halls of the dead!', '', 61068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27814, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who allowed these outsiders inside our halls? Only Clan Harthak or Clan Kargesh would stoop to such treachery!', '', 61067, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 27940, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand, Lorewalker. But the Serpent\'s Heart project is behind schedule and we\'ve not a stone to spare!', 61066, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 29534, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You call that... a fight...?', '', 61065, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the sudden arrival of strangers on Pandaria, I believe we\'ll need the lessons our history can teach us.', '', 61064, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will all be tested this day, but we shall prevail.', '', 61063, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient fresco was once inlaid with jade, but it has fallen into ruin and now its wisdom is lost to us.', '', 61062, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re close. I can feel the unnatural hatred broiling inside of me.', '', 61061, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will need the strongest the Shado-Pan has to offer for the confrontation with the Sha of Hatred. And it\'s likely that even then, not all of us will make it out alive.', '', 61060, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s spits blood in your face.', '', 61059, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ENOUGH OF THIS FARCE! You will feel PAIN, cowards!', '', 61058, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools, I possess the power of the elements!', '', 61057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are very brave... thank you!', '', 61056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the might of my arsenal, weaklings!', '', 61055, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorai lives? I will go find him. Thank you, friend!', '', 61054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend... I\'ll make my way to the south!', '', 61053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY MIGHT IS ENDLESS!', '', 61052, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re on the trail of the Sha of Hatred. I want you with us for the hunt.', '', 61051, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taoshi speaks highly of you. Her respect for you says a great deal.', '', 61050, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know you. If the reports I\'ve been receiving are true, I could use a $gman:woman; like you.', '', 61049, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this, more have come to claim my crown? They are small and weak.', '', 61048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not the first to challenge me, peons. You will not be the last.', '', 61047, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 28349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feeling a bit... dizzy?', 61046, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s still hope - Gorai is still alive, to the south. Go!', 'There\'s still hope - Gorai is still alive, to the south. Go!', 61045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no hope... our people have lost their minds!', '', 61044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you\'re not one of them, are you? You\'ve got to help me!', '', 61043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lawspeaker was right... they\'ve gone insane!', '', 61042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, try your luck! Ha ha haaa...', 61041, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh... death... hurts? Unreal...', 61039, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better luck next time!', 61037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aw. Careful not to bleed on the rug please, dear.', 61036, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ashes, ashes, we all fall down!', 61035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ooh, it takes some real stones to challenge the Mistress of Illusion. Well? Show me what you\'ve got!', 61034, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 30287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, accept the ancestors blessing. It is not much, but it is all I can give without my staff, and will help you traverse the Mere.', '', 61033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get too comfortable here, pal.$b$bThe general says these digs is only temporary.', '', 61032, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 388, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Lifting', 'Lifting', 61031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But look who has arrived! Mrs. Mann, there\'s someone I would like you to meet.', '', 61030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah! You\'re as stubborn as my dang husband!', 61029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would love to help you, Lorewalker, but understand - I am in a real bind here.', 61028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29533, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fewer of these pests behind the blockade.', 61027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This old bear... I can\'t stay mad at him.$B$BThank you, stranger.', 61026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine!', '', 61025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land must be made ready for the fleet.$b$bNo excuses!', '', 61024, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', 'How may I help you?', 61023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing to teach you, $c.', 'I have nothing to teach you, $c.', 61022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, Zin\'Jun, there\'s vengeance to be had!', 'Come on, Zin\'Jun, there\'s vengeance to be had!', 61021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('General Pa\'valak calls for Reinforcements!', '', 61020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hopefully this one will not be worse than the last...', '', 61019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, friend. Prepare yourself to defeat whatever emerges!', '', 61018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will begin the ritual. Prepare yourself!', '', 61017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you coming?', 'Are you coming?', 61016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the Shadow of the Golden Lotus to escape!', 'Defeat the Shadow of the Golden Lotus to escape!', 61015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey rookie, take this diving helmet. You might need it out there.', '', 61014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Point out the pools of corruption, and I will use my staff to cleanse them. You\'ll need to defeat the creatures that emerge!', '', 61013, 0, 16321, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I felt a presence, a burning pain and rage in my mind...', 61012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A beast emerged from you when I began the ritual. $p slew it!', '', 61011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is that?!', '', 61010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I feel so much calmer. What happened?', 61009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... thing must be what was controlling the villagers! I now know what we must do.', '', 61008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice seeing another Alliance face! I thought I was going to die out here.', 'Nice seeing another Alliance face! I thought I was going to die out here.', 61007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Don\'t worry, it was just a scratch. Now I feel good as new!', 'Thank you, friend. Don\'t worry, it was just a scratch. Now I feel good as new!', 61006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, friend. That was some firefight, but I knew that blue would pull through!', 'Thanks, friend. That was some firefight, but I knew that blue would pull through!', 61005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me. For the Alliance!', 'Thank you for rescuing me. For the Alliance!', 61004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was a goner. I owe you my life.', 'I thought I was a goner. I owe you my life.', 61003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First rule of the Tiger Temple Tournament: We don\'t talk about Tiger Temple Tournament.', '', 61002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat\'s betta. Now let\'s get to huntin\' dem monkeys, mon.', '', 61001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh... what is happening? Why is the ritual affecting her?', '', 61000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It worked! It wo-', '', 60999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even better than rations. Rest. I thought I\'d be out here a while yet.', 60998, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even better news than I was hoping. I look forward to a warm bed.', '', 60997, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let my replacement know that a lot of mantid have been trying to sneak through the main channel. This is no easy post.', 60996, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That swarm is what we have to look forward to. Ancestors help us if they decide to turn on the battlefront.', '', 60995, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gormal takes additional damage while taunted by a farmer!', '', 60994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see if this is sufficient to cleanse the corruption from my people\'s souls.', '', 60993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been passed down from ancient times, but none of our people have needed to use it since then.', '', 60992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never performed this ritual. I don\'t know what will happen, exactly.', '', 60991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not tolerate this disobedience!', '', 60990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our empire will be glorious! And you won\'t be there to see it!', '', 60989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare to defy the mogu? Then you will die!', '', 60988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent little $r!', '', 60987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know your place!', '', 60986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach you some respect!', '', 60985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weak have no place in this world!', '', 60984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow down!', '', 60983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll learn to serve!', '', 60982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More hired thugs?! It will take more than these three to best me!', '', 60981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve overrun the village! HELP!', 'They\'ve overrun the village! HELP!', 60980, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Away, you fiends! Help!', 'Away, you fiends! Help!', 60979, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Help!', 'Help! Help!', 60978, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic*', '', 60977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have studied your craft well, $c.', 'You have studied your craft well, $c.', 60976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $c. You have been taught well.', 'Well done, $c. You have been taught well.', 60975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did you learn to do that? You must have had a lot of practice.', 'Where did you learn to do that? You must have had a lot of practice.', 60974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your healing skills are impressive, $n.', 'Your healing skills are impressive, $n.', 60973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are skilled in the healing arts, $c.', 'You are skilled in the healing arts, $c.', 60972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay here tonight, buy my wares, and fortune will shine on you for certain.', '', 60971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find a copper, pick it up, all day long I\'ll have good luck.', '', 60970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone! Please help!', 'Someone! Please help!', 60969, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once found a feather from big green bird on Neverrest. No green birds fly on Neverrest. This is a very good luckydo.', '', 60968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll defend this place to my death, you monster!', '', 60967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was doomed. Thank you so much!', 'I thought I was doomed. Thank you so much!', 60966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s hope for Greenstone! Thank you!', 'There\'s hope for Greenstone! Thank you!', 60965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude!', 'You have my gratitude!', 60964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to remove my glyphs.', 'I wish to remove my glyphs.', 60963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to reset my Class Specialization.', 'I wish to reset my Class Specialization.', 60962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I do.', 'Yes. I do.', 60961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. I do.', 'Yes. I do.', 60960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude.', 'You have my gratitude.', 60959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You want something? Mine is the bitterest of the brews. Are you worthy?', 60958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your impudent patter does not intimidate me, fool.', '', 60957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, priest! You know nothing of my work!', '', 60956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orachi shall have my head if you do not work faster, smith! And I shall have yours.', '', 60955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you ever finish your work, smith? Perhaps you require additional encouragement?', '', 60954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, smith! Shai Hu hungers for blood!', '', 60953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know where you came from, but if you\'ll continue to stand up for justice as you have done today, you\'ll be welcome in Pandaria.$B$BThank you.', '', 60952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew it was within their power to defy the mogu - they just needed someone like you to show them how.', '', 60951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Danger? Ha! I scoff at danger!$B$BDon\'t you know that the most delicious foods are also the most dangerous to acquire?', 60950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay inside, Hanae! Adventurer, please see if there\'s anything the Gentle Mother needs. She is working tirelessly to tend to the survivors inside.', '', 60949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a grummle cake in a corner of my cage. So delicious! Best day ever!', '', 60948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We wouldn\'t be in this mess if Tankiss would learn to keep the heat off his healer.', '', 60947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away. My team can handle ourselves.', '', 60946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible! Our might is the greatest in all the empire!', '', 60945, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 28247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our clan is the true clan! No interloper can change that!', '', 60944, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 27948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will never surrender our right to rule the destiny of our people!', '', 60943, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 27933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can hear myself getting luckier...', '', 60942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... its like I can smell the grummle luck...', '', 60941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These grummles make a strange grog.', '', 60940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These grummle charms are starting to kick in...', '', 60939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah... My hooves are huuuuge...', '', 60938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people, corrupted...\n\nShai Hu, a local warrior, was the first to drink of the tainted waters.\n\nHe was strengthed, emboldened, and urged the others to do the same.\n\nI warned them against it. I sensed danger, corruption...', '', 60937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like they couldn\'t handle the taste of Alliance steel. Good work, $n.', '', 60936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeeee-haw, we drove them back!! That\'s right, monkeys, run your little tails off!', '', 60935, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clan Harthak will show all why they are the truest of Mogu!', '', 60934, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 27947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clan Kargesh will demonstrate why only the strong deserve to stand at our King\'s side!', '', 60933, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 28246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clan Gurthan will show our King and the rest of you power-hungry imposters why we are the rightful ones at his side!', '', 60932, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 27932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you have returned! One thousand thanks. Please, take this, our most potent creation: Volatile Greenstone Brew.', '', 60931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks... I couldn\'t have held out much longer.', '', 60930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', 'For the Alliance!', 60929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho, did they send more reinforcements from Stormwind? $C on the field!', 'Ho, did they send more reinforcements from Stormwind? $C on the field!', 60928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$R, over here! Drive them back!', '$R, over here! Drive them back!', 60927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their numbers are endless, $c! Help us hold them back!', 'Their numbers are endless, $c! Help us hold them back!', 60926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
