('It is not in our nature to shirk from danger. We will dive gladly into darkness if it means protecting our loved ones.', '', 60783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not leave until we have located Suna.', '', 60782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seeing scenery that beautiful really puts things into perspective.', '', 60781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you noticed anything strange happening around Zouchin Village?', 'Have you noticed anything strange happening around Zouchin Village?', 60780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $c! Be sure to take a moment and enjoy the view!', 60779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Mishi appears ready to leave.>', '', 60778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hat is the most good coach. $p would be a luckydo to listen to my advice.', '', 60777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me find my amulet Mishi?', 'Can you help me find my amulet Mishi?', 60776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death will not stop da storm that is coming! Da Thunder King will rise!', '', 60775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My husband was captured by the yaungol several days ago. I cannot not rest until I see him safely returned.', 60774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do we continue to wait? They should make the order to attack!', 60773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taran and Ban are masters of strategy and logistics. I prefer fighting to planning.', 60772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No no no! Jib! Then Jab!', '', 60771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
