('Jib that $pr in the dooker!', '', 60770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat that wikket like it owes you money!', '', 60769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can beat that $pr wikket!', '', 60768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket gonna eat lightning and derk thunder!', '', 60767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sha took us by surprise. Luckily, we had no casualties.', '', 60766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go go $pc luckydo!', '', 60765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I face the sha, I will be prepared.', '', 60764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I survived my first encounter with the sha. It was more frightening than I had anticipated.', '', 60763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were all trained to strengthen our minds against the sha\'s influence, but it is stronger than we imagined.', '', 60762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other rangers simply turned on one another.$B$BWe would have turned as well, but thanks to Yalia\'s quick thinking, we are safe.', '', 60761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make with more left right punch and runs!', '', 60760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let it grab you!', '', 60759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this the presence of the sha? It is far worse than my instructors ever described.', '', 60758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My training has led to this point. I must not fail my brothers and sisters!', '', 60757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give him the chair!', '', 60756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Punch the luck out of that Wrestler!', '', 60755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go kid! Make with the punch!', '', 60754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hardly believe it. You were able to suppress your hatred.', 60753, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like we\'ve managed to quell the sha... for now.', 60752, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are not out of the woods yet.', 60751, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you are not careful, your own hatred could consume you.', 60750, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally, the sha has shown its face. Be careful!', 60749, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be alert, $n! We are surrounded!', 60748, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quest Objective Complete. *Click!*', '', 60747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Challengers, to my Tournament of Strength!', '', 60746, 0, 15324, 0, 65, 0, 29025, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
