('Vengeful Hui has appeared in the Mason\'s Quarter, north of Greenstone Village. Challenge him!', '', 60742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flee, craven villagers! This land belongs to nature alone once more!', '', 60741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
