('Look here! It\'s the history of Zian of the Endless Shadow, a powerful sorcerer who kept the kingdoms in check through terror and darkness.', '', 60728, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 30207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Wayward Landing, please.', 'Take me to Wayward Landing, please.', 60727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Let\'s go investigate!', 'What are you waiting for? Let\'s go investigate!', 60726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My precious $n! You\'ll pay for that!', '', 60725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unbelievable! This is the fabled Mogu\'shan Library!  Can you even imagine what we could learn from these vaults?', '', 60724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Hellscream\'s Hope!', 'Take me to Hellscream\'s Hope!', 60723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, it is dangerous out there. For your own safety, make use of the totem I gave you!', 60722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go ahead with the binding, Cho.', 'Go ahead with the binding, Cho.', 60721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
