('Very well. Today... is your day...', '', 60719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All done. Did I miss anything?', '', 60718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you counting on this whelp to stop us? Hah!', '', 60717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clever, hiding out up here - using the elements to shield your tracks. But my quilen hounds could sense the Tongue even here.', '', 60716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LOREWALKER! You have something of mine.', '', 60715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch my back - I trust you can handle any interruptions.', '', 60714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The binding should only take a moment, but I\'ll be completely entranced.', '', 60713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I saw the Wrestler\'s real face once. True story.', '', 60712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder who talked Xuen in to letting the sauroks compete. I like a good test of strength, but those creatures are just... so... angry.', '', 60711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Apparently a hozen found himself a crate of bombs and thinks he\'s a monk now.', '', 60710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wrestler is going to destroy the competition today.', '', 60709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be frightened, $r. We will keep everyone safe.', '', 60708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never seen anything like this. Have you, $n?', '', 60707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $r, what do you make of this place?', '', 60706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is Suna really out there somewhere?', '', 60705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! Don\'t sneak up on a pandaren like that!', '', 60704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to know what happened here. It\'s too horrible to imagine.', '', 60703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t think this place is... haunted... do you?', '', 60702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t like the look of this place.', '', 60701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, I see some of Suna\'s things! She must have made camp here. But where is she?', '', 60700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaack! Wikkets win! Just don\'t take my boom booms!', '', 60699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In this place? Are... are you sure?', '', 60698, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 31899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like the site of... a massacre.', '', 60697, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Suna\'s tracks lead into the village ahead.', '', 60696, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 31897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Suna\'s tracks stop here. We won\'t leave until we find her.', '', 60695, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stop here. Everyone out!', '', 60694, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30588, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s too quiet. We should check this out.', '', 60693, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30587, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope so, Yalia.', '', 60692, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But now... she hates me.', '', 60691, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have taken the risk and sent the order to attack.', '', 60690, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She blames me, you know.', '', 60689, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But this place reeks of death!', 60688, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 31416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh, what is that stench?', 60687, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 31415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, she cannot hate you. At least not forever. Hahahaha!', 60686, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 31414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You swore the Shado-Pan blood oath together, did you not? You are bound together by powers far stronger than hatred.', 60685, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks!', 'Many thanks!', 60684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did what you thought was best. No commander has the foresight to see the future.', 60683, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That may be, but it was no one\'s fault.', 60682, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'She must be torn by grief over her husband\'s death.', 60681, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ban, you look worried.', 60680, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, well... it\'s not like Suna to run off by herself.', '', 60679, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your goal on an Island Expedition is to collect Azerite.  A group of the opposing faction\'s forces will be collecting Azerite as well.\n\nThe first group to 6000 wins.\n\nPowerful creatures, Azerite nodes, treasure chests, allies in need of aid, and many more things will grant you Azerite. \n\nYou and your party can see concentrated Azerite sources that are close to you on your map.\n\nAfter several minutes, your Azerite detector will come on-line, showing you all of the Azerite on the island.\n\nShrines, food, and objects around the island may turn the tides in your favor.\n\nSome monsters on the island are powerful, watch out!', '', 60678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, brave $c.', 'Thank you, brave $c.', 60677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just about done here...', '', 60676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, we\'re ready to get started.', '', 60675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
