('You\'ve all accomplished a great thing in saving Shen-zin Su. You do us all proud.', '', 60632, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you, my young student? Where will you go?', '', 60631, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... perhaps that is for the best. I like what I\'ve seen of them, and it sounds as though their world could use my help.', '', 60630, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 27305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What of you, Ji? Will you join the Horde in their journey back?', '', 60629, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Master Shang Xi, I would like to accompany the Alliance back to their home.', 60628, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We risked everything, but we did it. Shen-zin Su will be okay.', 60627, 0, 0, 1, 69, 0, 0, 27418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $p! We need help!', '', 60626, 0, 19275, 5, 65, 0, 27332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need more healers at the tents. Recall the priests from the west.', 60625, 0, 18360, 22, 65, 0, 0, 27508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have men in that wreckage! Get more men out there recovering the wounded.', 60624, 0, 18359, 22, 65, 0, 0, 27507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand down, tauren, before I put you back in chains.', 60623, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 27522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And he\'s down for the count! Good going.', '', 60622, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This monkey\'s about to get slapped!', '', 60621, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That all you\'ve got?!', '', 60620, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this, monkeyface!', '', 60619, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you at the dock!', '', 60618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All done! Let\'s get back and see if Aysa\'s come up with anything during her meditation. [Removed?]', '', 60617, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to fight by you more often.', '', 60616, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got this handled.', '', 60615, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 27327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They never stood a chance.', '', 60614, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You make this look easy.', '', 60613, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27325, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! That one looked painful!', '', 60612, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He had that one coming.', '', 60611, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 27323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like the way you fight!', '', 60610, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s tackle this one together!', '', 60609, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, Huo. The people have missed your warmth.', '', 60608, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 27788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes master.', 60607, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 27406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On it!', '', 60606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27306, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And $n, you shall be the hand that guides us all. Speak with me for a moment before you join Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east.', '', 60605, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27794, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aysa, I want you to go to the Singing Pools to find Shu, the spirit of water.', '', 60604, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27793, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ji, I\'d like you to go to the Dai-Lo Farmstead in search of Wugou, the spirit of earth.', '', 60603, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to speak to Shen-zin Su and discover how to heal it. And to do that, we need the four elemental spirits returned. Huo was the first.', '', 60602, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a much larger problem we face now, my students. Shen-zin Su is in pain. If we do not act, the very land on which we stand could die, and all of us with it.', '', 60601, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have conquered every challenge I put before you, $n. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple.', '', 60600, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A challenge in compassion and humility. By helping Merchant Lorvo, it would seem you\'ve passed, $c. Master Shang would be pleased.', 60599, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 27404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! Off to de spirit world wit\' ya!', '', 60598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Munchies and crunchies for most happy sale. You buy?', '', 60597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Boom Boom ready to boom up some wikkets!', '', 60596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for the Boom Box!', '', 60595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets can\'t survive the Boom Boom Boogaloo!', '', 60594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boom boom for you!', '', 60593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boogaloo of the boom boom!', '', 60592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for the Boom Boom Boogaloo!', '', 60591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doom doom from the boom boom!', '', 60590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets gonna fail. I got a box full of boom booms!', '', 60589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets gonna face the Boom Boom!', '', 60588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gonna set wikkets up the boom boom!', '', 60587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hatred intensifies! Control it now!', 'Your hatred intensifies! Control it now!', 60586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You feel hatred boiling up inside you.', 'You feel hatred boiling up inside you.', 60585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... feel something. Is it... peace?', '', 60584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! IT CANNOT BE! YOU CAN NOT STOP ME!', '', 60583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT IS THIS?! THEIR RAGE... IT BURNS ME...', '', 60582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR RAGE! I FEED ON YOUR RAGE!', '', 60581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroying the pipes leaks |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r into the room!', 'Destroying the pipes leaks |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r into the room!', 60580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hatred overwhelms you!', 'Your hatred overwhelms you!', 60579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to begin the ritual.', 'I am ready to begin the ritual.', 60578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and that is what happened in the brewery.', '', 60577, 0, 16309, 0, 65, 0, 29666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sha had me in its grasp? I had not even realized it until now...', 'The sha had me in its grasp? I had not even realized it until now...', 60576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... what happened? I feel much calmer now.', 'I... what happened? I feel much calmer now.', 60575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that... the sha? I wanted to rip everyone to shreds!', 'Was that... the sha? I wanted to rip everyone to shreds!', 60574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. I could not escape the sha\'s grip on my own.', 'Thank you, friend. I could not escape the sha\'s grip on my own.', 60573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Suddenly, I feel at peace...', 'What? Suddenly, I feel at peace...', 60572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me of that horrible burden.', 'Thank you for freeing me of that horrible burden.', 60571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt... so much hatred...', 'I felt... so much hatred...', 60570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh-what came over me?', 'Wh-what came over me?', 60569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need another Totem of Harmony.', 'I need another Totem of Harmony.', 60568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! Their deaths hurt us, but they will hurt him, too! Bring them close to him!', '', 60567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When these creatures die, they explode... I know, kill them near Shai Hu!', '', 60565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall crush Shai Hu, together!', '', 60564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here to help you defeat the poisoner of my people!', '', 60563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, I come to help. We will show Shai Hu to his grave!', '', 60562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c? Most engaging.', '', 60561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight well, and with honor.', '', 60560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah... a challenge.', '', 60559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I await a challenger.', '', 60558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind is my ally!', '', 60557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why aren\'t you helping me fight things?', 'Why aren\'t you helping me fight things?', 60556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Because Uncle Chen made me promise not to!$b$bListen. Chen may be a stupid, boring, lazy, fat old uncle, but that doesn\'t mean that I don\'t respect him. He told me not to get into any trouble, and I\'m not about to ignore him.$b$bBesides, you seem to be doing just fine on your own. You don\'t need a little girl to help you kill things.', 60555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe Uncle Chen would rather sit down and drink beer than walk around and explore this place!', 60554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for taking me out exploring with you, $n.', 60553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you seeing all this stuff? This place is great!', 60552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.', '', 60551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For everything you have done, $n... you have our gratitude.', '', 60550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent my life on that wall, $n. I gave up everything I had to become Shado-Pan, to prevent something like this from happening.$b$bI have failed.', '', 60549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I understand.', 'I understand.', 60548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the wall, anyway?', 'What happened to the wall, anyway?', 60547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shado-Pan?', 'Shado-Pan?', 60546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening here?', 'What is happening here?', 60545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A few days past, I saw a bolt of dark energy crackling through the ground from my tower vigil. It came from the west, fracturing the wall, and very nearly breaking through it entirely.$b$bYou can still see the scars it left. It ruined these farmers\' land.$b$bThe mantid scouts followed shortly after. Whether they\'ve had this attack planned or they\'re just capitalizing on an opportunity, I couldn\'t say. Maybe they\'re running away from whatever caused the crack in the first place.', '', 60544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. The defense of Stoneplow currently rests on me, Guard-Captain Oakenshield, and three others of our order. As we speak, those three Shado-Pan are standing at the foot of the wall, waiting to defend against the next wave of attackers. This is our charge - to protect Pandaria from the enemies that the common people have all but forgotten about.$b$bWhile our numbers here in Stoneplow are few, we do not expect reinforcements from Kun Lai... unless this situation gets worse. Say, for example, if that weak spot in the wall crumbled.', '', 60543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantid are attacking, and we are shamefully unprepared.$b$bUnder normal circumstances, our enemy is quite predictable. We anticipated that the next full-scale mantid attack would hit in about ten years, as they do so regularly every hundred.$b$bThis current invasion is hardly \"full-scale\", but it\'s still strong enough to catch a farming village unawares. Had my Shado-Pan not been keeping such a watchful vigil on the wall, Stoneplow might have already fallen.', '', 60542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The defense of Stoneplow is more important than you may know.$b$bIf the mantid take Stoneplow, they may as well take this entire valley. Beyond this wall, there is nothing to stop them from sweeping through the entirety of Pandaria.', '', 60541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Mogu Machine goes into overdrive! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!', 'The Ancient Mogu Machine goes into overdrive! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!', 60540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ancient Mogu Machine breaks down! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!', 'The Ancient Mogu Machine breaks down! |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116779|h[Titan Gas]|h|r floods the room!', 60539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_talent_icon_furyintheblood:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117708|h[Maddening Shout]|h|r!', '', 60538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_envelopingshadows.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117506|h[Undying Shadows]|h|r!', '', 60537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The machine hums to life!  Get to the lower level!', '', 60536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a rule: anybody who calls me handsome gets free beer.', '', 60535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whaa.... What\'s happening?!?', 60534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31420, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! I\'ve come too far to give up!', 60533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It doesn\'t look very friendly in there. Maybe I should just...', 60532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess he\'s somewhere in this forest?', 60531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I win? Yay!', 60530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me. We will use these totems to purify the earth.', 60529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good luck!', 60528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, help me by activating the three large totems.', 60527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now! Let us see what darkness corrupts this place!', 60526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31418, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... think I will be safe, for now, thanks to you.', '', 60525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] I\'m ready to fight!', '[PH] I\'m ready to fight!', 60524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH] Are you ready to fight?', '[PH] Are you ready to fight?', 60523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s! And, ah... salutations, I suppose.$b$bSorry. Not quite sure what to say. I\'m not used to havin\' much in the way of company around here.$b$bThat is, not unless they\'re here to buy some o\' my brew, of course.', '', 60522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha.', 'Ha ha.', 60521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aw, heck no. That\'s just how I make my beer.$b$bMuddy water, you see... it\'s got little bugs in it, that ferment your ale for you. Some folks use real yeast, grown in a fancy brewery under controlled conditions and what have you. I use muddy water.$b$bIt\'s kind of my thing.$b$bI guess I\'m just not what you\'d call \"cultured\".', '', 60520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is Mudmug your real name?', 'Is Mudmug your real name?', 60519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Yup. Been brewin\' beer since I could drink it.$b$bSome folks say I\'m wastin\' my time, that I could just buy the beer that comes out o\' that big ol\' brewery down yonder, but... I dunno. There\'s somethin\' right nice about brewin\' your own mug of ale.', '', 60518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you\'re a homebrewer?', 'So, you\'re a homebrewer?', 60517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Engine of Nalak\'sha begins to self destruct!', '', 60516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Energy Vortex begins to shut down.', '', 60515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Energy Vortex is inactive!', '', 60514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Energy Vortex is powering down! Get off the platform!', '', 60513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing shall stop the engine of creation!', '', 60512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infinite energy, unbound!', '', 60511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orb has been returned!', '', 60510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orbs have appeared!', '', 60509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m being sarcastic, by the way.', 60508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30507, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My favorite part was when you splashed muddy water in my eyes.', 60507, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe we can find some more weird, splashy bottles to fill with mud.', 60506, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you sure you don\'t want to keep wading in this gross water?', 60505, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What, we\'re done already!?', 60504, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Watch where you\'re splashing that $g thing, big guy!:thing!;', 60503, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PH]Troll Boss unleashes a Voodoo Hex![PH]', '', 60501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just going to bite without even looking!', '', 60500, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something fishy here...', '', 60499, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, wait. You smell... turnip...?', '', 60498, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something funny about carrot...', '', 60497, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop talk, start eat!', '', 60496, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust it.', '', 60495, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... perfect.', '', 60494, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrots never bad!', '', 60493, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good things happen to us today.', '', 60492, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We so lucky.', '', 60491, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
