('You\'re a life-saver. I\'ll do everything I can to heal the wound.', 'You\'re a life-saver. I\'ll do everything I can to heal the wound.', 60343, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m heading to the wound. Try to keep these beasts off of me.', 'I\'m heading to the wound. Try to keep these beasts off of me.', 60342, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is gone. We must all move on.', '', 60341, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to Lin, it was no one\'s fault.', '', 60340, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You throw caution to the wind.', '', 60339, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the greatest losses.', '', 60338, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will save him, Suna. I promise.', '', 60337, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 30596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lower your voice. It\'s no wonder Taran did not pick you for command. You take too many risks.', '', 60336, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 30595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, Suna. I share your desire to stop the yaungol. But I must consider every soldier, not just your husband.', '', 60335, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 30594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Taran Zhu just departed with the majority of our soldiers. Attacking now would be foolish.', '', 60334, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 30593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why did he have to die, Ban? I never told him how I felt.', 60333, 0, 16231, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And you cling to caution as if it will save you. Did your caution save your brother?', 60332, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We would not lose.', 60331, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He should have chosen me. Those who take the greatest risks achieve the greatest victories.', 60330, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Lin is down there!', 60329, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you forgotten that they are holding my husband prisoner? Time is running out!', 60328, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should attack them now, Ban, while their eyes are set upon the gates of Kun-Lai.', 60327, 0, 16231, 0, 65, 0, 0, 31299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We... did it...', '', 60326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mists are now leaving my body. I will remain in this world as long as I can. As long as it takes.', '', 60325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect Arconiss!', '', 60324, 0, 16218, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect Golgoss!', '', 60323, 0, 16217, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, friends. Glory awaits us.', '', 60322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you again, soon.', '', 60321, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are finished with your duties, report to Ban Bearheart. I am leaving him in command for the duration of the mission here.', '', 60320, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a situation to the south that requires my immediate attention.', '', 60319, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Remove the spear from Orbiss\' side.>', '<Remove the spear from Orbiss\' side.>', 60318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yaungol have shamed my people.$b$bThey will soon know the true meaning of shame.', '', 60317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on, $n. Pull it out. You will not be held accountable for my death, when it comes.', '', 60316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Settle down, you two. We have much to do, and getting Lin out alive is one of our top priorities.', '', 60315, 0, 16208, 1, 65, 0, 28412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But how much blood must be shed? There are both clever ways and foolish ways.', '', 60314, 0, 16208, 1, 65, 0, 30592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As do ours. Do you not see the number of our injured? Do you forget how many have been taken prisoner?', '', 60313, 0, 16208, 6, 65, 0, 30591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I disagree. We cannot underestimate the yaungol\'s strength.', '', 60312, 0, 16208, 274, 65, 0, 30590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course we need a sound strategy. But why cut off an arm when you can strike at the heart?', 60311, 0, 16208, 6, 65, 0, 0, 31298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not! YOU are the one who forgets my husband is one of the captives.', 60310, 0, 16208, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We already have them on the defensive. Even as we speak, their numbers weaken.', 60309, 0, 16208, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lord Taran, our foothold here is secure. We should take the first opportunity to attack.', 60308, 0, 16208, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sigh... she has always been this way. Proud, decisive, and always right.$B$BIn twenty years, I have not yet won an argument.$B$BWhy have I not yet learned my lesson?', '', 60307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantle of a commander is a heavier burden than I had expected.', '', 60306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suna and I do not always agree, but I always respect her opinion.', '', 60305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suna\'s thoughts are colored by worry for her husband.', '', 60304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $r.', '', 60303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see Lin down there? There are so many prisoners, but I cannot spot my husband.', 60302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Finally we are taking action! Something we should have done days ago.', 60301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ban is a great strategist, but he fails to see the most obvious solution.', 60300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should take action! While our leaders waggle their tongues, I could have slain ten yaungol.', 60299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would never ask a stranger to take on the duties of a Shado-Pan, but neither will I refuse help from a skilled $c.$B$BThis place is dangerous, $r. If you insist on staying, then I will gladly accept your help.', '', 60298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As soon as all of our reinforcements arrive, we will begin pushing further south.', '', 60297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much to be done.', '', 60296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I am going to die, I will die with my friends by my side.$b$bI will die knowing I did everything I could to avenge my people.$b$bI will die staring directly into the shamed face of my enemy.', '', 60295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was not always like this.$b$bThe Osul were not our enemies. They lived beside us. We assisted one another.', '', 60294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a long, drawn out sigh.', '', 60293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_stalwartprotector.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:117910|h[Flanking Orders]|h|r!', '', 60292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So hungry...  Mmm! YOU!', '', 60291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Must fight Osul now. Must stop hatred.', '', 60290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gol... goss...', '', 60289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are on the wrong side of this battle, $r. You side with savage beasts!', '', 60288, 0, 16156, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most bad fortune with big hozen ravage. Makes for bad travels.', '', 60287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grummles know all roads through mountains. But some grummles know better roads than others.', '', 60286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When counting past 3, continue to 5. Never stop at 4. Most bad fortune for those who stop on four.', '', 60285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luck is like lady grummle: hard to find but worth the search.', '', 60284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A clean yak is a lucky yak. A dirty yak is a yeti attack.', '', 60283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rabbitsfoot and Eightcoins argue over who has more luck. Those silly grummles forget that nothing is more lucky than finding lint in your pocket.', '', 60282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good fortune to drink coffee before a hike. Bad fortune to drink after.', '', 60281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know a secret trail through Neverrest. Add three days to any journey, but you see very neat waterfall along way. Most fortunate path.', '', 60280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to decide.', 'I\'m ready to decide.', 60279, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a broken world that could use your help, my student. Have you decided who you would like to accompany in your journey?', '', 60278, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements shield me!', '', 60277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NO!', '', 60276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...is stronger than yours.', '', 60275, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the will of my people...', '', 60274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because my will...', '', 60273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You resist the power of the torch... why won\'t you die, beast?', '', 60272, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think I can\'t see you back there, hiding in the shadows...', '', 60271, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s another mistlurker here... I can smell his stink.', '', 60270, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... strong...', '', 60269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re next, small one!', '', 60268, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('No...', '', 60267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you refuse to bend to the torch, you will die to the torch!', '', 60266, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have enough torches to erase all three of you!', '', 60265, 0, 16214, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s enough!', '', 60264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C... you must be the one that\'s been helping these pitiful mistlurkers.', '', 60263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahahaha! More than filth like you deserved.', '', 60262, 0, 16190, 0, 65, 0, 28130, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deceit is no match for true strength! This one is more powerful than you!', '', 60261, 0, 16190, 0, 65, 0, 28128, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are your lackeys, great chief? They cannot help you this time!', '', 60260, 0, 16190, 0, 65, 0, 28127, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not running this time, Jung Duk?', '', 60259, 0, 16190, 0, 65, 0, 28126, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hear you are the reason my cousin Syra is sending me wedding invitations.$b$bThanks a lot. Now I have to be the unmarried black yak of the family.', 60258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never set a yeti on fire. They just get mad.', '', 60257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some argue Brother Rabbitsfoot has more good fortune than I, the Lucky Eightcoins.$b$bAt this I laugh.$b$bIt is simple: he is called \"brother\", I am called \"Lucky\". Obviously I am of more luck.', '', 60256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most grummles keep a few luckydos about.$b$bLook, lint in pocket. Big luckydo. Oh, and smelly incense. Very big luckydo.$b$bNever trust unsmellible luck. Sometimes that is luck for someone else.', '', 60255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend, to the Grummle Bazaar!', '', 60254, 0, 15324, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares to challenge me?', '', 60253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to leave.', 'I\'m ready to leave.', 60252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Mishi looks at you inquisitively.>', '', 60251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu are preparing for something big. We\'ve got to stop them from getting ahold of any more ancient weapons.', '', 60250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Sprites swarm!', '', 60249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the help. I\'ll go help with the wound.', 'Thank you for the help. I\'ll go help with the wound.', 60248, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Energy Vortex is powering up!', '', 60247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Fooled you!', '', 60246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you... figure... it out...', '', 60245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you figure out which is real?!', '', 60244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Energy Vortex is active!', '', 60243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! You killed my brothers! You spilled their blood on the sacred ground of my ancestors!$B$BIf I were not chained, I would kill you now!$B$B<The old yaungol collapses from his outburst, breathing heavily.>', '', 60242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The old yaungol stares at you with hatred in his eyes.>', '', 60241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outsider! Ally of the Shado-Pan.$B$B<The old yaungol spits out the strange words bitterly.>$B$BCome closer if you wish me to break your neck!', '', 60240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have won. I was stronger. Wiser. I would have won against him!', '', 60239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They did not have to die...$B$BThe village to the south... my home, my family! They killed them all!$B$BIf only I had been stronger. I could have saved them!', '', 60238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away and leave me be. Let me suffer in peace.', '', 60237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die like this. Not like this!', '', 60236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you stare at, stranger?', '', 60235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the yaungol fighting each other? It seems their troubles run deeper than we thought.', '', 60234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the yaungol fighting each other? It seems their troubles run deeper than we thought.', '', 60233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was prepared for death. Now... you have given me another chance.', '', 60232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I could not have survived another day of the yaungol\'s cruelty.', '', 60231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in your debt, stranger. Thank you.', '', 60230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. I can find my way back on my own.', '', 60229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mirror... IMAGE!', '', 60228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! Let\'s see if you can figure this out!', '', 60227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n caused the Darkness.', '', 60226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew someone would come for us! Let me help you fight the yaungol.', '', 60225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few nibbles.  Hoping for a bite soon!', 'Just a few nibbles.  Hoping for a bite soon!', 60224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope.  How about you?', 'Nope.  How about you?', 60222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any luck today?', 'Any luck today?', 60221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me, $Gbrother:sister;. I cannot let you fight alone.', '', 60220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m in your debt, stranger. Please let me help you.', '', 60219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just what I was waiting for! Time to introduce those yaungol to my fists!', '', 60218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $r. It would be my honor to fight at your side.', '', 60217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... understand. Come, we must talk.', '', 60216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, cousin. But... the village.', '', 60215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cousin! You are well?', '', 60214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right. Let us make haste to the village!', '', 60213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should return... I am sure my skills will be needed at my cousin\'s village. And... we must prepare a funeral for those we have lost.', '', 60212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aysa sighs.', 60211, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or, they killed most of us. I was the village\'s healer - after they ran me through, I was able to apply enough of my medical skills to keep me alive... but barely.', '', 60210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we should have resisted - because, despite the fact that we... I... allowed them to take what they wanted, they killed us anyways.', '', 60209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first group that came - the Trolls... they cared nothing for us - walked right past us, pushing our families out of the way.\n\nThe next, though - the mercenaries. They took us prisoner, stole from our homes, and threatened us with death if we resisted.', '', 60207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... is the ground shaking?', '', 60206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay... I think... I can stand...', '', 60205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 60204, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is reckless, even for Ji. I need to stop him. Are you coming?', 60203, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of nibbles today, but not many bites.', 'Lots of nibbles today, but not many bites.', 60202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had it!  Must have been a huge one to take all my bait!', 'I had it!  Must have been a huge one to take all my bait!', 60201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got one!', 'Got one!', 60200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A brew sure would be nice right now.', 'A brew sure would be nice right now.', 60199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Unscrew the flask and offer it to her.>', '<Unscrew the flask and offer it to her.>', 60198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The massive yeti looks at you expectantly.>', '', 60197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re... we\'re alive!', '', 60196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
