('I see.', 'I see.', 60156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the hallowed birthplace of Chi-Ji, the Red Crane, the Southern Celestial. Followers and acolytes of Chi-Ji gather in this place to train their bodies, to hone their minds, to duel one another, and to better themselves in the eyes of the Red Crane.$b$bYou are welcome to join us in our training, $c. Bring with you a stout heart and a stout staff.', '', 60155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no more trials for you today, $n. Return to us again soon.', '', 60154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to face your next challenger?', '', 60153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail, Champion of Chi-Ji! Your presence honors us, $n.', '', 60152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s an honor, $n. Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji.', '', 60151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $n. I\'ve been eagerly anticipating your return.', '', 60150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our new challenger returns! Welcome, $n.', '', 60149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend! I am glad to see that you\'ve returned.', '', 60148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Cradle of Chi-Ji, friend.', '', 60147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, $n, you have a near perfect track record. Tell me, how do you feel about the Navy?', '', 60146, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! What else have you been up to out there? Let me give you a word of advice; don\'t accept a promotion that\'ll take you out of the action.', '', 60145, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you been to Shado-Pan Retreat or Firebough Nook yet, $n? I heard about trouble brewing there with the sha.', '', 60144, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you ask me, you should round up a bunch of your friends and burn Easterly Rest to the ground, $n.', '', 60143, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what would be the cherry on top today? Nazgrim dead.', '', 60142, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, what\'s this I hear about trouble at the Gate of Winter\'s Blossom? Are we looking at a second yaungol invasion even bigger than the first?', '', 60141, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pull up a chair, $n. I could use the company.', '', 60140, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! How are you? I hear things from here and there about your heroics.', '', 60139, 0, 16144, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how happy I am right now. If you were one of my officers, you\'d be getting a promotion!', '', 60138, 0, 16143, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no time to waste, $n. My intel tells me that the yaungol are about to launch an all-out last ditch assault. We\'re all counting on you to kill Chief Ragemesa.', '', 60137, 0, 16142, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts tell me that you brought the shield down. I\'m confused as to why you\'re back here instead of up there killing their leader.', '', 60136, 0, 16141, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ordo Ragemesa is right on our border, $n. I need you to bring that shield down now or we\'re lost.', '', 60135, 0, 16140, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another job well done, friend. You should see if Mishka and Sully need you?', '', 60134, 0, 16139, 396, 65, 0, 32452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
