('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_waepon_bow_zulgrub_d_01.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000$n has assaulted the Troll Depot!|r', '', 60117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_waepon_bow_zulgrub_d_01.blp:20|t|cFF00AEEF$n has Defended the Troll Depot!|r', '', 60116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_waepon_bow_zulgrub_d_01.blp:20|t|cFF00AEEF$n has assaulted the Troll Depot!|r', '', 60115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good to see you again, $n. How have you fared?', 60114, 0, 16137, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, $n, you did it! It warms my heart to see the pandaren families reuniting.', 60113, 0, 16136, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000$n has defended the Waterfall Depot!|r', '', 60112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m so worried about those poor captured pandaren. Have you had a chance yet to see what condition they\'re in, $n?', 60111, 0, 16135, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t|r|cFF00AEEF$n has defended the Waterfall Depot!|r', '', 60110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s so nice to no longer be hearing that troll go on and on! Thank you, $n!', 60109, 0, 16134, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do plan on taking care of that troll, yes?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, no?', 60108, 0, 16133, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t|cFFFF0000$n has assaulted the Waterfall Depot!|r', '', 60107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.blp:20|t|cFF00AEEF $n has assaulted the Waterfall Depot!|r', '', 60106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good news about Mogujia, $n?', 60105, 0, 16132, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you been able to investigate Mogujia? Please don\'t tell me that little pickle dwarf has you running off somewhere else. Can\'t he do his own dirty work?', 60104, 0, 16131, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, a moment of your time, please? There\'s trouble that we need your help with.', 60103, 0, 16130, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh sure, bein\' a nurse is fine and all for fixin\' folk up after all the hard work\'s been done.  Don\'t let that Mishka fool ya.', '', 60102, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this I hear \'bout trouble to the west at Firebough Nook?', '', 60101, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Kun-Lai pandaren are comin\' along just fine. Now if they\'d only show a little more of that scrappiness that you seem to be full of.', '', 60100, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I get all teary eyed just thinkin\' about all we been through together, $g boyo : lass;.', '', 60099, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tell ya, ten years from now everyone will be talkin\' about the time that ol\' Sully the Pickle and $n lit a fire right under those stinkin\' yaungol\'s noses and blew their oil rigs to kingdom come!', '', 60098, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! Let\'s brawl!', 'Come on! Let\'s brawl!', 60097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now look who\'s here. Heya, $n, bring us a pint and get o\'er here!', '', 60096, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got yourself a duel, $c.', 'You\'ve got yourself a duel, $c.', 60095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glory to Chi-Ji!', 'Glory to Chi-Ji!', 60094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s cries softly to himself.', '', 60093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen a finer $c than $n, and neither have you!', '', 60092, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Raise your weapon, $r! Let\'s fight!', 'Raise your weapon, $r! Let\'s fight!', 60091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There $g he : she; is! Oh, yer my favorite $g lad : lass;, yes you are, $n!', '', 60090, 0, 16128, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here I come!', 'Here I come!', 60089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go!', 'Here we go!', 60088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get o\'er here and give Sully a big ol\' hug, you scrapper! Them oil rigs went boom, one, two three! Ahahahahahaha!', '', 60087, 0, 16127, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You \'n me both know that those oil rigs ain\'t gonna blow themselves to smithereens. Well... they might, but it\'d be more fun if you did the deed, $n.', '', 60086, 0, 16126, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent work down there. Top notch. Now I\'ve got some other matters for ya if\'n your thinkin\' your up to some more skullbashin\'?', '', 60085, 0, 16125, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word is yer doin\' a fine job, $g lad : lass;. A fine job. I only ask that you finish up down there at the farm as soon as you can. We\'ve got some pretty hungry folks \'round here.', '', 60084, 0, 16124, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You already head o\'er to that farmstead? We\'re gonna run out of food here real quick, $g boyo : girlie;.', '', 60083, 0, 16123, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Couldn\'t have done better myself, my $g boy : girl;! Now, let\'s get down to business.', '', 60082, 0, 16122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Special attack: TIGER BOMB!', '', 60081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death from above: TIGER BOMB!', '', 60080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deadly attack: TIGER BOMB!', '', 60079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you survive? TIGER BOMB!', '', 60078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m getting fat and lazy just standing around here. I need some action!', '', 60077, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard that the Shado-Pan were having trouble to the southwest. Know anything about that, $n?', '', 60076, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, you could just head over to Westerly Rest and kill all of those Alliance fools.', '', 60075, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You sticking around for a while? We should drink.', '', 60074, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of these days we\'re going to have to talk about you joining my group, $n.', '', 60073, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
