('What word do you bring from the rest of Kun-Lai Summit?', '', 60071, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, $n.', '', 60070, 0, 16118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a smile on your face? Are you about to tell me that the Ordo Warbringer is dead?', '', 60069, 0, 16117, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, please listen closely. You MUST go back to Ordo Ragemesa and kill their chief.', '', 60068, 0, 16116, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. The shield is down. But what are you doing back here?', '', 60067, 0, 16115, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
