('I cannot emphasize enough how important it is that you kill those channelers and bring that shield down, $n.', '', 60065, 0, 16114, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pay your respects. $n is in the house!', '', 60064, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you! Faster! Chop chop! Oh hey, hiya, $n. What\'s cookin\'?', '', 60063, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between you and me, $n, these Kun-Lai guys are kinda slow. Nothin\' like us!', '', 60062, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah. I taught $n everything $g he : she; knows.', '', 60061, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me and $n go way back. Ain\'t that right, $n?', '', 60060, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s next, $n? Gonna take on the whole yaungol army by yourself? You could do it, too!', '', 60059, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, lookie here. It\'s $n!', '', 60058, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There $g he : she; is!', '', 60057, 0, 16111, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sound of those explosions was like music to my ears. Come here, $n. Give me a hug!', '', 60056, 0, 16110, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta blow those oil rigs, $n. We don\'t want them stinky yaungol raining exploding fire kegs down on our heads!', '', 60055, 0, 16109, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to hear you got those farmers all squared away, chief. Now we gotta take care of some new business.', '', 60054, 0, 16108, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re helpin\' those farmers out, right, ace? We\'re countin\' on you to get us some grub.', '', 60053, 0, 16107, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What gives? You gotta get to that farm. Did Kiryn send you to do her work? She\'s so lazy!', '', 60052, 0, 16106, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heya, $n. Nice work here, chief.', '', 60051, 0, 16105, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! They took my luckydo!', '', 60050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I smell my luckydo! Oh please bring to me.', '', 60049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The... village... dead...', '', 60047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next.', 60046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on! This is gonna be a bumpy ride!', '', 60045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kafa good for grummles and pandaren - not good for goots and yetis and hozen. You should know that!', '', 60044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is what happen when you get lazy.', '', 60043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You never shoulda fed dem goots, Cousin.', '', 60042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m such a luckydont! I ruined Uncle Keenbean\'s kafa trade!', '', 60041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will show you the meaning of despair... and I will drag this whole island down with me!', 60040, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still clinging to the tailfeathers of Chi-Ji, and his idiotic notions of \"hope\"?', 60039, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not bury me again!', '', 60038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your rage gives you strength!', '', 60037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29006, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wrath flows freely!', '', 60036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29009, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your rage sustains me!', '', 60035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29007, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
