('The Northern Crossroads changed tracks!', '', 60032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eastern Crossroads changed tracks!', '', 60031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eastern Crossroads changed tracks!', '', 60030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Leesa. You\'re $g boyfriend\'s : girlfriend\'s; here!', '', 60029, 0, 16091, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just the other day I saw a much more powerful $c flying overhead.', '', 60028, 0, 16091, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone should finish these yaungol off. I\'ve got better things to do than stand around here all day!', '', 60027, 0, 16091, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meh.', '', 60026, 0, 16091, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
