('The |cFFFF0000Horde|r has taken control of the Diamond Depot!', '', 60008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought you were going to hit them. You roll that keg like you\'re new, or something.', '', 60007, 0, 16089, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has taken control of the Diamond Depot!', '', 60006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
