('The Alliance has lost control of the Diamond Depot!', '', 60004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Are you too good to help us out here?', '', 60003, 0, 16088, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Be you friend or foe?', '', 60002, 0, 16087, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t let Maikee know, but I kinda love him even if he is a grump.', 60001, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve lost count of the yaungol I\'ve killed. How many have you gotten, $n?', 60000, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bouncy, bouncy!', 59999, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once, I brained an opponent who was stunned to see that my pants had fallen down during battle. He wasn\'t looking where he should have been.', 59998, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing better than working up a sweat with a good fight!', 59997, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These yaungol thought the sha were scary until they met me!', 59996, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi, $n! Going to join me?', 59995, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you\'re ready for a bruising, $n.', '', 59994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you there, $n!', 59993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go get \'em, tiger!', 59992, 0, 16085, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those spearthrowers are still firing. Don\'t you like destroying stuff, $c?', 59991, 0, 16082, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, $c, over here!', 59990, 0, 16076, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:116982|h[Protective Frenzy]|h|r!', '', 59989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re lucky I haven\'t fought in a while, $p.', '', 59988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The $g hero : heroine; returns triumphant. How are you, $n?', '', 59987, 0, 16066, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The keg bombs are ready. $n, are you going to stop the yaungol?', '', 59986, 0, 16065, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our hearts are heavy with grief at the passing of master Zhen. Will you face Humongous to regain his honor, $n?', '', 59985, 0, 16064, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must seek out Shado-Master Zhen if you\'re to aid us here, $c.', '', 59984, 0, 16063, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh good, a $g hero : heroine; of the land. Come, let us speak, $c.', '', 59983, 0, 16062, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please rest while you are here, $n. I hope the Vale brings you much peace and happiness.', '', 59982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vale was once the seat of power of the great mogu empire. The time of the mogu reign was terrible, cruel, and bloody.', '', 59981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in to your anger!', '', 59980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29005, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick up those spears before they overload! Throw them back at him!', '', 59979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whirling death: TIGER WIND!', '', 59978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready?! TIGER WIND!', '', 59977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here it comes: TIGER WIND!', '', 59976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch my weapon: TIGER WIND!', '', 59975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Video of leaving the turtle and traveling to Orgrimmar via hot air balloon.', 'Video of leaving the turtle and traveling to Orgrimmar via hot air balloon.', 59974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Video of leaving the turtle and traveling to Stormwind via hot air balloon.', 'Video of leaving the turtle and traveling to Stormwind via hot air balloon.', 59973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not much, but I will lend you what little I have. May it help you in this final hour.', '', 59968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait. I got here as quickly as I could. I\'m not too late, I hope.', '', 59967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! Turn back and speak to Sinan at the bottom of the stairs. You should not face the Warlord\'s wrath alone!', '', 59966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, with the crane\'s powers, you can jump over the flames!', '', 59965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steer!', '', 59964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trolls... I thought they were but legend!', '', 59963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought. Until next time...', 'Well fought. Until next time...', 59962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'N-no...', 59961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The taste of defeat... so strange and unfamiliar. Thank you for keeping me humble.', '', 59960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... yes, I believe you will do. I will see you again shortly, $p.', '', 59959, 0, 16059, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impossible...', '', 59958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THAT\'S what I was looking for! You\'ve given me a reason to train again.', '', 59957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice moves. You keep reapin\' in those wins like grain, neighbor. I\'ll be rootin\' for you.', '', 59956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tukka-Tuk pretty sad about losing to wimpy $p. Tukka-Tuk gonna go look at horizon and think about life.', '', 59955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did... I don\'t... no, no NO! NOT AGAIN!', 59954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s been a while since I lost to a trainee. Thank you for the match.', 59953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father foresaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it.', '', 59952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice moves, sweetie. Maybe I\'ll see you again...', 59951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very interesting...', '', 59950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I lost to $p, twice in a row? I can\'t believe it.', 59949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... humbled.', '', 59948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, $p... we are now RIVALS. You haven\'t seen the last of me.', 59947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stand no chance.', 'You stand no chance.', 59946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My hated rival... so glad you came.', 59945, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha! Don\'t pull any punches!', '', 59944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me everything you have, $n.', '', 59943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the name of Chi-Ji, I smite you down!', '', 59942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<sigh>...Let\'s get this over with.', '', 59941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t rule me out be just \'cause I\'m a country boy! I got freakish strong arms, you know.', '', 59940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good idea! Let\'s ookin\' get it on!', '', 59939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just give up! It\'s hopeless! You\'ll never beat me!', 59938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not hold back on you, $n. Please, do me the same favor.', 59937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your winning streak ends here, $n. Today, you fall by my spear.', '', 59936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YAAAAAAAAHHHH!!!', 59935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize in advance for the beating you are about to suffer.', '', 59934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today is the day I defeat my rival!', 59933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for the beating of your life, weakling!', '', 59932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, my first fight!', 59931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here for a fight?', 'Are you here for a fight?', 59930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The path of the Red Crane is a path of failure. I have seen the truth!$b$bAll paths lead to despair! You have no hope! NONE OF YOU!!', 59929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a rare and auspicious day when I get to test my abilities.$b$bI think you are ready to fight me, $n. Let us find out if I am correct.', '', 59928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is me again. It is good to see you, $n.$b$bShall we begin?', '', 59927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve faced the best of our trainees, and defeated them all. Now let\'s see what you\'re really made of...', '', 59926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody can defeat me.$b$bI\'ve been on this island for weeks, fighting duels every day, and nobody\'s come close to winning.$b$bIs this the best Pandaria has to offer?', '', 59925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, neighbor.$b$bI heard a lot about you. You been winnin\' duels all over this here island. I suppose I\'m ready to give you a shot.', '', 59924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tukka-Tuk gonna punch you and pound you and kick you and scratch you and bite you and poke you and ook you and dook you and...', '', 59923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, rival.$b$bI\'ve been busy training.$b$bI hope you\'ve done the same.', 59922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thelonius has told me much about your skill in battle. I look forward to seeing it firsthand.', 59921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not find many jinyu here in the Cradle of Chi-Ji. In fact, I believe I may be the only one.$b$bIn general, my people shun Chi-Ji and his teachings. The crane dines on carp, after all.', '', 59920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, sweetie. You\'re lookin\' pretty good in all that fancy armor.$b$bSo you\'ve found the way of the Red Crane, too? Interested in a duel?', 59919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m very interested in seeing your fighting style, $c.', '', 59918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been training really hard! There\'s no way you can defeat me now, $n.', 59917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look forward to our melee. Of course, I plan to win.', '', 59916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fight!', 'Let\'s fight!', 59915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! You here to challenge me to a fight?', 59914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoulda never fed them goots.', '', 59913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope... nope... not good.', '', 59912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
