('The hozen fed my yaks to their pet yeti. This is most bad fortune.', '', 59787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many good fortunes to you. I am Brother Rabbitsfoot. I am a merchant, a traveller, and a big luckydo for grummles.$b$bIn times of peace, $p would do well to buy of my wares. But fortune has us meet this day.$b$bWe have much work to do together.', '', 59786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
