('I trust that you\'re planning to do something about that giant surge of anger that\'s erupting from the middle of the lake?!', '', 59750, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really wasn\'t built for this. I\'m a master orator and diplomat of the people. Are we quite done here yet?', '', 59749, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can speak for everyone when I say that you\'re a true hero of Kun-Lai Summit, not to mention Firebough Nook, $p!', '', 59748, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to give Shado-Master Chong a piece of my mind when I see him. The nerve of the Shado-Pan not coming to our aid!', '', 59747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kobai used to threaten us, that was all. Now... whatever mind he had, he\'s clearly lost.', '', 59746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of my people, dead. Maybe I should build a new manor in Binan Village?', '', 59745, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These yaungol never even bothered to say hello. They simply attacked! Serves them right being infested by those sha things!', '', 59744, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you working with the Shado-Pan? I can\'t believe they\'d let an outsider help them!', '', 59743, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh. Looks like I\'ve sprung a leak! The brew!!!', '', 59742, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, yeah, sure... who hasn\'t heard of Chen Stormstout? Though, I hear his keg\'s empty, if you know what I mean.', '', 59741, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s really nothing quite like a warm brew. Warms your bones and hits the spot. You can keep that cold stuff to yourself.', '', 59740, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father brewed Firebough Stout. His father did before him. I can\'t let the legacy die out.', '', 59739, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear that the yaungol busted through the gates up north. Wonder what happened to the Shado-Pan there?', '', 59738, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When we make it back to the Retreat, we can tap these and toast to life!', '', 59737, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How far must we go?', '', 59736, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These aren\'t as light as they look. Could we make haste?', '', 59735, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When these monsters came, the Shado-Pan got so serious... they kept saying, \"Sha\". What\'s that?', 59734, 0, 17839, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re... working for the Shado-Pan? I can\'t believe it!', 59733, 0, 17840, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, was it? There\'ll be a few extra gold for you if you can personally guarantee my safety.', '', 59732, 0, 17841, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, $g mister : ma\'am;..$B$BWill you get me out of here?', 59731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... why don\'t you \"escort\" me out of here.', 'Yes... why don\'t you \"escort\" me out of here.', 59730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no place for a bright, young $g man : lady; such as yourself.$B$BPerhaps you would like for me to escort you to safety, hmm?', 59729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...That\'s enough. Let\'s go.', '...That\'s enough. Let\'s go.', 59728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me to introduce myself - I am Ya Firebough, illustrious leader of this formerly maginificent hamlet.$B$BClearly, you are an upstanding citizen of the world.$B$BI wonder if I could trouble you to help me out of this rather sticky situation? I\'m certain that the Shado-Pan at the nearby retreat will be more than happy to recompense you for any inconvenience.', '', 59727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not leaving these behind. This is my family\'s legacy!', '', 59726, 0, 17842, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honey Badger doesn\'t give a sh*t!', 'Honey Badger doesn\'t give a sh*t!', 59723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tend to the wounded! This isn\'t over yet.', 59722, 0, 18358, 22, 65, 0, 0, 27506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold the line, sailors! Your brothers depend on you!', 59721, 0, 18357, 22, 65, 0, 0, 27505, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll cover this front. You keep my priests safe.', 59720, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 27503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand by your side, friend.  This battle is not yours alone.', '', 59719, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 28119, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like the way you think! Let\'s go!', '', 59718, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come quickly!  Wouldn\'t want to miss out on the fun, would ya?', '', 59717, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, friend! The fighting\'s this way!', '', 59716, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Way to go! You are a natural at this.', '', 59715, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel a violent |cFFFF0404|Hspell:116040|h[Epicenter]|h|r!', '', 59714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhhh! Come quietly. She\'s practicing.', '', 59712, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re departing so soon?  I am envious of your prowess, $c. Good luck to you.', '', 59711, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you\'re ready, $p. Jaomin Ro awaits you just over the bridge.', '', 59710, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The mogu broke through our defenses...$B$BTheir army of jade soldiers was too much for us to hold back.$B$BI stayed behind to take care of Che, but the others retreated to the city to make their last stand.', 59709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smelly wikkets!', '', 59708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have a firm grip - now JUMP!', 'You have a firm grip - now JUMP!', 59707, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get out of here.', 'Let\'s get out of here.', 59706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the heavens... I thought the secrets of Firebough Stout would die with me. Help me out of here, friend!', '', 59705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Niuzao, strength of the west, charges into battle!', '', 59704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yu\'Lon, guardian of the east, appears on the field of battle!', 'Yu\'Lon, guardian of the east, appears on the field of battle!', 59703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xuen, might of the north, answers the call of battle!', '', 59702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_05.blp:20|t |c00C3B7EA%s|r begins to petrify all players!', '', 59701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_02.blp:20|t |c00F19C88%s|r begins to petrify all players!', '', 59700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_03.blp:20|t |c0093F8D1%s|r begins to petrify all players!', '', 59699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_qirajicrystal_04.blp:20|t |c0091D0F8%s|r begins to petrify all players!', '', 59698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tassle sniffs the air.', '', 59697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll meet you at Kota Basecamp!', '', 59696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good fortune to you!', '', 59695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike at these barbarians with the full force of my rage!', '', 59694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hoptallus lets out a loud screech! The virmen are coming!', 'Hoptallus lets out a loud screech! The virmen are coming!', 59693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A challenger approaches.', '', 59692, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now all you have to do is wait! Most crops are ready the day after they start growing.$B$BAren\'t we lucky to have land in such a fruitful valley?', '', 59691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has captured a Mine Cart!', '', 59690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has captured a Mine Cart!', '', 59689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My crop is Growing... now what?', 'My crop is Growing... now what?', 59688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', '', 59687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 30 seconds!', '', 59686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 1 minute!', '', 59685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 2 minutes!', '', 59684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us.', 'Learn this spell well for it will burn the taint from all those who oppose us.', 59683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good. Channel the flames, feel them course through you.', 'Good. Channel the flames, feel them course through you.', 59682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear what those Tillers said about me being a citypaw?$B$BSure I grew up in Dawn\'s Blossom, but I visited my grandpa a few times. I know the difference between a carrot and a turnip! One\'s orange and one\'s white, after all!$B$BAfter Grandpa passed, he left the farm to me, so I\'m going to do my best for him! But how can I prove that to those Tillers?', '', 59681, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fire spirit is upset. It\'s dangerous to enter the shrine now...', '', 59680, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You do not fight alone! Unleash my storm upon these invaders!', 59679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is not on our side. Go as soon as you are able.', '', 59678, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. I would ask you to meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo.', '', 59677, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you are the champion I\'ve long been awaiting. You will be the one to find and reunite the elemental spirits so that we might speak to Shen-zin Su and heal our land.', '', 59676, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient wisdoms tell of speaking to Shen-zin Su through the voice of the four elemental spirits, but the spirits have fled our great temple and their powers are fading.', '', 59675, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shen-zin Su, the very land on which we stand, is in deep pain. Though I don\'t know the source, I can feel his ache within my own body.', '', 59674, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your first try! Now, take the flame to the top of the temple and burn the scroll that you find there.', '', 59672, 0, 18562, 1, 65, 0, 27795, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the grummles. We know all of the paths through the mountains.$b$bMost of all we bring supplies to the great wall in the east. The bastion of the Shado-Pan.$b$bThese are dark times though, and grummles face great dangers on our road.', '', 59671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! A luckydo comes to the great Grummle Bazaar eh? I smell good fortune in our meeting.$b$bI am called the Lucky Eightcoins. I am named for my best luckydo, the one that gives most pungent smelling fortune.', '', 59670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. What to make first? Incense? Campfire logs? Everburning candle?', '', 59669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I lend you the cold vengeance of the northern winds!', '', 59668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'YOU TOLD HER WHAT?!', 59667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did they leave yet?', '', 59666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I give up.  I can\'t get through to you cuddly bears.  $n, would you come over here and show these newbs how it\'s done?', 59665, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What I wouldn\'t give for a fresh corpse to cannibalize.  Oops, did I say that out loud?', 59664, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Talk around camp is that on the other side of the wall to the west, Townlong Steppes is crawling with bugs.  What do you think, $n?', 59663, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, have you been back to Orgrimmar?  What news?', 59662, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder how long we\'ll be here before the general gives us our marching orders.', 59661, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Going to be around for a while, $n?', 59660, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play dead! They\'ll get bored and go away.', '', 59659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t make them angry!', '', 59658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s heading right for us!', '', 59657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All hail $n, the mighty conqueror of the yaungol and champion of Easterly Rest!', 59656, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not in the face!', '', 59655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, well, well, look who\'s back!  Slumming, $n?', 59654, 0, 15860, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'News of your success has preceeded you.  Our ranks have swelled!  We\'re in better shape now than I\'d dared to hope for thanks to you, $n.', 59653, 0, 15859, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need those pandaren rescued.  If that doesn\'t happen soon, we\'re going to have a slew of defectors here going after their loved ones and getting themselves killed!', 59652, 0, 15858, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t hear that crazy troll yelling any longer.  Music to my ears!', 59651, 0, 15857, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why do I have the feeling that you\'ve got good news for me, $n?', 59650, 0, 15855, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I always hate the days that I have to go in to that cave looking for sprite needles.', '', 59649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... why isn\'t that troll dead yet?  He is the one reanimating all of those mogu, yes?', 59648, 0, 15856, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s the hold up?  You busy with something else?  Did that little creep, Rivett, ask you to do something for him?!', 59647, 0, 15854, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, $g you handsome devil : you sexy thing;, get over here.  We need to talk about some statues....', 59646, 0, 15853, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My boy! Just in time. We have more yaks to clean.', '', 59645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe we made it. Thank you stranger!', '', 59644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cleared the way. You should be good to go.', 'I cleared the way. You should be good to go.', 59643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you really think we are going to make it out of here alive?', '', 59642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Thunder King will rise again!', '', 59641, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 29642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your people are lost. Even as we speak, we mogu are overtaking your precious Vale.', '', 59640, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those who steal from the mogu will be punished.', '', 59639, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! I will finish you myself!', '', 59638, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits and elements of Pandaria, I call upon you! Destroy $p!', '', 59637, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been expecting you, $p!', '', 59636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our homes... destroyed... We did what we had to....', '', 59635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had figured out the fresco sooner. So much could have been avoided, $n.', '', 59634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nob nob nibble.', '', 59633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW! OW! OW!', '', 59632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the ook?!', '', 59631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Cart!', '', 59630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking to infiltrate the ruins, speak to Kun Autumnlight at the Guo Lai Ruin first.', '', 59629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that should put a damper on their plans. Good work, $n. I trust you can get back on your own.', '', 59628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes the most beautiful things are also the most deadly. Just look at me!', '', 59627, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Vale is peaceful. Too peaceful.', '', 59626, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s your report?', 59625, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When times are dark, it is best to turn on a light.', '', 59624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare they attack a caretaker of the Vale, so far behind our defensive lines!$B$BDo you see now why we need your help?$B$BThe Shao-Tien mogu have found a way to enter the Vale. Unchecked, they will bring unspeakable devastation to our tranquil home.', '', 59623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmph. Those mogu will have to try harder than that!$B$BThe Golden Lotus will defend the Vale... no matter the cost.$B$BThe secrets that we guard are much too precious... much too powerful... to allow into the hands of the Shao-Tien!', '', 59622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOOM!', '', 59621, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One...', '', 59620, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two...', '', 59619, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three...', '', 59618, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep fighting, pandaren! Cancel all retreat orders! Stoneplow hasn\'t fallen yet!', '', 59617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can do this, $p... but you cannot do this alone. You will need help from that mushan beast. Yes, I believe her name was Miss Fanny.', '', 59616, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep striking!', '', 59614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your martial arts training. Focus your energy... then STRIKE!', '', 59613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been swallowed by the Ik\'thik Colossus!', '', 59612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hope is not lost, $p.', '', 59611, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 29107, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go, Miss Fanny.', 'Let\'s go, Miss Fanny.', 59610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Miss Fanny looks at you expectantly. Her eye twinkles with anticipation.>$b$b<Miss Fanny\'s moment for glory has arrived.>', '', 59609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Miss Fanny shuffles uncomfortably. Either she\'s nervous about the nearby combat, or anxious to get into the fray herself.>', '', 59608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n. Wait... I see a scout approaching.', 59607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are needed back at the Golden Pagoda immediately!', '', 59606, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their main army has breached the north gate!', '', 59605, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone to arms! The mogu are attacking!', '', 59604, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I still have a luckydo. This is your last chance to surrender before bad fortune finds you.', '', 59603, 0, 15823, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did I ever do to you? Why so angry?', '', 59602, 0, 15823, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t throw me in the fire, hozen!', '', 59601, 0, 15823, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put me down!', '', 59600, 0, 15823, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! Over here!', '', 59599, 0, 15760, 0, 65, 0, 31900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Removing the spirit\'s illusion damages the hozen\'s fragile mind!', 'Removing the spirit\'s illusion damages the hozen\'s fragile mind!', 59598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not worthy of me. You! Come crush this insignificant flea!', '', 59597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, go speak to Guard Captain Oakenshield. Tell him we need reinforcements!', '', 59596, 0, 15820, 0, 65, 0, 31935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot fight like this forever.', '', 59595, 0, 15820, 274, 65, 0, 31934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve saved us!  Now we need to get out of here.', 'You\'ve saved us!  Now we need to get out of here.', 59594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings of the four winds upon you, stranger.', 'Blessings of the four winds upon you, stranger.', 59593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, $c, drive them out of Kun-Lai for good.', 'Please, $c, drive them out of Kun-Lai for good.', 59592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to find my family!', 'I need to find my family!', 59591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a whole bunch of them still in the caves.  They\'re getting ready to attack your people!', 'There\'s a whole bunch of them still in the caves.  They\'re getting ready to attack your people!', 59590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to try to get out of here now.  Thank you!', 'I\'m going to try to get out of here now.  Thank you!', 59589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Ragemesa leader is in the caves!', 'The Ragemesa leader is in the caves!', 59588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $c.  Thank you!', 'Thank you, $c.  Thank you!', 59587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, we\'ve got a master person-finder here, eh $p?  We\'re on it.', '', 59586, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gladly, my new friend. Our engineer is still in the wilds though - we\'ll need to rescue him first.', '', 59585, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to dislodge that ship, Korga.  If we help your crewmates, can you help us?', '', 59584, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Alliance? If the crashed ship is theirs, we need to contact them. Jojo, would you come with me?', 59583, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 27419, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did grummles ever do to you?', '', 59582, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why so angry?', '', 59581, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friends of grummles come soon. You will see!', '', 59580, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad fortune for you.', '', 59578, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, I beg you.', 'Please, I beg you.', 59577, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I just want to go home.', 'I just want to go home.', 59576, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did we ever do to you?', 'What did we ever do to you?', 59575, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', 'Over here!', 59574, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey you. Would you let me loose?', 'Hey you. Would you let me loose?', 59573, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silly wikkets. Walking for goat goats.', '', 59572, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 11, 0, 1, 2, 39653),
('Ookin wikkets gonna give up their nibs. One way or another.', '', 59571, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 11, 0, 1, 2, 39653),
('Wikkets gonna be munch munch food for Old Poot Poot.', '', 59570, 0, 15817, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 11, 0, 1, 2, 39653),
('If I don\'t get away from these beasts, they\'re going to kill me!', 'If I don\'t get away from these beasts, they\'re going to kill me!', 59569, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, would you get me out of here?', 'Please, would you get me out of here?', 59568, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha! Such a pitiful creature!', '', 59567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb me? Show your cowardly faces and kneel before me!', '', 59566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody help!', 'Somebody help!', 59565, 0, 15819, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Korga Strongmane, once prisoner of the Alliance, now free and woefully unarmed tauren. Good to meet you, pandaren.', '', 59555, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 28121, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never met them before in my life. Pandaren don\'t really come in any bad flavors though.', '', 59554, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s head out to the battlefield, Mudmug.', 'Let\'s head out to the battlefield, Mudmug.', 59553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not one for fightin\' much. Pickin\' up heavy stuff, sure... but my muscles get all weak an\' wobbly when it comes to hittin\' somethin\'.', '', 59552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s wait for the next wave.', '', 59551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop. Let them pass.', '', 59550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wait for you at the base of Ruins Rise.', '', 59549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Changed your mind? I\'ll wait for you at the entrance to Ruins Rise when you\'re ready.', '', 59548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give back my luckydo!', '', 59547, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help a grummle?', '', 59546, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Grummle in trouble.', '', 59545, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fault? I wasn\'t one who bought unclean yak.', '', 59544, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This your fault!', '', 59543, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many thanks for rescue!', '', 59542, 0, 15815, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_warlock_demonsoul.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:115297|h[Evict Soul]|h|r on |cFF006EFD$n|r!', '', 59541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stubborn weeds! They\'re a constant nuisance, creeping up in the soil and threatening to take over your land.$B$BBefore you can till that plot, you need to rip the weed out. There\'s no trick to it, really - just grab it and pull!$B$BIn the words of my grandpa, \"you just gotta be more ornery than the weed!\"', '', 59540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes virmen try to burrow up into the soil plots and live there, hoping vegetables will just rain down on them - I think they figure we just put \'em in the ground whole for some reason.$B$BSquatters, that\'s what Grandpa called them. You gotta put your foot down. Literally. Stomp the ground and root \'em out!', '', 59539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tangleweeds, eh? Nasty little devils. They run deep into the ground some fifteen yards or so - you gotta pull the entire length out if you wanna get rid of it.$B$BGrab the exposed end of the weed and just keep moving away until you see the other end come out. Nothin\' more to it than that.', '', 59538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Runty! Hah! Now that\'s a term I haven\'t heard in awhile!$B$BGrandpa used to call me that when I refused to get up and go somewhere. He\'d grab the nape of my neck and hoist me up \"like a runty turnip\" he would say.$B$BThese crops just need a helping hand getting vertical. Get a firm grip on them and lift.', '', 59537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wild?! Now that\'s a surprise! Grandpa used to tell stories about having to wrestle his wild crops into submission.$B$B\"Yoonie,\" he used to say, \"don\'t be afraid to slap your scallions around.\"$B$BI always thought he was just being gross.', '', 59536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smothered  crops have a weed budging in on them!$B$BYou deal with them just like you deal with a stubborn weed in a plot of soil - elbow grease! Grab that sucker and pull for all you\'re worth. It\'ll give eventually.', '', 59535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, sometimes veggies get to sprouting SO beautifully, they practically beg to be pilfered.$B$BGrandpa said a keen plainshawk could spot a prize pumpkin better than anyone at the market, and it\'d make for it quicker than a... err....$B$B\"Quicker than a hozen in heat.\"$B$BI guess you could say stuff like that back then?$B$BThe point is, you\'ll just have to defend alluring crops from critters!', '', 59534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I reckon I\'ll head back to Stoneplow and rest my dang arms.', '', 59533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it for me! No more beer to deliver.', '', 59532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wiggling, eh? Well, as Grandpa used to say: carrots don\'t dance!$B$BSomething is trying to pull the veggies right out from under us!$B$BI\'m afraid you\'ll have to kill whatever varmit\'s down there if you want the crop to have any peace. Heartbreaking, I know, but it\'s part of the job.', '', 59531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go deliver some dang BEER!', '', 59530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!$B$BNow that we have that Pulse Wave Emitter, though, it should be easy to get rid of them. Flip it on to shoo all those pests away in a humane fashion, without any pesticide!$B$BHey, does that mean our veggies count as organic?', '', 59529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrr-r-r-RRAHHH!', '', 59528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31030, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Infested crops are covered in bugs. Yech!$B$BGrandpa\'s bug sprayer is on the ground near the field - use it to give those critters a blast of what-for!', '', 59527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I deal with Stubborn weeds?', 'How do I deal with Stubborn weeds?', 59526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I deal with Occupied soil?', 'How do I deal with Occupied soil?', 59525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Maybe Pandaria will make a good home after all...', '', 59524, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 32458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have another question...', 'I have another question...', 59523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beer delivery, in the middle of a battlefield? Perhaps Pandaria will make a good home after all...', 59522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, Jojo!', '', 59521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First we get into a fight, and then someone brings us beer! Can today get any better?', '', 59519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh... beer. Just what my men needed. Thank you, $p.', '', 59518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beer\'s here! Drink up, boys!', '', 59517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step aside. I\'ve got the key right here.', '', 59516, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did they prop this door up against a boulder?  It won\'t budge!', '', 59515, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Parched crops just need water!$B$BThey should be easy to take care of now that we\'ve got that sprinkler! It should be on the ground just at the edge of the field.', '', 59514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me try.', '', 59513, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Parched crops just need water!$B$BYou can use the old rusty watering can my grandpa left here. I keep it right over there by that tree stump, just next to the field.', '', 59512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The gate is jammed.', 59511, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 27422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Tangled crops?', 'How do I care for Tangled crops?', 59510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Runty crops?', 'How do I care for Runty crops?', 59509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Wild crops?', 'How do I care for Wild crops?', 59508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Smothered crops?', 'How do I care for Smothered crops?', 59507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Alluring crops?', 'How do I care for Alluring crops?', 59506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Wiggling crops?', 'How do I care for Wiggling crops?', 59505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Infested crops?', 'How do I care for Infested crops?', 59504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I care for Parched crops?', 'How do I care for Parched crops?', 59503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course!$B$BWhat seems to be the problem?', '', 59502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoon, I need some farming advice.', 'Yoon, I need some farming advice.', 59501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never thought about where the food on my table came from before we started this farming business.$B$BThis experience has been enlightening, to say the least!', '', 59500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahem.$B$B\"I reckon there just ain\'t enough hours in the day!\"$B$BHow did that sound? Too forced? You think it would fly at the market?', '', 59499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are your thumbs turning green yet?$B$BMine look pretty much the same.', '', 59498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never imagined farming would involve so many... exotic odors.', '', 59497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $p!$B$BHow\'s it feel to be a full-fledged farmer?', '', 59496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wha...', 59495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this caravan on the road!', 'Let\'s get this caravan on the road!', 59494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
