('', 'Lilian\'s Soul fixates on $n!', 59467, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sacred Pools have been corrupted by dark energy, thanks to Garrosh Hellscream. Remnants of the sha still linger.', '', 59466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
