('The final step, we add heat! Smell that aroma!', '', 59310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next, we ferment the brew! Look out!', '', 59309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You again! Don\'t you see? I have made a name for myself at last: I have brewed perfection!', '', 59308, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 31999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The name of Stormstout will be sung once again throughout the hills!', '', 59307, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such harmony of flavor, such heady aroma! It is...the perfect brew!', '', 59306, 0, 0, 479, 65, 0, 28294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it...can it be???', '', 59305, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 28293, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, yes, yes...no, no, no no no! Yes! No! Peppers!', '', 59304, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too bitter! Just a drop of honey, and a cane of sugar, and maybe some corn? Yes, more corn!', '', 59303, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 28291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes yes yes! So close! Just a pinch of...oops...', '', 59302, 0, 0, 7, 65, 0, 28290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh! Help! What is that thing!? It doesn\'t matter, nothing will stop me now, not when I\'m so close! Maybe if I don\'t look at it...?', '', 59301, 0, 0, 430, 65, 0, 28289, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azure Serpent stirs in the distance!', '', 59300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Azure Serpent moves in to attack!', '', 59299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to me, serpent!  Together we will destroy these intruders.', '', 59298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me show you my power.', '', 59297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Instructor Chillheart\'s soul escapes to her phylactery. Destroy it!', 59296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A deadly wave of ice begins to sweep across the room!', 59295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s seems not to hear what her husband has said while her eyes attempt to keep up with the crazed movements of the wascally wirmen destroying her fields.', 59294, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s just looks at you.', 59293, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s cries softly thinking no one has noticed before drying her tears and standing resolute once more.', 59292, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s waves off her husband as she glares at the continuing unwelcome presence on the farmstead.', 59291, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Approach... your death awaits.', '', 59290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaklings... let me make room for our guests.', '', 59289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28322, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s sighs, clearly exasperated by the whole situation.', 59288, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shooting you a glance, %s frowns and spits.', 59287, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s doesn\'t seem impressed.', 59286, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s grunts noncommittally.', 59285, 0, 15696, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good work! Dealing with the Hozen will be easier than I had anticipated.', 59284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on now. You got more important things to do than to be visitin\' the likes of us. Still, while you\'re here, you see that wascally wirmen runnin\' wild out in the fields?', '', 59283, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, the most famous $r $c in all of Pandaria! Get over here and give ol\' Chow a hug!', '', 59282, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DEBUG ONLY] Attacking $n!', '[DEBUG ONLY] Attacking $n!', 59281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This here\'s a might embarrassing with them yaungol still infestin\' the farm. You gotta understand though... I ain\'t no fancy $c like you. These things take time for ordinary folk like us. Well, I could just let Uyen go beat \'em \'bout their heads. But I wouldn\'t want to get her started if you know what I mean.', '', 59280, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uyen, $n\'s back. We got any chow for $g him : her;. Heh, get it? Chow?', '', 59279, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You got any humdingers to tell us? I bet you just got all kinds of new stories \'bout your adventures and whatnot.', '', 59278, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, I know. We got the upper hand here now thanks to you, so we\'ll get them dang yaungol out of here soon. Just the same, if you feel like crackin\' a skull or two, you won\'t hear me complainin\'.', '', 59277, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doesn\'t feel like it\'s been that long since last we talked.', '', 59276, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookie here, ma, it\'s $n. We was just talkin\' \'bout you.', '', 59275, 0, 15703, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got \'em, $n! Here. Let\'s just get \'em over there into the pen nice as you please.', '', 59274, 0, 15702, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well now, look Ma. $n\'s back. Why ain\'t you got any of my yaks?', '', 59273, 0, 15701, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t seen fightin\' like that since, well, I guess I haven\'t ever seen fightin\' like that. You sure are a firecracker, $n.', '', 59272, 0, 15700, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it goin\' out there? You\'re gonna rescue my people, right?', '', 59271, 0, 15699, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, Uyen, it\'s a $c. You here to help, $g mister : miss; $c?', '', 59270, 0, 15698, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must never give in to despair.', '', 59269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me near the statue at the center of the temple grounds. We will speak there.', '', 59268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time for celebration - many followers of the Way still battle outside.', '', 59267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems hope has triumphed after all...', '', 59266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it!', '', 59265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s calling out more sha! Focus them down first, $p!', '', 59264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? What\'s happening...', '', 59263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get this lightning party started, Blanche.', 'Let\'s get this lightning party started, Blanche.', 59262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are moving out of the Verdant Belt. Your yak is about to break loose!', 'You are moving out of the Verdant Belt. Your yak is about to break loose!', 59261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p... he\'s succumbing to the sha...', '', 59260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gonna Ook all night!', '', 59259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on and get your Ook on!', '', 59258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get Ooking party started!', '', 59257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Crane! Are you okay?', '', 59256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There he is!', '', 59255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27578, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the dooker!', '', 59254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook! Oooook!!', '', 59253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You da new Ook!', '', 59252, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know what dat mean...', '', 59251, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take down Ook-Ook...', '', 59250, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auntie Stormstout...why is the brewery abandoned?', '', 59249, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are the other Stormstouts? Why are hozen all over the brewery?', '', 59248, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me, what has happened here?', '', 59247, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am not Zan - I am Chen Stormstout!', '', 59246, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very lucky day to travel friend! East wind brings much good fortune.', '', 59245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mountain is angry, stranger. Not good for travel now.', '', 59244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who dares disturb my eternal slumber?!', 'Who dares disturb my eternal slumber?!', 59243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Supplies are limited, but I accept only the best from the traders.', '', 59242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My shop is filled with many wonderous and hard to come by things. It would be wise to look, but not to touch.', '', 59241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy is a bit like magic, don\'t you think? With the change of a single ingredient a simple drought can either heal you, or kill you.', '', 59240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey neighbor, since you\'ve been such a good friend to me, from now on I\'m going to give you crop predictions for free. Absolutely no charge! Just come drink with me now and again, eh?', '', 59239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! A new customer! You are most welcome, friend!', 59238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come in out of the cold friend and make yourself comfortable!', 59237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There aren\'t many willing to brave the mountain pass anymore, friend. Nowadays, some would say you\'d have to be crazy to try.', 59236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We don\'t see very many new faces here anymore.', 59235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome Traveler! Help yourself to some ale.', 59234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Farmer Yoon is such a gentleman! He even said he liked the new furniture!', 59233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All\'s clear, $n. Don\'t let down your guard, though. Those virmen can tunnel faster than you can say \"Virmen a hole!\"', 59232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, neighbor. Your chickens seem very happy.', '', 59231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Not bad, not bad! If I do say so myself, your farm is running smoothly. Maybe one day you\'ll be as successful as Haohan Mudclaw!', '', 59230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This pond sure is nice, neighbor.', '', 59229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farmer Yoon is just a dear! I keep telling him what to do, and he goes on and does it!', 59228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to say, $n, your garden looks great! Of course, I have been weeding all day...', '', 59227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, neighbor! Your pigs be lookin\' mighty fine!', 59226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh... why, hello $n! Your farm is looking very pretty today.', 59225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey boss, your sheeps is lookin\' pretty good.', '', 59224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the best of friends will do.', '', 59223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I hire someone to help me on my farm?', 'Can I hire someone to help me on my farm?', 59221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh $n, as your best friend, I\'d really like to give you something. I thought your farm could use a little sprucing up, so I had some folks install some new furniture in your house. I hope you like it!', 59220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait a minute. I\'ve been thinking... you\'ve done so much for me, it\'s about time I gave you a little something in return. Where I\'m from, we grow beautiful orange trees. I planted one on your farm. From the way things grow around here, I wouldn\'t be surprised if it had already bloomed by the time you got back to your farm.', 59219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, you\'ve been a real nice friend to me for a while now. Now that we\'re neighbors, I\'m going to give you some of my chickens. Ain\'t too much, but they should liven up yer farm a bit. I\'ll send \'em over.', '', 59218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wasn\'t too sure \'bout you when you first came to the valley, but now I can proudly call you my neighbor. As a token of my friendship, I\'d like to give ye a big something for yer farm. She should be there already. Name\'s Miss Fifi, and she likes to eat turnips!', '', 59217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and me, we\'re proper neighbors now, not just in the geographical sense. You done so much for me, I think it\'s time I helped you out a bit. I called in a few favors and had them install your own postbox right on your farm. Now you can keep in touch with all your friends!', 59216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we\'re neighbors, I\'ve decided to give you the best gift a neighbor can just about give to anybody! I\'m going to give you one of my prized yaks! I\'ll swing on by later and leave \'er in your pen.', '', 59215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well now that you and me are neighbors, I can tell you the truth. It\'s just downright wrong not ta have a proper pig or two on your farm! I\'ll bring some by when yer not lookin\' and then blammo! You\'ll have pigs.', 59214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, wait just a minute... I... well... you\'ve been such a good friend and... I want to give you my favorite kitty, Luna! I don\'t want you to be lonely at your farm and...<sob>... just take good care of her, okay? I\'ll bring her by later.', 59213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey boss, me been thinkin\'. You been real good to Chee Chee, so I wanted to give you a sheep for your farm. It should be waiting already. You take good care of Chee Chee\'s sheeps, okay?', '', 59212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s about time you asked! I was wondering when Farmer Yoon would ever notice me. You go ahead, and I\'ll be there soon.', 59211, 0, 17633, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sunsong Ranch needs my help? Let me gather my equipment, and I\'ll meet you there.', 59210, 0, 17635, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I s\'pose the chickens won\'t mind if I visit fer a bit. I\'ll meet ya there later.', '', 59209, 0, 15674, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I could leave things to Mung-Mung for a while and take a gander at Yoon\'s. He does have the best soil in the entire valley! Let me just get my things in order, first.', '', 59208, 0, 15675, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Really? That whole pond, just for me? I\'ll be right there!', '', 59207, 0, 17631, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well all right, I s\'pose I could hop on over to the farm now and again. I\'m only doing this for you, y\'hear? And well... I s\'pose I have taken quite a shine to Mr. Yoon...', 59206, 0, 17632, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was wonderin\' when you would ask. Sure thing. Let me take care of some things and I\'ll be right on over.', '', 59205, 0, 15673, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always did say to help out a neighbor in need! I\'ve just gotta take care of some stuff, then I\'ll be there in a jiffy!', 59204, 0, 17636, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, I suppose I could help out for a bit! I\'ll meet you there in a bit.', 59203, 0, 17637, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, boss! Chee Chee got stuff to do, then he be there soon.', '', 59202, 0, 17634, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Tina, I hear Farmer Yoon needs some help at his farm. Would you... ?', 'Hey Tina, I hear Farmer Yoon needs some help at his farm. Would you... ?', 59201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Sho, take a break and come watch my farm for a while.', 'Hey Sho, take a break and come watch my farm for a while.', 59200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy Old Hillpaw. How\'d you like to keep me company at my farm?', 'Howdy Old Hillpaw. How\'d you like to keep me company at my farm?', 59199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Jogu, how\'d you like to move into the pond at Sunsong Ranch?', 'Hey Jogu, how\'d you like to move into the pond at Sunsong Ranch?', 59198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mr. Mudclaw, would you lend us a hand at Sunsong Ranch?', 'Mr. Mudclaw, would you lend us a hand at Sunsong Ranch?', 59197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gina, how\'d you like to help us run the farm?', 'Gina, how\'d you like to help us run the farm?', 59196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, Farmer Fung. Farmer Yoon and I really need you at our farm.', 'Howdy, Farmer Fung. Farmer Yoon and I really need you at our farm.', 59195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Fish, how\'d you like to be my partner at the farm?', 'Hey Fish, how\'d you like to be my partner at the farm?', 59194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi Ella, would you like to join me and Farmer Yoon at his farm?', 'Hi Ella, would you like to join me and Farmer Yoon at his farm?', 59193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Chee Chee, would you like to be my farm hand?', 'Hey Chee Chee, would you like to be my farm hand?', 59192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To serve upon his table.', '', 59190, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He often seeks a lordly dish...', '', 59189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis hard to decipher his true wish...', '', 59188, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When man asks favor of a fish...', '', 59187, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Tina Mudclaw?', 'How is my relationship with Tina Mudclaw?', 59186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Sho?', 'How is my relationship with Sho?', 59185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Old Hillpaw?', 'How is my relationship with Old Hillpaw?', 59184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Haohan Mudclaw?', 'How is my relationship with Haohan Mudclaw?', 59183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Jogu the Drunk?', 'How is my relationship with Jogu the Drunk?', 59182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my relationship with Gina Mudclaw?', 'How is my relationship with Gina Mudclaw?', 59181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
