('', 'I like things that come from nature.', 59063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife used to make a mean dish of braised turtle. The taste of that dish sure would bring back memories.', '', 59062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
