('I\'ll tell you one thing, $n. I like jade, but it\'s not my favorite. Everyone gives it to me, all the time!', '', 59058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I won\'t lie to you, $n. I\'m one of the most powerful men in the Valley. Most people send me gifts of great value.', '', 59057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, recently I\'ve had quite the craving for Fire Spirit Salmon.', 59056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh you know me. I\'m a humble girl, so I\'d only ask for rubies.$B$BWhat? It\'s not like I\'m asking for diamonds!', 59055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
