('', 'Oh you shouldn\'t! Oh, but I do love gifts, so maybe you should.', 59053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a silly question! I\'ll give you a hint. My favorite food has my name in it! Maybe more than once!', 59052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, I\'ve always like the color of jade. So green, just like the forest.', 59051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Being resourceful can often sway a battle in your favor.$b$bI\'ve put together this remedy using plants from the forest around us. Hopefully it will be enough. We need every available fighter in the field.', 59050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
