('Well you know the only thing that I admire as much as my own looks is a rare white flower that grows around these parts.$B$BIt\'s terribly hard to find, though.', '', 59047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
