('', 'A wise man does not rush into war. A wise man wins a war.', 59028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My friend, one of these days we should see who is stronger in battle - you, or me.', 59027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My friend, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts.', 59026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am studying the hozen\'s movements. When I find their weakness, I will strike.', 59025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not tell me what it is like to be a $c. Show me.', 59024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey buddy, you are making enough noise to scare off a pack of mushan beasts.', 59023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One gains little wisdom from speaking. One gains much wisdom from listening.', 59022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have seen you in these parts before. I can see that you are a $c, from the look of you.', 59021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet, $r. Please do not break my concentration.', 59020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only in silence will we hear the trees speaking.', 59019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no quarrel with you, stranger.', 59018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quiet, stranger. I need complete focus for the task at hand.', 59017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, $n? How are those chickens doing?$B$BMake sure to look around for their eggs. Those darned things hide them in the weirdest places!', '', 59016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, neighbor! Good to see ya! You come visit me any time, you hear?', '', 59015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, neighbor! Fields are lookin\' like a shiny new copper today.', '', 59014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, neighbor. Nice day today.', '', 59013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n, I been thinkin\' that your farm needs some chickens. What do you think?', '', 59012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye know, $n, I gotta admit I look forward to your visits now and again.', '', 59011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My good friend, you got any news for me today?', '', 59010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it\'s my good friend $n! Anything I can do fer ya?', '', 59009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, thanks for visiting today.', '', 59008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, friend. You ever tried a fresh egg from one o\' my chickens? Dee-licious, I tell ya.', '', 59007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy. I got two chickens gone missin\' last night. Bet it was them hozen that\'re behind it.', '', 59006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got three sick chickens and another two hens not layin\'. I got too many problems to listen to yours, citypaw.', '', 59005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friend, you sure do run your mouth when you get a chance. But it\'s kinda nice to hear somethin\' other than silence now and again.', '', 59004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, I\'m a little busy here. Ye got something ya need?', '', 59003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buddy, ye know... sometimes it\'s nice to see you around.', '', 59002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buddy, ye sure got a big mouth. Does it ever stop yappin\'?', '', 59001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy, I\'m busy here. Can\'t ye come back later?', '', 59000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A simple flesh wound won\'t keep me from the battle.', '', 58999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pah! I know I seen you around, but that don\'t make us friends. Go away!', '', 58998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do ye pester everyone this much? Sheesh.', '', 58997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Humph. I\'m busy, can\'t you see?', '', 58996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude. I should return back to training now.', '', 58995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! Leave an old man be!', '', 58994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU HAVE WON THE SCENARIO. HOORAY!', '', 58993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m busy? Got things I\'m working at, stranger.', '', 58992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ain\'t got time for no strangers. Now please leave me be.', '', 58991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, traveler. I think I can make it now.', '', 58990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, neighbor. Would you like a cold brew?', '', 58989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that we\'re neighbors, you have to tell me your farming secrets. Do you use fertilizer? Growth spray? Weedkiller? Tell me, already!', '', 58988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey neighbor, how is that mushan beast working out for you? She\'s quite a beauty, ain\'t she?', '', 58987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A long day in the fields makes a man thirsty, you know what I mean, good friend?', '', 58986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, good friends always share their farming secrets. Now tell me, how do you get your vegetables looking like that?', '', 58985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My good friend, you must know a thing or two about exterminating virmen.', '', 58984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, $n! Let us share a drink together.', '', 58983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, how\'s the soil looking today?', '', 58982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, you got any experience dealing with hozen or virmen?', '', 58981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, if it isn\'t my buddy $n! I\'ve just come from a long day in the fields.', '', 58980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buddy, did you know that every farmer worth his dirt is a member of the Tiller\'s Union?', '', 58979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey buddy, you got any experience dealing with hozen or virmen?', '', 58978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure the fields here are prosperous, but that\'s on account of hard, back-breaking work!', '', 58977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I am the head of the Tiller\'s Union. Why do you ask?', '', 58976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got trouble in the fields. Whether it\'s virmen or hozen, I tell ya, it ain\'t good.', '', 58975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The convoy to Kota Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!', '', 58974, 0, 15527, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How is Luna doing? She\'s such a sweet cat!', 58973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So I\'ve been sharing some of my brews around town, and everyone is raving! I can hardly believe it!', 58972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, neighbor! The turnips are looking mighty fine this morning.', 58971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How many cats do I have?$B$BOh, ummm... I think I may have lost track...', 58970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been experimenting with all sorts of brews in my spare time.$B$BWith the Stormstout brewery right across the way, I can\'t help but get inspired sometimes.$B$BOh, but these aren\'t anywhere as good as what they make over there.', 58969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, good friend. Oh, is it okay if I call you my good friend?', 58968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cats keep me company. It\'s been quite lonesome on the farm since my parents passed...$B$BOh no, I didn\'t mean to tell you so much.', 58967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you know that turnips make quite a tasty brew?', 58966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, friend! Isn\'t it a lovely day?', 58965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t have that many cats, right? I mean, it\'s quite reasonable when you think about it.', 58964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I grow turnips at my family farm. Oh... I don\'t know if you wanted to know that...', 58963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, $n. How are you today?', 58962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you like kitties? I love them!$B$B<Ella looks surprised at her sudden outburst and smiles shyly.>', 58961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you like... turnips?$B$B<Ella turns pink and shakes her head.>', 58960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Hi! Um... I should probably... go...$B$B<Ella blushes as her voice lowers to a whisper.>', 58959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give only nice sheep for you, neighbor! What do you think?', '', 58958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neighbor, because of you, my problems is less somewhat.', '', 58957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey neighbor! You like the sheep?', '', 58956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee raise only sheep in the fields!$B$BAnyone want sheep, they come to Chee Chee.', '', 58955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good friend, is things going good for you?', '', 58954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My good friend! You drink with Chee Chee sometime, yes?', '', 58953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee is only hozen with own farm!$B$B<Chee Chee thumps his chest proudly.>$B$BYou, friend, come visit me at my farm sometime, okay?', '', 58952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend, how is things going on your farm?', '', 58951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey friend. I got problems, but no need to be your problems, too.', '', 58950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee work hard for farm. Buddy understand, right?', '', 58949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems. Buddy help Chee Chee?', '', 58948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey. You are Chee Chee\'s buddy, yes?', '', 58947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee work hard for farm. Now bad monkeys come take away!', '', 58946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee got big problem. Big, big problems.', '', 58945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo, I know you before. You help me, yes?', '', 58944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chee Chee\'s sheep sheep are so scared... bad monkeys on hill! Bad monkey!', '', 58943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Chee Chee real busy. You got some-ting you want?', '', 58942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You new here?', '', 58941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey neighbor! How\'re those pigs doin\' at yer farm? I bet they\'re mighty happy!', 58940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, my good friend! Now why my mama and papa didn\'t name me Pig, I jus\' don\'t know.', 58939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, friend! You gone down and seen my pigs yet?', 58938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey buddy! The pigs are doin\' jus\' fine today!', 58937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I take care o\' the pigs \'round here.', 58936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always told me that neighbors are worth more than earth. Now that\'s sayin\' something!$B$BThat\'s why yer my neighbor, $n!', 58935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey neighbor, what\'re we talkin\' bout anyway? Ain\'t nothing in a name!$B$BLike my papa always said, ye\'d still eat a pink melon if it were called an onion, right?', 58934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So the cave\'s a crashing down, and Old Man Thistle and Bobo run as fast as they can! They twist and turn through the caves, til they burst outta the ground right up that hill!$B$BAnd what happened then but the cave closed up right behind \'em, like it got swallowed by the earth.$B$BOld Man Thistle\'s shaking, but first thing he does when he gets home is make a map to that cave full o\' treasure. Cuz maybe it\'s still there, true?$B$BGood thing he did, cuz the next day, he couldn\'t remember as well, and the day after that he remembered even less, till he plumb forgot \'bout that cave altogether.', 58933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, neighbor! I love stories so much, I just wanna hear \'em all!$B$BBut ya know, I think we\'ve made some good stories together too, dontcha think?', 58932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, neighbor! Whatcha doin\' today?', 58931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always told me that good friends are worth more than a chipper carrot. That\'s why yer my good friend, $n!', 58930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yeh know my good friend, I seen a lot o\' funny names in my time. Fish really ain\'t that strange. No, it\'s downright normal!', 58929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So Old Man Thistle\'s stuck down the cave, so what does he do but whistle fer his trusty mushan, Bobo!$B$BAnd right fore long, he hears a boomin\' noise, and Bobo busts a hole right in that cave!$B$BThat mushan done hear his master and come fer him!$B$BAnd then, what happens but the whole cave starts a shakin\' and the ceiling starts crashing down.$B$BSo Old Man Thistle jumps on Bobo\'s back and you know what happened\' then?', 58928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, my good friend! Tell me again that story \'bout that scary dragon, Deathwing!', 58927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Buck-Bucka Betty!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Buck-Bucka Betty!', 58926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Stumbleflutter!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Stumbleflutter!', 58925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, $n!', 58924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Egga!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Egga!', 58923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Rumblefeather!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Rumblefeather!', 58922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always told me that friends are worth more than sweet turnips. That\'s why yer my friend, $n!', 58921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Mantidsbane!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Mantidsbane!', 58920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Thunderpeck!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Thunderpeck!', 58919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Madam Specklybottom!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Madam Specklybottom!', 58918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that we\'re friends, you can call me Fish.$B$BHa ha! I\'m so funny!$B$BI\'m jus\' kidding... everyone calls me Fish! That\'s cuz everyone\'s my friend!', 58917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Mother Clucks!', 'Old Hillpaw\'s prize-winning chicken, Mother Clucks!', 58916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Marmot Disguised in Chicken Feathers! Expose him for the sham he really is!', 'A Marmot Disguised in Chicken Feathers! Expose him for the sham he really is!', 58915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Wild Prairie Chicken! Kick him out of here!', 'A Wild Prairie Chicken! Kick him out of here!', 58914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An Amorous Rooster! Dip him in the water to cool his passions.', 'An Amorous Rooster! Dip him in the water to cool his passions.', 58913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Lost Hen! Bring her back to a chicken coop.', 'A Lost Hen! Bring her back to a chicken coop.', 58912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Old Man Thistle found a cave full o\' TREASURE!!!!$B$BThere was gold \'n diamonds \'n jade \'n statues \'n a whole room full o\' books!$B$BWell he wandered \'round that cave \'n before long a whole day had passed \'n he was gettin\' mighty hungry.$B$BSo he heads back toward the way he came and what happened but he couldn\'t find no way back out agin\'!', 58911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You found...', 'You found...', 58910, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, friend! Tell me again that story \'bout the world tree and the... whatcha callit... the sunderin\'!', 58909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey friend! Mighty nice seein\' you again.', 58908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always told me to make friends \'stead o\' enemies. That\'s why ye\'re my buddy!', 58907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whaddaya mean Fish is a weird name, too? It ain\'t weird at all, buddy! I was named after dem fishes in the lake!$B$BNow just now what\'s a \"$n,\" eh? I ask ya that!', 58906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Old Man Thistle owned a little plot o\' land just o\'er there on that hill.$B$BNow one day he was diggin\' and diggin\', and he dug so far down he didn\'t do but found a whole cave underneath these them hills!$B$BAnd what do you suppose he found in that cave?', 58905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, buddy! I loved that story \'bout that orc Thrall. You got any others to share?', 58904, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, buddy! I loved that story \'bout that boy Arthas. You got any others to share?', 58903, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey buddy! Mighty nice seein\' you again.', 58902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My papa always told me that fish swim \'n birds fly. Now if I can swim AND fly, what does that make me?', 58901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Folk \'round here are mighty good... if you stick \'round long enough to find out.', 58900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
