('Hey, hey! No need to get physical! Fine, I\'ll pay... but don\'t expect me to be happy about it.', '', 58764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Threaten him with violence.> Do you want to get punched in the mouth?', '<Threaten him with violence.> Do you want to get punched in the mouth?', 58763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We took your land and now we take your food.', '', 58762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pandaren are weak.', '', 58761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My debt? I owe that girl nothing.$b$bI\'m pretty sure she... GAVE me those spices. I saw her wink at me. This sort of thing happens often when you\'re as handsome as I am.$b$bAre you still here? Scurry off, little $r.', '', 58760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I hit harder!', '', 58759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gina? That girl down in the marketplace? Hah!$b$bTell that pretty little thing to come collect the money personally. I\'m sure she and I can come to some sort of... agreement.', '', 58758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Absolutely. I have her payment right here. And send her my... regards.', '', 58757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop slacking off!', '', 58756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello! I\'m here on behalf of Gina Mudclaw, regarding your debt.', 'Hello! I\'m here on behalf of Gina Mudclaw, regarding your debt.', 58755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step inside, step inside! Is there anything I can get for you today?', '', 58754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help you, $c?', '', 58753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, welcome. Are you here to buy spices? Strange, rare, exotic spices?$b$bYou\'ve come to the right place... neighbor.', '', 58752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster!', '', 58751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, finally! This is my absolute dream! Yes, Mr. Mudclaw! Of course I\'ll join you!', '', 58750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, it\'s true! Thanks to $n, the Kunzen\'s leader is dead. Those monkeys shouldn\'t bother Mr. Mudclaw any more.', '', 58749, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoon, $n, it\'s an honor to have you join us.', '', 58748, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, this last spot\'s for you and Farmer Yoon. Why don\'t you do the honors?', '', 58747, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve more\'n earned my vote.', '', 58746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My farm was in real trouble because of those hozen, but it\'s saved thanks to you.', '', 58745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know I\'m a stubborn old paw of the earth, but even I have to admit you\'ve done me a great deed.', '', 58744, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know Yoon, maybe I was wrong about you.', '', 58743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I\'ll be a hozen\'s uncle...', '', 58742, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice job, Yoonie!', '', 58741, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that nasty Chief Yip Yip dead?', '', 58740, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!', '', 58739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho, Yoon! Is it true? Did your plan work?', '', 58738, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This may be a bit unsettling...', '', 58737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you put in that juju?', '', 58736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ughhh...bad juju make me sick!', '', 58735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something bad in that juju...', '', 58734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ughhhh...boss don\'t feel so good...', '', 58733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fresh fruit for me?', '', 58732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pretty juju? Me want to eat!', '', 58731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that? A sweet juju?', '', 58730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grummles en route for Neverrest Basecamp gather round for the lighting of the traditional travel incense.', '', 58729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chief Yip-Yip is about to charge forward! Throw a melon now!', '', 58728, 0, 15532, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[PLACEHOLDER] Teleport me to the Scenario', '[PLACEHOLDER] Teleport me to the Scenario', 58727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh, delicious juju!', '', 58726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what you\'ve got.', 'Let\'s see what you\'ve got.', 58725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Training is an ongoing process. There is always something to learn.', '', 58724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must be in top fighting condition when we face the Hozen in battle.', '', 58723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you test my skills?', '', 58722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be better prepared next time we meet!', '', 58721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One can only grow from their defeats.', '', 58720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have shown me I must remain diligent in my training.', '', 58719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been an honor to train with you.', '', 58718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Happy travels, $r!$B$BThe weather may look nice now, but the skies over the Jade Forest can darken quickly with squalls. Can you feel the air changing? Perhaps you\'d like to help me brew some of my legendary Boomer Brew?', 58717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp on marmots! Avoid insect swarms!', 'Stomp on marmots! Avoid insect swarms!', 58716, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scans the sky pensively, clicking her tongue. She sniffs the air and furrows her brow.', '', 58715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The barometer is falling fast. Time to start hauling gear!', 58714, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s tinkers with her weather instrumentation, a gleam in her eyes.', '', 58713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s licks her finger and holds it up. She sniffs the air, her eyes scanning the sky.', 58712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll start gettin\' her prepped for ye to return.', '', 58711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The convoy to Neverest Basecamp is leaving now! Gather around!', '', 58710, 0, 15527, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get \'em with my pesticide!', '', 58709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need healing!', '', 58708, 0, 15527, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A vicious guard dog appears!', 'A vicious guard dog appears!', 58707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Get sprayed!', '', 58706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here, dookers!', '', 58705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay back, you ookin\' bugs!', '', 58704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gonna get a mouth full of pesticide!', '', 58703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away from my crops!', '', 58702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it all, stingy bugs!', '', 58701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These ballistas are just the advantage we needed! Now if we can just get the other one up and runnin\' we\'ll really be in business.', '', 58700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid insect swarms!', 'Avoid insect swarms!', 58699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Click on marmots to stomp them!', 'Click on marmots to stomp them!', 58698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mook-mooks?', 'Mook-mooks?', 58697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the mook-mooks went away. For now. You should go talk to boss Mudclaw.', '', 58696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh, stingin\' bugs! Don\'t let them get near you! They bite!', '', 58695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More mook-mooks! Look out!', '', 58694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! There\'s a mook-mook right there!', '', 58693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You here to stomp on the mook-mooks?', '', 58692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wika-Wika just trying to start a farm. Didn\'t know it would be this hard.', '', 58691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dog gives your face a sloppy wet lick.', '', 58690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dog loves you too!', '', 58689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dog pushes its head under your hand.', '', 58688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dog tilts its head, as if wondering what you\'re thinking.', '', 58687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dog wags its tail happily.', '', 58686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your dog smiles at you.', '', 58685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no! Do not fail me!', '', 58684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their energy is strong!', '', 58683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Serpent, charge me with your power!', '', 58682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dog wags its tail happily. It heads toward your farm!', '', 58681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woof!', '', 58680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good fortune to friend of grummles. Many thanks for aid!', '', 58679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dog raises its head to look at you, and wags its tail weakly.>', '', 58678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dog\'s fur is matted with dirt. Its breathing is shallow.>', '', 58677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dog\'s ribs are poking out of its sides. It looks at you with pitiful eyes.>', '', 58676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems that after only a few days of study, Anduin already understands the Way of the Crane.$B$BPerhaps he always has?', '', 58675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got a green thumb and a steel thumb. My pappy taught me how to fix just \'bout anything.', 58674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, here\'s the deal. You keep yammerin\' and I stop hammerin\'.', 58673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well this wagon ain\'t gonna fix itself.', 58672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are all you citypaws this impatient?', 58671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll collect my tools and meet you at Farmer Yoon\'s. Bet I can beat you there!', 58670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My pappy must\'ve told me the story a hunnert times!$B$BBack during the great drought, times sure were hard. Farmers were spitting on their crops to water \'em, it was so dry. The entire town was starvin\' o\' thirst!$B$BSo what does Farmer Yoon\'s grandpappy do but pack up his wagon in the middle o\' the night.$B$BThen he drives his mushan beast all the way to the lake at the base o\' Kun-Lai Summit. He loads up that wagon with a hunnert barrels o\' fresh water, then drives right on back.$B$BHe didn\'t stop fer nuthin\'! How could he? Our whole town was dyin\'! He drove that busted wagon up to his farm and his mushan died on the spot!$B$BBut we had enough water for the entire town and the spring harvest, too.$B$BSaved Halfhill, Yoon\'s grandpappy did!', 58669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me the story about Farmer Yoon\'s wagon.', 'Tell me the story about Farmer Yoon\'s wagon.', 58668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Howdy, stranger!', 58667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It all makes sense! All the strange things that have been happening on our farms. The hozen must have been behind it all! I must admit, you figured it out pretty quickly, $n.', '', 58666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A startled hozen leaps out of a nearby bush!', '', 58665, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Footprints lead toward the mountain to the north.', '', 58664, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next to signs of a scuffle is a sharp, pointy spearhead and some colorful feathers.', '', 58663, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behind the print is the long impression of a prehensile tail.', '', 58662, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stamped into the footprint is a clod of mud mixed with hay and yak hair.', '', 58661, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The muddy track clearly shows a dexterous paw.', '', 58660, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next to this track, you see some bits of chewed up carrot.', '', 58659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This footprint is too muddy to be useful.', '', 58658, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello friend!  You\'re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns.', '', 58657, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Kun-Lai was ours....', '', 58656, 0, 15489, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any gooseberries for sale?', 'Do you have any gooseberries for sale?', 58655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ur-bataar will kill you!', '', 58654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', '', 58653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire bad!', '', 58652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ur-Bataar, help!', '', 58651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The banner!', '', 58650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no!', '', 58649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The banner\'s on fire!', '', 58648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put it out!', '', 58647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, that\'s some powerful stuff. I\'ve got the runs... er... got to run!', 'Wow, that\'s some powerful stuff. I\'ve got the runs... er... got to run!', 58646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! I feel something rumbling. Excuse me!', 'Oh! I feel something rumbling. Excuse me!', 58645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh...! I feel the call of nature!', 'Uh-oh...! I feel the call of nature!', 58644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great gourds! Sorry, but I need to leave!', 'Great gourds! Sorry, but I need to leave!', 58643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Uh... I gotta... go!', 'Whoa! Uh... I gotta... go!', 58642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits can finally rest, thanks to you. Soon I, too, will return to the other side.$B$BI leave you with this piece of advice: Pandaria is a land of history. If ever you are unsure about the future, you need only to seek answers from the past.$B$BRemember this, and you will thrive here.', '', 58641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be waiting at the Tan-Chao. Come and speak to me there.', '', 58640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s finally over...', '', 58639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cinematic will happen here...', '', 58638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gone to Halfhill Market. Don\'t touch my vegetables!\n\n- Farmer Fung', '', 58637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This field will look as good as new in no time!', '', 58636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a little more, and it will be finished.', '', 58635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weed whacking is hard work.', '', 58634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sooner I\'m left alone, the faster the work will be finished.', '', 58633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience, now. It will be done soon.', '', 58632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool! I will crush you!', '', 58631, 0, 15489, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeating the Lingering Doubts will take a level head and steady emotions, $c. With them under control the rebuilding process can begin.', '', 58630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go on ahead. I\'ll gather my tools and meet you at Sunsong Ranch.', '', 58629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mistakes are simply lessons we have yet to learn, $n. It is how you handle those mistakes that will ultimately define you.', '', 58628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you have the courage to die bravely, human. I\'m in the mood for a good fight.', '', 58627, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren are a wise enough people. Sooner or later, they will side with the Horde.', '', 58626, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you escaped me in Vashj\'ir. You won\'t be so lucky here.', '', 58625, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind shall never build a foothold here. This is destined to be Horde land.', '', 58624, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My axe will soon feast upon your blood, human.', '', 58623, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon, you and your Alliance will only be found in Azeroth\'s history books.', '', 58622, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin, find my axe! I\'ll separate this fool human\'s head from his neck!', '', 58621, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As soon as I... can get up, I\'m going to crush you!', '', 58620, 0, 15498, 0, 65, 0, 29184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here!', '', 58619, 0, 15497, 0, 65, 0, 29183, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the peaceful, kind people of this land. They were born to belong to the Alliance.', '', 58618, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll wait until you\'re healed to finish you, Nazgrim. Let it not be said that the Alliance has no honor.', '', 58617, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kun-Lai Summit is where you\'re going to die, orc. I\'m going to bury you.', '', 58616, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only three Horde rats left. Shouldn\'t be a problem to finish you off once and for all.', '', 58615, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many innocents have died at your hand, orc? Your Horde has no honor...', '', 58614, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These people shall not be enslaved by your cruel Horde. I will not allow it!', '', 58613, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I grow weary of these Horde cowards. There must be someplace else in this village to rest.', '', 58612, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must gain a foothold here.. away from these Horde dogs.', '', 58611, 0, 15496, 0, 65, 0, 32444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here.', '', 58610, 0, 15495, 0, 65, 0, 32443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got backup. Watch this.', 58609, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 31180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, fresh meat for the dogs.', '', 58608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, kid! You all right?\n\nI\'ve got you. Don\'t go into the light!', '', 58605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go get \'em, kid.', '', 58604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What kind of gifts do you like?', 'What kind of gifts do you like?', 58603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ain\'t much to it!$B$BThere are five rare treasures that you can find in the Dark Soil around Pandaria: Ruby Shards, Lovely Apples, Jade Cats, Blue Feathers, and Marsh Lilies.$B$BAs long as you have one of those items in your bags, you\'ll see who around here is willing to accept them.$B$BFind one of those and give them to someone you like, and chances are they\'ll like you a little back! Everyone has a favorite item out of the five, so talk to folks to learn what they prefer.$B$BAlso, the folks \'round here love food! I mean, who doesn\'t? If you know how to cook, you might just profit!$B$BThat\'s about all I know about gifts. Good luck!', 58602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... will not defeat... the thunder...', '', 58601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are MINE!', '', 58600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will have your unruly spirit, like all the others!', '', 58599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how strong you are without your slicky friends!', '', 58598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay down, stupid slickies!', '', 58597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak slickies are good for nuthin\'!', '', 58596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bleed... haha... but I won\'t die!', '', 58592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAHH!!', '', 58591, 0, 15488, 1, 64, 0, 27729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sully! Little Lu! Anyone!', '', 58590, 0, 15488, 1, 64, 0, 27728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here!', '', 58589, 0, 15488, 1, 64, 0, 27727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', '', 58588, 0, 15488, 1, 64, 0, 27726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello there! I\'m Weng: pupil of nature!$B$BI\'ve been sent to investigate the recent wood sprite problems.$B$BI\'ve always been fascinated with wood sprites, even as a child. They\'re not normally violent, you know.$B$BPlayful, maybe, but rarely do they mean any real harm.', '', 58587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dang nibblers are tearin\' the place down in there!', 'Dang nibblers are tearin\' the place down in there!', 58586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yaungol must be attacking because of the stranger!', 'The yaungol must be attacking because of the stranger!', 58585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did we ever do to the yaungol?!', 'What did we ever do to the yaungol?!', 58584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our warriors are losing!', 'Our warriors are losing!', 58583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bramblestaff, do something!', 'Bramblestaff, do something!', 58582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody save us!', 'Somebody save us!', 58581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to die!', 'We\'re going to die!', 58580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yaungol are attacking!', 'The yaungol are attacking!', 58579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think that was bad? You shoulda been here, oh, thirty years ago, I\'d say.$B$BOne o\' the boys left his lunch out - some kind of fish stew, if mem\'ry serves.$B$BWell he leaves it out in the atrium - BIG ol\' pot o\' fish stew, I\'m sure of it now - and, cub\'s honor, every hozen within a hundred miles come a-runnin\'.$B$BAfter cleanin\' THAT up, I\'ll take some overgrown nibblers any day...', '', 58578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me none.$B$BHNNGGHHH!!$B$BI\'ll be fine, really.', '', 58577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The quarry will be fine thanks to you.$B$BThink I\'ll let some o\' the boys take a little vacation...$B$BHAH! Who am I kiddin\'? I almost said that with a straight face, too.$B$BWe got WORK to do!', 58576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Normally we\'d be more than capable of fulfilling Cho\'s request. Jade veins run through this land like...$B$B<Mann scratches her head for a moment in thought.>$B$BWell, like something that runs through something else in veins. $B$BLook, I ain\'t a poet.$B$BPoint is: we got problems.', 58575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a look, $p. This panel clearly depicts war.$B$BWhat could be next? What is it trying to say?', '', 58574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is fascinating... but what could it mean?!$B$BThe jade you gathered from those sprites will help us fill in the next panel, but we\'ll need more to finish the whole fresco.$B$BPlease help the foreman get her quarry back in operation.', '', 58573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, stranger, I\'ll tell you the same thing I told the honorable Lorewalker...$B$B<Mann leans in closer with each word, her eyes widening.>$B$BI. Have. No. Jade!', 58572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you again, $p.$B$BThis place is ancient. There are answers here, for those who know the questions.', '', 58571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will be the bomb.', '', 58570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much of your time is spent inflicting your anger on others? How can you possibly hope to defeat us?', '', 58569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! I WILL POSSESS YOU AND ALL OF YOUR KIND!', '', 58568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you care what we do to these fish heads?', '', 58567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
