('We are legion. We are everywhere. See you back at Jinyu Mere, $p.', '', 58561, 0, 15398, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re nothing but backwater peasants with sticks! Get back in line!', '', 58560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you speak to me like that! Know your place!', '', 58559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will teach you to obey!', '', 58558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent cubs! Submit or die!', '', 58557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you\'ll make a fine rock-breaker I think!', '', 58556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n could probably wipe out all of these tainted jinyu with one of $g his : her; signature $c moves.', '', 58555, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n!', '', 58554, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $n, what do you think of this move?', '', 58553, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks again for handling my chores. See you back at the village soon?', '', 58552, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you come from, $n? When you go back, can I come?', '', 58551, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I want to be a $c, swordmistress.', '', 58550, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, can I come and train with you after we\'re done here?', '', 58549, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, it\'s $n!', '', 58548, 0, 15476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s grunts her admiration.', 58547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! You really did it! Maybe you can show me some of your moves, $n?', '', 58546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Masterfully done, $n.', '', 58545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah!', '', 58544, 0, 15472, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the mask for?', '', 58543, 0, 15465, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it done, $n? We saw the explosion from all the way over here.', '', 58542, 0, 15472, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p, if the scouts give you any information on the mogu leader, you know what to do.', 58541, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would DESTROY them. It is worthless to stay here!', 58540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take your time, $n. Better that you face the Fury Leviathan prepared and on your terms.', '', 58539, 0, 15471, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Betrayed! We came here every week. They seemed to be simple traders. \n\nNow these... fish-men greet us with one webbed hand, all the while with the other behind their back, holding their knives, waiting for us to turn around so they can plunge them in!', 58538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m still amazed that I ever joined the Shado-Pan to be honest. Not that they\'re not an amazing bunch and all, just the thought of the violence clashing with my impecible complection.$B$BI never have trouble remembering why I joined them though... let\'s just say Anji can be very convincing.', '', 58537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. You just saved my hide!', '', 58536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How fare your efforts to remove the taint of the sha from the jinyu, $c?', '', 58535, 0, 15466, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, $n!', '', 58534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$C, I would ask something of you.', 58533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The $c returns. Is that my mask I spy?', '', 58532, 0, 15465, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My house is just to the right as you enter the village. The mask should be upstairs.', '', 58531, 0, 15463, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bones! You wretch!', '', 58530, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?!', '', 58529, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave me...to die...alone...please...', 58528, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'DIE, NECROMANCER!', 58527, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How intriguing, her spirit will not relinquish its grasp on this world.', '', 58526, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger! A moment of your time if you please?', '', 58525, 0, 15462, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How does it feel, Voss?  To watch them hack your mortal body to pieces?', '', 58524, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why let a perfectly good corpse go to waste?', '', 58523, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...', 58522, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give \'em hell, $n!', 58521, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a real honor, $n. Maybe we can have a sitdown soon and you can regale me with your latest exploits?', 58520, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Careful with those shots. Don\'t hit $n!', 58519, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You figure out yet what\'s driving all of these yaungol out of the Townlong Wastes?', 58518, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t I owe you a drink, $g handsome : lady;?', 58517, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t mind us. We\'re just mopping up the last of them now. Shouldn\'t be much longer.', 58516, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you again, $n. Feel like taking another swing at these yaungol pests?', 58515, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hail the hero of Kun-Lai Pass, $n!', 58514, 0, 15460, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, Lilian, it is time for your transformation.', '', 58513, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you going to find them? Can you really?', '', 58512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The farmer stares at the floor with a distant look in his eyes.>$B$BThey... took them.$B$BTook them away...', '', 58511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looks like you got more than enough. Quick, $n, I think I can see the yaungol reinforcements massing on the horizon.', 58510, 0, 15459, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My plan hinges on you bringing us as many arrows as you can from the battlefield, $c.', 58509, 0, 15458, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A foreigner? And by the look of you, a seasoned $c. Good! Maybe you can get us out of this mess.', 58508, 0, 15457, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something isn\'t right...', 'Something isn\'t right...', 58507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What am I missing...', 'What am I missing...', 58506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel her will breaking! Her soul burns so brightly.', '', 58505, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a luckydo to have a clean yak. It is a bigger luckydo to feed it my special brew. This is how one makes Kobeyaks!', '', 58504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was just thinking about you, $n.', 58503, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With all of the adventuring you do, what you need is a good rest, young $g man : lady;.', 58502, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Going to be around long, $n? You\'ll have to tell me about your latest exploits.', 58501, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There $g he : she; is. You\'re welcome here anytime, $n.', 58500, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are your friends doing, $n?', 58499, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It amazes me how selfless and kind you have been to all of us.', 58498, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are you feeling, $c? Need more dit da jow?', 58497, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always good to see you, $n. How have you been?', 58496, 0, 15453, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The warriors are reporting that you saved their lives. Thank you, $n.', 58495, 0, 15452, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you had a chance to test the efficacy of my family\'s dit da jow, $c?', 58494, 0, 15451, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c. Your people are inside. But first, may I ask a favor?', 58493, 0, 15450, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It burns...my soul...it burns!!!!', 58492, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
