('I heard that $n comes from a far off land beyond the mists. $G He : She; must be their $g hero : heroine; to have come all this way to save us.', 'I heard that $n comes from a far off land beyond the mists. $G He : She; must be their $g hero : heroine; to have come all this way to save us.', 58482, 0, 15448, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
