('Thank you... Now what?', 'Thank you... Now what?', 58472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dog?! Where\'s my dog?!', 'My dog?! Where\'s my dog?!', 58471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My house! My things! It\'s all ablaze!', 'My house! My things! It\'s all ablaze!', 58470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let them take me!', 'I won\'t let them take me!', 58469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is everything alright, $c? We\'re all counting on you to kill the yaungol war leader.', '', 58468, 0, 15446, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have saved Binan Village, $n. Ring the gong so all shall know!', '', 58467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('$n, I was wondering if you\'d be willing to endorse me come election time?', '', 58466, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you, $n.', '', 58465, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back! What news, $n?', '', 58464, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never witnessed such heroics and selflessness.', '', 58463, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you considered settling down, $n? Kun-Lai Summit could use a strong $c such as yourself as its protector.', '', 58462, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell us again how you slew the yaungol war leader, $n.', '', 58461, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail the savior of Binan Village!', '', 58460, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s my $g boy : girl;!', '', 58459, 0, 15444, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were magnificent out there, $n!', '', 58458, 0, 15443, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hot food, fresh food, delicious food! Get your race snacks here!', '', 58457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great day for a race, don\'t you think?', '', 58456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I get for you?', '', 58455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer to work in solitude.', '', 58454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have written many powerful words in my time, but still, the most powerful is hidden to me.', '', 58453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Within every brush stroke are a thousand meanings.', '', 58452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time we got another shipment. I heard they were having trouble at the mines, but our work cannot wait.', '', 58451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soon, very soon, it will all pay off.', 58450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wonderful! Just look at it. A hundred years to produce this incredible monument for the Jade Serpent. And now, you too have contributed to this masterpiece.', 58449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unbelievable! You\'ve just saved my neck, $n. Oh ho, and just look at this luster.', '', 58448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Trick to drinking with grummles is not to stop. With any luck, they\'ll pass out before you do.', 58447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely, beautiful! I see you have already visited the East Temple. Then you understand why this statue is so important to our way of life.', '', 58446, 0, 15434, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lovely, beautiful! If you have time, you should also visit the East Temple. You may gain further insight into our great statue, and its importance to our way of life.', '', 58445, 0, 13382, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a new jade shipment for you.', 'I\'ve got a new jade shipment for you.', 58444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a jade delivery for you.', 'I\'ve got a jade delivery for you.', 58443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did someone say they needed jade?', 'Did someone say they needed jade?', 58442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got your jade right here.', 'I\'ve got your jade right here.', 58441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Binan Village, $c. I beg you... please help us.', '', 58440, 0, 15442, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh that\'s a fine piece o\' metal you have der. I am quite fond of a good piece of steel.', '', 58439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A luckydo would be wise to buy my wares. Bad fortune to those who simply walk away.', '', 58438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares.', 'Show me your wares.', 58437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This jade shortage is the worst thing to happen since the golden autumn crisis. Production is already months behind. The Serpent ain\'t getting any younger!', '', 58436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jade, it\'s all about the jade! We need it, and that\'s the bottom line!', '', 58435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care what you say. If that $c is here to help us, I say we welcome $g him : her; with arms wide open!', 'I don\'t care what you say. If that $c is here to help us, I say we welcome $g him : her; with arms wide open!', 58434, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strange getup, even for a $r $c if you ask me.', 'Strange getup, even for a $r $c if you ask me.', 58433, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to save us, $c?', 'Are you here to save us, $c?', 58432, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A foreigner. $G He : She; looks very exotic. Don\'t stare!', 'A foreigner. $G He : She; looks very exotic. Don\'t stare!', 58431, 0, 17106, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have to retreat into the Valley of the Four Winds. I don\'t want to give up my home here.', 'We may have to retreat into the Valley of the Four Winds. I don\'t want to give up my home here.', 58430, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$G He : She; looks pretty powerful. Maybe powerful enough to drive the yaungol back!', '$G He : She; looks pretty powerful. Maybe powerful enough to drive the yaungol back!', 58429, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh, an outlander.', 'Shhh, an outlander.', 58428, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look. A stranger. I wonder if $g he\'s : she\'s; come to save us from the yaungol.', 'Look. A stranger. I wonder if $g he\'s : she\'s; come to save us from the yaungol.', 58427, 0, 15440, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOUR SOUL IS MINE!', '', 58426, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'END IT! NOW! Before he can...', 58425, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t...fight him...', 58424, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I...won\'t let you...', 58423, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now turn your lovely runeblades on our guests, and fetch me their bones!', '', 58422, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you forget, girl? I am the Darkmaster! I command the undead!', '', 58421, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WE\'LL MEET AGAIN, $P!', '', 58420, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride to the bottom of the statue.', 'I need a ride to the bottom of the statue.', 58419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whatever you do, don\'t look down.', 58418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Going down?', 58417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a ride to the top of the statue.', 'I need a ride to the top of the statue.', 58416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Class dismissed.', 58415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 29455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless...', 'Useless...', 58414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$P, YOU DARE?!', '', 58413, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is the work day over yet? The Drunken Hozen in Dawn\'s Blossom is calling my name.', '', 58412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My family is planning a great banquet to celebrate the statue\'s completion.', '', 58411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will not be long, now before our work is finished.', '', 58410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will feel good to rest after the statue is done.', '', 58409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more shipments of jade, and the dragon will be complete.', '', 58408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The work is hard, but necessary. This statue represents all that we believe.', '', 58407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father and my father\'s father spent their lives toiling on this statue. I am proud to be the one who will finish it.', '', 58406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Need a lift?', '', 58405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take a moment and look at the statue. This marvel is the culmination of a hundred years of labor.', 58404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our work here has been steady and tedious, but the statue is almost complete.', 58403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes it is good to take a step back and reflect upon our larger goals.', '', 58402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make it fast, buddy. We\'ve got deadlines to meet.', '', 58401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your yak is beginning to buck. Return to Lao & Son\'s Yakwash.', 'Your yak is beginning to buck. Return to Lao & Son\'s Yakwash.', 58400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to leave.', 'I am ready to leave.', 58399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s out there, Shao? Is it safe?', 58398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I squish you!', '', 58397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge accepted!', '', 58396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You give yaks now!', '', 58395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 58394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I break you!', '', 58393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not afraid of little thing like you.', '', 58392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let loose your rage. Kill me and in so doing, validate my existence.', '', 58391, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is no business of yours, $p! I will allow you to leave.', '', 58390, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My sight may be gone, but I am fortunate to live in a land which rewards all of the senses.', '', 58389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The answer I seek eludes me...$b$bSometimes $c, one must step back from the trees in order to see the forest.', '', 58386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry. The little fellas seem to have found their way back here. Here you go.', '', 58385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not to worry. These little fellas seem to have found their way back here.', '', 58383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my yaks.', 'I lost my yaks.', 58382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, I can smell the luck of your yaks from here. Come $pc, and I will give you much fortune in return.', '', 58381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing but the Crusade! Anyone that is not with us, will fall!', '', 58380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The principle is absolute, follow it and you will be accepted.', '', 58379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was an impressive number of sprites you just mowed through.', '', 58378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing me stranger! I will see you at the Yakwash.', '', 58377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Nazgrim wants to know the status of the supplies.', 'General Nazgrim wants to know the status of the supplies.', 58376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how much your help has saved our family business.$b$bI should be able take it from here as long as the yaungol slow down their assault.', '', 58375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please! Can you help me! These sprites grabbed me when I was searching for some of our missing yaks.', '', 58374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa keeps telling me I need to be more like my grandpa. But he died before I was born in a yak stampede.', '', 58373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mountain sprites are mean creatures. Their pranks can really hurt people.', '', 58372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pa says we\'ve faced worse. But when he says \"we\" he means people like his great great grandfather.$b$bThe worst thing I\'ve ever had to face was a grummle angry that his yak wasn\'t smelly enough.', '', 58371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope the yaungol arriving wasn\'t a sign of worse things to come. They are bad enough.', '', 58370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I honestly don\'t know how I am going to round up so many yaks on my own. Those yaungol are dangerous.', '', 58369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So warm, so red!', 'So warm, so red!', 58368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27758, 27758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always pumping, always pumping!', 'Always pumping, always pumping!', 58367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27757, 27757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spurts of crimson!', 'Spurts of crimson!', 58366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27756, 27756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scent of blood...so delicious!', 'The scent of blood...so delicious!', 58365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27755, 27755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More blood!', 'More blood!', 58364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27754, 27754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dripping and pouring and clotting!', 'Dripping and pouring and clotting!', 58363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27753, 27753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood blood blood BLOOD BLOOD!!', 'Blood blood blood BLOOD BLOOD!!', 58362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27752, 27752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Yes! More blood!', 'Yes! Yes! More blood!', 58361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27751, 27751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from his attack!', '', 58360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my son and my ranch. I am forever in your debt, stranger. If you ever find yourself in need of a clean yak, you know where to go.', '', 58359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of his range!', '', 58358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from him!', '', 58357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You here to steal my yaks?!$b$bIf so, be ready for me to slap that look off your face.', '', 58356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our business has stood for twelve generations and supplied many hundreds of fresh, clean, and smelly yaks to the grummles.$b$bWe\'ve faced floods, famine, and mogu. I\'ll be a hozen\'s uncle if I let these yaungol run us off.', '', 58355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you met the Lucky Eightcoins? He is our biggest customer and the shrewdest of grummle negotiators.', '', 58354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If this keeps up, I don\'t know how we are ever going to continue our supply of yaks to the grummle.', '', 58353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an absolute travesty of our time I tell you. That a rancher and his son can\'t just run a yak wash in peace without fear of yaungol raiding...', '', 58352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am just glad my wife, spirits guide her, is not around to see our business overrun by these ruffians and hoodlums!', '', 58351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope the mantid come and drag you yaungols back over the wall.', '', 58350, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Filthy yaungol infestation!', '', 58349, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better be happy I threw my back out or I\'d come over there and kick you off my land.', '', 58348, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! These yaungol are trying to steal my yaks!', '', 58347, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you think I\'m going to be intimidated by a bunch of filthy yaungol, you\'ve got another thing coming!', '', 58346, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Those are my yaks! Bring them back here this instant!', '', 58345, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not gonna run me off my land!', '', 58344, 0, 15415, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope that one doesn\'t have to go through twice.', '', 58343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did the yaungol do to that poor thing?', '', 58342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the grummle are going to love that one.', '', 58341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm. I think that one is going to need some extra perfuming.', '', 58340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'ve been looking all over for that one. He\'s a handful.', '', 58339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew... that one was ripe.', '', 58338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow. That\'s a filthy one. Sure you don\'t want to go through the wash too?', '', 58337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s great, $p. We\'ll take it from here.', '', 58336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Nazgrim needs an update on your progress.', 'General Nazgrim needs an update on your progress.', 58335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Nazgrim wants an update on your progress.', 'General Nazgrim wants an update on your progress.', 58334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The doctor is in!', '', 58333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Nazgrim needs your training report.', 'General Nazgrim needs your training report.', 58332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt. Please save the rest of my people.', '', 58331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish the jinyu could join the Alliance.  Thank you!', '', 58330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! Long live the Alliance!', '', 58329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
