('Thank you, Outlander!', '', 58327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance comes to the rescue again!', '', 58326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d be dead or worse if not for you!', '', 58325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once we defeat the Alliance and their allies, claiming this land will be a fitting testimony to the tenacity of the Horde.', '', 58324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RATTLEGORE!', 'RATTLEGORE!', 58323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will need Anduin\'s help to move on the temple. When he\'s ready, we\'ll begin.', '', 58322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit I had my doubts about you at first, $n, but you have proven yourself with our tribe.', '', 58321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your coming was a blessing to our tribe.', '', 58320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you the $c, $n? I\'ve heard so many stories about you, but never expected to meet you in person.', '', 58319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our soldiers speak of nothing but their new training.', '', 58318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have spoken to some of your... Alliance... friends. Your people are quite interesting.', '', 58317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, I will tell my children about you, $n.', '', 58316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, for the first time in many moons, I feel hopeful for our future.', '', 58315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit showed us the path to our future. And somehow, it has something to do with you.', '', 58314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe it! I saw the spirit of of an emperor!', '', 58313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hozen are slippery and cunning. Worse yet, they feel no shame or remorse.$B$BThey kill out of base instinct, for pleasure and for greed.', '', 58312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have lost so many brothers in battle, I no longer wish to keep count.', '', 58311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do your waters flow today, traveler?', '', 58310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', '', 58309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well here, $n. I will put in a good word with your superiors when we return to Stormwind.', '', 58308, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Horde finally show their ugly faces, we\'ll be ready.', '', 58307, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the right training, the jinyu will make a strong addition to our land force.', '', 58306, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jinyu are proving to be capable soldiers.', '', 58305, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe you a great debt, $r.', '', 58304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, perhaps you will show me your home. It must be very different than ours.', '', 58303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your name will be spoken in our village for many years to come.', '', 58302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are friends now, $n. You are welcome to our village any time you wish to return.', '', 58301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Elder has much to consider, but I think it\'s clear. You are meant to lead us to victory against the hozen.', '', 58300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I believe the vision means for us to join together, $n.', '', 58299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit\'s voice echoed through me like thunder. Did you hear it?', '', 58298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have gazed upon one of the ancient jinyu emperors of Pandaria, $n.', '', 58297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirit has spoken. We should take up arms and attack the hozen!', '', 58296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, perhaps you can tell me more about this strange land from where you came.', '', 58295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomorrow holds untold possibilities, and it is all thanks to you and the Alliance.', '', 58294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks to you, the hozen are no longer a threat. Our village can now work on rebuilding and growing.', '', 58293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are hard at work, training with your soldiers.', '', 58292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waterspeaking ceremony has tired me. Please, give me time to rest, and think.', '', 58291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One thing is clear. Our future will be affected by you and your people.', '', 58290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I spoke to the waters, they showed me a vision of you, $n. Perhaps you are more than a passing traveler. Perhaps you were sent to us for a reason.', '', 58289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving my life!', '', 58288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back where you came from, Horde!', '', 58287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First anger sha, now the Horde!', '', 58286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved me? But, you\'re Horde!', '', 58285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eek! Everybody run!', '', 58284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide your kids! Hide your wife!', '', 58283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde is invading!', '', 58282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde! Run away!', '', 58281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ack! It\'s the Horde!', '', 58280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Hey you in the back! I\'m watchin\' you mister!', '', 58279, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 388, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Oh come on! We\'ve been doin\' this all day!', '', 58278, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 388, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no... Left foot then right foot!', '', 58277, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 388, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the worst marching I\'ve ever seen!', '', 58276, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' dooker!', '', 58275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grookie wikket!', '', 58274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen whakkin\' stinky wikket!', '', 58273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket grookin stinky slickies!', '', 58272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikkets is furry food!', '', 58271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, I think I know what our next move\'s gotta be.', '', 58269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nesingwary is a brilliant hunter, but I wish there was a druid here to teach us some proper animal hunting tactics.', '', 58266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once hunted alongside the famous Ohlorn Farstrider. He was a tauren who could hunt with nothing but a totem and his skivvies.', '', 58265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feed my anger!', '', 58264, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fu Mo Shi is a doddering old fool. He\'s a master of nothing!', '', 58263, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense the anger building inside of you.', '', 58262, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jinyu are ours and Binan Village is next!', '', 58261, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon Kun-Lai Summit and all of Pandaria will be consumed with anger. And then, the world!', '', 58260, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give in to your anger!', '', 58258, 0, 15425, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU\'LL NEVER GET THE MASK FROM ME, $P!', '', 58257, 0, 15398, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen a tauren hunt? You never do until it\'s too late.', '', 58256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tauren are the most majestic of hunters.', '', 58255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s stops along the road, panting heavily.', 58254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep an eye on the rear! No - not MY rear. Behind us!', 58253, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your footing! The stones are still slick from rain.', 58252, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive, $r.$b$bThanks to you, these creatures may turn out to be valuable allies.', '', 58251, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re scaling the cliff walls! This is going to get dirty.', 58250, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll cook you into my soup, you dook-wikket!', '', 58249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' $r!', '', 58248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You tik-digglin\' jook-manker!', '', 58247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get the ook away from there!', '', 58246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get lost, tik-nooker!', '', 58245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You in hot water now!', '', 58244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I kill you, dooker!', '', 58243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You get away from fire!', '', 58242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You went an\' made it so these savages like us?$b$bYou gotta be some kinda freak $r genius!$b$bWho\'da thought...', '', 58241, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ho boy, more saurok. They always seek high ground when the rains hit!', 58240, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everyone ready? Let\'s roll!', 58239, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rest up for a second while I prep the keg.', 58238, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must place the fireworks near a pile of stolen goods.', '', 58237, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my... we made it to the other side somehow. I am so relieved.$b$bIt is not an easy thing to create a portal to a place you have never been before.$b$bBut then, if it were easy, everybody would be doing it.', '', 58236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lyalia wants me to create a new portal? That woman is crazy. Did she already forget what happened the last time?$b$bWell, Vaeldrin\'s research did suggest some possible ways around traps like that. And I may have taken a short cut or two to get us here.$b$bGive me enough time and I might be able to summon another portal for the encampment.', '', 58235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurray! We made it!', '', 58234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to travel to Dawn\'s Blossom.', 'I would like to travel to Dawn\'s Blossom.', 58233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where would you like to travel today?', '', 58232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, our friendship is cemented with the Alliance! Today, we go forth as brothers and sisters. To our new future!', '', 58231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Follow and use the shield as cover!', '', 58228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! PH', '', 58227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hurt! PH', '', 58226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pain is temporary! PH', '', 58225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never liked that guy. PH', '', 58224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m surprised he lasted as long as he did. PH', '', 58223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He died fighting! PH', '', 58222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He was a good man, but terrible with a sword! PH', '', 58221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen grookin\' slicky wikket dookers.', '', 58220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' wikket no whakkin\' hozen!', '', 58219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen grookin\' slicky wikket!', '', 58218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket no grookin\' hozen?', '', 58217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' slicky make a good dook!', '', 58216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sliiickeeey!', '', 58215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cheeky little bugger! Didn\'t think he had it in him!', '', 58214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run...necromancer...your life ends once I catch my breath.', 58213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not let you curse another soul with this nightmare.', 58212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll pay for your tongue.', 58211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, father, I will. Lo was willing to fight the Pandriarchs for me. It took $p to champion us but they consented.', 58210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. What\'s done is done. But don\'t assume I will ever like this. Or you, Kai.', '', 58209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... um... I...', '', 58208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('My Syra will NOT be seen with the likes of a Wanderbrew.', '', 58207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! This is preposterous.', '', 58206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Same. Now lets get these kids back to Dawn\'s Blossom.', '', 58205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on Peiji. I don\'t like it any better than you do but there is honor in the Pandriarchs\' blessings.', '', 58204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They agreed?!', '', 58203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll see if you revel so much in death once I\'ve ripped out your throat!', 58202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll never stop hunting your kind, necromancer.  NEVER.', 58201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You feed their souls to their brethren?  You are sick.', 58200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, Voss, your fate awaits you.', '', 58199, 0, 0, 425, 65, 0, 27485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dear, you should embrace this gift that has been bestowed upon you.', '', 58198, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, too, are beautiful, Voss. Have you looked in a mirror recently?', '', 58197, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t it beautiful? The weaving of flesh and bone and soul.', '', 58196, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the matter, Voss, getting tired?', '', 58195, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 27481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their deaths only serve to empower my summoners further! Behold!', '', 58194, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 27480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dear, it appears we have visitors!  Friends of yours, Voss?', '', 58193, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Vale of Eternal Blossoms is getting more and more intriguing. I may just have to see it for myself.', '', 58192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Song of the Vale hangs on the wall. Take it. I hear the celestials calling. Thank you...', '', 58191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow! That was amazing. What next, $p? Think you can get the hozen and jinyu to get along?', '', 58190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here they are. See, told you I could find anyone or anything.', '', 58189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Son! What are you doing! She\'s a Goldendraft.', '', 58188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness came from deep within the earth. Still, it hungers...', '', 58187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters of the Vale are now yours to protect...', '', 58186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. And now, with your permission, I would like to ask for your daughter\'s hand.', '', 58185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not her name I am interested in. It is her. She is the kindest, nicest, prettiest person I have ever met.', '', 58184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mister Goldendraft, I humbly ask permission to marry your daughter Syra.', '', 58183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s on!', '', 58182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blades at the ready men!', '', 58181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My time with the Red Crane was short, but I learned a great deal under his tutelage.$B$BThis foe--this \"sha\" energy--is unlike anything we\'ve ever faced. It is the physical manifestation of emotional turmoil, bottled in the land for centuries$B$BThis emotional energy has now burst forth to find living, feeling hosts in which to reside.$B$BThe sha threatens to wash over the whole continent, possibly the world, if we do not aid the pandaren in facing it down!', '', 58180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat all the Expired Test Subjects to escape!', 'Defeat all the Expired Test Subjects to escape!', 58178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.$b$bMy name is Shai.$b$bThey tell me to watch the cliff.$b$bSometimes cubs come because of a dare. Sometimes grown ups come because they are curious.$b$bI tell you what I tell them. The cliffs are sad, and the jungle is even more sad.$b$bYou may descend using the rope, but know it is a very sad place.', '', 58177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another down.  Do not relent!', '', 58175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep firing! Let none escape!', '', 58174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our people have their differences, $c, but we are all guests in this place.$B$BThe pandaren have shown me great hospitality and respect, as I\'m sure you\'ve also received, and now they need our help.$B$BThe Horde is not without honor. If you know honor, you will know to save our quarrel for another time.', '', 58173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve come to return to me to my father, I must ask that you look around us first - can we truly walk away from these people in their time of need and still claim to represent the Alliance?', '', 58172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am Anduin Wrynn, Prince of Stormwind. I won\'t die here. Not like this!', '', 58171, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 27577, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, slicky! I dook up your like fer breakfast!', '', 58170, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The books burst into flame from being hit by Book Burner.', '', 58169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_01.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:113653|h[Greater Dragon\'s Breath]|h|r!', '', 58168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c of your caliber is exactly what we need to turn the battle in our favor.', '', 58167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at the size of that thing! That easily has to be the biggest moth I\'ve seen all week.', '', 58165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not now!', '', 58163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extreme sewing!', '', 58161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s chuckles.', '', 58160, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 29604, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That it is. You speak with a wisdom beyond your years. If we get through this, I think I\'d like to know more about where you are from.', '', 58159, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 29605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you - both of you. The Red Crane has always symbolized hope to our people, but in his absence I fear that even my thoughts began to darken.', '', 58158, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use focus and relaxation to maintain your balance.', '', 58157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anduin, will you join me? With the saurok threat at bay for now, it is time we discuss our next move.', '', 58156, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think no more on despair, Koro. We have a saying where I\'m from: It is darkest just before the dawn.', '', 58155, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27586, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There should be plenty of anti-venom, thanks to $p.', '', 58154, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27585, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This storm is raging out of control! Keep the brewkegs safe...', 58152, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Put out those brewkegs!', 58151, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s all about the brewkegs - keep them from burning!', 58150, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You there!  Make yourselves useful and deal with these summoners!', 58148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 29469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yow, the storm is more intense than I thought! Be careful!', 58146, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...Saurok? What are they doing here? Keep them away!', 58145, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch out for lightning strikes!', 58144, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the brewkegs catch fire, I need you to help put them out.', 58143, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The storm is starting! Get ready.', 58142, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please wait a moment.', '', 58141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archers, attack!', '', 58139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dream Brew is an ancient recipe passed down through the ages.', '', 58138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly.', '', 58137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mind has untold powers that we have not yet discovered. With balance and wisdom, it may be possible to unlock these powers of the mind.$B$BThe Dream Brew is only a tool that produces a temporary period of this all-seeing state.', '', 58136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dream Brew will put you into a deep state of meditation. Your mind\'s eye will find the answers to your greatest questions.', '', 58135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stronger the ingredients, the stronger the magic of the brew.', '', 58134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_inferno.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:113364|h[Book Burner]|h|r!', '', 58133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To find your White Pawn, we must call upon the ancient magic of my people. To do so, we must first create a Dream Brew.', '', 58132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The spirits have spoken. I have much to ponder.', '', 58131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lo! We are leaving. Where did you get off to?', '', 58130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. Let us begin.', '', 58129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to find Syra!', '', 58128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Wanderbrew marrying a Goldendraft? I would be offended but there is a certain amusement to how offended old Peiji is going to be when he hears this.$b$bAt the least you seem to have made my boy happy. Thank you, $p.', '', 58127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brewmaster Wanderbrew, at your service.$b$bI travel the Jade Forest in search of only the finest of ingredients for my brews.$b$bUnlike the high and mighty Goldendrafts of Dawn\'s Blossom.$b$bThey have their big brewhouse for mass producing. Which is fine, you know, if you enjoy drinking swill.', '', 58126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $p! I am so happy that you helped us. My Lo is with me now, and even my father seems to have relaxed.$b$bHe won\'t admit it to me, but I think my father likes Lo.', 58125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandriarchs blessed my future son-in-law thanks to you. I guess this means the Wanderbrew and Goldendraft feud will have to go on hold.$b$bDon\'t tell anyone this, but I\'m sort of grateful to you for that. So many years of hate is just exhausting.$b$bWe were too set in our ways though, and it took something, or someone, new to help us see passed our differences.', '', 58124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to go? I think we\'re just about done here...', '', 58123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lo? Sure. I\'ve been sent to hunt him down lots of times. Well, him and Syra Goldendraft.$b$bBest places to look for them are either the inn or the Arboretum.', '', 58120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Wanderbrew? Why would a Goldendraft ever know where a Wanderbrew is? Their family has always been a scar on our beautiful town\'s reputation.$b$bTo make things worse, that filthy creaton is probably making eyes at my daughter. That I will not have!$b$bIf you see either him or my daughter you tell them as much for me.', '', 58119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to Pandaria!', 'Send me to Pandaria!', 58109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings stranger. Would you like to visit the mystical Pandaria?', '', 58108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take the supplies.', 'Take the supplies.', 58107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle.', '', 58106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle.$B$BHis supply satchel appears to be unharmed.', '', 58105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You brought back the instruments just in time, $n. The Elder is ready to perform the waterspeaking ceremony.', '', 58104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_book_01.blp:20|t%s assigns $n a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:113395|h[Harsh Lesson]|h|r!', '', 58103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Class... dismissed.', '', 58102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I feel much better.$B$BMishka and Bold Karasshi have brought me up to speed. Your arrival, your search for the White Pawn, my rescue from the hozen.$B$BThe situation is not ideal, and we have much work to do. Finding Anduin is our top priority.', '', 58101, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dunce.', '', 58100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('School is in session!', '', 58099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you seen an SI:7 agent by the name of Amber?$B$BThe last I heard, her bomber took heavy damage and disappeared into the trees to the northeast.', 58098, 0, 19221, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we have both lost enough today, old elf. See to your dead.', '', 58097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agreed.', '', 58096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What now, Sunwalker?', '', 58095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaohao must have sent you.', '', 58093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have great honor, stranger. Please join us.', '', 58092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must drive the yaungol back to the Townlong Steppes.', '', 58091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must rejoin the battle to save Binan Village.', '', 58090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. You have saved my life.', '', 58089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join us, $c. We could use you in the fight.', '', 58088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is powerful healing!', '', 58087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt.', '', 58086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh...where is everyone? Gnome in a cage here! Help!', 58082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t come any closer, monkey! I\'m a trained SI:7 agent.', 58081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop looking at me with your beady little eyes!', 58080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey monkey, don\'t look at me like that. I\'m not for eating, got that?', 58079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone help me!', 58078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never imagined we\'d run into this much trouble out here.$B$BMaybe we shouldn\'t have left the temple...', '', 58077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Is anybody out there? Hellooooooo!', 58076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this thing?', 'What is this thing?', 58075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Way back in the old times the mogu would put little traps like this around the world to stop people from portalling this way and that. It\'s powered by the people who get stuck in it and won\'t turn off until they are dead.$b$bIt\'s like mama Bramblestaff always used to say: \"Don\'t put your hand in a stranger\'s portal.\"', '', 58074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! $p! My daughter! I... a vision, she... she\'s in trouble!', '', 58073, 0, 15328, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even in their own time of need, the pandaren have graciously offered to share food and a place by the fire.$B$BThe rest of us could learn a lot from them.', 58072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even in their own time of need, the pandaren have graciously offered to share food and a place by the fire.$B$BThe rest of us could learn a lot from them.', 58071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will crush you!', '', 58070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kthh! You will die in the mud like your friend over there...', '', 58069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, I lost my diving helmet.', 'Commander, I lost my diving helmet.', 58068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget your helmet, $n. Rookies...', '', 58067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stranger, have you ever seen a stone fall into a calm lake? Every action creates a ripple, even accepting a pledge of friendship. I shall think upon your request.', '', 58066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The great river flows through us all. Some prefer to surrender themselves to the water\'s path. Others swim toward certain shores.$B$BWhich are you, stranger? Where will your river take you?', '', 58065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen our lake, so calm and still? That is how we like it. Constant. Unmoving. We do not bear change.', '', 58064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Action speaks louder than intent, stranger. My warriors intend to seek retribution, but only practice will make it so. Now go away. We are busy.', '', 58063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are masters of the water, which is why we have been able to defend this village for so long. But on land, especially with thick tree cover, the hozen are vastly superior.', '', 58062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hozen rely on dirty guerilla tactics. Ambushes and traps. It is sad to say, but they seem to outwit us at every turn.', '', 58061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am teaching our warriors everything I know. Unfortunately, it doesn\'t seem to be enough.', '', 58060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must train harder.', '', 58059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stronger our defenders, the greater our chance of survival. But that should be obvious, even to someone like you.', '', 58058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you must be the outsider. Sadly, I am making weapons for war. Once, not long ago, I made instruments for prayer and celebration. It is this war that makes everyone stand on edge.', '', 58057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! $c! Over here. I could use some assistance if you have a moment.', '', 58056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No harm? Pah! Many thousand years ago, the Pearlfin Tribe stood on the throne of all Pandaria. Now, this village is all that is left of our people, all because we trusted a tribe of outsiders... the hozen.', '', 58055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like to consider myself a historian of my people. I believe that in order to understand the present, we should examine the events of the past.', '', 58054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your mind as calm as still water. Breathe deeply. And be at peace.', '', 58053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To find clarity and purpose, immerse yourself in inner reflection.', '', 58052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I come from the Alliance. We wish to be allies, not enemies.', 'I come from the Alliance. We wish to be allies, not enemies.', 58051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friends and I come with peaceful intentions.', 'My friends and I come with peaceful intentions.', 58050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing?', 'What are you doing?', 58049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please allow us a chance to prove our friendship. We wish you no harm.', 'Please allow us a chance to prove our friendship. We wish you no harm.', 58048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh thank you! Thank you! Thank you!', 'Oh thank you! Thank you! Thank you!', 58047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want my mommy.', 'I want my mommy.', 58046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was An! She dared Shin to go knock on the Jade Witch\'s door.', 'It was An! She dared Shin to go knock on the Jade Witch\'s door.', 58045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, here is the boy. Doesn\'t he look special? My late husband and I always wanted children.', 58044, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31393, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The camp is just ahead, we should be able to make it from here.', '', 58043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gah! My knee! I\'m sorry, $p, I cannot fight like this.', '', 58042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More saurok incoming!', '', 58041, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 29599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I\'ll be okay, but we\'d better keep moving.', '', 58040, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help me up, $p. I... I took an arrow in the knee...', '', 58039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Pearlfin!', '', 58038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Courage, brothers! Press on!', '', 58037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that the stranger?', '', 58036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is the stranger who walks among us?', '', 58035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be strong, warriors! Keep the hozen at bay!', '', 58034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s no use! The hozen are pushing us back!', '', 58033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, a stranger.', '', 58032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bold Karasshi has returned!', '', 58031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve punched it, kicked it, smacked it, thwacked it. Nothing seems to break this oubliette.', '', 58030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old mogu traps are as dangerous now as they were back in the scary story times.', '', 58029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful. Get stuck in that and it will drain your life to power itself.', '', 58028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the trap is sprung no one gets in or out until the people trapped are completely drained of life. Mogu are evil.', '', 58027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, I tried to hop through that thing too.', '', 58026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are going to pass through a fierce battle. You must engage the hozen while I run through. If all goes well, I will meet you at my village.', '', 58025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
