('Argghhhh!', '', 58011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who throws a bucket? Honestly!', '', 58010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not the face!', '', 58009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is bad.', '', 58008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('N-n-nice doggies...', '', 58007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters. They only transfer life. My translations are starting to make sense now.$b$bI surmise the mogu used to extend their lives with the water by sacrificing prisoners, rebels, and slaves.$b$bIt is also my guess that all of the ancient scrolls I was researching were written by mogu originally, and they neglected to mention that fact.', '', 58006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What strange and fascinating creatures. Tall, burly, with almost metallic skin. I must research these creatures.', '', 58005, 0, 16789, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at these ruins, $p! What sort of empire built them I wonder.', '', 58004, 0, 16789, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh, I\'m pinned! Watch yourselves!', '', 58003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 58002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For you see, strife feeds on conflict. When you have peace in your heart, strife will find somewhere else to roam.', '', 57990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('However, when he let it alone, the beast shrank to near nothingness.', '', 57989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The yaungol attacked the beasts with great determination and ferocity. Yet, the more he attacked, the more fearsome the beasts grew!', '', 57988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE ANCIENTS!', '', 57987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 33369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the tale goes, the yaungol was traveling across the Kun\'lai plains when suddenly he was ambushed by two strange creatures!', '', 57986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frack!', '', 57983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lose slapslap...?', '', 57982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bad slickies...', '', 57981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dookin\'...', '', 57980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Takk!', '', 57979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook!', '', 57978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Icky slickies is escaping!', '', 57977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' dooker!', '', 57976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook\'em in the jerb!', '', 57975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dookers is doin\' ookin\' things!', '', 57974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?! Don\'t you know the Yaungol are invading Kun-Lai Summit?', 'What are you doing here?! Don\'t you know the Yaungol are invading Kun-Lai Summit?', 57973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gukgut say you gotta die!', '', 57972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t steal big slickies!', '', 57971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh-oh... Chief ain\'t gonna be happy...', '', 57970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wikkets belong in the pits!', '', 57969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not now. Leza needs all of my attention. She is three weeks early and something is very wrong.', 57966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This jungle is making me depressed.', 57965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here is what I have. As you can see, things are not what we were expecting.$b$bThese people need help, and I intend to stay and help them.$b$bWe would stand a much better chance with your help if you are willing to stay as well.', 57964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no business with you, stranger. What do you want?', '', 57963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, stranger?', '', 57962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step, it\'s a mine field out here!', '', 57961, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have a report for Kor and Dezco?', 'Do you have a report for Kor and Dezco?', 57960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Admiral\'s body is covered with wounds, scratches, bruises, blood, and sweat. He looks feverish.>', '', 57959, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taylor fought against the hozen like a wild beast. He is a great credit to your people!$B$BBut in the end, he was overcome.', '', 57958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The visions we had failed to mention this event.', '', 57957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will escape from here, and when I return, it will be with an army of jinyu warriors.', '', 57956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people fight to defend our last village. If we lose now, it will be the end of a lineage of once great emperors and philosophers.', '', 57955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land once belonged to the great jinyu empire. As our kingdom has fallen into disrepair, we have lost more and more land to the relentless hozen tribes.', '', 57954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only fools trust strangers, but I would rather trust a stranger than a hozen.', '', 57953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not mistake me for your friend. Over time, my people have learned that trust is too easily broken.', '', 57952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people are wary of strangers. However, it seems I have no choice but to trust you.', '', 57951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your friend put up quite the fight. He nearly escaped, but now he is a prisoner, just like the rest of us.', '', 57950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30637, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dezco, we must strike at the mogu now while they think us weak. Let us unleash this $c on them.', '', 57949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would you bring a pregnant woman with you?', 'Why would you bring a pregnant woman with you?', 57948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My wife, Leza, is in labor and fighting a fever.$b$bThis cursed jungle is sapping all of our strength. It could be something in the water.', '', 57947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t ask what you want. I asked you to fulfill your oaths sworn to the horde.$b$bWe are at war, $p, in case you forgot.$b$bIn such times, personal interests must take second place to duty.', '', 57946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What if I don\'t want to kill Alliance?', 'What if I don\'t want to kill Alliance?', 57945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my twin sister, Nimm? She\'s probably lost, as usual.', '', 57944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold up... I don\'t like the looks of this...', '', 57943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pick their corpses clean!', '', 57942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Icky slicky! Go away!', '', 57941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never seen a dooker like you before!', '', 57940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dookers die quick!', '', 57939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook off, you big dookers!', '', 57938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dookers don\'t know when to quit!', '', 57937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chief Gukgut say you gotta go!', '', 57936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' dooker!', '', 57935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You wikkets belong in the pits!', '', 57934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission priority has changed.$B$BWe need to defend this camp. Now!', '', 57933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have already created an acceptable sketch of this piece.', '', 57932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like... a LOT of guns.', 57931, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That guy sure had a lot of guns.', 57930, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope they find what they\'re looking for, here in Pandaria.', 57929, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was really cool, how you helped those people out.', 57928, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No? Okay, you\'re the boss! Let\'s keep going, $n!', 57927, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...but don\'t you think that maybe we\'ve done enough exploring for today?', 57926, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...letting me watch you while you dispatch of an ancient evil, and all that other stuff we did, too...', 57925, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, I really appreciate you taking with me into this scary jungle and all...', 57924, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here. He\'s hurt.', '', 57923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Press on to Stoneplow and help them against the Mantid threat.', 57920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I refuse to outlive my daughter.', '', 57919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'F... father? No! Not for me! Not for this!', 57918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay close and keep your eyes peeled.', '', 57917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('It looks like we are going in blind. I\'m glad you are with us, $p.', '', 57916, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrong answer.', '', 57915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, lizard lips, one more chance: where are your patrols?!', '', 57914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Koro.', 'I\'m ready, Koro.', 57913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n has taken the orb!', '', 57911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 9431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The orb has been dropped!', '', 57907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mantid, they remind me too much of the day the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj opened and swallowed my wife.$b$bThese creatures are the real threat in this land.', '', 57906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twenty years of research, hoping and dreaming, all crashing to a halt. All that remains now is the mission, and my daughter Lyalia.', '', 57905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have known about the Pools of Youth. I had visions before the trip but I was blinded by the dream of perpetual youth.', '', 57904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Mama Bramblestaff could see me now...', '', 57903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mogu fight very differently than the ones I\'ve faced in the past. They have confidence.', '', 57902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, a word before you venture forth.', '', 57901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, this may take a while.', '', 57900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[NOTE: Many placeholder visuals in this cinematic. Expecting Observatory WMO & charge up visuals.]', '', 57899, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('PLACEHOLDER CINEMATIC', 'PLACEHOLDER CINEMATIC', 57898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I almost hit my goal of ten mage portals without incident. Those thrice damned mogu ruined that with their trap.$b$bThe trap sundered most of my abilities but I should be able to manage some more local portals.', '', 57897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father! Are you okay?', 57896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That... hurt...', '', 57895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaaaaahhh!', '', 57894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now for the moment of truth.', '', 57893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the last one. Hop on that sea plane and we\'ll get going. The King has placed a lot of trust in you.', '', 57892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 57891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father would tell you we are here for the Pools of Youth.$b$bThe real story is that our lady Tyrande Whisperwind has had visions of a great light we would... will... find on this journey. A light that will need to be found and defended.$b$bMy father insists it is the Pools of Youth.$b$bI think he is blinded by a decade of obsession.', 57890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I guess what I\'m saying is... thanks.', 57889, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 30479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t forget to talk to that jinyu, down there by the river.', 57888, 0, 15252, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yikes, $p, don\'t manhandle the thing. Have you never picked an herb before?', 57887, 0, 10818, 5, 65, 0, 0, 30512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Following you all over the place. Have been for a while now.', 57886, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... umm... $p? I\'m still here, you know.', 57885, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is all pretty cool, and scary, and all that stuff, but shouldn\'t we be getting back to Mudmug\'s place now?', 57884, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone LIVES back here?', 57883, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well? Are we going in, or what?', 57882, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And it\'s kind of scary, too.', 57881, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just like, all of a sudden, out of nowhere... BOOM. Super-thick jungle.', 57880, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, where did this weird jungle come from?', 57879, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve only spent a day with you, and we\'ve already seen this entire valley.', 57878, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uncle Chen and I spent weeks wandering around that Jade Forest, and all we saw were trees... and ONE cool serpent thing.', 57877, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re way cooler than Uncle Chen.', 57876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know what, $p?', 57875, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Check this place out!', 57874, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s exactly what I need... even MORE boring old uncles.', 57873, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll bet Uncle Chen is inside, meeting our distant relatives, as we speak.', 57872, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here it is: the Stormstout Brewery.', 57871, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s smiles and glances about nervously.', 57870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait until I\'m older, so I can finally find out what beer tastes like.', 57869, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, cool! This must be where they store the grain for all the beer they make at that brewery.', 57868, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just too bad that it\'s all vegetables. Why no giant meat?', 57867, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll bet they grow enough food here to feed pretty much everybody on Pandaria.', 57866, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who would think to start a farm in the middle of a town? Hah!', 57865, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this! A little farm, right in the middle of a town.', 57864, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'OK! Not hungry anymore. Let\'s keep exploring.', 57863, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s burps.', 57862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we buy something? I\'m hungry.', 57861, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if Uncle came through here on his way to the brewery.', 57860, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh! This must be where all those farmers sell their fruits, and vegetables, and grains, and beer.', 57859, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I love puddles! No wonder all these birds like to hang out here.', 57858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place is like... ALL puddles.', 57857, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30458, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you seeing this, $p?', 57856, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30457, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THAT... WAS... AWESOME!', 57855, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was kind of cool.', 57854, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry up, $p!', 57853, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 30528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, done with the little guys! Let\'s move on to this \"horrible silk monster\"!', 57852, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, let\'s go kill some of those little guys first.', 57851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See... THIS is the type of adventure I can get behind.', 57850, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did he say \"horrible monster\"?', 57849, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I think I\'ll just stick with \"silk-getting guy\".', 57848, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are they called, anyways? Silkers? Silksters? Worm-butt squeezers?', 57847, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is kind of cool. A day in the life of a... a silk-getting guy.', 57846, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey $p? I don\'t think I want to try Bottletoads.', 57845, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you listening to me, turtle?', 57844, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s a good thing my Uncle Chen told me not to get into any fights, otherwise you\'d be dead meat, turtle!', 57843, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look how big and ugly he is!', 57842, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yuck.', 57841, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 30513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$p... you picked that flower like a champion! You\'re like a... a professional flower-picker! Have you done this before?', 57840, 0, 416, 5, 65, 0, 0, 30511, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Besides... isn\'t it THEIR job to pick the flowers?', 57839, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seems kind of girly to me.', 57838, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30509, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait a minute, now we need to go pick a flower for these guys?', 57837, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30508, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s happening?', 57836, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Back off, flower-head. That\'s MY $c you\'re talking about!', 57835, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Say, you think they\'re related to murlocs?', 57834, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m glad to see that there\'s still some left, after what happened in the Jade Forest.', 57833, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Neat! A jinyu!', 57832, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sounds good to me! And maybe next time, you could warn us about the GIANT MURDEROUS CROCODILE.', 57831, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Holy smokes, it had a mom. Look out, $p!', 57830, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is fun, $p. Way more fun than hanging out with a boring uncle.', 57829, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What, so we gather a couple of bugs, and a few bird feathers? No problem!', 57828, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle has begun!', '', 57827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 30 seconds!', '', 57826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 1 minute!', '', 57825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle begins in 2 minutes!', '', 57824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Groundbreaker Brojai has made it clear the mogu have no intention of negotiating with us.', 57823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father thought we would not encounter resistance. But then, he often spends his time obsessing over immortality instead of thinking things through.', 57822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father\'s sacrifice will not have been in vain. We need to press the attack against the mantid.', 57821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I miss my father.', 57820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was... so dark...', 'It was... so dark...', 57819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems we haven\'t lost yet.', 'It seems we haven\'t lost yet.', 57818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I give up when heroes still fight at my side?', 'How can I give up when heroes still fight at my side?', 57817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, I cannot let it end like this. I have to keep fighting!', 'No, I cannot let it end like this. I have to keep fighting!', 57816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, I had lost sight of the Way.', 'Thank you, I had lost sight of the Way.', 57815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So they CAN die... I have to stay focused.', 'So they CAN die... I have to stay focused.', 57814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course. We must not lose hope.', 'Of course. We must not lose hope.', 57813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t know what came over me.', 'I... I don\'t know what came over me.', 57812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did it! Let\'s get this brew to the Monastery...', 57811, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I will just sit this one out.', '', 57810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', 'For the Horde!', 57809, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not learn the secrets of the mogu!', 'You will not learn the secrets of the mogu!', 57808, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu sympathizers!', 'Mogu sympathizers!', 57807, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light grant me strength!', 'Light grant me strength!', 57806, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance will not be allowed to scar this land!', 'The Alliance will not be allowed to scar this land!', 57805, 3, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are on a quest to find the Pools of Youth!$b$bThe fabled waters were a boon of a mysterious lost civilization that predated Queen Azshara.$b$bWith these waters, we will be able to restore the glory of immortality to the kal\'dorei.', '', 57804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing here?', 'What are you doing here?', 57803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I failed. Thank you for coming for me.', 'I... I failed. Thank you for coming for me.', 57802, 0, 15245, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. I didn\'t uncover anything before they caught me.', 'Thank you, friend. I didn\'t uncover anything before they caught me.', 57801, 0, 15245, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw their leader. He was heading further up the wall. I\'ll mark it on your map.', 'I saw their leader. He was heading further up the wall. I\'ll mark it on your map.', 57800, 0, 15246, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn\'t find anything.', 'I was barely inside their outer patrols when they caught me. I didn\'t find anything.', 57799, 0, 15245, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is wrong with the portal?', 'What is wrong with the portal?', 57798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An arcanic oubliette. Thankfully the walls of this ruin have collapsed away otherwise we would have been trapped in this one spot without food or water.$b$bSeems whoever built these ruins designed them to be a prison for anyone attempting to portal to the coordinates we were travelling to.$b$bIt also is lethal to any mages that pass through it. Look what it did to our poor arcanist.$b$bThe good news is we can still communicate with the other side and were able to warn them not to send anyone else through. The bad news is we are stuck on the wrong side of what is now a one way portal.', 57797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, we could use a champion like you in Stoneplow.', '', 57796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are indeed a stranger to Pandaria.$b$BThe mantid are the monsters beyond the wall. The scourge of the west. The evil that haunts our lands.$b$BEvery one hundred years the mantid launch an assault on our lands to ravage them of their wealth and food.$b$bOur greatest scholars tell us we are still many years from the next ravage, but our dreams say otherwise.', '', 57795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mantid?', 'Mantid?', 57794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We seek the wisdom of the Crane to explain the visions we have been having.$b$bMantid! Mantid assaulting our homes, flying over the wall and attacking in force.$b$bSuch dreams are expected, living so close to the wall.$b$BBut lately, they have been most insistent.', '', 57793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why were you travelling to the Crane Temple?', 'Why were you travelling to the Crane Temple?', 57792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions.', 'Our dreams have been haunted by mantid. We hoped the Crane Temple would give us some insight to these visions.', 57791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back.', 'The mogu chose the worst time to attack. The mantid are on the move, and not even the great wall will hold them back.', 57790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?', 'When did the mogu learn to wield magic portals?', 57789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse.', 'I don\'t know what brought you into the Forbidden Jungle, but I am glad it did. You saved us from slavery... or worse.', 57788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First mantid, then mogu. These are dark days indeed.', 'First mantid, then mogu. These are dark days indeed.', 57787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?', 'These \"elf\" creatures. Can they be trusted?', 57786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.', 'Thank you for rescuing us, $c. Hopefully now our mission will not be lost.', 57785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did all of these mogu come from?', 'Where did all of these mogu come from?', 57784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here you go. Keep the report safe, $p. The sunwalkers are moving west as well.$b$bI\'m going to stay here and help these people. We would stand a better chance if you stay and help us out.', 57783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay calm. I\'m here, you\'re safe.', '', 57782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy, girl. You\'ll be up and running again in no time.', '', 57781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There, there.', '', 57780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s alright, girl. Relax.', '', 57779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sentinel Commander Lyalia needs your report.', 'Sentinel Commander Lyalia needs your report.', 57778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Us meeting on these shores is more than just random chance.', 57777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even the very air is ripe with sadness.', 57776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande sent us here as a vanguard for the Light.', 57775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sentinels, saddle up and prepare to move out! Xintar, carve us a portal to the next location. We are leaving a small garrison here and pressing northwestward.', 57774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds like you\'ve really stirred up a hornet\'s nest, $c.$B$BReady to set sail?', '', 57773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 11, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('It\'s done. The Fist of Garrosh is dropping the bomb.', 'It\'s done. The Fist of Garrosh is dropping the bomb.', 57772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is ours. Finally, peace...', '', 57771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honoring', 'Honoring', 57770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you cook these yourself?', 57769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t wait to try these.', 57768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These dumplings look delicious!', 57767, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was getting real sick of eating turnips.', 57766, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you so much for the lovely gift, $n. Cats are my favorite!', 57765, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The water may not create life, but at least it will let me transfer it.', '', 57764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love you, my little Lyalia.', '', 57763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now this... folly... would cost my daughter her life.', '', 57762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I would have more time. I always thought...', '', 57761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spent so long trying to find a way to extend my life that I forgot to live it.', '', 57760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My marines are already on shore, holding the harbor entrance.$B$BYou have your orders. Do your jobs, and return safely.$B$BThe eyes of Hellscream are upon you!', '', 57759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 2, 0, 39653),
('I think I saw some mogu digging up artifacts.$b$bThat can\'t be good.$b$bWe still tell tales of all the evil stuff the mogu did when they knew how to use artifacts and arcane powers.', '', 57758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mogu may be clunky in their movements but their faces are hard on the knuckles.', '', 57757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never heard of mogu gathering in such large numbers before.', '', 57756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mama Bramblestaff often told me if I didn\'t stop breaking her vases she would ship me off to the Dungeons of Dojan.', '', 57755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande warned... she... she said there would be great dark... before light.', 57754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... blood burns.', 57753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aly... Alynna is in command.', 57752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thankfully our allies on the other side of the portal can send supplies through now that the oubliette is disabled.$b$bUnfortunately we still haven\'t disabled the trap preventing us from returning through it.', 57751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh! Hello...$B$B<Ella\'s face turns pink and she looks down shyly.>', 57750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kang says the mogu are ruffians and bandits.$b$bFrom what we\'ve seen so far, I think they might be becoming a larger threat than any of the pandaren suspect.', 57749, 0, 13986, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can allow this no longer!', '', 57748, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27747, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'High Priestess Tyrande was hesitant to approve this mission.$b$bShe seemed to believe the source of Vaeldrin\'s research to be a double edged sword.$b$bAfter spending days in that arcanic oubliette, I am beginning to think she might not have been wrong.', 57747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zao has become corrupted too! Please, fight him with dignity...', '', 57746, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lorekeeper Vaeldrin insists he can find the Pools of Youth.$b$bShould we succeed, imagine what that would do for our people. To be immortal again...', 57745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The trees here are more beautiful than any I have seen in my travels.', 57744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You addled goose, that\'s me! Who do you think you\'re talking to!?', 57743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who are you looking for? Give me your map there and I\'ll mark it for you.', 57742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farmer Fung lives just north of town, right near the water tower.$B$BI know him well, unfortunately.', 57741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you at the ruins of the Lost Dynasty, $p.', 57740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does everyone live?', 'Where does everyone live?', 57739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Fish Fellreed live?', 'Where does Fish Fellreed live?', 57738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can\'t find someone? Well only three possible places a person can be.$B$BEither they\'re here at the market, or they\'re at their own house for the day, or they\'re at Sunsong Ranch.$B$BIf you don\'t see them at any of those places, you might need your eyes checked!', 57737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh Jogu...he\'s probably passed out behind the still. Just go a few yards to the south to the watering hole and you can\'t miss him.$B$BHe came wandering through town a while back and hasn\'t ever left.$B$BThe locals love him. He\'s got quite the knack for predicting the harvest.', 57736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sister lives with my father in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands, just east of the big ol\' crane statue.$B$BI like to see my sister now and then, but she\'s usually too busy making herself look pretty for the next farmboy to pass through these parts.', 57735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father lives in his farmhouse in the middle of the farmlands. He\'s just east of the big ol\' crane statue.$B$BHe owns almost all the fertile land in the valley, and he never lets anyone forget it.$B$BThat\'s why I left home, you know. He thinks he owns everything...and everyone.', 57734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh Fish? That sweet girl lives up at the docks to the north.$B$BI\'ve known that girl since she was a little\'un.$B$BShe\'s always digging in mud or swimmng in the lake or jumping off trees. Her parents sure named her right, cuz she\'s as slippery as a fish.', 57732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That strange girl Sho\'s been hanging around up the mountain.$B$BNo one knows where she comes from, but she\'s trained in the assassin\'s arts.$B$BJust showed up one day to help us with our hozen problem. Nice girl, but she don\'t talk much.', 57731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Chee Chee\'s got his own farm to the northwest, just up the mountain some.$B$BThat poor fella\'s been plagued by one ill turn after another.', 57730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Old Hillpaw lives up on the rise to the northwest. His farm is just south of the mountain.$B$BPoor old man\'s shut everyone out since his son died.', 57729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ella lives at the very western end of the farmlands, just north of the Stormstout Brewery.$B$BShe\'s been living alone since her parents died, poor thing.', 57728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t find someone. Help!', 'I can\'t find someone. Help!', 57727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Jogu live?', 'Where does Jogu live?', 57726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Farmer Fung live?', 'Where does Farmer Fung live?', 57725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Gina Mudclaw live?', 'Where does Gina Mudclaw live?', 57724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Tina Mudclaw live?', 'Where does Tina Mudclaw live?', 57723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Haohan Mudclaw live?', 'Where does Haohan Mudclaw live?', 57722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Chee Chee live?', 'Where does Chee Chee live?', 57721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Sho live?', 'Where does Sho live?', 57720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Old Hillpaw live?', 'Where does Old Hillpaw live?', 57719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where does Ella live?', 'Where does Ella live?', 57718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can tell you where everyone in this town lives. Who are you looking for?', 57717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve rigged the powder barrels in every ship.', 'We\'ve rigged the powder barrels in every ship.', 57716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna turn this place into a sinkhole, heh.', '', 57715, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 30625, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me what you got, Blanche!', 'Show me what you got, Blanche!', 57714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Blanche shouts over the commotion of the storm.>$B$BYou made it! The boiler and the brewkegs are in place... now all we need is Mother Nature to work her magic.$B$BWhat do you say? Are you ready for some fireworks?', 57713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome. We\'ll hold just a few seconds to see if anyone else is coming along.', '', 57712, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Working all day in the fields works up a big appetite.$B$BYou didn\'t hear it from me, but most o\' the folk here can eat a woman out of a market stall.$B$BMost everyone has a favorite dish. If you\'ve got any cooking skill, they\'ll be hankering to try your dishes.', 57711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where can you find gifts? Have you tried looking around the fields?$B$BYou never know what you can run across around these farms.$B$BMaybe you\'ll even dig something up on your own land!', 57710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know what they say - help your neighbors and your neighbors will help you.$B$BSure, you can help \'em out with chores now and then, but gifts make faster friends, don\'tcha think?', 57709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know what I have a craving for? A good bowl of Swirling Mist Soup. That would sure taste good right now.', 57708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Many beautiful flowers grow around here, but my favorite is the Marsh Lily. Unfortunately, those gorgeous blooms are rare to find.', 57707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should give beautiful flowers to beautiful ladies. Like me.', 57706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who doesn\'t like receiving a gift?$B$BMe - I love flowers.', 57705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s there to know? You like somebody, you give them something they like.', 57704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can you tell me about gifts?', 'What can you tell me about gifts?', 57703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you need something? I\'m a little... busy.$B$B<Koro tightens his grip on the wriggling saurok\'s neck.>', '', 57702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You here to buy or sell, stranger? Feel free to look around.', 57701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well don\'t just stand there, stranger! You got any gossip for me?', 57700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Looking for food and brew, stranger? We\'ve got it right here at Halfhill Market.', 57699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come to the right place, stranger! Halfhill Market\'s got everything you need.', 57698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, what\'s it gonna be, stranger? I\'ve got a market to run.', 57697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ash can get me back to the Incursion. Please, $p, bring those poisoned blades.', 57696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been an asset to Stoneplow, $n. We may call upon you again in the future. Until then, you should speak with our flight master. He will take you wherever you need to go... free of charge.', '', 57695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They... came out of nowhere. Ambush.', 57694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ash nuzzles Sentinel Commander Lyalia.', '', 57693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmmm, did you make thish yourself? It\'sh just what I wanted, thank you!', '', 57692, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Sauteed Carrots! My favorite!', '', 57691, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh...these flowersh remind me of home.', '', 57690, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sh a feather. Sho bootiful. Thank you...hic!', '', 57689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sh a nice kitty, just like in my lasht brew dream...hic!', '', 57688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, a Lovely Apple! Thish must me by lucky day!', '', 57687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ohhhh, pretty! I like it!', '', 57686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I ate a Lovely Apple once. It was delishioush.$B$B<Jogu stares blankly into the distance, as if he\'s lost his train of thought.>', '', 57685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ever heard of Sauteed Carrots? It\'sh my favorite food. I wish I had some right now...hic!', '', 57684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Eternal Blossom Fish is for you.', 'This Eternal Blossom Fish is for you.', 57683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Twin Fish Platter is for you.', 'This Twin Fish Platter is for you.', 57682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Fire Spirit Salmon is for you.', 'This Fire Spirit Salmon is for you.', 57681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Braised Wolf is for you.', 'This Braised Wolf is for you.', 57680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Hozen Stir Fry is for you.', 'This Hozen Stir Fry is for you.', 57679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Charbroiled Tiger Steak is for you.', 'This Charbroiled Tiger Steak is for you.', 57678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Forest Pheasant Roast is for you.', 'This Forest Pheasant Roast is for you.', 57677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These Shrimp Dumplings are for you.', 'These Shrimp Dumplings are for you.', 57676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Swirling Mist Soup is for you.', 'This Swirling Mist Soup is for you.', 57675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Jade Forest Fried Rice is for you.', 'This Jade Forest Fried Rice is for you.', 57674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve changed my mind.', 'I\'ve changed my mind.', 57673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Giftsh? Well here\'s an idea.$B$BYou know what goesh great wid a tasty drink? A tasty shnack.', '', 57672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drinking ain\'t so nice on an empty stomach. Give a jinyu something to eat, eh?', '', 57671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those night elves at their base camp. He\'s looking for trouble, if you ask me.$b$bYou want to join him?', '', 57670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"night elves\" at the place they call \"the Incursion\". He\'s looking for trouble, if you ask me.$b$bYou want to join him?', '', 57669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"tauren\" at Dawnchaser Retreat. He\'s looking for trouble, if you ask me.$b$bYou want to join him?', '', 57668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Bramblestaff boy is down in the wilds, fraternizing with those \"tauren\" at Thunder Cleft. He\'s looking for trouble, if you ask me.$b$bYou want to join him?', '', 57667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think you\'re mistaken, friend. You don\'t have anything that I want.', '', 57666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Lovely Apple is for you.', 'This Lovely Apple is for you.', 57665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Jade Cat is for you.', 'This Jade Cat is for you.', 57664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Marsh Lily is for you.', 'This Marsh Lily is for you.', 57663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Blue Feather is for you.', 'This Blue Feather is for you.', 57662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('This Ruby Shard is for you.', 'This Ruby Shard is for you.', 57661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrhmhmm...do I likesh giftsh? Well yesh, of coursh! Who doesn\'t like giftsh?', '', 57660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you like gifts?', 'Do you like gifts?', 57659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The \"failed\" siege was merely a feint, of course. You didn\'t realize?', '', 57658, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ken-Ken... I think I heard a rumor that he was staying somewhere near the Temple of the Red Crane.$b$bShall I take you there?', '', 57657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ken-Ken... I think I heard a rumor that he was staying in Zhu\'s Watch.$b$bShall I take you there?', '', 57656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go.', 'Let\'s go.', 57655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, I\'ve heard about him. He\'s down at the brewery, right?$b$bI can take you there when you\'re ready.', '', 57654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, I\'ve heard about him. He\'s visiting Halfhill with Mudmug, right?$b$bI can take you there when you\'re ready.', '', 57653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, I\'ve heard about him. He\'s visiting Mudmug\'s Place, right?$b$bI can take you when you\'re ready.', '', 57652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah yes, I\'ve heard about him. He\'s visiting Pang\'s Stead, over in Thunderfoot Fields.$b$bYou ready to go?', '', 57651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to meet up with Kang Bramblestaff.', 'I need to meet up with Kang Bramblestaff.', 57650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to meet up with Ken-Ken, the hozen.', 'I need to meet up with Ken-Ken, the hozen.', 57649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to meet up with Chen Stormstout.', 'I need to meet up with Chen Stormstout.', 57648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need a lift?', '', 57647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buuuuuuuuuurrrppp!', '', 57646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you really called Fish? That\'s an unusual name.', 'Are you really called Fish? That\'s an unusual name.', 57645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t help but notice you from over there. I\'m new in town.', 'I couldn\'t help but notice you from over there. I\'m new in town.', 57644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello Mr. Mudclaw. I don\'t know if you saw me earlier, but I\'m helping Farmer Yoon out on his farm.', 'Hello Mr. Mudclaw. I don\'t know if you saw me earlier, but I\'m helping Farmer Yoon out on his farm.', 57643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello. Nice to meet you.', 'Hello. Nice to meet you.', 57642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello sir. Do you live around here?', 'Hello sir. Do you live around here?', 57641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why hello. I\'m from out of town.', 'Why hello. I\'m from out of town.', 57640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, how\'s it going? I\'m new around here.', 'Hey, how\'s it going? I\'m new around here.', 57639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi! I work with Farmer Yoon down the road. How are you?', 'Hi! I work with Farmer Yoon down the road. How are you?', 57638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, hello?', 'Um, hello?', 57637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Drool dangles down the side of Jogu\'s mouth.>', '', 57636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LYALIA! NOOOOOOOO!', '', 57635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Retreat!', '', 57634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now that we\'re acquaintances, $n, let me give you a tip. Folks \'round here can help spruce up your farm, but you gotta become friends with them first. Make friends by helping them out with daily tasks, or by giving them gifts like the one you just gave me.', 57633, 0, 54164, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, meet me at the Sentinel Basecamp. I must bring my daughter\'s body there. We still have the Water of Youth.', '', 57632, 0, 15263, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lyalia! I am so sorry, my child.', '', 57631, 0, 15263, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Try to untie Lyalia.>', '<Try to untie Lyalia.>', 57630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It... it\'s a trap...', 57629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s |cFFFF0000Weak Spot|r is exposed! Attack it to break his Impervious Carapace!', '', 57628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dang ol\' croc nearly took off my hand!', '', 57627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water spider! Smush him, $p!', '', 57626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' pinched me! Get it, $p!', '', 57625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the tale goes, Zao battled furiously... shooting his arrows high into the sky, until only one sun remained.', '', 57624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blistering heat must have dulled my senses... mirages! All of you!', '', 57623, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27748, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it is not yet over. From what I see, we face the trial of the yaungol. Let me shed some light...', '', 57614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, off with you! I require meditation before I begin the restoration ritual.', '', 57613, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, heroes. You have given peace to this sacred temple.', '', 57612, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zao was a true champion of our people, how sad it is to see his story tainted by the sha. I am relieved to see justice served to his memory.', '', 57611, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fires, they are burning the library! Please, heroes! Purge this evil before the temple crumbles to ash!', '', 57610, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I reckon we got enough.', '', 57609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31004, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crops wilted, villages burned, and families wandered endlessly to seek refuge from the flames...', '', 57608, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('According to the legend, long ago, there were five suns that burned brightly in the sky. When the winds blew, their intense heat caused great wildfires.', '', 57607, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, heroes. I...', '', 57606, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my. If I am not mistaken, it appears that the tale of Zao Sunseeker has come to life before us.', '', 57605, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I beseech you, kind strangers. Cleanse this place of their foul presence! Lay our stories to rest!', '', 57604, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 30889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFFFE9A2EKrik\'thik Swarm Bringer|r reinforcements join the battle!', '', 57603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFFFE9A2EKrik\'thik Engulfer|r reinforcements appear above!', '', 57602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The |cFFFE9A2EKrik\'thik Protectorate|r reinforcements appear!', '', 57601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready to go water-huntin\'?', '', 57600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to go, Mudmug.', 'I\'m ready to go, Mudmug.', 57599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s head out into that glade. Look for dark, swirling pools of water... that\'ll be the good stuff.', '', 57598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks! Shall we make our way off this miserable little island?', '', 57597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sunreavers will not be pleased. Mark my words, we\'re not an organization to be taken lightly.', '', 57596, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll bet that Chen never made no croc-belly-water beer.', '', 57595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Holy smokes, this fella swallowed a lot of water. I oughta pick some up.', '', 57594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll just scrape some of this water from his little spider mouth-parts. A little bit o\' poison never hurt no one, right?', '', 57593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like he\'s got a little bit o\' that water stuck in his gills. I\'ll just scoop some of this up...', '', 57592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crap!', '', 57591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hot damn!', '', 57590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch!', '', 57589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should be the last of it.', '', 57588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now this is what I\'m talkin\' about! Ain\'t no spiders or crabs in this water.', '', 57587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30992, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This water seems a little too... what\'s that word? Oh yeah, clean.', '', 57586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see here...', '', 57585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy howdy! Look at this pretty little pool!', '', 57584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\'s a little funny about this here water...', '', 57583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30988, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This water looks pretty good over here.', '', 57582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30987, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Captain of the Guard upstairs, Hedric Evencane, should posses a key. Please, make haste. We do not have all night, you know!', '', 57581, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Leave him shackled.>', '<Leave him shackled.>', 57580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have the shackles key.', 'I don\'t have the shackles key.', 57579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Unlock the shackles.>', '<Unlock the shackles.>', 57578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFF0008E8Rogue:|r <Pick the shackle locks.>', '|cFF0008E8Rogue:|r <Pick the shackle locks.>', 57577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, it\'s about time. Will you free me, or did you have... other ideas?', '', 57576, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, $n! We\'re really good friends.$B$BDon\'t you remember the time that you saved me from that mountain hozen? And then afterward we got drunk and lost our pants?', 57575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey Chef! I gotta ask you...are we friends?', 'Hey Chef! I gotta ask you...are we friends?', 57573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing like a fresh harvest of vegetables for your soup.', '', 57572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from the sabotaged tank before it blows!', '', 57568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '', 57567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '', 57566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '', 57565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('4...', '', 57564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('5...', '', 57563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Father, we need to deal with the Horde scout first.', 57562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These creatures are fascinating. Great fighters. Though so thin...', '', 57560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $p! I was searching for the Hidden Master when I came across this big purple thing with a bunch of little purple things inside.$b$bLooks like an old mogu magic trap. Thankfully they don\'t know how to build these anymore.', '', 57559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You saved the lives of my sentinels, hero. You have my everlasting gratitude. Now we can continue with our mission.', 57558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For all of its dangers, this land is a hunter\'s paradise.', 57557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tyrande hand picked me for this mission.$b$BShe said it was because of her visions but I am guessing it was because my father was the one who talked her in to approving the mission.', 57556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This jungle is nice and humid compared to the arid deserts of Uldum.', 57555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something about this land seems to be affecting our squad\'s morale.', 57554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My sentinels have faced far worse than this jungle has to offer.', 57553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My father is here for the Pools of Youth. I\'m here at Tyrande Whisperwind\'s command.', 57552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Out for the day at Halfhill Market.\n\n- Ella', 57549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Went to Halfhill Market. Please show yourselves out.\n\n- Old Hillpaw', '', 57548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<<Event: Lorekeeper Vaeldrin drinks the potion and transfers his life essence to all npcs around him>>', '', 57547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('M A r c K e T.\n\n- Chee Chee', '', 57546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you find this note, then I am either dead or at Halfhill Market.$B$BHopefully I have temporarily left my post to enjoy a hot mug of ale in town. Perhaps you should go check, just in case.$B$BIf indeed I have failed my mission, please send my love and effects to my family in Zhu\'s Watch.\n\n- Sho', 57545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Took the fish to market. See you at Halfhill!\n\n- Fish', 57544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Snuck out while my dad wasn\'t looking. Find me at Halfhill Market!\n\n- Tina Mudclaw', 57543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gone to the market. For official Tiller\'s Union business, please find me at Halfhill Market. Otherwise, Mung-Mung can take care of any needs.\n\n- Haohan Mudclaw', '', 57542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look for the shackles around the edges of the oubliette. There should be three.', '', 57541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $r! Well timed indeed.$b$bWe had not expected to find anyone from the Alliance in this land.', '', 57540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My daughter Lyalia would have me spend the rest of my days cleaning a temple.$b$bBah! I have never felt so alive as when I chose to step through the portal to this strange and beautiful land.', '', 57539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used to live only for the pursuit of knowledge.$b$bNow I spend every waking hour searching for a way for our people to rekindle our lost immortality.', '', 57538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Pools of Youth were an ancient fable my grandsires told me long ago. Now this old man intends to find them!', '', 57537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I\'ll just add this to the stew. We were short on meat anyways.', '', 57535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lets out a pitiful wail.', '', 57533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww shucks. At this rate, I\'ll never get to join the Tiller\'s Union. Well, let me know if you ever change your mind.', '', 57532, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Together, we\'ll work until we join the Tiller\'s Union!', '', 57531, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No thanks, I\'ll be on my way.', 'No thanks, I\'ll be on my way.', 57530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help you, Farmer Yoon.', 'I\'ll help you, Farmer Yoon.', 57529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two days, tops!', '', 57528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I give \'im five days.', '', 57527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, do I hear someone outside?', '', 57526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never say never, my grandpa always said. I\'m going to give it my best shot.', '', 57525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('B-but it\'s my family farm. I can\'t just sell it.', '', 57524, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Besides, once I\'ve gotten the hang of this, I want to be a Tiller like the rest of you!', '', 57523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yessir! My grandfather left me this farm. Just moved in the other day. Nice to meet you, neighbor!', '', 57522, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are THE Haohan Mudclaw, right? Head of the Tiller\'s Union? They are the master farmers in all of Pandaria!', '', 57521, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You? Join the Tillers? Ha! You\'d have to prove your farming skills to all five members of our Council. They would never vote for you!', '', 57520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, oh my! Mr. Mudclaw! I didn\'t expect such an important visitor.', '', 57519, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on boys, let\'s leave him to his \"farming.\"  Ho ho ho!', '', 57518, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wager you won\'t last a week.', '', 57517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pshaw, sell me your land and I\'ll save you the trouble.', '', 57516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do as you please, city boy, but I wager you won\'t last a week. I mean, just look at this dump!', '', 57515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You even know how to run a farm? Know what, I\'ll save you the trouble. Sell me this here piece of land and go back where you came from.', '', 57514, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get one thing straight. You may be Old Yoon\'s cub, but you\'re still a citypaw.', '', 57513, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you\'ve taken over the ranch for good, eh?', '', 57512, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, Yoon! Come out here!', '', 57511, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farming is much harder than it looks.', '', 57510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then perhaps his deeds will be so great that history will remember it as a bull\'s name.', '', 57509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, but I have a girl\'s name.', 'Thanks, but I have a girl\'s name.', 57508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! The young one on my chest is named \"Kor\", for my oldest friend.$b$bAnd this young champion on my back is named \"$p\", for his savior.', '', 57507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you named the twins?', 'Have you named the twins?', 57506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren are a noble race, and one that I am willing to fight alongside.', '', 57505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We live, we fight, we die. The tricky part is finding a reason to do each of those.', '', 57504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find me in my house if you need me.', '', 57503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take over for me... uh... what\'s your name? $n? Thank you, $n. I need a break.', '', 57502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, meet me at Dawnchaser Retreat. I must see to my brother\'s remains, and then we must deal with this mantid threat.', '', 57501, 0, 13896, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kor, why did you do this? Vengeance is not worth dying over.', '', 57500, 0, 13896, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Farmer Yoon wipes his brow wearily.>$B$BThis is hopeless! I\'ll never move these rocks!', '', 57499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings $p. The waters foretold of your arrival. Unfortunately they didn\'t foretell of the raiders hitting us so hard.$b$bI am Waterspeaker Tired Shushen. Welcome to Fallsong.', '', 57498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Crane Temple usually comes to our defense and keeps the raiders at bay. But lately they have been quiet.', '', 57497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These raiders stole the cloths off our dead, the trinkets out of our homes, and the ingots out of our forge. What sort of behavior is that?', '', 57496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m confused as to how these raiders are constantly able to assail us no matter how many of them we kill.', '', 57495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face these \"mantid\" $p and we\'ll continue our assault on the Mogu. With luck, we should join you shortly.', '', 57494, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our envoy was making for the Crane Temple when the mogu ambushed us.', '', 57493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My thanks, stranger.', 'My thanks, stranger.', 57492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu ambushed us while we were trying to retreat from the mantid.', 'The mogu ambushed us while we were trying to retreat from the mantid.', 57491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must get to Stoneplow! The mantid will attack soon.', 'I must get to Stoneplow! The mantid will attack soon.', 57490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, hero.', 'Thank you, hero.', 57489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since meeting you I have fought legends and seen countless wonders.', '', 57488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shado-Pan are legendary. Their force is unmatched in Pandaria.', '', 57487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mantid?! I always thought they were a spooky legend pandaren tell their children.', '', 57486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Between mantid, soren, mogu, fever, and countless beasts of this jungle, I refuse to let my children out of my sight.', '', 57485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These pandaren are skilled warriors despite being civilians.', '', 57484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss Leza.', '', 57483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were heading west when we received word of the mantid attack and redirected here.', '', 57482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
