('What is the Sky Race? Why, only the greatest test of a Serpent Rider\'s skill!', '', 57415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi there!$B$BYou\'ll need a few more seasons behind you before joining us. Hope to see you soon!', 57414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, perhaps you too can aspire to become a serpent rider.', '', 57413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, I am too busy to speak to strangers.', 57412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, kid. Riding\'s not as hard as it looks.$B$BYou should get a few more notches on your belt before attempting this, though.', '', 57411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, another admirer! My reputation precedes me, I\'m sure.$B$BDon\'t worry, someday perhaps you and I will ride together.', '', 57410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are rough, untested, unranked. You fly alone.$B$BIf you wish to change this, speak to Elder Anli to the west.', 57409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is no experience quite like riding on the back of a war serpent.', 57408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to The Arboretum, traveler.$B$BThis is the home of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. Together with our cloud serpents, we are sworn to defend The Jade Forest.$B$BYou, too, can join our ranks. However, you need more experience before you can begin the journey.$B$BGo and travel the land, then return to me when you are stronger.', 57407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new student?$B$BYes, of course.$B$BYou come to me all bright-eyed and bob-tailed, thinking to take home a the great cloud serpent of the east.$B$BWell, you should consider the journey carefully.$B$BIt is not an easy path to take.$B$BThe Order only accepts students who have the potential to see their training through to the end.', '', 57406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We welcome all who wish to join our ranks, but you need some more experience before you can begin. Please come speak to me later.', '', 57405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak to Elder Anli if you are interested in joining our ranks.', 57404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someday when you have seen more of the world, you should come back and speak to me. I can tell you all about the Serpent Riders.', 57403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someday I hope to improve on our ancient knowledge. Much of it has been lost through the ages.', 57402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you know the history of the Serpent Riders? It is quite an interesting study.', 57401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I spend half my time in the libraries and the other half caring for the hatchlings.', 57400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unless you want to help me clean the nests, you had best let me get back to work.', 57399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The care of a young serpent is a delicate thing.', 57398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the other trainees are such good riders. I hope to be as good as them someday. In the meantime, I just have to keep practicing!', '', 57397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may not be the best rider, but I have the best inventions!', '', 57396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t worry, I\'ll be rooting for you even if you come in last!', 57395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Skill is important, but sometimes it comes down to luck.', 57394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve heard from the other trainees that you can find rare onyx eggs at Windward Isle. I\'ve looked and looked, but I haven\'t found any yet!', 57393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look around for new paths. Sometimes the fastest way is not the most obvious!', 57392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Flying through cloud rings is the best way to pick up speed. Sometimes it\'s worth going out of the way for that boost of speed!', 57391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Try to remember where the checkpoints are located. Once you know where to pick up the flags, you can chart the shortest course.', 57390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you need any help, just ask me!', 57389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi! How are you?', 57388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an honor to ride with you.', '', 57387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other trainees have their skills and talents. I am honored to ride with them.', '', 57386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn from the masters. I have nothing to teach you, for I am but a student.', '', 57385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why am I so fast? If I tell you, I would only be disadvantaging myself.', '', 57384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can tell you my tricks for riding, but they are nothing compared to your own practice and experience.', '', 57383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The best experience is one\'s own.', '', 57382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t you be practicing?', '', 57381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A studious rider is a successful rider.', '', 57380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I don\'t work hard, I will fall behind.', 57379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh yeah, I\'ve brought plenty of onyx eggs to Elder Anli. Whenever I give her one, I rise higher in the ranks of the Order.', 57378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I won\'t beat the others by standing around talking to you.', 57377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wish to race against me? Ha! You\'ll be seeing the back of my serpent\'s tail.', 57376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The only one I\'m worried about is Qua-Ro. He always has some trick up his sleeve.', 57375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not worried about my competition. Because I know I will win.', 57374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Could you come back later? I am busy training my cloud serpent right now. I must work harder if I wish to beat the others.', 57373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t talk right now. I\'m very busy.', 57372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta eat well to keep up your strength! That\'s what my mama always told me, anyway...', '', 57371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you know that you can sometimes find rare onyx eggs on Windward Isle? If you bring one to a Serpent Master, you will gain great respect within the Order.', '', 57370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have an idea for a new invention. It\'s called a pooper hooper. I\'ll never have to pick up poop again!', '', 57369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I get sad about losing, I eat...', '', 57368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may not be the best rider, but I have the best inventions!', '', 57367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, I can\'t talk right now. After we\'re done training here, it\'s time for lunch!', '', 57366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, are you here from my fan club? I\'m sorry, I\'m not giving autographs right now.', '', 57365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey rookie, when you\'re at Windward Isle, keep your eyes open for onyx eggs. The Serpent Masters\'ll go nuts if you bring one to them.', '', 57364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After this, me and some of the boys are going to visit The Dancing Serpent Inn for some brew.', '', 57363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, how youuu doing?', '', 57362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you\'re here to admire my serpent. Oh, and Agara is quite impressive too.', '', 57361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been told that I\'m the best-looking rider in the skies. I wouldn\'t believe that if I were you. I\'m also the best-looking rider on land, under the sea...well, just about anywhere!', '', 57360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agara makes me look good, just like I make her look good.', '', 57359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My fur, doesn\'t it look good today?', '', 57358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My child is nearly here... everything changes today...', '', 57357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, stand by your wife\'s side. I will protect the tent from invaders.', 'Go, stand by your wife\'s side. I will protect the tent from invaders.', 57356, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fly together with honor and courage. Now... rise as a serpent rider!', 57355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the Riders behind me, and my serpent beside me.', 'With the Riders behind me, and my serpent beside me.', 57354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never again will you fly alone.', 57353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through wind and tide, we fly together.', 57352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through sea and sky, we fly together.', 57351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through thunder and storm, we fly together.', '', 57350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, you forge an eternal bond with your cloud serpent.', 57349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Today, your journey toward the Order of the Cloud Serpent ends. Today, a new rider joins our ranks.', 57348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GAAAHHH!', 57347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEZA!!', '', 57346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leza!', '', 57345, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My love... whatever happens... you must protect our... our child....', 57344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here, Leza.', '', 57343, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dezco, where are you?!', 57342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Something\'s wrong. The baby\'s turned the wrong way.', 57341, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dezco... it hurts... it... AAAHHH!', 57340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are right, $p. I should be there for Leza. Thank you.', '', 57339, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have given much of your time, patience, and love, $n. Behold your serpent now.', 57338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instructor Windblade, how is my serpent doing?', 'Instructor Windblade, how is my serpent doing?', 57337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, meet me back at Thunder Cleft. I must bring my brother\'s body back to our people.', '', 57336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you at Thunder Cleft, $p. May the sun\'s light protect you.', '', 57335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instructor Windblade, could you call my serpent again?', 'Instructor Windblade, could you call my serpent again?', 57333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good, that was good. You can rest now. I will get you some more hot water.', 57332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GAAAAAAHHH!', 57331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AAAHHH! HNNNH!', 57330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Push!', 57329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s nods.', 57328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alright, Leza, I need you to push. Are you ready?', 57327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The path of the cloud serpent rider is long and arduous, but you will travel it together with your cloud serpent companion.$B$BIf you reach the end of the road together, you will have a loyal friend who will carry you to the end of your days.', 57324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Young serpents are much more playful than their adult counterparts.', 57323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A young serpent is a delicate thing. This is the time when bad habits form. Good training makes a difference.', 57322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye for saving me, $p! I owe ya a big one.', '', 57321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You show much promise, $n, but you must nurture your talent with discipline.', 57320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent thought that the food was delicious.', 'Your serpent thought that the food was delicious.', 57319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent nudges you affectionately before digging in.', 'Your serpent nudges you affectionately before digging in.', 57318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent\'s belly looks a little rounder.', 'Your serpent\'s belly looks a little rounder.', 57317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent looks at you imploringly. Is there more?', 'Your serpent looks at you imploringly. Is there more?', 57316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent licks its lips. That was delicious!', 'Your serpent licks its lips. That was delicious!', 57315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, another one eh? $p, kite him toward the back o\' the cave so I can snipe him.', '', 57314, 0, 13765, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent eats the food and looks around for more.', 'Your serpent eats the food and looks around for more.', 57313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent gulps down the food. Yum!', 'Your serpent gulps down the food. Yum!', 57312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your serpent gobbles up the food hungrily.', 'Your serpent gobbles up the food hungrily.', 57311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! Nesingwary and Nesingwary are waiting for you at the Torjari Pit.', '', 57310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me at the Torjari Pit once you have the carcasses, $p.', '', 57309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To the fastest riders go the prizes of victory! Mount your cloud serpents!', 57308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was Leza\'s visions that led us here. Each of us have had dreams of a valley, golden with blossoms, filled with the hope of peace.$b$bEven our chieftan Baine Bloodhoof had these dreams.$b$bOnly Leza\'s visions gave us a path to follow, though. And now, here we are, for better or worse.', '', 57307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is happening inside the tent?', 'What is happening inside the tent?', 57306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were called.$b$bWe sailed deep into uncharted waters, at first on orders from High Chieftan Baine Bloodhoof.$b$bIt was my wife Leza whose visions gave us a course to sail by.$b$BBut when we saw the wall of mists, we all began to feel the call like a voice on the wind. North. The voice calls for us to travel north.$b$bWe came ashore, dismantled our ship, and sailed up river by canoe until we hit the cliff you see before us.', '', 57305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get here?', 'How did you get here?', 57304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want to start the encounter?', 'Do you want to start the encounter?', 57303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to pass through all 10 checkpoints before completing the racecourse!', 'You need to pass through all 10 checkpoints before completing the racecourse!', 57302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n6TH PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n6TH PLACE!', 57301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n5TH PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n5TH PLACE!', 57300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n4TH PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n4TH PLACE!', 57299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n3RD PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n3RD PLACE!', 57298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n2ND PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n2ND PLACE!', 57297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You finished in...\n...\n1ST PLACE!', 'You finished in...\n...\n1ST PLACE!', 57296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GO!!!!', 'GO!!!!', 57295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GO! To the skies!', 57294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '1...', 57293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '2...', 57292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '3...', 57291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rules are simple. Pass through all 10 checkpoints and cross the finish line.', 57290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Contestants to the starting line! The Sky Race is about to begin!', 57289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your serpent is arriving now. You can find the flags hanging from the red hot air balloons in the sky.', 57288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are your trophies shrinking, Pop? Or are you hunting smaller game?', '', 57287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now... THAT is a trophy.', '', 57286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quality over quantity my boy.', '', 57285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new land, and you want to hunt boring old wolves?', '', 57284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I canna\' believe I made myself the bait for a trap. Lucky for me you an\' me Pop were there.', '', 57283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $p! I\'ll never forget the help ya gave me savin\' my boy. Now that was a proper hunt!', '', 57282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spread among the spires are 10 hot air balloons, or checkpoints. We are passing one just now.', 57281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You got any other errands you need to run? Don\'t you worry about ol\' Mudmug... just poke me when we get there.', '', 57280, 0, 13774, 0, 65, 0, 31008, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is coming...', '', 57279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love ya too, son. Now let\'s go get us a pint!', '', 57278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, you were right. You did put \"BIG\" into \"big game hunting\". You done me proud son!', '', 57277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junior! You\'re okay!', '', 57276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li? Is that you? Hello? Anybody gonna pay attention to ol\' Mudmug?', '', 57275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Was that a hozen I heared? Are we in Halfhill yet?', '', 57274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where you takin\' me, $p?', '', 57273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who\'s that guy? The guy you were talkin\' to? Can someone tell me what\'s goin\' on?', '', 57272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are we? Smells like... like carrots and turds.', '', 57271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something tells Ken-Ken that\'s not the last of the sads, though...', '', 57270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now, I must direct my attention to rebuilding the village. There is much to be done. You may rest here if you like, but we\'ll not accept any more help.', '', 57269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should you ever need aid of any kind, from a handful of turnip seeds to a volley of arrows, know that Zhu\'s Watch will provide it.', '', 57268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am shamed beyond comprehension. Please forgive me - my mind was not my own.', '', 57267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p... To think you\'d risked your life to save me - twice now - and I\'d only treated you with disdain.', '', 57266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We did it, $p! That was some good butt-punchin\' back there!', '', 57265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You chose the wrong hunter to hunt! $p, kite that thing a little further away so I can get a better shot.', '', 57264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, watch the corners. I hear something comin\'.', '', 57263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Try shaking Hemet.>', '<Try shaking Hemet.>', 57262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master comes.', '', 57260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p is coming. They can help us get you out of here.', '', 57259, 0, 13772, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on boy, you\'re stronger \'an this thing.', '', 57258, 0, 13772, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junior! Junior! Snap out of it.', '', 57257, 0, 13772, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junior! Junior! Snap out of it.', '', 57256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love ya pop.', '', 57255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry I made such a mess o\' things.', '', 57254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... what... who? How did I get here?', '', 57253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are too far! Get closer to your Instructor!', 57252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In a real race, you will need to fly through each checkered flag to get credit for passing the checkpoint.', 57251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must fly through all 10 checkpoints before you can finish the race.', 57250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak to me when you are ready to try again.', 57249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You must keep up with me, $n. Venture too far and you will fail the exercise.', 57248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You fell too far behind!', 57247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n.', 57246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re almost done. Just the homestretch now!', 57245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PH Random 8', 57244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PH Random 7', 57243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PH Random 6', 57242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PH Random 5', 57241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'PH Random 4', 57240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When you are on your own, your enemies will not be as kind as I.', 57239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stay with me, $n.', 57238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you undergo these trials, you and your serpent will strengthen your bond.', 57237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see the hanging pennants above our heads? These flags mark the race course. If you ever get lost, you can use these flags as a guide.', 57236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will guide you with this rope. If you get too far away from me, it will break and I will be forced to restart the exercise.', 57235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you start to get too far, I will warn you. If you continue to stray, I will not hesitate to fail you.', 57234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will gain speed as the exercise continues. Try to keep up.', 57233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! Are you okay? Wake up!', '', 57232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on! We need to save my boy!', '', 57231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junior! Nooooo!', '', 57230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, resorting to hocus pocus now are ya?', '', 57229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master calls.', '', 57228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step two: say the words. \"Heed my call, waters of pain, and bring forth, Torjari\'s Bane!\"', '', 57227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step one: dance.', '', 57226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll see, Pop. I\'m gonna bag me a big one.', '', 57225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s see if this ol\' ritual will work.', '', 57224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will teach you the rules of this race. Follow me!', 57223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Students of our Order test their speed in an aerial competition known as the Sky Race.', 57222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$GHe\'s:She\'s; coming to!', '', 57221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yi-Mo will be fine for right now, we gotta take care of these nasties first!', '', 57220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand solo against a yeti with nothing but a bowie knife while wearing a loincloth and you\'ll earn yourself the title of \"lucky\" as well.', '', 57219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall was killed! Attack Corrupted Slimes to prevent damage to him.', 'Thrall was killed! Attack Corrupted Slimes to prevent damage to him.', 57218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great dedication is necessary to ascend the ranks of the Order of the Cloud Serpent. I wish you luck.', 57217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The journey to becoming a Serpent Master is a difficult one. Are you up for the challenge?', 57216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your serpent is arriving now. Please mount when you are ready.', 57215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instructor Windblade, could you call my serpent again?', 'Instructor Windblade, could you call my serpent again?', 57214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your serpent will arrive in just a moment. Good luck!', 57213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALL IS LOST! LAY DOWN AND SUBMIT TO YOUR DESPAIR!', '', 57212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:105723|h[Elementium Bolt]|h|r killed you.  Move away from the impact point to decrease the bolt\'s damage.', '', 57211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFF0000|Hspell:106794|h[Shrapnel]|h|r killed you! Use |cFF04FC32|Hspell:106466|h[Dream]|h|r to prevent damage.', '', 57210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $p! It\'s been a while since we shared a proper hunt, now hasn\'t it. Let\'s see if time has softened yer aim.', '', 57209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me pop n\' I are on a genuine safari. This is a strange, new land filled with dangers around every turn, monsters pokin\' out of every hole, and beasts as ol\' as the dirt itself livin\' life without fear.$b$bIt\'s huntin\' season!', '', 57208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, no more time. Yi-Mo needs help now! Let\'s get a mask on him!', '', 57207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the... Sha nasties are poppin\' out everywhere! We gotta take care of them first!', '', 57206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A $c? Here? And a Horde no less.$b$bWe could make good use of you if you are willing to help.$b$bWe followed visions and dreams to get here only to find a nightmare waiting for us.', '', 57205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m part of the Nesingwary Safari. We were riding along in our hot air balloon through some mists when we came across this land.$b$bNesingwary and his boy wanted to hunt some of the hoofed animals and what not up north.$b$bI decided to get a headstart on them in the jungle where the real beasts are.$b$bA rocket ride later I\'m neck deep in tigers.', 57202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you get here?', 'How did you get here?', 57201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The rest of Nesingwary\'s Safari is up in the western side of the Valley of Four Winds. If you find yourself heading west, you should join us. Good hunting!', 57200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I punched him so hard his ancestors felt it.', '', 57199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Face the wrath of the Bramblestaff!', '', 57198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory is mine!', '', 57197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $p!', '', 57196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bow before our might!', '', 57195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind were made to be ruled.', '', 57194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avert your eyes, peasant!', '', 57193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Thunder King!', '', 57192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your kind is no match for the return of our Thunder King!', '', 57191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will rise again, and your kind will be made to serve!', '', 57190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel supplicant!', '', 57189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry, your hatchling\'s got it!', '', 57188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hatchling wants to catch this one!', '', 57187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your hatchling chases after the ball!', '', 57186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sadness in the earth is quelling the gifts granted me by the light.$b$bMy wife, she is suffering, and none of my abilities are able to help her.', '', 57185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This jungle is filled with an unnatural sense of despair.', '', 57184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch the skies for Alliance eyes. I will see you back at Thunder Cleft. Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you.', '', 57183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay away! We no know what it can do!', '', 57182, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('False carrot alert! False carrot alert!', '', 57181, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It horrible!', '', 57180, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run away! Run away!', '', 57179, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from it!', '', 57178, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gross!', '', 57177, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yuck!', '', 57176, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I confused!', '', 57175, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We been duped!', '', 57174, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, we been tricked!', '', 57173, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah... The Fearless... sounds good.', '', 57172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it... is it gone?', '', 57171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, the hozenity! Get it out of here! Ken-Ken too smart to die!', '', 57170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the ook is that?!', '', 57169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you so much, brave heroes! I will tell stories of you! Of $p the Mighty! And Ken-Ken the Fearless!', 'Thank you so much, brave heroes! I will tell stories of you! Of $p the Mighty! And Ken-Ken the Fearless!', 57168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I feel... happy!', 'I... I feel... happy!', 57167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine... whatever. Hand it over.', 'Fine... whatever. Hand it over.', 57166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sighs deeply.', '%s sighs deeply.', 57165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... what was that stuff? It went through me like bad tea.', 'Ugh... what was that stuff? It went through me like bad tea.', 57164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perfect! C\'mere, buddy. Sorry about last time! Put this on.', '', 57163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nobody can be sad when they wearin\' a mask like this! Now, who can we test it on?', '', 57162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Faster, you fools. We need all of these artifacts soon or it\'s the cane for your hides.', '', 57161, 0, 13743, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO!', '', 57160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ughh... urrrggg....', '', 57159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahaha! It worked! Ken-Ken KNEW it would work! You feelin\' better now?', '', 57158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, drink this.', '', 57157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... ughh... what have you done to me?!', '', 57156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chezin lay dead with grievous wounds both physical and magical.', '', 57155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to pay?', 'Are you sure you want to pay?', 57154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s gut churns violently.', '', 57153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, it\'s not like things could get any worse...', '', 57152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who, me?', '', 57151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! Get over here, mopesy. Ken-Ken got just the thing for you!', '', 57150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, now we need someone to test this on...', '', 57149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my serpent! Could you perform the spirit link once again?', 'I lost my serpent! Could you perform the spirit link once again?', 57148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, a chance to use the skills we\'ve been training for. Who knows what adventure we\'ll find here in the Valley of the Four Winds?', '', 57147, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elders of my village taught me that wisdom flows through every river, and collects in every pond. I can\'t wait to learn what the waters of this place have to offer.$b$bThe elders of my village also taught me that one should never trust a hozen.$b$b<Ashyo shoots a wary glance over at Ken-Ken.>', '', 57146, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beggars and usurpers, we will burn you and your pandaren allies to ash.', '', 57145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! It\'s me! Remember? From the Tian Monastery?$b$bIt took me a while, but I\'ve finally graduated! Xiao, too, and... well, everybody else that you see here.$b$bWe\'re not students anymore. We\'re on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master.', 57144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve just graduated from the Tian Monastery, in the Jade Forest. Have you been there before?$b$bWe\'re not students anymore. We\'re on our first quest - the quest to find the Hidden Master.', 57143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen can learn martial arts too, you know.$b$bKen-Ken better than all these other guys put together. ESPECIALLY better than Clever Ashyo the Dumb Jinyu, over there.', '', 57142, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be one with your serpent, $n. Perceive your serpent\'s experiences as your own and strengthen your bond.', 57141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know that your world will soon follow.', '', 57139, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like you, all of Azeroth shall burn.', '', 57138, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no hope, no future. All life is doomed.', '', 57137, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back, $n! How goes your training?$b$bOur trainees have missed you dearly... though I must say that they appreciate not having to spar with you anymore.', '', 57136, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, $n, we celebrate your graduation. You have learned all that there is to know within the walls of Tian.', '', 57135, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
