('Thank you for bringing back Yi-Mo.$B$BIt\'s clear to me now that we can no longer ignore our duties in the province.', 'Thank you for bringing back Yi-Mo.$B$BIt\'s clear to me now that we can no longer ignore our duties in the province.', 56989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
