('', 'Should I run?', 56987, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mei, do you have any idea where I can find salt around here?', 'Mei, do you have any idea where I can find salt around here?', 56986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Umm... he\'s coming right at me.', 56985, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Sha are too many, we must flee while we still have the chance!', 'The Sha are too many, we must flee while we still have the chance!', 56984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Priestess Flameheart has betrayed us! The temple is lost!', 'Priestess Flameheart has betrayed us! The temple is lost!', 56983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must regroup before the Sha attack again!', 'We must regroup before the Sha attack again!', 56982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready for a brawl, $n?', '', 56981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Crack your knuckles and nod your head.>', '<Crack your knuckles and nod your head.>', 56980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wouldn\'t mind settling down in a place like this. Great views, plenty of beer... and lots of stuff to fight.', '', 56979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mogu have a way about them that implies leadership. Use caution.', '', 56978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hate will blind you, brother, if you let it.', '', 56977, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My orders from Baine were to secure new holdings in this land and investigate the light our sunwalkers felt. The Alliance is of little concern.', '', 56976, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must stay by Leza\'s side until she has given birth. Death can wait for life.', '', 56975, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can only hide behind Leza\'s pain for so long. Sooner or later you must stand as the Sunwalker you claim to be and lead us against the enemies of the horde.', '', 56974, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a subject of the Horde. Remember your obligations and oaths. By the Warchief\'s command we must slay these night elves.', '', 56973, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother, we must look to our defenses. The Alliance are encroaching on us from the east.', '', 56972, 0, 13643, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at that. The little guy left you some purified water.', '', 56971, 0, 13657, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the summit of Wyrmrest Temple to fight Ultraxion and his minions.', 'Take me to the summit of Wyrmrest Temple to fight Ultraxion and his minions.', 56970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unfortunately, our efforts to breed the serpents have been unsuccessful. We carefully take a few eggs from the wild serpents to raise as our own.', '', 56969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you had a chance to visit the Temple of the Jade Serpent? Many of our students are sent to further their training within its walls, under the watchful gaze of Yu\'lon herself.', '', 56968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Na Lek imbues $p with gratitude and returns to the waters of the pool.', '', 56967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The little spirit is helping us! Fight near him, hero!', '', 56966, 0, 13657, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is their natural breeding ground. We must tread carefully.', '', 56965, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve collected so much data on serpents in the wild!', '', 56964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t bathed in sixteen days. It\'s easier to blend in this way.', '', 56963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must be very quiet. The Slitherscale will not hesitate to eat us for dinner.', '', 56962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am only one pandaren, but I must stay here and help the serpents.', '', 56961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhhh! They don\'t know that I\'m hiding here.', '', 56960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guardians! Kill these intruders.', '', 56959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Halt, supplicant! These waters belong to the Thunder King. Your presence is unwelcome.', '', 56958, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This wall of shadow will hold back the demons long enough for us to cross.\n$bWhen you and the other elves have crossed I will follow.', '', 56957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attempt to free Na Lek from his prison.', 'Attempt to free Na Lek from his prison.', 56956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old legends tell of the Dojani Dynasty and their Pools of Youth. Let us see if the legend is true.', '', 56955, 0, 13657, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Join me!', 'Join me!', 56954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you must usher in a new age... The age of mortals.', 'Now you must usher in a new age... The age of mortals.', 56953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26498, 26498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we have achieved the impossible.', '', 56952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26261, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannot be, is it finally over?  I must be dreaming again.', 'This cannot be, is it finally over?  I must be dreaming again.', 56951, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26142, 26142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you at back at camp.', '', 56950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me, dragon.', 'Show me, dragon.', 56949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing\'s destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish.', '', 56948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, my apprentice! You ARE my apprentice, right...?', '', 56947, 0, 13656, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could learn much by watching me in action.', '', 56946, 0, 13656, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would look upon these lands with my own eyes.', '', 56945, 0, 13656, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t stay in town anymore. I must find a fight!', '', 56944, 0, 13656, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please show me, Chromie.', 'Please show me, Chromie.', 56943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can show you the aftermath of Deathwing\'s destruction at the Maelstrom, if you wish.', 56942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel the elements awakening... rejoicing... the Cataclysm... is over.', '', 56941, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dojani Dynasty is remembered for their cruelty. Use caution.', '', 56937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens of Orgrimmar, rejoice! Deathwing is no more! The Cataclysm is over! A band of valiant heroes lashed out at the Destroyer with deadly precision and overwhelming might, granting the Dragon Aspects the opportunity to sacrifice their powers into one final strike. The last remains of Deathwing now reside here in Orgrimmar to serve as a beacon of hope for the future!', '', 56936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Citizens of Stormwind, rejoice! Deathwing is no more! The Cataclysm is over! A band of valiant heroes lashed out at the Destroyer with deadly precision and overwhelming might, granting the Dragon Aspects the opportunity to sacrifice their powers into one final strike. The last remains of Deathwing now reside here in Stormwind to serve as a beacon of hope for the future!', 56935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks for the help friend. If you see Nesingwary and his boy to the west tell them how many things we killed. They like hearing that.', 56934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The horde shall not defile this land!', 56933, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The horde is here?!', 56932, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the Alliance!', 56931, 2, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Un... provoked. The mogu attacked and... everything going dark...', '', 56930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the jungle, $r! Nesingwary dispatched me to gather info on the wildlife down here.$b$bFeel like lending a hand?', 56929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We live together, or we die together. All of Pandaria is connected.', 56928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28584, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When that day comes, seek all the light and wonder of this world, and fight.', 56927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 28583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I saw eyes in the underbrush...', 'I thought I saw eyes in the underbrush...', 56926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly.', 'This is a strange land. So beautiful. And yet so deadly.', 56925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dezco is a great chieftan, though I\'m beginning to doubt how well we can survive in this land he led us to.', 'Dezco is a great chieftan, though I\'m beginning to doubt how well we can survive in this land he led us to.', 56924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I almost prefer the cold bite of Northrend to this appalling soggy heat. It\'s as if the trees themselves are trying to suffocate us.', '', 56923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance to our south, mogu to our east and west, and cliffs to the north. We are hemmed in on all sides.', '', 56922, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We followed Leza\'s visions of the light to this place like moths to a flame.', '', 56921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be Gone.', '', 56920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 26496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $p! These \"sunwalkers\" may not be the Hidden Master, but their fighting style is unlike anything I have ever seen.$b$bI intend to learn from them.', '', 56919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel the call of the Light, far to the north of here. But this place...$b$bIt has not known the light for many, many generations.', '', 56918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, traveller. I had not thought to see a friendly Horde face on these shores.', '', 56917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s has buffed $t!', '%s has buffed $n!', 56916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bell is recharged! Strike it to weaken nearby enemies!', 'The bell is recharged! Strike it to weaken nearby enemies!', 56915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arcane Storage Unit begins to overload. Step back!', '', 56914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sniff \'em out!', 'Sniff \'em out!', 56913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just pick a spot already!', 'Just pick a spot already!', 56912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anytime now...', 'Anytime now...', 56911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve sniffed every inch of this city.', 'You\'ve sniffed every inch of this city.', 56910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would make better rugs!', '', 56909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen cats that are better guards than you!', '', 56908, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on with it!', 'Get on with it!', 56907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lazy mutts!', '', 56906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All these sad pandas making Ken-Ken a sad hozen.', '', 56905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should help Mei.$B$BKen-Ken trying to think of way to cheer up these super-sads.', '', 56904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snake eyes...', 'Snake eyes...', 56903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Double or nothing!', 'Double or nothing!', 56902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ken-Ken met a few pandaren in his time. He tell you something: they NOT sads.$B$BNow, look at this place! Sad, mopey-dopeys sulking around everywhere.$B$BWhere\'s song and dance? Where\'s piles of food?$B$BWhere\'s BOOZE, man?!', '', 56901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lady luck is on my side tonight!', 'Lady luck is on my side tonight!', 56900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cling to a shattered world... Your time comes... soon enough...', 56899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t how it ends. Not for me. I\'m a survivor.', 56898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I need more time!', 56897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got some secrets of my own, rogue.', 56896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'An assassin! Did the little whelpling send you after me? Come, rogue. Let\'s dance.', 56895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There goes the BOOM!', '', 56894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With the loss of my power, the Dragon Soul has returned to its original place in time.', '', 56893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them off! Protect the archers!', '', 56892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please stay out of the gaming area.', 'Please stay out of the gaming area.', 56891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this, Chen.', 'Let\'s do this, Chen.', 56890, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll help.', 'I\'ll help.', 56889, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm down, Mudmug. Let\'s go.', 'Calm down, Mudmug. Let\'s go.', 56888, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t stop now.$B$BYou still have time left to play!', 'Don\'t stop now.$B$BYou still have time left to play!', 56887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormstout!', '', 56886, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 29687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is going on inside this brewery!? Has nobody maintained this place? Where are the brewers?$b$bWhere is my family...?$b$bThey must have gone somewhere. If they were here, then they\'d be cleaning up this mess! For now, looks like it\'s up to you and me, $n. You ready?', '', 56885, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good! Maybe this time, WE can be the barrel-throwing jerks!', 56884, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This guy\'s a little bigger than I thought he\'d be.$b$bYou think it\'s from drinking beer? I know too much beer makes you fat, like Uncle Chen, but I didn\'t think it\'d make you any taller.$b$bEither way, I don\'t think I can take this guy on alone.', 56883, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright! Let\'s go smush that water varmint!', '', 56882, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 30957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You ready to do this? I\'m ready to do this. I\'m fixin\' to make a puddle out of that critter.$b$bIt\'s just... well, I ain\'t much of a bruiser, and I get skeered real easy. You\'re the $c here. You gonna... you gonna protect me, right?', '', 56881, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_arcaneresilience.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:109807|h[Arcane Destruction]|h|r! Activate the pillars to stop her!', 56880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_riposte:20|t%s begins to cast |cFF9900CC|Hspell:109893|h[Arcane Infused Armor]|h|r! Expose her armor!', 56879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_weapon_shortblade_45.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFF9900CC|Hspell:109887|h[Arcane Infused Weapon]|h|r! Avoid her attacks!', 56878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven too difficult to control!', '', 56876, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 26388, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill... they want me to kill you now... oh, why did you have to go and anger them?', '', 56875, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, No! I\'m in control of the voices. They\'re here to help me.', '', 56874, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 26386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s - not true!', '', 56873, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 26385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your highness. I have never tried to conceal what I am from you.', '', 56872, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 26384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My Prince, we should leave this place, in case they come back to finish the job.', '', 56871, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 26383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand upon this disc, $p. Kalecgos approaches!', 56870, 0, 13621, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem prepared.', '', 56869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooo!', '', 56868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we will meet again. I hope we find ourselves on the same side...', '', 56867, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 26472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must go now - disappear.', '', 56866, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new age for mortals has dawned, and heroes like you are among the vanguard.', '', 56865, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done, friend. To my knowledge, I am the only black dragon who remains.', '', 56864, 0, 0, 26, 65, 0, 26469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hero... strike now! Use your newfound power to FINISH HIM.', '', 56863, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 26468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will NEVER be controlled! The Red Dragonflight has no idea what they unleashed when they experimented on my egg.', '', 56862, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what are they telling you now, Fahrad? What do your dark masters whisper?', '', 56861, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 26466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you deny it? The dark visions? The voices in your head?', '', 56860, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 26465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you are a Black Dragon. And you share the corruption of all my brothers and sisters.', '', 56859, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 26464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. You rescued me while I was still within my egg, and I owe you my life.', '', 56858, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 26463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curious weapons you wield... such power.', '', 56857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fahrad! I was just talking about you. The final Black Dragon. The one who\'s been more hidden than any of them.', '', 56856, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champion, you have your reward. But there is one final dragon we need to slay.', '', 56855, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can feel it... As if a dark shadow has been lifted from the land. Dead! My father is dead!', '', 56854, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t give up, thunderbirds! Come back for me!', '', 56853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes sir?', '', 56850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shall we execute him, my prince?', '', 56849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your highness, we caught this beast snooping around the caves just outside the compound.', '', 56848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now then, my new friend. We have much to talk about.', '', 56847, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break his legs.', '', 56846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And Fahrad?', '', 56845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing\'s minions should be afraid of ME. Get him out of here.', '', 56844, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell them that I am free of my father\'s madness, and I will be free of them as well. I am to be left alone: this will be my first and only warning.', '', 56843, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No. I want him to deliver a message to the red dragonflight.', '', 56842, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 26441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t recognize your former prisoner?', '', 56841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
