('But I\'m one-of-a-kind! A black dragon raised free from the taint of my father\'s corruption. And that\'s how I intend to stay: free.', '', 56839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look so surprised! We dragons are conscious, even within our shells. As I grew, I could hear the plotting and scheming. I was to be born a prisoner.', '', 56838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not some trophy for a red dragon\'s mantle-piece, and I\'m never going back.', '', 56837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right, mortal. The prize you seek no longer sleeps within a shell. Here I am: in the flesh.', '', 56836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you live through this... I assure you it will be worth it.', '', 56835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26453, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you intend to play the fool, you may as well look the part.', 56834, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 26025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
