('', 'Umm... guys...', 56704, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30417, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, this burden falls to you once again.', '', 56703, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 25898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think breweries are supposed to make that sound...', '', 56702, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 30980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find out.', '', 56701, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 29713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y\'all think they\'re hidin\' something inside?', '', 56700, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The ritual will take much from us, as it requires a very piece of our being. We will be weakened greatly.', 56699, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 26504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, strange. This door was not here before.', '', 56698, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 29712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Huh! Looks like they\'re closed.', 56697, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent! We will begin the ritual at once!', '', 56696, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not entirely unexpected.', '', 56695, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 25953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Praise the Titans, they have returned!', 56694, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 26145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you could use a hot meal.$B$BWhat can I get for you?', '', 56693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our fighters need nutritious food to keep our enemies at bay!$B$BHurry up and tell me what I can get for you.', '', 56692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As long as the sha stay outside, I\'ll be fine.', 56691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, traveler. Please stay a while and rest.', 56690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you come to observe my class?', 56688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Much of our knowledge of the sha has been lost through time.$B$BWhile the battle continues, I must study their nature.$B$BOnly then can we prevent this from happening again in the future.', 56686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'When the sha attack began, every one of my students ran to battle without hesitation.$B$BI have taught them much, but yet they continue to surpass my expectations.', 56685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gather your courage, $r. Together, we can resist the sha.', 56684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot dwell on the mistakes of the past, $r.$B$BThe only path is forward.', '', 56683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite our efforts to become enlightened beings, we have repeated the mistakes of our past.$B$BThe sha threaten this land once again.', '', 56682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is our land. Our home.$B$BI will not see it fall to the sha.', '', 56681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I seen an enemy such as this.', '', 56680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our serpents are working hard to save the temple.$B$BThey will gladly lend their strength if you require it.', '', 56679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m serious. Benedictus tried to kill Thrall and deliver Azeroth to Deathwing. I saw it with my own eyes.', 'I\'m serious. Benedictus tried to kill Thrall and deliver Azeroth to Deathwing. I saw it with my own eyes.', 56678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually, I saw Benedictus at Wyrmrest. He was the Twilight Prophet.', 'Actually, I saw Benedictus at Wyrmrest. He was the Twilight Prophet.', 56677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mission?', 'A mission?', 56676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rumors, child. Rumors have a way of attaching themselves to people of power. In fact, I recently heard a particularly nasty one about the late lord Bolvar.$b$bI will ask you to spread your lies elsewhere. Return when you are ready to confess your wrongs before the Light.', '', 56675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha hah hah! Benedictus, the Twilight Prophet!$b$bBwa ha ha ha!$b$bOh, that\'s a good one. Hoo-ee.', '', 56674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. He has been called upon to help the aspects with their efforts at Wyrmrest. He wishes to aid them in cleansing Azeroth of Deathwing\'s menace.$b$bMay the Light guide his path.', '', 56673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come to supplicate yourself before the Light? Or perhaps you have come here to train in the holy arts?$b$bIf you are here to speak with Archbishop Benedictus, I am sorry to inform you that he has left on a mission.', '', 56672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last! A challenge! Let us test your mettle, \"champion\".', '', 56671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have no choice.  We must have faith in our allies.', '', 56670, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 25906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense danger...it is a trap...carefully laid for us at this crucial moment.', 56669, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 26147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Then truly, we are lost.', 56668, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 26503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing\'s own power back against him.', '', 56667, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 25905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is no use, the power of the Dragon Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces contained within it may be the doom of us all.', '', 56666, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 25904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions.', '', 56665, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 26266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work.', '', 56664, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 26547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Seriously though, Mudmug. Don\'t be dumb.', 56663, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you there, $n!', '', 56662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, I will put my belly into it...', '', 56661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is this the fastest you can go? Come on, fatsos! Move those legs!', 56660, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30415, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, help me pull this cart.', '', 56659, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ugh! You guys are gonna make me throw up.', 56658, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y-yeah! Beer brothers!', '', 56657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course not! We brewed beer together. That practically makes us brothers.', '', 56656, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 29708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No foolin\'?', '', 56655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It IS a family thing, Mudmug. And I want you to join us.', '', 56654, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 29707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I dunno. This kinda seems like a family thing you\'re doin\'...', '', 56653, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 30976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mudmug, are you coming?', '', 56652, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So long, Halfhill!', 56651, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 30412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward to the Stormstout Brewery!', '', 56650, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 29705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s load these barrels up into the cart, shall we?', '', 56649, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hour of Twilight is nigh; the sun sets on your pitiful mortal existence.', '', 56648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nefarian, Onyxia, Sinestra... they were nothing. Now you face my ultimate creation.', '', 56647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twisting your pitiful whelps into mindless abominations, bent only to my will. It was a very... painful process.', '', 56646, 0, 0, 457, 64, 0, 26361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve gathered up some items from this time period. I hope this helps!', 56645, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Demonic] Amanare maev il azgalada zila ashj ashj zila enkil!', '', 56644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless!', '', 56643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SQUIRM! SCREAM!', '', 56642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall and DIE before me!', '', 56641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This way!', '', 56640, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 26493, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not if we\'re caught up in it! Why weren\'t you running? What have you been doing with your hand in the Well?', '', 56639, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 26492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan! The well is out of control!', '', 56638, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 26491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hush, Tyrande. Where is Illidan?', '', 56637, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 26490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In Azshara\'s name!', '', 56636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A deserved death!', '', 56635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None may cross the Queen!', '', 56634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26138, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve a way out of here, we should probably use it! I\'ve tried casting myself and Tyrande out of here, but the well is too much in flux!', '', 56633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26062, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye. It\'s been twisted and turned by too many spells. The fuss we - especially you - made with the portal was too much! The same spell that sent the Burning Legion back into their foul realm now works on the well! It\'s devouring itself and taking its surroundings with it! Fascinating, isn\'t it?', '', 56632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brother. A timely arrival...', '', 56631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The artifact!', '', 56630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26059, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard the Skyfire.  You ready to chase down the end of the world?', '', 56629, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 26302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is heading to the maelstrom!  We must stop him NOW, we may never get another chance if he escapes into Deepholm.', '', 56628, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 26263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The War Serpent will not travel beyond the Jade Temple Grounds! Return before you are tossed off!', 'The War Serpent will not travel beyond the Jade Temple Grounds! Return before you are tossed off!', 56627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your tenacity is admirable, but pointless. You ride into the jaws of the apocalypse.', '', 56626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26346, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cling while you can, \"heroes.\" You and your world are doomed.', '', 56625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your efforts are insignificant. I carry you to your deaths.', '', 56624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha! I had not realized you fools were still there.', '', 56623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'I do not know who you are, but I thank you. Without your aid, our world would be...I do not wish to think about it. Moon goddess light your path.', 56622, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25991, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By the very edge...', 56621, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25990, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion...', 56620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25989, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about me. Stop the Destroyer! Enshu-falah-nah, dorini.', '', 56619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26291, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The plates! He\'s coming apart! Tear up the plates and we\'ve got a shot at bringing him down!', '', 56618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26290, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not one of you will live to see the final cataclysm! Finish them!', 56617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll not leave this place alive!', 56616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t preen just yet, little pups. We\'ll cleanse this world of your kind.', 56615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even with the Aspect of Time on your side, you stumble foolishly into a trap?', 56614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for a lost companion.', 'I\'m looking for a lost companion.', 56613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. The Dragon Soul is safely within the clutch of the dragonflights.', '', 56610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay by my side, $n. We may have need of one another.', '', 56609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I be of aid, stranger?', 56608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to meet Nozdormu at the End Time.', 'I am ready to meet Nozdormu at the End Time.', 56607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to meet Nozdormu at the End Time.', 'I am ready to meet Nozdormu at the End Time.', 56606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to help Thrall, back in my present time.', 'I am ready to help Thrall, back in my present time.', 56605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n.', 56604, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to travel back in time - to the Well of Eternity.', 'I\'m ready to travel back in time - to the Well of Eternity.', 56603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $n?', '', 56602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you see now, $n, is your distant future. A future where Deathwing, the Twilight\'s Hammer, and the Old Gods that they serve have won. A barren, unchanging wasteland, inhabited only by the echoes of the past.', '', 56601, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Over here! No, down here! I can take you back to the present time, if you want.', 56600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did I miss anything? Oh WOW!', 56599, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such a foolish creature, trying to challenge us.  His rancid corpse will serve as a reminder to the Legion of the power of Illidan Stormrage.\n$bThe shadowcloak\'s magic is fading, concealing us no longer.  It was fun while it lasted, but I prefer a more direct approach to bringing death to my enemy.\n$bYou fought well, but where I\'m heading I need to go alone.', '', 56598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, and good luck.', 'Farewell, and good luck.', 56597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_twilightflamebreath.blp:20|t%s prepares to unleash a |cFF9900CC|Hspell:106401|h[Twilight Onslaught]|h|r!', 56596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in! Nalice has wards that negate my magic, so I won\'t be able to help you from here on out. Go get her!', '', 56595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! Another corrupt dragon obliterated! Soon, none will stand but Deathwing himself...', '', 56594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t fly and be stealthy at the same time.... I tried.', '', 56593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wrathion believes in you. I know you can do this!', '', 56592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe it\'s your gear?', '', 56591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to have to pull out every trick you know in order to get in there.', '', 56590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know, right?', '', 56589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Say what you want. I\'m not moving an inch.', '', 56588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We shall see, $C.', '', 56587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will become legend.', 'We will become legend.', 56586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are either mad, foolhardy, or a hero worthy of being called legend. Which one are you?', '', 56585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terminate $ghim:her;.', 'Dirty sneak. You will be destroyed!', 56584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool!', 'You\'re not so clever, assassin.', 56583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I humbly request that the Dragon Aspects provide no aid to myself and my fellow adventurers. They should worry about their own problems, and we will worry about ours.', 'I humbly request that the Dragon Aspects provide no aid to myself and my fellow adventurers. They should worry about their own problems, and we will worry about ours.', 56582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to move quickly! Tyrygosa and her guard have fallen, leaving the temple defenseless. Deathwing\'s forces must never reach the Dragon Soul or all is lost. The Wyrmrest Accord will aid you in the assault; the siege must be broken!', '', 56581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why won\'t you give up?!', 56580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25926, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A little ice ought to quench the fire in your hearts...', 56579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25925, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps this will cool your heads...', 56578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25924, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wish you\'d surrendered.', 56577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t want to do that.', 56576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You forced my hand.', 56575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand, now. Farewell, and good luck.', 56574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t know who you are, but I\'ll defend this shrine with my life. Leave, now, before we come to blows.', 56573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate resorting to violence.', 56572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to survey the land.', 'Ready to survey the land.', 56571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope to see you back from this mission alive. But if I do not, I want to say I\'ve enjoyed seeing you work. You\'re a credit to your race. Good luck.', '', 56570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26456, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her name is \"Nalice.\" And until recently she stood at Wyrmrest Temple as the representative of the black dragonflight. Now? She\'s on the run.', '', 56569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26455, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The gems you collected will be able to augment the power of the weapons I gave you, but I require another ingredient.  It will come from your next target.', '', 56568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26454, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s surrounded herself with a small army of deranged dragon cultists. They may not by right in the head, but they\'re well-armed. And dangerous.', '', 56567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26381, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve just located her here, in the caverns beneath Karazhan. Fearful for her life, she is researching arcane secrets buried beneath the foundation.', '', 56566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls upon the |cFF0080FF|Hspell:104900|h[Blue]|h|r, |cFF424242|Hspell:104894|h[Black]|h|r, |cFF9932CD|Hspell:104896|h[Purple]|h|r, and |cFFFFA901|Hspell:104901|h[Yellow]|h|r Bloods of Shu\'ma!', '', 56565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
