('Raise you a keg of Stormstout Gold. It\'ll be your loss.', '', 56428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Four coppers on Zhou.', '', 56427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has the legs of an ox! Have you ever been kicked by him in training?', '', 56424, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His stamina is nothing against Lam\'s strength.', '', 56423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhou has the stamina of three men, so he can out-stay most opponents.', '', 56422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s where you\'re mistaken, friend. Zhou is as sturdy as an oak.', '', 56421, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My money\'s on Lam. Did you see him take down Chu during training last week?', '', 56420, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shouldn\'t you be training, young $c?$B$BDiscipline your mind and body, and there is little that you cannot achieve.', '', 56417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just won a kickin\' rad poster! Raise your hand in the air like you just don\'t care!', '', 56416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello friend!  You\'re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Temple of Five Dawns.', '', 56415, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mothallus approaches!', 'Mothallus approaches!', 56414, 0, 13511, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That DID take a long time!', 56413, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you wouldn\'t mind waiting, $n... this might take a long time.', '', 56412, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn straight ya can!', '', 56411, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 32503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the best brewer across three continents! I think I can handle this part.', '', 56410, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am kidding!', '', 56409, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 29727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I yell out the names of ingredients, you throw them in the pot...', '', 56408, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, $n. I will need your help making this beer.', '', 56407, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello friend!  You\'re welcome to use my cart if you like.  It will take you to the Dai-Lo Farmstead.', '', 56406, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The race to defeat the Firelands has begun!', '', 56405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am able to teleport you near any of the boss encounters here in Firelands.', '', 56404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Ragnaros', 'Teleport to Ragnaros', 56403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Fandral', 'Teleport to Fandral', 56402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Baleroc', 'Teleport to Baleroc', 56401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Alysrazor', 'Teleport to Alysrazor', 56400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Beth\'tilac', 'Teleport to Beth\'tilac', 56399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Lord Rhyolith', 'Teleport to Lord Rhyolith', 56398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Shannox', 'Teleport to Shannox', 56397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firelands on the Test Realm has been reserved for a special event.', '', 56396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, friends. Once we find the Hidden Master, we can continue our training.', '', 56395, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. As the oldest and fattest among us, I will wait here for each of you to return.', '', 56394, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 31910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I suppose I\'ll go west, then.', 56393, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ken-Ken go chase east wind. Shortest walk.', '', 56392, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will follow the north wind.', '', 56391, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a much better idea, Ken-Ken. I volunteer to travel south, into the jungle.', '', 56390, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31939, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ken-Ken thinks we split up. Follow the four winds.', '', 56389, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ask the streams? You\'re no elder, Ashyo. You\'re not even a jinyu grown yet. It would be a waste of your time.', '', 56388, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 31938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can try asking the streams for guidance...', '', 56387, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 30691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, where should we search first?', 56386, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh. Sorry.', 56385, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 0, 30882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pretty sure that\'s why he\'s called the hidden master, Lin.', '', 56384, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 31909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So... do any of you know where the hidden master lives?', 56383, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I\'ll be off then. You a-comin\', Chen?', '', 56382, 0, 13503, 0, 65, 0, 30953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I\'ll be off then. You a-comin\', Li Li?', '', 56381, 0, 13502, 0, 65, 0, 30952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where\'d those other two go? Did they leave me behind? Don\'t nobody care about Mudmug?', '', 56380, 0, 13501, 0, 65, 0, 30951, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I reckon I\'ll see you over there.', '', 56379, 0, 13500, 0, 65, 0, 30950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The brewery\'s got a second entrance, over yonder.', '', 56378, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 30949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you there, Uncle Chen!', 56377, 0, 13499, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you dumb old uncle! You left me behind!', 56376, 0, 13498, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, you old jerks! You left me behind!', 56375, 0, 13497, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uncle Chen, Mudmug! Race you there!', 56374, 0, 13496, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going ahead to see if there\'s anything I can do to help.', 56373, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d better catch up Mudmug.', '', 56372, 0, 13495, 0, 65, 0, 29652, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li, wait up!', '', 56371, 0, 13494, 22, 65, 0, 29651, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!', '', 56370, 0, 13493, 22, 65, 0, 29650, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mudmug, Li Li... follow me!', '', 56369, 0, 13492, 0, 65, 0, 29649, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you on the other side, $n.', '', 56368, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29648, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alizabal skewers $n to the ground.', 56367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'They have broken our defenses... the very earth turns against us in Deathwing\'s name.', 56366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gets absorbed into the Maw of Go\'rath', '%s gets absorbed into the Maw of Go\'rath', 56365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m... I\'m just going to lie down a while... until this headache goes away.', '', 56364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is magnificent!  I\'ve never seen craftsmanship so fine.', '', 56363, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... my head... it hurts so badly!  I\'ve... the pillar must contain enormous power... perhaps stronger even than my brow...', '', 56362, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is only one thing to do.  I must smash it!  Once and for all, all shall know the power of my mighty brow.', '', 56361, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you stranger!', '', 56360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So sticky! I\'ll try to bring that moth down for you.', '', 56359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! I will try to break some of that silk shield off.', '', 56358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surprise!', '', 56357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any who yet doubt my strength are simply foolish.', '', 56356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the densest stones across all of Shen-zin Su, yet they are as nothing before my mighty head.', '', 56355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose there are worse fates than being stuck forever inside a beer barrel.', '', 56354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, kind... OH NO, HERE HE COMES AGAIN!', '', 56353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally!', '', 56352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better get out of here before he comes by again!', '', 56351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! The light... it hurts our eyes...', '', 56350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no idea how long I was in there.', '', 56349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a beer.', '', 56348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks!', '', 56347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The beast has been defeated! Hurray!', '', 56346, 0, 13533, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mothallus is defeated! Hurray for $p!', '', 56345, 0, 13511, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing made by pandaren hands can withstand me.', '', 56344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our crafters build the finest wooden planks.  They would weather the most brutal of storms.  But they are as water before the storm of my crushing skull.', '', 56343, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can anybody hear me?', '', 56342, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me out of this barrel!', '', 56341, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heeelllp!', '', 56340, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone get me outta here!', '', 56339, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s dark in here!', '', 56338, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little help here?', '', 56337, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!', '', 56336, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anybody out there?', '', 56335, 0, 13476, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Many have tested my claim, and I yet stand proven.', '', 56334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The reeds of the Singing Pools are the hardest in all of the land, but they are as air before my mighty brow.', '', 56333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How I HATE this place. My captors may be long-dead, but don\'t think I won\'t take it all out on you miserable treasure-hunters.', 56331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate martyrs.', 56330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate armor.', 56329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My hate will consume you!', 56328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My hatred burns!', 56327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel my hatred!', 56326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate standing still.', 56325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate you all!', 56324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate... every one of you...', 56323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate adventurers.', 56322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I didn\'t hate that.', 56321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate mercy.', 56320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you hate me? Good.', 56319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I still hate you.', 56318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hate incompetent raiders.', 56317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25780, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master, I lost my torch.', 'Master, I lost my torch.', 56316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can tell a lot about a designer in how they weave their fabric together. Yours has the look of function over pride.$b$bTightly sealed with mana infused right into the fabric. Impressive, though it could benefit from an artistic hand.', '', 56315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, sorry about that bottle, by the way. It\'s actually better to keep all the old slime in there - it ages like a fine brew.', '', 56314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, good to see you, my friend!$B$BHungry?', '', 56313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer is retreating! The temple is ours; fortify your positions within!', '', 56312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Horde. We are always ready.', 'We are the Horde. We are always ready.', 56311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat up big fella.', '', 56310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BAD WORM! THAT\'S A BAD BAD BAD WORM!', '', 56309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW! MY FACE!', '', 56308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW!', '', 56307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('JUSTICE AND GLORY!', 'JUSTICE AND GLORY!', 56306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are the Alliance. We are always ready.', 'We are the Alliance. We are always ready.', 56305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome aboard the Skyfire. You ready to chase down the end of the world?', '', 56304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could this happen to me? I\'m sick of this life.', 'How could this happen to me? I\'m sick of this life.', 56303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t bother me.', 'Don\'t bother me.', 56302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What day is it? Nobody tells me anything.', 'What day is it? Nobody tells me anything.', 56301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little rain never hurt anybody... yet.', 'A little rain never hurt anybody... yet.', 56300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not much of a day. Just right for not much of a life.', 'Not much of a day. Just right for not much of a life.', 56299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, great. An adventurer. Just what I needed.', 'Oh, great. An adventurer. Just what I needed.', 56298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A banana in hand is worth than two in bush.', 'A banana in hand is worth than two in bush.', 56297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, bother.', 'Oh, bother.', 56296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s raining still. And freezing. At least we haven\'t had a typhoon lately.', 'It\'s raining still. And freezing. At least we haven\'t had a typhoon lately.', 56295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop crowding me, everybody\'s always crowding around in this village. There\'s no space.', 'Stop crowding me, everybody\'s always crowding around in this village. There\'s no space.', 56294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '...', 56293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me be.', 'Let me be.', 56292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you want?', 'What do you want?', 56291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the point anymore?', 'What\'s the point anymore?', 56290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave me alone.', 'Leave me alone.', 56289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go away.', 'Go away.', 56288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You remind me of a young Master Goh, minus the girth.$b$BHe first came to me a farm boy dressed in rags but with a stylish stride to him that owned the look.$B$bTogether we made a clothing line that was all the rage in the east for at least two years.', '', 56287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boots, no. The belt, oh very much no. The shirt, stunning, but not on you. We should get you a real cape. And perhaps a vest with a proper hero\'s cut.', '', 56286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your clothing appears as one well travelled. Quite an interesting look. I might use it in one of my future clothing lines. I shall call it:$b$b$pique.', '', 56285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings stranger. I am Silkmaster Tsai. Welcome to the ancient Imperial Silk Farm.$b$bThis farm dates back to some of the earliest dynasties of Pandaria, and each generation exceeds the last in quality of silk.', '', 56284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Loommaster Jeng once spun a weave of silk so thin and smooth that it slipped through a crack in time. It hasn\'t re-appeared yet but we expect it one of these days.', '', 56283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember my first experiment gone awry. These fields were crawling with super grubs the likes of which had not been seen in this age of the world.', '', 56282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I remember a time when the venerable Silkmaster Tsai created a strand of silk so fine it sliced through the earth when he dropped it. We never saw it again.', '', 56281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What interesting garb you wear. By whose hand was it threaded, if I may ask?', '', 56280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seem to me to be one who has had many experiences.', '', 56279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My journeyman often forgets that one must expect to fail many times in the pursuit of perfection.', '', 56278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The siege must be broken. Wyrmrest Accord, defend the line!', '', 56277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Advance to the front!', '', 56276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp now.', '', 56275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
