('I\'m here to help with that fancy beer you was talkin\' about.', '', 56124, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 30955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mudmug!', '', 56123, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 29683, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mudmug!', 56122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can find your malts at the granary, I reckon.', '', 56121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s snaps its tether with a mighty effort, breaking free!', '', 56120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh hello! Haven\'t seen you around before...', '', 56119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm... don\'t get many $cs up this way...', 'Hm... don\'t get many $cs up this way...', 56118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First things first. We\'re going to need some sweet malts.', '', 56114, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 29682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to The Well of Eternity.', 'Teleport to The Well of Eternity.', 56111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Azshara\'s Overlook.', 'Teleport to Azshara\'s Overlook.', 56110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Teleport to Azshara\'s Palace.', 'Teleport to Azshara\'s Palace.', 56109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
