('Time ends.', '', 55749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25938, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sand has run out.', '', 55748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time has come.', '', 55747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey mister Ironbelly! The witch in the woods turned my friends into jade. Can you help?', 55746, 0, 13227, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know not what you have done. Aman\'Thul... What I... have... seen...', '', 55745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So be it.', '', 55744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25927, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lo? Oh. I haven\'t seen him today. I thought it was very odd. He usually walks me to work in the morning.$b$bHe has a kind heart. It\'s a shame he looks down on his apprenticeship with Singegruff. He is a very talented smelter.$b$bIf you see him, tell him I missed our walk this morning.', '', 55743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Jade Serpent, grant me strength!', 55742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessings of the Pandriarchs.', 'Blessings of the Pandriarchs.', 55741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek two lovers blind to the ambitions of their family names. They were here, seeking a way to hold to their path.$b$bSadly they did not find their answers among the trees or art.', '', 55739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?', 'Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?', 55738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is an ancient and long lived culture.$b$bThanks to our craft, some of the memory of that culture can be preserved for future generations.', '', 55737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our lives are but a blink of reality\'s eye.', '', 55736, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Arboretum. May you find inspiration amongst the trees.', '', 55735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have not seen Lo since he made off with my student, Syra. They were heading east toward the Arboretum.$b$bIt will not go well if their parents learn of this. The Wanderbrews and the Goldendrafts have had a long standing feud.', 55734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Tian Monastery taught me how to focus my energies so tightly that I could tap a keg using only my pinky finger.', 55733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you wish to expand your mind and body beyond the boundaries it is currently confined to?', 55732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oook!  Ooooooook!!', '', 55731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you seek enlightenment?', 55730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?', 'Have you seen Lo Wanderbrew?', 55729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_food_23.blp:20|t Ook-Ook is |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106651|h[Going Bananas]|h|r! More barrels are coming!', '', 55728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me gonna ook you in the dooker!', '', 55727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28796, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The grown ups always told us the Jade Witch was just some old lady in the woods who was sad her husband died. But you showed them!$b$bOnly... I didn\'t tell any of the grown ups \'cause I didn\'t want to get in trouble.', 55726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was so neat how you beat up those cats! They went and were like \"Grrrrr!\" and then you went and \"Wabang!\" and then you took their stuff.', 55725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wow stranger! You really showed that mean old witch who was boss.', 55724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The waters whisper to me... enemies approach.', '', 55723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you again for your help, stranger. I have already begun to think of ideas on the ring I shall craft for Syra\'s hand.', '', 55722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waters... claim me...', '', 55721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I peer into these waters and my reflection is empty...', '', 55720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkness clears...', '', 55719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to see Lorewalker Cho.', 'I\'m ready to see Lorewalker Cho.', 55718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m Toya! You need it? I can get it! Don\'t go to nobody else in Dawn\'s Blossom!', '', 55717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You had something important to tell me, master?', 'You had something important to tell me, master?', 55716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cowards! You pack of weakling... dogs...', 55715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lorewalker Cho spoke highly of you. You are welcome as long as you don\'t go all hozen on us.', 55714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re not here to start a fight in my brewery are you? Those two strangers over there started quite a brawl when they arrived last week.', 55713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another stranger? Where are all of you coming from?$b$BSomeone was through here a few days ago claiming to be from the turtle. Said his name was Stormstout.', 55712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chin did not earn his title lightly. There was a fierce championship of noodle makers gathered from all four corners of the village.$b$bIt was here they battled with great ferocity over barrels of boiling water to forge only the finest noodles ever made within a days travel.$b$bGlorious I tell you!$b$bOnly Flourfury emerged victorious, crafting a noodle so astounding it shook the very foundation of my taster\'s bowl.', '', 55711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I once did battle with the dreaded fang toothed beast that shall not be named for fear of darkening the day.', '', 55710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the mighty Tzu the Ironbelly Monk, so named for my infamous belly barrage. Perhaps you have heard of me.', '', 55709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my noodle shack. We\'ve got every type of noodle that should be eaten. If we don\'t have it, you shouldn\'t be eating it.', '', 55708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I was young I wanted to be a brewmaster. Mixing various chemicals to get the perfect drink and flavor.$b$bDuring my training though they kept telling me my drinks were too hearty.$b$bSo I went into smelting. Seemed like a logical transition at the time.', '', 55707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic* Gimme more of that ook-dooglin\' BEER! *hic*', '', 55706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 31627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had no choice but to defend myself.', '', 55705, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[This line has been cut]', '', 55704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was all I needed to hear. Shunned... by my own blood! I turned and left.', '', 55703, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I decided to give him one more chance. I was not about to give up on family.', '', 55702, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First beer elementals, and now a hozen attack? Something was very wrong.', '', 55701, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was shaken, but I did not give up. I pursued the strange old brewer to ask him some more questions.', '', 55700, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I decided to look around for someone else from the Stormstout family.', '', 55699, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found the brewery and made my way inside.', '', 55698, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s not what you\'ve done, it\'s who you are. You are not welcome here, \"Chen Stormstout.\"', '', 55697, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 28287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t understand, old man. What have I done to upset you?', '', 55696, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 29664, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many times must I tell you... GO AWAY!', '', 55695, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 28286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, what\'s that behind you?!', '', 55694, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 28285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[This line has been cut]', '', 55693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There will be no sitting. No talking. And none of your horrible beer!', '', 55692, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 28284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, speak with me! Let\'s sit down and talk. Have a beer together...', '', 55691, 0, 0, 404, 65, 0, 29661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh?! That\'s... that\'s nothing! Now GO AWAY!', '', 55690, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait - what is going on behind you!?', '', 55689, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 29658, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no need to speak to me that way.', '', 55688, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29657, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you deaf? We aren\'t allowing anybody in the brewery right now.', '', 55687, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 28282, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But we are family. I am a Stormstout! From the Wandering Isle...', '', 55686, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 29656, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should leave.', '', 55685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28281, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
