('', 'Swagger all you like; you pups don\'t stand a chance. Flee now, while you can.', 55646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agh! My wards!', '', 55645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear that with fire and force you shape metals for war. I can achieve this through the pressures of water and a mastery of their densities.', '', 55644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to fight your own battles, you monster! No more spirits to hide behind!', '', 55643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel stronger than before.', '', 55642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight hard! Press onward!', '', 55641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strike true, friends!', '', 55640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will send you to a watery grave!', '', 55639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For our brothers and sisters!', '', 55638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For honor! For justice!', '', 55637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never give up, friends!', '', 55636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready for anything!', '', 55635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward! For the Pearlfin tribe!', '', 55634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll fight this to the very end!', '', 55633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not going to run away!', '', 55632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tribe will prevail!', '', 55631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We might be able to win this.', '', 55630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fight isn\'t over yet!', '', 55629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, we\'re not doing so bad.', '', 55628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They aren\'t so tough after all.', '', 55627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, this isn\'t so bad.', '', 55626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These opponents are tough.', '', 55625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which way is the enemy?', '', 55624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When should I open my eyes?', '', 55623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Where is the enemy?', '', 55622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do I use this thing?', '', 55621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do I keep missing?', '', 55620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is really hard!', '', 55619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we start with something easier?', '', 55618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breaking and Entering', 'Breaking and Entering', 55616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This training is really helping.', '', 55614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I understand it now.', '', 55613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I learned something new!', '', 55612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, I think I\'m getting the hang of this.', '', 55611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your spirit has been ripped from your body! Get back to your body!', 'Your spirit has been ripped from your body! Get back to your body!', 55610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STRIKE!', '', 55609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What, were you sent to check up on me? Everything\'s fine! It\'s all under control!', '', 55608, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 28288, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rises from the fountain!', '', 55607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spring to life!', '', 55606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the power of torrential waters!', '', 55605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 28266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elder is right, we should find a diplomatic solution with the hozen.', '', 55604, 0, 13237, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should be taking the fight to the hozen, not stalling out of fear.', '', 55603, 0, 13237, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s just a matter of time before we retake Moonwater Retreat.', '', 55602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damned hozen move through the trees like ghosts!', '', 55601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I\'m a little busy here?', '', 55600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why won\'t Elder Lu let us fight the hozen back properly.', '', 55599, 0, 13237, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Each day we send off only enough warriors to hold the hozen at bay. Never enough to actually push them back.', '', 55598, 0, 13237, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am a fighter. Why will the elder not let me fight?', '', 55597, 0, 13237, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened, Chen?', 'What happened, Chen?', 55596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah! I do not want to talk about it.', '', 55595, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 29724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look, here he comes now! How was the brewery, Uncle?', 55594, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose that\'s enough for today. Let\'s wait for Uncle Chen to return.', 55593, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Furries chompin\' the Jinyu!', '', 55592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slinger eat slicky. Slicky make dooker. Slingin\' dooker grook the Jinyu!', '', 55591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grookin Jinyu make for happy Kah Kah.', '', 55590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket got slickies?', '', 55589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shiney jab-jab, wikket.', '', 55588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grook all the jinyu, wikket!', '', 55587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen watchin\' wikket... someday hozen learn to grook like wikket!', '', 55586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You think the jinyu built this place?', 55585, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a village up here... and a big fish statue, too.', 55584, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look at this!', 55583, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move.', 55582, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought.', 55581, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27440, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like they crashed.  I don\'t think they\'re here for trouble.', '', 55580, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27304, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And those aren\'t pandaren down there.  They\'ve got no fur.', '', 55579, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27303, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a boat... a whole airship!  That\'s a bigger thorn than I was expecting.', 55578, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27439, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you seeing what I\'m seeing?!  Is that a boat?!', '', 55577, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27302, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll know soon enough.', 55576, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27438, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How could such a thing cause pain to something so large?', '', 55575, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27301, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home.', '', 55574, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27300, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!', 55573, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is in the forest where your feet do not walk.  Continue along the mountains and you will find it.', '', 55572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Shen-zin Su!  But your shell is large, and I do not know where this thorn could be.', 55571, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please grandchildren, can you remove this thorn?  I cannot do so on my own.', '', 55570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27825, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pain is unbearable, and I can no longer swim straight.', '', 55569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27824, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it.', '', 55568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eww... they look like maggots.', 55567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think that they really get this stuff from the silkworms\' rear end?', 55566, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 30429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Check out all the cool silk!', 55565, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30424, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?', 55564, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 27435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We\'ve sensed your pain, and we want to help.', 55563, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I might if you embarrass us.', 55562, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27433, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa.', '', 55561, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su.', 55560, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27432, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should always check behind waterfalls for caves.', 55559, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if there\'s a cave behind it.', 55558, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30422, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Look at that waterfall!', 55557, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 30421, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I\'m going to miss the old man.', '', 55556, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...Ji, they were in the Wood of Staves.  You know where Master Shang is now.', 55555, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, where\'s Master Shang?', '', 55554, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 27297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t listen to him.  We\'ve got work to do.', 55553, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or if you want to wander the woods a while, Aysa and I can hang out here.  You know... just the two of us.', '', 55552, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hop in.', 55551, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in pain, but it warms my heart that Liu Lang\'s grandchildren have not forgotten me.', '', 55550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re ready to go whenever you are, $n.', 55549, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27428, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! Check this thing out!', '', 55548, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 27295, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sure, let\'s go have a drink.', 'Sure, let\'s go have a drink.', 55547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you so much $p! If you find me in Dawn\'s Blossom later I\'ll give you one of the things we stashed from our adventures.', 55546, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Now I am ready for battle.', '', 55545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I expected...', '', 55544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! Shin! You\'re alive!', 55543, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should join our family, preserved forever in jade.', 55542, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here kitty kitty.', 55541, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 31395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $p!', 55540, 0, 0, 21, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahoo! We did it!', '', 55539, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My legs feel stiff.', '', 55538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not interfere again!', '', 55537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little spirit, you cannot hide from me in that body!', '', 55536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_deathwing_cataclysm.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:106523|h[Cataclysm]|h|r! Stop Him!', '', 55535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! Impossible!', '', 55534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve come far, my young student. I see within you a great hero. I leave the fate of this land to you.', '', 55533, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 27812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aysa and Ji have retrieved the spirits and brought them here. You are to go with them, speak to the great Shen-zin Su, and do what must be done to save our people.', '', 55532, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now Shen-zin Su is ill, and we are all in danger. With the help of the elements, you will break the silence. You will speak to him.', '', 55531, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p, our people have lived the wholes of their lives on this great turtle, Shen-zin Su, but not in hundreds of years has anyone spoken to him.', '', 55530, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every elder reaches the day where he must pass on and plant his stave with the staves of his ancestors. Today is the day when my staff joins these woods.', '', 55529, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For 3,000 years, we have passed the knowledge of our people down. Elder to youth. Master to student.', '', 55528, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are plenty of targets out there for both of us...', 55527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That one was already in my sights!', 55526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That was my kill, $p!', 55525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey! Stop stealing my kills, $p!', 55524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the Guardian of the Elders, and we may pass.', '', 55523, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of the many ways to prove your worth, I require the simplest of you now. I must know that you will fight for our people. I must know that you can keep them safe.', '', 55522, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beyond the Elders\' Path lies the Wood of Staves, a sacred place that only the worthy may enter.', '', 55521, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come child. We have one final journey to take together before your training is complete.', '', 55520, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve got your back, $p.', 55519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you finding everything well, $n?', '', 55517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have a drink and rest, traveler.', '', 55516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I really hope it didn\'t eat any of my friends before you beat it up.', 55515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did you get to be so brave?', 55514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh wow! It was like \"Rawwr!\" and you were like \"Kahpowww!\"', 55513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, you fight like two gnolls in heat. Distracted. Sloppy. Gibbering. Get out. OUT! Next?', '', 55512, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good. Is that blood? On your teeth? Excellent! Bring on two more!', '', 55511, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like what I\'m seeing here. Did everyone see that? Who is next?', '', 55510, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You movements are light, free, flowing ... you would be killed in an instant. Get out of the ring!', '', 55509, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you doing, dancing? We\'re studying murder, people! BAH - send in two more.', '', 55508, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shins. The face. The crotch. Kick them all, indiscriminately.', '', 55507, 0, 0, 60, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your goal is a silent kill. Screamy, angry kills will do in a pinch.', '', 55506, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see your scowls. Scowl. Scowl harder! You call that a scowl?', '', 55505, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just use the blade. Use the butt of your weapon. Break his nose!', '', 55504, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vary your blows. Show your opponent no pattern. Prove his instincts wrong.', '', 55503, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step in close. Engage into his space. Don\'t give him the initiative!', '', 55502, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I found us a cool bodyguard didn\'t I?', 55501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How did you get up that high?', 55500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Make a run for Dawn\'s Blossom. We\'ll meet you there!', 55499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
