('Lord Deathwing, your gift...it is too much! I am...rrrraaaaagghhh!!', '', 55335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The final shred of light fades, and with it, your pitiful mortal existence!', '', 55334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26323, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahahaha!', '', 55333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26321, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have no hope!', '', 55332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall before Ultraxion!', '', 55331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26319, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But...but...I am...Ul...trax...ionnnnnn...', '', 55330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now is the hour of twilight!', '', 55329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cycle of time brings an end to all things.', '', 55328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winds of the arcane be at their backs, and refresh them in this hour of darkness!', '', 55327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!', 55326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take heart, heroes, life will always blossom from the darkest soil!', 55325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26506, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength of the Earth, hear my call! Shield them in this dark hour, the last defenders of Azeroth!', '', 55324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For this moment ALONE was I made. Look upon your death, mortals, and despair!', '', 55323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mere whelps, experiments, a means to a greater end. You will see what the research of my clutch has yielded.', '', 55322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense a great disturbance in the balance approaching. The chaos of it burns my mind!', 55321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 26148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the beginning of the end...the shadow which blots out the sun...the bell which tolls your doom...', '', 55320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26317, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s hit the road.', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s hit the road.', 55319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. Are you as thirsty as I am?', '', 55318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Well done $p. Meet me back at Grookin and we\'ll discuss our next plan of action.', '', 55317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the smoke of their burning camp wreaks of futility and shame.', '', 55316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As my master once said, \"You cannot truly know someone until you fight them.\"', '', 55315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27634, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have bested my prize students. Perhaps you can be of use to us after all...', '', 55314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27633, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flying Snow!  Fragrant Lotus!  Step forward!', '', 55313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have bested our most junior of students.  Now you will face two of my most senior.', '', 55312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27631, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have much to learn if you wish to defend your people from the Sha initiate.  Stand aside for your fellow students!', '', 55311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27625, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where one falls, another will rise to take their place.', '', 55310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27624, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, you will face our initiates...', '', 55309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27632, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you truly wish to undo what your kind have wrought upon our land you must first prove yourselves here in our school.', '', 55308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27627, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You!  You have allowed the Sha to reawaken after all these years!', '', 55307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27626, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck, heroes!', '', 55306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25964, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara\'s Highborne lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.', '', 55305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25963, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time.', '', 55304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25962, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mudmug\'s vial will slowly spill water while you are moving. Plan your path carefully!', 'Mudmug\'s vial will slowly spill water while you are moving. Plan your path carefully!', 55303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\'s what hozen do best!', '', 55302, 0, 13190, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oogh... grooked me bad slickies...', '', 55301, 0, 13190, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ook! Dookin\' prarie-doggin\'!', '', 55300, 0, 13190, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... I think I mighta ooked my dookers.', '', 55299, 0, 13190, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can carry you to the top of the temple. Ji awaits you there to lead the way.', '', 55298, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27779, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The only remaining spirit is Dafeng, who hides somewhere across the Dawning Span to the west.', '', 55297, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wugou and Shu are welcome here. We will care for them well.', '', 55296, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27777, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve returned with the spirits of water and earth. You make an old master proud.', '', 55295, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 27776, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exploiting the hostility between these races is unwise, $r.$b$bYou are going to have to accept responsibility for the consequences.', '', 55294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, you\'ve managed to train an army...$b$bAn impressive achievement, but is war really the right course of action?', '', 55293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Involving these races in our war? Tarnishing this land with the horrors of warfare?$b$bIs that what you really want?', '', 55292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand in an undiscovered paradise as ancient as the titans themselves and you want to go to war?', '', 55291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Noble $r, I am sure there is some agreement we can come to for my release.', '', 55290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But... But Deathwing\'s minions may have you killed...', '', 55289, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not afraid of you! Wait - who - who are you?', '', 55288, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did it! You\'re in! Now... where would they be keeping the egg? Someplace dark, I would imagine. Be careful!', '', 55287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work! Is there a window open up there? Look around!', '', 55286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah-hah! There are no guards back here. Maybe you can find a way up onto the roof?', '', 55285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmmm... it doesn\'t look like there\'s anything over here. Try circling around to the back of the manor.', '', 55284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where are you going? The manor is in the other direction!', '', 55283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful! The front door is too heavily guarded. Hmmm - Circle around the back of the manor and maybe we can find another way in.', '', 55282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s it... you\'ve got this... keep it up...', '', 55281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s the matter? Alliance can\'t hold their grog? Ha ha ha!', '', 55280, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are less than dust, fit only to be brushed from my back.', '', 55279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t fly here. We\'ll be spotted for sure!', '', 55278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you crazy? They\'ll see you if you go flying around in there!', '', 55277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to use your stealth!', '', 55276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I got one!', 55275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a thief over here!', 55274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah - hah! Busted!', 55273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Someone\'s here!', 55272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you\'ve arrived. This is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.', '', 55271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25961, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrot was turnip! Run!', '', 55270, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, turnip! Get out of here!', '', 55269, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who would do this?!', '', 55268, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Not turnip!!', '', 55267, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nooooo!', '', 55266, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! It\'s TURNIP!', '', 55265, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s all eat it!', '', 55264, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we should eat it.', '', 55263, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love it. I love this carrot.', '', 55262, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems legit.', '', 55261, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It so juicy!', '', 55260, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The next spirit that awaits you is Shu, the spirit of water. When you are ready, meet Aysa at the Singing Pools to the east.', '', 55259, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It so fat!', '', 55258, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am proud of what you have accomplished this day.', '', 55257, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold as Huo brings warmth back to the temple, and passion to its people.', '', 55256, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm... carrot!', '', 55255, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your training has paid off, young $c. You have found Huo and brought him safely to the temple.', '', 55254, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooh, carrot!', '', 55253, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carrot appeared!', '', 55252, 0, 16275, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have earned the right to proceed.  Huo lies beyond.', '', 55251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, Rivett. I\'m ready!', 'Okay, Rivett. I\'m ready!', 55250, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $p! Methane labs like these can be extremely volatile.', '', 55249, 0, 13190, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Assuming this works, I\'ll need a name for my invention. How \'bout... Grookin Grenade?', '', 55248, 0, 13190, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have any more grog?', 'Have any more grog?', 55247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So if i just substitute the powder with compressed...fuel, we should be in business! So to speak.', '', 55246, 0, 13190, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not about to let this Alliance scum steal back my prize.', '', 55245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooohwee! Smells like Dalaran Sharp!', '', 55244, 0, 13190, 479, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, come on, come on! They\'ll be here any moment!', '', 55243, 0, 13190, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('True wisdom comes from the understanding that you have much to master.', '', 55242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The first step to learning is to admit that you have much to learn.', '', 55241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Picking', 'Picking', 55240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Taylor is very sick. It is best not to speak to him now.>', '', 55239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been unable to befriend the Glassfin Elder. $C, I\'m counting on you to succeed where I failed.', '', 55238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have tried to speak to their chief, but he does not want to see me. It appears I am not \"high status\" enough. Apparently he\'s never seen an Admiral.', '', 55237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The jinyu seem to be an ancient race. We will learn their secrets, in time.', '', 55236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The natives here are quite friendly. Well, except for those monkeys.', '', 55235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This land is rich in resources, $n. I am preparing a detailed report for our return.', '', 55234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must focus on creating a base of operations. Once we have secured our position, then we can spare resources to find a way back home.', '', 55233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have delivered word to Wayward Landing. They should be sending more soldiers shortly.', '', 55232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel fine, $n. Thank you for asking, but there are more important matters at hand.', '', 55231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have done all that I can for the Commander. I am afraid it will not be long, now.', 55230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It would take a miracle to save the Commander, now.', 55229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am afraid the Commander\'s injuries are beyond my aid.', 55228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you are becoming quite a skilled medic. You should continue your first aid training.', 55227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, $n. Without you, the Admiral would have perished in that filthy pit.', 55226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shhh, $n. I will need total concentration to attend these wounds.', 55225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can only describe the Admiral\'s attackers as...savages.', 55224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Admiral is very hurt, but not entirely broken. I can fix him, but I\'ll need time.', 55223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Judging from his injuries, the Admiral was cruelly tortured.', 55222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Admiral is very, very fortunate that you arrived when you did.', 55221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Admiral is gravely wounded, $n.', 55220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have never failed a mission in many years, $n. I am not about to do so now.', 55219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think we will ever find a way home?', 55218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The longer I stay here, the more I am charmed by this strange land.', 55217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A medic\'s work is never done.', 55216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The jinyu may not seem welcoming, but I do believe we prove our good intentions.', 55215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is there anyone in need of medical aid?', 55214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sure you can handle things in here. I\'ll be outside settling things down.', '', 55213, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 32866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, there we go. Told you I had it!', '', 55212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HNNGGG!!!', '', 55211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 32864, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was an honor to be defeated by you.', '', 55210, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bow to your skill. You bested me fairly.', '', 55209, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson.', '', 55208, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Amazing! You\'re much stronger than you look.', '', 55207, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought. Master Shang will be pleased.', '', 55206, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve been trained well.', '', 55205, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $p! We have to start the smelling... I mean, the shelling!', '', 55204, 0, 13190, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot...escape!', '', 55203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you, fool!', '', 55202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!', '', 55201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here - get $ghim:her;!', '', 55200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thief. Thief!', '', 55199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for bringing my driver back, friend.', '', 55198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gotcha! Let\'s try that again...', '', 55197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26411, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You weren\'t trying to pick their pockets, were you?', '', 55196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... That got ugly. You\'re lucky I\'m here.', '', 55195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need to be careful - they\'re on full alert!', '', 55194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got you. That was close!', '', 55193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm.$b$b<You wait patiently for Chief Kah Kah to think, then wait some more for him to speak.>$b$bKah Kah have many nephews. They all have earned their name name.$b$bGrookin home to one who has not yet earned his name name....$b$bRiko been a little too frisky - even for a hozen. Maybe long walk do him some good.', '', 55192, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 5, 0, 2000, 1000, 39653),
('I better be getting overtime for this.', 'I better be getting overtime for this.', 55191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today it\'s cave-ins and nibblers, tomorrow it\'ll be floods and jinyu. Just another day at the quarry.', 'I ain\'t settin\' foot in this place ever again!', 55190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Big Chief Kah Kah, we will be exploring your lands and could use a good guide. Will you help us?', 'Big Chief Kah Kah, we will be exploring your lands and could use a good guide. Will you help us?', 55189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket smart to be friend to hozen.$b$bNow, one less wikket hozen have to smash.', '', 55188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll check in with Hao. Thank you!', 'Foreman\'s gotta be fumin\' right now. Glad yer dealin\' with her and not me.', 55187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I was just resting... I rest sometimes... under rocks...', 'I was JUST about to wiggle myself free... I think.', 55186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of Alliance scum is in the air.', '', 55185, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never thought I\'d need a $c to save me from nibblers. Thank you!', 'My favorite kind of $c: the brave, rescue-y type!', 55184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I gotta tell my cubs about this! Of course, I\'ll change the part where their paw-paw got stuck...', 'That\'s it: I\'m demanding hazard pay after this.', 55183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I weren\'t scurred...', 'Oof, that\'s better... How\'s my hair?', 55182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Much obliged, stranger.', 'Well thankee, friend!', 55181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well of course he did. He\'d be a fool not to.$b$bThank you, $r. I\'ll prepare to depart at once.', 55180, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim has assigned you to the scouting party, Kiryn. You are to depart shortly.', 'Nazgrim has assigned you to the scouting party, Kiryn. You are to depart shortly.', 55179, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know, these little guys aren\'t so bad once you get to know them...', 55178, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shame. I could use a bit of rest.$b$bNo matter. Tell Nazgrim that I will accompany the party.', '', 55177, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 113, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim has assigned you to help scout the region, Gorrok. You are to depart shortly.', 'Nazgrim has assigned you to help scout the region, Gorrok. You are to depart shortly.', 55176, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This will take some getting used to.$b$bI struggle to resist the urge to rip the heads from these creatures.', '', 55175, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll make ready.$b$bIt will be good to get away from these savages for a time.', 55174, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim has assigned you to scout the region, Shokia. You are to depart shortly.', 'Nazgrim has assigned you to scout the region, Shokia. You are to depart shortly.', 55173, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who would have thought these creatures could be reasoned with?', 55172, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find your soul to break the curse!', 'Find your soul to break the curse!', 55171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaaa? I can\'t believe he did that ta me!', '', 55170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you\'re ready to explain this to Admiral Taylor!', 55169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You silly dwarf, he mind controlled you! Now he\'s gone!', 55168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh? What happened?', '', 55167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sully! How could you just let him go?', 55166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, let\'s go.', '', 55165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27576, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh? Oh...uh...you\'re absolutely right, Prince Anduin. You are free to go as you please.', '', 55164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, but I won\'t. I\'m sure you understand my reasons.', '', 55163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27575, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come quietly, now.', '', 55162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prince Anduin, we\'ve come to take ye home.', '', 55161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27841, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve decided to search for the Vale. I must find the Sacred Pools and study their healing powers.', '', 55160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry, but I cannot go back just yet.', '', 55159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any friend of Anduin\'s is a friend of ours, $c. My father would not be here without him.', 55158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Ren tosses about deliriously. His brow is hot with fever.>$B$BWa....water...', '', 55157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is time to go home, Prince Anduin.', 'It is time to go home, Prince Anduin.', 55156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t want to go home quite yet. There\'s still so much to see and learn.', '', 55155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My father doesn\'t think so, but I can take care of myself.', '', 55154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is my father? I hope he is not too worried. He worries too much about me.', '', 55153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someday, Ren is going to show me his family\'s village.', '', 55152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where do you think the pandaren came from? Why have they been hidden for so long?', '', 55151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren are full of ancient knowledge. Lina has been teaching me the medicinal uses of the local herbs.', '', 55150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have never seen a place like this. Have you, $n?', '', 55149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s struggles to turn his face away from the $n.', '%s struggles to turn her face away from the $n.', 55148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s huffs and puffs, trying to blow at the $n.', '%s huffs and puffs, trying to blow at the $n.', 55147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grr... get a little closer, critter. I\'ll bite yer legs off!', 'Grr... get a little closer, critter. I\'ll bite yer legs off!', 55146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I don\'t want to be nibbled!', 'No! I don\'t want to be nibbled!', 55145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, get these things away from me!', 'Ahh, get these things away from me!', 55144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did it have to be spiders?!', 'Why did it have to be spiders?!', 55143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! It\'s comin\' right for me!', 'Ah! It\'s comin\' right for me!', 55142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woah... get away from me, crazy... spider-thing!', 'Woah... get away from me, crazy... spider-thing!', 55141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ji may kill Shen-zin Su if we let him go through with this! Come with me, $p, quickly!', 55140, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 27412, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I am in your debt.', 'I... I am in your debt.', 55139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FOR THE HORDE!', 'FOR THE HORDE!', 55138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little hand says it\'s time to rock and roll. Everyone into the hold: We\'ve got a dragon to kill.', '', 55137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like our paths have crossed again, $n. At a pig farm, of all places.$b$bI enjoy this valley. It almost feels like... home. The green fields, the big sky... I have even heard mention that there\'s a big brewery down the road. Maybe it is time I settled down once and for all.$b$b<Chen looks off into the distance for a few long seconds, then shrugs his shoulders.>$b$bOr maybe not.', '', 55136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps this one will know something about the poem. Be cleansed, spirit!', '', 55135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was the darkness that corrupted you?', '', 55134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to you, master?', '', 55133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shudder at the thought. An ancient evil. An enemy of Pandaria. I will not speak their name.', '', 55132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even after our mortal flesh had rotted away, it leeched hope from our souls. It was unending!', '', 55131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then the darkness came. It seeped from the ground. Slowly, it infected us...suffocated us!', '', 55130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We guarded the waters. Too dangerous, too powerful, to fall into the wrong hands.', '', 55129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A thousand lifetimes ago, I brought the waters here. A gift to the Pearlfin for ancient deeds.', '', 55128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally! To be free from the grip of that darkness. The light! The blessed, beautiful light!', '', 55127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, we meet again! You looking for Shang? I think he\'s in back, polishing his melon.', '', 55126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat the Great White Plainshawk!', 'Defeat the Great White Plainshawk!', 55125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoo, shoo!', 55124, 0, 13092, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
