('Time to steal more watermelon soon.', '', 55113, 0, 13153, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows are gone...the corruption is lifted.', '', 55112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look how slow your boat go.', '', 55111, 0, 13153, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger...', '', 55110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
