('Hey! Got out of here!', '', 55078, 0, 13147, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does all of this farmland belong to you?', 'Does all of this farmland belong to you?', 55077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and all your friends are welcome to stay here for as long as you like.', '', 55076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would ENJOY the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!', 55075, 0, 13117, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax, Li Li. We have all the time in the world to explore Pandaria. Take some time to enjoy the trip.', '', 55074, 0, 13117, 1, 65, 0, 29671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come ON, Uncle Chen! What are we waiting for?', 55073, 0, 13117, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How about now?', 55072, 0, 13118, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
