('Ooked my dookin\' slickies.', '', 55056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da slickies win.', '', 55055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay on the ground, and stay hidden. I\'ll port you back here if you get into any trouble!', '', 55054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26414, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient spirits of water!', '', 55053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your counsel. I will meditate on it deeply.', '', 55052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must become a better leader for our tribe.', '', 55051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps I have been too shrouded in my own doubts and fears.', '', 55050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A great darkness? Could he mean that we must trust these strangers... these... Alliance... after all?', '', 55049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aid your children in this time of need!', '', 55048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awaken from the great waters beyond.', '', 55047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear my echo through the silent deeps.', '', 55046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancient spirits of water.', '', 55045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 29517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are a thousand reasons, but you must decide what is worth fighting for.', '', 55044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
