('', 'That... barely even makes sense! You\'re just saying that because you\'re lazy and old!', 54939, 0, 13117, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30384, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be patient, Li Li. If we explore Pandaria too quickly, we will quickly run out of Pandaria to explore.', '', 54938, 0, 13117, 0, 65, 0, 29678, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are, FINALLY setting foot in our ancestral home, for the first time in our lives, and you want to stop and rest by a PIG FARM?', 54937, 0, 13117, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, NOW I am!', 54936, 0, 13118, 15, 65, 0, 0, 30387, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you so impatient? Are you worried that the mists are going to come back before I finish my drink?', '', 54935, 0, 13118, 0, 65, 0, 29680, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll leave without you. Don\'t think I\'m bluffing. I don\'t need some smelly old uncle to hold my hand.', 54934, 0, 13118, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Li Li, but the bottom of this mug is very interesting to me.', '', 54933, 0, 13118, 11, 65, 0, 29679, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s get going! There\'s a whole big valley waiting for us, but you\'re too focused on the bottom of that mug to see it.', 54932, 0, 13118, 0, 65, 0, 0, 30385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How about now?', 54931, 0, 18353, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Almost.', '', 54930, 0, 18353, 0, 65, 0, 29673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can we go yet? Are you done with your beer?', 54929, 0, 18353, 20, 65, 0, 0, 30379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I would enjoy the trip more if we were actually GOING somewhere!', 54928, 0, 13101, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Relax, Li Li. We have all the time in the world to explore Pandaria. Take some time to enjoy the trip.', '', 54927, 0, 13101, 1, 65, 0, 29671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come ON, Uncle Chen! What are we waiting for?', 54926, 0, 13101, 1, 65, 0, 0, 30375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
