('This is a family farm, in case you haven\'t noticed yet. We Thunderfoots don\'t fight, don\'t explore... we don\'t even drink that much.$b$bWe do enjoy our food, however.', '', 54921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
