('I destroyed twenty hozen before my capture!', '', 54897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s levels out.', '', 54894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mist dissipates...', 'The mist dissipates...', 54893, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12112, 12112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of the mist, a creature emerges!', 'Out of the mist, a creature emerges!', 54892, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mist envelops you in its grip!', 'The mist envelops you in its grip!', 54891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All around you, the mist grows denser.', 'All around you, the mist grows denser.', 54890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mist gathers around you.', 'Mist gathers around you.', 54889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mist senses your presence!', 'The mist senses your presence!', 54888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 12197, 12197, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen startin\' to like wikket.$b$bWikket maybe not so bad...', '', 54887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You been savin\' hozen, wikket?$b$bWikket loves hozen?', '', 54886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen and wikket... friends?', '', 54885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not gonna jorb my jangos!', '', 54884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take their slickies!', '', 54883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve put my son, Ang, in charge of my vegetable farm, just down the hill. My nephew Liang runs the pig farm down to the west, and his father - my brother - maintains a small sheep ranch to the south of that.$b$bMy farming days are over. These days, I just gather the harvested crops and sell them to folks headed down this road. Less time on my feet, more money in my pocket.', '', 54882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, friend. Care to purchase anything while you\'re here?', '', 54881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rolls right!', '', 54880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rolls left!', '', 54879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feels players on his right side. He\'s about to roll right!', '', 54878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take carrot! You take turnip instead!', '', 54877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This virmen land!', '', 54876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s feels players on his left side. He\'s about to roll left!', '', 54875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AIIIIEEEEEEE!', '', 54874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimme all your vegetables!', '', 54873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot fill a cup that is already overflowing. Before you can gain wisdom, you must become an empty vessel.', '', 54872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave nothing but smoldering husks.', '', 54871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26041, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their fate is sealed.', '', 54870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' wikket gronkin\' hozen? Grookie wikket!', '', 54869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ookin\' slicky? Nookanookanooka!', '', 54868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get back onto the plainshawk\'s back!', 'Get back onto the plainshawk\'s back!', 54867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, you must become an empty vessel.', '', 54866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot fill a cup that is already overflowing.', '', 54865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone lost their derk?', '', 54864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examines a steaming pile of smelly stuff on the ground.', '', 54863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me find the White Pawn?', 'Can you help me find the White Pawn?', 54862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How can I help the jinyu win against those monkey savages?', 'How can I help the jinyu win against those monkey savages?', 54861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this land? Why has its presence been hidden for centuries?', 'What is this land? Why has its presence been hidden for centuries?', 54860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
