('%s begins to transform everybody into puppets! You must interrupt her!', '%s begins to transform everybody into puppets! You must interrupt her!', 54845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work, work, work! I love to work!', '', 54844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
