('Whoa! I feel great!', '', 54840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well, but for now I must continue alone.  Good hunting.', '', 54839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hunter became the prey.', '', 54838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
