('Hit it with average power.', 'Hit it with average power.', 54809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it as hard as possible.', 'Hit it as hard as possible.', 54808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it very softly.', 'Hit it very softly.', 54807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it with average power.', 'Hit it with average power.', 54806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it as hard as possible.', 'Hit it as hard as possible.', 54805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it very softly.', 'Hit it very softly.', 54804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit it with average power.', 'Hit it with average power.', 54803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Miss Fanny looks at you expectantly.>', '', 54802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Miss Fanny stares forward resolutely. She is dedicated to her job.>', '', 54801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon me traveller, but did you happen to bring any bamboo up from the forest below?  I spend all day staring at it, drooling, hungry to no avail.  Yet all I have to eat up here is what I can conjour from my limited magics.', '', 54800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you interested in bell and gong lore?  Not as many young ones are willing to take such a fascinating intellectual journey these days.', '', 54799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the Gong of Hope!  Though really we replaced the gong with a bell many centuries ago.  The old gong was quite small and did not provide the proper level of hope infusion to our people.', '', 54798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your waters never run dry.', '', 54797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to speak with your chief.', 'I wish to speak with your chief.', 54796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are leaving?', 'You are leaving?', 54795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear you are responsible for saving one of my youngest descendants from the clutches of the Jade Witch.  I thank you for your heroism.', '', 54794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear on the wind that you have helped my great great grand-daughter Ji achieve her dream of becoming a brewmaster.$b$bI am quite proud of her and very thankful to you for your aid.  You have helped put my family name back on the right track.', '', 54793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I watch as my lineage is reduced to a faded memory around me.  Once the greatest of all brewmasters we now stand backstage to the Stormstouts.  Bah!', '', 54792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some champion.', '', 54791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see you.', '', 54790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26122, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I yield!  The boy chose his champion well. Give him my blessing and make sure he does not squander it.', '', 54789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Wanderbrew wants to marry an Goldendraft?! Preposterous.', '', 54788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Strength!  That is the lifeblood of the Bramblestaff family.  My lineage lives today as a testament of physical greatness willing to take on any challenger.', '', 54787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disappointing.', '', 54786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was a fine battle!  The likes of which I have not enjoyed in many decades.  Go and give the boy my blessing.', '', 54785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 54784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge the Pandriarch.', 'Challenge the Pandriarch.', 54783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough!  You win... champion.  Tell that upstart that he has my blessing.', '', 54782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would champion the cause of such a lowly street rat? Very well, best me in combat and I shall consider giving you my blessing.', '', 54781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A conducting crystal overloads!', 'A conducting crystal overloads!', 54780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In life I had many cubs, and many grand cubs.  But none of my great grand cubs visit anymore.  Few remember with honor the great Windfur family lineage.', '', 54779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mortal may stand before me and live!', '', 54778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26112, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare deny me?!', '', 54777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26116, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s make a game of this, hmmm? Hide well, worms, and you may yet live a little longer...', '', 54776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26114, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your magic is pathetic. Let me show you mine.', '', 54775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This... isn\'t how it\'s supposed to... end.', 54774, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 25967, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch, heathens, as death surrounds you!', 54773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 25970, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so ends your story.', 54772, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 25968, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cry havoc!', 54770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 25969, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another band of Deathwing\'s converts? I\'ll be sure your death is especially painful.', 54769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 25966, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every line, every stroke, helps define an image. It separates thought from parchment and seizes the attention of a viewer.', '', 54768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Color.  It gives us contrast, depth, value, and tone.  The simple shift of a hue can move a person to laughter or tears.', '', 54767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hide well, worms.  But how long you can delay your doom?', '', 54766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26123, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you exactly?', 'Who are you exactly?', 54765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen tellin\' Tooki Tooki wikket grookin\' crocs!', '', 54764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket grookin\' crocs and savin\' hozen?', '', 54763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hozen live to fish another day!', '', 54762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket savin\' hozen?', '', 54761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wikket grook the croc? Nice wikket?', '', 54760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did Ji send you?  I like Ji!  She is happy face.  The Mad Brewer though, he is a big fat dry face meany!$b$bCan you help make my water friends better?  The dry faced meany put a bunch of nasty stuff in there.', '', 54759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can use the orchids you gathered to purify the lake in the Valley of the Mad Brewer.  We\'ll need help though.$b$bMy friend Jian is a water sprite that has helped with some of my own brews and is very useful for getting just the right density of water.  He would know how best to distribute these herbs.', 54758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Between the orchids and the cleaner waters I might have constructed a recipe for the ultimate brew.  I may need to get at Brewmaster Shadowpour\'s still in order to make it work.  To do that, we\'ll need to beat him at his own game.', 54757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There was something interesting about those red pandas.  I think I might have an idea on how to fix Brewmaster Shadowpour\'s drinks so they are non-lethally tasty.', 54756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve the world\'s TRUE masters! When their rule begins, we will share in their glory!', '', 54755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21412, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where is my Potato?', '', 54754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurray for $p!  They let me turn them into a tea bag to fix my lake!', '', 54753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beware of Wolpertingers!  They like to bite when you least expect it.', '', 54752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang in there, Lieutenant!', '', 54751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons should all be leaving. We will be at the palace in no time.', '', 54750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic*...Rawr?', '', 54749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic*', '', 54748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic*... grrrr...*hic*', '', 54747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaugh!', '', 54746, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
