('What did that Brewmaster do to my water?', '', 54600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to cleanse the lake.', 'Ready to cleanse the lake.', 54599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder. Did my master send you as a distraction from my studies?$b$b...or perhaps you were sent to test my patience.', '', 54598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We may have to improvise. Make friends with the locals - whatever it takes to secure a beach-head.', '', 54597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wake up, stranger! Your snoring is interrupting my studies.', '', 54596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood is MINE, elf!', '', 54595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things that are done, it is needless to speak about... things that are past, it is needless to blame.', '', 54594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? A Horde ship? HERE?', '', 54593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deal!', '', 54592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell ya what Sully, tell me all about him over a mug of ale when we get back.', 54591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well I wouldn\'t be surprised if he did. He were a great dwarf!', '', 54590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can count on us, sir. We won\'t return without that boy.', 54589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27442, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pappy helped build this harbor, you know. Ain\'t she a beauty?', '', 54588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d better help them out and worry about the others later. Let\'s go!', '', 54587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the crew here is in trouble.', '', 54586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pull up!', 54585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They\'re firing on us, sir!', 54584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27445, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Commander, we\'re picking up an Alliance distress signal ahead.', 54583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27443, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we supposed to find anything in this mist, anyway?', '', 54582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kidding me, Commander? I ain\'t here to babysit some untried newcomer.', '', 54581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trad! Renstadt! Nooooooooooooooooooo!', '', 54580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But sir, there ain\'t any record of land in that region. Where are they?', '', 54579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All right everyone, listen up. We\'re entering hostile uncharted territory, far from the Alliance chain of command.', '', 54578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you should know that the last sixteen recruits...', 54577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The herbs from the fire seem to already be healing this animal.  Thank you!', 54576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They stand unaware that their deaths are moments away.', '', 54575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another demon, ready to be slaughtered.', '', 54574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too easy.', '', 54573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The demons are no longer pouring from the palace. We can move ahead.', '', 54572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge to a tasters\' duel.', 'Challenge to a tasters\' duel.', 54568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You watch in fascination as the creature gracefully carves lines through the air in this cozy cavern. The respite from the violence and turmoil of your last hours is most welcome.$b$bThe being offers no visible acknowledgement of your presence, but a feeling grows within you that he is aware of your every breath.$b$bThinking back to Nazgrim and the others, you consider how best to engage the stranger in conversation.>', '', 54567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome child to my humble valley.  It is my goal in life to build a beverage so delicious it will humble any other experience your taste buds have encountered.$b$bMy research is on the verge of something phenominal, that no pandaren can claim to be even close to achieving.', '', 54566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We should join this fleet, captain. The admiral\'s allies are worthy.', '', 54565, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I yield to your superior skills.', '', 54564, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Williams, we have a challenger. Show this $c what we\'ll do to the orcs!', '', 54563, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll join your fleet if you can best my first officer in battle.', '', 54562, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love the opportunity to punish the Horde for this outrage...', '', 54561, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth is launching a fleet to break the Horde blockade of Kalimdor. Will you join her?', 'Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth is launching a fleet to break the Horde blockade of Kalimdor. Will you join her?', 54560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, time for the good stuff.  This is my special stout... of suffering!', '', 54559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Obviously we got off to a bad start.  How about an ale... of more pain?!', '', 54558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So angry.  We should calm you down with a nice lager... of pain!', '', 54557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re here to conduct business, say your piece.', '', 54556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrraaaghhh!!', '', 54555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Give me a warning before you do that!', 'Give me a warning before you do that!', 54554, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slow down you big fool!', 'Slow down you big fool!', 54553, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wooah... Not so fast next time!', 'Wooah... Not so fast next time!', 54552, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more shootin\' straw orcs fer me!', 'No more shootin\' straw orcs fer me!', 54551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll made the Horde pay, we will!', 'We\'ll made the Horde pay, we will!', 54550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, I\'ll get me gun, and I\'ll shoot ye wit\' it if ye ever interrupt me when I\'m drinkin\' again!', 'Oh, I\'ll get me gun, and I\'ll shoot ye wit\' it if ye ever interrupt me when I\'m drinkin\' again!', 54549, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I\'ll go, but I\'ll go when I\'m good an\' ready...', 'Aye, I\'ll go, but I\'ll go when I\'m good an\' ready...', 54548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 66, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I\'m ready to smash some Horde ships to splinters!', 'Aye, I\'m ready to smash some Horde ships to splinters!', 54547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your essence... is MINE.', '', 54546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26132, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put down that ale and take up your gun. Your captain\'s shipping out.', 'Put down that ale and take up your gun. Your captain\'s shipping out.', 54545, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too... *hic* much flavor.  Must...rest.', '', 54544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look like the barmaid...', 'You don\'t look like the barmaid...', 54543, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this about?', 'What\'s this about?', 54542, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I know you?', 'Do I know you?', 54541, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You buyin\' the next round?', 'You buyin\' the next round?', 54540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell ya what, me crewmen are drinkin\' wherever ale can be found in this city. If ya can convince \'em to give up their ales and take up their guns, count me in!', '', 54539, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sounds like the battle will be fierce and the plunder good!', '', 54538, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I haven\'t had a reason to train me guns on a Horde vessel in a long time...', '', 54537, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Challenge accepted! Hit for hit, drink for drink.', '', 54536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth sent me to ask you to join the fleet in breaking the Horde blockade of Kalimdor.', 'Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth sent me to ask you to join the fleet in breaking the Horde blockade of Kalimdor.', 54535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get another parachute?', 'Can I get another parachute?', 54534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yea?', '', 54533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Tis a brave $r who comes between ol\' Ardan and his drink. What can I do fer you?', '\'Tis a brave $r who comes between ol\' Ardan and his drink. What can I do fer you?', 54532, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you for coming so quickly, $n.', 54531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I get another parachute?', 'Can I get another parachute?', 54530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This won\'t hurt a bit.', '', 54529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t wait for all this infernal itching to be gone and to have my lustrous coat back! You have what you wanted. Begone!', '', 54528, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell your admiral that if this works, my ship and crew will be at her command.', '', 54527, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, these... these are the remedies I need. How did she know?', '', 54526, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s scratches himself furiously.', '', 54525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough hiding. It\'s time to take the fight to the iron dwarves.', '', 54524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So the grand admiral knows about my... affliction, does she? I didn\'t know she cared!', '', 54523, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grand admiral asked me to give you these bottles and to ask you to consider joining our efforts against the Horde.', 'The grand admiral asked me to give you these bottles and to ask you to consider joining our efforts against the Horde.', 54522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you see I want to be alone? What\'s the meaning of this disturbance?', '', 54521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help me clense the lake?', 'Can you help me clense the lake?', 54520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is that? What do you want? Don\'t look at me!', '', 54519, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold this rope and don\'t be heavy.', '', 54518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m thirsty!', '', 54517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Na Lek smiles at you, and you feel young as though you have not felt in years.>', '', 54516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi I\'m Jian!  Did we meet before?  You have one of those faces.  Like things with faces have...', '', 54515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut this one down from the shadows.', '', 54514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack the demon soon, or I will.', '', 54513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The stench of sulfur and brimstone... These portals are as foul as the demons themselves.', '', 54512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re leaving. Stay close.', '', 54511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They come endlessly from the palace.', '', 54510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riko is... well, he\'s the most mature hozen I\'ve met so far, which isn\'t saying much.$b$bHe\'s really not as bad as Shokia makes him out to be. I actually think he\'s kind of sweet... in a hozen sort of way.', 54509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our prisoner is strange. He carries no weapon, and his garb is... untraditional.$b$bPerhaps he\'s a lord of some kind. With any luck, we might have captured someone valuable!', 54508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What the jeek are you lookin\' at?', '', 54507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko\'s got a lot to think about.', '', 54506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok\'tar, $n.', 54505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sure, we found an Alliance prisoner of war... but at what price?', 54504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My blades hunger.', '', 54503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing! Nothing....', '', 54502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aspects misplaced their trust.', '', 54501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Shaman can\'t protect you.', '', 54500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mere mortals.', '', 54499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25803, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Shaman is mine, focus on his companions!', '', 54498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None will survive!', '', 54497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough, Shaman!', '', 54496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25807, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a mere mortal. It is time you died like one.', '', 54495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25804, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am with you!', 'I am with you!', 54494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My friend, today we will face one of the greatest and most diabolical of brewmasters the pandaren have ever known.$b$bThere are few who have not heard of the dangers of his brews and yet despite that he is able to dupe people and animals alike into tasting his beverages.$b$bHe must be stopped!  Are you with us?', '', 54493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show yourself!', '', 54492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a moment to catch your breath before we move on.', '', 54491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another ambush. Watch your backs!', '', 54490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out!', '', 54489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gah!', 54488, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 32035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, Kiryn! Let\'s get the ook outta here!', '', 54487, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riko...', 54486, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I on way, Kiryn! And I don\'t care about you weird dead face!', '', 54485, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M BACK, YOU DOOKERS!', '', 54484, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sensed a commotion in the village\'s eastern island.', 54483, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn, another jinyu net! We were so close, too...', 54482, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The coast was clear. Kiryn began to make her escape.', 54481, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shokia, they\'ve spotted me! Give me cover!', 54480, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31193, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'ll teach the jinyu and the Alliance to mess with us! Let\'s get out of here!', 54479, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The center of the jinyu village was clear. Just to be safe, Kiryn planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot.', 54478, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s see if my hozen poison works on jinyu! Try not to blow me up, Shokia!', 54477, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31190, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nice work back there! One more time!', 54476, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shoot all the guards, so I can move ahead!', 54475, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Straining my eyes, I could just barely read her lips, as she said:', 54474, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kiryn had made it to the jinyu village. I spotted her lurking in some bushes on the village\'s edge.', 54473, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I approached my sniper rifle and took aim at the jinyu village.', 54472, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha-?', '', 54471, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 27572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With nobody to watch over our prisoner, I had to make sure he was... incapable of escaping.', 54470, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We set up a small camp in the hills above the jinyu village.', 54469, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the crystal so we can move on.', '', 54468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will make the arrangements right away, my king. I know several captains that we might persuade to help us in dealing with this blockade...', 54467, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Admiral, send the remnants of Theramore\'s fleet to assist the night elves and issue letters of marque to any captains willing to take up our cause.', '', 54466, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stormwind and the Alliance cannot allow them to succeed, but our options are limited. Most of the fleet is being refitted.', '', 54465, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So Garrosh hopes to isolate Kalimdor completely?', '', 54464, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh Syra, Syra. She is the most beautiful person I have ever met and the kindest soul to ever walk Pandaria.$b$bWe want to get married but she is a Goldendraft, and I\'m a Wanderbrew.', '', 54463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Orc ships have begun a blockade of the Kalimdor coastline. No passengers can reach the continent and our merchants cannot move their goods!', 54462, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde did attack the ship, preventing it from reaching Teldrassil. But that\'s only the beginning of it...', 54461, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your Highness, with $n\'s help, I have completed my investigation into what happened aboard the Bravery.', 54460, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move out!', 'Move out!', 54459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to continue?', '', 54458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The important thing is that these jinyu and Alliance have joined forces. Come speak with me, $n. I can give you the final part of our report.', 54457, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 31543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I done fightin\', went up to Kiryn to ask for my... reward.', '', 54456, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHHH!', '', 54455, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from our plane, hozen scum!', '', 54454, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 30564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance and jinyu... fight side by side?', '', 54453, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
