('Never! Riko protect you to death!', 'Never! Riko protect you to death!', 54448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the jinyu set this trap, they\'ll be back soon.$b$b<Kiryn looks up at the horizon in shock.>$b$bDark Lady watch over us... they\'re here. Save yourself, Riko!', 54447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
