('Death to the Legion!', '', 54444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT THE OOK IS WRONG WITH YOUR FACE? YOU\'RE... YOU\'RE JEEKIN\' DEAD?', '', 54443, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course. Let me just take off my mask...', 54442, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... uh... can Riko get a kiss?', '', 54441, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riko, you... you saved my life.', 54440, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31186, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I save you, Kiryn!', '', 54439, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wha- Help! Help, Shokia! Riko!', 54438, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31185, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You nothin\' but a blikk-jeekin\', dikkety dook-manker with an ook for a head!', '', 54437, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, you tik-jooglin\' orc! Riko done following you stupid orders!', '', 54436, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t you dare follow her, Riko. I don\'t want you messing things up again.', 54435, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 31542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see it, Shokia. I\'ll go take a look.', 54434, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31184, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
