('I cracked knuckles and got ready for fight.$b|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_gauntlets_05.blp:32|t  |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_inscription_pigment_emerald.blp:32|t$b', '', 54432, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yelling at Shokia wasn\'t doing nothin\'. Riko decided to follow Kiryn.', '', 54431, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe Riko lost temper a little bit.', '', 54430, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shokia watched the prisoner while Kiryn went ahead.', '', 54429, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We kept goin\' south, until Shokia started whinin\' about somethin\'.', '', 54428, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That coded message is the only clue we have.', 54425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has us by the purse, and if the king doesn\'t send his fleet to teach them a lesson, we\'re doomed.', 'The Horde has us by the purse, and if the king doesn\'t send his fleet to teach them a lesson, we\'re doomed.', 54424, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t think this\'ll help much, but here\'s my petition.', 'Don\'t think this\'ll help much, but here\'s my petition.', 54423, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Wrynn will listen to you, you\'re a hero to the Alliance!', 'King Wrynn will listen to you, you\'re a hero to the Alliance!', 54422, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How long will it be before the Horde does to us what it did to Theramore? The king must understand...', 'How long will it be before the Horde does to us what it did to Theramore? The king must understand...', 54421, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde means to strangle us to death this time. I hope to the Light that the king acts before it\'s too late...', 'The Horde means to strangle us to death this time. I hope to the Light that the king acts before it\'s too late...', 54420, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the king can\'t keep our shipments safe, he has no business on that throne!', 'If the king can\'t keep our shipments safe, he has no business on that throne!', 54419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I supposed to feed my family if I can\'t move my goods?', 'How am I supposed to feed my family if I can\'t move my goods?', 54418, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Word is that I\'m not the only one who can\'t get goods into or out of Kalimdor.', 'Word is that I\'m not the only one who can\'t get goods into or out of Kalimdor.', 54417, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riko time! I know what happened next! Pick me! Over here, $n!', '', 54416, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... release!', '', 54415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No peace here... no rest...', '', 54414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkness...', '', 54413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Away! Leave us to suffer!', '', 54412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never... submit!', '', 54411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did this land come from? It seems to have appeared from nowhere!', 'Where did this land come from? It seems to have appeared from nowhere!', 54410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These savage primates want to kill us! Tell me... how can we overcome them?', 'These savage primates want to kill us! Tell me... how can we overcome them?', 54409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I were to answer you now, I would deny you the enlightenment that should be yours.', '', 54408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must learn to ponder, stranger. Your impetuous questions betray a lazy mind.', '', 54407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen carefully to the silence, $c. What does it say?', '', 54406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is yet much which stands between you and your question\'s answer.', '', 54405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To ask a thing only begins to prepare the mind to receive the answer.', '', 54404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you truly desire to know such things, the answer shall come to you when you are prepared to receive it.', '', 54403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To merely provide an answer teaches nothing.$b$bPandaria is a land of teaching and learning.', '', 54402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very good, $r! Remember, your ring will not reach its full charge for many hours.', 'Very good, $r! Remember, your ring will not reach its full charge for many hours.', 54401, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deep truths may only be learned through deep questioning.', '', 54400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you... WHAT are you?', 'Who are you... WHAT are you?', 54399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then.$B$BIt is good that I no longer sleep.', 'Well then.$B$BIt is good that I no longer sleep.', 54398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One cannot break Pandaria.$b$bOne can only break one\'s self upon Pandaria.', '', 54397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The more eagerly you seek after a thing, the more it eludes you.', '', 54396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand!? Outrageous! I\'ll kill you while you sleep!', 'Ten thousand!? Outrageous! I\'ll kill you while you sleep!', 54395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what brings you to our lands, stranger.$b$bThe mists of Pandaria will reveal the answer in time...', '', 54394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Lorewalker Cho watches you with a curious anticipation.>', '', 54393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Lorewalker\'s kind eyes rest upon you attentively.>', '', 54392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Pay the 10,000 gold.>', '<Pay the 10,000 gold.>', 54391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see... involved in some shady business, $r? Oh no need to worry - the confidentiality of all transactions is assured.$B$BThis ring you have is a superb piece of work. We can begin the charging process... for a modest fee. Charging the ring will take roughly one half of your world\'s cycles to complete. In other words, twelve hours.$B$BShall we say 10,000 gold? That\'s fair.', '', 54390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re lucky I don\'t kill you right now... you look delicious.', 54389, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 31181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.', '', 54388, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 27571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How, exactly, do you have me cornered, undead?', '', 54387, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 27570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t move, human. I\'ve got you cornered.', 54386, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 31179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rendezvous back here when you\'re done.', 54385, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll cover you from here. It\'s dark, so you\'ll have to mark my targets for me.', 54384, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31539, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way, Kiryn.', 54383, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31538, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, dooker...', '', 54382, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31069, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, Riko. You stay here. Try not to get anyone killed this time.', 54381, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 31537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And... and I will protect Kiryn from danger.', '', 54380, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good idea. I\'ll scout that area up ahead.', 54379, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 31175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll set up camp soon. First, we\'ll take advantage of this darkness to do some reconnaissance.', 54378, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riko.', 54377, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right, Kiryn.', 54376, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How am I supposed to run my business with an empty warehouse?', 'How am I supposed to run my business with an empty warehouse?', 54375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Does King Wrynn even care our plight?', 'Does King Wrynn even care our plight?', 54374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I can\'t move goods to and from Kalimdor, I\'ll be ruined!', 'If I can\'t move goods to and from Kalimdor, I\'ll be ruined!', 54373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t afford to miss another shipment!', 'I can\'t afford to miss another shipment!', 54372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I returned back to camp with my quarry. Shokia would be pleased.', 54371, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At the northern shrine, I found him: a scrawny-looking human soldier.', 54370, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'UNUSED', 54369, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw signs of a campfire up ahead, on the eastern side of the statue.', '', 54368, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I encountered enemies, I\'d hit them with the smoke. Shokia\'s sniper rifle would take care of the rest.', 54367, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I found a stack of smoke bombs in my pockets. They\'d have to do.$b|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_smoke.blp:32|t$b', 54366, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We traveled south until night fell. Shokia spoke:', 54365, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After they boarded the ship, I closed my eyes and hid. Please don\'t make me talk about it...', '', 54364, 0, 12951, 430, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I managed to take one of the attackers\' weapons and fight back, but there were too many of them. See? I still have the axe...', '', 54363, 0, 12951, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dafeng! What\'s wrong? Why are you hiding back here?', 54362, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those orcs took my wife and tossed her into the water when she tried to protect the goods we were bringing to Stormwind! You can\'t let them get away with this!', '', 54361, 0, 12951, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Horde warships stopped us and their warriors swarmed over the deck of the Bravery. They took what they wanted and killed those who wouldn\'t cooperate. We were outnumbered...', 54360, 0, 12951, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All right Riko, I think $n has heard enough. Kiryn can tell the next part.', 54359, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened on the Bravery?', 'What happened on the Bravery?', 54358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait for another opening. I\'ll meet you on the far side.', 54357, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27402, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to wait for the winds to settle, then make a break for the cover of the far hallway.', 54356, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 27401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait!', 54355, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 27400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Freeze!', '', 54354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s summons a Resonating Crystal!', '', 54353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All I wanted was to visit some friends in the city. I never wanted this! Why is the Horde doing this to us?', '', 54352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to my clothes?!', 'What happened to my clothes?!', 54351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you?! Who are you?! Where am I?!', 'What are you?! Who are you?! Where am I?!', 54350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s what\'s left of the message we found, $n. Can you make any sense of it?', 54349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why does it hurt?!', 'Why does it hurt?!', 54348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Devrestrasz sent me. He said you have a message to decode?', 'Lord Devrestrasz sent me. He said you have a message to decode?', 54347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m your man! Give me the coded message.', 'I\'m your woman! Give me the coded message.', 54346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have swept the wreckage for days, Your Majesty. There is no sign of Admiral Taylor or his ships.', 54345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Five hundred ships at my disposal, yet the one that holds the key to the kingdom is missing. How can this be?', '', 54344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde seems determined to escalate this war even further and that warchief has his eyes on my homeland!', '', 54343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They... they just attacked a ship full of passengers!', '', 54342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything was goin\' great! I felt like we was really bonding.', '', 54341, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s why you\'re here, $n. The egg was hidden here at the Vermillion Redoubt. Days ago, it disappeared.$B$BWhoever did it was able to elude our sharpest guards. One of the thieves was killed during the abduction, although now I believe he may have been a diversion - the egg is simply GONE.$B$BOn his corpse we found this note. It remains our only clue, but it is written in a dense code and it MUST be deciphered.', 54340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened to the egg?', 'What happened to the egg?', 54339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Corastrasza does a double-take.>$B$BYou!? YOU helped Rheastrasza? And lived to tell about it?$B$BI underestimate you, $r. No wonder Lord Devrestrasz sent you to me.$B$BNo doubt you remember what happened next: Rheastrasza was killed by Deathwing, but thanks to her sacrifice a single purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden.', '<Corastrasza does a double-take.>$B$BYou!? YOU helped Rheastrasza? And lived to tell about it?$B$BI underestimate you, $r. No wonder Lord Afrasastrasz sent you to me.$B$BNo doubt you remember what happened next: Rheastrasza was killed by Deathwing, but thanks to her sacrifice a single purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden.', 54338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course! I helped her back when I was in the Badlands.', 'Of course! I helped her back when I was in the Badlands.', 54337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Believe it or not, her plan DID work. She acquired an egg - I\'m still not certain by what means - and claimed to have severed its link to the tainted flight.$B$BThen Deathwing found out about it.$B$BHe cornered Rheastrasza in a cave in the Badlands, destroying her and all of her work. Or so he thought. Rheastrasza had sacrificed her own eggs to fool the Aspect of Death.$B$BThe single, purified black dragon egg was secreted away and hidden!', 54336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did it work?', 'Did it work?', 54335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde is up to something. They\'ve never attacked our transports directly before.', 54334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
