('Hey Gorrok, which girl do you like? Shokia or Kiryn?', '', 54317, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Stay out - no visitors.\" Hah!', '', 54316, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, the hut! Good idea. You go first.', '', 54315, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31058, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will investigate this hut. Perhaps they have seen Alliance survivors.', '', 54314, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come on, Kiryn. Let\'s go do girl stuff.', 54313, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 31532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be on the lookout for Alliance.', '', 54312, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After inspecting the statues, we saw this old lady pandaren come out of the house.', '', 54311, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was just me and Gorrok. I let him take the lead... him bein\' all big and all.', '', 54310, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31056, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Patience is not one of my virtues.', '', 54309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll let you have the first kill.  Don\'t make me regret that.', '', 54308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drinking is tiring work... Time to fish!  Wait, that\'s not right... Fishing is boring work, time to drink!', 'Drinking is tiring work... Time to fish!  Wait, that\'s not right... Fishing is boring work, time to drink!', 54307, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink up!', 'Drink up!', 54306, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink time!', 'Drink time!', 54305, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack. I don\'t like to be kept waiting.', '', 54304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a drink...', 'Time for a drink...', 54303, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Waiting to attack...', '', 54302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shokia an\' Kiryn went off to do some girl stuff.', '', 54301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31055, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things was goin\' good, so we decided to split up for a bit.', '', 54300, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My magic is fading. I\'m going through!', '', 54299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We was travelin\' east, looking for those horkin\' human guys.', '', 54298, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 31053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will hold them back so we can get past. Be ready.', '', 54297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen a single Guardian Demon slaughter a hundred elves.  Tread lightly.', '', 54296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da faire be easy times for ol\' Griftah...', '', 54295, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been discovered. I know you\'re tired, but we cannot keep the Aspects waiting!', '', 54294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will get what they deserve, in due time.', '', 54292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground.', 'It\'s all their fault, stupid orcs. Had to burn my farm to the ground.', 54291, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm.', 'It\'s all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm.', 54290, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today.', 'I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today.', 54289, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many demons, not enough time.', '', 54288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help a poor bloke out?', 'Help a poor bloke out?', 54287, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alms for the poor?', 'Alms for the poor?', 54286, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could ye spare some coin?', 'Could ye spare some coin?', 54285, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me if you\'d like to live long enough to see me save this world!', '', 54284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?', 'Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?', 54283, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spare some copper?', 'Spare some copper?', 54282, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoooohoo, you well-proportioned charmer, you!', 'Yoooohoo, you well-proportioned charmer, you!', 54281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweetie! Hey, $c! Are you interested in a woman able to hold intelligent discourse and look attractive while doing so?', 'Sweetie! Hey, $c! Are you interested in a woman able to hold intelligent discourse and look attractive while doing so?', 54280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You! The cute one! Would you like to go over to my place and look over my tool collection?', 'You! The cute one! Would you like to go over to my place and look over my tool collection?', 54279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooo, walk by again, cutie! Your posterior muscles are very finely toned!', 'Ooo, walk by again, cutie! Your posterior muscles are very finely toned!', 54278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think we stand a better chance fighting alongside one another.', '', 54277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many choices, so little time...', 'So many choices, so little time...', 54276, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The faire seems to bring out all the lookers!', 'The faire seems to bring out all the lookers!', 54275, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, in the shadows.', '', 54274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26076, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragon Soul\'s link to the portal has been broken!  The Soul plummets downwards towards the Well!', 'The Dragon Soul\'s link to the portal has been broken!  The Soul plummets downwards towards the Well!', 54273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragon Soul is safe once again. Quickly, into the time portal, before this world sunders!', '', 54272, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 25960, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No...no! This victory will not be ripped from my grasp! I will not return to him in failure! I will not be torn from this pitiful world! No...NOOOOOOOO!!!', '', 54271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Malfurion, he has done it! The portal is collapsing!', 54270, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 26003, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead the way.', 'Lead the way.', 54269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande is imbued with the shining light of the Moon Goddess!', 'Tyrande is imbued with the shining light of the Moon Goddess!', 54268, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to keep moving; are you ready?', '', 54267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Demonic] Revos ill ok mordanas archim maz naztheros! Archim xi ante maz-re mishun te nagas!', '', 54266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26097, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Illidan!', 54265, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 26002, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be the savior of our people! I WILL FULFILL MY DESTINY!', '', 54264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26098, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande collapses!  The Light of Elune winks out!', 'Tyrande collapses!  The Light of Elune winks out!', 54263, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan...you musn\'t!', 54262, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 26001, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not the sole wielder of Sargeras\' power, Mannoroth! Behold!', '', 54261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26096, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A massive demonic portal opens nearby!', 'A massive demonic portal opens nearby!', 54260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes...yes! I can feel his burning eyes upon me, he is close...so close! And then your world will be unmade, your lives as nothing!', '', 54259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan, I am out of arrows! Moon goddess, protect us from the darkness, that we may see your light again another night!', 54258, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 26000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is still connected to the Well somehow! Focus your attacks on Mannoroth, we must disrupt his concentration!', '', 54257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Sargeras, I will not fail you! Sweep your molten fist through this world, so that it may be reborn in flames and darkness!', '', 54256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varo\'then\'s magical sword falls to the ground!', 'Varo\'then\'s magical sword falls to the ground!', 54255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sword has pierced his infernal armor! Strike him down!', '', 54254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26095, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Light of lights...I have failed you. I am sorry...my Azshara...', '', 54253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26135, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan has recovered!', 'Illidan has recovered!', 54252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Illidan has been knocked to the ground!  Mannoroth is looking for a new target!', 'Illidan has been knocked to the ground!  Mannoroth is looking for a new target!', 54251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How DARE you turn your back on me?', '', 54250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mwahahahaha. Had enough, Stormrage?', '', 54249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I...will not...be defeated...', '', 54248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 54247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to be hidden by your shadowcloak.', 'I am ready to be hidden by your shadowcloak.', 54246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How do we deal with the demons?', 'How do we deal with the demons?', 54245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you familiar with the late dragon Rheastrasza? A little off, that one. She often lurked about the Badlands in the form of a mortal goblin.$B$BRheastrasza came up with a scheme to steal and purify a black dragon egg, severing its tie with the black dragonflight and the corrupted Earth Warder, Deathwing.', 54244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are some mighty fine animals...', 'These are some mighty fine animals...', 54243, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how fast these guys can move?', 'I wonder how fast these guys can move?', 54242, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how many kegs these animals can hold?', 'I wonder how many kegs these animals can hold?', 54241, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened here? What was stolen?', 'What happened here? What was stolen?', 54240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm...', 'Hmm...', 54239, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve had no luck tracking down the missing black dragon egg.$B$BHave you discovered anything, $n?', 54238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lost. Stolen! This is a terrible blow. Terrible!', 54237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande can hold her own once again!', 'Tyrande can hold her own once again!', 54236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wonderful!', 'Wonderful!', 54235, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I had more room in my store, I\'d take you all with me to Dalaran.', 'If only I had more room in my store, I\'d take you all with me to Dalaran.', 54234, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tyrande is overwhelmed! Use the Blessing of Elune to drive the demons back!', 'Tyrande is overwhelmed! Use the Blessing of Elune to drive the demons back!', 54233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Corastrasza steps between you and the nearby corpse, her face wrinkled with concern.>$B$BI\'m sorry, $n. This is a private matter for the red flight to resolve.$B$BPlease see if you can help the others outside.', 54232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will hold them back for now!', 54231, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 25999, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... So cute!', 'Oh... So cute!', 54230, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light of Elune, save me!', 54229, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 25998, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at all these adorable animals!', 'Look at all these adorable animals!', 54228, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will handle the demons. Elune, guide my arrows!', 54227, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 25997, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anything outside of that circle around you will not be able to see you, but the illusion will fade if you attack or take damage.\n$bI suggest you remain hidden until I say otherwise, these demons are too powerful to face head on and in full force.', '', 54226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For you, Azshara.', '', 54225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26134, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadows will hide us well.\n$bI am concealed by this shadowcloak, and can imbue its magics onto you.\n$bIt will not make us invisible, but as long as we keep our distance from our foes we will remain hidden.', '', 54224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come Stormrage, and I will show you what happens to those that betray the lord of the Legion!', '', 54223, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 26478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Interesting...  Very interesting.', 'Interesting...  Very interesting.', 54222, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks good so far.', 'Looks good so far.', 54221, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sloppy, but adequate.  You seem capable in a fight and in need of direction.\n$bThere are hundreds of demons ahead, it would be suicide to go it alone:', '', 54220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything seems to be in order here.', 'Everything seems to be in order here.', 54219, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm...', 'Hmm...', 54218, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots of junk food here, but is it ever delicious.', 'Lots of junk food here, but is it ever delicious.', 54217, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... No one here specializes in fresh bread...', 'Hmm... No one here specializes in fresh bread...', 54216, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re good at hawking their goods...', 'They\'re good at hawking their goods...', 54215, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much activity... It reminds me of the Trade District.', 'So much activity... It reminds me of the Trade District.', 54214, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Aimee has some sweet pies.', 'That Aimee has some sweet pies.', 54213, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This faire is a sweet surprise!', 'This faire is a sweet surprise!', 54212, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is huge!', 'This place is huge!', 54211, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at this place!', 'Look at this place!', 54210, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, that looks like fun!', 54209, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t have to wory about getting sunburned out here.', 54208, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is much more relaxing than being on the speedbarge.', 54207, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is nothing at all like the Shimmering Flats.', 54206, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings!  I am apprentice to Brewmaster Shadowpour, a pandaren we now call the Mad Brewer.$b$BHis reckless pursuit of flavor at the risk of safety has resulted in countless injuries, illnesses, and now even the wildlife of the area feels his mad brewing.  He is a villain, and I could use your help in stopping him.', 54205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What a festive event.', 54204, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you charge my Cryptomancer\'s Decoder Ring?', 'Can you charge my Cryptomancer\'s Decoder Ring?', 54203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s nice to relax for a day.', 54202, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No need to lug water around here.', 54201, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well this is certainly a nice change of scenery.', 54200, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arcurion begins to freeze Thrall in a block of ice.', '', 54199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to reach the top of the temple to leave for the Air Plateau.', 'I need to reach the top of the temple to leave for the Air Plateau.', 54198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is crucial that we bring all of the three remaining spirits back safely. I am too old to do this myself, and for all their strengths, both Aysa and Ji are single-minded in their ideals.$B$BYou possess all the qualities of a hero, and a balance that they do not. It is you that must do this.', '', 54197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $p! This way to Morning Breeze Village.', '', 54196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 27294, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Fox Grove before your Stag becomes angry!', 'Return to the Fox Grove before your Stag becomes angry!', 54195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not take the practice of spirit-binding lightly. If the mogu are creating simulacra, you can be certain they\'re preparing for war.', '', 54194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.', 54193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my cloth. Can you rip me off another piece?', 'I lost my cloth. Can you rip me off another piece?', 54192, 0, 12936, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh...', 'Ugh...', 54191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so sorry for getting that on you.', 'I am so sorry for getting that on you.', 54190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It tasted soooo good going down.', 'It tasted soooo good going down.', 54189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am an orc, ma\'am. Would you mind if I asked you a few questions?', 'I am an orc, ma\'am. Would you mind if I asked you a few questions?', 54187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What manner of creature are you?$b$b<The pandaren pauses, her eyes growing wide.>$b$bMy... look at that gorgeous green skin!', 54186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Handle Varo\'then. Mannoroth is mine.', '', 54184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26094, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hear the rest of your report, Shokia.', 'Let\'s hear the rest of your report, Shokia.', 54183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened next, Kiryn?', 'What happened next, Kiryn?', 54182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go on, Riko.', 'Go on, Riko.', 54181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Taking a hozen guide with us might not have been the best idea.', 54180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is no small island, $n. It\'s a landmass that would likely rival Northrend!$b$bHow it has gone undiscovered is still a mystery.', 54179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah?', '', 54178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re surrounded - dispatch the ascendant while I keep the ambushers at bay.', '', 54177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight forces begin to appear around the canyon\'s edges.', '', 54176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are super brave.  Can you teach me to be as brave?', 54175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sticking with you.  You can be my bodyguard!', 54174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope the Jade Witch didn\'t get all of my friends.  She is super spooky.', 54173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next time I see a jade monster I\'m gonna punch it in the naughty bits.', 'Next time I see a jade monster I\'m gonna punch it in the naughty bits.', 54172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I tried to boot a jade monster in the head but hurt my paw.', 'I tried to boot a jade monster in the head but hurt my paw.', 54171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not rest until those wards are functional. We must not be disturbed.', '', 54170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please don\'t tell my parents I was here.', 'Please don\'t tell my parents I was here.', 54169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me!', 'Thank you for saving me!', 54168, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened out here?', 'What happened out here?', 54167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make haste and secure the area! Much work remains to be done.', '', 54166, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rebirth of the Empire of Azjol-Nerub is upon us! Hear my call, brothers, and rise to reclaim what is rightfully ours!', '', 54165, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work faster! We must hatch the cocoon!', '', 54164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies believe us vanquished from the frozen wastes.$B$BWe will show them the consequence of their ignorance.', '', 54163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll blikker yer nook, then hork ya clean, wikket!', '', 54162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Florkun wikket! I\'ll shove your nibs into your horker!', '', 54161, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh! I\'m gunna gork ya til ya ook your dookers, wikket!', '', 54160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spirits of old, I release you from my staff! Seek your vengeance on this beast!', '', 54159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am NEVER drinking again!', 'I am NEVER drinking again!', 54158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More spirits! MORE! Quickly now!', '', 54157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of your interference, $r! Spiritclaws! Deal with this pest!', '', 54156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_mage_conjurewater11.blp:20|t Illidan douses himself with the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:103952|h[Waters of Eternity]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_mage_conjurewater11.blp:20|t Illidan douses himself with the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:103952|h[Waters of Eternity]|h|r!', 54155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancestors, hear me! I call you back from the beyond, to bind this spirit to my will!', '', 54154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_moonglow.blp:20|t Tyrande gains the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:103917|h[Blessing of Elune]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_moonglow.blp:20|t Tyrande gains the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:103917|h[Blessing of Elune]|h|r!', 54153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sting of your defeat will fade with time.', 'The sting of your defeat will fade with time.', 54152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anub\'Arak has fallen, my brothers! Rise from the depths and reclaim our birthright!', '', 54151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' this one\'s for Gizmo and Socks, you bastards!!', '', 54150, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s for beatin\' up Rell!', '', 54149, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one\'s for beatin\' up Amber!', '', 54148, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ouch! Hey!', '', 54147, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see an opening! Here I come, Amber!', '', 54146, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'d need to bring this information back to Pearlfin Village... but not before shooting a few orcs in the head.', 54145, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just as I suspected... the Horde is here, in Pandaria. And they\'ve allied with the hozen.', 54144, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bingo... I see a Horde crate! Cover me, I\'m going out in the open!', '', 54143, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing to see here! Let\'s keep going!', '', 54142, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought these monkeys some presents! Try not to blow me up, Amber!', '', 54141, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sully planted some explosive barrels for me to shoot.', 54140, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work back there! One more time!', '', 54139, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoot all the guards, so I can move ahead!', '', 54138, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27895, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Straining my eyes, I could just barely read his lips, as he said:', 54137, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I found Sully waiting outside the village\'s entrance.', 54136, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As you wish, commander.', 54135, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 0, 27467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill some hozen today, Amber.', '', 54134, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I walked up to the top of the mountain and took a hold of my sniper rifle.', 54133, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We made camp in the mountains. Little Lu watched over Rell.', 54132, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No, we didn\'t find the White Pawn.$b$bNo, I can\'t tell you what the White Pawn is.', 54131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rell is... he is hurt badly.$b$b<Agent Kearnen slams her fist on the ground.>$b$bHe\'s dying, $n! And there\'s not a damn thing we can do about it!', 54130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The loss of the raccoon is the least of our worries. Our biggest concern is that petrified orc... and what its presence means. I can tell you the rest of the story.', 54129, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 27464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeak!', '', 54128, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, Little Lu! Run away!! Before she gets you too!', '', 54127, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27894, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to the boss.', 'Send me to the boss.', 54126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to portal 3.', 'Send me to portal 3.', 54125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to portal 2.', 'Send me to portal 2.', 54124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me to portal 1.', 'Send me to portal 1.', 54123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you\'ve arrived. \n$bThis is the eve of the sundering, when the collapse of the Well of Eternity fractured the continents of the world.\n$bHere, we will snatch up the Dragon Soul before it is lost to the mists of time.\n$bBut first, you must bring down the protective wards of Azshara\'s lackeys. You will find them within the palace. I will scout on ahead.\n$bGood luck, heroes!', '', 54122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They are not where they appear to be!  Strike in an area, it is the only way to uncover the real one!', '', 54121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26093, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I cannot strike them!  What is this demon magic?', 54120, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 25996, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Highguard, to arms! For your queen! For Azshara!', '', 54119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26137, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varo\'then, see that I am not disrupted by this rabble!', '', 54118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes...YES. I can feel the raw power of the Well of Eternity! It is time to end this charade!', '', 54117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26092, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What our people could not.', '', 54116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26091, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After inspecting the statues, we saw a female pandaren emerge from the house.', '', 54115, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Illidan, what is in that vial? What are you doing?', 54114, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 25995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, I have an idea.', '', 54113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh this will be fun...', '', 54112, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 26089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weak, pitiful creatures. Hardly worthy of being called a legion.', '', 54111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother moon, guide us through this darkness.', 54110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25994, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are so MANY of them...', '', 54109, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 26087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He knows what we attempt. We have not much time, the forest crawls with his demons.', 54108, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 25993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot break his will alone...', '', 54107, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 26495, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is being maintained by the will of a powerful demon...Mannoroth.', '', 54106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them come.', '', 54105, 0, 0, 45, 65, 0, 26085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, we shall break it for you.', '', 54104, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 26086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you close the portal, brother?', '', 54103, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 26084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grook \'em in the nook, then gork \'em clean!', '', 54102, 0, 12956, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horg \'em off their jeeks and blikker \'em til their wik falls off!', '', 54101, 0, 12956, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grook \'em \'til they ook in their dookers!', '', 54100, 0, 12956, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grook \'em in the kroogs, boys!', '', 54099, 0, 12956, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grook them florkin\' wikkets!', '', 54098, 0, 12956, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Hour of Twilight falls - the end of all things - you cannot stop it. You are nothing. NOTHING!', '', 54097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25801, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SOCKS! NOOOOOOOOOOO!', '', 54096, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27893, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'AHHH HA HA HAAAAA!', 54095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 31401, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I finally understood what was going on... but I was a second too late.', '', 54094, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sully... those aren\'t statues on her lawn! She wants to turn you into jade!', '', 54093, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 29881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in blazes are you talkin\' about...', '', 54092, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 27892, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Beard-Sprite will make an excellent addition to my family!', 54091, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 31400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m a dwarf, ma\'am. Can we borrow some food?', '', 54090, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 27891, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now look at this... a jinyu and... what is that? Some sort of Beard-Sprite?', 54089, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 31399, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now wait a darn minute. Is that an orc? Is... is the HORDE here too!?', '', 54088, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27890, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This person sure has lots o\' statues...', '', 54087, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pshh! No sign is gonna stop me an\' my best pal Socks!', '', 54086, 0, 0, 4, 64, 0, 27888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One statue in particular stood out. I had never seen a creature like this.', '', 54085, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The lawn was littered with small jade statues. They seemed almost... lifelike.', '', 54084, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sign out front was not very... welcoming.', '', 54083, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I envy you in a way, little $r.$B$BYou are so fortunate as to bear witness to the first steps of the rebirth of the mighty Empire of Azjol-Nerub.', '', 54082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. I\'d be bound to that wretched construct right now if it weren\'t for your intervention.$B$BStill, I shouldn\'t be here at all. We must put a stop to the spiritbinders.', '', 54081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poo not good to eat, but very good to throw.', 'Poo not good to eat, but very good to throw.', 54080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t pull own tail when there are other tails to pull.', 'Don\'t pull own tail when there are other tails to pull.', 54079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t roll in own poo unless want to smell like poo all day.', 'Don\'t roll in own poo unless want to smell like poo all day.', 54078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wet fur not fun to sleep on.', 'Wet fur not fun to sleep on.', 54077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Firecracker for throwing, banana for eating.', 'Firecracker for throwing, banana for eating.', 54076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Steal a banana from a hozen, expect a angry hozen.', 'Steal a banana from a hozen, expect a angry hozen.', 54075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Peel banana first, eat second.', 'Peel banana first, eat second.', 54074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t throw banana peel where going to walk.', 'Don\'t throw banana peel where going to walk.', 54073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is a very unusual place.$B$BThe magic I\'m channeling to try to repair the ley lines should be tearing my body apart, but I feel incredible!', 54072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rell survived the attack, but he wasn\'t doing very well.', '', 54071, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We don\'t stand a chance if we face the hozen alone. We will need the help of the Alliance if our tribe is to survive.', '', 54070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things have changed rapidly since you arrived here, $n. The hozen are more of a threat now than ever before.$b$bBut we, jinyu... we are stronger now, too.', '', 54069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AMBER! AIM YER SIGHTS OVER HERE!', '', 54068, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I returned to find Rell bein\' attacked by hozen! Again!', '', 54067, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once the White Pawn is recovered, the full might of our navy can engage the Horde. On OUR terms.', '', 54066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...encountered -- tribe -- extremely hostile creatures...we -- in immediate danger...Requesting rescue, I repeat--', '', 54065, 0, 0, 27, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...[Sound of swords clashing]...immediate danger! Requesting rescue, requesting --', '', 54064, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...hostile creatures. But the White Pawn is accounted for. Repeat: the White Pawn is safe.', '', 54063, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Thick fog bank to provide cover...retreat...uncharted land...', '', 54062, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory is ours today!', '', 54061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...west of the planned rendezvous...Horde airfleet...[gunfire]...casualties!', '', 54060, 0, 0, 333, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear? They\'re safe somewhere!', '', 54059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No time! We\'ll send a small team immediately. An elite force. Rescue the survivors, AND their precious cargo!', '', 54058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightwind, have you pieced together that last transmission yet? Play me whatever you have!', '', 54057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your Majesty! We\'ve finally restored Taylor\'s last transmission.', '', 54056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sir, we can have the entirety of the seventh fleet on the scene within the month--', 54055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Northrend\'s depths belong to the nerubians, $r.$B$BI have devoted myself to restoring that great truth.', '', 54052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot fall here. Not with so much work left to be done...', '', 54051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh! Too... much... It\'s too much!', '', 54050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL have you, spirit-sage!', '', 54049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All these poor souls... here, this will lead you home.', '', 54047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
