('No. Your perversion of the dead ends here.', '', 54046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nnn... nn nnnn... n-nl nnnr nnn... nn n nnnt...\n\n<I\'ll... be fine... it\'ll wear off... in a bit...>', '', 54045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... Rell...', '', 54044, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 27884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weeeeee!', '', 54043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My orchids!', '', 54042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pollen punch!', '', 54041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Socks followed along, faithfully.', '', 54040, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After scoutin\' the three shrines, I headed back over to camp.', '', 54039, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found nothin\' at the northern shrine - no Anduin, no hozen... nothin\'.', '', 54038, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grrrrr...*hic*...rrr...', '', 54037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there!  It looks as though the Twilight Cultists have brought the Old Gods and their corruption to Wyrmrest.  Hold on tight!', '', 54036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, Socks. Let\'s get out of here before you get sniped.', '', 54035, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 27878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
