('', 'Well well, a young visitor.$B$bHave you come to pay your respects at the shrine of my husband?  He was a hero you know.  A master of Jade crafting and fighting. He was to be remembered forever they said.$B$bDo you like my statues?  I craft them with special care saving only the best to  provide my husband company and protection.', 53907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
