('The washed ones!', '', 53871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugly fish men!', '', 53870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood! Blood! Blood!', '', 53869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, oh, I know! The eggheads!', '', 53868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grim! Grim! Grimleer!', '', 53867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeeeaaaahhh!', '', 53866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sea riders!', '', 53865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmmm...', '', 53864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monkeys!', '', 53863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill! Kill! Kill!', '', 53862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blue banners!', '', 53861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Water?', '', 53860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Us! Grimleer!', '', 53859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pale skins!', '', 53858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza\'s drakes should meet us here...', '', 53857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25887, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Personal hygiene?', '', 53856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You, Chief!', '', 53855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaahaahahaha!', '', 53854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ravage! Ravage! Ravage!', '', 53853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one messes with the Grimleer Tribe. It is time for our clan to taste blood and victory!', '', 53852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then I remind you...WE are the strongest in this forest. We are the kings of the trees! We are death to our enemies!', '', 53851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we going to let those soft-skinned, tail-less cowards cut down our forest and kill our clan brothers?', '', 53850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, idiots! The ones down by the beach!', '', 53849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is our greatest enemy?', '', 53848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who owns this forest?', '', 53847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"It is good to see you again, Aysa. You\'ve come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek.\"', '', 53845, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Go, children. We shall meet again very soon.\"', '', 53844, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo\'s presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\"', '', 53843, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"If you find these things and bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\"', '', 53842, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger. He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\"', '', 53841, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll hold them off as long as I can!', '', 53840, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 27718, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Little Lu, keep Amber alive! Sully, try and keep this plane from exploding on us!', '', 53839, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 27717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen up, men! Prepare for a hozen ambush!', '', 53838, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 27716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s still breathin\', sir! Get over here! Talk to \'er!', '', 53837, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27854, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are Amber and Nimm? Should we follow him?', '', 53836, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 29870, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s Amber an\' Nimm\'s plane! They might be alive after all!', '', 53835, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naw, that\'s a plane. Wait... A PLANE!?', '', 53834, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 27852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s that, over there? Some kind of bird?', '', 53833, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 29869, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somethin\' hit it, sir. Wasn\'t cut down, didn\'t fall on its own.', '', 53832, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 27849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you suppose happened to this tree, Sully?', '', 53831, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 27715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off with you, $c. You have much to do.', '', 53829, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The closest spirit is Huo, the spirit of flame. You will meet with some of my most talented students and learn what they know of Huo.', '', 53828, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must seek out the elemental spirits and reunite them in the temple. Through this we will heal the land and find understanding of what truly ails it.', '', 53827, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did they find us? Ready your weapons - we\'ve got to get out of this canyon!', '', 53826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25871, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where do you think you\'re going, little lizard?', 53825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25818, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here you see the Darkmoon Deathmatch pit.  Do you possess the power and will to best all comers and take the pit fighter\'s prize?\n\nBouts begin at midnight and every three hours thereafter.', '', 53824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them come!', '', 53823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer returns.', '', 53822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let none stand in our way.', '', 53821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me hear the rest of your report, Agent Kearnen.', 'Let me hear the rest of your report, Agent Kearnen.', 53820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter what happens - we must stay focused on our objectives here.', 53819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a fool if you think to take your place as the Aspect of Earth, Shaman!', '', 53818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25802, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your training will be put to use very soon, young $c. Go now, continue your lessons.', '', 53816, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very recently, all four spirits left the temple and scattered to the corners of Shen-zin Su. The land suffers.', '', 53815, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the Darkmoon Deathmatch BEGIN!', '', 53814, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention, fairegoers! The Darkmoon Deathmatch is about to begin! In mere moments the prize chest will appear at the center of the fighting pit!', '', 53813, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In caring for the spirits and bringing them back among us, we can heal the land, and we can find understanding of the greater threats at hand.', '', 53812, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the land ails, the spirits are first to feel the ill tiding. When the spirits leave the temple and fall to their baser instincts, the wise Pandaren takes heed.', '', 53811, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold, Master Greenpaw, known throughout the lands as the Jade Fist Monk.$b$bThrough skill, determination, and chi, he mastered the form now known as the dreaded Jade Strike, a blow that would transmute foes into statues of jade.$b$bIt was his heroism and sacrifice that saved the Jade Forest in a time of great need, and his like is not to be seen in this world again.$b$bMay this statue forever stand as a reminder of the price of peace, and may his sacrifice never be forgotten.', '', 53810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare for adventure!', 'Prepare for adventure!', 53809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings!', 'Greetings!', 53808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe that\'s just a big scary mask on its face...', '', 53807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome!', 'Welcome!', 53806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!', 'Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire!', 53805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!', 'Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, $c!', 53804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will go nowhere, Shaman.', '', 53803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This statue does not match the description of Shin that An Windfur gave you.', 'This statue does not match the description of Shin that An Windfur gave you.', 53802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike. The expression is locked in horror.', 'The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike. The expression is locked in horror.', 53801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you help us? Our friend is injured.', 'Can you help us? Our friend is injured.', 53800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, little children?', 53799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy them all, but bring the Shaman to me!', '', 53798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman! The Dragon Soul is not yours. Give it up, and you may yet walk away with your life.', '', 53797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My people do not like strangers, but I owe you this much. May the elders not punish me for this deed.', '', 53796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 30639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The statue\'s shoulder looks quite imposing in relation to the rest of its features. The subject was clearly a mighty creature!$b$bPerhaps it\'s a good natured sort. Or if not, then maybe it\'s extinct!$b$bOne can hope...', '', 53795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is now open!$b$bFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.$b$bWould you like to go?', 'The Darkmoon Faire is now open!$b$bFor a small fee, I can teleport you to the fairground staging area.$b$bWould you like to go?', 53794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This portion of the statue tells you little, other than the subject actually had arms...', '', 53793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Create a sketch of the statue piece.>', '<Create a sketch of the statue piece.>', 53792, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortunately, you can still make out enough detail to sketch what looks to be a creature\'s torso.', '', 53791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Is that...is that a $r I see? Thank you for rescuing me.', '', 53790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened next, Little Lu?', 'What happened next, Little Lu?', 53789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad that these \"SI:7\" people decided to take me with.$b$bWe do not leave the comforts of our lake very often at all. This was the farthest I\'ve ever been from home.', '', 53788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_shaman_cleansespirit.blp:16|tThrall casts |cFF00FFFF|Hspell:103550|h[Cleanse Spirit]|h|r on you!', '', 53787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stop!  You will NOT turn my friends into stupid statues!', 53786, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the statue', 'Examine the statue', 53784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The features of this jade statue are incredibly lifelike.  The expression on the face is one locked in horror.$b$BIt does not resemble Shin however.', '', 53783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep telling your story, Sully.', 'Keep telling your story, Sully.', 53777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Aw shoot, aw shoot, aw shoot...', '', 53775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At the dawn of the year, we elders visit briefly to offer counsel to the living and welcome those who have joined the ancestors.', '', 53773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need something built or broken? Stripped or soldered? Cracked or cobbled? You\'ve come to the right engineer.', '', 53772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, continue your report.', 'Please, continue your report.', 53770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Rell does not look up to address you.>$b$b<Judging by his state, you\'re not certain he even has the energy to move his head.>', '', 53769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did well, Agent Kearnen. Now save your energy... we\'ll fend them off.', 'You did well, Agent Kearnen. Now save your energy... we\'ll fend them off.', 53765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The... the monkeys... they attacked...$b$bI fought them off, but... they\'ll be back... with more...', 53764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve been stranded here for days. We are stretched to the breaking point, but trying our best to keep spirits high.', 53760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you have for sale?', 'What do you have for sale?', 53758, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death to all who oppose us!', 'Death to all who oppose us!', 53757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have another Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide?', 'May I have another Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide?', 53756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide?', 'Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide?', 53755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mysteries and wonders surround us every day, not just at the faire.  We\'ve compiled a list of some of the wonders you may encounter in your every day business.  The Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide will help you navigate the wonders of the world.$b$bWith the guide in your possession, you may come across items you never knew existed.  Items you may have taken for granted in the past are now treasures that others long for.$b$bKeep the guide with you, and keep your eyes open for mystery.$b$bIf you happen to lose your guide, seek us out and we will replace it for free.', 'Mysteries and wonders surround us every day, not just at the faire.  We\'ve compiled a list of some of the wonders you may encounter in your every day business.  The Darkmoon Adventurer\'s Guide will help you navigate the wonders of the world.$b$bWith the guide in your possession, you may come across items you never knew existed.  Items you may have taken for granted in the past are now treasures that others long for.$b$bKeep the guide with you, and keep your eyes open for mystery.$b$bIf you happen to lose your guide, seek us out and we will replace it for free.', 53754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and with that out of the way, you and your flock of fumbling friends are next on my list. Mmm, I thought you\'d never get here!', 53751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25819, 396, 153, 0, 0, 4, 0, 39653),
('Rifle through his bag.', 'Rifle through his bag.', 53750, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My skull feels like it was hit by a hammer, but otherwise I\'m all right. That\'s more than I can say for most of the crew.', '', 53749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<He looks like he was knocked unconscious in all the fighting.>$B$B<He clutches tightly to a leather bag.>', '', 53748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things are looking up for us, $n. Now that the attacks are over, we can finally work on repairing our ships to find a way home.', '', 53746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brace yourself!', '', 53745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know how we did it, but we managed to fend off those hozen.$B$BThanks to you, mate.', '', 53744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You picked a nice time to show up, friend. We need every Alliance soldier to pitch in.', '', 53743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s kind of scary looking...', 'It\'s kind of scary looking...', 53739, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve heard some people got outrageous fortunes.', 'I\'ve heard some people got outrageous fortunes.', 53738, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sayge seems pretty nice...', 'Sayge seems pretty nice...', 53737, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if Sayge plays Whack-a-Gnoll?', 'I wonder if Sayge plays Whack-a-Gnoll?', 53735, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder if the fortunes are real...', 'I wonder if the fortunes are real...', 53734, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The boys are afraid of Sayge, that\'s why they stay away.', 'The boys are afraid of Sayge, that\'s why they stay away.', 53733, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mysterious...', 'Mysterious...', 53732, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spooky...', 'Spooky...', 53731, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s truly outrageous that so many workers are hurt.', 'It\'s truly outrageous that so many workers are hurt.', 53728, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope they\'ll be okay.', 'I hope they\'ll be okay.', 53727, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder how they got hurt.', 'I wonder how they got hurt.', 53726, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So many are hurt, that can\'t be good.', 'So many are hurt, that can\'t be good.', 53725, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope they get better.', 'I hope they get better.', 53724, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor workers...', 'Poor workers...', 53723, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww...  They are hurt.', 'Awww...  They are hurt.', 53722, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Awww...', 'Awww...', 53721, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet no one gets in her way.', 'I bet no one gets in her way.', 53720, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Her strength is truly outrageous!', 'Her strength is truly outrageous!', 53719, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s tall!', 'She\'s tall!', 53718, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what it\'s like to have so much fame?', 'I wonder what it\'s like to have so much fame?', 53717, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to be like Kerri when I grow up!', 'I want to be like Kerri when I grow up!', 53716, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think the boys are afraid of her!', 'I think the boys are afraid of her!', 53715, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard she\'s the strongest woman in the world!', 'I heard she\'s the strongest woman in the world!', 53714, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s sooo strong!', 'She\'s sooo strong!', 53713, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
