('The lesser races will learn to once again fear the mogu!', '', 53535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blood for the Thunder King!', '', 53534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard everything, $n. Go ahead to the camp and I\'ll meet you there.', '', 53533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rocks back and forth gently.', '', 53532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s rests his head in his hands and weeps.', '', 53531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s mumbles incoherently to himself.', '', 53529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See? I\'m helping by picking up this full mug of ale that someone left on the ground.', '', 53527, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I...I\'m free? Thank you, $gbrother:sister;.', '', 53526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am in your debt, stranger.', '', 53525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elders will hear of your kindness.', '', 53524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the sacred pools bless you.', '', 53523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, stranger.', '', 53522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unstable solenoids are unstable! RUN!', '', 53516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your end has come!', '', 53515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 53514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will burn!', '', 53513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RIGHT!', '', 53512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('LEFT!', '', 53511, 0, 12811, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Horde sailor likely met his end during the battle.', 'This Horde sailor likely met his end during the battle.', 53510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The General is determined to set up camp here.$b$bI hope he knows what he\'s doing...', 53509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like the deck swabbing assignments from the day of the battle.', 'Looks like the deck swabbing assignments from the day of the battle.', 53508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cannon is dented and streaked with gunpowder.', 'The cannon is dented and streaked with gunpowder.', 53507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The map shows a naval strategy for defeating the Horde fleet.', 'The map shows a naval strategy for defeating the Horde fleet.', 53506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Regrouping... In the village... I think I can make it.', 53505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On your feet! Nazgrim is organizing a counter-attack. We\'re regrouping in the village.', 'On your feet! Nazgrim is organizing a counter-attack. We\'re regrouping in the village.', 53504, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What happened?$b$bWh-where are we?', 53503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This set up sure is hard work.', 'This set up sure is hard work.', 53501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find a stack of partially soaked pages, written in the Prince\'s hand. You\'d better take them back to Nodd.', 'You find a stack of partially soaked pages, written in the Prince\'s hand. You\'d better take them back to Nodd.', 53500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $c, no time for mourning. Let us avenge our fallen brethren and claim this land for the Horde!', '', 53499, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tomb of the Forgotten', 'Tomb of the Forgotten', 53498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crown of Heaven', 'Crown of Heaven', 53497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('White Riding Camel', 'White Riding Camel', 53496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spurious Sarcophagus', 'Spurious Sarcophagus', 53495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to regroup, Sergeant! Go to the nearby village.', 'We need to regroup, Sergeant! Go to the nearby village.', 53494, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I shouldn\'t be alive, $r.$b$bI should have died with the rest of my brothers.', '', 53493, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sand Scarab Pet', 'Sand Scarab Pet', 53492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monogrammed on the leather cover are the initials, \"A.L.W.\" \n\nYou take the few intact pages that remain.', 'Monogrammed on the leather cover are the initials, \"A.L.W.\" \n\nYou take the few intact pages that remain.', 53491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This soldier is not like the others. He looks like a personal bodyguard.', 'This soldier is not like the others. He looks like a personal bodyguard.', 53490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The King\'s royal banner. Someone of royal blood certainly slept in this chamber.', 'The King\'s royal banner. Someone of royal blood certainly slept in this chamber.', 53489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better luck next time, $n. Try using some abilities that hit more than one enemy at a time!', 53488, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh alright! Don\'t get your trousers in a bunch!', '', 53487, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit messing around and use your knife! Nazgrim wants you to report to the village immediately.', 'Quit messing around and use your knife! Nazgrim wants you to report to the village immediately.', 53485, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get me outta here, $n! This lady is going to kill me!', '', 53484, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Corrupted Hippogryph', 'Corrupted Hippogryph', 53483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ogre Mage Costume', 'Ogre Mage Costume', 53482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gregarious Grell Pet', 'Gregarious Grell Pet', 53481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Congratulations to $n, victor of the Rumpus!', 53480, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re nearly done, $n!', 53479, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Halfway there, $n. Keep it up!', 53478, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And now... let the Rumpus start!', 53477, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now entering the arena: $n!', 53476, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you. I\'ll make my way to the village. Stay safe...', 53475, 0, 0, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snap out of it! You\'re alive! Nazgrim has ordered us to report to the nearby village.', 'Snap out of it! You\'re alive! Nazgrim has ordered us to report to the nearby village.', 53474, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I barely made it off the ship before it went down!', 53473, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Swing a hammer, win a prize!', 'Swing a hammer, win a prize!', 53472, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammer swingin\' fun! Who wants to swing a hammer?', 'Hammer swingin\' fun! Who wants to swing a hammer?', 53471, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whack some gnolls! Step right up and whack some gnolls!', 'Whack some gnolls! Step right up and whack some gnolls!', 53470, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hammer time!', 'Hammer time!', 53469, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry about your weight, this cannon can handle any payload!', 'Don\'t worry about your weight, this cannon can handle any payload!', 53468, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step up to get blown up!', 'Step up to get blown up!', 53467, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?', 'Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?', 53466, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Transportation to the other end of the faire!', 'Transportation to the other end of the faire!', 53465, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey! Command a tonk in glorious battle!', 'Hey, hey! Command a tonk in glorious battle!', 53464, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re under attack! Step up and do your part, $c!', 'We\'re under attack! Step up and do your part, $c!', 53463, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and try a tonk!', 'Step right up and try a tonk!', 53462, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tonks! We got tonks here!', 'Tonks! We got tonks here!', 53461, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Find any survivors, $n. We\'re sure to need them...', '', 53460, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can shoot, you can score some sweet prizes!', 'If you can shoot, you can score some sweet prizes!', 53459, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test your skill, win a prize!', 'Test your skill, win a prize!', 53458, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Folks, I\'m handing out epics over here! Don\'t miss out!', 'Folks, I\'m handing out epics over here! Don\'t miss out!', 53457, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step right up and take your best shot!', 'Step right up and take your best shot!', 53456, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guns, guns, guns! C\'mon, pal!', 'Guns, guns, guns! C\'mon, pal!', 53455, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shoot for loot! Who wants to shoot for some loot?', 'Shoot for loot! Who wants to shoot for some loot?', 53454, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come play a game so simple that even a $c can do it!', 'Come play a game so simple that even a $c can do it!', 53453, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Test your aim! Test your aim!', 'Test your aim! Test your aim!', 53452, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toss a ring, win a prize!', 'Toss a ring, win a prize!', 53451, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simple game, for simple folk. Think you can manage it?', 'Simple game, for simple folk. Think you can manage it?', 53450, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you\'ve got quite the arm there. Care to give this game a try?', 'You look like you\'ve got quite the arm there. Care to give this game a try?', 53449, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, hey $c! Think you can land a ring on a slow moving turtle?', 'Hey, hey $c! Think you can land a ring on a slow moving turtle?', 53448, 0, 0, 70, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kargath Bladefist has been slain! Long live the Alliance!', '', 53447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m afraid Gunny didn\'t make it, $n.', '', 53446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men. All dead? No...', '', 53445, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... My head still swims, friend. Come, show me the wreckage.', '', 53444, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Caza\'rez was not as lucky as I was, $n. He rests with the spirits now.', '', 53443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kargath Bladefist has fallen! For the Horde!', '', 53442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never forget those that you love. Never forget what you\'re fighting for.', '', 53441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never put yourself ahead of others. Never forget that this land is shared by many.', '', 53440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never forget those that came before you. Never forget where you came from.', '', 53439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never stop fighting. Never stop practicing. You are never perfect.', '', 53438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is a shame we lost our own planes during our arrival. It will make our extraction mission a bit more...challenging.', 53437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope that the Horde have not yet found this place. They will wish to seize it for their own.', 53436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is good of us to help the survivors here, but we must not lose sight of our original mission.', 53435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do hope that the other agents made it. Otherwise, I\'ll have more work to do.', 53434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I never had any talent with healing powers, but I found my calling in the medic\'s craft. Potions, bandages, and other triage methods can go a long way!', 53433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n! CAN YOU HEAR ME? Just checking to see if you\'re paying attention.', 53432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot save them all, $n. Let us move on to someone who may yet respond to our treatment.', 53431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no, we\'ve lost a patient. Do not despair, $n. They were too far gone already.', 53430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You actually saved one! I must admit, I had some doubts.', 53429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Electric Shock can be used to increase the patient\'s vitals a great deal. However, we cannot use this frequently.', 53428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Compress the patient\'s chest to steadily improve their vitals.', 53427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If the crewman is choking, we can deliver Air to temporarily stabilize their falling vitals.', 53426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can save this one, but we must be quick.', 53425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wouldn\'t expect a recruit to perform well in this situation, but try your best.', 53424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Such fragile creatures. Worthless!', '', 53423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26039, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They came from nowhere! There was nothing we could do...', '', 53422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That\'s why I\'m here to help.$b$bDo you have any questions?', 'Hello $c, and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bThere is so much to do here at the faire that it can be a little overwhelming for our first time visitors. That\'s why I\'m here to help.$b$bDo you have any questions?', 53421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did my son send you? There\'s plenty of stew to go around. Please, help yourself.', 53420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fortune teller?', 'Fortune teller?', 53419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told.$b$bI know, I know... he\'s a gnoll.  But he\'s a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!', 'I highly recommend that you visit Sayge to get your fortune told.$b$bI know, I know... he\'s a gnoll.  But he\'s a very special gnoll with the power to divine your future!', 53418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shooting Gallery?', 'Shooting Gallery?', 53417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rinling runs the shooting gallery.$b$bThere are only three targets to hit, and the faster you are, the better you do.$b$bPersonally, it\'s one of my favorite games.', 'Rinling runs the shooting gallery.$b$bThere are only three targets to hit, and the faster you are, the better you do.$b$bPersonally, it\'s one of my favorite games.', 53416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ring Toss?', 'Ring Toss?', 53415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We like to make sure that faire goers of all ages can enjoy the games.$b$bRing Toss is a simple game where you try to land a ring on the back of a moving turtle.$b$bIt\'s one of my favorite games to play.', 'We like to make sure that faire goers of all ages can enjoy the games.$b$bRing Toss is a simple game where you try to land a ring on the back of a moving turtle.$b$bIt\'s one of my favorite games to play.', 53414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you have no idea how glad I am to see you. Supervising is hungry work.', '', 53413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim: Land? Here? Impossible!', '', 53412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin: Land ho!', '', 53411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim: ...and you know how I feel about that idea...', '', 53410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim: We\'re not returning until we discover its fate - even if we have to scour the sea floor!', '', 53409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Officer: Still no sign of the missing transport.', '', 53408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Officer: Looks like we\'ve made it through enemy lines, General.', '', 53407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portal is closing! Hurry!', '', 53406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! Go! GO!!!', '', 53405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 26038, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whack-a-Gnoll is a fun-filled game of whacking... gnolls.$b$bIt\'s a new attraction, and quite popular among us... Well, Sayge isn\'t too fond of it.', 'Whack-a-Gnoll is a fun-filled game of whacking... gnolls.$b$bIt\'s a new attraction, and quite popular among us... Well, Sayge isn\'t too fond of it.', 53404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whack-a-Gnoll?', 'Whack-a-Gnoll?', 53403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device.$b$bDelivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renowned for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you\'d like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer.', 'The Blastenheimer 5000 Ultra Cannon is a state-of-the-art single person projectile device.$b$bDelivering its payload at near the speed of a dragon, the cannon is the pride and joy of the Blastenheimer family, world renowned for their aeronautical and combustible feats!$B$BIf you\'d like to be launched through the skies to fly free as a bird, seek out Maxima Blastenheimer.', 53402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Miniature tanks, or Tonks as we\'ve cleverly named them, have been a faire favorite for as long as I can remember.$b$bWe have two arenas dedicated for tonk battles.$b$bOne arena pits you against the clock as you race to destroy targets, and avoid the enemy tonks.  You just need a game token to play!$b$bThe other arena is a place where you can use your own tonks or MiniZeps to battle your friends.', 'Miniature tanks, or Tonks as we\'ve cleverly named them, have been a faire favorite for as long as I can remember.$b$bWe have two arenas dedicated for tonk battles.$b$bOne arena pits you against the clock as you race to destroy targets, and avoid the enemy tonks.  You just need a game token to play!$b$bThe other arena is a place where you can use your own tonks or MiniZeps to battle your friends.', 53401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are there tonks?', 'Are there tonks?', 53400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Darkmoon Faire is filled with all sorts of amazing attractions.  We have a fortune teller, a concert, a fishing contest and a lot of games.$b$bWe are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!$b$bAre there any attractions you\'d like more information on?', 'The Darkmoon Faire is filled with all sorts of amazing attractions.  We have a fortune teller, a concert, a fishing contest and a lot of games.$b$bWe are constantly expanding the faire with all manner of new attractions!$b$bAre there any attractions you\'d like more information on?', 53399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.$b$bThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them.', 'Hello and welcome to the Darkmoon Faire Staging Area.$b$bThe portal here will take you to the Darkmoon Faire.$b$bBut if you have any questions before you go, I can answer them.', 53398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ban should have arrived by now... Look for him at the edge of the camp.', 'Ban should have arrived by now... Look for him at the edge of the camp.', 53397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you are interested in training with us, speak with me again at the banquet tables, later this evening.', '', 53396, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at what we have here! Another straggler from the orchard...', '', 53395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mogu ambushers descend from the trees. Look out!', 'Mogu ambushers descend from the trees. Look out!', 53394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That should do it!', 53393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '%s mixes the cider and a handful of crushed herbs into a flask, then shakes the concoction vigorously.', 53392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Just a moment, $n.', 53391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free at last! I need a drink...', 'Free at last! I need a drink...', 53390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Great Banquet. High Elder Cloudfall awaits you at the back table.', 'Welcome to the Great Banquet. High Elder Cloudfall awaits you at the back table.', 53388, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another mug of ale for $n!', '', 53387, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re obviously no farmer...', '', 53386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s smiles.', '', 53385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t just attack him one at a time, you idiots! Surround him now!', '', 53381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Submit or die, you fool!', '', 53380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am certain. Let\'s move on to the fighting.', 'I am certain. Let\'s move on to the fighting.', 53379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine. Let\'s proceed with the introductions.', 'Fine. Let\'s proceed with the introductions.', 53378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t need any introductions, old man. Let\'s skip ahead to the good part.', 'I don\'t need any introductions, old man. Let\'s skip ahead to the good part.', 53377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on a moment, I\'m not ready yet.', 'Hold on a moment, I\'m not ready yet.', 53376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to be introduced to the instructors, High Elder.', 'I\'m ready to be introduced to the instructors, High Elder.', 53375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish. A toast, to our honored guest, $n!', '', 53374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain? The trainers would love to meet an experienced $r $c like you.', '', 53373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well, $n. Return to me when your thirst and hunger are sated.', '', 53372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, $n. We are honored to have you as our guest. Today, we celebrate not only your arrival, but the initiation of a new class of trainees within our monastery.$b$bPlease, enjoy the food and drink that we have prepared. When you are ready, I would like to introduce you to some of the monastery\'s instructors.', '', 53371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now you are caught up. And would you look at that? My cup is full again! It is good to be the High Elder.', '', 53370, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are all responsible for maintaining our home. Even the High Elder must occasionally lend a hand.', '', 53369, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wu will be asking you to perform a few chores. Nothing complex, just some tasks relating to the maintenance of our monastery.', '', 53368, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh...<hic>... hello... $nsszzhhhh...', '', 53367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wu, this is $n. $GHe:She; will be joining the other trainees.', '', 53366, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye... yes, high <hic> elder?', '', 53365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WU!', '', 53364, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, this is Groundskeeper Wu.', '', 53363, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may have noticed the hozen and jinyu among us. All are welcome here at the monastery, as long as they have the desire to learn.', '', 53362, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He has seen many high elders come and go. He also tends to take these celebrations very seriously.', '', 53361, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Upon this table, you see Spirit-Sage Gaoquan, the oldest member of our monastery.', '', 53360, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Walk and drink with me, $n.', '', 53359, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Luckily, High Elders no longer have to perform basic training. I find that I am happier when I am not exercising.', '', 53358, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand and one.', '', 53357, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And how many do YOU perform?', '', 53356, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ten thousand strikes, every day.', '', 53355, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xann, how many practice strikes do your students perform daily?', '', 53354, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, Instructor Xann. His mastery of the very basics of combat has given him a nearly perfect fighting form.', '', 53353, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never cheat!', '', 53352, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Cheated!?', '', 53351, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The thousandth challenger cheated.', '', 53350, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Stone Fist is nearly unmatched in single combat. He once defeated nine hundred and ninety-nine challengers in a row.', '', 53349, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Next, we have Master Stone Fist. He will be leading your sparring exercises.', '', 53348, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and a half. Sir.', 53347, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flatter you? You were eight years old.', '', 53346, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You flatter me, High Elder. Those hozen were weak, young, and unskilled. Any other pandaren would have done the same.', 53345, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is said that, before she joined our monastery, Myang defeated one hundred ravaging hozen in a single melee.', '', 53344, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before you sits Instructor Myang. She will be responsible for teaching you the most practical fighting techniques.', '', 53343, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us start with the three who sit behind me.', '', 53342, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Over here, ugly!', 'Over here, ugly!', 53341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your goons smashed my keg of Stormstout Special Reserve... I was saving that!!', 'Your goons smashed my keg of Stormstout Special Reserve... I was saving that!!', 53340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
