('Shot down by a group of alliance cowards?! PATHETIC!', '', 53316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry pal, can\'t let you play for free.', 'Sorry pal, can\'t let you play for free.', 53315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
