('There are no freebies here, move on.', 'There are no freebies here, move on.', 53313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need Darkmoon Game Tokens to play.$b$bBuy them from any of the faire\'s Game Token vendors.$b$bI\'ll mark one on your map for you.', 'You need Darkmoon Game Tokens to play.$b$bBuy them from any of the faire\'s Game Token vendors.$b$bI\'ll mark one on your map for you.', 53312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do I need to play?', 'What do I need to play?', 53311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I floated for days \'til one of our ships spotted me...', '', 53309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stuck with the cargo \'til the end, which came, well, right after the start...', '', 53308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Before we knew it they was everywhere!', '', 53307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dance for the Eternal Court.', 53306, 0, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 26024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bold of you, to strike a queen. A lesser monarch might be enraged.', 53305, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 26014, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To prepare for a world of perfection, the imperfect must be swept away.', 53304, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 26020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Unfortunate, but deserved.', 53303, 0, 0, 11, 64, 0, 0, 26023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your conduct was inexcusable.', 53302, 0, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 26022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still these strangers would oppose your queen\'s will. Who will stop them?', 53301, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 26028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have no time for such diversions. Keepers of Eternity, will you stand for your queen?', 53300, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 26027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I beseech of you, my beloved subjects: Put an end to these miscreants.', 53299, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 26029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, who am I kidding? You are a wily one, thief.', '', 53298, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here I go!', '', 53297, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
