('Don\'t make me stand up!', '', 53295, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am unimpressed.', 53294, 0, 0, 274, 64, 0, 0, 26021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alexstrasza\'s Drakes will pick us up on the other side of this abandoned excavation site. Check your weapons, this place stinks of an ambush.\n\nLet me know when you\'re ready to move out.', '', 53290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re stealing my inventory, aren\'t you?', '', 53289, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey... HEY! What are you doing?', '', 53288, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Flower of Life calls upon me. I WILL NOT fail you, my Queen.', 'The Flower of Life calls upon me. I WILL NOT fail you, my Queen.', 53287, 0, 0, 66, 64, 0, 26047, 26047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Light of Lights! My life is yours!', 'Yes, Light of Lights! My life is yours!', 53286, 0, 0, 16, 64, 0, 26513, 26513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I pray that the Light of a Thousand Moons will grant me this honor.', 'I pray that the Light of a Thousand Moons will grant me this honor.', 53285, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 26042, 26042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then it happened... all at once! A whole mess of fighters came outta nowhere, sir...', '', 53284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose it has to be this way, then. If only you\'d seen what I\'ve seen. THEN you\'d understand.', '', 53283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21410, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We made it past enemy lines - looked like it was gunna be smooth sailin\' all the way.', '', 53282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Riders, to me!', 53281, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 26018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough! As much as I adore playing hostess, I have more pressing matters to attend to.', 53280, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 26017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
