('Huo warmed the land and ignited the passions of the people.', 'Huo warmed the land and ignited the passions of the people.', 53263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And then came Huo, the spirit of fire, to the land of Shen-zin Su.', 'And then came Huo, the spirit of fire, to the land of Shen-zin Su.', 53262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In an ancient time, the spirits of the people dimmed and the land grew cold.', 'In an ancient time, the spirits of the people dimmed and the land grew cold.', 53261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Into that house! Take anyone who can still walk!', '', 53260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This one, over here! He\'s trying to protect the others!', '', 53259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sabotaging', '', 53258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to learn your place, pandaren!', '', 53257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, Shaman, you will give the Dragon Soul to ME.', '', 53255, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 25867, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get inside, quickly! I\'ll hold them off!', '', 53254, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 25866, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were here to scout for an invasion, but they already knew we were coming.', '', 53250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We came here for war.$B$BThey gave it to us.', '', 53249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come, $n. Let us move swiftly.', 53248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 27685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After intense fighting, our supply route to Booty Bay has been reestablished.', '', 53247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think I ever stood a chance. See you around, then!', 'I don\'t think I ever stood a chance. See you around, then!', 53246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I came to ask the famous Aysa Cloudsinger for help, but I just can\'t bring myself to intrude on her exercises. She\'s so poised, so practiced... so beautiful.', '', 53245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good fight.', 'Good fight.', 53244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take this pretty seriously, don\'t you?', 'You take this pretty seriously, don\'t you?', 53243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the opportunity of getting beaten up by you.', 'Thank you for the opportunity of getting beaten up by you.', 53242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Stone Fist was right about you. You\'re good.', 'Master Stone Fist was right about you. You\'re good.', 53241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good fight. I\'ll get you next time.', 'Good fight. I\'ll get you next time.', 53240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man... I thought I had that one...', 'Man... I thought I had that one...', 53239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice moves!', 'Nice moves!', 53238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here I come!', 'Here I come!', 53237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for a few traditional \"Welcome to the Monastery\" punches!', 'Time for a few traditional \"Welcome to the Monastery\" punches!', 53236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah! Fightin\' time!', 'Yeah! Fightin\' time!', 53235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see how you hold up against my \"slow, weak punches\" technique!', 'Let\'s see how you hold up against my \"slow, weak punches\" technique!', 53234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go easy on the belly, alright?', 'Go easy on the belly, alright?', 53233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re about to get a mouthful of claws, $c. Ha HA!', 'You\'re about to get a mouthful of claws, $c. Ha HA!', 53232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your paws up where I can see \'em!', 'Get your paws up where I can see \'em!', 53231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s rumble!', 'Let\'s rumble!', 53230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s fight!', 'Let\'s fight!', 53229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is it fighting time? I think it is!', 'Is it fighting time? I think it is!', 53228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, let\'s get this match started!', 'Alright, let\'s get this match started!', 53227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to rumble?', 'You want to rumble?', 53226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been sparring all day. When do we eat?', 'I\'ve been sparring all day. When do we eat?', 53225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready if you are.', 'I\'m ready if you are.', 53224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you\'re thinking. I can see it in your little $r eyes.$b$b<The pupil smiles.>$b$bWell, are we doing this, or what?', 'I know what you\'re thinking. I can see it in your little $r eyes.$b$b<The pupil smiles.>$b$bWell, are we doing this, or what?', 53223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'d be an honor to spar with you, $gsir:ma\'am;.', 'It\'d be an honor to spar with you, $gsir:ma\'am;.', 53222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be gentle - I\'m still a bit bruised from the last fight I lost... er... won.', 'Be gentle - I\'m still a bit bruised from the last fight I lost... er... won.', 53221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win... this time. I\'d better get back to my size training.', '', 53220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, then. It\'s time for an open-faced $R sandwich!', '', 53219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put down your fork, and pick up your fists! I challenge you!', 'Put down your fork, and pick up your fists! I challenge you!', 53218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eating is a form of training, too, you know.', '', 53217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried the rice? You really need to try the rice.', '', 53216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t say I mind the food here. Or the beer, for that matter.', '', 53215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must give peace to these lands if you are to face Murozond.', '', 53214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25959, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew I would lose. The rivers told me so.', '', 53213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well!', '', 53212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I challenge you to a fight, Husshun!', 'I challenge you to a fight, Husshun!', 53211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have learned much from these monks, $r. You would do well to do the same.', '', 53210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I like this place. Although it needs more water... I like it.', '', 53209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pandaren elders were wise to allow the jinyu into their monastery.$b$bThey were unwise to allow the hozen the same privileges.', '', 53208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Onward! We\'re almost there! Say the word and we shall continue to victory!', '', 53207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our forces report major victories off the coasts of Tanaris and Tol Barad...', '', 53206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re one step closer my friends.  Have a rest and let me know when you are ready to continue.', '', 53205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, enough, enough! STOP HITTING ZHI-ZHI!', 'Alright, enough, enough! STOP HITTING ZHI-ZHI!', 53204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('About time someone challenged Zhi-Zhi!', 'About time someone challenged Zhi-Zhi!', 53203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wanna fight?', 'Wanna fight?', 53202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhi-Zhi has always been good at hitting his friends, but Zhi-Zhi has gotten a lot better since studying here.', '', 53201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back! Zhi-Zhi practicing here! Anybody who gets within 5 yards of here is probably going to get knocked out... maybe even killed.$b$bHai-yah!', '', 53200, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhi-Zhi can\'t believe they\'ve actually let me into the monastery training program!$b$bMe! Zhi-Zhi!', '', 53199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am pleased to report that the battle goes well, Warchief.', '', 53198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m alive? Ha! That\'s more than I can say for those Horde at Garrosh\'ar Point. We tore them up good.', 'I\'m alive? Ha! That\'s more than I can say for those Horde at Garrosh\'ar Point. We tore them up good.', 53197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for saving me. It was rough up there.', 'Thanks for saving me. It was rough up there.', 53196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. Time to lick my wounds and get back to the fight!', 'Thank you. Time to lick my wounds and get back to the fight!', 53195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What lies before you is the aftermath of Deathwing\'s reign. What was once the Ruby Dragonshrine now lays in waste, its charred husk and scorched earth the only testament to its existence.\n$b It is said that, long ago, a single drop of Alexstrasza\'s blood melted away the snows and gave life to the great Crimson Oak that stands before you. Its branches raised triumphantly into the sky and radiated the warmth and life of the Red Dragonflight.\n$bBut now, its twisted, rotting limbs can no longer harness the power of life and vitality - instead only death and destruction. As flame and corruption extinguished the life force of these lands, the great tree captured an image...an echo of the warriors who fell on its hallowed grounds.', '', 53194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find all the Fragments of Jaina\'s Staff!', '', 53193, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where she stood, heroes, and this is where she fell. The time-lost echo of Sylvanas Windrunner will reverberate through the rotting limbs of the Dragonshrine for all eternity.', '', 53192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 25958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The leadership of Shattrath is too slow to act, so the great people of the Lower City have taken matters in the Shadow Labyrinth into our own hands.', '', 53191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sandra winks at you.', 53190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks, $n! I should be able to get back on my own. Come see me later if you need any provisions for the road.', 53189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We people of the Lower City had a rather extensive spy network set up in the Shadow Labyrinth until recently.$B$BNow they\'re all dead except me and To\'gun.', 53188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We kin make it back to camp on our own. Come talk to meh later if ya fancy borrowin\' a gryphon.', '', 53187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Snowpuff! Ye\'re saved! Oh thank ye, $c!', '', 53186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At once.', '', 53185, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nazgrim, lift my spirits with news of victory.', '', 53184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The powers of the Hourglass do nothing to me!', '', 53183, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak to me when you are ready for combat, young $c.', '', 53182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The braziers are prepared. I am ready to face you in combat.', 'The braziers are prepared. I am ready to face you in combat.', 53181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through the purity of the fire\'s spirit are we cleansed.  Through the passion of its being are we driven.', '', 53180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve lost my Tabard of Conquest.', 'I\'ve lost my Tabard of Conquest.', 53179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cabal have threatened the innocent for far too long! The time for retribution has come!', '', 53178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will stop the Shadow Council and put an end to their atrocities!', '', 53177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blackheart! Vorpil! Your time has come!', '', 53176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cabal will pay for their recklessness!', '', 53175, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They have two moons to pay their debts. Make it known!', '', 53174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! The realms will carry their weight or crumble beneath mine!', '', 53173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silvermoon, over nine thousand...', '', 53172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Undercity, five thousand twenty-two in arrears.', '', 53171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Thunder Bluff, two-thousand sixty-three in arrears.', '', 53170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Argh!! It stings!', '', 53169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh! More eggmen come. Chief, we\'d better run for now!', '', 53168, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_lunarguidance.blp:20|t Tyrande gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:102472|h[Lunar Guidance]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_lunarguidance.blp:20|t Tyrande gains |cFFFF0000|Hspell:102472|h[Lunar Guidance]|h|r!', 53167, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? Do I see rescuers? Over here, $r! Help us!', '', 53166, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('H-h-help! My men... we\'re under attack!', '', 53165, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re going to get to Warlord Kalithresh, you\'ll need to defeat Mekgineer Steamrigger and Hydromancer Thespia so that you can get to the Main Chambers Access Panels.$B$BYou mash a few buttons on those, and the door to the main chamber will open right up!', '', 53164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t sleep easy, \'cause we\'ll be back. And next time, we\'ll destroy you for good!', '', 53163, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, over here!', '', 53162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grimleer tribe owns this forest. We\'ll kill anyone who creeps on our turf.', '', 53161, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_starfall.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:102241|h[Tears of Elune]|h|r begin to rain from the sky!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_starfall.blp:20|t |cFFFF0000|Hspell:102241|h[Tears of Elune]|h|r begin to rain from the sky!', 53160, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can...see the light of the moon...so clearly now.  It is...beautiful...', 53159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25976, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spear of Elune, drive back the night!', 53158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25984, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eyes of night, pierce this darkness!', 53157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25983, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Elune guide you through the night.', 53156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25982, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the peaceful light of Elune soothe your souls in this dark time.', 53155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25972, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mother moon, I can no longer see your light! Your daughter is alone in the darkness!', 53154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25975, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The darkness closes in...my vision is clouded...', 53153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25974, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Moon goddess, your light dims!  I am lost without your guidance!', 53152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25973, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have chosen a path of darkness.  Mother moon, guide my hand; allow me to bring rest to these misbegotten souls.', 53151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25981, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Give yourselves to the night, Elune will guide you from this mortal prison.', 53150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25980, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The moonlight can bring rest to your weary souls in this forgotten place.', 53149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25979, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The darkness surrounds you, the light of Elune is your only salvation.', 53148, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25978, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is nothing left for you here, nothing but death and sorrow.', 53147, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 25977, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you?', 53146, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know who you are, but you have my gratitude.', 'I don\'t know who you are, but you have my gratitude.', 53145, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', '', 53144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, I\'ll go now.', 'Thank you, I\'ll go now.', 53143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I help you?', '', 53142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to travel by air.', 'I\'d like to travel by air.', 53141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you?', 53140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bite\'s spell isn\'t going to last forever.', '', 53139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all that is left of the Blue Dragonshrine. A great battle shattered the timeways leading out of this forsaken place. You must reconstruct the fragments strewn across the ground and defeat the trapped spirit to proceed.', '', 53138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25957, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s too many of them. Kalithresh has an entire army down here.', 53137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can\'t just sit here!', '', 53136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get to Hanae\'s house. It\'s safe there.', 'Get to Hanae\'s house. It\'s safe there.', 53135, 0, 12709, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look like one of them... who are you?', 'You don\'t look like one of them... who are you?', 53134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They came out of nowhere!', 'They came out of nowhere!', 53133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must contain the disease the naga have unleashed here before it is too late!', '', 53132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Windcaller Claw growls.', '', 53131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei fades away.', '', 53130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Li Fei\'s voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\"', '', 53129, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wilting lotus is the first sign of winter, a winter that has not come to Shen-zin Su in thousands of years.', '', 53128, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Step aside and let some others have a chance to play.', 'Step aside and let some others have a chance to play.', 53127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whaddya want now?', 'Whaddya want now?', 53126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No more games for you.', 'No more games for you.', 53125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
