('We should strike now. I\'ll tear them apart!', '', 53123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is an unnatural darkness to this place, a perpetual midnight. Take caution, heroes, and do not stray from the light.', '', 53122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warlord Kalithresh will fall!', 53121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes! The goggles do nothing!', '', 53119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
