('Lower your voice, $r. I am no longer welcome in Sethekk.', '', 53117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re too late, $n. Looks like those monkeys butchered the Foreman and his crew.', 53116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
