('The only true crime is inaction.', '', 53109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The way of the Tushui is one of gaining proper perspective. Through meditation and consideration, we find our way to the most effective solution to any problem. Through practice and discipline, we hone our bodies to be the perfect implements of our will.$B$BTo live the way of the Tushui is to be respected both for tempered mind and impeccable form.', 53108, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Every pandaren must search out and uncover their own fate. Whether a warrior or a farmer, we each have a place that suits us, and each place carries a unique importance.', '', 53107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spirits here have been tormented for a long time. We only want to rest.', 53106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals! I cannot follow you any further - accept my blessing and use the Hourglass of Time to defeat Murozond!', '', 53105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Tonk is taking aim at you!', '', 53104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
