('', 'There\'s nothing there, Ha\'lei. Please, I just need a few more minutes of silence.', 53095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw one, I know I did...', '', 53094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, mom! A spirit! See? See?', '', 53093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your medic abilities to revive the crewman before it\'s too late!', 'Use your medic abilities to revive the crewman before it\'s too late!', 53092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crewman is choking!', 'The crewman is choking!', 53091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They do not know the doors they are opening...', 53089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We should not peer into the spirit realm...', 53088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once, these crypts were sacred to my people. They held our loved ones\' spirits. A great many people traveled long distances here on pilgrimages.$B$BThose times are long gone. Something has taken a hold of the Auchenai that used to care so deeply for the deceased. Please, you must help before the spirits tear the crypt apart.', 53087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dead do not belong in this realm.$B$BWhy, then, do we continually seek them out after putting them to rest?', 53086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spawn of the Old Gods materialize nearby!', 'Spawn of the Old Gods materialize nearby!', 53085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can only show you the door, Morphalius. You\'re the one that has to walk through it.', '', 53084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at me! You said I would be fine! Do I look fine?', '', 53083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is an \"Ologist\", you ask? Why, it means I study everything! I\'m more knowledgable about any subject you can think of than anyone you know or anyone you\'ll ever know.$B$BGetting through Shaffar\'s ward was nothing. Morphalius wouldn\'t have a scratch on him if he had just listened to me. Always doing things his way, that one.', '', 53082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nexus-Prince Haramad kept telling me that if we didn\'t find a way through Shaffar\'s ward soon that I\'d be the next test subject.$B$BHe wasn\'t bluffing.', '', 53081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Void Storage', 'Void Storage', 53080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Stormwind, along the canal south of Cathedral Square.\n\n\"The Three Winds,\" it\'s called. Look for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can\'t miss it.\n\nThey offer just the sort of services you\'re looking for.', 'A trio of ethereal technomancers has set up shop in Stormwind, along the canal south of Cathedral Square.\n\n\"The Three Winds,\" it\'s called. Look for the weird machinery and purple lights... you can\'t miss it.\n\nThey offer just the sort of services you\'re looking for.', 53079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being able to study and learn from the Underbog is a once in a lifetime opportunity.$B$BTo think I was practically dead not long ago sitting in a crate in the Slave Pens...', '', 53078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These mushrooms are unlike anything on the surface. They\'re said to bring great wisdom and clarity to those who eat them.$B$BI\'m going to bring some back with me to Sporeggar.', '', 53077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is still mostly free from the naga. But...it is deeply tormented. I don\'t know how long we have.', '', 53076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I joined this expedition for one reason, $r: revenge.', '', 53075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 396, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga are pumping all of the water away for their own use, and entire species are dying out as a result.$B$BIf we don\'t do something soon, what life is left on this dying world will disappear forever.', 53074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 0, 1, 1, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have to stop the naga and save Zangarmarsh while we still can!', 53073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The naga are using slave labor? They\'ll pay for their transgressions!', 53072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe they already escaped? What if they\'re out there looking for me?', 53071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope my friends are ok...', 53070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If ye love killing orcs and ye don\'t talk much, glad to have ye!$B$BIf not, there\'s a lovely portal east of here that I heard is just lovely this time of year.', '', 53069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
