('Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?$B$BBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.$B$BWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?', 'Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?$B$BBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.$B$BWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?', 53019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
