('Uh...', 'Uh...', 52916, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The spiders here are as big as... me! Do you know how to get rid of a spider infestation?$B$BYeah, that\'s right. Dynamite. Lots and lots of dynamite.', 52915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am gathering my strength before I return to the battle. You would be wise to do the same.', 52914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The warm embrace of Tarecgosa\'s presence encircles you.', 'The warm embrace of Tarecgosa\'s presence encircles you.', 52913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know how many supplies it takes to support an army, $n? We need weapons, food, shelter, bandages...and that\'s just to start.$B$BThe supplies will not stock themselves. Ask Matoclaw if you\'re looking for ways to help. She will put you to use.', '', 52912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
