('Placeholder Text!', 'Placeholder Text!', 52896, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tholo and I have been through so much together. I always know he\'s watching out for me.', '', 52895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tholo and I are joining the Firelands invasion effort. Live together, fight together, die together. That\'s what brothers are for!', '', 52894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Anren is my best friend. I don\'t know what I would do without him.', '', 52893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If there\'s one thing I know, it\'s that you can always count on a good friend. If you have such a person in your life, cherish them well.', '', 52892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leyara barks a cruel laugh.', 52891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_sword_09.blp:20|t%s readies his |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99350|h[Inferno Blade]|h|r!', '', 52890, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_curse.blp:20|t%s readies his |cFF7A0080|Hspell:99352|h[Decimation Blade]|h|r!', '', 52889, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s becomes enraged at seeing one of his companions fall!', '', 52888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\achievement_boss_ragnaros.blp:20|tYou are about to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:101109|h[Rage of Ragnaros]|h|r!', '', 52887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, kick the boss on the third cast of the second phase. Always kick the first cast of the first phase but never the second on the first. Unless, you see lightning. If you see lightning - kick anyway. What\'s so hard about that?', 'Ok, kick the boss on the third cast of the second phase. Always kick the first cast of the first phase but never the second on the first. Unless, you see lightning. If you see lightning - kick anyway. What\'s so hard about that?', 52886, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your flasks! Get your buffs!', 'Get your flasks! Get your buffs!', 52885, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we pull yet? Can we? Can we?', 'Can we pull yet? Can we? Can we?', 52884, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
