('With it, you will be able to enter Karazhan without fear of harm or detection. Not even Harrison Jones will know how you uncover the tower\'s history.', '', 52721, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have the charm with me and I will unlock its power once the crate is in my hands. You were wise to change your mind, Barnes.', '', 52720, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do. $n just returned with it, but how do I know you\'re going to keep your end of the bargain?', '', 52719, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you again, Mr. Barnes. Do you have the crate?', '', 52718, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This isn\'t supposed to happen!', '', 52717, 0, 0, 431, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If only Malfurion hadn\'t dumped your grandfather in prison. He rots in a barrow den while the Horde assaults Ashenvale.', 52716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, I will share my knowledge with you.', 52715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reanimates and surges into battle to protect his master!', '', 52714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses into a smouldering heap....', '', 52713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s instantly kills all nearby allies!', '%s instantly kills all nearby allies!', 52712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11139, 11139, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this, an intruder? Let\'s see what the artifacts inside this box can do, shall we?', '', 52711, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Xylem does not bargain with the likes of you, ruffian. There shall be no payment!', '', 52710, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_mace_2h_sulfuras_d_01.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF6600|Hspell:100604|h[Empower Sulfuras]|h|r!', '', 52709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your only hope is that you will all burn together. There is no victory for you.', 52708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24937, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You know nothing of power. You cling to your allies in desperation, but they cannot save you.', 52707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24936, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have nothing. No one.', 52706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24935, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will abandon you when you need them most. They will leave you to burn.', 52705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24934, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They have all abandoned you. Left you to die.', 52704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24933, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All that awaits you is nothingness.  Emptiness.', 52703, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24932, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are weak. Pathetic.  Your life will be stripped from you, but only after everything you love has been burnt away.', 52702, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24931, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cause is foolish and futile. You haven\'t the strength to hold on to those dearest to you.', 52701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24930, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here there is only fire, brimstone, and death.', 52700, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come where you are not welcome.', 52699, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24928, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the best, $p!', '', 52698, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is great!', '', 52697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, $p! I\'ll tell my pa you helped me see the world!', '', 52696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahoo!', '', 52695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is good to have you back, Hamuul. Let us leave this place.', '', 52694, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You did not kill Hamuul, Leyara. He lives.', '', 52693, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leyara, you must see that Fandral is beyond redemption. The corruption within him runs deeper than you know.', '', 52692, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll meet you back in camp.', '', 52691, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24850, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry that I did not arrive sooner, though you seem to have held your own quite well.', '', 52690, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24849, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I release you from this fate Leyara. May you finally find your peace in death.', '', 52689, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24848, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I have come for you, Leyara.', '', 52688, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would be my pleasure, Matoclaw.', '', 52687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go now, $n. The moonwell will be filled by the time you return to the front.', 52686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t believe it! I seared the life from your body!', 52685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tenaron, old friend. Would you go collect a vial of moonwell water for this $c?', 52684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll kill your companion just like I killed Hamuul. And there is nothing you can do about it.', 52683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have power you\'ll never know, Malfurion.', 52682, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They will all see through to your weakness soon enough, \"Shan\'do.\"', 52681, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24904, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You haven\'t the strength to lead anyone.', 52680, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fandral was a true leader. You are nothing more than a desperate dream.', 52679, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24902, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time to be rid of you.', 52678, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 24901, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I thought you might come. You\'ve proven very persistent. Annoyingly so.', 52677, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24900, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh goody! Time to fight fire with...highly flammable weapons grade explosives!', 52676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ow! Well I guess that prototype didn\'t work, either.', 52675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good timing, Ricket. $n says they need your expertise on the Molten Front.', 52674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Aggra... $n...', '', 52673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a start. And what about you, newcomer? You wouldn\'t be here if you weren\'t after the crate as well.', '', 52670, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, protectors! We lend the strength of the ancients to this battle! And we shall not fall!', '', 52669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot let Deathwing win. Should he triumph in this war, then all life will perish.', '', 52668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $c. We foresaw this day long ago, and we are ready.', '', 52667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the guards pay you a visit, I\'m sure you\'ll have no problem explaining how you got your hands on those Uldum artifacts or that lovely painting.', '', 52666, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, fine. I might\'ve given him the name of a private collector interested in that crate\'s contents.', '', 52665, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re willing to forget this crate thing, I can give you a good price on some recent arrivals from Uldum.', '', 52664, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep it down, will you? I\'m trying to run a business here...', '', 52663, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The contents of that crate are very dangerous and they belong in a secure vault, not in the hands of some well-to-do, but ignorant collector!', '', 52662, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop evading the question, Quincy! I know the thief was here with that crate.', '', 52661, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could watch her reduce your pitiful band to cinders, but I am needed elsewhere. Farewell!', '', 52660, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You mortals may remember Alysra, who spirited me to freedom in Mount Hyjal. She, too has been reborn. Born of flame!', '', 52659, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have we here - visitors to our kingdom in the Firelands?', '', 52658, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Protect me and I\'ll place guardian totems all around us.', 52657, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! I see him, wreathed in flame! I can feel waves of fury radiating from his core. Such rage... his anger alone could burn us to cinders!', 52656, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 24711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We won\'t have much time before they\'re onto us. Let\'s begin.', 52655, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 24712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This realm is more terrible than I\'d imagined. Even now, I can feel the rage of this place pressing down on me.', 52654, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared. Let us go to the Firelands and finish this.', 'I am prepared. Let us go to the Firelands and finish this.', 52653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brace yourself. The Firelands are a dangerous place... even for a formidable $r such as yourself.$b$bLet me know when you are ready.', 52652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can he just STAND there, while we fight off the attackers at his feet?', 52651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal filth... the master\'s keep is forbidden....', '', 52650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24444, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'See you on the field of battle, $Gbrother:sister;.', 52649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sisters, show yourselves. The time for subtlety is past. We will face our enemies in the Plane of Fire.', 52648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our original duty binds us to defend this land, but if Fandral has indeed escaped to the Firelands, then we must bring him to justice.', 52647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_mount_hordescorpiong.blp:20|t%s transforms into a |c0087CEFA|Hspell:98379|h[Scorpion]|h|r!', '', 52646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_tigersroar.blp:20|t%s transforms into a |c0087CEFA|Hspell:98374|h[Cat]|h|r!', '', 52645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to enjoy this.', 52644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Thisalee. Gather our forces. We leave for the Molten Front at once.', '', 52643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need no more convincing, $n. The Druids of the Talon will lend you their aid.', '', 52642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did I hear right, Omnuron? We\'re going to join the fight?', 52641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naturally, I told him that we don\'t deal in stolen goods. This is the Stormwind auction house, not some smoke-filled, back alley swapmeet!', '', 52640, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The person you described was just here and he tried to persuade me to list a crateful of arcane objects.', '', 52639, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, in my business, discretion is important. I shouldn\'t be talking about this at all.', '', 52638, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am but a humble herald of the Dark Lady Sylvanas, our Banshee Queen.', 52637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has anyone suspicious tried to list a crate of goods recently?', 'Has anyone suspicious tried to list a crate of goods recently?', 52636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to browse the items up for auction.', 'I\'d like to browse the items up for auction.', 52635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please feel free to browse the items up for bid, or if you would like to list an item, I can help.', '', 52634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet us back at the World Tree. There\'s something... I want you to witness.', '', 52633, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, my friend. I can never repay your service or your friendship.', '', 52632, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24772, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But we must hurry back to the World Tree! The Dragon Aspects are waiting...', 52631, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24724, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, you\'re certainly more talkative...', 52630, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24723, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, I am all that I once was... and more.', '', 52629, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24771, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the TRUTH - and my chains have been broken.', '', 52628, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But what he and his Twilight Masters never understood is that the elements do not exist to rage and war... they exist to bring harmony. Within the world... and within us.', '', 52627, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fandral sought to use that weakness against me...', '', 52626, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24770, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...a THRALL.', '', 52625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For I see now what I had become, so weighted down by doubt and anger. All my life, I had CHOSEN to be a slave to fear...', '', 52624, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, my heart... you never gave up on me. I owe you my life... everything that I am.', '', 52623, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24769, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el, I thought I\'d lost you...', 52622, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 24722, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am... alive...', '', 52621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24768, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... okay, I\'ll just wait for zero then...', 'Oh... okay, I\'ll just wait for zero then...', 52620, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, right... So let\'s start the countdown from ten, ready?  TEN!', 'Right, right... So let\'s start the countdown from ten, ready?  TEN!', 52619, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well... I guess that no one here is going to want to hear about the Keg Tapper prototypes 74205 and 75633...  Maybe if I spoke about prototype 1701-D, you would get excited...', 'Well... I guess that no one here is going to want to hear about the Keg Tapper prototypes 74205 and 75633...  Maybe if I spoke about prototype 1701-D, you would get excited...', 52618, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With plans drawn up, I had my top men and women begin work on a machine to do that exact task!  We had calculated down to the second how best to dist-', 'With plans drawn up, I had my top men and women begin work on a machine to do that exact task!  We had calculated down to the second how best to dist-', 52617, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Magni must have sensed some disapointment as he did allow a slight change.  He allowed me a chance to tap the Brewfest Keg.  I remember spending nights trying to figure out how to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently.', 'King Magni must have sensed some disapointment as he did allow a slight change.  He allowed me a chance to tap the Brewfest Keg.  I remember spending nights trying to figure out how to efficiently and quickly open the keg and distribute its contents such that all participants will receive equal parts quickly and efficiently.', 52616, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, when King Magni approached me about these festivities  I assured him that we gnomes could make Brewfest an event to remember.  But Magni, knew that we gnomes had other tasks that we should focus on.  He wanted to keep it simple and honor the past.', 'Years ago, when King Magni approached me about these festivities  I assured him that we gnomes could make Brewfest an event to remember.  But Magni, knew that we gnomes had other tasks that we should focus on.  He wanted to keep it simple and honor the past.', 52615, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  We\'ve suffered many tragedies this year, so a celebration like Brewfest is a welcome and jubilous occasion.', 'It\'s so good seeing so many of you here to celebrate this time honored festivity.  We\'ve suffered many tragedies this year, so a celebration like Brewfest is a welcome and jubilous occasion.', 52614, 7, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you even hear me???', 52613, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CAIRNE WAS MY BROTHER!!!!!!!!!', '', 52612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el! Go\'el, you must stop! Your anger is JUST - but it will only consume you! Fight it down, or we\'re ALL LOST!', 52611, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 24721, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GARROSH... Garrosh...', '', 52610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24767, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU WILL SEE THE FURY OF THE HORDE RAGE THROUGH YOUR CITIES! YOU WILL SEE YOUR THRONE SPLIT IN TWO! THIS I SWEAR!!!', '', 52609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KING VARIAN... YOU WISH TO MAKE WAR ON MY PEOPLE? YOU SHALL HAVE YOUR WAR, HUMAN!', '', 52608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ALL ARE GUILTY! ALL MUST PAY!', '', 52607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEATH WAS TOO GOOD FOR BLACKMOORE. ANYONE WHO WOULD ENSLAVE ANOTHER... DESERVES WORSE THAN DEATH!', '', 52606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RAISED AS A SLAVE... TO KILL FOR HUMAN AMUSEMENT...', '', 52605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s absolutely raging!  So much anger, so much pain... and he had the strength to suppress it all these years...', 52604, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE! DO YOU HEAR ME???', '', 52603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GUL\'DAN! IF I MUST BURN MY WAY ACROSS THE AFTERLIFE, I WILL FIND YOU IN WHATEVER HELL YOU\'VE HIDDEN!', '', 52602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MY PARENTS... MURDERED BEFORE I COULD KNOW THEM... BETRAYED!', '', 52601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Fire Totem, near Thrall!', 'Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Fire Totem, near Thrall!', 52600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Earth Totem, in the east!', 'Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Earth Totem, in the east!', 52599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Water Totem, in the north!', 'Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Water Totem, in the north!', 52598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Air Totem, in the west!', 'Kill elementals near Aggra\'s Air Totem, in the west!', 52597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is about to |cFFFF0000Emerge|r!', '', 52594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burning Treants erupt from the ground to aid the Protector!', 'Burning Treants erupt from the ground to aid the Protector!', 52593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jin\'do charges his weapon with the Shadows of Hakkar!', '', 52592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Molten Eggs begin to crack and splinter!', 'The Molten Eggs begin to crack and splinter!', 52591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small moonwell arises from the droplets of the chalice.', '', 52590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_horn_03.blp:20|tThe hunting horn sounds again, nearer and more urgently.', '', 52589, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 6423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_horn_03.blp:20|tAs the creatures of the Firelands fall, a huntsman\'s horn sounds in the distance.', '', 52588, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 6423, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fiery Lava Worms erupt from the ground!', 'Fiery Lava Worms erupt from the ground!', 52586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to drink from the magma pools.', '', 52585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, I am ready. Let us go to Thrall.', 'Aggra, I am ready. Let us go to Thrall.', 52583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Know this, friend: you have my deepest thanks. Your courage, your strength... you...$b$bYou remind me of him. ', 52581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24740, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even now, while our enemies crash and surge all around us - he refuses to move - to act! Go\'el, my love... you can be infuriating sometimes.', 52580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I should have known! The Twilight\'s Hammer knew we\'d be here! Defend yourself!', 52579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve seen it before - in Nagrand when he refused to lay down his mantle of Warchief, and again during his training.', 52578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24693, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There! Look at him - frozen in stone, unmoving. Unfeeling. That look on his face... the resolve, the stubbornness. He gets it when he digs his heels in.', 52577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24692, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed.', '', 52576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25161, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes Cenarius, we must maintain a constant vigil over this realm.  But let us celebrate this day and the great victory we have earned here.', '', 52575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25168, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ragnaros has perished.  But the primal powers he represents can never be vanquished.  Another will rise to power, someday.', '', 52574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25158, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes, the world owes you a great debt.', '', 52573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25171, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps...', '', 52572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25160, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is finished then!', '', 52571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25170, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes! He is bound. Finish him!', '', 52570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25169, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, fiend. Your time is NOW.', '', 52569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25159, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The summoning runes were already drawn when we arrived. You\'ll need to destroy all of them.', 52568, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cinderweb Spinners dangle from above!', 'Cinderweb Spinners dangle from above!', 52567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 8714, 8714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Spiderlings have been roused from their nest!', 'Spiderlings have been roused from their nest!', 52566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 11778, 11778, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With turmoil as tinder, let it blaze; may it temper us against what tomorrow may bring.', '', 52565, 7, 0, 397, 64, 0, 25182, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is an opportunity to mock the fearsome - to gaze boldly into the grim unknown and laugh!', '', 52564, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you stand before me, I pray you cast your burdens behind me.', '', 52563, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25180, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For we have endured much... far beyond what any of us could have imagined.', '', 52562, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25175, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The sooner we can get away from the Stonemother, the better. I do not trust her.', 52561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cried out in agony as our families were cut down before our eyes.', 52560, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, I am ready to travel to Deepholm.', 'Aggra, I am ready to travel to Deepholm.', 52559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... we are a force even more terrifying...', 52558, 1, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 25194, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To those who would question our place in this world...', 52557, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25192, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We watched as our homes were razed to the ground.', 52556, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25187, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We paint our faces with the ash to send a message to new enemies - a declaration to those who fear and revile us as monsters.', 52555, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 25191, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s smoldering body begins to flicker and combust!', '%s\'s smoldering body begins to flicker and combust!', 52554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 8715, 8715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Molten cracks appear along the Branch of Nordrassil! Something powerful is emerging from the staff!', 'Molten cracks appear along the Branch of Nordrassil! Something powerful is emerging from the staff!', 52553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait no longer, I\'m ready to fight.', 'Wait no longer, I\'m ready to fight.', 52552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve delayed long enough. Let us take the battle to this servant of Ragnaros immediately.', '', 52551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will save him, $n. We MUST.', 52550, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 24727, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world-shaman is already lost to the dark fathoms. He exists now only to consume - tortured by the currents of the life he longed for - but never knew.', '', 52549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24784, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We arrived just in time! Go\'el\'s spirit has become so unstable, it could collapse upon itself if we don\'t act fast.', 52548, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24726, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your world-shaman has become a vortex of longing and desire. See how his heart devours everything within its proximity? Tread lightly, traveler, lest you too, be consumed.', '', 52547, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24783, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, travelers. The tides of destiny have brought you far from the bright world above. I know what it is you seek - and it lies there before you...', '', 52546, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24782, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The water here is disturbed... what is happening here?', 52545, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 24725, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is a time to celebrate new friends and the future we may forge together.', '', 52544, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25178, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s collapses upon seeing his master die!', '', 52543, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am sorry, dear Nordrassil.  I have failed...', '', 52542, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will give you what power I can.  May the boughs of the Great Tree shade you from the flames in this infernal abyss.', '', 52541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the spirit of the Great Tree shelter you...', '', 52540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25167, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You...friend of Nordrassil...take what remains of my strength...and fight back the flames...', '', 52539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25166, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The children love this holiday.  Some children have gone out trick-or-treating, some have stayed behind, and some, like these, have decided to try to run a small business.$b$bTheir goal is to amass as much candy as possible, and they felt the best way was to offer treats for the hard work of others.  I laughed when I first heard of their plan, $c.  But now that I see how many adventurers are giving them candy for their wares, I am worried.$b$bThat is a lot of sugar.  I don\'t think the children will ever be able to fall asleep again.', 52538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can only teleport us once. Make sure you are ready. Go\'el waits for us at the bottom of the ocean...', 52537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fires...torment me no longer.  But...I am consumed...', '', 52536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25165, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra, I am ready to travel to the Abyssal Maw.', 'Aggra, I am ready to travel to the Abyssal Maw.', 52535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough...stop...', '', 52534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No matter how far it takes me - I refuse to give up on him.', 52533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fires consuming the Tormented Protector wink out!', 'The fires consuming the Tormented Protector wink out!', 52532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Twilight Curse is shifting Go\'el between elemental states! Before he vanished, he took on the aspect of water. We must hurry to him...', 52531, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 24689, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $n. I heard the call to arms, so I\'ve temporarily taken up my fighting form. You have learned all that I have to teach, so I leave you one last lesson. Fight bravely, young one, as an honored member of the Horde.', '', 52530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you look well. I heard the call to arms, which is why I\'ve left our home and come here to join the fight.$B$BI see you have grown much since we last met. I am honored to have taught you. You are a true hero of the Alliance.', '', 52529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, I am not surprised to see you here. I always thought you were my brightest pupil. I am honored to fight alongside you, my friend.', 52528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Branch of Nordrassil reacts violently to $n\'s touch!', 'The Branch of Nordrassil reacts violently to $n\'s touch!', 52527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahhh $n, it be good to see ya once agin. Da threat to dese lands be grave, and I come to join da fight. I see ya grown in your own. Good. You mek me, an\' all your tribe, proud.', 52526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
