('', 'Ready yourselves, warriors. We ride into enemy territory.', 52436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly, friend. Go\'el should be just below.', 52434, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24691, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thank you, Stonemother.', 52433, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24690, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My studies... had only just begun...', '', 52432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the rage of the Firelands!', '', 52431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The master\'s power takes on many forms...', '', 52430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You may seek him... with my blessing.', 52429, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24792, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He may not wish to leave, regardless of whose heart beckons him home.', 52428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24791, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blaze of Glory!', '', 52427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your world-shaman stands in the basalt-groves below. But take heed - he has become one with these Unending Halls of Stone.', 52426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24790, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Still, I can hear the cry of a distant heart, echoing through the labyrinths between worlds. It\'s the cry of a lover\'s heart, I hear... and Great Therazane has not forgotten what it was to love...', 52425, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24789, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'His spirit is strong for a creature of mortal flesh. He fascinates me... and I am loathe to give him up.', 52424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24788, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, mortals, your Thrall is here. He has fused with the stone of this place - heart and soul.', 52423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24787, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing but ash!', '', 52422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stood in the fire!', '', 52421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So much power!', '', 52420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Soon ALL of Azeroth will burn!', '', 52419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn.', '', 52418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beg for mercy now, and I may yet allow you to live. Well, \"heroes?\" What is your answer?', '', 52417, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But none may enter the Firelord\'s abode!', '', 52416, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, well. I admire your tenacity. Baleroc stood guard over this keep for a thousand mortal lifetimes.', '', 52415, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The realm of fire will consume you!', '', 52414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24536, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be consumed by flame!', '', 52413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I will see you all burn.', '', 52412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Begone from my realm, insects.', '', 52411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The cycle begins again! Go\'el has become living stone! We must pursue him within the caverns of Deepholm.$b$bSeeing as how the Earthen Ring just saved her kingdom, Therazane should be more than willing to help us in saving him. If not, the Stonemother will answer to me!', 52410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My Go\'el... consumed by the sea. Tormented by his own desires!', 52409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kneel before the burning flame!', '', 52408, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24810, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s nothing more inspiring than a flower in bloom!', 52401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there! Plants are my speciality. Do you have an inquiry about the local flora?', 52400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing says \"Hallow\'s End is here\" more than a ride on a broomstick.', 52394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?', 'Greetings, $n. You were not followed here, I trust?', 52393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.', 'It appears you took a wrong turn, $c.', 52392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek training, I cannot help you.', 'If you seek training, I cannot help you.', 52391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, how may I further your training?', '$n, how may I further your training?', 52390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek further instruction, $n?', 'You seek further instruction, $n?', 52389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.', 'Ours is a path for those with an iron will and unfaltering resolve. You seem to possess none of these traits, $c.', 52388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to train, warrior?', 'Are you ready to train, warrior?', 52387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I train only warriors, $c. You\'ll have to look elsewhere.', 'I train only warriors, $c. You\'ll have to look elsewhere.', 52386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you prefer guns or bows?', 'Do you prefer guns or bows?', 52385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We can run no longer. It is time to stand and fight.', '', 52384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.', 'I apologize, $c. I mistook you for someone with a spine. Begone; our secrets are not for untrained ears.', 52383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can sense your desire for power, $c.', 'I can sense your desire for power, $c.', 52382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.', 'The Light gives us the strength and magic to triumph.', 52381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.', 'I have no time for a sermon now, $c. Seek your knowledge elsewhere.', 52380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 'Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 52379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?', 'Greetings, mage.  Shall I provide you with further insight into the world of magic?', 52378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need someone who can get the job done. Can I count on you, $c?', '', 52377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $n. Are you helping with the invasion? A skilled $c such as yourself will be a valuable addition to our force.', 52376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is difficult to say. His injuries are grievous. Even though he is a powerful druid, it will take time and patience to restore him back to full health.', '', 52374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How is Hamuul doing?', 'How is Hamuul doing?', 52373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes? The Archdruid is resting.$B$BI am sure he appreciates your visit, but it is best not to disturb him.', '', 52372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How are the preparations going?', 52371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are there any teeny tiny animals in need of my aid?$B$B<Mylune\'s eyes glisten at the thought.>$B$BI need to hug a bunny right now!', 52370, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What happens now will affect us all. Everyone\'s aid is needed. We must work together to fight against the invasion.', 52369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not yet have the strength to push forward into the Firelands. First, we must rebuild our forces and supplies. Will you lend yourself to our efforts?', 52368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, $n. Have you come to join the invasion of the Firelands?', 52367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While we prepare to invade the Firelands, the Firelord sends his minions to repel our attack. Our position here cannot fall. We are all that stands between them and the World Tree.', 52366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winds of Aviana, grant me the strength to keep the flames at bay.', '', 52364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look with your eyes. What do you see? What do you feel?', 52363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have done well, $c. Our presence here can no longer be unnoticed by Ragnaros. We are an essential thorn in his side. As his rage grows, so must we continue to press forward.$B$BWe must stay ever vigilant here, but it is time to cast our eyes upon the final battle. It is time to face the Lord of Fire himself.', '', 52362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Through your efforts, you have brought both the Shadow Wardens and the Druids of the Talon to our side.$B$BExcellent work, $c.$B$BWe are gaining ground, but much work still remains.$B$BAs the enemy assails us, we must continue to build up our defenses. We require three things, $n.$B$BElderlimb and the Ancient Protectors watch over Hyjal, but their strength would be invaluable here.$B$BAs stalwart as our courage, our armory needs additional military supplies.$B$BFinally, the strength of Elune\'s calming waters will heal and rejuvenate our tired soldiers.$B$BWe need these things before our work here is complete.$B$BGo, $n. Your efforts are crucial to our victory.', '', 52361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have managed to defend this point, and much of it is thanks to you.$B$BYou have managed to recruit a valuable ally to our ranks, however, the enemy continues to assail us without relent.$B$BWe must hold our ground or lose what we have fought so hard to gain.', '', 52360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gave up much to attain this foothold, and we must continue fighting to keep it. Although our defenses are weak, continued efforts to push forward will help us recruit stronger allies in the future.$B$BThe time for courage is now, champion.', '', 52359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are we doing in the battle?', 'How are we doing in the battle?', 52357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are the Wardens? We are the silence in the shadows.', 52356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are the Wardens? We are the hum of a spinning blade in the moment before death.', 52355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What are the Wardens? We are the precision slice of a killing blow.', 52354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Any questions you have about the Wardens can be answered on the field of battle.', 52353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand in the heart of Beth\'tilac\'s breeding ground. Beyond those pillars to the north, her brood awaits. They will defend her young relentlessly.', '', 52352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never have I seen such a barren wasteland.', '', 52351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s you again! Do you think we\'ll be able to mustard up the forces we need?', 52349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some people say I\'m corny, but I think I\'m rather sage.', 52348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I like you! Weed make anise pear.', 52347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alysrazor is unable to fully re-ignite!  Kill her quickly!', 'Alysrazor is unable to fully re-ignite!  Kill her quickly!', 52346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s sweltering down here. Did someone tell them to turnip the heat?', 52345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will we win this war? Only thyme will tell.', 52344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh-oh, you have something on your face!', 52343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is war, but the preservation of life? Just as the seed struggles to push out of the soil, so do we fight for our own existence.', 52342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are just barely holding our ground. We need every able-bodied soldier to report for duty.', '', 52341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With time, we may be able to restore this land.', '', 52340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our Storm Crows struggle to fly in this high density air, but the fire hawks on that ridge seem to soar with ease.$B$BThey are as wild as any of the creatures in the Plane of Fire, yet there is beauty in their form.', 52339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We cannot rest yet, my child. Hyjal still stands, but if we falter on the Fire Lord\'s doorstep, all may still be lost. Let the strength of the ancients be with us.', 52338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth beneath our feet groans and shudders. Fire rains down from the sky. The air chokes away all life. This is truly the realm of the Fire Lord.', '', 52337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you ever seen anything like it? ', 'Have you ever seen anything like it?', 52336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The Shadow Warden looks at you silently.>', 52335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let the unbelievers perish in fire!', 52334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24799, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Behold His power!', 52333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24798, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We call upon you, Firelord!', 52332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24797, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None escape the rage of the Firelands!', '', 52331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witness the majesty of flame!', '', 52330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24811, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold His power!', '', 52329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24809, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We call upon you, Firelord!', '', 52328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24808, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Together we call upon the lord of fire!', 'Together we call upon the lord of fire!', 52327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24800, 24800, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The light...mustn\'t burn out...', 52326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24429, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reborn in flame!', 52325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24437, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fire...fire...', 52324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24436, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will burn you from the sky!', 52323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These skies are MINE!', 52322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24434, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For his glory!', 52321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24431, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'BURN!', 52320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I serve a new master now, mortals!', 52319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_improvedfirenova.blp:20|t Alysrazor is at |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99925|h[Full Power]|h|r!', 52318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_elemental_primal_fire.blp:20|t Alysrazor\'s fiery core |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99922|h[Re-Ignites]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_elemental_primal_fire.blp:20|t Alysrazor\'s fiery core |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99922|h[Re-Ignites]|h|r!', 52317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holiday_tow_spicecloud.blp:20|t Alysrazor\'s fire |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99432|h[Burns Out]|h|r!', 52316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_mage_firestarter.blp:20|t The harsh winds form a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99794|h[Fiery Vortex]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_mage_firestarter.blp:20|t The harsh winds form a |cFFFF0000|Hspell:99794|h[Fiery Vortex]|h|r!', 52315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alysrazor begins to fly in a rapid circle!  The harsh winds will remove Wings of Flame!', 52314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Molten Eggs begin to hatch!', '', 52313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra? Aggra! I can\'t hear-', '', 52312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re almost home, my love. Our time is so brief. You will change again, Go\'el - but I will find you! I\'ll NEVER give up on you!', 52311, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra... I heard your voice... calling me back...$b$bWhere are we?', '', 52310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOW. AWAKEN.', '', 52309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24757, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, don\'t you tell ME to be patient, you green-skinned...', 52308, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 24701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are patient.', '', 52307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24756, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Damn you, Go\'el - WAKE UP! Don\'t let it end like this! We\'ve come too far to fail now!', 52306, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 24700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He did NOT just say that!', 52305, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 24699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are patient.', '', 52304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24755, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'GO\'EL! Pull it together or we\'re all going to DIE!', 52303, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did he just...? Go\'el, can you hear me? We need your help! Do something!', 52302, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 24697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are patient.', '', 52301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24754, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s too many of them! I don\'t know how long we can hold out! Go\'el, now would be a good time to wake up!', 52300, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 24696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t feel so good...', 'I don\'t feel so good...', 52299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can...can anyone help me?', 'Can...can anyone help me?', 52298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the first time, the Earthen Ring and the Cenarion Circle will unite - to restore this great Tree - thereby healing the whole of Azeroth.', 52293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24795, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And the flame of our vengeance draws near. Be ready.', '', 52292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24496, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even now, the elements are tearing you apart - and they shall feed upon your doubts and fears \'til the last spark of life on this wretched world has been snuffed out.', '', 52291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight Prophet knows that YOU - and you alone - are our final obstacle. He\'s sent ME to remove you from the game.', '', 52290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24503, 0, 5, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fight this, Go\'el! You\'ve got to snap out of it!', 52289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24736, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He must embrace them and find balance... or this curse will never end. ', 52288, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24738, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, Go\'el, hold on! I WILL free you! And you\'ll HAVE this life, I swear it! ', 52287, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24734, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hear me, Go\'el! You ARE NOT alone! I\'m here with you - I will NOT let you go! ', 52286, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24731, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Naive as always, I see. Your pet orc cannot save you now, Malfurion.', '', 52284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24497, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, shan\'do - certainly you recognize your former pupil?', '', 52283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24498, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will I?\n', '', 52282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24499, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may be this world\'s greatest shaman, Thrall - but you are only mortal. This is my master\'s curse upon you - turning your great bond with the elements... into your undoing!\n', '', 52281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death? Who said anything about death?', '', 52280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24502, 0, 274, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, Son of Durotan! You and your allies have certainly set us back, but the Hour of Twilight CANNOT be averted!', '', 52279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24504, 0, 5, 274, 25, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m sorry, are we interrupting?', '', 52278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24495, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time is precious, sister. Let us see to our ritual...', '', 52277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24821, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fandral is corrupting fellow druids into something sinister. He may have other followers already - I must warn Moonglade.', '', 52276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24962, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fandral - what have they done to you?', '', 52275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24961, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret this, stranger!', '', 52274, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24960, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense a vast power has grown within you, young Thrall. You\'ve achieved much, since last we met.', '', 52273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24959, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friends.', '', 52272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24958, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was the Earthen Ring\'s most powerful shaman, and the ceremony cannot continue without him. But we must be prepared to accept that he may be lost forever...', 52271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24796, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Friends, we have gathered here today to heal this world that we\'ve sacrificed so much to save.', 52270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24794, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome, Son of Durotan. And to you, Aggralan of the Frostwolves.', 52269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24793, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not fear death.', '', 52268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24776, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer!', '', 52267, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24775, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master Stormrage. It\'s good to have you back in the waking world.', '', 52266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24774, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...They grew it in the first place.', '', 52265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Aspects believe it will. And they should know...', '', 52264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24773, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Those mongrels have stolen my Go\'el, but I will NOT forsake him. Ancestors forgive me - my heart feels stolen away with him.', 52263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24745, 5, 25, 20, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But what of Go\'el?', 52262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24744, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el! NO!', 52261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24743, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lady Ysera.', 52260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24742, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you think it will work, Go\'el? The druids and shaman uniting to restore the World Tree... Could it actually heal this broken world?', 52259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24741, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may go to him... at your peril.', '', 52258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24781, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kalecgos has been chosen as the new aspect for the blue dragonflight.$b$bOne among you was instrumental in thwarting Arygos\'s betrayal to Deathwing, thereby averting a terrible crisis.$b$bWe are here to partake in the celebration of their heroic deeds.', '', 52253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What occasion brings you to our home town, drake?', 'What occasion brings you to our home town, drake?', 52252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, mortal?', '', 52251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp and burn, stomp and burn. ', '', 52250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shatter the bones!', '', 52249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sear the flesh from their tiny frames.', '', 52248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush, crush... crush.', '', 52247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Broken. Mnngghhh... broken...', '', 52246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh... burns!', '', 52245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Consume...', '', 52244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My inner fire can never die.', '', 52243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succumb to living flame.', '', 52242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24551, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Buuurrrnn!', '', 52241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24550, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eons I have slept undisturbed... Now this... Creatures of flesh, now you will BURN!', '', 52240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll crush you underfoot!', '', 52239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stomp now.', '', 52238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh you little beasts...', '', 52237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24544, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uurrghh now you... you infuriate me!', '', 52236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24543, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh - smooshy little pests, look what you\'ve done!', '', 52235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24542, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Graaahh!', '', 52234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oww now hey.', '', 52233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Squeak, little pest.', '', 52232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24548, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So soft!', '', 52231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24547, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finished.', '', 52230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24546, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah? Hruumph? Soft little fleshy-things? Here? Nuisances, nuisances!', '', 52229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24537, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry! You must save Aggra before she is pulled into the vortex!', 52228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is regenerating. Dispel his Twilight Restoration spell!', '%s is regenerating. Dispel his Twilight Restoration spell!', 52227, 0, 3623, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You shall not have him!', 52226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'While I am buried in research, it will be up to you to teach the Lasher the ways of the world.', 52225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such a unique specimen! So many possibilities! I must devote myself harder to the study of the local flora and fauna.', 52224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not worry. I will keep the Crimson Lasher safe with me. Until we learn more about its behavior, I\'m afraid it must stay here in the Firelands.', 52223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, noooo- This was to be my hour of triumph...', '', 52222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24518, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I finish this, your pathetic mortal world will burn with my vengeance!', '', 52221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrggh, outsiders - this is not your realm!', '', 52220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too soon...', '', 52219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Too soon! ... You have come too soon...', '', 52218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sulfuras will be your end.', '', 52217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fall to your knees, mortals!  This ends now.', '', 52216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough! I will finish this.', '', 52215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your judgment has come!', '', 52214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 52213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be crushed!', '', 52212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By fire be purged!', '', 52211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arise, servants of fire, consume their flesh!', '', 52210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24516, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Denizens of flame, come to me!', '', 52209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions of fire! Purge the outsiders!', '', 52208, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come forth, my servants! Defend your master!', '', 52207, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is MY realm!', '', 52206, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 52205, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, insect!', '', 52204, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal Insects! You dare trespass into MY domain?  Your arrogance will be purged in living flame.', '', 52203, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24517, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to channel a massive Shadow Nova!', '%s begins to channel a massive Shadow Nova!', 52202, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hurry, mortal.$b$bMeet me inside the Nexus!', 52201, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el!', 52200, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 24739, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His aspect shifts once again! You are losing him!', '', 52199, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24786, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I need... the world... needs him whole once again. But he\'s always placed the needs of others before his own. How long has he suppressed these feelings - these desires?', 52198, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24737, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done the impossible, shaman. You have stilled the vortex within him without losing yourself, in turn. Your love for him... must be very great. ', '', 52197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find and release Aggra before she gets pulled into the whirlpool!', 52196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. Witness the raw power of my new Lord!', '', 52195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ancestors, give me strength! The vortex\'s pull is increasing! It\'s pulling me in! The power of his longing... it\'s overwhelming!', 52194, 0, 0, 430, 65, 0, 0, 24735, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...to have a family of his own... with me? Go\'el never knew his parents... It was only a few years ago that he even found his people... I should have known this was what he wanted most.', 52193, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 24733, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A final vision! Ancestors... could those be... our children? This was his deepest desire... to be a father?', 52192, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 24732, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Another vision! I see Go\'el, but... it... it\'s me. Was I his deepest desire? A mate with which to share his life... his burdens and his joys?', 52191, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 24730, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He... wished to lay down his weapon... and the burdens of leadership...', 52190, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24729, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look there - a vision within the torrent! Is this what Go\'el longed for most? Peace with his enemies - an end to the constant warring of his world?', 52189, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 24728, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Its purgin time!', '', 52186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool mortals. Hurl yourselves into your own demise!', '', 52185, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24446, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s retreats and calls for the protection of his allies!', '', 52184, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your flesh is forfeit to the fires of this realm.', '', 52183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24450, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By the Firelord\'s command, you, too, shall perish!', '', 52182, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24447, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn beneath my molten fury!', '', 52181, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are forbidden from my master\'s domain, mortals.', '', 52180, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24441, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None shall pass!', '', 52179, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold your weakness.', '', 52178, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24451, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have been judged.', '', 52177, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24449, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Moat Monster submerges.', 'The Moat Monster submerges.', 52176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you going to pay for that? Oh, it\'s for Aska! Take care, then.', 'Were you going to pay for that? Oh, it\'s for Aska! Take care, then.', 52175, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re here for Aska\'s order, then? Please tell her I said hello.', 'You\'re here for Aska\'s order, then? Please tell her I said hello.', 52174, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only the very best, hmmm?', 'Only the very best, hmmm?', 52173, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well-picked. I\'m sure Aska will be satisfied.', 'Well-picked. I\'m sure Aska will be satisfied.', 52172, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That one? Well done. It\'s the best here.', 'That one? Well done. It\'s the best here.', 52171, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Picking that up for Aska? She\'ll be pleased with your choice.', 'Picking that up for Aska? She\'ll be pleased with your choice.', 52170, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve a good eye for ingredients.', 'You\'ve a good eye for ingredients.', 52169, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wise choice. I\'d have selected that one myself.', 'A wise choice. I\'d have selected that one myself.', 52168, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH HAH HAH! Enjoy your stale rations, then. This slop\'s delicious.', 'HAH HAH HAH! Enjoy your stale rations, then. This slop\'s delicious.', 52167, 1, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Roaches?! They wouldn\'t! Would they...? That\'s disgusting.', 'Roaches?! They wouldn\'t! Would they...? That\'s disgusting.', 52166, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not at all! If my gut could take three years of the Razor Hill barrack\'s Stinky Cactus Grub Soup, a bowl of roaches isn\'t going to kill me.', 'Not at all! If my gut could take three years of the Razor Hill barrack\'s Stinky Cactus Grub Soup, a bowl of roaches isn\'t going to kill me.', 52165, 1, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aren\'t you worried about what\'s IN that?', 'Aren\'t you worried about what\'s IN that?', 52164, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have more Bloated Frogs?', 'Can I have more Bloated Frogs?', 52163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I have another Decoy Kit?', 'Can I have another Decoy Kit?', 52162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am drunk, like many of my fellow dwarves.  I\'ve dug a tunnel and wound up here.  Who wants to drink?', 'I am drunk, like many of my fellow dwarves.  I\'ve dug a tunnel and wound up here.  Who wants to drink?', 52161, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This city is so big, to me, a tiny, pathetic gnome.', 'This city is so big, to me, a tiny, pathetic gnome.', 52160, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I?  I crashed with the Exodar and now stumbled into this imposing city...', 'Where am I?  I crashed with the Exodar and now stumbled into this imposing city...', 52159, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tremble in fear you mighty members of the Horde, the Alliance is here!', 'Tremble in fear you mighty members of the Horde, the Alliance is here!', 52158, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our loss in Tol Barad will be avenged!  I will try to bring death to this grand city.  Cower as I try to remember a battle cry!', 'Our loss in Tol Barad will be avenged!  I will try to bring death to this grand city.  Cower as I try to remember a battle cry!', 52157, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m so angry that we lost Wintergrasp, again!  I will try to kill your leader, the all powerful, Sylvanas, instead.', 'I\'m so angry that we lost Wintergrasp, again!  I will try to kill your leader, the all powerful, Sylvanas, instead.', 52156, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, look, there are people here.  Nothing at all like that tree city that I, a night elf, live in.', 'Hey, look, there are people here.  Nothing at all like that tree city that I, a night elf, live in.', 52155, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoo hoo!  I am here to slay Sylvanas!', 'Yoo hoo!  I am here to slay Sylvanas!', 52154, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There ye are! I was startin\' to think ye\'d made off with the beer!', '', 52153, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 52152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24263, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A soul fragment merges souls with the Harbinger of Darkness!', 'A soul fragment merges souls with the Harbinger of Darkness!', 52151, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This body is useless!', 52150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel me agony!', 52149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24284, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Share in my pain!', 52148, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha! You are nothing but a plaything!', 52147, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24275, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am sworn to protect this place!', 52146, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I told you to leave!', 52145, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No. NO! Get out! Leave me here with the memory of my sister!', 52144, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24269, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Twilight minions in the Nexus...$b$bThese are desperate times, $r.', 52143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Give me thanks to Daryl, will ye?', '', 52142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank ye!', '', 52141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep bringing me food like this an\' ye\'ll be me new best friend!', '', 52140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haggis fer breakfast, haggis fer lunch, and a sensible haggis dinner!', '', 52139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did ye know me favorite meal?', '', 52138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beer an\' haggis, now that\'ll put hair on yer chest!', '', 52137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
