('Hmph... quitter.', 'Hmph... quitter.', 52136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By th\' Light, it worked! Grimnur\'s brilliant... oh, I hope all the pinchin\' didn\'t hurt ye too much... But when ye taste the meat, ye\'ll know it\'s worth it!', '', 52135, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
