('Aggra, I... I can\'t hold on... AAH!', '', 52113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24753, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be still, my love. Calm your mind. You became a slave to your duty. But being true to your heart is how you\'ll fulfill that duty... to your people... and to me.', 52112, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24688, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra... it IS you...', '', 52111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24752, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are Go\'el, Son of Durotan and Draka! Rightful Warchief of the Horde! You are the orc who won my heart. Remember WHO YOU ARE!', 52110, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24687, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know your face... Aggra! Oh, my heart - can\'t you see? I am... nothing. Selfish... all I\'ve done... accomplished... all for the sake of pride alone. I am... unworthy of you...', '', 52109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Brace yourself, $n!', 52108, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 24686, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why did I not listen?', '', 52107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You did what you thought best, Go\'el! Fight these doubts! They\'re devouring your heart!', 52106, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24685, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have... failed the Horde... as Warchief...$b$bGarrosh... will lead it to ruin...$b$bMy people... to ruin. Cairne, my brother... why did I not listen?', '', 52105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s too far gone! We have to keep trying!', 52104, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 24684, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
