('Your presence here is unwelcome, elemental!', '', 51992, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing!', '', 51991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We of Gilneas show little patience for outsiders.', 51990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What\'s a little fire in the face of five heroes of the Alliance?', 51989, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Gilneas!', 51988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Never return to this place, elemental. This is a place of nature!', 51987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'By Elune, I shall show you a quick death.', 51986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May you frolic through meadows of pain.', 51985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallo!', '', 51984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d \'ave a cleaner shot \'round \'ere if someone hadn\'t all gone and done regrown up all them stupid trees.', '', 51983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The doctor is... IN!', 51982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this.', '', 51981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you are to be my commander today. Very well.', '', 51980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, I fight by your side.', '', 51979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You need help with some fires? Very well, let\'s get down to business.', 51978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nature\'s blessings upon you.', 51977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your deceit is unforgivable, Jin\'do. You spit in the face of a god!', '', 51976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24246, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be freed, insects. I will deal with you another time.', '', 51975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24243, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meddlesome insects! Now you will feel my wrath!', '', 51973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24268, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You nothing!', '', 51972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t NO ONE gonna stop Jin\'do!', '', 51971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24257, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You nothing!', '', 51970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good leather in the marshes, if you\'ve the guts for it. Lots of crocolisks. Thinkin\' my brother and I\'ll stay a while.\n\nSomethin\' I can help you with?', '', 51969, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The staff pulsates with arcane energies.>', '', 51968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In a flash, you\'ll be nothing more than dust...', '', 51967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s gem-mad, he is, but I love him. Says I\'m his favorite gem of them all, hee!\n\nNow then, what can I help ye with? Archaeology, is it?', 51966, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twinkles! Why did it have to be Twinkles?', '', 51964, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you looking at me? Yes, look at me. You should be looking at me. Are you? Looking at me? Good.', '', 51963, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We thank you, friend of the blue dragonflight.', '', 51962, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May her presence be a source of comfort and companionship to you.', '', 51961, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I used ta be in the Explorers\' League, ye know.\n\nBut then I realized the only thing I really cared ta look for was GEMS.\n\nBig, sparklin\', colorful, valuable gems... oh, how I love ye!', '', 51960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my kitchen!\n\nAre you here looking for food, or to do some cooking yourself?', '', 51959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With all the Siege Engines nearly complete, I\'m getting a bit bored!\n\nYou\'re not an engineer, are you? Care to compare blueprints...?', '', 51958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please, lower your voice. It isn\'t wise to remind Lady Proudmoore of the sorts of things we study.\n\nNow, shall we speak of TRUE power...?', 51957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the might of my storm!', '', 51956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24332, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mean to say there is a warlock? Here, in goodly Theramore?!\n\nOh, my. Someone must inform Lady Proudmoore immediately!\n\n...heh.', 51955, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shocking. I know.', '', 51954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24331, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end of our empire... is only the beginning...', '', 51953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24330, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The storm feeds my power!', '', 51952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24336, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you quicker than lightning?', '', 51951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re in for a stunning surprise...', '', 51950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24334, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel that tingling sensation? It may be your last.', '', 51949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were this tower to boast TWICE as many tomes, it would still not be enough for me. My collecting and copying shall never be done.\n\nSo. You have need of my assistance?', '', 51948, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall regret disturbing my homeland!', '', 51947, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24329, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I consider it a great honor to assist the Lady Proudmoore in her research. She\'s the most powerful human mage upon Azeroth, you know!\n\nNow, was there something I might help you with?', 51946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll all suffer for this! Zul\'Gurub is NOTHING without Zan... Zan...', 'You\'ll all suffer for this! Zul\'Gurub is NOTHING without Zan... Zan...', 51945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24338, 24338, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe deep, friends! Breathe it all in!', 'Breathe deep, friends! Breathe it all in!', 51944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24341, 24341, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahaha!', 'Hahahaha!', 51943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24340, 24340, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rise up! Zanzil\'s elixir gives you life!', 'Rise up! Zanzil\'s elixir gives you life!', 51942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24352, 24352, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who needs friends? Zanzil just makes his own! ', 'Who needs friends? Zanzil just makes his own! ', 51941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24351, 24351, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go, little one! Fight them! KILL THEM!', 'Go, little one! Fight them! KILL THEM!', 51940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24350, 24350, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you need someone bigger to play with!', 'Maybe you need someone bigger to play with!', 51939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24349, 24349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oooh, pretty... Zanzil\'s got big plans for this one...', 'Oooh, pretty... Zanzil\'s got big plans for this one...', 51938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24344, 24344, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How does that taste?', 'How does that taste?', 51937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24343, 24343, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t worry. Zanzil won\'t leave you dead for long...', 'Don\'t worry. Zanzil won\'t leave you dead for long...', 51936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24342, 24342, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What? You\'ve come to laugh at Zanzil, too? Not again! I\'ll make you pay!', 'What? You\'ve come to laugh at Zanzil, too? Not again! I\'ll make you pay!', 51935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24337, 24337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to the Hyjal invasion area, or you will be dropped!', '', 51934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not even a thousand deaths could put my soul to rest...', '', 51933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24310, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One thousand blades!', '', 51932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feel the sting of a thousand cuts!', '', 51931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24307, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It only hurts this much the first time.  The second time, you\'re dead.', '', 51930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24316, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rogues do it from behind...', '', 51929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24315, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps a quick stab will let out all that tension in your shoulders...', '', 51928, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Learn your place.', '', 51927, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A swift slice to the throat, and this one falls like any other.', '', 51926, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24311, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahhh... I shall add a new blade to my collection today...', '', 51925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24309, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, Tarecgosa, our beloved sister whose essence you have generously borne, has chosen this staff as her permanent home.', '', 51924, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24879, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My spirit dreams no longer...', '', 51923, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24248, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slumber... another dream awaits you...', '', 51922, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24251, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what\'s more horrifying... to dream unwaking, or to awaken in a living nightmare!', '', 51921, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24250, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us see what horrors stir within your nightmares!', '', 51920, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24249, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There there... close your eyes...', '', 51919, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24253, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pity. In death, you no longer dream...', '', 51918, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24252, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Today, you\'ll wish you never stirred from your bed!', '', 51917, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 24247, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gri\'lek wanders... no more...', '', 51916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24233, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! You do not escape the rage of the Gurubashi!', '', 51915, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24242, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Coward! You cannot run!', '', 51914, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24241, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will catch you, small one!', '', 51913, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24235, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I COME FOR YOU, LITTLE MORTAL!', '', 51912, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24234, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weak!', '', 51911, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24237, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crushed!', '', 51910, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24236, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek me? We fight now!', '', 51909, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, aye. I took the wee rotter\'s candle.\n\nNow, what did ye need?', '', 51906, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is not the fighters I watch; that is the Combat Masters\' task.\n\nMy concern is for the two neophytes whose duty it is to heal them. So far, my students are doing well.', '', 51905, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That island over there is full of Obsidium creatures! I\'d go over there myself, but I can\'t get across the bridge.', 51904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My, it sure is hot down here. I didn\'t even need to bring my own forge.', 51903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This platform is about to crumble! Jump to another!', 'This platform is about to crumble! Jump to another!', 51902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Present me your staff, that we may endow it with great power.', '', 51901, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24878, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We owe you a great deal for the part you have played in the destiny of our flight.', '', 51900, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24877, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But praise alone will not suffice.', '', 51899, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are to be congratulated for your success in the Firelands.', '', 51898, 0, 0, 485, 65, 0, 24875, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend. We\'ve been expecting you.', '', 51897, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can teach the art of cooking.\n\nAre you looking to learn?', 'I can teach the art of cooking.\n\nAre you looking to learn?', 51896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While this is certainly a grave marker, it is unclear who is buried here.', '', 51895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Present the Smoke-Stained Locket.', 'Present the Smoke-Stained Locket.', 51894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The grave is old, peaceful, and undisturbed.', '', 51893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand upon this disc, $p. Kalecgos approaches!', 51892, 0, 12207, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now, the war begins.', '', 51891, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24955, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we will draw the attention of Ragnaros\' army so that others might strike at the heart of his realm.', '', 51890, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24954, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we will hold firm against the onslaught of the elements.', '', 51889, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24953, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With this seed, we set root. With time and attention, we should be able to grow shelter from this charred, hostile realm.', '', 51888, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24952, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done. We should be safe for the moment, but we haven\'t much time.', '', 51887, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 24950, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Follow me, $n. A ceremony has been prepared in your honor.', 51884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready to take part in the ceremony, Hallegosa.', 'I am ready to take part in the ceremony, Hallegosa.', 51883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your deeds shall live on forever in the memories of every blue dragon, $n.', 51882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Bloodlord, it look like he be overseein\' da Gurubashi warriors.', 51881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mandokir sure do love his raptors.', 51880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What kinda mess did we stumble into?', 51879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What part of da jungle ain\'t da other emissary been in?', 51878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da other emissary, he always be tryin\' to save da world!', 51877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s armor is weakened by the active volcano.', '', 51876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I fear there may be a lost druid in the back of the cave, $n. Be on the lookout.', 51875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There are plenty of thermal vents up ahead, $n. Feel free to use them if you get into a jam.', 51874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The flamewakers up ahead mean business. Be careful in there.', 51873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Welcome to the Molten Flow, $n.', 51872, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad you could make it, $n.', 51871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no time to waste, friend.$b$bMy flight is in disarray and is in desperate need of leadership.', '', 51870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tank ya for savin\' my life.', 'Tank ya for savin\' my life.', 51869, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da spirits be watchin\' over me today.', 'Da spirits be watchin\' over me today.', 51868, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I was tinkin\' dat I was gonna to die in dis jungle.', 'I was tinkin\' dat I was gonna to die in dis jungle.', 51867, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da serpents overwhelmed us.', 'Da serpents overwhelmed us.', 51866, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da serpents, dey be everywhere!', 'Da serpents, dey be everywhere!', 51865, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwemba, is dat you?  Tanks for da save.', 'Bwemba, is dat you?  Tanks for da save.', 51864, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya saved my life!', 'Ya saved my life!', 51863, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tanks for da help.', 'Tanks for da help.', 51862, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The troll sings to himself as he observes the carnage around him.>', '', 51861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why don\'t these trolls just deal with their problems on their own?', '', 51859, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can barely understand what these trolls are trying to say.', '', 51858, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These trolls have just shown up demanding our help.', '', 51857, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leyara nods.', 51856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools! Neltharion take you all!', '', 51855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I named her Istaria. She has your eyes. ', 51854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our child has been born. It\'s a girl! A beautiful baby girl.', 51853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will learn in due time, my daughter. Come with me. Together, we will bring vengeance to those who have wronged us...', '', 51852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24494, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What is this power? What have you become?', 51851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24916, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was rescued by some new allies. I\'m sorry I was not here sooner.', '', 51850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24492, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fandral! You escaped from prison?', 51849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24915, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One who shares your pain. One who offers you the power to assuage it.', '', 51848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s there?', 51847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your anger is not misguided.', '', 51846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fandral would never have allowed the Horde to attack our home! And who did Malfurion send to defend us? No one!', 51845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I tried to save you Istaria, but I was too weak.', 51844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leyara, the two of you are all I have left. I swear to you, on my life, you and my granddaughter will ALWAYS have my protection.', '', 51843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Valstann, my dear husband, you left us too soon.', 51842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24909, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time passes, yet the sting of his death will not fade.', '', 51841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh - this is terrible. Why would Leyara cling to this memory? Valstann must have been an important part of her life...', '', 51840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24941, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
