('', 'Very well. Malfurion shall press into the Firelands, and we will deal with him there. His judgment can wait for a few more brief days.$b$b<Leyara\'s eyes light up.>$b$bThe tauren arch druid, however, will not be so lucky.', 51767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
