('', 'Never you mind, $r. The details of my past were burned away when I joined the Druids of the Flame. They are of no concern to you.$b$bBesides, I am here to discuss the future of this realm. And I do not plan to discuss it with you.$b$bNow answer me... where is Malfurion!?', 51764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
