('', 'Halduron, we should combine our forces and make preparations to act on reports from the Darkspear scouts.', 51686, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat be da plan. My men be infiltratin\' da city and learnin\' what dey can about da new Zandalari warlord. ', '', 51685, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must prevent it from occurring in the first place. ', '', 51684, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So how are we going to deal with this alliance between the Amani and the Zandalari? ', 51683, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rastakhan be callin\' me his brother, but da Horde be our true brothers. We gotta stop him before he can sweet-talk da others into joinin\' his empire.', '', 51682, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be holed up inside da ruined city, regroupin\'. ', '', 51681, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My scouts have reported nothing but quiet outside Zul\'Aman. ', '', 51680, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Amani, da Gurubashi, all o\' dem. He be dispatchin\' emissaries to every tribe. ', '', 51679, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Including the Amani? ', 51678, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('King Rastakhan, he be plannin\' to unite da troll tribes under his Zandalari.', '', 51677, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dat I was. Da Zandalari called a meeting  o\' all da troll tribes includin\' da Darkspears. ', '', 51676, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, Chieftain Vol\'jin, before we were so rudely interrupted, you were telling us of the Zandalari plan. ', '', 51675, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the commander of Silvermoon\'s defenses and I will seek assistance as I deem necessary! ', '', 51674, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Lor\'themar does not concur with your reasoning, ranger-general. You have no authority to invite this --', '', 51673, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She is here at my invitation, courier. Most of my Farstriders are away and cannot be recalled easily. Vereesa\'s rangers know the land and they are experienced combatants. ', '', 51672, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vereesa, please! ', '', 51671, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quel\'Thalas is as much my home as it is yours and I would not see it fall to our ancient enemy. Now, you tell your cowardly regent --', 51670, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Lor\'themar demands an explanation for the presence of this... exile in our lands.', '', 51669, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring word from the Regent Lord of Silvermoon.', '', 51668, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Planting', 'Planting', 51667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is the meaning of this?!', '', 51666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done, $n. It looks like we have them on the run.', 51665, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, friends! The tower is ours! Now I shall see to the destruction of this foul monument.', '', 51664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tarecgosa!', '', 51663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fool! Be bathed in the flames!', 51662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I will attend to the Archdruid. Malfurion and Matoclaw have requested your presence immediately.', '', 51661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25157, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what has happened?', '', 51660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 25156, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am prepared to accompany you, Kalecgos.', 'I am prepared to accompany you, Kalecgos.', 51659, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear me, Rastakhan! Wherever ya and your Zandalari be schemin\' to rule da troll people, ya be findin\' da Darkspear and our allies standin\' against ya!', '', 51658, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da warlord has fallen!', '', 51657, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I be one o\' da Darkspear scouts. Kill dat Amani priest so I can return wit\' my report!', '', 51656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Help me outta here, $r. First, you gotta kill da Amani priest who captured me. He be preparin\' to sacrifice me!\n', 51655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nevermind me, $r. $b$bNorkani as good as dead. Leave now, $r, before da Amani get you too.', 51654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya have my gratitude for gettin\' me outta dat cage. My wits are finally returnin\' an\' I\'ll be able to tell Vol\'jin what I learned.\n', 51653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'Dere be somethin\' in dat one. Go take look.', 51652, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hmm. Dat\'s not da one. Let\'s try one o\' da other vases.', 51651, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe it be in dis urn over here. Stand back!', 51650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dat be so much better. I be weak, but I remember hearin\' da Amani and da Zandalari talkin\' about treasure hidden in dis very room.', 51649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go on, then. Weep over the body of your precious tauren... though I assure you that your tears will not bring him back.', 51648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24923, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, look before you! One of Azeroth\'s most powerful \"druids\", reduced to nothing but a charred husk. Such is the will of Fandral Staghelm. Such is the will of the flame!', 51647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24922, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have you had enough yet? Have you felt enough pain?', 51646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24920, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Burn, tauren!  BURN!!', 51645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24919, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this?  I... can\'t move!  Someone, help!', '', 51644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24853, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of this!', 51643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24918, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You killed dozens of my students.  You will pay for what you\'ve done.', '', 51642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You... you\'re the one from the portal... the druid of flame...', '', 51641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is already determined.  You have no hope... the flames shall consume all!', 51640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24917, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Darkspear be foolish.  No one gonna stand in our way.', '', 51639, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De tides of darkness gonna take over.  All da trolls be in danger.', '', 51638, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis shattered world not done breakin, mon.', '', 51637, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De Zandalari got powers you never seen.  Wisdom of de most ancient of trolls, wisdom dat\'s rightfully yours.', '', 51636, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De green fist of de troll empire gonna crush dis land and make it our own again.', '', 51635, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis land was taken from us in a tide of blood.', '', 51634, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Dis be de only way, bruddahs.', '', 51633, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zul has seen tha\' future.  We gotta come together, or we all fall to de darkness.', '', 51632, 14, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, it is good to see you again, $r.', '', 51631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancients of Zandalar, mark \'dem for de black road.', '', 51630, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shower of Flame incoming! Don\'t stop moving!', '', 51629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need use of a wyvern to fly me to where the Darkspear emissary went.', 'I need use of a wyvern to fly me to where the Darkspear emissary went.', 51628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These trolls have made a grave mistake, $c.', 51627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, our forces are about to push up the ramp. You should join them.', 51626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancestors be beside me, let \'dem hear yo\' voice!', '', 51625, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keeper Taldros, I am sending Sira and the others with you to help you take the tower. Elune be with you.', 51624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deldren, Shalis, these men are yours to lead. Take the tower.', 51623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Turak, Marin, lead these forces up the ramp and take the tower! Be swfit!', 51622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, our attack should be ready shortly. Wait here and push up the ramp with them.', 51621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, our forces are pushing up to the tower already. You should join them, quickly.', 51620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, our forces are pushing up the ramp. You should join them there.', 51619, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Wistfully, Kalecgos looks off to the horizon.>$b$bTarecgosa is... special to me.$b$bWhen she was but a hatchling, I was charged with her protection and education. Over the millennia, we have forged a special bond, not unlike what you would call siblings.$b$bTarecgosa was born under a special sign that foretold of a great destiny. If the prophecies are true, then her survival is of vital importance to the blue dragonflight, and to Azeroth itself.$b$bOur affinity for one another is well known within the remnants of our flight. If your vision recounted an event that has actually taken place, she could be in grave danger.', '', 51618, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who is Tarecgosa? I could not have made it through the Nexus without her.', 'Who is Tarecgosa? I could not have made it through the Nexus without her.', 51617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a great deal at stake within the blue dragonflight, $c.$b$bSoon, a new aspect must be chosen to take the place of Malygos.$b$bArygos aspires to follow in the footsteps of his father, renewing the misguided aggression against all who wield magic. This path, I feel, would lead to the end of our kind.$b$bThe remnants of our flight are divided on this fateful issue, and I fear that Arygos will stop at nothing to meet his ends...', '', 51616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My vision in the Eye of Eternity haunts me, Kalecgos. What do you make of it?', 'My vision in the Eye of Eternity haunts me, Kalecgos. What do you make of it?', 51615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something about you seems... familiar.', '', 51614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak freely, friend.', '', 51613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('What brings you to me, mortal?', '', 51612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancients of Zandalar, grant dis one da power ta\' mock death itself!', '', 51611, 14, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dere was a shrine to serpents just to da east of Bambala, I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in front of dat shrine.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest.', 51610, 0, 923, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is time, $c.$b$bLet us see what has been so carefully hidden...', 51609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Their leader is here! Strike him down!', '', 51608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press on!  Push towards the tower!', '', 51607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come brothers and sisters. It is time to take this foul tower from the hands of our enemies.', '', 51606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Weeee! I\'m alive, I\'m alive, I\'m alive! Oh, I hope it\'s not too forward of me to tell you that I think I love you all and I hope I can find my bag because you certainly deserve a little something extra, you know, for the effort and all that you must have went through to save me...', 51605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Spirits let dis one return to us.', 51604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You be free from da voodoo now!', 51603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be free from da voodoo!', 51602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Voodoo be gone!', 51601, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Things be comin\' back. I be here for... a mission... Help me outta here. Dere\'s things to be done.', 51600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'My head be swimmin\'. Please, I be beggin\' ya!', 51599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'I be hearin\' ya an\' I think ya not be my captors. Come closer so I be seein\' ya.', 51598, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('', 'Dey\'ve done something to me! I be needin\' help!', 51597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 1, 1, 0, 1000, 500, 39653),
('They must\'ve drugged you. It\'s safe now.', 'They must\'ve drugged you. It\'s safe now.', 51596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where am I? You be here to help?', 51595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It be good to be outta dat cage. Norkani will have her revenge...', 51594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please take dis. Norkani be havin\' no use for it.', 51593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand clear....', 51592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now, where have dey put Norkani\'s things?', 51591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last, Norkani is free!\n', 51590, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I must be returnin\' to Vol\'jin wit\' my report! Help me outta here!', 51589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Norkani still be needin\' your help!\n', 51588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My liberators! Come down and have a word wit\' Norkani.', 51587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This place be reekin\' of death and sacrifice.$b$bBest you leave before you become da next prisoner.\n', 51586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis be a grisly business. I be happy when it be over and we go home again.', '', 51585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vol\'jin will show dose Zandalari not to mess wit\' da Darkspears.', '', 51584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Amani and da Zandalari will never try somethin\' like this again.', '', 51583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis place not be so bad if only dere weren\'t so many Amani \'ere.', '', 51582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Hideaway, it be overrun with zombies...', 51581, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Digsite, it be overrun with zombies...', 51580, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya be havin\' me gratitude, $c.$b$bIf there be anythin\' I can be doin\' for ya, just say so.', '', 51579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da hunters seem to be holdin\' da serpents off.  But sometin\' else feel wrong... Like we bein\' watched.', 51578, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help yourselves. It be suicide for a scout to walk around wit\' so much weighing me down.', '', 51577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no... Bambala...  It look like we already too late.  Da Zandalar attack, it begun.', 51576, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is Fort Livingston?  It look like we already too late.  Da Zandalar attack, it begun.', 51575, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Allow me ta show you something I discovered. Now where\'d I see dat satchel?', '', 51574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I be an emissary from da Darkspear trolls.  Da threat we face, also be a threat to da Alliance.  You willin\' to help out da Darkspear, $r?', 51573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It be good to be free again!', '', 51572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go leavin\' the job half done. Come an\' tell me if it be safe to make my report!', '', 51571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got information dat Vol\'jin needs. Help me outta here!', '', 51570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about comin\' over here an\' helpin\' me outta here?', '', 51569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t be forgettin\' about me!', '', 51568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya have my tanks, $c. I thought I\'d be endin\' up just another sacrifice...', '', 51567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you here to aid da Darkspear, $c?', 51566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok mon, this be what I saw....$b$bAll was quiet, til we be hearin\' a rustlin\' sound, like the wind through the trees. Before we know it, we be surrounded by these Amani and their pets! Next think I knew, I be wakin\' up here, stuck in a cage.$b$bDay an\' night, one by one, da captured scouts be gettin\' killed. Every time one be dyin\', that bear-troll be lookin\' stronger.$b$bThat be all I could learn from my place in dat cage.', '', 51565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 1, 0, 500, 1000, 39653),
('You don\'t have to worry about that anymore. What\'s going on here?', 'You don\'t have to worry about that anymore. What\'s going on here?', 51564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be outta dat cage. Dey were goin\' to sacrifice me...', '', 51563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 500, 0, 39653),
('There now. It be a gift to you, to help wit\' defeatin\' da Amani!', '', 51562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here be some of my things....', '', 51561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, I be free!', '', 51560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I could be pickin\' this lock in my sleep. Just come an\' say when it be safe to make my escape.', '', 51559, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Don\'t ya be forgettin\' about Hazlek over here.', '', 51558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello out there. Anybody be hearin\' Hazlek?', '', 51557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You kill the trollbear, mon? It be safe for me to make my way back now?', '', 51556, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once da high priest is dead and da coast is clear, let me know and I be returnin\' to the blood guard wit\' my report.', '', 51555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stay by Elderlimb\'s side!', 'You must stay by Elderlimb\'s side!', 51554, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stay by Tholo and Anren\'s side!', 'You must stay by Tholo and Anren\'s side!', 51553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must stay by Thisalee\'s side!', 'You must stay by Thisalee\'s side!', 51552, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am here, Anren!', '', 51551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
