('', 'Dese Gurubashi mean business.  We gotta help dese people.', 51410, 0, 12093, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I don\'t believe my eyes... Is dat Bloodlord Mandokir?  Dis gonna be bad...', 51409, 0, 12093, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah... It be Kilnara.  I shoulda known she be involved here.', 51408, 0, 12090, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dis is serious business.  Venoxis ain\'t one to trifle wit\'.', 51407, 0, 12089, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now let\'s see what Bwemba\'s conjured up...', 51406, 0, 12089, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I got a few more tings to discuss here.  Den I\'ll head to Zul\'Gurub.  I will see you dere.', '', 51405, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work Bwemba, you an\' your friend, make da Darkspear proud.', '', 51404, 0, 923, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Den dat be where we go next.  We gonna stop dis uprising at da source.', '', 51403, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know.  It be why I went around, to warn everyone.   When da leader of da Darkspear speak, everyone listen, Horde an\' Alliance.', '', 51402, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see you were able to get some help.', '', 51401, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zanzil!', 51400, 0, 12065, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Gurubashi be usin\' all sorts of voodoo to reclaim dere land.', 51399, 0, 12090, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work Bwemba.  It be good to see dat dere be Alliance willin\' to help stop da Zandalar.', '', 51398, 0, 924, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can keep my town safe,  I\'ll definitely make it worth your while.', '', 51397, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not all da places held together so well.  We try to help as much as we can.  But da source, it be Zul\'Gurub.', 51396, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da help\'s been good.  Da Zandalar plan has set da Gurubashi on da warpath.', 51395, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh, dere you are!  We been searching da entire jungle for ya!', 51394, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you! Now to see about this burning sensation...', 'Thank you! Now to see about this burning sensation...', 51393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('S-s-s-st-sticky....', 'S-s-s-st-sticky....', 51392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for getting me out of there! That was awful.', 'Thanks for getting me out of there! That was awful.', 51391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for freeing me. I thought I was done for.', 'Thank you for freeing me. I thought I was done for.', 51390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t want to know what it was like in there.', 'You don\'t want to know what it was like in there.', 51389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I\'ll be sure to slay a few spiders on my way back to camp.', 'Thank you. I\'ll be sure to slay a few spiders on my way back to camp.', 51388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my thanks, friend.', 'You have my thanks, friend.', 51387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can one of your gryphons get me to the Digsite?', 'Can one of your gryphons get me to the Digsite?', 51386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is no end to these trolls, $c.', '', 51385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahaha, get a load \'a me, mon!$b$bGriftah be back again! New stall, and brand new wares, and ready to pass on the deals to ya!$b$bWant to be better, stronger, faster? Each one of these amulets be guaranteed to do just what I say they be doin\'. Step up and buy one of these miraculous baubles! Cheap at twice the price!', '', 51384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My death means...nothing...', '', 51383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the coils of death unfurl!', '', 51382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your sssacrifice pleases him.', '', 51381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mortal coil unwindsss...', '', 51380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your grip is loosening! Climb down the tree quickly!', 'Your grip is loosening! Climb down the tree quickly!', 51379, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You forget yourself, child! Do you know who stands before you?', '', 51378, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it\'s not true? Thank the ancestors! I wouldn\'t want you to be my enemy, Lady Sylvanas.', '', 51377, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Garrosh and I will always do what is best for our people.', 51376, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Horde embraced my people when we stood alone and we Forsaken never forget a debt...', 51375, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I do not require defending, ambassador. Young one, as I have told the warchief, my loyalties have never been in doubt.', 51374, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone says you had a fight with the warchief and you\'re going to abandon the Horde. Is that true?', '', 51373, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, so you\'re the Banshee Queen? I kind of expected you to be taller!', '', 51372, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump to shake off the Cinderlings!', '', 51371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I did it! I got us back on track!', '', 51370, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna be fun!', '', 51369, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('T\'kulu\'s death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!', '', 51368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mauri\'s death removes the protections from a nearby cauldron!', 51367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gotta be Bwemba\'s hands on dis one... I need ya to toss some sticks into da bonfire in da center of dis camp.  Den Bwemba can handle da rest.', 51366, 0, 924, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I found the emergency button. Rockets have those, don\'t they?', '', 51365, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wanna be talkin\' to da spirits?  Well let\'s see what we can do... ', 51364, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something unnatural is going on, Bwemba.  Can you help?', 'Something unnatural is going on, Bwemba.  Can you help?', 51363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the only button I haven\'t pushed yet. Let\'s give it a try!', '', 51362, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m losing control!', '', 51361, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, rocket! Don\'t go that way!', '', 51360, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Hang onto your, um... helmet!', '', 51359, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve figured out how this works. I\'m taking control!', '', 51358, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now THAT\'s more like it!', '', 51357, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wonder what this button does...', '', 51356, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve seen goblins riding these things. I know they can go faster!', '', 51355, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek the Cloudchasers upon the lower rise. They should be able to help you in all matters of jewelcrafting.', 'Seek the Cloudchasers upon the lower rise. They should be able to help you in all matters of jewelcrafting.', 51354, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be looking for Palehoof, who keeps our elevators and windmills in good working order. Find him upon the lower rise.', 'You must be looking for Palehoof, who keeps our elevators and windmills in good working order. Find him upon the lower rise.', 51353, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who summons Millagazor?', '', 51352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You pests are not worth my time!', '', 51351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Millagazor begins to escape!', '', 51350, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A pair of skilled miners fled plague-ridden Gilneas and made their way here. You\'ll find them in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 'A pair of skilled miners fled plague-ridden Gilneas and made their way here. You\'ll find them in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 51349, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mining', 'Mining', 51348, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineering', 'Engineering', 51347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blacksmithing', 'Blacksmithing', 51346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you seek the Silverdews in the Craftmen\'s Terrace. They\'ve only recently set up shop, near the enchanter\'s.', 'Ah, you seek the Silverdews in the Craftmen\'s Terrace. They\'ve only recently set up shop, near the enchanter\'s.', 51345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least one Gilnean engineer works out of the Craftsmen\'s Terrace. She should be able to help you.', 'At least one Gilnean engineer works out of the Craftsmen\'s Terrace. She should be able to help you.', 51344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cub sniffs your hand and decides you\'re not a threat... this time.', '', 51343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your little cub nips and paws at the air, eager to try out his hunting skills.', '', 51342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A blacksmith and his assistant can be found working in the Warrior\'s Terrace, near the armor and weapon vendors there.', 'A blacksmith and his assistant can be found working in the Warrior\'s Terrace, near the armor and weapon vendors there.', 51341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cub nuzzles your hand and purrs.', '', 51340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cub bats one paw at a tiny insect, only taking note of your attention when the plaything flies away.', '', 51339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you the mortal on which so much depends?', '', 51338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal warlock.', 'The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal warlock.', 51337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal shaman.', 'The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal shaman.', 51336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal priest.', 'The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal priest.', 51335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal mage.', 'The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal mage.', 51334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal druid.', 'The fate of Azeroth hinges on the deeds of a mortal druid.', 51333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While the details remain shrouded from our view, one thing we have gleaned...', '', 51332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth will burn!', '', 51331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the unavoidable outcome is plain:', '', 51330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A recent event, obscured by powerful magics, remains masked even to me...', '', 51329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When disruptions are detected by our watchers, we are charged with their repair.', '', 51328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As the wardens of time, we of the bronze dragonflight observe their infinite combinations.', '', 51327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countless threads are woven to create the fabric of our timeline.', '', 51326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen well, mortal.', '', 51325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, my stomach... That food really was awful.', 'Oh, my stomach... That food really was awful.', 51324, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had just about given up hope.', 'I had just about given up hope.', 51323, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The food, there is something wrong with the food!', 'The food, there is something wrong with the food!', 51322, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were just trying to eat and suddenly zombies started to appear!', 'We were just trying to eat and suddenly zombies started to appear!', 51321, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zombies... They are everywhere!', 'Zombies... They are everywhere!', 51320, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... What is going on?  The last thing I remember was sitting down to eat...', 'Wha... What is going on?  The last thing I remember was sitting down to eat...', 51319, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life!', 'You saved my life!', 51318, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help.', 'Thank you for your help.', 51317, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go to inner ring of War Quarter.  You find jewel-making people there.', 'Go to inner ring of War Quarter.  You find jewel-making people there.', 51316, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find a jewelcrafting trainer and supplies on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 'You\'ll find a jewelcrafting trainer and supplies on the inner ring of the War Quarter.', 51315, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye want Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting, over on the northern side of The Great Forge.', 'Ye want Deepmountain Mining and Jewelcrafting, over on the northern side of The Great Forge.', 51314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You overstepped your bounds, Jin\'do. You toy with powers that are beyond you. Have you forgotten who I am? Have you forgotten what I can do?!', '', 51313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24244, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eject! Eject! Auuuuugghhh!', '', 51312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the biggest sword ever!', 'This is the biggest sword ever!', 51311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at me, I\'m Uther Lightbringer!', 'Look at me, I\'m Uther Lightbringer!', 51310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 51309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t catch me!', 'You can\'t catch me!', 51308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BI see you have had a chance to help out here at the Crossroads. Carry on for the Horde!', '', 51307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aww Ruby, you\'re the best pet ever!', 51306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Anachronos. I am ready to witness your vision of the future.', 'Yes, Anachronos. I am ready to witness your vision of the future.', 51305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the best!', 'This is the best!', 51304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! Let me go!', '', 51303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me the sugar!', '', 51302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have some Candy Coins I would like to exchange.', 'I have some Candy Coins I would like to exchange.', 51301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nagala will have her famous grilled zhevra chops waiting for us, no doubt. She says I need to cut back and eat more vegetables, but I don\'t think I\'ve gained that much weight...do you?', '', 51300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BOOO!  Did I scare you?$b$bHallow\'s End is all about two things, tricks and treats!  Some adults think it\'s more.  They tried to tell me, but I got bored, until things got set on fire.  That was cool!$b$bBut still, even fire can get boring.  I can tell you what doesn\'t get boring... Tricking people and eating candy!$b$bBut I only want one kind of candy, Candy Coins!  They are the best.  They look like real gold coins!  Also, if you have too many coins, you can eat them!  It\'s like being rich and eating your money!  It\'s crazy!$b$bSo... Do you have some coins you want to trade?', 'BOOO!  Did I scare you?$b$bHallow\'s End is all about two things, tricks and treats!  Some adults think it\'s more.  They tried to tell me, but I got bored, until things got set on fire.  That was cool!$b$bBut still, even fire can get boring.  I can tell you what doesn\'t get boring... Tricking people and eating candy!$b$bBut I only want one kind of candy, Candy Coins!  They are the best.  They look like real gold coins!  Also, if you have too many coins, you can eat them!  It\'s like being rich and eating your money!  It\'s crazy!$b$bSo... Do you have some coins you want to trade?', 51299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, a surprise! I love surprises!', 'Wow, a surprise! I love surprises!', 51298, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Children, $n has brought a gift for you! Why don\'t you come take a look?', 51297, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me see what you have for sale.', 'Let me see what you have for sale.', 51295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the object.', 'Examine the object.', 51294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the object.', '', 51293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be at ease, mortal. Our time together here must be productive, and unclouded by tension.$b$bMuch depends on your ability to think clearly and reason well.', '', 51292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This artifact has been cursed by the troll witch doctors!  At your touch, it begins to emit a foul glow.', '', 51291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Examine the object.', '', 51290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is something odd about this particular object...', '', 51289, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And when the soap\'s gone, you\'d have a new fork!', '', 51288, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What about... putting soap on a fork? Then it would have a handle and everything!', '', 51287, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When I grow up, I want to put strange things together too!', '', 51286, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, I never knew mages could make ice cream. That was good!', '', 51285, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yay! That was amazing!', 51284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re a smart girl, aren\'t you?', 51283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That\'s a good widdle waptor!', 51282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good girl, Ruby!', 51281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ruby, dance.', 51280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ruby, walk backwards.', 51279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ruby, jump.', 51278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ruby, speak.', 51277, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
