('I\'m going to take you down to pain town.', '', 51117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They used to call me Tony THREE-Tusk.', '', 51116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got a proposition for you: You die now.', '', 51115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not used to fighting with other people.', '', 51114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, boy! I\'m so hungry, I could eat a fire elemental!', '', 51113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excuuuse me, princess!', '', 51112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was fun! Can I keep the kite, please?', '', 51111, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be proud, dragon. Today you fall to the blade of Azeroth\'s greatest hero. And also to my blade.', '', 51110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be slain by me, villainous cretin!', '', 51109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
