('MRRRFFFFMMMMRRR!', '', 51083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bonk! Yes sir!', '', 51082, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weee!', '', 51081, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m fiiiighting!', '', 51080, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! I was expecting a challenge.', '', 51079, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Light be purged!', '', 51078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only Gidwin were here... he\'d love to see this.', '', 51077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did somebody say Grapplehammer? No? Oh well, here I am.', '', 51076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calder Gray, reporting for mayhem... er, duty.', '', 51075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wait a minute... where am I? WHEN am I? Are we in Hyjal?', 51074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fire elementals must die!', '', 51073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Congratulations. Today you will have the honor of fighting alongside me.', '', 51072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me at \'em! I\'ll blast \'em off the side o\' the mountain!', '', 51071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Reporting for duty, commander.', 51070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Da Darkspear fight alongside ya.', 51069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lunk here to help.', '', 51068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I prefer my fish boiled AFTER they\'ve been caught. Let\'s put out these fires.', '', 51067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard Azeroth needed saving. May I lend a hand?', '', 51066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The druids of DEHTA support your efforts here in Hyjal.', '', 51065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Earthen Ring stands behind you.', 51064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Light be with you.', 51063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here come Zen\'Kiki!', '', 51062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the slaughter begin.', '', 51061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello.', '', 51060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My talons will slice you to shreds, invader.', 51059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar, hero. Today I fight with you.', '', 51058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what kind of trouble we can get into today.', '', 51057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my sword.', '', 51056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What ho, fellow knights! Are we fully barded and armored? Then let us thrust ourselves deeply into that which they call adventure!', '', 51055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy there, captain.', '', 51054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did somebody call for a paladin?', '', 51053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Two knives and a goblin. What more could you ask for?', 51052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear not. Johnny Awesome fights by your side.', '', 51051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is gonna be a bloodbath. A bloodbath... of flames!', '', 51050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Senior Initiate Goldmine, reporting for duty!', '', 51049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heeeeere\'s... Theldurin!', '', 51048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mrfmmmm... mrrr.', '', 51047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahoy!', '', 51046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade stands behind you.', '', 51045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rexxar\'s ally! Murderer!', 51044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our matron craves the taste of your blood!', 51043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You will pay for my sister\'s death!', 51042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Serena Bloodfeather will rip out your eyes and feast upon your heart!', 51041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to your kind!', 51040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm...  The beast looks smaller than I would have thought.', '', 51039, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what we got here...', '', 51038, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The large cat doesn\'t seem quite as big as the hunter lead you to believe.', 'The large cat doesn\'t seem quite as big as the hunter lead you to believe.', 51037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inspect the body.', 'Inspect the body.', 51036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t stop it. We\'re in for a crash landing!', '', 51035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('High Priest Venoxis is exhausted!', '', 51034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_creature_poison_06.blp:20|t High Priest Venoxis begins casting |cFFFF0000|Hspell:96637|h[Bloodvenom]|h|r!', '', 51033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The mists around the Altar of Hethiss dissipate as Venoxis prepares a powerful spell!', '', 51032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well here we are, back at the Crossroads, safe and sound.', '', 51031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no, Sputtervalve is going to kill me! Sigh...You\'d better find your own transportation from here. I have to pick up the pieces and start the long walk back to camp...', '', 51030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing\'s working!', '', 51029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe if I press this green button. No, what about this blue one? Hold on, let me try resplicing some wires. Ow!', '', 51028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auuugh! Looks like we\'re taking an unexpected detour! Hold on tight!', '', 51027, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, no, no...this can\'t be happening. This wasn\'t part of the travel plan!', '', 51026, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! What\'s going on?', '', 51025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? Hold on, the engine stalled...', '', 51024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dream is to be as brilliant as Sputtervalve someday. You should see his design for a two-wheeled tricycle!', '', 51023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait until the guys back home find out about this! This is soooo totally geared out!', '', 51022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man, oh man...Just look at that amazing view! Are those LIONS? Oops, almost let go of the steering wheel there.', '', 51021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, wow, wow! I can\'t believe Sputtervalve actually let me drive this baby! Have I mentioned this is my first time flying? Don\'t worry though. I have everything under control.', '', 51020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meeeee sooooorrryyyy....', '', 51019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huuuuuuuunnnnnngggrryyyy!', '', 51018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day! Need some screws tightened or some bolts loosened? You\'ve come to the right place.', '', 51017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, little one, it\'s nothing like that. My spirit spent many years in the Emerald Dream while my body slept, and it started to take on attributes of our animal forms.', '', 51016, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wheeee! I\'m a bird-boy!', '', 51015, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Emerald Dream doesn\'t sound like a place for me. What if it turns me into a turtle? I\'ve always wanted wings, though...', '', 51014, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see what you\'re doing. You\'re gonna take all the druid forms and make them into one super-form!', '', 51013, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our orphan matron says druids can turn into birds, cats, and bears, but you look like a combination of all of them!', '', 51012, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, you sure don\'t look like any night elf I\'ve seen before!', '', 51011, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a worgen druid by the name of Dareth just outside the city gates; he might be able to help you.$B$BBig beast of a fellow, covered in white leather and furs. You can\'t miss him.', 'There\'s a worgen druid by the name of Dareth just outside the city gates; he might be able to help you.$B$BBig beast of a fellow, covered in white leather and furs. You can\'t miss him.', 51010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you seek training in the Old Ways, I cannot help you.', 'If you seek training in the Old Ways, I cannot help you.', 51009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.', 51008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s got me!', '', 51007, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, lad.', '', 51006, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This was my fault, my lord. I should\'ve done more research on those tablets...', '', 51005, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'ve spotted us! Defend the caravan!', '', 51004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m really sorry you lost your king. But in a way, it\'s like he\'s with you forever!', '', 51003, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, I don\'t think that was such a good idea...', '', 51002, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, lad. He tried to use an old titan ritual to keep his people safe, but this is what it did to him.', '', 51001, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks just like the paintings of King Magni too! Did he really do this to himself?', '', 51000, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This has to be the biggest diamond ever!', '', 50999, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_heroicleap.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:96740|h[Devastating Slam]|h|r!', '', 50998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a pair of tauren visiting the city. I\'m told they\'ve come from Mulgore to learn more about the Forsaken \"condition,\" or something to that effect.$B$BSeek them out near the herbalist by the Apothecarium.', 'There is a pair of tauren visiting the city. I\'m told they\'ve come from Mulgore to learn more about the Forsaken \"condition,\" or something to that effect.$B$BSeek them out near the herbalist by the Apothecarium.', 50997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to ride.', 'I\'m ready to ride.', 50996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'All the supplies flowing north to Ashenvale stop here to rest and re-fuel. It\'s important to keep our operations running smoothly.', 50995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What!? The Burning Blade kidnapped my brother?', 50994, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re planning to sacrifice me! Their demons are already licking their chops over my corpse.$B$B<Balgor shudders.>$B$BMakes me think twice about my own diet.$B$B Anyway, they\'ve got a guard watching my every move. I can get myself out of here, but I need a good distraction.', '', 50993, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought the Park fell into a big hole, but this one\'s way bigger and it has a whirlwind!', '', 50992, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shaman...? A troll mystic of some sort has come to the city recently to visit Harene upon the Walk of Elders. She might be able to help you.', 'Shaman...? A troll mystic of some sort has come to the city recently to visit Harene upon the Walk of Elders. She might be able to help you.', 50991, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go an\' get dem, Ohgan! We WON\'T be fooled again!', '', 50990, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24298, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We reclaiming our land, Gurubashi land.  An\' we gonna kill anyone dat get in our way.', '', 50989, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will reclaim thisss land. Gurubashi land.  An\' we kill anyone dat getssss in our way!', '', 50988, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 24328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My ssssserpents, dey already ssssslither beneath every rock an\' shrub of Ssssstranglethorn.', '', 50987, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 24327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disssssturb the plans of Gurubashi, little one.  It\'sss too late for you.  Too late for all of you!', '', 50986, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 24326, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was great! Let\'s do it again!', '', 50985, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa! Did you see how high we went?', '', 50984, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My tummy doesn\'t feel so good...', '', 50983, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is about to blast you with lightning! Get away!', '%s is about to blast you with lightning! Get away!', 50982, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeew, it\'s on my head! Help!', '', 50981, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at all that slime. One is flying straight at me!', '', 50980, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That looks fun! I wanna drive, but the orphan matron says I can\'t get a mount \'til I\'m older.', '', 50979, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve never seen a flying tree before. Let\'s get closer!', '', 50978, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look, someone\'s attacking Sentinel Hill. C\'mon guards, you just hafta win!', '', 50977, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Burning Blade sends its greetings.', '', 50976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The fat one! He\'ll make for a nice sacrifice.', 50975, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, have a taste of Jin\'do\'s true powah!', '', 50974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bwemba be watchin\' you, young one.', 50973, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack the nightmare illusions and defend your sleeping allies!', 'Attack the nightmare illusions and defend your sleeping allies!', 50972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Balgor! No!', 50971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Which one should I take?', '', 50970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve grown a few inches around the waist, little brother! Come down here and give your sister a hug!', 50969, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ho, Nagala! How about some lunch for your starving brother?', '', 50968, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Arcane Guardian gestures towards the city\'s center.>', '', 50967, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving my life.', 'Thank you for saving my life.', 50966, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had just about given up hope.', 'I had just about given up hope.', 50965, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die in this awful jungle.', 'I thought I was going to die in this awful jungle.', 50964, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The serpents overwhelmed us.', 'The serpents overwhelmed us.', 50963, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The serpents, they are everywhere!', 'The serpents, they are everywhere!', 50962, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another troll?  At least you aren\'t a serpent...', 'Another troll?  At least you aren\'t a serpent...', 50961, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You saved my life!', 'You saved my life!', 50960, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Class trainers may be found in the various ground-floor wings of the Terrace of Light\'s central structure.$B$BAldor, Scryer or otherwise, someone will be able to help you.', 'Class trainers may be found in the various ground-floor wings of the Terrace of Light\'s central structure.$B$BAldor, Scryer or otherwise, someone will be able to help you.', 50959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for your help.', 'Thank you for your help.', 50958, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may find Shattrath\'s guild master - as well as guild and tabard vendors - within the Terrace of Light\'s central structure, in the middle of the city.', 'You may find Shattrath\'s guild master - as well as guild and tabard vendors - within the Terrace of Light\'s central structure, in the middle of the city.', 50957, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guild Services', 'Guild Services', 50956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quickly now! Grab one of them while I take the supply cart!', 50955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re here. Just wait a moment while we load up---HEY! What\'s happening!?', '', 50954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My path is a dark and cursed one, $c. You do not wish to walk with me.', 'My path is a dark and cursed one, $c. You do not wish to walk with me.', 50953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You seek power, yes? But will you walk the cursed path I do for it?', 'You seek power, yes? But will you walk the cursed path I do for it?', 50952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need your help to remove the poison from these adventurers.', 'I need your help to remove the poison from these adventurers.', 50951, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yesss...ssssuccumb to the venom...', '', 50950, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can Bwemba aid ya?', 50949, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you don\'t mind, but we\'ll stop at Dreadmist Camp to pick up additional supplies and fresh mounts for the last leg of the journey.', '', 50945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our enemies wouldn\'t dare attack us this close to the Crossroads. It\'s further out that we\'ll have to watch our backs.', '', 50944, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How are you doing back there? Not too bumpy I hope.', '', 50943, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everybody on board! This caravan\'s leaving for the Mor\'shan Rampart!', '', 50942, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, glad to see you\'re still in one piece! I saw a rocket fly by earlier and heard your voice screaming, so I was a bit worried.$B$BWe have one last shipment to take care of. Talk to me when you\'re ready and we\'ll get going.', '', 50941, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 50940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have you done? I can\'t... control... RRAAAARRRGHHH!', 50939, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Haaa ha ha haa!  Now, heathens... face the TRUE might of Bethekk!', 50938, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 24287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You disssssturb the plans of Gurubashi, little one.  It\'sss too late for you.  Too late for all of you!', '', 50937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, this sure goes fast!', '', 50936, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Send me back to Nozzlepot\'s Outpost.', 'Send me back to Nozzlepot\'s Outpost.', 50935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you see that? Someone just fell out of the sky!', 50934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did Brak say this teleporter thing was tested? Well, if you\'re ready to go back to Nozzlepot\'s Outpost, just say the word! I hope you get there in one piece.', 50933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These tracks are fresh, and they lead down into the water...', '', 50931, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This trail is bloody. You follow it to a nearby bush, where you find the remains of the creature\'s last meal.', '', 50930, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mixed in with the mud are traces of oily sludge from the nearby rig.', '', 50929, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The tracks are smeared, almost as if the creature drags its feet.', '', 50928, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grass, sand, and sludge mix together to form the vague resemblance of a footprint.', '', 50927, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ain\'t NO ONE gonna stop Jin\'do!', '', 50925, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24256, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NOOOO!!!', '', 50924, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to de great show, friends. Just wait \'til ya see what I got in store for ya.', '', 50923, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 24254, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will drive your foul stench from the forest, monster!', 50921, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Abbendis will return, and I will be waiting for her!  SHE WILL COME BACK FOR US!', 'Abbendis will return, and I will be waiting for her!  SHE WILL COME BACK FOR US!', 50920, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I judge you...DELICIOUS!', '', 50919, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t eaten in weeks; this bread is mine!  FOR THE SANDWICH!', '', 50918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally out from under the boot of that she-witch Abbendis, and free to pursue my own interests: BLOOD, BLOOD, AND MORE BLOOD!', 'Finally out from under the boot of that she-witch Abbendis, and free to pursue my own interests: BLOOD, BLOOD, AND MORE BLOOD!', 50917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This teleporter will transport you to the irradiated ruins of Gnomeregan, deep beneath Dun Morogh.$B$BDon\'t worry, there\'s another one there that\'ll send you back here... well, if it doesn\'t turn you inside-out or transmogrify your organs into unstable organic explosives, that is!$B$BWell? What are you waiting for? Hop on in!', '', 50916, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This teleporter will transport you to Grom\'gol in Northern Stranglethorn.$B$BUsually.$B$BI mean, sometimes it\'ll just disintegrate you, or reduce all your soft tissues into a greenish, foul-smelling mist, but mostly it\'s safe!$B$B...mostly.', '', 50915, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If\'n I\'m gonna be Scourge anyway, I might as well be drunk!', '', 50914, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But though I feel the plague within, my hopes \'ave not yet sunk.', '', 50913, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' surrounded by the Lich King\'s beasts, what could old Duggan do?', '', 50912, 0, 0, 430, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But tha\' mead was cursed with th\' plague o\' death, and now old Duggan, too.', '', 50911, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A hundred crates of barley there ta\' be makin\' inta\' mead!', '', 50910, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An\' when he did arrive there, what\'d his dwarf eyes see?', '', 50909, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where th\' scent of death is on th\' wind and everythin\' is mostly brown.', '', 50908, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To the plaguelands went old Duggan, ta\' send them Scourge back inta\' th\' groun\'.', '', 50907, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ooooooooh...', '', 50906, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah ken see very well through this haze, but I\'d know tha\' smell anywhere!  Die ye foul ogre!', '', 50905, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer will rise again! The very earth beneath your feet will be swallowed by the fury of our resurgence!', '', 50904, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you go get me a drink? I\'d do it myself, but I\'m working on my tan.', 'Could you go get me a drink? I\'d do it myself, but I\'m working on my tan.', 50903, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen the outrageous prices here?', 'Have you seen the outrageous prices here?', 50902, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have what it takes to stay in my kitchen?', '', 50901, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Plot revenue minus supply expenditures against the elasticity of demand, considering assets and liabilities inflected across the regression quotient....oh hi! How are you?', 50900, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn...my corpse...do not let me join them...', '', 50899, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You choose my corpse over another ally against the undead?  So be it.', '', 50898, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'re looking for a place to rest, I can help.', 'If you\'re looking for a place to rest, I can help.', 50897, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, hapless adventurer.  I ask only that you wait a moment...and BLEED!', '', 50896, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory in Tol Barad is ours! While the Alliance offensive is crippled, we need your immediate efforts to gather resources and secure the island!', '', 50895, 0, 923, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory in Tol Barad is ours! While the Horde offensive is crippled, we need your immediate efforts to gather resources and secure the island!', '', 50894, 0, 924, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I intend to fight the Soulflayer, but I have no way of summoning him.  Can you assist me?', 'I intend to fight the Soulflayer, but I have no way of summoning him.  Can you assist me?', 50893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, my name is Kevin, do you want to play a movie ?', 'Hi, my name is Kevin, do you want to play a movie ?', 50892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The darkness is closing in!  I will not go without a fight, monster!', 50890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Tol Barad will begin in 1 minute!', '', 50889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Battle for Tol Barad will begin in 2 minutes!', '', 50888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Preparations for Tol Barad will begin in 5 minutes!', '', 50887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seek other veterans of the campaign here in Northrend. We are urgently needed to face new foes at home.', '', 50886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We barely made it out alive. You\'d better run and tell Lasha what you\'ve seen. We\'ve got a serious problem to deal with!', '', 50885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no! They\'ve spotted us! Hang on -- I\'ll get us out of here!', '', 50884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The...they\'re agents of the Twilight\'s Hammer! Is that...the Assistant Resort Director with them?', '', 50883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, do you see that light up there? What\'s going on?', '', 50882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you tried any of Chef Tramsay\'s dishes yet? I really enjoyed his Moth Soup. Delicious!', '', 50881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoying your stay? One dip in the steam pools and you come out looking 10 years younger. Just look at me if you want proof!', '', 50880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woooweeee! Look at her run! Just relax and enjoy the view. I\'ll have us across the lake in no time.', '', 50879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s fills the area with a |cFF33FF00toxic gas|r!', '%s fills the area with a |cFF33FF00toxic gas|r!', 50878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to resurrect a swarm of |cFFCC0000Zanzili Zombies|r!', '%s begins to resurrect a swarm of |cFFCC0000Zanzili Zombies|r!', 50877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to resurrect a |cFF3366CCZanzili Berserker|r!', '%s begins to resurrect a |cFF3366CCZanzili Berserker|r!', 50876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_cyclone.blp:20|t%s begins to cast|cFFFF9A20|Hspell:86193|h [Wind Blast]!|r', '', 50875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve impressed me so far, $n. How do you feel about helping me in creating the ultimate dish?', '', 50874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nightmare spiders appear in the darkness!  Kill Helix before his nightmare overwhelms you!', '', 50871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You nincompoops! This place deserves to burn.', '', 50870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe someone should go fetch some water. A person with a brain would have done that already!', '', 50869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Idiots! Dolts! Morons! Imbeciles! Fools! Dimwits! Ignoramuses! Shall I go on?', '', 50868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feckless cowards, the lot of you! Maybe if you\'d show some backbone, I would actually pay your wages!', '', 50867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit running and DO SOMETHING!', '', 50866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You there! Hiding like a coward when you should be fighting these devils?', '', 50865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cowards!  I will not fall so easily into your trap!', '', 50864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ozumat is vulnerable, strike now!', 'Ozumat is vulnerable, strike now!', 50863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not allowed here!', 'You not allowed here!', 50862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You break and enter?! Me break YOU!', 'You break and enter?! Me break YOU!', 50861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no belong here!', 'You no belong here!', 50860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our brothers at Baradin Hold on Tol Barad are very busy and not always available when you need them.  I have been stationed here around the clock to help you with tasks they might have given you.', 'Our brothers at Baradin Hold on Tol Barad are very busy and not always available when you need them.  I have been stationed here around the clock to help you with tasks they might have given you.', 50858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shale Spider', 'Shale Spider', 50857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Monkey', 'Monkey', 50856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fox', 'Fox', 50855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dog', 'Dog', 50854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beetle', 'Beetle', 50853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hostile forces detected.  Defense mode activated.', '', 50852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Multiple vapors appear from the fog!  Kill Admiral Ripsnarl before you are overwhelmed!', '', 50851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A treasure hunter\'s life is a treacherous one. Don\'t be foolin\' yerself.', '', 50850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
