('One of those blasted Jaedenar demons saw me! Gave me a good slash in the side. The wound isn\'t pretty, but I\'ll live.$B$BThere are more urgent matters at hand, like stopping the Shadow Council from launching a full-scale attack on our friends at Wildheart Point. I\'m in no shape to fight, so you\'ll have to go in my place.', '', 50764, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
