('Let this wickerman embody any unrest within us.', '', 50754, 7, 0, 397, 64, 0, 25181, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New struggles await us with each dawn, and uncertainty weighs upon us all.', '', 50753, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25179, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
