('As you know, Hallow\'s End is a celebration of transition... of change.', '', 50750, 7, 0, 396, 64, 0, 25173, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sons and daughters of Gilneas! Friends and allies old and new! Please, come close!', '', 50749, 7, 0, 22, 64, 0, 25172, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
