('Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 'Well met, $c.  My advice to you is this: As you travel the world, be wary of magic for it will burn the untrained.', 50652, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
