('', 'When we returned from Deepholm, we found that the Twilight\'s Hammer had established a base here and taken control of the elemental portals.$B$BPlease, $n, you must stop them before Cho\'gall can complete whatever it is that he\'s up to inside the Bastion of Twilight!', 50650, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take curse away!', '', 50649, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
