('I need a new GS-9x Multibot.', 'I need a new GS-9x Multibot.', 50617, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen my latest invention? It\'s going to be a hit... if it doesn\'t explode.', '', 50616, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toughen up, lad.  I raised you better than that.  Stiff upper lip!', '', 50615, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father... why must we endure such hardship?  Why can\'t we live somewhere sunny and lush?  A tropical island perhaps?', '', 50614, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will return, dear friend.  We will come back, to take what belongs to us.  This I swear!', '', 50613, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crowley!  You\'ve done enough.  I cannot allow you to stay behind again...', '', 50612, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lead our people to their new home.', '', 50611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone must stay behind and keep the Forsaken from gaining a foothold.  Farewell, Genn.', '', 50610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Everybody onboard the ships now!', 50609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... I will stay with you, father.', 50608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds.', '', 50607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why do you flee, mortals? There is nowhere you can run or hide here!', '', 50606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Highborne, Irriende, inside of the inn, can train you in the ways of the arcane.', 'The Highborne, Irriende, inside of the inn, can train you in the ways of the arcane.', 50605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
