('Blown away!', '', 50603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As I am the strongest wind, it shall be I that tears the invaders apart!', '', 50602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
