('Ha! I expected a challenge!', '', 50393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fought without honor.', '', 50392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have many lessons to learn.', '', 50391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood... my axe.', '', 50390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', '', 50389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho\'gall will...rip you...to pieces...', 'Cho\'gall will...rip you...to pieces...', 50388, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is too powerful!  You must use the drums!', 'He is too powerful!  You must use the drums!', 50387, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot hold out against power of this magnitude!  You must use the horn!', 'We cannot hold out against power of this magnitude!  You must use the horn!', 50386, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skullcrusher the Mountain goes into a frenzy!', 'Skullcrusher the Mountain goes into a frenzy!', 50385, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am the favored of the master Cho\'gall.  I WILL NOT FALL TO YOU.', 'I am the favored of the master Cho\'gall.  I WILL NOT FALL TO YOU.', 50384, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fight without HONOR!', '', 50383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you.', 'My apologies, $c, but the arcane secrets of the Highborne will forever remain secrets to you.', 50382, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More blood! I want more blood!', '', 50381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You maggots brought this on yourselves.', '', 50380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you in hell.', '', 50379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killin\'s as easy as breathin\'.', '', 50378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damn these orcs.', '', 50377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nowhere for you to run. The disease is inside you.', '', 50376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!!!', '', 50375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no... I\'m not done with you.', '', 50374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want more? YOU WANT MORE?', '', 50373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAHHHHH!', '', 50372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay out of Redridge!', '', 50371, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KREEEEAAGH!', '', 50370, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare challenge me?', '', 50369, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok-Narash! To battle!', '', 50368, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shaman trainer?  Not here in Goldshire.$B$BBut there may be someone at the Training Hall in Stormwind City.', 'A shaman trainer?  Not here in Goldshire.$B$BBut there may be someone at the Training Hall in Stormwind City.', 50367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flames of Ragnaros will burn you all.', '', 50366, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'re the ones causing all that ruckus!', '', 50365, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragonmaw reinforcements have arrived!', 'Dragonmaw reinforcements have arrived!', 50364, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha... who... GET OUT OF MY DIGSITE!', '', 50363, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wildhammer reinforcements have arrived!', 'Wildhammer reinforcements have arrived!', 50362, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My kin won\'t forget what you\'ve done! We will rage, mortals!', '', 50361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zaela has fallen!  Revive her or we will meet our end on this forsaken altar!', 'Zaela has fallen!  Revive her or we will meet our end on this forsaken altar!', 50360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Online.', '', 50359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must tend to the wounded!  Quickly!', 'You must tend to the wounded!  Quickly!', 50358, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He is too powerful!  Use the altars to harness the powers of the elements and we may stand a chance!', 'He is too powerful!  Use the altars to harness the powers of the elements and we may stand a chance!', 50357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Active.', '', 50356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll rip out your eyeballs, weakling...', '', 50355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Benjamin Foxworthy and his pet, Sly, can be found just behind the smithy, here in Goldshire.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you.', 'Benjamin Foxworthy and his pet, Sly, can be found just behind the smithy, here in Goldshire.  Maybe you should go see if he could help you.', 50354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar ogar!', 'Lok\'tar ogar!', 50353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kurdran is down!  You\'ve got to get him back into the fight or we\'re done for!', 'Kurdran is down!  You\'ve got to get him back into the fight or we\'re done for!', 50352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man down!  We\'ve got a man down!  Get him back up as soon as you can!', 'Man down!  We\'ve got a man down!  Get him back up as soon as you can!', 50351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scourge will rise again, under a dark new master... Ix\'lar!', '', 50350, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s too powerful!  You\'ve got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!', 'He\'s too powerful!  You\'ve got to find a way to use those altars to give us an edge!', 50349, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade is not over! Undeath is merely a setback!', '', 50348, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Play the Dragonmaw drums to call for reinforcements!', 'Play the Dragonmaw drums to call for reinforcements!', 50347, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow into the Wildhammer horn to call for reinforcements!', 'Blow into the Wildhammer horn to call for reinforcements!', 50346, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your pain is my release.', '', 50345, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll fill your corpses with arrows!', '', 50344, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw drums fall from Zaela\'s unconscious body!', 'The Dragonmaw drums fall from Zaela\'s unconscious body!', 50343, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Druids?  I haven\'t seen any druids around here.  Although I am sure that in Stormwind you could find one.  You should ask a guard in Stormwind.', 'Druids?  I haven\'t seen any druids around here.  Although I am sure that in Stormwind you could find one.  You should ask a guard in Stormwind.', 50342, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die!', '', 50341, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Wildhammer horn falls from Kurdran\'s unconscious body!', 'The Wildhammer horn falls from Kurdran\'s unconscious body!', 50340, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will kill you, or I will die trying.', 50339, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can\'t fight at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t', 'If you can\'t fight at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t', 50338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Wildhammer!', 'For the Wildhammer!', 50337, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MOLDFANG STRONG!', '', 50336, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You have already lost.', 50335, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Revive your fallen companion by right-clicking on their unconscious body!', 'Revive your fallen companion by right-clicking on their unconscious body!', 50334, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Activate the altars to gain the blessings of the elements, but avoid the deadly shadow altar!', 'Activate the altars to gain the blessings of the elements, but avoid the deadly shadow altar!', 50333, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll die in this cave!', 50332, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill the intruder!', '', 50331, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('By Kurzen\'s sword!', '', 50330, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t come in here!', '', 50329, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bartlett the Brave has set up gryphon roosts here in town.  If you\'re looking to take a ride, then talk to him.', 'Bartlett the Brave has set up gryphon roosts here in town.  If you\'re looking to take a ride, then talk to him.', 50328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention!', '', 50327, 7, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BLEEAAAGGHHH! I\'m a monster, don\'t look at me!', '', 50326, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look what they\'ve done to me!', 'Look what they\'ve done to me!', 50325, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll kill you!', 'I\'ll kill you!', 50324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repel the intruders!', '', 50323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why everyone else get so big?', '', 50322, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No make me small!', '', 50321, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who am I?', 'Who am I?', 50320, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you do to me?', '', 50319, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t... lift... tools...', '', 50318, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve succeeded in defending the bridge. The summon ritual has been completed.', '', 50317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The totem has finished taking its sample!', '', 50316, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The totem is halfway finished with taking its sample.', '', 50315, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The captain and his forces pushed forward to take one of the bases you scouted for him earlier. You should go and meet them.', 50314, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This was one of the royal cities of the elves in the days when Azshara was queen. In this city lie the keys to lore long lost and artifacts of unimaginable historical value. ', 50313, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Greetings, $c. We Wildhammer reward our friends.', '', 50312, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Eoin\'s mug to replenish your health!', 'Use Eoin\'s mug to replenish your health!', 50311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To success, then!', 50310, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He already knows it will be a smashing success!', '', 50309, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s roars wildly, initiating a massive stomp attack!', '', 50308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome back to Thundermar, $n. Fighting continues all across the shire, but with Alliance help I think we can gain the upper hand.', '', 50307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The good doctor is being modest. He knows precisely how much powder to put in the charge, down to the very grain.', '', 50306, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop it! You\'ll break his legs off!', '', 50305, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re breaking him!', '', 50304, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop twisting his legs, they aren\'t supposed to bend that way!', '', 50303, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re being mean!  I\'m telling Mommy!', '', 50302, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WAAAHHH!!!', '', 50301, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You better not break Jum-jump!  It\'s not fair!', '', 50300, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimmie back Jum-jump!', '', 50299, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No fair!  Gimme back my gorilla!!', '', 50298, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m hoping this is the breakthrough that will allow us to pack more explosive power into a smaller bomb.', '', 50297, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re nearing completion on the next batch of high-powered elementium explosives.', '', 50296, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So, doctor, how goes your research?', 50295, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Whoops!', 50294, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Baby wants his dolly!', 50293, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now who\'s the crybaby, crybaby!?', 50292, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you want him back you\'re gonna have to beg... like a monkey!!', 50291, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder how far the gears turn?', 50290, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have your gorilla! Nyah nyah!', 50289, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wonder if your Grindgear Gorilla can jump across the Park!', 50288, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ha ha! I have your Grindgear Gorilla!', 50287, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_prayerofshadowprotection.blp:20|t The Beast Unleashed begins to emit an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:93717|h[Aura of Darkness]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_prayerofshadowprotection.blp:20|t The Beast Unleashed begins to emit an |cFFFF0000|Hspell:93717|h[Aura of Darkness]|h|r!', 50286, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So let\'s make every explosion a quality asplosion!', '', 50285, 0, 0, 25, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The important thing to remember is that we\'re all here because of our love for explosions!', '', 50284, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It won\'t be easy. It\'s true that six out of every seven analysts won\'t live to see Demolitions Analyst II.', '', 50283, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As most of you know, we\'re about to begin another intensive round of demolitions testing.', '', 50282, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, not that! Look, I\'m quaking in my boots...', '', 50281, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Russell Brower begins to play a wedding hymn!  Stand near him to receive its regenerative effects!', 'Russell Brower begins to play a wedding hymn!  Stand near him to receive its regenerative effects!', 50280, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m the warden, and you know that! You\'d better not make any trouble, because I\'ll know the moment that you try anything...', '', 50279, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And who do you think you are? I\'ll use as large a weapon as I please!', '', 50278, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t think a weapon that big is legal in this town...', '', 50277, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_frostnova.blp:20|t The wedding party is afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91978|h[Cold Feet]|h|r!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_frost_frostnova.blp:20|t The wedding party is afflicted with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91978|h[Cold Feet]|h|r!', 50276, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'COWARD!', 50275, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The pitiful human escaped!', 50274, 0, 0, 397, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the cookie crumbles.', '', 50273, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess that\'s the way...', '', 50272, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Cenarion Circle been around a long time, mon. We trolls are newcomers to this party.', '', 50271, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think after doing such good work on Stormwind Harbor I\'d get a bit of slack from this dwarf...$B$BI just want to get this statue up the ramp and back in place as fast as possible.  But she\'s got a complaint every step of the way.  Her solution to every problem is to blow it up.  It feels like I\'m working with a gnome or a goblin.  But at least they\'d be sober.$B$BLook at our work crew, no discipline.  You know why?  Because she undermines me!$B$BA bad attitude, a lazy crew... This isn\'t going to be a quick fix at all.', '', 50270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'That statue\'s provin\' ta be quite the pain.  I thought we could lift it up an\' outta the water with a crane an\' some well timed explosives.  But Wick thought we\'d be safer an\' do less damage by rolling it up this ramp.$B$BNow look at it...  We\'ve got it angled all wrong.  An\' once we get it to the top, then what?$B$BI\'ve gotta bad feeling we\'re gonna to be here a long time.  A real long time...', 50269, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('', 'I get a lot of mail, $n. Most of it is junk, but some of them might be helpful to a helpful $c like you. Here\'s a couple letters sent to Everlook, looking for help in the far corners of the world.$b$bIt\'s almost as if you have a choice for where you go next!  Now, let\'s see...', 50268, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, $n! We meet once more. I helped you attain your swift flight form in Outland.$B$B<Morthis tightens his jaw and shakes his head, his withered eyes sad.>$B$BThese young druids today... they have it too easy.', '', 50267, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the Shrine of Aviana, $c. Here we sit atop the world and touch the sky.', '', 50266, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look into their eyes!  They\'re not the people you once knew!', 'Don\'t look into their eyes!  They\'re not the people you once knew!', 50265, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold them back!  We must protect the survivors!', 'Hold them back!  We must protect the survivors!', 50264, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re turning our people into MONSTERS!!', 'They\'re turning our people into MONSTERS!!', 50263, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, I\'m not gettin\' paid enough for this.', '', 50262, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love gettin\' paid for this.', '', 50261, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time for you to take a long nap in the sand....', '', 50260, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
