('There\'s nothing I hate more than mercenaries. They are without honor!', '', 50113, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Booster rockets for cages. What will I think of next? I am a genius!', '', 50112, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deliver the footbomb uniform to the Slave Pits. Hurry, $n!', 50111, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need oil and lots of it if we\'re going to get your footbomb uniform running, kid!', '', 50110, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s time for a little sabotage!', 50109, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!', '', 50108, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You cannot let him walk all over you like that! Go get his heart, girl!', 50107, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna make you the ultimate footbomb uniform, kid. But first, we need parts. Lots of them.', '', 50106, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get rid of those Steamwheedle Sharks before they trounce us!', 50105, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hold on!', 50104, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, we need to escape through the northern tunnel!', 50103, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve got to get our people out of here, $n! The key is to get them to drink plenty of Kaja\'Cola Zero-One!', 50102, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor.', 50101, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Run, Bastia! Get $n to Sky Falls and the labor mine.', '', 50100, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Better hurry up, $n. I think that Thrall has news on where our people are being held.', 50099, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is no use.  My magic is ineffective on these creatures.', 50098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I forget... did you take flying lessons back on Kezan?', 50097, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You honor us with your actions on behalf of our dead, $n.', 50096, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goblin grenades versus gnomish land mines. Show them who\'s better, $n!', 50095, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deliver justice for our dead, $n.', 50094, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I specialize in two things: taking tiny things and making them blow up into huge things, and making huge things fit into itty-bitty places.$b$bWhich one do you need today?', '', 50093, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But once ol\' $p here blasts through their bulkhead in a hail of splintered wood, blood, and phlegm then starts crawlin\' across the deck with both legs broken, oh aye, they\'ll not see THAT comin\' by a sweet mile, no sir!', '', 50092, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flintlocke, if we have a big giant cannon, why don\'t we just shoot ... a cannonball?', '', 50091, 0, 0, 6, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t take this away from me!  Not now, not ever!', '', 50090, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All those dragon essences I\'ve collected... the power... is exhilarating!', '', 50089, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $n.', 50088, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I\'m fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting.', '', 50087, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take your time, my $g boy : girl;. Now what can I modify this shredder boot to be? Hmm.', '', 50086, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, like you coulda done any better.', '', 50085, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That Schnottz is a madman! I ain\'t never goin\' back!', '', 50084, 0, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re going to love this!', '', 50083, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Look for the mounds of glowing stuff on the ground.', 50082, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, look for the pygmy leaders: Gaahl, Malmo, and Teloch.', '', 50081, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You should paint me sometime, Sudsy.', 50080, 1, 0, 17, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve never seen something so beautiful in all my life!', 50079, 1, 0, 24, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The colors are so vivid!', 50078, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Absolutely stunning!', 50077, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s beautiful!', 50076, 1, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s looks just like it!', 50075, 1, 0, 21, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sooo lifelike!', 50074, 1, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s amazing!', 50073, 1, 0, 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get in there and show those zombies what the Bilgewater Buccaneers are made of, kid!', '', 50072, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies, please.  The boar will live on in my art.  Please don\'t shed another tear, unless it is because my art moves you so.', '', 50071, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well that\'s one way to voice your opinion.', '', 50070, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'ll be okay ladies.  Just look at my painting and remember better days.  Or you can just look at me and imagine a better future.', '', 50069, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies, ladies... It\'s going to be alright.  I\'ve already captured the creature\'s essence in my painting.', '', 50068, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to see how long I can last against the waves of undead.', 'I want to see how long I can last against the waves of undead.', 50067, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you are a genius, you have to put up with a lot of strange actions.', '', 50066, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone\'s a critic, ladies.', '', 50065, 1, 0, 396, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve come too far to be chased off by a few undead bullies.', 'I\'ve come too far to be chased off by a few undead bullies.', 50064, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is offline.', '', 50063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is online.$B$BInsert coins for further instructional training.', '', 50062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 destroy!$B$BInsert coins for further instructional training.', '', 50061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warrior-Matic NX-01 is offline.', '', 50060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you sneak up on zombies? Don\'t they smell your brains when you get close?$B$BHalf the people around here have nothing to worry about then.', 50059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you sneak up on zombies? Don\'t they smell your brains when you get close?$B$BHalf the people around here have nothing to worry about then.$B$BNeed any training, $n?', 50058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll find Ergll to the northeast. This should help you get across the bay more quickly.', '', 50057, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deploying an urban setting in the middle of the wild. I love it!', 50056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deploying an urban setting in the middle of the wild. I love it!$B$BNeed any training, $n?', 50055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zombies, goblin or not, are an abomination in the eyes of the Light. Besides, there\'s no profit in them.$B$BNot yet anyway.', 50054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zombies, goblin or not, are an abomination in the eyes of the Light. Besides, there\'s no profit in them.$B$BNot yet anyway.$B$BNeed any training, $n?', 50053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How much did you charge to deploy this place?', 50052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How much did you charge to deploy this place?$B$BWant to spend some of that moolah on training?', 50051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was a time when I could ask whatever I wished from those who sought out my master.  But now, he takes pretty much anyone in as an apprentice and they can pass through his portals all they please.$B$BIt is upsetting to me, but I do not question his orders.  I can only take enjoyment in making fun of the ridiculous clothes you wear or the pathetic look on your face.  Even that bores me...$B$BEven this rambling bores me!  Go. Be gone. Share your depressing sense of style with someone else.', '', 50050, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You gotta do something about these pygmies, $n!', 50049, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Great work getting this place going, $n!', 50048, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin zombies? Goblin zombies! Wreck those pygmies, $n!', '', 50047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Goblin zombies? Goblin zombies! Wreck those pygmies, $n!$B$BNeed any training before you go?', '', 50046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The flag is a nice touch.  I bet a few more accessories will really make this rocket stand out.', '', 50045, 1, 0, 273, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This probably isn\'t a smooth ride, but I bet I\'d look smooth in this ride.', '', 50044, 1, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bet this baby has got some real orcpower inside.', '', 50043, 1, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boy I wish I had a ride like this!', '', 50042, 1, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... interesting choice of parts.', '', 50041, 1, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s some nice work there!', '', 50040, 1, 0, 432, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?', '', 50039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Town-In-A-Box. Are we not the greatest tinkers in the world?$B$BNeed any training, my young protege?', '', 50038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keeping the fusion core stable is taxing nearly all my computational powers.$B$BLet us hope that floating-point error got worked out during my last maintenance cycle.', '', 50037, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t touch those boots!  I\'m waiting for the authorities to show up and collect the evidence.', '', 50036, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to give this another try.', 'We need to give this another try.', 50035, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The last $c to use that machine got the boot... Or rather, the machine got their boots.', '', 50034, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you don\'t want first aid training?  If you use that machine, I may get a chance to practice my skills on you, $c.', '', 50033, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you smell the burning?  Do you see the shoes? Can you piece this puzzle together, $c?', '', 50032, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare they change our people into zombies and throw them at us!', '', 50031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare they change our people into zombies and throw them at us!$B$BNeed some training before you go up there and kick their butts?', '', 50030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are really going to risk life and limb on that busted up machine?  There are far more reputable trainers in Orgrimmar.', '', 50029, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That machine is a piece of junk.  But once you are done using it, come see me for your first aid needs, $c.', '', 50028, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, you don\'t want to end up like the last $r that used that machine.', '', 50027, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d watch my step around that machine, $c.', '', 50026, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!', '', 50025, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Town-In-A-Box. Nice!$B$BNeed any training, $n?', '', 50024, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those zombies are so slow. It\'s a turkey shoot out there!', '', 50023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those zombies are so slow. It\'s a turkey shoot out there!$B$BNeed any training before you head out?', '', 50022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work deploying the Town-In-A-Box, $n.', '', 50021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work deploying the Town-In-A-Box, $n.$B$BNeed any training?', '', 50020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite our losses here, the king will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated.', '', 50019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man, zombies?', '', 50018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In spite of our losses here, Hellscream will be pleased to know that the naga general was defeated.', '', 50017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh man, zombies?$B$BNeed some training?', '', 50016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you, $n? Need some training?', '', 50015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do for you, $n?', '', 50014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Those zombies are slow. You don\'t have to run right through them. Don\'t let them eat your brains, $n!', 50013, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whatever yeh do... Don\'t. Black. Out!', '', 50012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right then. I hate long plane rides. So I\'mma gonna kick in the after-market burners and ignite our entire fuel supply in one go.', '', 50011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy ... does it...', '', 50010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yep! Off we go.', '', 50009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Goblin zombies? The Town-In-A-Box has to be warned!', 50008, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, you gotta get in there and rescue our people!', 50007, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Press on, friend.$b$bI shall find my way out when strength returns to me.', '', 50006, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your ride\'s waitin\', buddy. Let\'s ditch this place!', 50005, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s clean this up and get these boys out. I\'ve got another operation waiting.', '', 50004, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love nothing more than to wring that witch\'s neck myself, but someone\'s got to keep these naga off of your back...$b$bDo not fail me, $n!', '', 50003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love nothing more than to take down Naz\'jar and her minions, but someone\'s got to cover your back...', '', 50002, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, try and be sensitive to an orc\'s condition.  I\'m having a rough couple of days, and I\'d prefer if you kept your comments to yourself.', '', 50001, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going in after Erunak. Follow me, $n!', '', 50000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, make sure not to walk into that smoker!  The last unfortunate $r to do that didn\'t survive the heat.$b$bThat poor, delicious $r.', '', 49999, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want take Dormus camels?  NO!  MY CAMELS!  DORMUS KILL YOU!!!', '', 49998, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The harbinger has come. The world heaves.', 'The harbinger has come. The world heaves.', 49997, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shethnoth, ol\'goth, grell. Such is the mantra of those who come.', 'Shethnoth, ol\'goth, grell. Such is the mantra of those who come.', 49996, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My eyes are opened, yet they see only black.', 'My eyes are opened, yet they see only black.', 49995, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gillari, geth\'shar. Gillari, teko\'shar. It sees. It knows.', 'Gillari, geth\'shar. Gillari, teko\'shar. It sees. It knows.', 49994, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going in after Erunak. Follow me, $n!', '', 49993, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing, nothing, we are nothing. The grasper touches our hearts and clenches his fist.', 'Nothing, nothing, we are nothing. The grasper touches our hearts and clenches his fist.', 49992, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite... Don\'t make me look! I\'ve seen more than I can stand!', 'Fear broils forth from the heart of the infinite... Don\'t make me look! I\'ve seen more than I can stand!', 49991, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun eclipses. Darkness crawls through earth and ash. The seas are as blood...', 'The sun eclipses. Darkness crawls through earth and ash. The seas are as blood...', 49990, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The shadow sees. Bal\'qwari Og Shadar. The end comes!', 'The shadow sees. Bal\'qwari Og Shadar. The end comes!', 49989, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The SI:7 agent is unconscious.>', '', 49988, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! No! This lawn... was... mine...', 'What?! No! This lawn... was... mine...', 49987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough fooling around. It\'s time for some hands-on management!', 'Enough fooling around. It\'s time for some hands-on management!', 49986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay Warden Stillwater before you\'re overwhelmed!', 'Slay Warden Stillwater before you\'re overwhelmed!', 49985, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build some defenses before Warden Stillwater arrives!', 'Build some defenses before Warden Stillwater arrives!', 49984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[DEBUG] I left combat!!!', '[DEBUG] I left combat!!!', 49983, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seriously. Feast away. I\'m quite beautiful.', '', 49980, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Feast ye eyes upon the dreadful, clever, all-powerful, hate-filled, sword-swingin\', face-punchin\', insult-flingin\', and all around handsome, BURGY BLACKHEART.', '', 49979, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
