('Hurry, $n, deploy the Town-In-A-Box. Our people are trapped inside! Oh! I almost forgot your parachute.', '', 49886, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Most of my men were killed while infiltrating the Neferset borders.$B$BIt is my duty to make that sacrifice count for something.', '', 49885, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya, mon, for now. Dey not be too keen on teachin\' many more o\' our kind, but dey be helpin\' us \'long as we be keepin\' de life o\' de isles flourishin\'. When Gonk left after de fall o\' Zalazane, he be tellin\' us how ta contact him if de other loa don\'t keep dey end o\' de bargain.$B$BI be hopin\' it never come ta dat... but just in case, we be openin\' up channels wit dat Cenarion Circle group. $B$B<Zen\'tabra cackles madly.>$B$BOh, ya shoulda seen de look on dat night elf\'s face....', 49884, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So are the loa still holding to their side of the deal?', 'So are the loa still holding to their side of the deal?', 49883, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We been workin\' wit de spirits for many moons now, mon, but many o\' us already knew de forms o\' de loa we served before. It not be easy, but de Emerald Dream be a powerful teacher by itself-havin\' de spirits demselves also teachin\' ya... it hurries tings along.$B$BDat don\'t mean \'twas easy keepin\' safe from Zalazane. Even wit our new tricks combined wit de loa givin\' what help dey could, we lost a few bruddas and sistas over de years ta his voodoo and mindless servants. But we kept de life o\' de isles alive, and when Vol\'jin and de Darkspears returned, we knew just how ta take Zalazane down.', 49882, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So what happened then?', 'So what happened then?', 49881, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Zen\'tabra laughs.>$B$BDe other loa, \'specially Shirvallah, did not much care for dis plan. Dey still be wantin\' us ta work just for one o\' dem at a time, not wit all de spirits at once. But Gonk had forced dere hands, and dey knew it was de only way ta save de isles while Zalazane still ruled.$B$BI be tinkin\' dat Gonk did not care for de other loa much either. He be teasin\' de other loa all de time while we be learnin\' from dem.', 49880, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did the other loa react to this?', 'How did the other loa react to this?', 49879, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Zalazane\'s mindless servants were killin\' all de beasts o\' de isles, burnin\' up de trees and plants too. Gonk needed us ta save de life on de isles. But since we not be able ta draw upon de power o\' de loa wit Zalazane in power, Gonk be showin\' us a new way ta connect wit ALL de spirits o\' nature, ta work WIT de spirits, not just be servin\' a single loa at a time. $B$BIt be difficult at first, ya, mon, but Gonk be showin\' us how ta also reach inta de Emerald Dream ta speak wit de spirits and learn from dem directly!', 49878, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_healingway.blp:32|t  Your Lifebinder Boon will heal others while restoring your health and mana.', '', 49877, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did the spirit want?', 'What did the spirit want?', 49876, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_druid_ravage.blp:32|t  When your enemies are weak, tear them from the sky with your Finishing Strike!', '', 49875, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Zen\'tabra\'s head snaps back to you, her eyes bright and her smile wide around her tusks.>$B$B\'Twas a jungle bigger and wilder dan I ever seen! And before me, de ancient raptor loa only talked about in Zandalari tales-Gonk, de Great Hunter! $B$BDe raptor spirit spoke ta me, told me he had brought me spirit to a place called de Emerald Dream. De spirit had been trapped, like de other loa on de Echo Isles, by Zalazane\'s magic. But Gonk, bein\' an ancient spirit, was able ta reach across and bring me spirit ta him, even through Zalazane\'s voodoo. ', 49874, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_flamebolt.blp:32|t  Use Your Fire Blast to incinerate Twilight Shadowdrakes.', '', 49873, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The battle is about to begin!', '', 49872, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was the vision?', 'What was the vision?', 49871, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Zen\'tabra closes her eyes and shakes her head.>$B$BWhen Vol\'jin called for everyone ta flee, we... we couldn\'t face de tribe after failing dem so badly. So, we fled south, ta de untamed jungle islands.$B$BDe wilds claimed a few o\' us dat first night. We found safety in a deep cave in de center o\' de isle, but me dreams dere were not peaceful: I be havin\' a vision!', 49870, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you escape Zalazane?', 'How did you escape Zalazane?', 49869, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Some o\' us be loa priests, witch doctors before. Like Zalazane...$B$B<Zen\'tabra\'s face grows hard as her gaze drifts south.>$B$BWe thought de spirits be angry wit us; we did not suspect it be Zalazane slowly cuttin\' us off from dem. We knew he be strong, but not dat strong... and by de time his voodoo had reached de other isles, we was powerless ta stop \'im. ', 49868, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What were you before you were druids, then?', 'What were you before you were druids, then?', 49867, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<Zen\'tabra laughs.>$B$BWe spread dose rumors, mon. Keep\'n Zalazane and others off our tails. Don\'t be believin\' everyting ya hear.$B$BNo, we be new ta de craft, only learnin\' a few years ago. But in some ways, we spent our lives preparin\' ta answer de call....', 49866, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zen\'tabra, are you one of the druids from the rumors? Were there druids on the Echo Isles long ago?', 'Zen\'tabra, are you one of the druids from the rumors? Were there druids on the Echo Isles long ago?', 49865, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Uh oh, it\'s the Trade Prince.', 49864, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ride Bastia! Find Brax!', '', 49863, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are you talking to me? You don\'t make nearly as much money as me.$B$BGo mingle with your own kind, pal.', '', 49862, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<PLACEHOLDER: Exciting Cinematic!>', '', 49861, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Head back through the vale and meetup with Kilag at the Wild Overlook.', 49860, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '', 49859, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am so... darn... beautiful. Look at these guns. Look at this gold. Look at these girls. Who wouldn\'t want to be me?', '', 49858, 0, 0, 23, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. Thank you all for coming to stare at my enormous, bulging piles of gold. It must feel like such a wonderful privilege to be in my presence.', '', 49857, 0, 0, 2, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Three cheers for all of you! Keep on riding that rocketway and buying from those vendors. You\'re contributing to the most noble cause in all of Azeroth: my pockets!', '', 49856, 0, 0, 71, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go back to Aggra and tell her that we\'re moving northwest.', '', 49855, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hahahah! This reminds me of that little boy who came up and told me he wanted to be just like me, sitting on his own pile of gold someday. So adorable. I told him to get back to mopping and stop being lazy. I mean, really.', '', 49854, 0, 0, 153, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sometimes... sometimes it hurts to have so much money. It\'s so lonely. Just me and all my gold.', '', 49853, 0, 0, 18, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good for you. Good for all of you to go on living your lives knowing you can never have the wealth that I do. I\'m proud of you for sticking it out.', '', 49852, 0, 0, 21, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attention. Attention, everyone. I would like to offer my sincerest apologies that I am so much richer than all of you. I truly hope you find a way to continue on.', '', 49851, 0, 0, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit the button labeled \'Entrance\'.', 'Hit the button labeled \'Entrance\'.', 49850, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit the button labeled \'Into the Domicile\'.', 'Hit the button labeled \'Into the Domicile\'.', 49849, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit the button labeled \"Just past the Grim Guzzler\".', 'Hit the button labeled \"Just past the Grim Guzzler\".', 49848, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This mole machine is a little rusty, but it still looks operational.', '', 49847, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your weed whacker to mow down these plants, little goblin!', '', 49846, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know you. I have you to thank for my freedom from the deepening corruption that consumed me for so many years.$B$BWelcome to my home. Deepholm.  It is a shadow of what it used to be, but still, here I can be free. I shall never take such freedom for granted after what we have endured.$B$BI know not why you are here, but I hope you find what you seek within the stone walls of this place. Stay safe, $n.', 49845, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Rising Flames!', '', 49844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kilag Gorefang should be down the path to the west, goblin.', 49843, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deepholm has changed much in recent years. It\'s hardly recognizable.$B$BStill... here I am free from corruption. Free from the tainting influence of ancient gods. It seems that sometimes your freedom must be stripped away for you to truly appreciate its value.', 49842, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of your pesky pea-shooters. Let them shoot at this!', 'Enough of your pesky pea-shooters. Let them shoot at this!', 49841, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna burn this place to the ground!', 'We\'re gonna burn this place to the ground!', 49840, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DIE!!!', 'DIE!!!', 49839, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to join your friends, kissin\' the dirt!', 'Time to join your friends, kissin\' the dirt!', 49838, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ll kill anybody for the right price!', 'We\'ll kill anybody for the right price!', 49837, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been quite the pleasure workin\' with yeh, $glad:lass;.$b$bI\'d be honored ta do so again sometime.', '', 49836, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need some new friends if we\'re going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won\'t just kill you on sight.', 49835, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!', '', 49834, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The kaja\'mite has gone and made these monkeys smart! Keep that miner safe, $n.', '', 49833, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dampwick\'s at the cave entrance just to the southeast.', 49832, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was the most beautiful thing that I\'ve ever seen!', '', 49831, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The monkeys are going to get a kick out of those bananas!', '', 49830, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear the matriarch growling up on the cliff? Steer clear of her!', '', 49829, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you gotta get those teraptor hatchlings before they get us!', '', 49828, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n.', 49827, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You move with grace, rogue. How may I help you?', 'You move with grace, rogue. How may I help you?', 49826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot help you, $c.', 'I cannot help you, $c.', 49825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, there\'s tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you\'re not the boss anymore. Anyways, they\'re all probably going to drown if you don\'t get them out.', '', 49824, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Azeroth lives to see another day!', '', 49823, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wahooo!', '', 49822, 0, 0, 71, 65, 0, 23706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Escaping from this place is proving harder than I thought.$B$BWhere do you go when there is nowhere to go in sight?', '', 49821, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Reorigination device detonation aborted.', '', 49820, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23716, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blue! For the Alliance!', '', 49819, 0, 924, 5, 65, 0, 23704, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RED! For the HORDE!', '', 49818, 0, 923, 5, 65, 0, 23705, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about, in consideration of all ye\'ve done, we go with...', '', 49817, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 23703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble bobbles around appreciatively and then disappears into the distance.', '', 49816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble shuffles up against your leg happily, then races off into the distance.', '', 49815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble shuffles around happily and disappears into the distance.', '', 49814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble bounces up and down happily as he disappears into the distance.', '', 49813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble\'s stones jitter as he obediently falls in beside you.', '', 49812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come little guy, let\'s get out of here.', 'Come little guy, let\'s get out of here.', 49811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pebble bounces around and looks up at you hopefully. He definitely remembers you.', '', 49810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Look alive, men! There are orcs and worgs about!', '', 49809, 0, 11516, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your worgs are no match for the might of Stormwind!', '', 49808, 0, 11516, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll kill a hundred more of your battle worgs!', '', 49807, 0, 11516, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your filthy dogs won\'t be enough!', '', 49806, 0, 11516, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrite, here goes nuthin\'!', '', 49805, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, monsters! We will crush you!', '', 49804, 0, 11516, 22, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och! I can\'t decide!', '', 49803, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrite! Fuses exposed! Now which one ta break? Red? Or blue...?', '', 49802, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 23700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Detonation in thirty seconds.', '', 49801, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23715, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m goin\' in manually! There\'s gotta be a way!', '', 49800, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23699, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One minute!? Come on, Brann! Think!', '', 49799, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23698, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning!$bReorigination device activated. Detonation in one minute.', '', 49798, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23714, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What!? Wait! That\'s no good! That\'s no good at all...', '', 49797, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 23697, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Repository access denied. Reorigination subroutine initiated.', '', 49796, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23713, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, yeah. Just read the discs and gimme access already...', '', 49795, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 23696, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing reorigination device override.', '', 49794, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\INV_ELEMENTAL_PRIMAL_SHADOW.BLP:20|t%s throws |cFF660099dark|r magic into the cauldron!', '', 49793, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Accessing data... stand by.', '', 49792, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 23711, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go. That should do it!', '', 49791, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 23695, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must admit, I couldn\'ta done this one without yer help.', '', 49790, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 23694, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 'Our master Malfurion has returned from the Dreaming, $c.  His is the light of a beacon that shows the way for us, and we must do everything in our power to preserve that light.', 49789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this.', 'Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BWe are the preservers of the balance, now and forever, with Malfurion watching over us.  Never forget this.', 49788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve got the money, I\'m sure the Light\'s got something to teach you.', 'If you\'ve got the money, I\'m sure the Light\'s got something to teach you.', 49787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you pay the right price, the Light can always protect you, $c.', 'If you pay the right price, the Light can always protect you, $c.', 49786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your time ends now!', 49785, 0, 0, 15, 64, 0, 0, 11541, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Flame Jet attack to engulf enemies in flames!', 'Use the Flame Jet attack to engulf enemies in flames!', 49784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sacrifices of my Argent Dawn brothers must never be forgotten. They believed in the Dawn, though none lived to see the return of the Light to these lands.', '', 49783, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inconceivable! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... tip the scales. ', '', 49782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could have seen the looks on their faces when they realized you were shooting them down with our junk.', '', 49781, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, get to one of the Krazz Cannons and shoot those Stormtalons down before they bring this whole place down on us!', '', 49780, 1, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alexstrasza is hurt. Keep the beams red by killing Twilight Corruptors, or she will lose the fight!', 49779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Summon elevator to current floor.', 'Summon elevator to current floor.', 49778, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Choose a destination.', 'Choose a destination.', 49777, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring elevator to third floor.', 'Bring elevator to third floor.', 49776, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring elevator to second floor.', 'Bring elevator to second floor.', 49775, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help Alexstrasza by killing the Twilight Corruptors.', '', 49774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bring elevator to first floor.', 'Bring elevator to first floor.', 49773, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You defended against the attack!$BThe Warden will not be happy about this...', 'You defended against the attack!$BThe Warden will not be happy about this...', 49772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'H-help! Get him off me!', 49771, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gut him! Tear him apart!', 49770, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep him distracted!', 49769, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always strive ta understand the balance maintained by our world\'s elemental spirits.', 'Always strive ta understand the balance maintained by our world\'s elemental spirits.', 49768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember ta always show yer respect for the elements.', 'Remember ta always show yer respect for the elements.', 49767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar, $c. Behind me is the Warchief\'s Command board containing our leader\'s instructions to members of the Horde. It will tell you where your skills will best serve the Horde in battle against its foes.', '', 49766, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring greetings from King Wrynn, $c. Behind me is the Hero\'s Call board, a collection of proclamations from the King of Stormwind directing adventurers to locations where their talents can best aid the Alliance.', '', 49765, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good work with them constructs, $glad:lass;.$b$bYou just bought us unfettered access to the repository.', '', 49764, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calissa is dying!', 49763, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'James...please...I love you...', 49762, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calissa...I am so sorry...', '', 49761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alexstrasza is already engaged with Deathwing! If you hurry, there may still be time to help!', 49760, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The circle of life is not yet prepared for Alexstrasza. Speak with me again as soon as I have finished my preparations.', 49759, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathwing is victorious! Try again once Alexstrasza recovers.', 49758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanessa pulls out a final barrel of mining powder and ignites it!  RUN!', 49757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanessa is detonating more charges!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!', 49756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanessa has detonated charges on the ship!  Get to the ropes at the side of the boat!', 49755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'MY FATE IS MY OWN!', 49754, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 24612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'ENOUGH!  I will not give you the pleasure!', 49753, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 24610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If I\'m going to die, I\'m taking you all with me!', 49752, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 24611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fools!  This entire ship is rigged with explosives!  Enjoy your fiery deaths!', 49751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Did you really think I would come to this fight alone?', 49750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24620, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The first of many.', 49749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24618, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will not share my father\'s fate!  Your tale ends here!', 49748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 24599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use Pumpkin Bombs to defeat large clusters of zombies or weaken difficult ones.', 'Use Pumpkin Bombs to defeat large clusters of zombies or weaken difficult ones.', 49747, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och!$b$bWhy can\'t it just be easy fer once?!', '', 49746, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20903, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He was called James Harrington.  A tragedy in three parts.', 49745, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AHHHHH!', 'AHHHHH!', 49744, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where am I?', 'Where am I?', 49743, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ripsnarl wasn\'t always a bloodthirsty savage.  Once, he even had a family.', 49742, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?  What happened?', 'Who are you?  What happened?', 49741, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are weakening, Sintharia!  Accept the inevitable!', '', 49740, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your mother calls!', 49739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Come forth, children of twilight....', 49738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I don\'t understand...', 'I... I don\'t understand...', 49737, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Forsaken!', 'For the Forsaken!', 49736, 1, 0, 94, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am reborn!', 'I am reborn!', 49735, 1, 0, 71, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feel my hatred!', 49734, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am yours to command.', 'I am yours to command.', 49733, 1, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Suffer!', 49732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve the Dark Lady!', 'I serve the Dark Lady!', 49731, 1, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The energy infused within my clutch is mine to reclaim!', 49730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathwing!  I have fallen....  The brood... is lost.', 49729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flame of Life!  Burn within me and renew my vigor!', '', 49728, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All is lost....  Forgive me, my Queen....', '', 49727, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A simple spark can mean the difference between life...and death.', 49726, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Can you imagine the life of a machine?', 49725, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You never know what skitters in the darkness.', 49724, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24605, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Most rogues prefer to cloak themselves in the shadows, but not Helix.', 49723, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24604, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
