('Filthy beasts! Your presence in Skywall will not be tolerated!', '', 49570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20876, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Starfall Village, traveler. Have you come to assist us?', '', 49569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s summons a |cFFFF0000Faceless Corruptor|r!', '', 49568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Build at least 3 Sunflowers to survive this mission.', 'Build at least 3 Sunflowers to survive this mission.', 49567, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Plant Sunflowers to create additional solar power, which will help you survive zombie attacks.', 'Plant Sunflowers to create additional solar power, which will help you survive zombie attacks.', 49566, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...is control.', '', 49565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you two are lacking...', '', 49564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Internal: Aberration Wave to 50%%.', 'Internal: Aberration Wave to 50%%.', 49563, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Internal: Ghoul Wave to 50%%.', 'Internal: Ghoul Wave to 50%%.', 49562, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Internal: Zombie Wave to 50%%.', 'Internal: Zombie Wave to 50%%.', 49561, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There will be time to celebrate later, commander.  Twilight dragons approach!', 49560, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Collect Solar Power and place Spitters in the center lane to fight the zombies!', 'Collect Solar Power and place Spitters in the center lane to fight the zombies!', 49559, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep placing spitters in the center lane to hold off the zombies.', 'Keep placing spitters in the center lane to hold off the zombies.', 49558, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Goldrinn!  It\'s true then... the Ancients walk among us again!', '', 49557, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You might not have that long.  Enemy reinforcements are already underway.', '', 49556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just a few more minutes...  Cenarius is almost here!', '', 49555, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use this Blast Tape to seal them faulty valves up real good, chief.', '', 49554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good job!', 'Good job!', 49553, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tutorial Completed!$BYou\'ve unlocked the Sunflower.', 'Tutorial Completed!$BYou\'ve unlocked the Sunflower.', 49552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You survived the attack!$BRocknut Unlocked!', 'You survived the attack!$BRocknut Unlocked!', 49551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve come to help, $c? Let us stay together for a while.', 49550, 0, 11498, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to stay and do what I can to free these spiders. Thank you for your help, $n.', 49549, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s calls a Twilight Drake to aid him!', '', 49548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I won\'t hold you up.  It\'s been a pleasure, $n.  I hope our paths cross again soon.', '', 49547, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about you?  I\'ve heard that Sarvis is going to send you off to Calston Estate.  Big assignment, eh?', '', 49546, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll probably be staying here in Deathknell.  If things work out, though... who knows?  Maybe I\'ll get to meet the Dark Lady herself.', '', 49545, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They\'re making me into a Deathguard.  Can you believe it?', '', 49544, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hi, $n!  What do you think about my new gear?', '', 49543, 0, 0, 23, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, look who\'s here!', '', 49542, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Brann. Go ahead and activate the coffer.', 'I\'m ready, Brann. Go ahead and activate the coffer.', 49541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrite, $r.$b$bEverything looks ta be in its proper place.', '', 49540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Arrite, now... Let\'s see here.', '', 49539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see ya there, $n! Don\'t be late!', '', 49538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks $n, I think I can take one of these horses and make it back to camp from here.  I could not have made it without your help.', 'Thanks $n, I think I can take one of these horses and make it back to camp from here.  I could not have made it without your help.', 49537, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ok, this is the right way for sure.  Quite a few guards out there so be on your toes.', 'Ok, this is the right way for sure.  Quite a few guards out there so be on your toes.', 49536, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This does not look familar to me at all.  Let\'s head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way.  I don\'t really like long stairwells anyways.', 'This does not look familar to me at all.  Let\'s head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way.  I don\'t really like long stairwells anyways.', 49535, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, this just looks like a dead end.  That bed does look comfy though.  Let\'s try the other way.', 'Bah, this just looks like a dead end.  That bed does look comfy though.  Let\'s try the other way.', 49534, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t remember which way the exit is here.  Let\'s try this doorway over here.', 'I don\'t remember which way the exit is here.  Let\'s try this doorway over here.', 49533, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can help me out of here?  Well  there is no reason to stand around, let\'s go!', 'You can help me out of here?  Well  there is no reason to stand around, let\'s go!', 49532, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better sharpen up, laddie! I may not be there to pull yer bacon outta the fire next time.', '', 49531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Two steps ahead of ya again, junior! As usual.', '', 49530, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahah! Fresh air at last!', '', 49529, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49527, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Auckh!!!', '', 49525, 0, 0, 34, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy zhe - Vait... vhat is ZHAT?!', '', 49524, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Och! Come on now, ye buggar...', '', 49523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brann!? Wha?! How...', '', 49519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$p! We\'ve done it!', '', 49518, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would you look at that...', '', 49517, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That oughta do it!', '', 49516, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am ready for Deathwing!', 'I am ready for Deathwing!', 49515, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I understand that Alexstrasza has pronounced judgment on Deathwing. Perhaps this whole ordeal will end, right here?', 49514, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beat it, Schnottz!', '', 49510, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You alright, $n?', '', 49509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Placeholder', '', 49504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You haven\'t seen zhe last of me, $p!', '', 49503, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VHAAAT?! Vhat is zhe meanink of zhis?', '', 49502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, yes. Any last vords? Hmm?', '', 49501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, zhen, vhere vere ve?', '', 49500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Be certain there aren\'t, Schnottz. Deathwing\'s patience wears thin.', '', 49499, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell him zhat zhere vill be no furzher interruptions.', '', 49498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can take it from here, my friends. Report to your master zhat zhe problem has been dealt vizh.', '', 49497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhat\'s far enough!', '', 49496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are fortunate zhat I am too busy to make you suffer as you deserve.', '', 49495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You vill pay, $p. Deazh by firink sqvad!', '', 49494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhen, on top of everyzhink, you nearly take my life... ME!', '', 49493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If zhat vere not enough, you sabotaged my ritual and caused Gobbles\' death!', '', 49492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO BUT! Silence! Keep Movink!', '', 49491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, I have to set a broken leg on a baby dragon. Can you come back in a few minutes?', 'Sorry, I have to set a broken leg on a baby dragon. Can you come back in a few minutes?', 49490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cage the pygmy!', '', 49489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But -', 'But -', 49488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhen you mercilessly kill my loyal vorkers...', '', 49487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clumsily interferink vizh my operation...', '', 49486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First, you come traipsing into Uldum as if you owned zhe place...', '', 49485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you really zhink you vould get avay vizh it, $p? Hmm?', '', 49484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Vanessa injects you with the Nightmare Elixir!', 49483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How\'s it going.', '', 49482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Especially venoms that affect the mind.', 49481, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24617, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But I always excelled at poisons.', 49480, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I was never very good at hand-to-hand combat, you know.  Not like my father.', 49479, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Biding my time, building my forces, studying the minds of my enemies.', 49478, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve been waiting a long time for this, you know.', 49477, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 24613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You hear a noise from above the cabin door!', 49476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now we are making progress!  This is the way out for sure.  Looks like a lot of guards though so I really need you to help me out!', 'Now we are making progress!  This is the way out for sure.  Looks like a lot of guards though so I really need you to help me out!', 49475, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm...  This stairway does not look promising at all.  Let\'s head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way out.', 'Hmmm...  This stairway does not look promising at all.  Let\'s head back to the courtyard and see if there is another way out.', 49474, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah!  This just looks like a dead end.  Let\'s head back the other way.', 'Bah!  This just looks like a dead end.  Let\'s head back the other way.', 49473, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... I can\'t remember which way to go here.  Let\'s try this side!', 'Hmm... I can\'t remember which way to go here.  Let\'s try this side!', 49472, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah - here comes Alexstrasza now.', 49471, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And so the circle of life is complete. All is prepared.', 49470, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fire burns for lives at their end; their work may be done, but their contribution eternal.', 49469, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fire burns for lives in their prime; struggling to make and reshape the world.', 49468, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fire burns for lives born anew; the passion of youth and the energy they bear.', 49467, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fire burns for lives to come; nascent souls awakening in the womb.', 49466, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'One fire burns for lives long lost; their essence now shared with all living things.', 49465, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alexstrasza will be here shortly. Come, we will prepare the sanctuary.', 49464, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh you poor thing, you\'re covered head to toe in sand!  Please feel free to rest and rejuvenate yourself here at this beautiful oasis.', 'Oh you poor thing, you\'re covered head to toe in sand!  Please feel free to rest and rejuvenate yourself here at this beautiful oasis.', 49463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to browse your wares, Yasmin.', 'I wish to browse your wares, Yasmin.', 49462, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you have what it takes to face the challenges of Azeroth\'s dungeons? Inquire within...', '', 49461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I see some corpses up ahead.  Let\'s go, $n!  You do the searching and fighting.  I\'ll do the lifting.', '', 49460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get moving, $n.  Saltain said that we\'d find some corpses up here.', '', 49459, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, here he is.', '', 49458, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good, you\'re still here.  Now, where\'s Deathguard Saltain?', '', 49457, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know the way to Deathknell.  Come with me!', '', 49456, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello again.', '', 49455, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will delay the Aspect of Death. Take her to safety. GO!', '', 49454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal, take the dragon queen. Carry her to safety. Now! RUN! Get her away from here!', '', 49453, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 21521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deathwing - he lives!', '', 49452, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mother, stay still. Your wounds are great.', '', 49451, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 21515, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There - they\'ve fallen!', '', 49450, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 21514, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them out of sight! Quickly - come with me!', '', 49449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21513, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, mother.', '', 49448, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 21512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not leave your side.', '', 49447, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 21510, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think to entrap me!?', '', 49446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20280, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of Twilight falls.', '', 49445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20279, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just as all life ends in death ... all order must end in chaos ... Come! Embrace the inevitable, as I have!', '', 49444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20278, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then witness my new gifts, bestowed by this world\'s true masters.', '', 49443, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 20277, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"End\" me? Lifebinder, you think life is yours to take away?', '', 49442, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 20276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lifebinder! Do you presume that I am at your beck and call? I have a world to unmake.', '', 49441, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 20275, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No!', 49440, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 21054, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Calen, no!', 49439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21053, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Impossible!', 49438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21052, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But it is over. We can work now to bottle up the horrors he has unleashed.', 49437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Alexstrasza winches in pain.', 49436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The black aspect\'s blood is cursed. Wherever it was shed - nothing will grow for ten thousand years.', 49435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Earth Warder... he is dead.', 49434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Neltharion! Look at yourself. Misshapen. Twisted. You\'re coming apart.', 49433, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 21049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see the hollow metal shell of a once great ally, and the precious gift of the Titans wasted.', 49432, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 21048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It pains me, Neltharion - but I must end you, as I have ended Malygos.', 49431, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your life isn\'t yours to throw away, Calen. Should I fail, the fate of this world may rest on your shoulders.', 49430, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 21046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mortal, I want you to bear witness to this, but for your own safety stay back. Calen, you too.', 49429, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 21045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for coming, but you really all must die now!', '', 49428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeat has never tasted so bitter...', '', 49427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20083, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You really have to want it!', '', 49426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20081, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH!', '', 49425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20080, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has been a pleasure!', '', 49424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20079, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortal minds... So easily manipulated.', '', 49423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20078, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have tried to be an accommodating host, but you simply will not die! Time to throw all pretense aside and just... KILL YOU ALL!', '', 49422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20077, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you can swim... in molten lava!', '', 49421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20075, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse you, mortals! Such a callous disregard for one\'s possessions must be met with extreme force!', '', 49420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20082, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh turns to ash!', '', 49419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20074, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See how the shadowflame animates their bones! They fight at my command!', '', 49418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20073, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My dearest sibling, do you hunger? THEN FEAST UPON OUR ENEMIES!', '', 49417, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 20071, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold the brood mother, Onyxia, REBORN! Perhaps my finest work.', '', 49416, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 20070, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!', '', 49415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20090, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!', '', 49414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20089, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Impressive. You have managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations, a task I had thought impossible until now.', '', 49413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20088, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that was really unnecessary.', '', 49412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20087, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That malfunctioning piece of junk was murder on the repair bills.', '', 49411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20086, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, \"heroes.\"', '', 49410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Massive Wave of Zombies is Approaching!', 'A Massive Wave of Zombies is Approaching!', 49409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valdred Moray, reporting for duty, sir!', '', 49408, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The bomb is set! Get clear!', '', 49407, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Neferset City will fall!  ATTACK!!!', '', 49406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Pharaoh has fallen!  His immortal colossi tumble like toys!', '', 49405, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to start whenever you are! I\'ll keep the bride and groom close in case the Twilight\'s Hammer tries anything.$B$BAre you ready?', '', 49404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get it! Kill it!', 49403, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Wiiiiiildhammmmmer!', 49402, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Twilight\'s Hammer don\'t scare me none. Bring \'em on!', 49401, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wildhammer stay ta\'gether wot slay ta\'gether!', '', 49400, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEST! WEDDING! EVAR! *Hic*', '', 49399, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*hic* You an\' me, Firebeard. Wildhammers FOREVER.', '', 49398, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tha\'s the way we Wildhammer ... get hitched, it was. *hic* That were BEAUTIFUL!', '', 49397, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re okay, Firebeard. *urp* You\'re okay by me.', '', 49396, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I love yoooouuu man ... *hic* like a BROTHER!', '', 49395, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beak. Beak!', '', 49394, 0, 10732, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re safe now, Beak. C\'mon back to Donnelly!', '', 49393, 0, 10732, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take it easy, Beak. Come back here!', '', 49392, 0, 10732, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aww, c\'mon Beak. It weren\'t nothin\' but a big ... tentacle thing. Donnelly will keep ya safe!', '', 49391, 0, 10732, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beak! Get down here, Beak!', '', 49390, 0, 10732, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies from his injuries.', '%s dies from his injuries.', 49389, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 49388, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Kezan, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Kezan, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 49387, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 49386, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the goblin that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were my best friend! Fight this!', 'Remember the goblin that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were my best friend! Fight this!', 49385, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t remember me, $n? I lost count of the number of jobs you and I ran back in the day on Kezan. Then I picked up a real bad Kaja\'Cola habit and you saved me! It was you who took me to Kalimdor to join the Steamwheedle Cartel. You were the only good goblin I knew. That\'s how I ended up in the Argent Dawn, because I knew it was what you woulda done. How could this have happened to you?', 'You don\'t remember me, $n? I lost count of the number of jobs you and I ran back in the day on Kezan. Then I picked up a real bad Kaja\'Cola habit and you saved me! It was you who took me to Kalimdor to join the Steamwheedle Cartel. You were the only good goblin I knew. That\'s how I ended up in the Argent Dawn, because I knew it was what you woulda done. How could this have happened to you?', 49384, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', '$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', 49383, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n?', '$n?', 49382, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up.', 'Alright, j... just let me... let me st... stand up.', 49381, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('C... can\'t we work this out somehow?', 'C... can\'t we work this out somehow?', 49380, 0, 11400, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on in there? What\'s taking so long, $n?', '', 49379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s dies from his injuries.', '%s dies from his injuries.', 49378, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!', 49377, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Gilneas, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Gilneas, our beloved home. This world is worth saving.', 49376, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!', 49375, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember the worgen that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were our savior! Fight this!', 'Remember the worgen that you once were, $g brother:sister;! You were our savior! Fight this!', 49374, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, my back!', '', 49373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?', 'You don\'t remember me? We were both servants of Arugal back in Silverpine Forest. We put up with his merciless torture for ages. It was you who saved me on that fateful night when we escaped Shadowfang Keep. Without you I would have died. YOU! The most noble worgen I ever knew. What have they done to you, $n? How could this have happened?', 49372, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', '$n, I\'d recognize that face anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?', 49371, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n?', '$n?', 49370, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do it while I\'m standing...', 'Do it while I\'m standing...', 49369, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s sent one of his cowards in to kill me, has he?', 'He\'s sent one of his cowards in to kill me, has he?', 49368, 0, 11399, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rush their positions!  $n is with us -- our victory is assured!', '', 49367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No amount of marketing is going to get us out of this one. The only thing that\'s going to work is a bazillion macaroons!$B$BYou have to get that moolah and get to the docks, pronto!', 49366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, heya, toots. Yeah... we need to talk.$B$BLater, okay?', '', 49365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Heya, hon. Um... we need to talk, but later.$B$BOkay?', 49364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We gotta finish up here and get you to the dock before the Trade Prince leaves us all behind!', 49363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Boss, we gotta get you a bazillion macaroons by any means possible!', 49362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s here! Get in that cannon, damnit! Get ready to fire!', '', 49361, 0, 11392, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This isn\'t looking good, boss.', 49360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s almost here. Get ready!', '', 49359, 0, 11392, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, predictable! They\'ll see it comin\'!', '', 49358, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now hold yer breeks. The zeppelin will take a minute or so to pull around.', '', 49357, 0, 11392, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Pirates?! Boss, you have to deal with this! They\'re ruining the party!', 49356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s your big coming out party. We\'ll make you a Trade $G Prince : Princess; yet, $n!$B$BGet out there and strut your stuff!', 49355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You talk to Undertaker Mordo.  He\'ll tell you what to do.  That\'s all I know.', 'You talk to Undertaker Mordo.  He\'ll tell you what to do.  That\'s all I know.', 49354, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Calm down, Valdred.  Undertaker Mordo probably sewed some new ones on for you.', 'Calm down, Valdred.  Undertaker Mordo probably sewed some new ones on for you.', 49353, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you remember?  You died.', 'Don\'t you remember?  You died.', 49352, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.  Well then, let\'s get to work, $n!  The Dark Lady needs us, right?', '', 49351, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Valdred looks back down at his hands.>$b$bI suppose this is my fate then.  Hah!  Part of an undead army.  Somehow I never considered that I might end up fighting for the Forsaken.$b$b<He looks back up at you.>$b$bWhat do I do now?', '', 49350, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... died?$b$bYes, you\'re right.  I died.  It was an orc... he cut off my hands, and left me to die.$b$b<Valdred looks down at his hands.>$b$bThese aren\'t my hands!  THESE AREN\'T MY HANDS!', '', 49349, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... what\'s going on?  Who are you?  What happened to me?', '', 49348, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are free to do whatever you like.', 'You are free to do whatever you like.', 49347, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not here to fight.  I\'ve only been asked to speak with you.', 'I\'m not here to fight.  I\'ve only been asked to speak with you.', 49346, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you calling a monster? You\'re the monster! I\'m just a man who died.', '', 49345, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh really?$b$bFine.  I don\'t want to join you and your Forsaken.  Maybe I\'ll start my own Forsaken!  Maybe I\'ll invent Forsaken with elbows!', '', 49344, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stand back, monster.  You want to fight?  Because I\'ll fight you.$b$bI\'ll fight any one of you creatures!  Do you hear me?', '', 49343, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My official diagnosis is that you are both idiots! IDIOTS I SAY!', '', 49342, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Frankly, I\'m getting a little tired of these therapy sessions. We\'re fine! Just let us go.', '', 49341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lilian, do you realize that you are undead yourself?', 'Lilian, do you realize that you are undead yourself?', 49340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not an abomination, I\'m simply undead.  I just want to speak with you.', 'I\'m not an abomination, I\'m simply undead.  I just want to speak with you.', 49339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d go back if I could. I had a life in Durnholde. Towards the end there I was beaten maybe once a week at MOST.', '', 49338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.  You\'re lying!  My father will protect me!', 49337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And we don\'t appreciate you refering to our friends as a \'ball and chain,\' doc.', '', 49336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The undead are a taint upon Azeroth!  Every one of you creatures deserves to be destroyed!', 49335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Get away from me, you abomination!', 49334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m with Drull, doc. Laverne and I are happy together. Why try and separate us?', '', 49333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, when I was first captured I hated Teddy. He dug into my skin and prevented me from moving around freely. But let me tell you something, doc; after six years with the guy I can honestly say that I have feelings for him.', '', 49332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll be free to take it off when I die.', '', 49331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO, DAMN IT! For the hundredth time, NO!', '', 49330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can\'t you just see me for me, doc? Why does it always have to be about Teddy?', '', 49329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I want to know is this: WHY DO YOU CARE IF I HAVE A BALL AND CHAIN SHACKLED TO MY ANKLE!?', '', 49328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Six weeks? I spent six years in Durnholde! You cannot possibly expect me to just throw aside something that has been a part of my life for so long!', '', 49327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need time to think. It... it\'s too soon.', '', 49326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It has now been six weeks since your release. Are you ready to have the shackles removed?', '', 49325, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hit the icicle to break free!', '', 49324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks for freeing me! I\'m off to have more amazing adventures.', '', 49323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20839, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Great job guys! The key should be in his guts somewhere. Just, uh, fish around in there \'till you find it.', '', 49322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uh oh! He looks pretty mad now!', '', 49321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20837, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor little fella.', '', 49320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20836, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little help?', '', 49319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20835, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey! Over here!', '', 49318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20834, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help! I\'m trapped in here!', '', 49317, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20833, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The molten slag begins to bubble furiously!', '', 49316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A stray jolt from the Foe Reaper has disrupted the foundry controls!', '', 49315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tread Lightly.', '', 49314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murkash!', '', 49313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Siamat must not be freed! Turn back before it is too late!', '', 49312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insolent rat!', '', 49311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21889, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Invaders, you shall go no further!', '', 49310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...is just one CHOP!', '', 49309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why flail around when all you need...', '', 49308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We\'re through, $n! I\'m with Candy now.', '', 49307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re through, $n! I\'m with Chip now.', 49306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $n.', '', 49305, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw someone up there whose jaw fell off.  I wonder if Mordo can fix him up?', '', 49304, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nice work!  You\'ve found them.  Let\'s bring these back to Mordo.', '', 49303, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
