('', 'Yeah, a real party that I was actually invited to. Why does something always happen and I never get to go? I could use a drink.', 49247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Technically speaking, that\'s not true, doctor. The rocks that fly out of a volcano like Mount Kajaro are called ejecta. It\'s not the sky. It\'s molten rock, or tephra. It cools as it descends, becoming lava bombs. Very appropriate, wouldn\'t you say?', 49246, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away. I\'ll flag the Lab-In-A-Box for deployment in Azshara.  I\'ll pack her little cushion in with her, too. She\'s so cute!', 49245, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re going to blow if you don\'t calm down! Don\'t you think it was a little bit convenient? The dragon flying over right as the winning field goal for the footbomb finals was kicked into Mount Kajaro?', 49244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
