('What did ye call me? I\'ll show ye what a \"snow licker\" can do!', '', 49164, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess it\'s true then. I didn\'t want to believe that you were a yellow-bellied snow licker, but there\'s no doubt about it now.', 'I guess it\'s true then. I didn\'t want to believe that you were a yellow-bellied snow licker, but there\'s no doubt about it now.', 49163, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m busy, lad. Why don\'t ye go find some Forsaken goo and take a bath, eh?', '', 49162, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on then, Nancy! Let\'s go!', '', 49161, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did ye say, Sally?! The only one of us who resembles a gnome is you - after I\'m done cuttin\' you into wee pieces!', '', 49160, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dirty, stinkin\' Wildhammer. You know these dwarves only consider you as half a dwarf, right? What does that make you? A gnome?', 'Dirty, stinkin\' Wildhammer. You know these dwarves only consider you as half a dwarf, right? What does that make you? A gnome?', 49159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OY! Piss off, eh?', '', 49158, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to the infirmary!', 'I\'m going to the infirmary!', 49157, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('MEDIC!', 'MEDIC!', 49156, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_holy_innerfire.blp:20|t Glubtok creates a moving |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91398|h[Fire Wall]|h|r!', '', 49155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...', '...', 49154, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_mage_firestarter.blp:20|tUse |cFFFF0000|Hspell:74040|h[Engulfing Flames]|h|r to destroy the Twilight\'s Hammer!', '', 49153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Mulgore, Tel\'aporta!', 'Take me to the Mulgore, Tel\'aporta!', 49152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gwaaaaaaahhh!!!', '', 49151, 0, 0, 53, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Echo Isles, Tel\'aporta!', 'Take me to the Echo Isles, Tel\'aporta!', 49150, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey mon!$b$bDis area been goin\' through lotsa changes.  Tel\'aporta gonna take you somewhere else.', '', 49149, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wha.. ungh...', 'Wha.. ungh...', 49148, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARGH! THROAT ON FIRE!', 'ARGH! THROAT ON FIRE!', 49147, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So tired...', 'So tired...', 49146, 0, 0, 462, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... I don\'t feel so good.', 'Ugh... I don\'t feel so good.', 49145, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I feel like I could drink a lake!', 'I feel like I could drink a lake!', 49144, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, yer a lifesaver, lad!', 'Ah, yer a lifesaver, lad!', 49143, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the Light! I\'m parched!', 'Thank the Light! I\'m parched!', 49142, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Gobber acts tough, but you can tell that deep down, he\'s scared.>', '', 49141, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WATER!', 'WATER!', 49140, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It looks like this is the end, but I\'ll be brave if you will, $n.', 49139, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, $g man : lady;, are we gonna get through this okay?', '', 49138, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t look right, buddy. There\'s somethin\' wrong with you.', '', 49137, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you, $n!$B$BI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?$B$BThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja\'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.$B$BAnyway, I\'m working on a few more things here that I think you\'ll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine.', '', 49136, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey. How ya doing, boss? Hobart and I are working on some things that will ensure that you have phenomenal backup products for when the kaja\'mite runs out.$B$BThere\'s only so much of it left down there in the mines, and when it\'s gone, all of the Kaja\'Cola is going to go with it, I\'m afraid.', 49135, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We can both agree on that, doctor.', 49134, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t the foggiest notion what you\'re talking about, Miss Greely.', '', 49133, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now what\'s this about you \'always loved me\', Grapplehammer?', 49132, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Is that egg on your face?', 49131, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hobart\'s jaw hits the ground.', '', 49130, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well of course we are, my dear Greely. And look there. The Micro Mechachicken\'s stabilization appears to be a complete success!', '', 49129, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts.', 49128, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we still alive?', '', 49127, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'WHAT?!!!', 49126, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flipping the override switch now!', '', 49125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here goes nothing. I always loved you, Greely!', '', 49124, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It\'s going to eggsplode!', 49123, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know... I know! Where\'s the override? The override?!', '', 49122, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destablizing. It\'s expanding!', 49121, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... something\'s wrong!', '', 49120, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m flipping the second switch!', '', 49119, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grocery store owners everywhere will owe me a percentage of their profits!', '', 49118, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!', '', 49117, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am now flipping the switch!', '', 49116, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quite right, Greely. You passed today\'s pop quiz.', '', 49115, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Um, Hobart, you\'re at the controls.', 49114, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greely coughs.', 49113, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flip the switch!', '', 49112, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all time! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick.', '', 49111, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!', '', 49110, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The assistant shakes her head.', 49109, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process.', '', 49108, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please.', '', 49107, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer.', 49106, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greely sighs and rolls her eyes.', 49105, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!', '', 49104, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There. One Micro Mechachicken. I\'ll never understand how you come up with these names.', 49103, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You don\'t have to yell, Hobart, I\'m standing right here. Sheesh!', 49102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!', '', 49101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEGONE!', '', 49100, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You go back to that spineless orc who would not come see me and you tell him that the Frostwolf clan will not aid the Forsaken. Not now, not ever!', '', 49099, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... I have done terrible things, but nothing could ever be as terrible as lending aid to the Forsaken.', '', 49098, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countless... countless lives... *cough*', '', 49097, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many innocents have fallen before the Forsaken war machine?', '', 49096, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They ravage the land and destroy everything that they touch. How many lives have been lost to their vile poisons?', '', 49095, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But the Forsaken. *cough* What do they feel?', '', 49094, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But these terrible things that I have done and the people that I have harmed - I know them... I face them... and I feel remorse for them.', '', 49093, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Things that still keep me awake at night.', '', 49092, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... *cough* I have been alive for a very long time. In that time I have seen and done terrible things.', '', 49091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s coughs.', '', 49090, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you have come seeking our aid?', '', 49089, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that you\'ve helped me to establish my ice cream empire, make sure to enjoy one of my many tasty concoctions!', '', 49088, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I defer to your wisdom, brother.  Let us pray we are quick to come to a decision.  The enemy will not wait.', '', 49087, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fight to the death, Phaoris!  Our race was created to guard this land.  We must not betray that legacy.', '', 49086, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I urge you to reconsider, Phaoris. Deathwing would use the scepters\' power to unravel the secrets of Uldum and unleash great destruction.', '', 49085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cho\'gall beckons and casts |cFF006EFD|Hspell:91303|h[Conversion]|h|r!', '', 49084, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The wedding\'s a go! I\'m going to need a gift for the happy couple, of course. Something important.$B$BThe future of the Wildhammer really hinges on this one last chance to bring us all together!', '', 49083, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your words ring true, brother.... but even a king cannot make this decision alone.  I will put the issue to a High Council vote.', '', 49082, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must act to protect my people first.  Our enemies buried Orsis in the desert.  How do you fight against that sort of power?', '', 49081, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If that is all they want then perhaps war can be avoided.  The coming bloodshed could be prevented!', '', 49080, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps we ought to give the enemy what they\'re after... and spare our people the coming bloodshed.', '', 49079, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A wedding, eh? If that doesn\'t bring this bunch together, I\'ll eat my hammer!$B$BWe need to make sure this wedding is spectacular, $n, and we\'re going to need your help. There\'s an old Wildhammer saying... let me think... how does it go?', '', 49078, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have been disposed of a long time ago.', '', 49077, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23357, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These shields are proving quite the nuisance.', '', 49076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Atramedes, the heroes are right THERE!', '', 49075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Atramedes, are you going deaf as well as blind? Hurry up and kill them all.', '', 49074, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You begin to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:91317|h[Worshipping]|h|r!', '', 49073, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, friend of the Wildhammer!$B$BKirthaven is the spiritual center of our people, the one place where the varied clans can come together in peace.$B$BIt\'s here we honor our dead heroes, before burying them with their gryphons atop Mount Thunderstrike. There they spend eternity at one with the sky.', '', 49072, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t stand to watch. So many good memories. So much profit.', 49071, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Congratulations! Allow me to grant you a title befitting the amazing achievement you just performed. Henceforth you shall be known as the \"Slayer of Stupid, Incompetent, and Disappointing Minions.\"', '', 49070, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!', '', 49069, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23370, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals. Semicompetent help is SO hard to create.', '', 49068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23372, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... a shame to lose that experiment.', '', 49067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23361, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This fight has gotten a bit stale; allow me to spice things up!', '', 49066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop fighting yourself this instant, Chimaeron!', '', 49065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, you were expecting something else to happen just then, weren\'t you? Let\'s see how well YOU adapt after a new set of \"adjustments,\" shall we?', '', 49064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23363, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, Chimaeron, truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years, and the final result is truly something to behold.', '', 49063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23362, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You won? How... disappointing. I could have easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire.', '', 49062, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On second thought, what fun is an \"adequate\" challenge?', '', 49061, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23369, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found this fascinating specimen in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band.', '', 49060, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I should have known better than to rely on something so stupidly named to entertain me for long.', '', 49059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23373, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Were you planning on using Toxitron\'s chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan, let me ruin that for you.', '', 49058, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23378, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Lightning Conductor works much better in a crowd, yes?', '', 49057, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23377, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stupid Dwarves and your fascination with runes! Why would you create something that would help your enemy?', '', 49056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You would like to move away from that, wouldn\'t you? Too bad.', '', 49055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23375, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmm... the Omnotron Defense System. Centuries ago these constructs were considered the Dwarves\' greatest technical achievements. With so many counters to each construct\'s attacks, I\'ll have to rectify these designs for them to provide me any entertainment.', '', 49054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23374, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mortals that fancy themselves HEROES have entered the Broken Hall. Oh, I do hope this \"raid\" will amuse me more than the last.', '', 49053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 23379, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woohoo! We got us a convoy!', '', 49052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep yer eyes open, $n! That road is crawling with Dragonmaw.', '', 49051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to escort a delivery to Kirthaven.', 'I\'m here to escort a delivery to Kirthaven.', 49050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright!  Let\'s head down to the Swamp of Sorrows!', 'Alright!  Let\'s head down to the Swamp of Sorrows!', 49049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Need a ride, $g sugar: scumbag;?  Hop on.  We\'re headed down to Bogpaddle, and it\'s a one way trip.', 49048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah? Whadya want, ya mook? Be on the lookout for that no-good $n!$B$BNow get back to work!', '', 49047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lil\' green goblin gonna bleed for all ya done!', '', 49046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis here be our kaja\'mite! We mine it up with our own sweat an\' blood!', '', 49045, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe I take dem bombs from ya an\' we see who go boom!', '', 49044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Outa my way, mon. I\'m off ta join da pirates!', '', 49043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kezan for da trolls!', '', 49042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I not gonna take it anymore, mon!', '', 49041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya bring down da big badda dragon an\' destroy da island!', '', 49040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ya got some nerve, mon!', '', 49039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe the nerve of those trolls. Rebelling after all that I\'ve done for them!', '', 49038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a flight to the Bulwark, please.', 'I need a flight to the Bulwark, please.', 49037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a flight to Chillwind Camp, please.', 'I need a flight to Chillwind Camp, please.', 49036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll set the cap to auto-activate once you\'re at the villa. Just make sure you avoid those pigs!', 49035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insert coins to let Warrior-Matic NX-01 teach you how to Charge. Then use it on the training dummies.', '', 49034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you gotta do is learn how to cast Corruption, and then go use it on these training dummies that Bamm is shooting at. Corrupt \'em!', '', 49033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All you gotta do is let me teach you how to perform a Primal Strike and then use it on these training dummies that Bamm is shooting at.', '', 49032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
