('I\'d like to leave this place.', 'I\'d like to leave this place.', 48895, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I wasn\'t expecting anyone down here. Come to keep me company, or just looking for a way out?', 48894, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFFFFFFSofera\'s Naze, the first of the four fingers of Hillsbrad.|r', '', 48893, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My lute is all tuned up. Are we ready to compose something?', '', 48892, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a gryphon, Bibilfaz.  I\'m headed to Andorhal.  My king needs me!', 'I need a gryphon, Bibilfaz.  I\'m headed to Andorhal.  My king needs me!', 48891, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a bat, Timothy.  I\'m headed to Andorhal.  The Dark Lady needs me!', 'I need a bat, Timothy.  I\'m headed to Andorhal.  The Dark Lady needs me!', 48890, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready, Russell. Let\'s write a song!', 'I\'m ready, Russell. Let\'s write a song!', 48889, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a bat, Kellen.  I\'m headed to Western Plaguelands.  The Dark Lady needs me!', 'I need a bat, Kellen.  I\'m headed to Western Plaguelands.  The Dark Lady needs me!', 48888, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak your peace, $c.', '', 48887, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Bawdy:] \"Tight!\"', '[Bawdy:] \"Tight!\"', 48886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Silly:] \"Knifefight.\"', '[Silly:] \"Knifefight.\"', 48885, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Romantic:] \"Alight.\"', '[Romantic:] \"Alight.\"', 48884, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Bawdy:] \"...Chest?', '[Bawdy:] \"...Chest?\"', 48883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Silly:] \"Arrest.\"', '[Silly:] \"Arrest.\"', 48882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Romantic:] \"Blessed.\"', '[Romantic:] \"Blessed.\"', 48881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Bawdy:] \"Thighs!\"', '[Bawdy:] \"Thighs!\"', 48880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Silly:] \"Pint-Sized.\"', '[Silly:] \"Pint-Sized.\"', 48879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a gryphon, Guthrum.  I\'m headed to Western Plaguelands.  My king needs me!', 'I need a gryphon, Guthrum.  I\'m headed to Western Plaguelands.  My king needs me!', 48878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('[Romantic:] \"Wise.\"', '[Romantic:] \"Wise.\"', 48877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...Hmmm, okay, I think I can make that work. Last verse! A rousing celebration of love calling the Wildhammer to action!$B$BAll I need is a rhyme for \"Unite...\"', '', 48876, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, I see what kind of $c you are, $n! Now then, the second verse is all about Fanny and Firebeard getting together.$B$BWhat rhymes with \"Professed?\"', '', 48875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s get started! The first verse is all about dear Fanny, but I just can\'t quite put it together.$B$BWhat rhymes with \"Eyes?\"', '', 48874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hallo, friend!$B$BRussell\'s the name, and music is my business. All the great Wildhammer heroes from ages past are kept alive with song. Through the strings of my lute and the sound of my voice, our warriors gain immortality.$B$BStay a while, and listen!', '', 48873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you there, $n!', '', 48872, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I had no idea Sullah had so many... acquaintances.', '', 48871, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s goes into a murderous rage!', '%s goes into a murderous rage!', 48870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish to buy from you, Derak.', 'I wish to buy from you, Derak.', 48869, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Derak Nightfall, at your service!', '', 48868, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am freed! Let us slay Hallazeal in Neptulon\'s name, $n. He lurks within the temple.', 'I am freed! Let us slay Hallazeal in Neptulon\'s name, $n. He lurks within the temple.', 48867, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh no you didn\'t!', 48866, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Jack grunts something about the hammer being his weapon... you think.>', '', 48865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m tryin\' to run a business here!', '', 48864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just comin\' to see you. Honest!', '', 48863, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that thing, $g dude : toots;?', '', 48862, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Why\'s the ground shaking, $n?!', 48861, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good show!', '', 48860, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He had it coming.', '', 48859, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal will save us! We can be saved!', 'The crystal will save us! We can be saved!', 48858, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So tired... just want to rest...', 'So tired... just want to rest...', 48857, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again...', 'The crystal can still be found... if we can just find it again...', 48856, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s our fault... the destruction is all our fault...', 'It\'s our fault... the destruction is all our fault...', 48855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... I was to live forever... I will still...', 'No... I was to live forever... I will still...', 48854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children... what have I done?', 'My children... what have I done?', 48853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It was all her fault! She told us to steal it!', 'It was all her fault! She told us to steal it!', 48852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Blackrock Disguise, sir.  May I have another?', 'I lost my Blackrock Disguise, sir.  May I have another?', 48851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve my father and respect his plan... but I also serve my own sense of justice.  I have seen enough treachery from my Blackrock brothers to fill a thousand books.  And now they plan to invade Redridge, for no reason other than blind territorialism.$b$bThe treachery stops here.  It\'s time for the final chapter.  And it\'s not going to be a happy ending.', '', 48850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Blackrock orcs are my kin.  My father was a Blackrock, as was his father before him.  My mother was a Blackrock.  And I am a Blackrock.$b$bBut before anything else, I am an orc.  And that means honor above all else.$b$bMy Highlord has granted me leave to complete my task here in the Burning Steppes.  And I will not leave until the Blackrock orcs here learn the error of their ways.', '', 48849, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah!$b$bYou\'ve really stirred up a sandstorm, $n.', '', 48848, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yeah, get him!', '', 48847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tear him apart!', '', 48846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dog stares blankly at the wall...', '', 48845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their loot.', 'Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their Stolen Loot.', 48844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Rabid Mastiff slobbers all over the floor...', '', 48843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Rabid Mastiff growls...', '', 48842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins channelling power for a massive attack!', '', 48841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to make our way to the coffer without tipping off Schnottz and his boys.', '', 48840, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Listen!$b$bTaking out those crystals should drain the construct.', '', 48839, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thank you for the clean death. I would not have done the same...', '', 48838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Murder never gets old.', '', 48837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the quality of assassin sent to kill me? Laughable.', '', 48836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sylvanas sent you too, did she? No matter, your journey ends in agony.', '', 48835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ivar\'s pack failed horribly, so now he sends mercenaries. No matter, your journey ends in agony.', '', 48834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My new life was just beginning...', '', 48833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This childish effort ends now!', '', 48832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You shall annoy me no longer!', '', 48831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even here I find myself beset by fools!', '', 48830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our vigilance is eternal...', '', 48829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The attackers weaken!', '', 48828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One step closer to victory!', '', 48827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruders in the keep! To arms!', '', 48826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope your spirit finds solace.', '', 48825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May your soul rest in peace.', '', 48824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This death is only a temporary respite from my curse.', '', 48823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s bindings have been released! Full powers unlocked.', '', 48822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leave this accursed place at once!', '', 48821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Killed by lowly commoners. How droll...', '', 48820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic.', '', 48819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There was no sport in that kill.', '', 48818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tally ho! The hunt begins!', '', 48817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sun has set on this mortal world, fools. Make peace with your end, for the hour of twilight falls!', '', 48816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take out those crystals, $n! That should shut it down!', '', 48815, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be here ta learn fishin\', mon? Or maybe ta buy some tings for it?', 'You be here ta learn fishin\', mon? Or maybe ta buy some tings for it?', 48813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_whirlwind.blp:20|t Foe Reaper 5000 begins to activate |cFFFF0000|Hspell:88481|h[Overdrive]|h|r!', '', 48812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inscription', 'Inscription', 48811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be on top of de tall building in de southeast end of de valley.', 'Dey be on top of de tall building in de southeast end of de valley.', 48810, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Even the skies burn with my fury!', '', 48809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Constructing defense mechanism.', '', 48808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('System failure. Internal data corruption detected.$b$bConstructing defense mechanism.', '', 48807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like we do this the hard way. Let\'s go!', '', 48806, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Too good to be true. I might have known.', '', 48805, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, that went smoothly for a change.', '', 48804, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Know that what you did will save hundreds, maybe thousands of lives. You are also a true hero of the Horde, $n.', '', 48803, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('From Lordaeron to Kalimdor, they will know his name and they will sing songs of glory, praising the fallen champion of the Horde.', '', 48802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not mourn Orkus. He died with honor... with pride. He died a hero of the Horde.', '', 48801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s lifts Orkus\' lifeless body up.', '', 48800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He... He died to get this here?', '', 48799, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s reads the Alliance battle plan.', '', 48798, 0, 0, 432, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What happened? What have you got in your hands there?', '', 48797, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Burn in the liquid heat of the Firelands!', '', 48796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Codes accepted. Activating mechanism.', '', 48795, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bile-O-Tron signals in the affirmative and shuts down permanently.', '', 48794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This should just take a moment.', '', 48793, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...this way!', '', 48792, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gut\'s telling me....', '', 48791, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cannon was rigged with an explosive trap!', '', 48790, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n. Follow me!', '', 48789, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no gettin\' away this time, orc! You\'ve sung your last lok\'tar!', '', 48788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready when you are, Doctor Jones!', 'Ready when you are, Doctor Jones!', 48787, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, I\'m going to be using this orb to perform a powerful ritual in just a few minutes.  Don\'t tell anyone this... but I\'ll be summoning a pit lord.  Redridge will bow to the Blackrock!', '', 48786, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess I\'ll just... leave the sleeping imps right over here?  Are these even... imps?  Gah!', '', 48785, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on boys, let\'s eat!  My favorite soldier brought enough worg for everyone!', '', 48784, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your conspirator has informed me of your plan.  I shall see you on the battlefield... painted with the ashes of the elementals.', '', 48783, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget that disguise!', '', 48782, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish.  Just make sure they don\'t come to no harm.', '', 48781, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flamestar!  I can return these dragons to their kind.  Let me take care of them.', '', 48780, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' Please take care of Kasha. Make sure she finds a cold place to live.', '', 48779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the best friend that Orkus has ever had, $p. *Orkus coughs*', '', 48778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I can use that horse to make it the rest of the way.  Thanks!', 'I think I can use that horse to make it the rest of the way.  Thanks!', 48777, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you really here to rescue me?  Great, lets go!', 'Are you really here to rescue me?  Great, lets go!', 48776, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be sure to talk to the MacGraffs, inside the sanctuary. They\'ll be orchestratin\' the ceremonies.', 48775, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somewhere safe...', '', 48774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I never knew anyone like you. You saved me, $p. More than once. I... I know it\'s selfish, but I have something to ask of you.', '', 48773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('K... Kasha... you... came back for me...', '', 48772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FORGET ABOUT ME, KASHA! GO!', '', 48771, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s keep moving. There\'s a lot at stake here.', '', 48770, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KASHA, GET $P OUT OF HERE!', '', 48769, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Archmage Pratt\"? To fel with formality; my vanity died with the rest of me. \"Charles\" or even a simple \"Chaz\" will do, thank you.', '', 48768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s a real powder-keg that one. She\'d make a fine Firebeard! Y\'think the Thundermars would go for it?', '', 48767, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The %s flickers warmly, granting a portion of its power to $n in thanks.', '', 48766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GET THE PLANS AND GO!', '', 48765, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CAN YOU SMELL WHAT THE LOK\'TAR IS COOKIN\'?!', '', 48764, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo! I\'m Kall Worthaton, Bilgewater Trikes.$B$BGo ahead, look over the lot. Pick out the trike that you REALLY want!$B$BA trike that\'s a blast to ride... a trike that\'s dangerous and death-defying... a trike you can be PROUD of!$B$BYou let me know when you see it, and we\'ll make a deal.', 'Yo! I\'m Kall Worthaton, Bilgewater Trikes.$B$BGo ahead, look over the lot. Pick out the trike that you REALLY want!$B$BA trike that\'s a blast to ride... a trike that\'s dangerous and death-defying... a trike you can be PROUD of!$B$BYou let me know when you see it, and we\'ll make a deal.', 48763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wish I could make you a deal, partner - I really do - but you\'ll need to be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel, first.', 'I wish I could make you a deal, partner - I really do - but you\'ll need to be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel, first.', 48762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I lost my Blackrock Disguise, Colonel.  May I have another?', 'I lost my Blackrock Disguise, Colonel.  May I have another?', 48761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
