('You ready to ride?', 'You ready to ride, babe?', 48750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I\'ll teach you how to ride.', 'You gotta be exalted with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I\'ll teach you how to ride, babe.', 48749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta be friendly with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I\'ll teach you how to ride.', 'You gotta be friendly with the Bilgewater Cartel goblins before I\'ll teach you how to ride, babe.', 48748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look there, near the map table! The Stormpike Battle Master holds the Alliance battle plans!', '', 48747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ve made yer way to Chiselgrip, $g lad: lass;.  Best make yerself useful.', '', 48746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CAREFUL! Vanndar, Balinda and Bloodfang are right there also.', '', 48745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('STOP! GET DOWN, $n!', '', 48744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This all feels like a long shot.  We\'ve got a lot riding on this plan.  Redridge\'s freedom, for one.', '', 48743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let those damned orcs invade Redridge again!', '', 48742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see that, $n? What a woman!', '', 48741, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ogres - ya kilt \'em!', '', 48740, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye! We\'re here to rescue you!', '', 48739, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aye, they was getting\' a wee handsy, so I took care of it. C\'mon then, I\'m done here.', 48738, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Took yer sweet time, didn\'tcha?', 48737, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n? What are you doing here? And is that Keegan Firebeard behind you?', 48736, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Woo!', 48735, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers and sisters of the Horde, Orgimmar is under attack!  Take up your arms and defend our capital!  If you are unable to wage war against the intruders, then help place barricades to fortify our city!  LOK\'TAR OGAR!', '', 48734, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Better to rot in this cell than live as a dishonorable traitor.', '', 48733, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bastard.', '', 48732, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m trying to convince Godfrey to just kill all of you to end your misery, but he keeps telling me no. More pain and suffering for the lot of you, then!', '', 48731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I had my way, you would be long dead. Your kind disgusts me.', '', 48730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A few of us here have lived in this land since the Scythe of Elune first passed through it. Most suffered through the fall of Gilneas.$B$BWe have settled in this forest to learn the ways of nature and uphold its balance. In this cursed land, our cursed people have found a new way of life.', 48729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your voice low, and your scent downwind.', '', 48728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have a ride to Talonbranch Glade courtesy of James Hallow.', 'I have a ride to Talonbranch Glade courtesy of James Hallow.', 48727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me! But don\'t tell Ferli, ok? I said I busted out on my own!', '', 48726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None pass!', '', 48725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oil leak! OIL LEAK! Someone\'s done flipped the switch!', '', 48724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When you\'re doggone tired, it\'s mighty easy to slip up on the job, pardner! Be sure to get at least two hours\' rest between shifts!', '', 48723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deputy Clunky wants all his buckaroos to stay safe, and have a good ol\' fun time, assumin\' you meet your contract-stipulated servitude quota! Gosh!', '', 48722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Always wear head protection while on the job! You never know when Miss Darla might have to smack you in the face!', '', 48721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve been wrasslin\' with oil, be sure to avoid all sources of sparks or open flame, such as candles, lighters, mages, Kester\'s shop, and Deputy Clunky!', '', 48720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we stop these dwarves and worgen we will be celebrated as great heroes of the Horde!', '', 48719, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have heard tale of the Maelstrom itself opening up, threatening to devour the world. Could you imagine such a thing?', '', 48718, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found Kasha in Icecrown. She was injured and dying. I managed to carry her back to the Shadow Vault where the death knights helped nurse her back to health. We are now the best of friends.', '', 48717, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hillsbrad has changed. Back in my day Hillsbrad was a place of constant battle. The humans and dwarves of Southshore would constantly attack the Horde at Tarren Mill. There were days when you could look out past the intersection at Darrow Hill and see a thousand people battling. Glory days, $n - they\'ll pass you by.', '', 48716, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, just between you and me, I never saw the fall of the Lich King. And... well... I\'ve never been to Ulduar. I... well... I am a dungeon explorer. Yes. I prefer exploring dungeons with allies. The pay is excellent and the risk is low.', '', 48715, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I liked the worgen better when they were a disorganized mess that you\'d run into in small packs. This new Gilnean worgen alliance is much more difficult to deal with.', '', 48714, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If Ivar Bloodfang is here, where is Darius Crowley?', '', 48713, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I wasn\'t there, but I heard that Sylvanas died in Silverpine and that her precious val\'kyr resurrected her at the cost of their own lives. Know anything about it?', '', 48712, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Varian Wrynn... I saw him fight once at Dire Maul. He killed five feral scar yetis with his bare hands. Pretty good for a human, no?', '', 48711, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I ever tell you about the time I met Varok Saurfang? I asked him to sign my massive pectoral muscles. He backhanded me instead, which is why I sometimes forget things now. It was totally worth it.', '', 48710, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t get me wrong, $n, I like Thrall. He was a strong leader, but I don\'t think he was cut out to lead the Horde. Not in a time of war!', '', 48709, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
