('$B$B|cFFFFFFFFAs I emerged from the outhouse, I saw them! It should be noted that Orkus prefers silence when he is doing his duty.|r$B', '', 48626, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh, the lok\'tar must have been cooking up a turd - which would explain the smell.', '', 48625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|cFFFFFFFFI had just finished making use of the facilities on the docks when...|r', '', 48624, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here, what\'s this?', '', 48623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Colin is massing the Thundermars for a full-on assault of Glopgut\'s Hollow. ', '', 48622, 7, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I plan on creating a wonder of my own for them to behold...', '', 48621, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Glopgut ogres stormed Thundermar while Colin was here at the summit. They kidnapped Fanny and ran for the hills!', '', 48620, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('People will come from all over Azeroth to marvel at her wonders.', '', 48619, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Haaaaaalp!', '', 48618, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can see that Uldum will one day transform from a dangerous wilderness to a tourist magnet!', '', 48617, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lira sent me to watch your backs. If Obsidia is in here, I\'ll keep her busy while you finish her off.', '', 48616, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some are easy for even simple men to discern, while others require wisdom to see.', '', 48615, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uldum is full of treasures, my friend.', '', 48614, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But that will all change one day, $n. And when it does, those with vision will be prepared.', '', 48613, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When it becomes difficult to tell friend from foe...', '', 48612, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It becomes so easy to take it all for granted when danger surrounds us at every turn.', '', 48611, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a beautiful land this is, wouldn\'t you say?', '', 48610, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come! Walk with me, $n.', '', 48609, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes $n, I heard the whole miserable thing from out here.$B$BI was hoping my old Wildhammer brothers could work things out among themselves, but it doesn\'t look like it.$B$BYou and I are going to have to get creative.  ', '', 48608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.$B$BTo join them all back together isn\'t going to be easy. ', '', 48607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Explain to Orkus that he is standing in shallow water.|TInterface\\GossipFrame\\GOSSIPGOSSIPICON.blp:32|t', '', 48606, 0, 11188, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your feet are touching the ground, Orkus. This is shallow water. Just stand up and walk to shore.', 'Your feet are touching the ground, Orkus. This is shallow water. Just stand up and walk to shore.', 48605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not survive!$B$B*GULP*$B$BHELP ME!', '', 48604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KASHA! NO!!', '', 48603, 0, 11188, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kasha! Come to me! I am fine!', '', 48602, 0, 11188, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh... OH! YES! Orkus has regained his senses! The foul human mage must have cursed Orkus\' mind. Quickly we must get to shore! Kasha is hurt!', '', 48601, 0, 11188, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thundermar, if we weren\'t on holy ground I\'d pop you one so hard yer shoes would be the only thing left standin\'!', '', 48600, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unity? Now? The Thundermars weren\'t exactly unitin\' when them Twilight Shaman tore open our stronghold on the shore.', '', 48599, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t have to take this. I\'ll be part of no Alliance that has a Firebeard innit. That\'s me final word!', '', 48598, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, that\'s just like a Firebeard, can\'t see anything past yer own fat nose. We were up to arses and elbows in Dragonmaw. But did you send a single bird to help? NO!', '', 48597, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lord!', '', 48596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach! This\'ll be harder than I thought.', '', 48595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gentlemen, please -', '', 48594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!', '', 48593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No? Well... my offer stands. Just come by anytime and I\'ll be glad to give you the makeover you\'ve always dreamed of.', '', 48592, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your bodies are all magnificent! If you\'d be willing to take a small whiff of this chloroform, I promise that you will all wake up 10 times stronger and 100 times more... unified in purpose.', '', 48591, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Conclave of Wind is nearing full strength!', '', 48590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Friends. The Wildhammer way of life is threatened. Our enemies are too numerous for us to remain isolated from one another. We must unite!', '', 48589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Finally, the agony ceases....', 'Finally, the agony ceases....', 48588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The curse ends!', 'The curse ends!', 48587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, $n. My torment is now at an end.', 'Thank you, $n. My torment is now at an end.', 48586, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enjoy my fine wares.', '', 48585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You all love to hate him, and he\'s glad to shower his hate right back down on ya. LETS... GET... BLOODY!!!', '', 48584, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde have been relentless out here.  Feels like we are fighting two battles at one time.', 'The Horde have been relentless out here.  Feels like we are fighting two battles at one time.\n', 48583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like we have one more challenger yet to face though, so let\'s get those wagers in!', '', 48582, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seems like we never run out of things to do around here.  New orders arrive every day at 3am, it\'s really strange.', 'Seems like we never run out of things to do around here.  New orders arrive every day at 3am, it\'s really strange.', 48581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no denying it - they really put that dog down! So much for our former champion!', '', 48580, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to baradin base camp.  I know it does not look like much now, but with a little hard work we can whip this place into shape.', 'Welcome to baradin base camp.  I know it does not look like much now, but with a little hard work we can whip this place into shape.', 48579, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lots to be done around here, $r.  Are you ready to help?', 'Lots to be done around here, $r.  Are you ready to help?', 48578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... is only... the beginning, mortals! You will... ALL DIE!', '', 48577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If I am to understand all that is transpiring, if I am to make a difference, then my devotion must be absolute.  I must submit.', '', 48576, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear what both of you are saying and am grateful for the counsel.', '', 48575, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go\'el.  You cannot continue to ride the line between Warchief and Shaman.  The time will come when you must commit to one side fully.  That time is fast approaching.', 48574, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aggra shoots Gavan a disapproving look.', 'Aggra shoots Gavan a disapproving look.', 48573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thrall, you must fully devote yourself to the cause.', '', 48572, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your heart, your love for your land and your people is what has led you here.  It was neither your armor nor your weapons.', 48571, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dwarf speaks the truth.  If you wish to commune with the elements you must do so from the heart.  ', 48570, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The clothing is merely a manifestation of a larger problem.  I\'ve no doubt that you are here to learn, but you must commit yourself both in spirit and in form.', '', 48569, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My clothing?!  Is that what this has come to now?  We debate the merits of my clothing?', '', 48568, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You say you have come to seek knowledge and understanding, but you are dressed for battle.  That is why I question you and your willingness to do what must be done.', 48567, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes I know, Go\'el.  Thrall is the leader of the Horde, but you are not here in that capacity.  Look at you: At what you are wearing...', 48566, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have told you to call me Thrall.', '', 48565, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have heard you before.  You are here to save your world; to learn from ours.  Greatmother Geyah has charged me with instructing you, and as such, you will listen to me, Go\'el.', 48564, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Would I be here if this were not serious?', '', 48563, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See to it that they are made to feel MOST welcome, hmmm? After all, their bones will be lying here for a long, LONG time...', '', 48562, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doubtless they are incensed by my meddling with their fragile little homes.', '', 48561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I felt that one from the stands! I think we have a clear winner here boys, and the bodyparts littering the arena agree', '', 48560, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DESTROYED! DOMINATED! DECIMATED! DELICIOUSLY DISMEMBERED! You do it just like I like it!', '', 48559, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHOA! Call in the cleaning crew. They made a mess of that challenger!', '', 48558, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bah, couldn\'t you have dragged it out a bit! People don\'t pay me when you make it look that easy! Add some theatrics to it, will ya?!', '', 48557, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OOOOOOOH! Check that mess out! Amazing win! Way to stick it through him!', '', 48556, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Painful but beautiful! Gurgthock gives you what you want! The best display of carnage in Azeroth. Show me some love, people!', '', 48555, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ladies and gentlemen, these deliverers of dismemberment have come out VICTORIOUS! Bets on the next round start now! Let\'s get this money flowin\'.', '', 48554, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cut, bruised, and covered with blood - looks like we have a new winner!', '', 48553, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, our esteemed guests have arrived!', '', 48552, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alsudar the Bastion and the other warrior trainers may be found overlooking Farstriders\' Square, from near the foundry.', 'Alsudar the Bastion and the other warrior trainers may be found overlooking Farstriders\' Square, from near the foundry.', 48551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I never called any dragons...', '', 48550, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quickly, everyone run toward those dragons!  All troops, towards the dragons!  The dragons will save us!', '', 48549, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The pit lord\'s loose!  We\'re doomed!  Retreat!', '', 48548, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It... it\'s not doing anything!  The pit lord is loose!', '', 48547, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And now to quickly use the Orb of Domination, before the pit lord turns on us.', '', 48546, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One, two, three, four, I declare a thumb war!', '', 48545, 8, 0, 50, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re both failures.  But it doesn\'t matter: with a pit lord on our side, we won\'t need foot soldiers OR dragons.  Behold!', '', 48544, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Besides, I\'ve been busy dealing with other issues.  Dozens of my dragons died when those two enemies swept through the front lines.', '', 48543, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Imps, flamekin, whatever!  I don\'t know warlock crap.  Demons all look the same to me!', '', 48542, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Delivered?  Woke up?  What are you even talking about?  Were you attacked by flamekin?', '', 48541, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Those imps you had delivered... they woke up and started shooting fireballs at everybody!  It was chaos!', '', 48540, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.  Well, do the best you can.  And Neeralak, why are you all black and smoky?', '', 48539, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Timan fell from the Pillar of Ash.  Othana was eaten by wolves.  Gorlop fell in lava.  And most of my sergeants were killed in a freak cudgelling accident.', '', 48538, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you still lead your troops?  Do you need to promote one of your sergeants?', '', 48537, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT?  No reason... it\'s just... something is very wrong with my stomach.  I think it\'s something I ate.', '', 48536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are nearly prepared to start this battle, brothers.  Thorg\'izog, what is the matter?  Why are you covering your butt like that?', '', 48535, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The land suffers... and RAGES!', '', 48534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No I am!', '', 48532, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I\'m da best at watchin\' da door.', '', 48531, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only for da bad guys.', '', 48530, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dats dangerous.', '', 48529, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine gots a RUSTY nail!', '', 48528, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine gots a bigger nail!', '', 48527, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mine gots a nail in it!', '', 48526, 0, 0, 36, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me got a big board for hit things!', '', 48525, 0, 0, 36, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, me!', '', 48524, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Me da best bodyguard!', '', 48523, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Howdy, partner! Miss Darla built me to make sure all you lil\' pilgrims stay nice an\' safe!$B$BBe sure to listen to Deputy Clunky\'s down-home safety tips! Yeehaw!', '', 48522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re truly a force to be reckoned with. The beast is done with. Let\'s get out of here. ', 48521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well look who it is!  The cudgel-bearer $g himself: herself;!', '', 48520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t stand being cooped up in here with all these warlocks.  This is Xi\'lun\'s job, not mine!$b$bI can\'t wait for this battle to start.  I need to be outside, with my dragons.', '', 48519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it, underling?  Can\'t you see I\'m busy?', '', 48518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Victory to the Forsaken!', 48517, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Such glorious, beautiful power!', 48516, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lordaeron is ours!', 48515, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am renewed!', 48514, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our enemies will perish!', 48513, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know I\'d gladly blow myself up for the company with you in charge, boss!', 'You know I\'d gladly blow myself up for the company with you in charge, boss!', 48512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s that crazy Hobart Grapplehammer\'s fault! Someone ought to fire that guy and promote his assistant!', 'It\'s that crazy Hobart Grapplehammer\'s fault! Someone ought to fire that guy and promote his assistant!', 48511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Normally, I\'d just shrug off an explosion like that, but I think someone got the nitro and kaja\'mite mixture wrong.', 'Normally, I\'d just shrug off an explosion like that, but I think someone got the nitro and kaja\'mite mixture wrong.', 48510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Working conditions are horrible under Trade Prince Gallywix. I hope you become the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!', 'Working conditions are horrible under Trade Prince Gallywix. I hope you become the new Trade $g Prince : Princess;!', 48509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This healing stuff sure does beat having to pay for medical insurance!', 'This healing stuff sure does beat having to pay for medical insurance!', 48508, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope this isn\'t coming out of my pocket!', 'I hope this isn\'t coming out of my pocket!', 48507, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'d gone an hour without an injury report. That\'s a new record!', 'We\'d gone an hour without an injury report. That\'s a new record!', 48506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks, boss!', 'Thanks, boss!', 48505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber.', 'Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber.', 48504, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go.', 48503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...but here I shall remain, forever.', 48502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It pleases me, after all, to cause such strife in the world above... to shake, to shatter, to swallow and crush...', 48501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But do not despair, ogre. I will continue to aid you and your... cult. ', 48500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Terramok is my home, not my prison. The remains of my beloved make it so.', 48499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Watch your tongues, servant of Deathwing. Do you think me a fool?!', 48498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well. With your permission, Princess.', '', 48497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vaults of the Titans grow weak as chaos flourishes. This prison can no longer contain you.', '', 48496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No longer are you bound here, great Princess. Have you not heard?', '', 48495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
