('I am thankful for all you\'ve done, $n.  But I am afraid I will be even further in your debt before this ordeal is through.', '', 48347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are a very bad person.', '', 48346, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I want to go home.', '', 48345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please stop.', '', 48344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s throws up.', '', 48343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is your idea of doing the right thing???', '', 48342, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Disgusting. They\'re of no use to us without their heads.', '', 48341, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have issues.', '', 48340, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CUT IT OUT! You\'re getting blood all over my robe.', '', 48339, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know, you can probably just free them. I won\'t tell anyone.', '', 48338, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have done some pretty twisted things, but what you\'re doing here is crossing a threshold even for me.', '', 48337, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bring you back from the brink of death, $Gbrother:sister;. We are in need of your aid!', '', 48336, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gorlop wonder if other lava hot?', '', 48335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This lava hot.', '', 48334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Polishing Vigorously', 'Polishing Vigorously', 48333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Augh sounds like a name I can trust. Lead the way!', 'Augh sounds like a name I can trust. Lead the way!', 48332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEY! You dere! You want treasure? Augh know where to gets golds and shinies. Follow Augh to Lost City of Tol\'vir? Augh promise no steal.', '', 48331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('OWIE!  GORLOP CAN\'T MOVE!  GORLOP GONNA FALL!', '', 48330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HEX YOU!  HEX YOU!  HEX YOU!', '', 48329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OW, MON!', '', 48328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'NO!  AHHHHHHH!!!!', 48327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No... no... get them away from me!', 48326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ahh!  I... I can\'t move!', 48325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think that you\'ve won? THINK AGAIN! Stand before my new form and tremble!', '', 48324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Quit your whining, you worthless wolves!', 48323, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll make you bleed, you weak little sacks of bones!', 48322, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stinking curs had better enjoy the taste of my whip!', 48321, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You wolves are worthless!  Worthless!', 48320, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You stupid mongrels!  I ought to whip you all to death!', 48319, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nope.. not yet.', '', 48318, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Woohoo!$b$bWe\'ll have to do that again sometime!$b$bWell, I\'m off to do some more research. I\'ll catch up to you when I\'m ready.', '', 48317, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank heavens!  It\'s so good to see...  Why are your pants on backwards?', 'Thank heavens!  It\'s so good to see...  Why are your pants on backwards?', 48316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m back, Sis!', 'I\'m back, Sis!', 48315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them all! They will serve as subjects for our next study!', '', 48314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What I\'ve created here is an evolution! THIS is how the Forsaken will thrive, not through some magical winged fairy sprinkling happy dust on corpses!', '', 48313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I AM A THREAT? I AM DERANGED?! ', '', 48312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KNEEL!', '', 48311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That goes for all of you traitorous scum who supported this fool!', '', 48310, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warden Stillwater, you are deranged and a threat to our way of life. By authority of the Dark Lady herself, I hereby impose upon you the harshest penalty allowed under Forsaken law - true death.', '', 48309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you, Jenny? I thought we had a connection. You\'ve broken my heart for the last time.', '', 48308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now I know where your allegiances lie, $n!', '', 48307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lydon!? Alive?', '', 48306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been placed in command of Alliance joint operations in the Twilight Highlands.$B$BThe independent Wildhammer clans still dot this countryside. If we can unite them under the Alliance banner, nothing can stop us! But enemies close in on all sides. I hope you\'re ready for a fight, $c.', '', 48305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank the stars!  Now turn around so I can put them on.', 'Thank the stars!  Now turn around so I can put them on.', 48304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('I\'m ready, Flintlocke. Take me to the Highlands!', 'I\'m ready, Flintlocke. Take me to the Highlands!', 48303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pack yer bags, $n! We\'re off to the Twilight Highlands. You ready?', '', 48302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh, wot?', '', 48301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salvage the Stone Power Core.  These are rare!', 'Salvage the Stone Power Core.  These are rare!', 48300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salvage the Thorium Gearshaft.', 'Salvage the Thorium Gearshaft.', 48299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salvage the Obsidian Piston.', 'Salvage the Obsidian Piston.', 48298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Salvage the Flux Exhaust Sieve.', 'Salvage the Flux Exhaust Sieve.', 48297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You find a few salvageable parts in the ruined creature\'s hull.  It looks like you will only be able to salvage one part.', '', 48296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training level sufficient.  Returning to guard duty.  Thank you.', '', 48295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Self-training complete!', '', 48294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN IN MY HATRED!', '', 48293, 0, 11041, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See now the product of your meddling!', '', 48292, 0, 11041, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m here to help you with your combat training, golem.', 'I\'m here to help you with your combat training, golem.', 48291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, friend of the Brotherhood.', '', 48290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defeated.  Shame level: High.  Adjusting strategy for future battles.', '', 48289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Battle result: embarrassing failure.  Incorporating new methods into battle regimen.', '', 48288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pummeling received.  Adjusting battle parameters...', '', 48287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beatdown received.  Optimizing strategy for next battle...', '', 48286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re not leaving me to rot in this place! Take me with you!', '', 48285, 0, 11051, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I won\'t let them get away with this, Twinkles. They will pay! They will all pay!', '', 48284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TWINKLES! TWINKLES! NOOOOO!!', '', 48283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 15131, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Feed, children!  Take your fill from their meaty husks!', 48282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See ya around, kid.', '', 48281, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Meet me in Ramkahen and I\'ll tell you what our next step should be.', '', 48280, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s no telling how we might use the power these mechanisms create.', '', 48279, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to need to research what we\'ve learned here, $n.', '', 48278, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take a look at this holotable. I want to show you a bit about Operation: Gnomeregan.', '', 48277, 0, 11832, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A shadowy figure appears in the ship\'s cabin!', '', 48276, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'That cat-creature chained back there looks like he wants to talk.  Maybe he can help us... but be careful.', 48275, 0, 11034, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done!  I was about to jump in!  But it looked like you had it under control.', 48274, 0, 11034, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here comes the guard, $n!  Take him out!', 48273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Crap!  That was my last lock pick!', 48272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Please don\'t break... please don\'t break....', 48271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get your filthy hands off of me, $R.', 'Get your filthy hands off of me, $R.', 48270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Taste my axe, coward!', 'Taste my axe, coward!', 48269, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could go on fighting like this forever.  What is it you truly want?', '', 48268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius.  He controls a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul\'dan.  It is responsible for corrupting these forests.', '', 48267, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t need your pity, $C.', 'I don\'t need your pity, $C.', 48266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here I am, $g sir:madam; $n!', '', 48265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetings, $c! I\'m from the Highbank advance scouting unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.$B$BTheir gryphon riders are having a tough time bringing down Dragonmaw drake riders. I\'ve got a plan for a contraption that will help, but I\'m going to need supplies. Lots of supplies.$B$BCan you help?', '', 48264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re done practicing so soon?  Very well, I\'ll see you later.', '', 48263, 0, 11099, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m from the Highbank advance unit, trying to win over the Wildhammer here at Thundermar.$B$BI think I can help them out, but can you believe that they don\'t have a single tri-cyclic alternating current re-polarization device? Not a one!$B$BHow do they even get by?', '', 48262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s\'s corpse disintegrates into frothing twilight essence.', '', 48261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is revived by the commingled essences!', '', 48260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight essence begins to bubble forth from the corpse of the whelp....', '', 48259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kitty... KITTY! I\'M SO SORRY, KITTY! COME BACK! DON\'T LEAVE ME LIKE THIS!', 48258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU THERE! Yes, you, $c! I have been captured against my will and imprisoned illegaly by Warden Stillwater. Get me out of this cage and I will explain everything.', '', 48257, 0, 11024, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Open wide, Mr. Tauren! Here comes the hippogryph into the roost!', 48256, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HLORRHGH!', '', 48255, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Urrrrrrgh...', '', 48254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thundermar is the last holdout of the Wildhammer. My brother\'s trying to keep up the fight while our little town fills up with refugees.', 48253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Blundy peers up from his cups.>$B$BAye, that\'s right. The High Shaman is out in the field, fighting to retake the Thundermar Wreckage. I\'m whatcha call the \"Low Shaman.\"$B$BWhile he\'s away, he left me here, to take care of all of Thundermar\'s Shamanin\'in... nin.', '', 48252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Curse the Dragonmaw!$B$BThey kill our birds, attack our families, take our land. Even as the world crashes down around us, still they assault our homes.$B$BIf your Alliance wants the help of the Wildhammer, there\'s only one way to win us over: Stop. The. Dragonmaw.', '', 48251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How much longer are you going to cry?', '', 48250, 0, 11024, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR STILLWATER! KILL ME! DO IT NOW!', '', 48249, 0, 11024, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is this Stillwater\'s plan? To torture me before he kills me?', '', 48248, 0, 11024, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('KILL ME OR KILL THE GIRL!', '', 48247, 0, 11024, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you want a dolly, little girl? Would that make it better?', '', 48246, 0, 11024, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Somebody shut this little girl up!', '', 48245, 0, 11024, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have ye brought me?', '', 48244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I brought you some hides, mud, and thread.', 'I brought you some hides, mud, and thread.', 48243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ye\'ll not find a finer craftsman than I in all the Dark Irons!$b$bHammerin\', smithin\', and diggin\' be damned!  A needle and a thimble\'s all the metal I need!', '', 48242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This... this is perfect!  This disguise shall be my masterpiece!', '', 48241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ach!  Everything else looks good, but there\'s too much thread!', '', 48240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve got the proper amounts of mud and hide, but not enough thread to hold it together.', '', 48239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to need more mud to properly color your disguise.', '', 48238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve brought me way too much worg-hide, $n!', '', 48237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, this is far too much mud.  Your disguise will be too dark and gloppy.', '', 48236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s not nearly enough hide here to make a proper disguise.', '', 48235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If the rumors about you are true, stranger, I will gladly join you in the fight against the Neferset!', '', 48234, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will defend our lands!', '', 48233, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will defend Ramkahen with my bare hands if I have to!', '', 48232, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time we started doing something.', '', 48231, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The $r that rescued Prince Nadun is the only $r that I\'ll ever take orders from.', '', 48230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard of what you did in Orsis.  I will be honored to fight along your side.', '', 48229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... aunt died?  I can\'t believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral.', 48228, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... uncle died?  I can\'t believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral.', 48227, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... sister died?  I can\'t believe I never even met her.  Take this money and give him a good funeral.', 48226, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My... brother died?  I can\'t believe I never even met him.  Take this money and give him a good funeral.', 48225, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Thanks so much!  I\'m glad I could extend the warranty on my cast iron pots for another month.', 48224, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know I worked a hundred and sixty eight hours last week... but if the paperwork says I didn\'t clock in, maybe you\'re right.', '', 48223, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really need to stop gambling.  Tell them no more cards for me.', '', 48222, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I really need to stop gambling.  Tell them no more cards for me.', '', 48221, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can\'t believe you sell those here, of all places.  I\'ll swing by the cook later to pick them up.', 48220, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They had what on them?  Tell the tailor my ceremonial robes had better be perfect with everything she\'s charging me.', 48219, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An account of all the fractions of copper we round off... brilliant.', '', 48218, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I couldn\'t have miscalculated your interest... because we don\'t give any!  I\'d rather pay than be subjected to the trials, so take my personal cash.', '', 48217, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It appears as if that gold we recovered from the dead rogue was yours.  You certainly are lucky...', '', 48216, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you caught a thief.  Enjoy your finder\'s fee!', '', 48215, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Investigate the hides.', 'Investigate the hides.', 48214, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take four spools of thread.', 'Take four spools of thread.', 48213, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take three spools of thread.', 'Take three spools of thread.', 48212, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take two spools of thread.', 'Take two spools of thread.', 48211, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take one spool of thread.', 'Take one spool of thread.', 48210, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take four handfuls of mud.', 'Take four handfuls of mud.', 48209, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
