('WERE YOU IN SILVERPINE WHEN THE BANSHEE QUEEN KILLED ALL OF THE WORGEN!?', '', 48075, 0, 10979, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHO ARE OUR FRIENDS?', '', 48074, 0, 10979, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHEN I WOKE UP I SAW THE BANSHEE QUEEN TALKING TO A BIG BROWN ORC!', '', 48073, 0, 10979, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THANKS FOR RESCUING ME!', '', 48072, 0, 10979, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THESE HUMANS LOOK DANGEROUS!', '', 48071, 0, 10979, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THERE\'S ONE OVER THERE!', '', 48070, 0, 10979, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I USED TO BE A FARMER!', '', 48069, 0, 10979, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These glorious fields weren\'t always here, $c. Only through determination and the strength of will did we turn the decrepit human farms into Lordaeron\'s largest and most productive sludge and mushroom plantation.$B$BNow all of that could be lost due to a simple accident!', '', 48068, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 396, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS ONE IS ANGRY!', '', 48067, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HOW DID ALL THESE PEOPLE GET IN HERE?!?', '', 48066, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HERE\'S ONE!', '', 48065, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THIS IS EASY! YES!', '', 48064, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BEAT THEM DOWN THEN KILL! THEN SHACKLE!', '', 48063, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('TARREN MILL! OK! IS THAT IN THE BARRENS! I\'M ON MY WAY! THANKS!', '', 48062, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wow, yea, that\'s great. I\'m SO HAPPY to see that $P helped you out of the mine, postponing your tragic and inevitable death. Now why don\'t you scurry along now. I hear Tarren Mill is looking for Forsaken just like you, Dumass.', '', 48061, 0, 10980, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YAY! CAPTAIN I AM BACK! HOORAY!', '', 48060, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('WHAT\'S TAKING SO LONG? I\'M LEAVING! BYE!', '', 48059, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Escort Dumass out of the mine safely. Keep Dumass away from webbed humans.', '', 48058, 0, 10979, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THANKS! HI! LET\'S ROUND UP SOME HUMANS FOR THE CAPTAIN!', '', 48057, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic mortal... I will build a new empire atop your corpse!', '', 48056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No... NO! This is my domain! You cannot have... it...', '', 48055, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Beat me to it, I see. Your exit awaits...', 48054, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('|c0000FF00The Bile-O-Tron is back online!|r', '', 48053, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|c00FF0000Chimaeron\'s Massacre has knocked the Bile-O-Tron offline!|r', '', 48052, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The high elf mage and scholar Dariness is the city\'s most learned archaeologist... and the most sociable.$B$BShe can often be found in the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city\'s center, enjoying the atmosphere or discussing her wild adventures with the proprieters and patrons both.', 'The high elf mage and scholar Dariness is the city\'s most learned archaeologist... and the most sociable.$B$BShe can often be found in the Legerdemain Lounge, just north of the city\'s center, enjoying the atmosphere or discussing her wild adventures with the proprieters and patrons both.', 48051, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Highborne Archmage, Aranhir Starsinger, is a master of arcane reforging... you might convince him to aid you.\n\nHe can often be found discussing his craft with those of Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.', 'The Highborne Archmage, Aranhir Starsinger, is a master of arcane reforging... you might convince him to aid you.\n\nHe can often be found discussing his craft with those of Simply Enchanting, just outside the Magus Commerce Exchange in northwest Dalaran.', 48050, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boduro the Seeker can often be found in the merchant\'s bazaar within the Lower City. I would look for him there.', 'Boduro the Seeker can often be found in the merchant\'s bazaar within the Lower City. I would look for him there.', 48049, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sarus, I lost my spider. Could I have another?', 'Sarus, I lost my spider. Could I have another?', 48048, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings, $c!', 48047, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dese caves be haunted, mon. Filled with the worst juju.$B$BIn days when de Twilight\'s Hammer be settin\' up atop de mountain, the unworthy were tossed into dese caverns. Into de Gullet. Food for de black drakes dat once nested here.$B$BDem people, dey never come out. Not even de spirits.', 48046, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I vill vorry about zhe drivink!', '', 48045, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looking for Diya, wandering among the images around the Seat of the Naaru. She will be more than happy to help you.', 'Looking for Diya, wandering among the images around the Seat of the Naaru. She will be more than happy to help you.', 48044, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s all gone to hell, $c!', '', 48043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You vorry about zhe killink!', '', 48042, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('One of Darnassus\' Highborne, an Arcane Reforger, is working with the Exodar\'s enchanters.  You\'ll find them all in the Crystal Hall, opposite the jewel crafters.', 'One of Darnassus\' Highborne, an Arcane Reforger, is working with the Exodar\'s enchanters.  You\'ll find them all in the Crystal Hall, opposite the jewel crafters.', 48041, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Find the codes to release me from these infernal bonds!', 48040, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The city\'s Arcane Reforger, Enchantress Fira, will be able to help you.  She is most often found with Sedana and her enchanter\'s apprentices, off the Court of the Sun.', 'The city\'s Arcane Reforger, Enchantress Fira, will be able to help you.  She is most often found with Sedana and her enchanter\'s apprentices, off the Court of the Sun.', 48039, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, run! With every step your heart quickens. The beating, loud and thunderous... Almost deafening. You cannot escape!', '', 48038, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20827, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Meet me just outside of the Twilight Withering down the path to the east.', 48037, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot hide from searing flame!', '', 48036, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20826, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I suppose I should thank you for freeing me. We\'ll soon see if you think that was a wise decision.', 48035, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This miserable existence finally ends.', '', 48034, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20823, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death waits in the darkness!', '', 48033, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20822, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m surprised that you made it this far.', 48032, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sighted, but blind to the truth. Embrace the finality of it all!', '', 48031, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20821, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have no need for eyes to see my enemies. Your clumsy footsteps and foul stench give you away!', '', 48030, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20820, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Elder Crone rubs her wrists as she flashes a toothy grin your way.', 48029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paladin', 'Paladin', 48028, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Seers of Elder Rise will help you.  Seek them out in the Hall of Elders there.', 'The Seers of Elder Rise will help you.  Seek them out in the Hall of Elders there.', 48027, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find the Sunwalker\'s Lodge on Hunter\'s Rise.', 'You will find the Sunwalker\'s Lodge on Hunter\'s Rise.', 48026, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s just say that I have no love for Tichondrius, and the lord I serve would... benefit from the Legion\'s downfall.', '', 48025, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Otoh Greyhide spends much of time in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.  Seek him out there, and he will help you.', 'Otoh Greyhide spends much of time in the Hall of Elders on the Elder Rise.  Seek him out there, and he will help you.', 48024, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And you wish for me to steal it. Why?', '', 48023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is responsible for corrupting these forests.', '', 48022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dreadlord who commands this undead army is called Tichondrius. He commands a powerful warlock artifact called the Skull of Gul\'dan.', '', 48021, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We could go on fighting like this forever. What is it you truly want?', '', 48020, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come then. You\'ll find that we\'re evenly matched.', '', 48019, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You reek of death, human. You\'ll regret approaching me.', '', 48018, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you certain of that, demon hunter? Are you certain your will is your own?', '', 48017, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am free after ten thousand years, yet still my own brother thinks I am a villain! I\'ll show him my true power! I\'ll show him that the demons have no hold over me!', '', 48016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come, $n! Into zhe siege tank! NOW!', '', 48015, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hurry, $n! Zhere is little time!', '', 48014, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhis vay, $n! Come! Come!', '', 48013, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! Ovah he\'ah!', '', 48012, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warlord Krogg sent me here to keep this front locked down. But he hasn\'t sent me any soldiers yet.$B$BLook at this place! I\'ve got ogres. I\'ve got Twilight\'s Hammer. I\'ve got... nothing.', '', 48011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will...NOT find her...until it is too late...', '', 48010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your blood only increases my hunger!', '', 48009, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha ha ha ha ha!  Rah ha ha ha ha ha!', '', 48008, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will rip your heart from your chest!', '', 48007, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell your fear...', '', 48006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will find a blood elf Arcane Reforger, Herim, at Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise.  She will be able to assist you.', 'You will find a blood elf Arcane Reforger, Herim, at Dawnstrider Enchanters on the middle rise.  She will be able to assist you.', 48005, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Isn\'t it weird that we\'re keeping Magatha Grimtotem captive here? Good thing all of her totems were destroyed.$B$BI even heard that she poisoned Cairne Bloodhoof. Wish she were on our side.', 'Isn\'t it weird that we\'re keeping Magatha Grimtotem captive here? Good thing all of her totems were destroyed.$B$BI even heard that she poisoned Cairne Bloodhoof. Wish she were on our side.', 48004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes peeled. They say that freak that was attacking people earlier might still be around.', 'Keep your eyes peeled. They say that freak that was attacking people earlier might still be around.', 48003, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Something big\'s brewing at the Withering to the east.$B$BWhatever it is, I hope that it\'ll be over soon and we get restationed somewhere nicer.', 'Something big\'s brewing at the Withering to the east.$B$BWhatever it is, I hope that it\'ll be over soon and we get restationed somewhere nicer.', 48002, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, you haven\'t seen Grom-Grom have you? Orc, about this tall. No?$B$BHmm. No one\'s seen him for a while. Probably went a.w.o.l.', 'Hey, you haven\'t seen Grom-Grom have you? Orc, about this tall. No?$B$BHmm. No one\'s seen him for a while. Probably went a.w.o.l.', 48001, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('New recruit? Have you reported to the commander yet?', 'New recruit? Have you reported to the commander yet?', 48000, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a little blood on your armor there. Are you okay?', 'There\'s a little blood on your armor there. Are you okay?', 47999, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The end days are nigh!', 'The end days are nigh!', 47998, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do I know you? No? Welcome to the Twilight\'s Hammer.', 'Do I know you? No? Welcome to the Twilight\'s Hammer.', 47997, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is a scholar, Hammond the Jaded, who can assist you.  You will find him in the Temple of the Moon, often conversing with one of the returned Highborne.', 'There is a scholar, Hammond the Jaded, who can assist you.  You will find him in the Temple of the Moon, often conversing with one of the returned Highborne.', 47996, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah, you seek one of the returned Highborne.$B$BOne of their Arcane Reforgers has been spending time with Taladan, the enchanter.  Seek them out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 'Ah, you seek one of the returned Highborne.$B$BOne of their Arcane Reforgers has been spending time with Taladan, the enchanter.  Seek them out in the Craftsmen\'s Terrace.', 47995, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My advice to you is simple, $r.$b$bDo not get in the way here.', '', 47994, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archmage Pratt, an Arcane Reforger recently from Dalaran, is usually working with Lavinia Crowe, the local enchanter. They\'re both in the Apothecarium.', 'Archmage Pratt, an Arcane Reforger recently from Dalaran, is usually working with Lavinia Crowe, the local enchanter. They\'re both in the Apothecarium.', 47993, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The starlet stares at you blankly.>', 47992, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Easy for you to say.$b$bI\'m not cut out for this! I need to find a way out of here!\n', '', 47991, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just relax... Panicking will only make it worse.', 'Just relax... Panicking will only make it worse.', 47990, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, but I don\'t need to have seen it to know that we\'re all going to DIE!$b$bDo you hear me?!\n', '', 47989, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just take a deep breath. Did you see anything?', 'Just take a deep breath. Did you see anything?', 47988, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s happening out here!?$b$bDid you see the man\'s wounds?!$b$bWhat kind of monster DOES that?\n', '', 47987, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Certainly not!$b$bI mean, I do have my entire fortune at risk here... and honestly, what good would a public crisis do anyone?', '', 47986, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your only concern here is your stake in this operation?', 'Your only concern here is your stake in this operation?', 47985, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m curious, of course, but what\'s done is done.$b$bWe wouldn\'t want to stir up any unneccesary panic. That simply wouldn\'t be prudent!', '', 47984, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t you want to know what happened to the man?', 'Don\'t you want to know what happened to the man?', 47983, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How unfortunate!$b$bLet\'s get this cleaned up, shall we?$b$bWouldn\'t want to make any more of this than needs be...', '', 47982, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot be certain of what I saw.$b$bIt was over before I realized what was happening.', '', 47981, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Terrible business!$b$bThere was a horrific growling noise that seemed to echo throught the region.$b$bPoor fellow...$b$bYou\'ll excuse me - I do believe I need a drink.', '', 47980, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The emissary sneers without looking at you.>$b$bGo about your business, $r.', '', 47979, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Move along, $r.$b$bYour presence is of no consequence to me.', '', 47978, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A mirror? How wonderful!', '', 47977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look! Behind you! A mirror!', 'Look! Behind you! A mirror!', 47976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Commander, behind you! Gnomeregan paratroopers!', 'Commander, behind you! Gnomeregan paratroopers!', 47975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Paratroopers?!', '', 47974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s what I like to see. Who needs a gatestone anyway...', '', 47973, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charges are set. Might want to get clear!', '', 47972, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On it.', '', 47971, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blow it open. There isn\'t a problem that some explosives can\'t solve.', '', 47970, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s never easy, is it? That\'s alright, we came prepared.', '', 47969, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Right away sir. Er... I don\'t see a slot to put it in?', 47968, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break out the gatestone. Open this thing up.', '', 47967, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The man barely acknowledges your presence. It is clear that he isn\'t interested in speaking with you.>', '', 47966, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s weakens! Capture them with your shackles!', '%s weakens! Capture them with your shackles!', 47965, 0, 10969, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ambassador lies dead in a pool of his own gore.$b$bThrough his rent clothing, you can make out a row of enormous, deep teethmarks.$b$bEven stranger, the wounds appear to be cauterized, even charred in places.', '', 47964, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Careful, $r.$b$bSchnottz is in a foul mood after the failed ritual incident.', '', 47963, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enter Twilight!', '', 47962, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21899, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Theralion, I will engulf the hallway. Cover their escape!', '', 47961, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21898, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At least... Theralion dies with me...', '', 47960, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21897, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Breathe your dying breath!', '', 47959, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21896, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s prepares to massacre his foes!', '', 47958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! I\'m glad you made it.', '', 47957, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Toxitron unit shield systems online.', '', 47956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21871, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huh? What?', '', 47955, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deethuk, you\'re a little snot! Wait... what\'s wrong with your code device?', 'Deethuk, you\'re a little snot! Wait... what\'s wrong with your code device?', 47954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I kind of like you. Try not to get killed out there.', 'I kind of like you. Try not to get killed out there.', 47953, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('See you around!', '', 47952, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good working with you.', '', 47951, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
