('We\'ve made it this far into the Slag Pit, $n.  Now it\'s time to finish the job.', '', 47802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Thorium Point.  As Overseer, I\'m responsible for all the activities of the Thorium Brotherhood.  While that mainly involves mining, smithing, and some minor guard duty, we\'ve lately become more of a martial organization... out of necessity.', '', 47801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s retracts her cyclone shield!', '', 47800, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Attack you cowardly vermin!', '', 47799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All in my path shall be destroyed!', '', 47798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18534, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like a  charm. Who needs a key anyway...', '', 47797, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death is my only option.', '', 47796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18533, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Charges are set. Might want to get clear!', '', 47795, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t believe that we\'re doing this.  I know that Calcinder\'s presence threatens us all, but really?  Doesn\'t this seem like the domain of the Earthen Ring, or something?$b$bWhy\'s the Thorium Brotherhood gotta come save the day all the time?', '', 47794, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right away, boss!', '', 47793, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Screw it. Ticker, you\'re up!', '', 47792, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You put it right in the... wait... where\'s the keyhole? What kind of racket is this?', '', 47791, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You got it boss. Er... where do I put it?', 47790, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you come for training, hunter?', 'Have you come for training, hunter?', 47789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Newt, you\'re up! Break out the gatestone!', '', 47788, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Clear the terrace for landing!  Shoot at Cauldron Defenders!', '', 47787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Messy...', '', 47786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18532, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vermin, your dinner awaits!', '', 47785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18531, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A million more await my orders. What chance do you have?', '', 47784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18530, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throngus SLICE you up!', '', 47783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, this gonna HURT!', '', 47782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18949, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not get through defenses!', '', 47781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18947, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death... Good choice. Not best choice maybe, but better than fail and live.', '', 47780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18946, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You break easy!', '', 47779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18945, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throngus use your corpse on body. Somewhere...', '', 47778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18944, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Throngus get whipped again if he no finish!', '', 47777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18943, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll get in and fire it! What could go wrong?', 'I\'ll get in and fire it! What could go wrong?', 47776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This cannon appears to be pointed directly at the shore, with a fresh charge of powder and fuse already set.$B$BHow convenient!', '', 47775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('F\'lakh ghet! The shadow\'s hunger cannot be sated!', '', 47774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18644, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ywaq maq oou; ywaq maq ssaggh. Ywaq ma shg\'fhn.', '', 47773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18641, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flesh for the offering.', '', 47772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18640, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahahaha!', '', 47771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18639, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The darkest days are still ahead!', '', 47770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18638, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If they do not kill you, I will do it myself!', '', 47769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not die for you, Drahga.', '', 47768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dragon, you will do as I command! Catch me!', '', 47767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18621, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BY FIRE BE... BURNED!', '', 47766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18619, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INCINERATE THEM, MINIONS!', '', 47765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Valiona, finish them! Avenge me!', '', 47764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold On!', 'Hold On!', 47763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have come better prepared!', '', 47762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An easy kill!', '', 47761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will burn you from the inside out!', '', 47760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_staticshock.blp:20|t%s casts|cFF1CF2FE|Hspell:79888|h [Lightning Conductor]|h|r at |cFF1CF2FE$n|r!', '', 47759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our men have secured the walkway. Focus on helping those in the main room.', 'Our men have secured the walkway. Focus on helping those in the main room.', 47758, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Grab a seat, chaps. Let me coach you on some true carnage!', '', 47757, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough toying around! It\'s time to get my hands dirty!', '', 47756, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good lord! Manservants, aid your master!!', '', 47755, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes.$b$bThat sounds like a good idea.', 47754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you should go lie down for a little while.', 'Maybe you should go lie down for a little while.', 47753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He just came stumbing out of the barracks.$b$bI screamed for help, but the guards wouldn\'t even look at me!', 47752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you see what happened?', 'Did you see what happened?', 47751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No! Of course I\'m not alright!$b$bI-I\'ve never seen an actual corpse before...', 47750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just calm down. Are you alright?', 'Just calm down. Are you alright?', 47749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Don\'t - don\'t touch me...$b$bWhat\'s happening?!', 47748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wh-what?! Well, I...$b$bIn this midst of such an exciting excavation, I\'m not certain it would be appropriate to focus on such a thing.$b$bIt would make for a most troubling story, you know.', '', 47747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, you WILL at least write about it, won\'t you?', 'Well, you WILL at least write about it, won\'t you?', 47746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who, me?$b$bWhy, I\'d hardly consider myself qualified to, uh... No, I should think not.', '', 47745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Will you investigate the murder?', 'Will you investigate the murder?', 47744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows?$b$bHe was becoming quite critical of this operation, but that\'s not proof of anything.', '', 47743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who could have done such a thing?', 'Who could have done such a thing?', 47742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I dare say I\'ve had enough of this. Time to bring out... THE BEAST WITHIN!', '', 47741, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Someone, or something, seems to have done in the Ambassador!', '', 47740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to replace your main weapon!', '', 47739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like father always said; it takes a shrewd mind, sharp instincts, and unfailing courage to become a successful investor.$b$bI must admit, I smelled this opportunity a mile away.', '', 47738, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This Schnottz fellow is proving to be a wise investment.$b$bGood that I was insightful enough to get in on the ground floor.', '', 47737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s time for your ultimate attack, my darling!', '', 47736, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh! Too full... oh no... ', '', 47735, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Daddy!', '', 47734, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eww! Get away from me, you nasty thing!', '', 47733, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is reviled by your ugliness!', '', 47732, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... my creation! It didn\'t even blot out the sky! I\'d better recheck my notes...', '', 47731, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I guess it\'s time for a rebuilding phase...', '', 47730, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, my beautiful angel! Ah, it is so very sad when one\'s children leave the nest, isn\'t it?', '', 47729, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The ground beneath you rumbles ominously....', '', 47728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The surrounding air crackles with energy....', '', 47727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('FEEL THE POWER!', '', 47726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20400, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dare invade our lord\'s sanctum?', '', 47725, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20162, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will die for your insolence!', '', 47724, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20285, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Quake!', '', 47723, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth will devour you!', '', 47722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The soil welcomes your bones!', '', 47721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 21842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Merely a whisper in the wind....', '', 47720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20238, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Thundershock!', '', 47719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wind, hear my call!', '', 47718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20239, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perish!', '', 47717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20163, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More fuel for the fire!', '', 47716, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20286, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('BURN!', '', 47715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20287, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s this? Shoo!', '', 47714, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 1299, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aaaaaiiiiiiiiiiiiii......!', '', 47713, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO!', '', 47712, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! Get away! Get off of me!', '', 47711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s see what this ember does... whaaaa?', '', 47710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No flights out right now, $r. By order of Garrosh, these windriders are for military use only until the night elves are wiped out.', '', 47709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Useless wind rider! I don\'t need you anyway!', '', 47708, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be a pleasure shooting you down!', '', 47707, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, creep!', '', 47706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only pain awaits you!', '', 47705, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will suffer!  You will face the wrath of the Twilight\'s Hammer!', '', 47704, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh no!  Why do you kill it?', '', 47703, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, no kill when Lunk is around.', '', 47702, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hurt Lunk\'s feelings when you kill.', '', 47701, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!  No kill!', '', 47700, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You stop killing now!  Lunk doesn\'t like!', '', 47699, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why you do that?  Why you kill?', '', 47698, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dark Irons in Blackrock have got nothin\' on me.  Neither do those boys up at Thorium Point.$b$bI\'m independent as can be, and that\'s the way I like it.  Of course, for the right price, I\'d listen to either side...', '', 47697, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you repair my gear, Argus?', 'Could you repair my gear, Argus?', 47696, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you could repair my gear, Burrian?', 'Think you could repair my gear, Burrian?', 47695, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ever heard of the Thorium Brotherhood?  Sure, we might look a lot like those dwarves down in the gorge, or in Blackrock Depths, but trust me: we\'re not anything like them.$b$bThose scoundrels dug too deep, and now they serve a darker force: Ragnaros, the Firelord.  We\'re happy to be more independent of will and purpose, although most of the time our purpose ends up being the prevention of whatever trouble they\'re causing.', '', 47694, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Succeed, and you may ascend after all.  Fail, and burn.', '', 47693, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig wide, dig deep.  Seek out the places of fire beneath the world.  My brothers and sisters yearn to be free.', '', 47692, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing to offer, except your backs and your shovels.  So you will dig.', '', 47691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You dwarves are worthless!  You come to Ragnaros seeking ascendance, but you have nothing to offer!', '', 47690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will do this ONE thing that you ask of me, quest giver. Pray I find more menial tasks to accomplish or you will be hearing from me again and I assure you that my commentary on forums of public opinion will be most unkind.', '', 47689, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THAT\'S ALL, JOHNNY AWESOME. TAKE IT OR LEAVE IT!', 'THAT\'S ALL, JOHNNY AWESOME. TAKE IT OR LEAVE IT!', 47688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all? One quest? Surely you jest. Are there not bear asses to collect? Perhaps a rare flower that I could pick from which you will make some mildly hallucinogenic tonic which you will then drink, resulting in visions of a great apocalypse? Perhaps the local populace of mildly annoying, ill-tempered gophers are acting up and need to be brought to justice? No? Nothing?', '', 47687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s all.', 'That\'s all.', 47686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine, fine, what else?', '', 47685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, we are having some problems at the Sludge Fields, located northeast of here. Warden Stillwater could use your help.', 'Well, we are having some problems at the Sludge Fields, located northeast of here. Warden Stillwater could use your help.', 47684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at me, peasant. Heirlooms cover my body from head to toe, gifted to me by the greatest heroes Azeroth has ever known.$B$BNow look at yourself.$B$BQuickly, look back at me.$B$BYes, this horse IS made of STARS.$B$BWhat pointless series of tasks befitting a mentally deficient orc have you prepared for me?', '', 47683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Johnny Awesome has arrived, philistine. Present me with your menial tasks so that I may complete them with only mild enthusiasm and most likely a complete disregard for any directions that you provide that are more complicated than what my map is able to display.', '', 47682, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, crap. You\'re on your own with this one, $p.', 47681, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here\'s to hoping he never returns. Maybe he\'ll drown?', 47680, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, cowardly quest giver, sit atop your pale horse while Orkus brings glory to the Horde! I shall return with a thousand skulls!', '', 47679, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right, thanks. Just go ahead and head southeast. More south than east. Probably off the coast.', 'Right, thanks. Just go ahead and head southeast. More south than east. Probably off the coast.', 47678, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Then Orkus WILL DO IT! YES!', '', 47677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('None.', 'None.', 47676, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Insurgents you say? Is there any risk of death or dismemberment to me?', '', 47675, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um... Apparently there is some trouble at Southshore. Something about worgen insurgents. Maybe you could help with them?', 'Um... Apparently there is some trouble at Southshore. Something about worgen insurgents. Maybe you could help with them?', 47674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen the fall of the Lich King. Creations of the titans have fallen before my mighty axe. When called upon, I alone spearheaded a victory for the Argent Crusade against the beasts of Northrend. Now, I come for the ultimate challenge. What does Hillsbrad Foothills have to offer Kingslayer Orkus???', '', 47673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s begins to cast Glaciate!', '', 47672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will freeze the blood in your veins!', '', 47671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20164, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What have you got for me today, weakling?! Point me to where the Alliance hide and I shall DOMINATE THEM!', '', 47670, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HAH! Looks like you\'re running out of idiots to put atop this horse, Darthalia. This is the puniest one yet.', '', 47669, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CAN YOU SMELL WHAT THE LOK\'TAR IS COOKIN\'?!', '', 47668, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh great... not this one again. I know this orc. He\'s got no business being here, but since he\'s a bottom-feedier, he likes to hang around and prey on the helpless. Don\'t let him bully you.', 47667, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These new Forsaken tend to be a little... um... stupid. It usually takes awhile for them to acclimate.', 47666, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NORTH! GOT IT! THANKS! BYE! THANKS!', '', 47665, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait a minute. It looks like something just came up. Yes, right here on this sheet of paper. You need to head southeast to the Azurelode Mine and report to Captain Keyton. Southeast is that way *you point southeast*.', 'Wait a minute. It looks like something just came up. Yes, right here on this sheet of paper. You need to head southeast to the Azurelode Mine and report to Captain Keyton. Southeast is that way *you point southeast*.', 47664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OK! THANKS! I\'LL JUST WAIT HERE WITH YOU! THANKS! OK!', '', 47663, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you should go take a nap or something. I don\'t know if I have any work for you.', 'Maybe you should go take a nap or something. I don\'t know if I have any work for you.', 47662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HI! I\'M NEW! BIG WHITE LIGHT CREATURE WITH WINGS MADE ME ALIVE! I SERVE THE BANSHEE QUEEN! YAY!$B$BHELP!$B$BHI!', '', 47661, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 3, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HI! HI! HELP!', '', 47660, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see one coming now! Looks like a real winner. Keep it cool, $n. Keep it cool.', 47659, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Stand tall and proud, $n. Don\'t let any of these scrubs give you any trouble. Show them who\'s boss!', 47658, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fools!  You cannot defeat me!  I will only return again...', '', 47657, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO!  THIS CANNOT BE!  I... AM... IMMORTAL...!', '', 47656, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heartrazor bellows his appreciation.', '', 47655, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s is weakened!  Banish him now!', '', 47654, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now that\'s what ye call heavy hands!', '', 47653, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps ye filthy animals would like another taste o the dirt!', '', 47652, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful meat bags! Feel the full force of the Dragonmaw!', '', 47651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hang tight, $n.  We gotta wait for Maltorius and Arkkus to come back before we can fight \'em.', '', 47650, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now ye\'re talkin\'!  I\'ll take the Twilight guy.  You focus on the little dwarf.', '', 47649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do this!  Let\'s take out Maltorius and Arkkus!', 'Let\'s do this!  Let\'s take out Maltorius and Arkkus!', 47648, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are here to stop the Archduke?', '', 47647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mount One of Aviana\'s Guardians', '', 47646, 0, 10973, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
