('Grab a Lance from the Racks', '', 47644, 0, 10973, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overheat threshold exceeded.  System failure.  Wheat clog in port two.  Shutting down.', '', 47643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Safety restrictions off-line.  Catastrophic system failure imminent.', '', 47642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s about time!  I\'m sick of being a slave!', 'It\'s about time!  I\'m sick of being a slave!', 47641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, thank you!  Thank you!', 'Oh, thank you!  Thank you!', 47640, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the Thorium Brotherhood would come through!', 'I knew the Thorium Brotherhood would come through!', 47639, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll never leave!  I wouldn\'t know what to do outside!', 'I\'ll never leave!  I wouldn\'t know what to do outside!', 47638, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Intruder!  The intruder is trying to save me!', 'Intruder!  The intruder is trying to save me!', 47637, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never!  I love working for the Dark Iron!', 'Never!  I love working for the Dark Iron!', 47636, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on, let\'s get out of here!', 'Come on, let\'s get out of here!', 47635, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you... here to save me?', 'Are you... here to save me?', 47634, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get out of here, before the slavers see you!', 'Get out of here, before the slavers see you!', 47633, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?', 'Who are you?', 47632, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready to take the flight into the Cauldron!', 'I\'m ready to take the flight into the Cauldron!', 47631, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target destroyed.', '', 47630, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Target acquired.  Harvesting servos engaged.', '', 47629, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Acquiring target...', '', 47628, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I care little about the wars between the Horde and the Alliance. What matters is that we save the sacred wind riders of Highperch.$B$BIf not for their sake, then at least to keep them from falling into the hands of the Twilight\'s Hammer, $r.', '', 47627, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Years ago, I was trapped here while trying to study the wind riders. But once I made my way to freedom, I resolved to return and protect them.$B$BNow the Cataclysm has struck and the Twilight\'s Hammer is capturing all of these sacred creatures, or worse, destroying them.', '', 47626, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw them loading a shipment of artifacts onto the boats the other day.$b$bIt was the most gold I\'ve ever seen in one place!', 47625, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_twilightnova.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:86788|h[Blackout]|h|r!', '', 47624, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Smells like... gold!', 47623, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me your wares, quartermaster.', 'Show me your wares, quartermaster.', 47622, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I supply the Krom\'gar army with equipment.', '', 47621, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help the injured orc up.', 'Help the injured orc up.', 47620, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is fight left in me yet, scum.', 'There is fight left in me yet, scum.', 47619, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And with the powers of the South Wind, we will reclaim this city and seal it from those who would trespass upon our territory!', '', 47618, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I bestow upon you the power that is our birthright... and more!', '', 47617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m working on a biographical piece for Commander Schnottz, among other things.$b$bYou\'ll have to excuse me.', '', 47616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pardon me, friend, but I\'m busier than it might appear.$b$bI\'ve been commissioned to document the discoveries of the commander in this region, you see.$b$bThey\'re certain to be most profound!', '', 47615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('End the orc\'s misery.', 'End the orc\'s misery.', 47614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This orc is severely injured.', 'This orc is severely injured.', 47613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flap Your Wings Rapidly to Re-Gain Altitude!', '', 47612, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your makers failed you... your flawed race succumbed to the curse of flesh!  Lord Deathwing\'s gift makes you perfect again!', '', 47611, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the last of your tribe with any sense left.  As a reward for giving us Prince Nadun, I grant you the gift that is your birthright and more!', '', 47610, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Overdrive engine activated.', '', 47609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack and Weaken the Black Drake!', '', 47608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Care to join our dance?', 'Care to join our dance?', 47607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye.', '', 47606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help ye with somethin\'?', '', 47605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A little busy here, $c.  What d\'ye want?', '', 47604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s slumps forward, exposing his pincers!', '', 47603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 8717, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ice cream, Brivelthwerp. I need ice cream!', 'Ice cream, Brivelthwerp. I need ice cream!', 47602, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brill\'s only chef is in the middle of town.$B$BWe don\'t know why he\'s out there; he won\'t sell anything he makes. We also don\'t know where he\'s getting that fresh raw meat.$B$BWell, no matter. Good luck.', 'Brill\'s only chef is in the middle of town.$B$BWe don\'t know why he\'s out there; he won\'t sell anything he makes. We also don\'t know where he\'s getting that fresh raw meat.$B$BWell, no matter. Good luck.', 47601, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dedlow Wormwood\'s the corpse you want. He\'s usually around the south end of town.', 'Dedlow Wormwood\'s the corpse you want. He\'s usually around the south end of town.', 47600, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nespirah is waking up! Use the Nespirah Fluid to kill Idra\'kess.', '', 47599, 0, 11908, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slay the Idra\'kess Mistresses to destroy the shield!', '', 47598, 0, 11908, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Places like Uldaman hold secrets as to the mysteries of my people\'s past!', '', 47597, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foe Reaper 5000 on-line.  All systems nominal.', '', 47596, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This library should prove to be useful to my own research.', '', 47595, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Missing pages, broken equipment, tainted samples! How does someone work in these conditions!', '', 47594, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must give Arugal some credit, his lines of research were quite novel.', '', 47593, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These notes are horribly organized. I can\'t tell if Arugal was brilliant or simply an imbecile.', '', 47592, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish mortals-(Usurper\'s children!) nothing you have done- (Spawn of a lesser god!) I am TRYING to speak here. (Words, words, words. The Master wants murder.) ALL falls to chaos. ALL will be destroyed. (Chaos, chaos!) Your work here today changes nothing. (Chaos, chaos, all things end) No mortal may see what you have and live. Your end has come.', '', 47591, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22068, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For Sylvanas!', 47590, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remain steady always.', '', 47589, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brothers of Twilight! The Hammer calls to you! (Fire water earth air). Leave your mortal shell behind. (Fire water earth air). Embrace your new forms for here and everafter! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate). And use your gifts to destroy the unbelievers. (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate)!!', '', 47588, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22067, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is here the chosen realize their destiny. (One with eternity). And it is here that you will realize yours.(End of the flesh. End of the flesh)!', '', 47587, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22066, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you see me now, Cho\'gall? I\'m coming for you! I\'m going to rip off your head while the other watches!', 47586, 0, 0, 36, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, mortals. (Frail little children). Few have laid eyes on this inner sanctum. (They reach out to touch the fire!)', '', 47585, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22065, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Time to expand my ice cream empire.$B$BTigule is going down!', '', 47584, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bloodfang will prevail.', '', 47583, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing can stop the wrath of the Banshee Queen.', '', 47582, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Be quick about it.', 47581, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s always something new to investigate.', '', 47580, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll want to find Adam Hossack. He\'s got an office in the southern Mage Quarter along the inner ring.$B$BIf he\'s not out exploring, he\'ll likely be there.', 'You\'ll want to find Adam Hossack. He\'s got an office in the southern Mage Quarter along the inner ring.$B$BIf he\'s not out exploring, he\'ll likely be there.', 47579, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Extricating', 'Extricating', 47578, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want Master Hossack. He in south part of Mage District, inner ring.', 'You want Master Hossack. He in south part of Mage District, inner ring.', 47577, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gimme some more of that swim tonic!', 'Gimme some more of that swim tonic!', 47576, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The scales...have...tipped...', '', 47575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Only ten copper? You\'re not even worth killing!', '', 47574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t need him! Not when I\'ve got YOU oafs!', '', 47573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'May I suggest that you save us from the pirates, my dear $n?!', 47572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you gonna save us from those pirates, or what?!', '', 47571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide your vives! Hide your children! H-h-hide you husbands!! Zhey\'re killink everyvone up in he\'ah!', '', 47570, 0, 10830, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('History? Culture? Tch. Such is the realm of scholars and scribes.$B$BWe of The Reliquary concern ourselves with... the immediate, and perhaps the future.$B$BWe discover, acquire, and amass lost artifacts, wealth, and lore so that it cannot be used against us. Power does, after all, belong in the hands of those who would use it best... wouldn\'t you agree?', '', 47569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 11, 0, 2, 2, 39653),
('Lookin\' for some punishment?', 'Lookin\' for some punishment?', 47568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look like you want a piece of me...', 'You look like you want a piece of me...', 47567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookin\' to scrap?', 'Lookin\' to scrap?', 47566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duglas send you over to get roughed up?', 'Duglas send you over to get roughed up?', 47565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Only the highest-ranking members of The Reliquary know where our order\'s Grand Vault is located.$B$BSome say it is not even upon this plane of existence...', 47564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine! Fine. You win this one.', 'Fine! Fine. You win this one.', 47563, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you waiting for? Get out there and stop them!', '', 47562, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Seek out The Reliquary in the Royal Exchange; doubtless one of that organization\'s many archaeologists will be there and can likely assist you.', 'Seek out The Reliquary in the Royal Exchange; doubtless one of that organization\'s many archaeologists will be there and can likely assist you.', 47561, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Off course, sir! At Vonce!', '', 47560, 0, 10830, 113, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhey\'re runnink around killink everyzhink! Shtompink! Like zhis!!', '', 47559, 0, 10830, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hide your vives! Hide your children! Zhey\'re killink everyvone up in he\'ah!', '', 47558, 0, 10830, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Them\'s DEFINITELY fightin\' words!', 'Them\'s DEFINITELY fightin\' words!', 47557, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not backing out, are you?', 'Not backing out, are you?', 47556, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The Mullan Gryphon Rider stays still, eyes locked forward, not acknowledging your presence.>', '<The Mullan Gryphon Rider stays still, eyes locked forward, not acknowledging your presence.>', 47555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll talk, I\'ll talk! Anything! Just keep that perfumed bag away from me!', '', 47554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are you talking about, goblin?! Speak!!', '', 47553, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhe shtatues! Zhey\'re aliiive!', '', 47552, 0, 10830, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
