('Tol Barad is mine, it\'s mine I tell you!', 'Tol Barad is mine, it\'s mine I tell you!', 47400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may enter this hill alive, but I guarantee you won\'t leave alive.', 'You may enter this hill alive, but I guarantee you won\'t leave alive.', 47399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in hell\'s name is going on out here?', '', 47398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat it!', '', 47397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No one attacks the Big G and lives!', '', 47396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My poor Gobbles...', '', 47395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Out of my sight, vizh you! Auch...', '', 47394, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE! NINE!!!', '', 47393, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhe ritual shpecifically calls for NINE!!', '', 47392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You only brought me eight idols!', '', 47391, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vait a shekkont! Vhat\'s zhis!?', '', 47390, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vhat could haf possibly gone vrong? I followed every lasht detail...', '', 47389, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('VHAT!?', '', 47388, 0, 0, 388, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve absorbed 3 Static Charges. Your next Storm Hammer will deal massive AoE damage!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t', 'You\'ve absorbed 3 Static Charges. Your next Storm Hammer will deal massive AoE damage!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningoverload.blp:32|t', 47387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Use your Storm Shield before the Static Charge finishes!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningshield.blp:32|t', 'Use your Storm Shield before the Static Charge finishes!\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_nature_lightningshield.blp:32|t', 47386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold on, Gobbles! Shtand back everyvone!', '', 47385, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d best hurry if you want any of the spoils.', '', 47384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, Gobbles! Ve\'re ready to begin! Come, come!', '', 47383, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mmm-hmmm, yes, yes... simple enough...\n', '', 47382, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very vell, zhen. Let me just check my notes vone lasht time...', '', 47381, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You too are a student of the arcane, yes?$B$BI can teach you about portal magic, if you wish to learn.', 'You too are a student of the arcane, yes?$B$BI can teach you about portal magic, if you wish to learn.', 47380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, $c. $B$BYour grasp of the arcane isn\'t strong enough to understand portal magic.', 'Sorry, $c. $B$BYour grasp of the arcane isn\'t strong enough to understand portal magic.', 47379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack, my brothers! Make him feel the fury of the pack!', '', 47378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Man am I tired!', 'Man am I tired!', 47377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The perimeter is secure, commander.', 'The perimeter is secure, commander.', 47376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see that you did it, $n. You\'re a credit to your race.', '', 47375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve taught me what it means to have friends, $n.', '', 47374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for rescuing the king... and the prince, $n.', '', 47373, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get behind the Colossus!', 'Get behind the Colossus!', 47372, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you.', 'For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BSadly, they will remain a secret to you.', 47371, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BAre you here to learn, as well?', 'For too long we have ignored the secrets of the Arcane.$B$BAre you here to learn, as well?', 47370, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 47369, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The coffer is just beyond these ruins.$b$bLet\'s go!', '', 47368, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I travelled all this way to speak with the famed \"Seer of the Dragonmaw.\" I wanted to see inside Cho\'gall\'s dark heart before I tear it out.$B$BBut she\'s worthless to me. All riddles and rhyme. Maybe you can help.', 47367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your time has finally come, Godfrey!', '', 47366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What a pathetic lock! Godfrey is going to have to try harder than this if he wants to defeat us.', '', 47365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crowley is a disgrace to our kind for giving in to the Forsaken. My pack will show them the true face of the worgen and the relentless fury that comes with our presence!', '', 47364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ARCANE POWER!!!', '', 47363, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s do it!', '', 47362, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glubtok ready?', '', 47361, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zhat vhich you seek vill soon be mine, Doctor Jones!', '', 47360, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Daaaaaaamn... Loss of potential revenue is devastating.', '', 47359, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carefully Collecting', 'Carefully Collecting', 47358, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid the shadow runes!', 'Avoid the shadow runes!', 47357, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Have fun storming the Highlands!', 47356, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From all of us at Bilgewater Harbor...', 47355, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh hells no! Those things are death-traps!', 47354, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We call them \"Emergency Rampless Debarkation Devices.\"', 47353, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A little.', 47352, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Maybe.', 47351, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No.', 47350, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I can hit my house from here!', 47349, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With Pleasure!', 47348, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nothing keeps a fleet of combustible dirigibles safer than randomly flinging molten metal in every conceivable direction!', 47347, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll also find a complementary bag of peanuts.', 47346, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For those of you allergic to almonds, our cyanide capsules come in an assortment of flavors.', 47345, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In the unlikely event of a water \"landing,\" please reach under your seat cushion where a cyanide capsule has been located for your convenience.', 47344, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'To ensure a rapid crew response in the event of a fire, fuel storage has been moved away from the crew quarters and placed beneath the passenger compartment.', 47343, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even verbal.', 47342, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We call it \"Doom Juice.\"', 47341, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell \'em about the engines, boss.', 47340, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ask yourself: what good is a \"safety\" valve if it keeps going off? That doesn\'t sound very safe to me.', 47339, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We passed the savings on to us.', 47338, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We bent the crap outta them!', 47337, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Not a penny was wasted on comfort or personal safety! ', 47336, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have fun storming the Highlands!', '', 47335, 0, 0, 3, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your safety and well-being are no longer any concern of mine.', '', 47334, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well then. I see that the Spear of Durotar has almost arrived.', '', 47333, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greely, would you like to demonstrate how our parachutes work?', '', 47332, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply grab a nearby parachute to be vaulted clear of the burning zeppelin. Hopefully onto dry land.', '', 47331, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...a number of parachutes will appear along the railings.', '', 47330, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the unlikely event that a catastrophic failure does not instantly kill everyone aboard...', '', 47329, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greely, you\'re not randomly firing that thing into Bilgewater Port, are you?', '', 47328, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Simply aim and pull the trigger. Or don\'t aim. I wash my hands of the whole thing.', '', 47327, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greely, show them how the guns work.', '', 47326, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Instead, look for a number of deck-mounted flak cannons positioned for just such an emergency.', '', 47325, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Should your zeppelin be attacked en-route, panic is inadvisable.', '', 47324, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t ask how we know what they taste like.', '', 47323, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust me, friend, a rapid pill-induced death is far preferable to the long, agonizing process of hypothermia and subsequent dismemberment by sharks.', '', 47322, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An enormous, unforgiving expanse of pounding grey waves, freezing temperatures, and ravenous sea life.', '', 47321, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your course today will take you directly across the great sea.', '', 47320, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This stuff is so volatile, it probably shouldn\'t be moved. Much less... flown.', '', 47319, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is so energy-dense as to combust at the slightest provocation.', '', 47318, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh my, yes. In order to maximize both range and payload, we\'ve concocted an unorthodox blend of rocket fuels for the state-of-the-art engines.', '', 47317, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Doing so required the removal of a number of safety valves that kept erupting. ', '', 47316, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve mitigated the explosive instability of the gas by putting it under IMMENSE pressure.', '', 47315, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bilgewater engineers have taken advantage of its inherent high-altitude instability and resultant low-cost.', '', 47314, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Spear of Durotar is filled to the bursting point with combustible, super-heated gas.', '', 47313, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you know, air weighs nothing. So to create a lighter-than-air vessel, we had to bend a few rules.', '', 47312, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While you wait for its arrival, my assistant and I will momentarily demonstrate some of the features of this remarkable aircraft.', '', 47311, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been recklessly engineered with a merciless disregard for both budgetary concerns and those cumbersome, inefficient \"laws of physics.\"', '', 47310, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are about to rip the horizon a new sky-hole aboard a sensational new era in aeronautical innovation. ', '', 47309, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Boarding the Spear of Durotar, are we? You are to be envied, Horde marine!', '', 47308, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in one minute. One minute.', '', 47307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in two minutes.', '', 47306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in three minutes.', '', 47305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in four minutes.', '', 47304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in five minutes.', '', 47303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zeppelin arrival in six minutes.', '', 47302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 22491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could I get a boat ride to Eastern Plaguelands, please?', 'Could I get a boat ride to Eastern Plaguelands, please?', 47301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We fish, we sleep, and we explode things.  What could be better than that?', '', 47300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A boat ride to the Badlands, please.', 'A boat ride to the Badlands, please.', 47299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'Need something?', 47298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed!', '', 47297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huzzah!', '', 47296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All hail, $n! Huzzah!', '', 47295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A new victim! Me was almost don wit dis one anyway. ', '', 47294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fires dim, champions....  Take this, the last of my power.  Succeed where I have failed.  Avenge me.  Avenge the world....', '', 47293, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough!  Drawing upon this source will set us back months.  You should feel honored to be worthy of its expenditure.  Now... die!', 47292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You mistake this for weakness?  Fool!', 47291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heroes!  My power wanes....', '', 47290, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 21589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We must keep Therazane\'s forces from attacking Stonehearth.$B$BIf they do, they will steal the middle fragment of the World Pillar.', '', 47289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was as surprised as you to find the black dragonflight asserting its will against New Kargath.  Gorn is stubborn, and refuses help from anyone.$b$bEven so, High Examiner Bloodwatcher has asked me to watch from a distance, to make sure things do not become... ugly.', '', 47288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Dragon\'s Mouth was established to give the Alliance their first real foothold here in the Badlands.  Despite its position between Stormwind and Dun Morogh, the Badlands have traditionally been Horde territory.$b$bIf that\'s ever to change, we need to start asserting ourselves.  Of course, the dragon attacks on New Kargath don\'t hurt our cause either.', 47287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you can\'t fight Zoltrik at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t', 'If you can\'t fight Zoltrik at range, use your Jump Drakes! ability:\n\n|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_vehicle_launchplayer.blp:64|t', 47286, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...alvays vatchink!', '', 47285, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ve\'re vatchink you, $r...', '', 47284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('State your business, $r.', '', 47283, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So, zhis is zhe $r $c I haf heard so much about, hmm?', '', 47282, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, $c.$b$bI really don\'t know enough to discuss such things. And honestly, I would prefer to keep it that way.', 47281, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you think about the troops he\'s arming? Seems a little excessive, no?', 'What do you think about the troops he\'s arming? Seems a little excessive, no?', 47280, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Word has it that some of the relics in these parts hold mystical power!$b$bHe seems to be fascinated with such things...', 47279, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Uhhh.. I\'m not sure. Anything else you can tell me about him?', 'Uhhh.. I\'m not sure. Anything else you can tell me about him?', 47278, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, it\'s been wonderful!$b$bThe commander is so confident, and that accent! I must admit, he\'s quite captivating.$b$bDo you know if he\'s married?', 47277, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, yes. How have you been enjoying your time here?', 'Ahh, yes. How have you been enjoying your time here?', 47276, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m out of here!', 'I\'m out of here!', 47275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Exquisite weather here, wouldn\'t you say, $c?', 47274, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avoid the beams of searing light!', '', 47273, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see what you mean, I suppose...$b$bYou know, I\'m just here because I want to expand my horizons a bit, see the world and whatnot.$b$bI\'m not terribly concerned with the goings on of others.$b$bNice to meet you, though.\n', '', 47272, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('His troops, these guards... it all seems a little intense.', 'His troops, these guards... it all seems a little intense.', 47271, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Destroy the Obsidian Colossus!', 'Destroy the Obsidian Colossus!', 47270, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He\'s a bit animated for my tastes, but the world needs all kinds, I suppose.$b$bWhy do you ask?\n', '', 47269, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Indeed! And how do you find the Commander, friend?', 'Indeed! And how do you find the Commander, friend?', 47268, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, isn\'t this the place to be?$b$bTouring unexplored corners of the world with likeminded fellows?$b$bWhat could be better?', '', 47267, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You von\'t live to see your precious coffer, Jones!', '', 47266, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Permanently!', '', 47265, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not so fast, Schnottz! ', '', 47264, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I figured I might see you again, Schnottz.', '', 47263, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They haven\'t noticed us yet. Hurry, maybe we can still stop them!', '', 47262, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speculation, my dear $gboy:girl;!$b$bOnce our eager little furrier has unearthed enough treasure, he\'ll be one of Azeroth\'s most influential figures.$b$bWe\'ll all be properly positioned when that comes to pass.', '', 47261, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmm, well what is it that brings you to these parts?', 'Hmmm, well what is it that brings you to these parts?', 47260, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, just look at the treasure he has accumulated!$b$bI\'m not always comfortable with his methods, but there\'s no denying the results...$b$bBest not to dwell upon unpleasant thoughts. It\'s bad manners, you know.', '', 47259, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you know of our generous host, sir?', 'What do you know of our generous host, sir?', 47258, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I say! Raise a glass, my friend!$b$bTake in the sights here.$b$bThis entire region has been hidden away for ages, you know.', '', 47257, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Glubtok show you da power of de arcane!', '', 47256, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry about the interruption, Martek.  You\'ve gotta admit though... I made your story about fifty times better.  Next drink\'s on me.', '', 47255, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling scampers into the distance, excited by its newfound freedom.', '', 47254, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling offers a great gravelly sigh of appreciation.', '', 47253, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling thuds happily upon the ground.', '', 47252, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear a loud cracking noise as the rockling tries to smile.', '', 47251, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling looks up at you questioningly.', '', 47250, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling clatters its crystals together in thanks.', '', 47249, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling looks confused for a moment before running off.', '', 47248, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rockling rumbles in appreciation.', '', 47247, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eediot!$b$bAvay vizh you!$b$bCan\'t you see zhat I am concentratink?', '', 47246, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vell in zhat case, ve must ensure zhat you and your friend are out of zhe picture.', '', 47245, 0, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not surprised.$b$bSo many questions, I cannot ignore...$b$bWhy all these weapons for an archaeological dig? And what is being done with the unearthed relics? Under what authority is the excavation being conducted?$b$bThe answers don\'t seem to be forthcoming. I\'ll just have to find out for myself, I suppose.', '', 47244, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve encountered some of his underlings out in the field. They\'ve been quite hostile.', 'I\'ve encountered some of his underlings out in the field. They\'ve been quite hostile.', 47243, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
