('I know what you\'re up to, Schnottz! Deathwing will never have the coffer, not if I can help it!', '', 47236, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... is that thing?!', 'The statue is alive?!', 47235, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
