('We were to be rewarded for the best work we\'d ever done, and we were... with this.', '', 46918, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A special project... an artifact for Cho\'gall.', '', 46917, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
