('Gather a force and go to the lake.  I want Countess Verrall destroyed by the end of the day!', '', 46889, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The weapon will soon be completed. The Wildhammer and the Dragonmaw are about to be no more.', '', 46888, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sense one amongst us that does not belong!', '', 46887, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Work harder for the glory of Cho\'gall!', '', 46886, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your weak, fleshy eyes open! There are intruders amongst us.', '', 46885, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find the interlopers! I know that they have someone sneaking around to the north!', '', 46884, 0, 10763, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Guarding the bank and treasures of the Horde is far more satisfying than dispensing coins and trade goods from inside a cage of iron.$B$BI would not exchange places with one of those quill-pushing goblins for a moment.', 'Guarding the bank and treasures of the Horde is far more satisfying than dispensing coins and trade goods from inside a cage of iron.$B$BI would not exchange places with one of those quill-pushing goblins for a moment.', 46883, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More traitors? Put \'em down in the pit, where they belong!', '', 46882, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...the Cookie crumbles.', '', 46881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s the way...', '', 46880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be sure to keep an eye on things as we begin cleaning the Deadmines out. Hopefully we can use it again soon as the famous gold mine it once was. As for the kingpin\'s fate...', '', 46879, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Vanessa VanCleef is still out there somewhere, plotting against us. Thankfully, without this base she is largely powerless against the might of the Alliance.', '', 46878, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.$B$BThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.$B$BI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.', 'After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.$B$BThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.$B$BI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.', 46877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The false Kingpin has fallen thanks to you adventurers.', '', 46876, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another fly enters the spider\'s web...', 'Another fly enters the spider\'s web...', 46875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.$B$BThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.$B$BI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.$B$BSo. Are you ready to train?', 'After the fall of the Burning Blade Clan, we blademasters swore to free ourselves and our people from demonic control.$B$BThis may be done, but my honor remains unsatisfied.$B$BI shall fight for the Horde - and train other warriors to do so - until I die gloriously in battle. This is the only path I may tread.$B$BSo. Are you ready to train?', 46874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are nothing more than the warchief\'s dog!', '', 46873, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the elements curse you!', '', 46872, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go!', 'Let\'s go!', 46871, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re loaded in and ready, $n.', '', 46870, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this? I have done nothing!', 'What is this? I have done nothing!', 46869, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What are these suspicious papers? Guard, take this citizen into custody.', 'What are these suspicious papers? Guard, take this citizen into custody.', 46868, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t let you into Orgrimmar with these cultist articles.', 'I can\'t let you into Orgrimmar with these cultist articles.', 46867, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is cultist propaganda. You\'re under arrest!', 'This is cultist propaganda. You\'re under arrest!', 46866, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A Twilight\'s Hammer medallion? Guard!', 'A Twilight\'s Hammer medallion? Guard!', 46865, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is cultist literature. The only way you\'re entering Orgrimmar is in chains.', 'This is cultist literature. The only way you\'re entering Orgrimmar is in chains.', 46864, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This looks suspicious. I can\'t let you in.', 'This looks suspicious. I can\'t let you in.', 46863, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s a cultist robe. Guard!', 'That\'s a cultist robe. Guard!', 46862, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you. I\'ll be on my way.', 'Thank you. I\'ll be on my way.', 46861, 1, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All clear, you can go.', 'All clear, you can go.', 46860, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything\'s in order. You\'re free to go.', 'Everything\'s in order. You\'re free to go.', 46859, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re free to enter Orgrimmar.', 'You\'re free to enter Orgrimmar.', 46858, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can enter the city.', 'You can enter the city.', 46857, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everything seems ok, you may go now.', 'Everything seems ok, you may go now.', 46856, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hope you brought your mining pick, pilgrim.  No place better than here for digging up ancient treasure.', '', 46855, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Make your search fast, I have to be somewhere.', 'Make your search fast, I have to be somewhere.', 46854, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing to hide.', 'I have nothing to hide.', 46853, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You insult my honor with your inquiries.', 'You insult my honor with your inquiries.', 46852, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How dare you question me.', 'How dare you question me.', 46851, 1, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, I\'ll lead the caravan to our destination. You stay in the back and make sure our tail is clean. Let me know when you\'re ready. ', '', 46850, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s move, cultist filth.', 'Let\'s move, cultist filth.', 46849, 1, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cho\'gall once held sway over my mind with the simple utterance of a magic word. He made me do a lot of things that I\'m not proud of. I\'m going to repay him tenfold, and you\'re going to help me do it, $n!', 46848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to kill all of these cultists and their leaders out here before we can take out the Bastion of Twilight.', 46847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope that you\'re ready for a one-way mission, $n.', 46846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cho\'gall\'s keeping himself hidden inside of the Bastion of Twilight. I hope he decides to come out and play.', 46845, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These Twilight idiots have no idea of the pain that\'s coming their way.', 46844, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We need to figure out everything there is to know about the weapon Cho\'gall\'s working on and we need to do it fast!', 46843, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Over here. Find out anything? Were you tailed, $n?', 46842, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re glad to see you here again, $n. With so many of our brethren seized by the Warchief\'s forces, we thought we\'d never see you again.', 46841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Greetings.', 46840, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('THREE? He woulda paid five, easy... Dummy!', '', 46839, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It\'s just you and me, $r. Let\'s get this wrapped up quickly so that I can go kill Cho\'gall.', 46838, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did I tell you about the time when the Twilight\'s Hammer actually tried to recruit me? True story.', '', 46837, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to take care of everything out here before we can launch the final assault on the Bastion of Twilight.', '', 46836, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This might be a one-way mission, $n. If you\'re not comfortable with that, you can walk away at any time, though I\'d rather that you didn\'t.', '', 46835, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re going to have to deal with Cho\'gall and Skullcrusher sooner rather than later. Are you up to it, $n?', '', 46834, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to be back out in the field. Nice change of pace from being cooped up in Stormwind all of the time.', '', 46833, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Looks like it\'s just you, me, and those two Earthen Ringers over at the mine. Let\'s work fast, $n, before we\'re discovered.', '', 46832, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We need to figure out everything there is to know about Cho\'gall\'s mystery weapon before it\'s too late.', '', 46831, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, over here. What do you have to report? Were you followed?', '', 46830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancients of flour and earth, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Orgrimmar!', 'Ancients of flour and earth, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Orgrimmar!', 46829, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancients of fire and earth, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Orgrimmar.', 'Ancients of fire and earth, I have prepared the way for you. Come forth and raze Orgrimmar.', 46828, 0, 10755, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This red statue looks a lot like the Sentinel\'s pawn that you hold.$b$bThe statue has a small indentation that matches the size of your pawn.', '', 46827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Judging by its color, this must be The Warden.$b$bYou see a small indentation where your pawn might fit.', '', 46826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Citizens of Orgrimmar, as you know, a dangerous cult threatens to tear our city apart. Until this cult has been destroyed, Warchief Garrosh Hellscream, hero of Northrend, champion of the people, decrees that all who wish to enter Orgrimmar must submit to searches and questioning.', 'Citizens of Orgrimmar, as you know, a dangerous cult threatens to tear our city apart. Until this cult has been destroyed, Warchief Garrosh Hellscream, hero of Northrend, champion of the people, decrees that all who wish to enter Orgrimmar must submit to searches and questioning.', 46825, 1, 10754, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Place the pawn in the indentation.>', '<Place the pawn in the indentation.>', 46824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('While it is clearly quite old, this statue does not appear to have crumbled at all over the centuries.', '', 46823, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The hulking statue stands inert, untouched for centuries.', '', 46822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No mercy remains in them. Make your peace.', '', 46821, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our captors have allied with Deathwing, $r.', '', 46820, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Brilliant!', '', 46819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ROCK ON!!!', '', 46818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weaponized sharks?  Why didn\'t I think of that!?', '', 46817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So... EPIC!!!', '', 46816, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to survey those curves!', '', 46815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Check out the modified leg articulation!  Perfect for off-roading!', '', 46814, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t know it came in lightning-blue!  AWESOME!!', '', 46813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('200 horsepower, dual combustion engine with modified flux capacitors!  ZOING!', '', 46812, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s the TXR-5000!', '', 46811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shake it like a sine wave, baby!', '', 46810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You could bounce a washer off those legs!', '', 46809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hubba-hubba!', '', 46807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, definitely an idea.', '', 46806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose we\'ll just have to throw these away... WAIT!  I think I\'m having an idea.', '', 46805, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The console whirrs and buzzes as you approach it.>', 46804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is done. Scour the place clean. Leave them nothing to return to!', 'It is done. Scour the place clean. Leave them nothing to return to!', 46803, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go. My blade grows hungry.', '', 46802, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hah! Get these Wildhammer off their gryphons and look what kind of a fight they put up. Nothing! ', '', 46801, 1, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another notch in my sword.', 'Another triumph! Another set of beards to hang from my belt.', 46800, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will destroy all who oppose us!', '', 46799, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You cannot stop us!  We will wield the power beneath the tombs!', '', 46798, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secrets of Uldum will be ours only!', '', 46797, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world is imperfect!  We must begin anew!', '', 46796, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('We did it! That\'ll learn those Dragonmaw to try an\' ambush a Wildhammer.', 'We did it! That\'ll learn those Dragonmaw to try an\' ambush a Wildhammer.', 46795, 7, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s hurry, Thundermar needs these supplies.', 'Let\'s hurry, Thundermar needs these supplies.', 46794, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Okay, back to work. If we\'re fast we can finish up here before another attack.', 'Okay, back to work. If we\'re fast we can finish up here before another attack.', 46793, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That\'s right! They can keep on comin\', we\'ll keep knockin\' \'em down!', 'THAT\'s how you handle an orc, boys.', 46792, 7, 0, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You think you\'ve won, but the forces of Twilight will triumph in the end!', '', 46791, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay for this, traitor!', '', 46790, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo ho, Yo ho, a pirates life for me!', 'Yo ho, Yo ho, a pirates life for me!', 46789, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yarg!', 'Yarg!', 46788, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing warms my bones like this trusty southsea rum!', 'Nothing warms my bones like this trusty southsea rum!', 46787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The portals will open and your precious city will be swept away!', '', 46786, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What in Cho\'Gall\'s name are you doing?!', '', 46785, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'LL GET YOU, GOLDMINE!', '', 46784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sweep the ridge! Kill the Wildhammer!', 'Sweep the ridge! Kill the Wildhammer!', 46783, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heads up, $n. The Dragonmaw are about to attack!', 'Heads up, $n. The Dragonmaw are about to attack!', 46782, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More Wildhammer scum. Assault the ridge!', '', 46781, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was close!', '', 46780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic, bearded little rodents!', '', 46779, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Another one dead.', '', 46778, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weakness. These dwarves are nothing!', '', 46777, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now stay dead.', '', 46776, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eat dirt, stumpy!', '', 46775, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How many coconuts can we get for the ugly one?', '', 46774, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 18259, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'At last, you\'re back! We were beginning to worry that you\'d been arrested.', 46773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More cultist traitors? Good job gettin\' \'em off the streets.', '', 46772, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We serve Stormwind faithfully, my lady!', 'We serve Stormwind faithfully, my lady!', 46771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('YOU\'RE BOTH GOING TO BURN!', '', 46770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But these cultists are determined to bring Stormwind to ruin. Men, we must remain vigilant for our city and our king, as $n as done!', 46769, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guards, let $n serve as an example to you in defending Stormwind from its enemies.', 46768, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ancients of wheat and water, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Stormwind!', 'Ancients of wheat and water, I have peppered the way for you. Come forth and glaze Stormwind!', 46767, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep yer eyes open fer Dragonmaw.', 'Keep yer eyes open fer Dragonmaw.', 46766, 7, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s a lot of gear here we can still use. Fan out. And step lively! The Dragonmaw are near.', 'Grab what supplies you can and move quick. Expect the Dargonmaw any minute!', 46765, 7, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are betrayed! You may have won here, but the ritual will succeed!', '', 46764, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fool! This is a ritual, not a recipe!', '', 46763, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like a Dunwald. I like you.', '', 46762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Attack!', '', 46761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s appears to be waking up!', '', 46760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s slumps down in exhaustion.', '', 46759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathwing\'s madness overcomes him, and we, the red dragons, must take this opportunity to steal his black dragons from beneath him.  We will remake the black dragons as they were intended to be: the warders of the earth.', 46758, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will now remove the fog from your eyes.  Behold, our captive.', 46757, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help!  Up here!', '', 46756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20921, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
