('Scraping', 'Scraping', 45886, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With this staff, the circle is entrusting an item of great power to you, $n. Use it to uphold the tenets of our order.', 45885, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh, my... The enchantment succeeded even beyond my expectations.', 45884, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Death means nothing to me, $r!', '', 45883, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can never stop the Scourge!', '', 45882, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aarrghhh...', '', 45881, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will never stop us!', '', 45880, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Foolish $r!  You seek the dwarf?  Baroness Anastari has hidden him well!', '', 45879, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She will never return the dwarf to you!', '', 45878, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Plaguewood is too big!  Your friend is gone!  You will never find him!', '', 45877, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But now that I have the items, I can sense the power Loganaar spoke about. They will make a fitting weapon for you.', 45876, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The dwarf belongs to our kind now!  Not yours!', '', 45875, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not fear death at your hands, $r!', '', 45874, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will tell you nothing, $r-pig!', '', 45873, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Loganaar said that you would be bringing powerful artifacts from Shadowfang Keep. At first, I questioned the value of these materials.', 45872, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve gathered them here for you, master.', '', 45871, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That should complete the enchantment. Here is your new staff, $n. Always use it in service to the Horde.', '', 45870, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jhag, did you set aside those formulas and regeants I asked for?', '', 45869, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your bow is complete, $n. I hope it will serve you as well as you have served the Horde.', 45868, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These materials you brought from Shadowfang Keep are no common things. They will invest your weapon with great power.', 45867, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ormak told me to expect you, $n.', 45866, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You won\'t find a finer firearm anywhere else in Orgrimmar.', 45865, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Adventurers are such hypocrites!  Like YOU just FOUND your weapon on the side of the road!', 45864, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ve made it a point not to argue with a dwarf when it comes to the earth.  If the Bronzebeards are sure this tablet will help solve the earth\'s problems, then by all means we should support them.', 45863, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All the more reason we need to reach the bottom of this.  This tablet from Ulduar will lead us in the right direction.  Brann is sure of it.  And if Brann is certain, then I am certain.', '', 45862, 7, 10604, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And our lack of answers only fuels the confusion.', '', 45861, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Troubling times indeed. Fear of the unknown makes people do foolish things.', 45860, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These cultists only exacerbate the problem.  They preach the end of the world, or that the world is having birthing pains... Hyperbole that is hard for the populace to ignore.', '', 45859, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hopefully we can get these answers quickly.  The people are frightened, and cultists are taking advantage of that fear.', 45858, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fleeing is not an option I wish to entertain at this point. We will find another way.  Perhaps these tablets from Ulduar will shed some light on our situation.', '', 45857, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It seems as if this world is coming apart at the seams.  I\'ve seen these symptoms before, on Draenor... We may not be able to stop this.  Fleeing may be our best option.', '', 45856, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Perhaps these events are also what have brought forth the Highborne from Shen\'dralar.', 45855, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, there is at least a wee bit of good news... no offense, Gelbin.  The shaking seems to have stirred up The Earthen Ring.  Even the Wildhammer shaman have offered their help.', '', 45854, 7, 10604, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m not certain we could organize our people to move even if we wanted to.  We\'ve also received word of hostile elementals appearing randomly across the lands, sometimes in towns, sometimes across the countryside.  Moving may not be an option.', 45853, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 'I\'m ready. Let\'s go!', 45852, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well then. Ready to fly?', '', 45851, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...because on the one hand, this could be a handy device, the \"Shake-a-Ton 2000.\"  But on the other hand, the last thing we gnomes want to see is the mountains of Dun Morogh collapse and crush Ironforge.\n', '', 45850, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And those that did know how dangerous these earthquakes can be.  To this day, the Exodar is still shaking from our rather abrupt arrival.', '', 45849, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poor Lightning. She\'s gonna need some time to recouperate.', '', 45848, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My bird! Lightning - they shot her! Those filthy beasts shot her from the sky!', '', 45847, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eliza isss pretty....sssso pretty...', 45846, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yet I am a true servant of the warchief and he does not grant boons lightly. His wisdom guides my hammer.', '', 45845, 0, 10575, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, magi! Be reborn as Forsaken!', 45844, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The dimensional barrier is broken! TAKE THEM NOW! FOR THE BANSHEE QUEEN!', 45843, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your weapon is finished. I think you will find our work a fitting reward for your loyalty to the Horde. Use it to remind our enemies why they should fear us!', '', 45842, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forget this, Crablegs.  It\'s takin\' too long!', '', 45841, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, friend. How fare the Wildhammer clans? We\'ve much to discuss!', '', 45840, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I haven\'t worked moonsteel in years, but it\'s not the kind of thing you forget. Apprentices, it\'s time to show you how to work real metal!', '', 45839, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, the elements clearly speak to you, and when I\'m done, you\'ll have a fine weapon to help you harness their power.', '', 45838, 0, 3284, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Still, looks are deceiving for the likes of you. Don\'t worry, I\'ll make something that favors your style of fighting.', '', 45837, 0, 62, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Perhaps you won\'t need to rely on your chanting so much with a proper weapon by your side.', '', 45836, 0, 1667, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you\'ve earned the respect of the warchief, there must be something to you. If you can lift the weapon, it\'s yours.', '', 45835, 0, 419, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have to admit, you\'re not what I expected when I received the warchief\'s commission.', '', 45834, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stuff me like a haggis! Kurdran Wildhammer - in the flesh. He lives!', '', 45833, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve got quite the setup here, friend. Come with me while I find out who\'s in charge.', '', 45832, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hope you Alliance are here to give them Dragonmaw Orcs a good thumpin\'.', '', 45831, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hop aboard, $n. Let\'s move!', '', 45830, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('RUN! DO NOT LET THEM TURN YOU!', '', 45829, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lordaeron belongs to the Alliance. You only delay the inevitable...', '', 45828, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The armies of the Alliance will march upon your bones!', '', 45827, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will... never... give up!', '', 45826, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will not succeed, monster!', '', 45825, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Minions, destroy the interloper! The shield must not come down!', '', 45824, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d only heard about your kind in stories, $r.  I never thought I\'d owe my life to one of you.', '', 45822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I owe you my life.  My people have paid a high price for defying Deathwing.', '', 45821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... *cough*  I thank you, stranger.', '', 45820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('SOUND THE ALARMS! INTRUDERS HAVE BREACHED THE PORTAL!', '', 45819, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Use the Ambermill Dimensional Portal.>', '<Use the Ambermill Dimensional Portal.>', 45818, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The dimensional portal hums.>', '', 45817, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we go yet, Tarenar?  I want to join the Crusade!', '', 45816, 0, 10653, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tarenar, you dolt!  The chapel is twenty yards away!  Let\'s get moving!', '', 45815, 0, 10653, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come on already!  Let\'s go!', '', 45814, 0, 10653, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good luck.', 'Good luck.', 45813, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well-done, heroes.  You have passed my test of combat.', '', 45812, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will see you in green fields on the other side, $n.', '', 45811, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will be goin\' now.  I have no reason to remain here.  I may be undead, but my will is my own.', '', 45810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They will pay for forsaking us.  For leaving us here amongst the beastly undead to rot...', '', 45809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It did not have to be this way!  I only wish to see my family again...to share with them this gift!', '', 45808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will have to pry the relics of the Dalaran archmages from my dead hands!', '', 45807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your warm-up is complete.  Now, the real trial begins!', '', 45806, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let the trial begin.  Rise, champions!  Rise, and meet these three in combat!', '', 45805, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You gotta love fel energy: Cheap, renewable, and guaranteed to blow things up.$B$BSure, you risk losin\' your eternal will to Unimaginable Horrors from Beyond Time and Space, but hey, risk versus reward!$B$BNow, what did you wanna see me about, hmmm?', 'You gotta love fel energy: Cheap, renewable, and guaranteed to blow things up.$B$BSure, you risk losin\' your eternal will to Unimaginable Horrors from Beyond Time and Space, but hey, risk versus reward!$B$BNow, what did you wanna see me about, hmmm?', 45804, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look. You don\'t even WANNA know the sorta stuff I could teach ya.$B$BSeriously. It\'d melt yer brain. Go play nice somewhere else.', 'Look. You don\'t even WANNA know the sorta stuff I could teach ya.$B$BSeriously. It\'d melt yer brain. Go play nice somewhere else.', 45803, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Controlling the Elements for Fun and Profit.\"$B$BThat\'s what it\'s all about, am I right?  Let\'s get ta work.', '\"Controlling the Elements for Fun and Profit.\"$B$BThat\'s what it\'s all about, am I right?  Let\'s get ta work.', 45802, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You need somethin\'?$B$BToo bad. I got nothin\' for ya, $c.', 'You need somethin\'?$B$BToo bad. I got nothin\' for ya, $c.', 45801, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lookin\' good, kid.$B$BWhat\'s the word? Up for some trainin\'?', 'Lookin\' good, kid.$B$BWhat\'s the word? Up for some trainin\'?', 45800, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?  I look like a $c to you?$B$BGet outta here, will ya?', 'What?  I look like a $c to you?$B$BGet outta here, will ya?', 45799, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard ya comin\' a league away, mon. Maybe ya need some more trainin\'?', 'I heard ya comin\' a league away, mon. Maybe ya need some more trainin\'?', 45798, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothin\' ta see here, mon.  Be on yer way, why don\'cha?', 'Nothin\' ta see here, mon.  Be on yer way, why don\'cha?', 45797, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, it ain\'t MY fault ya didn\'t learn proper spellcraft.\n\nGo pester a $c trainer, yeah?', 'Hey, it ain\'t MY fault ya didn\'t learn proper spellcraft.\n\nGo pester a $c trainer, yeah?', 45796, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey there, $n. Here for a lesson? I ain\'t got all day...', 'Hey there, $n. Here for a lesson? I ain\'t got all day...', 45795, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There you have it, $n. A mighty bow for a mighty hunter. Use it well in service of the Alliance.', '', 45794, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yo. Up for a little target practice?', 'Yo. Up for a little target practice?', 45791, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No offense, but you don\'t look like you could shoot the broad side of a pack kodo.$B$BHow about we stop wastin\' each other\'s time and you go find the right trainer.', 'No offense, but you don\'t look like you could shoot the broad side of a pack kodo.$B$BHow about we stop wastin\' each other\'s time and you go find the right trainer.', 45790, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The materials you have gathered from that cursed old keep will certainly make a worthy bow.', '', 45789, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You must be the talented hunter that Wulf mentioned, the hunter who has managed to attract King Wrynn\'s attention.', '', 45788, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You and your allies have struck against my kind at the gates to Grim Batol in the past. You\'ve shown no respect for the sacred oath we would die to keep. You\'ll find no trust with me.', 45787, 0, 924, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My drakes shall be watching you. Choose your words and your actions carefully, $r.', 45786, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fortunately for you, your fate is not mine to decide. Calen awaits you by the tree.', 45785, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know not whether you\'ve come on the call and beckon of your new Dragonmaw allies. Nor do I really care to trust you even if you do not.', 45784, 0, 923, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ve crossed into the domain of red dragons, $r.', 45783, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Of course, Lucan. Here they are.', 45782, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('At last, $n, here is your staff. Wield it proudly in service to the Alliance.', '', 45781, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where did I put that scroll? Ah, yes, here it is...', '', 45780, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jessara, hand me those dusts and shards.', '', 45779, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Among the items you found in the keep is one that will serve as a powerful focus for your new staff.', '', 45778, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'re the one who ventured into Shadowfang Keep to retreive the rare and powerful materials hidden there?', '', 45777, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A commission from King Wrynn is always an honor. I\'ll get to work on it right away.', '', 45776, 0, 10575, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Success! The Siege Tank is able to retreat.', '', 45775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Siege Tank explodes!', '', 45774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('There! We got it! Let\'s get \'er outta here.', 'There! We got it! Let\'s get \'er outta here.', 45773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ahh, blast it. C\'mon, c\'mon already!', 'Ahh, blast it. C\'mon, c\'mon already!', 45772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend the Siege Tank!', '', 45771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skinning', 'Skinning', 45770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mining', 'Mining', 45769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism', 'Herbalism', 45768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 45767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Error retrieving data.... Please see Doc Zapnozzle for further instruction.>', '', 45766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('First Aid', 'First Aid', 45765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking', 'Cooking', 45763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You may train any of the secondary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>', '', 45762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to purchase secondary profession training.', 'I\'d like to purchase secondary profession training.', 45761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tailoring', 'Tailoring', 45760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leatherworking', 'Leatherworking', 45759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jewelcrafting', 'Jewelcrafting', 45758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inscription', 'Inscription', 45757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Engineering', 'Engineering', 45756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enchanting', 'Enchanting', 45755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blacksmithing', 'Blacksmithing', 45754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alchemy', 'Alchemy', 45753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<You may train in up to two primary professions. Please choose from the following selections:>', '', 45752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Once again you have impressed me, $n. Without your aid, we would have not made it this far. Walk with me...', 45751, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Armor, weapons, whatever you may need, you will find at the supply depot behind me. Go now.', 45750, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you wish, Banshee Queen.', '', 45749, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Prepare your men. The Gilneas Liberation Front amasses at the Greymane Wall. Soon their reinforcements from Stormwind will arrive. We haven\'t a minute to waste.', 45748, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Or in this case, better undead than worgen.', '', 45747, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Though as I have always said, better dead than worgen.', '', 45746, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The irony of what I have become is not lost upon me, Lady Sylvanas.', '', 45745, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, of course...', 45744, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde...', '', 45743, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You live to serve me, Godfrey. Together we will crush the worgen uprising and retake Gilneas for the Forsaken.', 45742, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I live again...', '', 45741, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, Lord Vincent Godfrey. Be reborn as an instrument of my vengeance!', 45740, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, it is good that things have turned out... better for you and your people, High Tinker.  But not all of us have the luxury of up and moving our kingdom.', '', 45739, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ha, not at all!  Though it is a striking coincidence.  Gnomeregan has been and continues to shame our people.  It is long past time we reclaim our homeland.', '', 45738, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So is that why you have moved out?', 45737, 7, 10604, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our top minds have been looking into the seismic activities... Well, we\'ve mostly been looking at how to secure a building\'s frame while at the same time simulating tectonic shifts...\n', '', 45736, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This might just change your mind.  Brann is shipping the tablets to me as we speak. Preliminary reports from the Explorers\' League state that they may be able to help us understand what is going on with the earthquakes.', '', 45735, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing good has come from that dreadful place.\n', '', 45734, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve received word from my brother Brann in Northrend.  In his exploring of Ulduar he came across some unusual tablets... something ancient.', '', 45733, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even in Darnassus we have noticed the earth is at odds with something.', 45732, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We dwarves have a connection to the earth.  We can feel her pain.  And right now the earth is crying out.  These earthquakes... they are both natural and not.  I wanted to gather you all together and discuss them.', '', 45731, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What do you mean?', 45730, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve no doubt noticed the string of earthquakes we\'ve had in the last weeks.  Something doesn\'t feel right about them.', '', 45729, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are ready to proceed.  Magni, you have called this meeting.  What concerns you?', '', 45728, 7, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do nothing.  Betina said only one drop was needed.', 'Do nothing.  Betina said only one drop was needed.', 45727, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing seems to happen.  The plague cauldron may be ruined, but it certainly doesn\'t look any different.  What will you do?', '', 45726, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your weapon is finished, $n. Wield it as an example to all who serve the Alliance.', '', 45725, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s been years since I last worked moonsteel, but I haven\'t forgotten the technique. Dane, join me at the anvil.', '', 45724, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The metals do not speak to me as the elements speak to you, but I hope that you will find this weapon worthy. King Wrynn and your farseer both have great confidence in your abilities.', '', 45723, 0, 3284, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw in all 12 flasks.', 'Throw in all 12 flasks.', 45722, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw in an entire flask.', 'Throw in an entire flask.', 45721, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Put in a drop of liquid, as Betina requested.', 'Put in a drop of liquid, as Betina requested.', 45720, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cauldron bubbles violently.', '', 45719, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I\'ll try to get her moving again...', 'Aye, protect the tank while the boys make repairs! I\'ll try to get her moving again...', 45718, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here are some spare parts. I\'ll cover you while you make repairs!', 'Here are some spare parts. I\'ll cover you while you make repairs!', 45717, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Needless to say, it is an honor to work on behalf of such an upstanding servant of the Light and the Alliance.', '', 45716, 0, 1667, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shadow_shadetruesight.blp:20|t%s begins to cast |cFFFF0000|Hspell:82299|h[Fester Blood]|h|r!', '', 45715, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('She\'s hung up in the debris and I\'ve lost steam pressure. This terrain is murder!$B$BCan you get us out of this?', 'She\'s hung up in the debris and I\'ve lost steam pressure. This terrain is murder!$B$BCan you get us out of this?', 45714, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any friend of SI:7 is a friend of mine. Wouldn\'t want to end up on the wrong side o\' me own blade, now, would I?', '', 45713, 0, 62, 11, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It will be an honor to carry out King Wrynn\'s commission for a warrior so dedicated to the Alliance.', '', 45712, 0, 419, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horton motions to the rickety riverboat nearby.', '', 45711, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I take your test again, Vex\'tul?', 'Can I take your test again, Vex\'tul?', 45710, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You do not need to fight me, $r.  I mean you no ill will.', '', 45709, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, brothers!  Attack the $r!', '', 45708, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Oh my... hang on tight!', 45707, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So be it. Farewell, Belmont.', 45706, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and your coin are -always- welcome here.', 'You and your coin are -always- welcome here.', 45705, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now move out! You must not keep the Banshee Queen waiting.', '', 45704, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll probably make it back to the Forsaken Front before you two, er, three.', '', 45703, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll be fine, Arthura. The worgen lost our scent. It\'s doubtful that they even know we\'re here.', '', 45702, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What about you, Belmont? How will you get back?', 45701, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These are the reasons that you must leave.', '', 45700, 1, 10604, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Despite our success in Northrend, we face serious problems that cannot be solved simply by axe and sword.  Earthquakes shake every region.  Elementals ravage the countryside.  I can hear our land, Azeroth, cry out in pain.', '', 45699, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forgive my outburst.  Warchief, please, continue.', '', 45698, 1, 10604, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Garrosh! Vol\'jin!  Hold your tongues.  There are larger issues at stake.', '', 45697, 1, 10604, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch yourself, young one. You don\'t-', '', 45696, 1, 10604, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Our\" success?  Troll, you played no part in the Horde\'s victories in Northrend.  While I led our warriors against the Lich King, you merely took back a few scattered islands.', '', 45695, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da people be happy with our success in Northrend.', '', 45694, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know that these are troubling times for the Horde.  Our supplies dwindle.  Our lands are barren.  Our warriors are in need of rest.  These are tasks that must be addressed for the good of the Horde.', '', 45693, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No, Warchief, this is enough.', '', 45692, 1, 10604, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I do not wish to make an event of this.  Such frivolities are expensive and merely serve our vanity.  But if you wish to have a celebration...', '', 45691, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are we not going to have more witnesses?', '', 45690, 1, 10604, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let us begin.', '', 45689, 1, 10604, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not be alarmed. I am not as I appear.$B$BMy name is Acridostrasz, though you may call me Acride. My Queen sent me here to stop Nefarian, and I will not rest until my task is complete. However, there are other foes here guarding his lair that I cannot take on alone.$B$BHelp me dispose of them, and you will be in the favor of Alexstrasza. You may not know that name, but you will one day be thankful you do, of this I am certain. ', '', 45688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Please take me to Vashj\'ir.', 'Yes. Please take me to Vashj\'ir.', 45687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just stand back, $n. We wouldn\'t want $gyou:a pretty little thing like you; getting hurt.', '', 45686, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Speak with Joseph Redpath in the center of Darrowshire.', '', 45685, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Joseph Redpath has been corrupted!  Kill him quickly!', '', 45684, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain Redpath has appeared on the battlefield!  Protect him!', '', 45683, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horgus the Ravager has appeared!  Kill him quickly!', '', 45682, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Protect Davil Lightfire!', '', 45681, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help Joseph Carlin\'s troops defend Darrowshire!', '', 45680, 0, 3122, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you need to return to Vashj\'ir?', 45679, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What can I do to help?', 'What can I do to help?', 45678, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This here terrain is terrible! Spongy ground, all lumpy-like with stumps and stones. Like angry oatmeal. The mud\'ll practically swallow a steam tank whole.$B$BOur gear\'s all mired in the muck, getting thumped by the Horde!', '', 45677, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This place is an archaeologist\'s dream!$b$bI wish there were time to conduct a proper excavation.', '', 45676, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ride Fiona\'s Caravan to its next destination.', 'Ride Fiona\'s Caravan to its next destination.', 45675, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inside the caravan are boxes of vendor supplies, along with the personal belongings of Fiona and her companions.', '', 45674, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Until we meet again.', '', 45673, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Farewell for now.', 45672, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello again, $c.', 45671, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, traveler?', '', 45670, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hail.', '', 45669, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, I can\'t.  I\'ve been tasked to watch this hippogryph post.  These things might seem tame, but they really require a twenty-four hour vigil.', 45668, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No thanks!  Maybe sometime in the future.  Or the past.  Not today.', 45667, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh!  No, I could never.  Afraid of horses.', '', 45666, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve spent far too long in that town.  It\'s a wonderful place, and I enjoyed my service there, but I think I\'d prefer to stay here.', '', 45665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve helped me clear the roads of all that nasty wildlife, so I suppose I have no choice.  Let\'s get going!', '', 45664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I am headed in that direction.  I\'ve only been dallying here at Crown\'s Guard because of all the wildlife activity on the roads.$b$bI\'ll make you a deal: help me clear the roads, and yes, I\'ll join your group.', '', 45663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you interested in joining our caravan?  We\'re headed to Light\'s Hope Chapel.', 'Are you interested in joining our caravan?  We\'re headed to Light\'s Hope Chapel.', 45662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s coats his weapons in wolfsbane oil.', '', 45661, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let them come! All will fall before the Dark Lady\'s war machine!', '', 45660, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am more alive now than I ever was as a human. THIS is life, $n. This is living!', '', 45659, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance will never recover from the blow that we are about to deal them!', '', 45658, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With Godfrey on our side, we will crush this uprising!', '', 45657, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My men recovered the corpses of two of Godfrey\'s lieutenants: Baron Ashbury and Lord Walden.', '', 45656, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godfrey will be our ace in the hole. With his knowledge of Gilneas and of the worgen, we cannot fail.', '', 45655, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am told that Godfrey snapped when he learned of his king\'s affliction. Could you imagine the sense of betrayal he must have felt? His own king one of the very beasts that he spent his existence killing?', '', 45654, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Godfrey spent his life defending Gilneas. When the worgen curse spread across Gilneas he turned his attention towards thwarting the worgen assault.', '', 45653, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There were two others that were already recovered. Godfrey is the final piece.', 45652, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Banshee Queen sees all.', 45651, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'These pathetic pups cannot hope to withstand the might of the Forsaken.', 45650, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mortals... They never cease to amaze me.', 45649, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This Godfrey must be quite an extraordinary individual. The mistress has sacrificed much for his return.', 45648, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death to all that would oppose the Forsaken!', 45647, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mine is not to question why.', 45646, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We mustn\'t fail the Banshee Queen.', 45645, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will find you, monster!', 'We will find you, monster!', 45644, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 19345, 19345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO ESCAPE!', 'NO ESCAPE!', 45643, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 19345, 19345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re coming for you!', 'We\'re coming for you!', 45642, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 19345, 19345, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We were hoping you wouldn\'t surrender peacefully!', 'We were hoping you wouldn\'t surrender peacefully!', 45641, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can smell you!', 'I can smell you!', 45640, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I think I see them! HERE! HERE!', 'I think I see them! HERE! HERE!', 45639, 0, 10538, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I sent my pet out to get me shome more to drink.  You\'ll be shorry when he shows up with a wagon full of Mudder\'s Milk and you don\'t get any.', 'I sent my pet out to get me shome more to drink.  You\'ll be shorry when he shows up with a wagon full of Mudder\'s Milk and you don\'t get any.', 45638, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t like that pet anyways.  Beshides... People stop by all the time and give me their pets.  If I lost one, it doesn\'t matter, I\'ve got dozens more to lose!', 'I didn\'t like that pet anyways.  Beshides... People stop by all the time and give me their pets.  If I lost one, it doesn\'t matter, I\'ve got dozens more to lose!', 45637, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait... Where is my pet?  It\'s gone! No need to panic... Just need a quick drink and I can figure out where he went to.', 'Wait... Where is my pet?  It\'s gone! No need to panic... Just need a quick drink and I can figure out where he went to.', 45636, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HA! Shows how much you know.  I left the critter back on the third ship!', 'HA! Shows how much you know.  I left the critter back on the third ship!', 45634, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My pet! Oh no!  Uh... I am shure that pet is around here somewhere...', 'My pet! Oh no!  Uh... I am shure that pet is around here somewhere...', 45633, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shhh!  SHHH!!!!!  Maybe if you shtay quiet your pet might come back to you!', 'Shhh!  SHHH!!!!!  Maybe if you shtay quiet your pet might come back to you!', 45632, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, shtop bothering me.  You\'re a dishgrace to us all.  You can\'t even hold onto your own petsh!', 'Hey, shtop bothering me.  You\'re a dishgrace to us all.  You can\'t even hold onto your own petsh!', 45631, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Shalty.\"  That\'s my name!  Your name should be \"I can\'t hold onto petsh.\"  I can\'t believe anyone would trusht you with a beasht.  ', '\"Shalty.\"  That\'s my name!  Your name should be \"I can\'t hold onto petsh.\"  I can\'t believe anyone would trusht you with a beasht.', 45629, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe you should worry about your pet and not me!  I\'m taking care of my bushinesh jusht fine!', 'Maybe you should worry about your pet and not me!  I\'m taking care of my bushinesh jusht fine!', 45628, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s \"Salty!\"  I got here firsht!  I got off the boat and onto land firsht!  I called the name \"Salty.\"  Hey... Where\'s your pet at?', 'It\'s \"Salty!\"  I got here firsht!  I got off the boat and onto land firsht!  I called the name \"Salty.\"  Hey... Where\'s your pet at?', 45627, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\"Malty!\"  Hey, \"Malty!\"  I thought you were going to get us shome more booze!  What\'sh the hold up?', '\"Malty!\"  Hey, \"Malty!\"  I thought you were going to get us shome more booze!  What\'sh the hold up?', 45626, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pssst!  Pssst!  Hey!  \"Pepper!\"  Are you done hording all the shupplies!  You shee what I just did? Horde..  For the horde!', 'Pssst!  Pssst!  Hey!  \"Pepper!\"  Are you done hording all the shupplies!  You shee what I just did? Horde..  For the horde!', 45625, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yoo hoo!  \"Shmaltzy!\"  Hey, why come your shupplies... Whe... Oh... Um... You got lots of boxes to keep track of...', 'Yoo hoo!  \"Shmaltzy!\"  Hey, why come your shupplies... Whe... Oh... Um... You got lots of boxes to keep track of...', 45624, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey over there!  Hey!  Hey!  Over there!  How\'sh everything going Gororgararar?', 'Hey over there!  Hey!  Hey!  Over there!  How\'sh everything going Gororgararar?', 45623, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, \"Salty\" when are you going to get a new name? Thish town ain\'t big \'nough for two of ussh...', 'Hey, \"Salty\" when are you going to get a new name? Thish town ain\'t big \'nough for two of ussh...', 45621, 1, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her.', 'If my mother had told me there would be days like this I would not have believed her.', 45620, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again.', 'A drunk orc is  a sight to see.  An army of drunk orcs is a sight I wish to never see again.', 45619, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot promise that your rest will be peaceful, $c.  These orcs do not know when to quit.', 'I cannot promise that your rest will be peaceful, $c.  These orcs do not know when to quit.', 45618, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Surrender? I\'ll scrawl out the terms of our surrender in their blood.', '', 45617, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I would like to go back and see one of the visions again. Do you still have the enchanted blade?', 'I would like to go back and see one of the visions again. Do you still have the enchanted blade?', 45616, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not certain where. Start with their western base overlooking Highperch.', '', 45615, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer.', '', 45614, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop! You have bested my wind serpent.', '', 45613, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for the gifts. Let us see if you are worthy, $c!', '', 45611, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Never underestimate the power of proper supply management. The warriors may win the battles, but it\'s the supplies that win the war. ', '', 45610, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, brave heroes. Thank you for showing Azeroth that no matter how overhwelming the darkness becomes, a single Light can pierce through.', '', 45609, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stratholme may take quite some time to be rebuilt and fully cleansed, but it is an effort I will take great pleasure in watching unfold. Perhaps one day we will see the next great defender of the Light armed in the Bastion of the Silver Hand, or ordained in Alonsus Chapel. No matter the outcome, our work here will bear great fruit one day.', '', 45608, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your actions were pivotal in successfully reclaiming the city. Rivendare\'s death signifies the beginning of a new era for the Plaguelands. The few remaining Scourge should fall easily, and the land will at last be reborn.', '', 45607, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve done it, heroes! Stratholme is ours! Come, we wait just outside the Slaughterhouse!', '', 45606, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alliance reinforcements have arrived.', 'Alliance reinforcements have arrived.', 45605, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why, yes... does Chromie need this?  I suppose she would.$b$bYes, you may have it.  Feel free to leaf through the pages.  Inside you will find the history of Darrowshire, and the details of the events that led to the deaths of so very many men.', '', 45604, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Carlin, do you have the extended Annals of Darrowshire?', 'Carlin, do you have the extended Annals of Darrowshire?', 45603, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Here we are!', 45602, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon.', '', 45601, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Actually, I agree with Fiona.', '', 45600, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We won\'t lose a horse.  Look at them!  They look exactly like they did when we started.', '', 45599, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don\'t want to risk losing a horse.', 45598, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let\'s just go to Light\'s Hope Chapel!', '', 45597, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There\'s a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?', 45596, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe now I don\'t want to.  Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend.  It smells like horses up there.', '', 45595, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gidwin, you can sit in front with me next time.', 45594, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Sigh>... \"The Paladin Pals\".', '', 45593, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m dead serious.  I\'ve completely forgotten.', '', 45592, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You remember damn well enough what it was.', '', 45591, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?', '', 45590, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t do this, Tarenar.', '', 45589, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember when we were kids, Gidwin?  We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls.', '', 45588, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Giddy... you\'re mad at me, aren\'t you?', '', 45587, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gidwin?  Are you ignoring me?', '', 45586, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So seriously, how did your undead hunting go?  I want to hear stories.', '', 45585, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t.  You just told me!', '', 45584, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('H... how did you know that?', '', 45583, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m going to bet that you only killed four.', '', 45582, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m pretty sure I killed six.', '', 45581, 0, 0, 24, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine.  I killed five zombies.  And they were huge.  How many undead did you kill?', '', 45580, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who says you won the bet?  We haven\'t compared tallies yet.', '', 45579, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun.', '', 45578, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey now!  Why do you get to sit in front?', '', 45577, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shotgun!', '', 45576, 0, 0, 275, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Earth Mother be merciful!', 45575, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where are those lunkheads?', 45574, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Now, hurry along, little $n. I\'ve one more challenge to see if you\'re worthy of the honor.', '', 45573, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, do be a dear and kill Arnak for me along the way. He\'s become something of an embarassment to the family.', '', 45572, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, $c! You can follow simple clues.', '', 45571, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO! Magatha, forgive me! Bring me back!', '', 45570, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re the one my aunt sent? A test, no doubt. I\'ll kill you quickly and prove myself to her once again.', '', 45569, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Da Twilight\'s Hammer have been assaultin\' our rings all over da highlands, and dey\'ve taken many for demselves in da process. Dis be our last and we have no intention of givin\' it up, no matter what kind of horrors dey be summonin\' from the earth to assault us.', '', 45568, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Once you go shaman, you don\'t go back.$B$BI completely underestimated the usefulness of fire elementals. Easy to discipline too: just add water.', '', 45567, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('After everything, this is how it ends? Here on Darkcloud Pinnacle?', '', 45566, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew you were on your way. I don\'t care what they\'re saying about you or your connection to Arikara. This ends here!', '', 45565, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you, $c?', 45564, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is nothing I call my own that would be of use to you.$B$BPerhaps D\'lom will have something of interest to you in his collection.', '', 45563, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More artillery... more! I never liked peninsulas.', '', 45562, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So long as we\'re sendin\' troops up the beach, we should double-up the artillery-fire. You know, to help.', '', 45561, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thas\'it! Pulverize the beach! Leave nuthin\' but ... sand.', '', 45560, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can we fire some more cannons? I dunnae think we\'re firin\' nearly enough cannons.', '', 45559, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why would she choose... an outsider?', '', 45558, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Chosen of the Elder Crone! You don\'t realize yet, do you? I\'ll put an end to you first! You and your friend!', '', 45557, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That which has broken, I mend.$B$BSo much has been broken in recent time. So very much.', '', 45555, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot. I merely collect.$B$BIbdil may help you. His way is to mend.', '', 45554, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That which falls, I collect.$B$BOf late, there have been many things to gather.', '', 45553, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rifts are down and Ironforge is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.$B$BQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!', '', 45552, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, well, well, it looks like you people have a spine after all.', 45551, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'ll soon learn to kneel before the might of the Grimtotem! If I let you live.', 45550, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What have we here? A beaten coward and a meddling outsider?', 45549, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It will be a pleasure cleaving you in half!', 45548, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is a war, right? We\'re supposed to be able to kill our enemies with our weapons, right?', 'This is a war, right? We\'re supposed to be able to kill our enemies with our weapons, right?', 45547, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re gonna lose this war to \"regulations.\" What\'s next? Only wooden swords may be used???', 'We\'re gonna lose this war to \"regulations.\" What\'s next? Only wooden swords may be used???', 45546, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watered down garbage. Doesn\'t even slow \'em down.', 'Watered down garbage. Doesn\'t even slow \'em down.', 45545, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwagauugh!!! Augh feed you to da crocs!!!', '', 45544, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What did they test this crap on? Murlocs?', 'What did they test this crap on? Murlocs?', 45543, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This blight is useless.', 'This blight is useless.', 45542, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will meet you in Alonsus Chapel. It is the holy place where Uther the Lightbringer was ordained into the Silver Hand. It is the only building the Scourge cannot touch, and will be our forward base of operations in that half of the city. With your help, Stratholme will become the capital of the Light and a new beginning for Lordaeron.', '', 45541, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That is where you come in, heroes. The war for Stratholme is not yet over. Leave this area and travel east to the Eastwall Gate. It is the service entrance to the city, and the last remaining opening into Lord Aurius Rivendare\'s scourge-infested domain. If we defeat him, Stratholme will be ours once more.', '', 45540, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For now, we have regained control over this half of Stratholme and should rejoice for that. The former Bastion of the Silver Hand is back in the hands of its rightful owners. Countless treasures to the order reside here, and we now have a fortified location to launch our next assault.', '', 45539, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Regrettably, Balnazzar is not yet finished. Defeating a dreadlord in the mortal plane only sends it back to the Twisting Nether. He will be back one day, perhaps even working again with his brothers, Varimathras and Detheroc. ', '', 45538, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, heroes. Balnazzar had been a threat for far too long. He had a hand in the Scourge and the Scarlet Crusade, two of our most difficult foes. The Risen may have tipped the balance against us, had they time to fester.', '', 45537, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have nothing for you.$B$BHegrid, though, has been gathering Twilight supplies to replenish our own. You might speak with her.', '', 45536, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 1, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Little of their camp has been left intact. Still, there might be something we can make use of.$B$BDid you require something of me, $r?', '', 45535, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Nay, but ye can talk ta Earthmender Doros over there... the big draenei, lookin\' over what\'s left o\' the Twilight camp.', 45534, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you repair equipment?', 'Can you repair equipment?', 45533, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you have any supplies?', 'Do you have any supplies?', 45532, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help ye, $c?', 45531, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gwaaaaaaaaaaaahhh!!!', '', 45530, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bwaaaah! You no take da treasure!!!', '', 45529, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For a small donation, I can train you in the priestly arts.', '', 45528, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, friend. You\'ll have to seek training elsewhere.', '', 45527, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Warning: This vehicle is not permitted to operate outside of Tol Barad. Turn back now.', '', 45526, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do not be afraid. I will not let you fall.', 45525, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde now controls the Twilight Shores beach head.', '', 45524, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance now controls the Twilight Shores beach head.', '', 45523, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve come at your call, Stonemother.', 'I\'ve come at your call, Stonemother.', 45522, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '<The Stonemother stares down at you. Through you. As if she\'s peering into your soul.>$B$BMy daughter, Theradras, sequestered herself deep within the Crystal Caverns of Terramok to grieve for her lost love, Zaetar. There, heartless, stoneless beings invaded and slaughtered her amidst her mourning.$B$BIf I had any reason to trust a creature afflicted by the curse of flesh, it was stripped from me that day. And yet in your arrogance, you persist.$B$BOne day, you will outlive your usefulness.', 45521, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have another Cleansing Totem?', 'May I have another Cleansing Totem?', 45520, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May I have another vial of Elemental Sapta?', 'May I have another vial of Elemental Sapta?', 45519, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Grimtotem have struck us for the last time. Since they cannot be taught the error of their ways, we will destroy them like beasts.$B$BEarth Mother forgive us.', '', 45518, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', 'We have much to do and very little time to do it if we\'re to assist the Freewind Post tauren and push the Grimtotem back.$B$BTor ilisar\'thera\'nal! Let our enemies beware!', 45517, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gandling is strong, but do not worry.  I will join you shortly after you begin to fight him.', '', 45516, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the proper technology, you can fix anything, $n. Of course there are always malfunctions, short circuits, and uncooperative patients to keep things interesting.', 45515, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may rest here, if you like. The Temple of Earth is under our care, now.', '', 45514, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Access profession vending machine', 'Access profession vending machine', 45513, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d like to purchase primary profession training.', 'I\'d like to purchase primary profession training.', 45512, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Join me ... in the depths.', 45511, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Quality you can depend upon until the explosive end!>$B$B<Insert moolah for profession training and vending services.>', '', 45510, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Training', 'Training', 45509, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, heroes. Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Ironforge.', '', 45506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well done, heroes. Let us return through the very portal meant to send this beast through! Much work awaits me in Thunder Bluff.', '', 45505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar! Let us return through that portal we left behind... much work awaits me in Orgrimmar.', '', 45504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, $n. Time to see what this staff of yours has to show us.', '', 45503, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eh - what? Who? What\'s going on?', '', 45502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day.', 'Good day.', 45501, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t go in there!', 'Don\'t go in there!', 45500, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De tauren says that she\'ll teach me to heal if we do a good job!  Let\'s go, mon!', '', 45499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will join you soon. Together, we will teach these Grimtotem cowards the meaning of fear!', '', 45498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nechi owachi, $c. Hello and thank you.', '', 45496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Is that a.. a val\'kyr?', '', 45495, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will rejoin you soon. We will teach these Grimtotem savages the meaning of honor.', 45494, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ishnu-alah, $c. Good fortune to you.', 45493, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now this is how you win a war!  Someone ought to teach that death knight some military strategy.', 45492, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hadn\'t planned on fighting soldiers AND farmers.  With these farmers nipping at our flank, we risk losing focus on the task at hand: taking Andorhal.', '', 45491, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I spoke too quickly, $n.  Even with your support, things are looking grim for our forces out there.', '', 45490, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are winning this battle, $n.  As long as those farmers keep chipping away at the Forsaken\'s flanks, we will overtake them.', '', 45489, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will need some time to study these samples, $n.  I will speak to you again when I have completed my analysis.', '', 45488, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cower before the tempest storm!', '', 45487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20228, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your city will be buried, your lives forfeit to the elements!', '', 45486, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20230, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Suffer the storm!', '', 45485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20229, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky... Beckons...', '', 45484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20226, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Winds of the south, rise and come to your master\'s aid!', '', 45483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20227, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing more than dust in the wind.', '', 45482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20232, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I. AM. UNLEASHED!', '', 45481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20231, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes.', 45480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome ta Moonglade, $c. All be welcome \'ere, as long as ya be keepin\' the sacred peace.', 'Welcome ta Moonglade, $c. All be welcome \'ere, as long as ya be keepin\' the sacred peace.', 45479, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot offer ya trainin\', friend.', 'I cannot offer ya trainin\', friend.', 45478, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you should need reagents, I have a full selection available.', '', 45477, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay alert, now. There\'s no telling what we might run into down here...', '', 45476, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let\'s go, $n. Stay close.', '', 45475, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Watch your step!', '', 45474, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
