('', 'You, too, shall serve!', 45461, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'They attacked us when the waters rushed in! It was almost as if they knew what was going to happen.$B$BThey should all suffer for what they\'ve done.', 45460, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The South Spire has been destroyed!', '', 45459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The South Spire has been heavily damaged!', '', 45458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The West Spire has been heavily damaged!', '', 45457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The West Spire has been destroyed!', '', 45456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Xan\'tish and his snakes are slitherin\' around de valley\'s central building, mon.', 'Xan\'tish and his snakes are slitherin\' around de valley\'s central building, mon.', 45455, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The East Spire has been destroyed!', '', 45454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The East Spire has been heavily damaged!', '', 45453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A small group of us, druids and sentinels, have come to aid the tauren of Freewind Post with our common enemy: the Grimtotem Clan.', '', 45452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hold fast, $c. This is for yer own protection.', '', 45451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kneel, Alliance!  Kneel before the might of the Forsaken!', 45449, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Huju and Xen\'to can take care of ya.$B$BFind dem in de valley\'s central building, mon.', 'Huju and Xen\'to can take care of ya.$B$BFind dem in de valley\'s central building, mon.', 45448, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pet Snakes', 'Pet Snakes', 45447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Poisons & Reagents', 'Poisons & Reagents', 45446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trade Supplies', 'Trade Supplies', 45445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('General Goods', 'General Goods', 45444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Old Umbehto be on a lil\' islet east of de valley\'s central buildin\'.', 'Old Umbehto be on a lil\' islet east of de valley\'s central buildin\'.', 45443, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I may or may not have pissed myself.', '', 45442, 0, 10466, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ORC NEEDS PEANUTS!', '', 45441, 0, 10466, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My power has returned!', '', 45440, 0, 10466, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('HELL OF A KICK TO THAT ALE!', '', 45439, 0, 10466, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush and clobber! Bobber slobber!', '', 45438, 0, 10466, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAAAAALLLLLLLLLLEEEEEEEEE!!! ARRRRRRRRGGGHHHH!', '', 45437, 0, 10466, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fishing', 'Fishing', 45436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jandi and Zeal\'aya work from a hut just north of de valley\'s central building.$B$BDey can help ya wit\' whatever ya need, mon.', 'Jandi and Zeal\'aya work from a hut just north of de valley\'s central building.$B$BDey can help ya wit\' whatever ya need, mon.', 45435, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Herbalism', 'Herbalism', 45434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zamja be de best cook in Orgrimmar, mon.$B$BYou can find her just south of de valley\'s central building. Batamsi sells de food Zamja makes, too, if ya just be hungry.', 'Zamja be de best cook in Orgrimmar, mon.$B$BYou can find her just south of de valley\'s central building. Batamsi sells de food Zamja makes, too, if ya just be hungry.', 45433, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cooking', 'Cooking', 45432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be crazy, mon, meddlin\' with dat bad mojo. But I ain\'t one ta stop ya.$B$BUnjari Feltongue is in de taller building in de southeast, past de shadow priest\'s shrine.', 'You be crazy, mon, meddlin\' with dat bad mojo. But I ain\'t one ta stop ya.$B$BUnjari Feltongue is in de taller building in de southeast, past de shadow priest\'s shrine.', 45431, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be lookin\' for Sesebi, mon.$B$BShe most often be sleepin\' under de tree by old Umbehto, de fisherman, lookin\' like a big ol\' tiger.', 'You be lookin\' for Sesebi, mon.$B$BShe most often be sleepin\' under de tree by old Umbehto, de fisherman, lookin\' like a big ol\' tiger.', 45430, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ku\'nanji, de Night-Stalker, is who yer lookin\' for.$B$BHe be just north of de Valley of Spirits\' central building.', 'Ku\'nanji, de Night-Stalker, is who yer lookin\' for.$B$BHe be just north of de Valley of Spirits\' central building.', 45429, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Shadow-Walker Zuru can help ya.$B$BYou\'ll find him on de lowest floor of de taller building in de southeast.', 'Shadow-Walker Zuru can help ya.$B$BYou\'ll find him on de lowest floor of de taller building in de southeast.', 45428, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This may look like a losing battle, but the Scarlet Crusade will prevail. I believe wholly in our capability to eradicate the scourge in Stratholme. And though I do not look favorably upon the Argent Dawn, the Brotherhood of the Light is much closer to how I like to work.$B$BEnough idle chatter, $c. Let\'s get started. ', 45427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Like an angel...', '', 45426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are no emotions. There are no morals. There are no zealots.$B$BThere is only the Brotherhood.$B$BHere, in the very chapel where Uther the Lightbringer joined the Order of the Silver Hand, I, Korfax, Champion of the Light, will inspire fear into the fearless.$B$BNothing will curb my fury - not the Scarlet Crusade, not the Argent Dawn, not my brothers, not even you.', '', 45425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dey be on top of de tall building in de southeast end of de valley.', 'Dey be on top of de tall building in de southeast end of de valley.', 45424, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No gold for oil!', 'No gold for oil!', 45423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cap it!', 'Cap it!', 45421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Junk shot that thing!', 'Junk shot that thing!', 45420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There Will Be Blood!', 'There Will Be Blood!', 45419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Find your black gold somewhere else!', 'Find your black gold somewhere else!', 45418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To arms, brothers and sisters! They are destroying the land!', 'To arms, brothers and sisters! They are destroying the land!', 45417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re polluting our new home!', 'You\'re polluting our new home!', 45416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Break this unnatural thing!', 'Break this unnatural thing!', 45415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kuzari and Zanga are trainin\' headhunters on one of de small islets towards de southeast end of de valley, mon.', 'Kuzari and Zanga are trainin\' headhunters on one of de small islets towards de southeast end of de valley, mon.', 45414, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Witch Doctor Umbu spends his time walkin\' about de valley, tendin\' to de people and elemental spirits alike.$B$BLook for him around de central building.', 'Witch Doctor Umbu spends his time walkin\' about de valley, tendin\' to de people and elemental spirits alike.$B$BLook for him around de central building.', 45413, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Brotherhood of the Light transcends the ability of any other group to eradicate affronts to the Light. We will take any actions necessary to rid the world of foul beasts like these undead. Nothing will stand in our way.$B$BAre you with us, or against us?', '', 45412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
