('Which ya be lookin\' for?', 'Which ya be lookin\' for?', 45402, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Right outside de valley\'s inn, mon.$B$BIt be de tall building in de middle.', 'Right outside de valley\'s inn, mon.$B$BIt be de tall building in de middle.', 45401, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be wantin\' Sijambi, mon.$B$BShe be in de tall building in de middle of de valley.', 'You be wantin\' Sijambi, mon.$B$BShe be in de tall building in de middle of de valley.', 45400, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De auction house and bank be at de top of de tall building in de middle of de valley, mon.$B$BLook for Ziji and Makavu.', 'De auction house and bank be at de top of de tall building in de middle of de valley, mon.$B$BLook for Ziji and Makavu.', 45399, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey der, mon.$B$BIf ya be ready, I can teach ya how ta be conjurin\' up a portal back ta dis place...', 'Hey der, mon.$B$BIf ya be ready, I can teach ya how ta be conjurin\' up a portal back ta dis place...', 45398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry, $c.$B$BI ain\'t believin\' ya got de right mind for graspin\' de nature of portal magic.', 'Sorry, $c.$B$BI ain\'t believin\' ya got de right mind for graspin\' de nature of portal magic.', 45397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey der, mon.$B$BDid ya need help recoverin\' a lost companion?', 'Hey der, mon.$B$BDid ya need help recoverin\' a lost companion?', 45396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey der, mon.$B$BDid ya want ta be stablin\' yer pets, or were ya lookin\' for a lost companion?', 'Hey der, mon.$B$BDid ya want ta be stablin\' yer pets, or were ya lookin\' for a lost companion?', 45395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
