('Barber', 'Barber', 45376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve been meaning to investigate this site.$b$bNo time like the present!', '', 45375, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, mon. What can I be helpin\' ya find?', 'Hey, mon. What can I be helpin\' ya find?', 45374, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 'You be a LONG way from home, mon. Heh heh heh.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 45373, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 396, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('This rock is about to fall! Jump to another!', 'This rock is about to fall! Jump to another!', 45372, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t see many a\' your kind \'round here, mon.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 'Don\'t see many a\' your kind \'round here, mon.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 45371, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You take a wrong turn, mon? Heh heh heh.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 'You take a wrong turn, mon? Heh heh heh.\n\nWhat can I be helpin\' ya find?', 45370, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 153, 396, 0, 0, 3, 0, 39653),
('Shovel meet head!', '', 45369, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come to die, have you?', '', 45368, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gory give up!  You farmers fight more good!', '', 45367, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You want to fight?  Alright, Gory fight.', '', 45366, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('These so-called paladins won\'t let me through so I can see if any of the legendary Ezra Grimm\'s famous tobacco remains in Stratholme! They\'re no better than the scourge, if you ask me.$B$BBetween you an\' me, I think their \'brotherhood of the light\' is a hoax. An elaborate ploy I tell ya!', '', 45365, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you really want to help out, you can help me and my friends with some combat practice.', 'If you really want to help out, you can help me and my friends with some combat practice.', 45364, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gory not very good at planting, but Gory VERY good at reaping.', '', 45363, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gory wants to help out on farm.  Gory already has his own scythe!', '', 45362, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gory just happy to be in the sun.', '', 45361, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gory always wanted to be a farmer.', '', 45360, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weapons...armor...these are the keys to victory. Any warrior, no matter how strong, is essentially defenseless without them.$B$BI have crafted many a legend in my day, $r. You will find nothing like them in all of Azeroth. They are the key to my brethren\'s success.', '', 45359, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can\'t see a thing with this mask on, but I\'m not about to tell HER that.', '', 45358, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Good to see you again! Thanks for the hand. I\'ll be back on my feet in just a moment.', 45357, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thought I couldn\'t handle them? Don\'t let my size be follin\' ya. Anyway, thanks for the hand.', '', 45356, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Glad to have a chance to catch my breath. Thanks for the help!', 45355, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This crate looks like it was used to store weapons and armor.', '', 45354, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Inspecting', 'Inspecting', 45353, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There! She reveals herself. Attack!', '', 45352, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t look at her... ruby red... soft... sensual lips! Oh...', '', 45351, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t listen to her voice!', '', 45350, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Avert yer eyes! Don\'t look at her!', '', 45349, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here she comes. Oh, foul temptress of the sea...', '', 45348, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I am unable to assist you.', 'I am unable to assist you.', 45347, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How may I assist you in the afterlife?', 'How may I assist you in the afterlife?', 45345, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll see to it that you get the middle fragment of the World Pillar.', '', 45344, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sorry about my earlier rudeness. I was worried about my father. Friends?', '', 45343, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rifts are down and Orgrimmar is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.$B$BQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!', '', 45342, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool!', '', 45341, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You thoughtless $r!  You\'ll pay for your interference!', '', 45340, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get away from here!', '', 45339, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who are you?  What have you done to me?', '', 45338, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... I think I\'m ready to leave now.', '', 45337, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve waited here for too long.  Time to say goodbye.', '', 45336, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, I\'ve said my goodbyes.  Time to move on.', '', 45335, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I must be going now...', '', 45334, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the South Spire.', 'Take me to the South Spire.', 45333, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the West Spire.', 'Take me to the West Spire.', 45332, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the East Spire.', 'Take me to the East Spire.', 45331, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Warden\'s Vigil.', 'Take me to the Warden\'s Vigil.', 45330, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Throw me back up!', 'Throw me back up!', 45329, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Ironclad Garrison.', 'Take me to the Ironclad Garrison.', 45328, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to the Slagworks.', 'Take me to the Slagworks.', 45327, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Take me to Baradin Hold.', 'Take me to Baradin Hold.', 45326, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thanks... this\'ll give us a couple more hours of not running into the rocks.  No guarantees after that.', '', 45325, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You no take crate!', '', 45324, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We cannot fail, $n.  The future of multiple worlds is at stake here.', '', 45323, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jump from rock to rock to attract the attention of the Broodmother!', '', 45322, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The broodmother flies above us! Do not fear, fleshling, I am called \"The Steady\" for a reason...', '', 45321, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slaughter them, $c! Destroy as many naga as you can to honor those that fell.', '', 45320, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fleet was mostly intact as it limped into harbor after our engagement with the Horde. We weighed anchor in the shadow of Highbank here to regroup.$B$BThen the naga came.$B$BScaly, glistening hands clambering up the anchor chains... dragging men, screaming, into the depths...$B$BThese are cursed shores, $n. Cursed. ', '', 45319, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hefting', 'Hefting', 45318, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'d be surprised how often that works.', '', 45317, 0, 10432, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s fires up the Goblin Barbecue!  Get ready to party!', '%s fires up the Goblin Barbecue!  Get ready to party!', 45316, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You win.  This time.', 'You win.  This time.', 45315, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mom was right... I\'ll NEVER make it into the Argent Crusade.', 'Mom was right... I\'ll NEVER make it into the Argent Crusade.', 45314, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose I need some more practice.', 'I suppose I need some more practice.', 45313, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well fought.', 'Well fought.', 45312, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get ready, \'cause here I come!', 'Get ready, \'cause here I come!', 45311, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine... but I won\'t hold back!', 'Fine... but I won\'t hold back!', 45309, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time for the Crusade is now!', 'The time for the Crusade is now!', 45308, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fine.  You want some of this?', 'Fine.  You want some of this?', 45307, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lieutenant Myner asked me to challenge you to a duel.', 'Lieutenant Myner asked me to challenge you to a duel.', 45306, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', 'Yes?', 45305, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m training right now.  Can this wait?', 'I\'m training right now.  Can this wait?', 45304, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is it?  I\'m a little busy here.', 'What is it?  I\'m a little busy here.', 45303, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Grunt>$b$bYou need something, $r?', '<Grunt>$b$bYou need something, $r?', 45302, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll pay with your life for interfering with my plans, you miserable scum!', '', 45301, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was just wondering what you knew about the gnolls to the south.  Someone has been giving them supplies to practice necromancy.', 'I was just wondering what you knew about the gnolls to the south.  Someone has been giving them supplies to practice necromancy.', 45300, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('W-what are you doing up here, $r?  Can\'t you see you\'re interfering with OFFICIAL ARGENT CRUSADE BUSINESS!?', '', 45299, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stolen supplies?  Well, let me think about it...$b$bI know a certain priest named Daria who took all the extra wine after last week\'s service, but didn\'t throw it out as I asked.  I believe she\'ll be apologizing soon, though.$b$b<Alphus winks at you.>$b$bI\'ve also heard an abnormal number of confessions this week from one of the mages... what was his name?  Crisp?  Lisp?  Something along those lines.$b$bNow, be on your way.', '', 45298, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m looking for someone who may have stolen some supplies from Hearthglen.  Have any leads for me?', 'I\'m looking for someone who may have stolen some supplies from Hearthglen.  Have any leads for me?', 45297, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the Light watch over you, child.  And how may I help you this fine day?', '', 45296, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well, let\'s see.  I heard that Magus Bisp has been spending his time cooped up on top of his tower, working on some new spell, or something.$b$bI heard that Del Gahrron was planning on retiring and heading back to his farm.  He may have already left, in fact.$b$bOh, and I heard that there\'s some $r $c running around town, asking people all sorts of annoying questions!$b$bJust playing with you, love.  Hope that information helped.', 45295, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, ma\'am.  Heard any interesting rumors lately?', 'Hello, ma\'am.  Heard any interesting rumors lately?', 45294, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello there, $c!', 45293, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What is this, an interrogation?  You\'re not one of Fordring\'s internal affairs guys, are you?$b$bWell, I\'ve got nothing to hide.  Let me look over my records.  Last week I sold a ball gown to Lieutenant Myner, which struck me as odd.  What else... Magus Bisp bought several dozen leather jerkins, which he couldn\'t give a reason for.  Oh, and Friar Burlingham came by to stock up on swimwear for his trip to Hardwrench Hideaway.  That\'s about it.$b$bNow if you don\'t mind, I have customers!', '', 45292, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers, buying anything suspicious?', 'Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers, buying anything suspicious?', 45291, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help you?', '', 45290, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, let\'s see... I saw some drudges running away from that mine over there.  Said something about a spider.  New customers?  Well, there\'s Jeralee, the lovely young gnome, who bought an axe twice her size last week.  Oh, and Magus Bisp came by asking for armor.  Not sure why he\'d need plate armor...', '', 45289, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers in the blacksmith shop?', 'Have you noticed anything strange lately?  Any new customers in the blacksmith shop?', 45288, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good day, $g brave: fair; $c.  How can I be of service?', '', 45287, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, $n! Into the chests!', '', 45286, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whoa... easy, now.', '', 45284, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AYYYIEEE!!', 'AYYYIEEE!!', 45283, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You just let Zen\'Kiki know when you\'re ready!  I\'ll bring one of these birds down for ya!', '', 45282, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Prepare to die, $r!', '', 45281, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill nearest mystic.', '', 45280, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just let me know when you\'re ready for the ritual, $n.', '', 45279, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me know when you\'re ready, $n.', '', 45278, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, $c.\n\nIt be a sad ting, de way de secrets of de world are hidden from ya: Time, Fate, de burnin\' stars an\' de cold, cold darkness between... never will ya know de truth of such tings!', 'Greetin\'s, $c.\n\nIt be a sad ting, de way de secrets of de world are hidden from ya: Time, Fate, de burnin\' stars an\' de cold, cold darkness between... never will ya know de truth of such tings!', 45277, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Greetin\'s, $n.  Are ya here ta be learnin\' of de Hidden Arts?', 'Greetin\'s, $n.  Are ya here ta be learnin\' of de Hidden Arts?', 45276, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who knows what dark an\' horrid tings be gibberin\' in de outer darkness... tings dat\'d drive a soul mad ta see?$B$B-We- be knowin\'. An\' you\'ve come lookin\' ta know -more,- haven\'t ya?', 'Who knows what dark an\' horrid tings be gibberin\' in de outer darkness... tings dat\'d drive a soul mad ta see?$B$B-We- be knowin\'. An\' you\'ve come lookin\' ta know -more,- haven\'t ya?', 45275, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('De secrets I have ta share would blast your soul apart, $c.$B$BTrust me: You be wantin\' ta talk ta someone else about trainin\'.', 'De secrets I have ta share would blast your soul apart, $c.$B$BTrust me: You be wantin\' ta talk ta someone else about trainin\'.', 45274, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '$n, may I have a moment of your time?', 45273, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They can drain the Loch until it\'s little more than a drip of mud, and we\'ll still fight to keep it ours.', '', 45272, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Horde Win', '', 45271, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Alliance Win', '', 45270, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Alliance Neutral', '', 45269, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Horde Neutral', '', 45268, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The rifts are down and Thunder Bluff is safe!  These portals must be the second half of their attack.$B$BQuickly! Into the portal! We must press the attack while we have the advantage!', '', 45267, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Alliance Contested', '', 45266, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Horde Contested', '', 45265, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Alliance Progress', '', 45264, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('DEBUG Event Sent - North - Horde Progress', '', 45263, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Keep starin\', I don\'t get any prettier.', 45262, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The triumphant $g hero : heroine; returns!$B$BYou haven\'t seen Magmatooth around, have you?$B$B<The initiate looks worried.>', '', 45261, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'d love to stop and chat awhile, but these explosives aren\'t going to move themselves...', '', 45260, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How about you don\'t go runnin\' off with my explosives this time, okay?', '', 45259, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Just look at this place!$b$bIt\'s an archaeologist\'s dream...', '', 45258, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('You\'re not thinkin\' about stealing my explosives again, are ya?', '', 45257, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You can thank me later.', 45256, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Shh... quiet, death knight.  When I\'m finished with you, your fear will be gone.', 45255, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No!', '', 45254, 0, 0, 20, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Fortunately, I have agents that can help you... erase this weakness.  Beneath the Undercity you go.', 45253, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas clearly failed when he created his death knights.  You are still weak.', 45252, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Y... your majesty...', '', 45251, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I know your secret, Koltira.  I\'m aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian.', 45250, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No thanks to you.  Andorhal should have been ours days ago, when we defeated the Scourge.', 45249, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I... your majesty, we were victorious!', '', 45248, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Enough of this insolence.  Do you think that I\'m blind to everything that goes on outside of the Undercity?', 45247, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your highness.  I deliver to you... Andorhal.', '', 45246, 0, 0, 16, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Koltira!  Your queen summons you!', 45245, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t listen to anything Alexi says. He was a fool to stay during the plague and now look at him - he\'s no better than the other abominations in this place.$B$BDon\'t fret, we will reclaim Scholomance and the surrounding lands for the last living son of Barov - the rightful heir.', '', 45244, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Weldon is nothing more than a damned coward. He fled from the scourge and now dares to come here as if he were some sort of hero?$B$BBah!', '', 45243, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m not made of fire totems, you know!', '', 45242, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Um, Goldmine, I seem to have misplaced your fire totem.', 'Um, Goldmine, I seem to have misplaced your fire totem.', 45241, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is not in my contract! Die, $r!', '', 45240, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know what you\'re after. I can sense it!', '', 45239, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Deepholm? I hate this place. Wait... you\'re not Initiate Goldmine!', '', 45238, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stonescale Matriarch is snared!  Avoid her attacks by staying on the move!', '', 45237, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NOOOOOO! You tell Goldmine he\'s a dead goblin! Our contract is over!', '', 45236, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The time has come!  March onward, and bring doom to the frightened denizens of this blasted land!', '', 45235, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The sky darkens with your impending demise!', '', 45234, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go forth, minions of destruction, and bathe this world in the flames of the twisting nether!', '', 45233, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The legion will conquer all!', '', 45232, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('INFERNO!', '', 45231, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have proven capable. Resourceful. I think you will be the one to take the fight to the gyreworms where we cannot. You will be the one to make your way deep into the Crumbling Depths, the only place where we cannot pass.', '', 45230, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The materials I offer are rare and powerful.', 45229, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lordaeron belongs to the Forsaken - always and forever.\n', 45228, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 20491, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will never allow it... Never!', 45227, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 20490, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But the Alliance does not recognize our rights. They claim this land is their own while attempting to invalidate the claims of the founders of this kingdom.', 45226, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The people who called this land their home in life, do so in death as well.', 45225, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Now the Lich King is dead and we have returned. ', 45224, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20487, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Our goal... Our sole purpose was to destroy the Lich King. We threw our lot in with the Horde and began our journey towards redemption.', 45223, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20486, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'From the cruelty and mercilessness of Arthas, the man who would be the Lich King, the Forsaken were born.', 45222, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With Arthas gone, so too was the control he held over the undead masses of Lordaeron. After recovering my body, I freed the remaining Scourge that were left behind.', 45221, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And though the hour of his atonement had come, the worm managed to escape his fate, returning to the frozen wastes of Northrend.', 45220, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was when Arthas was at his weakest that I struck!', 45219, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But Arthas was not invincible! With each passing day his power waned - his grip over the will of the damned loosening.', 45218, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 20481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In death, they were reborn as mindless undead.', 45217, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The eyes of the great lord Sargeras can see your betrayal, your desires, your utter destruction!', 45216, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sacrifice the nonbeliever!  In the name of Sargeras!', 45215, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bow down before your superiors, and you may yet survive the destruction of this puny world!', 45214, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Repent, mortals!  Repent in the face of unstoppable annihilation!', 45212, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Cleanse your soul in the flames of the abyss!', 45211, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A similar fate befell all that would die to the Scourge war machine.', 45210, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 20479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In his vast cruelty, Arthas severed my spirit from my body and raised me as a banshee to serve in his Scourge army.', 45209, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My own death came at the hands of Arthas when he and his armies sacked my homeland, Quel\'Thalas, and murdered my people.', 45208, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through Frostmourne, Arthas killed his own father and razed this land along with every living creature in it!', 45207, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This man-child, Arthas, took for himself a cursed blade known as Frostmourne.', 45206, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Arthas... even saying his name makes my body quiver in rage.', 45205, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Terenas had a son named Arthas.', 45204, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Long ago this land comprised the northern kingdoms of Lordaeron, ruled by King Terenas Menethil.', 45203, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'And my people have not always been the Forsaken.', 45202, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 20471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have not always been the Banshee Queen, $n.', 45201, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 20470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come in, mon... forget yer cares for a while!$B$BRest de body, rest de soul.', 'Come in, mon... forget yer cares for a while!$B$BRest de body, rest de soul.', 45200, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, here we go!', '', 45199, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('How did you manage to get here on foot alive? You must be quite the hero to brave Dire Maul.', '', 45198, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hm?', '', 45197, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What WAS that thing?', '', 45196, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve got to get out of here!', '', 45195, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was in Ironforge during the takeover - it was chaos.$B$BNo wonder father gets so protective when I leave the keep. ', '', 45194, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This way, $n. We will take them by surprise.', 45193, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Al\'golath mal shal\'nel... darkness consumes... ', '', 45192, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We are all counting on you.', 45191, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22616, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has successfully taken Tol Barad!', '', 45190, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has successfully taken Tol Barad!', '', 45189, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Horde has successfully defended Tol Barad!', '', 45188, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ve taken control of the temple and we\'re containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he\'s in charge.', 45187, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22615, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm\'s Fury.  It never made it here.', 45186, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'RUN!', 45185, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Run...', 45184, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together.', 45182, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22613, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
(' Looks like a last ditch effort by the stone troggs. Your destination is just around the corner!', '', 45181, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm.', 45180, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22612, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here come more stone troggs. Defend the catapult!', '', 45179, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stone troggs are attacking!', '', 45178, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gods of shadow, lords of twilight ... give me strength!', '', 45177, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is the Temple of Earth.  It\'s the most important structure in Deepholm.', 45176, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22611, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You made it!  Good!', 45175, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 22610, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Alliance has successfully defended Tol Barad!', '', 45174, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Deathwing\'s taint shall be wiped from Deepholm, and his Twilight cultists with it.', 45173, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'This is it!  Brace yourself!', 45172, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22609, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let us hope Thrall and the others can contain it while you\'re inside.', 45171, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!', 45170, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22607, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I hope you have a strong stomach.  Travelling through the breach is not for the weak.', 45169, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 22606, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We choose vengeance!', '', 45168, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We would rather die than be turned into worgen, but seeing as how even death provides no relief from the atrocities of this war...', '', 45167, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Help us destroy the Forsaken and retake Lordaeron for the Alliance!', '', 45166, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Drink in my blood and be reborn as worgen, immune to the depravity of the Forsaken.\n', '', 45165, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die in battle and be raised as a servant of the Forsaken or...', '', 45164, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A decision must be made!', '', 45163, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are out of time.', '', 45162, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Forsaken have broken through your defenses, magistrate.', '', 45161, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Farewell, $n.  Send my regards to the good men and women at the Menders\' Stead.', '', 45160, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('May the light embrace you.', '', 45159, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I care far too deeply about redeeming Eldre\'thalas to deal with any other matter. War, strife, allegiances, none of it matters until this city is safe.', '', 45158, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s lucky that you came along.', 'It\'s lucky that you came along.', 45157, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I thought I was going to die in there.', 'I thought I was going to die in there.', 45156, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m free! Thank you!', 'I\'m free! Thank you!', 45155, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get out of here!', 'I need to get out of here!', 45154, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you for saving me!', 'Thank you for saving me!', 45153, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('No! I won\'t let you interfere!  My transformation is not yet complete!', '', 45152, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
