('At least ye didn\'t have to leave a wife back in Ironforge.  I can\'t imagine what she\'s up to without me around.  Ya ken how ladies are around ore.', '', 45144, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
