('Blasted lands - what a fitting name.  Blast this place, blast this keep, and blast the other identical keep.', '', 45136, 0, 0, 14, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My gut is telling me that it\'s about time we jump into action and start drinking.', '', 45135, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Search for clues?  Here\'s a clue: it was the orcs.  Here\'s another clue: orcs smell.', '', 45134, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
