('Da Gordok no like Dagg\'thol, so he kill them. Da stupid trees and goat men no like Dagg\'thol, so he want kill them too.$B$BPuny $r like Dagg\'thol and help him take dis place for Master? Or does Dagg\'thol need kill you too?$B$BStupid tree keep staring at Ambassador Dagg\'thol...', '', 45125, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
