('Bishop threatens pawn...', '', 45102, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Bishop moves diagonally!', '', 45101, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He\'s coming.  Get ready, lads!', 45100, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Through me the Banshee Queen sees all...', 45099, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Life is meaningless. It is in the afterlife that we are truly tested.', 45098, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you feel it, $n? The darkness surrounds us.', 45097, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I long for the frozen wastes of Northrend.', 45096, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The warmth of this place sickens me.', 45095, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I sense doom in your future, $n.', 45094, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Different master, same insatiable thirst for power.', 45093, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Waste no time, $n. We mustn\'t keep the Banshee Queen waiting.', 45092, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, $n! Become Forsaken!', 45091, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Death is only the beginning.', 45090, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You serve the Banshee Queen now, mortal.', 45089, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Rise, Forsaken!', 45088, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Your soul is mine.', 45087, 0, 0, 457, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in fishing, and sell fishing poles and supplies.$B$BHow may I help you?', 'I can instruct you in fishing, and sell fishing poles and supplies.$B$BHow may I help you?', 45086, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?', 'I can instruct you in blacksmithing as well as supply the necessary tools.$B$BHow may I help you?', 45085, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need a drink!', '', 45080, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We gotta find the matriarch of this operation and end her!', '', 45079, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Thank you, friend. Let\'s kill us some overgrown... spiders. Sounded better in my head.', '', 45078, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to the party, $g pal:lady;!', '', 45077, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There is little time for idle chatter. Our people are in crisis and every sin\'dorei has a role to play in our restoration.', 45076, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here she comes, boss!', '', 45075, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Touch my chicken and I will kill you in your sleep. Am I understood?', '', 45069, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Forshaken do... that\'sh who...It\'sh sho big... Look at it\'sh big shtupid neck. I jusht want to choke it to death!', '', 45063, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'sh makin\' me hungry... why\'s it shooo big? You shome kind of idiot or shomething? Makin\' a chicken sho big... Who doesh that?', '', 45062, 1, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'sh with the huuuuge bush chick-a-doodle?', '', 45061, 1, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll go back to the throne room and keep an eye on Samuelson while you speak with Mathias. Stay safe!', '', 45059, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are not to speak to ANYONE about the agreement that was made today, $n.  Consider this an order from your direct superior.', '', 45056, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  I look forward to it.', '', 45055, 0, 0, 2, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 45054, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, I know.  And don\'t think I\'ll go easy on you.', '', 45053, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Eventually, we will fight this battle for Andorhal, and only one of us can walk off of this battlefield victorious.', '', 45052, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But you must be aware, Koltira: we are brothers no longer.  You are a member of the Horde now, and I of the Alliance.', '', 45051, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I see.  Then I will do the same.', '', 45050, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, it may... but not today.  With the Scourge out of the way, I plan to pull my troops back and regroup.', '', 45049, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It looks like it may have to come to that.', '', 45048, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s laughs.', '', 45047, 0, 0, 153, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You heard correctly, Thassarian.  I wanted to give you a chance to kill me again.', '', 45046, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Koltira!  I had heard rumors that you were here in Lordaeron.', '', 45045, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enough of this.  The Cult of the Damned doesn\'t need Andorhal.  This worthless city is yours to fight over.', '', 45044, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Horde!', '', 45043, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For the Alliance!', '', 45042, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is all wrong. There\'s nothing in here about the Twilight\'s Hammer. What is Samuelson playing at?', '', 45030, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hmmmm....', '', 45029, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Here we go. Nobody here will question it if the Prince wants to glance through some files.', '', 45028, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is the place. Samuelson\'s files should be on the third floor, all the way up the spiral staircase.', '', 45027, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where to put? Dey falling! HELP!', '', 45025, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OOF!', '', 45024, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I seem to have misplaced my sea pup, admiral. Do you have another that you could lend to me?', 'I seem to have misplaced my sea pup, admiral. Do you have another that you could lend to me?', 45023, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll burn this place to the ground before I am shamed in the eyes of Hellscream!', 45022, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<hic!> Well... Let\'s see... By my count, nobody. The whole crew\'s drunk out of their gourds, admiral... \'cept the sea pups... <hic!>', '', 45021, 1, 10439, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes.', 45020, 1, 10439, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Including me?', '', 45019, 1, 10439, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Who\'s not drunk, Torok?', 45018, 1, 10439, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey $n, we don\'t have to tell my father about that little ambush. If he finds out about an attempt on my life, he\'d never allow me out of that keep...', '', 45017, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You hear rustling of heavy wings in the distance.  The matriarch approaches!', '', 45016, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you don\'t mind me asking.  How did we manage to recover the fragment?  How did we infiltrate our enemies\' forces without their knowledge?', '', 45015, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course, ma\'am.  At once!', '', 45014, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The fragment is now in the dragon\'s custody, ma\'am.', '', 45013, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 20886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Let\'s just say we have friends in high places, forgemaster.', 45012, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21625, 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well done.  Meet me inside the Stonecore for further instructions.', 45011, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21624, 397, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Forgemaster!  I\'ve been informed the enemy has disrupted your operations.  Where is the fragment?', 45010, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 21623, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You runts want to riot?  I\'ll show you!', '', 45009, 0, 9625, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Agghh!  So many of them!', '', 45008, 0, 9625, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I knew the puny ones weren\'t to be trusted!  Smash them!', '', 45007, 0, 9625, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, you did it. It looks like they\'re fleeing.', '', 45006, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fight them back - I can\'t hold this shield up much longer!', '', 45005, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out - I see another!', '', 45004, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('NO MORE! DIS IS MAXI... MAXIMO... ME... DIS TOO MUCH!', '', 45003, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis hurt so bad. Like da time poop came out sideways.', '', 45002, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please... Kill... Me...', '', 45001, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('CAN NO SEE! WHERE TO GO!? WHAT DOING?!', '', 45000, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, captain, I can put box down?', '', 44999, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ME NO SIGN UP FOR DIS! WAIT! Yes, me did sign up for dis.', '', 44998, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis giving me a hernia. Captain, what is hernia?', '', 44997, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Captain, pup need help!', '', 44996, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ugh... dese boxes too heavy. Dey might fall!', '', 44995, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maybe captain carry one box too?', '', 44994, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Heavy... no can see notin.', '', 44993, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('OOF! Maybe trow little softer, captain?', '', 44992, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis not so bad. Maybe little heavy, but me ok.', '', 44991, 1, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Where to going, captain?', '', 44990, 0, 0, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Who do you think - wait - $n, look out behind you!', '', 44989, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some sort of rituals were performed at this altar. It looks like a kind of pagan initiation ritual that Velen once told me about. Bloody. Disgusting.', '', 44988, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What IS this place? Ugh, and that smell...', '', 44987, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s gasps.', '%s gasps.', 44986, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zen\'Kiki, why don\'t you head back to the Menders\' Stead for a while?', 'Zen\'Kiki, why don\'t you head back to the Menders\' Stead for a while?', 44985, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dis is a lot of fun, mon!  I love bein\' a druid!', '', 44984, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, Zen\'Kiki.  Let\'s go run some combat practice.', 'Yes, Zen\'Kiki.  Let\'s go run some combat practice.', 44983, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('\'Ey, mon!  You come to help Zen\'Kiki out?', '', 44982, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Th... thank you.', '', 44981, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re immune to my water spell! How can this be?', '', 44980, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My firebolt is useless! No matter you smug little insect. I will still destroy you!', '', 44979, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What?! You\'re immune to my air magic?', '', 44978, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need more encrypted plans.', 'I need more encrypted plans.', 44977, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('', '$n, you\'ve returned! Is that the middle fragment?', 44976, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'M HIT!', '', 44975, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You will be destroyed!', '', 44974, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will prepare the pack. It will take some time to gather them all, but we will join... for now.', '', 44973, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was hoping you\'d say that...', '', 44972, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I live... and die... for the Banshee Queen.', 44971, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What say you now, spy?', '', 44970, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Treacherous little pup!', '', 44969, 0, 0, 15, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It would appear that we are being watched, Crowley. You have grown soft... Likely Greymane\'s fault.', '', 44968, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('%s sniffs at the air.', '', 44967, 0, 0, 479, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Aye, I will gather my pack... we...', '', 44966, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you will help?', '', 44965, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have seen firsthand what the Forsaken are capable of doing. It is true. They hunt us... slaughter the defenseless.', '', 44964, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But...', '', 44963, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t care about your war, Crowley.', '', 44962, 0, 0, 274, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are the alpha male, Ivar. The rest of the ferals in Silverpine will do as you command.', '', 44961, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If we\'re to win this war we will need your help. Our packs must unite! The Forsaken will destroy us otherwise.', '', 44960, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why trust you now, Crowley? You abandoned us. Left us to die.', '', 44959, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Western Plaguelands or your mustang will kick you off!', '', 44958, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you given any more thought to my proposal, Ivar?', '', 44957, 0, 0, 6, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ready to go, mon!', '', 44956, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'THERE! Hide in the armoire! I\'ll hide in the shadows next to you.', 44955, 0, 0, 25, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Alright, here I go!', '', 44954, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey, that tickles, mon!', '', 44953, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quit yer pokin\', mon!', '', 44952, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We haven\'t got much time. Crowley will be arriving shortly. Let\'s go!', 44951, 0, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is true that we serve Deathwing, but we also serve a higher power. Never forget that!', '', 44950, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is an intruder amongst us. Destroy them! Nothing must interfere with Lord Deathwing\'s plan!', '', 44949, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Decrypt the final instructions. We activate the Waygate within the hour!', '', 44948, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unimaginable power courses through me to the Waygate! Muahahahahahaha!', '', 44947, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Long ago, before the last great war, my father ran the Northridge Lumber Mill. It was his life, and he was committed to it. Then the war came, and as much as it pained him, we had to flee to Stormwind.$B$BWith the passing of the Scourge and the flight of the Scarlet Crusade, however... Northridge is ours again.', '', 44946, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How do you do, $n?', 44945, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lord Deathwing\'s sundering of the Well of Eternity has brought down Uldum\'s defenses. Prepare yourselves. We will march through the Waygate soon!', '', 44944, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have labored long and hard for our lord Deathwing. Let us give our all in his name that we will bask in his flames at the end of days!', '', 44943, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The titan Waygate is almost opened. We will assist the Tol\'vir to reconfigure Uldum and bring about the end of all life on Azeroth!', '', 44942, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come fools. Come to your doom. The end of days is here!', '', 44941, 0, 10350, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yorick, you in there? I\'m ready to do this! Let\'s go!', 'Yorick, you in there? I\'m ready to do this! Let\'s go!', 44940, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The outhouse is silent.>', '', 44939, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('All of our explosives are missing!? $n, something sinister is definitely happening here.', '', 44938, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you often sent to gather things for people? I suppose a hero\'s work is never done.', '', 44937, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll never catch me alive!', '', 44936, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When the Cataclysm happened, the links bounding elementals across Azeroth weakened significantly.  One such elemental, Aquementas, is no longer imprisoned.  I hear he\'s causing some major problems for the Southsea gang!', '', 44935, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you seen those huge dirt mounds moving around beneath the dunes?  They belong to a species of tunneling worm the likes of which Azeroth has never seen!  I\'m sure that battling one would be a great learning experience for a seasoned adventurer such as yourself.', '', 44934, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I found a broken-down cart amongst the dunes when I was checking out the potential profitibility of Centipaar Silithid Snacks (patent pending).  I thought to myself, \"hey, free cart!\"  That is, until the biggest basilisk you\'ve ever seen showed up, and I had to leave the whole thing behind!', '', 44933, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('An old friend of mine named Frokle was supposed to be heading in to Gadgetzan, but him and the rest of the Bilgewater crew manning the ship never arrived.  I\'ve heard rumors of a crazy goblin that hangs out near a downed flying machine in the far south, could it be...?', '', 44932, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know much about dragons, but a big, scary one showed up one day just over yonder, near the entrance to the Caverns of Time.  He kept yelling something about...what was it...the end of time as we know it?  I wasn\'t really paying much attention.', '', 44931, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the biggest bug you\'ve ever seen wandering around one of those Silithid hives.  Or maybe it was both of them.  I think the heat\'s getting to me...do you see that sand kitten over there?', '', 44930, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I saw the Wastewander and their leader, Caliph Scorpidsting, heading south of here.  Watch out, they look like they\'ve toughened up some!', '', 44929, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
