('', 'Call me Twin. That\'s what Mowi calls me.$B$BNo, we don\' look alike. Are ye blind? She\'s a gnome fer the Light\'s sake! We act alike. \'specially when we\'re fightin\'.$B$BAs fer my name... have ya na heard o\' the storied Wildhammer Brewers? Care fer a pint?', 44854, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I heard the forgemaster keeps notes about his meetings  in a book at the tower overlooking the camp.', '', 44853, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
