('Gryphon Master Talonaxe has ordered me sent to Stormfeather Outpost!', 'Gryphon Master Talonaxe has ordered me sent to Stormfeather Outpost!', 44822, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If one such as I can be captured by that lumbering oaf, then you must be brave indeed to venture here.\n\nIf you can distract Halfus and break the chains binding me then I will fight alongside you.\n\nMy ability to slow the passage of time in an area will help you evade the Proto-Behemoth\'s Fireball Barrage.', '', 44821, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know this looks grim, but our enemies will pay for what they have done. I\'ll make sure they do.', '', 44820, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m going to be giving the king a haircut tomorrow. Would you like to come and meet him, Anna?', 44819, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anna, how would you like to go down to the harbor in a little while?', 44818, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anna, ten more minutes, then you need to wash up. We\'re having your favorite. Mac and cheese.', 44817, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'re going to do little Andi\'s braids soon. Would you like yours done too, sweetie?', 44816, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Scarlet Crusade will return to its noble roots!', '', 44815, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We\'ll go ice skating as soon as the lake freezes over, honey.', 44814, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I saw Little Timmy the other day, Anna. Would you like a kitten?', 44813, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You\'re going to have a play date with William and Donna later. How does that sound?', 44812, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Anastasia, stay close please. We\'ll go do something fun soon.', 44811, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I need to get to the top of Jintha\'Alor. Time to ride Sharpbeak!', 'I need to get to the top of Jintha\'Alor. Time to ride Sharpbeak!', 44810, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We must take what is ours. Our survival depends on it.', 44809, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Sharpbeak\'s the finest gryphon in Aerie Peak. He\'ll get you right to the top of Jintha\'Alor, and we\'ll take the top terraces in no time.', '', 44808, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hi. Welcome to my salon.$B$BYou look great! But if you\'re in the mood for a change, just sit right down in one of the chairs.', 44807, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The eagle spirit of the Hinterlands be on our side now, $n.$B$BWith her idol free from the Vilebranch, I can transport you straight to it on the upper tier of Jintha\'Alor. Strike at their hearts!', '', 44806, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
