('Final stop, the Forsaken Front! EVERYBODY OUT!', 'Final stop, the Forsaken Front! EVERYBODY OUT!', 44788, 1, 0, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I trust you and my son are getting along? Anduin is anything but shy.', '', 44787, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I regret nothing.', '', 44786, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18582, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Beacons of light, bestow upon me your aegis!', '', 44785, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18581, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What... have you... done?', '', 44784, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18579, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('A product of your own insolence.', '', 44783, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18583, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Turn back, intruders! These halls must not be disturbed!', '', 44782, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18580, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The earth TREMBLES!', '', 44781, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18908, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ptah... is... no more...', '', 44780, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18905, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dust to dust.', '', 44779, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18907, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('More carrion for the swarm...', '', 44778, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18906, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bask in my radiance!', 44777, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18845, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My luster... wanes.', 44776, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18844, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Eons of darkness... by your hand.', 44775, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18842, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Insignificant!', 44774, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18847, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The glimmer of your life, extinguished.', 44773, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18846, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Gaze to the heavens! What do you see?', 44772, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 18843, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your life, UNLEASHED!', '', 44771, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18572, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The cycle continues...', '', 44770, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Waste of energy.', '', 44769, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18574, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wither away!', '', 44768, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18573, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This chamber will flourish with your life energy!', '', 44767, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Behold as infinite darkness befalls your world!', '', 44766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes! Harness... your... hatred.', '', 44765, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you understand now?', '', 44764, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Embrace the end!', '', 44763, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You fear that which you cannot control. But can you control your fear?', '', 44762, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can you feel it? The blessed warmth of the sun?', '', 44761, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18912, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blazing rays of light, take me!', '', 44760, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18910, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I take this life as an offering!', '', 44759, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18914, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I send you to your deity.', '', 44758, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18913, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defilers! Wretches! Fiends! Begone from here!', '', 44757, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 18911, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey there, cutie!  Mind rubbing some lotion on my exposed areas?', 44756, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n, I remember when you first came to see my father after the battle for Ebon Hold. I\'m glad you\'re still with us. ', '', 44755, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re one of the fiercest-looking warriors I\'ve ever seen, $n!', '', 44754, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Being a powerful warlock must be hard. Do you ever worry you\'ll lose control of one of your demons?', '', 44753, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s it like to be a shaman? I met Thrall once. My father doesn\'t trust him but he seemed very wise.', '', 44752, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is great, I never get to talk to Stormwind\'s rogues. They\'re always so quiet and secretive...', '', 44751, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m training to be a priest, myself. One day I hope I can command as much power as you.', '', 44750, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a paladin? Highlord Fordragon was, as well. He taught me a great deal. I... I still miss him.', '', 44749, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re a mage, like Jaina Proudmoore? How long have you studied the arcane? It seems so difficult to master.', '', 44748, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So you\'re a hunter? My father has taught me to be pretty handy with a bow, myself.', '', 44747, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ve always wondered what it would be like to be a druid. Where do your clothes go when you change into a bear?', '', 44746, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Could you foresee this, fool?', '', 44745, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come with me, your highness.', 'Come with me, your highness.', 44744, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Anduin sizes you up.>$B$B$n, is it? A few of your triumphs have been the talk of the court.$B$BWhat was it like to serve in Northrend? Have you seen the World Tree? Are the stories about Vashj\'ir true? I have so many questions!', '', 44743, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome to Stormwind, $c.', '', 44742, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How does it feel to watch your men slaughtered by your mortal enemies, Inquisitor?', 44741, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Scarlet Monastery belongs to the Forsaken now!', 44740, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Flesh Rippers, hold the forward courtyard for our champions!', 44739, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('As you command, Warchief!', '', 44738, 1, 10321, 66, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tremble, crusaders, before the might of the Forsaken!', 44737, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dive!  Dive!  Dive!', '', 44736, 0, 0, 397, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stop calling me Fronkle!', '', 44735, 0, 0, 18, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll have the Kickin\' Chimeroak Chops, extra kick!', '', 44734, 0, 0, 396, 65, 0, 0, 0, 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look out for that turtle!', '', 44733, 0, 0, 22, 65, 0, 0, 0, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Veer left!', '', 44732, 0, 0, 4, 65, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My name ISN\'T FRONKLE!', '', 44731, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Tell me more about Deepholm and the World Pillar.', 'Tell me more about Deepholm and the World Pillar.', 44730, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Twilight\'s Hammer has infiltrated my city. Left unchecked, they\'ll rot it to the core. Before we besiege their stronghold in the Highlands, I must be certain that Stormwind is safe from their machinations.$B$BI need more feet on the ground, reliable eyes and ears throughout the city. An experienced $c like yourself would be invaluable.$B$BAre you prepared to help Stormwind\'s cause?', '', 44729, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Move quickly, $n. Your work will be for nothing if Mograine notices us before your work is done. ', 44728, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Remember, Sylvanas, eventually we all have to stand before our maker and face judgment. Your day may come sooner than others\'....', '', 44721, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 20504, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cromush, you stay behind and make sure the Banshee Queen is well \"guarded.\" I will be expecting a full report when next we meet.', '', 44720, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 20503, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Watch your clever mouth.', '', 44719, 1, 10321, 397, 65, 0, 20502, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Isn\'t it obvious, Warchief? I serve the Horde.', 44718, 1, 10321, 66, 65, 0, 0, 20469, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What difference is there between you and the Lich King now?', '', 44717, 1, 10321, 6, 65, 0, 20501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you given any thought to what this means, Sylvanas?', '', 44716, 1, 10321, 6, 65, 0, 20500, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warchief, without these new Forsaken my people would die out... Our hold upon Gilneas and northern Lordaeron would crumble.', 44715, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20468, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What you have done here, Sylvanas... it goes against the laws of nature. Disgusting is the only word I have to describe it.', '', 44714, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 20499, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('ABBERATION!', '', 44713, 1, 10321, 5, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Agatha, show the Warchief!', 44709, 1, 10321, 22, 65, 0, 0, 20467, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the aid of the val\'kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken.', 44707, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate.', 44706, 1, 10321, 274, 65, 0, 0, 20465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Very well, Warchief. I have solved the plight of the Forsaken!', 44705, 1, 10321, 5, 65, 0, 0, 20464, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Get on with it, Sylvanas.', '', 44704, 1, 10321, 1, 65, 0, 20498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', '...and they are part of the reason that I asked to see you.', 44703, 1, 10321, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20463, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became... unemployed. Those \'fiends,\' as you so delicately put it, are called val\'kyr. They are under my command now...', 44702, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 0, 20462, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Warchief, so glad you could make it.', 44701, 1, 10321, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20461, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here?', '', 44700, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 20497, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This better be important, Sylvanas. You know how I detest this place and its foul stench. Why have you called for me?', '', 44699, 1, 10321, 0, 65, 0, 20496, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Ah, speak of the devil...', 44696, 1, 10321, 1, 65, 0, 0, 20460, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Where is that ogre-headed buffoon?', 44695, 1, 10321, 6, 65, 0, 0, 20459, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Smash them! Then we join attack upon Temple of Earth!', '', 44691, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Therazane be happy to get middle fragment.', '', 44690, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not take World Pillar fragment from me!', '', 44689, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ignore Twilight\'s Hammer! They stupid. Kill other one, now!', '', 44688, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We control World Pillar!', '', 44687, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Crush them! I take fragment to Stone Mother.', '', 44686, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Kill them! Kill all!', '', 44685, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You not let them near fragment!', '', 44684, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The blessed warmth of the sun courses through your veins!', '', 44683, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Understood. I\'ll head there right away.', 'Understood. I\'ll head there right away.', 44682, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Exactly what I wanted to hear. Let\'s go.', 'Exactly what I wanted to hear. Let\'s go.', 44681, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That encampment has been begging for our attention. Let\'s get this done.', 'That encampment has been begging for our attention. Let\'s get this done.', 44680, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m glad to hear we\'re fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time.', 'I\'m glad to hear we\'re fighting along side the Stonemother herself this time.', 44679, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Some action. Glad to hear it.', 'Some action. Glad to hear it.', 44678, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Elements be with us.', 'Elements be with us.', 44677, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Got it. I\'ll head there right away.', 'Got it. I\'ll head there right away.', 44676, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m on my way.', 'I\'m on my way.', 44675, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are joining an assault on Lorthuna\'s Gate. You are needed.', 'We are joining an assault on Lorthuna\'s Gate. You are needed.', 44674, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And I thought I might get a bit of rest. Silly me.', 'And I thought I might get a bit of rest. Silly me.', 44673, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Am I needed?', 'Am I needed?', 44672, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look intent. Is there something I can help with?', 'You look intent. Is there something I can help with?', 44671, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Any luck with Therazane?', 'Any luck with Therazane?', 44670, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Have you recovered the final piece?', 'Have you recovered the final piece?', 44669, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes?', 'Yes?', 44668, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Good to see you.', 'Good to see you.', 44667, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You look exhausted. Is something wrong?', 'You look exhausted. Is something wrong?', 44666, 0, 0, 378, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'ll even get you started.', 44665, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flying', 'Flying', 44664, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Riding', 'Riding', 44663, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are bound by will to serve the Banshee Queen.', 'We are bound by will to serve the Banshee Queen.', 44662, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?$B$BA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts.', 'Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?$B$BA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts.', 44661, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If only I could get to the Launch Bay. Gimme one, just one, of those beautiful airborne machines and I could retake Gnomeregan and scare the goggles off of B.E Barechus at the same time!$B$BIf you need another parachute, we\'ve stored some in chests near the drop points.', '', 44660, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Gryphon Handler', 'Gryphon Handler', 44659, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There are stables just beyond Old Town\'s southeast gates. You can find a riding trainer and a horse breeder there.', 'There are stables just beyond Old Town\'s southeast gates. You can find a riding trainer and a horse breeder there.', 44658, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Horse Breeder', 'Horse Breeder', 44657, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Honor & Conquest Quartermasters', 'Honor & Conquest Quartermasters', 44656, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('In the Command Center, just outside of Old Town\'s southeast gates, you\'ll find the quartermasters.', 'In the Command Center, just outside of Old Town\'s southeast gates, you\'ll find the quartermasters.', 44655, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Justice & Valor Quartermasters', 'Justice & Valor Quartermasters', 44654, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Champions\' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.$B$BThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there.', 'The Champions\' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.$B$BThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there.', 44653, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Champions\' Hall', 'Champions\' Hall', 44652, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Profession vendors can always be found near their respective trainers. Other sorts of vendors are scattered throughout Stormwind.$B$BWhat were you looking for?', 'Profession vendors can always be found near their respective trainers. Other sorts of vendors are scattered throughout Stormwind.$B$BWhat were you looking for?', 44651, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Harrison Jones teaches Archaeology in Stormwind Keep\'s Royal Library when not out in the field.', 'Harrison Jones teaches Archaeology in Stormwind Keep\'s Royal Library when not out in the field.', 44650, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Archaeology', 'Archaeology', 44649, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Denman Family Jewelers, between the northern Trade District and The Canals, should have everything you\'re looking for.', 'Denman Family Jewelers, between the northern Trade District and The Canals, should have everything you\'re looking for.', 44648, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Jewelcrafting', 'Jewelcrafting', 44647, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re trying to find a solution to the growin\' elemental disturbances in Azeroth. Here in Nagrand, we see the same rifts formin\', but as a direct consequence of Draenor bein\' torn to shreds. They\'re a sign of a weakened planet and of an elemental plane in upheaval.$B$BYet, on Azeroth, there\'s no solid explanation for it.$B$BIf ya find any information about these rifts when adventurin\' in the Outland, please let us know. We\'ll continue to speak with the elements here and find a way to calm the elements in Azeroth...before it\'s too late.\n', '', 44646, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The elements in Azeroth are becoming more disturbed each passing day.  The key to this disturbance lies here, in Nagrand.  When Draenor was torn apart, all of the elemental planes were thrown into great turmoil and have never recovered.  The rifts here form naturally and are a sign of a severely damaged world.$B$BTo see this same kind of disruption on Azeroth is not just unnerving, it could be a precursor to a type of destruction the world has never seen before.$B$B$n, bring me any information you may find when walking around Outland.$B$BI must spend time with the elements here, researching a way to calm the elements again in Azeroth...before it\'s too late.', '', 44645, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'ve been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now.  Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven\'t quite been able to determine the source.  We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.$B$BKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know.  You can find us in any capital city.$B$BKeep your eye open.  Trouble is brewing.', 'We\'ve been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now.  Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven\'t quite been able to determine the source.  We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.$B$BKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know.  You can find us in any capital city.$B$BKeep your eye open.  Trouble is brewing.', 44644, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How can I help you, $c?', 44643, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, I cannot train you.', 44642, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The caravan is uprotected - I\'m turning back!', '', 44641, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prison? Why would you want to go there? It\'s in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.$B$BIf you\'re truly going there, be careful. I\'ve heard news of riots.', 'The prison? Why would you want to go there? It\'s in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.$B$BIf you\'re truly going there, be careful. I\'ve heard news of riots.', 44640, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Stockade', 'The Stockade', 44639, 7, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
