('Rrglrglrglrglrgl!', '', 44506, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rrglrglrglrglrgl.', '', 44505, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 416, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('*sniff sniff*', '', 44504, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 15995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('EEEEEEEEEEE! RUN AWAY!', '', 44503, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('AAAAAAGH! CURSE YOUR SUDDEN YET INEVITABLE BETRAYAL!', '', 44502, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ll regret this! This is your only chance, you fishy fools!', '', 44501, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...why are you looking at me like that?', '', 44500, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What was that? And what the heck is that smell?', '', 44499, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And, armed with gnoll-forged weapons of indestructible copper, you murlocs will be unstoppable!', '', 44498, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('With your strength, murlocs, our plan will succeed. Our kobold friends will mine us plenty of ore...', '', 44497, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Lok\'tar! We need your help!', '', 44496, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you here to train, hunter?', 'Are you here to train, hunter?', 44495, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I cannot help you with your training. Seek out a $c trainer.', 'I cannot help you with your training. Seek out a $c trainer.', 44494, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, it did. Try to be more careful.$B$BWe wouldn\'t want to lose the king\'s axe!', '', 44493, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Slate, did the Axe of Earthly Sundering return to you?', 'Slate, did the Axe of Earthly Sundering return to you?', 44492, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Dragonmaw are attempting to push out of the Angerfang Encampment and are already raiding the caravan to the east.  They\'ve called in two powerful warriors who are leading the charge.  If you\'re up for a challenge, you might find them at the Encampment, planning and strategizing and doing other evil, Orcish things.', '', 44491, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I was up at Whelgar\'s a few days ago attempting to...er...liberate...some titan relics from the bones of the dead raptors, and I saw him!  Sarltooth lives!  \n\nWell, he\'s undead, so I guess he doesn\'t live, but he exists.  Sarltooth exists!', '', 44490, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They say that the raptor matriarch lives deep within Raptor Ridge, protecting her clutch of eggs.', '', 44489, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('On my way down here from Dun Algaz I saw a gnoll hunting Threshadons in the middle of a lake.  If you\'ve never seen a dog try to use a spear, you\'re in for a treat!', '', 44488, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I can offer you a free bunk if you\'d like to rest.  They\'re not comfortable, but it doesn\'t look like you get much sleep anyway. ', 'I can offer you a free bunk if you\'d like to rest.  They\'re not comfortable, but it doesn\'t look like you get much sleep anyway. ', 44487, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The middle fragment of the World Pillar has been dug up and is missing!', '', 44486, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$C, over here.', '', 44485, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_rogue_shadowdance.blp:20|t%s begins to summon |cFFFF0000Corrupted Adherents|r to aid him!\n', '', 44484, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my undying gratitude and that of my people, $n.', '', 44483, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I suppose you\'ll be needing a key for this cage? Wait, don\'t tell me. The horrific gibbering monster behind me ate it, right?', 'I suppose you\'ll be needing a key for this cage? Wait, don\'t tell me. The horrific gibbering monster behind me ate it, right?', 44482, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Leaping Leper Gnomes! You\'re a sight for sore eyes. I was worried the giant magma worm out front would deter visitors. Now that you\'re here you can give me a hand.', '', 44481, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Are you here to help Ironforge, or just gawk at me all day?', 44480, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Father! Let me get you free of those chains.', '', 44479, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Choosing the path of a mage is to choose a path of great difficulty. Many do not understand us. Our own people struggle to accept our arts.', 44478, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I\'m sorry, but I can\'t offer you training.', 44477, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rock-mans dig or kobold hit more!', '', 44476, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rock-mans so lazy! Why rock-mans so lazy?!', '', 44475, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig ore! Rock-mans dig ore now!', '', 44474, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nasty rock-mans! Do as we say!', '', 44473, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig! Rock-mans! For everlasting peace!', '', 44472, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Dig faster! Faster! No stop!', '', 44471, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know.$B$BDon\'t hit me!', '', 44470, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 18, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I hear strange orcs whispering all the time inside the south zeppelin tower. They always shut up whenever I get near.', '', 44469, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'m too dumb to be in a cult. Been that way since I felled off the back of the zeppelin. And hit them propellors. Landed on a rock. They fixed my head up with a metal bowl to make it round and hard.$B$B<He thunks his fist against his skull.>$B$BThen the lightning done come.', '', 44468, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secret cult? You\'re not with those creepy orcs who lurk around the south zeppelin tower, are you?', '', 44467, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Secret cult? Is that who I see having meetings at the base of the south zeppelin tower?', '', 44466, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I don\'t know nothing! Ask the others.', '', 44465, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Cult? I don\'t know. Seen some suspicious types lingering around the south zeppelin tower, though.', '', 44464, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hello, $c!$B$BOrgrimmar\'s skyway is the center of the world. The north zeppelin tower will take you to Stranglethorn or Undercity. The south tower will take you to Thunderbluff or all the way to Northrend.$B$BFlight Master Doras can send you all over Kalimdor - at least, anyplace you\'ve already explored.', '', 44463, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Can I help?', '', 44462, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Orgrimmar is stronger than ever!', '', 44461, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `SoundEntriesID1`, `SoundEntriesID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('Zub zub!', '', 44460, 0, 0, 273, 65, 0, 0, 0, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Silence, idiot.', '', 44459, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('So it\'s true? Sauranok IS guilty of treason!', 'So it\'s true? Sauranok IS guilty of treason!', 44458, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know all about your cult master.', 'I know all about your cult master.', 44457, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I didn\'t say Twilight\'s Hammer. YOU said Twilight\'s Hammer.', 'I didn\'t say Twilight\'s Hammer. YOU said Twilight\'s Hammer.', 44456, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Has a secret cult infiltrated the Orgrimmar skyway?', 'Has a secret cult infiltrated the Orgrimmar skyway?', 44455, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wait, uh - you put words in my mouth! Not fair!', '', 44454, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The peon\'s eyes widen in terror.>$B$BNo! You\'ve discovered Sauranok is the new cult leader in Orgrimmar? He told me his secret is safe!\n', '', 44453, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<The peon sweats and twitches.>$B$BI was ... what I meant ... um, bad!', '', 44452, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why ask me? I know nothing of the Twilight\'s Hammer.', '', 44451, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zub zub.$B$BWhat? Two zubs not good \'nuff for you, $c?', '', 44450, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Zub zub.$B$BWhat? Go away.', '', 44449, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The prince has run off. This is bad!', '', 44448, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Quick, grab onto the ladder!  That troll doesn\'t look too friendly!', '', 44447, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hey!  What are you doing down there?', '', 44446, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This hero represents the Earthen Ring. They need the middle fragment.', '', 44445, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Return to Pyrium Lodestone with the good news. We\'ll see you back at Stonehearth shortly.', '', 44444, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You have my gratitude and that of my people.', '', 44443, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'ve saved both myself and my son.', '', 44442, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Oh, hey $n.', '', 44441, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('That was... unexpected.', '', 44440, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Titan artifacts are largely inert.  Something like Zanzil\'s mixture should have no effect whatsoever.  Let\'s try it out!', '', 44439, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This ancient totem is fashioned into the shape of a bat.  It must be the totem that Maywiki spoke of.', '', 44438, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Maywiki, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can you remind me where to go next?', 'Maywiki, I was hunting Zanzil and I lost track of what I was doing.  Can you remind me where to go next?', 44437, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The Gurubashi are dead, and Hakkar with them.  Most of my fellow Zandalar have returned to their homeland.$b$bIt falls on me, Chabal, and the Darkspears of Bambala to watch over Zul\'Gurub now.', 44436, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There we go.  The substance that you have brought me is approximately... 150,000 years old?  What!?  I\'m going to need to run another test.', '', 44435, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and, we put the potion on the sample...', '', 44434, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...alchemy, alchemy, alchemy...', '', 44433, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...give a little swirl...', '', 44432, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We just mix these two together...', '', 44431, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('$n! You\'re a sight for sore eyes. Get over here and give me a hand, would you?', '', 44430, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You don\'t know what you\'re doing, Bouldergut! By keeping me captive, you\'re dooming Deepholm and us all!', '', 44429, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Free me now before it\'s too late! Deepholm cannot survive much longer without the World Pillar intact!', '', 44428, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Nothing in all of the elemental planes will stop me from killing you once I get out of these chains, Bouldergut!', '', 44427, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hello, $c.  Care to purchase something?', 44426, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re too late, Bouldergut. The proverbial cavalry has arrived!', '', 44425, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Damned stinking stone trogg! You\'ll never get the World Pillar fragment!', '', 44424, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Flint! Get out of here! He\'s too powerful!', '', 44423, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Let me out of these chains! I\'ll reduce you to rubble!', '', 44422, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bouldergut, you coward! Fight someone your own size!', '', 44421, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Hey, $n!', 44420, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. Plant Seaforium is now available on your action bar.$BToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE.', 'Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. Plant Seaforium is now available on your action bar.$BToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE.', 44419, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. New abilities are now available on your action bar.$BToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE.', 'Bravo Company Field Kit ACTIVE. New abilities are now available on your action bar.$BToggle Bravo Company Field Kit to DEACTIVATE.', 44418, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to grab a war guardian, $n.', '', 44417, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('When Deathwing destroyed the World Pillar, he broke open a rift between your world and ours. These spores and fungi are one consequence.$B$BLet\'s see if we can deal with them together.', '', 44416, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t forget to command your pet to follow you! |TInterface\\Icons\\ABILITY_TRACKING.BLP:24|t', '', 44415, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You should have your pet wait for you here. Beware the Blackrock Worg Captain! |TInterface\\Icons\\SPELL_NATURE_TIMESTOP.BLP:24|t', '', 44414, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We will defeat the Twilight\'s Hammer wherever they may hide.  Not even the elemental planes will be a safe haven for their kind.', 44413, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('To serve is madness, but defiance ... impossible!', '', 44412, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This world unravels. If you could see the horrors I have seen... ', '', 44411, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My powers of sight... I beheld the future... I have seen what is to come...', '', 44410, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Twilight\'s Hammer has agents everywhere! Kill me and a dozen take my place!', '', 44409, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pathetic. The Horde grows weaker by the day...', '', 44408, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Hear anything interesting, $n? Your little revelation about me is about to cost you your life.', '', 44407, 0, 0, 1, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I\'ll keep that in mind.', 'I\'ll keep that in mind.', 44406, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pie is far better than cake. Everyone knows that! Shouldn\'t a $c of your standing be well-informed about such important matters?', '', 44405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why pie over cake?', 'Why pie over cake?', 44404, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Show me today\'s selection of pies.', 'Show me today\'s selection of pies.', 44403, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It\'s good to see you made it through, $n. ', '', 44402, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you ready to train, warrior?', 'Are you ready to train, warrior?', 44401, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I train only warriors, $c. You\'ll have to look elsewhere.', 'I train only warriors, $c. You\'ll have to look elsewhere.', 44400, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('snarls at Stormglen Defender.', '', 44399, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 53, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Die, foul beast!', '', 44398, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Stormglen! For Gilneas!', '', 44397, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Don\'t let them break the line!', '', 44396, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay here with the others and don\'t try anything funny.', 'Stay here with the others and don\'t try anything funny.', 44395, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('They told us Gilneas City was safe...', 'They told us Gilneas City was safe...', 44394, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We have to get out of here! The howling gets louder every night.', 'We have to get out of here! The howling gets louder every night.', 44393, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Did you hear that?', 'Did you hear that?', 44392, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Why are the gates closed?', 'Why are the gates closed?', 44391, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We\'re pulling up near your stop. Head due west along the road to reach Nozzlepot\'s Outpost.', '', 44390, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Everyone always says, \"Horton, why do you drive a boat up and down the river?\" I ask them, \"Why don\'t you?\"  ... that\'s usually where I run out of witty retorts.', '', 44389, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('This is where you\'d expect something to go wrong on a beautiful trip like this.', '', 44388, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There\'s nothing quite like the smell of Durotar on a warm, comfortable boat ride.', '', 44387, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Whew, that was a bit of a tight squeeze, but the rest of the trip should be a breeze.', '', 44386, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Explorers\' League exists to uncover the hidden secrets within this world.  While the cataclysm was devastating for most, for us, it provided access to untold troves of information and wealth.', '', 44385, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Wulfred says that he paid for my trip to the Explorers\' League Digsite.  I\'m ready to depart.', 'Wulfred says that he paid for my trip to the Explorers\' League Digsite.  I\'m ready to depart.', 44384, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes, $n?', '', 44383, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Keep your eyes open, $c. Even Durotar is not safe from our enemies.', '', 44382, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Skeezy says he already paid for my flight to Hardwrench Hideaway.  I\'m ready to depart.', 'Skeezy says he already paid for my flight to Hardwrench Hideaway.  I\'m ready to depart.', 44381, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ey mon, what you need?', '', 44380, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What\'s going on? I thought I saw something on the rooftops.', 'What\'s going on? I thought I saw something on the rooftops.', 44379, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My children are in Stormglen alone! I have to get to them!', 'My children are in Stormglen alone! I have to get to them!', 44378, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You can\'t do this to us!', 'You can\'t do this to us!', 44377, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Step on through, $n!', 44376, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stay calm. We have everything under control.', '', 44375, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It isn\'t safe to leave, there\'s something lurking out there in the woods.', '', 44374, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
